const o={"char-0":JSON.parse(`{"1":[{"paragraph":4,"mentions":6,"tokens":["子玉","庾香","梅子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"颜夫人今年四十四岁，真是德容兼备，贤淑无双，与梅学士唱随已二十余年。二十九岁上梦神人授玉，遂生了一个玉郎，取名子玉，号庾香。这梅子玉今年已十七岁了，生得貌如良玉，质比精金，宝贵如明珠在胎，光彩如华月升岫。而且天授神奇，胸罗斗宿，虽只十年诵读，已是万卷贯通。士燮前年告假回乡扫墓，子玉随了回去，即入了泮，在本省过了一回乡试未中，仍随任进京，因回南不便，遂以上舍生肄业","en":"dreamed that a divine being bestowed upon her a piece of jade, and subsequently gave birth to a jade-like son, named Ziyu and styled Yuxiang. This Mei Ziyu is now seventeen, his countenance as flawless as fine jade, his essence as pure as refined gold—precious as a luminous pearl taking shape, radiant as the glorious moon cresting the peaks. Furthermore, endowed with heavenly"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一日，先生有事放学，子玉正在独坐，却有两个好友来看他。一个姓颜名仲清，号剑潭，现年二十三岁，即系已故编修颜庄之子，为颜夫人之侄。","en":"One day, the teacher dismissed his students early to attend to some affairs, leaving Ziyu sitting in solitude, when two close companions arrived to visit him. One was surnamed Yan, named Zhongqing, and styled Jiantan; currently twenty-three years of age, he was the son of the late Compiler Yan Zhuang, making him Lady Yan's nephew."},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":3,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"现为吏科给事中。这两人同是才高八斗，学富五车，但两人的情性却又各不相同。仲清是孤高自洁，坦白为怀。将他的学问与子玉比较起来，子玉是纯粹一路，仲清是旷达一路。一切人情物理，仲清不过略观大概，不求甚解。子玉则钩探索隐，精益求精。","en":"was solitary, lofty, and self-purifying, bearing a heart of open candor. If one compared his scholarship with Ziyu's, Ziyu followed the path of absolute purity, whereas Zhongqing pursued the path of expansive unorthodoxy. In matters of human sentiment and physical principles, Zhongqing grasped the broad outlines without seeking exhausting detail, while Ziyu probed"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"往往有仲清鄙夷不屑之学，经子玉精心讲贯，便觉妙义环生。亦有子玉所索解不得之理，经仲清一言点悟，顿觉白地光明。","en":"Often, a subject that Zhongqing would dismiss with disdainful neglect, once meticulously expounded by Ziyu, would suddenly bloom with endless, subtle meaning. Conversely, a principle that eluded Ziyu's deepest searching could be illuminated by a single word from Zhongqing, instantly flooding the barren ground with brilliant light."},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这两个相聚十余年，其结契之厚，比同胞手足更加亲密。那南湘是啸傲忘形，清狂绝俗，目空一世，倚马万言，就只赏识子玉、仲清二人。","en":"generation, capable of writing ten thousand words while leaning against a horse, and deigned to appreciate only Ziyu and Zhongqing."},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":5,"tokens":["子玉","庾香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这日同来看子玉，门上见是来惯的，是少爷至好，便一直引到书房与子玉见了。仲清又同子玉进内见了姑母，然后出来与南湘坐下。三人讲了些话，书僮送上香茗。南湘见这室中清雅绝尘，一切陈设甚精且古，久知其胸次不凡，又见那清华尊贵的仪表，就是近日所选那《曲台花谱》中数人，虽然有此","en":"On this day, they came together to visit Ziyu. The gatekeepers, recognizing them as frequent guests and the young master's closest friends, ushered them straight into the study to meet him. Zhongqing first accompanied Ziyu into the inner chambers to pay his respects to his aunt, then returned to"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":3,"tokens":["子玉","庾香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"见俗优滥妓，油头粉面，无耻之极，则可恨。你想，凡目中所见的，去了这些，还有那一种人？」子玉正猜不着他所说什么，只得说道：「既然娱悦不在声色，其唯二三知己朝夕素心乎？」仲清大笑。南湘道：「岂有此理！朋友岂可云娱耳悦目的？庾香设心不良。」说罢哈哈大笑。子玉被他们这一笑，笑得不好意思起来，脸已微红，便说道：「你们休要取笑。我是这个意思：挥麈清谈","en":"vision, once you strip away these types, what kind of person remains?\\" Unable to guess his friend's true intent, Ziyu could only offer: \\"Since true pleasure is not to be found in superficial sounds and sights, does it not reside solely in the day-and-night companionship of two or three kindred spirits with pure hearts?\\" Zhongqing burst into loud laughter. Nanxiang retorted:"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":4,"tokens":["子玉","庾香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"无动心荡魄处么？」南湘笑道：「你总是这一间屋子里的说话，所见不广，所游未化。」即从（靴）勒里取出一本书来，送与子玉道：「这是我近刻的，大约可以娱耳悦目，动心荡魄者，要在此数君。」仲清笑道：「你将此书呈政于庾香，真似苏秦始见秦王，可保的你书十上而说不行。他非但没有领略此中情味，且未见过这些人，如何能教他一时索解出来？」子玉见他们说得郑重，不知是什么好书，便揭开一看","en":"broad, and your wanderings have yet to transform you.\\" With that, he drew a book from his boot and handed it to Ziyu, saying: \\"This is my recent printing. Those capable of pleasing the ear, delighting the eye, and stirring the soul are, I daresay, to be found among these few gentlemen.\\" Zhongqing chuckled: \\"Presenting this book to Yuxiang for his judgment is rather"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":3,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"清澄。\\n自从珠字名卿后，能使珠光百倍增。\\n瘦沈腰肢绝可怜，一生爱好自天然。\\n风流别有消魂处，始信人间有谪仙。\\n子玉笑道：「这不是说戏班里的小旦么？这是那里的小旦，你赞得这样好？」仲清道：「现在这里的，你不见说在联锦班么？」子玉道：「我不信，这是竹君撒谎。我今年也看过一天的戏，几曾见小旦中有这样好人？」南湘道：「你那天看的不知是什么班子，自然没有好的了。」子玉再看","en":"grace holds a separate, soul-melting charm;\\nOnly now do I believe an exiled immortal walks the mortal realm.\\n\\nZiyu smiled and said, \\"Are these not descriptions of young dan actors in the theatrical troupes? Which troupe boasts such an actor, that you praise him so highly?\\" Zhongqing replied, \\"He is right here in the capital; did you not read that he belongs to the"},{"paragraph":34,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"为妆。\\n石麟天上原无价，应捧炉香侍玉皇。\\n才啭歌喉赞不休，黄金争掷作缠头。\\n玉郎偶驾羊车出，十里珠帘尽上钩。\\n子玉看了只是笑，不置一词。南湘问道：「你何以不加可否？」子玉道：「大凡论人，虽难免粉饰，也不可过于失实。若论此辈，真可惜了这副笔墨。","en":"handsome youth occasionally rides out in his goat-drawn cart,\\nTen miles of pearl curtains are rolled up all at once.\\n\\nZiyu read it and merely smiled, offering not a single word. Nanxiang asked, \\"Why do you withhold your judgment?\\" Ziyu replied, \\"Generally speaking, when evaluating people, though some embellishment is unavoidable, one should not stray too far from the truth."},{"paragraph":38,"mentions":2,"tokens":["庾香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"兄不惜笔墨，竭力铺张，为若辈增光，而使古人抱恨，窃为吾兄有所不取。」这一番话，把个史南湘说出气来。仲清笑道：「庾香之论未尝不是，而竹君之选也甚平允。但庾香不知天地间有此数人，譬如读《搜神》之记，《幽怪》之书。","en":"there is something lacking in your approach.\\" This speech infuriated Shi Nanxiang. Zhongqing laughed and said, \\"Yuxiang's argument is not without merit, yet Zhujun's selections are also quite fair. It is just that Yuxiang does not realize that such individuals exist in the universe. It is like reading 'In Search of the Supernatural' or books of 'Hidden Marvels';"},{"paragraph":40,"mentions":5,"tokens":["庾香","子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"我想庾香一见这些人，也必能赏识的。天地之灵秀，何所不钟。若谓仅钟于女而不钟于男，也非通论。庾香方说男子秽浊，焉能如女子灵秀。所为美人佳人者，我想古来男子中美的也就不少，称美人佳人者亦有数条。如《毛诗》「彼美人兮」，杜诗「美人何为隔秋水」，《赤壁赋》「望美人兮","en":"I believe that once Yuxiang sees these people, he too will be able to appreciate them. The spiritual essence of heaven and earth—where does it not gather? To say it gathers only in women and not in men is an untenable generalization. Yuxiang just claimed that men are foul and turbid,"},{"paragraph":41,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"便拉了仲清去了。子玉送客转来，又将南湘的《花选》默默的一想，再想从前看过的戏，与见过的小旦一毫不对，犹以南湘为妄言，借此以自消遣的，便也不放在心上了。李先生回来，仍在书房念了一会书，颜夫人然后叫了进去。","en":"He then dragged Zhongqing away. Ziyu saw his guests out and returned, silently pondering Nanxiang's \\"Selection of Flowers\\" once more. He thought back to the plays he had seen in the past and the young dan he had encountered, finding that they did not match the descriptions in the slightest."},{"paragraph":42,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"过了两日，子玉于早饭后告了半天假，回去看南湘、仲清。","en":"Two days later, Ziyu requested a half-day's leave after breakfast and went back to visit Nanxiang and Zhongqing."},{"paragraph":44,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"生得一表非凡，丰华俊雅，文才既极精通，心地尤为浑厚。纳了个上舍生，在北闱乡试。与子玉是表弟兄，为莫逆之交。","en":"a senior student at the Imperial Academy and was participating in the northern provincial examinations. He and Ziyu were cousins and sworn, inseparable friends."},{"paragraph":45,"mentions":4,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"接进了子玉。先同到内里去见了表舅母陆氏夫人。这夫人已是文辉续娶的了，今年才四十岁。又见了王恂的妻室孙氏，那是表嫂。仲清的妻室蓉华，那是表姊。还有个琼华小姐没有出来，因听得他父亲前日说那子玉的好处，其口风似要与他联姻的话，所以不肯出来见这表兄了。陆夫人见子玉，真","en":"He welcomed Ziyu inside. First, they went to the inner quarters to pay respects to his maternal aunt, Lady Lu. This lady was Wenhui's second wife and was only forty years old this year. He also greeted Wang Xun's wife, Lady Sun, his cousin-in-law. Zhongqing's wife, Ronghua,"},{"paragraph":46,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"然后同王恂到了书房，问起仲清，为高品、南湘请去。子玉说起前日所见南湘的《花选》过于失实，王恂道：「竹君的《花选》，据实而言，尚恐说不到，何以为失实？现在那些宝贝得了这番品题，又长了些声价，你也应该见过这些人。」子玉听了，知王恂也有旦癖，又是个好为附会的人，便不说了。","en":"Wang Xun to the study and asked after Zhongqing, learning that he had been invited out by Gao Pin and Nanxiang. Ziyu mentioned that the \\"Selection of Flowers\\" he had seen Nanxiang carrying the other day was excessively exaggerated. Wang Xun replied, \\"As for Zhujun's 'Selection of Flowers,' practically speaking, one should rather fear it falls short; how could it be"},{"paragraph":47,"mentions":5,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"不及这八个，这是万选青钱。若要说尽他们的好处，除非与他们一人序一本年谱才能清楚，这几句话还不过略述大概而已。」子玉心里甚异：「难道现在真有这些人？」又想：「这三人也不是容易说人好的，何以说到这几个小旦，都是心口如一。总要眼见了才信不然总是他们的偏见。」便说道：「我恰不常听戏，是以疏于物色。你何不同我去听两出戏，使我广广眼界？」王恂道：「很好。」即吩咐套了车，备了","en":"separate biographical chronology for each to make it clear. These few words barely outline the broad strokes.\\" Ziyu felt highly intrigued in his heart. \\"Could such people truly exist now?\\" He thought again, \\"These three men do not easily praise others. How is it that when speaking of these few young dan, their hearts and mouths are so aligned? I must see them with"},{"paragraph":48,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉看了一会闷戏，只见那边桌子上来了一人，招呼王恂，王恂便旋转身子与那人讲话。又见一个人走将过来，穿一件灰色老狐裘，一双泥帮宽皂靴。，看他的身材阔而且扁，有三十几岁，歪着膀子，神气昏迷，在他身边挤了过去。停一会又挤了过来，一刻之间就走了三四回。每近身时，","en":"Ziyu watched the tedious play for a while, only to see a man at a table over there calling out to Wang Xun. Wang Xun turned his body to converse with the man. Then, Ziyu saw another man walking over. He wore a gray old fox-fur coat and a pair of loose black"},{"paragraph":49,"mentions":5,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉好不心烦，如坐涂炭。王恂说完了话坐正了，子玉想要回去。尚未说出，只见一人领着一个相公，笑嘻嘻的走近来，请了两个安，便挤在桌子中间坐了。王恂也不认的。子玉见那相公，约有十五六岁，生得蠢头笨脑，脸上露着两块大孤骨，脸面虽白，手却是黑的。他倒摸着子玉的手问","en":"Ziyu felt incredibly annoyed, as if sitting on burning coals. Wang Xun finished his conversation and sat back properly. Ziyu wanted to suggest they return. Before he could speak, he saw a man leading an escort boy, approaching with a beaming smile. He offered"},{"paragraph":50,"mentions":3,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"见王恂问那人道：「你这相公叫什么名字？」那人道：「叫保珠。」子玉听了，忍不住一笑。又见王恂问道：「你不在桂保处么？」那人道：「桂保处人多，前日出来的。这保珠就住在桂保间壁，少爷今日叫保珠伺候？」王恂支吾，那保珠便拉了王恂的手问道：「到什么地方去，也是时候了。」王恂道：「改日罢。」那相公便缠住了王恂，要带他吃饭。子","en":"He heard Wang Xun ask the man, \\"What is this boy's name?\\" The man replied, \\"He's called Baozhu.\\" Hearing this, Ziyu couldn't suppress a laugh. He then heard Wang Xun ask, \\"Aren't you with Guibao?\\" The man answered, \\"There are too many people at Guibao's place; he left there a few days ago. This Baozhu lives right next door to Guibao. Will the young master call for"},{"paragraph":51,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，歇一天早些来。」也就同了出来。王恂的家人付了戏钱，那相公还拉着王恂走了几步，看不像带他吃饭的光景，便自去了。子玉、王恂上了车，各自分路而回。","en":"Xun, walking a few steps with him, but seeing no prospect of being taken out to eat, eventually left on his own. Ziyu and Wang Xun boarded their carriages and went their separate ways home."},{"paragraph":52,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉心里自笑不已：「何以这些人为几个小旦，颠倒得神昏目暗，皂白不分。设或如今有个真正绝色来，只怕他们倒说不好了。」一路思想，忽到一处挤了车，子玉觉得鼻中一阵清香，非兰非麝，便从帘子上玻璃窗内一望，见对面一辆车，车里坐着一个老年的，外面坐了两个妙童，都不过","en":"Ziyu couldn't stop laughing to himself all the way. \\"Why do these people turn their minds so hazy and blind, failing to distinguish black from white, all for a few young dan? If a truly peerless beauty were to appear right now, I fear they would actually"},{"paragraph":53,"mentions":3,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"个已似海棠花，娇艳无比，眉目天然。一个真是天上神仙，人间绝色，以玉为骨，以月为魂，以花为情，以珠光宝气为精神。子玉惊得呆了，不知不觉把帘子掀开，凝神而望。那两个妙童，也四目澄澄的看他；那个绝色的更觉凝眸伫望，对着子玉出神。子玉觉得心摇目眩。那个绝色的脸上，似有一层光彩照过来，散作满鼻的异香。","en":"the moon for a soul; flowers formed his emotions, and the glowing aura of pearls and jewels formed his spirit. Ziyu was struck dumb. Without realizing it, he lifted the curtain and stared intently. Those two wondrous boys also gazed back at him with clear, unblinking eyes. The one of peerless beauty seemed to stare even more intently, his gaze fixed on Ziyu, lost"},{"paragraph":54,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"正在好看，车已过去。后头又有三四辆，也坐些小孩子，恰不甚佳。子玉心里有些模模糊糊起来，似像见过这人的相貌，好像一个人，再想不起了。","en":"Behind it followed three or four more carriages, also carrying young children, though they were quite ordinary. Ziyu felt a sense of hazy confusion rising in his mind; it was as if he had seen this person's face before, as if he resembled someone, but he couldn't quite remember who."},{"paragraph":56,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这么看来，「有目共赏」的一句，竟是妄言了。把方才这个保珠比他，做他的舆儓，也还不配。」子玉一路想到了家；不知后事如何。且听下回分解。","en":"boast. To compare that Baozhu from earlier to this one—he would not even be fit to serve as his lowliest menial.\\" Ziyu pondered this all the way home. To know what happens next, please listen to the explanation in the following chapter."}],"2":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说子玉在车里，一路想那所见的绝色美童。到了家，见门口一车三马，认得王通政的家人，知道通政在此。便进来到书房，见他父亲陪着王文辉在那里说话，上前见了，说道：「方才到舅舅处请安。」文辉笑容可掬的道：「我一早出来，还未到家。」子玉站在一旁，见文辉说：「开春同年团","en":"As the story goes, Ziyu rode home in his carriage, his mind lingering the entire way upon the exquisitely beautiful youths he had glimpsed. Arriving at the gate, he noticed a carriage and three horses; recognizing the servants of Commissioner Wang of the Office of Transmission,"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":3,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「士燮问了他父母好。子玉出来，见过了礼，士燮即叫子玉引元茂去见他父亲，子玉即同了元茂、聘才到书房去了。士燮吩咐家人许顺，收拾书房后身另院的两间屋子，给他们暂且住下。","en":"Shixie courteously asked after his parents' health. When Ziyu emerged and exchanged formal greetings, Shixie promptly instructed him to escort Yuanmao to meet his father. Ziyu then led both Yuanmao and Pincai toward the study. Meanwhile, Shixie ordered the servant Xu Shun to prepare two rooms in the secluded courtyard"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":6,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这边子玉引李、魏二人到了书房，性全已知道他儿子来了，等他叩见过了，然后与魏聘才见礼，问了姓名，性全让他上坐，聘才只是不肯。子玉想了一想：「先生父子乍见，定然有些说话。」就引聘才到对面船房内坐下，云儿与俊儿送了茶。聘才笑道、「世兄可还认得小弟么？」子玉道：「面","en":"In the study, Ziyu guided Li and Wei to meet Li Xingquan, who was already aware of his son's arrival. Once the son had offered his filial respects, introductions were made with Wei Pincai. Li Xingquan courteously offered Pincai the seat of honor, an offer Pincai repeatedly"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"喝了一会茶，说了些南边年岁光景，聘才知道元茂不能熬夜，起身告辞，性全也体谅他们路上辛苦，就叫元茂跟了过去，子玉送他们进屋，见已铺设好了，说声：「早些安歇罢！」也就叫俊儿提灯，照进上房去了。","en":"rose to take his leave. Li Xingquan, understanding the exhaustion of their travels, sent Yuanmao along with him. Ziyu escorted them to their quarters, ensuring everything was appropriately arranged. Bidding them to rest early, he called for Jun'er to light a lantern and made his way back to the main house."},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"去。这聘才本是个聪明人，又经乃父陶镕，这一张嘴，真个千伶百俐，善于哄骗，所以在梅宅不到十天，满宅的人都说他好。子玉虽与其两道，然觉此人也无可厌处，尚可藉以盘桓，遣此岑寂。","en":"cajoling. Consequently, within less than ten days, every member of the Mei household was singing his praises. Although Ziyu was of an altogether different bent, he found Pincai far from disagreeable, serving as a pleasant enough companion to wile away the quiet hours."},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一日晚上，元茂睡了，子玉与聘才闲谈。聘才问道：「京里的戏是甲于天下的。我听得说那些小旦称呼相公，好不扬气。","en":"One evening, while Yuanmao slept, Ziyu and Pincai sat chatting together. Pincai asked, \\"The theater of the capital is renowned as the finest beneath the heavens. I have heard that the young performers of female roles, addressed as 'xianggong,' carry themselves with an extraordinary air of"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":3,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"巴结他的，像要借他的声气，在些阔老面前吹嘘吹嘘。叫他陪一天酒要给他几十两银子，那小旦谢也不谢一声，是有的么？」子玉笑道：「或者有之，但我不出门，所以也不大知道外面的事。」聘才道：「戏是总听过的，那些小旦到底生得怎样好呢？」子玉道：「我就没有见过好的。这京里的风气，只要是个小旦，那些人嘴里讲讲都是快活，因此相习成风，不可挽回。」聘才道：「我也是这么说，南京的戏子本","en":"tens of taels of silver, yet the performer may not utter a single word of gratitude. Is this truly the case?\\" Ziyu laughed softly, \\"Perhaps in certain circles, but as I rarely venture out, I know little of such worldly affairs.\\" Pincai pressed, \\"Surely you have attended performances. What are these young actors truly like?\\" Ziyu replied dismissively, \\"I have never"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉不觉笑起来，心里想道：「他这般称赞是\\n不可信的，但他形容这两个人，倒可以移到我前日车里所见的那两个身上，倒是一毫不错的。世间既生了这两个，怎么还能再生两个出来？断无是理，不必信他。」即说道：「吾兄说得这样好，天下只怕真没这个人。」聘才道：「这是你可以","en":"Ziyu could not suppress a laugh. Inwardly, he reasoned, \\"Such extravagant praise cannot be entirely trusted. Yet, his description mirrors the two youths I beheld in the carriage the other day with uncanny precision, not a single detail is amiss. Since those"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":6,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉心里想道：「他说这两个人，与他同一天进京。我那日看见那两人之后，他就到了，不要他说的就是我见的，那一班人却像从南边来的模样。」便又问道：「你说那个顶好的叫什么名字？」聘才道：「叫琴官。那个叫琪官。」子玉道：「琴官进城那一天穿的什么衣裳？」聘才道：「都","en":"Ziyu reflected silently, \\"He claims these two entered the capital on the exact same day as he did. They arrived precisely after I saw those two on that very day, could the ones he speaks of be the very ones I saw? That group did indeed appear to be travelers"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":4,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「比京里那些红相公怎样？」子玉笑道：「前日车里那两个，我皆目所未见，那个琴官更为难得，但不知此时在什么班里？」聘才道：「明日我出去打听，打听着了，我们去听他的戏。」子玉点头，再要问时，忽见灯光一亮，一个小丫头在门外说道：「太太叫请少爷早些睡罢。」子玉只得起身进去。这一宿就把聘才的","en":"\\"How do they compare to the famed actors of the capital?\\" Ziyu smiled, \\"The two I saw in the carriage the other day surpass anything my eyes have ever beheld, with Qinguan being a rarity beyond measure. Yet, I wonder which troupe they have joined?\\" Pincai proposed, \\"I shall make inquiries tomorrow. Once I have word,"}],"3":[{"paragraph":7,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"说妥，定于正月初六日在姑苏会馆，不论分包不分包，只要点谁的戏，不短脚色就是了。许顺上去回明，付了定银各散。是晚子玉课期，未得与聘才闲谈。","en":"ascended to report the finalized terms, the deposit was paid, and the party dispersed. That evening was reserved for Ziyu's studies, leaving no time for idle chatter with Pincai."},{"paragraph":38,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"此时日已西沉，富、贵两人急急的赶城，聘才送了他们上车，同着四儿慢慢步行而归。到家时点了灯了，子玉、元茂都在书房夜课。聘才换了衣裳，趿着鞋，喝了几杯茶，坐了一回。","en":"slowly walking the darkening streets home with Si'er. By the time they arrived, the estate was bathed in lamplight. Ziyu and Yuanmao were sequestered in the study, immersed in their evening lessons. Pincai changed out of his street clothes, slipped into comfortable shoes, drank several cups of hot tea, and sat in quiet contemplation."},{"paragraph":39,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"少停，子玉、元茂出来，同到聘才房里。","en":"Shortly thereafter, Ziyu and Yuanmao emerged from their studies, making their way to Pincai's room."},{"paragraph":40,"mentions":4,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"只见聘才解下腰间的褡包，一只手揣在怀里，剩着一只空袖子悠悠荡荡的，在房里走来走去转圈儿。见了子玉、元茂进来，，便嘻嘻的笑。元茂道：「今日什么事，到此刻才回？」又凑到他脑上一看道：「酒气醺醺，一定是叶茂林请你的，可曾见那些小孩子么？」聘才道：「我没有去找叶茂林，我倒听了联珠班的戏。那班里的相公，足有五六十个，都是生得很好的。遇见一个相好，是从前南","en":"lapel of his robe, letting his empty sleeve sway rhythmically as he paced slow circles around the room. Seeing Ziyu and Yuanmao enter, his face broke into a radiant grin. Yuanmao asked, \\"What kept you abroad until this late hour?\\" Peering closer, he added, \\"You reek of wine! Did Ye Maolin invite you out? Did you happen to see any of those young actors?\\" Pincai laughed,"}],"4":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":5,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"却说子玉正在体贴琴官心事，只听元茂开着风门说道：「了不得了。」倒把子玉等唬了一跳，问道：「为什么大惊小怪？」元茂道：「你看地下已铺了一层，这棉花大的朵子下起来，一夜就有一尺多了。」子玉同聘才到门口看时，果然飘飘洒洒，下起雪来。子玉道：「这腊雪是最好的。今年一","en":"To return to our story: Ziyu was brooding over Qinguan's heavy heart when he heard Yuanmao fling open the vestibule door and cry out, \\"Something terrible has happened!\\" Startled, Ziyu and the others asked why he was making such a fuss. \\"Look at the ground,\\" Yuanmao said, \\"it is"},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":3,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"止了。真个琼妆世界，玉琢乾坤，一派好景。那李性全先生，清早起来冒了寒，头晕咳嗽，仍上床躺了，觉得心里烦闷，不令子玉等读书。性全自己精于药理，便叫书僮去抓了几味发散药吃了，蒙头安睡。子玉命两个书僮，在书房外好好伺候，自己到了一个小三间书屋，名为二十四琴斋。这块匾额，还是其祖文穆公手笔。子玉无聊，翻出谢惠连的《雪赋》阅看。","en":"braved the chill, only to develop a dizzy head and a cough. Feeling out of sorts, he returned to bed and excused Ziyu and the others from their studies. Being well-versed in pharmacology, he had his page-boy fetch several doses of dispersing medicine, swallowed them down, and went to sleep with his head covered. Ziyu instructed the two page-boys to wait quietly outside"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉是不能饮酒的，勉强相陪。又将琴官的光景来问聘才，聘才见他心甚注意，便改了口风，索性将琴官的身分、性气一赞，赞得子玉更为倾慕。又想这个雪天，若见琼枝玉立，何异瑶岛看花，真笑党家锦帐中，醇酒羔羊，终不脱武夫气象矣。吃完之后，煮雪煎茶，闲谈一会，聘才、元茂","en":"Unable to drink wine, Ziyu merely made a show of accompanying the others. He turned again to Pincai to ask after Qinguan. Seeing how entirely Ziyu's thoughts were captivated, Pincai shifted his tone, speaking of Qinguan's bearing and temperament with nothing but soaring praise,"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子玉","庾香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"梅少爷手展，旁有一行小字。内信笺一纸，诗笺四纸。认得仲清笔迹，便问俊儿是谁送来的。俊儿道：「是颜少爷的健儿。」子玉道：「叫他等一等。」拆开看时，信笺上写着是：昨与庸庵同居虚室。玉杯寒重，始知六出花飞；银烛光残，才见十分雪艳。冰山迭迭，围成云母屏风；宝塔层层，照见琉璃灯火。美人装罢，玉戏猫儿；罗汉堆来，球抛狮子。\\n黄昏选韵，白战分题；愧乏琼词，聊为砖引。\\n谨呈冰鉴","en":"it. Inside lay a single sheet of note-paper and four sheets of verse-paper. Recognizing Zhongqing's calligraphy, Ziyu asked Jun'er who had delivered it. \\"It was brought by Young Master Yan's personal attendant,\\" Jun'er replied. Ziyu asked him to wait a moment, then broke the seal. The note read: \\"Yesterday, Yong'an and I sat together in a desolate room. Only when our"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉看了道：「好工致的尺牍！」再看诗笺上，写着《雪窗八咏》。","en":"Ziyu read it and exclaimed, \\"What an exquisitely wrought letter!\\" He then turned to the verse sheets, which bore the title, Eight Odes from the Snow Window."},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"光宁向壁，读书无火是谁家。\\n清寒已尽三条烛，照睡还看六出花。\\n记取元宵佳节近，闹蛾残柳莫争夸。\\n庸庵王恂初稿\\n子玉看了道：「好诗。这四首之中，自然以《雪塔》为第一，《雪屏》第二，《雪山》次之，《雪灯》又次之。再看仲清的诗是：","en":"festive moths and withered willows, boast not against this glow.\\n\\n—first draft by Wang Xun of the Yong'an studio.\\n\\nZiyu read them and said, \\"Splendid poems. Of these four, Snow Pagoda must rank first, Snow Screen second, Snow Mountain next, and Snow Lantern last. Now let us see Jiantan's:\\""},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"擅雄。\\n乘气岂能腾海外，因风只合吼河东。\\n黄金高座非难灿，红树新妆愧未工。\\n若使龙丘居士见，定抛拄杖又谈空。\\n子玉想道：《雪狮》此题却不好做，看他用典举重若轻，雅与题称，非名手不办。再看是：","en":"Recluse, henpecked as he was, were but to see it,\\nhe would surely cast aside his staff and speak again of emptiness.\\n\\nZiyu thought to himself: The topic of Snow Lion is not easily handled; yet look how he weaves his allusions with effortless grace, perfectly suited to the subject. Only a master's hand could manage this. He read on:"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"雕檐。\\n聘求那得鱼穿柳，引去还宜饭裹盐。\\n比似虎头原有样，奈他鼠辈只趋炎。\\n牡丹此日飞红尽，冷眼无须一线添。\\n子玉道：「这首做得更好，第三联调侃不少。」再看下去，题目是《雪罗汉》、《雪美人》。子玉想了一想，题目比前六个更加枯寂，却难着笔。只见是：","en":"red of peony has all flown away;\\ncold-eyed, there is no need to add a single thread.\\n\\n\\"This one is even better,\\" Ziyu said. \\"The third couplet is delightfully pointed.\\" He read further, finding the next topics to be Snow Arhat and Snow Beauty. Ziyu reflected that these two topics were even more barren and still than the preceding six, making them exceedingly difficult"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"似沾泥絮，妾貌应同着雨花。\\n后夜思量成逝水，前身风味记煎茶。\\n卖珠侍婢今何在，倚竹无言日又斜。\\n剑潭仲清脱稿\\n子玉看毕，又轻轻的吟哦了几遍，觉得仲清这几首，《雪狮》镂金错彩，《雪猫》琢玉雕琼，《雪罗汉》吐属清芬，莲花满庭，《雪美人》双管齐下，玉茗风流，却在王恂之上。因想依韵再和八首，未必能如原唱浑成。不如另拟四题，不落窠臼。他这八个题目，都是从后着想，以虚作实，","en":"attended her?\\nLeaning against the bamboo without a word, the sun slopes once more.\\n\\n—Jiantan Zhongqing, final draft.\\n\\nZiyu read through to the end, softly intoning the verses several times. He felt that of Zhongqing's four poems, Snow Lion was gilded and richly patterned; Snow Cat was carved of jade and finely chiseled; Snow Arhat exhaled a clean fragrance, like a courtyard"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"咏雪罢了。」聘才道：「就是咏雪，要对却费力。我只好做首绝句。」元茂道：「七个字一句的累赘，我只会做五言律诗。」子玉道：「都使得。」他们各自搜索枯肠去了。","en":"Yuanmao said, \\"Seven-character lines are too unwieldy; all I know is how to write a five-character regulated poem.\\" Ziyu smiled. \\"Either will do perfectly well.\\" They each went off to rack their brains."},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"不多一会，子玉四首都已作成，用一张冷金笺写了。又写了一封回书，正要缄封。聘才却笑吟吟的拿了一张诗稿来：「道做得不好，你替我改改。」子玉接来看时，题目是《咏雪》，诗是：","en":"Before long, Ziyu had completed all four of his poems and written them out on a sheet of cold-gold notepaper. He had just finished writing a reply and was about to seal it when Pincai came over smiling, carrying a sheet of verse: \\"It has not come out well. Please help"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":7,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"舞向梅梢片片斜，蛾儿粉蝶满天涯。\\n分明仙品瑶台上，独占人间第一花。\\n子玉诧异道：「我倒不晓得你有这样本领。你在诗上头，想是很用过工夫的。」聘才道：「我那里有什么工夫，就是记得几枝曲子，随便凑上的。」子玉道：「什么曲子？聘才道：「那舞向梅梢片片，及蛾儿粉蝶，是《江天雪》的《走雪》上的。」子玉道：「下两句呢？」聘才道：「第三","en":"these are immortal products from the Jade Terrace above,\\ncommanding alone the foremost flower of the human world.\\n\\nZiyu said in surprise, \\"I had no idea you possessed such skill. You must have put a great deal of effort into poetry.\\" Pincai replied, \\"Where would I find the time for that? I just remembered a few arias and patched them together.\\" Ziyu asked, \\"What arias?\\""},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"剑潭、庸庵两兄同览。子玉拜手。外附拙作四首，又七绝五律各一首，即乞郢正。","en":"\\"To Jiantan and Yong'an, both brothers, for their joint perusal. Ziyu, with clasped hands. Attached are four rough compositions of mine, along with one seven-character quatrain and one five-character regulated poem; please kindly correct them.\\""},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子玉","庾香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"仲清等再看子玉的诗题是：《雪意》、《雪影》、《雪声》、《雪色》。仲清向王恂道：「这四个题目太空，比我们更难着笔，庾香必有佳制。」说着看诗，只见上写着：","en":"Zhongqing and the others then looked at Ziyu's poem titles: Snow Feeling, Snow Shadow, Snow Sound, Snow Color. Zhongqing said to Wang Xun, \\"These four topics are entirely abstract—even harder to get a brush around than ours. Yuxiang is sure to have produced something fine.\\" With that, they looked"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":2,"tokens":["庾香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「这几首诗，把我们的都压下去了。」再看聘才的那首绝句。王恂道：「这首亦甚好，只不知庾香又做这一首做什么？」仲清道：「这首也还下得去，然断不是庾香所作。」再看元茂的五律，起二句写着是：「天上彤云布，来思雨雪盈。」王恂道：「这「来思」两字怎么讲？」仲清忽然大笑道：「你往下看。」王恂再看第二联是：「白人双目近，长马四蹄轻。」沉吟道：「马蹄轻","en":"all of ours.\\" They then looked at Pincai's quatrain. Wang Xun said, \\"This one is also quite good, but what made Yuxiang compose this extra one on his own?\\" Zhongqing replied, \\"This one is passable, but it is certainly not Yuxiang's work.\\" They then looked at Yuanmao's five-character regulated poem. The opening couplet read:\\nIn the sky, vermilion clouds spread;\\nmy thoughts"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":1,"tokens":["庾香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"。」王恂道：「李世兄不应如此，看他斯斯文文，却还有些书气。」仲清道：「惟其有了书气，所以没有诗气。」王恂道：「庾香叫我们批，我们还是批不批？」仲清道：「你就何妨批他一批。」王恂道：「我为什么得罪人呢？」仲清道：「我来先把聘才这首全圈了。」批了一个批语是：得天公玉戏之神。","en":"him.\\" Zhongqing replied, \\"Precisely because he has scholarly spirit, he lacks poetic spirit.\\" Wang Xun asked, \\"Yuxiang asks us to comment on them. Shall we or not?\\" Zhongqing said, \\"You might as well give them a comment.\\" Wang Xun said, \\"Why should I make enemies?\\" Zhongqing said, \\"Let me begin by marking Pincai's quatrain with a full circle.\\" He wrote a critical note:"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":3,"tokens":["子玉","庾香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"元茂的诗第一二联单圈，下四句全圈。批语云：裁对工稳，用古入化，足可嗣响元徽。王恂把子玉的诗，用针在碧纱橱内戳了，来看批语，笑道：「却批得好，就是太挖苦些。」仲清道：「可惜天不早了，这雪也下不住，不然，倒可以去与庾香谈谈。」王恂道：「明日去罢！此刻去也谈不久了。」是日又下了一天一夜，积得有一尺厚了。次早晴了，朔风一吹，将一个世界，竟冻成","en":"dissolved into the new composition; fully worthy to carry on the succession of Yuanhui. Wang Xun used a needle to pin Ziyu's poems inside a translucent gauze cabinet, then read Zhongqing's comments and laughed. \\"The comments are well done, only slightly too barbed.\\" Zhongqing said, \\"What a pity it is already so late, and the snow will not hold off. Otherwise we could go"},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":5,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"门上通报了，子玉出来，迎了进去，便道：「两兄做得好诗，佩服之至。拙作草草涂鸦，未免小巫见大巫。」仲清道：「兄等所作，粗枝大叶，那里及得老弟的佳章，恬吟密咏，风雅宜人。」王恂道：「我最爱《雪意》、《雪色》这两首，清新俊逸，庾鲍兼长。」子玉道：「吾兄这四首，冰雪为怀，珠","en":"The gatekeeper announced them. Ziyu came out to welcome them inside, saying, \\"The two brothers have written excellent poems; my admiration is boundless. My own rough scribbles are inevitably a case of a minor shaman meeting a greater one.\\" Zhongqing replied, \\"What my brother and the others"},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":3,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"王恂又将孙氏昆仲与他说了，子玉也笑，就叫人请了聘才、元茂出来，大家见了。子玉把各人的诗交给了，说道：「这都是颜大兄评定的，称赞得了不得。」聘才看了批语，暗想道：「颜仲清这人，真可谓博古通今，我用的戏曲，都被他看出来了。」当向仲清道了谢。仲清道：「魏兄诗笔甚俊，声律兼优，想是常做，","en":"Wang Xun then also told him about the Sun brothers. Ziyu laughed, and had someone summon Pincai and Yuanmao to come out. Everyone met. Ziyu returned each person's poems and said, \\"These assessments were made by Elder Brother Yan; he was most complimentary.\\" Pincai read the comment and thought to himself: \\"This"},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":5,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"我看古人诗里也有把自己写在里面，就是这个意思。」王恂方才恍然。又说了一会闲话，仲清等告辞，子玉等送到门口，仲清道：「何不同出去看看雪景？」元茂听了，就高兴愿去。子玉道：「先生今日尚未全好，我们须在家伺候，改日再奉陪罢。」元茂撅了嘴不言语。仲清等告辞而去，子玉送出大门，进来与聘才、元茂又谈了一会诗，忽又问起琴官来。聘才见他有点意思，便轻轻的挑他","en":"intention.\\" Wang Xun suddenly understood. After more idle conversation, Zhongqing and Wang Xun said their farewells. Ziyu and the others escorted them to the door. Zhongqing suggested, \\"Why not come out with us to see the snow scenery?\\" Yuanmao, hearing this, was quite eager to go. Ziyu said, \\"The teacher has not fully recovered today. We must stay home to attend to him."},{"paragraph":33,"mentions":1,"tokens":["庾香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"雅，气象不凡。看他年纪，不过二十余岁的光景，带了四个相公，倚着楼窗而望。仲清、王恂暗暗吃惊：看他这品貌，足可与庾香匹敌，真是人中鸾凤。听他口音，也像江宁人，却又有些扬州话在里头。再看那四个相公，却非名下青钱，不过花中凡艳。王恂认得一个是蓉官，那三个都不认得，因问春喜。春喜道：「穿染貂的是玉美，穿倭刀的是四喜，穿水獭的是全福。都是剑春班的。」只见那位少年，将这边楼","en":"Zhongqing and Wang Xun were privately astonished. Looking at his appearance and bearing, he was fully a match for Yuxiang—truly a phoenix among men. From his accent, he seemed to be from Jiangning, yet there was also something of a Yangzhou intonation mixed in. Looking at the four young performers, they were none of them celebrated names or proven talent, no more than common"}],"5":[{"paragraph":11,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"入梅花林内不见了。琴官进去找时，见梅树之上，结了一个大梅子，细看是玉的，便也醒了。明日进城，在路上挤了车，见了子玉，就是梦中救他之人，心里十分诧异，所以呆呆看了他一回。但陌路相逢，也不知他姓名、居处，又无从访问。如逢堂会、园子里，四下留心，也没见他。后来见了徐子云，十分赏识他，赏了他许多衣裳什物，心里倒又疑疑惑惑。又知道是个贵公子，必有那富贵骄人之态，十分不愿去","en":"made of jade. Then he awoke. The next day upon entering the city, jostled in a traffic jam on the road, he saw Ziyu, who was the very person who had saved him in the dream. He was greatly astonished and could only stare at him dazedly for a while. But they were strangers on the road; he did not know the young man's name or address, and had no way to make inquiries."},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"云的好处，细细说给他听，琴官便也放了好些心。二人同上了车，琴官在前，宝珠在后，正是天赐奇缘，到了南小街口，恰值子玉从史南湘处转来，一车两马，劈面相逢，子玉恰不挂帘子，琴官却挂了帘子，已从玻璃窗内，望得清清楚楚。","en":"Qinguan in front, Baozhu behind. By happy coincidence, they reached the South Small Street intersection. They met Ziyu returning from Shi Nanxiang's, in a carriage with two horses, coming directly toward them. Ziyu had not drawn his curtain; Qinguan had drawn his, but through the glass window he had already seen clearly."},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"不觉把帘子一掀，露出一个绝代花容来。子玉瞥见，是前日所遇、聘才所说、朝思夕想的那个琴官，便觉喜动颜开，笑了一笑。见琴官也觉美目清扬，朱唇微绽，又把帘子放下，一转瞬间，各自风驰电掣的离远了。子玉见他今日车袭华美，已与前日不同，心里暗暗赞叹：「果信夜光难掩，明月自华，自然遇了赏鉴家，但不知所遇","en":"Unable to help himself, he raised the curtain, revealing a face of unparalleled beauty. Ziyu caught a glimpse and recognized the very Qinguan he had encountered before, the one Pincai had told him about, the one he had been thinking of day and night. Joy spread across his face and he smiled. He glimpsed Qinguan's clear bright eyes and slightly"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":4,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"再说子玉今日又遇见了琴官，十分快意，回家之后，急急的找了聘才，与他说知。聘才也有些喜欢，因将路上的光景，细说与子玉。原来聘才与叶茂林同行到济宁州时，那一班相公上岸去了，独见琴官在船中垂泪，便问了他好些心事，终不答应。及说到敢是不愿唱戏，恐辱没了父母的话，他方","en":"Now let us return to Ziyu, who had again encountered Qinguan that day and was in excellent spirits. Returning home, he immediately sought out Pincai to tell him what had happened. Pincai was somewhat pleased as well, and proceeded to describe to Ziyu the scene on the road. It"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":4,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"所以天下的至宝，惟有美色为第一，如果真美色，天下人没有不爱的。子玉前日在戏园的光景，倒像那个保珠沾染了他什么，那片心应该永远不动才是。谁知一个琴官，见了两次，还如电光石火，一过不留，心里就时时的思念。何况他人，其自守本不如子玉，又能与美人朝夕相见，自然爱慕更切，把个百炼钢化为绕指柔了。聘才自知与琴官无缘，巴结不上，","en":"world, true beauty is the foremost. If it is genuine beauty, there is no one in the world who does not love it. Ziyu's experience at the theater the other day had been such that Baozhu seemed to have made some impression on him; his heart ought to have been forever unmoved. Yet who would have known that after only two encounters with Qinguan, it was like a flash of"},{"paragraph":38,"mentions":4,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"李先生也散了学，时常出去，找些同乡同年聚谈消遣。到了除夕这一天，聘才、元茂在书房闷坐，大有作客凄凉之感。少顷，子玉出来对他二人说道：「昨日听得王母舅于团拜那一日，格外备两桌酒请我们，还有孙氏弟兄。」元茂道：「我是不去的，我又不是同乡。」子玉道：「那不要紧，一来是王母舅单请我们的，又不与他们坐在一处；二来也是庸庵的意思，你若不去，就大家无趣了。」聘才笑道：「若果如","en":"Pincai and Yuanmao sat idly in the study, feeling very much the melancholy of guests far from home. Presently Ziyu came out and said to both of them: \\"Yesterday I heard that Uncle Wang, on the day of the group-visit ceremony, will especially prepare two tables of wine to host us, and also the Sun brothers.\\" Yuanmao said: \\"I will not go. I am not even from the same"},{"paragraph":39,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"素玻璃灯，元茂上前叩了头。聘才也来辞岁，性全连忙还礼，即同了他们到老师、师母跟前辞岁，士燮挡住了。颜夫人即吩咐子玉出去叩贺先生，梅学士即领了子玉，来到书房，彼此贺毕，便摆上酒肴。","en":"and Teacher's Wife. Scholar Mei stopped them from the full formality of bowing. Lady Yan immediately instructed Ziyu to go out and offer New Year's greetings to the Teacher. Scholar Mei then personally escorted Ziyu to the study; they exchanged congratulations, and wine and food were set out."},{"paragraph":41,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"士燮是个言方行矩的人，更配上那个李性全，席间无非讲些修身立行，勉励子玉的话。李元茂拘拘束束，菜也不敢吃，坐着好不难受。倒是聘才还能假充老实，学些迂腐的话，与他们谈谈。不多一会，也就散了席。梅学士又在外坐了一会，讲了好些话，然后同了子玉进去。性全、元茂等亦各安寝，且待下回分解。","en":"conversation at the table was nothing but discourse on self-cultivation and moral rectitude, all words of exhortation to Ziyu. Li Yuanmao sat stiff and constrained, hardly daring to eat, in considerable discomfort. Only Pincai managed to pretend at being earnest, affecting pedantic speech to converse with them. After not too long, the banquet dissolved. Scholar Mei sat outside"}],"6":[{"paragraph":10,"mentions":3,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"颜夫人领着一群仆妇丫鬟迎将出来，引进了内堂。这颜夫人虽四十外的人，尚觉丰采如仙，其面貌与子玉彷佛。颜夫人见琼华小姐更觉生得好了，清如浣雪，秀若餐霞，疑不食人间烟火食者。而蓉华小姐朗润清华，外妍内秀。那个孙氏少奶奶佩秋，媚妍婉妙，和顺如春。两夫人见过了礼，然后两位少奶奶、一位姑娘，齐齐的拜见了颜夫人，各叙了些寒温。陆夫人问起子玉来，颜夫人说他","en":"hall. Though past forty, Lady Yan possessed an almost immortal grace, her features closely resembling those of Ziyu. She found Miss Qionghua increasingly radiant—as pristine as newly fallen snow, as ethereal as one nourished by rosy dawn clouds, seemingly unburdened by mortal sustenance. Miss Ronghua, meanwhile, was luminous and bright, displaying an exquisite blend"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"众少奶奶见这屋子精雅，便都坐下。巴氏少奶奶是没有见过子玉的，见镜屏里画着一个美少年，面粉唇朱，秀气成彩，光华耀目，觉眼中从未见过这样美貌人，便拉孙氏少奶奶同看道：「姑奶奶你看这画，画得好么？」孙氏少奶奶一笑道：「这个就是我们将来的二姑爷，真画得像。」蓉华与沈氏少奶奶都来看子玉的小照，惟有琼华不来，独自走到","en":"refined and elegant, the young mistresses took their seats. The young mistress, née Ba, who had never laid eyes on Ziyu, noticed a portrait of a beautiful young man on a mirror screen—a face of flawless, powder-white skin and crimson lips, radiating an elegance that dazzled the eye, unlike anyone she had ever seen. Pulling the young mistress, née Sun, closer, she said,"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"那边众少奶奶也出来，巴氏少奶奶还将子玉的小照看个不已，出来时还回头了两次，不觉失口赞道：「这才是个佳公子呢。」","en":"Soon after, the other young mistresses emerged. The young mistress, née Ba, could scarcely tear her gaze from Ziyu's portrait; as she left, she cast two more lingering glances backward, involuntarily exclaiming, \\"Now that is a truly magnificent young nobleman!\\""},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":5,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"次日，要说姑苏会馆团拜的事了，一早梅学士先去了。聘才于隔宿已向子玉借了一副衣裳，长短称身。只有元茂嫌自己的衣服不好，闷闷的不高兴，见了子玉华冠丽服的出来，相形之下颇不相称，便赌气脱下衣裳，仍穿了便服，说道：「我不去了。」子玉就命云儿进去。禀知太太，将我的衣服拿一副出来，说李少爷要穿，云儿随即捧了一包出来。谁知子玉虽","en":"at the Suzhou Guild Hall. Scholar Mei departed early in the morning. Pincai had borrowed a set of clothes from Ziyu the previous night—a perfect fit. Only Yuanmao remained dissatisfied with his attire, brooding in a foul mood; seeing Ziyu emerge in his splendid official hat and elegant garments, he felt acutely inferior and stubbornly tore off his clothes, reverting"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":3,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"再穿了外面的猞猁裘，子玉又将个大毛貂冠给他戴了，觉得毛茸茸的一大团，车里都要坐不下去，惹得子玉、聘才皆笑。带了四个书童出来，外面已套了两辆车，四匹马。子玉独坐一车，聘才、元茂同坐一车，一径来到姑苏会馆，车已歇满了。","en":"Next, he donned the outer lynx-fur coat, and Ziyu placed a massive sable fur hat upon his head—a colossal, fluffy sphere that barely fit within the carriage. Ziyu and Pincai burst into irrepressible laughter. Accompanied by four book-boys, they found two carriages already harnessed with four horses"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"人见了，迎上前来，道：「王少爷、颜少爷来了多时了，诸位老爷早已到齐。」遂一直引至正座，见已开了戏。座中诸老辈，子玉尚有几位不认识，士燮指点他一一见了礼，这些老前辈个个称赞不休。随后聘才、元茂上来与王文辉见礼。聘才还生得伶俐，这元茂又系近视眼，再加上那套衣服，转动不便，一个揖作完，站起来，不料把文辉的帽子碰歪在一边。文辉连忙整好，元茂也涨红了脸，就想走开。","en":"area, where the operatic performance was already underway. Among the distinguished elders, there were several Ziyu had yet to meet; Scholar Mei pointed them out, and Ziyu offered his respects to each, receiving lavish praise in return. Pincai and Yuanmao then stepped forward to greet Wang Wenhui. Pincai, nimble and composed, managed the introduction smoothly; Yuanmao,"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":6,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"偏有那司业沈公，年老健谈，拉住了子玉，见他这样丰神秀澈，如神仙中人，想起他那位娇客来，真觉人道中，有天仙化人、魑魅魍魉两途。便问了目下所读何书，所习何文的话，子玉一一答了。子玉尚是年轻，被这些老前辈，你一句我一句的赞，倒赞得他很不好意思。沈大人放了手，子玉等告退，来至东边楼上，王恂、颜","en":"Just then, Imperial College Director Shen—elderly but famously talkative—seized Ziyu's arm. Struck by his extraordinary, almost ethereal beauty, and remembering his own son-in-law, he mused that the human realm held two extremes: celestial beings walking the earth, and monstrous demons. He asked about the books Ziyu was currently studying"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子玉","庾香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"当下王恂、仲清引了子玉过去，与他们一一见了，彼此都是年谊世交，各叙了些仰慕之意。刘文泽道：「庸庵，你请客怎么不通知我一声。就是你请这二位生客，我们在一处也很好，何必又要另坐在那边。」王恂笑道：「不是我定要与你们分开，庾香是不用说的，就是这李、魏二位长兄，也是最有趣的人。","en":"Wang Xun and Zhongqing guided Ziyu over, facilitating introductions. Bound by examination-year ties and family connections, they exchanged warm pleasantries. Liu Wenze said, \\"Yong'an, when arranging this banquet, why didn't you inform me? Even these two guest-friends of yours could have"},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":6,"tokens":["庾香","子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"过来！正席上有许多老前辈在那里，巴老三想必也不动手的。」王恂只得叫将那边两桌，就搬过这边，一同坐下，南湘道：「庾香，你今日就看见好戏好人了，你才信我不是言过其实呢。」子玉笑道：「你定的第一，我已经请教过了。」南湘道：「何如，可赏识得不错？」子玉笑而不言。王恂道；「你几时见过的？」子玉道：「你好记性，那天还问你要饭吃，拉住了你，你倒忘了？」南湘侧耳而听，听这说话诧","en":"Left with no choice, Wang Xun ordered the two tables moved over, and everyone sat together. Nanxiang turned to Ziyu, \\"Today you will witness magnificent opera and exquisite performers—then you will believe I was not exaggerating.\\" Ziyu smiled, \\"You named your foremost one; I have already had the pleasure.\\" Nanxiang pressed, \\"And? Does your appreciation endure?\\" Ziyu"},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"随意坐最好」。大家都要远着孙氏弟兄，便乱坐起来。刘文泽、沈伯才、巴霖、张仲雨坐了一席；史南湘、颜仲清、高品拉了子玉过来，坐了一席；聘才、元茂坐了一席；嗣徽、嗣元坐了一席，王恂只好两席轮流作陪。孙嗣徽又之乎者也的闹了一会，问了魏、李二位姓名、籍贯。一面就摆上菜喝酒。高品见嗣徽的脸上疙瘩更多了好些，喝了几杯酒，那个红鼻子如经霜辣子，通红光亮。","en":"Wenze, Shen Bocai, Ba Lin, and Zhang Zhongyu claimed one table; Shi Nanxiang, Yan Zhongqing, and Gao Pin pulled Ziyu to a second; Pincai and Yuanmao took a third; leaving Sihui and Siyuan isolated at the fourth, with Wang Xun moving between tables to act as host. Sun Sihui, adopting his pedantic \\"the Master says\\" persona, began interrogating Wei and Li about their"},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"恶，倒不晓得他有何寓意，便再问他。巴霖道：「也是个三字经，打手统是捋、捋、捋，倒溺壶是别、别、别。」众人大笑。子玉赞道：「这两经尤妙，实在说得自然得很。」从此嗣元又添了一个「朱批三字经」的诨名。嗣元将要翻脸，又因他父亲在上，且从前被巴霖打过几回，吃了痛苦，因此不敢与较，只好忍气结舌。唯把那只眼睛睁大了，狠狠的瞪着他滴泪。","en":"the hand-gun is: pull-pull-pull. Emptying the chamber-pot is: lean-lean-lean.\\" The room roared with laughter. Ziyu praised, \\"These two Classics are exceptionally fine—truly expressed with perfect naturalness.\\" From that moment, Siyuan gained the moniker \\"the Unapproved Three-Character Classic.\\" Enraged, Siyuan was ready to explode, but fearful of his father's presence"},{"paragraph":30,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"停了一会，见聘才的跟班走到聘才身边道：「叶先生送来的戏单。」子玉过来，与聘才同看，见头几出是《扫花》、《三醉》、《议剑》、《谒师》、《赏荷》，都已唱过；以下是《功宴》、《瑶台》、《舞盘》、《偷诗》、《题曲》、《山门》、《出猎》、《回猎》、《游园惊梦》，末后是《明珠记》上的《侠隐》，子玉悄悄的向聘才道：「戏倒罢了，","en":"A moment later, Pincai's attendant approached and whispered, \\"Master Ye has sent the opera program.\\" Ziyu leaned over to review it with Pincai. The opening pieces—'Sweeping Flowers,' 'Three Times Drunk,' 'Discussing the Sword,' 'Paying Respects to the Teacher,' and 'Appreciating the Lotuses'—had already concluded. The remaining lineup included 'Merit Banquet,'"},{"paragraph":31,"mentions":3,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉等往下看时，却是王文辉在那里发气，见一个人只管赔着笑，又向文辉请安。又听文辉说道：「就是在徐老爷那里，唱一出再去何妨；况且定戏时，怎样交代你的？」那人道：「这出《惊梦》有个新来的琴官，比宝珠还好。大人不信，叫他先唱一出瞧瞧，如果不中大人的意，再赶着去","en":"Ziyu and the others peered over the balcony: Wang Wenhui was throwing a tantrum. A man stood beside him, bowing repeatedly and offering placating smiles. Wenhui snapped, \\"Even at Master Xu's house, what harm is there in singing a single piece before leaving?"},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"《功宴》唱完了，是《瑶台》出场。子玉一见，吃了一惊，心上迷迷糊糊倒先当他是琴官，又看不大像，比琴官略大些。","en":"As 'Merit Banquet' concluded, 'The Jade Terrace' commenced. Catching his first glimpse of the performer, Ziyu started; in a momentary daze, he mistook the figure for Qinguan, before realizing this actor was slightly older."},{"paragraph":33,"mentions":3,"tokens":["子玉","庾香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"花开到八分，色艳到十足。已看得出神，便问南湘道：「这是谁？有此秀骨。」南湘道：「这个算好吗，只怕也难入品题。」子玉知南湘故意讥诮他，便问仲清，仲清道：「这就是《花选》上第二的瑶台璧月苏蕙芳。」子玉叹道：「天地钟灵尽于此矣，我竟如夏虫不可语冰，难怪竹君怪我。」南湘哈哈大笑道：「我也不怪的，幸你自行检举。」文泽道：「怎么？庾香连苏媚香也不认识。」南湘道：「他是秀才不","en":"blossom opening to eight-tenths of its glory, his beauty shining with absolute brilliance. Already transfixed, Ziyu asked Nanxiang, \\"Who is this? He possesses such exquisite bone structure.\\" Nanxiang replied, \\"Do you find this good? I'm afraid he barely registers on the rankings.\\" Knowing Nanxiang was intentionally baiting him, Ziyu turned to Zhongqing. Zhongqing"},{"paragraph":34,"mentions":6,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉倒有些不放心，恐琴官也未必压得下这苏蕙芳，且先聚精会神等着。上场门口，帘子一掀，琴官已经见过二次，这面目记得逼真的了。手锣响处，莲步移时，香风已到，正如八月十五月圆夜，龙宫赛宝，宝气上腾，月光下接，似云非云的，结成了一个五彩祥云华盖，其光华色艳非世间","en":"Anxious that Qinguan might struggle to match Su Huifang's brilliance, Ziyu focused his entire attention on the stage. The entrance curtain was swept aside, revealing Qinguan—the very same youth he had glimpsed twice before, whose delicate features were flawlessly engraved in his memory. At the resonant strike of the hand-gong,"},{"paragraph":35,"mentions":11,"tokens":["子玉","庾香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"原来琴官一出场，早已看见子玉，他是梦中多见了一回，今日已是第四回了，心里暗暗欢喜道：「难得今日这位公子也在这里。」到第二次出场，唱那「雨香云片」这枝曲子，一面唱，那眼波只望着子玉溜来，子玉心里十分畅满。文泽低低的对南湘道：「这个新来的相公，倒与庾香很熟，你瞧这一片神情，尽注意着","en":"The moment Qinguan stepped onto the stage, he had instantly spotted Ziyu. Having encountered him once more in a dream—making this their fourth encounter in total—he felt a secret surge of joy: \\"What a fortunate coincidence—this gentleman is here today.\\" During his second entrance, while singing the aria 'Fragrance of Rain"},{"paragraph":36,"mentions":4,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"席间那个张仲雨与聘才叙起来是亲戚，讲得很投机。聘才又把合席的人都恭维拉拢了一会。子玉又见那些相公，到正席上去劝酒的劝酒，讲话的讲话；颇觉有趣。又见他的舅舅王文辉，分外比人高兴，后又看了一出戏。正席上刘侍郎、梅学士、吴阁学、沈司业先散。子玉见他父亲走了，天也不早，也要回去。刚起身时，忽见一个美少年上楼来。文泽的家人说道：「冯少爷来了！","en":"friendship. Pincai dedicated his time to cultivating goodwill, offering compliments to everyone seated nearby. Ziyu watched with quiet amusement as the opera performers circulated among the main tables, pouring wine and engaging in lively banter. He also noted his uncle, Wang Wenhui, who appeared more exuberantly animated than anyone else in the room. Another operatic"},{"paragraph":37,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"文泽对子玉道：「初九日弟备小酌，屈吾兄一叙，作个清谈雅集。人不多，就是竹君、剑潭、庸庵、卓然几位，吾兄断不可推辞。」子玉应允，又谢了。王恂、聘才、元茂也同道了谢，一径先回。那些人又谈了一会，也各散去。不知后事如何，且听下回分解。","en":"Wenze turned to Ziyu and said, \\"On the ninth, I am hosting a small gathering and hope Elder Brother will honor us with a visit—a refined discourse and elegant assembly. It will be an intimate group: just Zhujun, Jiantan, Yong'an, Zhuoran, and a few others. Elder Brother"}],"7":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说子玉从会馆回来，将琴官的戏足足想了两日，以谓天下之美莫过于此。又将苏蕙芳、陆素兰、金漱芳、李玉林的色艺品评，都为绝顶。细细核来，蕙芳的神色尤胜于诸人，次则素兰可以匹敌。然较比琴官起来，毫厘之间终觉稍逊。又想：","en":"After returning from the guild hall, Ziyu spent two full days reflecting on Qinguan's performance, convinced it was the pinnacle of worldly beauty. He also appraised Su Huifang, Lu Sulan, Jin Shufang, and Li Yulin, finding them all to be utterly superlative. Yet upon careful comparison, Huifang's"},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":3,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"前日我听得二姑娘雪儿说，孙家太太做媒，将二姑娘配了少爷了，将二姑娘配了少爷了，二姑娘还戴了太太一根簪子回去。」子玉似信不信的问道：「我不信，你敢是撒谎的？」小丫鬟道：「我敢撒谎？我那天看着房没有敢走开，这是雪儿说的。只怕咱们家里人，都也知道。」子玉听了心内甚喜，猛想起这二表妹的容貌，也有些像琴官的模样，便将他们比较起来，不知谁好。又把挖去的字一想，恍然大悟：「谁","en":"betrothed the Second Miss to you, Young Master—she even took one of the Mistress's hairpins with her.\\" Half-believing, Ziyu asked, \\"I don't believe it—are you making this up?\\" The maidservant protested, \\"Would I dare lie? I was watching the room that day and didn't dare leave. That's what Xue'er said. I expect the whole household knows by now.\\" Hearing this, Ziyu felt a surge"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"到了初九日，刘文泽又着人来邀了。子玉告票萱堂，更衣乘舆而去。","en":"On the ninth day, Liu Wenze sent someone to extend another invitation. After informing his mother, Ziyu changed his clothes and departed in his carriage."},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":4,"tokens":["梅子玉","子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"且说文泽所请的容颜仲清、王恂、史南湘已经到了，随后梅子玉、高品一同到门。家人引着走过大厅，到了花厅之旁垂花门进去，系石子砌成的一条甬道，两边都是太湖石迭成高高低低的假山，衬着参参差差的寒树。远远望去，却也有台有亭，布置得十分幽雅。转了两三个弯，过了一座石桥，甬路旁是一色的，都是绿竹，绕着一带红阑，迎面便是","en":"residence, the invited guests—Yan Zhongqing, Wang Xun, and Shi Nanxiang—had already arrived, followed shortly by Mei Ziyu and Gao Pin at the gate. A servant guided them past the main hall, through a flowered gate beside the reception hall, and onto a pebble-paved path. On either side, irregular artificial hills of Lake Tai rocks were artfully arranged, interspersed with"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"款是「道生屈本立书」，书法古拙异常。下面一张大案，案上罗列着许多书籍。旁边摆着十二盆唐花，香气袭人，令人心醉。子玉看了，又想起琴言那日作戏光景，真是宝光夺人，香气沁骨，不觉有些模糊起来。忽听文泽道：「这屋子太敞，我们里面坐罢。」随同到东边，有书童揭起帘子，进去却是三间书房，中间玻璃窗隔作两层。从旁绕进，玻璃窗内又是两间套房。朝南窗内，即看得见外面。上悬着董香光写","en":"twelve pots of forced winter flowers, their fragrance wafting over and intoxicating the senses. Taking it all in, Ziyu was reminded of Qinyan's performance—a dazzling, jewel-like radiance and a fragrance that pierced the bone—and he felt momentarily dazed. Suddenly, Wenze's voice broke his reverie: \\"This room is too drafty; let us sit inside.\\" They proceeded east, where"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":6,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"文泽道：「这有何可笑？」南湘忽然想着，抚掌大笑道：「这促狭鬼，实在可恶，难为他实在对得敏捷。」子玉等悟着也都笑了，道：「雅字竟当他实字，真对得工稳。」文泽道：「卓兄，我出一对你对，却不许思索。如对得好，我吃三杯。对不出，罚十杯。不好，罚五杯。」高品道：「从来说出对容易，对对难。对不出三杯，对不好一杯，如何？」南湘道：「也要看上对出得难不难，你且说","en":"and roared with laughter, \\"This mischievous devil is truly incorrigible, but one must admit it's a quick match!\\" Ziyu and the others also burst into laughter as realization dawned. \\"He has read a function word as a content word — and the match is exact for all that.\\" Wenze proposed, \\"Zhuo Brother, I'll give you a line to match, but you cannot pause to think. If it's"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":3,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"文泽道「双」字，仲清对「孤」字，高品对「八」，字子玉对「九」字，王恂道：「不好了，顺着数儿就是十罢。」南湘道：「是了，我这个字倒有些难下，也罢，对「三」字罢。」文泽道「辇」宇。南湘道：「我晓得一定是这句诗。」子玉抢对了一个「琴」字，王恂对了「车」字，南湘对了「船」字，只有高品未对。文泽催道：「再迟要罚","en":"Wenze presented '双' (Double/Pair): Zhongqing matched '孤' (Solitary), Gao Pin matched '八' (Eight), Ziyu matched '九' (Nine), and Wang Xun lamented, \\"Oh no, I suppose I must follow the sequence with '十' (Ten).\\" Nanxiang pondered, \\"That's right, my character is a bit tricky to place. Very well, I'll match '三' (Three).\\" Finally, Wenze set '辇' (Imperial Carriage)."},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":4,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"再看子玉对的是「九鸾天上听琴来」。大家赞道：「这句真对得字字稳惬，又在剑潭之上。」于是公贺了一杯。南湘对的是「三鸦水上送船归」。文泽道：「竹君此对，未免杂凑。」南湘道：「你这试官，少所见而多所怪，要挖眼睛了。这才对得工呢。」子玉道：「真对得好。」文泽道：「这","en":"Next, they examined Ziyu's match: 'Nine phoenixes descend from heaven to hear the lute. (九鸾天上听琴来)' Everyone praised it: \\"This matches perfectly character by character, and it surpasses Jiantan's.\\" Thus, they offered a congratulatory toast. Nanxiang's match read: 'Three crows"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"。若要再加，万万来不得了，只好不说罢。」文泽道：「不加就是了。」高品道：「把我的对句，倒转来念，你说好不好？」子玉同玉恂、文泽暗暗的念了一遍，都不觉鼓掌大笑起来，子玉笑得伏在桌上，王恂笑得靠着南湘，引得南湘、仲清又笑了一阵。","en":"relented, \\"No additions, then.\\" Gao Pin proposed, \\"Read my matching line backward — 前舟靠后露鸡八 — how does it sound?\\" Ziyu, Wang Xun, and Wenze silently read it to themselves, and soon found themselves clapping and roaring with laughter. Ziyu laughed so hard he collapsed onto the table, while Wang Xun leaned heavily against Nanxiang, setting off another wave of laughter"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":10,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"。高品道：「五杯一口气喝，定要醉倒。还是与各人豁一拳，或者可以希冀。」随顺手一个个豁完，却也有输有赢。各饮毕，子玉作令官，一个个出了四字，是「费影收肠」。南湘对的是「惊声放胆」，王恂是「融香浣乳」，文泽是「翻么小舌」，仲清是「多仙散发」，独高品对得别致，是「除伊放粪」，大家看了已经发笑。子玉又出了一个「台」字，南湘道：「这句好生。」沉吟了一会，对了「馆」字，王恂","en":"thumb-guessing with each person; winning some and losing others. Once the rounds were settled and the wine drunk, Ziyu took his turn as game-master, offering four characters for all to match: '费影收肠' (expend, shadow, withdraw, sorrow). Nanxiang matched '惊声放胆' (startle, sound, release, courage); Wang Xun matched '融香浣乳' (melt, fragrance, wash, milk); Wenze matched '翻么小舌'"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"高品道：「我的「鸟」与「雀」总是一样，你的「鸟」字若换了「雀」字不好么？」文泽想了一想，却也有理。子玉就只取了仲清、王恂两副对句，其余文泽、高品罚了酒。","en":"changed to 'que,' wouldn't that also be an improvement?\\" Wenze considered this and conceded the point. Ultimately, Ziyu accepted only Zhongqing's and Wang Xun's matching lines as passing; Wenze and Gao Pin were penalized with wine."},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":3,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"」字，高品对「正」字。王恂道：「平对平使得么？」众人道：「使得，已经对过了。」王恂道「晨」字，仲清是「秋」字，子玉是「冬」字。南湘又出「月」字。高品道：「竹君的心思与众不同，这两字必定不连的，我对「阳」字。」王恂对「霜」，子玉对「雪」，仲清对「空」。文泽道：「管他连不连，我们只管对我们的。」对了「云」字。南湘出了一个「三」字，高品道：「何如，不是三月。就是三春，","en":"\\"Certainly—it has been done before.\\" Wang Xun matched '晨' (morning/dawn), Zhongqing matched '秋' (autumn), and Ziyu matched '冬' (winter). Nanxiang then offered '月' (moon). Gao Pin noted, \\"Zhujun's thinking is always unconventional—these two characters surely won't connect logically, so I'll match '阳' (sun/sunlight).\\" Wang Xun matched '霜' (frost), Ziyu matched '雪'"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「兔」字。你们对罢。」王恂道：「貉」字。」仲清道：「鹰能制兔，我对「鹰」字。」子玉道：「骑着驴子放鹰，想来是没有的，且借他来对对，就是「驴」字。」文泽道：","en":"of you.' Wang Xun offered '貉' (badger). Zhongqing reasoned, 'The eagle masters the rabbit—I match '鹰' (eagle).' Ziyu pondered, 'A donkey-rider flying a hawk is likely unheard of, but I'll borrow it for the match—'驴' (donkey).' Wenze said:"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":1,"tokens":["庾香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"字，内中前舟的「夏云半堆乌」，「乌」字原也借对得好。然凭文取之，究不若剑潭的「秋空一盘鹰」浑脱，还该让他第一。庾香的「冬雪一敲驴」，庸庵的「晨霜一丰貂」，都对得很工。最不好的是卓然的「正阳一伏龟」，这「正阳」二字如何加得上？」高品笑问文泽道：「贵处是那里？」","en":"cannot rival Jiantan's 'Autumn sky one-wheel eagle (秋空一盘鹰)'—so pure and unrestrained; it deserves first place. Yuxiang's 'Winter snow one-knock donkey (冬雪一敲驴)' and Yong'an's 'Morning frost one-lush sable (晨霜一丰貂)' are both skillfully matched. The worst is Zhuoran's 'Upright-sun one-prostrate tortoise. (正阳一伏龟)' How can 'upright sun' (zheng yang) possibly apply to a tortoise?\\""},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"以下仲清做令官，一个个字出的对是「丝发白日如新」六字，高品属的是「签毛朱天入长」。子玉对的是「镜颜华年对好。」南湘是「竹唇朱声吹慢。」王恂是「剪衣乌时试拂」。文泽是「草麻黄朝起视」。仲清写出上联是「白发如丝日日新」。","en":"(silk, hair, white, day, as, new). Gao Pin assembled: '签毛朱天入长' (signature, feather, vermilion, sky, enter, long). Ziyu matched: '镜颜华年对好' (mirror, complexion, glorious, year, face, good). Nanxiang matched: '竹唇朱声吹慢' (bamboo, lip, crimson, sound, blow, slow). Wang Xun matched: '剪衣乌时试拂' (scissors, garment, raven, time, try, brush). Wenze matched: '草麻黄朝起视' (grass, hemp, yellow,"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"把文泽的「黄麻起草朝朝视」取了第一，子玉的「华颜对镜年年好」取了第二，南湘的「朱唇吹竹声声慢」夹圈了，取了第三。大家都道：「这两副对都好，似乎竹君的较胜。令官甲乙，似不甚公。」仲清道：「这两本卷子都好，是不用说的。","en":"He ranked Wenze's match—'Yellow hemp paper, edicts drafted, scanned morning after morning (黄麻起草朝朝视)'—as first; Ziyu's match—'Glorious face against the mirror—year after year beautiful (华颜对镜年年好)'—as second; and Nanxiang's match—'Crimson lips blow bamboo—note after note (Sheng Sheng Man)'—received circled marks and placed third. The group murmured, \\"Both of these matches"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":1,"tokens":["庾香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"面子上看去竹君的「竹」对「丝」，「朱唇」对「白发」，工巧极矣，「声声慢」又暗藏曲牌名，似乎在庾香之上，我所以把他夹圈了。但上对即是一字字拆开，必得一字字恰对方好。","en":"hair,' is exquisitely crafted; 'Sheng Sheng Man' ingeniously conceals a ci tune title, seemingly placing it above Yuxiang's—which is why I awarded it circled marks."},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":3,"tokens":["庾香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"庾香以「年」对「日」最妥，竹君以「声」对「日」，就不很对，假使「日」字不是迭用。或者竟是「白日」，那「朱声」就讲不去了，到底不及庾香的稳当，而且句子大方，不落纤巧，诸公以为然否？」几句话说得众人很服。南湘向来不肯让人，此时亦甚首肯。高品道：「然则我以「天","en":"\\"However, since the opening line is split character by character, each must match precisely. Yuxiang's use of 'year' to match 'day' is highly fitting; Zhujun's use of 'sound' to match 'day'—well, if 'day' is not reduplicated, or simply means 'broad daylight,' then 'crimson sound' becomes impossible to parse. Ultimately, it lacks the flawless balance"},{"paragraph":31,"mentions":3,"tokens":["子玉","庾香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「此番卓然大概要取第一了，字字对得很稳。」子玉对的是「情深西旦感昆名」。南湘的是」图多西士画名园」。一一对毕，王恂写出出句，是「香销南国美人尽」。文泽对的是「曲谱东山名妓多。」仲清是「赋炼东都学士难」。高品是「斗驾西方齐圣长」。子玉是「情感西昆名旦深」。南湘是「图画西园名士多。」王恂道：「这第一","en":"\\"This time, Zhuoran is likely taking first place—every character matches with immense stability.\\" Ziyu matched: 'Deep feeling, Western dan-performer, moves Kun, fame.' Nanxiang matched: 'Many paintings, Western scholars, paint famous gardens.' As they finished, Wang Xun revealed the opening line: 'Fragrance fades in the Southern kingdom—the beauties are"},{"paragraph":35,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"来混人」。便道：「你这六个字可是「重诏和」三字么？若不说明。我们就罢考了。」高品被他猜着，只得笑嘻嘻的点点头。子玉对了「卓言贯」三字，南湘对了「品阳长」三字，王恂对了「一龄庆」三字，文泽对了「品奸动」三字，仲清对了「管毫定」三字。高品又一连出了四字是「九喜气凤」。","en":"(Repeat-Decree-Harmony)? If you don't clarify, we'll refuse to sit for the exam.\\" Caught out, Gao Pin could only smile and nod. Ziyu matched with three characters: '卓言贯' (Zhuo-speech-penetrating); Nanxiang matched: '品阳长' (Pin-sun-long); Wang Xun matched: '一龄庆' (One-year-celebrate); Wenze matched: '品奸动' (Pin, intercourse, move); Zhongqing matched: '管毫定' (Tube-fine hair-determined)."},{"paragraph":36,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"仲清道：「这倒不是拆字的，我就对「一高标兔」。」文泽道：「我就对「一欢心鸡」。」王恂道：「我对「第长年龟」。」子玉对了「超元精人」，南湘对了「一精神龙。」高品背着人写了上联，搁着笔，把大众的看了一回，鼻子里笑了一笑，就用纸蘸着酒，把粉板上的字一齐擦了。众人都诧异道：","en":"followed, \\"I'll match '一欢心鸡' (one-joy-heart-rooster).\\" Wang Xun added, \\"I'll match '第长年龟' (rank-long-year-tortoise).\\" Ziyu matched: '超元精人' (surpassing-primal-refined-person). Nanxiang matched: '一精神龙' (one-spirit-dragon). Gao Pin turned his back, wrote out his opening line, set down his brush, and inspected everyone's submissions. With a quiet snort of amusement, he took"},{"paragraph":37,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"来把人取笑了。我想想他出的那几个字，凑起来看是一句什么。」仲清道：「他写的时候，我瞧见起头是「凤诏」两个字。」子玉想了想道：「莫非「凤诏九重和喜气」这句诗？」南湘道：「一点不错。」高品道：「不是，不是。」仲清道：「我们且各自记出对句来，就明白了。」子玉道：「我的「人言超卓贯元精」这句却不见好，也没有什么不通。」南湘道：「他是因他号卓然，这「卓贯元精」，因他受不住","en":"Zhongqing recalled, \\"While he was writing, I caught a glimpse of 'feng zhao' (phoenix-decree) at the beginning.\\" Ziyu thought for a moment, \\"Could it be 'The phoenix-decree from the nine heavens brings harmonious joyful air (凤诏九重和喜气)'?\\" Nanxiang confirmed, \\"Exactly right.\\" Gao Pin denied it, \\"No, no.\\" Zhongqing suggested, \\"Let us each recount our own matching line;"},{"paragraph":38,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉一面走着，向主人道：「这园子点缀得很幽雅。」文泽道：「这算什么园子，不及徐度香怡园十分之一，几时我同你去逛逛。」这里宾主二人讲着，那高品对仲清道：「你可晓得京里又来了一个精品么？」仲清笑道：「想是高品的弟兄。」高品道：「这人却也可以做得我的弟兄，闻他","en":"As Ziyu walked out, he complimented his host, \\"This garden is tastefully arranged—quite secluded and refined.\\" Wenze replied, \\"This barely qualifies as a garden, not even a tenth of Xu Duxiang's Garden of Contentment. Someday I'll take you there for a stroll.\\""}],"8":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说子玉从刘文泽家饮酒回来，已是二更多天。先见过父母，换了衣裳，来寻聘才、元茂说话，却见静悄悄的，掩了房门。那边虎儿走来道：「少爷出去后，师爷就有人请出去了，今日不回来。李少爷、魏少爷吃了早饭出去的。」子玉道：","en":"Ziyu returned from drinking at Liu Wenze's home long past the second watch of the night. After paying his respects to his parents and changing his garments, he went to seek out Pincai and Yuanmao for a chat. Yet he found their quarters perfectly silent, the"},{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「他们往那里去了？这时候还不回家。」说罢就往里头去了。却说聘才、元茂因子玉出了门，便觉纳闷。元茂自初六那一天，见了些标致相公，心上很想作乐，一来为他父亲拘管，二来手内无钱，不能随心所欲，即对聘才道：「今日你也该请我看本戏。」聘才道：「我若有钱，怕不请你，还等你说？」元茂便皱着眉，拢着袖子闲踱，踱了一会道：「我们两人听戏，三","en":"\\"Where could they have gone? To still be out at this hour!\\" Ziyu said, turning back inside. Now, once Ziyu had left the house earlier, Pincai and Yuanmao found themselves quite bored. Ever since the sixth day of the month when Yuanmao laid eyes upon those beautiful performers, his heart had been set on merrymaking."},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":1,"tokens":["梅庾香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"过这人，相貌倒好，就是人冷些。如今是天天在怡园徐度香处。还有个琪官，略比他和气些。」聘才道：「这个琴官，是我们梅庾香最得意的。」仲两道：「他也喜欢琴官吗？我倒不大见他出来。」元茂却呆呆听着，见有一个相公走来，到张仲雨面前请了安，又照应了聘才，对着元茂也弯了弯腰。元茂擦擦眼睛，聚起了眼光，把那相公一看，原来是前日在会馆里唱戏的，孙嗣徽极口称赞他。那相公便靠着张仲雨坐","en":"of Contentment. There is also Qiguan, who is somewhat more amiable.\\" Pincai noted, \\"This Qinguan is the one our Mei Yuxiang treasures above all.\\" Zhongyu raised an eyebrow. \\"He fancies Qinguan as well? I rarely see him out and about.\\" Yuanmao sat in a daze, listening quietly, when a young performer approached. The youth offered a respectful greeting to Zhang Zhongyu, acknowledged"}],"9":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"自安睡。到了次日，只得央了许顺，借了十吊钱的票子，分作两张，写了一封字，叫四儿送与叶茂林，分给二喜、保珠。后来子玉盘问，聘才、元茂只推张仲雨请去听戏下馆子，却将实情瞒过了。","en":"with a letter, they had Si'er deliver the money to Ye Maolin to distribute between Erxi and Baozhu. Later, when Ziyu asked, Pincai and Yuanmao simply claimed that Zhang Zhongyu had treated them to opera and a restaurant, keeping the truth concealed."},{"paragraph":2,"mentions":4,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"过了两日，已是元宵佳节，李性全带着元茂，到会馆中吃年酒去了，聘才出去逛灯未回。子玉一人正在无聊，恰好梅进进来说道：「刘少爷、颜少爷、王少爷，请少爷出去逛灯，都在门口等着。」子玉禀过父母，梅进即叫套了车，云儿跟着出来。仲清等却在车里等着，见子玉出来便下了车。刘文泽道：「如此良宵，千金一刻，我们趁着灯月，倒是步行好些，把车跟在后头，回","en":"a New Year banquet at the guild hall, while Pincai had gone out to view the lanterns and had not yet returned. Ziyu sat alone with nothing to do when Mei Jin came in and announced: \\"Young Master Liu, Young Master Yan, and Young Master Wang invite you to go out and view the lanterns. They are all waiting at the gate.\\" Ziyu reported to his parents, Mei Jin had the carriage"},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一进灯棚里，便人山人海的拥挤起来，还夹着些车马在里头。子玉等在那些店铺廊下，慢慢地走。只见那些店铺，都是悬灯结彩，有挂玻璃灯，有挂画纱灯，有里头摆着灯屏，有门外搭着灯楼；还有那些卖灯的，密密层层的摆着。幸喜街道宽阔，不然也就一步不能行了。还有那些人在门口放泥筒，放花炮，流星赶月，九龙戏珠，火树银花，锣鼓丝竹","en":"the lantern arbors, they were engulfed in a sea of people, with carriages and horses jostling among the crowds. Ziyu and the others strolled slowly along the shop verandahs. Every shop was hung with festive lanterns and colored streamers. There were glass lanterns, painted gauze lanterns, elaborate screens displayed inside, and lantern towers erected outside the doors,"},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":5,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"此时子玉在前，刚刚被那车轴拦住，过不去，文泽见车里一个少妇，生得颇好，打扮也十分华美，子玉恰恰的挤在车前，文泽见那少妇目不转睛的看着子玉，见子玉倒低了头，却无路可走。见那少妇一手把着车门，将身子一松，伸出一只脚来，正是三寸莲钩，纤不盈握。见他先盘了那边的腿，","en":"At that moment Ziyu was in the lead and had just been blocked by a carriage axle, unable to pass. Wenze noticed a young woman inside the carriage, quite handsome and exquisitely dressed. Ziyu happened to be squeezed against the front of the carriage. Wenze saw the young"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":3,"tokens":["庾香","子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"文泽扯扯王恂的衣服，低低的说道：「你看似为着庾香，要显显他的莲瓣。」王恂点头。仲清又在文泽后面说道：「焉知他不是为着你？」文泽笑道：「不像。」又低低的叫道：「庾香，那《施公案》有什么好看，你尽望着那几对灯。」子玉回转脸来，却与那少妇相对，见那少妇还在玻璃窗内看他，颇觉不好意思。","en":"Wenze tugged at Wang Xun's sleeve and murmured softly: \\"Look, it seems she is taken with Yuxiang and wishes to show off her lotus feet.\\" Wang Xun nodded. Zhongqing, standing behind Wenze, added: \\"How do you know it is not you she fancies?\\" Wenze laughed: \\"I do not think so.\\" Then he called quietly: \\"Yuxiang, what is there to look at in 'Cases of"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"里头抹巾障袖的做作。文泽看他灯笼上贴着一个「花」字。开动车，接着过去了。四人又逛了几处，街道又窄小起来。文泽对子玉道：「方才这个少妇，那样顾盼你，你也不回个情儿，倒只管看那旧纱灯，什么意思？难道那样少妇，还不足以当一盼么？」","en":"moved and passed on. The four wandered to a few more spots, where the streets began to narrow again. Wenze said to Ziyu: \\"Just now that young woman was so attentive in her glancing at you, yet you gave her no response and kept looking at that old gauze lantern. What is the meaning of this? Could a young woman like that not merit even one glance in return?\\""},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉笑道：「我没留心他，他也不曾看我，是物色你们的。」四人说说笑笑，又看了几处灯。","en":"Ziyu laughed: \\"I paid no attention to her, nor did she look at me. She was sizing you gentlemen up.\\" The four friends bantered and laughed as they moved on to admire a few more lantern displays."},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":7,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"又见一个三十几岁一个妇人，身量生得很高，穿着双高底鞋，眼望着灯。脚下踏着了一块砖，身子一歪，几乎栽倒，恰恰碰着子玉，他就把子玉的胸前一把揪牢，才站稳了。子玉倒几乎跌下，唬得心中乱跳，正不知他是何缘故。那人放了手嗤嗤的笑，一齐挤了过去。听得有个妇人说道：「这些爷们实在可恨，睁着大眼睛瞧人，难道他家里没有娘儿们的，故意挡了路不放人走。」仲清等听了大笑。王恂道：「真晦","en":"lanterns. Her foot caught on a brick, and she lurched to one side, nearly toppling over. She happened to grab onto Ziyu's chest, clutching it tight to steady herself. Ziyu nearly fell as well, his heart leaping in fright, utterly bewildered as to what was happening. The woman let go and giggled as the whole crowd squeezed past. He heard one of the women say: \\"These gentlemen"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":4,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"道：「我们猜了几个灯谜。再进去不迟。」于是同看第一个是：「双栖稳宿无烦恼，认得卢家玳瑁梁。」下注《礼记》一句。子玉正在思索，只听得王恂问仲清道：「这可是知其能安，燕而不乱也？」仲清道：「只怕是的。」再看第二个是：「任他万水千山远，雁帛鱼书总得来。」下注《易经》一句。仲清道：「这个真是「行险而不失其信」。」子玉道：「那第四个「落花人独立，微雨燕双飞。」打一字的准是","en":"undisturbed, recognizing the Lu family's tortoiseshell rafters.' Below was a notation indicating a line from the Liji. Ziyu was pondering it when he heard Wang Xun ask Zhongqing: \\"Could this be: 'knowing that one can dwell in peace, like the swallow who is settled and orderly'?\\" Zhongqing replied: \\"I believe so.\\" They looked at the second: 'Though ten thousand waters and"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「降生辰巳之年，可是「维虺维蛇」？」园门口的人回说不是。文泽道：「不要给人抢去了，我们去报罢。」大家走下亭子。子玉道：「那打《诗经》的，我已想着了，必是「不属于毛」。」仲清道：「很是。这句实在亏你想。」","en":"not. Wenze said: \\"Do not let others take it from us. Let us go submit.\\" Everyone descended the pavilion steps. Ziyu said: \\"As for that Classic of Poetry one, I have thought of it. It must be 'not belonging to the fur-bearing creatures.'\\" Zhongqing said: \\"Precisely right. That answer was truly remarkable to have thought of.\\""},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"：「白也诗无敌。」里头也答应了「是」。只见一人又拿了一盏灯出来，将先挂的那盏灯换下。见屏门后头走了出一个人来，子玉见他有三十来岁，生得眉清目秀，气体高华，穿得一身雅淡衣服，闲闲雅雅的过来。","en":"new lantern and swapped it for the one already hanging. From behind the screen door someone came walking out. Ziyu saw a man of about thirty, with clear brows and fine eyes and an air of lofty elegance, dressed in understated, refined clothing. He strolled over in a leisurely, graceful fashion."},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"见文泽、仲清、王恂三人一齐迎上前来，称呼他为静宜先生。那人与三人见了礼，又向子玉作了个揖，子玉连忙还礼。","en":"once to greet him, addressing him as Master Jingyi. The man exchanged courtesies with the three, then bowed to Ziyu, who hastened to return the salutation."},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":8,"tokens":["梅庾香","子玉","庾香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"文泽即对萧次贤说道：「这位是梅庾香，是当今无双士。静宜先生没有会过么？」次贤道：「今日识荆，实为万幸」便请四人进内，子玉道：「今晚便服，未免不恭，容另日专诚晋谒罢！」次贤笑道：「庾香先生，当今名士，不应琐琐及此。况主人也不在家，我辈聊以聚谈，切勿拘以礼节。」子玉难以固辞，只得同着走出","en":"Wenze thereupon said to Xiao Cixian: \\"This gentleman is Mei Yuxiang, the peerless scholar of this age. Has Master Jingyi not had occasion to meet him?\\" Cixian replied: \\"Meeting such a distinguished personage today is truly my great good fortune.\\" He then invited the four men inside. Ziyu said: \\"Being in plain clothes"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":3,"tokens":["庾香","子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「这琴是庾香先生猜着的么？」子玉道：「是小弟胡猜的，断不敢当此厚赠。」次贤道：「这是园主人为杜玉侬而设，另有深意，幸勿见却。琴后尚须镌铭，俟镌好再行送上。」说毕便令小厮，仍将瑶琴抱了进去。其余彩礼，交给各跟随收存。原来琴言因制灯谜时，喜诵「落花人独立」这一联，度","en":"\\"Was it you, Master Yuxiang, who solved the qin riddle?\\" Ziyu replied: \\"I merely guessed at random. I could not possibly presume to accept such a generous prize.\\" Cixian replied: \\"This was set by the garden's master for Du Yunong, and carries a particular meaning, so pray do not"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"你们藏在那里？」宝珠道：「我们在前面小船室下棋。」文泽道：「相公阿曾点个只眼？」宝珠、漱芳都笑了一笑。座中就是子玉不认得，那日虽见漱芳的《题曲》，也是上妆容貌。此时看他骨香肉腻，玉洁晶莹；宝珠亭亭玉立，弱不胜衣，便想道：「这两个姿色似可与琴官相并，但不知性情何如。」正想着，猛听得台下云锣一响，对面很远的树林里，放起几枝流星赶月来，便接着一个个的泥筒，接接连连，远","en":"said: \\"And did either of you contrive to make an eye?\\" Baozhu and Shufang both smiled. Of those present, only Ziyu did not know them. Though he had seen Shufang's 'Inscribing the Song' that day, that had been in full makeup and costume. Now he saw them in plain dress. Their flesh was fragrant and smooth, of jade-pure clarity and crystalline freshness. Baozhu stood"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"道：「我醉欲眠君且去。」便放身欲睡。次贤恐着了凉，便命家人扶他到后面小座落里炕上去睡，扶了南湘进去，把门带上。子玉问次贤这是什么丸，次贤道：「这是度香自制的，任凭喝得烂醉，只须一丸下去，宿酒尽消，且补元气，名为仙桃益寿丸。」","en":"servants carry him to a kang in the small inner room, helped Nanxiang inside, and pulled the door behind him. Ziyu asked Cixian what the pill was. Cixian replied: \\"It is something Duxiang himself makes. No matter how dead-drunk one may be, one pill and all the stored wine is consumed, with the vital energy additionally restored. It is called the Immortal Peach Life-Prolonging"},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"、黄罴，奇奇怪怪，约有数百，足下都有四个小轮，用人拉着飞跑，鼻里生烟，口中吐火，觉得如雷轰电掣，地塌山崩。看得子玉等神惊肤栗。这边百兽，那边群龙，合将拢来，黑雾冲天，火光遍地，大有赤壁鏖兵之势。闹了好一会，猛听得一声响，半天里放起一个九子炮来，只见地下火光一散，如穿梭一般，霎时满园寂寂，不见一灯。众名士齐声喝采道：「真有天地化工，孙吴兵法之妙，我们皆目所未见。」","en":"from their mouths. It was as thunderous and electrifying as if the earth had collapsed and the mountains fallen. Ziyu and the others were so astonished their skin rose in gooseflesh. On this side a hundred beasts, on that side five dragons, merging together with black fog rising to the sky and firelight covering the ground. It truly evoked the ferocity of the Red Cliff"},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子玉","庾香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"秋》，一个是《赶车》。宝珠对漱芳笑道：「你的一个，我的一个，都被他猜着了。」南湘笑道：「原来是你们做的。」即对子玉道：「庾香，此二君何如？你看他们的相貌、才艺，你评评，还是我说谎的么？」又指着两边的书画道：「你再看看，这是瑶卿画的，那是香畹写的，你看外边那班假名士，能够如这班真相公吗？」","en":"\\"One is yours, one is mine, and he solved them both.\\" Nanxiang laughed: \\"So you two made them!\\" He then turned to Ziyu and said: \\"Yuxiang, what do you make of these two? Judging from their looks and talents, am I telling the truth or not? Now look at this,\\" he pointed at the calligraphy and paintings on the walls, \\"this is painted by Yaoqing, and that is written by Xiangwan."},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":4,"tokens":["子玉","庾香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉笑道：「小弟早已认过，吾兄尚还刻刻在心。」南湘道：「以后你们这一班，见我们不许请安，只许称号，如违了要罚的。」宝珠道：「这倒与度香、静宜一样脾气，就是这样便了。」王恂道：「庾香，你看这瑶卿，与你去年戏园所见的怎样？这真伪可能相混么？」子玉笑道：「瓦砾","en":"Ziyu laughed: \\"I long ago made my acknowledgment, yet my elder brother still dwells on it at every moment.\\" Nanxiang said: \\"Henceforth, among your company, when you meet us you must not bow in salutation. You may only address us by our courtesy names. Violators"},{"paragraph":30,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"于是漱芳拉了王恂下棋，文泽观局。子玉同宝珠看那墨兰，赞不绝口；南湘、仲清、次贤同坐在醉翁床闲话。南湘道：「静宜兄，还记得「只有酒狂名下士，醉吟许上岳阳楼」佳句否？」","en":"Thereupon Shufang drew Wang Xun into a game of chess while Wenze looked on. Ziyu and Baozhu admired the ink-painted orchid, praising it without end. Nanxiang, Zhongqing, and Cixian sat together on the Drunken-Scholar's Couch in easy conversation. Nanxiang said: \\"Brother Jingyi, do you still recall those fine lines: 'Only the poet-drunkard"},{"paragraph":31,"mentions":8,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"」名句足传。」仲清道：「若教酒满洞庭湖，只怕史竹君早已醉死了。静宜先生，明日可与他写个竹醉图。」次贤点头微笑。子玉乘他们说话时，悄悄的问宝珠道：「这两天可曾见你们同班的琴官？」宝珠听了，把子玉打量了一番，问道：「你同琴官相好么？」倒把子玉问住了，很不好意思，只得答道：「向未交接，不过闻名思慕。」宝珠道：「他如今不叫琴官，改名为琴言，今日可惜迟来一步，度香带他赴席","en":"'Drunken Bamboo' picture tomorrow.\\" Cixian nodded and smiled faintly. Taking advantage of the others' conversation, Ziyu quietly asked Baozhu: \\"These past two days, have you seen Qinyan from your troupe?\\" Baozhu, hearing this, looked Ziyu over carefully and asked: \\"Are you and Qinyan close friends?\\" This question rather caught Ziyu off guard. Quite embarrassed, he could"},{"paragraph":33,"mentions":3,"tokens":["子玉","庾香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉道：「好个春灯谜面子。」宝珠道：「我最爱傅粉郎君一联。」南湘道：「我们这里只有庾香算得傅粉郎君，你爱他么？」宝珠笑了一笑，子玉倒臊得脸都红了。再看那封回书是：","en":"Ziyu exclaimed: \\"What a fine puzzle in the guise of a Lantern Festival riddle!\\" Baozhu said: \\"I love most the couplet about the 'powder-faced young gentleman.'\\" Nanxiang said: \\"Among us here, only Yuxiang qualifies as a powder-faced young gentleman. Do you"},{"paragraph":35,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这两封书，都是静宜先生的手笔么？」次贤道：「那封原书，是度香的手笔。」说着，王恂已经下完了棋，倒输了漱芳三子。子玉因夜色已深，随同南湘等告辞；子玉并说度香来园，先为致意，改日专诚再来的话，次贤答应着，送出各人上车而散。再听下回分解。","en":"Duxiang's hand.\\" As he spoke, Wang Xun had already finished his chess game, having lost three stones to Shufang. Ziyu, the night being already deep, took his leave together with Nanxiang and the others. Ziyu also conveyed that when Duxiang returned to the garden he would first pay his respects, and that he would come again in earnest on another day. Cixian replied affirmatively"}],"10":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说子玉等散后，徐子云才回，因夜色已深，时交子末，便一径回宅。","en":"To resume our tale: after Ziyu and the other guests had dispersed, Xu Ziyun at last returned. Seeing that the night had already grown deep and the zi hour was ending, past one in the morning, he made his way directly to his private residence."},{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"饮食衣服，只要他心爱，徐子云无不供给，也算相待十分，琴言未尝不知感恩，却只算得半个知己。自那进京这一天路上见了子玉，便认得是梦中救他出陷坑的人，时时刻刻放在心上。又姑苏会馆唱戏那一日，见他同了一班公子，还有魏聘才、李元茂在座，问起叶茂林，始知这位公子就姓梅，已应了梅花树下之兆。从此，一缕幽情如沾泥柳絮，已被缠住。","en":"regarded Ziyun as only half a kindred spirit. From the day of his arrival in the capital, when he had encountered Ziyu on the road and recognized him as the savior from his dream of the hidden pit, Ziyu's image had remained constantly in his thoughts. Then, on the day of the opera at the Suzhou Guild Hall, seeing Ziyu seated among a company of young gentlemen that included"},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这几日晚间，梦见子玉好几次，恍恍惚惚的，不是对着同笑，就是对着同哭。","en":"Over these past few evenings, he had dreamed of Ziyu several times. In a haze of reverie, they would either be laughing together or shedding tears in each other's presence."},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":5,"tokens":["子玉","梅庾香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"又像自己远行，子玉送他，牵衣执手。又像远行了，重又回来，两人促膝谈心。模模糊糊，醒来也记不真切。虽知道是个世家公子，却不知道他的性情嗜好，与度香何如，又恐他是个青年轻薄寡情短行之人。又恐他豪贵骄奢要人趋奉的人。但细看他温存骨格，像个厚道正人，断不至此。一日又梦见宝珠变","en":"In another dream, it seemed as though he were traveling far away, with Ziyu seeing him off, holding his sleeve and clasping his hand. Then the journey seemed to have already taken place, and he had returned, the two of them sitting close with knees touching, pouring out their hearts. The images were blurred and indistinct, and"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":1,"tokens":["梅庾香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"痕，就将史南湘的醉态，及妆点情形，说得琴言欢喜了，便同在一张床榻上坐着道：「看昨日这几个打灯谜的人，内中一个叫梅庾香的，年纪不过十七八岁，相貌生得最好。」琴言道：「这人也姓梅么？」宝珠道：「他曾问起你来。」琴言沉吟道：「姓梅的他说会过我么？」","en":"together on the daybed. Baozhu said: \\"Among those who solved the lantern riddles yesterday, there was one named Mei Yuxiang, no more than seventeen or eighteen years of age, who possessed the most exceptional appearance of them all.\\" Qinyan asked: \\"Is his surname also Mei?\\" Baozhu replied: \\"He even asked after you.\\" Pondering for a moment, Qinyan said: \\"This Mei person, did"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"《惊梦》，倒是一对。就可惜我不会变。」琴言默然良久。道：「咳，可惜昨日出去了，没有见他一面。」宝珠试出琴言属意子玉，便道：「你可晓得今日错怪了度香么？」琴言道：「怎么？」宝珠道：「他所说替你觅着的配对，你道是那个？」琴言悄悄的道：「难道就是梅公子不成？」宝珠道：：不是他是谁？」琴言道：「我当是度香有心糟蹋我，却不晓得他所说打灯谜的人就是他。」宝珠道：「据我看来，","en":"out yesterday and missed the chance to see him.\\" Baozhu, having gauged that Qinyan's affections were fixed on Ziyu, then asked: \\"Do you realize now that you wronged Duxiang today?\\" Qinyan asked: \\"How so?\\" Baozhu explained: \\"The match he said he had found for you, who do you think it is?\\" Qinyan asked softly: \\"Could it really be the Mei young master?\\" Baozhu confirmed:"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":2,"tokens":["梅庾香","庾香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"况且你又不是女孩子，怕什么配对不配对，难道真把你配了梅庾香不成？」说得次贤、宝珠都笑起来。宝珠道：「不要说了，他已经明白过来了。我们何不去请了庾香来与他见一见。」子云道：「知道是他不是他，我自有道理。」宝珠、琴言即在怡园吃了晚饭，坐到二更而回。","en":"Besides, you are not a girl, so what is there to fear in talk of a 'match'? Could I really be marrying you off to Mei Yuxiang?\\" This remark made Cixian and Baozhu both burst into laughter. Baozhu interjected: \\"Say no more, for he has already understood. Why don't we simply invite Yuxiang here to meet him?\\" Ziyun said: \\"I have my own method of determining whether it is truly"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":3,"tokens":["子玉","梅庾香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"次日，子云即去拜望子玉，彼此道了些景仰渴想的话，就约定于十九日晚间一叙。出来顺道到王恂、刘文泽、史南湘等处看望，俱未晤见。回来想道：「这梅庾香果然名不虚传，玉侬又属意于他，将来见了面，不消说是他的人了。」又想这：「玉侬的脾气，差不多的人都猜摸不着，倘或一言不合，就可以决绝","en":"The following day, Ziyun went to call upon Ziyu. They exchanged warm words of mutual admiration and longing, ultimately agreeing to meet for an intimate dinner on the evening of the nineteenth. On his way back, Ziyun stopped at the residences of Wang Xun, Liu Wenze, and Shi Nanxiang to pay courtesy"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":1,"tokens":["梅子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"到了十九日这一日，一切安排停当。申刻时候，梅子玉到了怡园，主人迎接，进了梅崦。这梅崦是园中名胜，且值梅花盛开，在大山之下，梅林丛中，有数十间分作五处，屋围着花，花围着屋，层层迭迭，望之林屋不分。","en":"On the nineteenth, every arrangement was perfectly in order. At the hour of Shen, Mei Ziyu arrived at the Garden of Contentment, where the host stepped forward to welcome him. Together they walked to the Plum Knoll. This Plum Knoll was celebrated as one of the garden's most exquisite scenic spots. Just then the plum blossoms were in their"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":7,"tokens":["子玉","庾香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"花万树鼻功德，古屋一山心太平。中悬着林和靖的小像，迎面摆一张雕梅花的紫檀木榻。榻上陈着一张古锦囊的瑶琴。子云让子玉进内坐了，子玉道：「前日斗胆在此试灯，已成不速之客，今日又蒙宠召，坐我瑶斋，主人情重，何以克当？」子云道：「庾香先生，景星卿云，相见恨晚，前日失迓为罪。今蒙不弃，惠然肯来，私心实深欣幸。」子玉问道：「今日坐间尚有何客，静宜先生何以不见？」子云道：「静","en":"carved with plum-blossom designs. Upon it rested a guqin lovingly wrapped in antique brocaded silk. Ziyun invited Ziyu to take his seat inside. Ziyu expressed his gratitude: \\"The other day I had the boldness to come here and try my hand at the lantern riddles, already acting as an uninvited guest. Today I am once again graced with your summons and seated in your exquisite"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":1,"tokens":["庾香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"四句琴铭下，又镌着一行行书小字，是：「山阴徐子云为玉侬杜琴言移赠庾香名士清赏。」下刻图章两方：阴文是「次贤撰句」四字，阳文是「静宜手镌」四字。","en":"on behalf of Yunong Du Qinyan, presents this as a gift for the refined appreciation of the celebrated scholar Yuxiang.' Below this dedication were neatly engraved two seals: one in intaglio reading 'Composed by Cixian,' and one in relief reading 'Carved by Jingyi.'"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉想起宝珠改名之言，知道玉侬就是琴官，却喜出望外，便深深一揖，道了谢，仍令小厮囊好。子云试他道：「闻说吾兄与玉侬相与最深，可是真的么？」子玉道：「弟因家君管教极严，平素足不出户，就只开春初六那日，在姑苏会馆看见他一出《惊梦》的戏，有人说起他的名字叫琴官","en":"Recalling what Baozhu had revealed about the change of name, Ziyu now fully understood that Yunong was none other than Qinguan, and a wave of joy washed over him beyond all expectation. He made a deep and respectful bow of thanks and then directed his page boy to carefully rewrap the qin. Ziyun, testing the waters,"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":3,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉笑道：「情之一字，谈何容易？就是我辈文字之交，或臭味相投，一见如故；或道义结契，千里神交。亦必两意眷注，始可言情，断无用情于陌路人之理。琴言之于弟，犹陌路人也。弟已忘情于彼，彼又安能用情于弟乎?」子云道：「据吾兄品评琴言，比前日所见宝珠何如？」子玉因","en":"Ziyu smiled gently: \\"The matter of true feeling is never easily spoken of. Whether it is a literary friendship between peers where kindred spirits connect at first sight, or a bond forged in morality and righteousness spanning a thousand miles, it absolutely"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":4,"tokens":["子玉","庾香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"正说着，只见宝珠同着花枝招展的一个人来，子玉一看不是别人，就是朝思暮想的琴言，心里暗暗吃惊。又听得子云道：「玉侬，你的意中人在此，过来见了。」琴言嫣然一笑，走上来请了一个安，倒弄得子玉坐不是，站不是，呆呆的只管看那琴言。那琴言又对子云也请了安。宝珠道：「庾香，我竟遵竹君的教不为礼了。」子玉道：","en":"conversation, Baozhu arrived gracefully, adorned like a flowering branch, accompanied by another figure. When Ziyu looked, he saw it was none other than the very person for whom he had yearned day and night: Qinyan. His heart gave a secret, powerful start of surprise. Then he heard Ziyun announce: \\"Yunong, your heart's beloved is here. Come and be properly introduced.\\""},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「是这样脱俗最好，玉侬何不也是这样？」琴言微微的一笑，不言语。子玉看看琴言，又看看宝珠，觉宝珠比琴言，面目清艳了好些，吐属轻倩了好些，举止闲雅了好些。心里寻思道：","en":"conventions in this manner. Why should Yunong not do the same?\\" Qinyan offered a faint smile but remained silent. Ziyu looked first at Qinyan, then at Baozhu, and felt that Baozhu surpassed Qinyan in luminous beauty, possessed a lighter and more charming manner of speech, and exhibited a far more leisurely elegance in his movements. He found himself pondering:"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":5,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"此相思已久，今日初次见面，也该说两句知心话，亲热亲热，为什么大家冷冰冰的，都不言语。」说着就拉着琴言的手，送到子玉手内。子云道：「可不是，不要因我们在这里碍眼，不好意思。」说得子玉更觉接不是，不接又不是的，只得装作解手出来，又在窗外看了一回梅花。经子云再三相让，然后迟迟疑疑的进屋。子云道：「这里太敞，我们到里间去坐。」宝珠走近镜屏一摸，那镜屏就像门似的旋了一个转","en":"cold as ice, refusing to speak a single word?\\" As he spoke, he gently took Qinyan's hand and placed it firmly in Ziyu's. Ziyun encouraged: \\"He is quite right, so please don't let our presence here inhibit you in any way.\\" This encouragement only served to make Ziyu feel all the more awkward, for taking the hand felt inappropriate, yet refusing it seemed equally wrong."},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":5,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"那镜屏仍复掩上，屋内止剩子玉、琴言两人，琴言让子玉榻上坐了，他却站在子玉身旁，目不转瞬的看着子玉，倒将子玉看得害羞起来，低了头。","en":"The mirrored screen was once again drawn shut, leaving only Ziyu and Qinyan together in the quiet room. Qinyan invited Ziyu to sit on the daybed, while he himself remained standing beside him, gazing at Ziyu without once turning his eyes away. This intense scrutiny made Ziyu feel deeply bashful, and he lowered his"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":6,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉把头点一点。又道：「你晓得我想念你的心事么？」子玉把头摇一摇。琴言道：「那瑶琴的灯谜，是你猜着的么？」子玉又把头点一点。又道：「好心思，你可晓得度香的主意么？」子玉又把头摇一摇。琴言用一个指头，将子玉的额抬起来，道：「我听得宝珠说，你背地里很问我，我","en":"Ziyu gave a single, slow nod. Qinyan continued: \\"Are you aware of the deep longing I have felt for you?\\" Ziyu gently shook his head. Qinyan pressed: \\"The lantern riddle about the jade qin, was it truly you who solved it?\\" Ziyu nodded once again. \\"What a wonderfully"},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":7,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「原来你不理我，是看我不起，怪不得这样不瞅不睬的，只是可惜我白费了一番心。」说着脸上起了一层红晕，眼波向子玉一转，恰好眼光对着眼光，子玉把眼一低，脸上也红红的，心里十分不快。琴言惺松松两眼，乘势把香肩一侧，那脸直贴到子玉的脸上来，子玉将身一偏，琴言就靠在子玉怀里，嗤嗤的笑。子玉已有了气，把他推开，站了起来，只得说道：「人之相知，贵相知心。你这么样，竟把我当","en":"feeling.\\" As he spoke, a delicate flush of red spread across his face; the luminous waves of his eyes swept toward Ziyu, and their gazes locked. Ziyu hastily lowered his eyes, his own face reddening as he felt deeply ill at ease. Qinyan let his half-drowsy eyes linger upon him, and then tilted his fragrant shoulder sideways so that his cheek pressed intimately against"},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":4,"tokens":["子玉","庾香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"的无可如何，只听得镜屏里轻轻的一响，子云、次贤、宝珠都在镜屏之外，迎面笑盈盈的走进来，那琴言一影就不见了，把个子玉吓得迷迷糊糊的。只听得子云笑道：「好个坐怀不乱的柳下惠，失敬，失敬！就是骂我徐度香太挖苦些。」子玉一回转头来，那知众人都在镜屏对面套间之内。子玉与次贤见了礼，即向子云告辞道：「今日出门忘了一件要事，只好改日再来奉扰。」子云笑道：「庾香兄，必是因适才唐","en":"other side of the screen. At that precise instant, the figure of Qinyan vanished without a single trace, leaving Ziyu utterly dazed and bewildered. Then he heard Ziyun laughing brightly: \\"What an admirable Liu Xiahui, able to sit entirely unmoved in the presence of a breathtaking beauty. I offer you my absolute deepest respects. Though I must admit your severe censure"},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":15,"tokens":["子玉","庾香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"次贤道：「小弟才来，正拟畅谈衷曲，足下拂然欲去，是怪我奉陪得迟了。」宝珠一手拉着子玉进套间屋内，道：「你且再看看你的意中人，不要哭坏了他。」子玉见一人背坐着在那里哭泣，只道就是刚才的那个琴言。因想他既知哭泣，尚能悔过，意欲于酒席中间，慢慢的用言语感化他。那晓得他倒转过脸来，用手帕擦擦眼泪，看着子玉道：「庾香，你的心我知道了。」子玉听","en":"intends to leave in displeasure. Am I to blame for arriving too late to properly escort you?\\" Baozhu gently took Ziyu's hand and led him into the inner suite, urging: \\"Come and have another look at your heart's true beloved; do not let him weep himself sick on your account.\\" Ziyu saw a figure sitting quietly with his back turned, weeping softly. Thinking it was the"},{"paragraph":31,"mentions":2,"tokens":["庾香","子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"酒过数巡，次贤道：「庾香兄，今日可曾见那瑶琴上镌的字么？」子玉道：「我倒忘了道谢，铁笔古心，的是名手。但此灯谜也还易打，度香先生所说为玉侬而设，究竟不知其故？」","en":"After several rounds of fine wine, Cixian asked: \\"Brother Yuxiang, have you seen the inscription engraved on the jade qin today?\\" Ziyu replied: \\"I nearly forgot to express my profound thanks. The brushwork is ancient and masterly, truly the work of a highly skilled hand. But as for the lantern riddle, it was not so"},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"」、「微雨」两句。又因他名字是琴，所以借此为彩，原是要替他卜个生平知己。可巧是吾兄猜着，不枉弟一番作合之心。」子玉道：「却之不恭，受之有愧，当为玉侬珍重藏之。」琴言面有豫色。宝珠见了，将唐诗改了一字念道：「寻常一样琴前月，才有梅花便不同。」子云、次贤同声赞道：「琴字改得好。」","en":"happened, it was you, elder brother, who solved it, brilliantly vindicating my small effort at making a match.\\" Ziyu replied: \\"To refuse would be deeply discourteous, and to accept leaves me feeling entirely unworthy, yet I shall treasure it carefully on Yunong's behalf.\\" A delicate shadow of pleasure crossed Qinyan's face. Baozhu, observing this, recited a line of"},{"paragraph":33,"mentions":3,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉看琴言颜色微愠，知是宝珠以他名字为戏，便道：「若非瑶卿胸有智珠，不能改得如此敏妙。」子云等还道是寻常赞语，惟有琴言深感子玉之情，替他报复了这个琴字。次贤道：「今日玉侬，何以一言不发？」子云道：「他本来像息夫人似的，将来静宜可将那「花如解语还多事，石不","en":"Ziyu, noticing a slight flash of annoyance cross Qinyan's face, understood that Baozhu was playfully using the character 'qin' in his name, and so said: \\"If Yaoqing did not possess brilliance like a luminous pearl within his breast, he could not have made"},{"paragraph":34,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉想道：「这分明与前见的一些不同，难道竟是两个人。」","en":"Ziyu thought to himself: \\"This is clearly someone entirely different from the one I saw earlier. Can there really, truly be two of them?\\""},{"paragraph":35,"mentions":6,"tokens":["子玉","庾香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云见子玉、琴言两意相投的光景，便道：「庾香兄不是有事么？为什么不打发人回去，我们可以畅饮。」子玉支吾道：「虽有小事，迟到明日尚却不妨。足下好客，可惜前日同来的一班好友都不在此。」子云道：「他们是常来的，不妨另日再叙。」子玉道：「此外尚有个卓然高品。」子云道：","en":"Ziyun, perceiving that Ziyu and Qinyan were already mutually and deeply drawn to each other, suggested: \\"Did not Brother Yuxiang say he had something to attend to? Why not send someone home with word? We could then drink freely to our hearts' absolute content.\\" Ziyu hedged politely:"},{"paragraph":36,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"宝珠道：「我们今日何不以玉侬说话为令，他说一句话，我们合席饮一杯。」子云笑道：「这令很新，就是这样。」子玉道：「说一句话，合席饮一杯酒，这个令未免酒太多。他和谁说，谁饮一杯不好么？」琴言点头。宝珠道：「这个恐怕有弊。」子云道：「不妨，就吃醉了，我有醒酒丸。」于是大家依允。","en":"time he says a sentence, the whole table drinks a cup.\\" Ziyun laughed warmly: \\"What a novel rule. Let it be so.\\" Ziyu reasoned: \\"For every sentence spoken, the whole table must drink a cup; that would mean far too much wine. Would it not be better if each person he speaks to drinks a cup?\\" Qinyan nodded in agreement. Baozhu cautioned: \\"That might lead to abuses.\\" Ziyun"},{"paragraph":37,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一一说了，共是两杯。琴言问次贤道：「今日为什么回来得这样迟？」次贤道：「替人做媒，回来迟了。」也饮一杯。琴言把子玉看了一看，都不言语，回转头来问子云道：「这园梅花共有多少株？」宝珠咳嗽一声，子云道：「约有二千株。」该是一杯。","en":"Cixian replied: \\"I was acting as a matchmaker and came back late.\\" That was one more cup. Qinyan looked steadily at Ziyu but said absolutely nothing; then he turned back and asked Ziyun: \\"How many plum trees does this garden have in total?\\" Baozhu gave a slight, knowing cough. Ziyun replied: \\"Approximately two thousand trees.\\" That was another cup."},{"paragraph":38,"mentions":6,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"宝珠过来，替子云斟了，就便向子云耳边说了一句。琴言道：「你们改令，是要罚十杯。」子玉道：「没有人改的。」宝珠过来要与子玉斟酒，琴言把子玉的杯子拿了道：「我又没有和他说话，为什么要给他酒吃呢？」宝珠道：「他和你说话也是一样。」琴言道：「这个我不依。」子玉倒不好意思道：「我原是想酒吃罢了，吃一杯罢。」琴言道；「你要吃，用他的杯子。」宝珠","en":"whispered something secretively in his ear. Qinyan warned: \\"If you change the rules, the penalty is ten cups.\\" Ziyu put in: \\"No one changed anything.\\" Baozhu came over to fill Ziyu's cup. Qinyan took up Ziyu's cup and argued: \\"I did not speak to him, so why should he get wine?\\" Baozhu countered: \\"Him speaking to you is exactly the same thing.\\" Qinyan firmly stated:"},{"paragraph":39,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云虽曾经握过，此时也只能艳羡而已。子玉忆起日间那个琴言的手，又粗又黑，始知必非一人。宝珠心生一计，便道：","en":"Ziyun, though he had once clasped that hand himself, could now only look on in deep, admiring envy. Ziyu thought of the hand of that daytime Qinyan, rough and dark, and understood at long last that they must be two different people entirely. Baozhu thought of a clever scheme and asked:"},{"paragraph":40,"mentions":4,"tokens":["子玉","庾香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「你们大家看他的纤纤玉手作什么？」琴言把手一缩，宝珠随即取了这杯酒，送在子玉手内。琴言向子玉道：「这杯酒你偏不要吃。」子玉答应。子云道：「玉侬你该替我作主人，敬客一杯才是。」宝珠接口道：「况这个令，那头一句话，就不算向庾香说的，难道这句话也是和别人说的不成？」琴言想了一想，这话有理，只得一笑。","en":"hand?\\" At this, Qinyan hastily drew back his hand, and Baozhu immediately seized the cup and placed it directly in Ziyu's hand. Qinyan turned to Ziyu: \\"You must not drink this cup.\\" Ziyu said nothing in reply. Ziyun instructed: \\"Yunong, you should represent me as host and offer a cup to our honored guest.\\" Baozhu chimed in: \\"Besides, under this rule, that very first sentence"},{"paragraph":41,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉饮完酒，便问宝珠道：「方才这个玉侬，到底是谁？」","en":"When Ziyu had finished drinking, he turned and asked Baozhu: \\"Who exactly was that Yunong just now?\\""},{"paragraph":43,"mentions":5,"tokens":["子玉","庾香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉一见，颇难为情，始恍然知初见那个琴言，实在是假的，疑团尽释。子云道：「我是要试试庾香的眼力，所以刻画无盐，唐突西子。今果被识透，足见高明。」就令玉龄取了两个大玉杯来道：「你代我敬梅少爷一杯。」玉龄斟了，送与子玉。子玉接着道：「酒已多了，天也不早了，我","en":"At the sight of him, Ziyu felt distinctly awkward, and suddenly everything became wonderfully clear: the Qinyan he had first seen was truly the false one. All his lingering doubts dissolved at once. Ziyun explained: \\"I wanted to test Brother Yuxiang's discernment, and so deliberately"},{"paragraph":44,"mentions":6,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉今日初会琴言，天姿国色已经心醉。又饮这一大杯，虽说酒落欢肠，究竟饮已过量，觉得眼前花花绿绿的，支持不住。子云不敢再敬。大家吃饭，洗漱毕，子玉便要告辞。倒是琴言恐怕他醉了不受用，向子云要了一服仙桃益寿丸，泡制好了，吹得不甚热，给子玉服了。不多一会，子玉","en":"Today was Ziyu's very first meeting with Qinyan, and the beauty of natural endowment and celestial grace had already deeply intoxicated his heart. Then to drink this large cup on top of all the rest, though joy poured into a joyful breast, meant the wine had passed"}],"11":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说徐子云送子玉出园之后，与萧次贤谈了一会，即便回宅。子云的住宅也离园不远，就在对面，还是他曾祖老太爷住的相府，府中极其宽大。现在父母、兄嫂都不在京住。此宅内仅子云夫妇二人，其余都是家人。子云与他夫人讲起琴言、子玉的事来，又羡慕他们缱绻的情致。袁氏夫人微笑，即问道：","en":"After escorting Ziyu out of the garden, Xu Ziyun lingered a moment to converse with Xiao Cixian before wending his way homeward. His own residence, the vast and imposing ancestral mansion built by his late great-grandfather the Grand Chancellor, lay only a short distance"},{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["梅庾香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"袁夫人道：「就算你如此，难道你那些朋友也是这样么？」子云道：「他们若不是这样，就与我冰炭不入了。方才我不是说那梅庾香，教玉龄略说了两句戏话，他就气得什么似的，连我都骂起来，这不是可以相信的么？况那几个孩子也不喜人与他戏谑的。」说了一会闲话，袁夫人说起明日是华夫人生日，且系二十岁正寿，是必要去走一走的。子云道：「自然该去，且你去年生日他也过来，还送了好些东西，我们也","en":"they were not of a similar disposition, we would be as incompatible as fire and ice. Did I not just tell you how Mei Yuxiang erupted in fury, even turning his wrath upon me, merely because Yuling uttered a few flirtatious jests? Does that not prove their honor? Moreover, the boys themselves disdain such frivolous teasing.\\" They conversed a while longer until Mrs. Yuan said"}],"15":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子玉","庾香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"田湘帆倒可以收心改过了。」也将前日题画规劝之事说了，又说春航且有徽愠。南湘道：「改日我与你们和事如何？」又问起子玉来，仲清道：「庾香日间在此，他的李先生于月初选了安徽知县，就要动身了。」南湘说了几句，也就回去不题。","en":"Nanxiang said, \\"On another day, I shall offer myself as mediator between them. What do you say?\\" He also asked after Ziyu. Zhongqing said, \\"Yuxiang was here during the day. His tutor Master Li was appointed to the post of county magistrate in Anhui at the beginning of the month and is about to set off.\\" After a few more words, Nanxiang took his leave and went home."},{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"却说子玉在王恂处谈了半天回家。李先生已经解馆，要张罗盘缠，魏聘才替他拉了一纤。托张仲雨问西客借了一票银子，占了些空头，有二百余金，添补些衣服，也叫了几天相公。李元茂要在京寄籍，性全也只得由他。","en":"Now let us speak of Ziyu, who had been at Wang Xun's for a long chat before returning home. Master Li had already packed up his tutoring post and needed to arrange travel funds; Wei Pincai had found a financial connection for him, asking Zhang Zhongyu to borrow a draft of silver"},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":11,"tokens":["子玉","庾香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"当晚子玉与聘才在书房闲话。那日是忌辰，日间聘才独自一人到樱桃巷去，找着了叶茂林，两人谈了半天。聘才拉他在扁食楼上吃了饭，即同到那些小旦寓处，打了几家茶围。末了到琴言处，琴言倒出来与聘才谈了几句，即问起子玉来。聘才就将子玉的心事，再装点了些，说得琴言着实感激，","en":"That evening, Ziyu and Pincai were chatting in the study. That day was a memorial anniversary, so Pincai had gone alone to Cherry Lane during the day and found Ye Maolin. The two talked for a long while, and Pincai treated him to a meal at the Flat-Dumpling Restaurant;"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"再说子玉在家无趣，趁他们吃酒时，便带了云儿去找刘文泽、史南湘。","en":"Now, Ziyu found little enjoyment at home; while the others were drinking, he took Yun'er along and went to find Liu Wenze and Shi Nanxiang."},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":12,"tokens":["子玉","庾香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"先到了文泽处，不在家，去找南湘，恰好文泽的车也到南湘门口。子玉道：「我方才找你。」文泽道：「失候。我去找冯子佩，适值他进城去了。」说着遂一同进去，到南湘书房坐了。伺候南湘的龙儿送了茶道：「我们少爷，这时候还没有起身呢！」说罢进去了，一盏茶时候，见南湘科头赤脚，披着件女棉袄出来道：「你们来得好早。」子玉见了，便笑","en":"home. He went on to find Nanxiang, and just as he arrived Wenze's carriage also pulled up at Nanxiang's gate. Ziyu said, \\"I was just looking for you.\\" Wenze said, \\"I missed calling on you earlier. I went to find Feng Zipei, but he had just gone into the city.\\" So saying, they went in together and sat down in Nanxiang's study. Long'er, the attendant who served Nanxiang,"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":3,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"文泽的跟班进去，一问琴言不在家，听得里头说道，就是刘大人带到春喜园去了。文泽一个没趣，子玉倒觉喜欢。南湘道：「那里去？我还没有吃饭，对门不是妙香堂素兰家么，咱们就找香畹去。」文泽道：「只怕也未必在家。叫人去问一问。「素兰却好在家，里头有人出来，请了进去，到客厅坐下，送了茶。文泽问子玉道」香畹你见过没有？」子玉道：「没有。」","en":"at home — they heard from within that the Lord Liu had taken him to Chunxi Garden. Wenze was somewhat put out; Ziyu, on the other hand, felt quietly relieved. Nanxiang said, \\"Where to now? I haven't eaten yet — isn't that Miaoxiang Hall, where Sulan lives, right across the lane? Let's go and find Xiangwan.\\" Wenze said, \\"I'm not sure he'll be at home either. Send someone"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":5,"tokens":["子玉","庾香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"南湘道：「此君丰韵，足并袁苏，为梨园三鼎足。」不多一会，素兰出来，与南湘、文泽见了，又与子玉相见。素兰把子玉细细打量了一番，问文泽道：「这位可姓梅？」文泽向子玉道：「又对出谎来了，你方才说不认识他，他怎么又认识你呢？」子玉真不明白，恰难分辩，倒是素兰道：「认是并不认得，被我一猜就猜着了。」南湘道：「我恰不信，那里有猜得这么准。你若是猜得着他","en":"three pillars of the pear garden.\\" Before long, Sulan came out, greeted Nanxiang and Wenze, and was introduced to Ziyu. Sulan looked Ziyu over carefully and then asked Wenze: \\"Is this young gentleman surnamed Mei?\\" Wenze said to Ziyu, \\"Another lie exposed — you just claimed not to know him, yet he already knows you. How can that be?\\" Ziyu was genuinely puzzled and had"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":2,"tokens":["庾香","子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「这却叫我们试出来了，还赖说不认识。我们当庾香是个至诚人，谁知他倒善于撒谎。」说得子玉两颊微红，这个委屈，无人可诉。细看素兰的面貌，与自己觉有些相像，恐怕被南湘、文泽看出说笑，他便走开，去看旁边字画。南湘对文泽道：","en":"\\"This proves it — and you still claim not to know him! We thought Yuxiang was a man of perfect sincerity, and now it turns out he is quite accomplished at telling lies.\\" With these words Ziyu's cheeks flushed slightly; the injustice of it was such that he had no one to whom he could complain. He looked closely at Sulan's features"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":7,"tokens":["庾香","子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「你可看得出香畹像谁？」文泽道；「像庾香，我第一回见庾香，我就要说他，因为他面嫩，所以没有说出来。」子玉权当不听见，由他们议论。素兰道：「你们不要糟蹋他，怎么将我比他？」说罢拉了子玉过来，到这边坐下。南湘道：「我们还没有吃饭，你快拿饭来。」素兰即吩咐厨房备饭。子玉虽见过素兰的《舞盘》，那日","en":"\\"Can you see who Xiangwan resembles?\\" Wenze said, \\"He resembles Yuxiang. The very first time I saw Yuxiang, I was going to say so, but because he looked so young, I held back.\\" Ziyu pretended not to hear and let them talk among themselves. Sulan said, \\"Don't make sport of him — how could you compare me to him?\\" He laughed"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":21,"tokens":["子玉","庾香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"随又与南湘、文泽斟了，文泽问道：「你今日倒不上戏园子去？」素兰道：「今日没有我的戏，可以不去。」子玉见了素兰也是幽闲贞静一派，心里就契重他。素兰一抬头，见子玉只管偷看他，不觉一笑，便有一种幽情艳思摇漾出来，子玉把眼一低。文泽笑道：「同了庾香出来，我们有多少算不来处。」子玉不解。文泽笑道：「有了你，譬如逛灯那一天，车中的少妇只爱你，不爱看我们了，不是","en":"said, \\"There is no role for me today, so I may stay away.\\" Seeing Sulan's quiet, serene, and composed manner, Ziyu felt a deep affinity in his heart. Sulan raised his eyes and, noticing that Ziyu kept stealing glances at him, broke into an involuntary smile, from which wafted a quiet romantic sensibility and languid charm. Ziyu dropped his gaze. Wenze laughed: \\"Coming"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":9,"tokens":["子玉","庾香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"幅画图小影，你道这情深不深？人家费了这片心，难得你今日来，我所以替他明白明白，教你知道，不教他白费了这片心。」子玉听了，便如哑子吃黄连，说不出苦来，两眼眶的酸眼泪，只好望肚子里咽。文泽、南湘连连点头道：「这真难得。」文泽又道：「玉侬于庾香的情，可为二十四分了，不知庾香与玉侬的情怎样，你可知道？」素兰道：「怎么不知道？也是瑶卿说的。」又将徐子云将假琴言试子玉的情节","en":"fortunate; I have told you all this clearly on his behalf, so that you may know and his devotion should not be wasted.\\" Ziyu, hearing all this, was like a mute who has swallowed bitter herbs, unable to express the bitterness. The moisture in the corners of his eyes he could only force back down into his chest. Wenze and Nanxiang nodded repeatedly: \\"This is truly exceptional.\\""},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"行，梅学士行李一切早已收拾停妥，已于初九日打发家人押了出城。是日亲友拥挤不开，时候尚早，仲清、王恂先在书房，与子玉、元茂等等候。仲清便对元茂道了喜，道：「恭喜，恭喜！你今日真得了一个雪美人。你从前不是有句诗是「白人双目近」么？如今倒成了诗谶了。」元茂不解，颇自得意。","en":"relatives and friends crowded the house. As it was still early, Zhongqing and Wang Xun waited first in the study with Ziyu, Yuanmao, and the others. Zhongqing offered Yuanmao his congratulations, saying: \\"Congratulations, congratulations! Today you have truly obtained a 'snow beauty.' Did you not once write a line of poetry declaring, \\"The white one's eyes draw near\\"? Now"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":3,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"少顷，士燮送了客出去，便叫出子玉来，教训了一番。又叮嘱了元茂、聘才几句。然后与夫人别了，即上车起程，颜仲清、王恂、魏聘才、李元茂一起随后，颜夫人领着子玉，并有些仆妇丫鬟一群的车，也送出城来。城外是王文辉、孙亮功等十几个同年至好，一齐在旗亭饯别。士燮盘桓了一会，文辉等进城。天色不早，","en":"Shortly afterward, Shixie finished seeing off other guests and called Ziyu out to deliver a thorough admonition. He then also gave a few words of instruction to Yuanmao and Pincai. After that he bade farewell to Lady Yan, mounted his carriage, and departed. Yan Zhongqing, Wang Xun, Wei Pincai, and Li Yuanmao followed close"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"士燮又勉励了子玉几句，子玉也只得同仲清等哭泣而回，且按下不题。","en":"Shixie offered a few more words of encouragement to Ziyu; Ziyu had no choice but to return weeping with Zhongqing and the others. But let us leave that aside."},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":3,"tokens":["庾香","梅庾香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"次贤问道：「今日送行的人多么？」子云道：「人倒不少，庾香、剑潭送到前站宿店去了，要明日才回。」即指着宝珠笑道：」惟有他们同队中，不见有一个人在那里送行，只怕这位老先生，生平也没有叫过他们。」宝珠笑道：「这位梅大人，每逢戏酒，叫我们也伺候过几回，人倒谦雅的，就总没有赏过一句话儿。倒不料他生出那么一个风流的公","en":"Cixian asked: \\"Were there many people at the farewell today?\\" Ziyun said, \\"Quite a few — Yuxiang and Jiantan went to see him off to the first inn overnight, so they will not be back until tomorrow.\\" He then pointed with a smile at Baozhu: \\"I dare say none of those in their party were here to see him off; I suspect this elder gentleman has never"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":1,"tokens":["庾香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"宝珠尚推诿不肯，经子云、次贤逼住了，只得说道：「何苦要我们做笑话？我非但别样记不清，连这曲牌名也记得有限。或者庾香还能，我是定说得不好的。」只得掷起来，掷了好几掷，掷着了一个色样，名为绿暗红稀，便呆呆的想来，想了一会，不得主意，便道：","en":"remember other things clearly, even the tune-pattern names (qu pai ming) are only vaguely in my memory. Perhaps Yuxiang might manage, but I am sure to do it poorly.\\" He threw the dice several times until he got a combination whose name was \\"The Shadows of Green, the Scarceness of Red\\" (绿暗红稀). He sat blankly thinking for a while; unable to come up with anything, he said:"},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":1,"tokens":["梅庾香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"将他自己的神情，行乎所当行，倒比那戏文上的老关目还好些。所以才有人说他生疏，也有人说他神妙。」子云笑道：「以后梅庾香，大约非玉侬之戏不看，非玉侬的之酒不喝的了。」漱芳笑道：「玉侬行事还没媚香的奇，近来闻他天天到宏济寺去一回。有个什么田湘帆，也是个风流名士，闹到不堪。后来见了媚香的戏，便天天跟着他的车，他往东就往东，他往西就往西，跟了整个月。媚香怜念他，与他一谈，倒","en":"the script. That is why some say he is untutored while others say he is divine.\\" Ziyun laughed: \\"From now on, Mei Yuxiang will probably watch no theater but Yunong's and drink at no feast where Yunong is not present.\\" Shufang laughed: \\"Yunong's conduct is not yet as remarkable as Meixiang's. I hear that lately Meixiang goes to Hongji Temple once a day. There is a certain"}],"16":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说前回书中梅士燮赴任之后，一切家事，内而颜夫人掌管，外而许顺经理，井井有条。子玉仍系读书，经籍之外研磨诸子百家。到花晨月夕，则有二三知己，明窗净几，共事笔砚。","en":"assumed charge of the inner household while Xu Shun managed affairs without, leaving the estate in perfect order. Ziyu continued his studies, delving into the various philosophical schools alongside his classical texts. On fine mornings and moonlit evenings, he would gather with close friends by a bright window and clean desk, sharing in the quiet pursuits of brush and"},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"闲之日，又须为诸花物色，茶靡石叶之香，鹿锦凤绫之艳，虽倾倒一时，然较之小楼深处修竹一坪，纸帐开时梅花数点，反逊子玉、竹君等之清闲自在也。","en":"courtyard, or a few plum blossoms unfurling upon a paper screen, for in serene freedom Duxiang was in fact outdone by Ziyu, Zhujun and their circle."},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"是日聘才就与子玉说明，并谢数月叨扰。子玉吃惊道：「大哥何故要去，莫非嫌小弟有得罪之处么？」聘才连连陪笑道：「愚兄自到贵府以来，承伯父母同棣台如此恩待，岂尚有不足？无奈愚兄此番进京，家父谆谕自己，定要谋一前程出京。","en":"That same day, Pincai explained the situation to Ziyu, expressing his gratitude for the months of hospitality. Ziyu was taken aback, asking, \\"Elder Brother, why must you leave? Have I done something to offend you?\\" Pincai laughed reassuringly and replied, \\"Since arriving at your esteemed home, I have received"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"。」聘才道：「各人有各人的打算，我如今比不上你了。你是知县少爷，享现成的福，我不但自己不能受用，还要顾家呢！」子玉听到这句，便知不能强留，只得进去与颜夫人说了。颜夫人道：「既然如此，只好听他自去罢。但老爷出门时，嘱咐我好生看待，且说他倒能办事。但此时也无甚多事，如果将来有事，再请他回来亦可。」","en":"provided for you. I, on the other hand, cannot simply enjoy ease; I must provide for my family.\\" Hearing this, Ziyu realized he could not insist and went to explain the matter to Lady Yan. She replied, \\"If that is the case, we have no choice but to let him go. Still, when your father left, he instructed me to treat him well, noting his capability. There is little"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"是晚即命子玉与聘才饯行，又送出四十两银子与聘才，聘才感激不尽。一夜与元茂谈谈讲讲，各有难分之意。","en":"That evening, Lady Yan had Ziyu host a farewell dinner for Pincai, presenting him with forty taels of silver. Pincai was overwhelmed with gratitude. He and Yuanmao talked late into the night, both reluctant to part ways."},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"明早富三爷即遣人带了两辆车来接聘才，聘才即拜别颜夫人并子玉，又辞了元茂，收拾停妥，带了四儿一径上车。先到富宅略叙片时，富三亲送到华府。到了门口，富三先着人回进去，并说魏师爷来了。聘才在车内一望这门面，就觉威严得了不得，就是南京总督衙门，也无此高大。门前一座大照墙，用水磨砖砌成，上下镂花，并有花檐滴水，上盖琉","en":"Early the next morning, Fu the Third sent two carriages to collect Pincai. After bidding farewell to Lady Yan, Ziyu, and Yuanmao, Pincai gathered his belongings, brought Si'er along, and boarded the carriage. They first stopped at the Fu residence for a brief visit before Fu the Third personally escorted him to the Hua mansion. At the gate, a messenger was sent ahead"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"却说子玉因聘才去了，心中也着实思念了几天。此时是四月中旬，因有个闰五月，所以节气较迟，尚见芍药盛开，庭外又有丁香、海棠等，红香粉腻，素面冰心，独自玩赏了一回。","en":"Meanwhile, Ziyu found himself deeply missing Pincai for several days following his departure. It was the middle of the fourth month, and because there was an intercalary fifth month, the season had shifted slightly later than usual. Peonies still bloomed vibrantly in"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":5,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"厮，登舆遍访诸人，一无所遇，大为扫兴。只得独自来至素兰寓所，恰值素兰从戏园中回来，迎接进内，未免也有几句寒温。子玉即将所送之物，面赠素兰，素兰谢了，细玩一番。又见字画端楷，重复谢了又谢。即同子玉到卧室外一间书室内，是素兰书画之所，颇为幽雅，因问子玉道：「今日为何独自一人出来？可曾到过对门？见你心上人么？」子玉笑道：「今日走了好几处，没有见着一个。我本为你而来，对","en":"residence, arriving just as Sulan returned from the theater. Welcomed inside, they exchanged the usual pleasantries. Ziyu presented his gifts, which Sulan received with gratitude, examining them with careful appreciation. Noting the elegant calligraphy and refined paintings, Sulan thanked him repeatedly. They moved into the adjacent study, a secluded and elegant space where"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"梅没有，杂花的有没有？难为度香竟找出几匹来，如今现做了袍子、袄儿穿上了。你说这个心思奇不奇，不是为你是为谁？」子玉听了便觉一阵心酸，止不住流下泪来，要说话。喉间若有物噎住说不出，只呆呆的看着素兰。素兰又道：「到底你们是怎样的交情？我是你的功臣，为你也费了些神。因我有些像你，所以常来对我讲些懵懂话儿。我说你这片心，不知人家知道不知道？","en":"extraordinary? If it is not meant for you, who else could it be for?\\" Hearing this, a profound ache surged through Ziyu's heart, and despite his efforts, tears began to fall. He tried to speak, but the words caught in his throat, leaving him to gaze blankly at Sulan. Sulan pressed on gently, \\"What kind of bond is this between you two? I have tried my best to help you."},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":4,"tokens":["庾香","子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"有这种情分没有？他倒说得好，这是我自己的心肠，管人家知道不知道，又管人家待我怎么样，横竖我自己一人明白就是了。庾香先生，你心里到底怎样。你不妨对我说说。你当面不好意思的对他讲，我替你代说，自然你也有一番思念他的心肠，何妨说给我听听。」子玉只是不语，素兰料着是不肯说的，「我们同到他家去瞧瞧罢？」子玉略一踌躇道：「去也使得。」于是素兰即同子玉走出门来，不多几步，即到","en":"knows? What does it matter how others treat me? As long as I understand it clearly myself, that is enough.' Master Yuxiang, what truly resides in your heart? You need not hide it from me. If you find it difficult to tell him directly, I can speak on your behalf. You clearly harbor deep longing for him; why not share it with me?\\" Ziyu remained silent. Sensing his reluctance,"},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「这光景是里头有客，只怕不便进去，不如回去，先着人进去看看何如？」子玉心上略有一分不自在，不晓里面所请是何客，玉侬陪与不陪？又想起他家里请客，断无不陪之礼。毫无主意，只听凭素兰进退。","en":"has guests; it might not be convenient to enter. Let us go back and send someone to check the situation first.\\" Ziyu felt a wave of unease, uncertain of who was inside or whether Yunong was obliged to entertain them. He reasoned that one must naturally attend to their guests and could hardly refuse them. Lacking a better idea, he simply followed Sulan's lead."},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"床，请客是他师傅长庆请分子，是部里几位经承先生，还是吃的早饭，不多一回就散的。素兰道：「再请到里面坐着等罢。」子玉听见心中略定，只得重进里面。无精打采的坐下。素兰只管笑嘻嘻的问长问短，又问你到底待那玉侬何如？子玉被问不过，只得说道：「玉侬之事，其说甚长。」就把魏聘才途中所见情景，说出至今年会馆中见他一出《惊梦》，真是绝世无双，情文互至，尚未悉其性情抱负。及到怡园","en":"they were several clerks from the Board who had come for an early meal and would soon be departing. Sulan invited Ziyu, \\"Please, come inside and wait.\\" Relieved by the news, Ziyu returned indoors, taking a seat with a heavy heart. Sulan maintained a cheerful stream of conversation, asking about various matters before gently returning to the topic of Ziyu's true feelings"},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，我是晓得他底蕴；他为我，难道他又晓得我什么？且我有何感动他处，使他如此？倒不如不见面罢，省得见面时更多感触。子玉说到此处，更神色惨淡，似有悲泣之意。","en":"Perhaps it would be better if we never saw each other again; it might spare us the heartache of every meeting.\\" As Ziyu spoke, his expression grew increasingly sorrowful, hovering on the edge of tears."},{"paragraph":31,"mentions":5,"tokens":["庾香","子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"乡中一个知己。我看玉侬待他，不如待君十分之二，难得度香更加爱惜，说道：「人各有缘，此中系天定，非人情能强。」且庾香属意玉侬一人，毫不移动，此真是多情种子，非玉侬不足为庾香赏识，非庾香不足为玉侬眷恋。《国风》好色而不淫，其庾香、玉侬之谓乎！」子玉听了，感激度香万分，且爱素兰之聪慧，不枉《曲台花谱》中定作探花郎也。","en":"predestined affinity, determined by heaven and beyond the coercion of human feeling.' Furthermore, your heart, Yuxiang, is fixed solely upon Yunong without the slightest wavering—this is the true nature of a deeply passionate soul. None but Yunong is worthy of your admiration, and none but you are worthy of his devotion. Does not the 'Airs of the States,' when it speaks"},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":5,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"因谈了许多时候，素兰又请子玉随意用了些点心，着人再到琴言处探望。来人回来道：「起先之客倒散了。偏又来了一班人，说要叫琴言，长庆回他不在家，那些人不肯去，坐着等候。长庆因不认识他们，便不应酬，自到房里吃烟去了。被他们闯进去，将长庆的烟枪抢了，要到兵马司衙门出首他。长庆无法，只得赔","en":"They conversed for a long while before Sulan offered Ziyu refreshments and sent another messenger to check on Qinyan. The messenger returned with troubling news: \\"The first group of guests has left, but unfortunately, another group arrived demanding to see Qinyan. Changqing told them he was not at home, but"},{"paragraph":33,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"今日子玉出门，只与素兰谈了半日，所访不遇，倒遇见了丈人，好不纳闷。意欲去望高品，又嫌路远，且出门过久，又恐高堂见责，只得怏怏而回。","en":"Ziyu had spent half the day out, only managing a conversation with Sulan; every other friend he had sought was absent. Instead, he had the misfortune of running into his father-in-law—a truly vexing encounter. He considered visiting Gao Pin, but the distance"}],"17":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说子玉从素兰处回来，见过高堂，即向书房中来。晚饭毕，一轮月上，辉映花间，和风微来，天云四皎，遂把湘帘卷起，倚阑而望。忽见小厮进来禀道：「高、史、颜、王诸少爷同来。」子玉正在怅望，今见齐来，不胜之喜，遂请进同坐。","en":"When Ziyu returned from Sulan's and had paid his respects to his mother, he made his way to his study. The evening meal being finished, a solitary moon arose, casting its silvery radiance among the blossoms. A gentle breeze whispered past, and the heavens and"},{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉即把日间一一过访不遇事说过。先是王恂开言道：「今日我们都在卓然斋中，交会田湘帆与媚香，又遇见竹君前来。那湘帆果是吾辈，与媚香相处的光景，真令人羡慕。」高品道：「湘帆此时是六根全净，五蕴皆空，守定了约法三章，不许你胡行乱走，始信人间果然多是惧内的，怪不","en":"Ziyu recounted how he had called upon each of them earlier in the day to no avail. Wang Xun was the first to speak: \\"Today we were all gathered in Zhuoran's studio, where we met with Tian Xiangfan and Meixiang, and chanced upon Zhujun who arrived later. Xiangfan"},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":4,"tokens":["庾香","子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，有受恩深重，浃髓沦肌等语。」众人大笑，高品道：「岂有此理！你这个谎也撒得不像。」众人又说笑了一阵，高品道：「庾香，后日有一件极好的事，来与你商量。」子玉便问道：「何事？」高品道：「十五日是媚香生日。今日大家商议，并订前舟与你合成一剂六君子汤，凑一公分，找个宽敞的地方，把那些知名宝贝，都叫将来热闹一天，请湘帆与媚香做生日，你道好不好？」子玉道：「好极，好极！但不","en":"\\"Preposterous! Even as a fabrication, it lacks the ring of truth.\\" They joked for a while longer before Gao Pin said: \\"Yuxiang, the day after tomorrow there is a most splendid affair, and I have come to discuss it with you.\\" Ziyu asked: \\"What affair?\\" Gao Pin said: \\"The fifteenth is Meixiang's birthday. Today we all deliberated and agreed to join forces with Qianzhou and yourself"},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子玉","庾香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"王恂道：「你们可不是说徐度香么！我非遗漏，我恐他的事情多。未必能来。」子玉道：「度香应酬虽多，然看其性情光景，我们请他，虽有事也必来的。就是萧静宜，也断不可不请。」大家说：「很好，就添上这两位是了。那是九个，合上那八个，是十七个，也就很热闹了。」南湘道：「没有人了？」王恂道：「尚有何人呢？」南湘道：「你好记性，你既大会群花","en":"had not forgotten him; I only feared his social obligations were too numerous and he might be unable to attend.\\" Ziyu said: \\"Though Duxiang has many engagements, judging by his temperament, if we invite him, he will certainly come regardless of his busyness. And Xiao Jingyi must absolutely be invited as well.\\" Everyone said: \\"Splendid, we shall simply add those two."},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，我真该打，一时竟忘了琴言，是必要他来的。还有那个秦琪官号玉艳的也叫了他来，凑成十个。」众人道：「如此更妙。」子玉道：「如今我们商议起来，怎样邀客。」王恂道：「你作一小札与怡园徐、萧二公，前舟以及余人，我们明日自去知会。」于是大家直谈至二更方散。子玉送了诸人，独坐凝思了一回，想道：「后日之会，足成千古，不晓琴言病体能否痊愈？那时琼林十树，自然要推杜若为先，不识大","en":"Qiguan, styled Yuyan, should be summoned too, making it a perfect ten.\\" Everyone said: \\"That is even better.\\" Ziyu said: \\"Now that we have discussed it, how shall we invite the guests?\\" Wang Xun said: \\"You draft a brief note to the two gentlemen Xu and Xiao of the Garden of Contentment, as well as to Qianzhou and the others, and tomorrow we shall notify them ourselves.\\""},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":3,"tokens":["梅子玉","子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"粉青衫，也堪同揆。点鸳鸯之卅六，红豆齐抛；备翡翠之千双，紫云任请。\\n肃笺申启，代面丁宁。\\n早发高轩，同光下里。梅子玉顿白。上度香先生、静宜逸士阁下。\\n子玉写完封好，用上图章，即付小厮交与门房，明早着人送到怡园，后日请徐、萧二位老爷，同到刘大少爷宅内饮酒，须要交代明白。小厮答应了，子玉亦即安寝，一夜无话。","en":"this note in advance. Bestir your lofty carriage early, and grace our humble lane with your radiant presence. Mei Ziyu bows in respect. To the honored desks of Master Duxiang and the recluse Jingyi.\\"\\n\\nHaving finished writing and sealed the letter, he affixed his seal and handed it to a page to deliver to the gatehouse, instructing that it be sent to the Garden of Contentment"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":3,"tokens":["庾香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，于明日辰刻毕集。因说道：「明日花林中，恐有几个不能来。我知道秦琪官害眼，杜琴言亦患病未痊。昨晚我见素兰，谈及庾香在彼处坐了半日，去访琴言，恰值他师傅请客没有进去，琴言亦未知庾香去访他。明日就使他们两个不来，也有八人，很为热闹的了。庾香、静宜想一定来的。」南湘道：「席间行令，新鲜的甚少，太难了又恐座客一时不能，须得雅俗共赏，易知易能的，又要避熟。\\n射覆等令，亦觉","en":"suffers an eye ailment, and Du Qinyan is also ill and not yet recovered. Last night I saw Sulan, who mentioned that Yuxiang sat there for half the day, then went to visit Qinyan; it happened that his master was hosting guests so he did not enter, and Qinyan remained unaware that Yuxiang had come to visit him. Even if those two do not come tomorrow, there are still eight,"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"品将其中情节剖明，又说起仲清仍送五十金作浇裹之费，春航自然十分感激敬佩。仲清叫蕙芳为之转弯，更觉比前相好。惟有子玉，尚未谋面。是日知文泽等为蕙芳做生日，心上虽十分欢喜，又因他二人交好，竟人人共知，翻有些不好意思，意欲不去，又不好却众人情面，只好践诺。","en":"had Huifang smooth things over for him, rendering their relationship even more harmonious than before. Only with Ziyu had he not yet met face to face. On this day, knowing that Wenze and the others were hosting a birthday banquet for Huifang, he was immensely pleased in his heart; yet because their close bond was now universally known, he conversely felt somewhat abashed"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":5,"tokens":["子玉","庾香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"诸人正在叙谈，只见传帖人引着子玉进来，蕙芳虽不认识，心中却已猜着，上前叩谢。子玉搀住道：「这可是媚香么？我庾香闻名久慕，觌面无缘，今幸仰企下风，已觉清芬竟体。」蕙芳连称不敢，看了子玉仪容，心中暗暗赞赏：「真是天上日星，人间鸾凤，有一段孚瑜和粹之情，皎皎乎有出群之致。怪不得杜玉侬倾倒","en":"While everyone was exchanging courtesies, they saw the servant who had received the letter leading Ziyu in. Though Huifang did not recognize him, he had already guessed his identity in his heart, and stepped forward to bow and give thanks. Ziyu supported him, saying: \\"Can this be Meixiang? I, Yuxiang, have long admired your name but lacked the fate to"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":2,"tokens":["庾香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"道：「媚香一向洒脱，今日忽然拘礼，不是倒累了你了。」遂进室内，与诸人相见，群旦亦都见毕，叙齿坐下。子云道：「蒙庾香、前舟及诸兄折柬相招，今日之举，可为极盛。昨已饱读庾香珠玉，今日尚觉齿有余芬。又复当此群花大会，使弟等附骥餐芳，实为快事。」次贤道：「丹山彩凤，深巷乌衣，裙屐风流无过于此。而寒皋野鹤亦可翱翔其间乎？」文泽、王恂等同说道：「度香、静宜两先生，名士班头，","en":"introductions, seated themselves by seniority, and settled down. Ziyun said: \\"Thanks to the kind invitation by letter from Yuxiang, Qianzhou, and all the gentlemen, today's occasion is truly a grand gathering. Yesterday I drank my fill of reading Yuxiang's pearls and jade, and even today my teeth still carry their lingering fragrance. And now we find ourselves in this great assembly"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"坐受拜。二人如何肯坐，急行收了。此时春航、蕙芳二人真觉口众我寡，只好听凭他们取笑；若回答两句，又惹出许多话来。子玉颇敬春航仪容之洒落，与蕙芳正是冰壶秋月，相映生辉。又复品评诸花，各有佳妙，只不见琴言前来，殊觉怦怦欲动。","en":"felt they were outnumbered and simply submitted to the general raillery; to answer back would only invite more. Ziyu felt a deep admiration for Chunhang's free and easy bearing, and paired with Huifang, the two were truly an ice-jar and an autumn moon, each enhancing the other's radiance. He also observed all the beauties in turn, each possessing their own unique loveliness."},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"定中间一席。论齿是次贤为长，次贤自知不能推逊，只得依了，并坐者为高品，次是仲清；左首一席，子云为首，次南湘，次子玉；右首一席，田春航为首，次王恂，文泽作陪。是每席三位。","en":"honor, with Gao Pin beside him, then Zhongqing. The left-hand table had Ziyun at the head, then Nanxiang, then Ziyu. The right-hand table had Tian Chunhang at the head, then Wang Xun, with Wenze as host. There were three guests at each table."},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一会觥筹交错，履舄纷遗，极尽少年雅集之乐，内中有几个已是玉山半颓，海棠欲睡的光景。席上人人心畅，个个情欢。只有子玉念着琴言卧病在床，知是恹恹神思，药炉半烬，深闭绿窗，不知怎样烦闷。又晓得我今日在此热闹之场，必思冷静。此时怎能走到彼处，安慰他几句，与他瀹茗添香，助起他的精神来。他又不要疑我乐即忘忧，当此群花大会，便就忘了他，那时更觉闷上加闷。偏偏素兰又在此，不然他","en":"crabapple blossoms about to doze. At the tables, everyone's heart was at ease, every face glowing with joy. Only Ziyu kept thinking of Qinyan lying ill in bed, knowing he would be listless and depressed. His medicine-stove half-burned, his green window shut tight; he could not imagine the degree of his tedium. And he knew that Qinyan, aware of today's festive scene,"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":1,"tokens":["庾香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"：「我偏不用人教也赢得你。」文泽道：「今日我们亦算极乐了，可惜花部中少了两人，那个还不要紧，第一是琴言不来，使庾香不能畅意。」子云道：「可不是！琴言的病颇为古怪，精神疲软，饮食不思，已经十余天了，不见好。」次贤道：「我昨日诊他的脉，似积劳，兼之感愤忧郁，昨日痰中竟有血点，非静养数月不能痊愈。」","en":"from the flower contingent. The other is no great matter, but first and foremost Qinyan's absence has prevented Yuxiang from being fully at ease.\\" Ziyun said: \\"Indeed! Qinyan's illness is rather mysterious: listless in spirit, no desire to eat or drink; it has been over ten days with no improvement.\\" Cixian said: \\"Yesterday I took his pulse, and it appeared to be accumulated"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉在炕上听得清楚，不免更觉烦闷。仲清道：「今日之事，不可无文辞翰墨。静宜先生可绘一图，并作一序，以记雅集，我辈藉可附骥。」次贤道：「作图呢，弟当效劳。至于高文典册，自有群公大手笔在。山人寒瘦之语，不称金谷繁华，反使名花减色。」众人道：「太谦了。」子云道","en":"Ziyu, lying on the kang, heard all this clearly and could not help feeling more agitated. Zhongqing said: \\"Today's occasion cannot be without literature and calligraphy. Let Master Jingyi paint a picture and compose a preface to record this elegant gathering,"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":5,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"于是以年齿为先后，仍系次贤为首，次子云，次高品，次南湘，次文泽，次仲清，次春航，次王恂，次子玉，共是九人。王恂已将子玉叫醒，净净脸，素兰取出一颗醒酒丸给子玉吃了。子玉不好意思，只得勉强扎挣。素兰见子玉不语不言，似醉非醉，心上猜着是为琴言未来。一因人多不好解慰他，二因提起琴言反恐倒勾他的心事，非惟不能宽解，越增愁闷了，反倒走开，找别人说话。文泽","en":"followed by Ziyun, then Gao Pin, then Nanxiang, then Wenze, then Zhongqing, then Chunhang, then Wang Xun, and finally Ziyu, making nine people in all. Wang Xun had already roused Ziyu and had him wash his face; Sulan brought out a sobering pill and gave it to Ziyu to ingest. Ziyu felt embarrassed and forced himself to pull it together. Seeing that Ziyu was silent and listless,"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":4,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"高品道：「奇了，人家骂你们，我替你们不平，自然也有不像兔子的，你们倒骂我，真是好人难做。」以下要子玉了，子玉心上正想着琴言，觉得无情无绪，众人亦都明白。子玉虽极意遮饰，终究思绪不佳，不得已，勉强写道：「顾盼曾回玉女眸。鸾篦亲掠云鬟绿。」春航道：「此系上妆时了，底下倒要细细摹写呢。」子玉此时想着琴言唱那《惊梦》的神情，所以有」曾回玉女眸」一句。众人不","en":"people scold you all, and I defend your honor, yet you scold me. Truly no good deed goes unpunished.\\" It was now Ziyu's turn; Ziyu's mind was on Qinyan, feeling hollow and listless, as everyone well understood. Though Ziyu tried his utmost to conceal it, his inspiration was at a low ebb, and he had no choice but to strain and write:\\n\\n\\"A glance in passing, that jade-girl's"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"佩原不错，他有一种脾气，他偏不肯在群花堆里取乐。」王兰保冷笑道：「他自然不肯在我们堆里，他见我们还要生气呢。」子玉道：「何故？」桂保接口道：「他有他的心肠。」子玉接道：「绮席花筵日易夜。英华美可咏同车。」二轮又到次贤，遂写道：「元白诗原结莲社。红氍毹上艳情多。」子云接道：「惯唱《丁娘十索》歌。葑菲彩无遗下体。」高品道：「妙、妙！这句待我对一句好的。」群旦听了料定","en":"Lanbao said with a cold laugh: \\"Of course he won't join our crowd; he actually gets annoyed when he sees us.\\" Ziyu said: \\"Why so?\\" Guibao cut in: \\"He has his own feelings about it.\\" Ziyu continued:\\n\\n\\"Brocade seat and flower banquet, day turns easily to night;\\nin splendor and beauty, worthy of the 'Same Carriage' ode.\\"\\n\\nThe second round came to Cixian, who wrote:"},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":2,"tokens":["庾香","子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"众人又复笑起来。高品道：「诗言志，解铃便是系铃人。若我做了，又不是了。」此下应是王恂，王恂道：「可以收了，轮到庾香作结罢。」写道：「扇底窥郎留半面。拾得瑶光一片明。」众人齐赞道：「好！应结句了，这一结倒不容易。要结得住通篇才好。」子玉想了一想，写道：「雪花飞上琼枝艳。」大众齐赞结得有力，能使通篇一气。","en":"write this one, it would be wrong again.\\" Wang Xun's turn came, and he said: \\"We can close now, so let it fall to Yuxiang to write the conclusion.\\" He wrote:\\n\\n\\"Through the fan-base, peering at my lord, half a face glimpsed;\\npicking up the piece of moonlight, a single bright sliver.\\"\\n\\nEveryone exclaimed in praise: \\"Fine! It is time to conclude, and this conclusion is no"},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":2,"tokens":["庾香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"八人品题尽合，因又想到琴言、琪官为何花？子云道：「琴言色艺过佳，而性情过冷，比为梅花最是相称，且其酷爱梅，不属庾香将谁属耶？」众人说道；「很是。」高品道：「只怕和靖先生不依，庾香割了他靴革幼子了。」","en":"exceedingly cool. Likening him to the plum blossom is most apt; and since his passionate love of the plum is not for Yuxiang's sake, then whose?\\" Everyone agreed: \\"Quite right.\\" Gao Pin said: \\"Only I fear that Lin Hejing would not consent, for Yuxiang would have taken away his leather-shod little son.\\""},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉不觉脸红。仲清道：「琪官呢？」子云道：「琪官性情刚烈，相貌极好。似欠旖旎风流。比他为菊花罢。」高品道：「菊花种数不一，有白有黄，或红或紫，白的还好，其余似觉老气横秋。琪官性情虽烈，其温柔处亦颇耐人怜爱，不如比为杏花。」众人道：「好个杏花，极妥当。」文","en":"Ziyu could not help blushing. Zhongqing said: \\"And Qiguan?\\" Ziyun said: \\"Qiguan's temperament is fierce and upright, his appearance extremely fine; he somewhat lacks a gentle, flowing charm. Let him be likened to the chrysanthemum.\\" Gao Pin said: \\"Chrysanthemums"},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"交给我，如有一人不到，罚我作东一天，两人不到，罚我作东两天。」宝珠道：「真么？明日酒醒了，不要又想不起了。」独子玉默然不语，大家说说笑笑，已至明月正中，红灯欲烬，三更多了。","en":"days' hosting.\\" Baozhu said: \\"Truly? After tomorrow's wine wears off, don't tell me you'll have forgotten.\\" Only Ziyu sat in silence. The others went on talking and laughing; the bright moon was now directly overhead, the red lanterns about to burn out, and it was past the third watch."},{"paragraph":30,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"了，我们可以散罢。」于是大家各起，宝珠又订十八日之期，皆应允了，风雨不阻，遂各登舆四散。明日蕙芳踵门叩谢，惟有子玉病了，不曾进去。","en":"carriages and scattered in all directions. The next day, Huifang went around to call and express thanks; only Ziyu was ill and did not receive him."},{"paragraph":31,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"了十八日，果然诸名士并那些名旦都到宝珠新寓来，从午刻起直至子刻止。是日专以行令猜枚，清歌檀板，亦极欢而散。内中子玉因病不到。添了张仲雨，热闹场中最为趋奉的。","en":"guessing forfeits, clear singing and clapper-beat, and they dispersed having fully enjoyed themselves. Among them Ziyu did not come owing to illness. Zhang Zhongyu was added to the company, always the most eager to please in a festive scene."},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"花谱中添了琪官，惟琴言尚未痊愈。高品、文泽因南湘说过，「一客不来罚我做东一日。」子玉是日不到，罚了南湘一天，南湘甚为乐从。即在他家里又叙了一日。惟有子玉、琴言皆未痊愈。正是：数点梅花娇欲坠，月轮又下竹桥西。未知如何，且听下回分解。","en":"Pin and Wenze held Nanxiang to what he had said: \\"If one guest is absent, I'll be fined to host a day.\\" Since Ziyu did not come that day, Nanxiang was fined a day of hosting; Nanxiang was thoroughly happy to oblige. Another day's gathering was held at his residence. Only Ziyu and Qinyan had both not yet recovered. Truly: a few plum blossoms, tender and about to fall;"}],"18":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说琴言病体恹恹，闭门谢客，只有同班中几个相好时来宽慰。宝珠、素兰又说子玉前日的光景，又不能常来看你，托我们传话，千万保重等语，琴言更加伤感。自患病以来，各处不去，怡园亦屏迹已久。奈其师长庆靠他做个摇钱树，因其久病，不能见客，便也少了好些兴头。","en":"friends from the same troupe came by from time to time to offer comfort. Baozhu and Sulan also passed on word from Ziyu, recounting his recent days and explaining his inability to visit often, yet urging Qinyan to take the utmost care of his health. Hearing these messages, Qinyan only grew more heavy-hearted. Since falling ill, he had gone nowhere at all; even the Garden"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":3,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这一日出门闲走，出得城来，正觉得车如流水马如龙，比城里热闹了好些。顺着路，走到鸣珂坊梅宅来，进去见子玉，卧病未愈，精神懒散。子玉问起聘才光景，聘才只得说好，随口撒了几句谎。又去见了颜夫人，道了谢，即出来找李元茂，只见锁了房门，遂复辞了子玉出门，冷冷清清，到何处去呢？","en":"water, horses like dragons. Following the road, he came to Mei's residence on Mingke Alley, went in and found Ziyu still ill in bed, listless and low-spirited. Ziyu asked how Pincai was doing; Pincai could only speak positively, rattling off a few easy lies. He then went to pay his respects to Lady Yan and express his thanks. Coming out to find Li Yuanmao, he discovered"}],"19":[{"paragraph":8,"mentions":1,"tokens":["梅庾香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"是很红的。」聘才道：「料没有琴官好。」梅窗道：「那个琴官？」聘才就把新年看戏的话，略述了些，又道：「这琴官除了梅庾香之外，其余见了总是冰冷的，恐怕叫他不来。」梅窗道：「那里有叫不动的相公，今日你就叫他。」聘才心内想道：「如今我在华府，他们也应该知道了，自然看我不比从前，就去叫他，如若不来，再叫别个。」梅窗又问笑梅道：「叫谁？」笑梅道：","en":"the story of watching the opera at New Year's, and added: \\"This Qinguan is always icy cold to everyone except Mei Yuxiang; I'm afraid he won't come if called.\\" Meichuang said: \\"Where is there a young protégé who won't come when called? You call him today.\\" Pincai thought to himself: \\"Now that I am in the Hua household, they ought to know about it; naturally they won't treat"}],"20":[{"paragraph":3,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这回书又要说几个风雅人，做件风雅事情。如今这一班名士，渐渐的散了。子玉自从与琴言怡园一叙之后，总未能会面。琴言之病，时好时发，也不进园子唱戏，有时力疾到怡园一走。","en":"tastes engaged in an affair of elegant taste. The company of celebrated men had by now gradually thinned. Since Ziyu's one meeting with Qinyan at the Garden of Contentment, they had never managed to see each other again. Qinyan's illness came and went; he was not appearing in the troupe's productions, and only occasionally, forcing himself despite illness, would he"},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":9,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"而子玉之病亦系忧闷而起，或到怡园时，偏值琴言不来；或到琴言寓里，偏又逢着他们有事，不是他师傅请客，就是有人坐着。又不便再寻素兰，子玉亦觉得无可奈何，只好怅恨缘悭而已。这边琴言在家，并不知子玉来过几次，又听得子玉害病，心上更是悲酸，因为没有到过梅宅，不便自去","en":"Meanwhile Ziyu's own illness had also arisen from melancholy and worry; sometimes when he went to the Garden of Contentment, Qinyan happened not to have come; sometimes when he went to Qinyan's lodgings, there was always some inconvenience — either his teacher Changqing"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"且说子玉是在家养病，不出大门，高品为河间胡太尊请去修志，刘文泽是他岳母惦记他，来接他并其室吴氏，同到直隶总督衙门去了。此中已少了三人，只有子云、次贤、南湘、仲清、春航、王恂六人，不时往来。","en":"Let us speak of Ziyu: he was at home recuperating from his illness and not going out at all. Gao Pin had been invited by the prefect of Hejian, Lord Hu, to assist in compiling a local gazetteer. Liu Wenze's mother-in-law had been missing him and had come to fetch him along"},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":1,"tokens":["庾香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，绕道出园。子云道：「今日本有一事要烦两兄。园中各处的对联尚须添设几副，今日倒被龙舟耽误了，迟日再请一游，并约庾香、剑潭诸君何如？」史、田二人应了，遂上车而去。这边相公五人，也各陆续散去。这回怡园二次宴客，可惜人少未齐，不晓下卷又叙何人，再俟细细想来。","en":"today we were sidetracked by the dragon boat. Perhaps another day I can invite another outing and also include Yuxiang, Jiantan, and the other gentlemen — what do you say?\\" Shi and Tian both agreed, then mounted their carriages and departed. The five young dan actors also gradually dispersed. This second grand entertainment at the Garden of Contentment — it was a pity"}],"21":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"欢暮乐，所见所闻，无非势力钻营等事，是以渐渐心肥胆大。从前在梅宅有士燮学士在家，虽不来管教他，自然畏惧的。而且子玉所结交的，都是些公子名士，没有那些游荡之人。譬如马困槽枥之中，虽欲泛驾也就不能。此时是任凭所欲，无所忌惮。","en":"residence Academician Mei had been at home: though he did not lecture Pincai, fear naturally restrained him. Moreover Ziyu kept company only with gentlemen of name — none of those idle roamers. Like a horse stalled in its manger, however much it wished to bolt the traces it could not. Now he might indulge every whim without scruple."},{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一日，因张、顾二人有事，遂独自出城，雇了一辆十三太保玻璃热车，把四儿也打扮了，意气扬扬，特来看子玉之病。","en":"glass-windowed heated carriage, dressed up Si'er as well, and with an air of triumph came expressly to inquire after Ziyu's illness."},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":4,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"已到梅宅，进去见过颜夫人，即到子玉房中来。子玉已经病了月余，虽非沉痾，然觉意懒神疲，饮食大减，情兴索然。有时把些书本消遣，无奈精神一弱，百事不宜，独自一人不言不语，有咄咄书空气象。就是颜夫人，也猜不出儿子什么病来，只道其读书认真，心血有亏，便常把些参苓调理，无如药不对病，不能见效。世","en":"Arriving at the Mei house he paid his respects to Lady Yan and went straight to Ziyu's chamber. Ziyu had now been ill over a month; though not gravely sick, he felt leaden and weary, ate far less than before, and his spirits flagged utterly. Sometimes he diverted himself with books, but his vitality was too weak for any pursuit; he sat"},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":11,"tokens":["子玉","庾香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉听到提起琴言，便又感动他的心事，即对聘才道：「琴言原是吾兄说起的，及我亲见其人，果是绝世无双，怎么如今说有多少比他好的呢？」聘才道：「琴言相貌原生得好，但其性情过冷，譬如一枝花，颜色是好极了，偏在树高头，攀折不到，叫你不能亲近他，人若爱花，自然爱那近","en":"At mention of Qinyan Ziyu's old sorrow stirred; he said to Pincai: \\"You were the first to speak of Qinyan — when I met him he seemed peerless in the world; how can there now be so many said to surpass him?\\" Pincai replied: \\"Qinyan's looks are indeed fine, but his temper is cold"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":2,"tokens":["庾香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"了几袋烟。聘才便道：「我听得你身子不快，特地出城看你，近来可好些么？」琴言听得「出城」二字，即思想了一回，怪道庾香久不出来，原来搬进内城去了，因问道：「庾香几时搬进城的？住在那一城？离此多远？」","en":"of the city especially to see you — are you better lately?\\" At the words \\"out of the city\\" Qinyan pondered — so Yuxiang had not visited because he had moved inside the walls — and asked: \\"When did Yuxiang move into the city? Which ward? How far from here?\\""},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":15,"tokens":["庾香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"聘才知琴言听错了，便道：「庾香是没有搬家，如今我在城里住，不在庾香处了。」琴言听了，便不言语，似觉精神不振，就有些烦闷光景。聘才想道：「他问庾香就高高兴兴的，对我就是这样冰冷，实在可恶。横竖他们不常见面，待我捏造些事哄他，且看他如何？」问琴言道：「这月内见过庾香没有？」琴言道：「","en":"Pincai saw that Qinyan had misunderstood him and explained, \\"Yuxiang has not moved house. It is I who now live inside the city and no longer stay with him.\\" At once Qinyan fell silent. The little brightness that had risen in him faded, and a shadow of fretfulness crossed his face. Pincai thought, \\"At the mere mention"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":3,"tokens":["庾香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"衫子边儿，是件白花绉绸的，我明白是个相公，倒猜着是你的。又想起你现病着，未必出来。又想道，是你，决不躲的。再看庾香满脸飞红，装起瞌睡来，我怕他不好意思，只好辞了出来。走到门房门口，见跟那联珠班内蓉官的得子与那些三爷们讲话，我知道是蓉官了。玉侬，你想蓉官这种东西，交他做什么？\\n就叫个相公，也不用瞒人。我真不懂我们这个兄弟的脾气。我也知道你为了他，很有一番情。他起初","en":"you were ill and unlikely to be abroad, and, had it been you, you would never have hidden from me. One glance at Yuxiang showed his whole face in a blaze; he even pretended to doze. I feared to shame him, so I could only take my leave. At the gatehouse I saw Dezi, the page belonging to Rongguan of the Lianzhu troupe, chatting with several of the young gentlemen. Then I"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":2,"tokens":["庾香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这边魏聘才听了心中大怒，意欲发作，忽又转念道：「他是庾香心上人，糟蹋了他，又怕庾香见怪，权且忍耐，慢慢的收拾他。屡次遭他白眼，竟把我看得一钱不值，实在可恨。我不能摆布他，也枉做了华公府的朋友了。只得忿忿而出，坐上了热车，风驰电掣的去了。","en":"Pincai heard this and rage flared — almost to explode — then thought: \\"He is Yuxiang's darling — ruin him and Yuxiang may blame me — endure for now — settle slowly — time and again his cold eyes treat me as worthless — hateful. If I cannot master him what am I as Young Master Hua's man?\\" Swallowing fury he swept out, climbed his heated"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":6,"tokens":["庾香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"再说琴言在床卧了，觉得阵阵心酸，淌了许多眼泪，左思右想，不能明白。忽想起素兰那日之言，说同庾香前来，因为师傅请客，不得进内，说到此又被人打断。这几天又寻不着他，何不再寻他来一问，便知庾香的光景了。即着人去寻素兰，素兰回家即换了便服过来，这边琴言接着，就在房里坐下。素兰道：「你寻我有什么事？莫非又要我做庾香的替身么？」琴言笑道：「我有一件好难明","en":"wave of acid grief — tears without end — could not puzzle it out. He recalled Sulan's words that day — he and Yuxiang had come but the master was feasting guests and could not enter — then someone cut the tale short; these days he could not find Sulan — sent for him; Sulan changed to plain dress and came; Qinyan received him and they sat in the room. Sulan opened: \\"You"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":5,"tokens":["庾香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「什么笑话？你快快说罢。」素兰道：「媚香的生日，田湘帆做了一篇小序，大家说做得好，度香便抄了。那一天，庾香来，静宜便将小序给庾香看，庾香也赞了几声。度香在旁说道：「湘帆好一个浓艳文心，愈艳愈好，愈浓愈好。」度香正赞湘帆的文章，庾香忽说道：「玉侬自然在玉艳之上，玉艳虽好，尚逊瑶卿、媚香一筹，而玉侬则玉树琼花，似非人间花谱中可以位置。」静宜、度香初听了不知他","en":"\\"On Meixiang's birthday Tian Xiangfan wrote a short preface — everyone praised it — Duxiang copied it. The day Yuxiang came Jingyi showed him the piece; Yuxiang admired it. Standing by, Duxiang said: 'Xiangfan's style — the thicker the richer — the richer the better.' Jingyi and Duxiang at first did not catch Yuxiang's drift — then realized: he misheard 'thick and rich'"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":1,"tokens":["庾香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"听得人说那个人也姓魏，叫什么才，却是华公府里的。」琴言道：「我却听得他说，如今住在城里，不在庾香处了，我也没有问他在那里。」素兰道：「我听走堂的说起来，却说得原原委委。新年上，这姓魏的同了几个人，带着保珠、二喜，吃了五十几吊钱，掌柜的因不认识，写账的时候，想必说了什么话。","en":"surnamed Wei — something Cai — from the Hua mansion.\\" Qinyan said: \\"I heard him say he lives in the city now — not at Yuxiang's — I did not ask where.\\" Sulan said: \\"The waiters told the tale end to end. New Year's week this Wei and others brought Baozhu and Erxi — fifty-odd strings — the boss did not know him and must have spoken out of turn when tallying credit.\\""},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":11,"tokens":["庾香","子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"听你骂他，想必就是这个魏聘才了。」琴言道：「管他是不是，横竖叫魏聘才的总不是东西就是了。」因又问道：「那日你同庾香来，遇见我师傅请客。那一回的说话，还没有说完，到底讲什么？」素兰就把那一天子玉的光景，细细述了一遍，又道：「我也为你说得口渴了，你茶都没有一碗。」琴言笑道：「说话说得要紧，忘了吩咐，快沏茶来。」素兰吃了两口茶，便笑道：「庾香与你倒是一样的心肠，竟是一","en":"said Qinyan, \\"anyone named Wei Pincai is certainly no decent thing.\\" He then asked, \\"That day when you came with Yuxiang and found my master entertaining guests, you never finished what you had begun to tell me. What exactly was said?\\"\\n\\nSulan recounted in careful detail all that had happened with Ziyu that day. At the end he complained, \\"I have talked myself thirsty for"}],"22":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说前回书中，陆素兰应许了琴言约子玉出来相会，话便说了这一句，明日恰好是端午，是没有工夫的。偏又接连唱了三天堂会戏，素兰身子也乏了，又静养几天。这边琴言是度日如年，天天使人来问他，把个素兰弄得没有主意。又因自己寓中来往人多，也不甚便。若借人地方，或是酒楼饭馆，一发不好说话，又不便请陪客","en":"The last chapter told how Lu Sulan promised Qinyan that he would arrange for Ziyu to come out for a meeting. But no sooner was the promise spoken than the next day proved to be the Dragon Boat Festival, when there was no leisure to be had; and then came three days running of private engagement performances, which left Sulan so worn"},{"paragraph":2,"mentions":4,"tokens":["子玉","庾香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"送信人照着吩咐，一径到梅宅来，投了书信。子玉正在闷闷不乐，将子云所赠之瑶琴，翻着琴谱，捡那容易的在那里学弹。忽又将琴翻转，将那琴铭诵了几遍。只觉绿阴满院，长日如年，想不出什么解闷的事来。正在情绪烦闷之时，忽见云儿拿了一封信进来，放在桌上，说怡园徐老爷送来的，明日请逛运河，并要回信呢。子玉取过书","en":"The messenger, as instructed, went straight to the Mei residence and presented the letter. Ziyu was sitting in listless gloom with the jade qin that Ziyun had given him, turning over the notation and picking out the easier pieces to practice; then he turned the qin over again and recited its inscription several times through. He felt only that"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":3,"tokens":["庾香","子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，连累了什么人？干净的就是我一个。」素兰道：「别人也连累不着，疼你的虽多，也不至于为你死的。你怎么今日就想不起庾香来，难道他不要为你死吗？你且看看这是谁写的？」便把子玉的回信递与琴言，琴言当下接过信来一看，便即放下道：「这是人家与徐老爷的信，你给我看作什么？」素兰笑道：「你且不要性急，这是信面，你且看里头写的是什么？」琴言只得抽出信来，从头至尾看了一遍，又从起头","en":"down, true; many love you, but not to the point of dying for you. How is it that today of all days you cannot call Yuxiang to mind — would he not die for you? Look, then — whose hand wrote this?\\" And he handed Ziyu's reply to Qinyan, who took the letter, glanced at it, and laid it down, saying: \\"This is a letter from someone to Master Xu — why show it to me?\\" Sulan laughed:"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴言也倦极了，伏枕而卧，倒又熟睡起来。梦见素兰与子玉先在船中，自己刚刚要上船来，忽见岸上跑出两人：一个穿青的，光着脊梁，盘着辫子，赶上来一把揪了过去，骂道：「你这小杂种，日间装病不见人，怎么如今又跑到这里来了？」琴言哭喊救命，把身子用力一挣，却自己仍在床上，惊得一身冷汗，已是红日满窗。","en":"Qinyan, utterly spent, sank upon his pillow and fell fast asleep after all. He dreamed that Sulan and Ziyu were already in the boat, and he himself just stepping aboard, when suddenly two men came running out upon the bank: one in dark clothes, bare to the waist, queue coiled on his head, rushed up, seized him, and hauled him back, cursing: \\"You little bastard!"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":1,"tokens":["庾香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"见了素兰，问道：「你昨日可约定庾香到这里来没有？」素兰道：「我是约他一直上船的，我犹恐他找不着，又着人假充怡园的人领他去了，此时一定先在船里。我要等他们将酒席什物等类齐备了，省得临时短少，也就要去了。」看那素兰为人，又精细，又聪明，差不多赶上蕙芳，不过尚少蕙芳赚潘三的辣手，较之他人，","en":"On seeing Sulan he asked: \\"Did you settle with Yuxiang yesterday that he should come here?\\" Sulan said: \\"I arranged for him to go straight to the boat. And lest he fail to find it, I sent a man besides, passing as one of the Garden of Contentment people, to guide him there; by this time he is surely aboard"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"却说子玉从二更躺下，也就巴不到天明，听了这一场雨，便短叹长吁的怨命，唯恐明日早上也是这样大雨，只怕萱堂就不叫他出门。起来开了窗子看天，恰又值南风大作，把雨直打进来。仰面看时，黑云如墨，电光开处，闪烁金蛇。忽然一个霹雳，震得屋角都动，连忙闭上了窗，挑灯独坐，幸","en":"As for Ziyu, from the moment he lay down at the second watch he could scarcely wait for morning; and when he heard that storm of rain he sighed short and long and cursed his luck, fearing that if the morning brought more of the same, his mother would never let him"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":6,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"好了，再欲到上房告禀，只见李元茂披着件短衫，赤了脚，慌慌张张进来道：「我今日特意早起，想不到你已经早起来了。」子玉道：「我今日出门有事，所以略早了些。」元茂道：「我有句话商量。」子玉正要问时，只见云儿进来道：「徐老爷打发人来请，说客业已到齐了，就请少爷过去。」子玉也不及再问元茂，连忙便进上房，见颜夫人尚在梳头，子玉把出门的事告禀。颜夫人道：「你这几日身子好些，出","en":"in all in a flurry: \\"I made a point of rising early today — who'd have thought you would be up earlier still!\\" Ziyu said: \\"I have business abroad today, so I am somewhat early.\\" Yuanmao said: \\"There is a matter I want to talk over with you.\\" Ziyu was about to ask what, when Yun'er came in: \\"Master Xu has sent a man to say the guests are all assembled, and requests"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":6,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"正要出来，李元茂忽又前来拦住道：「你且慢走，我有一件要紧的事，必要商量。」子玉着急道：「有什么事，快说罢！」元茂擦擦眼睛，打了一个呵欠，吞吞吐吐的说不出来。子玉道：「怎样？有话剪绝快说。有人在门口候我，你快说罢。」元茂道：「谁候着你？这么忙，今日还早得很呢。你听那个卖甜浆粥的还没有喊过来，你就如此着忙，作什么！」子玉心上真有些","en":"Yuanmao once more planted himself in the way: \\"Not so fast! I have a pressing matter that must be talked over.\\" Ziyu said impatiently: \\"What is it then? Out with it!\\" Yuanmao rubbed his eyes, gave a yawn, and hemmed and hawed without bringing anything out. Ziyu said: \\"Well? If you have something to say, say it short and quick — someone is waiting for me at the gate."},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":4,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这一缠绕，看表上已到巳初一刻，子玉即忙上车，往大东门来。路又远，出得城时，已是午初，素兰早已先到了，一面又叫人在路口探望。少顷，望见子玉乘车而来，下了车，素兰衣冠楚楚的迎上岸来，请安问好。同上了船，便与子玉除了冠，脱了外面的衣服，素兰也换了便服。子玉谢道：「多感雅意，十分周匝，使我负","en":"What with all this entanglement, his watch showed the first quarter of the si hour. Ziyu hurried onto the cart and made for the Great East Gate. The way was long, and by the time he was out of the city it was the beginning of the wu hour. Sulan had long since arrived ahead of him, and had besides posted a man at the head of the road to watch."},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"又不好来辞，只好我们二人权坐一坐，再散罢。我因玉侬病重，也觉心绪不佳。总之好事多磨，是一点不错的。」几句话说得子玉如冰水淋身，默然无语，怔怔的看着素兰好一回，叹了一口气道：「不料今日之事果然如此，不出我之所料。香畹，只可惜你白费了一番心，叫我无福之人不能消受。不晓我昨夜因这一场雨，就是千愁万虑的，原知道今日是断不能会着玉侬的。今日之勉强而来者，一来为你这番美情，","en":"short, 'good things are ever crossed' — there is not a hair's error in the saying.\\" These few words fell upon Ziyu like ice-water poured over his body. He was silent, staring blankly at Sulan a long while; then he sighed and said: \\"So today's affair has indeed turned out thus — not a jot beyond what I foresaw. Xiangwan, the pity is only that you have spent your pains"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":5,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"说着便已红了眼睛，摇着头道：「这也奇了，这也实在奇了。」素兰见了忍不住要笑出来，便对子玉道：「我们如今同去找玉侬罢，去看看他的病何如？」子玉想了一想，道：「也可不必了，既然此地还见不着，就到那里必要生出别故来，也是见不着的。」素兰说：「他现病在床，怎么会见不着呢？」子玉道：「前日你我同去那一回，玉侬不病在床吗？后来我又去过两次，皆没有见","en":"from laughing, and said to him: \\"Come, let us go together now and find Yunong, and see how his illness does.\\" Ziyu considered a moment and said: \\"Better not. Since I cannot meet him even here, some fresh hindrance would be sure to spring up there, and I should not see him even so.\\" Sulan said: \\"He lies sick in his bed — how should you fail to see him?\\" Ziyu said:"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":7,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉沉思了一回，道：「如不像玉侬，倒可以会会，如像玉侬，则当日怡园已经唐突过了，何必再叫婢学夫人呢！不但不愿见那人，而且于玉侬实有所不忍。香畹，你是个明白人，想能见到，非我故作矫情。」素兰道：「你的话也是，你是不肯见他，我偏叫他出来。」子玉尚要拦阻，已见","en":"Ziyu pondered a while, then said: \\"If he is unlike Yunong, I might well meet him; but if he is like Yunong — I committed affront enough that day at the Garden of Contentment; why set the maid to ape her mistress a second time? Not only am I unwilling to see"},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":6,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「今日请你们来，原为乐一天，何必哭哭啼啼。且已经半天过了，不到晚就要赶城，能有几个时辰欢乐，不如大家笑笑罢。」子玉勉强答应道：「香畹之言极是，玉侬也不必伤心了。」琴言道：「有什么欢笑呢？我们在怡园一叙，直到如今，是五个月。再候第二次欢叙，只怕也要一年了。这一年内，知道我能候得到候不到呢。大约这一场也就完结了。」说罢又哭，子玉劝道：「不妨，只要你身子好了，天天可以","en":"evening we must race for the city. We have but a few hours left for gladness; better we should all laugh a little.\\" Ziyu forced himself to assent: \\"Xiangwan is quite right; Yunong, grieve no more.\\" Qinyan said: \\"And what is there to laugh over? From our one meeting at the Garden of Contentment to this day is five months. For a second glad meeting we may well wait a year;"},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"此时船已开行，素兰的家人把酒肴都摆上来，素兰一面敬酒，一面劝，子玉、琴言只得坐了，悲从中来，无言相对，尚复何心饮酒。经素兰苦劝，只得勉强饮了几杯，终究是强为欢笑，亦不知何所为而然。在琴言心上，终觉得生离死别，只此一面，以后像不能见面的光景。子玉也觉得像是无缘，料定是不能常见的。此是大家心上，想到极尽头处，自然生出忧","en":"boat was under way, and Sulan's servants set out the wine and dishes. Sulan poured the wine, urging and coaxing; Ziyu and Qinyan could only take their seats, but with sorrow flooding up in them they sat wordless, face to face — what heart had they left for drinking? Under Sulan's patient pressing they forced down a few cups, but it was gaiety worn as a mask, and they"},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"当下船已走了三四里，三人静悄悄的清饮了一回。子玉一面把着酒，一面看那琴言，如蔷薇濯露，芍药笼烟，真是王子乔、石公子一派人物，就与他同坐一坐，也觉大有仙缘，不同庸福。又看素兰，另有一种丰神可爱，芳姿绰约，举止雅驯，也就称得上珠联璧合。今日这一会，倒觉是绝世难逢的，便就欢乐顿出，忧愁渐解。琴言看子玉是","en":"By now the boat had traveled three or four li; the three sat quietly, drinking clear wine for a time. As Ziyu held his cup, he gazed at Qinyan, who appeared like a rose washed in dew, or a peony veiled in mist—truly a figure of the same immortal stripe as Prince Qiao or Master Shi. Merely to sit beside him felt like a profound karmic blessing, far beyond vulgar"},{"paragraph":30,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"要妒忌的，只有离多会少了。若使他们天天常在一处，也不显得天所珍惜，秘而不露的意了。心上十分羡慕，即走过来，坐在子玉肩下，温温存存，婉婉转转的敬了三杯，又让了琴言一杯。此时三人的恩情美满，却作了极乐国无量天尊，只求那鲁阳公挥戈酣战，把那一轮红日倒退下去，不许过来。","en":"not show heaven's intent to cherish and hide them away. Feeling deep admiration, Sulan walked over and sat at Ziyu's side, warmly and gently offering him three cups of wine, then offering one to Qinyan. At this moment, the deep affection among the three was perfectly complete; it was as if they had become the Boundless Celestials of the Pure Land. They only wished"},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":5,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"再听时，是急管繁弦，淫哇艳曲。不一时摇将过来，子玉从船舱帘子里一望，见有三个人在船中，大吹大擂的，都是袒裼露身；有一个怀中抱着小旦，在那里一人一口的喝酒，又有两个小旦坐在旁边，一弹一唱。止觉得欢声如迅雷出地，狂笑似奔流下滩，惊得琴言欲躲进后舱，子玉便把船窗下了，却不晓得是什么人。素兰从窗缝里看时，对","en":"hurrying pipes and thronging strings, and wanton, garish songs. In a little while the boat came rowing past, and Ziyu, peering through the cabin blind, saw three men in it, blowing and drumming away at full blast, every one of them stripped to the skin; one held a xiaodan in his arms, and the pair were drinking mouth-about from one cup, while two more xiaodan sat at"},{"paragraph":33,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"素兰笑道：「各人有各人的乐处，他们不如此就不算乐。」看看红日将近沉西，子玉此时心中甚是快乐，竟有乐而忘返之意。","en":"behave like this, they would not consider it pleasure.\\" Looking on, the red sun was nearing the western horizon. Ziyu's heart at this moment was full of joy — he almost felt the pleasure of having forgotten to return."},{"paragraph":34,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴言心上虽知天色已晚，却也不忍催迫。素兰恐晚了，不能进城，便叫船家快些摇摆，天不早了，于是一面即收拾起来。子玉便将带来之物，分送二人，二人不好推辞，只得收了。子玉又将那包里散碎银，分赏了素兰、琴言的人，又说辛苦了你们，众人叩头谢赏。","en":"city, called to the boatmen to ply their oars faster, for the hour pressed; and meanwhile they began to pack up. Ziyu then divided the things he had brought between the two of them, and they, unable to refuse, accepted. Ziyu also shared out the loose silver from his bundle in rewards to Sulan's and Qinyan's servants, saying, \\"You have all had a weary day\\"; and the company"},{"paragraph":35,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"船到大东门，又各自上车。子玉拉着琴言的手道：「我们迟日再叙罢，诸事须要自解才好。」又流下泪来，琴言也哽咽道：「你放心去罢，将要关城了，咱们见面不在香畹处，就在怡园两处。」子玉点了点头，只得硬了心肠，各自上车。车夫怕晚了，加上一鞭，急急的跑了。","en":"The boat came to the Great East Gate, and they went each to his own cart. Ziyu held Qinyan's hand and said: \\"We shall meet again another day; in all things you must learn to console yourself\\" — and his tears fell once more. Qinyan answered, choking: \\"Go, and set your heart at rest; the gates will soon be closing. When we meet,"},{"paragraph":36,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉回来，已点了灯，颜夫人问起来，只得随口支吾了几句。不知后事如何，且听下回分解。","en":"Ziyu returned home; the lamps were already lit. Lady Yan asked where he had been; he could only give a vague answer to put her off. As for what happened next, listen to the following chapter to find out."}],"23":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说子玉逛运河这一天，李元茂向子玉借钱。少顷账房送出八吊大钱，李元茂到手，心花尽开。又想道：「这些钱身上难带，不如票子便当。」便叫跟他小使王保，拿了五吊大钱放在胡衕口烟钱铺内，换了十张票子，元茂一张张的点清了装在槟榔口袋里，挂在衫子衿上。候不到吃饭，即带了王","en":"On the very day Ziyu set out to tour the canal, Li Yuanmao came to borrow money from him. Shortly after, the accounts room brought out eight strings of large cash; upon receiving them, Yuanmao felt his heart blossom with unrestrained joy. Yet he thought to himself, \\"This"}],"24":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":14,"tokens":["庾香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"从前看了这两个人都是斯斯文文的，再不料如今作出这些事来，真是知人知面不知心了。」仲清道：「我又听得一件快活事，庾香与琴言、素兰倒游了一天运河。近日他们二人病都好了。」王恂笑道：「庾香竟公然独乐起来，也不来约我们一声。」仲清道：「是素兰请他与琴言相会，各诉相思，外人是不可与闻。」王恂道：「我真不知庾香、琴言之情，是何处生的？世间好色钟情，原是我辈。但情之所出，实非","en":"of them were so refined; truly, faces can deceive.\\" Zhongqing smiled, \\"But I do have some more uplifting news. Yuxiang spent an entire day drifting along the canal with Qinyan and Sulan. Recently, both of them seem to have recovered from their illnesses.\\" Wang Xun smiled faintly, \\"Yuxiang revels all on his own now, never inviting us.\\" Zhongqing replied, \\"It was Sulan"},{"paragraph":2,"mentions":7,"tokens":["庾香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"是什么心，虽未出之于口，未必不藏之于心。就算也没有这片心，但世间既爱此人，断无爱其拒绝，反不爱其逢迎之理。所以庾香一怒，而琴言之感愈深；琴言一哭，而庾香之爱弥甚。虽然只得一面，他们心上，倒像是三生前定，隔世重逢，是呼吸相通的了。此即是庾香、琴言之情根，似已支支节节，布得满地，你尚说没有么？但又闻宝珠讲，琴言留意庾香，已在怡园未会之前，就是初六那一天望见庾香之后，","en":"no such underlying depths, when one loves someone, they would never prefer rejection over reciprocation. Thus, Yuxiang's fierce anger only deepened Qinyan's gratitude, just as Qinyan's tears deepened Yuxiang's love. Though they had met but once, their hearts aligned as seamlessly as breath. The roots and branches of their bond already spread in every direction—how can"},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":1,"tokens":["庾香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"且资助他，劝导他，则转爱为敬，转敬为爱，几如良友之箴规，他山之攻错，其中不正而自正，亦可谓勇于改过，以湘帆比起庾香来，正如子云、相如，同工异曲。世唯好色不淫之人始有真情，若一涉淫亵，情就是淫亵上生的，不是性分中出来的。譬如方才说的潘三，心上也是想着媚香，难道说他也是钟情的不成？」王恂道：「也要算情，若说不是情，他也不想了。」仲清笑道：「潘三若有情，倒绝不想媚香，","en":"from another mountain used for polishing jade—his wrongs were righted without the need for preaching. Compared to Yuxiang, they are like Sima Xiangru and Yang Xiong: sharing the same craft, yet playing an entirely different tune. Only those who love beauty without succumbing to debauchery can hold true passion; feelings born of sheer lust do not stem from one's true nature."},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":1,"tokens":["庾香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"」仲清道：「难道你还没有见过这人，怎么想不起来？」王恂道：「媚香生日，那一位顶年轻，生得顶好的，就是梅公子，号庾香。」桂保想了一想，道：「是了，是了，果然不错。论容貌与玉侬一对，但他倒合得来玉侬这脾气吗？」玉林道：「那一天玉侬没有来，怪不得那位梅公子是无精打采的，话也不说，酒也不喝，略喝了几杯，就出席躺着去了。后约定到瑶卿家里去，他答应了，也没有来。王恂道：「听","en":"with longing for him! Who exactly is this Master Mei?\\" Zhongqing clarified, \\"You met him—Young Master Mei, styled Yuxiang.\\" Guibao recalled, \\"Ah, yes! His beauty certainly makes a handsome match for Yunong, but does Yunong's temper truly suit him?\\" Yulin added, \\"That day when Yunong was absent, no wonder Yuxiang drooped so noticeably. He was completely silent, sipped very"}],"25":[{"paragraph":6,"mentions":1,"tokens":["庾香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"外是史、颜、田、王、梅，分作三席。那晓昨日一齐辞了，可可的这么凑巧，竟一个都不能来。」文泽便问何故，子云道：「庾香旧病又发了。史竹君昨日醉坏了，竟至呕血不能出房。湘帆说是没有会过华公子，不肯来。庸庵为是这两天，他夫人要弄璋了，一步不离伺候。剑潭见诸人不来，也就辞了。昨日只得邀了张仲雨，倒是同华公子相识的。余外就是静宜，共有五人，只有两席。他们没有会过华公子，不晓","en":"yesterday they all declined at once? By sheer coincidence, not a single one could come.\\" Wenze asked why. Ziyun said: \\"Yuxiang's old illness has flared up again. Shi Zhujun drank himself sick yesterday — vomiting blood, unable even to leave his room. Xiangfan says he has never met Young Master Hua and refuses to come. Yong'an's wife is about to give birth any day now, so he"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":5,"tokens":["庾香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"就恨还有一个袁宝珠与他作敌手，心上总想压他下来，故也加了工夫，更觉一往情深，如水斯注。又见华公子面貌也有些相像庾香处，又想起那一天是唱《惊梦》遇见了庾香，就彼此两心相印，只可惜庾香今日没有在坐，若是他在坐，我便不枉唱这两回了。我且今日试把华公子权当庾香在那边楼上，照着那一天的情景做来，或者心动神知，庾香在梦中竟看见，也未可知；就算他看不见我，我却倒像见了他。便也","en":"out deeper in feeling than before, like water poured out of a jar.\\n\\nThen he noticed that there was something of Yuxiang about Young Master Hua's face; and he remembered that the day he had met Yuxiang he had been singing *The Interrupted Dream*, and how the two of them had understood each other. *A pity Yuxiang is not sitting here today. If he were, I should not have"},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":1,"tokens":["庾香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"如此，你可感激他么？」琴言把子云看了一看，低着头不言语。文泽道：「玉侬今日亦不可无知己之感，星北之倾倒，亦不下庾香，你明日倒去见见他为是。」","en":"should not be without the feeling of one who has found a friend who knows him. Xinbei's infatuation is no less than Yuxiang's — you would do well to go and see him tomorrow.\\""},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":1,"tokens":["庾香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"言被众人讲得，似乎要他去亲近华公子的意思，便气忿忿的无处发泄，因想道：「别人说我也罢，就是度香不该。他既知我与庾香相好，今日又讲这些话来，拿我当什么人看待？越想越气，便淌下泪来。仲雨已经醉了，见了琴言如此光景，便冷笑一声，说道：「你这个相公真有些古怪，难道倒赞坏了？人家用尽心费尽力，还巴结不到这一赞呢。」琴言本已有气，正愁没有处发作，听到此便忍不住说道：「我也不","en":"the others to say this, but Duxiang of all people should know better. He knows full well of my affections for Yuxiang, yet he speaks these words today — how exactly does he view me?\\" The more he thought, the angrier he grew, until tears finally spilled down his cheeks. Zhongyu was already drunk, and seeing Qinyan in such a state, he let out a cold sneer and said: \\"This"},{"paragraph":30,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"就撤了席，又吃了西瓜、莲藕，送了客出园，诸旦也各自回去。琴言这一句话，便生出无数苦况来，虽徐子云也难荫庇，何况子玉。不知闹些什么事出来，且听下回分解。","en":"Qinyan would go on to spawn countless bitter hardships; even Xu Ziyun would struggle to shelter him, let alone Ziyu. To know what troubles were to arise, one must listen to the next chapter's unfolding."}],"26":[{"paragraph":12,"mentions":2,"tokens":["梅庾香","庾香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，这也不难，好花不在多，就拣顶好的买几个进来，就可以了。」心上又想道：「他倒中意琴言这东西，殊不知他心上只想着梅庾香，未必想到你。」又想道：「这琴言或者倒是势利的心肠，所以看不起我。若到这府里，自然会改变的。无论其改变不改变，既进了府，此生就不要想见庾香的面了。」再又想道：「琴言这等古怪脾气，此刻华公子是不知道，若长久了，是必定厌恶的。让我弄他进来，叫他受两年苦，","en":"that will suffice.\\" Inwardly, Pincai plotted: 'He fancies Qinyan, little knowing that Qinyan's heart belongs to Mei Yuxiang and is unlikely to favor him. Furthermore, Qinyan's snobbery scorns me. If admitted to this mansion, he might change, or he might not, but once inside, he would never glimpse Yuxiang again. The Young Master is unaware of Qinyan's eccentric temper; in"}],"27":[{"paragraph":12,"mentions":1,"tokens":["庾香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"心中七上八下：一来为华公子赏识了他，将来必叫他进府唱戏，那时府里多少人，怎生应酬得来；二来每逢热闹之场独独不见庾香，故此越想越觉伤心，倒不料得聘才即来，说要买他。","en":"him and was soon summoning him to the mansion—how would he navigate that crowd? Second, at every lively scene Yuxiang was absent, so his sorrow deepened. He had never expected Pincai would come wanting to buy him."},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":1,"tokens":["庾香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"有什么不好，我也没有见他糟蹋过人。你若心上没有牵挂的事，倒可以去混几年，或者倒有些好处，也不可知。就是不能会见庾香的苦了。」琴言道：「就算华公子是个好人，难道魏聘才就不教坏他么？」","en":"him ruin actors. If there are no worries in your heart, a few years there might bring profit; it is only missing Yuxiang that hurts you.\\" Qinyan replied, \\"Even if Hua is good, won't Wei Pincai corrupt him?\\""},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":7,"tokens":["庾香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"欺你，且要巴结你呢！但我有一句话，你倒不要怪我：譬如我们这班人与人相好，原是要论心的，但也不好太过。譬如度香、庾香两人，待你的情分是一样的。不过，庾香专在你身上，不肯移情于人，所以你就为这上头，也就专为他，不肯移动一步，是讲究专致的工夫了。但是庾香比不得别人，他年纪小，没有惯常出来，一切都不甚便当。假使他们太太晓得了，还要教训他，不准他出来；若访出你们相好，还要","en":"a word to say — do not take it amiss. Our sort befriend hearts, yet we must not fall into excess. Duxiang and Yuxiang favor you equally. Yuxiang is fixated upon you and will not shift, so you fixate on him and will not budge—that is devotion. Yet Yuxiang is unlike others; he is young, rarely ventures out, and everything is inconvenient. If his parents learn of this,"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":2,"tokens":["庾香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"素兰道：「杀身图报，难道我辈做不出来？但也要看什么事。你为庾香捐躯，是为什么？问你，你自己也就说不出；你死了也不算什么忠臣烈士，节妇义夫。明白人还说你可怜，是一个情痴，胡涂人便说你是个呆子。甚至于胡猜到另有他故。且庾香到你死后，他不能不看破了。他上有父母，要报答的；自己有功名，要奋励的；且未娶妻生子，后嗣是要接","en":"Sulan sighed, \\"Die for love? We can. But weigh the cause. To die for Yuxiang—why? You yourself cannot articulate it. Dead, you would be no loyal minister and no martyr, no chaste wife and no righteous husband; the clear-sighted will pity you as a fool of feeling, but fools will call you an idiot, and guess at darker tales. After"}],"28":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"；聘才又作了许多情，长庆喜出望外，叩谢聘才而去。回来与琴言讲了。琴言到此光景，自知不能不避。但今日之祸起萧墙，子玉全然不知，明日进了华府，未卜何日相见，意欲就去别他一别，犹恐见面彼此伤心，耳目又多，诸多未便；欲写信与他，方寸已乱，万语千言，无从下笔，只好谆托素兰转致。便又想了一会，即将自己常常拭泪的那方罗帕，拣了四味药另包了，将帕子包好，外面再将纸封了，交与素兰","en":"arrangement. At this juncture, Qinyan knew there was no escape. This disaster had arisen within his own walls, yet Ziyu remained completely unaware. Tomorrow, he would enter the Hua mansion, and who could say when they might ever see each other again? He longed to bid Ziyu a proper farewell, yet he feared a meeting would only shatter them both; moreover, there were too"},{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"。又领他到华夫人处叩见，华夫人见他弱质婷婷，毫无优伶习气，也说了个「好」字，华公子是更不必说。琴言心上总是惦记子玉，也只好暗中洒泪，背地长吁。过了几天，见华公子脾气是正正经经的，没有什么歪缠之处，便也略觉放心。惟见了魏聘才，只是息夫人不言的光景，聘才也无可奈何，就要用计收拾他，此时也断乎不能。","en":"\\"Good.\\" As for the Young Master's satisfaction, it goes without saying. Yet Qinyan's heart remained anchored to Ziyu; he could only weep in secret and sigh softly when no one was looking. After a few days, observing that the Young Master's temper was quite proper and devoid of any indecent pestering, his mind eased slightly. However, toward Wei Pincai, he maintained"},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"且说琴言临行之际，所留之物托素兰面交子玉。素兰打算过几日，请子玉过来，与他面谈衷曲。","en":"As for the items Qinyan had left behind at parting, which were entrusted to Sulan to give to Ziyu, Sulan planned to invite Ziyu over in a few days to speak with him heart to heart."},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"却说子玉自五月内与琴言一叙之后，直至今日，并非没有访过琴言，但其中有多少错误。这一日天气凉爽，早饭后到素兰处，先叫云儿问了在家，素兰闻知甚喜，忙出迎进。只见房内走出两人来：子玉看时，认得一个是王兰保；一个是琪官，因多时不见他，即看了他一看。见他杏脸搓酥，柳眉","en":"Now concerning Ziyu: ever since that single, fleeting conversation with Qinyan in the fifth month, it was not that he hadn't tried to visit him, but countless misunderstandings had intervened. One cool, pleasant day, after his morning meal, Ziyu made his way to Sulan's"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":5,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉道：「今日实不料香畹处尚有佳客。」兰保道：「这就是你的小姨子，你们会过亲没有？」子玉道：「这是什么话？那里有这个称呼？」素兰道：「这个称呼倒也通。」琪官也不好意思，便道：「静芳不要取笑。」兰保道：「这倒也不算取笑，你是玉侬的师弟，可不是他的小姨吗？」","en":"Ziyu said, \\"I truly did not expect Xiangwan to be hosting such distinguished guests today.\\" Lanbao teased, \\"This is your little sister-in-law. Have you two paid your familial respects yet?\\" Ziyu replied, \\"What kind of talk is this? Where does such a title"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":12,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉更觉纳闷，却思不到琴言身上来，说道：「我实在不晓得你们说的是什么，我是不出大门的，这两天又没人到我那里，如何晓得外面的事？」琪官笑了一笑，素兰道：「你真不知道，我只得告诉你，你且坐稳了。静芳、玉艳，你两个扶住了他，待我再说。」子玉道：「香畹一向直爽，","en":"Ziyu grew even more baffled, the thought never crossing his mind that this might concern Qinyan. He said, \\"I honestly have no idea what you are talking about. I haven't stepped past my front gates, and no one has visited me these past two days. How could"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":5,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉听了，知琴言尚在人间，心便放了一分，停了一停道：「玉侬此去，也就如出尘离世的一样。」便又滚下泪来，出了一回神，重把那几味药看了又看，只认得一样是芍药，其余皆不认识，因对素兰道：「玉侬寄这几味药，必有深意，但不知是什么药，你可叫人拿到药铺问明，叫他就写","en":"Hearing that Qinyan still remained in the realm of the living, Ziyu's heart eased a fraction. He paused, then said, \\"With Yunong gone there, it is as though he has vanished from the mortal dust.\\" Fresh tears cascaded down his cheeks. After a long moment of stunned silence, he examined the medicinal herbs once more. Recognizing"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":3,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"又对子玉，把从前魏聘才同船，一路在舟中下作的模样讲了好些。忽又想起奚十一来，复咬牙切齿的骂几句。素兰让子玉吃饭，子玉心绪不佳，便要早回，辞了一径回去，车上便觉四肢不舒起来。","en":"To Ziyu they also recounted the vulgar and despicable behavior Wei Pincai had exhibited on the boat when they previously shared passage. The mere mention of Xi Eleven caused them to grit their teeth and curse his name. Sulan urged Ziyu to eat, but his spirits"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":3,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"清、王恂三天两日常来看视，心中虽是明白，却也无法可治。二人商量，又不好对颜夫人讲，只好婉言解慰而已。颜夫人每听子玉睡梦之中，必呼玉侬二字，心上便疑心子玉在外有什么勾当，便当玉侬是个女人，心有说不出的隐情；因又想子玉不常出门，出门必有云儿随去。一日便唤云儿来细细追问，说：「你跟少爷出去，到底在些什么地方？那玉侬是谁？还是娼妓呢，还是什么样的人？」云儿起初不招，只说","en":"matter, they felt they could not reveal the truth to Lady Yan, offering only gentle, evasive comforts. Hearing Ziyu constantly cry out \\"Yunong\\" in his sleep, Lady Yan grew suspicious that he had become entangled in some illicit affair outside. Assuming \\"Yunong\\" was a woman's name, she suspected a scandalous secret. Knowing Ziyu rarely ventured out, and never without"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"闻，要问魏老聘才晓得他们的细底。」颜夫人便叫门上许顺，到华府请魏少爷过来有事相商。聘才却不晓得是这件事，近来与子玉颇觉疏远，竟有一个多月不来。今闻颜夫人相请，道是有些好事与他商量。隔了一日，便服御辉煌的出城，到了梅宅，见过了颜夫人。见颜夫人脸上似有忧闷的光景，聘才先问了江西的近况，可有家信回来；又问起子玉，并说场期将近，今年一定高中的这些套话。","en":"there was urgent business to discuss. Pincai had no inkling it concerned this matter. He had grown distant from Ziyu recently and hadn't visited for over a month. Hearing Lady Yan's summons, he assumed some favorable opportunity awaited him. The next day, dressed in splendid attire, he rode out and arrived at the Mei residence. Upon meeting Lady Yan, he noticed the"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"讲了一回，颜夫人道：「子玉得了一个异样的病症。」便把病的光景说与聘才听，又将云儿、元茂的话也说了，便说：「小儿与这琴言到底有什么缘故？」聘才听了便觉得有些踌躇不安，良心发动，脸上露出愧色。停了一会，说道：「去年小侄进京，是搭了一班戏子的船，内中有个小旦叫琴言。今年团拜这一天，","en":"After exchanging pleasantries, Lady Yan cut to the chase. \\"Ziyu has contracted a strange illness,\\" she said, describing the symptoms and repeating the testimonies of Yun and Yuanmao. She pressed him, \\"What exactly is the bond between my son and this Qinyan?\\" Pincai felt a sudden wave of unease; his conscience pricked,"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，此刻我也不说什么了。既然如此，请你今日就去。如来得及，今日就赐一回信更好。」聘才答应了，即便告辞出来，看了看子玉。子玉见了聘才，虽在病中，却未忘前事，便合眼装睡，没有理他。","en":"willing, please go today. If possible, a reply today would be best.\\" Pincai agreed. Before leaving, he looked in on Ziyu. Even in his severe illness, Ziyu had not forgotten past grievances; upon seeing Pincai, he shut his eyes, feigning sleep, and completely ignored him."},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":1,"tokens":["庾香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"他。今日聘才的一番话，正好立主意，因此就应许他，便到了留青精舍与琴言说知。琴言一听就是眼泪汪汪的，说道：「怎么庾香就病到如此，林哥你真能叫我出去，他家果真要我去看他吗？」","en":"Quiet-Green Retreat and informed Qinyan of the plan. Upon hearing the news, Qinyan's eyes filled with tears. \\"How could Yuxiang fall so gravely ill? Brother Lin, can you truly send me out? Does his family really want me to visit him?\\""},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":1,"tokens":["庾香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"他的病治好了，再去第二回，可就难了。」琴言红了脸不言语，心中却也甚感激珊枝，我进来了倒全仗他照应，且能叫我去看庾香，以后倒不要忘了此人。珊枝走后，琴言想来想去，就把聘才的仇恨也就淡了，说这件事也亏他。","en":"toward Shanzhi. He felt he relied entirely on Shanzhi's care in this mansion, and to be granted the chance to see Yuxiang was a debt he must never forget. In the glow of this favor, even his deep-seated hatred for Pincai faded, acknowledging that this opportunity was also owed to him."},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":3,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴言一进门时，原为子玉病重，出于情所难忍，故不顾吉凶祸福，也拼着颜夫人骂了几句。而且聘才在车上，一路上说了些利害话，心虚胆怯，只得战战兢兢上前，见夫人磕了一个头起来，低头傍立。颜夫人叫近前来，又打量了一回，即请聘才坐下。颜夫人道：「你是那里人？去年几时到京？怎么认识我们少","en":"As Qinyan stepped over the threshold, his mind was solely on Ziyu's grave illness. Driven by a love he could scarcely endure, he had ignored the risks of fortune and disaster, steeling himself for Lady Yan's harsh scolding. Pincai's threatening words in the carriage had left him timid and trembling. He approached,"}],"29":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":10,"tokens":["子玉","庾香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"言到梅宅之时，心中十分害怕，满拟此番必有一场凌辱。及至见过颜夫人之后，不但不加呵叱，倒有怜恤之意，又命他去安慰子玉，却也意想不到。心中一喜一悲，但不知子玉是怎样光景，将何以慰之，只得遵了颜夫人的命，老着脸，走到子玉卧房来。见帘帏不卷，几案生尘，药鼎烟浓，香炉灰烬，一张小小的楠木床，垂下白轻绡帐。云儿先把帐子掀开，叫声：「少爷！琴言来看你了。」子玉正在半睡，叫了两","en":"he was greeted not with scolding, but with a deep, compassionate pity. She gently ordered him to go and comfort Ziyu—a kindness he had never dared to anticipate. A surging tide of joy and sorrow overwhelmed him. Unsure of Ziyu's true condition or how he might possibly offer solace, Qinyan simply obeyed her command. Bracing himself, he stepped into Ziyu's bedchamber."},{"paragraph":2,"mentions":6,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"阵伤心，两泪交流，只管怔怔的瞅着聘才，聘才心上也觉凄楚，便说道：「玉侬你只管叫醒他。」琴言便叫了两声「少爷！」子玉嗤的一声笑道：「你好痴也！」又道：「云儿，你只管叫我作什么！这么近的路怕什么！你还当是大东门外么？」琴言要高声叫，又哽咽了，喉咙叫不出来，只把手拍他。那子玉忽然睁开眼来，对着琴言道：「香畹，这回又亏了你，费了如此的心，我以后便放了心了。」琴言又往前凑","en":"After a brief pause, Ziyu murmured, \\"Below duhuo and fangji there ought to be added one herb more — danggui, 'one who ought to return.'\\" Outside the door, Lady Yan heard his words and knew he was completely consumed by delirium. Though she could not parse the meaning of everything"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":4,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉坐起后，精神稍觉清爽，猛然眼中一清，见琴言坐在旁边，便问道：「你是谁？坐在这里？」琴言带着哭道：「怎么连我也不认得了？」琴言见窗户未开，且系背光而坐，自然看不明白，便挪转身子向外坐了，侧了一半脸，望着子玉道：「我是玉侬，太太特叫我来看你的，不料十数天","en":"After sitting up, Ziyu felt a measure of clarity return to his mind. His vision suddenly sharpened, and noticing Qinyan sitting beside him, he asked, \\"Who are you, sitting here?\\" Qinyan wept openly, replying, \\"How can you not know me?\\" Seeing that the windows were closed and"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":6,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"颜夫人听了，对着聘才道：「此话说的奇怪。」又听琴言道：「我是为着你的病来的。」子玉笑道：「你真是玉侬，如何得来？就算你愿意来，人家如何肯放你来？」琴言道：「我真是玉侬，我已来了多时，是奉太太之命，叫我来看你；又亏魏师爷带我上来。我劝你自己宽心，不必忧郁，身子要紧。快养好了病，我既来动了，就可以常来的。」说着又滴下泪来。颜夫人见子玉","en":"\\"Those words sound exceedingly strange.\\" She then heard Qinyan say softly, \\"I came because of your sickness.\\" Ziyu laughed dismissively. \\"If you truly were Yunong, how could you come here? Even if you were willing, would they ever release you?\\" Qinyan replied earnestly, \\"I truly am Yunong. I have been here for a long time. By Madame's own order, Secretary Wei brought"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"聘才见了忍不住的笑，那些丫鬟、仆妇也无人不笑。颜夫人点头叹息，见子玉两手扶着琴言的肩，要坐起来，先笑了一回。","en":"and matrons in the room all joined in the mirth. Lady Yan nodded, a deep sigh escaping her lips. She watched as Ziyu, with both hands firmly grasping Qinyan's shoulders, tried to pull himself up, laughing the entire time."},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":7,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"言道：「你倒是什么病？我劝你不要病了，从今日就好了罢，省得多少人为你苦，更招太太心里不安。」说着遂又滴了些泪。子玉笑道：「我有什么病，我这个病要他来就来，要他去就去，原不要紧的。」琴言道：「休说不要紧，你这病不比从前，也添了满面的病容，千万句并作一句：放宽了心。你从前说自己会宽解，看得破，怎么今日又不会宽解，看不破了呢？」子玉笑道：「我又何尝不会宽解，又何尝看不","en":"heal. Spare those who suffer for your sake, and end Madame's relentless worry.\\" Fresh tears welled in his eyes. Ziyu laughed effortlessly, \\"What illness? My illness comes when it pleases and goes when it pleases. It has never truly mattered.\\" Qinyan rebuked him gently, \\"Do not say it has never mattered. This is not like the times before; your face is utterly consumed"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"此时颜夫人见子玉只是欢笑不已，也便解去了多少愁闷。","en":"Seeing Ziyu laughing so freely and happily, much of the heavy gloom that had settled over Lady Yan's heart finally lifted."},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"想既能如此欢笑，心中自已开豁，其病就可好了。又见琴言总是凄凄楚楚，真想不出这个道理来。子玉便又笑道：「你进去了，作些什么事来？」琴言道：「一件事都没有，叫我在留青精舍伺候。府里的房屋排场，比怡园又是一样光景，错不得规矩。","en":"Ziyu reasoned to himself that if he could laugh with such unburdened joy, his mind must be opening, and his illness would soon mend. Yet, noticing that Qinyan seemed perpetually wretched and sorrowful, he could not fathom the true cause of his despair. Ziyu"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":10,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"却用不着唱戏，也不作什么，不过作一个伺候书房的书童就是了。」子玉道：「你出来他们知道不知道？」琴言道：「他在上屋时候多。他还有好几处书房，歇了几天，才到一处，也不过略坐一坐就走了。这屋子里的人不奉呼唤是不进那屋子里去的。」琴言向来总说实话的，今日要治子玉的病，就有几句谎话在里头。说得在华府里这等快活，将来还可以时","en":"\\"There is no need for me to sing; we do essentially nothing. I merely serve as a quiet page boy in the study.\\" Ziyu asked, \\"Did they know you were leaving today?\\" Qinyan answered carefully, \\"The Young Master spends most of his time in the upper halls. He has several studies, and after resting for days, he might visit one place, sit briefly, and then vanish again."},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":7,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"火，也不敢不尽力。」说完，露出满面得意。颜夫人又谢了几声，即命云儿将那莲子粉熬成了小米粥，盛了两碗，命琴言陪着子玉吃了。子玉见了琴言，心中一喜；又听了他这番言语，郁抑全舒。又喝了一碗粥，便觉得神清气爽，即对琴言道：「我的病已好了，你全可放心。你今日出来，倒要早些回去，不要叫人说出话来，以后倒难告假了。你的话我句句记着，句句依着你。你自己也要留神，诸事随和些，图个","en":"thanked him gracefully and ordered Yun'er to prepare two bowls of delicate lotus porridge. Inside, Qinyan kept Ziyu company. Seeing Qinyan and hearing his comforting words, all of Ziyu's gloom vanished entirely. He ate his bowl of porridge with a clear, revitalized spirit and said to Qinyan, \\"I am healed now. You should rest and leave early today so as not to stir"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":4,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"却说子玉这一场大病，琴官这一出华府，魏聘才自为得意，又以为奇，在城外各处传扬。人家听了，竟当了一件新闻。有那些各班里相公，有嫌琴言的，有爱造言生事的，七张八嘴，改头换面，添起枝叶，把个子玉、琴言说得无所不至。不料王通政在人家席上遇着蓉官、二喜等类，就把子玉、","en":"As for Ziyu's grave illness—and Qinyan's dramatic excursion from the heavily guarded Hua mansion—Wei Pincai swelled with immense pride. He thought the entire affair striking and romantic, and he hawked the story loudly outside the mansion walls until the common"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「少年人这些事原也禁不住的，也只好逢场作戏。况且子玉才十八岁，正是好花含蕊的时候，怎么就作起这些事来。偏偏去年又将个爱女许了他。人生起头第一件，就是这不爱听的事，有了外遇，将来琴瑟之间就不能专好的了。」回家就叫他儿子王恂问了一回，王恂只好含含糊糊的说了几句，又与子玉剖辨，说断不至此，文辉终有些疑心。陆","en":"resist all restraint,\\" Wang Wenhui reasoned with himself, \\"and one can only play along when at a feast. Besides, Ziyu is only eighteen—the very bud of youth just forming. Why would he let himself sink into such scandalous depths? Just last year, we joyfully betrothed our beloved daughter to him. The first and most fatal poison in any marriage is a wandering fancy; if"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"文辉听这些话，明明的逼到自己身上来，只得呵呵一笑，踱了出来，往书房里去了。陆夫人气极了，又在他女儿琼姑面前，把子玉讲了又讲。琼姑低头不语，心中也有些不耐烦。本知道是个风流夫婿，却不道是这样轻薄，应着一句常说的话「才人行短」了。便又想起哥哥、姊夫，常说子玉的好处，说人是极正经的，又极有情的。或者他爱的这人，是单为其色，没有别的事，也未可知。便觉红晕桃腮，手拈衣带，","en":"\\"talented men often trip short.\\" Yet, she also remembered her brother and her sister's husband constantly praising Ziyu's unwavering goodness and noble character. Perhaps, she hoped, it was only a fleeting, innocent lust for beauty. At that thought, a deep blush painted her cheeks as she sat pondering her fate. Seeing her daughter so conflicted, Lady Lu felt a sudden"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"再说子玉自从琴言来看之后，便已放心。又晓得他母亲不责备，而且反托聘才带琴言来，心中十分快意，自然更好得快了，不到十日便已精神复旧，惟见了母亲总有些惶恐不安的光景。颜夫人爱子之心十分体贴，又知儿子并无苟且之行，绝不提起琴言的事。那王文辉亲自来过几次，陆夫人也来","en":"To return to the Mei household—after Qinyan's visit, Ziyu's spirit was profoundly eased. He now knew for certain that his mother did not blame him, and realizing that she had personally commissioned Pincai to bring Qinyan to him made his heart rejoice endlessly. Free from his despair, he mended entirely in"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"过了几日，子玉究竟放心不下，便回了母亲，借看聘才为名，去看琴言，恰好见着聘才。聘才又求珊枝，把琴言叫出来，说了有一个多时辰的话，子玉方才放心而去。华府中人多嘴杂，且各存一心，过了几日，就有人将此事传到华公子耳中。华公子听了着实有气，便叫珊枝上来问了一遍，珊枝替辩了","en":"Days later, however, Ziyu found he still could not rest easily. He begged his mother for permission to go out, using the pretext of visiting Pincai, solely to see Qinyan once more. He met with Pincai and relentlessly begged Shanzhi, until they finally called Qinyan out to see"}],"30":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说琴言从子玉处回来，华公子虽未知其细底，但责其私行出府，殊属不知规矩，姑念初犯，权且免责，把他拨在内室，这是里外不通的所在。一日，独坐在水晶山畔，对着几丛凤仙花垂泪，心中想到人生在世，不能立身扬名，作些事业，仅与那些皮相平人混在一堆，光阴易过，则与草木同朽。即如","en":"Of Qinyan's return from Ziyu's, the Young Master Hua knew no particulars, yet blamed him for leaving the mansion without permission, a serious breach of discipline. Thinking it a first offense, he waived punishment for the moment and reassigned him to the inner chambers—a secluded"},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":1,"tokens":["庾香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"来被人厌恶的时候，就如花之落圂飘茵，沾泥带水，无所归结，想至此岂不痛杀人，恨杀人。一面想，一面滴下泪来。再想到庾香虽然病好，但我从前说了些谎话，若知我近日的光景，他不能来，我不能去，只怕旧病又要发了，那时再来叫我，恐怕也不能再去。思前想后，终日凄凄楚楚的。一日一日的挨去，光阴最快，转眼已一月有余，只见丹桂芬芳，香盈庭院。","en":"could the thought not fill me with anguish and bitter resentment? As he pondered, tears fell. Then he thought of Yuxiang. Although Yuxiang had recovered, Qinyan had told him some untruths before. If Yuxiang learned of his present circumstances—that neither could visit the other—his old illness might return. And if he sent for Qinyan again, Qinyan feared he would be unable"},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":3,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一班知名之士回避了一大半。内中除徐子云、史南湘是前科举人，萧次贤是高尚自居，无心问世，只有田春航、高品入场。如子玉、王恂、文泽、仲清等皆遵例回避。子玉在家闷闷不乐，又因琴言杳无音信，内外隔绝，又不能传递消息，几次要去访问聘才，又因华府威严，豪奴气焰。故而子玉不肯前去，只得静坐书斋，闷坐而已。","en":"worldly affairs and had no intention of participating, only Tian Chunhang and Gao Pin entered the examination hall. Ziyu, Wang Xun, Wenze, and Zhongqing all withdrew according to the rules. Ziyu stayed at home, brooding unhappily. Moreover, because there was no news from Qinyan and they were completely cut off from each other, unable to exchange messages, he wanted to"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"傲神气。且隔了两月，从前是朝亲夕见的，如今倒像是相逢陌路，对面无言，未免有些感慨。即叫他走近，问了些话，要问起子玉来，却又缩住。次贤、文泽也问了几句。","en":"not help feeling a pang at the change. He called him closer, asked a few questions, and was about to ask about Ziyu, but held back. Cixian and Wenze also asked a few questions."}],"31":[{"paragraph":16,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"十五日一日过了。到了十六日，王恂、颜仲清约了史南湘来望子玉。子玉自七月中病好，调养了二十八日，已经强健。","en":"came and went. On the morning of the sixteenth, Wang Xun and Yan Zhongqing brought Shi Nanxiang along to visit Ziyu. Since recovering from his illness in the middle of the seventh month, Ziyu had spent twenty-eight days resting and recuperating, and he had now grown strong and healthy once more."},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":3,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，其实情怀未断，犹时一念及，涕泪潸潸，不能自解。十五日到王文辉家一走，王恂、仲清约定明日午刻去望田春航、高品。子玉已吃过了早饭，在书房等候。不多一会，史、颜诸人已到，南湘坐了，与子玉叙谈。仲清、王恂先进内室，见了颜夫人，略坐一坐即出来。喝了一杯茶，即催子玉同走。","en":"Knowing that Qinyan had fallen into the Hua mansion and could not escape, Ziyu harbored a deep desire to see through the vanity of the mortal world. He completely completely withdrew from the world of song and dance, shutting himself away in a solitary room, finding his only companionship among tea bowls and incense burners. Though"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"外间已套上车，子玉也不换衣服，云儿恐怕寒冷，包上了几件棉衣。上了车，来到春航、高品寓处一问，都已回寓，遂同下车进内，一直走到里面。只听高品一片笑声，夹着些燕语莺声在内。到春航斋中，见苏蕙芳、李玉林在内。高品、春航见了四人进来，不胜欢喜，让坐了，苏、李二相公也都见了。","en":"Outside, the carriage was already hitched. Ziyu did not even change his clothes, but Yun'er, fearing he might catch a chill, wrapped him in several layers of cotton garments. They boarded the carriage and headed straight for the residence of Chunhang and Gao Pin. Upon inquiring, they learned that"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":4,"tokens":["子玉","庾香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"不好，不好，不必看他。」王恂道：「什么话！就不好也要看看。」南湘道：「这三道题，卓然一定见长，就不看也不妨。」子玉道：「到底看看怎样。据我愚见却有几样作法，注疏上有可依，有不可依的。」高品道：「我那日忽然神思昏昏，不成一字，到晚随手乱写，完了卷就算账。首艺虽有草稿，也不知团在什么地方去了。」即到自己房里寻了出来。众人看了一遍，连诗稿也在上面。南湘看了一半，即不看","en":"added, \\"With these three topics, Zhuoran is bound to shine. Even without seeing them, I know they will be fine.\\" Ziyu chimed in, \\"Still, we should take a look. In my humble opinion, there are several different approaches one could take; some annotations are fitting to rely on, while others are not.\\" Gao Pin confessed, \\"On that day, my mind was suddenly overcome by a"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"人赞了一回，尤赞玉林的词更为工妙。高品道：「强将之下自无弱兵。你们看佩仙这首词，外边那些头巾纱帽作得出来么？」子玉道：「果然。就是华公子这几个字也改得好。」又问了琴言几句，玉林、蕙芳也细细说了，子玉又发起怔来。忽然高品的小使进来请他，说有客要会。高品即忙出去，有好一刻工夫尚不进来。南湘道：「什么人这么长谈？」春航道：「近来卓然有些古怪，找他的不一而足，却非寻常往","en":"Looking at Peixian's opening lyric, could those hack scholars in their square caps outside ever produce such work?\\" Ziyu agreed, \\"Indeed. Even Young Master Hua's edits were brilliantly done.\\" He then asked a few questions about Qinyan, and Yulin and Huifang recounted the details of his quiet departure. Upon hearing this, Ziyu fell into a frozen daze. Suddenly, Gao Pin's"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"站起道：「此等高义，今人所难。我等自当盥沐敬书，表其万一。且香雪有如此高弟令子，即落魄而死，亦无遗恨。」春航与子玉更觉赞叹不置。南湘道：「这篇传你自己作的么？」蕙芳道：「都是实话，就是少些文气。」仲清道：「也好，请湘帆润色润色就好了。」即说道：「我与他作篇诔。」王恂道：「我作几首挽诗罢。」南湘道：「我作墓志。」春航道：「把他的作了略节，我另作一篇传如何？」蕙芳道","en":"bright a son, even though Fragrant-Snow died in obscurity, he surely harbors no lingering regrets.\\" Chunhang and Ziyu were particularly vocal in their unceasing praise. Nanxiang asked, \\"Did you write this biography yourself?\\" Huifang replied, \\"It contains only the raw facts; it lacks literary polish.\\" Zhongqing suggested, \\"It is quite good, though having Xiangfan refine"},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":2,"tokens":["庾香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"到了二十八日，仲清又到南湘处商议明日之事，并说：「大约有几个不愿去的，庸庵畏首畏尾，防他严亲知道，庾香更不消说了，那古庙里三更半夜的，也不好叫他去。」南湘道：「我倒想着个主意。既是此举，也不专为祭他，我们借此可以散步野游，不如日间携樽而往，一献之后，即到锦秋墩、浩然亭上，与那些相公一叙，不很好吗？」仲清道：「果然好，我未想到。如庸庵、庾香不来，我们四","en":"to go. Yong'an is always timid and fearful, constantly worrying that his strict father might find out. As for Yuxiang, it goes without saying; we certainly cannot ask him to go out to a ruined ancient temple in the middle of the night.\\" Nanxiang offered a solution: \\"I've actually thought of an idea. Since we are undertaking this endeavor, we need not do it solely for"}],"33":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"给事放了大名道，南湘随任同行，且到明年会试再来。诸名士、名旦送行，又叙了几日。光阴甚快，不觉又到腊月中旬。且说子玉因南湘、高品出京，又少了两个知己。前月王阁学来对颜夫人说，不是冬底，就是春初，要与子玉毕姻。","en":"reminisce. Time flew by, and soon it was the middle of the twelfth month. With Nanxiang and Gao Pin out of the capital, Ziyu found himself missing two close confidants. Last month, Academician Wang of the Grand Secretariat visited Madam Yan, proposing that Ziyu should be married either by the end of winter or early spring."},{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"颜夫人回说不好专主，须寄信到江西，俟其回信转来，再为定夺，子玉因此连王宅也不大去了。徐子云近日补了缺，衙门中添了些公事，不能天天在园。","en":"decision alone; she must send a letter to Jiangxi and wait for a reply before settling the matter. Because of this, Ziyu seldom visited the Wang residence. Recently, Xu Ziyun had filled a vacancy, which added public duties to his work in the yamen, preventing him from spending every day in the garden."},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"是日天气晴和，雪消风静，子玉欲访聘才，打探琴言消息。","en":"That day, the weather was mild and clear; the snow had melted, and the wind was calm. Ziyu wanted to visit Pincai to ask for news about Qinyan."},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":6,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"云儿勒转马头，赶车的倒转车来，出了城，忽然有几辆车塞满了路，还有一群骆驼挤在里头。众赶车的喧喧嚷嚷，开让不来。子玉的车下了帘子，与一个车相并，子玉从玻璃窗内一望，却好那人也转过脸来望他，原来是宝珠。子玉见了，不觉一笑，宝珠问道：「你从那里来？还到那里去？」子玉道：「我从城里回来，不到那里去了。」宝珠道：「何不到我寓里谈谈，我们也有两月不见了。」子玉一想回去尚早，","en":"blocked the road, with a herd of camels squeezed among them. The drivers shouted loudly, unable to clear the way. Ziyu lowered the curtain of his carriage as it pulled alongside another. Looking through the glass window, he saw the person inside turning to look at him as well—it was Baozhu. Seeing him, Ziyu couldn't help but smile. Baozhu asked, \\"Where are you coming"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":7,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉尚是初次进来，到了内院，见正面上房三间，西间便是书斋，上悬一额是「小琅嬛室」。子玉进内，觉得芳香扑鼻，不染点尘，有两盆水仙花已开足。桌上摆一个古铜瓶，插一枝天竹，两枝腊梅，那边还有两盆唐花。壁上所挂字画，皆是前人名迹，绝非世俗纱帽之作。又见一个小地罩","en":"It was Ziyu's first time visiting. Upon reaching the inner courtyard, he saw three main rooms facing forward, with the west room serving as a study. A plaque hung above, reading 'Little Langhuan Studio.' Entering, Ziyu felt a fragrant breeze that was untainted by"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":6,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉踌躇道：「若吃饭回去就迟了。前日这么大雪，你想必积了些雪水，我们何不煮雪烹茶，请了香畹来作个清谈雅会，不好吗？」宝珠笑道：「很好，到底你总与别人不同。」一面着人去邀素兰，一面吩咐把火盆抬到外间去，将茶炉搬过来，并搬出全副茶具。子玉见地上先放了一个大铜","en":"Ziyu hesitated, saying, \\"If I dine here, I'll be late returning. There was a heavy snowfall the other day; you must have collected some snow water. Why don't we boil snow to brew tea, and invite Xiangwan for a refined conversation—wouldn't that be nice?\\""},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":11,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"看玉侬出来伺候，就是勉强，叫作没有法就是了。」素兰道：「如今见了我们也是生生的，觉得心上总是忧郁不开的光景。」子玉听了，不禁叹了一声。宝珠见水开了，自己于博古厨内取出一个玉茶缸，配了四种名茶，自己亲手泡好了，把盖子盖上。又取出三个粉定茶杯，分作三杯，又将开水添满茶缸，仍旧盖了。子玉道：「要你亲手自制，倒累了。」宝珠道：「你们尝尝，这茶味可好么？」子玉与素兰喝了两","en":"us, there is a strangeness about him; it feels like his heart is always clouded with a lingering melancholy.\\" Ziyu listened and could not help but sigh. When Baozhu saw the water boiling, he took a jade tea caddy from the curio cabinet, blended four famous teas, and brewed it himself, placing the lid on. He then brought out three Ding-kiln porcelain cups, divided"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"讯明是实，相应开释等情。」子玉道：「这已算明白了，怎么又送部呢？」素兰道：「闻说有位巡城都老爷，访得吏目诈赃，改供私放，把这案提上去，送了刑部。」宝珠道：「如今魏聘才是在监里了？应该，应该。但华公子怎么不替他料理呢？」","en":"Having established the facts, they were promptly released.\\" Ziyu said, \\"Since it's settled, why send it to the Ministry?\\" Sulan replied, \\"I heard a patrolling censor discovered the official was extorting bribes, altering testimony, and releasing people privately, so he escalated the case and sent it to the Ministry"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"且又是个假名假姓。大约脸总丢了，也不至有什么大罪。又听说魏聘才新捐了一个从九品，审实了，这功名只怕也革的了。」子玉听了，甚替聘才着急，连说道：「这怎么好！就是我们那位李世兄，也在外边胡闹。夏间去嫖，连衣服都被人剥了。亲友们都知道，闹得很不好看。不料魏聘才又闹出这件事来。」素兰道：「也叫他吃些亏才好，如今报应得甚快。谁叫他会使赶车的糟蹋人，如今是加倍奉还了。」子玉","en":"Pincai recently purchased a minor official rank; if convicted, that title might be stripped as well.\\" Hearing this, Ziyu felt anxious for Pincai and repeatedly said, \\"This is terrible! Even our friend Li has been messing around outside. Over the summer, he went to a brothel and was even stripped of his clothes. All his relatives and friends know, and it caused quite a"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"当下三人讲了好一回，子玉见天色不早，辞了二人回家。","en":"The three of them chatted for quite a while. Seeing it was getting late, Ziyu bid the two farewell and headed home."},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":4,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"到上房见了颜夫人，颜夫人似有不悦之色，子玉也不敢问，呆呆的站在一边。颜夫人道：「你父亲有家书回来了，你作的事，他都知道，并且说我不能教训，你自去看罢。」便将家书递与子玉，子玉接了，来看时已唬得目定口呆。走到窗前，恭恭敬敬捧了，看了一遍，两颊通红，一言不发，只看着颜夫人。颜夫人见了这样光景，心","en":"Upon reaching the main room, he saw Madam Yan, who appeared displeased. Ziyu dared not ask and stood dumbly to the side. Madam Yan said, \\"A letter from your father has arrived. He knows everything you've done and says I haven't disciplined you properly. See for yourself.\\" She handed the letter to Ziyu. Before he even read it,"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":7,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉听了，似有踌躇，欲说不说的光景。颜夫人又问了一声，子玉说道：「没有见着，而且得个信，说魏聘才不晓得闹了什么事，被人告了，前日已收在刑部监里。」颜夫人听了，吃惊不小，急问道：「这话是谁说的？为着什么事，你从何处打听来？」子玉随口说道：「是一个认识的人，","en":"Hearing this, Ziyu hesitated, appearing as if he wanted to speak but couldn't. When Madam Yan asked again, Ziyu said, \\"I didn't see him, but I received word that Wei Pincai has gotten into some trouble and was reported; the day before yesterday, he was detained in the"}],"34":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":3,"tokens":["庾香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"寻着你，店铺里那一家不访到，原来搬在这里。」聘才道：「我也搬出来不多几日，因为有些事情，所以还没有来看你，并看庾香。」即问：「庾香近来可好？」元茂道：「好是好的，前月王家写信与太老师，明年二三月间要替庾香完姻了。就是我那头亲事，孙家常来催，本来年纪都不小了。我写禀帖与老人家，尚无回信。","en":"the old place for a few days. Being tangled up with various affairs, I haven't had the chance to call on you and Yuxiang.\\" He then asked, \\"How has Yuxiang been lately?\\" Yuanmao answered, \\"He's well enough. Last month, the Wang family wrote to the old master, planning to have Yuxiang's marriage finalized sometime in the second or third month of next year. As for my own"}],"35":[{"paragraph":6,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"再说王恂、颜仲清、文泽、春航，从十三日至十五日都在怡园赏灯饮酒。子玉也去了一天，因想去年此日初见琴言，今年似成隔世，不觉伤感了一回。新年上，诸名旦彼此纷纷请客，热闹了十余日。到了十七日，王恂、颜仲清飞了札来与子玉。","en":"thirteenth to the fifteenth, they had all been at the Garden of Contentment, admiring lanterns and drinking wine. Ziyu had also joined them for one day. Remembering how he had first met Qinyan on this very day last year, and feeling as if a whole lifetime had passed since then, he couldn't help but feel a pang of sorrow. During the New Year, the famous performers had"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉看时，才知道明日是宝珠的生日，请名士、名旦在他寓里一叙，子云便要在他园里辰刻毕集。子玉作了回札应允。","en":"Upon reading it, Ziyu learned that the following day was Baozhu's birthday. Famous scholars and performers were invited to gather at Baozhu's residence, and Ziyun wanted everyone to assemble at his garden by the chen hour. Ziyu wrote a reply accepting the invitation."},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":1,"tokens":["梅子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"不能分身。宝珠之外，来的是蕙芳、素兰、玉林、漱芳四人。这边名士，怡园二位之外，是刘文泽、颜仲清、王恂、田春航、梅子玉五人。共十二人。众客到齐，宝珠先叩谢了。","en":"the two hosts of the Garden of Contentment, there were Liu Wenze, Yan Zhongqing, Wang Xun, Tian Chunhang, and Mei Ziyu—five in total. Together, they made twelve. Once all the guests had assembled, Baozhu first bowed in gratitude to everyone."},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":6,"tokens":["子玉","庾香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"众人都到园中散步了一回，子玉看见梅崦廊上新嵌了一个石刻，镌有二行半字，下面年月尚未刻完。即来看时，是一首五言绝句，道：「春已随年转，花如人返魂。\\n料他惜花客，坐月到黄昏。」子玉看了，心中想道：「此诗是谁做的？却才刻起，像个望花而不见的意思。」故羡慕起来。子云和众人也来看这诗，子","en":"They all took a stroll through the garden. Ziyu noticed a newly inlaid stone inscription in the corridor of Plum Knoll, engraved with two and a half lines of characters, though the date below was not yet finished. Upon closer inspection, it was a five-character quatrain: \\"Spring turns with the passing"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"怎么我叫他就不灵？」重新拿了过来放在面前，又说了一遍，那杯子又往下首走去，到了宝珠面前住了。文泽道：「作怪。」子玉道：「此中必有原故，你摸不着。」众人皆猜不出机巧。只见次贤又把杯子取了过来，又说：「敬刘老爷一杯。」那杯子又往文泽面前来了。文泽奇得了不得，说道：「你能个个走到我才佩服，不然也是碰着的。」次贤道：「合席都要走到的。」于是敬仲清、王恂、春航、子玉以及五","en":"himself and repeated the command, but the cup rolled down to Baozhu and stopped. \\"How bizarre,\\" Wenze muttered. Ziyu said, \\"There must be a hidden trick to this that you haven't grasped.\\" None of the others could guess the secret. They watched as Cixian retrieved the cup and said again, \\"A cup for Lord Liu.\\" The cup returned right in front of Wenze. Astounded, Wenze"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":6,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"于是也把座子下看了一遍，斟了酒，说道：「敬媚香一杯！」那杯错走到子玉面前，引得众人大笑。子云笑道：「真有些古怪，我也叫不应他。」子玉把酒饮了，细看轮盘里，已懂了八分，便笑道：「我也来试试，不知灵不灵。」斟了酒，说道：「这杯酒敬瑶卿！」那杯子便对着宝珠走来，走到面前，碰着箸子住了。蕙芳拍手笑道：「又一个人知道了。」子玉","en":"underside of the base, poured some wine, and said, \\"A cup for Meixiang!\\" But the cup mistakenly rolled over to Ziyu, causing everyone to burst into laughter. Ziyun laughed and admitted, \\"This really is a bit peculiar; I can't command it either.\\" Ziyu drank the wine, closely examined the dial mechanism, and, having understood most of it, smiled and said, \\"Let me try"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":6,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"得甚近，恐怕走过了。」便站起把杯子放远了些，说道：「敬徐老爷一杯！」那杯子果然直走到子云面前。子云称异，喝了。子玉笑道：「是了，不错的了。」蕙芳对子玉道：「你恐怕走的远，故放远些。我看静宜于近处则斟得浅，于远处便斟得满。此杯想是要重了才得远呢。」子玉点头道：「果然。」次贤道：「可恶之极，轻重远近都被他知道了。」王恂问子玉道：「到底你从何处看出？」子玉道：「你们何","en":"out, \\"A cup for Lord Xu!\\" The cup rolled straight to Ziyun. Ziyun marveled and drank the wine. Huifang said to Ziyu, \\"You must have thought it would roll far, so you placed it further back. I noticed that Jingyi poured less for short distances and filled it for long distances. I suppose this cup needs to be heavier to travel far.\\" Ziyu nodded, \\"Exactly.\\" Cixian complained,"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"喝了，即斟了酒，念道：「刺绣五纹添弱线。」数到宝珠。宝珠喝了酒，说道：「六字本来少，偏轮到我，只怕要罚酒了。」子玉道：「六字亦有。」","en":"with the word 'six' are already rare, and of course it lands on me. I'm afraid I'll have to drink a penalty.\\" Ziyu encouraged, \\"There are indeed lines with 'six.'\\""},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":5,"tokens":["子玉","庾香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"漱芳也只得喝了一杯。宝珠喝了，想了一会，飞出一句道：「南陌青楼十二重。」飞到子玉。子玉喝了酒，道：「已经十二了，还要飞吗？」次贤道：「座中媚香还没有轮到。轮到了他，我们再换令罢。如今只可飞十三了。」子玉飞出一句是：「娉娉袅袅十三余。」飞到了仲清，仲清喝了酒，想了一想道：「这一飞，轮到数目皆要喝酒，等媚香飞一句收令罢。要十几的数目","en":"for a moment, and recited a line: \\"On the southern path, the green towers stand twelve tiers high.\\" It landed on Ziyu. Ziyu drank the wine and asked, \\"We're already at twelve, do we still need to continue?\\" Cixian replied, \\"It hasn't landed on Meixiang yet. Once it reaches him, we can change the game. For now, we must proceed to thirteen.\\" Ziyu recited a line: \\"Graceful"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉道：「《毛诗》中凑花名，却也有几个。不过要并头、并蒂的难些。」王恂道：「也好，横竖大家费点心，也可以消消食，不然这些东西在肚子里何以消化。就恐他们要凑《毛诗》，未免苦人所难了。」子云道：「不然，单是我们七人行这个苦令，他们五人另行一个甜令，何如？我们","en":"Ziyu noted, \\"There are indeed some flower names that can be found in the *Mao Shi*, although finding matches for the paired-head and paired-stem varieties will be quite challenging.\\" Wang Xun said, \\"Racking our brains might at least help us digest our food."},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"文泽欣然，自己饮了两杯。仲清便掣筹，文泽道：「你的贺酒还没有喝呢！」仲清道：「你想这两句连不连？还要人贺酒。」子玉道：「鸡冠却是并头，就是句子欠贯串些。」文泽道：「你们除此句之外，再找一个冠字在上的，我就服你们。」忽又说道：「我想起先的一个来了。吁嗟乎驺虞，西方美人。」仲清道：「更要罚了。这个虽好，却不是并头花。」文泽一想，道：「呸！果然错了。」次贤道：「我替你","en":"reminded him of his toast. Zhongqing retorted, \\"Your lines weren't smoothly linked and hardly deserve celebration.\\" Ziyu mediated, \\"'Cockscomb' technically fits, though the coherence is weak.\\" Wenze challenged the group to produce a better line for 'guan,' then suggested another himself. But Zhongqing argued it still failed the paired-head criteria. Wenze admitted his"},{"paragraph":30,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"那里凝思，这边要他贺酒，他只得喝了两杯，倒凑着两句，念道：「全没有半星儿惜玉怜香，只合守蓬窗茆屋梅花账。」旁边子玉拍手称妙道：「好个温柔旖旎！倒转来，偏这样凑拍，倒比原文还好。」文泽道：「这是《访素》的曲文，是一枝上的，我们也贺一杯。」这边王恂掣了枝是鸟门的，美人名飞燕，花名也是并蒂花。王恂素来文思略迟，只得思索起来。看着素兰掷了个么四，也在那里凝思。忽见素兰想","en":"even half a star of pity for jade or fragrance—fit only to keep to reed windows and thatched plum-curtains.'\\" Ziyu clapped his hands and praised its tender elegance, remarking that the adapted pairing felt even better than the original context. Wenze pointed out that the lines came from *Visiting Su* in a specific aria sequence and deserved another toast. Back on"},{"paragraph":33,"mentions":7,"tokens":["子玉","庾香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉掣了个地理门，美人名洛神，花是并头花。想了两句不见甚佳，才要另想，只见蕙芳掷了一个么三，想了一想，念着《偷诗》上两句道：「恨无眠残月窗西，更难听孤雁嘹呖。」子玉赞道：「实在绣口锦心，愧煞我辈。」子云道：「这个令，叫我们行，也没有这些好句。」大家满贺了","en":"Ziyu drew a lot from the geography category: the beauty 'Luoshen' (洛神) and a paired-head flower. He thought of two lines but felt they weren't quite right. Just as he was about to think of new ones, he saw Huifang roll a one and a three. Huifang paused, then"},{"paragraph":36,"mentions":2,"tokens":["庾香","子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"宝珠将眼睛看了子云一看，心中若有所思。次贤道：「不是这两字，也与庾香一样可以贺三杯。子云等诸位喝两杯也罢了。」再说花名道：「南有乔木，堇荼如饴。木堇是连理花。」众人道：「这两句却自然，该贺两杯。」这一天大家思索也都乏了，都要吃饭。子云道：「尚早，再看他们掷几回。他们到底比我们少用些心。」素兰掷了一个重四，即想出一句《","en":"continued, \\"Even without a perfect match on those two characters, his lines are just as worthy of a three-cup toast as Yuxiang's. But let's settle for Ziyun and the rest of us drinking two cups.\\" Ziyun then announced his flower name: \\"'In the south there are lofty trees; the violet and the sowthistle are sweet as syrup.' The last character of the first line and the first of"}],"36":[{"paragraph":8,"mentions":3,"tokens":["庾香","子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴言道：「魏聘才搬了出去了，不知可在庾香处？」蕙芳道：「魏聘才么，如今倒更阔了。就在宏济寺住，同了奚十一、潘三、杨八一班混账人天天的闹，是什么剃头的，又是什么大和尚、小和尚，开赌宿娼，闹得不像。张仲雨也不与他往来了。」 　　 琴言问起子玉来，宝珠道：「前日我们在怡园叙了一日。」便将前日怎样","en":"Qinyan asked, \\"Wei Pincai has moved out. Do you know if he's with Yuxiang?\\" Huifang scoffed, \\"Wei Pincai? He's even more arrogant now. He lives at Hongji Temple and causes trouble every day with a bunch of scoundrels like Xi Eleven, Pan the Third, and Yang Eight—barbers, monks big and small—gambling and visiting prostitutes."},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":1,"tokens":["庾香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，道：「本定今日，因度香有事，遂改明日辰刻在怡园叙集。」琴言应了，梳洗毕，独坐凝思：「今日空闲无事，不如去看看庾香罢。」因想去年梅夫人待的光景，去谅也无妨。主意定了，换了一身素服，吩咐套了车，一面告诉师娘去谢谢同班的人。到了外间，忽然又转念道：「如今已隔了半年了，况从前是聘才领我去的，不要进门房里回话。如今我独自去，就算太太待我好，叫我进去，那门房里我总要去求他","en":"tomorrow.\\" Qinyan agreed. After washing up, he sat alone in thought: \\"Since I have nothing to do today, why not go see Yuxiang?\\" Remembering Lady Mei's kind treatment last year, he figured there would be no harm in going. Mind made up, he changed into plain clothes, ordered the carriage to be readied, and told his teacher's wife he was going to thank his fellow actors. When"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":1,"tokens":["庾香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"…」说到此，又不好意思说出来，聘才已经明白，便道：「要我同你到那里去。」琴言只得说道：「要你同我去见见梅太太与庾香。」聘才笑了一笑，点点头道：「使得，使得，停一停我们就去。」琴言见有人在此，不好催他。","en":"asked, \\"Where do you want me to go with you?\\" Qinyan finally said, \\"I want you to go with me to see Lady Mei and Yuxiang.\\" Pincai smiled, nodded, and said, \\"Of course, of course. We'll go in a little while.\\" Seeing so many people present, Qinyan couldn't urge him."},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":1,"tokens":["庾香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"饭再去，自然有一会耽搁。」琴言一想，在聘才处吃饭也不妨。况且这些人都去了，自然没有人来，便问聘才道：「今年见过庾香几次了？」聘才随口说道：「三次了。」琴言又问道：「我听得奚十一是个坏人，为什么与他相好？」聘才道：「也没有什么很相好，看他也是个爽快人。」琴言道：「那个姓潘的，我也知道他。」聘才道：「那是个买卖老实人，就这和尚也极通世务的。」琴言心里暗笑，也不便驳他","en":"problem, and since the others were gone, no one would bother them. He asked Pincai, \\"How many times have you seen Yuxiang this year?\\" Pincai casually replied, \\"Three times.\\" Qinyan asked further, \\"I've heard Xi Eleven is a bad man. Why are you friends with him?\\" Pincai deflected, \\"We aren't that close. He just seems like a straightforward fellow.\\" Qinyan added, \\"And that"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":1,"tokens":["庾香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"了，也回敬了聘才一杯。聘才喜出望外，也是平生第一次得意，难得两人对坐了。聘才随口的说些话来哄琴言，要他喜欢，说庾香近来也不出门赴席听戏，常托我对你说，在那里放宽了心，不要惦记着他，他慢慢的去结交华公子，自然可以常见面了。聘才无非要他安心久坐，等奚十一来。无奈琴言急于要走，酒也不喝，菜也不吃，呆呆的坐着，如芒刺在背的光景。","en":"to finally sit face-to-face like this. Pincai chatted casually to coax Qinyan into a good mood, mentioning that Yuxiang rarely went out to banquets or plays these days, and frequently asked him to pass on a message: \\"Tell him to relax, not to worry about me, and to slowly build a relationship with Young Master Hua; naturally, you'll be able to see each other often.\\" Pincai's"}],"37":[{"paragraph":3,"mentions":4,"tokens":["子玉","庾香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"团拜，文泽、王恂是座师的世兄，故大家请了他。春航并请仲清，仲清新受感冒，两处都辞了。王恂也辞了那边，清早就约同子玉到怡园，次贤、子云接进梅崦坐下。这梅崦是个梅花样式，五间一处，共有五处。长廊曲槛钩连，绿萼红香围绕。外边望着，也认不清屋宇，唯觉一片香雪而已。子玉每到园中，必须赏玩几处。子云道：「今日之局，人颇不齐，这月里戏酒甚多。我想玉侬回来，尚有二十余日之久，这","en":"declined both invitations. Wang Xun also declined his invitation, having arranged early in the morning to accompany Ziyu to the Garden of Contentment. Cixian and Ziyun welcomed them into the Plum Knoll and they took their seats. This retreat was laid out in the shape of a plum blossom, comprising five sections of five rooms each. Winding corridors and curved balustrades"},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":5,"tokens":["子玉","庾香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"桂保道：「再忙半个月也就闲了。」宝珠道：「我见湘帆、前舟在那里，剑潭何以不来？」王恂道：「身子不爽快。」桂保谓子玉道：「今年我们还是头一回见面。」子玉道：「正是，我却出来过几次，总没有见你。」宝珠道：「今日香畹与静芳苦了，处处有他们的戏，是再不能来了。」子云道：「我算有六七人可来，谁晓得都不能来。」将到午正，桂保往外一望，道：「玉侬来了！」大家一齐望着他进来。子","en":"Xiangfan and Qianzhou there; why did Jiantan not come?\\" Wang Xun explained that he was unwell. Guibao turned to Ziyu and said, \\"This is the first time we have met this year.\\" Ziyu agreed, noting that although he had been out several times, he had never run into him. Baozhu said, \\"Xiangwan and Jingfang are having a hard time of it today, as they are scheduled to perform"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":4,"tokens":["庾香","子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云吩咐摆起席面来，也不送酒。子云对王恂道：「论年齿，吾弟长于庾香，但今日之酌特为玉侬而设，要玉侬坐个首席，庾香作陪。」琴言道：「这个如何使得？我是不坐的。」子玉道：「应是庸庵。」子云道：「往日原是这样，今日却要倒转来。」便拉定琴言坐了首席，子玉并之。桂保坐了二席，王恂并之，不准再逊，逊者罚酒十杯。子云又叫宝珠坐在","en":"gave orders for the table to be laid, without a formal offering of wine. He said to Wang Xun, \\"You are older than Yuxiang, but today we are drinking in Yunong's honour. Let him take the seat of honour, with Yuxiang beside him.\\" Qinyan protested, \\"That cannot be. I shall not sit there.\\" Ziyu suggested that Yong'an should have the top seat. Ziyun replied, \\"On other occasions,"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":3,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"个多情人，长庆待他也不算好，他还哭得这样，这也难得。」众人尽皆太息。琴言听了，触起昨日的气来，便脸有怒容。又见子玉在旁，总是为他而起，他一阵酸楚，流下泪来。众人齐相劝慰，殊不知琴言别有悲伤，并不是为了长庆。众人既不知道，又不便告诉人，闷在心里，越想越气，要忍也忍不住，把帕子掩了面，想道：「魏聘才这东西专会捏造谣言，将来必说我在他那里陪酒，奚十一赏镯子等语，不如我","en":"heard this, it stirred up yesterday's resentment, casting an expression of anger across his face. Then he saw Ziyu beside him: it had all come of his wish to see Ziyu. A surge of anguish welled up within him, and tears spilled down his cheeks. Everyone at the table hastened to offer words of comfort, not realizing that Qinyan's grief had quite a different source"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":3,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴言道：「我昨日见他，他说今年见你三次了。」子玉道：「何曾见过？最可笑的是大年初一天明的时候，在门外打门。门上人才穿衣起来，他说了一声，留下个片子，到如今还没有见着他。你是那里见他的？」琴言骂了一声道：「这魏聘才始终不是个东西。」蕙芳道：「早就不是个东西，何须你说。」子玉又问琴言，琴言含泪说道：「","en":"Qinyan said, \\"I saw him yesterday and he told me he had met you three times this year.\\" Ziyu replied, \\"That is quite untrue. The most absurd instance was at dawn on New Year's Day when he came banging on the gate. The doorman had only just gotten out of bed and dressed. Pincai said a word or two, left a calling card, and to this day we have"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"聘才撵了潘三，奚十一忽又送菜来，后奚十一、潘三、和尚先后的闯进，并将席间诸般戏侮，与砸了他的镯子，都说了出来。子玉听了，甚是生气，说道：「这是聘才的坏，定是他设的计，故意叫他们糟蹋你的。」琴言道：「可不是他通同的么？幸亏我如今不唱戏了，他们还不敢十分怎样。不然还了得，只怕你们今日也不能见我的。」子云道：「这三个恶煞，怎么你一齐都遇见了，这也实在为难你。」次贤、王","en":"subjected him to at the table, and how he had smashed the bracelet Xi had forced onto his wrist. Listening to this, Ziyu was furious. \\"This is all Pincai's doing,\\" he said. \\"He must have arranged the whole thing on purpose, deliberately setting those men on to ill-use you.\\" Qinyan agreed, \\"Of course he was in it with them. Fortunately, I no longer perform on stage, so"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":6,"tokens":["子玉","庾香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"忽见子玉与琴言四目相注，各人饮了半杯酒。子云不觉微笑，问子玉道：「你与玉侬同过几回席了？」子玉道：「这是第二回，已一年之久。」子云道：「只得两回，可怜，可怜！真是会少离多了。」琴言笑道：「也第三回了。」次贤道：「庾香有些贪心不足，以多报少。去年你们瞒着人私逛","en":"Just then, Ziyu and Qinyan caught each other's gaze, and each drank half a cup. Ziyun smiled and asked Ziyu, \\"How many times have you and Yunong sat at the same table now?\\" Ziyu replied, \\"This is the second time, and it has been a year since the first.\\" Ziyun lamented,"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云大笑，次贤道：「十日之叙，已无此福，若华星北之福，真是福如东海了。」说得众人大笑。琴言与子玉此时，已觉十分畅满。","en":"Now that would be good fortune as vast as the Eastern Sea!\\" Everyone laughed at this remark. By now, Qinyan and Ziyu were both filled with contentment."},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"上去是香字。」众人赞道：「更好！」宝珠道：「我有个丁字，加一笔是于字，移上去是亍字。」子云道：「这字却冷些。」子玉道：「也可用。」宝珠道：「彳亍二字也不算冷。」琴言道：「我有个卜字，加一笔是上字，移上去是下字。」次贤道：「这个好得很。」桂保道：「我有个白字，加一笔是自字，移上去是百字。」蕙芳道：「略短些。」王恂道：「我有个曰字，加一笔是田字，移上去…」说到此顿住","en":"make it 'in' (于), and move it to the top to make it 'step' (亍).\\" Ziyun said, \\"That character is rather obscure.\\" Ziyu countered, \\"It is acceptable enough.\\" Baozhu defended it, \\"彳 and 亍 aren't so very obscure.\\" Qinyan offered another, \\"I have the character for 'divine' (卜), add a stroke to make it 'above' (上), and move it to the top to make it 'below' (下).\\" Cixian said,"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":3,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"屈，不是姓瞿。」蕙芳道：「是姓屈，我记错了。」次贤道：「不要是屈道生么？」子云道：「一定是他，我听说他到了。」子玉道：「他名字可叫本立？」子云道：「正是，你认识他么？」子玉道：「我却不认识，我见他几封书札与家严的，有论些史事疑难处，却独出卓见，真是只眼千古。家严将他裱成一个册页，我倒常看的。」次贤道：「这道生先生今年六十岁了，与先兄同举孝廉方正。他在江西作知县，","en":"had it wrong.\\" Cixian asked, \\"Could it be Qu Daosheng?\\" Ziyun confirmed, \\"It must be him. I heard he’d arrived.\\" Ziyu asked, \\"Would his given name be Benli?\\" Ziyun said, \\"Exactly! Do you know him?\\" Ziyu explained, \\"I do not know him personally, but I have read several of his letters to my father, discussing obscure points of history. In them, he advanced wholly original"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":2,"tokens":["庾香","子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"次贤道：「很好，就请庾香、玉侬先对起来。」子玉道：「还是你与媚香先对，次度香、瑶卿，次庸庵、蕊香，末后轮到我们罢。」子云道：「也罢，你作个先锋，他作个后劲，把我们放在中间，容易讨好些。」次贤道：「头难，头难，我一时想不出好的。我前日见瘦香的《题曲》唱得甚好，就出《题曲》罢。","en":"Cixian agreed, \\"Excellent. Let Yuxiang and Yunong start.\\" Ziyu suggested, \\"It would be better if you and Meixiang go first, then Duxiang and Yaoqing, then Yong'an and Ruixiang, and we shall go last.\\" Ziyun agreed to this arrangement, \\"You take the vanguard, and he brings up the rear; that"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"你们以为何如？」王恂道：「你这评论，真是毫发不爽，我改了《访鼠》罢。」次贤道：「这该贺了。」各人都贺一杯。到了子玉，出的是《看袜》，琴言对的是《借靴》。大家说道：「这个对得好，要贺两杯。」蕙芳道：「一杯也够了，这对子也对得快。若两杯两杯的贺起来，将人喝醉了，倒对不好了。」次贤道：「说得是，以后顶好的方贺一杯，好的贺半杯，平平的不贺。」于是各贺了一杯。","en":"change mine to *Visiting the Rat* (访鼠).\\" Cixian said, \\"Now that deserves a toast.\\" Everyone drank. When it came to Ziyu's turn, he offered *Looking at the Stocking* (看袜), and Qinyan paired it with *Borrowing the Boot* (借靴). The company exclaimed, \\"Beautifully paired! That deserves two toasts.\\" Huifang interjected, \\"One cup is enough. That was a quick answer, too. If we"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴言出了《醉妃》，子玉听得王恂的《伏虎》，就触着了，对了《醒妓》。众人道：「这个对得有趣，满贺一杯。」琴言道：「巧在一醉一醒，这倒难得的。」轮到次贤，次贤道：「我出《撇斗》。」蕙芳道：「好个《撇斗》。」想了一想道：「我对《搜杯》。」次贤道：「也好个《搜杯》，这里面工稳，贺","en":"Qinyan then put forward *The Drunken Consort* (醉妃). Wang Xun's earlier title, *Subduing the Tiger* (伏虎), gave Ziyu an idea, and he answered Qinyan with *Sobering the Courtesan* (醒妓). Everyone exclaimed, \\"That pairing is delightful! A full cup all round!\\" Qinyan added, \\"One drunk, the other sober—that's the clever part. Not an easy match to find.\\" When it came to"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"次贤道：「要喝的。那《势利》又叫《势僧》，这不是绝对么？」蕙芳道：「势字怎么对得牝字？」子玉一想，不觉抚掌大笑道：「妙极，妙极！就是势字才可对得牝字，真是绝对。」琴言与宝珠尚未明白，子云、王恂也想出来了，也笑起来，赞道：「真好心思，把这两字当这两件东西，真是异想天开了。」四旦尚未想出，蕙芳犹呆呆的想，王恂道：「你们尚未想着，你们不知男子阳为","en":"goes by the name *The Snobbish Monk* (势僧). Is that not a perfect pairing?\\" Huifang said, \\"How can 势 pair with 牝?\\" Ziyu thought for a moment, then clapped his hands and burst out laughing. \\"Marvellous, utterly marvellous! Only 势 could possibly pair with 牝. A truly perfect match.\\" Qinyan and Baozhu had not yet understood it. Ziyun and Wang Xun, having worked it out, also"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":3,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"了《火判》。大家已经赞好要贺，王恂道：「慢着，我还要改。」又改了《草相》，众人道：「更好，新奇之极。」各贺了。子玉出了个《封房》，琴言对了《辞阁》，也算工稳，贺了半杯。琴言出了《卸甲》，子玉也思索了一回，没有新鲜的，偶想起《桃花扇》上有出《哄丁》，便把《哄丁》借对了，众人极口赞妙，各贺了满杯。次贤出了《饭店》，蕙芳对了《茶房》。蕙芳出了《拔眉》，子云道：「这更难","en":"(草相). The others exclaimed, \\"Even better! That is remarkably fresh and inventive.\\" They all toasted in agreement. Ziyu offered *Sealing the Chamber* (封房), and Qinyan matched it with *Taking Leave of the Grand Secretary* (辞阁). This too was judged a solid pairing and rewarded with a half cup. Qinyan then proposed *Removing Armour* (卸甲). Ziyu reflected but could think of"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"了一会，出了《扶头》。子云笑道：「这个真不容易。」忽然把桌子一拍道：「有个好对，我对《切脚》，你们说好不好？」子玉道：「妙，妙！这个与《拔眉》、《刺目》，可称双绝。」次贤道：「比《拔眉》、《刺目》还好，这头、脚两字都是虚的，里面是一样，平仄又调，真是好对。倒是媚香激出来的，我们要贺双杯。」于是大家贺了，吃了一回菜。","en":"Then he suddenly slapped the table, \\"I have it! I'll match it with *Cutting the Foot* (切脚). What do you think?\\" Ziyu exclaimed, \\"Superb! Superb! This and *Plucking the Eyebrow* (拔眉) matched with *Piercing the Eye* (刺目) may both be called perfect pairings.\\" Cixian added, \\"It is even better than *Plucking the Eyebrow* (拔眉) and *Piercing the Eye* (刺目). Here, 头 (head)"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":6,"tokens":["子玉","庾香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"对，其余我想不出来，我喝一杯罢。」桂保喝了半杯酒，出了个《跪池》，王恂对了《投井》，大家说好，也贺了半杯。到了子玉，子玉出了《折柳》。子云笑道：「庾香惠顾着玉侬，出这样稀松的对子出来。」子玉道：「我一时想不出生的，我看倒是对对易，出对难。」琴言对了《扫松》。子玉道：「这一对连我的上对都好了。」众人也贺半杯。琴言道：「我就出个扫字的上对，是《扫秦》。」众人道：「这","en":"promptly matched it with *Leaping into the Well* (投井). Everyone approved, and half a cup was toasted. When it came to Ziyu's turn, he offered *Plucking a Willow Branch* (折柳). Ziyun laughed, \\"Yuxiang is making things easy for Yunong by offering such a simple title.\\" Ziyu said, \\"I couldn't think of a fresh one just now. Matching a title is easier than choosing one.\\" Qinyan"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":1,"tokens":["庾香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"次贤道：「又轮到我了，我也学庾香惠顾人，出个容易的。」出了《酒楼》，蕙芳对了《书馆》，便说道：「我也学玉侬的连环出法，我就用书字出个《改书》。」次贤道：「你就难我，我偏要对个好的。」因想了一会，对了《追信》。","en":"Cixian said, \\"My turn again. I'll follow Yuxiang's example and offer an easy one.\\" He offered *The Tavern* (酒楼), and Huifang matched it with *The Study* (书馆). Huifang then said, \\"I'll follow Yunong's linked pattern too, using 书 again in *Revising the Letter* (改书).\\" Cixian said, \\"Trying to make it hard"},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":4,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉道：「这对可以结了，天也不早了。况我一早出来，过迟了恐家慈见问。请以此对收令罢。」王恂道：「也是时候了，对了吃饭罢。」子云道：「且看，其实天还早呢。」子玉道：「既要叙几天，也宜留些精神在明日，今日早散为妙。」子玉见琴言有些倦意，故要收令。子云只得依了","en":"Ziyu suggested, \\"We can end the game here, as it is getting late. Besides, I came out early this morning. If I stay much longer, my mother may ask what kept me. Let us close with this pairing.\\" Wang Xun agreed, \\"It is time. After the pairing, let us eat.\\""},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":6,"tokens":["子玉","庾香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"难。」琴言道：「罚酒也只得一杯了。若是大家都要对四字的，自然就难了，这一两个只怕还有。」便出了个《卖子投渊》。子玉也想了一会，对了个《思亲罢宴》，众人拍案称妙。子云道：「情见乎词，庾香方才说回去过迟，恐怕伯母见问，真是思亲罢宴了。这个本地风光，我们各贺三杯吃饭。」这一回每人对了四转，共有三十二副对子，是六十四个戏目。也费了好些心，喝了几十杯酒，各有醉意，便也不能","en":"still be able to find one or two such pairings.\\" He offered *Selling a Son and Plunging into the Abyss* (卖子投渊). Ziyu pondered for a while, then offered *Longing for One's Parents, Abandoning the Feast* (思亲罢宴). Everyone struck the table in admiration. Ziyun said, \\"Your words give your feelings away! Yuxiang said just now he feared his mother would ask why he was home"}],"38":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"且说徐子云请了屈公来，并请南湘、仲清、文泽、春航、王恂、子玉作陪，仍在梅崦中。王恂是日为孙亮功请去有事，因李元茂吉期已定，要招赘过来。亮功因两位贤郎是不懂事的，一切皆托王恂料理，王恂所以不能前来。","en":"our story: Xu Ziyun had invited Master Qu to attend, with Nanxiang, Zhongqing, Wenze, Chunhang, Wang Xun, and Ziyu as companions, again in the Plum Knoll. Wang Xun on this particular day had been called away by Sun Lianggong on an important matter: the wedding date had been fixed for Li Yuanmao, who was to be adopted into the Sun household as a son-in-law. Since"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":5,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"田春航前日已经会过，唯仲清、子玉初次识荆，见了那仙风道骨的相貌，况且又是父执，自然十分恭敬。道生见仲清骨秀神清，知是不凡。又看子玉温然玉立，皎若珠光，秀外慧中，神怡气肃，又不是那徒有外貌的一派，心中十分大喜，想道：「梅铁庵可为有子矣。」便与子玉说些江西事情，说道：「令尊大人严拒情面","en":"Tian Chunhang had met him the day before, but Zhongqing and Ziyu were making his acquaintance for the first time. Seeing that otherworldly, Taoist-sage bearing, and mindful moreover that he was a friend of his father's generation, Ziyu naturally showed the deepest respect. Master Qu saw in Zhongqing a refined and"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"西首定要南湘，南湘道：「这是我乡前辈，如何敢抗礼。」才定了仲清。东席第二是南湘，西席第二是春航。东席第三是子玉，西席三是文泽。子云东席作主，次贤西席作陪。宝珠、琴言在东，蕙芳、素兰在西，一一坐了。主人让酒，客皆饮了几杯。道生道：「我将前日先见的苏媚香谈起。」西席的人个个细听。道生道：「我这看相不论气色，部位是要论的，然尚在其次。我看全身的神骨、举止行动、坐相","en":"that seat instead. Second on the east table was Nanxiang; second on the west was Chunhang. Third on the east was Ziyu; third on the west was Wenze. Ziyun presided at the east table while Cixian acted as second host at the west. Baozhu and Qinyan sat on the east side; Huifang and Sulan on the west. Everyone took their places. The host circulated wine and the guests each"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":3,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云见上菜的家人一件新衣上爬着个虱子，候他上好了菜，叫他拈掉了。道生即问关子玉道：「世兄博览经史，不知方才这个虱子见于何书为古？诗词杂说是不用讲的。」子玉劈头被他一问，呆了一呆，想道：「这个字却也稀少，他说见于何书为古，这些扪虱、贯虱就不必讲了。」婉言答道：「小侄寡闻浅见，读书未多。见于书史者也只有数条，大约要以阮籍《大人先生","en":"until the man had set down the dishes, then called him over and told him to pick it off. Qu immediately turned to Ziyu and asked, \\"Since the young gentleman has read widely in the classics and histories, I wonder — in which text does this creature make its earliest and most venerable appearance? I need not say anything of it in poetry and miscellaneous writing.\\" Taken"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉问道：「先生方才说唐诗中晚之分，小侄以唐诗自然推李、杜、韩三家，而王荆公定诗则称杜、李，又选杜、韩、欧、李四家诗，则以李太白居四。元微之亦谓杜在李上，其优劣之意见于《工部墓志》。以太白天才，竟有不满人意处。韩昌黎则云：「李杜文章在，光焰万丈长。\\n不知","en":"Ziyu asked, \\"A moment ago you drew the distinction between the High and Late Tang in poetry. In my own view, Li Bai, Du Fu, and Han Yu are the natural summit of Tang poetry. Yet Wang Anshi, in ranking poets, placed Du above Li, and in his selection of four"},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉道：「诗之妙论，既闻命矣。韵有通转之分，且自魏晋而始，如李登之《诗韵》，吕静之《集韵》，齐周颙作《四声切韵》，梁沈约撰《四声》一卷，而韵谱成。隋陆法言、刘臻等，本沈约之旨又为《广韵》，唐郭知玄又为《切韵》，孙愐又为《唐韵》，丁度、宋祁为《集韵》。景云","en":"Ziyu said, \\"I have now received your instruction on the art of poetry. On the question of rhyme and the distinctions between standard, transferred, and merged rhymes — this system began to take shape in the Wei and Jin period. Thus Li Deng compiled his Poetic"},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"之《韵学集成》校定四声，而古韵之通转亦可类推。请以《雅》、《颂》、《离骚》古歌诗核之，古今通转之异可想见矣。」子玉避席而谢。","en":"Sorrow* in the light of this, the differences between ancient and modern transferences become readily apparent.\\" Ziyu rose from his seat and bowed in thanks."},{"paragraph":36,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"众人说道：「极是，从古以来，未有量及身体者。」子玉道：「缠足之始，谓始于陈后主之潘贵妃，今《秘辛》之「约缣迫袜，收束微如禁中」，非缠足之始么？」","en":"said, \\"Quite so — from ancient times to the present, no one has ever taken someone's measurements in such detail.\\" Ziyu said, \\"The binding of feet is said to have originated with Consort Pan of the Last Ruler of Chen. Yet the passage in the *Secret Affairs* — 'thin silk wrapped close as a band of gauze, binding them minutely as if they were confined within the palace'"},{"paragraph":38,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，皆是此君教的。前月他们还逛了两天翠微山呢。他之待此君，也不亚于蕙芳之待湘帆了。」宝珠一笑，道：「何至于此？」子玉道：「前在瑶卿处，见其笔墨高雅之至，大有唐六如的光景。」道翁道：「不特笔墨似六如，命宫磨蝎也似六如，却是怪事。何以古今若合，此又不可以言理不言数了。我明日尚要拜他去。」子云忙道：「何不为我先容？得此良友，也是快事。」道翁道：「妙极，妙极！」","en":"gentleman is no less than Meixiang's regard for Xiangfan.\\" Baozhu smiled and said, \\"Surely not quite to that degree.\\" Ziyu said, \\"I once saw at Yaoqing's some of his brushwork — supremely elegant and refined, with much of the quality of Tang Liuru.\\" Master Qu said, \\"Not only is his brushwork like Tang Liuru's — his natal palace stands under Capricorn just as Tang Liuru's"}],"39":[{"paragraph":3,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"去见了颜夫人，因有好几个月不去了，又为去年闹了事，甚是局促不安。颜夫人也不问其往事，淡淡问了几句话。聘才去见了子玉，子玉想起琴言前日的话，心上总有些怪他，也不似从前待他亲厚了。","en":"her part, asked nothing about past events and exchanged only a few bland words with him. When Pincai went to see Ziyu, the latter still remembered what Qinyan had said some days earlier and bore him a quiet grudge and was noticeably less warm toward him than before."},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"到了吉期，自有梅宅家人料理，备了两桌酒，一席送颜夫人，一席待媒人，并请子玉、颜仲清作陪。仲清道：「元兄今夕真个到了群玉山头了。」王恂道：「一路荣华到白头。」子玉道：「犹道灯前相对影，愈揉双眼愈模糊。」此是近视眼洞房诗，今日可为元兄咏矣。」元茂道：「我说倒是近视眼好，就新人丑些，也看不清楚。」仲清道：「若美的呢，可不孤负了？","en":"the preparations, laying on two tables of wine, one for Madam Yan and one for the matchmakers, while inviting Ziyu and Yan Zhongqing to keep them company. Zhongqing said, \\"Brother Yuan, tonight you truly arrive at the summit of the Jade Mountain.\\" Wang Xun said, \\"A life of glory and splendor all the way to white-haired age.\\" Ziyu said, \\"'Still they say the lamplight"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"笑。嗣徽道：「夫妇居室，人之大伦也，外人何得与闻？幸亏兄弟阋于床，外御其侮。不然，白雪之白，竟为十目所视矣。」子玉听了大笑。王恂对仲清道：「真所谓「无感我帨兮，无使龙也吠。」仲清也觉微笑。李元茂得意洋洋的喝酒。","en":"the bedside against all insult. Otherwise, that which is white as snow would be viewed by ten pairs of eyes.\\" Ziyu heard this and broke into laughter. Wang Xun said to Zhongqing, \\"It is as the old ode says: 'Stir not my kerchief; set not the shaggy dog barking.'\\" Zhongqing smiled faintly. Li Yuanmao drank his wine with an air of supreme self-satisfaction."},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":3,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"姬亮轩与王恂、仲清是见过几回的了，子玉却是初见，心中想道：「这个梅少爷好相貌，比起那孙老徽来，倒似那戏上岑彭、马武了。」聘才问姬亮轩道：「好几天不见你东家出来，在家里作什么？」亮轩道：「这两天敝东有点贵恙，不便行动。」聘才道：「什么贵恙？」亮轩道：「听得腿上生了疖子，所以不出来。」这一席","en":"Ji Liangxuan had met Wang Xun and Zhongqing on several previous occasions, but this was his first meeting with Ziyu, whom he eyed with private admiration: \\"This young master Mei is a fine-looking man. Set beside that Sun Sihui, who might be Cen Peng or Ma Wu straight off the stage.\\" Pincai asked Ji Liangxuan, \\"I haven't seen your master come out in days, what's he"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":3,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"叫嗣元过来，嗣元不肯，拿张凳子在床面前坐着。姬亮轩向子玉笑嘻嘻道：「梅大先生是不常出来，小弟今日还是头一回识荆。如高兴，歇天何不到敝东处来走走，敝东是极好相与的。」子玉不知他的东家是谁，含糊答应。即私问王恂，王恂答以奚十一，子玉便是一腔忿恨，也不理他。亮轩又向元茂道：「舍表妹贤德无双，李大哥真有福气，结了","en":"would not leave; he pulled up a stool and planted himself in front of the bed-curtain. Ji Liangxuan turned to Ziyu with a grinning smile and said, \\"Elder Master Mei rarely goes out in company, and today is the first time I have had the honor of your acquaintance. If you're inclined, why not come visit my master one of these days? He is a most agreeable person.\\" Ziyu,"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"带。」说得个恶心。仲清忍不住问道：「姬先生这样叙起来，我们都可以算得亲戚，只要多转两个弯。」亮轩连称「正是」。子玉微笑。元茂道：「我非但算不得清，而且也听不清，真是葫芦牵倒扁豆藤。」聘才笑道：「忙中遇着腿缠筋。」嗣徽道：「亲亲也，凡有血气者莫不尊亲。亲亲人也，仁者人也。」嗣元听了乃兄开口，就要驳起来，道：「这话、话，不、不通，你、你说凡有血、血、血气者，莫不、不","en":"connections, we all become kinsmen, as it merely requires a few more turns in the pedigree.\\" Liangxuan agreed heartily. Ziyu smiled. Yuanmao said, \\"Not only can I not follow the connections, I couldn't even hear them properly. It's like a pumpkin vine tangled up with a bean vine.\\" Pincai laughed and said, \\"And in the middle of it all you run into a man with his legs all wrapped"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"本家，个个算我亲戚么？」龙王大惊道：「快些放他去罢，不然他要与我攀亲了，不要攀出蛤蟆亲戚来。」说得聘才、王恂、子玉几乎笑倒。嗣徽与亮轩知道是骂他们，因回答不出来，只好忍气。嗣元见骂了他们，倒反笑起来，道：「好、好个王八亲戚，好、好个蛤蟆亲、亲、亲戚。」王恂道：「我也有个笑话。一个妓女是个瞎子，有人去嫖他，他虽看不见，却分得人的等次来。那一天接了三个客，老鸨问他道","en":"will soon claim kinship with me, and I have no desire for a toad as a cousin.\\"' At this, Pincai, Wang Xun, and Ziyu nearly fell off their seats laughing. Sihui and Liangxuan, knowing themselves to be the butt of the joke and having no reply, had to swallow their indignation. Siyuan, however, seeing those two mocked, laughed all the louder. \\"A f-f-fine turtle kinsman!\\""}],"42":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说琴言在怡园与子玉叙了几日，颇觉十分畅满。到长庆葬事过了，忙了两三天，琴言辛苦了，身子有些不快起来，意欲安顿几天，再进华府。一日早饭后，卧在房中，见他师娘进来，琴言连忙站起。师娘叫他坐了，说道：「从前你进华府，不知华公子怎样对你师父讲的，师父也没有对我说过。他在时我诸","en":"To return to our story: Qinyan had spent several delightful days at the Garden of Contentment in the company of Ziyu, feeling thoroughly content and at ease. After Changqing's funeral concluded, the ensuing bustle of two or three days left Qinyan rather worn out and slightly unwell. He thought to rest quietly for a few more days before returning to the Hua household."}],"43":[{"paragraph":18,"mentions":2,"tokens":["庾香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"举么？」蕙芳道：「若说力量，原也勉强，但集腑成裘，也还容易。我与瑶卿、香畹三人可以凑得六百金，王氏弟兄、佩仙、庾香可以凑得四百金。」次贤道：「我来一分，出二百金，前舟可出三百金，庸庵、竹君二人可出三百金。庾香、湘帆、剑潭不必派他，凑起来已得一千八百了。若要三千，还少一千二百两，不消说是度香包圆了。」子云道：「难道华星北倒干干净净，一文不花，这么便宜。」蕙芳道：「","en":"The three of us, Yaoqing, Xiangwan, and I, could put together six hundred taels; the Wang brothers, Peixian, and Yuxiang could manage four hundred.\\" \\"I shall contribute my share of two hundred taels,\\" said Cixian, \\"and Qianzhou can put in three hundred; Yong'an and Zhujun together can provide three hundred. We need not call on Yuxiang, Xiangfan, or Jiantan. All told we"}],"44":[{"paragraph":18,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这是琴言出师第二日，琴言原要今日进去，适子云于初六日要请客，一来与南湘、春航送场，并请屈道生，约子玉、仲清等相陪。今日已是初四，索性到初七进去，并说写个字贴与华公子，说他过了假期，一因身子不快，二因留他逛几天。所以琴言倒也心安，乐得多顽几日。","en":"banquet on the sixth day of the month — to send off Nanxiang and Chunhang, and to host Master Qu Daosheng, with Ziyu, Zhongqing, and others invited to keep them company. As today was only the fourth, they resolved to wait until the seventh for Qinyan to go back, and to draft a note to Young Master Hua explaining that after his leave expired, Qinyan had felt unwell"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":2,"tokens":["庾香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，竹君是才气比纵横，恐怕遇着那冬烘考官，就要委屈了。殿试工夫，竹君不及湘帆，若试宏词，竹君倒要擅长了。我看今年庾香是必得的，剑潭、卓然也有九分。」子云道：「你自己呢，一发拿得稳了。」次贤道：「也不去考，我自知无福。」子云道：「这叫什么话？你不应举也罢了，还可以说得无心进取。这宏词原是品定海内人才，就是那些老前辈退居林下的，还来应考，岂有全才如你，倒不去的？那时我","en":"falls short of Xiangfan; but in the Erudite Scholars examination, Zhujun would have the advantage. My view is that Yuxiang is certain to pass this year, and Jiantan and Zhuoran each have a nine-in-ten chance.\\" \\"And you yourself,\\" said Ziyun, \\"are a foregone conclusion.\\" \\"I am not entering,\\" said Cixian. \\"I know my own lack of fortune in such things.\\" \\"What sort of talk is"}],"45":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["梅子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"昨日子云又请了屈道生、梅子玉、史南湘、颜仲清、田春航、刘文泽、王恂等，并有诸名旦全来，会了一日。因南湘、春航次早要入场，所以散得甚早。","en":"The day before, Ziyun had once again invited Qu Daosheng, Mei Ziyu, Shi Nanxiang, Yan Zhongqing, Tian Chunhang, Liu Wenze, Wang Xun, and others. Together with all the leading actors, they had gathered for an entire day. Since Nanxiang and Chunhang were to enter the examination hall the following morning, the gathering"},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"且说子玉又与琴言聚了一日，知他出了华府，十分欢喜。","en":"Let us leave that aside and speak of Ziyu. He had spent another full day with Qinyan and learned that Qinyan had left the Hua mansion. Upon hearing this news, his delight knew no bounds."},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":3,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"着那一钩新月，去到怡园，也可畅叙一会，遂禀明了颜夫人、带了云儿，乘兴而来。进了怡园，却值子云未回，到了次贤处。子玉尚未进门，听得有人在那里高谈阔论。次贤见子玉来了，即忙出来，要请到里面。子玉问道：「何客？」次贤笑道：「不要紧，是个湖州王客人，贩些古董书画笔墨等货，来托消的。」","en":"so many people the previous day, they could not lay bare what was in their hearts. After supper this evening, Ziyu wished to take advantage of the crescent moon to visit the Garden of Contentment and talk freely for a while. He informed Lady Yan, brought Yun'er along, and set off on a whim. Upon entering the garden, he discovered that Ziyun had not yet returned,"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":4,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉进去，那人便鞠躬如也的直迎上来，深深作一个揖，子玉也还了礼。见那人有五十余岁，相貌虽俗，倒生得一部好须，直垂至腹。王胡子见子玉清华潇洒，知是个贵公子，头一句便问家世，第二句就问科第。子玉倒有些不好意思，次贤代他答了，王胡子道：「在下作个斯文买卖，二十","en":"Ziyu went in, and the man bowed deeply at the waist to greet him. Ziyu politely returned the courtesy. The fellow appeared to be past fifty. Although his features were somewhat vulgar, he sported a handsome beard that swept down to his belly. Observing Ziyu's"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"那王胡子好不话多，子玉有些发烦。无奈王胡子要候子云回来，消些东西。还有一部《图书集成》，这部书是个难消的，心上要想求子云买这部书，情愿减价，只要三千银子，今日看来也要在园中下榻的了。","en":"Old Wang Beard talked without end, and Ziyu grew rather tired of his chatter. Unfortunately, Old Wang insisted on waiting for Ziyun's return to unload his goods. He also carried a complete set of the *Complete Collection of Illustrations and Writings from Antiquity to the Present*, which was a"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":7,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"次贤觉得子玉有些嫌他。便对子玉道：「何不到玉侬处谈谈，今日又挪到海棠春圃，相去不远。」子玉正中心怀。次贤便叫书童引路，送子玉到了海棠春圃。望见琴言穿着随身的月白夹袄，脚上是双大红盘花珠履，倚着海棠花树，对着块太湖石，在那里凝思。书童咳嗽一声，琴言回头，见了子玉，","en":"Cixian sensed Ziyu's patience wearing thin and suggested, \\"Why not slip off to Yunong's place for a chat? He moved today to the Crabapple Spring Arbour, which is not far at all.\\" Ziyu's heart leapt at the idea. Cixian ordered a page to guide him, and the servant conducted"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":10,"tokens":["子玉","庾香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"果然，果然！你真是细心人。这香就像与花的颜色一样，说他不香却真有香，说他香又不像别的花香，真正恰是海棠的香。」子玉笑道：「此所谓心香，如何可以比得别的花香呢？岂有娇如海棠而云其一无香气，此真为唐安全突名花了。」二人在花下谈了一会，才进屋子坐下。子玉道：「你如今出了华府，无拘无束，所有那些愁闷都可消了。况在这个园子里，一年四季都可游玩，又有那一班长见的时来时往，比","en":"a fragrance. If you claim there is a scent, it is unlike any other flower. It is exactly crabapple fragrance.\\" Ziyu laughed. \\"That is what they call 'fragrance of the heart.' How could it ever compare with vulgar bloom-scents? Could anything as exquisite as the crabapple truly lack fragrance? That would be a downright affront to a famous flower.\\" They talked for a"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":2,"tokens":["庾香","子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"了柜子，取出十二盏海棠灯，是用通草作成。花朵中点了小白蜡，挂起来十分好看。子云道：「对此好花，也须小饮几杯，况庾香也来久了。」子玉道：「可不必了，时候不早，要回去了。」","en":"when hung. Ziyun smiled, \\"Facing such beautiful blossoms, we ought to drink a few cups. All the more so since Yuxiang has been here a while.\\" Ziyu shook his head gently. \\"Better not. The hour is late, and I should return.\\""},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云道：「略饮数杯，领领玉侬的情。」吩咐随便拿几样果菜来。当下四人小酌了一回，已经二更，子玉告辞，子云又嘱明日务必早到，子玉答应而别。","en":"servants to bring light refreshments. The four of them drank a little together. It was already the second watch. Ziyu took his leave. Ziyun urged him once again to come early the next morning, and Ziyu happily agreed."},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"颜夫人是从没有阻过他的。子玉到了辰刻，因是仙坛，衣冠而去。是日一早，屈道生同金吉甫先到，随后颜仲清、刘文泽、王恂一齐都来了，子玉到了，各人与吉甫相见，叙了些彼此仰慕的话。只有史南湘、田春航在场中未来。相公们到的是宝珠、蕙芳、素兰、玉林、漱芳、兰保、桂保、春喜、琪官、连琴言刚是十","en":"Lady Yan never stood in his way. Ziyu arrived at the chen hour. Since it was an immortal altar, he went in full dress. Early that morning, Qu Daosheng and Jin Jifu had already arrived. They were followed by Yan Zhongqing, Liu Wenze, Wang Xun, and finally Ziyu. They exchanged words of long"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":2,"tokens":["庾香","子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"梅花一枝开春先，瑶琴三尺弹鹍弦。\\n红愁绿怨泪沾袖，明月一年几度圆。\\n道生写了。仲清对金粟道：「这四句像是说庾香与玉侬的。」金粟点头。子玉看了，分明一个梅字，一个琴字，也知道是说他们二人的，心里又想道：「难道坡仙今日要将这十九个人全写入诗内么？」子云与诸人也都看了，蕙芳呆呆的看着乩盘，只见道生又照着乩上写了四句是：","en":"times each year does the bright moon wax full?\\"\\nZhongqing turned to Jin Su and whispered, \\"These lines sound like Yuxiang and Yunong.\\" Jin nodded in agreement. Ziyu plainly saw the characters mei (plum) and qin (zither), and he knew they spoke of the two of them. He wondered whether Su meant to gather all nineteen of them into his poem. Ziyun and the others read on. Huifang"},{"paragraph":35,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"知君一生秉正直，风骨棱棱谢雕饰。\\n娇女含愁化玉郎，石头城下伤春色。\\n道生写到此处，不禁伤感起来，众人亦皆叹息。子玉道：「据两仙所云，玉侬前身的真是道翁先生前世之女，今日相见，可谓有缘。」道生听了子玉之言，不觉泪下。原来道生六十无儿，并且丧偶，孤苦一身，是以触动心事，凄然流涕，便呆呆的看着琴言，琴言也呆呆的看着道生，各有感伤之态。众人也呆呆的看他二人。忽然乩上又写","en":"stone-walled town.\\"\\nAs Daosheng copied the words, deep sorrow welled up within him, and everyone sighed in sympathy. Ziyu said softly, \\"From both immortals' words, Yunong's former life was truly your daughter, Old Gentleman. Today's meeting was destined by fate.\\" Hearing Ziyu's words, Daosheng wept. He was childless at sixty, widowed, and utterly alone. The sight of Qinyan"},{"paragraph":38,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"而诸公以弟之言为然否？」道生尚未回言，子玉喜动颜色，即道：「玉侬若得道翁先生栽培，真是精金入冶，美玉成器。只求道翁不以寒微为鄙，玉侬岂有不愿之理？」次贤与吉甫等都赞成道：「这是极好的事，大约今日合当父子相逢，不然杜兰仙何以特判出来，又单叫道翁上前，说明前因后果，不是也要撮合这件事么？可见数已","en":"turned to the rest of the group. \\"And you, gentlemen, do you find my proposal sound?\\" Before Daosheng could answer, Ziyu's face lit up with joy. \\"If Yunong gains Old Gentleman's guidance, it will be fine gold in the forge, fair jade carved to ware. Only do not scorn his humble birth. How could Yunong refuse?\\" Cixian and Jifu wholeheartedly approved. \\"Nothing could be better."},{"paragraph":40,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"事要你自己作主意，旁人难以应答的。」琴言道：「这个自然，我又没有父母，岂有不追随的道理？」子云赞了一声「好」。子玉听到此，未免有些伤悲，然也无可奈何，况从此琴言入了正路，故也喜多悲少。在琴言彻底一想，非但不悲，而且极乐。道生便叫过琴言来，说道：「从今以后，须要改去本来面目，也不应常到外边，在我寓里读书习字。出京日期也近了，你的名姓是都要改的，如今就依我的姓，改名","en":"written 琴仙 — Immortal of the Qin.\\" Everyone praised the new names. Qinyan bowed deeply and listened. Ziyun and Ziyu found the scene deeply bittersweet. Henceforth they would have to treat him differently. Truly, \\"the Xiao Lang becomes a stranger on the road.\\""},{"paragraph":41,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云便请入席。第一席是道生、子玉、吉甫、王胡子、琴言，二席是仲清、文泽、王恂、子云、次贤，九个名旦分为两桌，各自叙齿坐了三、四两席。琴言坐在下手，拘拘谨谨，也不举箸，甚觉可怜。倒是道生体恤他，道：「凡遇热闹场中，当言的即言，也不必过于拘谨，但存着个后辈的分寸就是了。」","en":"Ziyun invited everyone to the table. The first table sat Daosheng, Ziyu, Jifu, Old Wang Beard, and Qinyan. The second seated Zhongqing, Wenze, Wang Xun, Ziyun, and Cixian. The nine actors split two more tables by age. Qinyan sat quietly at the foot, his chopsticks untouched, looking pitifully constrained. Daosheng comforted"},{"paragraph":42,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"道生喝了几杯酒，便与子玉、吉甫、王胡子谈些闲话。王胡子道：「屈老先生，晚生这个请仙的本事如何？你说我是赚人么？」道生笑道：「今日之事却真稀奇，若不是我亲眼见的，亲手写的，凭谁告诉我，我也不信。」又道：「胡兄，你往常请仙，也有这么灵异么？」胡子道：「今年过扬州时，在一个盐商家","en":"After a few cups, Daosheng chatted comfortably with Ziyu, Jifu, and Old Wang Beard. Old Wang asked, \\"Old Gentleman Qu, how was my spirit-planchette today? Do you still say I cheat people?\\" Daosheng smiled warmly. \\"Today was a marvel. I would not believe it from hearsay had I not seen and copied it with my"}],"46":[{"paragraph":3,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"诸名士于二十八日早上陆续皆到。是日子玉、春航、南湘、仲清、文泽、王恂，共是六位，惟吉甫因感冒未到。园内屈氏父子，与次贤、主人四位，都在含万楼下坐了。道翁道：「这个含万楼是本《易经》「含万物而化光」句摘下，因为园中的主楼，故取此名。但就本意是言干道之大，此名似乎不甚相宜，度香以为何如？我见","en":"On the twenty-eighth morning the gentlemen arrived piecemeal: Ziyu, Chunhang, Nanxiang, Zhongqing, Wenze and Wang Xun—six—while Jifu stayed home with a chill. The Qu father and son, Cixian and their host — four in all — sat below the Tower of Myriad Containment. Daoweng explained: \\"This tower borrows from the *Book"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":2,"tokens":["庾香","子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"为欣喜。道翁道：「对面戏台，虽有联匾，那块「太音之和」可以不换，檐前那块是要换的。柱上的七字联，应改八字的，请庾香世兄一题，老夫借观珠玉。」子玉尚要推逊，众人挤定了，却也不慌不忙，想了半刻工夫，提起笔来写了，说道：「小侄荒疏，未敢妄作，也集个成语，尚求老先生斧正。」道翁与诸名士看时，匾是「画堂秋拍」四字，联句也是集六朝文上的，是：","en":"of Great Music' may stay—but the eaves board must change; the seven-character pillars should carry eight—Young Yuxiang shall try—I would trade for a pearl.\\" Ziyu hesitated until the crowd settled him; calmly he thought, then wrote: \\"A rough mosaic of set phrases—forgive me, Elder.\\" Daoweng read the horizontal board *Autumn Beats Upon the Painted Hall* and matched lines"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":1,"tokens":["庾香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"轻扇初开，长眉始画。\\n鸣瑟向赵，吹箫入秦。\\n道翁赞道：「我说庾香世兄定是不凡的，果然，果然！」子云及众名士也赞了好。","en":"open; long brows are freshly traced.\\nZithers resound toward Zhao, pipes echo into Qin.\\n\\nDaoweng cried: \\"I knew Yuxiang would excel—indeed!\\" Ziyun and the others praised without stint."},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":5,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"道翁道：「已经好极了，设使我起出稿来，还未必能如此。」子云道：「有几处，静宜也改了好几回才成的。」子玉道：「这梅崦两字，只好刻在山上。在房屋里，这崦字似乎要改才好。」道翁道：「就请教换个名字。」子玉道：「还请道翁先生改罢。」仲清道：「你若想着了好的，就说也不妨。」道翁道：「正是，就我换得不妥，也要请教大家商量的。」子玉道：「改做古香林屋罢。」道翁道：","en":"standard.\\" Ziyun explained, \\"There were several places that Jingyi revised again and again before they came right.\\"\\n\\nZiyu said, \\"The two words 'Plum Cove' would do very well carved upon the face of a hill; attached to a house, however, the character for \\"cove\\" seems to want changing.\\"\\n\\n\\"Then please favor us with another name,\\" said Daoweng.\\n\\n\\"I would rather ask you to alter"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":3,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉看了，真是喜不自胜。琴仙见子玉题了这副好对，也觉得玉颜春暖，笑启朱唇，仲清、南湘等也替子玉喜欢。大家走出了梅崦，过了梅林，转过一处，又是一个庭院。","en":"Ziyu brimmed with joy; Qinxian glowed knowing Ziyu had brushed the scroll—Zhongqing and Nanxiang shared their delight. They left the plum grove, crossed the silent woods, turned into another courtyard."},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"仙道：「有倒有一个，只怕不好用。」道翁道：「你且说来。」琴仙道：「春风沉醉轩，不知用得用不得？」子云拍手赞好，子玉等同声说道：「果然真好！这沉醉二字，用得入神入妙。」道翁也点点头，道：「也难为他。」又道：「你还能作一副对子么？」琴仙正要回言，王恂已写了卧云香院的对子出来，看是：","en":"of Spring-Wind Intoxication.' I do not know whether it can be used.\\"\\n\\nZiyun clapped his hands in delight, while Ziyu and the others praised it with one voice: \\"It is truly excellent! Those two words 'lie drunk' catch the very spirit with uncanny perfection.\\" Daoweng too nodded approvingly. \\"He has done remarkably well.\\" Then he asked, \\"Can you also compose a couplet"},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":4,"tokens":["子玉","庾香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一曲惜余芳，娇比玉颜时醒醉；\\n众人大赞，倒将琴仙赞得不好意思起来。仲清道：「可惜没有下联。」子玉将这句不住的吟哦，次贤道：「这下联非庾香续成不可。」道翁道：「果然，就烦庾香点铁成金罢。」子玉欣然提起笔来，写道：","en":"The company praised it so much that Qinxian grew shy under it. Zhongqing said, \\"A pity there is no lower line.\\" Ziyu kept murmuring the words over. Cixian said, \\"Nobody but Yuxiang can complete that lower line.\\" Daoweng said, \\"True enough. Let us trouble Yuxiang to turn iron into gold.\\" Ziyu took up the brush with pleasure and wrote:"},{"paragraph":41,"mentions":2,"tokens":["庾香","子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"开了。遂同过了小石梁，来到桃花坞。这里有五六处坐落，游赏已毕，道翁道：「此处改为寻源仙墅，也须添副对子，再借重庾香一题罢。」子玉想了一会，写出看是：","en":"said, \\"This may be changed to the Seeking-the-Source Immortal Villa, and it wants a couplet added. Let us trouble Yuxiang for it again.\\" Ziyu thought a while and wrote out:"},{"paragraph":45,"mentions":2,"tokens":["庾香","子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"正在厅内，见题着积翠轩，有几副对联。道翁道：「积翠轩可改为清凉诗境。」众名士道：「这诗境二字大妙。」道翁道：「庾香再题一联何如？既题了温柔乡，也不可不题清凉境。」子玉听了，颇有愧色，只得唯唯听命，也就集了成语。众人看是：","en":"Tranquil Poetic Realm.\\" The scholars said, \\"Those two words 'realm of poetry' are admirable.\\" Daoweng said, \\"Suppose Yuxiang inscribes another couplet? He has done the Land of Tenderness; he cannot leave the Poetic Realm undone.\\" Ziyu looked rather abashed, but had to submit, and again made one out of set phrases. They read:"},{"paragraph":48,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"田之乐来。谓子云道：「将来尊大人回来，这个平泉庄胜于古人多矣。」便数今天添的对子，已有了二十二副，内有最多者是子玉与他自己，其余也有两副的，惟文泽、王恂只有一副，未免不公，于是烦王恂、文泽各撰一副，又改稻庄为红雪西庄。先是文泽念了出来，是：","en":"outdo the ancients'.\\"\\n\\nHe then counted the couplets added that day, and there were twenty-two of them, of which Ziyu and he himself had the most, and the others two apiece; only Wenze and Wang Xun had but one each, which was hardly fair. So he asked Wenze and Wang Xun each to compose another, and changed the rice hamlet to the Red Snow West Manor. Wenze recited his"},{"paragraph":52,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"到宝香堂，已是夕阳西下，朱霞半天，映着那些牡丹花，更为绚烂。已撤了护花的幛子。子云备了两席，一席是道翁、南湘、子玉、琴仙、次贤，一席是仲清、春航、文泽、王恂、子云。","en":"red sky half the vault set peonies blazing—protective screens gone. Two tables waited—one for Daoweng, Nanxiang, Ziyu, Qinxian, Cixian; one for Zhongqing, Chunhang, Wenze, Wang Xun, Ziyun."},{"paragraph":53,"mentions":1,"tokens":["庾香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"勉强不来的。」道翁道：「这也不然，一来相体裁衣，二来是各人的性灵。今日高超的是剑潭，沉着的是竹君，细腻风光的是庾香，风华绮丽的是湘帆，秀润工稳的是庸庵、前舟，潇洒跌宕的是静宜，就是度香那副集句，也觉得落落大方。正是各人自立一帜，无从评定甲乙。你们看这二十四副对子，好在虚字少，尽是实字多，便见得力量。若教外边那些名宿做起来，不知要添多少虚字在里头，才凑得成、捏得拢","en":"and in the second every man writes out of his own nature. Today Jiantan is the lofty one; Zhujun the weighty; Yuxiang has the delicate scene; Xiangfan the rich and splendid; Yong'an and Qianzhou the polished and well-turned; Jingyi the free and unconstrained; and even Duxiang's set of borrowed lines has an easy largeness about it. Each has planted his own banner, and"}],"47":[{"paragraph":3,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，也在两可。」春航明日面辞了子云，说要接家眷来京，子云也不好相强。蕙芳也找着一所房子，甚是合式，就在鸣珂坊，与子玉相近。又替春航备了车马，新收了几个管家。那赶车的就是周小三，进来后，又荐他小舅子许老三，改名许贵，做了跟班，局面一变，暂且按下。","en":"him, and Ziyun could hardly press the matter. Huifang found an entirely suitable house in Mingke Ward, close to Ziyu. He also arranged a carriage and horses for Chunhang and took on several new servants. The driver was Zhou Xiaosan; once hired, he recommended his young brother-in-law, Xu Laosan, who took the name Xu Gui and became a footman. And so the household took"}],"48":[{"paragraph":12,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，不是垂帘度曲，就是对酒当歌。南湘素有才名，如今加上个翰林名号，更有那求文求诗的接踵而来。他又怕烦，常请金粟、子玉等代笔。至于不要紧的，连琴仙、蕙芳、素兰、宝珠的佳章都有在里面，好在人人说好，没有一个看得出来。南湘本要接夫人来京，一因任上两大人无人侍奉，二因他夫人利害，常要阻他的清兴，劝他戒酒。南湘有些惧内，本来只好狂饮狂游，鳏居倒也不妨。","en":"title, requests for essays and poems poured in endlessly. Detesting the nuisance, he frequently asked Jin Su, Ziyu, and others to write on his behalf. For less important pieces, even Qinxian, Huifang, Sulan, and Baozhu supplied exquisite verses. Everyone praised the work, and no one could tell the difference. Nanxiang had intended to bring his wife to the capital,"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子玉","庾香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴仙因与子玉就要离别，虽然叙了几日，心上还是丢不开，郁郁的想念，被南湘道破了，只得强起精神。也因闷坐无聊，便随着他到吟秋榭去。南湘忽又说：「我们何不去请了庾香、吉甫两人来，作个清谈雅集，倒也有趣。」琴仙听了，正合他意，便道：「很好，你打发人去请来。」南湘道：「你","en":"Because Qinxian was about to part from Ziyu, they had conversed for days, yet his heart remained inextricably bound in melancholy. Nanxiang's words pierced through his gloom, prompting him to force up his spirits. Feeling oppressed by idle sitting, he agreed to go along to the Autumn-Chant Waterside"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"家人奉命先到梅宅投了字帖，却好金粟正在子玉处，吃了早饭，正想同子玉到怡园来。二人看了字，吩咐来人先去了。","en":"Following his orders, the servant first delivered the note to the Mei residence. As it happened, Jin Su was already at Ziyu's home, having finished breakfast and intending to accompany Ziyu to the Garden of Contentment. The two read the note, instructed the messenger to go ahead, and set out themselves."},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉、金粟都是随身便服，各带了书童，坐车到怡园。自有南湘的家人引进，知道主人在吟秋榭，便从山边小径抄入练秋阁前，下了船。这个船是天天有人伺候的，不须找人荡桨。双桨分开，哑哑轧扎的，从莲萍菱芡中荡去，见白鹭横飞，绿杨倒挂，已觉妙不可言。穿过了红桥，望见吟秋","en":"Ziyu and Jin Su arrived in everyday attire, each accompanied by a pageboy, and rode in a carriage to the Garden of Contentment. Nanxiang's servant guided them. Upon learning that the hosts were at the waterside pavilion, they took a shortcut along a hillside"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":4,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"金粟、子玉上了岸，进了第一层，听得楼上叮叮当当的响，又听得南湘朗吟东坡的《水调歌头》道：「我欲乘风归去，只恐琼楼玉宇，高处不胜寒。」当的一声，像把个玻璃钵击碎了，遂狂笑进来。金粟笑道：「何物狂奴，悲歌击节？」南湘见金粟等进来，益发大笑。金粟道：「此是端午，又非","en":"Ziyu and Jin Su went ashore and entered the first tier. From above, they heard the clinking of glasses and Nanxiang loudly reciting Su Shi's \\"Prelude to Water Tune,\\" chanting about riding the wind home and fearing the jade towers and high altitudes. A loud"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":2,"tokens":["庾香","子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"又道：「玉侬两三天就要走了，今日庾香应当怎样，也应大家叙个痛快。这一别不知几年再见呢。」子玉、琴仙听了，都觉凄然，几乎堕泪。","en":"speak his heart completely today, for who knew how many years it would be before they met again. Hearing this, Ziyu and Qinxian both felt a profound sorrow and nearly shed tears."},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":6,"tokens":["子玉","庾香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴仙道：「我们何不下船去坐坐。一面走，一面看，比这阁子倒还好些。」子玉道：「果然船里好。」南湘道：「我们就下船去，我备了几样酒果，船里去谈，一发有趣。」说着都下船来。南湘叫书童带了笔研，又把酒肴也摆下船来，荡动双桨。南湘道：「庾香、玉侬何以不开口谈谈？再隔两天就谈不成了。」子玉道：「谈也是这样，亦只两天半了。就算再叙两","en":"said, \\"Why do we not go down and sit in the boat? We can move and look about us as we go — better than this loft.\\" Ziyu said, \\"The boat would indeed be better.\\" Nanxiang said, \\"Then down we go. I have laid in a few dishes and some fruit; talking in the boat will be the more delightful for it.\\" With that they all went down. Nanxiang had a page bring brush and inkstone,"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":10,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉也与琴仙并坐，靠在一个窗里，慢慢的荡到桥边，只见一群鸭子从桥洞里过来，琴仙道：「你看这鸭子是一群同着走，倒没有一个离群的。」子玉道：「人生在世，倒没有这些物类快活，毫无拘束。」南湘对着金粟微笑，金粟点点头，听着他们讲话。子玉道：「人生离合也没有什么一","en":"Ziyu sat close beside Qinxian, the two of them leaning in one window, as the boat drifted slowly to the bridge. A flock of ducks came through the arch, and Qinxian said, \\"Look at these ducks — the whole flock keeps together, and not one of them leaves the"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":2,"tokens":["庾香","子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"南湘叫摆过酒来，家童摆好了。金粟道：「庾香、玉侬过来喝一杯罢。」一面把船荡到练秋阁前，南湘道：「去年静宜有个《水浒传》的酒令，媚香掣着了《潘金莲雪天戏叔》，媚香那个神色，再没有这么好笑，不料湘帆今日竟能如此了。」金粟道：「湘帆真不负媚香。」说着，叹了一口气。南湘道：「也幸遇着了媚香，若遇了别","en":"Nanxiang ordered the wine to be served, and the pageboys quickly set the table. Jin Su invited Yuxiang and Yunong to share a cup. As the boat drifted near Refining Autumn Loft, Nanxiang recalled Jingyi's \\"Water Margin\\" drinking game from the previous year, remembering how Meixiang's expression during \\"Pan Jinlian Teases Her Brother-in-Law in the Snow\\""},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":7,"tokens":["子玉","庾香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"船又荡到了桂岭，子玉道：「我们荡转去，到兰径、菊畦、稻庄去罢。」南湘道：「也只可到兰径罢。我看那边水浅，这船如何去得？」琴仙道：「要到稻庄去，就要走围墙边那带河，过了水闸，全是大河。从菊畦背后，就到了稻庄，还可以到桃花源，就到不得兰径。」金粟道：「这里路我没有走过，就这","en":"The boat drifted gently toward Osmanthus Ridge. Ziyu said, \\"Let us turn about and go to Orchid Path, Chrysanthemum Beds and the rice hamlet.\\" Nanxiang said, \\"Orchid Path at most. The water looks shallow over there — how would the boat get through?\\" Qinxian said, \\"To reach the rice hamlet you must take"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":5,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"。」斟了一杯酒喝了，便跷脚而卧，口中吟道：「一声《河满子》，双泪落君前。哀猿夜吟，令人肠断。」琴仙痛哭了一会，子玉勉强劝住了，把绢子替他拭了眼泪，琴仙还望着那词稿，想人念完了。金粟只得念道：「门外天涯何处是，但见江湖浩漫，也难浣、愁肠一半。若虑梦魂飞不到，试宵宵、彼此将名唤。墨和泪，请君玩。」琴仙哭了一个发昏，把个子玉哭得柔肠寸断。金粟叹道：「这首词也不枉玉侬这","en":"gibbons crying in the night, he said, were enough to break a man in two.\\n\\nWhen Qinxian had wept himself out and Ziyu had, with difficulty, quieted him and dried his eyes with a handkerchief, Qinxian still gazed at the sheet, wanting someone to finish it. Jin Su had to read:\\n\\n\\"Beyond the gate — where is the world's end?\\nOnly the rivers and lakes, going on and on,\\nand"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云还要留金粟、子玉小饮，子玉坐在此倒觉心酸，便同金粟各自回去。","en":"Ziyun attempted to keep Jin Su and Ziyu for a small drink, but sitting there only deepened Ziyu's heartache, so he and Jin Su quietly departed for their respective homes."},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":5,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴仙一同来京，且同一师傅学戏，如今见他跳出樊笼，得以出京，心里甚为感慨，便单请琴仙过来话别。因想请琴仙，必须请子玉，又托琴仙转约子玉于初六日同去。琴仙应了，果然把子玉请了出来。子玉那日先到文辉处拜寿，耽搁了一早晨，吃了面，即便辞回。王恂留住不放，陆夫人也留他。子玉是一腔心事，如何留得住？只得将实话悄悄的告诉了仲清。仲清与王恂说了，方才放他出来。","en":"decided to invite Qinxian over alone to bid him a proper farewell. Knowing that inviting Qinxian required inviting Ziyu as well, he asked Qinxian to bring Ziyu along on the sixth. Qinxian agreed and successfully brought Ziyu out. That morning, Ziyu had gone to celebrate Wenhui's birthday and was delayed for hours; after eating longevity noodles, he tried to excuse himself,"},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":5,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉喜欢，一径就到琪官寓处，进去见琴仙已等了好一会，还有一个老年人在那里说话。见了子玉，那人就站起身来。作别而去，琴仙还谢了一声。琪官送客转来，请子玉到他书房里坐下。子玉问起方才这人，琴仙道：「他叫叶茂林，是我们教戏的师傅，闻我要出京，今日送了几样东西来","en":"Ziyu hurried joyfully to Qiguan's lodgings. Upon entering, he found that Qinxian had been waiting for quite some time, engaged in conversation with an elderly man. Seeing Ziyu arrive, the man stood up, bid his farewells, and departed, with Qinxian offering"},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":3,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"将背拥了你的背，你才睡着。及到了京，又分开在两处。我想起，好不伤心！」琴仙听了，眼泪直流下来，琪官也哭起来了。子玉本来伤心，今见他二人都哭，再将琴仙前前后后一想，怎么还忍得住，便也泪流满面。琪官又道：「你从前给我那个水晶猫儿，我还当着宝贝一样。现在天天学字，拿他做镇纸。去年林小梅要我的，我不肯给他。我说是哥哥路上给我的，我要留着他。」琴仙道：「你给我那琥珀扇坠儿","en":"it, how can I not be heartbroken?\\"\\n\\nThe tears ran straight down Qinxian's face, and Qiguan began to cry as well. Ziyu had been grieving already, and now, seeing the two of them weep, and thinking over everything that had happened to Qinxian from first to last, how could he hold out? His own face was soon covered in tears.\\n\\nQiguan went on, \\"That crystal cat you gave"},{"paragraph":31,"mentions":4,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"我已经死了，你就怎样？不如你先寄封书来问问，得了我的信再来。」琪官道：「何必说死说活呢？哥哥总喜欢诅怨自己。」子玉道：「是极了，玉侬总要咒自己。譬如去年你进华府的时候，你也口口声声咒自己要死，如今偏好好儿的出来了。那时怎想到今日？那时既想不到今日，自然今日也想不到后日。焉知不应了玉艳的说话？我劝你放开些罢。若说玉艳要找个便人同到江西，这也不难。我们老爷现在江西，","en":"answer.\\" Qiguan reproached him: \\"Why must it be dying and living? Brother, you are always cursing yourself.\\"\\n\\nZiyu said, \\"Just so — Yunong will always curse himself. Last year when you went into the Hua household, you said over and over that you would die of it, and yet here you are, out of it and well. Could you have imagined this then? And if you could not imagine"},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":6,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"都盛盘里，不觉凄然有感。见一个绝小的方锦匣子，揭开看时，是六颗骰子。琴仙放在手中，重新入席，拿了个空碟儿，对着子玉、琪官说道：「三心和同，有始有终。掷个全红。」璫琅一声掷下，却也奇怪，倒像有神明佑护着他，却好碰着六个全红。子玉大喜，琴仙也觉开怀。琪官笑了一笑，取骰子在手，也对着琴仙、子玉说道：「三心和同，后是相逢，二十四红。」又说道：「你们看我掷。」琴仙、子玉看","en":"found six dice inside. He took them in his hand, came back to the table, set out an empty saucer, and said to Ziyu and Qiguan, \\"Three hearts in accord, a beginning and an end. Let it come up all red.\\"\\n\\nDown they went with a clatter — and, strangely enough, as though some spirit were shielding him, all six came up red. Ziyu was delighted, and Qinxian's heart lifted."},{"paragraph":33,"mentions":6,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这一回也谈了许久，琴仙恐他义父回来，只得要早散，琪官也不好久留他。子玉想后日送他的人多，不好说话，便从身上解下一个小玉琴，送与琴仙道：「此是我常佩的东西，给你算个记念罢。」琴仙接了，一阵心酸，也从身边解下个五色玉梅花，递与子玉道：「这也是我常佩的。」子玉也收了，各人佩上。子玉道：「明日一天怎样？」琴仙道：「你也不用来了","en":"Qinxian, afraid his foster father might come back, insisted on breaking up early, and Qiguan could not well keep him. Ziyu, thinking that the day after tomorrow there would be too many people seeing him off for any word to pass between them, untied a small jade qin from his own dress and gave it to Qinxian. \\"I wear this always. Keep it for a remembrance.\\"\\n\\nQinxian took it"},{"paragraph":36,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"翁的盘费很富足了。子云、次贤各备车马跟着，一直送出城外，直到十里之外皇华亭。只见南湘、仲清、文泽、金粟、王恂、子玉、春航，领着那蕙芳、宝珠、素兰、漱芳、玉林、兰保、桂保、琪官、春喜九个名旦，在皇华亭等候。道翁等连忙下车，极口辞谢。各人皆要把盏。","en":"Envoys' Pavilion, ten miles away. Waiting there at the pavilion were Nanxiang, Zhongqing, Wenze, Jin Su, Wang Xun, Ziyu, and Chunhang, alongside Huifang and the nine famous performers: Baozhu, Sulan, Shufang, Yulin, Lanbao, Guibao, Qiguan, and Chunxi. Daoweng hurried down from his carriage and thanked everyone repeatedly, as they all eagerly wished to raise a cup in a"},{"paragraph":38,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴仙见了这九人，已觉悲酸万状。又见子玉躲在人后，在那里拭泪，不觉一阵心痛，头晕眼花，跌倒在地。慌得众人连忙扶起，拍的拍，唤的唤。把个子玉急得如痰迷心窍一般，直瞪瞪两眼，一句话说不出，泪落如雨。子云、次贤慌了，救醒了琴仙，便说道：「快扶他上车罢。」道翁交代家人刘喜好好服侍。子云谓道翁道：「","en":"Seeing these nine friends, Qinxian already felt a sour, unbearable ache in his heart. Then, catching a glimpse of Ziyu hiding behind the crowd and quietly wiping away tears, a sharp pain stabbed through his chest; his head spun violently, his vision darkened, and he collapsed to the ground. Everyone panicked instantly, rushing to lift him up, patting his back, and calling"},{"paragraph":40,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"双轮碾动如飞去，回首云山已渺茫。\\n众人劝回子玉，子玉直着眼睛望不见琴仙的车，才放声一哭而回。不知后事如何，且听下回分解。","en":"wheels grind and fly away; turning back, the clouded hills are already lost in hazy mist.\\nThe crowd gently urged Ziyu to return. Ziyu stood rigidly, staring blankly until he could no longer see Qinxian's carriage, and only then did he let out a loud, piercing cry and turn back, weeping inconsolably. To know what happens next, please listen to the following chapter."}],"49":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说子玉送了琴仙回来，这一急一痛，便出了神，旧病复发，足足病了一月始愈。后来颜夫人已知琴仙出了京，道翁养为义子，倒也替他欢喜。","en":"After sending Qinxian away, Ziyu suffered such acute shock and grief that his mind drifted into a stupor; his old illness relapsed, and a full month passed before he recovered. Later, when Lady Yan learned that Qinxian had left the capital and had been taken by Qu Daoweng as an adopted"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"限于成例不能保举的，真真令人可惜。此外呢？」子云道：「此外尚有几个，都是英才未发的人。翰林院侍读学士梅公之子名子玉，目下少年中有景星凤凰之誉。」苏侯点点头。子云又道：「已故翰林院编修颜庄之子名仲清，现任礼部尚书刘大人之子名文泽，内阁学士王大人之子名恂。此外，还有苏州拔贡生高品，湖南优贡生萧次贤。这几位都是名下无虚，与田修撰、史庶常朝夕观摩，是门生往来无间的。其余","en":"few others whose brilliant talents are yet unrevealed. The son of the Hanlin Reader-in-Waiting Mr. Mei, named Ziyu, is currently hailed among the youth as a resplendent star and a phoenix.\\" Su the Marquis nodded. Ziyun went on, \\"The son of the late Hanlin Compiler Yan Zhuang, named Zhongqing; the son of the current Minister of Rites Lord Liu, named Wenze; and the"}],"50":[{"paragraph":8,"mentions":5,"tokens":["子玉","庾香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"文泽问起子玉，还是前月初七日送行时见他。仲清道：「庾香以后大约未必肯出门的了，我们去看过他几次，他又病了几天，俨然去年夏天的模样。他这个元神，此时正跟着玉侬在长江里守风，只怕要送他到了南昌，才肯回来呢。」琪官听了，眉颦起来，神情之间，颇有感慨，说道：「初六那一日","en":"Wenze asked after Ziyu, noting he hadn't seen him since they saw him off on the seventh of the previous month. Zhongqing sighed, \\"Since Yuxiang left, it's unlikely he's willing to step out of the house. We've visited him a few times, and he's fallen ill again for days—he looks"}],"52":[{"paragraph":3,"mentions":2,"tokens":["梅子玉","子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"班。春航陪着一班名士在花园挹爽斋观演联锦班。那一天大媒是徐子云，客是萧次贤、高品、南湘、颜仲清、刘文泽、王恂、梅子玉。近日子玉病已好了，勉强打起精神出来。这八个名旦不消说都在园中，那聚星堂上一个也不去，尽是一班中年的脚色，与那些寻常的旦脚，在那里应酬。","en":"was Xu Ziyun, and the guests included Xiao Cixian, Gao Pin, Nanxiang, Yan Zhongqing, Liu Wenze, Wang Xun, and Mei Ziyu. Ziyu had only recently recovered from his illness, forcing himself to rally his spirits to attend. Naturally, all eight famous dan actors remained in the garden; not a single one went to the Gathering Stars Hall, which was left entirely to middle-aged"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"早上就开了戏，诸人一面看戏，一面欢笑，好不高兴。子玉见那些名旦之中，就只少了琴言，触景伤情，颇有一人向隅之惨，众人也都会意。忽不见了高品，子云命书童去找他，找到戏房后头，找着了。见高品在那里教王兰保的戏，兰保点头而笑。高品出来，装出正经样子，连笑话也都不说一句。少顷，王兰保来请点戏，送到子云面前，子云","en":"The opera commenced in the morning. Everyone watched the stage, laughing and reveling in high spirits. Ziyu, however, observing all the famed actors yet finding Qinyan alone missing, felt a sharp pang of sorrow at the sight, an agonizing sense of being 'one person alone in a corner.' The others silently understood his melancholy. At one point, Gao Pin suddenly"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":4,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，都不认识，内中见一个最年轻的，觉得如月光珠彩，凤举霞轩，骨重神清，风华雅丽，心里一惊，觉眼中从未见过这样人。子玉见华公子的品貌，也暗暗称赞：「清华贵重，仪表天然，果是不凡。」华公子一一见了，问明了子云。华公子道：「叙起来都也有世谊，小弟疏于交接，今日幸会，涤我尘衿。」诸名士也各述一番景仰，遂推华公子首坐。华公子如何肯坐，说道：「我们既幸会了，就与夙好一样。若以","en":"anything Young Master Hua had ever beheld. He was inwardly startled, realizing he had never seen such a person. Ziyu, in turn, observing Young Master Hua's bearing, silently praised him: 'So noble and refined, with a bearing entirely natural—truly extraordinary.' After introductions were made, Young Master Hua said, \\"Tracing our roots, we all share old family ties,"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":7,"tokens":["子玉","庾香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"即对子云道：「此君风韵不减袁、苏，貌类琴言，而聪明过之。」赞得素兰好不喜欢。华公子又问子玉道：「弟与尊兄虽初次识面，但心契已久。有个魏聘才，是府上搬出来，在弟处住了半年，常常提及阁下，并有一事倒要请教。」子玉不知问他何事，即答道：「魏世兄也时常提及尊府，但未识荆，不敢晋谒，不知有何赐教？」华公子道：「事本细微，但一时不能索解。闻得阁下与琴","en":"Qinyan's, his intelligence surpasses his.\\" Sulan was utterly delighted by the praise. Young Master Hua then addressed Ziyu, \\"Though you and I meet face-to-face for the first time, our hearts have long been aligned. A certain Wei Pincai, who moved out of your esteemed residence, lodged with me for half a year and frequently mentioned you. There is one matter I must ask for"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":4,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"素兰的扇子一面画的甚细，要了过来，看了一会。又见那一面写着小楷，题目是《断肠词》。华公子道：「肠何可以轻断？」子玉见了，又觉不安。华公子低低吟了一遍，又问素兰道：「这是你自己的么？」素兰道：「字与画都是胡乱涂写的，这词…」即指着子玉道：「就是梅少爷送玉侬的。」华公子折了扇子，对着子玉道：「看时就有几分猜着是吾兄手笔，非至情人不能道，果然，果然。」又笑道：「这梦魂","en":"titled *Heartbreak Lyrics*. Young Master Hua said, \\"How can the intestines be broken so casually?\\" Hearing this, Ziyu once again felt uneasy. Young Master Hua chanted the lines in a low voice, then asked Sulan, \\"Is this your own work?\\" Sulan replied, \\"The writing and painting are just casual daubs, but this lyric...\\" He pointed at Ziyu, \\"It is what Young Master Mei"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"：「金错园赏桃花和《桃花扇》曲。」春航道：「这楷书是闺阁笔迹。」众人看这两首词，情文互至，秀韵天然，赞叹不已。子玉道：「这第二首也像闺阁口气。」子云道：「不要是他夫人题的么？这两首像是唱和的。」仲清道：「未必，如果是他夫人写的，怎肯给人？」次贤道：「这话说得是。」诸名士在园内谈心，却说那聚星堂上，王文辉见诸名旦一个不来，颇觉岑寂，又不好意思去叫他们。想蕙芳在账房","en":"their intertwining emotion and literary grace, their natural and elegant rhythm, sighing in endless admiration. Ziyu noted, \\"This second piece truly sounds like a woman's voice.\\" Ziyun suggested, \\"Could his wife have written them? These two seem to be a harmonized exchange.\\" Zhongqing doubted this, \\"Not necessarily. If his wife had written it, how could he so casually"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":1,"tokens":["梅庾香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，朋友不像朋友，妓又不像妓么？然而写这片情，真写得消魂动魄。」华夫人道：「是度香作的么？」华公子道：「不是，是梅庾香，就是琴言向日的知己。」华夫人问道：「前日我写的扇子呢？你不要给人瞧。」华公子听了这句话，方想起给了素兰，就是这扇，心中甚悔一时没有留心，只得说道：「我不与人瞧，我恐扇旧了，已收起了。」华夫人也不疑心他给了人。将要出门，带了宝珠、爱珠、蕊珠、珍珠、明","en":"emotion is truly soul-shaking.\\" Lady Hua asked, \\"Did Duxiang write it?\\" Young Master Hua replied, \\"No, it was Mei Yuxiang, Qinyan's former confidant.\\" Lady Hua then asked, \\"Where is the fan I wrote for you the other day? You must not show it to anyone.\\" Hearing this, Young Master Hua suddenly remembered he had given that very fan to Sulan. Deeply regretting his carelessness,"}],"53":[{"paragraph":7,"mentions":4,"tokens":["梅庾香","庾香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴言用情专一，不善变通。倘使琴言一进京来，就遇公子，有这番恩典，他竟可以杀身相报，至死不怨的。」公子道：「他与梅庾香，到底是怎样交情？」素兰道：「他与梅庾香的交情，其实也不甚亲密，就是两心相照，悲多欢少，这是人人解不出来的。一见就哭，大约前世有点因果在里头。那日扶乩说琴言原是屈公前生之女，我想庾香前世，又是琴言什么，也未可知。」华公子道：「这事渺茫，譬如你作了琴言","en":"word of complaint even unto death.\\"\\n\\nYoung Master Hua asked, \\"What exactly is the true nature of his bond with Mei Yuxiang?\\"\\n\\nSulan said, \\"His friendship with Mei Yuxiang is not actually one of outward intimacy, but rather a mutual illumination of hearts—more sorrow than joy, something outsiders simply cannot parse. They weep at the mere sight of each other; there must be"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":2,"tokens":["庾香","子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"人五古一篇，并沿途七律八首。又见琴言另有一封信，子云拆开，内里是三封，一封是诸名士同启，一封是众弟兄同启，一封庾香才子手启。子云一一拆看，与他们及与诸名旦的写得已经沉痛，及看与子玉的信，是和的《金缕曲》，只见写着是：","en":"inside: one addressed jointly to the renowned scholars, one to the brothers, and one specifically to the talented Yuxiang. Ziyun read them one by one. The letters to the scholars and the famous dan actors were already deeply moving, but when he read the letter addressed to Ziyu, he found it was a *Jinlü Qu* (Jinlü Qu) composed in response to Ziyu's original lyric.\\n\\nIt read:"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":2,"tokens":["庾香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"。居两地、从今伊始。自古多情成积恨，恨东流、不接西流水。肠断矣！写此纸。\\n子云等看了大奇，道：「不料玉侬竟能与庾香那首工力悉敌，一样沉痛。」高品道：「玉侬学问几时长的？我去年没有见他能如此。」次贤道：「这是新进长的，不料受乃翁陶熔了几天，就这些进境。若过两年，不知要好到怎样呢！」南湘道：「我只道庾香这首词是绝唱，不能和的，谁又想和出这一首来，我看倒非玉侬不能。」","en":"this paper.\\"\\n\\nZiyun and the others read this with great astonishment. \\"Who could have expected Yunong to match Yuxiang's piece in both skill and profound sorrow?\\"\\n\\nGao Pin said, \\"When did Yunong's learning advance so much? I did not see him capable of this last year.\\"\\n\\nCixian said, \\"This is fresh growth; to think that after only a few days of his adoptive father's molding,"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":2,"tokens":["庾香","子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"餐，愿期后会，请自宽解，以侍晨昏。\\n夏秋多厉，千万珍重。琴言百拜。\\n子云等看了，叹息一会。子云道：「怎样呢？将庾香请来罢。」次贤道：「不可。这首词他若见了，必有一番伤心痛哭，那时在这里倒教他难为情。不如送去与他，索性使他哭个尽性罢。」子云即着人将琴言并道生的信，送与子玉。","en":"times.\\"\\n\\nZiyun and the others read it and sighed for a long while. Ziyun asked, \\"What should we do? Should we invite Yuxiang over?\\"\\n\\nCixian said, \\"We must not. If he sees this lyric here, it will surely provoke a bout of heartbreaking, bitter weeping, and it will be difficult for him to contain his emotions in public. It is better to send it to him, so he can simply weep to"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":17,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"却说子玉自前日春航处见了诸名旦，单少了琴言一人，又感伤了数日。一夜在睡梦中，忽见云儿走来道：「少爷，琴言回来了。」子玉听了大喜，即问道：「在哪里？」云儿道「就在门外。」子玉忙到大门外一望，只见烟水茫茫，查无涯涘，便失惊道：「这是什么地方？」迷迷离离，心无主意","en":"Since seeing all the famous performers at Chunhang's the other day—with only Qinyan absent—Ziyu had remained steeped in melancholy for days. One night, in the midst of a dream, he suddenly saw Yun'er approach and say, \\"Young Master, Qinyan has returned.\\"\\n\\nZiyu was overjoyed and quickly asked, \\"Where is he?\\"\\n\\n\\"Just outside the gate,\\" Yun'er replied."},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":4,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"把子玉一把搂紧。子玉大窘，只得叫道：「云儿快来！」那女郎又道：「呆郎，你叫什么？难道天下有女子调戏人的么？」子玉道：「你将何为？」那女郎道：「我也不过怜才爱貌的心，君固男子，岂无能为事耶？」子玉越急。正在无法，只见一个船拢将过来，船窗相对。却见琴言坐在舱里","en":"She pulled Ziyu into a tight embrace. Extremely embarrassed and distressed, Ziyu could only cry out, \\"Yun'er, come quickly!\\"\\n\\nThe woman mocked him again: \\"Foolish man, why are you shouting? Are there truly women in the world who seduce others unprovoked?\\"\\n\\n\\"What is"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":10,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉叫道：「玉侬救我！」那女郎发起怒来，将他一推，狠狠的骂了一句，道：「世间有此措大，令人气忿欲死！」子玉见两船相并，便从船舱里跨了过去。一见琴言，喜不可言，但仔细看他，果然是泪眼将枯，面黄于蜡，见了子玉，惟有掩面悲啼，子玉便觉心如刀割。琴言说道：「谁叫","en":"Ziyu cried out, \\"Yunong, save me!\\"\\n\\nThe strange woman flew into a rage, shoved him violently, and cursed him viciously: \\"That there is such a miserable pedant in the world—it makes one angry enough to die!\\"\\n\\nSeeing the two boats side by side, Ziyu stepped"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"明日，子云处送了琴言的和词来，子玉看了，一恸欲绝。过了半天，将这信与这词足足念了有百余遍，又喜琴言学问大进，竟成了名作，便缝了一个古锦囊，置了此词，佩在身上。不知后事如何，且听下回分解。","en":"The next day, Ziyun's household sent over Qinyan's response lyric. Upon reading it, Ziyu was so overcome with grief he nearly fainted. Over the course of the morning, he read the letter and the lyric fully a hundred times over. Yet amidst his sorrow, he was also overjoyed to see that Qinyan's learning had advanced so immensely, truly producing"}],"54":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说子玉得了琴言和词之后，悲楚了好几日。又想起那个梦，见琴言十分憔悴，不知是何吉凶，只是郁闷不解，终日精神涣散，涕泪沾巾。","en":"After receiving Qinyan's answering lyric, Ziyu remained in sorrow for days. He also kept recalling that dream in which Qinyan looked haggard, and he could not tell whether it boded good or ill. Depressed and unsettled, he drifted through his days listless, with tears constantly wetting his kerchief."},{"paragraph":2,"mentions":6,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"书回来，与颜夫人说在任上很好，也取了多少真才实学的士子。现今有个进士，保荐博学宏词进京，托他带了三千金回来。说子玉年已十九，可以完婚，若要等我任满回来，要到明年冬天，适或又有调动。更觉迟了。况王质夫又系至亲至好，一切可托仲清料理，不丰不俭，叫颜夫人办了这件亲事。又与子玉一个谕帖，说近日寄来诗文颇有些进境。今秋有宏词之试，你要自己明白，如可以自信去得，即求人保荐。","en":"for the Broad Learning and Grand Diction exam, was bringing back three thousand taels on his behalf. Mei said Ziyu was now nineteen and could marry; if they waited for his return at end of term, it might be next winter or later if transfer came. Since Wang Zhifu was a close kinsman and trusted friend, everything could be entrusted to Zhongqing. The wedding should"},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":7,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"论》八题。二试是《大礼赋》、《大乐赋》、《大搜赋》。三试《拟杜少陵北征诗》、《韩昌黎南山诗》，皆依元韵。这三场子玉甚是得意，第一试共有八百人，就贴去了五百，第二场止三百名了，第三场出榜时，只取了六十名。王恂已被落，高品取在四十九，仲清取在二十七，子玉取在第二。另期殿试，子玉文星照命，也占鳌头，共取了三十二名。仲清、高品才高运蹇，皆被落。此科最年轻者就是子玉一人，","en":"poems: *In the Style of Du Fu's Northern Expedition* and *Han Changli's South Mountain Poem*, plus original rhymes. Ziyu performed strongly across all three. From about eight hundred in session one, five hundred were cut; after session two, only three hundred remained; after session three, only sixty. Wang Xun was eliminated; Gao Pin placed forty-ninth, Zhongqing twenty-seventh,"},{"paragraph":37,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"听得从前有个什么琴言，害他病过几场，如今不知这琴言又怎样了。」却说王文辉定了九月十九日吉期，颜夫人写了家信，说子玉已中宏词，又即完姻，一切交与仲清办理。","en":"now?\\"\\n\\nWang Wenhui fixed the nineteenth of the ninth month for the wedding, and Lady Yan wrote home to say that Ziyu had passed the Broad Learning examination and was to be married at once, and that everything had been put in Zhongqing's hands."},{"paragraph":38,"mentions":4,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"里，便照常一样。过了几日，吉期已到，两边各请喜酒，还有那些名旦夹在里头，送戏送席的，闹了好几天。洞房花烛之夜，子玉一见，颇觉心花开放。说也奇怪，倒不是做书人说谎，也是前定姻缘，皇天可怜子玉这一片苦心，因琴言是个男子，虽与子玉有些情分，究竟不能配偶，故将此模样，又生个琼华小姐出来，与琴言上妆时一样，岂不是个奇事？此事颜夫人久知，当日见了琴言即说像他媳妇。这么看起来","en":"with famous performers woven throughout, delivering operas and feasts for several days. On the wedding night, Ziyu saw the bride and his heart bloomed. The narrator insists this was no fabrication: perhaps heaven, pitying Ziyu's long suffering, had fixed this fate in advance. Qinyan, being male, could never truly become spouse despite deep attachment; thus heaven"},{"paragraph":39,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一日，子玉在房中与琼华谈心，值馆中有事请他，即便穿衣出门。不意将个小锦囊落在地下。琼华拾起解开时，见折着两张字：一张认得是子玉笔迹，一首《金缕曲》，反复吟哦，甚觉悲楚，知是送别词。再看那一张，也是《金缕曲》，想是那人和的。又看了信笺写着琴言的名字，不觉心中甚喜","en":"One day Ziyu was talking privately with Qionghua when business from the academy called him out suddenly. In his haste he dropped a small old-brocade pouch on the floor. Qionghua picked it up and opened it, finding two folded sheets. One, in Ziyu's hand, was a *Jinlü"},{"paragraph":40,"mentions":10,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"少顷，子玉回来，一时倒想不起锦囊，忽见挂在那边，便吃了一惊。琼华故作不见，只见子玉欲取不取，如有所思，颇为可笑。子玉忍不住把锦囊取了下来，捏了一捏，空空的，心甚着忙，知道琼华取了去了。别样倒还可以辩，惟有那信上有琴言的名字，如何辩得来？欲要问时，又不好径问，只","en":"After a while Ziyu returned. At first the pouch went out of his head; then he saw it hanging there and started. Qionghua pretended not to see. Ziyu hovered, wanting to take it down and not taking it, with a thoughtful air that was rather comic. At last he could not help"},{"paragraph":41,"mentions":11,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"魂梦飞不到，试宵宵、彼此将名唤。墨和泪，请君玩。」这句也不消解，不过和墨和泪，请你看就是了。是这么解的不是？」子玉笑道：「解得一点不错。」琼华道：「我且问你，这人与你常相厮守，你却怎样位置他？」子玉道：「不过侍书捧研。」琼华道「侍书捧研，何用魂梦相唤？」子玉着了一分急，说道：「我说你是我的知己了，自然是洞见肺腑。谁道你也不能知我，何况他人？」琼华笑道：「我讲得这","en":"needs no explanation; it just means 'ink and tears, take this and see.' Is that how it is explained, or not?\\" Ziyu smiled awkwardly and said, \\"Explained without the slightest error.\\" Qionghua asked, \\"Let me ask you: this person lived in constant intimacy with you, but what position did you actually place him in?\\" Ziyu said, \\"Merely an attendant for books and ink.\\""}],"55":[{"paragraph":13,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子玉","庾香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"好么？」道翁道：「甚好！我见他们一班的后人，个个都是佳品。」石翁道：「都好么？」道翁道：「第一是梅铁庵的令郎名子玉，号庾香，竟是人中鸾凤。今年若考宏词，是必中的。」石翁笑道：「宏词科也没有什么稀奇，熟读《事类赋》三部就取得中宏词。」道翁道：「这是你老先生没有考上，所以题起你的牢骚来。」石翁道：「这也不然，我倒是公论。那梅铁庵的令郎怎么好呢？」道翁道：「第一相貌就","en":"of outstanding character.\\" Shiweng asked, \\"All of them?\\" Daoweng said, \\"The foremost is Mei Tie'an's son, named Ziyu, styled Yuxiang. He is truly a phoenix among men. If he sits for the Erudite Scholar exam this year, he is certain to pass.\\" Shiweng laughed, \\"The Erudite Scholar exam is nothing special. Anyone who thoroughly memorizes the three volumes of the *Rhapsodies"}],"56":[{"paragraph":3,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"同了琴仙，到燕子矶上逛了一逛，又到宏济寺看了悬崖撒手处，再到了铁索缆孤舟，名胜不一而足，直到天黑而回。琴仙想和子玉的词，便卧在床想了半夜才妥。明日依然大风，不能开船，即写了这首词，又写了一封信。此外又写了两封，一与众名士，一与众弟兄，与道翁的信一处封了。道翁命家人进城，交城守营加封递寄。","en":"countless breathtaking sights until darkness finally fell. That night, Qinxian worked out a lyric poem to match Ziyu's earlier composition, tossing in his bed for half the night before he was finally satisfied with the phrasing. The next day, the wind remained too high for them to safely sail. Taking advantage of the delay, Qinxian formally wrote out his new lyric"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「那边梅翰林来了。」琴仙回头一看，只见江山如画，是燕子矶边，自己仍在船上，道翁也不知去向。忽见一个船靠拢来，见子玉坐在舱里，长吁短叹。","en":"Swallow Bluff. He found himself on a boat once more, and Daoweng had vanished. Another boat drew alongside, where Ziyu sat in the cabin, sighing deeply."},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":5,"tokens":["子玉","庾香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴仙又触起心事，欲要叫他，那船已与他的船相并。琴仙又见他舱里走出一个美人来，艳妆华服，与子玉并坐。琴仙细看，却又大骇，分明就是他扮戏的装束，面貌一毫不错。自己又看看自己，想不出缘故来。见他二人香肩相并，哝哝唧唧，好不情深意密，心上看出气来。忽见那美人拿了一面镜子，他们两人同照，听得那美人笑吟吟的说道：「一镜分照两人，心事不分明。」听得子玉笑","en":"Qinxian's old sorrows stirred, and he meant to call out, but the boats gently collided. A beauty stepped from Ziyu's cabin, arrayed in gorgeous dress, and sat beside him. Qinxian looked closely and started in alarm: she was wearing his exact stage costume, and her face was identical to his own. He looked at himself and could not fathom the mystery. The pair sat shoulder"},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":1,"tokens":["梅庾香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"住了气道：「人也认得几个。」石翁道：「是些什么人？」琴仙道：「都是一班正正经经的，倒也没有那种假好人。徐度香、梅庾香之外，还有几人也是名士。」石翁笑道：「徐度香么，是晓山相国的公子，他与你相好么？」琴仙道：「是，现在先君还有一封遗书与他，托他照应的。」","en":"knew a few people.\\" \\"Whom?\\" Lord Hou pressed. \\"Serious men. They were not false friends. Besides Xu Duxiang and Mei Yuxiang, I knew a few other respectable scholars.\\" Lord Hou smiled knowingly. \\"Xu Duxiang, the esteemed son of Minister Xiaoshan. Are you two close?\\" Qinxian nodded stiffly. \\"Yes. My late father left a letter specifically asking him to look after me.\\""}],"57":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["梅子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"心，才能咏絮。于十月初十日，请了华公子的夫人苏浣香、田春航的夫人浣兰、刘文泽的夫人吴紫烟、颜仲清的夫人王蓉华、梅子玉的夫人琼华、王恂的夫人孙佩秋。此时园中菊花开满，五色斑烂。是日晴光和蔼，风不扬尘，小毛衣服都用不着，绵的尽够了。袁绮香一早带了十二红婢，还有几个家人媳妇，先到园里候客。那日次贤、高品、南湘皆回避了。那十二红都是十五六岁，有的已是云鬓堆鸦，有的还是垂髫","en":"wife, Su Huanxiang; Tian Chunhang's wife, Huanlan; Liu Wenze's wife, Wu Ziyan; Yan Zhongqing's wife, Wang Ronghua; Mei Ziyu's wife, Qionghua; and Wang Xun's wife, Sun Peiqiu. By this time, the garden's chrysanthemums were in full bloom, a brilliant tapestry of five colors. The day's sunlight was gentle, the wind stirred no dust, and light fur garments were unneeded as padded"}],"59":[{"paragraph":3,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"刘喜道：「要便人要天天有的，折差、塘报那一日没有？你写起来，我去寄就是了。」琴仙于是哀哀切切，写了几封信与子玉、子云、蕙芳诸人，要他们专人来接他回去，子云信内并封着屈道翁遗言。写了一天，刘喜托便寄了。后来寺中又做起法事来，男女混杂，游人挤满。琴仙屋里常有人来张张望望的，琴仙好不气闷。刘喜见度日艰难，就算京里有人来接他们，也须两月之久，就到年底去了。便想出个法","en":"and I will go and send them.\\" With a sorrowful heart, Qinxian poured his grief into several letters addressed to Ziyu, Ziyun, Huifang, and the others, pleading with them to send someone specifically to take him back. In the letter to Ziyun, he also enclosed Qu Daoweng's dying testament. After a full day of writing, Liu Xi entrusted the letters to a courier. Later on,"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"府正詹事，又升了都察院左副都御史，复升吏部左侍郎，现着来京供职。江西学政改放了陆宗沅。梅侍郎近又得了家信，已知子玉取了宏词，授职编修，又知娶了媳妇，心中大乐，即日起身还京。官场应酬无暇细述，自然纷纷的阻道送行。梅侍郎于十一月初一日起程，正是一帆风送滕王阁。行了十日，到了南京，要在家耽搁几天，祭扫坟墓，查理田园，周恤亲戚。到了两日，第三日去拜制台，谈了一会。","en":"Education Commissioner of Jiangxi. Recently, Vice Minister Mei had also received letters from home, learning that Ziyu had successfully passed the Erudite Scholastic examination, had been appointed as a Compiler, and had even taken a wife. Overjoyed by this news, he set out for the capital that very day. The endless official farewells require no detailed recounting;"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"翁一封奠仪，自己备了祭桌，到护国寺来。刘喜手忙脚乱，请个小和尚看了摊子，进来伺候。琴仙穿了孝衣，帏间俯伏，知是子玉的父亲，心里虽喜，然倒有些虚心，恐他风闻前事，问起他的根本来，甚是惶恐。只见梅侍郎进来上了香，奠了酒，行了礼，请出琴仙来。琴仙上前叩谢了。梅侍郎挽起，先把琴仙一看，点了一点头，叹了一声，道：「道翁可为有子。」便问：「世兄尊庚多少？」琴仙答道：「十七岁","en":"stall and hurried inside to serve. Qinxian, dressed in mourning white, knelt behind the curtain. Knowing this was Ziyu's father, his heart swelled with joy, yet a nagging apprehension lingered, fearful that the man might have caught wind of past rumors and would question his origins. With great trepidation, he watched as Vice Minister Mei entered, offered incense, poured"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"梅侍郎半信不信的道：「明日我且去看看，问问地方，可以买得，就是那块。」琴仙一面看那梅侍郎的相貌，却与子玉半点不像，生得身瘦而长，一脸秋霜，凛然可畏，将近五十岁光景。","en":"spoke, Qinxian quietly studied Vice Minister Mei's features, noting that he bore not the slightest resemblance to Ziyu. Mei was tall and lean, his face weathered like autumn frost, projecting an awe-inspiring, formidable presence, appearing to be nearing fifty years of age."},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"梅侍郎于二十八日开船在船上也是寂寞，倒将琴仙当着子玉一样，朝夕相依。又见他稳重灵警，十分契爱，又试他书本上虽未用过功，而诗词杂艺颇觉聪明，因想到京后，慢慢的再教他读书，学作文字。惟琴仙绝不敢题起认得子玉，心里还怕问他的出身，如果问他，只好撒两句谎，支吾遮饰，再不知道乃尊梦中已嘱咐了他。船到王家营子起旱","en":"Vice Minister Mei set sail on the twenty-eighth. Feeling lonely on the boat, he treated Qinxian just as he would Ziyu, keeping him by his side from morning till night. Observing Qinxian's steady demeanor and sharp intellect, Mei grew exceedingly fond of him. Testing the boy's knowledge, he found that although Qinxian hadn't devoted much effort to formal classical studies,"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":3,"tokens":["子玉","梅庾香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"再说子玉见父亲超升了侍郎，喜出望外。已得了江西所发之信，计日早可到京，为何至今未到。颜夫人盼望，更不必说，王文辉也是常来问信。那日已是腊月十五，早上送了一封信来，子玉看信面上是：「江西学政梅宅梅庾香少爷手启，屈勤先寄。」心中大喜，知琴仙到了江西任所了，便忙拆","en":"Meanwhile, Ziyu was overjoyed to learn of his father's exceptional promotion to Vice Minister. He had already received letters sent from Jiangxi, and by his calculations, his father should have reached the capital long ago. Why was he still not here? Lady Yan's anxious"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":5,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"逃奴辈窃去，守棺萧寺，衣食全无，又屡遭侯石翁戏侮，本拟一死，又因旅榇无归，故尔暂延残喘，务祈设法着人前来等语。子玉不觉泪如泉涌，万箭攒心，毫无主意，也不忍再看。便吩咐套车到怡园找子云，谁知次贤、子云、南湘、高品没有一个在园子里，子玉更加着急。跟班们不知何事，又不敢问子玉，便又到九香楼，进去见诸名旦都在园中，南湘、高品、金粟都在这里。子玉不及叙话，一脸悲愁，就将琴","en":"entirely bereft of food and clothing, and that he had been repeatedly harassed and humiliated by Hou Shiweng, Ziyu's heart shattered. The letter stated that Qinxian had intended to end his own life, but because the traveling coffin remained unburied, he was temporarily clinging to his fleeting breath, desperately praying that they would find a way to send someone"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"又将道翁的遗言拆读，更加泪落如雨。子玉等与众人看了，个个大哭了一场，哭得九香楼下好不热闹。众人哭毕，子云道：「此事在我，明日即着人到江南去接玉侬回来，并办道翁葬事。但今年不能到了。」子云即回，要告诉次贤商量此事。子玉也无心在九香楼，便即回家。高品，史南湘金粟与那些名旦，各惆怅无欢。子云回","en":"When they tore open and read Daoweng's dying testament, their tears fell even more heavily, like rain. After Ziyu and the others finished reading, every one of them wept bitterly, their cries making the base of the Nine-Fragrance Tower ring with grief. Once their weeping subsided, Ziyun spoke up: \\"Leave this matter to me. Tomorrow, I will dispatch men to Jiangnan"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云发了一千银子，打发家人星夜下了江南。子玉连天的悲苦，日间不敢进内，一来怕颜夫人问他，二来怕琼华小姐看出，正是他的苦楚，比人更胜几倍。但心上有这样心事，脸上如何装得过来？颜夫人倒疑心他怕见父亲，想是他父亲就回来，因此着急。惟有那琼华小姐，异样心灵，便料定他另有心事，再三盘诘，子玉只得直说了。","en":"issued a thousand taels of silver and dispatched his servants to travel to Jiangnan by the light of the stars. Ziyu was steeped in endless sorrow day after day. During the daytime, he didn't dare enter the inner quarters; firstly, he feared Lady Yan would question him, and secondly, he was afraid Miss Qionghua would see through him—his suffering was, after all, several"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":8,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"过了几日，又得了梅侍郎家信。头站人已回，说二十三日就到了，便把子玉急上加急。若父亲回来拘管住他，那就要闷死了。正是悲尽欢来，到了二十二日，子玉同了仲清接出三十里之外，住了宿店。等到定更时侯，头站才到，却是新收的家人，子玉不相认识，店家与他说了，才进来叩见，说老爷的轿子也就到了，今日是破站走的。子玉等到二更，听得门外","en":"Vice Minister Mei. The advance party had returned, reporting that he would arrive on the twenty-third, which made Ziyu even more frantic. If his father returned and kept him under strict confinement, he would suffocate to death. It was truly a case of sorrow reaching its limit and turning into joy; on the twenty-second, Ziyu and Zhongqing rode out thirty li from the"},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":4,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"士燮道：「这个是我的小儿，那个是我的内侄颜剑潭。」又对子玉、仲清道：「这是屈道生先生的令郎，同我进京的，其中缘故，此是也不及细说。你们见见，将来要在一处的。」子玉始而大骇，继而大乐，竟乐得笑将出来。琴仙见了子玉，笑容满面，也觉喜欢，上前与二人见了礼，彼此面面相觑，心里明白，口里却都无话可讲。士燮当着他们初次","en":"Shixie said, \\"This is my youngest son, and that is my nephew by marriage, Yan Jiantan.\\" He then turned to Ziyu and Zhongqing and said, \\"This is the son of the scholar Qu Daosheng, who traveled with me to the capital. There are reasons behind this that I don't have time to detail right now. You should greet him; you will be spending a lot of time together in the"},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"个不敢问，一个不敢说，仲清心上也不知姑父知道琴仙细底不知，也不便问，只好心内细细的默想，竟是三个哑子聚在一处。子玉与琴仙只好以眉目相与语，一会儿大家想着了苦，都低头颦眉泪眼的光景，一会儿想到此番聚会，也是梦想不到，竟能如此，便又眉欢眼笑起来，倒成了黄梅时节阴晴不定的景象。少顷，送饭进来，琴仙吃了。","en":"so he could only silently ponder the situation in his heart. It was as if three mutes had gathered in one room. Ziyu and Qinxian could only communicate with their eyes. One moment, they recalled the bitter pain of the past, bowing their heads, knitting their brows, their eyes welling with tears; the next moment, realizing that this reunion, which they hadn't even dared"},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":3,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"那边士燮已安歇，琴仙困乏已甚，支持不住，便躺在炕上，子玉、仲清也都在炕上坐了。家人们出去，今日幸喜云儿没跟来，仲清也是新用的人，都不认识琴仙，故此一宵无话。后来三人都也困乏，便都躺下，人静之后，细细的谈起来。此刻子玉、琴仙在一个枕上和衣而卧，竟把嫌疑也忘了，琴仙便哝哝唧唧说出京时如何想念，在南京如何游玩，","en":"rest. Qinxian was exhausted beyond measure and couldn't hold on any longer, so he lay down on the kang, while Ziyu and Zhongqing sat beside him. The servants left the room; fortunately, Yun'er had not come along today, and Zhongqing was accompanied by newly hired men who didn't recognize Qinxian, so the night passed quietly without incident. Eventually, all three"},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":4,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"欢离合，真也奇极了。」后来，琴仙又讲到他梦见神娥授笔，道翁成神，并舟中彼此照镜正面反面，怎样又化了珠为龙抢去，子玉、仲清连连称异。子玉也将送行后怎样得病，得信后怎样悲伤，众人怎样祭奠道翁，度香已着人下了江南来接你并安葬道翁，直说到今日再想不着你来，二人又复悲喜交集。琴仙又复感激子云与众人，不住在枕上与子玉、仲清连连叩头。仲清问道：「你一路来，姑父知道你的事不知道","en":"reflected each other's fronts and backs in mirrors, and how the pearl had turned into a dragon and been snatched away. Ziyu and Zhongqing marveled repeatedly at these tales. Ziyu then shared how he had fallen ill after their parting, his devastating grief upon receiving the letters, how everyone had offered sacrifices to Daoweng, and how Duxiang had sent men down to Jiangnan"},{"paragraph":30,"mentions":5,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，姑父既看重他今日，也只好将他从前的倒说明了，彼此相安。况姑母甚说他好，如今转了一劫，也决不再题起以往的了。」子玉道：「甚好，但我不便说，还是你去说。」仲清应了，以后大家也就睡着了。到天明时，仲清先醒，只见琴仙枕着子玉的手，尚呼呼睡着，子玉也未睡醒。仲清暗笑，唤醒了他们。琴仙见与子玉一枕，且枕着他的膀子，被仲清见了，甚是羞愧。子玉一个膀子被他枕得很酸也不知觉，及","en":"him. Now that he has survived this tribulation and turned a new leaf, no one will ever bring up the past again.\\" Ziyu agreed, \\"That is a very good plan, but it's not convenient for me to say it. You should be the one to go and speak with them.\\" Zhongqing agreed, and after that, everyone finally drifted off to sleep. When dawn broke, Zhongqing woke first and saw Qinxian"},{"paragraph":31,"mentions":4,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"士燮起来，急急的叫上车进城，三十里路甚快，一个多时辰已到了。梅侍郎且不到家，先宿了庙，明日五鼓时分上朝复命。子玉先将琴仙在书房里安顿了。梅进、云儿一见琴仙，个个骇异，又猜是他，又猜不是他。若说是他，为何老爷与他抗礼？且又穿着素服，像个有孝的人。若说不是他，面貌再没有这般相像的了。众人疑疑惑惑，猜不出来，又听得叫屈大爷，便知不是。子玉趁这空儿，就请仲清对颜夫人讲","en":"a temple first, preparing to attend court and report back to the Emperor at the fifth watch the next morning. Ziyu first settled Qinxian in the study. As soon as Mei Jin and Yun'er saw Qinxian, they were utterly astonished, guessing first that it was him, and then that it wasn't. If it was him, why did the master treat him as an equal? And why was he wearing plain"},{"paragraph":33,"mentions":3,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琼华小姐进房，子玉同了进来。琼华道：「如今好了，是不要做梦，天天的呼唤了。」子玉笑道：「我去同他进来见太太，你出去看看像不像？」琼华啐了一声，忽又说道：「你去同他进来见太太，我真要望望他。」子玉果然拉了琴仙进来，到内堂拜见了颜夫人。夫人见了，也甚疼他，便叫了一声：「屈","en":"Miss Qionghua entered the room, and Ziyu followed her in. Qionghua said, \\"Well, things are fine now. You won't have to keep dreaming and calling out for him every single day.\\" Ziyu laughed, \\"I'm going to bring him in to meet my mother. Why don't you step outside and see if he looks the part?\\""},{"paragraph":34,"mentions":5,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"燮十分喜欢。颜夫人同着谈了一回，后将琴仙的事委委婉婉说了出来，就说他唱过戏，屈道翁见他人品好，所以收为义子。将子玉害病的话，却隐藏不题。士燮道：「我已猜着了几分。」也将屈道翁梦中之言说了，又道：「前事也不必论他。这个孩子甚好，没有一点优伶习气，不说破真令人看不出来。」颜夫人道：「看这个孩子，将来有些造化也未可定的。」士燮点头，索性叫了梅进进来，将琴仙之事与他说明","en":"that Qu Daoweng, seeing his excellent character, had adopted him as his son. She deliberately hid the details of Ziyu's illness, making no mention of it. Shixie said, \\"I had already guessed as much.\\" He then shared the words Qu Daoweng had spoken to him in his dream, adding, \\"There's no need to dwell on the past. This child is very good, without the slightest trace"},{"paragraph":35,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴仙初来不好出门，一日子玉带了他到众名士处一走，都相见了，齐与子玉称贺。又到了九香楼，见了九名旦，都各悲喜交集。琴仙也喜诸人都跳出了孽海，保全了清白身子，各诉离情，牵衣执手的足足谈了一天。正是：","en":"At first, Qinxian was reluctant to go out. One day, however, Ziyu took him to visit the various renowned scholars. Everyone met with him and offered their congratulations to Ziyu in unison. They then went to the Nine-Fragrance Tower and met with the nine famous dans, each encounter filled with a mix of sorrow and joy."}],"60":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["梅子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说新年已过，又到元宵，六街三市，火树银花，好不热闹。子云于十三日请了华公子、田春航、梅子玉、史南湘、高品、颜仲清、刘文泽、王恂、萧次贤、金粟、屈勤先，并九香园诸人，作一大会。琴仙见了华公子，尚有些不安，华公子也不问起前事，以礼相待。此时琴仙已出了旦党，入了士党，但从前作旦时傲睨一切，此刻倒谦谦自守起来，因此上下诸人更加尊重他，绝没有一个人","en":"blazed in bustling splendor. On the thirteenth, Ziyun hosted a grand gathering for Young Master Hua, Tian Chunhang, Mei Ziyu, Shi Nanxiang, Gao Pin, Yan Zhongqing, Liu Wenze, Wang Xun, Xiao Cixian, Jin Su, Qu Qinxian, and the entire company of Nine-Fragrance Garden. Seeing Young Master Hua, Qinxian still felt a trace of unease, yet Hua asked nothing of past affairs, treating"},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"？」春航道：「妙，妙！此像要画得像，不必说真姓真名，缀个别号，每人做一篇赞语，说得似真似幻的，要与人花两合。」子玉道：「这个图怎样的好呢？还是单画人，还是补景呢？」仲清道：「自然单画人，一并的画去，后就缀小传一篇。刻石之后，可以拓出来，或裱册页，或裱手卷，皆可传世。」文泽道：「做两块好，就镶嵌在东西两楹。」王恂道：「若画杜仙女，就画他在采莲船上的样子。」吉甫道：","en":"will have a eulogy, written to sound half-real and half-illusory, blending the person and the flower into one.\\" Ziyu asked, \\"How should the compositions be handled? Should it be figures alone, or figures with a background?\\" Zhongqing answered, \\"Naturally, figures alone. We paint them in sequence, then append a short biography to each. Once carved in stone, rubbings"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"写起阄来，将屈道翁与杜仙女、屈琴仙分做二阄，其余九人分作九阄。说也奇怪，想必文字有灵，前生缘法，子云拈了道翁，子玉拈了杜仙女、琴仙，金粟拈了宝珠，春航拈了蕙芳，仲清拈了琪官，文泽拈了春喜，南湘拈了兰保，王恂拈了桂保，高品拈了玉林，次贤拈了漱芳，单拈不着素兰，只好送与华公子去作了。众人分派已定，子玉说道：「做传容易，画画难，还要刻石，更须时日，不知几天可以告成？」","en":"Curiously enough, as if the written word possessed a spirit and past-life affinities were at play, Ziyun drew Daoweng; Ziyu drew Fairy Du and Qinxian; Jin Su drew Baozhu; Chunhang drew Huifang; Zhongqing drew Qiguan; Wenze drew Chunxi; Nanxiang drew Lanbao; Wang Xun drew Guibao; Gao Pin drew Yulin; and Cixian drew Shufang. Sulan alone was not drawn, so that assignment was"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉同了琴仙回家，正是内有韵妻，外有俊友，名成身立，清贵高华，好不有兴。子云写了一札与华公子为素兰作传。这边次贤妙腕灵思，画了十天才成。画成又请吉甫一一的改好，画一个，刻一个，倒也甚快。子云因受了感冒甚重，不敢用心，嘱将道翁、琴仙、杜仙女画在一幅，并求子","en":"Ziyu returned home with Qinxian. With a graceful wife within and a handsome friend without, his fame established and his station secure, he was in the highest of spirits. Ziyun wrote a letter to Young Master Hua, requesting a biography for Sulan. Meanwhile,"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"总持九香花主、三闾道君及左右花史杜仙之像。下有赞语，是子玉手笔：","en":"Nine-Fragrance Flowers, Daoist Lord of Sanlu, with Attendants and Flower Historian Fairy Du.\\"\\nBeneath it was a eulogy in Ziyu's handwriting:"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":1,"tokens":["庾香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"道：「不是我，这是蟾宫花史。」众人说道：「这些诗词赞语，他们倒是争奇角胜，那里记着本人？就是竹君的诗，与静宜、庾香这两个赞语，倒是切定题目说的。」琴仙道：「都切得很。你将这些诗更换了人，便不像了。」宝珠道：「只有静芳那一首，再不能更换的。」琴仙再看第十一方，画一个杏花，下有一个仙女，珠腰玉衱，十分妩媚，题曰：及第花史。知是琪官，看颜仲清的序文：","en":"among them actually remembers the person they're writing about? Only Zhujun's poem and the eulogies for Jingyi and Yuxiang actually stick to the subject.\\" Qinxian disagreed, \\"They are all very fitting. If you swapped the poems around to different people, they wouldn't make sense anymore.\\" Baozhu added, \\"Only Jingfang's piece is absolutely irreplaceable.\\" Qinxian then looked"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子玉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴仙心上甚喜，就辞了回家，到晚上构思起来，子玉面前也未讲起。这一晚各人的赞已做成。","en":"took his leave and went home, spending the evening composing his thoughts without even mentioning the plan to Ziyu. By the end of that night, everyone had finished composing their eulogies."}]}`),"char-1":JSON.parse(`{"1":[{"paragraph":52,"mentions":1,"tokens":[],"kind":"identified-reference","zh":"车里坐着一个老年的，外面坐了两个妙童，都不过十四五岁。","en":"Ziyu couldn't stop laughing to himself all the way. \\"Why do these people turn their minds so hazy and blind, failing to distinguish black from white, all for a few young dan? If a truly peerless beauty were to appear right now, I fear they would actually say he looked terrible.\\" Lost in these thoughts along the way, his carriage suddenly became wedged in a crowded bottleneck. Ziyu caught a waft of a pure, fresh fragrance—neither orchid nor musk—and peeked out through the glass window on the curtain. He saw a carriage opposite them. Inside sat an elderly man, and on the outside sat two wondrous young boys, both no more than fourteen or fifteen.","identityNote":{"en":"Chapter 2 identifies the three carriage occupants retrospectively as Qinyan, Qiguan and Ye Maolin.","zh":"第2回回叙此番挤车，明言同车者为琴官、琪官与叶茂林。"}}],"2":[{"paragraph":13,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这已经算个绝色了。更有一个唱闺门旦的叫琴官，十五岁了。他的好处，真教我说不出来。要将世间的颜色比他，也没有这个颜色。要将古时候的美人比他，我又没有见过古时候的美人。世间的活美人，是再没有这样好的。就是画师画的美人，也画不到这样的神情眉目。他姓杜，或者就是杜丽娘还魂？不然，就是杜兰香下嫁。除了","en":"suffice to declare him a peerless beauty. Yet there was another, portraying the sequestered maiden, a youth named Qinguan, merely fifteen years of age. His beauty transcends the boundaries of earthly language. To compare him to the beauties of this world is futile, for no such exquisite coloring exists in reality. Though one might liken him to the celebrated beauties of"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":3,"tokens":["琴官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"到了，不要他说的就是我见的，那一班人却像从南边来的模样。」便又问道：「你说那个顶好的叫什么名字？」聘才道：「叫琴官。那个叫琪官。」子玉道：「琴官进城那一天穿的什么衣裳？」聘才道：「都是蓝绉绸皮袄，酱色呢得胜褂。」子玉见衣服已经对了，又问：「他一人一个车呢，还与人同坐一个车？」聘才道：「他与琪官、叶茂林同坐一个车，那车围是蓝布的，骡子是白的。」子玉又道：「那叶茂林","en":"from the south.\\" He then asked, \\"What did you say the most beautiful one was named?\\" Pincai replied, \\"He is named Qinguan. The other is Qiguan.\\" Ziyu pressed on, \\"What garments was Qinguan wearing on the day he entered the city?\\" Pincai described, \\"Both wore fur coats of blue crepe silk beneath outer riding jackets of dark brown wool.\\" Ziyu, noting the match in attire,"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「比京里那些红相公怎样？」子玉笑道：「前日车里那两个，我皆目所未见，那个琴官更为难得，但不知此时在什么班里？」聘才道：「明日我出去打听，打听着了，我们去听他的戏。」子玉点头，再要问时，忽见灯光一亮，一个小丫头在门外说道：「太太叫请少爷早些睡罢。」子玉只得起身进去。这一宿就把聘才的话想了又想，又将车中所见模样神情，细细追摹一回","en":"capital?\\" Ziyu smiled, \\"The two I saw in the carriage the other day surpass anything my eyes have ever beheld, with Qinguan being a rarity beyond measure. Yet, I wonder which troupe they have joined?\\" Pincai proposed, \\"I shall make inquiries tomorrow. Once I have word, we shall go and hear them perform.\\" Ziyu nodded in agreement, but just as he was about to speak again, the"},{"paragraph":42,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"文辉赏了桂保二十两银子，桂保谢了，走到书房来找王恂、仲清，谈了一会，说道：「我们班里新来了两个：一个叫琴官，一个叫琪官，生得色艺俱佳，只怕史竹君的《花选》又要翻刻了。」又坐了一会也自回去。不知后事如何，且听下回分解。","en":"They conversed for a time before Guibao revealed, \\"Two new performers have recently joined our troupe, one named Qinguan, the other Qiguan. Both are exquisitely beautiful and remarkably talented. I fear Shi Zhujun's Selection of Flowers will require yet another printing.\\" He lingered a while longer before finally departing for home. As for what unfolded next, you must"}],"3":[{"paragraph":4,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这样看起来，那琴官虽然生得天仙似的，只怕未必比得上这一班」。忽又转念道：「这书上说的，也怕有些言过其实。","en":"\\"By this measure,\\" he mused further, \\"though Qinguan possesses an otherworldly beauty, even he might not surpass this echelon of performers.\\" Then another thought struck him: \\"And yet what this book says may well be somewhat overstated.\\""},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"若论相貌，我看世界上未必赛得过琴官。」重新又将这八个人的光景逐一摹拟一番，又牢牢的记了一记。只见四儿跑进来说道：「同路来的叶先生找少爷说话，现在账房里。」聘才说：「这也奇了，他怎的到这里来。」就将《花谱》在枕头底下，带上房门出来。","en":"\\"As for sheer physical grace, I doubt anyone in this world could eclipse Qinguan.\\" He closed his eyes, vividly summoning the images of the eight performers described, etching them into his mind. Just then, Si'er came running in, breathless: \\"Master Ye, who traveled with you on the boat, is looking for the young master—he is waiting"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"怎样新鲜，脚色怎样齐全，小旦怎样装束好看，园子里怎样热闹，堂会戏怎样排场，说得聘才十分高兴。问起同船的人来，知琴官在曹长庆处，现今患了几天病，也渐渐好了。","en":"Pincai listened, thoroughly enchanted. Inquiring after their fellow passengers from the boat, he learned that Qinguan was residing with Cao Changqing; having suffered a brief illness, he was now on the mend."},{"paragraph":40,"mentions":3,"tokens":["琴官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"个相好，是从前南京藩台的少爷，与我们也有世谊。他请我吃饭，叫了个相公，也是上等的。」子玉道：「大哥，你前日说那琴官脾气不好，又爱哭，是怎样脾气？」聘才道：「那琴官的脾气是少有的，大约托生时，阎罗王把块水晶放在他心里，又硬又冷，绝没有一点怜悯人的心肠。这个人与他讲情字，是不必题了。我因为他脑袋生得好，生了一片怜香惜玉之心，奴才似的巴结他，非但不能引他笑一笑，倒几次","en":"young dan of the very finest caliber.\\" Ziyu, intrigued, asked, \\"Elder Brother, the other day you mentioned that Qinguan possessed a difficult temper and was prone to weeping. What manner of temperament is it, exactly?\\" Pincai paused, his eyes distant. \\"Qinguan's nature is an extreme rarity. When he was cast into this world, I suspect the King of Hell embedded a shard"}],"4":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琴官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"却说子玉正在体贴琴官心事，只听元茂开着风门说道：「了不得了。」倒把子玉等唬了一跳，问道：「为什么大惊小怪？」元茂道：「你看地下已铺了一层，这棉花大的朵子下起来，一夜就有一尺多了。」子玉同聘才到门口看时，果然飘飘洒洒，下起雪来。子玉道：「这腊雪是最好的。今年一冬风燥，现在","en":"To return to our story: Ziyu was brooding over Qinguan's heavy heart when he heard Yuanmao fling open the vestibule door and cry out, \\"Something terrible has happened!\\" Startled, Ziyu and the others asked why he was making such a fuss. \\"Look at the ground,\\" Yuanmao said, \\"it is already blanketed. With flakes"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琴官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉是不能饮酒的，勉强相陪。又将琴官的光景来问聘才，聘才见他心甚注意，便改了口风，索性将琴官的身分、性气一赞，赞得子玉更为倾慕。又想这个雪天，若见琼枝玉立，何异瑶岛看花，真笑党家锦帐中，醇酒羔羊，终不脱武夫气象矣。吃完之后，煮雪煎茶，闲谈一会，聘才、元茂各自回房去了。","en":"Unable to drink wine, Ziyu merely made a show of accompanying the others. He turned again to Pincai to ask after Qinguan. Seeing how entirely Ziyu's thoughts were captivated, Pincai shifted his tone, speaking of Qinguan's bearing and temperament with nothing but soaring praise, leaving Ziyu all the more ardently enamored. Ziyu thought to himself how, on such a snowy day,"},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琴官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"家伺候，改日再奉陪罢。」元茂撅了嘴不言语。仲清等告辞而去，子玉送出大门，进来与聘才、元茂又谈了一会诗，忽又问起琴官来。聘才见他有点意思，便轻轻的挑他一句道：「改日何不偷个空儿，同去认认那个琴官。」元茂道：「明日就去，我只说去看路上同来的朋友。」指着子玉道：「你说到王家去回拜他们。只要出了这两扇牢门，还怕什么人？」子玉笑道：「过几日再看。」且按下这边。","en":"came back inside, and chatted with Pincai and Yuanmao for a while about the poems, then suddenly again brought up Qinguan. Seeing that Pincai had developed a certain intent, he quietly threw out a hint: \\"Another day, why not steal a moment to come with me and make Qinguan's acquaintance?\\" Yuanmao said, \\"Let us go tomorrow. I shall just say I am going to see friends who"},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琴官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"第七，我定了第八，我以后再不做这不通诗了。等我学了一年，再与他们来。」又说道：「我们班里来了两个新脚色，一个叫琴官，一个叫琪官，你们见过没有？」仲清道，「前日蕊香说起两人来，刚说时就有人来打断了，没有说下去。」王恂问道：「这两人怎样？」春喜道：「好极了，那个琴官，与瑶卿不相上下。那个琪官，与蕊香难定高低。此刻都还没有上台，但一天已有三五处叫他。前日度香见了，也大","en":"then come back and compete with them.\\" Then he added, \\"Two new performers have come to our company. One is called Qinguan, one is called Qiguan. Have you met them?\\" Zhongqing said, \\"The other day Ruixiang mentioned the two of them, but just as he was starting to say something, someone interrupted and he never finished.\\" Wang Xun asked, \\"What are these two like?\\" Chunxi"},{"paragraph":33,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这两人是要大出名的。就是琴官脾气冷些，不大好说话。」这边正在谈心，忽听对面楼上，窗子一响，也开了。仲清等举目看时见一个美少年，服饰甚都，身穿肃鸟霜裘，头戴紫貂冠，面如冠玉，唇若涂朱，目光眉彩觉有凌云之气，举止大雅，气象不凡。看他年纪，不过二十余岁的光景，带了四个相公，倚着楼窗而","en":"\\"These two are going to make a great name for themselves. Only Qinguan's temperament is a bit cool; he is not very easy to talk to.\\" Just as they were deep in conversation here, suddenly the window on the opposite west balcony opened with a sound. Zhongqing and the others looked up to see a beautiful young man, splendidly"}],"5":[{"paragraph":8,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琴官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一日，子云在堂会中，见了新来的琴官、琪官两个，十分赞赏，叹为创见，正与那八个名旦一气相孚，才生了物色的念头。叫袁宝珠改日同他们到园来。又见他们的服饰未美，即连夜制造了几套，赏给了他们，这两个相公自然感激的了。但那个琴官，却又不然。且先将他的出身略叙一叙。","en":"One day, at a theatrical gathering, Ziyun encountered two newly arrived performers, Qinguan and Qiguan, and was greatly impressed. He marveled that such talent was unprecedented, seeing that they were perfectly suited to stand alongside the eight famous dan performers. This kindled his desire to cultivate their acquaintance. He asked Yuan Baozhu"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琴官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这个琴官姓杜，父亲叫做杜琴师，以制琴弹琴为业，江苏缙绅子弟争相延请教琴，因此都称他为杜琴师。生了这个儿子就以琴字为名，叫为琴官。","en":"Qinguan's surname was Du. His father was known as Du Qinshi, Master Du the Qin-player, who made his living by crafting and performing on the qin zither. The sons of gentry throughout Jiangsu vied to invite him to give lessons, and so everyone called him Du Qinshi."},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":5,"tokens":["琴官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴官手掌有文，幼而即慧，父母爱如珍宝。到了十岁上，杜琴师忽为豪贵殴辱，气忿碎琴而卒。其母一年之后，亦悲痛成病而死。遗下这个琴官无依无靠，赖其族叔收养。十三岁上叔叔又死，其婶不能守节，即行改嫁，遂以琴官卖入梨园。适叶茂林见了，又从戏班中买出，同了进京。这琴","en":"Qinguan bore auspicious markings on his palm and was clever from earliest childhood; his parents loved him as their most precious treasure. When he reached ten years of age, Du Qinshi was suddenly humiliated and beaten by a powerful lord, smashed his qin in"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琴官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"将已及顶，万分危急，忽见一个美少年，玉貌如神，一手将他提了出来。琴官感激不尽，将要拜谢，那个少年翩翩的走入梅花林内不见了。琴官进去找时，见梅树之上，结了一个大梅子，细看是玉的，便也醒了。明日进城，在路上挤了车，见了子玉，就是梦中救他之人，心里十分诧异，所以呆呆看了他一回。但陌路相逢，也不知他姓名、居处，又无从访问。如","en":"desperate peril. Suddenly a beautiful youth appeared, his face as luminous as jade and divine. With one hand he lifted Qinguan out. Qinguan was overwhelmed with gratitude and was about to bow in thanks. The young man turned gracefully, walked into the plum grove, and vanished. Qinguan went in to search and found a large plum fruit growing on a plum tree; looking closely, he"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":6,"tokens":["琴官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"是日琪官感冒，不能起来，袁宝珠先到琴官寓里。这个宝珠的容貌，《花选》中已经说过了，性格温柔，貌如处女。他也爱这琴官的相貌与己彷佛，虽是初交，倒与夙好一般。两人已谈心过几回，琴官也重宝珠的人品，是个洁身自爱的人。宝珠又将子云的好处，细细说给他听，琴官便也放了好些心。二人同上了车，琴官在前，","en":"That day, Qiguan had caught a cold and could not get up, so Yuan Baozhu came first to Qinguan's lodgings. Baozhu's appearance had already been described in the Selection of Flowers: his nature gentle and yielding, his looks like a maiden's. He too was attracted to Qinguan, whose appearance resembled his own. Though they had just met, it was as"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":3,"tokens":["琴官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"不觉把帘子一掀，露出一个绝代花容来。子玉瞥见，是前日所遇、聘才所说、朝思夕想的那个琴官，便觉喜动颜开，笑了一笑。见琴官也觉美目清扬，朱唇微绽，又把帘子放下，一转瞬间，各自风驰电掣的离远了。子玉见他今日车袭华美，已与前日不同，心里暗暗赞叹：「果信夜光难掩，明月自华，自然遇了赏鉴家，但不知所遇为何等人。」又想：「聘才说他脾气古怪，十分高傲","en":"he raised the curtain, revealing a face of unparalleled beauty. Ziyu caught a glimpse and recognized the very Qinguan he had encountered before, the one Pincai had told him about, the one he had been thinking of day and night. Joy spread across his face and he smiled. He glimpsed Qinguan's clear bright eyes and slightly parted crimson lips. Then the curtain fell, and"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":3,"tokens":["琴官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴官羞羞涩涩的上前请了两个安，道了谢，俯首而立。子云、次贤见他今日容貌，华装艳服，更加妍丽了些。但见他那生生怯怯、畏畏缩缩的神情。教人怜惜之心，随感而发，便命他坐下。琴官挨着宝珠坐了，子云笑盈盈的问道：「前日我们乍见，未能深谈，你将你的出身家业、怎样入班","en":"Qinguan timidly went forward, made two bows of greeting, expressed his thanks, and stood with bowed head. Ziyun and Cixian saw that today, in fine and colorful dress, his appearance was even more beautiful than before. But they saw his tentative, bashful, nervous"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"又问了他所学的戏，是那几出，琴官也回答了。次贤道：","en":"They then asked what operas he had studied, which pieces he knew, and Qinguan answered them. Cixian said:"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"里，使易冠履而裙钗，恐江东二乔犹难比数。想是造物之心，欲使此辈中出几个传人，一洗向来凡陋之习，也未可知。」即对琴官道：「我们这里是比不得别处，你不必怕生，你各样都照着瑶卿，他怎样你也怎样。要知我们的为人，你细细问他就知道了。","en":"washing away all the commonplace and vulgar habits of former times, who can say for certain?\\" He then said to Qinguan: \\"Here is different from other places, you need not feel like a stranger. Follow Yaoqing in everything; whatever he does, you do likewise. If you wish to know what we are like, simply ask him in detail."},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琴官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一样，可以大家称号，请安也可不用。你若高兴，空闲时，可以常到这里来，倒不必要存什么规矩，存了规矩，就生疏了。」琴官也只得答应了，再将他们二人看看，都是骨格不凡，清和可近，已知不是寻常人了。次贤对子云道：「你这话说得最是，他此时还不晓得我们脾气怎样，当是富贵场中，必有骄奢之气，谁知我们最厌的是那样。你这个人材，是不用说了。但人之丰韵雅秀，皆从书本中来，若不认字读书","en":"please come here often in your free time. There is no need to stand on ceremony, for ceremony creates distance.\\" Qinguan could only agree. He looked at the two men again. Both were of extraordinary bearing, serene and approachable, and he knew they were not ordinary men. Cixian said to Ziyun: \\"What you have said is exactly right. At this moment he still does not know what"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":5,"tokens":["琴官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「他肚子里比我们强得多呢！我们如今考起来，只怕媚香还考不过他。」子云听了，更加欢喜，便问琴官道：「你到底念过书没有？」琴官道：「也念过五六年的书。」次贤道：「念过些什么书呢？」琴官道：「《四书》之外，念了一部《事类赋》，两本唐诗。」子云道：「也够了，你可会做诗？」琴官道：「不会做。」宝殊道：「那是他没有学过，将来一学就会的。前日他与我讲那些","en":"were tested right now, I'm afraid even Meixiang could not surpass him.\\" Ziyun was even more pleased and asked Qinguan: \\"Tell me honestly, have you studied books?\\" Qinguan replied: \\"I have studied for five or six years.\\" Cixian asked: \\"What have you read?\\" Qinguan replied: \\"Besides *The Four Books*, I read through the Rhapsodies on Categorized Affairs, a rhapsody on"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":12,"tokens":["琴言","玉侬","琴官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「他这个名字不好，静宜你与他改一个字，将这官字换了罢，再与他起个号。」次贤想了一回道：「改为琴言，号玉侬，可好么？」子云道：「很好，这琴言二字，又新又雅；\\n玉侬之号，雅称其人。」宝珠叫琴官道谢，琴官又起身请了两个安。次贤道：「方才已说过的了，怎么又请起安来？」子云道：「我们立下章程，凡遇年节庆贺大事，准你们请安，其余常见一概不用。老爷二字，永远","en":"word 'guan'. And give him a style name as well.\\" Cixian thought for a moment and said: \\"What about changing it to Qinyan, meaning Lute-Words, with the style name Yunong, meaning Jade Youth. Would that do?\\" Ziyun said: \\"Very good. The two characters 'Qinyan' are both fresh and elegant; and 'Yunong' as a style name suits the person perfectly.\\" Baozhu told Qinguan to express"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琴官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"再说子玉今日又遇见了琴官，十分快意，回家之后，急急的找了聘才，与他说知。聘才也有些喜欢，因将路上的光景，细说与子玉。原来聘才与叶茂林同行到济宁州时，那一班相公上岸去了，独见琴官在船中垂泪，便问了他好些心事，终不答应。及说到敢是不愿唱戏，恐辱没了父母的话，他方把聘才看了一眼。","en":"Now let us return to Ziyu, who had again encountered Qinguan that day and was in excellent spirits. Returning home, he immediately sought out Pincai to tell him what had happened. Pincai was somewhat pleased as well, and proceeded to describe to Ziyu the scene on the road. It turned out that when Pincai and Ye"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琴官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"如果真美色，天下人没有不爱的。子玉前日在戏园的光景，倒像那个保珠沾染了他什么，那片心应该永远不动才是。谁知一个琴官，见了两次，还如电光石火，一过不留，心里就时时的思念。何况他人，其自守本不如子玉，又能与美人朝夕相见，自然爱慕更切，把个百炼钢化为绕指柔了。聘才自知与琴官无缘，巴结不上，虽也爱其容貌，其实恨其性情。如今见子玉爱他，以局外人想局中事，不过说些怂慂之言，","en":"him; his heart ought to have been forever unmoved. Yet who would have known that after only two encounters with Qinguan, it was like a flash of lightning or a spark of flint, passing in an instant without a trace, and yet his heart was now constantly thinking of him? How much more so for others, whose self-restraint was not as great as Ziyu's, and who could be with beautiful"},{"paragraph":38,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"我们的，又不与他们坐在一处；二来也是庸庵的意思，你若不去，就大家无趣了。」聘才笑道：「若果如此，那一天可以见着琴官的戏了。」子玉一笑，道：「我还有一点事。」说罢进去了。晚间李性全回来，进门时已见满堂灯彩，照耀辉煌。望见大厅上，梅学士与夫人及子玉，围着一群仆妇，在神像前上供。","en":"will be awkward for everyone.\\" Pincai smiled and said: \\"If that is the case, that day we should be able to watch Qinguan perform in the opera!\\" Ziyu smiled and said: \\"There is still something else I must attend to.\\" And he went back inside. That evening, when Li Xingquan returned home, entering the gate he already saw the whole hall illuminated with lanterns in brilliant"}],"6":[{"paragraph":30,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"》、《出猎》、《回猎》、《游园惊梦》，末后是《明珠记》上的《侠隐》，子玉悄悄的向聘才道：「戏倒罢了，只不晓得有琴官的戏没有？」一语未了，只听得楼下有人嚷道：「没有袁宝珠的戏，是断不依的。」","en":"'Knight-Errant in Hiding' from The Bright Pearl Record. Ziyu murmured to Pincai, \\"The program is fine, but I wonder if Qinguan is in any of these.\\" Before he finished speaking, a voice from below shouted, \\"Without Yuan Baozhu's performance, I absolutely refuse!\\""},{"paragraph":31,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"又听文辉说道：「就是在徐老爷那里，唱一出再去何妨；况且定戏时，怎样交代你的？」那人道：「这出《惊梦》有个新来的琴官，比宝珠还好。大人不信，叫他先唱一出瞧瞧，如果不中大人的意，再赶着去叫宝珠来，包管不误。」刘侍郎道：「也罢，唱了《瑶台》之后，就唱《惊梦》也使得。」那人答应几个「是！」看着文辉不言语，也就进戏房去了。聘才向子玉道：「你听见没有？」子玉点头，心上很感激","en":"you explicitly told?\\" The man explained, \\"In this 'The Interrupted Dream,' there is a newly arrived performer, Qinguan, who surpasses even Baozhu. If Your Lordship doubts this, let him sing one piece first—if he fails to meet your expectations, I will rush off immediately to fetch Baozhu, guaranteeing no delay.\\" Vice-Minister Liu intervened, \\"Very well, then—after 'The"},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琴官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"《功宴》唱完了，是《瑶台》出场。子玉一见，吃了一惊，心上迷迷糊糊倒先当他是琴官，又看不大像，比琴官略大些。","en":"commenced. Catching his first glimpse of the performer, Ziyu started; in a momentary daze, he mistook the figure for Qinguan, before realizing this actor was slightly older."},{"paragraph":34,"mentions":5,"tokens":["琴官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉倒有些不放心，恐琴官也未必压得下这苏蕙芳，且先聚精会神等着。上场门口，帘子一掀，琴官已经见过二次，这面目记得逼真的了。手锣响处，莲步移时，香风已到，正如八月十五月圆夜，龙宫赛宝，宝气上腾，月光下接，似云非云的，结成了一个五彩祥云华盖，其光华色艳非世间之物可比。这一道光射","en":"Anxious that Qinguan might struggle to match Su Huifang's brilliance, Ziyu focused his entire attention on the stage. The entrance curtain was swept aside, revealing Qinguan—the very same youth he had glimpsed twice before, whose delicate features were flawlessly engraved"},{"paragraph":35,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琴官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"原来琴官一出场，早已看见子玉，他是梦中多见了一回，今日已是第四回了，心里暗暗欢喜道：「难得今日这位公子也在这里。」到第二次出场，唱那「雨香云片」这枝曲子，一面唱，那眼波只望着子玉溜来，子玉心里十分畅满。文泽低低的对南湘道：「这个新来的相公，倒与庾香很熟，你瞧","en":"The moment Qinguan stepped onto the stage, he had instantly spotted Ziyu. Having encountered him once more in a dream—making this their fourth encounter in total—he felt a secret surge of joy: \\"What a fortunate coincidence—this gentleman is here today.\\" During his second"}],"7":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琴官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说子玉从会馆回来，将琴官的戏足足想了两日，以谓天下之美莫过于此。又将苏蕙芳、陆素兰、金漱芳、李玉林的色艺品评，都为绝顶。细细核来，蕙芳的神色尤胜于诸人，次则素兰可以匹敌。然较比琴官起来，毫厘之间终觉稍逊。又想：","en":"After returning from the guild hall, Ziyu spent two full days reflecting on Qinguan's performance, convinced it was the pinnacle of worldly beauty. He also appraised Su Huifang, Lu Sulan, Jin Shufang, and Li Yulin, finding them all to be utterly superlative. Yet upon careful comparison, Huifang's spirit and bearing surpassed the rest,"},{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「琴官这个美貌，若不唱戏，天下人也不能瞻仰他，品题他，他也埋没了，所以使其堕劫梨园，以显造化游戏钟灵之意也未可知，故生了这个花王，又生得许多花相，如百花之辅牡丹。","en":"\\"If Qinguan's beauty were not placed upon the stage, the world would have no chance to admire and praise him, leaving him buried in obscurity. Perhaps the Creator, in a playful mood of bestowing spiritual essence, deliberately cast him into the theater world to"},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"庸庵等必有言过其实之处，如今看来，真还刻划不到，想必那些能诗能画之说，也是的确无疑了。」便又想：「今日虽然见了琴官的戏，也未能稍通款曲，此后相逢，不知又在何日？但看他今日双波频注，似乎倒有缱纟卷之意。前此在车内掀帘凝望，又似非以陌上相逢看待，这也不知何故？」","en":"claims about his poetic and painting talents must also be unequivocally true.\\" He then thought: \\"Although I saw Qinguan perform today, I had no chance to make his acquaintance. When might we meet again? Yet seeing his eyes repeatedly glance my way, it seemed he harbored some tender sentiment. Earlier, when he lifted the carriage curtain to gaze out, it felt as though"},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琴官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"天看着房没有敢走开，这是雪儿说的。只怕咱们家里人，都也知道。」子玉听了心内甚喜，猛想起这二表妹的容貌，也有些像琴官的模样，便将他们比较起来，不知谁好。又把挖去的字一想，恍然大悟：「谁知竟犯了他的讳，无意之间天然凑合，这也奇极了。他看了，当我必是有心想念他，心里定然怪我，这便怎样？我又无从与他分辩，这竟是个不白之冤。」继又想道：「既订了姻，就怪我也不妨。」子玉复因","en":"Ziyu felt a surge of joy. He suddenly recalled his second cousin's appearance, which bore some resemblance to Qinguan's, and began comparing the two in his mind, unsure of who was finer. Then, thinking of the scraped-away characters, he realized in a flash: \\"Who would have thought I inadvertently used her name—an unintentional coincidence, how extraordinary! She must"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"书」，书法古拙异常。下面一张大案，案上罗列着许多书籍。旁边摆着十二盆唐花，香气袭人，令人心醉。子玉看了，又想起琴言那日作戏光景，真是宝光夺人，香气沁骨，不觉有些模糊起来。忽听文泽道：「这屋子太敞，我们里面坐罢。」随同到东边，有书童揭起帘子，进去却是三间书房，中间玻璃窗隔作两层。从旁绕进，玻璃窗内又是两间套房。朝南窗内，即看得见外面。上悬着董香光写的「虚白」二字，","en":"winter flowers, their fragrance wafting over and intoxicating the senses. Taking it all in, Ziyu was reminded of Qinyan's performance—a dazzling, jewel-like radiance and a fragrance that pierced the bone—and he felt momentarily dazed. Suddenly, Wenze's voice broke his reverie: \\"This room is too drafty; let us sit inside.\\" They proceeded east, where a book-boy lifted a"}],"8":[{"paragraph":5,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"坐了一张小桌子。已开过台，做了两出，此刻唱的是《拾金》。元茂见不是小旦戏，便不看，他左顾右盼，四下里闲望，非但琴官等不见，连叶茂林也不在台上。","en":"roles, Yuanmao lost interest. He let his gaze wander in every direction, searching the hall. Yet not only were Qinguan and the others nowhere to be seen, even Ye Maolin was absent from the stage."},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":3,"tokens":["琴官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"答应了几句。仲雨道：「老弟，以后如有缓急，可到愚兄处商量。」聘才谢了一声，仲雨也不看戏，只与聘才说话。聘才说起琴官，仲雨道：「我也见过这人，相貌倒好，就是人冷些。如今是天天在怡园徐度香处。还有个琪官，略比他和气些。」聘才道：「这个琴官，是我们梅庾香最得意的。」仲两道：「他也喜欢琴官吗？我倒不大见他出来。」元茂却呆呆听着，见有一个相公走来，到张仲雨面前请了安，又照","en":"Pincai thanked him. Zhongyu paid no mind to the stage, preferring to chat with Pincai. When Pincai brought up Qinguan, Zhongyu said, \\"I have met the young man. His features are striking enough, though his temperament runs rather cold. These days he is constantly at Xu Duxiang's Garden of Contentment. There is also Qiguan, who is somewhat more amiable.\\" Pincai noted,"}],"9":[{"paragraph":18,"mentions":4,"tokens":["杜玉侬","琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「这琴是庾香先生猜着的么？」子玉道：「是小弟胡猜的，断不敢当此厚赠。」次贤道：「这是园主人为杜玉侬而设，另有深意，幸勿见却。琴后尚须镌铭，俟镌好再行送上。」说毕便令小厮，仍将瑶琴抱了进去。其余彩礼，交给各跟随收存。原来琴言因制灯谜时，喜诵「落花人独立」这一联，度香随嘱次贤，以词意为琴言写图，所以这灯谜即以琴作彩，原是于游戏之中，寓作合之意。非但子","en":"possibly presume to accept such a generous prize.\\" Cixian replied: \\"This was set by the garden's master for Du Yunong, and carries a particular meaning, so pray do not decline. An inscription still needs to be engraved on the qin. I will send it once that is done.\\" With this he had a page-boy carry the jade qin back inside, and the remaining prizes were given to each"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"见漱芳的《题曲》，也是上妆容貌。此时看他骨香肉腻，玉洁晶莹；宝珠亭亭玉立，弱不胜衣，便想道：「这两个姿色似可与琴官相并，但不知性情何如。」正想着，猛听得台下云锣一响，对面很远的树林里，放起几枝流星赶月来，便接着一个个的泥筒，接接连连，远远近近，放了一二百筒。那兰花竹箭，射得满园，映得那些绿竹寒林，如画在火光中一般。泥筒放了一回，听得接连放了几个大炮，各处树林里放","en":"too delicate to bear the weight of clothing. Ziyu thought to himself: \\"These two in beauty seem comparable to Qinyan. What their characters are like, I do not know.\\" Just as he was thinking this, he heard a cloud-gong strike once below the terrace. In the far tree-groves across the way, several shooting-star rockets rose. Immediately a succession of clay-cylinders"},{"paragraph":31,"mentions":5,"tokens":["琴官","琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"了。静宜先生，明日可与他写个竹醉图。」次贤点头微笑。子玉乘他们说话时，悄悄的问宝珠道：「这两天可曾见你们同班的琴官？」宝珠听了，把子玉打量了一番，问道：「你同琴官相好么？」倒把子玉问住了，很不好意思，只得答道：「向未交接，不过闻名思慕。」宝珠道：「他如今不叫琴官，改名为琴言，今日可惜迟来一步，度香带他赴席去了。」子玉心里想道：「我与他直如此缘悭，要接谈的福分都没","en":"faintly. Taking advantage of the others' conversation, Ziyu quietly asked Baozhu: \\"These past two days, have you seen Qinyan from your troupe?\\" Baozhu, hearing this, looked Ziyu over carefully and asked: \\"Are you and Qinyan close friends?\\" This question rather caught Ziyu off guard. Quite embarrassed, he could only answer: \\"We have never met. I merely admire his name.\\" Baozhu"}],"10":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":3,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴言自去年谒见子云之后，也随着一班名花天天常到怡园，子云爱之不亚于宝珠。但琴言生性高傲，冷冷落落，不善应酬，任凭黄金满斗，也买不动他一笑。一切古玩饮食衣服，只要他心爱，徐子云无不供给，也算相待十分，琴言未尝不知感恩，却只算得半个知己。自那进京这一天路上见","en":"Ever since Qinyan first paid his respects to Ziyun the previous year, he had accompanied the other celebrated beauties in their daily visits to the Garden of Contentment, where Ziyun favored him no less than he did Baozhu. Yet Qinyan was of an aloof and arrogant nature,"},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":4,"tokens":["琴言","玉侬"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"他的模样，与自己唱了一出《惊梦》，又想不出这个理来。次日，子云到园来，次贤讲起昨晚诸诺人来园看灯，并子玉打着了琴言的灯谜，即将子玉的才貌痛赞了一番。子云听了，心里颇为喜欢，即道：「这个梅庾香，他虽不认得我，我去年恰见过他。我们也有世谊，他令祖相国，与先叔祖总宪公是同年至好。这梅庾香的外貌却没有说的，不知品行如何？」次贤道：「持重如金，温润如玉，绝无矜才使气的模样","en":"long while, and Ziyun did not go out that day. By the hour of You, Baozhu arrived at the garden accompanied by Qinyan. Seeing them, Ziyun laughed and said: \\"Yunong, things have turned out wonderfully for you this time. I have found your perfect match, so do not forget me when the time comes.\\" This unexpected remark so startled Qinyan that he immediately flared up. Unable"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":3,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这里袁宝珠用手帕替他擦了泪痕，就将史南湘的醉态，及妆点情形，说得琴言欢喜了，便同在一张床榻上坐着道：「看昨日这几个打灯谜的人，内中一个叫梅庾香的，年纪不过十七八岁，相貌生得最好。」琴言道：「这人也姓梅么？」宝珠道：「他曾问起你来。」琴言沉吟道：「姓梅的他说会过我么？」","en":"Here, Yuan Baozhu used a handkerchief to wipe away the tear-stains on Qinyan's face. He then described Shi Nanxiang's drunken antics and his adorned appearance in such amusing detail that Qinyan's spirits lifted, and they sat together on the daybed. Baozhu said: \\"Among those who solved the lantern riddles yesterday, there was"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":14,"tokens":["琴言","玉侬"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"他可与你相好，他支吾了一句，说什么向未交接，不过闻声思慕，似乎不像见过的。又说看见你《惊梦》这出戏唱得很好。」琴言想道：「不要这姓梅的，就是那天看戏的梅公子。」因问宝珠道：「这梅公子，可是初六那天，在姑苏会馆东边楼上看戏的？」宝珠笑道：「那天我又没有唱戏，那里知道是他不是他？」琴言呆呆的想了半晌，又问宝珠道：「他的相貌可同我们班里陆香畹差不多？就只眼睛长些，觉得","en":"you. He also mentioned that he found your performance of the 'The Interrupted Dream' scene exceedingly fine.\\" Qinyan mused: \\"Could this Mei-surnamed gentleman be the very Mei young master who watched the opera that day?\\" Consequently, he asked Baozhu: \\"This Mei young master, was he the one sitting in the upper eastern gallery of the Suzhou Guild Hall on the sixth day"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":3,"tokens":["琴言","玉侬"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这里说得热闹，那晓得徐子云同萧次贤，早已转到隔壁套间内，窃听得逼真，把门一推，子云、次贤走将出来，琴言一见，羞得红了脸，就背转身坐了。子云道：「玉侬还怪我不怪我？」琴言低头不语，子云道，「就算我错了一句话，也是无心之言。","en":"room and overheard every word with absolute clarity. Pushing the door open, Ziyun and Cixian came out. The moment Qinyan saw them, he flushed crimson with deep embarrassment and turned his back to sit facing away. Ziyun asked: \\"Yunong, do you still blame me?\\" Qinyan lowered his head and offered no reply. Ziyun continued: \\"Even if my words were poorly chosen, they were"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「不要说了，他已经明白过来了。我们何不去请了庾香来与他见一见。」子云道：「知道是他不是他，我自有道理。」宝珠、琴言即在怡园吃了晚饭，坐到二更而回。","en":"here to meet him?\\" Ziyun said: \\"I have my own method of determining whether it is truly him or not.\\" Baozhu and Qinyan dined at the Garden of Contentment that evening, sitting together until the second night-watch before finally returning home."},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":2,"tokens":["玉侬"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，就约定于十九日晚间一叙。出来顺道到王恂、刘文泽、史南湘等处看望，俱未晤见。回来想道：「这梅庾香果然名不虚传，玉侬又属意于他，将来见了面，不消说是他的人了。」又想这：「玉侬的脾气，差不多的人都猜摸不着，倘或一言不合，就可以决绝的。即使梅庾香是个多情人，也未必能像我这样体贴。","en":"Returning to his own residence, he reflected: \\"This Mei Yuxiang is indeed everything his stellar reputation suggests. Yunong is already deeply drawn to him, and once they meet, it goes without saying that he will devote himself entirely to Yuxiang.\\" He then considered further: \\"Yunong's temperament is something most people can never quite fathom. If a single word goes awry,"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":1,"tokens":["玉侬"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"据瑶卿说来，与玉侬改了名字，他全然不知，可见素未浃洽。","en":"According to Yaoqing's account, Yuxiang knew nothing whatsoever of the name change arranged for Yunong, which clearly demonstrates that the two have never shared true intimacy."},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":4,"tokens":["琴言","玉侬"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"就看过一出戏，想来也不过赏识他的相貌，未必心上只有这个琴言，我倒要试他一试。」又想道：「若是十九那一天，竟叫玉侬陪酒，他初次见面，就是彼此有心也难剖说，旁人也看不出来。我如今用个移花接木之计，先把玉侬藏了，另觅一个像玉侬的人，用言打动他，看他如何，自然就试出来了。」主意已定，即向次贤、宝珠说知。","en":"He has only watched a single opera performance, and I suspect his admiration is limited to an appreciation of Yunong's face and figure. There is no certainty that Qinyan alone holds sway over his heart. I believe I shall put him to a test.\\" His thoughts continued: \\"If on the nineteenth I simply arrange for Yunong to serve wine beside him, this being their very first"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":2,"tokens":["玉侬"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"：「今日坐间尚有何客，静宜先生何以不见？」子云道：「静宜现有小事，少刻奉陪。即指着榻上的琴道：「今日此酌，专为玉侬赠琴而设，未便另邀他客，致扰情话。」子玉道：「弟正要动问，前日因何为打一灯谜，有此厚赠？这玉侬究系何人，吾兄如此郑重？」子云便令小厮，将琴囊解开，双手送交子玉道：「琴后镌有铭款，请试一观。」子玉接过琴来看时，玉轸珠徽，梅纹蛇断，绝好一张焦尾古琴，后面","en":"gracefully toward the qin on the daybed, he added: \\"Today's banquet has been arranged expressly for the occasion of Yunong presenting this qin. It would not be fitting to invite other guests, lest the atmosphere for intimate conversation be spoiled.\\" Ziyu pressed further: \\"I was just about to inquire: why, simply for solving a lantern riddle, was such a tremendously generous"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":2,"tokens":["玉侬","杜琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"四句琴铭下，又镌着一行行书小字，是：「山阴徐子云为玉侬杜琴言移赠庾香名士清赏。」下刻图章两方：阴文是「次贤撰句」四字，阳文是「静宜手镌」四字。","en":"elegant four-line inscription flowed a further line in cursive running script: 'Xu Ziyun of Shanyin, on behalf of Yunong Du Qinyan, presents this as a gift for the refined appreciation of the celebrated scholar Yuxiang.' Below this dedication were neatly engraved two seals: one in intaglio reading 'Composed by Cixian,' and one in relief reading 'Carved by Jingyi.'"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":4,"tokens":["玉侬","琴官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉想起宝珠改名之言，知道玉侬就是琴官，却喜出望外，便深深一揖，道了谢，仍令小厮囊好。子云试他道：「闻说吾兄与玉侬相与最深，可是真的么？」子玉道：「弟因家君管教极严，平素足不出户，就只开春初六那日，在姑苏会馆看见他一出《惊梦》的戏，有人说起他的名字叫琴官，觉得色艺俱佳。","en":"Recalling what Baozhu had revealed about the change of name, Ziyu now fully understood that Yunong was none other than Qinguan, and a wave of joy washed over him beyond all expectation. He made a deep and respectful bow of thanks and then directed his page boy to carefully rewrap the qin. Ziyun, testing the waters, said: \\"I have heard that you and"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":3,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"直到前日在此，于无意中询知阁下替他改名为琴言，却从未与他会过，相与之说，恐是讹传。吾兄将来晤见琴言，尚可询问。」子云道：「吾兄赏识不错，可晓得琴言颇有情于吾兄么？」","en":"until the other day, here in your esteemed company, did I chance to learn that your honor had changed his name to Qinyan. In truth, I have never actually met him in person. As for the rumors of intimacy, that is surely a misconception. You might ask Qinyan himself when you next see him.\\" Ziyun said: \\"Your appreciation is certainly not misplaced. But are you aware that"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":5,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"？就是我辈文字之交，或臭味相投，一见如故；或道义结契，千里神交。亦必两意眷注，始可言情，断无用情于陌路人之理。琴言之于弟，犹陌路人也。弟已忘情于彼，彼又安能用情于弟乎?」子云道：「据吾兄品评琴言，比前日所见宝珠何如？」子玉因想琴言、宝珠都是子云宠爱，未便轩轾，便道：「大凡品花，必须于既上妆之后，观其体态。又必于已卸妆之后，视其姿容。且必平素熟悉其意趣，熟闻其语言","en":"can truly speak of feeling. There is absolutely no reason to bestow such feeling upon a mere stranger. To me, Qinyan is like a stranger on the road. Since I have completely forgotten any thought of him, how could he possibly direct such feeling toward me?\\" Ziyun pressed: \\"According to your own judgment, how does Qinyan compare to the Baozhu you met the other day?\\""},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":5,"tokens":["琴言","玉侬"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"正说着，只见宝珠同着花枝招展的一个人来，子玉一看不是别人，就是朝思暮想的琴言，心里暗暗吃惊。又听得子云道：「玉侬，你的意中人在此，过来见了。」琴言嫣然一笑，走上来请了一个安，倒弄得子玉坐不是，站不是，呆呆的只管看那琴言。那琴言又对子云也请了安。宝珠道：「庾香，我竟遵竹君的教不为礼了。」子玉道：","en":"figure. When Ziyu looked, he saw it was none other than the very person for whom he had yearned day and night: Qinyan. His heart gave a secret, powerful start of surprise. Then he heard Ziyun announce: \\"Yunong, your heart's beloved is here. Come and be properly introduced.\\" Qinyan smiled sweetly, walked gracefully forward, and made a formal greeting bow. This unexpected"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":4,"tokens":["玉侬","琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「是这样脱俗最好，玉侬何不也是这样？」琴言微微的一笑，不言语。子玉看看琴言，又看看宝珠，觉宝珠比琴言，面目清艳了好些，吐属轻倩了好些，举止闲雅了好些。心里寻思道：","en":"\\"It is best to transcend worldly conventions in this manner. Why should Yunong not do the same?\\" Qinyan offered a faint smile but remained silent. Ziyu looked first at Qinyan, then at Baozhu, and felt that Baozhu surpassed Qinyan in luminous beauty, possessed a lighter and more charming manner of speech, and exhibited a far more"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":3,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「原来琴言不过如此，何以那两回车中瞥见如此之好，而唱起戏来又有那样丰神态度呢？而且魏聘才赞不绝口，徐子云又钟情到这样，真令人不解。「一面想，那神色之间，微露出不然之意来。子云却早窥出，颇得意用计之妙。宝珠道：「你们彼此相思已久，今日初次见面，也该说两句知心话，","en":"\\"So this is the true extent of Qinyan's charm. How is it that those two fleeting glimpses of him from the carriage were so extraordinarily remarkable, and that his stage performance held such immense richness of spirit and manner? And yet Wei Pincai praised him without end, and Xu Ziyun's"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"那镜屏仍复掩上，屋内止剩子玉、琴言两人，琴言让子玉榻上坐了，他却站在子玉身旁，目不转瞬的看着子玉，倒将子玉看得害羞起来，低了头。","en":"The mirrored screen was once again drawn shut, leaving only Ziyu and Qinyan together in the quiet room. Qinyan invited Ziyu to sit on the daybed, while he himself remained standing beside him, gazing at Ziyu without once turning his eyes away. This intense scrutiny made Ziyu feel deeply bashful, and he lowered his head."},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴言把身子一歪，斜靠着炕几，一手托着香腮，娇声媚气的道：「梅少爷，大年初六那天，你在楼上看我唱戏的不是？」","en":"Qinyan leaned his body slightly, resting elegantly against the kang table, supporting his fragrant cheek with one hand, and said in a sweet, coaxing voice: \\"Master Mei, on the sixth day of the first month, you were in the gallery watching me perform, were you"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":4,"tokens":["琴言","玉侬"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉把头点一点。又道：「你晓得我想念你的心事么？」子玉把头摇一摇。琴言道：「那瑶琴的灯谜，是你猜着的么？」子玉又把头点一点。又道：「好心思，你可晓得度香的主意么？」子玉又把头摇一摇。琴言用一个指头，将子玉的额抬起来，道：「我听得宝珠说，你背地里很问我，我很感你的情。今日见了面，这里又没有第三个人，为什么倒生分起来？」子","en":"Ziyu gave a single, slow nod. Qinyan continued: \\"Are you aware of the deep longing I have felt for you?\\" Ziyu gently shook his head. Qinyan pressed: \\"The lantern riddle about the jade qin, was it truly you who solved it?\\" Ziyu nodded once again. \\"What a wonderfully fine mind. And do you"},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":3,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"了一番心。」说着脸上起了一层红晕，眼波向子玉一转，恰好眼光对着眼光，子玉把眼一低，脸上也红红的，心里十分不快。琴言惺松松两眼，乘势把香肩一侧，那脸直贴到子玉的脸上来，子玉将身一偏，琴言就靠在子玉怀里，嗤嗤的笑。子玉已有了气，把他推开，站了起来，只得说道：「人之相知，贵相知心。你这么样，竟把我当个狎邪人看待了。」琴言笑道：「你既然爱我，你今日却又远我。若彼此相爱，","en":"Ziyu, and their gazes locked. Ziyu hastily lowered his eyes, his own face reddening as he felt deeply ill at ease. Qinyan let his half-drowsy eyes linger upon him, and then tilted his fragrant shoulder sideways so that his cheek pressed intimately against Ziyu's cheek. Ziyu shifted uncomfortably aside, and Qinyan leaned directly into Ziyu's arms, laughing softly. Ziyu,"},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"正急的无可如何，只听得镜屏里轻轻的一响，子云、次贤、宝珠都在镜屏之外，迎面笑盈盈的走进来，那琴言一影就不见了，把个子玉吓得迷迷糊糊的。只听得子云笑道：「好个坐怀不乱的柳下惠，失敬，失敬！就是骂我徐度香太挖苦些。」子玉一回转头来，那知众人都在镜屏对面套间之内。子玉与次贤见了礼，即向子云告辞道：「今日出门忘了一件要事，只好改日再来奉扰。」子云笑道：","en":"adorned with smiles, walked in gracefully from the other side of the screen. At that precise instant, the figure of Qinyan vanished without a single trace, leaving Ziyu utterly dazed and bewildered. Then he heard Ziyun laughing brightly: \\"What an admirable Liu Xiahui, able to sit entirely unmoved in the presence of a breathtaking beauty. I offer you my absolute deepest respects."},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":9,"tokens":["琴言","玉侬"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"拉着子玉进套间屋内，道：「你且再看看你的意中人，不要哭坏了他。」子玉见一人背坐着在那里哭泣，只道就是刚才的那个琴言。因想他既知哭泣，尚能悔过，意欲于酒席中间，慢慢的用言语感化他。那晓得他倒转过脸来，用手帕擦擦眼泪，看着子玉道：「庾香，你的心我知道了。」子玉听这声音似乎不是琴言，仔细一看，只觉神采奕奕，丽若天仙，这才是那天车中所遇，戏上所见的这个人。子玉这一惊。倒","en":"your account.\\" Ziyu saw a figure sitting quietly with his back turned, weeping softly. Thinking it was the same Qinyan as before, he reflected that since Qinyan possessed enough awareness to weep, he was entirely capable of regretting his conduct; he resolved to use the occasion of the banquet to reform him gradually through gentle, guiding words. Imagine his profound"},{"paragraph":31,"mentions":1,"tokens":["玉侬"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"兄，今日可曾见那瑶琴上镌的字么？」子玉道：「我倒忘了道谢，铁笔古心，的是名手。但此灯谜也还易打，度香先生所说为玉侬而设，究竟不知其故？」","en":"the lantern riddle, it was not so very difficult to solve. As for what Duxiang said about it being arranged for Yunong, I confess I still do not quite understand his true meaning.\\""},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":3,"tokens":["琴言","玉侬"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云指着琴言道：「弟是为他看我制灯谜时，喜诵「落花」、「微雨」两句。又因他名字是琴，所以借此为彩，原是要替他卜个生平知己。可巧是吾兄猜着，不枉弟一番作合之心。」子玉道：「却之不恭，受之有愧，当为玉侬珍重藏之。」琴言面有豫色。宝珠见了，将唐诗改了一字念道：「寻常一","en":"Ziyun pointed to Qinyan and explained: \\"This younger brother of mine set the riddle because he watched me compose it, and Qinyan loved to recite the two poetic lines about 'fallen flowers' and 'gentle rain.' And because his name contains the character for qin, I used it as"},{"paragraph":33,"mentions":4,"tokens":["琴言","玉侬"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉看琴言颜色微愠，知是宝珠以他名字为戏，便道：「若非瑶卿胸有智珠，不能改得如此敏妙。」子云等还道是寻常赞语，惟有琴言深感子玉之情，替他报复了这个琴字。次贤道：「今日玉侬，何以一言不发？」子云道：「他本来像息夫人似的，将来静宜可将那「花如解语还多事，石不能言最","en":"Ziyu, noticing a slight flash of annoyance cross Qinyan's face, understood that Baozhu was playfully using the character 'qin' in his name, and so said: \\"If Yaoqing did not possess brilliance like a luminous pearl within his breast, he could not have made such a quick and exquisitely clever substitution.\\""},{"paragraph":35,"mentions":3,"tokens":["琴言","玉侬"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云见子玉、琴言两意相投的光景，便道：「庾香兄不是有事么？为什么不打发人回去，我们可以畅饮。」子玉支吾道：「虽有小事，迟到明日尚却不妨。足下好客，可惜前日同来的一班好友都不在此。」子云道：「他们是常来的，不妨另日再叙。」子玉道：「此外尚有个卓然高品。」子云道：「我也","en":"Ziyun, perceiving that Ziyu and Qinyan were already mutually and deeply drawn to each other, suggested: \\"Did not Brother Yuxiang say he had something to attend to? Why not send someone home with word? We could then drink freely to our hearts' absolute content.\\" Ziyu hedged politely: \\"The"},{"paragraph":36,"mentions":2,"tokens":["玉侬","琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"宝珠道：「我们今日何不以玉侬说话为令，他说一句话，我们合席饮一杯。」子云笑道：「这令很新，就是这样。」子玉道：「说一句话，合席饮一杯酒，这个令未免酒太多。他和谁说，谁饮一杯不好么？」琴言点头。宝珠道：「这个恐怕有弊。」子云道：「不妨，就吃醉了，我有醒酒丸。」于是大家依允。","en":"Baozhu proposed: \\"Why do we not make a forfeit rule for this evening based on Yunong's speaking? Every time he says a sentence, the whole table drinks a cup.\\" Ziyun laughed warmly: \\"What a novel rule. Let it be so.\\" Ziyu reasoned: \\"For every sentence spoken, the whole table must drink a cup; that would mean far too much wine. Would it"},{"paragraph":37,"mentions":3,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴言问子云道：「是什么醒酒丸？这丸叫什么名字？」子云一一说了，共是两杯。琴言问次贤道：「今日为什么回来得这样迟？」次贤道：「替人做媒，回来迟了。」也饮一杯。琴言把子玉看了一看，都不言语，回转头来问子云道：「这园梅花共有多少株？」宝珠咳嗽一声，子云道：「约","en":"Qinyan asked Ziyun: \\"What sobering pills are those? What are they called?\\" Ziyun answered each question in turn, which came to two cups for himself. Qinyan then asked Cixian: \\"Why did you return so late today?\\" Cixian replied: \\"I was acting as a matchmaker"},{"paragraph":38,"mentions":7,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"宝珠过来，替子云斟了，就便向子云耳边说了一句。琴言道：「你们改令，是要罚十杯。」子玉道：「没有人改的。」宝珠过来要与子玉斟酒，琴言把子玉的杯子拿了道：「我又没有和他说话，为什么要给他酒吃呢？」宝珠道：「他和你说话也是一样。」琴言道：「这个我不依。」子玉倒不好意思道：「我原是想酒吃罢了，吃一杯罢。」琴","en":"Baozhu came over and filled Ziyun's cup, then leaned over and whispered something secretively in his ear. Qinyan warned: \\"If you change the rules, the penalty is ten cups.\\" Ziyu put in: \\"No one changed anything.\\" Baozhu came over to fill Ziyu's cup. Qinyan took up Ziyu's cup and argued: \\"I did not speak to him, so why should he get wine?\\" Baozhu countered: \\"Him"},{"paragraph":39,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云虽曾经握过，此时也只能艳羡而已。子玉忆起日间那个琴言的手，又粗又黑，始知必非一人。宝珠心生一计，便道：","en":"clasped that hand himself, could now only look on in deep, admiring envy. Ziyu thought of the hand of that daytime Qinyan, rough and dark, and understood at long last that they must be two different people entirely. Baozhu thought of a clever scheme and asked:"},{"paragraph":40,"mentions":4,"tokens":["琴言","玉侬"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「你们大家看他的纤纤玉手作什么？」琴言把手一缩，宝珠随即取了这杯酒，送在子玉手内。琴言向子玉道：「这杯酒你偏不要吃。」子玉答应。子云道：「玉侬你该替我作主人，敬客一杯才是。」宝珠接口道：「况这个令，那头一句话，就不算向庾香说的，难道这句话也是和别人说的不成？」琴言想了一想，这话有理，只得","en":"\\"Why is everyone staring at his slender, delicate hand?\\" At this, Qinyan hastily drew back his hand, and Baozhu immediately seized the cup and placed it directly in Ziyu's hand. Qinyan turned to Ziyu: \\"You must not drink this cup.\\" Ziyu said nothing in reply. Ziyun instructed: \\"Yunong, you should represent me as host and"},{"paragraph":41,"mentions":1,"tokens":["玉侬"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉饮完酒，便问宝珠道：「方才这个玉侬，到底是谁？」","en":"When Ziyu had finished drinking, he turned and asked Baozhu: \\"Who exactly was that Yunong just now?\\""},{"paragraph":42,"mentions":3,"tokens":["玉侬","琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"宝珠笑道：「这个要问你的玉侬。」子云笑着唤道：「玉龄！你再来给梅少爷瞧瞧。」只见里面套间内走出一个人来，却是头里那个假琴言，垂手正色，侍立在子云身旁。这假琴言是华公子家八龄班内的一个，名字叫玉龄，本是子云家人，送给华公子。因其面貌有些相像，所以叫回应用。这就是子云移花接木之计。","en":"Baozhu laughed brightly: \\"That is something you must ask your own Yunong.\\" Ziyun, still laughing, called out: \\"Yuling! Come and show yourself again for Master Mei.\\" From the inner suite there emerged a person. It was the false Qinyan from before, standing with arms at his sides, composed and upright, attending quietly beside"},{"paragraph":43,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉一见，颇难为情，始恍然知初见那个琴言，实在是假的，疑团尽释。子云道：「我是要试试庾香的眼力，所以刻画无盐，唐突西子。今果被识透，足见高明。」就令玉龄取了两个大玉杯来道：「你代我敬梅少爷一杯。」玉龄斟了，送与子玉。子玉接着道：「酒已多了，天也不早了，我们用饭罢。」子云道：「吾兄若不饮这杯","en":"At the sight of him, Ziyu felt distinctly awkward, and suddenly everything became wonderfully clear: the Qinyan he had first seen was truly the false one. All his lingering doubts dissolved at once. Ziyun explained: \\"I wanted to test Brother Yuxiang's discernment, and so deliberately presented an inferior likeness to impose upon a true beauty. That you saw right"},{"paragraph":44,"mentions":5,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉今日初会琴言，天姿国色已经心醉。又饮这一大杯，虽说酒落欢肠，究竟饮已过量，觉得眼前花花绿绿的，支持不住。子云不敢再敬。大家吃饭，洗漱毕，子玉便要告辞。倒是琴言恐怕他醉了不受用，向子云要了一服仙桃益寿丸，泡制好了，吹得不甚热，给子玉服了。不多一会，子玉心里十分清爽","en":"Today was Ziyu's very first meeting with Qinyan, and the beauty of natural endowment and celestial grace had already deeply intoxicated his heart. Then to drink this large cup on top of all the rest, though joy poured into a joyful breast, meant the wine had passed its proper measure, and before his"}],"11":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"祖老太爷住的相府，府中极其宽大。现在父母、兄嫂都不在京住。此宅内仅子云夫妇二人，其余都是家人。子云与他夫人讲起琴言、子玉的事来，又羡慕他们缱绻的情致。袁氏夫人微笑，即问道：","en":"sprawling estate housed only Ziyun, his wife, and a retinue of servants. When he recounted the tender devotion between Qinyan and Ziyu to his wife, Mrs. Yuan, they both marveled at such delicate affection. Smiling, she asked:"}],"15":[{"paragraph":3,"mentions":5,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一人到樱桃巷去，找着了叶茂林，两人谈了半天。聘才拉他在扁食楼上吃了饭，即同到那些小旦寓处，打了几家茶围。末了到琴言处，琴言倒出来与聘才谈了几句，即问起子玉来。聘才就将子玉的心事，再装点了些，说得琴言着实感激，并与琴言约定了，明日同子玉前来相会。回来与子玉说知，子玉便添了一件心事，一夜未曾睡着。是夕士燮在尚书房值宿未回。到了次日，子玉正要打算和聘才去看琴言。忽见门","en":"together to call on various young dan actors, visiting several tea parlors in a row. At the last stop they went to Qinyan's place; Qinyan actually came out, exchanged a few words with Pincai, and asked after Ziyu. Pincai dressed up Ziyu's feelings for him a little more vividly, and spoke in such a way that Qinyan was genuinely moved. He also arranged with Qinyan to bring"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":6,"tokens":["杜玉侬","玉侬","琴言","琴官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"瞒着我们定的好情。」子玉只当说他定亲，倒害躁起来。文泽道：「定得什么情？」南湘道：「前日我在度香处，他说有个叫杜玉侬，是古往今来第一个名旦，被庾香独占去子。他们还在怡园唱了一出《定情》。」文泽道：「那个叫杜玉侬？我们怎么也没有见过。」南湘道：「好得很。据度香、静宜品题，似乎在宝珠之上，我却不认得。庾香今日何不同我们去赏鉴赏鉴？」子玉听了，才知不是问他定亲，然却是初","en":"this?\\" Nanxiang said, \\"The other day I was at Duxiang's place; he told me there is a young dan actor called Du Yunong — the finest name actor of all ages past and present — and that Yuxiang has taken exclusive possession of him. They even performed a scene from 'Fixing Affection' (定情) at the Garden of Contentment together.\\" Wenze said, \\"Who is this Du Yunong? How is"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"文泽的跟班进去，一问琴言不在家，听得里头说道，就是刘大人带到春喜园去了。文泽一个没趣，子玉倒觉喜欢。南湘道：「那里去？我还没有吃饭，对门不是妙香堂素兰家么，咱们就找香畹去。」文泽道：「只怕也未必在家。叫人去问一问。「素兰却好在家，里头有人出来，请了进去，到客厅坐下，送了茶。","en":"Wenze's attendant went inside to inquire; Qinyan was not at home — they heard from within that the Lord Liu had taken him to Chunxi Garden. Wenze was somewhat put out; Ziyu, on the other hand, felt quietly relieved. Nanxiang said, \\"Where to now? I haven't eaten yet — isn't that Miaoxiang Hall, where"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"来，到这边坐下。南湘道：「我们还没有吃饭，你快拿饭来。」素兰即吩咐厨房备饭。子玉虽见过素兰的《舞盘》，那日为了琴言，恰未留心。今见素兰，秀若芝兰，艳如桃李，极清中恰生出极艳来。年纪是十七岁，穿一件莲花色绉绸绵袄，星眸低缬，香辅微开，真令人消魂荡魄。便暗暗十分赞叹，也不在琴言、宝珠之下，只不知性情脾气怎样。外面已送进酒肴来，三人也不推让，随意坐了。素兰斟酒，谓子玉","en":"seen Sulan's performance of \\"Dancing on the Tray\\" before, on that occasion he had been entirely preoccupied with Qinyan and had not paid Sulan any attention. Now, seeing Sulan before him — refined as orchid and iris, radiant as peach and plum, out of the purest clarity blooming the most vivid brightness — Ziyu was struck with admiration. He was seventeen years of age,"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":6,"tokens":["琴言","玉侬"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"他的相好是谁？」素兰道：「他的相好，倒天天到我这里来，就住在对门，你怎么过门不入？快去请了他来。」子玉方悟出是琴言，心里想道：「怎么他们都会知道了。」文泽道：「何如？连庾香的相好，他都知道，可见你们交情很深。」南湘道：「我们先到对门，琴言不在家，方到这里来。」素兰道：「原来因他不在家，你们才过来。」子玉听了，心上恰有些过意不去，正要开口，文泽接着道：「我们从那一","en":"is it you have not called, passing his door? Go and invite him here.\\" Only then did Ziyu understand that it was Qinyan. His heart misgave him: \\"How is it they all know about this?\\" Wenze said, \\"You see — even Yuxiang's beloved is known to him. Clearly you two are on terms of deep friendship.\\" Nanxiang said, \\"We went first to the other side of the lane — Qinyan was not"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":5,"tokens":["玉侬","琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"有一日瑶卿在此，我与他说起来，瑶卿便把你们的情节，说了一个透彻。玉侬以后自己也说出来道：「我有些像你，见我如见你一样。」所以时常到我这里来，并不是与我真心相好，不过借我作幅画图小影，你道这情深不深？人家费了这片心，难得你今日来，我所以替他明白明白，教你知道，不教他白费了这片心。」子玉听了，便如哑子吃黄连，说不出苦来，","en":"day Yaoqing was here, and I brought it up with him; Yaoqing then laid out your situation in full. After that, Yunong himself admitted it: 'I am somewhat like you. To see me is to see you.' So it is for that reason that he comes here so often. It is not that he is genuinely drawn to me as a friend; he is merely using me as a painted portrait, a small likeness. Would"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":4,"tokens":["玉侬"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"伺候过几回，人倒谦雅的，就总没有赏过一句话儿。倒不料他生出那么一个风流的公子。这梅庾香前日竟在香畹处吃饭，还到玉侬处，没有遇见。据香畹说，他待玉侬的情分，竟是有一无二的。」子云道：「你怎么知道他去找玉侬？是他一人去的么。」宝珠道：「是香畹对我讲的，他恰与竹君、前舟二人同去，香畹还送了他一柄扇子，他们倒也合式了。」次贤道：「我看前日庾香、玉侬二人，真可谓用志不纷，","en":"romantic-hearted son. This Mei Yuxiang was actually at Xiangwan's place for dinner the other day, and then went over to Yunong's place without finding him. According to Xiangwan, the depth of his feeling for Yunong is truly unparalleled.\\" Ziyun said, \\"How do you know he went to find Yunong? Did he go alone?\\" Baozhu said, \\"It was Xiangwan who told me. He went with Zhujun and"},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":4,"tokens":["琴言","玉侬"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"道：「《西厢》呢，用那一句？」子云想了一想，笑道：「《西厢》上可用的恰又不是这个韵。」四人在花下坐了，子云问起琴言今日何以不来，宝珠道：「今日他又替我到堂会里去了。他就有一样好处，他唱戏时并不很留心关目，他那丰韵生得好，就将他自己的神情，行乎所当行，倒比那戏文上的老关目还好些。所以才有人说他生疏，也有人说他神妙。」子云笑道：「以后梅庾香，大约非玉侬之戏不看，非玉","en":"from *The Western Chamber* happen not to fit this rhyme.\\" The four of them sat under the flowers; Ziyun asked why Qinyan had not come today. Baozhu said, \\"Today he went again to a private banquet in my place. He has one particular virtue: when he performs, he does not pay close attention to the prescribed stage business; but his natural elegance and charm are such that"}],"16":[{"paragraph":24,"mentions":1,"tokens":["玉侬"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"人出来？可曾到过对门？见你心上人么？」子玉笑道：「今日走了好几处，没有见着一个。我本为你而来，对门也未去，不知玉侬在家不在家？」素兰叹口气不言语，子玉心疑，便问道：「香畹因何不快？」素兰道：「我自己倒没有什么不快，我想起你心上人，你们背地里这本胡涂帐，将来怎么算得清楚，白教没相干的眼泪，淌了许多，到底亦不晓得为什么。问他，他又不说，猜抹也猜抹不出来。其实你们又不","en":"visited several places today but found no one. I came specifically to see you and haven't crossed the street. Is Yunong at home?\\" Sulan let out a soft sigh and fell silent. Puzzled, Ziyu asked, \\"Why does Xiangwan seem so unhappy?\\" Sulan replied, \\"It is not I who am unhappy. I was thinking of the one in your heart. This tangled, unspoken bond between you two—how will it"},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":1,"tokens":["玉侬"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「这光景是里头有客，只怕不便进去，不如回去，先着人进去看看何如？」子玉心上略有一分不自在，不晓里面所请是何客，玉侬陪与不陪？又想起他家里请客，断无不陪之礼。毫无主意，只听凭素兰进退。","en":"send someone to check the situation first.\\" Ziyu felt a wave of unease, uncertain of who was inside or whether Yunong was obliged to entertain them. He reasoned that one must naturally attend to their guests and could hardly refuse them. Lacking a better idea, he simply followed Sulan's lead."},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":7,"tokens":["琴言","玉侬","琴官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"素兰回到自己家门口，唤人往琴言处打听，不多一刻，来说琴言卧病在床，请客是他师傅长庆请分子，是部里几位经承先生，还是吃的早饭，不多一回就散的。素兰道：「再请到里面坐着等罢。」子玉听见心中略定，只得重进里面。无精打采的坐下。素兰只管笑嘻嘻的问长问短，又问你到底待那玉侬何如？子玉被问不","en":"Sulan returned to his own gate and sent someone to inquire at Qinyan's residence. Shortly after, the messenger returned, reporting that Qinyan was confined to his bed with an illness. The guests had been invited by his master, Changqing; they were several clerks from the Board who had come for an early meal and would"},{"paragraph":30,"mentions":1,"tokens":["玉侬"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"素兰亦觉凄楚，便淌下泪来，半晌劝道：「你们两人前生竟有些瓜葛，不然何至于此？以君才貌而论，是人人怜爱的。但似玉侬之冰雪心肠，独为你缠绵宛转。","en":"to this? With your talents and bearing, you are naturally cherished by all. But it is truly extraordinary that Yunong—a soul of ice and snow—should intertwine his feelings so tenderly for you alone."},{"paragraph":31,"mentions":5,"tokens":["玉侬"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"以度香之百般体贴，亦算温柔乡中一个知己。我看玉侬待他，不如待君十分之二，难得度香更加爱惜，说道：「人各有缘，此中系天定，非人情能强。」且庾香属意玉侬一人，毫不移动，此真是多情种子，非玉侬不足为庾香赏识，非庾香不足为玉侬眷恋。《国风》好色而不淫，其庾香、玉侬之谓乎！」子玉听了，感激度香万分，且爱素兰","en":"gentle warmth and devoted attentions, he is merely a kindred spirit in the realm of affection. I can see that Yunong's regard for him is not even a fraction of what he feels for you. Yet Duxiang cherishes him all the more, believing that 'each has his own predestined affinity, determined by heaven and beyond the coercion of human feeling.' Furthermore, your heart,"},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":7,"tokens":["琴言","玉侬"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"因谈了许多时候，素兰又请子玉随意用了些点心，着人再到琴言处探望。来人回来道：「起先之客倒散了。偏又来了一班人，说要叫琴言，长庆回他不在家，那些人不肯去，坐着等候。长庆因不认识他们，便不应酬，自到房里吃烟去了。被他们闯进去，将长庆的烟枪抢了，要到兵马司衙门出首他。长庆无法，只得赔礼，又请了他间壁槽房李四、缎","en":"They conversed for a long while before Sulan offered Ziyu refreshments and sent another messenger to check on Qinyan. The messenger returned with troubling news: \\"The first group of guests has left, but unfortunately, another group arrived demanding to see Qinyan. Changqing told them he was not at home, but they refused to leave and sat down to wait. Since Changqing"}],"17":[{"paragraph":4,"mentions":1,"tokens":["玉侬"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"南湘道：「没有人了？」王恂道：「尚有何人呢？」南湘道：「你好记性，你既大会群花，倒忘了一个花王。既有庾香，没有玉侬，独使他一人向隅，是何道理？」","en":"convening a grand assembly of flowers, you have actually forgotten a king of flowers. To invite Yuxiang but exclude Yunong, leaving him alone in the corner, lacks all reason.\\""},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":3,"tokens":["琴言","玉侬"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"王恂道：「是呀，我真该打，一时竟忘了琴言，是必要他来的。还有那个秦琪官号玉艳的也叫了他来，凑成十个。」众人道：「如此更妙。」子玉道：「如今我们商议起来，怎样邀客。」王恂道：「你作一小札与怡园徐、萧二公，前舟以及余人，我们明日自去知会。」于是大家直谈至二更方散。子玉送了诸人，独坐凝思了一回，","en":"Wang Xun said: \\"Quite right, I deserve a reprimand! I entirely forgot Qinyan for a moment, yet he absolutely must come. And that Qin Qiguan, styled Yuyan, should be summoned too, making it a perfect ten.\\" Everyone said: \\"That is even better.\\" Ziyu said: \\"Now that we have discussed it, how shall we invite the guests?\\" Wang Xun"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":3,"tokens":["杜琴言","琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"药、海棠等花开满。少停。即去知会群花，于明日辰刻毕集。因说道：「明日花林中，恐有几个不能来。我知道秦琪官害眼，杜琴言亦患病未痊。昨晚我见素兰，谈及庾香在彼处坐了半日，去访琴言，恰值他师傅请客没有进去，琴言亦未知庾香去访他。明日就使他们两个不来，也有八人，很为热闹的了。庾香、静宜想一定来的。」南湘道：「席间行令，新鲜的甚少，太难了又恐座客一时不能，须得雅俗共赏，易知","en":"\\"Tomorrow among the floral forest, I fear a few may be unable to attend. I know Qin Qiguan suffers an eye ailment, and Du Qinyan is also ill and not yet recovered. Last night I saw Sulan, who mentioned that Yuxiang sat there for half the day, then went to visit Qinyan; it happened that his master was hosting guests so he did not enter, and Qinyan remained unaware that Yuxiang"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":1,"tokens":["杜玉侬"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"芳连称不敢，看了子玉仪容，心中暗暗赞赏：「真是天上日星，人间鸾凤，有一段孚瑜和粹之情，皎皎乎有出群之致。怪不得杜玉侬倾倒如此，与我田郎可谓瑜亮并生矣！」子玉又与陆素兰等相见，忽听外面说：「徐老爷同萧老爷来了。」众人一齐出厅迎接，只见子云同了次贤翩翩的，俨似太原公子裼裘而来，后面随着袁宝珠、王兰保二人。再后还有八个清俊书童，拿着衣包、铜盆、漱盂等物。","en":"unblemished purity and harmonious essence, shining brightly with a grace that rises above the crowd. No wonder Du Yunong is so deeply enchanted by him. Alongside my Tian, they might be called twin paragons, a Zhou Yu and a Zhuge Liang born in the same age!\\" Ziyu then greeted Lu Sulan and the others. Suddenly they heard from outside: \\"Master Xu and Master Xiao have arrived!\\""},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"翁来罚其三大觞。」蕙芳似觉脸红，宝珠道：「今日的客，尚短几人？」文泽道：「就止寿翁一人。花部中未到的尚有四人：琴言、琪官都有病，早来辞了，桂保、春喜是必来的。等湘帆一到，就可坐了。」","en":"arrive today?\\" Wenze said: \\"Just the birthday-star, one person. Among the flower contingent, four are absent: Qinyan and Qiguan are both ill and sent their regrets early this morning; Guibao and Chunxi will certainly be here. Once Xiangfan arrives, we can take our seats.\\""},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"回答两句，又惹出许多话来。子玉颇敬春航仪容之洒落，与蕙芳正是冰壶秋月，相映生辉。又复品评诸花，各有佳妙，只不见琴言前来，殊觉怦怦欲动。","en":"turn, each possessing their own unique loveliness. The only thing that diminished his pleasure was the absence of Qinyan, which left him with an unsettled flutter in his chest."},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"交错，履舄纷遗，极尽少年雅集之乐，内中有几个已是玉山半颓，海棠欲睡的光景。席上人人心畅，个个情欢。只有子玉念着琴言卧病在床，知是恹恹神思，药炉半烬，深闭绿窗，不知怎样烦闷。又晓得我今日在此热闹之场，必思冷静。此时怎能走到彼处，安慰他几句，与他瀹茗添香，助起他的精神来。他又不要疑我乐即忘忧，当此群花大会，便就忘了他，那时更觉闷上加闷。偏偏素兰又在此，不然他还可以过","en":"to doze. At the tables, everyone's heart was at ease, every face glowing with joy. Only Ziyu kept thinking of Qinyan lying ill in bed, knowing he would be listless and depressed. His medicine-stove half-burned, his green window shut tight; he could not imagine the degree of his tedium. And he knew that Qinyan, aware of today's festive scene, would certainly be yearning"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"奇。」宝珠道：「我偏不用人教也赢得你。」文泽道：「今日我们亦算极乐了，可惜花部中少了两人，那个还不要紧，第一是琴言不来，使庾香不能畅意。」子云道：「可不是！琴言的病颇为古怪，精神疲软，饮食不思，已经十余天了，不见好。」次贤道：「我昨日诊他的脉，似积劳，兼之感愤忧郁，昨日痰中竟有血点，非静养数月不能痊愈。」","en":"is a pity that two are absent from the flower contingent. The other is no great matter, but first and foremost Qinyan's absence has prevented Yuxiang from being fully at ease.\\" Ziyun said: \\"Indeed! Qinyan's illness is rather mysterious: listless in spirit, no desire to eat or drink; it has been over ten days with no improvement.\\" Cixian said: \\"Yesterday I took his pulse,"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，净净脸，素兰取出一颗醒酒丸给子玉吃了。子玉不好意思，只得勉强扎挣。素兰见子玉不语不言，似醉非醉，心上猜着是为琴言未来。一因人多不好解慰他，二因提起琴言反恐倒勾他的心事，非惟不能宽解，越增愁闷了，反倒走开，找别人说话。文泽命小厮于每位座前，列一小几，置放笔砚一副，花笺数张，研好了墨，大家就请次贤起句。次贤道：「把寿字撇开罢。」又说声「僭了！」提起笔来写了一句，便","en":"Seeing that Ziyu was silent and listless, half-drunk and half-sober, Sulan guessed in his heart that it was because Qinyan had not come. Firstly, there were too many people around to comfort him properly; secondly, he feared that bringing up Qinyan would only stir his feelings further, failing to relieve his mind while adding to his melancholy. So instead he walked away"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「奇了，人家骂你们，我替你们不平，自然也有不像兔子的，你们倒骂我，真是好人难做。」以下要子玉了，子玉心上正想着琴言，觉得无情无绪，众人亦都明白。子玉虽极意遮饰，终究思绪不佳，不得已，勉强写道：「顾盼曾回玉女眸。鸾篦亲掠云鬟绿。」春航道：「此系上妆时了，底下倒要细细摹写呢。」子玉此时想着琴言唱那《惊梦》的神情，所以有」曾回玉女眸」一句。众人不解其故，不过见其兴致不","en":"your honor, yet you scold me. Truly no good deed goes unpunished.\\" It was now Ziyu's turn; Ziyu's mind was on Qinyan, feeling hollow and listless, as everyone well understood. Though Ziyu tried his utmost to conceal it, his inspiration was at a low ebb, and he had no choice but to strain and write:\\n\\n\\"A glance in passing, that jade-girl's eyes turned back once;\\nluan-comb"},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"兰为莲花，玉林为碧桃，漱芳为海棠，兰保为玫瑰，桂保为芙蓉，春喜小而多才，人人钟爱为兰花。八人品题尽合，因又想到琴言、琪官为何花？子云道：「琴言色艺过佳，而性情过冷，比为梅花最是相称，且其酷爱梅，不属庾香将谁属耶？」众人说道；「很是。」高品道：「只怕和靖先生不依，庾香割了他靴革幼子了。」","en":"beloved by all, was assigned the orchid. The eight assignments all felt fitting. They then wondered what flowers Qinyan and Qiguan should be. Ziyun said: \\"Qinyan's art and beauty are exceptional, yet his temperament is exceedingly cool. Likening him to the plum blossom is most apt; and since his passionate love of the plum is not for Yuxiang's sake, then whose?\\" Everyone"},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"花谱中添了琪官，惟琴言尚未痊愈。高品、文泽因南湘说过，「一客不来罚我做东一日。」子玉是日不到，罚了南湘一天，南湘甚为乐从。即在他家里又叙了一日。惟有子玉、琴言皆未痊愈。正是：数点梅花娇欲坠，月轮又下竹桥西。未知如何，且听下回分解。","en":"Qiguan was added to the flower register; only Qinyan had still not recovered. Gao Pin and Wenze held Nanxiang to what he had said: \\"If one guest is absent, I'll be fined to host a day.\\" Since Ziyu did not come that day, Nanxiang was fined a day of hosting; Nanxiang was thoroughly happy to oblige. Another"}],"18":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说琴言病体恹恹，闭门谢客，只有同班中几个相好时来宽慰。宝珠、素兰又说子玉前日的光景，又不能常来看你，托我们传话，千万保重等语，琴言更加伤感。自患病以来，各处不去，怡园亦屏迹已久。奈其师长庆靠他做个摇钱树，因其久病，不能见客，便也少了好些兴头。","en":"Qinyan's illness lingered and he remained listless, keeping his door closed to visitors; only a few close friends from the same troupe came by from time to time to offer comfort. Baozhu and Sulan also passed on word from Ziyu, recounting his recent days and"},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"到时运退了，只好在班子里，打旗儿去杂脚，那时只得比做狗了。此是做师傅的刻板面目。琴言自去年腊月到京，迄今四个月，徐子云已去白金数千，不为不多，是以长庆待琴言分外好。","en":"to the status of \\"dogs.\\" Such was the standard life-portrait of a troupe teacher. Four months had passed since Qinyan arrived in the capital the previous twelfth month. In that time, Xu Ziyun had already spent several thousand taels of silver. This was no small sum, and it explained why Changqing treated Qinyan exceptionally well."},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"若使琴言病了一年半载，只怕也要变了心，此是旁人疑议，且按下不题。","en":"Should Qinyan remain ill for a year and a half, one might fear Changqing's heart would change. However, this remained mere speculation by others, and we shall let it rest for now."}],"19":[{"paragraph":8,"mentions":3,"tokens":["琴官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"人家天天总叫那个人。我前日见联珠班内有个叫玉林，生得很好，一下台就有人同了出去，想是很红的。」聘才道：「料没有琴官好。」梅窗道：「那个琴官？」聘才就把新年看戏的话，略述了些，又道：「这琴官除了梅庾香之外，其余见了总是冰冷的，恐怕叫他不来。」梅窗道：「那里有叫不动的相公，今日你就叫他。」聘才心内想道：「如今我在华府，他们也应该知道了，自然看我不比从前，就去叫他，如","en":"stepped off stage someone took him out, so he must be very popular.\\" Pincai said: \\"I expect he's not as good as Qinguan.\\" Meichuang said: \\"Which Qinguan?\\" Pincai briefly recounted the story of watching the opera at New Year's, and added: \\"This Qinguan is always icy cold to everyone except Mei Yuxiang; I'm afraid he won't come if called.\\" Meichuang said: \\"Where is there"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琴官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"只见那走堂的进来道：「琴官、玉林都说病着不能来，蓉官就来。」聘才原料琴官不来的，只好罢了。倒是杨梅窗心上不快，说道：「怎么叫三个人，倒有两个不来？不知是真病呢，还是推托的？笑梅道：「自然是真病，推托什么。」聘才道：「还有个琪官也是很好的，我正月里叫过他几回，倒是全来的。」聘才","en":"Then the waiter came in and said: \\"Qinguan and Yulin both say they're ill and can't come; Rongguan is coming.\\" Pincai had originally expected Qinguan wouldn't come, so he simply let it be. But Yang Meichuang was displeased in his heart and said: \\"How is it that of three people called, two are"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"说罢自己也笑了。聘才心中暗忖道：「倒不料琴官、琪官，既唱了戏，还这么傲性子，有骨气，这也奇了。」即问二喜道这奚十一到底是什么人？这样横行霸道，又这样有钱？」二喜道：「我听得春兰讲，说也是个少爷，他家祖太爷做过布政司，他父亲现做提督呢。」聘才道：「如今春兰呢？」二喜道：「同出去了。」于是大家又谈","en":"Having said this, Erxi laughed himself. Pincai thought privately: \\"Who would have expected that Qinguan and Qiguan, even as performers, should be so proud and dignified, so steadfast in their principles. That is something to marvel at.\\" He then asked Erxi who exactly this Xi Eleven was, and how he could behave so lawlessly and still have so much money."}],"20":[{"paragraph":3,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这回书又要说几个风雅人，做件风雅事情。如今这一班名士，渐渐的散了。子玉自从与琴言怡园一叙之后，总未能会面。琴言之病，时好时发，也不进园子唱戏，有时力疾到怡园一走。","en":"affair of elegant taste. The company of celebrated men had by now gradually thinned. Since Ziyu's one meeting with Qinyan at the Garden of Contentment, they had never managed to see each other again. Qinyan's illness came and went; he was not appearing in the troupe's productions, and only occasionally, forcing himself despite illness, would he go to the Garden of Contentment"},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":6,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"而子玉之病亦系忧闷而起，或到怡园时，偏值琴言不来；或到琴言寓里，偏又逢着他们有事，不是他师傅请客，就是有人坐着。又不便再寻素兰，子玉亦觉得无可奈何，只好怅恨缘悭而已。这边琴言在家，并不知子玉来过几次，又听得子玉害病，心上更是悲酸，因为没有到过梅宅，不便自去。正是一点怜才慕色之心，无可宽解，惟有","en":"Ziyu's own illness had also arisen from melancholy and worry; sometimes when he went to the Garden of Contentment, Qinyan happened not to have come; sometimes when he went to Qinyan's lodgings, there was always some inconvenience — either his teacher Changqing was entertaining guests, or someone was sitting there. He also could not easily go to Sulan's again; Ziyu felt"}],"21":[{"paragraph":3,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，不能见效。世人说得好，心病须将心药医。这是七情所感而起，叫这些草根树皮如何解劝得来。只有子玉自己明白，除非是琴言亲来，爽爽快快的谈一昼夜，即可霍然。倒是聘才猜着了几分，进来问了好些话。子玉因这几日没人来，便觉气闷，聘才来了，也稍可排解。问那华公府内光景，聘才即把华公子称赞得上天下地选不出来，又夸其亲随林珊枝及八龄班怎样的好，就说琴言也不能及他。","en":"passions stirred from the seven emotions cannot be soothed by roots and bark. Only Ziyu himself understood — unless Qinyan came in person and talked freely through a whole day and night he could not suddenly recover. Pincai guessed part of this; entering, he asked many questions. With no visitors these few days Ziyu felt stifled — Pincai's presence eased him somewhat. Asked"},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":11,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉听到提起琴言，便又感动他的心事，即对聘才道：「琴言原是吾兄说起的，及我亲见其人，果是绝世无双，怎么如今说有多少比他好的呢？」聘才道：「琴言相貌原生得好，但其性情过冷，譬如一枝花，颜色是好极了，偏在树高头，攀折不到，叫你不能亲近他，人若爱花，自然爱那近在手边的了；","en":"At mention of Qinyan Ziyu's old sorrow stirred; he said to Pincai: \\"You were the first to speak of Qinyan — when I met him he seemed peerless in the world; how can there now be so many said to surpass him?\\" Pincai replied: \\"Qinyan's looks are indeed fine, but his temper"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"恰好长庆出门去了，聘才便径进琴言卧室。只见绿窗深闭，小院无人，庭前一棵梅树，结满了一树黄梅，红绽半边，地下也落了几个。忽听得一声：「客来了，莫要进来！」抬头一看，檐下却挂了一个白鹦鹉，见聘才便说起话来。对面厢房内，走出一人，便来挡住道：「相公病着，不能见客，请老爷外面客房里坐罢。」","en":"As it happened Changqing had gone out; Pincai walked straight into Qinyan's bedchamber. Green windows were tightly shut; the small yard stood empty; a plum tree bore clusters of yellow fruit, half flushed red on one side, several fallen on the ground. Suddenly a voice cried: \\"A guest — do not enter!\\" Looking up he saw a white"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"聘才再欲进内，只见琴言掀着帘子出来。聘才举目看时，见他穿一件湖色纺绸夹袄，蓝纱薄绵半臂，却比从前消瘦了几分，正似雪里梅花，偏甘冷淡，越觉得动人怜爱。即让聘才在上边坐了，自己却远远的坐在靠窗琴桌边一张梅花式样凳上，叫人送了一碗茶，又有个小孩子拿了一枝白铜水烟袋，与聘才装了几","en":"Pincai was about to step further when Qinyan lifted the curtain and came out. At first sight he wore a pale lake-green lined silk jacket and blue gauze short-sleeved surcoat — somewhat thinner than before, like plum in snow that prefers cold — only the more pitiable and lovely. He seated Pincai"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":8,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"聘才知琴言听错了，便道：「庾香是没有搬家，如今我在城里住，不在庾香处了。」琴言听了，便不言语，似觉精神不振，就有些烦闷光景。聘才想道：「他问庾香就高高兴兴的，对我就是这样冰冷，实在可恶。横竖他们不常见面，待我捏造些事哄他，且看他如何？」问琴言道：「这月内见过庾","en":"Pincai saw that Qinyan had misunderstood him and explained, \\"Yuxiang has not moved house. It is I who now live inside the city and no longer stay with him.\\" At once Qinyan fell silent. The little brightness that had risen in him faded, and a shadow of fretfulness crossed his"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":10,"tokens":["玉侬","琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"瞌睡来，我怕他不好意思，只好辞了出来。走到门房门口，见跟那联珠班内蓉官的得子与那些三爷们讲话，我知道是蓉官了。玉侬，你想蓉官这种东西，交他做什么？\\n就叫个相公，也不用瞒人。我真不懂我们这个兄弟的脾气。我也知道你为了他，很有一番情。他起初却很惦记你。又听得人说，他找你几回，你不见他，他所以心就冷了。你不问我，我不便说，你既问我，我就不忍瞒你。好顽相公，也是常事，我","en":"of the Lianzhu troupe, chatting with several of the young gentlemen. Then I knew the hidden man was Rongguan. Yunong, think of it—what possible reason has he to associate with a creature like that?\\n\\n\\"Even if he chooses to amuse himself with an actor, why conceal it from others? I truly cannot understand our brother's temperament. I know how deeply you have cared for"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":5,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"再说琴言在床卧了，觉得阵阵心酸，淌了许多眼泪，左思右想，不能明白。忽想起素兰那日之言，说同庾香前来，因为师傅请客，不得进内，说到此又被人打断。这几天又寻不着他，何不再寻他来一问，便知庾香的光景了。即着人去寻素兰，素兰回家即换了便服过来，这边琴言接着，就在房里","en":"Qinyan lay on the bed — wave on wave of acid grief — tears without end — could not puzzle it out. He recalled Sulan's words that day — he and Yuxiang had come but the master was feasting guests and could not enter — then someone cut the tale short; these days"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":3,"tokens":["玉侬","琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，庾香也赞了几声。度香在旁说道：「湘帆好一个浓艳文心，愈艳愈好，愈浓愈好。」度香正赞湘帆的文章，庾香忽说道：「玉侬自然在玉艳之上，玉艳虽好，尚逊瑶卿、媚香一筹，而玉侬则玉树琼花，似非人间花谱中可以位置。」静宜、度香初听了不知他说些什么，后来想了出来：「他误听「愈浓、愈艳」，当是问你与琪官那个好？他就所以说出这两句来，惹得静宜、度香笑个不了。庾香也想出错来，便着实","en":"drift — then realized: he misheard 'thick and rich' as asking which of you or Qiguan ranks higher — he answered: 'Yunong naturally above Yuyan — Yuyan though fine still falls short of Yaoqing and Meixiang — while Yunong stands like trees of jade and blossoms of pearl — no place on human flower-lists.' Jingyi and Duxiang laughed until they could not stand — Yuxiang saw"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":3,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"素兰安慰道：「哭什么？你病还没有好些，就这么伤心，正是雪上加霜了，所以我不肯对你讲，知道你要伤心的」。琴言忽又蹬足道：「这魏聘才真不是个东西，无缘无故的糟蹋人，玷污人，造言生事。」素兰问道：「那个魏聘才？你因甚骂他？」琴言便将帕子掩了脸，索性哭个不止。素兰只得再三解劝，劝得住了哭，把前日宝珠、蕙芳行的酒令说给琴言听。说瑶卿还罢了，第一媚香尖利不肯吃亏的，","en":"soothed: \\"Why weep — you are barely mending — grief only heaps frost on snow — that is why I would not tell.\\" Qinyan stamped: \\"Wei Pincai is less than human — slandering and staining people for nothing.\\" Sulan asked who Wei Pincai was; Qinyan hid his face in the sleeve and wept without stopping; Sulan coaxed until he ceased, then told the drinking game the other day"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴言听了这些话，略有笑容。素兰便问魏聘才是何人，琴言略把去年搭船进京，及住在梅宅的话，说了几句，即对素兰道：「细听起来，这魏聘才真是个小人，你问他怎的，不如不提他为妙。」素兰道：「不为别的，我昨日在春阳楼吃饭，听得说，掌柜的闹了一件事，得罪了华公府一个师","en":"Hearing this, Qinyan smiled a little. Sulan asked who Wei Pincai was, and Qinyan gave him a few words about coming up to the capital by boat the year before and lodging at the Mei house, and then said, \\"When one listens closely, this Wei Pincai is a mean sort of man. Why"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"听得人说那个人也姓魏，叫什么才，却是华公府里的。」琴言道：「我却听得他说，如今住在城里，不在庾香处了，我也没有问他在那里。」素兰道：「我听走堂的说起来，却说得原原委委。新年上，这姓魏的同了几个人，带着保珠、二喜，吃了五十几吊钱，掌柜的因不认识，写账的时候，想必说了什么话。","en":"\\"People said the man was also surnamed Wei — something Cai — from the Hua mansion.\\" Qinyan said: \\"I heard him say he lives in the city now — not at Yuxiang's — I did not ask where.\\" Sulan said: \\"The waiters told the tale end to end. New Year's week this Wei and others brought Baozhu and Erxi — fifty-odd strings — the boss did not know him"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":13,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"讲了情，只打了二十，才放出来；又送了两桌酒席与张二爷。他们说是魏什么才，方才听你骂他，想必就是这个魏聘才了。」琴言道：「管他是不是，横竖叫魏聘才的总不是东西就是了。」因又问道：「那日你同庾香来，遇见我师傅请客。那一回的说话，还没有说完，到底讲什么？」素兰就把那一天子玉的光景，细细述了一遍，又道：「我也为你说得口渴了，你茶都没有一碗。」琴言笑道：「说话说得要紧，忘","en":"Hearing you curse him just now, I imagine it can only have been this Wei Pincai.\\"\\n\\n\\"Whether it was or not,\\" said Qinyan, \\"anyone named Wei Pincai is certainly no decent thing.\\" He then asked, \\"That day when you came with Yuxiang and found my master entertaining guests, you never finished what you had begun to tell me. What exactly was said?\\"\\n\\nSulan recounted in careful"}],"22":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":3,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说前回书中，陆素兰应许了琴言约子玉出来相会，话便说了这一句，明日恰好是端午，是没有工夫的。偏又接连唱了三天堂会戏，素兰身子也乏了，又静养几天。这边琴言是度日如年，天天使人来问他，把个素兰弄得没有主意。又因自己寓中来往人多，也不甚便。若借人地方，或是酒楼饭馆，一发不好说话，又不便","en":"The last chapter told how Lu Sulan promised Qinyan that he would arrange for Ziyu to come out for a meeting. But no sooner was the promise spoken than the next day proved to be the Dragon Boat Festival, when there was no leisure to be had; and then came three days running of private engagement performances,"},{"paragraph":2,"mentions":2,"tokens":["玉侬","琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"叫书童写的也未可知。即拆开一看，第一行是陆素兰谨启，庾香公子吟坛云云。」心中倒觉跳了一跳，香畹何故作札来，莫非玉侬有什么缘故么？遂即一字字的细看，看完了又看，至两三遍，脸上便自然发出笑来，便对云儿道：「你去叫来人候一候，我即写回信。」云儿出去了，子玉又看了一遍，便觉心花大开，病已去了九分，遂即忙研墨伸纸。前半写的是感激的话，后半写的是必到的话，准于明日辰刻赴约。","en":"Yuxiang\\" — at which his heart gave a leap. Why should Xiangwan be writing to him? Could something be afoot concerning Yunong? He read it word by word, and having finished, read it again, two and three times over, until a smile rose unbidden to his face. He said to Yun'er: \\"Go tell the messenger to wait a little; I will write a reply at once.\\" When Yun'er had gone out, Ziyu"},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":7,"tokens":["琴言","琴官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴言家里的几个人，尽着招赔软央，说道：「琴官实在有病，好不好都拿不定。这几天如果好了，总叫他师傅领着到两位太爷府上磕头。今儿求你能高高手，实在他病势沉得很，你就骂他，他也断不能出来。他师傅又进城去了，总求你能施点恩。过了今天，明日再说，我们替你能赔个礼，","en":"The several members of Qinyan's household did their best to placate them, pleading: \\"Qinguan is truly ill — it's still touch and go with him. If he mends within these few days, his master will surely bring him to both your lordships' gates to kowtow. Today we beg you to hold your"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"爷们吃什么？告诉你，太爷们是不上白肉馆、扁食楼的，一顿饭那一回不花十吊八吊，就这两吊钱？」说着凸出了眼珠看着。琴言的人，倒也心灵，便又赔笑道：「不要忙，这原是孝敬一位太爷的，还有两吊，再送出来。」即转身又拿出两吊钱，作了一个揖，再三求他们收了。那短衫子的尚作出怒容，那穿青衫子的便提了钱，搭上肩头，一手拉了那人出来。","en":"a dinner ever cost us less than eight or ten strings — and this is two?\\" And he glared with bulging eyeballs. Qinyan's man, quick of wit, smiled again: \\"No haste — that was meant to honor one of your lordships only; there are two strings more, we'll fetch them straight out.\\" He turned and brought out two more strings of cash, made a bow, and begged them again and again"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"大门，幸亏素兰跑的快已回去了。这条胡衕却是短的，两家斜对门，都在胡衕口边。那个人当是跑出胡衕，也不来追赶，便问琴言的人道：「方才这个小兔子，在那个班子里，在什么地方？他见三太爷就跑，三太爷偏要找他。」","en":"opposite, both at its mouth — and the man, supposing he had run clean out of the lane, gave up the chase and asked Qinyan's people: \\"That little rabbit just now — what troupe is he in, and where does he live? He runs at the sight of your Third Grandpa; then your Third Grandpa will make a point of finding him.\\""},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴言的人道：「这是登春班的，名字我倒想不起来，他住得远，在石头胡衕呢。」两人还是胡言乱道，一路歪歪斜斜的去了。里边琴言听得骂他，已经气得发昏。","en":"Qinyan's man answered: \\"He's from the Dengchun troupe — I can't recall his name. He lives a long way off, in Shitou Hutong.\\" The two men, still spouting their wild talk, went reeling and swaying away. Within, Qinyan, who had heard himself so abused, was already"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":4,"tokens":["琴官","琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这边陆素兰跑了回去，吓得心头乱跳，两颊飞红，几乎哭出来了。急到房中坐了，定了定神。好一回心上又惦记着琴官，受了这一场辱骂，不知气得怎么样子。欲要过去看他，恐又遇见那两个，踌躇了半晌，到底放心不下，只得叫人先去看了，没有人，方才三步两步忙忙的过去。到琴言房里，只见垂着蓝纱帐，一片呜咽之声。素兰挑起了帐子，一手拍着琴言道：「起来罢！好事来了，如今且不要气，","en":"into tears. He hurried to his room, sat down, and steadied his spirit. But after a while his heart went back to Qinguan: after such a storm of insult, who knew to what state rage had brought him? He wished to go over to see him, but feared to meet those two again; and after wavering a long while, still unable to set his mind at rest, he sent someone ahead to look. The"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":4,"tokens":["琴言","玉侬"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"二人正正对哭了半个时辰。琴言见素兰为他如此伤心，心中十分感激，便拉了素兰的手，重新又哭，素兰见琴言拉着他哭，知道是感激他的意思，便又想道：「琴言如此才貌，偏有如此磨折，是天地竟妒这些有才貌的人了。我素兰也是花中数一数二的，若天地也要妒忌起来，也把这些磨折来磨我，便与玉侬一样，那","en":"The two of them wept face to face for a full hour. Qinyan, seeing Sulan grieve so on his account, was filled with gratitude; he took Sulan's hand and wept afresh. Sulan, feeling Qinyan clasp him as he cried, knew it was meant in thankfulness, and thought: \\"With such talent and such beauty, Qinyan meets with"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":3,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"又想道：「方才那两个人赶骂出来，也是生平第一回，从此也惹些祸患出来，也未可知。」便也九转回肠，索性对着琴言大哭，哭得家里人人惊骇，都走进来站着，怔怔的，劝又不敢来劝，知道是为日间所闹的事了。有两个人只得进来解劝，劝得各人略住了，然后出去拿了两盆脸水，泡了两碗茶，各自退出。这边两人虽止了哭，却讲不出话来，仍是呜呜咽咽的，含着眼泪。又停了好一回，陆素兰开口道","en":"may yet spring from it?\\" At this his heart wound through its nine turns, and he gave way and wept aloud facing Qinyan, till the whole household took alarm and came crowding in to stand about, dazed, not daring to offer comfort, knowing well it was over the day's ugly business. Two of them at last came forward to soothe them, and when each had somewhat quieted, went"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":8,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"：「前日我原对你讲过，叫你留点神，不要得罪他，果然他已先下手了。」又想道：「究竟也是我们胡猜，也作不得准的。」琴言不语，呆呆的，又道：「横竖我也就死了，再有事，我也不怕。」素兰道：「你竟说傻话，死活是命中注定的，难道你自己去寻死不成？况且你当真死了，也连累了一个人，也要死了。」琴言道：「我是没有父母，又没有兄弟姊妹，连累了什么人？干净的就是我一个。」素兰道：「别","en":"the first blow.\\" Then he added: \\"Though after all this is only our guessing, and can't be taken for certain.\\" Qinyan said nothing, staring blankly; then: \\"I shall be dead soon in any case. Let anything more come — I am not afraid of it.\\" Sulan said: \\"Now you are talking folly. Life and death are written in fate — would you go seeking death yourself? Besides, if you"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"听着打了四更，忽呼呼起了几阵大风，就是倾盆大雨，雷电交加，琴言坐起来，长叹了几声。下过了一阵大雨，犹是萧萧索索的一阵细雨，雷声轰轰，只是不住，直到天明时，才止住了。","en":"several great gusts of wind came roaring up, and with them a downpour of rain, thunder and lightning interlocked. Qinyan sat up in bed and sighed long and deep. When the cloudburst had passed there lingered still a thin, soughing drizzle, and the thunder went rolling on without pause; only toward daybreak did it cease."},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴言也倦极了，伏枕而卧，倒又熟睡起来。梦见素兰与子玉先在船中，自己刚刚要上船来，忽见岸上跑出两人：一个穿青的，光着脊梁，盘着辫子，赶上来一把揪了过去，骂道：「你这小杂种，日间装病不见人，怎么如今又跑到这里来了？」琴言哭喊救命，把身子用力一挣，却自己仍在床","en":"Qinyan, utterly spent, sank upon his pillow and fell fast asleep after all. He dreamed that Sulan and Ziyu were already in the boat, and he himself just stepping aboard, when suddenly two men came running out upon the bank: one in dark clothes, bare to the"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":3,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"听得窗外鹦鹉说起话来，道：「昨日的人又来了。」又把琴言唬了一大跳，只道又是他两个人来找他。原来素兰候了一回，不见琴言过来，只得着人来请，对他师傅说是同到怡园去的。长庆应允，就催琴言起来。净了脸，吃了一碗冰燕，命跟班的捡出几件衣裳包了，带上车，辞了长庆，即到素兰处来。","en":"Then he heard the parrot outside the window begin to talk: \\"Yesterday's men have come again!\\" — and it gave Qinyan another great start, thinking those two had indeed come back for him. In fact it was Sulan who, having waited a while without sign of Qinyan, had sent a man to fetch him, with word to his master that they were going together to the Garden of Contentment."},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":6,"tokens":["玉侬"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"素兰笑道：「效力不周，偏偏玉侬今日病势加重，不能出来。又因昨日有两个无赖，把玉侬痛骂一顿，因此气坏了。我昨日既约你出来，今日又不好来辞，只好我们二人权坐一坐，再散罢。我因玉侬病重，也觉心绪不佳。总之好事多磨，是一点不错的。」几句话说得子玉如冰水淋身，默然无语，怔怔的看着素兰好一回","en":"Sulan smiled: \\"My poor services have fallen short. As luck would have it, Yunong's illness has taken a turn for the worse today, and he cannot come out. Yesterday, besides, two ruffians gave him a savage tongue-lashing, and rage has made him iller still. Having invited you yesterday, I could hardly send round today to cry off; so"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":8,"tokens":["玉侬"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"说着便已红了眼睛，摇着头道：「这也奇了，这也实在奇了。」素兰见了忍不住要笑出来，便对子玉道：「我们如今同去找玉侬罢，去看看他的病何如？」子玉想了一想，道：「也可不必了，既然此地还见不着，就到那里必要生出别故来，也是见不着的。」素兰说：「他现病在床，怎么会见不着呢？」子玉道：「前日你我同去那一回，玉侬不病在床吗？后来我又去过两次，皆没有见着。今日再去，也是断断见","en":"strange indeed.\\" Sulan could scarcely keep from laughing, and said to him: \\"Come, let us go together now and find Yunong, and see how his illness does.\\" Ziyu considered a moment and said: \\"Better not. Since I cannot meet him even here, some fresh hindrance would be sure to spring up there, and I should not see him even so.\\" Sulan said: \\"He lies sick in his bed — how should"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":11,"tokens":["玉侬","琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉沉思了一回，道：「如不像玉侬，倒可以会会，如像玉侬，则当日怡园已经唐突过了，何必再叫婢学夫人呢！不但不愿见那人，而且于玉侬实有所不忍。香畹，你是个明白人，想能见到，非我故作矫情。」素兰道：「你的话也是，你是不肯见他，我偏叫他出来。」子玉尚要拦阻，已见素兰从后舱唤出一个如花似玉的","en":"Ziyu pondered a while, then said: \\"If he is unlike Yunong, I might well meet him; but if he is like Yunong — I committed affront enough that day at the Garden of Contentment; why set the maid to ape her mistress a second time? Not only am I unwilling to see this person: for Yunong's own sake I could not bear"},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":6,"tokens":["玉侬","琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"哭哭啼啼。且已经半天过了，不到晚就要赶城，能有几个时辰欢乐，不如大家笑笑罢。」子玉勉强答应道：「香畹之言极是，玉侬也不必伤心了。」琴言道：「有什么欢笑呢？我们在怡园一叙，直到如今，是五个月。再候第二次欢叙，只怕也要一年了。这一年内，知道我能候得到候不到呢。大约这一场也就完结了。」说罢又哭，子玉劝道：「不妨，只要你身子好了，天天可以见得的，何必要一年呢。」琴言又哭","en":"left for gladness; better we should all laugh a little.\\" Ziyu forced himself to assent: \\"Xiangwan is quite right; Yunong, grieve no more.\\" Qinyan said: \\"And what is there to laugh over? From our one meeting at the Garden of Contentment to this day is five months. For a second glad meeting we may well wait a year; and within that year, who knows whether I can last to see"},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"此时船已开行，素兰的家人把酒肴都摆上来，素兰一面敬酒，一面劝，子玉、琴言只得坐了，悲从中来，无言相对，尚复何心饮酒。经素兰苦劝，只得勉强饮了几杯，终究是强为欢笑，亦不知何所为而然。在琴言心上，终觉得生离死别，只此一面，以后像不能见面的光景。子玉也觉得像是无缘，料定是不能常见的。此是大家心上，想到极尽头处，自然生出忧虑来，","en":"under way, and Sulan's servants set out the wine and dishes. Sulan poured the wine, urging and coaxing; Ziyu and Qinyan could only take their seats, but with sorrow flooding up in them they sat wordless, face to face — what heart had they left for drinking? Under Sulan's patient pressing they forced down a few cups, but it was gaiety worn as a mask, and they scarcely"},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"当下船已走了三四里，三人静悄悄的清饮了一回。子玉一面把着酒，一面看那琴言，如蔷薇濯露，芍药笼烟，真是王子乔、石公子一派人物，就与他同坐一坐，也觉大有仙缘，不同庸福。又看素兰，另有一种丰神可爱，芳姿绰约，举止雅驯，也就称得上珠联璧合。今日这一会，倒觉是绝世难逢的，便就欢乐顿出，忧愁渐解。琴言看子玉是瑶柯琪树，秋月冰壶，其一","en":"traveled three or four li; the three sat quietly, drinking clear wine for a time. As Ziyu held his cup, he gazed at Qinyan, who appeared like a rose washed in dew, or a peony veiled in mist—truly a figure of the same immortal stripe as Prince Qiao or Master Shi. Merely to sit beside him felt like a profound karmic blessing, far beyond vulgar fortune. He then looked at Sulan,"},{"paragraph":30,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，也不显得天所珍惜，秘而不露的意了。心上十分羡慕，即走过来，坐在子玉肩下，温温存存，婉婉转转的敬了三杯，又让了琴言一杯。此时三人的恩情美满，却作了极乐国无量天尊，只求那鲁阳公挥戈酣战，把那一轮红日倒退下去，不许过来。","en":"Sulan walked over and sat at Ziyu's side, warmly and gently offering him three cups of wine, then offering one to Qinyan. At this moment, the deep affection among the three was perfectly complete; it was as if they had become the Boundless Celestials of the Pure Land. They only wished Duke Yang of Lu would swing his halberd in fierce battle once more, forcing the red sun"},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":7,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"怀中抱着小旦，在那里一人一口的喝酒，又有两个小旦坐在旁边，一弹一唱。止觉得欢声如迅雷出地，狂笑似奔流下滩，惊得琴言欲躲进后舱，子玉便把船窗下了，却不晓得是什么人。素兰从窗缝里看时，对琴言道：「过来瞧。」琴言过来，也从窗缝里瞧了一瞧，便道：「这些蠢人，看他作什么？」素兰指着那下手坐的那一个道：「这就是与媚香缠扰的潘三。」琴言道：「哎哟！这个样子，亏媚香认识他，倒又","en":"like quick thunder bursting from the earth, their wild laughter like a torrent racing down the rapids — so that Qinyan in alarm made to hide in the rear cabin, and Ziyu let down the boat window, wondering who they might be. Sulan, looking through the crack of the window, said to Qinyan: \\"Come and see.\\" Qinyan came and peeped in his turn, then said: \\"Those vulgar louts"},{"paragraph":34,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴言心上虽知天色已晚，却也不忍催迫。素兰恐晚了，不能进城，便叫船家快些摇摆，天不早了，于是一面即收拾起来。子玉便将带来之物，分送二人，二人不好推辞，只得收了。子玉又将那包里散碎银，分赏了素兰、琴言的人，又说辛苦了你们，众人叩头谢赏。","en":"Qinyan knew in his heart that the day was growing late, yet could not bear to hurry the parting. Sulan, fearing that if it grew later they could not enter the city, called to the boatmen to ply their oars faster, for the hour pressed; and meanwhile they began"},{"paragraph":35,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"船到大东门，又各自上车。子玉拉着琴言的手道：「我们迟日再叙罢，诸事须要自解才好。」又流下泪来，琴言也哽咽道：「你放心去罢，将要关城了，咱们见面不在香畹处，就在怡园两处。」子玉点了点头，只得硬了心肠，各自上车。车夫怕晚了，加上一鞭，急急的跑了。","en":"The boat came to the Great East Gate, and they went each to his own cart. Ziyu held Qinyan's hand and said: \\"We shall meet again another day; in all things you must learn to console yourself\\" — and his tears fell once more. Qinyan answered, choking: \\"Go, and set your heart at rest; the gates will soon be closing. When we meet, it will be either"}],"24":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":18,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"分：闹了春阳馆，送了掌柜的，打了二十还不要紧。又听得陆素兰对人说，魏聘才买出华公府一个车夫，一个三小子，去糟蹋琴言，直骂了半天。琴言的人磕头请安赔了不是，又送了他几吊钱才走。「王恂道：「奇了，这几天就有这许多事。我们从前看了这两个人都是斯斯文文的，再不料如今作出这些事来，真是知人知面不知心了。」仲清道：「我又听得一件快活事，庾香与琴言、素兰倒游了一天运河。近日他","en":"the worst of it. Lu Sulan says Pincai hired a groom and a page boy from the Hua household to ruthlessly bully Qinyan. They hurled abuse for half the day, until Qinyan's people were forced to kowtow, apologize, and pay them several strings of cash just to make them leave.\\" Wang Xun shook his head, \\"How strange. So many absurdities in a matter of days. We used to think"},{"paragraph":2,"mentions":7,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"来，说我爱你者，为你有这容貌，又有这身分；若徒有容貌而无身分，也就不稀奇了。这两句在他人听了，也还不甚感激，而琴言之孤高自赏，唯恐稍有不谨，致起戏侮之渐。不料偶一见面，如电光过影之梅公子，即能窥见我的肺腑。又想人之所爱唯在容貌而已，而爱我容貌之心，究竟是什么心，虽未出之于口，未必不藏之于心。就算也没有这片心，但世间既爱此人，断无爱其拒绝，反不爱其逢迎之理。所以庾","en":"your rank; beauty without such rank is ordinary.' Most people might scarcely feel the weight of those words, but Qinyan's proud soul fears any subtle slip into mockery. Yet, in the blink of an eye, Young Master Mei pierced straight through to his inmost heart, like a flash of lightning illuminating his very core. People often assume that love is purely for one's physical"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":3,"tokens":["玉侬","琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"凑成的。」仲清道：「旦脚十个是谁？」桂保道：「我们两个之外，尚有瑶卿、媚香、香畹、静芳、瘦香、小梅，后来又添了玉侬、玉艳，共是十个。」王恂道：「这就是十美班了。」桂保道：「陪客尚未定，你们是一定在数的。听得度香已写书子到保定府去，请前舟回来商议，只怕就是这件事。」王恂道：「也近了，今日已是二十六日了，还有十天，就演得全这些新戏吗？」玉林笑道：「你好记性，还有个闰","en":"Guibao replied, \\"Besides the two of us, there are Yaoqing, Meixiang, Xiangwan, Jingfang, Shouxiang, and Xiaomei. Yunong and Yuyan joined later, making ten in all.\\" Wang Xun said, \\"That makes a Ten-Beauties company.\\" Guibao added, \\"The guest list isn't entirely settled yet, but you two are certainly included. I heard Duxiang wrote to Baoding to invite Qianzhou back, likely"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":1,"tokens":["玉侬"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"演习，那十个人，你可晓得他们有几种情性，脾气是那个最好相与，可讲得来么？」桂保道：「这十个却也好几样，内中就是玉侬脾气冷些，其余没有什么脾气。」玉林道：「讲情性风雅，心地聪敏，不慕势利，意气自豪，是瑶卿。一尘不染，灵慧空明，胸有别才，心怀好胜，是媚香。温文俊雅，出言有章，和而不流，婉而有致，要算香畹。言语爽直，风度高超，雅俗咸宜，毫无拘束，是静芳。恬静安详，言语","en":"true temperament? Whose company is the easiest to keep?\\" Guibao replied, \\"There are ten entirely different sorts. Yunong is by far the coldest, but the rest are mild enough.\\" Yulin elaborated, \\"For refined taste and a keen, penetrating mind—someone who doesn't chase power and possesses a proud, independent spirit—that is Yaoqing. Spotless and bright, harboring a fiercely"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":7,"tokens":["玉侬","杜玉侬","琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"仪秀态妍，是小梅。泛应有余，风流自赏。」把嘴向着桂保道：「这是他。别有会心，人难索解，海枯石烂，节操不移，这是玉侬。把洁守贞，不计利害，是玉艳。至于我则无长可取，碌碌庸人，使人嫌弃的，就是我了。」桂保道：「这是你自己不好下赞语，这考语待我出吧：芳洁自守，风雅宜人，不亢不卑，无好无恶，这些是佩仙。」仲清、王恂同道：「这考语出得很切，足见蕊香近日识见又长了好些。」玉","en":"toward Guibao, \\"that is him. A secret heart that few can ever truly grasp, steadfast until the seas run dry—that is Yunong. Pure fidelity, entirely heedless of personal gain—that is Yuyan. As for me, I have no merit whatsoever; I am dull, and people despise me. That is who I am.\\" Guibao interrupted, \\"You sell yourself far too short! Here is my verdict on you: fragrant restraint"}],"25":[{"paragraph":13,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"了一出，其余那七个都上来了请点。华公子且不点戏，先将诸旦打量一回，却不认识，因问了姓名别号。七个之中，又独赏识琴言，便问子云道：「这个像是新来的。」子云笑问道：「何以知之？」华公子道：「我见他举止似乎没熟练，然而秀外慧中，觉有出尘之致。」就点了一出，又将各人的戏也都点了。送到文泽面前，文泽、仲雨、次贤，大家公商点了几出。开了场，加官出来，献上世受国恩」，那林珊枝","en":"one — he did not recognize them, and so asked each one's name and style name. Among the seven, he singled out Qinyan for particular admiration and asked Ziyun: \\"This one seems to be new.\\" Ziyun smiled and asked: \\"How can you tell?\\" Young Master Hua said: \\"I notice his bearing seems not quite seasoned, and yet he is beautiful without and wise within — there is a transcendent"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"次贤一杯。次贤自觉得逸兴霞飞，十分得意，即连饮了三大觞。华公子亦陪了三杯。又命家人把酒送到台上，命宝珠、素兰、琴言、蕙芳，各饮三杯，并将席间果品赏了四碟，四旦遥遥叩谢。又劝合席各饮了三大杯。","en":"him with three cups of his own. He then ordered a servant to carry wine to the stage, commanding Baozhu, Sulan, Qinyan, and Huifang each to drink three cups, and sent four dishes of fruit from the banquet table as a gift; the four dan actors bowed their thanks from afar. He then urged everyone at the table to drink three more great cups apiece."},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":4,"tokens":["琴言","玉侬"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"。」就将群旦叫上来。群花听了，即荡动兰桨，往水榭边来，上了岸，在阑外雁排侍立。华公子便指名叫了四个进来：蕙芳、琴言、宝珠、素兰。华公子对着四旦说道：「方才《峨嵋山群仙》一出，虽全部出场，未尽态度。你们可将各人得意之戏说一出来。」四旦听了，想了一想，各说了一出。子云道：「此尚非极得意的，只有媚香与香畹的《独占》，瑶卿与玉侬的《惊梦》《寻梦》，都是绝妙无双，人家唱不","en":"landed, and drew up in goose formation beyond the railing. Young Master Hua called four men in by name: Huifang, Qinyan, Baozhu, Sulan. To them he said: \\"In 'Immortals of Mount Emei' just now the whole cast stood forth but not every gesture appeared. Each of you name a piece you do best.\\" The four thought and each named one. Ziyun said: \\"Those are not yet your acme —"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一杯的不用人让，一连饮了十几杯，尚觉喝采不住，又逼住了文泽饮了三杯，次贤、仲雨饮了五六杯。华公子忽又对着宝珠、琴言说道：「你们尽管唱，唱完了不妨再唱。」又复细细看了一回，对众人道：「此两人各有妙处，正如五雀六燕，轻重适均；\\n赵后杨妃，瘦肥自合。宝珠则柔情脉脉，我见犹怜；琴言则秀骨珊珊，谁堪遣此。离之则独绝，合之则两全。度香仁兄，今日真怡我情矣！」子云见华公子似有","en":"praise — forced Wenze through three more and Cixian and Zhongyu five or six. Suddenly he turned to Baozhu and Qinyan: \\"Sing on — when done, sing again.\\" He studied them again minutely and told the company: \\"These two each have marvels — like five sparrows and six swallows, weight in balance — Lady Zhao and Consort Yang, lean and plump each right. Baozhu's tenderness"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，心上便越要加些精神，做些态度出来，一来要起公子爱慕之心，二来也与度香脸上增些体面，比起先一出，更唱得出色。这琴言心上却是不愿，只因听华公子是得罪不得的，只得受些委屈。又想起十人中单叫他们两人，就恨还有一个袁宝珠与他作敌手，心上总想压他下来，故也加了工夫，更觉一往情深，如水斯注。又见华公子面貌也有些相像庾香处，又想起那一天是唱《惊梦》遇见了庾香，就彼此两心相印，","en":"catch the young master's fancy, and partly to do Duxiang credit — so that he sang better than in the first piece.\\n\\nQinyan was unwilling in his heart; but he had heard that Young Master Hua was not a man to offend, and had to swallow the indignity. And thinking that out of the ten only the two of them had been called, he resented having Yuan Baozhu for a rival and wanted"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"看看天色已是将上灯时候，觉得去留两难，又见他跟来的人，都整整齐齐站在阶下，心上要走不走的；又看宝珠、琴言将要唱完，便对子云道：「我还进城罢。」珊枝听了接口道：「将要关城了，公子既要进城，就要快些赶呢。」华公子听了没奈何，只得起身穿戴衣冠，谢了子云，又辞了众人。","en":"— stay or go tore at him; his train stood in neat ranks below the steps — he half wished to leave; Baozhu and Qinyan were finishing their song — he said to Ziyun: \\"I had better return to the city.\\" Shanzhi cut in: \\"Gates will shut — if you go, hurry.\\" Young Master Hua had no choice — rose, dressed formal wear, thanked Ziyun and took leave of the company."},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":5,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"此时宝珠、琴言已卸装下来送客，华公子执着琴言的手道：「你这戏实在唱得好，可夸京城独步。歇一天你进府来，我还要细细请教。」说着便将身上一块汉玉双龙佩，扣着一个荷包扯下来，给了琴言，琴言请安谢了。华公子已走了两步，忽又回转来对着宝珠道：「你们两个真是棋逢敌手，难分高下","en":"By now Baozhu and Qinyan had washed off greasepaint and came to see guests off. Young Master Hua clasped Qinyan's hand: \\"Your singing tops the capital — rest a day then visit my mansion — I have much to ask in detail.\\" From his waist he unclasped a Han jade paired-dragon pendant"},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":5,"tokens":["琴言","玉侬"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"今日这十旦，若论头一个得意的，自然是琴言，其次要算宝珠了。宝珠此时却颇欢喜，惟有琴言终是冷冷的。子云便问琴言道：「你今日又得了一个知己。华公子是难得赞人的，你一上来他就留心你，以后又独要你与瑶卿唱戏，他这眼力却也不低，一面之间，就赏识如此，你可感激他么？」琴言把子云看了一看，低着头不言语。","en":"Of the ten dan performers that day, the one with most cause for satisfaction was of course Qinyan, and after him Baozhu. Baozhu glowed inwardly; only Qinyan stayed cool as frost. Ziyun asked Qinyan: \\"Today you have gained another connoisseur. Young Master Hua praises hardly anyone, yet from the moment you came up he had his eye on you, and afterwards"},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":4,"tokens":["玉侬","琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"次贤道：「我看华公子，倒是个怜香惜玉的人，外面传闻之言是不可信，今日这一天终是温温和和，并没有什么公子脾气。玉侬见人也不可一味太冷淡了。」琴言被众人讲得，似乎要他去亲近华公子的意思，便气忿忿的无处发泄，因想道：「别人说我也罢，就是度香不该。他既知我与庾香相好，今日又讲这些话来，拿我当什么人看待？越想越气，便淌下泪来。仲雨已经醉了，见了琴言如此光景，便冷笑一声，","en":"believed. Throughout this whole day he has been mild and warm, without a trace of a spoiled young master's arrogance. Yunong — you really shouldn't remain so unremittingly cold when dealing with people.\\" Being spoken to like this by everyone, seemingly urging him to cozy up to Young Master Hua, Qinyan felt an angry resentment building up with nowhere to vent. He thought to"},{"paragraph":30,"mentions":5,"tokens":["琴言","玉侬"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云知琴言说话生硬，得罪了仲雨，便解释道：「玉侬今日又吃醉了，瑶卿你同他到那边顽顽，等他醒醒酒再来。」宝珠即拉了琴言到里边去了，劝他道：「你说话太直了，那位张二爷也不是好说话的人。」琴言尚是呜咽。宝珠把华公子所赏之物拿出来与他比了，却小一些儿。那边文泽是绝早过","en":"Ziyun knew Qinyan's blunt words had deeply offended Zhongyu, so he mediated: \\"Yunong has simply drunk too much today — Yaoqing, take him over there to amuse yourselves until the wine wears off, and then come back.\\" Baozhu immediately pulled Qinyan inside and gently chided"}],"26":[{"paragraph":4,"mentions":3,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"道：「每逢朔望，他们总清早来的，门上只道爷没有起身，便挡住不叫进来。班子里的人来请安，号簿上是不挂的。就是那个琴言，从前他师傅也领他来过，不过没有进来。」华公子道：「那琴言是谁的徒弟？」珊枝道：「是长庆的徒弟。」公子道：「长庆，你的师傅也不是叫长庆吗？」珊枝答应：「是。奴才本在联锦班，后进登春的。」公子道：「为什么要进登春呢？」珊枝道：「那长庆的脾气不好，奴才伤","en":"away. When actors come to pay their respects, their names are not even entered in the register. Even that boy Qinyan was once brought here by his master, though he never made it inside.\\" \\"Whose apprentice is Qinyan?\\" the Young Master asked. \\"He is Changqing's apprentice.\\" \\"Changqing... wasn't your master also named Changqing?\\" \\"Yes,\\" Shanzhi replied. \\"This servant"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":5,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"公子道：「你瞧这琴言怎样？」珊枝不言语。华公子又问了一遍，珊枝说道：「好是好的，也是徐二老爷钟爱的，听说外边不肯应酬。」华公子道：「徐二老爷钟爱的是袁宝珠，不爱他。」珊枝道：「听见徐二老爷爱他与袁宝珠差不多。又听得说，徐二老爷在他身上已花过好几千银子了。」华公子不语，少","en":"\\"And what do you think of this Qinyan?\\" the Young Master asked. Shanzhi remained silent. When pressed again, he finally answered, \\"He is good enough, but he is also Second Master Xu's darling. Word has it he refuses to entertain anyone else.\\" \\"Second Master Xu favors Yuan Baozhu, not him,\\""},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":4,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"道：「见过的。公子若要压倒外边，这也不难，好花不在多，就拣顶好的买几个进来，就可以了。」心上又想道：「他倒中意琴言这东西，殊不知他心上只想着梅庾香，未必想到你。」又想道：「这琴言或者倒是势利的心肠，所以看不起我。若到这府里，自然会改变的。无论其改变不改变，既进了府，此生就不要想见庾香的面了。」再又想道：「琴言这等古怪脾气，此刻华公子是不知道，若长久了，是必定厌恶","en":"crowd a garden. Simply purchase the choicest few, and that will suffice.\\" Inwardly, Pincai plotted: 'He fancies Qinyan, little knowing that Qinyan's heart belongs to Mei Yuxiang and is unlikely to favor him. Furthermore, Qinyan's snobbery scorns me. If admitted to this mansion, he might change, or he might not, but once inside, he would never glimpse Yuxiang again. The"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":3,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"华公子道：「我闻得这两个都是度香所爱，不好去夺他。」聘才道：「度香所爱的是宝珠，琴言不是真喜欢的。公子若当真喜欢他，晚生倒认识，而且常照顾他。他的师傅叫长庆，最爱的是钱，听得公子要，必十分巴结，送上门来的。」华公子倒踌躇不定，心上总碍着徐子云，又因琴言进来，也只得九人，宝珠是断乎不能买的，因此犹豫。聘才再三解说，竭力怂慂，才把华公子","en":"favorites; it would be hard to wrest them away,\\" the Young Master replied. \\"Duxiang truly cherishes Baozhu, not Qinyan,\\" Pincai countered. \\"If the Master desires him, I can assure you it is possible. I know his master, Changqing, quite well, and often patronize his troupe. Changqing loves silver above all else. If he learns the Master wants him, he will crawl to oblige"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"仲雨问起聘才，聘才把华公子托他之事说了。仲雨道：「怪不得他前天如此高兴，总赏了一百多金子，又将自己的玉佩，给了琴言、宝珠。」","en":"generous the other day,\\" Zhongyu said. \\"He bestowed over a hundred gold pieces and even gave his own jade pendants to Qinyan and Baozhu.\\""},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"到了琴言门口，叶茂林先下来，同了聘才进内。恰好长庆在家，请进坐了。长庆打量了聘才一回，又因是叶茂林同来，便当是不要紧人，淡淡招呼了几句。茂林道：「这位魏师老爷，是华公府的师老爷，与公子是最相好的，闻你的大名，特来相访。还有一句话要商量。」长庆听了，登时满面添","en":"Arriving at Qinyan's door, Maolin alighted first and entered alongside Pincai. Fortunately, Changqing was home and invited them to sit. Changqing looked Pincai over, and because he had come in Ye Maolin's company took him for a person of no consequence, greeting him coolly."},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":3,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"他性气又不好，油饼也吃多了，到常要怄我，我所以把他换了登春班的绣芳。绣芳出师，就得了八千吊，人人知道的。如今这琴言比绣芳又强了几倍。师老爷求你对公子说，长庆如今就剩这一个好徒弟，要靠他一辈子过活。其余几个小孩子，都是不中用的，倒赔钱做衣服。一月内陪了三五天酒，还要生出事来。」聘才正要回言，叶茂林笑迷迷，拈着胡子讲道：「老庆，事情是好商量的。华公子行事，难道你不知","en":"traded him for Xiufang. When Xiufang graduated, he brought in eight thousand strings of cash—everyone knows this. Qinyan surpasses Xiufang many times over. Secretary, I beg you to plead with the Young Master. He is my only fine disciple, my lifelong reliance. The other boys are worthless; they only cost me money for costumes, attend a few wine banquets a month, and constantly"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"来，找到了聘才，将长庆的话一字不隐，全说了。聘才无可奈何，只得回去叫林珊枝回了，说没有找着长庆，迟日再去。不知琴言祸福如何，再听下回分解。","en":"had Shanzhi report that he could not locate Changqing, deciding to try again later. Whether this would decide Qinyan's fate remains to be seen in the next installment."}],"27":[{"paragraph":9,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"豁完了拳，讲些闲话，仲雨忽然问奚十一道：「如今有个顶好的相公叫琴言，在秋水堂住，他的师傅叫长庆，你曾见过么？」奚十一道：「没曾见，听是听得说过，是好的。」仲雨正要说时，蓉官道：「好什么？只得两三出戏。你叫他陪酒，终席不说话。\\n要他斟钟酒，是没有的事。」春林道：「好沉架子，到他家去看他，倒是从不会客的。就是从前的王吉","en":"finger-guessing was over and they had fallen to idle talk, Zhongyu suddenly asked Xi Eleven, \\"There's a prime actor called Qinyan lodging at Autumn-Water Hall with his teacher Changqing. Have you met him?\\" Xi replied, \\"Not seen, but heard he's good.\\" Zhongyu was about to say more when Rongguan cut in. \\"Good in what way? He has two or three pieces and no more. Call him to pour the"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"奚十一过了夜，明日早饭后，想起仲雨所说的琴言这么利害，到底不信，必要去试试。过瘾之后，同了姬亮轩，带了春兰、巴英官，自己换了件新纱衫子，坐了车，叫春兰、巴英官同跨了车沿，亮轩另雇一个车，到秋水堂来。","en":"night turning Zhongyu's remarks over in his mind. The next morning after breakfast, still unable to believe that Qinyan could be so unapproachable, he resolved to test the matter for himself. After taking opium, along with Ji Liangxuan, Chunlan, and Ba Yingguan, he wore a fresh gauze jacket and took a carriage. Chunlan and Ba Yingguan rode on the footboards, while Liangxuan"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":3,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这边琴言正在悲悲楚楚的时候，前日长庆见聘才生气走了，虽托叶茂林为他婉言，总不见茂林回信，心上有些狐疑。又想起五月间，有两个人闹来，送了四吊钱，赔了多少礼方去，听得传说是华公府的车夫。昨日听得聘才口风利害，似乎必要来的，便十分担着担子，进来与琴言商量。琴言自那","en":"Meanwhile, Qinyan was miserable. Changqing, seeing Pincai storm off, had begged Ye Maolin to mediate, but with no word returned, he grew uneasy. He remembered the two men raising a row in the fifth month, requiring a four-string payoff and apologies, rumored to be Hua"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":4,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"长庆进来，见了琴言啼哭，不知为着何事，便安慰他两句，就说起聘才来说的话，去的光景，要寻事生端，叫你唱不成戏的意思，我不知你心内如何。若进去了，快活倒是快活的，不过是一世奴才，永作华府家人了。琴言听了，不由得放声大哭起来。长庆没了主意，又安慰他。琴言带哭说道：「师傅，多","en":"Changqing came in and found Qinyan crying, and not knowing what it was about said a word or two to comfort him; then he told him what Pincai had said, and how he had gone off, and that they meant to pick a quarrel and see to it that he should not perform at all. \\"I do not know what is"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"家，也就不必应酬他了。」又想道：「这姓奚的，虽听得他是个冤大头，但是个没味的人，多少相公上了他的当，没处伸冤，琴言是断乎讲不来的。不然叫天福、天寿回来，或者有些甜头，也未可知。一面即打发人到戏园去叫，一面自己穿了衣裳、鞋袜出来，款待奚十一。","en":"He thought, \\"This Xi, I've heard he's a sucker and tasteless. Many actors have been ruined with no redress, and Qinyan is hopeless with him. Or I could summon Tianfu and Tianshou; maybe there are sweets to be had.\\" He sent for them from the theater, donned his coat and boots, and went out to receive Xi Eleven."},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":9,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"且说陆素兰来，见了琴言问道：「何事？」只见琴言又是娇啼满面，歪倒在炕上。素兰安慰道：「你又怎么，你师傅请我来有何话说？」琴言道：「我今番真要死了，不比从前还可捱得下去。」素兰忙问何事，琴言就把长庆的话述了一遍。素兰也觉吃惊，发怔了半天，方问道：「你师傅的意思怎样？」琴言道","en":"Meanwhile, Lu Sulan arrived and asked Qinyan: \\"What's wrong?\\" He found him tear-stained and collapsed on the kang. Sulan comforted him: \\"Again? Why did you fetch me?\\" Qinyan answered, \\"This time I truly die; it's not like before when I was merely enduring.\\" Sulan pressed for answers, and Qinyan"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这一席话，说得彻底澄清，一丝不障，就是个极胡涂的人，也能明白，岂有夙慧如琴言，尚不能领悟，便也点点头道：「我并不是料不着这些事，我为着情在此时，事尚在日后，故重情而略事，行吾心之所安，以待苦乐之自来。如到极处，则捐生以报，成我之情，一无顾忌。」","en":"clear as a crystal stream, completely unveiling the truth. Even a fool could grasp it, let alone the quick-witted Qinyan. He nodded: \\"It is not that I failed to foresee all this. But my feeling is here and now, while these events lie in the days to come; so I weigh the feeling heavily and the events lightly, doing what sets my heart at ease and waiting for joy or bitterness"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":7,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"说到此处，自己笑起来，琴言也就笑了，叫道：「兰哥，兰哥！我真佩服你，你这些见解从何处得来？」素兰忽要走动，问道：「后面那小院子，可解手么？」琴言道：「有毛厕，倒还干净。」素兰就开了房后一扇小门，上了毛房。只听得叩门之声，见院子内东基角上有一小后门，叩得乱响，即问道：「是那个？","en":"Speaking thus, he laughed; Qinyan laughed too, and then cried: \\"Brother Lan, Brother Lan! I utterly admire you; whence comes such insight?\\" Sulan wanted the privy, and asked whether there was one in the small court behind. Qinyan said, \\"There is a latrine, and quite a clean one.\\" Sulan"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"。又见两个俊俏跟班，一个认得是春兰，就请客房坐下。奚十一道：「我姓奚，想来你也知道，不用我说。我听得你这里有个琴言，特来会会他，快些叫他出来。」长庆赔笑道：「琴言偏偏不在家，进城去了。」","en":"room. Xi said, \\"I am surnamed Xi. You must have heard of me, so there's no need for much speech. I hear you keep a Qinyan here; I have come specifically to meet him. Bring him out at once.\\" Changqing smiled apologetically: \\"Qinyan happens to be out; he has gone into the city.\\""},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"新戏，前在怡园演了一个月，才上台。前日华公子即在徐老爷处见了，就把他们叫了进府，唱了两天了，还要三天才得唱完。琴言的戏又多，华公子又喜欢他。若是别处，就可以叫回来，惟有这个府里，小的们是不敢去的。大老爷或与公子有交情，倒可以打发管家拿个贴子，去要了出来。如果合老爷的意，就将他留着使唤都使得。小的久闻大老爷的威名，几次想请驾过来顽顽，恐怕贵人不踏贱地，又因没有伺候","en":"saw them at Lord Xu's and summoned them to the mansion. They have sung for two days, with three days remaining. Qinyan's roles are many, and the Young Master favors him. Anywhere else we would recall him, but for that mansion, we small folk dare not approach. If my Lord shares ties with them, send a steward with a card and demand him out; if he suits you, keep him. I"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"烧了几口，心上又起了坏主意，赔着笑道：「小的还有两个徒弟：「一个叫天福，一个叫天寿，今日先叫他们伺候，迟日再叫琴言到府上来，不知大老爷可肯赏脸？」奚十一既吹动了烟，即懒得起来。又想他如此殷懃，便也点点头，说：「叫来看看。」长庆着人叫了天福、天寿回来，走进炕边。奚十一举目看时：一个是圆脸，一个是尖脸，眉目也还清秀洁白。一样的湖色罗衫，粉底小靴。","en":"two more disciples, one named Tianfu and one Tianshou. Today let them serve you, and another day I will bring Qinyan to your mansion, if the Great Master would honor us.\\" Xi, smoke-lulled and lazy to rise, seeing such zeal, nodded: \\"Call them for a look.\\" Changqing sent for Tianfu and Tianshou. They reached the kang, and Xi raised his eyes: one had a round face, the"},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":6,"tokens":["琴言","琴官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"只见素兰忽然回头，看见窗缝里有个影子，便问：「是谁？」那两个噗哧的一笑，跑了出来。素兰要出来看时，琴言道：「看他做什么，自然是福、寿这两个顽皮了。」素兰终不放心，也因前日吓怕了，叫人关上门，别叫人进来。春兰对巴英官道：「他们说琴官不在家，在床上坐的不是吗？」巴英官道：「那个呢？」春兰道：「是素兰。待我们与老爷说了，好不依他。」于是二人又到房门口，见他","en":"saw a shadow in the window crack, and asked, \\"Who's there?\\" The two tittered and bolted. Sulan rose to look, but Qinyan said, \\"Why look? It is naturally Tianfu and Tianshou making mischief.\\" Sulan was still uneasy, still frightened from before, and ordered the door barred to all visitors. Chunlan told Ba Yingguan, \\"They told the Master that Qinyan wasn't home, but isn't"},{"paragraph":31,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"奚十一见房后有重小门开着，走去一望，院子里有个后门虚掩着，就知从这门出去了，便气得不可开交，先把琴言床帐扯下，顺手将桌子一翻，零星物件，打得满地。长庆见了心中甚怒，又不敢发作。想要分辩两句，不防奚十一一把揪住，连扇了五个嘴巴。长庆气极欲要动手，自己力不能敌，红着半边脸，高声说道：「我的祖太爷，你放手咱们外面讲。你受了谁的赚，凭空来吵闹，我虽吃了戏饭","en":"yard, and found the back gate on the latch; and knowing they had got away he was beside himself. He tore down Qinyan's bed-curtains first, then overturned the table and sent the small things smashing about the floor. Changqing was furious and dared not show it; and when he tried to say a word in his own defence Xi seized hold of him and gave him five slaps one after"},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":4,"tokens":["琴言","玉侬"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"长庆受了这一场打骂，不敢哼一声，关上门，即叫人到兰保处找回琴言，素兰连兰保也送了过来。大家说起这奚十一一味凶蛮，真是可怕，只怕其中又有人调唆出来，日后还不肯干休。一个魏聘才冤仇未解，又添出个奚十一来，如何是好？说得长庆更无主意，越发害怕，琴言只是哭泣。兰保道：「我有一个好主意，只劝得玉侬依了，倒是妥当的。你们明","en":"Changqing took that beating mutely, shut the gate, and sent someone to Lanbao's house for Qinyan. Sulan had sent Lanbao back as well. They all spoke of Xi Eleven's savage, lawless temper and agreed that a man who could erupt so suddenly was frightening indeed. Perhaps someone had stirred him up, and he wouldn't rest. The feud with Wei Pincai was"}],"28":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"到府支领。」珊枝答应了，即同聘才出来，见了长庆，一一说明；聘才又作了许多情，长庆喜出望外，叩谢聘才而去。回来与琴言讲了。琴言到此光景，自知不能不避。但今日之祸起萧墙，子玉全然不知，明日进了华府，未卜何日相见，意欲就去别他一别，犹恐见面彼此伤心，耳目又多，诸多未便；欲写信与他，方寸已乱，万语千言，无从下笔，只好谆托素兰转致。便又想了一会，即将自己常常拭泪的那方罗帕","en":"Changqing overjoyed. He kowtowed his profound thanks to Pincai and took his leave. Returning home, he informed Qinyan of the arrangement. At this juncture, Qinyan knew there was no escape. This disaster had arisen within his own walls, yet Ziyu remained completely unaware. Tomorrow, he would enter the Hua mansion, and who could say when they might ever see each other"},{"paragraph":2,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"至明日，长庆即把琴言送到华府，公子又细细的打量了一回，心中甚喜，即拨在留青精舍伺候。又领他到华夫人处叩见，华夫人见他弱质婷婷，毫无优伶习气，也说了个「好」字，华公子是更不必说。琴言心上总是惦记子玉，也只好暗中洒泪，背地长吁。过了几天，见华公子脾气是正正经经的，没有什么歪","en":"The next morning, Changqing delivered Qinyan to the Hua mansion. The Young Master scrutinized him again in fine detail, found himself exceedingly pleased, and assigned him to attend to them at the Quiet-Green Retreat. Qinyan was also led in to kowtow before Lady Hua. Observing his frail, graceful"},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"且说琴言临行之际，所留之物托素兰面交子玉。素兰打算过几日，请子玉过来，与他面谈衷曲。","en":"As for the items Qinyan had left behind at parting, which were entrusted to Sulan to give to Ziyu, Sulan planned to invite Ziyu over in a few days to speak with him heart to heart."},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"却说子玉自五月内与琴言一叙之后，直至今日，并非没有访过琴言，但其中有多少错误。这一日天气凉爽，早饭后到素兰处，先叫云儿问了在家，素兰闻知甚喜，忙出迎进。只见房内走出两人来：子玉看时，认得一个是王兰保；一个是琪官，因多时不见他，即看了他一看。见他杏脸搓酥，柳眉耸翠，光彩奕奕","en":"Now concerning Ziyu: ever since that single, fleeting conversation with Qinyan in the fifth month, it was not that he hadn't tried to visit him, but countless misunderstandings had intervened. One cool, pleasant day, after his morning meal, Ziyu made his way to Sulan's place. He first had Yun inquire if he was home; upon hearing"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":1,"tokens":["玉侬"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这个称呼？」素兰道：「这个称呼倒也通。」琪官也不好意思，便道：「静芳不要取笑。」兰保道：「这倒也不算取笑，你是玉侬的师弟，可不是他的小姨吗？」子玉笑道：「岂有此理。」说着遂各坐下。见桌上杯盘狼籍，似吃饭的光景，素兰叫人收拾了，便亲送一碗茶来，问道：「你今日之来甚奇，想必已经知道了。」子玉听了又是不解，问道：「什么事已经知道？我却实在是不知道。」兰保看着子玉道：「","en":"embarrassed and protested, \\"Jingfang, please don't joke.\\" Lanbao countered, \\"It hardly counts as a joke. You are Yunong's junior apprentice-brother, does that not make you his little sister-in-law?\\" Ziyu laughed, \\"That is utterly absurd.\\" With that, they all took their seats. Noticing the table was strewn with cups and plates from a recent meal, Sulan had the servants"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":5,"tokens":["琴言","玉侬"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉更觉纳闷，却思不到琴言身上来，说道：「我实在不晓得你们说的是什么，我是不出大门的，这两天又没人到我那里，如何晓得外面的事？」琪官笑了一笑，素兰道：「你真不知道，我只得告诉你，你且坐稳了。静芳、玉艳，你两个扶住了他，待我再说。」子玉道：「香畹一向直爽，今日何故作这些态度？想","en":"Ziyu grew even more baffled, the thought never crossing his mind that this might concern Qinyan. He said, \\"I honestly have no idea what you are talking about. I haven't stepped past my front gates, and no one has visited me these past two days. How could I know of matters in the outside world?\\" Qiguan offered a small smile, while Sulan said, \\"Since"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":6,"tokens":["琴言","玉侬"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉听了，知琴言尚在人间，心便放了一分，停了一停道：「玉侬此去，也就如出尘离世的一样。」便又滚下泪来，出了一回神，重把那几味药看了又看，只认得一样是芍药，其余皆不认识，因对素兰道：「玉侬寄这几味药，必有深意，但不知是什么药，你可叫人拿到药铺问明，叫他就写在包上。」素","en":"Hearing that Qinyan still remained in the realm of the living, Ziyu's heart eased a fraction. He paused, then said, \\"With Yunong gone there, it is as though he has vanished from the mortal dust.\\" Fresh tears cascaded down his cheeks. After a long moment of stunned silence,"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":6,"tokens":["玉侬","琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一毫效验。一日之内有时昏愦，有时清楚，昏愦时糊胡涂涂，不闻不见的光景；清楚时与好人一样。睡梦中呓语喃喃，有时叫玉侬，有时唤香畹，有时大骂奚十一、魏聘才诸人。颜夫人十分着急，颜仲清、王恂三天两日常来看视，心中虽是明白，却也无法可治。二人商量，又不好对颜夫人讲，只好婉言解慰而已。颜夫人每听子玉睡梦之中，必呼玉侬二字，心上便疑心子玉在外有什么勾当，便当玉侬是个女人，心","en":"clear-headed, he appeared as healthy as anyone else. In his sleep, he muttered incessantly—sometimes calling for \\"Yunong,\\" sometimes \\"Xiangwan,\\" and at times, vehemently cursing Xi Eleven and Wei Pincai. Lady Yan was frantic with worry. Yan Zhongqing and Wang Xun visited every few days; they understood the root of the malady but were powerless to cure it. After discussing"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":4,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"李元茂道：「小门生没同出去过，琴言不琴言，我也不得而知。我去年听见魏老聘常常赞那琴言，世叔就有些留心。到今年正月初六，会馆团拜那一天，世叔看了琴言的戏回来，又听得他们说好，以后的事，小门生实是没有见闻，要问魏老聘才晓得他们的细底。」颜夫人便叫门上许顺，到华府请魏少爷过来有事相商。聘才","en":"Yuanmao said, \\"This student has never gone out with him. Whether there is a Qinyan or not, I truly do not know. Last year, I heard old Wei Pincai often praising that Qinyan, and my uncle took notice. On the sixth day of the New Year, at the guild gathering, my uncle saw his performance and heard the praises. After that, this student"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":9,"tokens":["琴言","玉侬"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一回，颜夫人道：「子玉得了一个异样的病症。」便把病的光景说与聘才听，又将云儿、元茂的话也说了，便说：「小儿与这琴言到底有什么缘故？」聘才听了便觉得有些踌躇不安，良心发动，脸上露出愧色。停了一会，说道：「去年小侄进京，是搭了一班戏子的船，内中有个小旦叫琴言。今年团拜这一天，却好见着他的戏。后来世兄不知怎样认识的，听说在怡园打灯谜时认识的，又赠了一张琴。小侄是个粗人","en":"repeating the testimonies of Yun and Yuanmao. She pressed him, \\"What exactly is the bond between my son and this Qinyan?\\" Pincai felt a sudden wave of unease; his conscience pricked, and a guilty flush colored his face. He hesitated before answering, \\"Last year, when this nephew entered the capital, I shared a boat with a theatrical troupe. Among them was a young dan"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"聘才道：「琴言原不要钱，他师傅是非钱不行。小侄方才细想了，断无法子弄他来，必要和他师傅商量了，事方可行。他师傅又不肯讲白话的。」颜夫人道：「他师傅是怎样的？」聘才道：「难说话的很，在钱眼里过日子，要和他商量，除非多许他钱，尚不知他肯不肯。他怕得罪了那边，一年得不了","en":"Pincai replied, \\"Qinyan originally never wanted money, but his teacher absolutely refuses to budge without silver. This nephew has thought long and hard, but there is no easy path. We must negotiate with the teacher, and the teacher will not accept empty talk.\\" Lady Yan pressed,"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":3,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"你道珊枝是什么意思，敢作主意叫他出来？原来琴言刚进来半月光景，连华夫人都疼他，时常赏他东西。又常说：「这孩子老实，不像个唱戏的。」因此珊枝便动了酸意。想道：「我进来了三年多，也算第一分的人，他才进来几天，就这么样。脑袋又好，将来不要把我压下去。」如此一想，便要设法挤他。今日聘才的一番话，正好立主","en":"Why did Shanzhi dare to orchestrate such a scheme? Qinyan had only been in the mansion for half a month, yet even Lady Hua doted on him, frequently bestowing gifts and praising him: \\"This child is honest; he doesn't act like a theatrical performer at all.\\" This favoritism stoked the fires of Shanzhi's jealousy."},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，我自会答应。可有一层，你去只管去，可要早些回来。再者，你今既去，千万把他的病治好了，再去第二回，可就难了。」琴言红了脸不言语，心中却也甚感激珊枝，我进来了倒全仗他照应，且能叫我去看庾香，以后倒不要忘了此人。珊枝走后，琴言想来想去，就把聘才的仇恨也就淡了，说这件事也亏他。","en":"return quickly. Furthermore, you must cure him this time. A second visit will be incredibly difficult to arrange.\\" Qinyan flushed and remained silent, but his heart swelled with profound gratitude toward Shanzhi. He felt he relied entirely on Shanzhi's care in this mansion, and to be granted the chance to see Yuxiang was a debt he must never forget. In the glow of this"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":3,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"是日无话，好容易盼到天明，恰好又天从人愿，华公子身子不爽快，在夫人房里不出来。琴言便更放了心，忙忙的吃了饭，来找珊枝，说：「怎样出去？我是不认得路径。」珊枝道：「你同魏师爷出去，他们就不好问什么；就使他们有话，也传不到里头去。」琴言只得折口气来找聘才，聘才见了心中甚喜，脸上却装了冷冷的说：「你去只管去，要谨慎些。将来闹穿了，可别说","en":"endeavor. The Young Master felt unwell and remained in Lady Hua's quarters, not emerging. Tremendously relieved, Qinyan quickly ate his meal and sought out Shanzhi. \\"How do I get out? I don't know the way.\\" Shanzhi instructed, \\"Go with Secretary Wei. The gatekeepers won't ask questions, and even if they do, the rumors won't pierce the inner walls.\\" Qinyan swallowed his"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":3,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"出了大门，即叫琴言坐在车里，放下车帘，自己跨沿，四儿坐在车尾，不多一刻即到了梅宅。聘才也不候通报，同了琴言一直到了书房。许顺见了甚为诧异，却又不好拦阻，也跟了进来。颜夫人正在盼望，见许顺进来，似欲回什么话似的，颜夫人问：「有什么事？」许顺说：「魏大爷同了一个人，到像个","en":"Once outside the gate, Qinyan was seated in the carriage, the curtains drawn tight. Pincai stood on the footboard, with Si'er riding on the tail. Before long, they arrived at the Mei residence. Pincai did not wait for an announcement; he led Qinyan straight toward the study. The"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":8,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴言一进门时，原为子玉病重，出于情所难忍，故不顾吉凶祸福，也拼着颜夫人骂了几句。而且聘才在车上，一路上说了些利害话，心虚胆怯，只得战战兢兢上前，见夫人磕了一个头起来，低头傍立。颜夫人叫近前来，又打量了一回，即请聘才坐下。颜夫人道：「你是那里人？去年几时到","en":"As Qinyan stepped over the threshold, his mind was solely on Ziyu's grave illness. Driven by a love he could scarcely endure, he had ignored the risks of fortune and disaster, steeling himself for Lady Yan's harsh scolding. Pincai's threatening words in the carriage"}],"29":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":8,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"却说琴言到梅宅之时，心中十分害怕，满拟此番必有一场凌辱。及至见过颜夫人之后，不但不加呵叱，倒有怜恤之意，又命他去安慰子玉，却也意想不到。心中一喜一悲，但不知子玉是怎样光景，将何以慰之，只得遵了颜夫人的命，老着脸，走到子玉卧房来。见帘帏不卷，几案生尘，药鼎烟浓","en":"When Qinyan finally arrived at the Mei residence, his heart trembled with profound dread; he was entirely prepared to face a torrent of humiliation and abuse. Yet, to his astonishment, upon meeting Lady Yan, he was greeted not with scolding, but with a deep, compassionate"},{"paragraph":2,"mentions":8,"tokens":["玉侬","琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"颜夫人听了，知是呓语，虽不能十分明白，也是一阵伤心，两泪交流，只管怔怔的瞅着聘才，聘才心上也觉凄楚，便说道：「玉侬你只管叫醒他。」琴言便叫了两声「少爷！」子玉嗤的一声笑道：「你好痴也！」又道：「云儿，你只管叫我作什么！这么近的路怕什么！你还当是大东门外么？」琴言要高声叫，又哽咽了，喉咙叫不出来，只把手拍他。那子玉忽然睁开眼来，对着琴言道：「香畹，这回又亏了你，费","en":"cheeks. She could only stare blankly at Pincai. Pincai, too, felt a stark bleakness in his heart and gently urged, \\"Yunong, wake him.\\" Qinyan called out twice more, \\"Young Master!\\" Ziyu merely tittered and replied, \\"How foolish you are!\\" He then chided, \\"Yun'er, why keep calling? The road is so short, what is there to fear? Do you still think we are outside the Great East"},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"颜夫人道：「他认不得人，这怎么好呢？」聘才也只得走到床前，叫了几声：「世兄，你心上的琴言特来看你，我扶起你来坐坐，你们说说话就好了。」聘才叫云儿拧块热手巾来，替他净了脸，擦了擦眼睛，扶他坐起，把床锦被迭了，在背后靠着。","en":"Hearing this, Pincai felt compelled to step up to the bedside. He called out several times, \\"Dear brother! The Qinyan you have been longing for has come especially to see you. Let me help you sit up; once you talk, you will surely feel better.\\" He then instructed Yun'er to wring out a hot towel. After washing Ziyu's face and gently wiping his eyes, Pincai carefully"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":8,"tokens":["琴言","玉侬"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉坐起后，精神稍觉清爽，猛然眼中一清，见琴言坐在旁边，便问道：「你是谁？坐在这里？」琴言带着哭道：「怎么连我也不认得了？」琴言见窗户未开，且系背光而坐，自然看不明白，便挪转身子向外坐了，侧了一半脸，望着子玉道：「我是玉侬，太太特叫我来看你的，不料十数天，就病到这样。」说着又呜咽起来，子玉听得分","en":"After sitting up, Ziyu felt a measure of clarity return to his mind. His vision suddenly sharpened, and noticing Qinyan sitting beside him, he asked, \\"Who are you, sitting here?\\" Qinyan wept openly, replying, \\"How can you not know me?\\" Seeing that the windows were closed and that Qinyan was sitting with his back to the dim light, Ziyu naturally struggled to see his face"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":11,"tokens":["琴言","玉侬"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"颜夫人听了，对着聘才道：「此话说的奇怪。」又听琴言道：「我是为着你的病来的。」子玉笑道：「你真是玉侬，如何得来？就算你愿意来，人家如何肯放你来？」琴言道：「我真是玉侬，我已来了多时，是奉太太之命，叫我来看你；又亏魏师爷带我上来。我劝你自己宽心，不必忧郁，身子要紧。快养好了病，我既来动了，就可以常来的","en":"this exchange, Lady Yan turned to Pincai and whispered, \\"Those words sound exceedingly strange.\\" She then heard Qinyan say softly, \\"I came because of your sickness.\\" Ziyu laughed dismissively. \\"If you truly were Yunong, how could you come here? Even if you were willing, would they ever release you?\\" Qinyan replied earnestly, \\"I truly am Yunong. I have been here for a"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"聘才见了忍不住的笑，那些丫鬟、仆妇也无人不笑。颜夫人点头叹息，见子玉两手扶着琴言的肩，要坐起来，先笑了一回。","en":"the mirth. Lady Yan nodded, a deep sigh escaping her lips. She watched as Ziyu, with both hands firmly grasping Qinyan's shoulders, tried to pull himself up, laughing the entire time."},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":8,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴言道：「你倒是什么病？我劝你不要病了，从今日就好了罢，省得多少人为你苦，更招太太心里不安。」说着遂又滴了些泪。子玉笑道：「我有什么病，我这个病要他来就来，要他去就去，原不要紧的。」琴言道：「休说不要紧，你这病不比从前，也添了满面的病容，千万句并作一句：","en":"Qinyan spoke softly, \\"What kind of illness is this? I beg you, do not be sick anymore. From today on, you must heal. Spare those who suffer for your sake, and end Madame's relentless worry.\\" Fresh tears welled in his eyes. Ziyu laughed effortlessly, \\"What illness?"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"想既能如此欢笑，心中自已开豁，其病就可好了。又见琴言总是凄凄楚楚，真想不出这个道理来。子玉便又笑道：「你进去了，作些什么事来？」琴言道：「一件事都没有，叫我在留青精舍伺候。府里的房屋排场，比怡园又是一样光景，错不得规矩。","en":"laugh with such unburdened joy, his mind must be opening, and his illness would soon mend. Yet, noticing that Qinyan seemed perpetually wretched and sorrowful, he could not fathom the true cause of his despair. Ziyu laughed again and asked eagerly, \\"Inside the mansion... what exactly do you do?\\" Qinyan replied evenly, \\"Nothing at all. They keep me at the Quiet-Green"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":8,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"却用不着唱戏，也不作什么，不过作一个伺候书房的书童就是了。」子玉道：「你出来他们知道不知道？」琴言道：「他在上屋时候多。他还有好几处书房，歇了几天，才到一处，也不过略坐一坐就走了。这屋子里的人不奉呼唤是不进那屋子里去的。」琴言向来总说实话的，今日要治子玉的病，就有几句谎话在里头。说得在华府里这等快活，将来还可以时常出来，不过极力要宽子玉的心病。子","en":"nothing. I merely serve as a quiet page boy in the study.\\" Ziyu asked, \\"Did they know you were leaving today?\\" Qinyan answered carefully, \\"The Young Master spends most of his time in the upper halls. He has several studies, and after resting for days, he might visit one place, sit briefly, and then vanish again. Servants do not dare enter those rooms unbidden.\\" Qinyan"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":11,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"出，聘才等亦都跟了出来。颜夫人道：「怪事！怪事！直看不出他们什么意思来，这一对小人儿，却真也奇怪。今日实实亏了琴言，我倒要重重的赏他。」聘才嬉嬉笑道：「这也实在稀奇。伯母请看：世兄与琴言都是正大光明，一无苟且的。今日真亏了他，若不然，就是那叶天士重生，也不能治的这么快。」颜夫人道：「这也总是世兄的大力，才能叫得出来，这功劳总是世兄的，我母子感激不尽。」聘才连道：","en":"amazement, \\"Strange... truly strange. I simply cannot read those two little ones. But today, we truly owe everything to Qinyan. I will reward him heavily.\\" Pincai grinned broadly, \\"It is rare indeed, Madame. You can see they are completely open, without a single shameful secret between them. Today, we owe him a great debt; otherwise, even if the divine physician Ye Tianshi were"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":6,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴言答应，走了出来，即重到上房中堂内，颜夫人见了便笑吟吟的道：「今日真亏了你治好了少爷的病，但不教他再病才好。」琴言脸上一红，停了一停道：「少爷心地光明，没有看不透的事情，以后可保没有病了。」颜夫人又把琴言打量了一回，便道：「你今日去了，几时再来呢？」琴","en":"Qinyan agreed and stepped out, making his way to the upper hall. Lady Yan smiled warmly at his approach and said, \\"Today we owe you a great debt; you have cured him completely. You must not let him fall sick again.\\" Qinyan flushed slightly, pausing before he"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":7,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"聘才见时候过久，便要同琴言回去，琴言也心内悬着，便叩辞颜夫人要去。颜夫人道：「你且略候一候，我还有话。」便自己进房，先着人叫了许顺进来，叫他秤了二百银子来，颜夫人道：「你交与魏少爷收了。」聘才叫交四儿拿了。又见一个仆妇拿着一包东西出来，付与琴言道：「这是太太赏你的，你收了再去","en":"Seeing that much time had passed, Pincai knew he must return with Qinyan. Qinyan, growing anxious about his long absence, quickly bid his farewells. Lady Yan raised a hand. \\"Wait. I have words for you.\\" She stepped into the inner room and called for Xu Shun, ordering him to weigh out two hundred taels of silver. \\"Give this"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":8,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"进城已是申初时分了。到门口下来，一径跟着聘才进去，只见总门口有人拿了大簿子记上一笔，琴言知道是上号簿。聘才先叫四儿将银包拿进房去，放在钱柜内锁好。一同进来找着林珊枝，珊枝见琴言回来，即笑道：「怎么去了许多时，想必医的病好了。」琴言面有惭色，便问道：「公子可曾传我？」珊枝道：「怎么没传？传了两三回，不见你回来，公子大发气，已着人叫你师傅去","en":"They entered the city at the beginning of the hour of shen. Alighting at the gate, Qinyan followed Pincai straight in; at the main gate a man with a great ledger set down an entry, and Qinyan knew it was the register of comings and goings. Pincai had Si'er carry the silver straight to his room to lock it safely in a chest, while he went to"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"到了留青精舍，珊枝问起琴言之事，琴言只得大略说了一说。","en":"Later, at the Quiet-Green Retreat, Shanzhi gently questioned Qinyan, and Qinyan outlined the true events of the day in quiet murmurs."},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"你戏的也不止他一个，难道人人见了你，就都为你害病吗？我倒不晓得，你们有这些情分，还是另有缘故呢？」一片话，说的琴言臊的了不得，又不敢驳回他，吊桶落在他井里，只好忍住这气罢了。","en":"play, yet not all of them fell ill. Is there some deeper bond between you, or perhaps something else entirely?\\" Qinyan burned with shame. Unable to answer, he felt like a bucket dropped into a deep well, swallowing his helpless anger in silence."},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":4,"tokens":["琴官","琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"却说子玉这一场大病，琴官这一出华府，魏聘才自为得意，又以为奇，在城外各处传扬。人家听了，竟当了一件新闻。有那些各班里相公，有嫌琴言的，有爱造言生事的，七张八嘴，改头换面，添起枝叶，把个子玉、琴言说得无所不至。不料王通政在人家席上遇着蓉官、二喜等类，就把子玉、琴言的事说得活龙","en":"As for Ziyu's grave illness—and Qinyan's dramatic excursion from the heavily guarded Hua mansion—Wei Pincai swelled with immense pride. He thought the entire affair striking and romantic, and he hawked the story loudly outside the mansion walls until the common folk took it up as fresh, scandalous"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":3,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"再说子玉自从琴言来看之后，便已放心。又晓得他母亲不责备，而且反托聘才带琴言来，心中十分快意，自然更好得快了，不到十日便已精神复旧，惟见了母亲总有些惶恐不安的光景。颜夫人爱子之心十分体贴，又知儿子并无苟且之行，绝不提起琴言的事。那王文辉亲自来过几次，陆夫人也来过。一回","en":"To return to the Mei household—after Qinyan's visit, Ziyu's spirit was profoundly eased. He now knew for certain that his mother did not blame him, and realizing that she had personally commissioned Pincai to bring Qinyan to him made his heart rejoice endlessly. Free from his despair, he mended"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":5,"tokens":["琴言","琴官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"过了几日，子玉究竟放心不下，便回了母亲，借看聘才为名，去看琴言，恰好见着聘才。聘才又求珊枝，把琴言叫出来，说了有一个多时辰的话，子玉方才放心而去。华府中人多嘴杂，且各存一心，过了几日，就有人将此事传到华公子耳中。华公子听了着实有气，便叫珊枝上来问了一遍，珊枝替辩了几句，华公子也说了他几句，以后不准琴言出门，将他","en":"rest easily. He begged his mother for permission to go out, using the pretext of visiting Pincai, solely to see Qinyan once more. He met with Pincai and relentlessly begged Shanzhi, until they finally called Qinyan out to see him. They talked for more than two hours, and only then did Ziyu's heart feel truly at peace. But within the sprawling Hua mansion, there were"}],"30":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说琴言从子玉处回来，华公子虽未知其细底，但责其私行出府，殊属不知规矩，姑念初犯，权且免责，把他拨在内室，这是里外不通的所在。一日，独坐在水晶山畔，对着几丛凤仙花垂泪，心中想到人生在世，不能立身扬名，作些事业，仅与那些皮相平人混在一堆，光阴易过，则与草木同朽","en":"Of Qinyan's return from Ziyu's, the Young Master Hua knew no particulars, yet blamed him for leaving the mansion without permission, a serious breach of discipline. Thinking it a first offense, he waived punishment for the moment and reassigned him to the inner"},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"萧次贤是高尚自居，无心问世，只有田春航、高品入场。如子玉、王恂、文泽、仲清等皆遵例回避。子玉在家闷闷不乐，又因琴言杳无音信，内外隔绝，又不能传递消息，几次要去访问聘才，又因华府威严，豪奴气焰。故而子玉不肯前去，只得静坐书斋，闷坐而已。","en":"withdrew according to the rules. Ziyu stayed at home, brooding unhappily. Moreover, because there was no news from Qinyan and they were completely cut off from each other, unable to exchange messages, he wanted to visit Pincai several times. However, deterred by the strictness of the Hua mansion and the arrogance of its servants, Ziyu refused to go and could only sit quietly"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，文采丰韵却是有的。」聘才、仲雨也随声附和，讲了一阵。华公子酒兴便发起来，便劝诸人畅饮了几杯。子云留心今日不见琴言，便问道：「我闻得琴言近在尊府，今日何以不见？」华公子道：「这孩子脾气虽有些古怪，却还老实，如今派在内书房，少刻就出来的。」子云又留心看去，却又不见林珊枝与那八龄班，心内思想，今日如此盛举，为何又不见这些人？难道都在戏房里扮戏么？这出戏唱完了，华公子","en":"while. Young Master Hua's mood for drinking rose, and he urged everyone to drink heartily. Ziyun noticed that Qinyan was nowhere to be seen today, so he asked, \\"I heard that Qinyan is currently at your esteemed residence. Why don't I see him today?\\" Young Master Hua replied, \\"This boy's temper is a bit odd, but he's fairly well-behaved. He's now assigned to the inner"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"纱栊前摆了一个长桌，室中焚了几炉好香，献上香茗。众人坐了，正觉秋光如画，清洗心脾。子云偶回头时，又只见珊枝同着琴言上来，对着子云等请了安。子云等忙招呼了。","en":"was like a painting, cleansing their hearts and minds. When Ziyun casually looked back, he saw Shanzhi leading Qinyan up. They bowed to Ziyun and the others. Ziyun and the rest quickly greeted them."},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云见了琴言，此时低眉垂首，不像从前高傲神气。且隔了两月，从前是朝亲夕见的，如今倒像是相逢陌路，对面无言，未免有些感慨。即叫他走近，问了些话，要问起子玉来，却又缩住。次贤、文泽也问了几句。","en":"Ziyun saw that Qinyan stood with his eyes lowered and his head bowed, showing none of his former proud bearing. They had been apart for two months. Once they had met with easy familiarity, morning and evening; now they faced each other in silence, almost as strangers. Ziyun"}],"31":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":3,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"要走也可以走。」华公子道：「忙什么，到辰刻散不迟。」即吩咐撤席止戏，家人整顿茶具，泡好了香茗送来。子云留心不见琴言，但见珊枝靠着屏风有些倦态。华公子查起琴言来，珊枝回道：「他身子不快，睡了。」原来琴言每逢热闹中便触起他心事，就要伤心。又见冯子佩与聘才串戏，眼中颇瞧他们不起，转托珊枝托病而去。","en":"servants arranged the tea sets and brought in freshly brewed fragrant tea. Ziyun looked around and noticed that Qinyan was missing, seeing only Shanzhi leaning wearily against a screen. When Young Master Hua asked about Qinyan's whereabouts, Shanzhi replied, \\"He was feeling unwell, so he has gone to sleep.\\" The truth was that whenever Qinyan found himself amidst such"},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":2,"tokens":["玉侬"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"长于舞剑的，香畹是长于书法的，佩仙是长于填词的，蕊香是长于猜谜诙谐的，瘦香是长于品箫的，小梅是长于吹笙的。可惜玉侬又病了，他倒会一套《平沙落雁》。」华公子便命叫他起来，又吩咐珊枝拿了琵琶来。家人把些笔砚乐器都搬了出来，分摆在各处。次贤道：「我来点将：先点玉侬与瘦香把琴箫和起来；再点瑶卿画一幅，媚香、香畹、佩仙对景吟诗，题在上面；再点珊枝与小梅笙、琵琶竞奏；再点蕊","en":"Shouxiang is masterful with the vertical flute, and Xiaomei plays the mouth-organ beautifully. It is only a pity that Yunong has fallen ill, for he plays a wonderful rendition of 'Wild Geese Alighting on Level Sand'.\\" Hearing this, Young Master Hua ordered him to be roused from his sleep and told Shanzhi to fetch the pipa. The servants brought out brushes, inkstones, and musical"},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴言不得已，双锁蛾眉，把弦和起来。这边漱芳依谱吹箫。琴言一来心神不佳，而且手生，生生涩涩的弹了一套《平沙》。","en":"Left with no other choice, Qinyan drew his delicate brows together and began to tune the strings. Beside him, Shufang followed the musical score and began to blow softly upon the xiao. Qinyan's mind was profoundly troubled, and his fingers were out of practice; thus, he ground out a"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"和平。华公子摇摇头道：「琴声不佳，箫声倒好。」子云道：「琴本难学，也还亏他。」次贤道：「想你不长弹，生疏了。」琴言道：「有半年不学了，方才第四段第三句几乎想不出来。瘦香的箫，比从前更好了。」漱芳道：「我是向老师课学。静宜先生隔三日必教我一吹，所以不生。」琴言默然，抚今追昔，颇觉感慨，几乎落下泪来，只得退后站了。次贤、子云亦颇恻然怜念。","en":"him credit.\\" Cixian added, \\"I imagine you have not practiced in a long time, and so the skill has grown rusty.\\" Qinyan replied, \\"I have not touched the instrument for half a year. Just now, I nearly forgot the third phrase of the fourth movement. Shouxiang's flute playing, however, is even better than it was before.\\" Shufang explained, \\"I study diligently under my master."},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"知琴言身落华府，不可复出，大有看破红尘之念，歌场舞席，绝不与闻，惟独坐一室，茗碗香炉，周旋其间。名为看破，其实情怀未断，犹时一念及，涕泪潸潸，不能自解。十五日到王文辉家一走，王恂、仲清约定明日午刻去望田春航、高品。子玉已吃过了早饭，在书房等候。不多一会，史","en":"Knowing that Qinyan had fallen into the Hua mansion and could not escape, Ziyu harbored a deep desire to see through the vanity of the mortal world. He completely completely withdrew from the world of song and dance, shutting himself away in a solitary room, finding his"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"自无弱兵。你们看佩仙这首词，外边那些头巾纱帽作得出来么？」子玉道：「果然。就是华公子这几个字也改得好。」又问了琴言几句，玉林、蕙芳也细细说了，子玉又发起怔来。忽然高品的小使进来请他，说有客要会。高品即忙出去，有好一刻工夫尚不进来。南湘道：「什么人这么长谈？」春航道：「近来卓然有些古怪，找他的不一而足，却非寻常往来，都是俗陋不堪的人。前日我的小使见他的管家，拿了好","en":"Ziyu agreed, \\"Indeed. Even Young Master Hua's edits were brilliantly done.\\" He then asked a few questions about Qinyan, and Yulin and Huifang recounted the details of his quiet departure. Upon hearing this, Ziyu fell into a frozen daze. Suddenly, Gao Pin's page boy entered to summon him, announcing that a guest had arrived to see him. Gao Pin hurriedly left the room"}],"33":[{"paragraph":3,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"是日天气晴和，雪消风静，子玉欲访聘才，打探琴言消息。","en":"mild and clear; the snow had melted, and the wind was calm. Ziyu wanted to visit Pincai to ask for news about Qinyan."},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":6,"tokens":["玉侬"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"但添了我这个俗人，不要把雅事闹俗了么？」宝珠道：「你也就雅极的了。」素兰问子玉道：「近来何以足不出户，可曾会过玉侬么？」子玉道：「没有。玉侬此刻如何能出来？倒不料他安身立命竟在那一处了。」宝珠笑道：「恐怕那处还不是玉侬安身立命处。玉侬之志，岂肯长受委屈的？」子玉道：「我听得待他甚好，有甚委屈处？」宝珠道：「好原好，但华公子那人究竟不能十分体贴人的。度香这么样待玉","en":"\\"You are extremely elegant yourself.\\" Sulan asked Ziyu, \\"Why have you been staying indoors lately? Have you seen Yunong?\\" Ziyu answered, \\"No. How could Yunong come out now? I never expected he would find his place there.\\" Baozhu smiled, \\"I fear that place isn't where Yunong belongs. With his aspirations, how could he endure being wronged for long?\\" Ziyu replied, \\"I heard"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":3,"tokens":["玉侬"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"局面就是两样，那处是步步不离规矩的，闲散惯的人也是不便的。八月十四那一天，我看玉侬出来伺候，就是勉强，叫作没有法就是了。」素兰道：「如今见了我们也是生生的，觉得心上总是忧郁不开的光景。」子玉听了，不禁叹了一声。宝珠见水开了，自己于博古厨内取出一个玉茶缸，配了四种名茶，自己亲手泡好了，把盖子盖上。又取出三个粉定茶杯，分作三杯，又将开","en":"every step, which is inconvenient for someone accustomed to leisure. On the fourteenth of the eighth month, I saw Yunong come out to serve; it was clearly forced, a matter of having no other choice.\\" Sulan added, \\"Now when he sees us, there is a strangeness about him; it feels like his heart is always clouded with a lingering melancholy.\\" Ziyu listened and could not help"}],"35":[{"paragraph":6,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"再说王恂、颜仲清、文泽、春航，从十三日至十五日都在怡园赏灯饮酒。子玉也去了一天，因想去年此日初见琴言，今年似成隔世，不觉伤感了一回。新年上，诸名旦彼此纷纷请客，热闹了十余日。到了十七日，王恂、颜仲清飞了札来与子玉。","en":"Contentment, admiring lanterns and drinking wine. Ziyu had also joined them for one day. Remembering how he had first met Qinyan on this very day last year, and feeling as if a whole lifetime had passed since then, he couldn't help but feel a pang of sorrow. During the New Year, the famous performers had frequently hosted one another, maintaining a lively atmosphere for over ten"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":2,"tokens":["玉侬"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"来看这诗，子云道：「庾香，此诗如何，可好么？」子玉道：「诗意甚好，但何以单刻这一首，想是新咏。」子云道：「这是玉侬近日怀梅崦的诗，瑶卿抄了他的出来，也是个望梅止渴的意思，我故把他刻了。真是花是人非，吾兄尚忆去年否？」几句话提起子玉的心事，不觉一阵悲酸，忍住了，也不言语，走开了。仲清道：「玉侬近日也学做诗了？」宝珠道：「我搜他的，已有二十余首，就不肯给人瞧，这首是","en":"sentiment is excellent, but why carve only this one poem? It must be a new composition.\\" Ziyun explained, \\"This is Yunong's recent poem longing for Plum Knoll. Yaoqing copied it out for him. It's meant to quench his thirst by gazing at plums, so I had it carved. Truly, the flowers remain but the people have changed—do you still remember last year, brother?\\" These few words"}],"36":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"前回书讲的宝珠生日，在怡园乐了一天，正是人生悲乐不同。却说琴言在华府，因元宵之日，华公子命其与八龄演戏，是日琴言身子不快，且兼感伤往日，是以神情寂寞，兴致不佳。","en":"human life vary. Meanwhile, at the Hua estate, on the day of the Lantern Festival, Young Master Hua had ordered Qinyan and the Eight-Ages boys to perform a play. Qinyan, feeling unwell and grieving over the past, wore a desolate expression and lacked any spirit for the performance."},{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"那日在台上，演到中情所感，不觉真哭起来。华公子以为无故生悲，十分不悦，叫下来痛斥了一番，有几日不叫上去。琴言独居一室，来往无人，且与那些跟班小使气味不投，凿枘相处。","en":"but weep real tears. Young Master Hua, assuming he was mourning for no reason, was deeply displeased; he called Qinyan down and sharply reprimanded him, not summoning him again for several days. Qinyan remained alone in his room without visitors. Finding the tempers of the servants and attendants incompatible, he felt entirely out of place."},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":11,"tokens":["琴言","玉侬"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"此日是正月二十七日，琴言对了这梅花，不觉思念怡园的梅崦来。想那度香相待的光景，较之今日，真有天渊之别。即有伺候不到处，度香非但没有形之于色，并且不藏之于心，反百般的安慰体贴。此日的华公子，喜欢时便也与度香彷佛，及不合他的意时，不是发烦，就是挑斥，元宵那一日竟至诟斥起来，与诸","en":"It was the twenty-seventh day of the first month. Facing the plum blossoms, Qinyan could not help but long for the Plum Knoll of the Garden of Contentment. He recalled how Duxiang had treated him; compared to the present day, they were worlds apart. Even if the servants fell short in their duties, Duxiang not only refrained from showing"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":8,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"将到了门口，已见一班人在那里搭篷。琴言进了门，一直进内，只见天寿跑出来，见了琴言，重又跑进。听得他师娘在里头，呜呜咽咽哭起来。琴言到了床前，见他师傅已穿好了衣，帕子蒙了面，自然一阵悲酸，跪在床前，痛哭不止。倒是他师娘拉他起来，劝他住了哭。琴言问道：「师傅得了什么病，好端端就死了？」他师娘","en":"As they neared the door, a group of people was already setting up a mourning canopy. Qinyan entered and went straight in. Tianshou ran out, saw him, and ran back in. Inside, he could hear his teacher's wife weeping bitterly. Approaching the bed, Qinyan saw his teacher already dressed in grave clothes, a cloth covering his face. Overcome with"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"只见众人纷纷的忙乱，伍麻子捧了一包孝衣进来。又见袁宝珠、苏蕙芳、陆素兰来了，琴言即忙招接三人，一同坐下。","en":"bustling crowd, Wu Mazi brought in a bundle of mourning clothes. Then Yuan Baozhu, Su Huifang, and Lu Sulan arrived. Qinyan quickly welcomed them, and they sat down together."},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":5,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"问了他师傅的事，然后问起他新年光景。琴言略将近事说了几句。宝珠道：「你既回来，告了几天假？」琴言道：「早上是林珊枝来告诉的，我也没有见着公子，说办完丧事就回去，也没有限定几天。」素兰道：「总得告一个月的假，等出了殡才可进去，不然也对不住你师娘。」琴言道：「可不是。」蕙芳道：「索性告假告个长","en":"They first asked about his teacher's passing, then asked about his life since the New Year. Qinyan briefly recounted recent events. Baozhu asked, \\"Since you're back, how many days of leave did you get?\\" Qinyan replied, \\"Lin Shanzhi came to tell me this morning. I didn't see the young master myself. He only said to return after the funeral, without"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":9,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴言道：「魏聘才搬了出去了，不知可在庾香处？」蕙芳道：「魏聘才么，如今倒更阔了。就在宏济寺住，同了奚十一、潘三、杨八一班混账人天天的闹，是什么剃头的，又是什么大和尚、小和尚，开赌宿娼，闹得不像。张仲雨也不与他往来了。」 　　 琴言问起子玉来，宝珠道：「前","en":"Qinyan asked, \\"Wei Pincai has moved out. Do you know if he's with Yuxiang?\\" Huifang scoffed, \\"Wei Pincai? He's even more arrogant now. He lives at Hongji Temple and causes trouble every day with a bunch of scoundrels like Xi Eleven, Pan the Third, and Yang"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"人来，便请了金三、叶茂林来张罗，同班的脚色之外，还有各班的并左右街邻，和馆子掌柜的，挤满了一屋，看烧了纸才散。琴言也乏极了，回房就睡了。","en":"troupes, neighbors, and restaurant owners crowded the house, only dispersing after the paper offerings were burned. Qinyan, exhausted, returned to his room and slept."},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"到了明早，宝珠着人送了信来，道：「本定今日，因度香有事，遂改明日辰刻在怡园叙集。」琴言应了，梳洗毕，独坐凝思：「今日空闲无事，不如去看看庾香罢。」因想去年梅夫人待的光景，去谅也无妨。主意定了，换了一身素服，吩咐套了车，一面告诉师娘去谢谢同班的人。到了外间，忽然又转念道：「如今已隔了半年了，况从前是聘才领我去的，不要进门房里回话。如今我","en":"matters to attend to, so we've changed the gathering at the Garden of Contentment to the chen hour tomorrow.\\" Qinyan agreed. After washing up, he sat alone in thought: \\"Since I have nothing to do today, why not go see Yuxiang?\\" Remembering Lady Mei's kind treatment last year, he figured there would be no harm in going. Mind made up, he changed into plain clothes, ordered"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":22,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"遂对小使道：「我先到宏济寺看魏师爷。」即出门上了车，小使跨了车沿，几个转弯，不上一里路，已到了。琴言见寺门口歇一辆大鞍子四六档车，有个车夫睡在车上。琴言当是聘才的车，想道幸而来早一步，不然他就要出门去了。小使进去问了，说道：「在家，请你进去。」琴言下来，走进了东边的门，小使指点他一直过了两层殿，从东廊后另有一个院子进去。琴言低着头，并不留心别处，一","en":"boarded the carriage; the servant climbed onto the shaft. After a few turns and less than a li, they arrived. Qinyan saw a large, fine carriage with a sleeping driver resting at the temple gate. Assuming it was Pincai's, he felt relieved to have arrived before he went out. The servant went in to ask and reported, \\"He's home and invites you in.\\" Qinyan stepped down"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"奚十一是个粗卤人，尽讲实事的，但面目之好歹也分得出来。此时见了琴言，却是生平未见过的宝贝，心中着实大动。","en":"coarse and vulgar man who cared only for raw desires, but he could easily distinguish a beautiful face. Seeing Qinyan now, he felt he had laid eyes on an unprecedented treasure, and his heart was deeply stirred."},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":3,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，立起身来道：「我要走了。」便腆起肚子，几步就走了出去。聘才与和尚连忙相送，潘三尚坐着不动，黄瞪瞪眼睛只管看着琴言，看得琴言一腔怒气，不能发作。奚十一拉了聘才，走到和尚房中，对聘才作了一个揖道：「今日我要求你行件好事。方才这个人，我实在爱他。我若叫他陪酒，是一定不肯的。」聘才不等说完，忙摇头道：「不肯，不肯！不肯，定的。」奚十一道：「况且他已改了行，也难强他。如","en":"paces. Pincai and the monk hurried to see him off, while Pan the Third remained seated, his eyes wide and fixed on Qinyan, watching him with an intensity that filled Qinyan with an unexpressible rage. Xi Eleven pulled Pincai into the monk's room and bowed to him, saying, \\"Today I must beg you to do a good deed. I am truly enamored with that person we just saw. But if I"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":5,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"才进来对潘三道：「和尚请你说话。」潘三不得已，迟延的出去，尚回顾了几次。聘才把天香、翠官也打发走了，便故意的对琴言道：「好了，清净了，我也被他们闹昏了，闹得一屋子俗臭不堪。我们如今清清净净谈谈，吃了早饭再去，自然有一会耽搁。」琴言一想，在聘才处吃饭也不妨。况且这些人都去了，自然没有人来，便问聘才道：「今年见过庾香几次了？」聘才随口说道：「三次了。」琴言又问道：「","en":"Third dawdled out, looking back several times. Pincai then sent Tianxiang and Cuiguan away and feigned relief to Qinyan, \\"Ah, finally some peace and quiet. I was getting dizzy with all their noise, filling the room with such vulgar stench. Let's have a nice, quiet chat. We'll go after breakfast; a little delay won't matter.\\" Qinyan thought it over; eating at Pincai's"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"么要你老爷费事？又几时得罪过琴爷？说得这样周到，我就收下代做主人便了。你回去多多道谢。」即赏了来人五百钱，又对琴言说道：「这是奚老爷的盛情，送你的，我倒叨光了。你也应该谢一声。」琴言不解其故，只得也谢了一句。聘才叫四儿吩咐厨房快弄起来，就要吃饭。","en":"and act as host in his stead. Please convey my many thanks.\\" He gave the servant five hundred cash and said to Qinyan, \\"This is Master Xi's kindness, sent for you, and I am merely benefiting from it. You should also offer a word of thanks.\\" Not understanding the reason, Qinyan had no choice but to offer a polite word of thanks. Pincai told Si'er to have the kitchen"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":4,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"四儿去了不多一刻，就摆了酒菜上来，在个方桌子上。聘才道：「虽然便饭，也喝一杯酒。」琴言道：「不消了，就吃饭罢。」聘才不听，斟了一杯送过来，琴言只得接了，也回敬了聘才一杯。聘才喜出望外，也是平生第一次得意，难得两人对坐了。聘才随口的说些话来哄琴言，要他喜欢，说庾香近来也不出门赴席听戏，常托我对你说，在那里放宽了心，不要惦记着他，他慢慢的","en":"dishes were set out on a square table. Pincai urged, \\"Though it's just a simple meal, let us share a cup of wine.\\" Qinyan declined, \\"There's no need, I will just eat.\\" But Pincai wouldn't listen, pouring a cup and handing it over. Qinyan had no choice but to accept and poured one in return. Pincai was overjoyed; it was the proudest moment of his life to finally sit face-to-face"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":18,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"正要催饭，只听得院子里一阵脚步响，已撬了风门进来，琴言见奚十一，心里就慌，站了起来。聘才笑盈盈的说道：「来得正好，主人来陪客了。」奚十一笑道：「我知道此刻尚未吃完，竭诚来敬琴言一杯。」便叫巴英官拖过凳子，就朝南坐了。一手执壶，一手擎杯，斟好了，直送到琴言嘴边。琴言接又不好，不接又不好，急得满脸通红。聘才","en":"the sound of hurried footsteps echoed in the courtyard. The wind-door was pried open, and in walked Xi Eleven. Qinyan panicked and immediately stood up. Pincai smiled warmly, \\"Perfect timing—the host has arrived to keep the guest company.\\" Xi Eleven laughed, \\"I knew you hadn't finished yet. I've come in all sincerity to toast Qinyan.\\" He had Ba Yingguan pull up a stool"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":6,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"又叫换个杯子来，琴言道：「不必，不必，就拿来我也不喝。」奚十一道：「那不能，也不多劝你，一人劝你三杯。」潘三满拟这杯酒，他若喝了，琴言便亲了他的□嘴一样，偏又砸了，甚是扫兴。还想重来敬他，被聘才拦住。唐和尚不知好歹，斟了半杯道：「阿弥陀佛，华公府是小寺的大施主，老太太装","en":"When they called for a replacement cup, Qinyan flatly refused. \\"There is no need, no need at all. Even if you bring it, I will not drink.\\" Xi Eleven insisted, \\"That won't do. We won't press you too hard—just three cups from each of us.\\" Pan the Third had been eagerly anticipating that if Qinyan drank"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":5,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"和尚道：「我的祖爷爷，你不喝这一钟，我和尚就没有脸，明日只好还俗了。」便将酒杯顶在光头上，双膝跪下，两手靠在琴言膝上，口中不住的念佛，不肯起来，笑得众人捧腹。琴言被他缠得无法，只得说道：「请起，请起，我喝一口，下不为例。」便在光头上拿了杯子，喝了一口。想一想，恐人喝他的剩酒，索性干了。立起身来想走，奚十一推住了，和尚抱了他的腿，跪着在他膝上碰头。琴言只得坐下，","en":"secular life tomorrow.\\" He balanced the wine cup on his bald head, dropped to both knees, rested his hands on Qinyan's lap, and continuously chanted prayers, refusing to rise. The others laughed until their sides ached. Harassed beyond endurance, Qinyan finally conceded, \\"Please get up, please get up. I will take one sip, and never again.\\" He took the cup from the"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":7,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"」不住「啧啧啧」的几声。聘才、和尚也睁睁的望着。聘才暗想道：「好出手，头一回就拿这样好东西赏他，看他要不要？」琴言也不来看，只低了头。奚十一道：「你试试，大小包管合式。」便叫琴言戴上。琴言站起来，正色的说道：「这个我断不敢受，况且我从不带镯子的。」琴言无心，伸出一手给他们看，是带镯子不带镯子的意思。奚十一误猜是要替他戴上的意思，便顺手把住了他的膀子，一拽过来，用","en":"wide-eyed. Pincai thought, \\"What an opening move—offering such a fine thing right away. Let's see if he takes it.\\" Qinyan didn't even look, keeping his head bowed. Xi Eleven urged, \\"Try them on, I guarantee the size is perfect,\\" and told Qinyan to put them on. Qinyan stood up and said sternly, \\"I absolutely dare not accept this. Furthermore, I never wear bracelets.\\" Without"},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"且说琴言上了车，下了帘子，一路掩面悲泣。到家即脱下外褂，上床卧下，越想越恨，只怨自己发昏，去找聘才，惹出这场祸来。把被蒙了头，整整哭了半日，几乎要想自尽。不知后事如何，且听下回分解。","en":"Meanwhile, Qinyan boarded his carriage, lowered the curtain, and wept into his hands all the way back. Upon arriving home, he stripped off his outer coat, collapsed onto his bed, and the more he thought about it, the more bitterly he hated himself for foolishly seeking"}],"37":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":3,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"且说琴言回寓，气倒了，哭了半日，即和衣蒙被而卧。千悔万悔，不应该去看聘才。知他通同一路，有心欺他，受了这场戏侮，恨不得要寻死，凄凄惨惨，恨了半夜。睡到早晨，尚未曾醒，他小使进来推醒了他，说道：「怡园徐老爷来叫你，说叫你快去，梅少爷已先到了。」琴言起来，小使叠","en":"To return to our story: Qinyan had returned to his lodgings in a fury. He wept for half the day before lying down on his bed fully clothed, pulling the quilt over himself. He regretted a thousand times over having gone to see Pincai, realizing too late that Pincai was in league with"},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":1,"tokens":["玉侬"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"也认不清屋宇，唯觉一片香雪而已。子玉每到园中，必须赏玩几处。子云道：「今日之局，人颇不齐，这月里戏酒甚多。我想玉侬回来，尚有二十余日之久，这梅花还可开得十天。我要作个十日之叙，不拘人多人少，谁空闲即谁来，即或我有事不在园里，静宜总在家，尽可作得主人。庸庵、庾香以为何如？」王恂道：「就是这样。如果有空，我是必来的。」子玉道：「依我，也不必天天尽要主人费心，谁人有兴","en":"spots. Ziyun said, \\"We are rather short of company today, as there are many theatricals and banquets this month. Yunong still has more than twenty days before he must return to the Hua household, and these plum blossoms should last another ten days. I mean to keep open house for ten days. Whoever is free can come, whether we are many or few. Even if I happen to be occupied"},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":8,"tokens":["玉侬","琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"见来呢？」少顷，宝珠、桂保来了，见过了。子云道：「怎么这时候还只得你们两个人来？」宝珠道：「今日恐有个不能来。玉侬还没有来吗？」桂保道：「今日联锦是五包堂会，联珠是四包堂会。大约尽唱昆戏，脚色分派不开，我们都唱过一堂的了。」王恂道：「何以今日这么多呢？」桂保道：「再忙半个月也就闲了。」宝珠道：「我见湘帆、前舟在那里，剑潭何以不来？」王恂道：「身子不爽快。」桂保谓","en":"asked, \\"Only the two of you, even at this hour?\\" Baozhu answered, \\"I fear some may be unable to attend today. Has Yunong not arrived either?\\" Guibao explained, \\"Today Lianjin has five private engagements and Lianzhu has four. They are probably all performing Kunqu, and there are not enough performers to cover all the engagements. We have each already performed at one gathering.\\""},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":4,"tokens":["玉侬","琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云吩咐摆起席面来，也不送酒。子云对王恂道：「论年齿，吾弟长于庾香，但今日之酌特为玉侬而设，要玉侬坐个首席，庾香作陪。」琴言道：「这个如何使得？我是不坐的。」子玉道：「应是庸庵。」子云道：「往日原是这样，今日却要倒转来。」便拉定琴言坐了首席，子玉并之。桂保坐了二席，王恂并之，不准再逊，逊者罚酒十杯。子云又叫宝珠坐在上面，宝珠要推时，见","en":"without a formal offering of wine. He said to Wang Xun, \\"You are older than Yuxiang, but today we are drinking in Yunong's honour. Let him take the seat of honour, with Yuxiang beside him.\\" Qinyan protested, \\"That cannot be. I shall not sit there.\\" Ziyu suggested that Yong'an should have the top seat. Ziyun replied, \\"On other occasions, yes, but today we are reversing"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":4,"tokens":["琴言","玉侬"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"宝珠看琴言的眼睛似像哭肿的，想是为师傅了。子云也看出来，太息了一声道：「玉侬真是个多情人，长庆待他也不算好，他还哭得这样，这也难得。」众人尽皆太息。琴言听了，触起昨日的气来，便脸有怒容。又见子玉在旁，总是为他而起，他一阵酸楚，流下泪来。众人齐相劝慰，殊不知琴言","en":"Baozhu noticed that Qinyan's eyes looked swollen from weeping and guessed it must be on account of his teacher. Ziyun had also noticed this and sighed quietly. \\"Yunong is truly a tender-hearted soul,\\" he said. \\"Changqing did not treat him particularly well, and yet he has wept"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":6,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴言道：「我昨日见他，他说今年见你三次了。」子玉道：「何曾见过？最可笑的是大年初一天明的时候，在门外打门。门上人才穿衣起来，他说了一声，留下个片子，到如今还没有见着他。你是那里见他的？」琴言骂了一声道：「这魏聘才始终不是个东西。」蕙芳道：「早就不是个东西","en":"Qinyan said, \\"I saw him yesterday and he told me he had met you three times this year.\\" Ziyu replied, \\"That is quite untrue. The most absurd instance was at dawn on New Year's Day when he came banging on the gate. The doorman had only just gotten out of bed"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":3,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"蕙芳听了，皱了皱眉，问道：「你怎样呢？」琴言也恨极了，索性细细的将奚十一故意先走，后聘才撵了潘三，奚十一忽又送菜来，后奚十一、潘三、和尚先后的闯进，并将席间诸般戏侮，与砸了他的镯子，都说了出来。子玉听了，甚是生气，说道：「这是聘才的坏，定是他设的计，故意叫他们糟蹋你的。」琴言道：「可不是他通同","en":"Huifang frowned and asked, \\"And what happened to you?\\" Qinyan's anger had by now reached such a pitch that he went ahead and recounted the whole story in detail: how Xi Eleven had made a point of leaving early, how Pincai had then sent Pan the Third away, how Xi Eleven had unexpectedly sent over some dishes, and"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":4,"tokens":["琴言","玉侬"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"忽见子玉与琴言四目相注，各人饮了半杯酒。子云不觉微笑，问子玉道：「你与玉侬同过几回席了？」子玉道：「这是第二回，已一年之久。」子云道：「只得两回，可怜，可怜！真是会少离多了。」琴言笑道：「也第三回了。」次贤道：「庾香有些贪心不足，以多报少。去年你们瞒着人私逛运河，","en":"Just then, Ziyu and Qinyan caught each other's gaze, and each drank half a cup. Ziyun smiled and asked Ziyu, \\"How many times have you and Yunong sat at the same table now?\\" Ziyu replied, \\"This is the second time, and it has been a year since the first.\\" Ziyun lamented, \\"Only twice?"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云大笑，次贤道：「十日之叙，已无此福，若华星北之福，真是福如东海了。」说得众人大笑。琴言与子玉此时，已觉十分畅满。","en":"Xingbei's luck? Now that would be good fortune as vast as the Eastern Sea!\\" Everyone laughed at this remark. By now, Qinyan and Ziyu were both filled with contentment."},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴言道：「我有个水字，加一点是氷字，移上去是永字。」次贤道：「这个永字些须欠一点儿，也只好算个薄氷。然眼前的却也没有多少。」王恂道：「只怕就是几个，被他们想完了。」桂保道：「我还有一个十字，加一划是士字，移上去是干字。」大家说道：「好。」蕙芳道：「我有个","en":"Qinyan offered, \\"I have the character for 'water' (水), add a dot to make it 'ice' (氷), and move it to the top to make it 'eternal' (永).\\" Cixian said, \\"That 永 is not quite right; it will only pass as thin ice. Still, there aren't many examples that come readily"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"生虽是个古执人，笔墨却极游戏。其著作之外，还有些零碎笔墨，一种名《忘死集》，一种名《醒睡集》，都是游戏之笔。」琴言道：「这两种书名就奇。」王恂道：「内中说些什么呢？」","en":"Death* and another called *The Awakening from Sleep Collection*, all of it written in a spirit of amusement.\\" Qinyan said, \\"Those two titles alone are remarkable.\\" Wang Xun asked, \\"What is in them?\\""},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":1,"tokens":["玉侬"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"次贤道：「很好，就请庾香、玉侬先对起来。」子玉道：「还是你与媚香先对，次度香、瑶卿，次庸庵、蕊香，末后轮到我们罢。」子云道：「也罢，你作个先锋，他作个后劲，把我们放在中间，容易讨好些。」次贤道：「头难，头难，我一时想不出好的。我前日见瘦香的《题曲》唱得甚好，就出《题曲》罢。」蕙芳","en":"Cixian agreed, \\"Excellent. Let Yuxiang and Yunong start.\\" Ziyu suggested, \\"It would be better if you and Meixiang go first, then Duxiang and Yaoqing, then Yong'an and Ruixiang, and we shall go last.\\" Ziyun agreed to this arrangement, \\"You take the vanguard, and he brings up the rear; that leaves us"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"：「你这评论，真是毫发不爽，我改了《访鼠》罢。」次贤道：「这该贺了。」各人都贺一杯。到了子玉，出的是《看袜》，琴言对的是《借靴》。大家说道：「这个对得好，要贺两杯。」蕙芳道：「一杯也够了，这对子也对得快。若两杯两杯的贺起来，将人喝醉了，倒对不好了。」次贤道：「说得是，以后顶好的方贺一杯，好的贺半杯，平平的不贺。」于是各贺了一杯。","en":"deserves a toast.\\" Everyone drank. When it came to Ziyu's turn, he offered *Looking at the Stocking* (看袜), and Qinyan paired it with *Borrowing the Boot* (借靴). The company exclaimed, \\"Beautifully paired! That deserves two toasts.\\" Huifang interjected, \\"One cup is enough. That was a quick answer, too. If we keep drinking two cups at a time, we'll all be too drunk to"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴言出了《醉妃》，子玉听得王恂的《伏虎》，就触着了，对了《醒妓》。众人道：「这个对得有趣，满贺一杯。」琴言道：「巧在一醉一醒，这倒难得的。」轮到次贤，次贤道：「我出《撇斗》。」蕙芳道：「好个《撇斗》。」想了一想道：「我对《搜杯》。」次贤道：「也好个《搜杯","en":"Qinyan then put forward *The Drunken Consort* (醉妃). Wang Xun's earlier title, *Subduing the Tiger* (伏虎), gave Ziyu an idea, and he answered Qinyan with *Sobering the Courtesan* (醒妓). Everyone exclaimed, \\"That pairing is delightful! A full cup all round!\\" Qinyan"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"么？」蕙芳道：「势字怎么对得牝字？」子玉一想，不觉抚掌大笑道：「妙极，妙极！就是势字才可对得牝字，真是绝对。」琴言与宝珠尚未明白，子云、王恂也想出来了，也笑起来，赞道：「真好心思，把这两字当这两件东西，真是异想天开了。」四旦尚未想出，蕙芳犹呆呆的想，王恂道：「你们尚未想着，你们不知男子阳为势吗？」蕙芳等恍然大悟，便都笑起来，都也说好。蕙芳真喝了三杯，余皆贺一杯。","en":"burst out laughing. \\"Marvellous, utterly marvellous! Only 势 could possibly pair with 牝. A truly perfect match.\\" Qinyan and Baozhu had not yet understood it. Ziyun and Wang Xun, having worked it out, also began laughing and said, \\"A brilliant conceit, to treat those two characters as those two things: a truly inspired stroke of imagination.\\" The four performers had not"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"赞好要贺，王恂道：「慢着，我还要改。」又改了《草相》，众人道：「更好，新奇之极。」各贺了。子玉出了个《封房》，琴言对了《辞阁》，也算工稳，贺了半杯。琴言出了《卸甲》，子玉也思索了一回，没有新鲜的，偶想起《桃花扇》上有出《哄丁》，便把《哄丁》借对了，众人极口赞妙，各贺了满杯。次贤出了《饭店》，蕙芳对了《茶房》。蕙芳出了《拔眉》，子云道：「这更难对了。」次贤对了《开","en":"is remarkably fresh and inventive.\\" They all toasted in agreement. Ziyu offered *Sealing the Chamber* (封房), and Qinyan matched it with *Taking Leave of the Grand Secretary* (辞阁). This too was judged a solid pairing and rewarded with a half cup. Qinyan then proposed *Removing Armour* (卸甲). Ziyu reflected but could think of nothing entirely novel. Suddenly, he remembered"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":3,"tokens":["玉侬","琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"酒，出了个《跪池》，王恂对了《投井》，大家说好，也贺了半杯。到了子玉，子玉出了《折柳》。子云笑道：「庾香惠顾着玉侬，出这样稀松的对子出来。」子玉道：「我一时想不出生的，我看倒是对对易，出对难。」琴言对了《扫松》。子玉道：「这一对连我的上对都好了。」众人也贺半杯。琴言道：「我就出个扫字的上对，是《扫秦》。」众人道：「这个难了。」子玉道：「这个真难。秦是姓，又是国名","en":"to Ziyu's turn, he offered *Plucking a Willow Branch* (折柳). Ziyun laughed, \\"Yuxiang is making things easy for Yunong by offering such a simple title.\\" Ziyu said, \\"I couldn't think of a fresh one just now. Matching a title is easier than choosing one.\\" Qinyan matched it with *Sweeping the Pine* (扫松). Ziyu said, \\"Your answer makes even my opening title look good.\\" Everyone"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":1,"tokens":["玉侬"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"次贤道：「又轮到我了，我也学庾香惠顾人，出个容易的。」出了《酒楼》，蕙芳对了《书馆》，便说道：「我也学玉侬的连环出法，我就用书字出个《改书》。」次贤道：「你就难我，我偏要对个好的。」因想了一会，对了《追信》。","en":"one.\\" He offered *The Tavern* (酒楼), and Huifang matched it with *The Study* (书馆). Huifang then said, \\"I'll follow Yunong's linked pattern too, using 书 again in *Revising the Letter* (改书).\\" Cixian said, \\"Trying to make it hard for me? Then I'll give you a really good match.\\" After thinking for a moment, he matched it with *Pursuing Han Xin* (追信)."},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"对了吃饭罢。」子云道：「且看，其实天还早呢。」子玉道：「既要叙几天，也宜留些精神在明日，今日早散为妙。」子玉见琴言有些倦意，故要收令。子云只得依了。子玉道：「我出个三字对罢。」遂出了《飞熊梦》。众人道：「三个字就难些，好对的也少得很。」琴言想了一会，对了《伏虎韬》。","en":"for several days. Let's save some energy for tomorrow and break up early today.\\" In truth, Ziyu had noticed that Qinyan was beginning to look tired, and that was his real reason for wishing to end the game. Ziyun had to agree. Ziyu proposed, \\"Let me offer a three-character title for the close.\\" He offered *The Flying Bear Dream* (飞熊梦). Everyone murmured, \\"Three characters"},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":3,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"众人大为称赞，贺了一杯。琴言笑道：「就这一对完结了，我出四个字对罢。」众人道：「四个字的更难。」琴言道：「罚酒也只得一杯了。若是大家都要对四字的，自然就难了，这一两个只怕还有。」便出了个《卖子投渊》。子玉也想了一会，对了个《思亲罢宴》，众人拍案称妙。子云道：「情见乎词，庾香方才","en":"Everyone praised this warmly and drank a cup in celebration. Qinyan smiled and said, \\"Let us finish with just one more pairing. I shall offer a four-character title.\\" \\"Four characters will be even harder,\\" the others said. Qinyan reassured them, \\"The penalty for a failed match is still only one cup. If everyone had to"}],"38":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云因屈道生是个高雅好静的人，名旦中止叫了四个，宝珠、漱芳、蕙芳、素兰。漱芳有恙不能前来，格外又知会了琴言。是日屈公先到，与子云、次贤叙了好些旧话。","en":"performers: Baozhu, Shufang, Huifang, and Sulan. Shufang was indisposed and unable to attend; as an added guest, Qinyan was also notified. That day Master Qu arrived first and spent a good while in conversation with Ziyun and Cixian, catching up on old times."},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"」才定了仲清。东席第二是南湘，西席第二是春航。东席第三是子玉，西席三是文泽。子云东席作主，次贤西席作陪。宝珠、琴言在东，蕙芳、素兰在西，一一坐了。主人让酒，客皆饮了几杯。道生道：「我将前日先见的苏媚香谈起。」西席的人个个细听。道生道：「我这看相不论气色，部位是要论的，然尚在其次。我看全身的神骨、举止行动、坐相、立相，并口音言语，分人清浊，观人心地，以定休咎。但头","en":"the west was Wenze. Ziyun presided at the east table while Cixian acted as second host at the west. Baozhu and Qinyan sat on the east side; Huifang and Sulan on the west. Everyone took their places. The host circulated wine and the guests each drank a few cups. Qu said, \\"I shall begin with Su Meixiang, whom I met the other day.\\" Everyone at the west table listened attentively."},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"素兰、宝珠，大致相仿，与蕙芳也不差什么，就没有讲他们出身。又道：「出污泥而不滓，就是他们三人的大概了。」看到了琴言，道生道：「这位有些不像，如今还在班里么？」次贤道：「现在班里，而且是个五月榴花照眼明，雅俗共赏，是个顶红的。」琴言笑了一笑。道生道：「雅或有之，俗恐未必。我看他身有傲骨，断不能与时俯仰，而且一腔心事，百不合宜。此人若念了书，倒与我一样，断不能发科发","en":"said, \\"Emerging from the mud unsullied — that is the general impression these three give.\\" When his gaze reached Qinyan, Qu said, \\"This one is rather different. Are you still in the troupe at present?\\" Cixian said, \\"Still in the troupe — and a fifth-month pomegranate blazing before the eye at that: admired by sophisticated and common alike, at the very height of his fame.\\""},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"又要琴言的手看了一看，道：「可惜了，有文在手，趁早改行，虽非富贵中人，恰是清高一路。你这片心与人两样，不是你愿意的，恰一点委屈受不得。是你愿意，恰又死而无怨。如遇着忠孝节义的事，倒能行人所不能行的出来。但有一句话，心从宽厚上用，可以造命立运，惟怕寿元不足。然","en":"He then asked to see Qinyan's hand and examined it. \\"A pity,\\" he said. \\"The lines show talent — change your profession as soon as you can. You will not be wealthy, but yours is the path of the pure and lofty. Your heart is not cast as other men's are. What is not your own will"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"道：「又闻得有些对戏目的对子。」道生道：「有数十条，也记不得了。」次贤道：「我们前日几个人，也凑了好些。」又指琴言、蕙芳、宝珠三人道：「这三个还有一个王桂保，他们也对了许多，比我们还好些。」便叫人到他书房拿出一个单子，并上次所行之令也写在上面，注了各人姓名。道生看了，连声赞好，道：「不料这四位竟能如此，竟是我辈，老夫今日真有幸也。他们贵行中我却也见过许多，不过写","en":"cannot remember them now.\\" Cixian said, \\"We ourselves produced a good many the other day,\\" and, gesturing toward Qinyan, Huifang, and Baozhu, he added, \\"These three, along with one Wang Guibao, matched a great number of pairs — and their results were somewhat better than ours.\\" He sent a servant to his study to fetch a sheet of paper on which the results of that session"},{"paragraph":39,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"。宝珠问子云要柄扇子，求道翁题诗，子云索性叫取四柄扇子出来，给四旦每人一柄。于是宝珠拂几，蕙芳移砚，素兰磨墨，琴言润毫，共求道翁留题。道翁也十分高兴，遂将各人的大概，每人写了七律一首，半行半草的一笔虞世南，并落了双款。四旦谢了，谈了一会各散。不知后事如何，且听下回分解。","en":"Thereupon Baozhu wiped the small table clean, Huifang shifted the ink-stone into position, Sulan ground the ink, and Qinyan moistened the brush — all four together asked Master Qu to write a tribute. Master Qu was greatly pleased; he captured the general character of each person and composed a regulated poem of seven-character lines for each, written in a semi-formal semi-cursive"}],"39":[{"paragraph":3,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"因有好几个月不去了，又为去年闹了事，甚是局促不安。颜夫人也不问其往事，淡淡问了几句话。聘才去见了子玉，子玉想起琴言前日的话，心上总有些怪他，也不似从前待他亲厚了。","en":"and exchanged only a few bland words with him. When Pincai went to see Ziyu, the latter still remembered what Qinyan had said some days earlier and bore him a quiet grudge and was noticeably less warm toward him than before."}],"40":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说前回书中，奚十一受了琴言之气，恨恨而回，心中很想收拾他，又想不出什么计策，惟有逢人便说琴言在外陪酒，怎样的待他好，还要来跟他。","en":"To return to our story: after the last encounter in which Xi Eleven had been humiliated by Qinyan and went home in a fury, he had been racking his mind for some way to exact his revenge. But, unable to think of any clever scheme, he had to content himself with spreading gossip wherever he went — claiming that Qinyan had been performing at drinking"}],"41":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说华公子自琴言告假之后，假期已满，不见回来，心上有些思念他。","en":"To return to our story: ever since Qinyan had taken his leave of absence, the appointed time had long since passed with no sign of his return, and Young Master Hua found himself missing the boy more with each passing day."},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"干净。若不会听的，怕不定你第一？」花珠方才服了，因又问道：「奶奶听珊枝的怎样？」华夫人道：「珊枝也是戏曲，倒是琴言虽然生些，还得清字意。」","en":"\\"Mistress, what did you think of Shanzhi's singing?\\" Madam Hua replied, \\"Shanzhi also has the theatrical style. As for Qinyan, though still raw in some ways, he still achieves that quality of purity and meaning.\\""},{"paragraph":30,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"公子听说琴言，便对夫人道：「琴言这个孩子，实在有些古怪。我们待他也算好了，看他心上总像有些委屈。如今告假一个多月，也不见他进来。其实看他也不像那种下作的，不知为什么心上总不喜欢，我实想不出来。」华夫人道：「我看这孩子，大抵是个高傲性子，像不是肯居人下的光景。但不","en":"At the mention of Qinyan, the young master turned to his lady and said: \\"That boy Qinyan is truly something of a puzzle. We have treated him well by any measure, and yet one always senses that he carries some private grievance in his heart. He has been on leave for over a month"},{"paragraph":39,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这边华公子直送夫人到房内坐了，又将方才填的词看了一会，同吃了晚饭。忽又高兴，到了洗红轩，因想起琴言如何还不进来，像已过了假期了，即叫小丫头去唤珊枝进来。小丫头去了一会，同了珊枝上前。公子问道：「琴言是那天告假的？」珊枝道：「正月二十四日。」公子道：「正月二十四日，今日已是三月初二了。他告一个月假，怎么过了七八天还不回来？」","en":"together. Afterward, in high spirits, he went to the Crimson Wash Pavilion, and as he sat there the thought of Qinyan came to him—how the boy still had not come back, though his leave seemed already to have run over. He called a little maidservant to go and summon Shanzhi. The maid went and presently came back with Shanzhi. The young master asked: \\"What day did Qinyan"}],"42":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":3,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说琴言在怡园与子玉叙了几日，颇觉十分畅满。到长庆葬事过了，忙了两三天，琴言辛苦了，身子有些不快起来，意欲安顿几天，再进华府。一日早饭后，卧在房中，见他师娘进来，琴言连忙站起。师娘叫他坐了，说道：「从前你进华府，不知华公子怎样对你师父讲的，师父也没有对我说过","en":"To return to our story: Qinyan had spent several delightful days at the Garden of Contentment in the company of Ziyu, feeling thoroughly content and at ease. After Changqing's funeral concluded, the ensuing bustle of two or three days left Qinyan rather worn out and slightly unwell."},{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"还有那些人情使费，是免不了的。我知道你是有良心的人，你替我想想，叫我怎样，不靠你靠谁？」琴言听了，呆了一会，心中想道：「这倒是件难事。","en":"avoided. I know you are a person of conscience. Think about it for my sake: if not you, who else can I count on?\\" Qinyan listened, and sat in silence for a while. He thought to himself: \\"This is indeed a difficult problem."},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":6,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"倒是件难事。况且公子近来待我又不如从前，这话怎好去问他？」想来想去，不得主意，答不出来。他师娘心上疑着华公子待琴言不知怎样好，自然要一千就是一千，要二千就是二千。这几天在琴言身上盘算，把个心想昏了。又恐琴言存着坏心，道是师父死了，便可撒开。所以长庆媳妇的心，想钱倒与长庆一样，可称良偶。便要紧挤住了琴言，做个靠山吃山、靠水吃水的主意。见琴言不语，便生疑虑，又道：「","en":"leaving him entirely unable to reply. His master's widow, for her part, imagined that Young Master Hua treated Qinyan with the greatest favor. She assumed that whatever she asked for, be it a thousand cash or two thousand, would simply be given. For days she had been scheming about how to make the most of Qinyan's situation, until her head was quite muddled with calculations."},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"有进去时，华公子就打发人出来说要买你，他可是不肯花钱的主儿？一个人凭良心过日子，怎么师父一死，你就变起心来？」琴言听了这些话，已气得要哭，只得忍住了，说道：「这话只好等我进去了再商量，我自己是没有留一个钱。去年及新年得的赏赐，就是前天那一包银子。","en":"money? A person should act in good conscience. How is it that the moment your master dies, you change your tune?\\" Qinyan, stung nearly to tears by these words, could only suppress his feelings and say: \\"The only way is to wait until I return and then discuss it. I have not kept a single coin for myself. What I received in gifts last year and at New Year is merely that"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"两条路凭你走那一条。你总要讲明了，才可以进城。不然进去了，我又不能进来找你，便费了许多周折。」说罢起身出去了。琴言受了这些话，又不能驳他，心中好不气苦。以为师父死了，这个身子由得自己，那知师娘更加利害。","en":"cannot very well go in there after you, and that will create endless complications.\\" With that she got up and left. Qinyan, assaulted by all these words, could not argue back, yet his heart burned with intense anger and bitterness. He had thought that with his master gone, his own fate would be his own to manage. He had not known that this woman would prove even more ruthless."},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":4,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴言低着头，只顾走，觉那两人就跟着他。听得一人低低的说道：「好一朵鲜花。」又听得一个说道：「咦，是那一家的，我竟不认识。我们且踩踩他。」又听那个说道：「这才算个好脑袋呢。」琴言听了，好不有气，然也无奈何，只好由他们讲。只听得背后一直促促，脚步接着脚步，衣","en":"Qinyan kept his head down and walked on, but he could clearly sense that the two men were following him. He heard one say in a low voice: \\"What a fresh bloom.\\" Then the other muttered: \\"Hmm. Which household is he from? I don't recognize him. Let's trail him"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"此刻正是散戏的时候，这些相公如何在家？琴言白白走了一回，路上又遇着这两个厌物，更加纳闷。进了房，长叹了一声，不觉泪下。偏有那师娘的表弟伍麻子，不看风色，走进来坐在炕沿，捏着潮烟袋，找了个纸条子，抽了二三十口，纸煤烟灰吹得一地。","en":"At this hour the afternoon performances were just ending. Where would any of the young entertainers be at home? Qinyan had made two wasted trips and on top of that had run into these two repellent creatures on the road, leaving him feeling even more wretched. Back in his room, he heaved a long sigh, and found tears falling without his willing them. At just this inopportune"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"又盘三问四的寻这样，看那样。琴言好不砂烦，也不理他。伍麻子吃了一会潮烟，问琴言道：「我听说华府里那些大爷们是不用说了，各人家里都是大屋子，有十个八个小老婆陪着睡觉。","en":"He then started poking around, turning this over, peering at that. Qinyan found him unbearably tiresome and simply ignored him. After chewing on his damp tobacco for a while, Wu Mazi turned to Qinyan: \\"I've heard that those senior gentlemen at the Hua household, needless to say about them, each man has a big house to himself,"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，在酒馆子里喝酒，也叫个打十不闲的陪陪。虽然是讹你爹的钱，然而也还有些出息，是真的吗？怎么这些人也这么发财？」琴言心中只管纳闷，更加烦恼，那里有心听他的话，只是不答应。","en":"from your late master, but even so, he was doing well enough. Is that all true? How do these people get so rich?\\" Qinyan's mind was entirely occupied with his own misery and vexation. He had no heart for Wu Mazi's chatter and simply did not respond."},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"变小了？」那些人说：「晒了一天，晒干了，自然收小了。」这句话我有些不信，难道这位公子，真当着银子都晒得干吗？」琴言听到此，不觉失笑道：「你这话是那里听来的。」伍麻子道：「我们有一班朋友，闲着没有事，聚在一处就讲这些话。城里一个华公子，城外一个大园子里的徐老爷，这两家富贵，讲一年也讲不完。说那徐老爷的园子里山子石底下，埋着十缸银，十缸金。那看金子的财神爷是一头黄毛","en":"find that rather hard to believe. Does this young master really think silver can shrink in the sun?\\" At this, Qinyan could not help laughing and asked where he had heard such a thing. Wu Mazi replied: \\"There's a group of us fellows, and when we have nothing to do we gather together and talk about things like this. In the city there's a Young Master Hua, and outside"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"让他们坐了。你道这两人是谁？一个是乌大傻，一个是姬亮轩，他二人新在戏园里认识。这日都在街上闲走，适相遇了，跟了琴言到门口。亮轩恍惚记得这个门，想了一会想着了，就猜方才见的是琴言。后又想起奚十一的话，说前月在聘才处叫他陪过酒，无疑是他。便与大傻讲了，大傻见亮轩高兴，欲赞成他进去，好吃个镶边酒，便道：「管他是与不是，既是相公寓里，总可以进得的，我们且进去坐坐，喝杯茶","en":"the theater. That day both had been idling about the streets when they happened upon each other, had followed Qinyan to the gate, and now had come in. Liangxuan had a vague sense that he recognized the gate, and after thinking about it for a while it came to him. He guessed that the person he had seen just now was Qinyan. He then recalled something Xi Eleven had said,"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子道：「他既不肯出来，你领我们到他屋里坐坐是可以的。」天寿摇头道：「他要骂我们。」伍麻子站在廊前道：「我们这个琴官，如今是华公府的二爷，不见人了。二位老爷如高兴，叫天福、天寿伺侯罢。」","en":"\\"Somebody came in — taller than you, sixteen or seventeen.\\" Tianshou said, \\"No, no. We only have our senior brother Qinyan, back from the Hua household, and he is not a boy of the trade any more — he does not sing. Perhaps that is who you saw.\\" Liangxuan said eagerly, \\"That's it, that's it, that's the one. Could you ask him to come out and let us pay our respects?\\"\\n\\nTianfu"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":4,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"亮轩心上又想去看看琴言，此时已经点了灯，便对天福道：「你同我到你师兄屋子里去坐坐罢。」天福道：「你定要见他，待我先去讲一声。」天福进去，见琴言在那里看书，便说道：「外面有个姬老爷要见见你，见不见呢？」琴言道：「我见他作什么呢？你见我见过人吗？」天福没趣，将要出来，琴言想要","en":"Liangxuan was beginning to want a look at Qinyan. By now lamps had been lit, and he said to Tianfu, \\"Take me into your senior brother's room and let us sit there.\\" Tianfu said, \\"If you must see him, let me go and say a word first.\\"\\n\\nTianfu went in and found Qinyan reading. \\"There is a Master Ji outside"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴言满脸怒容，未开言，大傻子深深一揖，亮轩也曲着腰作了半个揖，满面堆下笑来。琴言倒也无法，只得还了一揖，不好就走。他们也不待招呼就坐了。","en":"Qinyan's face was full of anger. He had not yet spoken when Dasha made a deep, sweeping bow, and Liangxuan bent forward in a half-bow, his face wreathed in eager smiles. Qinyan found he had no choice but to return their bow, as he could not very well walk away."},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"前日又听得尊驾与敝东同席，我就没福奉陪。敝东是个直爽人，不会温存体贴，一切尚祈包涵，不要见怪。」琴言见这二人就是路上跟着他走的，心中甚恼。及见他们恭恭敬敬的作揖，一个说与师父相好，一个说与他敝东同席，正猜不出这两个是什么东西，也不来细问，含糊的答应了一声，叫小子给了两钟茶。","en":"lacks the gift of warmth and delicacy. I hope you will overlook his shortcomings and not hold them against him.\\" Qinyan now fully recognized these two as the men who had followed him on the street, and felt a surge of renewed anger. But seeing them bow so respectfully, one claiming to have been a friend of his master's, the other saying he had dined at the same table"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"傻一面吃茶，见挂着一副对子，念将出来，错了两字。大傻腹内既属欠通，眼光又系近视，倒最喜念对子看画，充那假斯文。琴言看了暗笑，略略看他们的相貌，已经生厌。又见亮轩嘻着嘴说道：「我那敝东，其实很好交的。你是不知道他的脾气，若混熟了，只怕还离不开呢。」大傻道：「不见那春兰么？」亮轩道：「春兰固然。本来钱也花多了，自应心悦诚服的了。我那英官呢，借去用两天，就用到如今不肯","en":"especially fond of reading out couplets and peering at paintings, so as to pass himself off as a man of culture. Qinyan saw the mistake and smiled inwardly; one look at their faces had already disgusted him.\\n\\nLiangxuan said with his simpering grin, \\"That patron of mine is really very easy to get on with. You do not know his temper yet. Once you were used to him, I dare"},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"亮轩与福、寿二人说了一会话，问了些琴言光景。伍麻子来请吃饭，亮轩才找起大傻来，杳无影响，心中着忙，便变了神色，只管要找乌大傻。天寿说道：「他去了。这个人是坐不住的，我见他在戏园里，一天总要走个十几回，想必他就来的。我们先坐，不用等他了。」亮轩只得坐了。看菜是四碟两碗，两盘饽饽，就吃了些。","en":"Liangxuan chatted with the two boys for a while, asking about Qinyan's situation. Wu Mazi came in to announce that dinner was ready. Only then did Liangxuan start looking for Dasha. But Dasha had vanished without a trace, and Liangxuan's expression changed as he kept urgently trying to find Wu Dasha. Tianshou explained"},{"paragraph":34,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"他塞在你手里，就跑进去了。我想跟他进去，有个管门的出来解劝，说是奚十一的寓处。那奚十一是好惹的？去年凭空的来找琴官，将姐夫一摔一个大筋斗，半天爬不起来，桌椅板凳打得粉碎。倘今日又遇见了他，可不要白挨一顿打，连这三吊钱也没有，我所以只好接了回来。我岂不想他三十吊么？」长庆媳妇道：「都是你们这些瞎眼睛的，也不分个人鬼。分明来打茶围的，苦苦拉住他，将个臭虫当作洋虫。以","en":"Eleven's lodgings. Is Xi Eleven someone to trifle with? Last year he came out of nowhere to make trouble over Qinyan, grabbed his brother-in-law and threw him over in a sprawling tumble. The man couldn't get up for ages, and the tables and chairs were smashed to splinters. If I'd run into him again today, I might have gotten a beating for nothing and come away without"},{"paragraph":35,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴言今日找着了宝珠、素兰、商量师师娘要钱之事。不知宝、素二人有何良策，且听下回分解。","en":"As for Qinyan, that same day he had managed to find both Baozhu and Sulan to discuss the matter of his master's widow's demands for money. As to what Baozhu and Sulan proposed as a plan, listen to the following chapter."}],"43":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说琴言是晚听姬亮轩、乌大傻说了多少瞎话，更加烦闷，幸他们就出去了。候到二更，不见宝珠、素兰过来，只得睡了。一夜无眠，到了次早，即叫小使去请他二人来。","en":"That evening, Qinyan endured a great deal of empty talk from Ji Liangxuan and Wu Dasha, leaving his spirit ever more clouded. Fortunately they soon took their leave. He waited until the second watch, yet seeing no sign of Baozhu or Sulan, he had little choice but to retire"},{"paragraph":2,"mentions":6,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"没有对我讲。方才你们五儿说起来，方知道。两三天总不见你，为什么不出来散散闷？今日度香约赏杏花，咱们可同去了。」琴言道：「可以。我这两日偶然感冒，觉得疲倦，今日也想出去散散。且假期已满，也要打算进城了。」宝珠道：「再歇两天进去也不要紧，进去了，咱们又会少离多了。」琴言道：「近来倒有件难事，我竟没有主意，故请你与香畹来商量，怎么代我想个法儿才好。」宝珠道：「什么难事","en":"air? Today Duxiang has invited us to enjoy the apricot blossoms. Shall we all go together?\\" \\"Very well,\\" said Qinyan. \\"These past two days I have had a slight chill and felt rather weary. I too should like to go out for some air. Besides, my leave has run out, and I must soon think about returning to the city.\\" \\"A few more days can't hurt,\\" said Baozhu. \\"Once you go"},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":10,"tokens":["琴言","玉侬"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"只见素兰走来，琴言、宝珠让坐了。琴言道：「你早上那里去？」素兰道：「今早王大人叫我去，我当是什么紧要事，原来很不要紧的一句话。我与剑潭、庸庵谈了一会，方才到家。知道你请我，不知有何差委？」宝珠将方才的话与素兰讲了，素兰拍手笑道：「果然，果然不出我们所料！我真佩服他。据","en":"Just then Sulan walked in, and Qinyan and Baozhu invited him to sit. \\"Where did you go so early?\\" asked Qinyan. \\"Lord Wang sent for me this morning,\\" said Sulan. \\"I thought it must be something urgent, but it turned out to be quite a trifling matter. I had a chat with Jiantan and Yong'an,"},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"二人即同坐了琴言的车，到蕙芳寓处。","en":"The two of them rode together in Qinyan's carriage to the place where Huifang was staying."},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"画的。看到末后一页，是一个美人倚阑惆怅的光景，阑外落花满地，双燕飞来，像是：「落花人独立，微雨燕双飞」的诗意。琴言触动了当年那个灯谜，忽忽如有所感，看题着一首绝句，琴言默念是：","en":"the solitary figure;\\nA gentle spring rain descends, as paired swallows take to flight.\\"\\n\\nThe image stirred in Qinyan's memory the riddle from long ago, and a sudden vague emotion passed over him. He read the quatrain inscribed below, and softly recited it to himself:"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"单为看花么？」素兰道：「事有一件，到怡园再讲罢。」蕙芳道：「何不先讲讲，此刻还早，到度香处尚可略迟。」素兰就将琴言的师娘要他出师的话，略说了几句。蕙芳道：「何如？我前日对你讲，你还说这也未必然之事，谁知竟叫我说着了。但要办这事，其实也不很难，就怕娘儿们的说话不作准，一会儿又不愿了。或是说定了数目，又要增添起来。且谁去与他讲呢？」素兰道：「那倒不要紧，就是我们也可","en":"Huifang. \\"It is still early — there is no need to hurry to Duxiang's.\\" Sulan then briefly outlined the matter of Qinyan's master's wife demanding that Qinyan be released from his indenture. \\"Indeed!\\" said Huifang. \\"I told you the other day, and you said it might not come to pass, yet here it is, just as I predicted. The matter is not so very difficult to arrange. The"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"宝珠等走上扶梯，进得楼来，次贤、子云笑面相迎，见了琴言、蕙芳等更加欢喜，说道：「今日倒料不着你们来。」宝珠道：「都是我请来的。」又对次贤道：「瘦香身子不快，不来了。」","en":"the others climbed the staircase into the upper room. Cixian and Ziyun came forward with smiling faces; seeing Qinyan and Huifang among the visitors, they were all the more pleased, saying: \\"We hardly expected you today.\\" \\"I brought them all,\\" said Baozhu. And then, turning to Cixian: \\"Shouxiang is unwell and could not come.\\""},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴言于此楼还是初次上来，见这楼弯弯曲曲，层层迭失，有好几十间，围满了杏花。有三层的，有两层，五花八门，暗通曲达，真成了迷楼款式。又望见前面的桃花坞，隔了一座小山。","en":"This was Qinyan's first time ascending that tower. He saw that it curved and folded, rising in tier upon tier, spanning several dozen rooms, all wreathed in apricot blossoms. Some parts rose three storeys, others two; the passages branched in every direction, winding"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"牙白雪选词场。\\n次贤、子云看他四人今日打扮分外好看，艳的艳，雅的雅，倒像有心比赛的一般。此刻都还穿着小毛外褂，琴言是玄狐耳绒，宝珠是玄狐抓仁，蕙芳是云狐抓仁，素兰是骨牌块云狐干尖。四人相对，就是珊瑚玉树交枝，瑶草琪花弄色，觉得楼外千枝红杏，比不上楼中四个玉人。次贤、子云虽时常相对，此刻亦还顾盼频频。子云道：「今日无肴，只有小饮，你们饿了，就吃起来罢。」蕙芳道：「","en":"elegant, as though each had taken pains to outshine the others. All four still wore their short fur outer jackets. Qinyan wore dark fox-ear velvet, Baozhu wore dark fox with a raked-claw pattern, Huifang wore cloud-fox with a raked-claw pattern, and Sulan wore cloud-fox cut in domino-block points. Seen together, they were like coral trees and jade branches intertwined,"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":3,"tokens":["琴言","玉侬"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"入《礼记》。」四旦皆笑。子云道：「我今日得了些江瑶柱，但是干的，作起汤来，虽不及新鲜的，比那寻常海味还好些。」琴言道：「我闻新鲜荔枝与江瑶柱别有滋味，不同凡品。若那干荔枝，也就没甚可爱，还比不上桂圆。那干江瑶不知是怎样的？」蕙芳忽然大有感慨，呆呆不语，俯首若思。子云颇觉诧异，见他是倜傥诙谐惯的，何以忽然如此。次贤问道：「媚香有什么心事么？」蕙芳道：「没有。」子云","en":"course, as they make a finer broth than common dried seafood, though not equal to fresh.\\" \\"I have heard,\\" said Qinyan, \\"that fresh lychees paired with fresh river scallops have a flavour unlike anything else in the world. Dried lychees lose all their charm and are no better than longans. What can dried river scallops be like?\\" Huifang suddenly fell into a deep reverie,"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"尚在。」宝珠问次贤道：「食品之内，究以何物为第一？」次贤道：「我口不同于人口，不敢定。以我所好，以鱼为第一。」琴言、蕙芳皆道：「说得是。」次贤道：「食品中也分作几样。如人品不同，有仙品，有神品，有逸品，有妙品，有宜烹龙煮凤，有宜吸月餐露，使其相反，两不为佳。故往往我说这样好，他说这样不好。《孟子》曰：口之于味也有同嗜焉。","en":"most,\\" said Cixian, \\"and I dare not pronounce. Personally, I would put fish above all else.\\" \\"Well said,\\" agreed Qinyan and Huifang together. \\"Among foods, as among people,\\" Cixian continued, \\"there are distinctions: celestial rank, divine rank, transcendent rank, exquisite rank. Some are fit to simmer dragon and boil phoenix, others fit to drink moonlight and dine on"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":7,"tokens":["琴言","玉侬"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"宝珠对琴言道：「上一回对戏目的对，你出四个字的，以后我也想着一副。」琴言道：「是什么？」宝珠道：「《游湖借伞》，《搜山打车》。」琴言道：「真好，工稳之极。」蕙芳道：「就是《别母乱箭》，可以对《训子单刀》。」素兰道：「这么对，还有《闹朝扑犬》，也可对得《打店偷鸡","en":"\\"Last time you were matching opera titles,\\" Baozhu said to Qinyan, \\"and you gave a set of four characters. Since then I thought of a couplet of my own.\\" \\"What is it?\\" asked Qinyan. \\"'Borrowing an Umbrella on the Lake'\\" said Baozhu, \\"matched with 'Searching the Mountain, Driving the Cart.'\\" \\"Excellent. Perfectly balanced,\\""},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":10,"tokens":["琴言","玉侬"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"吃过了饭，又下楼逛了一会，过了小山，过了石梁，便是留春坞。就在留春坞内煮茗清谈。宝珠对子云将琴言的师娘要他出师，及蕙芳、素兰的主意说了一遍。子云道：「若果如此，倒也很好。」便问蕙芳道：「你们有这力量作此义举么？」蕙芳道：「若说力量，原也勉强，但集腑成裘，也还容易。我与瑶卿、香畹三人可以凑得六百金，王氏弟兄、佩仙、庾香可以凑得四百金。」次贤道：「","en":"Spring-Lingering Dell. There, over brewed tea, they fell into easy conversation. Baozhu recounted to Ziyun the matter of Qinyan's master's wife demanding the release of his indenture, together with the plans that Huifang and Sulan had proposed. \\"If that is truly the case,\\" said Ziyun, \\"it would be very good indeed.\\" He turned to Huifang and asked: \\"Do you have the means to carry"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"。那位庆奶奶嘴里，好像画眉哨的一般，我有几分怯他。」蕙芳道：「人说他倒是个直性人，顺了他的毛，倒也易的很的。」琴言、宝珠、素兰先回去了。","en":"is a direct sort of person,\\" said Huifang. \\"Stroke her the right way and she will be quite easy to deal with.\\" Qinyan, Baozhu, and Sulan went home ahead."},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":3,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"芳即与他吃了饭，谈了一会，春航去了。茂林已在外面候了多时。定更后了，茂林提了灯笼，照着蕙芳，到了长庆家。也不找琴言，找了伍麻子，请了长庆媳妇出来。蕙芳见他扎了白包头，穿了孝衫，下面倒是条长绿绸裤子，白布弓鞋，黄瘦脸儿，长挑身材，三十来岁年纪，像个嘴尖舌利的人。见了蕙芳却不认识，问茂林道：「这位是谁？」茂林道：「这是班里的苏大相公。」蕙芳上前见了礼，叫了婶娘。长庆","en":"took up a lantern, lit the way for Huifang, and the two arrived at the Changqing household. They did not seek out Qinyan but found Wu Mazi and asked for the widow, the wife of Changqing. Huifang saw a woman emerge who wore a white mourning kerchief and a white hemp jacket, below which she had on a long green silk skirt with white cloth bound shoes. Her face was sallow"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"量，若要花三五千两，是花不起的，三千吊钱还可以打算。」长庆媳妇口里「阿哟」了几声道：「三千吊钱就要出师！你想那琴言去年唱戏时，半年就得了整万吊钱。如今与他出师，这个人就是他的，他倒几个月就捞回本来。啧，啧，啧！有这便宜的事情，我也去干了。」茂林道：「嫂子不是这么说。譬如还唱戏呢，原可以挣得出来。若卖去作儿子，是要攻书、上学、娶亲，只有赔钱，那里能挣钱？况且这个人","en":"strings, and you want to release him!\\" The widow exclaimed several times in astonishment. \\"Do you realise that when Qinyan was performing last year, he earned a clear ten thousand strings in half a year alone? This person pays three thousand strings and gets Qinyan for his own, and then in a few months he will have recouped his investment. Dear me, dear me! If it were this"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":4,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"后就有回信，如成了，就送银子来，并要这边写张字据给他。一番话，也讲到三更天了。蕙芳便请长庆媳妇进内，他们还要到琴言处谈谈。长庆媳妇谢了一声，先进去了，心里想道：「姓苏的这小杂种好不利害，二千四百两，从三千吊钱添起，我若软一点儿，就被他欺定了。内里他倒想赚一注大钱。这般可恶！」自言自语的也就睡了。蕙芳与茂林到琴言房内，把事讲定了的话与琴言说了，琴言甚是喜欢，只候明","en":"the third watch. Huifang then invited Changqing's widow to retire inside; he and Maolin still wanted to talk to Qinyan. She thanked them and went in first; she thought to herself: \\"That young Mr. Su is a clever little rascal! Starting from three thousand strings and working up to two thousand four hundred taels. If I had softened even a little, I would have been completely"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":7,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"：「费了多少力，他才凑了一千九百两，我代他借了五百两，一总开了一张票子在此，请收了。」茂林就代写了一张字据，与琴言收执。长庆媳妇见事成了，才备了几个碟子请茂林、蕙芳，叫琴言陪了小酌。蕙芳道：「我吃过饭了，不消费心，叶先生请独用罢。」即对琴言道：「你去收拾收拾，辞辞师父的灵，谢谢师娘的恩，就同我到那边去，我再同你进城去谢华公子，也不宜迟了。」琴言依了他，带回的东西","en":"behalf. The whole has been made into a single draft, so please accept it.\\" Maolin drew up a written receipt for Qinyan to keep. Seeing the matter concluded, the widow set out a few dishes and invited Maolin and Huifang to take a light meal, asking Qinyan to sit with them. \\"I have already eaten,\\" said Huifang. \\"Please do not trouble yourself. Master Ye, I leave you to"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"明日，长庆媳妇谢了茂林一百吊钱，茂林倒也不想，已心满意足的了。谁知琴言命中磨蝎颇多，虽出了师，忽又生出气恼来。未知后事如何，且听下回分解。","en":"thanked Maolin with a gift of a hundred strings. Maolin had not been expecting it, and was well satisfied. But Qinyan's natal palace stood under Capricorn, the sign of a life dogged by slander: though he had now been released, a fresh source of trouble was about to arise. What came next, the following chapter shall reveal."}],"44":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说琴言出师之日，就是华公子赏花之日。明日，华公子吩咐珊枝着人去叫琴言回来，珊枝派了一个外跟班姚贤，一早出城。到了长庆寓处，见了伍麻子。说假期已过，叫他进城。","en":"Now, on the very day Qinyan was released from his indenture, Young Master Hua was hosting a flower-viewing gathering. The next morning Young Master Hua ordered Shanzhi to send someone to summon Qinyan back to the household. Shanzhi dispatched an outer attendant named Yao Xian,"},{"paragraph":2,"mentions":3,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"伍麻子道：「琴言么，昨日有人替他出师，已经搬了出去，恐怕未必进城来了。」姚贤听了一惊，道：「这话怎么说！我家的人怎样私自放走了，如今他搬在那里？」伍麻子道：「我不知道，听得说替他出师的，是个江南人，想必就在他家了。」姚贤道：「岂有此理！你们就要出师，也回明公子，没有","en":"\\"Qinyan?\\" said Wu Mazi. \\"Yesterday someone arranged his release from indenture. He has already moved out and is unlikely to return to the city.\\" Yao Xian was startled. \\"What does that mean? How could someone in our household be simply let go without permission?"},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":5,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"我想他现在我们府里，外人如何敢替他出师，又带他去？这也实在是个奇闻。况我们公子待琴言怎样的恩典，一月给他师父二百银，格外还有赏赐。他的分儿，在府里除了林珊枝，还有谁比得上他？他竟绝不感恩，辞也不辞，竟同人走了。我想天下竟有这样忘恩负义的人，我回去禀明了公子，定然要拿转来，这就看他的造化罢。」孟七听了，笑道：「那里的话，这是谁哄你的？","en":"\\"As I see it, Qinyan is currently in our household — how could an outsider simply arrange his release and take him away? That is extraordinary news. And given how generously our young master has treated Qinyan — paying his teacher two hundred taels a month, on top of extra"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"那胡八道：「这琴言我没见过，不知怎样生得好呢。就是我们老爷，前月在宏济寺魏大爷处，叫他陪了一天酒。将我们姨奶奶的一对翡翠镯子赏了他。这镯子在广东买，还值一千四百块钱，在京里更贵了。如今我们老爷病到了，也没见他来看过一回，这人大概是没有良心的。既跟了你们公子，又想跟他们","en":"Hu Ba then put in: \\"I have never seen this Qinyan — I don't know what he looks like. As for our master, last month at the Hongjisi Temple, at the gathering hosted by Master Wei, Qinyan attended our master for a whole day, and our master gave him a pair of jadeite bracelets that had belonged to his consort."},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"姚贤吃了饭，道了谢，就进城来见了珊枝，将琴言近日的事，先照伍麻子，后照孟七、胡八的话，没有少说一句，说得顺口，还添了好些。又说路上见他与一个相公同车，想是陪酒去了。珊枝听了，呆了一会，说道：「这是什么话？是真的，还是假的？我要照你的话回，若有假的在里头，就了不得了。」","en":"Xian finished his meal, offered his thanks, and returned to the city, where he reported to Shanzhi. He relayed Qinyan's recent doings — first as Mazi had told them, then as Meng Qi and Hu Ba had reported — without leaving out a single word, and with his tongue loosened, he added a good many embellishments of his own. He also said that on the road he had seen Qinyan"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"撒谎？这是徐老爷家的孟七爷，并奚家的胡八爷，讲得有凭据，我敢添一句，对出谎来，是好耍的么？」珊枝心里细想道：「琴言何敢如此负恩？非特公子白疼了他，我也白白的照应他一番了。」又转念道：「看他的心总是勉强在此，心上又有什么梅少爷，自然在外面快乐。但到徐老爷处也还罢了。怎么连魏聘才、奚十一都陪酒来了？就不顾自己身分，也应留公子脸面。翡翠镯子也不算什么宝贝，就这么下作。","en":"said. Would I dare add a word? Is it something to jest about?\\" Shanzhi turned it over in his mind: \\"How could Qinyan be so ungrateful? Not only has the young master loved him for nothing — I have taken care of him for nothing as well.\\" Then the thought shifted: \\"Looking at his heart, he has always been reluctant to be here, always pining after some young Master Mei."},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":6,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"才方才走来，听得公子正说着话，故在太湖石后瞧一瞧，再上来。」公子道：「有什么话说？」珊枝道：「今早打发姚贤去叫琴言，姚贤回来了。」公子道：「琴言呢？」珊枝道：「琴言没有回来。」公子道：「琴言怎么还不回来？难道还有事呢？」珊枝道：「这琴言恐怕不能来的了。」公子听了，倒吃一惊，道：「怎么说，琴言有病么？」珊枝道：「没有。」公子道：「既没有病，为什么不能来呢？」珊枝故","en":"rock before coming forward.\\" \\"What is it?\\" said the young master. \\"You sent Yao Xian early this morning to summon Qinyan; Yao Xian has returned,\\" said Shanzhi. \\"And Qinyan?\\" \\"Qinyan did not come back.\\" \\"Why has Qinyan still not come back? Has something detained him?\\" \\"I fear Qinyan will not be able to come.\\" The young master was startled. \\"What do you mean — is Qinyan"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":3,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"华公子听了这些话，不觉大怒，把脸都气得白了，连说：「有这等事！可恨！可恨！琴言丧尽天良，人间少有。而度香笑里藏刀，欺人太甚，难道我就罢了不成！你明日还叫姚贤去，务必把他叫来，我问问他，是何缘故。我也不管什么徐度香，我自然不能依他，与他评个理，天下有这么欺人的事情么？若不相好的人也罢了，既系相好，就不该有心欺人。从前何以不早与他","en":"overcome with fury; the colour drained from his face. He kept saying: \\"Can this be true! Outrageous! Outrageous! Qinyan has utterly lost all human conscience — the like of it is rarely seen. And Duxiang — smiling on the outside, a blade within — he has gone too far in insulting me. Do you think I will simply let this pass? Go at once and send Yao Xian back — he must bring"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"珊枝又对宝珠丢个眼色，宝珠也劝道：「珊枝的话说得是。琴言若果真心向着公子，就有人替他出师，他也不肯瞒着公子，必来禀明一声。如果他来禀明公子，难道公子不肯与他出师？这个人又胡涂，又没有良心，还要他人作什么呢？况去年原是他自己要来的，今年又是他自己要去的，公子待他的恩典，那一个不知道？这是他自己没福，消受不起","en":"Shanzhi then caught Baozhu's eye, and Baozhu also sought to console him: \\"Shanzhi speaks rightly. If Qinyan's heart had truly been with the young master, then even if someone had arranged his release, he would not have concealed it but would have come to inform the young master in person. If he had come to inform the young master, would the young master not"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":5,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"公子回房，见了夫人，欲不题起，心上又忍不住，就将子云与琴言出师的事说了。华夫人道：「什么叫作出师？」华公子道：「当年他师父也是花钱买的，所以挣的钱都归他师父。有人替他出了师，那就不算师父的人，由他自己作主了。昨日度香花二千四百两与琴言出师的。」华夫人道：「这么说，琴言就是度香的人了。」公子道：「可不是么！我","en":"mistress, he tried not to broach the subject — but could not hold it back, and told her of Ziyun's arrangement of Qinyan's release from indenture. \\"What does 'release from indenture' mean?\\" asked Madam Hua. \\"In the old days his shifu paid to have him, so all earnings went to the shifu,\\" the young master explained. \\"With his release, he is no longer considered the shifu's"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":4,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"度香的老爷与我们老爷是至好，何必为着琴言，伤了世交的情份。我劝你可以不必，琴言到底算个优伶，若闹起来，这狎优二字就难免了。」华公子素来敬爱夫人的，听他心平气和的讲，心中的气亦消了一大半，口内答应了一句：「说得是。」但又舍不得琴言。忽又转念过来，欲行不可，欲罢不能，惟是无情无绪的光景。华夫人","en":"\\"Duxiang's lord and our lord were the closest of friends — why damage a friendship of generations over Qinyan? My advice is that you need not act on this at all. When all is said and done, Qinyan is a performer — if this becomes a quarrel, both families will earn an unpleasant reputation for keeping company with such people.\\" The young master, who had always"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":3,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这是琴言出师第二日，琴言原要今日进去，适子云于初六日要请客，一来与南湘、春航送场，并请屈道生，约子玉、仲清等相陪。今日已是初四，索性到初七进去，并说写个字贴与华公子，说他过了假期，一因身子不快，二因留他逛几天。所以琴言倒也心安，乐得多顽几日。","en":"This was the second day after Qinyan's release. Qinyan had originally intended to return to the Hua household that day, but Ziyun was planning a banquet on the sixth day of the month — to send off Nanxiang and Chunhang, and to host Master Qu Daosheng, with Ziyu, Zhongqing, and others invited"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":6,"tokens":["琴言","玉侬"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"那日蕙芳出门去了，琴言便到怡园来。此时梨花已开，子云、次贤与宝珠在梨院闲谈，琴言进来相见了。次贤笑道：「玉侬，如今由你自己作主了，不如辞了华府，到这里来罢。」琴言笑道：「我倒很愿，意但怎样去辞那边呢！」子云笑道：「那还了得？华星北必说我夺其所好，这官司还打得清么？不要弄到","en":"That day Huifang had gone out, and Qinyan came to the Garden of Contentment on his own. The pear blossoms were now in bloom; Ziyun and Cixian were chatting with Baozhu in the Pear Blossom Courtyard when Qinyan arrived and greeted them. \\"Yunong,\\" laughed Cixian, \\"now that you are your own master,"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"那时我托人硬把你荐了，由不得你不去。」次贤笑而不答。宝珠道：「若考中了，作什么官呢？」子云道：「翰林院编修。」琴言道：「庾香是个秀才，也可考么？」子云道：「可以。」琴言道：「你自然也去的。」子云道：「现任官不准考，我已补了缺。就是前舟，只怕也不能的了，五月前后总可得缺。」","en":"office does one hold?\\" \\"Compiler in the Hanlin Academy,\\" said Ziyun. \\"Can Yuxiang take the examination?\\" asked Qinyan. \\"He is only a xiucai.\\" \\"He can,\\" said Ziyun. \\"You yourself will surely go,\\" said Qinyan. \\"Active officials are not permitted to sit,\\" said Ziyun. \\"I have already taken up a post. And as for Qianzhou — I fear he cannot enter either; he will likely receive"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"发人来，要面见老爷，还有几个箱子送来。」子云诧异，道：「什么箱子？叫来人进来。」话言未了，只见珊枝已走到梨院。琴言望见珊枝，早躲进屋后，潜身听他所为何事。珊枝见子云、次贤，请过了安，说道：「公子与二位老爷请安，有一封信在此。」便双手呈上。子云接来，看见封面上有「皮箱四个，面交徐二老爷查收」，才即问了华公子好，将书拆开，次贤在旁同看，只见写道：","en":"Have the visitor come in.\\" Before the words were out, Shanzhi had already walked into the Pear Blossom Courtyard. Qinyan caught sight of Shanzhi and immediately retreated behind the house to listen in concealment, wondering what business had brought him. Shanzhi greeted Ziyun and Cixian formally, and said: \\"The young master sends his respects to both gentlemen, and asks"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":4,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"正月二十七日，小价琴言因其师长庆病故，告假一月，经理丧葬，今已逾假数日。弟于昨日着家人姚贤出城唤彼回来，始知吾兄已为琴言出师，并已收用。今将其箱笼什物一并送上，祈即查收转交，想琴言断无颜面前来自取也。但闻此子下流已甚，曾于各处陪酒，不择所从，惟利是爱，弟闻之发指。本欲拘回","en":"\\"On the twenty-seventh day of the first month, my household page Qinyan, following the death of his shifu Changqing, was granted one month's leave to manage the funeral arrangements. As this leave has now been exceeded by several days, I sent my man Yao Xian to the city outskirts yesterday to summon him back, and only then"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":6,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这边琴言尚不知缘故，似乎听得将箱子送来。知珊枝去了，忙走出来，见子云面貌失色，靠在椅上。宝珠与次贤还看那信，琴言过来要看，次贤意欲藏过，子云道：「给他看看，这是那里说起？华星北真不是人，听了谁的话，这般糟蹋人，可恼！可恼！」琴言不看此信还可，看了不由得伤心起","en":"In the courtyard, Qinyan remained unaware of the exact reason for the visit, yet he gathered that his trunks had been delivered. Hearing Shanzhi's departure, he hurried out, only to find Ziyun pale and slumped in his chair while Baozhu and Cixian pored over the letter. Qinyan"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":5,"tokens":["琴言","玉侬"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云见琴言如此，甚是伤心，因想道：「华星北过于欺人，不问真假。我本要与他讲个明白，但我去剖辩，倒长了他的志气，道是去招陪他了。索性罢了，断了这个交情，也不要紧。」说道：「玉侬不必哭了，你的好处，都是共见的，这些话有谁信他？一定是林珊枝从中调唆，以至如此，连我也","en":"Seeing Qinyan in such distress, Ziyun felt an ache of sympathy. \\"Hua Xingbei has gone too far,\\" he thought to himself. \\"To hurl such insults without verifying a single fact is intolerable. I had intended to go and clear the air, but to defend myself now would only"},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":6,"tokens":["琴言","玉侬"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"只见蕙芳来了，见了琴言光景，着实诧异，问了缘故，便拍手称快道：「天下有这么好事，真求也求不到，还哭什么呢？」次贤又将子云不要他们唱戏，要他们在园里的话说了。蕙芳道：「这是极好的，只怕我们生了这个下贱的命，未必能有此清福。我这两年内就想要改行，但又无行可改。这跟官一道，与唱","en":"Just then, Huifang arrived at the garden. Seeing Qinyan's red, tear-streaked face, he was thoroughly surprised. However, upon hearing the full story, he clapped his hands in absolute delight. \\"There is no better fortune in all the world!\\" he exclaimed. \\"One could not beg for such luck, yet here you are weeping"},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":3,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"且说珊枝回去，华公子便问到怡园见了度香怎样光景，珊枝道：「今日见他们在梨花园内，奴才进去见琴言、宝珠，琴言见了奴才，即躲开了。徐老爷问了公子好，将帖儿拆开看了一会，一句话也没有讲，就只冷笑一声。萧老爷说不及写回字了，回去与公子请安，我们明日见了公子当面讲罢。奴才将箱子交给他们门上，也就收了。」华公子打发珊枝去后，心上想子云必定认个不是，自将琴","en":"\\"When I arrived, I found them gathered in the Pear Blossom Courtyard,\\" Shanzhi reported. \\"As I entered, I saw Qinyan and Baozhu standing there, but the moment Qinyan spotted me, he quickly moved away. Lord Xu formally asked after the young master's health. He then opened the letter and read it for a long moment in utter silence, offering only a single, chilling laugh."}],"45":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说琴言在怡园住下，赖有子云、次贤日为开导，又有那些名旦不约而来，或有煮茗清谈，或有咏花斗酒，园中的胜景甚多，今日在牡丹台，明日在芍药圃，倒也把愁闷消去了一半。","en":"Qinyan stayed on at the Garden of Contentment, finding comfort in the daily counsel of Xu Ziyun and Xiao Cixian. The celebrated dan actors also visited frequently of their own accord. Sometimes they would brew tea for quiet conversation, and at other times"},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"且说子玉又与琴言聚了一日，知他出了华府，十分欢喜。","en":"Let us leave that aside and speak of Ziyu. He had spent another full day with Qinyan and learned that Qinyan had left the Hua mansion. Upon hearing this news, his delight knew no bounds."},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":4,"tokens":["玉侬","琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"次贤觉得子玉有些嫌他。便对子玉道：「何不到玉侬处谈谈，今日又挪到海棠春圃，相去不远。」子玉正中心怀。次贤便叫书童引路，送子玉到了海棠春圃。望见琴言穿着随身的月白夹袄，脚上是双大红盘花珠履，倚着海棠花树，对着块太湖石，在那里凝思。书童咳嗽一声，琴言回头，见了子玉，便笑盈盈的迎上来，说道：「来得正好","en":"Cixian sensed Ziyu's patience wearing thin and suggested, \\"Why not slip off to Yunong's place for a chat? He moved today to the Crabapple Spring Arbour, which is not far at all.\\" Ziyu's heart leapt at the idea. Cixian ordered a page to guide him, and the servant conducted Ziyu all the way to the Crabapple Spring Arbour. Looking toward"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":5,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴言果然走上台阶，手扳一枝海棠，看了一会，又闻了一回，点头微笑道：「果然，果然！你真是细心人。这香就像与花的颜色一样，说他不香却真有香，说他香又不像别的花香，真正恰是海棠的香。」子玉笑道：「此所谓心香，如何可以比得别的花香呢？岂有娇如海棠而云其一无香气，","en":"Qinyan mounted the terrace and steadied a crabapple spray in both hands. He watched it for a while and sniffed again, then nodded gently and smiled. \\"You are right. You are incredibly attentive. Its scent truly resembles its color. If you claim there is none,"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":1,"tokens":["玉侬"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云道：「略饮数杯，领领玉侬的情。」吩咐随便拿几样果菜来。当下四人小酌了一回，已经二更，子玉告辞，子云又嘱明日务必早到，子玉答应而别。","en":"Ziyun urged him, \\"Just a few cups, to honor Yunong's regard.\\" He instructed the servants to bring light refreshments. The four of them drank a little together. It was already the second watch. Ziyu took his leave. Ziyun urged him once again to come early the next morning, and Ziyu happily agreed."},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"此仰慕的话。只有史南湘、田春航在场中未来。相公们到的是宝珠、蕙芳、素兰、玉林、漱芳、兰保、桂保、春喜、琪官、连琴言刚是十人。","en":"Among the performers who came were Baozhu, Huifang, Sulan, Yulin, Shufang, Lanbao, Guibao, Chunxi, and Qiguan. Qinyan made ten in total."},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":3,"tokens":["玉侬","琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"的。及王胡子问时，你推我，我推你，没有一个肯上前。子云忍不住笑道：「既诸位没有问的事，我要问一个人。」就叫：「玉侬，你来跪下。默祷默祷，请上仙判判你的终身，后来如何？」琴言原想自己问问，不好抢先上来，今见子云叫他，即便上前跪下，叩头默祷了一回。只见乩上运动，已写了两三行。琴言起来，站在王胡子背后，看他写出，也是首七绝，道：","en":"first. Ziyun could not help laughing. \\"Since no one has questions, I will ask about someone.\\" He called out, \\"Yunong, kneel and pray silently. Ask the immortal to pronounce on your fate to come.\\" Qinyan had wanted to ask himself, but hesitated to leap ahead. Hearing Ziyun, he stepped forward, knelt, knocked his head, and prayed. The planchette moved, and two or three"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"杜鹃啼血自年年。\\n再生不记前生事，父子相逢各惘然。\\n众人看了，不解其意，有的还在细细推求。但第四句总解不出来，琴言只是发怔。王胡子道：「你再祷告祷告，求个注解。」琴言又祷告了，乩上又判了四句是：","en":"and son shall meet, each lost in mist.\\"\\nNo one grasped the meaning fully, though some pondered the fourth line. Qinyan stood stunned. Old Wang instructed, \\"Pray again. Ask for a commentary.\\" Qinyan prayed once more, and four more lines appeared:"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":2,"tokens":["玉侬","琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云看了，不禁笑道：「据上仙所判，玉侬前世，竟是道翁的女公子了。」琴言不觉红晕了两颊，道生也觉奇异，欲要再问时，见乩又动起来，写道：「吾去也，坡仙来。」写罢，寂然不动。","en":"Ziyun could not help laughing. \\"According to the immortal, Yunong was Old Gentleman's daughter in a previous life!\\" Qinyan's cheeks flushed crimson. Daosheng marveled too and would have asked more, but the planchette wrote: \\"I depart; the Immortal of the Slope comes.\\" Then all was still."},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"道生与琴言拜送了杜兰仙，重新焚香换酒，众名士一齐下拜，换了琪官、春喜上来扶乩。道生道：「今日坡仙必有佳作，我们当盥漱恭读。」只见乩上写道：","en":"Daosheng and Qinyan bowed to see off the Goddess Du Lanxiang. Fresh incense and wine were brought. Every gentleman knelt together, and Qiguan and Chunxi took the planchette. Daosheng said, \\"Today the Immortal of the Slope will surely leave us a masterpiece. We should rinse"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":1,"tokens":["玉侬"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"花一枝开春先，瑶琴三尺弹鹍弦。\\n红愁绿怨泪沾袖，明月一年几度圆。\\n道生写了。仲清对金粟道：「这四句像是说庾香与玉侬的。」金粟点头。子玉看了，分明一个梅字，一个琴字，也知道是说他们二人的，心里又想道：「难道坡仙今日要将这十九个人全写入诗内么？」子云与诸人也都看了，蕙芳呆呆的看着乩盘，只见道生又照着乩上写了四句是：","en":"does the bright moon wax full?\\"\\nZhongqing turned to Jin Su and whispered, \\"These lines sound like Yuxiang and Yunong.\\" Jin nodded in agreement. Ziyu plainly saw the characters mei (plum) and qin (zither), and he knew they spoke of the two of them. He wondered whether Su meant to gather all nineteen of them into his poem. Ziyun and the others read on. Huifang stared"},{"paragraph":35,"mentions":3,"tokens":["玉侬","琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"棱谢雕饰。\\n娇女含愁化玉郎，石头城下伤春色。\\n道生写到此处，不禁伤感起来，众人亦皆叹息。子玉道：「据两仙所云，玉侬前身的真是道翁先生前世之女，今日相见，可谓有缘。」道生听了子玉之言，不觉泪下。原来道生六十无儿，并且丧偶，孤苦一身，是以触动心事，凄然流涕，便呆呆的看着琴言，琴言也呆呆的看着道生，各有感伤之态。众人也呆呆的看他二人。忽然乩上又写道：","en":"deep sorrow welled up within him, and everyone sighed in sympathy. Ziyu said softly, \\"From both immortals' words, Yunong's former life was truly your daughter, Old Gentleman. Today's meeting was destined by fate.\\" Hearing Ziyu's words, Daosheng wept. He was childless at sixty, widowed, and utterly alone. The sight of Qinyan touched him deeply. Qinyan stared back, and both"},{"paragraph":37,"mentions":5,"tokens":["玉侬"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云吩咐家人在承荫堂摆了四桌盛席，便对众人道：「今日我有一言，上承仙命，下合人心，成了前因后果。两仙乩上俱判玉侬为道翁前生娇女。现在道翁无子，玉侬无父，我欲成此仙缘，要请道翁收玉侬为义子。玉侬虽失足于前，未尝不可立身于后，想先生决不以世俗之见论人。未识玉侬之意如何？","en":"commanded from above and welcomed below, that completes the circle of cause and effect. Both immortals judged Yunong to be Old Gentleman's daughter in a former life. Now, he has no son, and Yunong has no father. I wish to seal this fairy bond and ask Old Gentleman to adopt Yunong as a son. Although Yunong stumbled in the past, he may yet stand upright. Surely you will"},{"paragraph":38,"mentions":4,"tokens":["玉侬","琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"而诸公以弟之言为然否？」道生尚未回言，子玉喜动颜色，即道：「玉侬若得道翁先生栽培，真是精金入冶，美玉成器。只求道翁不以寒微为鄙，玉侬岂有不愿之理？」次贤与吉甫等都赞成道：「这是极好的事，大约今日合当父子相逢，不然杜兰仙何以特判出来，又单叫道翁上前，说明前因后果，不是也要撮合这件事么？可见数已前定。」子云接口道：「","en":"you, gentlemen, do you find my proposal sound?\\" Before Daosheng could answer, Ziyu's face lit up with joy. \\"If Yunong gains Old Gentleman's guidance, it will be fine gold in the forge, fair jade carved to ware. Only do not scorn his humble birth. How could Yunong refuse?\\" Cixian and Jifu wholeheartedly approved. \\"Nothing could be better. Today, father and son were meant"},{"paragraph":39,"mentions":3,"tokens":["玉侬","琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"但终是面嫩，答应不来，红泛桃花，低头不语。子云道：「玉侬，你怎么样？道翁是极愿意的了。况你们前生原系父女，今世自然天性未离，这是光明正大的事情，何妨答应，有什么害羞处说不出来的？」琴言目视子云，将头点了一点。子云哈哈大笑道：「愿意了，愿意了！这也不是轻易遇得着的。」就让众人到承荫堂，铺了红毡，次贤、子云扶","en":"speaking. His face bloomed as red as peach-blossoms, and he looked down in silence. Ziyun encouraged him gently. \\"Yunong, what say you? Old Gentleman is willing. You were father and daughter of old, and natural bonds survive. This is open and honorable. Why shrink from saying yes?\\" Qinyan looked at Ziyun and nodded once. Ziyun laughed aloud. \\"He agrees, he agrees! Such"},{"paragraph":40,"mentions":7,"tokens":["琴言","琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"只挂个名儿。我既认了他，自就与亲生的一样，要教训他，并且要随着我去，不知他心上何如？」子云听了，略一踌躇，即问琴言道：「这事要你自己作主意，旁人难以应答的。」琴言道：「这个自然，我又没有父母，岂有不追随的道理？」子云赞了一声「好」。子玉听到此，未免有些伤悲，然也无可奈何，况从此琴言入了正路，故也喜多悲少。在琴言彻底一想，非但不悲，而且极乐。道生便叫过琴言来，说道","en":"blood kin and instruct him. He must follow me when I go. What is his wish?\\" Ziyun hesitated briefly, then asked Qinyan. \\"Only you can decide. Others cannot answer for you.\\" Qinyan replied, \\"That goes without saying. I have no parents. How could I not follow?\\" Ziyun said, \\"Good!\\" Yet he felt a pang of sorrow, though there was nothing to be done. He was glad, on balance,"},{"paragraph":41,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云便请入席。第一席是道生、子玉、吉甫、王胡子、琴言，二席是仲清、文泽、王恂、子云、次贤，九个名旦分为两桌，各自叙齿坐了三、四两席。琴言坐在下手，拘拘谨谨，也不举箸，甚觉可怜。倒是道生体恤他，道：「凡遇热闹场中，当言的即言，也不必过于拘谨，但存着个后辈的分寸就是了。」","en":"Ziyun invited everyone to the table. The first table sat Daosheng, Ziyu, Jifu, Old Wang Beard, and Qinyan. The second seated Zhongqing, Wenze, Wang Xun, Ziyun, and Cixian. The nine actors split two more tables by age. Qinyan sat quietly at the foot, his chopsticks untouched, looking pitifully constrained. Daosheng comforted him gently. \\"In lively gatherings,"},{"paragraph":44,"mentions":1,"tokens":["玉侬"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琪官道：「这神仙也不知怎么来的，就这样快，就像在这园子里一样，真是心动神知了。」兰保道：「那杜兰仙与玉侬同姓，所以关切得很，把他的前事都说出来了，总成了这件好事。」","en":"in this garden. Truly, 'the mind moves, and the spirit knows.'\\" Lanbao noted thoughtfully, \\"Du Lanxiang shared Yunong's surname. She cared for him. She told his whole story and brought about this wonderful blessing.\\""},{"paragraph":47,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"道生来了一天，便要早回，对琴言道：「明日我着人来接你罢。」子云道：「先生何不搬来，那寓里有甚好处？」道生道：「这个最妙。我心上不好讲，又要搅扰。我还要细细把你的园子逛一逛呢！」诸名士道：「若得道翁先生住在园里，更有趣了。」次贤道：「前年园亭成后，一切布置倒也罢了。只有一样，各处的","en":"Daosheng had been out all day and wished to leave early. He told Qinyan, \\"Tomorrow I will send for you.\\" Ziyun asked, \\"Why not move in here? What good is an inn?\\" Daosheng replied, \\"That sounds ideal. I hardly liked to impose, but I still mean to wander your garden thoroughly.\\" The gentlemen all agreed. \\"If Old Gentleman"},{"paragraph":48,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"来，第一就要请教这篇序。」次贤笑道：「他还没有搬进来，你倒先索房租了。」说得众人大笑。道生约定明日即移过来，与琴言同住。","en":"The room filled with general laughter. Daosheng named the morrow for his move, confirming he would lodge with Qinyan."},{"paragraph":49,"mentions":4,"tokens":["琴言","屈勤先","琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"以后琴言就改了姓屈，称为屈勤先，人叫他号是琴仙，不叫琴言了，看官须自记明。不知后来如何，且看下回分解。","en":"From then on, Qinyan took the surname Qu and was known as Qu Qinxian. People affectionately called him Immortal Qin, not Qinyan. Readers, mark this well. As for what followed, see the next chapter."}],"46":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":6,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说屈道翁搬过怡园来，与琴仙就在海棠春圃住下。次贤向在梨花院，与海棠圃相近。道翁即有一番教导，琴仙从前念过的书，一面温理，一面与他讲究些诗词文艺，习学楷书。可喜琴仙天姿颖悟，过目成诵，而且锐志攻书，把从前的忧闷倒也撇开。一连几日，道翁见其聪明可学，也甚欢喜。子云更为得意，吩咐园","en":"When Qu Daoweng moved over to the Garden of Contentment, he and Qinxian took up their lodging at the Crabapple Spring Garden. Cixian had long been in the Pear Blossom Court, which was close by. Daoweng set about teaching him at once: the books Qinxian had read before were gone over again, and along with them they discussed"},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"请诸名士题罢。」子云道：「诸兄自有分题，这第一联还求道翁先生赐题，就是诸弟兄也不肯相僭的。」道翁又让了一会，叫琴仙捧过笔砚来，题了一副长联。诸人见他写出，看是：","en":"rest—but this first pair demands your brush; none of us would presume ahead.\\" After modest parley Daoweng told Qinxian to bring inkstone and brush and wrote a long matched scroll; all leaned in as he wrote:"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"若尽要老夫题咏，倒将诸位的锦绣埋没了。」众名士谦道：「此处实不敢妄拟，其余各拟几句呈改。」琴仙又捧了笔砚过来，道翁道：「你学了几天字了，我念你写，不要写别字才好，诸兄看看可长进些么？」遂口占一联，琴仙写了，个个的端楷。","en":"we really dare not presume; for the rest, each of us will draft a few lines and submit them for correction.\\"\\n\\nQinxian brought the brush and inkstone over again, and Daoweng said, \\"You have been at your writing some days now. I shall dictate and you shall write — mind you make no wrong characters. Gentlemen, see whether he has come on at all.\\" He composed a couplet aloud,"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"佳气近蓬莱，欣玉烛时和，金瓯业盛；睛光开阆苑，咏珠帘雨卷，画栋云飞。\\n又集六朝文语，成了一副八言的，也念与琴仙，写出是：","en":"rafters fly among the clouds.\\"\\nHe also wove Six Dynasties prose into eight-character lines and dictated them for Qinxian to copy:"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"风草月松，缘庭绮合；\\n日华云实，旁沼星罗。\\n诸名士惟有痛赞。再看琴仙的字，已是美女簪花，秀润如水，更为欣喜。道翁道：「对面戏台，虽有联匾，那块「太音之和」可以不换，檐前那块是要换的。柱上的七字联，应改八字的，请庾香世兄一题，老夫借观珠玉。」子玉尚要推逊，众人挤定了，却也不慌不忙，想了半刻工夫，提起笔来写了，说道：「小","en":"court; sun-born flowers and cloud-born fruit scatter like stars beside the pond.\\"\\nOnly unstinting praise followed; Qinxian's brush now flowed like hairpins and blossoms—graceful and moist—and hearts warmed further. Daoweng said: \\"The stage opposite keeps its plaques—'Harmony of Great Music' may stay—but the eaves board must change; the seven-character pillars should carry"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"」子玉道：「改做古香林屋罢。」道翁道：「妙、妙！这个古香林屋实在改得妙，就请题一联以成全璧。」子玉要取笔写时，琴仙道：「我代写，你念来。」子玉一面念，琴仙一面写，众人看是：","en":"Now please complete the wall for us by composing a matching couplet.\\" Ziyu was about to take up the brush when Qinxian said, \\"I shall write it for you; you need only dictate.\\" Thus, as Ziyu recited and Qinxian's brush moved, the company watched the following lines appear:"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"静，正值瑶琴一曲，玉笛三终。\\n道翁大赞道：「仙骨珊珊，非吃烟火食所能道，拜服，拜服！」子云与众人也都大赞，又赞琴仙的字比先写的更加精美。","en":"third refrain.\\"\\n\\nDaoweng cried: \\"Immortal bones—no kitchen smoke could phrase it—I bow!\\" Ziyun praised again; Qinxian's brush surpassed earlier work."},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉看了，真是喜不自胜。琴仙见子玉题了这副好对，也觉得玉颜春暖，笑启朱唇，仲清、南湘等也替子玉喜欢。大家走出了梅崦，过了梅林，转过一处，又是一个庭院。","en":"Ziyu brimmed with joy; Qinxian glowed knowing Ziyu had brushed the scroll—Zhongqing and Nanxiang shared their delight. They left the plum grove, crossed the silent woods, turned into another courtyard."},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"海棠春圃坐下。道翁道：「海棠花为花中艳品，还有那些紫白丁香衬贴他，更觉香色兼备，须好好起他个名字才好。」即笑对琴仙道：「我看你于那些诗词上也还明白，我今日当着人考你一考，你能起这个名字么？」","en":"lilacs to set it off it has scent and colour together. It ought to be given a good name.\\" And he said, smiling, to Qinxian, \\"I see you have some understanding of poetry now. Let me examine you today before company: can you find the name for it?\\""},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":4,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴仙听了，红起脸来，答应不出。子云道：「很能，很能。你快想来，如不甚好，也没有人笑你的。」琴仙道：「有倒有一个，只怕不好用。」道翁道：「你且说来。」琴仙道：「春风沉醉轩，不知用得用不得？」子云拍手赞好，子玉等同声说道：「果然真好！这沉醉二字，用得入神入妙","en":"At this Qinxian's face flushed red, and no answer would come. Ziyun encouraged him: \\"You certainly can—of course you can. Think of something quickly. Even if it is not quite perfect, no one here will laugh at you.\\"\\n\\n\\"I do have one name,\\" Qinxian said at last, \\"but I"},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"梦到香云生屋角，笑看新月上墙腰。\\n道翁与众人也着实赞赏了。琴仙道：「这个春风沉醉轩是昨日偶然想着的。对子只有上联，没有想得出下联。」道翁道：「你且将上联写出来看看，不好就不用他。如可以用得，请一位替你对成了才好。」琴仙就将上联写了出来，众人看是：","en":"roof's corner; with a smile I watch the new moon crest the wall's waist.\\"\\n\\nDaoweng and the rest praised it warmly. Qinxian said, \\"This Pavilion of Spring-Wind Intoxication came into my head only yesterday. I have the upper line of the couplet and could not get the lower.\\" Daoweng said, \\"Write out the upper line and let us see it. If it is no good we shall not use it; if"},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一曲惜余芳，娇比玉颜时醒醉；\\n众人大赞，倒将琴仙赞得不好意思起来。仲清道：「可惜没有下联。」子玉将这句不住的吟哦，次贤道：「这下联非庾香续成不可。」道翁道：「果然，就烦庾香点铁成金罢。」子玉欣然提起笔来，写道：","en":"Last Fragrance* — lovely as a jade face, hovering between waking and wine;\\"\\n\\nThe company praised it so much that Qinxian grew shy under it. Zhongqing said, \\"A pity there is no lower line.\\" Ziyu kept murmuring the words over. Cixian said, \\"Nobody but Yuxiang can complete that lower line.\\" Daoweng said, \\"True enough. Let us trouble Yuxiang to turn iron into gold.\\" Ziyu took"},{"paragraph":43,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"无须更换。东风昨夜楼是那一位题的？」次贤道：「是度香题的，对子是我做的。」道翁道：「好对子。」朗吟了一遍，也叫琴仙写了出来，琴仙记得是：","en":"\\"Duxiang wrote the name, and I made the couplet.\\" Daoweng said, \\"A good couplet.\\" He chanted it through once and had Qinxian write it out; as Qinxian remembered it, it ran:"},{"paragraph":44,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"满四处，还有些罂粟、虞美人，有五六处坐落。道翁各处看了，知是小赤城，因榴花而设。又看了些对联，自己题了一副，命琴仙写了出来。众人看是：","en":"made for the sake of the pomegranate flower. He looked at the couplets as well, composed one of his own, and told Qinxian to write it out. They read:"},{"paragraph":52,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"堂，已是夕阳西下，朱霞半天，映着那些牡丹花，更为绚烂。已撤了护花的幛子。子云备了两席，一席是道翁、南湘、子玉、琴仙、次贤，一席是仲清、春航、文泽、王恂、子云。","en":"half the vault set peonies blazing—protective screens gone. Two tables waited—one for Daoweng, Nanxiang, Ziyu, Qinxian, Cixian; one for Zhongqing, Chunhang, Wenze, Wang Xun, Ziyun."}],"47":[{"paragraph":3,"mentions":4,"tokens":["玉侬","琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"皆不合意。一日来到子云处，说及此事，子云道：「何不到我园中来，也热闹些。且道翁已选了南昌府通判，不日就要赴任，玉侬是要同去的了，你们搬进来，不好么？」蕙芳道：「我是不搬进来。」子云道：「你也搬进来。」蕙芳道：「我要搬进来，还要等一两个月，此时还不能呢。」子云道：「桂岭那边丛桂山房就有三十几间屋子，竹君、湘帆二人很够住了。你去对他们讲，说我说的，不必另觅，将来如有","en":"be livelier. Besides, Daoweng has just been appointed as an Assistant Prefect in Nanchang and will soon depart; Yunong must naturally accompany him. Would it not be splendid for you to move in?\\" Huifang replied: \\"I am not moving in.\\" Ziyun countered: \\"You must move in as well.\\" Huifang said: \\"If I am to move in, I must wait a month or two; it is impossible just now.\\""},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"事题起来。潘三像写了卖身文契与他一样，零零星星真应酬了好几年，直到那人死了方罢。此是闲话，非书中正文。下文即叙琴仙出京，且俟细细分解。","en":"years until the man finally died. This is an aside, not the main thread of our tale. The following events concern Qinxian's departure from the capital—wait for the next installment to see it unfold."}],"48":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说屈道翁选了南昌府通判，领凭之后，就要起身，这几天就有些人与他饯行，常不在园。那些名士、名旦也轮流与琴仙作饯。","en":"away from the garden. The scholars and celebrated performers likewise took turns hosting farewell gatherings for Qinxian."},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"。南湘素有才名，如今加上个翰林名号，更有那求文求诗的接踵而来。他又怕烦，常请金粟、子玉等代笔。至于不要紧的，连琴仙、蕙芳、素兰、宝珠的佳章都有在里面，好在人人说好，没有一个看得出来。南湘本要接夫人来京，一因任上两大人无人侍奉，二因他夫人利害，常要阻他的清兴，劝他戒酒。南湘有些惧内，本来只好狂饮狂游，鳏居倒也不妨。","en":"nuisance, he frequently asked Jin Su, Ziyu, and others to write on his behalf. For less important pieces, even Qinxian, Huifang, Sulan, and Baozhu supplied exquisite verses. Everyone praised the work, and no one could tell the difference. Nanxiang had intended to bring his wife to the capital, but his elders at home required attendance, and his wife possessed a fierce"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"起身，众名士饯行已过。今日道翁一早进城，为华公子请去了。南湘来找次贤、子云，都不在园里，即到春风沉醉轩来，只见琴仙手托香腮，在那里颦眉泪眼，见南湘进来，连忙起身。南湘笑道：「我道你此番自然长了学问，谁知还是那样见识。人生离合悲欢，是一定之理，各人免不来的，何必作那儿女嗫嚅、楚囚相对的光景？快不要这样。你看半阴半晴，时凉时燠，这般好天气，何不同我到吟秋榭去看看龙舟","en":"Ziyun, but finding neither in the garden, he proceeded to the Pavilion of Spring Breeze Drunk. There he found Qinxian with his chin resting in his hand, his brows knitted and his eyes wet with tears. Nanxiang laughed and said that he had expected Qinxian to have grown wiser, yet he remained exactly the same. He reminded Qinxian that parting and reunion, sorrow and joy"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":3,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴仙因与子玉就要离别，虽然叙了几日，心上还是丢不开，郁郁的想念，被南湘道破了，只得强起精神。也因闷坐无聊，便随着他到吟秋榭去。南湘忽又说：「我们何不去请了庾香、吉甫两人来，作个清谈雅集，倒也有趣。」琴仙听了，正合他意，便道：「很好，你打发人去请来。」南湘","en":"Because Qinxian was about to part from Ziyu, they had conversed for days, yet his heart remained inextricably bound in melancholy. Nanxiang's words pierced through his gloom, prompting him to force up his spirits. Feeling oppressed by idle sitting, he agreed to go along"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"可言。穿过了红桥，望见吟秋榭边，靠着一个龙舟，今日却未装满，恐天要下雨，只装了几层油绸蜡绢。到了水榭阑边，已见琴仙靠在第二层栏杆，望见他们来，在上面微笑点头。下面栏前有几个书童站着。","en":"decorated, perhaps out of fear of rain, but only layered with oiled silk and waxed cloth. At the railing, they spotted Qinxian leaning against the second-tier balustrade; seeing them approach, he smiled and nodded, while a few pageboys stood below."},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"发大笑。金粟道：「此是端午，又非中秋，忽然念那《水调歌头》做什么？」南湘道：「我因看这副对子，不觉击节起来。」琴仙道：「若依着时令，只可改作：「我欲乘龙归去，只恐珠宫贝阙，深处不胜寒。」南湘赞道：「改得好。教我们馆中朋友改这一句，定想不到「深」字，必改个「低」字。」子玉、金粟大笑。子玉道：「你也把他们太薄了。」金粟道：「他们的文章诗赋，倒合古时候的格调，也是有本","en":"why he was reciting that particular lyric. Nanxiang explained that a certain couplet had moved him to beat time. Qinxian suggested that to suit the season, he should change it to riding a dragon home and fearing the pearl palaces and shell vaults, where the depths are too cold. Nanxiang praised the alteration, noting that his friends in the Hanlin academy would never think"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":2,"tokens":["玉侬","琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"又道：「玉侬两三天就要走了，今日庾香应当怎样，也应大家叙个痛快。这一别不知几年再见呢。」子玉、琴仙听了，都觉凄然，几乎堕泪。","en":"He added that since Yunong was leaving in just two or three days, they should allow him to speak his heart completely today, for who knew how many years it would be before they met again. Hearing this, Ziyu and Qinxian both felt a profound sorrow and nearly shed tears."},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":5,"tokens":["琴仙","玉侬"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴仙道：「我们何不下船去坐坐。一面走，一面看，比这阁子倒还好些。」子玉道：「果然船里好。」南湘道：「我们就下船去，我备了几样酒果，船里去谈，一发有趣。」说着都下船来。南湘叫书童带了笔研，又把酒肴也摆下船来，荡动双桨。南湘道：「庾香、玉侬何以不开口谈谈？再","en":"Qinxian said, \\"Why do we not go down and sit in the boat? We can move and look about us as we go — better than this loft.\\" Ziyu said, \\"The boat would indeed be better.\\" Nanxiang said, \\"Then down we go. I have laid in a few dishes and some fruit; talking in the"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":9,"tokens":["琴仙","玉侬"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉也与琴仙并坐，靠在一个窗里，慢慢的荡到桥边，只见一群鸭子从桥洞里过来，琴仙道：「你看这鸭子是一群同着走，倒没有一个离群的。」子玉道：「人生在世，倒没有这些物类快活，毫无拘束。」南湘对着金粟微笑，金粟点点头，听着他们讲话。子玉道：「人生离合也没有什么一定，你看","en":"Ziyu sat close beside Qinxian, the two of them leaning in one window, as the boat drifted slowly to the bridge. A flock of ducks came through the arch, and Qinxian said, \\"Look at these ducks — the whole flock keeps together, and not one of them leaves the rest.\\" Ziyu said, \\"A man"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":3,"tokens":["玉侬","琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"南湘叫摆过酒来，家童摆好了。金粟道：「庾香、玉侬过来喝一杯罢。」一面把船荡到练秋阁前，南湘道：「去年静宜有个《水浒传》的酒令，媚香掣着了《潘金莲雪天戏叔》，媚香那个神色，再没有这么好笑，不料湘帆今日竟能如此了。」金粟道：「湘帆真不负媚香。」说着，叹了一口气。南湘道：「也幸遇着了媚香，若遇了别人，未","en":"Nanxiang ordered the wine to be served, and the pageboys quickly set the table. Jin Su invited Yuxiang and Yunong to share a cup. As the boat drifted near Refining Autumn Loft, Nanxiang recalled Jingyi's \\"Water Margin\\" drinking game from the previous year, remembering how Meixiang's expression during \\"Pan Jinlian Teases Her Brother-in-Law in the Snow\\" was incomparably"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":9,"tokens":["琴仙","玉侬"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"桂岭，子玉道：「我们荡转去，到兰径、菊畦、稻庄去罢。」南湘道：「也只可到兰径罢。我看那边水浅，这船如何去得？」琴仙道：「要到稻庄去，就要走围墙边那带河，过了水闸，全是大河。从菊畦背后，就到了稻庄，还可以到桃花源，就到不得兰径。」金粟道：「这里路我没有走过，就这样去。」于是一路的荡去，又觉别开生面。金粟道：「庾香你也该临别赠言，做首诗赠玉侬。」子玉道：「我们联句罢","en":"hamlet.\\" Nanxiang said, \\"Orchid Path at most. The water looks shallow over there — how would the boat get through?\\" Qinxian said, \\"To reach the rice hamlet you must take the channel along the wall and pass the sluice, and beyond that it is all open water. Behind Chrysanthemum Beds you come out at the rice hamlet, and you can go on to Peach Blossom Spring — but you cannot"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":7,"tokens":["琴仙","玉侬"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"南湘道：「我念给你听，你也念不来了。」琴仙犹带着泣，听南湘念道：「明朝送别长亭畔。忍牵衣、道声珍重，此心更乱。」南湘念到此，也几乎念不出来。金粟听了，也觉惨然难忍。琴仙已放声大哭，南湘勉强又念道：「门外天涯……」将词稿放下道：「我不念了。」斟了一杯酒喝了，便跷脚而卧，口中吟道：「一声《河满子","en":"Nanxiang said, \\"I will read it out to you — you will never get through it.\\" Qinxian, still weeping, listened while Nanxiang read:\\n\\n\\"Tomorrow, farewell beside the long pavilion.\\nTo bear the pull at one's sleeve, and say 'take care of yourself' —\\nthe heart is more distracted than before.\\"\\n\\nNanxiang could barely get the words out himself,"},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":5,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"明日，道翁还有事进城。琪官因与琴仙一同来京，且同一师傅学戏，如今见他跳出樊笼，得以出京，心里甚为感慨，便单请琴仙过来话别。因想请琴仙，必须请子玉，又托琴仙转约子玉于初六日同去。琴仙应了，果然把子玉请了出来。子玉那日先到文辉处拜寿，耽搁了一早晨，吃了面，即便辞回。王恂留住不放，陆夫人也","en":"The following day, Daoweng had affairs to attend to in the city. Qiguan, who had traveled to the capital with Qinxian and trained under the same master, felt a deep wave of emotion seeing his friend escape their constrained life and prepare to leave the capital. He decided to invite Qinxian over alone to bid him a proper farewell. Knowing that inviting Qinxian required"},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":5,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉喜欢，一径就到琪官寓处，进去见琴仙已等了好一会，还有一个老年人在那里说话。见了子玉，那人就站起身来。作别而去，琴仙还谢了一声。琪官送客转来，请子玉到他书房里坐下。子玉问起方才这人，琴仙道：「他叫叶茂林，是我们教戏的师傅，闻我要出京，今日送了几样东西来。」子玉见琴仙面似梨花，朱唇浅淡，","en":"Ziyu hurried joyfully to Qiguan's lodgings. Upon entering, he found that Qinxian had been waiting for quite some time, engaged in conversation with an elderly man. Seeing Ziyu arrive, the man stood up, bid his farewells, and departed, with Qinxian offering a word of thanks. After seeing the guest out, Qiguan returned and invited"},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":6,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琪官与琴仙坐在一凳，拉着琴仙的手说道：「琴哥，你如今是好了，上了岸，看我们落在水里。想我们同来的十个人，到京后死的死，散的散，就剩下你我两个。你如今又要去了，就只有我一个。想到咱们在船上的时候，那几个又是不投机的。哥哥，你说咱们两个生在一处，死在一处。有一天你","en":"Qiguan sat on one stool with Qinxian and took his hand. \\"Brother Qin, you are all right now — you have got ashore, and you can look back and see the rest of us still in the water. Think of it: ten of us came up together, and since we reached the capital some have died and some have scattered,"},{"paragraph":31,"mentions":6,"tokens":["琴仙","玉侬"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"水，游玩不尽，也不至烦闷。我明年满了师，也由我怎样，我找个便人，同着他来找你。我随便都愿意作，我实不愿唱戏。」琴仙道：「你来找我，要我活着才好。适我已经死了，你就怎样？不如你先寄封书来问问，得了我的信再来。」琪官道：「何必说死说活呢？哥哥总喜欢诅怨自己。」子玉道：「是极了，玉侬总要咒自己。譬如去年你进华府的时候，你也口口声声咒自己要死，如今偏好好儿的出来了。那时","en":"going that way and come with him to find you. I will take any work at all; what I truly will not do is sing.\\"\\n\\nQinxian said, \\"If you come to find me, I had better be alive. Suppose I am already dead — what then? Better send a letter first and ask, and come when you have my answer.\\" Qiguan reproached him: \\"Why must it be dying and living? Brother, you are always cursing"},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":9,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"三人勉强饮了一巡，琴仙已经醉了，离了席，到书桌边，看见那个水晶猫儿，真在都盛盘里，不觉凄然有感。见一个绝小的方锦匣子，揭开看时，是六颗骰子。琴仙放在手中，重新入席，拿了个空碟儿，对着子玉、琪官说道：「三心和同，有始有终。掷个全红。」璫琅一声掷下，却也奇怪，倒像有神明佑护着","en":"After forcing themselves through one round, Qinxian was already drunk. He left the table and went over to the desk, and seeing the crystal cat sitting there in its little dish he felt a pang go through him. He noticed a very small brocade box, and lifting the lid found six dice inside. He took them in"},{"paragraph":33,"mentions":6,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这一回也谈了许久，琴仙恐他义父回来，只得要早散，琪官也不好久留他。子玉想后日送他的人多，不好说话，便从身上解下一个小玉琴，送与琴仙道：「此是我常佩的东西，给你算个记念罢。」琴仙接了，一阵心酸，也从身边解下个五色玉梅花，递与子玉道：「这也是我常佩的。」子玉也收了，各人佩上。","en":"They talked a long while, until Qinxian, afraid his foster father might come back, insisted on breaking up early, and Qiguan could not well keep him. Ziyu, thinking that the day after tomorrow there would be too many people seeing him off for any word to pass between them, untied a small jade"},{"paragraph":34,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"明日端午，道翁在园，琴仙也要收拾些零碎。那名旦九人，是要到子云处来贺节的，见了一见。子云也无心绪，没有请客，就止与南湘、次贤、屈氏父子，在练秋阁小饮了几杯，看了一看龙舟，应了景儿。","en":"The following day was the Dragon Boat Festival. Daoweng remained in the garden while Qinxian occupied himself with packing his small belongings. The nine renowned performers arrived at Ziyun's residence to offer their festival greetings and paid a brief, polite call. Lacking any mood for festive entertainment, Ziyun hosted no grand banquets;"},{"paragraph":35,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"到了初六日，道翁一早命家人押了行李先走，自己与琴仙到了辰初方才上车。其时送行的不计其数。道翁一班老友，有到园中来的，有在城外等候的。华公子本要出城亲送，道翁再三阻了，没有来，止打发家人代叩送行，预先送了程仪六百金。","en":"On the sixth, Daoweng instructed his servants early in the morning to escort the luggage ahead. He and Qinxian did not finally mount their carriage until the early chen hour. The crowd of people seeing them off was vast and beyond counting. Daoweng's old friends had either come directly to the garden or were waiting patiently outside the city walls. Young Master"},{"paragraph":37,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"那九个名旦见了琴仙，一齐上来，握手的握手，牵衣的牵衣。","en":"Upon seeing Qinxian, the nine famous performers all rushed forward at once, some tightly clasping his hands and others affectionately tugging at his sleeves."},{"paragraph":38,"mentions":4,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴仙见了这九人，已觉悲酸万状。又见子玉躲在人后，在那里拭泪，不觉一阵心痛，头晕眼花，跌倒在地。慌得众人连忙扶起，拍的拍，唤的唤。把个子玉急得如痰迷心窍一般，直瞪瞪两眼，一句话说不出，泪落如雨。子云、次贤慌了，救醒了琴仙，便说道：「快扶他上车罢。」道翁交代","en":"Seeing these nine friends, Qinxian already felt a sour, unbearable ache in his heart. Then, catching a glimpse of Ziyu hiding behind the crowd and quietly wiping away tears, a sharp pain stabbed through his chest; his head spun violently, his vision darkened, and he collapsed to the ground."},{"paragraph":40,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"双轮碾动如飞去，回首云山已渺茫。\\n众人劝回子玉，子玉直着眼睛望不见琴仙的车，才放声一哭而回。不知后事如何，且听下回分解。","en":"mist.\\nThe crowd gently urged Ziyu to return. Ziyu stood rigidly, staring blankly until he could no longer see Qinxian's carriage, and only then did he let out a loud, piercing cry and turn back, weeping inconsolably. To know what happens next, please listen to the following chapter."}],"49":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说子玉送了琴仙回来，这一急一痛，便出了神，旧病复发，足足病了一月始愈。后来颜夫人已知琴仙出了京，道翁养为义子，倒也替他欢喜。","en":"After sending Qinxian away, Ziyu suffered such acute shock and grief that his mind drifted into a stupor; his old illness relapsed, and a full month passed before he recovered. Later, when Lady Yan learned that Qinxian had left the capital and had been taken by Qu Daoweng"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"却说华公子为琴言之事，与子云有了嫌隙，如何又到怡园来呢？这华公子是一时气性，写了那封恶札。过了两日，使有些自悔了。谁知子云只当没有事的一般，又不来招陪他，心内殊觉无趣。后与屈道翁送行，道翁倒把子云的好处说了一番。","en":"But why had Young Master Hua returned to the Garden of Contentment after his rift with Ziyun over Qinyan? Young Master Hua had written that harsh, severing letter in a fit of sudden temper. After two days had passed, he began to regret it. Yet Ziyun carried on as if nothing had happened, making no move to invite him over or entertain him, leaving Young"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"又说起扶乩，琴言与他前世原是父女，并将那首诗通身念给他听。华公子听了，心中着实骇然。道翁又赞琴言多少好处，现在认为义子，带他到任。华公子冰消雨霁，倒有几分过意不去。","en":"Daoweng also recounted the spirit-writing session, revealing that Qinyan and he himself had been father and daughter in a former life, and he recited the entire poem to him. Hearing this, Young Master Hua was deeply shaken. Daoweng then went on to praise Qinyan's many fine qualities, mentioning that he had now taken him as"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"再将琴言细细一想，真没有甚么不好，倒冤了他，便也赞了几句。道翁去后，次贤又来，才将这事澈底澄清的讲了一番，华公子始悔自己孟浪，又念与子云两代世交，为这点事绝交，是给人要议论的。又因他是个盟兄，只得尽个弟道，下口气先去招陪他。先是道翁、次贤已将华公子懊悔之意与","en":"Thinking over Qinyan again, he realized the boy truly had no faults; he had wronged him, and he voiced his praise. After Daoweng left, Cixian arrived and clarified the entire matter thoroughly. Only then did Young Master Hua fully repent his rashness, mindful of the generations"}],"50":[{"paragraph":8,"mentions":2,"tokens":["玉侬"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"清道：「庾香以后大约未必肯出门的了，我们去看过他几次，他又病了几天，俨然去年夏天的模样。他这个元神，此时正跟着玉侬在长江里守风，只怕要送他到了南昌，才肯回来呢。」琪官听了，眉颦起来，神情之间，颇有感慨，说道：「初六那一日，我请他们叙了半日，虽然彼此啼哭，却也还劝得住，不料至皇华亭，彼此变成这形象，我此时想起，还替他们伤心。」王恂道：「那天幸是没有生人在那里，若有","en":"did last summer. His very soul, I fear, is out there braving the winds on the Yangtze River right now alongside Yunong. I imagine he won't be willing to 'return' until he feels he has safely escorted him all the way to Nanchang.\\" Qiguan frowned deeply upon hearing this, his expression filled with poignant sorrow. He murmured, \\"On the sixth, when I hosted them for half"}],"52":[{"paragraph":5,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"早上就开了戏，诸人一面看戏，一面欢笑，好不高兴。子玉见那些名旦之中，就只少了琴言，触景伤情，颇有一人向隅之惨，众人也都会意。忽不见了高品，子云命书童去找他，找到戏房后头，找着了。见高品在那里教王兰保的戏，兰保点头而笑。高品出来，装出正经样子，连笑话也都不说一句。少顷，王兰保来请点戏，送到子云面前，子云点了一出《乔醋》，高品点了一","en":"watched the stage, laughing and reveling in high spirits. Ziyu, however, observing all the famed actors yet finding Qinyan alone missing, felt a sharp pang of sorrow at the sight, an agonizing sense of being 'one person alone in a corner.' The others silently understood his melancholy. At one point, Gao Pin suddenly vanished. Ziyun sent a pageboy to search for him, eventually"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":7,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"即对子云道：「此君风韵不减袁、苏，貌类琴言，而聪明过之。」赞得素兰好不喜欢。华公子又问子玉道：「弟与尊兄虽初次识面，但心契已久。有个魏聘才，是府上搬出来，在弟处住了半年，常常提及阁下，并有一事倒要请教。」子玉不知问他何事，即答道：「魏世兄也时常提及尊府，但未识荆，不敢晋谒，不知有何赐教？」华","en":"Young Master Hua continued, \\"This gentleman's charm rivals that of Yuan and Su, and while his appearance resembles Qinyan's, his intelligence surpasses his.\\" Sulan was utterly delighted by the praise. Young Master Hua then addressed Ziyu, \\"Though you and I meet face-to-face for the first time, our hearts have long been aligned. A certain Wei Pincai, who moved out of your"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":1,"tokens":["玉侬"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"吟了一遍，又问素兰道：「这是你自己的么？」素兰道：「字与画都是胡乱涂写的，这词…」即指着子玉道：「就是梅少爷送玉侬的。」华公子折了扇子，对着子玉道：「看时就有几分猜着是吾兄手笔，非至情人不能道，果然，果然。」又笑道：「这梦魂到底唤得来唤不来呢？」子玉怎样回答，众人皆笑。","en":"painting are just casual daubs, but this lyric...\\" He pointed at Ziyu, \\"It is what Young Master Mei gifted to Yunong.\\" Folding the fan, Young Master Hua turned to Ziyu, \\"When I first read it, I half-guessed it was your handiwork. Only one of utmost feeling could write this way. Indeed, indeed.\\" He then added with a smile, \\"But can this dream-soul truly be summoned"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，说是赠妓的，也不甚像。然而语至情真，却有可取。」华公子笑道：「你真好眼力，这一评真评得不错。这首词是一个人送琴言的，可不是夫妇不像夫妇，朋友不像朋友，妓又不像妓么？然而写这片情，真写得消魂动魄。」华夫人道：「是度香作的么？」华公子道：「不是，是梅庾香，就是琴言向日的知己。」华夫人问道：「前日我写的扇子呢？你不要给人瞧。」华公子听了这句话，方想起给了素兰，就是这","en":"Master Hua laughed, \\"You have a brilliant eye! That assessment is absolutely correct. This lyric was written for Qinyan. Is it not exactly that—husband and wife yet not husband and wife, friend yet not friend, courtesan yet not courtesan? Yet the way it captures that emotion is truly soul-shaking.\\" Lady Hua asked, \\"Did Duxiang write it?\\" Young Master Hua replied, \\"No,"}],"53":[{"paragraph":7,"mentions":10,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"」素兰被他说破词中之意，只得遮饰道：「其实我倒没有什么寓意，公子这一讲，倒像有意题的了。」公子笑道：「你明明将琴言借题发挥感讽我，但究竟是他负我，非我负他。我如今一想，在我这里也终非了局，如今他倒好了。」素兰见他说明，不能再辨，只得说道：「公子之待琴言，原是没有说的。但琴言用情专一，不善变通。倘使琴言一进京来，就遇公子，有这番恩典，他竟可以杀身相报，至死不怨的。","en":"interpretation makes it seem as though I wrote with one in mind.\\"\\n\\nYoung Master Hua smiled, \\"You are clearly using Qinyan as a pretext to subtly reproach me, but ultimately, it was he who let me down, not I who let him down. Thinking on it now, staying with me would not have been a lasting solution anyway; perhaps things are better for him now.\\"\\n\\nSeeing him speak so frankly,"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"童拿了一包书信进来。子云一看封面，是屈道翁在南京途中寄来的，心中一喜。拆了总封，里头有十几封信与各相好，却都是琴言笔迹，说自己跌坏了膀子不能写，无非是些道谢等语，内有怀怡园诸同人五古一篇，并沿途七律八首。又见琴言另有一封信，子云拆开，内里是三封，一封是诸名士同启，一封是众弟兄同启，一封庾香才子手启。子云一一拆看，与他们及与诸名旦的写得已经沉痛，及看与子玉的信，是","en":"leapt with joy.\\n\\nHe broke the main seal and found over ten letters addressed to various friends—all written in Qinyan's hand. Qinyan explained that he had injured his shoulder and could not write himself, so the contents were mostly words of thanks and greetings. Included was a five-character old-style poem recalling the companions of the Garden of Contentment, along"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":3,"tokens":["玉侬"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"使形骸尚似。居两地、从今伊始。自古多情成积恨，恨东流、不接西流水。肠断矣！写此纸。\\n子云等看了大奇，道：「不料玉侬竟能与庾香那首工力悉敌，一样沉痛。」高品道：「玉侬学问几时长的？我去年没有见他能如此。」次贤道：「这是新进长的，不料受乃翁陶熔了几天，就这些进境。若过两年，不知要好到怎样呢！」南湘道：「我只道庾香这首词是绝唱，不能和的，谁又想和出这一首来，我看倒非玉","en":"broken! Writing this paper.\\"\\n\\nZiyun and the others read this with great astonishment. \\"Who could have expected Yunong to match Yuxiang's piece in both skill and profound sorrow?\\"\\n\\nGao Pin said, \\"When did Yunong's learning advance so much? I did not see him capable of this last year.\\"\\n\\nCixian said, \\"This is fresh growth; to think that after only a few days of his adoptive"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"违；\\n村鸡一鸣，揽衣起坐。伤哉，伤哉！何可言也！勉力加餐，愿期后会，请自宽解，以侍晨昏。\\n夏秋多厉，千万珍重。琴言百拜。\\n子云等看了，叹息一会。子云道：「怎样呢？将庾香请来罢。」次贤道：「不可。这首词他若见了，必有一番伤心痛哭，那时在这里倒教他难为情。不如送去与他，索性使他哭个尽性罢。」子云即着人将琴言并道生的信，送与子玉。","en":"morning and evening. Summer and autumn bring many illnesses; I beg you a thousand times to take care.\\"\\n\\nSigned: \\"Qinyan, bowing a hundred times.\\"\\n\\nZiyun and the others read it and sighed for a long while. Ziyun asked, \\"What should we do? Should we invite Yuxiang over?\\"\\n\\nCixian said, \\"We must not. If he sees this lyric here, it will surely provoke a bout of heartbreaking,"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":15,"tokens":["琴言","玉侬","杜玉侬"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"却说子玉自前日春航处见了诸名旦，单少了琴言一人，又感伤了数日。一夜在睡梦中，忽见云儿走来道：「少爷，琴言回来了。」子玉听了大喜，即问道：「在哪里？」云儿道「就在门外。」子玉忙到大门外一望，只见烟水茫茫，查无涯涘，便失惊道：「这是什么地方？」迷迷离离，心无主意，沿着江堤走去，唯见白浪滔天，帆樯","en":"Since seeing all the famous performers at Chunhang's the other day—with only Qinyan absent—Ziyu had remained steeped in melancholy for days. One night, in the midst of a dream, he suddenly saw Yun'er approach and say, \\"Young Master, Qinyan has returned.\\"\\n\\nZiyu was overjoyed and quickly asked, \\"Where is he?\\"\\n\\n\\"Just outside the gate,\\""},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"郎道：「我也不过怜才爱貌的心，君固男子，岂无能为事耶？」子玉越急。正在无法，只见一个船拢将过来，船窗相对。却见琴言坐在舱里，吟他的《金缕曲》，凄惋欲泣。","en":"his wit's end, another boat drew alongside, their windows facing each other. There, sitting in the cabin, was Qinyan, chanting his *Jinlü Qu* in a tone so mournful and desolate it invited tears."},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":5,"tokens":["玉侬","琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉叫道：「玉侬救我！」那女郎发起怒来，将他一推，狠狠的骂了一句，道：「世间有此措大，令人气忿欲死！」子玉见两船相并，便从船舱里跨了过去。一见琴言，喜不可言，但仔细看他，果然是泪眼将枯，面黄于蜡，见了子玉，惟有掩面悲啼，子玉便觉心如刀割。琴言说道：「谁叫你老远的来，","en":"Ziyu cried out, \\"Yunong, save me!\\"\\n\\nThe strange woman flew into a rage, shoved him violently, and cursed him viciously: \\"That there is such a miserable pedant in the world—it makes one angry enough to die!\\"\\n\\nSeeing the two boats side by side, Ziyu stepped across from the cabin."},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"明日，子云处送了琴言的和词来，子玉看了，一恸欲绝。过了半天，将这信与这词足足念了有百余遍，又喜琴言学问大进，竟成了名作，便缝了一个古锦囊，置了此词，佩在身上。不知后事如何，且听下回分解。","en":"The next day, Ziyun's household sent over Qinyan's response lyric. Upon reading it, Ziyu was so overcome with grief he nearly fainted. Over the course of the morning, he read the letter and the lyric fully a hundred times over. Yet amidst his sorrow, he was also overjoyed to see that Qinyan's learning"}],"54":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说子玉得了琴言和词之后，悲楚了好几日。又想起那个梦，见琴言十分憔悴，不知是何吉凶，只是郁闷不解，终日精神涣散，涕泪沾巾。","en":"After receiving Qinyan's answering lyric, Ziyu remained in sorrow for days. He also kept recalling that dream in which Qinyan looked haggard, and he could not tell whether it boded good or ill. Depressed and unsettled, he drifted through his days listless, with tears constantly"},{"paragraph":37,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"夫这样才学，终要高发的，不过迟早些罢了。」又想：「自己的郎君才得十九岁，已能如此，真是难得。但听得从前有个什么琴言，害他病过几场，如今不知这琴言又怎样了。」却说王文辉定了九月十九日吉期，颜夫人写了家信，说子玉已中宏词，又即完姻，一切交与仲清办理。","en":"\\"My own husband is only nineteen and already come to this — it is rare indeed. But I have heard there was some Qinyan who made him ill more than once. What has become of this Qinyan now?\\"\\n\\nWang Wenhui fixed the nineteenth of the ninth month for the wedding, and Lady Yan wrote home to say that Ziyu had passed the Broad Learning examination and was to be married at once,"},{"paragraph":38,"mentions":4,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"天。洞房花烛之夜，子玉一见，颇觉心花开放。说也奇怪，倒不是做书人说谎，也是前定姻缘，皇天可怜子玉这一片苦心，因琴言是个男子，虽与子玉有些情分，究竟不能配偶，故将此模样，又生个琼华小姐出来，与琴言上妆时一样，岂不是个奇事？此事颜夫人久知，当日见了琴言即说像他媳妇。这么看起来，就是两家的像貌也是五百年前就定下的了。一见之后，又未免有些感触起来，忽又暗暗的解释，遂成就","en":"insists this was no fabrication: perhaps heaven, pitying Ziyu's long suffering, had fixed this fate in advance. Qinyan, being male, could never truly become spouse despite deep attachment; thus heaven had made Qionghua with the same styled beauty as Qinyan in stage makeup. Lady Yan had recognized this long before and once said so on first seeing Qinyan. Seen this way,"},{"paragraph":39,"mentions":3,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"笔迹，一首《金缕曲》，反复吟哦，甚觉悲楚，知是送别词。再看那一张，也是《金缕曲》，想是那人和的。又看了信笺写着琴言的名字，不觉心中甚喜，想道：「我几次问他那琴言，他总不肯告诉我实话，倒取笑我，说我与他生得一样，如今教我拿着了凭据，看他回来怎样抵赖。原来他们有这样深情，彼此魂梦相唤，又说肠已断了几回，这个情倒是人间少有的。」又想：「我在家时，常听得哥哥与姐夫议论这","en":"a *Jinlü Qu* and clearly a painful parting lyric. The other, also *Jinlü Qu*, looked like a response. She saw Qinyan's name on the paper and felt a start go through her. She had asked several times about this Qinyan, and Ziyu had always put her off with a joke and said only that the two of them were somewhat alike; and now here was the proof of it. Their depth of feeling—calling"},{"paragraph":40,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"颇为可笑。子玉忍不住把锦囊取了下来，捏了一捏，空空的，心甚着忙，知道琼华取了去了。别样倒还可以辩，惟有那信上有琴言的名字，如何辩得来？欲要问时，又不好径问，只时时偷望琼华一眼。琼华忍不住笑了一笑，子玉借此进言，便问：「为何好笑？」琼华道：「我笑么，我其实也不要笑，偏无故的笑起来。」子玉也笑道：「那里有既不愿笑，而偏要笑的，正是：人世难逢开口笑。」琼华又笑道：「人","en":"was much alarmed, and knew Qionghua had taken what was in it. Anything else he might have explained away; but Qinyan's name was on the letter, and how was that to be explained? He wanted to ask and could not ask outright, and only kept stealing looks at her.\\n\\nQionghua could not help smiling, and Ziyu took his opening. \\"What is there to laugh at?\\" Qionghua said, \\"Am"},{"paragraph":41,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琴言"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"预先要问定了。」琼华道：「且看我们姐姐、嫂嫂怎样，他们若都去，我也去，如有不去的，我也就不去了。」子玉恐他再问琴言的事，尽找些闲话与他谈。琼华明知子玉心事，也不忍再问，教他难为情了。正是：鱼水深情，凤凰良匹；曾经沧海难为水，愿作鸳鸯不羡仙。下卷要详叙琴言在路景况，且俟细细分解。","en":"see what her sisters and sisters-in-law did; if they went, she'd go, otherwise not. Fearing she would ask about Qinyan again, Ziyu kept finding idle talk. Qionghua, knowing his heart, could not bear to press him and make him suffer. Truly: deep as fish and water, a perfect phoenix pair; having seen the great sea, other waters pale; willing to be mandarin ducks, not envying"}],"55":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":3,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说琴仙出京之后，一路相思，涕零不已。十八站旱路到了王家营，渡了黄河，在清江浦南河赁店住了。写了江船，做了旗子，制了衔牌，耽搁了三日。道翁于漕河两院都是相好，一概不惊动了，没有往拜。道翁有个长随叫刘喜，为人老实忠厚，四十多岁，跟随了五六年，跟过江宁侯石翁太史","en":"After departing from the capital, Qinxian was consumed by ceaseless longing, his tears falling like rain along the way. Traveling through eighteen overland relay stations, they finally reached Wangjiaying, crossed the rolling Yellow River, and took up lodgings at a riverside inn in Qingjiangpu."},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"是日一早想着平山堂，要带琴仙去逛逛，便在船上吃早饭，叫刘喜去雇了一个小船，从小南门沿河绕西门而去。此日幸喜凉爽，天阴阴的没有太阳。琴仙看那一湾绿水，萍叶参差，两岸习习清风，吹得罗衫滉漾，甚是有趣。行了数里，见一个花园，围墙半倒，楼屋全欹，古木鸦啼，繁阴蝉噪，正是：","en":"Early that morning, Daoweng thought of Pingshan Hall and decided to take Qinxian there for a leisurely stroll. After taking their breakfast aboard the ship, he had Liu Xi hire a small skiff, which carried them from the Little South Gate along the winding river toward the west. Fortunately, the day was refreshingly cool, the sky veiled"},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"与诸名士虹桥修禊，眼见琳宫梵宇，瑶草琪花，此刻成了这个模样，令人可感。前面还有个大虹园，也差不多，略还好些。」琴仙道：「若论这个园，当年只怕也与怡园彷佛。」道翁道：「那本来不及怡园，若能两园相并，再连到平山堂，就比得上怡园了。」过了一会，又见满地的灵石，尚有堆得好好的几座，其余坍的坍，倒的倒，滚满一地。又见几处楼阁，有倒了一角的，有只剩几根柱子竖着的，看了好不凄","en":"to sigh. Further ahead lies the Greater Rainbow Garden, which is much the same, perhaps only slightly better.\\" Qinxian said, \\"If we speak of this garden's former glory, I imagine it must have been comparable to the Garden of Contentment.\\" Daoweng replied, \\"Originally, it could not match the Garden of Contentment. But if these two gardens were combined and connected to"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":10,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"忽见前面有两个游船来，琴仙举眼望时，只见有两个人光了脊梁，都是皤皤大腹。那一个船坐着两个妇人，浓妆艳饰，粉黛霪霪。琴仙忽见他义父低着头看水，把扇子遮了脸，不知何意。琴仙又见那两个妇人都眼澄澄望着他，一个还对他笑盈盈的。两船紧挨他的船身过去，两个妇人越看得认真，倒像要与他说话一","en":"Suddenly, they saw two pleasure boats approaching from ahead. When Qinxian looked up, he spotted two bare-backed men with large, protruding bellies. On one of the boats sat two women, thickly powdered and elaborately dressed in gaudy colors. To his surprise, Qinxian noticed his foster father quickly lower his head to look at"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":4,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"拱一拱手，道：「才到。现等过关，今日晚上就要开船。」那和尚道：「那里有这样要紧，自然盘桓几天。」便骨碌碌两眼在琴仙面上转了几转，看琴仙穿着件白罗衫子，脚下一双小皂靴，便知道是他的少爷。便也两手和南，琴仙也还了一揖。和尚连忙让坐，问了道翁去向，即叫人拿出茶来，笑嘻嘻的对着琴仙道：「少爷是头一回来，不晓得我们这里有个第二泉，请尝尝这个第二泉。」又吩咐人，快将泉水泡那","en":"protested, \\"Why the rush? You must naturally linger for a few days.\\" His eyes rolled slickly as they darted over Qinxian's face several times. Seeing Qinxian dressed in a white gauze robe with small black boots, he guessed this was Daoweng's young master. The monk brought his hands together in a respectful greeting, and Qinxian returned the bow. The monk hastily offered"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":5,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"道翁笑道：「这些商家就多花几个钱，也不要紧。」和尚对琴仙道：「少爷，那边还有个花园，请去逛逛罢。」琴仙也想逛园，不敢说，看着道翁。道翁道：「也好，索性逛一逛。」和尚叫人开了门，引进了园。可惜是夏天，虽然今日没有太阳，也是热烘烘的，有那树木丛杂，翳障了不透风。各处逛了一逛，和尚又指那口井，说就是第二泉。平山","en":"Daoweng laughed and said, \\"It doesn't matter if those merchants spend a few extra coins.\\" The monk then turned to Qinxian, \\"Young master, there is another garden over there. Please, go and take a stroll.\\" Qinxian wanted to explore the garden but did not dare to say so, looking instead at Daoweng. Daoweng agreed, \\"Very well, we might as well take a look.\\" The monk had the"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":3,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"那和尚尚要挽留，道翁决意要走。琴仙见那开园门的几个人，问他刘喜要钱，刘喜给了一百大钱，尚还嫌少。和尚喝退了，直送出山门。道翁与琴仙下了船，仍坐船而回。只见往来游船甚多，一去一来，也有大半天。回来船已过关，等道翁、琴仙上了大船，即打了三回锣，抽了跳，开起船，趁着微风，到了瓜州，又要过关","en":"The monk still tried to urge them to stay, but Daoweng was resolved to leave. At the garden gate, Qinxian saw the gatekeepers asking Liu Xi for money. Liu Xi gave them one hundred large cash, but they still complained it was too little. The monk shouted them down and escorted the guests straight out of the mountain gate. Daoweng and Qinxian boarded their"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"道翁忆着侯石翁，要在此与他盘桓几日。一早带了琴仙并刘喜，雇了个凉篷子，由护城河摇到了旱西门，进城雇了肩舆，到凤凰山来访侯石翁。这个侯石翁，是个陆地神仙，今年已七十四岁。二十岁点了翰林，到如今已成了二十三科的老前辈，朝内已没有他的同年。此人从三十余岁就致仕而归，遨游天下三十余年。在凤凰山造了个花园，","en":"thought of Hou Shiweng and decided to linger here for a few days to visit him. Early the next morning, taking Qinxian and Liu Xi along, he hired a shaded skiff. They rowed from the city moat to the Hanxi Gate, entered the city, hired sedan chairs, and proceeded to Phoenix Mountain to call upon Hou Shiweng. This Hou Shiweng was a veritable immortal of the mortal realm,"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":7,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"道翁与琴仙到了园，叫刘喜先将名帖送进。琴仙见这个园四面尽编槿竹为篱，种些杂树。望着里头，疏疏落落，有几处亭台院宇，甚是清旷，却无围墙。不一会，刘喜同了一人出来，说请就将肩舆抬进。琴仙在轿窗里看时，高高下下，弯弯曲曲，有长松夹道，有修竹成林，有飞瀑如帘，有清泉作","en":"Upon arriving at the garden, Daoweng had Liu Xi send in his calling card first. Qinxian noticed that the garden was enclosed entirely by fences of woven hibiscus and bamboo, interspersed with various trees. Looking inside, he saw scattered pavilions and courtyards, exuding a clear and open atmosphere, entirely devoid of solid enclosing"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"两人又对驳了一会，各自抚掌大笑。石翁即吩咐家人备出饭来，石翁是不饮酒的，拿出来陪道翁。琴仙不肯喝酒，道翁善饮，便一人自酌。石翁道：「我劝你也不必做官了，虽然得了别驾，究也难展骥足。你的相知也尽多，难道舍了这六品前程，竟没有饭吃么？」道翁叹道：「我并非老马恋栈，但也有个难处。你晓得我数十年来非特依然故我，反成了个孑身，还是立锥无地。我若有你","en":"servants to prepare a meal. Though Shiweng did not drink wine himself, he brought some out to accompany Daoweng. Qinxian declined the wine, while Daoweng, a fine drinker, poured for himself. Shiweng said, \\"I advise you, there's no need to pursue officialdom any longer. Though you've obtained the post of Vice-Prefect, it is ultimately too small a stage for your talents."},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"在人口，吾兄岂不自知。特以才华侗傥，厌作绳墨中生计耳。」石翁道：「敬佩良箴，自后必为留心，以赎前咎。」忽然看看琴仙，说道：「琼枝太艳。」又笑道：「无逾我园，无折我树檀。」琴仙听了说他「琼枝太艳」，便有些不悦。道翁望着园中道：「你这园真好清净，正是合着「树深时见鹿，溪午不闻钟」两句。」","en":"excellent admonition. From now on, I will certainly take care to redeem my past faults.\\" Suddenly, looking at Qinxian, he said, \\"This jade branch is far too alluring.\\" He then laughed and quoted, \\"'Climb not over my garden wall, break not my sandalwood trees.'\\" Hearing himself called 'too alluring,' Qinxian felt somewhat displeased. Daoweng looked out at the garden"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":9,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"想，道：「对子虽非是你的好心，但于我颇合。文章具在，也是共见共闻的，千秋位置，自有一定，就用这一副罢。」石翁见琴仙玉笋尖尖的，拿了把扇子，便要他的扇子看，顺便拉他的手看了一看，赞道：「此子有文在手，是有夙慧的。」便将他的手，翻来翻去，迷离老眼，看了两回，又将自己扇子递与琴仙。琴仙见这扇上画甚好，不忍释手的看。石翁将琴仙的扇子看了一看，原来是道翁画的梅妻鹤子图，就","en":"are here for all to see and hear; my place in eternity will naturally be fixed. Let us use this one.\\" Noticing Qinxian's delicate, jade-shoot-like fingers holding a fan, Shiweng asked to see it. Taking the opportunity to examine Qinxian's hand as well, he praised, \\"This boy has literary patterns in his palm; he possesses innate intelligence from a past life.\\" He turned"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴仙出来，取过自己扇子一看，见上面题了一首诗是：","en":"After he left, Qinxian picked up his own fan and saw a poem inscribed upon it:"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"谁咏枝高出手寒，云郎捧研想应难。\\n羡他野外孤飞鹤，日傍瑶林偷眼看。\\n琴仙看了，有些疑心，恍记得有个云郎捧研的故事。细细一想，心上恼起来，欲将这扇子撕了，忽又想：「等义父回来看看，这种人何必与他相好！」便气忿忿的将扇子撂过一边，自己倒在床上发闷。忽又想起京中事来，更加凄楚，除了怡园一班名士之外，每见一个生人，必遭戏侮，甚为","en":"hard...\\nI envy the lone crane flying in the wild,\\nBy jade forests day by day, stealing a glance.\\"\\nReading this, Qinxian grew suspicious, vaguely recalling some anecdote about a 'cloud-youth holding an inkstone.' Thinking carefully, anger surged in his heart, and he wanted to tear the fan to pieces. But then he stopped himself: \\"I will wait for Foster Father to return"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"刘喜送早饭进来，琴仙也不肯吃。刘喜见他烦闷，便撺掇他去游玩，说道：「大爷坐在船上也闷得慌，不如进城逛逛。最好逛的是莫愁湖、秦淮河、报恩寺、雨花台、鸡鸣埭、玄武湖、燕子矶。小的同大爷进城散散闷，老爷总要晚上才回。」","en":"When Liu Xi brought breakfast in, Qinxian refused to eat. Seeing him so depressed, Liu Xi urged him to go sightseeing, saying, \\"Sitting on the boat is stifling for you, Young Master. It would be better to go into the city for a stroll. The best places to visit are Mochou Lake, the Qinhuai River,"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":5,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴仙道：「我不高兴。怪热的天气，也不能走路。」刘喜道：「若别处还要走几步，若到莫愁湖、秦淮河、燕子矶，一直水路，坐了船去，不用走的。燕子矶我们前日走风，没有靠船，可惜明日就过了，开船再逛罢。今日去逛逛秦淮河，两边珠围翠绕，好不有趣呢。」琴仙道：「莫愁湖此","en":"Qinxian replied, \\"I have no spirit for it. The weather is frightfully hot, and I cannot bear to walk.\\" Liu Xi said, \\"For other places you might have to walk a bit, but for Mochou Lake, the Qinhuai River, and Swallow Bluff, it is entirely by water. We can go"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":7,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴仙见是昨日所过的那条河，也有十余里，才到了莫愁湖。刘喜道：「我们且先逛逛，再去寻坟。」便引琴仙进了观音庵。到了里面，见两进重门，四面皆通，铺设精雅，满壁图书，尽是名人题咏，内中见有侯石翁的诗文，又见有江西学使梅士燮一副对子。琴仙见往来游玩的，也有士人，","en":"Qinxian saw they were traveling along the same river as yesterday, and after about ten li, they arrived at Mochou Lake. Liu Xi suggested, \\"Let's tour around first, then go looking for the grave.\\" He led Qinxian into the Guanyin Convent. Inside, they passed through"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":4,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"只见摇船的提了酒盒上前，刘喜问道：「这个坟地在什么地方呢？」琴仙道：「我如何知道，要去找呢！」刘喜道：「是那一家的？问了姓名方可去找。」琴仙一想，乩上并未判出姓名，便呆呆的想了一会，便说道：「我也不晓得姓什么。」刘喜笑道：「怎么亲戚的姓都忘了？那只好罢了，从何处找起？」琴仙道：「实不瞒你说，我从前请仙，乩上判出来","en":"Seeing the boatman come forward carrying the wine box, Liu Xi asked, \\"Where exactly is this grave located?\\" Qinxian replied, \\"How should I know? We have to look for it!\\" Liu Xi asked, \\"Which family does it belong to? We need a surname to even begin searching.\\" Qinxian thought for a moment, realizing the planchette had never revealed a surname. He sat in stunned silence"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴仙走到湖边，只见一湖的荷花，红的似杨玉环初酣御酒，白的似赵昭仪新浴兰汤。中间有些采莲船，也有几个小女郎在船里，还有些小孩子光着身在湖里嬉水。琴仙暗暗的默祷道：「上仙，上仙！承你指示了我的前身，又没有判出姓来，叫我身亲其地，无从寻觅，殊为恨事。怎样显个灵","en":"Qinxian walked to the edge of the lake and saw a vast expanse of lotus flowers. The red ones looked like Yang Guifei slightly flushed from imperial wine, while the white ones resembled Zhao Feiyan freshly emerged from a scented bath. Among them drifted a few"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":5,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴仙一面祷告间，望四面空地虽多，并无坟墓。忽见莲花丛中荡出个小艇来，有一穿红衣垂髫女郎，年可十四五，长眉秀颊，皓齿明眸，妙容都丽，荡将过来。琴仙谛视，以为天仙游戏，尘寰中安得有此丽姝？自觉形神俱俗，肃然而立。见那女郎船上放了几朵荷花，船头上集着一群翠雀，","en":"As Qinxian prayed, he looked around at the vast open spaces on all sides but saw no graves. Suddenly, a small skiff drifted out from the thickets of lotus. On it stood a young girl in red with her hair hanging down in twin tufts, about fourteen or fifteen years"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":4,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴仙听了有个杜仙女墓，触动了心事，即问道：「这个杜仙女是几时人？」那女郎道：「我却不知，只听说有七八十年，也是个官家的女儿，死了葬在这里的。」琴仙问道：「何以要称他仙女呢？」那女郎道：「他看这个地方也数得清的人家，如何有那样华妍妙丽的女郎？见他常常的荡个","en":"Hearing of Du the Fairy's tomb, Qinxian's heart was deeply stirred, and he immediately asked, \\"From what era was this Du the Fairy?\\" The girl answered, \\"That I don't know. I've only heard she lived seventy or eighty years ago. She was the daughter of an official family and was buried here"},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":7,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"女郎问琴仙道：「你是那里人？」琴仙道：「我本苏州人，如今从京里来。」女郎又问道：「如今要到那里去？」琴仙道：「到江西去。」女郎问一句，琴仙答一句，已到了湖岸。女郎道：「我领你去罢。」琴仙道：「很好。」女郎拿了一张荷叶、一朵荷花，领了琴仙，穿过树林。那城墙是因山","en":"The girl asked Qinxian, \\"Where are you from?\\" Qinxian replied, \\"I am originally from Suzhou, but I am now coming from the capital.\\" She asked again, \\"Where are you going now?\\" Qinxian answered, \\"To Jiangxi.\\" As she asked and he answered, they reached the shore of the lake."},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":11,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"道：「我来帮你。」于是将荷花剥下一瓣，放在坟前，满满斟了一花瓣酒，将那些果子放在荷叶里，叫刘喜将那盒子拿开，问琴仙道：「你为什么不拜两拜？」琴仙道：「我即是他，他即是我。」那女郎笑道：「这是怎么讲，好呆话。既有了你，就没有他；\\n既还有他，就没有你。」琴仙听这话有些灵机，便看着女郎，女郎也看着琴仙。琴仙道：「你不知道我，只知道他。」女郎道：「我倒没见着他，倒见着你","en":"the brim with wine, and arranged the fruits on her lotus leaf. She told Liu Xi to take the box away, then asked Qinxian, \\"Why aren't you bowing?\\" Qinxian replied, \\"I am her, and she is me.\\" The girl laughed, \\"What do you mean by that? Such silly talk. If there is you, there is no her; if she still exists, there is no you.\\" Hearing a spark of spiritual truth in her words,"},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴仙留心望他，只见花光湖水，一片迷离，望不清楚，不知那女郎去处，只得惆怅回船。","en":"Qinxian watched her intently, but amidst the shimmering light of the flowers and the haze of the lake water, everything blurred together. Unable to see clearly where she had gone, he returned to the boat, his heart heavy with melancholy."},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":4,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"的，或两三人倚肩的，或轻摇歌扇，露出那纤纤玉手的，或哝哝唧唧的轻启朱唇讲话的。有妍有妙，不是一样。那些妓女见了琴仙这个美貌，便唤姐姐、呼妹妹的，大家出来俯着首看他，又把琴仙看得好不害羞，只得埋怨刘喜不该来。急要倒转船身回去，那两头又来些游船，有些妓女们陪着些客，挤将拢来，个个挤眉擦眼的看他，琴仙真成了个看杀卫玠。好容易把船挤了过去，听得前面窗子一响，又有一个老妓","en":"whispering softly through parted red lips. They varied in beauty and charm, each distinct from the last. Seeing Qinxian's striking beauty, the courtesans began calling out 'sister' and 'brother,' leaning out to gaze down at him. Their stares made Qinxian so intensely embarrassed that he could only complain that Liu Xi shouldn't have brought him. Just as he urgently demanded"},{"paragraph":30,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"两个家人慌慌张张的道：「大爷怎么此刻才回？了不得了，老爷在山上跌了一交，晕了过去，救转来，现在还哼声不止呢。」琴仙听了，唬得一身冷汗，连忙进舱来。不知屈道翁性命如何，且听下回分解。","en":"took a fall on the mountain and fainted. Though we revived him, he hasn't stopped groaning since!\\" Hearing this, Qinxian broke into a cold sweat and rushed into the cabin. To know whether Qu Daoweng's life was saved, you must listen to the next chapter's explanation."}],"56":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":3,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说琴仙上船，闻道翁跌坏，连忙进舱看视，道翁道：「此刻略清爽些，就是半个身子动不来，想也就好的。我已服了好些药，你今日到何处去？」琴仙便说去逛莫愁湖，有个杜仙女墓，与仙乩上说的相对。道翁也觉诧异，道：「果然有这个坟，有碑记没有呢？」琴仙道：「没有碑记。」也将","en":"When Qinxian came aboard and heard that Daoweng had fallen and injured himself, he hurried into the cabin to check on him. Daoweng murmured: \\"I feel a little clearer now. Though half my body refuses to move, I imagine it will mend in time. I have already taken a"},{"paragraph":2,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴仙又将石翁所赠的诗，与道翁看了。道翁不觉动气，因说道：「此老游戏散漫，习与性成，老来还是这样。我就素鄙其人，不过爱其才耳。将这扇子撕了罢。」琴仙即将扇子撕得粉碎，一夜无话。","en":"Qinxian then showed Daoweng the poem Old Shiweng had gifted him. Daoweng's temper flared as he read it, and he scoffed: \\"That old man treats life as a trifling game and scatters his mind to the wind. His habits have calcified into his very nature, and even in"},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":4,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，忽然起了大顶风，走了锚，白浪滔天，把船倒打上去，一直打到了燕子矶，方才收住，连忙抛锚打橛，加缆守风。道翁叫过琴仙来，吩咐道：「京中诸好友也应写封信去道谢道谢，我膀子疼，你替我写，我念给你。写行书就是了，不必尽要楷书。」一面靠在靠枕上，一面念给琴仙，大同小异写了十几封，又写了好些诗，足足写了大半天。傍晚风小了些，道翁知他写乏了，便叫刘喜同他上岸去散散。刘喜同了琴","en":"anchor, drive mooring stakes deep into the bank, and double the cables against the howling wind. Daoweng called Qinxian to his side and instructed: \\"You ought to write letters of thanks to my friends in the capital. My arm aches terribly, so you shall write while I dictate. A flowing running script will suffice; it need not all be perfectly regular.\\" Leaning heavily against"},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":6,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"了心，连话也说不出来。兼之老年人了，大小便也不甚便，这些下人如何肯来服事？就只刘喜一人又兼买办，料理饮食，是以琴仙彻夜无眠，在中舱伺侯。偏遇了日日顶风，江中船来来往往，坏了多少。道翁自想：「此病未必能好，就好了，也是半身不遂之症。虽道路不多，但这个瘫痪人，到省去怎样见得上司？不如在此医好了，再去也不迟。」主意定了，叫人进城去租公馆，遂租了旱西门内一个护国寺养病，","en":"common servants deign to wait upon such a burden? Only Liu Xi faithfully cooked and saw to their meals, leaving Qinxian to go without sleep night after night, standing vigil in the mid-cabin. On top of this misery came day after day of relentless headwinds; boats traveling up and down the river were wrecked in endless succession. Daoweng reflected bitterly: \\"This illness"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":7,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"枯，素有李长吉呕血之病，近来好了几年，此时重又大发，一日呕吐数次，神昏色丧，卧床不起。过了二十余日，更加沉重。琴仙见此光景，心如油沸，日夜在神前焚香祷告，愿以身代。道翁自知不免，见琴仙如此孝心，更增伤感：「设或中道弃捐，教他如何归着，依靠谁人？」想到此，泪流不已。正在悲伤之际，琴仙捧了药碗进来，见了道翁，不敢仰视，惟泪盈盈的站在一边。道翁叫他上来，琴仙放下药碗，","en":"bed. After more than twenty days of this torment, his condition grew even graver. Seeing this tragic decline, Qinxian felt his own heart boiling like hot oil in his chest. Day and night he burned fragrant incense before the gods, desperately praying to take his foster father's place in death. Daoweng knew the end was inevitably near, and witnessing Qinxian's pure devotion"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴仙听了，肝肠寸断，双膝跪在床前，泪流满面，惟双手捧着药碗。道翁勉强吃了一口，咳嗽一声，又吐出许多血来。","en":"Hearing this final, bleak command, Qinxian felt his liver and bowels tear with grief. He fell to his knees by the bed in a flood of desperate tears, his trembling hands still gripping the porcelain medicine bowl. Daoweng forced down a single mouthful, but immediately broke into a violent cough,"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":3,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"时日将暮，琴仙方寸已乱，不知怎样，只听柏树上那几个老鸦，呀呀呀的叫个不住。又有一枭鸟在破楼上，鼓吻弄舌，叫得琴仙毛发森竖。时已新秋，天气昼热夜凉，琴仙身上发冷，到自己房里去穿衣。走到中堂，一灯如豆，那盏小琉璃，也是昏昏欲灭。窗外新月模糊，见树边有个人影一闪，即不见","en":"Evening was rapidly closing in, and Qinxian's mind descended into absolute chaos. From the ancient cypress outside, old crows cawed endlessly, while up on a ruined upper story, an owl relentlessly worked its beak and tongue until the eerie sound made Qinxian's hair stand on end. It was early autumn—still"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":3,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴仙唬得打颤，连忙叫人，刘喜偏有事去了，那三个不见个影儿，也不知在那里。琴仙战兢兢的走到房中，不防床前一个大乌黑的东西冲将出来，把琴仙一撞，「哎呀」一声，栽倒在地。","en":"Qinxian shook violently with fright and cried out for help. Liu Xi happened to be away on errands, and the other three servants were nowhere to be seen. Terrified, Qinxian crept slowly back toward his room. Without warning, a large, black mass shot out and slammed"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":4,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"那东西一溜烟走了，唬得琴仙浑身发抖。停了好一回，爬起来，灯又灭了。再到外头来点了灯，重到房来，见地下有个小木盖子，将灯一照，床前一个大碗翻在那里。原来刘喜见琴仙天天不能吃饭，今日将莲子薏苡蒸了一只一百天的大肥笋鸭子与琴仙，也只吃了几块。刘喜又怕那几个同伴要偷吃，便将盖子盖了，","en":"The dark thing whisked away into the night, leaving Qinxian trembling from head to toe. After a long, paralyzed moment, he finally forced himself up. The fragile lamp had gone out in the commotion. He crept out to relight it and returned to his room, where he discovered a small wooden lid discarded on the floor."},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":7,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴仙穿了个半臂，坐了一会，听得后头有响声，便又叫声张贵，不听得答应。琴仙又不敢去看，刘喜是请大夫没有回来，又问了一声：「是谁？」也没有答应。再听得一声很响，像似棺材暴起来，又像鬼叫了几声，琴仙好不害怕。想到佛前去求告，却又心惊肉跳的不敢前去。要不去，心又","en":"Qinxian pulled on a short, half-sleeve vest and sat in the gloom for a while. Hearing a strange noise behind him, he called out nervously for Zhang Gui, but received no answer. He dared not go look for the source. Liu Xi was still out fetching the doctor. He"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"却好刘喜回来了，进来见了，拿扇子打下来，一脚踏死。琴仙已唬得满身寒毛直竖，眼泪汪汪，且遍体发烧，眼睛冒火。","en":"returned to the room. Seeing the creature, he swiftly knocked it to the floor with a fan and crushed it underfoot. Qinxian was left paralyzed with fright. Every hair on his body stood on end, tears streamed endlessly down his face, and his entire body burned with a feverish heat as his eyes felt as though they were on fire."},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":4,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"刘喜与他放了蚊帐，看他床下只有一个空碗，便问道：「那鸭子呢？」琴仙道：「我不在房，一个大黑狗进来吃了。」刘喜骂了一声：「那里来这个害瘟疫的狗？我还不敢放在厨房里，恐伙计们嘴馋，来撕了几块去，倒请了这只狗了。」琴仙道：「你为何去了这半天才回？」刘喜道：「那王大夫今日到仪征县去了，要耽搁三四天才回。我只得去请了李大夫，","en":"comfort him. Noticing only an empty bowl discarded beneath the frame, he asked in confusion: \\"Where is the duck?\\" Qinxian sniffled and replied: \\"I was out of the room. A massive black dog sneaked in and ate the whole thing.\\" Liu Xi swore in frustration: \\"Where on earth did this plague of a dog come from? I didn't dare leave it in the kitchen for fear those greedy fellows"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":3,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴仙又到道翁的房来，只听得刘喜嚷道：「不好了，这些箱子到那里去了？」琴仙听了，慌忙出来，走到后面厢房里看时，就剩了几个书画箱，其余搬运一空。见张贵、汪升、钱德的李行都没有了，此刻还不回来？这门开着，岂没有人进来的，如何是好呢？况且盘费银子也都在箱内。老爷","en":"Qinxian went again toward Daoweng's room and heard Liu Xi shout: \\"Disaster—where are those trunks?\\" Qinxian hurried out. In the rear wing only a few chests of paintings and books remained; everything else was gone. Zhang Gui, Wang Sheng, and Qian De's luggage"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴仙与刘喜等到天明，绝无影响，方知三人偷了东西走了。琴仙却不是心疼东西，见道翁如此模样，设有不测，则殡殓之费皆无，如何是好？便哭了半日，只剩下一个刘喜，又不能分身寻觅。","en":"Qinxian and Liu Xi waited anxiously until the cold light of dawn, yet there was not a single trace of the missing servants. They finally realized the bitter truth: the three men had stolen their goods and fled into the night. Qinxian did not mourn the goods;"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":10,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"忽听得道翁叫人，琴仙急忙过去，见他歪转过身，当他要解手，问了他，摇摇头，心上要坐起来。琴仙叫刘喜来帮着扶起，把两个大靠枕靠了背。道翁道：「你们去找我那些诗文集来。」琴仙忙去开了箱，一部一部的搬过来。道翁问了书名，又过了目，叫留下一本近作诗稿子，一本书画册，其余都叫烧了。","en":"Suddenly they heard Daoweng call. Qinxian ran over. The old man had turned on his side—Qinxian thought he needed the pot; asked; he shook his head; he wanted to sit up. Qinxian called Liu Xi to help raise him and propped his back with two large bolsters. Daoweng said: \\"Fetch my poetry and prose"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":3,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"道翁执着笔，颤巍巍的，一大一小，写了一篇放下，又喘了一回，眼中掉下泪来，叫一声：「琴儿，我有句话吩咐你。」琴仙含泪听训。道翁道：「你虽幼年失路，但看你立志不凡，我不须多嘱，你回京后自然旧业是不理的了，徐度香处尽可寄身。」琴仙听到此，便哭起来，不能答应。道翁又道：「这个遗言你收好了，将来到京之后与度香，他必有个道理。」琴仙接了过来，看是：","en":"on a sheet—then stopped and panted. Tears fell from his eyes. He called: \\"Qin'er—I have something to tell you.\\" Qinxian listened through tears. Daoweng said: \\"Though you lost your way while young, your resolve is uncommon; I need not say much. After you return to Beijing you will not go back to your old trade—you may lodge with Xu Duxiang.\\" At that Qinxian wept and could"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":5,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"残魂不馁，当为报德之蛇；稚子有知，亦作感恩之雀。肝胆素照，神魂可通，不尽之言，伏惟矜察。七月七日屈本立绝笔。\\n琴仙看了。不觉恸倒在地，刘喜也哭了，道翁命刘喜扶起琴仙，琴仙独自倚床而哭，道翁道：「不必哭了，我累了你。殡殓之后，即埋我于江岸，也不必等过百日，你速速进京罢。你将我的文凭送到石翁处，托他在制台前缴了，要他与我做篇传。人虽不足传，但我一生之困苦艰难也就少有","en":"cicada's shell; my soul chokes in the tide. Where shall a handful of earth lie—who will shelter this six-foot orphan? Qinxian has long been in my favor; I bid him come and rely on me. Ah—Duxiang knows me; he will comfort me in the grave. If my lingering soul does not fade, may it be the snake that repays a kindness; if the boy has sense, let him be the sparrow that remembers"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":7,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一世牢骚到白头，文章误我不封侯。\\n江山故国空文藻，重过南朝感旧游。\\n题罢，掷笔而逝。琴仙一见，又昏晕倒了，慌得刘喜神魂失措，一面哭，一面拍醒琴仙。琴仙跪在床前，抱了道翁双足，哭得昏而醒，醒而昏，足足哭了半天。刘喜连连解劝道：「大爷，事已如此，人死不能复生，料理后事要紧。这么个热天，也不宜耽搁。」琴仙那里肯听，又哭了好一会，直到泪枯声尽，","en":"writing the final character, he cast the brush aside and peacefully breathed his last. At the horrifying sight, Qinxian fainted dead away once again. Liu Xi panicked, weeping openly as he gently slapped Qinxian's face to wake him. Qinxian knelt by the bed, desperately clasping Daoweng's cold feet, and wept until he swooned, woke, and swooned again, trapped in his grief"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":4,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴仙道：「这些事我都不知道，尽要仗你费点心的了。」刘喜道：「这个不消吩咐。」于是先将道翁扶下，易箦之后，点了香烛，焚了纸钱，昨日请的李大夫方来，闻得死了，即忙回转。刘喜出去料理，一个人又没有帮手。棺材买不到，只得向和尚买了那一口停放在后楼的，就去了二十二","en":"Qinxian shook his head helplessly: \\"I know absolutely nothing of these practical things. I must rely entirely on you.\\" Liu Xi squeezed his shoulder: \\"There is no need to even say it.\\" They first laid Daoweng's body down reverently; after the bedding was changed,"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":5,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"那日晚上，酸风动魄，微雨打窗，琴仙反复不寐，百感交并起来。在房里走了几步，脚下又虚飘飘的。听得刘喜鼻息如雷，琴仙走去看时，见枕头推在一边，仰着面，开着口，鼻孔朝天，鼾声大振，一手摸着心坎。又见一个耗子，在他铺上走去，闻他的鼻子。琴仙恐怕咬他，喝了一声，耗子跳了过去，琴仙也转身回铺。听","en":"That night, a biting, mournful wind stirred the soul, and fine rain tapped insistently against the paper window. Qinxian could not find sleep, a hundred conflicting feelings crowding into his exhausted mind. He stood and walked a few steps across the room; his feet felt as light and insubstantial as air. Hearing Liu Xi's snores rumbling like thunder, he went over to check"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":4,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴仙不解其故，倒唬得呆了。停了一会，不见响动，才大着胆走上前，见刘喜抱着树，又在那里打鼾。琴仙见他尚是睡着，便叫了几声，推了几推，刘喜方醒过来，问道：「做什么？」琴仙道：「你是什么缘故？睡梦中跑出来，抱住了树。」刘喜方揉揉眼，停了一停，道：「原来是梦。我","en":"Qinxian did not understand this bizarre behavior and stood frozen with fear. After a tense while, hearing no further commotion, he cautiously ventured closer. Liu Xi was still fiercely hugging the tree, snoring away once again. Realizing the man was merely sleepwalking,"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":4,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴仙也只得睡下，恍恍惚惚的，一会觉自己走出寺来，见对面有个书铺，招牌写着华正昌三字，有个老年掌柜的照应了他。琴仙即进铺内，忽听锣声锽锽，又接着作乐之声。回头看时，见一对对的旌旗幡盖，仪从纷纭，还有那金盔金甲，执刀列道，香烟成字，宝盖蟠云，玉女金童，华妆妙","en":"Qinxian had no choice but to lie down as well. In a hazy daze, he dreamed that he walked out of the temple and saw a bookshop situated directly opposite; the wooden sign read \\"Hua Zhengchang,\\" and an elderly shopkeeper warmly greeted him. Qinxian entered the"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":3,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴仙看他一直出了庙门，心上想道：「这不知是什么地方？那个童子好不兀傲，到了此处，还是那样凛凛的神色，怎么跪也不跪的，想是个有根气的人，来历不小。」琴仙将要出去，只见一个戴金幞头穿红袍的神人进来，仔细一看，就是他义父屈道翁。琴仙吃了一惊，心上却不当他是死的","en":"Qinxian watched him all the way until he passed out of the temple gate, thinking to himself: \\"What manner of place is this? That boy is unbearably proud. Even here, before a goddess, he refuses to kneel, standing as cold and unyielding as ice. He must be someone"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":7,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"神问了几句话，便听得一声云板，两边鼓乐起来。尊神退入后殿去了，仪从亦纷纷各散。见他义父独在阶下徘徊，仰瞻殿宇。琴仙此时忽想他已身死，一阵伤心，上前牵住了衣哭起来。见他义父也觉凄然，便安慰他道：「琴儿，你受苦了，也是你命里注定的。不过百日困苦，耐烦等候，自有个好人来带你回去。」琴仙想要问他几件事情，却一件也想不起，就记得方才那个童子，问道：「方才有个童子进来，那尊","en":"retinue scattered. His foster father paced alone beneath the steps, gazing up at the great hall. Only then did Qinxian remember that Daoweng had passed away; grief swept over him, and he seized the old man's robe, weeping bitterly. His foster father looked upon him with sorrow and offered comfort: \\"Qin'er, you have suffered, yet this was ordained by your fate. It will"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":8,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴仙又触起心事，欲要叫他，那船已与他的船相并。琴仙又见他舱里走出一个美人来，艳妆华服，与子玉并坐。琴仙细看，却又大骇，分明就是他扮戏的装束，面貌一毫不错。自己又看看自己，想不出缘故来。见他二人香肩相并，哝哝唧唧，好不情深意密，心上看出气来。忽见那美人拿了","en":"Qinxian's old sorrows stirred, and he meant to call out, but the boats gently collided. A beauty stepped from Ziyu's cabin, arrayed in gorgeous dress, and sat beside him. Qinxian looked closely and started in alarm: she was wearing his exact stage costume, and"},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴仙拾起镜子来一照，见自己变了那莫愁湖里采莲船上的红衣女子，心中大奇。忽又见许多人影，从镜子里过去，就是那一班名士与一班名旦。自己忽将镜子反过来，隐隐的有好些人映在里面，好像是魏聘才、奚十一等类。正看时，那镜子忽转旋起来，光明如月，成了一颗大珠，颇觉有趣","en":"Qinxian picked up the discarded mirror and looked into its surface. To his absolute astonishment, he saw that his reflection had become that of the mysterious girl in red from the lotus boat at Mochou Lake. His heart leaped with profound wonder. Then, many fleeting"},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴仙「哎哟」一声，原来是梦。睁眼看时，已是日高三丈，刘喜早已起身了。","en":"Qinxian cried out \\"Aiyo!\\" and bolted awake. It had all been a vivid dream. When he finally opened his eyes, the morning sun already stood high in the sky, and Liu Xi had been up for quite some time."},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":4,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴仙起来，刘喜伺候洗脸。琴仙呆呆的想那梦，件件都记得逼清，将两头藏过，单将中间的梦与刘喜说了，老爷像成了神，但是位分也不甚大。刘喜道：「只要成了神就是了，想必天上也会升转的。」刘喜一会儿就送上饭来，说要到侯老爷那里去，告诉老爷这件事情，要他将文凭找出来。","en":"Qinxian rose, and Liu Xi waited on him as he washed. Qinxian sat in a stunned daze, turning the dream over in his mind, remembering every detail with striking clarity. He kept the beginning and the end to himself, telling Liu Xi only the middle: that his master"},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"凭到江西去撞骗，也不可不防的。这些事都在我。明日还到寺里吊奠，面见你们少爷，再商量别的事。」刘喜叩谢了回来，对琴仙讲了，琴仙也没有什么感激。明日石翁去见了制台，说知此事，又到上元县与刘喜补了呈子，知县通详了，一面缉拿逃奴，一面行文到江西去了。","en":"will speak with your young master regarding the rest.\\" Liu Xi kowtowed in deep gratitude and returned to inform Qinxian, though the youth felt little thankfulness in his heart. The following day, Lord Hou met with the governor, explained the dire situation, and filed a formal petition at Shangyuan county. The magistrate swiftly forwarded it, issuing warrants for the runaway"},{"paragraph":30,"mentions":6,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"石翁过了一日，备了一桌祭筵，一副联额，亲到寺里来上香奠酒，痛哭了一场，倒哭得老泪盈盈，甚是伤感。琴仙在孝帏里也痛哭，心上想道：「此老倒也有些义气，听他这哭倒也不是假的。」石翁收了泪，叫自己带来的人挂了匾额，看了一看，叹口气，走进孝帏。琴仙忙叩头道谢，石翁蹲下身子，一把挽住，也就盘腿坐下，挨近了琴仙，握了琴仙的手，迷离了老眼。此时石翁如坐香草丛中，觉","en":"libations, weeping loudly until old tears streamed down his face, appearing deeply moved. Inside the mourning curtain, Qinxian wept as well, thinking to himself: \\"This old man possesses some measure of honor. That crying sounds genuine enough.\\" Hou dried his tears, directed his men to hang the plaque, gazed upon it with a heavy sigh, and stepped into the curtain. Qinxian kowtowed"},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":6,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴仙见他这个样子，两只生花老眼看定了他，口中虽说得正大光明，那神色之间，总不像个好人。心上又气又怕，脸已涨红，低了头，又不肯答应。石翁把琴仙的手握在掌中，两手轻轻的搓了几搓，笑迷迷的又问道：「前日扇上那首诗，看了可懂得么？」琴仙心中更气，把手缩进，将要哭","en":"Seeing Lord Hou's flower-bright old eyes fixed intently upon him, Qinxian felt a cold chill. Though the man's words sounded high and fair, his lingering manner was distinctly not that of a good and honorable man. Qinxian was seized by a mixture of anger and fear; his face flushed deeply as he looked down, unwilling to offer"},{"paragraph":33,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"就不放心。而且人要议论我不是，怎么把个至交的遗孤撇在脑后，也不照应，让他独自去了。你想这句话，我如何当得起？」琴仙只当没有听见，洒脱了手，站得远远的。石翁没趣，睁大了三角眼，瞅了他一会，又道：「我是一片好心，你倒不要错了主意。」便起身要走，琴仙只得又叩了两个头，道：「小侄不认得外边，就算谢过孝了。」","en":"of a dear friend, letting him wander off alone into danger. How could I ever bear the weight of such a charge?\\" Qinxian pretended not to hear a single word. He pulled himself entirely free and stood at a far distance. Lord Hou was visibly put out. His triangular eyes widened sharply as he stared at the boy, and then he sighed. \\"I only mean well. Please do not mistake"},{"paragraph":34,"mentions":5,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"石翁要扶他，琴仙已站了起来，离远了，石翁走出窗外，当着琴仙送他，尚可说两句。谁知琴仙竟已入帏。石翁无奈，只得走了回去。想了半日，明日着人送了一担米、一担炭、四两银来，试试琴仙的心受不受，若受了，自然慢慢的还肯到他家里去。谁知琴仙执意不肯受，刘喜也不敢作主，只得原物璧","en":"Lord Hou tried to help him rise, but Qinxian was already on his feet, stubbornly keeping his distance. Lord Hou stepped outside the window to bid a lingering farewell, hoping he might still slip in a final word, but Qinxian had already withdrawn completely behind the mourning curtain. Left with"}],"57":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说前回书讲琴仙在江宁落难，受尽悲苦，这回又要说些京中事了。此时已到了十月初旬，小春天气，晴光和蔼，百卉发荣，怡园又要热闹起来。","en":"The previous chapter recounted how Qinxian fell on hard times in Jiangning, tasting every bitterness. Now our story returns to affairs in the capital. It was already early in the tenth month. The weather felt like a 'little spring' with mild sunshine and gentle light, as a hundred blossoms flourished"}],"59":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"且说琴仙在南京护国寺里守灵，倏忽已经百日。主仆两人虽日用有限，但天天供饭烧纸，连房租银子，一月也须十金。","en":"Meanwhile, Qinxian had kept vigil for Qu Daoweng at the Huguo Temple in Nanjing for a hundred days. Although the master and servant lived frugally, the daily offerings of rice and paper money, along with the room rent, still cost them ten taels of silver a month."},{"paragraph":2,"mentions":4,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"三月以来，将琴仙所剩衣物尽行当卖。当时初冬时节，琴仙尚无棉衣，刘喜更不用说了。一日，刘喜劝道：「大爷，我看你年纪轻轻，也不可过于古板。我想那侯老爷一片真心待你，自己来请你过去，还送钱米来，这也就难得了。你倒不要错看这位老爷，是王侯将相都敬重他的。他的门生好不多呢，现","en":"By the third month of their stay, they had pawned or sold all of Qinxian's remaining clothes. The early winter chill was setting in, yet Qinxian had no padded garments, let alone Liu Xi. One day, Liu Xi offered a gentle word of advice: \\"Young Master, you are still young, and you shouldn't be so rigid. I believe Lord Hou was"},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":4,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"刘喜道：「要便人要天天有的，折差、塘报那一日没有？你写起来，我去寄就是了。」琴仙于是哀哀切切，写了几封信与子玉、子云、蕙芳诸人，要他们专人来接他回去，子云信内并封着屈道翁遗言。写了一天，刘喜托便寄了。后来寺中又做起法事来，男女混杂，游人挤满。琴仙屋里常有人来张张望望的，琴仙好不气闷。刘喜见度日艰难，就算京里有人来接他们，也须两月","en":"reports—when is there a day without one? Just write the letters, and I will go and send them.\\" With a sorrowful heart, Qinxian poured his grief into several letters addressed to Ziyu, Ziyun, Huifang, and the others, pleading with them to send someone specifically to take him back. In the letter to Ziyun, he also enclosed Qu Daoweng's dying testament. After a full day of writing,"},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一日，侯石翁自苏州回来，闻知琴仙还在寺里，已到衣食不周，心上又念着他。因前此送他米炭等物，倒去碰个钉子，虽然怀恨，但爱根未断，只得老了面皮，带了二十金，叫小童拿了，乘轿而来。到了门口，只见刘喜摆着个小摊子，无非乌菱、荸荠、瓜子、花生之类。又见壁上挂几张画，倒是生纸画的花卉，颜色鲜明","en":"One day, Hou Shiweng returned from Suzhou and learned that Qinxian was still staying at the temple, now struggling with inadequate food and clothing. His thoughts immediately turned back to the boy. Although he still harbored some resentment from being rebuffed when he previously sent rice and charcoal, the root of"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴仙见了石翁，心里老大的一跳，只得上前见礼。石翁忘了前情，又握了他的手，说了几句话，坐了。琴仙勉强陪着，面上却是冰冷的。","en":"Qinxian's heart gave a violent lurch at the sight of Shiweng, but he forced himself to step forward and offer a polite greeting. Shiweng, choosing to forget their previous unpleasantness, grasped the boy's hand once more, exchanged a few pleasantries, and sat"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":6,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴仙听了这些话，已气得满脸发烧。再看他的神情，那老面皮里紫光光的透出一团邪气。琴仙心里想要痛骂他一场，方可泄恨，但又因他是个老辈，只得暂时忍住不理他。石翁见他脸上红红的，当他面嫩不好答应，自然心上有些回心了。便叫小童将银子送过来，石翁亲手送与琴仙道：「这","en":"Hearing these words, Qinxian's face burned crimson with outrage. Observing Shiweng's demeanor, he noticed a purplish sheen radiating from the old man's face, exuding an undeniable aura of wickedness. Qinxian desperately wanted to unleash a torrent of curses to vent his anger, but"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"到收摊时进来煮饭，见琴仙尚在房里哭泣，刘喜又劝了他，讲了些懵懂话。琴仙又不能将石翁的歹意告诉他，只好闷在心里，惟有呜咽而已。暂且按下不题。","en":"When the stall closed for the day and Liu Xi came in to cook rice, he found Qinxian still weeping in his room. Liu Xi offered more clumsy words of comfort. Unable to speak of Shiweng's wicked intentions, Qinxian could only bottle up his sorrow, quietly choking on his sobs. We shall leave their plight there for now."},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"令郎英年逸隽，海内人才，共皆钦仰，正是德门世庆。」士燮谦让了一番，即说起方才制台所问道生之子安在。石翁闻他提起琴仙，心上很想说他不好，叫士燮不必理他，忽又天良不昧，失口说了一句：「此子甚佳，现在旱西门内护国寺，离此不远。」士燮又问了些闲话，便告辞回家。","en":"demurrers, then brought up the Governor-General's question regarding the whereabouts of Daosheng's son. Hearing Qinxian's name, Shiweng's initial impulse was to speak ill of him and advise Shixie to pay him no mind. Yet, a sudden flicker of conscience stayed his tongue, and he blurted out, \\"The boy is quite exceptional. He is currently at the Huguo Temple inside the Hanxi"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":7,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，说要亲自过来，又遣人送了道翁一封奠仪，自己备了祭桌，到护国寺来。刘喜手忙脚乱，请个小和尚看了摊子，进来伺候。琴仙穿了孝衣，帏间俯伏，知是子玉的父亲，心里虽喜，然倒有些虚心，恐他风闻前事，问起他的根本来，甚是惶恐。只见梅侍郎进来上了香，奠了酒，行了礼，请出琴仙来。琴仙上前叩谢了。梅侍郎挽起，先把琴仙一看，点了一点头，叹了一声，道：「道翁可为有子。」便问：「世兄尊","en":"making his way to the temple. Flustered, Liu Xi paid a young monk to watch the stall and hurried inside to serve. Qinxian, dressed in mourning white, knelt behind the curtain. Knowing this was Ziyu's father, his heart swelled with joy, yet a nagging apprehension lingered, fearful that the man might have caught wind of past rumors and would question his origins. With great"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"梅侍郎半信不信的道：「明日我且去看看，问问地方，可以买得，就是那块。」琴仙一面看那梅侍郎的相貌，却与子玉半点不像，生得身瘦而长，一脸秋霜，凛然可畏，将近五十岁光景。","en":"tomorrow. I'll inquire about the location, and if it can be purchased, that specific plot will do.\\" As they spoke, Qinxian quietly studied Vice Minister Mei's features, noting that he bore not the slightest resemblance to Ziyu. Mei was tall and lean, his face weathered like autumn frost, projecting an awe-inspiring, formidable presence, appearing to be nearing fifty years"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":6,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"此时琴仙称呼士燮为大人，自己为晚生。梅侍郎道：「你尊公与我二十年交好，祖上还有年谊，你叫我为世叔，自己称侄就是了。方才这个称呼，倒觉疏远。」说了些话，也就去了。琴仙心内安稳，且十分感激，意欲求他携带进京，尚有几天耽搁，且慢慢商量罢。明日，带了刘喜即去拜谢，梅","en":"At that moment, Qinxian was addressing Shixie as 'Your Excellency' and referring to himself as 'your humble junior.' Vice Minister Mei corrected him, saying, \\"Your father and I were close friends for twenty years, and our ancestors also shared long-standing ties. You should"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子必是个小旦出身。这也不必论他，只要人好，总是一样。又想：「看这道翁像成了神，莫非莫愁湖畔果有他女儿的坟么？昨琴仙请仙之说，又见什么杜仙女，竟是真的了。」半夜竟不能寐。天一明就起来，着人去请了屈大爷过来，有话商量。","en":"seems Daoweng has become a deity. Could it be that his daughter's grave truly is located by Mochou Lake? If so, Qinxian's account of the planchette session and his encounter with Fairy Du must actually be true.\\" He lay awake for the rest of the night. At the crack of dawn, he rose and sent someone to invite Master Qu over, indicating he had matters to discuss."},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":8,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"不多一会，琴仙过来，就同他吃了早饭，梅侍郎且不说梦，要他同去逛莫愁湖，琴仙欣然，梅侍郎与琴仙各坐了轿，家人骑马，出了城，沿着城墙走去，约有二里路已到了。此时正是严冬天气，已下过了几场大雪，梅侍郎恐旷野寒冷，轿中披了玄狐斗篷。及进了斑竹林中，反觉春风和煦，如二月间天","en":"Shortly thereafter, Qinxian arrived and shared breakfast with him. Vice Minister Mei did not mention the dream, but instead invited Qinxian to accompany him on an excursion to Mochou Lake, which Qinxian happily accepted. Vice Minister Mei and Qinxian each took a sedan chair, while"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":5,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"。规模粗定，士燮不能等待，发了二千金与家中老总管梅成督造，又画了杜仙女像，命塑泥身彩画。一一分拨定了，那日就请琴仙过来商量，要带他进京。琴仙喜出望外，又复谢了，即算清房租，一直搬到梅侍郎的船上，并将领回之银，送与梅侍郎，梅侍郎仍叫他收了。此番琴仙感激，真到二十分。梅侍郎因道翁梦中之语，绝不查问琴仙根底，因刘喜称呼大爷，便命家下人也称呼为屈大爷。梅侍郎要他叔侄称呼","en":"Du, ordering a painted clay statue to be modeled after it. Once every task was meticulously assigned, he invited Qinxian over that very day to discuss taking him along to the capital. Overjoyed, Qinxian offered his profound thanks once more. He immediately settled the rent for his room and moved directly onto Vice Minister Mei's boat. He then offered the silver he had"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"送葬之日，侯石翁被绅士拉了同去，也来走了一走。见琴仙尚是有气，话也不与他讲，石翁不乐，心里既恨琴仙，又妒士燮，一到就走，拜也没有拜一拜。后来诸绅士又有高兴的出来倡捐，这个十两，那个二十，集腋成裘，又凑了数千金。把这屈公祠扩充起来，起了好些亭台楼阁。莫愁湖中造了湖心亭、九曲红桥，又造了几个船，以为春夏游","en":"day of the funeral, Hou Shiweng had been dragged along by the gentry and made a brief appearance. Seeing that Qinxian was still holding a grudge and refused to speak a single word to him, Shiweng felt deeply displeased. Harboring hatred for Qinxian and jealousy toward Shixie, he left almost immediately without even offering a single bow of respect. Later, several enthusiastic"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"梅侍郎于二十八日开船在船上也是寂寞，倒将琴仙当着子玉一样，朝夕相依。又见他稳重灵警，十分契爱，又试他书本上虽未用过功，而诗词杂艺颇觉聪明，因想到京后，慢慢的再教他读书，学作文字。惟琴仙绝不敢题起认得子玉，心里还怕问他的出身，如果问他，只好撒两句谎，支吾遮饰，再不知道乃尊梦中已嘱咐了他。船到王家","en":"Vice Minister Mei set sail on the twenty-eighth. Feeling lonely on the boat, he treated Qinxian just as he would Ziyu, keeping him by his side from morning till night. Observing Qinxian's steady demeanor and sharp intellect, Mei grew exceedingly fond of him. Testing the boy's knowledge, he found that although Qinxian hadn't devoted much effort"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":2,"tokens":["屈勤先","琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"不必说，王文辉也是常来问信。那日已是腊月十五，早上送了一封信来，子玉看信面上是：「江西学政梅宅梅庾香少爷手启，屈勤先寄。」心中大喜，知琴仙到了江西任所了，便忙拆开，看见还有与子云、蕙芳、素兰、琪官的信，且搁过一边。拆开自己的信，见一张白纸写着「哀启者」，大为骇然，想道：「难道道翁有什么缘故了？」遂细细的看下去，不觉泪珠点点的落将下来。","en":"the personal attention of Young Master Mei Yuxiang at the Mei Residence, Jiangxi Education Commissioner. Sent by Qu Qinxian.\\" His heart leapt with joy, realizing Qinxian had reached the post in Jiangxi. He hurriedly tore it open, noticing there were also letters addressed to Ziyun, Huifang, Sulan, and Qiguan, which he temporarily set aside. Opening his own letter, he saw"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"何事，又不敢问子玉，便又到九香楼，进去见诸名旦都在园中，南湘、高品、金粟都在这里。子玉不及叙话，一脸悲愁，就将琴仙给众人之信与他们看了，个个洒泪。再不料琴仙一出京，就遭此大难，真令人意想不到。蕙芳道「如今没有别的，快找度香来商量。」于是打发人找寻子云。找着了子云，到了九香园，见了子玉的光景，急急的拆开信看了，已觉涕泪潸潸。","en":"When he read further, learning that all of Qinxian's clothes and belongings had been stolen by runaway servants, that he was keeping vigil over the coffin in a desolate temple entirely bereft of food and clothing, and that he had been repeatedly harassed and humiliated by Hou Shiweng, Ziyu's heart shattered."},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":1,"tokens":["玉侬"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"雨。子玉等与众人看了，个个大哭了一场，哭得九香楼下好不热闹。众人哭毕，子云道：「此事在我，明日即着人到江南去接玉侬回来，并办道翁葬事。但今年不能到了。」子云即回，要告诉次贤商量此事。子玉也无心在九香楼，便即回家。高品，史南湘金粟与那些名旦，各惆怅无欢。子云回园与次贤说了，次贤更痛得伤心，一夜之间，便摹了道翁神像。明日邀同众名士在九香楼为位而哭，设奠三日。华公子得","en":"weeping subsided, Ziyun spoke up: \\"Leave this matter to me. Tomorrow, I will dispatch men to Jiangnan to bring Yunong back and to handle Daoweng's funeral arrangements. However, they won't be able to reach him before the year's end.\\" Ziyun returned immediately to inform Cixian and discuss the matter with him. With no heart to remain at the Nine-Fragrance Tower, Ziyu"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，也乏极了，即忙坐下，靠在枕上，问了子玉家内一番事，又问仲清妻子都好，兼询文辉近况。爷儿三个谈了一会，士燮惦记琴仙，问家人：「怎么屈大爷的车子还不到来？」家人道：「总也快了。」不多一时，门外又车声辚辚，仲清、子玉想道：「不知那个屈大爷，想是任上同回来的。」只见一人照了灯笼，一个美少年走进来，仲清、子玉大奇，灯光之下，不甚分明，觉得此少年骨格甚是不凡。琴仙早已看得","en":"well, and asked about Wenhui's recent situation. After the three men had chatted for a while, Shixie remembered Qinxian and asked his servants, \\"Why hasn't Master Qu's carriage arrived yet?\\" A servant replied, \\"It should be here any moment.\\" Shortly after, the rumble of carriage wheels echoed outside the door. Zhongqing and Ziyu wondered to themselves, \\"Which Master Qu"},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"郎，同我进京的，其中缘故，此是也不及细说。你们见见，将来要在一处的。」子玉始而大骇，继而大乐，竟乐得笑将出来。琴仙见了子玉，笑容满面，也觉喜欢，上前与二人见了礼，彼此面面相觑，心里明白，口里却都无话可讲。士燮当着他们初次见面，自然是生的，没甚话说，那里知道有缘故在内，便道：「今日乏极了，要躺躺，你们都到那边去罢。」子玉喜甚，便拉了琴仙到那边屋里来。","en":"terrified, but this quickly gave way to immense joy, so much so that he nearly burst out laughing. Seeing Ziyu, Qinxian's face lit up with a smile, and he too felt a surge of happiness. He stepped forward and formally greeted the two of them. They stared at one another, their hearts completely clear on the situation, yet none of them could utter a single word. Believing"},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":3,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"三人怔怔的，你看我，我看你，一个不敢问，一个不敢说，仲清心上也不知姑父知道琴仙细底不知，也不便问，只好心内细细的默想，竟是三个哑子聚在一处。子玉与琴仙只好以眉目相与语，一会儿大家想着了苦，都低头颦眉泪眼的光景，一会儿想到此番聚会，也是梦想不到，竟能如此，便又眉欢眼笑起来，倒成了黄梅时节阴晴不定的景象。少顷，送饭进来，琴仙吃了。","en":"another; one didn't dare to ask, and the other didn't dare to speak. Zhongqing didn't know if his uncle was aware of Qinxian's detailed background, and he felt it inappropriate to ask, so he could only silently ponder the situation in his heart. It was as if three mutes had gathered in one room. Ziyu and Qinxian could only communicate with their eyes. One moment, they recalled"},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":4,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"那边士燮已安歇，琴仙困乏已甚，支持不住，便躺在炕上，子玉、仲清也都在炕上坐了。家人们出去，今日幸喜云儿没跟来，仲清也是新用的人，都不认识琴仙，故此一宵无话。后来三人都也困乏，便都躺下，人静之后，细细的谈起来。此刻子玉、琴仙在一个枕上和衣而卧，竟把嫌疑也忘了，琴仙便哝哝唧","en":"Meanwhile, Shixie had already gone to rest. Qinxian was exhausted beyond measure and couldn't hold on any longer, so he lay down on the kang, while Ziyu and Zhongqing sat beside him. The servants left the room; fortunately, Yun'er had not come along today, and Zhongqing was accompanied by newly hired"},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":3,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"快乐，想道：「这两人两年之内伤了无数的心，哭了无数的眼泪，才有今日这一叙，倒成了悲欢离合，真也奇极了。」后来，琴仙又讲到他梦见神娥授笔，道翁成神，并舟中彼此照镜正面反面，怎样又化了珠为龙抢去，子玉、仲清连连称异。子玉也将送行后怎样得病，得信后怎样悲伤，众人怎样祭奠道翁，度香已着人下了江南来接你并安葬道翁，直说到今日再想不着你来，二人又复悲喜交集。琴仙又复感激子云","en":"conversation. It has truly turned into a tale of sorrow and joy, parting and reunion; it's utterly extraordinary.\\" Later, Qinxian spoke of dreaming that the divine maiden had bestowed brushes upon them, how Daoweng had become a deity, how their boats had drawn alongside one another and they had reflected each other's fronts and backs in mirrors, and how the pearl had turned into"},{"paragraph":30,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"起以往的了。」子玉道：「甚好，但我不便说，还是你去说。」仲清应了，以后大家也就睡着了。到天明时，仲清先醒，只见琴仙枕着子玉的手，尚呼呼睡着，子玉也未睡醒。仲清暗笑，唤醒了他们。琴仙见与子玉一枕，且枕着他的膀子，被仲清见了，甚是羞愧。子玉一个膀子被他枕得很酸也不知觉，及要抬起手来，抬不动了，遂「扑哧」的一笑，各人漱洗。","en":"Zhongqing agreed, and after that, everyone finally drifted off to sleep. When dawn broke, Zhongqing woke first and saw Qinxian resting his head on Ziyu's arm, still sound asleep and breathing softly, while Ziyu remained asleep as well. Zhongqing smiled to himself and woke them up. Realizing he had been sharing a pillow with Ziyu and resting on his arm, and that Zhongqing had"},{"paragraph":31,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"来，急急的叫上车进城，三十里路甚快，一个多时辰已到了。梅侍郎且不到家，先宿了庙，明日五鼓时分上朝复命。子玉先将琴仙在书房里安顿了。梅进、云儿一见琴仙，个个骇异，又猜是他，又猜不是他。若说是他，为何老爷与他抗礼？且又穿着素服，像个有孝的人。若说不是他，面貌再没有这般相像的了。众人疑疑惑惑，猜不出来，又听得叫屈大爷，便知不是。子玉趁这空儿，就请仲清对颜夫人讲明，琼华","en":"preparing to attend court and report back to the Emperor at the fifth watch the next morning. Ziyu first settled Qinxian in the study. As soon as Mei Jin and Yun'er saw Qinxian, they were utterly astonished, guessing first that it was him, and then that it wasn't. If it was him, why did the master treat him as an equal? And why was he wearing plain mourning clothes, like"},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"仲清道：「此事要姑母与姑夫说明才好，不然外人见了，终要说的，倒教琴仙难为情。」颜夫人也应了，说道：「你姑夫重世交，又见他人好，决不看轻他的。」仲清见颜夫人应允了，也即告退。","en":"this clearly to everyone, Aunt; otherwise, when outsiders see him, they are bound to talk, which will only cause Qinxian embarrassment.\\" Lady Yan agreed, saying, \\"Your uncle highly values old friendships, and seeing that the boy is of good character, he certainly won't look down on him.\\" Seeing that Lady Yan had agreed, Zhongqing took his leave."},{"paragraph":33,"mentions":4,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"同他进来见太太，你出去看看像不像？」琼华啐了一声，忽又说道：「你去同他进来见太太，我真要望望他。」子玉果然拉了琴仙进来，到内堂拜见了颜夫人。夫人见了，也甚疼他，便叫了一声：「屈大爷受苦了！」琴仙先进来，尚觉不安，及见颜夫人以礼相待，称他屈大爷，便安了心。琼华小姐在房门口偷望，果然像他，心中颇以为异，望了一望就进去了。颜夫人问了琴仙近况，琴仙略说了几句，也就告退。","en":"part?\\" Qionghua scoffed, but then added, \\"Bring him in; I really do want to take a look at him.\\" Ziyu indeed led Qinxian inside to pay his respects to Lady Yan in the inner hall. Seeing him, the lady felt a deep sense of pity and called out, \\"Master Qu, you have suffered!\\" Qinxian had felt uneasy upon entering, but seeing Lady Yan treat him with such courtesy and address"},{"paragraph":34,"mentions":5,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"明日，士燮面圣回家，合家迎接。琼华拜见了公公，士燮十分喜欢。颜夫人同着谈了一回，后将琴仙的事委委婉婉说了出来，就说他唱过戏，屈道翁见他人品好，所以收为义子。将子玉害病的话，却隐藏不题。士燮道：「我已猜着了几分。」也将屈道翁梦中之言说了，又道：「前事也不必论他。这个孩子甚好，没有一点优伶习气，不说破真令人看不出来。」颜夫人道：「看这个孩子","en":"and Shixie was extremely pleased. Lady Yan chatted with him for a while, and then gently and tactfully recounted Qinxian's entire story, explaining that he had once sung in operas, and that Qu Daoweng, seeing his excellent character, had adopted him as his son. She deliberately hid the details of Ziyu's illness, making no mention of it. Shixie said, \\"I had already guessed"},{"paragraph":35,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴仙初来不好出门，一日子玉带了他到众名士处一走，都相见了，齐与子玉称贺。又到了九香楼，见了九名旦，都各悲喜交集。琴仙也喜诸人都跳出了孽海，保全了清白身子，各诉离情，牵衣执手的足足谈了一天。正是：","en":"At first, Qinxian was reluctant to go out. One day, however, Ziyu took him to visit the various renowned scholars. Everyone met with him and offered their congratulations to Ziyu in unison. They then went to the Nine-Fragrance Tower and met with the nine famous dans,"}],"60":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":4,"tokens":["屈勤先","琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"火树银花，好不热闹。子云于十三日请了华公子、田春航、梅子玉、史南湘、高品、颜仲清、刘文泽、王恂、萧次贤、金粟、屈勤先，并九香园诸人，作一大会。琴仙见了华公子，尚有些不安，华公子也不问起前事，以礼相待。此时琴仙已出了旦党，入了士党，但从前作旦时傲睨一切，此刻倒谦谦自守起来，因此上下诸人更加尊重他，绝没有一个人笑他。琴仙对了那些名旦，还是从前一样，并不生疏。是日觥筹交","en":"Hua, Tian Chunhang, Mei Ziyu, Shi Nanxiang, Gao Pin, Yan Zhongqing, Liu Wenze, Wang Xun, Xiao Cixian, Jin Su, Qu Qinxian, and the entire company of Nine-Fragrance Garden. Seeing Young Master Hua, Qinxian still felt a trace of unease, yet Hua asked nothing of past affairs, treating him with utmost courtesy. By now, Qinxian had left the circle of performers to enter the"},{"paragraph":2,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴仙一身历尽艰辛，此时才觉魔难尽释。然回想萧寺凄凉，孤灯残月，真如梦觉。次贤又将琴仙从前的梦境，向吉甫细细的说了一遍。吉甫因笑向子云、次贤道：「九香楼绝好一个花园，百花全有，如今单有一个花神牌位，且在隐僻处，与土地祠一样，岂不亵渎花神？我拟借他们九个作个","en":"Having tasted every hardship, Qinxian finally felt his trials melt away. Yet looking back on the bleak monastery, the lone lamp, and the waning moon, it all seemed like waking from a dream. Cixian then recounted to Jifu in detail the dreamscapes Qinxian had once described. Smiling, Jifu"},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":3,"tokens":["玉侬"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云问道：「怎样呢？」吉甫道：「花神若定要十二位，也可凑得上，只要把屈道翁做了芙蓉城主，再借重玉侬的前生所说那杜仙女，凑上玉侬，不是十二位了？」春航道：「妙，妙！此像要画得像，不必说真姓真名，缀个别号，每人做一篇赞语，说得似真似幻的，要与人花两合。」子玉道：「这个图怎样的好呢？还是单画人，还是补景呢？」仲清道：「自然单画人，一并的画去，后就缀小传","en":"can make up the number. We need only cast Qu Daoweng as the Lord of Furong City, and borrow the Fairy Du from Yunong's past-life vision. Add Yunong himself, and does that not make twelve?\\" Chunhang exclaimed, \\"Brilliant, brilliant! The portraits must capture their likenesses, but we need not use their true names—we can append style names instead. Each will have a eulogy,"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":2,"tokens":["屈琴仙","琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"如今是这样，各人拈阄，拈到谁是谁。华星北也叫他做一篇在内。」南湘道：「甚好。」于是写起阄来，将屈道翁与杜仙女、屈琴仙分做二阄，其余九人分作九阄。说也奇怪，想必文字有灵，前生缘法，子云拈了道翁，子玉拈了杜仙女、琴仙，金粟拈了宝珠，春航拈了蕙芳，仲清拈了琪官，文泽拈了春喜，南湘拈了兰保，王恂拈了桂保，高品拈了玉林，次贤拈了漱芳，单拈不着素兰，只好送与华公子去作了。众人","en":"as well.\\" Nanxiang agreed it was a fine idea. And so they prepared the lots, grouping Qu Daoweng, Fairy Du, and Qu Qinxian into two draws, and the remaining nine into nine draws. Curiously enough, as if the written word possessed a spirit and past-life affinities were at play, Ziyun drew Daoweng; Ziyu drew Fairy Du and Qinxian; Jin Su drew Baozhu; Chunhang drew Huifang;"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉同了琴仙回家，正是内有韵妻，外有俊友，名成身立，清贵高华，好不有兴。子云写了一札与华公子为素兰作传。这边次贤妙腕灵思，画了十天才成。画成又请吉甫一一的改好，画一个，刻一个，倒也甚快。子云因受了感冒甚重，不敢用心，嘱将道翁、琴仙、杜仙女画在一幅，并求子玉作赞。","en":"Ziyu returned home with Qinxian. With a graceful wife within and a handsome friend without, his fame established and his station secure, he was in the highest of spirits. Ziyun wrote a letter to Young Master Hua, requesting a biography for Sulan. Meanwhile, Cixian, wielding his wondrous"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":3,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"三十日，琴仙先到九香园看碑，九旦同到楼下。琴仙道：「今日也应祭一祭花神，明日我们方可聚会。这个花神就是我们的像，若叫他们来祭，我们也当不起，就是我们十个人祭一祭罢。」蕙芳等皆以为是，便设了酒果，焚了好香，十人齐齐拜了。琴仙看东楹嵌的第一方画，上云下水，云水中间，","en":"On the thirtieth, Qinxian arrived early at Nine-Fragrance Garden to view the steles, and the nine former dans came downstairs to join him. Qinxian said, \\"Today we ought to offer sacrifices to the flower gods before we hold our gathering tomorrow. Yet these flower gods bear our"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴仙再看第三方，画一个仙女，云鬟雾縠，清艳绝伦，手拈一枝蕙花，琴仙已知是蕙芳。看题的是：锦文花史苏仙。是春航一篇跋语：","en":"Qinxian then turned to the third panel, which depicted a fairy maiden with cloud-like hair and misty garments, of peerless, ethereal beauty, holding a single orchid sprig. Qinxian instantly knew it was Huifang. The title read: \\"Jinwen Flower Historian, Immortal"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"离乍合。萧史常垂于彩凤，裴航终隔于蓝桥。是宜结十重珠网，护金屋于群玉山头；何幸启九迭银屏，窥素面于瑶台月下。\\n琴仙道：「这个跋语跋得甚切，「狡狯神通均出三昧」二语尤妙。」蕙芳笑道：「凭他怎样讲，那里还算得我们？」看第四方，一个仙女月佩霓裳，十分娇艳，手捧明珠一颗，题曰：弄珠花史袁仙。有金粟赞曰：","en":"draw back the ninefold silver screen and glimpse her unadorned face beneath the moon on the Jasper Terrace.\\"\\n\\nQinxian said, \\"This colophon is profoundly apt; the line 'Her playful magic all springs from true samadhi' is especially brilliant.\\" Huifang laughed, \\"No matter how they dress it up, how can any of this truly be us?\\" They moved to the fourth panel, showing a"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"。\\n珍珠饰车，云锦缝裳。金枝翠羽，玉佩明璫。\\n华月光满，蓬山路长。既美且都，亦风而雅。\\n学士满宫，首推大舍。\\n琴仙道：「瑶卿之秾艳韶华，却一齐被静宜画出来，吉甫赞出来了。」宝珠道：「算花神罢了，我也配这样？」看第五方，画一个仙女，意致飘洒，素艳欲流，手拈兰花一朵，题曰：素心花史陆仙。下有小传，为华公子撰：","en":"majestic, elegant and refined.\\nAmong the scholars filling the palace, she is the first of the great houses.\\"\\n\\nQinxian noted, \\"Yaoqing's stunning, youthful radiance has been perfectly captured by Jingyi's brush and Jifu's praise.\\" Baozhu replied, \\"Even as a flower god, am I truly worthy of this?\\" They looked at the fifth panel, depicting a fairy maiden with an aura of"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，购之者千缗不获焉。昔钟嵘评诗，谓颜延之镂金错彩，不如谢康乐初日芙蓉。素面风流，是为绝艳，仙殆莲花化身者欤？\\n琴仙笑道：「这几句倒比香畹的小照还画得像些。这「紫绡衣行吟风露间，」与「莲花化身」之说，却移不到他人的，真是你。」素兰笑道：「我如何敢当？大抵既赞花神，自然就要竭力赞扬的了。」琴仙再看第六方仙女，纤纤弱质，乘辕舞凌风，有掌上轻盈之态，头上戴着金步摇，题曰","en":"unadorned, natural elegance is the height of supreme beauty; is this immortal not the very incarnation of the lotus?\\"\\n\\nQinxian laughed and said, \\"These lines capture her likeness even better than Xiangwan's small portrait. The descriptions of 'purple silk robes wandering amidst the wind and dew' and 'the incarnation of the lotus' could apply to no one else—it is truly you.\\""},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":3,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"用添。\\n鸳锦裁成九华帐，鲛珠穿作十重帘。\\n隐身阆苑依琼树，返劫归真典玉签。\\n只恐留仙留不住，晓风吹上绿云尖。\\n琴仙道：「将瘦香的神情骨相全写出来。」漱芳笑道：「我这个瘦字倒有些像，别样真令我惭愧死了。」再看第七方画的仙女，在两棵玉树之下，有玉树凌风之致，题的是娟娟花史李仙，是高品的诗。琴仙道：「高卓然肯说好话吗？」玉林道：「这一回倒没有刻薄人。」蕙芳道：「这首诗","en":"retaining an immortal, she cannot be kept,\\nAnd the dawn wind will blow her away to the tips of the green clouds.\\"\\n\\nQinxian said, \\"He has captured the very spirit and bone of 'slender fragrance' perfectly.\\" Shufang laughed, \\"The word 'slender' bears some resemblance to me, but the rest makes me want to die of shame.\\" They looked at the seventh panel, which depicted a fairy"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"袅然。\\n帐里不知兰麝贵，梦中羞作雨云仙。\\n珊瑚枕上生红晕，翡翠楼头锁绿烟。\\n谪往天台守孤另，碧桃流水自年年。\\n琴仙道：「真说得好，将佩仙浓香秀韵一齐写出来了。」玉林道：「这首诗究竟也不甚好，还有些刻薄，你看帐里梦中等句，有什么好呢？」蕙芳道：「这倒没有什么。不过写的娇艳尊贵处。」宝珠道：「卓然这等诗，就算他的好心了。若要他做庄重些，他也未尝不愿，但他那油嘴油舌说","en":"to Mount Tiantai to endure her solitary lot,\\nThe peach blossoms and flowing waters continue year after year.\\"\\n\\nQinxian said, \\"This is truly well-said; it perfectly captures Peixian's rich fragrance and elegant charm.\\" Yulin countered, \\"Actually, this poem isn't very good, and it still carries a hint of mockery. Look at lines like 'within the bedcurtains' and 'in dreams'—what"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":4,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"媚妩。\\n绿云堆鬓翠鬟新，九梁插花步摇古。\\n妾借防身不爱名，娇娆我自惜轻生。\\n请看世上黄衫客，多少恩仇报不成。\\n琴仙赞道：「这首七古，实在做得好，念去比《公孙大娘舞剑器行》还刻画得入细。」王兰保笑而不言。蕙芳道：「去年奚十一闹来，幸亏着他，我就没有法了。」素兰道：「原来你也怕奚十一，难道他比潘三还利害么？」蕙芳道：「潘三是个无用的人，那奚十一闹起来，就与前日魏聘才","en":"yellow-shirted swordsmen of this world,\\nHow many debts of gratitude and vengeance have they failed to repay?\\"\\n\\nQinxian praised it, saying, \\"This seven-character ancient verse is exceptionally well-crafted. Reading it, the details are even more vivid than in *Ballad of Lady Gongsun's Sword Dance*.\\" Wang Lanbao merely smiled without speaking. Huifang said, \\"When Xi Eleven"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"自芳，思美人兮何日忘。\\n蓬莱清浅不可到，我欲从之骑凤凰。天风急吹袂，玉露冷沾裳。吮纤毫而抒写，对玉貌而傍徨。\\n琴仙道：「好赋。正是松风竹雨，仙露明珠，将你那清腴娟秀，都一齐刻画出来。」春喜道：「这是前舟在那里认真做赋，忘了题目了。」琴仙道：「却也是你的光景。」再看第十方，是一个桂树下有个仙女，姿致风流，青眸善盼，题曰：","en":"I moisten the fine hairs of my brush to pour out my thoughts,\\nPacing hesitantly before her jade-like visage.\\"\\n\\nQinxian said, \\"A fine rhapsody. It speaks precisely of the wind in the pines and rain on the bamboo, of immortal dew and bright pearls, perfectly capturing your lean elegance and delicate beauty.\\" Chunxi replied, \\"This is Qianzhou taking his rhapsody too seriously"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":3,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"修。\\n蓬莱水清浅，或可操神舟。\\n银河望隔浦，七夕诉离忧。\\n唯此一轮月，梯虹亦难求。\\n安得张丽华，缟素来嬉游。\\n琴仙道：「好诗，好诗！读之令人口齿俱香。蕊香真像嫦娥。」桂保道：「不是我，这是蟾宫花史。」众人说道：「这些诗词赞语，他们倒是争奇角胜，那里记着本人？就是竹君的诗，与静宜、庾香这两个赞语，倒是切定题目说的。」琴仙道：「都切得很。你将这些诗更换了人，便不像了","en":"rainbow staircase is hard to find.\\nHow can we bring Zhang Lihua here,\\nTo playfully roam in her white silk robes?\\"\\n\\nQinxian exclaimed, \\"Good poem, good poem! Reading it leaves a lingering fragrance in the mouth. Ruixiang truly looks like Chang'e.\\" Guibao replied, \\"It's not me; it's the Changong Flower Historian.\\" The others chimed in, \\"With all these poems, lyrics, and eulogies,"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"莲；雾縠香飘，讶朝朝之琼树。谁不曰人间绝世，亦何愧仙处无双。若论六宫粉黛，定让龙头；以云一岁花司，是真凤尾。\\n琴仙痛赞了一会。蕙芳道：「你看这些诗文，各有体裁，正是格律不混，体制判然，都是作手，难定优劣。」琴仙道：「虽是些小文章，但吉光片羽，彩散人间，终胜雀屏五色。有此一赞，也不孤负我们数年辛苦了。」众人都皆欢喜。","en":"claim the highest rank;\\nIf we speak of the year's governing flowers, she is truly the phoenix tail among them.\\"\\n\\nQinxian offered fervent praise for a long while. Huifang said, \\"Look at these poems and prose pieces; each has its own distinct style and structure. The meters are never confused, the forms are sharply defined—they are all masterworks, hard to rank in excellence.\\""},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴仙就在九香楼吃了饭，坐了闲谈。宝珠忽然说道：「今日众兄弟都在一处，我想我们这十个人，同在京师沉沦菊部，如今个个跳了出来，虽然其中受苦的受苦，安逸的安逸，但自此以后，只要各人安分守已，想必没有风波出来。但我们这一班人，也算不得世间少有的。那一班名士将我们","en":"Qinxian stayed at Nine-Fragrance Tower for a meal, and they sat chatting idly. Baozhu suddenly spoke up: \\"Today, all of us brothers are gathered together. I was thinking, the ten of us sank together into the mire of the capital's theater world, and now, every"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴仙心上甚喜，就辞了回家，到晚上构思起来，子玉面前也未讲起。这一晚各人的赞已做成。","en":"Qinxian was delighted in his heart. He took his leave and went home, spending the evening composing his thoughts without even mentioning the plan to Ziyu. By the end of that night, everyone had finished composing their eulogies."},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"明日，琴仙先到九香楼将赞与众人看了，大家拿来评定一会，又各自斟酌一会，再公同推敲一会，尽善尽美了，宝珠便誊在一处。诸名士纷纷已到，华公子、金吉甫也都到了。大家果然要祭花神，宝珠等拦住了，然犹摆了香案，各名士奠酒焚香，就没有下拜。然后在九香楼下摆了四席，序齿而坐","en":"The next day, Qinxian arrived first at Nine-Fragrance Tower to show his eulogy to the others. They gathered to evaluate them, each pondering their own words, then collectively polishing the lines until they were perfect. Baozhu then transcribed them all together into a clean"},{"paragraph":35,"mentions":1,"tokens":["屈琴仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"多闻。温良冲淡，《九丘》《三坟》。磊磊落落，抱璞含芬。\\n高谈雄辩，说剑论文。\\n不合时宜，潇洒凌云。\\n第十一首是屈琴仙题的《仙中正品》：","en":"swords and analyzing prose.\\nThough out of step with the times, he remains free and cloud-borne.\\"\\n\\nThe eleventh was Qu Qinxian's *Upright Grade Among Immortals*:"},{"paragraph":37,"mentions":3,"tokens":["琴仙","玉侬"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"素兰与春喜各画几日，摹上了石，将赞语书丹，共有二十余日完竣。择于三月三日，供设九香楼上，为长生禄位。琴仙过来与宝珠商量，必须作一篇祝文，方表诚意，宝珠等深以为然。于是十人公同斟酌，凑成一篇文，改削了几遍，倒也不见联缀痕迹。宝珠道：「明日公祝，须请齐了诸名士来。再，我们跳出梨园，从前一切的所有之物，都用不着了，孽根须净，色界尽除，将那所存的钗钿首饰，当着","en":"the third day of the third month to install the longevity tablets on the upper floor of Nine-Fragrance Tower. Qinxian came to Baozhu to discuss the matter, saying that they must compose a formal invocation text to demonstrate their sincerity; Baozhu and the others agreed completely. Thus, the ten of them deliberated together and pieced together a text, revising and"}]}`),"char-2":JSON.parse(`{"1":[{"paragraph":5,"mentions":2,"tokens":["仲清","剑潭"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一日，先生有事放学，子玉正在独坐，却有两个好友来看他。一个姓颜名仲清，号剑潭，现年二十三岁，即系已故编修颜庄之子，为颜夫人之侄。","en":"leaving Ziyu sitting in solitude, when two close companions arrived to visit him. One was surnamed Yan, named Zhongqing, and styled Jiantan; currently twenty-three years of age, he was the son of the late Compiler Yan Zhuang, making him Lady Yan's nephew."},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":6,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这颜庄在日，与士燮既系郎舅至亲，又有雷陈至契。不料于三十岁即赴召玉楼，他夫人郑氏绝食殉节。那时仲清年甫三龄，士燮抚养在家，又与郑氏夫人请旌表烈。仲清在士燮处，到十九岁上中了个副车。是年士燮与其作伐，赘于同乡同年现任通政司王文辉家为婿。这王文辉是颜夫人的表兄，与仲清亲上加亲，翁婿甚为相得。那一位姓史名南湘，号竹君，是湖广汉阳人，现年二十四岁，已中了","en":"thirty, and his wife, Lady Zheng, starved herself to death to preserve her chastity and follow him. At that time, Zhongqing was barely three years old; Shixie brought him into his home to raise him and petitioned the court to erect a memorial arch honoring Lady Zheng's fierce devotion. Zhongqing lived under Shixie's roof until the age of nineteen, when he passed the examinations"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":2,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"往往有仲清鄙夷不屑之学，经子玉精心讲贯，便觉妙义环生。亦有子玉所索解不得之理，经仲清一言点悟，顿觉白地光明。","en":"Often, a subject that Zhongqing would dismiss with disdainful neglect, once meticulously expounded by Ziyu, would suddenly bloom with endless, subtle meaning. Conversely, a principle that eluded Ziyu's deepest searching could be illuminated by a single word from Zhongqing, instantly"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"两个相聚十余年，其结契之厚，比同胞手足更加亲密。那南湘是啸傲忘形，清狂绝俗，目空一世，倚马万言，就只赏识子玉、仲清二人。","en":"generation, capable of writing ten thousand words while leaning against a horse, and deigned to appreciate only Ziyu and Zhongqing."},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这日同来看子玉，门上见是来惯的，是少爷至好，便一直引到书房与子玉见了。仲清又同子玉进内见了姑母，然后出来与南湘坐下。三人讲了些话，书僮送上香茗。南湘见这室中清雅绝尘，一切陈设甚精且古，久知其胸次不凡，又见那清华尊贵的仪表，就是近日所选那《曲台花谱》中数人，虽然有此姿容，到底无此神骨。但见其谦谦自退，讷讷若虚，究不知他何所嗜","en":"them as frequent guests and the young master's closest friends, ushered them straight into the study to meet him. Zhongqing first accompanied Ziyu into the inner chambers to pay his respects to his aunt, then returned to sit with Nanxiang. After the three had exchanged pleasantries, a pageboy served fragrant tea. Nanxiang noted the room's transcendent elegance, its furnishings"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"的，去了这些，还有那一种人？」子玉正猜不着他所说什么，只得说道：「既然娱悦不在声色，其唯二三知己朝夕素心乎？」仲清大笑。南湘道：「岂有此理！朋友岂可云娱耳悦目的？庾香设心不良。」说罢哈哈大笑。子玉被他们这一笑，笑得不好意思起来，脸已微红，便说道：「你们休要取笑。我是这个意思：挥麈清谈，乌衣美秀，难道不可娱耳，不可悦目？","en":"does it not reside solely in the day-and-night companionship of two or three kindred spirits with pure hearts?\\" Zhongqing burst into loud laughter. Nanxiang retorted: \\"Absurd! How can one describe a friend as something that merely pleases the ear and delights the eye? Yuxiang, your heart harbors ill intentions.\\" With that, he laughed uproariously. Disconcerted by their"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"游未化。」即从（靴）勒里取出一本书来，送与子玉道：「这是我近刻的，大约可以娱耳悦目，动心荡魄者，要在此数君。」仲清笑道：「你将此书呈政于庾香，真似苏秦始见秦王，可保的你书十上而说不行。他非但没有领略此中情味，且未见过这些人，如何能教他一时索解出来？」子玉见他们说得郑重，不知是什么好书，便揭开一看，书目是《曲台花选》，有好几篇序，无非骈四俪六之文。南湘叫他不要看序","en":"pleasing the ear, delighting the eye, and stirring the soul are, I daresay, to be found among these few gentlemen.\\" Zhongqing chuckled: \\"Presenting this book to Yuxiang for his judgment is rather like Su Qin's first audience with the King of Qin; I guarantee you could submit it ten times and he would still remain unconvinced. Not only has he failed to grasp the flavor of these"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"天然。\\n风流别有消魂处，始信人间有谪仙。\\n子玉笑道：「这不是说戏班里的小旦么？这是那里的小旦，你赞得这样好？」仲清道：「现在这里的，你不见说在联锦班么？」子玉道：「我不信，这是竹君撒谎。我今年也看过一天的戏，几曾见小旦中有这样好人？」南湘道：「你那天看的不知是什么班子，自然没有好的了。」子玉再看第二题的是：瑶台璧月苏蕙芳\\n蕙芳姓苏氏，字媚香，年十七岁。姑苏人。","en":"young dan actors in the theatrical troupes? Which troupe boasts such an actor, that you praise him so highly?\\" Zhongqing replied, \\"He is right here in the capital; did you not read that he belongs to the Lianjin troupe?\\" Ziyu countered, \\"I don't believe it; Zhujun is making this up. I spent a day watching plays this year, and when did I ever see someone so extraordinary"},{"paragraph":38,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"足助欢笑。吾兄不惜笔墨，竭力铺张，为若辈增光，而使古人抱恨，窃为吾兄有所不取。」这一番话，把个史南湘说出气来。仲清笑道：「庾香之论未尝不是，而竹君之选也甚平允。但庾香不知天地间有此数人，譬如读《搜神》之记，《幽怪》之书。","en":"harbor regrets. I secretly feel there is something lacking in your approach.\\" This speech infuriated Shi Nanxiang. Zhongqing laughed and said, \\"Yuxiang's argument is not without merit, yet Zhujun's selections are also quite fair. It is just that Yuxiang does not realize that such individuals exist in the universe. It is like reading 'In Search of the Supernatural' or books"},{"paragraph":41,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"便拉了仲清去了。子玉送客转来，又将南湘的《花选》默默的一想，再想从前看过的戏，与见过的小旦一毫不对，犹以南湘为妄言，借此以自消遣的，便也不放在心上了。李先生回来，仍在书房念了一会书，颜夫人然后叫了进去。","en":"He then dragged Zhongqing away. Ziyu saw his guests out and returned, silently pondering Nanxiang's \\"Selection of Flowers\\" once more. He thought back to the plays he had seen in the past and the young dan he had encountered, finding that they did not match the descriptions in"},{"paragraph":42,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"过了两日，子玉于早饭后告了半天假，回去看南湘、仲清。","en":"Two days later, Ziyu requested a half-day's leave after breakfast and went back to visit Nanxiang and Zhongqing."},{"paragraph":45,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"了子玉。先同到内里去见了表舅母陆氏夫人。这夫人已是文辉续娶的了，今年才四十岁。又见了王恂的妻室孙氏，那是表嫂。仲清的妻室蓉华，那是表姊。还有个琼华小姐没有出来，因听得他父亲前日说那子玉的好处，其口风似要与他联姻的话，所以不肯出来见这表兄了。陆夫人见子玉，真是见一回爱一回，留他坐了，问了一会家常话，子玉告退。","en":"second wife and was only forty years old this year. He also greeted Wang Xun's wife, Lady Sun, his cousin-in-law. Zhongqing's wife, Ronghua, was his older female cousin. There was also a Miss Qionghua who did not come out to meet him; having heard her father praise Ziyu's qualities a few days prior, and sensing his tone suggested arranging a marriage between them, she felt"},{"paragraph":46,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"然后同王恂到了书房，问起仲清，为高品、南湘请去。子玉说起前日所见南湘的《花选》过于失实，王恂道：「竹君的《花选》，据实而言，尚恐说不到，何以为失实？现在那些宝贝得了这番品题，又长了些声价，你也应该见过这些人。」子玉听了，知王恂也有旦癖，又是个好为附会的人，便不说了。","en":"Afterward, he accompanied Wang Xun to the study and asked after Zhongqing, learning that he had been invited out by Gao Pin and Nanxiang. Ziyu mentioned that the \\"Selection of Flowers\\" he had seen Nanxiang carrying the other day was excessively exaggerated. Wang Xun replied, \\"As for Zhujun's 'Selection of Flowers,' practically"}],"2":[{"paragraph":18,"mentions":2,"tokens":["颜仲清","仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"次早聘才带了他的小子四儿，将王文辉的信送去。适文辉一早出门未回，王恂也不在家，只得请颜仲清会了。聘才见仲清一表非凡，叙了一番寒温，知是文辉之婿，又是士燮的内侄，免不得恭惟一番。正要告辞，只见一个跟班捧着一包衣服进来说：「老爷回来了。」聘才只得坐下。停了一会，听得外面有说话的声音，像是定班子唱戏的话。然后靴声秃秃，见一个大方脸，花白长须，三","en":"yet returned, and Wang Xun was likewise away from home, leaving Pincai no option but to request an audience with Yan Zhongqing. Upon meeting Zhongqing and observing his striking demeanor, Pincai engaged him in polite pleasantries. Learning that Zhongqing was Wenhui's son-in-law as well as Shixie's nephew by marriage, Pincai was generous with his flattery. He was just preparing"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"文辉让聘才坐下，自己就盘起腿来，仲清坐在靠窗凳上。聘才见这大模厮样的架子，心里筹划了一筹划，便站起来道：「小侄在诸位老伯荫庇之下，一切全仗栽培。家父曾吩咐过小侄，说大人的尊范，必要位至极品。趁如今拜识拜识，将来可以提拔寒畯。」说罢取出书子来双手呈上，文辉一手接着，看看信面就放下，哈哈大","en":"Wenhui invited Pincai to take a seat, settling himself comfortably with legs crossed, while Zhongqing occupied a stool by the window. Observing Wenhui's grandiose, self-important posture, Pincai carefully calculated his approach before rising to his feet and addressing him, \\"I am entirely dependent upon the patronage and shelter of esteemed elders like"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，便起身告辞，文辉要送出去，聘才道：「还同颜大哥有话讲，大人请便。」文辉便住了脚，弯一弯腰，大摇大摆的进去了。仲清送出了门，聘才想道：「这个老头儿好大架子，不及梅老伯远甚。」便自回梅宅不题。","en":"affairs.\\" Wenhui halted, offered a perfunctory bow, and swaggered into the inner chambers with an exaggerated sway. Zhongqing escorted Pincai to the door, while Pincai thought to himself, \\"This old man is incredibly arrogant, a far cry from the graciousness of Uncle Mei.\\" He then made his way back to the Mei residence, which needs no further recounting."},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"且说仲清到自己房中吃了饭，与其妻室蓉华讲了些话，来到王恂书斋，恰值王恂才回。刚说得一两句话，有王恂两个内舅前来看望：一个叫孙嗣徽，一个叫孙嗣元，本是王文辉同乡同年孙亮功部郎之子。这嗣徽、嗣元两个，真所谓难兄难弟。","en":"Meanwhile, Zhongqing had returned to his own quarters for a meal and conversed briefly with his wife, Ronghua, before heading to Wang Xun's study, arriving just as Wang Xun returned. They had barely exchanged a few words when two of Wang Xun's brothers-in-law arrived to"},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":4,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"是日来到王宅，适文辉请客，客将到了。王恂即同他到书房内来。仲清躲避不及，只得见了，同王恂陪着坐下。嗣徽先对仲清说道；今日天朗气清，所以愚兄弟正其衣冠，翩然而来奉看的。」王恂、仲清忍不住要笑。嗣徽又对王恂说道：「适值尊驾出门，不知去向，若不是「鸟倦飞而知还」，则虽引弓而射之，亦徒兴弋人之慕矣。」仲清正要回言，那嗣","en":"banquet, the guests on the verge of assembling. Wang Xun promptly ushered them into the study. Unable to avoid them, Zhongqing politely exchanged greetings and sat down beside Wang Xun to keep them company. Sihui initiated the conversation, addressing Zhongqing pompously, \\"Today the heavens are clear and the air is crisp, thus my brother and I have straightened our garments"},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":4,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这句「鸟倦飞而知还」，是出在《古文观止》上的。若说鸟不可以比人，那《大学》上为什么说「可以人而不如鸟乎」呢？」仲清暗笑道：天下也有这样蠢材，便道：「大哥的鸟论极通，岂特大哥如鸟，只怕鸟还不如大哥。要晓得靖节先生此言，原是引以自喻的。」嗣徽侧耳而听，又说道：「老兄所看的《古文观止》，只怕是翻板的。小弟记得逼真，做这篇古文是个姓陶的，并不是姓秦。」王恂忍不住，装作解","en":"bird cannot be compared to a human, then why does the Great Learning state, 'Can a human be inferior to a bird?'\\" Zhongqing chuckled inwardly at the sheer magnitude of such stupidity and said aloud, \\"Brother's avian discourse is profoundly logical. Not only is Brother akin to a bird, but I fear the bird is scarcely a match for Brother. One must understand that Master Jingjie"},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":2,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"此理。」家兄只当先生忘了，便乐、乐、乐得了不得，连忙翻、翻、翻出来看，原来是草字头的苟字，不是反犬旁的狗字。」仲清笑了一笑道：「若不是狗记错了，倒是一副好对子。」嗣元道：「又一日，先生出了一个做起讲的题、题、题目，是：「先生将何之。」家兄就、就、就将「牛何之」做了起头。先、先生拿笔叉、叉、叉了几叉，痛骂了一顿。」这一番说得嗣徽羞忿难耐，便在屋子里乱踱起来，说道：","en":"the character 'gou' (if/careless) with the grass radical, not the character 'gou' (dog) with the dog radical.\\" Zhongqing let out a soft laugh and commented, \\"If not for the canine confusion, it would have been an excellent couplet.\\" Siyuan continued, \\"On another occasion, the teacher set a theme for the opening argument of an essay: 'Where is the master going?' My brother"},{"paragraph":31,"mentions":2,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"王恂、仲清上前见了礼，亮功问道：「客到齐了么？」王恂道：「没有。」仲清看亮功虽是个紫糖色扁脸，蹋鼻子，但五官端正，又有了几根胡须，比两位贤郎好看多了。","en":"Wang Xun and Zhongqing stepped forward to exchange greetings. Lianggong asked, \\"Have all the guests assembled?\\" Wang Xun replied, \\"Not yet.\\" Zhongqing observed Lianggong closely, noting his purplish-brown complexion and flat nose. Yet, his features were properly aligned, and"},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"亮功正要与他儿子说话，适值王桂保进来，见了亮功并王恂、仲清，也站在一边。亮功看看桂保，对他儿子说道：「你们回去，不要说什么。」嗣徽兄弟会意答应，于是亮功即拉了桂保进去。","en":"verge of addressing his sons when Wang Guibao entered the courtyard. Spotting Lianggong, along with Wang Xun and Zhongqing, he also stepped respectfully aside. Lianggong glanced at Guibao before instructing his sons, \\"Return home immediately, and utter not a single word.\\" Sihui and his brother, understanding the implication, voiced their assent. Lianggong then took Guibao"},{"paragraph":33,"mentions":3,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"仲清、王恂送了他弟兄出门进来，大家换了衣裳，在书房内晚饭对酌闲谈。王恂道：「我们这两位舅兄，真可入得《无双谱》的。」仲清道：「为什么同胞兄妹丝毫不像？假使尊夫人生了这样嘴脸，那就够你受罪了。」王恂笑道：「幸亏内人是如今这位岳母生的。你不晓得我们还有个大姨","en":"Zhongqing and Wang Xun saw the two brothers to the door before returning inside. They changed their garments and settled in the study for an evening meal, sharing wine and casual conversation. Wang Xun said, \\"These two brothers-in-law of ours are truly worthy"},{"paragraph":42,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"文辉赏了桂保二十两银子，桂保谢了，走到书房来找王恂、仲清，谈了一会，说道：「我们班里新来了两个：一个叫琴官，一个叫琪官，生得色艺俱佳，只怕史竹君的《花选》又要翻刻了。」又坐了一会也自回去。不知后事如何，且听下回分解。","en":"twenty taels of silver. After expressing his gratitude, Guibao made his way to the study in search of Wang Xun and Zhongqing. They conversed for a time before Guibao revealed, \\"Two new performers have recently joined our troupe, one named Qinguan, the other Qiguan. Both are exquisitely beautiful and remarkably talented. I fear Shi Zhujun's Selection of Flowers will require"}],"4":[{"paragraph":6,"mentions":2,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"忽见俊儿拿了一封书信来，签子上写着梅少爷手展，旁有一行小字。内信笺一纸，诗笺四纸。认得仲清笔迹，便问俊儿是谁送来的。俊儿道：「是颜少爷的健儿。」子玉道：「叫他等一等。」拆开看时，信笺上写着是：昨与庸庵同居虚室。玉杯寒重，始知六出花飞；银烛光残，才见十分雪艳。冰山迭迭，围成云母屏风；宝塔层层，照见琉璃灯火。美人装罢，玉戏猫儿；罗汉堆来，球抛","en":"smaller characters beside it. Inside lay a single sheet of note-paper and four sheets of verse-paper. Recognizing Zhongqing's calligraphy, Ziyu asked Jun'er who had delivered it. \\"It was brought by Young Master Yan's personal attendant,\\" Jun'er replied. Ziyu asked him to wait a moment, then broke the seal. The note read: \\"Yesterday, Yong'an and I sat together in a desolate"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"恂初稿\\n子玉看了道：「好诗。这四首之中，自然以《雪塔》为第一，《雪屏》第二，《雪山》次之，《雪灯》又次之。再看仲清的诗是：","en":"four, Snow Pagoda must rank first, Snow Screen second, Snow Mountain next, and Snow Lantern last. Now let us see Jiantan's:\\""},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":3,"tokens":["剑潭","仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"非耶。\\n春心已似沾泥絮，妾貌应同着雨花。\\n后夜思量成逝水，前身风味记煎茶。\\n卖珠侍婢今何在，倚竹无言日又斜。\\n剑潭仲清脱稿\\n子玉看毕，又轻轻的吟哦了几遍，觉得仲清这几首，《雪狮》镂金错彩，《雪猫》琢玉雕琼，《雪罗汉》吐属清芬，莲花满庭，《雪美人》双管齐下，玉茗风流，却在王恂之上。因想依韵再和八首，未必能如原唱浑成。不如另拟四题，不落窠臼。他这八个题目，都是从后着","en":"pearl-selling maidservant who attended her?\\nLeaning against the bamboo without a word, the sun slopes once more.\\n\\n—Jiantan Zhongqing, final draft.\\n\\nZiyu read through to the end, softly intoning the verses several times. He felt that of Zhongqing's four poems, Snow Lion was gilded and richly patterned; Snow Cat was carved of jade and finely chiseled; Snow Arhat exhaled a"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"那边仲清接着回札，与王恂同看。只见上写着：书奉朵云，词霏香雪。芙蓉灯灺佛塔玲珑；翡翠屏寒，指点仙山飘渺。白地现金身罗汉，狮驯拄杖之旁；缟衣来玉骨美人，狸睡棋抨之侧。新露盥手，古雪院浣；\\n明月自来，阳春寡和。赋诗七字，惭珠玉之在前；俚语四章，愧琼瑶之莫报。手疏","en":"On the other side, Zhongqing received the reply note and read it together with Wang Xun. It read: \\"Your letter arrived like a drift of cloud; the words fell like fragrant snow. The lotus-lantern guttered in the Buddha-pagoda's delicate glow; the kingfisher screen grew cold as one"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":1,"tokens":["剑潭"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"剑潭、庸庵两兄同览。子玉拜手。外附拙作四首，又七绝五律各一首，即乞郢正。","en":"\\"To Jiantan and Yong'an, both brothers, for their joint perusal. Ziyu, with clasped hands. Attached are four rough compositions of mine, along with one seven-character quatrain and one five-character regulated poem; please kindly correct them.\\""},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":2,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"仲清等再看子玉的诗题是：《雪意》、《雪影》、《雪声》、《雪色》。仲清向王恂道：「这四个题目太空，比我们更难着笔，庾香必有佳制。」说着看诗，只见上写着：","en":"Zhongqing and the others then looked at Ziyu's poem titles: Snow Feeling, Snow Shadow, Snow Sound, Snow Color. Zhongqing said to Wang Xun, \\"These four topics are entirely abstract—even harder to get a brush around than ours. Yuxiang is sure to have produced something"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"雪意\\n三千世界望盈盈，知有瑶花酝酿成。\\n未作花时先剪水，已同云上欲飞翔。\\n仲清道：「起句题前蓄势得好，第二联刻划意字，真是神化之笔。」再看下去是：","en":"Before becoming flower, it first cuts water into shapes;\\nalready, cloud-like, it is about to take wing and fly.\\n\\nZhongqing said, \\"The opening couplet builds fine momentum before the topic; the second couplet carves out the essence of the word 'feeling'—truly a stroke of divine transformation.\\" He read on:"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"虚白，依约栖尘漾软红。\\n飞入梅花痕始淡，舞回柳絮色都空。\\n清寒合称瑶池梦，琪树分明映月中，\\n王恂一句一击节。\\n仲清道：「这首把题的魂都勾出来了。」再看下去是：","en":"dream of the Jade Pool;\\nthe jade-tree branches glowing plainly in the moon.\\n\\nWang Xun applauded after every line. Zhongqing said, \\"This one has summoned the very soul of the topic.\\" He read on:"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":2,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"叶无心会着绿，梨云有梦竟堆黄。\\n浓浮珠露三分艳，淡借冰梅一缕香。\\n照眼空明难细认，白沙淡月两茫茫。\\n当下看完，仲清拍案叫绝，同王恂朗吟了几遍。仲清道：","en":"hard to examine closely;\\nwhite sands and pale moon—both fade into endless haze.\\n\\nWhen they had finished reading, Zhongqing struck the table in admiration, and he and Wang Xun chanted the poems aloud several times. Zhongqing said:"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":2,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「这几首诗，把我们的都压下去了。」再看聘才的那首绝句。王恂道：「这首亦甚好，只不知庾香又做这一首做什么？」仲清道：「这首也还下得去，然断不是庾香所作。」再看元茂的五律，起二句写着是：「天上彤云布，来思雨雪盈。」王恂道：「这「来思」两字怎么讲？」仲清忽然大笑道：「你往下看。」王恂再看第二联是：「白人双目近，长马四蹄轻。」沉吟道：「马蹄轻，想是用雪尽马蹄轻了。","en":"quatrain. Wang Xun said, \\"This one is also quite good, but what made Yuxiang compose this extra one on his own?\\" Zhongqing replied, \\"This one is passable, but it is certainly not Yuxiang's work.\\" They then looked at Yuanmao's five-character regulated poem. The opening couplet read:\\nIn the sky, vermilion clouds spread;\\nmy thoughts come—rain and snow fill to overflowing.\\nWang"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":5,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"。上句想是用《诗经》上的因为「麻衣如雪」这个雪字，遂把「蜉蝣掘阅」用上来了。这个挖空狮子又有什么典故在里头？」仲清道：「也不过说堆的雪狮子就是了。」再看结句是：「出时献世宝，六瑞太阶平。」王恂道：「这还用得着颂扬么？这首诗准是那个老魏做的。看他有些油腔滑调，自然就有这笑话出来。」仲清道：「不然，我看老魏，虽不是正路人；但看他像个聪明人，笨不至此。只怕那首七绝是他","en":"'burrowing mayfly' passage gets dragged in. And this 'digging out hollow lions'—what allusion is buried there?\\" Zhongqing explained, \\"It is simply saying that the snow-sculpted lion has been hollowed out, that is all.\\" They read the closing couplet:\\nGoing out, one presents world-treasures;\\nsix auspicious signs—the great steps are made smooth.\\nWang Xun said, \\"Is such flattery"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":2,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"工稳，用古入化，足可嗣响元徽。王恂把子玉的诗，用针在碧纱橱内戳了，来看批语，笑道：「却批得好，就是太挖苦些。」仲清道：「可惜天不早了，这雪也下不住，不然，倒可以去与庾香谈谈。」王恂道：「明日去罢！此刻去也谈不久了。」是日又下了一天一夜，积得有一尺厚了。次早晴了，朔风一吹，将一个世界，竟冻成了一个玉合子，耀眼鲜明。仲清、王恂早饭后，两人同坐一车，两个跟班骑了马，来","en":"succession of Yuanhui. Wang Xun used a needle to pin Ziyu's poems inside a translucent gauze cabinet, then read Zhongqing's comments and laughed. \\"The comments are well done, only slightly too barbed.\\" Zhongqing said, \\"What a pity it is already so late, and the snow will not hold off. Otherwise we could go and chat with Yuxiang.\\" Wang Xun said, \\"Let us go tomorrow! If we"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"之污，睨而视之，曰无伤也。今病小愈，不能不绥之斯来耳。」王恂笑了一笑道：「我回来就来的。」嗣徽应了，匆匆而去。仲清道：「此君无所不用其文，真荒唐可笑。这「虫蛀千字文」，真生可为名，死可为谥，世间想无第二人似他的了。」王恂笑道：「我看此君，只怕到敦伦时还要用两句文。","en":"and bring them around.\\" Wang Xun smiled and said, \\"I will come by when I return.\\" Sihui agreed and hurried away. Zhongqing said, \\"This gentleman deploys his literary style in every conceivable context—truly absurd and laughable. This 'worm-eaten Thousand Character Classic' style is fit to be his name in life and his posthumous title in death; I doubt there is a second person"},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"倒可惜了我们那个舅嫂，虽不生得十分怎样，但端庄贞静，不言不笑。嫁了这种人，真抱恨终身的了。」仲清笑道：「或者他倒有一长可取，也未可知的。」一路说说笑笑，已到了梅宅。","en":"silent and unsmiling. Having married this sort of man, truly she will harbor regret for the rest of her life.\\" Zhongqing laughed, \\"Perhaps he has one virtue that makes up for it; one never knows.\\" Talking and laughing all the way, they arrived at the Mei residence."},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":3,"tokens":["仲清","剑潭"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"门上通报了，子玉出来，迎了进去，便道：「两兄做得好诗，佩服之至。拙作草草涂鸦，未免小巫见大巫。」仲清道：「兄等所作，粗枝大叶，那里及得老弟的佳章，恬吟密咏，风雅宜人。」王恂道：「我最爱《雪意》、《雪色》这两首，清新俊逸，庾鲍兼长。」子玉道：「吾兄这四首，冰雪为怀，珠玑在手。那《雪山》、《雪塔》两首，起句破空而来，尤为超脱。至剑潭的诗中名句，如「奈他","en":"admiration is boundless. My own rough scribbles are inevitably a case of a minor shaman meeting a greater one.\\" Zhongqing replied, \\"What my brother and the others have done—how can it compare with your fine compositions, which repay repeated murmured recitation? Refined and fitting in every respect.\\" Wang Xun added, \\"What I love most are these two poems, Snow Feeling and"},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":8,"tokens":["颜仲清","仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"元茂出来，大家见了。子玉把各人的诗交给了，说道：「这都是颜大兄评定的，称赞得了不得。」聘才看了批语，暗想道：「颜仲清这人，真可谓博古通今，我用的戏曲，都被他看出来了。」当向仲清道了谢。仲清道：「魏兄诗笔甚俊，声律兼优，想是常做，倒像曲不离口的。」聘才道：「小弟本来没有底子，又抛荒了这几年，那里还成什么诗？不失黏就罢了。」子玉向仲清道：「聘兄的诗，却还不很离谱。」仲","en":"were made by Elder Brother Yan; he was most complimentary.\\" Pincai read the comment and thought to himself: \\"This Yan Zhongqing is truly versed in everything ancient and modern; even the opera tunes I borrowed were spotted by him.\\" He then went and thanked Zhongqing. Zhongqing said, \\"Brother Wei's poetic style is quite fine; both sound and rhythm are excellent. You must compose"},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":3,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"我看古人诗里也有把自己写在里面，就是这个意思。」王恂方才恍然。又说了一会闲话，仲清等告辞，子玉等送到门口，仲清道：「何不同出去看看雪景？」元茂听了，就高兴愿去。子玉道：「先生今日尚未全好，我们须在家伺候，改日再奉陪罢。」元茂撅了嘴不言语。仲清等告辞而去，子玉送出大门，进来与聘才、元茂又谈了一会诗，忽又问起琴官来。聘才见他有点意思，","en":"themselves into the poem. It was that intention.\\" Wang Xun suddenly understood. After more idle conversation, Zhongqing and Wang Xun said their farewells. Ziyu and the others escorted them to the door. Zhongqing suggested, \\"Why not come out with us to see the snow scenery?\\" Yuanmao, hearing this, was quite eager to go. Ziyu said, \\"The teacher has not fully recovered today."},{"paragraph":30,"mentions":5,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"再说仲清、王恂由南小街走到下洼子眺望，只见白茫茫一片，也辨不出田原路径，远远望见徐子云的怡园，琪树参差，烟岚回合，重重的层楼耀目，隐隐的高阁凌云。望了一会，只见对面一辆车来，车沿上坐的看见了，先跳了下来，随后看是一个相公，也要下车。仲清等连忙止住，那相公便挪","en":"To return to Zhongqing and Wang Xun: they walked out of South Small Street to the Low Hollow to take in the view. All was a vast expanse of white; fields and paths were indistinguishable. Far off they could see Xu Ziyun's Garden of Contentment, with its jadeite trees rising"},{"paragraph":31,"mentions":2,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"仲清索性叫把窗子开了，也望得好远地方。点了菜，三人闲谈了一会。春喜道：「这月里我们八个人，在怡园三日一聚，作消寒会，今日是第五会了。每一会必有一样顽意儿，或是行令，或是局戏。今日度香要叫我们做诗，出了个《冰床》题目，各人做七律一首，教苏媚香考了第一。」仲","en":"Zhongqing had the windows thrown open, and the view extended a great distance. They ordered food and chatted idly for a while. Chunxi said, \\"This month the eight of us have been holding gatherings at the Garden of Contentment every three days—a Winter Solstice"},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":2,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"蓬山路未通。\\n都说他运用灵妙，不着一死句，所以胜于他人。」王恂道：「你的呢？」春喜道」我的不好，也记不得了。」仲清道：「只怕你是第八了。」春喜嘻嘻的笑道：「被你一猜就猜着。」王恂道：「这难怪他，他方十四岁，若教他学上两年，怕赶不上他们？」春喜道：「我原不肯做的，他们定要我做。今日大家的诗，都也没有什么好，但就蕊香与我倒了平仄，因此蕊香定了第七，我定了第八，我以后","en":"he surpassed the others.\\" Wang Xun asked, \\"And yours?\\" Chunxi said, \\"Mine was not good; I cannot remember it.\\" Zhongqing teased, \\"I imagine you came eighth.\\" Chunxi laughed sheepishly, \\"You guessed it on the first try.\\" Wang Xun reasoned, \\"No wonder; he is only fourteen years old. If he were to study for two years, do you think he could not catch up with them?\\" Chunxi"},{"paragraph":33,"mentions":2,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这两人是要大出名的。就是琴官脾气冷些，不大好说话。」这边正在谈心，忽听对面楼上，窗子一响，也开了。仲清等举目看时见一个美少年，服饰甚都，身穿肃鸟霜裘，头戴紫貂冠，面如冠玉，唇若涂朱，目光眉彩觉有凌云之气，举止大雅，气象不凡。看他年纪，不过二十余岁的光景，带了四个相公，倚着楼窗而望。仲清、王恂暗暗吃惊：看他这品貌，足可与庾香匹敌，真是人中鸾凤。听他口音","en":"as they were deep in conversation here, suddenly the window on the opposite west balcony opened with a sound. Zhongqing and the others looked up to see a beautiful young man, splendidly dressed. He wore a white heron-frost fur cloak and a violet sable cap on his head. With a face like polished jade and lips red as if painted, his gaze was bright with something of a cloud-piercing"},{"paragraph":35,"mentions":5,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"仲清低低对王恂说道：「此人议论虽偏，但他别有会心，不肯随人俯仰之意已见。且其胸中必多积忿，故不喜和平而喜激越。丝声本哀，说胡琴非淫声，此却破俗之论，从没有人听得出来的。我看此人恰是我辈，决非庸庸碌碌的人，几时倒要访他一访。」王恂道：「听其语言，观其气度，","en":"Zhongqing said quietly to Wang Xun, \\"This man's views are partial, yet he has his own private understanding. His unwillingness to follow the common herd is already evident. Moreover his chest must hold much accumulated resentment, which is why he dislikes the"}],"5":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"前回说林春喜与仲清等，讲起在怡园作消寒赋诗之会。我今要将怡园之事序起来：有个公子班头，文人领袖，姓徐名子云，号度香，是浙江山阴县人。说他家世，真是当今数一数二的，七世簪缨之内，是祖孙宰相，父子尚书，兄弟督抚。单讲这位徐子云的本支，其父名震，由翰林出身，现做了大学士，总","en":"The previous chapter told of Lin Chunxi and Zhongqing discussing the poetry-gathering at the Garden of Contentment. Now let us set the stage for that garden. There was a prince among young noblemen, a leader of literary men, by the name of Xu Ziyun, style name Duxiang, a native of Shanyin County in Zhejiang."}],"6":[{"paragraph":23,"mentions":1,"tokens":["颜仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"玉尚是年轻，被这些老前辈，你一句我一句的赞，倒赞得他很不好意思。沈大人放了手，子玉等告退，来至东边楼上，王恂、颜仲清便迎上来，都作揖道：「我们已等久了，怎么这时候才来？」子玉道：「今日起迟了些，那孙大哥、孙二哥还没有来么？」王恂道：「也该快来了。」王、颜二人又与聘才、元茂款接了一番。只见对面楼上来了几个，先是右待郎的少君刘文泽做主，请了史给事的少君史南湘、吴阁学的","en":"released him, Ziyu and his companions excused themselves and ascended to the eastern upper floor. There, Wang Xun and Yan Zhongqing hurried to greet them, bowing and saying, \\"We have waited endlessly—how is it you've only just arrived?\\" Ziyu replied, \\"I rose a little late today. Have Elder Brother Sun and Second Brother Sun not yet arrived?\\" Wang Xun answered, \\"They should be here"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"当下王恂、仲清引了子玉过去，与他们一一见了，彼此都是年谊世交，各叙了些仰慕之意。刘文泽道：「庸庵，你请客怎么不通知我一声。就是你请这二位生客，我们在一处也很好，何必又要另坐在那边。」王恂笑道：「不是我定要与你们分开，庾香是不用说的，就是这李、魏二位长兄，也是最有趣","en":"Wang Xun and Zhongqing guided Ziyu over, facilitating introductions. Bound by examination-year ties and family connections, they exchanged warm pleasantries. Liu Wenze said, \\"Yong'an, when arranging this banquet, why didn't you inform me? Even these two guest-friends of yours"},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":1,"tokens":["颜仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"好，也不必推让，随意坐最好」。大家都要远着孙氏弟兄，便乱坐起来。刘文泽、沈伯才、巴霖、张仲雨坐了一席；史南湘、颜仲清、高品拉了子玉过来，坐了一席；聘才、元茂坐了一席；嗣徽、嗣元坐了一席，王恂只好两席轮流作陪。孙嗣徽又之乎者也的闹了一会，问了魏、李二位姓名、籍贯。一面就摆上菜喝酒。高品见嗣徽的脸上疙瘩更多了好些，喝了几杯酒，那个红鼻子如经霜辣子，通红光亮。","en":"everyone scrambled for seats. Liu Wenze, Shen Bocai, Ba Lin, and Zhang Zhongyu claimed one table; Shi Nanxiang, Yan Zhongqing, and Gao Pin pulled Ziyu to a second; Pincai and Yuanmao took a third; leaving Sihui and Siyuan isolated at the fourth, with Wang Xun moving between tables to act as host. Sun Sihui, adopting his pedantic \\"the Master says\\" persona, began interrogating"},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":1,"tokens":["颜仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"睛索落落的滴泪，说道：「我、我、我有一句：红红红红而光，一一一一团火球飞上床。」众人笑得难忍，将要高声笑起来。颜仲清道：「这一烧真烧得个红而光了。」高品道：「这一烧倒烧成了孙老二的三字经。」众人不解其说，高品道：「那救火的时候，自然说来、来、来！快、快、快！救、救、救！搬什物的抢、抢、抢！逃命的跑、跑、跑！风是呼、呼、呼！火是烘、烘、烘！烧着东西，爆起来哔、哔、哔","en":"sh-sh-sh-shiny—a-a-a-a fireball f-f-f-flies up onto the b-b-bed.\\" The crowd laughed uncontrollably, nearly shouting in amusement. Yan Zhongqing said, \\"With a fire like that, it truly becomes entirely red and shiny.\\" Gao Pin added, \\"That fire has inspired Old Second Sun's Three-Character Classic.\\" When the others looked puzzled, Gao Pin explained, \\"During a fire, people naturally yell: 'Come,"},{"paragraph":33,"mentions":2,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"看得出神，便问南湘道：「这是谁？有此秀骨。」南湘道：「这个算好吗，只怕也难入品题。」子玉知南湘故意讥诮他，便问仲清，仲清道：「这就是《花选》上第二的瑶台璧月苏蕙芳。」子玉叹道：「天地钟灵尽于此矣，我竟如夏虫不可语冰，难怪竹君怪我。」南湘哈哈大笑道：「我也不怪的，幸你自行检举。」文泽道：「怎么？庾香连苏媚香也不认识。」南湘道：「他是秀才不出门，焉知天下事。」少顷《","en":"I'm afraid he barely registers on the rankings.\\" Knowing Nanxiang was intentionally baiting him, Ziyu turned to Zhongqing. Zhongqing explained, \\"This is the Selection of Flowers's number two — Su Huifang, A Jade Moon over the Jasper Terrace.\\" Ziyu marveled, \\"All the spiritual essence of heaven and earth is concentrated here. I was truly a summer insect, unable to conceive"},{"paragraph":36,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"了饭，又听了他们几出戏，才放我走，还是急急的赶出来的。」子玉同了元茂、聘才告辞，诸人都送到楼门口，文泽、王恂、仲清送下楼来。","en":"Pincai, bid their farewells; the entire group accompanied them to the staircase landing, with Wenze, Wang Xun, and Zhongqing escorting them all the way downstairs."},{"paragraph":37,"mentions":1,"tokens":["剑潭"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"文泽对子玉道：「初九日弟备小酌，屈吾兄一叙，作个清谈雅集。人不多，就是竹君、剑潭、庸庵、卓然几位，吾兄断不可推辞。」子玉应允，又谢了。王恂、聘才、元茂也同道了谢，一径先回。那些人又谈了一会，也各散去。不知后事如何，且听下回分解。","en":"will honor us with a visit—a refined discourse and elegant assembly. It will be an intimate group: just Zhujun, Jiantan, Yong'an, Zhuoran, and a few others. Elder Brother must absolutely not decline.\\" Ziyu agreed, expressing his deep gratitude. Wang Xun, Pincai, and Yuanmao offered their thanks in turn before departing. The remaining guests lingered in conversation for"}],"7":[{"paragraph":6,"mentions":3,"tokens":["颜仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"且说文泽所请的容颜仲清、王恂、史南湘已经到了，随后梅子玉、高品一同到门。家人引着走过大厅，到了花厅之旁垂花门进去，系石子砌成的一条甬道，两边都是太湖石迭成高高低低的假山，衬着参参差差的寒树。远远望去，却也有台有亭，布置得十分幽雅。转了两三个弯，过了一座石桥，甬路旁是一色的","en":"At Wenze's residence, the invited guests—Yan Zhongqing, Wang Xun, and Shi Nanxiang—had already arrived, followed shortly by Mei Ziyu and Gao Pin at the gate. A servant guided them past the main hall, through a flowered gate beside the reception hall, and onto a pebble-paved path. On either side, irregular"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":10,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「今日我们可为软红尘中，一时雅集。」仲清坐在高品肩下，高品即凑着仲清耳边轻轻的说了一句，仲清哑然失笑。众人问仲清道：「他说什么？」仲清向高品道：「我说罢。」高品摇了摇头。仲清道：「那第七字对得尤妙。」说着两人相视而笑。南湘最是性急，便道：「你们说了，我情愿吃一杯。」高品道：「喝十杯再说。」","en":"\\"Today, amidst the red dust of the world, we can enjoy a fleeting moment of refined assembly.\\" Zhongqing was seated just below Gao Pin. Gao Pin leaned close to Zhongqing's ear and whispered something, causing Zhongqing to break into a silent laugh. The others asked Zhongqing, \\"What did he say?\\" Zhongqing turned to Gao Pin, \\"Shall I tell them?\\" Gao Pin shook"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":3,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"好一杯，如何？」南湘道：「也要看上对出得难不难，你且说来。」文泽向子玉道：「要借重大名，就是「子玉人如玉」。」仲清道：「这倒不容易呢。」一语未了，高品道：「我已对着了，你喝三杯。」文泽道：「你说。」南湘道：「如果对得好，我们还要公贺一杯。」高品笑道：「卯金面是金」。何如？」王恂道：「卯金对子玉却是绝对。」南湘道：「就是「面是金」欠典切些。」高品道：「典虽不典，切","en":"line is. Let's hear it.\\" Wenze turned to Ziyu, \\"I must borrow your esteemed name: 'Ziyu is like jade' (子玉人如玉).\\" Zhongqing said, \\"That won't be easy.\\" Before he could finish, Gao Pin said, \\"I've got it. Drink your three cups.\\" Wenze challenged, \\"Let's hear it.\\" Nanxiang chimed in, \\"If it's truly good, we must all drink a toast.\\" Gao Pin smiled and recited, \\"'Maojin's face"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":8,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"文泽道「双」字，仲清对「孤」字，高品对「八」，字子玉对「九」字，王恂道：「不好了，顺着数儿就是十罢。」南湘道：「是了，我这个字倒有些难下，也罢，对「三」字罢。」文泽道「辇」宇。南湘道：「我晓得一定是这句诗。」子玉抢对了一个「琴」字，王恂对了「车」字，南湘对了「船」字，只","en":"Wenze presented '双' (Double/Pair): Zhongqing matched '孤' (Solitary), Gao Pin matched '八' (Eight), Ziyu matched '九' (Nine), and Wang Xun lamented, \\"Oh no, I suppose I must follow the sequence with '十' (Ten).\\" Nanxiang pondered, \\"That's right, my character is a bit tricky to place. Very well, I'll"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":2,"tokens":["剑潭","仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"再看子玉对的是「九鸾天上听琴来」。大家赞道：「这句真对得字字稳惬，又在剑潭之上。」于是公贺了一杯。南湘对的是「三鸦水上送船归」。文泽道：「竹君此对，未免杂凑。」南湘道：「你这试官，少所见而多所怪，要挖眼睛了。这才对得工呢。」子玉道：「真对得好。」文泽道：「这个我倒要请教请教。」子玉道：「三鸦水上一归人，是韩翃的诗。」文泽恍","en":"hear the lute. (九鸾天上听琴来)' Everyone praised it: \\"This matches perfectly character by character, and it surpasses Jiantan's.\\" Thus, they offered a congratulatory toast. Nanxiang's match read: 'Three crows on the water send the boat returning. (三鸦水上送船归)' Wenze critiqued, \\"Zhujun's match is a bit rough around the edges.\\" Nanxiang shot back, \\"You're just an examiner with little"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":2,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"得这样。如果实在说得好，免罚何妨。」南湘道：「若说了，非但不能免罚，还要倍罚。」文泽道：「莫非又是糟蹋我么？」仲清道：「然也。」文泽道：「只要糟蹋得有理，罚酒也可以少减。」高品道：「想来五杯是不能免的。若要再加，万万来不得了，只好不说罢。」文泽道：「不加就是了。」高品道：「把我的对句，倒转来念，你说好不好？」子玉同玉恂、文泽暗暗的念了一遍，都不觉鼓掌大笑起来，子","en":"tells you, not only will the fine stand, it will be doubled.\\" Wenze narrowed his eyes, \\"Is he mocking me again?\\" Zhongqing nodded, \\"Precisely.\\" Wenze reasoned, \\"As long as the mockery has merit, the fine can be reduced.\\" Gao Pin chimed in, \\"I suppose five cups are unavoidable. If you add more, I absolutely refuse. Better I say nothing.\\" Wenze relented, \\"No additions, then.\\""},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":11,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，子玉作令官，一个个出了四字，是「费影收肠」。南湘对的是「惊声放胆」，王恂是「融香浣乳」，文泽是「翻么小舌」，仲清是「多仙散发」，独高品对得别致，是「除伊放粪」，大家看了已经发笑。子玉又出了一个「台」字，南湘道：「这句好生。」沉吟了一会，对了「馆」字，王恂对「屋」，文泽对「榭」，仲清对「岛」，高品道：「我住在宏济寺里，就对「寺」。」子玉又出了一个「鸾」字，南湘道","en":"Wang Xun matched '融香浣乳' (melt, fragrance, wash, milk); Wenze matched '翻么小舌' (flip, tiny-note, small, tongue); Zhongqing matched '多仙散发' (many, immortals, loosened, hair); while Gao Pin, as distinctive as ever, offered '除伊放粪' (remove, Yi, release, excrement)—already bringing smiles to their faces. Ziyu then put forth the character '台' (stage/terrace). Nanxiang noted, \\"This"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"高品道：「我的「鸟」与「雀」总是一样，你的「鸟」字若换了「雀」字不好么？」文泽想了一想，却也有理。子玉就只取了仲清、王恂两副对句，其余文泽、高品罚了酒。","en":"wouldn't that also be an improvement?\\" Wenze considered this and conceded the point. Ultimately, Ziyu accepted only Zhongqing's and Wang Xun's matching lines as passing; Wenze and Gao Pin were penalized with wine."},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":3,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"」字，文泽对「夏」字，高品对「正」字。王恂道：「平对平使得么？」众人道：「使得，已经对过了。」王恂道「晨」字，仲清是「秋」字，子玉是「冬」字。南湘又出「月」字。高品道：「竹君的心思与众不同，这两字必定不连的，我对「阳」字。」王恂对「霜」，子玉对「雪」，仲清对「空」。文泽道：「管他连不连，我们只管对我们的。」对了「云」字。南湘出了一个「三」字，高品道：「何如，不是","en":"another level-tone?\\" The group agreed, \\"Certainly—it has been done before.\\" Wang Xun matched '晨' (morning/dawn), Zhongqing matched '秋' (autumn), and Ziyu matched '冬' (winter). Nanxiang then offered '月' (moon). Gao Pin noted, \\"Zhujun's thinking is always unconventional—these two characters surely won't connect logically, so I'll match '阳' (sun/sunlight).\\" Wang Xun matched"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「兔」字。你们对罢。」王恂道：「貉」字。」仲清道：「鹰能制兔，我对「鹰」字。」子玉道：「骑着驴子放鹰，想来是没有的，且借他来对对，就是「驴」字。」文泽道：","en":"''兔' (rabbit). Match it, all of you.' Wang Xun offered '貉' (badger). Zhongqing reasoned, 'The eagle masters the rabbit—I match '鹰' (eagle).' Ziyu pondered, 'A donkey-rider flying a hawk is likely unheard of, but I'll borrow it for the match—'驴' (donkey).' Wenze said:"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":1,"tokens":["剑潭"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"还要题目么？我是一顺出的「春月三改兔」五字，内中前舟的「夏云半堆乌」，「乌」字原也借对得好。然凭文取之，究不若剑潭的「秋空一盘鹰」浑脱，还该让他第一。庾香的「冬雪一敲驴」，庸庵的「晨霜一丰貂」，都对得很工。最不好的是卓然的「正阳一伏龟」，这「正阳」二字如何加得上？」高品笑问文泽道：「贵处是那里？」","en":"half-stacked raven (夏云半堆乌)' borrows the 'raven' character quite effectively. Yet in pure composition, it cannot rival Jiantan's 'Autumn sky one-wheel eagle (秋空一盘鹰)'—so pure and unrestrained; it deserves first place. Yuxiang's 'Winter snow one-knock donkey (冬雪一敲驴)' and Yong'an's 'Morning frost one-lush sable (晨霜一丰貂)' are both skillfully matched. The worst is Zhuoran's 'Upright-sun"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":2,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"以下仲清做令官，一个个字出的对是「丝发白日如新」六字，高品属的是「签毛朱天入长」。子玉对的是「镜颜华年对好。」南湘是「竹唇朱声吹慢。」王恂是「剪衣乌时试拂」。文泽是「草麻黄朝起视」。仲清写出上联是「白发如丝日日新」。","en":"Next, Zhongqing served as game-master, presenting six characters for everyone to match: '丝发白日如新' (silk, hair, white, day, as, new). Gao Pin assembled: '签毛朱天入长' (signature, feather, vermilion, sky, enter, long). Ziyu matched: '镜颜华年对好' (mirror, complexion, glorious, year,"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"二，南湘的「朱唇吹竹声声慢」夹圈了，取了第三。大家都道：「这两副对都好，似乎竹君的较胜。令官甲乙，似不甚公。」仲清道：「这两本卷子都好，是不用说的。","en":"matches are excellent—it seems Zhujun's is actually superior. The judge's ranking doesn't seem entirely fair.\\" Zhongqing explained, \\"That both these submissions are exceptional goes without saying."},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":4,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"人很服。南湘向来不肯让人，此时亦甚首肯。高品道：「然则我以「天」对「日」，比庾香的更好，为什么又不取我的呢？」仲清道：「等我写出来，你讲给我听。」先写王恂的是「乌衣试剪时时拂」。众人道：「这句也自然得很。」仲清道：「这回考试，除了卓然，原是一榜尽赐及第的。」高品笑道：「留心眼睛，我这本卷子是打不得的。」仲清写出看时，是「朱毛入笠天天长」。仲清用笔叉了几叉，大家看","en":"interjected, \\"But my use of 'sky' to match 'day' is even better than Yuxiang's—why was my submission ignored?\\" Zhongqing replied, \\"Write it out and explain it.\\" He first wrote Wang Xun's: 'Raven-black robes, newly cut and tried on, brushed smooth time after time. (乌衣试剪时时拂)' The group agreed, \\"This line also flows quite naturally.\\" Zhongqing concluded, \\"In this round, aside"},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":2,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"南湘笑道：「这古典甚长，只说够他对的就是了。」文泽问道：「在什么书上？」仲清道：「《史氏外编》。」王恂、文泽才明白过来，复又笑声大作。高品道：「你们混说乱道，难道《四子书》都记不得？这就是《孟子》所说一毛不拔、追豚入笠之扬朱，所以谓之「朱毛入笠」。这才算得用古入化呢。」仲清道：「那「天天长」三字怎讲？」高品道：「你这试官真是","en":"allusion is rather long—enough has been said to serve the match.\\" Wenze asked, \\"In what book is this recorded?\\" Zhongqing replied, \\"Outer Compilation of Mr. Shi.\\" Wang Xun and Wenze finally understood, breaking into fresh peals of laughter. Gao Pin retorted, \\"You're all spouting nonsense—haven't you memorized *The Four Books*? This comes directly from Mencius's description"},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"然后王恂作令官，出的是「香尽南人消国美。」文泽对的是」曲多东妓谱山名」。仲清对的是「赋难东士炼都学」。高品对的是「斗长西圣驾方齐」。","en":"beautiful country. (香尽南人消国美)' Wenze matched: 'Many tunes, Eastern entertainers compose mountain-names. (曲多东妓谱山名)' Zhongqing matched: 'Rhapsody difficulty, Eastern scholars, refined, capital learning. (赋难东士炼都学)' Gao Pin matched: 'Combat long, Western sages, conveyed, region, equal-level. (斗长西圣驾方齐)'"},{"paragraph":31,"mentions":2,"tokens":["仲清","剑潭"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"名」。南湘的是」图多西士画名园」。一一对毕，王恂写出出句，是「香销南国美人尽」。文泽对的是「曲谱东山名妓多。」仲清是「赋炼东都学士难」。高品是「斗驾西方齐圣长」。子玉是「情感西昆名旦深」。南湘是「图画西园名士多。」王恂道：「这第一不消说是竹君了。庾香「名旦」二字不典，不及剑潭的浑成，只怕第二是他。前舟次之。卓兄这句，我实在不懂，若有典故在内，不妨说明，不要批屈了","en":"gone. (香销南国美人尽)' Wenze's assembled match: 'Tunes composed of Eastern Mountain—many famous courtesans. (曲谱东山名妓多)' Zhongqing's: 'Rhapsodies forged in the Eastern Capital—difficult for scholars. (赋炼东都学士难)' Gao Pin's: 'Contest-drive the Western region—the sages in long seniority. (斗驾西方齐圣长)' Ziyu's: 'Deep feeling moves the Western Kun—famous dan-performer of profound sentiment."},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":2,"tokens":["仲清","剑潭"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"高品道：「我没有见过主考阅文要请教士子。典故却有，若告诉了你，只说我通关节中的了。」仲清道：「他这典故，出在东土大唐。」高品道：「剑潭是主考至亲，倒应回避，不许乱说。」原来王恂却没有看过《西游记》，只管呆呆的看着粉板。南湘正在喝酒，忽见高品用手搭着凉篷。","en":"their allusions. There is indeed an allusion, but if I reveal it, you'll accuse me of manipulating the exam.\\" Zhongqing interjected, \\"His allusion stems from the Eastern Land of the Great Tang.\\" Gao Pin shot back, \\"Jiantan is a close kinsman of the chief examiner—he should recuse himself and remain silent.\\" It transpired that Wang Xun had never read *Journey to the West*,"},{"paragraph":35,"mentions":2,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"末了是高品出令。高品一口气说了六个字，是「千里言召禾口」。仲清想道：「通共只有七个字，他一说就是六个，难道不怕人想着么？必是用拆字法来混人」。便道：「你这六个字可是「重诏和」三字么？若不说明。我们就罢考了。」高品被他猜着，只得笑嘻嘻的点点头。子玉对了「卓言贯」三字，南湘对了「品阳长」三字，王恂对了「一龄庆」三字","en":"lead. He rattled off six characters in a single breath: '千里言召禾口' (thousand, li, speech, summon, grain, mouth). Zhongqing mused, \\"That's only seven characters total, yet he delivers six at once. Does he really think no one will see through it? He must be employing the character-decomposition method to confound us.\\" He challenged, \\"Could your six characters form the three"},{"paragraph":36,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"仲清道：「这倒不是拆字的，我就对「一高标兔」。」文泽道：「我就对「一欢心鸡」。」王恂道：「我对「第长年龟」。」子玉对了「超元精人」，南湘对了「一精神龙。」高品背着人写了上联，搁着笔，把大众的看了一回，鼻子里笑了一笑，就用纸蘸着酒，把粉板上的字一齐擦了。众","en":"Zhongqing said, \\"This one clearly isn't character-decomposition. I'll match '一高标兔' (one-high-mark-rabbit).\\" Wenze followed, \\"I'll match '一欢心鸡' (one-joy-heart-rooster).\\" Wang Xun added, \\"I'll match '第长年龟' (rank-long-year-tortoise).\\" Ziyu matched: '超元精人' (surpassing-primal-refined-person)."},{"paragraph":37,"mentions":3,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"好的么？」南湘道：「不是，不是，如果不好，他必定写出来把人取笑了。我想想他出的那几个字，凑起来看是一句什么。」仲清道：「他写的时候，我瞧见起头是「凤诏」两个字。」子玉想了想道：「莫非「凤诏九重和喜气」这句诗？」南湘道：「一点不错。」高品道：「不是，不是。」仲清道：「我们且各自记出对句来，就明白了。」子玉道：「我的「人言超卓贯元精」这句却不见好，也没有什么不通。」","en":"subject everyone to ridicule. Let me ponder the characters he provided... assembled, what line do they form?\\" Zhongqing recalled, \\"While he was writing, I caught a glimpse of 'feng zhao' (phoenix-decree) at the beginning.\\" Ziyu thought for a moment, \\"Could it be 'The phoenix-decree from the nine heavens brings harmonious joyful air (凤诏九重和喜气)'?\\" Nanxiang confirmed, \\"Exactly"},{"paragraph":38,"mentions":3,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"点缀得很幽雅。」文泽道：「这算什么园子，不及徐度香怡园十分之一，几时我同你去逛逛。」这里宾主二人讲着，那高品对仲清道：「你可晓得京里又来了一个精品么？」仲清笑道：「想是高品的弟兄。」高品道：「这人却也可以做得我的弟兄，闻他也是南京人，现寓在宏济寺内，却没有与他往来。看他人甚风雅，而光景很阔。你可晓得是什么人？」仲清道：「这又奇了，你们同在庙里倒不认得，来问我。」","en":"Duxiang's Garden of Contentment. Someday I'll take you there for a stroll.\\" As host and guest conversed, Gao Pin asked Zhongqing, \\"Did you know another exceptional individual has recently arrived in the capital?\\" Zhongqing smiled, \\"I suppose it must be one of your brothers.\\" Gao Pin clarified, \\"He could indeed be my brother. I hear he is also from Nanjing and currently lodging"}],"9":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"来说道：「刘少爷、颜少爷、王少爷，请少爷出去逛灯，都在门口等着。」子玉禀过父母，梅进即叫套了车，云儿跟着出来。仲清等却在车里等着，见子玉出来便下了车。刘文泽道：「如此良宵，千金一刻，我们趁着灯月，倒是步行好些，把车跟在后头，回来再坐罢。」子玉道：「甚好。」四人慢慢的走，一路闲谈，不多时就到了灯市。","en":"waiting at the gate.\\" Ziyu reported to his parents, Mei Jin had the carriage harnessed, and Yun'er followed along. Zhongqing and the others were waiting in the carriage, stepping down when they saw Ziyu emerge. Liu Wenze said: \\"On such a fine night, worth a thousand gold pieces, let us take advantage of the lantern-lit moon and walk. That would be much better. We can have"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"文泽扯扯王恂的衣服，低低的说道：「你看似为着庾香，要显显他的莲瓣。」王恂点头。仲清又在文泽后面说道：「焉知他不是为着你？」文泽笑道：「不像。」又低低的叫道：「庾香，那《施公案》有什么好看，你尽望着那几对灯。」子玉回转脸来，却与那少妇相对，见那少妇还在玻璃窗内看他，颇觉不好意思。","en":"murmured softly: \\"Look, it seems she is taken with Yuxiang and wishes to show off her lotus feet.\\" Wang Xun nodded. Zhongqing, standing behind Wenze, added: \\"How do you know it is not you she fancies?\\" Wenze laughed: \\"I do not think so.\\" Then he called quietly: \\"Yuxiang, what is there to look at in 'Cases of Magistrate Shi'? You keep staring at those pairs of lanterns.\\" Ziyu"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":2,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"挤了过去。听得有个妇人说道：「这些爷们实在可恨，睁着大眼睛瞧人，难道他家里没有娘儿们的，故意挡了路不放人走。」仲清等听了大笑。王恂道：「真晦气，被他这一脚，踏得我很痛，他还说我们挡了路看他。」子玉方定了神，说道：「我方才被他这一揪；真唬杀我。我当他认错了人，不要动手打起来，这不是晦气？不料妇女中，竟有这样蠢材。较起才见的车中人，真又有天壤之隔了。」文泽哈哈大笑道","en":"people. Can it be there are no women at home, that they block the road on purpose and will not let anyone pass?\\" Zhongqing and the others heard this and burst out laughing. Wang Xun said: \\"What rotten luck. That woman's foot hurt me badly, and she still says we blocked the road to stare at her.\\" Ziyu had just recovered his composure and said: \\"Just now when she grabbed me"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":6,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"亭子，墙上一盏扁方玻璃灯，上贴着许多字条，底下围着一簇，约有二十来人。走上亭子台阶，却已看见迎面写着八个灯谜。仲清将要看时，只见怡园的家人上来请安，说：「少爷们何不到里边逛逛？」文泽即问他主人，那人说道：「我们老爷在外赴席未回，萧老爷在家。」王恂道：「我们猜了几个灯谜。再进去不迟。」于是同看第一个是：「双栖稳宿无烦恼，认得卢家玳瑁梁。」下注《礼记》一句。子玉正在","en":"people had gathered. Climbing the pavilion steps, they found eight lantern riddles written out facing them. Just as Zhongqing was about to read them, a Garden of Contentment servant came up to greet them and said: \\"Why not come inside to look around?\\" Wenze asked about the host, and the man replied: \\"Our master is out at a dinner and has not returned, but Master Xiao is at"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":2,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「第七句「鸦儿卅六双飞稳」不消说是《乌生八九子》了。」仲清道：「末句「应向章台送远人」，大约是《折杨柳》。就是第五条「降生辰巳之年」，打《诗经》一句，及第八条「不着一字尽得风流」打《唐诗》一句，猜不着。」正说着，只听得有人问道：「降生辰巳之年，可是「维虺维蛇」？」园门口的人回说不是。文泽道：「不要给人抢去了","en":"line, 'Thirty-six pairs of crows fly in steady formation,' is unmistakably 'The Crow Has Eight or Nine Young'.\\" Zhongqing said: \\"The last line, 'She should send the distant traveler on the road to Zhangtai,' must be 'Breaking the Willow'. As for the fifth entry, 'Born in the years of chen and si', based on a line from *The Classic of Poetry*, and the eighth entry, 'Not"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"见文泽、仲清、王恂三人一齐迎上前来，称呼他为静宜先生。那人与三人见了礼，又向子玉作了个揖，子玉连忙还礼。","en":"Wenze, Zhongqing, and Wang Xun all stepped forward at once to greet him, addressing him as Master Jingyi. The man exchanged courtesies with the three, then bowed to Ziyu, who hastened to return the salutation."},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":2,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"壁之下，一带雕窗细格的五间卷棚、檐下挂着一色的二十多盏西番莲洋琉璃灯。次贤让进屋内，分宾主坐下。与文泽、王恂、仲清都是认识的，单与子玉叙了些倾心仰慕的话。子玉见他出言有体，举止不凡，也知道是个名士，便也颇为浃洽。谈了一会，用过了茶，有书童从里间出来，送出一分一分的灯谜彩来，摆在桌上，是些湖笔，徽墨、端砚、雅扇之类，惟有子玉所猜的「落花人独立，微雨燕双飞」的彩最重","en":"type. Cixian invited them inside, and guest and host took their seats. He was acquainted with Wenze, Wang Xun, and Zhongqing, and had only an exchange of heartfelt admiration to make with Ziyu. Ziyu, seeing his speech proper and his bearing extraordinary, knew this was a man of distinction, and the two found themselves thoroughly congenial. After some conversation and tea,"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"香随嘱次贤，以词意为琴言写图，所以这灯谜即以琴作彩，原是于游戏之中，寓作合之意。非但子玉不知杜玉侬为何人，就是仲清、文泽等也未能悉。大家问时，次贤不即说明，答以久后必知。","en":"within the playful game the intention of making a match. Not only did Ziyu not know who Du Yunong was, but even Zhongqing, Wenze, and the others had not been fully informed. When everyone asked, Cixian did not immediately explain, replying only that all would be known in due time."},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"闲谈了一回，仲清说起都中值此试灯时节，可惜无南来巧灯，殊为减色。","en":"They conversed idly for a time. Zhongqing said that it was a pity that the capital, despite being in the very season of lantern-viewing, had no southern-style novelty lanterns, a considerable diminishment of the festival's splendor."},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":2,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"走进亭内，地下铺着栽绒毯子，中间一张大圆桌，周围都是扇面式凳子，拼起来，刚刚扣着桌子一个圈儿。仲清等因是夜天气不寒，就在外面回阑上坐着，小厮们抬了些圆茶几来，每人面前一张，送了茶，仰观淡月朦胧，疏星布列；俯视流烟淡沱，空水澄鲜，颇觉心旷神怡。远远望去，只见回峦迭嶂，飞阁层楼，隐隐约约，看视不明，尚未见一盏灯火。忽见亭子前面太湖石山洞，一对明灯照出","en":"stools, fitted together in a perfect circle that precisely encircled the table. Because the night air was mild, Zhongqing and the others sat on the outer gallery railing. Page-boys brought round tea-tables, one before each guest, and tea was served. Looking upward, a hazy moon shed diffuse light, and sparse stars lay scattered. Looking downward, drifting mist hung light"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「你们好，你们好……」便说不出来，小厮先拿了一碗温水与他漱了口，又说道：「你们好乐！」仲清道：「你且坐下，歇歇再说。」扶上亭子，他就坐在地下，宝珠等上去见他，他把头点点。文泽道：「你在那里喝得这样？」南湘又摇摇头。宝珠到次贤耳边说了几句话，次贤命小厮去拿了一个小小的金盒子，取出一丸药来，放在碗内，用开水化了，递给宝珠，捧到南湘身边，弯了腰","en":"brought a bowl of warm water for him to rinse his mouth, then he managed: \\"What a fine time you are all having!\\" Zhongqing said: \\"Sit down first. Rest and then tell us.\\" They helped him up into the pavilion, and he sat on the floor. Baozhu and the others went up to greet him, and he nodded to them. Wenze asked: \\"Where have you been drinking to reach this state?\\" Nanxiang"},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":2,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"不多一会，只见南湘已开了门走将出来，说道：「有趣，有趣！几作了刘玄石一醉三年，险些儿被人埋在地下。」仲清道：「你酒已醒了，还说醉话。」漱芳已拧了一块湿手巾来，南湘擦了脸道：「这是什么地方？」众人皆笑，次贤笑道：「竹君，这是黄鹤楼，你怎么认不清了？」南湘近前一看，狂笑起来，说道：「原来静宜也在这里，你们到底几时来的？」众人听了又笑，宝珠、漱芳拉他到亭外看","en":"Delightful! I nearly became Liu Xuanshi who slept a drunken sleep of three years. I was nearly buried alive.\\" Zhongqing said: \\"Your head has cleared, so why are you still talking drunken nonsense?\\" Shufang had wrung out a damp cloth. Nanxiang wiped his face and asked: \\"Where are we?\\" Everyone laughed. Cixian smiled and said: \\"Zhujun, this is Yellow Crane Tower. How can"},{"paragraph":30,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"于是漱芳拉了王恂下棋，文泽观局。子玉同宝珠看那墨兰，赞不绝口；南湘、仲清、次贤同坐在醉翁床闲话。南湘道：「静宜兄，还记得「只有酒狂名下士，醉吟许上岳阳楼」佳句否？」","en":"chess while Wenze looked on. Ziyu and Baozhu admired the ink-painted orchid, praising it without end. Nanxiang, Zhongqing, and Cixian sat together on the Drunken-Scholar's Couch in easy conversation. Nanxiang said: \\"Brother Jingyi, do you still recall those fine lines: 'Only the poet-drunkard is famed among the scholars; drunk and chanting, he may ascend Yueyang Tower'?\\""},{"paragraph":31,"mentions":3,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"次贤道：「那里及得「只恨仙人丹药少，不教酒满洞庭湖」名句足传。」仲清道：「若教酒满洞庭湖，只怕史竹君早已醉死了。静宜先生，明日可与他写个竹醉图。」次贤点头微笑。子玉乘他们说话时，悄悄的问宝珠道：「这两天可曾见你们同班的琴官？」宝珠听了，把子玉打量了一番，问道：「你同琴官相好么？」倒把子玉问住了，很不好意思，只得答道：","en":"'I only grieve that the immortals' elixir is scarce, preventing wine from filling the whole of Dongting Lake.'\\" Zhongqing said: \\"If wine filled Dongting Lake, I fear Shi Zhujun would long since have drunk himself to death. Master Jingyi, why not paint him a 'Drunken Bamboo' picture tomorrow.\\" Cixian nodded and smiled faintly. Taking advantage of the others' conversation,"},{"paragraph":35,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"仲清道：「这两封情书，就不是灯谜，也香艳极了。况且隐藏药名、花名，恰切不移。这猜着的人，真是个绝世聪明人了，可借不知是谁？」文泽道：「这两封书，都是静宜先生的手笔么？」次贤道：「那封原书，是度香的手笔。」说着，王恂已经下完了棋，倒输了漱芳三子。子玉因夜色","en":"Zhongqing said: \\"These two love-letters, even setting aside the riddle element, are supremely fragrant and beautiful in their own right. Moreover the concealed herb names and flower names fit each context perfectly without the slightest strain. The person clever"}],"12":[{"paragraph":15,"mentions":3,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，自我失之，亦复何憾？」二人正讲得热闹，忽见高品的下人来说：「颜少爷来拜老爷。」高品即出去，到了自己屋里，见了仲清坐下，问有好几日不见，仲清道：「自从灯节逛灯之后，便着了凉，病了好几日，已有半个多月不曾出门，在家也闷。」就说起灯节晚上南湘的醉态来，高品笑道：「那一天我也在坐，也醉得了不得了。我是乘间脱逃，不然也要波及无辜，难道去向酒糟头索命么？」于是大家又讲起怡","en":"Pin's came to say: \\"Young Master Yan has come to call on you, sir.\\" Gao Pin went out to his own room and found Zhongqing seated there. Asking where he had been for so many days, Zhongqing replied: \\"After viewing the lanterns on the festival night, I caught a chill and fell ill for several days — I have not left home for more than half a month and was growing restless indoors.\\""},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「这湘帆怎样的人？」高品道：「也是我辈。我去年对你说过的：样样精致，是个精品。如今是样样精光了。」仲清笑问：「怎样？」高品便将他方才的议论，与到京所为的事，一一说了。又道：「此人却真可惜，才貌双全，胸襟阔大，就是爱闹，太无收束。他也是你们金陵人，此时住家扬州。他说他的夫人母家姓颜，或者是你的本家，你何不会会他？」","en":"refined specimen. Nowadays he is exquisite in a different sense — having polished himself clean of everything.\\" Zhongqing smiled and asked: \\"How so?\\" Gao Pin then recounted his arguments just now and everything Chunhang had done since arriving in the capital, one by one. He added: \\"This man is truly a pity — talented and handsome together, broad in temperament and spirit,"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":4,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"仲清道：「也好。你为我先容。」高品即同了仲清进去，仲清先已望见一个少年，神光似玉，宝气如珠，可不就是去年酒楼上所见的？高品与他们介绍了。春航见了仲清，也觉面熟。","en":"Zhongqing said: \\"A fine idea. Go in and introduce me.\\" Gao Pin immediately brought Zhongqing inside. Zhongqing caught sight first of a young man — luminous as jade, radiant as a pearl — was this not the very one he had seen in the wine house the previous year?"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":4,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"仲清说起去年在酒楼见了那首词，倾倒至今，真恨相见之晚。春航也想起那日相见，便彼此说些仰慕的话。仲清把他的家世细细问了一遍，始知春航的泰山，果是他的本家叔父。不过仲清在京久了，所以不知这门亲戚。二人说的意气相投，又系亲戚，已十分相契，后来便谈起肺腑来。仲清","en":"Zhongqing said that ever since seeing the lyric in the wine house last year he had been full of admiration, and truly regretted that they had not met sooner. Chunhang also recalled that encounter, and they exchanged words of mutual esteem. Zhongqing asked in detail"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":4,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"仲清大笑，春航涨红了脸说道：「放屁！你这个屁，倒有些香。只可惜白香山那句好诗，夹在你那三个屁里头。」仲清笑道：「说正经话，吾兄赏识的到底是谁？」春航道：「各部名花，我未曾全览，想亦妍媸不等。我也不过逢场作戏，所谓未能免俗，聊复尔尔。大约诸名班中，要推登春","en":"Zhongqing burst out laughing. Chunhang's face went red and he said: \\"You are farting! Though that fart of yours has a certain fragrance about it. It's just a pity you've buried Bai Juyi's fine line inside your three stinking verses.\\" Zhongqing laughed: \\"In all"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":5,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"在蓬莱第一峰。」春航道：「这副对子，也题得不切。」高品道：「切得很，上联切你的粉白黛绿，下联切你的长袖轻裙。」仲清、春航都不甚解。高品道：「有了这副对子，人才知道他这金屋中，前面要开棚子，后面要开窑子。」仲清大笑。春航道：「你搁起那贫嘴。」三人谈笑了半日，仲清回去，与王恂说起春航与他有亲，就是去年酒楼题词的少年，果然才貌双全，但志愿太奢，流而忘返。迟了几日，又去","en":"powdered and rouged beauties in the rear; the lower line fits your long-sleeved, light-robed attendants in front.\\" Zhongqing and Chunhang both puzzled over this. Gao Pin said: \\"With this couplet up on the wall, everyone will know that this golden chamber of yours has a tent erected out front and a kiln opened in the back.\\" Zhongqing burst out laughing. Chunhang said: \\"Put"},{"paragraph":36,"mentions":1,"tokens":["颜仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"但生平没有求人，今日去向谁借贷？且到京两三月了，也没有去拜望一个同乡亲友，此时怎样去问人告借？忽又想起颜仲清，前日一面之交，居然就赠银二百两，况且并未向他商量，这人真是今人中之古人。想他也不是为那点葭孚之谊，必定知我的肺腑，看来还可与他商量商量。","en":"fellow provincial or old acquaintance; how could he now go to ask someone for a loan? Then his thoughts turned to Yan Zhongqing — just one meeting between them the other day, yet he had spontaneously given him two hundred taels of silver, without Chunhang even asking. This person was truly an ancient man in a modern age. It seemed he had not done it out of the slender bond of"},{"paragraph":37,"mentions":2,"tokens":["颜仲清","剑潭"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"手，连回书也没有，说道：「他们门上说，颜少爷知道了，就送回信来。」春航想他必定打算银子，吃了饭，候了一会。忽见颜仲清着人来，来人手里拿上一轴画，说：「我们少爷，给老爷请安。这轴画请老爷题一题，叫小的候着带了回去。」春航听了，不知何意，又不见有回信，只得打开画来一看，是唐六如画的郑元和小像，鹑衣百结，在风雪中乞食的模样。春航知道奚落他，不觉大怒，两颊通红，然也不便对","en":"Chunhang assumed he must be working out the money, ate his meal, and waited a while. Then suddenly someone came from Yan Zhongqing, carrying a rolled painting, and said: \\"Our young master sends his respects to your honor. He asks that your honor write an inscription on this painting — I am to wait and take it back.\\" Chunhang was mystified, and no reply letter had come; he could"},{"paragraph":40,"mentions":2,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"来人回去，将画送上，仲清与王恂同看，见这两首诗虽是强词夺理，但其志可见，未免可惜了一番。仲清原想把这两首诗去感化他，谁想倒激怒了他。又听来人说，他光景更为狼狈。","en":"The messenger returned and presented the painting. Zhongqing and Wang Xun read it together. The two quatrains, though forced in their argument, revealed something of their author's spirit — and they could not help feeling a renewed pity for the man. Zhongqing had originally intended his two poems to reform Chunhang;"},{"paragraph":41,"mentions":4,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"据他的跟班讲，今日已断了炊，不能举火。仲清与王恂皆为叹息，仲清道：「这样看来，此人真是「我心匪石，不可转矣。」奈何！奈何！」王恂道：「你前日送他二百金，不上半月，竟已化为乌有。这人这样行为，就再送给他二百金，也是无济于事。除非要将徐度香的家私分一半与他，才够他挥霍。但人到断炊，也不成件事了。","en":"According to his manservant's account, that very day the kitchen fire had gone out, and there was nothing to cook. Zhongqing and Wang Xun both sighed. Zhongqing said: \\"From the look of things, this man is truly like the saying: 'My heart is not a stone — it cannot be turned.' What can be done? What can be done?\\" Wang Xun said: \\"You sent him two hundred taels the other day;"}],"13":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说仲清激怒春航之后，即将王恂所备之百金送至高品处，为春航薪水之费。春航闷坐了两日，米煤催逼，告贷无门。经高品款留，只得暂时寄食。","en":"After Zhongqing had provoked Chunhang into anger, he sent the hundred taels that Wang Xun had prepared to Gao Pin, to cover Chunhang's daily expenses of firewood and food. Chunhang sat brooding for two days; pressed on all sides for rice, coal, and the repayment of"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":1,"tokens":["剑潭"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"兰。正面挂着六幅金笺的小楷，却是一人一幅，写得停匀娟秀。一幅是度香主人，一幅是静宜逸士，一幅是竹君词客，一幅是剑潭山人，一幅是前舟外史，一幅是庸庵居士。像是几首和韵七律诗。再看上款，是媚香嘱和《长河修禊》七律六章原韵，春航心里更加起敬。想道：","en":"calligraphy. The signatures included \\"Master of Duxiang\\", \\"The Recluse Jingyi\\", \\"The Lyricist Zhujun\\", \\"The Mountain Man Jiantan\\", \\"The Unofficial Historian Qianzhou\\", and \\"The Lay Scholar Yong'an\\". They appeared to be matching seven-character regulated verse poems. Looking closer at the dedication, it read: \\"By Meixiang's request, matching the original rhymes of the six seven-character"}],"14":[{"paragraph":29,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"会弹琴，你要学琴，须我教你。方才这《水仙操》倒也弹得好。」高品道：「我何尝会弹？弹琴的就是田湘帆。」南湘已听见仲清讲过田湘帆的才学，便道：「既是田湘帆，何不出来会我史竹君？」高品道：「我为介绍。」说到此，蕙芳已出来见了，即便拉了南湘进去。南湘道：「咦，你也在这里，不料今日高卓然的斋堂倒成了石季伦的金谷。」那边春航亦迎出来，彼此相见，未免道了些仰慕的话。玉林、兰保","en":"did I ever play? The one playing is Tian Xiangfan.\\" Nanxiang had already heard of Tian Xiangfan's talents from Zhongqing, and said, \\"Since it is Tian Xiangfan, why does he not come out and meet Shi Zhujun?\\" Gao Pin said, \\"Allow me to make the introduction.\\" At that moment Huifang had already come out to greet him, and promptly drew Nanxiang inside. Nanxiang said, \\"Well!"},{"paragraph":43,"mentions":1,"tokens":["颜仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"经王恂门口走过，南湘忽然口渴，便叫跟班的进去一问王少爷可睡了没有？跟班的走到门房说知，管门的到书房，探看王恂、颜仲清尚未安睡。门上回过，王恂等便叫请进，史南湘进来。未知后事如何，且听下回分解。","en":"to the gatekeeper and passed on the message; the gatekeeper looked in on the study and found that Wang Xun and Yan Zhongqing had not yet gone to sleep. The gatekeeper reported back, and Wang Xun told them to invite him in. Shi Nanxiang entered. As for what happened next, let the following chapter tell the tale."}],"15":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":4,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说史南湘进内与仲清、王恂见了、喝了几杯茶、王恂问其所从来、南湘将日间的事，一一说了，又将春航、蕙芳的光景说了一会。王恂、仲清羡慕不已。仲清道：「不料苏媚香竟能这样，从此田湘帆倒可以收心改过了。」也将前日题画规劝之事说了，又说春航且有徽愠。南湘道：「改日我与你们和事如何","en":"When Shi Nanxiang entered and greeted Zhongqing and Wang Xun, they shared a few cups of tea. Wang Xun asked him where he had been, and Nanxiang recounted the day's events one by one, then spoke at some length about Chunhang and Huifang. Wang Xun and Zhongqing found themselves unable to conceal their"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":3,"tokens":["颜仲清","仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"次日，颜夫人备了彩盒礼帖，请亮功来，送了过去。文辉处回礼丰盛，有颜仲清帮同亮功押了回来，士燮备酒相待。是日不请外客，就请聘才、元茂相陪。这李元茂今日福至心灵，说话竟清楚起来。性全出京时留下二百两银子与他，元茂买了几件衣裳，混身光亮。亮功眼力本是平常，今见了元茂团头大脸，书气满容，便许为佳士，大有余润之意，便问起他的姻事","en":"betrothal documents and asked Lianggong to convey them. The return gifts from the Wenhui household were lavish; Yan Zhongqing helped Lianggong bring them back, and Shixie hosted a wine reception. That day no outside guests were invited; only Pincai and Yuanmao were asked to keep the company. This Li Yuanmao had, at this auspicious moment, achieved a sudden clarity of mind —"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":3,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"初十日，仲清、王恂绝早过来送行，梅学士行李一切早已收拾停妥，已于初九日打发家人押了出城。是日亲友拥挤不开，时候尚早，仲清、王恂先在书房，与子玉、元茂等等候。仲清便对元茂道了喜，道：「恭喜，恭喜！你今日真得了一个雪美人。你从前不是有句诗是「白人双目近」么？如今倒成","en":"On the tenth day, Zhongqing and Wang Xun came very early to see Shixie off. The Academician Mei's luggage had long been properly packed and put in order; his servants had been dispatched out of the city on the ninth to transport everything. On the day itself, relatives and friends"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":2,"tokens":["颜仲清","仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"少顷，士燮送了客出去，便叫出子玉来，教训了一番。又叮嘱了元茂、聘才几句。然后与夫人别了，即上车起程，颜仲清、王恂、魏聘才、李元茂一起随后，颜夫人领着子玉，并有些仆妇丫鬟一群的车，也送出城来。城外是王文辉、孙亮功等十几个同年至好，一齐在旗亭饯别。士燮盘桓了一会，文辉等进城。天色不早，颜夫人也只得带了仆妇丫鬟洒泪先回。子玉、仲清、聘才、元茂与些家人们，随到店","en":"instruction to Yuanmao and Pincai. After that he bade farewell to Lady Yan, mounted his carriage, and departed. Yan Zhongqing, Wang Xun, Wei Pincai, and Li Yuanmao followed close behind. Lady Yan, leading Ziyu and a group of female servants and maids, also accompanied him in carriages out of the city. Outside the city gate, Wang Wenhui, Sun Lianggong, and a dozen or so fellow"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"士燮又勉励了子玉几句，子玉也只得同仲清等哭泣而回，且按下不题。","en":"Shixie offered a few more words of encouragement to Ziyu; Ziyu had no choice but to return weeping with Zhongqing and the others. But let us leave that aside."},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":1,"tokens":["剑潭"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"次贤问道：「今日送行的人多么？」子云道：「人倒不少，庾香、剑潭送到前站宿店去了，要明日才回。」即指着宝珠笑道：」惟有他们同队中，不见有一个人在那里送行，只怕这位老先生，生平也没有叫过他们。」宝珠笑道：「这位梅大人，每逢戏酒，叫我们也伺候过几回，人倒谦雅的，就总没有赏过一句话儿。倒不料他生出那么一个风流的公子。这","en":"Cixian asked: \\"Were there many people at the farewell today?\\" Ziyun said, \\"Quite a few — Yuxiang and Jiantan went to see him off to the first inn overnight, so they will not be back until tomorrow.\\" He then pointed with a smile at Baozhu: \\"I dare say none of those in their party were here to see him off; I suspect this elder gentleman has never once invited"}],"16":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["颜仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"或把酒清谈，或题诗分韵，所来往者刘文泽、颜仲清等为最密。而怡园徐度香一月间亦过访几次，或遇，或不遇。盖度香局面阔大，现处福地，为富贵神仙，所以干谒者纷纷而来，应酬甚繁。","en":"they would drink wine and converse freely, or compose poetry and assign rhymes; of these companions Liu Wenze and Yan Zhongqing were the closest. Xu Duxiang from the Garden of Contentment also paid several visits during the month, though they did not always meet. Because Duxiang commanded a grand presence and currently occupied a position of prosperity, he was viewed as a celestial"}],"17":[{"paragraph":3,"mentions":3,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"湘帆还是对着个半雌半雄的人，已经如此，又何怪四畏堂中规矩乎！」说得众人要笑，仲清道：「你也是门内出身，如今隔远了，就夸口了。」南湘道：「我见卓然与他细君书，如属员与上司禀帖一样，有受恩深重，浃髓沦肌等语。」众人大笑，高品道：「岂有此理！你这个谎也撒得不像。」众人又说笑了一阵，高品道：「庾香，后日有一件极好的事，来与你商量。」子玉","en":"state! Is it any wonder about the strict rules within the Hall of the Four Fears?\\" This caused everyone to laugh. Zhongqing said: \\"You yourself emerged from behind those very doors; now that you are far away, you boast.\\" Nanxiang said: \\"I saw Zhuoran's letter to his wife—it read like a subordinate's petition to a superior, filled with phrases such as 'deeply indebted to your"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":4,"tokens":["颜仲清","仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，未尝怀刺一谒要津，宁居萧寺，玉人作伴，名士同声。蕙芳又替他结交了许多好友，如徐度香、萧静宜、刘文泽、史南湘、颜仲清、王恂等。仲清前与春航不睦，原是激励春航之意；经高品将其中情节剖明，又说起仲清仍送五十金作浇裹之费，春航自然十分感激敬佩。仲清叫蕙芳为之转弯，更觉比前相好。惟有子玉，尚未谋面。是日知文泽等为蕙芳做生日，心上虽十分欢喜，又因他二人交好，竟人人共知，翻有","en":"Huifang also helped him befriend many worthy companions, such as Xu Duxiang, Xiao Jingyi, Liu Wenze, Shi Nanxiang, Yan Zhongqing, and Wang Xun. Zhongqing's previous discord with Chunhang had originally been intended to spur Chunhang onward; after Gao Pin illuminated the underlying circumstances, and mentioned that Zhongqing was still sending fifty taels of silver for his living"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"仲清道：「竹君快人，开口立见，今日之集，皆系至好，正可畅叙幽情，不拘形迹为妙。」只见高品笑道：「今日王母早来，只有南极仙翁，迟迟不到，难道半路上撞着了小行者的筋斗云，碰伤了小寿星，因此行走不便么；不然，或是又滑倒在车辙里了。」说得众人大笑道：「卓然妙语，","en":"Zhongqing said: \\"Zhujun is a candid and open-hearted person, and his opening words show it immediately. Today's gathering is all the closest of friends; it would be best to speak freely of what lies in the heart, without standing on ceremony.\\" Then Gao Pin laughed"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"妙。」众人也说叙齿罢了。文泽送酒，先定中间一席。论齿是次贤为长，次贤自知不能推逊，只得依了，并坐者为高品，次是仲清；左首一席，子云为首，次南湘，次子玉；右首一席，田春航为首，次王恂，文泽作陪。是每席三位。","en":"age, Cixian was eldest; knowing he could not refuse, he took the seat of honor, with Gao Pin beside him, then Zhongqing. The left-hand table had Ziyun at the head, then Nanxiang, then Ziyu. The right-hand table had Tian Chunhang at the head, then Wang Xun, with Wenze as host. There were three guests at each table."},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉在炕上听得清楚，不免更觉烦闷。仲清道：「今日之事，不可无文辞翰墨。静宜先生可绘一图，并作一序，以记雅集，我辈藉可附骥。」次贤道：「作图呢，弟当效劳。至于高文典册，自有群公大手笔在。山人寒瘦之语，不称金谷繁华，反使名花减色。」众人道：「太谦了。」子云道：「今日起意是因媚香，引得百花齐放","en":"Ziyu, lying on the kang, heard all this clearly and could not help feeling more agitated. Zhongqing said: \\"Today's occasion cannot be without literature and calligraphy. Let Master Jingyi paint a picture and compose a preface to record this elegant gathering, so that we may attach our names to it.\\" Cixian said: \\"As for painting a picture, I will offer"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"于是以年齿为先后，仍系次贤为首，次子云，次高品，次南湘，次文泽，次仲清，次春航，次王恂，次子玉，共是九人。王恂已将子玉叫醒，净净脸，素兰取出一颗醒酒丸给子玉吃了。子玉不好意思，只得勉强扎挣。素兰见子玉不语不言，似醉非醉，心上猜着是为琴言未来。一因人多不好解慰他，二因提起琴言反恐倒勾他的心事，非惟不能宽解，越增愁闷了，反","en":"order of age, with Cixian again taking the lead, followed by Ziyun, then Gao Pin, then Nanxiang, then Wenze, then Zhongqing, then Chunhang, then Wang Xun, and finally Ziyu, making nine people in all. Wang Xun had already roused Ziyu and had him wash his face; Sulan brought out a sobering pill and gave it to Ziyu to ingest. Ziyu felt embarrassed and forced himself to pull"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":3,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"敢！认题还认得清楚。」轮到文泽了，文泽道：「此句对了才有关键，不然气散了。这雄蛱蝶倒有些难对。」因细细的凝思，仲清道：「快交卷子，外边吹打要开门了。」文泽道：「有了。鸳鸯虽小总相亲。」次贤、子云道：「这却对得好，又工又切。」南湘道：「也亏他。」文泽就放下笔，仲清道：「怎么一句就算了？」提醒了文泽，笑道：「你催得紧，我忘了。」又想一想，写道：「化工细选无瑕琢。」众","en":"otherwise the energy will dissipate. These male butterflies are rather hard to match.\\" He thought deeply about it. Zhongqing said: \\"Hurry and hand in your paper; outside the musicians are already blowing and striking to open the gates.\\" Wenze said: \\"I have it. Though the mandarin ducks are small, they are always close.\\" Cixian and Ziyun said: \\"That is a fine match, both skillful"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"势又振得整齐了。」文泽便接道：「倾国倾城世无偶。软到人间铁石肠。」众人道：「妙、妙！这句要对得工力悉敌才好。」仲清想了一想，又笑了一笑，写道：「春回世上支离叟。」春航道：「这实在对得奇妙。」再看下句是：「嫣然一笑百媚生。」便接道：「缠头争掷黄金轻。郑樱桃是真殊艳。」","en":"even this world's heart of iron and stone.\\"\\n\\nEveryone said: \\"Wonderful! This line needs a match of equal force.\\" Zhongqing thought a moment, then laughed slightly and wrote:\\n\\n\\"Spring returns on earth, to the tottering old man.\\"\\n\\nChunhang said: \\"That is truly a marvelous match.\\" Then he saw the next line:\\n\\n\\"How a single smile gives birth to a hundred charms.\\"\\n\\nHe continued:"},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":2,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"竟生出好心来，晓得珍惜了，这也难得。」接道：「莫把花枝忽抛掷。愿如王献买桃根。」文泽联道：「可笑王戎钻李核。」仲清笑道：「又来煞了，你们心上毕竟有些不干净。」又看文泽写道：「一旦天生好玉郎。」仲清联道：「忍教天地错阴阳。只闻雌霓成神女。」众人道：「此是规讽之辞，倒不是刻薄，世间竟亦不能无此事。但不在我辈中耳。」春航联道：「莫变雄风当大王。画堂终日开良宴。」众人又","en":"could, like Wang Xian, buy a Taogen.\\"\\n\\nWenze linked:\\n\\n\\"How laughable that Wang Rong bored through the plum pits.\\"\\n\\nZhongqing laughed: \\"Here we go again, straying into impurity; your hearts still have something unclean in them.\\" Then he saw what Wenze had written next:\\n\\n\\"Once heaven gives birth to a fine jade youth.\\"\\n\\nZhongqing linked:\\n\\n\\"Must heaven and earth make the yin and"},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉不觉脸红。仲清道：「琪官呢？」子云道：「琪官性情刚烈，相貌极好。似欠旖旎风流。比他为菊花罢。」高品道：「菊花种数不一，有白有黄，或红或紫，白的还好，其余似觉老气横秋。琪官性情虽烈，其温柔处亦颇耐人怜爱，不如比为杏花。」众人道：「好个杏花，极妥当。」文泽道：「说起菊","en":"Ziyu could not help blushing. Zhongqing said: \\"And Qiguan?\\" Ziyun said: \\"Qiguan's temperament is fierce and upright, his appearance extremely fine; he somewhat lacks a gentle, flowing charm. Let him be likened to the chrysanthemum.\\" Gao Pin said: \\"Chrysanthemums vary in variety: some white,"},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"门户中。倒也生得素净，故有此雅号。但是两广人裹足者少，都系六寸肤圆光致致，双跌着地，行走如风。人倒极风骚的。」仲清道：「这就是你各处稽察新闻事务的头衔了。」众人又笑了。子云道：「今日一叙之后，盛筵难再。十八日瑶卿移寓，诸同人可以移樽一叙否？」众人皆道：「断无不来之理，如有不到者罚他作一东，再叙一天。」宝珠道；「只怕我没有这脸面，断乎不能全来的。」春航道：「为什么","en":"round, with a double-footed gait, walking like the wind. As a person, she is exceedingly vivacious and charming.\\" Zhongqing said: \\"That explains your official title of Inspector-General of Intelligence from All Quarters.\\" Everyone laughed again. Ziyun said: \\"After today's gathering, such a magnificent feast will be hard to convene again. On the eighteenth, Yaoqing is moving"}],"20":[{"paragraph":5,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"请去修志，刘文泽是他岳母惦记他，来接他并其室吴氏，同到直隶总督衙门去了。此中已少了三人，只有子云、次贤、南湘、仲清、春航、王恂六人，不时往来。","en":"wife née Wu to the office of the Viceroy of Zhili. So three of the group were gone; only Ziyun, Cixian, Nanxiang, Zhongqing, Chunhang, and Wang Xun — six people — continued to meet from time to time."},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":2,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，家中却也有些至交好友亲戚同年来贺，内里又有些太太姑娘们，如梅宅的颜夫人，孙宅的陆夫人之类，也觉得热闹。王恂与仲清这怡园之约，就不能去了。是日子云、次贤知道了，也去拜拜寿，适遇南湘、春航皆在，就约了回来。仲清、王恂说如客散得早，也来赴约。","en":"as Lady Yan from the Mei household and Madam Lu from the Sun household — so it was quite festive. Wang Xun and Zhongqing were thus unable to attend the Garden of Contentment appointment. On learning of this, Ziyun and Cixian also went to offer birthday congratulations; there they happened to find Nanxiang and Chunhang both present, so they invited them to come back with"},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":1,"tokens":["剑潭"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"出园。子云道：「今日本有一事要烦两兄。园中各处的对联尚须添设几副，今日倒被龙舟耽误了，迟日再请一游，并约庾香、剑潭诸君何如？」史、田二人应了，遂上车而去。这边相公五人，也各陆续散去。这回怡园二次宴客，可惜人少未齐，不晓下卷又叙何人，再俟细细想来。","en":"were sidetracked by the dragon boat. Perhaps another day I can invite another outing and also include Yuxiang, Jiantan, and the other gentlemen — what do you say?\\" Shi and Tian both agreed, then mounted their carriages and departed. The five young dan actors also gradually dispersed. This second grand entertainment at the Garden of Contentment — it was a pity it was"}],"24":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":11,"tokens":["颜仲清","仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这回书要讲颜仲清、王恂二人。这一日在家，仲清对王恂道：「你可知道，这几日内出了许多新闻，你听见没有？」王恂道：「那两天因你弟妹身上不好。我天天候医生，有些照料，没有出门。」仲清道：「我昨日听得张仲雨讲的，有个开银号的潘三，从三月间想买苏蕙芳作干儿子。头一回是拉着张老","en":"Our story now turns to Yan Zhongqing and Wang Xun. Idling at home one day, Zhongqing turned to Wang Xun and asked, \\"Have you heard the flurry of strange rumors going around these past few days?\\" Wang Xun replied, \\"My sister-in-law has been unwell of late. I've been waiting on the doctor"},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":5,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"仲清笑道：「那又是一种。我看湘帆之爱媚香，起初却是为色起见。已花了无数冤钱，一旦遇见这样绝色，故辱之而不怒，笑之而不耻，犹之下界凡人，望见了天仙，自然要想刻刻去瞻仰的。及到媚香怜其难诉之隐情，感其不怨之劳苦，似欲稍加颜色，令其自明。及亲见湘帆吐属之雅，容","en":"Zhongqing laughed, \\"That is entirely another species of love. As I see it, Xiangfan's devotion to Meixiang was born initially of physical desire. He squandered oceans of silver, and upon gazing at such transcendent loveliness, he endured insult without rage and"},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":5,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"仲清道：「虫蛀千字文」要给他吃碗墨水，才好免得随口胡言。」王恂道：「李元茂吃什么呢？」仲清笑道：「李元茂颟颟顸顸，七窍闭塞，要吃大黄、芒硝，方才打得通他这些浊污。」王恂又问仲雨，仲清答道：「在可善可恶之间，尚识好人，天良未昧。」二人刚说得有趣，忽见李玉林","en":"Zhongqing said, \\"That worm-eaten 'Thousand-Character Classic' needs to be force-fed a bowl of ink to stop his loose talk.\\" Wang Xun asked what remedy Li Yuanmao should be prescribed. Zhongqing laughed, \\"Yuanmao is so profoundly dull that all seven of his orifices"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":11,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"仲清笑道：「口恶，此是毛声山哄人的，止于批《琵琶记》内题出这几个戏名是：《李陵返汉》、《燕丹灭秦》、《诸葛延年》、《明妃归汉》等事，共有八九种。」玉林道：「如今静宜又添了四种是：「《金谷园绿珠投楼》、《马嵬驿杨妃随驾》、《李谪仙夜郎奉诏》、《杜拾遗金殿承","en":"Zhongqing laughed heartily. \\"What a vile mouth! Mao was merely teasing his readers. He only listed titles in his commentary on *Story of the Pipa*, such as 'Li Ling Returns to Han,' 'Prince Dan Destroys Qin,' 'Zhuge Yan Nian,' and 'The Bright Consort Returns to"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":4,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"少顷，夕阳西下，仲清叫人卷起帘子，就把桌子挪到廊前，摆了四个座儿。王恂道：「便饭，没有为你们添菜，我这里却比不得度香。」桂保道：「好说，你的便饭我也吃得记不清了，东成居也作不出来。度香处也过于糜费，其实如何吃得这么许多。」说完就同坐了。厨房内闻得有相公，便多备了八个碟子","en":"Presently, the sun slanted westward. Zhongqing ordered the curtains to be rolled up and had the table moved out to the gallery, setting out four seats. Wang Xun said, \\"It will just be a plain meal with no extra dishes; I certainly cannot match Duxiang's extravagance.\\" Guibao waved it off, \\"You say"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"方才王恂日间听了仲清品评各人的情境，因想起《花谱》中诸旦都也讲究情分的。因问玉林、桂保道：「你们此刻在怡园演习，那十个人，你可晓得他们有几种情性，脾气是那个最好相与，可讲得来么？」桂保道：「这十个却也好几样，内中就是玉侬脾气冷些，其余没有什么脾气。」玉林道：「讲情性风雅","en":"Earlier in the day, Wang Xun had listened intently to Zhongqing judge the depths of each man's passions, which naturally led his thoughts to the actors of the Catalogue of Flowers and their own emotional temperaments. He asked Yulin and Guibao, \\"Of the ten of you rehearsing at the Garden of Contentment, do you know"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":3,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"我了。」桂保道：「这是你自己不好下赞语，这考语待我出吧：芳洁自守，风雅宜人，不亢不卑，无好无恶，这些是佩仙。」仲清、王恂同道：「这考语出得很切，足见蕊香近日识见又长了好些。」玉林道：「我却当不起这考语。」王恂道：「还有几个人索性请你批评批评。」桂保笑道：「是谁？」王恂道：「蓉官、二喜、玉美、春林、凤林，这些人又是怎样？」桂保笑道：「这又是一路，不与我们往来的。我","en":"grace, neither overly proud nor lowly base, harboring neither intense love nor bitter hatred—that is Peixian.\\" Zhongqing and Wang Xun applauded, \\"Sharp indeed! Ruixiang's insight grows by the day.\\" Yulin modestly demurred. Wang Xun then asked for their judgment on Rongguan, Erxi, Yumei, Chunlin, and Fenglin—the outsiders. Guibao laughed, \\"They belong to an entirely different"}],"25":[{"paragraph":6,"mentions":1,"tokens":["剑潭"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"君昨日醉坏了，竟至呕血不能出房。湘帆说是没有会过华公子，不肯来。庸庵为是这两天，他夫人要弄璋了，一步不离伺候。剑潭见诸人不来，也就辞了。昨日只得邀了张仲雨，倒是同华公子相识的。余外就是静宜，共有五人，只有两席。他们没有会过华公子，不晓得是怎么一个富贵骄奢的气概，所以不肯来。你也长见的，其实也不见怎样，不过气势自高，侍从华美而已。","en":"refuses to come. Yong'an's wife is about to give birth any day now, so he will not leave her side for a single step. Jiantan, seeing that no one else was coming, also sent his regrets. Yesterday I had no choice but to invite Zhang Zhongyu, who does happen to be acquainted with Young Master Hua. Besides him there is only Jingyi — five of us in all, which leaves just two tables."}],"28":[{"paragraph":9,"mentions":1,"tokens":["颜仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"的光景；清楚时与好人一样。睡梦中呓语喃喃，有时叫玉侬，有时唤香畹，有时大骂奚十一、魏聘才诸人。颜夫人十分着急，颜仲清、王恂三天两日常来看视，心中虽是明白，却也无法可治。二人商量，又不好对颜夫人讲，只好婉言解慰而已。颜夫人每听子玉睡梦之中，必呼玉侬二字，心上便疑心子玉在外有什么勾当，便当玉侬是个女人，心有说不出的隐情；因又想子玉不常出门，出门必有云儿随去。一日便唤云","en":"sometimes \\"Xiangwan,\\" and at times, vehemently cursing Xi Eleven and Wei Pincai. Lady Yan was frantic with worry. Yan Zhongqing and Wang Xun visited every few days; they understood the root of the malady but were powerless to cure it. After discussing the matter, they felt they could not reveal the truth to Lady Yan, offering only gentle, evasive comforts. Hearing Ziyu constantly"}],"30":[{"paragraph":4,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一大半。内中除徐子云、史南湘是前科举人，萧次贤是高尚自居，无心问世，只有田春航、高品入场。如子玉、王恂、文泽、仲清等皆遵例回避。子玉在家闷闷不乐，又因琴言杳无音信，内外隔绝，又不能传递消息，几次要去访问聘才，又因华府威严，豪奴气焰。故而子玉不肯前去，只得静坐书斋，闷坐而已。","en":"intention of participating, only Tian Chunhang and Gao Pin entered the examination hall. Ziyu, Wang Xun, Wenze, and Zhongqing all withdrew according to the rules. Ziyu stayed at home, brooding unhappily. Moreover, because there was no news from Qinyan and they were completely cut off from each other, unable to exchange messages, he wanted to visit Pincai several times. However,"}],"31":[{"paragraph":16,"mentions":1,"tokens":["颜仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"十五日一日过了。到了十六日，王恂、颜仲清约了史南湘来望子玉。子玉自七月中病好，调养了二十八日，已经强健。","en":"The fifteenth day came and went. On the morning of the sixteenth, Wang Xun and Yan Zhongqing brought Shi Nanxiang along to visit Ziyu. Since recovering from his illness in the middle of the seventh month, Ziyu had spent twenty-eight days resting and recuperating, and he had now grown strong and healthy once more."},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":2,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一室，茗碗香炉，周旋其间。名为看破，其实情怀未断，犹时一念及，涕泪潸潸，不能自解。十五日到王文辉家一走，王恂、仲清约定明日午刻去望田春航、高品。子玉已吃过了早饭，在书房等候。不多一会，史、颜诸人已到，南湘坐了，与子玉叙谈。仲清、王恂先进内室，见了颜夫人，略坐一坐即出来。喝了一杯茶，即催子玉同走。","en":"not ease. He took a brief walk to Wang Wenhui's home on the fifteenth, where he agreed to accompany Wang Xun and Zhongqing to visit Tian Chunhang and Gao Pin at noon the following day. Ziyu had already eaten breakfast and was waiting in his study. Soon enough, Shi, Yan, and the others arrived. Nanxiang took a seat and chatted with Ziyu, while Zhongqing and Wang Xun proceeded"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":5,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"略谈了几句，仲清便问闱中的事。春航、高品多属得意。仲清道：「湘帆的文章请教过了，是一定得意的。卓然的文章，快拿出来看看，想来定有出人头地的好处。」高品道：「不好，不好，不必看他。」王恂道：「什么话！就不好也要看看。」南湘道：「这三道题，卓然一定见长，就不看也不妨。」","en":"After exchanging a few pleasantries, Zhongqing asked about the civil service examinations. Both Chunhang and Gao Pin seemed quite pleased with their prospects. Zhongqing said, \\"I have already seen Xiangfan's essays, and I am certain of his success. Zhuoran, you must bring out your essays for us to"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"的不一而足，却非寻常往来，都是俗陋不堪的人。前日我的小使见他的管家，拿了好几封银包进来，问他，他说不知谁的。」仲清道：「是了，卓然也穷极了，自然要作这个买卖。况且这篇文字是信手写的，不然何至忙到如此。」南湘道：「不错，你听他说，总中一个给你们看，这话就明白了。」高品送了客去进来，大家住口。","en":"his servant bring in several packets of silver. When asked about it, he claimed he didn't know who sent them.\\" Zhongqing connected the dots: \\"Ah, that explains it. Zhuoran is completely broke, so he naturally has to resort to the business of selling his essays. That explains why his exam piece was so hastily scribbled; why else would he rush it like that?\\" Nanxiang nodded"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":2,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"而死，亦无遗恨。」春航与子玉更觉赞叹不置。南湘道：「这篇传你自己作的么？」蕙芳道：「都是实话，就是少些文气。」仲清道：「也好，请湘帆润色润色就好了。」即说道：「我与他作篇诔。」王恂道：「我作几首挽诗罢。」南湘道：「我作墓志。」春航道：「把他的作了略节，我另作一篇传如何？」蕙芳道：「更好，这原算略节，用不得的。」子玉道：「大文章你们都作了，我们作什么呢？我只好作篇","en":"you write this biography yourself?\\" Huifang replied, \\"It contains only the raw facts; it lacks literary polish.\\" Zhongqing suggested, \\"It is quite good, though having Xiangfan refine it would make it perfect.\\" He then added, \\"I shall compose an elegy for him.\\" Wang Xun volunteered, \\"I shall write a few elegiac poems.\\" Nanxiang said, \\"I shall compose his tomb inscription.\\""},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":3,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"明日，南湘、仲清即致札与子云、前舟诸人，数日后都送了些分金，并有几首歌行。南湘、仲清看了，点过分金是：子云二十四，文泽十六，次贤十二，共五十二两。仲清道：「我们共有六分，每人八两，共凑成一百两也就够了。」南湘道：「很够了。」于是又致札众人，两三日间都要凑足。诗文共遗","en":"The following day, Nanxiang and Zhongqing wrote letters to Ziyun, Qianzhou, and several others. A few days later, the subscription funds arrived, along with several verses and songs. Nanxiang and Zhongqing tallied the contributions: Ziyun gave twenty-four taels, Wenze gave sixteen, and Cixian"},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":2,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"到了二十八日，仲清又到南湘处商议明日之事，并说：「大约有几个不愿去的，庸庵畏首畏尾，防他严亲知道，庾香更不消说了，那古庙里三更半夜的，也不好叫他去。」南湘道：「我倒想着个主意。既是此举，也不专为祭他，我们借此可以散步野游，不如日间携樽而往，一献之后，即到锦秋墩、浩然亭","en":"On the twenty-eighth, Zhongqing visited Nanxiang to discuss the plans for the following day. He noted, \\"I imagine there are a few who will be unwilling to go. Yong'an is always timid and fearful, constantly worrying that his strict father might find out. As for Yuxiang, it goes without"},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"南湘到了明日，即约仲清骑马出城。到了寿佛寺门口下了马，马夫拴在一边，已见五六辆车歇在那里。进得门来，古剎荒凉，草深一尺，见马骡在那里吃草。颓垣败井，佛像倾欹。","en":"The next morning, Nanxiang and Zhongqing rode out of the city on horseback. When they arrived at the gates of the Shoufo Temple, they dismounted and had the grooms tie their horses to the side. They noticed five or six carriages already parked there. Stepping through the gates, they found the"},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":2,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"进了弥陀殿，尚不见一人。只见大雄宝殿，西边坍了一角，风摇树动，落叶成堆，凄凉已极。才见一人从殿后走出来。仲清认的是蕙芳的人，见了垂手站住。仲清问道：「他们在那里？」那人道：「尚在后面，待小的引道。」走到殿后，西边一个门内是一带危楼，门窗全无。走过了才是三间小屋，堆满灵柩，约有二三十具。见一柩前，有一小桌，点着香蜡，想就是了。","en":"dead leaves in great heaps, creating a scene of absolute desolation. Finally, a man emerged from behind the hall. Zhongqing recognized him as one of Huifang's servants. Upon seeing them, the servant stood respectfully with his hands by his sides. Zhongqing asked, \\"Where are they?\\" The servant replied, \\"They are in the back. Please allow me to lead the way.\\" They walked past"},{"paragraph":30,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"南湘道：「这么个所在，阴惨怕人，怪不得有人不肯来。」蕙芳忙拖过条板凳放在上面，请他们坐了。仲清道：「人已齐了，就奠一奠，我们往锦秋墩去逛罢。」蕙芳即将祭筵就叫在那屋里摆起来。蕙芳上香，素兰奠酒，漱芳执壶，宝珠上菜，桂保焚纸，春航、南湘、高品同行了一个礼，五旦连连叩头代谢。","en":"It is no wonder some refused to come.\\" Huifang hurriedly dragged a wooden bench over and invited them to sit. Zhongqing said, \\"Now that everyone is here, let us pour our libations and then head straight over to Brook Autumn Mound for our stroll.\\" Huifang immediately ordered the sacrificial feast to be laid out in the room. Huifang offered the incense, Sulan poured the"},{"paragraph":31,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"大家也都坐不住了，急忙的叫人收拾，给了和尚一吊钱，一齐走出庙来。南湘、仲清仍旧骑马，余人上车，从人挑着担子，一径往锦秋墩来。疏林黄叶，满目萧条。","en":"to pack everything up, handed the old monk a string of cash, and swiftly left the temple grounds. Nanxiang and Zhongqing remounted their horses, while the rest boarded their carriages. With the porters carrying their loads on poles, they headed straight for Brook Autumn Mound. The sparse woods and yellowing leaves painted a picture of absolute bleakness and desolation."},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":4,"tokens":["仲清","剑潭"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"君想来是游过的了。」南湘道：「我是第一次。我因前日偶见前人有《题锦秋墩》诗，所以知道。大远的路，谁到此间来？」仲清道：「其实也好。天天在热闹地方，也应冷落一回。」南湘道：「这个寿佛寺就冷落够了。剑潭，你说惟清心者能叩寂，志淡者能探幽。那个庙里，你敢住几天么？」仲清笑道：「若到此地位，也不得不住。晚间月明风静，或者有些鬼狐来盘桓盘桓，也未尝不佳。」高品道：「剑潭总","en":"'Inscription on Jinqiu Mound' a few days ago. It is quite a far journey; who would ever come all the way out here?\\" Zhongqing noted, \\"It is a pleasant change, actually. When one spends every day amidst the noise and bustle, it is necessary to seek out the quiet and cold now and then.\\" Nanxiang teased, \\"The Shoufo Temple was certainly cold enough! Jiantan, you once said that"},{"paragraph":37,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"听呜呜击破秦人缶。且一醉，莫僝僽田。大家吟了一遍，哈哈大笑。天要下雨，遂无心久留，急忙收拾。南湘搭了蕙芳的车，仲清搭了素兰的车，一路而回。到得家时，已萧萧疏疏落起细雨来。不知后事如何，且听下回分解。","en":"piles up in my chest as heavy as a mountain.\\nSinging by the autumn graves, letting our verses serve as tears.\\"\\n\\nYan Zhongqing concluded:\\n\\n\\"Listen to the wailing that shatters the Qin man's earthen jar.\\nLet us drink our fill,\\nAnd put aside our cares.\\"\\n\\nTian Chunhang finished the verse. They chanted it aloud together, breaking into roaring laughter. As the rain threatened to"}],"32":[{"paragraph":5,"mentions":4,"tokens":["颜仲清","仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"你这名字未必有同的。」高品道：「也难说，总要看了榜方作准。」春航默默不语，蕙芳只好说些宽慰的话。少顷，史南湘、颜仲清闯将进来，南湘道：「贺喜的来了，快预备喜酒。媚香你也在这里？」春航道：「此刻也差不多报完了，将吊之不暇，何贺之有？」仲清道：「才报了一百八十多名了，卓然中在八十一名，你嫌低了，因此有些委屈么？」高品道：「恐怕不是，你不见条子上写的是江南监生？」南湘、","en":"sure.\\" Chunhang remained silent, and Huifang could only offer words of comfort. A moment later, Shi Nanxiang and Yan Zhongqing burst in. Nanxiang said, \\"Here come the bearers of glad tidings, quick, prepare the celebration wine! Meixiang, are you here too?\\" Chunhang said, \\"By now almost all the names must be announced; there won't be time to prepare anything, what is there to"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"也有些疑心起来，恐怕报喜来诳他，只管发怔。蕙芳笑道：「报已报完了二百几十名，人都要疑心，难道人人全是假的么？」仲清道：「不必疑心，此刻已三更天，城门也都开了，叫你管家骑匹快马先看了榜来。我们也不回去，你叫人索性添些酒来。」春航、高品道：「甚好。」一面打发人去看榜，一面再添酒菜。","en":"laughed, \\"Over two hundred names have been announced already. If everyone is suspicious, is it all just a lie?\\" Zhongqing said, \\"There's no need to doubt. It's already the third watch, the city gates are open. Have your servant take a fast horse and check the board first. We won't go back either; why don't you just order more wine?\\" Chunhang and Gao Pin said, \\"Very well.\\""},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":2,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"你们直讲罢，一千六百两银子卖掉了一个举人，这个杠花就是我中的，是张仲雨的过手，明日就要讨帐去了。」春航、南湘、仲清、蕙芳都埋怨他几句。高品道：「我岂不知此事原作不得，我也有个想头在内，或者今科不当中，或者我竟能名利双收，也未可知。况且我要回南一走，家内有几件大事急于要办，妙手空空的，亦殊难堪。如今倒罢了，虽不能巴结与湘帆作个同年，但不叫抬杠的做年伯，称婊子为年嫂","en":"I sat for. Zhang Zhongyu was the middleman, and tomorrow I will go and collect the money.\\" Chunhang, Nanxiang, Zhongqing, and Huifang all scolded him. Gao Pin said, \\"I know this shouldn't be done, but I had a thought: either I wouldn't pass this time, or I might actually achieve both fame and fortune. Besides, I needed to take a trip back south; I have several urgent family"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"苏州去了。春航在庙里寂寞，文泽邀至家中，王恂又欲相留，春航两处时相寄榻。又兼蕙芳照旧相陪，便安心乐意，与文泽、仲清等交相琢磨，闲时作些诗赋，习学殿试工夫。南湘也写了几天殿试卷子，以后又不写了，且按下不题。","en":"With Huifang still keeping him company as usual, he felt content and happy, studying and discussing with Wenze, Zhongqing, and the others, writing poetry and prose in his spare time, and preparing for the Palace Examination. Nanxiang also practiced writing Palace Examination essays for a few days, but then stopped; we will leave that aside for now."},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":2,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"从此归自荣成了一个衣冠禽兽了。一日，文泽的家人从外面抄了一张来送与文泽看，恰好南湘、仲清都在那里。大家看时，只见写道：勘得归自荣，家本书香，父曾攀桂；心耽铜臭，性爱游花。\\n浪迹都门，骗人弱息；缩头陋巷，拥彼淫娼。恣挑达于风月场中，攫钱财于鸳鸯被底。臀有肤而尽堪凿空，面无皮而岂解包羞。贪酒食之欢娱，畅烟花之撩乱。交游假托，后庭里玉树常埋；","en":"day, Wenze's servant copied down the judgment from outside and brought it to show Wenze, just when Nanxiang and Zhongqing happened to be there. As they read it, it said: \\"Upon investigation of Gui Zirong: His family originally belonged to the scholarly class, his father having grasped the osmanthus branch; but his heart is addicted to the stench of copper, and his nature"}],"33":[{"paragraph":5,"mentions":1,"tokens":["剑潭"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"觉放心，因又道：「不觉日子这么快，转眼又是年底了，真是流年如水。」宝珠道：「可不是么，本来离年近了。前日我听得剑潭讲，一过年你就要恭喜了，可请我们吃喜酒么？」子玉道：「还没有定，等老人家家信回来再看。」宝珠道：「今日我倒得了两样菜，不晓得你肯赏脸在这里吃饭么？若肯在这里吃饭，我便约了香畹来，大家叙叙。」","en":"of the year. Time truly flows like water.\\" Baozhu agreed, \\"Indeed, the new year is approaching. The other day, Jiantan mentioned that right after the new year you will be celebrating—will you invite us to your wedding feast?\\" Ziyu replied, \\"It hasn't been decided yet; we'll wait for the letter from the elders.\\" Baozhu then said, \\"I just got two nice dishes today; would"}],"35":[{"paragraph":6,"mentions":2,"tokens":["颜仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"再说王恂、颜仲清、文泽、春航，从十三日至十五日都在怡园赏灯饮酒。子玉也去了一天，因想去年此日初见琴言，今年似成隔世，不觉伤感了一回。新年上，诸名旦彼此纷纷请客，热闹了十余日。到了十七日，王恂、颜仲清飞了札来与子玉。","en":"Returning to Wang Xun, Yan Zhongqing, Liu Wenze, and Tian Chunhang—from the thirteenth to the fifteenth, they had all been at the Garden of Contentment, admiring lanterns and drinking wine. Ziyu had also joined them for one day. Remembering how he had first met Qinyan on this very day last"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":1,"tokens":["颜仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"个不得来，都有堂会戏，不能分身。宝珠之外，来的是蕙芳、素兰、玉林、漱芳四人。这边名士，怡园二位之外，是刘文泽、颜仲清、王恂、田春航、梅子玉五人。共十二人。众客到齐，宝珠先叩谢了。","en":"the side of the famous scholars, apart from the two hosts of the Garden of Contentment, there were Liu Wenze, Yan Zhongqing, Wang Xun, Tian Chunhang, and Mei Ziyu—five in total. Together, they made twelve. Once all the guests had assembled, Baozhu first bowed in gratitude to everyone."},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":2,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，我故把他刻了。真是花是人非，吾兄尚忆去年否？」几句话提起子玉的心事，不觉一阵悲酸，忍住了，也不言语，走开了。仲清道：「玉侬近日也学做诗了？」宝珠道：「我搜他的，已有二十余首，就不肯给人瞧，这首是无意中看见的。」大家嗟叹了一声，即重到里面来。次贤道：「今日十二人，一桌又挤，两桌又离开了。」子云道：「依我，把两张大方桌并拢来，就可坐了。」摆好了坐位，是东西对面八坐","en":"Ziyu's heart, bringing a sudden wave of bittersweet sorrow. He suppressed it, remained silent, and walked away. Zhongqing asked, \\"Has Yunong recently learned to write poetry?\\" Baozhu answered, \\"I searched his belongings and found over twenty poems, but he refuses to show them to anyone. This one was discovered by chance.\\" Everyone sighed collectively before heading back"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"泽面前来了。文泽奇得了不得，说道：「你能个个走到我才佩服，不然也是碰着的。」次贤道：「合席都要走到的。」于是敬仲清、王恂、春航、子玉以及五旦，走来走去，又稳，酒又一滴都不洒出来。喜得个个眉飞色舞，别人叫又不灵，个个称奇。","en":"single person; otherwise, it's just luck.\\" Cixian replied, \\"It must visit everyone at the table.\\" He then toasted Zhongqing, Wang Xun, Chunhang, Ziyu, and the five performers. The cup rolled back and forth, smoothly and steadily, without spilling a single drop. Everyone was overjoyed and dancing with delight. Yet when others tried to command it, it failed to respond, leaving"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"。」子玉也甚欢喜，宝珠饮了酒，便道：「我是不服，偏要想想。」子玉又将杯子拿起来细看，被宝珠一手抢来，四面揣摹。仲清便问子玉道：「你怎么看出来的？」子玉道：「待我再试一试。」","en":"Just as Ziyu picked the cup up to look closer, Baozhu snatched it from his hand and studied it from all angles. Zhongqing asked Ziyu, \\"How did you figure it out?\\" Ziyu replied, \\"Let me try it one more time.\\""},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"数二字，又在第五，轮到次贤，杯子就到次贤面前。次贤喝了，念道：「愿陪鸾鹤回三山。」数到仲清，喝了酒，把酒斟了，走到春航面前，道：「罗帐四垂红烛背。」春航喝了，道：「好个「罗帐四垂红烛背」，香艳无比。」把酒喝了，即斟了酒，念道：「刺绣五纹添弱线。」数到宝珠。宝珠喝了酒，说道：「六字本来少，偏轮到我，只怕要罚酒了。」子玉道：「六字亦有。」","en":"Cixian drank and recited, \\"I wish to accompany the phoenix and crane back to the three mountains.\\" Counting to Zhongqing, he drank the wine, poured another cup, walked over to Chunhang, and recited, \\"The silk bed-curtains droop low on all four sides behind the red candle.\\" Chunhang drank it and praised, \\"What a fine line, 'The silk bed-curtains droop low on all four sides"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":2,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"：「座中媚香还没有轮到。轮到了他，我们再换令罢。如今只可飞十三了。」子玉飞出一句是：「娉娉袅袅十三余。」飞到了仲清，仲清喝了酒，想了一想道：「这一飞，轮到数目皆要喝酒，等媚香飞一句收令罢。要十几的数目相连，也就少了。」即念道：「花面丫头十三四。」瑶卿、媚香各饮一杯。媚香飞一句算结罢。」蕙芳道：「其实轮不到我，应该是度香。」子云道：「你飞了罢。」蕙芳想了一想，道：","en":"must proceed to thirteen.\\" Ziyu recited a line: \\"Graceful and slender, she is just over thirteen.\\" It landed on Zhongqing. Zhongqing drank the wine, pondered for a moment, and said, \\"With this count, whoever it lands on will have to drink. Let's wait for Meixiang to recite a line and conclude the game. Lines with numbers in the teens are quite rare.\\" He then recited, \\"'The"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"」大家看了一看，说道：「此令太难，一时如何集得起来？」宝珠、蕙芳道：「此令我们是不能的，只好你们七个人去行。」仲清道：「倒是集《毛诗》凑花名不易。若说唐诗要飞两句，也不过与方才的数目差不多。」","en":"difficult. Baozhu and Huifang said, \\"We won't be able to play this. It's better if only you seven gentlemen play.\\" Zhongqing said, \\"The hardest part is matching the flower names from the *Mao Shi*. Composing the two Tang lines shouldn't be much harder than our previous numbers game.\\""},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":8,"tokens":["剑潭","仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"忘了，再想不起什么花。」偶见酒杯是个鸡缸，倒便触着了两句，念道：「鸡既鸣矣，冠绥双止。鸡冠是个并头花。」并坐是剑潭，该贺两杯。仲清道：「你且饮了再贺。」文泽欣然，自己饮了两杯。仲清便掣筹，文泽道：「你的贺酒还没有喝呢！」仲清道：「你想这两句连不连？还要人贺酒。」子玉道：「鸡冠却是并头，就是句子欠贯串些。」文泽道：「你们除此句之外，再找一个冠字在上的，我就服你们。","en":"the crest (guan) and tassel stand in pair'—thus 'cockscomb' as the paired-head flower.\\" Since his seatmate was Jiantan, Jiantan was required to toast two cups. Zhongqing interjected, \\"Wenze should drink his own two cups first.\\" Wenze gladly complied. As Zhongqing drew the next lot, Wenze reminded him of his toast. Zhongqing retorted, \\"Your lines weren't smoothly linked"},{"paragraph":31,"mentions":2,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"大赞道：「妙，妙！此二句如一句，实在接得妙。」王恂又说道：「奉时辰牡，颜如渥丹。是并蒂牡丹花。」众人尚未开口，仲清道：「菜还没有上得一半，烧猪倒先拿了出来。」众人不解，留心四顾，王恂道：「那里有什么烧猪？」仲清笑道：「就是你想吃烧猪，你说得「奉时辰牡，颜如渥丹」，不像个烧猪么？」众人听了，大笑起来，王恂自己也笑了。次贤道：「庸庵，你那第二句像说错了一字，或是刻本","en":"the seamless linkage. Wang Xun then offered 'paired-stem peony' from the *Mao Shi*. Before anyone could respond, Zhongqing joked, \\"Half the dishes haven't even been served yet, and the roast pig has already appeared.\\" People looked around in confusion. Wang Xun asked, \\"Where is there a roast pig?\\" Zhongqing laughed, \\"Even if you want to eat roast pig, your phrase 'presented"},{"paragraph":33,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"冷朝阳《送红线》诗一句，孟浩然《登襄城楼》一句，合着是：还似洛妃乘雾去，更凝神女弄珠游。」子玉方才念完，次贤、仲清、春航等大赞道：「方才飞的以此为第一，好在对得工稳。旖旎风光，却是庾香本色。」子玉又说并头花道：「月出皎兮，季女思饥。月季是并头花。」众人道：「这个花名也好极，我们应贺三杯，方可赏此佳句。」子玉谦了几句。又见素兰掷了一个么六，也想了一想，凑起《酒楼》","en":"Luo riding the mist away; gazing still as the river deity plays with pearls.'\\" As soon as Ziyu finished, Cixian, Zhongqing, Chunhang, and the others lauded him: \\"Of all the lines recited so far, this is the first and best. It's wonderfully balanced and graceful. Such tender and romantic charm is exactly Yuxiang's style.\\" Ziyu then provided his paired-head flower: \\"'When"},{"paragraph":36,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"看他们掷几回。他们到底比我们少用些心。」素兰掷了一个重四，即想出一句《窥浴》上的曲文道：「两人合一副肠和胃。」仲清拍案叫绝道：「这个是天籁，我们快贺三杯。」于是合席又贺了三杯。玉林掷了个重三，也念《小宴》一句道：「列长空数行新雁。」次贤道：「他们越说越好了，真是他们的比我们的好。」王恂道：「词出佳人口，信然。」春航道：「他们也实在敏捷，我们只好甘拜下风了。」文泽","en":"instantly recalled a line from *Peeking at the Bath*: \\"'Two people become one set of intestines and stomach.'\\" Zhongqing slammed his hand on the table in sheer delight, exclaiming, \\"This is heavenly inspiration! We must quickly toast three cups.\\" And so the entire table toasted another three cups. Yulin rolled double threes and recited a line from *The Small Banquet*:"}],"37":[{"paragraph":3,"mentions":3,"tokens":["颜仲清","仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"今日之约，刘文泽、颜仲清、田春航不来，因为是春航会同年团拜，文泽、王恂是座师的世兄，故大家请了他。春航并请仲清，仲清新受感冒，两处都辞了。王恂也辞了那边，清早就约同子玉到怡园，次贤、子云接进梅崦坐下。这梅崦是个梅花样式，五间一处，共有五处。长廊曲槛钩连，绿萼红香围绕。外边望","en":"For today's gathering, Liu Wenze, Yan Zhongqing, and Tian Chunhang did not attend. Chunhang was attending a New Year gathering of his examination year-mates. The examination cohort had invited Wenze and Wang Xun as sons of their examiners. Chunhang had also invited Zhongqing, but Zhongqing had recently"},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":1,"tokens":["剑潭"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"唱过一堂的了。」王恂道：「何以今日这么多呢？」桂保道：「再忙半个月也就闲了。」宝珠道：「我见湘帆、前舟在那里，剑潭何以不来？」王恂道：「身子不爽快。」桂保谓子玉道：「今年我们还是头一回见面。」子玉道：「正是，我却出来过几次，总没有见你。」宝珠道：「今日香畹与静芳苦了，处处有他们的戏，是再不能来了。」子云道：「我算有六七人可来，谁晓得都不能来。」将到午正，桂保往外","en":"busy for another half month before things quieted down. Baozhu added, \\"I saw Xiangfan and Qianzhou there; why did Jiantan not come?\\" Wang Xun explained that he was unwell. Guibao turned to Ziyu and said, \\"This is the first time we have met this year.\\" Ziyu agreed, noting that although he had been out several times, he had never run into him. Baozhu said, \\"Xiangwan and Jingfang"}],"38":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"且说徐子云请了屈公来，并请南湘、仲清、文泽、春航、王恂、子玉作陪，仍在梅崦中。王恂是日为孙亮功请去有事，因李元茂吉期已定，要招赘过来。亮功因两位贤郎是不懂事的，一切皆托王恂料理，王恂所以不能前来。","en":"To return to our story: Xu Ziyun had invited Master Qu to attend, with Nanxiang, Zhongqing, Wenze, Chunhang, Wang Xun, and Ziyu as companions, again in the Plum Knoll. Wang Xun on this particular day had been called away by Sun Lianggong on an important matter: the wedding date had been fixed for Li Yuanmao, who was to be adopted into the"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":2,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"田春航前日已经会过，唯仲清、子玉初次识荆，见了那仙风道骨的相貌，况且又是父执，自然十分恭敬。道生见仲清骨秀神清，知是不凡。又看子玉温然玉立，皎若珠光，秀外慧中，神怡气肃，又不是那徒有外貌的一派，心中十分大喜，想道：「梅铁庵可为有子矣。」便与子玉说些江西事情，说道：「令尊大人严","en":"Tian Chunhang had met him the day before, but Zhongqing and Ziyu were making his acquaintance for the first time. Seeing that otherworldly, Taoist-sage bearing, and mindful moreover that he was a friend of his father's generation, Ziyu naturally showed the deepest respect. Master Qu saw in Zhongqing a refined"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"西首定要南湘，南湘道：「这是我乡前辈，如何敢抗礼。」才定了仲清。东席第二是南湘，西席第二是春航。东席第三是子玉，西席三是文泽。子云东席作主，次贤西席作陪。宝珠、琴言在东，蕙芳、素兰在西，一一坐了。主人让酒，客皆饮了几杯。道生道：「我将前日先见的苏媚香谈起。」西席的人个个细听。道生道：「我这看相不论气色，部位是要","en":"Nanxiang, who said, \\"This is a senior from my own region — how could I presume to take such a position?\\" And so Zhongqing was given that seat instead. Second on the east table was Nanxiang; second on the west was Chunhang. Third on the east was Ziyu; third on the west was Wenze. Ziyun presided at the east table while Cixian acted as second host at the west. Baozhu and Qinyan"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"那边仲清问道：「先生所藏金石甚富，且精于考辨。不知篆隶碑板，究以何本为最？」道生道：「古篆近人不甚讲究，如《衡岳碑》，相传七十七字，在衡岳密云峰。至宋嘉定中何致子一游南岳，拓其文刻于岳麓，杨用修又刻于滇南，杨时乔又刻于栖霞，辗转相刻，姑为弗论，余尝译其文曰：","en":"On the other side of the table, Zhongqing asked, \\"Your collection of bronze and stone inscriptions is extensive, and you are known for the precision of your assessments. Of seal script, clerical script, and carved steles, which examples do you consider the finest?\\" Qu said, \\"Seal script is not"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"、《受禅碑》、《祀孔子碑》，后魏鲁郡太守《张君颂》、李仲璇《修孔子庙碑》等等，优劣互见。汉隶已失，况其后乎。」仲清称善。","en":"excellence and inferiority. Once Han clerical script had been lost, how much more so everything that came after.' Zhongqing expressed his admiration."}],"39":[{"paragraph":5,"mentions":3,"tokens":["颜仲清","仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"到了吉期，自有梅宅家人料理，备了两桌酒，一席送颜夫人，一席待媒人，并请子玉、颜仲清作陪。仲清道：「元兄今夕真个到了群玉山头了。」王恂道：「一路荣华到白头。」子玉道：「犹道灯前相对影，愈揉双眼愈模糊。」此是近视眼洞房诗，今日可为元兄咏矣。」元茂道：「我说倒是近视眼好，就新人丑些，也看不清楚。」仲清道：「若美的呢，可不孤负了？」元茂笑","en":"preparations, laying on two tables of wine, one for Madam Yan and one for the matchmakers, while inviting Ziyu and Yan Zhongqing to keep them company. Zhongqing said, \\"Brother Yuan, tonight you truly arrive at the summit of the Jade Mountain.\\" Wang Xun said, \\"A life of glory and splendor all the way to white-haired age.\\" Ziyu said, \\"'Still they say the lamplight shows two shadows"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":6,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"元茂与新娘拜了花烛，送入新房，坐床撒帐，饮了交杯，复又请新郎上席，坐了华筵。那嗣徽、嗣元陪了一回，王恂、仲清即要移席到新房中畅饮。大家进了新房，仲清道：「今日可以看新人的。」便要走到床前。床前本有两个伴送的老妇人，还有两个小丫鬟侍立。嗣元恐怕仲清看了他的姐姐，便跑到床前把帐门把住，口内连说了几个「看」字，然后挣出「不得」两字，惹得众人都笑了。王恂扯了仲清过","en":"back out to sit at the great banquet table. Sihui and Siyuan kept them company for a while, until Wang Xun and Zhongqing proposed moving the party into the bridal chamber to drink more freely. Everyone filed into the bridal chamber. Zhongqing said, \\"Tonight we get to look at the new bride,\\" and made as if to approach the bed. By the bed stood two elderly escort-women and"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":3,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"姬亮轩与王恂、仲清是见过几回的了，子玉却是初见，心中想道：「这个梅少爷好相貌，比起那孙老徽来，倒似那戏上岑彭、马武了。」聘才问姬亮轩道：「好几天不见你东家出来，在家里作什么？」亮轩道：「这两天敝东有点贵恙，不便行动。」聘才道：「什么贵恙？」亮轩道：「听得腿上生了疖子，","en":"Ji Liangxuan had met Wang Xun and Zhongqing on several previous occasions, but this was his first meeting with Ziyu, whom he eyed with private admiration: \\"This young master Mei is a fine-looking man. Set beside that Sun Sihui, who might be Cen Peng or Ma Wu straight off the stage.\\" Pincai asked"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":2,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"不久外放，不是四川夔州府，就是湖南辰州府。李大哥是娇客，将来同到任上，不要说是账房，只怕内外一切都要仰仗呢。」仲清听了好笑，忍不住道：「足下与孙府上怎么样的亲？」亮轩道：「孙大哥的嫡亲舅嫂，是我两姨中表嫡亲表嫂之嫡亲表妹，这是新亲。叙起老亲来，从前已故太太的外祖，是我丈人的丈人。」仲清笑起来，聘才道：「这个青，也只好算个蛋青了。」亮轩道：「虽然是淡亲，却也胜于举","en":"won't just be as a secretary, for I should think the entire household, inside and out, will have to rely on you.\\" Zhongqing found this amusing and could not help asking, \\"And how exactly are you related to the Sun household?\\" Liangxuan said, \\"The legitimate sister-in-law of Elder Sun's mother-in-law is the elder cousin on my mother's sister's side, through her legitimate"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"华公府上的上宾，就是少府。都是一班贵客。只有区区小子，是个幕宾，将来总要拜求栽培栽培，携带携带。」说得个恶心。仲清忍不住问道：「姬先生这样叙起来，我们都可以算得亲戚，只要多转两个弯。」亮轩连称「正是」。子玉微笑。元茂道：「我非但算不得清，而且也听不清，真是葫芦牵倒扁豆藤。」聘才笑道：「忙中遇着腿缠筋。」嗣徽道：「亲亲也，凡有血气者莫不尊亲。亲亲人也，仁者人也。」","en":"patronage and assistance in future, your support and kind mention.\\" This speech fairly turned everyone's stomach. Zhongqing could not contain himself and said, \\"The way Master Ji works out these connections, we all become kinsmen, as it merely requires a few more turns in the pedigree.\\" Liangxuan agreed heartily. Ziyu smiled. Yuanmao said, \\"Not only can I not follow the connections,"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"仲清道：「我有个笑话也是现成的。海龙王有一天放那些怪物转生，已放过了好些。末后，巡海夜叉在泥里掏出两个怪物，求龙王放他，龙王看时，一个是王八，一个是蛤蟆。龙王道：「这两个放他去，我有些不放心，教他找个保人来。」王八听了，即指着旁边龟丞相道：「他是我本家。","en":"Zhongqing said, \\"I have a ready-made joke for the occasion. One day the Dragon King of the Sea was releasing the various monsters to be reborn into the world, and had already freed a great many. At last a night-patrolling Yaksha dug two creatures out of the mud"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"过了几日，元茂谢媒拜客，听得王恂、仲清问他的新人怎样得意，不说别样，总说的是头发。有的说是白丝细发，有的说是银丝鹤发，总不懂什么意思。人家见他得意，也是诧异。","en":"when Yuanmao was making the rounds of thanks to the matchmakers and paying calls on well-wishers, Wang Xun and Zhongqing asked him how he found his new wife. He said nothing about anything else, but kept talking about hair, one person said it was white silk-fine hair, another said it was silver thread and crane feathers, and no one could make out what he meant. People"}],"43":[{"paragraph":3,"mentions":1,"tokens":["剑潭"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"宝珠让坐了。琴言道：「你早上那里去？」素兰道：「今早王大人叫我去，我当是什么紧要事，原来很不要紧的一句话。我与剑潭、庸庵谈了一会，方才到家。知道你请我，不知有何差委？」宝珠将方才的话与素兰讲了，素兰拍手笑道：「果然，果然不出我们所料！我真佩服他。据我说是出师的妙，你且应承他出师。」琴言道：「好容易的话，你倒轻轻的一口断定了。这三千头打那里来，我岂能去对华公子讲的","en":"Sulan. \\"I thought it must be something urgent, but it turned out to be quite a trifling matter. I had a chat with Jiantan and Yong'an, and only just got home. I heard you had sent for me. What is it you need?\\" Baozhu repeated everything that had just been discussed. Sulan clapped his hands and laughed: \\"Just as I thought! Just as I predicted! I truly admire him. My view"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":1,"tokens":["剑潭"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"仙、庾香可以凑得四百金。」次贤道：「我来一分，出二百金，前舟可出三百金，庸庵、竹君二人可出三百金。庾香、湘帆、剑潭不必派他，凑起来已得一千八百了。若要三千，还少一千二百两，不消说是度香包圆了。」子云道：「难道华星北倒干干净净，一文不花，这么便宜。」蕙芳道：「据我说，不必要他出钱。如今与他讲，就是一总要他拿出来，他也肯，但是玉侬只好在他家一辈子了。」子云点头道：「","en":"three hundred; Yong'an and Zhujun together can provide three hundred. We need not call on Yuxiang, Xiangfan, or Jiantan. All told we would have one thousand eight hundred. If three thousand is the target, we are still short one thousand two hundred, which means, it goes without saying, Duxiang makes up the rest.\\" \\"Surely Hua Xingbei is not let off entirely without spending"}],"44":[{"paragraph":18,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这是琴言出师第二日，琴言原要今日进去，适子云于初六日要请客，一来与南湘、春航送场，并请屈道生，约子玉、仲清等相陪。今日已是初四，索性到初七进去，并说写个字贴与华公子，说他过了假期，一因身子不快，二因留他逛几天。所以琴言倒也心安，乐得多顽几日。","en":"on the sixth day of the month — to send off Nanxiang and Chunhang, and to host Master Qu Daosheng, with Ziyu, Zhongqing, and others invited to keep them company. As today was only the fourth, they resolved to wait until the seventh for Qinyan to go back, and to draft a note to Young Master Hua explaining that after his leave expired, Qinyan had felt unwell and had been"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":1,"tokens":["剑潭"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"纵横，恐怕遇着那冬烘考官，就要委屈了。殿试工夫，竹君不及湘帆，若试宏词，竹君倒要擅长了。我看今年庾香是必得的，剑潭、卓然也有九分。」子云道：「你自己呢，一发拿得稳了。」次贤道：「也不去考，我自知无福。」子云道：「这叫什么话？你不应举也罢了，还可以说得无心进取。这宏词原是品定海内人才，就是那些老前辈退居林下的，还来应考，岂有全才如你，倒不去的？那时我托人硬把你荐了","en":"Scholars examination, Zhujun would have the advantage. My view is that Yuxiang is certain to pass this year, and Jiantan and Zhuoran each have a nine-in-ten chance.\\" \\"And you yourself,\\" said Ziyun, \\"are a foregone conclusion.\\" \\"I am not entering,\\" said Cixian. \\"I know my own lack of fortune in such things.\\" \\"What sort of talk is that?\\" said Ziyun. \\"If you choose not to"}],"45":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["颜仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"昨日子云又请了屈道生、梅子玉、史南湘、颜仲清、田春航、刘文泽、王恂等，并有诸名旦全来，会了一日。因南湘、春航次早要入场，所以散得甚早。","en":"The day before, Ziyun had once again invited Qu Daosheng, Mei Ziyu, Shi Nanxiang, Yan Zhongqing, Tian Chunhang, Liu Wenze, Wang Xun, and others. Together with all the leading actors, they had gathered for an entire day. Since Nanxiang and Chunhang were to enter the examination hall the following morning, the gathering disbanded quite early."},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":1,"tokens":["颜仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"颜夫人是从没有阻过他的。子玉到了辰刻，因是仙坛，衣冠而去。是日一早，屈道生同金吉甫先到，随后颜仲清、刘文泽、王恂一齐都来了，子玉到了，各人与吉甫相见，叙了些彼此仰慕的话。只有史南湘、田春航在场中未来。相公们到的是宝珠、蕙芳、素兰、玉林、漱芳、兰保、桂保、春喜、琪官、连琴言刚是十人。","en":"he went in full dress. Early that morning, Qu Daosheng and Jin Jifu had already arrived. They were followed by Yan Zhongqing, Liu Wenze, Wang Xun, and finally Ziyu. They exchanged words of long admiration with Jifu. Shi Nanxiang and Tian Chunhang were still at the examination grounds. Among the performers who came were Baozhu, Huifang, Sulan, Yulin, Shufang, Lanbao, Guibao,"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"梅花一枝开春先，瑶琴三尺弹鹍弦。\\n红愁绿怨泪沾袖，明月一年几度圆。\\n道生写了。仲清对金粟道：「这四句像是说庾香与玉侬的。」金粟点头。子玉看了，分明一个梅字，一个琴字，也知道是说他们二人的，心里又想道：「难道坡仙今日要将这十九个人全写入诗内么？」子云与诸人也都看了，蕙芳呆呆的看着乩盘，只见道生又照着乩上写了四句是：","en":"strings.\\nRed grief, green longing, tears soak the sleeves,\\nHow many times each year does the bright moon wax full?\\"\\nZhongqing turned to Jin Su and whispered, \\"These lines sound like Yuxiang and Yunong.\\" Jin nodded in agreement. Ziyu plainly saw the characters mei (plum) and qin (zither), and he knew they spoke of the two of them. He wondered whether Su meant to gather all nineteen"},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":2,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"石崇王恺人争羡，世德勋门荷天眷。\\n只惜豪华怒碎琴，明珠减价珊瑚贱。\\n仲清道：「这不消说是华公子。」子云道：「竟连前日的事，都说出来了。你知道明珠、珊瑚的故事么？」仲清道：「我不知这句的故事。」文泽道：「明珠是他有十婢，皆以珠字为名，这珊瑚就是林珊枝了。」又看写的是：","en":"favor blessed.\\nPity such splendor vented rage at a qin,\\nBright pearls cheapened, coral branches priced less.\\"\\nZhongqing exclaimed, \\"That can only be Young Master Hua.\\" Ziyun agreed, \\"Even last week's quarrel appears. Do you know the pearl and coral story?\\" Zhongqing shook his head. \\"I don't know that line.\\" Wenze explained, \\"The pearls were his ten maids, all named with"},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":1,"tokens":["剑潭"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"冲寒一鹤云中来，知尔磊落非凡材。\\n依刘暂作王粲计，剑气闪烁凌风雷。\\n子云道：「此是剑潭无疑了。」又见写道：","en":"like Wang Can,\\nSword-flash gleams to rend the wind and thunder there.\\"\\nZiyun smiled and said, \\"That is surely Jiantan.\\" Next:"},{"paragraph":39,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"哈哈大笑道：「愿意了，愿意了！这也不是轻易遇得着的。」就让众人到承荫堂，铺了红毡，次贤、子云扶道生坐了，文泽、仲清拉过琴言来拜了八拜，道生受了。","en":"led everyone to the Hall of Inherited Shade and spread a red carpet. Cixian and Ziyun seated Daosheng. Wenze and Zhongqing gently drew Qinyan forward to perform eight deep bows, and Daosheng graciously received them."},{"paragraph":41,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云便请入席。第一席是道生、子玉、吉甫、王胡子、琴言，二席是仲清、文泽、王恂、子云、次贤，九个名旦分为两桌，各自叙齿坐了三、四两席。琴言坐在下手，拘拘谨谨，也不举箸，甚觉可怜。倒是道生体恤他，道：「凡遇热闹场中，当言的即言，也不必过于拘谨，但存着个后辈的分寸就是了。」","en":"everyone to the table. The first table sat Daosheng, Ziyu, Jifu, Old Wang Beard, and Qinyan. The second seated Zhongqing, Wenze, Wang Xun, Ziyun, and Cixian. The nine actors split two more tables by age. Qinyan sat quietly at the foot, his chopsticks untouched, looking pitifully constrained. Daosheng comforted him gently. \\"In lively gatherings, speak when speech is due."},{"paragraph":48,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"至今日看去，似觉草草。昨日我与度香商量，尚须添的添，换的换，非道翁及诸兄手笔不可。」仲清道：「我们究竟还没有逛到。须尽一日之兴，游到了，方可拟题。」子云道：「含万楼下，我想刻一篇怡园序，要借重道翁。明日搬来，第一就要请教这篇序。」次贤笑道：「他还没有搬进来，你倒先索房租了。」说得众人大笑。道生约定明日即移过来，与琴言同住。","en":"Some must be added, and others swapped. Nothing less than Old Gentleman's brush and yours, gentlemen, will do.\\" Zhongqing pointed out, \\"We still have not seen the garden through. Only after a full day's wandering can we draft proper texts.\\" Ziyun agreed. \\"Below the Tower of Myriad Containment, I wish to engrave a *Preface to the Garden of Contentment*, and I humbly beg"}],"46":[{"paragraph":3,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"诸名士于二十八日早上陆续皆到。是日子玉、春航、南湘、仲清、文泽、王恂，共是六位，惟吉甫因感冒未到。园内屈氏父子，与次贤、主人四位，都在含万楼下坐了。道翁道：「这个含万楼是本《易经》「含万物而化光」句摘下，因为园中的主楼，故取此名。但就本意是言干道之大，此名似乎不甚相宜，度香以为何如？我见楼上现供着赐书，何","en":"On the twenty-eighth morning the gentlemen arrived piecemeal: Ziyu, Chunhang, Nanxiang, Zhongqing, Wenze and Wang Xun—six—while Jifu stayed home with a chill. The Qu father and son, Cixian and their host — four in all — sat below the Tower of Myriad Containment. Daoweng explained: \\"This tower borrows from the *Book of Changes*: 'embracing the myriad"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":3,"tokens":["仲清","剑潭"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"尽是碧杜、红兰、翠苔、绿藓，甚为幽雅。道翁道：「此处甚佳，一洗宝香堂繁华之气，不可不题。」因题为风露清吟馆，对仲清道：「剑潭兄试题一联。」仲清不能推辞，此处也合他的雅趣，即题道：","en":"Treasured Fragrance. It must be inscribed.\\" He named it the Lodge of Pure Chanting in Wind and Dew, and said to Zhongqing, \\"Brother Jiantan, try a couplet on it.\\" Zhongqing could not well refuse, and the place suited his own taste besides, so he inscribed:"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"二分水蘸三分竹，一面山栽两面花。\\n道翁赞道：「好极了，却移不到别处去。」仲清笑道：「有先生的珠玉在前，我等实难附尾，不过聊以塞责而已。」文泽道：「此处我竟没有来游玩过。」王恂道：「我也没有，到护香廊就住了。」南湘道：「我去年看菊花，是从这里走过，倒游了一游。」子云引道，过了一座木桥，从竹林走出，是片空地，有几间敞厅，立着鹄棚","en":"of hill bears two slopes of bloom.\\"\\n\\nDaoweng exclaimed, \\"Excellent — and it could not be moved anywhere else.\\" Zhongqing smiled. \\"With your pearls before us, we can hardly do more than follow at the tail; it is only to fill the gap.\\" Wenze said, \\"I have never once come and looked at this place.\\" Wang Xun said, \\"Nor I. I always stopped at the colonnade.\\" Nanxiang said,"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"两字，只好刻在山上。在房屋里，这崦字似乎要改才好。」道翁道：「就请教换个名字。」子玉道：「还请道翁先生改罢。」仲清道：「你若想着了好的，就说也不妨。」道翁道：「正是，就我换得不妥，也要请教大家商量的。」子玉道：「改做古香林屋罢。」道翁道：「妙、妙！这个古香林屋实在改得妙，就请题一联以成全璧。」子玉要取笔写时，琴仙道：「我代写，你念来。」子玉一面念，琴仙一面写，众","en":"changing.\\"\\n\\n\\"Then please favor us with another name,\\" said Daoweng.\\n\\n\\"I would rather ask you to alter it, sir.\\"\\n\\nZhongqing smiled. \\"If a good one has come to you, there is no harm in saying it.\\"\\n\\n\\"Exactly,\\" Daoweng agreed. \\"Even if my own replacement proved unsuitable, we should still have to ask everyone to deliberate together.\\"\\n\\n\\"Then let it be called the Ancient-Fragrance"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉看了，真是喜不自胜。琴仙见子玉题了这副好对，也觉得玉颜春暖，笑启朱唇，仲清、南湘等也替子玉喜欢。大家走出了梅崦，过了梅林，转过一处，又是一个庭院。","en":"Ziyu brimmed with joy; Qinxian glowed knowing Ziyu had brushed the scroll—Zhongqing and Nanxiang shared their delight. They left the plum grove, crossed the silent woods, turned into another courtyard."},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一曲惜余芳，娇比玉颜时醒醉；\\n众人大赞，倒将琴仙赞得不好意思起来。仲清道：「可惜没有下联。」子玉将这句不住的吟哦，次贤道：「这下联非庾香续成不可。」道翁道：「果然，就烦庾香点铁成金罢。」子玉欣然提起笔来，写道：","en":"jade face, hovering between waking and wine;\\"\\n\\nThe company praised it so much that Qinxian grew shy under it. Zhongqing said, \\"A pity there is no lower line.\\" Ziyu kept murmuring the words over. Cixian said, \\"Nobody but Yuxiang can complete that lower line.\\" Daoweng said, \\"True enough. Let us trouble Yuxiang to turn iron into gold.\\" Ziyu took up the brush with pleasure"},{"paragraph":31,"mentions":1,"tokens":["剑潭"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，屋边皆树，云护烟笼，赞道：「我看园中以此处为第一，这榭名也好，就每层有一副对子。前舟题第一层，竹君题第二层，剑潭题第三层。必皆有惊人好句，老夫洗耳恭听。」三人不能推让，先看文泽的第一层是：","en":"pavilion is good too. Each storey should have its couplet. Let Qianzhou inscribe the first, Zhujun the second and Jiantan the third. They will all have startling lines in them, and this old man will listen with washed ears.\\"\\n\\nThe three could not decline. They looked first at Wenze's, for the lowest storey:"},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"及众人痛赞了。道翁道：「这第二层最难，上有第三层，下有第一层，这要看竹君的巧思了。」南湘已想了一会，颇难着笔。仲清也在那里凝思，各要争胜。南湘已得了，写了出来，道：「题得不好，将就算他第二层罢。」众人看是：","en":"will take all Zhujun's ingenuity.\\" Nanxiang had been thinking a good while and found it hard to set pen to paper; Zhongqing sat pondering too, each wanting to outdo the other. Then Nanxiang had it, wrote it out, and said, \\"It is badly done. Let it pass for the middle storey.\\" They read:"},{"paragraph":33,"mentions":2,"tokens":["剑潭","仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"置身已觉超平等；月光穿竹树，放眼请登最上层。\\n道翁赞道：「果然是第二层的联句，移易不动，这是煞费苦心才得出来。剑潭的第三层如何？想另有妙意。」仲清道：「我的不及竹君的切题。」即写了出来，看是：君如趁月来游，云移一鹤；我欲乘风归去，桥卧长虹。","en":"afar, please ascend the highest tier.\\"\\nDaoweng said: \\"Truly the middle voice—immovable—clearly wrought with pain. Jiantan, the summit?\\" Zhongqing answered: \\"Mine cannot match his fit\\" and wrote: Should you roam by moon, a crane rides shifting cloud; I would ride the wind home—a long bridge sleeps like rainbow."},{"paragraph":34,"mentions":1,"tokens":["剑潭"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"南湘看了，先痛赞起来，道：「剑潭此联，颇有仙气，这断不像第二层，也不像第一层，实在是第三层最高处，我真服了你这种浑脱句子。」道翁与诸人也齐声痛赞。","en":"Nanxiang cried admiration: \\"Immortal breath—neither lowest nor middle tone—pure top-storey height—I yield to such unfettered lines!\\" Daoweng and all thundered praise."},{"paragraph":52,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"朱霞半天，映着那些牡丹花，更为绚烂。已撤了护花的幛子。子云备了两席，一席是道翁、南湘、子玉、琴仙、次贤，一席是仲清、春航、文泽、王恂、子云。","en":"peonies blazing—protective screens gone. Two tables waited—one for Daoweng, Nanxiang, Ziyu, Qinxian, Cixian; one for Zhongqing, Chunhang, Wenze, Wang Xun, Ziyun."},{"paragraph":53,"mentions":1,"tokens":["剑潭"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"底觉得力薄，那里能这样大方，这是勉强不来的。」道翁道：「这也不然，一来相体裁衣，二来是各人的性灵。今日高超的是剑潭，沉着的是竹君，细腻风光的是庾香，风华绮丽的是湘帆，秀润工稳的是庸庵、前舟，潇洒跌宕的是静宜，就是度香那副集句，也觉得落落大方。正是各人自立一帜，无从评定甲乙。你们看这二十四副对子，好在虚字少，尽是实字多，便见得力量。若教外边那些名宿做起来，不知要添","en":"the first place one cuts the coat to the cloth, and in the second every man writes out of his own nature. Today Jiantan is the lofty one; Zhujun the weighty; Yuxiang has the delicate scene; Xiangfan the rich and splendid; Yong'an and Qianzhou the polished and well-turned; Jingyi the free and unconstrained; and even Duxiang's set of borrowed lines has an easy largeness"}],"48":[{"paragraph":18,"mentions":2,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"最传诵者，为落霞秋水一联，然亦不过写景而已。」南湘道：「我们今日作何消遣？你看天也晴了。去年是初六日，我记得是仲清泰山的生日，那日所以仲清没有能来。今年竟都不在坐。」","en":"how they should amuse themselves since the sky had cleared, recalling that last year on the sixth it had been Zhongqing's father-in-law's birthday, which kept Zhongqing away, and this year that entire group was absent."},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":2,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"耽搁了一早晨，吃了面，即便辞回。王恂留住不放，陆夫人也留他。子玉是一腔心事，如何留得住？只得将实话悄悄的告诉了仲清。仲清与王恂说了，方才放他出来。","en":"Burdened with a heart full of sorrowful thoughts, he found it impossible to remain. He quietly confided the truth to Zhongqing, who then spoke to Wang Xun, finally securing Ziyu's release."},{"paragraph":36,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"了六百，文泽送了二百，道翁的盘费很富足了。子云、次贤各备车马跟着，一直送出城外，直到十里之外皇华亭。只见南湘、仲清、文泽、金粟、王恂、子玉、春航，领着那蕙芳、宝珠、素兰、漱芳、玉林、兰保、桂保、琪官、春喜九个名旦，在皇华亭等候。道翁等连忙下车，极口辞谢。各人皆要把盏。","en":"beyond the city wall to the Imperial Envoys' Pavilion, ten miles away. Waiting there at the pavilion were Nanxiang, Zhongqing, Wenze, Jin Su, Wang Xun, Ziyu, and Chunhang, alongside Huifang and the nine famous performers: Baozhu, Sulan, Shufang, Yulin, Lanbao, Guibao, Qiguan, and Chunxi. Daoweng hurried down from his carriage and thanked everyone repeatedly, as they all eagerly"}],"49":[{"paragraph":13,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"人。翰林院侍读学士梅公之子名子玉，目下少年中有景星凤凰之誉。」苏侯点点头。子云又道：「已故翰林院编修颜庄之子名仲清，现任礼部尚书刘大人之子名文泽，内阁学士王大人之子名恂。此外，还有苏州拔贡生高品，湖南优贡生萧次贤。这几位都是名下无虚，与田修撰、史庶常朝夕观摩，是门生往来无间的。其余不知其他，不敢滥举。」苏侯听了，掀髯大笑：「怎么你举的人，多半是我的年侄？你不要阿","en":"star and a phoenix.\\" Su the Marquis nodded. Ziyun went on, \\"The son of the late Hanlin Compiler Yan Zhuang, named Zhongqing; the son of the current Minister of Rites Lord Liu, named Wenze; and the son of Academician of the Grand Secretariat Lord Wang, named Xun. In addition, there is the Suzhou specially recommended graduate Gao Pin, and the Hunan honored graduate Xiao Cixian."}],"50":[{"paragraph":5,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"会画兰竹与几笔花卉，山水尚是乱画的，草虫他更不会。此时说我比他好，我也不安，将来或者赶得上他。」正说话间，只见仲清、王恂同着琪官、桂保进来。","en":"than him now makes me uneasy, but perhaps in the future, I might catch up to him.\\" Just as they were speaking, Zhongqing and Wang Xun walked in, accompanied by Qiguan and Guibao."},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"文泽见了大喜，问道：「怎么今日不约而同，都到这里来？」仲清道：「庸庵要到蕊香那里去，却遇见玉艳，想同到新开的庄子里去坐坐。见你的车在门口，所以进来。」文泽道：「莫非就是那唐和尚开的安吉堂么？闻得那地方倒好，他又将寺里的几间房子也通了过去，我们就去。」春喜道：「怪热的天，在这里不好吗？」桂保道：「那里也好，内","en":"overjoyed to see them and asked, \\"How is it that you all arrived together here today, without even arranging it?\\" Zhongqing explained, \\"Yong'an was on his way to see Ruixiang, but ran into Yuyan. We thought we might go sit for a while at the newly opened establishment. Seeing your carriage parked outside, we decided to come in here first.\\" Wenze guessed, \\"Could it be the"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":2,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"磨墨再烦高力士，当垆重访卓文君。\\n众人看了大笑，仲清道：「怪不得这里热，被这些联额字画，看得出汗。」再看两边墙上两个大横披，一个姓马的写的字，其恶俗已到不堪，那一幅画甚离奇，是画的张生游寺。文泽等又笑了一阵。掌柜的进来张罗了一会，亲手倒了几杯茶出去，遂换走堂进来点菜。王恂道：「这里的生炒翅子、烧鸭子是","en":"trouble Gao Lishi;\\nReturn to the wine stand to visit Zhuo Wenjun.\\"\\nThe group burst into laughter upon reading it. Zhongqing said, \\"No wonder it feels so hot in here; just looking at these vulgar plaques and couplets is enough to make one sweat!\\" Looking at the two large horizontal scrolls on the side walls, one featured calligraphy by a man surnamed Ma—so atrociously vulgar"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":4,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"文泽问起子玉，还是前月初七日送行时见他。仲清道：「庾香以后大约未必肯出门的了，我们去看过他几次，他又病了几天，俨然去年夏天的模样。他这个元神，此时正跟着玉侬在长江里守风，只怕要送他到了南昌，才肯回来呢。」琪官听了，眉颦起来，神情之间，颇有感慨，说道：「初六那一日，我请他们叙了半日，虽然彼此啼哭","en":"Wenze asked after Ziyu, noting he hadn't seen him since they saw him off on the seventh of the previous month. Zhongqing sighed, \\"Since Yuxiang left, it's unlikely he's willing to step out of the house. We've visited him a few times, and he's fallen ill again for days—he looks exactly as he did last summer. His very soul, I fear, is out there braving the winds on the Yangtze"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"后不兴说这种冷字。若要说这种冷字，字典上翻一翻，就说不尽。且教人认不真，有甚趣味？」琪官被驳得在理，也不言语。仲清道：「倒也有趣，我们也说几个。我说旧管是个射字。新收一个木字，是榭字。开除了身字，实在是村字。」","en":"fun if people don't even recognize them.\\" Qiguan, finding the reasoning sound, accepted the ruling in silence. Zhongqing smiled, \\"This is rather amusing; let us offer a few. I say the 'Old Stock' is 'shoot' (射). The 'New Intake' is 'wood' (木), forming 'pavilion' (榭). 'Remove' 'body' (身), and the 'Actual Remainder' is 'village' (村).\\""},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"心字，是患字。开除了口字，实在是忠字。」春喜道：「我旧管是昌字，新收门字，是个阊字。开除了曰字，实在是间字。」仲清道：「我旧管是贱字，新收三点水，是溅字。开除了贝字，实在是浅字。」文泽道：「我旧管是波字，新收一个女字，是婆字。开除了波字，实在是女字。」春喜道：「怎么说？闹错了。旧管是波字。怎么开除也是波字？新收是女字，怎么实在又是女字？内中少了运化。」桂保道：「","en":"'New Intake' is 'door' (门), forming chang (阊). 'Remove' 'say' (曰), and the 'Actual Remainder' is 'between' (间).\\" Zhongqing added, \\"My 'Old Stock' is 'cheap' (贱). The 'New Intake' is the three water drops (氵), forming 'splash' (溅). 'Remove' 'shell' (贝), and the 'Actual Remainder' is 'shallow' (浅).\\" Wenze said, \\"My 'Old Stock' is 'wave' (波). The 'New Intake' is 'woman' (女),"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"中了状元，另娶韩丞相之女为妻，一旦把奴休了，是令人气愤不过等。」把他头一段口白分作三段，这就通身文气都接了。」仲清、文泽、王恂道：「这都改得好，但如今讲究唱昆腔的也不少，怎么就不晓得这些毛病呢？」春喜道：「唱清曲的人，原不用口白，他来改正他做什么？唱戏曲的课师，教曲时总是先教曲文，后将口白接写一篇，挤在一处，没有分开段落，所以沿袭下来，总是这样。」众人正在谈得高","en":"initial long speech into three separate sections, the emotional current runs smoothly through the entire scene.\\" Zhongqing, Wenze, and Wang Xun praised him, \\"Those revisions are brilliant! But since there are so many who study Kunqu deeply these days, how is it they don't recognize these flaws?\\" Chunxi sighed, \\"Those who sing 'pure songs' (qingqu) don't use spoken text anyway,"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"仲清等大笑。","en":"Zhongqing and the others burst into uproarious laughter."},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"板着脸，一点笑容也没有。」王恂道：「方才里头吹唱的是谁？」唐和尚道：「那就是魏大爷。」文泽道：「那个魏大爷？」仲清道：「魏聘才在这里作寓。」唐和尚道：「魏大爷，想少爷们都认识的。」王恂道：「认识之至。」唐和尚道：「这个人真好，真是个满场飞。近来他也要出京了。方才是杨八爷、张、顾二位师老爷在那里，大家高兴，唱了几只曲子。」","en":"flute in the room next door just now?\\" Tang replied, \\"Oh, that was Master Wei.\\" Wenze pressed, \\"Which Master Wei?\\" Zhongqing clarified, \\"Wei Pincai is lodging here.\\" Tang said, \\"Master Wei! I imagine you young masters must all know him.\\" Wang Xun nodded, \\"Intimately.\\" Tang praised him, \\"He is a truly wonderful man, the life of any gathering! He will be leaving the capital"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"仲清道：「他出京怎么？」和尚道：「他捐了个从九品，如今是分发湖北去了，这也是他运气好。正月里被贼一偷，偷去衣服、银钱等物，共有千金，也就把他的家私去了一半。后来他又包了那个玉天仙，每月一百五十吊钱，四五个月也支持不来，渐渐的当卖东西起来。我常常劝他道：「","en":"Zhongqing asked, \\"Why is he leaving the capital?\\" Monk Tang leaned in, full of gossip, \\"He purchased a ninth-rank official posting and has been assigned to Hubei. Talk about good luck! During the first month of the year, a thief robbed him, taking clothes, silver,"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":3,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"那三个相公看着唐和尚胁肩谄笑，好不难看。仲清道：「连日未见瑶卿。」琪官道：「瑶卿近日从着吉甫学琴呢，竟是足不出户。吉甫也真好静，他当日教过梅卿弹琴，自梅卿死后，他的《梅花三弄》是再不弹的了。你说这也算深于情了。」仲清道：「吉甫的人本沈静高雅，于这些文玩无上无不精通。」大家谈论，日已西沉，文泽等","en":"watched Monk Tang hunching his shoulders in his obsequious, fawning smile and found the sight utterly repulsive. Zhongqing said, \\"I haven't seen Yaoqing for days.\\" Qiguan replied, \\"Yaoqing has been studying the guqin with Jifu recently; he practically never steps out of the house. Jifu truly loves his peace and quiet. Back in the day, he taught Meiqing how to play the qin,"}],"52":[{"paragraph":3,"mentions":1,"tokens":["颜仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"聚星堂观戏，演得是联珠班。春航陪着一班名士在花园挹爽斋观演联锦班。那一天大媒是徐子云，客是萧次贤、高品、南湘、颜仲清、刘文泽、王恂、梅子玉。近日子玉病已好了，勉强打起精神出来。这八个名旦不消说都在园中，那聚星堂上一个也不去，尽是一班中年的脚色，与那些寻常的旦脚，在那里应酬。","en":"Troupe. The principal matchmaker that day was Xu Ziyun, and the guests included Xiao Cixian, Gao Pin, Nanxiang, Yan Zhongqing, Liu Wenze, Wang Xun, and Mei Ziyu. Ziyu had only recently recovered from his illness, forcing himself to rally his spirits to attend. Naturally, all eight famous dan actors remained in the garden; not a single one went to the Gathering Stars Hall, which"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"华公子又与高品、南湘、仲清、王恂、文泽、次贤各讲了些话，知高品才从苏州来，问了些江苏风景。偶然见素兰的扇子一面画的甚细，要了过来，看了一会。又见那一面写着小楷，题目是《断肠词》。华公子道：「肠何可以轻断？」子玉见了，又觉不安。华公子低低吟了一遍，又问素兰道：「这是你自己的么？","en":"Young Master Hua then conversed with Gao Pin, Nanxiang, Zhongqing, Wang Xun, Wenze, and Cixian. Learning that Gao Pin had just arrived from Suzhou, he asked about the landscapes of Jiangsu. By chance, he noticed Sulan holding a fan with exceedingly delicate painting on one side and asked to look at it. Turning it over,"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"互至，秀韵天然，赞叹不已。子玉道：「这第二首也像闺阁口气。」子云道：「不要是他夫人题的么？这两首像是唱和的。」仲清道：「未必，如果是他夫人写的，怎肯给人？」次贤道：「这话说得是。」诸名士在园内谈心，却说那聚星堂上，王文辉见诸名旦一个不来，颇觉岑寂，又不好意思去叫他们。想蕙芳在账房里，便叫了他出来。蕙芳也累苦了，乐得出来歇歇，便到文辉席上来，就在文辉旁边坐了。此处","en":"woman's voice.\\" Ziyun suggested, \\"Could his wife have written them? These two seem to be a harmonized exchange.\\" Zhongqing doubted this, \\"Not necessarily. If his wife had written it, how could he so casually give it away?\\" Cixian agreed, \\"That is a fair point.\\" While the scholars chatted in the garden, back in the Gathering Stars Hall, Wang Wenhui found the absence of the"}],"54":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":4,"tokens":["仲清","剑潭"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉年已十九，可以完婚，若要等我任满回来，要到明年冬天，适或又有调动。更觉迟了。况王质夫又系至亲至好，一切可托仲清料理，不丰不俭，叫颜夫人办了这件亲事。又与子玉一个谕帖，说近日寄来诗文颇有些进境。今秋有宏词之试，你要自己明白，如可以自信去得，即求人保荐。如果不能自信，也不必好此虚名。颜夫人问子玉道：「你父亲问你信得过再去，信不过就不用去，你是怎样？」子玉道：「自","en":"later if transfer came. Since Wang Zhifu was a close kinsman and trusted friend, everything could be entrusted to Zhongqing. The wedding should be done appropriately, neither lavish nor mean. He sent Ziyu a separate instruction: Ziyu's recent writings showed progress; with the autumn special exam approaching, Ziyu should judge himself honestly—seek recommendation only if"},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":4,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"意，第一试共有八百人，就贴去了五百，第二场止三百名了，第三场出榜时，只取了六十名。王恂已被落，高品取在四十九，仲清取在二十七，子玉取在第二。另期殿试，子玉文星照命，也占鳌头，共取了三十二名。仲清、高品才高运蹇，皆被落。此科最年轻者就是子玉一人，授了编修之职，颜夫人好不喜欢。正是身经三试，压倒群英，比中状元难得多了。子玉见仲清、高品、王恂等落第，心甚不安，并不以此","en":"three hundred remained; after session three, only sixty. Wang Xun was eliminated; Gao Pin placed forty-ninth, Zhongqing twenty-seventh, and Ziyu second. At palace-level final selection, Ziyu's star burned bright: he took top place and, among thirty-two selected, was appointed compiler. Zhongqing and Gao Pin, talented but unlucky, were both dropped. Ziyu was the youngest"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一日，王恂的妻子孙佩秋与仲清的妻子蓉华，到琼华房里来贺喜，蓉华道：「妹夫恭喜，压倒了天下英才。如今是玉堂金马，才子神仙，比今科鼎甲还要体面了好些，这是妹妹的福气，我如何比得上来？」佩秋讲道：「二姑爷真是天下第一个才子，我听这些赴考宏词，从前中过鼎甲，点过翰林的也有在内，也考不过","en":"One day Sun Peiqiu, Wang Xun's wife, and Ronghua, Zhongqing's wife, came to Qionghua's room to offer their congratulations. Ronghua said, \\"Joy to you, little sister! Your husband-to-be has borne down all the finest talents under heaven. Now he belongs to the Jade Hall and Golden Horse Gate—a gifted scholar among"},{"paragraph":37,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"场，如今不知这琴言又怎样了。」却说王文辉定了九月十九日吉期，颜夫人写了家信，说子玉已中宏词，又即完姻，一切交与仲清办理。","en":"Ziyu had passed the Broad Learning examination and was to be married at once, and that everything had been put in Zhongqing's hands."},{"paragraph":38,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"仲清打起精神，幸他本来旷达，也不将这些得失放在心里，便照常一样。过了几日，吉期已到，两边各请喜酒，还有那些名旦夹在里头，送戏送席的，闹了好几天。洞房花烛之夜，子玉一见，颇觉心花开放。说也奇怪，倒不是做书人说谎，也是前定姻缘，皇天可怜子玉这一片苦心，因琴言","en":"Zhongqing roused himself. Being naturally broad-minded, he did not brood over gains and losses and resumed normal life. Soon the wedding date arrived. Both families hosted celebratory banquets, with famous performers woven throughout, delivering operas and feasts"},{"paragraph":41,"mentions":1,"tokens":["剑潭"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"玉只得赔笑道：「这事也不用讲他，横竖久后自知，也不须分辩的。我今日见着度香，说他夫人要请你去赏菊花，还请庸庵与剑潭的夫人，并众相好的夫人。你去不去呢？」琼华道：「我不去罢。」子玉道：「为什么不愿去？」琼华道：「一来我也才过来，还没有满月。二来也要等太太吩咐，如太太去，我就跟了去。」子玉道：「他们不请太太，单请你们一辈人。度香并说他夫人讲的，日子还没有定，要一家一","en":"I saw Duxiang, who said his wife wants to invite you to view chrysanthemums, inviting the wives of Yong'an and Jiantan and other close friends. Will you go?\\" Qionghua said she would probably not go. Why? \\"First, I have just come over and a month hasn't passed. Second, I must wait for Madam's instructions; if Madam goes, I will follow.\\" Ziyu said they were not inviting"}],"57":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["颜仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"贤淑无双，又且绣口锦心，才能咏絮。于十月初十日，请了华公子的夫人苏浣香、田春航的夫人浣兰、刘文泽的夫人吴紫烟、颜仲清的夫人王蓉华、梅子玉的夫人琼华、王恂的夫人孙佩秋。此时园中菊花开满，五色斑烂。是日晴光和蔼，风不扬尘，小毛衣服都用不着，绵的尽够了。袁绮香一早带了十二红婢，还有几个家人媳妇，先到园里候客。那日次贤、高品、南湘皆回避了。那十二红都是十五六岁，有的已是云","en":"month, she invited Hua Gongzi's wife, Su Huanxiang; Tian Chunhang's wife, Huanlan; Liu Wenze's wife, Wu Ziyan; Yan Zhongqing's wife, Wang Ronghua; Mei Ziyu's wife, Qionghua; and Wang Xun's wife, Sun Peiqiu. By this time, the garden's chrysanthemums were in full bloom, a brilliant tapestry of five colors. The day's sunlight was gentle, the wind stirred no dust, and light fur"}],"59":[{"paragraph":25,"mentions":7,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"回，说二十三日就到了，便把子玉急上加急。若父亲回来拘管住他，那就要闷死了。正是悲尽欢来，到了二十二日，子玉同了仲清接出三十里之外，住了宿店。等到定更时侯，头站才到，却是新收的家人，子玉不相认识，店家与他说了，才进来叩见，说老爷的轿子也就到了，今日是破站走的。子玉等到二更，听得门外车马声喧，知是到了，与仲清出外迎接。士燮出轿，仲清、子玉上前叩见了，士燮慰劳了几句，","en":"to death. It was truly a case of sorrow reaching its limit and turning into joy; on the twenty-second, Ziyu and Zhongqing rode out thirty li from the city to welcome him, staying overnight at an inn. They waited until the first watch of the night before the advance party finally arrived. However, these were newly employed servants whom Ziyu didn't recognize. After the innkeeper"},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":2,"tokens":["颜剑潭","仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"士燮道：「这个是我的小儿，那个是我的内侄颜剑潭。」又对子玉、仲清道：「这是屈道生先生的令郎，同我进京的，其中缘故，此是也不及细说。你们见见，将来要在一处的。」子玉始而大骇，继而大乐，竟乐得笑将出来。琴仙见了子玉，笑容满面，也觉喜欢，上前与二人见了礼，彼此面面相觑，心里明白，口里却都无话可讲。士燮","en":"Shixie said, \\"This is my youngest son, and that is my nephew by marriage, Yan Jiantan.\\" He then turned to Ziyu and Zhongqing and said, \\"This is the son of the scholar Qu Daosheng, who traveled with me to the capital. There are reasons behind this that I don't have time to detail right now. You should greet him; you will be spending a"},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"三人怔怔的，你看我，我看你，一个不敢问，一个不敢说，仲清心上也不知姑父知道琴仙细底不知，也不便问，只好心内细细的默想，竟是三个哑子聚在一处。子玉与琴仙只好以眉目相与语，一会儿大家想着了苦，都低头颦眉泪眼的光景，一会儿想到此番聚会，也是梦想不到，竟能如此，便又眉欢眼笑起来，倒成了黄梅时节阴晴不定的景象。少顷","en":"them stood there in a daze, looking at one another; one didn't dare to ask, and the other didn't dare to speak. Zhongqing didn't know if his uncle was aware of Qinxian's detailed background, and he felt it inappropriate to ask, so he could only silently ponder the situation in his heart. It was as if three mutes had gathered in one room. Ziyu and Qinxian could only communicate"},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":2,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"那边士燮已安歇，琴仙困乏已甚，支持不住，便躺在炕上，子玉、仲清也都在炕上坐了。家人们出去，今日幸喜云儿没跟来，仲清也是新用的人，都不认识琴仙，故此一宵无话。后来三人都也困乏，便都躺下，人静之后，细细的谈起来。此刻子玉、琴仙在一个枕上和衣而卧，竟把嫌疑也忘了，琴仙便哝哝唧唧说出京时如何想念，在南京如何游玩，到莫愁","en":"Qinxian was exhausted beyond measure and couldn't hold on any longer, so he lay down on the kang, while Ziyu and Zhongqing sat beside him. The servants left the room; fortunately, Yun'er had not come along today, and Zhongqing was accompanied by newly hired men who didn't recognize Qinxian, so the night passed quietly without incident. Eventually, all three grew tired and"},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":4,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"仲清在旁看他们并头而卧，哝哝私语，心上颇替他们快乐，想道：「这两人两年之内伤了无数的心，哭了无数的眼泪，才有今日这一叙，倒成了悲欢离合，真也奇极了。」后来，琴仙又讲到他梦见神娥授笔，道翁成神，并舟中彼此照镜正面反面，怎样又化了珠为龙抢去，子玉、仲清连连称","en":"Watching them lie head to head, whispering intimately, Zhongqing felt a deep sense of happiness for them, thinking to himself, \\"These two have suffered countless heartbreaks and shed countless tears over the past two years, all leading up to this single night's conversation. It has truly turned into a tale of sorrow"},{"paragraph":30,"mentions":5,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"仲清道：「此事倒也瞒不得，明日一到家，家中人岂没有认得你的么？依我想，此事隐着倒也不便，若叫外人对姑父讲了，倒教你脸上更下不来。不如明日求姑母与姑父婉婉的讲明，姑父既看重他今日，也只好将他从前的倒说明了，彼此相安。况姑母甚说他好，如今转了一劫，也决不再题","en":"Zhongqing said, \\"This matter can't be kept hidden anyway. Once we arrive home tomorrow, won't there be people in the household who recognize you? From my perspective, trying to hide it will only make things awkward. If outsiders end up telling my uncle, it will"},{"paragraph":31,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"的人。若说不是他，面貌再没有这般相像的了。众人疑疑惑惑，猜不出来，又听得叫屈大爷，便知不是。子玉趁这空儿，就请仲清对颜夫人讲明，琼华也在旁听了，望着子玉笑，看着子玉含羞含愧，局促不安。颜夫人听了，也以为异，便道：「这个孩子本来原好，如今既做了屈家的儿子，从前的出身，倒也不必提起了，算他转了个劫罢。」","en":"addressed as 'Master Qu,' they concluded it couldn't be him. Taking advantage of this free moment, Ziyu asked Zhongqing to explain the situation clearly to Lady Yan. Qionghua listened from the side, smiling at Ziyu as she watched him flush with embarrassment and shame, squirming uneasily. Lady Yan found the whole thing quite strange as well, remarking, \\"This child was"},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":2,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"仲清道：「此事要姑母与姑夫说明才好，不然外人见了，终要说的，倒教琴仙难为情。」颜夫人也应了，说道：「你姑夫重世交，又见他人好，决不看轻他的。」仲清见颜夫人应允了，也即告退。","en":"Zhongqing said, \\"It's best if you and Uncle explain this clearly to everyone, Aunt; otherwise, when outsiders see him, they are bound to talk, which will only cause Qinxian embarrassment.\\" Lady Yan agreed, saying, \\"Your uncle highly values old friendships, and"}],"60":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["颜仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说新年已过，又到元宵，六街三市，火树银花，好不热闹。子云于十三日请了华公子、田春航、梅子玉、史南湘、高品、颜仲清、刘文泽、王恂、萧次贤、金粟、屈勤先，并九香园诸人，作一大会。琴仙见了华公子，尚有些不安，华公子也不问起前事，以礼相待。此时琴仙已出了旦党，入了士党，但从前作旦时傲睨一切，此刻倒谦谦自守起来，因此上下诸人更加尊重他，绝没有一个人笑他。琴仙对了那些名旦","en":"thirteenth, Ziyun hosted a grand gathering for Young Master Hua, Tian Chunhang, Mei Ziyu, Shi Nanxiang, Gao Pin, Yan Zhongqing, Liu Wenze, Wang Xun, Xiao Cixian, Jin Su, Qu Qinxian, and the entire company of Nine-Fragrance Garden. Seeing Young Master Hua, Qinxian still felt a trace of unease, yet Hua asked nothing of past affairs, treating him with utmost courtesy. By now, Qinxian"},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"个别号，每人做一篇赞语，说得似真似幻的，要与人花两合。」子玉道：「这个图怎样的好呢？还是单画人，还是补景呢？」仲清道：「自然单画人，一并的画去，后就缀小传一篇。刻石之后，可以拓出来，或裱册页，或裱手卷，皆可传世。」文泽道：「做两块好，就镶嵌在东西两楹。」王恂道：「若画杜仙女，就画他在采莲船上的样子。」吉甫道：「玉侬梦见那面镜子，必非无因。我画条龙执着这面镜子，就","en":"Ziyu asked, \\"How should the compositions be handled? Should it be figures alone, or figures with a background?\\" Zhongqing answered, \\"Naturally, figures alone. We paint them in sequence, then append a short biography to each. Once carved in stone, rubbings can be made and mounted as album leaves or handscrolls to be passed down through generations.\\" Wenze suggested, \\"It"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"人分作九阄。说也奇怪，想必文字有灵，前生缘法，子云拈了道翁，子玉拈了杜仙女、琴仙，金粟拈了宝珠，春航拈了蕙芳，仲清拈了琪官，文泽拈了春喜，南湘拈了兰保，王恂拈了桂保，高品拈了玉林，次贤拈了漱芳，单拈不着素兰，只好送与华公子去作了。众人分派已定，子玉说道：「做传容易，画画难，还要刻石，更须时日，不知几天可以告成？」吉甫道：「不消多日，碑是磨现成的，一面画，一面就叫","en":"affinities were at play, Ziyun drew Daoweng; Ziyu drew Fairy Du and Qinxian; Jin Su drew Baozhu; Chunhang drew Huifang; Zhongqing drew Qiguan; Wenze drew Chunxi; Nanxiang drew Lanbao; Wang Xun drew Guibao; Gao Pin drew Yulin; and Cixian drew Shufang. Sulan alone was not drawn, so that assignment was sent to Young Master Hua. The tasks distributed, Ziyu said, \\"Writing biographies"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":1,"tokens":["颜仲清"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，再不能更换的。」琴仙再看第十一方，画一个杏花，下有一个仙女，珠腰玉衱，十分妩媚，题曰：及第花史。知是琪官，看颜仲清的序文：","en":"utterly captivating. The title read: \\"Jidi Flower Historian.\\" Knowing this was Qiguan, he read the preface by Yan Zhongqing:"}]}`),"char-3":JSON.parse(`{"1":[{"paragraph":6,"mentions":2,"tokens":["南湘","竹君"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"其作伐，赘于同乡同年现任通政司王文辉家为婿。这王文辉是颜夫人的表兄，与仲清亲上加亲，翁婿甚为相得。那一位姓史名南湘，号竹君，是湖广汉阳人，现年二十四岁，已中了本省解元。父亲史曾望现为吏科给事中。这两人同是才高八斗，学富五车，但两人的情性却又各不相同。仲清是孤高自洁，坦白为怀。将他的学问与子玉比较起来，子玉是纯粹一路，仲清是旷达一路。一切人情物理，仲清不过略观大概","en":"ties, and father-in-law and son-in-law found great harmony together. The other visitor was surnamed Shi, named Nanxiang, and styled Zhujun. Hailing from Hanyang in Huguang, he was twenty-four years old and had already claimed the title of Jieyuan—the top scholar in his provincial examination. His father, Shi Zengwang, currently served as a Supervising Secretary in the"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":1,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这两个相聚十余年，其结契之厚，比同胞手足更加亲密。那南湘是啸傲忘形，清狂绝俗，目空一世，倚马万言，就只赏识子玉、仲清二人。","en":"other's company; the profound depth of their connection surpassed even the intimacy of blood brothers. As for Nanxiang, he was given to roaring with laughter and transcending mere form—a man of pure madness who stood utterly apart from the vulgar world. He looked down upon his entire generation, capable of writing ten thousand words while leaning against a horse, and"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":4,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这日同来看子玉，门上见是来惯的，是少爷至好，便一直引到书房与子玉见了。仲清又同子玉进内见了姑母，然后出来与南湘坐下。三人讲了些话，书僮送上香茗。南湘见这室中清雅绝尘，一切陈设甚精且古，久知其胸次不凡，又见那清华尊贵的仪表，就是近日所选那《曲台花谱》中数人，虽然有此姿容，到底无此神骨。但见其谦谦自退，讷讷若虚，究不知他何所嗜好，若有些拘执鲜通，胶滞不化，也算不","en":"Zhongqing first accompanied Ziyu into the inner chambers to pay his respects to his aunt, then returned to sit with Nanxiang. After the three had exchanged pleasantries, a pageboy served fragrant tea. Nanxiang noted the room's transcendent elegance, its furnishings exquisite and touched with antiquity, fully aware of Ziyu's extraordinary inner mind. Observing his noble and"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":1,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"些，还有那一种人？」子玉正猜不着他所说什么，只得说道：「既然娱悦不在声色，其唯二三知己朝夕素心乎？」仲清大笑。南湘道：「岂有此理！朋友岂可云娱耳悦目的？庾香设心不良。」说罢哈哈大笑。子玉被他们这一笑，笑得不好意思起来，脸已微红，便说道：「你们休要取笑。我是这个意思：挥麈清谈，乌衣美秀，难道不可娱耳，不可悦目？","en":"day-and-night companionship of two or three kindred spirits with pure hearts?\\" Zhongqing burst into loud laughter. Nanxiang retorted: \\"Absurd! How can one describe a friend as something that merely pleases the ear and delights the eye? Yuxiang, your heart harbors ill intentions.\\" With that, he laughed uproariously. Disconcerted by their laughter, Ziyu felt a faint blush touch"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":2,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"醇醪醉心，古剑照胆，交友中难道无动心荡魄处么？」南湘笑道：「你总是这一间屋子里的说话，所见不广，所游未化。」即从（靴）勒里取出一本书来，送与子玉道：「这是我近刻的，大约可以娱耳悦目，动心荡魄者，要在此数君。」仲清笑道：「你将此书呈政于庾香，真似苏秦始见秦王，可保的你书十上而说不行。他非但没有领略此中情","en":"wine, or an ancient sword reflecting a hero's courage—do these not stir the soul within the bonds of friendship?\\" Nanxiang smiled and said: \\"Your words never leave the confines of this single room. Your vision is not broad, and your wanderings have yet to transform you.\\" With that, he drew a book from his boot and handed it to Ziyu, saying: \\"This is my recent printing. Those"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":2,"tokens":["竹君","南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"里的小旦么？这是那里的小旦，你赞得这样好？」仲清道：「现在这里的，你不见说在联锦班么？」子玉道：「我不信，这是竹君撒谎。我今年也看过一天的戏，几曾见小旦中有这样好人？」南湘道：「你那天看的不知是什么班子，自然没有好的了。」子玉再看第二题的是：瑶台璧月苏蕙芳\\n蕙芳姓苏氏，字媚香，年十七岁。姑苏人。","en":"in the capital; did you not read that he belongs to the Lianjin troupe?\\" Ziyu countered, \\"I don't believe it; Zhujun is making this up. I spent a day watching plays this year, and when did I ever see someone so extraordinary among the young dan?\\" Nanxiang retorted, \\"Who knows what miserable troupe you watched that day; naturally, you saw no one worthwhile.\\" Ziyu then"},{"paragraph":34,"mentions":1,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"捧炉香侍玉皇。\\n才啭歌喉赞不休，黄金争掷作缠头。\\n玉郎偶驾羊车出，十里珠帘尽上钩。\\n子玉看了只是笑，不置一词。南湘问道：「你何以不加可否？」子玉道：「大凡论人，虽难免粉饰，也不可过于失实。若论此辈，真可惜了这副笔墨。","en":"miles of pearl curtains are rolled up all at once.\\n\\nZiyu read it and merely smiled, offering not a single word. Nanxiang asked, \\"Why do you withhold your judgment?\\" Ziyu replied, \\"Generally speaking, when evaluating people, though some embellishment is unavoidable, one should not stray too far from the truth. As for evaluating this lot, it is truly a waste of your brush"},{"paragraph":38,"mentions":2,"tokens":["史南湘","竹君"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，翻可舒荡心胸，足助欢笑。吾兄不惜笔墨，竭力铺张，为若辈增光，而使古人抱恨，窃为吾兄有所不取。」这一番话，把个史南湘说出气来。仲清笑道：「庾香之论未尝不是，而竹君之选也甚平允。但庾香不知天地间有此数人，譬如读《搜神》之记，《幽怪》之书。","en":"ancients to harbor regrets. I secretly feel there is something lacking in your approach.\\" This speech infuriated Shi Nanxiang. Zhongqing laughed and said, \\"Yuxiang's argument is not without merit, yet Zhujun's selections are also quite fair. It is just that Yuxiang does not realize that such individuals exist in the universe. It is like reading 'In Search of the Supernatural'"},{"paragraph":40,"mentions":2,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"冲帝时，李固之搔头弄姿。唐武后时，张易之之施朱傅粉。不独潘安仁、卫叔宝之昭著一时也明矣。」子玉听了，心稍感动。南湘道：「且不仅此。草木向阳者华茂，背阴者衰落。梅花南枝先，北枝后。还有凤凰、鸳鸯、孔雀、野雉、家鸡，有文采的禽鸟都是雄的，可见造化之气，先钟于男，而后钟于女。那女子固美，究不免些粉脂涂泽，岂及男子之不御铅华，自然光彩。更有一句话最易明白的。我将你现身说","en":"Jie were not the only ones to dazzle their respective eras.\\" Hearing this, Ziyu felt his heart slightly moved. Nanxiang added, \\"And it does not stop there. Vegetation facing the sun flourishes, while that in the shade withers. The southern branches of the plum blossom bloom first, the northern branches later. Consider the phoenix, the mandarin duck, the peacock, the wild"},{"paragraph":41,"mentions":2,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"便拉了仲清去了。子玉送客转来，又将南湘的《花选》默默的一想，再想从前看过的戏，与见过的小旦一毫不对，犹以南湘为妄言，借此以自消遣的，便也不放在心上了。李先生回来，仍在书房念了一会书，颜夫人然后叫了进去。","en":"He then dragged Zhongqing away. Ziyu saw his guests out and returned, silently pondering Nanxiang's \\"Selection of Flowers\\" once more. He thought back to the plays he had seen in the past and the young dan he had encountered, finding that they did not match the descriptions in the slightest. He still concluded that Nanxiang was speaking wildly, using"},{"paragraph":42,"mentions":1,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"过了两日，子玉于早饭后告了半天假，回去看南湘、仲清。","en":"Two days later, Ziyu requested a half-day's leave after breakfast and went back to visit Nanxiang and Zhongqing."},{"paragraph":46,"mentions":3,"tokens":["南湘","竹君"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"然后同王恂到了书房，问起仲清，为高品、南湘请去。子玉说起前日所见南湘的《花选》过于失实，王恂道：「竹君的《花选》，据实而言，尚恐说不到，何以为失实？现在那些宝贝得了这番品题，又长了些声价，你也应该见过这些人。」子玉听了，知王恂也有旦癖，又是个好为附会的人，便不说了。","en":"accompanied Wang Xun to the study and asked after Zhongqing, learning that he had been invited out by Gao Pin and Nanxiang. Ziyu mentioned that the \\"Selection of Flowers\\" he had seen Nanxiang carrying the other day was excessively exaggerated. Wang Xun replied, \\"As for Zhujun's 'Selection of Flowers,' practically speaking, one should rather fear it falls short; how could"},{"paragraph":47,"mentions":1,"tokens":["竹君"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"王恂道：「你见竹君的《花选》怎样，还是选得不公呢，还是太少，有遗珠之憾么？好的呢也还有些。但总不及这八个，这是万选青钱。若要说尽他们的好处，除非与他们一人序一本年谱才能清楚，这几句话还不过略述大概而已。」子玉心里甚异：「难道现在真有这些人？」又想：「这三人也不是容易说","en":"Wang Xun continued, \\"What do you think of Zhujun's 'Selection of Flowers'? Was the selection unfair, or too narrow, leaving behind uncollected pearls? There are certainly other good ones out there. But they simply cannot compare to these eight; these are coin that would pass any assay, ten thousand"}],"2":[{"paragraph":42,"mentions":1,"tokens":["史竹君"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"谢了，走到书房来找王恂、仲清，谈了一会，说道：「我们班里新来了两个：一个叫琴官，一个叫琪官，生得色艺俱佳，只怕史竹君的《花选》又要翻刻了。」又坐了一会也自回去。不知后事如何，且听下回分解。","en":"troupe, one named Qinguan, the other Qiguan. Both are exquisitely beautiful and remarkably talented. I fear Shi Zhujun's Selection of Flowers will require yet another printing.\\" He lingered a while longer before finally departing for home. As for what unfolded next, you must listen to the following chapter for the explanation."}],"5":[{"paragraph":5,"mentions":1,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"他有个好友，是楚南湘潭县人，姓萧名次贤，号静宜，年方三十二岁，是个名士，以优贡入京考选。他却厌弃微名，无心进取，天文地理之书，诸子百家之学，无不精通。与子云八拜之交，费了三四年心血，替他监造了这个怡园。真有驱云排岳之势，崇楼迭阁之观，窈屋宇其之胜。一时花木游览之盛，甲于","en":"He had a close friend from Xiangtan County in southern Hunan, a man named Xiao Cixian, style name Jingyi. Thirty-two years of age, he was a renowned man of letters who had come to the capital to sit for examinations as a distinguished tribute student. Yet he had no desire for trifling titles and no ambition to advance. In astronomy and geography, in the writings of all the philosophers and the hundred schools, there was nothing he had not mastered. He and Ziyun had sworn brotherhood, and over the course of three or four years spent enormous effort supervising the construction of the Garden of Contentment. The result was a place of driving clouds and shifting mountains, a sweep of soaring towers and layered pavilions, secluded recesses and winding depths. In the magnificence of its flowers, plants, and scenic walks it surpassed all others in the capital, comprising twenty-four scenic areas with over four hundred rooms. Great hills linked together, streams wound in curving courses; its wonders were beyond description. Ziyun's reputation and connections were vast, and scholars from all directions gathered like stars and massing clouds."},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":1,"tokens":["史南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"相并，而在道义之可交。虽然日日的座客常满，樽酒不空，也不过几个素心朝夕，其余泛泛者，惟以礼相待，如愿相偿而已。史南湘《花选》中的八个名旦日夕来游，子云尽皆珍爱，而尤宠异者惟袁宝珠。这一片钟情爱色之心，却与别人不同，视这些好相公与那奇珍异宝、好鸟名花一样，只有爱惜之心，却无褒狎之念，所以这些名旦，个个与他忘形略迹，视他为慈父恩母。甘雨祥云，无话不可尽言，无情不可径遂","en":"received with proper courtesy, their wishes accommodated as best as possible. The eight famous dan performers from Shi Nanxiang's Selection of Flowers came and went daily. Ziyun treasured them all, but singled out Yuan Baozhu for particular affection. His feeling of love and appreciation for beautiful performers was quite different from others. He regarded these fine young opera"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":1,"tokens":["史南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"处，细细说给他听，琴官便也放了好些心。二人同上了车，琴官在前，宝珠在后，正是天赐奇缘，到了南小街口，恰值子玉从史南湘处转来，一车两马，劈面相逢，子玉恰不挂帘子，琴官却挂了帘子，已从玻璃窗内，望得清清楚楚。","en":"Baozhu behind. By happy coincidence, they reached the South Small Street intersection. They met Ziyu returning from Shi Nanxiang's, in a carriage with two horses, coming directly toward them. Ziyu had not drawn his curtain; Qinguan had drawn his, but through the glass window he had already seen clearly."}],"6":[{"paragraph":23,"mentions":2,"tokens":["史南湘","南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"来了。」王、颜二人又与聘才、元茂款接了一番。只见对面楼上来了几个，先是右待郎的少君刘文泽做主，请了史给事的少君史南湘、吴阁学的外甥张仲雨、姑苏名士高品、国子监司业沈公之子沈伯才、天津镇守海口巴总兵之子巴霖，这两位就是孙氏弟兄的妻舅。还有一个本京人，原任江苏知县之子冯子佩，尚未到来。这一班人，子玉除了南湘、文泽之外，恰不认识。这刘文泽字前舟，系中州世家，已得了二品荫","en":"upper floor, another group had assembled, hosted by Liu Wenze, son of the Right Vice-Minister. His guests included Shi Nanxiang, son of Censor Shi; Zhang Zhongyu, nephew of Grand Academician Wu; the renowned Suzhou scholar Gao Pin; Shen Bocai, son of Imperial College Director Shen; and Ba Lin, son of Regional Commander Ba, the coastal defender of Tianjin. The latter two were"},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":5,"tokens":["史南湘","南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「最好，最好，我们今日就并在一处，为什么食不下咽？有了「虫蛀千字文」，「叠韵双声谱」，还胜如《汉书》下酒呢。」史南湘道：「怕什么？搬过来，搬过来！正席上有许多老前辈在那里，巴老三想必也不动手的。」王恂只得叫将那边两桌，就搬过这边，一同坐下，南湘道：「庾香，你今日就看见好戏好人了，你才信我不是言过其实呢。」子玉笑道：「你定的第一，我已经请教过了。」南湘道：「何如，可","en":"'Rhyme-and-Alliteration Compendium' among us, it beats using the History of the Former Han as a relish for our wine!\\" Shi Nanxiang said, \\"What is there to fear? Bring them over! Bring them over! With so many venerable elders at the main tables, Old Third Ba won't dare start anything.\\" Left with no choice, Wang Xun ordered the two tables moved over, and everyone sat together. Nanxiang"},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":1,"tokens":["史南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「都是相好，也不必推让，随意坐最好」。大家都要远着孙氏弟兄，便乱坐起来。刘文泽、沈伯才、巴霖、张仲雨坐了一席；史南湘、颜仲清、高品拉了子玉过来，坐了一席；聘才、元茂坐了一席；嗣徽、嗣元坐了一席，王恂只好两席轮流作陪。孙嗣徽又之乎者也的闹了一会，问了魏、李二位姓名、籍贯。一面就摆上菜喝酒。高品见嗣徽的脸上疙瘩更多了好些，喝了几杯酒，那个红鼻子如经霜辣子，通红光亮。","en":"Sun brothers, everyone scrambled for seats. Liu Wenze, Shen Bocai, Ba Lin, and Zhang Zhongyu claimed one table; Shi Nanxiang, Yan Zhongqing, and Gao Pin pulled Ziyu to a second; Pincai and Yuanmao took a third; leaving Sihui and Siyuan isolated at the fourth, with Wang Xun moving between tables to act as host. Sun Sihui, adopting his pedantic \\"the Master says\\" persona, began"},{"paragraph":33,"mentions":6,"tokens":["南湘","竹君"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"只见得这人，如宝月祥云，明霞仙露，香触触，春霭霭，花开到八分，色艳到十足。已看得出神，便问南湘道：「这是谁？有此秀骨。」南湘道：「这个算好吗，只怕也难入品题。」子玉知南湘故意讥诮他，便问仲清，仲清道：「这就是《花选》上第二的瑶台璧月苏蕙芳。」子玉叹道：「天地钟灵尽于此矣，我竟如夏虫不可语冰，难怪竹君怪我。」南湘哈哈大笑道：「我也不怪的，幸你自","en":"opening to eight-tenths of its glory, his beauty shining with absolute brilliance. Already transfixed, Ziyu asked Nanxiang, \\"Who is this? He possesses such exquisite bone structure.\\" Nanxiang replied, \\"Do you find this good? I'm afraid he barely registers on the rankings.\\" Knowing Nanxiang was intentionally baiting him, Ziyu turned to Zhongqing. Zhongqing explained, \\"This"},{"paragraph":35,"mentions":4,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"在这里。」到第二次出场，唱那「雨香云片」这枝曲子，一面唱，那眼波只望着子玉溜来，子玉心里十分畅满。文泽低低的对南湘道：「这个新来的相公，倒与庾香很熟，你瞧这一片神情，尽注意着他。」南湘向子玉道：「这个相公叫什么名字？」子玉道：「他叫琴官。」南湘道：「你们盘桓过几回了？」子玉答道：「我尚不认识他。」文泽笑道：「庾香叫相公，是要瞒着人的。这样四目相窥，两心相照的光景","en":"eyes continually wandered to rest upon Ziyu, filling Ziyu's heart with a quiet, glowing warmth. Wenze murmured to Nanxiang, \\"This newly arrived young performer seems exceptionally intimate with Yuxiang—look at his expression, all his attention is directed entirely at him.\\" Nanxiang turned to Ziyu, \\"What is this performer's name?\\" Ziyu replied, \\"He is called Qinguan.\\" Nanxiang"},{"paragraph":37,"mentions":1,"tokens":["竹君"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"文泽对子玉道：「初九日弟备小酌，屈吾兄一叙，作个清谈雅集。人不多，就是竹君、剑潭、庸庵、卓然几位，吾兄断不可推辞。」子玉应允，又谢了。王恂、聘才、元茂也同道了谢，一径先回。那些人又谈了一会，也各散去。不知后事如何，且听下回分解。","en":"Brother will honor us with a visit—a refined discourse and elegant assembly. It will be an intimate group: just Zhujun, Jiantan, Yong'an, Zhuoran, and a few others. Elder Brother must absolutely not decline.\\" Ziyu agreed, expressing his deep gratitude. Wang Xun, Pincai, and Yuanmao offered their thanks in turn before departing. The remaining guests lingered in conversation"}],"7":[{"paragraph":3,"mentions":1,"tokens":["史竹君"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"赏玩不过一季，而人之颜色可以十年。惟人胜于花，则爱人之心，自然比爱花更当胜些。谁想天下人的眼界，竟能相同。我意史竹君、王庸庵等必有言过其实之处，如今看来，真还刻划不到，想必那些能诗能画之说，也是的确无疑了。」便又想：「今日虽然见了琴官的戏，也未能稍通款曲，此后相逢，不知又在何日？但看他今日双波频注，似乎倒有缱纟卷之意。前此在车内掀帘凝望，又似非以陌上相逢看待，这也","en":"the deeper. Who would have thought the eyes of the world could be so perfectly aligned? I had assumed that Shi Zhujun, Wang Yong'an, and the others were exaggerating, but now I see their descriptions actually fell short. Their claims about his poetic and painting talents must also be unequivocally true.\\" He then thought: \\"Although I saw Qinguan perform today, I had"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":3,"tokens":["史南湘","南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"且说文泽所请的容颜仲清、王恂、史南湘已经到了，随后梅子玉、高品一同到门。家人引着走过大厅，到了花厅之旁垂花门进去，系石子砌成的一条甬道，两边都是太湖石迭成高高低低的假山，衬着参参差差的寒树。远远望去，却也有台有亭，布置得十分幽雅。转了两三个弯，过了一座石桥，甬路旁是一色的，都是绿竹，绕","en":"At Wenze's residence, the invited guests—Yan Zhongqing, Wang Xun, and Shi Nanxiang—had already arrived, followed shortly by Mei Ziyu and Gao Pin at the gate. A servant guided them past the main hall, through a flowered gate beside the reception hall, and onto a pebble-paved path. On either side, irregular artificial hills of Lake Tai"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":2,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"南湘道：「可惜今日没有叫几个人来。」文泽道：「我也打算叫的，因打听他们今日都在怡园送九作消寒会，连堂会里都没有一个去的，所以没有去叫，怕倒叫他们为难。南湘又道：","en":"Nanxiang said, \\"It's a pity we didn't invite any performers today.\\" Wenze replied, \\"I had intended to, but I learned they are all attending a gathering to mark the end of the nine periods of winter at the Garden of Contentment. Not a single one went to the theatrical"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":4,"tokens":["南湘","竹君"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"仲清道：「他说什么？」仲清向高品道：「我说罢。」高品摇了摇头。仲清道：「那第七字对得尤妙。」说着两人相视而笑。南湘最是性急，便道：「你们说了，我情愿吃一杯。」高品道：「喝十杯再说。」文泽晓得南湘酒德平常，道：「我来讲和，三杯罢。」高品笑：「竹君三杯，诸公各饮一杯，赏识这句话。」仲清道：「我是请教过的了，免饮。」高品笑道：「几时？」仲清道：「真正你这张嘴，狗口里生","en":"Zhongqing said, \\"His match for the seventh character is exceptionally clever.\\" The two exchanged a knowing smile. Nanxiang, impatient as always, urged, \\"Tell us, and I'll gladly drink a cup.\\" Gao Pin countered, \\"Drink ten cups, and then we'll see.\\" Knowing that Nanxiang was apt to misbehave after drinking, Wenze mediated, \\"Let's compromise—three cups.\\" Gao Pin smiled, \\"Zhujun"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":6,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"文泽道：「这有何可笑？」南湘忽然想着，抚掌大笑道：「这促狭鬼，实在可恶，难为他实在对得敏捷。」子玉等悟着也都笑了，道：「雅字竟当他实字，真对得工稳。」文泽道：「卓兄，我出一对你对，却不许思索。如对得好，我吃三杯。对不出，罚十杯。不好，罚五杯。」高品道：「从来说出对容易，对对难。","en":"Wenze asked, \\"What is so amusing about that?\\" Suddenly catching on, Nanxiang clapped his hands and roared with laughter, \\"This mischievous devil is truly incorrigible, but one must admit it's a quick match!\\" Ziyu and the others also burst into laughter as realization dawned. \\"He has read a function word as a content word — and"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":8,"tokens":["南湘","史南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"文泽道「双」字，仲清对「孤」字，高品对「八」，字子玉对「九」字，王恂道：「不好了，顺着数儿就是十罢。」南湘道：「是了，我这个字倒有些难下，也罢，对「三」字罢。」文泽道「辇」宇。南湘道：「我晓得一定是这句诗。」子玉抢对了一个「琴」字，王恂对了「车」字，南湘对了「船」字，只有高品未对。文泽催道：「再迟要罚酒了。」高品笑了一笑，道「舟」字，令官重新写起来，出的","en":"Ziyu matched '九' (Nine), and Wang Xun lamented, \\"Oh no, I suppose I must follow the sequence with '十' (Ten).\\" Nanxiang pondered, \\"That's right, my character is a bit tricky to place. Very well, I'll match '三' (Three).\\" Finally, Wenze set '辇' (Imperial Carriage). Nanxiang exclaimed, \\"I know exactly which line of poetry this is!\\" Ziyu quickly matched '琴' (Lute), Wang Xun"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":5,"tokens":["南湘","竹君"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"再看子玉对的是「九鸾天上听琴来」。大家赞道：「这句真对得字字稳惬，又在剑潭之上。」于是公贺了一杯。南湘对的是「三鸦水上送船归」。文泽道：「竹君此对，未免杂凑。」南湘道：「你这试官，少所见而多所怪，要挖眼睛了。这才对得工呢。」子玉道：「真对得好。」文泽道：「这个我倒要请教请教。」子玉道：「三鸦水上一归人，是韩翃的诗。」文泽恍然道：「可是《送襄垣王君归别","en":"matches perfectly character by character, and it surpasses Jiantan's.\\" Thus, they offered a congratulatory toast. Nanxiang's match read: 'Three crows on the water send the boat returning. (三鸦水上送船归)' Wenze critiqued, \\"Zhujun's match is a bit rough around the edges.\\" Nanxiang shot back, \\"You're just an examiner with little experience who marvels at the ordinary—you should"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":3,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"文泽道：「还有卓然的罚酒未饮，刚才到底说什么，笑得这样。如果实在说得好，免罚何妨。」南湘道：「若说了，非但不能免罚，还要倍罚。」文泽道：「莫非又是糟蹋我么？」仲清道：「然也。」文泽道：「只要糟蹋得有理，罚酒也可以少减。」高品道：「想来五杯是不能免的。若要再加，万万来不得了，只好不说罢。」文泽道：「不加就是了。」高品道：「把我的对句，倒转","en":"penalty wine. What on earth did he say to make you laugh like that? If it's truly clever, we might waive the fine.\\" Nanxiang replied, \\"If he tells you, not only will the fine stand, it will be doubled.\\" Wenze narrowed his eyes, \\"Is he mocking me again?\\" Zhongqing nodded, \\"Precisely.\\" Wenze reasoned, \\"As long as the mockery has merit, the fine can be reduced.\\" Gao Pin chimed"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":15,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"人豁一拳，或者可以希冀。」随顺手一个个豁完，却也有输有赢。各饮毕，子玉作令官，一个个出了四字，是「费影收肠」。南湘对的是「惊声放胆」，王恂是「融香浣乳」，文泽是「翻么小舌」，仲清是「多仙散发」，独高品对得别致，是「除伊放粪」，大家看了已经发笑。子玉又出了一个「台」字，南湘道：「这句好生。」沉吟了一会，对了「馆」字，王恂对「屋」，文泽对「榭」，仲清对「岛」，高品道","en":"his turn as game-master, offering four characters for all to match: '费影收肠' (expend, shadow, withdraw, sorrow). Nanxiang matched '惊声放胆' (startle, sound, release, courage); Wang Xun matched '融香浣乳' (melt, fragrance, wash, milk); Wenze matched '翻么小舌' (flip, tiny-note, small, tongue); Zhongqing matched '多仙散发' (many, immortals, loosened, hair); while Gao Pin, as distinctive"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":6,"tokens":["南湘","竹君"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"以下轮着南湘出令，出了一个「春」字，文泽对「夏」字，高品对「正」字。王恂道：「平对平使得么？」众人道：「使得，已经对过了。」王恂道「晨」字，仲清是「秋」字，子玉是「冬」字。南湘又出「月」字。高品道：「竹君的心思与众不同，这两字必定不连的，我对「阳」字。」王恂对「","en":"The turn passed to Nanxiang to set the game. He presented the character '春' (spring): Wenze matched '夏' (summer), and Gao Pin matched '正' (upright/primary). Wang Xun questioned, \\"Can a level-tone character be matched with another level-tone?\\" The group agreed, \\"Certainly—it has"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":2,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「原来如此，失敬，失敬。」众人哗然大笑。南湘道：「这是你自画供招，以后尊名竟改作高龟何如？」高品自知失口，缩不转来，便道：「这两字杜撰，不如转赠吾兄。史龟二字，本是古人名，最典雅的。」文泽道：「你听卓然这张嘴，自己落了便宜，又移到别人身上去了。」大家笑了一回，静听南湘出对。","en":"\\"Ah, I see. My apologies, my apologies.\\" The room erupted in laughter. Nanxiang teased, \\"This is your own self-incriminating confession. From now on, shouldn't we change your honorable name to Gao Gui (High Tortoise)?\\" Realizing his slip and unable to retract it, Gao Pin deflected, \\"These two characters are somewhat contrived—better"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":2,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"南湘只管吃菜，总不出声。文泽道：「你怎么不出对了？」南湘笑道：「卷子已经交完了，还要题目么？我是一顺出的「春月三改兔」五字，内中前舟的「夏云半堆乌」，「乌」字原也借对得好。然凭文取之，究不若剑潭的「秋空一盘鹰」浑脱，还该让他第一。庾香的「冬雪一敲驴」，庸","en":"Nanxiang simply continued eating, remaining silent. Wenze prompted, \\"Why haven't you announced the couplet?\\" Nanxiang chuckled, \\"The examination papers have all been submitted—do we need more prompts? I gave the five characters in sequence: 'Spring moon three"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":1,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"以下仲清做令官，一个个字出的对是「丝发白日如新」六字，高品属的是「签毛朱天入长」。子玉对的是「镜颜华年对好。」南湘是「竹唇朱声吹慢。」王恂是「剪衣乌时试拂」。文泽是「草麻黄朝起视」。仲清写出上联是「白发如丝日日新」。","en":"feather, vermilion, sky, enter, long). Ziyu matched: '镜颜华年对好' (mirror, complexion, glorious, year, face, good). Nanxiang matched: '竹唇朱声吹慢' (bamboo, lip, crimson, sound, blow, slow). Wang Xun matched: '剪衣乌时试拂' (scissors, garment, raven, time, try, brush). Wenze matched: '草麻黄朝起视' (grass, hemp, yellow, morning, rise, gaze). Zhongqing wrote the opening line: 'White hair like"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":2,"tokens":["南湘","竹君"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"把文泽的「黄麻起草朝朝视」取了第一，子玉的「华颜对镜年年好」取了第二，南湘的「朱唇吹竹声声慢」夹圈了，取了第三。大家都道：「这两副对都好，似乎竹君的较胜。令官甲乙，似不甚公。」仲清道：「这两本卷子都好，是不用说的。","en":"(黄麻起草朝朝视)'—as first; Ziyu's match—'Glorious face against the mirror—year after year beautiful (华颜对镜年年好)'—as second; and Nanxiang's match—'Crimson lips blow bamboo—note after note (Sheng Sheng Man)'—received circled marks and placed third. The group murmured, \\"Both of these matches are excellent—it seems Zhujun's is actually superior. The judge's ranking doesn't seem entirely fair.\\""},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":1,"tokens":["竹君"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"面子上看去竹君的「竹」对「丝」，「朱唇」对「白发」，工巧极矣，「声声慢」又暗藏曲牌名，似乎在庾香之上，我所以把他夹圈了。但上对即是一字字拆开，必得一字字恰对方好。","en":"\\"On the surface, Zhujun's 'bamboo' matching 'silk,' and 'crimson lips' matching 'white hair,' is exquisitely crafted; 'Sheng Sheng Man' ingeniously conceals a ci tune title, seemingly placing it above Yuxiang's—which is why I awarded it circled marks."},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":3,"tokens":["竹君","南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"庾香以「年」对「日」最妥，竹君以「声」对「日」，就不很对，假使「日」字不是迭用。或者竟是「白日」，那「朱声」就讲不去了，到底不及庾香的稳当，而且句子大方，不落纤巧，诸公以为然否？」几句话说得众人很服。南湘向来不肯让人，此时亦甚首肯。高品道：「然则我以「天」对「日」，比庾香的更好，","en":"split character by character, each must match precisely. Yuxiang's use of 'year' to match 'day' is highly fitting; Zhujun's use of 'sound' to match 'day'—well, if 'day' is not reduplicated, or simply means 'broad daylight,' then 'crimson sound' becomes impossible to parse. Ultimately, it lacks the flawless balance of Yuxiang's, whose phrasing remains broadly elegant without"},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":1,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"南湘笑道：「这古典甚长，只说够他对的就是了。」文泽问道：「在什么书上？」仲清道：「《史氏外编》。」王恂、文泽才明白过来，复又笑声大作。高品道：「你们混说乱道，难道《四子书》都记不得？这就是《孟子》所说一毛不拔、追豚入笠之扬朱，所以谓之「朱毛入笠」。这才算","en":"Nanxiang waved it off, \\"The allusion is rather long—enough has been said to serve the match.\\" Wenze asked, \\"In what book is this recorded?\\" Zhongqing replied, \\"Outer Compilation of Mr. Shi.\\" Wang Xun and Wenze finally understood, breaking into fresh peals of"},{"paragraph":31,"mentions":3,"tokens":["南湘","竹君"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「此番卓然大概要取第一了，字字对得很稳。」子玉对的是「情深西旦感昆名」。南湘的是」图多西士画名园」。一一对毕，王恂写出出句，是「香销南国美人尽」。文泽对的是「曲谱东山名妓多。」仲清是「赋炼东都学士难」。高品是「斗驾西方齐圣长」。子玉是「情感西昆名旦深」。南湘是「图画西园名士多。」王恂道：「这第一不消说是竹君了。庾香「名旦」二","en":"character matches with immense stability.\\" Ziyu matched: 'Deep feeling, Western dan-performer, moves Kun, fame.' Nanxiang matched: 'Many paintings, Western scholars, paint famous gardens.' As they finished, Wang Xun revealed the opening line: 'Fragrance fades in the Southern kingdom—the beauties are all gone. (香销南国美人尽)' Wenze's assembled match: 'Tunes composed of Eastern"},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":1,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"东土大唐。」高品道：「剑潭是主考至亲，倒应回避，不许乱说。」原来王恂却没有看过《西游记》，只管呆呆的看着粉板。南湘正在喝酒，忽见高品用手搭着凉篷。","en":"transpired that Wang Xun had never read *Journey to the West*, leaving him staring blankly at the writing-board. Nanxiang was mid-drink when he noticed Gao Pin shading his eyes with his hand like a sun-visor,"},{"paragraph":33,"mentions":2,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"向王恂一望，忍不住笑将出来，酒咽不及喷了出来，还咳嗽不已，引得合席都笑。南湘向王恂道：「等我笑完了，说《西游记》给你听。」文泽接着说道：「就是齐天大圣，送唐僧往西天取经的典故。」王恂恍然大悟道：「岂有此理，就是如此，那「斗驾」及「长」字总连不上。」南湘笑道：「你不晓得，孙行者驾起筋斗云，就是十万八千里，这路还不长么？」","en":"glancing toward Wang Xun. Unable to suppress his mirth, Nanxiang choked on his wine, coughing and spluttering, setting the entire table off. Catching his breath, Nanxiang told Wang Xun, \\"Let me finish laughing, and then I'll tell you about *Journey to the West*.\\" Wenze stepped in to clarify, \\"It's the allusion of"},{"paragraph":35,"mentions":1,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"个字可是「重诏和」三字么？若不说明。我们就罢考了。」高品被他猜着，只得笑嘻嘻的点点头。子玉对了「卓言贯」三字，南湘对了「品阳长」三字，王恂对了「一龄庆」三字，文泽对了「品奸动」三字，仲清对了「管毫定」三字。高品又一连出了四字是「九喜气凤」。","en":"Caught out, Gao Pin could only smile and nod. Ziyu matched with three characters: '卓言贯' (Zhuo-speech-penetrating); Nanxiang matched: '品阳长' (Pin-sun-long); Wang Xun matched: '一龄庆' (One-year-celebrate); Wenze matched: '品奸动' (Pin, intercourse, move); Zhongqing matched: '管毫定' (Tube-fine hair-determined). Gao Pin then fired off four more characters: '九喜气凤' (nine, joy, spirit,"},{"paragraph":36,"mentions":1,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"的，我就对「一高标兔」。」文泽道：「我就对「一欢心鸡」。」王恂道：「我对「第长年龟」。」子玉对了「超元精人」，南湘对了「一精神龙。」高品背着人写了上联，搁着笔，把大众的看了一回，鼻子里笑了一笑，就用纸蘸着酒，把粉板上的字一齐擦了。众人都诧异道：","en":"added, \\"I'll match '第长年龟' (rank-long-year-tortoise).\\" Ziyu matched: '超元精人' (surpassing-primal-refined-person). Nanxiang matched: '一精神龙' (one-spirit-dragon). Gao Pin turned his back, wrote out his opening line, set down his brush, and inspected everyone's submissions. With a quiet snort of amusement, he took a wine-dampened paper and wiped the writing-board clean. The"},{"paragraph":37,"mentions":7,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「这又奇了，难道一卷都没有好的么？」南湘道：「不是，不是，如果不好，他必定写出来把人取笑了。我想想他出的那几个字，凑起来看是一句什么。」仲清道：「他写的时候，我瞧见起头是「凤诏」两个字。」子玉想了想道：「莫非「凤诏九重和喜气」这句诗？」南湘道：「一点不错。」高品道：「不是，不是。」仲清道：","en":"\\"How extraordinary! Was not a single submission acceptable?\\" Nanxiang theorized, \\"No, no—if they were unacceptable, he'd have displayed them to subject everyone to ridicule. Let me ponder the characters he provided... assembled, what line do they form?\\" Zhongqing recalled, \\"While he was writing, I caught a glimpse of 'feng"}],"9":[{"paragraph":24,"mentions":1,"tokens":["史南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"忽见怡园家人上前说道：「史少爷来了！」大家起身看时，只见两人扶着史南湘，踉踉跄跄，一步步的跺着石蹬上来。将到台前，便霍然的大吐起来。吐了一会，摇着头，喘吁吁的在台前站住，指着众人道：","en":"forward announcing: \\"Young Master Shi has arrived!\\" Everyone rose to look. They saw two attendants supporting Shi Nanxiang, who came stumbling and staggering, step by halting step, up the stone stairs. Just as he reached the terrace, he suddenly heaved in a great surge of vomiting. After retching for a while, he shook his head and stood panting at the edge of the terrace,"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":5,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"道：「你且坐下，歇歇再说。」扶上亭子，他就坐在地下，宝珠等上去见他，他把头点点。文泽道：「你在那里喝得这样？」南湘又摇摇头。宝珠到次贤耳边说了几句话，次贤命小厮去拿了一个小小的金盒子，取出一丸药来，放在碗内，用开水化了，递给宝珠，捧到南湘身边，弯了腰给他喝，南湘摇头不要。宝珠道：「这是醒酒汤，喝了就好了。」南湘心里明白，把汤喝完，闭着眼道：「我醉欲眠君且去。」便","en":"went up to greet him, and he nodded to them. Wenze asked: \\"Where have you been drinking to reach this state?\\" Nanxiang shook his head again. Baozhu whispered a few words to Cixian. Cixian instructed a page-boy to bring a small gold box, from which he took out a pill, placed it in a bowl, dissolved it in boiling water, and gave it to Baozhu. Baozhu carried it over to"},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":5,"tokens":["南湘","竹君"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"不多一会，只见南湘已开了门走将出来，说道：「有趣，有趣！几作了刘玄石一醉三年，险些儿被人埋在地下。」仲清道：「你酒已醒了，还说醉话。」漱芳已拧了一块湿手巾来，南湘擦了脸道：「这是什么地方？」众人皆笑，次贤笑道：「竹君，这是黄鹤楼，你怎么认不清了？」南湘近前一看，狂笑起","en":"Before long, they saw Nanxiang already open the door and walk out, saying: \\"Delightful! Delightful! I nearly became Liu Xuanshi who slept a drunken sleep of three years. I was nearly buried alive.\\" Zhongqing said: \\"Your head has cleared, so why are you still talking drunken nonsense?\\""},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":1,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"满屋通明。一一坐了，次贤道：「我们何不再饮几杯？」众人道：「我们在亭子上已饮多了，可以不必酒了，倒是清谈罢。」南湘道：「我今日的酒不晓得怎样醒的？」宝珠道：","en":"have already drunk too much in the pavilion. We can do without wine, so let us have a quiet, simple gathering.\\" Nanxiang said: \\"I have no idea how my drunken state cleared. What happened?\\" Baozhu replied:"},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":3,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「我们今日醒眼观醉。眼倒也有趣。」南湘道：「瑶卿，我记得你还灌我一大碗酒。」众人笑道：「这人醉胡涂了，到底饮了多少酒来？」南湘道：「今日我同高卓然、张仲雨，带了王静芳、李佩仙在酒楼上饮了一天，也不晓得有多少，他们都醉得先走了。我送静芳回去，顺路到庸庵家，问知出外逛灯，我也去逛灯。也不知赶","en":"\\"We who were sober today watched others in their cups, and that also had its charms.\\" Nanxiang said: \\"Yaoqing, I recall that you poured a great bowl of wine down my throat.\\" Everyone laughed and said: \\"This fellow is still befuddled from drink. How much did you actually consume in the end?\\" Nanxiang said: \\"Today I went with Gao Zhuoran and Zhang"},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":1,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉笑道：「小弟早已认过，吾兄尚还刻刻在心。」南湘道：「以后你们这一班，见我们不许请安，只许称号，如违了要罚的。」宝珠道：「这倒与度香、静宜一样脾气，就是这样便了。」王恂道：「庾香，你看这瑶卿，与你去年戏园所见的怎样？这真伪可能相混么？」子玉笑道：「瓦砾岂可僭称珠玉？那个名字，叫他改了才好。」宝珠不","en":"Ziyu laughed: \\"I long ago made my acknowledgment, yet my elder brother still dwells on it at every moment.\\" Nanxiang said: \\"Henceforth, among your company, when you meet us you must not bow in salutation. You may only address us by our courtesy names. Violators will be penalized.\\" Baozhu said: \\"This is exactly the same disposition as Duxiang and Jingyi, so it shall"},{"paragraph":30,"mentions":2,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"于是漱芳拉了王恂下棋，文泽观局。子玉同宝珠看那墨兰，赞不绝口；南湘、仲清、次贤同坐在醉翁床闲话。南湘道：「静宜兄，还记得「只有酒狂名下士，醉吟许上岳阳楼」佳句否？」","en":"game of chess while Wenze looked on. Ziyu and Baozhu admired the ink-painted orchid, praising it without end. Nanxiang, Zhongqing, and Cixian sat together on the Drunken-Scholar's Couch in easy conversation. Nanxiang said: \\"Brother Jingyi, do you still recall those fine lines: 'Only the poet-drunkard is famed among the scholars; drunk and chanting, he may ascend Yueyang"},{"paragraph":31,"mentions":2,"tokens":["史竹君","南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"次贤道：「那里及得「只恨仙人丹药少，不教酒满洞庭湖」名句足传。」仲清道：「若教酒满洞庭湖，只怕史竹君早已醉死了。静宜先生，明日可与他写个竹醉图。」次贤点头微笑。子玉乘他们说话时，悄悄的问宝珠道：「这两天可曾见你们同班的琴官？」宝珠听了，把子玉打量了一番，问道：「你同琴官相好么？」倒把子玉问住了，很不好意思，只得答道：「向未交接，不过闻名思慕。」宝珠","en":"preventing wine from filling the whole of Dongting Lake.'\\" Zhongqing said: \\"If wine filled Dongting Lake, I fear Shi Zhujun would long since have drunk himself to death. Master Jingyi, why not paint him a 'Drunken Bamboo' picture tomorrow.\\" Cixian nodded and smiled faintly. Taking advantage of the others' conversation, Ziyu quietly asked Baozhu: \\"These past two days, have"},{"paragraph":33,"mentions":1,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉道：「好个春灯谜面子。」宝珠道：「我最爱傅粉郎君一联。」南湘道：「我们这里只有庾香算得傅粉郎君，你爱他么？」宝珠笑了一笑，子玉倒臊得脸都红了。再看那封回书是：","en":"of a Lantern Festival riddle!\\" Baozhu said: \\"I love most the couplet about the 'powder-faced young gentleman.'\\" Nanxiang said: \\"Among us here, only Yuxiang qualifies as a powder-faced young gentleman. Do you admire him?\\" Baozhu gave a little smile, and Ziyu's cheeks turned thoroughly red in embarrassment. Then they read the reply letter:"},{"paragraph":35,"mentions":1,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"生的手笔么？」次贤道：「那封原书，是度香的手笔。」说着，王恂已经下完了棋，倒输了漱芳三子。子玉因夜色已深，随同南湘等告辞；子玉并说度香来园，先为致意，改日专诚再来的话，次贤答应着，送出各人上车而散。再听下回分解。","en":"chess game, having lost three stones to Shufang. Ziyu, the night being already deep, took his leave together with Nanxiang and the others. Ziyu also conveyed that when Duxiang returned to the garden he would first pay his respects, and that he would come again in earnest on another day. Cixian replied affirmatively and saw each guest to their carriage. So they scattered."}],"10":[{"paragraph":5,"mentions":1,"tokens":["史南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这里袁宝珠用手帕替他擦了泪痕，就将史南湘的醉态，及妆点情形，说得琴言欢喜了，便同在一张床榻上坐着道：「看昨日这几个打灯谜的人，内中一个叫梅庾香的，年纪不过十七八岁，相貌生得最好。」琴言道：「这人也姓梅么？」宝珠道：「他曾问起你来。」琴言沉吟道：「姓梅的他说会过我么？」","en":"Here, Yuan Baozhu used a handkerchief to wipe away the tear-stains on Qinyan's face. He then described Shi Nanxiang's drunken antics and his adorned appearance in such amusing detail that Qinyan's spirits lifted, and they sat together on the daybed. Baozhu said: \\"Among those who solved the lantern riddles yesterday, there was one named Mei Yuxiang, no more than seventeen"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":1,"tokens":["史南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"次日，子云即去拜望子玉，彼此道了些景仰渴想的话，就约定于十九日晚间一叙。出来顺道到王恂、刘文泽、史南湘等处看望，俱未晤见。回来想道：「这梅庾香果然名不虚传，玉侬又属意于他，将来见了面，不消说是他的人了。」又想这：「玉侬的脾气，差不多的人都猜摸不着，倘或一言不合，就可以决绝的。即使梅庾香是个多情人，也未必能像我这样体贴。","en":"on the evening of the nineteenth. On his way back, Ziyun stopped at the residences of Wang Xun, Liu Wenze, and Shi Nanxiang to pay courtesy visits, but found none of them at home. Returning to his own residence, he reflected: \\"This Mei Yuxiang is indeed everything his stellar reputation suggests. Yunong is already deeply drawn to him, and once they meet, it goes without saying"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":1,"tokens":["竹君"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"走上来请了一个安，倒弄得子玉坐不是，站不是，呆呆的只管看那琴言。那琴言又对子云也请了安。宝珠道：「庾香，我竟遵竹君的教不为礼了。」子玉道：","en":"stared blankly at Qinyan. Qinyan then offered a greeting bow to Ziyun as well. Baozhu said: \\"Yuxiang, following Zhujun's wise instructions I shall dispense with tedious ceremony.\\" Ziyu responded:"}],"12":[{"paragraph":15,"mentions":1,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"好几日不见，仲清道：「自从灯节逛灯之后，便着了凉，病了好几日，已有半个多月不曾出门，在家也闷。」就说起灯节晚上南湘的醉态来，高品笑道：「那一天我也在坐，也醉得了不得了。我是乘间脱逃，不然也要波及无辜，难道去向酒糟头索命么？」于是大家又讲起怡园的灯，与那些灯谜来。高品道：「有两个好灯谜，是两封情书：一封是花名，一封是药名，都被我们同庙住的一位叫田湘帆打着了，真是好","en":"several days — I have not left home for more than half a month and was growing restless indoors.\\" He then spoke of Nanxiang's drunken state on the lantern festival evening. Gao Pin laughed: \\"I was there that day too and was quite thoroughly drunk myself. I managed to slip away at an opportune moment — otherwise I too would have been caught in the crossfire. Why on earth would"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":1,"tokens":["史竹君"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"龙，未见真龙；\\n郑人梦鹿，终是假鹿。湘帆可惜有闹相公之名，无闹相公之实。天下相公出在京城，京城相公聚在联锦班。史竹君的《曲台花选》，品题最允，如袁宝珠、苏蕙芳等方配称名花，而且诗词书画无一不佳，直可作我辈良友。若翠宝、玉美等，不过狐媚迎人，蛾眉善妒，视钱财为性命，以衣服作交情，今日迎新，明朝弃旧，湘帆何其孟浪用情若此？」春航听了，半晌不语，俯首而思。仲清道：「足下","en":"actors in the world are in the capital, and the finest in the capital are assembled in the Lianjin troupe. Shi Zhujun's Opera Stage Flower Selection ranks them most fairly: Yuan Baozhu, Su Huifang, and such as these alone may be called celebrated flowers — and moreover they are accomplished in poetry, lyrics, calligraphy, and painting without exception, truly capable"},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":1,"tokens":["史竹君"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"是苏蕙芳，不错的，定是苏媚香，那真是冰壶秋月，清绝无尘，生得不肥不瘦，一个鸡子脸儿，常穿件素色衣裳，在联锦班。史竹君定他是第二名。」春航道：「尚是第二名，第一名是谁？难道还有比他好的么？」高品道：「第一名是袁宝珠，过两天开沟的时候，你就看见了。」春航道：「为什么？」高品道：「见第二名相公，已经跌在车辙里，见第一名相公，不要倒在沟里么？」春航只管的笑，犹细细的把那相","en":"build, with a face like a hen's egg, and habitually wears pale-colored garments. He is in the Lianjin troupe. Shi Zhujun ranked him second.\\" Chunhang said: \\"Only second — then who is first? Is there really someone finer than him?\\" Gao Pin said: \\"The first is Yuan Baozhu. In a few days when the spring drains are opened, you will see for yourself.\\" Chunhang said: \\"Why then?\\""}],"13":[{"paragraph":7,"mentions":1,"tokens":["竹君"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，开着五六箭素心兰。正面挂着六幅金笺的小楷，却是一人一幅，写得停匀娟秀。一幅是度香主人，一幅是静宜逸士，一幅是竹君词客，一幅是剑潭山人，一幅是前舟外史，一幅是庸庵居士。像是几首和韵七律诗。再看上款，是媚香嘱和《长河修禊》七律六章原韵，春航心里更加起敬。想道：","en":"balanced, elegant calligraphy. The signatures included \\"Master of Duxiang\\", \\"The Recluse Jingyi\\", \\"The Lyricist Zhujun\\", \\"The Mountain Man Jiantan\\", \\"The Unofficial Historian Qianzhou\\", and \\"The Lay Scholar Yong'an\\". They appeared to be matching seven-character regulated verse poems. Looking closer at the dedication, it read: \\"By Meixiang's request, matching the original"}],"14":[{"paragraph":29,"mentions":8,"tokens":["史南湘","南湘","史竹君"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"高品急出来看时，不是别人，恰是史南湘左手挽着王兰保，右手携了李玉林，面上已有了几分酒意。又见玉林手内拈了一枝杏花，后面又跟着三四个人。高品见自己的跟班也在院子里，高品问道：「你从何处来？」南湘道：「你叫相公瞒着我，倒问我从何处来？我今日同了静芳到怡园，他们都在家，留我吃了饭。佩仙也在座","en":"Gao Pin hurried out to look, and who should it be but Shi Nanxiang, his left hand clasped around Wang Lanbao's arm and his right hand holding Li Yulin, already a little flushed with wine. Yulin held a sprig of apricot blossom in his hand, and three or four more people followed behind. Gao Pin noticed that his own attendant"},{"paragraph":30,"mentions":5,"tokens":["南湘","史竹君","竹君"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"高品的跟班同厨子把酒看肴摆了上来。大家在圆桌上坐了。南湘与春航又谈了些琴谱文艺，彼此均各敬服。高品道：「当今史竹君，是梨园的狄梁公；田湘帆，是戏班的李药师。」南湘道：「你又胡言乱道了。」春航道：「怎么说？我倒不明白。」高品道：「竹君序那《燕台花选》，这些小旦，便为公门桃李，兔丝、马勃尽是药笼中物，这不是狄","en":"Gao Pin's attendant and the cook brought out wine and dishes. They all sat around a round table. Nanxiang and Chunhang talked further about qin scores and literary arts, each finding much to admire in the other. Gao Pin said, \\"Today's Shi Zhujun is the Di Renjie of the pear-garden world; Tian Xiangfan is the Li Yaoshi of the theater troupe.\\" Nanxiang said,"},{"paragraph":31,"mentions":2,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"南湘也大笑道：「湘帆真是韵人，绝代佳人以一跌感之，倒是从来未有之事。古闻孙寿堕妆，梁冀下马。今见苏郎唱戏，田子跟车。一副好对，持赠媚香罢。」蕙芳睃着南湘道：「你何苦也学着那嚼舌头的人挖苦我。」高品道：「这话是恨我已深，其实我与你无仇无怨，何必这样恶狠狠的","en":"Nanxiang burst out laughing too: \\"Xiangfan is truly a man of rare romantic sentiment! A peerless beauty moved to feeling by a single fall, that is something that has never happened before. Of old we heard that Sun Shou's falling make-up brought Liang Ji down"},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":2,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这官衔是刘文泽编成的，席中惟有南湘一人知道，春航尚是创闻。高品道：「还有一个官衔你没有说。」蕙芳道：「好像没有了。」高品道：「还有监造兔园册子呢。」南湘又笑。蕙芳不曾理会，即与兰保、玉林在各人面前敬了几杯酒。春航前次已见过玉林，看他丰致嫣然，虽逊蕙芳一筹，然比起从前赏识的一班相公，却","en":"This string of titles had been composed by Liu Wenze; of those present, only Nanxiang knew their origin, while to Chunhang it was entirely new. Gao Pin said, \\"There is one title you have left out.\\" Huifang said, \\"It seems there was nothing more.\\" Gao Pin said, \\"You have omitted Superintendent of the Compilation of the Rabbit Garden Catalogue.\\""},{"paragraph":33,"mentions":4,"tokens":["史南湘","南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"又看那王兰保，却是史南湘最得意的，春航倒有些怕他。柳眉贴翠，含娇处亦复含嗔。凤眼斜睃，似有情亦似有怒。径行自遂，倜傥不羁。年纪十七岁，是个武旦，学得一手好拳脚。南湘是个放浪形骸之外的人，从前初识兰保时，也曾大闹过几场，以后倒又相好起来。兰保也知南湘的性情、脾气，倒与他十分贴","en":"Then he noticed Wang Lanbao, the one Shi Nanxiang held in highest favor, and Chunhang felt a touch of awe before him. Willow eyebrows pressed close and green, containing both coquetry and vexation. Phoenix eyes cast sidelong glances that seemed to carry both sentiment and suppressed anger. He went his"},{"paragraph":34,"mentions":1,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"今日席上唯春航不善饮酒，南湘那里肯依，便猜拳行令的百般闹起来。","en":"At the table that day, only Chunhang could not hold his wine well, and Nanxiang would not hear of excuses. They began finger-guessing contests and drinking forfeits, creating lively chaos all around."},{"paragraph":35,"mentions":1,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"偏是春航输得多了，以后便不肯饮。南湘命兰保斟了一杯酒，去灌春航。兰保即拿着酒来，走到春航面前，蕙芳知春航不能饮酒，便凑着兰保的手饮了。","en":"Chunhang kept losing, and after a while refused to drink any more. Nanxiang ordered Lanbao to pour a cup and make Chunhang drink it. Lanbao rose and walked over to Chunhang with the wine; but Huifang, knowing that Chunhang could not hold his drink, leaned forward and drank it from Lanbao's hand for him."},{"paragraph":36,"mentions":1,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"杯酒，要蕙芳饮。蕙芳道：「我不爱饮了，适可而止。」兰保道：「那由不得你，你不闻」失意睚眦间，白刃相交加」么？」南湘、春航看着他们，高品对着王兰保作嘴作脸，要他罚蕙芳的酒。李玉林则斜身单香肩，嫣然而笑。兰保也笑道：「你真不喝？」蕙芳有些怕他，只得赔着笑道：「兰哥饶了我罢。」玉林也再三替他讨情，兰保终是不肯，犹罚了蕙芳一杯，方才开交。大家又饮过了一会，忽见蕙芳家内有","en":"Lanbao said, \\"That is not for you to decide. Have you not heard: 'Between feuding enemies, bare blades cross'?\\" Nanxiang and Chunhang watched them, while Gao Pin pulled faces at Wang Lanbao, urging him to impose more forfeit wine on Huifang. Li Yulin reclined on one shoulder, smiling languidly. Lanbao also laughed: \\"Are you truly not going to drink?\\" Huifang was a little"},{"paragraph":37,"mentions":1,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"种。」蕙芳道：「你倒好在庙门口，摆个测字摊子。」说得大家笑了。高品道：「今日清饮无趣，何不拿奚十一来做个令？」南湘道：「奚十一怎么好做令？」","en":"Pin said, \\"Today's drinking is dull without a game. Why not use 'Xi Eleven' as the basis for a forfeit round?\\" Nanxiang said, \\"How can 'Xi Eleven' serve as the basis for a round?\\""},{"paragraph":38,"mentions":6,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"要从第一个，说到第十一个，说差了照字数罚酒。他们三个人，替我们分消。」春航道：「《四书》上未必有这许多奚字。」南湘道：「就有也不能凑数。」高品道：「不过罚几杯酒就是了，何妨试他一试，我先说。」即说道：「奚。」春航道：「那一句书的奚字，要说明白。」高品道：「奚取于三家的奚。」南湘便道：「子奚……女奚。」高品道：「多说了一句，罚两杯。」南湘道：「不兴说两句么？」高品","en":"will serve as our seconds.\\" Chunhang said, \\"There may not be that many instances of 'xi' in *The Four Books*.\\" Nanxiang said, \\"Even if there are, we couldn't get through them all.\\" Gao Pin said, \\"We'll simply drink a few cups of forfeit; there is no harm in trying. I'll go first.\\" He said: \\"Xi (奚).\\" Chunhang said, \\"You must identify which passage in *The Four Books* the"},{"paragraph":39,"mentions":6,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"轮到南湘，南湘便顿住了口，一时倒想不出来。高品道：「罚了五杯，我代你说。」南湘又想了一会没有，只得饮了三杯，兰保代了两杯。高品说道：「是亦为政，奚……」南湘道：「怎么我就想不着。」春航也想了一会道：「虞不用百里奚……」南湘拍着桌子道：「罚得冤！有庳之人奚……","en":"When it came to Nanxiang's turn, Nanxiang fell silent, unable for the moment to recall anything. Gao Pin said, \\"I was penalized five cups, let me say it for you.\\" Nanxiang thought a while longer and could not recall a passage, so he drank three cups while Lanbao drank two on"},{"paragraph":40,"mentions":2,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"大家都笑起来。高品道：「都要罚。第七个奚字轮到我说，为什么要你们抢说？」李玉林便斟起罚酒来，南湘、春航只图说得爽快，倒也意不在罚。南湘饮了五杯，兰保代了两杯。春航饮了三杯，蕙芳代了四杯。","en":"forfeits. The seventh 'xi' was my turn to cite, so why did you both rush in?\\" Li Yulin duly poured the forfeit cups. Nanxiang and Chunhang had been so eager to recite that they had quite forgotten about the penalties. Nanxiang drank five cups and Lanbao drank two for him. Chunhang drank three cups and Huifang drank four for him."},{"paragraph":41,"mentions":12,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"高品催南湘说第八个奚字，南湘道：「第七个你还没有说，要罚。」因便叫兰保斟酒。高品道：「岂有此理！你们都抢说了，叫我说出什么来？还要罚我，天理良心何在？」李玉林也替高品说情，南湘只得依了，便道：「以粟易之。曰：许子奚……」春航道：「第九个到少。」便想了一想道：「","en":"Gao Pin pressed Nanxiang to cite the eighth 'xi'; Nanxiang said, \\"You have not yet given the seventh, so you must be penalized.\\" He called upon Lanbao to pour wine. Gao Pin said, \\"This is outrageous! You both rushed in and said it before me. What am I supposed to say now? And"},{"paragraph":42,"mentions":1,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"南湘先送了兰保回去，又送李玉林到门口。","en":"Nanxiang first saw Lanbao home, then escorted Li Yulin to his gate."},{"paragraph":43,"mentions":3,"tokens":["南湘","史南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"玉林留他进去，南湘道：「天不早了，改日再见罢。」便一径回家。经王恂门口走过，南湘忽然口渴，便叫跟班的进去一问王少爷可睡了没有？跟班的走到门房说知，管门的到书房，探看王恂、颜仲清尚未安睡。门上回过，王恂等便叫请进，史南湘进来。未知后事如何，且听下回分解。","en":"Yulin invited him to come inside; Nanxiang said, \\"It is already late, let us meet again another day.\\" He turned and went straight home. Passing by Wang Xun's gate, Nanxiang suddenly felt thirsty, and sent his attendant inside to ask whether young Master Wang had yet retired. The attendant went"}],"15":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":4,"tokens":["史南湘","南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说史南湘进内与仲清、王恂见了、喝了几杯茶、王恂问其所从来、南湘将日间的事，一一说了，又将春航、蕙芳的光景说了一会。王恂、仲清羡慕不已。仲清道：「不料苏媚香竟能这样，从此田湘帆倒可以收心改过了。」也将前日题画规劝之事说了，又说春航且有徽愠。南湘道：「改日我与你","en":"When Shi Nanxiang entered and greeted Zhongqing and Wang Xun, they shared a few cups of tea. Wang Xun asked him where he had been, and Nanxiang recounted the day's events one by one, then spoke at some length about Chunhang and Huifang. Wang Xun and Zhongqing found themselves"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":1,"tokens":["史南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"再说子玉在家无趣，趁他们吃酒时，便带了云儿去找刘文泽、史南湘。","en":"little enjoyment at home; while the others were drinking, he took Yun'er along and went to find Liu Wenze and Shi Nanxiang."},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":13,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"先到了文泽处，不在家，去找南湘，恰好文泽的车也到南湘门口。子玉道：「我方才找你。」文泽道：「失候。我去找冯子佩，适值他进城去了。」说着遂一同进去，到南湘书房坐了。伺候南湘的龙儿送了茶道：「我们少爷，这时候还没有起身呢！」说罢进去了，一盏茶时候，见南湘科头赤脚，披着件女棉袄出来道：","en":"He went first to Wenze's house, but Wenze was not at home. He went on to find Nanxiang, and just as he arrived Wenze's carriage also pulled up at Nanxiang's gate. Ziyu said, \\"I was just looking for you.\\" Wenze said, \\"I missed calling on you earlier. I went to find Feng Zipei, but he had just gone into the city.\\" So saying, they went in"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":1,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"文泽的跟班进去，一问琴言不在家，听得里头说道，就是刘大人带到春喜园去了。文泽一个没趣，子玉倒觉喜欢。南湘道：「那里去？我还没有吃饭，对门不是妙香堂素兰家么，咱们就找香畹去。」文泽道：「只怕也未必在家。叫人去问一问。「素兰却好在家，里头有人出来，请了进去，到客厅坐下，送了茶。文泽问子玉道」香畹你见过没有？」子玉道：「没有。」","en":"Liu had taken him to Chunxi Garden. Wenze was somewhat put out; Ziyu, on the other hand, felt quietly relieved. Nanxiang said, \\"Where to now? I haven't eaten yet — isn't that Miaoxiang Hall, where Sulan lives, right across the lane? Let's go and find Xiangwan.\\" Wenze said, \\"I'm not sure he'll be at home either. Send someone to ask.\\" As it happened, Sulan was indeed at"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":4,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"南湘道：「此君丰韵，足并袁苏，为梨园三鼎足。」不多一会，素兰出来，与南湘、文泽见了，又与子玉相见。素兰把子玉细细打量了一番，问文泽道：「这位可姓梅？」文泽向子玉道：「又对出谎来了，你方才说不认识他，他怎么又认识你呢？」子玉真不明白，恰难分辩，倒是素兰道：","en":"Nanxiang said, \\"This gentleman's elegance and charm stands alongside Yuan and Su as one of the three pillars of the pear garden.\\" Before long, Sulan came out, greeted Nanxiang and Wenze, and was introduced to Ziyu. Sulan looked Ziyu over carefully and then asked"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":2,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"是个至诚人，谁知他倒善于撒谎。」说得子玉两颊微红，这个委屈，无人可诉。细看素兰的面貌，与自己觉有些相像，恐怕被南湘、文泽看出说笑，他便走开，去看旁边字画。南湘对文泽道：","en":"could complain. He looked closely at Sulan's features and noticed a certain resemblance to himself; fearing that Nanxiang and Wenze might notice and make sport of it, he moved away and went to look at the calligraphy and paintings on the nearby wall. Nanxiang said to Wenze:"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":1,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"说出来。」子玉权当不听见，由他们议论。素兰道：「你们不要糟蹋他，怎么将我比他？」说罢拉了子玉过来，到这边坐下。南湘道：「我们还没有吃饭，你快拿饭来。」素兰即吩咐厨房备饭。子玉虽见过素兰的《舞盘》，那日为了琴言，恰未留心。今见素兰，秀若芝兰，艳如桃李，极清中恰生出极艳来。年纪是十七岁，穿一件莲花色绉绸绵袄，星眸低缬，香辅微开，真令人消魂荡魄。便暗暗十分赞叹，也不在","en":"\\"Don't make sport of him — how could you compare me to him?\\" He laughed and drew Ziyu over to sit beside him. Nanxiang said, \\"We haven't eaten yet — please bring food quickly.\\" Sulan at once ordered the kitchen to prepare a meal. Though Ziyu had seen Sulan's performance of \\"Dancing on the Tray\\" before, on that occasion he had been entirely preoccupied with Qinyan and"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":6,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"随又与南湘、文泽斟了，文泽问道：「你今日倒不上戏园子去？」素兰道：「今日没有我的戏，可以不去。」子玉见了素兰也是幽闲贞静一派，心里就契重他。素兰一抬头，见子玉只管偷看他，不觉一笑，便有一种幽情艳思摇漾出来，子玉把眼一低。文泽笑道：「同了庾香出来，我们有多少算不","en":"He then poured cups for Nanxiang and Wenze. Wenze asked: \\"Are you not going to the theater today?\\" Sulan said, \\"There is no role for me today, so I may stay away.\\" Seeing Sulan's quiet, serene, and composed manner, Ziyu felt a deep affinity in his heart. Sulan raised his eyes and, noticing"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":3,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，教你知道，不教他白费了这片心。」子玉听了，便如哑子吃黄连，说不出苦来，两眼眶的酸眼泪，只好望肚子里咽。文泽、南湘连连点头道：「这真难得。」文泽又道：「玉侬于庾香的情，可为二十四分了，不知庾香与玉侬的情怎样，你可知道？」素兰道：「怎么不知道？也是瑶卿说的。」又将徐子云将假琴言试子玉的情节，说了一番，听得南湘、文泽笑了又赞，赞了又笑。子玉十分难受，只得说道：「些须","en":"the bitterness. The moisture in the corners of his eyes he could only force back down into his chest. Wenze and Nanxiang nodded repeatedly: \\"This is truly exceptional.\\" Wenze added: \\"Yunong's feeling for Yuxiang must amount to twenty-four parts deep. I wonder what Yuxiang's feeling for Yunong is? Do you know?\\" Sulan said, \\"How could I not know? That too was told to me"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":1,"tokens":["竹君"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"侬的情分，竟是有一无二的。」子云道：「你怎么知道他去找玉侬？是他一人去的么。」宝珠道：「是香畹对我讲的，他恰与竹君、前舟二人同去，香畹还送了他一柄扇子，他们倒也合式了。」次贤道：「我看前日庾香、玉侬二人，真可谓用志不纷，乃凝于神。","en":"do you know he went to find Yunong? Did he go alone?\\" Baozhu said, \\"It was Xiangwan who told me. He went with Zhujun and Qianzhou together; Xiangwan also gave him a fan. They were well suited to each other.\\" Cixian said, \\"I think those two — Yuxiang and Yunong — are truly what one might call 'minds focused and undivided, their spirit crystallized in each other.'"}],"16":[{"paragraph":3,"mentions":1,"tokens":["竹君"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，又须为诸花物色，茶靡石叶之香，鹿锦凤绫之艳，虽倾倒一时，然较之小楼深处修竹一坪，纸帐开时梅花数点，反逊子玉、竹君等之清闲自在也。","en":"a few plum blossoms unfurling upon a paper screen, for in serene freedom Duxiang was in fact outdone by Ziyu, Zhujun and their circle."}],"17":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":2,"tokens":["竹君"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉即把日间一一过访不遇事说过。先是王恂开言道：「今日我们都在卓然斋中，交会田湘帆与媚香，又遇见竹君前来。那湘帆果是吾辈，与媚香相处的光景，真令人羡慕。」高品道：「湘帆此时是六根全净，五蕴皆空，守定了约法三章，不许你胡行乱走，始信人间果然多是惧内的，怪不得庸庵、竹君辈，牢守闺房，不奉将令不敢妄离一步。违了，晚间夹棍利害。","en":"\\"Today we were all gathered in Zhuoran's studio, where we met with Tian Xiangfan and Meixiang, and chanced upon Zhujun who arrived later. Xiangfan is truly a kindred spirit. The way he and Meixiang interact is genuinely enviable.\\" Gao Pin chimed in: \\"Xiangfan is now a man whose six senses are entirely purified, his five skandhas rendered void. He steadfastly abides by"},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":3,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"雌半雄的人，已经如此，又何怪四畏堂中规矩乎！」说得众人要笑，仲清道：「你也是门内出身，如今隔远了，就夸口了。」南湘道：「我见卓然与他细君书，如属员与上司禀帖一样，有受恩深重，浃髓沦肌等语。」众人大笑，高品道：「岂有此理！你这个谎也撒得不像。」众人又说笑了一阵，高品道：「庾香，后日有一件极好的事，来与你商量。」子玉便问道：「何事？」高品道：「十五日是媚香生日。今日","en":"laugh. Zhongqing said: \\"You yourself emerged from behind those very doors; now that you are far away, you boast.\\" Nanxiang said: \\"I saw Zhuoran's letter to his wife—it read like a subordinate's petition to a superior, filled with phrases such as 'deeply indebted to your grace' and 'seeping into the marrow and soaking the flesh.'\\" Everyone burst into uproarious laughter."},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":2,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"就是萧静宜，也断不可不请。」大家说：「很好，就添上这两位是了。那是九个，合上那八个，是十七个，也就很热闹了。」南湘道：「没有人了？」王恂道：「尚有何人呢？」南湘道：「你好记性，你既大会群花，倒忘了一个花王。既有庾香，没有玉侬，独使他一人向隅，是何道理？」","en":"simply add those two. That makes nine, and together with the eight, it is seventeen—a truly bustling assembly.\\" Nanxiang said: \\"Is there no one else?\\" Wang Xun said: \\"Who else could there be?\\" Nanxiang said: \\"What a fine memory you possess! Since you are convening a grand assembly of flowers, you have actually forgotten a king of flowers. To invite Yuxiang but exclude"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":2,"tokens":["史南湘","南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"到了明日，王恂、史南湘等，就到刘文泽家来讲了，文泽甚为高兴，说明日就在倚剑眠琴之室布置。恰好兰蕙芬芳，又有芍药、海棠等花开满。少停。即去知会群花，于明日辰刻毕集。因说道：「明日花林中，恐有几个不能来。我知道秦琪官害眼，杜琴言亦患病未痊。昨晚我见素兰，谈及庾香在彼处坐了半日","en":"The next day, Wang Xun, Shi Nanxiang, and the others went to Liu Wenze's house and informed him. Wenze was highly delighted, declaring that the following day they would arrange the festivities right there in the 'Sword Reclining, Zither Sleeping' studio. As it happened, orchids and thoroughworts"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":1,"tokens":["史南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"干谒为耻，未尝怀刺一谒要津，宁居萧寺，玉人作伴，名士同声。蕙芳又替他结交了许多好友，如徐度香、萧静宜、刘文泽、史南湘、颜仲清、王恂等。仲清前与春航不睦，原是激励春航之意；经高品将其中情节剖明，又说起仲清仍送五十金作浇裹之费，春航自然十分感激敬佩。仲清叫蕙芳为之转弯，更觉比前相好。惟有子玉，尚未谋面。是日知文泽等为蕙芳做生日，心上虽十分欢喜，又因他二人交好，竟人人共","en":"same voice. Huifang also helped him befriend many worthy companions, such as Xu Duxiang, Xiao Jingyi, Liu Wenze, Shi Nanxiang, Yan Zhongqing, and Wang Xun. Zhongqing's previous discord with Chunhang had originally been intended to spur Chunhang onward; after Gao Pin illuminated the underlying circumstances, and mentioned that Zhongqing was still sending fifty taels of silver"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":1,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"恂等同说道：「度香、静宜两先生，名士班头，骚坛牛耳，弟等无刻不思雅范。今不鄙凡陋，惠然肯来，足以快此生平矣！」南湘道：「朋友之交，随分投合，以我鄙见，竟不必纯作寒暄。」","en":"you do not disdain our humble abode and have come so graciously today is all we could wish for in this life!\\" Nanxiang said: \\"Between friends, what matters is congenial rapport; in my humble view, there is no need to maintain the stiff formalities of mere social calls.\\""},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":1,"tokens":["竹君"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"仲清道：「竹君快人，开口立见，今日之集，皆系至好，正可畅叙幽情，不拘形迹为妙。」只见高品笑道：「今日王母早来，只有南极仙翁，迟迟不到，难道半路上撞着了小行者的筋斗云，碰伤了小寿星，因此行走不便么；不然，或是又滑倒在车辙里了。」说得众人大笑道：「卓然妙语，待寿翁来罚","en":"Zhongqing said: \\"Zhujun is a candid and open-hearted person, and his opening words show it immediately. Today's gathering is all the closest of friends; it would be best to speak freely of what lies in the heart, without standing on ceremony.\\" Then Gao Pin laughed and said:"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":1,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"送酒，先定中间一席。论齿是次贤为长，次贤自知不能推逊，只得依了，并坐者为高品，次是仲清；左首一席，子云为首，次南湘，次子玉；右首一席，田春航为首，次王恂，文泽作陪。是每席三位。","en":"took the seat of honor, with Gao Pin beside him, then Zhongqing. The left-hand table had Ziyun at the head, then Nanxiang, then Ziyu. The right-hand table had Tian Chunhang at the head, then Wang Xun, with Wenze as host. There were three guests at each table."},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":1,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"喜与桂保到太湖石畔，同坐在芍药栏边闲话；玉林、漱芳已醉卧在海棠花下；兰保在池畔钓鱼；宝珠与蕙芳对弈，素兰观局，南湘、高品在傍为宝珠指点。蕙芳道：「你们三人下我一个。就赢了也不算稀奇。」宝珠道：「我偏不用人教也赢得你。」文泽道：「今日我们亦算极乐了，可惜花部中少了两人，那个还不要紧，第一是琴言不来，使庾香不能畅意。」子云道：「可不是！琴言的病颇为古怪，精神疲软，饮","en":"blossoms. Lanbao was fishing by the pond. Baozhu and Huifang were playing chess, with Sulan watching the game, while Nanxiang and Gao Pin stood by offering Baozhu advice. Huifang said: \\"Three of you against my one; even if you win it is hardly a surprise.\\" Baozhu said: \\"I can win against you without any coaching at all.\\" Wenze said: \\"Today we have had real pleasure. It is a"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":1,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"于是以年齿为先后，仍系次贤为首，次子云，次高品，次南湘，次文泽，次仲清，次春航，次王恂，次子玉，共是九人。王恂已将子玉叫醒，净净脸，素兰取出一颗醒酒丸给子玉吃了。子玉不好意思，只得勉强扎挣。素兰见子玉不语不言，似醉非醉，心上猜着是为琴言未来。一因人多不好解慰他，二因提起琴言反恐倒勾他的心事，非惟不能宽解","en":"So they proceeded in order of age, with Cixian again taking the lead, followed by Ziyun, then Gao Pin, then Nanxiang, then Wenze, then Zhongqing, then Chunhang, then Wang Xun, and finally Ziyu, making nine people in all. Wang Xun had already roused Ziyu and had him wash his face; Sulan brought out a sobering pill and gave it to Ziyu to ingest. Ziyu felt embarrassed"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":4,"tokens":["南湘","竹君"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"南湘道：「此句要转韵了。这花到底与真花有别，若竟把他当做花，则西子、太真又是何等花呢？」遂写道：「惟觉花心尚少真。蛱蝶有雄谁细辨。」众人拍手道：「绝妙！着此句便分得清界限，不至笼统不分。竹君始终是个妙才。」南湘道：「不敢，不敢！认题还认得清楚。」轮到文泽","en":"Nanxiang said: \\"This line needs to shift the rhyme. These flowers are after all different from real flowers; if we just treat them as flowers, then what kind of flowers were Xi Shi and Taizhen?\\" So he wrote: \\"One only feels the flower's heart still lacks a little"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":1,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"道：「娇柔解唱红绡曲。清颖偶触便魂销。」高品道：「魂消兮可奈何？」即写道：「铜雀春深大小乔。花有连枝称姊妹。」南湘道：「好便好，铜雀句有些打混。」即对道：「玉如合璧定琼瑶。纤腰扭入灵和柳」众人皆赞道：「这姊妹花，琼瑶玉实在对得好。局势又振得整齐了。」文泽便接道：「倾国倾城世无偶。软到人间铁石肠。」众人道：「妙、妙！这句要对得工力悉敌才好。」仲清想了一想，又笑了一","en":"Sparrow's deep spring, the greater and lesser Qiao;\\nwhere flowers are joined on a single branch, the sisters.\\"\\n\\nNanxiang said: \\"Fine as it is, that Bronze Sparrow line is a little muddled.\\" He matched it immediately:\\n\\n\\"Jade-like, a pair of discs, surely Qiongyao and jasper;\\nslender waist swaying into the Magic Harmony willow.\\"\\n\\nEveryone praised: \\"This 'sister flowers,'"},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":2,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"来，道：「雨云行得到中阿。」众人又笑起来，群旦将高品乱啐乱打的一阵。子云笑道：「这是我不好，斗出他这一句来。」南湘道：「虽然游戏，也不好过于刻薄，改一字就救转来了，将「得」字改做「岂」字罢。」群旦方才依了。高品道：「罢了，众怒难犯。」又写道：「天生丽质当珍惜。」南湘道：「强盗看经，屠户成佛，卓然竟生出好心来，晓得珍惜了，这也难得。」接道：「莫把花枝忽抛掷。愿如王","en":"spat at him and pummeled him in a flurry. Ziyun laughed: \\"It is my fault, for I provoked that line from him.\\" Nanxiang said: \\"Even as playful writing, it should not be so cutting. Change one character and it can be saved; change 'traveled' to 'how could'.\\" The beauties finally agreed to this. Gao Pin said: \\"Very well, the wrath of the multitude must not be incurred.\\""},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":1,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"。」春航道：「为什么不来？况且你是个花王，这些群花是要来朝贺的。就是我们看花人，赏到国色天香没有不踊跃从事。」南湘道：「你交给我，如有一人不到，罚我作东一天，两人不到，罚我作东两天。」宝珠道：「真么？明日酒醒了，不要又想不起了。」独子玉默然不语，大家说说笑笑，已至明月正中，红灯欲烬，三更多了。","en":"encounter beauty as striking as national-fragrance and heavenly-perfume, how could we not be eager and enthusiastic?\\" Nanxiang said: \\"Leave it to me; if one person fails to come, I'll be fined to host a day; two people, two days' hosting.\\" Baozhu said: \\"Truly? After tomorrow's wine wears off, don't tell me you'll have forgotten.\\" Only Ziyu sat in silence. The others went on"},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":3,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"花谱中添了琪官，惟琴言尚未痊愈。高品、文泽因南湘说过，「一客不来罚我做东一日。」子玉是日不到，罚了南湘一天，南湘甚为乐从。即在他家里又叙了一日。惟有子玉、琴言皆未痊愈。正是：数点梅花娇欲坠，月轮又下竹桥西。未知如何，且听下回分解。","en":"Qiguan was added to the flower register; only Qinyan had still not recovered. Gao Pin and Wenze held Nanxiang to what he had said: \\"If one guest is absent, I'll be fined to host a day.\\" Since Ziyu did not come that day, Nanxiang was fined a day of hosting; Nanxiang was thoroughly happy to oblige. Another day's gathering was held at his residence. Only Ziyu and"}],"20":[{"paragraph":5,"mentions":1,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"胡太尊请去修志，刘文泽是他岳母惦记他，来接他并其室吴氏，同到直隶总督衙门去了。此中已少了三人，只有子云、次贤、南湘、仲清、春航、王恂六人，不时往来。","en":"with his wife née Wu to the office of the Viceroy of Zhili. So three of the group were gone; only Ziyun, Cixian, Nanxiang, Zhongqing, Chunhang, and Wang Xun — six people — continued to meet from time to time."},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":1,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"颜夫人，孙宅的陆夫人之类，也觉得热闹。王恂与仲清这怡园之约，就不能去了。是日子云、次贤知道了，也去拜拜寿，适遇南湘、春航皆在，就约了回来。仲清、王恂说如客散得早，也来赴约。","en":"On learning of this, Ziyun and Cixian also went to offer birthday congratulations; there they happened to find Nanxiang and Chunhang both present, so they invited them to come back with them. Zhongqing and Wang Xun said that if the guests dispersed early, they would also come to keep the appointment."},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":1,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一角。此间颇觉清风荡漾，水石清寒，飘飘乎有凌虚之想。春航道：「奇奥！文心一至于此，即匡庐之香炉峰，何以过之。」南湘道：「前似王麓台，此似萧尺木，幽邃处却不险仄。」子云道：「此皆静宜手笔，布置时曾数易其稿。」次贤道：「也亏那几株松树，不然也就一望易尽。」春航道：「正不知静宜先生胸中有多少丘壑，的是驱排河岳神手。倪云林、徐青藤定当把臂入林。」次贤只得谦让几句。四人小","en":"literary imagination could go no further; even the Incense Burner Peak of Mount Lu could offer nothing superior.\\" Nanxiang said: \\"The earlier scenery resembled Wang Lutai's style; this evokes Xiao Chizhu—secluded and deep, without being narrow or perilous.\\" Ziyun noted: \\"This was all designed by Jingyi; when laying out the arrangement, he revised his drafts numerous times.\\""},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":1,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"插着几枝竹箭，中悬一额，曰：「停云叙雨之斋。」旁有一联，其句云：拜石有时具袍笏。看云无处不神仙。署款为华光宿。南湘失惊道：「此华公子手笔，不料其词翰如此。」子云道：「华公子天分极高，不过工夫稍浅，亦其势位所误。若论书、画、诗、词，倒与其境遇相反的。」春航道：「若仅闻于流俗之口，几乎失是人矣。即此联句，可见其胸次之雅；即此书法，可见其意气之豪。」说罢，远远望见水榭","en":"and hat;\\nGazing at clouds, there is nowhere one is not a celestial immortal.\\"\\n\\nThe signature read: Hua Guangsu. Nanxiang exclaimed in surprise: \\"This is Young Master Hua's brushwork—I had no idea his literary arts reached such heights.\\" Ziyun replied: \\"Young Master Hua possesses exceptionally high natural talent; his application has merely been somewhat shallow, having"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":6,"tokens":["南湘","竹君"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"大家正看得有趣，又见船中走出几枝花来。一只船内是宝珠、漱芳，一只船内是蕙芳、素兰，共是五个。舟人把舟泊近阑干，南湘道：「芙蓉未开，水榭减色。有此众芳一渡，庶不寂寞。湘娥洛神，江湄游戏，我度香先生当以玉佩要之。」大家笑了一笑，群旦上来都见过了。次贤道：「你们看静芳窄袖踟蹰的，越显得风流跌宕。竹君之赞语「翩若惊鸿，婉若游龙」，真觉得摹拟入神。」南湘道：「静芳之倜傥，","en":"and Shufang, the other Huifang and Sulan — five people in all. The boatmen moored the craft against the railing; Nanxiang said: \\"The hibiscus has not yet opened, and the water pavilion lacks a certain brilliance. With all this company of flowers making the crossing, it will no longer be desolate. Xiang Consorts and Luo Goddesses sporting on the river's edge — I imagine"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":2,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"下是绿阴千树，金弹离离，结满了梅子，青黄各半，把个梅崦遮住，看不清楚。对岸树石蒙茸，却不知还有多少亭院。春航问南湘道：「这园子里共游过几处了？」南湘道：「到却到过许多回，逛却没有逛到。一喝酒就是一天，那里能逛。约有七八处逛过。」宝珠道：「我同瘦香是逛完的了。」蕙芳道：「我就是桂岭、菊畦、兰径没有到过，其余也都逛完。」","en":"overgrown with trees and rocks; how many more pavilions and courts it concealed one could not know. Chunhang asked Nanxiang: \\"How many parts of this garden have you toured so far?\\" Nanxiang said: \\"I've been here many times, but I've never actually toured it properly. A drinking session takes the whole day — when would one find time to stroll about? I've been to perhaps seven"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":1,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"廊前摆了一个圆桌。此会是宾主四人，名花五人。子云便要穿衣，经史、田三位止住，只得就便服送了酒，依齿而坐。东首是南湘，子云命兰保坐在肩下。西首是春航，肩下是蕙芳。\\n上面是次贤，肩下是漱芳。","en":"three others stopped him; so they sent round the wine in informal attire, seating by seniority. To the east sat Nanxiang; Ziyun asked Lanbao to sit at his shoulder. To the west sat Chunhang, with Huifang at his shoulder. At the head sat Cixian, with Shufang at his shoulder."},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":1,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"穿着绿油绸短衫，红油绸裤，赤膊拴腰，红巾扎额，赤了脚，穿着草鞋，腿上缠紧了蓝布，站齐在阑干前，对上叩了一个头。南湘不解其故，待要问时，只听龙舟一声鼓响，那四个人齐齐的倒翻筋斗下水去了。子云道：「这些蠢奴，他们也要显些本领。」遂命家人去捉几对鸭子来，又叫取几个红漆葫芦抛下水去，众人方晓得是夺标。家人答应，便将一个白鸭先抛下水去，那鸭子下了水，把头一钻也翻了一个筋斗","en":"legs wrapped tightly in blue cloth. They lined up at the railing and performed a full bow toward those above. Nanxiang did not understand the meaning; he was about to ask when a drumbeat sounded from the dragon boat, and all four men simultaneously turned somersaults and plunged into the water. Ziyun said: \\"These foolish fellows — they want to show off some skill too.\\""},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":4,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"宋、戴陪饮一小杯，即与张顺豁十拳。李逵赢拳，张顺吃酒；张顺赢拳，李逵喝开水。」众人看了皆笑。次贤先饮了门面杯，南湘、春航陪了一杯。即与子云猜拳，子云饮了六杯酒，次贤饮了四杯茶。众人道：「倒也有趣。」又见拿了一个上来，看筹是南湘的。那面是：「武松醉夺快活林。」下注：无三不过岗，先满饮三杯。对面为蒋门神，要连胜三拳方过，再打通关一转。」南湘道：「这一回太多了，三杯我","en":"drinks; if Zhang Shun wins, Li Kui drinks plain water.\\" Everyone laughed. Cixian first drained the opening cup; Nanxiang and Chunhang accompanied with one cup each. Then he finger-guessed with Ziyun; Ziyun drank six cups of wine, Cixian drank four cups of plain water. Everyone said: \\"Quite entertaining.\\" Then another was retrieved; the tally was Nanxiang's. The inscription"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":2,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"罢。」子云道：「这是令上写明白的，水里捞出来的，岂可改得？」次贤道：「况且是你亲手写在筹上的，如今怎好翻悔？」南湘道：「你如要改令，方才我们又何必照样呢？」蕙芳无奈，踌躇了半天，兰保笑道：「报应之快，如今是真要上那姓潘的当了。」众人不甚明白，只道是筹上的潘金莲，却不晓得兰保是听见潘三的事。春航心内明白，只低头不语。蕙芳听了一发脸红，也不理他，只得拿了一杯酒，站起","en":"it be changed?\\" Cixian said: \\"And moreover you yourself wrote it on the tally — how can you go back on it now?\\" Nanxiang said: \\"If you're going to change the game, why did we follow ours as prescribed?\\" Huifang had no choice and hesitated for a long time. Lanbao laughed: \\"Retribution comes swiftly — now you're truly going to play Pan Jinlian's role for real.\\" The company"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":1,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"山门。」注：「先饮一大杯，首二坐为金刚，每人豁三拳。」蕙芳道：「他就这等便宜，我偏这么啰嗦。」兰保照令行了，与南湘、春航各豁了三拳。","en":"had to go through all that trouble.\\" Lanbao followed the game rules and finger-guessed three rounds each with Nanxiang and Chunhang."},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":1,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"史进各一杯。」众人道：「这还可以，在不即不离之间。况且真是个姓金的，怎么遇得这般凑巧？」漱芳只得弹起琵琶，敬了南湘、春航、次贤三人。","en":"surname Jin — what an extraordinary coincidence!\\" Shufang had no choice but to take up the pipa, and offered cups to Nanxiang, Chunhang, and Cixian."},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":3,"tokens":["南湘","竹君"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"娘！饮这一杯。」子云笑道：「可可如今轮到我了。」春航道：「香尘沾膝是件最美的事，况且莲钩在握，就饮十杯何妨？」南湘大笑道：「香尘沾膝还可以，只不要跪在烂泥里，那时莲钩倒摸不着，摸着的是条驴腿。」说得众人哄然狂笑起来，把个金漱芳笑得闪了腰，直跌到次贤怀里。王兰保、陆素兰笑得走开了。宝珠道：「此又是报应，天理昭彰，一毫不爽的。」大家笑得春航十分难受，又不好认真，只得","en":"to one's knee is the finest of affairs — and moreover with a lotus hook in the hand; why not drink ten cups?\\" Nanxiang laughed loudly: \\"'Fragrant dust cling to the knee' is still manageable — only don't kneel in the mud; then the lotus hook would be out of reach, and what you'd grasp would be a donkey's leg.\\" This set everyone into wild uncontrollable laughter; Jin Shufang"},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":1,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"盥漱毕，又饮了一回香茗，南湘道：「还有小赤城的榴花没有赏鉴，何不就趁着晚霞掩映，看那榴火如焚不好吗？」子云即引众复坐船回过红桥，到西边假山前上岸，从神仙洞走出，穿过了杏楼、桃坞两处，便是小赤城。只见榴花回绕如城，约有一二百株，红霞闪烁，流火欲燃，间有几种黄白及玛瑙等色，相间而开","en":"After rinsing their mouths and washing their hands, they drank another round of fragrant tea. Nanxiang said: \\"We still haven't appreciated the pomegranate blossoms at Little Red Citadel — shall we take advantage of the evening glow to go look at those blazing pomegranate fires?\\" Ziyun then led everyone back to the boats, which crossed the red bridge back"},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":1,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"天色已晚，南湘、春航要回，小使送上衣帽，各人穿戴，谢了主人并次贤，绕道出园。子云道：「今日本有一事要烦两兄。园中各处的对联尚须添设几副，今日倒被龙舟耽误了，迟日再请一游，并约庾香、剑潭诸君何如？」史、田二人应了，遂上车而去。这边相公五人，也各陆续散去。这回怡园二次","en":"The day was now late. Nanxiang and Chunhang wished to leave; small attendants brought their outer garments and hats, they dressed and put them on, thanked the host and Cixian, and took the roundabout path out of the garden. Ziyun said: \\"Today there was actually one matter I had meant"}],"24":[{"paragraph":3,"mentions":1,"tokens":["竹君"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"之主人。」因又道：「萧次贤如野鹤闲云，尚有名士结习。但其纯静处，人不能及。终日相对，娓娓无倦容，其情可见在此。竹君恃才傲物，卓荦不群。唯用情处为甚恳挚，虽其狂态难掩，而究少克伐之心。卓然如云行水流，随处遇合，竟无成心，凡事出以天趣。且辞锋尖利，而独于所好者，便不忍加一刻薄语，亦其情有专用处。前舟与阁下，大致相似，和平浑厚，蔼然可亲，所谓宁人负我，毋我负人者也。至","en":"him; one could converse with him all day without weariness—his passion reveals itself in that quiet endurance. Nanxiang is proud of his talent and can be fierce, but where his feelings run earnest, he shows little cruelty, moving as freely as cloud and water. His wit is sharp, yet toward those he favors, he never utters a cruel syllable; his is a devoted passion. Qianzhou"}],"25":[{"paragraph":6,"mentions":1,"tokens":["史竹君"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"王、梅，分作三席。那晓昨日一齐辞了，可可的这么凑巧，竟一个都不能来。」文泽便问何故，子云道：「庾香旧病又发了。史竹君昨日醉坏了，竟至呕血不能出房。湘帆说是没有会过华公子，不肯来。庸庵为是这两天，他夫人要弄璋了，一步不离伺候。剑潭见诸人不来，也就辞了。昨日只得邀了张仲雨，倒是同华公子相识的。余外就是静宜，共有五人，只有两席。他们没有会过华公子，不晓得是怎么一个富贵骄","en":"coincidence, not a single one could come.\\" Wenze asked why. Ziyun said: \\"Yuxiang's old illness has flared up again. Shi Zhujun drank himself sick yesterday — vomiting blood, unable even to leave his room. Xiangfan says he has never met Young Master Hua and refuses to come. Yong'an's wife is about to give birth any day now, so he will not leave her side for a single step. Jiantan,"}],"30":[{"paragraph":4,"mentions":1,"tokens":["史南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"辉，已升了阁学，陆宗沅、杨芳猷、周锡爵、孙亮功一班可可的一齐分房，将那一班知名之士回避了一大半。内中除徐子云、史南湘是前科举人，萧次贤是高尚自居，无心问世，只有田春航、高品入场。如子玉、王恂、文泽、仲清等皆遵例回避。子玉在家闷闷不乐，又因琴言杳无音信，内外隔绝，又不能传递消息，几次要去访问聘才，又因华府威严，豪奴气焰。故而子玉不肯前去，只得静坐书斋，闷坐而已。","en":"the well-known scholars had to avoid the exams due to conflict of interest. Among them, except for Xu Ziyun and Shi Nanxiang, who were already provincial graduates from the previous exam, and Xiao Cixian, who considered himself above worldly affairs and had no intention of participating, only Tian Chunhang and Gao Pin entered the examination hall. Ziyu, Wang Xun, Wenze, and"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":1,"tokens":["史竹君"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"蕙芳敬到子云面前，子云问起春航场中文字得意么，蕙芳道：「前日史竹君说他的很好，是必中的。」文泽在那席听了笑道：「我听得你在家，天天的焚香祷告，湘帆就文章不佳，也是必要中的。」蕙芳笑道：「谁说的？中举可以祷告得来，我倒愿替众人祷告了。」华公子问道：「你们说的什么？」子云正要回言，蕙芳忙斟了一杯酒来劝子云，子云被他缠住","en":"offered wine to Ziyun, Ziyun asked how Chunhang's examination essays went. Huifang replied, \\"The other day, Shi Zhujun said his essays were very good and he will definitely pass.\\" Hearing this from the other table, Wenze laughed and said, \\"I heard you burn incense and pray every day at home. Even if Xiangfan's essays are poor, he will still pass.\\" Huifang smiled, \\"Who"}],"31":[{"paragraph":16,"mentions":1,"tokens":["史南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"十五日一日过了。到了十六日，王恂、颜仲清约了史南湘来望子玉。子玉自七月中病好，调养了二十八日，已经强健。","en":"The fifteenth day came and went. On the morning of the sixteenth, Wang Xun and Yan Zhongqing brought Shi Nanxiang along to visit Ziyu. Since recovering from his illness in the middle of the seventh month, Ziyu had spent twenty-eight days resting and recuperating, and he had now grown strong and healthy once more."},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":1,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"王文辉家一走，王恂、仲清约定明日午刻去望田春航、高品。子玉已吃过了早饭，在书房等候。不多一会，史、颜诸人已到，南湘坐了，与子玉叙谈。仲清、王恂先进内室，见了颜夫人，略坐一坐即出来。喝了一杯茶，即催子玉同走。","en":"Ziyu had already eaten breakfast and was waiting in his study. Soon enough, Shi, Yan, and the others arrived. Nanxiang took a seat and chatted with Ziyu, while Zhongqing and Wang Xun proceeded into the inner chambers to greet Madam Yan, sitting for a brief moment before returning. After drinking a cup of tea, they urged Ziyu to depart with them."},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":4,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"快拿出来看看，想来定有出人头地的好处。」高品道：「不好，不好，不必看他。」王恂道：「什么话！就不好也要看看。」南湘道：「这三道题，卓然一定见长，就不看也不妨。」子玉道：「到底看看怎样。据我愚见却有几样作法，注疏上有可依，有不可依的。」高品道：「我那日忽然神思昏昏，不成一字，到晚随手乱写，完了卷就算账。首艺虽有草稿，也不知团在什么地方去了。」即到自己房里寻了出来。","en":"need to look at them.\\" Wang Xun protested, \\"Nonsense! Even if they are poor, you must show them to us anyway.\\" Nanxiang added, \\"With these three topics, Zhuoran is bound to shine. Even without seeing them, I know they will be fine.\\" Ziyu chimed in, \\"Still, we should take a look. In my humble opinion, there are several different approaches one could take; some annotations"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":2,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"玉林、蕙芳也细细说了，子玉又发起怔来。忽然高品的小使进来请他，说有客要会。高品即忙出去，有好一刻工夫尚不进来。南湘道：「什么人这么长谈？」春航道：「近来卓然有些古怪，找他的不一而足，却非寻常往来，都是俗陋不堪的人。前日我的小使见他的管家，拿了好几封银包进来，问他，他说不知谁的。」仲清道：「是了，卓然也穷极了，自然要作这个买卖。况且这篇文字是信手写的，不然何至忙到","en":"that a guest had arrived to see him. Gao Pin hurriedly left the room and did not return for a very long time. Nanxiang asked, \\"Who could be talking for so long?\\" Chunhang explained, \\"Zhuoran has been acting rather odd lately. He receives an endless stream of visitors, but they are not his usual acquaintances; they are all dreadfully vulgar and unrefined people. The other"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":7,"tokens":["史南湘","竹君","南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"蕙芳便在靴掖里拿出几页纸来，像是写的一篇文字，递与首坐史南湘道：「竹君先生，我今日请分子就是为此。你看了，待我再说。」众人不解，都凑近来看时，题目写的是《香雪先生传》。蕙芳又叫跟班的拿进一个小包，解开一并送上。诸人看是《香雪遗稿》，共两本，诗文并列。南湘一句一句的念出，念完才晓得即是蕙芳教书教戏的业师，竟是个","en":"several sheets of paper from his boot, which looked like a formal essay, and handed them to the guest of honor, Shi Nanxiang, saying, \\"Master Zhujun, this is the very reason I am asking for subscriptions today. Please read it, and then I shall explain.\\" Confused, the others crowded around to look. The title read: 'Biography of Master Fragrant Snow'. Huifang then instructed"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":1,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"必，也不敢当。况庙宇窄小，也无容身之地，赐些笔墨已荣耀极了，何敢当再祭奠？且外面俗眼甚多，反为诸公添些物议。」南湘道：「这倒不妨，他也是士林中人，人也知道，且到那几日再议。我看湘帆，似不能少此一举，我辈附尾，亦无不可。」今日有蕙芳这一请，诸人动了恻隐之念，不能尽欢，到了初更，各自散了。","en":"Besides, there are many gossiping eyes outside, and I fear this might bring unwarranted criticism upon all of you.\\" Nanxiang dismissed his concerns, \\"There is no harm in it. He was also a man of the scholarly circles, and people are aware of that. Let us decide when the day draws nearer. Looking at Xiangfan, it seems he cannot do without this gesture, and there is no harm"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":3,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"明日，南湘、仲清即致札与子云、前舟诸人，数日后都送了些分金，并有几首歌行。南湘、仲清看了，点过分金是：子云二十四，文泽十六，次贤十二，共五十二两。仲清道：「我们共有六分，每人八两，共凑成一百两也就够了。」南湘道：「很够了。」于是又致札众人，两三日间都要凑足。诗","en":"The following day, Nanxiang and Zhongqing wrote letters to Ziyun, Qianzhou, and several others. A few days later, the subscription funds arrived, along with several verses and songs. Nanxiang and Zhongqing tallied the contributions: Ziyun gave twenty-four taels, Wenze gave sixteen,"},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":2,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"到了二十八日，仲清又到南湘处商议明日之事，并说：「大约有几个不愿去的，庸庵畏首畏尾，防他严亲知道，庾香更不消说了，那古庙里三更半夜的，也不好叫他去。」南湘道：「我倒想着个主意。既是此举，也不专为祭他，我们借此可以散步野游，不如日间携樽而往，一献之后，即到锦秋墩、浩然亭上，与那","en":"On the twenty-eighth, Zhongqing visited Nanxiang to discuss the plans for the following day. He noted, \\"I imagine there are a few who will be unwilling to go. Yong'an is always timid and fearful, constantly worrying that his strict father might find out. As for Yuxiang, it goes without saying; we certainly"},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":1,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"南湘到了明日，即约仲清骑马出城。到了寿佛寺门口下了马，马夫拴在一边，已见五六辆车歇在那里。进得门来，古剎荒凉，草深一尺，见马骡在那里吃草。颓垣败井，佛像倾欹。","en":"The next morning, Nanxiang and Zhongqing rode out of the city on horseback. When they arrived at the gates of the Shoufo Temple, they dismounted and had the grooms tie their horses to the side. They noticed five or six carriages already parked there. Stepping through the gates,"},{"paragraph":30,"mentions":2,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"南湘道：「这么个所在，阴惨怕人，怪不得有人不肯来。」蕙芳忙拖过条板凳放在上面，请他们坐了。仲清道：「人已齐了，就奠一奠，我们往锦秋墩去逛罢。」蕙芳即将祭筵就叫在那屋里摆起来。蕙芳上香，素兰奠酒，漱芳执壶，宝珠上菜，桂保焚纸，春航、南湘、高品同行了一个礼，","en":"Nanxiang said, \\"What a grim and dreadful place this is. It is no wonder some refused to come.\\" Huifang hurriedly dragged a wooden bench over and invited them to sit. Zhongqing said, \\"Now that everyone is here, let us pour our libations and then head straight"},{"paragraph":31,"mentions":1,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"大家也都坐不住了，急忙的叫人收拾，给了和尚一吊钱，一齐走出庙来。南湘、仲清仍旧骑马，余人上车，从人挑着担子，一径往锦秋墩来。疏林黄叶，满目萧条。","en":"their servants to pack everything up, handed the old monk a string of cash, and swiftly left the temple grounds. Nanxiang and Zhongqing remounted their horses, while the rest boarded their carriages. With the porters carrying their loads on poles, they headed straight for Brook Autumn Mound. The sparse woods and yellowing leaves painted a picture of absolute bleakness and"},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":3,"tokens":["竹君","南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"前，倒也有趣。春航道：「今日目击荒凉，心殊难受。及到此处，觉得眼界一空。」高品道：「这个锦秋墩，我竟没有到过，竹君想来是游过的了。」南湘道：「我是第一次。我因前日偶见前人有《题锦秋墩》诗，所以知道。大远的路，谁到此间来？」仲清道：「其实也好。天天在热闹地方，也应冷落一回。」南湘道：「这个寿佛寺就冷落够了。剑潭，你说惟清心者能叩寂，志淡者能探幽。那个庙里，你敢住几","en":"vision suddenly clear and expand.\\" Gao Pin said, \\"I have actually never been to Brook Autumn Mound before. I assume Zhujun has visited here in the past?\\" Nanxiang replied, \\"This is my first time as well. I only knew of it because I chanced upon an ancient poem titled 'Inscription on Jinqiu Mound' a few days ago. It is quite a far journey; who would ever come all the way"},{"paragraph":34,"mentions":1,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"南湘心中发恶，便痛喝了一大碗酒，对着一带远山舒啸起来，清风四起，林木为摇。高品道：「看你们哭的哭，笑的笑，胸中都有如此块垒，独我高卓然胸中空空洞洞，如无肠国民一般。","en":"Feeling a sudden, overwhelming sickness in his heart, Nanxiang downed a massive bowl of wine and let out a long, howling cry toward the distant mountains. The wind rose from all sides, violently shaking the trees. Gao Pin said, \\"Look at you all, some weeping and others laughing. Every one of you harbors such heavy"},{"paragraph":35,"mentions":1,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"孙登之啸，不过形狂；\\n阮籍之悲，亦云气馁。古人登高作赋，感慨系焉。我们今日聊且一吟何如？」南湘道：「好，你先起句。」高品道：「悲壮淋漓，莫如填首《贺新凉》，我得了起句在此。」即念道：世事君知否？古今来桑田沧海，不堪回首。高。只有词人清兴好，日日狂歌对酒。史。正秋在断云残柳。","en":"their prose, they bound their grief to their words. Why don't we improvise some verses today to ease our minds?\\" Nanxiang agreed, \\"A fine idea! You start us off.\\" Gao Pin said, \\"For something truly stirring and mournful, nothing suits better than composing to the tune of 'Hexinliang'. I have the opening lines ready right here.\\" He then chanted aloud:\\n\\n\\"Do you know the ways"},{"paragraph":37,"mentions":1,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"唱秋坟聊当哭，颜。听呜呜击破秦人缶。且一醉，莫僝僽田。大家吟了一遍，哈哈大笑。天要下雨，遂无心久留，急忙收拾。南湘搭了蕙芳的车，仲清搭了素兰的车，一路而回。到得家时，已萧萧疏疏落起细雨来。不知后事如何，且听下回分解。","en":"Gao Pin said:\\n\\n\\"The dead have been gone for a thousand autumns,\\nWhat is the use of speaking of undying fame?\\"\\n\\nShi Nanxiang mourned:\\n\\n\\"Grief piles up in my chest as heavy as a mountain.\\nSinging by the autumn graves, letting our verses serve as tears.\\"\\n\\nYan Zhongqing concluded:\\n\\n\\"Listen to the wailing that shatters the Qin man's earthen jar.\\nLet us drink our fill,\\nAnd put"}],"32":[{"paragraph":5,"mentions":6,"tokens":["史南湘","南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"不错的，你这名字未必有同的。」高品道：「也难说，总要看了榜方作准。」春航默默不语，蕙芳只好说些宽慰的话。少顷，史南湘、颜仲清闯将进来，南湘道：「贺喜的来了，快预备喜酒。媚香你也在这里？」春航道：「此刻也差不多报完了，将吊之不暇，何贺之有？」仲清道：「才报了一百八十多名了，卓然中在八十一名，你嫌低了，因此有些委屈么？」高品道：「恐怕不是，你不见条子上写的是江南监生？","en":"posted list to be sure.\\" Chunhang remained silent, and Huifang could only offer words of comfort. A moment later, Shi Nanxiang and Yan Zhongqing burst in. Nanxiang said, \\"Here come the bearers of glad tidings, quick, prepare the celebration wine! Meixiang, are you here too?\\" Chunhang said, \\"By now almost all the names must be announced; there won't be time to prepare anything,"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":1,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，我对你们直讲罢，一千六百两银子卖掉了一个举人，这个杠花就是我中的，是张仲雨的过手，明日就要讨帐去了。」春航、南湘、仲清、蕙芳都埋怨他几句。高品道：「我岂不知此事原作不得，我也有个想头在内，或者今科不当中，或者我竟能名利双收，也未可知。况且我要回南一走，家内有几件大事急于要办，妙手空空的，亦殊难堪。如今倒罢了，虽不能巴结与湘帆作个同年，但不叫抬杠的做年伯，称婊子","en":"is the one I sat for. Zhang Zhongyu was the middleman, and tomorrow I will go and collect the money.\\" Chunhang, Nanxiang, Zhongqing, and Huifang all scolded him. Gao Pin said, \\"I know this shouldn't be done, but I had a thought: either I wouldn't pass this time, or I might actually achieve both fame and fortune. Besides, I needed to take a trip back south; I have several"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":1,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"又欲相留，春航两处时相寄榻。又兼蕙芳照旧相陪，便安心乐意，与文泽、仲清等交相琢磨，闲时作些诗赋，习学殿试工夫。南湘也写了几天殿试卷子，以后又不写了，且按下不题。","en":"Zhongqing, and the others, writing poetry and prose in his spare time, and preparing for the Palace Examination. Nanxiang also practiced writing Palace Examination essays for a few days, but then stopped; we will leave that aside for now."},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":3,"tokens":["南湘","史南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"从此归自荣成了一个衣冠禽兽了。一日，文泽的家人从外面抄了一张来送与文泽看，恰好南湘、仲清都在那里。大家看时，只见写道：勘得归自荣，家本书香，父曾攀桂；心耽铜臭，性爱游花。\\n浪迹都门，骗人弱息；缩头陋巷，拥彼淫娼。恣挑达于风月场中，攫钱财于鸳鸯被底。臀有肤而尽堪凿空，面无皮而岂解包羞。贪酒食之欢娱，畅烟花之撩乱。交游假托，后庭里玉树","en":"clothing\\". One day, Wenze's servant copied down the judgment from outside and brought it to show Wenze, just when Nanxiang and Zhongqing happened to be there. As they read it, it said: \\"Upon investigation of Gui Zirong: His family originally belonged to the scholarly class, his father having grasped the osmanthus branch; but his heart is addicted to the stench of copper,"}],"33":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":2,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说史给事放了大名道，南湘随任同行，且到明年会试再来。诸名士、名旦送行，又叙了几日。光阴甚快，不觉又到腊月中旬。且说子玉因南湘、高品出京，又少了两个知己。前月王阁学来对颜夫人说，不是冬底，就是春初，要与子玉毕姻。","en":"It is said that Supervising Secretary Shi had been appointed Intendant of the Daming Circuit, and Nanxiang accompanied him to his new post, planning to return for the metropolitan examination the following year. The various scholars and renowned actors saw them off, lingering for a few days to reminisce. Time flew by, and soon it was the middle of the twelfth"}],"37":[{"paragraph":28,"mentions":1,"tokens":["史南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴言二人，又叙了一日，这一日清谈小叙，更为有趣。一连叙了三日，子玉也心满意足，人也乏了。徐子云要请屈道生，却好史南湘已到京，作一个诗酒大会。子玉不能推辞，只得赴约。且听下回分解。","en":"though by now he was quite worn out. Xu Ziyun had been planning to invite Qu Daosheng, and just at this point Shi Nanxiang arrived in the capital, providing the occasion for a grand literary gathering of wine and verse. Ziyu could not decline, and had no choice but to attend. As to what happened next, listen to the following chapter for the explanation."}],"38":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"且说徐子云请了屈公来，并请南湘、仲清、文泽、春航、王恂、子玉作陪，仍在梅崦中。王恂是日为孙亮功请去有事，因李元茂吉期已定，要招赘过来。亮功因两位贤郎是不懂事的，一切皆托王恂料理，王恂所以不能前来。","en":"To return to our story: Xu Ziyun had invited Master Qu to attend, with Nanxiang, Zhongqing, Wenze, Chunhang, Wang Xun, and Ziyu as companions, again in the Plum Knoll. Wang Xun on this particular day had been called away by Sun Lianggong on an important matter: the wedding date had been fixed for Li Yuanmao, who was to be adopted"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":1,"tokens":["史南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"从前徐中堂在京时，也与他相好，并有些事情请教他，又请他代代笔，作些诗文，所以子云以长者相待。史南湘是同乡后辈，不消说是认识的了。","en":"compose poems and prose pieces on his behalf — which is why Ziyun treated him with the deference due to an elder. Shi Nanxiang was a younger native of the same region, and it goes without saying that he was already acquainted with him."},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":3,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"西首定要南湘，南湘道：「这是我乡前辈，如何敢抗礼。」才定了仲清。东席第二是南湘，西席第二是春航。东席第三是子玉，西席三是文泽。子云东席作主，次贤西席作陪。宝珠、琴言在东，蕙芳、素兰在西，一一坐了。主人让酒，客皆饮了几杯。道生道：「我将前日先见的苏媚香谈起。」西席","en":"The head of the west table was to be taken by Nanxiang, who said, \\"This is a senior from my own region — how could I presume to take such a position?\\" And so Zhongqing was given that seat instead. Second on the east table was Nanxiang; second on the west was Chunhang. Third on the east was Ziyu; third on"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":2,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"道生与南湘并坐，便问道：「令尊到任可有些施为？请把善政讲讲。」南湘道：「家严初任外官，况且才三个月，尚未办什么事，就访得了一个土豪、两个蠹役，地方上很称快。制台写信来，也说了几句好话，其余也没有什么。」道生道：「我知道你令尊是耿直人，定有作为的。说起土豪、蠹役","en":"Qu turned to Nanxiang, who was seated beside him, and asked, \\"Has your honoured father made any notable achievements since taking up his post? Tell me of any good governance he has carried out.\\" Nanxiang said, \\"My father has only recently taken a provincial post, and it has"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":2,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"寡闻浅见，读书未多。见于书史者也只有数条，大约要以阮籍《大人先生论》「君子之处域内，何异虱之处裈中」为先了。」南湘道：「还有《史记》「搏牛之虻，不可以破虮虱。」道生道：「此二条尚在《商子》之后，古有虱官，见于《商子》。《汉书艺文志》传《商君书》二十九篇，后来亡其三篇，只传二十六篇。内有仁义礼乐之官为虱官。杜牧之书其语于处州孔子庙碑阴曰：「彼商鞅者，能耕能战，能行","en":"'How does the gentleman dwelling within the four seas differ from a louse dwelling within a pair of trousers?'\\" Nanxiang said, \\"There is also the line from the Records of the Grand Historian: 'The horsefly attacking an ox cannot pierce a nit.'\\" Qu said, \\"Both of these come after a passage in the *Book of Lord Shang*. In antiquity there was an office called the 'lice official,'"},{"paragraph":30,"mentions":1,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"南湘道：「古人讲《易》言理不言数，今人讲《易》言数不言理。数竟可以该得理么？且数自康节先生之后无真传。今之所为太乙数者，可以验运祚灾祥刀兵水火，并知人之贵贱。其考阳九百六之数，历历灵验，其说可以得闻否？」","en":"Nanxiang said, \\"The ancients who discoursed on the Book of Changes spoke of principle and not of number; scholars today speak of number and not of principle. Can number really fully encompass principle? Moreover, since Shao Kangjie no true transmission of the"},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":1,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"南湘道：「是真快论，可破古今之疑。」次贤道：「休论世上升沉事，且斗樽前现在身。我有一个极琐屑鄙俚之理要请教请教。我见《越绝书》有慧种生圣、痴种生狂、桂实生桂、桐实生桐之说，我往往见愚夫蠢妇，倒生出绝慧绝美的儿女来。看其父母，先天后天，皆无此种宿因，何竟得","en":"Nanxiang said, \\"A truly bold and penetrating argument — it dissolves doubts that have accumulated through the ages.\\" Cixian said, \\"Let us set aside the great risings and fallings of the world, and attend to what stands before us in this cup. I have an extremely"}],"43":[{"paragraph":18,"mentions":1,"tokens":["竹君"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"三人可以凑得六百金，王氏弟兄、佩仙、庾香可以凑得四百金。」次贤道：「我来一分，出二百金，前舟可出三百金，庸庵、竹君二人可出三百金。庾香、湘帆、剑潭不必派他，凑起来已得一千八百了。若要三千，还少一千二百两，不消说是度香包圆了。」子云道：「难道华星北倒干干净净，一文不花，这么便宜。」蕙芳道：「据我说，不必要他出钱。如今与他讲，就是一总要他拿出来，他也肯，但是玉侬只好","en":"shall contribute my share of two hundred taels,\\" said Cixian, \\"and Qianzhou can put in three hundred; Yong'an and Zhujun together can provide three hundred. We need not call on Yuxiang, Xiangfan, or Jiantan. All told we would have one thousand eight hundred. If three thousand is the target, we are still short one thousand two hundred, which means, it goes without saying,"}],"44":[{"paragraph":18,"mentions":1,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这是琴言出师第二日，琴言原要今日进去，适子云于初六日要请客，一来与南湘、春航送场，并请屈道生，约子玉、仲清等相陪。今日已是初四，索性到初七进去，并说写个字贴与华公子，说他过了假期，一因身子不快，二因留他逛几天。所以琴言倒也心安，乐得多顽几日。","en":"return to the Hua household that day, but Ziyun was planning a banquet on the sixth day of the month — to send off Nanxiang and Chunhang, and to host Master Qu Daosheng, with Ziyu, Zhongqing, and others invited to keep them company. As today was only the fourth, they resolved to wait until the seventh for Qinyan to go back, and to draft a note to Young Master Hua explaining"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":3,"tokens":["竹君"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云道：「已四十天了，怎么这样快？」琴言道：「我在府里，又觉日子慢，在外面又觉得快了。」子云对次贤道：「这两天竹君、湘帆都在那里抱佛脚呢。湘帆无怪乎其然，他要在媚香跟着争个脸。竹君也坐得定能写字作文，可见功名心切，是人人不免的。」次贤道：「今年有两条道路，不中进士，还可以考试博学宏词。中了宏词科，比那进士不好些么？」子云道：「比中进士难多着呢，我是不能想这个好出","en":"seemed to crawl,\\" said Qinyan, \\"and out here they seem to race.\\" Ziyun said to Cixian: \\"These past two days both Zhujun and Xiangfan have been cramming for the examinations. It is understandable for Xiangfan — he wants to make a name for himself under Meixiang's admiring eye. As for Zhujun, the fact that he can sit still long enough to write and compose shows how keen"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":3,"tokens":["竹君"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"次贤道：「他二人本事不相上下，湘帆是当行出色之文，竹君是才气比纵横，恐怕遇着那冬烘考官，就要委屈了。殿试工夫，竹君不及湘帆，若试宏词，竹君倒要擅长了。我看今年庾香是必得的，剑潭、卓然也有九分。」子云道：「你自己呢，一发拿得稳了。」次贤道：「也不去考，我自知无福。」子云道：「这叫什么话？你不应举也罢了，还","en":"abilities are about evenly matched,\\" said Cixian. \\"Xiangfan's style is exceptionally polished and in the right vein; Zhujun's gifts are more wide-ranging and bold. If they meet with an examiner who is conservative, he will likely be undervalued. In palace examination composition, Zhujun falls short of Xiangfan; but in the Erudite Scholars examination, Zhujun would have the"}],"45":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":2,"tokens":["史南湘","南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"昨日子云又请了屈道生、梅子玉、史南湘、颜仲清、田春航、刘文泽、王恂等，并有诸名旦全来，会了一日。因南湘、春航次早要入场，所以散得甚早。","en":"The day before, Ziyun had once again invited Qu Daosheng, Mei Ziyu, Shi Nanxiang, Yan Zhongqing, Tian Chunhang, Liu Wenze, Wang Xun, and others. Together with all the leading actors, they had gathered for an entire day. Since Nanxiang and Chunhang were to enter the examination hall the following morning, the gathering disbanded quite"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":1,"tokens":["史南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"早，屈道生同金吉甫先到，随后颜仲清、刘文泽、王恂一齐都来了，子玉到了，各人与吉甫相见，叙了些彼此仰慕的话。只有史南湘、田春航在场中未来。相公们到的是宝珠、蕙芳、素兰、玉林、漱芳、兰保、桂保、春喜、琪官、连琴言刚是十人。","en":"followed by Yan Zhongqing, Liu Wenze, Wang Xun, and finally Ziyu. They exchanged words of long admiration with Jifu. Shi Nanxiang and Tian Chunhang were still at the examination grounds. Among the performers who came were Baozhu, Huifang, Sulan, Yulin, Shufang, Lanbao, Guibao, Chunxi, and Qiguan. Qinyan made ten in total."},{"paragraph":31,"mentions":1,"tokens":["竹君"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"酒狂词客何纷纷，眼底直欲空人群。\\n举杯渴酌洞庭水，掉头笑看吴山云。\\n文泽道：「这必是竹君、卓然二公了。」众人说道：「正是的，怎么把他二人写得如此活跳，真非仙笔不能。」又见写道：","en":"cup, drink deep from Dongting's tide,\\nTurn your head, laugh at Mount Wu's clouds wide.\\"\\nWenze said, \\"That must be Zhujun and Zhuoran.\\" Everyone cried out in agreement. \\"How vividly drawn! Only an immortal brush could manage such a feat.\\" Next:"}],"46":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"也好看。」次贤称善。子云即叫书童找出了八张大宣纸，照着屏风大小裁好了，送到海棠春圃，请道翁亲笔自书。此时春航、南湘场事已毕，子云定了二十八日，请诸名士游园，以辰初毕集。是日不设筵宴，恐误了游兴，止于几处备了小酌茶点。凡近水者坐船，离水远者步行，须以一日之内游尽。王胡子住了两日回寓，将《图书集成》装了五大车，送进怡园，子云只得收了，就放在含万楼上，也就摆满了五间大","en":"of fine xuan cut to the screen and deliver them to the Crabapple Arbour for Daoweng's own brush. Chunhang and Nanxiang had finished their examinations; Ziyun fixed the twenty-eighth for a garden tour, gathering at the beginning of the chen hour. No full banquet—only light wine and tea en route; near water they boated, far from water they walked—to finish in one day."},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":1,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"诸名士于二十八日早上陆续皆到。是日子玉、春航、南湘、仲清、文泽、王恂，共是六位，惟吉甫因感冒未到。园内屈氏父子，与次贤、主人四位，都在含万楼下坐了。道翁道：「这个含万楼是本《易经》「含万物而化光」句摘下，因为园中的主楼，故取此名。但就本意是言干道之大，此名似乎不甚相宜，度香以为何如？我见楼上现供着赐","en":"On the twenty-eighth morning the gentlemen arrived piecemeal: Ziyu, Chunhang, Nanxiang, Zhongqing, Wenze and Wang Xun—six—while Jifu stayed home with a chill. The Qu father and son, Cixian and their host — four in all — sat below the Tower of Myriad Containment. Daoweng explained: \\"This tower borrows from the *Book of Changes*: 'embracing"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":1,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"前，我等实难附尾，不过聊以塞责而已。」文泽道：「此处我竟没有来游玩过。」王恂道：「我也没有，到护香廊就住了。」南湘道：「我去年看菊花，是从这里走过，倒游了一游。」子云引道，过了一座木桥，从竹林走出，是片空地，有几间敞厅，立着鹄棚，旁边还有一条马路，望东北上编些竹篱，高高矮矮，护着几处屋宇。同到了里头，内中摆设俱极雅淡，署名曰菊畦。后面是个大荡，荡边树木茂密，再后","en":"\\"I have never once come and looked at this place.\\" Wang Xun said, \\"Nor I. I always stopped at the colonnade.\\" Nanxiang said, \\"I came through here last year to see the chrysanthemums, and did have a look round.\\"\\n\\nZiyun led the way over a wooden bridge and out through the bamboo to an open piece of ground with a few wide halls on it and a target-shed standing there, and"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":2,"tokens":["竹君","南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，前面一个丹鼎，署名为松龛。外有一个鹤栏，见有两只白鹤，雪羽皑皑的，甚是可爱。道翁道：「松龛可改名为松鹤丹房，竹君可题一联。」南湘也集了六朝文，念道：","en":"plumage very fine to see.\\n\\nDaoweng said, \\"The Pine Shrine may be renamed the Cinnabar Chamber of Pine and Crane. Zhujun, give us a couplet.\\" Nanxiang made one out of Six Dynasties prose, and recited:"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":1,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉看了，真是喜不自胜。琴仙见子玉题了这副好对，也觉得玉颜春暖，笑启朱唇，仲清、南湘等也替子玉喜欢。大家走出了梅崦，过了梅林，转过一处，又是一个庭院。","en":"Ziyu brimmed with joy; Qinxian glowed knowing Ziyu had brushed the scroll—Zhongqing and Nanxiang shared their delight. They left the plum grove, crossed the silent woods, turned into another courtyard."},{"paragraph":31,"mentions":1,"tokens":["竹君"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"有泉，翻银滚雪，屋边皆树，云护烟笼，赞道：「我看园中以此处为第一，这榭名也好，就每层有一副对子。前舟题第一层，竹君题第二层，剑潭题第三层。必皆有惊人好句，老夫洗耳恭听。」三人不能推让，先看文泽的第一层是：","en":"and the name of the pavilion is good too. Each storey should have its couplet. Let Qianzhou inscribe the first, Zhujun the second and Jiantan the third. They will all have startling lines in them, and this old man will listen with washed ears.\\"\\n\\nThe three could not decline. They looked first at Wenze's, for the lowest storey:"},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":3,"tokens":["竹君","南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"楚江烟水吴江雨；▉字阑杆丁字帘。\\n道翁及众人痛赞了。道翁道：「这第二层最难，上有第三层，下有第一层，这要看竹君的巧思了。」南湘已想了一会，颇难着笔。仲清也在那里凝思，各要争胜。南湘已得了，写了出来，道：「题得不好，将就算他第二层罢。」众人看是：","en":"said, \\"The middle storey is the hardest — there is a third above it and a first below, and this will take all Zhujun's ingenuity.\\" Nanxiang had been thinking a good while and found it hard to set pen to paper; Zhongqing sat pondering too, each wanting to outdo the other. Then Nanxiang had it, wrote it out, and said, \\"It is badly done. Let it pass for the middle storey.\\""},{"paragraph":33,"mentions":1,"tokens":["竹君"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"赞道：「果然是第二层的联句，移易不动，这是煞费苦心才得出来。剑潭的第三层如何？想另有妙意。」仲清道：「我的不及竹君的切题。」即写了出来，看是：君如趁月来游，云移一鹤；我欲乘风归去，桥卧长虹。","en":"\\"Autumn colours sweep the latticed screens—already one feels raised above the mortal realm; moonlight threads through bamboo and tree—to cast your gaze afar, please ascend the highest tier.\\"\\nDaoweng said: \\"Truly the middle voice—immovable—clearly wrought with pain. Jiantan, the summit?\\" Zhongqing answered: \\"Mine cannot match his fit\\" and wrote: Should you roam by moon, a crane rides shifting cloud; I would ride the wind home—a long bridge sleeps like rainbow."},{"paragraph":34,"mentions":1,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"南湘看了，先痛赞起来，道：「剑潭此联，颇有仙气，这断不像第二层，也不像第一层，实在是第三层最高处，我真服了你这种浑脱句子。」道翁与诸人也齐声痛赞。","en":"Nanxiang cried admiration: \\"Immortal breath—neither lowest nor middle tone—pure top-storey height—I yield to such unfettered lines!\\" Daoweng and all thundered praise."},{"paragraph":52,"mentions":1,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"众位还到宝香堂，已是夕阳西下，朱霞半天，映着那些牡丹花，更为绚烂。已撤了护花的幛子。子云备了两席，一席是道翁、南湘、子玉、琴仙、次贤，一席是仲清、春航、文泽、王恂、子云。","en":"sank west; red sky half the vault set peonies blazing—protective screens gone. Two tables waited—one for Daoweng, Nanxiang, Ziyu, Qinxian, Cixian; one for Zhongqing, Chunhang, Wenze, Wang Xun, Ziyun."},{"paragraph":53,"mentions":1,"tokens":["竹君"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"里能这样大方，这是勉强不来的。」道翁道：「这也不然，一来相体裁衣，二来是各人的性灵。今日高超的是剑潭，沉着的是竹君，细腻风光的是庾香，风华绮丽的是湘帆，秀润工稳的是庸庵、前舟，潇洒跌宕的是静宜，就是度香那副集句，也觉得落落大方。正是各人自立一帜，无从评定甲乙。你们看这二十四副对子，好在虚字少，尽是实字多，便见得力量。若教外边那些名宿做起来，不知要添多少虚字在里头","en":"the coat to the cloth, and in the second every man writes out of his own nature. Today Jiantan is the lofty one; Zhujun the weighty; Yuxiang has the delicate scene; Xiangfan the rich and splendid; Yong'an and Qianzhou the polished and well-turned; Jingyi the free and unconstrained; and even Duxiang's set of borrowed lines has an easy largeness about it. Each has planted"}],"47":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说诸名士那日在怡园分题了些对子，经道翁一番赏识，俱极欣喜，后又看了那篇序文，真是五体投地，不能不服。就是南湘、春航，是最不轻易服人的，此时也是真心拜倒。明日子云又请金吉甫到园，将那些联额看了，吉甫亦甚佩服。请道翁用真行字，写了十六扇屏风，吉甫荐的季十矮子在园中刻起来。","en":"Daoweng's praise left them glowing with joy; reading his preface afterward moved them to true admiration. Even Nanxiang and Chunhang, usually slow to bow to anyone, yielded in genuine respect. The next day Ziyun invited Jin Jifu to the garden to view the paired couplets and plaques; Jifu, too, voiced high praise. Daoweng was invited to brush the characters in flowing"},{"paragraph":2,"mentions":3,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"到了四月十一日，春航、南湘报中进士，南湘中了二十一名，春航中了三十四名，两人不消说都欢喜，把个蕙芳、兰保也乐得说不出来。南湘此番在京，借住在文泽处，因去年乃翁赴任时，将住宅卖去。蕙芳因春航在文泽处，虽彼此相安，但他出进虽没人说话，也常要到门房走走，因此觉得不甚便当。","en":"On the eleventh day of the fourth month, Chunhang and Nanxiang were posted to the rolls of new jinshi graduates—Nanxiang placing twenty-first and Chunhang thirty-fourth. Their delight went without saying, while Huifang and Lanbao were too overjoyed for words. Since his father had sold their residence upon leaving"},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":6,"tokens":["南湘","竹君"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"又见南湘也中了，想他们二人的才学，是必入馆选的，即与春航、南湘商量，何不合租一所房子。他二人甚愿意，就托蕙芳留心，蕙芳又托人问了几处，皆不合意。一日来到子云处，说及此事，子云道：「何不到我园中来，也热闹些。且道翁已选了南昌府通判，不日就要赴任，玉侬是要同去的","en":"Seeing that Nanxiang had also passed, and certain that both men's talents would earn them selection for the Hanlin Academy, Huifang suggested they rent a residence together. The two readily agreed and asked him to keep watch for a suitable place. Huifang asked acquaintances"}],"48":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":2,"tokens":["史南湘","南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"田春航、史南湘殿试过了，正是万言满策，铁画银钩。春航竟占了鳌头，大魁天下，授了修撰之职。南湘在二甲第四，点了庶常。雁塔题名，杏林赐宴，好不有兴，比起去年春间的春航来，就天壤之别了。这春航偏是姓苏的与他有缘。去年亏了苏蕙芳遂了他的心愿，本以风月因缘，倒成了道义肝胆，","en":"Following the palace examination, Tian Chunhang and Shi Nanxiang had both achieved brilliant success. Their policy responses were vast and profound, and their calligraphy possessed the vigor of iron strokes and silver hooks. Chunhang actually took first place as the Zhuangyuan and was granted the post of Hanlin compiler."},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":1,"tokens":["史南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"却说史南湘馆选后，便搬进怡园，在清凉诗境住了。他的脾气又与春航两样，把那些同年同馆朋友不放在眼里，也不出去应酬，天天与屈道翁、萧次贤、徐子云一班人，诗酒陶情。","en":"After the Hanlin selection, Shi Nanxiang moved into the Garden of Contentment and took up residence at the Cool and Tranquil Poetic Realm. His temperament differed from Chunhang's; he looked down upon his cohort friends and avoided social engagements. Day after day, he indulged in wine and"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":3,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"闲时又有宝珠、素兰、兰保、漱芳等一班名旦，不是垂帘度曲，就是对酒当歌。南湘素有才名，如今加上个翰林名号，更有那求文求诗的接踵而来。他又怕烦，常请金粟、子玉等代笔。至于不要紧的，连琴仙、蕙芳、素兰、宝珠的佳章都有在里面，好在人人说好，没有一个看得出来。南湘本要接夫人来京，一因任上两大人无人侍奉，二因他夫人利害，常要阻他的清兴","en":"Lanbao, and Shufang would join them, either singing behind screens or drinking and harmonizing with their melodies. Nanxiang already possessed a literary reputation, and now, adorned with a Hanlin title, requests for essays and poems poured in endlessly. Detesting the nuisance, he frequently asked Jin Su, Ziyu, and others to write on his behalf. For less important pieces,"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":3,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"今日已是五月初四，道翁定于初七日起身，众名士饯行已过。今日道翁一早进城，为华公子请去了。南湘来找次贤、子云，都不在园里，即到春风沉醉轩来，只见琴仙手托香腮，在那里颦眉泪眼，见南湘进来，连忙起身。南湘笑道：「我道你此番自然长了学问，谁知还是那样见识。人生离合悲欢，是一定之理，各人免不来的，何必作那儿女嗫嚅、楚囚相对的光景？快不要这样。你看半阴","en":"banquets had already concluded. Early that morning, Daoweng went into the city at Young Master Hua's invitation. Nanxiang came searching for Cixian and Ziyun, but finding neither in the garden, he proceeded to the Pavilion of Spring Breeze Drunk. There he found Qinxian with his chin resting in his hand, his brows knitted and his eyes wet with tears. Nanxiang laughed and"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":4,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴仙因与子玉就要离别，虽然叙了几日，心上还是丢不开，郁郁的想念，被南湘道破了，只得强起精神。也因闷坐无聊，便随着他到吟秋榭去。南湘忽又说：「我们何不去请了庾香、吉甫两人来，作个清谈雅集，倒也有趣。」琴仙听了，正合他意，便道：「很好，你打发人去请来。」南湘道：「你找张纸来，我写个字帖儿去。」琴仙找了一张诗笺，南湘写了两行","en":"about to part from Ziyu, they had conversed for days, yet his heart remained inextricably bound in melancholy. Nanxiang's words pierced through his gloom, prompting him to force up his spirits. Feeling oppressed by idle sitting, he agreed to go along to the Autumn-Chant Waterside Pavilion.\\n\\nNanxiang said suddenly, \\"Why do we not send and ask Yuxiang and Jifu over, and"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":1,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉、金粟都是随身便服，各带了书童，坐车到怡园。自有南湘的家人引进，知道主人在吟秋榭，便从山边小径抄入练秋阁前，下了船。这个船是天天有人伺候的，不须找人荡桨。双桨分开，哑哑轧扎的，从莲萍菱芡中荡去，见白鹭横飞，绿杨倒挂，已觉妙不可言。穿过了红桥，望见吟秋榭边，靠着一个龙舟，今日却未装满，恐天要下雨，只装了","en":"arrived in everyday attire, each accompanied by a pageboy, and rode in a carriage to the Garden of Contentment. Nanxiang's servant guided them. Upon learning that the hosts were at the waterside pavilion, they took a shortcut along a hillside path, arrived before Refining Autumn Loft, and boarded a boat. This boat was tended to daily, eliminating the need to search for"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":5,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"金粟、子玉上了岸，进了第一层，听得楼上叮叮当当的响，又听得南湘朗吟东坡的《水调歌头》道：「我欲乘风归去，只恐琼楼玉宇，高处不胜寒。」当的一声，像把个玻璃钵击碎了，遂狂笑进来。金粟笑道：「何物狂奴，悲歌击节？」南湘见金粟等进来，益发大笑。金粟道：「此是端午，又非中秋，忽然念那《水调歌头》做什么？」南湘道：「我因看","en":"Ziyu and Jin Su went ashore and entered the first tier. From above, they heard the clinking of glasses and Nanxiang loudly reciting Su Shi's \\"Prelude to Water Tune,\\" chanting about riding the wind home and fearing the jade towers and high altitudes. A loud crash followed, like a glass bowl shattering, and Nanxiang burst into wild laughter as he entered. Jin Su chuckled"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":2,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"南湘道：「只怕还有些清而不平，平而不清的。」金粟道：「文章之妙，在各人领略，究竟也无甚凭据。我看庾子山为文，用字不检，一篇之内，前后迭出。今人虽无其妙处，也无此毛病。宋之问以土囊谋人佳句，试看佳句何如？王勃《滕王阁序》最传诵者，为落霞秋水一联，然亦不过写","en":"Nanxiang mused that some works were clear but not level, while others were level but not clear. Jin Su replied that the marvel of literature lies in each reader's individual comprehension, and there is no absolute standard. He pointed out that Yu Xin's writing"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":3,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴仙道：「我们何不下船去坐坐。一面走，一面看，比这阁子倒还好些。」子玉道：「果然船里好。」南湘道：「我们就下船去，我备了几样酒果，船里去谈，一发有趣。」说着都下船来。南湘叫书童带了笔研，又把酒肴也摆下船来，荡动双桨。南湘道：「庾香、玉侬何以不开口谈谈？再隔两天就谈不成了。」子玉道：「谈也是这样，亦只两天半了。就算再叙两次，还只好算一天。」琴仙","en":"We can move and look about us as we go — better than this loft.\\" Ziyu said, \\"The boat would indeed be better.\\" Nanxiang said, \\"Then down we go. I have laid in a few dishes and some fruit; talking in the boat will be the more delightful for it.\\" With that they all went down. Nanxiang had a page bring brush and inkstone, set out the wine and food in the boat, and the two"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":2,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"来，琴仙道：「你看这鸭子是一群同着走，倒没有一个离群的。」子玉道：「人生在世，倒没有这些物类快活，毫无拘束。」南湘对着金粟微笑，金粟点点头，听着他们讲话。子玉道：「人生离合也没有什么一定，你看天上的云，总是望一边去的。你不见今日是两来的云，东边的会遇着西边的么？」琴仙仰首看天，道：「只怕有横风来吹散他。」子玉道：「那边有横风来吹得散，难道这边没有横风来吹合他？」","en":"leaves the rest.\\" Ziyu said, \\"A man in this world is not so happy as these creatures. Nothing binds them at all.\\" Nanxiang smiled across at Jin Su, and Jin Su nodded, and the two of them listened.\\n\\nZiyu said, \\"There is nothing fixed about meeting and parting in a life either. Look at the clouds up there — they all go one way. Do you not see that today the clouds come from"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":4,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"南湘叫摆过酒来，家童摆好了。金粟道：「庾香、玉侬过来喝一杯罢。」一面把船荡到练秋阁前，南湘道：「去年静宜有个《水浒传》的酒令，媚香掣着了《潘金莲雪天戏叔》，媚香那个神色，再没有这么好笑，不料湘帆今日竟能如此了。」金粟道：「湘帆真不负媚香。」说着，叹了一口","en":"Nanxiang ordered the wine to be served, and the pageboys quickly set the table. Jin Su invited Yuxiang and Yunong to share a cup. As the boat drifted near Refining Autumn Loft, Nanxiang recalled Jingyi's \\"Water Margin\\" drinking game from the previous year, remembering"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":4,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"船又荡到了桂岭，子玉道：「我们荡转去，到兰径、菊畦、稻庄去罢。」南湘道：「也只可到兰径罢。我看那边水浅，这船如何去得？」琴仙道：「要到稻庄去，就要走围墙边那带河，过了水闸，全是大河。从菊畦背后，就到了稻庄，还可以到桃花源，就到不得兰径。」金粟道：「这里路我没有走过，就这样去。」于是一路的荡去，又觉别开生面。金粟道：「","en":"Osmanthus Ridge. Ziyu said, \\"Let us turn about and go to Orchid Path, Chrysanthemum Beds and the rice hamlet.\\" Nanxiang said, \\"Orchid Path at most. The water looks shallow over there — how would the boat get through?\\" Qinxian said, \\"To reach the rice hamlet you must take the channel along the wall and pass the sluice, and beyond that it is all open water. Behind Chrysanthemum"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":5,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"南湘道：「我念给你听，你也念不来了。」琴仙犹带着泣，听南湘念道：「明朝送别长亭畔。忍牵衣、道声珍重，此心更乱。」南湘念到此，也几乎念不出来。金粟听了，也觉惨然难忍。琴仙已放声大哭，南湘勉强又念道：「门外天涯……」将词稿放下道：「我不念了。」斟了一杯酒喝了","en":"Nanxiang said, \\"I will read it out to you — you will never get through it.\\" Qinxian, still weeping, listened while Nanxiang read:\\n\\n\\"Tomorrow, farewell beside the long pavilion.\\nTo bear the pull at one's sleeve, and say 'take care of yourself' —\\nthe heart is more"},{"paragraph":34,"mentions":1,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"端午，道翁在园，琴仙也要收拾些零碎。那名旦九人，是要到子云处来贺节的，见了一见。子云也无心绪，没有请客，就止与南湘、次贤、屈氏父子，在练秋阁小饮了几杯，看了一看龙舟，应了景儿。","en":"mood for festive entertainment, Ziyun hosted no grand banquets; he merely shared a few quiet cups of wine with Nanxiang, Cixian, and the Qu father and son at Refining Autumn Loft, watching the dragon boats perfunctorily to honor the occasion before letting it pass."},{"paragraph":36,"mentions":1,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"云也送了六百，文泽送了二百，道翁的盘费很富足了。子云、次贤各备车马跟着，一直送出城外，直到十里之外皇华亭。只见南湘、仲清、文泽、金粟、王恂、子玉、春航，领着那蕙芳、宝珠、素兰、漱芳、玉林、兰保、桂保、琪官、春喜九个名旦，在皇华亭等候。道翁等连忙下车，极口辞谢。各人皆要把盏。","en":"ten li beyond the city wall to the Imperial Envoys' Pavilion, ten miles away. Waiting there at the pavilion were Nanxiang, Zhongqing, Wenze, Jin Su, Wang Xun, Ziyu, and Chunhang, alongside Huifang and the nine famous performers: Baozhu, Sulan, Shufang, Yulin, Lanbao, Guibao, Qiguan, and Chunxi. Daoweng hurried down from his carriage and thanked everyone repeatedly, as they"}],"49":[{"paragraph":5,"mentions":1,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"云访问。到了怡园门口，见有一辆绿围车，八匹马挤在一边，知道有客，跟班问明了，是华公子在园。春航便先到清凉诗境找南湘去了。","en":"Hua was in the garden. Chunhang therefore decided to head first to the Cool and Tranquil Poetic Realm to find Nanxiang."},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":3,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"不题起那事。华公子忍不住，只得说误信浮言，认了不是。子云也安慰了好些话，留他在春风沉醉轩小饮了一会而散。次贤、南湘皆未在坐。南湘昨夜于子云去后大发酒兴，邀了次贤下船，两人喝了一坛，把个次贤喝得大醉。南湘掉了水里，家人救了出来，已是喝了几口水。今日腹胀腰疼，起不来。次贤也是昏昏沉沉的睡了。春航到他们房里谈了一会，打听华公子去了，才到子云处来。","en":"kept him for a small drink at the \\"Spring Breeze Intoxication\\" pavilion before they parted. Neither Cixian nor Nanxiang were present. The previous night, after Ziyun left, Nanxiang had been struck by a wild drinking mood. He dragged Cixian onto a boat and they polished off an entire jar, leaving Cixian dead drunk. Nanxiang himself fell into the water and swallowed several"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":2,"tokens":["史南湘","史竹君"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"岳也就遇着好些蹭蹬的事。」苏侯道：「海楼先生过于耿直，我想做他的属员是不容易的。」又问道：「今年有个点庶常的叫史南湘，是大名道史同年的儿子。这人倒有些才名，只不见他出来。」子云笑道：「史竹君是个清高疏放人，现寓在门生园里，老师有教训他的话？」苏侯道：「也没有什么话。我就听得有人说，他见那些前辈的礼数，不大合式。有人议论他狂，或是他才入翰林，不知这些礼数也未可知的。","en":"unbending; I imagine being his subordinate is no easy task.\\" He then asked, \\"This year, a new Hanlin bachelor named Shi Nanxiang was selected; he is the son of Intendant Shi of Daming, who passed the same year as I did. This man has some literary reputation, but I never see him out and about.\\" Ziyun smiled, \\"Shi Zhujun is a lofty, unconstrained character; he is currently staying"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":1,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"明日，春航果然来找子云，子云只推宅里有事，叫春航在南湘、次贤处等了一日。明日又来，子云又不见他。春航明知子云故意作难，然心上又恐怕此事不谐，只得忍耐了性气，第三日又来，才见了子云。子云笑道：「这几日，吾弟有甚么要紧事，连日来找我？」春航笑道：「已经三顾了。我知道前日失言，仁兄因此怪我。」子云笑道：「岂有","en":"looking for Ziyun, but Ziyun merely claimed there was business in the inner household and left Chunhang waiting in Nanxiang and Cixian's quarters all day. The following day, Chunhang came again, and again Ziyun avoided him. Chunhang knew perfectly well that Ziyun was deliberately making things difficult, but fearing the match might fall through, he swallowed his impatience."},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":4,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"只见次贤、南湘进来，大家坐了。子云即将苏侯问南湘的话，与南湘说了。南湘听了，不觉双眉一扬，说道：「没有什么错处，我也照着人一样。况且那一天同着人去的，并不是我一人，怎么就是我错，又单是我狂呢？这就难了，这就难了。」","en":"Just then, Cixian and Nanxiang entered, and everyone took a seat. Ziyun immediately relayed Su the Marquis's remarks about Nanxiang's etiquette. Hearing this, Nanxiang's eyebrows shot up in indignation. \\"What did I do wrong? I follow the same etiquette as everyone else. Besides, that"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":3,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"春航笑道：「礼数是不会错的，或者你那神色之间，有些错处也未可知。」南湘瞅着春航道：「我倒请教你，什么叫神色之间有些错呢？」大家也就不言语了。次贤问子云道：「湘帆的事如何？」子云道：「可成。」又将苏侯问他访些真才实学的人，就将对苏侯所举那几个，一一讲来。又对南湘道：「原来你们都是年谊。」南湘道：「原是年伯，但从前却不大往","en":"formal etiquette might not have been wrong, but perhaps there was something amiss in your expression or demeanor.\\" Nanxiang glared at Chunhang and demanded, \\"I'd like you to explain to me—what exactly does \\"something amiss in expression or demeanor\\" mean?\\" The room fell silent. Cixian broke the quiet by asking Ziyun, \\"How did Xiangfan's matter go?\\" Ziyun replied, \\"It can"}],"50":[{"paragraph":8,"mentions":2,"tokens":["竹君"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"姓苏的，而且才貌双全。你道湘帆的运气好不好？我看咱们这一班朋友，就是他一个得意。」仲清道：「自然。」王恂道：「竹君近来倒没有从前的意兴，这是何故？」仲清道：「竹君么，他因不得鼎甲，因此挫了锐气。如今看他倒有避热就凉之意，是以住在怡园，不与那些新同年往来。」文泽道：「今年你们若考中了宏词科，也就好了。倒要劝劝庾香，保养身子要紧。」仲清、王恂点头。","en":"our entire circle of friends, he is the sole one truly thriving.\\" Zhongqing agreed, \\"Indeed.\\" Wang Xun asked, \\"Zhujun seems to have lost his former spirit lately; why is that?\\" Zhongqing explained, \\"Ah, Zhujun... failing to rank in the top three really dampened his drive. Now, he seems to prefer seeking cool refuge away from the heat; he stays in the Garden of Contentment"}],"52":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说光阴甚快，六月将过，又交七月，高品到了，住在怡园，与南湘同寓在清凉诗境。带了本省抚台的文书，一咨礼部，一咨府尹，保荐应考博学宏词。四方名宿，纷纷渐到。已定于八月初十日开考。","en":"Gao Pin arrived and took lodging at the Garden of Contentment, sharing the Cool and Tranquil Poetic Realm with Nanxiang. He carried with him his provincial governor's letters of recommendation—one bound for the Ministry of Rites, the other for the prefectural magistrate—sponsoring his candidacy for the upcoming Broad Learning and Grand Diction examination. From all corners"},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":1,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"几位在聚星堂观戏，演得是联珠班。春航陪着一班名士在花园挹爽斋观演联锦班。那一天大媒是徐子云，客是萧次贤、高品、南湘、颜仲清、刘文泽、王恂、梅子玉。近日子玉病已好了，勉强打起精神出来。这八个名旦不消说都在园中，那聚星堂上一个也不去，尽是一班中年的脚色，与那些寻常的旦脚，在那里应酬。","en":"Lianjin Troupe. The principal matchmaker that day was Xu Ziyun, and the guests included Xiao Cixian, Gao Pin, Nanxiang, Yan Zhongqing, Liu Wenze, Wang Xun, and Mei Ziyu. Ziyu had only recently recovered from his illness, forcing himself to rally his spirits to attend. Naturally, all eight famous dan actors remained in the garden; not a single one went to the Gathering"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":1,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"华公子又与高品、南湘、仲清、王恂、文泽、次贤各讲了些话，知高品才从苏州来，问了些江苏风景。偶然见素兰的扇子一面画的甚细，要了过来，看了一会。又见那一面写着小楷，题目是《断肠词》。华公子道：「肠何可以轻断？」子玉见了，又觉不安。华公子低低吟了一遍，又问素兰道：「这是你自己","en":"Young Master Hua then conversed with Gao Pin, Nanxiang, Zhongqing, Wang Xun, Wenze, and Cixian. Learning that Gao Pin had just arrived from Suzhou, he asked about the landscapes of Jiangsu. By chance, he noticed Sulan holding a fan with exceedingly delicate painting on one side and asked to look at it. Turning"}],"53":[{"paragraph":15,"mentions":1,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一日，子云正与静宜、南湘、高品闲话，只见书童拿了一包书信进来。子云一看封面，是屈道翁在南京途中寄来的，心中一喜。拆了总封，里头有十几封信与各相好，却都是琴言笔迹，说自己跌坏了膀子不能写，无非是些道谢等语，内有怀怡园诸同人五古一篇，并沿途七律八首。又见琴言另有一封信，子云拆开","en":"One day, Ziyun was chatting idly with Jingyi, Nanxiang, and Gao Pin when a pageboy brought in a bundle of letters. Ziyun looked at the cover and saw it was sent by Qu Daoweng en route from Nanjing. His heart leapt with joy.\\n\\nHe broke the main seal and found over ten letters addressed to various friends—all"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":1,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"去年没有见他能如此。」次贤道：「这是新进长的，不料受乃翁陶熔了几天，就这些进境。若过两年，不知要好到怎样呢！」南湘道：「我只道庾香这首词是绝唱，不能和的，谁又想和出这一首来，我看倒非玉侬不能。」又见另写着一纸道：","en":"adoptive father's molding, he has made such progress. In another two years, who knows how excellent he will become!\\"\\n\\nNanxiang added, \\"I thought Yuxiang's lyric was an unanswerable masterpiece. Who could have expected a response like this? It seems no one but Yunong could have written it.\\"\\n\\nThey then saw another note appended, which read:"}],"57":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"不扬尘，小毛衣服都用不着，绵的尽够了。袁绮香一早带了十二红婢，还有几个家人媳妇，先到园里候客。那日次贤、高品、南湘皆回避了。那十二红都是十五六岁，有的已是云鬓堆鸦，有的还是垂髫刷翠，却一样的盈盈秋水，窄窄弓鞋。绮香夫人带了群婢在宝香堂伺候。今日宝香堂另是一番铺设，一色的锦裀绣褥，翠幕银屏，中间堆了七层菊花。","en":"along with several married serving-women, into the garden to await her guests. On this day, Cixian, Gao Pin, and Nanxiang had tactfully avoided the inner grounds. The twelve Red maids were all about fifteen or sixteen years of age. Some already wore their hair in towering cloud-buns like crows' wings, while others still wore hanging tresses brushed with kingfisher green."}],"59":[{"paragraph":22,"mentions":2,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"祈设法着人前来等语。子玉不觉泪如泉涌，万箭攒心，毫无主意，也不忍再看。便吩咐套车到怡园找子云，谁知次贤、子云、南湘、高品没有一个在园子里，子玉更加着急。跟班们不知何事，又不敢问子玉，便又到九香楼，进去见诸名旦都在园中，南湘、高品、金粟都在这里。子玉不及叙话，一脸悲愁，就将琴仙给众人之信与他们看了，个个洒泪。再不料琴仙一出京，就遭此大难，真令人意想不到。蕙芳道「如","en":"ordered a carriage to take him to the Garden of Contentment to find Ziyun. To his dismay, neither Cixian, Ziyun, Nanxiang, nor Gao Pin were at the garden. Ziyu grew even more frantic. The footmen, unaware of what had happened, didn't dare to ask Ziyu and drove him on to the Nine-Fragrance Tower. Going inside, he found that all the famous dans were gathered in the garden,"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":1,"tokens":["史南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"接玉侬回来，并办道翁葬事。但今年不能到了。」子云即回，要告诉次贤商量此事。子玉也无心在九香楼，便即回家。高品，史南湘金粟与那些名旦，各惆怅无欢。子云回园与次贤说了，次贤更痛得伤心，一夜之间，便摹了道翁神像。明日邀同众名士在九香楼为位而哭，设奠三日。华公子得了信，也来哭奠。一个九香园倒成了屈道翁的丧居了，就没有穿孝的人。","en":"the matter with him. With no heart to remain at the Nine-Fragrance Tower, Ziyu also went straight home. Gao Pin, Shi Nanxiang, Jin Su, and the famous dans were left feeling melancholic and devoid of any joy. When Ziyun returned to the garden and recounted the events to Cixian, Cixian was even more profoundly grief-stricken; over the course of a single night, he traced and painted"}],"60":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["史南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说新年已过，又到元宵，六街三市，火树银花，好不热闹。子云于十三日请了华公子、田春航、梅子玉、史南湘、高品、颜仲清、刘文泽、王恂、萧次贤、金粟、屈勤先，并九香园诸人，作一大会。琴仙见了华公子，尚有些不安，华公子也不问起前事，以礼相待。此时琴仙已出了旦党，入了士党，但从前作旦时傲睨一切，此刻倒谦谦自守起来，因此上下诸人更加尊重他，绝没有一个人笑他。琴","en":"bustling splendor. On the thirteenth, Ziyun hosted a grand gathering for Young Master Hua, Tian Chunhang, Mei Ziyu, Shi Nanxiang, Gao Pin, Yan Zhongqing, Liu Wenze, Wang Xun, Xiao Cixian, Jin Su, Qu Qinxian, and the entire company of Nine-Fragrance Garden. Seeing Young Master Hua, Qinxian still felt a trace of unease, yet Hua asked nothing of past affairs, treating him with utmost"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":2,"tokens":["南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"再给我改改。」子云道：「自然是借重你们二位。那十篇如今是这样，各人拈阄，拈到谁是谁。华星北也叫他做一篇在内。」南湘道：「甚好。」于是写起阄来，将屈道翁与杜仙女、屈琴仙分做二阄，其余九人分作九阄。说也奇怪，想必文字有灵，前生缘法，子云拈了道翁，子玉拈了杜仙女、琴仙，金粟拈了宝珠，春航拈了蕙芳，仲清拈了琪官，文泽拈了春喜，南湘拈了兰保，王恂拈了桂保，高品拈了玉林，次","en":"the other ten pieces, let us draw lots to see who gets which. We should ask Hua Xingbei to write one as well.\\" Nanxiang agreed it was a fine idea. And so they prepared the lots, grouping Qu Daoweng, Fairy Du, and Qu Qinxian into two draws, and the remaining nine into nine draws. Curiously enough, as if the written word possessed a spirit and past-life affinities were"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":1,"tokens":["史南湘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"不能让他。」又看第八方，画一个仙女，玉貌锦衣，腰悬秋水，似公孙大娘模样。题曰：侠隐花史王仙。琴仙知是兰保，下看史南湘的七古：","en":"Flower Historian, Immortal Wang.\\" Qinxian knew this was Lanbao, and read the seven-character ancient verse by Shi Nanxiang below it:"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":1,"tokens":["竹君"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"香真像嫦娥。」桂保道：「不是我，这是蟾宫花史。」众人说道：「这些诗词赞语，他们倒是争奇角胜，那里记着本人？就是竹君的诗，与静宜、庾香这两个赞语，倒是切定题目说的。」琴仙道：「都切得很。你将这些诗更换了人，便不像了。」宝珠道：「只有静芳那一首，再不能更换的。」琴仙再看第十一方，画一个杏花，下有一个仙女，珠腰玉衱，十分妩媚，题曰：及第花史。知是琪官，看颜仲清的序文：","en":"with each other in cleverness and skill; who among them actually remembers the person they're writing about? Only Zhujun's poem and the eulogies for Jingyi and Yuxiang actually stick to the subject.\\" Qinxian disagreed, \\"They are all very fitting. If you swapped the poems around to different people, they wouldn't make sense anymore.\\" Baozhu added, \\"Only Jingfang's piece"}]}`),"char-4":JSON.parse(`{"1":[{"paragraph":43,"mentions":1,"tokens":["庸庵"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"俊儿，骑了马，先到他表母舅王通政宅内，适值通政出门去了，通政的少君出来接进。这王通政的少君，名字单叫个恂字，号庸庵，年方二十二岁。","en":"gone out, but his eldest son came out to welcome him in. This young master of the Wang family had the single name Xun, was styled Yong'an, and was precisely twenty-two years old."},{"paragraph":45,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"接进了子玉。先同到内里去见了表舅母陆氏夫人。这夫人已是文辉续娶的了，今年才四十岁。又见了王恂的妻室孙氏，那是表嫂。仲清的妻室蓉华，那是表姊。还有个琼华小姐没有出来，因听得他父亲前日说那子玉的好处，其口风似要与他联姻的话，所以不肯出来见这表兄了。陆夫人见子玉，真是见一回爱一回，留他坐了，问了一会家常话，子玉告退。","en":"maternal aunt, Lady Lu. This lady was Wenhui's second wife and was only forty years old this year. He also greeted Wang Xun's wife, Lady Sun, his cousin-in-law. Zhongqing's wife, Ronghua, was his older female cousin. There was also a Miss Qionghua who did not come out to meet him; having heard her father praise Ziyu's qualities a few days prior, and sensing his tone suggested"},{"paragraph":46,"mentions":3,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"然后同王恂到了书房，问起仲清，为高品、南湘请去。子玉说起前日所见南湘的《花选》过于失实，王恂道：「竹君的《花选》，据实而言，尚恐说不到，何以为失实？现在那些宝贝得了这番品题，又长了些声价，你也应该见过这些人。」子玉听了，知王恂也有旦癖，又是个好为附会的人，便不","en":"Afterward, he accompanied Wang Xun to the study and asked after Zhongqing, learning that he had been invited out by Gao Pin and Nanxiang. Ziyu mentioned that the \\"Selection of Flowers\\" he had seen Nanxiang carrying the other day was excessively exaggerated. Wang Xun replied, \\"As for Zhujun's"},{"paragraph":47,"mentions":5,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"王恂道：「你见竹君的《花选》怎样，还是选得不公呢，还是太少，有遗珠之憾么？好的呢也还有些。但总不及这八个，这是万选青钱。若要说尽他们的好处，除非与他们一人序一本年谱才能清楚，这几句话还不过略述大概而已。」子玉心里甚异：「难道现在真有这些人？」又想：「这三","en":"Wang Xun continued, \\"What do you think of Zhujun's 'Selection of Flowers'? Was the selection unfair, or too narrow, leaving behind uncollected pearls? There are certainly other good ones out there. But they simply cannot compare to these eight; these are coin"},{"paragraph":48,"mentions":5,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉看了一会闷戏，只见那边桌子上来了一人，招呼王恂，王恂便旋转身子与那人讲话。又见一个人走将过来，穿一件灰色老狐裘，一双泥帮宽皂靴。，看他的身材阔而且扁，有三十几岁，歪着膀子，神气昏迷，在他身边挤了过去。停一会又挤了过来，一刻之间就走了三四回。每近身时，必看他一眼，又看看王恂，复停一停脚步，似有照应","en":"Ziyu watched the tedious play for a while, only to see a man at a table over there calling out to Wang Xun. Wang Xun turned his body to converse with the man. Then, Ziyu saw another man walking over. He wore a gray old fox-fur coat and a pair of loose black boots with mud-caked edges. Looking at his build, he was broad and flat, around thirty years old, with"},{"paragraph":49,"mentions":2,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉好不心烦，如坐涂炭。王恂说完了话坐正了，子玉想要回去。尚未说出，只见一人领着一个相公，笑嘻嘻的走近来，请了两个安，便挤在桌子中间坐了。王恂也不认的。子玉见那相公，约有十五六岁，生得蠢头笨脑，脸上露着两块大孤骨，脸面虽白，手却是黑的。他倒摸着子玉的手问起贵姓来，子玉颇不愿答他","en":"Ziyu felt incredibly annoyed, as if sitting on burning coals. Wang Xun finished his conversation and sat back properly. Ziyu wanted to suggest they return. Before he could speak, he saw a man leading an escort boy, approaching with a beaming smile. He offered two greetings, then squeezed into the middle of the table and"},{"paragraph":50,"mentions":9,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"见王恂问那人道：「你这相公叫什么名字？」那人道：「叫保珠。」子玉听了，忍不住一笑。又见王恂问道：「你不在桂保处么？」那人道：「桂保处人多，前日出来的。这保珠就住在桂保间壁，少爷今日叫保珠伺候？」王恂支吾，那保珠便拉了王恂的手问道：「到什么地方去，也是时候了","en":"He heard Wang Xun ask the man, \\"What is this boy's name?\\" The man replied, \\"He's called Baozhu.\\" Hearing this, Ziyu couldn't suppress a laugh. He then heard Wang Xun ask, \\"Aren't you with Guibao?\\" The man answered, \\"There are too many people at Guibao's place; he left"},{"paragraph":51,"mentions":3,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「今日来迟了，歇一天早些来。」也就同了出来。王恂的家人付了戏钱，那相公还拉着王恂走了几步，看不像带他吃饭的光景，便自去了。子玉、王恂上了车，各自分路而回。","en":"\\"We arrived too late today; let's rest a day and come earlier next time.\\" They then left together. Wang Xun's servant paid the theater fee. That escort boy still tugged at Wang Xun, walking a few steps with him, but seeing no prospect of being taken out to eat, eventually left on his own. Ziyu and Wang Xun boarded their carriages and went their separate ways"}],"2":[{"paragraph":18,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"次早聘才带了他的小子四儿，将王文辉的信送去。适文辉一早出门未回，王恂也不在家，只得请颜仲清会了。聘才见仲清一表非凡，叙了一番寒温，知是文辉之婿，又是士燮的内侄，免不得恭惟一番。正要告辞，只见一个跟班捧着一包衣服进来说：「老爷回来了。」聘才只得坐下。停了一会，听得外面有说话的声音，像是定班子唱戏的话。然后靴声秃秃，见一","en":"Si'er, to deliver Wang Wenhui's letter. As it happened, Wenhui had departed early and had not yet returned, and Wang Xun was likewise away from home, leaving Pincai no option but to request an audience with Yan Zhongqing. Upon meeting Zhongqing and observing his striking demeanor, Pincai engaged him in polite pleasantries. Learning that Zhongqing was Wenhui's son-in-law"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":3,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"且说仲清到自己房中吃了饭，与其妻室蓉华讲了些话，来到王恂书斋，恰值王恂才回。刚说得一两句话，有王恂两个内舅前来看望：一个叫孙嗣徽，一个叫孙嗣元，本是王文辉同乡同年孙亮功部郎之子。这嗣徽、嗣元两个，真所谓难兄难弟。","en":"Zhongqing had returned to his own quarters for a meal and conversed briefly with his wife, Ronghua, before heading to Wang Xun's study, arriving just as Wang Xun returned. They had barely exchanged a few words when two of Wang Xun's brothers-in-law arrived to pay a visit. One was named Sun Sihui, the other Sun Siyuan, both sons of Ministry Director Sun Lianggong, a fellow provincial"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"将他们的外貌内才比起王恂来，真有天渊之隔。这嗣徽生得缩颈堆腮，脸色倒还白净，就是肺火太重，一年四季总是满脸的红疙瘩，已堆得面无余地，而鼻上更多，已变了一个红鼻子。","en":"Compared to Wang Xun in both physical appearance and intellectual capacity, the difference was as vast as that between heaven and the abyss. Sihui possessed a hunched neck and bulging cheeks, his complexion passably fair were it not marred by a severe excess of internal"},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":4,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"是日来到王宅，适文辉请客，客将到了。王恂即同他到书房内来。仲清躲避不及，只得见了，同王恂陪着坐下。嗣徽先对仲清说道；今日天朗气清，所以愚兄弟正其衣冠，翩然而来奉看的。」王恂、仲清忍不住要笑。嗣徽又对王恂说道：「适值尊驾出门，不知去向，若不是「鸟倦飞而知还」，则虽引弓而射之，亦徒兴弋人之慕矣","en":"arrived at the Wang residence precisely as Wenhui was hosting a banquet, the guests on the verge of assembling. Wang Xun promptly ushered them into the study. Unable to avoid them, Zhongqing politely exchanged greetings and sat down beside Wang Xun to keep them company. Sihui initiated the conversation, addressing Zhongqing pompously, \\"Today the heavens are clear and the"},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"徽侧耳而听，又说道：「老兄所看的《古文观止》，只怕是翻板的。小弟记得逼真，做这篇古文是个姓陶的，并不是姓秦。」王恂忍不住，装作解手出去，抿着嘴笑了一会。仲清笑道：「大哥实在渊博之至，连那做古文的姓都知道。」嗣徽只道仲清果真佩服他，便意气扬扬，脸上的红疙瘩，如出花灌了浆一样，一颗颗的亮澄澄起来，便对嗣元道：「老二，但凡我们读书人，天分记性是并行不悖，缺一不可的。」","en":"perused is a pirated copy. My memory is flawless; the author of this ancient text was surnamed Tao, not Qin.\\" Wang Xun, unable to contain himself any longer, feigned the need to use the washroom and hurried out, his lips pressed tightly together to stifle his laughter. Zhongqing replied with a smile, \\"Brother is truly a wellspring of profound knowledge, even knowing"},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"叉、叉、叉了几叉，痛骂了一顿。」这一番说得嗣徽羞忿难耐，便在屋子里乱踱起来，说道：「屁话，屁话！」便起身告辞。王恂也恐他们弟兄斗气，不便挽留，同仲清送了出来。","en":"began pacing wildly around the room, sputtering, \\"Bullshit! Bullshit!\\" before storming out to take his leave. Wang Xun, fearing their sibling rivalry might escalate unpleasantly, deemed it unwise to insist they stay, and together with Zhongqing, escorted them out."},{"paragraph":31,"mentions":2,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"王恂、仲清上前见了礼，亮功问道：「客到齐了么？」王恂道：「没有。」仲清看亮功虽是个紫糖色扁脸，蹋鼻子，但五官端正，又有了几根胡须，比两位贤郎好看多了。","en":"Wang Xun and Zhongqing stepped forward to exchange greetings. Lianggong asked, \\"Have all the guests assembled?\\" Wang Xun replied, \\"Not yet.\\" Zhongqing observed Lianggong closely, noting his purplish-brown complexion and flat nose. Yet, his features were properly"},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"亮功正要与他儿子说话，适值王桂保进来，见了亮功并王恂、仲清，也站在一边。亮功看看桂保，对他儿子说道：「你们回去，不要说什么。」嗣徽兄弟会意答应，于是亮功即拉了桂保进去。","en":"was on the verge of addressing his sons when Wang Guibao entered the courtyard. Spotting Lianggong, along with Wang Xun and Zhongqing, he also stepped respectfully aside. Lianggong glanced at Guibao before instructing his sons, \\"Return home immediately, and utter not a single word.\\" Sihui and his brother, understanding the implication, voiced their assent. Lianggong then"},{"paragraph":33,"mentions":4,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"仲清、王恂送了他弟兄出门进来，大家换了衣裳，在书房内晚饭对酌闲谈。王恂道：「我们这两位舅兄，真可入得《无双谱》的。」仲清道：「为什么同胞兄妹丝毫不像？假使尊夫人生了这样嘴脸，那就够你受罪了。」王恂笑道：「幸亏内人是如今这位岳母生的。你不晓得我们还有个大姨子在家","en":"Zhongqing and Wang Xun saw the two brothers to the door before returning inside. They changed their garments and settled in the study for an evening meal, sharing wine and casual conversation. Wang Xun said, \\"These two brothers-in-law of ours are truly worthy of inclusion"},{"paragraph":42,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"文辉赏了桂保二十两银子，桂保谢了，走到书房来找王恂、仲清，谈了一会，说道：「我们班里新来了两个：一个叫琴官，一个叫琪官，生得色艺俱佳，只怕史竹君的《花选》又要翻刻了。」又坐了一会也自回去。不知后事如何，且听下回分解。","en":"Guibao with twenty taels of silver. After expressing his gratitude, Guibao made his way to the study in search of Wang Xun and Zhongqing. They conversed for a time before Guibao revealed, \\"Two new performers have recently joined our troupe, one named Qinguan, the other Qiguan. Both are exquisitely beautiful and remarkably talented. I fear Shi Zhujun's Selection of Flowers"}],"4":[{"paragraph":6,"mentions":2,"tokens":["庸庵"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"仲清笔迹，便问俊儿是谁送来的。俊儿道：「是颜少爷的健儿。」子玉道：「叫他等一等。」拆开看时，信笺上写着是：昨与庸庵同居虚室。玉杯寒重，始知六出花飞；银烛光残，才见十分雪艳。冰山迭迭，围成云母屏风；宝塔层层，照见琉璃灯火。美人装罢，玉戏猫儿；罗汉堆来，球抛狮子。\\n黄昏选韵，白战分题；愧乏琼词，聊为砖引。\\n谨呈冰鉴，乞报瑶章。庾香仁弟文几。庸庵嘱候，仲清手肃。","en":"personal attendant,\\" Jun'er replied. Ziyu asked him to wait a moment, then broke the seal. The note read: \\"Yesterday, Yong'an and I sat together in a desolate room. Only when our jade cups grew heavy with cold did we realize the six-pointed flowers had begun to fly; only when the silver candle-light guttered did we perceive the snow's full, radiant beauty. Ice mountains piled"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":2,"tokens":["庸庵","王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"九华。\\n织素有光宁向壁，读书无火是谁家。\\n清寒已尽三条烛，照睡还看六出花。\\n记取元宵佳节近，闹蛾残柳莫争夸。\\n庸庵王恂初稿\\n子玉看了道：「好诗。这四首之中，自然以《雪塔》为第一，《雪屏》第二，《雪山》次之，《雪灯》又次之。再看仲清的诗是：","en":"Lantern Feast draws near;\\nyou festive moths and withered willows, boast not against this glow.\\n\\n—first draft by Wang Xun of the Yong'an studio.\\n\\nZiyu read them and said, \\"Splendid poems. Of these four, Snow Pagoda must rank first, Snow Screen second, Snow Mountain next, and Snow Lantern last. Now let us see Jiantan's:\\""},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"清这几首，《雪狮》镂金错彩，《雪猫》琢玉雕琼，《雪罗汉》吐属清芬，莲花满庭，《雪美人》双管齐下，玉茗风流，却在王恂之上。因想依韵再和八首，未必能如原唱浑成。不如另拟四题，不落窠臼。他这八个题目，都是从后着想，以虚作实，借宾定主。我却从未下雪以前着想，竟用四个虚字，连着雪字作题。我想未下雪之前，彤云密布，空空蒙蒙，先有了下雪的意思。把雪意做了第一个题目。到了雪花飘","en":"courtyard full of lotus; Snow Beauty was deft in both strokes at once, and had all Tang Xianzu's grace—surpassing even Wang Xun's work. He thought he would compose eight matching poems using the same rhymes, but feared they could not equal the seamless completeness of the originals. It would be better to choose four new topics and avoid the same grooves. Those eight topics of"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"那边仲清接着回札，与王恂同看。只见上写着：书奉朵云，词霏香雪。芙蓉灯灺佛塔玲珑；翡翠屏寒，指点仙山飘渺。白地现金身罗汉，狮驯拄杖之旁；缟衣来玉骨美人，狸睡棋抨之侧。新露盥手，古雪院浣；\\n明月自来，阳春寡和。赋诗七字，惭珠玉之在前；俚语四章，愧琼瑶之莫报。手疏覆此，目笑存之。","en":"On the other side, Zhongqing received the reply note and read it together with Wang Xun. It read: \\"Your letter arrived like a drift of cloud; the words fell like fragrant snow. The lotus-lantern guttered in the Buddha-pagoda's delicate glow; the kingfisher screen grew cold as one traced the fairy mountain's dim silhouette. Upon the white"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":1,"tokens":["庸庵"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"剑潭、庸庵两兄同览。子玉拜手。外附拙作四首，又七绝五律各一首，即乞郢正。","en":"\\"To Jiantan and Yong'an, both brothers, for their joint perusal. Ziyu, with clasped hands. Attached are four rough compositions of mine, along with one seven-character quatrain and one five-character regulated poem; please kindly correct them.\\""},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"仲清等再看子玉的诗题是：《雪意》、《雪影》、《雪声》、《雪色》。仲清向王恂道：「这四个题目太空，比我们更难着笔，庾香必有佳制。」说着看诗，只见上写着：","en":"others then looked at Ziyu's poem titles: Snow Feeling, Snow Shadow, Snow Sound, Snow Color. Zhongqing said to Wang Xun, \\"These four topics are entirely abstract—even harder to get a brush around than ours. Yuxiang is sure to have produced something fine.\\" With that, they looked at the poems. They read:"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"玲珑。\\n低迷照水摇虚白，依约栖尘漾软红。\\n飞入梅花痕始淡，舞回柳絮色都空。\\n清寒合称瑶池梦，琪树分明映月中，\\n王恂一句一击节。\\n仲清道：「这首把题的魂都勾出来了。」再看下去是：","en":"void.\\nIn the clear cold it matches a dream of the Jade Pool;\\nthe jade-tree branches glowing plainly in the moon.\\n\\nWang Xun applauded after every line. Zhongqing said, \\"This one has summoned the very soul of the topic.\\" He read on:"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"云有梦竟堆黄。\\n浓浮珠露三分艳，淡借冰梅一缕香。\\n照眼空明难细认，白沙淡月两茫茫。\\n当下看完，仲清拍案叫绝，同王恂朗吟了几遍。仲清道：","en":"fade into endless haze.\\n\\nWhen they had finished reading, Zhongqing struck the table in admiration, and he and Wang Xun chanted the poems aloud several times. Zhongqing said:"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":3,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「这几首诗，把我们的都压下去了。」再看聘才的那首绝句。王恂道：「这首亦甚好，只不知庾香又做这一首做什么？」仲清道：「这首也还下得去，然断不是庾香所作。」再看元茂的五律，起二句写着是：「天上彤云布，来思雨雪盈。」王恂道：「这「来思」两字怎么讲？」仲清忽然大笑道：「你往下看。」王恂再看第二联是：「白人双目近，长","en":"\\"These poems surpass all of ours.\\" They then looked at Pincai's quatrain. Wang Xun said, \\"This one is also quite good, but what made Yuxiang compose this extra one on his own?\\" Zhongqing replied, \\"This one is passable, but it is certainly not Yuxiang's work.\\" They then looked at Yuanmao's five-character regulated poem. The opening"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":5,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"再看下联是：「掘阅蜉游似，挖空狮子成。」王恂道：「这两句就奇怪得很，怎么用得上来？。上句想是用《诗经》上的因为「麻衣如雪」这个雪字，遂把「蜉蝣掘阅」用上来了。这个挖空狮子又有什么典故在里头？」仲清道：「也不过说堆的雪狮子就是了。」再看结句是：「出时献世宝，六瑞太阶平。」王恂道：「这还用得着颂扬","en":"He looked at the third couplet:\\nBurrowing mayflies resemble—\\ndigging out hollow lions, made complete.\\nWang Xun said, \\"These two lines are very strange indeed. How do they come into play? The first line probably uses *The Classic of Poetry*—since there is the character for snow in 'linen garments white as snow,' the 'burrowing mayfly' passage gets dragged in."},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":3,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"元茂的诗第一二联单圈，下四句全圈。批语云：裁对工稳，用古入化，足可嗣响元徽。王恂把子玉的诗，用针在碧纱橱内戳了，来看批语，笑道：「却批得好，就是太挖苦些。」仲清道：「可惜天不早了，这雪也下不住，不然，倒可以去与庾香谈谈。」王恂道：「明日去罢！此刻去也谈不久了。」是日又下了一天一夜，积得有一尺厚了。次早晴了，朔风一吹，将一个世界，","en":"classical allusions are dissolved into the new composition; fully worthy to carry on the succession of Yuanhui. Wang Xun used a needle to pin Ziyu's poems inside a translucent gauze cabinet, then read Zhongqing's comments and laughed. \\"The comments are well done, only slightly too barbed.\\" Zhongqing said, \\"What a pity it is already so late, and the snow will not hold off."},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":4,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"王恂看是孙嗣徽，两车相对，王恂问道：「你往那里去？」嗣徽道：「只因家父夫妻反目，噬肤灭鼻，几几乎血流漂杵。有一王大夫，以人治人，有以去其旧染之污，睨而视之，曰无伤也。今病小愈，不能不绥之斯来耳。」王恂笑了一笑道：「我回来就来的。」嗣徽应了，匆匆而去。仲清","en":"Wang Xun looked and saw it was Sun Sihui. The two carriages drew up face to face. Wang Xun asked, \\"Where are you headed?\\" Sihui replied, \\"Owing to the fact that my father and his wife have been at cross purposes—consuming and obliterating, with blood nearly flowing"},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":4,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"之至。拙作草草涂鸦，未免小巫见大巫。」仲清道：「兄等所作，粗枝大叶，那里及得老弟的佳章，恬吟密咏，风雅宜人。」王恂道：「我最爱《雪意》、《雪色》这两首，清新俊逸，庾鲍兼长。」子玉道：「吾兄这四首，冰雪为怀，珠玑在手。那《雪山》、《雪塔》两首，起句破空而来，尤为超脱。至剑潭的诗中名句，如「奈他鼠辈只趋炎」，及「后夜思量成逝水」一联，寓意措词，情深一往，东坡所谓不食","en":"with your fine compositions, which repay repeated murmured recitation? Refined and fitting in every respect.\\" Wang Xun added, \\"What I love most are these two poems, Snow Feeling and Snow Color. Fresh and vigorous, combining the virtues of Yu Xin and Bao Zhao at once.\\" Ziyu said, \\"Your own four poems, brother, breathe ice and snow throughout, with pearls and jade in hand."},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":2,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"王恂又将孙氏昆仲与他说了，子玉也笑，就叫人请了聘才、元茂出来，大家见了。子玉把各人的诗交给了，说道：「这都是颜大兄评定的，称赞得了不得。」聘才看了批语，暗想道：「颜仲清这人，真可谓博古通今，我用的戏曲，都被他看出来了。」当向仲清道了谢。仲清道：「魏兄诗笔","en":"Wang Xun then also told him about the Sun brothers. Ziyu laughed, and had someone summon Pincai and Yuanmao to come out. Everyone met. Ziyu returned each person's poems and said, \\"These assessments were made by Elder Brother Yan; he was most complimentary.\\" Pincai"},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"我看古人诗里也有把自己写在里面，就是这个意思。」王恂方才恍然。又说了一会闲话，仲清等告辞，子玉等送到门口，仲清道：「何不同出去看看雪景？」元茂听了，就高兴愿去。子玉道：「先生今日尚未全好，我们须在家伺候，改日再奉陪罢。」元茂撅了嘴不言语。仲清等告辞而去，子玉送出大门，进来与聘才、元茂又谈了一会诗，忽又","en":"seen in the poems of the ancients that they sometimes write themselves into the poem. It was that intention.\\" Wang Xun suddenly understood. After more idle conversation, Zhongqing and Wang Xun said their farewells. Ziyu and the others escorted them to the door. Zhongqing suggested, \\"Why not come out with us to see the snow scenery?\\" Yuanmao, hearing this, was quite eager"},{"paragraph":30,"mentions":3,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"再说仲清、王恂由南小街走到下洼子眺望，只见白茫茫一片，也辨不出田原路径，远远望见徐子云的怡园，琪树参差，烟岚回合，重重的层楼耀目，隐隐的高阁凌云。望了一会，只见对面一辆车来，车沿上坐的看见了，先跳了下来，随后看是一个相公，也要下车。仲清等连忙止住，那相公便挪出身子","en":"To return to Zhongqing and Wang Xun: they walked out of South Small Street to the Low Hollow to take in the view. All was a vast expanse of white; fields and paths were indistinguishable. Far off they could see Xu Ziyun's Garden of Contentment, with its jadeite trees rising in uneven lines,"},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":3,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"揖竟成床笫稳，风波得与坦途同。\\n谁言青海填难满，不信蓬山路未通。\\n都说他运用灵妙，不着一死句，所以胜于他人。」王恂道：「你的呢？」春喜道」我的不好，也记不得了。」仲清道：「只怕你是第八了。」春喜嘻嘻的笑道：「被你一猜就猜着。」王恂道：「这难怪他，他方十四岁，若教他学上两年，怕赶不上他们？」春喜道：「我原不肯做的，他们定要我做。今日大家的诗，都也没有什么好，但就蕊","en":"his use of figures was wonderfully inspired, without a single flat line, which is why he surpassed the others.\\" Wang Xun asked, \\"And yours?\\" Chunxi said, \\"Mine was not good; I cannot remember it.\\" Zhongqing teased, \\"I imagine you came eighth.\\" Chunxi laughed sheepishly, \\"You guessed it on the first try.\\" Wang Xun reasoned, \\"No wonder; he is only fourteen years old. If"},{"paragraph":33,"mentions":2,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"朱，目光眉彩觉有凌云之气，举止大雅，气象不凡。看他年纪，不过二十余岁的光景，带了四个相公，倚着楼窗而望。仲清、王恂暗暗吃惊：看他这品貌，足可与庾香匹敌，真是人中鸾凤。听他口音，也像江宁人，却又有些扬州话在里头。再看那四个相公，却非名下青钱，不过花中凡艳。王恂认得一个是蓉官，那三个都不认得，因问春喜。春喜道：「穿染貂的是玉美，穿倭刀的是四喜，穿水獭的是全福。都是剑","en":"had four young performers in his company, and was leaning against the balcony window gazing out. Zhongqing and Wang Xun were privately astonished. Looking at his appearance and bearing, he was fully a match for Yuxiang—truly a phoenix among men. From his accent, he seemed to be from Jiangning, yet there was also something of a Yangzhou intonation mixed in. Looking at"},{"paragraph":35,"mentions":3,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"仲清低低对王恂说道：「此人议论虽偏，但他别有会心，不肯随人俯仰之意已见。且其胸中必多积忿，故不喜和平而喜激越。丝声本哀，说胡琴非淫声，此却破俗之论，从没有人听得出来的。我看此人恰是我辈，决非庸庸碌碌的人，几时倒要访他一访。」王恂道：「听其语言，观其气度，已可得其大","en":"Zhongqing said quietly to Wang Xun, \\"This man's views are partial, yet he has his own private understanding. His unwillingness to follow the common herd is already evident. Moreover his chest must hold much accumulated resentment, which is why he dislikes the peaceful and prefers the"}],"5":[{"paragraph":38,"mentions":1,"tokens":["庸庵"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"元茂道：「我是不去的，我又不是同乡。」子玉道：「那不要紧，一来是王母舅单请我们的，又不与他们坐在一处；二来也是庸庵的意思，你若不去，就大家无趣了。」聘才笑道：「若果如此，那一天可以见着琴官的戏了。」子玉一笑，道：「我还有一点事。」说罢进去了。晚间李性全回来，进门时已见满堂灯彩，照耀辉煌。望见大厅上，梅学士与夫人及子玉，围着一群仆妇，在神像前上供。","en":"matter. First, Uncle Wang has invited us specifically, and we will not be seated with the others; second, it is also Yong'an's wish. If you do not go, it will be awkward for everyone.\\" Pincai smiled and said: \\"If that is the case, that day we should be able to watch Qinguan perform in the opera!\\" Ziyu smiled and said: \\"There is still something else I must attend to.\\" And he"}],"6":[{"paragraph":5,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"陆夫人就生了王恂的少奶奶一个，名叫佩秋，生得德容兼备，爱若掌珠，十八岁嫁与王家去了。还有个白头的大姑娘，是不能嫁人的，新年已二十九岁。嗣徽二十六，嗣元二十四，这两个废物，都已娶了亲。嗣徽娶的沈氏，是国子监司业沈恭之女，名字叫做芸姑。生得齐齐整整，伶俐聪明，嫁了过来，","en":"Madam Lu had borne but one child of her own—Wang Xun's wife. Named Peiqiu, she was a paragon of virtue and beauty, cherished like a precious pearl, and had been married into the Wang household at eighteen. There was also the eldest daughter, her hair prematurely white, destined to remain unwed; this New"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":2,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"了。子玉尚是年轻，被这些老前辈，你一句我一句的赞，倒赞得他很不好意思。沈大人放了手，子玉等告退，来至东边楼上，王恂、颜仲清便迎上来，都作揖道：「我们已等久了，怎么这时候才来？」子玉道：「今日起迟了些，那孙大哥、孙二哥还没有来么？」王恂道：「也该快来了。」王、颜二人又与聘才、元茂款接了一番。只见对面楼上来了几个，先是右待郎的少君刘文泽做主，请了史给事的少君史南湘、","en":"finally released him, Ziyu and his companions excused themselves and ascended to the eastern upper floor. There, Wang Xun and Yan Zhongqing hurried to greet them, bowing and saying, \\"We have waited endlessly—how is it you've only just arrived?\\" Ziyu replied, \\"I rose a little late today. Have Elder Brother Sun and Second Brother Sun not yet arrived?\\" Wang Xun answered, \\"They"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":3,"tokens":["王恂","庸庵"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"当下王恂、仲清引了子玉过去，与他们一一见了，彼此都是年谊世交，各叙了些仰慕之意。刘文泽道：「庸庵，你请客怎么不通知我一声。就是你请这二位生客，我们在一处也很好，何必又要另坐在那边。」王恂笑道：「不是我定要与你们分开，庾香是不用说的，就是这李、魏二位长兄，也是","en":"Wang Xun and Zhongqing guided Ziyu over, facilitating introductions. Bound by examination-year ties and family connections, they exchanged warm pleasantries. Liu Wenze said, \\"Yong'an, when arranging this banquet, why didn't you inform me? Even these two guest-friends"},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":3,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"还胜如《汉书》下酒呢。」史南湘道：「怕什么？搬过来，搬过来！正席上有许多老前辈在那里，巴老三想必也不动手的。」王恂只得叫将那边两桌，就搬过这边，一同坐下，南湘道：「庾香，你今日就看见好戏好人了，你才信我不是言过其实呢。」子玉笑道：「你定的第一，我已经请教过了。」南湘道：「何如，可赏识得不错？」子玉笑而不言。王恂道；「你几时见过的？」子玉道：「你好记性，那天还问你","en":"With so many venerable elders at the main tables, Old Third Ba won't dare start anything.\\" Left with no choice, Wang Xun ordered the two tables moved over, and everyone sat together. Nanxiang turned to Ziyu, \\"Today you will witness magnificent opera and exquisite performers—then you will believe I was not exaggerating.\\" Ziyu smiled, \\"You named your foremost one; I have"},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"才、巴霖、张仲雨坐了一席；史南湘、颜仲清、高品拉了子玉过来，坐了一席；聘才、元茂坐了一席；嗣徽、嗣元坐了一席，王恂只好两席轮流作陪。孙嗣徽又之乎者也的闹了一会，问了魏、李二位姓名、籍贯。一面就摆上菜喝酒。高品见嗣徽的脸上疙瘩更多了好些，喝了几杯酒，那个红鼻子如经霜辣子，通红光亮。","en":"pulled Ziyu to a second; Pincai and Yuanmao took a third; leaving Sihui and Siyuan isolated at the fourth, with Wang Xun moving between tables to act as host. Sun Sihui, adopting his pedantic \\"the Master says\\" persona, began interrogating Wei and Li about their names and native places. Dishes were served, and wine flowed. Gao Pin noted that the pimples on Sihui's face"},{"paragraph":36,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"拉住吃了饭，又听了他们几出戏，才放我走，还是急急的赶出来的。」子玉同了元茂、聘才告辞，诸人都送到楼门口，文泽、王恂、仲清送下楼来。","en":"Yuanmao and Pincai, bid their farewells; the entire group accompanied them to the staircase landing, with Wenze, Wang Xun, and Zhongqing escorting them all the way downstairs."},{"paragraph":37,"mentions":2,"tokens":["庸庵","王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"文泽对子玉道：「初九日弟备小酌，屈吾兄一叙，作个清谈雅集。人不多，就是竹君、剑潭、庸庵、卓然几位，吾兄断不可推辞。」子玉应允，又谢了。王恂、聘才、元茂也同道了谢，一径先回。那些人又谈了一会，也各散去。不知后事如何，且听下回分解。","en":"us with a visit—a refined discourse and elegant assembly. It will be an intimate group: just Zhujun, Jiantan, Yong'an, Zhuoran, and a few others. Elder Brother must absolutely not decline.\\" Ziyu agreed, expressing his deep gratitude. Wang Xun, Pincai, and Yuanmao offered their thanks in turn before departing. The remaining guests lingered in conversation for a while"}],"7":[{"paragraph":3,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王庸庵"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一季，而人之颜色可以十年。惟人胜于花，则爱人之心，自然比爱花更当胜些。谁想天下人的眼界，竟能相同。我意史竹君、王庸庵等必有言过其实之处，如今看来，真还刻划不到，想必那些能诗能画之说，也是的确无疑了。」便又想：「今日虽然见了琴官的戏，也未能稍通款曲，此后相逢，不知又在何日？但看他今日双波频注，似乎倒有缱纟卷之意。前此在车内掀帘凝望，又似非以陌上相逢看待，这也不知何故","en":"Who would have thought the eyes of the world could be so perfectly aligned? I had assumed that Shi Zhujun, Wang Yong'an, and the others were exaggerating, but now I see their descriptions actually fell short. Their claims about his poetic and painting talents must also be unequivocally true.\\" He then thought: \\"Although I saw Qinguan perform today, I had no chance to make"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":2,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"且说文泽所请的容颜仲清、王恂、史南湘已经到了，随后梅子玉、高品一同到门。家人引着走过大厅，到了花厅之旁垂花门进去，系石子砌成的一条甬道，两边都是太湖石迭成高高低低的假山，衬着参参差差的寒树。远远望去，却也有台有亭，布置得十分幽雅。转了两三个弯，过了一座石桥，甬路旁是一色的，都是","en":"At Wenze's residence, the invited guests—Yan Zhongqing, Wang Xun, and Shi Nanxiang—had already arrived, followed shortly by Mei Ziyu and Gao Pin at the gate. A servant guided them past the main hall, through a flowered gate beside the reception hall, and onto a pebble-paved path. On either side, irregular artificial"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":2,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"了，你喝三杯。」文泽道：「你说。」南湘道：「如果对得好，我们还要公贺一杯。」高品笑道：「卯金面是金」。何如？」王恂道：「卯金对子玉却是绝对。」南湘道：「就是「面是金」欠典切些。」高品道：「典虽不典，切却甚切。你没有见过中秋节，摊子摆的兔儿爷脸上，都是金的么？」说得哄堂大笑起来，文泽道：「你这刻薄鬼，连盟弟都骂起来了。」高品道：「箭在弦上，不得不发。」主人只得照数","en":"good, we must all drink a toast.\\" Gao Pin smiled and recited, \\"'Maojin's face is gold' (卯金面是金). How is that?\\" Wang Xun said, \\"'Maojin' (卯金) against 'Ziyu' (子玉) is an absolute match.\\" Nanxiang critiqued, \\"It's just that 'face is gold' lacks a bit of classical elegance.\\" Gao Pin defended, \\"It may not be classical, but it is highly apt. Haven't you seen the Rabbit God figurines"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":2,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"文泽道「双」字，仲清对「孤」字，高品对「八」，字子玉对「九」字，王恂道：「不好了，顺着数儿就是十罢。」南湘道：「是了，我这个字倒有些难下，也罢，对「三」字罢。」文泽道「辇」宇。南湘道：「我晓得一定是这句诗。」子玉抢对了一个「琴」字，王恂对了「车」字，南湘对了「船」字，只有高品未对。文泽催道：「再迟要罚酒了。」高品笑了","en":"'双' (Double/Pair): Zhongqing matched '孤' (Solitary), Gao Pin matched '八' (Eight), Ziyu matched '九' (Nine), and Wang Xun lamented, \\"Oh no, I suppose I must follow the sequence with '十' (Ten).\\" Nanxiang pondered, \\"That's right, my character is a bit tricky to place. Very well, I'll match '三' (Three).\\" Finally, Wenze set '辇' (Imperial Carriage). Nanxiang exclaimed, \\"I know"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":3,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"《送襄垣王君归别墅》的诗？我记性真坏极了，该打，该打！」南湘道：「幸亏你还记得娘家，不然总要罚十杯酒的。」再看王恂对的是「十乌日里驭车回」。王恂道：「我的对坏了。」文泽道：「就是十乌二字不连。」高品道：「前舟又错了，日中有乌，尧时十日并出，难道不是十乌么？」文泽道：「这却强词夺理，到底勉强些。」于是公论推子玉第一、南湘第二、仲清第三、王恂第四、高品居末，就依名次","en":"teased, \\"Luckily you remembered where it came from, otherwise you'd be fined ten cups.\\" Finally, they looked at Wang Xun's match: 'Ten ravens in the sun drive the carriage returning. (十乌日里驭车回)' Wang Xun admitted, \\"My match is ruined.\\" Wenze noted, \\"It's just that the 'ten ravens' don't connect.\\" Gao Pin argued, \\"Qianzhou, you are in the wrong again. The sun contains the"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"：「把我的对句，倒转来念，你说好不好？」子玉同玉恂、文泽暗暗的念了一遍，都不觉鼓掌大笑起来，子玉笑得伏在桌上，王恂笑得靠着南湘，引得南湘、仲清又笑了一阵。","en":"\\"No additions, then.\\" Gao Pin proposed, \\"Read my matching line backward — 前舟靠后露鸡八 — how does it sound?\\" Ziyu, Wang Xun, and Wenze silently read it to themselves, and soon found themselves clapping and roaring with laughter. Ziyu laughed so hard he collapsed onto the table, while Wang Xun leaned heavily against Nanxiang, setting off another wave of laughter from Nanxiang"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":8,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"」随顺手一个个豁完，却也有输有赢。各饮毕，子玉作令官，一个个出了四字，是「费影收肠」。南湘对的是「惊声放胆」，王恂是「融香浣乳」，文泽是「翻么小舌」，仲清是「多仙散发」，独高品对得别致，是「除伊放粪」，大家看了已经发笑。子玉又出了一个「台」字，南湘道：「这句好生。」沉吟了一会，对了「馆」字，王恂对「屋」，文泽对「榭」，仲清对「岛」，高品道：「我住在宏济寺里，就对","en":"match: '费影收肠' (expend, shadow, withdraw, sorrow). Nanxiang matched '惊声放胆' (startle, sound, release, courage); Wang Xun matched '融香浣乳' (melt, fragrance, wash, milk); Wenze matched '翻么小舌' (flip, tiny-note, small, tongue); Zhongqing matched '多仙散发' (many, immortals, loosened, hair); while Gao Pin, as distinctive as ever, offered '除伊放粪' (remove, Yi, release, excrement)—already"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"：「我的「鸟」与「雀」总是一样，你的「鸟」字若换了「雀」字不好么？」文泽想了一想，却也有理。子玉就只取了仲清、王恂两副对句，其余文泽、高品罚了酒。","en":"an improvement?\\" Wenze considered this and conceded the point. Ultimately, Ziyu accepted only Zhongqing's and Wang Xun's matching lines as passing; Wenze and Gao Pin were penalized with wine."},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":4,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"以下轮着南湘出令，出了一个「春」字，文泽对「夏」字，高品对「正」字。王恂道：「平对平使得么？」众人道：「使得，已经对过了。」王恂道「晨」字，仲清是「秋」字，子玉是「冬」字。南湘又出「月」字。高品道：「竹君的心思与众不同，这两字必定不连的，我对「阳」字。」王恂对「霜」，子玉对「雪」，仲清对「空」。文泽道：「管他连不连，我们","en":"He presented the character '春' (spring): Wenze matched '夏' (summer), and Gao Pin matched '正' (upright/primary). Wang Xun questioned, \\"Can a level-tone character be matched with another level-tone?\\" The group agreed, \\"Certainly—it has been done before.\\" Wang Xun matched '晨' (morning/dawn), Zhongqing matched '秋' (autumn), and Ziyu matched '冬' (winter). Nanxiang then offered"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「兔」字。你们对罢。」王恂道：「貉」字。」仲清道：「鹰能制兔，我对「鹰」字。」子玉道：「骑着驴子放鹰，想来是没有的，且借他来对对，就是「驴」字。」文泽道：","en":"''兔' (rabbit). Match it, all of you.' Wang Xun offered '貉' (badger). Zhongqing reasoned, 'The eagle masters the rabbit—I match '鹰' (eagle).' Ziyu pondered, 'A donkey-rider flying a hawk is likely unheard of, but I'll borrow it for the match—'驴' (donkey).' Wenze said:"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":1,"tokens":["庸庵"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"堆乌」，「乌」字原也借对得好。然凭文取之，究不若剑潭的「秋空一盘鹰」浑脱，还该让他第一。庾香的「冬雪一敲驴」，庸庵的「晨霜一丰貂」，都对得很工。最不好的是卓然的「正阳一伏龟」，这「正阳」二字如何加得上？」高品笑问文泽道：「贵处是那里？」","en":"(秋空一盘鹰)'—so pure and unrestrained; it deserves first place. Yuxiang's 'Winter snow one-knock donkey (冬雪一敲驴)' and Yong'an's 'Morning frost one-lush sable (晨霜一丰貂)' are both skillfully matched. The worst is Zhuoran's 'Upright-sun one-prostrate tortoise. (正阳一伏龟)' How can 'upright sun' (zheng yang) possibly apply to a tortoise?\\" Gao Pin laughed and asked Wenze, \\"Where exactly"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"出的对是「丝发白日如新」六字，高品属的是「签毛朱天入长」。子玉对的是「镜颜华年对好。」南湘是「竹唇朱声吹慢。」王恂是「剪衣乌时试拂」。文泽是「草麻黄朝起视」。仲清写出上联是「白发如丝日日新」。","en":"complexion, glorious, year, face, good). Nanxiang matched: '竹唇朱声吹慢' (bamboo, lip, crimson, sound, blow, slow). Wang Xun matched: '剪衣乌时试拂' (scissors, garment, raven, time, try, brush). Wenze matched: '草麻黄朝起视' (grass, hemp, yellow, morning, rise, gaze). Zhongqing wrote the opening line: 'White hair like silk threads—renewing day by day. (白发如丝日日新)'"},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"高品道：「然则我以「天」对「日」，比庾香的更好，为什么又不取我的呢？」仲清道：「等我写出来，你讲给我听。」先写王恂的是「乌衣试剪时时拂」。众人道：「这句也自然得很。」仲清道：「这回考试，除了卓然，原是一榜尽赐及第的。」高品笑道：「留心眼睛，我这本卷子是打不得的。」仲清写出看时，是「朱毛入笠天天长」。仲清用笔叉了几叉，大家看了笑得不亦乐乎。南湘忍着笑道：「他这用的","en":"than Yuxiang's—why was my submission ignored?\\" Zhongqing replied, \\"Write it out and explain it.\\" He first wrote Wang Xun's: 'Raven-black robes, newly cut and tried on, brushed smooth time after time. (乌衣试剪时时拂)' The group agreed, \\"This line also flows quite naturally.\\" Zhongqing concluded, \\"In this round, aside from Zhuoran, everyone else passes.\\" Gao Pin laughed, \\"Watch"},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"是国王建都之所。红毛国王进了这城，住了两日觉得浑身肿胀，一天长似一天起来。想来用的这个古典了。」说着放声大笑。王恂似信不信的问道：「后来呢？」","en":"growing larger day by day.\\" Nanxiang claimed this was the intended allusion, bursting into laughter as he spoke. Wang Xun, half-believing, asked, \\"What happened next?\\""},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"南湘笑道：「这古典甚长，只说够他对的就是了。」文泽问道：「在什么书上？」仲清道：「《史氏外编》。」王恂、文泽才明白过来，复又笑声大作。高品道：「你们混说乱道，难道《四子书》都记不得？这就是《孟子》所说一毛不拔、追豚入笠之扬朱，所以谓之「朱毛入笠」。这才算得用古入化呢。」仲清道：「那「天天长」三字怎讲？」高品道：「你这试官真是胡涂，他既是一毛不拔，自然","en":"serve the match.\\" Wenze asked, \\"In what book is this recorded?\\" Zhongqing replied, \\"Outer Compilation of Mr. Shi.\\" Wang Xun and Wenze finally understood, breaking into fresh peals of laughter. Gao Pin retorted, \\"You're all spouting nonsense—haven't you memorized *The Four Books*? This comes directly from Mencius's description of Yang Zhu—'who would not pull out a single hair'—chasing"},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"然后王恂作令官，出的是「香尽南人消国美。」文泽对的是」曲多东妓谱山名」。仲清对的是「赋难东士炼都学」。高品对的是「斗长西圣驾方齐」。","en":"Wang Xun then took the mantle of game-master, presenting the opening line: 'Fragrance exhausted, Southern person fades—the beautiful country. (香尽南人消国美)' Wenze matched: 'Many tunes, Eastern entertainers compose mountain-names. (曲多东妓谱山名)' Zhongqing matched: 'Rhapsody"},{"paragraph":31,"mentions":2,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「此番卓然大概要取第一了，字字对得很稳。」子玉对的是「情深西旦感昆名」。南湘的是」图多西士画名园」。一一对毕，王恂写出出句，是「香销南国美人尽」。文泽对的是「曲谱东山名妓多。」仲清是「赋炼东都学士难」。高品是「斗驾西方齐圣长」。子玉是「情感西昆名旦深」。南湘是「图画西园名士多。」王恂道：「这第一不消说是竹君了。庾香「名旦」二字不典，不及剑潭的浑成，只怕第二是他。","en":"moves Kun, fame.' Nanxiang matched: 'Many paintings, Western scholars, paint famous gardens.' As they finished, Wang Xun revealed the opening line: 'Fragrance fades in the Southern kingdom—the beauties are all gone. (香销南国美人尽)' Wenze's assembled match: 'Tunes composed of Eastern Mountain—many famous courtesans. (曲谱东山名妓多)' Zhongqing's: 'Rhapsodies forged in the Eastern Capital—difficult"},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"只说我通关节中的了。」仲清道：「他这典故，出在东土大唐。」高品道：「剑潭是主考至亲，倒应回避，不许乱说。」原来王恂却没有看过《西游记》，只管呆呆的看着粉板。南湘正在喝酒，忽见高品用手搭着凉篷。","en":"\\"Jiantan is a close kinsman of the chief examiner—he should recuse himself and remain silent.\\" It transpired that Wang Xun had never read *Journey to the West*, leaving him staring blankly at the writing-board. Nanxiang was mid-drink when he noticed Gao Pin shading his eyes with his hand like a sun-visor,"},{"paragraph":33,"mentions":3,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"向王恂一望，忍不住笑将出来，酒咽不及喷了出来，还咳嗽不已，引得合席都笑。南湘向王恂道：「等我笑完了，说《西游记》给你听。」文泽接着说道：「就是齐天大圣，送唐僧往西天取经的典故。」王恂恍然大悟道：「岂有此理，就是如此，那「斗驾」及「长」字总连不上。」南湘笑道","en":"glancing toward Wang Xun. Unable to suppress his mirth, Nanxiang choked on his wine, coughing and spluttering, setting the entire table off. Catching his breath, Nanxiang told Wang Xun, \\"Let me finish laughing, and then I'll tell you about *Journey to the West*.\\" Wenze stepped"},{"paragraph":35,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"？若不说明。我们就罢考了。」高品被他猜着，只得笑嘻嘻的点点头。子玉对了「卓言贯」三字，南湘对了「品阳长」三字，王恂对了「一龄庆」三字，文泽对了「品奸动」三字，仲清对了「管毫定」三字。高品又一连出了四字是「九喜气凤」。","en":"nod. Ziyu matched with three characters: '卓言贯' (Zhuo-speech-penetrating); Nanxiang matched: '品阳长' (Pin-sun-long); Wang Xun matched: '一龄庆' (One-year-celebrate); Wenze matched: '品奸动' (Pin, intercourse, move); Zhongqing matched: '管毫定' (Tube-fine hair-determined). Gao Pin then fired off four more characters: '九喜气凤' (nine, joy, spirit, phoenix)."},{"paragraph":36,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"仲清道：「这倒不是拆字的，我就对「一高标兔」。」文泽道：「我就对「一欢心鸡」。」王恂道：「我对「第长年龟」。」子玉对了「超元精人」，南湘对了「一精神龙。」高品背着人写了上联，搁着笔，把大众的看了一回，鼻子里笑了一笑，就用纸蘸着酒，把粉板上的字一齐擦了。众人都诧异道：","en":"character-decomposition. I'll match '一高标兔' (one-high-mark-rabbit).\\" Wenze followed, \\"I'll match '一欢心鸡' (one-joy-heart-rooster).\\" Wang Xun added, \\"I'll match '第长年龟' (rank-long-year-tortoise).\\" Ziyu matched: '超元精人' (surpassing-primal-refined-person). Nanxiang matched: '一精神龙' (one-spirit-dragon). Gao Pin turned his back, wrote out his opening line, set down his brush, and inspected everyone's"},{"paragraph":37,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"然，这「卓贯元精」，因他受不住的原故。」仲清道：「我的是「兔毫一管定高标」，必定因「兔高」二字，犯了他的讳。」王恂道：「我记得是龟龄第一庆长年。」南湘道：「好对，好对，第一定了，这又为什么？」文泽道：「你不见他巍然首座么。」南湘点点头，道：「我的对更明明指着他了。」众人问是为什么？南湘道：「龙阳一品长精神。」文泽道：「我的更说穿了，是「鸡奸一品动欢心。」这也奇怪","en":"highest standard (gao biao)'—surely rejected because the characters 'rabbit' (兔) and 'high' (高) offended him.\\" Wang Xun remembered, \\"Mine was 'Tortoise longevity, foremost of all, celebrating the long years. (龟龄第一庆长年)'\\" Nanxiang praised, \\"An excellent match, clearly first place—so why was it rejected?\\" Wenze pointed out, \\"Don't you see him sitting up there in lofty first"}],"9":[{"paragraph":3,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一队香车秀撵过来，也都开着帘子，丫鬟仆妇坐在车沿上，点着九合沉速香。那些奶奶们，在大玻璃窗内，左顾右盼。文泽、王恂等也各留神凝视，有好看的，有不好看的，但华妆艳服，灯光之下，也总加了几个成色。四人走路也不能齐集，有些参前落后起来，约过了七八辆后，又有了几辆接上前队，便挤住了走不开。","en":"edges, burning superior incense, while the ladies inside gazed left and right through large glass windows. Wenze, Wang Xun, and the others watched attentively. Though they varied in beauty, the women's festive dress and jewels under the lamplight added radiant layers of color. As the four friends walked, they could not stay abreast, with some falling ahead and others lingering"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":2,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"文泽扯扯王恂的衣服，低低的说道：「你看似为着庾香，要显显他的莲瓣。」王恂点头。仲清又在文泽后面说道：「焉知他不是为着你？」文泽笑道：「不像。」又低低的叫道：「庾香，那《施公案》有什么好看，你尽望着那几对灯。」子玉回转脸来，却与那少妇相对，见那少妇还在玻璃窗内看他","en":"Wenze tugged at Wang Xun's sleeve and murmured softly: \\"Look, it seems she is taken with Yuxiang and wishes to show off her lotus feet.\\" Wang Xun nodded. Zhongqing, standing behind Wenze, added: \\"How do you know it is not you she fancies?\\" Wenze laughed: \\"I do not think so.\\""},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"嘻嘻笑笑，两袖如狂蝶穿花，一身如惊蛇出草。他也不顾人好让不好让，直拥过来。内中一个想是大脚的，一脚踏来，踏着了王恂靴头。","en":"give way and came barging straight through. One of them, apparently with natural feet, planted a foot squarely on Wang Xun's boot."},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":4,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"王恂一只新皂靴黑了半边，被他踏得很疼，说不出来，觉得这一脚就有三十多斤气力。王恂急忙让开。又见一个三十几岁一个妇人，身量生得很高，穿着双高底鞋，眼望着灯。脚下踏着了一块砖，身子一歪，几乎栽倒，恰恰碰着子玉，他就把子玉的胸前一把揪牢，才站稳了。子玉倒几乎跌","en":"Wang Xun's new black boot had its side smudged, and his foot was trodden on with considerable force. He reckoned the blow carried at least thirty catties of weight, but he could say nothing and quickly stepped aside. Then he saw a woman of some thirty years,"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":3,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"的家人上来请安，说：「少爷们何不到里边逛逛？」文泽即问他主人，那人说道：「我们老爷在外赴席未回，萧老爷在家。」王恂道：「我们猜了几个灯谜。再进去不迟。」于是同看第一个是：「双栖稳宿无烦恼，认得卢家玳瑁梁。」下注《礼记》一句。子玉正在思索，只听得王恂问仲清道：「这可是知其能安，燕而不乱也？」仲清道：「只怕是的。」再看第二个是：「任他万水千山远，雁帛鱼书总得来。」下","en":"the host, and the man replied: \\"Our master is out at a dinner and has not returned, but Master Xiao is at home.\\" Wang Xun said: \\"Let us guess a few lantern riddles first and then go in. There is no hurry.\\" So they all looked at the first riddle: 'Roosting together, stable and undisturbed, recognizing the Lu family's tortoiseshell rafters.' Below was a notation indicating"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"文泽道：「或者是《休洗红》。那第三联是「长夜迢遥闻断漏，中年陶写漫劳神。」必是《五更钟》、《莫愁乐》。」王恂道：","en":"dripping; in middle age I pour out my heart and yet labor in vain', must be 'Fifth-Watch Bell' and 'Mochou's Joy'.\\" Wang Xun said:"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":2,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"王恂道：「那打唐诗一句的，不要是「殷子正书空」？」文泽道：「且报一报试试。」大家到园门口，一个个报去，里头都答应了「是」，就是末后一个没有猜着。王恂道：「白也诗无敌。」里头也答应了「是」。只见一人又拿了一盏灯出来，将先挂的那盏灯换下。见屏门后头走了出一个","en":"Wang Xun said: \\"The one on the Tang poetry line, could it not be 'Yin Zi writing in the air'?\\" Wenze replied: \\"Let us go and try submitting it.\\" Everyone went to the garden gate and reported their answers one by one. From inside came \\"Correct\\" for each one, until"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"见文泽、仲清、王恂三人一齐迎上前来，称呼他为静宜先生。那人与三人见了礼，又向子玉作了个揖，子玉连忙还礼。","en":"Wenze, Zhongqing, and Wang Xun all stepped forward at once to greet him, addressing him as Master Jingyi. The man exchanged courtesies with the three, then bowed to Ziyu, who hastened to return the salutation."},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"了。峭壁之下，一带雕窗细格的五间卷棚、檐下挂着一色的二十多盏西番莲洋琉璃灯。次贤让进屋内，分宾主坐下。与文泽、王恂、仲清都是认识的，单与子玉叙了些倾心仰慕的话。子玉见他出言有体，举止不凡，也知道是个名士，便也颇为浃洽。谈了一会，用过了茶，有书童从里间出来，送出一分一分的灯谜彩来，摆在桌上，是些湖笔，徽墨、端砚、雅扇之类，惟有子玉所猜的「落花人独立，微雨燕双飞」的","en":"fragrant-lotus type. Cixian invited them inside, and guest and host took their seats. He was acquainted with Wenze, Wang Xun, and Zhongqing, and had only an exchange of heartfelt admiration to make with Ziyu. Ziyu, seeing his speech proper and his bearing extraordinary, knew this was a man of distinction, and the two found themselves thoroughly congenial. After some conversation"},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":1,"tokens":["庸庵"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"我同高卓然、张仲雨，带了王静芳、李佩仙在酒楼上饮了一天，也不晓得有多少，他们都醉得先走了。我送静芳回去，顺路到庸庵家，问知出外逛灯，我也去逛灯。也不知赶车的什么意思，就拉我到这里，园门口的人说你们在里面赏灯，就扶了我进来。」一面说，就从怀里掏出一团灯谜字条，大家看时：一个是「春风一曲费缠头」，一个是「马儿快快随」，都打戏名，一个是《赏秋》，一个是《赶车》。宝珠对","en":"winehouse. I do not know how much it was; they all got drunk and left before me. I saw Jingfang home, then dropped by Yong'an's place on the way. Learning he had gone out to see the lanterns, I went too. I do not know what the carriage-driver was thinking, but he just pulled me here. The people at the garden gate said you were inside viewing the lanterns, so they helped me"},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":3,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"以后你们这一班，见我们不许请安，只许称号，如违了要罚的。」宝珠道：「这倒与度香、静宜一样脾气，就是这样便了。」王恂道：「庾香，你看这瑶卿，与你去年戏园所见的怎样？这真伪可能相混么？」子玉笑道：「瓦砾岂可僭称珠玉？那个名字，叫他改了才好。」宝珠不解，便问王恂，王恂就将去年所见保珠，子玉听错的话说了，宝珠嫣然而笑。","en":"will be penalized.\\" Baozhu said: \\"This is exactly the same disposition as Duxiang and Jingyi, so it shall be.\\" Wang Xun said: \\"Yuxiang, look at this Yaoqing. How does he compare to what you saw at the theater last year? Could the real and the fake possibly be confused?\\" Ziyu laughed: \\"Can rubble and stone presume to the name of pearl and jade? That person's name should"},{"paragraph":30,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"于是漱芳拉了王恂下棋，文泽观局。子玉同宝珠看那墨兰，赞不绝口；南湘、仲清、次贤同坐在醉翁床闲话。南湘道：「静宜兄，还记得「只有酒狂名下士，醉吟许上岳阳楼」佳句否？」","en":"Thereupon Shufang drew Wang Xun into a game of chess while Wenze looked on. Ziyu and Baozhu admired the ink-painted orchid, praising it without end. Nanxiang, Zhongqing, and Cixian sat together on the Drunken-Scholar's Couch in easy conversation. Nanxiang said: \\"Brother Jingyi, do"},{"paragraph":35,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"明人了，可借不知是谁？」文泽道：「这两封书，都是静宜先生的手笔么？」次贤道：「那封原书，是度香的手笔。」说着，王恂已经下完了棋，倒输了漱芳三子。子玉因夜色已深，随同南湘等告辞；子玉并说度香来园，先为致意，改日专诚再来的话，次贤答应着，送出各人上车而散。再听下回分解。","en":"letters written in Master Jingyi's hand?\\" Cixian replied: \\"The original letter is in Duxiang's hand.\\" As he spoke, Wang Xun had already finished his chess game, having lost three stones to Shufang. Ziyu, the night being already deep, took his leave together with Nanxiang and the others. Ziyu also conveyed that when Duxiang returned to the garden he would first pay his respects,"}],"10":[{"paragraph":9,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"次日，子云即去拜望子玉，彼此道了些景仰渴想的话，就约定于十九日晚间一叙。出来顺道到王恂、刘文泽、史南湘等处看望，俱未晤见。回来想道：「这梅庾香果然名不虚传，玉侬又属意于他，将来见了面，不消说是他的人了。」又想这：「玉侬的脾气，差不多的人都猜摸不着，倘或一言不合，就可以决绝的。即使梅庾香是个多情人，也未必能像我这样体贴。","en":"meet for an intimate dinner on the evening of the nineteenth. On his way back, Ziyun stopped at the residences of Wang Xun, Liu Wenze, and Shi Nanxiang to pay courtesy visits, but found none of them at home. Returning to his own residence, he reflected: \\"This Mei Yuxiang is indeed everything his stellar reputation suggests. Yunong is already deeply drawn to him, and once"}],"12":[{"paragraph":20,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"知道他这金屋中，前面要开棚子，后面要开窑子。」仲清大笑。春航道：「你搁起那贫嘴。」三人谈笑了半日，仲清回去，与王恂说起春航与他有亲，就是去年酒楼题词的少年，果然才貌双全，但志愿太奢，流而忘返。迟了几日，又去看望春航，一连几次，总未晤及。春航竟闹得不堪回首。仲清怜其才，欲成全他，闻他窘得不堪，便张罗了二百两银子，写了一封书，说闻其旅况不佳，少助买花之费，原是试他的","en":"that sharp tongue of yours.\\" The three talked and laughed for half a day; then Zhongqing returned home and told Wang Xun that Chunhang was a kinsman of his, and also the very young man who had written the lyric in the wine house last year — truly possessed of both talent and looks, but with ambitions too lavish and pleasures that had carried him off. A few days later he"},{"paragraph":40,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"来人回去，将画送上，仲清与王恂同看，见这两首诗虽是强词夺理，但其志可见，未免可惜了一番。仲清原想把这两首诗去感化他，谁想倒激怒了他。又听来人说，他光景更为狼狈。","en":"The messenger returned and presented the painting. Zhongqing and Wang Xun read it together. The two quatrains, though forced in their argument, revealed something of their author's spirit — and they could not help feeling a renewed pity for the man. Zhongqing had originally intended his two poems to reform Chunhang; who would"},{"paragraph":41,"mentions":3,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"据他的跟班讲，今日已断了炊，不能举火。仲清与王恂皆为叹息，仲清道：「这样看来，此人真是「我心匪石，不可转矣。」奈何！奈何！」王恂道：「你前日送他二百金，不上半月，竟已化为乌有。这人这样行为，就再送给他二百金，也是无济于事。除非要将徐度香的家私分一半与他，才够他挥霍。但人到断炊，也不成件事了。依我想","en":"manservant's account, that very day the kitchen fire had gone out, and there was nothing to cook. Zhongqing and Wang Xun both sighed. Zhongqing said: \\"From the look of things, this man is truly like the saying: 'My heart is not a stone — it cannot be turned.' What can be done? What can be done?\\" Wang Xun said: \\"You sent him two hundred taels the other day; in less than"}],"13":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说仲清激怒春航之后，即将王恂所备之百金送至高品处，为春航薪水之费。春航闷坐了两日，米煤催逼，告贷无门。经高品款留，只得暂时寄食。","en":"After Zhongqing had provoked Chunhang into anger, he sent the hundred taels that Wang Xun had prepared to Gao Pin, to cover Chunhang's daily expenses of firewood and food. Chunhang sat brooding for two days; pressed on all sides for rice, coal, and the repayment of debts, with nowhere to turn for a loan, he accepted Gao Pin's kind offer to"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":1,"tokens":["庸庵"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一人一幅，写得停匀娟秀。一幅是度香主人，一幅是静宜逸士，一幅是竹君词客，一幅是剑潭山人，一幅是前舟外史，一幅是庸庵居士。像是几首和韵七律诗。再看上款，是媚香嘱和《长河修禊》七律六章原韵，春航心里更加起敬。想道：","en":"Jingyi\\", \\"The Lyricist Zhujun\\", \\"The Mountain Man Jiantan\\", \\"The Unofficial Historian Qianzhou\\", and \\"The Lay Scholar Yong'an\\". They appeared to be matching seven-character regulated verse poems. Looking closer at the dedication, it read: \\"By Meixiang's request, matching the original rhymes of the six seven-character verses on the *Purification Rite on the Long River*.\\" Chunhang's"}],"14":[{"paragraph":43,"mentions":3,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"玉林留他进去，南湘道：「天不早了，改日再见罢。」便一径回家。经王恂门口走过，南湘忽然口渴，便叫跟班的进去一问王少爷可睡了没有？跟班的走到门房说知，管门的到书房，探看王恂、颜仲清尚未安睡。门上回过，王恂等便叫请进，史南湘进来。未知后事如何，且听下回分解。","en":"Nanxiang said, \\"It is already late, let us meet again another day.\\" He turned and went straight home. Passing by Wang Xun's gate, Nanxiang suddenly felt thirsty, and sent his attendant inside to ask whether young Master Wang had yet retired. The attendant went to the gatekeeper and passed on the message; the gatekeeper looked in on the study and found that Wang Xun and"}],"15":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":3,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说史南湘进内与仲清、王恂见了、喝了几杯茶、王恂问其所从来、南湘将日间的事，一一说了，又将春航、蕙芳的光景说了一会。王恂、仲清羡慕不已。仲清道：「不料苏媚香竟能这样，从此田湘帆倒可以收心改过了。」也将前日题画规劝之事说了，又说春航且有徽愠。南湘道：「改日我与你们和事如何？」又","en":"When Shi Nanxiang entered and greeted Zhongqing and Wang Xun, they shared a few cups of tea. Wang Xun asked him where he had been, and Nanxiang recounted the day's events one by one, then spoke at some length about Chunhang and Huifang. Wang Xun and Zhongqing found themselves unable to conceal their profound admiration."},{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"却说子玉在王恂处谈了半天回家。李先生已经解馆，要张罗盘缠，魏聘才替他拉了一纤。托张仲雨问西客借了一票银子，占了些空头，有二百余金，添补些衣服，也叫了几天相公。李元茂要在京寄籍，性全也只得由他。","en":"Now let us speak of Ziyu, who had been at Wang Xun's for a long chat before returning home. Master Li had already packed up his tutoring post and needed to arrange travel funds; Wei Pincai had found a financial connection for him, asking Zhang Zhongyu to borrow a draft of silver from Xi Rong, which included"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":2,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"初十日，仲清、王恂绝早过来送行，梅学士行李一切早已收拾停妥，已于初九日打发家人押了出城。是日亲友拥挤不开，时候尚早，仲清、王恂先在书房，与子玉、元茂等等候。仲清便对元茂道了喜，道：「恭喜，恭喜！你今日真得了一个雪美人。你从前不是有句诗是「白人双目近」么？如今倒成了诗谶","en":"On the tenth day, Zhongqing and Wang Xun came very early to see Shixie off. The Academician Mei's luggage had long been properly packed and put in order; his servants had been dispatched out of the city on the ninth to transport everything. On the day itself, relatives and friends crowded the"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"少顷，士燮送了客出去，便叫出子玉来，教训了一番。又叮嘱了元茂、聘才几句。然后与夫人别了，即上车起程，颜仲清、王恂、魏聘才、李元茂一起随后，颜夫人领着子玉，并有些仆妇丫鬟一群的车，也送出城来。城外是王文辉、孙亮功等十几个同年至好，一齐在旗亭饯别。士燮盘桓了一会，文辉等进城。天色不早，颜夫人也只得带了仆妇丫鬟洒泪先回。子玉、仲清、聘才、元茂与些家人们，随到店中住了","en":"Yuanmao and Pincai. After that he bade farewell to Lady Yan, mounted his carriage, and departed. Yan Zhongqing, Wang Xun, Wei Pincai, and Li Yuanmao followed close behind. Lady Yan, leading Ziyu and a group of female servants and maids, also accompanied him in carriages out of the city. Outside the city gate, Wang Wenhui, Sun Lianggong, and a dozen or so fellow examination"}],"17":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":2,"tokens":["王恂","庸庵"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉即把日间一一过访不遇事说过。先是王恂开言道：「今日我们都在卓然斋中，交会田湘帆与媚香，又遇见竹君前来。那湘帆果是吾辈，与媚香相处的光景，真令人羡慕。」高品道：「湘帆此时是六根全净，五蕴皆空，守定了约法三章，不许你胡行乱走，始信人间果然多是惧内的，怪不得庸庵、竹君辈，牢守闺房，不奉将令不","en":"Ziyu recounted how he had called upon each of them earlier in the day to no avail. Wang Xun was the first to speak: \\"Today we were all gathered in Zhuoran's studio, where we met with Tian Xiangfan and Meixiang, and chanced upon Zhujun who arrived later. Xiangfan is truly a kindred spirit. The way he and Meixiang interact is genuinely enviable.\\""},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":4,"tokens":["王恂","庸庵"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"把那些知名宝贝，都叫将来热闹一天，请湘帆与媚香做生日，你道好不好？」子玉道：「好极，好极！但不知在何处聚会？」王恂道：「我家亦可，但无花园子，不如前舟园里好。我们主人六个，添上湘帆七个，媚香、瑶卿、香畹、佩仙、静芳、蕊香、瘦香、小梅共是八个，要三席才可坐，醵分之说，不能预定多少，只好办了再算。」众人道：「极是。」子玉便呆呆的。仲清笑道：「庸庵你这差使办得不周到，","en":"of Xiangfan and Meixiang. What say you to this?\\" Ziyu said: \\"Excellent, excellent! But where shall we convene?\\" Wang Xun said: \\"My home would suffice, but it lacks a garden. It would be better in Qianzhou's garden. With the six of us as hosts, plus Xiangfan, that makes seven; Meixiang, Yaoqing, Xiangwan, Peixian, Jingfang, Ruixiang, Shouxiang, and Xiaomei make eight. We"},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":2,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"王恂道：「你们可不是说徐度香么！我非遗漏，我恐他的事情多。未必能来。」子玉道：「度香应酬虽多，然看其性情光景，我们请他，虽有事也必来的。就是萧静宜，也断不可不请。」大家说：「很好，就添上这两位是了。那是九个，合上那八个，是十七个，也就很热闹了。」南湘道：","en":"Wang Xun said: \\"Are you speaking of Xu Duxiang? I had not forgotten him; I only feared his social obligations were too numerous and he might be unable to attend.\\" Ziyu said: \\"Though Duxiang has many engagements, judging by his temperament, if we invite him, he"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":2,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"王恂道：「是呀，我真该打，一时竟忘了琴言，是必要他来的。还有那个秦琪官号玉艳的也叫了他来，凑成十个。」众人道：「如此更妙。」子玉道：「如今我们商议起来，怎样邀客。」王恂道：「你作一小札与怡园徐、萧二公，前舟以及余人，我们明日自去知会。」于是大家直谈至二更","en":"Wang Xun said: \\"Quite right, I deserve a reprimand! I entirely forgot Qinyan for a moment, yet he absolutely must come. And that Qin Qiguan, styled Yuyan, should be summoned too, making it a perfect ten.\\" Everyone said: \\"That is even better.\\" Ziyu said: \\"Now"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":3,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"到了明日，王恂、史南湘等，就到刘文泽家来讲了，文泽甚为高兴，说明日就在倚剑眠琴之室布置。恰好兰蕙芬芳，又有芍药、海棠等花开满。少停。即去知会群花，于明日辰刻毕集。因说道：「明日花林中，恐有几个不能来。我知道秦琪官害眼，杜琴言亦患病未痊。昨晚我见素兰，谈及庾香在彼处","en":"The next day, Wang Xun, Shi Nanxiang, and the others went to Liu Wenze's house and informed him. Wenze was highly delighted, declaring that the following day they would arrange the festivities right there in the 'Sword Reclining, Zither Sleeping' studio. As it happened, orchids"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"刺一谒要津，宁居萧寺，玉人作伴，名士同声。蕙芳又替他结交了许多好友，如徐度香、萧静宜、刘文泽、史南湘、颜仲清、王恂等。仲清前与春航不睦，原是激励春航之意；经高品将其中情节剖明，又说起仲清仍送五十金作浇裹之费，春航自然十分感激敬佩。仲清叫蕙芳为之转弯，更觉比前相好。惟有子玉，尚未谋面。是日知文泽等为蕙芳做生日，心上虽十分欢喜，又因他二人交好，竟人人共知，翻有些不好","en":"befriend many worthy companions, such as Xu Duxiang, Xiao Jingyi, Liu Wenze, Shi Nanxiang, Yan Zhongqing, and Wang Xun. Zhongqing's previous discord with Chunhang had originally been intended to spur Chunhang onward; after Gao Pin illuminated the underlying circumstances, and mentioned that Zhongqing was still sending fifty taels of silver for his living expenses, Chunhang"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"使弟等附骥餐芳，实为快事。」次贤道：「丹山彩凤，深巷乌衣，裙屐风流无过于此。而寒皋野鹤亦可翱翔其间乎？」文泽、王恂等同说道：「度香、静宜两先生，名士班头，骚坛牛耳，弟等无刻不思雅范。今不鄙凡陋，惠然肯来，足以快此生平矣！」南湘道：「朋友之交，随分投合，以我鄙见，竟不必纯作寒暄。」","en":"sash and sandal could surpass this. And yet may the cold-hilltop wild cranes also soar freely among them?\\" Wenze, Wang Xun, and the others all said in unison: \\"Duxiang and Jingyi are foremost among celebrated men, leaders of the literary and poetic assembly; there is no moment we do not long for your refined example. That you do not disdain our humble abode and have come"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"贤自知不能推逊，只得依了，并坐者为高品，次是仲清；左首一席，子云为首，次南湘，次子玉；右首一席，田春航为首，次王恂，文泽作陪。是每席三位。","en":"table had Ziyun at the head, then Nanxiang, then Ziyu. The right-hand table had Tian Chunhang at the head, then Wang Xun, with Wenze as host. There were three guests at each table."},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":2,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"于是以年齿为先后，仍系次贤为首，次子云，次高品，次南湘，次文泽，次仲清，次春航，次王恂，次子玉，共是九人。王恂已将子玉叫醒，净净脸，素兰取出一颗醒酒丸给子玉吃了。子玉不好意思，只得勉强扎挣。素兰见子玉不语不言，似醉非醉，心上猜着是为琴言未来。一因人多不好解慰他，二因提起琴言反恐倒勾他的心事，非惟不能宽解，越增愁闷了，反倒走开，找别人说","en":"taking the lead, followed by Ziyun, then Gao Pin, then Nanxiang, then Wenze, then Zhongqing, then Chunhang, then Wang Xun, and finally Ziyu, making nine people in all. Wang Xun had already roused Ziyu and had him wash his face; Sulan brought out a sobering pill and gave it to Ziyu to ingest. Ziyu felt embarrassed and forced himself to pull it together. Seeing that Ziyu"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":2,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"费尽龙宫十斛珠。」轮到春航了，接道：「截来碧海双枝玉。小玉生嗔碧玉愁。」众人又赞道：「好！又提得清楚。「底下是王恂，略费思索，写道：「玉人又恐占千秋。婵娟疑窃嫦娥药。」大家正要赞好，高品道：「这句忒骂得恶，难道个个都像月宫里的兔子？」众人大笑起来，王恂倒觉不安。众旦便骂高品道：「惟有他，是生平不肯说好话的，将来罚他作个哑子。」","en":"of anger, Green Jade feels sorrow.\\" Everyone praised again: \\"Good! It lifts the theme clearly again.\\" Next was Wang Xun; he thought for a bit and wrote: \\"The jade-like person also fears usurping a thousand autumns; / Chanjuan seems to have stolen Chang'e's elixir.\\" Everyone was just about to praise it when Gao Pin said: \\"This line scolds too viciously; surely not every"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"王恂对道：「冯子都非浪得名。迟迟长昼当初夏。」文泽道：「冯子都如今有个冯子佩，倒像弟兄呢。」子云道：「冯子佩原不错，他有一种脾气，他偏不肯在群花堆里取乐。」王兰保冷笑道：「他自然不肯在我们堆里，他见我们还要生气呢。」子玉道：「何故？」桂保接口道：「他有他","en":"Wang Xun matched:\\n\\n\\"Feng Zidu, his fame no empty claim;\\nslowly the long days pass in the early summer.\\"\\n\\nWenze said: \\"Feng Zidu. Nowadays there is a Feng Zipei; they seem like brothers.\\" Ziyun said: \\"Feng Zipei is actually not bad; he has one particular trait:"},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":2,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"雄风当大王。画堂终日开良宴。」众人又复笑起来。高品道：「诗言志，解铃便是系铃人。若我做了，又不是了。」此下应是王恂，王恂道：「可以收了，轮到庾香作结罢。」写道：「扇底窥郎留半面。拾得瑶光一片明。」众人齐赞道：「好！应结句了，这一结倒不容易。要结得住通篇才好。」子玉想了一想，写道：「雪花飞上琼枝艳。」大众齐赞结得有力，能使通篇一气。","en":"expresses the will; the one who ties the bell must untie it. If I were to write this one, it would be wrong again.\\" Wang Xun's turn came, and he said: \\"We can close now, so let it fall to Yuxiang to write the conclusion.\\" He wrote:\\n\\n\\"Through the fan-base, peering at my lord, half a face glimpsed;\\npicking up the piece of moonlight, a single bright sliver.\\"\\n\\nEveryone exclaimed"}],"20":[{"paragraph":5,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"文泽是他岳母惦记他，来接他并其室吴氏，同到直隶总督衙门去了。此中已少了三人，只有子云、次贤、南湘、仲清、春航、王恂六人，不时往来。","en":"the Viceroy of Zhili. So three of the group were gone; only Ziyun, Cixian, Nanxiang, Zhongqing, Chunhang, and Wang Xun — six people — continued to meet from time to time."},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":2,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"不做寿，家中却也有些至交好友亲戚同年来贺，内里又有些太太姑娘们，如梅宅的颜夫人，孙宅的陆夫人之类，也觉得热闹。王恂与仲清这怡园之约，就不能去了。是日子云、次贤知道了，也去拜拜寿，适遇南湘、春航皆在，就约了回来。仲清、王恂说如客散得早，也来赴约。","en":"ladies — such as Lady Yan from the Mei household and Madam Lu from the Sun household — so it was quite festive. Wang Xun and Zhongqing were thus unable to attend the Garden of Contentment appointment. On learning of this, Ziyun and Cixian also went to offer birthday congratulations; there they happened to find Nanxiang and Chunhang both present, so they invited them to"}],"24":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":11,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这回书要讲颜仲清、王恂二人。这一日在家，仲清对王恂道：「你可知道，这几日内出了许多新闻，你听见没有？」王恂道：「那两天因你弟妹身上不好。我天天候医生，有些照料，没有出门。」仲清道：「我昨日听得张仲雨讲的，有个开银号的潘三，从三月间想买苏蕙芳作干儿子。头一回是拉着张老二同去","en":"Our story now turns to Yan Zhongqing and Wang Xun. Idling at home one day, Zhongqing turned to Wang Xun and asked, \\"Have you heard the flurry of strange rumors going around these past few days?\\" Wang Xun replied, \\"My sister-in-law has been unwell of late. I've been waiting on the doctor every day and"},{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"留意庾香，已在怡园未会之前，就是初六那一天望见庾香之后，便恍恍惚惚，思及梦寐，这却猜不透，因果之说容或有之。」王恂道：「吾兄之论，如楞严说法，绝无翳障，以此观庾香、琴言之情，正是极深极正，就在人人之上了。若湘帆、媚香之情，较之庾香、琴言，又将何如呢？」","en":"sixth day of the New Year. That part remains a mystery to me, and perhaps karma truly does hold sway over it all.\\" Wang Xun marveled, \\"You preach with the clarity of the Surangama Sutra, stripping away every veil. Their love stands deepest and straightest, elevating it far beyond common folk. How, then, does it compare to the bond between Xiangfan and Meixiang?\\""},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":6,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"若一涉淫亵，情就是淫亵上生的，不是性分中出来的。譬如方才说的潘三，心上也是想着媚香，难道说他也是钟情的不成？」王恂道：「也要算情，若说不是情，他也不想了。」仲清笑道：「潘三若有情，倒绝不想媚香，其想媚香正是其无情处。」王恂笑道：「此语有些矫强了！不过情有邪正，潘三之情，是邪情、淫情，非湘帆可比。若定说他于媚香毫没有情，又何至三回五次，这么瞎巴结呢？」仲清笑道：「","en":"from one's true nature. Take Pan the Third, for instance—he covets Meixiang, but would you call that 'passion'?\\" Wang Xun countered, \\"It is still a kind of feeling. If he felt nothing at all, he wouldn't spare him a single thought.\\" Zhongqing laughed dismissively, \\"If Pan possessed true feeling, he would never lust after Meixiang so basely. His lust is the very proof of"},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":3,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"仲清道：「虫蛀千字文」要给他吃碗墨水，才好免得随口胡言。」王恂道：「李元茂吃什么呢？」仲清笑道：「李元茂颟颟顸顸，七窍闭塞，要吃大黄、芒硝，方才打得通他这些浊污。」王恂又问仲雨，仲清答道：「在可善可恶之间，尚识好人，天良未昧。」二人刚说得有趣，忽见李玉林同着桂保来，见过了，遂即坐下，因问道：「这两日不见你们出来","en":"said, \\"That worm-eaten 'Thousand-Character Classic' needs to be force-fed a bowl of ink to stop his loose talk.\\" Wang Xun asked what remedy Li Yuanmao should be prescribed. Zhongqing laughed, \\"Yuanmao is so profoundly dull that all seven of his orifices are blocked tight. He needs a heavy dose of rhubarb and mirabilite to purge the muck from his system.\\" Wang Xun then asked"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":9,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，六军可发，是件顺情合理之事。这陈元礼上无忧国之心，下无束师之律，罪应摒弃。若要将这些事翻转来，此外尚多呢。」王恂道：「在怡园演习的共有几人？」桂保道：「旦脚十个，此外生、净、老、丑有二十余个，是五六班凑成的。」仲清道：「旦脚十个是谁？」桂保道：「我们两个之外，尚有瑶卿、媚香、香畹、静芳、瘦香、小梅，后来又添了玉侬、玉艳，共是十个。」王恂道：「这就是十美班了。」","en":"discipline, and should have been cast out. If we were to reverse these historical wrongs, so many more would remain.\\" Wang Xun asked how many actors were rehearsing. Guibao replied, \\"Ten female roles, alongside twenty-some sheng, jing, lao, and chou actors drawn from five or six different companies.\\" Zhongqing asked, \\"Who are the ten dan performers?\\" Guibao replied, \\"Besides"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":3,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"少顷，夕阳西下，仲清叫人卷起帘子，就把桌子挪到廊前，摆了四个座儿。王恂道：「便饭，没有为你们添菜，我这里却比不得度香。」桂保道：「好说，你的便饭我也吃得记不清了，东成居也作不出来。度香处也过于糜费，其实如何吃得这么许多。」说完就同坐了。厨房内闻得有相公，便多备了八个碟子，添了四样菜。先把黄酒、小吃送上来。玉林、桂保各敬","en":"Zhongqing ordered the curtains to be rolled up and had the table moved out to the gallery, setting out four seats. Wang Xun said, \\"It will just be a plain meal with no extra dishes; I certainly cannot match Duxiang's extravagance.\\" Guibao waved it off, \\"You say that, but I have lost count of the plain feasts I've enjoyed here. The Dongcheng Kitchen couldn't possibly equal"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"方才王恂日间听了仲清品评各人的情境，因想起《花谱》中诸旦都也讲究情分的。因问玉林、桂保道：「你们此刻在怡园演习，那十个人，你可晓得他们有几种情性，脾气是那个最好相与，可讲得来么？」桂保道：「这十个却也好几样，内中就是玉侬脾气冷些，其余没有什么脾气。」玉林道：","en":"Earlier in the day, Wang Xun had listened intently to Zhongqing judge the depths of each man's passions, which naturally led his thoughts to the actors of the Catalogue of Flowers and their own emotional temperaments. He asked Yulin and Guibao, \\"Of the ten of you rehearsing at the"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":6,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"」桂保道：「这是你自己不好下赞语，这考语待我出吧：芳洁自守，风雅宜人，不亢不卑，无好无恶，这些是佩仙。」仲清、王恂同道：「这考语出得很切，足见蕊香近日识见又长了好些。」玉林道：「我却当不起这考语。」王恂道：「还有几个人索性请你批评批评。」桂保笑道：「是谁？」王恂道：「蓉官、二喜、玉美、春林、凤林，这些人又是怎样？」桂保笑道：「这又是一路，不与我们往来的。我们是玉","en":"overly proud nor lowly base, harboring neither intense love nor bitter hatred—that is Peixian.\\" Zhongqing and Wang Xun applauded, \\"Sharp indeed! Ruixiang's insight grows by the day.\\" Yulin modestly demurred. Wang Xun then asked for their judgment on Rongguan, Erxi, Yumei, Chunlin, and Fenglin—the outsiders. Guibao laughed, \\"They belong to an entirely different school!"}],"25":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说前回书中，玉林、桂保在王恂处，讲起怡园演习新戏，预备华公子逛园。流光荏苒，倏忽一月，刘文泽已回。书中所讲这班名士，华公子向来往来者就是刘文泽一人，其余多未谋面。此时文泽之父刘守正已升了礼部尚书，是以文泽偕其妻星夜赶回，未免有些庆贺之事。又适子云写书前往，文泽回京已有半月，诸事","en":"In the previous chapter, Yulin and Guibao at Wang Xun's place were speaking of the new plays being rehearsed at the Garden of Contentment in preparation for Young Master Hua's garden visit. Time flew swiftly; in the blink of an eye a month passed, and Liu Wenze had returned. Of this circle of distinguished"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":1,"tokens":["庸庵"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"」文泽便问何故，子云道：「庾香旧病又发了。史竹君昨日醉坏了，竟至呕血不能出房。湘帆说是没有会过华公子，不肯来。庸庵为是这两天，他夫人要弄璋了，一步不离伺候。剑潭见诸人不来，也就辞了。昨日只得邀了张仲雨，倒是同华公子相识的。余外就是静宜，共有五人，只有两席。他们没有会过华公子，不晓得是怎么一个富贵骄奢的气概，所以不肯来。你也长见的，其实也不见怎样，不过气势自高，侍","en":"vomiting blood, unable even to leave his room. Xiangfan says he has never met Young Master Hua and refuses to come. Yong'an's wife is about to give birth any day now, so he will not leave her side for a single step. Jiantan, seeing that no one else was coming, also sent his regrets. Yesterday I had no choice but to invite Zhang Zhongyu, who does happen to be acquainted with"}],"28":[{"paragraph":9,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"清楚时与好人一样。睡梦中呓语喃喃，有时叫玉侬，有时唤香畹，有时大骂奚十一、魏聘才诸人。颜夫人十分着急，颜仲清、王恂三天两日常来看视，心中虽是明白，却也无法可治。二人商量，又不好对颜夫人讲，只好婉言解慰而已。颜夫人每听子玉睡梦之中，必呼玉侬二字，心上便疑心子玉在外有什么勾当，便当玉侬是个女人，心有说不出的隐情；因又想子玉不常出门，出门必有云儿随去。一日便唤云儿来细","en":"and at times, vehemently cursing Xi Eleven and Wei Pincai. Lady Yan was frantic with worry. Yan Zhongqing and Wang Xun visited every few days; they understood the root of the malady but were powerless to cure it. After discussing the matter, they felt they could not reveal the truth to Lady Yan, offering only gentle, evasive comforts. Hearing Ziyu constantly cry out"}],"29":[{"paragraph":21,"mentions":2,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"去年又将个爱女许了他。人生起头第一件，就是这不爱听的事，有了外遇，将来琴瑟之间就不能专好的了。」回家就叫他儿子王恂问了一回，王恂只好含含糊糊的说了几句，又与子玉剖辨，说断不至此，文辉终有些疑心。陆夫人听见了，虽未过门，倒先替女儿吃起醋来了，便向文辉说道：「若论玉哥儿，相貌是极好的，所以去年孙亲家母作媒，我就应许了。如今你自然不管，这怎么好？亲尚未成，倒先弄些笑话","en":"peace and harmony of their household will never stay pure.\\" Upon returning home, he immediately summoned his son, Wang Xun, and interrogated him. Xun answered vaguely, trying desperately to argue Ziyu's side, insisting that the situation was nowhere near as bad as the rumors claimed. But Wenhui's doubts remained deeply entrenched. Lady Lu happened to overhear the conversation."}],"30":[{"paragraph":4,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"名之士回避了一大半。内中除徐子云、史南湘是前科举人，萧次贤是高尚自居，无心问世，只有田春航、高品入场。如子玉、王恂、文泽、仲清等皆遵例回避。子玉在家闷闷不乐，又因琴言杳无音信，内外隔绝，又不能传递消息，几次要去访问聘才，又因华府威严，豪奴气焰。故而子玉不肯前去，只得静坐书斋，闷坐而已。","en":"affairs and had no intention of participating, only Tian Chunhang and Gao Pin entered the examination hall. Ziyu, Wang Xun, Wenze, and Zhongqing all withdrew according to the rules. Ziyu stayed at home, brooding unhappily. Moreover, because there was no news from Qinyan and they were completely cut off from each other, unable to exchange messages, he wanted to visit Pincai"}],"31":[{"paragraph":16,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"十五日一日过了。到了十六日，王恂、颜仲清约了史南湘来望子玉。子玉自七月中病好，调养了二十八日，已经强健。","en":"The fifteenth day came and went. On the morning of the sixteenth, Wang Xun and Yan Zhongqing brought Shi Nanxiang along to visit Ziyu. Since recovering from his illness in the middle of the seventh month, Ziyu had spent twenty-eight days resting and recuperating, and he had now grown strong and healthy once more."},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":2,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"惟独坐一室，茗碗香炉，周旋其间。名为看破，其实情怀未断，犹时一念及，涕泪潸潸，不能自解。十五日到王文辉家一走，王恂、仲清约定明日午刻去望田春航、高品。子玉已吃过了早饭，在书房等候。不多一会，史、颜诸人已到，南湘坐了，与子玉叙谈。仲清、王恂先进内室，见了颜夫人，略坐一坐即出来。喝了一杯茶，即催子玉同走。","en":"sorrow he could not ease. He took a brief walk to Wang Wenhui's home on the fifteenth, where he agreed to accompany Wang Xun and Zhongqing to visit Tian Chunhang and Gao Pin at noon the following day. Ziyu had already eaten breakfast and was waiting in his study. Soon enough, Shi, Yan, and the others arrived. Nanxiang took a seat and chatted with Ziyu, while Zhongqing and"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":2,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"请教过了，是一定得意的。卓然的文章，快拿出来看看，想来定有出人头地的好处。」高品道：「不好，不好，不必看他。」王恂道：「什么话！就不好也要看看。」南湘道：「这三道题，卓然一定见长，就不看也不妨。」子玉道：「到底看看怎样。据我愚见却有几样作法，注疏上有可依，有不可依的。」高品道：「我那日忽然神思昏昏，不成一字，到晚随手乱写，完了卷就算账。首艺虽有草稿，也不知团在什","en":"rest.\\" Gao Pin waved his hand dismissively, \\"No, they are poor, quite poor. There is no need to look at them.\\" Wang Xun protested, \\"Nonsense! Even if they are poor, you must show them to us anyway.\\" Nanxiang added, \\"With these three topics, Zhuoran is bound to shine. Even without seeing them, I know they will be fine.\\" Ziyu chimed in, \\"Still, we should take a look. In"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"蕙芳道：「难得你们诸公可巧全都在这里，今日我作个东道，请你们何如？」王恂道：「甚好。」高品道：「相公不是要请分子？」蕙芳笑道：「被你猜着了，我真要请分子。」众人当是顽话，都应允了。蕙芳命人到饭庄子上备了一桌菜来，众家人相帮摆好，蕙芳即恭恭敬敬的安了席。众人诧异道：「媚香今日忽庄严如此，想来真要请分子么？」蕙芳应道：「我早","en":"gentlemen happen to be gathered here. How about I play the host today and invite you all to a feast? What do you say?\\" Wang Xun agreed, \\"That sounds excellent.\\" Gao Pin teased, \\"Xianggong, you aren't going to hit us up for subscription funds, are you?\\" Huifang laughed, \\"You caught me! I truly am seeking subscriptions.\\" They all thought he was merely jesting and readily agreed."},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"的么？」蕙芳道：「都是实话，就是少些文气。」仲清道：「也好，请湘帆润色润色就好了。」即说道：「我与他作篇诔。」王恂道：「我作几首挽诗罢。」南湘道：「我作墓志。」春航道：「把他的作了略节，我另作一篇传如何？」蕙芳道：「更好，这原算略节，用不得的。」子玉道：「大文章你们都作了，我们作什么呢？我只好作篇赞罢。」高品道：「赞也很好，我作篇祭文倒沉痛些。」仲清道：「我们何","en":"good, though having Xiangfan refine it would make it perfect.\\" He then added, \\"I shall compose an elegy for him.\\" Wang Xun volunteered, \\"I shall write a few elegiac poems.\\" Nanxiang said, \\"I shall compose his tomb inscription.\\" Chunhang proposed, \\"We can expand upon his original draft, and I will write a completely new biography. How does that sound?\\" Huifang replied, \\"That"},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":2,"tokens":["庸庵"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"到了二十八日，仲清又到南湘处商议明日之事，并说：「大约有几个不愿去的，庸庵畏首畏尾，防他严亲知道，庾香更不消说了，那古庙里三更半夜的，也不好叫他去。」南湘道：「我倒想着个主意。既是此举，也不专为祭他，我们借此可以散步野游，不如日间携樽而往，一献之后，即到锦秋墩、浩然亭上，与那些相公一叙，不很好吗？」仲清道：「果然好，我未想","en":"to discuss the plans for the following day. He noted, \\"I imagine there are a few who will be unwilling to go. Yong'an is always timid and fearful, constantly worrying that his strict father might find out. As for Yuxiang, it goes without saying; we certainly cannot ask him to go out to a ruined ancient temple in the middle of the night.\\" Nanxiang offered a solution:"}],"32":[{"paragraph":10,"mentions":2,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"过春航，于他儿子们书房内，见他些笔墨东西，也久已倾倒，惟恐不得其人为憾。今中了南元，十分欢喜。从此春航与文泽、王恂又成了世谊，更加亲爱。惟有孙氏昆仲颇难浃洽，然亦不得不往来，惟淡交而已。高品代枪之银已收清，共得了一千六百金。张仲雨过手，在花处讲定二千四百金，从中扣出去八百金，又索花姓谢仪二百金，也得了千金，自己享用。便从藩经历上加捐了正指挥，即在坊里当起差来。高","en":"that they had not secured him themselves. From then on, Chunhang formed a generational friendship with Wenze and Wang Xun, growing even closer. Only the Sun brothers were difficult to get along with, though they had to maintain some interaction, keeping it purely formal. Gao Pin collected the silver for taking the exam as a substitute, receiving a total of one thousand"}],"35":[{"paragraph":6,"mentions":2,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"再说王恂、颜仲清、文泽、春航，从十三日至十五日都在怡园赏灯饮酒。子玉也去了一天，因想去年此日初见琴言，今年似成隔世，不觉伤感了一回。新年上，诸名旦彼此纷纷请客，热闹了十余日。到了十七日，王恂、颜仲清飞了札来与子玉。","en":"Returning to Wang Xun, Yan Zhongqing, Liu Wenze, and Tian Chunhang—from the thirteenth to the fifteenth, they had all been at the Garden of Contentment, admiring lanterns and drinking wine. Ziyu had also joined them for one day. Remembering how he had first met Qinyan on"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"到了明日，只说怡园请酒，禀明了颜夫人，即到王恂处，一同来到怡园。次贤那日要在红茶仙馆里面，一切都是他预备，不要子云费心，却说那红茶仙馆是去年新辟的，地方在梅崦之前，梨院海棠春圃之后，本是空地，只有一个亭子。亭外有两块英州灵石，一块有一丈二尺高，一块四尺余高。有一株大玉兰花，树身已有一抱有余，就倚","en":"told Lady Yan he was invited for drinks at the Garden of Contentment. Having obtained her permission, he went to Wang Xun's place, and together they proceeded to the Garden of Contentment. That day, Cixian had arranged for everything to be hosted inside the Red Camellia Immortal Pavilion, taking charge of all preparations so Ziyun wouldn't have to worry. This pavilion had"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，都有堂会戏，不能分身。宝珠之外，来的是蕙芳、素兰、玉林、漱芳四人。这边名士，怡园二位之外，是刘文泽、颜仲清、王恂、田春航、梅子玉五人。共十二人。众客到齐，宝珠先叩谢了。","en":"the famous scholars, apart from the two hosts of the Garden of Contentment, there were Liu Wenze, Yan Zhongqing, Wang Xun, Tian Chunhang, and Mei Ziyu—five in total. Together, they made twelve. Once all the guests had assembled, Baozhu first bowed in gratitude to everyone."},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"开了。」子云道：「依我，把两张大方桌并拢来，就可坐了。」摆好了坐位，是东西对面八坐，南北对面四坐。文泽、仲清、王恂、春航、子玉、次贤、子云坐了东西，上下是蕙芳、素兰、玉林、漱芳、宝珠。宝珠坐了末位。","en":"all sit.\\" The seating was arranged: eight facing east and west, four facing north and south. Wenze, Zhongqing, Wang Xun, Chunhang, Ziyu, Cixian, and Ziyun took the east-west seats, while the upper and lower seats were occupied by Huifang, Sulan, Yulin, Shufang, and Baozhu. Baozhu took the very last seat."},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":2,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"。文泽喜欢的了不得，便轻轻的拿起来，一饮而尽。便也斟了一杯，也说道：「回敬萧老爷一杯。」那杯子忽然走错了，走到王恂面前住了。文泽道：「怎么我叫他就不灵？」重新拿了过来放在面前，又说了一遍，那杯子又往下首走去，到了宝珠面前住了。文泽道：「作怪。」子玉道：「此中必有原故，你摸不着。」众人皆猜不出机巧。只见次贤又把杯子取了过来，又说：「敬刘老爷一杯。」那杯子又往文泽面","en":"cup and said, \\"Returning the favor, a cup for Lord Xiao.\\" But the cup suddenly went awry, stopping in front of Wang Xun. Wenze exclaimed, \\"Why doesn't it work when I call it?\\" He brought it back in front of himself and repeated the command, but the cup rolled down to Baozhu and stopped. \\"How bizarre,\\" Wenze muttered. Ziyu said, \\"There must be a hidden trick to this that"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，于远处便斟得满。此杯想是要重了才得远呢。」子玉点头道：「果然。」次贤道：「可恶之极，轻重远近都被他知道了。」王恂问子玉道：「到底你从何处看出？」子玉道：「你们何尝不看，但总看轮盘外面，没有看轮盘里面。你不见轮盘里有个绝小的小针，对着谁就到谁。」众人看了，大家试过，一些不差，群服子玉、蕙芳聪慧。","en":"nodded, \\"Exactly.\\" Cixian complained, \\"How utterly detestable, he's figured out the weight and distance too.\\" Wang Xun asked Ziyu, \\"Where exactly did you spot the trick?\\" Ziyu explained, \\"You all looked, but only at the outside of the dial, not the inside. Didn't you see the tiny needle inside the dial? Wherever it points is where the cup goes.\\" Everyone took a look"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":2,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"人《宫词》都不记得了。」玉林笑道：正是。我恐怕他有心要我喝酒。」便喝了道：「要说七字了。」想了有半刻工夫，飞到王恂道：「门前才下七香车。」王恂喝了，飞出八字是薛逢《夜宴赠妓》的「愁傍翠蛾深八字」。数到了子云，子云喝了酒，道：「这九字只怕少些，就有也没有好句了。」因想了一会，念道：「宝扇迎归九华帐。」一数数到素兰，素兰喝了酒，飞出十字道：「闺里佳人年十余。」数到了","en":"cup and said, \\"Now for a seven-character line.\\" After pondering for half a quarter of an hour, he passed it to Wang Xun: \\"Before the gate, a carriage of seven fragrances has just arrived.\\" Wang Xun drank and countered with an eight-character line, \\"Sorrow clings to the deep figure-eight brows' from Xue Feng's \\"Night Banquet Bestowing a Courtesan.\\" The count reached Ziyun,"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉道：「《毛诗》中凑花名，却也有几个。不过要并头、并蒂的难些。」王恂道：「也好，横竖大家费点心，也可以消消食，不然这些东西在肚子里何以消化。就恐他们要凑《毛诗》，未免苦人所难了。」子云道：「不然，单是我们七人行这个苦令，他们五人另行一个甜令，何如？我们搜索枯肠想不出时，听了他们行得好的，也可触动灵机，或者倒凑出来呢。","en":"*Mao Shi*, although finding matches for the paired-head and paired-stem varieties will be quite challenging.\\" Wang Xun said, \\"Racking our brains might at least help us digest our food. But forcing the performers to navigate the *Mao Shi* would indeed be too much to ask.\\" Ziyun proposed a compromise: \\"How about we split up? The seven of us scholars will play this 'bitter'"},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"次贤把筹和了一和，递给文泽，先掣了一枝，把筹筒搁过一边。王恂道：「何不一同抽出，按着次序说不好吗？」次贤笑道：「那就太便宜了，后头可以细想改换，再罚不成酒了。」文泽看那筹时，服饰门，美人名玉环，注：「飞七言唐诗二句，集《毛诗》说并头花。」文泽想一想，出坐走了几步道：「这倒不是行令，倒是考文了。」次贤笑道：「总","en":"Cixian shuffled the lots and handed the tube to Wenze to draw first. Wang Xun asked, \\"Why not have everyone draw their lots first and then proceed in order?\\" Cixian replied, \\"That would be too easy. People would have too much time to overthink and avoid penalties.\\" Wenze's lot was for the 'Adornment' category, featuring the beauty"},{"paragraph":30,"mentions":3,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"个温柔旖旎！倒转来，偏这样凑拍，倒比原文还好。」文泽道：「这是《访素》的曲文，是一枝上的，我们也贺一杯。」这边王恂掣了枝是鸟门的，美人名飞燕，花名也是并蒂花。王恂素来文思略迟，只得思索起来。看着素兰掷了个么四，也在那里凝思。忽见素兰想着了两句，念道：「月明云淡露花浓，人在蓬莱第几宫。」春航赞道：「更妙！」子玉道：「我们说的句子，倒没有他们的香艳。」素兰道：「你们","en":"lines came from *Visiting Su* in a specific aria sequence and deserved another toast. Back on the scholars' side, Wang Xun had drawn the category of birds, with the beauty 'Feiyan' (Flying Swallow), requiring a paired-stem flower. His composition was progressing slowly. Meanwhile, Sulan rolled a one and a four. After deep thought, he recited, \\"'The moon is bright, the clouds"},{"paragraph":31,"mentions":6,"tokens":["王恂","庸庵"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"》两句道：「长空孤雁添悲哽，峨嵋山下少人行。」众人也说：「好。」子云道：「就是情景凄凉些。」也各贺了一杯。这边王恂想着了，说道：「我用裴虔余一句，温飞卿一句，合着是：玉搔头袅凤双飞，燕钗落处无声腻。」子云、文泽大赞道：「妙，妙！此二句如一句，实在接得妙。」王恂又说道：「奉时辰牡，颜如渥丹。是并蒂牡丹花。」众人尚未开口，仲清道：「菜还没有上得一半，烧猪倒先拿了出来","en":"though Ziyun noted the mood was rather bleak; nevertheless, they each toasted one cup. Over on the hard side, Wang Xun finally produced his lines, combining Pei Qianyu and what he thought was Wen Tingyun: \\"'The jade hairpin sways, twin phoenixes fly; where the swallow-pin falls, the silence grows soft.'\\" Ziyun and Wenze praised the seamless linkage. Wang Xun then offered"},{"paragraph":36,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"杯。玉林掷了个重三，也念《小宴》一句道：「列长空数行新雁。」次贤道：「他们越说越好了，真是他们的比我们的好。」王恂道：「词出佳人口，信然。」春航道：「他们也实在敏捷，我们只好甘拜下风了。」文泽道：「难为他们句句贴切，也从没有人罚过一杯，倒叫人贺了好几十杯。」子玉道：「我早说我们不及他们。他们若行我们的令，只怕比我们总要好些。然而也是时候了，可以收令吃饭罢。」子云","en":"of new geese.'\\" Cixian said, \\"Their lines are getting better and better; truly, theirs are better than ours.\\" Wang Xun agreed, \\"Fine words come from the mouths of beauties—it is indeed true.\\" Chunhang added, \\"They are also remarkably quick-witted; we have no choice but to concede defeat.\\" Wenze pointed out, \\"It's impressive how perfectly fitting every single one of their"}],"37":[{"paragraph":3,"mentions":7,"tokens":["王恂","庸庵"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"今日之约，刘文泽、颜仲清、田春航不来，因为是春航会同年团拜，文泽、王恂是座师的世兄，故大家请了他。春航并请仲清，仲清新受感冒，两处都辞了。王恂也辞了那边，清早就约同子玉到怡园，次贤、子云接进梅崦坐下。这梅崦是个梅花样式，五间一处，共有五处。长廊曲槛钩连，绿萼红香围绕。外边望着，也认不清屋宇，唯觉一片香雪而已。子玉每到园","en":"was attending a New Year gathering of his examination year-mates. The examination cohort had invited Wenze and Wang Xun as sons of their examiners. Chunhang had also invited Zhongqing, but Zhongqing had recently caught a chill, so he declined both invitations. Wang Xun also declined his invitation, having arranged early in the morning to accompany Ziyu to the Garden of"},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":5,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云微笑。王恂笑道：「我见你满园子都是花，我们谈了这半日，不见一个人中花来，不是你爱花不爱人么？」子云笑道：「你不过是这么说呀，前日约得好好儿的，怎么此刻还不见来呢？」少顷，宝珠、桂保来了，见过了。子云道：「怎么这时候还只得你们两个人来？」宝珠道：「今日恐有个不能","en":"Ziyun smiled faintly. Wang Xun laughed, \\"I see your garden is filled with blossoms, yet in all the time we have been talking not a single flower among men has appeared. Does this not show you prefer flowers to people?\\" Ziyun replied with a chuckle, \\"So that is what you mean! We made"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":4,"tokens":["王恂","庸庵"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云吩咐摆起席面来，也不送酒。子云对王恂道：「论年齿，吾弟长于庾香，但今日之酌特为玉侬而设，要玉侬坐个首席，庾香作陪。」琴言道：「这个如何使得？我是不坐的。」子玉道：「应是庸庵。」子云道：「往日原是这样，今日却要倒转来。」便拉定琴言坐了首席，子玉并之。桂保坐了二席，王恂并之，不准再逊，逊者","en":"Ziyun gave orders for the table to be laid, without a formal offering of wine. He said to Wang Xun, \\"You are older than Yuxiang, but today we are drinking in Yunong's honour. Let him take the seat of honour, with Yuxiang beside him.\\" Qinyan protested, \\"That cannot be. I shall not sit there.\\" Ziyu suggested that Yong'an should have the top seat. Ziyun"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"言含泪说道：「原是我不好，我到他寓里，要他同我去看你。」子玉听到此，一阵心酸，眼皮上已红了一点。众人尽听他说，王恂道：「你看他，他怎样待你？」琴言道：「聘才起先还好，如今有一班坏人在那里引诱。」子云问道：「是谁呢？」琴言道：「一个奚十一，一个潘其观，还有一个和尚，就是聘才的房东。」","en":"a sharp pang went through Ziyu, and his eyes began to redden. Everyone listened intently as Qinyan continued. Wang Xun asked, \\"And how did he treat you?\\" Qinyan explained, \\"Pincai used to be decent enough, but now a set of bad characters are leading him astray.\\" Ziyun asked who they were. Qinyan said, \\"One is Xi Eleven, another is Pan Qiguan, and a monk—Pincai's landlord.\\""},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":4,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"样。不然还了得，只怕你们今日也不能见我的。」子云道：「这三个恶煞，怎么你一齐都遇见了，这也实在为难你。」次贤、王恂皆笑。桂保道：「那个奚十一，我倒没碰见他，就是佩仙、玉艳吃了他的大亏。」琴言道：「我是两次了。」王恂谓桂保道：「你若遇见了奚十一，便怎样呢？」桂保道：「我若遇见了他，也叫他看看桶子，叫个赶车的顽顽他。」说得众人大笑。蕙芳道：「我们如何想个法儿收拾他？","en":"said, \\"What bad luck to run into all three of those fiends at once! You must have had a dreadful time.\\" Cixian and Wang Xun both laughed. Guibao added, \\"That Xi Eleven, I have never had dealings with him myself, but Peixian and Yuyan suffered badly at his hands.\\" Qinyan noted, \\"For me it has been twice now.\\" Wang Xun asked Guibao what he would do if he ran into Xi Eleven."},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":3,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"个水字，加一点是氷字，移上去是永字。」次贤道：「这个永字些须欠一点儿，也只好算个薄氷。然眼前的却也没有多少。」王恂道：「只怕就是几个，被他们想完了。」桂保道：「我还有一个十字，加一划是士字，移上去是干字。」大家说道：「好。」蕙芳道：「我有个杳字，加一笔是查字，移上去是香字。」众人赞道：「更好！」宝珠道：「我有个丁字，加一笔是于字，移上去是亍字。」子云道：「这字却","en":"not quite right; it will only pass as thin ice. Still, there aren't many examples that come readily to mind.\\" Wang Xun said, \\"I fear there are only a few, and they have all been taken.\\" Guibao proposed another, \\"I have the character for 'ten' (十), add a stroke to make it 'scholar' (士), and move it to the top to make it 'shield' (干).\\" Everyone approved. Huifang added,"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":2,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"吃了些点心，又喝了几杯酒。王恂问蕙芳道：「你见湘帆、前舟没有？」蕙芳道：「原是为他们在那里，所以耽搁了好一回，将我的戏挪上了才来的。我今天见了一个老名士，说是前舟的业师，相貌清古，有六旬之外了。」子云道：「姓什么？」蕙芳道：「姓得有些古怪，我想想着，好像姓瞿，穿着六品服饰，觉得议","en":"They ate a few pastries and drank several more cups of wine. Wang Xun asked Huifang, \\"Have you seen Xiangfan and Qianzhou?\\" Huifang replied, \\"It was because they were there that I was held up for so long. My performance was moved earlier so I could come. I saw a remarkable old gentleman of letters there today, said to"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"高于石翁。石翁的才虽大，格却不高，且系驳杂不纯。道翁才也不小，其格纯正，却是可传之作。就是石翁也很佩服他的。」王恂道：「我们江宁的侯石翁么，他却自负天下第一才子。据我看来，也不见得。」子云道：「才是大的，博也博的，到他那地位，却也不易。」又说道：「我想戏目颇可作对，譬如《观画》就可对《偷诗》，《偷诗》又可对《拾画》等类，倒也有趣。我们八个人分着四对，我给你对一个","en":"writing has a pure, sound style; his works deserve to be handed down. Even Shiweng himself greatly admires him.\\" Wang Xun asked, \\"Do you mean our Nanjing man, Hou Shiweng? He considers himself the foremost genius under heaven, but from what I have seen, I am not sure that is warranted.\\" Ziyun said, \\"The talent is great and the learning is broad. To achieve what he has achieved"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":2,"tokens":["庸庵","王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"次贤道：「很好，就请庾香、玉侬先对起来。」子玉道：「还是你与媚香先对，次度香、瑶卿，次庸庵、蕊香，末后轮到我们罢。」子云道：「也罢，你作个先锋，他作个后劲，把我们放在中间，容易讨好些。」次贤道：「头难，头难，我一时想不出好的。我前日见瘦香的《题曲》唱得甚好，就出《题曲》罢。」蕙芳道：「《题曲》就可以对《偷诗》。」宝珠道：「将现成人家方才对","en":"Yunong start.\\" Ziyu suggested, \\"It would be better if you and Meixiang go first, then Duxiang and Yaoqing, then Yong'an and Ruixiang, and we shall go last.\\" Ziyun agreed to this arrangement, \\"You take the vanguard, and he brings up the rear; that leaves us in the middle, where it is easier to make a good showing.\\" Cixian said, \\"Hard to begin, hard to begin! I can't think"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":5,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"错的。」子云一想也真没有多少，也就依了。宝珠出了《山门》，子云想了一回，对了《石洞》，也算工稳，贺了一杯。到了王恂、桂保了，王恂出了《弹词》，桂保对了《制谱》。次贤道：「我想这上对，总要新鲜的才好，太平正了觉得不见新奇。」桂保谓王恂道：「我就出个新奇的与你对，是《偷鸡》。」王恂道：「我对《伏虎》。」大家赞道：「却也工稳。」要贺一杯。次贤道：「要贺也可贺，但《偷鸡","en":"with *The Stone Grotto* (石洞). This was deemed acceptably well-matched, earning a toast. Next came the turn of Wang Xun and Guibao. Wang Xun offered *Singing the Ballad* (弹词), and Guibao matched it with *Composing the Score* (制谱). Cixian said, \\"The opening title ought to be fresh. Too straightforward, and there's no surprise.\\" Guibao turned to Wang Xun and said, \\"Let"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴言出了《醉妃》，子玉听得王恂的《伏虎》，就触着了，对了《醒妓》。众人道：「这个对得有趣，满贺一杯。」琴言道：「巧在一醉一醒，这倒难得的。」轮到次贤，次贤道：「我出《撇斗》。」蕙芳道：「好个《撇斗》。」想了一想道：「我对《搜杯》。」次贤道：「也好个《搜杯》，这里面工稳，贺一满杯。","en":"Qinyan then put forward *The Drunken Consort* (醉妃). Wang Xun's earlier title, *Subduing the Tiger* (伏虎), gave Ziyu an idea, and he answered Qinyan with *Sobering the Courtesan* (醒妓). Everyone exclaimed, \\"That pairing is delightful! A full cup all round!\\" Qinyan added, \\"One drunk, the other sober—that's the clever"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":2,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"得牝字？」子玉一想，不觉抚掌大笑道：「妙极，妙极！就是势字才可对得牝字，真是绝对。」琴言与宝珠尚未明白，子云、王恂也想出来了，也笑起来，赞道：「真好心思，把这两字当这两件东西，真是异想天开了。」四旦尚未想出，蕙芳犹呆呆的想，王恂道：「你们尚未想着，你们不知男子阳为势吗？」蕙芳等恍然大悟，便都笑起来，都也说好。蕙芳真喝了三杯，余皆贺一杯。","en":"Only 势 could possibly pair with 牝. A truly perfect match.\\" Qinyan and Baozhu had not yet understood it. Ziyun and Wang Xun, having worked it out, also began laughing and said, \\"A brilliant conceit, to treat those two characters as those two things: a truly inspired stroke of imagination.\\" The four performers had not yet grasped it; Huifang was still sitting blankly thinking."},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":4,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云出了《打店》，宝珠对了《逃关》。宝珠出了《抢娇》，子云对了《杀惜》。都为工稳，贺了一杯。王恂出了《草桥》，桂保对了《麻地》，忽又说道：「这地字还差半个字，我改作《絮阁》罢。」王恂道：「这《絮阁》借对得好，可贺半杯。」桂保出了《花婆》，王恂想了一会，对了《火判》。大家已经赞好要贺，王恂道：「慢着，我还要改。」又改了《草相》，众人道：「更好，新","en":"Beauty* (抢娇), which Ziyun matched with *Killing Poxi* (杀惜). Both were judged good matches and toasted with a cup. Wang Xun brought forth *Grass Bridge* (草桥), and Guibao paired it with *Hemp Ground* (麻地), then suddenly paused. \\"The character for 'ground' here is half a character off,\\" he mused. \\"Let me change it to *The Scolding in the Pavilion* (絮阁).\\" Wang Xun praised the"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":2,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"到了王恂，王恂出了《花鼓》。桂保想来想去，没有对，急得脸都红了。","en":"It was Wang Xun's turn again, and he offered *Flower Drum* (花鼓). Guibao thought and thought, but no match came. He grew so flustered that his face turned red."},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":2,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"王恂催他，桂保道：「不料这个倒没有对的。只有《闻铃》上那个《雨铃》好对，却不是戏目。《草桥》这桥字也不甚对，其余我想不出来，我喝一杯罢。」桂保喝了半杯酒，出了个《跪池》，王恂对了《投井》，大家说好，也贺了半杯。到了子玉，子玉出了《折柳》。子云笑道：「庾香","en":"Wang Xun pressed him. Guibao said, \\"I didn't expect this one to stump me. The only good match is the *Bell in the Rain* (雨铃) in *Hearing the Bells* (闻铃), but that is not an opera title. *Grass Bridge* (草桥) is not really a perfect match either, as the 'bridge'"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"王恂道：「书、信两字甚好。」次贤又道：「我又想了一个《放易》，易字好似信字。」大家齐声赞道：「这个更好，该贺双杯。」各贺了。子云道：「《见鬼》。」大家没有留心。停了一会，宝珠催其出对，子云笑道：「你倒不对，还来催我。」宝珠道：「你还没有出对，叫我对什么呢","en":"Wang Xun said, \\"书 ('book') and 信 ('letter') form a fine pair of characters.\\" Cixian added, \\"I also thought of *Releasing Yi* (放易). Yi works here much as Xin does.\\" Everyone cried out together in praise, \\"That one is even better! It deserves double cups.\\" And"},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":2,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"到了王恂，出了个《冥判》。次贤道：「这不容易。这个判字半虚半实，蕊香只怕要罚酒。」桂保想了一回，道：「有一个好对，就新些，却不是老戏。《空谷香》上有出《佛医》，我对《佛医》。」次贤道：「果然好，非但不罚，还要贺呢。」桂保道：「我想出一个难的来了，我出《惊丑》","en":"It was Wang Xun's turn, and he offered *The Infernal Judge* (冥判). Cixian warned, \\"This is not easy. That word for 'judge' is half concrete and half abstract; Ruixiang may well be penalized.\\" Guibao thought for a while and said, \\"I have a good match, though it comes"},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉道：「这对可以结了，天也不早了。况我一早出来，过迟了恐家慈见问。请以此对收令罢。」王恂道：「也是时候了，对了吃饭罢。」子云道：「且看，其实天还早呢。」子玉道：「既要叙几天，也宜留些精神在明日，今日早散为妙。」子玉见琴言有些倦意，故要收令。子云只得依了。子玉道：「我出个三字对罢。」遂出了《飞熊梦》。众人道：「三个字就难些，好对的也少得很","en":"out early this morning. If I stay much longer, my mother may ask what kept me. Let us close with this pairing.\\" Wang Xun agreed, \\"It is time. After the pairing, let us eat.\\" Ziyun protested, \\"Wait, it is actually still quite early.\\" Ziyu countered, \\"We plan to meet for several days. Let's save some energy for tomorrow and break up early today.\\" In truth, Ziyu had noticed"},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子，是六十四个戏目。也费了好些心，喝了几十杯酒，各有醉意，便也不能再饮。三杯之后，吃过了饭，略坐了一坐，子玉、王恂告辞，子云又约了明日。到明日又添了文泽、春航，名旦中也添了几个，又在怡园叙了一日。陆素兰单请子玉、琴言二人，又叙了一日，这一日清谈小叙，更为有趣。一连叙了三日，子玉也心满意足，人也乏了。徐子云要请屈道生，却好史南湘已到京，作一个诗酒大会。子玉不能推辞","en":"could drink no more. After drinking the three toasts, they had their meal, sat for a while, and then Ziyu and Wang Xun took their leave. Ziyun invited them back for the following day. The next day, Wenze and Chunhang joined the party, as did several more of the famous performers, and they spent another day together at the Garden of Contentment. Lu Sulan gave a small"}],"38":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":4,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"且说徐子云请了屈公来，并请南湘、仲清、文泽、春航、王恂、子玉作陪，仍在梅崦中。王恂是日为孙亮功请去有事，因李元茂吉期已定，要招赘过来。亮功因两位贤郎是不懂事的，一切皆托王恂料理，王恂所以不能前来。","en":"To return to our story: Xu Ziyun had invited Master Qu to attend, with Nanxiang, Zhongqing, Wenze, Chunhang, Wang Xun, and Ziyu as companions, again in the Plum Knoll. Wang Xun on this particular day had been called away by Sun Lianggong on an important matter: the wedding date had been fixed for Li Yuanmao, who was to be adopted into the Sun household as a son-in-law."}],"39":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":2,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说王恂前日不能赴怡园之约，因为孙亮功请去商办喜事，也替他张罗了几天。定于二月初十日招赘，也不多几天了。新年李性全寄了几百两银子来与元茂，并写个禀帖与王文辉，要替他儿子办喜事。王文辉不耐烦作媒，俱令王恂代劳。李元茂求着了魏聘才，求其代制一切。魏聘才闹了一个多","en":"To return to our story: Wang Xun had been unable to keep his appointment at the Garden of Contentment the other day, for Sun Lianggong had engaged him to help arrange the wedding, and he had spent several days running about on the matter. The ceremony was set for the tenth day of the"},{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"聘才明日去拜王文辉，文辉进衙门去了，王恂接待。又同去见了亮功，说了些客套，无非是现在客途，无人照料，一切尚求包涵等语。亮功道：「原是爱亲结亲，这些烦文，一概删去。我也不要破费他一钱，一切在我就是了。」即留聘才吃饭。","en":"The following day Pincai called on Wang Wenhui, but Wenhui had gone into the yamen; Wang Xun received him instead. They then went together to pay their respects to Lianggong, exchanged the usual pleasantries, mentioning that they were currently sojourning away from home with no one to look after things, and begged for his forbearance. Lianggong"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"家人料理，备了两桌酒，一席送颜夫人，一席待媒人，并请子玉、颜仲清作陪。仲清道：「元兄今夕真个到了群玉山头了。」王恂道：「一路荣华到白头。」子玉道：「犹道灯前相对影，愈揉双眼愈模糊。」此是近视眼洞房诗，今日可为元兄咏矣。」元茂道：「我说倒是近视眼好，就新人丑些，也看不清楚。」仲清道：「若美的呢，可不孤负了？」元茂笑道：「我这新人想来未必能美。我也有些风闻，只要不像","en":"keep them company. Zhongqing said, \\"Brother Yuan, tonight you truly arrive at the summit of the Jade Mountain.\\" Wang Xun said, \\"A life of glory and splendor all the way to white-haired age.\\" Ziyu said, \\"'Still they say the lamplight shows two shadows face to face, the more you rub your eyes, the blurrier they grow.' That is a poem about a nearsighted man in the bridal"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":3,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"元茂与新娘拜了花烛，送入新房，坐床撒帐，饮了交杯，复又请新郎上席，坐了华筵。那嗣徽、嗣元陪了一回，王恂、仲清即要移席到新房中畅饮。大家进了新房，仲清道：「今日可以看新人的。」便要走到床前。床前本有两个伴送的老妇人，还有两个小丫鬟侍立。嗣元恐怕仲清看了他的姐姐，便跑到床前把帐门把住，口内连说了几个「看」字，然后挣出「不得」两字，惹得众人都笑了。王恂扯了","en":"groom was called back out to sit at the great banquet table. Sihui and Siyuan kept them company for a while, until Wang Xun and Zhongqing proposed moving the party into the bridal chamber to drink more freely. Everyone filed into the bridal chamber. Zhongqing said, \\"Tonight we get to look at the new bride,\\" and made as if to approach the bed. By the bed stood two elderly"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":4,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"姬亮轩与王恂、仲清是见过几回的了，子玉却是初见，心中想道：「这个梅少爷好相貌，比起那孙老徽来，倒似那戏上岑彭、马武了。」聘才问姬亮轩道：「好几天不见你东家出来，在家里作什么？」亮轩道：「这两天敝东有点贵恙，不便行动。」聘才道：「什么贵恙？」亮轩道：「听得腿上生了","en":"Ji Liangxuan had met Wang Xun and Zhongqing on several previous occasions, but this was his first meeting with Ziyu, whom he eyed with private admiration: \\"This young master Mei is a fine-looking man. Set beside that Sun Sihui, who might be Cen Peng or Ma Wu straight off the stage.\\""},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":2,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"今日还是头一回识荆。如高兴，歇天何不到敝东处来走走，敝东是极好相与的。」子玉不知他的东家是谁，含糊答应。即私问王恂，王恂答以奚十一，子玉便是一腔忿恨，也不理他。亮轩又向元茂道：「舍表妹贤德无双，李大哥真有福气，结了这头好亲。我们太亲翁不久外放，不是四川夔州府，就是湖南辰州府。李大哥是娇客，将来同到任上，不要说是账房，只怕内外一切都要仰仗呢。」仲清听了好笑，忍不住","en":"agreeable person.\\" Ziyu, not knowing whose household was being spoken of, gave a vague reply, then quietly asked Wang Xun, who answered that it was Xi Eleven. A sudden surge of indignation filled Ziyu and he said nothing more. Liangxuan then turned to Yuanmao: \\"Your future wife, my cousin's cousin on the other side, is a paragon of virtue, Brother Li is truly fortunate"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":2,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"人算我本家，个个算我亲戚么？」龙王大惊道：「快些放他去罢，不然他要与我攀亲了，不要攀出蛤蟆亲戚来。」说得聘才、王恂、子玉几乎笑倒。嗣徽与亮轩知道是骂他们，因回答不出来，只好忍气。嗣元见骂了他们，倒反笑起来，道：「好、好个王八亲戚，好、好个蛤蟆亲、亲、亲戚。」王恂道：「我也有个笑话。一个妓女是个瞎子，有人去嫖他，他虽看不见，却分得人的等次来。那一天接了三个客，老鸨","en":"he linger, he will soon claim kinship with me, and I have no desire for a toad as a cousin.\\"' At this, Pincai, Wang Xun, and Ziyu nearly fell off their seats laughing. Sihui and Liangxuan, knowing themselves to be the butt of the joke and having no reply, had to swallow their indignation. Siyuan, however, seeing those two mocked, laughed all the louder. \\"A f-f-fine turtle"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"过了几日，元茂谢媒拜客，听得王恂、仲清问他的新人怎样得意，不说别样，总说的是头发。有的说是白丝细发，有的说是银丝鹤发，总不懂什么意思。人家见他得意，也是诧异。","en":"a few days, when Yuanmao was making the rounds of thanks to the matchmakers and paying calls on well-wishers, Wang Xun and Zhongqing asked him how he found his new wife. He said nothing about anything else, but kept talking about hair, one person said it was white silk-fine hair, another said it was silver thread and crane feathers, and no one could make out what he"}],"43":[{"paragraph":3,"mentions":1,"tokens":["庸庵"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"坐了。琴言道：「你早上那里去？」素兰道：「今早王大人叫我去，我当是什么紧要事，原来很不要紧的一句话。我与剑潭、庸庵谈了一会，方才到家。知道你请我，不知有何差委？」宝珠将方才的话与素兰讲了，素兰拍手笑道：「果然，果然不出我们所料！我真佩服他。据我说是出师的妙，你且应承他出师。」琴言道：「好容易的话，你倒轻轻的一口断定了。这三千头打那里来，我岂能去对华公子讲的？」素","en":"thought it must be something urgent, but it turned out to be quite a trifling matter. I had a chat with Jiantan and Yong'an, and only just got home. I heard you had sent for me. What is it you need?\\" Baozhu repeated everything that had just been discussed. Sulan clapped his hands and laughed: \\"Just as I thought! Just as I predicted! I truly admire him. My view is that release"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":1,"tokens":["庸庵"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"、香畹三人可以凑得六百金，王氏弟兄、佩仙、庾香可以凑得四百金。」次贤道：「我来一分，出二百金，前舟可出三百金，庸庵、竹君二人可出三百金。庾香、湘帆、剑潭不必派他，凑起来已得一千八百了。若要三千，还少一千二百两，不消说是度香包圆了。」子云道：「难道华星北倒干干净净，一文不花，这么便宜。」蕙芳道：「据我说，不必要他出钱。如今与他讲，就是一总要他拿出来，他也肯，但是玉","en":"hundred.\\" \\"I shall contribute my share of two hundred taels,\\" said Cixian, \\"and Qianzhou can put in three hundred; Yong'an and Zhujun together can provide three hundred. We need not call on Yuxiang, Xiangfan, or Jiantan. All told we would have one thousand eight hundred. If three thousand is the target, we are still short one thousand two hundred, which means, it goes without"}],"45":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"昨日子云又请了屈道生、梅子玉、史南湘、颜仲清、田春航、刘文泽、王恂等，并有诸名旦全来，会了一日。因南湘、春航次早要入场，所以散得甚早。","en":"before, Ziyun had once again invited Qu Daosheng, Mei Ziyu, Shi Nanxiang, Yan Zhongqing, Tian Chunhang, Liu Wenze, Wang Xun, and others. Together with all the leading actors, they had gathered for an entire day. Since Nanxiang and Chunhang were to enter the examination hall the following morning, the gathering disbanded quite early."},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"颜夫人是从没有阻过他的。子玉到了辰刻，因是仙坛，衣冠而去。是日一早，屈道生同金吉甫先到，随后颜仲清、刘文泽、王恂一齐都来了，子玉到了，各人与吉甫相见，叙了些彼此仰慕的话。只有史南湘、田春航在场中未来。相公们到的是宝珠、蕙芳、素兰、玉林、漱芳、兰保、桂保、春喜、琪官、连琴言刚是十人。","en":"Early that morning, Qu Daosheng and Jin Jifu had already arrived. They were followed by Yan Zhongqing, Liu Wenze, Wang Xun, and finally Ziyu. They exchanged words of long admiration with Jifu. Shi Nanxiang and Tian Chunhang were still at the examination grounds. Among the performers who came were Baozhu, Huifang, Sulan, Yulin, Shufang, Lanbao, Guibao, Chunxi, and Qiguan."},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":2,"tokens":["庸庵","王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"刘晨子晋求仙去，十丈红尘阻前路。\\n均是龙华会上人，名场同日欣知遇。\\n次贤道：「这是前舟、庸庵了。」众人说是。王恂道：「我们这些人都说完了，看以后还说谁。」只见又写道：","en":"guests at Dragon-Flower feast,\\nSame day they knew joy in fame's bright field.\\"\\nCixian noted, \\"That is Qianzhou and Yong'an.\\" Wang Xun added, \\"We've all been named. Let's see who follows.\\" Next:"},{"paragraph":41,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云便请入席。第一席是道生、子玉、吉甫、王胡子、琴言，二席是仲清、文泽、王恂、子云、次贤，九个名旦分为两桌，各自叙齿坐了三、四两席。琴言坐在下手，拘拘谨谨，也不举箸，甚觉可怜。倒是道生体恤他，道：「凡遇热闹场中，当言的即言，也不必过于拘谨，但存着个后辈的分寸就是了。」","en":"table. The first table sat Daosheng, Ziyu, Jifu, Old Wang Beard, and Qinyan. The second seated Zhongqing, Wenze, Wang Xun, Ziyun, and Cixian. The nine actors split two more tables by age. Qinyan sat quietly at the foot, his chopsticks untouched, looking pitifully constrained. Daosheng comforted him gently. \\"In lively gatherings, speak when speech is due. Do not bind yourself"}],"46":[{"paragraph":3,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"诸名士于二十八日早上陆续皆到。是日子玉、春航、南湘、仲清、文泽、王恂，共是六位，惟吉甫因感冒未到。园内屈氏父子，与次贤、主人四位，都在含万楼下坐了。道翁道：「这个含万楼是本《易经》「含万物而化光」句摘下，因为园中的主楼，故取此名。但就本意是言干道之大，此名似乎不甚相宜，度香以为何如？我见楼上现供着赐书，何不就改为赐书","en":"On the twenty-eighth morning the gentlemen arrived piecemeal: Ziyu, Chunhang, Nanxiang, Zhongqing, Wenze and Wang Xun—six—while Jifu stayed home with a chill. The Qu father and son, Cixian and their host — four in all — sat below the Tower of Myriad Containment. Daoweng explained: \\"This tower borrows from the *Book of Changes*: 'embracing the myriad things, transforming"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"到别处去。」仲清笑道：「有先生的珠玉在前，我等实难附尾，不过聊以塞责而已。」文泽道：「此处我竟没有来游玩过。」王恂道：「我也没有，到护香廊就住了。」南湘道：「我去年看菊花，是从这里走过，倒游了一游。」子云引道，过了一座木桥，从竹林走出，是片空地，有几间敞厅，立着鹄棚，旁边还有一条马路，望东北上编些竹篱，高高矮矮，护着几处屋宇。同到了里头，内中摆设俱极雅淡，署名曰","en":"follow at the tail; it is only to fill the gap.\\" Wenze said, \\"I have never once come and looked at this place.\\" Wang Xun said, \\"Nor I. I always stopped at the colonnade.\\" Nanxiang said, \\"I came through here last year to see the chrysanthemums, and did have a look round.\\"\\n\\nZiyun led the way over a wooden bridge and out through the bamboo to an open piece of ground with"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":2,"tokens":["庸庵","王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"修竹径，一条荔枝街，又过了几处神仙洞，望东走，到了萧次贤的梨院来。道翁道：「可不必进去了，梨院可改为卧云香院，庸庵兄请题一联。」王恂一面想，随着走到了海棠春圃来。子云道：「且请坐坐，喝杯茶，那边又要用船了。」都进了海棠春圃坐下。道翁道：「海棠花为花中艳品，还有那些紫白丁香衬贴他，更觉香色兼备，须好好起他个名字才好。」即笑对琴仙道：「我看你于那些诗词上也还明白，我","en":"said, \\"There is no need to go in. The Pear Court may be changed to the Fragrant Court of Reclining Clouds. Brother Yong'an, a couplet, if you please.\\"\\n\\nWang Xun was still thinking as they walked on to the Crabapple Spring Garden, and Ziyun said, \\"Sit a while and take a cup of tea; we shall want the boat again after this.\\" They all went into the Crabapple Spring Garden and"},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"真好！这沉醉二字，用得入神入妙。」道翁也点点头，道：「也难为他。」又道：「你还能作一副对子么？」琴仙正要回言，王恂已写了卧云香院的对子出来，看是：","en":"remarkably well.\\" Then he asked, \\"Can you also compose a couplet for it?\\" Qinxian was just about to answer when Wang Xun finished writing the couplet for the Fragrant Court of Reclining Clouds and brought it forward. They read:"},{"paragraph":48,"mentions":2,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这个平泉庄胜于古人多矣。」便数今天添的对子，已有了二十二副，内有最多者是子玉与他自己，其余也有两副的，惟文泽、王恂只有一副，未免不公，于是烦王恂、文泽各撰一副，又改稻庄为红雪西庄。先是文泽念了出来，是：","en":"were twenty-two of them, of which Ziyu and he himself had the most, and the others two apiece; only Wenze and Wang Xun had but one each, which was hardly fair. So he asked Wenze and Wang Xun each to compose another, and changed the rice hamlet to the Red Snow West Manor. Wenze recited his first:"},{"paragraph":49,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"梅雨平添瓜蔓水，豆花新带稻香风。\\n王恂也念了两句，是：","en":"Plum-rain swells melon-creeper channels; bean-blossom brings fresh rice-field breeze.\\nWang Xun then offered his pair:"},{"paragraph":52,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"牡丹花，更为绚烂。已撤了护花的幛子。子云备了两席，一席是道翁、南湘、子玉、琴仙、次贤，一席是仲清、春航、文泽、王恂、子云。","en":"gone. Two tables waited—one for Daoweng, Nanxiang, Ziyu, Qinxian, Cixian; one for Zhongqing, Chunhang, Wenze, Wang Xun, Ziyun."},{"paragraph":53,"mentions":1,"tokens":["庸庵"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"来相体裁衣，二来是各人的性灵。今日高超的是剑潭，沉着的是竹君，细腻风光的是庾香，风华绮丽的是湘帆，秀润工稳的是庸庵、前舟，潇洒跌宕的是静宜，就是度香那副集句，也觉得落落大方。正是各人自立一帜，无从评定甲乙。你们看这二十四副对子，好在虚字少，尽是实字多，便见得力量。若教外边那些名宿做起来，不知要添多少虚字在里头，才凑得成、捏得拢呢。」众名士一齐佩服。子云道：「先生","en":"Jiantan is the lofty one; Zhujun the weighty; Yuxiang has the delicate scene; Xiangfan the rich and splendid; Yong'an and Qianzhou the polished and well-turned; Jingyi the free and unconstrained; and even Duxiang's set of borrowed lines has an easy largeness about it. Each has planted his own banner, and there is no ranking them first and second.\\n\\n\\"Look at these twenty-four"}],"48":[{"paragraph":26,"mentions":2,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"仙转约子玉于初六日同去。琴仙应了，果然把子玉请了出来。子玉那日先到文辉处拜寿，耽搁了一早晨，吃了面，即便辞回。王恂留住不放，陆夫人也留他。子玉是一腔心事，如何留得住？只得将实话悄悄的告诉了仲清。仲清与王恂说了，方才放他出来。","en":"celebrate Wenhui's birthday and was delayed for hours; after eating longevity noodles, he tried to excuse himself, but Wang Xun and Madam Lu firmly insisted he stay. Burdened with a heart full of sorrowful thoughts, he found it impossible to remain. He quietly confided the truth to Zhongqing, who then spoke to Wang Xun, finally securing Ziyu's release."},{"paragraph":36,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"百，道翁的盘费很富足了。子云、次贤各备车马跟着，一直送出城外，直到十里之外皇华亭。只见南湘、仲清、文泽、金粟、王恂、子玉、春航，领着那蕙芳、宝珠、素兰、漱芳、玉林、兰保、桂保、琪官、春喜九个名旦，在皇华亭等候。道翁等连忙下车，极口辞谢。各人皆要把盏。","en":"Imperial Envoys' Pavilion, ten miles away. Waiting there at the pavilion were Nanxiang, Zhongqing, Wenze, Jin Su, Wang Xun, Ziyu, and Chunhang, alongside Huifang and the nine famous performers: Baozhu, Sulan, Shufang, Yulin, Lanbao, Guibao, Qiguan, and Chunxi. Daoweng hurried down from his carriage and thanked everyone repeatedly, as they all eagerly wished to raise a cup"}],"50":[{"paragraph":5,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"竹与几笔花卉，山水尚是乱画的，草虫他更不会。此时说我比他好，我也不安，将来或者赶得上他。」正说话间，只见仲清、王恂同着琪官、桂保进来。","en":"makes me uneasy, but perhaps in the future, I might catch up to him.\\" Just as they were speaking, Zhongqing and Wang Xun walked in, accompanied by Qiguan and Guibao."},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":1,"tokens":["庸庵"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"文泽见了大喜，问道：「怎么今日不约而同，都到这里来？」仲清道：「庸庵要到蕊香那里去，却遇见玉艳，想同到新开的庄子里去坐坐。见你的车在门口，所以进来。」文泽道：「莫非就是那唐和尚开的安吉堂么？闻得那地方倒好，他又将寺里的几间房子也通了过去，我们就去。」春喜道：「怪热的天，在这里不好吗？」桂保道：「那里也好，内中有几间屋","en":"asked, \\"How is it that you all arrived together here today, without even arranging it?\\" Zhongqing explained, \\"Yong'an was on his way to see Ruixiang, but ran into Yuyan. We thought we might go sit for a while at the newly opened establishment. Seeing your carriage parked outside, we decided to come in here first.\\" Wenze guessed, \\"Could it be the 'Anji Hall' opened by"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":2,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"那一幅画甚离奇，是画的张生游寺。文泽等又笑了一阵。掌柜的进来张罗了一会，亲手倒了几杯茶出去，遂换走堂进来点菜。王恂道：「这里的生炒翅子、烧鸭子是出名的，就要这两样。」各人又分要了好些，皆是凉菜多，热菜少。走堂的先摆上酒杯、小菜，果碟倒也精致。送上陈绍、木瓜、百花、惠泉四壶酒来，放下一搭纸片。那边桌上点了一盘小盘香，中间一个冰桶，拿了些西瓜、鲜核桃、杏仁、大桃儿、","en":"personally pouring them several cups of tea before retreating, replaced by a waiter who came in to take their orders. Wang Xun said, \\"Their stir-fried shark fin and roast duck are famous here; we must have those two.\\" The others each ordered their favorites, favoring cold dishes over hot ones in the summer heat. The waiter first set out the wine cups and delicate small dishes,"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":3,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一日，我请他们叙了半日，虽然彼此啼哭，却也还劝得住，不料至皇华亭，彼此变成这形象，我此时想起，还替他们伤心。」王恂道：「那天幸是没有生人在那里，若有生人见了他们这个光景，岂不好笑？玉侬倒还遮饰得过，有他们一班人送他，自然离别之间，倒应如此的。就是庾香遮饰不来，直着眼睛，拉他上车，还挣着不动，又有那一哭，到底为着什么事来？幸亏度香催道翁走了，不然，他见了也要猜疑。","en":"Envoys' Pavilion, they would be reduced to such a state. Even now, thinking back on it, my heart aches for them.\\" Wang Xun added, \\"Thank goodness there were no strangers present that day. If any outsiders had witnessed that scene, wouldn't it have been laughable? Yunong managed to keep his composure somewhat—surrounded by so many friends sending him off, such deep sorrow"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"桂保对王恂道：「从前我在怡园，行那一个字化作三个字的令，你一个也没有想得出来。我如今又想了一个拆字法，分作四柱，叫做旧管、新收、开除、实在四项。譬如这个酒字…」一面说，一面在桌子上写道：「旧管一个酉字，新收一个三点水，便成了一个酒字。开除了酉字中间的一字，实在","en":"Guibao turned to Wang Xun and said, \\"Back in the Garden of Contentment, when we played that game of turning one character into three, you couldn't come up with a single one. Well, I've just thought of a new character-dissection game. It's divided into four columns: 'Old Stock',"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"桂保道：「好，说得剪截。」文泽道：「旧管是个圭字，新收一个木字，是桂字。开除了土字，实在是杜字。」王恂道：「旧管是个寺字，新收一个言字，是诗字。开除了土字，实在是讨字。」桂保道：「这个比从前的田字讲得好了。我说旧管是个一字，新收一个史字，是吏字。开除了口字，实在是丈字。」","en":"Intake' is 'wood' (木), forming gui (桂, osmanthus). 'Remove' 'earth' (土), and the 'Actual Remainder' is du (杜).\\" Wang Xun said, \\"The 'Old Stock' is 'temple' (寺). The 'New Intake' is 'speech' (言), forming 'poetry' (诗). 'Remove' 'earth' (土), and the 'Actual Remainder' is 'demand' (讨).\\" Guibao noted, \\"This is much better than his explanation of the character tian (田) from"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"文泽笑道：「正是汝字。」桂保道：「太不自然，要罚一杯。」文泽笑道：「不与你们来了。」饮了一杯，王恂道：「旧管是眇字，新收三点水，是渺字，开除了目字，实在是沙字。」桂保道：「旧管是士字，新收了口字，是吉字。开除了一字，实在是个古字。」文泽道：「这张口可惜生下了些，凑不拢，也要抬上些才好。」众人皆笑。桂保道：「这个批评未免吹毛求疵。就算略差些，也用不","en":"drink a penalty cup.\\" Wenze, still laughing, conceded, \\"I'm not playing with you all anymore,\\" and drank his cup. Wang Xun took his turn: \\"The 'Old Stock' is 'blind' (眇). The 'New Intake' is the three water drops (氵), forming 'vast' (渺). 'Remove' 'eye' (目), and the 'Actual Remainder' is 'sand' (沙).\\" Guibao said, \\"The 'Old Stock' is 'scholar' (士). The 'New Intake' is 'mouth'"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":2,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"娶韩丞相之女为妻，一旦把奴休了，是令人气愤不过等。」把他头一段口白分作三段，这就通身文气都接了。」仲清、文泽、王恂道：「这都改得好，但如今讲究唱昆腔的也不少，怎么就不晓得这些毛病呢？」春喜道：「唱清曲的人，原不用口白，他来改正他做什么？唱戏曲的课师，教曲时总是先教曲文，后将口白接写一篇，挤在一处，没有分开段落，所以沿袭下来，总是这样。」众人正在谈得高兴，只听那间","en":"three separate sections, the emotional current runs smoothly through the entire scene.\\" Zhongqing, Wenze, and Wang Xun praised him, \\"Those revisions are brilliant! But since there are so many who study Kunqu deeply these days, how is it they don't recognize these flaws?\\" Chunxi sighed, \\"Those who sing 'pure songs' (qingqu) don't use spoken text anyway, so why would they"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":2,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一样，必恭必敬，不当我们是个和尚，少了头发看待。不像那个什么琴相公，在华府里的，见人板着脸，一点笑容也没有。」王恂道：「方才里头吹唱的是谁？」唐和尚道：「那就是魏大爷。」文泽道：「那个魏大爷？」仲清道：「魏聘才在这里作寓。」唐和尚道：「魏大爷，想少爷们都认识的。」王恂道：「认识之至。」唐和尚道：「这个人真好，真是个满场飞。近来他也要出京了。方才是杨八爷、张、顾二","en":"the Hua household? Always walking around with a stiff, wooden face, never offering a single smile to anyone.\\" Wang Xun asked, \\"Who was that singing and playing the flute in the room next door just now?\\" Tang replied, \\"Oh, that was Master Wei.\\" Wenze pressed, \\"Which Master Wei?\\" Zhongqing clarified, \\"Wei Pincai is lodging here.\\" Tang said, \\"Master Wei! I imagine you young"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":2,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这也算深于情了。」仲清道：「吉甫的人本沈静高雅，于这些文玩无上无不精通。」大家谈论，日已西沉，文泽等也要散了，王恂叫走堂的报账，文泽又抢作东，两人争执，谦让一回。唐和尚对着走堂的把嘴扭了一扭，走堂的出去交代了柜上，进来说道：「这帐两位少爷不用争会，唐大爷已会过了。」文泽道：「这怎么说？」王恂道：「断无此理。」唐和尚笑道：「些须敬意，三位少爷肯赏脸，常来坐坐就沾光","en":"mastered.\\" As they conversed, the sun began to sink in the west, and Wenze and the others prepared to depart. Wang Xun called the waiter to settle the bill, but Wenze fiercely insisted on playing the host, and the two playfully argued back and forth, each yielding to the other. Monk Tang subtly twisted his mouth in a signal to the waiter, who stepped out to the front"}],"51":[{"paragraph":26,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"孙亮功到领凭之后，即到通州写了四个太平船赴任，自然的一样饯行热闹。惟有王恂的夫人，见父亲哥嫂一齐出京，未免凄凉悲苦，在母家住了几日。陆夫人也疼爱到十分，又不能带他赴任，只好劝慰他一番。元茂与孙氏是同去的。元茂外间有些亏空，这两天追逼起来，孙氏虽有些妆资，但不肯与元茂花消。元茂问他要钱时，便骂起来，说：「不是叫相公，就是嫖婊","en":"journey to his new post. Naturally, this was accompanied by the usual lively rounds of farewell banquets. Only Wang Xun's wife, seeing her father, brothers, and sister-in-law all departing the capital at once, felt an acute sense of desolate sorrow, and chose to stay at her maternal home for a few days. Madam Lu loved her daughter dearly, but unable to bring her along"},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"明日，元茂没法，只得老了面皮去找王恂借了四十金，说是娶亲时欠下的帐，到了安徽即行寄还，才把那些零星馆子帐、相公开发及婊子嫖钱还个清楚。也到各处辞了行，遂同丈人出了京，到了凤阳府，住了一月，同着孙氏到他父亲任上去了。","en":"The following day, cornered and out of options, Yuanmao was forced to swallow his pride and seek out Wang Xun. He borrowed forty taels of gold, falsely claiming it was a lingering debt from his marriage and promising to remit the funds as soon as he reached Anhui. With this, he finally managed to clear his scattered tavern tabs, the fees owed to the actors,"}],"52":[{"paragraph":3,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"是联珠班。春航陪着一班名士在花园挹爽斋观演联锦班。那一天大媒是徐子云，客是萧次贤、高品、南湘、颜仲清、刘文泽、王恂、梅子玉。近日子玉病已好了，勉强打起精神出来。这八个名旦不消说都在园中，那聚星堂上一个也不去，尽是一班中年的脚色，与那些寻常的旦脚，在那里应酬。","en":"matchmaker that day was Xu Ziyun, and the guests included Xiao Cixian, Gao Pin, Nanxiang, Yan Zhongqing, Liu Wenze, Wang Xun, and Mei Ziyu. Ziyu had only recently recovered from his illness, forcing himself to rally his spirits to attend. Naturally, all eight famous dan actors remained in the garden; not a single one went to the Gathering Stars Hall, which was left entirely"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"华公子又与高品、南湘、仲清、王恂、文泽、次贤各讲了些话，知高品才从苏州来，问了些江苏风景。偶然见素兰的扇子一面画的甚细，要了过来，看了一会。又见那一面写着小楷，题目是《断肠词》。华公子道：「肠何可以轻断？」子玉见了，又觉不安。华公子低低吟了一遍，又问素兰道：「这是你自己的么？」素兰","en":"Young Master Hua then conversed with Gao Pin, Nanxiang, Zhongqing, Wang Xun, Wenze, and Cixian. Learning that Gao Pin had just arrived from Suzhou, he asked about the landscapes of Jiangsu. By chance, he noticed Sulan holding a fan with exceedingly delicate painting on one side and asked to look at it. Turning it over, he saw"}],"54":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"太省也省不来，外面的排场是必要的。剑潭倒还明白，表妹一切吩咐他就是了。」坐一坐，别了颜夫人回去，将子玉、仲清、王恂托了刘尚书保了。","en":"what is all this being sure or not sure? That much rests with me; cousin need not trouble herself. Jiantan and Xun are both going, and we can ask the same patron to recommend them together.\\"\\n\\nLady Yan said, \\"As to Ziyu's marriage, I really know nothing of these things and have nobody to manage them. I must beg my cousin to tell me plainly what ought to be done, and"},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":3,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，皆依元韵。这三场子玉甚是得意，第一试共有八百人，就贴去了五百，第二场止三百名了，第三场出榜时，只取了六十名。王恂已被落，高品取在四十九，仲清取在二十七，子玉取在第二。另期殿试，子玉文星照命，也占鳌头，共取了三十二名。仲清、高品才高运蹇，皆被落。此科最年轻者就是子玉一人，授了编修之职，颜夫人好不喜欢。正是身经三试，压倒群英，比中状元难得多了。子玉见仲清、高品、王","en":"session one, five hundred were cut; after session two, only three hundred remained; after session three, only sixty. Wang Xun was eliminated; Gao Pin placed forty-ninth, Zhongqing twenty-seventh, and Ziyu second. At palace-level final selection, Ziyu's star burned bright: he took top place and, among thirty-two selected, was appointed compiler. Zhongqing and Gao Pin, talented"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一日，王恂的妻子孙佩秋与仲清的妻子蓉华，到琼华房里来贺喜，蓉华道：「妹夫恭喜，压倒了天下英才。如今是玉堂金马，才子神仙，比今科鼎甲还要体面了好些，这是妹妹的福气，我如何比得上来？」佩秋讲道：「二姑爷真是天下第一个才子，我听这些赴考宏词，从前中过鼎甲，点过翰林的","en":"One day Sun Peiqiu, Wang Xun's wife, and Ronghua, Zhongqing's wife, came to Qionghua's room to offer their congratulations. Ronghua said, \\"Joy to you, little sister! Your husband-to-be has borne down all the finest talents under heaven. Now he belongs to the Jade Hall and Golden"},{"paragraph":41,"mentions":1,"tokens":["庸庵"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"玉。子玉只得赔笑道：「这事也不用讲他，横竖久后自知，也不须分辩的。我今日见着度香，说他夫人要请你去赏菊花，还请庸庵与剑潭的夫人，并众相好的夫人。你去不去呢？」琼华道：「我不去罢。」子玉道：「为什么不愿去？」琼华道：「一来我也才过来，还没有满月。二来也要等太太吩咐，如太太去，我就跟了去。」子玉道：「他们不请太太，单请你们一辈人。度香并说他夫人讲的，日子还没有定，要","en":"defenses. Today I saw Duxiang, who said his wife wants to invite you to view chrysanthemums, inviting the wives of Yong'an and Jiantan and other close friends. Will you go?\\" Qionghua said she would probably not go. Why? \\"First, I have just come over and a month hasn't passed. Second, I must wait for Madam's instructions; if Madam goes, I will follow.\\" Ziyu said they were"}],"57":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"月初十日，请了华公子的夫人苏浣香、田春航的夫人浣兰、刘文泽的夫人吴紫烟、颜仲清的夫人王蓉华、梅子玉的夫人琼华、王恂的夫人孙佩秋。此时园中菊花开满，五色斑烂。是日晴光和蔼，风不扬尘，小毛衣服都用不着，绵的尽够了。袁绮香一早带了十二红婢，还有几个家人媳妇，先到园里候客。那日次贤、高品、南湘皆回避了。那十二红都是十五六岁，有的已是云鬓堆鸦，有的还是垂髫刷翠，却一样的盈","en":"wife, Huanlan; Liu Wenze's wife, Wu Ziyan; Yan Zhongqing's wife, Wang Ronghua; Mei Ziyu's wife, Qionghua; and Wang Xun's wife, Sun Peiqiu. By this time, the garden's chrysanthemums were in full bloom, a brilliant tapestry of five colors. The day's sunlight was gentle, the wind stirred no dust, and light fur garments were unneeded as padded clothes provided ample warmth."}],"60":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"又到元宵，六街三市，火树银花，好不热闹。子云于十三日请了华公子、田春航、梅子玉、史南湘、高品、颜仲清、刘文泽、王恂、萧次贤、金粟、屈勤先，并九香园诸人，作一大会。琴仙见了华公子，尚有些不安，华公子也不问起前事，以礼相待。此时琴仙已出了旦党，入了士党，但从前作旦时傲睨一切，此刻倒谦谦自守起来，因此上下诸人更加尊重他，绝没有一个人笑他。琴仙对了那些名旦，还是从前一样","en":"grand gathering for Young Master Hua, Tian Chunhang, Mei Ziyu, Shi Nanxiang, Gao Pin, Yan Zhongqing, Liu Wenze, Wang Xun, Xiao Cixian, Jin Su, Qu Qinxian, and the entire company of Nine-Fragrance Garden. Seeing Young Master Hua, Qinxian still felt a trace of unease, yet Hua asked nothing of past affairs, treating him with utmost courtesy. By now, Qinxian had left the circle"},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"后就缀小传一篇。刻石之后，可以拓出来，或裱册页，或裱手卷，皆可传世。」文泽道：「做两块好，就镶嵌在东西两楹。」王恂道：「若画杜仙女，就画他在采莲船上的样子。」吉甫道：「玉侬梦见那面镜子，必非无因。我画条龙执着这面镜子，就做头幅，好不好？」大家说道：「好。」子玉道：「这云龙人必猜有个寓意在里头呢。」子云道：「这十一篇传赞，各人分了罢。」次贤道：「好。这一番大著作倒","en":"generations.\\" Wenze suggested, \\"It would be best to make two stone panels, inset into the eastern and western pillars.\\" Wang Xun added, \\"If painting Fairy Du, paint her as she appeared on the lotus-picking boat.\\" Jifu said, \\"Yunong's dream of that mirror cannot be without meaning. I shall paint a dragon holding that mirror for the opening panel—how does that sound?\\" Everyone voiced"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"法，子云拈了道翁，子玉拈了杜仙女、琴仙，金粟拈了宝珠，春航拈了蕙芳，仲清拈了琪官，文泽拈了春喜，南湘拈了兰保，王恂拈了桂保，高品拈了玉林，次贤拈了漱芳，单拈不着素兰，只好送与华公子去作了。众人分派已定，子玉说道：「做传容易，画画难，还要刻石，更须时日，不知几天可以告成？」吉甫道：「不消多日，碑是磨现成的，一面画，一面就叫季十矮子找人刻，大约十几天是必要的，嵌好这","en":"Qinxian; Jin Su drew Baozhu; Chunhang drew Huifang; Zhongqing drew Qiguan; Wenze drew Chunxi; Nanxiang drew Lanbao; Wang Xun drew Guibao; Gao Pin drew Yulin; and Cixian drew Shufang. Sulan alone was not drawn, so that assignment was sent to Young Master Hua. The tasks distributed, Ziyu said, \\"Writing biographies is easy, but painting is difficult, and carving stone takes even"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王恂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"蟾宫花史王仙。知是桂保，有王恂五古一首：","en":"\\"Changong Flower Historian, Immortal Wang.\\" Knowing this was Guibao, he read the five-character ancient verse by Wang Xun:"}]}`),"char-5":JSON.parse(`{"2":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["魏聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"问道：「有谁来了？」仆妇将帖呈上说道：「门上说是家乡来的，现在二门外等回话。」士燮看时，一个全帖上写着：世愚侄魏聘才；一个写着：门下晚学生李元茂。","en":"middle gate for a response.\\" Shixie examined the cards, one read, \\"Your humble nephew of the next generation, Wei Pincai,\\" while the other read, \\"Your devoted later student, Li Yuanmao.\\""},{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["魏聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"士燮道：「这称呼是小门生，不知那里来的？这魏聘才又是谁呢？」王文辉道：「世愚侄，不要是魏老仁的儿子么？」士燮道：「只怕是的，今年夏间接着老仁的信，说要打发他儿子进京弄一小功名，托我收留照应的话。若论老魏人品，实在下作，惟在你我面上，还算有点真情。」文辉道：「若论老魏，原是个上等聪明人，要发科甲也很","en":"pondered, \\"'Your devoted later student', what a peculiar title. I wonder where he hails from? And who might this Wei Pincai be?\\" Wang Wenhui suggested, \\"'Your humble nephew of the next generation', could it be the son of Wei Laoren?\\" Shixie nodded, \\"I suspect you are right. This past summer, I received a letter from Laoren mentioning his intent to send his son to the capital"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":2,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"上首的跄步上前，满面笑容，口称老伯，就跪下叩头。士燮还礼不迭，起来看道：「老世台的尊范，与令尊竟是一模一样。」聘才正要答应，李元茂已高高的作了一个揖，然后徐徐跪下，如拜神的拜了四拜。士燮两手扶起，说道：「你令尊正盼望你来，一路辛苦了。」那李元茂掀唇动齿的咕噜了一句，也听不明白。士燮让他们坐了，聘才道：「家父深感老伯厚恩，铭刻五内，特叫小侄进京来，给老伯与老伯母请","en":"moment, and said, \\"You carry the distinguished bearing of your family, you are the very image of your father.\\" Pincai was about to reply when Li Yuanmao raised his clasped hands high in a sweeping bow, then slowly knelt to prostrate himself four times as though worshipping at a temple altar. Shixie helped him up with both hands, saying, \\"Your esteemed father has been"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":1,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「士燮问了他父母好。子玉出来，见过了礼，士燮即叫子玉引元茂去见他父亲，子玉即同了元茂、聘才到书房去了。士燮吩咐家人许顺，收拾书房后身另院的两间屋子，给他们暂且住下。","en":"greetings, Shixie promptly instructed him to escort Yuanmao to meet his father. Ziyu then led both Yuanmao and Pincai toward the study. Meanwhile, Shixie ordered the servant Xu Shun to prepare two rooms in the secluded courtyard behind the study for their temporary lodging."},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":12,"tokens":["魏聘才","聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这边子玉引李、魏二人到了书房，性全已知道他儿子来了，等他叩见过了，然后与魏聘才见礼，问了姓名，性全让他上坐，聘才只是不肯。子玉想了一想：「先生父子乍见，定然有些说话。」就引聘才到对面船房内坐下，云儿与俊儿送了茶。聘才笑道、「世兄可还认得小弟么？」子玉道：「面善的很，实在想不起了。」聘才笑道：「从来说贵人多忘事，是不差的。那一年","en":"already aware of his son's arrival. Once the son had offered his filial respects, introductions were made with Wei Pincai. Li Xingquan courteously offered Pincai the seat of honor, an offer Pincai repeatedly declined. Ziyu, sensing that father and son, newly reunited, would cherish a moment to converse in private, tactfully escorted Pincai to the boat-shaped annex across"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":1,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"喝了一会茶，说了些南边年岁光景，聘才知道元茂不能熬夜，起身告辞，性全也体谅他们路上辛苦，就叫元茂跟了过去，子玉送他们进屋，见已铺设好了，说声：「早些安歇罢！」也就叫俊儿提灯，照进上房去了。","en":"They lingered over tea for a while, discussing the state of affairs in the south. Pincai, aware that Yuanmao could not abide late hours, eventually rose to take his leave. Li Xingquan, understanding the exhaustion of their travels, sent Yuanmao along with him. Ziyu escorted them to their quarters, ensuring everything was appropriately arranged."},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":2,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"次日聘才、元茂到上屋去拜见了颜夫人，又将南边带来的土仪与他父亲的书信一并呈上，书中无非恳切求照应的话。另有致王文辉一信，士燮叫他迟日亲自送去。这聘才本是个聪明人，又经乃父陶镕，这一张嘴，真个千伶百俐，善于哄骗，所以在梅宅不到十天，满宅的人都说他好。子玉虽与其","en":"The following day, Pincai and Yuanmao visited the main residence to pay their respects to Lady Yan. They presented regional gifts brought from the south, alongside letters from their fathers, each brimming with earnest pleas for continued patronage and care. Among the missives"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":2,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一日晚上，元茂睡了，子玉与聘才闲谈。聘才问道：「京里的戏是甲于天下的。我听得说那些小旦称呼相公，好不扬气。","en":"One evening, while Yuanmao slept, Ziyu and Pincai sat chatting together. Pincai asked, \\"The theater of the capital is renowned as the finest beneath the heavens. I have heard that the young performers of female roles, addressed as 'xianggong,' carry themselves with an extraordinary air of distinction."},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":3,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"要给他几十两银子，那小旦谢也不谢一声，是有的么？」子玉笑道：「或者有之，但我不出门，所以也不大知道外面的事。」聘才道：「戏是总听过的，那些小旦到底生得怎样好呢？」子玉道：「我就没有见过好的。这京里的风气，只要是个小旦，那些人嘴里讲讲都是快活，因此相习成风，不可挽回。」聘才道：「我也是这么说，南京的戏子本来不好，小旦也有三四十岁了，从没有见过叫这些人陪酒。但如今现","en":"laughed softly, \\"Perhaps in certain circles, but as I rarely venture out, I know little of such worldly affairs.\\" Pincai pressed, \\"Surely you have attended performances. What are these young actors truly like?\\" Ziyu replied dismissively, \\"I have never encountered a truly exceptional one. Such is the fashion in the capital: so long as a man is a young dan, people take pleasure"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":1,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"世间既生了这两个，怎么还能再生两个出来？断无是理，不必信他。」即说道：「吾兄说得这样好，天下只怕真没这个人。」聘才道：「这是你可以见得着的，他们与我同一天到京，此时自然已经进了班子；难道将来不上台唱戏的？那时吾兄见了，才信小弟这对眼睛，是个识宝回回，不是轻易赞好的。就是一样，这两个相貌好了，脾气恰不好。凭你怎样巴结他，要他一句好言好语也不能。","en":"your description, Brother, they sound truly peerless. It is doubtful anyone else in this world could rival them.\\" Pincai said, \\"You shall see for yourself. They arrived in the capital on the exact same day as I did, and by now they must be formally bound to a troupe. Are they not destined to grace the stage one day? Once you set eyes upon them, you will trust my judgment,"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":6,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"人之后，他就到了，不要他说的就是我见的，那一班人却像从南边来的模样。」便又问道：「你说那个顶好的叫什么名字？」聘才道：「叫琴官。那个叫琪官。」子玉道：「琴官进城那一天穿的什么衣裳？」聘才道：「都是蓝绉绸皮袄，酱色呢得胜褂。」子玉见衣服已经对了，又问：「他一人一个车呢，还与人同坐一个车？」聘才道：「他与琪官、叶茂林同坐一个车，那车围是蓝布的，骡子是白的。」子玉又道","en":"indeed appear to be travelers from the south.\\" He then asked, \\"What did you say the most beautiful one was named?\\" Pincai replied, \\"He is named Qinguan. The other is Qiguan.\\" Ziyu pressed on, \\"What garments was Qinguan wearing on the day he entered the city?\\" Pincai described, \\"Both wore fur coats of blue crepe silk beneath outer riding jackets of dark brown wool.\\" Ziyu,"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":3,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「比京里那些红相公怎样？」子玉笑道：「前日车里那两个，我皆目所未见，那个琴官更为难得，但不知此时在什么班里？」聘才道：「明日我出去打听，打听着了，我们去听他的戏。」子玉点头，再要问时，忽见灯光一亮，一个小丫头在门外说道：「太太叫请少爷早些睡罢。」子玉只得起身进去。这一宿就把聘才的话想了又想，又将车中所见模样神情，细细追摹一回，然后睡着。自此子玉待聘才更加亲厚。","en":"eyes have ever beheld, with Qinguan being a rarity beyond measure. Yet, I wonder which troupe they have joined?\\" Pincai proposed, \\"I shall make inquiries tomorrow. Once I have word, we shall go and hear them perform.\\" Ziyu nodded in agreement, but just as he was about to speak again, the light flared, and a young maidservant called from outside the door, \\"The mistress"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":5,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"次早聘才带了他的小子四儿，将王文辉的信送去。适文辉一早出门未回，王恂也不在家，只得请颜仲清会了。聘才见仲清一表非凡，叙了一番寒温，知是文辉之婿，又是士燮的内侄，免不得恭惟一番。正要告辞，只见一个跟班捧着一包衣服进来说：「老爷回来了。」聘才只得坐下。停了一会，","en":"The following morning, Pincai took his young servant, Si'er, to deliver Wang Wenhui's letter. As it happened, Wenhui had departed early and had not yet returned, and Wang Xun was likewise away from home, leaving Pincai no option but to request an audience with Yan Zhongqing. Upon"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":3,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"文辉让聘才坐下，自己就盘起腿来，仲清坐在靠窗凳上。聘才见这大模厮样的架子，心里筹划了一筹划，便站起来道：「小侄在诸位老伯荫庇之下，一切全仗栽培。家父曾吩咐过小侄，说大人的尊范，必要位至极品。趁如今拜识拜识，将来可以提拔寒畯。」说罢取出书子来双手呈上，文辉一手接","en":"Wenhui invited Pincai to take a seat, settling himself comfortably with legs crossed, while Zhongqing occupied a stool by the window. Observing Wenhui's grandiose, self-important posture, Pincai carefully calculated his approach before rising to his feet and addressing him,"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":2,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"后来到底转荐没有呢？」聘才茫然，并不曾见有此事，只得恭身道谢。又说：「也没有转荐。」文辉道：「想必他又听了什么闲话了。但此时令尊还是处馆，还仍旧做那勾当？」聘才道：","en":"\\"Tell me, did that alternative recommendation ever materialize?\\" Pincai, utterly bewildered and entirely unaware of the matter, could only bow deeply in feigned gratitude and reply, \\"No such recommendation came to pass.\\" Wenhui said, \\"He must have caught wind of some unsavory gossip. Is your father still teaching, or is"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":5,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「这倒好。一年有多少修金呢？」聘才道：「也有三百金。」文辉道：「也够浇裹了。论起来我做了三品京堂，一年的俸银，也不过如此。」说罢又仰面而笑。聘才也无话可说，正想告辞，忽见一个俊俏跟班，打扮得十分华丽，凑着文辉耳边说了一句话。聘才是乖觉人，知道有事，便起身告辞，文辉要送出去，聘才道：「","en":"\\"That is much better. What is his annual remuneration?\\" Pincai replied, \\"He earns around three hundred taels.\\" Wenhui said, \\"That should suffice for daily expenses. Truth be told, as a third-rank metropolitan official, my own annual stipend scarcely amounts to more.\\" With that, he threw his head back and laughed."}],"3":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":6,"tokens":["魏聘才","聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说魏聘才回来，书房中已吃过饭了，正在踌躇，想到外面馆子上去吃点心。走到账房门口，忽见一个小厮，托着一个大方盘，内放一只火锅，两盘菜，热气腾腾的送进去了。随后见有管事的许顺跟着进去，见了聘才，便问：「大爷用过饭没有？」聘才道：「才从外头送信回来的。」许顺道，「","en":"Wei Pincai returned to find that dinner had already been served in the study. Finding himself at a loss, he considered venturing out to a restaurant for a light repast. As he approached the accounts room, he caught sight of a young page bearing a large square tray—upon"},{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"吃过了饭，许顺泡了一碗酽茶递给聘才，说了一会闲话。","en":"When the meal concluded, Xu Shun brewed a bowl of deep, fragrant tea, offering it to Pincai as they fell into idle conversation."},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":3,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"取一本薄薄的二三十页，却是刻板的，题着《曲台花选》。略翻一翻，像品题小旦的。再拿几本看时，是不全的《缀白裘》。聘才道：「这两本书是自己的么？想来音律是讲究的。」许顺道：「那里懂什么音律，不知是那个爷们撂在这里的。」聘才要借去看看，许顺道：「只管拿去。」聘才袖了出来，到自己房里，歪在炕上，取那本《花选》看了一会，记清了八个名氏。一面想道：「原来京里有这样好小旦，怪","en":"Glancing at the wall clock, Pincai noted it was just past one in the afternoon. His gaze drifted to a purple-bamboo bookshelf, where a few worn volumes caught his eye. Pulling out two at random, he found them to be hand-copied opera librettos, containing nothing more than a few scattered"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":1,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"将这八个人的光景逐一摹拟一番，又牢牢的记了一记。只见四儿跑进来说道：「同路来的叶先生找少爷说话，现在账房里。」聘才说：「这也奇了，他怎的到这里来。」就将《花谱》在枕头底下，带上房门出来。","en":"\\"Master Ye, who traveled with you on the boat, is looking for the young master—he is waiting in the accounts room.\\" Pincai said, \\"How curious—why would he come here?\\" He slid the *Catalogue of Flowers* beneath his dressing box, latched the door behind him, and made his way out."},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":7,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"到了账房，见叶茂林同着个白胖面生的人在那里坐着，见聘才进来，都站起了，上前拉手问好。聘才道：「叶先生到此有何贵干？」叶茂林笑嘻嘻的道：「晓得尊驾在此，特来请安的。」聘才知道他是顺口的话，便道：「我还没有来奉拜，倒先劳你的驾过来。」又问：「那位贵姓？」叶茂林道：「这是我们大掌班金二爷，来请梅大人定戏的。」","en":"Upon entering the accounts room, he found Ye Maolin seated beside an unfamiliar, pale, and stout gentleman. At Pincai's entrance, both men rose to greet him warmly. Pincai asked, \\"Master Ye, what brings you to our humble residence?\\" Maolin beamed, \\"Knowing Your Excellency was here, I came especially to pay my respects.\\" Sensing the polite fiction, Pincai replied, \\"I"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":3,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琪官定于腊月初十日上台，其余各自跟他师傅，也有在联锦班的，也有过别班里去的。聘才又问他的寓处，说在杨柳巷联锦班总寓内。聘才道：「改日过来奉看。」茂林道：「这如何敢当，只好顺便去逛逛。」说着许顺已同了金二回来，已经说妥，定于正月初六日在姑苏会馆，不论分包不分包，只要点谁的戏，不短脚色就是了。许顺上去回明，付了定银各散。是晚子玉课期","en":"had followed their respective masters—some joining the Lianjin Troupe, others scattering to different companies. Pincai asked for Ye's residence and was told he resided at the Lianjin Troupe's main quarters in Yangliu Lane. \\"I shall come to pay my respects soon,\\" Pincai promised. \\"I would not dare presume,\\" Maolin replied, \\"only drop by if you are passing through.\\" Presently,"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":4,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"次日，聘才记着叶茂林的话，吃了早饭想去听戏，叫四儿带了钱，换了衣裳。因元茂在书房读书，不好约他，独自步行出门，不多路就到了戏园地方。这条街共有五个园子，一路车马挤满，甚是难走。遍看联锦班的报子，今日没有戏，遇着传差，聘才心上不乐，只得再找别的班子。耳边听得一阵","en":"The following morning, with Ye Maolin's vivid descriptions lingering in his mind, Pincai finished his breakfast, resolved to attend a play. He instructed Si'er to carry some coin and changed into fresh garments. Knowing Yuanmao was immersed in his studies, Pincai departed alone on foot. The theater district was a short distance away, a bustling"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":1,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"脑袋，花嫣柳媚的神情。一会儿靠在人身边，一会儿坐在人身旁，一会儿扶在人肩上，这些人说说笑笑，像是应接不暇光景，聘才已经看出了神。","en":"Casting his gaze to the upper gallery, Pincai noticed a party of men bearing the distinguished air of capital officials, flanked by a retinue of attendants. By the curtained entrance to the dressing rooms, several young dan actors lingered, their snow-white profiles partially visible as they smiled"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":1,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"。见那人的神气好不飞扬跋扈，顾盼自豪，叫家人买这样，买那样，茶果点心摆了无数，不好的摔得一地，还把那家人大骂。聘才听得怪声怪气的，也不晓得他是那一处人。","en":"stream of delicacies. When a dish displeased him, he hurled it to the floor, cursing his attendants ruthlessly. Pincai, listening to his strange, grating accent, could not decipher which province the man hailed from."},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":7,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一个生得黑瘦，有了微须，身上也穿得华丽，都是三十来岁年纪，也有两个小旦跟着说闲话。小厮铺上坐褥，一齐挤着坐下。聘才听他们说话，又看看那两个相公，也觉得平常，不算什么上好的。忽见那个热闹官座里，有一个相公，望着这边，少顷走了过来，对胖子与那一位都请了安。这张桌子连聘才已经是五个人，况兼那人生得肥胖，又占了好多地方，那相公来时已挤不进去。因见聘才同桌，只道是一起的人","en":"actors engaged in idle chatter. A servant unrolled their seat cushions, and they squeezed together at the table. Pincai eavesdropped briefly, appraising the two accompanying actors—they seemed rather ordinary, possessing no transcendent beauty. Suddenly, a young dan from the raucous official's box cast a glance in their direction, gracefully excused himself, and approached"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":2,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"把那胖子笑得眼皮裹着眼睛，没了缝，把蓉官嘴上一拧，骂道：「好个贫嘴的小么儿。这是偶然的事情，那里是常打架吗。」聘才听得这话，说得尖酸有趣。一面细看他的相貌，也十分可爱，年纪不过十五六岁，一个瓜子脸儿，秀眉横黛，美目流波，两腮露着酒凹，耳上穿着一只小金环，衣裳华美，香气袭人。这蓉官瞅着那胖子说道：「三老爷你好冤，人说你常在全福班听戏，花了三千吊钱，替小福出师。你瞧","en":"scolding gently, \\"You sharp-tongued little imp. That was but a rare occurrence—it is not as if they brawl every day.\\" Pincai, listening intently, found the banter delightfully sharp. He took the opportunity to study Rongguan's features more closely: the youth was exquisitely captivating, no more than fifteen or sixteen, possessing a flawless melon-seed face. His elegantly"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":3,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"板凳上踏了两板，就倒了一杯茶，一手擎着慢慢的喝。可巧那胖子要下来走动，把手向蓉官肩上一扶，蓉官身子一幌，碰着了聘才的膀子，茶碗一侧，淋淋漓漓把聘才的袍子泼湿了一大块。那胖子同蓉官，着实过意不去，赔了不是，聘才倒不好意思，笑道：「这有什么要紧，干一干就好了。」说着自己将手巾拭了。","en":"The third act was *The Southern Shore*, a universally beloved scene. Pincai tapped his foot gently against the bench in time with the rhythm, poured himself a fresh cup of tea, and sipped it slowly. Just then, the stout man moved to stand. Seeking balance, he pressed his hand heavily upon Rongguan's shoulder. Rongguan swayed,"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":7,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"个小黄漆木盘，盘内盛着那许多玉器，还有些各样颜色的东西，口里轻轻的道：「买点玉器儿，瞧瞧玉器儿。」从人丛里走近聘才身边，一手捏着一个黄色鼻烟壶，对着聘才道：「买鼻烟壶儿。」聘才见这壶颜色甚好，接过来看了一看，问要多少钱。那卖玉器的道：「这琥珀壶儿是旧的，老爷要使，拿去就结了。人家要，是十二两银，一厘不能少的。你能算十两银就是了。」聘才只道这壶儿不过数百文，今听他","en":"of jade,\\" he murmured softly. \\"Have a look at the jade.\\" Threading through the dense crowd, he stopped beside Pincai, pinching a yellow snuff bottle between his fingers. \\"Care for a snuff bottle, sir?\\" Finding the color exceptionally rich, Pincai accepted the piece, turning it over in his hands before inquiring the price. The jade peddler replied, \\"This amber bottle"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":10,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「我卖了四十多年的玉器，走了几十个戏园子，从没有见还了价，重说不要的。老爷那里不多使二两银，别这么着。」靠紧了聘才，把壶儿捏着。聘才没奈何，只得直说道：「今日实在没有带银子，明日带了银子来取你的罢。」那卖玉器的那里肯信道：「老爷没有银子，就使票子。」聘才道：「连票子也没有。」卖玉器的道：「我跟老爷府上去领。」聘才道：「我住得远。」卖玉器的只当不听见，仍捏着壶儿紧","en":"The peddler, a seasoned trickster adept at reading faces, instantly recognized Pincai as a newcomer to the capital and seized the advantage. \\"I have peddled jade for forty years, traversing dozens of playhouses, and never once have I met a gentleman who strikes a bargain only to rescind it! Do not hoard your two taels, sir. Do not play"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":7,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"聘才待要发作，只见那个胖子伸过手来，将那卖玉器的一扯，就指着他说道：「老王，你别要这么着。」聘才连忙招呼，那胖子倒真动了气，又道：「老王，你别要混懵。怎么拿个松香壶儿不值一百钱，赚人二两银。砸碎了就要六两。你瞧他南边人老实，不懂你那懵劲儿，你就懵开了。我","en":"Just as Pincai was about to lose his temper, the stout man reached across the table, seizing the peddler by the arm. Pointing a thick finger, he warned, \\"Old Wang, enough of your tricks.\\" Pincai offered a grateful nod, but the stout man's anger was genuine. \\"Old Wang,"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":2,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"富、贵二人也问了聘才的姓，又问了他是那一处人，现在当什么差？聘才道：「小弟是江宁府人，才到京，尚未谋干什么。此时寓在鸣珂坊梅世伯梅大人处。」富三道：「江宁是个好地方，我小时候跟着我们老爷子到过江宁。那时我们老爷子做江宁藩司，我才十二岁，后来升了广东巡抚。你方才说鸣珂坊的","en":"Fu and Gui returned the inquiry, asking Pincai's origins and current posting. Pincai replied, \\"I hail from Jiangning Prefecture. Having only recently arrived in the capital, I have not yet secured a position. I currently reside as a guest in the Mingke Lane estate of my family's old friend, Lord"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":3,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"先生们往来，所以这好几年不走动了。闻得他家玉哥儿很聪明，人也生得好，年纪也有十六七岁了，不知娶过媳妇儿没有？」聘才一一回答了，又与贵大爷寒喧一番。聘才已知富三是个热心肠，多情多义的人；那个贵大爷却是个谨慎小心，安分守己的一路。当下三人，倒闲谈了好一会。蓉官又到对面楼上去了，聘才望着他，又去与那黑脸大汉讲话。","en":"Master Yu is exceedingly bright and strikingly handsome, perhaps sixteen or seventeen now. Has he taken a bride?\\" Pincai answered the inquiries gracefully, engaging Master Gui in polite conversation. He quickly discerned the nature of his companions: Fu the Third was a man of fiery generosity and deep sentiment, while Master Gui was cautious, proper, and anchored in convention."},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":1,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"来。下了楼，才一路骂出戏园，看得那些相公个个大笑，都探出身子看他出了戏园，才住了笑。这边富三看了，也拍手称快，聘才更乐得了不得。但不知这个人，是个什么阔人，少顷等蓉官来问他。只见那黑大汉已起身，带了四个相公，昂昂然大踏步的出去了。那些没有带去的相公，又分头各去找人。","en":"From his seat, Pincai watched the jade peddler squeeze his way up to the upper gallery, clutching his remaining trinkets, attempting to hawk his wares among the actors and patrons. His persistence drew the ire of the dark-faced man, who barked a sharp reprimand. When the"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":3,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"富三见聘才人品活动，又系梅氏世谊，便道：「魏大哥，今日这戏没有听头，咱们找个地方喝一钟去罢？」聘才见富三是个慷慨爽快的人，便有心要拉拢他，说道：「今日幸会，但先要说明赏兄弟的脸作个东。」富三笑道：「使得。」就在靴革幼里拿出个靴页子来，取一张钱票，交与他跟班给看","en":"Observing Pincai's elegant bearing and mindful of his connection to the Mei family, Fu the Third suggested, \\"Brother Wei, the opera has lost its flavor today. Shall we find a quiet place for a few cups of wine?\\" Recognizing Fu's generous, open-hearted nature, Pincai"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":2,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"他们是有车来的，聘才搭了蓉官的车，四儿也跨了车沿，跟兔坐了车尾。聘才在车里随口的说笑，哄得蓉官十分欢喜，又赞他的相貌，要算京城第一。","en":"They had arrived by carriage. Pincai shared a carriage with Rongguan, while Si'er rode the shaft, and Rongguan's boy clung to the back. Within the carriage, Pincai conversed with effortless charm, drawing delighted laughter from Rongguan. He praised the youth's beauty, declaring him without"},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":1,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"菜，蓉官斟了酒。只听得隔壁燕语莺声，甚为热闹。蓉官从板缝里望时，就是那个奚大老爷带了春兰，还有三个相公在那里。聘才问富三道：「老太爷的讳，上下是那两个字？」","en":"Rongguan whispered, \\"It is that Great Lord Xi. He has Chunlan and three other actors with him.\\" Turning back, Pincai respectfully addressed Fu the Third: \\"May I ask the honorable name of your late father?\\""},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":1,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，倒是贵太爷明白，即对富三说道：「他问大叔官名是叫什么？」富三道：「你问我们老爷的名字么，我们老爷叫富安世。」聘才即站起身来道：「怪不得了，三爷是个大贤人之后。你们老大人，在我们南京地方已成了神。三年前，地方上百姓，共捐了几千银子，造了一个名宦祠，供了老大人的牌位。还有一位是江宁府某大老爷。这老大人生前爱民是不用说了，到归天之后，还恋着南京百姓，遇着瘟疫、蝗虫、","en":"for your father's official name,\\" Gui clarified. Fu smiled, \\"You ask after my father? He was known as Fu Anshi.\\" Pincai immediately rose from his seat, his expression filled with awe. \\"No wonder! Third Master is the descendant of a true sage. Your venerable father is revered as a living god in our Nanjing. Three years ago, the local populace gathered thousands of taels"},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":6,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"们老爷在江宁十六年，自知府到藩司，没有出过省，真与南京人有缘。我是生在江宁府衙门里的，所以我会说几句南京话。」聘才又将贵大爷恭惟一番。贵大爷道：「我这个功名是看得见的，要升官也难得个拣选，不是同知，就是通判，并无他途。」聘才道：「将来总不止于同、通的。」蓉官笑道：「你瞧我将来怎样？」聘才笑道：「你将来是要到月宫里去，会成仙呢。」富三、贵大皆笑，蓉官罚了聘才一杯酒","en":"within the walls of the Jiangning Prefectural compound, which is why I still carry a trace of the local dialect.\\" Pincai then paid Master Gui a round of compliments as well. Gui sighed modestly, \\"My path is already written in stone. Promotion relies entirely on selection—I shall end my days a Subprefect, or failing that a Assistant Prefect. There is no other road for me.\\""},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":1,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"鸡巴攘的，又装腔做作了。」蓉官低低的说道：「不好了，那位奚大老爷又翻了，不知骂谁？」便到板壁缝里去望他们。这边聘才与富三、贵大都静悄悄的听，听得一个相公说道：「你倒开口就骂人。好便宜的鸡巴，做起菜来，你口里还吃不尽呢。」听得那人又骂道：「我最恨那装腔做作的，一天一个样子。」又听得那相公说道：「就算我装腔做作了，你也不能打死了我。」又听得那人骂道：「我倒不打死你，","en":"exploded again. Who is he cursing this time?\\" He pressed his eye to the crack in the partition. At their table, Pincai, Fu the Third, and Master Gui fell utterly silent, straining to listen. Through the thin wood, a young actor shot back, \\"You cannot open your mouth without cursing. Cock is cheap enough with you — cook it up as a dish and your own mouth could never finish"},{"paragraph":36,"mentions":5,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"富三与聘才、贵大都在门口看了一会进来。蓉官吐了吐舌，说道：「好不怕人！这才算个标子。」富三笑道：「这种标也标得无趣，但不知为什么事闹起来？」蓉官道：「这位奚大老爷的下作脾气，是讲不出来的。」于是富三与聘才、贵大豁了一会拳，此时天气尚短，他们也要进城。贵大爷先抢","en":"Fu the Third, Pincai, and Master Gui watched the spectacle from the doorway for a long while before returning to their seats. Rongguan stuck out his tongue playfully. \\"Terrifying! Now that is what I call a proper spectacle.\\" Fu the Third laughed, \\"Such crude spectacles hold"},{"paragraph":37,"mentions":2,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"聘才说：「一定来的，咱们从此订交。只是我是个白身人。仰扳不上。」富三、贵大同说：「罚你！咱们哥儿们论什么，你不嫌我们粗卤就是了。」富三赏了蓉官八吊钱，跟兔两吊钱。蓉官谢了赏，辞了贵大爷与聘才先去了。","en":"Pincai bowed deeply. \\"I shall certainly come. Let us count ourselves friends from this day forth. Yet I am but a commoner, without rank or title. I hardly dare aspire to your exalted company.\\" Fu the Third and Master Gui objected in unison: \\"You must drink"},{"paragraph":38,"mentions":2,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"此时日已西沉，富、贵两人急急的赶城，聘才送了他们上车，同着四儿慢慢步行而归。到家时点了灯了，子玉、元茂都在书房夜课。聘才换了衣裳，趿着鞋，喝了几杯茶，坐了一回。","en":"The sun had sunk low into the west; Fu and Gui hurried back toward the city gates. Pincai escorted them to their carriage, watching them depart before slowly walking the darkening streets home with Si'er. By the time they arrived, the estate was bathed in lamplight. Ziyu and Yuanmao were sequestered in the study, immersed in their evening"},{"paragraph":39,"mentions":1,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"少停，子玉、元茂出来，同到聘才房里。","en":"Shortly thereafter, Ziyu and Yuanmao emerged from their studies, making their way to Pincai's room."},{"paragraph":40,"mentions":3,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"只见聘才解下腰间的褡包，一只手揣在怀里，剩着一只空袖子悠悠荡荡的，在房里走来走去转圈儿。见了子玉、元茂进来，，便嘻嘻的笑。元茂道：「今日什么事，到此刻才回？」又凑到他脑上一看道：「酒气醺醺，一定是叶茂林请你的，可曾见那些小孩子么？」聘才道：「我没有去找叶茂林","en":"Pincai had untied his heavy waist-pouch, tucking one hand casually into the lapel of his robe, letting his empty sleeve sway rhythmically as he paced slow circles around the room. Seeing Ziyu and Yuanmao enter, his face broke into a radiant grin. Yuanmao asked,"}],"4":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":2,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一跳，问道：「为什么大惊小怪？」元茂道：「你看地下已铺了一层，这棉花大的朵子下起来，一夜就有一尺多了。」子玉同聘才到门口看时，果然飘飘洒洒，下起雪来。子玉道：「这腊雪是最好的。今年一冬风燥，现在求雪，幸亏我们说着琴官，所以感召天和，样样献瑞。」聘才道：「今晚若下得一宿，明日我们就可以赏雪了。」云儿已拿了斗篷、风帽来，请子玉穿戴了进去。","en":"blanketed. With flakes falling as large as cotton bolls, we shall have over a foot of snow by morning.\\" Ziyu and Pincai stepped to the door to look, and indeed, snowflakes were drifting and swirling down from the sky. Ziyu said, \\"Snow in the twelfth month is the finest kind. The wind has blown dry all winter and we were only now praying for snow; that it has come is surely"},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":1,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"房上树上的雪，被风刮得如梨花乱舞。即吩咐云儿，叫厨房多备几样莱，请魏、李两位少爷赏雪。少顷，送过一桌佳肴，请了聘才、元茂过来一同赏玩。","en":"young gentlemen Wei and Li to come and admire the snow. Before long, a table of fine delicacies was laid out, and Pincai and Yuanmao arrived to enjoy the snowy vista together."},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":3,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉是不能饮酒的，勉强相陪。又将琴官的光景来问聘才，聘才见他心甚注意，便改了口风，索性将琴官的身分、性气一赞，赞得子玉更为倾慕。又想这个雪天，若见琼枝玉立，何异瑶岛看花，真笑党家锦帐中，醇酒羔羊，终不脱武夫气象矣。吃完之后，煮雪煎茶，闲谈一会，聘才、元茂各自回房去了。","en":"Unable to drink wine, Ziyu merely made a show of accompanying the others. He turned again to Pincai to ask after Qinguan. Seeing how entirely Ziyu's thoughts were captivated, Pincai shifted his tone, speaking of Qinguan's bearing and temperament with nothing but soaring praise, leaving Ziyu all the more ardently enamored. Ziyu thought to himself how,"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":1,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"做了第三。已经下了雪，那白皓皓一片，自然就有雪色，做了第四题。倒也新鲜别致，就构思起来。才做了两首，却被元茂、聘才进来看见，子玉遂叫他们也做几首。元茂道：","en":"his fourth topic. Novel and original. With that, he set to composing. He had just completed two when Yuanmao and Pincai came in and saw him. Ziyu therefore invited them to compose a few verses as well. Yuanmao said:"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":1,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「雪字下连了一个虚字眼儿，我是做不来的。我只好咏咏雪罢了。」聘才道：「就是咏雪，要对却费力。我只好做首绝句。」元茂道：「七个字一句的累赘，我只会做五言律诗。」子玉道：「都使得。」他们各自搜索枯肠去了。","en":"appended to the word 'snow' as my topic, I simply cannot manage it. All I can do is write a plain poem on snow.\\" Pincai added, \\"Even a plain snow poem—making it rhyme properly is hard work. I can only manage a quatrain.\\" Yuanmao said, \\"Seven-character lines are too unwieldy; all I know is how to write a five-character regulated poem.\\" Ziyu smiled. \\"Either will do perfectly"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":1,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"不多一会，子玉四首都已作成，用一张冷金笺写了。又写了一封回书，正要缄封。聘才却笑吟吟的拿了一张诗稿来：「道做得不好，你替我改改。」子玉接来看时，题目是《咏雪》，诗是：","en":"them out on a sheet of cold-gold notepaper. He had just finished writing a reply and was about to seal it when Pincai came over smiling, carrying a sheet of verse: \\"It has not come out well. Please help me correct it.\\" Ziyu took it and looked. The topic was Ode on Snow, and the poem read:"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":4,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"涯。\\n分明仙品瑶台上，独占人间第一花。\\n子玉诧异道：「我倒不晓得你有这样本领。你在诗上头，想是很用过工夫的。」聘才道：「我那里有什么工夫，就是记得几枝曲子，随便凑上的。」子玉道：「什么曲子？聘才道：「那舞向梅梢片片，及蛾儿粉蝶，是《江天雪》的《走雪》上的。」子玉道：「下两句呢？」聘才道：「第三句是空的，末了一句，用《占花魁》上《独占》这一出戏，我就拉他来用做古典","en":"said in surprise, \\"I had no idea you possessed such skill. You must have put a great deal of effort into poetry.\\" Pincai replied, \\"Where would I find the time for that? I just remembered a few arias and patched them together.\\" Ziyu asked, \\"What arias?\\" Pincai explained, \\"The lines about swirling toward the plum tips, and moths and powdered butterflies, are from the Walking"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":1,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「这几首诗，把我们的都压下去了。」再看聘才的那首绝句。王恂道：「这首亦甚好，只不知庾香又做这一首做什么？」仲清道：「这首也还下得去，然断不是庾香所作。」再看元茂的五律，起二句写着是：「天上彤云布，来思雨雪盈。」王恂道：「这「来思」两字怎么讲？」仲清忽然大笑道：「你往下看。」王恂再看第二联是：","en":"\\"These poems surpass all of ours.\\" They then looked at Pincai's quatrain. Wang Xun said, \\"This one is also quite good, but what made Yuxiang compose this extra one on his own?\\" Zhongqing replied, \\"This one is passable, but it is certainly not Yuxiang's work.\\" They then looked at Yuanmao's five-character regulated"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":1,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"庾香叫我们批，我们还是批不批？」仲清道：「你就何妨批他一批。」王恂道：「我为什么得罪人呢？」仲清道：「我来先把聘才这首全圈了。」批了一个批语是：得天公玉戏之神。","en":"well give them a comment.\\" Wang Xun said, \\"Why should I make enemies?\\" Zhongqing said, \\"Let me begin by marking Pincai's quatrain with a full circle.\\" He wrote a critical note: Captures the spirit of Heaven's sport with jade."},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":4,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"王恂又将孙氏昆仲与他说了，子玉也笑，就叫人请了聘才、元茂出来，大家见了。子玉把各人的诗交给了，说道：「这都是颜大兄评定的，称赞得了不得。」聘才看了批语，暗想道：「颜仲清这人，真可谓博古通今，我用的戏曲，都被他看出来了。」当向仲清道了谢。仲清道：「魏兄诗笔甚俊，声律兼优，想是常做，倒像曲不离口的。」聘","en":"Wang Xun then also told him about the Sun brothers. Ziyu laughed, and had someone summon Pincai and Yuanmao to come out. Everyone met. Ziyu returned each person's poems and said, \\"These assessments were made by Elder Brother Yan; he was most complimentary.\\" Pincai read the comment and thought to himself: \\"This Yan Zhongqing is truly versed in everything"},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":2,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"道：「先生今日尚未全好，我们须在家伺候，改日再奉陪罢。」元茂撅了嘴不言语。仲清等告辞而去，子玉送出大门，进来与聘才、元茂又谈了一会诗，忽又问起琴官来。聘才见他有点意思，便轻轻的挑他一句道：「改日何不偷个空儿，同去认认那个琴官。」元茂道：「明日就去，我只说去看路上同来的朋友。」指着子玉道：「你说到王家去回拜他们。只要出了这两扇牢门，还怕什么人？」子玉笑道：「过几日","en":"and the others bid farewell and departed. Ziyu saw them out the front gate, came back inside, and chatted with Pincai and Yuanmao for a while about the poems, then suddenly again brought up Qinguan. Seeing that Pincai had developed a certain intent, he quietly threw out a hint: \\"Another day, why not steal a moment to come with me and make Qinguan's acquaintance?\\" Yuanmao"}],"5":[{"paragraph":13,"mentions":2,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"不觉把帘子一掀，露出一个绝代花容来。子玉瞥见，是前日所遇、聘才所说、朝思夕想的那个琴官，便觉喜动颜开，笑了一笑。见琴官也觉美目清扬，朱唇微绽，又把帘子放下，一转瞬间，各自风驰电掣的离远了。子玉见他今日车袭华美，已与前日不同，心里暗暗赞叹：「果信夜光难掩，明月自华，自然遇了赏鉴家，但不知所遇为何等人。」又想：「聘","en":"unparalleled beauty. Ziyu caught a glimpse and recognized the very Qinguan he had encountered before, the one Pincai had told him about, the one he had been thinking of day and night. Joy spread across his face and he smiled. He glimpsed Qinguan's clear bright eyes and slightly parted crimson lips. Then the curtain fell, and in an instant both carriages had sped away"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":6,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"再说子玉今日又遇见了琴官，十分快意，回家之后，急急的找了聘才，与他说知。聘才也有些喜欢，因将路上的光景，细说与子玉。原来聘才与叶茂林同行到济宁州时，那一班相公上岸去了，独见琴官在船中垂泪，便问了他好些心事，终不答应。及说到敢是不愿唱戏，恐辱没了父母的话，他方把聘才看了一眼。聘才从此便想进一步，竟不打量打量自己","en":"had again encountered Qinguan that day and was in excellent spirits. Returning home, he immediately sought out Pincai to tell him what had happened. Pincai was somewhat pleased as well, and proceeded to describe to Ziyu the scene on the road. It turned out that when Pincai and Ye Maolin had been traveling together and reached Jining Department, all the performers had"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":1,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"不留，心里就时时的思念。何况他人，其自守本不如子玉，又能与美人朝夕相见，自然爱慕更切，把个百炼钢化为绕指柔了。聘才自知与琴官无缘，巴结不上，虽也爱其容貌，其实恨其性情。如今见子玉爱他，以局外人想局中事，不过说些怂慂之言，生些逢迎之意，自己倒也不十分留意。当下子玉出去，亦就将此事搁开了。","en":"would be even more intense, transforming a hundred-tempered blade into steel soft enough to wind round a finger. Pincai knew that he and Qinguan had no karmic affinity and could get nowhere; though he admired Qinguan's looks, he genuinely resented his temperament. Now seeing Ziyu's infatuation, viewing the inside situation as an outsider, he merely offered encouraging"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":2,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一日，天气晴和，雪也化了，聘才想起富三爷来，要进城去看他，便叫四儿去雇了一辆车坐了，望东城来。对面遇着一群车马，泼风似的冲将过来，先是一个顶马，又一对引马，接着一辆绿围车，旁边开着门。聘才探出身子一看，只觉电光似的，一闪就过去了。就这一闪之中，见是个美少年，英眉秀目，丰采如神，若","en":"One day the weather turned clear and mild. The snow had melted, and Pincai thought of Fu the Third and wished to go into the city to visit him. He had his boy Si'er hire a carriage and set off toward the Eastern City. Coming from the opposite direction was a crowd of horses and carriages rushing forward like the wind. First"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":2,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"些箱子、衣包，还有些茶炉、酒盒、行厨等物。那些赶车的，都是短袄绸裤，绫袜缎鞋，雄纠纠的好不威风。倒过了好一会。聘才想道：「这是什么人，这样的排场？」忽听得他赶车的说道：「老爷可知道这个人？」聘才答道：「不知道是什么人，这等阔。」赶车的道：「这是锦春园的阔大公子，这京城里有四句口号，人人常说的。道：「城里一个星，城外一朵云。\\n两个大公子，阔过天下人。」这公子的家世","en":"stockings, and satin shoes, striding along in magnificent, vigorous fashion. The procession passed for quite some time. Pincai thought: \\"What sort of person is this, with such a grand retinue?\\" Just then he heard his driver say: \\"Sir, do you know who this person is?\\" Pincai replied: \\"I have no idea. What person is this, so wealthy?\\" The driver said: \\"This is the magnificent"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":2,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子，周围就有三四里。他们有个管牲口的爷们卢大爷，我曾听他说有一百几十匹马，七八十个大骡子，你说这人家阔不阔？」聘才道：「他姓什么？」赶车的道：「他姓华，人家都叫他华公子。」聘才道：「马上那些人，自然是家人了，车里头那些孩子，倒像相公模样的，又是什么人呢？」赶车的道：","en":"heard him say they have a hundred-odd horses and seventy or eighty large mules. Would you say that's wealthy?\\" Pincai asked: \\"What is his surname?\\" The driver replied: \\"His surname is Hua, people all call him Young Master Hua.\\" Pincai asked: \\"The men on horseback must be his household servants; but those children in the carriages, who look like opera performers, what"},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":3,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"看得中，也就不借重价买了回去。听说他现在一个跟班也是相公，他去年花八千两银子买的。你想这个手段，谁赶得上他。」聘才道：「真阔。但他家父母由他这样，不管他的么？」赶车的道：「他家老爷子、老太太在万里之外呢！再说他府里的银子本多，就多使些，什么要紧？今日想必出去赴席，所以带着班子。」一面说着，已进了东城，到了金牌楼，找着茶叶铺对门，一个大门口住了车。聘才命四儿投了片","en":"last year for eight thousand taels of silver. Just think of that extravagance! Who could possibly match him?\\" Pincai said: \\"Truly magnificent. But do his parents just let him carry on like this without interfering?\\" The driver replied: \\"His father and mother are ten thousand li away! Besides, his family has boundless silver. So what if he spends a little more, what"},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":7,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"进了穿堂，便是正厅，两边有六间厢房。富三早已站在正房檐下，迎将出来。聘才抢步上前，拉了手。富三即引到正厅后，另有两间小书房内坐了，问了几句寒温。聘才道：「这几天下雪耽搁了，不然，前日就要过来奉拜的，在家好不纳闷，惟有刻刻的想念三爷。」富三道：「彼此，彼此。」此处是富三的书房，离内屋已近，只隔一个院子。聘才略观屋中铺设，中","en":"either side. Fu the Third was already standing beneath the eaves of the main house, coming forward to welcome him. Pincai hurried up and clasped his hands in greeting. Fu the Third led him behind the main hall to sit in a pair of small study rooms, exchanging polite inquiries about each other's health. Pincai said: \\"The snow delayed me these past few days, otherwise I would"},{"paragraph":30,"mentions":2,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"共一千多吊，不但没有讨好，他倒说我俗恶不堪，以后我就再不敢请他的了。他有一个亲随林珊枝，真花八千两银子买的。」聘才听了，点头微笑，说道：「这个阔公子，与他拉交情，是不容易的。」富三道：「难，难，除非真有本领，教他佩服了，不然，就是巴结到二十四分，这个人是最喜奉承的。」说到此，便已摆上饭来，一壶酒，四碟菜，一只火锅。富三道：「今日却是便饭，没有什么吃的。」二人对酌","en":"invite him again. He has a personal attendant named Lin Shanzhi who genuinely cost eight thousand taels of silver.\\" Pincai nodded with a slight smile and said: \\"Befriending this wealthy nobleman would indeed be no easy matter.\\" Fu the Third said: \\"Difficult indeed, unless one possesses true abilities that earn his admiration. Otherwise, however assiduously one flatters and"},{"paragraph":31,"mentions":1,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"富三欲待不管，因聘才在此，听得不好意思，便走了进去。","en":"Fu the Third tried to ignore it, but with Pincai present he felt embarrassed, and went inside."},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":2,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"聘才静听，只听得出富三声口，说「有客，有客」的两句。那些女人说话就略低了些，疏疏落落的犹有些牵藤蔓葛。富三走了出来，与聘才喝了一杯酒，里头又闹起来。","en":"Pincai listened quietly and could make out Fu the Third's voice saying \\"There's a guest, there's a guest\\" once or twice. The women's voices dropped slightly, trailing off in sporadic murmuring. Fu the Third came back out and drank a cup of wine with Pincai;"},{"paragraph":34,"mentions":4,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"聘才无心喝酒，也不便问，先要饭吃了。富三又出来，聘才看他心神不定，便告辞了，又谢了饭。富三见聘才已经吃饭，里头又闹得这样，便也不好留他，只得说道：「今日简慢极了，别要笑话，内人一出门，这些人就没有了拘束，乱吵起来。」聘才也不好答应，一径出来，富三送出大门","en":"Pincai had no heart for drinking, and it would have been awkward to ask questions, so he simply asked for the meal to be served. Fu the Third came out again; Pincai could see that his composure was quite unsettled. He took his leave and expressed thanks for"},{"paragraph":35,"mentions":2,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"聘才又到贵大爷处，没有在家，投刺而去。聘才在车里想道：","en":"Pincai then called on Master Gui's house; he was not at home, so Pincai left his card and departed. Riding in the carriage, Pincai reflected:"},{"paragraph":38,"mentions":2,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"李先生也散了学，时常出去，找些同乡同年聚谈消遣。到了除夕这一天，聘才、元茂在书房闷坐，大有作客凄凉之感。少顷，子玉出来对他二人说道：「昨日听得王母舅于团拜那一日，格外备两桌酒请我们，还有孙氏弟兄。」元茂道：「我是不去的，我又不是同乡。」子玉道：「那不要紧，一来是王母舅单请我们的，又不与他们坐在一处；二来也是庸庵的意思","en":"gathering with fellow provincials and examination classmates for conversation and amusement. On New Year's Eve, Pincai and Yuanmao sat idly in the study, feeling very much the melancholy of guests far from home. Presently Ziyu came out and said to both of them: \\"Yesterday I heard that Uncle Wang, on the day of the group-visit ceremony, will especially prepare two tables"},{"paragraph":39,"mentions":1,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"急忙来到书房，见书房中也点着两对红烛、四盏素玻璃灯，元茂上前叩了头。聘才也来辞岁，性全连忙还礼，即同了他们到老师、师母跟前辞岁，士燮挡住了。颜夫人即吩咐子玉出去叩贺先生，梅学士即领了子玉，来到书房，彼此贺毕，便摆上酒肴。","en":"two pairs of red candles and four plain glass lanterns burning within. Yuanmao went forward to bow in greeting. Pincai also came to offer the New Year's salutation. Xingquan hastily returned the courtesies, then led them to pay their New Year's respects to their Teacher and Teacher's Wife. Scholar Mei stopped them from the full formality of bowing. Lady Yan immediately"},{"paragraph":40,"mentions":2,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"梅学士恭恭敬敬与性全斟了酒，性全连称不敢；又要与聘才、元茂斟酒，聘才连忙接过酒杯，自己放好了，依次坐下。","en":"wine for Xingquan; Xingquan kept demurring that he could not accept such an honor. Mei then made to fill cups for Pincai and Yuanmao as well. Pincai quickly took the wine cup himself, set it in place, and they all took their seats in proper order."},{"paragraph":41,"mentions":1,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"行矩的人，更配上那个李性全，席间无非讲些修身立行，勉励子玉的话。李元茂拘拘束束，菜也不敢吃，坐着好不难受。倒是聘才还能假充老实，学些迂腐的话，与他们谈谈。不多一会，也就散了席。梅学士又在外坐了一会，讲了好些话，然后同了子玉进去。性全、元茂等亦各安寝，且待下回分解。","en":"exhortation to Ziyu. Li Yuanmao sat stiff and constrained, hardly daring to eat, in considerable discomfort. Only Pincai managed to pretend at being earnest, affecting pedantic speech to converse with them. After not too long, the banquet dissolved. Scholar Mei sat outside a while longer, speaking at length on various matters, then went inside together with Ziyu. Xingquan,"}],"6":[{"paragraph":20,"mentions":2,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"次日，要说姑苏会馆团拜的事了，一早梅学士先去了。聘才于隔宿已向子玉借了一副衣裳，长短称身。只有元茂嫌自己的衣服不好，闷闷的不高兴，见了子玉华冠丽服的出来，相形之下颇不相称，便赌气脱下衣裳，仍穿了便服，说道：「我不去了。」子玉就命云儿进去。禀知太太，将我的衣服拿一副出来，说李少爷要穿，云儿随即捧了一包出","en":"following day brought the fellowship gathering at the Suzhou Guild Hall. Scholar Mei departed early in the morning. Pincai had borrowed a set of clothes from Ziyu the previous night—a perfect fit. Only Yuanmao remained dissatisfied with his attire, brooding in a foul mood; seeing Ziyu emerge in his splendid official hat and elegant garments, he felt acutely inferior and"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":2,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"再穿了外面的猞猁裘，子玉又将个大毛貂冠给他戴了，觉得毛茸茸的一大团，车里都要坐不下去，惹得子玉、聘才皆笑。带了四个书童出来，外面已套了两辆车，四匹马。子玉独坐一车，聘才、元茂同坐一车，一径来到姑苏会馆，车已歇满了。","en":"a massive sable fur hat upon his head—a colossal, fluffy sphere that barely fit within the carriage. Ziyu and Pincai burst into irrepressible laughter. Accompanied by four book-boys, they found two carriages already harnessed with four horses waiting outside. Ziyu rode alone in one, while Pincai and Yuanmao shared the other. They made straight for the Suzhou Guild"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":2,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"遂一直引至正座，见已开了戏。座中诸老辈，子玉尚有几位不认识，士燮指点他一一见了礼，这些老前辈个个称赞不休。随后聘才、元茂上来与王文辉见礼。聘才还生得伶俐，这元茂又系近视眼，再加上那套衣服，转动不便，一个揖作完，站起来，不料把文辉的帽子碰歪在一边。文辉连忙整好，元茂也涨红了脸，就想走开。","en":"meet; Scholar Mei pointed them out, and Ziyu offered his respects to each, receiving lavish praise in return. Pincai and Yuanmao then stepped forward to greet Wang Wenhui. Pincai, nimble and composed, managed the introduction smoothly; Yuanmao, however, hindered by his nearsightedness and cumbersome attire, struggled to maneuver. As he rose from his bow, he accidentally"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":1,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"怎么这时候才来？」子玉道：「今日起迟了些，那孙大哥、孙二哥还没有来么？」王恂道：「也该快来了。」王、颜二人又与聘才、元茂款接了一番。只见对面楼上来了几个，先是右待郎的少君刘文泽做主，请了史给事的少君史南湘、吴阁学的外甥张仲雨、姑苏名士高品、国子监司业沈公之子沈伯才、天津镇守海口巴总兵之子巴霖，这两位就是孙氏弟兄的妻舅。还有一个本京人，原任江苏知县之子冯子佩，尚未","en":"Brother Sun not yet arrived?\\" Wang Xun answered, \\"They should be here any moment.\\" Wang and Yan warmly welcomed Pincai and Yuanmao. Across the upper floor, another group had assembled, hosted by Liu Wenze, son of the Right Vice-Minister. His guests included Shi Nanxiang, son of Censor Shi; Zhang Zhongyu, nephew of Grand Academician Wu; the renowned Suzhou scholar Gao"},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":1,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"要远着孙氏弟兄，便乱坐起来。刘文泽、沈伯才、巴霖、张仲雨坐了一席；史南湘、颜仲清、高品拉了子玉过来，坐了一席；聘才、元茂坐了一席；嗣徽、嗣元坐了一席，王恂只好两席轮流作陪。孙嗣徽又之乎者也的闹了一会，问了魏、李二位姓名、籍贯。一面就摆上菜喝酒。高品见嗣徽的脸上疙瘩更多了好些，喝了几杯酒，那个红鼻子如经霜辣子，通红光亮。","en":"Ba Lin, and Zhang Zhongyu claimed one table; Shi Nanxiang, Yan Zhongqing, and Gao Pin pulled Ziyu to a second; Pincai and Yuanmao took a third; leaving Sihui and Siyuan isolated at the fourth, with Wang Xun moving between tables to act as host. Sun Sihui, adopting his pedantic \\"the Master says\\" persona, began interrogating Wei and Li about their names and native places."},{"paragraph":30,"mentions":4,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"停了一会，见聘才的跟班走到聘才身边道：「叶先生送来的戏单。」子玉过来，与聘才同看，见头几出是《扫花》、《三醉》、《议剑》、《谒师》、《赏荷》，都已唱过；以下是《功宴》、《瑶台》、《舞盘》、《偷诗》、《题曲》、《山门》、《出猎》、《回猎》、《游园惊梦》，末后是《明珠记","en":"A moment later, Pincai's attendant approached and whispered, \\"Master Ye has sent the opera program.\\" Ziyu leaned over to review it with Pincai. The opening pieces—'Sweeping Flowers,' 'Three Times Drunk,' 'Discussing the Sword,' 'Paying Respects to the Teacher,' and 'Appreciating"},{"paragraph":31,"mentions":1,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"刘侍郎道：「也罢，唱了《瑶台》之后，就唱《惊梦》也使得。」那人答应几个「是！」看着文辉不言语，也就进戏房去了。聘才向子玉道：「你听见没有？」子玉点头，心上很感激文辉。","en":"eagerly agreed with a chorus of \\"Yes, yes, sirs!\\" and, seeing Wenhui mollified, hurried into the theater room. Pincai nudged Ziyu, \\"Did you hear that?\\" Ziyu nodded, feeling a profound surge of gratitude toward Wenhui."},{"paragraph":34,"mentions":1,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"缘，把青春抛的远」，便字字打入子玉心坎，几乎流下泪来，只得勉强忍住。再看那柳梦梅出场，唱到「忍耐温存一晌眠」，聘才问道：「何如？」子玉并未听见，魂灵儿倒像附在小生身上，同了琴官进去了。偏有那李元茂冒冒失失走过来，把子玉一拍，道：「这就是琴官，你说好不好？」倒把子玉唬了一跳。众人都也看得出神。","en":"barely reining in his tears. As Liu Mengmei took the stage, singing, \\"Endure for now and rest tenderly a while,\\" Pincai asked, \\"Well, what do you think?\\" Ziyu heard nothing; his very spirit seemed tethered to the young leading man, vanishing behind the stage with Qinguan. Suddenly, Li Yuanmao blundered over, clapping Ziyu on the shoulder: \\"This is Qinguan—would you say"},{"paragraph":36,"mentions":3,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"席间那个张仲雨与聘才叙起来是亲戚，讲得很投机。聘才又把合席的人都恭维拉拢了一会。子玉又见那些相公，到正席上去劝酒的劝酒，讲话的讲话；颇觉有趣。又见他的舅舅王文辉，分外比人高兴，后又看了一出戏。正席上刘侍郎、梅学士、吴阁学、沈司业先散。子玉见他父亲走了，天也不早，也要回去","en":"At the tables, Zhang Zhongyu and Pincai discovered a shared family connection through marriage and struck up a fast friendship. Pincai dedicated his time to cultivating goodwill, offering compliments to everyone seated nearby. Ziyu watched with quiet amusement as the opera performers circulated"},{"paragraph":37,"mentions":1,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，屈吾兄一叙，作个清谈雅集。人不多，就是竹君、剑潭、庸庵、卓然几位，吾兄断不可推辞。」子玉应允，又谢了。王恂、聘才、元茂也同道了谢，一径先回。那些人又谈了一会，也各散去。不知后事如何，且听下回分解。","en":"few others. Elder Brother must absolutely not decline.\\" Ziyu agreed, expressing his deep gratitude. Wang Xun, Pincai, and Yuanmao offered their thanks in turn before departing. The remaining guests lingered in conversation for a while longer before dispersing into the night. As for the events that followed, please await the unfolding of the next chapter."}],"8":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说子玉从刘文泽家饮酒回来，已是二更多天。先见过父母，换了衣裳，来寻聘才、元茂说话，却见静悄悄的，掩了房门。那边虎儿走来道：「少爷出去后，师爷就有人请出去了，今日不回来。李少爷、魏少爷吃了早饭出去的。」子玉道：","en":"second watch of the night. After paying his respects to his parents and changing his garments, he went to seek out Pincai and Yuanmao for a chat. Yet he found their quarters perfectly silent, the door closed fast. The servant boy Hu'er approached and said, \\"After Young Master went out, the private secretary was invited away and will not return tonight. Masters Li and Wei"},{"paragraph":2,"mentions":5,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「他们往那里去了？这时候还不回家。」说罢就往里头去了。却说聘才、元茂因子玉出了门，便觉纳闷。元茂自初六那一天，见了些标致相公，心上很想作乐，一来为他父亲拘管，二来手内无钱，不能随心所欲，即对聘才道：「今日你也该请我看本戏。」聘才道：「我若有钱，怕不请你，还等你说？」元茂便皱着眉，拢着袖子闲踱，踱了一会道：「我们","en":"gone? To still be out at this hour!\\" Ziyu said, turning back inside. Now, once Ziyu had left the house earlier, Pincai and Yuanmao found themselves quite bored. Ever since the sixth day of the month when Yuanmao laid eyes upon those beautiful performers, his heart had been set on merrymaking. However, his father kept him under strict discipline, and his own pockets were"},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":6,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「当了就没有穿的。」元茂道：「到账房去借，你与那管帐的倒很相好。」聘才道：「好意思？才来了几天。为着听戏去借钱，也叫人瞧不起。」元茂道：「那就难了，当又不当，借又不借，只好拉倒，我是没有方法想。」聘才道：「你倒有方法，你有银子不肯使。」元茂道：「我有银子？在路上就短了，到京后又没有人给我，那里来的银子？」聘才道：「你尊","en":"\\"If I pawn them, I shall have nothing to wear,\\" Pincai replied. Yuanmao urged, \\"Then borrow from the accounts room! You are quite friendly with the bookkeeper.\\" Pincai shook his head. \\"How could I show my face? We have only just arrived a few days ago. To borrow money just to watch operas would make us laughingstocks.\\""},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":3,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"将到戏园，元茂道：「我们听什么班子呢？」聘才道：「自然联锦班了。」到墙上去看报子，联锦班在太和园，聘才是去年闲逛熟的了，一径同元茂进了戏园。聘才走的快，元茂见那戏园门口。摆着些五花云彩，又有老虎，又有些花架子，花花绿绿的。只管往前观看，信着脚步走，不防总径路口，横着一张矮长板凳，绊了一交，作了","en":"As they approached, Yuanmao asked, \\"Which troupe shall we patronize?\\" Pincai answered without hesitation, \\"The Lianjin Troupe, naturally.\\" Checking the playbills on the wall, they confirmed the Lianjin Troupe was performing at the Taihe Garden. Having frequented the area the previous year, Pincai knew the way well and led Yuanmao"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":1,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"元茂不好意思，谢了一声，进去觅着聘才，在楼上坐了一张小桌子。已开过台，做了两出，此刻唱的是《拾金》。元茂见不是小旦戏，便不看，他左顾右盼，四下里闲望，非但琴官等不见，连叶茂林也不在台上。","en":"Deeply embarrassed, Yuanmao muttered his thanks and hurried inside to find Pincai. They settled at a small table upstairs. The performance was already underway, with two acts concluded; they were currently staging 'Finding Gold.' Noticing it was not a play featuring young female roles, Yuanmao lost interest. He let his gaze wander"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":13,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"正无精打采的坐着，忽见一人走来，对着他点点头，元茂颇觉面善，一时想不起来。那人便走到聘才背后拍一拍肩，说声：「高兴」！聘才回头见是张仲雨，便满面堆下笑来，连忙让坐。问道：「二哥独自一人来，还有人同来的？」仲雨道：「我那里有工夫听戏？清早到锦春园华公府走了一走，出来又到怡园徐二爷处商量件事，遂同起盛银号潘老三在天香楼吃了饭。昨日宏济寺的唐","en":"in his direction. Yuanmao found the face familiar but could not immediately place him. The man stepped behind Pincai, patted him on the shoulder, and said, \\"In high spirits, I see!\\" Pincai turned, his face instantly lighting up with a wide smile as he hastily offered his seat. \\"Second Brother!\\" he exclaimed. \\"Are you alone, or did you come with company?\\" Zhang Zhongyu"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":1,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「他叫什么？」仲雨未及回答，那相公急应道：「我叫二喜。」就问：「你能贵姓？」聘才与他说了。又问元茂道：「前日你在苏州会馆听戏，你和孙大少爷说话，你们相好有交情么？」","en":"his name?\\" Before Zhongyu could answer, the performer eagerly chimed in, \\"My name is Erxi.\\" He then turned to Pincai, \\"And your honorable surname?\\" Pincai provided his name. Erxi then addressed Yuanmao, \\"The other day at the Suzhou Guild Hall, you were conversing with Young Master Sun. Are the two of you well acquainted?\\""},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":3,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"倒突突的跳，喉咙里痒痒的说不出话来。那相公便坐着不动。换了一出《嫖院》，便又一个相公到张仲雨身边，也坐着不走。聘才问他的名字，叫保珠。台上又换一出《女弹词》，一出场，聘才认得是琪官。看他打扮得十分香艳，颇有花含晓露，月印暗川之致，两边楼上喝采不迭。仲雨道：「这个就是琪官。」聘才点头含笑道：「这琪官比去年更觉好了。「元茂也认不清楚，只与二喜说话，又看看保珠，却没有","en":"Courtyard,' commenced, and another performer approached, seating himself beside Zhang Zhongyu and lingering there. Pincai asked his name and learned it was Baozhu. On stage, the scene shifted to 'Female Ballad-Singing.' The moment the actor made his entrance, Pincai recognized Qiguan. His attire was exquisitely alluring, exuding the delicate grace of a blossom kissed by"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":3,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琪官唱完，进了场，卸了妆，在帘子边站了一站，望见了聘才，即微微的一笑。聘才对他点点头。又见他衣裘华美，靴帽时新，迥非从前模样，意谓其必过来招呼。果见他进了戏房，候了一会，猛一抬头，只见他已坐在对面楼上，同着前日唱《题曲》的那个小旦，陪着两个华冠丽服的人。不多一会，那两人带着他们走了，聘才好不扫兴。只听得","en":"performance, he exited the stage, removed his makeup, and paused at the edge of the curtain. Catching sight of Pincai, he offered a faint, graceful smile. Pincai returned the nod. He noted that Qiguan was now arrayed in splendid furs, complete with fashionable boots and a stylish hat—a stark contrast to his former appearance. Pincai assumed the young man would surely"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":4,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"好，看这光景，两个都要去的，但恐所带的银子不够。」又想道：「两人给他十二吊钱，吃五六吊钱的酒菜，也够了。」便问聘才道：「我们走罢。」保珠便拉了元茂的手道：「到那个馆子？」聘才看这两个相公。心里不大喜欢，因是元茂花钱，与他无干，乐得热闹热闹，便对仲雨道：「二哥同走罢，我们去饮一杯。」仲雨道：「你们先请，我还要候一候。」聘才道：「同走罢，这时候不来是未必来的了。」便","en":"strings of cash, and we spend five or six on food and wine, it should be enough.\\" Resolving this, he turned to Pincai, \\"Shall we go?\\" Baozhu immediately caught Yuanmao's hand and asked, \\"Which restaurant?\\" Pincai cast a glance at the two performers, not entirely pleased, but since Yuanmao was footing the bill, he was content to join the revelry. He turned to Zhongyu"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":6,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"才出了戏园，两个跟兔的跟着。聘才问仲雨道：「那个馆子好？」仲雨道：「前面的春阳馆就很好。」不多几步，走进了馆子，掌柜的都站了起来，叫声」张老爷，新年好！升官发财。」又作了个揖，仲雨也应酬了几句。拣了个雅座，仲雨首坐，元茂第二，聘才第三，二喜、保珠一凳坐了。走堂的送了茶，便请点菜。仲","en":"No sooner had they exited the theater than their two young companions fell into step behind them. Pincai asked Zhongyu, \\"Which restaurant is best?\\" Zhongyu replied, \\"The Chunyang Restaurant just ahead is quite excellent.\\" A few short steps brought them inside, where the manager immediately rose to his feet. \\"Master Zhang, a happy New Year to you! May you"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":3,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"着杯子一瞧，道：「原来这杯酒是干巴巴的，你就这么饮了罢。」二喜就拿杯子送到元茂嘴边，元茂乐极，一饮就干。仲雨、聘才齐声说「好」！保珠道：「这个笑话实在说得有趣。」便也斟了一杯酒，送到聘才嘴边，叫道：「干爸爸饮这杯。」聘才也喜欢，干了。","en":"With that, Erxi raised his own cup to Yuanmao's lips. Overjoyed, Yuanmao drained it in a single gulp. Zhongyu and Pincai erupted in cheers of \\"Bravo!\\" Baozhu added, \\"That joke was truly delightful.\\" He then poured a cup of wine, brought it to Pincai's lips, and called out affectionately, \\"Godfather, drink this cup.\\" Pincai, highly amused, drank it down."},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":1,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"。李元茂的脑门子，又痒又辣，便伏在二喜肩上抬不起头。保珠笑得坐不牢，已塌下凳子，坐在地上。仲雨笑的翻了一身酒。聘才笑的腹痛，捧住了肚子。","en":"balance, slipping off his stool and onto the floor. Zhongyu laughed until he spilled wine all over himself, while Pincai clutched his aching sides."},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":1,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"」穷老斗见了黑相公，便害怕道：「老虎来了，逢人就要吃的。」你瞧上头到底是财神爷骑黑老虎，还是穷老斗跨黑相公？」聘才拍案叫绝，元茂掩着鼻孔要笑，保珠却仰面看那龛。二喜便斟了一杯酒，送到仲雨面前道：「该罚，你挖苦得利害。」仲雨接过来，饮了道：「这里却没有怕相公的穷老斗。」又与二喜豁第三杯，二喜输了，要敬仲雨皮杯。仲雨道：「咱们倒不用这么着，方才李老爷那杯没有吃得好，","en":"Look up there—is that the God of Wealth riding a black tiger, or a destitute patron straddling a dark performer?\\" Pincai slammed the table in absolute delight, Yuanmao pinched his nose to stifle his laughter, while Baozhu tipped his head back to study the shrine. Erxi poured a cup of wine and presented it to Zhongyu, declaring, \\"A penalty for you! Your mockery is far too"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":1,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"元茂便如醍醐灌顶，乐不可言。大家听他喉咙里头咭咯咭咯的，咽了三咽。二喜又斟了酒，轮到聘才了。第一拳是二喜输了，唱了一枝《九连环》。","en":"beyond words. The others listened as he audibly gulped three distinct times. Erxi poured more wine, and it was Pincai's turn. Erxi lost the first round and sang a verse of the 'Nine Linked Rings'."},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":8,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"第二拳是聘才输了，聘才先笑了一笑，道：「人家姑嫂两个，哥哥不在家，姑娘就和嫂子一床睡觉。嫂子想起他丈夫，便睡不着，叫这姑娘学着他哥哥的样儿，伏了一会。那嫂子乐得了不得，道：「好虽好，只是不大在行，淌出水来。」姑娘道：「这是头一回，二次就在行了，咱们起他个名儿才好","en":"Pincai lost the second round. With a sly grin, he began, \\"There were once two sisters-in-law. With the older brother away from home, the younger sister shared a bed with the older sister-in-law. Missing her husband terribly, the sister-in-law could not sleep."},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":3,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"聘才忽见一个和尚走进来，口中说道：「我的二老爷！你在这里，我走了七八个戏园子，那一处不寻到？」二喜、保珠见了和尚都请了安，聘才、元茂也站起来招呼。和尚都作了揖，与仲雨一凳坐了。聘才看那和尚相貌，是个紫糖色方脸，两撇浓须，有四十来岁，戴个绒僧帽，穿件宝蓝绸","en":"Suddenly, Pincai noticed a monk entering the room. \\"My Second Master!\\" the monk exclaimed. \\"Here you are! I have scoured seven or eight theaters looking for you!\\" Seeing the monk, Erxi and Baozhu both offered respectful greetings, while Pincai and Yuanmao rose to acknowledge"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":1,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"但看他倒也和颜悦色，很会张罗。当下即问了聘才、元茂姓名寓处，便对仲雨道：「二老爷，明日事完了，不是姑苏会馆，就是天庆堂，再约上你这两位令友，与这两位相公，咱们高高兴兴乐一天。今日实在不好耽搁，那边人已到齐了，就候你去成事。」仲雨道：「不用忙，你也吃一钟，咱们就走。」那和尚将胡子抹了一抹，嘻着嘴","en":"Yet, his demeanor was remarkably pleasant and accommodating. After inquiring after Pincai and Yuanmao's names and lodgings, he turned to Zhongyu. \\"Second Master, when tomorrow's affairs are concluded, we shall gather at either the Suzhou Guild Hall or the Tianqing Hall. Bring your two esteemed friends and these two young performers, and we"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":4,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"爷，也与奶奶一样。」唐和尚一手就伸到二喜脸上来。二喜笑道：「我说和奶奶的模样长得一样，没有说错呀。」唐和尚见有聘才、元茂在坐，便也假装斯文，缩回手来，说道：「你们糟蹋佛门弟子，是有罪过的。」仲雨、聘才大笑。唐和尚又催仲雨起身，仲雨道：「再略坐片时也不妨。」二喜见壁上挂着一个葫芦，指着问唐和尚道：「这个像什么？」唐和尚笑道：「这个像你的嘴。」二喜道：「不通，不通！","en":"reached out to pinch Erxi's cheek. Erxi dodged, laughing, \\"I only said he looks like a wife, I wasn't wrong!\\" Noting Pincai and Yuanmao's presence, the monk feigned scholarly dignity, withdrawing his hand. \\"To mock a disciple of the Buddha is a grave sin,\\" he chided. Zhongyu and Pincai burst into laughter. Tang again urged Zhongyu to leave. \\"A brief delay will do no harm,\\""},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":9,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"聘才、元茂又与保珠豁了一轮拳，保珠也敬了两次皮杯。，二喜又要了几样莱，重又闹了好一回，已点了半枝蜡烛。约有定更后了。两个相公都也困乏，两个跟兔在风门口站着。李元茂不知颠倒，饮汤饮酒，除下帽子，头上热气腾腾，如蒸笼一般。聘才道：「咱们也好散了。」轻轻的凑着","en":"Pincai and Yuanmao played another round of games with Baozhu, who offered two more skin-cups. Erxi ordered several more dishes, and the revelry continued for some time, well past the lighting of the candles, deep into the first watch of the night. The two performers"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":3,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"天不早了。」又到元茂耳边一凑道：「你到我家里去，我伺候你。」元茂听了这句，心里又喜又急，脸上发起烧来，只顾看着聘才发怔。保珠、二喜猜不出什么意思。聘才只得对元茂道：「丢了这包银子，如今怎样呢？」元茂道：「原是还有些东西在内，一齐偷去了。」保珠道：「什么？」元茂道：「银子，在戏园门口，叫小利割去了」二喜道：「我同你出来，没有见小利。」元茂道：「进门时丢的。「二喜道","en":"this, Yuanmao felt a surge of joy mixed with intense panic, his face burning hot. He could only stare blankly at Pincai. Baozhu and Erxi were utterly bewildered by his behavior. Left with no alternative, Pincai finally spoke up, \\"Now that the silver has been lost, what are we to do?\\" Yuanmao added miserably, \\"There were other things in that pouch—it was all taken together.\\""},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":7,"tokens":["聘才","魏聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这话说的很是，只要咱们师傅知道了，就好了，咱们要什么钱。」把个李元茂急得无法，脸上胀的通红，一句话也说不出来。聘才只得说道：「咱们认识了，难道就这一回，没有后来的交情了？你要他同去，对你师傅说，也不怕你师傅不依，但我倒没有见过，相公要请出师傅来对帐的。」保珠道：「这原是不认识的才这样，若伺候过三年两载，相熟了，原不用这样。」二人正在为难。只见四儿进来，道：「孙大","en":"Yuanmao was reduced to absolute helplessness. His face flushed a deep crimson, and he could not utter a single word. Pincai had no choice but to intervene. \\"We have only just made each other's acquaintance. Is this to be our first and last meeting? You ask him to face your master—your master would likely accept the explanation, but I have never heard of a performer dragging"},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":1,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"嗣徽听了心里一惊，便道：「余力不能举百钧，任重而道远，恐难担也。」聘才只得又再三央求，嗣徽勉强答应，说道：「明日可以与则与之，人而无信，不知其可也。」即对二喜、保珠道：「来，余与尔言，盍去诸？明日亲送之门，毋逼人太甚也。」两个相公不能明白，嗣徽只得说了几句平话。保珠、二喜见嗣徽担了，也就没法，只得勉勉强强，谢了一声而去","en":"strength cannot lift a hundred jun cannot bear a heavy burden on a long road'—I fear I am unequal to the task!\\" Pincai pleaded with him at length until Sihui finally, reluctantly, agreed. \\"What can be given tomorrow shall be given,\\" he intoned solemnly. \\"'A man without integrity, who knows what becomes of him?'\\" He then turned to Erxi and Baozhu. \\"Come, let me speak"},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":4,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"的笑道：「我们的帐是不打折头的，五十六吊七百八十个京钱。」元茂道：「怎么就有这许多？」走堂的道：「不敢多开。」聘才对元茂道：「你醉了不要多话，咱们到柜上去写罢。」遂到柜上，走堂的又交代了一遍，掌柜的把算盘拨了一回，看着聘才、元茂道：「你们二位是同着张二老爷来的，怎么张二老爷又先走了。你们二位同他是同乡还是什么？」聘才道：「我们是亲戚，他有事先走了。」掌柜的又问道","en":"copper cash.\\" \\"How can it be so much?\\" Yuanmao protested. \\"We dare not overcharge,\\" the waiter replied simply. Pincai nudged Yuanmao, \\"You are drunk. Stop talking nonsense. Let us go settle the bill at the counter.\\" They approached the front desk, where the waiter recited the total once more. The manager clicked his abacus beads, then looked sharply at Pincai and Yuanmao."},{"paragraph":30,"mentions":2,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"魏老爷既是张二老爷的亲戚，我也不好意思不叫写帐。但是记着，不要拖长下去。」便拿了一张条子递与聘才，聘才心里好不有气，便照数写了，又加了两吊酒钱，注了鸣珂坊梅宅魏字。","en":"for me to refuse you a credit account. But I beg of you—do not let this drag on too long.\\" He handed a slip to Pincai. Seething with inward indignation, Pincai wrote out the full amount, added two strings for the wine service, and signed it: 'Mingke Alley, Mei Residence, Wei surname.'"}],"9":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":3,"tokens":["魏聘才","聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说魏聘才、李元茂回家时已三更，梅宅关了门落了锁，四儿敲了半天，才有人来开了。两人走到房中，聘才免不得将不小心丢银子的话，抱怨了元茂两句。元茂无言可答，各自安睡。到了次日，只得央了许顺，借了十吊钱的票子，分作两张，写了一封字，叫四儿送与叶茂林，分给二喜、保珠。","en":"When Wei Pincai and Li Yuanmao arrived home, it was past the third night-watch. The Mei household had already barred and bolted its gates. Si'er knocked for a long while before anyone came to open them. The two entered their rooms, and Pincai could not help voicing"},{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"过了两日，已是元宵佳节，李性全带着元茂，到会馆中吃年酒去了，聘才出去逛灯未回。子玉一人正在无聊，恰好梅进进来说道：「刘少爷、颜少爷、王少爷，请少爷出去逛灯，都在门口等着。」子玉禀过父母，梅进即叫套了车，云儿跟着出来。仲清等却在车里等着，见子玉出来便下了车。刘文泽道：「如此良宵，千金一刻，我们趁着灯月，倒是步行好些","en":"days later came the Lantern Festival. Li Xingquan took Yuanmao to a New Year banquet at the guild hall, while Pincai had gone out to view the lanterns and had not yet returned. Ziyu sat alone with nothing to do when Mei Jin came in and announced: \\"Young Master Liu, Young Master Yan, and Young Master Wang invite you to go out and view the lanterns. They are all waiting"}],"10":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["魏聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这一天路上见了子玉，便认得是梦中救他出陷坑的人，时时刻刻放在心上。又姑苏会馆唱戏那一日，见他同了一班公子，还有魏聘才、李元茂在座，问起叶茂林，始知这位公子就姓梅，已应了梅花树下之兆。从此，一缕幽情如沾泥柳絮，已被缠住。","en":"day of the opera at the Suzhou Guild Hall, seeing Ziyu seated among a company of young gentlemen that included Wei Pincai and Li Yuanmao, he asked Ye Maolin and learned that this young master's surname was indeed Mei, fulfilling the omen beneath the plum tree. From that moment, a thread of tender feeling, like willow catkins clinging to the mud, had hopelessly entangled"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":1,"tokens":["魏聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「原来琴言不过如此，何以那两回车中瞥见如此之好，而唱起戏来又有那样丰神态度呢？而且魏聘才赞不绝口，徐子云又钟情到这样，真令人不解。「一面想，那神色之间，微露出不然之意来。子云却早窥出，颇得意用计之妙。宝珠道：「你们彼此相思已久，今日初次见面，也该说两句知心话，亲热亲热，为什么大家冷冰冰的，都不言语。」说着就拉着琴言的手，送到子玉手内。子","en":"extraordinarily remarkable, and that his stage performance held such immense richness of spirit and manner? And yet Wei Pincai praised him without end, and Xu Ziyun's affection for him runs so astonishingly deep that it truly defies all understanding.\\" As these complex thoughts passed through his mind, a faint trace of genuine disappointment appeared in his expression. Ziyun"},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":1,"tokens":["魏聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"魏聘才之赞扬，固不足信，只可惜徐度香爱博而情不专，惟以人之谄媚奉承为乐，未免纨袴习气。其实焉能□我？」说着，气忿忿的要开镜屏出去，那晓得摸不着消息，任你推送，只是不开。","en":"As for Wei Pincai's lavish praises, they were certainly not to be trusted. But what a tragic pity that Xu Duxiang, loving so widely with feeling spread far too thin, takes such pleasure in the shallow flattery and servility of others. Such is truly the deplorable habit"}],"11":[{"paragraph":4,"mentions":1,"tokens":["魏聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"且说那华公子年方二十一岁，其容貌虽见于魏聘才之目，性情述于富三之口，究未得其详。这华公子气焰虽豪，性情却极纯粹。不过在那起居服食上，享用些富贵豪华之福。养尊处优，不喜酬应。\\n骑射既精，词赋更妙。也曾千卷罗胸，不难七步随口。这华夫人母家姓苏，父名臣泰，也是功臣之后，世袭列侯，现任兵部尚书。并无嗣","en":"young master Hua was then twenty-one years of age. Though his striking figure had fleetingly caught the eye of Wei Pincai and his temperament had been hinted at by Fu the Third, his true nature remained untold. Young Master Hua possessed an extravagant, commanding bearing, yet his heart was uncommonly pure and genuine. He immersed himself freely in the worldly delights"}],"12":[{"paragraph":21,"mentions":1,"tokens":["魏聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"着草上霜，同着一个二十几岁伶伶俐俐的人坐下，背后站着一个跟班。那胖子是一口京话，那一个是南边人，原来就是富三与魏聘才。不多一刻，蓉官卸了妆，已坐在对面楼上，与一个少年说话。下来又在楼下坐了一会，即走到这边来，一路路请安照应人。","en":"The plump man spoke in pure Beijing speech; the other was from the south. These were in fact Fu the Third and Wei Pincai. Before long, Rongguan had removed his stage makeup and was sitting in the gallery upstairs talking with a young man. He came down again and sat for a moment in the lower area, then walked over toward this side, greeting and acknowledging people along"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":2,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"冷清清的一人坐着。意欲过去照应，又恐不是。及仔细看清了，才过去请了一个安，坐下，倒说了好一会话。富三却不留心，聘才见了，便扯扯富三的衣裳，道：「你瞧，蓉官倒巴结那个人，难道这种人，倒有什么巴结处么？」富三道：「那也难说的。」蓉官辞了春航，又到富三处来。聘才笑向蓉官道：「好阔老斗。」蓉官脸上一红，道：「他真阔过来。他倒从没有欠人的开发，要人替担帐。」少停，富三等即","en":"went over, made a greeting bow, sat down, and they talked quite a good while. Fu the Third paid no attention; but Pincai noticed and tugged at Fu the Third's sleeve, saying: \\"Look there — Rongguan is actually paying court to that person. What sort of person could that be, to have anything worth paying court to?\\" Fu the Third said: \\"Hard to say.\\" Rongguan took his leave"}],"15":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["魏聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"却说子玉在王恂处谈了半天回家。李先生已经解馆，要张罗盘缠，魏聘才替他拉了一纤。托张仲雨问西客借了一票银子，占了些空头，有二百余金，添补些衣服，也叫了几天相公。李元茂要在京寄籍，性全也只得由他。","en":"chat before returning home. Master Li had already packed up his tutoring post and needed to arrange travel funds; Wei Pincai had found a financial connection for him, asking Zhang Zhongyu to borrow a draft of silver from Xi Rong, which included a measure of empty credit amounting to over two hundred taels. With this, Master Li supplemented his clothing and also hired young"},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":11,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"当晚子玉与聘才在书房闲话。那日是忌辰，日间聘才独自一人到樱桃巷去，找着了叶茂林，两人谈了半天。聘才拉他在扁食楼上吃了饭，即同到那些小旦寓处，打了几家茶围。末了到琴言处，琴言倒出来与聘才谈了几句，即问起子玉来。聘才就将子玉的心事，再装点了些，说得琴言着实感激，并与琴","en":"That evening, Ziyu and Pincai were chatting in the study. That day was a memorial anniversary, so Pincai had gone alone to Cherry Lane during the day and found Ye Maolin. The two talked for a long while, and Pincai treated him to a meal at the Flat-Dumpling Restaurant; they then"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":1,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"人备了彩盒礼帖，请亮功来，送了过去。文辉处回礼丰盛，有颜仲清帮同亮功押了回来，士燮备酒相待。是日不请外客，就请聘才、元茂相陪。这李元茂今日福至心灵，说话竟清楚起来。性全出京时留下二百两银子与他，元茂买了几件衣裳，混身光亮。亮功眼力本是平常，今见了元茂团头大脸，书气满容，便许为佳士，大有余润之意，便问起他的姻事来。仲清早已看明，便竭力赞扬。李元茂不知就里，乐得了不","en":"helped Lianggong bring them back, and Shixie hosted a wine reception. That day no outside guests were invited; only Pincai and Yuanmao were asked to keep the company. This Li Yuanmao had, at this auspicious moment, achieved a sudden clarity of mind — his speech became quite articulate. When Xingquan left the capital, he had left two hundred taels of silver for Yuanmao; Yuanmao"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":2,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"揖，就将我的帽子碰歪，只好娶这样媳妇。」便应允了。为这件事，特到士燮处来，将亮功之意达之士燮。士燮大喜，就请了聘才、元茂出来，聘才自然一口赞成，元茂十分畅满。士燮就与元茂代写了求允帖，交与文辉，于初六日过了礼帖。这是千里姻缘，百年前定，李元茂这个呆子巴不得明日就赘了过去，才可免指头儿告了消乏。","en":"went specifically to Shixie's residence to convey Lianggong's intentions. Shixie was greatly pleased; he called Pincai and Yuanmao out, Pincai naturally gave his wholehearted approval, and Yuanmao was thoroughly delighted. Shixie then wrote on Yuanmao's behalf a letter formally requesting consent, which he handed to Wenhui; on the sixth day the betrothal letter was conveyed."},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":3,"tokens":["聘才","魏聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"少顷，士燮送了客出去，便叫出子玉来，教训了一番。又叮嘱了元茂、聘才几句。然后与夫人别了，即上车起程，颜仲清、王恂、魏聘才、李元茂一起随后，颜夫人领着子玉，并有些仆妇丫鬟一群的车，也送出城来。城外是王文辉、孙亮功等十几个同年至好，一齐在旗亭饯别。士燮盘桓了一会，文辉等进城。天色不早，颜夫人也只得带了仆妇丫鬟洒泪先回。","en":"called Ziyu out to deliver a thorough admonition. He then also gave a few words of instruction to Yuanmao and Pincai. After that he bade farewell to Lady Yan, mounted his carriage, and departed. Yan Zhongqing, Wang Xun, Wei Pincai, and Li Yuanmao followed close behind. Lady Yan, leading Ziyu and a group of female servants and maids, also accompanied him in carriages"}],"16":[{"paragraph":4,"mentions":2,"tokens":["魏聘才","聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"却说魏聘才其人在不粗不细之间，西流东列，风雅丛中，究非知已；\\n繁华门下，尽可帮闲。目下与李元茂同住梅宅，一无所事，唯有出外闲游。而元茂又另是一种呆头呆脑的脾气，与之长处，实属可厌。聘才思量道：「我进京来本欲图些名利，今在京数月，一事无成。且梅老伯又到江西去了，","en":"Now let us speak of Wei Pincai. He was a man neither entirely coarse nor refined; though he mingled widely in cultured circles, he was no true confidant to anyone, serving rather as a willing companion-for-hire in wealthy households. Currently residing at the Mei mansion with Li Yuanmao,"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":17,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"聘才听说三爷不在家，在对门贵大老爷处打牌，小使出来，聘才道：「贵大爷我去年却拜过他，未曾见着，今日正好拜他。」即到对门来，传进片子，听得里面叫：「请！」开了两扇中门，聘才进去，却是小小一个院落，只见贵大爷从正厅上出来，迎上前，与聘才拉了手，让聘才进屋内炕","en":"Pincai learned that the Third Master was not at home, but was playing cards across the street at Lord Gui's residence. When the servant came out, Pincai said, \\"I left a card for Lord Gui last year but never had the chance to meet him; today is the perfect opportunity"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":2,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「怎么不认得？他们茔地的树，还是我种的呢。」贵大爷道：「这杨老八的风水是高明的，我们内城多半是请他瞧的。」聘才便又拉拢起来，只有那个阎简安是冷冰冰的，只与富、贵两人讲话。富三爷道：「歇了罢，这牌打得闷人，就是我输了，算账罢。」阎简安便道：「怎么就歇？方才打了两转。」梅窗道：「算了，不用来了。」于是，大家起身散坐，点筹马，是阎、富两人输了。聘才道：「倒是我吵散","en":"Yang the Eighth's geomancy is outstanding; most families in the inner city ask him to assess their properties.\\" Pincai engaged him further, though Yan Jian'an sat coldly aside, speaking only with Fu and Gui. Third Master Fu complained, \\"Let's stop here. This card game is insufferably dull, and I've been losing. Let's settle our accounts.\\" Yan Jian'an countered, \\"Why"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":8,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"席中聘才对那阎简安问起华府的光景，那老阎就觉得有些高兴，便道：「敝东公子，是人间少有的。府里的阔大；是说不尽的。」聘才又问同事几位？简安道：「在府里住的有十几位，在老爷子任上的有十几位，其余来来去去走动的，不计其数。我是老爷子三十年的交情，同着出过兵，与那些","en":"During the meal, Pincai asked Yan Jian'an about the situation in the Hua household. Old Yan's spirits lifted as he boasted, \\"My employer's young master is a rare individual in this world, and the grandeur of the mansion is beyond description.\\" When Pincai asked about the number"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":3,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"聘才便同到富三家里来，又坐了一回，便把心事讲起。富三爷道：「既然如此，何不就挪到舍下来，盘桓几时。」重又说道：「我们舅太爷府中朋友最多。今日听得老阎说，辞了那位出去，如今正少人呢。」聘才道：「舅太爷是那一位？」富三道：「你不记得去年在城外，瞧见那十几辆车","en":"Pincai then accompanied Fu the Third back to his residence for a brief visit, taking the opportunity to share his thoughts. Third Master Fu suggested, \\"In that case, why not simply move in here and stay for a while?\\" He added, \\"In our uncle-by-marriage's household,"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":1,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"来的，去年老佛爷叫他和过诗，并说好，还赏了黄辫子荷包一对，四喜搬指儿一个呢。你要去，我明日就荐你，包管可成。」聘才听得喜动颜色，忙作揖谢了。因又想着这个老阎有些碍眼。忽又想道：「各人办各人的事，不与他往来便了。」再坐了一回，辞了富三回寓。","en":"pouch and a four-happiness ring. If you wish to go, I will recommend you tomorrow. I guarantee it will work out.\\" Pincai's face lit up with pleasure, and he bowed in gratitude. He considered Old Yan an obstacle but reasoned, \\"Everyone minds their own affairs; if I simply avoid him, there will be no issue.\\" After sitting a while longer, he took his leave of Fu the Third"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":2,"tokens":["聘才","魏聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"明日，富三就到华公府来，见了华公子，就荐聘才进府，帮办杂务。华公子应了，说道：「我这里到不拘人多人少，只要人好，是你的好朋友。自然不用讲了。说请你去讲一声，请他来就是了。」即吩咐林珊枝传谕总办，将魏师爷修金钦馔说定，富三连连答应几个「是」！又进去见了华夫人，就辞了，一径出城，通知了魏聘才，请其","en":"The following day, Fu the Third arrived at the Hua mansion, met Young Master Hua, and recommended Pincai as a secretary to handle miscellaneous affairs. Young Master Hua agreed, saying, \\"I have no strict limit on staff here. As long as the person is capable and your close friend, there is nothing to discuss. Tell him he is invited and ask him to come.\\""},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":2,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"是日聘才就与子玉说明，并谢数月叨扰。子玉吃惊道：「大哥何故要去，莫非嫌小弟有得罪之处么？」聘才连连陪笑道：「愚兄自到贵府以来，承伯父母同棣台如此恩待，岂尚有不足？无奈愚兄此番进京，家父谆谕自己，定要谋一前程出京。","en":"That same day, Pincai explained the situation to Ziyu, expressing his gratitude for the months of hospitality. Ziyu was taken aback, asking, \\"Elder Brother, why must you leave? Have I done something to offend you?\\" Pincai laughed reassuringly and replied, \\"Since arriving"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":2,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"来的，棣台若不忘怀，华府园亭，闻说是极好逛的。伯母前请棣台先为禀明，明日起身时，再进去叩谢。」李元茂在旁，闻得聘才要进华府，心中有些难过，道：「你去了只剩了我，且你也少了个伴儿。我闻得华公子脾气不好，你倒不要去吃钉板，还是在此罢，过年再说。」聘才道：「各人有各人的打算，我如今比不上你了。你是知县少爷，享现成的福，我不但自己不能受用，还要顾家呢！」子玉听到这句，便","en":"tomorrow, I will pay my respects and take my leave.\\" Li Yuanmao, standing nearby, felt a pang of sadness upon hearing Pincai was bound for the Hua household. \\"If you leave, I will be here alone, and you will lose a companion. I have heard Young Master Hua has a difficult temper; you had better not go and invite trouble. Stay here instead, and we can reconsider after the New"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":3,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"是晚即命子玉与聘才饯行，又送出四十两银子与聘才，聘才感激不尽。一夜与元茂谈谈讲讲，各有难分之意。","en":"That evening, Lady Yan had Ziyu host a farewell dinner for Pincai, presenting him with forty taels of silver. Pincai was overwhelmed with gratitude. He and Yuanmao talked late into the night, both reluctant to part ways."},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":7,"tokens":["聘才","魏聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"明早富三爷即遣人带了两辆车来接聘才，聘才即拜别颜夫人并子玉，又辞了元茂，收拾停妥，带了四儿一径上车。先到富宅略叙片时，富三亲送到华府。到了门口，富三先着人回进去，并说魏师爷来了。聘才在车内一望这门面，就觉威严得了不得，就是南京总督衙门，也无此高大。门前一座大照墙，用水磨砖砌成，上下镂","en":"Early the next morning, Fu the Third sent two carriages to collect Pincai. After bidding farewell to Lady Yan, Ziyu, and Yuanmao, Pincai gathered his belongings, brought Si'er along, and boarded the carriage. They first stopped at the Fu residence for a brief visit before Fu the Third personally escorted him to the Hua mansion."},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":2,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"正是个锦天绣地，令人目炫神乱。富三与聘才就坐在椅子上，等有两盏茶时候，忽见一个书童出来说：「公子今日不爽快，请三爷与师爷到东花园和各位师爷们见见，就请魏师爷在东花园与张师爷、顾师爷在一块儿住罢。」富三又说：「替我请安。」聘才也站起身道：「替我亦说到。」小厮答应了「是」。窗外那个书童就请富、","en":"It was a realm of embroidered splendor, enough to dazzle the eyes and bewilder the mind. Fu the Third and Pincai took their seats, waiting for the time it takes to drink two cups of tea. Suddenly, a page boy emerged and announced, \\"The Young Master is feeling unwell today. He invites the Third Master and the Master Secretary to the East Garden to meet the other"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":5,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"那东花园却在前面东首，聘才跟着富三，重新向外弯弯转转，尽走的回廊，处处多有人伺候。华府规矩：每一重门，有一个总管，有事出进都要登号簿的。聘才走了半天，心中也记不清过了多少庭院。及走到穿堂后身，东首有一条夹巷，觉有半里路长。又进了一重门，才见一个花园。这花园却也不小，有亭有台，","en":"The East Garden lay to the front and east. Pincai followed Fu the Third through a maze of winding corridors, encountering attendants at every turn. The Hua mansion operated under strict rules: each gate had a steward, and every entry and exit was recorded in a ledger. After walking for quite some time,"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":4,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"阎、王二老便道：「好说，好说，东人慕名请来的，自然是个名下无虚的了，我们都要请教。」聘才连声说：「不敢。」富三爷道：「这魏老大是我的把弟，且系南城外梅大人的世侄，极有本事，最够朋友的。此刻新来府中，一切都不在行，先生们自然要携带携带，都是一家人，倒不要生分才好。我明日见了我们舅太爷，还要面托的。」又对聘才道：「咱们到里头屋子，瞧瞧住那一","en":"invited you based on your reputation, you surely possess genuine talent. We look forward to learning from you.\\" Pincai repeatedly murmured, \\"I would not dare.\\" Third Master Fu interjected, \\"Brother Wei is my sworn brother and a close nephew of Lord Mei from outside the south city. He is highly capable and a true friend. Being new to the household, he naturally needs"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":3,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"三爷站起来道了谢。又道：「时候也不早了，刚是吃饭时候了。」大家就在中间屋子里圆桌上吃起来，无拘无束，甚为畅快。聘才见这席菜，只是上不完，大碗、中碗、大碟、小碟通计有四十多样。众人直饮到二更，富三方辞了众人出去。他的家人提灯伺候，聘才送到园门，富三又唠唠叨叨嘱咐一番。聘才尚要送出，富三道：","en":"time to eat.\\" They gathered around the round table in the central room, enjoying a relaxed and cheerful meal. Pincai marvelled at the endless array of dishes; large and small bowls, grand and modest plates—totaling over forty varieties. They drank until the second watch before Fu the Third finally took his leave. His servants waited with lanterns as Pincai escorted"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":1,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「不要送了，回来你认不得进园子倒累坠，咱们歇天再见罢。」于是不顾而去。聘才进内又与张、顾二人谈了好一回，又探问了好些府中光景方歇。","en":"would only cause trouble. We will see each other in a few days.\\" With that, he departed without looking back. Pincai returned inside and conversed with Zhang and Gu for quite some time, inquiring about the intricate workings of the household before finally retiring for the night."},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":3,"tokens":["聘才","魏聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"次日，张、顾二人，又引聘才去见了各项的朋友，连府中总管的爷们，以及账房、司阍、司厨、管马号、掌库房，并各处门口挂号簿的人，凡有头脑的，都一一见了。正是侯门如海，聘才初进来是一样摸不着的，反觉拘束得很，连话也不敢多说一句，惟有小心谨慎，恭维众人而已。看官记明：从此魏聘才进了华公","en":"The following day, Zhang and Gu introduced Pincai to his various colleagues and the household's managing stewards, including those in charge of the treasury, the gates, the kitchens, the stables, the storehouses, and the ledger-keepers at every entrance. He met everyone of significance. The mansion"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":1,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"却说子玉因聘才去了，心中也着实思念了几天。此时是四月中旬，因有个闰五月，所以节气较迟，尚见芍药盛开，庭外又有丁香、海棠等，红香粉腻，素面冰心，独自玩赏了一回。","en":"Meanwhile, Ziyu found himself deeply missing Pincai for several days following his departure. It was the middle of the fourth month, and because there was an intercalary fifth month, the season had shifted slightly later than usual. Peonies still bloomed vibrantly in the courtyard, accompanied by lilacs"},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":1,"tokens":["魏聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"的坐下。素兰只管笑嘻嘻的问长问短，又问你到底待那玉侬何如？子玉被问不过，只得说道：「玉侬之事，其说甚长。」就把魏聘才途中所见情景，说出至今年会馆中见他一出《惊梦》，真是绝世无双，情文互至，尚未悉其性情抱负。及到怡园为假琴官所戏，我说出思慕琴言，原为其守身如玉，落落难合，不料其自弃如此。那时玉侬在屏后听了呜咽欲绝，及同席时又彼此都讲不出什么来，倒像是前生相契，今生重","en":"deflect the questions any longer, Ziyu sighed, \\"The matter of Yunong is a long story.\\" He recounted the scene Wei Pincai had witnessed during his journey, and how he himself had been captivated by Yunong's incomparable performance of 'The Interrupted Dream' at the guild hall earlier that year, before he had even come to know Yunong's character and inner depth. He spoke"}],"18":[{"paragraph":6,"mentions":4,"tokens":["魏聘才","聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"再说魏聘才进了华公府，满拟锦上添花，立时可以发迹，那晓得进去了一月，宾主尚未见面。几次请见，只以有事辞之，所往来交接者，皆不三不四的人。又有那一班豪奴，架子很大，见了居然长揖，公然上坐，所说的话，无非懵懵懂懂。少年的意气扬扬，强作解事；老年的倚老卖老，一味藏奸","en":"Now let us speak of Wei Pincai, who had entered the Hua mansion full of expectation, imagining he would immediately make his mark. Who could have known that after a month inside, the host and guest had still not come face to face? The several times he had asked for an audience, he"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":2,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"来，正觉得车如流水马如龙，比城里热闹了好些。顺着路，走到鸣珂坊梅宅来，进去见子玉，卧病未愈，精神懒散。子玉问起聘才光景，聘才只得说好，随口撒了几句谎。又去见了颜夫人，道了谢，即出来找李元茂，只见锁了房门，遂复辞了子玉出门，冷冷清清，到何处去呢？","en":"residence on Mingke Alley, went in and found Ziyu still ill in bed, listless and low-spirited. Ziyu asked how Pincai was doing; Pincai could only speak positively, rattling off a few easy lies. He then went to pay his respects to Lady Yan and express his thanks. Coming out to find Li Yuanmao, he discovered his door locked. He took his leave of Ziyu again and went out,"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":2,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"问了些寒温，吃了一杯茶，略坐了一坐。仲雨道：「老弟如今进城，是难得出城的，何不找个地方坐坐，听出戏解个闷儿。」聘才道：「很好。这两天实也劳乏了，要去就去。」于是二人同了出来，到了戏园拣个地方坐下。看了两三出戏，也有些相公陪着说话。远远望见李元茂同着孙嗣徽，在对面楼下。聘才过去，讲了几句话，又过来。","en":"city, it must be hard to get out often. Why not find a place to sit and watch some opera to dispel the tedium?\\" Pincai replied: \\"Very well. I have actually been quite worn out these past two days, so if we are going, let us go.\\" So the two of them went together to the theater, found seats, and watched two or three plays. Some young protégés came by to chat with them."},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":4,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"亲，天生一对废物，照应他做什么？」是日，这几出戏，觉得陈腐欠新，仲雨坐不住，说道：「去罢！」算给了坐儿钱，与出聘才同上了酒楼，小酌叙谈。仲雨见聘才似乎兴致不佳，不像从前光景，因问道：「听见老弟进了华公府，那里局面宽大，且华公子是爱交接的，近来光景自然大有起色了。」聘才道：「仁兄不问，弟亦不便说起。始而富三爷讲起华公子有孟尝之名，门下食客数百人。弟进去了，门客却不","en":"and old-fashioned, making Zhongyu restless enough to say: \\"Let us go.\\" He paid for the seats, and together with Pincai went up to a wine-house for a small drink and a talk. Observing that Pincai appeared in poor spirits and lacked his usual demeanor, Zhongyu asked: \\"I heard you have entered the Hua family mansion. Given the grandeur of that establishment, and that the"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":6,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"聘才道：「那十样呢？」仲雨道：「一团和气，二等才情，三斤酒量，四季衣服，五声音律，六品官衔，七言诗句，八面张罗，九流通透，十分应酬。」聘才摇摇头道：「要这许多？」仲雨道：「底下每句还要加个不字呢！一团和气要不变，二等才情要不露，三斤酒量要不醉，四季衣服要","en":"Pincai said: \\"What are the ten qualities?\\" Zhongyu said: \\"A full measure of amiability; a second-tier degree of talent; three jin's capacity for wine; four-seasons appropriate dress; mastery of the five musical scales; an official rank of the sixth grade; skill"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":1,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"爷好，明日又听见说魏师爷好，就打动他的心了。这教做放线雀儿，几十丈线放了出去终究收得回来，只不要可惜小本钱。」聘才点点头道：「承教，随教！」仲雨又道：「譬如你同华公子交接过了，你看他是什么脾气，喜的是什么样，恶的是什么样，自然是顺他意见。","en":"string, knowing that in the end, it will always be reeled back in. Just don't begrudge the small initial outlay.\\" Pincai nodded and said: \\"I am much obliged and truly grateful!\\" Zhongyu continued: \\"For instance, once you've established a connection with the young master, observe what his temperament is, what pleases him and what he dislikes, and naturally follow his preferences."},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":5,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"能讲的，他却会懵人。你自己要看得清：可应酬则应酬，不必应酬就不应酬；你应酬那不中用的人，被那要紧人就看轻了。」聘才听了大笑道：「吾兄真是当今第一个大才，陈平之智，诸葛之谋，也不过如此，能把天下人的性情脾气，如写在手掌中，弟当以门生贴来拜老师，庶可传授心法。」仲雨笑道：「我都与你说了，还拜什么老师？依着做去包管不错，将来有了好处，不要忘了老师，就算你门生的良心了。","en":"attending to, don't attend to. If you attend to those who are useless, the ones who matter will look down on you.\\" Pincai burst out laughing when he heard all this: \\"Elder brother is truly the foremost great talent of our time. Chen Ping's stratagems and Zhuge Liang's plans are no more than this. You can describe the temperament and character of every sort of person in"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":2,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"众人听不出什么来，聘才却明白是骂他们二人的，几乎放声笑起来，只得忍住。再看那个生得好的，却像是新出来的。原来京里妓女，要进大局儿的，倒先要在东园、西厂落几天，见见市面，自然就不知羞耻，老练起来。如行院中不好的打下来，又到此两处。这个就是高品所说，从广西新来的白菊花了。聘才","en":"While the bystanders could not make out the meaning, Pincai understood perfectly that she was insulting those two. He nearly burst out laughing and had to hold it in. He looked again at the good-looking one, who appeared to be a newcomer. In the capital, a prostitute wanting to enter a proper establishment would"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":8,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"元茂系近视眼，索性挤进去门里呆看。聘才见那妇人，一面弹，一面唱道：杨柳枝、杨柳枝，昔年宫里斗腰肢。如今弃向道旁种，翠结双眉怨路岐。画船何处系，骏马向风嘶。盼不到东君二月陌头来，只做了秋林憔悴西风里。又见他把弦紧了一紧，和了一和，便高了一调了，再唱道：想当年是鸳与鸯，到今是参与商，果然是露","en":"Yuanmao, being shortsighted, pushed straight through into the doorway and stood there staring. Pincai watched the woman play and sing:\\n\\n\\"The willow branch, the willow branch,\\nIn years past, within the palace, we vied in slender waists.\\nNow cast aside to grow at the roadside,\\nKingfisher brows knotted, lamenting the crossroads.\\nWhere is the painted boat"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":3,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"美哉！价廉而工省。明日我与汝姑一试之，若迟迟吾行，恐为捷足先得，则虽悔莫追矣。只要其乐陶陶，又何论十目所视。」聘才听他仍是咬文嚼字，满口胡柴，忍住笑，只好由他罢了。到了路口，各人分路。聘才听得后面车声磷磷，直走过去，聘才连忙让开，只见坐在车里的就是方才弹唱的那个媳妇，车沿上坐着一个老婆子，跑得风快的过去了。","en":"though we repent it will be too late. As long as one finds true pleasure, why mind ten pairs of watching eyes?\\" Pincai, hearing him still mouthing his pedantic bookish phrases and talking absolute nonsense, suppressed his laughter and let it pass. At the crossroads they went their separate ways. Behind Pincai came the rumbling of a carriage passing at speed; Pincai quickly"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":1,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"且按下聘才那边。","en":"But let us set aside Pincai's side of the story."}],"19":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":2,"tokens":["魏聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说魏聘才自得仲雨传授，依法行之，先于林珊枝面前献尽殷懃，又于八龄班赔尽辛苦。珊枝本系联锦部有名小旦，继进登春班，华公子看中了他，遂以重价买进。后来之八龄班皆系珊枝所教。这林珊枝不消说是音律精通了。魏聘才本是个伶俐人，昆曲唱得绝好，就是吹弹也应酬的上来。更兼旧","en":"Following Zhongyu's instructions, Pincai put them into practice: he first lavished every effort on winning Lin Shanzhi's favor, and then painstakingly cultivated the goodwill of the Eight Ages. Shanzhi had originally been a celebrated young dan actor in the Lianjin troupe; he later joined the"},{"paragraph":2,"mentions":3,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一日，林珊枝教玉龄唱曲，适值聘才闲闯进来，珊枝就请他坐了，一面教着。刚刚这曲子是聘才最得意的，便在旁帮起腔来，五音不乱，唇齿分明，竟唱得出神入妙，把个林珊枝倒惊倒了。即由此相好，就在华公子面前，朝朝暮暮，称赞聘才。","en":"One day, Lin Shanzhi was teaching Yuling to sing an aria when Pincai happened to wander in. Shanzhi invited him to sit while he continued the lesson. As it happened, this aria was one of Pincai's favorites, so he began to sing along from the sidelines; his pitch was flawless and his articulation perfectly clear. He sang"},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":2,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"最信珊枝的，他又不轻易赞人，他肯赞好，必是真好了，心上就有了这个人。那八龄班内的都是些苏、扬人，脾气自然相合。聘才会讨好，今日送这个一把扇子，明日送那个一个荷囊，总是称心称意，小孩子喜欢的东西，觉得这位师爷实在知趣。至于管总的、办事的，尤巴结得周到，不到一月，竟人人说起好来。阎、王二公是不必说，就张、顾两位虽然也会拉拢，无如总不及聘才之和气周匝，鞠躬尽瘁的光景。","en":"Shanzhi did not praise people lightly, if he was willing to praise someone, they must truly be excellent. Thus, Pincai gained a firm place in the young master's heart. The members of the Eight-Ages Troupe were all from Suzhou and Yangzhou, so their temperaments naturally matched his. Pincai knew how to curry favor: today he would give someone a fan, tomorrow a lotus-shaped"},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":2,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一日，打听华公子出门去了，聘才约了张笑梅出城。笑梅要找冯子佩，二人同车即到冯子佩家来。这子佩是与华公子最熟的，已与聘才见过，彼此合式。冯子佩也是个宦家子弟，只因早丧严亲，又积些宦囊，其母钟爱，任凭他游荡歌场，结交豪贵，后来家业渐渐萧条。又亏了几个好友帮扶，所以觉得银钱应手，服御鲜","en":"One day, having learned that the young master had gone out, Pincai invited Zhang Xiaomei to come out of the city. Xiaomei wanted to find Feng Zipei, so the two shared a carriage straight to Feng Zipei's house. This Zipei was the most familiar with Young Master Hua; he had already met Pincai, and the two hit it off well."},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":3,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这天张、魏两人出来，带着一个小使，到了子佩门口，着小使进去问了。刚好在家，请了进去，到书房坐下。聘才是初次登堂，看那屋子是朝北两间，铺设倒也华丽，就觉得满桌子东西，残书、笔、砚、玩器等物颠颠倒倒乱杂无章。壁间挂些箫管、琵琶，又有刀箭等物。聘才对笑梅说道：「小冯这么一个样儿，怎么屋子里东西，也不检点检点。」笑梅笑道：「他未必有检点的工夫，世间人最没有","en":"go in to inquire. Fortunately, he was at home and invited them in, leading them to sit in the study. This was Pincai's first visit. Seeing that the room consisted of two north-facing bays and was quite splendidly furnished, he also noticed that the table was completely covered with scattered books, brushes, inkstones, and curios, all jumbled together in complete disorder."},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":1,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"」便把子佩脸上闻了一闻，又道：「好香！到不是二太爷，直是个小哥儿。」子佩道：「你又浪，闹得二太爷心上受不得。」聘才在旁大笑，三人厮混一阵，然后坐了，却大家讲不出什么话来。」","en":"young master.\\" Zipei said: \\"You're being frivolous again, acting up so that Lord Number Two can hardly bear it.\\" Pincai laughed heartily from the side. The three of them horsed around for a while before sitting down, though none of them could think of anything particular to say."},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":1,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"听得门口有人嚷道：「冯老二在家吗？」子佩接着道：「没有在家。」聘才听得声音很熟，只见一个直闯进来，道：「好阿！你在洞里头，还答应不在家。」众人一看，原来是杨梅窗，皆是熟识的，更为热闹了，大家说些无非是游戏欢乐的话。四人商议道：「难道今日说些闲话，就算了事不成，可不辜负了韶光么？」笑梅道：「我们是打算听戏的。」冯子佩","en":"outside came the sound of someone shouting: \\"Is Feng Number Two at home?\\" Zipei answered back: \\"Not at home.\\" Pincai thought the voice sounded very familiar, and then saw someone barge straight in, saying: \\"Well, well! You're hiding in your cave and yet you answer that you're not at home.\\" They all looked and saw it was Yang Meichuang; everyone was well-acquainted,"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":4,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"桌果碟儿，遂一样一样摆上来。四人饮了一回，又说些笑话，梅窗道：「咱们就这么算了，叫走堂的也瞧不起，叫个人罢。」聘才是最高兴的，便道：「很好，叫谁呢？」梅窗笑道：「我意中人却多，又喜欢新鲜，不比人家天天总叫那个人。我前日见联珠班内有个叫玉林，生得很好，一下台就有人同了出去，想是很红的。」聘才道：「料没有琴官好。」梅窗道：「那个琴官？」聘才就把新年看戏的话，略述了些","en":"Meichuang said: \\"We can't just leave it at this; even the waiter will look down on us. Let's call for someone.\\" Pincai was the most eager and said: \\"Excellent; who shall we call?\\" Meichuang laughed: \\"I have many favorites, and I like novelty; I'm not like some people who always call the same person every day. The day before yesterday I saw a boy in the Lianzhu troupe"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":3,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"只见那走堂的进来道：「琴官、玉林都说病着不能来，蓉官就来。」聘才原料琴官不来的，只好罢了。倒是杨梅窗心上不快，说道：「怎么叫三个人，倒有两个不来？不知是真病呢，还是推托的？笑梅道：「自然是真病，推托什么。」聘才道：「还有个琪官也是很好的，我正月里叫过他几回，倒是全来的。」聘才又写了条子去叫琪官，梅窗另叫了二喜。走","en":"Then the waiter came in and said: \\"Qinguan and Yulin both say they're ill and can't come; Rongguan is coming.\\" Pincai had originally expected Qinguan wouldn't come, so he simply let it be. But Yang Meichuang was displeased in his heart and said: \\"How is it that of three people called, two are not coming? I wonder if they are truly ill, or just making excuses?\\" Xiaomei"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":6,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"安，就在梅窗肩下坐了。斟了一巡酒，送了一巡菜，便问道：「今日席间还叫谁？」梅窗道：「叫的都是有病的，不能来。」聘才见了二喜，便不大欢喜，因正月里吃了他多少刻薄话。二喜倒不记在心，且那日开发，聘才明日即已送去，没有漂他的，所以二喜还看得起，遂问聘才道：「从前那一位姓什么？那个瞅瞅眼儿。叫小利偷了银子的，如今总不见他。」聘才道：「我如今在城里住了，这些朋友是不大往来","en":"asked: \\"Who else is called to the table today?\\" Meichuang said: \\"The ones called are all ill and cannot come.\\" Pincai was not very pleased to see Erxi, because in the first month he had endured many cutting remarks from him. Erxi, however, did not hold a grudge; moreover, the bill from that day had been sent over by Pincai the very next day, without any evasion, so"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":2,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，要去告那个人。琪官今日也不能来的。」于是大家问起什么事，二喜道：「说来话长，且喝两钟再说。」众人又干了几杯。聘才听说琪官闹事，便又问二喜道：「你就说来，大家听听。」二喜道：「有一位广东奚十一老爷，你们相好不相好？」三人说都不相识，冯子佩道：「我会过这人，却不相好，你有话尽说。」二喜道：「这奚老爷是在京候选的，听说带了几万银子进来，要捐一个大官。谁知用动了，就凑","en":"Erxi said: \\"It is a long story; let's drink two cups first before I tell it.\\" Everyone drained several more cups. Pincai, hearing that Qiguan was involved in an incident, asked Erxi: \\"Tell us about it, so we can all hear.\\" Erxi said: \\"There is a Lord Xi the Eleventh from Guangdong; are you gentlemen acquainted with him?\\" The three said they did not know him. Feng Zipei"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":2,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"佩把梅窗啐了两口。梅窗道：「他这个桶子，咱们京里不知会做不会做？」笑梅笑道：「你也要学样子么？」梅窗笑了一笑。聘才笑对二喜道：「你讲得这么清楚，这桶子你想必看过的了。」二喜脸上一红，便斜睃了一眼，就要拧聘才的嘴。梅窗道：「他未必要用着桶子。」二喜又将梅窗拧了两把，说道：「咱们作买卖的人，有钱就好，何必那样拿身分呢。可惜他们不像你能会看风水，所以才吃了这场苦。」","en":"the capital, or not?\\" Xiaomei laughed: \\"Are you thinking of copying the design?\\" Meichuang gave a little laugh. Pincai laughed and said to Erxi: \\"You've described it so clearly, you must have had a look at the barrel yourself.\\" Erxi's face reddened, and with a sideways glance he reached over to pinch Pincai's mouth. Meichuang said: \\"He probably doesn't need to use the"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":4,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"说罢自己也笑了。聘才心中暗忖道：「倒不料琴官、琪官，既唱了戏，还这么傲性子，有骨气，这也奇了。」即问二喜道这奚十一到底是什么人？这样横行霸道，又这样有钱？」二喜道：「我听得春兰讲，说也是个少爷，他家祖太爷做过布政司，他父亲现做提督呢。」聘才道：「如今春兰呢？」二喜道：「","en":"Having said this, Erxi laughed himself. Pincai thought privately: \\"Who would have expected that Qinguan and Qiguan, even as performers, should be so proud and dignified, so steadfast in their principles. That is something to marvel at.\\" He then asked Erxi who exactly this Xi Eleven was, and how he"}],"21":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["魏聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"此回书又要讲那魏聘才，在华府中住了一月有余，上上下下皆用心周旋的十分很好，又因华公子待他有些颜面，银钱又宽展起来，便有些小人得志，就不肯安分了。内有顾月卿、张笑梅，外有杨梅窗、冯子佩一班人朝欢暮乐，所见所闻，无非势力钻营等事，是以渐渐心肥胆大。从前在梅宅有士燮学士在家，","en":"This installment turns again to Wei Pincai. After dwelling in the Hua mansion for more than a month he had cultivated everyone above and below with such thorough success that Young Master Hua granted him some dignity and his purse grew easier; thereupon he began to show the petty man's triumph"},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":3,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"七情所感而起，叫这些草根树皮如何解劝得来。只有子玉自己明白，除非是琴言亲来，爽爽快快的谈一昼夜，即可霍然。倒是聘才猜着了几分，进来问了好些话。子玉因这几日没人来，便觉气闷，聘才来了，也稍可排解。问那华公府内光景，聘才即把华公子称赞得上天下地选不出来，又夸其亲随林珊枝及八龄班怎样的好，就说琴言也不能及他。","en":"— unless Qinyan came in person and talked freely through a whole day and night he could not suddenly recover. Pincai guessed part of this; entering, he asked many questions. With no visitors these few days Ziyu felt stifled — Pincai's presence eased him somewhat. Asked how things stood at the Hua mansion, Pincai praised Young Master Hua as unequalled under heaven,"},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":9,"tokens":["聘才","魏聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉听到提起琴言，便又感动他的心事，即对聘才道：「琴言原是吾兄说起的，及我亲见其人，果是绝世无双，怎么如今说有多少比他好的呢？」聘才道：「琴言相貌原生得好，但其性情过冷，譬如一枝花，颜色是好极了，偏在树高头，攀折不到，叫你不能亲近他，人若爱花，自然爱那近在手边的了；譬如冬天的月，清光皎皎，分外","en":"At mention of Qinyan Ziyu's old sorrow stirred; he said to Pincai: \\"You were the first to speak of Qinyan — when I met him he seemed peerless in the world; how can there now be so many said to surpass him?\\" Pincai replied: \\"Qinyan's looks are indeed fine, but his temper is cold — like a blossom whose color is superb"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":5,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"恰好长庆出门去了，聘才便径进琴言卧室。只见绿窗深闭，小院无人，庭前一棵梅树，结满了一树黄梅，红绽半边，地下也落了几个。忽听得一声：「客来了，莫要进来！」抬头一看，檐下却挂了一个白鹦鹉，见聘才便说起话来。对面厢房内，走出一人，便来挡住道：「相公病着，不能见客，请老爷外面客房","en":"As it happened Changqing had gone out; Pincai walked straight into Qinyan's bedchamber. Green windows were tightly shut; the small yard stood empty; a plum tree bore clusters of yellow fruit, half flushed red on one side, several fallen on the ground. Suddenly a voice cried: \\"A guest — do not enter!\\""},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":5,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"聘才再欲进内，只见琴言掀着帘子出来。聘才举目看时，见他穿一件湖色纺绸夹袄，蓝纱薄绵半臂，却比从前消瘦了几分，正似雪里梅花，偏甘冷淡，越觉得动人怜爱。即让聘才在上边坐了，自己却远远的坐在靠窗琴桌边一张梅花式样凳上，叫人送了一碗茶，又有个小孩子拿了一枝白铜水","en":"Pincai was about to step further when Qinyan lifted the curtain and came out. At first sight he wore a pale lake-green lined silk jacket and blue gauze short-sleeved surcoat — somewhat thinner than before, like plum in snow that prefers cold — only the more"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":9,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"聘才知琴言听错了，便道：「庾香是没有搬家，如今我在城里住，不在庾香处了。」琴言听了，便不言语，似觉精神不振，就有些烦闷光景。聘才想道：「他问庾香就高高兴兴的，对我就是这样冰冷，实在可恶。横竖他们不常见面，待我捏造些事哄他，且看他如何？」问琴言道：「这月内","en":"Pincai saw that Qinyan had misunderstood him and explained, \\"Yuxiang has not moved house. It is I who now live inside the city and no longer stay with him.\\" At once Qinyan fell silent. The little brightness that had risen in him faded, and a shadow of fretfulness"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":8,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"想了一回，身子斜靠了琴台，把一个指头慢慢儿捺那琴上的金徽。因又问道：「你见庾香就是这么样，也没有说些别的话？」聘才道：「我出房门时，他才说了一句，说：「你想必去听戏，听什么班子？」我也没有答应他，我就走了。」琴言道：「你这些话，都是真的？」聘才冷笑一声，道：「我是说过谎的吗？信不信由你。」琴言又道：「不是我不信，难道你坐了这半天，就这一句话吗？」聘才道：「我本来","en":"thought chased thought within him. He could neither quite believe nor quite disbelieve the story; yet by the time Pincai finished, a pang of grief had risen unbidden, and several tears slipped down his cheeks. He forced them back with all his strength. Leaning sideways against the qin table, he slowly pressed one finger upon a golden stud of the instrument. After turning"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":1,"tokens":["魏聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这边魏聘才听了心中大怒，意欲发作，忽又转念道：「他是庾香心上人，糟蹋了他，又怕庾香见怪，权且忍耐，慢慢的收拾他。屡次遭他白眼，竟把我看得一钱不值，实在可恨。我不能摆布他，也枉做了华公府的朋友了。只得忿忿而出，坐上了热车，风驰电掣的去了。","en":"Pincai heard this and rage flared — almost to explode — then thought: \\"He is Yuxiang's darling — ruin him and Yuxiang may blame me — endure for now — settle slowly — time and again his cold eyes treat me as worthless — hateful. If I cannot master him what am"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":2,"tokens":["魏聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「哭什么？你病还没有好些，就这么伤心，正是雪上加霜了，所以我不肯对你讲，知道你要伤心的」。琴言忽又蹬足道：「这魏聘才真不是个东西，无缘无故的糟蹋人，玷污人，造言生事。」素兰问道：「那个魏聘才？你因甚骂他？」琴言便将帕子掩了脸，索性哭个不止。素兰只得再三解劝，劝得住了哭，把前日宝珠、蕙芳行的酒令说给琴言听。说瑶卿还罢了，第一媚香尖利不肯吃亏的，偏偏吃了这闷亏；又听得","en":"weep — you are barely mending — grief only heaps frost on snow — that is why I would not tell.\\" Qinyan stamped: \\"Wei Pincai is less than human — slandering and staining people for nothing.\\" Sulan asked who Wei Pincai was; Qinyan hid his face in the sleeve and wept without stopping; Sulan coaxed until he ceased, then told the drinking game the other day with Baozhu and Huifang"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":2,"tokens":["魏聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴言听了这些话，略有笑容。素兰便问魏聘才是何人，琴言略把去年搭船进京，及住在梅宅的话，说了几句，即对素兰道：「细听起来，这魏聘才真是个小人，你问他怎的，不如不提他为妙。」素兰道：「不为别的，我昨日在春阳楼吃饭，听得说，掌柜的闹了一件事，得罪了华公府一个师爷，便送到兵马司，打了二十个嘴巴，还","en":"Hearing this, Qinyan smiled a little. Sulan asked who Wei Pincai was, and Qinyan gave him a few words about coming up to the capital by boat the year before and lodging at the Mei house, and then said, \\"When one listens closely, this Wei Pincai is a mean sort of man. Why ask about him? Better not to speak of him at"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":6,"tokens":["魏聘才","聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"几十吊钱，去讲了情，只打了二十，才放出来；又送了两桌酒席与张二爷。他们说是魏什么才，方才听你骂他，想必就是这个魏聘才了。」琴言道：「管他是不是，横竖叫魏聘才的总不是东西就是了。」因又问道：「那日你同庾香来，遇见我师傅请客。那一回的说话，还没有说完，到底讲什么？」素兰就把那一天子玉的光景，细细述了一遍，又道：「我也为你说得口渴了，你茶都没有一碗。」琴言笑道：「说话说","en":"the culprit was named Wei Something-cai. Hearing you curse him just now, I imagine it can only have been this Wei Pincai.\\"\\n\\n\\"Whether it was or not,\\" said Qinyan, \\"anyone named Wei Pincai is certainly no decent thing.\\" He then asked, \\"That day when you came with Yuxiang and found my master entertaining guests, you never finished what you had begun to tell me. What exactly"}],"22":[{"paragraph":8,"mentions":1,"tokens":["魏聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"你猜着这两人是谁？无缘无故来闹？原来一个是华府中的车夫，那个青衫子是跟官厨的三小子，魏聘才花了八吊钱买出来的。","en":"carriage-driver of the Hua mansion; the one in the dark gown was the third boy of the resident cook — bought for the work by Wei Pincai at a cost of eight strings of cash."},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":2,"tokens":["魏聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"：「我看这两人，像是大门子里赶车的，或是三爷，不要就是那个姓魏的指使来的也未可知。」琴言道：「不知是不是，但则魏聘才何仇于我，要使人来吵呢？」既又一想，恍然大悟道：「不错，不错！定是魏聘才使来的。不然，断无一进门来，无缘无故就骂的道理。","en":"it were that Wei fellow who set them on? It is not impossible.\\" Qinyan said: \\"Who can say? But what quarrel has Wei Pincai with me, that he should send men to raise a row?\\" Then, thinking again, he saw it all at once: \\"Yes — yes! It must be Wei Pincai's doing. Otherwise there is no sense in men walking in at the gate and cursing without cause or reason.\\""},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":5,"tokens":["魏聘才","聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"。」说罢又哭，子玉劝道：「不妨，只要你身子好了，天天可以见得的，何必要一年呢。」琴言又哭道：「我就要好，只怕这魏聘才也不容我好，他是要我死了才甘心的。」子玉听了吃惊道：「你倒不要错怪这魏聘才，他背地里到极口说你好的。」琴言顿足道：「你还不知道呢，他若说我好，也不造你的谣言了，也不叫人闹上门了。」子玉不知缘故，便又问道：「这些话我全不懂得，聘才怎样造谣言？又怎样来闹","en":"health mend, and we may meet every day; why speak of a year?\\" Qinyan wept on: \\"Mend I might; only I fear this Wei Pincai will not suffer me to mend — nothing short of my death will content him.\\" Ziyu was startled: \\"You must not wrong Wei Pincai there — behind your back he praises you to the skies.\\" Qinyan stamped his foot: \\"You do not know yet! If he spoke well of me,"}],"24":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":3,"tokens":["魏聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"恂笑道：「都是你的好作成，若论女貌郎才倒是一对。只我那泰山、泰水听见了，是要气坏的。」仲清道：「我还听得说，那魏聘才进了华公府，就变了相，在外边很不安分：闹了春阳馆，送了掌柜的，打了二十还不要紧。又听得陆素兰对人说，魏聘才买出华公府一个车夫，一个三小子，去糟蹋琴言，直骂了半天。琴言的人磕头请安赔了不是，又送了他几吊钱才走。「王恂道：「奇了，这几天就有这许多事。我们","en":"If my father- and mother-in-law ever found out, they would burst with rage.\\" Zhongqing went on, \\"Then there is Wei Pincai. Ever since he entered the Hua mansion, he has completely changed his tune. He behaves with utter insolence outside. He caused a massive uproar at the Chunyang Restaurant—the proprietor was beaten twenty strokes, and that wasn't even the worst of it."},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":3,"tokens":["魏聘才","聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"公子的举动，虽未与之谋面，但其豪爽是常听见的。我知其用情阔大，与度香同源异流，所以度香常赞他，也很佩服他。至若魏聘才、冯子佩、潘三等，真可谓情中之蠹，近其人则蠹身，顺其情则蠹心。天生这班人，在正人堆里作崇。还听得有个奚十一，专爱糟蹋相公，有一个木桶哄人，不到手不歇，受其荼毒者不少。前日琪官竟为所骗，幸其性烈，毁其木桶而出，双手竟刮得稀烂，至今尚未全好，此是情中的盗","en":"feeling matches Duxiang's source, though it flows from a different stream. Duxiang honors him greatly. As for Wei Pincai, Feng Zipei, and Pan the Third, they are mere worms devouring the grain of passion. To be near them rots the body, and to follow them rots the heart—they were born to plague decent folk. Then there is Xi Eleven, who ruins actors by trapping them in a"}],"26":[{"paragraph":3,"mentions":1,"tokens":["魏聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"有什么要紧话，请爷明早讲罢。况要开两三重门，从东园去请来，差不多就二更了，只怕师爷们也要安歇了。」林珊枝知道找魏聘才定是件不要紧事，不过讲今天看戏的话，便阻挡起来。华公子想了一想，果然没有什么要紧，也只得依了，便道：「既锁了门，到明日也还不迟。」停了一停，又对珊枝道：「那个宝珠的戏，我倒是初见，倒不料他如此之妙，怎么他们总不进府来？」","en":"Aizhu lifted the amber lantern to Shanzhi's face, smiling playfully. \\"Your face is flushed red from drinking; you are sure to meet a rebuff when you go in.\\" Shanzhi chuckled, \\"When did I drink? It's your red lantern reflecting on my face that makes you think I'm drunk.\\" Aizhu smiled again and led him slowly into the inner chambers, where the Young Master was chatting and laughing with the maids. Aizhu entered first to announce his arrival, and the Master called him forward. Standing by the window, Shanzhi saw the Young Master sitting cross-legged on a Drunken-Elder couch, flanked by four of the Pearls. Upon seeing him, Young Master Hua instructed, \\"Go and invite Secretary Wei to the Quiet-Green Retreat. I will head over from here; there is something I wish to discuss.\\" Shanzhi replied, \\"The first watch has already sounded, and the East Garden gates are locked, as are the three main gates. If it is nothing urgent, perhaps it would be better to tell him tomorrow. Furthermore, opening several sets of doors to fetch him from the East Garden will take us well into the second watch, and the secretaries will likely have gone to bed.\\" Knowing the summons was merely to discuss the day's opera, Shanzhi deliberately dissuaded him. Realizing it was indeed not pressing, the Young Master conceded, \\"Since the gates are locked, tomorrow will not be too late.\\" After a pause, he added, \\"It was my first time seeing Baozhu perform, and I never expected him to be so fine. Why does their troupe never enter the mansion?\\""},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":8,"tokens":["魏聘才","聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"且说华公子在夫人房内吃过饭，谈谈笑笑已过了午正，却忘了魏聘才在留青精舍等他。却说林珊枝去请魏聘才，聘才已起身多时，将要吃饭，忽听得华公子请吃早饭，叫他到留青精舍去。聘才这一喜，倒像金殿传胪一样，疾忙穿了靴，换了一件新衣，拿把团扇，摇摇摆摆，也不及与张、顾二位说知，就同了珊枝出园，犹一路恭惟，或叫老珊，或称老弟","en":"Master ate with Lady Hua, and their laughter and conversation carried them past noon, completely forgetting that Wei Pincai was waiting at the Quiet-Green Retreat. When Lin Shanzhi came to summon him, Pincai had been awake for some time and was just about to eat. Hearing that the Young Master had invited him to breakfast, he was as elated as a scholar hearing his name called"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":6,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"之约，已经迟了，只好吃晚饭的了，便就从侧边一个角门走出去，却只与留青精舍隔一个院子。 　　珊枝疾忙先去照应了，聘才连忙走出到窗前，华公子已到，聘才便请了一个安。华公子一手拉住说道：「本约足下早上过来谈谈，不料我昨日多吃了酒，今日起来又睡着了，倒叫你久待，可曾用过早饭么？」聘才只得说吃过了。倒是珊枝见聘才饿了半日，心中不忍，说道：「师爷从巳初进来到此刻，只怕还没有","en":"onto the courtyard of the Quiet-Green Retreat, only one courtyard away. Shanzhi hurried ahead to receive him, and Pincai stepped forward to the window as the Young Master arrived. Pincai bowed, but the Young Master seized his hand. \\"I meant to speak with you this morning, but yesterday's wine made me oversleep, keeping you waiting. Have you had breakfast?\\" Pincai lied"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":1,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「我倒费了多少心，买得八个，凑成一班，只想可以压倒外边，谁晓得倒被外边压倒了。你可曾见过他们的戏么？」聘才听此口风，便迎合上来，说道：「见过的。公子若要压倒外边，这也不难，好花不在多，就拣顶好的买几个进来，就可以了。」心上又想道：「他倒中意琴言这东西，殊不知他心上只想着梅庾香，未必想到你。」又想道：「这琴言或者倒是势利的心肠，所以看不起我。若到这府里，自","en":"\\"Who would have guessed that outsiders would eclipse us instead? Have you seen their acting?\\" Catching his drift, Pincai flattered him further. \\"I have seen them. Eclipsing outsiders is not difficult; fine flowers need not crowd a garden. Simply purchase the choicest few, and that will suffice.\\" Inwardly, Pincai plotted: 'He fancies Qinyan, little knowing that Qinyan's"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":4,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"华公子道：「我闻得这两个都是度香所爱，不好去夺他。」聘才道：「度香所爱的是宝珠，琴言不是真喜欢的。公子若当真喜欢他，晚生倒认识，而且常照顾他。他的师傅叫长庆，最爱的是钱，听得公子要，必十分巴结，送上门来的。」华公子倒踌躇不定，心上总碍着徐子云，又因琴言进来，也只得九人，宝珠是断乎不能买的，因此犹豫。聘才再","en":"it would be hard to wrest them away,\\" the Young Master replied. \\"Duxiang truly cherishes Baozhu, not Qinyan,\\" Pincai countered. \\"If the Master desires him, I can assure you it is possible. I know his master, Changqing, quite well, and often patronize his troupe. Changqing loves silver above all else. If he learns the Master wants him, he will crawl to oblige and deliver"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":5,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"明日早饭后，聘才带了四儿，坐了大鞍车，即出城找着了叶茂林，茂林就搭了聘才的车到长庆处来。劈面遇见了张仲雨，两边停了车，茂林让过一边，等聘才出来说话。仲雨问起聘才，聘才把华公子托他之事说了。仲雨道：「怪不得他前天如此高兴，总赏了一百多金子，又将自己的玉佩，给了琴言、宝","en":"The next morning, after breakfast, Pincai took Si'er and a large saddle-cart out of the city to find Ye Maolin. Maolin rode with him to Changqing's residence. Along the way, they ran into Zhang Zhongyu. Both carts halted, and Maolin yielded the right of way as Pincai stepped out to speak. When"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":2,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"说到此，便凑着聘才耳边说了好些，叶茂林听不清楚，只见聘才点头说道：「我自有道理，进来了还由得他？」又说了几句别的事，各人分道走了。","en":"Zhongyu then whispered at length into Pincai's ear. Ye Maolin could not hear the words, but saw Pincai nod emphatically. \\"I know my own mind,\\" Pincai muttered. \\"Once he is inside, will he not have to bend?\\" After exchanging a few more words, they parted ways."},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":8,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"到了琴言门口，叶茂林先下来，同了聘才进内。恰好长庆在家，请进坐了。长庆打量了聘才一回，又因是叶茂林同来，便当是不要紧人，淡淡招呼了几句。茂林道：「这位魏师老爷，是华公府的师老爷，与公子是最相好的，闻你的大名，特来相访。还有一句话要商量。」长庆听了，登时满面添花的趋奉起来，师老爷长，师老","en":"Arriving at Qinyan's door, Maolin alighted first and entered alongside Pincai. Fortunately, Changqing was home and invited them to sit. Changqing looked Pincai over, and because he had come in Ye Maolin's company took him for a person of no consequence, greeting him coolly. Maolin interjected, \\"This is Secretary Wei, the closest"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":1,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"说罢又送了一口来，聘才接了又道：「今日我就为这件事和你商量。昨日我们东家，见了他那出《寻梦》，爱得了不得，回去赞了一天。意欲要他进府里去，不晓得你舍得舍不得？」","en":"Changqing offered another puff; Pincai accepted it and continued. \\"Today's business is exactly what I wish to consult you about. Yesterday, our patron saw his performance of Pursuing the Dream and was completely besotted. He praised him all day and wishes to bring him into the mansion. Could"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":7,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一个好徒弟，要靠他一辈子过活。其余几个小孩子，都是不中用的，倒赔钱做衣服。一月内陪了三五天酒，还要生出事来。」聘才正要回言，叶茂林笑迷迷，拈着胡子讲道：「老庆，事情是好商量的。华公子行事，难道你不知道？人家要巴结进去也难，他来找你，就是你的造化，如中了意，不要说你一辈子，就两辈子也不难。将来你也可进府，巴结个执事，赏个十几品的官衔，好不体面，不强如吃这戏饭么？」","en":"worthless; they only cost me money for costumes, attend a few wine banquets a month, and constantly cause trouble...\\" Pincai was about to reply when Ye Maolin stroked his beard and smiled. \\"Old Qing, everything is negotiable. You know Young Master Hua's ways. Others crawl to enter his doors, yet he seeks you out. This is your great fortune! If he catches the Master's fancy,"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":5,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"叶茂林目视长庆，长庆见他生气，便赔着笑道：「师老爷不要动气，请坐，再商量。」聘才道：「商量什么？我也没有这么大工夫讲这些空头话。叶先生你坐坐罢，我要走了。」说罢一径出来，叶茂林跟在后头，拉住了聘才，聘才低低的说道：「我在六合馆等你。」故意洒脱手，头也不回，上车去了。长庆要送也来不及，只得邀了茂林，再进屋子。茂林道：「他一怒去了，","en":"seeing the rage, smiled placatingly. \\"Secretary, please calm down. Sit, let us discuss this.\\" \\"Discuss what?\\" Pincai retorted. \\"I have no patience for hollow talk. Maolin, you may sit, but I am leaving.\\" He marched out, and Maolin chased after him, clutching his arm. \\"Wait for me at the Six Harmonies Inn,\\" Pincai whispered, shaking him off and vanishing into the cart."}],"27":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说聘才从长庆处回来，听其口风狡猾，似要万金身价。","en":"When Wei Pincai returned from Changqing's place, he had heard the man's slippery tone clearly enough: Changqing seemed to be naming a price of ten thousand taels for the boy's person."},{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"欲想个法子收拾他，叫他总不安神，自然就进府来。聘才没有别法，找了张仲雨一次，也没有见着。打算仍叫赶车的及三小等去闹，但要耽搁几天才好，不然恐被他们看出来。华公子是一时高兴，况且他的声色，享用不尽，自然也不专于一人身上。","en":"He meant to harry him until the boy could find no peace and had no choice but to enter the mansion. Pincai had no better plan at hand. He went once to look for Zhang Zhongyu, but failed to find him. He intended to send the carter, San Xiao, and the others to make another disturbance, only waiting a few days so that the people at Changqing's would not see"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":3,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这边琴言正在悲悲楚楚的时候，前日长庆见聘才生气走了，虽托叶茂林为他婉言，总不见茂林回信，心上有些狐疑。又想起五月间，有两个人闹来，送了四吊钱，赔了多少礼方去，听得传说是华公府的车夫。昨日听得聘才口风利害，似乎必要来的，便十分担着担子，进来与琴言商量。琴言自那日从怡园回后，直到今日总是啼哭，自","en":"Meanwhile, Qinyan was miserable. Changqing, seeing Pincai storm off, had begged Ye Maolin to mediate, but with no word returned, he grew uneasy. He remembered the two men raising a row in the fifth month, requiring a four-string payoff and apologies, rumored to be Hua mansion carters. With yesterday's threatening"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":1,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"长庆进来，见了琴言啼哭，不知为着何事，便安慰他两句，就说起聘才来说的话，去的光景，要寻事生端，叫你唱不成戏的意思，我不知你心内如何。若进去了，快活倒是快活的，不过是一世奴才，永作华府家人了。琴言听了，不由得放声大哭起来。长庆没了主意，又安慰他。琴言带哭说道：「师傅，多承你能收了我做徒弟，教养了半年，我心上自然感","en":"found Qinyan crying, and not knowing what it was about said a word or two to comfort him; then he told him what Pincai had said, and how he had gone off, and that they meant to pick a quarrel and see to it that he should not perform at all. \\"I do not know what is in your own mind,\\" he said. \\"If you go in, pleasant it will be, no doubt — but it is a lifetime of service,"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":2,"tokens":["魏聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"说死，事情须细细的商量。况现在并没有闹事，又没人逼你，且缓缓的想个法儿。」琴言道：「有什么法想？你忘了他们有个魏聘才，肯救我这条命么？只有一句，倒是瑶卿害了我了。」素兰道：「怎么说是瑶卿害你？」琴言又淌了些泪，不言语，素兰疑心，连声的问，琴言叹了口气道：「若使大年初六那一天，瑶卿去唱了那出《惊梦》，我便不上台，也就干干净净，直到如今没什么丢不开的事。偏要我去当灾替","en":"yet and no one is forcing you; take your time and think of some way out.\\" Qinyan lamented, \\"What path? Forget Wei Pincai; would he spare my life? It's all because Yaoqing ruined me.\\" Sulan asked, \\"How did Yaoqing ruin you?\\" Qinyan wept mutely, and as Sulan pressed, he sighed: \\"Had Yaoqing sung 'The Interrupted Dream' on the sixth day of the New Year, I wouldn't have mounted"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":1,"tokens":["魏聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"素兰道：「你们若合了式，魏聘才那种东西，非特不能欺你，且要巴结你呢！但我有一句话，你倒不要怪我：譬如我们这班人与人相好，原是要论心的，但也不好太过。譬如度香、庾香两人，待你的情分是一样的。不过，庾香专在你身上，不肯移情于人，所以你就为这上头，也就专为他，不肯移动一步，是讲究专致的","en":"Sulan advised, \\"If you suit his taste, Wei Pincai cannot harm you; he must instead flatter you. But I have a word to say — do not take it amiss. Our sort befriend hearts, yet we must not fall into excess. Duxiang and Yuxiang favor you equally. Yuxiang is fixated upon you and will not shift, so you fixate"},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":1,"tokens":["魏聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"回琴言，素兰连兰保也送了过来。大家说起这奚十一一味凶蛮，真是可怕，只怕其中又有人调唆出来，日后还不肯干休。一个魏聘才冤仇未解，又添出个奚十一来，如何是好？说得长庆更无主意，越发害怕，琴言只是哭泣。兰保道：「我有一个好主意，只劝得玉侬依了，倒是妥当的。你们明天就送他到华公府，他府里要赏你身价，你万不可要，只说恐孩子不懂规矩，有伺候不到之处，叫他权且进来，伺候两月看看","en":"erupt so suddenly was frightening indeed. Perhaps someone had stirred him up, and he wouldn't rest. The feud with Wei Pincai was unsettled, and now Xi had joined in; what then? Changqing felt even more helpless and frightened, while Qinyan only wept. Lanbao offered, \\"I have a sound plan, if Yunong agrees. Tomorrow, deliver him to Young Master Hua's. If they offer a ransom,"}],"28":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":7,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说长庆被打之后甚是着急，只得仍去央求叶茂林，同到华公府聘才书房负荆请罪，情愿先送进来，分文不要。聘才见他小心赔礼，且说一钱不要，便甚得意，只道他一怒之后，使他愧悔送上门来，应了前日所说的话，便找了珊枝，请公子出来说了，华公子道：「为何不要身价呢？」聘才说：「他的意思恐怕孩子不懂规矩，二来如有错处，公子厌了，","en":"immediately without taking a single string of cash. Seeing him so meek and compliant, and refusing all purchase money, Pincai swelled with triumph. He thought his earlier fit of anger had successfully shamed them into delivering the goods directly to his door, exactly as he had predicted. He then sought out Lin Shanzhi, had the Young Master called, and made his report. Young"},{"paragraph":2,"mentions":2,"tokens":["魏聘才","聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"惦记子玉，也只好暗中洒泪，背地长吁。过了几天，见华公子脾气是正正经经的，没有什么歪缠之处，便也略觉放心。惟见了魏聘才，只是息夫人不言的光景，聘才也无可奈何，就要用计收拾他，此时也断乎不能。","en":"Master's temper was quite proper and devoid of any indecent pestering, his mind eased slightly. However, toward Wei Pincai, he maintained the stony silence of Lady Xi of old. Pincai found himself utterly powerless; any malicious design to \\"settle\\" the boy was, for the moment, entirely out of the question."},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":1,"tokens":["魏聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"底玉侬怎样？」便又走到里间来，兰保、琪官看着他，也有些凄楚。素兰道：「你细听着这五月内的事情。」便一五一十的将魏聘才怎样的来说，奚十一怎样来闹，他与兰保怎样的劝，怎样的出主意，又怎样的躲避奚十一，又怎样的送进华府，临行时怎样哭泣嘱咐，又将不受身价并可告假出来的话，细细的述了一遍，又安慰了几句。","en":"Sulan began, \\"Listen carefully to what transpired this fifth month.\\" He then recounted the entire ordeal: how Wei Pincai had schemed, how Xi Eleven had caused a chaotic scene, how he and Lanbao had tried to intervene and devise a plan, how Qinyan had hidden from Xi Eleven, and finally, how he was sent into the Hua mansion. He detailed his tearful parting instructions,"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":1,"tokens":["魏聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"又对子玉，把从前魏聘才同船，一路在舟中下作的模样讲了好些。忽又想起奚十一来，复咬牙切齿的骂几句。素兰让子玉吃饭，子玉心绪不佳，便要早回，辞了一径回去，车上便觉四肢不舒起来。","en":"To Ziyu they also recounted the vulgar and despicable behavior Wei Pincai had exhibited on the boat when they previously shared passage. The mere mention of Xi Eleven caused them to grit their teeth and curse his name. Sulan urged Ziyu to eat, but his spirits were too low. Desiring an early departure, he took his leave and"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":1,"tokens":["魏聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"楚，昏愦时糊胡涂涂，不闻不见的光景；清楚时与好人一样。睡梦中呓语喃喃，有时叫玉侬，有时唤香畹，有时大骂奚十一、魏聘才诸人。颜夫人十分着急，颜仲清、王恂三天两日常来看视，心中虽是明白，却也无法可治。二人商量，又不好对颜夫人讲，只好婉言解慰而已。颜夫人每听子玉睡梦之中，必呼玉侬二字，心上便疑心子玉在外有什么勾当，便当玉侬是个女人，心有说不出的隐情；因又想子玉不常出门，","en":"incessantly—sometimes calling for \\"Yunong,\\" sometimes \\"Xiangwan,\\" and at times, vehemently cursing Xi Eleven and Wei Pincai. Lady Yan was frantic with worry. Yan Zhongqing and Wang Xun visited every few days; they understood the root of the malady but were powerless to cure it. After discussing the matter, they felt they could not reveal the truth to Lady Yan, offering only"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":3,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"。到今年正月初六，会馆团拜那一天，世叔看了琴言的戏回来，又听得他们说好，以后的事，小门生实是没有见闻，要问魏老聘才晓得他们的细底。」颜夫人便叫门上许顺，到华府请魏少爷过来有事相商。聘才却不晓得是这件事，近来与子玉颇觉疏远，竟有一个多月不来。今闻颜夫人相请，道是有些好事与他商量。隔了一日，便服御辉煌的出城，到了梅宅，见过了颜夫人。见颜夫人脸上似有忧闷的光景，聘才先","en":"student has never gone out with him. Whether there is a Qinyan or not, I truly do not know. Last year, I heard old Wei Pincai often praising that Qinyan, and my uncle took notice. On the sixth day of the New Year, at the guild gathering, my uncle saw his performance and heard the praises. After that, this student has witnessed nothing. You must ask Wei Pincai for the detailed"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":7,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"讲了一回，颜夫人道：「子玉得了一个异样的病症。」便把病的光景说与聘才听，又将云儿、元茂的话也说了，便说：「小儿与这琴言到底有什么缘故？」聘才听了便觉得有些踌躇不安，良心发动，脸上露出愧色。停了一会，说道：「去年小侄进京，是搭了一班戏子的船，内中有个小旦叫琴言。今年团拜这一天，却好见着他的戏。后来世兄不知怎样认识的，听","en":"the testimonies of Yun and Yuanmao. She pressed him, \\"What exactly is the bond between my son and this Qinyan?\\" Pincai felt a sudden wave of unease; his conscience pricked, and a guilty flush colored his face. He hesitated before answering, \\"Last year, when this nephew entered the capital, I shared a boat with a theatrical troupe. Among them was a young dan named Qinyan."},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":2,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"聘才道：「琴言原不要钱，他师傅是非钱不行。小侄方才细想了，断无法子弄他来，必要和他师傅商量了，事方可行。他师傅又不肯讲白话的。」颜夫人道：「他师傅是怎样的？」聘才道：「难说话的很，在钱眼里过日子，要和他商量，除非多许他钱，尚不知他肯不肯。他怕得罪了那边，","en":"Pincai replied, \\"Qinyan originally never wanted money, but his teacher absolutely refuses to budge without silver. This nephew has thought long and hard, but there is no easy path. We must negotiate with the teacher, and the teacher will not accept empty talk.\\""},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":1,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"颜夫人听了这话，似乎要花些钱，便道：「只要把他叫得来，就给他钱也不要紧，但不知要用多少？」聘才道：「小侄再去见他讲讲看，总之小侄再没有不尽心的，先请伯母大人宽心。","en":"be spent, Lady Yan said, \\"Just bring him here. I do not mind spending the money, but how much will it require?\\" Pincai replied, \\"This nephew will go and negotiate. I will spare no effort. Please set your mind at ease, Madame.\\""},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":2,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，颜夫人又含泪道：「多费世兄的心，此刻我也不说什么了。既然如此，请你今日就去。如来得及，今日就赐一回信更好。」聘才答应了，即便告辞出来，看了看子玉。子玉见了聘才，虽在病中，却未忘前事，便合眼装睡，没有理他。","en":"I will say no more for now. Since you are willing, please go today. If possible, a reply today would be best.\\" Pincai agreed. Before leaving, he looked in on Ziyu. Even in his severe illness, Ziyu had not forgotten past grievances; upon seeing Pincai, he shut his eyes, feigning sleep, and completely ignored him."},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":6,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"聘才与元茂略谈几句，即便出来，一径回华府，到自己房中坐下，细细的想了一回，没有主意。即来找珊枝，把方才颜夫人托他话，都说与珊枝，又加上些话。又说我与这个兄弟是三代世交，且我这梅老伯母，止他一子，人极聪明，相貌生得也极齐整，你只当行好事，怎么成全成全他。倘","en":"Pincai exchanged a few brief words with Yuanmao before departing. He went straight back to the Hua mansion, sat in his room, and pondered deeply, yet no plan came to mind. He sought out Shanzhi, repeated Lady Yan's desperate plea, added his own embellishments,"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":1,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"了三年多，也算第一分的人，他才进来几天，就这么样。脑袋又好，将来不要把我压下去。」如此一想，便要设法挤他。今日聘才的一番话，正好立主意，因此就应许他，便到了留青精舍与琴言说知。琴言一听就是眼泪汪汪的，说道：「怎么庾香就病到如此，林哥你真能叫我出去，他家果真要我去看他吗？」","en":"and his looks are good besides. Won't he eventually crush me?\\" He fully intended to squeeze Qinyan out. Hearing Pincai's request presented the perfect opportunity. He went to the Quiet-Green Retreat and informed Qinyan of the plan. Upon hearing the news, Qinyan's eyes filled with tears. \\"How could Yuxiang fall so gravely ill? Brother Lin, can you truly send me out? Does"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":1,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，心中却也甚感激珊枝，我进来了倒全仗他照应，且能叫我去看庾香，以后倒不要忘了此人。珊枝走后，琴言想来想去，就把聘才的仇恨也就淡了，说这件事也亏他。","en":"chance to see Yuxiang was a debt he must never forget. In the glow of this favor, even his deep-seated hatred for Pincai faded, acknowledging that this opportunity was also owed to him."},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":4,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"是不认得路径。」珊枝道：「你同魏师爷出去，他们就不好问什么；就使他们有话，也传不到里头去。」琴言只得折口气来找聘才，聘才见了心中甚喜，脸上却装了冷冷的说：「你去只管去，要谨慎些。将来闹穿了，可别说我同你去的。」琴言答应了，即同聘才一重一重的出去，把门的有认得的，也有不认得的，见了聘才同着，却不敢问。","en":"questions, and even if they do, the rumors won't pierce the inner walls.\\" Qinyan swallowed his pride and found Pincai. Pincai was inwardly delighted but maintained a cold exterior. \\"Go on, but be careful. If this is exposed, do not say I accompanied you.\\" Qinyan agreed. They passed through the gates, layer by layer. The guards recognized Wei and dared not question them."},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":2,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"出了大门，即叫琴言坐在车里，放下车帘，自己跨沿，四儿坐在车尾，不多一刻即到了梅宅。聘才也不候通报，同了琴言一直到了书房。许顺见了甚为诧异，却又不好拦阻，也跟了进来。颜夫人正在盼望，见许顺进来，似欲回什么话似的，颜夫人问：「有什么事？」许顺说：「魏大爷同了一个人，到像个唱戏的似的，小的不敢不回。」颜夫人道：「我知道，快请进来。」许顺去请","en":"Once outside the gate, Qinyan was seated in the carriage, the curtains drawn tight. Pincai stood on the footboard, with Si'er riding on the tail. Before long, they arrived at the Mei residence. Pincai did not wait for an announcement; he led Qinyan straight toward the study. The gatekeeper, Xu Shun, was startled but could not block their path,"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":5,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴言一进门时，原为子玉病重，出于情所难忍，故不顾吉凶祸福，也拼着颜夫人骂了几句。而且聘才在车上，一路上说了些利害话，心虚胆怯，只得战战兢兢上前，见夫人磕了一个头起来，低头傍立。颜夫人叫近前来，又打量了一回，即请聘才坐下。颜夫人道：「你是那里人？去年几时到京？怎么认识我们少爷？又怎么样相好？你实对我说，我不难为你。」琴言见夫人颜色和霁，便","en":"scarcely endure, he had ignored the risks of fortune and disaster, steeling himself for Lady Yan's harsh scolding. Pincai's threatening words in the carriage had left him timid and trembling. He approached, kowtowed deeply to the Lady, rose, and stood with his head bowed. Lady Yan called him closer, studied him intently once more, and bid Pincai sit. \\"Where are you from?"}],"29":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":2,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"、防己之下，应须添一味当归。」外面颜夫人听了，知是呓语，虽不能十分明白，也是一阵伤心，两泪交流，只管怔怔的瞅着聘才，聘才心上也觉凄楚，便说道：「玉侬你只管叫醒他。」琴言便叫了两声「少爷！」子玉嗤的一声笑道：「你好痴也！」又道：「云儿，你只管叫我作什么！这么近的路怕什么！你还当是大东门外么？」琴言要高声叫，又哽咽了，喉咙叫不出来，只把手拍他。那子玉忽然睁开眼来，对","en":"profound grief washed over her, and two streams of tears traced down her cheeks. She could only stare blankly at Pincai. Pincai, too, felt a stark bleakness in his heart and gently urged, \\"Yunong, wake him.\\" Qinyan called out twice more, \\"Young Master!\\" Ziyu merely tittered and replied, \\"How foolish you are!\\" He then chided, \\"Yun'er, why keep calling? The road is so short,"},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":2,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"颜夫人道：「他认不得人，这怎么好呢？」聘才也只得走到床前，叫了几声：「世兄，你心上的琴言特来看你，我扶起你来坐坐，你们说说话就好了。」聘才叫云儿拧块热手巾来，替他净了脸，擦了擦眼睛，扶他坐起，把床锦被迭了，在背后靠着。","en":"Lady Yan sighed, \\"He cannot even recognize anyone. What can we possibly do?\\" Hearing this, Pincai felt compelled to step up to the bedside. He called out several times, \\"Dear brother! The Qinyan you have been longing for has come especially to see you. Let me help you sit up; once you talk, you will surely feel better.\\" He then instructed Yun'er"},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":1,"tokens":["魏聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"颜夫人倒不肯进来，恐怕儿子心上愧惧，魏聘才也离得远远的。","en":"Lady Yan chose not to enter the room, fearing that her sudden presence might cause her son shame, while Wei Pincai respectfully kept his distance."},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":3,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"颜夫人听了，对着聘才道：「此话说的奇怪。」又听琴言道：「我是为着你的病来的。」子玉笑道：「你真是玉侬，如何得来？就算你愿意来，人家如何肯放你来？」琴言道：「我真是玉侬，我已来了多时，是奉太太之命，叫我来看你；又亏魏师爷带我上来。我劝你自己宽心，不必忧郁，身子要紧。快养好","en":"Hearing this exchange, Lady Yan turned to Pincai and whispered, \\"Those words sound exceedingly strange.\\" She then heard Qinyan say softly, \\"I came because of your sickness.\\" Ziyu laughed dismissively. \\"If you truly were Yunong, how could you come here? Even if you were willing, would they ever release"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":1,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"聘才见了忍不住的笑，那些丫鬟、仆妇也无人不笑。颜夫人点头叹息，见子玉两手扶着琴言的肩，要坐起来，先笑了一回。","en":"Pincai could not help but laugh along with him, and the maids and matrons in the room all joined in the mirth. Lady Yan nodded, a deep sigh escaping her lips. She watched as Ziyu, with both hands firmly grasping Qinyan's shoulders, tried to pull himself up,"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":1,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"」子玉点点头道：「真没有说过假话。」便自己定了定神，越想越乐，不禁大笑，欢声盈耳，外边的颜夫人也喜欢的笑起来，聘才更觉洋洋得意，低低的说道：「小侄看世兄今日竟会痊愈的了，这功劳全亏了琴言的师傅，虽然受了他那些刁难，倒还值得。」这边子玉已乐不可言，那里留神到外间？况且外间人又是私窥他的，病人精神有限，故而听不出来。子玉竟慢慢的跨下床来，琴言扶着走了两步，觉得脚软神","en":"erupting into a resonant laughter that carried all the way to the outer room. Lady Yan smiled in response, and Pincai puffed up with pride, whispering, \\"Nephew sees that dear brother may heal completely today. The credit belongs to Qinyan's teacher. Though he vexed us endlessly, it was well worth it.\\" Ziyu paid no heed to the murmurs outside; his attention was entirely"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":4,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"便叫云儿道：「我觉饿了，有什么吃的，快拿些来。」颜夫人听了，即轻轻的走出，聘才等亦都跟了出来。颜夫人道：「怪事！怪事！直看不出他们什么意思来，这一对小人儿，却真也奇怪。今日实实亏了琴言，我倒要重重的赏他。」聘才嬉嬉笑道：「这也实在稀奇。伯母请看：世兄与琴言都是正大光明，一无苟且的。今日真亏了他，若不然，就是那叶天士重生，也不能","en":"bring me whatever there is to eat, and be quick.\\" Hearing this, Lady Yan quietly slipped out of the room, and Pincai quickly followed her. Lady Yan whispered in amazement, \\"Strange... truly strange. I simply cannot read those two little ones. But today, we truly owe everything to Qinyan. I will reward him heavily.\\" Pincai grinned broadly, \\"It is rare indeed, Madame."},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":2,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"把琴言打量了一回，便道：「你今日去了，几时再来呢？」琴言道：「可以告假就来，请太太宽心。」颜夫人叹了一口气，对聘才道：「他们两个小人儿的事情，真是猜不透。今日看他一个哭，一个笑，也没有讲什么，若不是亲眼看见，便任是什么人也要胡猜乱讲，还要说我溺爱不明，为儿子作这些事。世兄你想，你亲眼看见这光景，好笑不好笑？教我如何能认真，由他病去不成？」聘才正要说话，颜夫人又对","en":"son. Nephew, you saw it yourself—it was almost funny. How could I ever be harsh and let him simply waste away?\\" Pincai was about to speak, but Lady Yan turned her full attention back to Qinyan. \\"Only you truly understand him. We must rely on you to serve him completely.\\" Qinyan murmured his assent, bowing low. In his heart, he thought: I never imagined Madame could be"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":9,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"聘才见时候过久，便要同琴言回去，琴言也心内悬着，便叩辞颜夫人要去。颜夫人道：「你且略候一候，我还有话。」便自己进房，先着人叫了许顺进来，叫他秤了二百银子来，颜夫人道：「你交与魏少爷收了。」聘才叫交四儿拿了。又见一个仆妇拿着一包东西出来，付与琴言道：「这是","en":"Seeing that much time had passed, Pincai knew he must return with Qinyan. Qinyan, growing anxious about his long absence, quickly bid his farewells. Lady Yan raised a hand. \\"Wait. I have words for you.\\" She stepped into the inner room and called for Xu Shun, ordering him to weigh out two hundred"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":8,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"进城已是申初时分了。到门口下来，一径跟着聘才进去，只见总门口有人拿了大簿子记上一笔，琴言知道是上号簿。聘才先叫四儿将银包拿进房去，放在钱柜内锁好。一同进来找着林珊枝，珊枝见琴言回来，即笑道：「怎么去了许多时，想必医的病好了。」琴言面有惭色，便问道：「公子可曾传我？」珊枝道：「怎么没传？传了两三","en":"They entered the city at the beginning of the hour of shen. Alighting at the gate, Qinyan followed Pincai straight in; at the main gate a man with a great ledger set down an entry, and Qinyan knew it was the register of comings and goings. Pincai had Si'er carry the silver straight to his room to lock it safely in a chest, while he went to find Lin Shanzhi."},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":1,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话未说完，聘才就连忙问道：「你看见什么，只管说来我听，或者我可以就给你办来。」珊枝道：「不是别的。我见沙回子家里有一个金丝拧成的一个花篮，不过二两重，手工倒贵。我又见他自己泡茶的一把时大彬的宜兴茶壶，盖子上嵌着一块翡翠，是没有比他再好的了。我这个搬指都比不上。那金","en":"Before he could even finish, Pincai pressed eagerly, \\"What things? I will fetch them for you immediately.\\" Shanzhi smiled with satisfaction. \\"They belong to Sha Huizi. One is a flower basket woven entirely of gold wire—barely two liang in weight, but the craftsmanship is unimaginably fine."},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":1,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"聘才道：「茶壶用久了，所以才能够这样好。你既爱这两样，我就买来奉送。那纱也不必退，还留着送人罢。」珊枝笑道：「怎好这样。我若一定不要，倒显得不好，只得生受了。」说了一回，就回房去了。","en":"Pincai replied confidently, \\"Old pots ripen beautifully with age. I will buy them both for you, and you may keep the gauze as an extra gift.\\" Shanzhi laughed, his mood completely lifted. \\"I suppose I cannot refuse empty-handed, so I will accept them grudgingly.\\""},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":1,"tokens":["魏聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"却说子玉这一场大病，琴官这一出华府，魏聘才自为得意，又以为奇，在城外各处传扬。人家听了，竟当了一件新闻。有那些各班里相公，有嫌琴言的，有爱造言生事的，七张八嘴，改头换面，添起枝叶，把个子玉、琴言说得无所不至。不料王通政在人家席上遇着蓉官、二喜等类，就把子玉、琴言的事说得活龙活现。文辉本看过子","en":"As for Ziyu's grave illness—and Qinyan's dramatic excursion from the heavily guarded Hua mansion—Wei Pincai swelled with immense pride. He thought the entire affair striking and romantic, and he hawked the story loudly outside the mansion walls until the common folk took it up as fresh, scandalous news. Actors who harbored petty dislikes for Qinyan, or who"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":1,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"再说子玉自从琴言来看之后，便已放心。又晓得他母亲不责备，而且反托聘才带琴言来，心中十分快意，自然更好得快了，不到十日便已精神复旧，惟见了母亲总有些惶恐不安的光景。颜夫人爱子之心十分体贴，又知儿子并无苟且之行，绝不提起琴言的事。那王文辉亲自来过几次，陆夫人也来过。一回在颜夫人面前，也不好说得，但有些话里讥讽，暗藏褒贬，","en":"He now knew for certain that his mother did not blame him, and realizing that she had personally commissioned Pincai to bring Qinyan to him made his heart rejoice endlessly. Free from his despair, he mended entirely in under ten days. Only when standing before his mother did a lingering shade of shame still color his features. But Lady Yan loved him with a fine, perceptive"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":3,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"过了几日，子玉究竟放心不下，便回了母亲，借看聘才为名，去看琴言，恰好见着聘才。聘才又求珊枝，把琴言叫出来，说了有一个多时辰的话，子玉方才放心而去。华府中人多嘴杂，且各存一心，过了几日，就有人将此事传到华公子耳中。华公子听了着实有气，便叫珊枝上来问了一遍，珊枝替辩了几句，华公子也说了他几句，以后不准","en":"found he still could not rest easily. He begged his mother for permission to go out, using the pretext of visiting Pincai, solely to see Qinyan once more. He met with Pincai and relentlessly begged Shanzhi, until they finally called Qinyan out to see him. They talked for more than two hours, and only then did Ziyu's heart feel truly at peace. But within the sprawling Hua"}],"30":[{"paragraph":4,"mentions":1,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉、王恂、文泽、仲清等皆遵例回避。子玉在家闷闷不乐，又因琴言杳无音信，内外隔绝，又不能传递消息，几次要去访问聘才，又因华府威严，豪奴气焰。故而子玉不肯前去，只得静坐书斋，闷坐而已。","en":"from Qinyan and they were completely cut off from each other, unable to exchange messages, he wanted to visit Pincai several times. However, deterred by the strictness of the Hua mansion and the arrogance of its servants, Ziyu refused to go and could only sit quietly and gloomily in his study."},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":1,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"了一番。这西园景致奇妙，虽不及怡园，然而精工华丽，却亦相埒。不过地址窄小，只得怡园三分之一。园中有十二楼，从前聘才所到之西花厅，尚是进园第一处。从前华公爷一个好友叫作谢笠山，是个画画好手，与他布置了十二年，却是浓淡相宜，疏密得体。到华公子长成，心爱繁华，又把笠山手笔改了许多。如今是一味雕琢绚烂，竟不留一点朴素处。","en":"third the size of the Garden of Contentment. The garden contained twelve pavilions. The West Flower Hall where Pincai had previously been was just the first entry point. A close friend of the late Duke Hua named Xie Lishan, an excellent painter, had spent twelve years designing it, achieving a perfect balance of light and shade, density and sparseness. As Young Master"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":3,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"是日张仲雨一早进来，先在聘才处吃了早饭，与张、顾诸人谈笑了半天。到得午正时候，拉了聘才、林珊枝来逛西园。仲雨从前也不过到过一两处，聘才虽经游过两回，也未全到。","en":"That day, Zhang Zhongyu arrived early. After having breakfast at Pincai's place, he spent half the day chatting and laughing with Zhang, Gu, and the others. Around noon, he pulled Pincai and Lin Shanzhi along to stroll through the West Garden. Zhongyu had only visited one or two spots before, and although Pincai had toured"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":1,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"当下仲雨、聘才二人，跟着珊枝，顺着山路径，高低斜曲，穿入一个神仙洞内。从左边上去，几树丹桂，不到十余步，至一带曲廊，作凹字形，罘□轻幕，帘栊半遮。珊枝引入看时，共是七间，两楹如翼外张，中间平厦三间，后面玻璃大窗，逼近池畔。室中陈设华美，署名「归鸿小渚」。下有小跋数","en":"Following Shanzhi along a rocky path that rose, dipped, and twisted, Zhongyu and Pincai entered a grotto. They went up on the left, passing a few osmanthus trees. Within a short walk of about ten paces, they reached a curved corridor shaped like a concave 'U', with … light hangings, the blinds half-drawn. When Shanzhi led them in to look,"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":1,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"只听的远远敲梆之声。珊枝道：「此是传人伺候，公子将出来，客将到了，恐怕有事，我先出去。」说罢便走了。仲雨也同了聘才出来，仍到东园，穿好了衣裳等候。","en":"about to come out and the guests are arriving. I may be needed, so I'll go ahead.\\" With that, he left. Zhongyu and Pincai also came out, returning to the East Garden to change clothes and wait."},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":2,"tokens":["魏聘才","聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"色成彩。堂基深敞，中间靠外是三面阑干，上挂彩幔，下铺绒毯，便是戏台，两边退室通着戏房。宾主重新叙礼，将要坐时，魏聘才同着张仲雨出来。一一相见了礼，遂即叙齿坐下，讲了些寒温，献过了三道茶。只见两个六品服饰的，领着四个人上来，铺设桌面，摆了两席。戏房便作起乐来，随后银盘金碗，玉液琼浆献上来。华公子起身安席，子云、文泽等推让，欲要并作一席，也换个圆桌，华公子执定不肯，遂","en":"sides connected to the backstage. The host and guests exchanged greetings again. Just as they were about to sit, Wei Pincai and Zhang Zhongyu came out. They all greeted each other one by one, and then sat down according to age. After some small talk and three rounds of tea, two men in sixth-rank official attire led four people in to set the tables, arranging two banquets."},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":2,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"了。主人让酒，四客饮了几杯，上过了几样肴馔，正是罗列着海错山珍，说不尽腥浓肥脆。清谈妙语，佐以诙谐。那边席上，聘才问次贤怡园的光景。次贤略述了几处。随后即见宝珠、蕙芳、素兰、漱芳、玉林、兰保、桂保，春喜、琪官等九个，又凑上一个，作了一出《秦淮河看花大会》，有幽闲的，有妖冶的，有静婉的，有风流的，极尽靡艳之致，众人尽皆喝采。子云、次贤等就于此出中间放了赏。华公子对","en":"and savory flavors. Refined conversation and witty remarks were paired with humorous jokes. At the other table, Pincai asked Cixian about the sights of the Garden of Contentment. Cixian briefly described a few places. Next came Baozhu, Huifang, Sulan, Shufang, Yulin, Lanbao, Guibao, Chunxi, Qiguan—nine in total—plus one more, performing the play 'Flower-Viewing Assembly"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":2,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"华公子怔了一怔，道：「好，就请进来，却无生客在此。」聘才道：「缘何三更半夜的才来？」华公子道：「想必关在城里，无歇处了。」候了好一回，才听得脚步声，两盏小明角灯引路，冯子佩抢步上前，与华公子见了礼，又与众人相见了，却也都为熟识。华公子即令其坐在聘才之上，将要问话，子佩便笑道：「好！如此热闹请客，却不来叫我","en":"Young Master Hua was slightly taken aback and said, \\"Alright, invite him in; there are no strangers here anyway.\\" Pincai asked, \\"Why is he arriving in the middle of the night?\\" Young Master Hua said, \\"He must have been locked inside the city with nowhere to stay.\\" They waited for quite a while before hearing footsteps. Guided by two small horn lanterns, Feng Zipei hurried"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":1,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"：「归自荣本生得好，就是不该同小老婆另住在城外。听说仍旧窘迫得很。」子佩丢个眼色，文泽不说了，萧次贤冷笑一声，聘才像要说话又不说。","en":"still very short of money.\\" Zipei shot him a warning glance, and Wenze fell silent. Xiao Cixian gave a cold laugh. Pincai seemed about to speak, but held back."},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":4,"tokens":["魏聘才","聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"的。」仲雨摇头道：「我不能，况且我只会几套老生曲子，也配不上他。魏老大可以，不但小生，连二花面、三花面全能。」魏聘才只顾笑，也不招揽，也不推辞。徐子云道：「这不用说了，就请魏兄与子佩一试，也是工力悉敌的。」聘才道：「只怕不对路，况且没有请教过子佩怎么样？」华公子道：「这也不妨。关目腔调有不合处，预先对一对就是了。况且我这里教曲的苏州人也有好几个，叫他们伺候场面就是","en":"can do it; not only can he sing young male roles, but he can also handle second and third painted-face roles.\\" Wei Pincai just smiled, neither volunteering nor refusing. Xu Ziyun said, \\"That settles it then; let's invite Brother Wei to try a piece with Zipei, they are evenly matched.\\" Pincai said, \\"I'm just afraid our styles won't match. Besides, I have yet to see how Zipei"},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":7,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"聘才问道：「你会的是什么？」子佩道：「我会的是：《前诱》、《后诱》、《反诳》、《挑帘》、《裁衣》等戏。」聘才笑道：「也不对，竟唱不来。」华公子身子后边，站着几个八龄班内的，有一个对林珊枝低低说道：「魏师爷何不唱《活捉》，前日不是见他唱过的？」华公子早已听","en":"Pincai asked, \\"What do you know?\\" Zipei replied, \\"I know 'Prior Enticement', 'Later Enticement', 'Counter-Deception', 'Lifting the Curtain', and 'Cutting Cloth'.\\" Pincai laughed, \\"That's not right either; we simply can't perform.\\" Behind Young Master Hua stood"},{"paragraph":31,"mentions":1,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"张仲雨是更相熟的，就是聘才尚未知道。","en":"Zhang Zhongyu knew him even better; Pincai, however, knew nothing of these affairs."}],"31":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说华公子看到得意处，把酒来敬子云诸人，合席只得满饮了一杯，共赞聘才、子佩作得出神入妙，非寻常戏脚所能。","en":"the rest of the company. The entire table had no choice but to drain their cups in unison, collectively praising Pincai and Zipei for an acting performance so divine and marvelous that it lay far beyond the reach of ordinary theater players."},{"paragraph":2,"mentions":3,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"们说，你倒真像个阎婆惜。你若化了女身，也是个不安本分的。」子佩道：「好吗！你们逼我上台，又要取笑我。」徐子云问聘才道：「魏兄这音律实在精妙，将来尚要请教，如闲时可到敝园走走。」聘才连连答应道：「晚生是无师传授，都是听会的，就是上台也是头一回。莫要见笑。」于是大家猜拳行令，闹了一会，钟上已到子正时候了。子云道：「才到秋分，不应如此夜短。」次贤道：「亦觉久了，你试一","en":"isn't this fine! You force me onto the stage, and then you make a laughingstock of me.\\" Xu Ziyun then turned to Pincai and asked, \\"Brother Wei, your mastery of music is truly exquisite. I must ask for your guidance in the future. When you have the leisure, please do come visit my humble garden.\\" Pincai nodded repeatedly in agreement, \\"I have never had a proper teacher;"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":1,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"酌几个字。」蕙芳道：「就请一改。」文泽道：「可改作「想是嫦娥怕孤寂」，诗意较淡远些。」大家都说改的极好。仲雨、聘才暗暗吃惊，不料他们个个如此，向来疑他们有代笔，今日面试，是的确无疑了。惟冯子佩也不来看，桌子上放有一大盘桂花，他便撮了一把，问书童讨了一条红线，自己捏着这一头，叫书童捏着那一头，一朵一朵的堆在线上，顷刻结成了一个大花球。手中轻轻的抛了几抛，走过来挂在","en":"the poetic mood a more remote and ethereal quality.\\" Everyone agreed that the change was excellent. Zhongyu and Pincai were secretly astonished; they never expected such profound talent from all of them. They had previously suspected them of using ghostwriters, but seeing them tested in person today proved beyond a doubt that their skills were genuine. Only Feng Zipei"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":1,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"谜子也要人猜。」子佩道：「何以见得不通？」华公子笑道：「爆竹自然要他响，你这放不响的爆竹要他何用？」众人笑了。聘才道：「我也说个不通谜子请教，你猜猜。」念道：「惊天动地怒如雷，一去谁知不复来。\\n比似疆场发浩叹，古人征战几时回。」桂保笑道：「也是爆竹。」张仲雨道：「方才嫌子佩的不响，所以他第一句就从响字作出来。」此时晓风飘飘，晨钟已鸣，东方发白，华公子即催兰保舞剑","en":"naturally must make a loud bang. What use is a mute firecracker that makes no sound?\\" The crowd erupted in laughter. Pincai then said, \\"I also have an illogical riddle to offer for your guidance. See if you can guess it.\\" He recited:\\n\\n'It shakes the earth and shocks the heavens, raging like thunder,\\nOnce it departs, who knows when it will ever return?\\nLike heaving a great"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":1,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云等又将零星玩物，分赏众旦毕，各人同散，华公子直送出穿堂方回。惟冯子佩困乏已甚，已在留青精舍榻上睡了，聘才也自归房，华公子吩咐书童好好伺候冯子佩，一面也进内室。","en":"Feng Zipei, who was thoroughly exhausted, had already fallen fast asleep on a couch in the Quiet-Green Studio. Pincai also retired to his own room. Young Master Hua instructed the page boys to attend carefully to Feng Zipei, while he himself finally retired to the inner chambers."}],"33":[{"paragraph":3,"mentions":1,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"是日天气晴和，雪消风静，子玉欲访聘才，打探琴言消息。","en":"That day, the weather was mild and clear; the snow had melted, and the wind was calm. Ziyu wanted to visit Pincai to ask for news about Qinyan."},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":1,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"早饭后禀过萱堂，乘舆进城，行不到半里，心里忽又踌躇起来，料聘才也未必在家，越想越不高兴，便说：「不去了，出城回去罢！」云儿勒转马头，赶车的倒转车来，出了城，忽然有几辆车塞满了路，还有一群骆驼挤在里头。众赶车的喧喧嚷嚷，开让不来。子玉的车下了帘子，与一个车相并，子玉从玻璃窗内一望，却好那人也转过脸来望他，原来是宝","en":"his mother, took a carriage into the city, but before he had gone half a li, he began to hesitate. He thought Pincai might not even be home. The more he thought about it, the less enthusiastic he felt, so he said, \\"I won't go. Let's head out of the city and go back!\\" Yun'er reined in his horse, the driver turned the carriage around, and they left the city. Suddenly,"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":6,"tokens":["魏聘才","聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"此。」宝珠又捧上一个果盒来，聊以侑茶。子玉道：「倒比酒好。」三人闲谈了一会，素兰问子玉道：「近日你可见你那世交魏聘才么？」子玉道：「也有两月不见了。我今日倒特特要去看他。已经进了城，我想他是常在外边的，忽然不高兴起来，所以转回，恰才遇见瑶卿。」宝珠横波一笑道：「你错了，该去的。就使聘才不在家，你那心里人是不出门的，他知道你去，必出来见的。」子玉不语。素兰道：「你不","en":"better than wine.\\" The three chatted idly for a while before Sulan asked Ziyu, \\"Have you seen your family friend Wei Pincai lately?\\" Ziyu replied, \\"I haven't seen him in two months. I specifically meant to visit him today. I had already entered the city, but I figured he is often out and about, so I suddenly lost interest and turned back; that's when I ran into Yaoqing.\\""},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":10,"tokens":["魏聘才","聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"那一日魏聘才请富三爷在蓉官寓里喝酒，富三爷想起一件事来，先进城去了。聘才便不进城，叫蓉官去叫了一个媳妇，名叫玉天仙，就借蓉官寓里过夜。将近二更，尚在那里喝酒唱曲。有个吏目郁泰孙来查夜，走了进来，与聘才认识的，且同过席听过戏的。聘才见是郁吏目，便放了心，让他入座，","en":"That day, Wei Pincai invited Lord Fu the Third to drink at Rongguan's residence. Lord Fu suddenly remembered something and went into the city first. Pincai stayed behind, instructing Rongguan to fetch a young woman named Yutianxian to spend the night at Rongguan's place."},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":1,"tokens":["魏聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"怎么又送部呢？」素兰道：「闻说有位巡城都老爷，访得吏目诈赃，改供私放，把这案提上去，送了刑部。」宝珠道：「如今魏聘才是在监里了？应该，应该。但华公子怎么不替他料理呢？」","en":"releasing people privately, so he escalated the case and sent it to the Ministry of Punishments.\\" Baozhu added, \\"So Wei Pincai is now in prison? He deserves it. But why hasn't Young Master Hua taken care of him?\\""},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":3,"tokens":["魏聘才","聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"素兰道：「据仲雨讲，是瞒着华公子，况且又是个假名假姓。大约脸总丢了，也不至有什么大罪。又听说魏聘才新捐了一个从九品，审实了，这功名只怕也革的了。」子玉听了，甚替聘才着急，连说道：「这怎么好！就是我们那位李世兄，也在外边胡闹。夏间去嫖，连衣服都被人剥了。亲友们都知道，闹得很不好看。不料魏聘才又闹出这件事来。」素兰道：「也叫他吃些亏才好，如今报应得甚","en":"besides, he used a fake name. It's likely he's just lost face, and it won't amount to a major crime. I also heard Wei Pincai recently purchased a minor official rank; if convicted, that title might be stripped as well.\\" Hearing this, Ziyu felt anxious for Pincai and repeatedly said, \\"This is terrible! Even our friend Li has been messing around outside. Over the summer, he"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":1,"tokens":["魏聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"亲回来恐未必依你。」子玉只得连连答应几个：「是！」也不敢坐下，也不敢退出。颜夫人也不便安慰他，只好问他今日可见魏聘才。","en":"daring to sit down or leave. Madam Yan, finding it inconvenient to comfort him, could only ask if he had seen Wei Pincai today."},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":7,"tokens":["魏聘才","聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉听了，似有踌躇，欲说不说的光景。颜夫人又问了一声，子玉说道：「没有见着，而且得个信，说魏聘才不晓得闹了什么事，被人告了，前日已收在刑部监里。」颜夫人听了，吃惊不小，急问道：「这话是谁说的？为着什么事，你从何处打听来？」子玉随口说道：「是一个认识的人，就是魏世兄的亲戚张仲雨说的。他也讲得不甚明白，倒像是狎妓饮酒被坊官拿去的。」颜夫人听了，骂了","en":"wanted to speak but couldn't. When Madam Yan asked again, Ziyu said, \\"I didn't see him, but I received word that Wei Pincai has gotten into some trouble and was reported; the day before yesterday, he was detained in the Ministry of Punishments prison.\\" Startled, Madam Yan hurriedly asked, \\"Who told you this? What happened, and where did you hear it?\\" Ziyu casually replied,"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":4,"tokens":["魏聘才","聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"梅进来到王宅，文辉传进，问了来意。梅进禀明，文辉冷笑了一声，道：「那魏聘才，我一见他，就知道不是个东西。你们老爷定要留他，幸而如今出去了。这件事怎样去说，且刑部里绝无相好。你回去与太太请安，说我只好转托人，碰他的运气罢。」梅进回去照直说了，颜夫人也无法，只得听其自然。且说聘才在监里许了蓉官与玉天仙许多银子，叫他们跟着他的口","en":"him in and asked the reason for his visit. Mei Jin explained the situation, and Wenhui sneered, saying, \\"That Wei Pincai—I knew the moment I saw him that he was nothing good. Your master insisted on keeping him; fortunately, he has left now. How can I possibly intervene? Besides, I have no acquaintances in the Ministry of Punishments. Go back and pay your respects to the"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":1,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"口供相对。华公子已知道了，欲待不管，心里又有些不安，只得着人到刑部里与他托情关照，因此轻办了好些。将吏目革职，聘才杖了二十，玉天仙逐出境外，蓉官释放回家，结了案。","en":"Punishments to put in a good word, which resulted in a much lighter sentence. Official Yu was dismissed from his post, Pincai received twenty strokes of the cane, Yutianxian was expelled from the jurisdiction, and Rongguan was released to go home, thus concluding the case."},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":1,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"聘才尚欣欣的得意进城，道是官司赢了，一径回华府来。","en":"Pincai returned to the city triumphant, claiming he had won the lawsuit, and went straight back to the Hua residence."},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":1,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"门上人见了，都来宽慰了好些话。聘才扬扬的说道：「倒也没有受一点委屈，这些司官老爷们，都与我相好，司狱又是我的至交，一切全仗了他们。这几日倒也张罗得很好，不知公子可知道此事么？」众人只好回说不知道。","en":"Upon seeing him, the gatekeepers offered many words of comfort. Pincai boasted, \\"I didn't suffer the slightest injustice. Those officials are all on good terms with me, and the prison warden is a close friend; everything was thanks to them. They took great care of me these past few days. I wonder if the young master knows"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":4,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"聘才进了自己屋子，尚有一起一起的人来问他，唯不见华公子打发人来，聘才真道他不知此事，便放了心。到了第三日，见林珊枝进来，两手捧了一大封，像是银子，放在桌上，说道：「这是公子送你的。」说完转身就走，聘才「道谢」两字尚说不及，已去远了。聘才见此光景，与平日不","en":"After Pincai entered his room, groups of people came to inquire about him, but he saw no one sent by Young Master Hua. Pincai genuinely believed he was unaware of the matter, which put his mind at ease. On the third day, Lin Shanzhi entered, holding a large package"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":2,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，将书信给他传进。约有半个时辰，见门上进来道：「方才的字，公子已看，说回梅宅去的很是，公子有事，不及亲送了。」聘才心上尚冀转过脸来，听了这话，不觉心如死灰，只得说道：「多多道谢公子，并各位大爷们，多承照应了大半年。我今日就要搬出去，也不能当面叩辞了。」管门的答应着去了。聘才无奈，只得收拾行李物件，一面问管事的要了一个大车装好。自己有一车一马、两个小使、一个厨子、","en":"says returning to the Mei residence is appropriate. The young master is busy and cannot see you off personally.' Pincai still harbored hopes of reconciliation, but hearing these words, his heart turned to ash. He could only say: 'Many thanks to the young master and all the gentlemen for your care over the past half year. I will move out today and won't be able to bid"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":3,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"聘才在华府里仅有十个月，在外面招摇撞骗，所得银钱却也不少。华公子于修金之外，尚多遗赠。聘才捐了个从九，品花去四百余金，作衣服及浪花浪费共有二千金。此时除前日二百金之外，尚存三百金，还有些玩好等物。且幸所捐名次在前，约半年可选。因此胆壮心豪，与从前大不相同","en":"Pincai had only been in the Hua residence for ten months, yet through deceit and trickery outside, he had amassed quite a sum of money. Aside from his regular stipend, Young Master Hua had bestowed many gifts upon him. Pincai spent over four hundred taels to"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":15,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"却说富三爷闻得聘才闹了事，便在部里打听了几日，自己无路可通。后闻华公子替他托了情，才放了心。后又听见聘才辞馆出来，便又惦记着放心不下，意欲邀他回家。一日，起早出城来找聘才，只见寺门口一班人在那里啰唣。富三爷下车时，见一个披着件青布老羊皮大袄，戴一顶旧秋帽，有三十多岁，","en":"Meanwhile, Lord Fu the Third, upon hearing of Pincai's trouble, spent several days inquiring at the Ministry but found no way through. He only felt relieved after learning that Young Master Hua had interceded on his behalf. Later, hearing that Pincai had left his patron, his concerns returned, and he intended"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":7,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"人人称他为唐老爷，他又要人叫他唐大哥。」聘才话未说完，只听得风门一响，探进一个头来，戴个镶边酱色毡帽，两撇浓胡子，又缩了出去。聘才道：「唐大哥进来坐。」那人道：「停一回再来。」聘才道：「就请进来，这位客就是我说的富三老爷，他正要会会你。」唐和尚便撬开风门，走将进来。聘才与富三站起，唐和尚满面堆","en":"\\"Everyone calls him Master Tang, but he insists on being called Brother Tang.\\" Before Pincai could finish his sentence, the wind door rattled, and a head wearing a brown felt hat with trimmed edges and a thick mustache popped in, then quickly withdrew. Pincai called out, \\"Brother Tang, come in and sit down.\\" The man replied, \\"I'll come back"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":2,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"得两眼瞇，齐说道：「待我想来。」想了一回，忽然的大笑道：「呸！我记错了，我认是大悲庵的姑子，实在像得很。」说得聘才大笑，小和尚涨红了脸。唐和尚笑道：「三老爷取笑。」聘才道：「叫他装个姑子，却也看不出来。我们这唐大哥是第一个快乐人，吃的、穿的、用的、顽的，件件都好。」唐和尚道：「阿弥陀佛，出家人有什么好。我师兄在日把我拘束住了，如今比从前却舒服些。原先这屋子里有位","en":"I remembered wrong; I thought it was the nun from the Great Compassion Convent. The resemblance is striking.\\" Pincai roared with laughter, while the young monk blushed deeply. Monk Tang chuckled, \\"Master Third, you jest.\\" Pincai added, \\"If you dressed him as a nun, no one could tell. Our Brother Tang here is a man of true pleasure; whatever he eats, wears, uses, or"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":4,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"钟上已交正午，才见聘才的人来摆桌子，放杯箸。富三道：「你可不要费事。」聘才道：「没有什么可吃的。」于是分宾主坐了，富三叫得月也坐了。唐和尚命得月同着蓉官斟酒。富三见果碟小吃已摆满了一桌，便道：「作什么，都拿开，留四碟就够了。」便叫留下山鸡丝、火腿、倭瓜子、杏仁。蓉官道：「","en":"It was already noon when Pincai's servants arrived to set the table and arrange the cups and chopsticks. Fu the Third said, \\"Please don't go to any trouble.\\" Pincai replied, \\"There isn't much to eat.\\" Thus, they took their seats as host and guests, and Fu the Third invited Deyue to"}],"34":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":3,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说聘才送了富三出门，唐和尚即叫人去请他兄弟。聘才刚进屋子，只见李元茂闯将进来道：「今日才寻着你，店铺里那一家不访到，原来搬在这里。」聘才道：「我也搬出来不多几日，因为有些事情，所以还没有来看你，并看庾香。」即问：「庾香近来可好？」元茂道：「好是好的，前月王","en":"After seeing Fu the Third out, Pincai had Monk Tang send someone to invite Tang's younger brother over. Pincai had just stepped back indoors when Li Yuanmao barged in, declaring, \\"I've finally tracked you down today! There isn't an establishment I haven't scoured, only to find you've moved"},{"paragraph":2,"mentions":12,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"便怎样？如今有四十多吊的馆子账，零星费用也须二三十吊。衣服是当完了，也要赎出两件好拜年。你替我想个法儿才好。」聘才道：「不瞒你说，难道你还不知道，我近来被人讹诈那件事，也费了好一堆钱。如今我又闲住在此，若说起钱，真一个也没有。算起来，今年的钱也花得不少，谁想到今日呢。我又没什么衣服，除了外边挪借，连当都没有当的。」元茂道：「你装什么穷？我借了难道不还你么？此番老","en":"I must redeem at least two decent outfits to make my New Year calls. You must think of a way to help me out.\\" Pincai said, \\"To be frank—and surely you must know this—my recent entanglement with those extortionists cost me a veritable mountain of money. Now I'm living idly here; if we're speaking of cash, I truly do not have a single coin. Calculating it all, I've spent"},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":5,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"到了三更，四儿来请聘才，说唐和尚请说话。聘才来到和尚房中，见炕上开了灯，屋中点了两枝蜡，照得雪亮，铜炉内火焰熏人。旁边小方桌上有几碟残肴，一把烧酒壶，却不见和尚。聘才坐下等他，等了一回才来，说道：「偏偏要解手，忽然水泄起来。」叫人打了盆水，净了手，坐了说道：「日间所说的事","en":"At the third watch, Si'er came to inform Pincai that Monk Tang wished to speak with him. Pincai went to the monk's room, where he saw a lamp lit on the kang and two candles burning in the room, casting a snow-bright glow. A copper brazier radiated a smoky heat. On a small square table nearby sat a"},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":3,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"聘才心内算计一番，便又问道：「适或那边嫌多，还可以减些不可以呢？」和尚道：「这个就减而又减，除了我兄弟之外，别人也不能作主。你明早就去说，这事很快，二十九日就可引见。如今的事，要老练，恐怕事后更改。你明日就要将他这笔钱存一个铺子里，说明日子去取方好。若事","en":"Pincai calculated matters in his heart, then asked, \\"If, by chance, they feel the amount is too high, could it be reduced any further?\\" The monk replied, \\"This is already as low as it goes; aside from my brother, no one else can make such a decision. Go speak"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":2,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"聘才推醒了他，说道：「起来罢，我要进城去了，没有人在家照应你。」元茂模模糊糊的应了一声，翻一个身将被蒙了头，又睡着了。聘才好不烦躁，看这光景是不肯起来，只得叫四儿在家看守屋子，另带小使骑了马出门找富三去了。","en":"Pincai shook him awake, saying, \\"Get up, I must go into the city, and there is no one at home to attend to you.\\" Yuanmao gave a groggy grunt, rolled over, pulled the quilt over his head, and fell asleep again. Exceedingly irritated and seeing that the man refused"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":1,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"了一杯，又出去了。元茂一面喝酒，一面看那铺设，颇为精致。两间套房，昨晚心中有事未曾留心，日间是在外面小三间内。聘才卧房是在那院子西边，一重门进去，另是两间。此时元茂坐在外间炕上，喝酒喝了三四钟，已觉微醺，饭尚未来，遂留心观看。见炕上面挂了小小四幅工笔岁朝图，炕几上摆一个自鸣钟。东边三张楠木方椅，两张茶几，茶几上边一盆水仙，一边是一瓶腊梅。东边墙上并挂着一副对子，","en":"night before, he hadn't paid much attention. During the day, they had been in the small three-room suite outside. Pincai's bedroom lay to the west of the courtyard, separated by a gate leading to another two rooms. Now sitting on the kang in the outer room, after three or four cups of wine, Yuanmao felt a slight buzz. Since the rice had not yet arrived, he took a closer"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":7,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"再说聘才到了富三宅里，将事必成的话说了，富三甚是欢喜。问起要多少钱，聘才道：「钱却要的不少，他说此缺到任的规矩就有三万，十分中给他一分不为过多，定要三千两银子才办。我与和尚再三说了，只打了个八折，再要减时，他断不肯。」富三沉吟了一回，道：「二千四百银却也不多","en":"Meanwhile, Pincai arrived at Fu the Third's residence and conveyed that the matter was all but guaranteed, much to Fu the Third's delight. When asked how much it would cost, Pincai replied, \\"The sum required is not small. He said that the customary income upon taking"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":4,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"掌柜的只得应了，出了一千四百两。聘才对富三说：「叫他分开了写，两张五百，一张四百，适或人家今年使不了这许多，留两张明年来取呢。」富三道：「有理。」就照数开了三张。富三收了票子，别了掌柜的，上了车，再找两个银号，都说不能。富三没法，别家都是生的，没有往来，只得回家与三奶奶商量，拿了四十两","en":"Having no other choice, the manager agreed and issued a draft for one thousand four hundred taels. Pincai advised Fu the Third, \\"Tell him to write it out in separate drafts: two for five hundred and one for four hundred. Just in case the recipient cannot use so much this year, they can keep two drafts to withdraw next year.\\" Fu the Third agreed, \\"That makes"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":5,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"二十九日不得，即将原票退还。唐和尚笑嘻嘻的道：「断无不得之理，这二百两是我们两人应得的，只要给他一千就够了。」聘才道：「我要进去换衣裳了。」一直走到自己房里，见元茂尚在那里，又开了灯吹烟，聘才见了，心中甚气，便借此发作道：「你怎么还在这里？这样东西岂可青天白日摆出来的，况且是个庙里，什么人皆可进来观望。适或被人讹住了，不要累死我么？怎么这般胡涂！」元茂道：「怕什","en":"remaining two hundred taels are rightfully ours to share; passing him one thousand will be more than enough.\\" Pincai said, \\"I need to go in and change my clothes.\\" He walked straight to his room, only to find Yuanmao still there, having lit the lamp and puffing away on opium. Seeing this, Pincai was furious and seized the opportunity to unleash his temper: \\"Why are"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":3,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"到二十九日，富三果然得了湖北，彼此大喜，即到寺中谢了聘才与和尚。到明日，即将银票交与他兄弟，从一千之内又扣出二百为拉纤提缆之费，独自得了。将所零之二百两，分一百两与聘才，聘才倒实得了一千三百两。自己进城取了一半现银回来，又在城外换了些钱，得意扬扬，十分高兴，所有账目尽行清还，过年热闹是不必说。晚上竟把玉天","en":"Third indeed secured the post in Hubei. Everyone was overjoyed, and Fu the Third hurried to the temple to thank Pincai and the monk. The next day, the bank drafts were handed over to Tang's brother, who skimmed off another two hundred from the one thousand as a \\"brokerage fee\\" and kept it entirely for himself. As for the remaining two hundred taels of surplus, he split"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":1,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"唐和尚恐元旦日有人来行香，适或见了玉天仙，到底在他寺里，有些不便。将近天明，即催聘才将车送他回去。","en":"Yutianxian within the temple grounds, it would be rather inconvenient. Thus, just as dawn approached, he urged Pincai to send her back via carriage."},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":3,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"聘才初一日拜年，初二日听戏，初三日寓里大排筵席，请一班浮浪子弟如冯子佩、杨梅窗、乌大傻等，带了一群下作相公，天天的欢呼畅饮，清曲锣鼓，闹得竹嘈丝杂，酒池肉林，一连五日，方才少息，也去了三百吊钱。到初九日，忽然有人高兴要开赌，劝聘才做头家。聘才自思近来财运","en":"Pincai spent the first day making New Year calls and the second day listening to operas. On the third day, he threw a grand banquet at his lodgings, inviting a crowd of idle dandies—such as Feng Zipei, Yang Meichuang, and Wu Dasha—along with a flock of lowly"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":1,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"是日聘才赢了二百余金，放了一百八十两的头，与玉天仙收了。","en":"That day, Pincai won over two hundred taels of silver, and together with Yutianxian, collected one hundred and eighty taels in the banker's cut."},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":1,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"明日潘三要开赌，带了两叵罗的松江锭，足足一千两，摇了五十滩，已输了大半。及到清账时输完了，还添出一百余两。是日聘才也输了三百两。唐和尚赢了一百两，冯子佩赢了四百两。","en":"greater half. By the time accounts were settled, he had lost everything and owed an additional hundred-plus taels. Pincai also lost three hundred taels that day. Monk Tang won one hundred taels, and Feng Zipei won four hundred."},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":6,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"奚十一大赢，赢了八百五十余两，将五十余两分赏众小旦与聘才小使，自己收了八百两。奚十一看上了小和尚，赏了他十个中锭。玉天仙又得了二百四十两头钱。内中有个唐经承，就是和尚的兄弟，对着和尚道：「明日我劝你们别赌了。我先前进来时，门外有两个交头接耳的，像是坊里人，恐怕闹出事来，都不稳便。」聘才已是惊弓之鸟，听了便","en":"eight hundred and fifty taels. He distributed fifty-odd taels as tips among the young female impersonators and Pincai's servants, pocketing the remaining eight hundred for himself. Xi Eleven took a liking to the young novice monk and tipped him ten medium ingots. Yutianxian collected another two hundred and forty taels in banker's fees. Among the crowd was Clerk Tang,"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":2,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"冯子佩即与聘才同榻，聘才道：「我看近来好虚名而不讲实际的多。即如华公子、徐度香一班人，挥金如土，是大老官的脾气。但于那些相公，未免过于看得尊贵，当他与自己一样。","en":"Feng Zipei shared Pincai's bed that night. Pincai said, \\"It seems to me that lately there are many who love empty fame and care nothing for substance. Take Young Master Hua, Xu Duxiang, and that set: they scatter gold like dust—the temperament of grand lords indeed. But they"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":1,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，若常这么样，还有谁叫他？难道这许多相公竟靠着徐度香诸公么？一辈子连个有势有利的人都不认得，真是些个胡涂虫。」聘才道：「后日我要叫几个相公，也做个胜会。至于那几个假斯文的，我一概不要。你想想叫谁好？」子佩道：","en":"To pass a whole lifetime without knowing a single man of power or means—they are muddle-headed worms indeed.\\" Pincai said, \\"The day after tomorrow I mean to call a few actors and hold a grand gathering of our own. As for those phony-refined ones, I want none of them. Think it over—whom should I call?\\" Zipei said:"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":6,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「相公们总不过如此。近来有两个人倒很好，叫他也便宜，而且你还可以常使唤他，相貌也与袁宝珠、苏蕙芳相并。」聘才道：「叫什么名字？」子佩道：「一个叫卓天香，一个叫张翠官。」聘才道：「现在那班里？」子佩道：「在整容班。」聘才道：「整容班这班名很生，我竟没有领教过。」子佩道：「是软篷子里小剃头。」聘才笑道：「呸！你怎么说这些人？」子佩道：「你别轻看他，他比相公还红","en":"more, you can send for them whenever you please. In looks they stand comparison with Yuan Baozhu and Su Huifang.\\" Pincai asked, \\"What are their names?\\" Zipei said, \\"One is called Zhuo Tianxiang, the other Zhang Cuiguan.\\" Pincai asked, \\"Which troupe are they in now?\\" Zipei said, \\"The Zhengrong troupe.\\" Pincai said, \\"The Zhengrong troupe—that name is unfamiliar; I have never"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":7,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"到了明日，聘才发贴请客，请的是富三爷、贵大爷、奚十一、潘三、张仲雨、杨梅窗。是日辞了两个，贵大爷病了，张仲雨有事不能来。即补了冯子佩、唐和尚，宾主共七位。聘才叫了蓉官来陪富三，着人到篷子里叫了天香、翠官前来。不多一刻，两个剃头的也坐了大骡车，有一个人跟着，走进寺来","en":"The next day, Pincai sent out invitations for a gathering. His guests included Master Fu the Third, Gui the Eldest, Xi Eleven, Pan the Third, Zhang Zhongyu, and Yang Meichuang. Two sent their regrets—Gui was ill, and Zhang had other matters to attend to—so Feng Zipei and"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":3,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"明日一早即来伺候，聘才、子佩方才起来。两个剃头的便问聘才找出梳篦，替他梳发，梳完了又捶了一会。那一个也与子佩梳了，然后吃过早饭，开了烟灯，大家吃烟。富三爷先来，唐和尚见富三爷来了，就带了得月进来。天香、翠官与富三、和尚都请了安。富三却不认识，问他是谁，在那一班的，聘才就说","en":"Early the next morning, they arrived to serve before Pincai and Zipei had even risen. The two barbers asked Pincai to find his combs and began dressing his hair; once finished, they gave him a massage. The other barber did the same for Zipei. After breakfast, the opium lamps were lit, and everyone partook. Fu"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":5,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"皮帽，进门向各人作了个揖，说：「今日有个内城朋友请我去看阳宅，闹了一天，并邀我去给他们看地，也不过是想外放。」聘才因叫翠官、天香过来见了，说：「这就是很会看风水的杨八老爷，你们何不求他去看看你们的棚子，多会儿发财呢？」富三因接向杨八道：「你要留神呀，不要像乌家的事，看完了找到你门上去。」说罢大家大笑。冯子佩忽然皱了眉说声不好，便到院子里吐起来。慌得大家同来看他。","en":"houses, and also asked me to evaluate some land for them—they're likely hoping for a provincial appointment.\\" Pincai called Cuiguan and Tianxiang over to meet him, introducing him by saying, \\"This is Master Yang Eight, who is highly skilled in reading fengshui. Why don't you beg him to inspect your stall and tell you when you'll strike it rich?\\" Catching the joke,"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":2,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"着吗？」得月「呸」了一声，涨红了脸，扭转头不看。唐和尚合着掌道：「阿弥陀佛！罪过，罪过！」此时坐的是富三首席，聘才叫翠官陪了他。第二是奚十一，唐和尚知他是个阔手，且知道他爱得月，便叫得月陪了他。杨八坐了第三，聘才叫天香挨着他。潘三坐了第四，自己与唐和尚坐了主位，只不见蓉官来。饮酒之间，撒村笑骂，嘈杂到个不成样子。还是富三稳重些，不过与翠官说些顽笑话，尚不至十分村","en":"\\"Amitabha! Sinful, how sinful!\\" By this time, the seating was arranged. Fu the Third took the seat of honor, with Pincai assigning Cuiguan to accompany him. Xi Eleven took the second seat; knowing Xi was a generous spender who had a fondness for Deyue, Monk Tang told Deyue to sit with him. Yang Eight took the third seat, and Pincai had Tianxiang sit next to him. Pan the"},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":2,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"说着将他脸上又闻一闻。只有潘三与聘才无人可闹。聘才笑道：「我们今日只好轮着来闹这个老和尚了。」便互相与唐和尚豁了几拳。闹了一个多时辰，奚十一瘾来了，便叫巴英官拿出烟具来。灯是开现成的，奚十一躺下，叫得月陪他吹烟，两个剃头的也有烟瘾。都聚拢来。唐和尚见了，即连打了两个呵欠，伸了个懒腰。看","en":"As he spoke, he leaned in and sniffed Tianxiang's face again. Only Pan the Third and Pincai were left without someone to dally with. Pincai laughed and said, \\"It seems today we'll just have to take turns pestering this old monk.\\" With that, they engaged in a lively game of finger-guessing with Monk Tang. After they had carried on for over two"},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":1,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"聘才道：「你跟三爷去很好，还有什么不愿的吗。虽然比不得相公出师，也要赏你师父几吊钱。」富三道：「这个自然。」翠官道：「当真的了？」富三道：「当真的了。」翠官便索性扒上富三身上，将头在富三肩上碰了几碰，说道：「我就磕头谢了！好三老爷，好亲爸爸！」富三乐得受","en":"Pincai chimed in, \\"Going with Third Master is an excellent opportunity; what is there to hesitate about? Even though you don't need an actor's formal release fee, we should still tip your master a few strings of cash.\\" Fu the Third agreed, \\"Naturally.\\" Cuiguan"},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":2,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"得月颇不好意思，奚十一道：「不妨。」忙将手巾抹了，坐了过来，要盆水净了脸。一件猞狮裘上也洒了几点，也抹干净了。聘才的人忙换了一盏灯，擦了盘子。得月将盒子揭开看时，果然是空的。奚十一道：「这便怎么好？去问唐大爷要些来罢。」聘才道：「有，有，有！前日我得了几两老土烟。」便叫四儿到房里去取烟。","en":"water to wash up properly. A few drops had also splashed onto his lynx-fur coat, which he hastily wiped clean. Pincai's servants hurried in to replace the lamp and wipe down the opium tray. When Deyue opened the box to check, he found it truly empty. Xi Eleven asked, \\"What do we do now? Let's go ask Master Tang for some.\\" Pincai interjected, \\"I have some! I have some!"},{"paragraph":33,"mentions":2,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"聘才的房就在这院子西边，一重门进去，一个小院子，一并两间。聘才只将院门锁了，因要伺候客，不能叫人看守屋子。此夜月明如昼，四儿走到门边，开了锁，将手推门，忽然的推不开。因想此门素来松的，忽然今日紧了，略用些力也推不开。","en":"Pincai's quarters were located on the western side of the courtyard; stepping through a gate revealed a small courtyard containing a two-room suite. Pincai had merely locked the courtyard gate; busy entertaining his guests, he had been unable to spare anyone"},{"paragraph":34,"mentions":1,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"便吓了一大跳，只见大皮箱少了一个，炕上两个拜匣、一个衣包也不见了。即忙嚷将出来道：「老爷！不好了，被了窃了！」聘才心中甚慌，连忙赶去，到屋里看时，不知后事如何，且听下回分解。","en":"that had been on the kang were gone as well! He bolted outside, shouting, \\"Master! Disaster—we've been robbed!\\" Pincai panicked and rushed over to see for himself. As for what he found in the room, if you wish to know, you must listen to the next chapter."}],"35":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":3,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说聘才走进房中一看，不见箱子、拜匣，心中着急。忙到院子内菜园门口看时，门却锁好，墙边扔下零星物件，便嚷道：「快请和尚来看！」和尚已知道了，同了众人一齐进来。聘才急道：「这怎么好！贼是菜园里扒墙过来的。没有别的说，你去叫拿种菜的来问问。天天打更的，怎么今日有","en":"When Pincai entered his room and saw the trunk and caskets gone, he panicked. He rushed to the vegetable-garden gate in the yard: it was still locked, but scattered items lay by the wall. He shouted, \\"Someone fetch the monk, quickly!\\" The monk already knew, and"},{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"种菜的也在那里发抖，呆了一回，道：「不知那里去了，他还比我先睡，说睡了一觉出来打更。如今门也未开，就不见了。」聘才道：「这无疑了。」和尚道：「这还讲什么，不是你通同偷的还有谁呢？」于是叫火工、老道等把这种菜的拴了起来，那老婆子便叫冤叫屈，大哭起来，和尚一并把他拴了。恐他们寻死，交与看街士兵看守。","en":"he would take a nap and then do the night watch. Now the gate hasn't even been opened, yet he's disappeared.\\" Pincai said, \\"There's no doubt about it then.\\" The monk added, \\"What more is there to say? If it wasn't you who colluded in the theft, who else could it be?\\" He ordered the temple workers and acolytes to tie up the gardener. The old woman cried out in grievance,"},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":4,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"聘才同众人闹纷纷的进来，聘才请和尚陪了客在外边，自己去查点了一回。箱内是七件细毛衣服，有十五两金子、二百两银子。拜匣内有三十几两散碎银，二两鸦片烟，还有几样零件玉器。衣包内是几件大毛衣服。幸亏赚富三的银子并有些钱票都放在别处，没有拿去。算起来已过一千余金","en":"Amidst the commotion, Pincai returned inside with the others. He asked the monk to entertain the guests in the outer room while he went to take inventory. Inside the trunk had been seven pieces of fine fur clothing, fifteen taels of gold, and two hundred taels of silver. The casket"},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":1,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"剃头呢。」说罢，把腰一弯，竟自去了。两个剃头的甚是局促，众人也没有话说，各人上车而散。两个剃头的重新进来安慰，聘才每人赏了四两银子，欢喜而去。","en":"each boarded their carriages and departed. The two barbers then came back inside to offer their consolations. Pincai rewarded each with four taels of silver, and they left in high spirits."},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":1,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"明日聘才报了失单，坊里将种菜的审问，实系不知情。有个伙计姓蔡，去年年底新来，向来认识。本在个二荤铺打杂，因散了伙，情愿来帮同灌园打更。那晚睡后即不见了，委系无同谋窝窃情节。坊里问了几回，总是一样，只得送部。知会九城，严缉贼匪蔡某，且按下不题。","en":"The next day, Pincai submitted his report of the stolen goods. The ward officials interrogated the gardener and found that he was genuinely unaware of the circumstances. It turned out the helper, surnamed Cai, was a recent hire from late last year whom the gardener had known"}],"36":[{"paragraph":4,"mentions":1,"tokens":["魏聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"回，同伙多骂一回。那带诮带骂、冷言冷语的，叫人难受。总恨奚十一那个忘八蛋无缘无故的闹上门来，因此堕落在此。又想魏聘才虽不是个好人，然尚有一言半语，道着我的心事，如今他又出去了。那个林珊枝倒像是半个主儿一般，先要小心谨慎的奉承他才喜欢，不然他就要撮弄人。如今索性把我撵出去了，倒也自在，自然也可以不到师父处去了。若得皇天保佑，使我做个清白人，我就饥寒一世，也自愿意。不","en":"Eleven for causing trouble at his door for no reason, which had led to his current plight. He also thought of Wei Pincai; though not a good man, he had at least occasionally spoken words that touched Qinyan's heart, yet now he was gone too. Then there was Lin Shanzhi, who acted like half a master; one had to flatter him carefully to please him, otherwise he would stir"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":1,"tokens":["魏聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"不上来，也算难为他。」素兰道：「我听得说，他们府里，没有一个不巴结他，就是三代老家人，也要在他面前周旋周旋。那魏聘才是叫他三兄弟、老三、三太爷这些称呼。」","en":"everyone in their household flatters him, even the servants whose families have served for three generations. Wei Pincai calls him 'Third Brother,' 'Old Third,' or 'Third Grand Master.'\\""},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":2,"tokens":["魏聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴言道：「魏聘才搬了出去了，不知可在庾香处？」蕙芳道：「魏聘才么，如今倒更阔了。就在宏济寺住，同了奚十一、潘三、杨八一班混账人天天的闹，是什么剃头的，又是什么大和尚、小和尚，开赌宿娼，闹得不像。张仲雨也不与他往来了。」 　　 琴言问起子玉来，宝珠道：「前日我们在怡园","en":"Qinyan asked, \\"Wei Pincai has moved out. Do you know if he's with Yuxiang?\\" Huifang scoffed, \\"Wei Pincai? He's even more arrogant now. He lives at Hongji Temple and causes trouble every day with a bunch of scoundrels like Xi Eleven, Pan the Third, and Yang Eight—barbers, monks"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":2,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"了，换了一身素服，吩咐套了车，一面告诉师娘去谢谢同班的人。到了外间，忽然又转念道：「如今已隔了半年了，况从前是聘才领我去的，不要进门房里回话。如今我独自去，就算太太待我好，叫我进去，那门房里我总要去求他，适或碰起钉子来，他倒不许我进去呢？况且他家的人除了云儿之外，一个都不认识。」思前想后，不得主意，呆呆的站住。那小使进来说：「车已套了，到什么地方去？」琴言不语，","en":"his fellow actors. When he reached the outer courtyard, however, he hesitated: \\"It's been half a year. Before, Pincai took me, so I didn't have to speak to the gatekeepers. If I go alone now, even if the lady treats me well and invites me in, I still have to beg the gatekeepers. What if they refuse me entry? Besides Yun'er, I don't know anyone there.\\" He pondered but"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":11,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"了车，小使跨了车沿，几个转弯，不上一里路，已到了。琴言见寺门口歇一辆大鞍子四六档车，有个车夫睡在车上。琴言当是聘才的车，想道幸而来早一步，不然他就要出门去了。小使进去问了，说道：「在家，请你进去。」琴言下来，走进了东边的门，小使指点他一直过了两层殿，从东廊后另有一个院子进去。琴言低着头，并不留心别处，一直到了聘才院子里，见聘才的四儿出来，与他点点头，把风门一开。","en":"arrived. Qinyan saw a large, fine carriage with a sleeping driver resting at the temple gate. Assuming it was Pincai's, he felt relieved to have arrived before he went out. The servant went in to ask and reported, \\"He's home and invites you in.\\" Qinyan stepped down and entered the east gate. Following the servant's directions, he passed two halls and entered a courtyard"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":1,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"又在华府做亲随，便不好动手动脚调戏他，料想叫他陪酒也断不肯的，怎样想个法儿弄他一回。一面看，一面听他们说话，要聘才同他到梅宅去，便想出一个计策来。","en":"over wine. He had to think of a way to have his sport with him. As he watched and listened to them discussing Pincai accompanying Qinyan to the Mei residence, an idea formed."},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":5,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"自己思算了一会，立起身来道：「我要走了。」便腆起肚子，几步就走了出去。聘才与和尚连忙相送，潘三尚坐着不动，黄瞪瞪眼睛只管看着琴言，看得琴言一腔怒气，不能发作。奚十一拉了聘才，走到和尚房中，对聘才作了一个揖道：「今日我要求你行件好事。方才这个人，我实在爱他。我若叫他陪酒，是一定不肯的。」聘才不等说完，忙摇头道：「不肯，不肯！","en":"moment, Xi Eleven stood up and said, \\"I'm leaving.\\" Thrusting out his belly, he strode out the door in a few paces. Pincai and the monk hurried to see him off, while Pan the Third remained seated, his eyes wide and fixed on Qinyan, watching him with an intensity that filled Qinyan with an unexpressible rage. Xi Eleven pulled Pincai into the monk's room and bowed to him,"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":7,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"聘才进来对潘三道：「和尚请你说话。」潘三不得已，迟延的出去，尚回顾了几次。聘才把天香、翠官也打发走了，便故意的对琴言道：「好了，清净了，我也被他们闹昏了，闹得一屋子俗臭不堪。我们如今清清净净谈谈，吃了早饭再去，自然有一会耽搁。」琴言一想，在聘才处吃饭也不","en":"Pincai went in and told Pan the Third, \\"The monk wants to speak with you.\\" Reluctantly, Pan the Third dawdled out, looking back several times. Pincai then sent Tianxiang and Cuiguan away and feigned relief to Qinyan, \\"Ah, finally some peace and quiet. I was"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":4,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「你拿我的镯子做什么？」奚十一道：「我与人比一比颜色就拿回来了。」到了书房，叫了巴英官，忙忙的踩开大步，一直到聘才处来。心里喜道：「我若能弄上了他，这京里的大老官，就要算我奚老土了。」再说潘三到和尚房里，和尚把奚十一的计与他说了，潘三乐极，连称妙计，便在和尚房中等候，心里想道：「这个活宝，就与他坐一坐，喝一杯就够了，还想顽他么？就叫他顽我，我也愿意。他若肯顽我，","en":"back.\\" Returning to his study, he called for Ba Yingguan and hurried off with long strides, heading straight for Pincai's place. He rejoiced inwardly, \\"If I can get my hands on him, I, Xi the Clod, will be the greatest patron in the capital.\\" Back at the temple, the monk relayed Xi Eleven's plan to Pan the Third. Pan the Third was ecstatic, praising the brilliant scheme,"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":6,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"四儿去了不多一刻，就摆了酒菜上来，在个方桌子上。聘才道：「虽然便饭，也喝一杯酒。」琴言道：「不消了，就吃饭罢。」聘才不听，斟了一杯送过来，琴言只得接了，也回敬了聘才一杯。聘才喜出望外，也是平生第一次得意，难得两人对坐了。聘才随口的说些话来哄琴言，要他喜欢，说庾香近来也不出门赴席听戏，常托我对你说，在那","en":"Not long after Si'er left, wine and dishes were set out on a square table. Pincai urged, \\"Though it's just a simple meal, let us share a cup of wine.\\" Qinyan declined, \\"There's no need, I will just eat.\\" But Pincai wouldn't listen, pouring a cup and handing it over. Qinyan had no choice but to accept and poured one in return. Pincai"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":7,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"正要催饭，只听得院子里一阵脚步响，已撬了风门进来，琴言见奚十一，心里就慌，站了起来。聘才笑盈盈的说道：「来得正好，主人来陪客了。」奚十一笑道：「我知道此刻尚未吃完，竭诚来敬琴言一杯。」便叫巴英官拖过凳子，就朝南坐了。一手执壶，一手擎杯，斟好了，直送到琴言嘴边。琴言接又不好，不接又不好，急得满脸通红。聘才道：「这是主人敬客人之意，你不能干","en":"Just as Pincai was about to urge him to eat, the sound of hurried footsteps echoed in the courtyard. The wind-door was pried open, and in walked Xi Eleven. Qinyan panicked and immediately stood up. Pincai smiled warmly, \\"Perfect timing—the host has arrived to keep"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":2,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"只得苦苦的忍住，拿起杯子来，装作失手，「当」的一声砸得粉碎，衣服上也溅了几点酒，把绢子拭了，对聘才道：「我冒失了。」聘才也知道他的心思，便道：「这有何妨！」","en":"pieces on the floor, splashing a few drops of wine onto his clothes. He wiped it with his handkerchief and said to Pincai, \\"How clumsy of me.\\" Pincai, perfectly understanding his intent, replied, \\"It matters not at all.\\""},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":1,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"多劝你，一人劝你三杯。」潘三满拟这杯酒，他若喝了，琴言便亲了他的□嘴一样，偏又砸了，甚是扫兴。还想重来敬他，被聘才拦住。唐和尚不知好歹，斟了半杯道：「阿弥陀佛，华公府是小寺的大施主，老太太装过三世佛的金身，少奶奶塑过送子观音像，舍了三年的灯油。如今他府里爷们光降，我出家人无以为敬，借花献佛，小琴爷请喝这钟。」捧了杯子，打了个稽首，口中念道：「南无大慈大悲救苦救难","en":"they had kissed; seeing it smashed utterly ruined his mood. He tried to press another toast but was blocked by Pincai. Monk Tang, completely lacking in tact, poured half a cup and said, \\"Amitabha! The noble Hua estate is a great patron of our humble temple. The old lady adorned the Three-World Buddha with gold, the young mistress commissioned the Guanyin who brings"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":2,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"推住了，和尚抱了他的腿，跪着在他膝上碰头。琴言只得坐下，真急了，便厉声正色的说道：「今日请教各位，待要怎样？」聘才连忙说道：「不喝酒了，倒是大家谈谈罢。」拉了和尚起来。琴言道：「我有事不能再会了。」又要走，奚十一拦住不放，说道：「不喝酒就是了，坐一会，忙什么？」聘才只得说道：「快拿饭来吃了，我们还有事呢。」琴言又只得坐下，万分气恼，勉强忍住。","en":"and genuinely angered, Qinyan spoke with stern severity: \\"May I ask what exactly you gentlemen intend today?\\" Pincai hurriedly intervened, \\"No more drinking, let's just chat,\\" and hauled the monk to his feet. Qinyan insisted, \\"I have matters to attend to; I can stay no longer.\\" As he tried to leave again, Xi Eleven blocked his path, saying, \\"If you won't drink, fine."},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":5,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"伸一伸舌头道：「这个宝贝，只有你有。别人从何处得来？这对镯子，城里一千吊钱也找不出来。」不住「啧啧啧」的几声。聘才、和尚也睁睁的望着。聘才暗想道：「好出手，头一回就拿这样好东西赏他，看他要不要？」琴言也不来看，只低了头。奚十一道：「你试试，大小包管合式。」便叫琴言戴上。琴言站起来，正色的说道：「这个我断不敢受，况且我从不带镯子的。」琴言无心，伸出一手给他们看，是","en":"bracelets like this in the whole city for a thousand strings of cash.\\" He continued clicking his tongue in awe. Pincai and the monk stared wide-eyed. Pincai thought, \\"What an opening move—offering such a fine thing right away. Let's see if he takes it.\\" Qinyan didn't even look, keeping his head bowed. Xi Eleven urged, \\"Try them on, I guarantee the size is perfect,\\" and"},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":1,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"且说琴言上了车，下了帘子，一路掩面悲泣。到家即脱下外褂，上床卧下，越想越恨，只怨自己发昏，去找聘才，惹出这场祸来。把被蒙了头，整整哭了半日，几乎要想自尽。不知后事如何，且听下回分解。","en":"collapsed onto his bed, and the more he thought about it, the more bitterly he hated himself for foolishly seeking out Pincai and bringing this disaster upon himself. He pulled the quilt over his head and cried for half the day, nearly driven to thoughts of suicide. For what happened next, listen to the following chapter."}],"37":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"且说琴言回寓，气倒了，哭了半日，即和衣蒙被而卧。千悔万悔，不应该去看聘才。知他通同一路，有心欺他，受了这场戏侮，恨不得要寻死，凄凄惨惨，恨了半夜。睡到早晨，尚未曾醒，他小使进来推醒了他，说道：「怡园徐老爷来叫你，说叫你快去，梅少爷已先到了。」琴言起来，小使叠好了被，琴言净了脸，喝了碗茶。因昨日气了一天，哭了半夜，前两天又","en":"on his bed fully clothed, pulling the quilt over himself. He regretted a thousand times over having gone to see Pincai, realizing too late that Pincai was in league with the rest of them and had deliberately set out to humiliate him. So humiliated was he that he wished he could die. He went on seething and weeping through half the night. Morning came and he was still"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":2,"tokens":["魏聘才","聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"别有悲伤，并不是为了长庆。众人既不知道，又不便告诉人，闷在心里，越想越气，要忍也忍不住，把帕子掩了面，想道：「魏聘才这东西专会捏造谣言，将来必说我在他那里陪酒，奚十一赏镯子等语，不如我说了，也可叫人明白。况且谅无笑我的人。」又停了一会，问子玉道：「你几时见聘才的？」子玉道：「尚是去年十月内见过一次，如今住在城外宏济寺，也绝不到我家来。」","en":"grew, until he could bear it no longer. Pressing his handkerchief to his face, he thought to himself: \\"That wretch Wei Pincai is always inventing rumours. He is sure to say I kept them company over wine at his lodgings, that Xi Eleven rewarded me with a bracelet, and so on. It would be better to speak up myself and let people know the truth. Besides, surely no one here would"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":3,"tokens":["魏聘才","聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"门外打门。门上人才穿衣起来，他说了一声，留下个片子，到如今还没有见着他。你是那里见他的？」琴言骂了一声道：「这魏聘才始终不是个东西。」蕙芳道：「早就不是个东西，何须你说。」子玉又问琴言，琴言含泪说道：「原是我不好，我到他寓里，要他同我去看你。」子玉听到此，一阵心酸，眼皮上已红了一点。众人尽听他说，王恂道：「你看他，他怎样待你？」琴言道：「聘才起先还好，如今有一班坏","en":"dawn on New Year's Day when he came banging on the gate. The doorman had only just gotten out of bed and dressed. Pincai said a word or two, left a calling card, and to this day we have not seen each other. Where did you see him?\\" Qinyan cursed, \\"That Wei Pincai has never been anything but a scoundrel.\\" Huifang agreed, \\"He was a scoundrel long before that. You needn't"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":2,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"蕙芳听了，皱了皱眉，问道：「你怎样呢？」琴言也恨极了，索性细细的将奚十一故意先走，后聘才撵了潘三，奚十一忽又送菜来，后奚十一、潘三、和尚先后的闯进，并将席间诸般戏侮，与砸了他的镯子，都说了出来。子玉听了，甚是生气，说道：「这是聘才的坏，定是他设的计，故意叫他们糟蹋你的。」琴言道：「可不是他通同的么？幸亏我如今不唱戏了，他们还不敢十分怎样","en":"that he went ahead and recounted the whole story in detail: how Xi Eleven had made a point of leaving early, how Pincai had then sent Pan the Third away, how Xi Eleven had unexpectedly sent over some dishes, and how, one after another, Xi Eleven, Pan the Third, and the monk had all barged in. He detailed every manner of insult and mockery they had subjected him to at"}],"39":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":8,"tokens":["魏聘才","聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"性全寄了几百两银子来与元茂，并写个禀帖与王文辉，要替他儿子办喜事。王文辉不耐烦作媒，俱令王恂代劳。李元茂求着了魏聘才，求其代制一切。魏聘才闹了一个多月，花的，输的，丢了好些银钱，窃案又未能破，心上也有些烦闷起来，不得主意。今见李元茂来求他，当日原是他与王文辉为媒，意欲借此到文辉处走动，作个幌子，便答应了，又道：「你去年借我的镯子，如今也该取还我了，迟一日多一日利钱","en":"marriage. Wang Wenhui had no patience for matchmaking and delegated everything to Wang Xun. Li Yuanmao then sought out Wei Pincai and begged him to take charge of all the arrangements. Wei Pincai had been carousing for over a month, spending, losing at cards, and frittering away a good deal of money. As the theft case had still not been resolved, so his spirits were rather low"},{"paragraph":2,"mentions":2,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"聘才明日去拜王文辉，文辉进衙门去了，王恂接待。又同去见了亮功，说了些客套，无非是现在客途，无人照料，一切尚求包涵等语。亮功道：「原是爱亲结亲，这些烦文，一概删去。我也不要破费他一钱，一切在我就是了。」即留聘才吃饭。","en":"The following day Pincai called on Wang Wenhui, but Wenhui had gone into the yamen; Wang Xun received him instead. They then went together to pay their respects to Lianggong, exchanged the usual pleasantries, mentioning that they were currently sojourning away from home with"},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":2,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"到了前三日过礼，聘才只得去找元茂，免不得上去见了颜夫人，因有好几个月不去了，又为去年闹了事，甚是局促不安。颜夫人也不问其往事，淡淡问了几句话。聘才去见了子玉，子玉想起琴言前日的话，心上总有些怪他，也不似从前待他亲厚了。","en":"Three days before the wedding came the exchange of betrothal gifts, and Pincai had no choice but to go and find Yuanmao, which meant calling on Madam Yan as well. Having stayed away for several months and having caused that unpleasant scene the previous year, he was quite ill at ease. Madam Yan, for her part, asked nothing about"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":4,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"恂、仲清是见过几回的了，子玉却是初见，心中想道：「这个梅少爷好相貌，比起那孙老徽来，倒似那戏上岑彭、马武了。」聘才问姬亮轩道：「好几天不见你东家出来，在家里作什么？」亮轩道：「这两天敝东有点贵恙，不便行动。」聘才道：「什么贵恙？」亮轩道：「听得腿上生了疖子，所以不出来。」这一席却分了三路，子玉、仲清、王恂是一路，孙嗣徽兄弟是一路，聘才、亮轩又是一路，故此不能热闹","en":"Mei is a fine-looking man. Set beside that Sun Sihui, who might be Cen Peng or Ma Wu straight off the stage.\\" Pincai asked Ji Liangxuan, \\"I haven't seen your master come out in days, what's he doing at home?\\" Liangxuan said, \\"My master has been indisposed these past couple of days and hasn't been able to get about.\\" Pincai said, \\"What sort of indisposition?\\" Liangxuan"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":1,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"舅嫂，是我两姨中表嫡亲表嫂之嫡亲表妹，这是新亲。叙起老亲来，从前已故太太的外祖，是我丈人的丈人。」仲清笑起来，聘才道：「这个青，也只好算个蛋青了。」亮轩道：「虽然是淡亲，却也胜于举目无亲。我听得有副对子道：「岂有文章惊海内，更无亲友在朝中。」","en":"grandfather of the late mistress of the house was the father-in-law of my father-in-law.\\" Zhongqing started laughing. Pincai said, \\"That's a connection so light you'd call it eggshell blue.\\" Liangxuan said, \\"Though slender, it still beats having no kin at all. I've heard a couplet that goes: 'What writings could astonish all within the seas, when not a single friend or kinsman"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":1,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，只要多转两个弯。」亮轩连称「正是」。子玉微笑。元茂道：「我非但算不得清，而且也听不清，真是葫芦牵倒扁豆藤。」聘才笑道：「忙中遇着腿缠筋。」嗣徽道：「亲亲也，凡有血气者莫不尊亲。亲亲人也，仁者人也。」嗣元听了乃兄开口，就要驳起来，道：「这话、话，不、不通，你、你说凡有血、血、血气者，莫不、不、不尊亲，都、都、都是你、你的亲，我、我、我想就、就、就只有螃、螃、螃蟹","en":"follow the connections, I couldn't even hear them properly. It's like a pumpkin vine tangled up with a bean vine.\\" Pincai laughed and said, \\"And in the middle of it all you run into a man with his legs all wrapped in creepers.\\" Sihui said, \\"Kin love is the way of kin, whosoever has blood and breath cannot but honor his kin. To love one's kin is humanity; humanity is humanity"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":2,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"不是人人算我本家，个个算我亲戚么？」龙王大惊道：「快些放他去罢，不然他要与我攀亲了，不要攀出蛤蟆亲戚来。」说得聘才、王恂、子玉几乎笑倒。嗣徽与亮轩知道是骂他们，因回答不出来，只好忍气。嗣元见骂了他们，倒反笑起来，道：「好、好个王八亲戚，好、好个蛤蟆亲、亲、亲戚。」王恂道：「我也有个笑话。一个妓女是个瞎子，有人去嫖他，他虽看不见，却分得人的等次来。那一天接了三个客","en":"Should he linger, he will soon claim kinship with me, and I have no desire for a toad as a cousin.\\"' At this, Pincai, Wang Xun, and Ziyu nearly fell off their seats laughing. Sihui and Liangxuan, knowing themselves to be the butt of the joke and having no reply, had to swallow their indignation. Siyuan, however, seeing those two mocked, laughed all the louder. \\"A f-f-fine"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":2,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"原来聘才这个笑话，虽系有心打趣李元茂的近视眼，却不知关碍了新娘。从前就说过是个天老儿，生的一头白发，连眉毛、寒毛都是白的，北边叫作天老，南边谓之白羊子。更兼情性泼悍，今年已经三十岁了，四远驰名，无人聘他，故将就送与元茂。元茂如何知道？高高兴兴的进来，心中想道","en":"As it happened, Pincai's joke, though he had aimed it at Li Yuanmao's nearsightedness, had unwittingly landed on a tender nerve where the bride was concerned. As had been mentioned before, she was an albino: her hair, eyebrows, and body hair were all white. In the north such"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":1,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"元茂忽想起聘才挨骂那一回，也是说了白发、白阴毛，因此新人动气，便有些疑心。又想：「自己脸上天天沾染些黑油，那块帕子又是这样，况且他起得绝早，另在一间房内梳妆，而且要关了门，这是何故？」疑心不决，又不敢问。来到房中，见他欢天喜地，戴满了珠翠，分明一头好发，比漆还亮。","en":"Then Yuanmao recalled the incident when Pincai had been cursed, the joke had touched on white hair and white intimate hair, and that was what had made the bride so furious. His suspicions began to stir. And then he thought, \\"My own face is smeared with black oil every day, and there was that handkerchief;"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":3,"tokens":["魏聘才","聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"水一桶，用硼砂、明矾洗干净，晾得半干，然后梳挽，也要一个时辰。今日略迟了些，因此败露。元茂气哄哄的崛了出去，在魏聘才的处住了两天。聘才问其所以然，他只得直说了。聘才恍然大悟，遂明白前日的笑话，竟说到板眼里去了。","en":"been running a little late, and so the truth came to light. Yuanmao stormed out in a fury and went to stay at Wei Pincai's lodgings for a couple of days. Pincai asked him what had happened, and Yuanmao had no choice but to tell him the whole story. Pincai was immediately enlightened: he now understood how his joke the other night had hit exactly on the mark."},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":2,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"丈夫两三天不回，心上急了，禀明了父母。亮功大怒，陆夫人也有了气，便着人到梅宅上一问，没有去。又各处找寻，找到了聘才处，找着了。元茂尚不肯回去，聘才力劝，方同了来人回家，犹不肯进房，在书房中同嗣徽说闲话。晚间亮功回来，即说了元茂几句，陆夫人也责备了元茂一番，然究竟心上有些对不住元茂，半说半劝的叫他进房。元茂也没奈何，只得进去，心上犹记着那天的模样，总不能高兴。","en":"sent someone to the Mei household to inquire, but he was not there. After searching everywhere, he was found at Pincai's. Yuanmao still refused to go back; only after Pincai pressed him earnestly did he agree to return with the messenger, though he still would not go into the inner chambers and sat in the study chatting idly with Sihui instead. When Lianggong returned"},{"paragraph":30,"mentions":1,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"看到那妙处，好似骑了一匹银鬃马，倒应了聘才的笑话，真像一相蝇拂子遮着。元茂忍不住笑了一声，把他拧了一把。孙氏骂道：「作什么，你原也是个近视眼，何不也闻闻？」元茂看动了心，放了灯，上床去了。秽事休题，且看下回分解。","en":"came to that most intimate area, it was as if he had ridden upon a silver-maned horse, and indeed it bore out Pincai's joke, looking for all the world like a fly-whisk held over herself. Yuanmao could not suppress a laugh, and gave her a pinch. Madam Sun said, \\"What do you think you're doing? Aren't you yourself a nearsighted man? Why not have a good sniff as well?\\""}],"40":[{"paragraph":6,"mentions":1,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"闲话休题。且说奚十一那天一人独自到宏济寺来，和尚与聘才都出门去了，小和尚在自己一间房内，歪在炕上，朝里睡着。奚十一见他单穿个月白绸紧身，镶了花边，绿绉绸的套裤，剃得逼清的光头。奚十一看了动火，脱了外面长衣，倒身躺下，轻轻的解了他的带子，把裤子扯了一半下来，贴身服侍。得月惊醒，扭转头一看，见了奚十一，便说","en":"idle chatter aside. To return to our story: one day Xi Eleven came alone to the Hongji Temple. Both the monk and Pincai had gone out; the young novice was in his own room, lying sideways on the kang facing the wall, fast asleep. Xi Eleven saw him wearing only a close-fitting moon-white silk inner jacket trimmed with fancy borders, and green crinkle-silk leg-warmers, his"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":1,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"进去了。」天香道：「我们还到魏老爷那边去坐坐罢，他虽不在家，也可坐得的。」奚十一无可无不可，就同了天香进去，叫聘才的家人沏了两碗茶，与天香闲谈。天香道：「今日我找魏老爷，要问他借几吊钱，偏又不在家，不知几时才回来呢？」奚十一道：「你方才从何处来？沾得一身土。」天香道：「去找那卖牛肉的哈回子讨钱，又没遇着。」奚十一道：「你要多少钱使？」天香道：「还短十五吊钱，一时","en":"not home, we can still sit there.\\" Xi Eleven had no particular objection, so he went inside with Tianxiang, had Pincai's servant brew two bowls of tea, and fell to chatting idly. Tianxiang said, \\"Today I came to find Master Wei because I need to borrow a few strings of cash from him, but as luck would have it he's not at home — I don't know when he'll be back.\\" Xi Eleven"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":1,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"了。天香此时后门口觉得焦辣辣的难受，要想奚十一与他杀杀火。奚十一见天香情动，便也高兴，两人不言而喻，闹了一回，聘才尚未回来。","en":"aroused, was himself in high spirits; and so, by unspoken mutual understanding, the two had a vigorous tumble. Pincai had still not returned."}],"42":[{"paragraph":14,"mentions":1,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"适相遇了，跟了琴言到门口。亮轩恍惚记得这个门，想了一会想着了，就猜方才见的是琴言。后又想起奚十一的话，说前月在聘才处叫他陪过酒，无疑是他。便与大傻讲了，大傻见亮轩高兴，欲赞成他进去，好吃个镶边酒，便道：「管他是与不是，既是相公寓里，总可以进得的，我们且进去坐坐，喝杯茶也好。」亮轩道：「你高兴就进去，我是奉陪的。」商量一会，才同了进去。","en":"just now was Qinyan. He then recalled something Xi Eleven had said, that the previous month he had met Qinyan at Pincai's place and had him as a drinking companion. This confirmed his guess. He shared his thought with Dasha. Dasha, seeing that Liangxuan was eager and wishing to second his enthusiasm in order to cadge a few drinks on the side, suggested that whether it"}],"44":[{"paragraph":7,"mentions":1,"tokens":["魏聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"他一番了。」又转念道：「看他的心总是勉强在此，心上又有什么梅少爷，自然在外面快乐。但到徐老爷处也还罢了。怎么连魏聘才、奚十一都陪酒来了？就不顾自己身分，也应留公子脸面。翡翠镯子也不算什么宝贝，就这么下作。偏在府里时装腔作势，十三太保的样儿，冷气逼人。原来也报应在我眼里。此时就要替你遮瞒也不能了，不如照直说罢。这是有骨气的人作的事，也可臊臊人的脸，他身分好，不像个唱","en":"Naturally he is happier out there. To be at Lord Xu's is one thing. But how could he also attend wine parties for Wei Pincai and Xi Eleven? Has he no self-respect, or does he care nothing for the young master's face? The jade bracelets are not worth all that much, and yet he could sink so low. And here in the household he always put on such airs — the manner of a superior"}],"47":[{"paragraph":5,"mentions":1,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「你师父那里去了？」得月道：「在间壁庄子上。方才有个杨八爷请他去说话，就回来的。」奚十一又与得月顽笑一会，再问聘才，也不在家。","en":"Eighth called him over to talk; he will be back shortly.\\" Xi Eleven teased Deyue a while longer, then asked for Pincai, who was also out."}],"50":[{"paragraph":17,"mentions":1,"tokens":["魏聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"点笑容也没有。」王恂道：「方才里头吹唱的是谁？」唐和尚道：「那就是魏大爷。」文泽道：「那个魏大爷？」仲清道：「魏聘才在这里作寓。」唐和尚道：「魏大爷，想少爷们都认识的。」王恂道：「认识之至。」唐和尚道：「这个人真好，真是个满场飞。近来他也要出京了。方才是杨八爷、张、顾二位师老爷在那里，大家高兴，唱了几只曲子。」","en":"door just now?\\" Tang replied, \\"Oh, that was Master Wei.\\" Wenze pressed, \\"Which Master Wei?\\" Zhongqing clarified, \\"Wei Pincai is lodging here.\\" Tang said, \\"Master Wei! I imagine you young masters must all know him.\\" Wang Xun nodded, \\"Intimately.\\" Tang praised him, \\"He is a truly wonderful man, the life of any gathering! He will be leaving the capital soon, too. Just now, it"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":5,"tokens":["魏聘才","聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"却说魏聘才与玉天仙相好，倒得了他的嫖钱，捐了分发，掣着湖北，好不有兴。已另租了几间房子，从寺里搬出来，与玉天仙同居。这两日置备些出京物件，已买了一个丫头，雇了一个老婆子，玉天仙做起奶奶来。这玉天仙本是扬州瘦马，到京来颇有声名。但年纪已二十七岁，比聘才大了两年。","en":"Meanwhile, Wei Pincai, having won the deep affection of Yutianxian and secured her financial backing, purchased his official posting and drew an assignment to Hubei, filling him with immense elation. He quickly rented a few rooms, moved out of the temple, and set up a household"},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":2,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"聘才出京之日，唐和尚直送到十里长亭，洒泪而别。聘才回家接了父母，同往湖北，后来书中就没有他的事了。要叙李元茂、孙嗣徽在通州小考，闹了一个小小的笑话，且俟下回分解。","en":"On the day Wei Pincai finally departed the capital, Monk Tang escorted him all the way to the ten-li farewell pavilion, shedding genuine tears as they parted. Pincai returned to his hometown, collected his parents, and they all journeyed together to Hubei. From this point"}],"51":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说聘才出京之时，曾问元茂要帐，适值元茂赴通州去了。","en":"When Wei Pincai was departing the capital, he sought to collect a debt from Yuanmao, only to find that Yuanmao had just left for Tongzhou."},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":1,"tokens":["聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"颇为不薄，如今远别，怎好不给他十吊钱。但这四十两只够还账，不能有余，怎么好呢？」想了半夜，想出一个方法，去年借聘才的金镯子，若取了出来，照时价换了，可以多得五六十吊钱，可不是帐也还了，别敬也有了。","en":"turned for half the night until a scheme finally coalesced: last year, he had pawned a gold bracelet borrowed from Wei Pincai. If he redeemed it now and exchanged it at the current market rate for gold, he could net an extra fifty or sixty strings of cash. Thus, his debts would be cleared, and he would have a handsome parting gift as well."}],"52":[{"paragraph":15,"mentions":1,"tokens":["魏聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"不减袁、苏，貌类琴言，而聪明过之。」赞得素兰好不喜欢。华公子又问子玉道：「弟与尊兄虽初次识面，但心契已久。有个魏聘才，是府上搬出来，在弟处住了半年，常常提及阁下，并有一事倒要请教。」子玉不知问他何事，即答道：「魏世兄也时常提及尊府，但未识荆，不敢晋谒，不知有何赐教？」华公子道：「事本细微，但一时不能索解。闻得阁下与琴言订交最密，矢志不渝。琴言在弟处，弟即有所闻。琴","en":"addressed Ziyu, \\"Though you and I meet face-to-face for the first time, our hearts have long been aligned. A certain Wei Pincai, who moved out of your esteemed residence, lodged with me for half a year and frequently mentioned you. There is one matter I must ask for your guidance on.\\" Unsure of what he meant, Ziyu replied politely, \\"Brother Wei also frequently mentioned your"}],"56":[{"paragraph":26,"mentions":1,"tokens":["魏聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"奇。忽又见许多人影，从镜子里过去，就是那一班名士与一班名旦。自己忽将镜子反过来，隐隐的有好些人映在里面，好像是魏聘才、奚十一等类。正看时，那镜子忽转旋起来，光明如月，成了一颗大珠，颇觉有趣。忽然船舱外伸进一只蓝手，满臂的鳞甲，伸开五个大爪，把这面镜子抢去了。","en":"scholars and celebrated actors. He turned the mirror slightly, and the dim figures shifting within seemed to be Wei Pincai, Xi Eleven, and other men of their ilk. As he watched in utter fascination, the mirror suddenly began to spin. It grew as radiantly bright as the full moon, magically transforming into a single, massive pearl—a truly marvelous sight. But suddenly, a"}],"60":[{"paragraph":17,"mentions":1,"tokens":["魏聘才"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"了。」素兰道：「原来你也怕奚十一，难道他比潘三还利害么？」蕙芳道：「潘三是个无用的人，那奚十一闹起来，就与前日魏聘才使来的车夫一样，你怕不怕？」兰保道：「那天适或我不在家，你便怎样？」蕙芳道：「我就躲开不出来了。」琴仙问奚十一怎样，兰保将他的样子学了一回，琴仙也觉好笑。蕙芳道：「听得奚十一出京去了，但我前日在剃头铺里看见一个人，很像他那一天带来的那个小子，就不是他","en":"replied, \\"Pan the Third is a useless coward. But when Xi Eleven starts a riot, he's just like the carriage driver Wei Pincai sent the other day—would you be afraid or not?\\" Lanbao asked, \\"What would you have done if I hadn't been home that day?\\" Huifang answered, \\"I would have simply hidden away and refused to come out.\\" Qinxian asked what Xi Eleven was like, and Lanbao mimicked"}]}`),"char-6":JSON.parse(`{"2":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["李元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"呈上说道：「门上说是家乡来的，现在二门外等回话。」士燮看时，一个全帖上写着：世愚侄魏聘才；一个写着：门下晚学生李元茂。","en":"read, \\"Your humble nephew of the next generation, Wei Pincai,\\" while the other read, \\"Your devoted later student, Li Yuanmao.\\""},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":2,"tokens":["李元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，满面笑容，口称老伯，就跪下叩头。士燮还礼不迭，起来看道：「老世台的尊范，与令尊竟是一模一样。」聘才正要答应，李元茂已高高的作了一个揖，然后徐徐跪下，如拜神的拜了四拜。士燮两手扶起，说道：「你令尊正盼望你来，一路辛苦了。」那李元茂掀唇动齿的咕噜了一句，也听不明白。士燮让他们坐了，聘才道：「家父深感老伯厚恩，铭刻五内，特叫小侄进京来，给老伯与老伯母请安，还要恳求栽培","en":"the distinguished bearing of your family, you are the very image of your father.\\" Pincai was about to reply when Li Yuanmao raised his clasped hands high in a sweeping bow, then slowly knelt to prostrate himself four times as though worshipping at a temple altar. Shixie helped him up with both hands, saying, \\"Your esteemed father has been eagerly awaiting your arrival. You"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":2,"tokens":["元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「士燮问了他父母好。子玉出来，见过了礼，士燮即叫子玉引元茂去见他父亲，子玉即同了元茂、聘才到书房去了。士燮吩咐家人许顺，收拾书房后身另院的两间屋子，给他们暂且住下。","en":"his parents' health. When Ziyu emerged and exchanged formal greetings, Shixie promptly instructed him to escort Yuanmao to meet his father. Ziyu then led both Yuanmao and Pincai toward the study. Meanwhile, Shixie ordered the servant Xu Shun to prepare two rooms in the secluded courtyard behind the study for their temporary lodging."},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":3,"tokens":["元茂","李元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"慢慢的细讲。」正说着，见云儿走来请吃饭，遂一同到书房来。性全忙让聘才首坐，聘才如何肯僭，仍让先生坐了，次聘才，元茂与子玉坐在下面。席间性全问起一路来的光景，又谢聘才照应。聘才谦让未逞，又赞了元茂许多好处。性全也觉喜欢，道是儿子或者长进了些。那李元茂闷着头不敢言语。用完了晚饭，那时行李已取到，房间亦已打扫。","en":"offered Pincai the head seat. Pincai firmly refused, deferring to the teacher, and took a subordinate place, while Yuanmao and Ziyu sat below. Over the meal, Li Xingquan asked after their journey and expressed his gratitude to Pincai for looking after his son. Pincai responded with modest demurrers and offered effusive praise of Yuanmao. Li Xingquan was deeply gratified,"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":2,"tokens":["元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"喝了一会茶，说了些南边年岁光景，聘才知道元茂不能熬夜，起身告辞，性全也体谅他们路上辛苦，就叫元茂跟了过去，子玉送他们进屋，见已铺设好了，说声：「早些安歇罢！」也就叫俊儿提灯，照进上房去了。","en":"They lingered over tea for a while, discussing the state of affairs in the south. Pincai, aware that Yuanmao could not abide late hours, eventually rose to take his leave. Li Xingquan, understanding the exhaustion of their travels, sent Yuanmao along with him. Ziyu escorted them to their quarters, ensuring everything was appropriately arranged. Bidding them"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":1,"tokens":["元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"次日聘才、元茂到上屋去拜见了颜夫人，又将南边带来的土仪与他父亲的书信一并呈上，书中无非恳切求照应的话。另有致王文辉一信，士燮叫他迟日亲自送去。这聘才本是个聪明人，又经乃父陶镕，这一张嘴，真个千伶百俐，善于哄骗，所以在梅宅不到十天，满宅的人都说他好。子玉虽与其两道，","en":"The following day, Pincai and Yuanmao visited the main residence to pay their respects to Lady Yan. They presented regional gifts brought from the south, alongside letters from their fathers, each brimming with earnest pleas for continued patronage and care. Among the missives was a letter"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":1,"tokens":["元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一日晚上，元茂睡了，子玉与聘才闲谈。聘才问道：「京里的戏是甲于天下的。我听得说那些小旦称呼相公，好不扬气。","en":"One evening, while Yuanmao slept, Ziyu and Pincai sat chatting together. Pincai asked, \\"The theater of the capital is renowned as the finest beneath the heavens. I have heard that the young performers of female roles, addressed as 'xianggong,' carry themselves with an extraordinary"}],"3":[{"paragraph":8,"mentions":1,"tokens":["元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"次日，聘才记着叶茂林的话，吃了早饭想去听戏，叫四儿带了钱，换了衣裳。因元茂在书房读书，不好约他，独自步行出门，不多路就到了戏园地方。这条街共有五个园子，一路车马挤满，甚是难走。遍看联锦班的报子，今日没有戏，遇着传差，聘才心上不乐，只得再找别的班子。耳边听得一阵锣鼓响，走过了几家铺面，见一个戏园写着三乐园，是联珠班。进去看时","en":"breakfast, resolved to attend a play. He instructed Si'er to carry some coin and changed into fresh garments. Knowing Yuanmao was immersed in his studies, Pincai departed alone on foot. The theater district was a short distance away, a bustling thoroughfare lined with five distinct playhouses, choked with carriages and horses, making passage arduous. Scanning the playbills"},{"paragraph":38,"mentions":1,"tokens":["元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"此时日已西沉，富、贵两人急急的赶城，聘才送了他们上车，同着四儿慢慢步行而归。到家时点了灯了，子玉、元茂都在书房夜课。聘才换了衣裳，趿着鞋，喝了几杯茶，坐了一回。","en":"the darkening streets home with Si'er. By the time they arrived, the estate was bathed in lamplight. Ziyu and Yuanmao were sequestered in the study, immersed in their evening lessons. Pincai changed out of his street clothes, slipped into comfortable shoes, drank several cups of hot tea, and sat in quiet contemplation."},{"paragraph":39,"mentions":1,"tokens":["元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"少停，子玉、元茂出来，同到聘才房里。","en":"Shortly thereafter, Ziyu and Yuanmao emerged from their studies, making their way to Pincai's room."},{"paragraph":40,"mentions":3,"tokens":["元茂","李元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"只见聘才解下腰间的褡包，一只手揣在怀里，剩着一只空袖子悠悠荡荡的，在房里走来走去转圈儿。见了子玉、元茂进来，，便嘻嘻的笑。元茂道：「今日什么事，到此刻才回？」又凑到他脑上一看道：「酒气醺醺，一定是叶茂林请你的，可曾见那些小孩子么？」聘才道：「我没有去找叶茂林，我倒听了联珠班的戏。那班里的相公，足有五六十个，都是生得很好的。遇见一个相好，是从前南京藩台","en":"his robe, letting his empty sleeve sway rhythmically as he paced slow circles around the room. Seeing Ziyu and Yuanmao enter, his face broke into a radiant grin. Yuanmao asked, \\"What kept you abroad until this late hour?\\" Peering closer, he added, \\"You reek of wine! Did Ye Maolin invite you out? Did you happen to see any of those young actors?\\" Pincai laughed, \\"I did"}],"4":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":2,"tokens":["元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"却说子玉正在体贴琴官心事，只听元茂开着风门说道：「了不得了。」倒把子玉等唬了一跳，问道：「为什么大惊小怪？」元茂道：「你看地下已铺了一层，这棉花大的朵子下起来，一夜就有一尺多了。」子玉同聘才到门口看时，果然飘飘洒洒，下起雪来。子玉道：「这腊雪是最好的。今年一冬风燥，现在求雪，幸亏我们","en":"To return to our story: Ziyu was brooding over Qinguan's heavy heart when he heard Yuanmao fling open the vestibule door and cry out, \\"Something terrible has happened!\\" Startled, Ziyu and the others asked why he was making such a fuss. \\"Look at the ground,\\" Yuanmao said, \\"it is already blanketed. With flakes falling as large as cotton bolls,"},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":1,"tokens":["元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"上的雪，被风刮得如梨花乱舞。即吩咐云儿，叫厨房多备几样莱，请魏、李两位少爷赏雪。少顷，送过一桌佳肴，请了聘才、元茂过来一同赏玩。","en":"gentlemen Wei and Li to come and admire the snow. Before long, a table of fine delicacies was laid out, and Pincai and Yuanmao arrived to enjoy the snowy vista together."},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":1,"tokens":["元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，若见琼枝玉立，何异瑶岛看花，真笑党家锦帐中，醇酒羔羊，终不脱武夫气象矣。吃完之后，煮雪煎茶，闲谈一会，聘才、元茂各自回房去了。","en":"When the meal was finished, they melted snow to brew tea, conversed leisurely for a time, and then Pincai and Yuanmao returned to their own rooms."},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":2,"tokens":["元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，雪声做了第三。已经下了雪，那白皓皓一片，自然就有雪色，做了第四题。倒也新鲜别致，就构思起来。才做了两首，却被元茂、聘才进来看见，子玉遂叫他们也做几首。元茂道：","en":"Snow Color, his fourth topic. Novel and original. With that, he set to composing. He had just completed two when Yuanmao and Pincai came in and saw him. Ziyu therefore invited them to compose a few verses as well. Yuanmao said:"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":1,"tokens":["元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「雪字下连了一个虚字眼儿，我是做不来的。我只好咏咏雪罢了。」聘才道：「就是咏雪，要对却费力。我只好做首绝句。」元茂道：「七个字一句的累赘，我只会做五言律诗。」子玉道：「都使得。」他们各自搜索枯肠去了。","en":"snow.\\" Pincai added, \\"Even a plain snow poem—making it rhyme properly is hard work. I can only manage a quatrain.\\" Yuanmao said, \\"Seven-character lines are too unwieldy; all I know is how to write a five-character regulated poem.\\" Ziyu smiled. \\"Either will do perfectly well.\\" They each went off to rack their brains."},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":2,"tokens":["元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"是空的，末了一句，用《占花魁》上《独占》这一出戏，我就拉他来用做古典。」子玉道：「倒难为你凑得不着痕迹。」说着元茂却也做完，端端正正写了来。子玉看了，却甚费解，只得赞道：「工稳得很，何不都写起来，送去与他们看看。」元茂见子玉称赞，必定是好极的了，便道：「请教请教他们也好。」倒是聘才自知分量，忙道：「我的不必拿去献丑罢。」子玉道：「这又何妨？我替你们写。」另用一张","en":"said, \\"You have managed to patch it together without a single visible seam, which is no mean feat.\\" By this time, Yuanmao had also finished, returning with his poem written out neatly and properly. Ziyu looked it over; it was rather difficult to follow, but he could only offer praise: \\"Very polished and well-balanced. Why not write both of them out and send them over so"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":1,"tokens":["元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"首绝句。王恂道：「这首亦甚好，只不知庾香又做这一首做什么？」仲清道：「这首也还下得去，然断不是庾香所作。」再看元茂的五律，起二句写着是：「天上彤云布，来思雨雪盈。」王恂道：「这「来思」两字怎么讲？」仲清忽然大笑道：「你往下看。」王恂再看第二联是：「白人双目近，长马四蹄轻。」沉吟道：「马蹄轻，想是用雪尽马蹄轻了。","en":"his own?\\" Zhongqing replied, \\"This one is passable, but it is certainly not Yuxiang's work.\\" They then looked at Yuanmao's five-character regulated poem. The opening couplet read:\\nIn the sky, vermilion clouds spread;\\nmy thoughts come—rain and snow fill to overflowing.\\nWang Xun asked, \\"What do those two words 'my thoughts come' mean?\\" Zhongqing suddenly burst into laughter."},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":1,"tokens":["元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"元茂的诗第一二联单圈，下四句全圈。批语云：裁对工稳，用古入化，足可嗣响元徽。王恂把子玉的诗，用针在碧纱橱内戳了，来看批语，笑道：「却批得好，就是太挖苦些。」仲清道：「可惜天不早了，这雪也下不住，不然，倒可以去与庾香谈谈。」王恂道：「明日去罢！此刻去也谈不","en":"For the first two couplets of Yuanmao's poem he drew single circles; for the last four lines he drew full circles. His critical note read: Couplets are polished and well-matched; classical allusions are dissolved into the new composition; fully worthy to carry on the succession of Yuanhui."},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":4,"tokens":["元茂","李元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"王恂又将孙氏昆仲与他说了，子玉也笑，就叫人请了聘才、元茂出来，大家见了。子玉把各人的诗交给了，说道：「这都是颜大兄评定的，称赞得了不得。」聘才看了批语，暗想道：「颜仲清这人，真可谓博古通今，我用的戏曲，都被他看出来了。」当向仲清道了谢。仲清道：「魏兄诗笔甚俊，声律兼优，想是常做，倒像曲不离口的。」聘才道：","en":"Wang Xun then also told him about the Sun brothers. Ziyu laughed, and had someone summon Pincai and Yuanmao to come out. Everyone met. Ziyu returned each person's poems and said, \\"These assessments were made by Elder Brother Yan; he was most complimentary.\\" Pincai read the comment and thought to himself: \\"This Yan Zhongqing is truly versed in everything ancient"},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":4,"tokens":["元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"面，就是这个意思。」王恂方才恍然。又说了一会闲话，仲清等告辞，子玉等送到门口，仲清道：「何不同出去看看雪景？」元茂听了，就高兴愿去。子玉道：「先生今日尚未全好，我们须在家伺候，改日再奉陪罢。」元茂撅了嘴不言语。仲清等告辞而去，子玉送出大门，进来与聘才、元茂又谈了一会诗，忽又问起琴官来。聘才见他有点意思，便轻轻的挑他一句道：「改日何不偷个空儿，同去认认那个琴官。」","en":"the others escorted them to the door. Zhongqing suggested, \\"Why not come out with us to see the snow scenery?\\" Yuanmao, hearing this, was quite eager to go. Ziyu said, \\"The teacher has not fully recovered today. We must stay home to attend to him. We will accompany you another time.\\" Yuanmao stuck out his lip but said nothing. Zhongqing and the others bid farewell and"}],"5":[{"paragraph":38,"mentions":2,"tokens":["元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"李先生也散了学，时常出去，找些同乡同年聚谈消遣。到了除夕这一天，聘才、元茂在书房闷坐，大有作客凄凉之感。少顷，子玉出来对他二人说道：「昨日听得王母舅于团拜那一日，格外备两桌酒请我们，还有孙氏弟兄。」元茂道：「我是不去的，我又不是同乡。」子玉道：「那不要紧，一来是王母舅单请我们的，又不与他们坐在一处；二来也是庸庵的意思，你若","en":"with fellow provincials and examination classmates for conversation and amusement. On New Year's Eve, Pincai and Yuanmao sat idly in the study, feeling very much the melancholy of guests far from home. Presently Ziyu came out and said to both of them: \\"Yesterday I heard that Uncle Wang, on the day of the group-visit ceremony, will especially prepare two tables of wine"},{"paragraph":39,"mentions":1,"tokens":["元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"急忙来到书房，见书房中也点着两对红烛、四盏素玻璃灯，元茂上前叩了头。聘才也来辞岁，性全连忙还礼，即同了他们到老师、师母跟前辞岁，士燮挡住了。颜夫人即吩咐子玉出去叩贺先生，梅学士即领了子玉，来到书房，彼此贺毕，便摆上酒肴。","en":"He hurried to the study and found two pairs of red candles and four plain glass lanterns burning within. Yuanmao went forward to bow in greeting. Pincai also came to offer the New Year's salutation. Xingquan hastily returned the courtesies, then led them to pay their New Year's respects to their Teacher and Teacher's Wife. Scholar Mei stopped them from the full"},{"paragraph":40,"mentions":1,"tokens":["元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"梅学士恭恭敬敬与性全斟了酒，性全连称不敢；又要与聘才、元茂斟酒，聘才连忙接过酒杯，自己放好了，依次坐下。","en":"Xingquan; Xingquan kept demurring that he could not accept such an honor. Mei then made to fill cups for Pincai and Yuanmao as well. Pincai quickly took the wine cup himself, set it in place, and they all took their seats in proper order."},{"paragraph":41,"mentions":2,"tokens":["李元茂","元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"士燮是个言方行矩的人，更配上那个李性全，席间无非讲些修身立行，勉励子玉的话。李元茂拘拘束束，菜也不敢吃，坐着好不难受。倒是聘才还能假充老实，学些迂腐的话，与他们谈谈。不多一会，也就散了席。梅学士又在外坐了一会，讲了好些话，然后同了子玉进去。性全、元茂等亦各安寝，且待下回分解。","en":"the table was nothing but discourse on self-cultivation and moral rectitude, all words of exhortation to Ziyu. Li Yuanmao sat stiff and constrained, hardly daring to eat, in considerable discomfort. Only Pincai managed to pretend at being earnest, affecting pedantic speech to converse with them. After not too long, the banquet dissolved. Scholar Mei sat outside a while"}],"6":[{"paragraph":20,"mentions":4,"tokens":["元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"次日，要说姑苏会馆团拜的事了，一早梅学士先去了。聘才于隔宿已向子玉借了一副衣裳，长短称身。只有元茂嫌自己的衣服不好，闷闷的不高兴，见了子玉华冠丽服的出来，相形之下颇不相称，便赌气脱下衣裳，仍穿了便服，说道：「我不去了。」子玉就命云儿进去。禀知太太，将我的衣服拿一副出来，说李少爷要穿，云儿随即捧了一包出来。谁知子玉虽与元茂差不多高，而身材大小却差得","en":"departed early in the morning. Pincai had borrowed a set of clothes from Ziyu the previous night—a perfect fit. Only Yuanmao remained dissatisfied with his attire, brooding in a foul mood; seeing Ziyu emerge in his splendid official hat and elegant garments, he felt acutely inferior and stubbornly tore off his clothes, reverting to his ordinary dress, declaring, \\"I will not"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":1,"tokens":["元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一大团，车里都要坐不下去，惹得子玉、聘才皆笑。带了四个书童出来，外面已套了两辆车，四匹马。子玉独坐一车，聘才、元茂同坐一车，一径来到姑苏会馆，车已歇满了。","en":"found two carriages already harnessed with four horses waiting outside. Ziyu rode alone in one, while Pincai and Yuanmao shared the other. They made straight for the Suzhou Guild Hall, where carriages were already packed tightly."},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":3,"tokens":["元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"引至正座，见已开了戏。座中诸老辈，子玉尚有几位不认识，士燮指点他一一见了礼，这些老前辈个个称赞不休。随后聘才、元茂上来与王文辉见礼。聘才还生得伶俐，这元茂又系近视眼，再加上那套衣服，转动不便，一个揖作完，站起来，不料把文辉的帽子碰歪在一边。文辉连忙整好，元茂也涨红了脸，就想走开。","en":"Scholar Mei pointed them out, and Ziyu offered his respects to each, receiving lavish praise in return. Pincai and Yuanmao then stepped forward to greet Wang Wenhui. Pincai, nimble and composed, managed the introduction smoothly; Yuanmao, however, hindered by his nearsightedness and cumbersome attire, struggled to maneuver. As he rose from his bow, he accidentally bumped"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":1,"tokens":["元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"时候才来？」子玉道：「今日起迟了些，那孙大哥、孙二哥还没有来么？」王恂道：「也该快来了。」王、颜二人又与聘才、元茂款接了一番。只见对面楼上来了几个，先是右待郎的少君刘文泽做主，请了史给事的少君史南湘、吴阁学的外甥张仲雨、姑苏名士高品、国子监司业沈公之子沈伯才、天津镇守海口巴总兵之子巴霖，这两位就是孙氏弟兄的妻舅。还有一个本京人，原任江苏知县之子冯子佩，尚未到来。","en":"not yet arrived?\\" Wang Xun answered, \\"They should be here any moment.\\" Wang and Yan warmly welcomed Pincai and Yuanmao. Across the upper floor, another group had assembled, hosted by Liu Wenze, son of the Right Vice-Minister. His guests included Shi Nanxiang, son of Censor Shi; Zhang Zhongyu, nephew of Grand Academician Wu; the renowned Suzhou scholar Gao Pin; Shen Bocai,"},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":1,"tokens":["元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"孙氏弟兄，便乱坐起来。刘文泽、沈伯才、巴霖、张仲雨坐了一席；史南湘、颜仲清、高品拉了子玉过来，坐了一席；聘才、元茂坐了一席；嗣徽、嗣元坐了一席，王恂只好两席轮流作陪。孙嗣徽又之乎者也的闹了一会，问了魏、李二位姓名、籍贯。一面就摆上菜喝酒。高品见嗣徽的脸上疙瘩更多了好些，喝了几杯酒，那个红鼻子如经霜辣子，通红光亮。","en":"Zhang Zhongyu claimed one table; Shi Nanxiang, Yan Zhongqing, and Gao Pin pulled Ziyu to a second; Pincai and Yuanmao took a third; leaving Sihui and Siyuan isolated at the fourth, with Wang Xun moving between tables to act as host. Sun Sihui, adopting his pedantic \\"the Master says\\" persona, began interrogating Wei and Li about their names and native places. Dishes"},{"paragraph":34,"mentions":1,"tokens":["李元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"出场，唱到「忍耐温存一晌眠」，聘才问道：「何如？」子玉并未听见，魂灵儿倒像附在小生身上，同了琴官进去了。偏有那李元茂冒冒失失走过来，把子玉一拍，道：「这就是琴官，你说好不好？」倒把子玉唬了一跳。众人都也看得出神。","en":"nothing; his very spirit seemed tethered to the young leading man, vanishing behind the stage with Qinguan. Suddenly, Li Yuanmao blundered over, clapping Ziyu on the shoulder: \\"This is Qinguan—would you say he's good?\\" The sudden impact startled Ziyu, while the rest of the group remained locked in rapt attention."},{"paragraph":36,"mentions":1,"tokens":["元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"园华府去拜年，原打算不耽搁的。华星北定要拉住吃了饭，又听了他们几出戏，才放我走，还是急急的赶出来的。」子玉同了元茂、聘才告辞，诸人都送到楼门口，文泽、王恂、仲清送下楼来。","en":"watch several more pieces of opera before letting me leave; I rushed here as quickly as I could.\\" Ziyu, alongside Yuanmao and Pincai, bid their farewells; the entire group accompanied them to the staircase landing, with Wenze, Wang Xun, and Zhongqing escorting them all the way downstairs."},{"paragraph":37,"mentions":1,"tokens":["元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"兄一叙，作个清谈雅集。人不多，就是竹君、剑潭、庸庵、卓然几位，吾兄断不可推辞。」子玉应允，又谢了。王恂、聘才、元茂也同道了谢，一径先回。那些人又谈了一会，也各散去。不知后事如何，且听下回分解。","en":"Elder Brother must absolutely not decline.\\" Ziyu agreed, expressing his deep gratitude. Wang Xun, Pincai, and Yuanmao offered their thanks in turn before departing. The remaining guests lingered in conversation for a while longer before dispersing into the night. As for the events that followed, please await the unfolding of the next chapter."}],"8":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说子玉从刘文泽家饮酒回来，已是二更多天。先见过父母，换了衣裳，来寻聘才、元茂说话，却见静悄悄的，掩了房门。那边虎儿走来道：「少爷出去后，师爷就有人请出去了，今日不回来。李少爷、魏少爷吃了早饭出去的。」子玉道：","en":"the night. After paying his respects to his parents and changing his garments, he went to seek out Pincai and Yuanmao for a chat. Yet he found their quarters perfectly silent, the door closed fast. The servant boy Hu'er approached and said, \\"After Young Master went out, the private secretary was invited away and will not return tonight. Masters Li and Wei departed right"},{"paragraph":2,"mentions":4,"tokens":["元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「他们往那里去了？这时候还不回家。」说罢就往里头去了。却说聘才、元茂因子玉出了门，便觉纳闷。元茂自初六那一天，见了些标致相公，心上很想作乐，一来为他父亲拘管，二来手内无钱，不能随心所欲，即对聘才道：「今日你也该请我看本戏。」聘才道：「我若有钱，怕不请你，还等你说？」元茂便皱着眉，拢着袖子闲踱，踱了一会道：「我们两人听","en":"still be out at this hour!\\" Ziyu said, turning back inside. Now, once Ziyu had left the house earlier, Pincai and Yuanmao found themselves quite bored. Ever since the sixth day of the month when Yuanmao laid eyes upon those beautiful performers, his heart had been set on merrymaking. However, his father kept him under strict discipline, and his own pockets were empty, leaving"},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":8,"tokens":["元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「当了就没有穿的。」元茂道：「到账房去借，你与那管帐的倒很相好。」聘才道：「好意思？才来了几天。为着听戏去借钱，也叫人瞧不起。」元茂道：「那就难了，当又不当，借又不借，只好拉倒，我是没有方法想。」聘才道：「你倒有方法，你有银子不肯使。」元茂道：「我有银子？在路上就短了，到京","en":"\\"If I pawn them, I shall have nothing to wear,\\" Pincai replied. Yuanmao urged, \\"Then borrow from the accounts room! You are quite friendly with the bookkeeper.\\" Pincai shook his head. \\"How could I show my face? We have only just arrived a few days ago. To borrow money just to watch operas would make us laughingstocks.\\" Yuanmao"},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":4,"tokens":["元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"将到戏园，元茂道：「我们听什么班子呢？」聘才道：「自然联锦班了。」到墙上去看报子，联锦班在太和园，聘才是去年闲逛熟的了，一径同元茂进了戏园。聘才走的快，元茂见那戏园门口。摆着些五花云彩，又有老虎，又有些花架子，花花绿绿的。只管往前观看，信着脚步走，不防总径路口，横","en":"As they approached, Yuanmao asked, \\"Which troupe shall we patronize?\\" Pincai answered without hesitation, \\"The Lianjin Troupe, naturally.\\" Checking the playbills on the wall, they confirmed the Lianjin Troupe was performing at the Taihe Garden. Having frequented the area the previous"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":2,"tokens":["元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"元茂不好意思，谢了一声，进去觅着聘才，在楼上坐了一张小桌子。已开过台，做了两出，此刻唱的是《拾金》。元茂见不是小旦戏，便不看，他左顾右盼，四下里闲望，非但琴官等不见，连叶茂林也不在台上。","en":"Deeply embarrassed, Yuanmao muttered his thanks and hurried inside to find Pincai. They settled at a small table upstairs. The performance was already underway, with two acts concluded; they were currently staging 'Finding Gold.' Noticing it was not a play featuring young female"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":7,"tokens":["元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"正无精打采的坐着，忽见一人走来，对着他点点头，元茂颇觉面善，一时想不起来。那人便走到聘才背后拍一拍肩，说声：「高兴」！聘才回头见是张仲雨，便满面堆下笑来，连忙让坐。问道：「二哥独自一人来，还有人同来的？」仲雨道：「我那里有工夫听戏？清早到锦春园华公府走了一走，出来又到怡园徐二爷处商量件事，遂同起盛银","en":"As he sat there listlessly, a man approached and nodded in his direction. Yuanmao found the face familiar but could not immediately place him. The man stepped behind Pincai, patted him on the shoulder, and said, \\"In high spirits, I see!\\" Pincai turned, his face instantly lighting up with a wide smile as he hastily offered his seat."},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":1,"tokens":["元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「他叫什么？」仲雨未及回答，那相公急应道：「我叫二喜。」就问：「你能贵姓？」聘才与他说了。又问元茂道：「前日你在苏州会馆听戏，你和孙大少爷说话，你们相好有交情么？」","en":"is Erxi.\\" He then turned to Pincai, \\"And your honorable surname?\\" Pincai provided his name. Erxi then addressed Yuanmao, \\"The other day at the Suzhou Guild Hall, you were conversing with Young Master Sun. Are the two of you well acquainted?\\""},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":6,"tokens":["元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"元茂想道：「这个相公很多情，见了我他就记在心里，这也难得的，便含着两个黄眼珠，细细的睃着他。二喜索性过来，与他一凳坐了，问道：「你能常听戏，你喜欢那一家的戏？」元茂便支吾了两句。二喜把元茂的短烟袋装好了烟，吸着了送过来，元茂甚是得意，那两只眼，愈觉水汪汪","en":"Yuanmao thought to himself, \\"This performer is exceedingly attentive. To remember me after a single meeting is rare indeed.\\" And so, with his amber eyes fixed intently upon the young man, he observed him closely. Erxi unabashedly shifted closer, sharing the"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":2,"tokens":["李元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"两个黑相公，夹着个怯老斗，把个李元茂左顾右盼，应接不暇。保珠、二喜抢装烟，抢倒茶，一个挨紧了膀子，一个挤紧了腿。李元茂得意洋洋，乐得心花大放。","en":"and pour his tea. One pressed warmly against his shoulder, while the other squeezed intimately against his leg. Li Yuanmao was in seventh heaven, his heart blossoming with absolute delight."},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":1,"tokens":["元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，同着前日唱《题曲》的那个小旦，陪着两个华冠丽服的人。不多一会，那两人带着他们走了，聘才好不扫兴。只听得二喜问元茂道：","en":"taking the performers with them. Pincai felt a profound sense of disappointment. Just then, he heard Erxi ask Yuanmao:"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":6,"tokens":["元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「今日在什么地方？」元茂不懂，只把头点。又听得保珠问道：「今日咱们上那个馆子，我伺候你罢。」元茂支吾，说不出来。二喜又道：「今天才开了两三家，若去迟了，恐怕没有坐儿。」元茂心里想道：「这两个却都好，看这光景，两个都要去的，但恐所带的银子不够。」又想道：「两人给他十二吊钱，吃","en":"\\"Where shall we go today?\\" Unsure of what was being asked, Yuanmao simply nodded. Then Baozhu chimed in, \\"Which restaurant shall we visit today? Allow me to wait upon you.\\" Yuanmao stammered, unable to form a coherent reply. Erxi pressed, \\"Only two or three establishments have opened today. If we delay, there may not"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":8,"tokens":["元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"馆子，掌柜的都站了起来，叫声」张老爷，新年好！升官发财。」又作了个揖，仲雨也应酬了几句。拣了个雅座，仲雨首坐，元茂第二，聘才第三，二喜、保珠一凳坐了。走堂的送了茶，便请点菜。仲雨让元茂、聘才，二人又推仲雨先点，仲雨要的是瓦块鱼，烩鸭腰，聘才要的是炸肫、火腿。保殊要的是白蛤豆腐、炒虾仁。二喜要的是炒鱼片、卤牲口、黄焖肉。元茂道：「我喜欢吃鸡，我就是鸡罢。」走堂的及","en":"few polite pleasantries in return. They selected an elegant private room, with Zhongyu taking the seat of honor, Yuanmao the second, and Pincai the third. Erxi and Baozhu squeezed onto a single stool together. A waiter served tea and presented the menu. Zhongyu offered the choice to Yuanmao and Pincai, who deferred back to him. Zhongyu ordered tile-shaped fish and braised"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":2,"tokens":["元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"没有来，请什么？」主人家就走过来，拿着杯子一瞧，道：「原来这杯酒是干巴巴的，你就这么饮了罢。」二喜就拿杯子送到元茂嘴边，元茂乐极，一饮就干。仲雨、聘才齐声说「好」！保珠道：「这个笑话实在说得有趣。」便也斟了一杯酒，送到聘才嘴边，叫道：「干爸爸饮这杯。」聘才也喜欢，干了。","en":"seems this wine is utterly bone-dry. You had best drink it just as it is.'\\" With that, Erxi raised his own cup to Yuanmao's lips. Overjoyed, Yuanmao drained it in a single gulp. Zhongyu and Pincai erupted in cheers of \\"Bravo!\\" Baozhu added, \\"That joke was truly delightful.\\" He then poured a cup of wine, brought it to Pincai's lips, and called out affectionately, \\"Godfather,"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":4,"tokens":["元茂","李元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"豁第三杯又是元茂赢了。二喜便含着一口酒，双手捧了元茂的脸，口对口的灌下。元茂心里快活，脸上害躁，已咽了半口，忽低着头一笑，这口酒就从鼻孔里倒冲出来，绝像撒出两条黄溺，淋淋漓漓，标了一桌。李元茂的脑门子，又痒又辣，便伏在二喜肩上抬不起头。保珠笑得坐不牢，已塌下凳子，坐","en":"The third round saw Yuanmao victorious. Erxi took a mouthful of wine, cradled Yuanmao's face in both hands, and delivered the wine mouth-to-mouth. Yuanmao was in raptures, though his face flushed with embarrassment. Just as he swallowed half the mouthful, he suddenly lowered his"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":2,"tokens":["元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"二喜带笑拍着元茂的胸，元茂才抬起了头，闭了眼，张开口，鼻孔里还觉痒的，打了几个嚏喷，停了多时，方才说道：「有什么好笑？」众人见他这光景，又笑了一会，吃了几样菜。","en":"Laughing, Erxi patted Yuanmao's chest until he finally raised his head. His eyes closed, his mouth agape, his nostrils still tickling, he let out several loud sneezes. After a long pause, he finally asked, \\"What is so funny?\\" Seeing his bewildered state, the others broke into fresh"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":7,"tokens":["元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"二喜便斟了酒与张仲雨豁了一拳。仲雨输了，元茂便催仲雨唱。仲雨道：「这不难。」饮了一杯酒，唱了个《马头调》，大家却赞声」好」。第二杯又系仲雨输了，要说笑话。仲雨抬头，见屋子里钉着一个小神龛，供一张赵玄坛骑个黑虎，即对二喜道：「你们见了有钱的老斗，便喜欢道：「财神爷到了，肯花钱。」穷老斗见了黑相公","en":"Erxi then poured wine and engaged Zhang Zhongyu in a round. Zhongyu lost, and Yuanmao eagerly demanded a song. \\"That is simple enough,\\" Zhongyu replied. He downed a cup of wine and sang a verse of the 'Horse-Head Tune,' drawing cheers of approval from the group. Zhongyu lost the second round as well, requiring a joke. Glancing up, he"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":1,"tokens":["元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"元茂便如醍醐灌顶，乐不可言。大家听他喉咙里头咭咯咭咯的，咽了三咽。二喜又斟了酒，轮到聘才了。第一拳是二喜输了，唱了一枝《九连环》。","en":"Yuanmao felt as though heavenly nectar was being poured over his crown; his joy was beyond words. The others listened as he audibly gulped three distinct times. Erxi poured more wine, and it was Pincai's turn. Erxi lost the first round and sang a verse of the"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":5,"tokens":["元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"。」嫂子道：「本来有个名儿，叫磨镜子。」姑娘道：「不像，镜子是圆的，还是叫他敬皮杯罢」这一阵笑，却也笑得可听，元茂笑出眼泪来，骂道：「你这个恶人，明日就要变哑叭子。「笑得保珠滚在聘才怀里，二喜便过来，把聘才打了一下，道：「那里有这样坏人，骂人骂入骨的。」第三杯偏偏又是二喜输了，二喜拿着酒道：「怎样唱？你吩咐。」聘才即板起脸来道：「你听了张老爷的话，不听我的话，你","en":"just call it offering a skin-cup instead!'\\" This joke provoked roars of laughter. Tears streaming from his eyes, Yuanmao scolded, \\"You wicked man! You will surely be struck dumb by tomorrow!\\" Baozhu laughed until he collapsed into Pincai's lap. Erxi marched over and slapped Pincai lightly on the arm. \\"Is there anyone more wicked than you? Your insults cut straight to the"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":1,"tokens":["元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"进来，口中说道：「我的二老爷！你在这里，我走了七八个戏园子，那一处不寻到？」二喜、保珠见了和尚都请了安，聘才、元茂也站起来招呼。和尚都作了揖，与仲雨一凳坐了。聘才看那和尚相貌，是个紫糖色方脸，两撇浓须，有四十来岁，戴个绒僧帽，穿件宝蓝绸狐皮僧袍，腰拴黄丝绦，足下挖云青缎毛儿窝，也没有出家人的光景，定是酒肉和尚。","en":"theaters looking for you!\\" Seeing the monk, Erxi and Baozhu both offered respectful greetings, while Pincai and Yuanmao rose to acknowledge him. The monk returned their bows and took a seat beside Zhongyu. Pincai appraised the newcomer: a square face the color of dark sugar, two thick mustaches, perhaps forty years of age. He wore a velvet monk's cap and a sapphire-blue"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":1,"tokens":["元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"但看他倒也和颜悦色，很会张罗。当下即问了聘才、元茂姓名寓处，便对仲雨道：「二老爷，明日事完了，不是姑苏会馆，就是天庆堂，再约上你这两位令友，与这两位相公，咱们高高兴兴乐一天。今日实在不好耽搁，那边人已到齐了，就候你去成事。」仲雨道：「不用忙，你也吃一钟，咱们就走。」那和尚将胡子抹了一抹，嘻着嘴吃了一","en":"Yet, his demeanor was remarkably pleasant and accommodating. After inquiring after Pincai and Yuanmao's names and lodgings, he turned to Zhongyu. \\"Second Master, when tomorrow's affairs are concluded, we shall gather at either the Suzhou Guild Hall or the Tianqing Hall. Bring your two esteemed friends and these two young performers, and we shall enjoy"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":1,"tokens":["元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"与奶奶一样。」唐和尚一手就伸到二喜脸上来。二喜笑道：「我说和奶奶的模样长得一样，没有说错呀。」唐和尚见有聘才、元茂在坐，便也假装斯文，缩回手来，说道：「你们糟蹋佛门弟子，是有罪过的。」仲雨、聘才大笑。唐和尚又催仲雨起身，仲雨道：「再略坐片时也不妨。」二喜见壁上挂着一个葫芦，指着问唐和尚道：「这个像什么？」唐和尚笑道：「这个像你的嘴。」二喜道：「不通，不通！怎么说","en":"pinch Erxi's cheek. Erxi dodged, laughing, \\"I only said he looks like a wife, I wasn't wrong!\\" Noting Pincai and Yuanmao's presence, the monk feigned scholarly dignity, withdrawing his hand. \\"To mock a disciple of the Buddha is a grave sin,\\" he chided. Zhongyu and Pincai burst into laughter. Tang again urged Zhongyu to leave. \\"A brief delay will do no harm,\\" Zhongyu replied."},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":11,"tokens":["元茂","李元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"聘才、元茂又与保珠豁了一轮拳，保珠也敬了两次皮杯。，二喜又要了几样莱，重又闹了好一回，已点了半枝蜡烛。约有定更后了。两个相公都也困乏，两个跟兔在风门口站着。李元茂不知颠倒，饮汤饮酒，除下帽子，头上热气腾腾，如蒸笼一般。聘才道：「咱们也好散了。」轻轻的凑着元茂耳","en":"Pincai and Yuanmao played another round of games with Baozhu, who offered two more skin-cups. Erxi ordered several more dishes, and the revelry continued for some time, well past the lighting of the candles, deep into the first watch of the night. The two performers were"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":7,"tokens":["元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"二喜走出来道：「你们在院子里商量些什么？」二人重又进屋，坐下。二喜便说：「天不早了。」又到元茂耳边一凑道：「你到我家里去，我伺候你。」元茂听了这句，心里又喜又急，脸上发起烧来，只顾看着聘才发怔。保珠、二喜猜不出什么意思。聘才只得对元茂道：「丢了这包银子，如今怎样呢？」元茂道：「原是还有些东西在内，一齐偷去了。」保珠道：「什么？」元茂道：「银子","en":"here?\\" They returned inside and took their seats. \\"It is growing late,\\" Erxi noted. He leaned intimately into Yuanmao's ear and whispered, \\"Come back to my place; I will take good care of you.\\" Hearing this, Yuanmao felt a surge of joy mixed with intense panic, his face burning hot. He could only stare blankly at Pincai. Baozhu and Erxi were utterly bewildered by his"},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":10,"tokens":["元茂","李元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"求你能那里转一转手，省得我们为难。」即对二喜道：「喜哥，可不是这样么？」元茂道：「与你们说，你们不信。我今日是带着八块银子，足有十两多。也没有包，装在一个搭链袋里，他倒连袋子都拿去了。此时要我们别处去借，那里去借？不是个难题目难人。」二喜鼻子里哼了一声道：「此时尚早，你何不叫你们二爷回去取了来，咱们在这里坐一坐就得了。」说罢","en":"you find some way to spare us this hardship,\\" Baozhu pleaded. He turned to Erxi, \\"Brother Xi, is that not fair?\\" Yuanmao insisted, \\"I am telling you the truth, yet you refuse to believe me! I had eight pieces of silver today, well over ten taels, loose in a pouch, and the thief took the pouch and all. To ask us to borrow money at this hour—where would we even go? You are"},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":5,"tokens":["元茂","李元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这边走堂的进来，一样样的报了帐，连内外共五十六吊七百八十文。元茂一听，伸了伸舌头道：「这个打几折儿。」走堂的道：「实折不扣。」李元茂便掐着指头一算道：「十折是五千六百七十八个京钱，二千八百三十九个老官板儿，公道得很，以后倒要常来照顾你家。」走堂的笑道：「我们的帐是不打折头的，五十六吊七百八十个京钱。」元茂道：「怎","en":"including the staff gratuity, totaled fifty-six strings and seven hundred eighty copper cash. Hearing the sum, Yuanmao stuck out his tongue in shock. \\"What discount can you offer?\\" he asked. \\"Full price, sir. No discounts,\\" the waiter replied crisply. Counting on his fingers, Li Yuanmao calculated, \\"At a strict exchange rate, that is five thousand six hundred seventy-eight"}],"9":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":4,"tokens":["李元茂","元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说魏聘才、李元茂回家时已三更，梅宅关了门落了锁，四儿敲了半天，才有人来开了。两人走到房中，聘才免不得将不小心丢银子的话，抱怨了元茂两句。元茂无言可答，各自安睡。到了次日，只得央了许顺，借了十吊钱的票子，分作两张，写了一封字，叫四儿送与叶茂林，分给二喜、保珠。后来子玉","en":"When Wei Pincai and Li Yuanmao arrived home, it was past the third night-watch. The Mei household had already barred and bolted its gates. Si'er knocked for a long while before anyone came to open them. The two entered their rooms, and Pincai could not help voicing a few reproaches"},{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"过了两日，已是元宵佳节，李性全带着元茂，到会馆中吃年酒去了，聘才出去逛灯未回。子玉一人正在无聊，恰好梅进进来说道：「刘少爷、颜少爷、王少爷，请少爷出去逛灯，都在门口等着。」子玉禀过父母，梅进即叫套了车，云儿跟着出来。仲清等却在车里等着，见子玉出来便下了车。刘文泽道：「如此良宵，千金一刻，","en":"Two days later came the Lantern Festival. Li Xingquan took Yuanmao to a New Year banquet at the guild hall, while Pincai had gone out to view the lanterns and had not yet returned. Ziyu sat alone with nothing to do when Mei Jin came in and announced: \\"Young Master Liu, Young Master Yan, and Young Master Wang invite"}],"10":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["李元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"上见了子玉，便认得是梦中救他出陷坑的人，时时刻刻放在心上。又姑苏会馆唱戏那一日，见他同了一班公子，还有魏聘才、李元茂在座，问起叶茂林，始知这位公子就姓梅，已应了梅花树下之兆。从此，一缕幽情如沾泥柳絮，已被缠住。","en":"opera at the Suzhou Guild Hall, seeing Ziyu seated among a company of young gentlemen that included Wei Pincai and Li Yuanmao, he asked Ye Maolin and learned that this young master's surname was indeed Mei, fulfilling the omen beneath the plum tree. From that moment, a thread of tender feeling, like willow catkins clinging to the mud, had hopelessly entangled his heart."}],"15":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["李元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"张罗盘缠，魏聘才替他拉了一纤。托张仲雨问西客借了一票银子，占了些空头，有二百余金，添补些衣服，也叫了几天相公。李元茂要在京寄籍，性全也只得由他。","en":"hundred taels. With this, Master Li supplemented his clothing and also hired young protégés for several days. Li Yuanmao wished to register his household registration in the capital; Xingquan had no choice but to let him do as he wished."},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":5,"tokens":["元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"了江西学差，报喜的现在门口。」子玉听了也觉喜欢，便同着梅进到里头报与颜夫人知道，颜夫人欣喜更不必说。李性全就同元茂、聘才到上头去道了喜。少顷，士燮回家，有些同僚亲友陆续而来，一连忙了几日。便接着李先生赴任日期，士燮又与先生饯行。到动身那一日，子玉同了元茂、聘才直送出城外三十五里，到宿店住下。性全嘱咐他一番，又教训了元茂几句道：「庾香年纪虽小于你，学问却做得你的先","en":"went with Mei Jin inside to report it to Lady Yan, whose delight goes without saying. Li Xingquan, together with Yuanmao and Pincai, went upstairs to offer their congratulations. Before long, Shixie returned home; colleagues and relatives and friends came calling one after another, and they were kept busy for several days on end. Then came the date of departure for Master"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":5,"tokens":["元茂","李元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"彩盒礼帖，请亮功来，送了过去。文辉处回礼丰盛，有颜仲清帮同亮功押了回来，士燮备酒相待。是日不请外客，就请聘才、元茂相陪。这李元茂今日福至心灵，说话竟清楚起来。性全出京时留下二百两银子与他，元茂买了几件衣裳，混身光亮。亮功眼力本是平常，今见了元茂团头大脸，书气满容，便许为佳士，大有余润之意，便问起他的姻事来。仲清早已看明，便竭力赞扬。李元茂不知就里，乐得了不得，心","en":"bring them back, and Shixie hosted a wine reception. That day no outside guests were invited; only Pincai and Yuanmao were asked to keep the company. This Li Yuanmao had, at this auspicious moment, achieved a sudden clarity of mind — his speech became quite articulate. When Xingquan left the capital, he had left two hundred taels of silver for Yuanmao; Yuanmao purchased"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":6,"tokens":["元茂","李元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"却说孙亮功回去与陆夫人商量，要将大女儿许与元茂，陆夫人冷笑了几声，不发一言，亮功不敢再说。然主意已定，明日去托王文辉为媒，文辉踌躇了半天，心里想道：「这个白人儿，怎好嫁人？」因又想道：「那李元茂，也不是个佳婿，呆头呆脑的，那一天作个揖，就将我的帽子碰歪，只好娶这样媳妇。」便应允了。为这件事，特到","en":"of Sun Lianggong, who returned home and discussed with Madam Lu the idea of betrothing his eldest daughter to Yuanmao. Madam Lu laughed coldly several times without saying a word; Lianggong did not dare press her further. Nevertheless, his mind was made up, and the next day he went to ask Wang Wenhui to act as matchmaker. Wenhui hesitated at length, thinking to himself:"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":3,"tokens":["元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"学士行李一切早已收拾停妥，已于初九日打发家人押了出城。是日亲友拥挤不开，时候尚早，仲清、王恂先在书房，与子玉、元茂等等候。仲清便对元茂道了喜，道：「恭喜，恭喜！你今日真得了一个雪美人。你从前不是有句诗是「白人双目近」么？如今倒成了诗谶了。」元茂不解，颇自得意。","en":"friends crowded the house. As it was still early, Zhongqing and Wang Xun waited first in the study with Ziyu, Yuanmao, and the others. Zhongqing offered Yuanmao his congratulations, saying: \\"Congratulations, congratulations! Today you have truly obtained a 'snow beauty.' Did you not once write a line of poetry declaring, \\"The white one's eyes draw near\\"? Now it has"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":3,"tokens":["元茂","李元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"少顷，士燮送了客出去，便叫出子玉来，教训了一番。又叮嘱了元茂、聘才几句。然后与夫人别了，即上车起程，颜仲清、王恂、魏聘才、李元茂一起随后，颜夫人领着子玉，并有些仆妇丫鬟一群的车，也送出城来。城外是王文辉、孙亮功等十几个同年至好，一齐在旗亭饯别。士燮盘桓了一会，文辉等进城。天色不早，颜夫人也只得带了仆妇丫鬟洒泪","en":"other guests and called Ziyu out to deliver a thorough admonition. He then also gave a few words of instruction to Yuanmao and Pincai. After that he bade farewell to Lady Yan, mounted his carriage, and departed. Yan Zhongqing, Wang Xun, Wei Pincai, and Li Yuanmao followed close behind. Lady Yan, leading Ziyu and a group of female servants and maids, also accompanied him"}],"16":[{"paragraph":4,"mentions":2,"tokens":["李元茂","元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"却说魏聘才其人在不粗不细之间，西流东列，风雅丛中，究非知已；\\n繁华门下，尽可帮闲。目下与李元茂同住梅宅，一无所事，唯有出外闲游。而元茂又另是一种呆头呆脑的脾气，与之长处，实属可厌。聘才思量道：「我进京来本欲图些名利，今在京数月，一事无成。且梅老伯又到江西去了，要两三年才回，王老伯终是大模大样，绝无一点关切心肠。长安虽好，非久恋之乡，不如自己弄","en":"serving rather as a willing companion-for-hire in wealthy households. Currently residing at the Mei mansion with Li Yuanmao, he had no real duties and spent his days wandering about idly. Furthermore, Yuanmao possessed a rather dull and obtuse temperament, making his constant company truly tiresome. Pincai thought to himself: \\"I came to the capital seeking fame and profit,"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":1,"tokens":["李元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"隔一城，原可时常来的，棣台若不忘怀，华府园亭，闻说是极好逛的。伯母前请棣台先为禀明，明日起身时，再进去叩谢。」李元茂在旁，闻得聘才要进华府，心中有些难过，道：「你去了只剩了我，且你也少了个伴儿。我闻得华公子脾气不好，你倒不要去吃钉板，还是在此罢，过年再说。」聘才道：「各人有各人的打算，我如今比不上你了。你是知县少爷，享现成的福，我不但自己不能受用，还要顾家呢！」子","en":"explain this to your mother on my behalf; before I depart tomorrow, I will pay my respects and take my leave.\\" Li Yuanmao, standing nearby, felt a pang of sadness upon hearing Pincai was bound for the Hua household. \\"If you leave, I will be here alone, and you will lose a companion. I have heard Young Master Hua has a difficult temper; you had better not go and invite trouble."},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":1,"tokens":["元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"是晚即命子玉与聘才饯行，又送出四十两银子与聘才，聘才感激不尽。一夜与元茂谈谈讲讲，各有难分之意。","en":"farewell dinner for Pincai, presenting him with forty taels of silver. Pincai was overwhelmed with gratitude. He and Yuanmao talked late into the night, both reluctant to part ways."},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":1,"tokens":["元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"明早富三爷即遣人带了两辆车来接聘才，聘才即拜别颜夫人并子玉，又辞了元茂，收拾停妥，带了四儿一径上车。先到富宅略叙片时，富三亲送到华府。到了门口，富三先着人回进去，并说魏师爷来了。聘才在车内一望这门面，就觉威严得了不得，就是南京总督衙门，也无此高大。门前一座大照墙，用水磨砖砌成，上下镂花，并有花檐滴水，上盖琉璃瓦，约有三","en":"next morning, Fu the Third sent two carriages to collect Pincai. After bidding farewell to Lady Yan, Ziyu, and Yuanmao, Pincai gathered his belongings, brought Si'er along, and boarded the carriage. They first stopped at the Fu residence for a brief visit before Fu the Third personally escorted him to the Hua mansion. At the gate, a messenger was sent ahead to announce"}],"18":[{"paragraph":7,"mentions":1,"tokens":["李元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"去见子玉，卧病未愈，精神懒散。子玉问起聘才光景，聘才只得说好，随口撒了几句谎。又去见了颜夫人，道了谢，即出来找李元茂，只见锁了房门，遂复辞了子玉出门，冷冷清清，到何处去呢？","en":"rattling off a few easy lies. He then went to pay his respects to Lady Yan and express his thanks. Coming out to find Li Yuanmao, he discovered his door locked. He took his leave of Ziyu again and went out, feeling lonely and desolate with nowhere to go."},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":1,"tokens":["李元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"两天实也劳乏了，要去就去。」于是二人同了出来，到了戏园拣个地方坐下。看了两三出戏，也有些相公陪着说话。远远望见李元茂同着孙嗣徽，在对面楼下。聘才过去，讲了几句话，又过来。","en":"protégés came by to chat with them. Across the way, on the lower level of the opposite gallery, Pincai spotted Li Yuanmao together with Sun Sihui. Pincai went over, exchanged a few words, and came back."},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":4,"tokens":["元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"了出来，说道：「老弟，你进城罢。我还有事，不得奉陪。」说罢，拱拱手去了。其时天气尚早，一路行来，远远望见嗣徽、元茂两人在前转弯去了。聘才想道：「他们到何处去？」便悄悄的跟了来。到一条小胡衕，只见闲人塞满，都在人家门口瞧。聘才曾听得人说，有个东园是婊子聚会之处，便也随着众人，站住望将进去。见那一家是茅茨土墙，里头有两间草屋。又见嗣徽、元茂就在他前头站立。望着两个妇","en":"company.\\" With that, he bowed and departed. It was still early. As Pincai walked along the way, he spotted Sihui and Yuanmao in the distance, just rounding a corner ahead. Pincai thought: \\"Where are they going?\\" and quietly followed. He entered a small alleyway packed with idle onlookers, all crowded at someone's doorway peering in. Pincai had heard people say that the East"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":7,"tokens":["元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"元茂系近视眼，索性挤进去门里呆看。聘才见那妇人，一面弹，一面唱道：杨柳枝、杨柳枝，昔年宫里斗腰肢。如今弃向道旁种，翠结双眉怨路岐。画船何处系，骏马向风嘶。盼不到东君二月陌头来，只做了秋林憔悴西风里。又见他把弦紧了一紧，和了一和，便高了一调了，再唱道：想当","en":"Yuanmao, being shortsighted, pushed straight through into the doorway and stood there staring. Pincai watched the woman play and sing:\\n\\n\\"The willow branch, the willow branch,\\nIn years past, within the palace, we vied in slender waists.\\nNow cast aside to grow"}],"21":[{"paragraph":4,"mentions":1,"tokens":["元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，何妨常常的叫他，彼此畅叙，自然就不生病了。何必又闷在心里，又不是闺阁千金，不能看见的。」便辞了子玉，也不去找元茂，略到账房门房应酬应酬就出来，一直到樱桃巷琴言寓里来。","en":"then neither would ail — why bottle it — he is no boudoir maiden barred from sight.\\" Taking leave he did not seek Yuanmao but exchanged brief civilities at accounts and gate offices, then went straight to Cherry Lane and Qinyan's lodging."}],"22":[{"paragraph":20,"mentions":3,"tokens":["李元茂","元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"们送他的零碎东西，捡了几样出来，又捡了两匹江绸，两匹湖绸，带了十几两碎银子。自己收拾好了，再欲到上房告禀，只见李元茂披着件短衫，赤了脚，慌慌张张进来道：「我今日特意早起，想不到你已经早起来了。」子玉道：「我今日出门有事，所以略早了些。」元茂道：「我有句话商量。」子玉正要问时，只见云儿进来道：「徐老爷打发人来请，说客业已到齐了，就请少爷过去。」子玉也不及再问元茂，连","en":"taels of loose silver. He had just put all in order and was about to go to the upper rooms to take his leave when Li Yuanmao, a short jacket thrown over his shoulders and his feet bare, came bustling in all in a flurry: \\"I made a point of rising early today — who'd have thought you would be up earlier still!\\" Ziyu said: \\"I have business abroad today, so I am somewhat early.\\""},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":6,"tokens":["李元茂","元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"正要出来，李元茂忽又前来拦住道：「你且慢走，我有一件要紧的事，必要商量。」子玉着急道：「有什么事，快说罢！」元茂擦擦眼睛，打了一个呵欠，吞吞吐吐的说不出来。子玉道：「怎样？有话剪绝快说。有人在门口候我，你快说罢。」元茂道：「谁候着你？这么忙，今日还早得很呢。你听那个","en":"He was on the very point of leaving when Li Yuanmao once more planted himself in the way: \\"Not so fast! I have a pressing matter that must be talked over.\\" Ziyu said impatiently: \\"What is it then? Out with it!\\" Yuanmao rubbed his eyes, gave a yawn, and hemmed and hawed without bringing anything out. Ziyu"}],"23":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":4,"tokens":["李元茂","元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说子玉逛运河这一天，李元茂向子玉借钱。少顷账房送出八吊大钱，李元茂到手，心花尽开。又想道：「这些钱身上难带，不如票子便当。」便叫跟他小使王保，拿了五吊大钱放在胡衕口烟钱铺内，换了十张票子，元茂一张张的点清了装在槟榔口袋里，挂在衫子衿上。候不到吃饭，即带了王保出门，去找他阿舅孙","en":"On the very day Ziyu set out to tour the canal, Li Yuanmao came to borrow money from him. Shortly after, the accounts room brought out eight strings of large cash; upon receiving them, Yuanmao felt his heart blossom with unrestrained joy. Yet he thought to himself, \\"This heavy cash is cumbersome to carry on"},{"paragraph":2,"mentions":8,"tokens":["元茂","李元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"好些人。随意看了两三处，也有坐着两三人的，也有三五人的，村村俏俏，作张作致，看了又看，只不见从前那个弹琵琶的。元茂的眼力本不济事，也分不出好歹来，却想到里头看看；又因人多，且是第一次，心中也不得主意，不敢进去。再望到一个门口，却只有两人，走到门边，见有一个汉子，从屋子里低下头出来，一直出门去了。元茂心却痒痒的，只管把身子挨近了门，一只脚踏在门坎上，望着一个三十来","en":"airs and striking poses. He looked and looked again, but nowhere could he find the woman who had played the pipa. Yuanmao's judgment in such matters was naturally lacking, unable to distinguish the exquisite from the vulgar, yet he yearned to venture inside for a closer look. However, intimidated by the crowds and being a complete novice, his mind wavered, and he dared"},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":8,"tokens":["李元茂","元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"李元茂咕噜了一句，那人听不清楚，又道：「你若爱进去，你只管大大方方的进去，咱们都是朋友，我替你守着门，包管没有人来。你出来请我喝四两，吃碗烂肉面就是你的交情。没有也不要紧。顽笑罢了，算什么事。」说着哈哈大笑起来。那一个穿着一件蓝布衫子也道：「面皮太嫩，怕什","en":"Li Yuanmao muttered something unintelligible. The man, not hearing him clearly, continued: \\"If you wish to go in, just walk in boldly. We are all friends here; I will guard the door for you, and I guarantee no one will come. When you come out, treat me to four"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":1,"tokens":["李元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这李元茂即放大了胆，掀起帘子进内，觉得有些气味熏人。见那妇人坐在炕上，一条席子，一个红枕头，旁边一张长凳。","en":"His courage now bolstered, Li Yuanmao lifted the curtain and stepped inside, instantly feeling assaulted by a pungent, overwhelming odor. He saw the woman sitting upon the heated brick kang. On it lay a simple straw mat and a red pillow, with a long wooden bench placed beside it."},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":8,"tokens":["元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"元茂就心里迷迷糊糊的，在凳上坐了。那妇人从炕炉上一个砂壶内，倒了一钟半温的茶，给元茂吃了，嘻嘻笑着。即拿出一个木盆子，放在炕后墙洞内。那边有人接了，盛了半盆水，仍旧放在洞里。那妇人取下盆子来，蹲下身子，退下后面小衣，一手往下捞了两捞。元茂听得哐浪哐浪的水","en":"In a daze, Yuanmao sat down upon the bench. From a clay pot on the kang stove, the woman poured a cup of lukewarm tea and handed it to him with a giggling laugh. She then pulled out a wooden basin from a hollow in the wall behind the kang. Someone on the other side took"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":6,"tokens":["李元茂","元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这边李元茂，唬得魂飞魄散，忙把裤子掖好，将要穿衣，帘子外打得落花流水，便有些人拥进来看，一挤把帘子已掉下地了。元茂此时急得无处躲避，炕底下是躲不进的，墙洞里是钻不过去的，急得上天无路，入地无门。越嚷越近，仔细一看，就是先前那两个，见那穿蓝布衫的像是打输了，逃进","en":"Left behind, Li Yuanmao was frightened out of his wits. He hurriedly tucked in his trousers and was just about to put on his clothes when a violent brawl erupted outside the curtain, sounding like falling blossoms and flowing water. A crowd of people surged in to watch, squeezing"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":7,"tokens":["元茂","李元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，全没有影儿，引得外面的人，一起一起的看，说的说，笑的笑，有的道：「乱了套儿了。」有的道：「这是好嫖的报应。」元茂无可奈何，只得将草帘子裹着下身，蹲在屋子里，高声喊那王保。原来王保只得十三四岁，见元茂进去，明白是那件事，便跑开顽耍去了。及到望得那两人打进来，知道不好，却不敢上前，便唬得躲在一棵树后啼哭。此时见人散了，又听得主人叫喊，即忙走进，见了元茂光景，便又呆","en":"and laughing. Some said, \\"What a chaotic mess!\\" Others said, \\"This is the retribution for whoring.\\" Helpless, Yuanmao could only wrap the fallen straw curtain around his lower half, squat in the room, and shout loudly for Wang Bao. It turned out that Wang Bao, being only thirteen or fourteen, had understood what was happening when Yuanmao went inside and had run off"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":4,"tokens":["李元茂","元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"原来这两人与那媳妇本是一路的，那些地方向来没有好人来往，所来者皆系赶车的、挑煤的等类。今见李元茂呆头呆脑，是个外行，又见他一身新鲜衣服，猜他身边有些银两、钱票等物，果然叫他们看中了，得了些彩头。元茂受了这场荼毒，却又告诉不得人，无处伸冤。那时出出进进看的人，竟有认得元茂的在内，知系住在梅宅，又系孙部郎未过门的女婿，慢慢的传说开来。过后元茂因王保","en":"were never frequented by decent folk; the patrons were usually cart drivers, coal porters, and the like. Seeing Li Yuanmao's foolish, absent-minded demeanor and obvious inexperience, combined with his fresh, expensive clothes, they guessed he carried silver and notes, and indeed targeted him for a lucrative swindle. Having suffered this torment, Yuanmao could not tell a"}],"24":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":4,"tokens":["李元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"丢了一个金镯。」王恂笑道：「媚香原是个顶尖利的人，就是湘帆能服他。这潘银匠自然要上当的。」仲清道：「还听得那个李元茂，在东园闹了一个大笑话。」王恂道：「怎么样？」仲清道：「有人看见李元茂在土窑子，一个人去嫖，被些土棍打进去，将他剥个干净。李元茂围了草帘子，不能出来，惹得看的人，把那土窑子都挤倒了。后来不知怎样回去的。」王恂道：「有这等事？或是人家糟蹋他，也未可知。","en":"ever tame him. A mere silversmith was destined to be played for a fool.\\" Zhongqing continued, \\"I also heard that Li Yuanmao made a spectacular fool of himself over in the East Garden.\\" When Wang Xun asked how, Zhongqing elaborated, \\"Someone spotted him at a sordid brothel. A gang of local toughs burst in, stripped him bare. Forced to wrap himself in a straw mat, he could"},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":2,"tokens":["李元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"仲清道：「虫蛀千字文」要给他吃碗墨水，才好免得随口胡言。」王恂道：「李元茂吃什么呢？」仲清笑道：「李元茂颟颟顸顸，七窍闭塞，要吃大黄、芒硝，方才打得通他这些浊污。」王恂又问仲雨，仲清答道：「在可善可恶之间，尚识好人，天良未昧。」二人刚说得有趣，忽见李玉林同着桂保来，见过了，遂即坐下，因问道：「这两日不见你们出来，在家作些什","en":"'Thousand-Character Classic' needs to be force-fed a bowl of ink to stop his loose talk.\\" Wang Xun asked what remedy Li Yuanmao should be prescribed. Zhongqing laughed, \\"Yuanmao is so profoundly dull that all seven of his orifices are blocked tight. He needs a heavy dose of rhubarb and mirabilite to purge the muck from his system.\\" Wang Xun then asked about Zhongyu. Zhongqing"}],"28":[{"paragraph":9,"mentions":1,"tokens":["李元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"止此一子，今病到如此，即教训也是无益。万一因这一番教训，再添了病，更难治了，莫若待他好了再说。左思右想，便请进李元茂来，问其底细。","en":"would it do? It was better to wait until he recovered. Pondering the situation from every angle, she summoned Li Yuanmao to uncover the full truth."},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":1,"tokens":["李元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"李元茂道：「小门生没同出去过，琴言不琴言，我也不得而知。我去年听见魏老聘常常赞那琴言，世叔就有些留心。到今年正月初六，会馆团拜那一天，世叔看了琴言的戏回来，又听得他们说好，以后的事，小门生实是没有见闻，要问魏老聘才晓得他们的细底。」颜夫人便叫门上许顺，到华","en":"Yuanmao said, \\"This student has never gone out with him. Whether there is a Qinyan or not, I truly do not know. Last year, I heard old Wei Pincai often praising that Qinyan, and my uncle took notice. On the sixth day of the New Year, at the guild gathering,"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":1,"tokens":["元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"讲了一回，颜夫人道：「子玉得了一个异样的病症。」便把病的光景说与聘才听，又将云儿、元茂的话也说了，便说：「小儿与这琴言到底有什么缘故？」聘才听了便觉得有些踌躇不安，良心发动，脸上露出愧色。停了一会，说道：「去年小侄进京，是搭了一班戏子的船，内中有个小旦叫琴言。今年团拜这一天，却好见着他的戏。后来世兄不知怎样认识的，听说在怡园打灯谜时认","en":"has contracted a strange illness,\\" she said, describing the symptoms and repeating the testimonies of Yun and Yuanmao. She pressed him, \\"What exactly is the bond between my son and this Qinyan?\\" Pincai felt a sudden wave of unease; his conscience pricked, and a guilty flush colored his face. He hesitated before answering, \\"Last year, when this nephew entered the capital,"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":1,"tokens":["元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"聘才与元茂略谈几句，即便出来，一径回华府，到自己房中坐下，细细的想了一回，没有主意。即来找珊枝，把方才颜夫人托他话，都说与珊枝，又加上些话。又说我与这个兄弟是三代世交，且我这梅老伯母，止他一子，人极聪明，相貌生得也极齐整，你只当行好事，怎么成全成全他。倘能医好","en":"Pincai exchanged a few brief words with Yuanmao before departing. He went straight back to the Hua mansion, sat in his room, and pondered deeply, yet no plan came to mind. He sought out Shanzhi, repeated Lady Yan's desperate plea, added his own embellishments, and pleaded, \\"This brother and I are"}],"34":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":2,"tokens":["李元茂","元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说聘才送了富三出门，唐和尚即叫人去请他兄弟。聘才刚进屋子，只见李元茂闯将进来道：「今日才寻着你，店铺里那一家不访到，原来搬在这里。」聘才道：「我也搬出来不多几日，因为有些事情，所以还没有来看你，并看庾香。」即问：「庾香近来可好？」元茂道：「好是好的，前月王家写信与太老师，明年二三月间要替庾香完姻了。就是我那头亲事，孙","en":"Pincai had Monk Tang send someone to invite Tang's younger brother over. Pincai had just stepped back indoors when Li Yuanmao barged in, declaring, \\"I've finally tracked you down today! There isn't an establishment I haven't scoured, only to find you've moved here.\\" Pincai replied, \\"I've only been out of the old place for a few days. Being tangled up with various affairs, I"},{"paragraph":2,"mentions":10,"tokens":["元茂","李元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"起钱，真一个也没有。算起来，今年的钱也花得不少，谁想到今日呢。我又没什么衣服，除了外边挪借，连当都没有当的。」元茂道：「你装什么穷？我借了难道不还你么？此番老人家有信来与我办喜事，至少也有五百两银子。如今你借四十两银子与我，或是一百吊钱，就好过去。不然，我竟死了。好人，好人！你不要作难。」说罢作了两个揖。聘才冷笑道：「这真奇了，你也不去想想，我又不曾做官，我又不","en":"Furthermore, I have scarcely any clothes left; apart from borrowing left and right, I have nothing left to pawn.\\" Yuanmao retorted, \\"Why are you feigning poverty? Is it that you fear I won't repay you if I borrow? This time, when the elders send word for me to manage my wedding, there will be at least five hundred taels of silver. If you lend me forty taels now, or perhaps"},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":2,"tokens":["元茂","李元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子去取方好。若事成了，长长短短起来，就不光鲜了。」聘才道：「这个我知道，明早我就去。」又坐了一坐，即自回房，见元茂和衣睡着，已经鼻息如雷，聘才叫醒了他，又另将一副铺盖给他睡了，自己也便安息。把富三的事想了一会，又将自己的帐算了一会，已到五更。略睡片时，即见天明，便叫起家人，吩咐套车进城。净了脸，吃了点心，穿好衣裳，李元茂尚未睡醒。","en":"I shall go first thing in the morning.\\" He sat a while longer before returning to his own room, where he found Yuanmao asleep in his clothes, his snoring like thunder. Pincai woke him, provided him with a separate set of bedding, and finally lay down to rest. He pondered Fu the Third's affair for a time, then calculated his own debts, and soon it was the fifth watch."},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":1,"tokens":["元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"聘才推醒了他，说道：「起来罢，我要进城去了，没有人在家照应你。」元茂模模糊糊的应了一声，翻一个身将被蒙了头，又睡着了。聘才好不烦躁，看这光景是不肯起来，只得叫四儿在家看守屋子，另带小使骑了马出门找富三去了。","en":"Pincai shook him awake, saying, \\"Get up, I must go into the city, and there is no one at home to attend to you.\\" Yuanmao gave a groggy grunt, rolled over, pulled the quilt over his head, and fell asleep again. Exceedingly irritated and seeing that the man refused to rise, Pincai had no choice but to leave Si'er behind to watch the house, taking a young page with him to"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":8,"tokens":["元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"却说元茂睡到巳正方才起来，擦擦眼睛，见四儿在房里扫地抹桌子。元茂便问道：「你主人那里去了？」四儿道：「到富三爷那里去了。」元茂下炕穿了衣裳，走到外间，四儿送了脸水，泡了茶，又送上点心。元茂又吸了几袋水烟，吐了一地的痰，四儿扫干净了。元茂问道：「你可知道几时回","en":"As for Yuanmao, he slept until the late morning before finally getting up. Rubbing his eyes, he saw Si'er sweeping the floor and wiping the tables in the room. Yuanmao asked, \\"Where has your master gone?\\" Si'er replied, \\"He went to Master Fu the Third's place.\\" Yuanmao"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":5,"tokens":["元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"四儿先把菜摆好，又拿了木盘出去。元茂看菜，一碟是熏鸡，一碟是鸡蛋，一碟是肉丝，一碟像是面筋，看不清楚，拈了一块尝尝，果然是面筋。四儿拿了一小壶酒，一个酒杯子，替他斟了一杯，又出去了。元茂一面喝酒，一面看那铺设，颇为精致。两间套房，昨晚心中有事未曾留心，日间是在外面小三间内。聘才卧房是在","en":"Si'er first arranged the dishes, then took the wooden tray back out. Yuanmao inspected the food: one plate of smoked chicken, one of eggs, one of shredded meat, and one that looked like gluten. Unsure, he picked up a piece to taste—it was indeed gluten. Si'er fetched a small flagon of wine and a cup, poured him a serving, and"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":2,"tokens":["元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"有一个都盛盘，放着副笔砚。窗心镶着大玻璃，东边上手是一个小书架，放些零星物件；下手是两张方凳，用青缎套子套着。元茂看完，想道：「这个光景岂是没有钱的？这四个大皮箱衣裳也就不少，那两个木箱与这两个大柜，定是放银子钱的。他还装穷哄我，今日断不能放过他。」便走了出来。四儿又拿进两样菜、一锡罐饭来，一样是羊肉，一样是炒肝。后来厨子又送了一个小火锅，一齐摆上。元茂吃了五碗","en":"miscellaneous items, and below it were two square stools, clad in black satin covers. Having taken all this in, Yuanmao thought to himself, \\"Does this look like someone with no money? Those four large leather trunks must contain no small amount of clothing, and those two wooden chests and two cabinets are undoubtedly meant for storing silver and cash. He's feigning poverty"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":5,"tokens":["元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"无不得之理，这二百两是我们两人应得的，只要给他一千就够了。」聘才道：「我要进去换衣裳了。」一直走到自己房里，见元茂尚在那里，又开了灯吹烟，聘才见了，心中甚气，便借此发作道：「你怎么还在这里？这样东西岂可青天白日摆出来的，况且是个庙里，什么人皆可进来观望。适或被人讹住了，不要累死我么？怎么这般胡涂！」元茂道：「怕什么，这里有谁来？我坐了大半天，没有见一个人进来。况","en":"than enough.\\" Pincai said, \\"I need to go in and change my clothes.\\" He walked straight to his room, only to find Yuanmao still there, having lit the lamp and puffing away on opium. Seeing this, Pincai was furious and seized the opportunity to unleash his temper: \\"Why are you still here? How can you leave such things out in broad daylight? Furthermore, this is a temple;"}],"38":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["李元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"且说徐子云请了屈公来，并请南湘、仲清、文泽、春航、王恂、子玉作陪，仍在梅崦中。王恂是日为孙亮功请去有事，因李元茂吉期已定，要招赘过来。亮功因两位贤郎是不懂事的，一切皆托王恂料理，王恂所以不能前来。","en":"particular day had been called away by Sun Lianggong on an important matter: the wedding date had been fixed for Li Yuanmao, who was to be adopted into the Sun household as a son-in-law. Since Sun's two sons were not yet capable of managing such affairs, everything had been entrusted to Wang Xun, and so Wang Xun was unable to come."}],"39":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":11,"tokens":["元茂","李元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"之约，因为孙亮功请去商办喜事，也替他张罗了几天。定于二月初十日招赘，也不多几天了。新年李性全寄了几百两银子来与元茂，并写个禀帖与王文辉，要替他儿子办喜事。王文辉不耐烦作媒，俱令王恂代劳。李元茂求着了魏聘才，求其代制一切。魏聘才闹了一个多月，花的，输的，丢了好些银钱，窃案又未能破，心上也有些烦闷起来，不得主意。今见李元茂来求他，当日原是他与王文辉为媒，意欲借此到文","en":"second month, which was not many days off. At the New Year, Li Xingquan had sent several hundred taels of silver to Yuanmao, along with a letter to Wang Wenhui asking him to arrange his son's marriage. Wang Wenhui had no patience for matchmaking and delegated everything to Wang Xun. Li Yuanmao then sought out Wei Pincai and begged him to take charge of all the arrangements."},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":1,"tokens":["元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"到了前三日过礼，聘才只得去找元茂，免不得上去见了颜夫人，因有好几个月不去了，又为去年闹了事，甚是局促不安。颜夫人也不问其往事，淡淡问了几句话。聘才去见了子玉，子玉想起琴言前日的话，心上总有些怪他，也不似从前待他亲厚了。","en":"Three days before the wedding came the exchange of betrothal gifts, and Pincai had no choice but to go and find Yuanmao, which meant calling on Madam Yan as well. Having stayed away for several months and having caused that unpleasant scene the previous year, he was quite ill at ease. Madam Yan, for her part, asked nothing about past events and exchanged only a few bland"},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":1,"tokens":["元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"元茂的事是梅进代办，替他办了钗环簪镯、彩缎衣衫，并借了颜夫人的珠冠玉带、补服朝珠、蟒衣绣裙，共铺了十六盒，扎了亭子，也还像个局面。两个媒人押了去。孙家收了，回盒不过相称，也无甚珍异之物。","en":"All the arrangements for Yuanmao's affairs were handled by Mei Jin, who procured hairpins and bracelets, embroidered silks and gowns, and borrowed from Madam Yan a pearl crown, jade sash, official rank-badge robes with court beads, embroidered dragon skirt, and other finery, arranging"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":3,"tokens":["元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"王恂道：「一路荣华到白头。」子玉道：「犹道灯前相对影，愈揉双眼愈模糊。」此是近视眼洞房诗，今日可为元兄咏矣。」元茂道：「我说倒是近视眼好，就新人丑些，也看不清楚。」仲清道：「若美的呢，可不孤负了？」元茂笑道：「我这新人想来未必能美。我也有些风闻，只要不像那两位弟兄的相貌就好了。」到了吉时，都送元茂到了孙宅，孙宅鼓乐迎接。此位姑娘系亮功前室所生，如今这位夫人也不甚","en":"That is a poem about a nearsighted man in the bridal chamber; it would do nicely for Brother Yuan this evening.\\" Yuanmao said, \\"I've always thought nearsightedness had its advantages; even if the bride is a bit plain, you can't see her clearly.\\" Zhongqing said, \\"But if she should turn out to be beautiful, wouldn't that be a waste?\\" Yuanmao laughed. \\"I rather doubt my bride"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":2,"tokens":["元茂","李元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"元茂与新娘拜了花烛，送入新房，坐床撒帐，饮了交杯，复又请新郎上席，坐了华筵。那嗣徽、嗣元陪了一回，王恂、仲清即要移席到新房中畅饮。大家进了新房，仲清道：「今日可以看新人的。」便要走到床前。床前本有两个伴送的老妇人，还有两个小丫鬟侍立。嗣元恐怕仲清看了他的","en":"Yuanmao and his new bride performed the wedding rites before the bridal candles, were escorted to the bridal chamber, sat upon the bed while wedding verses were scattered over the curtains, drank from the crossed cups, and then the groom was called back out"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":1,"tokens":["元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，见同席都不能接洽，勉强要和合起来。此刻在新房里坐位乱坐的，无有推让。聘才与亮轩坐了一面，仲清与子玉坐了一面，元茂在上首独坐了一面，王恂与嗣徽坐在下首。","en":"taken without any ceremony of deference. Pincai and Liangxuan sat on one side; Zhongqing and Ziyu on another; Yuanmao sat alone at the head; and Wang Xun sat below with Sihui."},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":1,"tokens":["元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"极好相与的。」子玉不知他的东家是谁，含糊答应。即私问王恂，王恂答以奚十一，子玉便是一腔忿恨，也不理他。亮轩又向元茂道：「舍表妹贤德无双，李大哥真有福气，结了这头好亲。我们太亲翁不久外放，不是四川夔州府，就是湖南辰州府。李大哥是娇客，将来同到任上，不要说是账房，只怕内外一切都要仰仗呢。」仲清听了好笑，忍不住道：「足下与孙府上怎么样的亲？」亮轩道：「孙大哥的嫡亲舅嫂","en":"it was Xi Eleven. A sudden surge of indignation filled Ziyu and he said nothing more. Liangxuan then turned to Yuanmao: \\"Your future wife, my cousin's cousin on the other side, is a paragon of virtue, Brother Li is truly fortunate to have arranged such a fine match. Our mutual kinsman will be posted to a province before long, either Kuizhou in Sichuan or Chenzhou in"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":1,"tokens":["元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"个恶心。仲清忍不住问道：「姬先生这样叙起来，我们都可以算得亲戚，只要多转两个弯。」亮轩连称「正是」。子玉微笑。元茂道：「我非但算不得清，而且也听不清，真是葫芦牵倒扁豆藤。」聘才笑道：「忙中遇着腿缠筋。」嗣徽道：「亲亲也，凡有血气者莫不尊亲。亲亲人也，仁者人也。」嗣元听了乃兄开口，就要驳起来，道：「这话、话，不、不通，你、你说凡有血、血、血气者，莫不、不、不尊亲，","en":"become kinsmen, as it merely requires a few more turns in the pedigree.\\" Liangxuan agreed heartily. Ziyu smiled. Yuanmao said, \\"Not only can I not follow the connections, I couldn't even hear them properly. It's like a pumpkin vine tangled up with a bean vine.\\" Pincai laughed and said, \\"And in the middle of it all you run into a man with his legs all wrapped in creepers.\\""},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":1,"tokens":["李元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"元道：「那、那、那个近视眼倒像李大哥，那个刑名就是姬大哥。」亮轩笑道：「不是，不是。我看断非刑名，定是仵作。」李元茂道：「我不信眉毛会擦得痒。」子玉笑道：「尊眉也就不轻了。」嗣徽道：「三人中吾学那个作八股的。」聘才道：「我也有个笑话。亲兄弟两个，都是近视眼，然不肯自认近视眼。哥哥常说兄弟的眼光不好，兄弟也笑哥哥目力不佳。他家隔壁有个土地堂，新挂了一块匾，两人要试试","en":"and said, \\"Not at all, not at all. I am quite certain it was no law secretary — it must have been a coroner.\\" Li Yuanmao said, \\"I don't believe eyebrows can actually tickle.\\" Ziyu laughed. \\"Your own eyebrows are by no means light.\\" Sihui said, \\"Of the three, I am studying the one who composes eight-legged essays.\\" Pincai said, \\"I have a joke too. Two brothers, both nearsighted,"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":1,"tokens":["元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"了两个菜碗，吓得众人面面相觑。嗣元见姐姐骂了，即跳起身来，也帮着乱骂。大家无趣，急忙起身走了出来，急急的各散。元茂、嗣徽也难收罗，只得送出，看上车而回。","en":"embarrassment; everyone scrambled to their feet and hurried out, going their separate ways as fast as they could. Yuanmao and Sihui were left with no way to rein things in and could only see the departing guests to their carriages before going back inside."},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":3,"tokens":["李元茂","元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"原来聘才这个笑话，虽系有心打趣李元茂的近视眼，却不知关碍了新娘。从前就说过是个天老儿，生的一头白发，连眉毛、寒毛都是白的，北边叫作天老，南边谓之白羊子。更兼情性泼悍，今年已经三十岁了，四远驰名，无人聘他，故将就送与元茂。元茂如何知道？高高兴兴的进来，心中想道：「方才聘才的笑话，不过笑我","en":"As it happened, Pincai's joke, though he had aimed it at Li Yuanmao's nearsightedness, had unwittingly landed on a tender nerve where the bride was concerned. As had been mentioned before, she was an albino: her hair, eyebrows, and body hair were all white. In the north such a person is called a \\"Heaven's Elder\\"; in"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":3,"tokens":["元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"连忙把仆妇丫头打发开了，脱了外面的衣裳，掩了门，将蜡花剪的亮亮的，揭开帐子，挑了红巾，将灯一照，喜得元茂骨软筋酥。雪白桃花似的一个银盆脸，乌云似的一头黑发，弯流流翠生生的两道黑眉，猩猩红的一张樱桃小口，粉香油腻，兰麝袭人。元茂喜得了不得，与他宽衣解带，那新娘便先钻入被内去了。元茂也忙忙脱了衣服，挨进了被窝，自有一番举动，那新娘半推半就的成了一度。","en":"trimmed the candle to a good bright flame, lifted the curtain, drew aside the red veil, and held the lamp close. Yuanmao felt his bones go soft and his sinews melt with delight. There before him was a face like a silver basin, peach-blossom fair; a head of black hair like dark clouds; two curving, vivid black brows; a small cherry mouth, red as crimson; a fragrance of"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":2,"tokens":["元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"见新娘递块帕子与他，元茂想起有什么元红的说法，把帕子擦了，揌在枕边，明日试验。心中想这滋味真觉有趣，要想句话说说，又找不出来。睡了一睡，又来了一度。一床被褥都是新绵的，况且是二月初十，天气已暖，元茂动得一身汗似蒸笼是的，头上的汗流下不住。下来歇了，忽摸着那块帕子，他也忘记是","en":"The new bride handed him a handkerchief. Yuanmao remembered something about the practice of the \\"original red\\" and used it to wipe himself, then tucked it under the pillow to examine the next morning. He lay there thinking that this was truly a very satisfying experience, and tried to think of something"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":4,"tokens":["元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"绝早新娘已先起来，另在一间房梳头。元茂起来，擦了脸，穿了衣，悄悄的将那块帕子揣在怀里，要想去看新人梳头，已被伴婆拉了出去见泰山，并有些长亲等类，耽搁了好一回。新人梳妆已毕，华服艳妆的在房里低头坐着。元茂挨近身边，也挣出几句话来，新娘唯有含笑不答，也偷看元茂，团头大脸，除了眉毛眼睛之外，也","en":"Very early in the morning the new bride rose first and went to comb her hair in another room. Yuanmao got up, washed his face, and dressed; then, quietly slipping the handkerchief into his pocket, he tried to go and watch his bride at her morning toilette but was caught by an escort-woman who dragged him out to pay his respects to his father-in-law,"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":1,"tokens":["元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"旁边一个仆妇问道：「姑爷要找什么东西？等我来找。」元茂见了有好些丫头、老婆子在房中，又不好说。只得出来，再到无人处，将那帕子细看，见一条条的漆不像漆，油不像油、黑不像墨，真猜不出是什么东西。闻一闻有点油香，又有些汗气，扑嗤的笑了一声，想道：「怪不得他的乃弟满口通文，虽他姐姐发里头，也有这许多黑水。」既又","en":"A maidservant nearby asked, \\"Son-in-law, what are you looking for? Let me help.\\" Yuanmao looked around and saw the room full of maids and old serving-women; there was no way he could say. He had to go out again to a place with no one about, and hold the handkerchief up for close examination. He saw a series of streaks that were not quite"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":1,"tokens":["元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"过了几日，元茂谢媒拜客，听得王恂、仲清问他的新人怎样得意，不说别样，总说的是头发。有的说是白丝细发，有的说是银丝鹤发，总不懂什么意思。人家见他得意，也是诧异。","en":"After a few days, when Yuanmao was making the rounds of thanks to the matchmakers and paying calls on well-wishers, Wang Xun and Zhongqing asked him how he found his new wife. He said nothing about anything else, but kept talking about hair, one person said it was white silk-fine"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":2,"tokens":["元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"元茂忽想起聘才挨骂那一回，也是说了白发、白阴毛，因此新人动气，便有些疑心。又想：「自己脸上天天沾染些黑油，那块帕子又是这样，况且他起得绝早，另在一间房内梳妆，而且要关了门，这是何故？」疑心不决，又不敢问。来到房中，见他欢天喜地，戴满了珠翠，分明一头好发，","en":"Then Yuanmao recalled the incident when Pincai had been cursed, the joke had touched on white hair and white intimate hair, and that was what had made the bride so furious. His suspicions began to stir. And then he thought, \\"My own face is smeared with black oil"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":2,"tokens":["元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"那孙氏也猜不出他作什么。元茂费了半夜心，早上又睡着了。孙氏梳好了头，元茂才起来净脸时，就牢记着发顶里有纸包，急忙带上帽子，跑到外间，打开一看，却是漆黑的一根。","en":"Madam Sun could not imagine what he had been doing. Yuanmao had spent half the night at his maneuvers, and in the morning slept in. Madam Sun had long since finished combing her hair. When Yuanmao finally got up and was washing his face, he remembered the paper packet in his braid, hurriedly put on his hat, ran"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":2,"tokens":["元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"元茂欢喜道：「白疑心了几天，那班刻薄鬼原来是瞎说的。」才放了心。可笑元茂呆到二十分，费了半夜心，得了一毛，谁知还是他自己身上擦下来的，他当他老婆的，就疑心尽释了。","en":"Yuanmao was delighted. \\"I've been suspecting for nothing these several days, for those sharp-tongued gossips were just talking nonsense.\\" And his mind was at rest. What a fool that Yuanmao was, spending half the night on his scheme and obtaining a single hair,"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":4,"tokens":["元茂","李元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"约过了半月，那一天事当败露。孙氏梳头时，觉得身上有些凉，叫丫鬟出去拿件半臂来穿，不料元茂已起来，见丫鬟拿了衣服进那间屋里去，他就跟了进去，不及关门。只见坐着一个人，身穿件大红紧身，披着一头银丝似的细发，有三尺余长，两道淡金色眉毛。李元茂心中唬了一大跳，当是遇见了鬼，欲要转身，心中想道：「穿的衣服分明是他，难道真是白人？」急走近时，孙氏也","en":"combing her hair she felt a chill and called a maidservant to fetch her a sleeveless jacket from the other room. Yuanmao was already up, and seeing the maid carrying clothes into that other room, he followed along without enough time for the door to be closed. There, seated, was a figure dressed in a scarlet close-fitting garment, with a cascade of silver-silk hair over"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":1,"tokens":["元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"且也刷不上去。洗时用皂荚水一桶，用硼砂、明矾洗干净，晾得半干，然后梳挽，也要一个时辰。今日略迟了些，因此败露。元茂气哄哄的崛了出去，在魏聘才的处住了两天。聘才问其所以然，他只得直说了。聘才恍然大悟，遂明白前日的笑话，竟说到板眼里去了。","en":"the better part of two hours. That morning she had been running a little late, and so the truth came to light. Yuanmao stormed out in a fury and went to stay at Wei Pincai's lodgings for a couple of days. Pincai asked him what had happened, and Yuanmao had no choice but to tell him the whole story. Pincai was immediately enlightened: he now understood how his joke the"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":5,"tokens":["元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"心上急了，禀明了父母。亮功大怒，陆夫人也有了气，便着人到梅宅上一问，没有去。又各处找寻，找到了聘才处，找着了。元茂尚不肯回去，聘才力劝，方同了来人回家，犹不肯进房，在书房中同嗣徽说闲话。晚间亮功回来，即说了元茂几句，陆夫人也责备了元茂一番，然究竟心上有些对不住元茂，半说半劝的叫他进房。元茂也没奈何，只得进去，心上犹记着那天的模样，总不能高兴。","en":"someone to the Mei household to inquire, but he was not there. After searching everywhere, he was found at Pincai's. Yuanmao still refused to go back; only after Pincai pressed him earnestly did he agree to return with the messenger, though he still would not go into the inner chambers and sat in the study chatting idly with Sihui instead. When Lianggong returned that evening"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":5,"tokens":["元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"孙姑娘见他进来，要他先上来赔话，坐着不动。灯光之下，元茂依然看了黑白分明，是个美人，心上便活动了些，只得先说了一句话，孙氏也慢慢的答了一句。元茂垂着头，闭着眼，想了一回，想得了一个绝妙的主意，跳将起来，对着孙氏嘻嘻的笑。孙氏见他回心转意，反倒拿腔作势要收服他，冷冷的不言语，自己对镜顾影，做作一番。元茂忍不","en":"Madam Sun, seeing him come in, wanted him to speak first and apologize, and sat without stirring. In the lamplight Yuanmao looked again and saw her distinctly black and white, a real beauty, and his heart softened a little. He spoke first. Madam Sun slowly replied. Yuanmao sat with head bowed and eyes shut, pondering for a while, and then suddenly a brilliant idea struck"},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":2,"tokens":["元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"孙氏被他说得喜欢，便也笑颜悦色起来，道：「此刻尚早，何不着人去买了，明日就可用了。」元茂道：「买了来，今晚就用，省得又染我一脸。」孙氏叫丫头出去告诉了管事的，叫他买一个网巾、一个髻子、一个燕尾，速速的办来。果然不多一刻，即买齐了。孙氏喜欢不尽，即刻熬了一罐皂荚水，把油煤洗刷干净，洗了很酽的两大盆，似染坊中靛青一般。也等不得干，元茂拿一块","en":"smiles. She said, \\"It's still early, so why not send someone to buy it now so it's ready for tomorrow morning?\\" Yuanmao said, \\"Buy it now and we can use it tonight, saving my face from being smeared again.\\" Madam Sun called a maidservant to go tell the steward to buy one hairnet, one hairpiece, and one swallow-tail ornament, and to bring them back promptly. In short order"},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":1,"tokens":["元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"元茂又叫他索性把鬓脚及四围修去些，便不露出来。孙氏也叫老婆子用剃刀刮去一转，把眉毛也索性刮掉了，脸上也刮得光光的。把网巾戴上，真发盘了一圈，加上那假髻子，将簪子别好，扎上燕尾，额上戴上个翠翘，画了眉，真加了几分标致。","en":"Yuanmao then suggested she trim and shave back the temple-hair and the hairline all around so nothing would show. Madam Sun had an old serving-woman take a razor and shave all around the edges, and shaved off the eyebrows entirely as well; the fine down on her"},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":3,"tokens":["元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"晚上看了，竟是个醉杨妃一样。孙氏叫点了两枝大蜡，一前一后用两面镜子照了，觉得美不可言。元茂看了，也心花大开，走拢来，把他头上闻了一闻，将脸上擦了两擦，微有一点油，不像前头落色了。喜孜孜的支开了丫头，携手上床，同入鸳衾，开了一枝夜合花。元茂忽又想起前夜拔毛之事，便问孙氏道：「我闻得天老儿是浑身寒毛都是白的，为什么你下身的毛倒是黑的？」孙氏道","en":"mirrors, one in front and one behind, to admire herself from all angles, and she found the effect breathtaking. Yuanmao, looking at her, felt his heart blossom with delight; he stepped close, smelled the top of her head, rubbed his cheek against her face, finding only the faintest trace of oil, nothing like before. In high good spirits he dismissed the maids, took her"},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":3,"tokens":["元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"孙氏不肯，元茂道：「我还嫌你？如今我都替你这么样了，还隐藏作什么？」孙氏不语。元茂赤身下床，携了烛照，把被揭开，孙氏尚要遮掩，元茂见他身上真是雪霜似的，甚为可爱。","en":"Madam Sun refused. Yuanmao said, \\"Can you still be keeping things from me? After all I've done to fix things for you, what is there to hide?\\" Madam Sun said nothing. Yuanmao climbed naked out of bed, took up the candle, folded back the quilt. Madam Sun tried to shield herself,"},{"paragraph":30,"mentions":2,"tokens":["元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"看到那妙处，好似骑了一匹银鬃马，倒应了聘才的笑话，真像一相蝇拂子遮着。元茂忍不住笑了一声，把他拧了一把。孙氏骂道：「作什么，你原也是个近视眼，何不也闻闻？」元茂看动了心，放了灯，上床去了。秽事休题，且看下回分解。","en":"silver-maned horse, and indeed it bore out Pincai's joke, looking for all the world like a fly-whisk held over herself. Yuanmao could not suppress a laugh, and gave her a pinch. Madam Sun said, \\"What do you think you're doing? Aren't you yourself a nearsighted man? Why not have a good sniff as well?\\" Yuanmao, moved by what he had seen, set down the candle and climbed back into"}],"50":[{"paragraph":22,"mentions":2,"tokens":["元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"七岁，比聘才大了两年。相貌极为标致，看着还像二十来岁人，更兼弹唱皆精，与聘才甚为合意，故成了夫妻。聘才想起去年元茂所借之当还没有归还，便到孙宅去找他，谁知元茂同了他两个舅子下通州赴考去了，只好认了晦气。到出京那几日，一起一起的饯行，潘其观、奚十一、张仲雨、冯子佩、杨梅窗、张笑梅、顾月卿、唐和尚等轮流作饯，唐和尚的庄子好不热闹，聘才又辞了几天行。","en":"perfectly, and so they became husband and wife. Pincai suddenly remembered the pawn ticket he had borrowed from Yuanmao the previous year, which remained unsettled. He went to the Sun residence to find him, only to learn that Yuanmao and his two brothers-in-law had already left for Tongzhou to sit for their examinations. Pincai could only curse his rotten luck and let"},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":1,"tokens":["李元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"聘才出京之日，唐和尚直送到十里长亭，洒泪而别。聘才回家接了父母，同往湖北，后来书中就没有他的事了。要叙李元茂、孙嗣徽在通州小考，闹了一个小小的笑话，且俟下回分解。","en":"together to Hubei. From this point on, the book has no further business with his affairs. The narrative now turns to Li Yuanmao and Sun Sihui taking their preliminary examinations in Tongzhou, where a small, comical mishap unfolds. But to know the details, you must await the next chapter."}],"51":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":2,"tokens":["元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说聘才出京之时，曾问元茂要帐，适值元茂赴通州去了。","en":"When Wei Pincai was departing the capital, he sought to collect a debt from Yuanmao, only to find that Yuanmao had just left for Tongzhou."},{"paragraph":2,"mentions":4,"tokens":["元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"元茂与孙氏昆仲都冒了顺天籍贯，府县考过了，到通州院考，租了寓，进了场。元茂遇见了旧日窗稿，是先生改好的，便直笔而抄之。这孙嗣徽如何会做文章？遇见一个同窗朋友，是个廪生，托其代请枪手。那人与他请了一个人，讲定了八十两银子，写了契约。在场内与孙嗣徽枪了两文一","en":"Yuanmao and the Sun brothers had fraudulently registered under Shuntian prefectural origin. Having passed the prefectural and county examinations, they rented lodging in Tongzhou and entered the provincial academy examination hall. Yuanmao came across one of"},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":3,"tokens":["元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"元茂、嗣徽看了，也不知嗣元卷子上写了什么，嗣徽倒暗暗喜欢，与元茂进去叩见宗师。宗师见了元茂，倒也没有讲话。","en":"Yuanmao and Sihui, entirely ignorant of what Siyuan had written on his scroll, read the placard in confusion. Sihui secretly rejoiced and went in with Yuanmao to pay respects to the examiner. The examiner saw Yuanmao but offered no comment."},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":2,"tokens":["元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"嗣徽上了马，元茂坐了车，一同回寓，嗣元被州官叫了去了。却又得了个喜信，亮功放了安徽凤阳府。嗣徽心中大喜，就想回家，等着下科再花些银子，找人枪一枪，就可以拔贡了，无奈为嗣元的文卷尚未问明，只得再待两天。元茂得了一个秀才，也就心满意足，如今又娶了亲，心中一无牵挂。却喜丈","en":"Sihui mounted a horse, Yuanmao took a carriage, and together they returned to their lodging, Siyuan having already been summoned by the prefectural official. Then came glad tidings: Lianggong had been appointed to Fengyang Prefecture in Anhui. Sihui was overjoyed and wished to return"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":2,"tokens":["元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"那日饭后，元茂闷坐无聊，太阳也将落了，独自逛出城来，到了运河边。只见粮船如云，还有些官船，大旗招展，好不热闹。那粮船舱里，也有些妇女们，就望不清楚。把眼镜擦了一擦戴上，沿着河堤慢慢的走去，只管东张西望。见那些卖西瓜的与卖桃儿的，还有卖牛肉的，卖小菜、豆腐的，挤来挤","en":"After a meal one day, Yuanmao sat bored and idle. The sun was dipping low, so he strolled alone out of the city and arrived at the banks of the Grand Canal. Grain barges clustered like clouds, interspersed with official vessels flying grand, fluttering banners—a scene of bustling"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":4,"tokens":["元茂","李元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"见元茂跌来，吃了一惊，恐他跌到身上，急起身躲时，腿未站起，元茂已倒了过来，刚刚压着了他。船上岸上的人见了，齐拍手笑起来。这一笑，把个李元茂臊得满脸紫涨，把脚一伸，可可的中踹在烂泥里，没了力，左手撑着地，右手按着缝穷婆的腿，使劲一支，遂支了起来，沾了一袜子泥","en":"Seeing Yuanmao falling toward her, she gasped in alarm and tried to scramble away, but before she could stand, Yuanmao had already crashed down, pinning her beneath him. The onlookers on the boats and the shore erupted in claps and laughter. This collective mocking"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":8,"tokens":["元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"只见那缝穷婆抖着布衫，连说道：「这是怎么说，走道儿会栽到人身上来！」元茂只得自认不是。那缝穷的尚要发作几句，见元茂一身绸绢，像个旗丁模样，又见他一袜子泥，衫子也扎破了，倒想揽这个买卖，便道：「你的衣裳破了，你脱下来我与你缝缝罢。」元茂见他好言好语，便看自己样子也难回去，便把长衫脱将下来，蹲在一边看他缝补。又看那缝穷的颇有","en":"cotton blouse, and grumbled repeatedly, \\"What is the meaning of this? How does a man walk straight into a person?\\" Yuanmao had no choice but to swallow the blame. The mender was about to unleash a sharper scolding, but seeing Yuanmao clad in fine silks, resembling a banner guardsman, and noticing his mud-soaked sock and torn gown, her entrepreneurial spirit sparked. She"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":14,"tokens":["元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"缝完了，元茂穿上，缝穷的提了篮子，跟了元茂进城。元茂问他的住处，缝穷的道：「我也在城里。」元茂又问他的丈夫，缝穷的道：「我们当家的撑小驳船，如今在杨柳青呢。」元茂说一句，望一望，两人并着走，见他胸前高高的两个乳，元茂鼻子望空嗅嗅，觉有些汗香，心上有几分爱他，却又","en":"When the mending was finished, Yuanmao donned his gown, and the mender, carrying her basket, followed him into the city. Yuanmao asked where she lived; she replied, \\"I also live in the city.\\" He then asked about her husband. \\"Our master poles a small barge; he's currently at Yangliuqing,\\""},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":2,"tokens":["元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"元茂道：「我就给你四百钱。」对着他把嘴望炕上一扭，缝穷的道：「待我提了篮子进来。」元茂恐怕人来，关了门闩了，二人就在炕上云雨起来。","en":"Yuanmao agreed, \\"I will give you four hundred coppers.\\" He pursed his lips and gestured toward the kang. The mender said, \\"Wait, let me bring my basket inside.\\" Fearing someone might walk in, Yuanmao quickly closed and bolted the door, and the two tumbled onto"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":9,"tokens":["元茂","李元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"恰好嗣徽回来，望望元茂的房门没有锁，把手一推，却是闩着，知道元茂在内，便叫了一声：「开门，青天白日关了门做什么？」元茂听了，吃了一惊，伏着不动。嗣徽又推了一推，元茂只得应道：「我肚子疼，要躺一会起来，不要来推门吵闹人。」嗣徽倒也不疑心，一移步间，踢着一样东西，一看是妇人戴","en":"As chance would have it, Sihui returned just then. Seeing Yuanmao's door unpadlocked, he pushed it, only to find it bolted from the inside. Knowing Yuanmao was within, he called out, \\"Open the door! Why are you locked up in broad daylight?\\" Hearing this, Yuanmao was startled and froze, pressing himself flat. Sihui"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":2,"tokens":["元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"嗣徽看清，想撞破他，恐元茂脸上下不来。且看缝穷的生得少艾，便想要半路截留，便先到门口等他。那缝穷婆出来，嗣徽拦住了门，问道：「你方才在里头做什么？」那缝穷婆笑嘻嘻的扭着头，看嗣徽穿着芙蓉布汗衫，脚下是皂靴，知道是位老爷，说道：「方才有位爷们，叫我缝补小衣。」孙嗣徽道：「我在窗","en":"Sihui, having seen everything clearly, wanted to expose him, but feared causing Yuanmao too much embarrassment. Moreover, seeing that the mender was young and attractive, he decided to intercept her. He waited by the outer gate. When she emerged, Sihui blocked her path and asked, \\"What were you doing inside just now?\\" The mender grinned,"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":2,"tokens":["元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"尚不见来。心里一想，有些下人在面前，不便行事，把几个家人尽行打发出门，叫他去探听嗣元消息与到远处去买物去了。知元茂是要睡中觉的，到他房门口望了一望，见元茂在炕上躺着，闭了眼，当他睡着了。急到门口来，见那缝穷婆已坐在门坎上。今日打扮得不同，梳得光光的元宝头，绞光了鬓脚，插了一枝花，穿一件蓝夏布衫子，手中带上烧料镯子、铜戒指，回头见了嗣徽，便笑嘻嘻的提了篮子，走了进","en":"dispatched all his retainers on various errands—some to inquire about Siyuan, others to buy goods far away. Knowing Yuanmao habitually took a midday nap, he peeked into his room and saw Yuanmao lying on the kang with his eyes closed, assuming him to be asleep. Rushing to the outer gate, he found the mender already sitting on the threshold. She was dressed quite differently"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":9,"tokens":["元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"且说那元茂并未睡着，嗣徽与他对面房，有人进来，岂有听不见的？况那缝穷婆今日穿了木底鞋，鞋内又衬了高底，七寸长的花鞋，今日变了五寸。虽轻轻的走，总有咭咯之声。嗣徽当元茂睡着了，也不防他，把全副的精神施出来，那张躺椅响得好不热闹。元茂轻轻地走到嗣徽房门口，侧着耳朵","en":"Meanwhile, Yuanmao was not asleep at all. With Sihui in the room directly opposite, how could he fail to hear someone entering? Furthermore, the mender wore wooden-soled shoes today, with raised heels inside; her seven-inch shoes from yesterday had seemingly shrunk to"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":1,"tokens":["元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"都没有，压紧了人，气也透不出来。你听见响，那是小肚子碰着小肚子，你当是里头响吗？滑出滑进的，倒教我痒的难受。」元茂听了，心中好不有气，想候他出来，骂他两句，忽见孙嗣元从外边进来。","en":"Yuanmao heard Sihui laugh and ask, \\"I must ask you, how did you know I was a master? Was the man from yesterday not a master?\\" The mender replied, \\"He is no master.\\" Sihui, secretly delighted, thought, \\"She must have noticed the dark spot on the head of my member"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":3,"tokens":["元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"斗也恨他，狠狠的打了几下，打得嗣元两腿紫烂，一步一步攧回来。又恐气血凝滞，不敢坐车，幸遇见了家人，扶了回来。见元茂在房门口侧耳窃听，他也不知就里，吊起那一只眼皮，讲道：「晦、晦、晦他娘的气，你、你、你、你们倒在家快、快乐呢。」元茂正要问他，他到房门口把门一推，见闩着，双手乱搡，那薄板门将要破了，元茂摇摇手，嗣元不懂，仍是乱搡。嗣徽听嗣元回来，心内惊慌，定一定神，","en":"carriage would cause his blood to stagnate. Fortunately, he encountered a servant who helped him home. Seeing Yuanmao eavesdropping at the door, completely oblivious to the situation, Siyuan raised his drooping eyelid and grumbled, \\"Motherfucking bad luck! While I suffer, you... you... you lot are enjoying yourselves at home!\\" Yuanmao was about to ask what had happened"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":3,"tokens":["元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"有人请我来的，我又不是挨上门的。开口就骂人滚，好个不讲理的蛮子。」便理清了零星碎布，提了篮子，到外间来缝。见了元茂，有些不好意思，笑了一笑。元茂仔细看他，比昨日标致了好些，脚也小了，但心里恨他没有情义，还说他不像老爷，又嫌他笨不在行，尽巴结嗣徽，为他穿了双皂靴，便不理他，瞅着他缝衣。嗣元腿疼，便往躺椅上一躺，不料一边的铁搭已断，一侧滚了下来。嗣徽呵呵大笑道：「言","en":"scattered scraps of cloth, picked up her basket, and moved to the outer room to continue her sewing. Catching sight of Yuanmao, she looked a bit sheepish and offered a tight smile. Yuanmao observed her closely; she looked significantly prettier than yesterday, and her feet seemed daintier. Yet, his heart seethed with resentment at her callousness, recalling her mockery that"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":2,"tokens":["元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"嗣徽道：「人若一之，我百之。人若十之，我千之。」元茂笑起来。嗣元听得明白，又在里头狗肏狗卵的骂个不清，忽然一伸手，在席子上摸着一块湿漉漉的，沾了一手，连忙望地下一摔，听得「嗒」的一声。嗣元恨极了，即将席子扯下地来，叫小使进来，把马褥子铺了，便烂脓烂血的大骂。嗣徽自知理短，不敢回言，只作不闻。那个缝穷的","en":"man succeed by one effort, I will use a hundred efforts. If another man succeed by ten, I will use a thousand.'\\" Yuanmao burst out laughing. Siyuan heard this exchange clearly and started up again from the inner room, cursing \\"dog-fucked\\" and \\"dog-bollocks\\" without a pause. Suddenly, he reached out and touched a soaking wet patch on the sleeping mat. Recoiling, he frantically"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":1,"tokens":["元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子，走出房，照嗣徽劈头打来。嗣徽躲不及，肩胛上着了一下，连声哎哟道：「了不得，折兄之臂。」夺住了棍子要打嗣元，元茂连忙解劝分开了，两个还斗嘴斗舌的闹了半天。到五更，大家起来，收拾了，天明上车而回。到了家，亮功见大儿子与女婿进了学，也甚欢喜。又恨嗣元不通，出了大丑，痛骂了一顿。嗣元回房，又被他媳妇巴氏羞辱了一顿，他的气苦无门可诉，只好在外面逢人便说，他乃兄是代枪进","en":"\\"Outrageous! 'To strike the arm of an elder brother!'\\" He wrestled the stick away and prepared to strike back. Yuanmao hurriedly intervened, pulling them apart, but the two continued their venomous verbal brawl for half the day. Around the fifth watch, they finally rose, packed their belongings, and at daybreak, boarded a carriage to return home. Upon their arrival,"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":1,"tokens":["李元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"且说李元茂侥幸了这个秀才，也十分得意。见了孙氏，便夸奖他的才学，说嗣徽是代枪的，嗣元不通，以致打了板子。","en":"As for Li Yuanmao, his stroke of luck in securing the licentiate degree filled him with immense self-satisfaction. In the presence of the Sun family, he loudly boasted of his own scholarly prowess, casually dropping that Sihui had relied on a ghostwriter, and that Siyuan's"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":12,"tokens":["元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"孙氏也觉光彩，到底丈夫算个读书人了。元茂看着孙氏虽然假眉、假发，但五官生得颇好，又高又胖，是个有福之相，比起缝穷婆来，虽没有他风骚，到底比他干净了好些。到了并头夜合之际，已离了二十来天，未免彼此贪爱。况元茂学问也长了许多，孙氏又比不得那缝穷婆尝过那冲烦疲难的滋味，自然当是人生之乐止于如此。","en":"Madam Sun also felt a glow of reflected glory; her husband was, at last, a recognized scholar. Yuanmao looked at her closely. Though she wore painted eyebrows and a false hairpiece, her features were pleasing. She was tall and pleasantly plump, possessing a countenance that promised good fortune. Compared to the lowly mender, she lacked a certain wild"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":1,"tokens":["元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"孙氏犹咬着牙，把他搡了两搡，元茂又上去巴结了一回方好。","en":"Her teeth still gritted in fury, Madam Sun shoved him away roughly several times. Yuanmao had to spend a long while fawning and coaxing before she finally softened."},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":7,"tokens":["元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"的夫人，见父亲哥嫂一齐出京，未免凄凉悲苦，在母家住了几日。陆夫人也疼爱到十分，又不能带他赴任，只好劝慰他一番。元茂与孙氏是同去的。元茂外间有些亏空，这两天追逼起来，孙氏虽有些妆资，但不肯与元茂花消。元茂问他要钱时，便骂起来，说：「不是叫相公，就是嫖婊子。我也不给你钱，你也不许出去。」此时元茂被人追急了，无词可对，只得苦苦哀求他媳妇说，系进学费用，此时都应归还，并","en":"Lu loved her daughter dearly, but unable to bring her along to the new post, could only offer comforting words. Yuanmao and Madam Sun were to travel together. However, Yuanmao's outside debts were now pressing him hard. Although Madam Sun possessed a substantial dowry, she adamantly refused to let Yuanmao squander it. Whenever he asked for money, she would scold him bitterly:"},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":5,"tokens":["元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"找了当票，自己到当铺里，一算不够，又添了些碎银，做了利钱，把金镯子取了出来。到金店里请他看看成色，换了十四换，元茂不肯。又到一家，倒又少了半换，只得十三换半。元茂心中纳闷，把镯子带上手，一路的闯去。忽然见二喜坐着车，劈面过来，见了元茂忙下来，一把拉住，说道：「今日叫我找着了。我听得你要出京，又知道你中了秀才，也不知找你多少回，我们也多时没有坐坐了。」便拉着元茂，","en":"He then visited a goldsmith, asking them to assess its purity. They offered an exchange rate of fourteen, but Yuanmao, finding it too low, refused. He tried another shop, but they offered half a point less—only thirteen and a half. Frustrated and brooding, Yuanmao slipped the bracelet onto his wrist and stalked down the street. Suddenly, Erxi's carriage appeared, heading"},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":21,"tokens":["元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"进了客房，二喜道：「你此番去了，几时才来？你倒忍心撇得下我么？」说罢，便窜在元茂怀里道：「我跟你去罢！你去了，我在京里也没有疼我的人，不如咱苦苦乐乐的在一块儿。」说到此，两眼红红的，像要淌下泪来。元茂见了，好不伤心，也擦了眼睛，道：「若说跟我去的话，此时不用说他，且我明年就来的。如今我在这里寄了籍，明年要来科考，还要乡试，那时就","en":"leaving this time—when will you return? Can you truly bear to cast me aside?\\" With that, he buried his face in Yuanmao's chest and pleaded, \\"Let me go with you! Once you leave, there will be no one in this capital who truly cares for me. We'd be better off sharing our joys and sorrows together.\\" As he spoke, his eyes rimmed red, as if tears were about to fall. Moved"},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":9,"tokens":["元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"二喜知觉，把手伸过来一攥，仰着脸，望了元茂哈哈哈的几声，把手一紧，元茂一酥，说道：「了不得了。」便侧转身子来，把二喜紧紧的一搂，也算了春风一度，把裤裆擦了一擦。二喜又与元茂上了几口烟，一手把着元茂的手放在自己的脸上，道：「从前有位张少爷，也与我相好，我也使过他的钱。他在京时，问他要什么，他总","en":"a firm squeeze. Tilting his face upward, he let out a few bright peals of laughter while tightening his grip. Yuanmao went weak with pleasure, gasping, \\"This is unbearable!\\" He turned, pulled Erxi tightly against him, and they enjoyed a full bout of passion, after which Yuanmao wiped his crotch clean. Erxi then prepared a few more pipes of opium for Yuanmao. Taking"},{"paragraph":30,"mentions":1,"tokens":["元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"元茂睡了一觉醒来，见烟灯也收了，叫了一声：「二喜！」不见答应，擦擦眼睛，走了出来。只见那边房里，欢呼畅饮。","en":"When Yuanmao finally woke from his slumber, he found the opium lamp had been cleared away. He called out, \\"Erxi!\\" but received no answer. Rubbing his bleary eyes, he walked out of the room. From an adjacent chamber, the sounds of boisterous cheering and heavy drinking"},{"paragraph":31,"mentions":4,"tokens":["元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"有些人，还有几个相公，唱的唱，豁拳的豁拳。元茂见跟二喜的人站在门口，叫了他过来，问道：「二喜呢？」那人道：「在那里陪酒。」说了，又站到那里去了。元茂此时酒已醒了，一想心中有事，便一径出来。到了家，方知镯子被他狼去，心里甚急，再去找他，又不在家了，一肚子苦说不出来，丧气而回。孙氏问他为何出去了大半","en":"singing, while others bellowed as they played drinking-fist games. Spotting Erxi's attendant standing near the door, Yuanmao called him over and asked, \\"Where is Erxi?\\" The man replied curtly, \\"He's in there, keeping the guests company,\\" before turning away and resuming his post. Now fully sober, the reality of his pressing errands came crashing back to him, and he left the"},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":1,"tokens":["元茂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"明日，元茂没法，只得老了面皮去找王恂借了四十金，说是娶亲时欠下的帐，到了安徽即行寄还，才把那些零星馆子帐、相公开发及婊子嫖钱还个清楚。也到各处辞了行，遂同丈人出了京，到了凤阳府，住了一月，同着孙氏到他父亲任上去了。","en":"The following day, cornered and out of options, Yuanmao was forced to swallow his pride and seek out Wang Xun. He borrowed forty taels of gold, falsely claiming it was a lingering debt from his marriage and promising to remit the funds as soon as he reached Anhui. With this, he finally managed to clear his"}]}`),"char-7":JSON.parse(`{"2":[{"paragraph":35,"mentions":2,"tokens":["徐老爷","徐度香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"桂保斟了一巡酒，杨方猷命他入席，对着王文辉坐了。文辉问他哥哥兰保为什么不来，桂保道：「今日本都在怡园逛了一天，徐老爷知道这里请客，才打发我来的。兰保、宝珠、蕙芳、漱芳、玉林都还没有散，只怕总要到四五更天才散呢。」文辉道：「这徐度香也算人间第一个快乐人了。」陆宗沅道：「听说他这个怡园共花了五十多万银子才造成。」杨方猷道：「本来地方也大，也造得过于精致。」文辉道：「我","en":"Yulin have not yet dispersed; I suspect they will linger until the fourth or fifth watch.\\" Wenhui said, \\"This Xu Duxiang is truly the most carefree and joyous man in the mortal realm.\\" Lu Zongyuan added, \\"I have heard that constructing his Garden of Contentment cost over half a million taels of silver.\\" Yang Fangyou noted, \\"The grounds are vast, and the craftsmanship is"}],"4":[{"paragraph":30,"mentions":1,"tokens":["徐子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"再说仲清、王恂由南小街走到下洼子眺望，只见白茫茫一片，也辨不出田原路径，远远望见徐子云的怡园，琪树参差，烟岚回合，重重的层楼耀目，隐隐的高阁凌云。望了一会，只见对面一辆车来，车沿上坐的看见了，先跳了下来，随后看是一个相公，也要下车。仲清等连忙止住，那相公便挪出身子，生得香雕粉捏，玉裹金妆，原来是《花选》上最小的那个林春喜。王恂问道：「","en":"in the view. All was a vast expanse of white; fields and paths were indistinguishable. Far off they could see Xu Ziyun's Garden of Contentment, with its jadeite trees rising in uneven lines, mists and mountain vapors swirling and gathering, layer upon layer of gleaming multi-storied buildings, and the faint outline of high pavilions touching the clouds. They gazed for"},{"paragraph":31,"mentions":1,"tokens":["度香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"：「这月里我们八个人，在怡园三日一聚，作消寒会，今日是第五会了。每一会必有一样顽意儿，或是行令，或是局戏。今日度香要叫我们做诗，出了个《冰床》题目，各人做七律一首，教苏媚香考了第一。」仲清道：「你记得他的诗么？」春喜道：「我只记得他中间四句。」即念道：","en":"meeting. At each meeting there must be one entertainment, sometimes a drinking game, sometimes a parlor game. Today Duxiang wanted us to write poems. He set the topic The Ice Sledge, with each person writing one seven-character regulated poem, and Su Meixiang was judged first.\\" Zhongqing asked, \\"Do you remember his poem?\\" Chunxi said, \\"I only remember the middle four lines.\\""},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":1,"tokens":["度香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"道：「好极了，那个琴官，与瑶卿不相上下。那个琪官，与蕊香难定高低。此刻都还没有上台，但一天已有三五处叫他。前日度香见了，也大加赏赞，即赏了好些东西，把他们的衣服通身重做了几套。","en":"Neither has appeared on stage yet, but every day there are already three to five requests for them. The other day Duxiang saw them and praised them tremendously, immediately giving them fine gifts and having several complete new sets of costumes made for them."}],"5":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":3,"tokens":["子云","度香","徐子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"前回说林春喜与仲清等，讲起在怡园作消寒赋诗之会。我今要将怡园之事序起来：有个公子班头，文人领袖，姓徐名子云，号度香，是浙江山阴县人。说他家世，真是当今数一数二的，七世簪缨之内，是祖孙宰相，父子尚书，兄弟督抚。单讲这位徐子云的本支，其父名震，由翰林出身，现做了大学士，总督两广。其兄名子容，也是翰林出身，由御史放了淮扬巡道。","en":"set the stage for that garden. There was a prince among young noblemen, a leader of literary men, by the name of Xu Ziyun, style name Duxiang, a native of Shanyin County in Zhejiang. Speaking of his family lineage, it was truly among the foremost of the age, boasting seven generations of official distinction, with grandfathers and grandsons serving as prime ministers, fathers"},{"paragraph":2,"mentions":3,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"其太夫人随任广东去了，单是子云在京。这子云生得温文俊雅，卓荦不群，度量过人，博通经史，现年二十五岁。由一品萌生，得了员外郎在部行走。二十二岁，又中了一个举人。夫人袁氏，年方二十三岁，是现任云南巡抚袁浩之女。生得花容绝代，贤淑无双，而且蕙质兰心，颂椒咏絮，正与子云是瑶琴玉瑟，才子佳","en":"His mother had gone to Guangdong to accompany his father's posting; only Ziyun himself remained in the capital. This Ziyun was cultivated and elegant in appearance, distinguished and peerless in character, magnanimous beyond measure, and deeply versed in the classics and histories. He was twenty-five years of age, holding a sinecure"},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这子云虽在繁华富贵之中，却无淫佚骄奢之事，厌冠裳之拘谨，愿丘壑以自娱。虽二十几岁人，已有谢东山丝竹之情，孔北海琴樽之乐。他住宅之前，有一块大空地，周围有五六里大，天然的崇丘洼泽，古树虬松。原是当初人家的一个废园。","en":"Ziyun lived amid luxury and splendor. He had no trace of dissolution or extravagance. He disliked the constraints of official dress and decorum. He preferred the pleasures of hills and valleys as his enjoyment. Though still in his twenties, he already possessed"},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云买了这块空地，扩充起来，将些附近民房尽用重价买了。","en":"Ziyun purchased this plot and expanded it, buying up the nearby residences at generous prices."},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"静宜，年方三十二岁，是个名士，以优贡入京考选。他却厌弃微名，无心进取，天文地理之书，诸子百家之学，无不精通。与子云八拜之交，费了三四年心血，替他监造了这个怡园。真有驱云排岳之势，崇楼迭阁之观，窈屋宇其之胜。一时花木游览之盛，甲于京都。成了二十四处楼台四百余间屋宇，其中大山连络，曲水湾环，说不尽的妙处。子云声气既广，四方名士，星从云集。","en":"in the writings of all the philosophers and the hundred schools, there was nothing he had not mastered. He and Ziyun had sworn brotherhood, and over the course of three or four years spent enormous effort supervising the construction of the Garden of Contentment. The result was a place of driving clouds and shifting mountains, a sweep of soaring towers and layered"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"常满，樽酒不空，也不过几个素心朝夕，其余泛泛者，惟以礼相待，如愿相偿而已。史南湘《花选》中的八个名旦日夕来游，子云尽皆珍爱，而尤宠异者惟袁宝珠。这一片钟情爱色之心，却与别人不同，视这些好相公与那奇珍异宝、好鸟名花一样，只有爱惜之心，却无褒狎之念，所以这些名旦，个个与他忘形略迹，视他为慈父恩母。甘雨祥云，无话不可尽言，无情不可径遂。那个萧次贤更是清高恬淡，玩意不留","en":"In character, Ziyun was noble and sincere, responsive to every request and sparing no effort. He cherished the choosing of friends, not by power or status, but by virtue and principle. Though every day his seats were full of guests and wine cups never empty, only a few"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一日，子云在堂会中，见了新来的琴官、琪官两个，十分赞赏，叹为创见，正与那八个名旦一气相孚，才生了物色的念头。叫袁宝珠改日同他们到园来。又见他们的服饰未美，即连夜制造了几套，赏给了他们，这两个相公自然感激的了。但那个琴官，却又不然。且先将他的出身略叙一叙。","en":"One day, at a theatrical gathering, Ziyun encountered two newly arrived performers, Qinguan and Qiguan, and was greatly impressed. He marveled that such talent was unprecedented, seeing that they were perfectly suited to stand alongside the eight famous dan performers. This kindled his desire"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":1,"tokens":["徐子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"所以呆呆看了他一回。但陌路相逢，也不知他姓名、居处，又无从访问。如逢堂会、园子里，四下留心，也没见他。后来见了徐子云，十分赏识他，赏了他许多衣裳什物，心里倒又疑疑惑惑。又知道是个贵公子，必有那富贵骄人之态，十分不愿去亲近他。无奈迫于师傅之命，只得要去谢一声。","en":"theatrical gatherings or visited the theaters, he looked everywhere, but did not see him again. When he later met Xu Ziyun, who greatly appreciated him and gave him many clothes and objects, he became uncertain and wary. Knowing Ziyun was a nobleman of great wealth and rank, he feared such a man must carry the haughty airs of the powerful, and was very reluctant to approach"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这琴官的相貌与己彷佛，虽是初交，倒与夙好一般。两人已谈心过几回，琴官也重宝珠的人品，是个洁身自爱的人。宝珠又将子云的好处，细细说给他听，琴官便也放了好些心。二人同上了车，琴官在前，宝珠在后，正是天赐奇缘，到了南小街口，恰值子玉从史南湘处转来，一车两马，劈面相逢，子玉恰不挂帘子，琴官却挂了帘子，已从玻璃窗内，望得清清楚楚。","en":"value Baozhu's character, seeing him as someone who kept his own purity and self-respect. Baozhu then described Ziyun's fine qualities in detail, and Qinguan felt somewhat reassured. The two of them rode in a carriage together, Qinguan in front, Baozhu behind. By happy coincidence, they reached the South Small Street intersection. They met Ziyu returning from Shi Nanxiang's,"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"不多一刻进了怡园，宝珠询知子云今日在海棠春圃。这海棠春圃，平台曲榭。密室洞房，接接连连共有二十余间。宝珠引了进去，到了三间套房之内，子云正与次贤在那里围炉斗酒，见了这二人进来，都喜孜孜的笑面相迎。","en":"Not long after, they entered the Garden of Contentment. Baozhu asked and learned that Ziyun was that day at the Crabapple Spring Court. This Crabapple Spring Court had open terraces and winding covered galleries, intimate chambers and secluded rooms, all connecting in a continuous chain of over twenty bays. Baozhu led them inside to a suite"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":3,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴官羞羞涩涩的上前请了两个安，道了谢，俯首而立。子云、次贤见他今日容貌，华装艳服，更加妍丽了些。但见他那生生怯怯、畏畏缩缩的神情。教人怜惜之心，随感而发，便命他坐下。琴官挨着宝珠坐了，子云笑盈盈的问道：「前日我们乍见，未能深谈，你将你的出身家业、怎样入班的缘故，细细讲给我听。」琴官见问他的出身，便提动","en":"Qinguan timidly went forward, made two bows of greeting, expressed his thanks, and stood with bowed head. Ziyun and Cixian saw that today, in fine and colorful dress, his appearance was even more beautiful than before. But they saw his tentative, bashful, nervous bearing. Feelings of tender regard arose in them unbidden, and they invited him to sit. Qinguan sat"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"看他那里像什么唱戏的？可借天地间有这一种灵秀，不钟于香闺秀阁，而钟于舞榭歌楼，不钗而冠，不裙而履，真是恨事。」子云道：「他与瑶卿，真可谓享单云瑞雪，方驾千里，使易冠履而裙钗，恐江东二乔犹难比数。想是造物之心，欲使此辈中出几个传人，一洗向来凡陋之习，也未可知。」即对琴官道：「我们这里是比不得别处，你不必怕生，你各样都照着瑶卿，他怎样你也怎样。要知我们的为人，你细细","en":"the singing stage. Wearing a cap instead of hairpins, shoes instead of skirts. It is truly a lamentable matter.\\" Ziyun said: \\"He and Yaoqing truly could be called a matched pair soaring under auspicious clouds, racing a thousand li abreast. If their hats and shoes were exchanged for hairpins and skirts, I fear even the Two Beauties east of the River could scarcely be"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"矩，存了规矩，就生疏了。」琴官也只得答应了，再将他们二人看看，都是骨格不凡，清和可近，已知不是寻常人了。次贤对子云道：「你这话说得最是，他此时还不晓得我们脾气怎样，当是富贵场中，必有骄奢之气，谁知我们最厌的是那样。你这个人材，是不用说了。但人之丰韵雅秀，皆从书本中来，若不认字读书，粗通文理，一切语言举止未免欠雅。你可曾念过书么？」琴官尚未回答，宝殊笑道：","en":"were of extraordinary bearing, serene and approachable, and he knew they were not ordinary men. Cixian said to Ziyun: \\"What you have said is exactly right. At this moment he still does not know what our temperament is like; he may suppose that wealth and rank must bring with them proud and extravagant airs, not knowing that we most dislike such things. As for your"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":3,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「他肚子里比我们强得多呢！我们如今考起来，只怕媚香还考不过他。」子云听了，更加欢喜，便问琴官道：「你到底念过书没有？」琴官道：「也念过五六年的书。」次贤道：「念过些什么书呢？」琴官道：「《四书》之外，念了一部《事类赋》，两本唐诗。」子云道：「也够了，你可会做诗？」琴官道：「不会做。」宝殊道：「那是他没有学过，将来一学","en":"mind is far stronger than ours! If we were tested right now, I'm afraid even Meixiang could not surpass him.\\" Ziyun was even more pleased and asked Qinguan: \\"Tell me honestly, have you studied books?\\" Qinguan replied: \\"I have studied for five or six years.\\" Cixian asked: \\"What have you read?\\" Qinguan replied: \\"Besides *The Four Books*, I read through the Rhapsodies"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":10,"tokens":["子云","度香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"个名字不好，静宜你与他改一个字，将这官字换了罢，再与他起个号。」次贤想了一回道：「改为琴言，号玉侬，可好么？」子云道：「很好，这琴言二字，又新又雅；\\n玉侬之号，雅称其人。」宝珠叫琴官道谢，琴官又起身请了两个安。次贤道：「方才已说过的了，怎么又请起安来？」子云道：「我们立下章程，凡遇年节庆贺大事，准你们请安，其余常见一概不用。老爷二字，永远不许出口。称我竟是度香，","en":"about changing it to Qinyan, meaning Lute-Words, with the style name Yunong, meaning Jade Youth. Would that do?\\" Ziyun said: \\"Very good. The two characters 'Qinyan' are both fresh and elegant; and 'Yunong' as a style name suits the person perfectly.\\" Baozhu told Qinguan to express his thanks; Qinguan rose and made two bows. Cixian said: \\"We have already said all this,"}],"6":[{"paragraph":23,"mentions":1,"tokens":["徐子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"文泽之外，恰不认识。这刘文泽字前舟，系中州世家，已得了二品荫生。这人最是和气，性情阔大，蔼然可亲，尤好结交，与徐子云、华星北均称莫逆。那个张仲雨是扬州人，生得俊秀灵警，是进京来赶异路功名的，就住在他舅舅吴阁学家。一切手谈博弈，吹竹弹丝，各色在行，捐了个九品前程，是个热闹场中的趣人。这高品是苏州人，号卓然，是个拔贡生。聪明绝世，博览群书，善于诙谐，每出一语，往往颠倒","en":"Known for his generous spirit and approachability, he deeply valued friendship and was exceptionally close to Xu Ziyun and Hua Xingbei. Zhang Zhongyu, a quick-witted and handsome Yangzhou native, had traveled to the capital seeking an alternative path to officialdom, lodging with his uncle, Grand Academician Wu. Masterful in chess, qin, flute, and all manner of entertainments,"},{"paragraph":31,"mentions":1,"tokens":["徐老爷"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉等往下看时，却是王文辉在那里发气，见一个人只管赔着笑，又向文辉请安。又听文辉说道：「就是在徐老爷那里，唱一出再去何妨；况且定戏时，怎样交代你的？」那人道：「这出《惊梦》有个新来的琴官，比宝珠还好。大人不信，叫他先唱一出瞧瞧，如果不中大人的意，再赶着去叫宝珠来，包管不误。」刘侍郎道：「也罢，唱了《瑶台》之后，就唱《惊梦》也使得。」那人答应几个「是","en":"Ziyu and the others peered over the balcony: Wang Wenhui was throwing a tantrum. A man stood beside him, bowing repeatedly and offering placating smiles. Wenhui snapped, \\"Even at Master Xu's house, what harm is there in singing a single piece before leaving? Besides, when this opera was arranged, what were you explicitly told?\\" The man explained, \\"In this 'The Interrupted Dream,' there is a newly arrived performer, Qinguan, who surpasses even Baozhu. If Your Lordship doubts this, let him sing one piece first—if he fails to meet your expectations, I will rush off immediately to fetch Baozhu, guaranteeing no delay.\\" Vice-Minister Liu intervened, \\"Very well, then—after 'The Jade Terrace' concludes, 'The Interrupted Dream' will do perfectly.\\" The man eagerly agreed with a chorus of \\"Yes, yes, sirs!\\" and, seeing Wenhui mollified, hurried into the theater room. Pincai nudged Ziyu, \\"Did you hear that?\\" Ziyu nodded, feeling a profound surge of gratitude toward Wenhui."}],"7":[{"paragraph":38,"mentions":1,"tokens":["徐度香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉一面走着，向主人道：「这园子点缀得很幽雅。」文泽道：「这算什么园子，不及徐度香怡园十分之一，几时我同你去逛逛。」这里宾主二人讲着，那高品对仲清道：「你可晓得京里又来了一个精品么？」仲清笑道：「想是高品的弟兄。」高品道：「这人却也可以做得我的弟兄，闻他也是南京人，现寓在宏济寺内，却没有与他往来。看他人甚风雅，而光景很阔。你可晓得","en":"arranged—quite secluded and refined.\\" Wenze replied, \\"This barely qualifies as a garden, not even a tenth of Xu Duxiang's Garden of Contentment. Someday I'll take you there for a stroll.\\" As host and guest conversed, Gao Pin asked Zhongqing, \\"Did you know another exceptional individual has recently arrived in the capital?\\" Zhongqing smiled, \\"I suppose it must be one of"}],"8":[{"paragraph":6,"mentions":2,"tokens":["徐二爷","徐度香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"。问道：「二哥独自一人来，还有人同来的？」仲雨道：「我那里有工夫听戏？清早到锦春园华公府走了一走，出来又到怡园徐二爷处商量件事，遂同起盛银号潘老三在天香楼吃了饭。昨日宏济寺的唐和尚，有件事约我在这里等他。」说罢拿出了玉烟壶，递与聘才，聘才接了过来。元茂此时方想起是初六那一天见过的，重叙了几句寒温。仲雨又将烟壶递与元茂，元茂不知好歹，当着闻痧药的，一闻即连打了七八个","en":"man. His features are striking enough, though his temperament runs rather cold. These days he is constantly at Xu Duxiang's Garden of Contentment. There is also Qiguan, who is somewhat more amiable.\\" Pincai noted, \\"This Qinguan is the one our Mei Yuxiang treasures above all.\\" Zhongyu raised an eyebrow. \\"He fancies Qinguan as well? I rarely see him out and about.\\" Yuanmao"}],"9":[{"paragraph":10,"mentions":1,"tokens":["徐度香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"听得有好灯谜，去猜几个顽顽也好。」子玉道：「我不认得主人，既是晚上，又是便服，如何去得？」仲清道：「这倒不妨。徐度香这个人，却是我辈，全不在形迹上讲究的；况且他园中，还有萧静宜，更是个清高潇洒的人，就去逛逛，倒也不妨。」三人都要去，子玉也只得同去。于是各上了车，书童跨了车沿，望怡园来。","en":"and since it is evening and we are in plain clothes, how can we go?\\" Zhongqing said: \\"That is no obstacle. Xu Duxiang is one of our sort. He places no importance on formalities or appearances. Moreover, his garden also has Xiao Jingyi, who is an even more upright and free-spirited person. Going for a stroll would be perfectly fine.\\" All three wished to go, and Ziyu"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":1,"tokens":["度香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"上。」说毕便令小厮，仍将瑶琴抱了进去。其余彩礼，交给各跟随收存。原来琴言因制灯谜时，喜诵「落花人独立」这一联，度香随嘱次贤，以词意为琴言写图，所以这灯谜即以琴作彩，原是于游戏之中，寓作合之意。非但子玉不知杜玉侬为何人，就是仲清、文泽等也未能悉。大家问时，次贤不即说明，答以久后必知。","en":"guest's attendants. The fact was that because Qinyan loved to recite the couplet about \\"fallen blossoms\\" when Duxiang was composing the riddle, Duxiang had asked Cixian to make this a riddle with the qin as the prize, embedding within the playful game the intention of making a match. Not only did Ziyu not know who Du Yunong was, but even Zhongqing, Wenze, and the others"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":1,"tokens":["度香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"次贤恐着了凉，便命家人扶他到后面小座落里炕上去睡，扶了南湘进去，把门带上。子玉问次贤这是什么丸，次贤道：「这是度香自制的，任凭喝得烂醉，只须一丸下去，宿酒尽消，且补元气，名为仙桃益寿丸。」","en":"inside, and pulled the door behind him. Ziyu asked Cixian what the pill was. Cixian replied: \\"It is something Duxiang himself makes. No matter how dead-drunk one may be, one pill and all the stored wine is consumed, with the vital energy additionally restored. It is called the Immortal Peach Life-Prolonging Pill.\\""},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":1,"tokens":["度香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"认过，吾兄尚还刻刻在心。」南湘道：「以后你们这一班，见我们不许请安，只许称号，如违了要罚的。」宝珠道：「这倒与度香、静宜一样脾气，就是这样便了。」王恂道：「庾香，你看这瑶卿，与你去年戏园所见的怎样？这真伪可能相混么？」子玉笑道：「瓦砾岂可僭称珠玉？那个名字，叫他改了才好。」宝珠不解，便问王恂，王恂就将去年所见保珠，子玉听错的话说了，宝珠嫣然而笑。","en":"us by our courtesy names. Violators will be penalized.\\" Baozhu said: \\"This is exactly the same disposition as Duxiang and Jingyi, so it shall be.\\" Wang Xun said: \\"Yuxiang, look at this Yaoqing. How does he compare to what you saw at the theater last year? Could the real and the fake possibly be confused?\\" Ziyu laughed: \\"Can rubble and stone presume to the name of pearl"},{"paragraph":31,"mentions":1,"tokens":["度香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"了，很不好意思，只得答道：「向未交接，不过闻名思慕。」宝珠道：「他如今不叫琴官，改名为琴言，今日可惜迟来一步，度香带他赴席去了。」子玉心里想道：「我与他直如此缘悭，要接谈的福分都没有。」一面想，怔怔的看着宝珠，宝珠也怔怔的看着子玉，四目勾留，都出了神。刘文泽一回头看见这光景，轻轻的向子玉肩上一拍道：「瑶卿好不好？」子玉当是问琴言，便道：「他的《惊梦》这一出，直是","en":"longer called Qinguan; his name has been changed to Qinyan. What a pity you were just a step too late today, for Duxiang took him to a dinner engagement.\\" Ziyu thought to himself: \\"It is as if fate is sparing in its dealings with us. I do not even have the fortune of a proper conversation with him.\\" As he thought, he stared absently at Baozhu, and Baozhu too was staring"},{"paragraph":35,"mentions":2,"tokens":["度香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"着的人，真是个绝世聪明人了，可借不知是谁？」文泽道：「这两封书，都是静宜先生的手笔么？」次贤道：「那封原书，是度香的手笔。」说着，王恂已经下完了棋，倒输了漱芳三子。子玉因夜色已深，随同南湘等告辞；子玉并说度香来园，先为致意，改日专诚再来的话，次贤答应着，送出各人上车而散。再听下回分解。","en":"Wenze said: \\"Are both these letters written in Master Jingyi's hand?\\" Cixian replied: \\"The original letter is in Duxiang's hand.\\" As he spoke, Wang Xun had already finished his chess game, having lost three stones to Shufang. Ziyu, the night being already deep, took his leave together with Nanxiang and the others. Ziyu also conveyed that when Duxiang returned to the garden"}],"10":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["徐子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说子玉等散后，徐子云才回，因夜色已深，时交子末，便一径回宅。","en":"To resume our tale: after Ziyu and the other guests had dispersed, Xu Ziyun at last returned. Seeing that the night had already grown deep and the zi hour was ending, past one in the morning, he made his way directly to his private residence."},{"paragraph":2,"mentions":3,"tokens":["子云","徐子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴言自去年谒见子云之后，也随着一班名花天天常到怡园，子云爱之不亚于宝珠。但琴言生性高傲，冷冷落落，不善应酬，任凭黄金满斗，也买不动他一笑。一切古玩饮食衣服，只要他心爱，徐子云无不供给，也算相待十分，琴言未尝不知感恩，却只算得半个知己。自那进京这一天路上见了子玉，便认得","en":"Ever since Qinyan first paid his respects to Ziyun the previous year, he had accompanied the other celebrated beauties in their daily visits to the Garden of Contentment, where Ziyun favored him no less than he did Baozhu. Yet Qinyan was of an aloof and arrogant nature, preferring solitude to social"},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":7,"tokens":["度香","子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"手。又像远行了，重又回来，两人促膝谈心。模模糊糊，醒来也记不真切。虽知道是个世家公子，却不知道他的性情嗜好，与度香何如，又恐他是个青年轻薄寡情短行之人。又恐他豪贵骄奢要人趋奉的人。但细看他温存骨格，像个厚道正人，断不至此。一日又梦见宝珠变了他的模样，与自己唱了一出《惊梦》，又想不出这个理来。次日，子云到园来，次贤讲起昨晚诸诺人来园看灯，并子玉打着了琴言的灯谜，即","en":"a great family, he remained entirely ignorant of his temperament and predilections, or how he might compare to Duxiang. He harbored the fear that Ziyu might be one of those young men of wealth who were shallow, heartless, and fickle in their affections, or perhaps an arrogant lord of luxury who demanded constant fawning. Yet studying the warmth in his bearing, he seemed"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":4,"tokens":["度香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"变。」琴言默然良久。道：「咳，可惜昨日出去了，没有见他一面。」宝珠试出琴言属意子玉，便道：「你可晓得今日错怪了度香么？」琴言道：「怎么？」宝珠道：「他所说替你觅着的配对，你道是那个？」琴言悄悄的道：「难道就是梅公子不成？」宝珠道：：不是他是谁？」琴言道：「我当是度香有心糟蹋我，却不晓得他所说打灯谜的人就是他。」宝珠道：「据我看来，你同这梅公子大有缘法。我去叫度香","en":"Baozhu, having gauged that Qinyan's affections were fixed on Ziyu, then asked: \\"Do you realize now that you wronged Duxiang today?\\" Qinyan asked: \\"How so?\\" Baozhu explained: \\"The match he said he had found for you, who do you think it is?\\" Qinyan asked softly: \\"Could it really be the Mei young master?\\" Baozhu confirmed: \\"If not him, then who?\\" Qinyan admitted: \\"I thought"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":4,"tokens":["徐子云","子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这里说得热闹，那晓得徐子云同萧次贤，早已转到隔壁套间内，窃听得逼真，把门一推，子云、次贤走将出来，琴言一见，羞得红了脸，就背转身坐了。子云道：「玉侬还怪我不怪我？」琴言低头不语，子云道，「就算我错了一句话，也是无心之言。","en":"While this lively conversation was unfolding, Xu Ziyun and Xiao Cixian had long since slipped around into the adjoining side room and overheard every word with absolute clarity. Pushing the door open, Ziyun and Cixian came out. The moment Qinyan saw them, he flushed crimson with deep embarrassment and turned"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"梅庾香不成？」说得次贤、宝珠都笑起来。宝珠道：「不要说了，他已经明白过来了。我们何不去请了庾香来与他见一见。」子云道：「知道是他不是他，我自有道理。」宝珠、琴言即在怡园吃了晚饭，坐到二更而回。","en":"interjected: \\"Say no more, for he has already understood. Why don't we simply invite Yuxiang here to meet him?\\" Ziyun said: \\"I have my own method of determining whether it is truly him or not.\\" Baozhu and Qinyan dined at the Garden of Contentment that evening, sitting together until the second night-watch before finally returning home."},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"次日，子云即去拜望子玉，彼此道了些景仰渴想的话，就约定于十九日晚间一叙。出来顺道到王恂、刘文泽、史南湘等处看望，俱未晤见。回来想道：「这梅庾香果然名不虚传，玉侬又属意于他，将来见了面，不消说是他的人了。」又想这：「玉侬的脾气，差不多的人都猜摸不着，倘或一言不合","en":"The following day, Ziyun went to call upon Ziyu. They exchanged warm words of mutual admiration and longing, ultimately agreeing to meet for an intimate dinner on the evening of the nineteenth. On his way back, Ziyun stopped at the residences of Wang Xun, Liu Wenze, and Shi"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":4,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"是：梅花万树鼻功德，古屋一山心太平。中悬着林和靖的小像，迎面摆一张雕梅花的紫檀木榻。榻上陈着一张古锦囊的瑶琴。子云让子玉进内坐了，子玉道：「前日斗胆在此试灯，已成不速之客，今日又蒙宠召，坐我瑶斋，主人情重，何以克当？」子云道：「庾香先生，景星卿云，相见恨晚，前日失迓为罪。今蒙不弃，惠然肯来，私心实深欣幸。」子玉问道：「今日坐间尚有何客，静宜先生何以不见？」子云道","en":"intricately carved with plum-blossom designs. Upon it rested a guqin lovingly wrapped in antique brocaded silk. Ziyun invited Ziyu to take his seat inside. Ziyu expressed his gratitude: \\"The other day I had the boldness to come here and try my hand at the lantern riddles, already acting as an uninvited guest. Today I am once again graced with your summons and seated"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":1,"tokens":["徐子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"四句琴铭下，又镌着一行行书小字，是：「山阴徐子云为玉侬杜琴言移赠庾香名士清赏。」下刻图章两方：阴文是「次贤撰句」四字，阳文是「静宜手镌」四字。","en":"Below the elegant four-line inscription flowed a further line in cursive running script: 'Xu Ziyun of Shanyin, on behalf of Yunong Du Qinyan, presents this as a gift for the refined appreciation of the celebrated scholar Yuxiang.' Below this dedication were neatly engraved two seals: one in intaglio reading 'Composed by Cixian,' and one in relief"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉想起宝珠改名之言，知道玉侬就是琴官，却喜出望外，便深深一揖，道了谢，仍令小厮囊好。子云试他道：「闻说吾兄与玉侬相与最深，可是真的么？」子玉道：「弟因家君管教极严，平素足不出户，就只开春初六那日，在姑苏会馆看见他一出《惊梦》的戏，有人说起他的名字叫琴官，觉得色艺俱佳。","en":"expectation. He made a deep and respectful bow of thanks and then directed his page boy to carefully rewrap the qin. Ziyun, testing the waters, said: \\"I have heard that you and Yunong are on the most intimate of terms. Is there truth to this?\\" Ziyu earnestly replied: \\"My family is kept under such strict supervision by my father that ordinarily I am confined strictly to the"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"到前日在此，于无意中询知阁下替他改名为琴言，却从未与他会过，相与之说，恐是讹传。吾兄将来晤见琴言，尚可询问。」子云道：「吾兄赏识不错，可晓得琴言颇有情于吾兄么？」","en":"for the rumors of intimacy, that is surely a misconception. You might ask Qinyan himself when you next see him.\\" Ziyun said: \\"Your appreciation is certainly not misplaced. But are you aware that Qinyan harbors rather deep feelings for you?\\""},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":4,"tokens":["子云","度香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"交。亦必两意眷注，始可言情，断无用情于陌路人之理。琴言之于弟，犹陌路人也。弟已忘情于彼，彼又安能用情于弟乎?」子云道：「据吾兄品评琴言，比前日所见宝珠何如？」子玉因想琴言、宝珠都是子云宠爱，未便轩轾，便道：「大凡品花，必须于既上妆之后，观其体态。又必于已卸妆之后，视其姿容。且必平素熟悉其意趣，熟闻其语言，方能识其情性之真。弟于宝珠、琴言均止一见，一系上妆，一系卸","en":"road. Since I have completely forgotten any thought of him, how could he possibly direct such feeling toward me?\\" Ziyun pressed: \\"According to your own judgment, how does Qinyan compare to the Baozhu you met the other day?\\" Ziyu, mindful that both Qinyan and Baozhu enjoyed Ziyun's favor and unwilling to elevate one at the expense of the other, replied diplomatically:"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"正说着，只见宝珠同着花枝招展的一个人来，子玉一看不是别人，就是朝思暮想的琴言，心里暗暗吃惊。又听得子云道：「玉侬，你的意中人在此，过来见了。」琴言嫣然一笑，走上来请了一个安，倒弄得子玉坐不是，站不是，呆呆的只管看那琴言。那琴言又对子云也请了安。宝珠道：「庾香，我竟遵竹君的教不为礼了。」子玉道：","en":"whom he had yearned day and night: Qinyan. His heart gave a secret, powerful start of surprise. Then he heard Ziyun announce: \\"Yunong, your heart's beloved is here. Come and be properly introduced.\\" Qinyan smiled sweetly, walked gracefully forward, and made a formal greeting bow. This unexpected moment left Ziyu entirely uncertain whether to sit or to stand, and he"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":9,"tokens":["徐子云","子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「原来琴言不过如此，何以那两回车中瞥见如此之好，而唱起戏来又有那样丰神态度呢？而且魏聘才赞不绝口，徐子云又钟情到这样，真令人不解。「一面想，那神色之间，微露出不然之意来。子云却早窥出，颇得意用计之妙。宝珠道：「你们彼此相思已久，今日初次见面，也该说两句知心话，亲热亲热，为什么大家冷冰冰的，都不言语。」说着就拉着琴言的手，送到子玉手内。子云道：「可不是，","en":"stage performance held such immense richness of spirit and manner? And yet Wei Pincai praised him without end, and Xu Ziyun's affection for him runs so astonishingly deep that it truly defies all understanding.\\" As these complex thoughts passed through his mind, a faint trace of genuine disappointment appeared in his expression. Ziyun had already keenly detected it and was"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":1,"tokens":["度香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"的心事么？」子玉把头摇一摇。琴言道：「那瑶琴的灯谜，是你猜着的么？」子玉又把头点一点。又道：「好心思，你可晓得度香的主意么？」子玉又把头摇一摇。琴言用一个指头，将子玉的额抬起来，道：「我听得宝珠说，你背地里很问我，我很感你的情。今日见了面，这里又没有第三个人，为什么倒生分起来？」子玉被他盘问得没法，只得勉强的道：「玉侬，我听说你性气甚是高傲，所以我敬你。为什么到","en":"it truly you who solved it?\\" Ziyu nodded once again. \\"What a wonderfully fine mind. And do you fully comprehend Duxiang's plan?\\" Ziyu shook his head once more. Qinyan raised Ziyu's chin with one finger and said: \\"I heard from Baozhu that behind my back you asked quite extensively about me, and I am profoundly touched by your feeling. Now that we have met today, and there"},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":1,"tokens":["徐度香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"魏聘才之赞扬，固不足信，只可惜徐度香爱博而情不专，惟以人之谄媚奉承为乐，未免纨袴习气。其实焉能□我？」说着，气忿忿的要开镜屏出去，那晓得摸不着消息，任你推送，只是不开。","en":"As for Wei Pincai's lavish praises, they were certainly not to be trusted. But what a tragic pity that Xu Duxiang, loving so widely with feeling spread far too thin, takes such pleasure in the shallow flattery and servility of others. Such is truly the deplorable habit of a pampered young lord. In absolute truth, how could it ever … me?\\" So saying, he angrily made"},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":5,"tokens":["子云","徐度香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"正急的无可如何，只听得镜屏里轻轻的一响，子云、次贤、宝珠都在镜屏之外，迎面笑盈盈的走进来，那琴言一影就不见了，把个子玉吓得迷迷糊糊的。只听得子云笑道：「好个坐怀不乱的柳下惠，失敬，失敬！就是骂我徐度香太挖苦些。」子玉一回转头来，那知众人都在镜屏对面套间之内。子玉与次贤见了礼，即向子云告辞道：「","en":"an utter loss and hovering on the very edge of despair, a soft, distinct sound was heard at the mirror screen. Ziyun, Cixian, and Baozhu, their faces adorned with smiles, walked in gracefully from the other side of the screen. At that precise instant, the figure of Qinyan vanished without a single trace, leaving Ziyu utterly dazed and bewildered. Then he heard Ziyun"},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":3,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"面。次贤道：「足下是客，那有代主人送酒之理。」子玉始知错了坐位，只好将错就错的送了一杯，定了神，又替主人把盏。子云再三谦让，便道：「这杯酒我代庾香兄转敬一人。」就摆在子玉肩下道：「玉侬，你坐到这里来。」琴言只得依了，斟了一杯酒送在子云面前。又与宝珠斟了酒，然后入席。\\n天色已暮，点上灯来。子玉道：「今日之事甚奇，方才难道是梦境迷离。」说得合席都笑，琴言向来不肯轻易","en":"the best of the awkward mistake by sending a cup, composing himself, and then refilling the host's cup. After Ziyun had declined with repeated, gracious courtesies, he said: \\"I will convey this cup on behalf of Brother Yuxiang to one special person.\\" And he placed it at the seat beside Ziyu, instructing: \\"Yunong, come and sit here.\\" Qinyan had no choice but to gracefully"},{"paragraph":31,"mentions":1,"tokens":["度香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"次贤道：「庾香兄，今日可曾见那瑶琴上镌的字么？」子玉道：「我倒忘了道谢，铁笔古心，的是名手。但此灯谜也还易打，度香先生所说为玉侬而设，究竟不知其故？」","en":"work of a highly skilled hand. But as for the lantern riddle, it was not so very difficult to solve. As for what Duxiang said about it being arranged for Yunong, I confess I still do not quite understand his true meaning.\\""},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云指着琴言道：「弟是为他看我制灯谜时，喜诵「落花」、「微雨」两句。又因他名字是琴，所以借此为彩，原是要替他卜个生平知己。可巧是吾兄猜着，不枉弟一番作合之心。」子玉道：「却之不恭，受之有愧，当为玉侬珍重藏之。」琴言面有豫色。宝珠见了，将唐诗改了一字念道：","en":"Ziyun pointed to Qinyan and explained: \\"This younger brother of mine set the riddle because he watched me compose it, and Qinyan loved to recite the two poetic lines about 'fallen flowers' and 'gentle rain.' And because his name contains the character for"},{"paragraph":33,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉看琴言颜色微愠，知是宝珠以他名字为戏，便道：「若非瑶卿胸有智珠，不能改得如此敏妙。」子云等还道是寻常赞语，惟有琴言深感子玉之情，替他报复了这个琴字。次贤道：「今日玉侬，何以一言不发？」子云道：「他本来像息夫人似的，将来静宜可将那「花如解语还多事，石不能言最可人」，替他写一副对子。」子玉只管点头。宝珠道：「他是只会作梦，那里会说话？」琴言","en":"avenging the slight of that character 'qin.' Cixian asked: \\"Why has Yunong not said a single word all evening?\\" Ziyun replied: \\"He is like the legendary Lady Xi, who steadfastly refused to speak. In the future, Jingyi, you might write him a couplet with those lines:\\n\\n'If flowers could speak they would only cause trouble;\\nThe stone that cannot speak is the most admirable.'"},{"paragraph":35,"mentions":4,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云见子玉、琴言两意相投的光景，便道：「庾香兄不是有事么？为什么不打发人回去，我们可以畅饮。」子玉支吾道：「虽有小事，迟到明日尚却不妨。足下好客，可惜前日同来的一班好友都不在此。」子云道：「他们是常来的，不妨另日再叙。」子玉道：「此外尚有个卓然高品。」子","en":"Ziyun, perceiving that Ziyu and Qinyan were already mutually and deeply drawn to each other, suggested: \\"Did not Brother Yuxiang say he had something to attend to? Why not send someone home with word? We could then drink freely to our hearts' absolute content.\\""},{"paragraph":36,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"宝珠道：「我们今日何不以玉侬说话为令，他说一句话，我们合席饮一杯。」子云笑道：「这令很新，就是这样。」子玉道：「说一句话，合席饮一杯酒，这个令未免酒太多。他和谁说，谁饮一杯不好么？」琴言点头。宝珠道：「这个恐怕有弊。」子云道：「不妨，就吃醉了，我有醒酒丸。」于是大家依允。","en":"rule for this evening based on Yunong's speaking? Every time he says a sentence, the whole table drinks a cup.\\" Ziyun laughed warmly: \\"What a novel rule. Let it be so.\\" Ziyu reasoned: \\"For every sentence spoken, the whole table must drink a cup; that would mean far too much wine. Would it not be better if each person he speaks to drinks a cup?\\" Qinyan nodded in agreement."},{"paragraph":37,"mentions":4,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴言问子云道：「是什么醒酒丸？这丸叫什么名字？」子云一一说了，共是两杯。琴言问次贤道：「今日为什么回来得这样迟？」次贤道：「替人做媒，回来迟了。」也饮一杯。琴言把子玉看了一看，都不言语，回转头来问子云道：「这园梅花共有多少株？」宝珠咳嗽一声，子云道：「约有二千","en":"Qinyan asked Ziyun: \\"What sobering pills are those? What are they called?\\" Ziyun answered each question in turn, which came to two cups for himself. Qinyan then asked Cixian: \\"Why did you return so late today?\\" Cixian replied: \\"I was acting as a matchmaker and came back"},{"paragraph":38,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"宝珠过来，替子云斟了，就便向子云耳边说了一句。琴言道：「你们改令，是要罚十杯。」子玉道：「没有人改的。」宝珠过来要与子玉斟酒，琴言把子玉的杯子拿了道：「我又没有和他说话，为什么要给他酒吃呢？」宝珠道：「他和你说话也是一样。」琴言道：「这个我不依。」子玉倒不好意思道：","en":"Baozhu came over and filled Ziyun's cup, then leaned over and whispered something secretively in his ear. Qinyan warned: \\"If you change the rules, the penalty is ten cups.\\" Ziyu put in: \\"No one changed anything.\\" Baozhu came over to fill Ziyu's cup. Qinyan took up Ziyu's cup and argued:"},{"paragraph":39,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云虽曾经握过，此时也只能艳羡而已。子玉忆起日间那个琴言的手，又粗又黑，始知必非一人。宝珠心生一计，便道：","en":"Ziyun, though he had once clasped that hand himself, could now only look on in deep, admiring envy. Ziyu thought of the hand of that daytime Qinyan, rough and dark, and understood at long last that they must be two different people entirely. Baozhu thought"},{"paragraph":40,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"纤玉手作什么？」琴言把手一缩，宝珠随即取了这杯酒，送在子玉手内。琴言向子玉道：「这杯酒你偏不要吃。」子玉答应。子云道：「玉侬你该替我作主人，敬客一杯才是。」宝珠接口道：「况这个令，那头一句话，就不算向庾香说的，难道这句话也是和别人说的不成？」琴言想了一想，这话有理，只得一笑。","en":"it directly in Ziyu's hand. Qinyan turned to Ziyu: \\"You must not drink this cup.\\" Ziyu said nothing in reply. Ziyun instructed: \\"Yunong, you should represent me as host and offer a cup to our honored guest.\\" Baozhu chimed in: \\"Besides, under this rule, that very first sentence was not addressed to Yuxiang either. Could it really have been said to someone else?\\" Qinyan"},{"paragraph":42,"mentions":4,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"宝珠笑道：「这个要问你的玉侬。」子云笑着唤道：「玉龄！你再来给梅少爷瞧瞧。」只见里面套间内走出一个人来，却是头里那个假琴言，垂手正色，侍立在子云身旁。这假琴言是华公子家八龄班内的一个，名字叫玉龄，本是子云家人，送给华公子。因其面貌有些相像，所以叫回应用。这就是子云移花接木之计。","en":"Baozhu laughed brightly: \\"That is something you must ask your own Yunong.\\" Ziyun, still laughing, called out: \\"Yuling! Come and show yourself again for Master Mei.\\" From the inner suite there emerged a person. It was the false Qinyan from before, standing with arms at his sides, composed and upright, attending quietly beside Ziyun."},{"paragraph":43,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉一见，颇难为情，始恍然知初见那个琴言，实在是假的，疑团尽释。子云道：「我是要试试庾香的眼力，所以刻画无盐，唐突西子。今果被识透，足见高明。」就令玉龄取了两个大玉杯来道：「你代我敬梅少爷一杯。」玉龄斟了，送与子玉。子玉接着道：「酒已多了，天也不早了，我们用饭罢。」子云道：「吾兄若不饮这杯酒，是真怪小弟了。玉龄你替我","en":"wonderfully clear: the Qinyan he had first seen was truly the false one. All his lingering doubts dissolved at once. Ziyun explained: \\"I wanted to test Brother Yuxiang's discernment, and so deliberately presented an inferior likeness to impose upon a true beauty. That you saw right through it proves your keen, exceptional perception.\\" He then directed Yuling to bring two"},{"paragraph":44,"mentions":3,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉今日初会琴言，天姿国色已经心醉。又饮这一大杯，虽说酒落欢肠，究竟饮已过量，觉得眼前花花绿绿的，支持不住。子云不敢再敬。大家吃饭，洗漱毕，子玉便要告辞。倒是琴言恐怕他醉了不受用，向子云要了一服仙桃益寿丸，泡制好了，吹得不甚热，给子玉服了。不多一会，子玉心里十分清爽，又把琴言饱看了一番，虽彼此衷曲不能在人前细剖，却已心许目成，意在不言之表了。子玉令云儿抱了瑶琴","en":"and before his eyes the world dissolved into a swirling haze of colors. He could no longer hold himself steady. Ziyun dared not offer any more. They all ate their rice, washed, and then Ziyu prepared to take his leave. It was Qinyan who, deeply concerned that he might be unwell from the wine, asked Ziyun for a dose of the Immortal Peach Longevity Pills, prepared them"}],"11":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":4,"tokens":["徐子云","子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说徐子云送子玉出园之后，与萧次贤谈了一会，即便回宅。子云的住宅也离园不远，就在对面，还是他曾祖老太爷住的相府，府中极其宽大。现在父母、兄嫂都不在京住。此宅内仅子云夫妇二人，其余都是家人。子云与他夫人讲起琴言、子玉的事来，又羡慕他们缱绻的情致。袁氏夫人微笑，即","en":"After escorting Ziyu out of the garden, Xu Ziyun lingered a moment to converse with Xiao Cixian before wending his way homeward. His own residence, the vast and imposing ancestral mansion built by his late great-grandfather the Grand Chancellor, lay only a short distance across the road. With his parents,"},{"paragraph":2,"mentions":5,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「这些相公对了你们怎样的光景，到底有甚好处？」子云笑道：「这些人你都见过，也听过他们的戏，难道还说不好？」袁夫人道：「我见他们唱戏时，也不过摹拟那闺阁的模样。至于下妆时，也还生得清清秀秀。若要说他是无价的至宝，我就不知。据我看来，似乎还不及我这几个丫头。」子云道：「你们眼里看着，自然是女孩子好。但我","en":"\\"These young gentlemen of the stage, what enchanting spell do they cast to so thoroughly captivate you all?\\" Ziyun answered with a laugh: \\"You have laid eyes on them and heard their songs. Can you truly claim they lack a certain exquisite charm?\\" \\"To my eye,\\" Mrs. Yuan replied, \\"they merely mimic the delicate graces of sheltered maidens when they perform. Even unadorned,"}],"12":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说袁夫人自华府回来，到家已晚，换了衣服，卸了花钿，便与子云说起所行的令，并将婢女们的也说了，子云连声说好。","en":"Hua household that evening, she arrived home late, changed her clothes and removed her ornaments, and then told Ziyun all about the wine-game they had played, including the maids' entries. Ziyun praised it all enthusiastically."},{"paragraph":41,"mentions":1,"tokens":["徐度香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"！」王恂道：「你前日送他二百金，不上半月，竟已化为乌有。这人这样行为，就再送给他二百金，也是无济于事。除非要将徐度香的家私分一半与他，才够他挥霍。但人到断炊，也不成件事了。依我想，我们如今再帮他百金，存在卓然处，教他相机行事，慢慢点化他。或者凭卓然那张嘴，倒还劝得转他，也未可知。仲清亦以为然。王恂即备了百金，交与仲清送至高品处。未知后事如何，且听下回分解。","en":"behaves, sending him another two hundred taels would be equally useless. Unless you were to divide half of Xu Duxiang's entire fortune and give it to him — then he would have something to squander. But a man who cannot even keep his kitchen fire going is in a sorry state. In my view, we might help him with another hundred taels right now, to be held at Zhuoran's, who"}],"13":[{"paragraph":7,"mentions":1,"tokens":["度香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"垫，炕几上供着一个粉定窑长方磁盆，开着五六箭素心兰。正面挂着六幅金笺的小楷，却是一人一幅，写得停匀娟秀。一幅是度香主人，一幅是静宜逸士，一幅是竹君词客，一幅是剑潭山人，一幅是前舟外史，一幅是庸庵居士。像是几首和韵七律诗。再看上款，是媚香嘱和《长河修禊》七律六章原韵，春航心里更加起敬。想道：","en":"gold-flecked paper, each written by a different hand in balanced, elegant calligraphy. The signatures included \\"Master of Duxiang\\", \\"The Recluse Jingyi\\", \\"The Lyricist Zhujun\\", \\"The Mountain Man Jiantan\\", \\"The Unofficial Historian Qianzhou\\", and \\"The Lay Scholar Yong'an\\". They appeared to be matching seven-character regulated verse poems. Looking closer at the dedication, it read:"}],"14":[{"paragraph":29,"mentions":2,"tokens":["度香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"？我今日同了静芳到怡园，他们都在家，留我吃了饭。佩仙也在座，还有瑶卿、瘦香两个。吃完了饭，佩仙家内有人来叫他，度香问起来，方知道是你叫的，我就辞了度香同来。」即指玉林手内的花道：「今日就在那里赏杏花。」又问高品道：「你又几时会弹琴，你要学琴，须我教你。方才这《水仙操》倒也弹得好。」高品道：「我何尝会弹？弹琴的就是田湘帆。」南湘已听见仲清讲过田湘帆的才学，便道：「","en":"there too, along with Yaoqing and Shouxiang. After dinner, someone came from Peixian's household to fetch him. Duxiang asked about it and that's how I learned you had summoned them, so I took leave of Duxiang and came along.\\" He pointed at the blossom in Yulin's hand and said, \\"We were enjoying the apricot blossoms over there today.\\" Then he asked Gao Pin: \\"Since when"}],"15":[{"paragraph":7,"mentions":2,"tokens":["度香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"：「恭喜，恭喜！你瞒着我们定的好情。」子玉只当说他定亲，倒害躁起来。文泽道：「定得什么情？」南湘道：「前日我在度香处，他说有个叫杜玉侬，是古往今来第一个名旦，被庾香独占去子。他们还在怡园唱了一出《定情》。」文泽道：「那个叫杜玉侬？我们怎么也没有见过。」南湘道：「好得很。据度香、静宜品题，似乎在宝珠之上，我却不认得。庾香今日何不同我们去赏鉴赏鉴？」子玉听了，才知不","en":"betrothal and became flustered. Wenze said, \\"What attachment is this?\\" Nanxiang said, \\"The other day I was at Duxiang's place; he told me there is a young dan actor called Du Yunong — the finest name actor of all ages past and present — and that Yuxiang has taken exclusive possession of him. They even performed a scene from 'Fixing Affection' (定情) at the Garden of Contentment"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":1,"tokens":["徐子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"玉侬于庾香的情，可为二十四分了，不知庾香与玉侬的情怎样，你可知道？」素兰道：「怎么不知道？也是瑶卿说的。」又将徐子云将假琴言试子玉的情节，说了一番，听得南湘、文泽笑了又赞，赞了又笑。子玉十分难受，只得说道：「些须小事，一经人道，便添出无数枝叶来了。」当下素兰又遣人去问，琴言尚未回来。吃过饭，讲了些闲话，子玉便要素兰写的字。素兰道：「现成的却没有。」说罢便往里面去，","en":"Sulan said, \\"How could I not know? That too was told to me by Yaoqing.\\" He then recounted the whole episode of Xu Ziyun testing Ziyu with the false Qinyan, and Nanxiang and Wenze laughed and praised it by turns. Ziyu found this all very difficult to bear, and could only say: \\"Such small matters, once they pass through others' mouths, they sprout a hundred embellishments.\\""},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":3,"tokens":["徐子云","子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"那日徐子云也在旗亭送行回来，且不进宅，一径到园，即到次贤屋里，始知次贤在桃花坞赏桃花，还有宝珠、漱芳两个，子云就到桃花坞来。虽是自己园中，也不能天天游览，数日之间，已见桃花开满，烂若晴霞，映着一水盈盈，草茵如绣，真觉春光已满。走进了第三重，始见曲榭之中，次贤与","en":"That day Xu Ziyun had also been at the roadside inn for the farewell; rather than returning directly to his residence, he went straight to the garden and on to Cixian's room — where he learned that Cixian was in the Peach Blossom Dell enjoying the peach blossoms, along"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云笑道：「静宜，今日竟偏我独乐了。」次贤道：「我知道你今日早回，先已虚左而待。」漱芳道：「你不见摆了四个坐儿么！？」子云即在次贤对面坐了。","en":"Ziyun laughed: \\"Jingyi, today you've entirely left me out of your pleasures.\\" Cixian said, \\"Knowing you would return early today, I left a seat waiting for you.\\" Shufang said, \\"Did you not notice there are four places set?\\" Ziyun sat down across from Cixian."},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"次贤问道：「今日送行的人多么？」子云道：「人倒不少，庾香、剑潭送到前站宿店去了，要明日才回。」即指着宝珠笑道：」惟有他们同队中，不见有一个人在那里送行，只怕这位老先生，生平也没有叫过他们。」宝珠笑道：「这位梅大人，每逢戏酒，叫我们也伺候过几回，人倒谦雅的，就总没有赏过一句话儿。倒不料他","en":"Cixian asked: \\"Were there many people at the farewell today?\\" Ziyun said, \\"Quite a few — Yuxiang and Jiantan went to see him off to the first inn overnight, so they will not be back until tomorrow.\\" He then pointed with a smile at Baozhu: \\"I dare say none of those in their party were here to see him off; I suspect this"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":5,"tokens":["度香","子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"得了，将来必要找出多少苦恼的事情来，你们慢慢的看着他们罢。」当下这四人喝了一会酒，看了一会花，次贤对宝珠道：「度香所刻那十六个酒令，你们看见没有？」宝珠道：「怎么没有看见。」子云道：「你们今日何不也照这令行几个出来，也见见你们的心思。」宝珠尚未回答，漱芳道：「这个我们只怕行不来，一来心思欠灵，二来这唐诗与《诗经》也不甚熟，那里能说得这样凑拍？除非在家里把几种书翻","en":"them drank for a while and enjoyed the blossoms. Cixian said to Baozhu: \\"Those sixteen drinking-game lines that Duxiang had engraved — have you seen them?\\" Baozhu said, \\"Of course we have.\\" Ziyun said, \\"Why don't you two today compose a few rounds of your own in the same vein? It would give us a chance to see what your minds can produce.\\" Before Baozhu could answer, Shufang"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"《诗经》上有一句什么永叹？我记不真。」次贤道：「每有良朋，况也永叹。」宝珠道：「有是有了一个，只就是不甚好。」子云道：「你且说来。」宝珠念道：绿暗红稀，梦好更寻难，你晚妆楼上杏花残。懒画眉，况也永叹。","en":"companions,\\nAll the more do I sigh without end.'\\"\\n\\nBaozhu said, \\"Good, that's one. Only it's not the most apt.\\" Ziyun said, \\"Go ahead and say it.\\" Baozhu recited:\\n\\n\\"The shadows of green, the scarceness of red,\\nGood dreams are rare to find again.\\nIn the twilight upon your powder-tower the apricot blossoms are spent.\\nToo weary to paint the brows,\\nAll the more do I sigh"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"次贤、子云赞道：「说得很好，第一个就这么通，真是难得。就这《诗经》一句稍差了些，然而也还说得过。」宝珠道：「这《诗经》实在难于凑拍，又要依这个韵，觉得更难了。」漱芳道：「我想的更不好。《诗经》上不是有一句「莫我肯顾」么？」子云道：「有。你快说。」漱芳要念时，重","en":"Cixian and Ziyun both praised him: \\"Very well said, and so coherent for the first one! Truly exceptional. The one line from *The Classic of Poetry* is slightly less apt, but it still works.\\" Baozhu said, \\"The Classic of Poetry is genuinely difficult to fit rhythmically,"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":4,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云道：「这个说得甚好，竟句句凑拍。」次贤道：「倒实在难为他。」宝珠道：「他的比我好，不比我的杂凑。」便觉两颊微红，大有愧色。子云安慰道：「你的也好，不过你的题目宽泛些，难于贴切。他这苏秦背剑的题目就好，所以比你的容易见长。」宝珠得了这一番宽慰，稍为意解","en":"Ziyun said, \\"This is excellently done. Every phrase fits in perfect cadence.\\" Cixian said, \\"It really is a remarkable achievement.\\" Baozhu said, \\"His is better than mine. It leaves mine looking rather mediocre.\\" Yet slight color rose in both cheeks, and there"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云等大赞。漱芳道：「你们知道他这「四边静，爱而不见」，是说得什么？」次贤笑道：「大有春恨怀人之致。」子云也笑。漱芳笑道：「不是。他昨日飞去一个秦吉了。我昨日到他那里去，正遇着他急急的跑出房来，四下张看。","en":"Ziyun and the others praised it greatly. Shufang said, \\"Do you know what this \\"all around is still, cherished but unseen\\" of his is really about?\\" Cixian smiled: \\"There is a deep charm of spring longing and yearning for someone.\\" Ziyun also laughed. Shufang"},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":3,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"打破锦屏风，暮色满房栊，吉丁当敲响帘拢。月儿高，何以穿我墉。\\n子云等大赞，子云道：「这个实在妙极了，就在那十六令中也是上等。我们恭贺三杯。」宝珠始为解颜欢喜。漱芳心里又着急起来．恐怕再行，不能及他，便道：「算了罢！实在费心得很，我不掷了。」子云道：「这令原也费心，但只五个，他得了三个。你才两个，你再掷一个罢？」漱芳","en":"latticed chamber.\\nJing-dong-dang, the curtain rings clatter.\\nThe moon is high.\\nWhereby to pierce through my wall.\\"\\n\\nZiyun and the others praised it highly. Ziyun said, \\"This is truly excellent. Even among those sixteen forfeits, it would rank in the top tier. Let us drink three cups in congratulation.\\" Only then did Baozhu truly smile with satisfaction. Shufang began to"},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，须要不重的才有趣。」漱芳不得已，掷了好几个重迭色样，然后才掷出一个楚汉争锋，便道：「掷了这个，就算完结了。」子云应允。漱芳便构思起来，一人独自走到桃花丛中去了。子云等也到花丛中游玩，漱芳道：「我想倒想着了一个，就是《唐诗》这一句还有些牵强，若除了这一句，我又找不出第二句来，只好将就些罢。」便念道：楚汉争锋，君王自神武，你助神威擂三通鼓。急三枪，百夫之御。","en":"getting \\"Chu and Han Contend for Supremacy\\" (楚汉争锋). He said, \\"Now that I've thrown this, I'll call it the last one.\\" Ziyun agreed. Shufang composed himself in thought and walked off alone among the peach blossom thicket. Ziyun and the others also strolled through the flowers. After a while Shufang said: \\"I have thought of something — only this line from the Tang poetry still"},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":7,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"大家赞好。子云道：「今日又得了六个，共有二十二个了，将来能凑成一百个就好了。」次贤道：「一百个是不能，况且骨牌名没有这许多，曲牌名是尽够，不如去了这骨牌名换个别样，或者凑得成百数。若用骨牌名，可用的也不过五六十个，内中有几个有趣的，偏掷不着，如公领孙、锺馗抹额、贪","en":"Ziyun said, \\"Today we have produced six more, bringing our total to twenty-two. It would be wonderful if we could eventually collect a full hundred.\\" Cixian said, \\"A hundred is not attainable. Besides, there are not that many bone-tile names (gǔ pái míng)."}],"16":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":2,"tokens":["徐度香","度香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"或把酒清谈，或题诗分韵，所来往者刘文泽、颜仲清等为最密。而怡园徐度香一月间亦过访几次，或遇，或不遇。盖度香局面阔大，现处福地，为富贵神仙，所以干谒者纷纷而来，应酬甚繁。","en":"freely, or compose poetry and assign rhymes; of these companions Liu Wenze and Yan Zhongqing were the closest. Xu Duxiang from the Garden of Contentment also paid several visits during the month, though they did not always meet. Because Duxiang commanded a grand presence and currently occupied a position of prosperity, he was viewed as a celestial being of wealth and status."},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":2,"tokens":["度香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"忽又问起度香南边定织来的绸缎，可有那折枝梅没有，杂花的有没有？难为度香竟找出几匹来，如今现做了袍子、袄儿穿上了。你说这个心思奇不奇，不是为你是为谁？」子玉听了便觉一阵心酸，止不住流下泪来，要说话。喉间若有物噎住说不出，只呆呆的看着素兰。素兰又道：「到底你们是怎样","en":"\\"Then he suddenly asked if the bolts of silk ordered from the south for Duxiang included any patterned with plum branches, or perhaps mixed flowers. Remarkably, Duxiang managed to find several bolts, and Yunong has already had robes and padded jackets tailored from them, wearing them constantly. Tell me, is this obsession not extraordinary?"},{"paragraph":31,"mentions":3,"tokens":["度香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"以度香之百般体贴，亦算温柔乡中一个知己。我看玉侬待他，不如待君十分之二，难得度香更加爱惜，说道：「人各有缘，此中系天定，非人情能强。」且庾香属意玉侬一人，毫不移动，此真是多情种子，非玉侬不足为庾香赏识，非庾香不足为玉侬眷恋。《国风》好色而不淫，其庾香、玉侬","en":"\\"Despite all of Duxiang's gentle warmth and devoted attentions, he is merely a kindred spirit in the realm of affection. I can see that Yunong's regard for him is not even a fraction of what he feels for you. Yet Duxiang cherishes him all the more, believing that 'each has"},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":3,"tokens":["度香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"：「我与玉侬要见一面，都如此之难。今日天也不早了，我也要回去，你明日见他时代为致意，说不可如此。必要保重身体；度香处倒要常去走走，不要叫人见怪。我是不能常出门的，迟几天再见。你若见了度香，也为我多多致谢。歇一天我们去逛他园子呢。」素兰道：「你几时出来，约定日子到我这里来，我约玉侬过来，倒是我这里清净。他师傅有些脾气，偏偏玉侬遭逢着他，也是玉侬运气不好。」子玉道：","en":"convey my regards and tell him he must not continue like this. He must prioritize his health. He should visit Duxiang's place more often to avoid idle gossip. I cannot go out frequently, but we will meet in a few days. If you see Duxiang, please convey my deepest thanks to him as well. Someday soon, we should all gather for an outing in his garden.\\" Sulan replied, \\"Whenever"}],"17":[{"paragraph":4,"mentions":2,"tokens":["徐度香","度香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"王恂道：「你们可不是说徐度香么！我非遗漏，我恐他的事情多。未必能来。」子玉道：「度香应酬虽多，然看其性情光景，我们请他，虽有事也必来的。就是萧静宜，也断不可不请。」大家说：「很好，就添上这两位是了。那是九个，合上那八个，是十七个，也就很热闹了。」南湘道：「没有人了？」王恂道：「","en":"Wang Xun said: \\"Are you speaking of Xu Duxiang? I had not forgotten him; I only feared his social obligations were too numerous and he might be unable to attend.\\" Ziyu said: \\"Though Duxiang has many engagements, judging by his temperament, if we invite him, he will certainly come regardless of his"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":1,"tokens":["度香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"揆。点鸳鸯之卅六，红豆齐抛；备翡翠之千双，紫云任请。\\n肃笺申启，代面丁宁。\\n早发高轩，同光下里。梅子玉顿白。上度香先生、静宜逸士阁下。\\n子玉写完封好，用上图章，即付小厮交与门房，明早着人送到怡园，后日请徐、萧二位老爷，同到刘大少爷宅内饮酒，须要交代明白。小厮答应了，子玉亦即安寝，一夜无话。","en":"and grace our humble lane with your radiant presence. Mei Ziyu bows in respect. To the honored desks of Master Duxiang and the recluse Jingyi.\\"\\n\\nHaving finished writing and sealed the letter, he affixed his seal and handed it to a page to deliver to the gatehouse, instructing that it be sent to the Garden of Contentment first thing the next morning, to invite Masters"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":1,"tokens":["徐度香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"下。无奈春航磊落自负，以干谒为耻，未尝怀刺一谒要津，宁居萧寺，玉人作伴，名士同声。蕙芳又替他结交了许多好友，如徐度香、萧静宜、刘文泽、史南湘、颜仲清、王恂等。仲清前与春航不睦，原是激励春航之意；经高品将其中情节剖明，又说起仲清仍送五十金作浇裹之费，春航自然十分感激敬佩。仲清叫蕙芳为之转弯，更觉比前相好。惟有子玉，尚未谋面。是日知文泽等为蕙芳做生日，心上虽十分欢喜，","en":"side and celebrated men of the same voice. Huifang also helped him befriend many worthy companions, such as Xu Duxiang, Xiao Jingyi, Liu Wenze, Shi Nanxiang, Yan Zhongqing, and Wang Xun. Zhongqing's previous discord with Chunhang had originally been intended to spur Chunhang onward; after Gao Pin illuminated the underlying circumstances, and mentioned that Zhongqing"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":2,"tokens":["徐老爷","子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"粹之情，皎皎乎有出群之致。怪不得杜玉侬倾倒如此，与我田郎可谓瑜亮并生矣！」子玉又与陆素兰等相见，忽听外面说：「徐老爷同萧老爷来了。」众人一齐出厅迎接，只见子云同了次贤翩翩的，俨似太原公子裼裘而来，后面随着袁宝珠、王兰保二人。再后还有八个清俊书童，拿着衣包、铜盆、漱盂等物。","en":"\\"Master Xu and Master Xiao have arrived!\\" Everyone went out from the hall together to welcome them; there came Ziyun and Cixian, moving gracefully as scions of great families draped in their furs, with Yuan Baozhu and Wang Lanbao following behind. Further back were eight bright-faced and handsome young attendants carrying clothing bundles, bronze basins, and rinsing"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":3,"tokens":["子云","度香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"蕙芳抢上几步行了礼，子云、次贤两边扶起来道：「媚香一向洒脱，今日忽然拘礼，不是倒累了你了。」遂进室内，与诸人相见，群旦亦都见毕，叙齿坐下。子云道：「蒙庾香、前舟及诸兄折柬相招，今日之举，可为极盛。昨已饱读庾香珠玉，今日尚觉齿有余芬。又复当此群花大会，使弟等附骥餐芳，实为快事","en":"Huifang stepped forward several paces to bow; Ziyun and Cixian each helped him up from one side and said: \\"Meixiang has always been easy and unconstrained, so why so formal today? Surely you are putting us to too much trouble.\\" They then entered the room and exchanged greetings with all present. All the"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"齿罢了。文泽送酒，先定中间一席。论齿是次贤为长，次贤自知不能推逊，只得依了，并坐者为高品，次是仲清；左首一席，子云为首，次南湘，次子玉；右首一席，田春航为首，次王恂，文泽作陪。是每席三位。","en":"could not refuse, he took the seat of honor, with Gao Pin beside him, then Zhongqing. The left-hand table had Ziyun at the head, then Nanxiang, then Ziyu. The right-hand table had Tian Chunhang at the head, then Wang Xun, with Wenze as host. There were three guests at each table."},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"也赢得你。」文泽道：「今日我们亦算极乐了，可惜花部中少了两人，那个还不要紧，第一是琴言不来，使庾香不能畅意。」子云道：「可不是！琴言的病颇为古怪，精神疲软，饮食不思，已经十余天了，不见好。」次贤道：「我昨日诊他的脉，似积劳，兼之感愤忧郁，昨日痰中竟有血点，非静养数月不能痊愈。」","en":"other is no great matter, but first and foremost Qinyan's absence has prevented Yuxiang from being fully at ease.\\" Ziyun said: \\"Indeed! Qinyan's illness is rather mysterious: listless in spirit, no desire to eat or drink; it has been over ten days with no improvement.\\" Cixian said: \\"Yesterday I took his pulse, and it appeared to be accumulated fatigue compounded by pent-up"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"呢，弟当效劳。至于高文典册，自有群公大手笔在。山人寒瘦之语，不称金谷繁华，反使名花减色。」众人道：「太谦了。」子云道：「今日起意是因媚香，引得百花齐放，胜唐宫之剪彩。弟意欲仰观诸兄珠玉，先作一联句何如？」众人道：「最好。」春航道：「古体呢，近体？」次贤道：「近体发挥难透，人多恐易平直，不如古体罢。」","en":"Golden Valley, and would only diminish the beauty of the famous flowers.\\" Everyone said: \\"You are too modest.\\" Ziyun said: \\"Today's idea arose because of Meixiang, drawing forth the blooming of a hundred flowers, surpassing even the cut silk flowers of the Tang palace. I would like to gaze upon the pearls and jade of all the gentlemen. How about we compose a linked"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"于是以年齿为先后，仍系次贤为首，次子云，次高品，次南湘，次文泽，次仲清，次春航，次王恂，次子玉，共是九人。王恂已将子玉叫醒，净净脸，素兰取出一颗醒酒丸给子玉吃了。子玉不好意思，只得勉强扎挣。素兰见子玉不语不言，似醉非醉，心上猜着是为琴言未来。一因人多不好解慰他，二因提起琴言反恐倒勾他的心","en":"So they proceeded in order of age, with Cixian again taking the lead, followed by Ziyun, then Gao Pin, then Nanxiang, then Wenze, then Zhongqing, then Chunhang, then Wang Xun, and finally Ziyu, making nine people in all. Wang Xun had already roused Ziyu and had him wash his face; Sulan brought out a sobering pill and gave it to Ziyu to"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"大家听了，各写出了，注了「静」字。应是子云，子云道：「底下应该各人两句才是。」略踌躇了一会，也即写道：「日日春风吹不散。散花天女好新奇。」众人也写了，注上「云」字，齐说道：「接得很妙，第三句一开，使人便有生发了。」应到高品，也不思索，即写道：「剪彩为花撒天半。花情花貌越精神。」众人皆道：「好","en":"Everyone listened, wrote their lines, and noted the character 'jing'. Next should be Ziyun; Ziyun said: \\"After this everyone should write two lines each.\\" He pondered for a moment, then wrote: \\"Day by day the spring breeze blows but does not scatter them; / The scattering flowers of the heavenly maidens are newly marvelous.\\" Everyone wrote"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"蝶倒有些难对。」因细细的凝思，仲清道：「快交卷子，外边吹打要开门了。」文泽道：「有了。鸳鸯虽小总相亲。」次贤、子云道：「这却对得好，又工又切。」南湘道：「也亏他。」文泽就放下笔，仲清道：「怎么一句就算了？」提醒了文泽，笑道：「你催得紧，我忘了。」又想一想，写道：「化工细选无瑕琢。」众人道：「此句亦出得好，又转韵了。」仲清接着写道：「一一雕镌设眉目。费尽龙宫十斛珠","en":"open the gates.\\" Wenze said: \\"I have it. Though the mandarin ducks are small, they are always close.\\" Cixian and Ziyun said: \\"That is a fine match, both skillful and apt.\\" Nanxiang said: \\"Credit to him.\\" Wenze laid down his brush; Zhongqing said: \\"How can one line be enough?\\" Wenze laughed: \\"You pushed so hard, I forgot.\\" He thought a moment more and wrote: \\"The Creator's"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"解其故，不过见其兴致不佳，故尔意不在诗，空衍了些。该又是次贤，接道：「镜里芙蓉睡新足。宛转歌成白纻词。」又转到子云，接道：「娇柔解唱红绡曲。清颖偶触便魂销。」高品道：「魂消兮可奈何？」即写道：「铜雀春深大小乔。花有连枝称姊妹。」南湘道：「好便好，铜雀句有些打混。」即对道：「玉如合璧定琼瑶。纤腰扭入灵和柳」众人皆赞道：「这姊妹花，琼瑶玉实在对得好。局势又振得整齐了","en":"\\"In the mirror, the lotus face, fresh from sleep;\\nthe charming voice forms the white-ramie song.\\"\\n\\nNext came Ziyun:\\n\\n\\"Lithe and pliant, knowing how to sing the red-gauze melody;\\na clear and nimble beauty, touched by chance, the soul is lost.\\"\\n\\nGao Pin said: \\"'The soul is lost'; alas, what can be done?\\" And wrote:\\n\\n\\"In the Bronze Sparrow's deep spring, the greater"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"王恂对道：「冯子都非浪得名。迟迟长昼当初夏。」文泽道：「冯子都如今有个冯子佩，倒像弟兄呢。」子云道：「冯子佩原不错，他有一种脾气，他偏不肯在群花堆里取乐。」王兰保冷笑道：「他自然不肯在我们堆里，他见我们还要生气呢。」子玉道：「何故？」桂保接口道：「他有他的心肠。」子玉接道：「绮席花筵日易夜。英华美可咏同车。」二轮又到次贤，遂写道：「元白诗原结莲","en":"pass in the early summer.\\"\\n\\nWenze said: \\"Feng Zidu. Nowadays there is a Feng Zipei; they seem like brothers.\\" Ziyun said: \\"Feng Zipei is actually not bad; he has one particular trait: he simply refuses to take pleasure among the flower company.\\" Wang Lanbao said with a cold laugh: \\"Of course he won't join our crowd; he actually gets annoyed when he sees us.\\" Ziyu"},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"高品带笑，慢慢的写将出来，道：「雨云行得到中阿。」众人又笑起来，群旦将高品乱啐乱打的一阵。子云笑道：「这是我不好，斗出他这一句来。」南湘道：「虽然游戏，也不好过于刻薄，改一字就救转来了，将「得」字改做「岂」字罢。」群旦方才依了。高品道：「罢了，众怒难犯。」又写道：「天生丽质当珍惜。」南湘道：「强盗看经，屠户成佛，卓然竟生出好心来，晓得珍惜了，","en":"way to Zhong'a.\\"\\n\\nEveryone burst out laughing, and the beauties all spat at him and pummeled him in a flurry. Ziyun laughed: \\"It is my fault, for I provoked that line from him.\\" Nanxiang said: \\"Even as playful writing, it should not be so cutting. Change one character and it can be saved; change 'traveled' to 'how could'.\\" The beauties finally agreed to this. Gao"},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"桃，漱芳为海棠，兰保为玫瑰，桂保为芙蓉，春喜小而多才，人人钟爱为兰花。八人品题尽合，因又想到琴言、琪官为何花？子云道：「琴言色艺过佳，而性情过冷，比为梅花最是相称，且其酷爱梅，不属庾香将谁属耶？」众人说道；「很是。」高品道：「只怕和靖先生不依，庾香割了他靴革幼子了。」","en":"the orchid. The eight assignments all felt fitting. They then wondered what flowers Qinyan and Qiguan should be. Ziyun said: \\"Qinyan's art and beauty are exceptional, yet his temperament is exceedingly cool. Likening him to the plum blossom is most apt; and since his passionate love of the plum is not for Yuxiang's sake, then whose?\\" Everyone agreed: \\"Quite right.\\" Gao"},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉不觉脸红。仲清道：「琪官呢？」子云道：「琪官性情刚烈，相貌极好。似欠旖旎风流。比他为菊花罢。」高品道：「菊花种数不一，有白有黄，或红或紫，白的还好，其余似觉老气横秋。琪官性情虽烈，其温柔处亦颇耐人怜爱，不如比为杏花。」众人道：「好个杏花，极妥当。」文泽道：「说起菊花有黄有白，你们可晓","en":"Ziyu could not help blushing. Zhongqing said: \\"And Qiguan?\\" Ziyun said: \\"Qiguan's temperament is fierce and upright, his appearance extremely fine; he somewhat lacks a gentle, flowing charm. Let him be likened to the chrysanthemum.\\" Gao Pin said: \\"Chrysanthemums vary in variety: some white, some yellow, some red, some"},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"六寸肤圆光致致，双跌着地，行走如风。人倒极风骚的。」仲清道：「这就是你各处稽察新闻事务的头衔了。」众人又笑了。子云道：「今日一叙之后，盛筵难再。十八日瑶卿移寓，诸同人可以移樽一叙否？」众人皆道：「断无不来之理，如有不到者罚他作一东，再叙一天。」宝珠道；「只怕我没有这脸面，断乎不能全来的。」春航道：「为什么不来？况且你是个花王，这些群花是要来朝贺的。就是我们看花人","en":"explains your official title of Inspector-General of Intelligence from All Quarters.\\" Everyone laughed again. Ziyun said: \\"After today's gathering, such a magnificent feast will be hard to convene again. On the eighteenth, Yaoqing is moving to new lodgings; would all the gentlemen be willing to move the wine-jars there for another gathering?\\" Everyone agreed: \\"There"}],"18":[{"paragraph":4,"mentions":1,"tokens":["徐子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"时运退了，只好在班子里，打旗儿去杂脚，那时只得比做狗了。此是做师傅的刻板面目。琴言自去年腊月到京，迄今四个月，徐子云已去白金数千，不为不多，是以长庆待琴言分外好。","en":"teacher. Four months had passed since Qinyan arrived in the capital the previous twelfth month. In that time, Xu Ziyun had already spent several thousand taels of silver. This was no small sum, and it explained why Changqing treated Qinyan exceptionally well."}],"19":[{"paragraph":14,"mentions":3,"tokens":["徐老爷"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"也就哭骂出来。他因小脑袋疼痛，也就躲了。琪官回去告诉了师傅，他与袁宝珠相好，又告诉了宝珠，宝珠气极，便进怡园与徐老爷说了。徐老爷就大怒道：「天下有这种东西，就容他这么样，这还了得！」又晓得了玉林之事，即着人去向坊里，连夜把玉林要了出来。一面打算告诉巡城都老爷，要搜他那个桶子，办他。徐老爷是个正直人，说话是不知避人的，不知有人怎样通了风。奚十一也怕闹事，又因银子用完","en":"\\"Get on with it.\\" Erxi drank some wine and continued: \\"Qiguan was also in a terrible state. His hands couldn't be withdrawn, and he became furious; ignoring the pain, he wrenched and twisted with all his strength until the mechanism was broken. Qiguan's two hands were scraped raw, dripping blood; he too came out weeping and cursing. Xi Eleven, his own vital part in agony, retreated to hide. Qiguan went back and told his teacher; and since he is close to Yuan Baozhu, he also told Baozhu. Baozhu was furious and went into the Garden of Contentment to tell Lord Xu. Lord Xu was outraged and said: 'How can the world contain such a creature, that anyone would tolerate him behaving like this? This is beyond endurance!' He then learned of Yulin's situation as well, and immediately sent someone to the ward office to have Yulin released overnight. At the same time he considered reporting the matter to the Metropolitan Circuit Censor, intending to have Xi Eleven's barrel confiscated and Xi Eleven prosecuted. Lord Xu is a straightforward and upright person; his words were spoken without any attempt at concealment, and somehow word leaked out. Xi Eleven, afraid of a public scandal, and moreover having run out of money, gave up his debts on the western account, rushed to the Board of Personnel and paid to have himself listed as unable to continue due to insufficient travel funds, and left the city. I hear he went to Tianjin; he'll probably hide there for a while and then come back. So Yulin is furious and unwell, and Qiguan's hands are not yet healed. How could he possibly come out? That's the whole story; now you all drink a big cup. My tongue is quite dry.\\""},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":1,"tokens":["徐老爷"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"翠好不好？」潘三一看，觉得碧清如水，而且系全绿的，便赞道：「好翠，城里头少，只怕是云南来的。」蕙芳道：「是怡园徐老爷赏的，一样四个给了四个人，我得了一个。听说在广东买来，一个是一块花边钱。」潘三吐了吐舌，讲道：「比金的还贵，十两重的也不过二百银。」蕙芳道：「好虽好，可惜没个金的配他。」一头瞧着潘三手腕上有个很重的金箍。潘三心上明白，意欲赏他，恰有十两重，值二百银，","en":"At this moment Pan Qiguan's lascivious heart was blazing; and yet he also wanted to appear generous, so he couldn't resort to brute force. Thinking it over, the only recourse was to win Huifang over with more money. He said: \\"I know you're a free-spending young protégé with a big style, always needing cash. Starting today, whenever you're short of money, just come to my shop and take what you need.\\" Huifang said: \\"How could I go there? We can't let Third Mistress find out; she'd give you such a scolding that you'd suffer all over again.\\" Pan Qiguan laughed: \\"Nonsense, tell me honestly: are you actually short of money or not?\\" Huifang thought: \\"This creature has been cut short by me and still doesn't understand. He still imagines he can buy me with money. I might as well milk this muddled fool for some; it can serve as lamp-oil money for Tian darling.\\" With a smile he said: \\"Money? Of course I want money. It's just awkward to say so. I fear Third Master would suspect that I'm always taking money and giving nothing in return; spending a great deal and getting nothing.\\" As he spoke, he looked down at the kingfisher-jade bracelet on his own wrist, then took it off and showed it to Pan Qiguan: \\"Tell me, is this jade any good?\\" Pan Qiguan looked: it was clear as water and entirely green in color. He praised it: \\"Fine kingfisher-jade, rarely seen in the city. It must be Yunnan-origin jade.\\" Huifang said: \\"It was a gift from Lord Xu at the Garden of Contentment. One of four identical pieces he gave to four people; I received one. I heard it was bought in Guangdong; one piece was priced at one foreign silver dollar.\\" Pan Qiguan clicked his tongue: \\"More expensive than gold. Ten liang of gold weighs as much but is worth only two hundred silver.\\" Huifang said: \\"Fine as it is, it's a pity there's no gold piece to match it.\\" As he spoke, his eyes kept glancing at a heavy gold bangle on Pan Qiguan's wrist. Pan Qiguan understood; he wanted to give it to him, but it weighed ten liang and was worth two hundred silver, and his heart ached to part with it; yet if he didn't give it, he feared Huifang would look down on him, so he said nothing."}],"20":[{"paragraph":5,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，高品为河间胡太尊请去修志，刘文泽是他岳母惦记他，来接他并其室吴氏，同到直隶总督衙门去了。此中已少了三人，只有子云、次贤、南湘、仲清、春航、王恂六人，不时往来。","en":"fetch him along with his wife née Wu to the office of the Viceroy of Zhili. So three of the group were gone; only Ziyun, Cixian, Nanxiang, Zhongqing, Chunhang, and Wang Xun — six people — continued to meet from time to time."},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一日，子云、次贤招诸名士到园看龙舟，并赏榴花。此日是五月初一，正值王通政生日，虽不做寿，家中却也有些至交好友亲戚同年来贺，内里又有些太太姑娘们，如梅宅的颜夫人，孙宅的陆夫人之类，也觉得热闹。王恂与仲清这怡园之约，就不能去了。是日子云、次贤知道了，也去拜拜寿，适","en":"One day, Ziyun and Cixian invited the celebrated gentlemen to the garden to view the dragon boat and enjoy the pomegranate blossoms. This day was the first of the fifth month, which happened also to be Commissioner Wang's birthday; though no formal celebration was"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"但只不要候，迟早不定。次贤等应了，才回怡园，同到了迎面峭壁之下。进了一个院落，子云便请大家宽了公服。又道：「今日天气甚热，红日照人，且龙舟在吟秋水榭，榴花在小赤城，离此颇远，不如乘马过去。」家人们已预先备马伺候，即带过来，四人都乘上了。从峭壁下左手转弯，高高低低，曲曲折折，走上青石羊肠小道，有些古藤碍首，香草钩衣。走完了山径，便顺","en":"returned to the Garden of Contentment. Coming together to the foot of the steep rock face at the garden's entrance, Ziyun invited everyone to change out of their formal attire. He also said: \\"The day is very hot and the red sun beats down on people; moreover the dragon boat is at the Autumn-Chant Waterside Pavilion, and the pomegranate blossoms are at Little Red Citadel"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云请客下了马，从山脚走上石级，三十余层，有一小亭，中具石台石凳，署名曰「缥缈亭」。对面望去，有几十株苍松，黛色参天的遮断眼界，树杪处微露碧瓦数鳞，朱楼一角。此间颇觉清风荡漾，水石清寒，飘飘乎有凌虚之想。春航道：「奇奥！文心一至于此，即匡庐之香炉峰，何以","en":"Ziyun invited his guests to dismount; from the foot of the hill they ascended over thirty stone steps, arriving at a small pavilion furnished with a stone table and benches. A plaque named it the \\"Pavilion of the Misty Void\\" (缥缈亭). Looking across, the view"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"当下子云让客且慢过桥，先进那阁里来，恰是正正三间，细铜丝穿成的帘子，水磨楠木雕阑，阁中摆设，精致异常，说不尽宝鼎瑶琴，璇几玉案。阑边放一个古铜壶，插着几枝竹箭，中悬一额，曰：「停云叙雨之斋。」旁有一联，其句云：拜石有时具袍笏。看云无处不神仙。署款为华光宿。南","en":"Ziyun asked his guests to pause before crossing the bridge, leading them first into the loft. It was a neat set of three central bays, hung with curtains woven of fine copper wire, its water-polished nanmu wood carved into delicate railings. The furnishings"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":3,"tokens":["度香","子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"素兰，共是五个。舟人把舟泊近阑干，南湘道：「芙蓉未开，水榭减色。有此众芳一渡，庶不寂寞。湘娥洛神，江湄游戏，我度香先生当以玉佩要之。」大家笑了一笑，群旦上来都见过了。次贤道：「你们看静芳窄袖踟蹰的，越显得风流跌宕。竹君之赞语「翩若惊鸿，婉若游龙」，真觉得摹拟入神。」南湘道：「静芳之倜傥，媚香之灵慧，瑶卿之柔婉，瘦香之妍静，香畹之丰韵，皆是天仙化人。若以其艺而观，","en":"crossing, it will no longer be desolate. Xiang Consorts and Luo Goddesses sporting on the river's edge — I imagine our Duxiang would be the man to beg their girdle-pendants of them.\\" Everyone laughed. All the young dan actors came up and made their greetings all around. Cixian said: \\"Look at the way Jingfang's narrow-sleeve movement stops and starts with an ease and flow — it"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"不尽的。在这间，看那间只隔一层玻璃，到过去时，却要转了好几处，方能过去。当下诸人，就在这第一层逛了好一回时候。子云道：「客也饿了，此刻将近午正，可以坐罢。」只见四个小童托上四个金漆盘来，放着几碗杏酪，分送各人面前，各人吃了。春航道：「索性上那两层再回来坐罢。」于是转上楼梯，上了第二层，略小了些，是四面样式，空出一转回廊，有阑干回护，也有雕窗隔作八处，古玩器皿一样","en":"other required winding through several turns. The company roamed about this first story for quite a long while. Ziyun said: \\"The guests must be hungry by now; it is nearly noon — shall we be seated?\\" Four small pages were seen carrying in four gold-lacquered trays with several bowls of apricot-kernel porridge, which were distributed to each person. Chunhang said: \\"Why"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"上望下，不如自下望上好。」众人即下了雁齿扶梯，仍到第一层，已见正中廊前摆了一个圆桌。此会是宾主四人，名花五人。子云便要穿衣，经史、田三位止住，只得就便服送了酒，依齿而坐。东首是南湘，子云命兰保坐在肩下。西首是春航，肩下是蕙芳。\\n上面是次贤，肩下是漱芳。","en":"in the front corridor of the central bays. This gathering was four host-and-guest gentlemen and five beauties. Ziyun was about to change into formal dress, but Cixian, Tian, and the three others stopped him; so they sent round the wine in informal attire, seating by seniority. To the east sat Nanxiang; Ziyun asked Lanbao to sit at his shoulder. To the west sat Chunhang,"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云坐了主位，左右为素兰、宝珠二人。饮酒的话头，无非是那几套，且慢讲他。再看那龙舟已到阁前，盘盘旋旋，来来往往，荡个不了。","en":"Ziyun took the host's seat, with Sulan and Baozhu on either side. The table talk was the usual sort; let us not linger over it. The dragon boat had now drawn up before the pavilion and was circling round and round, coming and going without end."},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"蓝布，站齐在阑干前，对上叩了一个头。南湘不解其故，待要问时，只听龙舟一声鼓响，那四个人齐齐的倒翻筋斗下水去了。子云道：「这些蠢奴，他们也要显些本领。」遂命家人去捉几对鸭子来，又叫取几个红漆葫芦抛下水去，众人方晓得是夺标。家人答应，便将一个白鸭先抛下水去，那鸭子下了水，把头一钻也翻了一个筋斗，便伸着头，拍着翅，呷、呷、呷的叫了几声。","en":"drumbeat sounded from the dragon boat, and all four men simultaneously turned somersaults and plunged into the water. Ziyun said: \\"These foolish fellows — they want to show off some skill too.\\" He ordered servants to catch several pairs of ducks, and also told them to bring several red-lacquered gourds to throw into the water; then everyone understood it was a competition"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"似梭子的穿过来。那鸭子见人来拿他，便扇起双翅，半沉半浮，走得风快。正走时，忽见水里探出个头来，一手把鸭子捉住。子云道：「好！记着赏他。」又将三只鸭子，两个葫芦同抛下去。这四个人各要讨好，都竭尽其艺，或俯或仰，或沉或浮，或侧半面，或跷一腿，游来游去，顽个不了。也有拿着的，也有拿不着的，也有拿到了，重新脱手的，也有拿到半路，被人夺去的，引得席上个个欢笑，各人饮了好几","en":"half-floating, sped away. Just as it was going, a head suddenly emerged from the water, and one hand seized the duck. Ziyun said: \\"Well done! Make a note to reward him.\\" Three more ducks and two gourds were thrown in together. The four men competed with each other to excel, displaying every skill: now face-down, now face-up, now sinking, now surfacing, now turning sideways,"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云叫了进来，再斟了酒。次贤道：「我们今日就以此为令何如？」众人问道：「怎样做令？」次贤问那些家人道：「去年园中结那些大葫芦，想来还有。」家人应道：「有十几个漆的，其余是没有漆的。」次贤便叫把漆的拿来。不多一刻，家人就提了一大串来，解开绳子，放在一张空桌","en":"Ziyun called them back inside and poured fresh cups. Cixian said: \\"Shall we use this as the basis of a drinking game today?\\" Everyone asked: \\"How would the game work?\\" Cixian asked the servants: \\"Those large gourds that were cultivated in the garden last year"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":4,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"知筹上写些什么。」次贤道：「方才这副筹，是《水浒传》上的人，各有饮酒的故事，我是随手数的，不知是那几个名字。」子云笑道：「这筹倒也好，喝得爽快。就是内中有几个大量的，抽着了却是难为。」众人道：「这也只好听天由命了。」只见水中抢了一个出来，家童拿到席边将手巾擦干了，开了盖子，倒出筹来，是萧次贤的。大家看那一面时，刻着七个大字，下注两行小字。大字是：「李逵大闹浔阳江","en":"drinking episode associated with them. I drew them at random; I don't know exactly which names have come out.\\" Ziyun laughed: \\"These tallies would also be good fun — the drinking would be hearty. Only, among them there are a few characters with large capacity; drawing one of those would really put one to the test.\\" Everyone said: \\"There is nothing to do but submit"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":1,"tokens":["徐子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"又见水中拿了两个出来，第一个揭出来是徐子云的。那面是：「宋江怒杀阎婆惜。」注：「饮两杯，并坐者为阎婆惜，宋江先自饮一杯，将一杯劝阎婆惜，婆惜不饮，仍是宋江自饮。","en":"Then two more were retrieved from the water. Opening the first: it was the character for Xu Ziyun. The inscription read: \\"Song Jiang Kills Yan Poxi in a Rage.\\" The annotation: \\"Drink two cups; the person seated beside is Yan Poxi. Song Jiang first drinks one cup himself, then urges one cup on Yan Poxi; if Yan Poxi refuses, Song Jiang drinks it himself.\\""},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":7,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「子云笑道：「座中谁是阎婆惜呢？」众人笑了。次贤道：「不消说，是并肩坐的这两个了，且仍是你自饮，用是用不着他们，但劝是要劝的。」子云带笑饮了一杯，又将一杯对素兰道：「香畹你是个好人，你莫要学那阎婆惜，心上只记着张三郎，不瞅不睬的，你且饮这一杯罢。」引得众人","en":"Ziyun laughed: \\"Who is Yan Poxi among us?\\" Everyone laughed. Cixian said: \\"No need to guess — it's the two sitting right beside you; and moreover, you still drink it yourself. There's no need for them, but you still have to invite them.\\" Ziyun laughed and"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":5,"tokens":["子云","度香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"杯要西门庆跪地，一手捏着金莲的鞋尖，敬金莲这一杯。第三杯，左邻是王婆，金莲福了一福，叫声：「干娘！饮这一杯。」子云笑道：「可可如今轮到我了。」春航道：「香尘沾膝是件最美的事，况且莲钩在握，就饮十杯何妨？」南湘大笑道：「香尘沾膝还可以，只不要跪在烂泥里，那时莲钩倒摸不着，摸着的是条驴腿。」说得众人哄然狂笑起来，把个金漱芳笑得闪了腰，直跌到次贤怀里。王兰保、陆素兰笑","en":"the third, the person to the left is Wang Po; Pan Jinlian curtsies and says: \\"Godmother, please drink this cup.\\" Ziyun laughed: \\"As luck would have it, it has now come around to me.\\" Chunhang said: \\"Having fragrant dust cling to one's knee is the finest of affairs — and moreover with a lotus hook in the hand; why not drink ten cups?\\" Nanxiang laughed loudly: \\"'Fragrant"},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"盥漱毕，又饮了一回香茗，南湘道：「还有小赤城的榴花没有赏鉴，何不就趁着晚霞掩映，看那榴火如焚不好吗？」子云即引众复坐船回过红桥，到西边假山前上岸，从神仙洞走出，穿过了杏楼、桃坞两处，便是小赤城。只见榴花回绕如城，约有一二百株，红霞闪烁，流火欲燃，间有几种黄白及玛瑙等色，相间而开。正是《天台山赋》上的「赤城霞起而建标」，所以叫做小赤城。","en":"Little Red Citadel — shall we take advantage of the evening glow to go look at those blazing pomegranate fires?\\" Ziyun then led everyone back to the boats, which crossed the red bridge back to the west side, where they disembarked at the foot of the artificial hill, passed through the Immortal's Cave, wended through the Apricot Tower (Xinglou) and Peach Grove, and arrived"},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"天色已晚，南湘、春航要回，小使送上衣帽，各人穿戴，谢了主人并次贤，绕道出园。子云道：「今日本有一事要烦两兄。园中各处的对联尚须添设几副，今日倒被龙舟耽误了，迟日再请一游，并约庾香、剑潭诸君何如？」史、田二人应了，遂上车而去。这边相公五人，也各陆续散去。这回怡园二次宴客，可惜人少未齐，不晓下卷又叙何人，再俟细细想来。","en":"hats, they dressed and put them on, thanked the host and Cixian, and took the roundabout path out of the garden. Ziyun said: \\"Today there was actually one matter I had meant to trouble you two gentlemen with. The paired inscriptions for various spots throughout the garden still need several more sets added; today we were sidetracked by the dragon boat. Perhaps another"}],"21":[{"paragraph":5,"mentions":1,"tokens":["徐子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"图》。旁有一联是：「心抱冰壶秋月，人依纸帐梅花。炕几上一个胆瓶，插了一枝梅花。一边是萧次贤画的四幅红梅，一边是徐子云写的四幅篆字。窗前放着一张古砖香梨木的琴桌，上有一张梅花古段文的瑶琴。里头一间是卧房了，却垂着个月色秋罗绣花软帘，绣的是各色梅花。","en":"a spray of plum; to one side four panels of red plum by Xiao Cixian; to the other four seal-script scrolls by Xu Ziyun. Before the window stood an antique brick-and-pearwood qin stand bearing a plum-patterned duan qin. The inner chamber hung a moonlight autumn-gauze embroidered curtain patterned with every variety of plum — this was the sleeping room."},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":1,"tokens":["度香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"听了，更觉伤心，低了头，一句话回答不出来。聘才又道：「或者因你常到怡园，他因此动了疑。你既与他相好，就不该常在度香处了，也要分个亲疏出来，这也难怪他有点醋意。」琴言心上一团酸楚，正难发泄，听到此便生了气，似乎要哭出来，说道：「你讲些什么话？什么叫相好，什么叫醋意，我倒不晓得。」便借这气又哭起来，聘才心中暗暗的喜欢，便赔着笑道：「我说错了，我知你是讲不得顽笑的，不","en":"visited the Garden of Contentment so often. If you were devoted to him, you should not have spent all your time with Duxiang; you ought to have shown some distinction between the nearer heart and the farther. One can hardly blame Yuxiang for a little jealousy.\\"\\n\\nQinyan's whole heart was one knot of sour anguish with no way to release it. At these words anger suddenly came"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":3,"tokens":["度香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「你方才说起庾香，你近来见他么？」素兰一笑道：「果然，果然！你除却庾香，是没有事寻我的。我们前日在怡园看龙舟，度香请庾香，他因病了没有来。度香说起他的病，有一个多月了，脸上清瘦了好些，十天前到过度香处。并有一个笑话，说来人家真好笑，只怕你又要哭坏了，我不说罢。」琴言听了，心上已觉回转，便道：","en":"expected — aside from Yuxiang you never send for me. The other day at the Garden of Contentment watching dragon boats Duxiang invited him — illness kept him away. Duxiang spoke of his illness — more than a month — face grown thin — ten days ago he did visit Duxiang. There's a joke — hilarious — I'm afraid you'll weep — maybe I should not tell.\\" Qinyan's heart already shifted"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":5,"tokens":["度香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「什么笑话？你快快说罢。」素兰道：「媚香的生日，田湘帆做了一篇小序，大家说做得好，度香便抄了。那一天，庾香来，静宜便将小序给庾香看，庾香也赞了几声。度香在旁说道：「湘帆好一个浓艳文心，愈艳愈好，愈浓愈好。」度香正赞湘帆的文章，庾香忽说道：「玉侬自然在玉艳之上，玉艳虽好，尚逊瑶卿、媚香一筹，而玉侬则玉树琼花，似非人间花谱中可以位置。」静","en":"— say it now.\\" Sulan said: \\"On Meixiang's birthday Tian Xiangfan wrote a short preface — everyone praised it — Duxiang copied it. The day Yuxiang came Jingyi showed him the piece; Yuxiang admired it. Standing by, Duxiang said: 'Xiangfan's style — the thicker the richer — the richer the better.' Jingyi and Duxiang at first did not catch Yuxiang's drift — then realized:"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":1,"tokens":["度香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"样带在身上？你别哄我！」素兰便大笑起来道：「呸！你这个傻子，难道你身上种着梅花吗？」琴言也笑了，素兰道：「我听度香说，庾香身上荷包、扇络等物，无一不是琴的样式，连扇子上画的也是两张琴，一张是正的，一张是反的，你说这心肠不是与你一样么。」说得琴言又哭了，素兰道：「你要哭，我以后再不说了。」琴言又只得忍住道：「你再说，我不哭就是了。」素兰笑道：「我也没得说了，你方才","en":"simpleton! Are the plum blossoms on your clothes growing from your skin?\\" Qinyan laughed too. Sulan continued, \\"Duxiang tells me that Yuxiang's purses, fan pendants, and all his other ornaments are made in the shape of qins. Even his fan is painted with two: one seen from the front and one from the back. Tell me, is that not a heart fashioned exactly like yours?\\"\\n\\nAt"}],"22":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":2,"tokens":["度香","徐老爷"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，笔砚花卉等物，搬些下船安置。便知会琴言明日早晨下船，尽一日之兴，也不约别人。因想起子玉处，怎样去请呢，只好借度香名，遂将请他的缘故，细细写明封了口，着人送了去；并吩咐对他门上，只说怡园徐老爷请他逛运河便了。","en":"enjoy the day to the full, inviting no one else. Then he considered: how was Ziyu to be invited? Only by borrowing Duxiang's name. So he wrote out in detail the reasons for the invitation, sealed the letter, and sent a man to deliver it, instructing him to tell the gatekeepers simply that Master Xu of the Garden of Contentment was inviting the young master to an outing on"},{"paragraph":2,"mentions":4,"tokens":["子云","徐老爷"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"送信人照着吩咐，一径到梅宅来，投了书信。子玉正在闷闷不乐，将子云所赠之瑶琴，翻着琴谱，捡那容易的在那里学弹。忽又将琴翻转，将那琴铭诵了几遍。只觉绿阴满院，长日如年，想不出什么解闷的事来。正在情绪烦闷之时，忽见云儿拿了一封信进来，放在桌上，说怡园徐老爷送来的，明日请逛运河，并要回信呢。子玉取过书来一看，觉得封面上字","en":"straight to the Mei residence and presented the letter. Ziyu was sitting in listless gloom with the jade qin that Ziyun had given him, turning over the notation and picking out the easier pieces to practice; then he turned the qin over again and recited its inscription several times through. He felt only that green shade filled the courtyard and the long day stretched"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":1,"tokens":["度香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"死了，活着这么受罪，不如死了倒干净。兰哥你是我的大恩人，既和我相好一场，索性作个全始全终的人。我死了，求你转求度香，把我这尸骨，葬在怡园梅崦的梅树下，我就作了鬼，也是快活的。再不然把我烧了灰，到那山高水深的地方，顺风吹散了，省得留一个苦命的痕迹在世间，叫人家想着，恨的恨，疼的疼。兰哥、兰哥！你是疼我的，你倒任我死罢，不用劝我。横竖我才十六岁，已经活得不耐烦了，自","en":"my great benefactor. Since we have loved each other so well, be my friend to the very end. When I am dead, beg Duxiang for me to bury my bones beneath the plum trees of the Plum Knoll in the Garden of Contentment; then even as a ghost I shall be happy. Or else burn me to ashes, and where the mountains are high and the waters deep scatter them down the wind, and spare"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":1,"tokens":["徐老爷"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"道他不要为你死吗？你且看看这是谁写的？」便把子玉的回信递与琴言，琴言当下接过信来一看，便即放下道：「这是人家与徐老爷的信，你给我看作什么？」素兰笑道：「你且不要性急，这是信面，你且看里头写的是什么？」琴言只得抽出信来，从头至尾看了一遍，又从起头再看，一句句的念了，又看一遍，即微微的笑道：「这不是庾香回你的信么，明日去逛运河，看信上是必定出来的。」素兰道：「你愿意他","en":"\\"But this dog Wei — what hatred does he bear me, that he must trample me so and hound me to my death?\\" Sulan said: \\"I told you the other day to be on your guard and not to offend him — and see, he has struck the first blow.\\" Then he added: \\"Though after all this is only our guessing, and can't be taken for certain.\\" Qinyan said nothing, staring blankly; then: \\"I shall be dead soon in any case. Let anything more come — I am not afraid of it.\\" Sulan said: \\"Now you are talking folly. Life and death are written in fate — would you go seeking death yourself? Besides, if you truly died, you would drag another down with you, who would die too.\\" Qinyan said: \\"I have no father or mother, no brothers, no sisters — whom should I drag down? I go clean, and I go alone.\\" Sulan said: \\"No one else would be dragged down, true; many love you, but not to the point of dying for you. How is it that today of all days you cannot call Yuxiang to mind — would he not die for you? Look, then — whose hand wrote this?\\" And he handed Ziyu's reply to Qinyan, who took the letter, glanced at it, and laid it down, saying: \\"This is a letter from someone to Master Xu — why show it to me?\\" Sulan laughed: \\"Not so fast — that is the envelope. Look what is written inside.\\" Qinyan could only draw the letter out. He read it from beginning to end, then began at the top again, reciting it sentence by sentence; read it through once more, and then smiled faintly: \\"Is this not Yuxiang's reply to you? He is to see the canal tomorrow — and by this letter he is certain to come.\\" Sulan said: \\"Would you rather he came, or rather he did not?\\" Qinyan smiled again and answered: \\"It is you who invited him. Only who knows whether the weather will hold tomorrow. In the fifth month rain and shine are never settled; if it should start pouring at first light, then he cannot come.\\" Sulan laughed: \\"Heaven bends to man's wishes. The tears we two have shed today may fairly pass for a day's rain — tomorrow is sure to be clear. Sleep soundly tonight, rise early, and come to my place to go together; to your master say only that you are going to the Garden of Contentment. Your health is frail and the weather uncertain — bring an extra garment or two, for the wind may be strong on the water.\\" So they talked on, and little by little the two faces brightened. Sulan took his evening meal with Qinyan and sat talking a while longer; not till past the second watch did he go home, and Qinyan too retired to rest."},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":1,"tokens":["徐老爷"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"起来了。」子玉道：「我今日出门有事，所以略早了些。」元茂道：「我有句话商量。」子玉正要问时，只见云儿进来道：「徐老爷打发人来请，说客业已到齐了，就请少爷过去。」子玉也不及再问元茂，连忙便进上房，见颜夫人尚在梳头，子玉把出门的事告禀。颜夫人道：「你这几日身子好些，出去散散也好，只要早些回来，不要贪凉，坐在风口里。多叫几个人跟去，衣服也多包两件。」子玉禀道：「衣服包好","en":"So he opened his chests and picked out several of the odd trifles that kinsmen and friends had given him over the years, adding two bolts of Jiangnan silk and two bolts of Huzhou silk, and took along a dozen-odd taels of loose silver. He had just put all in order and was about to go to the upper rooms to take his leave when Li Yuanmao, a short jacket thrown over his shoulders and his feet bare, came bustling in all in a flurry: \\"I made a point of rising early today — who'd have thought you would be up earlier still!\\" Ziyu said: \\"I have business abroad today, so I am somewhat early.\\" Yuanmao said: \\"There is a matter I want to talk over with you.\\" Ziyu was about to ask what, when Yun'er came in: \\"Master Xu has sent a man to say the guests are all assembled, and requests the young master to come over now.\\" Ziyu, with no more time for Yuanmao, hurried in to the upper rooms, where Lady Yan was at her toilet, and announced his outing. Lady Yan said: \\"You have been better these last days, and an airing will do you good. Only come home early; don't go courting the cool or sitting in a draft. Take a few more people with you, and pack an extra garment or two.\\" Ziyu replied: \\"The clothes are packed already; and I don't need many people — Yun'er alone will do.\\" Lady Yan said: \\"As you please; but mind you come back early, and be careful what you eat and drink.\\" Ziyu answered \\"Yes!\\", went out, dressed, and had the gifts and clothing-bundles carried out to the cart beforehand."}],"24":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":2,"tokens":["度香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"正月初六那一天，庾香只见琴言一出《惊梦》，犹是不识姓名，未通款曲。及怡园赏灯之夕，就有瑶琴灯谜为庾香打着，因此度香就请庾香与琴言相会。闻宝珠讲，那一天先将个假琴言勾搭庾香，庾香生气欲走，而真琴言始出，已是两泪交流，此心全许。以后偏是会少离多，因之成病，人皆猜是相思。即媚香生日这一日，琴言因病不来，庾香便觉着心神不定，后来生起病来。据我看来，庾香即是一个钟情人，也","en":"his name. On the night of the lantern festival at the Garden of Contentment, Yuxiang solved the lute riddle, and Duxiang brought them together. Baozhu mentioned that a fake Qinyan was sent to tease him first, and Yuxiang was so offended he nearly stormed out. Only when the true Qinyan appeared, weeping, were their hearts pledged to one another. Since then, their rare meetings"},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":6,"tokens":["子云","度香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"导他，则转爱为敬，转敬为爱，几如良友之箴规，他山之攻错，其中不正而自正，亦可谓勇于改过，以湘帆比起庾香来，正如子云、相如，同工异曲。世唯好色不淫之人始有真情，若一涉淫亵，情就是淫亵上生的，不是性分中出来的。譬如方才说的潘三，心上也是想着媚香，难道说他也是钟情的不成？」王恂道：「也要算情，若说不是情，他也不想了。」仲清笑道：「潘三若有情，倒绝不想媚香，其想媚香正是","en":"of mystery! I see it clearly now. You are truly a transcendent master of passion.\\" He then asked, \\"And what of Duxiang's passion?\\" Zhongqing replied, \\"Duxiang is a grand spendthrift, yet he carries himself with effortless ease and vast tolerance. His love is wide but never promiscuous, his spirit strong but never arrogant. For him, the boundary between self and other"},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":1,"tokens":["度香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"桂保道：「我们近日在怡园演习新戏。」仲清道：「什么新戏呢？」玉林道：「闻得六月初六日荷花生日，华公子要来逛园。度香为他是爱听戏的，即与静宜商量。静宜说：「华公子是爱新鲜热闹的，若说寻常的戏，他都已听过，而且这几个班子也未必能赛过他的八龄班。我想不若把各班中，挑出几个来，集个大成班，我再谱出些新戏来，便不与外间的相同，也就耳目一新了。」仲清道：「这倒很好。但不知戏","en":"replied, \\"The sixth of the sixth month is the Lotus Birthday, and Young Master Hua plans to tour the garden. Since Duxiang knows he loves the opera, he consulted Jingyi. Jingyi said that Young Master Hua has already heard all the ordinary plays, and no troupe could possibly surpass his own Eight Ages company. Therefore, it would be better to pick the brightest stars from"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":2,"tokens":["度香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"梅，后来又添了玉侬、玉艳，共是十个。」王恂道：「这就是十美班了。」桂保道：「陪客尚未定，你们是一定在数的。听得度香已写书子到保定府去，请前舟回来商议，只怕就是这件事。」王恂道：「也近了，今日已是二十六日了，还有十天，就演得全这些新戏吗？」玉林笑道：「你好记性，还有个闰五月，难道一月多，还演不出来？」王恂笑道：「我真胡涂，静坐了几天，真是山中忘甲子了。」仲清道：「","en":"company.\\" Guibao added, \\"The guest list isn't entirely settled yet, but you two are certainly included. I heard Duxiang wrote to Baoding to invite Qianzhou back, likely just for this occasion.\\" Wang Xun noted, \\"It's drawing close. Today is already the twenty-sixth. Are ten days enough to prepare all these new plays?\\" Yulin laughed, \\"You've forgotten the intercalary fifth"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":2,"tokens":["度香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"顷，夕阳西下，仲清叫人卷起帘子，就把桌子挪到廊前，摆了四个座儿。王恂道：「便饭，没有为你们添菜，我这里却比不得度香。」桂保道：「好说，你的便饭我也吃得记不清了，东成居也作不出来。度香处也过于糜费，其实如何吃得这么许多。」说完就同坐了。厨房内闻得有相公，便多备了八个碟子，添了四样菜。先把黄酒、小吃送上来。玉林、桂保各敬了酒，便谈谈讲讲，浅斟低酌了一回。仲清、王恂又","en":"setting out four seats. Wang Xun said, \\"It will just be a plain meal with no extra dishes; I certainly cannot match Duxiang's extravagance.\\" Guibao waved it off, \\"You say that, but I have lost count of the plain feasts I've enjoyed here. The Dongcheng Kitchen couldn't possibly equal this. Duxiang spends far too much—who can even eat such massive spreads anyway?\\" They took"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":1,"tokens":["度香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"的冤家竟不少了。他的记性又平常，寻常会过的，歇几天见面就想不起来。人人恨他的架子大，脸面冷，不会应酬，就是对着度香，也是冷冷的。唯听得心上只有一个梅公子，是生平第一知己，竟会眠思梦想得害起病来。这梅公子是谁呢？」仲清道：「难道你还没有见过这人，怎么想不起来？」王恂道：「媚香生日，那一位顶年轻，生得顶好的，就是梅公子，号庾香。」桂保想了一想，道：「是了，是了，果然","en":"after only a few days, he forgets faces completely, and everyone despises his cold pride. He is even cool toward Duxiang. The only one he calls his life's soulmate is Young Master Mei; he was actually sick with longing for him! Who exactly is this Master Mei?\\" Zhongqing clarified, \\"You met him—Young Master Mei, styled Yuxiang.\\" Guibao recalled, \\"Ah, yes! His beauty certainly"}],"25":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"就是刘文泽一人，其余多未谋面。此时文泽之父刘守正已升了礼部尚书，是以文泽偕其妻星夜赶回，未免有些庆贺之事。又适子云写书前往，文泽回京已有半月，诸事已毕。","en":"so Wenze and his wife had travelled back day and night, with all the attendant congratulations to be received. Ziyun's letter of invitation happened to arrive just then; Wenze had already been back in the capital half a month, and all his affairs were settled."},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":1,"tokens":["度香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"有射圃、球场、渔庄、稻舍、酒肆、茶寮等处，皆系园丁开设，一样的精洁，为园中有执事人消遣，亦可免其出外旷业，此系度香的作用。园中正经庭院通共有二十四处，有连有断，不犯不重，若认真要游，尽他一天，不过游得三四处，总要八九日方尽。","en":"clean — to occupy those with duties in the garden and keep them from slipping outside to neglect work: such was Duxiang's arrangement. Formal courtyards and halls numbered twenty-four in all — linked yet broken apart, never repetitive — if one toured conscientiously, a whole day might cover only three or four spots; eight or nine days were needed to finish the whole."},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":5,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"当时子云接进文泽，到含万楼下坐定，子云即问了些保定光景。文泽讲了一遍，便问子云道：「今日除华公子之外，有何佳客？」子云道：「几个年老纱帽头，同华公子是说不来的。平时来往那些人，系有生有熟。席间若有一个道学先生，就使通席不快，所以止请了我们常叙的几位，除高卓然","en":"At that moment Ziyun welcomed Wenze in, and they seated themselves below the Tower of Myriad Containment. Ziyun first asked about the situation in Baoding; Wenze recounted his news, then asked Ziyun: \\"Apart from Young Master Hua, what other notable guests are expected today?\\""},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":3,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"文泽便问次贤在何处，子云道：「静宜因今日新戏出场，内中有些关节，并声律尚有些不谐处，亲自在那里一一指点，少停就来的。」正说之间，张仲雨到了，子云迎接进来，文泽起身相见。见仲雨的服饰，今日与平日不同，往常仲雨是个从九品衔，今日冠服，忽然是个六品，与他一样，想必又加捐了。因问仲","en":"Wenze then asked where Cixian was. Ziyun said: \\"Jingyi is directing today's new plays in person. There are still a number of passages where the staging is not quite right, and the musical modes remain somewhat discordant in places, so he is correcting each one himself. He will be along shortly.\\""},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":3,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"文泽对子云道：「张老二实在算一把好手，各样精明。出去不消说是个能员，将来必定名利双收的。」子云笑道：「名利是一定双收，上司一定欢喜，就是百姓吃苦些。」文泽大笑，仲雨也笑道：「这倒被你猜着，若说将来不要钱，就是我自己也不肯作此欺人之语。况且我这个官，原是花了本钱","en":"Wenze said to Ziyun: \\"Zhang the Second is truly a capable fellow — sharp and shrewd in every way. Once he takes up his post, he will undoubtedly prove a most efficient official, and fame and fortune are sure to follow.\\" Ziyun laughed: \\"Fame and fortune he will certainly"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":3,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"带的，扶着椅轿，中间坐着那彩云皓月、玉裹金装的一位华公子，后头一群人，大大小小，约有二十余个人跟着。将近阶前，子云降阶而迎。华公子一见子云，即忙下轿，恭身上前，与子云相见，问了好，即携着手同上了阶，进了含万楼，重新见礼。","en":"into the cloth; and behind him again came a train of twenty and more, great and small. As they neared the steps Ziyun went down to meet him. The moment Young Master Hua saw Ziyun he got out of the chair, came forward with a bow, and greeted him and asked after his health; then they went up the steps hand in hand, entered the Tower of Myriad Containment, and made their"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":5,"tokens":["徐子云","子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"原来华公爷与徐相国，已是二十年至好，又同在军营两年，有苔岑之谊，金石之交。徐子云与华公子，他们又订金兰，重修世好。子云比华公子长了五岁，华公子以长兄相待，甚是恭敬。当时子云即让华公子坐了，家人献过了茶，华公子道：「早几日就要过来请安，因连日有随驾差使，而且天气又热，恐妨起居。今天稍为凉快，正可与吾兄快谈半日。只可惜一城之隔，不能","en":"years and served two campaigns together — friendship moss-thick as hill herbs, oath-bound as metal and stone. Xu Ziyun and Young Master Hua had sworn brotherhood and revived the tie between houses. Ziyun was five years elder; Young Master honored him as elder brother — courteous and yielding. At once Ziyun yielded Young Master Hua the seat of honor while servants poured"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"吾兄如不嫌简慢，弟当奉迓高轩。」子云道：「甚好！甚好！如遇不得出城之日，必来相扰。府上西园布置极佳，若能通到东园，则更妙矣。」华公子道：「隔着中间多少正房，是通不来的；且东园为宾客聚居，杂人甚多，无从点缀。」正说之间，只听后面鼓乐之声。子云即让华公子进内，过了穿堂，走到承荫堂阶前，堂上","en":"\\"If elder brother does not disdain plain fare, I shall send a carriage of welcome.\\" Ziyun said: \\"Excellent — whenever I cannot leave the city I shall trouble you. Your Western Garden is superbly laid — could it join the Eastern Garden it would be finer.\\" Young Master Hua said: \\"So many main halls stand between — cannot link — and the east"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"大笑道：「恐下里之音，不当清听。如蒙颔赏，鄙人愿代诸君浮一大白。」大家笑说：「很好。」酒筵已齐，家人即捧酒来，子云送酒安席。东边是华公子首座，仲雨作陪。西边文泽上座，次贤作陪。子云在华公子席上作主人。","en":"gladly drain a full cup for everyone.\\" All agreed it was good — wine was ready — servants bore jars forward — Ziyun poured and set seats — Young Master Hua held chief east seat with Zhongyu attending; Wenze chief west with Cixian attending; Ziyun played host beside Young Master Hua's table."},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":5,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"没有客了，就是五人，何妨并作一席，隔远了不好说话；再一开戏，讲话更听不见了。」文泽道：「既如此，并作一桌罢。」子云道：「也好，但是挤了，换个圆桌罢，只是不恭些。」华公子道：「好说，兄弟亦算不得客，二哥这么拘礼，以后就不敢奉扰了。」子云连声答应，家人们即在中间摆了一张圆桌，重将杯盘摆好，撤了两边。戏台上已打动锣鼓，只见戏房内婷婷袅袅走出十枝花来，莲步略移，香风已到","en":"opera begins, we shall not hear each other at all.\\" Wenze said: \\"In that case, let us combine into one table.\\" Ziyun said: \\"Very well, though it will be rather crowded — let us exchange for a round table instead. I only fear it may seem insufficiently formal.\\" Young Master Hua said: \\"Pray do not stand on ceremony! Between brothers, I can hardly be counted a guest."},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":9,"tokens":["子云","度香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这两本戏却做了多时，子云见华公子兴致甚高，便命止了戏，叫上那十个仙女带妆上前，一人各敬一大杯。华公子毫不推辞，笑而受之；也要众人照样，大家酒量皆不能及，只得换了小杯，也各饮了十杯。华公子又把群旦叫到面前看了一回，向子云道：「小弟去年托张老二选了八个，合成一班，如今看起来，不","en":"Those two performances had taken a great deal of time. Ziyun, seeing that Young Master Hua's spirits were running exceedingly high, ordered the plays stopped and summoned the ten immortal maidens forward, still in full stage makeup, to toast him — each one presenting a great cup. Young Master Hua refused not a"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一盘金锞子，有方胜的，有如意的，有梅花的，有菱角的，一两多重一个，约有百十个，分赏十旦。珊枝分毕，十旦叩谢了，子云亦忙道了谢。","en":"a hundred pieces — portioned among the ten performers. After Shanzhi handed them out the ten kowtowed thanks; Ziyun hastened thanks as well."},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"钟上时已未末，撤了席，华公子起身道：「本为逛园而来，今日又来不及了，但是荷花是要看的。」子云命将席挪到吟秋水榭，一面预备采莲船，就命十旦扮作采莲女子，下池荡桨；一面让客到水榭来。华公子等进了水榭，一望尽是荷花，红香芬馥，翠盖缤纷，好个色天香界，遂又入席坐定。只见四五个小舟，荡入池心，坐着一班名旦，扎扮得长裙短袖，称着莲脸桃腮，穿入花中，一个","en":"Hua rose and said: \\"I came to stroll the garden — today again there was no time — yet the lotus must be seen.\\" Ziyun had the feast carried to the Autumn-Chant Waterside Pavilion, ordered lotus-gathering boats prepared, and told the ten performers to dress as maidens gathering lotus and paddle into the pool; guests were shown to the pavilion. Young Master Hua and company"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":3,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云笑道：「正合鄙意。」就将群旦叫上来。群花听了，即荡动兰桨，往水榭边来，上了岸，在阑外雁排侍立。华公子便指名叫了四个进来：蕙芳、琴言、宝珠、素兰。华公子对着四旦说道：「方才《峨嵋山群仙》一出，虽全部出场，未尽态度。你们可将各人得意之戏说一出来。」四旦听","en":"Ziyun laughed: \\"Exactly my wish.\\" He had the whole troupe summoned up. Hearing the order, they plied orchid oars toward the pavilion, landed, and drew up in goose formation beyond the railing. Young Master Hua called four men in by name: Huifang, Qinyan, Baozhu,"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子云","度香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云只顾点头微笑，华公子拍案叫绝，道：「快哉！快哉！我今日始信人间真有绝色，深悔从前将些嫫拇、无盐，也置之绣帏金屋。」又高声说道：「唯怪我度香仁兄秘藏佳丽，独享眼福，不肯早以示人，直到餍足之后，才招客共赏，分明使人饫其余味。今日没有别的，我先罚你十巨觞再","en":"Ziyun only nodded and smiled. Young Master Hua smacked the table and cried: \\"Splendid! Splendid! Today I first believe peerless beauty exists under heaven — I deeply regret filling embroidered curtains with Momu and Wuyan look-alikes.\\" He added loudly: \\"I"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":7,"tokens":["子云","度香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"叫林珊枝取他自己之大玉斗来。珊枝看天色不早，知道公子的脾气，闹开了就不论昼夜的，口虽只管答应，呆呆的不动，目视子云。子云会意，也自知酒量不敌，便说道：「实在贱量不能多饮，愿将门杯以当大斗罢。」华公子犹不肯依，经次贤、文泽、仲雨都来解劝，说：「非特度香不能，就是我们都也陪不来的，以小杯罚他三杯罢。」华公子也知子云酒量平常，只得依了。众人请子云连饮了三杯，自己却用大","en":"his master's temper — once roused he would go day or night — though he answered aloud he stood frozen, eyes on Ziyun. Ziyun took the hint; knowing his drinking could not match, he said: \\"My shallow capacity truly cannot stomach more — let my door cup stand for your great dipper.\\" Young Master Hua still refused until Cixian, Wenze, and Zhongyu mediated: \\"Not only Duxiang"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":1,"tokens":["度香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"赏识，自然十分高兴。又见他看了一遍，还要再看，心上便越要加些精神，做些态度出来，一来要起公子爱慕之心，二来也与度香脸上增些体面，比起先一出，更唱得出色。这琴言心上却是不愿，只因听华公子是得罪不得的，只得受些委屈。又想起十人中单叫他们两人，就恨还有一个袁宝珠与他作敌手，心上总想压他下来，故也加了工夫，更觉一往情深，如水斯注。又见华公子面貌也有些相像庾香处，又想起那","en":"more spirit into it and made more of his gestures — partly to catch the young master's fancy, and partly to do Duxiang credit — so that he sang better than in the first piece.\\n\\nQinyan was unwilling in his heart; but he had heard that Young Master Hua was not a man to offend, and had to swallow the indignity. And thinking that out of the ten only the two of them had been"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":6,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"近酉正，若再闹下去便进不得城的，但又不敢上前催他，只得出去，先叫人去留了城门，重走上来，站在公子背后。只管看着子云，众人亦皆明白，皆因不好催促。适值华公子出外小解，珊枝便对子云请了一安，低低的讲道：「求二老爷劝我们爷少喝些酒，早些回去，要关城了。若不能进城，御前差使无有定准的，恐有迟误，不是顽的。」子云点了点头，道：「你说的很是，也是时候了。」华公子进来见珊枝与","en":"out and told retainers to hold the gate open, then returned and stood behind Young Master Hua, eyes pleading at Ziyun; everyone understood but none wished to prompt. When Young Master Hua stepped out briefly to relieve himself, Shanzhi bowed low to Ziyun and whispered: \\"Beg Second Master persuade our lord to drink less and return soon — the gates will close — palace"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"已是将上灯时候，觉得去留两难，又见他跟来的人，都整整齐齐站在阶下，心上要走不走的；又看宝珠、琴言将要唱完，便对子云道：「我还进城罢。」珊枝听了接口道：「将要关城了，公子既要进城，就要快些赶呢。」华公子听了没奈何，只得起身穿戴衣冠，谢了子云，又辞了众人。","en":"neat ranks below the steps — he half wished to leave; Baozhu and Qinyan were finishing their song — he said to Ziyun: \\"I had better return to the city.\\" Shanzhi cut in: \\"Gates will shut — if you go, hurry.\\" Young Master Hua had no choice — rose, dressed formal wear, thanked Ziyun and took leave of the company."},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":4,"tokens":["度香","子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"下来，给了琴言，琴言请安谢了。华公子已走了两步，忽又回转来对着宝珠道：「你们两个真是棋逢敌手，难分高下。你是我度香兄心爱的，所以不肯到我府中来。」又问子云道：「二哥，我可以给他东西么？」子云笑道：「任凭尊意，何必问我？」华公子又从身上解下一块玉佩来，赏了宝珠，宝珠亦谢了。此时十旦都送出来，华公子踉踉跄跄，犹几番回顾，对着琴言、宝珠，以及蕙芳、素兰等八人说：「你们","en":"Hua took two steps, turned back to Baozhu: \\"You two are matched opponents — hard to declare a winner. You are Duxiang's darling — that is why you seldom come to my house.\\" He asked Ziyun: \\"Second Brother — may I give him a gift?\\" Ziyun smiled: \\"As you will — why ask me?\\" Young Master Hua undid another jade plaque for Baozhu — Baozhu thanked him. All ten performers escorted"},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":4,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这边十旦进来，子云命他们换了便衣，重换了一个大圆桌面，把残肴收去，另换几样来。文泽道：「今日星北可谓尽兴，我见他从没这样留恋的。」子云道：「他心上犹以为未足，我若认真留他，他就不去了。他那个林珊枝急得什么似的，尽对我做眼色，只怕还有些醋意。」仲雨道：「何消说得。林珊枝","en":"Here the ten performers entered; Ziyun had them change into plain clothes, swapped for a larger round table, cleared scraps and ordered fresh dishes. Wenze said: \\"Today Xinbei may be said to have enjoyed himself to the full — I have never seen him so loath to leave.\\" Ziyun answered: \\"In his"},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"今日这十旦，若论头一个得意的，自然是琴言，其次要算宝珠了。宝珠此时却颇欢喜，惟有琴言终是冷冷的。子云便问琴言道：「你今日又得了一个知己。华公子是难得赞人的，你一上来他就留心你，以后又独要你与瑶卿唱戏，他这眼力却也不低，一面之间，就赏识如此，你可感激他么？」琴言把子云看了一看，低着头不言语。文泽道：「玉侬今日亦不可无知己之感，星北之倾倒，亦不下庾香，","en":"satisfaction was of course Qinyan, and after him Baozhu. Baozhu glowed inwardly; only Qinyan stayed cool as frost. Ziyun asked Qinyan: \\"Today you have gained another connoisseur. Young Master Hua praises hardly anyone, yet from the moment you came up he had his eye on you, and afterwards he would have none but you and Yaoqing sing. His discernment is no mean thing — on"},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":2,"tokens":["度香","子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"可一味太冷淡了。」琴言被众人讲得，似乎要他去亲近华公子的意思，便气忿忿的无处发泄，因想道：「别人说我也罢，就是度香不该。他既知我与庾香相好，今日又讲这些话来，拿我当什么人看待？越想越气，便淌下泪来。仲雨已经醉了，见了琴言如此光景，便冷笑一声，说道：「你这个相公真有些古怪，难道倒赞坏了？人家用尽心费尽力，还巴结不到这一赞呢。」琴言本已有气，正愁没有处发作，听到此便","en":"resentment building up with nowhere to vent. He thought to himself: \\"It's one thing for the others to say this, but Duxiang of all people should know better. He knows full well of my affections for Yuxiang, yet he speaks these words today — how exactly does he view me?\\" The more he thought, the angrier he grew, until tears finally spilled down his cheeks. Zhongyu was already"},{"paragraph":30,"mentions":3,"tokens":["子云","徐子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云知琴言说话生硬，得罪了仲雨，便解释道：「玉侬今日又吃醉了，瑶卿你同他到那边顽顽，等他醒醒酒再来。」宝珠即拉了琴言到里边去了，劝他道：「你说话太直了，那位张二爷也不是好说话的人。」琴言尚是呜咽。宝珠把华公子所赏之物拿出来与他比了，却小一些儿。那边文泽是","en":"Ziyun knew Qinyan's blunt words had deeply offended Zhongyu, so he mediated: \\"Yunong has simply drunk too much today — Yaoqing, take him over there to amuse yourselves until the wine wears off, and then come back.\\" Baozhu immediately pulled Qinyan inside and"}],"26":[{"paragraph":5,"mentions":1,"tokens":["徐二爷"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"千银子了。」华公子不语，少顷又说道：「前日我听得魏师爷说起那琴言好得很，我却今日才见。有个什么梅少爷和他最好，徐二爷倒是假的。」珊枝道：「其中的细底，奴才也不知道，就是琴言也是今日才见的。」华公子又道：「你也是门内出身，你瞧今日合唱这一出《寻梦》，到底是那个好？」珊枝想了一想，回道：「据奴才论戏，是要讲神情做态。这两个人相貌却差不多，若论戏还是宝珠的唱得熟。琴言第","en":"\\"And what do you think of this Qinyan?\\" the Young Master asked. Shanzhi remained silent. When pressed again, he finally answered, \\"He is good enough, but he is also Second Master Xu's darling. Word has it he refuses to entertain anyone else.\\" \\"Second Master Xu favors Yuan Baozhu, not him,\\" the Young Master countered. \\"I hear Second Master Xu cherishes them both equally,\\" Shanzhi replied. \\"They say he has already spent thousands of silver taels on Qinyan.\\" The Young Master fell silent. After a little while, he spoke again. \\"The other day, Secretary Wei mentioned that Qinyan was extraordinary, yet I only saw him for myself today. There is a young master named Mei whom Qinyan truly favors; his attachment to Second Master Xu is merely an act.\\" \\"This servant is unaware of such details,\\" Shanzhi said cautiously. \\"I only just saw Qinyan today as well.\\" \\"You are of the theater yourself,\\" the Young Master continued. \\"Tell me, in their joint performance of Pursuing the Dream today, who was truly the better of the two?\\" Shanzhi thought for a moment before replying. \\"If we judge strictly on acting, one must consider expression and bearing. In terms of appearance, they are quite matched. However, as for the performance, Baozhu's singing is far more seasoned. Qinyan was still a little raw the first time through, and only slightly better the second.\\" The Young Master nodded in agreement. \\"He is but a beginner, while Baozhu has been performing for two or three years; naturally, he is more polished. Yet, to my eyes, Qinyan possesses the finer appearance. He moves with an ethereal grace, as if set apart from ordinary mortals.\\" Shanzhi lowered his head and offered no reply."},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":5,"tokens":["度香","徐子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"华公子道：「我闻得这两个都是度香所爱，不好去夺他。」聘才道：「度香所爱的是宝珠，琴言不是真喜欢的。公子若当真喜欢他，晚生倒认识，而且常照顾他。他的师傅叫长庆，最爱的是钱，听得公子要，必十分巴结，送上门来的。」华公子倒踌躇不定，心上总碍着徐子云，又因琴言进来，也只得九人，宝珠是断乎不","en":"\\"I hear both are Duxiang's favorites; it would be hard to wrest them away,\\" the Young Master replied. \\"Duxiang truly cherishes Baozhu, not Qinyan,\\" Pincai countered. \\"If the Master desires him, I can assure you it is possible. I know his master, Changqing, quite well, and often"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":1,"tokens":["徐老爷"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这孩子却好，人也聪明。前日在徐二老爷园里唱戏，就是贵东公子，赏了十个金锞子，重十四两有余，算起来值七百来吊钱。徐老爷又自己赏了好些东西。公子还把自己的荷包别子也赏了他，这块玉的颜色，是黄而带红，我不懂得，请教德古斋的沙回子，他说也值二百吊。你能瞧瞧，不是孩子会巴结，讨喜欢，怎得人这么疼他。」","en":"Arriving at Qinyan's door, Maolin alighted first and entered alongside Pincai. Fortunately, Changqing was home and invited them to sit. Changqing looked Pincai over, and because he had come in Ye Maolin's company took him for a person of no consequence, greeting him coolly. Maolin interjected, \\"This is Secretary Wei, the closest confidant of Young Master Hua. Hearing of your fame, he has come especially to discuss a matter of business.\\" Changqing instantly bloomed with obsequious warmth, calling him \\"Secretary this\\" and \\"Secretary that.\\" Recognizing Pincai's cleverness, he eagerly courted him. \\"Young Master Hua favors me beyond measure, and with two of my disciples already in his mansion, his grace is as high as heaven and deep as the earth—truly inexpressible.\\" Tea was served, and after more pleasantries, Changqing prepared his opium lamp, inviting them to lie down. \\"I do not partake,\\" Maolin declined. \\"You entertain Secretary Wei; it will make talking easier.\\" Pincai added, \\"I am but a beginner and cannot prepare the pipe myself.\\" Changqing roasted a prime bowl and passed it to Pincai, who smoked it and returned the pipe. \\"I am an outsider; I won't offer a courtesy smoke in return.\\" When Pincai asked about Qinyan's recent situation, Changqing boasted, \\"The lad is doing wonderfully, and he is quite clever. Just the other day, he sang at Second Master Xu's garden, and your patron, the Young Master, rewarded him with ten gold ingots—over fourteen taels, worth roughly seven hundred strings of cash! Second Master Xu also piled gifts upon him, and the Young Master even gave him his own purse ornament, a yellow-red jade. I asked Sha Huizi at the Degu Studio, and he appraised it at two hundred strings. Without the boy's flattery and charm, who would pamper him so?\\""},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":2,"tokens":["徐老爷"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"道：「话也说得是，再商量罢。我也要问问他愿不愿。」聘才笑道：「老庆，明人不讲暗话。你那琴言的脾气我全知道，除了徐老爷，还有那个人喜欢他？他又肯应酬那一个？若再把徐老爷得罪了…」说到此冷笑一声，又道：「那时你还想靠他一辈子？他只好靠你一辈子了，难道你在家里，倒不晓得他从前为什么病？他就为着梅少爷，大家讲得来。陪酒时有梅少爷就喜欢，没有梅少爷就烦恼，一说就哭，人人厌他","en":"\\"Since his stage debut on the first day of the twelfth month, a mere seven months have passed. Not to mention others, Second Master Xu alone has poured oceans of wealth upon him.\\" Changqing stretched out his hand. \\"This much! My purse is vast, but the money is spent as fast as it is earned. You see my household of over twenty mouths? We rely entirely on him. If he goes to the mansion, he will thrive, but I will founder. He is only fifteen; with five years left until he completes his apprenticeship, would he not earn tens of thousands for me? How can I relinquish him? He is not like Lin Shanzhi, who had a surly temper, ate too many oil cakes, and constantly vexed me until I traded him for Xiufang. When Xiufang graduated, he brought in eight thousand strings of cash—everyone knows this. Qinyan surpasses Xiufang many times over. Secretary, I beg you to plead with the Young Master. He is my only fine disciple, my lifelong reliance. The other boys are worthless; they only cost me money for costumes, attend a few wine banquets a month, and constantly cause trouble...\\" Pincai was about to reply when Ye Maolin stroked his beard and smiled. \\"Old Qing, everything is negotiable. You know Young Master Hua's ways. Others crawl to enter his doors, yet he seeks you out. This is your great fortune! If he catches the Master's fancy, it secures not just one lifetime, but two. Later, you could enter the mansion yourself, obtain a minor post, a minor rank, and great face—surely that beats eating opera rice?\\" \\"Maestro Ye speaks plainly,\\" Pincai added. \\"A mere glance from him rewards one with gold. For a serious hire, would he ever stint? Your entire life would be secured. An early graduation pays more; a late one pays less. He is fourteen or fifteen, and his body is still developing. What if he takes a bad turn in a year or two? Then what? Thousands of strings wasted! I urge you to reflect on this. Anything is negotiable, and you will face no injustice.\\" Having smoked over a dozen puffs, Changqing sat up. \\"That sounds fair enough. We can discuss it, but I must also ask his will.\\" Pincai laughed coldly. \\"Old Qing, bright folks hide nothing. You know Qinyan's temper as well as I do. Aside from Second Master Xu, who else favors him? Who else will he oblige? Offend Second Master Xu...\\" He paused with a sneer, \\"And your lifelong reliance will reverse. At home, you surely know why he fell ill. It was all over Young Master Mei! Everyone knows they click. When he drinks with Mei, he is pleased; without Mei, there are only tears, and everyone tires of it. You are not blind; you merely protect your disciple's face, though the truth is ugly. If you are banking on Young Master Mei to lift him up, you are waiting for a rooster to lay eggs! Think carefully: is my counsel kind or cruel?\\" Changqing had disliked Qinyan's temper all along and had only been talking him up to raise his price; now that Pincai had put a finger on the real sore spot, he could not argue, and conceded, \\"The boy is indeed stubborn. You are a glass lantern, seeing right through it all. Whatever the case, I must lean on him. If the numbers don't work, there is no deal.\\" Maolin pulled Changqing toward the window and whispered, \\"Name your price, so Wei can report back.\\" Changqing reflected that Young Master Hua was a famous soft touch — name any sum and it would be paid. He could not quite bring himself to say ten thousand taels outright, but five or six thousand could certainly be got. So he said to Ye Maolin: \\"You know he has earned over ten thousand in half a year; reckon up the account for five years. It is hard for me to name a figure — let Young Master Hua weigh it as he sees fit.\\" Maolin relayed this to Pincai, who shook his head. \\"Impossible. A boy for ten thousand? He is not some rare treasure. Four or five thousand is suitable.\\" \\"It is a ballpark figure,\\" Maolin reasoned. \\"The best actors graduate for three or four thousand strings; this is more than double that.\\" Changqing shook his head repeatedly before finally saying, \\"At that price, it is impossible. He has only been here half a year. Money aside, my heart cannot bear to release him. I never wished him gone.\\" He wiped his eyes, feigning tears. Pincai thought to himself, 'Crafty devil! Asking for a sky-high price! How can I report this to the Young Master? Even if he doesn't suspect graft, others will. I must crush him with bluster.' Feigning outrage, he stood up. \\"Splendid! Go grow rich yourself, then! I meant to show you kindness, and you bite my hand. In a few days, you will crawl begging to me, entirely worthless.\\" With that, he stormed out."}],"27":[{"paragraph":7,"mentions":1,"tokens":["徐二爷"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"后挡车，有七八匹马跟着，相貌很体面，我看他将来也要做督抚的。我们东家也是不肯去，不知道什么脾气。」仲雨笑道：「徐二爷原是个顶阔的阔人，他与华公子真是一对。前日我为你东家，在他面前求了多少情，出了多少力，他还不晓得，我也没告诉他。论理，你东家应该重重谢我呢。」亮轩忙问何事？仲雨笑道：「久后便知，此事也不必说了。」只见奚十一出来，趿着双细草网凉鞋，穿条三缸青香云纱裤，","en":"Zhongyu laughed. \\"That is the talk outside. Still, the Hua lands run to forty-odd estates, and a year's rent from them would answer for a whole prefecture's grain tax. They are rich enough, certainly.\\" Liangxuan nodded. \\"My patron often speaks of it — that Young Master Hua is an uncle of his own generation, and that the old Duke Hua was the teacher of my former patron, the Provincial Military Commander. With a family connection as good as that, and yet my patron will not cultivate it. I am forever urging him to call. He says the tie came of a recommendation in camp, that Young Master Hua was a child at the time and would not know him if he heard the name; and so he will not go. It is the same with Grand Secretary Xu, who is Governor-General of Guangdong and Guangxi now — he and my old master were sworn brothers in the same camp. Only the Second Young Master is left in the capital. I saw him in the street the other day, in a carriage with flying eaves and seven or eight horses behind it, and a very handsome presence; I should say he will be a governor himself one day. And still my patron will not call. There is no knowing his temper.\\" Zhongyu laughed. \\"Second Master Xu is a very great spender indeed — he and Young Master Hua make a pair. The other day I begged and exerted myself a great deal on your patron's behalf, and he knows nothing about it, and I have never told him. By rights your patron owes me heavy thanks.\\" Liangxuan pressed to know what the matter was, but Zhongyu only smiled. \\"You will hear in good time. There is no need to speak of it now.\\" Just then Xi Eleven came out, shuffling in a pair of fine woven-grass sandals, triple-dyed fragrant-cloud trousers, and a pheasant-pattern ramie jacket, with Ba Yingguan behind holding a black lacquer foreign fan traced in gold, fanning at him now light now hard as he came out grinning. Liangxuan stood up and Zhongyu nodded to him; Xi sat down, and Zhongyu asked, \\"Have you been busy today?\\""},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":6,"tokens":["度香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"特不能欺你，且要巴结你呢！但我有一句话，你倒不要怪我：譬如我们这班人与人相好，原是要论心的，但也不好太过。譬如度香、庾香两人，待你的情分是一样的。不过，庾香专在你身上，不肯移情于人，所以你就为这上头，也就专为他，不肯移动一步，是讲究专致的工夫了。但是庾香比不得别人，他年纪小，没有惯常出来，一切都不甚便当。假使他们太太晓得了，还要教训他，不准他出来；若访出你们相好","en":"you. But I have a word to say — do not take it amiss. Our sort befriend hearts, yet we must not fall into excess. Duxiang and Yuxiang favor you equally. Yuxiang is fixated upon you and will not shift, so you fixate on him and will not budge—that is devotion. Yet Yuxiang is unlike others; he is young, rarely ventures out, and everything is inconvenient. If his parents learn"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":1,"tokens":["徐老爷"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"且看怎样。便满面堆着笑道：「不瞒大老爷说，我们班里近日串了几出新戏，前在怡园演了一个月，才上台。前日华公子即在徐老爷处见了，就把他们叫了进府，唱了两天了，还要三天才得唱完。琴言的戏又多，华公子又喜欢他。若是别处，就可以叫回来，惟有这个府里，小的们是不敢去的。大老爷或与公子有交情，倒可以打发管家拿个贴子，去要了出来。如果合老爷的意，就将他留着使唤都使得。小的久闻大老","en":"Xi frowned: \\"He's not in the city every day; why today of all days? Nonsense! Bring him out quickly. Why hide him? You might hide others, but didn't you ask who I am? Do you think you can hide from me? Don't play stupid.\\" Changqing saw his ill intent, smiled, and stalled, planning a delay; he had to deploy a big hat first to intimidate him. Heaping on smiles, he said: \\"In truth, our troupe lately staged new plays. After a month at the Garden, they just opened. The other day, Young Master Hua saw them at Lord Xu's and summoned them to the mansion. They have sung for two days, with three days remaining. Qinyan's roles are many, and the Young Master favors him. Anywhere else we would recall him, but for that mansion, we small folk dare not approach. If my Lord shares ties with them, send a steward with a card and demand him out; if he suits you, keep him. I have long heard of the Great Master's fame and often wished to invite you, but I feared your noble feet would not tread on low ground. Having never served you, I didn't presume. Don't suspect us of hiding him. Why would we? Even for middling callers, we produce him.\\""}],"28":[{"paragraph":9,"mentions":1,"tokens":["徐老爷"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"在是有个小旦，名字叫作琴言，少爷常去找他，见了面，两人也是哭的时候多，笑的时候少。就是五月里，有一天说是到怡园徐老爷处，也是假的，就同了那个小旦，还有一个也是小旦，在东门外运河里游了半天，也是哭了半天。小的在船头上，别样话是听不见的。前日少爷到了那个小旦家里，那个小旦说起琴言进了什么华公府里去了，又把那个小旦给少爷留了一个纸包，小的却不知道是什么东西，少爷就在那里","en":"Upon returning home, he paid his respects to Lady Yan and then retired to his study. He lay down, muttering to himself, alternating between heavy sighs and sudden tears, as though intoxicated. By the following day, a severe illness had taken hold. His mind was in turmoil, his speech disjointed. Throughout the day, he broke down weeping multiple times. Initially, he could suppress his tears when others were present, but gradually, he lost all control. Even in the presence of his mother, tears streamed down his face, his expression vacant and his spirit crushed. Lady Yan, believing he had been afflicted by some evil spirit, summoned physicians to treat him. She even resorted to drawing lots, consulting diviners, making vows, and praying to the gods. For over ten days, there was not a sliver of improvement. During a single day, he would alternate between stupor and clarity. In his stupor, he was entirely oblivious, seemingly deaf and blind to his surroundings. When clear-headed, he appeared as healthy as anyone else. In his sleep, he muttered incessantly—sometimes calling for \\"Yunong,\\" sometimes \\"Xiangwan,\\" and at times, vehemently cursing Xi Eleven and Wei Pincai. Lady Yan was frantic with worry. Yan Zhongqing and Wang Xun visited every few days; they understood the root of the malady but were powerless to cure it. After discussing the matter, they felt they could not reveal the truth to Lady Yan, offering only gentle, evasive comforts. Hearing Ziyu constantly cry out \\"Yunong\\" in his sleep, Lady Yan grew suspicious that he had become entangled in some illicit affair outside. Assuming \\"Yunong\\" was a woman's name, she suspected a scandalous secret. Knowing Ziyu rarely ventured out, and never without Yun, she summoned the servant one day for a rigorous interrogation. \\"Where exactly have you been taking the young master?\\" she demanded. \\"Who is this Yunong? A courtesan, or someone else?\\" Yun initially denied everything, insisting, \\"The young master only goes to the Garden of Contentment, or to Young Master Wang's and Young Master Shi's residences. He has never seen a woman. If this lowly one lies, may I not live to see tomorrow.\\" Lady Yan thought, \\"Gentle questions will yield nothing; he won't confess.\\" She ordered the servants to bring the heavy bamboo rods. \\"Beat the truth out of him!\\" she commanded. Seeing the rods, Yun fell to his knees and kowtowed frantically. \\"There truly is a young dan named Qinyan! The young master often seeks him out. When they meet, they cry more than they laugh. During the fifth month, there was a day they claimed to be visiting Lord Xu at the Garden of Contentment, but it was a lie. The young master went with that young dan and another young dan to boat on the canal east of the gate for half a day, and they cried for half a day. This lowly one was at the bow of the boat and heard nothing else. The other day, the young master visited that young dan's home. The other young dan told him Qinyan had entered Young Master Hua's mansion, and handed the young master a paper bundle—this lowly one does not know what was inside. The young master wept right there. They tried to comfort him, but ever since returning, he has been like this. Not a single word is false, and nothing else has happened!\\" Hearing this, Lady Yan burned with anger and scolded Yun fiercely, \\"You deserve a severe thrashing! Why didn't you tell me sooner, waiting until the rods were brought out to speak? If not for your honesty today, I would have had you beaten to death!\\" She dismissed Yun, her heart filling with resentment toward her son. He was young and reckless; to squander his health and fall so desperately ill over a mere young dan! She wanted to lecture him harshly, but seeing him so profoundly sick, and realizing she was past forty with only this one son, she held back. If she lectured him and worsened his condition, what good would it do? It was better to wait until he recovered. Pondering the situation from every angle, she summoned Li Yuanmao to uncover the full truth."},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":1,"tokens":["徐老爷"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"。今年正月初六日，在姑苏会馆唱戏，是头一回见少爷。不知是怎么缘故，倒像从前认识的一样。到元宵那一日，小的到怡园徐老爷家看灯，看他们制些灯谜，内中小的最爱那「落花人独立，微雨燕双飞」那个灯谜，徐二老爷就把一张瑶琴，作了这个灯谜的彩头，说有人猜着了，我就请他来与你相见。这日刚刚是少爷猜着。过了两天就请了少爷来喝酒，叫小的来伺候。自从那一天才认识。第二次是素兰邀游运河，","en":"As Qinyan stepped over the threshold, his mind was solely on Ziyu's grave illness. Driven by a love he could scarcely endure, he had ignored the risks of fortune and disaster, steeling himself for Lady Yan's harsh scolding. Pincai's threatening words in the carriage had left him timid and trembling. He approached, kowtowed deeply to the Lady, rose, and stood with his head bowed. Lady Yan called him closer, studied him intently once more, and bid Pincai sit. \\"Where are you from? When did you arrive in the capital? How did you come to know my son? And how close is your bond? Tell me the complete truth, and I will not harm you.\\" Seeing her gentle expression, Qinyan relaxed slightly, though tears still shimmered in his eyes. He mumbled a few indistinct words. Sensing his fear, Lady Yan soothed him, \\"Do not be afraid. This is my son's failing; he sought you out, not the other way around. Put your mind at ease. I swear I will not hurt you, but you must not evade the truth. Speak plainly.\\" Qinyan paused, then said, \\"This humble one is from Suzhou. I arrived in the capital last winter with the Lianjin troupe. Both my parents are dead; my uncle's wife sold me. On the sixth day of the New Year, at the Suzhou guild, I saw the young master for the first time. Oddly, it felt as if we had known each other before. During the Lantern Festival, I went to Lord Xu's Garden of Contentment to see the lanterns and the riddles they were making. I loved the riddle, 'Fallen flowers, a man stands alone; fine rain, a pair of swallows fly.' Second Master Xu offered a jade qin as the prize, saying he would introduce the winner to me. That day, it was the young master who guessed it. Two days later, there was a feast, and I was called to serve. That was our first true meeting. The second time was when Sulan invited us boating on the canal, where we spent half a day. It was only those two times. This is the absolute truth. If Madame does not believe me, please ask Secretary Wei. Besides, Madame surely knows of the young master's outings.\\" Before he could finish, tears spilled uncontrollably down his cheeks. Pincai interjected, \\"This is all true. They truly haven't even met three times.\\" Lady Yan listened, puzzled, yet moved to deep pity by Qinyan's demeanor. She thought, \\"How could they have only met twice in half a year?\\" She asked, \\"Your words are naturally true, but my son now dreams of you constantly. Surely you understand why.\\" Qinyan replied, \\"With Madame's grace, how would this humble one dare to lie? It is truly strange. Not only did I feel I had seen the young master before, but upon seeing me, he also said it was as if we were already acquainted. The moment we met, it felt as though we were family, yet neither of us could explain the cause.\\" Lady Yan smiled, \\"Hearing your words, it is indeed strange, and I cannot fathom it. But my son is now this ill because you entered the Hua mansion. I called you here to comfort and heal him. If you succeed, I will not blame you; instead, I will reward you.\\" Qinyan felt a deeper surge of grief, stifling a sob and murmuring an indistinct reply. Pitying him further, Lady Yan invited Pincai and Qinyan into Ziyu's room, while she and Pincai remained in the outer room to listen to what they would say and observe the scene. Xu Shun, having stood by and finally understood the source of the young master's illness, followed them into the bedroom to listen closely. As to how Qinyan cured Ziyu's sickness, listen to the explanation in the next installment."}],"30":[{"paragraph":4,"mentions":3,"tokens":["度香","子云","徐子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"此日是八月十二，华公子想起六月二十一日在怡园观剧，说秋凉了请度香过来。因想十五日是家宴之辰，不便请客，即定于十四日，请子云、次贤、文泽等，在西园中铺设了几处，并有灯戏。为他们是城外人，日间断不能尽兴，于下贴时说明了夜宴。此日正是秋试二场，刘文泽为什么不应举呢？这一科大主考即系文泽之父大宗伯刘守正，副主考系王文辉，","en":"the play at the Garden of Contentment on the twenty-first of the sixth month, when he had said he would invite Duxiang over once the autumn air cooled. Thinking that the fifteenth would be a family banquet and inconvenient for guests, he set the date for the fourteenth, inviting Ziyun, Cixian, Wenze, and others. He arranged several spots in the West Garden and prepared"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"且说十四日早，子云与次贤商议道：「今日华公子请我作通宵之饮，且闻赏灯，他今日必有一番热闹局面，并闻五大名班合唱。」即传家人分派跟班，检点衣服什物，零星珍宝赏需等类。总管预备好了，交与家人点过，免得临时短少。说着已到未初，当下二人早吃了早饭，穿了衣裳，上车一径往华府来。","en":"On the morning of the fourteenth, Ziyun discussed with Cixian: \\"Today Young Master Hua has invited us for an all-night feast and to view lanterns. There must be quite a lively scene today, and I heard five famous troupes will perform together.\\" He then ordered his servants to assign attendants,"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"六品服饰的，领着四个人上来，铺设桌面，摆了两席。戏房便作起乐来，随后银盘金碗，玉液琼浆献上来。华公子起身安席，子云、文泽等推让，欲要并作一席，也换个圆桌，华公子执定不肯，遂让次贤首坐，文泽次之，那一桌子云首坐，仲雨次之，聘才与自己作陪。","en":"and soon silver plates, golden bowls, and fine wine were served. Young Master Hua stood up to seat the guests. Ziyun, Wenze, and the others politely declined, suggesting they combine into one table and use a round one instead, but Young Master Hua insisted. Consequently, Cixian took the seat of honor at the first table, with Wenze next to him. At the other table, Ziyun"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":6,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，又凑上一个，作了一出《秦淮河看花大会》，有幽闲的，有妖冶的，有静婉的，有风流的，极尽靡艳之致，众人尽皆喝采。子云、次贤等就于此出中间放了赏。华公子对着笑道：「此系抄袭吾兄旧文，殊觉数见不鲜。」子云道：「唱的甚好，贞静的却极贞静，放浪的却极放浪，没有一人雷同。」文泽道：「这出戏我倒没有见他们唱过。」次贤道：「如今秦淮河也冷落了。就是从前马湘兰的相貌，也只中等，并","en":"coquettish, some quiet and gentle, and some romantic, exhibiting the utmost alluring charm. Everyone applauded. Ziyun, Cixian, and the others gave rewards right in the middle of the performance. Young Master Hua smiled and said, \\"This is cribbed from your own old programme, elder brother — one sees it rather too often.\\" Ziyun said, \\"They sang very well. The demure ones"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":7,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"蕙芳敬到子云面前，子云问起春航场中文字得意么，蕙芳道：「前日史竹君说他的很好，是必中的。」文泽在那席听了笑道：「我听得你在家，天天的焚香祷告，湘帆就文章不佳，也是必要中的。」蕙芳笑道：「谁说的？中举可以祷告得来，我倒愿替众人祷告了。」华公子问道：「你们说的什么？","en":"When Huifang offered wine to Ziyun, Ziyun asked how Chunhang's examination essays went. Huifang replied, \\"The other day, Shi Zhujun said his essays were very good and he will definitely pass.\\" Hearing this from the other table, Wenze laughed and said, \\"I heard you burn incense and pray"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":2,"tokens":["度香","子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"」说得众人不解，蕙芳怔了一怔，脸上不觉红起来。华公子看了，想起前日的话，动了些怜念，料有些隐情不好讲，慢慢的问度香罢了，便倒把别的话支开。当下谈笑间，饮了许多酒，戏唱过了好几出，吃过了两道点心。华公子起身道：「请到园中散散罢。」次贤、子云道：「甚好，本来酒已多了。」诸客一同起身，就有四五个家人，急忙从廊下近路抄入，通知园门伺候。","en":"ago, felt a bit of pity. He guessed there was some hidden matter that was hard to speak of. He decided to ask Duxiang about it later, at his leisure, and changed the subject. Amidst the chatting and laughing, they drank a lot of wine, watched several plays, and had two courses of snacks. Young Master Hua stood up and said, \\"Let's take a stroll in the garden.\\" Cixian"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":4,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云等欲要坐下，华公子让到里面去，从屏后走进，便见一个所在，里窄外宽，三面如扇面。绮窗雕槅，中间用乌木、象牙、紫檀、黄杨作成极细的花样。此中隔作五六处，前面不用帘子，是一带碧纱栊。众人到阁前看时，底下是一道清溪，有两个小画舫泊着。对面也是水阁，却通垂了湘","en":"Ziyun and the others were about to sit down, but Young Master Hua ushered them further inside. Walking behind a screen, they found a space that was narrow on the inside and wide on the outside, shaped like a fan on three sides. The beautiful windows were carved,"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云见了琴言，此时低眉垂首，不像从前高傲神气。且隔了两月，从前是朝亲夕见的，如今倒像是相逢陌路，对面无言，未免有些感慨。即叫他走近，问了些话，要问起子玉来，却又缩住。次贤、文泽也问了几句。","en":"Ziyun saw that Qinyan stood with his eyes lowered and his head bowed, showing none of his former proud bearing. They had been apart for two months. Once they had met with easy familiarity, morning and evening; now they faced each other in silence, almost as"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"：「为何不欢而散？你且说来。」子佩道：「今日和我妻舅归自荣，同到他的妻舅乌大傻家替他婶娘祝寿。」仲雨听了要笑，子云道：「有了乌大傻，自然就不妥了。」文泽点点头道：「这套话倒必定可听，快说罢。」子佩道：","en":"his brother-in-law Wu Dasha, to celebrate his aunt's birthday.\\" Zhongyu wanted to laugh when he heard this, and Ziyun said, \\"With Wu Dasha there, things naturally wouldn't go well.\\" Wenze nodded, \\"This story is definitely worth hearing; hurry up and tell us.\\" Zipei continued:"},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":2,"tokens":["徐子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"出，显显本领；况且多少赏鉴家都在此，或者巴结的上，于你有点好处。」子佩啐了一口道：「我又不是相公，要巴结谁？」徐子云道：「谁又当你是相公？就是顾曲登场，也是风流自赏的事。况你具此美貌，不教人赞声，岂不也冤枉煞了。」你一句，我一句，说得冯子佩有些活动，便道：「今日没有伙计，唱不成的。」华公子道：「怎么没有？你就不和班里人唱。」呶嘴道：「张老二，魏老大就很在行的。」仲","en":"impress them, it might be beneficial for you.\\" Zipei spat, \\"I'm not an actor, who do I need to curry favor with?\\" Xu Ziyun said, \\"Who's treating you as an actor? Even if you go on stage for the love of music, it's an elegant amusement. Moreover, with your beautiful looks, not having people praise you would be a tragic waste.\\" As everyone chimed in, Feng Zipei began to warm"},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":2,"tokens":["徐子云","子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"众客亦皆站起静看。华公子道：「奇怪！居然像个好妇人，今日倒要压倒群英了。」子佩听得众人赞他，略有一分羞涩；又见徐子云身旁站着蕙芳、宝珠，见蕙芳看看他，便凑着子云讲些话，又凑着宝珠讲些话；又见宝珠微笑；又见刘文泽与萧次贤站着，在一处彼此俯耳低言，大约是品评他的意思。原来文泽与蕙芳倒不是讲冯子佩，倒讲的是归自荣。","en":"outshine all the beauties.\\" Hearing the praise, Zipei felt a bit bashful. He saw Huifang and Baozhu standing beside Xu Ziyun. Huifang glanced at him, then leaned towards Ziyun to whisper a few words, and then towards Baozhu, who smiled. He also saw Liu Wenze and Xiao Cixian standing together, whispering in each other's ears, probably discussing him. In fact, Wenze and Huifang"},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"华公子是不喜与闻这些事情，故不理会，只顾看子佩出神，忽叫斟大杯酒来。家人捧上一个大玉杯，华公子叫送到子云面前。未知子云饮与不饮，且听下回分解。","en":"for a large cup of wine. A servant brought a large jade goblet, and Young Master Hua told him to present it to Ziyun. Whether Ziyun drinks it or not, listen to the next chapter to find out."}],"31":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说华公子看到得意处，把酒来敬子云诸人，合席只得满饮了一杯，共赞聘才、子佩作得出神入妙，非寻常戏脚所能。","en":"Young Master Hua, watching the performance with sheer delight, raised his wine cup to toast Ziyun and the rest of the company. The entire table had no choice but to drain their cups in unison, collectively praising Pincai and Zipei for an acting performance so divine and marvelous that it lay far beyond the reach of ordinary theater players."},{"paragraph":2,"mentions":4,"tokens":["徐子云","子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"我听得他们说，你倒真像个阎婆惜。你若化了女身，也是个不安本分的。」子佩道：「好吗！你们逼我上台，又要取笑我。」徐子云问聘才道：「魏兄这音律实在精妙，将来尚要请教，如闲时可到敝园走走。」聘才连连答应道：「晚生是无师传授，都是听会的，就是上台也是头一回。莫要见笑。」于是大家猜拳行令，闹了一会，钟上已到子正时候了。子云道：「才到秋分，不应如此夜短。」次贤道：「亦觉久了，","en":"Zipei retorted, \\"Well, isn't this fine! You force me onto the stage, and then you make a laughingstock of me.\\" Xu Ziyun then turned to Pincai and asked, \\"Brother Wei, your mastery of music is truly exquisite. I must ask for your guidance in the future. When you have the leisure, please do come visit my humble garden.\\" Pincai nodded repeatedly in agreement, \\"I have never"},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"俱以戏酒耽搁，不能使你们一试所长。此刻尚早，会诗的，不妨吟几句；会画的，不妨画几笔，不必谦让。」诸旦默默无言，子云与文泽站起来道：「妙，妙！待我来分派。」即对着蕙芳道：「媚香是长于诗的，瑶卿是长于丹青的，静芳是长于舞剑的，香畹是长于书法的，佩仙是长于填词的，蕊香是长于猜谜诙谐的，瘦香是长于品箫的，小梅是长于吹笙的。可惜玉侬又病了，他倒会一套《平沙落雁》。」华公子","en":"those who excel in painting, brush a few strokes. There is no need for false modesty.\\" The dans remained silent. Ziyun and Wenze stood up and said, \\"Splendid, splendid! Let us assign the tasks.\\" Turning to Huifang, he said, \\"Meixiang excels in poetry, Yaoqing is skilled in painting, Jingfang is a master of the sword dance, Xiangwan possesses beautiful calligraphy, Peixian"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"洞箫倒吹得和平。华公子摇摇头道：「琴声不佳，箫声倒好。」子云道：「琴本难学，也还亏他。」次贤道：「想你不长弹，生疏了。」琴言道：「有半年不学了，方才第四段第三句几乎想不出来。瘦香的箫，比从前更好了。」漱芳道：「我是向老师课学。静宜先生隔三日必教我一吹，所以不生。」琴言默然，抚今追昔，颇觉感慨，几乎落下泪来，只","en":"grace. Young Master Hua shook his head and commented, \\"The sound of the qin is poor, but the xiao is quite lovely.\\" Ziyun interjected, \\"The qin is inherently difficult to master; we must still give him credit.\\" Cixian added, \\"I imagine you have not practiced in a long time, and so the skill has grown rusty.\\" Qinyan replied, \\"I have not touched the instrument for half a"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"不到半个时辰，已经画完，成了二尺余长一个小横幅。华公子与子云等走近来，赞不绝口。华公子看了甚是欢喜，大赞道：「却实在亏他，怎么能够如此。无怪乎近来个个说他们的才貌，正是羞死从前那一班爱钱的相公了。」次贤又替他略略的润色了几处，竟成一幅好画。华公子即问蕙芳道：「你们题的想是有了？」蕙芳道：「有是有了，只是不好。","en":"than an hour, the painting was complete—a small, horizontal scroll spanning just over two feet. Young Master Hua, Ziyun, and the rest gathered around, their praise unceasing. Young Master Hua was absolutely delighted, praising him loudly: \\"It is truly a marvel that he could achieve such a feat. It is no wonder that lately everyone speaks so highly of their talent and"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"华公子一样赞好，道：「工力悉敌，竟是元、白同时了。」子云道：「也要改两字。第三句嫦娥二字，与前首相同，不若改作「广寒宫殿层层启」，不好么？」素兰道：「果然改得好。」始而子云恐素兰不及蕙芳，及到此刻才放了心。再看玉林的填词，填的《一痕沙》小令，看词是：娇舞酣歌深院，绣幕锦屏香软。珠履客三千，集群贤。月若有情","en":"craftsmanship is equally matched; it is as if the great poets Yuan Zhen and Bai Juyi have appeared in the same age.\\" Ziyun added, \\"I would also suggest changing two characters. The 'Chang'e' in the third line repeats the word from the previous poem. Would it not be better to change it to 'The gates of the Cold Moon palace unlatch tier upon tier'?\\" Sulan agreed, \\"Indeed,"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云等又将零星玩物，分赏众旦毕，各人同散，华公子直送出穿堂方回。惟冯子佩困乏已甚，已在留青精舍榻上睡了，聘才也自归房，华公子吩咐书童好好伺候冯子佩，一面也进内室。","en":"Ziyun and the others distributed assorted trinkets among the dans as rewards, and the guests all scattered their separate ways. Young Master Hua escorted them all the way out to the main vestibule before turning back. Only Feng Zipei, who was thoroughly exhausted,"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":1,"tokens":["度香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"更光景。」南湘道：「我们这些文章倒要早早的作起来，刻成一集，刷印几十本，交他带回。其分金，各人量力而行。或者如度香、静宜、前舟，也可叫他们出一分。","en":"take home. As for the subscription funds, let each man contribute according to his means. Perhaps we can also ask Duxiang, Jingyi, and Qianzhou to contribute a share as well."},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"明日，南湘、仲清即致札与子云、前舟诸人，数日后都送了些分金，并有几首歌行。南湘、仲清看了，点过分金是：子云二十四，文泽十六，次贤十二，共五十二两。仲清道：「我们共有六分，每人八两，共凑成一百两也就够了。」南湘道：「很够了。」于是又致札众人，两三日间都要凑足。诗文共遗集，俱已发刻","en":"The following day, Nanxiang and Zhongqing wrote letters to Ziyun, Qianzhou, and several others. A few days later, the subscription funds arrived, along with several verses and songs. Nanxiang and Zhongqing tallied the contributions: Ziyun gave twenty-four taels, Wenze gave sixteen, and Cixian gave twelve, bringing"}],"33":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["徐子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"颜夫人回说不好专主，须寄信到江西，俟其回信转来，再为定夺，子玉因此连王宅也不大去了。徐子云近日补了缺，衙门中添了些公事，不能天天在园。","en":"wait for a reply before settling the matter. Because of this, Ziyu seldom visited the Wang residence. Recently, Xu Ziyun had filled a vacancy, which added public duties to his work in the yamen, preventing him from spending every day in the garden."},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":2,"tokens":["度香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"岂肯长受委屈的？」子玉道：「我听得待他甚好，有甚委屈处？」宝珠道：「好原好，但华公子那人究竟不能十分体贴人的。度香这么样待玉侬，尚不能得玉侬欢心，那边能如度香这么样么？","en":"suffer?\\" Baozhu said, \\"Being treated well is one thing, but Young Master Hua is not entirely considerate. Even Duxiang's treatment couldn't win Yunong's heart; how could that place compare to Duxiang's?"}],"34":[{"paragraph":19,"mentions":1,"tokens":["徐度香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"冯子佩即与聘才同榻，聘才道：「我看近来好虚名而不讲实际的多。即如华公子、徐度香一班人，挥金如土，是大老官的脾气。但于那些相公，未免过于看得尊贵，当他与自己一样。","en":"to me that lately there are many who love empty fame and care nothing for substance. Take Young Master Hua, Xu Duxiang, and that set: they scatter gold like dust—the temperament of grand lords indeed. But they hold those young actors in altogether too exalted a regard, treating them as their own equals."},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":1,"tokens":["徐度香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"个奴才也不称，也要讲究字画琴棋，真真的可恶！」冯子佩道：「可不是，若常这么样，还有谁叫他？难道这许多相公竟靠着徐度香诸公么？一辈子连个有势有利的人都不认得，真是些个胡涂虫。」聘才道：「后日我要叫几个相公，也做个胜会。至于那几个假斯文的，我一概不要。你想想叫谁好？」子佩道：","en":"\\"Exactly so. If it were always like that, who would still engage them? Surely all these actors cannot live off Xu Duxiang and his gentlemen alone? To pass a whole lifetime without knowing a single man of power or means—they are muddle-headed worms indeed.\\" Pincai said, \\"The day after tomorrow I mean to call a few actors and hold a grand gathering of our own. As for those"}],"35":[{"paragraph":7,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉看时，才知道明日是宝珠的生日，请名士、名旦在他寓里一叙，子云便要在他园里辰刻毕集。子玉作了回札应允。","en":"following day was Baozhu's birthday. Famous scholars and performers were invited to gather at Baozhu's residence, and Ziyun wanted everyone to assemble at his garden by the chen hour. Ziyu wrote a reply accepting the invitation."},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"到了明日，只说怡园请酒，禀明了颜夫人，即到王恂处，一同来到怡园。次贤那日要在红茶仙馆里面，一切都是他预备，不要子云费心，却说那红茶仙馆是去年新辟的，地方在梅崦之前，梨院海棠春圃之后，本是空地，只有一个亭子。亭外有两块英州灵石，一块有一丈二尺高，一块四尺余高。有一株大玉兰花，树身已有一抱有余，就倚着那块大石。那小石边也有一棵红茶花，是千层起楼的，名为宝珠山茶，已有","en":"arranged for everything to be hosted inside the Red Camellia Immortal Pavilion, taking charge of all preparations so Ziyun wouldn't have to worry. This pavilion had been newly constructed the previous year, situated in front of Plum Knoll and behind the Pear Courtyard and Crabapple Spring Enclosure. It had originally been an empty plot with only a single pavilion. Outside"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"名之意与此相同，故要在此处。且厌平时酒菜不能翻新，三日前即把酒菜器皿通身亲手检点，意欲与平日不同。是日绝早即将子云行厨挪到仙馆厢房里来。次贤每一样菜开一个做法，怎样烹调，怎样脍炙，油盐酱醋各有分量。费了一日心，配成三十二样菜。","en":"advance, determined to make this occasion uniquely distinct from usual gatherings. Very early that day, he had Ziyun's traveling kitchen moved into the side rooms of the Immortal Pavilion. Cixian prescribed a specific cooking method for every single dish, detailing exactly how it should be boiled or roasted, and specifying the precise measurements for oil, salt, soy"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":5,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"料他惜花客，坐月到黄昏。」子玉看了，心中想道：「此诗是谁做的？却才刻起，像个望花而不见的意思。」故羡慕起来。子云和众人也来看这诗，子云道：「庾香，此诗如何，可好么？」子玉道：「诗意甚好，但何以单刻这一首，想是新咏。」子云道：「这是玉侬近日怀梅崦的诗，瑶卿抄了他的出来，也是个望梅止渴的意思，我故把他刻了。真是花是人非，吾兄尚忆去年否？」几句话提起子玉的心事，不觉","en":"just been carved, and seems to express a longing for flowers one cannot see,\\" and he found himself admiring it. Ziyun and the others also came over to look at the poem. Ziyun asked, \\"Yuxiang, what do you think of this poem? Is it good?\\" Ziyu replied, \\"The sentiment is excellent, but why carve only this one poem? It must be a new composition.\\" Ziyun explained, \\"This"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云道：「静宜实在有这想头，不知怎样想出来，真是胸有造化。」次贤笑道：「这没有什么奇。少停有两个杯子，却会走路，要到谁就到谁。」大家忙问道：「何不就拿出来试试？」次贤道：「少时行令时便用他，就只有两个。这两个叫银匠改了四五次，费了一个月工夫才成。」蕙芳道","en":"Ziyun said, \\"Jingyi truly has a remarkable imagination. I don't know how he comes up with these things; he really has a creative mind.\\" Cixian chuckled, \\"This is nothing extraordinary. Shortly, there will be two cups that can actually walk. They will go to"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":3,"tokens":["徐老爷","子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"文泽即问蕙芳所以然的缘故，蕙芳笑道：「等我再试一遍，方可相信。」于是又把杯子看了看，记好了，斟了酒，说声：「敬徐老爷酒！」那杯便送到子云面前。子云笑道：「十二个人，怎样单是他看得出？我偏不信。」","en":"position, poured the wine, and announced: \\"A cup of wine for Lord Xu!\\" The cup was delivered right in front of Ziyun. Ziyun chuckled, \\"With twelve people here, how is it that only he can figure it out? I simply don't believe it.\\""},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"于是也把座子下看了一遍，斟了酒，说道：「敬媚香一杯！」那杯错走到子玉面前，引得众人大笑。子云笑道：「真有些古怪，我也叫不应他。」子玉把酒饮了，细看轮盘里，已懂了八分，便笑道：「我也来试试，不知灵不灵。」斟了酒，说道：「这杯酒敬瑶卿！」那杯子便对着宝珠走来，走到面前，碰着箸子住了。蕙芳拍手笑道：「又一个人知道了。」子玉也甚欢喜，宝珠饮了酒，便","en":"So Ziyun also inspected the underside of the base, poured some wine, and said, \\"A cup for Meixiang!\\" But the cup mistakenly rolled over to Ziyu, causing everyone to burst into laughter. Ziyun laughed and admitted, \\"This really is a bit peculiar; I can't command"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":4,"tokens":["子云","徐老爷"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"便斟上了酒，把杯子的记号对着子云，将要放时，忽然想道：「离得甚近，恐怕走过了。」便站起把杯子放远了些，说道：「敬徐老爷一杯！」那杯子果然直走到子云面前。子云称异，喝了。子玉笑道：「是了，不错的了。」蕙芳对子玉道：「你恐怕走的远，故放远些。我看静宜于近处则斟得浅，于远处便斟得满。此杯","en":"He poured the wine and aimed the cup's marker toward Ziyun. Just as he was about to release it, he suddenly thought, \\"It's quite close; I might overshoot.\\" So he stood up, placed the cup a bit further away, and called out, \\"A cup for Lord Xu!\\" The cup rolled straight to Ziyun. Ziyun marveled and drank the wine."},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"些。如果那数目飞不出来，便照数目多少罚酒。」宝珠道：「譬如要飞十二，飞不出就要罚十二杯么？」文泽道：「自然。」子云道：「这也过多，且到临时再斟酌罢。前舟你且起令，看飞到谁。」文泽道：「我们坐在东边的，转过去自下而上，你们在西边的，须自上而下，方顺手。」次贤道：「不差，请先喝令杯。」便斟了一杯，走到文泽面前。文泽喝了，便说道：「梅花柳絮一时新。」一字在第五，数到是","en":"instance, if I have to recite twelve and can't, do I have to drink twelve penalty cups?\\" Wenze confirmed, \\"Naturally.\\" Ziyun interjected, \\"That's too much; let's deliberate on it when the time comes. Qianzhou, start the game and let's see who the cup lands on.\\" Wenze instructed, \\"Those of us sitting on the east side will count from bottom to top, and you on the west side must"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"了有半刻工夫，飞到王恂道：「门前才下七香车。」王恂喝了，飞出八字是薛逢《夜宴赠妓》的「愁傍翠蛾深八字」。数到了子云，子云喝了酒，道：「这九字只怕少些，就有也没有好句了。」因想了一会，念道：「宝扇迎归九华帐。」一数数到素兰，素兰喝了酒，飞出十字道：「闺里佳人年十余。」数到了漱芳，漱芳道：「我轮到两回了。」只得喝了酒，道：「幸亏还记得一句「十一月中长至夜」。」便对宝","en":"clings to the deep figure-eight brows' from Xue Feng's \\"Night Banquet Bestowing a Courtesan.\\" The count reached Ziyun, who drank and noted, \\"Lines with 'nine' are likely scarcer, and even if there are some, they might not be good.\\" After thinking for a while, he recited, \\"The jeweled fan welcomes her return to the nine-flowered canopy.\\" The count landed on Sulan. Sulan"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":2,"tokens":["度香","子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"也就少了。」即念道：「花面丫头十三四。」瑶卿、媚香各饮一杯。媚香飞一句算结罢。」蕙芳道：「其实轮不到我，应该是度香。」子云道：「你飞了罢。」蕙芳想了一想，道：「幸亏还记得这一句，静宜与庾香都喝一杯。」即道：「年初十五最风流。」次贤道：「很好。」即与子玉喝了酒，收了令，吃了几样菜，几样点心。","en":"Meixiang, recite a line to finish the game.\\" Huifang objected, \\"Actually, it shouldn't land on me; it should be Duxiang's turn.\\" Ziyun urged, \\"Just recite it.\\" Huifang thought for a moment and said, \\"Fortunately, I remember this line. Jingyi and Yuxiang, both drink a cup.\\" He then recited, \\"The fifteenth of the first month is the most romantic.\\" Cixian approved, \\"Very"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"：「也好，横竖大家费点心，也可以消消食，不然这些东西在肚子里何以消化。就恐他们要凑《毛诗》，未免苦人所难了。」子云道：「不然，单是我们七人行这个苦令，他们五人另行一个甜令，何如？我们搜索枯肠想不出时，听了他们行得好的，也可触动灵机，或者倒凑出来呢。」坐中一齐说：「好！但不知叫他们行个什么令呢？」子云道：「我也有个令。」于是叫书童拿两颗骰子，并一个小碟子来。","en":"help us digest our food. But forcing the performers to navigate the *Mao Shi* would indeed be too much to ask.\\" Ziyun proposed a compromise: \\"How about we split up? The seven of us scholars will play this 'bitter' and difficult game, while the five performers play a 'sweet' and easier one. Listening to their lines might even inspire us scholars when we get stuck.\\" Everyone"},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":3,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云道：「这骰子名色，么为月，二为星，三为雁，四为人，五为梅，六为天。如掷出么二色样，即是一月一星，须集两句曲文，一句说月，一句说星，也要气韵联属。如本来两句连缀更佳，各人贺一个双杯。如在一套曲里者，各人贺一杯。说得不好者，罚一杯。说颠倒者，譬如月在前星","en":"Ziyun explained the dice symbols: \\"One is the moon, two is a star, three is a goose, four is a person, five is a plum, and six is heaven. If someone rolls a one and a two, they must recite two lines of opera lyrics—one containing 'moon' and the other 'star'—ensuring"},{"paragraph":31,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"只见玉林掷了一个二四，念了《闻铃》两句道：「长空孤雁添悲哽，峨嵋山下少人行。」众人也说：「好。」子云道：「就是情景凄凉些。」也各贺了一杯。这边王恂想着了，说道：「我用裴虔余一句，温飞卿一句，合着是：玉搔头袅凤双飞，燕钗落处无声腻。」子云、文泽大赞道：「妙，妙！此二句如一句，实在接得妙。」王恂又说道：「奉时辰牡，颜如渥丹。是并蒂牡丹花。」众人尚未开口","en":"goose in the vast sky deepens the grief; beneath Emei few travelers pass.'\\" Everyone agreed it was good, though Ziyun noted the mood was rather bleak; nevertheless, they each toasted one cup. Over on the hard side, Wang Xun finally produced his lines, combining Pei Qianyu and what he thought was Wen Tingyun: \\"'The jade hairpin sways, twin phoenixes fly; where the swallow-pin"},{"paragraph":33,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"三，想了一想，念着《偷诗》上两句道：「恨无眠残月窗西，更难听孤雁嘹呖。」子玉赞道：「实在绣口锦心，愧煞我辈。」子云道：「这个令，叫我们行，也没有这些好句。」大家满贺了一杯。子玉得了，即道：「我用冷朝阳《送红线》诗一句，孟浩然《登襄城楼》一句，合着是：还似洛妃乘雾去，更凝神女弄珠游。」子玉方才念完，次贤、仲清、春航等大赞道：「方才飞的以此为第一，好在对得工稳。旖旎","en":"goose cry.'\\" Ziyu praised him, \\"Truly a brocade heart and an embroidered mouth. You put us scholars to shame.\\" Ziyun added, \\"Even if we were playing this game, we wouldn't come up with such fine lines.\\" Everyone offered a full toast. Ziyu, having finalized his lines, announced: \\"I'll use one line from Leng Chaoyang's *Seeing Off Hongxian* and one from Meng Haoran's"},{"paragraph":34,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"次贤掣了时令门，美人名夜来，花是并蒂花。子云道：「等你多想一想，我们用点菜再说。」大家又吃了一回菜，又上了五六样，俟点了灯，各人权且散坐。次贤道：「我有了白香山一句，李太白一句，合着是：八月九月正长夜，情人道来竟不来。」众人赏叹道：「老气横秋，又是「愿陪鸾鹤回三山」一例的，真是你的口气。」次贤","en":"Cixian drew a lot from the seasons category: the beauty 'Yelai' (Night-Coming) and a paired-stem flower. Ziyun suggested, \\"Take your time to think; let's order some more dishes first.\\" They enjoyed a few more courses, and five or six new dishes were brought out. Once the lamps were lit, everyone relaxed in their seats. Cixian said, \\"I have my lines. One from"},{"paragraph":35,"mentions":6,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"着个意中人，把心病挑。俏东君，春心偏向小梅梢。」蕙芳笑道：「这出《絮阁》比《闻铃》好得多了。」于是各贺了两杯。子云道：「我就献丑了。」掣了一根，是花木门的，美人名莲香，花是连理花。子云心上要想两句好的出来，不肯轻说。一面看着他们掷骰，见宝珠掷了一个二四，想了一想，念出《春睡》上的曲文道：「星眼倦摩呵，一片美人香和。」子云道：「好！也该贺。」大家各贺了一杯。漱芳又","en":"Scolding in the Pavilion* is much better than your earlier *Hearing the Bells*.\\" Thus, everyone toasted two cups. Ziyun said, \\"It's my turn to show my inadequacy.\\" He drew a lot from the flora category: the beauty 'Lianxiang' (莲香) and an intertwined flower. Desiring to produce truly fine lines, he didn't speak hastily, polishing his thoughts while watching the others"},{"paragraph":36,"mentions":4,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"宝珠将眼睛看了子云一看，心中若有所思。次贤道：「不是这两字，也与庾香一样可以贺三杯。子云等诸位喝两杯也罢了。」再说花名道：「南有乔木，堇荼如饴。木堇是连理花。」众人道：「这两句却自然，该贺两杯。」这一天大家思索也都乏了，都要吃饭。子云道：「尚早，再看他们掷几回。他们到","en":"Baozhu cast a thoughtful glance at Ziyun. Cixian continued, \\"Even without a perfect match on those two characters, his lines are just as worthy of a three-cup toast as Yuxiang's. But let's settle for Ziyun and the rest of us drinking two cups.\\" Ziyun then announced his flower name: \\"'In the"},{"paragraph":38,"mentions":3,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"次贤对子云道：「我明日要将这两个令刻起来，传到外间，也教人费点心，免得总是猜拳打擂的混闹。」子云道：「也好，况今日也没有什么不好的在里面。」又谈了一回，子云也自进去。不知后事如何，且听下回分解。","en":"Cixian said to Ziyun, \\"Tomorrow I will have the rules of these two games engraved and circulated outside. It will encourage people to use their minds a bit, saving them from the endless, rowdy brawling of finger-guessing games.\\" Ziyun agreed, \\"That would be good. Besides,"}],"36":[{"paragraph":4,"mentions":3,"tokens":["度香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"此日是正月二十七日，琴言对了这梅花，不觉思念怡园的梅崦来。想那度香相待的光景，较之今日，真有天渊之别。即有伺候不到处，度香非但没有形之于色，并且不藏之于心，反百般的安慰体贴。此日的华公子，喜欢时便也与度香彷佛，及不合他的意时，不是发烦，就是挑斥，元宵那一日竟至诟斥起来，与诸奴相等。那一班逢迎巴结的见了，便欣欣得意，","en":"plum blossoms, Qinyan could not help but long for the Plum Knoll of the Garden of Contentment. He recalled how Duxiang had treated him; compared to the present day, they were worlds apart. Even if the servants fell short in their duties, Duxiang not only refrained from showing anger but harbored no resentment, instead offering every comfort and consideration. On the"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":2,"tokens":["度香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「前日我们在怡园叙了一日。」便将前日怎样喝酒，怎样行令，次贤新制的酒壶、杯子都说了，琴言着实羡慕。又说那首诗，度香也刻了，庾香见了怎样思念感伤的神色，一一说给琴言，琴言听了也就感伤起来。蕙芳道：「你既回来，少不得我们要快聚几天，不知明日可以不可以？」宝珠道：「明日他也无事。」琴言道：「师傅新死，于理有碍，须消停数日才可。」素兰道：「若消停数日，你就要进城了。况大","en":"and used Cixian's newly designed wine pots and cups, making Qinyan deeply envious. He also mentioned the poem Duxiang had engraved and described Yuxiang's sorrowful expression upon seeing it, detailing every bit to Qinyan, which moved Qinyan to melancholy as well. Huifang suggested, \\"Since you're back, we must find a few days to gather properly. Would tomorrow be alright?\\""},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":1,"tokens":["度香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"到了明早，宝珠着人送了信来，道：「本定今日，因度香有事，遂改明日辰刻在怡园叙集。」琴言应了，梳洗毕，独坐凝思：「今日空闲无事，不如去看看庾香罢。」因想去年梅夫人待的光景，去谅也无妨。主意定了，换了一身素服，吩咐套了车，一面告诉师娘去谢谢同班的人。到了外间，忽然又转念道：「如今已隔了半年了，况从前是聘","en":"The next morning, Baozhu sent a message: \\"We originally planned for today, but Duxiang has matters to attend to, so we've changed the gathering at the Garden of Contentment to the chen hour tomorrow.\\" Qinyan agreed. After washing up, he sat alone in thought: \\"Since I have nothing to do today, why not go see Yuxiang?\\" Remembering Lady Mei's"}],"37":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["徐老爷"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"有心欺他，受了这场戏侮，恨不得要寻死，凄凄惨惨，恨了半夜。睡到早晨，尚未曾醒，他小使进来推醒了他，说道：「怡园徐老爷来叫你，说叫你快去，梅少爷已先到了。」琴言起来，小使叠好了被，琴言净了脸，喝了碗茶。因昨日气了一天，哭了半夜，前两天又劳乏了，此时觉得头晕眼花，口中干燥，好不难受。勉强扎挣住了，换了衣裳，把镜子照了一照，觉得面貌清减了些。又复坐了一会，神思懒怠。已到","en":"To return to our story: Qinyan had returned to his lodgings in a fury. He wept for half the day before lying down on his bed fully clothed, pulling the quilt over himself. He regretted a thousand times over having gone to see Pincai, realizing too late that Pincai was in league with the rest of them and had deliberately set out to humiliate him. So humiliated was he that he wished he could die. He went on seething and weeping through half the night. Morning came and he was still asleep, so his young manservant had to come in and shake him awake. \\"Mr Xu at the Garden of Contentment has sent for you,\\" the boy said. \\"He says to come quickly. Young Master Mei is already there.\\" Qinyan got up, and the boy folded away the bedding while Qinyan washed his face and drank a bowl of tea. After spending the previous day in a rage and half the night in tears, following two days of exhaustion, he now felt dizzy, with blurred vision. His mouth was dry and he felt utterly wretched. He struggled to rally himself, changed his clothes, and glanced at himself in the mirror, noticing that he looked a little thinner than usual. He sat for a while longer feeling listless. At the beginning of the noon watch, he made himself get into a carriage and set off for the Garden of Contentment."},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":7,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"座师的世兄，故大家请了他。春航并请仲清，仲清新受感冒，两处都辞了。王恂也辞了那边，清早就约同子玉到怡园，次贤、子云接进梅崦坐下。这梅崦是个梅花样式，五间一处，共有五处。长廊曲槛钩连，绿萼红香围绕。外边望着，也认不清屋宇，唯觉一片香雪而已。子玉每到园中，必须赏玩几处。子云道：「今日之局，人颇不齐，这月里戏酒甚多。我想玉侬回来，尚有二十余日之久，这梅花还可开得十天。","en":"his invitation, having arranged early in the morning to accompany Ziyu to the Garden of Contentment. Cixian and Ziyun welcomed them into the Plum Knoll and they took their seats. This retreat was laid out in the shape of a plum blossom, comprising five sections of five rooms each. Winding corridors and curved balustrades connected them, surrounded by a sea of green"},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":7,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云微笑。王恂笑道：「我见你满园子都是花，我们谈了这半日，不见一个人中花来，不是你爱花不爱人么？」子云笑道：「你不过是这么说呀，前日约得好好儿的，怎么此刻还不见来呢？」少顷，宝珠、桂保来了，见过了。子云道：「怎么这时候还只得你们两个人来？」宝珠道：「今日","en":"Ziyun smiled faintly. Wang Xun laughed, \\"I see your garden is filled with blossoms, yet in all the time we have been talking not a single flower among men has appeared. Does this not show you prefer flowers to people?\\" Ziyun replied with a chuckle, \\"So that"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":6,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云吩咐摆起席面来，也不送酒。子云对王恂道：「论年齿，吾弟长于庾香，但今日之酌特为玉侬而设，要玉侬坐个首席，庾香作陪。」琴言道：「这个如何使得？我是不坐的。」子玉道：「应是庸庵。」子云道：「往日原是这样，今日却要倒转来。」便拉定琴言坐了首席，子玉并之。桂","en":"Ziyun gave orders for the table to be laid, without a formal offering of wine. He said to Wang Xun, \\"You are older than Yuxiang, but today we are drinking in Yunong's honour. Let him take the seat of honour, with Yuxiang beside him.\\" Qinyan protested, \\"That"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"宝珠看琴言的眼睛似像哭肿的，想是为师傅了。子云也看出来，太息了一声道：「玉侬真是个多情人，长庆待他也不算好，他还哭得这样，这也难得。」众人尽皆太息。琴言听了，触起昨日的气来，便脸有怒容。又见子玉在旁，总是为他而起，他一阵酸楚，流下泪来。众人齐相劝慰，殊不知琴言别有悲伤，并不是为了长庆。众人既不知","en":"Baozhu noticed that Qinyan's eyes looked swollen from weeping and guessed it must be on account of his teacher. Ziyun had also noticed this and sighed quietly. \\"Yunong is truly a tender-hearted soul,\\" he said. \\"Changqing did not treat him particularly well, and yet he has wept like this for him; that is rare indeed.\\" Everyone present sighed in sympathy. When Qinyan"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"已红了一点。众人尽听他说，王恂道：「你看他，他怎样待你？」琴言道：「聘才起先还好，如今有一班坏人在那里引诱。」子云问道：「是谁呢？」琴言道：「一个奚十一，一个潘其观，还有一个和尚，就是聘才的房东。」","en":"you?\\" Qinyan explained, \\"Pincai used to be decent enough, but now a set of bad characters are leading him astray.\\" Ziyun asked who they were. Qinyan said, \\"One is Xi Eleven, another is Pan Qiguan, and a monk—Pincai's landlord.\\""},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"」琴言道：「可不是他通同的么？幸亏我如今不唱戏了，他们还不敢十分怎样。不然还了得，只怕你们今日也不能见我的。」子云道：「这三个恶煞，怎么你一齐都遇见了，这也实在为难你。」次贤、王恂皆笑。桂保道：「那个奚十一，我倒没碰见他，就是佩仙、玉艳吃了他的大亏。」琴言道：「我是两次了。」王恂谓桂保道：「你若遇见了奚十一，便怎样呢？」桂保道：「我若遇见了他，也叫他看看桶子，叫","en":"dared not go too far. Otherwise it would have been far worse, and I doubt you would be seeing me here today.\\" Ziyun said, \\"What bad luck to run into all three of those fiends at once! You must have had a dreadful time.\\" Cixian and Wang Xun both laughed. Guibao added, \\"That Xi Eleven, I have never had dealings with him myself, but Peixian and Yuyan suffered badly at"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":3,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"忽见子玉与琴言四目相注，各人饮了半杯酒。子云不觉微笑，问子玉道：「你与玉侬同过几回席了？」子玉道：「这是第二回，已一年之久。」子云道：「只得两回，可怜，可怜！真是会少离多了。」琴言笑道：「也第三回了。」次贤道：「庾香有些贪心不足，以多报少。去年你们瞒着人私逛运河，不算一回么？」子玉道：「我偶然","en":"Just then, Ziyu and Qinyan caught each other's gaze, and each drank half a cup. Ziyun smiled and asked Ziyu, \\"How many times have you and Yunong sat at the same table now?\\" Ziyu replied, \\"This is the second time, and it has been a year since the first.\\" Ziyun lamented, \\"Only twice? What a pity, what a pity! You meet so rarely and part"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云大笑，次贤道：「十日之叙，已无此福，若华星北之福，真是福如东海了。」说得众人大笑。琴言与子玉此时，已觉十分畅满。","en":"Ziyun laughed heartily. Cixian quipped, \\"Even ten days together are too much good fortune for him! What if he had Hua Xingbei's luck? Now that would be good fortune as vast as the Eastern Sea!\\" Everyone laughed at this remark. By now, Qinyan and Ziyu were"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":7,"tokens":["子云","度香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"王桂保对着子云笑道：「我有个一字化为三字的令，我说给你听，说不出者罚一杯。」子云道：「你且说来。」桂保道：「一个大字加一点是太字，移上去是犬字，照这么样也说一个。」子云笑道：「这是犬令，谁耐烦行他。」桂保笑嘻嘻的对着蕙芳道：「你说一个。」蕙芳想了一想，道：「一个王","en":"Wang Guibao turned to Ziyun with a smile and proposed, \\"I have a game: turn one character into three. I'll show you how. Anyone who can't give another must drink a cup.\\" Ziyun invited him to proceed. Guibao explained, \\"Take the character for 'great' (大) and add a dot to make it"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"个杳字，加一笔是查字，移上去是香字。」众人赞道：「更好！」宝珠道：「我有个丁字，加一笔是于字，移上去是亍字。」子云道：「这字却冷些。」子玉道：「也可用。」宝珠道：「彳亍二字也不算冷。」琴言道：「我有个卜字，加一笔是上字，移上去是下字。」次贤道：「这个好得很。」桂保道：「我有个白字，加一笔是自字，移上去是百字。」蕙芳道：「略短些。」王恂道：「我有个曰字，加一笔是田","en":"suggested, \\"I have the character 丁, add a stroke to make it 'in' (于), and move it to the top to make it 'step' (亍).\\" Ziyun said, \\"That character is rather obscure.\\" Ziyu countered, \\"It is acceptable enough.\\" Baozhu defended it, \\"彳 and 亍 aren't so very obscure.\\" Qinyan offered another, \\"I have the character for 'divine' (卜), add a stroke to make it 'above' (上), and move it"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":6,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"那里，所以耽搁了好一回，将我的戏挪上了才来的。我今天见了一个老名士，说是前舟的业师，相貌清古，有六旬之外了。」子云道：「姓什么？」蕙芳道：「姓得有些古怪，我想想着，好像姓瞿，穿着六品服饰，觉得议论风生，无人不敬爱他。」子云想了一想，道：「要是姓屈，不是姓瞿。」蕙芳道：「是姓屈，我记错了。」次贤道：「不要是屈道生么？」子云道：「一定是他，我听说他到了。」子玉道：「","en":"there today, said to be Qianzhou's teacher. He had a refined, old-fashioned air and appeared to be over sixty.\\" Ziyun asked his surname. Huifang answered, \\"It is an unusual name. Let me think, something like Qu, I believe. He was wearing sixth-rank official dress, and his conversation was so brilliant and wide-ranging that everyone present held him in admiration.\\" Ziyun"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"词、集曲为曲等类，还有些集经书诗词的对子，却甚有趣。好像末后还有个对戏目的对子，是两个字的多，可惜没有细看。」子云道：「你看道生的诗文，与侯石翁如何？」次贤道：「据我看，是道翁高于石翁。石翁的才虽大，格却不高，且系驳杂不纯。道翁才也不小，其格纯正，却是可传之作。就是石翁也很佩服他的。」王恂道：「我们江宁的侯石翁么，他却自负天下第一才子。据我看来，也不见得。」子云","en":"couplets matching opera titles, most of them two-character titles, but I regret I did not examine it carefully.\\" Ziyun asked, \\"How would you compare Daosheng's poetry and prose with Hou Shiweng's?\\" Cixian said, \\"In my estimation, Daoweng is the superior of the two. Shiweng has great talent, but his writing lacks distinction and is rather mixed and impure. Daoweng, too,"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":4,"tokens":["度香","子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"次贤道：「很好，就请庾香、玉侬先对起来。」子玉道：「还是你与媚香先对，次度香、瑶卿，次庸庵、蕊香，末后轮到我们罢。」子云道：「也罢，你作个先锋，他作个后劲，把我们放在中间，容易讨好些。」次贤道：「头难，头难，我一时想不出好的。我前日见瘦香的《题曲》唱得甚好，就出《题曲》罢。」蕙芳道：「《题曲》就可以对《偷诗》。」宝珠道：「将","en":"\\"Excellent. Let Yuxiang and Yunong start.\\" Ziyu suggested, \\"It would be better if you and Meixiang go first, then Duxiang and Yaoqing, then Yong'an and Ruixiang, and we shall go last.\\" Ziyun agreed to this arrangement, \\"You take the vanguard, and he brings up the rear; that leaves us in the middle, where it is easier to make a good showing.\\" Cixian said, \\"Hard to begin,"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":5,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"应子云出对了，子云出了《踏月》的上对，宝珠想了一想，对了《扫花》。桂保道：「好极了。」子云道：「论对却好，但两个字似乎平仄都要相配，扫字也是仄声。此中稍欠工稳。」次贤道：「你却论得是。据我想来，戏目虽多，内中可对者却也甚少，下一字须讲平仄，上一字尚可恕，不","en":"It was now Ziyun's turn to put forward a title, and he offered the first half of a couplet: *Treading on the Moon* (踏月). Baozhu thought for a moment and paired it with *Sweeping Flowers* (扫花). Guibao said, \\"Excellent.\\" Ziyun said, \\"The pairing is good in terms of meaning,"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"《女盗》有名《牝贼》，这两字却新奇，你对出来，我情愿喝三杯。」次贤道：「真的？」众人也暗暗想了一回，对不出来。子云道：「这对难对。」次贤忽然笑起来，谓蕙芳道：「你且喝三杯，我对给你。」蕙芳道：「你对了，我再喝。」","en":"three cups.\\" Cixian challenged, \\"Is that a promise?\\" Everyone mentally tried and failed to come up with a match. Ziyun said, \\"This is a difficult title to match.\\" Suddenly, Cixian burst out laughing and said to Huifang, \\"You drink your three cups first, then I shall give you the pairing.\\" Huifang countered, \\"Give me the match first. Then I'll drink.\\""},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"怎么对得牝字？」子玉一想，不觉抚掌大笑道：「妙极，妙极！就是势字才可对得牝字，真是绝对。」琴言与宝珠尚未明白，子云、王恂也想出来了，也笑起来，赞道：「真好心思，把这两字当这两件东西，真是异想天开了。」四旦尚未想出，蕙芳犹呆呆的想，王恂道：「你们尚未想着，你们不知男子阳为势吗？」蕙芳等恍然大悟，便都笑起来，都也说好。蕙芳真喝了三杯，余皆贺一杯。","en":"marvellous! Only 势 could possibly pair with 牝. A truly perfect match.\\" Qinyan and Baozhu had not yet understood it. Ziyun and Wang Xun, having worked it out, also began laughing and said, \\"A brilliant conceit, to treat those two characters as those two things: a truly inspired stroke of imagination.\\" The four performers had not yet grasped it; Huifang was still sitting"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":3,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云出了《打店》，宝珠对了《逃关》。宝珠出了《抢娇》，子云对了《杀惜》。都为工稳，贺了一杯。王恂出了《草桥》，桂保对了《麻地》，忽又说道：「这地字还差半个字，我改作《絮阁》罢。」王恂道：「这《絮阁》借对得好，可贺半杯。」桂保出了《花婆》，王恂想了一会，对","en":"Ziyun then offered *Attacking the Inn* (打店), and Baozhu matched it with *Fleeing the Pass* (逃关). Baozhu proposed *Seizing the Beauty* (抢娇), which Ziyun matched with *Killing Poxi* (杀惜). Both were judged good matches and toasted with a cup. Wang Xun brought"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":5,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"又到子云，子云出了《跌雪》，宝珠道：「这个宽了，便宜了我。」既又说道：「这个跌字也不容易。」遂想了一想，对了《堕冰》。一齐赞好，道：「好个《跌雪》、《堕冰》，真是一副好对，是一意化作两层法。」蕙芳谓宝珠道：「你想个难的给他对。」宝珠点点头。子云道：「你何故要","en":"It came round to Ziyun again, and he offered *Tumbling in the Snow* (跌雪). Baozhu said, \\"That is a broad one, making it easy for me.\\" He quickly added, \\"Though the word 'tumble' is not so easy either.\\" After a moment's thought, he matched it with *Falling on the Ice* (堕冰)."},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一杯罢。」桂保喝了半杯酒，出了个《跪池》，王恂对了《投井》，大家说好，也贺了半杯。到了子玉，子玉出了《折柳》。子云笑道：「庾香惠顾着玉侬，出这样稀松的对子出来。」子玉道：「我一时想不出生的，我看倒是对对易，出对难。」琴言对了《扫松》。子玉道：「这一对连我的上对都好了。」众人也贺半杯。琴言道：「我就出个扫字的上对，是《扫秦》。」众人道：「这个难了。」子玉道：「这个","en":"approved, and half a cup was toasted. When it came to Ziyu's turn, he offered *Plucking a Willow Branch* (折柳). Ziyun laughed, \\"Yuxiang is making things easy for Yunong by offering such a simple title.\\" Ziyu said, \\"I couldn't think of a fresh one just now. Matching a title is easier than choosing one.\\" Qinyan matched it with *Sweeping the Pine* (扫松). Ziyu said, \\"Your"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":5,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"信两字甚好。」次贤又道：「我又想了一个《放易》，易字好似信字。」大家齐声赞道：「这个更好，该贺双杯。」各贺了。子云道：「《见鬼》。」大家没有留心。停了一会，宝珠催其出对，子云笑道：「你倒不对，还来催我。」宝珠道：「你还没有出对，叫我对什么呢？」子云道：「我方才说的《见鬼》，就是这对。」宝珠一想，果然有这个戏目，便对了《离魂》。子云点点头道：「对也对得好。」贺了半","en":"Everyone cried out together in praise, \\"That one is even better! It deserves double cups.\\" And so they toasted. Ziyun said, \\"*Seeing the Ghost* (见鬼).\\" No one paid attention. After a pause, Baozhu pressed him to produce a title. Ziyun laughed, \\"You haven't answered, and now you're hurrying me?\\" Baozhu countered, \\"You haven't given a title. What am I supposed to match?\\""},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"对可以结了，天也不早了。况我一早出来，过迟了恐家慈见问。请以此对收令罢。」王恂道：「也是时候了，对了吃饭罢。」子云道：「且看，其实天还早呢。」子玉道：「既要叙几天，也宜留些精神在明日，今日早散为妙。」子玉见琴言有些倦意，故要收令。子云只得依了。子玉道：「我出个三字对罢。」遂出了《飞熊梦》。众人道：「三个字就难些，好对的也少得很。」琴言想了一会，对了《伏虎韬》。","en":"ask what kept me. Let us close with this pairing.\\" Wang Xun agreed, \\"It is time. After the pairing, let us eat.\\" Ziyun protested, \\"Wait, it is actually still quite early.\\" Ziyu countered, \\"We plan to meet for several days. Let's save some energy for tomorrow and break up early today.\\" In truth, Ziyu had noticed that Qinyan was beginning to look tired, and that was his"},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":3,"tokens":["子云","徐子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"字的，自然就难了，这一两个只怕还有。」便出了个《卖子投渊》。子玉也想了一会，对了个《思亲罢宴》，众人拍案称妙。子云道：「情见乎词，庾香方才说回去过迟，恐怕伯母见问，真是思亲罢宴了。这个本地风光，我们各贺三杯吃饭。」这一回每人对了四转，共有三十二副对子，是六十四个戏目。也费了好些心，喝了几十杯酒，各有醉意，便也不能再饮。三杯之后，吃过了饭，略坐了一坐，子玉、王恂告","en":"then offered *Longing for One's Parents, Abandoning the Feast* (思亲罢宴). Everyone struck the table in admiration. Ziyun said, \\"Your words give your feelings away! Yuxiang said just now he feared his mother would ask why he was home so late, and here is *Longing for One's Parents, Abandoning the Feast* (思亲罢宴). A pairing straight from life; let us each toast three cups"}],"38":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["徐子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"且说徐子云请了屈公来，并请南湘、仲清、文泽、春航、王恂、子玉作陪，仍在梅崦中。王恂是日为孙亮功请去有事，因李元茂吉期已定，要招赘过来。亮功因两位贤郎是不懂事的，一切皆托王恂料理，王恂所以不能前来。","en":"To return to our story: Xu Ziyun had invited Master Qu to attend, with Nanxiang, Zhongqing, Wenze, Chunhang, Wang Xun, and Ziyu as companions, again in the Plum Knoll. Wang Xun on this particular day had been called away by Sun Lianggong on an important matter: the wedding date had"},{"paragraph":2,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云因屈道生是个高雅好静的人，名旦中止叫了四个，宝珠、漱芳、蕙芳、素兰。漱芳有恙不能前来，格外又知会了琴言。是日屈公先到，与子云、次贤叙了好些旧话。","en":"Knowing that Qu Daosheng was a man of refined tastes who preferred quieter company, Ziyun had invited only four performers: Baozhu, Shufang, Huifang, and Sulan. Shufang was indisposed and unable to attend; as an added guest, Qinyan was also notified. That day Master Qu arrived first and spent a good while in conversation with Ziyun and Cixian,"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"从前徐中堂在京时，也与他相好，并有些事情请教他，又请他代代笔，作些诗文，所以子云以长者相待。史南湘是同乡后辈，不消说是认识的了。","en":"matters, and had engaged him from time to time to compose poems and prose pieces on his behalf — which is why Ziyun treated him with the deference due to an elder. Shi Nanxiang was a younger native of the same region, and it goes without saying that he was already acquainted with him."},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":5,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"只见四旦约齐同来，蕙芳已经认识，四人都上前请安。道生拱了手，命他们坐了，细细看了一番，又问了三人名号，谓子云道：「如今京里的相公，一发比从前好了。」子云道：「今日本不应叫他们来伺候，因他们尚不十分恶劣，还可以捧研拂笺。况他们前日听得先生来了，要瞻仰瞻仰老名士。若得齿颊余芬，褒扬一字，则胜于拳金之赏，想先生决不责子云之荒谬也。」道生笑道：「你为我是孝廉方正出","en":"in return, bade them be seated, and looked them over carefully, asking the names of three of them. He said to Ziyun, \\"The young performers in the capital today are even finer than in former times.\\" Ziyun said, \\"Strictly speaking I ought not to have invited them to wait upon us today; but they are not entirely without refinement and can handle an ink-stone and unfurl"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"湘道：「这是我乡前辈，如何敢抗礼。」才定了仲清。东席第二是南湘，西席第二是春航。东席第三是子玉，西席三是文泽。子云东席作主，次贤西席作陪。宝珠、琴言在东，蕙芳、素兰在西，一一坐了。主人让酒，客皆饮了几杯。道生道：「我将前日先见的苏媚香谈起。」西席的人个个细听。道生道：「我这看相不论气色，部位是要论的，然尚在其次。我看全身的神骨、举止行动、坐相、立相，并口音言语，","en":"table was Nanxiang; second on the west was Chunhang. Third on the east was Ziyu; third on the west was Wenze. Ziyun presided at the east table while Cixian acted as second host at the west. Baozhu and Qinyan sat on the east side; Huifang and Sulan on the west. Everyone took their places. The host circulated wine and the guests each drank a few cups. Qu said, \\"I shall"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"已换了七任知县，盗案、命案共有二百余件。我费了半年心力，办了这五个人，以后就太平无事，也没有人命、盗案出来。」子云道：「这功劳却也不小，感恩受惠的人也不止一县。」道生道：「我也不敢居功，地方上应办的我总要办，尽力作去，也不管身家性命，且到什么地位再说。」又与诸名士谈讲了好些事情。","en":"individuals, after which the district became peaceful — not a single case of homicide or banditry has occurred since.\\" Ziyun said, \\"That was no small achievement — the people who owe you gratitude extend far beyond a single county.\\" Qu said, \\"I dare not claim credit. Whatever the district requires to be dealt with, I deal with; I put in the effort regardless of personal risk,"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云见上菜的家人一件新衣上爬着个虱子，候他上好了菜，叫他拈掉了。道生即问关子玉道：「世兄博览经史，不知方才这个虱子见于何书为古？诗词杂说是不用讲的。」子玉劈头被他一问，呆了一呆，想道：「这个字却也稀少，他说见于何书为古，这些扪虱、贯虱就不必讲了。」婉言答","en":"Ziyun noticed that one of the house servants who was bringing dishes had a louse crawling on the shoulder of his new jacket. He waited until the man had set down the dishes, then called him over and told him to pick it off. Qu immediately turned to Ziyu and"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"道生道：「此板早已劈化了，这是少年时无赖，作这些东西，毫无道理。」子云道：「又闻得有些对戏目的对子。」道生道：「有数十条，也记不得了。」次贤道：「我们前日几个人，也凑了好些。」又指琴言、蕙芳、宝珠三人道：「这三个还有一个王桂保，他们也对了许多，比我们还好些。」便叫人到他书房拿出一个单子，并上次所行之令也写在上面，注了各","en":"long ago split up for firewood. It is a worthless thing I wrote in my youth, without the least sense or reason.\\" Ziyun said, \\"I also heard there was a section of couplets matching opera titles.\\" Qu said, \\"There were several dozen — I cannot remember them now.\\" Cixian said, \\"We ourselves produced a good many the other day,\\" and, gesturing toward Qinyan, Huifang, and Baozhu,"},{"paragraph":34,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云道：「古人美人多矣，其形之妙丽，唯在人之笔墨描写。见于文词诗赋者，亦指难胜屈，究以何处形容得最妙，先生肯指示一二处否？」","en":"Ziyun said, \\"Among the beautiful people of antiquity, their physical loveliness has been preserved only in the words and brushes of those who wrote about them. Among all the poems, prose-poems, and literary descriptions, those who described beautiful women"},{"paragraph":38,"mentions":3,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"道翁又道：「都中现有一个极博雅的人，年纪虽轻，与我是旧交，也是个南京巨族。论起世家来，与子云、星北不相上下，想诸公自必相熟的。」子云道：「是那一位？」道翁道：「此君姓金名粟，号吉甫，可相好么？」众人同道：「久闻其名，恨未一见。」道翁道：「若论考据学问品行，当今可以数一数二了。他也有一部说部，是说平倭寇的事，我将他这书的名字忘了。曾经看过一遍","en":"acquaintance of mine, and also from a great Nanjing family. In terms of family standing, his lineage is on a par with Ziyun's and Xingbei's, and I am sure you all know him well.\\" Ziyun said, \\"Who might that be?\\" Master Qu said, \\"His family name is Jin, given name Li, style name Jifu — are you acquainted with him?\\" Everyone said together, \\"We have long heard his name but have"},{"paragraph":39,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"。」这一日，屈道翁足足讲了一日，人也乏了。吃完了饭，散坐了一会，也就二更光景。刘文泽系旧学生，不敢问难。宝珠问子云要柄扇子，求道翁题诗，子云索性叫取四柄扇子出来，给四旦每人一柄。于是宝珠拂几，蕙芳移砚，素兰磨墨，琴言润毫，共求道翁留题。道翁也十分高兴，遂将各人的大概，每人写了七律一首，半行半草的一笔虞世南，并落了双款。四旦谢了，谈了一会各散。不知后事如何，且听下","en":"second watch. Liu Wenze, being a former student of his, did not venture to ask difficult questions. Baozhu asked Ziyun for a folding fan so that he could request a poem from Master Qu; Ziyun went further and had four fans brought out, one for each of the four performers. Thereupon Baozhu wiped the small table clean, Huifang shifted the ink-stone into position, Sulan"}],"42":[{"paragraph":3,"mentions":1,"tokens":["度香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"说，师父每月进府来领一次，也不知多少。如今师父死了，他们只怕未必照旧了。若除了华府，又问谁去要钱？难道还可以问度香商量么？不比在外，常可见面。此刻师娘要我一月定给多少钱，这倒是件难事。况且公子近来待我又不如从前，这话怎好去问他？」想来想去，不得主意，答不出来。他师娘心上疑着华公子待琴言不知怎样好，自然要一千就是一千，要二千就是二千。这几天在琴言身上盘算，把个心想","en":"if not through the Hua household, whom else would one go to for money? It is hardly possible to negotiate with Duxiang. He is not someone one can meet with easily. Now his widow is asking me to fix a monthly sum, which is a difficult thing to do. Furthermore, the young master has not been as warm toward me as he used to be. How could I possibly bring up money with him?\\""},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":2,"tokens":["徐老爷"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"是那里听来的。」伍麻子道：「我们有一班朋友，闲着没有事，聚在一处就讲这些话。城里一个华公子，城外一个大园子里的徐老爷，这两家富贵，讲一年也讲不完。说那徐老爷的园子里山子石底下，埋着十缸银，十缸金。那看金子的财神爷是一头黄毛，看银子的财神爷是一头的白毛。到半夜里，他两个便坐在园墙上吓人，还要拿金锭、银锭子打人。有时运的被他打着了，就捡了金银回去，回去就发财。没有时运","en":"Wu Mazi went on, undeterred: \\"I've heard that's not even the remarkable part. That household has so much silver it won't fit in the chests. It's piled loose against the walls. After two or three years without being used it gets damp and starts to mildew, so they have it brought out to air in the sun. They air it for a whole day and then someone swaps out the five-tael pieces for ten-tael ones, and the two-tael pieces for five-tael ones, and he doesn't even count them. Occasionally he notices and asks why his silver pieces have shrunk. And his people reply that they have been in the sun all day, dried out and naturally contracted. I find that rather hard to believe. Does this young master really think silver can shrink in the sun?\\" At this, Qinyan could not help laughing and asked where he had heard such a thing. Wu Mazi replied: \\"There's a group of us fellows, and when we have nothing to do we gather together and talk about things like this. In the city there's a Young Master Hua, and outside the city there's an Old Master Xu in a big garden estate. Between those two wealthy families you could talk for a year without running out of stories. They say that beneath the garden rocks on Old Master Xu's estate, there are ten urns of silver and ten urns of gold buried in the ground. The spirit guardian of the gold has a head of yellow fur, and the spirit guardian of the silver has a head of white fur. At midnight they sit on top of the garden wall and frighten people, and sometimes they even throw gold and silver ingots at them. If you have good fortune and they hit you, you pick up the gold and silver and go home rich. If you have no luck and they hit you, you pick it up and it's just a clod of yellow earth, and when you get home you fall ill. It seems to me that even the gods of wealth play favorites. They only oblige people who already have luck.\\" Qinyan found this rather amusing despite his gloomy mood."},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":1,"tokens":["徐老爷"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，就是他。可以叫他出来见见么？」天福摇头道：「他不见人的，多少人知他回来了，要见见他，他总不肯出来。就只到怡园徐老爷处，除了他家，是不到第二家的。」大傻子道：「他既不肯出来，你领我们到他屋里坐坐是可以的。」天寿摇头道：「他要骂我们。」伍麻子站在廊前道：「我们这个琴官，如今是华公府的二爷，不见人了。二位老爷如高兴，叫天福、天寿伺侯罢。」","en":"Liangxuan said, \\"You have a good memory. Tianfu here does not remember at all.\\" Now that Tianfu heard it, he recalled it too. \\"Aiyo! What a frightening day that was. That opium-smoker was fearsome — he turned the table clean over and went on fighting all the way inside. Lucky for me I got out of the way quick; one kick from him and I'd have been half dead.\\" Liangxuan said, \\"Just so. It was I who saved you. Are you grateful to me or not?\\"\\n\\nTianshou said, \\"And where has that gentleman got to now?\\" Liangxuan said, \\"He is ill at present.\\" Tianfu cried, \\"Heaven's justice! Heaven's justice! Let him be ill a good while longer.\\"\\n\\nDasha put in, \\"A young gentleman came in just now — what is his name?\\" Tianfu said, \\"There is nobody. It is only the two of us, brothers.\\" Liangxuan said, \\"Somebody came in — taller than you, sixteen or seventeen.\\" Tianshou said, \\"No, no. We only have our senior brother Qinyan, back from the Hua household, and he is not a boy of the trade any more — he does not sing. Perhaps that is who you saw.\\" Liangxuan said eagerly, \\"That's it, that's it, that's the one. Could you ask him to come out and let us pay our respects?\\"\\n\\nTianfu shook his head. \\"He does not see people. Any number know he is back and want to see him, and he never will come out. He goes only to Old Master Xu's at the Garden of Contentment; besides that house he goes nowhere.\\" Dasha said, \\"If he will not come out, you can at least take us into his room to sit.\\" Tianshou shook his head. \\"He would scold us.\\"\\n\\nWu Mazi, standing at the veranda, said, \\"This Qinguan of ours is Second Master in the Hua household now; he does not see people. If your honours are in the mood, let Tianfu and Tianshou wait on you.\\""}],"43":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["度香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，我到三更才回的，他们也忘了，没有对我讲。方才你们五儿说起来，方知道。两三天总不见你，为什么不出来散散闷？今日度香约赏杏花，咱们可同去了。」琴言道：「可以。我这两日偶然感冒，觉得疲倦，今日也想出去散散。且假期已满，也要打算进城了。」宝珠道：「再歇两天进去也不要紧，进去了，咱们又会少离多了。」琴言道：「近来倒有件难事，我竟没有主意，故请你与香畹来商量，怎么代我想个","en":"mentioned it just now. I haven't seen you these two or three days — why haven't you come out to take the air? Today Duxiang has invited us to enjoy the apricot blossoms. Shall we all go together?\\" \\"Very well,\\" said Qinyan. \\"These past two days I have had a slight chill and felt rather weary. I too should like to go out for some air. Besides, my leave has run out, and I must"},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":2,"tokens":["度香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"写卖字给华府，怎么由不得他，难道在那里一世么？」宝珠道：「此处说话，到底不方便，我们何不同去找媚香商议。一同到度香处，看看杏花，连碧桃也开了许多。不知今年节气这么早，我记得碧桃往年是三月中开的。度香今日也不请客，我们几个人去谈谈未尝不可。」琴言也甚乐从，换了一身衣服，一面叫套了车。素兰、宝珠都是走来的，二人便吩咐跟班回去套车，并吩咐所带的衣服，都到苏家佩香堂来。","en":"\\"Speaking here is awkward after all,\\" said Baozhu. \\"Why don't we all go find Meixiang and discuss it? We can go to Duxiang's together and see the apricot blossoms. The ornamental peaches have opened splendidly too. I can't think why the season is so early this year; I remember the ornamental peaches blooming in the middle of the third month in past years. Duxiang is not"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":2,"tokens":["度香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"又将那一本字也看了。蕙芳让三人坐下，问道：「你们还是不约而同，还是约了同来的。」宝珠道：「约齐来的，我们同到度香处看杏花罢。」蕙芳道：「今日又有局吗？」宝珠道：「局是没有，也算个不速之客何妨？」蕙芳点首笑应。素兰、宝珠的衣服与车都来了，二人即换了衣服。蕙芳进内也换了，又问道：「你们同来竟一无所事，单为看花么？」素兰道：「事有一件，到怡园再讲罢。」蕙芳道：「何不","en":"arrive together by chance, or was this arranged?\\" \\"We came by arrangement,\\" said Baozhu. \\"Let us all go together to Duxiang's to see the apricot blossoms.\\" \\"Is there a banquet today?\\" asked Huifang. \\"No banquet,\\" said Baozhu. \\"Call it three uninvited guests — what is the harm?\\" Huifang nodded and smiled his assent. Sulan's and Baozhu's clothes and carriages soon arrived;"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":1,"tokens":["度香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"水青山。过了一座红桥，绕了十重绮户，才到东风昨夜楼边。只听得楼上清歌檀板，有人在那里唱曲。四人便住了脚步，听像度香的声音，唱着一枝《懒画眉》，四人细听是：","en":"the tap of a clapperboard: someone was performing up there. The four of them halted to listen. It sounded like Duxiang's voice, singing a passage to the tune of \\"Too Lazy to Paint the Brows.\\" They listened carefully:"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"月落冷惺松，又朝朝铜瓶纸帐春寒重，且请试消息生香一线中。\\n众人听不出什么曲本上的，觉得笛韵凄清，甚为动听。听得子云笑道：「到底不好，还是你来，我来吹笛。」又像次贤唱道：","en":"in any known score, yet the flute harmonies were delicately mournful and pleasant to the ear. Then they heard Ziyun laugh and say: \\"That still won't do — let me come and play the flute instead.\\" And then what seemed to be Cixian's voice singing:"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"离愁离恨的梅花梦，作到月落参横萧寺钟。\\n四人正在好听，忽然止了，听得次贤说道：「其实唱起来，音节倒好。」又听得子云说道：「何不将工尺全谱了，教他们唱起来。」四人知道不唱了，齐走进去。书童匆忙上楼通报。","en":"when the singing suddenly ceased. They heard Cixian say: \\"Truly, sung aloud, the rhythm is quite beautiful.\\" Then Ziyun: \\"Why not transcribe the whole score with the gongche notation and have them learn it properly?\\" The four, realising no more singing was coming, walked inside together. A page boy scrambled up the stairs to announce their arrival."},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"宝珠等走上扶梯，进得楼来，次贤、子云笑面相迎，见了琴言、蕙芳等更加欢喜，说道：「今日倒料不着你们来。」宝珠道：「都是我请来的。」又对次贤道：「瘦香身子不快，不来了。」","en":"Baozhu and the others climbed the staircase into the upper room. Cixian and Ziyun came forward with smiling faces; seeing Qinyan and Huifang among the visitors, they were all the more pleased, saying: \\"We hardly expected you today.\\" \\"I brought them all,\\" said Baozhu. And then, turning to Cixian: \\"Shouxiang is unwell and could not"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":4,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一夜雨廉纤，正燕子飞来，帘卷东风，北宋南唐评乐府：\\n三分春旖旎，问杏花开未，窗闲青琐，红牙白雪选词场。\\n次贤、子云看他四人今日打扮分外好看，艳的艳，雅的雅，倒像有心比赛的一般。此刻都还穿着小毛外褂，琴言是玄狐耳绒，宝珠是玄狐抓仁，蕙芳是云狐抓仁，素兰是骨牌块云狐干尖。四人相对，就是珊瑚玉树交枝，瑶草琪花弄色，觉得楼外千枝红杏，比不上楼中四个玉人。次贤、子云虽时常","en":"jade, red sandalwood clappers and the loftiest of songs pick out the champions of the lyric field.\\"\\n\\nCixian and Ziyun observed that the four visitors were unusually well turned out that day. Some were resplendent and some elegant, as though each had taken pains to outshine the others. All four still wore their short fur outer jackets. Qinyan wore dark fox-ear velvet,"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":6,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"偏这音律上不甚讲究。弹琴之外，一无所好。你与他讲，他又说三代之后乐已亡，故将《乐记》并入《礼记》。」四旦皆笑。子云道：「我今日得了些江瑶柱，但是干的，作起汤来，虽不及新鲜的，比那寻常海味还好些。」琴言道：「我闻新鲜荔枝与江瑶柱别有滋味，不同凡品。若那干荔枝，也就没甚可爱，还比不上桂圆。那干江瑶不知是怎样的？」蕙芳忽然大有感慨，呆呆不语，俯首若思。子云颇觉诧异，见","en":"Music was absorbed into the Rites.\\" All four laughed. \\"I have obtained some dried river scallops today,\\" said Ziyun. \\"Dried ones, of course, as they make a finer broth than common dried seafood, though not equal to fresh.\\" \\"I have heard,\\" said Qinyan, \\"that fresh lychees paired with fresh river scallops have a flavour unlike anything else in the world. Dried lychees"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云道：「这一比虽切，然究竟委屈了道翁。他却不酸，还比为干江瑶罢。」次贤道：「那更委屈了。你是浙人，自然夸赞江瑶。若说那干江瑶，真像那从良老妓，回忆当年，姿态全无，余腥尚在。」宝珠问次贤道：「食品之内，究以何物为第一？」次贤道：「我口不同于人口，不敢定。","en":"\\"The comparison is apt, but rather unfair to Daoweng,\\" said Ziyun. \\"He at least is not sour. Let him be compared to dried river scallops instead.\\" \\"That is even more unfair to him,\\" said Cixian. \\"You are a man from Zhejiang, so naturally you sing the praises of river scallops. If you ask me, dried scallops are like"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"大概是论易牙所调的味，皆合人之口味。若今日的厨子，也就单合他自己的口味了。」子云道：「正是。譬如去年那个熊掌，真真糟蹋了。怪不得晋灵公要杀宰夫，想是他也剩这一个，若还有几对留着，也不至恨到如此。」说得合席皆笑。","en":"Yi Ya, which could suit all palates. As for today's cooks, they suit only their own palates.\\" \\"Exactly,\\" said Ziyun. \\"Take that bear's paw dish last year. What a waste it was. No wonder Duke Ling of Jin had his cook put to death. He must have had only the one paw left. Had he kept back a few more pairs, his resentment might not have reached quite that pitch.\\" The"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":10,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"蕙芳道：「就是《别母乱箭》，可以对《训子单刀》。」素兰道：「这么对，还有《闹朝扑犬》，也可对得《打店偷鸡》。」子云笑道：「到底他们记得熟，可以不假思索。」次贤道：「自然，我们虽也记得几个，究竟是半生半熟的。」子云道：「我有一个摆骰子的顽意儿，试试你们的心思。」叫取三颗骰子来，蕙芳道：「又是那个飞曲文的么？」子云道：「不是，这容易多着呢。将三颗骰子摆成一句诗色样，","en":"matches 'Attacking the Inn; Stealing the Chicken.'\\" \\"They clearly know the repertoire through and through,\\" laughed Ziyun, \\"and recall it without the least effort.\\" \\"Naturally,\\" said Cixian, \\"— we know a few titles too, but only half by heart.\\" \\"I have a little diversion with dice,\\" said Ziyun, \\"to test your wits.\\" He called for three dice. \\"Is this the 'flying lyrics'"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":11,"tokens":["子云","度香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"吃过了饭，又下楼逛了一会，过了小山，过了石梁，便是留春坞。就在留春坞内煮茗清谈。宝珠对子云将琴言的师娘要他出师，及蕙芳、素兰的主意说了一遍。子云道：「若果如此，倒也很好。」便问蕙芳道：「你们有这力量作此义举么？」蕙芳道：「若说力量，原也勉强，但集腑成裘，也还容易。我与瑶卿、香畹三人可以凑得六百金，王氏弟兄、佩仙、庾香可以凑得四百金。」次贤","en":"reach the Spring-Lingering Dell. There, over brewed tea, they fell into easy conversation. Baozhu recounted to Ziyun the matter of Qinyan's master's wife demanding the release of his indenture, together with the plans that Huifang and Sulan had proposed. \\"If that is truly the case,\\" said Ziyun, \\"it would be very good indeed.\\" He turned to Huifang and asked: \\"Do you"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":5,"tokens":["徐老爷"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"两上好纹银，我也肯了。他能不能？他若不能，我还候着华公子。他是个有名花钱的主儿，或者一万八千都可以呢。不然还有徐老爷，他是爱他的，更好说话。我忙什么！」蕙芳冷笑道：「婶娘但听华公子的声名，三千五千两原不算什么。但是华公子近来不甚喜欢他。非但不肯替他出师，只怕还要打发他出来。婶娘在外头如何知道？我们是常到他府里去的，如今是一间闲房给他住着，也不常使唤他。新年我们去叩","en":"\\"He discussed it with us yesterday. If three or five thousand taels were needed, he could not manage it, though three thousand strings might perhaps be possible.\\" \\"Three thousand strings, and you want to release him!\\" The widow exclaimed several times in astonishment. \\"Do you realise that when Qinyan was performing last year, he earned a clear ten thousand strings in half a year alone? This person pays three thousand strings and gets Qinyan for his own, and then in a few months he will have recouped his investment. Dear me, dear me! If it were this easy a bargain, I would go into the business myself.\\" \\"Sister-in-law, that is not quite how it works,\\" said Maolin. \\"Consider: if he were still performing, yes, he might earn that much. But if he is taken as a son for study, schooling, and a proper marriage, there is nothing but spending and no earning at all. Besides, this gentleman is a kind-hearted man, and helping Qinyan is in itself a good deed.\\" \\"I don't care about any of that,\\" said the widow. \\"So long as the person is willing to spend the money and meet my figure, I will let him come and arrange the release.\\" \\"Auntie,\\" said Huifang, \\"what is your actual figure? Name a definite sum, so that I may go and negotiate. Whether they can meet it or not, we can speak again...\\" \\"Plain and simple,\\" said the widow: \\"three thousand taels of good silver, nothing less, and I will agree. Can he manage it or not? If he cannot, I will wait for Young Master Hua. He has a reputation as a free spender, so ten thousand or eight thousand might not be beyond him. Or there is still Lord Xu, who is fond of Qinyan, and would be easier to approach. I am in no hurry!\\" \\"Auntie, you have heard of Young Master Hua's reputation,\\" Huifang said with a cool smile, \\"and three or five thousand taels is nothing to him, to be sure. But Young Master Hua has not been particularly pleased with Qinyan of late. Not only is he unlikely to buy out the indenture, he may well send him away entirely. How would Auntie know the inner workings from outside? We visit the household regularly. Now a single spare room has been allotted to him, and they don't often find uses for him. At New Year when we went to pay our respects, the young master gave each of us a silver ingot, yet Qinyan received nothing. One day I happened to see what was in his box. It was a mere sixty-odd taels of silver all told, accumulated from last year's Mid-Autumn Festival right to the present. As for Lord Xu, he has cooled somewhat from before, and besides, Qinyan has always kept a certain reserve with Lord Xu. If Lord Xu had truly been willing to release him, he would have done so long ago, not waited until now. Apart from these two, consider: two hundred strings a month, or three thousand taels for a full release, which is truly possible? Auntie is a sensible woman. Has more than a month at home not been enough to see through his situation? This opportunity has presented itself; we have come to speak for him, and perhaps you might add a little yourself. Auntie, see it clearly: treat him as you would your own child, and come down a little. Between the two sides we can make it work. Three thousand strings is indeed too little, but two thousand silver taels I can guarantee.\\" \\"Since you have come to speak,\\" said the widow, \\"you should be looking after my interests too, but not to the point of making your respected performer lose face. Very well then. Let us cut to the chase. I am a woman who binds her hair and wraps her feet, yet I dislike all this haggling and dragging on. I will come down two hundred taels. Two thousand eight hundred is the absolute minimum.\\" Maolin, sensing the wind shifting, said to Huifang: \\"Let us put it this way: go and tell that gentleman to consider it as an act of charity to a widow and orphan, a store of virtue and merit, and ask him to put up two thousand four hundred taels. We as middlemen will charge not a single cash in commission; every bit goes to the principal sum. Sister-in-law, you need not hold firm any longer. Speed is of the essence in this matter. If it is settled in a day or two, sister-in-law too can put her mind at rest. Qinyan is a straightforward person who cannot manage roundabout dealings.\\" The widow weighed the matter inwardly: \\"If the Hua household sends him away, and the boy is stubborn and refuses to perform again, that too will not do. As for Lord Xu, his heart is already divided among many. Better to accept the offer. Two thousand four hundred taels, which is six thousand strings, is not a small sum.\\""},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":3,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"明日一早，蕙芳就到怡园，子云尚未过来。在次贤处等候，一连两起的人，将子云请了过来，说明此事。子云也甚喜欢，就传总管的，叫他去开了二千四百两的一张银票，格外又一张五十两的，赏与茂林。蕙芳也不耽搁，急忙回去吃了饭，找了茂林，先将五十两送了他，茂林感激不尽，即同到长庆媳妇家来。蕙芳说","en":"Early the next morning, Huifang went to the Garden of Contentment. Ziyun had not yet arrived. He waited at Cixian's rooms, and after two rounds of messengers had been sent, Ziyun came over. The matter was explained to him. Ziyun was very pleased, and summoned his chief steward, instructing him to go and draw a bank draft"}],"44":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["徐子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"原来他倒在外边这样快乐，一定又到那里去陪酒了。」姚贤一面想，一面走，忽前面来了两个熟人，一个二十九岁叫孟七，是徐子云的家人；一个三十九岁叫胡八，是奚十一的家人，都是本京人，那胡八与姚贤是两姨中表，这三个人都是相好的。这日胡八因主人患病无事，出来找了孟七听戏，想到馆子里去吃饭，遇见了姚贤，又是城里出来的，便一把拉住，各人问了好，便邀进了馆子，要了几样菜、两壶酒，细酌","en":"thinking, when ahead of him two acquaintances appeared: one was twenty-nine-year-old Meng Qi, a household man of Xu Ziyun's; the other was thirty-nine-year-old Hu Ba, a household man of Xi Eleven's. Both were natives of the capital. Hu Ba was Yao Xian's first cousin on the maternal side; all three were on friendly terms. That day Hu Ba, whose master was ill and had no errands,"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":2,"tokens":["徐老爷"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"姚贤道：「我怎敢撒谎？这是徐老爷家的孟七爷，并奚家的胡八爷，讲得有凭据，我敢添一句，对出谎来，是好耍的么？」珊枝心里细想道：「琴言何敢如此负恩？非特公子白疼了他，我也白白的照应他一番了。」又转念道：「看他的心总是勉强在此，心上又有什么梅少爷，自然在外面快乐。但到徐老爷处也还罢了。怎","en":"\\"How would I dare to tell lies?\\" said Yao Xian. \\"These are words spoken by Meng Qi of Lord Xu's household and Hu Ba of the Xi family's household — with witnesses to what was said. Would I dare add a word? Is it something to jest about?\\" Shanzhi turned it over in his mind: \\"How could Qinyan be so ungrateful? Not only has the young master loved him for nothing — I have taken care of him for nothing as well.\\" Then the thought shifted: \\"Looking at his heart, he has always been reluctant to be here, always pining after some young Master Mei. Naturally he is happier out there. To be at Lord Xu's is one thing. But how could he also attend wine parties for Wei Pincai and Xi Eleven? Has he no self-respect, or does he care nothing for the young master's face? The jade bracelets are not worth all that much, and yet he could sink so low. And here in the household he always put on such airs — the manner of a superior being, a cold hauteur about him. So that is the reality of it, now plain to see. At this point I can no longer help conceal things for you — better to tell the truth outright. A person of true character acting out of true principle — perhaps it will shame someone too. His manner is refined and doesn't look like a performer's; there seems to be not a trace of vulgarity in him. Yet now, it turns out — it is those with a trace of vulgarity who do not dare to take unauthorized leave, while this one makes a spectacle of himself.\\" His mind made up, he walked to the inner study and called softly to little Xiang'er through the whitewashed wall. He heard Xiang'er's silvery laughter from within, and only after several calls did the girl emerge. \\"What is it?\\" Xiang'er asked. \\"I need to report something.\\" \\"The young master has gone to the garden,\\" said Xiang'er. \\"Did the young master go alone, or with the mistress?\\" \\"The young master went from here accompanied by Sister Bao, Sister Zhen, and Sister Rui to the garden, to see the peach blossoms again. The mistress did not go.\\" Then Shanzhi heard a voice inside the room: \\"Listen — who is that?\\" The voice replied: \\"Lin Shanzhi, of course — who else?\\" Shanzhi recognized it as Huazhu and Hezhu, and went off quickly toward the garden. He passed through a blaze of crimson and pink, in a languid and gentle breeze, and went straight along to the Liu Xian Courtyard. Reaching the rear of the garden, he could hear laughter everywhere, and what sounded like verse recitation — in girls' voices. Shanzhi lightened his step and circled to the western side, concealing himself behind a Taihu rock, peering through a gap in the stone from a distance. He saw Ruizhu, dressed in a peach-pink silk jacket and green silk vest, kneeling under the peach trees and reciting the \\"Song of Everlasting Sorrow.\\" She had arrived at the lines:"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":5,"tokens":["度香","徐度香","徐老爷"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"华公子听了这些话，不觉大怒，把脸都气得白了，连说：「有这等事！可恨！可恨！琴言丧尽天良，人间少有。而度香笑里藏刀，欺人太甚，难道我就罢了不成！你明日还叫姚贤去，务必把他叫来，我问问他，是何缘故。我也不管什么徐度香，我自然不能依他，与他评个理，天下有这么欺人的事情么？若不相好的人也罢了，既系相好，就不该有心欺人。从前何以不早与他出师！要到我这里来了，才卖","en":"true! Outrageous! Outrageous! Qinyan has utterly lost all human conscience — the like of it is rarely seen. And Duxiang — smiling on the outside, a blade within — he has gone too far in insulting me. Do you think I will simply let this pass? Go at once and send Yao Xian back — he must bring Qinyan here, no matter what. I must question him face to face and hear his reasons."},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":2,"tokens":["徐老爷"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"敢不来，但倒像少不得这个人，他自己一发看得自己尊贵了。奴才想以后随他来也好，不来也好，横竖府里不少这个人。至于徐老爷，自然更不该，但劝公子也不必与他较量，为着一个不要紧的人，伤了两代世交情分。且人自然也说徐老爷不好，抢人家的人，岂有不赞公子大量么？」","en":"Shanzhi then caught Baozhu's eye, and Baozhu also sought to console him: \\"Shanzhi speaks rightly. If Qinyan's heart had truly been with the young master, then even if someone had arranged his release, he would not have concealed it but would have come to inform the young master in person. If he had come to inform the young master, would the young master not have been willing to release him? This person is both confused and faithless — what use is such a one? Besides, last year it was he who chose to come; this year it is he who chooses to leave. The young master's kindness to him — who in the world does not know it? This is his own ill fortune — he is not able to receive such a blessing. If the young master were determined to have him brought back, he would certainly not dare disobey; but that would make it seem as though one cannot do without him, and he would think himself all the more valuable. In our humble opinion, from now on let him come if he will and stay away if he will — the household loses nothing by his absence. As for Lord Xu, he was certainly wrong; but we counsel the young master not to press the matter with him. Over one person of no great consequence, to damage the friendship of two generations of families is not worth it. And people will naturally say Lord Xu was in the wrong — poaching another's favourite — while praising the young master's magnanimity.\\""},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":4,"tokens":["子云","度香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"公子回房，见了夫人，欲不题起，心上又忍不住，就将子云与琴言出师的事说了。华夫人道：「什么叫作出师？」华公子道：「当年他师父也是花钱买的，所以挣的钱都归他师父。有人替他出了师，那就不算师父的人，由他自己作主了。昨日度香花二千四百两与琴言出师的。」华夫人道：「这么说，琴言就是度香的人了。」公子道：「可不是","en":"rooms, and seeing the mistress, he tried not to broach the subject — but could not hold it back, and told her of Ziyun's arrangement of Qinyan's release from indenture. \\"What does 'release from indenture' mean?\\" asked Madam Hua. \\"In the old days his shifu paid to have him, so all earnings went to the shifu,\\" the young master explained. \\"With his release, he is no longer"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":2,"tokens":["度香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"度香的老爷与我们老爷是至好，何必为着琴言，伤了世交的情份。我劝你可以不必，琴言到底算个优伶，若闹起来，这狎优二字就难免了。」华公子素来敬爱夫人的，听他心平气和的讲，心中的气亦消了一大半，口内答应了一句：「说得是。」但又舍不得琴言。忽又转念过来，欲行不可，","en":"\\"Duxiang's lord and our lord were the closest of friends — why damage a friendship of generations over Qinyan? My advice is that you need not act on this at all. When all is said and done, Qinyan is a performer — if this becomes a quarrel, both families will"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这是琴言出师第二日，琴言原要今日进去，适子云于初六日要请客，一来与南湘、春航送场，并请屈道生，约子玉、仲清等相陪。今日已是初四，索性到初七进去，并说写个字贴与华公子，说他过了假期，一因身子不快，二因留他逛几天。所以琴言倒也心安，乐得多顽几日。","en":"second day after Qinyan's release. Qinyan had originally intended to return to the Hua household that day, but Ziyun was planning a banquet on the sixth day of the month — to send off Nanxiang and Chunhang, and to host Master Qu Daosheng, with Ziyu, Zhongqing, and others invited to keep them company. As today was only the fourth, they resolved to wait until the seventh"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":5,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"那日蕙芳出门去了，琴言便到怡园来。此时梨花已开，子云、次贤与宝珠在梨院闲谈，琴言进来相见了。次贤笑道：「玉侬，如今由你自己作主了，不如辞了华府，到这里来罢。」琴言笑道：「我倒很愿，意但怎样去辞那边呢！」子云笑道：「那还了得？华星北必说我夺其所好，这官司还打得清么？不要弄到叩阍起来。到初七日也可回去了，","en":"Huifang had gone out, and Qinyan came to the Garden of Contentment on his own. The pear blossoms were now in bloom; Ziyun and Cixian were chatting with Baozhu in the Pear Blossom Courtyard when Qinyan arrived and greeted them. \\"Yunong,\\" laughed Cixian, \\"now that you are your own master, why not resign from the Hua household and come to live here?\\" \\"I would truly like nothing"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":5,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"官，就要委屈了。殿试工夫，竹君不及湘帆，若试宏词，竹君倒要擅长了。我看今年庾香是必得的，剑潭、卓然也有九分。」子云道：「你自己呢，一发拿得稳了。」次贤道：「也不去考，我自知无福。」子云道：「这叫什么话？你不应举也罢了，还可以说得无心进取。这宏词原是品定海内人才，就是那些老前辈退居林下的，还来应考，岂有全才如你，倒不去的？那时我托人硬把你荐了，由不得你不去。」次贤","en":"is certain to pass this year, and Jiantan and Zhuoran each have a nine-in-ten chance.\\" \\"And you yourself,\\" said Ziyun, \\"are a foregone conclusion.\\" \\"I am not entering,\\" said Cixian. \\"I know my own lack of fortune in such things.\\" \\"What sort of talk is that?\\" said Ziyun. \\"If you choose not to sit for the regular examinations, that is one thing — one might at least say"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":3,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"正说话间，忽然管门的进来禀道：「华公子打发人来，要面见老爷，还有几个箱子送来。」子云诧异，道：「什么箱子？叫来人进来。」话言未了，只见珊枝已走到梨院。琴言望见珊枝，早躲进屋后，潜身听他所为何事。珊枝见子云、次贤，请过了安，说道：「公子与二位老爷请安，有一封信在此。」便双手呈上。子云接来，看见封面上有「皮箱四个，面交徐二老爷查收」，才","en":"\\"Young Master Hua has sent someone who wishes to see the master in person, and has also brought several trunks.\\" Ziyun was puzzled. \\"What trunks? Have the visitor come in.\\" Before the words were out, Shanzhi had already walked into the Pear Blossom Courtyard. Qinyan caught sight of Shanzhi and immediately retreated behind the house to listen in concealment, wondering"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":3,"tokens":["子云","徐老爷"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"。兄虽大度优容，不与较量，而弟必留心查察，如有闻见，必为详达，代兄撵逐，勿使名园玷辱也。匆匆此布，并候通履。\\n子云看了，正不知从何说起，不白之冤，有口难辩，气得两手冰冷，与次贤面面相观，冷笑了几声。次贤问珊枝道：「你公子对你说什么？」珊枝道：「没有讲什么，就叫小的将琴言的箱子交明老爷，问有回信没有回信。」子云气得说不出来，次贤道：「奇了，这话从何说起？此时也不及","en":"garden may not be brought into disrepute. In haste, this brief note, with wishes for your continued wellbeing.\\"\\n\\nZiyun read through the letter and did not know where to begin: the injustice was total, the wrong impossible to argue away. His hands turned cold with anger. He and Cixian looked at each other in silence, and exchanged a few cold laughs. Cixian asked Shanzhi:"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":6,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这边琴言尚不知缘故，似乎听得将箱子送来。知珊枝去了，忙走出来，见子云面貌失色，靠在椅上。宝珠与次贤还看那信，琴言过来要看，次贤意欲藏过，子云道：「给他看看，这是那里说起？华星北真不是人，听了谁的话，这般糟蹋人，可恼！可恼！」琴言不看此信还可，看了不由得伤心起来，一字字看去，忽然一腔怒气，直涌上来，眼前一阵乌黑，喉中如","en":"yet he gathered that his trunks had been delivered. Hearing Shanzhi's departure, he hurried out, only to find Ziyun pale and slumped in his chair while Baozhu and Cixian pored over the letter. Qinyan stepped forward to read it. Cixian instinctively moved to hide the pages, but Ziyun intervened. \\"Let him see,\\" he said bitterly. \\"Where do such unfounded claims even"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云等搅得柔肠寸断，这三个人也无从劝得一句，直哭到一个时辰，尚是有泪无声，黯然而泣。","en":"Ziyun and the others felt their own hearts wrung within them; the three could find not a single word of consolation. He wept for a full two hours, until at last there were tears but no sound, and he wept on in silent, desolate grief."},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":6,"tokens":["子云","度香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云见琴言如此，甚是伤心，因想道：「华星北过于欺人，不问真假。我本要与他讲个明白，但我去剖辩，倒长了他的志气，道是去招陪他了。索性罢了，断了这个交情，也不要紧。」说道：「玉侬不必哭了，你的好处，都是共见的，这些话有谁信他？一定是林珊枝从中调唆，以至如此，","en":"Seeing Qinyan in such distress, Ziyun felt an ache of sympathy. \\"Hua Xingbei has gone too far,\\" he thought to himself. \\"To hurl such insults without verifying a single fact is intolerable. I had intended to go and clear the air, but to defend myself now would only look like groveling. Better"},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":3,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"芳来了，见了琴言光景，着实诧异，问了缘故，便拍手称快道：「天下有这么好事，真求也求不到，还哭什么呢？」次贤又将子云不要他们唱戏，要他们在园里的话说了。蕙芳道：「这是极好的，只怕我们生了这个下贱的命，未必能有此清福。我这两年内就想要改行，但又无行可改。这跟官一道，与唱戏也在伯仲之间。若做买卖，又不在行。且在这京里，就改了行，人家也认识，总要出了京，才能改图。你道我","en":"world!\\" he exclaimed. \\"One could not beg for such luck, yet here you are weeping over it?\\" Cixian then relayed Ziyun's generous proposal to end their performing days and harbor them all safely within the garden. \\"Nothing could be more wonderful,\\" Huifang sighed, \\"though I fear our lowly born fate may never allow us such leisured grace. I have desperately wanted to"},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":3,"tokens":["度香","徐老爷","子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"且说珊枝回去，华公子便问到怡园见了度香怎样光景，珊枝道：「今日见他们在梨花园内，奴才进去见琴言、宝珠，琴言见了奴才，即躲开了。徐老爷问了公子好，将帖儿拆开看了一会，一句话也没有讲，就只冷笑一声。萧老爷说不及写回字了，回去与公子请安，我们明日见了公子当面讲罢。奴才将箱子交给他们门上，也就收","en":"Meanwhile, Shanzhi returned to the Hua household. Young Master Hua eagerly demanded to know how Duxiang had reacted upon receiving the letter at the garden. \\"When I arrived, I found them gathered in the Pear Blossom Courtyard,\\" Shanzhi reported. \\"As I entered, I saw Qinyan and Baozhu standing there, but the moment Qinyan spotted me, he quickly moved away."}],"45":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说琴言在怡园住下，赖有子云、次贤日为开导，又有那些名旦不约而来，或有煮茗清谈，或有咏花斗酒，园中的胜景甚多，今日在牡丹台，明日在芍药圃，倒也把愁闷消去了一半。","en":"Qinyan stayed on at the Garden of Contentment, finding comfort in the daily counsel of Xu Ziyun and Xiao Cixian. The celebrated dan actors also visited frequently of their own accord. Sometimes they would brew tea for quiet conversation, and at other times they matched verses over wine. The garden offered scene after splendid scene. Today they"},{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"昨日子云又请了屈道生、梅子玉、史南湘、颜仲清、田春航、刘文泽、王恂等，并有诸名旦全来，会了一日。因南湘、春航次早要入场，所以散得甚早。","en":"The day before, Ziyun had once again invited Qu Daosheng, Mei Ziyu, Shi Nanxiang, Yan Zhongqing, Tian Chunhang, Liu Wenze, Wang Xun, and others. Together with all the leading actors, they had gathered for an entire day. Since Nanxiang and Chunhang were to enter the examination"},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"衷曲。今日晚饭后，想趁着那一钩新月，去到怡园，也可畅叙一会，遂禀明了颜夫人、带了云儿，乘兴而来。进了怡园，却值子云未回，到了次贤处。子玉尚未进门，听得有人在那里高谈阔论。次贤见子玉来了，即忙出来，要请到里面。子玉问道：「何客？」次贤笑道：「不要紧，是个湖州王客人，贩些古董书画笔墨等货，来托消的。」","en":"He informed Lady Yan, brought Yun'er along, and set off on a whim. Upon entering the garden, he discovered that Ziyun had not yet returned, so he went directly to Cixian's quarters. Before Ziyu even stepped inside, he heard someone holding forth loudly within. When Cixian saw Ziyu arrive, he hurried out to warmly welcome him inside. Ziyu asked, \\"Who is your guest?\\""},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"那王胡子好不话多，子玉有些发烦。无奈王胡子要候子云回来，消些东西。还有一部《图书集成》，这部书是个难消的，心上要想求子云买这部书，情愿减价，只要三千银子，今日看来也要在园中下榻的了。","en":"talked without end, and Ziyu grew rather tired of his chatter. Unfortunately, Old Wang insisted on waiting for Ziyun's return to unload his goods. He also carried a complete set of the *Complete Collection of Illustrations and Writings from Antiquity to the Present*, which was a notoriously slow seller. Old Wang secretly hoped Ziyun would buy it and was willing to"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":6,"tokens":["度香","子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"罪。及进去了，倒也不见得怎样。惟有这片心，人总瞧不出来。就算格外待得好，究竟把我当个优伶看待，供人的喜笑。至于度香待我，还有什么说的？但我此时身虽安了，心实未安。从前在火炕里，受这些孽障，只求早死，也想不到如今还能出来。既出来了，我的心倒比从前更乱了。戏是决意不唱，奴才也不再作，但又作什么呢？人既待得这么好，我只是愁愁闷闷，也叫人疑惑，说我不知足了。所以我此刻另","en":"it. Even when they favored me beyond measure, I was still merely a performer kept for others' amusement. As for Ziyun's profound kindness, what more could one possibly ask? Yet, although my body is settled now, my heart is not. Before, in that fiery pit, I bore those trials and only wished for an early death. I never dreamed I could actually escape. Now that I am out,"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":3,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云道：「既如此，就是明日辰刻毕集，此时就叫人去知会。」一面吩咐家人到各处去了。子云道：「今日月光不足，辜负名花，叫把那像生花灯点上几盏来，挂在树上。」家童忙到厢房内，开了柜子，取出十二盏海棠灯，是用通草作成。花朵中点了小白蜡，挂起来十分好看。子云道：「","en":"Ziyun said, \\"Then let everyone assemble at the chen hour tomorrow. I will send runners immediately.\\" He ordered the servants to carry notices everywhere. Ziyun looked up at the sky and said, \\"Tonight's moon is thin, wasting these famous blossoms. Have them"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云道：「略饮数杯，领领玉侬的情。」吩咐随便拿几样果菜来。当下四人小酌了一回，已经二更，子玉告辞，子云又嘱明日务必早到，子玉答应而别。","en":"Ziyun urged him, \\"Just a few cups, to honor Yunong's regard.\\" He instructed the servants to bring light refreshments. The four of them drank a little together. It was already the second watch. Ziyu took his leave. Ziyun urged him once again to come early the"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":3,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子过来，也与诸人叙礼，他却都是认识的，与屈道生更是多年相好。王胡子道：「今日人多，仙坛要设个宽绰的地方才好。」子云道：「我估量着人多，已经叫人在含万楼上铺设了。」又笑问王胡子道：「你是主坛的法师，请教你，今日是吃斋呢，还是吃荤？」王胡子笑道：「神仙也是吃肉的，只不用葱蒜五荤罢。」子云道：「这很好，我们菜里本不用葱蒜的。」于是吩咐摆早饭，吃了好上坛。计算人数共是十","en":"acquainted with Qu Daosheng for years. Old Wang said, \\"With such a crowd today, we need a spacious spot for the altar.\\" Ziyun replied, \\"I expected a crowd, so I had the Tower of Myriad Containment prepared.\\" He smiled at Old Wang and added, \\"You are the master of ceremonies. Tell us: shall we eat vegetarian or meat today?\\" Old Wang laughed heartily. \\"Even immortals eat meat,"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"盐商家那些花园，也算精工的了，如何比得上这里？再如平山堂、虹园也不能彷佛。至于侯石翁的起凤园，更不必提了。这边子云取出商彝、周□、汉鼎、秦盘，斟上百花酿，焚了百和香，中铺上一盘净沙，摆了一个仙乩。大家下楼冠带，盥漱已毕，重亲上楼。","en":"Pingshan Hall and Hong Garden fell short. As for Hou Shiweng's Qifeng Garden, it did not even bear mention. Here, Ziyun brought out Shang bronzes, Zhou bronzes, Han tripods, and Qin ritual dishes. He poured Hundred-Flowers brew, burned Hundred-Blend incense, spread clean sand on the tray, and set out the spirit planchette. Everyone went downstairs to robe up, rinse their"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"王胡子将笔写了，子云等就在两边看时，分明是「珠珍」两字。","en":"Old Wang transcribed the characters while Ziyun and the others watched intently from the sides. They were clearly the words Pearl and Jewel."},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"问，就请祷告，好待上仙判断。」众人心上都没有事，不过来看热闹的。及王胡子问时，你推我，我推你，没有一个肯上前。子云忍不住笑道：「既诸位没有问的事，我要问一个人。」就叫：「玉侬，你来跪下。默祷默祷，请上仙判判你的终身，后来如何？」琴言原想自己问问，不好抢先上来，今见子云叫他，即便上前跪下，叩头默祷了一回。只见乩上运动，已写了两三行。琴言起来，站在王胡子背后，看他写","en":"merely come for the spectacle. When Old Wang asked, each person pushed another forward, and none would go first. Ziyun could not help laughing. \\"Since no one has questions, I will ask about someone.\\" He called out, \\"Yunong, kneel and pray silently. Ask the immortal to pronounce on your fate to come.\\" Qinyan had wanted to ask himself, but hesitated to leap ahead. Hearing"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云看了，不禁笑道：「据上仙所判，玉侬前世，竟是道翁的女公子了。」琴言不觉红晕了两颊，道生也觉奇异，欲要再问时，见乩又动起来，写道：「吾去也，坡仙来。」写罢，寂然不动。","en":"Ziyun could not help laughing. \\"According to the immortal, Yunong was Old Gentleman's daughter in a previous life!\\" Qinyan's cheeks flushed crimson. Daosheng marveled too and would have asked more, but the planchette wrote: \\"I depart; the Immortal of the Slope"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"翩裙屐佳公子，舞席歌场日终始。\\n兴似春山再展云，情如秋浦长流水。\\n众人看了，都欣欣然说道：「坡仙要作长古了。」子云叫人取了一幅白绢笺，研好了墨，请道生另写。只见乩上又写道：","en":"renewed,\\nPassion like autumn river's endless flood.\\"\\nDelighted, they realized Su Shi meant to compose a long ballad. Ziyun ordered a bolt of fine silk and ink ground so Daosheng could copy it separately. The planchette continued:"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"玉看了，分明一个梅字，一个琴字，也知道是说他们二人的，心里又想道：「难道坡仙今日要将这十九个人全写入诗内么？」子云与诸人也都看了，蕙芳呆呆的看着乩盘，只见道生又照着乩上写了四句是：","en":"knew they spoke of the two of them. He wondered whether Su meant to gather all nineteen of them into his poem. Ziyun and the others read on. Huifang stared blankly at the tray as Daosheng copied four more lines from the planchette:"},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"名园公子人中英，于彼于此俱有情。\\n珠辉宝气联星斗，金光灿烂云霞明。\\n道生写了，对着子云、吉甫道：「这像是说你们二位呢。」子云、吉甫俱说「惭愧！惭愧！」宝珠看了，也知道带着他，且与吉甫相联，心甚喜欢。只见又写道：","en":"and treasure light thread through the Dipper,\\nGolden radiance and rosy clouds shine bright.\\"\\nDaosheng turned to Ziyun and Jifu. \\"This seems to describe you two.\\" Both replied, \\"We are unworthy!\\" Baozhu knew he was included, linked with Jifu, and he was deeply pleased. Next came:"},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"石崇王恺人争羡，世德勋门荷天眷。\\n只惜豪华怒碎琴，明珠减价珊瑚贱。\\n仲清道：「这不消说是华公子。」子云道：「竟连前日的事，都说出来了。你知道明珠、珊瑚的故事么？」仲清道：「我不知这句的故事。」文泽道：「明珠是他有十婢，皆以珠字为名，这珊瑚就是林珊枝了。」又看写的是：","en":"Bright pearls cheapened, coral branches priced less.\\"\\nZhongqing exclaimed, \\"That can only be Young Master Hua.\\" Ziyun agreed, \\"Even last week's quarrel appears. Do you know the pearl and coral story?\\" Zhongqing shook his head. \\"I don't know that line.\\" Wenze explained, \\"The pearls were his ten maids, all named with 'pearl.' The coral is Lin Shanzhi.\\" The next lines"},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"冲寒一鹤云中来，知尔磊落非凡材。\\n依刘暂作王粲计，剑气闪烁凌风雷。\\n子云道：「此是剑潭无疑了。」又见写道：","en":"beyond compare.\\nSheltering with Liu you plot like Wang Can,\\nSword-flash gleams to rend the wind and thunder there.\\"\\nZiyun smiled and said, \\"That is surely Jiantan.\\" Next:"},{"paragraph":33,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"花列两行。\\n十树琼花十样锦，春风喜气满华堂。\\n众人道：「首句是香畹，次句是佩仙、玉艳，三句总说，末句是小梅。」子云掐指一算，名花已有了八人，只少静芳、蕊香两人了。又见写道：","en":"first line is Xiangwan. The second is Peixian and Yuyan. The third sums them up, and the last line is Xiaomei.\\" Ziyun counted on his fingers. Eight flowers were named, leaving only Jingfang and Ruixiang missing. Next:"},{"paragraph":34,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"春兰秋桂非凡种，香色由来人所重。\\n尽待神仙闲品题，群花齐向天门拥。\\n子云道：「他们都说完了，就只有道翁先生与胡兄了。」王胡子拈着长须，候着乩上说他。道生道：「我这老朽，恐怕未必能附诸名士名花之后，且如何能邀坡仙齿芬一粲？」只见乩上又写道：","en":"has long held dear,\\nWait till immortals idly taste each name,\\nAll blooms together crowd Heaven's gate the same.\\"\\nZiyun said, \\"That finishes them. Only Old Gentleman Qu and Brother Hu remain.\\" Old Wang stroked his beard, eagerly waiting to be named. Daosheng said, \\"This worn-out frame hardly deserves a place after such masters and flowers. How could I ever win Su's smile?\\""},{"paragraph":37,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云吩咐家人在承荫堂摆了四桌盛席，便对众人道：「今日我有一言，上承仙命，下合人心，成了前因后果。两仙乩上俱判玉侬为道翁前生娇女。现在道翁无子，玉侬无父，我欲成此仙缘，要请道翁收玉侬为义子。玉侬虽失足于前，未尝不可立身于后，想先生决不以世俗之见论人。未识玉","en":"Ziyun ordered a lavish banquet to be laid in the Hall of Inherited Shade. He stood and addressed the gathering. \\"Today I have a proposal, commanded from above and welcomed below, that completes the circle of cause and effect. Both immortals judged Yunong to"},{"paragraph":38,"mentions":3,"tokens":["子云","度香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"今日合当父子相逢，不然杜兰仙何以特判出来，又单叫道翁上前，说明前因后果，不是也要撮合这件事么？可见数已前定。」子云接口道：「可勿三思，请到承荫堂一拜就算了。」道生想道：「我看着琴言虽系优伶，却无半点习气，度香早说过他多少好处。况我也见过他好几次，竟是毫无訾议的。若以为义子，倒是个千里驹。况他天姿颖悟，略一指点，便可有成。而且两次仙乩，都说前生是我的女儿，自然他也","en":"Old Gentleman forward to explain cause and effect, except to bring this about? The numbers were fixed long ago.\\" Ziyun added, \\"There is no need for long deliberation. Come to the Hall of Inherited Shade, bow, and it is done.\\" Daosheng thought to himself, \\"Though Qinyan is of the stage, he shows none of its habits. Ziyun has praised him often, and I have met him several"},{"paragraph":39,"mentions":4,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"但终是面嫩，答应不来，红泛桃花，低头不语。子云道：「玉侬，你怎么样？道翁是极愿意的了。况你们前生原系父女，今世自然天性未离，这是光明正大的事情，何妨答应，有什么害羞处说不出来的？」琴言目视子云，将头点了一点。子云哈哈大笑道：「愿意了，愿意了！这也不是轻易遇得着的。」就让众人到承荫堂，铺了红毡，次","en":"Yet shame kept him from speaking. His face bloomed as red as peach-blossoms, and he looked down in silence. Ziyun encouraged him gently. \\"Yunong, what say you? Old Gentleman is willing. You were father and daughter of old, and natural bonds survive. This is open and honorable. Why shrink from saying yes?\\" Qinyan looked at Ziyun and nodded once. Ziyun laughed aloud."},{"paragraph":40,"mentions":4,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"众人称贺已毕，道生又谢了子云，便说道：「弟是孤苦一身，并无家小，既承诸公雅爱作成，认为父子。但我比不得那有子嗣的人，单只挂个名儿。我既认了他，自就与亲生的一样，要教训他，并且要随着我去，不知他心上何如？」子云听了，略一踌躇，即问琴言道：「这事要你自己作主意，旁人难以应答的。」琴","en":"When the congratulations were done, Daosheng thanked Ziyun and said, \\"I am all alone, with no family. Since you gentlemen have honored me with this adoption, I am not one to wear an empty name. I will treat him as my own blood kin and instruct him. He must follow me when I go. What is his wish?\\" Ziyun hesitated"},{"paragraph":41,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云便请入席。第一席是道生、子玉、吉甫、王胡子、琴言，二席是仲清、文泽、王恂、子云、次贤，九个名旦分为两桌，各自叙齿坐了三、四两席。琴言坐在下手，拘拘谨谨，也不举箸，甚觉可怜。倒是道生体恤他，道：「凡遇热闹场中，当言的即言，也不必过于拘谨，但存着个后辈的","en":"Ziyun invited everyone to the table. The first table sat Daosheng, Ziyu, Jifu, Old Wang Beard, and Qinyan. The second seated Zhongqing, Wenze, Wang Xun, Ziyun, and Cixian. The nine actors split two more tables by age. Qinyan sat quietly at the foot, his chopsticks"},{"paragraph":42,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"里的事都写出来了，吓得那主人家磕头如捣蒜的哀求，方才没有写完。第二次就要算今日了。往常请时，却没有这么灵异。」子云笑道：「今日说我们的诗中，也有两句说着隐情，不过谑而未虐。」蕙芳咳嗽一声，惹得各席都笑了。","en":"pounding garlic and begged him to stop. Today's session was second only to that. Usually, it is not so sharp.\\" Ziyun laughed. \\"Today's poems merely hinted at private matters. They were playful, not cruel.\\" Huifang coughed lightly, and every table erupted in laughter."},{"paragraph":43,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"道生也笑道：「我也略猜着此，但不知是怎样个始末，何妨与我说明？」子云道：「我要说，又怕有人不依，我不说罢。」玉林对漱芳说道：「起初乩动的时候，我总当着你的手动，我想把我的手不动，教你写不成。后来，不由得我的手也跟着动起来了。」漱芳道：「可不是，我先也打量是你作诡，及至写了一句诗，我还疑惑是作出来的，后来才知不是了。」","en":"Daosheng smiled as well. \\"I guessed something of the sort. What was the story? Will you tell me?\\" Ziyun deflected gracefully. \\"If I speak, someone may object. I will keep silent.\\" Yulin turned to Shufang and whispered, \\"When the planchette first moved, I thought your hand moved it. I tried to hold my hand perfectly still so you could not write. But later,"},{"paragraph":47,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"道生来了一天，便要早回，对琴言道：「明日我着人来接你罢。」子云道：「先生何不搬来，那寓里有甚好处？」道生道：「这个最妙。我心上不好讲，又要搅扰。我还要细细把你的园子逛一逛呢！」诸名士道：「若得道翁先生住在园里，更有趣了。」次贤道：「前年园亭成后，一切布置倒也罢了。只有一样，各处的联匾，都是草创时定的。后来改造起","en":"Daosheng had been out all day and wished to leave early. He told Qinyan, \\"Tomorrow I will send for you.\\" Ziyun asked, \\"Why not move in here? What good is an inn?\\" Daosheng replied, \\"That sounds ideal. I hardly liked to impose, but I still mean to wander your garden thoroughly.\\" The gentlemen all agreed. \\"If Old Gentleman lives in the garden, it will be merrier"},{"paragraph":48,"mentions":2,"tokens":["度香","子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"至今日看去，似觉草草。昨日我与度香商量，尚须添的添，换的换，非道翁及诸兄手笔不可。」仲清道：「我们究竟还没有逛到。须尽一日之兴，游到了，方可拟题。」子云道：「含万楼下，我想刻一篇怡园序，要借重道翁。明日搬来，第一就要请教这篇序。」次贤笑道：「他还没有搬进来，你倒先索房租了。」说得众人","en":"\\"Today they look rather slipshod to the eye. Yesterday, Ziyun and I discussed it. Some must be added, and others swapped. Nothing less than Old Gentleman's brush and yours, gentlemen, will do.\\" Zhongqing pointed out, \\"We still have not seen the garden through. Only after a full day's wandering can we draft proper"}],"46":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"学楷书。可喜琴仙天姿颖悟，过目成诵，而且锐志攻书，把从前的忧闷倒也撇开。一连几日，道翁见其聪明可学，也甚欢喜。子云更为得意，吩咐园内家人都称为屈大爷。约有半月以来，琴仙的文理已通了好些，字也写好了，对对做诗也通顺了。父子之间，十分亲爱，竟是亲生的一样。那些相公们到园来，倒不好与他盘桓，到门口略一探望。琴仙也不肯旷功，足不出户，道翁倒有时体贴他，叫他也到各处逛逛，","en":"troubles were laid aside. After a few days Daoweng saw that he was bright and worth teaching, and was much pleased. Ziyun was more delighted still, and gave orders that everyone in the garden was to call him Master Qu.\\n\\nIn about half a month Qinxian's grasp of composition had improved a good deal, his characters were well formed, and he could match couplets and turn a poem"},{"paragraph":2,"mentions":6,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一日，想起子云托做《怡园序》，便作了半日，又修饰了一会，自己送与子云、次贤看了，请他斟酌。次贤道：「妙极了，就使徐、庾复生，也不能涂改一字。」子云道：「是石刻好呢，还是木刻好呢？」道翁道：「论长久，自然是石刻。前日见金吉甫相熟的那个季十矮子，刻工尚好，不过价值大些","en":"One day, remembering Ziyun's commission for a *Preface to the Garden of Contentment*, Daoweng drafted half a day, revised, and carried the text to Ziyun and Cixian for comment. Cixian said: \\"Perfect—even if Xu Ling and Yu Xin rose from the grave they could not alter a stroke.\\""},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":3,"tokens":["度香","子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"个含万楼是本《易经》「含万物而化光」句摘下，因为园中的主楼，故取此名。但就本意是言干道之大，此名似乎不甚相宜，度香以为何如？我见楼上现供着赐书，何不就改为赐书楼，未知可否？」子云道：「改得甚妙，就是赐书楼。还要求作一副长联。」道翁道：「老夫改了楼名，那联句请诸名士题罢。」子云道：「诸兄自有分题，这第一联还求道翁先生赐题，就是诸弟兄也不肯相僭的。」道翁又让了一会，","en":"the fit jars. Imperial books already fill the upper floor—why not rename it the Tower of Imperial Bestowals?\\" Ziyun said: \\"Excellent—we adopt Bestowed Books and still need a long couplet.\\" Daoweng answered: \\"Having renamed it, let the gentlemen compose the scrolls.\\" Ziyun insisted: \\"They may share the rest—but this first pair demands your brush; none of us would presume"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云让大众进了承荫堂，崇墉巍焕，局面堂皇。院子内有座戏台，槐阴布绿，栋宇生辉。道翁与诸名士看了那些匾对，说道：「这堂名很好，不用换。东西楹要添副长联，就请静宜大笔罢。」次贤道：「这些联额，原是弟当日胡乱写成的。这承荫堂与赐书楼，皆是正屋，还求吾兄老手一题","en":"Ziyun led them all into the Hall of Inherited Shade — high walls, splendid and imposing, and a stage in the courtyard, with green pagoda-tree shade against the shining eaves. Daoweng and the scholars looked over the plaques and couplets, and he said, \\"The"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"轻扇初开，长眉始画。\\n鸣瑟向赵，吹箫入秦。\\n道翁赞道：「我说庾香世兄定是不凡的，果然，果然！」子云及众名士也赞了好。","en":"traced.\\nZithers resound toward Zhao, pipes echo into Qin.\\n\\nDaoweng cried: \\"I knew Yuxiang would excel—indeed!\\" Ziyun and the others praised without stint."},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云就让进内，出了承荫堂，后是牡丹香国，四围短短花墙，围了有两三亩大的一块地。内中花石亭台，位置无一不佳，倒像独成一个园林景象。径用小白石砌成，曲曲折折有数十条，护以短栏。满园尽是牡丹花，有在石台上的，有在平地上的，高高下下，足有千万朵，开得正盛，五色缤","en":"Ziyun led them further in. Beyond the Hall of Inherited Shade lay the Kingdom of Peony Fragrance, walled about with a low flower-wall that enclosed two or three mu of ground. Within it the flowers and rocks, the kiosks and terraces were all admirably placed,"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"花。\\n道翁看了赞道：「真好富丽，却称这宝香堂。」众人也附和了几声。次贤道：「我们还是从东去呢，还是从西去呢？」子云道：「从西到东路长，还是从东转西，可以坐船，路却顺些。」便领众人出了护香廊后的围墙，只见一带石坡，层层的丛兰翠筱，芳磬袭人。从石磴上行到了山北，也是一样的兰竹。","en":"honour.\\"\\n\\nDaoweng praised the grandeur as worthy of the hall; others echoed. Cixian asked: \\"East loop or west?\\" Ziyun said: \\"West to east runs longer—begin east and circle west by boat—the route flows easier.\\" He led them past the colonnade wall onto stone terraces layered with orchid and bamboo—fragrance everywhere—then climbed north on stone steps to matching orchid"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"我竟没有来游玩过。」王恂道：「我也没有，到护香廊就住了。」南湘道：「我去年看菊花，是从这里走过，倒游了一游。」子云引道，过了一座木桥，从竹林走出，是片空地，有几间敞厅，立着鹄棚，旁边还有一条马路，望东北上编些竹篱，高高矮矮，护着几处屋宇。同到了里头，内中摆设俱极雅淡，署名曰菊畦。后面是个大荡，荡边树木茂密，再后头就是围墙了。道翁道：「此处可改做黄香东圃，添副小对","en":"colonnade.\\" Nanxiang said, \\"I came through here last year to see the chrysanthemums, and did have a look round.\\"\\n\\nZiyun led the way over a wooden bridge and out through the bamboo to an open piece of ground with a few wide halls on it and a target-shed standing there, and a riding-track beside it. Away to the north-east were bamboo fences, high and low, sheltering several"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"春秋多佳日，风雨近重阳。\\n子云引了从菊畦东手走出，一带桑林，前面是溪河挡住，便叫家童去撑了两个船来。家童沿着河堤，转过山嘴，不多一刻，见两个小艇撑了过来。众人下了船，一并的慢慢撑去。绕过了一个石矶，见一边是山，一边是树。到了一处，系好了船上岸。只见苍松夹道，古柏成船。从松林里进了","en":"\\"Spring and autumn bring forth flawless days; wind and rain draw the Double Ninth near.\\"\\n\\nZiyun led them out eastward from the Chrysanthemum Beds through a belt of mulberries, until a stream barred the way, and he sent the pages to pole two boats round. The pages went along the embankment and round the spur of the hill, and before long two small"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"过去，从一条石径走下，望南一百余步，倒是梅崦了。密叶繁阴，子多于豆。同进了屋内，众人已走了许多路，也要歇歇了。子云即吩咐摆饭上来，略喝了几杯酒，便吃了饭，喝了茶。道翁问道：「这个园共有几里？我们今日也走了好半天，还不到三分之一。」子云道：「周围原有五里，山占了一分，水占了两分，树木占了一分，空隙处又占了一分。于房屋原只得二十几处，除了门房、马棚、厨房等类，算起来","en":"on it than beans on a bush.\\n\\nThey went in together, for the company had walked a long way and wanted rest, and Ziyun ordered the meal brought. They drank a few cups, ate, and took tea. Daoweng asked, \\"How many li round is this garden? We have been at it half the day and are not through a third of it.\\"\\n\\nZiyun said, \\"Five li round. The hills take up one part of it, the"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"道翁道：「已经好极了，设使我起出稿来，还未必能如此。」子云道：「有几处，静宜也改了好几回才成的。」子玉道：「这梅崦两字，只好刻在山上。在房屋里，这崦字似乎要改才好。」道翁道：「就请教换个名字。」子玉道：「还请道翁先生改罢。」仲清道：「你若想着了好的，就说也不妨。」道翁道：「正是，就我换得不妥，也要请教大家商","en":"\\"It is already excellent. Even had I brought out a draft of my own, it might not have reached this standard.\\" Ziyun explained, \\"There were several places that Jingyi revised again and again before they came right.\\"\\n\\nZiyu said, \\"The two words 'Plum Cove' would do very well carved upon the face of a hill; attached to a house, however, the character for \\"cove\\" seems"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"寒，缟衣纯素；伴我夜阑人静，正值瑶琴一曲，玉笛三终。\\n道翁大赞道：「仙骨珊珊，非吃烟火食所能道，拜服，拜服！」子云与众人也都大赞，又赞琴仙的字比先写的更加精美。","en":"jade flute plays its third refrain.\\"\\n\\nDaoweng cried: \\"Immortal bones—no kitchen smoke could phrase it—I bow!\\" Ziyun praised again; Qinxian's brush surpassed earlier work."},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"次贤的梨院来。道翁道：「可不必进去了，梨院可改为卧云香院，庸庵兄请题一联。」王恂一面想，随着走到了海棠春圃来。子云道：「且请坐坐，喝杯茶，那边又要用船了。」都进了海棠春圃坐下。道翁道：「海棠花为花中艳品，还有那些紫白丁香衬贴他，更觉香色兼备，须好好起他个名字才好。」即笑对琴仙道：「我看你于那些诗词上也还明白，我今日当着人考你一考，你能起这个名字么？」","en":"a couplet, if you please.\\"\\n\\nWang Xun was still thinking as they walked on to the Crabapple Spring Garden, and Ziyun said, \\"Sit a while and take a cup of tea; we shall want the boat again after this.\\" They all went into the Crabapple Spring Garden and sat down.\\n\\nDaoweng said, \\"The crabapple is the beauty among flowers, and with those purple and white lilacs to set"},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴仙听了，红起脸来，答应不出。子云道：「很能，很能。你快想来，如不甚好，也没有人笑你的。」琴仙道：「有倒有一个，只怕不好用。」道翁道：「你且说来。」琴仙道：「春风沉醉轩，不知用得用不得？」子云拍手赞好，子玉等同声说道：「果然真好！这沉醉二字，用得入神入妙。」道翁也点点头，道：「也难为","en":"At this Qinxian's face flushed red, and no answer would come. Ziyun encouraged him: \\"You certainly can—of course you can. Think of something quickly. Even if it is not quite perfect, no one here will laugh at you.\\"\\n\\n\\"I do have one name,\\" Qinxian said at last, \\"but I fear it may not serve.\\"\\n\\n\\"Let us hear it first,\\" said"},{"paragraph":30,"mentions":3,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"大家喝了一会茶，子云命家童去驾船。那边池水宽阔，撑了一个画船来。众人绕过了河堤，下了船，荡出了小港，即是个大宽阔处，令人豁目爽心。不多一刻，到了吟秋水榭，子云请众客进了榭。道翁尚未游过，把这三层水榭游了一转，老年人也乏了，就在中间一层坐了。子云道：「少酌几杯，此处已预备","en":"They drank tea a while, and Ziyun sent the pages for the boat. The pond was broad on that side, and they poled a painted barge over. The company went round by the embankment and got aboard, and drifted out of the narrow inlet into a wide open reach that opened the eye and refreshed the"},{"paragraph":37,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云让众人下船，对次贤道：「先到桂岭，转来再到缥渺亭罢。」次贤道：「自然先到桂岭为是。」就从练秋阁旁，转入一条小港，随着山脚，荡有三箭多远。上坡见是一个药圃，四面围着白石短栏，一个亭子。从亭子进去，有几间屋宇，内中清洁，有些药铛、杵臼等物。一边是豆花篱，","en":"Ziyun had them go ashore, and said to Cixian, \\"Let us go to Osmanthus Ridge first, and come round afterwards to the Pavilion of Faint Mist.\\" Cixian said, \\"By all means Osmanthus Ridge first.\\"\\n\\nFrom beside the Refining Autumn Loft they turned into a small channel"},{"paragraph":38,"mentions":4,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"了一回。出了药圃，是一座土岭，见无数的桂树，过岭来桂树更加多了。内有好向处院落，自成一景，亭台楼阁，备极其胜。子云领众都走到了，进了正屋坐下。子云又让客用了些茶、点心。诸人一面游赏，道翁道：「此处是个大坐落，桂岭二字不足以尽之，改为丛桂山房罢。」子云道：「改得妙。」道翁又道：「你自置一联。」子云笑道：「道翁先生既要考我，也应早些命题。到临时才说，教我如何想得出来","en":"prospect of its own, with pavilions, terraces, upper chambers, and belvederes disposed in every variety of beauty. Ziyun led the company through them all before bringing them into the main hall to sit, where he again pressed tea and delicate refreshments upon his guests.\\n\\nAs they drank, they continued to admire the scene. Daoweng said, \\"This is an extensive establishment;"},{"paragraph":40,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，下面东手就是方才的练秋阁了。道翁道：「怎么又走回来了？」看亭子里有副对子，是他的学生华光宿的，也还用得，便对子云道：「你于此处，何不再集一副成语？」子云道：「我料着道翁还要考我，我已想就了。」即写道：幽岫含云，深溪蓄翠；\\n横藤碍路，弱柳低人。","en":"looked at the couplet hanging there, which was by his pupil Hua Guangsu and would serve well enough, and said to Ziyun, \\"Why not gather another couplet of set phrases for this spot?\\" Ziyun said, \\"I guessed Daoweng would examine me again, and I have one ready.\\" He wrote at once:\\n\\nHidden gorges cradle cloud, deep streams hoard the green;\\nTrailing vines bar the path, frail"},{"paragraph":43,"mentions":1,"tokens":["度香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"湘帘晃漾，绮户文窗，令人应接不暇。道翁道：「这个楼名题得才妙，无须更换。东风昨夜楼是那一位题的？」次贤道：「是度香题的，对子是我做的。」道翁道：「好对子。」朗吟了一遍，也叫琴仙写了出来，琴仙记得是：","en":"said, \\"This tower is finely named; it needs no changing. Who wrote the East-Wind-Last-Night Tower?\\" Cixian said, \\"Duxiang wrote the name, and I made the couplet.\\" Daoweng said, \\"A good couplet.\\" He chanted it through once and had Qinxian write it out; as Qinxian remembered it, it ran:"},{"paragraph":48,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"道翁不胜留恋，想起归田之乐来。谓子云道：「将来尊大人回来，这个平泉庄胜于古人多矣。」便数今天添的对子，已有了二十二副，内有最多者是子玉与他自己，其余也有两副的，惟文泽、王恂只有一副，未免不公，于是烦王恂、文泽各撰一副，又改稻庄为红雪西庄。先是文泽念了出来，是：","en":"Daoweng could hardly bear to leave it, and fell to thinking of the pleasures of retirement. He said to Ziyun, \\"When your honoured father comes home, this Pingquan manor of yours will far outdo the ancients'.\\"\\n\\nHe then counted the couplets added that day, and there were twenty-two of them, of which Ziyu and he himself had the most, and the others two apiece;"},{"paragraph":52,"mentions":3,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云请众位还到宝香堂，已是夕阳西下，朱霞半天，映着那些牡丹花，更为绚烂。已撤了护花的幛子。子云备了两席，一席是道翁、南湘、子玉、琴仙、次贤，一席是仲清、春航、文泽、王恂、子云。","en":"Ziyun invited all back to the Hall of Treasured Fragrance. The sun sank west; red sky half the vault set peonies blazing—protective screens gone. Two tables waited—one for Daoweng, Nanxiang, Ziyu, Qinxian, Cixian; one for Zhongqing, Chunhang, Wenze, Wang Xun,"},{"paragraph":53,"mentions":4,"tokens":["子云","度香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"正饮酒间，王兰保、金漱芳、秦琪官、林春喜同来见了，即分开坐了，谈了些闲话。子云道：「今日这二十四副对子，清芬浓艳，各尽所长。但我看来，始终要推道翁先生的赐书楼、承荫堂冠冕堂皇了。」众名士道：「自然，我们到底觉得力薄，那里能这样大方，这是勉强不来的。」道翁道：「这也不然，一来相体裁衣，二来是各人的性灵。今日高超的是剑潭，沉着的是","en":"Qiguan and Lin Chunxi all came in and paid their respects, and sat down apart, and there was some idle talk.\\n\\nZiyun said, \\"These twenty-four couplets today are fresh or rich by turns, and every man has done his best. But to my mind Master Qu's, for the Tower of Imperial Bestowals and the Hall of Inherited Shade, must have the crown for stateliness.\\" The scholars said,"}],"47":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，俱极欣喜，后又看了那篇序文，真是五体投地，不能不服。就是南湘、春航，是最不轻易服人的，此时也是真心拜倒。明日子云又请金吉甫到园，将那些联额看了，吉甫亦甚佩服。请道翁用真行字，写了十六扇屏风，吉甫荐的季十矮子在园中刻起来。","en":"admiration. Even Nanxiang and Chunhang, usually slow to bow to anyone, yielded in genuine respect. The next day Ziyun invited Jin Jifu to the garden to view the paired couplets and plaques; Jifu, too, voiced high praise. Daoweng was invited to brush the characters in flowing cursive for a sixteen-panel screen, and Ji the Tenth Dwarf, whom Jifu recommended, set to carving"},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":7,"tokens":["子云","度香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"选的，即与春航、南湘商量，何不合租一所房子。他二人甚愿意，就托蕙芳留心，蕙芳又托人问了几处，皆不合意。一日来到子云处，说及此事，子云道：「何不到我园中来，也热闹些。且道翁已选了南昌府通判，不日就要赴任，玉侬是要同去的了，你们搬进来，不好么？」蕙芳道：「我是不搬进来。」子云道：「你也搬进来。」蕙芳道：「我要搬进来，还要等一两个月，此时还不能呢。」子云道：「桂岭那边","en":"suitable place. Huifang asked acquaintances about several places, but none quite pleased them. One day he visited Ziyun and raised the matter. Ziyun said: \\"Why not move into my garden? It would be livelier. Besides, Daoweng has just been appointed as an Assistant Prefect in Nanchang and will soon depart; Yunong must naturally accompany him. Would it not be splendid for"}],"48":[{"paragraph":11,"mentions":1,"tokens":["徐子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"怡园，在清凉诗境住了。他的脾气又与春航两样，把那些同年同馆朋友不放在眼里，也不出去应酬，天天与屈道翁、萧次贤、徐子云一班人，诗酒陶情。","en":"friends and avoided social engagements. Day after day, he indulged in wine and poetry with Qu Daoweng, Xiao Cixian, Xu Ziyun, and their refined circle."},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"今日已是五月初四，道翁定于初七日起身，众名士饯行已过。今日道翁一早进城，为华公子请去了。南湘来找次贤、子云，都不在园里，即到春风沉醉轩来，只见琴仙手托香腮，在那里颦眉泪眼，见南湘进来，连忙起身。南湘笑道：「我道你此番自然长了学问，谁知还是那样见识。人生离合悲欢，是一定之理，各人免不来的，何必作那儿女嗫嚅、楚囚相对的光景？快不要这样。你看半阴半晴，时凉时燠","en":"that morning, Daoweng went into the city at Young Master Hua's invitation. Nanxiang came searching for Cixian and Ziyun, but finding neither in the garden, he proceeded to the Pavilion of Spring Breeze Drunk. There he found Qinxian with his chin resting in his hand, his brows knitted and his eyes wet with tears. Nanxiang laughed and said that he had expected Qinxian to"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":2,"tokens":["度香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"」金粟道：「这个恐不能，各人是各人的情意，未必联得上来。」琴仙道：「前日静宜画了一柄扇子，是个《怡园饯别图》，度香于那一面填了一首《金缕曲》，还空了一半。」说罢，便从袖子里拿了出来，给与金粟等看了，见画的是古香林屋，内中画几个人在那里饯行的光景，度香的词也做得甚好。子玉道：「我们就和他的韵罢。」南湘道：「你先来。」子玉一面闲谈，一面着想，即成了一阕，写了出来，南","en":"not join.\\"\\n\\nQinxian said, \\"The other day Jingyi painted a fan — a *Farewell at the Garden of Contentment* — and Duxiang filled in a *Jinlü Qu* on the other side, and left half of it empty.\\" He drew it from his sleeve and gave it to Jin Su and the others to look at: the Ancient-Fragrance Woodland Lodge, with a few figures in it seeing someone off, and Duxiang's lyric very"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"的呢？」金粟道：「这是绝唱，还和什么？可不必了。」子玉写好。这一会凄楚，连南湘、金粟也没有兴致，即上了岸。正逢子云、次贤回来，大家在寻源仙墅坐了一会，道翁也回来了。","en":"So much misery had left even Nanxiang and Jin Su without any heart for the day, and they went ashore. They met Ziyun and Cixian just coming back, and all sat a while at the Seeking-the-Source Immortal Villa, and presently Daoweng returned as well."},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云还要留金粟、子玉小饮，子玉坐在此倒觉心酸，便同金粟各自回去。","en":"Ziyun attempted to keep Jin Su and Ziyu for a small drink, but sitting there only deepened Ziyu's heartache, so he and Jin Su quietly departed for their respective homes."},{"paragraph":34,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"明日端午，道翁在园，琴仙也要收拾些零碎。那名旦九人，是要到子云处来贺节的，见了一见。子云也无心绪，没有请客，就止与南湘、次贤、屈氏父子，在练秋阁小饮了几杯，看了一看龙舟，应了景儿。","en":"garden while Qinxian occupied himself with packing his small belongings. The nine renowned performers arrived at Ziyun's residence to offer their festival greetings and paid a brief, polite call. Lacking any mood for festive entertainment, Ziyun hosted no grand banquets; he merely shared a few quiet cups of wine with Nanxiang, Cixian, and the Qu father and son at Refining"},{"paragraph":36,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云也送了六百，文泽送了二百，道翁的盘费很富足了。子云、次贤各备车马跟着，一直送出城外，直到十里之外皇华亭。只见南湘、仲清、文泽、金粟、王恂、子玉、春航，领着那蕙芳、宝珠、素兰、漱芳、玉林、兰保、桂保、琪官、春喜九个名旦，在皇华亭等候。道翁等连忙下车，极","en":"Ziyun also gifted six hundred pieces of silver, and Wenze gave two hundred, ensuring Daoweng's travel funds were exceedingly abundant. Ziyun and Cixian each prepared their own carriages and followed closely behind, escorting them ten li beyond the city wall"},{"paragraph":38,"mentions":3,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，跌倒在地。慌得众人连忙扶起，拍的拍，唤的唤。把个子玉急得如痰迷心窍一般，直瞪瞪两眼，一句话说不出，泪落如雨。子云、次贤慌了，救醒了琴仙，便说道：「快扶他上车罢。」道翁交代家人刘喜好好服侍。子云谓道翁道：「令郎与他们几年在一处，一刻要分手，自然是难忍的。道翁先生，我们倒不敢久留了，一路福星，请升舆罢。」道翁见琴仙如此，心内甚慌，与诸人作了一个揖，又握着子云、次贤","en":"as if thick phlegm had sealed his heart, entirely unable to speak while tears poured down his face like rain.\\n\\nZiyun and Cixian were equally alarmed. When Qinxian had been brought round, they said, \\"Get him into the carriage, quickly.\\" Daoweng charged his servant Liu Xi to wait on him carefully.\\n\\nZiyun said to Daoweng, \\"Your son has been among them these several years,"}],"49":[{"paragraph":5,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"留心一访。但系座师愿与他联姻，且是房师来讲，怎好推辞？口内只得允了。又说禀过家慈，再来复命。杨公去后，春航知道子云与苏侯最好，且慢禀高堂，先找子云访问。到了怡园门口，见有一辆绿围车，八匹马挤在一边，知道有客，跟班问明了，是华公子在园。春航便先到清凉诗境找南湘去了。","en":"must first report to his mother before giving a final answer. After Lord Yang departed, Chunhang, knowing that Ziyun was closest to Su the Marquis, decided to delay speaking to his mother and first sought out Ziyun to investigate. Arriving at the gates of the Garden of Contentment, he saw a green-canopied carriage and eight horses crowded to one side, realizing there"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":3,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"却说华公子为琴言之事，与子云有了嫌隙，如何又到怡园来呢？这华公子是一时气性，写了那封恶札。过了两日，使有些自悔了。谁知子云只当没有事的一般，又不来招陪他，心内殊觉无趣。后与屈道翁送行，道翁倒把子云的好处说了一番。","en":"But why had Young Master Hua returned to the Garden of Contentment after his rift with Ziyun over Qinyan? Young Master Hua had written that harsh, severing letter in a fit of sudden temper. After two days had passed, he began to regret it. Yet Ziyun carried on as if nothing had happened, making no move to invite him over or entertain him, leaving"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":6,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"有甚么不好，倒冤了他，便也赞了几句。道翁去后，次贤又来，才将这事澈底澄清的讲了一番，华公子始悔自己孟浪，又念与子云两代世交，为这点事绝交，是给人要议论的。又因他是个盟兄，只得尽个弟道，下口气先去招陪他。先是道翁、次贤已将华公子懊悔之意与子云讲过。子云是大度包容的，既是他先来，岂尚有芥蒂之意？便与从前一样相待，绝不题起那事。华公子忍不住，只得说误信浮言，认了不是。","en":"pride and went first to seek reconciliation. Daoweng and Cixian had already conveyed Young Master Hua's remorse to Ziyun. Ziyun, ever magnanimous and accommodating, harbored no lingering grudges since Young Master Hua had made the first move. He treated him exactly as before, never mentioning the incident. Unable to hold back, Young Master Hua admitted he had mistakenly"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":11,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"此时子云在宝香堂，见了春航进来，连忙迎接，彼此谈了些话。春航问他与苏侯是师生，可知他家的细底。子云道：「你问他做甚？」春航将杨方猷的话对子云讲了，子云连忙称贺道：「恭喜，恭喜！这个喜，比你中状元还要大些。」春航笑道：「不过显官罢了，知道成与不成，吾兄倒先贺起","en":"Ziyun was in the Hall of Treasured Fragrance. Seeing Chunhang enter, he hurried to welcome him, and they exchanged pleasantries. Chunhang asked whether Ziyun, being a student of Su the Marquis, knew the intimate details of his household. \\"Why do you ask?\\""},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":5,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云过了两日，回拜华公子，进城顺路到了苏府。正值苏侯下衙门回来，请了进去。子云请了安，又进去见了师母，说他夫人与师母请安，苏夫人也问了好。苏侯让进内书房坐下，谈了一会，子云将春航春间断弦，闻二世妹贤淑之名，奉母命求亲的话说了。苏侯故作沉吟道：「看田修撰文","en":"Two days later, Ziyun returned Young Master Hua's visit, and on his way back through the city, he stopped at the Su residence. Su the Marquis had just returned from his office and invited him in. Ziyun paid his respects and then went inside to greet the Madam, conveying his"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":10,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"苏侯大乐，留子云小饮，问近日见华星北无有。子云答以方才从那里来。苏侯又问：「园中想必收拾得更好了，我竟一二年没有来逛园子。」子云道：「比初成时又更好了些，花木比从前繁盛了，池子也开通了。」苏侯道：「我这几年也实在忙，竟没有一日空闲，倒是你们师母心上想来逛逛，如今天气","en":"Greatly pleased, Su the Marquis kept Ziyun for a small drink. He asked if Ziyun had seen Young Master Hua recently, and Ziyun replied that he had just come from there. Su the Marquis then asked, \\"Your garden must be even more beautifully arranged now; I haven't been there for a stroll in a year"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":4,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云道：「就五十外得子，也不算很迟。德门世冑，无须虑及此的。」苏侯道：「我已不作此想了。尊大人今年是六十几了？」子云道：「家严六十三，家慈六十二。」苏候道：「尊翁是何等福分！那年在京时是五十九了，须发光黑，那里像花甲之人，正是龙马精神，我们是比不上的。而","en":"Ziyun consoled him, \\"To have a son past fifty is not considered very late. A family of such accumulated virtue and noble lineage has no need to worry about this.\\" Su the Marquis sighed, \\"I no longer entertain such thoughts. Is your father in his sixties this"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":5,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"年秋间有宏词之试，这个科名已有五十年没有考了。年兄广交，于那些海内人才及世家子弟，有所见闻，有真才实学的么？」子云道：「老师垂问，门生不敢不对。海内人才甚广，门生孤陋，也不能广交。但在世家及各大员子弟，与四方乡会试诸名宿，门生熟识往来却也不少，但是人云亦云的多。就有一位老前辈，近来又赴任去了，叫屈本立。想现任官，在京也不能考的。」苏侯道：「屈道生么？他是孝廉方正","en":"talents of the realm and the sons of noble families, have you seen or heard of any with true, substantial learning?\\" Ziyun replied carefully, \\"Since Teacher asks, I dare not fail to answer. The talents of the realm are vast, and I am isolated and ignorant, unable to know everyone. But among the noble families, sons of high officials, and the famous scholars from the provincial"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":17,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"明日，春航果然来找子云，子云只推宅里有事，叫春航在南湘、次贤处等了一日。明日又来，子云又不见他。春航明知子云故意作难，然心上又恐怕此事不谐，只得忍耐了性气，第三日又来，才见了子云。子云笑道：「这几日，吾弟有甚么要紧事，连日来找我？」春航笑道：「已经三顾了。我知道前日失言，","en":"The next day, Chunhang indeed came looking for Ziyun, but Ziyun merely claimed there was business in the inner household and left Chunhang waiting in Nanxiang and Cixian's quarters all day. The following day, Chunhang came again, and again Ziyun avoided him. Chunhang knew perfectly well that Ziyun was"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"只见次贤、南湘进来，大家坐了。子云即将苏侯问南湘的话，与南湘说了。南湘听了，不觉双眉一扬，说道：「没有什么错处，我也照着人一样。况且那一天同着人去的，并不是我一人，怎么就是我错，又单是我狂呢？这就难了，这就难了。」","en":"Just then, Cixian and Nanxiang entered, and everyone took a seat. Ziyun immediately relayed Su the Marquis's remarks about Nanxiang's etiquette. Hearing this, Nanxiang's eyebrows shot up in indignation. \\"What did I do wrong? I follow the same etiquette as everyone else. Besides, that day I went with a group; I was not alone."},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":3,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"神色之间，有些错处也未可知。」南湘瞅着春航道：「我倒请教你，什么叫神色之间有些错呢？」大家也就不言语了。次贤问子云道：「湘帆的事如何？」子云道：「可成。」又将苏侯问他访些真才实学的人，就将对苏侯所举那几个，一一讲来。又对南湘道：「原来你们都是年谊。」南湘道：「原是年伯，但从前却不大往来。」子云道：「闻考宏词定于八月初一日，如今只有两月多了，怎么高卓然还不见来？」","en":"does \\"something amiss in expression or demeanor\\" mean?\\" The room fell silent. Cixian broke the quiet by asking Ziyun, \\"How did Xiangfan's matter go?\\" Ziyun replied, \\"It can be done.\\" He then recounted how Su the Marquis had asked him to seek out men of true talent and learning, detailing the names he had proposed. Turning to Nanxiang, he added, \\"It turns out you all"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"四人谈了一会，春航辞回，将子云去说亲的话，一一告禀，太夫人甚为欢喜。即又请子云说定了，择日先过帖子，俟定日之后，再行纳采。","en":"The four chatted a while longer before Chunhang took his leave and returned home. He reported everything Ziyun had said about the marriage proposal to his mother, and Madam Tian was delighted. She immediately asked Ziyun to finalize the agreement and choose an auspicious day to exchange the preliminary betrothal cards, to be followed by the formal presentation"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"后来定于七月初七日。春航将此事与蕙芳说明，蕙芳也替他欢喜。春航又述子云之言，说这位苏小姐像你竟到九分。蕙芳笑道：「这不是糟蹋人么？一个千金小姐像了我，还说好，我们算什么人呢？」春航道：「只怕未必如你。若果然像你，我就心满意足了，当他菩萨供养，天天拜他。」蕙芳笑道：「你嘴里常说，我就没见你拜过谁。」春航笑道：「你要我拜么","en":"the seventh month. Chunhang explained the matter to Huifang, who also rejoiced for him. Chunhang then recounted Ziyun's words, saying, \\"He says this Miss Su resembles you nine parts out of ten.\\" Huifang laughed, \\"Isn't that just insulting her? For a young lady of a noble house to look like me, and for that to be called good—what sort of people are we supposed to be?\\""},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":2,"tokens":["度香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"貌性德倒是见惯的，也没有那小模小样。就是一件，只怕主人已先受用，这倒十有八九。」春航笑道：「这是必有之事。我想度香家的丫鬟就不少。」蕙芳道：「度香自然是有好的，他家的闺范也好，从没有遇见丫鬟们到园里来，况且隔着一条街，也不便来。只闻得华公子的丫鬟最多，而且都好。我们有一回在他家唱戏，看见帘子内有一大群，有男装的，有女装的，粉白黛绿，也望不清楚。」春航道：「将来苏","en":"pleasure with her—that's true nine times out of ten.\\" Chunhang laughed, \\"That is an inevitable fact. I imagine Duxiang's household has quite a few maids.\\" Huifang said, \\"Duxiang naturally has good ones, and the inner household discipline is excellent; I've never encountered the maids coming out into the garden. Besides, we're separated by a street, so it wouldn't be"}],"50":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["徐子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"且说刘文泽补了吏部主事，与徐子云同在勋司，未免也要常常上衙门。这些公子官儿，那里认真当差，不过讲究些车马衣服，借着上衙门的日子，可以出来散散。戏馆歌楼，三朋四友，甚是有兴。一日，文泽回来，路过林春喜门口，着人问了春喜在家，文泽下了车进去。远远望见春喜穿着白纻丝衫子，面前放着一个玻璃","en":"Wenze, having secured a post as a secretary in the Ministry of Personnel, now served in the same honors bureau as Xu Ziyun and was obliged to make frequent appearances at the yamen. Yet these young gentlemen-officials hardly took their duties seriously; their true devotion lay in fine carriages, spirited horses, and elegant attire. They used their office days merely as an"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":1,"tokens":["度香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"自然离别之间，倒应如此的。就是庾香遮饰不来，直着眼睛，拉他上车，还挣着不动，又有那一哭，到底为着什么事来？幸亏度香催道翁走了，不然，他见了也要猜疑。」文泽道：「可不是？庾香与湘帆比起来，正是苦乐不同。湘帆非但与媚香朝夕相亲，如今又对了阔亲，偏偏又是个姓苏的，而且才貌双全。你道湘帆的运气好不好？我看咱们这一班朋友，就是他一个得意。」仲清道：「自然。」王恂道：「竹君","en":"pulled toward the carriage, refusing to move, and then that sudden wail... what was that all about? Fortunately, Duxiang hurried Daoweng away; otherwise, seeing that, Daoweng would surely have grown suspicious.\\" Wenze nodded. \\"Is it not so? When you compare Yuxiang with Xiangfan, the contrast in their suffering and joy is stark. Not only does Xiangfan enjoy the constant,"}],"52":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"器皿之类，送奁那一日，用了二千名人夫，苏夫人犹以为薄，不及大姑娘十分之七，于铺箱时铺了两万两白银、三千两黄金。子云是媒人，见春航房屋窄小，铺张不下，把自己住宅东边一所空房借与他，有个八九十间，还有个小花园在内。这回春航娶亲，贺客纷纷，很为热闹，请酒演戏，内外铺设，也成了个锦天花地。一个蕙芳如何料理得开？子云去请了张仲雨来帮忙，管了账房并指点铺设一切。","en":"thus, as the final cases were packed, she added twenty thousand taels of silver and three thousand taels of gold. Ziyun, acting as matchmaker, saw that Chunhang's own residence was far too cramped to accommodate such a display, so he lent him a vacant property east of his own mansion—a compound of eighty or ninety rooms complete with a small garden. Thus, for this wedding,"},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":1,"tokens":["徐子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"前辈兼有年谊。张桐孙陪了这几位在聚星堂观戏，演得是联珠班。春航陪着一班名士在花园挹爽斋观演联锦班。那一天大媒是徐子云，客是萧次贤、高品、南湘、颜仲清、刘文泽、王恂、梅子玉。近日子玉病已好了，勉强打起精神出来。这八个名旦不消说都在园中，那聚星堂上一个也不去，尽是一班中年的脚色，与那些寻常的旦脚，在那里应酬。","en":"young literati in the garden's Yishuang Study to watch the Lianjin Troupe. The principal matchmaker that day was Xu Ziyun, and the guests included Xiao Cixian, Gao Pin, Nanxiang, Yan Zhongqing, Liu Wenze, Wang Xun, and Mei Ziyu. Ziyu had only recently recovered from his illness, forcing himself to rally his spirits to attend. Naturally, all eight famous dan actors remained"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":3,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一面欢笑，好不高兴。子玉见那些名旦之中，就只少了琴言，触景伤情，颇有一人向隅之惨，众人也都会意。忽不见了高品，子云命书童去找他，找到戏房后头，找着了。见高品在那里教王兰保的戏，兰保点头而笑。高品出来，装出正经样子，连笑话也都不说一句。少顷，王兰保来请点戏，送到子云面前，子云点了一出《乔醋》，高品点了一出《当巾》。《乔醋》唱了，《当巾》却是兰保扮了小生，倒作得人情","en":"person alone in a corner.' The others silently understood his melancholy. At one point, Gao Pin suddenly vanished. Ziyun sent a pageboy to search for him, eventually discovering him behind the stage, cheerfully coaching Wang Lanbao on his performance while Lanbao nodded with a smile. When Gao Pin returned, he put on a deeply solemn face, not uttering a single joke. Shortly"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云道：「他是沾的露，你又怎么说他沾的泥呢？」众人皆笑。作到来兴进去，轿夫出来赶打，兰保跌了一交，便改了口白，说道：「罢了！罢了！被他一路赶来，跌了一身泥垢。且喜七叔赠我这件衣衫，我且去当了，也可听得两天。阿哟！兀的不想杀小生也。」众人听了，个个骇异道：","en":"Ziyun interjected, \\"He said he was stained by dew; why do you insist he was stained by mud?\\" Everyone burst into laughter. When the scene reached the point where Laixing went inside and the sedan-carriers chased and beat him, Lanbao staged a dramatic tumble"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"伺，跟随他绣幰香车。忍羞惭要乞青眸顾，应怜辱在泥涂，回肠如路，双轮一碾一嗟吁，怎笑倚。\\n兰保唱到此，也要笑了，子云等连声喝采，诸人乱叫起「好」来。春航满面通红，指着高品骂道：「我只道你别过了一年，自然也改恶从善，谁道还是这副歪心肝。」高品道：「这才骂得奇，我又讲了什么？这不是自己栽了筋斗埋怨地皮么？」","en":"smile and lean on them?\\"\\nAs he reached the end of the line, Lanbao himself nearly broke character and laughed. Ziyun and the others shouted their applause, cheering wildly. Chunhang blushed a deep scarlet, pointing at Gao Pin as he cursed, \\"I thought that after a year away, you would naturally have reformed your wicked ways, but who could have guessed you still have"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"春航尚要骂他，只见家人进来禀道：「苏府妆奁已到。」一片吹打之声。春航请了子云、次贤一同迎接上去。送奁的是苏府几位本家亲戚，内中有华公子，绣衣金带，玉貌如仙。春航尚是初见，已久仰这位连衿的大名，接进了聚星堂，齐齐见礼。","en":"announce, \\"The Su household's trousseau has arrived!\\" Outside, a cacophony of festive music flared. Chunhang invited Ziyun and Cixian to join him in welcoming the procession. Among the Su relatives escorting the dowry was Young Master Hua—dressed in embroidered robes and a golden belt, his features as radiant as an immortal. Though meeting this famed new brother-in-law for"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":1,"tokens":["徐子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"尚书、王文辉是父执，便请了安，其余都行平礼。春航与华公子系是新亲，无甚话说，不过彼此道些仰慕之意。幸有王文辉、徐子云帮着张罗，应酬了那几位新亲，颇不寂寞。","en":"one another, they could only exchange polite, formal words of mutual admiration. Fortunately, Wang Wenhui and Xu Ziyun helped enliven the atmosphere, graciously attending to the new relatives so the mood did not fall flat."},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":3,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"王文辉要推华公子首坐，华公子不肯。子云意欲邀他进园，与诸名士会会，华公子也不愿在外，便同了子云进园，文泽等齐齐站起，华公子上前见礼。除文泽之外，都不认识，内中见一个最年轻的，觉得如月光珠彩，凤举霞轩，骨重神清，风华雅丽，心里一惊，觉眼中从未见过这样人。子玉见华公子的品貌，也暗暗称赞：「清","en":"Wang Wenhui attempted to yield the seat of honor to Young Master Hua, but Young Master Hua steadfastly refused. Ziyun proposed bringing him into the garden to meet the gathered scholars; preferring not to remain in the outer hall, Young Master Hua gladly accompanied him. Wenze and the others rose in unison. Aside from Wenze, Young Master Hua knew none of them. Yet among"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子云","徐子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"个福分。」春航谢妆已回，也请仲雨入席，仲雨道：「外面一个媚香，如何照应得来？不可叫他怨我。」便拱拱手走开，指着子云道：「总是你好作成。」笑出去了。王文辉跷起了朝靴，手捋长髯，与华公子、徐子云讲了一番话，也就踱了出去。","en":"how can I possibly manage it all? I dare not let him resent me.\\" Cupping his hands, he stepped away, pointing at Ziyun with a laugh, \\"It is always you who loves to play the matchmaker!\\" and walked out smiling. Wang Wenhui, tipping his official boots and stroking his long beard, chatted a while with Young Master Hua and Xu Ziyun before leisurely strolling out as well."},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"叫他们歇歇。」八旦上来，华公子不见蕙芳，便问春航道：「怎么不见那位状元夫人，还在账房里么？」春航不好意思回答。子云听了，笑道：「如今闹出两位状元夫人，倒与《燕子笺》上的《诰圆》一样了。」华公子一想，自觉失言，便不再问。见素兰美丽风流，亭亭可爱，即叫他上前，说道：「你去年写在那《良宵风月图》上的诗，我已裱成了手卷，并请人题了好些，实在画也画得好，字也写得好，人人称","en":"Zhuangyuan'—is he still trapped in the accounting room?\\" Chunhang was too embarrassed to answer. Hearing this, Ziyun laughed, \\"Now we have a confusion of two 'Madam Zhuangyuans,' just as in *Gaoyuan*, the finale of *The Swallow Letter*!\\" Realizing he had misspoken, Young Master Hua dropped the subject. Noticing Sulan's graceful and captivating beauty, he called him"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"即对子云道：「此君风韵不减袁、苏，貌类琴言，而聪明过之。」赞得素兰好不喜欢。华公子又问子玉道：「弟与尊兄虽初次识面，但心契已久。有个魏聘才，是府上搬出来，在弟处住了半年，常常提及阁下，并有一事倒要请教。」子玉不知问他何事，即答道：「魏世兄也时常提及尊府，但未","en":"Turning to Ziyun, Young Master Hua continued, \\"This gentleman's charm rivals that of Yuan and Su, and while his appearance resembles Qinyan's, his intelligence surpasses his.\\" Sulan was utterly delighted by the praise. Young Master Hua then addressed Ziyu, \\"Though you"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子云","度香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"春航道：「这楷书是闺阁笔迹。」众人看这两首词，情文互至，秀韵天然，赞叹不已。子玉道：「这第二首也像闺阁口气。」子云道：「不要是他夫人题的么？这两首像是唱和的。」仲清道：「未必，如果是他夫人写的，怎肯给人？」次贤道：「这话说得是。」诸名士在园内谈心，却说那聚星堂上，王文辉见诸名旦一个不来，颇觉岑寂，又不好意思去叫他们。想蕙芳在账房里，便叫了他出来。蕙芳也累苦了，乐","en":"elegant rhythm, sighing in endless admiration. Ziyu noted, \\"This second piece truly sounds like a woman's voice.\\" Ziyun suggested, \\"Could his wife have written them? These two seem to be a harmonized exchange.\\" Zhongqing doubted this, \\"Not necessarily. If his wife had written it, how could he so casually give it away?\\" Cixian agreed, \\"That is a fair point.\\" While the"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"那苏府繁荣不能细述。明日辰刻，春航先行了亲迎之礼，随后子云并一班迎亲的押了花轿到苏府来，一切交代排场已毕，花轿回来，一路笙歌鼎沸，仪从纷纭，满街车填马塞，好不热闹。进了门，请出新人，拜了花烛，珠围翠绕，玉暖花香，说不尽富贵风流，温柔旖旎。外面那些宾客及诸名士，又足足闹了一日。到晚间春航进房，见了新人，果然应","en":"description. The following morning at the hour of the dragon, Chunhang performed the formal rite of fetching the bride. Ziyun and the groom's escort accompanied the bridal sedan to the Su mansion. After all the ceremonial exchanges and displays were completed, the sedan returned, heralded by a deafening crescendo of festive music and a dense throng of attendants. The streets"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":1,"tokens":["徐子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"明日，苏夫人请了他大姑奶奶浣香与徐子云夫人袁绮香去陪新，吃扶头卯酒。田太夫人请了王文辉的陆氏夫人，带了他大姑奶奶蓉华并媳妇孙少奶奶佩秋，又请刘守正的夫人，没有来，他媳妇吴少奶奶紫烟来了。周锡爵、杨方猷、陆宗沅的夫人都辞了。","en":"The next day, Lady Su invited her elder daughter Huanxiang and Xu Ziyun's wife, Yuan Qixiang, to accompany the bride and partake in the morning wine. Old Madam Tian invited Wang Wenhui's wife, Madam Lu, who brought along her elder daughter Ronghua and her daughter-in-law, Madam Sun Peiqiu. She also invited the wife of Liu"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":2,"tokens":["度香","徐度香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一个人送琴言的，可不是夫妇不像夫妇，朋友不像朋友，妓又不像妓么？然而写这片情，真写得消魂动魄。」华夫人道：「是度香作的么？」华公子道：「不是，是梅庾香，就是琴言向日的知己。」华夫人问道：「前日我写的扇子呢？你不要给人瞧。」华公子听了这句话，方想起给了素兰，就是这扇，心中甚悔一时没有留心，只得说道：「我不与人瞧，我恐扇旧了，已收起了。」华夫人也不疑心他给了人。将要","en":"courtesan yet not courtesan? Yet the way it captures that emotion is truly soul-shaking.\\" Lady Hua asked, \\"Did Duxiang write it?\\" Young Master Hua replied, \\"No, it was Mei Yuxiang, Qinyan's former confidant.\\" Lady Hua then asked, \\"Where is the fan I wrote for you the other day? You must not show it to anyone.\\" Hearing this, Young Master Hua suddenly remembered he had"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":2,"tokens":["徐子云","子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"来。看他们二人，倒像在那里见过的一般，想不出来，惟觉眼中很熟，想去想来，原来有些像苏蕙芳，怪不得像见过的了。看徐子云的夫人袁绮香是冰肌玉骨，雍容大雅，真是林下风流，与子云恰是一对佳偶。刘少奶奶娟秀可爱，颜少奶奶秀丽超群，甚是洒落，王少奶奶静婉和妍，与刘少奶奶彷佛。","en":"a moment, she realized they bore a resemblance to Su Huifang—no wonder they seemed familiar! She then observed Xu Ziyun's wife, Yuan Qixiang, noting her icy-fair skin, jade-like bones, and profoundly elegant demeanor; she possessed a truly transcendent charm, making her a perfect match for Ziyun. Liu's daughter-in-law was graceful and endearing; Yan's daughter-in-law"}],"53":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":2,"tokens":["度香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，开张起来，空空的什么样子？若尽靠些花木，不成个花局子了么？」宝珠道：「要凑东西其实也不难。若说书画，前日我见度香园中晒晾，也数不清有多少。一种书有十几部的，他要这许多作什么？法帖重的很多，若画那似假似真的也有几十箱，横竖将来总饱蠹鱼的了，分些来他岂有不肯的？至于古玩，好的自然不好去要他。他那不爱的东西，要几件来，也就搁不下了，就怕什么香料、针黹、顾绣的东西倒少","en":"Baozhu replied, \\"In truth, gathering stock isn't so difficult. As for books and paintings, the other day I saw Duxiang airing his collection in the garden, and there were countless volumes. He has dozens of copies of the same book—what does he need so many for? He has many duplicate calligraphy rubbings, and as for paintings, whether genuine or reproduction, he must"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":7,"tokens":["度香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"就是那样。所谓孤忠苦节，不避艰险，不顾利害，其实也是他的好处。」公子点头道：「你说得是，我毕竟不是他的知己。但度香又怎样的待他，算知己不算呢？」 　　素兰道：「若说度香待他，真也是个知己。度香第一能包容，第二能体贴。琴言之待度香，或冷一会，或热一会，笑一会，哭一会，顶撞一会。度香非但全不芥蒂，倒反过意不去，百般的安慰他。所以他视度香也算一个知已。」华公子道：「这","en":"greatest virtue.\\"\\n\\nYoung Master Hua nodded, \\"You are right, I was never truly his confidant after all. But how does Duxiang treat him—does he count as a confidant?\\"\\n\\nSulan said, \\"If we speak of Duxiang's treatment, he truly is a confidant. Duxiang's greatest strengths are his boundless tolerance and his profound empathy. Qinyan's attitude toward Duxiang runs cold one moment"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":1,"tokens":["度香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"点了两枝蜡，开了箱子，一件一件的看了，对素兰道：「这些东西若全买起来，也要好几千银子，而且未必有这好材料。再到度香处添几样，就可添可不添了。我明日就把橱柜制办起来，叫花儿匠来收拾花草。八月中秋竟可以开了。」素兰道：「题个什么名字呢？」蕙芳道：「我想题为九香楼可好么？」素兰道：「好个九香楼，妙极，妙极！」又请了宝珠、漱芳、玉林、兰保等来，大家看了，都极喜欢，同赞素","en":"several thousand taels of silver, and we still might not find materials this good. Once we add a few things from Duxiang's place, whether we procure more or not won't even matter. Tomorrow I will order the display cabinets and counters, and call the gardeners to arrange the flowers and plants. We can absolutely open by mid-autumn in the eighth month.\\"\\n\\nSulan asked, \\"What"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":3,"tokens":["子云","徐度香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"明日，宝珠等到子云处，将华公子赏给素兰的东西，一一说了，并要子云回去，也把账单看了，点出：花玻璃灯二十对，大小玻璃杂器四十件，料珠灯八盏，各色洋呢十板，各色纱衣料一百匹、各色贡缎二十匹、各色湖绉一百匹、各色绸绫一百匹，座钟四架、挂钟四架，洋表二十个，真古铜器一件，赝古","en":"The next day, Baozhu and the others went to Ziyun's place and recounted one by one the items Young Master Hua had bestowed upon Sulan. They then asked Ziyun to go back, look through his own ledgers, and pick out items to contribute.\\n\\nZiyun selected a long list: twenty pairs of floral glass lamps, forty"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"蕙芳本想不受，但恐春航心上过不去，又见宝珠、素兰得了多少东西，自己又有好胜之心，只得收了，托子云着人到苏杭添置一切。子云封了金子，开了一个清单，写了一封书，着人到他乃兄署中，叫管总的徐福亲自制办。","en":"Baozhu and Sulan had acquired, which stirred his own competitive spirit—he felt compelled to accept. He asked Ziyun to send someone to Suzhou and Hangzhou to handle the remaining procurements. Ziyun sealed the gold, drafted a detailed manifest, wrote a letter, and sent a man to his elder brother's yamen, instructing the head steward, Xu Fu, to personally manage the"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":4,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一日，子云正与静宜、南湘、高品闲话，只见书童拿了一包书信进来。子云一看封面，是屈道翁在南京途中寄来的，心中一喜。拆了总封，里头有十几封信与各相好，却都是琴言笔迹，说自己跌坏了膀子不能写，无非是些道谢等语，内有怀怡园诸同人五古一篇，并沿途七律八首。又见琴言另有一","en":"One day, Ziyun was chatting idly with Jingyi, Nanxiang, and Gao Pin when a pageboy brought in a bundle of letters. Ziyun looked at the cover and saw it was sent by Qu Daoweng en route from Nanjing. His heart leapt with joy.\\n\\nHe broke the main seal and found over ten"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"应胜死。勉强加餐期日后，要使形骸尚似。居两地、从今伊始。自古多情成积恨，恨东流、不接西流水。肠断矣！写此纸。\\n子云等看了大奇，道：「不料玉侬竟能与庾香那首工力悉敌，一样沉痛。」高品道：「玉侬学问几时长的？我去年没有见他能如此。」次贤道：「这是新进长的，不料受乃翁陶熔了几天，就这些进境。若过两年，不知要好到怎样呢！」南湘道：「我只道庾香这首词是绝唱，不能和的，谁又","en":"hate that the east-flowing stream,\\nCannot meet the west-flowing water.\\nMy heart is broken! Writing this paper.\\"\\n\\nZiyun and the others read this with great astonishment. \\"Who could have expected Yunong to match Yuxiang's piece in both skill and profound sorrow?\\"\\n\\nGao Pin said, \\"When did Yunong's learning advance so much? I did not see him capable of this last year.\\""},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":3,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"鸣，揽衣起坐。伤哉，伤哉！何可言也！勉力加餐，愿期后会，请自宽解，以侍晨昏。\\n夏秋多厉，千万珍重。琴言百拜。\\n子云等看了，叹息一会。子云道：「怎样呢？将庾香请来罢。」次贤道：「不可。这首词他若见了，必有一番伤心痛哭，那时在这里倒教他难为情。不如送去与他，索性使他哭个尽性罢。」子云即着人将琴言并道生的信，送与子玉。","en":"autumn bring many illnesses; I beg you a thousand times to take care.\\"\\n\\nSigned: \\"Qinyan, bowing a hundred times.\\"\\n\\nZiyun and the others read it and sighed for a long while. Ziyun asked, \\"What should we do? Should we invite Yuxiang over?\\"\\n\\nCixian said, \\"We must not. If he sees this lyric here, it will surely provoke a bout of heartbreaking, bitter weeping, and it will be"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"明日，子云处送了琴言的和词来，子玉看了，一恸欲绝。过了半天，将这信与这词足足念了有百余遍，又喜琴言学问大进，竟成了名作，便缝了一个古锦囊，置了此词，佩在身上。不知后事如何，且听下回分解。","en":"The next day, Ziyun's household sent over Qinyan's response lyric. Upon reading it, Ziyu was so overcome with grief he nearly fainted. Over the course of the morning, he read the letter and the lyric fully a hundred times over. Yet amidst his sorrow, he was also overjoyed"}],"54":[{"paragraph":3,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"考期三日前就忙乱起来，各士子投印结，买卷子，海内文人纷纷拥挤，自致仕先达以及布衣，共有七八百人。子云托人保了次贤，次贤忽然的抱病起来，不能赴考，子云甚为太息。","en":"sheets, crowds of scholars from all regions, retired grandees and commoners alike—seven to eight hundred in total. Ziyun had arranged recommendation for Cixian, but Cixian suddenly fell ill and could not sit; Ziyun sighed deeply."},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":2,"tokens":["徐子云","子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"初九日派了几位阅卷大臣，苏候又做了总裁，华公子派了搜捡官，徐子云派了收卷官，刘文泽派了弥封官，张仲雨派了巡逻官。初十日一早入场，首试题目是《拟汉诏》、《拟唐疏》、《五经条解》、《五代南北朝年号考》、《治河策》、《问酌六科则例》《增损盐法利弊》、《正本清源论》八题。二试是《大礼赋》、《大乐赋》、《大搜赋》。三试《拟","en":"ninth, examining ministers were assigned: Su the Marquis again chief examiner, Young Master Hua inspection officer, Ziyun receiving officer, Wenze sealing officer, and Zhang Zhongyu patrol officer. On the morning of the tenth they entered the hall. First session had eight questions: *Draft Han Edict*, *Draft Tang Memorial*, *Exegesis of the Five Classics*, *Examination"},{"paragraph":41,"mentions":2,"tokens":["度香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"说下去。子玉看了琼华，琼华也看了子玉。子玉只得赔笑道：「这事也不用讲他，横竖久后自知，也不须分辩的。我今日见着度香，说他夫人要请你去赏菊花，还请庸庵与剑潭的夫人，并众相好的夫人。你去不去呢？」琼华道：「我不去罢。」子玉道：「为什么不愿去？」琼华道：「一来我也才过来，还没有满月。二来也要等太太吩咐，如太太去，我就跟了去。」子玉道：「他们不请太太，单请你们一辈人。度","en":"apologetically and say, \\"No need to speak of this; eventually truth is known, no need for defenses. Today I saw Duxiang, who said his wife wants to invite you to view chrysanthemums, inviting the wives of Yong'an and Jiantan and other close friends. Will you go?\\" Qionghua said she would probably not go. Why? \\"First, I have just come over and a month hasn't passed. Second,"}],"56":[{"paragraph":16,"mentions":2,"tokens":["徐度香","度香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"有句话吩咐你。」琴仙含泪听训。道翁道：「你虽幼年失路，但看你立志不凡，我不须多嘱，你回京后自然旧业是不理的了，徐度香处尽可寄身。」琴仙听到此，便哭起来，不能答应。道翁又道：「这个遗言你收好了，将来到京之后与度香，他必有个道理。」琴仙接了过来，看是：","en":"I need not say much. After you return to Beijing you will not go back to your old trade—you may lodge with Xu Duxiang.\\" At that Qinxian wept and could not answer. Daoweng went on: \\"Keep this testament; when you reach the capital give it to Duxiang—he will know what to do.\\" Qinxian took it and read:"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":1,"tokens":["度香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"伤哉！伤哉！素车无闻，青绳谁吊，骸轻蝉蜕，魂咽之潮。一抔之土何方，六尺之孤谁托？琴儿素蒙青眼，令其来依。呜呼？度香知我，自能慰我于九原也。残魂不馁，当为报德之蛇；稚子有知，亦作感恩之雀。肝胆素照，神魂可通，不尽之言，伏惟矜察。七月七日屈本立绝笔。\\n琴仙看了。不觉恸倒在地，刘喜也哭了，道翁命刘喜扶起琴仙，琴仙独自倚床而哭，道翁道：「不必哭了，我累了你。殡殓之后，即","en":"lie—who will shelter this six-foot orphan? Qinxian has long been in my favor; I bid him come and rely on me. Ah—Duxiang knows me; he will comfort me in the grave. If my lingering soul does not fade, may it be the snake that repays a kindness; if the boy has sense, let him be the sparrow that remembers grace. Our hearts have seen each other clear; spirits may meet. What"},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":2,"tokens":["徐度香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，只得忍住了气道：「人也认得几个。」石翁道：「是些什么人？」琴仙道：「都是一班正正经经的，倒也没有那种假好人。徐度香、梅庾香之外，还有几人也是名士。」石翁笑道：「徐度香么，是晓山相国的公子，他与你相好么？」琴仙道：「是，现在先君还有一封遗书与他，托他照应的。」","en":"muttered: \\"I knew a few people.\\" \\"Whom?\\" Lord Hou pressed. \\"Serious men. They were not false friends. Besides Xu Duxiang and Mei Yuxiang, I knew a few other respectable scholars.\\" Lord Hou smiled knowingly. \\"Xu Duxiang, the esteemed son of Minister Xiaoshan. Are you two close?\\" Qinxian nodded stiffly. \\"Yes. My late father left a letter specifically asking him to look after"}],"57":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["徐子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"且说徐子云的夫人袁绮香，生得婉娴柔静，贤淑无双，又且绣口锦心，才能咏絮。于十月初十日，请了华公子的夫人苏浣香、田春航的夫人浣兰、刘文泽的夫人吴紫烟、颜仲清的夫人王蓉华、梅子玉的夫人琼华、王恂的夫人孙佩秋。此时园中菊花开满，五色斑烂。是日晴光和蔼，风不扬尘，小毛","en":"Xu Ziyun's wife, Yuan Qixiang, possessed a gentle, quiet grace and unparalleled virtue. With a heart of brocade and lips that embroidered verse, her talents rivaled Xie Daoyun's famous 'willow-fluff' poetry. On the tenth day of the tenth month, she invited Hua"}],"59":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["徐老爷"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"夫人、小姐们拜他做老师。那一年做起寿来，那些寿屏、寿诗，园内的房子处处都挂满了，还挂不下。我看他的交游比怡园的徐老爷还要阔些。你若去了，倒也可以认得些人，怕不有些好处出来。若长在此，举目无亲，将何度日？不要说别的，就老爷这口灵柩，也须入土为安。天又冷了，身上棉衣也没有，这个光景，须趁早定个主意。不是这样的。」琴仙道：「侯老爷那里，我就饿死也不去的。」刘喜道：「这却","en":"By the third month of their stay, they had pawned or sold all of Qinxian's remaining clothes. The early winter chill was setting in, yet Qinxian had no padded garments, let alone Liu Xi. One day, Liu Xi offered a gentle word of advice: \\"Young Master, you are still young, and you shouldn't be so rigid. I believe Lord Hou was sincere in his intentions. For him to personally invite you over and even send money and rice is quite rare. You shouldn't misjudge this gentleman; princes, nobles, and prime ministers all respect him. He has countless disciples—serving officials, jinshi, and juren beyond reckoning—and many ladies and young misses also bow to him as their teacher. I remember one year when he celebrated his birthday, the longevity screens and poetic scrolls filled every room in his garden, with some left over because there was no place to hang them. I reckon his social circle is even grander than Master Xu's at the Garden of Contentment. If you were to go, you could make some useful acquaintances, and surely some good would come of it. If we stay here, with no relatives in sight, how are we to survive? Putting everything else aside, the old master's coffin must eventually be laid to rest in the earth. The weather is turning cold, and you don't even have padded winter clothes. In this situation, we need to make a decision sooner rather than later. We can't go on like this.\\" Qinxian replied firmly, \\"I would rather starve to death than go to Lord Hou's estate.\\" Liu Xi pressed, \\"But why? I truly don't understand.\\" Qinxian instructed him, \\"Keep an eye out outside for any travelers heading to the capital. I need to send letters and borrow some silver so we can properly bury the old master.\\""},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"喜道：「要便人要天天有的，折差、塘报那一日没有？你写起来，我去寄就是了。」琴仙于是哀哀切切，写了几封信与子玉、子云、蕙芳诸人，要他们专人来接他回去，子云信内并封着屈道翁遗言。写了一天，刘喜托便寄了。后来寺中又做起法事来，男女混杂，游人挤满。琴仙屋里常有人来张张望望的，琴仙好不气闷。刘喜见度日艰难，就算京里有人来接他们，也须两月之久，就到年底去了。便想出个法子，卖","en":"will go and send them.\\" With a sorrowful heart, Qinxian poured his grief into several letters addressed to Ziyu, Ziyun, Huifang, and the others, pleading with them to send someone specifically to take him back. In the letter to Ziyun, he also enclosed Qu Daoweng's dying testament. After a full day of writing, Liu Xi entrusted the letters to a courier. Later on, the temple"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉看信面上是：「江西学政梅宅梅庾香少爷手启，屈勤先寄。」心中大喜，知琴仙到了江西任所了，便忙拆开，看见还有与子云、蕙芳、素兰、琪官的信，且搁过一边。拆开自己的信，见一张白纸写着「哀启者」，大为骇然，想道：「难道道翁有什么缘故了？」遂细细的看下去，不觉泪珠点点的落将下来。","en":"Qinxian had reached the post in Jiangxi. He hurriedly tore it open, noticing there were also letters addressed to Ziyun, Huifang, Sulan, and Qiguan, which he temporarily set aside. Opening his own letter, he saw a plain sheet of paper bearing the words, \\"A Notice of Bereavement.\\" He was deeply shocked, thinking to himself, \\"Could something have happened to Daoweng?\\" He"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":5,"tokens":["子云","度香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"无归，故尔暂延残喘，务祈设法着人前来等语。子玉不觉泪如泉涌，万箭攒心，毫无主意，也不忍再看。便吩咐套车到怡园找子云，谁知次贤、子云、南湘、高品没有一个在园子里，子玉更加着急。跟班们不知何事，又不敢问子玉，便又到九香楼，进去见诸名旦都在园中，南湘、高品、金粟都在这里。子玉不及叙话，一脸悲愁，就将琴仙给众人之信与他们看了，个个洒泪。再不料琴仙一出京，就遭此大难，真令","en":"to bear reading any further, he immediately ordered a carriage to take him to the Garden of Contentment to find Ziyun. To his dismay, neither Cixian, Ziyun, Nanxiang, nor Gao Pin were at the garden. Ziyu grew even more frantic. The footmen, unaware of what had happened, didn't dare to ask Ziyu and drove him on to the Nine-Fragrance Tower. Going inside, he found that"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":3,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"又将道翁的遗言拆读，更加泪落如雨。子玉等与众人看了，个个大哭了一场，哭得九香楼下好不热闹。众人哭毕，子云道：「此事在我，明日即着人到江南去接玉侬回来，并办道翁葬事。但今年不能到了。」子云即回，要告诉次贤商量此事。子玉也无心在九香楼，便即回家。高品，史南湘金粟与那些名旦，各惆怅无欢。子云回园与次贤说了，次贤更痛得伤心，一夜之间，便摹了道翁神像。明日邀同众","en":"bitterly, their cries making the base of the Nine-Fragrance Tower ring with grief. Once their weeping subsided, Ziyun spoke up: \\"Leave this matter to me. Tomorrow, I will dispatch men to Jiangnan to bring Yunong back and to handle Daoweng's funeral arrangements. However, they won't be able to reach him before the year's end.\\" Ziyun returned immediately to inform Cixian"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云发了一千银子，打发家人星夜下了江南。子玉连天的悲苦，日间不敢进内，一来怕颜夫人问他，二来怕琼华小姐看出，正是他的苦楚，比人更胜几倍。但心上有这样心事，脸上如何装得过来？颜夫人倒疑心他怕见父亲，想是他父亲就回来，因此着急。惟有那琼华小姐，异样心灵，便料","en":"Ziyun issued a thousand taels of silver and dispatched his servants to travel to Jiangnan by the light of the stars. Ziyu was steeped in endless sorrow day after day. During the daytime, he didn't dare enter the inner quarters; firstly, he feared Lady Yan"},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":2,"tokens":["度香","子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"正面反面，怎样又化了珠为龙抢去，子玉、仲清连连称异。子玉也将送行后怎样得病，得信后怎样悲伤，众人怎样祭奠道翁，度香已着人下了江南来接你并安葬道翁，直说到今日再想不着你来，二人又复悲喜交集。琴仙又复感激子云与众人，不住在枕上与子玉、仲清连连叩头。仲清问道：「你一路来，姑父知道你的事不知道呢？」琴仙道：「大约不知道，大人也总没有问我根底，我倒天天的防着问我，教我怎样","en":"parting, his devastating grief upon receiving the letters, how everyone had offered sacrifices to Daoweng, and how Duxiang had sent men down to Jiangnan to fetch him and bury Daoweng, right up to the shock of seeing him arrive today when he had least expected it. Once again, the two were overcome with a mixture of sorrow and joy. Qinxian felt a renewed wave of gratitude"}],"60":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说新年已过，又到元宵，六街三市，火树银花，好不热闹。子云于十三日请了华公子、田春航、梅子玉、史南湘、高品、颜仲清、刘文泽、王恂、萧次贤、金粟、屈勤先，并九香园诸人，作一大会。琴仙见了华公子，尚有些不安，华公子也不问起前事，以礼相待。此时琴仙已出了旦党，入了士党，但从前作旦时傲睨一切，此刻倒谦谦自守起来，因","en":"streets and three markets, silver trees and flowered lanterns blazed in bustling splendor. On the thirteenth, Ziyun hosted a grand gathering for Young Master Hua, Tian Chunhang, Mei Ziyu, Shi Nanxiang, Gao Pin, Yan Zhongqing, Liu Wenze, Wang Xun, Xiao Cixian, Jin Su, Qu Qinxian, and the entire company of Nine-Fragrance Garden. Seeing Young Master Hua, Qinxian still"},{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"此时才觉魔难尽释。然回想萧寺凄凉，孤灯残月，真如梦觉。次贤又将琴仙从前的梦境，向吉甫细细的说了一遍。吉甫因笑向子云、次贤道：「九香楼绝好一个花园，百花全有，如今单有一个花神牌位，且在隐僻处，与土地祠一样，岂不亵渎花神？我拟借他们九个作个九香花史，众位以为何如？」","en":"dream. Cixian then recounted to Jifu in detail the dreamscapes Qinxian had once described. Smiling, Jifu turned to Ziyun and Cixian: \\"Nine-Fragrance Tower is a superb garden holding every kind of flower, yet currently there is only one flower-god tablet hidden away in a secluded corner like an earth-god shrine. Is that not a slight to the flower deity? I propose we borrow"},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云问道：「怎样呢？」吉甫道：「花神若定要十二位，也可凑得上，只要把屈道翁做了芙蓉城主，再借重玉侬的前生所说那杜仙女，凑上玉侬，不是十二位了？」春航道：「妙，妙！此像要画得像，不必说真姓真名，缀个别号，每人做一篇赞语，说得似真似幻的，要与人花两合。」子玉","en":"Ziyun asked what it was. Jifu explained, \\"If we must have twelve flower deities, we can make up the number. We need only cast Qu Daoweng as the Lord of Furong City, and borrow the Fairy Du from Yunong's past-life vision. Add Yunong himself, and does that not"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「不必过谦。道生先生故后，笔墨之道，自然要让你，大家公论，何必推辞。我就做云龙那一幅，作好了，你再给我改改。」子云道：「自然是借重你们二位。那十篇如今是这样，各人拈阄，拈到谁是谁。华星北也叫他做一篇在内。」南湘道：「甚好。」于是写起阄来，将屈道翁与杜仙女、屈琴仙分做二阄，其余九人分作九阄。说也奇怪，想必文字有灵，前生缘法，子云拈了道翁，子玉拈了杜仙女、琴仙，金粟","en":"public consensus, so why decline? I will draft the cloud-dragon panel; once it is done, you can refine it for me.\\" Ziyun said, \\"Naturally, we must rely on you both. As for the other ten pieces, let us draw lots to see who gets which. We should ask Hua Xingbei to write one as well.\\" Nanxiang agreed it was a fine idea. And so they prepared the lots, grouping Qu Daoweng,"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉同了琴仙回家，正是内有韵妻，外有俊友，名成身立，清贵高华，好不有兴。子云写了一札与华公子为素兰作传。这边次贤妙腕灵思，画了十天才成。画成又请吉甫一一的改好，画一个，刻一个，倒也甚快。子云因受了感冒甚重，不敢用心，嘱将道翁、琴仙、杜仙女画在一幅，并求子玉作赞。到二十七日，连传赞都也刻起，系是各人书丹。二十八日就搬往九香楼镶","en":"and a handsome friend without, his fame established and his station secure, he was in the highest of spirits. Ziyun wrote a letter to Young Master Hua, requesting a biography for Sulan. Meanwhile, Cixian, wielding his wondrous brush and nimble mind, spent ten full days completing the paintings. As each was finished, Jifu meticulously refined it; they painted one and"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":2,"tokens":["度香","子云"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"诵佛。不识诸贵人不以贱地为鄙，俗笔为亵，使我等得遂所愿否？」众名士大喜，个个情愿，倒翻谦让了几句。宝珠又道：「度香先生提倡风雅，只得另立一品，在各位文星之上，曰：群仙领袖。未知诸贵人以为然否？」众人皆说：「是极。」子云说：「这个何敢？」宝珠就将诗稿恭恭敬敬的取出来，却已誊在一处，端正的楷书。除群仙领袖徐文星之次，皆以年齿定的先后，第二是仙中逸品萧文星，第三是仙中","en":"one of them was willing, though they offered a few words of polite refusal in return. Baozhu continued, \\"Master Duxiang promotes and champions elegance and culture; we have no choice but to establish a separate rank for him above all the literary stars, naming him: 'Leader of the Immortal Circle.' We wonder if you noble gentlemen agree?\\" Everyone replied, \\"Absolutely.\\""}]}`),"char-8":JSON.parse(`{"5":[{"paragraph":5,"mentions":2,"tokens":["次贤","静宜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"他有个好友，是楚南湘潭县人，姓萧名次贤，号静宜，年方三十二岁，是个名士，以优贡入京考选。他却厌弃微名，无心进取，天文地理之书，诸子百家之学，无不精通。与子云八拜之交，费了三四年心血，替他监造了这个怡园。真有驱云排岳之势，崇楼迭阁之观，窈屋宇其之胜。一时花木游览之盛，甲于京都。成了二十四处","en":"He had a close friend from Xiangtan County in southern Hunan, a man named Xiao Cixian, style name Jingyi. Thirty-two years of age, he was a renowned man of letters who had come to the capital to sit for examinations as a distinguished tribute student. Yet he had no desire for trifling titles and no ambition to advance. In astronomy and"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":1,"tokens":["萧次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"之心，却无褒狎之念，所以这些名旦，个个与他忘形略迹，视他为慈父恩母。甘雨祥云，无话不可尽言，无情不可径遂。那个萧次贤更是清高恬淡，玩意不留。","en":"treating him as a kind father or caring mother, able to speak openly of anything, free to follow their hearts. Xiao Cixian was even more pure and detached, taking no pleasure in worldly amusements."},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":1,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"今日在海棠春圃。这海棠春圃，平台曲榭。密室洞房，接接连连共有二十余间。宝珠引了进去，到了三间套房之内，子云正与次贤在那里围炉斗酒，见了这二人进来，都喜孜孜的笑面相迎。","en":"connecting in a continuous chain of over twenty bays. Baozhu led them inside to a suite of three rooms, where Ziyun and Cixian were sitting around a charcoal brazier drinking together. Seeing the two arrivals, both welcomed them with warm, smiling faces."},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":2,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴官羞羞涩涩的上前请了两个安，道了谢，俯首而立。子云、次贤见他今日容貌，华装艳服，更加妍丽了些。但见他那生生怯怯、畏畏缩缩的神情。教人怜惜之心，随感而发，便命他坐下。琴官挨着宝珠坐了，子云笑盈盈的问道：「前日我们乍见，未能深谈，你将你的出身家业、怎样入班的缘故，细细讲给我听。」琴官见问他的出身，便提动他的积","en":"Qinguan timidly went forward, made two bows of greeting, expressed his thanks, and stood with bowed head. Ziyun and Cixian saw that today, in fine and colorful dress, his appearance was even more beautiful than before. But they saw his tentative, bashful, nervous bearing. Feelings of tender regard arose in them unbidden, and they invited him to sit. Qinguan sat close beside"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":1,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"又问了他所学的戏，是那几出，琴官也回答了。次贤道：","en":"They then asked what operas he had studied, which pieces he knew, and Qinguan answered them. Cixian said:"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":1,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"什么规矩，存了规矩，就生疏了。」琴官也只得答应了，再将他们二人看看，都是骨格不凡，清和可近，已知不是寻常人了。次贤对子云道：「你这话说得最是，他此时还不晓得我们脾气怎样，当是富贵场中，必有骄奢之气，谁知我们最厌的是那样。你这个人材，是不用说了。但人之丰韵雅秀，皆从书本中来，若不认字读书，粗通文理，一切语言举止未免欠雅。你可曾念过书么？」琴官尚未回答，宝殊笑道：","en":"men again. Both were of extraordinary bearing, serene and approachable, and he knew they were not ordinary men. Cixian said to Ziyun: \\"What you have said is exactly right. At this moment he still does not know what our temperament is like; he may suppose that wealth and rank must bring with them proud and extravagant airs, not knowing that we most dislike such things."},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":1,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"来，只怕媚香还考不过他。」子云听了，更加欢喜，便问琴官道：「你到底念过书没有？」琴官道：「也念过五六年的书。」次贤道：「念过些什么书呢？」琴官道：「《四书》之外，念了一部《事类赋》，两本唐诗。」子云道：「也够了，你可会做诗？」琴官道：「不会做。」宝殊道：「那是他没有学过，将来一学就会的。前日他与我讲那些戏曲，那种好，那种不好，讲得一点不错。有这样天分，岂有学不来","en":"Qinguan: \\"Tell me honestly, have you studied books?\\" Qinguan replied: \\"I have studied for five or six years.\\" Cixian asked: \\"What have you read?\\" Qinguan replied: \\"Besides *The Four Books*, I read through the Rhapsodies on Categorized Affairs, a rhapsody on classes of things, and two volumes of Tang poetry.\\" Ziyun said: \\"That is quite enough. Can you compose poetry?\\""},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":5,"tokens":["静宜","次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「他这个名字不好，静宜你与他改一个字，将这官字换了罢，再与他起个号。」次贤想了一回道：「改为琴言，号玉侬，可好么？」子云道：「很好，这琴言二字，又新又雅；\\n玉侬之号，雅称其人。」宝珠叫琴官道谢，琴官又起身请了两个安。次贤道：「方才已说过的了，怎么又请起安来？」子云道：「我","en":"\\"His name is not suitable. Jingyi, please give him a new character, let us change this word 'guan'. And give him a style name as well.\\" Cixian thought for a moment and said: \\"What about changing it to Qinyan, meaning Lute-Words, with the style name Yunong, meaning Jade Youth. Would that"}],"9":[{"paragraph":10,"mentions":1,"tokens":["萧静宜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"是晚上，又是便服，如何去得？」仲清道：「这倒不妨。徐度香这个人，却是我辈，全不在形迹上讲究的；况且他园中，还有萧静宜，更是个清高潇洒的人，就去逛逛，倒也不妨。」三人都要去，子玉也只得同去。于是各上了车，书童跨了车沿，望怡园来。","en":"is one of our sort. He places no importance on formalities or appearances. Moreover, his garden also has Xiao Jingyi, who is an even more upright and free-spirited person. Going for a stroll would be perfectly fine.\\" All three wished to go, and Ziyu agreed to join them. So everyone got into their carriages, with the pages riding on the footboards, and headed for the"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":1,"tokens":["静宜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"见文泽、仲清、王恂三人一齐迎上前来，称呼他为静宜先生。那人与三人见了礼，又向子玉作了个揖，子玉连忙还礼。","en":"Wenze, Zhongqing, and Wang Xun all stepped forward at once to greet him, addressing him as Master Jingyi. The man exchanged courtesies with the three, then bowed to Ziyu, who hastened to return the salutation."},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":6,"tokens":["萧次贤","静宜","次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"文泽即对萧次贤说道：「这位是梅庾香，是当今无双士。静宜先生没有会过么？」次贤道：「今日识荆，实为万幸」便请四人进内，子玉道：「今晚便服，未免不恭，容另日专诚晋谒罢！」次贤笑道：「庾香先生，当今名士，不应琐琐及此。况主人也不在家，我辈聊以聚谈，切勿拘以礼节。」子玉难","en":"Wenze thereupon said to Xiao Cixian: \\"This gentleman is Mei Yuxiang, the peerless scholar of this age. Has Master Jingyi not had occasion to meet him?\\" Cixian replied: \\"Meeting such a distinguished personage today is truly my great good fortune.\\" He then invited the four men inside. Ziyu"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":3,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「这琴是庾香先生猜着的么？」子玉道：「是小弟胡猜的，断不敢当此厚赠。」次贤道：「这是园主人为杜玉侬而设，另有深意，幸勿见却。琴后尚须镌铭，俟镌好再行送上。」说毕便令小厮，仍将瑶琴抱了进去。其余彩礼，交给各跟随收存。原来琴言因制灯谜时，喜诵「落花人独立」这一联，度香随嘱次贤，以词意为琴言写图，所以这灯谜即以琴作彩，原是于游戏","en":"riddle?\\" Ziyu replied: \\"I merely guessed at random. I could not possibly presume to accept such a generous prize.\\" Cixian replied: \\"This was set by the garden's master for Du Yunong, and carries a particular meaning, so pray do not decline. An inscription still needs to be engraved on the qin. I will send it once that is done.\\" With this he had a page-boy carry the jade"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":1,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"次贤道：「诸兄要看灯么？也容易，虽非来自南边，却还不俗。」便令小厮引道，沿着峭壁，走有一箭多远，却是一层层的石蹬，上了三十余级，转了峭壁，后面就是一个白石平台。","en":"Cixian replied: \\"You gentlemen wish to see lanterns? That can easily be arranged. Though these are not from the south, they are by no means unrefined.\\" He had a page-boy lead the way. Skirting along the sheer cliff face, they walked the length of an arrow-shot,"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":2,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"文泽想道：「可惜无酒，负此花灯。」听得次贤说道：「如此良夜，诸兄何不小饮几杯。」即吩咐取酒来。不一会，小厮们取了四壶酒交给宝珠、漱芳，走到各人面前，将茶碗撤去，把茶几揭起了一层盖子，便是一个镶成的攒盒，共有十二碟果菜，银杯象箸都镶在里面，十分精巧。宝珠、漱芳都斟了酒，次贤说：「请！」大家浅斟","en":"there is no wine, for we are squandering this magnificent evening of flowers and lanterns.\\" Just then he heard Cixian say: \\"On such a splendid night, why do you gentlemen not drink a few cups?\\" He at once ordered wine to be brought. In a short while the page-boys brought four jars of wine and handed them to Baozhu and Shufang, who went before each guest, removed the"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":5,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"再说。」扶上亭子，他就坐在地下，宝珠等上去见他，他把头点点。文泽道：「你在那里喝得这样？」南湘又摇摇头。宝珠到次贤耳边说了几句话，次贤命小厮去拿了一个小小的金盒子，取出一丸药来，放在碗内，用开水化了，递给宝珠，捧到南湘身边，弯了腰给他喝，南湘摇头不要。宝珠道：「这是醒酒汤，喝了就好了。」南湘心里明白，把汤喝完，闭着眼道：「我醉欲眠君且去。」便放身欲睡。次贤恐着了","en":"\\"Where have you been drinking to reach this state?\\" Nanxiang shook his head again. Baozhu whispered a few words to Cixian. Cixian instructed a page-boy to bring a small gold box, from which he took out a pill, placed it in a bowl, dissolved it in boiling water, and gave it to Baozhu. Baozhu carried it over to Nanxiang and bent down to offer it to him. Nanxiang shook his"},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":4,"tokens":["次贤","静宜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"在地下。」仲清道：「你酒已醒了，还说醉话。」漱芳已拧了一块湿手巾来，南湘擦了脸道：「这是什么地方？」众人皆笑，次贤笑道：「竹君，这是黄鹤楼，你怎么认不清了？」南湘近前一看，狂笑起来，说道：「原来静宜也在这里，你们到底几时来的？」众人听了又笑，宝珠、漱芳拉他到亭外看了一会，南湘方知道是怡园，细细一想，便又大笑。将要问时，忽然满园的金鼓盈天，爆声大发，风驰火骤，声势","en":"nonsense?\\" Shufang had wrung out a damp cloth. Nanxiang wiped his face and asked: \\"Where are we?\\" Everyone laughed. Cixian smiled and said: \\"Zhujun, this is Yellow Crane Tower. How can you not recognize it?\\" Nanxiang looked around and burst into wild laughter, saying: \\"So Jingyi is here too. When exactly did all of you arrive?\\" Everyone laughed again. Baozhu and Shufang"},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":2,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"穿过几处神仙洞，依着树屏竹径，走到一处是梨花园，次贤让客进内。也过了好几重门户，进了朝东五间三明两暗的西洋房。此中点缀得甚佳，琴床画桌，金鼎铜壶，斑然可爱。正中悬着一额，是屈本立写的「宜春阁」三字，一边是陆素兰写的几幅小楷，一边是袁宝珠画的几幅墨兰，中间地上点着一盏仿古鸡足银灯，有四尺高，上面托着个九","en":"immortal caverns, they followed a path lined with tree-screens and bamboo until they reached a pear-blossom garden. Cixian ushered the guests inside. Passing through several more sets of gates, they entered a five-bay Western-style building, three lit outer bays and two shuttered inner ones, facing east. The interior was appointed with extraordinary elegance. There were"},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":1,"tokens":["静宜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"吾兄尚还刻刻在心。」南湘道：「以后你们这一班，见我们不许请安，只许称号，如违了要罚的。」宝珠道：「这倒与度香、静宜一样脾气，就是这样便了。」王恂道：「庾香，你看这瑶卿，与你去年戏园所见的怎样？这真伪可能相混么？」子玉笑道：「瓦砾岂可僭称珠玉？那个名字，叫他改了才好。」宝珠不解，便问王恂，王恂就将去年所见保珠，子玉听错的话说了，宝珠嫣然而笑。","en":"courtesy names. Violators will be penalized.\\" Baozhu said: \\"This is exactly the same disposition as Duxiang and Jingyi, so it shall be.\\" Wang Xun said: \\"Yuxiang, look at this Yaoqing. How does he compare to what you saw at the theater last year? Could the real and the fake possibly be confused?\\" Ziyu laughed: \\"Can rubble and stone presume to the name of pearl and jade?"},{"paragraph":30,"mentions":2,"tokens":["次贤","静宜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"于是漱芳拉了王恂下棋，文泽观局。子玉同宝珠看那墨兰，赞不绝口；南湘、仲清、次贤同坐在醉翁床闲话。南湘道：「静宜兄，还记得「只有酒狂名下士，醉吟许上岳阳楼」佳句否？」","en":"Wenze looked on. Ziyu and Baozhu admired the ink-painted orchid, praising it without end. Nanxiang, Zhongqing, and Cixian sat together on the Drunken-Scholar's Couch in easy conversation. Nanxiang said: \\"Brother Jingyi, do you still recall those fine lines: 'Only the poet-drunkard is famed among the scholars; drunk and chanting, he may ascend Yueyang Tower'?\\""},{"paragraph":31,"mentions":6,"tokens":["次贤","静宜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"次贤道：「那里及得「只恨仙人丹药少，不教酒满洞庭湖」名句足传。」仲清道：「若教酒满洞庭湖，只怕史竹君早已醉死了。静宜先生，明日可与他写个竹醉图。」次贤点头微笑。子玉乘他们说话时，悄悄的问宝珠道：「这两天可曾见你们同班的琴官？」宝珠听了，把子玉打量了一番，","en":"Cixian replied: \\"That cannot compare to the celebrated lines: 'I only grieve that the immortals' elixir is scarce, preventing wine from filling the whole of Dongting Lake.'\\" Zhongqing said: \\"If wine filled Dongting Lake, I fear Shi Zhujun would long since have"},{"paragraph":35,"mentions":3,"tokens":["静宜","次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"艳极了。况且隐藏药名、花名，恰切不移。这猜着的人，真是个绝世聪明人了，可借不知是谁？」文泽道：「这两封书，都是静宜先生的手笔么？」次贤道：「那封原书，是度香的手笔。」说着，王恂已经下完了棋，倒输了漱芳三子。子玉因夜色已深，随同南湘等告辞；子玉并说度香来园，先为致意，改日专诚再来的话，次贤答应着，送出各人上车而散。再听下回分解。","en":"a peerless wit. What a pity we do not know who it was.\\" Wenze said: \\"Are both these letters written in Master Jingyi's hand?\\" Cixian replied: \\"The original letter is in Duxiang's hand.\\" As he spoke, Wang Xun had already finished his chess game, having lost three stones to Shufang. Ziyu, the night being already deep, took his leave together with Nanxiang and the others."}],"10":[{"paragraph":4,"mentions":3,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"个厚道正人，断不至此。一日又梦见宝珠变了他的模样，与自己唱了一出《惊梦》，又想不出这个理来。次日，子云到园来，次贤讲起昨晚诸诺人来园看灯，并子玉打着了琴言的灯谜，即将子玉的才貌痛赞了一番。子云听了，心里颇为喜欢，即道：「这个梅庾香，他虽不认得我，我去年恰见过他。我们也有世谊，他令祖相国，与先叔祖总宪公是同年至好。这梅庾香的外貌却没有说的，不知品行如何？」次贤道：","en":"Interrupted Dream' with him, leaving him utterly bewildered. The following day, when Ziyun came to the garden, Cixian spoke at length of the young gentlemen who had come to view the lanterns the previous evening, praising Ziyu's talent and appearance with great effusiveness. Hearing this, Ziyun was inwardly quite pleased and said: \\"This Mei Yuxiang, though he does not"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":2,"tokens":["萧次贤","次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这里说得热闹，那晓得徐子云同萧次贤，早已转到隔壁套间内，窃听得逼真，把门一推，子云、次贤走将出来，琴言一见，羞得红了脸，就背转身坐了。子云道：「玉侬还怪我不怪我？」琴言低头不语，子云道，「就算我错了一句话，也是无心之言。","en":"While this lively conversation was unfolding, Xu Ziyun and Xiao Cixian had long since slipped around into the adjoining side room and overheard every word with absolute clarity. Pushing the door open, Ziyun and Cixian came out. The moment Qinyan saw them, he flushed crimson with deep embarrassment and turned his back to"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":1,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"况且你又不是女孩子，怕什么配对不配对，难道真把你配了梅庾香不成？」说得次贤、宝珠都笑起来。宝珠道：「不要说了，他已经明白过来了。我们何不去请了庾香来与他见一见。」子云道：「知道是他不是他，我自有道理。」宝珠、琴言即在怡园吃了晚饭，坐到二更而回。","en":"what is there to fear in talk of a 'match'? Could I really be marrying you off to Mei Yuxiang?\\" This remark made Cixian and Baozhu both burst into laughter. Baozhu interjected: \\"Say no more, for he has already understood. Why don't we simply invite Yuxiang here to meet him?\\" Ziyun said: \\"I have my own method of determining whether it is truly him or not.\\" Baozhu and Qinyan"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":1,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"如今用个移花接木之计，先把玉侬藏了，另觅一个像玉侬的人，用言打动他，看他如何，自然就试出来了。」主意已定，即向次贤、宝珠说知。","en":"response will naturally reveal everything.\\" With his mind firmly made up, he disclosed the intricacies of his plan to Cixian and Baozhu."},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":2,"tokens":["静宜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"庾香先生，景星卿云，相见恨晚，前日失迓为罪。今蒙不弃，惠然肯来，私心实深欣幸。」子玉问道：「今日坐间尚有何客，静宜先生何以不见？」子云道：「静宜现有小事，少刻奉陪。即指着榻上的琴道：「今日此酌，专为玉侬赠琴而设，未便另邀他客，致扰情话。」子玉道：「弟正要动问，前日因何为打一灯谜，有此厚赠？这玉侬究系何人，吾兄如此郑重？」子云便令小厮，将琴囊解开，双手送交子玉道：","en":"delight to me.\\" Ziyu then asked: \\"Are there other guests expected at today's gathering? Why do I not see Master Jingyi?\\" Ziyun explained: \\"Jingyi has a small matter to attend to and will join us shortly.\\" Then, gesturing gracefully toward the qin on the daybed, he added: \\"Today's banquet has been arranged expressly for the occasion of Yunong presenting this qin. It would"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":2,"tokens":["次贤","静宜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"四句琴铭下，又镌着一行行书小字，是：「山阴徐子云为玉侬杜琴言移赠庾香名士清赏。」下刻图章两方：阴文是「次贤撰句」四字，阳文是「静宜手镌」四字。","en":"celebrated scholar Yuxiang.' Below this dedication were neatly engraved two seals: one in intaglio reading 'Composed by Cixian,' and one in relief reading 'Carved by Jingyi.'"},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":2,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"正急的无可如何，只听得镜屏里轻轻的一响，子云、次贤、宝珠都在镜屏之外，迎面笑盈盈的走进来，那琴言一影就不见了，把个子玉吓得迷迷糊糊的。只听得子云笑道：「好个坐怀不乱的柳下惠，失敬，失敬！就是骂我徐度香太挖苦些。」子玉一回转头来，那知众人都在镜屏对面套间之内。子玉与次贤见了礼，即向子云告辞道：「今日出","en":"utter loss and hovering on the very edge of despair, a soft, distinct sound was heard at the mirror screen. Ziyun, Cixian, and Baozhu, their faces adorned with smiles, walked in gracefully from the other side of the screen. At that precise instant, the figure of Qinyan vanished without a single trace, leaving Ziyu utterly dazed and bewildered. Then he heard Ziyun laughing"},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":2,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"次贤道：「小弟才来，正拟畅谈衷曲，足下拂然欲去，是怪我奉陪得迟了。」宝珠一手拉着子玉进套间屋内，道：「你且再看看你的意中人，不要哭坏了他。」子玉见一人背坐着在那里哭泣，只道就是刚才的那个琴言。因想他既知哭泣，尚能悔过，意欲于酒席中间，慢慢的用言语感化他。","en":"Cixian added: \\"I have only just arrived, and was eagerly looking forward to a long and candid conversation, yet your honor fully intends to leave in displeasure. Am I to blame for arriving too late to properly escort you?\\" Baozhu gently took Ziyu's hand and"},{"paragraph":31,"mentions":1,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"酒过数巡，次贤道：「庾香兄，今日可曾见那瑶琴上镌的字么？」子玉道：「我倒忘了道谢，铁笔古心，的是名手。但此灯谜也还易打，度香先生所说为玉侬而设，究竟不知其故？」","en":"After several rounds of fine wine, Cixian asked: \\"Brother Yuxiang, have you seen the inscription engraved on the jade qin today?\\" Ziyu replied: \\"I nearly forgot to express my profound thanks. The brushwork is ancient and masterly, truly the work of a highly skilled hand. But as for the lantern"},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":1,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"愧，当为玉侬珍重藏之。」琴言面有豫色。宝珠见了，将唐诗改了一字念道：「寻常一样琴前月，才有梅花便不同。」子云、次贤同声赞道：「琴字改得好。」","en":"same moonlight as always shines upon the qin;\\nOnly with the plum blossom is it no longer ordinary.'\\n\\nZiyun and Cixian together praised the verse: \\"The change of 'qin' for the original word is wonderfully, perfectly apt.\\""},{"paragraph":33,"mentions":2,"tokens":["次贤","静宜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"便道：「若非瑶卿胸有智珠，不能改得如此敏妙。」子云等还道是寻常赞语，惟有琴言深感子玉之情，替他报复了这个琴字。次贤道：「今日玉侬，何以一言不发？」子云道：「他本来像息夫人似的，将来静宜可将那「花如解语还多事，石不能言最可人」，替他写一副对子。」子玉只管点头。宝珠道：「他是只会作梦，那里会说话？」琴言瞅了宝珠一眼。","en":"but Qinyan alone felt deeply, profoundly moved by Ziyu's care in avenging the slight of that character 'qin.' Cixian asked: \\"Why has Yunong not said a single word all evening?\\" Ziyun replied: \\"He is like the legendary Lady Xi, who steadfastly refused to speak. In the future, Jingyi, you might write him a couplet with those lines:\\n\\n'If flowers could speak they would"},{"paragraph":35,"mentions":1,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"识。」琴言道：「这个名字倒起得别致。」子云举杯照子玉道：「难得玉侬开了金口，我们当浮一大白。」子玉饮毕，又照了次贤，也饮干了。","en":"Yunong open his golden lips, so we ought all to drain a full cup.\\" After Ziyu had drained his, he raised one toward Cixian, who also drained his to the very dregs."},{"paragraph":37,"mentions":2,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴言问子云道：「是什么醒酒丸？这丸叫什么名字？」子云一一说了，共是两杯。琴言问次贤道：「今日为什么回来得这样迟？」次贤道：「替人做媒，回来迟了。」也饮一杯。琴言把子玉看了一看，都不言语，回转头来问子云道：「这园梅花共有多少株？」宝珠咳嗽一声，子云道：「约有二千株。」该是一杯。","en":"are they called?\\" Ziyun answered each question in turn, which came to two cups for himself. Qinyan then asked Cixian: \\"Why did you return so late today?\\" Cixian replied: \\"I was acting as a matchmaker and came back late.\\" That was one more cup. Qinyan looked steadily at Ziyu but said absolutely nothing; then he turned back and asked Ziyun: \\"How many plum trees does"},{"paragraph":44,"mentions":1,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"清爽，又把琴言饱看了一番，虽彼此衷曲不能在人前细剖，却已心许目成，意在不言之表了。子玉令云儿抱了瑶琴，向子云、次贤道了谢出来。琴言悄悄的问后会之期，子玉心里觉得十分难受，勉强的道：「稍有空闲，即当相聚。」大家送到上车地方，大有依依不舍之意，一直望他车子出了园门，宝珠、琴言也各上车回去。欲知后事，再听下回分解。","en":"expression. Ziyu directed his page boy Yun'er to take the jade qin, and then said his fond farewells to Ziyun and Cixian and took his leave. Qinyan quietly asked when they might meet again; Ziyu felt a great, heavy weight of pain in his heart, but forced himself to say: \\"As soon as a moment of leisure presents itself, we shall surely meet again.\\" The whole party saw him"}],"11":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["萧次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说徐子云送子玉出园之后，与萧次贤谈了一会，即便回宅。子云的住宅也离园不远，就在对面，还是他曾祖老太爷住的相府，府中极其宽大。现在父母、兄嫂都不在京住。此宅内仅子云夫妇二人，其余都是家人。子云与他夫人讲起琴言、子玉的事来，又羡慕他们缱绻的情致。袁氏夫人微笑，即问道：","en":"After escorting Ziyu out of the garden, Xu Ziyun lingered a moment to converse with Xiao Cixian before wending his way homeward. His own residence, the vast and imposing ancestral mansion built by his late great-grandfather the Grand Chancellor, lay only a short distance across the road. With his parents, elder brother, and sister-in-law departed"}],"12":[{"paragraph":4,"mentions":1,"tokens":["萧次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"光阴甚快，不觉已至仲春。如今要特说一个人的行事，也是此书中紧要人。你道是谁？前回书中，萧次贤说有两封情书的灯谜，被人打去了，可惜没有问得这人姓名。原来这人姓田，名春航，号湘帆，年二十三岁。也是金陵人，却寄居扬州。自幼失怙。母张氏，名门世族，淹通经史。二十五岁上生了春航，二十八岁上，春航之父田浩中了进士，即殁于京师。这田夫人苦节抚孤，教养兼任","en":"person's affairs that must be told — a person of great importance in this book. Who is he? In a previous chapter, Xiao Cixian mentioned two lantern riddles in the form of love letters, which had been solved by someone whose name he had unfortunately failed to ask. This person's surname was Tian, his given name Chunhang, his style Xiangfan, and he was twenty-three years old."}],"13":[{"paragraph":7,"mentions":1,"tokens":["静宜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"个粉定窑长方磁盆，开着五六箭素心兰。正面挂着六幅金笺的小楷，却是一人一幅，写得停匀娟秀。一幅是度香主人，一幅是静宜逸士，一幅是竹君词客，一幅是剑潭山人，一幅是前舟外史，一幅是庸庵居士。像是几首和韵七律诗。再看上款，是媚香嘱和《长河修禊》七律六章原韵，春航心里更加起敬。想道：","en":"by a different hand in balanced, elegant calligraphy. The signatures included \\"Master of Duxiang\\", \\"The Recluse Jingyi\\", \\"The Lyricist Zhujun\\", \\"The Mountain Man Jiantan\\", \\"The Unofficial Historian Qianzhou\\", and \\"The Lay Scholar Yong'an\\". They appeared to be matching seven-character regulated verse poems. Looking closer at the dedication, it read: \\"By Meixiang's request,"}],"14":[{"paragraph":27,"mentions":1,"tokens":["萧静宜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"揖道：「宽恕小生这一次罢。」惹得蕙芳倒笑了。蕙芳要春航弹《胡笳十八拍》，又要弹《洞天春晓》，说道：「这两套我听萧静宜弹得最好，他并有琴箫合谱。他曾教过我吹箫。」春航道：「《洞天春晓》这套琴却好，但太长。《胡筋十八拍》没有什么意思，于本意不大很合，不如弹一套《水仙操》罢。」又停了一会，再和好了弦，清清冷冷的弹起来。这套琴共十二段，指法最细，吟揉绰注，正是一分错乱不得","en":"Flute\\" (胡笳十八拍) and then \\"Spring Dawn in the Grotto Heaven\\" (洞天春晓), saying: \\"These two suites I have heard Xiao Jingyi play most beautifully; he also has a combined score for qin and xiao flute. He once taught me to play the xiao.\\" Chunhang said, \\"'Spring Dawn in the Grotto Heaven' is indeed a fine suite, but it is too lengthy. 'Eighteen Beats of the Nomad Flute' does"}],"15":[{"paragraph":7,"mentions":1,"tokens":["静宜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"去子。他们还在怡园唱了一出《定情》。」文泽道：「那个叫杜玉侬？我们怎么也没有见过。」南湘道：「好得很。据度香、静宜品题，似乎在宝珠之上，我却不认得。庾香今日何不同我们去赏鉴赏鉴？」子玉听了，才知不是问他定亲，然却是初出茅庐，不比他们舞席歌场闹惯的了，却躁得回答不出了。文泽再三盘问，只得答道：「这玉侬就是琴言，你们也都见过的。」文泽道：「真冤枉杀人，我们不要说没有","en":"said, \\"Who is this Du Yunong? How is it we've never seen him?\\" Nanxiang said, \\"Splendid! According to Duxiang and Jingyi's assessment, he surpasses Baozhu — yet I don't know him. Yuxiang, why not take us today to have a look?\\" Only now did Ziyu understand that this was not about his betrothal; but still, this was his first step out of the thatched cottage, nothing like"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":4,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"那日徐子云也在旗亭送行回来，且不进宅，一径到园，即到次贤屋里，始知次贤在桃花坞赏桃花，还有宝珠、漱芳两个，子云就到桃花坞来。虽是自己园中，也不能天天游览，数日之间，已见桃花开满，烂若晴霞，映着一水盈盈，草茵如绣，真觉春光已满。走进了第三重，始见曲榭之中，次贤与宝珠、漱芳在那里喝酒。见了子云，宝珠、漱芳已迎","en":"inn for the farewell; rather than returning directly to his residence, he went straight to the garden and on to Cixian's room — where he learned that Cixian was in the Peach Blossom Dell enjoying the peach blossoms, along with Baozhu and Shufang. Ziyun came to the grove at once. Though it was within his own garden, he could not wander through it every day; in just a"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":3,"tokens":["静宜","次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云笑道：「静宜，今日竟偏我独乐了。」次贤道：「我知道你今日早回，先已虚左而待。」漱芳道：「你不见摆了四个坐儿么！？」子云即在次贤对面坐了。","en":"Ziyun laughed: \\"Jingyi, today you've entirely left me out of your pleasures.\\" Cixian said, \\"Knowing you would return early today, I left a seat waiting for you.\\" Shufang said, \\"Did you not notice there are four places set?\\" Ziyun sat down across from Cixian."},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":2,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"次贤问道：「今日送行的人多么？」子云道：「人倒不少，庾香、剑潭送到前站宿店去了，要明日才回。」即指着宝珠笑道：」惟有他们同队中，不见有一个人在那里送行，只怕这位老先生，生平也没有叫过他们。」宝珠笑道：「这位梅大人，每逢戏酒，叫我们也伺候过几回，人倒谦雅的","en":"Cixian asked: \\"Were there many people at the farewell today?\\" Ziyun said, \\"Quite a few — Yuxiang and Jiantan went to see him off to the first inn overnight, so they will not be back until tomorrow.\\" He then pointed with a smile at Baozhu: \\"I dare say none of"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":2,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这两人既相得了，将来必要找出多少苦恼的事情来，你们慢慢的看着他们罢。」当下这四人喝了一会酒，看了一会花，次贤对宝珠道：「度香所刻那十六个酒令，你们看见没有？」宝珠道：「怎么没有看见。」子云道：「你们今日何不也照这令行几个出来，也见见你们的心思。」宝珠尚未回答，漱芳道：「这个我们只怕行不来，一来心思欠灵，二来这唐诗与《诗经》也不甚熟，那里能说得这样凑拍？除非","en":"them in future — just watch them slowly unfold.\\" The four of them drank for a while and enjoyed the blossoms. Cixian said to Baozhu: \\"Those sixteen drinking-game lines that Duxiang had engraved — have you seen them?\\" Baozhu said, \\"Of course we have.\\" Ziyun said, \\"Why don't you two today compose a few rounds of your own in the same vein? It would give us a chance to"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":2,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"是寻烦恼么？」漱芳道：「我且掷着色样再想。」他也掷了好几掷，掷着了「苏秦背剑」，便道：「这更难了。」忽见宝珠问次贤道：「《诗经》上有一句什么永叹？我记不真。」次贤道：「每有良朋，况也永叹。」宝珠道：「有是有了一个，只就是不甚好。」子云道：「你且说来。」宝珠念道：绿暗红稀，梦好更寻难，你晚妆楼上杏花残。懒画眉，况也永叹。","en":"getting \\"Su Qin Turns His Back on His Sword\\" (苏秦背剑). He said, \\"This is even harder.\\" Then Baozhu was seen asking Cixian: \\"There is a line in *The Classic of Poetry* about \\"sighing without end.\\" I can't recall it exactly.\\" Cixian said:\\n\\n\\"'Whenever I have good companions,\\nAll the more do I sigh without end.'\\"\\n\\nBaozhu said, \\"Good, that's one. Only it's not the most apt.\\""},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":2,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"次贤、子云赞道：「说得很好，第一个就这么通，真是难得。就这《诗经》一句稍差了些，然而也还说得过。」宝珠道：「这《诗经》实在难于凑拍，又要依这个韵，觉得更难了。」漱芳道：「我想的更不好。《诗经》上不是有一句「莫我肯顾」么？」子云道：「有。你快说。」漱芳要念","en":"Cixian and Ziyun both praised him: \\"Very well said, and so coherent for the first one! Truly exceptional. The one line from *The Classic of Poetry* is slightly less apt, but it still works.\\" Baozhu said, \\"The Classic of Poetry is genuinely difficult to fit"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":1,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云道：「这个说得甚好，竟句句凑拍。」次贤道：「倒实在难为他。」宝珠道：「他的比我好，不比我的杂凑。」便觉两颊微红，大有愧色。子云安慰道：「你的也好，不过你的题目宽泛些，难于贴切。他这苏秦背剑的题目就好，所以比你的容易见长。」宝珠得了这一番宽慰，稍为意解。便又掷了一个「紫燕穿帘」，便道：「这","en":"Ziyun said, \\"This is excellently done. Every phrase fits in perfect cadence.\\" Cixian said, \\"It really is a remarkable achievement.\\" Baozhu said, \\"His is better than mine. It leaves mine looking rather mediocre.\\" Yet slight color rose in both cheeks, and there was clear chagrin in his expression. Ziyun offered comfort: \\"Yours is fine"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":1,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云等大赞。漱芳道：「你们知道他这「四边静，爱而不见」，是说得什么？」次贤笑道：「大有春恨怀人之致。」子云也笑。漱芳笑道：「不是。他昨日飞去一个秦吉了。我昨日到他那里去，正遇着他急急的跑出房来，四下张看。","en":"greatly. Shufang said, \\"Do you know what this \\"all around is still, cherished but unseen\\" of his is really about?\\" Cixian smiled: \\"There is a deep charm of spring longing and yearning for someone.\\" Ziyun also laughed. Shufang laughed: \\"That's not it. Yesterday a talking myna flew away from him. Yesterday I went to his place just as he came dashing out of his room in a panic,"},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":2,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，掷了一个，「花开蝶满枝」。漱芳想了一会，说道：花开蝶满枝，是妾断肠时，我是散相思的五瘟使。蝶恋花，春日迟迟。次贤等大赞道：「这个更好。」宝珠道：「他总比我的说得好，我今日的两个都不及他。」便又掷了一个「打破锦屏风」，便道：「这个题目恰好，然难也难极了，须要在打破两字上头着想，若得凑成了，倒是个好令。」漱芳道：「这个难，教我就凑不成，只怕那句《诗经》就不容易。」","en":"Five-Pestilence Emissary who scatters lovesickness.\\nButterfly Loves Flowers (蝶恋花).\\nThe spring days pass slowly, slowly.\\"\\n\\nCixian and the others praised it greatly: \\"This one is even better.\\" Baozhu said, \\"His are always better than mine — both of my rounds today were not as good as his.\\" He threw again and got \\"Smashing the Brocade Screen\\" (打破锦屏风). He said, \\"This is a fine topic"},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":1,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「适或色样重了呢？」次贤道：「重了不算，须要不重的才有趣。」漱芳不得已，掷了好几个重迭色样，然后才掷出一个楚汉争锋，便道：「掷了这个，就算完结了。」子云应允。漱芳便构思起来，一人独自走到桃花丛中去了。子云等也到花丛中游玩，漱芳道：「我想倒想着了一个，就是《唐诗》这一句还有些","en":"\\"What if the dice pattern comes up again as a repeat?\\" Cixian said, \\"A repeat doesn't count. It must be a new one to hold any interest.\\" Shufang had no choice and threw several repeated patterns before finally getting \\"Chu and Han Contend for Supremacy\\" (楚汉争锋). He said, \\"Now that I've thrown this, I'll call it"},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":3,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"大家赞好。子云道：「今日又得了六个，共有二十二个了，将来能凑成一百个就好了。」次贤道：「一百个是不能，况且骨牌名没有这许多，曲牌名是尽够，不如去了这骨牌名换个别样，或者凑得成百数。若用骨牌名，可用的也不过五六十个，内中有几个有趣的，偏掷不着，如公领孙、锺馗抹额、贪花不满，三十秃爪龙等类，凑起来必有妙语。就是限定《西厢》也窄一点儿，","en":"more, bringing our total to twenty-two. It would be wonderful if we could eventually collect a full hundred.\\" Cixian said, \\"A hundred is not attainable. Besides, there are not that many bone-tile names (gǔ pái míng). Tune-pattern names (qǔ pái míng) are more than sufficient. It would be better to drop the bone-tile names and replace them with something else; that way,"}],"16":[{"paragraph":24,"mentions":1,"tokens":["萧静宜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"你们怡园同席之后，他就不大招呼人，对我们讲话，总喜欢说梅花，就搭不上这句话，也硬搭上来。说喜得是怡园梅崦，又要萧静宜画了四幅各色的梅花，这也罢了。","en":"topic. He constantly remarks how fortunate he is that Garden of Contentment has a Plum Knoll and even asked Xiao Jingyi to paint four hanging scrolls of plum blossoms in various colors. That much might be overlooked, but...\\""}],"17":[{"paragraph":4,"mentions":1,"tokens":["萧静宜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"！我非遗漏，我恐他的事情多。未必能来。」子玉道：「度香应酬虽多，然看其性情光景，我们请他，虽有事也必来的。就是萧静宜，也断不可不请。」大家说：「很好，就添上这两位是了。那是九个，合上那八个，是十七个，也就很热闹了。」南湘道：「没有人了？」王恂道：「尚有何人呢？」南湘道：「你好记性，你既大会群花，倒忘了一个花王。既有庾香，没有玉侬，独使他一人向隅，是何道理？」","en":"engagements, judging by his temperament, if we invite him, he will certainly come regardless of his busyness. And Xiao Jingyi must absolutely be invited as well.\\" Everyone said: \\"Splendid, we shall simply add those two. That makes nine, and together with the eight, it is seventeen—a truly bustling assembly.\\" Nanxiang said: \\"Is there no one else?\\" Wang Xun said: \\"Who else could"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":1,"tokens":["静宜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"之卅六，红豆齐抛；备翡翠之千双，紫云任请。\\n肃笺申启，代面丁宁。\\n早发高轩，同光下里。梅子玉顿白。上度香先生、静宜逸士阁下。\\n子玉写完封好，用上图章，即付小厮交与门房，明早着人送到怡园，后日请徐、萧二位老爷，同到刘大少爷宅内饮酒，须要交代明白。小厮答应了，子玉亦即安寝，一夜无话。","en":"lane with your radiant presence. Mei Ziyu bows in respect. To the honored desks of Master Duxiang and the recluse Jingyi.\\"\\n\\nHaving finished writing and sealed the letter, he affixed his seal and handed it to a page to deliver to the gatehouse, instructing that it be sent to the Garden of Contentment first thing the next morning, to invite Masters Xu and Xiao to drink at"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":1,"tokens":["静宜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，去访琴言，恰值他师傅请客没有进去，琴言亦未知庾香去访他。明日就使他们两个不来，也有八人，很为热闹的了。庾香、静宜想一定来的。」南湘道：「席间行令，新鲜的甚少，太难了又恐座客一时不能，须得雅俗共赏，易知易能的，又要避熟。\\n射覆等令，亦觉无趣。」王恂道：「从前在此对诗的令倒可以。」文泽道：「再行此令，亦觉无味。且到明日见景生情罢。」是日王恂等就在文泽处吃饭，又谈了","en":"Even if those two do not come tomorrow, there are still eight, which will be lively enough. I imagine Yuxiang and Jingyi will certainly grace us.\\" Nanxiang said: \\"As for drinking games at the banquet, there are very few fresh ones. If they are too abstruse, I fear the guests may be unable to manage them on the spot. We need something that appeals to both refined and common"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":1,"tokens":["萧静宜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"春航磊落自负，以干谒为耻，未尝怀刺一谒要津，宁居萧寺，玉人作伴，名士同声。蕙芳又替他结交了许多好友，如徐度香、萧静宜、刘文泽、史南湘、颜仲清、王恂等。仲清前与春航不睦，原是激励春航之意；经高品将其中情节剖明，又说起仲清仍送五十金作浇裹之费，春航自然十分感激敬佩。仲清叫蕙芳为之转弯，更觉比前相好。惟有子玉，尚未谋面。是日知文泽等为蕙芳做生日，心上虽十分欢喜，又因他二","en":"celebrated men of the same voice. Huifang also helped him befriend many worthy companions, such as Xu Duxiang, Xiao Jingyi, Liu Wenze, Shi Nanxiang, Yan Zhongqing, and Wang Xun. Zhongqing's previous discord with Chunhang had originally been intended to spur Chunhang onward; after Gao Pin illuminated the underlying circumstances, and mentioned that Zhongqing was still sending"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":1,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"田郎可谓瑜亮并生矣！」子玉又与陆素兰等相见，忽听外面说：「徐老爷同萧老爷来了。」众人一齐出厅迎接，只见子云同了次贤翩翩的，俨似太原公子裼裘而来，后面随着袁宝珠、王兰保二人。再后还有八个清俊书童，拿着衣包、铜盆、漱盂等物。","en":"and Master Xiao have arrived!\\" Everyone went out from the hall together to welcome them; there came Ziyun and Cixian, moving gracefully as scions of great families draped in their furs, with Yuan Baozhu and Wang Lanbao following behind. Further back were eight bright-faced and handsome young attendants carrying clothing bundles, bronze basins, and rinsing vessels."},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":3,"tokens":["次贤","静宜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"蕙芳抢上几步行了礼，子云、次贤两边扶起来道：「媚香一向洒脱，今日忽然拘礼，不是倒累了你了。」遂进室内，与诸人相见，群旦亦都见毕，叙齿坐下。子云道：「蒙庾香、前舟及诸兄折柬相招，今日之举，可为极盛。昨已饱读庾香珠玉，今日尚觉齿有余芬。又复当此群花大会，使弟等附骥餐芳，实为快事。」次","en":"Huifang stepped forward several paces to bow; Ziyun and Cixian each helped him up from one side and said: \\"Meixiang has always been easy and unconstrained, so why so formal today? Surely you are putting us to too much trouble.\\" They then entered the room and exchanged greetings with all present. All the young dan"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":2,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"寿翁寿母上坐？」春航、蕙芳同道：「这断断不敢，自然叙齿为妙。」众人也说叙齿罢了。文泽送酒，先定中间一席。论齿是次贤为长，次贤自知不能推逊，只得依了，并坐者为高品，次是仲清；左首一席，子云为首，次南湘，次子玉；右首一席，田春航为首，次王恂，文泽作陪。是每席三位。","en":"Everyone agreed to go by seniority. Wenze arranged the wines, and the center table was first set in order. By age, Cixian was eldest; knowing he could not refuse, he took the seat of honor, with Gao Pin beside him, then Zhongqing. The left-hand table had Ziyun at the head, then Nanxiang, then Ziyu. The right-hand table had Tian Chunhang at the head, then Wang Xun, with"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":1,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"是琴言不来，使庾香不能畅意。」子云道：「可不是！琴言的病颇为古怪，精神疲软，饮食不思，已经十余天了，不见好。」次贤道：「我昨日诊他的脉，似积劳，兼之感愤忧郁，昨日痰中竟有血点，非静养数月不能痊愈。」","en":"rather mysterious: listless in spirit, no desire to eat or drink; it has been over ten days with no improvement.\\" Cixian said: \\"Yesterday I took his pulse, and it appeared to be accumulated fatigue compounded by pent-up emotion and melancholy. Yesterday there were specks of blood in his phlegm; without several months of complete rest he cannot recover.\\""},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":3,"tokens":["静宜","次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉在炕上听得清楚，不免更觉烦闷。仲清道：「今日之事，不可无文辞翰墨。静宜先生可绘一图，并作一序，以记雅集，我辈藉可附骥。」次贤道：「作图呢，弟当效劳。至于高文典册，自有群公大手笔在。山人寒瘦之语，不称金谷繁华，反使名花减色。」众人道：「太谦了。」子云道：「今日起意是因媚香，引得百花齐放，胜唐宫之剪彩。弟意欲仰观诸兄珠玉，","en":"feeling more agitated. Zhongqing said: \\"Today's occasion cannot be without literature and calligraphy. Let Master Jingyi paint a picture and compose a preface to record this elegant gathering, so that we may attach our names to it.\\" Cixian said: \\"As for painting a picture, I will offer my services. But as for lofty essays and classic texts, we have the great brushes of"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":3,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"于是以年齿为先后，仍系次贤为首，次子云，次高品，次南湘，次文泽，次仲清，次春航，次王恂，次子玉，共是九人。王恂已将子玉叫醒，净净脸，素兰取出一颗醒酒丸给子玉吃了。子玉不好意思，只得勉强扎挣。素兰见子玉不语不言，似醉非醉，心上猜着是为琴言未来。一因人多不好解慰他，二因提起琴言反","en":"So they proceeded in order of age, with Cixian again taking the lead, followed by Ziyun, then Gao Pin, then Nanxiang, then Wenze, then Zhongqing, then Chunhang, then Wang Xun, and finally Ziyu, making nine people in all. Wang Xun had already roused Ziyu and had him wash his face; Sulan brought out"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":1,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这雄蛱蝶倒有些难对。」因细细的凝思，仲清道：「快交卷子，外边吹打要开门了。」文泽道：「有了。鸳鸯虽小总相亲。」次贤、子云道：「这却对得好，又工又切。」南湘道：「也亏他。」文泽就放下笔，仲清道：「怎么一句就算了？」提醒了文泽，笑道：「你催得紧，我忘了。」又想一想，写道：「化工细选无瑕琢。」众人道：「此句亦出得好，又转韵了。」仲清接着写道：「一一雕镌设眉目。费尽龙宫","en":"striking to open the gates.\\" Wenze said: \\"I have it. Though the mandarin ducks are small, they are always close.\\" Cixian and Ziyun said: \\"That is a fine match, both skillful and apt.\\" Nanxiang said: \\"Credit to him.\\" Wenze laid down his brush; Zhongqing said: \\"How can one line be enough?\\" Wenze laughed: \\"You pushed so hard, I forgot.\\" He thought a moment more and wrote:"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":1,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"言唱那《惊梦》的神情，所以有」曾回玉女眸」一句。众人不解其故，不过见其兴致不佳，故尔意不在诗，空衍了些。该又是次贤，接道：「镜里芙蓉睡新足。宛转歌成白纻词。」又转到子云，接道：「娇柔解唱红绡曲。清颖偶触便魂销。」高品道：「魂消兮可奈何？」即写道：「铜雀春深大小乔。花有连枝称姊妹。」南湘道：「好便好，铜雀句有些打混。」即对道：「玉如合璧定琼瑶。纤腰扭入灵和柳」众人","en":"were poor and his mind not really on the poetry, so the lines came out somewhat flat and diffuse. It was again Cixian's turn; he wrote:\\n\\n\\"In the mirror, the lotus face, fresh from sleep;\\nthe charming voice forms the white-ramie song.\\"\\n\\nNext came Ziyun:\\n\\n\\"Lithe and pliant, knowing how to sing the red-gauze melody;\\na clear and nimble beauty, touched by chance, the soul"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":1,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"气呢。」子玉道：「何故？」桂保接口道：「他有他的心肠。」子玉接道：「绮席花筵日易夜。英华美可咏同车。」二轮又到次贤，遂写道：「元白诗原结莲社。红氍毹上艳情多。」子云接道：「惯唱《丁娘十索》歌。葑菲彩无遗下体。」高品道：「妙、妙！这句待我对一句好的。」群旦听了料定又要取笑他们，便都围拢来看着高品写的什么。","en":"day turns easily to night;\\nin splendor and beauty, worthy of the 'Same Carriage' ode.\\"\\n\\nThe second round came to Cixian, who wrote:\\n\\n\\"Yuan and Bai's poems, originally formed amid lotus gatherings;\\non the red felt stage-carpet, passion and sentiment in abundance.\\"\\n\\nZiyun continued:\\n\\n\\"Practiced in singing 'Lady Ding's Ten Requests';\\nthe plain and beautiful, no humble part"},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":1,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"次贤重写了一篇，朗吟数过道：「竟是一气呵成，不见联缀痕迹，明日我就画一幅群花斗艳图何如！」众皆应道：「妙极！我们何不将人花比拟一回，总要从公，不可各存偏见。」于是大家评定：以宝珠为牡丹，蕙芳为芍药，素兰为莲花，玉林为碧桃，漱芳为海棠，兰保为玫瑰，桂保为芙","en":"Cixian made a fair copy and read through it several times aloud: \\"It truly flows in one unbroken breath, with no sign of stitching or joint.\\" He said: \\"Tomorrow I will paint a 'Picture of the Hundred Flowers Competing in Beauty', how would that be?\\" Everyone"},{"paragraph":30,"mentions":1,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"次贤道：「夜已深了，我们可以散罢。」于是大家各起，宝珠又订十八日之期，皆应允了，风雨不阻，遂各登舆四散。明日蕙芳踵门叩谢，惟有子玉病了，不曾进去。","en":"Cixian said: \\"The night is already deep, so we can disperse.\\" So everyone rose; Baozhu confirmed the date of the eighteenth, everyone agreed, come rain or shine. Then they each mounted their carriages and scattered in all directions. The next day, Huifang went"}],"20":[{"paragraph":5,"mentions":1,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"为河间胡太尊请去修志，刘文泽是他岳母惦记他，来接他并其室吴氏，同到直隶总督衙门去了。此中已少了三人，只有子云、次贤、南湘、仲清、春航、王恂六人，不时往来。","en":"along with his wife née Wu to the office of the Viceroy of Zhili. So three of the group were gone; only Ziyun, Cixian, Nanxiang, Zhongqing, Chunhang, and Wang Xun — six people — continued to meet from time to time."},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":2,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一日，子云、次贤招诸名士到园看龙舟，并赏榴花。此日是五月初一，正值王通政生日，虽不做寿，家中却也有些至交好友亲戚同年来贺，内里又有些太太姑娘们，如梅宅的颜夫人，孙宅的陆夫人之类，也觉得热闹。王恂与仲清这怡园之约，就不能去了。是日子云、次贤知道了，也去拜拜寿，适遇南湘","en":"One day, Ziyun and Cixian invited the celebrated gentlemen to the garden to view the dragon boat and enjoy the pomegranate blossoms. This day was the first of the fifth month, which happened also to be Commissioner Wang's birthday; though no formal celebration was held, a number"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":1,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"但只不要候，迟早不定。次贤等应了，才回怡园，同到了迎面峭壁之下。进了一个院落，子云便请大家宽了公服。又道：「今日天气甚热，红日照人，且龙舟在吟秋水榭，榴花在小赤城，离此颇远，不如乘马过去。」家人们已预先备马伺候，即带过来，四人都乘上了。从峭壁下左手转弯，高高低低，曲曲折折，走","en":"\\"But don't wait for us — we may be early or late.\\" Cixian and the others agreed and returned to the Garden of Contentment. Coming together to the foot of the steep rock face at the garden's entrance, Ziyun invited everyone to change out of their formal attire. He also said: \\"The day is very hot and the red"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":5,"tokens":["静宜","次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"！文心一至于此，即匡庐之香炉峰，何以过之。」南湘道：「前似王麓台，此似萧尺木，幽邃处却不险仄。」子云道：「此皆静宜手笔，布置时曾数易其稿。」次贤道：「也亏那几株松树，不然也就一望易尽。」春航道：「正不知静宜先生胸中有多少丘壑，的是驱排河岳神手。倪云林、徐青藤定当把臂入林。」次贤只得谦让几句。四人小憩了一回，走下石磴来，侧面有五间楼阁，恰作参差高下两层，似楼非楼，","en":"evokes Xiao Chizhu—secluded and deep, without being narrow or perilous.\\" Ziyun noted: \\"This was all designed by Jingyi; when laying out the arrangement, he revised his drafts numerous times.\\" Cixian added: \\"It is thanks to those ancient pines; otherwise, the eye would exhaust the view in a single glance.\\" Chunhang said: \\"One can only wonder how many landscapes reside"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":2,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"次贤笑道：「所谓「打鸭惊鸳鸯」，今日见了。」大家正看得有趣，又见船中走出几枝花来。一只船内是宝珠、漱芳，一只船内是蕙芳、素兰，共是五个。舟人把舟泊近阑干，南湘道：「芙蓉未开，水榭减色。有此众芳一渡，庶不寂寞。湘娥洛神，江湄游戏，我度香先生当以玉佩要之。」","en":"Cixian laughed: \\"The proverb about 'catching the duck and startling the mandarin ducks' — today one sees it in action.\\" While everyone was watching with interest, they saw figures stepping out of the boats like blossoming flowers: one boat held Baozhu and Shufang,"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":1,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"。顶上站着一个扎成的金毛孔雀，船内用石压底，两边共有二十四人荡桨。有个八音班，在内打动锣鼓丝竹，粗细十番。此是次贤在江苏看过，画出图样，选匠造制。春航是从南边来，也曾见过，即道：「实在制得华丽，就是常州府的龙舟，是甲于一省的，也不过如此。」","en":"drums, gongs, strings, and winds, both the coarse ten-beat and the refined varieties. This design had been seen by Cixian in Jiangsu and drawn in a sketch from which artisans had been engaged to build it. Chunhang had come from the south and had also seen something like it before; he said: \\"Truly magnificently made — even the dragon boats of Changzhou Prefecture, the finest"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":2,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"龙尾上挂着个秋千架子，两个孩子一上一下的打秋千。次贤道：「还请到底下去看罢，自上望下，不如自下望上好。」众人即下了雁齿扶梯，仍到第一层，已见正中廊前摆了一个圆桌。此会是宾主四人，名花五人。子云便要穿衣，经史、田三位止住，只得就便服送了酒，依齿而坐。东首是南湘，子云命兰保坐在肩下。西首是春航，肩下是蕙芳","en":"At the stern of the dragon boat hung a swing frame, with two children swinging up and down. Cixian said: \\"Please, let's go back down to look — looking from above down is not as fine as looking from below up.\\" Everyone descended the goose-step stairway back to the first story, where they found a round table already set out in the front corridor of"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":5,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云叫了进来，再斟了酒。次贤道：「我们今日就以此为令何如？」众人问道：「怎样做令？」次贤问那些家人道：「去年园中结那些大葫芦，想来还有。」家人应道：「有十几个漆的，其余是没有漆的。」次贤便叫把漆的拿来。不多一刻，家人就提了一大串来，解开绳子，放在一张空桌上。次贤又叫拿那副酒筹来","en":"Ziyun called them back inside and poured fresh cups. Cixian said: \\"Shall we use this as the basis of a drinking game today?\\" Everyone asked: \\"How would the game work?\\" Cixian asked the servants: \\"Those large gourds that were cultivated in the garden last year — I imagine you still have some.\\" The servants replied:"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":5,"tokens":["次贤","萧次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"次贤便把葫芦揭开盖子，每一个放下一个酒筹，仍旧将盖子旋紧，命家童抛下水去。」看拿到那一个的，便是那一个喝酒，这是极公道的顽意儿。」众人道：「极是，但不知筹上写些什么。」次贤道：「方才这副筹，是《水浒传》上的人，各有饮酒的故事，我是随手数的，不知是那几个名","en":"Cixian then lifted the lid of a gourd, placed one tally inside each, screwed the lid back on tight, and instructed the pages to throw them into the water. \\"Whoever's gourd is retrieved — that is the person who must drink. This is a perfectly fair amusement.\\""},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":5,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「子云笑道：「座中谁是阎婆惜呢？」众人笑了。次贤道：「不消说，是并肩坐的这两个了，且仍是你自饮，用是用不着他们，但劝是要劝的。」子云带笑饮了一杯，又将一杯对素兰道：「香畹你是个好人，你莫要学那阎婆惜，心上只记着张三郎，不瞅不睬的，你且饮这一杯罢。」引得众人笑起来。素兰本待要饮，因为众人一笑，便脸上","en":"Ziyun laughed: \\"Who is Yan Poxi among us?\\" Everyone laughed. Cixian said: \\"No need to guess — it's the two sitting right beside you; and moreover, you still drink it yourself. There's no need for them, but you still have to invite them.\\" Ziyun laughed and drank one cup, then offered a cup to Sulan: \\"Xiangwan — you are"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":1,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"」众人道：「这还可以，在不即不离之间。况且真是个姓金的，怎么遇得这般凑巧？」漱芳只得弹起琵琶，敬了南湘、春航、次贤三人。","en":"extraordinary coincidence!\\" Shufang had no choice but to take up the pipa, and offered cups to Nanxiang, Chunhang, and Cixian."},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":3,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"大笑道：「今日就是媚香与湘帆牵缠不清。」蕙芳红着脸道：「这是你们有心做成的，不然为什么单是这两根筹这么样呢？」次贤道：「冤枉冤哉！算我有心捡出的，难道你们又有心捡过去吗？」原来筹上写的是：「一丈青捉王矮虎。」注：「后成夫妇，与并坐的手牵红巾，饮三个交杯，合席共贺一杯。」春航欲要改令，怎禁得大家不依，只得拿块帕子与蕙芳递着，各饮了半杯，第三次惹得合席说了又笑，笑了","en":"and he said: \\"You've arranged this on purpose — otherwise why would only these two tallies come out like this?\\" Cixian said: \\"An absolutely unjust accusation! Say I purposely chose them — did you then purposely choose to draw them?\\" The inscription read: \\"Yi Zhangqing Captures Wang Duanhu.\\" The annotation: \\"After, they became husband and wife; hold a red handkerchief"},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":1,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"天色已晚，南湘、春航要回，小使送上衣帽，各人穿戴，谢了主人并次贤，绕道出园。子云道：「今日本有一事要烦两兄。园中各处的对联尚须添设几副，今日倒被龙舟耽误了，迟日再请一游，并约庾香、剑潭诸君何如？」史、田二人应了，遂上车而去。这边相公五人，也各陆续散去。这回怡园二次宴客，可惜人少未齐，不晓下卷又叙何人，再俟细细想来","en":"leave; small attendants brought their outer garments and hats, they dressed and put them on, thanked the host and Cixian, and took the roundabout path out of the garden. Ziyun said: \\"Today there was actually one matter I had meant to trouble you two gentlemen with. The paired inscriptions for various spots throughout the garden still need several more sets added; today"}],"21":[{"paragraph":5,"mentions":1,"tokens":["萧次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"是炕，中间挂一幅《寿阳点额图》。旁有一联是：「心抱冰壶秋月，人依纸帐梅花。炕几上一个胆瓶，插了一枝梅花。一边是萧次贤画的四幅红梅，一边是徐子云写的四幅篆字。窗前放着一张古砖香梨木的琴桌，上有一张梅花古段文的瑶琴。里头一间是卧房了，却垂着个月色秋罗绣花软帘，绣的是各色梅花。","en":"against a paper canopy.\\" On the kang table a vase held a spray of plum; to one side four panels of red plum by Xiao Cixian; to the other four seal-script scrolls by Xu Ziyun. Before the window stood an antique brick-and-pearwood qin stand bearing a plum-patterned duan qin. The inner chamber hung a moonlight autumn-gauze embroidered curtain patterned with every variety of"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":3,"tokens":["静宜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「什么笑话？你快快说罢。」素兰道：「媚香的生日，田湘帆做了一篇小序，大家说做得好，度香便抄了。那一天，庾香来，静宜便将小序给庾香看，庾香也赞了几声。度香在旁说道：「湘帆好一个浓艳文心，愈艳愈好，愈浓愈好。」度香正赞湘帆的文章，庾香忽说道：「玉侬自然在玉艳之上，玉艳虽好，尚逊瑶卿、媚香一筹，而玉侬则玉树琼花，似非人间花谱中可以位置。」静宜、度香初听了不知他说些什么","en":"Meixiang's birthday Tian Xiangfan wrote a short preface — everyone praised it — Duxiang copied it. The day Yuxiang came Jingyi showed him the piece; Yuxiang admired it. Standing by, Duxiang said: 'Xiangfan's style — the thicker the richer — the richer the better.' Jingyi and Duxiang at first did not catch Yuxiang's drift — then realized: he misheard 'thick and rich' as asking"}],"22":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"徐老爷送来的，明日请逛运河，并要回信呢。子玉取过书来一看，觉得封面上字迹，写着梅少爷手启，端端正正，不像子云、次贤笔迹，因想道：「或是叫书童写的也未可知。即拆开一看，第一行是陆素兰谨启，庾香公子吟坛云云。」心中倒觉跳了一跳，香畹何故作札来，莫非玉侬有什么缘故么？遂即一字字的细看，看完了又看，至两三遍，脸上便自然发出笑来，便对云儿道：「你去叫来人候一候，我即写回信","en":"envelope inscribed \\"For the hand of Young Master Mei\\" in neat, upright characters, quite unlike the hand of Ziyun or Cixian, and thought: \\"Perhaps he set a page-boy to write it.\\" He opened it, and the first line read: \\"Lu Sulan respectfully addresses the poetic altar of Master Yuxiang\\" — at which his heart gave a leap. Why should Xiangwan be writing to him? Could something"}],"24":[{"paragraph":3,"mentions":1,"tokens":["萧次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"个大纨袴，然其为人雍容大雅，度量过人。爱博而不泛，气盛而不骄。且无我无人，涵盖一切，是情中之主人。」因又道：「萧次贤如野鹤闲云，尚有名士结习。但其纯静处，人不能及。终日相对，娓娓无倦容，其情可见在此。竹君恃才傲物，卓荦不群。唯用情处为甚恳挚，虽其狂态难掩，而究少克伐之心。卓然如云行水流，随处遇合，竟无成心，凡事出以天趣。且辞锋尖利，而独于所好者，便不忍加一刻薄语，","en":"For him, the boundary between self and other dissolves entirely; he is the very host of passion.\\" He continued, \\"Xiao Cixian is like a wild crane or an idle cloud, retaining the habits of a wandering scholar. Yet in moments of stillness, none can match him; one could converse with him all day without weariness—his passion reveals itself in that quiet endurance. Nanxiang is"},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":2,"tokens":["静宜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"演习新戏。」仲清道：「什么新戏呢？」玉林道：「闻得六月初六日荷花生日，华公子要来逛园。度香为他是爱听戏的，即与静宜商量。静宜说：「华公子是爱新鲜热闹的，若说寻常的戏，他都已听过，而且这几个班子也未必能赛过他的八龄班。我想不若把各班中，挑出几个来，集个大成班，我再谱出些新戏来，便不与外间的相同，也就耳目一新了。」仲清道：「这倒很好。但不知戏文何如，是些什么戏呢？」","en":"Birthday, and Young Master Hua plans to tour the garden. Since Duxiang knows he loves the opera, he consulted Jingyi. Jingyi said that Young Master Hua has already heard all the ordinary plays, and no troupe could possibly surpass his own Eight Ages company. Therefore, it would be better to pick the brightest stars from several different companies, assemble them into"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":1,"tokens":["静宜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"》内题出这几个戏名是：《李陵返汉》、《燕丹灭秦》、《诸葛延年》、《明妃归汉》等事，共有八九种。」玉林道：「如今静宜又添了四种是：「《金谷园绿珠投楼》、《马嵬驿杨妃随驾》、《李谪仙夜郎奉诏》、《杜拾遗金殿承恩》，这四本戏更觉热闹，差不多要全部出场。」仲清道：「这四种更妙，为普天下才子佳人吐气。马嵬赐缳之事，千古伤心。且羯胡之叛，祸在国忠，于玉妃何罪？那些丛书稗史，","en":"Destroys Qin,' 'Zhuge Yan Nian,' and 'The Bright Consort Returns to Han'—eight or nine in total.\\" Yulin continued, \\"Jingyi has added four more: 'Green Pearl Throws Herself from the Golden Valley Garden,' 'Consort Yang Follows the Carriage at Mawei Post,' 'Li the Banished Immortal Receives the Edict at Yelang,' and 'Du the Remonstrator Honored in the Golden Hall.' These require"}],"25":[{"paragraph":6,"mentions":1,"tokens":["静宜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"两天，他夫人要弄璋了，一步不离伺候。剑潭见诸人不来，也就辞了。昨日只得邀了张仲雨，倒是同华公子相识的。余外就是静宜，共有五人，只有两席。他们没有会过华公子，不晓得是怎么一个富贵骄奢的气概，所以不肯来。你也长见的，其实也不见怎样，不过气势自高，侍从华美而已。","en":"but to invite Zhang Zhongyu, who does happen to be acquainted with Young Master Hua. Besides him there is only Jingyi — five of us in all, which leaves just two tables. The others have never met Young Master Hua and have no idea what sort of lordly, extravagant manner he cuts, which is why they would not come. You have seen him often enough yourself — in truth there"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":2,"tokens":["次贤","静宜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"文泽便问次贤在何处，子云道：「静宜因今日新戏出场，内中有些关节，并声律尚有些不谐处，亲自在那里一一指点，少停就来的。」正说之间，张仲雨到了，子云迎接进来，文泽起身相见。见仲雨的服饰，今日与平日不同，往常仲雨是个从九品衔，今日冠服，忽然是个六品，与他一样，想必又加","en":"Wenze then asked where Cixian was. Ziyun said: \\"Jingyi is directing today's new plays in person. There are still a number of passages where the staging is not quite right, and the musical modes remain somewhat discordant in places, so he is correcting each one himself. He will be"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":2,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"是花了本钱来的，比不得你们这些有福之人，一出书房就得了官。我将来不过看什么钱可要不可要就是了。」说得众人皆笑。次贤即从屏后出来，大家见了，诸名旦也都随着出来见过。大家又坐谈了一会，只见家人上前禀道：「华公子快到门了。」子云吩咐速备椅轿，在园门伺候，即请次贤陪着文泽等，自己忙整理衣冠，迎出含万楼来。","en":"may properly be taken and money that may not — that is all.\\" This set the whole company laughing. At that moment Cixian emerged from behind the screen, and everyone greeted him; the celebrated dan actors all followed him out and were introduced as well. They all sat chatting for a while longer when a household servant came forward and announced: \\"Young Master Hua is nearly"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":4,"tokens":["次贤","静宜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"又对次贤作了一揖道：「静宜先生费心了，排出这些戏，叫我们看戏的何以为报呢？今日大家只有多敬几杯酒酬劳的了。」次贤哈哈大笑道：「恐下里之音，不当清听。如蒙颔赏，鄙人愿代诸君浮一大白。」大家笑说：「很好。」酒筵已齐，家人即捧酒来，子云送酒安席。东边是华公子首座，","en":"He bowed to Cixian: \\"Master Jingyi took trouble to arrange these plays — how shall we watchers repay? Today we offer a few extra cups.\\" Cixian laughed loudly: \\"Rustic tunes may wound refined ears — if you nod once I shall gladly drain a full cup for everyone.\\" All agreed"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":1,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"见他举止似乎没熟练，然而秀外慧中，觉有出尘之致。」就点了一出，又将各人的戏也都点了。送到文泽面前，文泽、仲雨、次贤，大家公商点了几出。开了场，加官出来，献上世受国恩」，那林珊枝就走上来，拿出一个赏封望台上一抛，文泽等亦各赏了。","en":"piece for Qinyan and chose plays for all the rest as well. The program was passed to Wenze; Wenze, Zhongyu, and Cixian conferred together and added several more selections. The performance opened with the auspicious prologue, after which the \\"Conferring of Blessings\\" figure appeared, presenting the inscription \\"Generations Blessed by Imperial Grace.\\" Lin Shanzhi then"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":1,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，吩咐了一句话，珊枝出去了一回，就有十六个人，抬上八张桌子，赏了八十吊钱。主人照样发赏，文泽也赏了八桌，仲雨、次贤各赏了四桌。","en":"reward. The host distributed his rewards in the same fashion; Wenze too rewarded eight tables, while Zhongyu and Cixian rewarded four apiece."},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":2,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"世蕃之美人双陆，未必尽佳；杨国忠之姬妾屏风，恐非全美。当下把华公子竟看得眉飞色舞，豪兴顿生，便要了大杯，先敬了次贤一杯。次贤自觉得逸兴霞飞，十分得意，即连饮了三大觞。华公子亦陪了三杯。又命家人把酒送到台上，命宝珠、素兰、琴言、蕙芳，各饮三杯，并将席间果品赏了四碟，四旦遥遥叩谢。又劝合席各饮了三大杯。","en":"brows danced and his face glowed; heroic spirits surging within him, he called for a larger cup and first toasted Cixian. Cixian, his own spirits soaring like rosy clouds, was in the highest of moods and promptly drained three great goblets in succession. Young Master Hua matched him with three cups of his own. He then ordered a servant to carry wine to the stage, commanding"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":1,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"是绝妙无双，人家唱不来的，可惜偏又雷同。」文泽道：「何不叫他们两人同唱，各尽其妙，做个珠联璧合，岂不更好吗？」次贤、仲雨皆说：「极妙。虽然是工力悉敌，究竟亦有些异同处，亦可借此细细品题。」华公子大笑道：「这倒新鲜有趣，从未有两人同唱的，就是《寻梦》这一出，可以同唱。」子云即传与戏班，在两厢伺候，又命把桌子往上挪了。宝珠、琴言出去上妆。不多一回，听得豪竹哀丝，铮鏦","en":"said: \\"Why not pair the two sides and sing together — each perfecting his part — pearls strung on one string?\\" Cixian and Zhongyu both said: \\"Excellent — though evenly matched there will still be shades to savor.\\" Young Master Hua laughed: \\"Fresh — I have never seen two sing the same piece together — even 'Pursuing the Dream' may be doubled.\\" Ziyun relayed orders to"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":2,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"不动，目视子云。子云会意，也自知酒量不敌，便说道：「实在贱量不能多饮，愿将门杯以当大斗罢。」华公子犹不肯依，经次贤、文泽、仲雨都来解劝，说：「非特度香不能，就是我们都也陪不来的，以小杯罚他三杯罢。」华公子也知子云酒量平常，只得依了。众人请子云连饮了三杯，自己却用大杯一杯一杯的不用人让，一连饮了十几杯，尚觉喝采不住，又逼住了文泽饮了三杯，次贤、仲雨饮了五六杯。华公","en":"truly cannot stomach more — let my door cup stand for your great dipper.\\" Young Master Hua still refused until Cixian, Wenze, and Zhongyu mediated: \\"Not only Duxiang — none of us could match those cups — fine him three small cups instead.\\" Knowing Ziyun drank little, Young Master Hua yielded. They made Ziyun drain three cups in succession while he himself, needing no"},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":1,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"次贤道：「我看华公子，倒是个怜香惜玉的人，外面传闻之言是不可信，今日这一天终是温温和和，并没有什么公子脾气。玉侬见人也不可一味太冷淡了。」琴言被众人讲得，似乎要他去亲近华公子的意思，便气忿忿的无处发泄，因想道：「别人说我也罢，就是度香不该。他既知我与庾香","en":"Cixian said, \\"I see Young Master Hua as a man who truly cherishes fragrance and pities jade — the rumors outside are simply not to be believed. Throughout this whole day he has been mild and warm, without a trace of a spoiled young master's arrogance. Yunong"}],"30":[{"paragraph":4,"mentions":2,"tokens":["次贤","萧次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，华公子想起六月二十一日在怡园观剧，说秋凉了请度香过来。因想十五日是家宴之辰，不便请客，即定于十四日，请子云、次贤、文泽等，在西园中铺设了几处，并有灯戏。为他们是城外人，日间断不能尽兴，于下贴时说明了夜宴。此日正是秋试二场，刘文泽为什么不应举呢？这一科大主考即系文泽之父大宗伯刘守正，副主考系王文辉，已升了阁学，陆宗沅、杨芳猷、周锡爵、孙亮功一班可可的一齐分房，将","en":"fifteenth would be a family banquet and inconvenient for guests, he set the date for the fourteenth, inviting Ziyun, Cixian, Wenze, and others. He arranged several spots in the West Garden and prepared lantern plays. Because they lived outside the city, a daytime gathering would definitely not be enough for them to fully enjoy themselves, so he specified a night banquet in"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":1,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"且说十四日早，子云与次贤商议道：「今日华公子请我作通宵之饮，且闻赏灯，他今日必有一番热闹局面，并闻五大名班合唱。」即传家人分派跟班，检点衣服什物，零星珍宝赏需等类。总管预备好了，交与家人点过，免得临时短少。说着已到未初，当下二人早吃了早饭，穿了衣裳，上车一径往华府来。","en":"On the morning of the fourteenth, Ziyun discussed with Cixian: \\"Today Young Master Hua has invited us for an all-night feast and to view lanterns. There must be quite a lively scene today, and I heard five famous troupes will perform together.\\" He then ordered his servants to assign attendants, check clothes and"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":2,"tokens":["萧次贤","次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"舆抬进，直进了垂花门，到大厅下轿。华公子出迎叙礼。即开了中门，宾主四人，慢慢的走进来，又走了两进，才是恩庆堂。萧次贤是初次登堂，便留心观望。这恩庆堂极为壮丽，崇轮巍奂，峻宇雕墙，铺设得华美庄严，五色成彩。堂基深敞，中间靠外是三面阑干，上挂彩幔，下铺绒毯，便是戏台，两边退室通着戏房。宾主重新叙礼，将要坐时，魏聘才同着张仲雨出来。一一相见了礼，遂即叙齿坐下，讲了些寒温","en":"guests walked slowly inside, passing through two more courtyards before reaching the Enqing Hall. Since this was Xiao Cixian's first time there, he looked around carefully. The Enqing Hall was extremely magnificent, with towering roofs and carved walls, grandly and beautifully furnished with colorful decorations. The foundation of the hall was deep and spacious. In the middle,"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":4,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"人让酒，四客饮了几杯，上过了几样肴馔，正是罗列着海错山珍，说不尽腥浓肥脆。清谈妙语，佐以诙谐。那边席上，聘才问次贤怡园的光景。次贤略述了几处。随后即见宝珠、蕙芳、素兰、漱芳、玉林、兰保、桂保，春喜、琪官等九个，又凑上一个，作了一出《秦淮河看花大会》，有幽闲的，有妖冶的，有静婉的，有风流的，极尽靡艳之致，众人尽皆喝采。子云、次贤等就于此出中间放了赏。华公子对着笑道","en":"flavors. Refined conversation and witty remarks were paired with humorous jokes. At the other table, Pincai asked Cixian about the sights of the Garden of Contentment. Cixian briefly described a few places. Next came Baozhu, Huifang, Sulan, Shufang, Yulin, Lanbao, Guibao, Chunxi, Qiguan—nine in total—plus one more, performing the play 'Flower-Viewing Assembly on the Qinhuai'."},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":1,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，便倒把别的话支开。当下谈笑间，饮了许多酒，戏唱过了好几出，吃过了两道点心。华公子起身道：「请到园中散散罢。」次贤、子云道：「甚好，本来酒已多了。」诸客一同起身，就有四五个家人，急忙从廊下近路抄入，通知园门伺候。","en":"plays, and had two courses of snacks. Young Master Hua stood up and said, \\"Let's take a stroll in the garden.\\" Cixian and Ziyun agreed, \\"Very well, we've already had plenty of wine.\\" The guests all stood up together. Four or five servants hurried through a shortcut under the corridor to inform the garden gatekeepers to get ready."},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":1,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，从前是朝亲夕见的，如今倒像是相逢陌路，对面无言，未免有些感慨。即叫他走近，问了些话，要问起子玉来，却又缩住。次贤、文泽也问了几句。","en":"pang at the change. He called him closer, asked a few questions, and was about to ask about Ziyu, but held back. Cixian and Wenze also asked a few questions."},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":1,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"群旦进来伺候。对面水阁上却安放了一班十锦杂耍，便上起场来，说了好些笑话，作了一回像声，又说了一回《龙图公案》。次贤等不甚喜听，便与群旦猜枚行令，彼此传觞。华公子又叫了一档变戏法儿的，耍了一回。堪堪月色将上，又撤了席，在园中散步了一回。便有十数对的红灯笼前来引道，华公子与诸客都更了衣，随着红灯笼步出了园，仍从恩庆堂来，却见明灯灿烂，霞彩云蒸的一般。从屏后迤东而行，","en":"began their performance, telling jokes, doing vocal mimicry, and telling an episode from 'The Cases of Judge Bao'. Cixian and the others didn't enjoy listening to it much, so they played guessing games and drinking games with the Dan actors, passing cups back and forth. Young Master Hua also called for a magic act, which they performed for a while. As the moonlight gradually"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":1,"tokens":["萧次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"独占》。」文泽道：「归自荣本生得好，就是不该同小老婆另住在城外。听说仍旧窘迫得很。」子佩丢个眼色，文泽不说了，萧次贤冷笑一声，聘才像要说话又不说。","en":"his concubine. I hear he's still very short of money.\\" Zipei shot him a warning glance, and Wenze fell silent. Xiao Cixian gave a cold laugh. Pincai seemed about to speak, but held back."},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":1,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"混混沌沌的走去走来。略有一面之交就斜着身子站住了，人又不留他，没奈何又走过去。我不看戏便罢，若看戏必遇他的。」次贤笑道：「他也是我们浙江人，我看他书倒像念过的。」张仲雨道：「也不见得，我虽不懂文理，我见他那字就不成个样子。」华公子道：「别讲这些人，管他傻不傻。子佩你会唱戏，你何不上台唱一出，显显本领；况且多少赏鉴家都在此，或者巴结的上，于你有点好处。」子佩啐了一","en":"no choice but to shuffle on. If I don't go to the theater, it's fine, but if I do, I'm bound to run into him.\\" Cixian laughed, \\"He's also from our Zhejiang province. I think he seems to have had some schooling.\\" Zhang Zhongyu said, \\"Not necessarily. Although I don't understand literature much, his handwriting is a disgrace.\\" Young Master Hua said, \\"Stop talking about"},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":1,"tokens":["萧次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"涩；又见徐子云身旁站着蕙芳、宝珠，见蕙芳看看他，便凑着子云讲些话，又凑着宝珠讲些话；又见宝珠微笑；又见刘文泽与萧次贤站着，在一处彼此俯耳低言，大约是品评他的意思。原来文泽与蕙芳倒不是讲冯子佩，倒讲的是归自荣。","en":"then leaned towards Ziyun to whisper a few words, and then towards Baozhu, who smiled. He also saw Liu Wenze and Xiao Cixian standing together, whispering in each other's ears, probably discussing him. In fact, Wenze and Huifang were not talking about Feng Zipei at all; they were talking about Gui Zirong."}],"31":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":3,"tokens":["静宜","次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"你是不懂好歹的，我在台上费力，你倒在那里说长道短的批评我。」文泽极口叫冤道：「我何尝批评你，你这般瞎挑眼？我与静宜先生说闲话。」次贤道：「真是讲闲话。况且你唱得如此绝妙，赞不住口，尚何评论之有？」华公子笑道：「我听得他们说，你倒真像个阎婆惜。你若化了女身，也是个不安本分的。」子佩道：「好吗！你们逼我上台，又要取笑我。」徐子云问聘才道：「魏兄这音律实在精妙，将来尚","en":"ever critique you? Why are you picking such blind faults with me? I was merely having an idle chat with Master Jingyi.\\" Cixian chimed in, \\"It truly was just idle chat. Furthermore, you sang so superbly that we could not stop praising you; what room could there possibly be for criticism?\\" Young Master Hua laughed, \\"From what I heard them say, you truly resembled Yan"},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":1,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，他倒会一套《平沙落雁》。」华公子便命叫他起来，又吩咐珊枝拿了琵琶来。家人把些笔砚乐器都搬了出来，分摆在各处。次贤道：「我来点将：先点玉侬与瘦香把琴箫和起来；再点瑶卿画一幅，媚香、香畹、佩仙对景吟诗，题在上面；再点珊枝与小梅笙、琵琶竞奏；再点蕊香猜几个灯谜，说个笑话；末点静芳舞剑，溜亮风生，亦可如渔阳参挝矣。诸公以为何如？」众皆称好，诸旦依次而行。","en":"brought out brushes, inkstones, and musical instruments, setting them up at various stations around the room. Cixian said, \\"Let me act as the marshal and assign the roles: First, I call upon Yunong and Shouxiang to blend the melodies of the qin and xiao. Next, Yaoqing shall paint a scene, while Meixiang, Xiangwan, and Peixian improvise poems to match the view and inscribe"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":3,"tokens":["次贤","静宜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"洞箫倒吹得和平。华公子摇摇头道：「琴声不佳，箫声倒好。」子云道：「琴本难学，也还亏他。」次贤道：「想你不长弹，生疏了。」琴言道：「有半年不学了，方才第四段第三句几乎想不出来。瘦香的箫，比从前更好了。」漱芳道：「我是向老师课学。静宜先生隔三日必教我一吹，所以不生。」琴言默然，抚今追昔，颇觉感慨，几乎落下泪来，只得退后站了。次贤、子云亦颇恻然怜","en":"quite lovely.\\" Ziyun interjected, \\"The qin is inherently difficult to master; we must still give him credit.\\" Cixian added, \\"I imagine you have not practiced in a long time, and so the skill has grown rusty.\\" Qinyan replied, \\"I have not touched the instrument for half a year. Just now, I nearly forgot the third phrase of the fourth movement. Shouxiang's flute playing,"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":2,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"次贤与诸人不便来看，又恐怕他画坏了。次贤远远留心，觉得下笔甚快，毫无拘束，已觉面有喜色。那边蕙芳等三人挤在一处。只见李玉林俯首凝思，素兰把串香珠数个不了，蕙芳只管看着宝珠落笔，尚暗暗的指点他。","en":"Cixian and the others dared not draw too close, fearing they might disturb him and spoil the painting. Watching carefully from a distance, Cixian noted that Baozhu's brush moved with swift, unfettered grace, and a look of bright satisfaction had already begun"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":2,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"了甚是欢喜，大赞道：「却实在亏他，怎么能够如此。无怪乎近来个个说他们的才貌，正是羞死从前那一班爱钱的相公了。」次贤又替他略略的润色了几处，竟成一幅好画。华公子即问蕙芳道：「你们题的想是有了？」蕙芳道：「有是有了，只是不好。」便站在桌边，找了一张笺纸，写了一首七绝。华公子念道：良宵灯月赏秋光，丝竹纷纷斗两厢。\\n我道嫦娥畏岑寂，遣风吹送上华堂。华公子念罢，拍案叫绝，","en":"so highly of their talent and beauty; they put those old, money-grubbing xianggong of the past to utter shame.\\" Cixian lightly touched up a few spots, and it truly became a masterful painting. Young Master Hua then turned to Huifang and asked, \\"I trust you have your inscribed poems ready?\\" Huifang replied, \\"We have them, but I fear they are rather poor.\\" Standing by"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":1,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"道：「实在极好，但我要换几字：「集群贤」换作「会群仙」，乱啼声「换作」只三更」，可好么？」众人一齐道：「好。」次贤叫他们快些写上，蕙芳、玉林都要素兰代写，华公子不依，只得各自写了。大家又赏叹一回，于是静坐，听珊枝的琵琶与春喜的笙。珊枝斜坐着拨动檀槽，只见指法如雨洒芭蕉，声韵如滩头流水，满怀春色，绕乱一堂。加之笙韵高低，声声应和。听得人人色舞眉飞，四肢愉快。弹了《","en":"cries' to 'it is only the third watch.' Does that sound agreeable?\\" The crowd voiced their unanimous approval. Cixian urged them to quickly copy their final drafts onto the scroll. Huifang and Yulin both wanted Sulan to write it out for them, but Young Master Hua would not allow it, insisting they each write their own. After another round of admiration and praise, they"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":2,"tokens":["萧次贤","静宜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，访寻而来，一路狼狈不堪，到京始知香雪已故多年。蕙芳知道了，即倾囊相助，得二百金，除盘费外，尚够经理其家，并求萧次贤画像征诗。其子元佐，年十三岁，贫不能入塾读书，而天姿颖悟，过耳不忘。每到人家书塾听书，默志在心，五经已熟一半。蕙芳的意思，欲浼诸名士或作诗，或作墓志，或作传，以表扬潜德，阐发幽光，且以盖其前愆，裕其后裔。诸人一面看，蕙芳一面讲，讲到伤心处，便呜咽起来","en":"silver. Beyond covering their travel expenses, this was enough to help manage their household. He had also beseeched Xiao Cixian to paint a portrait and gather poems in his honor. The master's son, Yuanzuo, was thirteen years old. Though he was too poor to attend school, he was blessed with brilliant natural talent and an extraordinary memory; he never forgot anything he heard."},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":1,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"清即致札与子云、前舟诸人，数日后都送了些分金，并有几首歌行。南湘、仲清看了，点过分金是：子云二十四，文泽十六，次贤十二，共五十二两。仲清道：「我们共有六分，每人八两，共凑成一百两也就够了。」南湘道：「很够了。」于是又致札众人，两三日间都要凑足。诗文共遗集，俱已发刻停妥，印刷一百部，用银六十两，蕙芳一人出了。","en":"songs. Nanxiang and Zhongqing tallied the contributions: Ziyun gave twenty-four taels, Wenze gave sixteen, and Cixian gave twelve, bringing the total to fifty-two taels. Zhongqing said, \\"There are six of us sharing the burden, so at eight taels each, we can easily round it up to a hundred taels, which will be more than enough.\\" Nanxiang agreed, \\"It is plenty.\\" They"}],"35":[{"paragraph":8,"mentions":1,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"到了明日，只说怡园请酒，禀明了颜夫人，即到王恂处，一同来到怡园。次贤那日要在红茶仙馆里面，一切都是他预备，不要子云费心，却说那红茶仙馆是去年新辟的，地方在梅崦之前，梨院海棠春圃之后，本是空地，只有一个亭子。亭外有两块英州灵石，一块有一丈二尺高，一块四尺余高。有一株大玉兰花，树身已有一抱有余，就倚着那块大石。那小石边也","en":"her permission, he went to Wang Xun's place, and together they proceeded to the Garden of Contentment. That day, Cixian had arranged for everything to be hosted inside the Red Camellia Immortal Pavilion, taking charge of all preparations so Ziyun wouldn't have to worry. This pavilion had been newly constructed the previous year, situated in front of Plum Knoll and behind"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":2,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"里面即刻了十二个花神，系嵌在墙上。次贤因宝珠命名之意与此相同，故要在此处。且厌平时酒菜不能翻新，三日前即把酒菜器皿通身亲手检点，意欲与平日不同。是日绝早即将子云行厨挪到仙馆厢房里来。次贤每一样菜开一个做法，怎样烹调，怎样脍炙，油盐酱醋各有分量。费了一日心，配成三十二样菜。","en":"Deities were carved into the walls. Because the meaning of Baozhu's name resonated so well with this setting, Cixian insisted on hosting the gathering here. Furthermore, dissatisfied with the inability to innovate ordinary banquet dishes, he had personally inspected the wine, food, and utensils three days in advance, determined to make this occasion uniquely distinct"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":2,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"做诗了？」宝珠道：「我搜他的，已有二十余首，就不肯给人瞧，这首是无意中看见的。」大家嗟叹了一声，即重到里面来。次贤道：「今日十二人，一桌又挤，两桌又离开了。」子云道：「依我，把两张大方桌并拢来，就可坐了。」摆好了坐位，是东西对面八坐，南北对面四坐。文泽、仲清、王恂、春航、子玉、次贤、子云坐了东西，上下是蕙芳、素兰、玉林、漱芳、宝珠。宝珠坐了末位。","en":"show them to anyone. This one was discovered by chance.\\" Everyone sighed collectively before heading back inside. Cixian said, \\"With twelve of us today, one table is too crowded, but two tables would separate us.\\" Ziyun suggested, \\"If you ask me, let's join two large square tables together; then we can all sit.\\" The seating was arranged: eight facing east and west, four"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":9,"tokens":["静宜","次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云道：「静宜实在有这想头，不知怎样想出来，真是胸有造化。」次贤笑道：「这没有什么奇。少停有两个杯子，却会走路，要到谁就到谁。」大家忙问道：「何不就拿出来试试？」次贤道：「少时行令时便用他，就只有两个。这两个叫银匠改了四五次，费了一个月工夫才成。」蕙芳道：「快拿出","en":"Ziyun said, \\"Jingyi truly has a remarkable imagination. I don't know how he comes up with these things; he really has a creative mind.\\" Cixian chuckled, \\"This is nothing extraordinary. Shortly, there will be two cups that can actually walk. They will go to whomever you"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":3,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"绝小的小针，好像指南针一样，却是呆的，心上想道：「或者这一个针的缘故。」便斟了一杯酒，暗记着针头所向，把他对着次贤，说声：「敬萧老爷酒！」那杯子果然望次贤走来。蕙芳大笑，众人亦皆欢喜道：「被他识破机关了。」次贤笑道：「好个聪明贼，果然利害。」文泽即问蕙芳所以然的缘故，蕙芳笑道：「等我再试一遍，方可相信。」于是又把杯子看了看，记好了，斟了酒，说声：「敬徐老爷酒！」","en":"because of this needle.\\" He poured a cup of wine, secretly noting the direction the needle was pointing, aimed it at Cixian, and called out: \\"A cup of wine for Lord Xiao!\\" True enough, the cup rolled toward Cixian. Huifang burst out laughing, and the others rejoiced, saying, \\"He has seen through the trick.\\" Cixian laughed, \\"What a clever thief, quite formidable indeed.\\" Wenze"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":2,"tokens":["静宜","次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"果然直走到子云面前。子云称异，喝了。子玉笑道：「是了，不错的了。」蕙芳对子玉道：「你恐怕走的远，故放远些。我看静宜于近处则斟得浅，于远处便斟得满。此杯想是要重了才得远呢。」子玉点头道：「果然。」次贤道：「可恶之极，轻重远近都被他知道了。」王恂问子玉道：「到底你从何处看出？」子玉道：「你们何尝不看，但总看轮盘外面，没有看轮盘里面。你不见轮盘里有个绝小的小针，对着谁","en":"Huifang said to Ziyu, \\"You must have thought it would roll far, so you placed it further back. I noticed that Jingyi poured less for short distances and filled it for long distances. I suppose this cup needs to be heavier to travel far.\\" Ziyu nodded, \\"Exactly.\\" Cixian complained, \\"How utterly detestable, he's figured out the weight and distance too.\\" Wang Xun asked"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":2,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"次贤道：「今日雅集，不可无令。前舟你是首坐，出个令，大家顽顽罢。」文泽道：「甚好。但我的令没甚新鲜的，待我想想看。」想了一回道：「我们今天是十二个人，还是念句唐诗飞觞罢，用数目字飞。第一个飞一字，一字到谁谁喝酒。接飞二字，到那人，那人也照样喝酒。又飞三字","en":"Cixian said, \\"Today's elegant gathering must have a drinking game. Qianzhou, since you hold the first seat, propose a game for us all to play.\\" Wenze agreed, \\"Very well. But my games aren't particularly novel, let me think for a moment.\\" After some thought,"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":3,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"数二字，又在第五，轮到次贤，杯子就到次贤面前。次贤喝了，念道：「愿陪鸾鹤回三山。」数到仲清，喝了酒，把酒斟了，走到春航面前，道：「罗帐四垂红烛背。」春航喝了，道：「好个「罗帐四垂红烛背」，香艳无比。」把酒喝了，即斟了酒，念道：「刺绣五纹添弱线。」数到宝珠。宝珠喝了酒，说道：「","en":"Counting two words, it again landed on the fifth person, Cixian. The cup stopped right in front of him. Cixian drank and recited, \\"I wish to accompany the phoenix and crane back to the three mountains.\\" Counting to Zhongqing, he drank the wine, poured another cup, walked over to Chunhang, and recited, \\"The silk bed-curtains"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":3,"tokens":["次贤","静宜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一杯。宝珠喝了，想了一会，飞出一句道：「南陌青楼十二重。」飞到子玉。子玉喝了酒，道：「已经十二了，还要飞吗？」次贤道：「座中媚香还没有轮到。轮到了他，我们再换令罢。如今只可飞十三了。」子玉飞出一句是：「娉娉袅袅十三余。」飞到了仲清，仲清喝了酒，想了一想道：「这一飞，轮到数目皆要喝酒，等媚香飞一句收令罢。要十几的数目相连，也就少了。」即念道：「花面丫头十三四。」瑶","en":"high.\\" It landed on Ziyu. Ziyu drank the wine and asked, \\"We're already at twelve, do we still need to continue?\\" Cixian replied, \\"It hasn't landed on Meixiang yet. Once it reaches him, we can change the game. For now, we must proceed to thirteen.\\" Ziyu recited a line: \\"Graceful and slender, she is just over thirteen.\\" It landed on Zhongqing. Zhongqing drank the wine,"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":3,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"谈了一回，次贤道：「我有一个令，就费心些，但是今日坐中却好都是喜欢行令的，想必不嫌烦碎，我们就照这个令行一行。」蕙芳道：「你不要又拿《水浒传》来顽笑人了。」次贤笑道：「你还记得雪天戏叔么？那日也就够你受了。」即叫书童到书架上把第三筒牙筹取来。少顷，书童捧了出来，众","en":"After chatting a bit more, Cixian said, \\"I have another drinking game that requires a bit more effort. But since everyone here today seems to enjoy playing, I suspect you won't find it too tedious. Let's play a round of this one.\\" Huifang warned, \\"Don't bring out something from *Water"},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":2,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"说不出罚三杯，余皆照此。」蕙芳、宝珠听明了，又说了一遍道：「也不容易，幸亏我们的曲子，还有几枝在肚里。」子云谓次贤道：「索性叫香畹、佩仙坐到这里来，好在一处掷骰，我们与他二人换个坐儿。」次贤、子云与玉林、素兰换了坐位。","en":"the rules, noting it wasn't easy, though they still had many lyrics committed to memory. Ziyun then instructed Cixian to have Xiangwan and Peixian switch seats so the performers could roll the dice in one designated area, and the seating was adjusted accordingly."},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":3,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"次贤把筹和了一和，递给文泽，先掣了一枝，把筹筒搁过一边。王恂道：「何不一同抽出，按着次序说不好吗？」次贤笑道：「那就太便宜了，后头可以细想改换，再罚不成酒了。」文泽看那筹时，服饰门，美人名玉环，注：「飞七言唐诗二句，集《毛诗》说并头花。」文泽想一想，出坐","en":"Cixian shuffled the lots and handed the tube to Wenze to draw first. Wang Xun asked, \\"Why not have everyone draw their lots first and then proceed in order?\\" Cixian replied, \\"That would be too easy. People would have too much time to overthink and avoid penalties.\\""},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":1,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"大家都赞道：「妙极！」次贤道：「并且玉环二字也在句首，倒与并头花相合。请说《毛诗》并头花罢，我们先贺一杯。」","en":"Everyone praised the lines as excellent. Cixian added, \\"Placing 'yu' and 'huan' at the very beginning of the lines perfectly matches the paired-head flower requirement. Now, what is your paired-head flower from the *Mao Shi*?\\" They first toasted him one cup."},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":1,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"个来了。吁嗟乎驺虞，西方美人。」仲清道：「更要罚了。这个虽好，却不是并头花。」文泽一想，道：「呸！果然错了。」次贤道：「我替你们讲和，剑潭贺一杯罢。」仲清只得饮了一杯，抽出筹来，是天文门，美人名朝云，下：「飞七言唐诗二句，集《毛诗》并蒂花。」仲清想了一会，说道：「我上句用韦庄的诗，下句用杜诗，合着是「朝朝暮暮阳台下，云雨荒台岂梦思」。」又说道：「我其夙夜，妻子好","en":"suggested another himself. But Zhongqing argued it still failed the paired-head criteria. Wenze admitted his error. Cixian mediated, \\"Let's just offer one courtesy toast.\\" Zhongqing drank and then read his own drawn lot: the category was astronomy, the beauty was 'Chaoyun' (Morning Cloud), requiring two seven-character Tang lines and a paired-stem flower from the *Mao Shi*."},{"paragraph":30,"mentions":2,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"大家赞了几声，次贤道：「并且这花名与唐诗多联合的，我们共贺一杯。对坐的是媚香，应贺两杯。」那苏蕙芳掷了一个二五，正在那里凝思，这边要他贺酒，他只得喝了两杯，倒凑着两句，念道：「全没有半星儿惜玉怜香，只合守蓬窗茆屋梅花账。」旁边子玉拍手称妙道：「好个温柔旖旎！倒转来，偏","en":"Everyone praised Zhongqing's effort. Cixian noted, \\"The flower matches your Tang lines perfectly. We should all toast one cup, and Meixiang, sitting opposite, should toast two.\\" Huifang had just rolled a two and a five and was still contemplating his lines when asked to drink the toasts. After"},{"paragraph":31,"mentions":1,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"仲清笑道：「就是你想吃烧猪，你说得「奉时辰牡，颜如渥丹」，不像个烧猪么？」众人听了，大笑起来，王恂自己也笑了。次贤道：「庸庵，你那第二句像说错了一字，或是刻本之讹也论不定。我记得是「玉钗落处无声腻」，不是「燕」字，且是李长吉的《美人梳头歌》，你又记错是温飞卿，该罚一杯。」王恂道：「名字我说错了，似乎「燕」字没有记错。」春航道：「或者别的选本作「燕」字亦论不得的。","en":"like a description of roast pork color, doesn't it?\\" Everyone burst out laughing, including Wang Xun himself. Cixian corrected him: \\"Yong'an, I think you got one character wrong in your second line, or perhaps it's an error in your edition. I remember it as 'where the jade pin falls,' not 'swallow pin.' Furthermore, the source is Li He's *Song of a Beauty Combing Her"},{"paragraph":33,"mentions":1,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「我用冷朝阳《送红线》诗一句，孟浩然《登襄城楼》一句，合着是：还似洛妃乘雾去，更凝神女弄珠游。」子玉方才念完，次贤、仲清、春航等大赞道：「方才飞的以此为第一，好在对得工稳。旖旎风光，却是庾香本色。」子玉又说并头花道：「月出皎兮，季女思饥。月季是并头花。」众人道：「这个花名也好极，我们应贺三杯，方可赏此佳句。」子玉谦了几句。又见素兰掷了一个么六，也想了一想，凑起《","en":"Goddess of Luo riding the mist away; gazing still as the river deity plays with pearls.'\\" As soon as Ziyu finished, Cixian, Zhongqing, Chunhang, and the others lauded him: \\"Of all the lines recited so far, this is the first and best. It's wonderfully balanced and graceful. Such tender and romantic charm is exactly Yuxiang's style.\\" Ziyu then provided his paired-head flower:"},{"paragraph":34,"mentions":3,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"次贤掣了时令门，美人名夜来，花是并蒂花。子云道：「等你多想一想，我们用点菜再说。」大家又吃了一回菜，又上了五六样，俟点了灯，各人权且散坐。次贤道：「我有了白香山一句，李太白一句，合着是：八月九月正长夜，情人道来竟不来。」众人赏叹道：「老气横秋，又是「愿陪","en":"Cixian drew a lot from the seasons category: the beauty 'Yelai' (Night-Coming) and a paired-stem flower. Ziyun suggested, \\"Take your time to think; let's order some more dishes first.\\" They enjoyed a few more courses, and five or six new dishes were brought"},{"paragraph":35,"mentions":1,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"该贺个双杯。我也交卷了，我就用温飞卿《采莲曲》上的两句，凑起来是：绿萍金粟莲茎短，露重花多香不消。」大家说好，次贤道：「这两句很佳，可惜「不」字与「茎」字不对。」","en":"are short; the dew is heavy, the flowers many, the fragrance does not fade.'\\" Everyone voiced their approval. Cixian said, \\"These two lines are quite beautiful. It's just a pity that the character 'not' (不) and 'stem' (茎) don't form a perfect poetic match.\\""},{"paragraph":36,"mentions":2,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"宝珠将眼睛看了子云一看，心中若有所思。次贤道：「不是这两字，也与庾香一样可以贺三杯。子云等诸位喝两杯也罢了。」再说花名道：「南有乔木，堇荼如饴。木堇是连理花。」众人道：「这两句却自然，该贺两杯。」这一天大家思索也都乏了，都要吃饭。子云道：「尚早，再看他们掷几回。他们到底比我们少用些心。」素兰","en":"Baozhu cast a thoughtful glance at Ziyun. Cixian continued, \\"Even without a perfect match on those two characters, his lines are just as worthy of a three-cup toast as Yuxiang's. But let's settle for Ziyun and the rest of us drinking two cups.\\" Ziyun then announced his flower name: \\"'In the south there"},{"paragraph":38,"mentions":1,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"次贤对子云道：「我明日要将这两个令刻起来，传到外间，也教人费点心，免得总是猜拳打擂的混闹。」子云道：「也好，况今日也没有什么不好的在里面。」又谈了一回，子云也自进去。不知后事如何，且听下回分解。","en":"Cixian said to Ziyun, \\"Tomorrow I will have the rules of these two games engraved and circulated outside. It will encourage people to use their minds a bit, saving them from the endless, rowdy brawling of finger-guessing games.\\" Ziyun agreed, \\"That would be"}],"36":[{"paragraph":8,"mentions":1,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"仲雨也不与他往来了。」 　　 琴言问起子玉来，宝珠道：「前日我们在怡园叙了一日。」便将前日怎样喝酒，怎样行令，次贤新制的酒壶、杯子都说了，琴言着实羡慕。又说那首诗，度香也刻了，庾香见了怎样思念感伤的神色，一一说给琴言，琴言听了也就感伤起来。蕙芳道：「你既回来，少不得我们要快聚几天，不知明日可以不可以？」宝珠道：「明日他也无事。」琴言道：「师傅新死，于理有碍，须消","en":"spent the whole day together at the Garden of Contentment.\\" He described how they drank, played games, and used Cixian's newly designed wine pots and cups, making Qinyan deeply envious. He also mentioned the poem Duxiang had engraved and described Yuxiang's sorrowful expression upon seeing it, detailing every bit to Qinyan, which moved Qinyan to melancholy as well. Huifang"}],"37":[{"paragraph":3,"mentions":4,"tokens":["次贤","静宜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"王恂是座师的世兄，故大家请了他。春航并请仲清，仲清新受感冒，两处都辞了。王恂也辞了那边，清早就约同子玉到怡园，次贤、子云接进梅崦坐下。这梅崦是个梅花样式，五间一处，共有五处。长廊曲槛钩连，绿萼红香围绕。外边望着，也认不清屋宇，唯觉一片香雪而已。子玉每到园中，必须赏玩几处。子云道：「今日之局，人颇不齐，这月里戏酒甚多。我想玉侬回来，尚有二十余日之久，这梅花还可开得","en":"declined his invitation, having arranged early in the morning to accompany Ziyu to the Garden of Contentment. Cixian and Ziyun welcomed them into the Plum Knoll and they took their seats. This retreat was laid out in the shape of a plum blossom, comprising five sections of five rooms each. Winding corridors and curved balustrades connected them, surrounded by a sea"},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":3,"tokens":["次贤","静宜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"来。子玉见他比去年高了好些，穿一套素淡衣裳，走入梅花林内，觉得人花一色，耀眼鲜明。大家含笑相迎，琴言上前先见了次贤、子云、王恂，复与子玉见了，问了几句寒温。子云笑道：「如今人也高了，学问也长了。你看他竟与庾香叙起寒温来，若去年就未必能这样。」琴言听了，不好意思道：「他是半年没有见面了。」子云道：「我们又何曾常见面？」琴言笑道：「新年上你同静宜来拜年，不是见过的？","en":"blossoms seemed all of a piece, bright and dazzling. The company welcomed him with smiles. Qinyan first greeted Cixian, Ziyun, and Wang Xun, then turned to Ziyu to exchange polite greetings. Ziyun laughed and said, \\"He has grown taller now and his learning has advanced. Look at him exchanging pleasantries with Yuxiang; he would hardly have been able to do that last year.\\""},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":3,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，王恂并之，不准再逊，逊者罚酒十杯。子云又叫宝珠坐在上面，宝珠要推时，见蕙芳来了。子云道：「好，好，你来坐了，次贤相并。」蕙芳不肯坐在次贤之上。次贤道：「今日所定之席，皆是你们为上，我们为次，你不见已定了两位吗？」蕙芳只得依了，下面宝珠也只得坐在子云之上。坐定了，王恂笑道：「外边馆子上，若便依这坐法，便可倒贴开发。」众皆微笑，互相让了几杯酒，随意吃了几样菜。","en":"position. Just as Baozhu was about to decline, Huifang arrived. Ziyun welcomed him warmly, \\"Splendid, do sit down, Cixian will be beside you.\\" Huifang was reluctant to sit above Cixian, but Cixian reassured him, \\"Today's arrangement puts all of you above us. Have you not seen that two have already been settled?\\" Huifang had to comply, and Baozhu below likewise had no choice"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":6,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"十分怎样。不然还了得，只怕你们今日也不能见我的。」子云道：「这三个恶煞，怎么你一齐都遇见了，这也实在为难你。」次贤、王恂皆笑。桂保道：「那个奚十一，我倒没碰见他，就是佩仙、玉艳吃了他的大亏。」琴言道：「我是两次了。」王恂谓桂保道：「你若遇见了奚十一，便怎样呢？」桂保道：「我若遇见了他，也叫他看看桶子，叫个赶车的顽顽他。」说得众人大笑。蕙芳道：「我们如何想个法儿收","en":"Ziyun said, \\"What bad luck to run into all three of those fiends at once! You must have had a dreadful time.\\" Cixian and Wang Xun both laughed. Guibao added, \\"That Xi Eleven, I have never had dealings with him myself, but Peixian and Yuyan suffered badly at his hands.\\" Qinyan noted, \\"For me it has been twice now.\\" Wang Xun asked Guibao what he would do if he ran into"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":1,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"玉道：「这是第二回，已一年之久。」子云道：「只得两回，可怜，可怜！真是会少离多了。」琴言笑道：「也第三回了。」次贤道：「庾香有些贪心不足，以多报少。去年你们瞒着人私逛运河，不算一回么？」子玉道：「我偶然忘了。」子云道：「我请吾弟与玉侬作十日之欢，阁下不知嫌烦否？」子玉道：「名园胜友，若得常常欢聚，不胜之幸，何敢嫌烦。只怕弟无此香福，犹恐福薄灾生。」","en":"pity! You meet so rarely and part so often.\\" Qinyan smiled and corrected him, \\"This is in fact the third time.\\" Cixian said, \\"Yuxiang is being a little greedy, counting fewer than there have been. Last year you two slipped away to stroll along the canal without telling anyone; does that not count?\\" Ziyu admitted, \\"It slipped my mind.\\" Ziyun then proposed, \\"I should like"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":1,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云大笑，次贤道：「十日之叙，已无此福，若华星北之福，真是福如东海了。」说得众人大笑。琴言与子玉此时，已觉十分畅满。","en":"Ziyun laughed heartily. Cixian quipped, \\"Even ten days together are too much good fortune for him! What if he had Hua Xingbei's luck? Now that would be good fortune as vast as the Eastern Sea!\\" Everyone laughed at this remark. By now, Qinyan and Ziyu were both filled with contentment."},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":3,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴言道：「我有个水字，加一点是氷字，移上去是永字。」次贤道：「这个永字些须欠一点儿，也只好算个薄氷。然眼前的却也没有多少。」王恂道：「只怕就是几个，被他们想完了。」桂保道：「我还有一个十字，加一划是士字，移上去是干字。」大家说道：「好。」蕙芳道：「我有个杳字，加一笔是查字，移上去是香字。」众人赞道：「更好","en":"the character for 'water' (水), add a dot to make it 'ice' (氷), and move it to the top to make it 'eternal' (永).\\" Cixian said, \\"That 永 is not quite right; it will only pass as thin ice. Still, there aren't many examples that come readily to mind.\\" Wang Xun said, \\"I fear there are only a few, and they have all been taken.\\" Guibao proposed another, \\"I have the character"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":3,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"品服饰，觉得议论风生，无人不敬爱他。」子云想了一想，道：「要是姓屈，不是姓瞿。」蕙芳道：「是姓屈，我记错了。」次贤道：「不要是屈道生么？」子云道：「一定是他，我听说他到了。」子玉道：「他名字可叫本立？」子云道：「正是，你认识他么？」子玉道：「我却不认识，我见他几封书札与家严的，有论些史事疑难处，却独出卓见，真是只眼千古。家严将他裱成一个册页，我倒常看的。」次贤道","en":"moment and corrected him, \\"It will be Qu written 屈, not Qu written 瞿.\\" Huifang agreed, \\"Yes, Qu, I had it wrong.\\" Cixian asked, \\"Could it be Qu Daosheng?\\" Ziyun confirmed, \\"It must be him. I heard he’d arrived.\\" Ziyu asked, \\"Would his given name be Benli?\\" Ziyun said, \\"Exactly! Do you know him?\\" Ziyu explained, \\"I do not know him personally, but I have read several of"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":2,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"次贤道：「我当年在人家案头略翻一翻，也没有看他。记得《醒睡集》内有些集词为词、集曲为曲等类，还有些集经书诗词的对子，却甚有趣。好像末后还有个对戏目的对子，是两个字的多，可惜没有细看。」子云道：「你看道生的诗文，与侯石翁如何？」次贤道：「据我看，是道翁高于","en":"Cixian said, \\"I once flipped through them briefly on someone's desk, but did not read them closely. I recall that *The Awakening from Sleep Collection* (醒睡集) contained pieces composed by collaging lines from ci poems to make new ci, and from qu lyrics to make"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":4,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"次贤道：「很好，就请庾香、玉侬先对起来。」子玉道：「还是你与媚香先对，次度香、瑶卿，次庸庵、蕊香，末后轮到我们罢。」子云道：「也罢，你作个先锋，他作个后劲，把我们放在中间，容易讨好些。」次贤道：「头难，头难，我一时想不出好的。我前日见瘦香的《题曲》唱得甚","en":"Cixian agreed, \\"Excellent. Let Yuxiang and Yunong start.\\" Ziyu suggested, \\"It would be better if you and Meixiang go first, then Duxiang and Yaoqing, then Yong'an and Ruixiang, and we shall go last.\\" Ziyun agreed to this arrangement, \\"You take the vanguard,"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":5,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"对了《扫花》。桂保道：「好极了。」子云道：「论对却好，但两个字似乎平仄都要相配，扫字也是仄声。此中稍欠工稳。」次贤道：「你却论得是。据我想来，戏目虽多，内中可对者却也甚少，下一字须讲平仄，上一字尚可恕，不比泛对故实，可以随我们去搜索，此是有数的。与其平仄调而字面不工，莫若字面工而平仄稍为参差，也可算得。至于第二字，是不可错的。」子云一想也真没有多少，也就依了。宝","en":"tones should contrast. 扫 (sweep), like 踏 (tread), has an oblique tone, so there is a slight imperfection here.\\" Cixian said, \\"You're right. There are plenty of opera titles, but very few that pair well. The second characters must contrast in level and oblique tone, but we can allow some leeway with the first. This is unlike a general couplet matching historical references,"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":3,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"伏虎》，就触着了，对了《醒妓》。众人道：「这个对得有趣，满贺一杯。」琴言道：「巧在一醉一醒，这倒难得的。」轮到次贤，次贤道：「我出《撇斗》。」蕙芳道：「好个《撇斗》。」想了一想道：「我对《搜杯》。」次贤道：「也好个《搜杯》，这里面工稳，贺一满杯。」大家喝了。","en":"Qinyan added, \\"One drunk, the other sober—that's the clever part. Not an easy match to find.\\" When it came to Cixian's turn, he offered, \\"I shall propose *Flinging the Dipper* (撇斗).\\" Huifang said, \\"A fine title, *Flinging the Dipper* (撇斗)!\\" After a moment's thought, he replied, \\"I shall match it with *Searching for the Cup* (搜杯).\\" Cixian praised him, \\"And a fine answer,"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":4,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"停了一会，次贤催他出对，蕙芳道：「我有一个对，恐怕没有对的，因此迟疑。」次贤道：「若真没有对的，也只好喝一杯过去。你且说来，教我想想也好。」蕙芳道：「《女盗》有名《牝贼》，这两字却新奇，你对出来，我情愿喝三杯。」次贤道：「真的？」众人也暗暗想了一回，对不出来。子云","en":"After a pause, Cixian pressed Huifang to produce the next title. Huifang hesitated, \\"I have one in mind, but I fear it may have no possible answer.\\" Cixian encouraged him, \\"If there really is no match, we can drink a cup and move on. Go on, tell us. Let me think it over.\\""},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":1,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"次贤道：「要喝的。那《势利》又叫《势僧》，这不是绝对么？」蕙芳道：「势字怎么对得牝字？」子玉一想，不觉抚掌大笑道：「妙极，妙极！就是势字才可对得牝字，真是绝对。」琴言与宝珠尚未明白，子云、王恂也想出来了，也笑起来，赞道：「真好心思，把这两字当这两件东西，","en":"Cixian said, \\"You will drink. Now: *Power and Profit* (势利) also goes by the name *The Snobbish Monk* (势僧). Is that not a perfect pairing?\\" Huifang said, \\"How can 势 pair with 牝?\\" Ziyu thought for a moment, then clapped his hands and burst out laughing. \\"Marvellous,"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":3,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，子玉也思索了一回，没有新鲜的，偶想起《桃花扇》上有出《哄丁》，便把《哄丁》借对了，众人极口赞妙，各贺了满杯。次贤出了《饭店》，蕙芳对了《茶房》。蕙芳出了《拔眉》，子云道：「这更难对了。」次贤对了《开眼》。蕙芳道：「这真工巧极了。」次贤道：「还有《刺目》觉得更好些，就只刺字是个仄声。」子玉道：「这两个都好，倒像是天造地设，再没有比他好的了。」","en":"(哄丁) and offered it as a borrowed match. Everyone was full of admiration, and each drank a full cup in toast. Cixian offered *The Eating House* (饭店), and Huifang matched it with *The Tea-House* (茶房). Huifang offered *Plucking the Eyebrow* (拔眉), and Ziyun said, \\"This is even harder to match.\\" Cixian matched it with *Opening the Eye* (开眼). Huifang said, \\"Now that is"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":1,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"桌子一拍道：「有个好对，我对《切脚》，你们说好不好？」子玉道：「妙，妙！这个与《拔眉》、《刺目》，可称双绝。」次贤道：「比《拔眉》、《刺目》还好，这头、脚两字都是虚的，里面是一样，平仄又调，真是好对。倒是媚香激出来的，我们要贺双杯。」于是大家贺了，吃了一回菜。","en":"This and *Plucking the Eyebrow* (拔眉) matched with *Piercing the Eye* (刺目) may both be called perfect pairings.\\" Cixian added, \\"It is even better than *Plucking the Eyebrow* (拔眉) and *Piercing the Eye* (刺目). Here, 头 (head) and 脚 (foot) are both abstract, with the same underlying sense. The level and oblique tones also match well. It is a fine pairing. Since it was Meixiang"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":2,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"次贤道：「又轮到我了，我也学庾香惠顾人，出个容易的。」出了《酒楼》，蕙芳对了《书馆》，便说道：「我也学玉侬的连环出法，我就用书字出个《改书》。」次贤道：「你就难我，我偏要对个好的。」因想了一会，对了《追信》。","en":"Cixian said, \\"My turn again. I'll follow Yuxiang's example and offer an easy one.\\" He offered *The Tavern* (酒楼), and Huifang matched it with *The Study* (书馆). Huifang then said, \\"I'll follow Yunong's linked pattern too, using 书 again in *Revising the Letter*"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":1,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"王恂道：「书、信两字甚好。」次贤又道：「我又想了一个《放易》，易字好似信字。」大家齐声赞道：「这个更好，该贺双杯。」各贺了。子云道：「《见鬼》。」大家没有留心。停了一会，宝珠催其出对，子云笑道：「你倒不对，还来催我。」宝珠道：「你还没有出对，叫我对什么呢？」子云道：「我方才说的《见","en":"Wang Xun said, \\"书 ('book') and 信 ('letter') form a fine pair of characters.\\" Cixian added, \\"I also thought of *Releasing Yi* (放易). Yi works here much as Xin does.\\" Everyone cried out together in praise, \\"That one is even better! It deserves double cups.\\" And so they toasted. Ziyun said, \\"*Seeing the Ghost* (见鬼).\\" No one paid attention."},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":2,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"到了王恂，出了个《冥判》。次贤道：「这不容易。这个判字半虚半实，蕊香只怕要罚酒。」桂保想了一回，道：「有一个好对，就新些，却不是老戏。《空谷香》上有出《佛医》，我对《佛医》。」次贤道：「果然好，非但不罚，还要贺呢。」桂保道：「我想出一个难的来了，我出《惊丑》。」王恂想了一会道：「","en":"It was Wang Xun's turn, and he offered *The Infernal Judge* (冥判). Cixian warned, \\"This is not easy. That word for 'judge' is half concrete and half abstract; Ruixiang may well be penalized.\\" Guibao thought for a while and said, \\"I have a good match, though it comes from a newer play. In *Empty Valley Fragrance* (空谷香) there"}],"38":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"好静的人，名旦中止叫了四个，宝珠、漱芳、蕙芳、素兰。漱芳有恙不能前来，格外又知会了琴言。是日屈公先到，与子云、次贤叙了好些旧话。","en":"Qinyan was also notified. That day Master Qu arrived first and spent a good while in conversation with Ziyun and Cixian, catching up on old times."},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":1,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子弟。你们自然是极熟的，我却头一回见面，我试将他们的大概说出来，看对与不对。」众人听了，倒要细细的听他怎么讲。次贤道：「我知道尊兄是精于风鉴的，但以后的话不要讲他，倒要讲讲从前的是。什么千金事业、两子收成的话，我也会说的。你能将各人的性情脾气讲出来，我才服你。」诸旦听了皆笑。子云道：「这个未必相得出。」道生道：「不难，待我说给你们听。」说到此，已摆了席。子云敬酒","en":"you shall tell me whether I am right or wrong.\\" Everyone settled in to listen carefully to what he would say. Cixian said, \\"I know you have a gift for physiognomy, Elder Brother. But spare us the predictions — tell us about the past instead. Talk of great careers and fine outcomes is something any of us can manage. If you can describe each person's actual temperament"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":2,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"乡前辈，如何敢抗礼。」才定了仲清。东席第二是南湘，西席第二是春航。东席第三是子玉，西席三是文泽。子云东席作主，次贤西席作陪。宝珠、琴言在东，蕙芳、素兰在西，一一坐了。主人让酒，客皆饮了几杯。道生道：「我将前日先见的苏媚香谈起。」西席的人个个细听。道生道：「我这看相不论气色，部位是要论的，然尚在其次。我看全身的神骨、举止行动、坐相、立相，并口音言语，分人清浊，观人","en":"was Chunhang. Third on the east was Ziyu; third on the west was Wenze. Ziyun presided at the east table while Cixian acted as second host at the west. Baozhu and Qinyan sat on the east side; Huifang and Sulan on the west. Everyone took their places. The host circulated wine and the guests each drank a few cups. Qu said, \\"I shall begin with Su Meixiang, whom I met the"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":2,"tokens":["静宜","次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"尽了苦，所谓死里逃生。据我看，他一二年内，必有一番作为，就要改行的。后来收成怎样，此事还远，我也不必说。若说，静宜又要驳我了。」再看素兰、宝珠，大致相仿，与蕙芳也不差什么，就没有讲他们出身。又道：「出污泥而不滓，就是他们三人的大概了。」看到了琴言，道生道：「这位有些不像，如今还在班里么？」次贤道：「现在班里，而且是个五月榴花照眼明，雅俗共赏，是个顶红的。」琴言笑","en":"his current profession. How he will fare in the end is still far off, and I shall not venture to say. If I did, Jingyi would dispute me again.\\" He then looked at Sulan and Baozhu — their general qualities were much the same — and at Huifang as well, finding no great difference; for these three he made no comment about their origins. He said, \\"Emerging from the mud unsullied"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":2,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"之强，曰：彼仁义虱官也。」盖仁义自人心生，犹虱由人垢生。译虱字之义似易生且密之意，不知是否？」南湘、子玉拜服。次贤道：「今日道翁要开书箱了，幸这些陪客都还可以领教。若单是我一个，我就不准你讲。」道生笑道：「你们都是些才人词客，无书不览，我这老朽，岂敢班门弄斧。况且少年时也是些耳食之学，随听随忘，如今都不记得了。」子云道：「前日次贤见过大着内有一种《醒睡集》，此书","en":"bred and densely proliferating — though I am not certain this is correct.\\" Nanxiang and Ziyu bowed in admiration. Cixian said, \\"Master Qu is opening his trunk of books today — fortunately the guests at this table are all capable of receiving instruction. If it were just me alone, I would not give you permission to lecture.\\" Qu laughed and said, \\"You are all accomplished"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":1,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这是少年时无赖，作这些东西，毫无道理。」子云道：「又闻得有些对戏目的对子。」道生道：「有数十条，也记不得了。」次贤道：「我们前日几个人，也凑了好些。」又指琴言、蕙芳、宝珠三人道：「这三个还有一个王桂保，他们也对了许多，比我们还好些。」便叫人到他书房拿出一个单子，并上次所行之令也写在上面，注了各人姓名。道生看了，连声赞好，道：「不料这四位竟能如此，竟是我辈，老夫今","en":"section of couplets matching opera titles.\\" Qu said, \\"There were several dozen — I cannot remember them now.\\" Cixian said, \\"We ourselves produced a good many the other day,\\" and, gesturing toward Qinyan, Huifang, and Baozhu, he added, \\"These three, along with one Wang Guibao, matched a great number of pairs — and their results were somewhat better than ours.\\" He sent"},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":1,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"南湘道：「是真快论，可破古今之疑。」次贤道：「休论世上升沉事，且斗樽前现在身。我有一个极琐屑鄙俚之理要请教请教。我见《越绝书》有慧种生圣、痴种生狂、桂实生桂、桐实生桐之说，我往往见愚夫蠢妇，倒生出绝慧绝美的儿女来。看其父母，先天后天，皆无此种宿因，何竟得此妙果？」","en":"Nanxiang said, \\"A truly bold and penetrating argument — it dissolves doubts that have accumulated through the ages.\\" Cixian said, \\"Let us set aside the great risings and fallings of the world, and attend to what stands before us in this cup. I have an extremely trivial and vulgar point I wish to put to you. I have read in the *Book of Yue Annals* the saying that 'the sagely"},{"paragraph":37,"mentions":1,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"寸，依裁尺得五寸四分，究与缠足相异，也不为过小。通身算起来，身材觉长了些。要不然，古之美人，总是身长玉立的。」次贤道：「你也实在算得细。当日女姁量的时候，或者量错了，多说了一寸，也未可知。」说得众人皆笑。","en":"figure is somewhat on the tall side. Then again, ancient beauties were generally described as tall and stately.\\" Cixian said, \\"You have made a remarkably detailed calculation. It is possible that when the female official was measuring, she made a small error and recorded an inch too many — one never knows.\\" This made everyone laugh."},{"paragraph":38,"mentions":1,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，我将他这书的名字忘了。曾经看过一遍，笔下极为雄健。将两个逆首定江王、静海丞相骂得真真痛快，实在是才人之笔。」次贤道：「此辈叛贼荼毒生灵，害人多矣，也是人人言之发指的。既有此骂，也是快事，将来倒要找一部读读。」道翁道：「但其人时运太坏，未能大用其才，真真可惜。」宝珠忙接道：「何幸此君，今日竟遇知己。」道翁道：「瑶卿与此君相好么？」素兰在旁道：「他的画画弹琴，皆是","en":"Chancellor of Stilled Seas — are excoriated with such biting precision that it is truly the brush of a man of genius.\\" Cixian said, \\"Such traitors and rebels have inflicted misery on countless lives; every person's blood boils to speak of them. Such a denunciation is a cause for rejoicing; I must find a copy to read one day.\\" Master Qu said, \\"Yet his luck in life has been very"}],"43":[{"paragraph":8,"mentions":1,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一线中。\\n众人听不出什么曲本上的，觉得笛韵凄清，甚为动听。听得子云笑道：「到底不好，还是你来，我来吹笛。」又像次贤唱道：","en":"Ziyun laugh and say: \\"That still won't do — let me come and play the flute instead.\\" And then what seemed to be Cixian's voice singing:"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":1,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"曲唱江城一笛风。相和那帘钩敲戛玉丁冬，引入离愁离恨的梅花梦，作到月落参横萧寺钟。\\n四人正在好听，忽然止了，听得次贤说道：「其实唱起来，音节倒好。」又听得子云说道：「何不将工尺全谱了，教他们唱起来。」四人知道不唱了，齐走进去。书童匆忙上楼通报。","en":"night's last rite.\\"\\n\\nThe four were thoroughly absorbed in listening when the singing suddenly ceased. They heard Cixian say: \\"Truly, sung aloud, the rhythm is quite beautiful.\\" Then Ziyun: \\"Why not transcribe the whole score with the gongche notation and have them learn it properly?\\" The four, realising no more singing was coming, walked inside together. A page boy scrambled"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":2,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"宝珠等走上扶梯，进得楼来，次贤、子云笑面相迎，见了琴言、蕙芳等更加欢喜，说道：「今日倒料不着你们来。」宝珠道：「都是我请来的。」又对次贤道：「瘦香身子不快，不来了。」","en":"Baozhu and the others climbed the staircase into the upper room. Cixian and Ziyun came forward with smiling faces; seeing Qinyan and Huifang among the visitors, they were all the more pleased, saying: \\"We hardly expected you today.\\" \\"I brought them all,\\" said Baozhu. And then, turning to Cixian: \\"Shouxiang is unwell and"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":2,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一夜雨廉纤，正燕子飞来，帘卷东风，北宋南唐评乐府：\\n三分春旖旎，问杏花开未，窗闲青琐，红牙白雪选词场。\\n次贤、子云看他四人今日打扮分外好看，艳的艳，雅的雅，倒像有心比赛的一般。此刻都还穿着小毛外褂，琴言是玄狐耳绒，宝珠是玄狐抓仁，蕙芳是云狐抓仁，素兰是骨牌块云狐干尖。四人相对，就是珊瑚玉树交枝，瑶草琪花弄色，觉得楼外千枝红杏，比不上楼中四个玉人。次贤、子云","en":"of carved jade, red sandalwood clappers and the loftiest of songs pick out the champions of the lyric field.\\"\\n\\nCixian and Ziyun observed that the four visitors were unusually well turned out that day. Some were resplendent and some elegant, as though each had taken pains to outshine the others. All four still wore their short fur outer jackets. Qinyan wore dark fox-ear"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":8,"tokens":["次贤","静宜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"次贤道：「这是我当年一个好友，制了一部《梅花梦》的曲本，有二十出戏。前日从书箱内找出来，将《九宫谱》照着他的牌子填了工尺，倒也唱得合拍。却只填了这一出《入梦》，其余不知唱得唱不得。明日与你们班里教师商量，可以谱他出来。」蕙芳道：「那倒可惜了。我听这曲文甚","en":"\\"A close friend of mine from years ago,\\" said Cixian, \\"composed a twenty-act drama score called Dream of the Plum Blossom. The other day I found it at the bottom of a book-chest, and using the Nine-Palace Score, I worked out the gongche for his lyric modes. It came out quite well in pitch. But I have only"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":4,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云道：「这一比虽切，然究竟委屈了道翁。他却不酸，还比为干江瑶罢。」次贤道：「那更委屈了。你是浙人，自然夸赞江瑶。若说那干江瑶，真像那从良老妓，回忆当年，姿态全无，余腥尚在。」宝珠问次贤道：「食品之内，究以何物为第一？」次贤道：「我口不同于人口，不敢定。以我所好，以鱼为第一。」琴言、蕙芳皆道：「说得是。」次贤道：「食品中","en":"least is not sour. Let him be compared to dried river scallops instead.\\" \\"That is even more unfair to him,\\" said Cixian. \\"You are a man from Zhejiang, so naturally you sing the praises of river scallops. If you ask me, dried scallops are like an aging courtesan who has retired to respectable life: all the grace of her prime is gone, yet a faint smell of the old trade"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":8,"tokens":["次贤","静宜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"》。」素兰道：「这么对，还有《闹朝扑犬》，也可对得《打店偷鸡》。」子云笑道：「到底他们记得熟，可以不假思索。」次贤道：「自然，我们虽也记得几个，究竟是半生半熟的。」子云道：「我有一个摆骰子的顽意儿，试试你们的心思。」叫取三颗骰子来，蕙芳道：「又是那个飞曲文的么？」子云道：「不是，这容易多着呢。将三颗骰子摆成一句诗色样，随你算。譬如四可以算人，也可以算花，也可以算","en":"the repertoire through and through,\\" laughed Ziyun, \\"and recall it without the least effort.\\" \\"Naturally,\\" said Cixian, \\"— we know a few titles too, but only half by heart.\\" \\"I have a little diversion with dice,\\" said Ziyun, \\"to test your wits.\\" He called for three dice. \\"Is this the 'flying lyrics' game?\\" asked Huifang. \\"No, that is far simpler than this. You arrange"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":1,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"力量，原也勉强，但集腑成裘，也还容易。我与瑶卿、香畹三人可以凑得六百金，王氏弟兄、佩仙、庾香可以凑得四百金。」次贤道：「我来一分，出二百金，前舟可出三百金，庸庵、竹君二人可出三百金。庾香、湘帆、剑潭不必派他，凑起来已得一千八百了。若要三千，还少一千二百两，不消说是度香包圆了。」子云道：「难道华星北倒干干净净，一文不花，这么便宜。」蕙芳道：「据我说，不必要他出钱。","en":"brothers, Peixian, and Yuxiang could manage four hundred.\\" \\"I shall contribute my share of two hundred taels,\\" said Cixian, \\"and Qianzhou can put in three hundred; Yong'an and Zhujun together can provide three hundred. We need not call on Yuxiang, Xiangfan, or Jiantan. All told we would have one thousand eight hundred. If three thousand is the target, we are still short"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":1,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这边四旦个个喜欢，辞了次贤，也同去找了叶茂林，告知此事。茂林一口应承，又对蕙芳道：「停一会儿，你与我同去。我年纪老了，笨嘴笨舌的，恐说不圆转，你在旁帮个腔儿。那位庆奶奶嘴里，好像画眉哨的一般，我有几分怯他。」蕙芳道：「人说他倒是个直性人，顺了他的毛，倒也易的很的。」琴言、宝珠","en":"The four young performers departed in high spirits, took their leave of Cixian, and went together to find Ye Maolin and inform him of the matter. Maolin agreed at once, then said to Huifang: \\"Come with me in a little while. I am old, my tongue is clumsy, and I fear I may not manage the delicate turns of speech. Please be on hand"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":1,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"明日一早，蕙芳就到怡园，子云尚未过来。在次贤处等候，一连两起的人，将子云请了过来，说明此事。子云也甚喜欢，就传总管的，叫他去开了二千四百两的一张银票，格外又一张五十两的，赏与茂林。蕙芳也不耽搁，急忙回去吃了饭，找了茂林，先将五十两送了他，茂林感激不尽，即同到长庆媳妇家来。蕙芳说：「费了多少力，","en":"Early the next morning, Huifang went to the Garden of Contentment. Ziyun had not yet arrived. He waited at Cixian's rooms, and after two rounds of messengers had been sent, Ziyun came over. The matter was explained to him. Ziyun was very pleased, and summoned his chief steward, instructing him to go and draw a bank draft for two thousand four hundred taels, together"}],"44":[{"paragraph":19,"mentions":4,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"那日蕙芳出门去了，琴言便到怡园来。此时梨花已开，子云、次贤与宝珠在梨院闲谈，琴言进来相见了。次贤笑道：「玉侬，如今由你自己作主了，不如辞了华府，到这里来罢。」琴言笑道：「我倒很愿，意但怎样去辞那边呢！」子云笑道：「那还了得？华星北必说我夺其所好，这官司还打得清么？不要弄到叩阍起来。到初七日也可回去了，你是几","en":"gone out, and Qinyan came to the Garden of Contentment on his own. The pear blossoms were now in bloom; Ziyun and Cixian were chatting with Baozhu in the Pear Blossom Courtyard when Qinyan arrived and greeted them. \\"Yunong,\\" laughed Cixian, \\"now that you are your own master, why not resign from the Hua household and come to live here?\\" \\"I would truly like nothing better,\\""},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":3,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"次贤道：「他二人本事不相上下，湘帆是当行出色之文，竹君是才气比纵横，恐怕遇着那冬烘考官，就要委屈了。殿试工夫，竹君不及湘帆，若试宏词，竹君倒要擅长了。我看今年庾香是必得的，剑潭、卓然也有九分。」子云道：「你自己呢，一发拿得稳了。」次贤道：「也不去考，我自","en":"\\"Their abilities are about evenly matched,\\" said Cixian. \\"Xiangfan's style is exceptionally polished and in the right vein; Zhujun's gifts are more wide-ranging and bold. If they meet with an examiner who is conservative, he will likely be undervalued. In palace examination composition, Zhujun falls short"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":2,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"什么箱子？叫来人进来。」话言未了，只见珊枝已走到梨院。琴言望见珊枝，早躲进屋后，潜身听他所为何事。珊枝见子云、次贤，请过了安，说道：「公子与二位老爷请安，有一封信在此。」便双手呈上。子云接来，看见封面上有「皮箱四个，面交徐二老爷查收」，才即问了华公子好，将书拆开，次贤在旁同看，只见写道：","en":"behind the house to listen in concealment, wondering what business had brought him. Shanzhi greeted Ziyun and Cixian formally, and said: \\"The young master sends his respects to both gentlemen, and asks me to deliver this letter.\\" He offered it with both hands. Ziyun took it; on the envelope he read: \\"Four leather trunks, to be delivered to and receipted by Second Lord"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":3,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"代兄撵逐，勿使名园玷辱也。匆匆此布，并候通履。\\n子云看了，正不知从何说起，不白之冤，有口难辩，气得两手冰冷，与次贤面面相观，冷笑了几声。次贤问珊枝道：「你公子对你说什么？」珊枝道：「没有讲什么，就叫小的将琴言的箱子交明老爷，问有回信没有回信。」子云气得说不出来，次贤道：「奇了，这话从何说起？此时也不及写回字，明日我同徐老爷见你公子当面讲罢。」珊枝答应了「是」，退","en":"to begin: the injustice was total, the wrong impossible to argue away. His hands turned cold with anger. He and Cixian looked at each other in silence, and exchanged a few cold laughs. Cixian asked Shanzhi: \\"What did your young master say to you?\\" \\"Nothing in particular,\\" said Shanzhi. \\"He only asked me to deliver Qinyan's trunks clearly to his lordship and to ask whether"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":5,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这边琴言尚不知缘故，似乎听得将箱子送来。知珊枝去了，忙走出来，见子云面貌失色，靠在椅上。宝珠与次贤还看那信，琴言过来要看，次贤意欲藏过，子云道：「给他看看，这是那里说起？华星北真不是人，听了谁的话，这般糟蹋人，可恼！可恼！」琴言不看此信还可，看了不由得伤心起来，一字字看去，忽然一腔怒气，直涌上来，眼前一阵乌黑，喉中如物噎住，透不得气，两眼一翻，望","en":"Hearing Shanzhi's departure, he hurried out, only to find Ziyun pale and slumped in his chair while Baozhu and Cixian pored over the letter. Qinyan stepped forward to read it. Cixian instinctively moved to hide the pages, but Ziyun intervened. \\"Let him see,\\" he said bitterly. \\"Where do such unfounded claims even originate? Hua Xingbei proves himself devoid of all honor,"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":6,"tokens":["次贤","静宜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"少人。我实在不要活了，死了倒干干净净，气恼也没了。在一日恨一日，已经多活了两年，如今极该死的时候。」说了又哭。次贤说道：「你当初进华府时，我早对度香说过，必无好处，如今既已出来，倒也是件好事。以后你就一无罣碍，由你怎样。旧业自然不理的了，你就在这园中与我作个忘年小友，我将那琴棋书画、词赋诗文教你件件精通，将来成个名流，不强如在华府当书童么？应该自己欢喜才是，何必","en":"years past my time, and now it seems my true end has finally come.\\" With that, he dissolved into tears once more. Cixian gently intervened. \\"When you first entered the Hua household, I warned Duxiang that no good would come of it. Now that you have left, it is actually a blessing. From this moment on, you are free of all fetters and can do exactly as you please. Naturally,"},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":2,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"只见蕙芳来了，见了琴言光景，着实诧异，问了缘故，便拍手称快道：「天下有这么好事，真求也求不到，还哭什么呢？」次贤又将子云不要他们唱戏，要他们在园里的话说了。蕙芳道：「这是极好的，只怕我们生了这个下贱的命，未必能有此清福。我这两年内就想要改行，但又无行可改。这跟官一道，与唱戏也在伯仲之间。若做买卖，又不在行。且在这京里，就改了行，人家也认识，总要出了京，才能改图","en":"fortune in all the world!\\" he exclaimed. \\"One could not beg for such luck, yet here you are weeping over it?\\" Cixian then relayed Ziyun's generous proposal to end their performing days and harbor them all safely within the garden. \\"Nothing could be more wonderful,\\" Huifang sighed, \\"though I fear our lowly born fate may never allow us such leisured grace. I have desperately"},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":1,"tokens":["萧次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，心上想子云必定认个不是，自将琴言送来，可以消释此恨。谁知不发一言，公然笑纳，连回字也不给一个，这般可恶，还是萧次贤周旋了一句。这一气就如周公瑾遇了诸葛武侯一般，不觉双眉倒竖，脸泛浓霜，倒也讲不出什么话来。未知后事如何，且听下回分解。","en":"coolly accepted without so much as a written reply. It was sheer, unmitigated impudence, softened only slightly by Xiao Cixian's hollow diplomatic pleasantries. This fresh affront struck Hua Xingbei with the agonizing frustration of Zhou Gongjin outmaneuvered by Zhuge Wuhou. His brows drew together in a fierce, heavy scowl, and a dark chill settled over his features, leaving"}],"45":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说琴言在怡园住下，赖有子云、次贤日为开导，又有那些名旦不约而来，或有煮茗清谈，或有咏花斗酒，园中的胜景甚多，今日在牡丹台，明日在芍药圃，倒也把愁闷消去了一半。","en":"Qinyan stayed on at the Garden of Contentment, finding comfort in the daily counsel of Xu Ziyun and Xiao Cixian. The celebrated dan actors also visited frequently of their own accord. Sometimes they would brew tea for quiet conversation, and at other times they matched verses over wine. The garden offered scene after splendid scene. Today they gathered at the"},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":3,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"后，想趁着那一钩新月，去到怡园，也可畅叙一会，遂禀明了颜夫人、带了云儿，乘兴而来。进了怡园，却值子云未回，到了次贤处。子玉尚未进门，听得有人在那里高谈阔论。次贤见子玉来了，即忙出来，要请到里面。子玉问道：「何客？」次贤笑道：「不要紧，是个湖州王客人，贩些古董书画笔墨等货，来托消的。」","en":"off on a whim. Upon entering the garden, he discovered that Ziyun had not yet returned, so he went directly to Cixian's quarters. Before Ziyu even stepped inside, he heard someone holding forth loudly within. When Cixian saw Ziyu arrive, he hurried out to warmly welcome him inside. Ziyu asked, \\"Who is your guest?\\" Cixian laughed and replied, \\"It is nothing alarming."},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":1,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"得一部好须，直垂至腹。王胡子见子玉清华潇洒，知是个贵公子，头一句便问家世，第二句就问科第。子玉倒有些不好意思，次贤代他答了，王胡子道：「在下作个斯文买卖，二十年来，走了十四省，就是关东、甘肃、广西没有到过，其余各省都已走过几回。去年八月在江西吉安府，遇见尊大人，正在开考。候考完了，也进去叩谒过两回，消了一个宣炉、十匣笔。尊大人还到小寓来回拜的。不瞒梅少爷讲，在下","en":"question was about Ziyu's family background; his second was about examination honors. Ziyu felt somewhat awkward, so Cixian answered on his behalf. Old Wang Beard said, \\"My trade passes for something literary. For twenty years I have walked through fourteen provinces. Only Guandong, Gansu, and Guangxi remain untouched; everywhere else I have visited several times over. Last"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":2,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"次贤觉得子玉有些嫌他。便对子玉道：「何不到玉侬处谈谈，今日又挪到海棠春圃，相去不远。」子玉正中心怀。次贤便叫书童引路，送子玉到了海棠春圃。望见琴言穿着随身的月白夹袄，脚上是双大红盘花珠履，倚着海棠花树，对着块太湖石，在那里凝思。书童咳嗽一声，琴言回头，见","en":"Cixian sensed Ziyu's patience wearing thin and suggested, \\"Why not slip off to Yunong's place for a chat? He moved today to the Crabapple Spring Arbour, which is not far at all.\\" Ziyu's heart leapt at the idea. Cixian ordered a page to guide him, and the servant"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":4,"tokens":["静宜","次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"时还未到这田地。但替你想，也不好尽为着我耽误了你一世。」琴言道：「这话也是白说的。除非候你作了官，才可提拔我。静宜说今年要考博学宏词，若考中了就好了。」子玉道：「这如何拿得定？我倒不想中博学宏词作翰林，我只想得一个外任的小官，同了你出去，我就心满意足了。」二人这一回已谈到定更时候，只见新月半窗，花枝弄影，忽听得外面子云、次贤进来。子云叫道：「庾香在这里么？」子玉","en":"life for my sake.\\" Qinyan smiled sadly. \\"Those are fine words, unless you rise in office and lift me up with you. Jingyi says there is the Erudite Scholars examination this year. If you pass that, all will be well.\\" Ziyu shook his head. \\"Who can promise that? I do not dream of Erudite honors and the Hanlin Academy. I would be perfectly content with a minor provincial post,"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":1,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"用葱蒜五荤罢。」子云道：「这很好，我们菜里本不用葱蒜的。」于是吩咐摆早饭，吃了好上坛。计算人数共是十九位，就在次贤处摆了三桌。吃毕，才到午初。子云先上楼去，看看铺设，遂命人请众位上楼。","en":"Breakfast was ordered so they could ascend afterward. There were nineteen persons in all, with three tables laid in Cixian's quarters. When they finished, it was barely noon. Ziyun went up first to inspect the arrangements, and then invited everyone upstairs."},{"paragraph":30,"mentions":2,"tokens":["静宜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"更有清才萧颖士，漱芳六艺精文史。\\n闲云不肯出山来，赋价曾高洛阳纸。\\n道生道：「这位是静宜了。」漱芳看见第二句，心中暗喜神仙赞静宜，也带着他的名字，可谓附尾了。一面看写的道：","en":"clouds refuse the mountains' call,\\nHis fu once priced above Luoyang's fine paper.\\"\\nDaosheng nodded. \\"That must be Jingyi.\\" Shufang thrilled at the second line. The immortal had praised Jingyi and slipped in his own name. They read on:"},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":1,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"刘晨子晋求仙去，十丈红尘阻前路。\\n均是龙华会上人，名场同日欣知遇。\\n次贤道：「这是前舟、庸庵了。」众人说是。王恂道：「我们这些人都说完了，看以后还说谁。」只见又写道：","en":"blocked their sail,\\nYet all were guests at Dragon-Flower feast,\\nSame day they knew joy in fame's bright field.\\"\\nCixian noted, \\"That is Qianzhou and Yong'an.\\" Wang Xun added, \\"We've all been named. Let's see who follows.\\" Next:"},{"paragraph":38,"mentions":1,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉喜动颜色，即道：「玉侬若得道翁先生栽培，真是精金入冶，美玉成器。只求道翁不以寒微为鄙，玉侬岂有不愿之理？」次贤与吉甫等都赞成道：「这是极好的事，大约今日合当父子相逢，不然杜兰仙何以特判出来，又单叫道翁上前，说明前因后果，不是也要撮合这件事么？可见数已前定。」子云接口道：「可勿三思，请到承荫堂一拜就算了。」道生想道：「我看着琴言虽系优伶，却无半点习气，度香早说","en":"fine gold in the forge, fair jade carved to ware. Only do not scorn his humble birth. How could Yunong refuse?\\" Cixian and Jifu wholeheartedly approved. \\"Nothing could be better. Today, father and son were meant to meet. Else why would Du Lanxiang have singled out the judgment and called Old Gentleman forward to explain cause and effect, except to bring this about? The"},{"paragraph":39,"mentions":1,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"目视子云，将头点了一点。子云哈哈大笑道：「愿意了，愿意了！这也不是轻易遇得着的。」就让众人到承荫堂，铺了红毡，次贤、子云扶道生坐了，文泽、仲清拉过琴言来拜了八拜，道生受了。","en":"agrees, he agrees! Such meetings are rare!\\" He led everyone to the Hall of Inherited Shade and spread a red carpet. Cixian and Ziyun seated Daosheng. Wenze and Zhongqing gently drew Qinyan forward to perform eight deep bows, and Daosheng graciously received them."},{"paragraph":41,"mentions":1,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云便请入席。第一席是道生、子玉、吉甫、王胡子、琴言，二席是仲清、文泽、王恂、子云、次贤，九个名旦分为两桌，各自叙齿坐了三、四两席。琴言坐在下手，拘拘谨谨，也不举箸，甚觉可怜。倒是道生体恤他，道：「凡遇热闹场中，当言的即言，也不必过于拘谨，但存着个后辈的分寸就是了。」","en":"sat Daosheng, Ziyu, Jifu, Old Wang Beard, and Qinyan. The second seated Zhongqing, Wenze, Wang Xun, Ziyun, and Cixian. The nine actors split two more tables by age. Qinyan sat quietly at the foot, his chopsticks untouched, looking pitifully constrained. Daosheng comforted him gently. \\"In lively gatherings, speak when speech is due. Do not bind yourself too tightly."},{"paragraph":47,"mentions":1,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"个最妙。我心上不好讲，又要搅扰。我还要细细把你的园子逛一逛呢！」诸名士道：「若得道翁先生住在园里，更有趣了。」次贤道：「前年园亭成后，一切布置倒也罢了。只有一样，各处的联匾，都是草创时定的。后来改造起来，往往有些不合适了。且书字撰句，就是我们二人，并无第三人斟酌。","en":"garden thoroughly.\\" The gentlemen all agreed. \\"If Old Gentleman lives in the garden, it will be merrier still.\\" Cixian said, \\"When the pavilions were first built, the couplets and plaques were mere rough drafts. Later rebuilding left some ill fits. Only Ziyun and I penned them, and there was no third hand to polish the lines.\\""},{"paragraph":48,"mentions":1,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"日之兴，游到了，方可拟题。」子云道：「含万楼下，我想刻一篇怡园序，要借重道翁。明日搬来，第一就要请教这篇序。」次贤笑道：「他还没有搬进来，你倒先索房租了。」说得众人大笑。道生约定明日即移过来，与琴言同住。","en":"and I humbly beg Old Gentleman's ink for the task. Your first duty when you move in tomorrow is that preface.\\" Cixian laughed out loud. \\"He has not moved in yet, and you already demand rent!\\" The room filled with general laughter. Daosheng named the morrow for his move, confirming he would lodge with Qinyan."}],"46":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说屈道翁搬过怡园来，与琴仙就在海棠春圃住下。次贤向在梨花院，与海棠圃相近。道翁即有一番教导，琴仙从前念过的书，一面温理，一面与他讲究些诗词文艺，习学楷书。可喜琴仙天姿颖悟，过目成诵，而且锐志攻书，把从前的忧闷倒也撇开。一连几日，道翁见其聪明可学，也甚欢喜。子云更为得意，吩咐园内家人都称为屈大爷。约","en":"moved over to the Garden of Contentment, he and Qinxian took up their lodging at the Crabapple Spring Garden. Cixian had long been in the Pear Blossom Court, which was close by. Daoweng set about teaching him at once: the books Qinxian had read before were gone over again, and along with them they discussed poetry and prose and the arts, and he practised his regular"},{"paragraph":2,"mentions":3,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一日，想起子云托做《怡园序》，便作了半日，又修饰了一会，自己送与子云、次贤看了，请他斟酌。次贤道：「妙极了，就使徐、庾复生，也不能涂改一字。」子云道：「是石刻好呢，还是木刻好呢？」道翁道：「论长久，自然是石刻。前日见金吉甫相熟的那个季十矮子，刻工尚好，不过价值大些，然此是市井的常理。你莫若找吉甫将他荐来一刻，是极妙的。不是","en":"*Preface to the Garden of Contentment*, Daoweng drafted half a day, revised, and carried the text to Ziyun and Cixian for comment. Cixian said: \\"Perfect—even if Xu Ling and Yu Xin rose from the grave they could not alter a stroke.\\" Ziyun asked: \\"Stone inscription or woodblock?\\" Daoweng said: \\"For longevity, stone. That carver Ji the Tenth who knows Jin Jifu does honest"},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":1,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"士于二十八日早上陆续皆到。是日子玉、春航、南湘、仲清、文泽、王恂，共是六位，惟吉甫因感冒未到。园内屈氏父子，与次贤、主人四位，都在含万楼下坐了。道翁道：「这个含万楼是本《易经》「含万物而化光」句摘下，因为园中的主楼，故取此名。但就本意是言干道之大，此名似乎不甚相宜，度香以为何如？我见楼上现供着赐书，何不就改为赐书楼，未知可否？」子云道：「改得甚妙，就是赐书楼。还","en":"Chunhang, Nanxiang, Zhongqing, Wenze and Wang Xun—six—while Jifu stayed home with a chill. The Qu father and son, Cixian and their host — four in all — sat below the Tower of Myriad Containment. Daoweng explained: \\"This tower borrows from the *Book of Changes*: 'embracing the myriad things, transforming their splendour.' As chief pavilion it suits grandeur—yet the lines"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":2,"tokens":["静宜","次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子内有座戏台，槐阴布绿，栋宇生辉。道翁与诸名士看了那些匾对，说道：「这堂名很好，不用换。东西楹要添副长联，就请静宜大笔罢。」次贤道：「这些联额，原是弟当日胡乱写成的。这承荫堂与赐书楼，皆是正屋，还求吾兄老手一题才称，恐我们终是柔筋脆骨，撑不住这个大局面。况所添的地方尚多，大约有二十余处，再等我与诸位分拟罢。」道翁道：「不是这么说。我虽与诸位兄台相叙了几次，尚未瞻","en":"of this hall is good; there is no need to change it. The east and west pillars want a long couplet added. Let Jingyi take the brush.\\"\\n\\nCixian said, \\"Those boards and couplets I dashed off anyhow in my time. The Hall of Inherited Shade and the Tower of Imperial Bestowals are both principal buildings; nothing will suit them but an inscription from your practised hand."},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":1,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"五云书凿金银字，百宝栏开富贵花。\\n道翁看了赞道：「真好富丽，却称这宝香堂。」众人也附和了几声。次贤道：「我们还是从东去呢，还是从西去呢？」子云道：「从西到东路长，还是从东转西，可以坐船，路却顺些。」便领众人出了护香廊后的围墙，只见一带石坡，层层的丛兰翠筱，芳磬袭人。从石磴上行到了山北，也是一样的兰竹。","en":"gems cradle blossoms of wealth and honour.\\"\\n\\nDaoweng praised the grandeur as worthy of the hall; others echoed. Cixian asked: \\"East loop or west?\\" Ziyun said: \\"West to east runs longer—begin east and circle west by boat—the route flows easier.\\" He led them past the colonnade wall onto stone terraces layered with orchid and bamboo—fragrance everywhere—then climbed north"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":2,"tokens":["静宜","次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"以。」道翁道：「够了。太大了，太觉空旷。你这个园好在不散，处处精神团聚，一处有一处的结构，真是好手笔，大约你与静宜也费尽了心。」次贤道：「可不是，那时你又不在京里。你若在此，便好商量，必定还要添出许多好处来。」","en":"gathers at every point, and each place has a design of its own. It is very finely done, and I dare say you and Jingyi spent a great deal of thought on it.\\" Cixian said, \\"Indeed we did — and you were not in the capital then. If you had been here we could have consulted you, and no doubt a good many more merits would have come of it.\\""},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":1,"tokens":["静宜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"道翁道：「已经好极了，设使我起出稿来，还未必能如此。」子云道：「有几处，静宜也改了好几回才成的。」子玉道：「这梅崦两字，只好刻在山上。在房屋里，这崦字似乎要改才好。」道翁道：「就请教换个名字。」子玉道：「还请道翁先生改罢。」仲清道：「你若想着了好的，就说也不妨。」道翁道：「正是，就我换得不妥，也要请教大家商量的。」子玉道：「","en":"a draft of my own, it might not have reached this standard.\\" Ziyun explained, \\"There were several places that Jingyi revised again and again before they came right.\\"\\n\\nZiyu said, \\"The two words 'Plum Cove' would do very well carved upon the face of a hill; attached to a house, however, the character for \\"cove\\" seems to want changing.\\"\\n\\n\\"Then please favor us with another"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":1,"tokens":["萧次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"于是出了蕊珠仙府，顺着两行修竹径，一条荔枝街，又过了几处神仙洞，望东走，到了萧次贤的梨院来。道翁道：「可不必进去了，梨院可改为卧云香院，庸庵兄请题一联。」王恂一面想，随着走到了海棠春圃来。子云道：「且请坐坐，喝杯茶，那边又要用船了。」都进了海棠春圃坐下。道翁道：「海棠花为花中艳品，还有那些紫白丁香衬贴他，更觉香色兼备，须好好起他个","en":"Stamens, followed the double avenue of tall bamboo and Lychee Lane, passed several grottoes, and going east came to Xiao Cixian's Pear Court. Daoweng said, \\"There is no need to go in. The Pear Court may be changed to the Fragrant Court of Reclining Clouds. Brother Yong'an, a couplet, if you please.\\"\\n\\nWang Xun was still thinking as they walked on to the Crabapple Spring Garden,"},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":1,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"惜余芳，娇比玉颜时醒醉；\\n众人大赞，倒将琴仙赞得不好意思起来。仲清道：「可惜没有下联。」子玉将这句不住的吟哦，次贤道：「这下联非庾香续成不可。」道翁道：「果然，就烦庾香点铁成金罢。」子玉欣然提起笔来，写道：","en":"Qinxian grew shy under it. Zhongqing said, \\"A pity there is no lower line.\\" Ziyu kept murmuring the words over. Cixian said, \\"Nobody but Yuxiang can complete that lower line.\\" Daoweng said, \\"True enough. Let us trouble Yuxiang to turn iron into gold.\\" Ziyu took up the brush with pleasure and wrote:"},{"paragraph":35,"mentions":2,"tokens":["静宜","次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"道翁道：「这个名字要改，此处是第二个胜景，着不得陈腐语，改为练秋阁罢。」众人道：「改得很好。」道翁道：「此处须静宜添一副好对子。」次贤道：「恐题得不佳。」也即写了两句，看是：","en":"will not bear a stale phrase. Call it the Refining Autumn Loft.\\" They all said, \\"Well changed.\\" Daoweng said, \\"Jingyi must add a good couplet here.\\" Cixian said, \\"I am afraid it will not be well done,\\" and wrote two lines. They read:"},{"paragraph":37,"mentions":2,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云让众人下船，对次贤道：「先到桂岭，转来再到缥渺亭罢。」次贤道：「自然先到桂岭为是。」就从练秋阁旁，转入一条小港，随着山脚，荡有三箭多远。上坡见是一个药圃，四面围着白石短栏，一个亭子。从亭子进去，有几间屋宇，内中清洁，有些药铛、杵臼等物。一边是豆花篱，此时却还空着。","en":"Ziyun had them go ashore, and said to Cixian, \\"Let us go to Osmanthus Ridge first, and come round afterwards to the Pavilion of Faint Mist.\\" Cixian said, \\"By all means Osmanthus Ridge first.\\"\\n\\nFrom beside the Refining Autumn Loft they turned into a small channel and followed the foot of the hill"},{"paragraph":43,"mentions":1,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"三四层重楼，湘帘晃漾，绮户文窗，令人应接不暇。道翁道：「这个楼名题得才妙，无须更换。东风昨夜楼是那一位题的？」次贤道：「是度香题的，对子是我做的。」道翁道：「好对子。」朗吟了一遍，也叫琴仙写了出来，琴仙记得是：","en":"in. Daoweng said, \\"This tower is finely named; it needs no changing. Who wrote the East-Wind-Last-Night Tower?\\" Cixian said, \\"Duxiang wrote the name, and I made the couplet.\\" Daoweng said, \\"A good couplet.\\" He chanted it through once and had Qinxian write it out; as Qinxian remembered it, it ran:"},{"paragraph":52,"mentions":1,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"是夕阳西下，朱霞半天，映着那些牡丹花，更为绚烂。已撤了护花的幛子。子云备了两席，一席是道翁、南湘、子玉、琴仙、次贤，一席是仲清、春航、文泽、王恂、子云。","en":"vault set peonies blazing—protective screens gone. Two tables waited—one for Daoweng, Nanxiang, Ziyu, Qinxian, Cixian; one for Zhongqing, Chunhang, Wenze, Wang Xun, Ziyun."},{"paragraph":53,"mentions":2,"tokens":["静宜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"性灵。今日高超的是剑潭，沉着的是竹君，细腻风光的是庾香，风华绮丽的是湘帆，秀润工稳的是庸庵、前舟，潇洒跌宕的是静宜，就是度香那副集句，也觉得落落大方。正是各人自立一帜，无从评定甲乙。你们看这二十四副对子，好在虚字少，尽是实字多，便见得力量。若教外边那些名宿做起来，不知要添多少虚字在里头，才凑得成、捏得拢呢。」众名士一齐佩服。子云道：「先生何不将那篇序文拿出来，大","en":"Yuxiang has the delicate scene; Xiangfan the rich and splendid; Yong'an and Qianzhou the polished and well-turned; Jingyi the free and unconstrained; and even Duxiang's set of borrowed lines has an easy largeness about it. Each has planted his own banner, and there is no ranking them first and second.\\n\\n\\"Look at these twenty-four couplets: their merit is that they are light"}],"47":[{"paragraph":3,"mentions":1,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"了。你去对他们讲，说我说的，不必另觅，将来如有家眷来了，再找不迟。我明日拣个日子去请他就是了。」蕙芳应了，又到次贤、琴仙处谈了一会。琴仙知道不日就要出京，回念旧时朋友相好一场，出京之后，不知何年再叙，甚觉缱绻，留蕙芳坐了半天，谈了好些话。蕙芳道：「你要出京，我们自然要送行的。但你令尊在家，拘拘束束，不甚畅快，须到外边去才好。」琴仙也应了。蕙芳谈了许久，方才辞出，","en":"can search for a house then. I shall choose a day soon to formally invite them.\\" Huifang agreed, then visited Cixian and Qinxian for a while. Knowing he would leave the capital shortly, Qinxian felt a deep, lingering attachment to his old friends, wondering what year might bring them together again after his departure. He kept Huifang for half the day in heartfelt"}],"48":[{"paragraph":11,"mentions":1,"tokens":["萧次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，便搬进怡园，在清凉诗境住了。他的脾气又与春航两样，把那些同年同馆朋友不放在眼里，也不出去应酬，天天与屈道翁、萧次贤、徐子云一班人，诗酒陶情。","en":"cohort friends and avoided social engagements. Day after day, he indulged in wine and poetry with Qu Daoweng, Xiao Cixian, Xu Ziyun, and their refined circle."},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":1,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"今日已是五月初四，道翁定于初七日起身，众名士饯行已过。今日道翁一早进城，为华公子请去了。南湘来找次贤、子云，都不在园里，即到春风沉醉轩来，只见琴仙手托香腮，在那里颦眉泪眼，见南湘进来，连忙起身。南湘笑道：「我道你此番自然长了学问，谁知还是那样见识。人生离合悲欢，是一定之理，各人免不来的，何必作那儿女嗫嚅、楚囚相对的光景？快不要这样。你看半阴半晴，时","en":"concluded. Early that morning, Daoweng went into the city at Young Master Hua's invitation. Nanxiang came searching for Cixian and Ziyun, but finding neither in the garden, he proceeded to the Pavilion of Spring Breeze Drunk. There he found Qinxian with his chin resting in his hand, his brows knitted and his eyes wet with tears. Nanxiang laughed and said that he had expected"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":1,"tokens":["静宜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"南湘叫摆过酒来，家童摆好了。金粟道：「庾香、玉侬过来喝一杯罢。」一面把船荡到练秋阁前，南湘道：「去年静宜有个《水浒传》的酒令，媚香掣着了《潘金莲雪天戏叔》，媚香那个神色，再没有这么好笑，不料湘帆今日竟能如此了。」金粟道：「湘帆真不负媚香。」说着，叹了一口气。南湘道：「也幸遇着了媚香，若遇了别人，未必有这管教他的本领。若天天朝歌夜弦，只怕湘帆真要做郑元和","en":"Su invited Yuxiang and Yunong to share a cup. As the boat drifted near Refining Autumn Loft, Nanxiang recalled Jingyi's \\"Water Margin\\" drinking game from the previous year, remembering how Meixiang's expression during \\"Pan Jinlian Teases Her Brother-in-Law in the Snow\\" was incomparably amusing, and marveling that Xiangfan could rival it today. Jin Su agreed that Xiangfan"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":1,"tokens":["静宜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"做首诗赠玉侬。」子玉道：「我们联句罢。」金粟道：「这个恐不能，各人是各人的情意，未必联得上来。」琴仙道：「前日静宜画了一柄扇子，是个《怡园饯别图》，度香于那一面填了一首《金缕曲》，还空了一半。」说罢，便从袖子里拿了出来，给与金粟等看了，见画的是古香林屋，内中画几个人在那里饯行的光景，度香的词也做得甚好。子玉道：「我们就和他的韵罢。」南湘道：「你先来。」子玉一面闲","en":"\\"That will hardly answer. Each man's feeling is his own; the links may not join.\\"\\n\\nQinxian said, \\"The other day Jingyi painted a fan — a *Farewell at the Garden of Contentment* — and Duxiang filled in a *Jinlü Qu* on the other side, and left half of it empty.\\" He drew it from his sleeve and gave it to Jin Su and the others to look at: the Ancient-Fragrance Woodland Lodge,"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":1,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"」金粟道：「这是绝唱，还和什么？可不必了。」子玉写好。这一会凄楚，连南湘、金粟也没有兴致，即上了岸。正逢子云、次贤回来，大家在寻源仙墅坐了一会，道翁也回来了。","en":"misery had left even Nanxiang and Jin Su without any heart for the day, and they went ashore. They met Ziyun and Cixian just coming back, and all sat a while at the Seeking-the-Source Immortal Villa, and presently Daoweng returned as well."},{"paragraph":34,"mentions":1,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"道翁在园，琴仙也要收拾些零碎。那名旦九人，是要到子云处来贺节的，见了一见。子云也无心绪，没有请客，就止与南湘、次贤、屈氏父子，在练秋阁小饮了几杯，看了一看龙舟，应了景儿。","en":"festive entertainment, Ziyun hosted no grand banquets; he merely shared a few quiet cups of wine with Nanxiang, Cixian, and the Qu father and son at Refining Autumn Loft, watching the dragon boats perfunctorily to honor the occasion before letting it pass."},{"paragraph":36,"mentions":1,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云也送了六百，文泽送了二百，道翁的盘费很富足了。子云、次贤各备车马跟着，一直送出城外，直到十里之外皇华亭。只见南湘、仲清、文泽、金粟、王恂、子玉、春航，领着那蕙芳、宝珠、素兰、漱芳、玉林、兰保、桂保、琪官、春喜九个名旦，在皇华亭等候。道翁等连忙下车，极口辞谢。各人皆要把盏。","en":"pieces of silver, and Wenze gave two hundred, ensuring Daoweng's travel funds were exceedingly abundant. Ziyun and Cixian each prepared their own carriages and followed closely behind, escorting them ten li beyond the city wall to the Imperial Envoys' Pavilion, ten miles away. Waiting there at the pavilion were Nanxiang, Zhongqing, Wenze, Jin Su, Wang Xun, Ziyu, and Chunhang,"},{"paragraph":38,"mentions":2,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"在地。慌得众人连忙扶起，拍的拍，唤的唤。把个子玉急得如痰迷心窍一般，直瞪瞪两眼，一句话说不出，泪落如雨。子云、次贤慌了，救醒了琴仙，便说道：「快扶他上车罢。」道翁交代家人刘喜好好服侍。子云谓道翁道：「令郎与他们几年在一处，一刻要分手，自然是难忍的。道翁先生，我们倒不敢久留了，一路福星，请升舆罢。」道翁见琴仙如此，心内甚慌，与诸人作了一个揖，又握着子云、次贤的手道","en":"thick phlegm had sealed his heart, entirely unable to speak while tears poured down his face like rain.\\n\\nZiyun and Cixian were equally alarmed. When Qinxian had been brought round, they said, \\"Get him into the carriage, quickly.\\" Daoweng charged his servant Liu Xi to wait on him carefully.\\n\\nZiyun said to Daoweng, \\"Your son has been among them these several years, and to"}],"49":[{"paragraph":8,"mentions":6,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"再将琴言细细一想，真没有甚么不好，倒冤了他，便也赞了几句。道翁去后，次贤又来，才将这事澈底澄清的讲了一番，华公子始悔自己孟浪，又念与子云两代世交，为这点事绝交，是给人要议论的。又因他是个盟兄，只得尽个弟道，下口气先去招陪他。先是道翁、次贤已将华公子懊悔之意与子云讲过。子云是大度包容的，既是他先来，岂尚有芥蒂之意？便与从前","en":"again, he realized the boy truly had no faults; he had wronged him, and he voiced his praise. After Daoweng left, Cixian arrived and clarified the entire matter thoroughly. Only then did Young Master Hua fully repent his rashness, mindful of the generations of deep friendship between their families. To break ties over such a trivial matter would surely invite public ridicule."},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":1,"tokens":["萧次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"编修颜庄之子名仲清，现任礼部尚书刘大人之子名文泽，内阁学士王大人之子名恂。此外，还有苏州拔贡生高品，湖南优贡生萧次贤。这几位都是名下无虚，与田修撰、史庶常朝夕观摩，是门生往来无间的。其余不知其他，不敢滥举。」苏侯听了，掀髯大笑：「怎么你举的人，多半是我的年侄？你不要阿私所好，叫我听了喜欢。」子云笑道：「这个门生怎敢，至于老师的同年故旧，门生却也不能尽知。」苏侯笑道","en":"named Xun. In addition, there is the Suzhou specially recommended graduate Gao Pin, and the Hunan honored graduate Xiao Cixian. These gentlemen fully live up to their reputations. They study day and night with Compiler Tian and Bachelor Shi, and I associate with them closely. As for the rest, I do not know them well and dare not recommend them indiscriminately.\\" Hearing this,"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":1,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"明日，春航果然来找子云，子云只推宅里有事，叫春航在南湘、次贤处等了一日。明日又来，子云又不见他。春航明知子云故意作难，然心上又恐怕此事不谐，只得忍耐了性气，第三日又来，才见了子云。子云笑道：「这几日，吾弟有甚么要紧事，连日来找我？」春航笑道：「已经三顾了。我知道前日失言，仁兄因此怪我。」子云笑道：「岂有此理。","en":"Ziyun, but Ziyun merely claimed there was business in the inner household and left Chunhang waiting in Nanxiang and Cixian's quarters all day. The following day, Chunhang came again, and again Ziyun avoided him. Chunhang knew perfectly well that Ziyun was deliberately making things difficult, but fearing the match might fall through, he swallowed his impatience. On the third"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":1,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"只见次贤、南湘进来，大家坐了。子云即将苏侯问南湘的话，与南湘说了。南湘听了，不觉双眉一扬，说道：「没有什么错处，我也照着人一样。况且那一天同着人去的，并不是我一人，怎么就是我错，又单是我狂呢？这就难了，这就难了。」","en":"Just then, Cixian and Nanxiang entered, and everyone took a seat. Ziyun immediately relayed Su the Marquis's remarks about Nanxiang's etiquette. Hearing this, Nanxiang's eyebrows shot up in indignation. \\"What did I do wrong? I follow the same etiquette as everyone else."},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":2,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"者你那神色之间，有些错处也未可知。」南湘瞅着春航道：「我倒请教你，什么叫神色之间有些错呢？」大家也就不言语了。次贤问子云道：「湘帆的事如何？」子云道：「可成。」又将苏侯问他访些真才实学的人，就将对苏侯所举那几个，一一讲来。又对南湘道：「原来你们都是年谊。」南湘道：「原是年伯，但从前却不大往来。」子云道：「闻考宏词定于八月初一日，如今只有两月多了，怎么高卓然还不见","en":"you to explain to me—what exactly does \\"something amiss in expression or demeanor\\" mean?\\" The room fell silent. Cixian broke the quiet by asking Ziyun, \\"How did Xiangfan's matter go?\\" Ziyun replied, \\"It can be done.\\" He then recounted how Su the Marquis had asked him to seek out men of true talent and learning, detailing the names he had proposed. Turning to Nanxiang,"}],"50":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["静宜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"便道：「你又更换了好些？」春喜道：「你看我那幅画是黄鹤山樵的，真不真？」文泽道：「据我看不像真的。」春喜道：「静宜给我的，他说是真的。」","en":"you think it's authentic?\\" Wenze studied it and said, \\"To my eyes, it doesn't look genuine.\\" Chunxi replied, \\"Jingyi gave it to me; he assured me it was real.\\""},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":2,"tokens":["静宜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"近来我也不给他看了，他倒常来要我的看。我总要画好了才给他看呢。我问静宜要了许多稿子，静宜说我照着他画，倒不要看那芥子园的画谱。」又笑嘻嘻的对着文泽道：「我与你画把扇子。」文泽道：「此时我不要，等你学好了再画。」春喜道：「你们势利，怎见得我此时就画得不好？你若有好团扇，我就加意画了。」说罢就跑了进去，拿了一柄团扇出来，画","en":"instead he comes asking to see mine. But I insist on finishing them perfectly before I let him have a look. I asked Jingyi for a great many drafts, and Jingyi advised me to just copy his work from life, telling me to ignore those 'Mustard Seed Garden' painting manuals.\\" Smiling brightly at Wenze, he offered, \\"Let me paint a fan for you.\\" Wenze replied, \\"I don't want one"}],"52":[{"paragraph":3,"mentions":1,"tokens":["萧次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"。张桐孙陪了这几位在聚星堂观戏，演得是联珠班。春航陪着一班名士在花园挹爽斋观演联锦班。那一天大媒是徐子云，客是萧次贤、高品、南湘、颜仲清、刘文泽、王恂、梅子玉。近日子玉病已好了，勉强打起精神出来。这八个名旦不消说都在园中，那聚星堂上一个也不去，尽是一班中年的脚色，与那些寻常的旦脚，在那里应酬。","en":"Yishuang Study to watch the Lianjin Troupe. The principal matchmaker that day was Xu Ziyun, and the guests included Xiao Cixian, Gao Pin, Nanxiang, Yan Zhongqing, Liu Wenze, Wang Xun, and Mei Ziyu. Ziyu had only recently recovered from his illness, forcing himself to rally his spirits to attend. Naturally, all eight famous dan actors remained in the garden; not a single one went"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":1,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"春航尚要骂他，只见家人进来禀道：「苏府妆奁已到。」一片吹打之声。春航请了子云、次贤一同迎接上去。送奁的是苏府几位本家亲戚，内中有华公子，绣衣金带，玉貌如仙。春航尚是初见，已久仰这位连衿的大名，接进了聚星堂，齐齐见礼。","en":"Su household's trousseau has arrived!\\" Outside, a cacophony of festive music flared. Chunhang invited Ziyun and Cixian to join him in welcoming the procession. Among the Su relatives escorting the dowry was Young Master Hua—dressed in embroidered robes and a golden belt, his features as radiant as an immortal. Though meeting this famed new brother-in-law for the first"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":1,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"华公子又与高品、南湘、仲清、王恂、文泽、次贤各讲了些话，知高品才从苏州来，问了些江苏风景。偶然见素兰的扇子一面画的甚细，要了过来，看了一会。又见那一面写着小楷，题目是《断肠词》。华公子道：「肠何可以轻断？」子玉见了，又觉不安。华公子低低吟了一遍，又问素兰道：「这是你自己的么？」素兰道：「字与画","en":"Young Master Hua then conversed with Gao Pin, Nanxiang, Zhongqing, Wang Xun, Wenze, and Cixian. Learning that Gao Pin had just arrived from Suzhou, he asked about the landscapes of Jiangsu. By chance, he noticed Sulan holding a fan with exceedingly delicate painting on one side and asked to look at it. Turning it over, he saw neat, small script"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":1,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"像闺阁口气。」子云道：「不要是他夫人题的么？这两首像是唱和的。」仲清道：「未必，如果是他夫人写的，怎肯给人？」次贤道：「这话说得是。」诸名士在园内谈心，却说那聚星堂上，王文辉见诸名旦一个不来，颇觉岑寂，又不好意思去叫他们。想蕙芳在账房里，便叫了他出来。蕙芳也累苦了，乐得出来歇歇，便到文辉席上来，就在文辉旁边坐了。此处是两席，那席是刘守正、周锡爵、杨方猷，这席是王","en":"Zhongqing doubted this, \\"Not necessarily. If his wife had written it, how could he so casually give it away?\\" Cixian agreed, \\"That is a fair point.\\" While the scholars chatted in the garden, back in the Gathering Stars Hall, Wang Wenhui found the absence of the famous dans rather dreary but felt too embarrassed to summon them. Remembering Huifang was in the accounting"}],"53":[{"paragraph":15,"mentions":1,"tokens":["静宜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一日，子云正与静宜、南湘、高品闲话，只见书童拿了一包书信进来。子云一看封面，是屈道翁在南京途中寄来的，心中一喜。拆了总封，里头有十几封信与各相好，却都是琴言笔迹，说自己跌坏了膀子不能写，无非是些道谢等语，内有怀怡园诸同人五古一篇，并沿途七律八首。又见琴言另有一封信，子","en":"One day, Ziyun was chatting idly with Jingyi, Nanxiang, and Gao Pin when a pageboy brought in a bundle of letters. Ziyun looked at the cover and saw it was sent by Qu Daoweng en route from Nanjing. His heart leapt with joy.\\n\\nHe broke the main seal and found over ten letters addressed to various"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":1,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"了大奇，道：「不料玉侬竟能与庾香那首工力悉敌，一样沉痛。」高品道：「玉侬学问几时长的？我去年没有见他能如此。」次贤道：「这是新进长的，不料受乃翁陶熔了几天，就这些进境。若过两年，不知要好到怎样呢！」南湘道：「我只道庾香这首词是绝唱，不能和的，谁又想和出这一首来，我看倒非玉侬不能。」又见另写着一纸道：","en":"sorrow?\\"\\n\\nGao Pin said, \\"When did Yunong's learning advance so much? I did not see him capable of this last year.\\"\\n\\nCixian said, \\"This is fresh growth; to think that after only a few days of his adoptive father's molding, he has made such progress. In another two years, who knows how excellent he will become!\\"\\n\\nNanxiang added, \\"I thought Yuxiang's lyric was an unanswerable"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":1,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"请自宽解，以侍晨昏。\\n夏秋多厉，千万珍重。琴言百拜。\\n子云等看了，叹息一会。子云道：「怎样呢？将庾香请来罢。」次贤道：「不可。这首词他若见了，必有一番伤心痛哭，那时在这里倒教他难为情。不如送去与他，索性使他哭个尽性罢。」子云即着人将琴言并道生的信，送与子玉。","en":"others read it and sighed for a long while. Ziyun asked, \\"What should we do? Should we invite Yuxiang over?\\"\\n\\nCixian said, \\"We must not. If he sees this lyric here, it will surely provoke a bout of heartbreaking, bitter weeping, and it will be difficult for him to contain his emotions in public. It is better to send it to him, so he can simply weep to his heart's content.\\""}],"54":[{"paragraph":3,"mentions":2,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"考期三日前就忙乱起来，各士子投印结，买卷子，海内文人纷纷拥挤，自致仕先达以及布衣，共有七八百人。子云托人保了次贤，次贤忽然的抱病起来，不能赴考，子云甚为太息。","en":"regions, retired grandees and commoners alike—seven to eight hundred in total. Ziyun had arranged recommendation for Cixian, but Cixian suddenly fell ill and could not sit; Ziyun sighed deeply."}],"57":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"晴光和蔼，风不扬尘，小毛衣服都用不着，绵的尽够了。袁绮香一早带了十二红婢，还有几个家人媳妇，先到园里候客。那日次贤、高品、南湘皆回避了。那十二红都是十五六岁，有的已是云鬓堆鸦，有的还是垂髫刷翠，却一样的盈盈秋水，窄窄弓鞋。绮香夫人带了群婢在宝香堂伺候。今日宝香堂另是一番铺设，一色的锦裀绣褥，翠幕银屏，中间堆了七层菊花。","en":"twelve 'Red' maids, along with several married serving-women, into the garden to await her guests. On this day, Cixian, Gao Pin, and Nanxiang had tactfully avoided the inner grounds. The twelve Red maids were all about fifteen or sixteen years of age. Some already wore their hair in towering cloud-buns like crows' wings, while others still wore hanging tresses brushed"}],"59":[{"paragraph":22,"mentions":1,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"暂延残喘，务祈设法着人前来等语。子玉不觉泪如泉涌，万箭攒心，毫无主意，也不忍再看。便吩咐套车到怡园找子云，谁知次贤、子云、南湘、高品没有一个在园子里，子玉更加着急。跟班们不知何事，又不敢问子玉，便又到九香楼，进去见诸名旦都在园中，南湘、高品、金粟都在这里。子玉不及叙话，一脸悲愁，就将琴仙给众人之信与他们看了，个个洒泪。再不料琴仙一出京，就遭此大难，真令人意想不到","en":"immediately ordered a carriage to take him to the Garden of Contentment to find Ziyun. To his dismay, neither Cixian, Ziyun, Nanxiang, nor Gao Pin were at the garden. Ziyu grew even more frantic. The footmen, unaware of what had happened, didn't dare to ask Ziyu and drove him on to the Nine-Fragrance Tower. Going inside, he found that all the famous dans were gathered"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":3,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"。众人哭毕，子云道：「此事在我，明日即着人到江南去接玉侬回来，并办道翁葬事。但今年不能到了。」子云即回，要告诉次贤商量此事。子玉也无心在九香楼，便即回家。高品，史南湘金粟与那些名旦，各惆怅无欢。子云回园与次贤说了，次贤更痛得伤心，一夜之间，便摹了道翁神像。明日邀同众名士在九香楼为位而哭，设奠三日。华公子得了信，也来哭奠。一个九香园倒成了屈道翁的丧居了，就没有穿孝","en":"arrangements. However, they won't be able to reach him before the year's end.\\" Ziyun returned immediately to inform Cixian and discuss the matter with him. With no heart to remain at the Nine-Fragrance Tower, Ziyu also went straight home. Gao Pin, Shi Nanxiang, Jin Su, and the famous dans were left feeling melancholic and devoid of any joy. When Ziyun returned to the garden"}],"60":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["萧次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"宵，六街三市，火树银花，好不热闹。子云于十三日请了华公子、田春航、梅子玉、史南湘、高品、颜仲清、刘文泽、王恂、萧次贤、金粟、屈勤先，并九香园诸人，作一大会。琴仙见了华公子，尚有些不安，华公子也不问起前事，以礼相待。此时琴仙已出了旦党，入了士党，但从前作旦时傲睨一切，此刻倒谦谦自守起来，因此上下诸人更加尊重他，绝没有一个人笑他。琴仙对了那些名旦，还是从前一样，并不生","en":"gathering for Young Master Hua, Tian Chunhang, Mei Ziyu, Shi Nanxiang, Gao Pin, Yan Zhongqing, Liu Wenze, Wang Xun, Xiao Cixian, Jin Su, Qu Qinxian, and the entire company of Nine-Fragrance Garden. Seeing Young Master Hua, Qinxian still felt a trace of unease, yet Hua asked nothing of past affairs, treating him with utmost courtesy. By now, Qinxian had left the circle of performers"},{"paragraph":2,"mentions":2,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴仙一身历尽艰辛，此时才觉魔难尽释。然回想萧寺凄凉，孤灯残月，真如梦觉。次贤又将琴仙从前的梦境，向吉甫细细的说了一遍。吉甫因笑向子云、次贤道：「九香楼绝好一个花园，百花全有，如今单有一个花神牌位，且在隐僻处，与土地祠一样，岂不亵渎花神？我拟借他们九个作个九香花史，众位以为何如？」","en":"looking back on the bleak monastery, the lone lamp, and the waning moon, it all seemed like waking from a dream. Cixian then recounted to Jifu in detail the dreamscapes Qinxian had once described. Smiling, Jifu turned to Ziyun and Cixian: \\"Nine-Fragrance Tower is a superb garden holding every kind of flower, yet currently there is only one flower-god tablet hidden away"},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":1,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"众人均以为奇，同问道：「请道其详。」次贤道：「我久有此意，我欲画他们九个的小像。今你既有此意，妙不可言。我明日一一画出，就请你润色润色，就刻石供养在这九香楼下，做个花神。但只有九个，凑不出十二个来。」众人亦同说大妙。吉甫道：「我倒有一个主意，但不知可行不可行？」","en":"Everyone found the idea marvelously novel and asked for details. Cixian said, \\"I have long harbored this thought; I wished to paint small portraits of the nine of them. Since you now propose it as well, nothing could be more perfect. Tomorrow, I will paint them one by one, and ask you to refine the brushwork. Then we can"},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":1,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，好不好？」大家说道：「好。」子玉道：「这云龙人必猜有个寓意在里头呢。」子云道：「这十一篇传赞，各人分了罢。」次贤道：「好。这一番大著作倒要借吉甫以传。」吉甫道：「岂敢，岂敢。」","en":"allegory in this cloud-dragon.\\" Ziyun said, \\"Let us divide the eleven biographies and eulogies among ourselves.\\" Cixian agreed: \\"Yes. This great work must rely on Jifu's brush to be transmitted.\\" Jifu answered, \\"I would not dare assume so much.\\""},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":2,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"次贤道：「不必过谦。道生先生故后，笔墨之道，自然要让你，大家公论，何必推辞。我就做云龙那一幅，作好了，你再给我改改。」子云道：「自然是借重你们二位。那十篇如今是这样，各人拈阄，拈到谁是谁。华星北也叫他做一篇在内。」南湘道：「甚好。」于是写起阄来，将屈道翁","en":"Cixian insisted, \\"There is no need for excessive modesty. With Master Daosheng gone, the realm of brush and ink naturally yields to you; this is public consensus, so why decline? I will draft the cloud-dragon panel; once it is done, you can refine it for me.\\""},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":1,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉同了琴仙回家，正是内有韵妻，外有俊友，名成身立，清贵高华，好不有兴。子云写了一札与华公子为素兰作传。这边次贤妙腕灵思，画了十天才成。画成又请吉甫一一的改好，画一个，刻一个，倒也甚快。子云因受了感冒甚重，不敢用心，嘱将道翁、琴仙、杜仙女画在一幅，并求子玉作赞。到二十七日，连传赞都也刻起，系是各人书丹。二十八日就搬往九香楼镶嵌，一日完工。","en":"the highest of spirits. Ziyun wrote a letter to Young Master Hua, requesting a biography for Sulan. Meanwhile, Cixian, wielding his wondrous brush and nimble mind, spent ten full days completing the paintings. As each was finished, Jifu meticulously refined it; they painted one and carved one, proceeding with remarkable speed. Ziyun, suffering from a severe cold, dared"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":1,"tokens":["次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"拜了。琴仙看东楹嵌的第一方画，上云下水，云水中间，隐着一龙，露出一爪，托着一面镜子，上题曰：《品花宝鉴》。刻着次贤的赞语是：","en":"hidden in the space between, revealing a single claw holding a mirror. The inscription read: *Pinhua Baojian*. Cixian's eulogy was carved beside it:"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":1,"tokens":["静宜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"玉佩明璫。\\n华月光满，蓬山路长。既美且都，亦风而雅。\\n学士满宫，首推大舍。\\n琴仙道：「瑶卿之秾艳韶华，却一齐被静宜画出来，吉甫赞出来了。」宝珠道：「算花神罢了，我也配这样？」看第五方，画一个仙女，意致飘洒，素艳欲流，手拈兰花一朵，题曰：素心花史陆仙。下有小传，为华公子撰：","en":"first of the great houses.\\"\\n\\nQinxian noted, \\"Yaoqing's stunning, youthful radiance has been perfectly captured by Jingyi's brush and Jifu's praise.\\" Baozhu replied, \\"Even as a flower god, am I truly worthy of this?\\" They looked at the fifth panel, depicting a fairy maiden with an aura of flowing, unadorned grace, lightly holding a single orchid. The title read: \\"Suxin"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":1,"tokens":["萧次贤"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"赞扬的了。」琴仙再看第六方仙女，纤纤弱质，乘辕舞凌风，有掌上轻盈之态，头上戴着金步摇，题曰：纤纤花史金仙。下是萧次贤的七律一首：","en":"The title read: \\"Qianqian Flower Historian, Immortal Jin.\\" Beneath it was a seven-character regulated verse by Xiao Cixian:"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":1,"tokens":["静宜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"」桂保道：「不是我，这是蟾宫花史。」众人说道：「这些诗词赞语，他们倒是争奇角胜，那里记着本人？就是竹君的诗，与静宜、庾香这两个赞语，倒是切定题目说的。」琴仙道：「都切得很。你将这些诗更换了人，便不像了。」宝珠道：「只有静芳那一首，再不能更换的。」琴仙再看第十一方，画一个杏花，下有一个仙女，珠腰玉衱，十分妩媚，题曰：及第花史。知是琪官，看颜仲清的序文：","en":"skill; who among them actually remembers the person they're writing about? Only Zhujun's poem and the eulogies for Jingyi and Yuxiang actually stick to the subject.\\" Qinxian disagreed, \\"They are all very fitting. If you swapped the poems around to different people, they wouldn't make sense anymore.\\" Baozhu added, \\"Only Jingfang's piece is absolutely irreplaceable.\\" Qinxian"}]}`),"char-9":JSON.parse(`{"6":[{"paragraph":23,"mentions":5,"tokens":["刘文泽","文泽","前舟"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"没有来么？」王恂道：「也该快来了。」王、颜二人又与聘才、元茂款接了一番。只见对面楼上来了几个，先是右待郎的少君刘文泽做主，请了史给事的少君史南湘、吴阁学的外甥张仲雨、姑苏名士高品、国子监司业沈公之子沈伯才、天津镇守海口巴总兵之子巴霖，这两位就是孙氏弟兄的妻舅。还有一个本京人，原任江苏知县之子冯子佩，尚未到来。这一班人，子玉除了南湘、文泽之外，恰不认识。这刘文泽字前","en":"Wang and Yan warmly welcomed Pincai and Yuanmao. Across the upper floor, another group had assembled, hosted by Liu Wenze, son of the Right Vice-Minister. His guests included Shi Nanxiang, son of Censor Shi; Zhang Zhongyu, nephew of Grand Academician Wu; the renowned Suzhou scholar Gao Pin; Shen Bocai, son of Imperial College Director Shen; and Ba Lin, son of Regional Commander"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":1,"tokens":["刘文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"当下王恂、仲清引了子玉过去，与他们一一见了，彼此都是年谊世交，各叙了些仰慕之意。刘文泽道：「庸庵，你请客怎么不通知我一声。就是你请这二位生客，我们在一处也很好，何必又要另坐在那边。」王恂笑道：「不是我定要与你们分开，庾香是不用说的，就是这李、魏二位长兄，也是最有趣的人。","en":"facilitating introductions. Bound by examination-year ties and family connections, they exchanged warm pleasantries. Liu Wenze said, \\"Yong'an, when arranging this banquet, why didn't you inform me? Even these two guest-friends of yours could have joined us perfectly well. Why must you sit separately over there?\\" Wang Xun smiled, \\"It was not my intention to isolate us. Yuxiang"},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":2,"tokens":["刘文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"运气不佳，遇见了这两个冤家。」嗣元见了巴霖，也觉心跳，也与众人见了礼，巴霖勉勉强强，作了半个揖。楼上分了四桌。刘文泽道：「都是相好，也不必推让，随意坐最好」。大家都要远着孙氏弟兄，便乱坐起来。刘文泽、沈伯才、巴霖、张仲雨坐了一席；史南湘、颜仲清、高品拉了子玉过来，坐了一席；聘才、元茂坐了一席；嗣徽、嗣元坐了一席，王恂只好两席轮流作陪。孙嗣徽又之乎者也的闹了一会，问","en":"respects, to which Ba Lin responded with a begrudging half-bow. The upper floor was arranged with four tables. Liu Wenze said, \\"We are all friends here—no need for formalities; sit wherever you please.\\" Eager to distance themselves from the Sun brothers, everyone scrambled for seats. Liu Wenze, Shen Bocai, Ba Lin, and Zhang Zhongyu claimed one table; Shi Nanxiang, Yan"},{"paragraph":33,"mentions":1,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"玉叹道：「天地钟灵尽于此矣，我竟如夏虫不可语冰，难怪竹君怪我。」南湘哈哈大笑道：「我也不怪的，幸你自行检举。」文泽道：「怎么？庾香连苏媚香也不认识。」南湘道：「他是秀才不出门，焉知天下事。」少顷《瑶台》唱完，便是《惊梦》。","en":"reproached me.\\" Nanxiang laughed heartily, \\"I don't reproach you either—fortunately, you admit your own ignorance!\\" Wenze chimed in, \\"What? Yuxiang doesn't even recognize Su Meixiang?\\" Nanxiang added, \\"He is a scholar who never steps outside—how could he possibly know the ways of the world?\\" Shortly after, 'The Jade Terrace' concluded, and 'The Interrupted Dream' began."},{"paragraph":35,"mentions":2,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"日这位公子也在这里。」到第二次出场，唱那「雨香云片」这枝曲子，一面唱，那眼波只望着子玉溜来，子玉心里十分畅满。文泽低低的对南湘道：「这个新来的相公，倒与庾香很熟，你瞧这一片神情，尽注意着他。」南湘向子玉道：「这个相公叫什么名字？」子玉道：「他叫琴官。」南湘道：「你们盘桓过几回了？」子玉答道：「我尚不认识他。」文泽笑道：「庾香叫相公，是要瞒着人的。这样四目相窥，两","en":"Drifting Clouds,' his eyes continually wandered to rest upon Ziyu, filling Ziyu's heart with a quiet, glowing warmth. Wenze murmured to Nanxiang, \\"This newly arrived young performer seems exceptionally intimate with Yuxiang—look at his expression, all his attention is directed entirely at him.\\" Nanxiang turned to Ziyu, \\"What is this performer's name?\\" Ziyu replied, \\"He is"},{"paragraph":36,"mentions":3,"tokens":["文泽","刘文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"席上刘侍郎、梅学士、吴阁学、沈司业先散。子玉见他父亲走了，天也不早，也要回去。刚起身时，忽见一个美少年上楼来。文泽的家人说道：「冯少爷来了！」冯子佩上前与众人见礼，子玉见他还不过十八九岁，生得貌如美女，十分妩媚。刘文泽道：「人家都要散了，怎么这时候才来？」冯子佩道：「我早上进城到锦春园华府去拜年，原打算不耽搁的。华星北定要拉住吃了饭，又听了他们几出戏，才放我走，","en":"hour, Ziyu also prepared to leave. Just as he rose, a stunningly beautiful young man suddenly ascended the stairs. Wenze's servant announced, \\"Young Master Feng has arrived!\\" Feng Zipei stepped forward, offering his respects to the room. Ziyu observed that he was merely eighteen or nineteen, possessing a loveliness rivaling that of a beautiful young woman, thoroughly captivating"},{"paragraph":37,"mentions":1,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"文泽对子玉道：「初九日弟备小酌，屈吾兄一叙，作个清谈雅集。人不多，就是竹君、剑潭、庸庵、卓然几位，吾兄断不可推辞。」子玉应允，又谢了。王恂、聘才、元茂也同道了谢，一径先回。那些人又谈了一会，也各散去。不知后事如何，且听下回分解。","en":"Wenze turned to Ziyu and said, \\"On the ninth, I am hosting a small gathering and hope Elder Brother will honor us with a visit—a refined discourse and elegant assembly. It will be an intimate group: just Zhujun, Jiantan, Yong'an, Zhuoran, and a few others."}],"7":[{"paragraph":5,"mentions":1,"tokens":["刘文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"到了初九日，刘文泽又着人来邀了。子玉告票萱堂，更衣乘舆而去。","en":"On the ninth day, Liu Wenze sent someone to extend another invitation. After informing his mother, Ziyu changed his clothes and departed in his carriage."},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":3,"tokens":["文泽","刘文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"且说文泽所请的容颜仲清、王恂、史南湘已经到了，随后梅子玉、高品一同到门。家人引着走过大厅，到了花厅之旁垂花门进去，系石子砌成的一条甬道，两边都是太湖石迭成高高低低的假山，衬着参参差差的寒树。远远望去，却也有台有亭，布置得十分幽雅。转了两三个弯，过了一座石桥，","en":"At Wenze's residence, the invited guests—Yan Zhongqing, Wang Xun, and Shi Nanxiang—had already arrived, followed shortly by Mei Ziyu and Gao Pin at the gate. A servant guided them past the main hall, through a flowered gate beside the reception hall, and onto"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":1,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"二盆唐花，香气袭人，令人心醉。子玉看了，又想起琴言那日作戏光景，真是宝光夺人，香气沁骨，不觉有些模糊起来。忽听文泽道：「这屋子太敞，我们里面坐罢。」随同到东边，有书童揭起帘子，进去却是三间书房，中间玻璃窗隔作两层。从旁绕进，玻璃窗内又是两间套房。朝南窗内，即看得见外面。上悬着董香光写的「虚白」二字，一幅倪云林的枯木竹石，两旁对联是：名教中有乐地，风月外无多谈。屋","en":"performance—a dazzling, jewel-like radiance and a fragrance that pierced the bone—and he felt momentarily dazed. Suddenly, Wenze's voice broke his reverie: \\"This room is too drafty; let us sit inside.\\" They proceeded east, where a book-boy lifted a curtain revealing three studies, divided centrally by a glass partition. Walking around it, they found two connecting rooms within."},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":1,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"文泽因此屋中有地炕和暖，酒席即摆设在内。主人送了酒，大家坐下。","en":"Because the room was warmed by a heated floor, the banquet was set up inside. The host served the wine, and everyone took their seats."},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":1,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"南湘道：「可惜今日没有叫几个人来。」文泽道：「我也打算叫的，因打听他们今日都在怡园送九作消寒会，连堂会里都没有一个去的，所以没有去叫，怕倒叫他们为难。南湘又道：","en":"Nanxiang said, \\"It's a pity we didn't invite any performers today.\\" Wenze replied, \\"I had intended to, but I learned they are all attending a gathering to mark the end of the nine periods of winter at the Garden of Contentment. Not a single one went to the theatrical halls, so I refrained from calling them, fearing it would"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":1,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"那第七字对得尤妙。」说着两人相视而笑。南湘最是性急，便道：「你们说了，我情愿吃一杯。」高品道：「喝十杯再说。」文泽晓得南湘酒德平常，道：「我来讲和，三杯罢。」高品笑：「竹君三杯，诸公各饮一杯，赏识这句话。」仲清道：「我是请教过的了，免饮。」高品笑道：「几时？」仲清道：「真正你这张嘴，狗口里生不出象牙来。」南湘道：「快拿酒来喝了，等他说。」真个喝了三杯，其余也都喝","en":"Pin countered, \\"Drink ten cups, and then we'll see.\\" Knowing that Nanxiang was apt to misbehave after drinking, Wenze mediated, \\"Let's compromise—three cups.\\" Gao Pin smiled, \\"Zhujun drinks three, and the rest of you drink one each to appreciate the remark.\\" Zhongqing chimed in, \\"I've already been enlightened, so I'm exempt.\\" Gao Pin laughed, \\"Since when?\\" Zhongqing"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":10,"tokens":["文泽","刘文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"文泽道：「这有何可笑？」南湘忽然想着，抚掌大笑道：「这促狭鬼，实在可恶，难为他实在对得敏捷。」子玉等悟着也都笑了，道：「雅字竟当他实字，真对得工稳。」文泽道：「卓兄，我出一对你对，却不许思索。如对得好，我吃三杯。对不出，罚十杯。不好，罚五杯。」高品道：「","en":"Wenze asked, \\"What is so amusing about that?\\" Suddenly catching on, Nanxiang clapped his hands and roared with laughter, \\"This mischievous devil is truly incorrigible, but one must admit it's a quick match!\\" Ziyu and the others also burst into laughter as"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":6,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"文泽道「双」字，仲清对「孤」字，高品对「八」，字子玉对「九」字，王恂道：「不好了，顺着数儿就是十罢。」南湘道：「是了，我这个字倒有些难下，也罢，对「三」字罢。」文泽道「辇」宇。南湘道：「我晓得一定是这句诗。」子玉抢对了一个「琴」字，王恂对了「车」字，南湘","en":"Wenze presented '双' (Double/Pair): Zhongqing matched '孤' (Solitary), Gao Pin matched '八' (Eight), Ziyu matched '九' (Nine), and Wang Xun lamented, \\"Oh no, I suppose I must follow the sequence with '十' (Ten).\\" Nanxiang pondered, \\"That's right, my character is"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":6,"tokens":["文泽","前舟"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"鸾天上听琴来」。大家赞道：「这句真对得字字稳惬，又在剑潭之上。」于是公贺了一杯。南湘对的是「三鸦水上送船归」。文泽道：「竹君此对，未免杂凑。」南湘道：「你这试官，少所见而多所怪，要挖眼睛了。这才对得工呢。」子玉道：「真对得好。」文泽道：「这个我倒要请教请教。」子玉道：「三鸦水上一归人，是韩翃的诗。」文泽恍然道：「可是《送襄垣王君归别墅》的诗？我记性真坏极了，该打","en":"offered a congratulatory toast. Nanxiang's match read: 'Three crows on the water send the boat returning. (三鸦水上送船归)' Wenze critiqued, \\"Zhujun's match is a bit rough around the edges.\\" Nanxiang shot back, \\"You're just an examiner with little experience who marvels at the ordinary—you should have your eyes gouged out! This is a perfectly crafted match.\\" Ziyu agreed, \\"It truly"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":5,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"文泽道：「还有卓然的罚酒未饮，刚才到底说什么，笑得这样。如果实在说得好，免罚何妨。」南湘道：「若说了，非但不能免罚，还要倍罚。」文泽道：「莫非又是糟蹋我么？」仲清道：「然也。」文泽道：「只要糟蹋得有理，罚酒也可以少减。」高品道：「想来五杯是不能免的。若要","en":"Wenze reminded, \\"Zhuoran still hasn't drunk his penalty wine. What on earth did he say to make you laugh like that? If it's truly clever, we might waive the fine.\\" Nanxiang replied, \\"If he tells you, not only will the fine stand, it will be doubled.\\" Wenze"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":12,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"文泽道：「卓然将来死了，定坐拔舌地狱。」小厮斟了酒。高品道：「五杯一口气喝，定要醉倒。还是与各人豁一拳，或者可以希冀。」随顺手一个个豁完，却也有输有赢。各饮毕，子玉作令官，一个个出了四字，是「费影收肠」。南湘对的是「惊声放胆」，王恂是「融香浣乳」，文泽是","en":"Wenze said, \\"Zhuoran, when you die, you are certainly destined for the Hell of Pulled-Out Tongues.\\" A servant poured the wine. Gao Pin negotiated, \\"Drinking five cups in one breath will surely leave me drunk. Perhaps if I play finger-guessing games with everyone,"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":2,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"高品道：「我的「鸟」与「雀」总是一样，你的「鸟」字若换了「雀」字不好么？」文泽想了一想，却也有理。子玉就只取了仲清、王恂两副对句，其余文泽、高品罚了酒。","en":"(sparrow) are essentially identical. If your 'niao' were changed to 'que,' wouldn't that also be an improvement?\\" Wenze considered this and conceded the point. Ultimately, Ziyu accepted only Zhongqing's and Wang Xun's matching lines as passing; Wenze and Gao Pin were penalized with wine."},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":4,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"以下轮着南湘出令，出了一个「春」字，文泽对「夏」字，高品对「正」字。王恂道：「平对平使得么？」众人道：「使得，已经对过了。」王恂道「晨」字，仲清是「秋」字，子玉是「冬」字。南湘又出「月」字。高品道：「竹君的心思与众不同，这两字必定不连的，我对「阳」字。」王恂对「霜」，子玉对「雪」，仲清对「","en":"The turn passed to Nanxiang to set the game. He presented the character '春' (spring): Wenze matched '夏' (summer), and Gao Pin matched '正' (upright/primary). Wang Xun questioned, \\"Can a level-tone character be matched with another level-tone?\\" The group agreed, \\"Certainly—it has been done before.\\" Wang Xun matched '晨' (morning/dawn), Zhongqing"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":1,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"字。」仲清道：「鹰能制兔，我对「鹰」字。」子玉道：「骑着驴子放鹰，想来是没有的，且借他来对对，就是「驴」字。」文泽道：","en":"pondered, 'A donkey-rider flying a hawk is likely unheard of, but I'll borrow it for the match—'驴' (donkey).' Wenze said:"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":1,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「我「乌」字。」高品道：「我就是「龟」字。」文泽道：","en":"\\"'乌' (raven).\\" Gao Pin countered, \\"I match '龟' (tortoise).\\" Wenze replied:"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":1,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"竟改作高龟何如？」高品自知失口，缩不转来，便道：「这两字杜撰，不如转赠吾兄。史龟二字，本是古人名，最典雅的。」文泽道：「你听卓然这张嘴，自己落了便宜，又移到别人身上去了。」大家笑了一回，静听南湘出对。","en":"brother instead. The two characters 'Shi Gui' actually form an ancient personal name, most refined and classical.\\" Wenze noted, \\"Listen to Zhuoran's silver tongue—caught in his own trap, he immediately shifts the blame to someone else.\\" The group shared a laugh before quietly waiting for Nanxiang to reveal the assembled couplet."},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":3,"tokens":["文泽","前舟"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"南湘只管吃菜，总不出声。文泽道：「你怎么不出对了？」南湘笑道：「卷子已经交完了，还要题目么？我是一顺出的「春月三改兔」五字，内中前舟的「夏云半堆乌」，「乌」字原也借对得好。然凭文取之，究不若剑潭的「秋空一盘鹰」浑脱，还该让他第一。庾香的「冬雪一敲驴」，庸庵的「晨霜一丰貂」，都对","en":"Nanxiang simply continued eating, remaining silent. Wenze prompted, \\"Why haven't you announced the couplet?\\" Nanxiang chuckled, \\"The examination papers have all been submitted—do we need more prompts? I gave the five characters in sequence: 'Spring moon three change rabbit. (春月三改兔)' Among the submissions, Qianzhou's"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":3,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"文泽道：「你这狗头，实在恨不死人，你还想翻供么？」大家想想高品的话，又笑得了不得。原来文泽正是河南正阳县人，刚刚合着这句对，你道巧不巧。文泽又灌了他一大杯酒，方出了气。","en":"Wenze groaned, \\"You dog! You truly make a man want to die of frustration—are you trying to retract your confession?\\" When the group realized what Gao Pin meant, they laughed uncontrollably. It turned out Wenze was a native of Zhengyang County in Henan—perfectly"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":1,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"六字，高品属的是「签毛朱天入长」。子玉对的是「镜颜华年对好。」南湘是「竹唇朱声吹慢。」王恂是「剪衣乌时试拂」。文泽是「草麻黄朝起视」。仲清写出上联是「白发如丝日日新」。","en":"(bamboo, lip, crimson, sound, blow, slow). Wang Xun matched: '剪衣乌时试拂' (scissors, garment, raven, time, try, brush). Wenze matched: '草麻黄朝起视' (grass, hemp, yellow, morning, rise, gaze). Zhongqing wrote the opening line: 'White hair like silk threads—renewing day by day. (白发如丝日日新)'"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":1,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"把文泽的「黄麻起草朝朝视」取了第一，子玉的「华颜对镜年年好」取了第二，南湘的「朱唇吹竹声声慢」夹圈了，取了第三。大家都道：「这两副对都好，似乎竹君的较胜。令官甲乙，似不甚公。」仲清道：「这两本卷子都好，是不用说的。","en":"He ranked Wenze's match—'Yellow hemp paper, edicts drafted, scanned morning after morning (黄麻起草朝朝视)'—as first; Ziyu's match—'Glorious face against the mirror—year after year beautiful (华颜对镜年年好)'—as second; and Nanxiang's match—'Crimson lips blow bamboo—note after note"},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":2,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"南湘笑道：「这古典甚长，只说够他对的就是了。」文泽问道：「在什么书上？」仲清道：「《史氏外编》。」王恂、文泽才明白过来，复又笑声大作。高品道：「你们混说乱道，难道《四子书》都记不得？这就是《孟子》所说一毛不拔、追豚入笠之扬朱，所以谓之「朱毛入笠」。这才算得用古入化呢。」仲清道：「那「天天长」三字怎讲","en":"Nanxiang waved it off, \\"The allusion is rather long—enough has been said to serve the match.\\" Wenze asked, \\"In what book is this recorded?\\" Zhongqing replied, \\"Outer Compilation of Mr. Shi.\\" Wang Xun and Wenze finally understood, breaking into fresh peals of laughter. Gao Pin retorted, \\"You're all spouting nonsense—haven't you memorized *The Four Books*?"},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":1,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"然后王恂作令官，出的是「香尽南人消国美。」文泽对的是」曲多东妓谱山名」。仲清对的是「赋难东士炼都学」。高品对的是「斗长西圣驾方齐」。","en":"game-master, presenting the opening line: 'Fragrance exhausted, Southern person fades—the beautiful country. (香尽南人消国美)' Wenze matched: 'Many tunes, Eastern entertainers compose mountain-names. (曲多东妓谱山名)' Zhongqing matched: 'Rhapsody difficulty, Eastern scholars, refined, capital learning. (赋难东士炼都学)' Gao Pin matched: 'Combat long, Western sages, conveyed, region, equal-level."},{"paragraph":30,"mentions":1,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"众人留心高品对的，一个个都是平正通达的字。文泽道：","en":"The group scrutinized Gao Pin's match, finding each character level, regular, and coherent. Wenze noted:"},{"paragraph":31,"mentions":2,"tokens":["文泽","前舟"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"稳。」子玉对的是「情深西旦感昆名」。南湘的是」图多西士画名园」。一一对毕，王恂写出出句，是「香销南国美人尽」。文泽对的是「曲谱东山名妓多。」仲清是「赋炼东都学士难」。高品是「斗驾西方齐圣长」。子玉是「情感西昆名旦深」。南湘是「图画西园名士多。」王恂道：「这第一不消说是竹君了。庾香「名旦」二字不典，不及剑潭的浑成，只怕第二是他。前舟次之。卓兄这句，我实在不懂，若有","en":"Xun revealed the opening line: 'Fragrance fades in the Southern kingdom—the beauties are all gone. (香销南国美人尽)' Wenze's assembled match: 'Tunes composed of Eastern Mountain—many famous courtesans. (曲谱东山名妓多)' Zhongqing's: 'Rhapsodies forged in the Eastern Capital—difficult for scholars. (赋炼东都学士难)' Gao Pin's: 'Contest-drive the Western region—the sages in long seniority."},{"paragraph":33,"mentions":1,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"忍不住笑将出来，酒咽不及喷了出来，还咳嗽不已，引得合席都笑。南湘向王恂道：「等我笑完了，说《西游记》给你听。」文泽接着说道：「就是齐天大圣，送唐僧往西天取经的典故。」王恂恍然大悟道：「岂有此理，就是如此，那「斗驾」及「长」字总连不上。」南湘笑道：「你不晓得，孙行者驾起筋斗云，就是十万八千里，这路还不长么？」","en":"breath, Nanxiang told Wang Xun, \\"Let me finish laughing, and then I'll tell you about *Journey to the West*.\\" Wenze stepped in to clarify, \\"It's the allusion of the Great Sage Equal to Heaven escorting the Tang Monk to the Western Heaven to retrieve the scriptures.\\" Wang Xun finally understood, \\"How can that be? Even so, 'contest-drive' and 'long/seniority' still"},{"paragraph":35,"mentions":1,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"。」高品被他猜着，只得笑嘻嘻的点点头。子玉对了「卓言贯」三字，南湘对了「品阳长」三字，王恂对了「一龄庆」三字，文泽对了「品奸动」三字，仲清对了「管毫定」三字。高品又一连出了四字是「九喜气凤」。","en":"(Zhuo-speech-penetrating); Nanxiang matched: '品阳长' (Pin-sun-long); Wang Xun matched: '一龄庆' (One-year-celebrate); Wenze matched: '品奸动' (Pin, intercourse, move); Zhongqing matched: '管毫定' (Tube-fine hair-determined). Gao Pin then fired off four more characters: '九喜气凤' (nine, joy, spirit, phoenix)."},{"paragraph":36,"mentions":1,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"仲清道：「这倒不是拆字的，我就对「一高标兔」。」文泽道：「我就对「一欢心鸡」。」王恂道：「我对「第长年龟」。」子玉对了「超元精人」，南湘对了「一精神龙。」高品背着人写了上联，搁着笔，把大众的看了一回，鼻子里笑了一笑，就用纸蘸着酒，把粉板上的字一齐擦了。众人都诧异道：","en":"Zhongqing said, \\"This one clearly isn't character-decomposition. I'll match '一高标兔' (one-high-mark-rabbit).\\" Wenze followed, \\"I'll match '一欢心鸡' (one-joy-heart-rooster).\\" Wang Xun added, \\"I'll match '第长年龟' (rank-long-year-tortoise).\\" Ziyu matched: '超元精人' (surpassing-primal-refined-person). Nanxiang matched: '一精神龙' (one-spirit-dragon). Gao Pin turned his back, wrote"},{"paragraph":37,"mentions":3,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「兔高」二字，犯了他的讳。」王恂道：「我记得是龟龄第一庆长年。」南湘道：「好对，好对，第一定了，这又为什么？」文泽道：「你不见他巍然首座么。」南湘点点头，道：「我的对更明明指着他了。」众人问是为什么？南湘道：「龙阳一品长精神。」文泽道：「我的更说穿了，是「鸡奸一品动欢心。」这也奇怪，为什么牵名道姓，都骂起他来？」南湘道：「这也是天理昭彰，嘴头刻薄的报应。」高品道","en":"the long years. (龟龄第一庆长年)'\\" Nanxiang praised, \\"An excellent match, clearly first place—so why was it rejected?\\" Wenze pointed out, \\"Don't you see him sitting up there in lofty first position?\\" Nanxiang nodded, \\"My match pointed even more directly at him.\\" When asked why, Nanxiang revealed, \\"'The Longyang passion, first quality, ever vigorous in spirit. (龙阳一品长精神)'\\" Wenze"},{"paragraph":38,"mentions":1,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉一面走着，向主人道：「这园子点缀得很幽雅。」文泽道：「这算什么园子，不及徐度香怡园十分之一，几时我同你去逛逛。」这里宾主二人讲着，那高品对仲清道：「你可晓得京里又来了一个精品么？」仲清笑道：「想是高品的弟兄。」高品道：「这人却也可以做得我的弟兄，闻他也是南京人，现寓在宏济寺内，却没有与他往来。看他","en":"As Ziyu walked out, he complimented his host, \\"This garden is tastefully arranged—quite secluded and refined.\\" Wenze replied, \\"This barely qualifies as a garden, not even a tenth of Xu Duxiang's Garden of Contentment. Someday I'll take you there for a stroll.\\" As host and guest conversed, Gao Pin asked Zhongqing, \\"Did you know another exceptional individual has recently"}],"8":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["刘文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说子玉从刘文泽家饮酒回来，已是二更多天。先见过父母，换了衣裳，来寻聘才、元茂说话，却见静悄悄的，掩了房门。那边虎儿走来道：「少爷出去后，师爷就有人请出去了，今日不回来。李少爷、魏少爷吃了早饭出去的。」子玉道：","en":"Ziyu returned from drinking at Liu Wenze's home long past the second watch of the night. After paying his respects to his parents and changing his garments, he went to seek out Pincai and Yuanmao for a chat. Yet he found their quarters perfectly silent, the door closed fast. The servant boy"}],"9":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["刘文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"出去逛灯，都在门口等着。」子玉禀过父母，梅进即叫套了车，云儿跟着出来。仲清等却在车里等着，见子玉出来便下了车。刘文泽道：「如此良宵，千金一刻，我们趁着灯月，倒是步行好些，把车跟在后头，回来再坐罢。」子玉道：「甚好。」四人慢慢的走，一路闲谈，不多时就到了灯市。","en":"followed along. Zhongqing and the others were waiting in the carriage, stepping down when they saw Ziyu emerge. Liu Wenze said: \\"On such a fine night, worth a thousand gold pieces, let us take advantage of the lantern-lit moon and walk. That would be much better. We can have the carriage follow behind so we can ride back.\\" Ziyu agreed. The four strolled slowly, chatting"},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":1,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"又见有一队香车秀撵过来，也都开着帘子，丫鬟仆妇坐在车沿上，点着九合沉速香。那些奶奶们，在大玻璃窗内，左顾右盼。文泽、王恂等也各留神凝视，有好看的，有不好看的，但华妆艳服，灯光之下，也总加了几个成色。四人走路也不能齐集，有些参前落后起来，约过了七八辆后，又有了几辆接上前队，便挤住了走不开。","en":"carriage edges, burning superior incense, while the ladies inside gazed left and right through large glass windows. Wenze, Wang Xun, and the others watched attentively. Though they varied in beauty, the women's festive dress and jewels under the lamplight added radiant layers of color. As the four friends walked, they could not stay abreast, with some falling ahead and"},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":2,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"此时子玉在前，刚刚被那车轴拦住，过不去，文泽见车里一个少妇，生得颇好，打扮也十分华美，子玉恰恰的挤在车前，文泽见那少妇目不转睛的看着子玉，见子玉倒低了头，却无路可走。见那少妇一手把着车门，将身子一松，伸出一只脚来，正是三寸莲钩，纤不盈握。见他先盘了那边的腿，然后将莲钩缩进，盘好坐了，那只纤手也","en":"At that moment Ziyu was in the lead and had just been blocked by a carriage axle, unable to pass. Wenze noticed a young woman inside the carriage, quite handsome and exquisitely dressed. Ziyu happened to be squeezed against the front of the carriage. Wenze saw the young woman's eyes fixed unblinkingly on Ziyu, while Ziyu had lowered his head with nowhere"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":3,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"文泽扯扯王恂的衣服，低低的说道：「你看似为着庾香，要显显他的莲瓣。」王恂点头。仲清又在文泽后面说道：「焉知他不是为着你？」文泽笑道：「不像。」又低低的叫道：「庾香，那《施公案》有什么好看，你尽望着那几对灯。」子玉回转脸来，却与那少妇相对，见那少妇还在玻璃","en":"Wenze tugged at Wang Xun's sleeve and murmured softly: \\"Look, it seems she is taken with Yuxiang and wishes to show off her lotus feet.\\" Wang Xun nodded. Zhongqing, standing behind Wenze, added: \\"How do you know it is not you she fancies?\\" Wenze laughed: \\"I"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":1,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一会儿车才开动，文泽见那车沿下，挂了一个小洋灯，画着两个如意，一面写着四个小字是：起盛号潘。后头又是一辆。","en":"After a moment the carriage moved on. Wenze noticed that hanging from the carriage side-panel was a small foreign-style lantern painted with two ruyi scepters. Four small characters on its face read: Qisheng Hao Pan, marking the Pan family of the Qisheng trading house. Behind it followed another"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":2,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，却生得奇丑，堆满了一脸黑肉，涂起粉来，虽然晚上，也看得是紫油油的，打扮倒各样的讲究，还在里头抹巾障袖的做作。文泽看他灯笼上贴着一个「花」字。开动车，接着过去了。四人又逛了几处，街道又窄小起来。文泽对子玉道：「方才这个少妇，那样顾盼你，你也不回个情儿，倒只管看那旧纱灯，什么意思？难道那样少妇，还不足以当一盼么？」","en":"fashionable variety, and she was making affected gestures inside the carriage, fluttering her silken sleeve-cloth. Wenze noticed that a character on her lantern read 'Hua', meaning Flower. The carriage moved and passed on. The four wandered to a few more spots, where the streets began to narrow again. Wenze said to Ziyu: \\"Just now that young woman was so attentive in her"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":2,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"。我当他认错了人，不要动手打起来，这不是晦气？不料妇女中，竟有这样蠢材。较起才见的车中人，真又有天壤之隔了。」文泽哈哈大笑道：「不上高山，不见平地。你原来是皮里阳秋，暗中摸索。那个车中少妇，得你这一赞，也不枉他顾盼多时了。」子玉也觉微笑，又道：「这些灯也没有什么好逛，路又难走。不如坐车回去罢。」王恂道：「早得狠，回去也无甚意思。」文泽道：「我们到怡园去看灯罢，还","en":"Comparing them to the lady we saw in the carriage just now, there is truly a difference of heaven and earth.\\" Wenze laughed loudly: \\"Without climbing a high mountain, you do not see flat ground. So you have been harboring private thoughts all along, silently taking the measure of things. That young woman in the carriage earned this praise from you, which is not a"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":2,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"。走上亭子台阶，却已看见迎面写着八个灯谜。仲清将要看时，只见怡园的家人上来请安，说：「少爷们何不到里边逛逛？」文泽即问他主人，那人说道：「我们老爷在外赴席未回，萧老爷在家。」王恂道：「我们猜了几个灯谜。再进去不迟。」于是同看第一个是：「双栖稳宿无烦恼，认得卢家玳瑁梁。」下注《礼记》一句。子玉正在思索，只听得王恂问仲清道：「这可是知其能安，燕而不乱也？」仲清道：「","en":"read them, a Garden of Contentment servant came up to greet them and said: \\"Why not come inside to look around?\\" Wenze asked about the host, and the man replied: \\"Our master is out at a dinner and has not returned, but Master Xiao is at home.\\" Wang Xun said: \\"Let us guess a few lantern riddles first and then go in. There is no hurry.\\" So they all looked at the first"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":1,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"文泽道：「或者是《休洗红》。那第三联是「长夜迢遥闻断漏，中年陶写漫劳神。」必是《五更钟》、《莫愁乐》。」王恂道：","en":"Wenze said: \\"Perhaps it is 'Do Not Wash the Red'. The third couplet, 'Through the long night I hear the broken water-clock dripping; in middle age I pour out my heart and yet labor in vain', must be 'Fifth-Watch Bell' and 'Mochou's Joy'.\\" Wang Xun said:"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":1,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"流」打《唐诗》一句，猜不着。」正说着，只听得有人问道：「降生辰巳之年，可是「维虺维蛇」？」园门口的人回说不是。文泽道：「不要给人抢去了，我们去报罢。」大家走下亭子。子玉道：「那打《诗经》的，我已想着了，必是「不属于毛」。」仲清道：「很是。这句实在亏你想。」","en":"and si', could that be 'Where there are vipers and serpents'?\\" The man at the garden gate replied it was not. Wenze said: \\"Do not let others take it from us. Let us go submit.\\" Everyone descended the pavilion steps. Ziyu said: \\"As for that Classic of Poetry one, I have thought of it. It must be 'not belonging to the fur-bearing creatures.'\\" Zhongqing said: \\"Precisely"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":1,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"王恂道：「那打唐诗一句的，不要是「殷子正书空」？」文泽道：「且报一报试试。」大家到园门口，一个个报去，里头都答应了「是」，就是末后一个没有猜着。王恂道：「白也诗无敌。」里头也答应了「是」。只见一人又拿了一盏灯出来，将先挂的那盏灯换下。见屏门后头走了出一个人来，子玉见他有三十来岁，生得眉清目秀，气体高华，","en":"Wang Xun said: \\"The one on the Tang poetry line, could it not be 'Yin Zi writing in the air'?\\" Wenze replied: \\"Let us go and try submitting it.\\" Everyone went to the garden gate and reported their answers one by one. From inside came \\"Correct\\" for each one, until the very last, which no one had solved. Wang Xun said: \\"'Bai — his poetry has no rival'"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":1,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"见文泽、仲清、王恂三人一齐迎上前来，称呼他为静宜先生。那人与三人见了礼，又向子玉作了个揖，子玉连忙还礼。","en":"Wenze, Zhongqing, and Wang Xun all stepped forward at once to greet him, addressing him as Master Jingyi. The man exchanged courtesies with the three, then bowed to Ziyu, who hastened to return the salutation."},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":2,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"文泽即对萧次贤说道：「这位是梅庾香，是当今无双士。静宜先生没有会过么？」次贤道：「今日识荆，实为万幸」便请四人进内，子玉道：「今晚便服，未免不恭，容另日专诚晋谒罢！」次贤笑道：「庾香先生，当今名士，不应琐琐及此。况主人也不在家，我辈聊以聚谈，切勿拘以礼节","en":"Wenze thereupon said to Xiao Cixian: \\"This gentleman is Mei Yuxiang, the peerless scholar of this age. Has Master Jingyi not had occasion to meet him?\\" Cixian replied: \\"Meeting such a distinguished personage today is truly my great good fortune.\\" He then invited"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":1,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"次贤，以词意为琴言写图，所以这灯谜即以琴作彩，原是于游戏之中，寓作合之意。非但子玉不知杜玉侬为何人，就是仲清、文泽等也未能悉。大家问时，次贤不即说明，答以久后必知。","en":"playful game the intention of making a match. Not only did Ziyu not know who Du Yunong was, but even Zhongqing, Wenze, and the others had not been fully informed. When everyone asked, Cixian did not immediately explain, replying only that all would be known in due time."},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":1,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"人来。走到面前看时，一个是袁宝珠，一个是金漱芳。仲清问道：「你们藏在那里？」宝珠道：「我们在前面小船室下棋。」文泽道：「相公阿曾点个只眼？」宝珠、漱芳都笑了一笑。座中就是子玉不认得，那日虽见漱芳的《题曲》，也是上妆容貌。此时看他骨香肉腻，玉洁晶莹；宝珠亭亭玉立，弱不胜衣，便想道：「这两个姿色似可与琴官相并，但不知性情何如。」正想着，猛听得台下云锣一响，对面很远的","en":"asked: \\"Where have you been hiding?\\" Baozhu replied: \\"We were playing chess in the little boat room at the front.\\" Wenze said: \\"And did either of you contrive to make an eye?\\" Baozhu and Shufang both smiled. Of those present, only Ziyu did not know them. Though he had seen Shufang's 'Inscribing the Song' that day, that had been in full makeup and costume. Now he saw them"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":1,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"文泽想道：「可惜无酒，负此花灯。」听得次贤说道：「如此良夜，诸兄何不小饮几杯。」即吩咐取酒来。不一会，小厮们取了四壶酒交给宝珠、漱芳，走到各人面前，将茶碗撤去，把茶几揭起了一层盖子，便是一个镶成的攒盒，共有十二碟果菜，银杯象箸都镶在里面，十分精巧。宝珠、","en":"Wenze thought to himself: \\"What a pity there is no wine, for we are squandering this magnificent evening of flowers and lanterns.\\" Just then he heard Cixian say: \\"On such a splendid night, why do you gentlemen not drink a few cups?\\" He at once ordered wine"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":1,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"口，又说道：「你们好乐！」仲清道：「你且坐下，歇歇再说。」扶上亭子，他就坐在地下，宝珠等上去见他，他把头点点。文泽道：「你在那里喝得这样？」南湘又摇摇头。宝珠到次贤耳边说了几句话，次贤命小厮去拿了一个小小的金盒子，取出一丸药来，放在碗内，用开水化了，递给宝珠，捧到南湘身边，弯了腰给他喝，南湘摇头不要。宝珠道：「这是醒酒汤，喝了就好了。」南湘心里明白，把汤喝完，闭","en":"into the pavilion, and he sat on the floor. Baozhu and the others went up to greet him, and he nodded to them. Wenze asked: \\"Where have you been drinking to reach this state?\\" Nanxiang shook his head again. Baozhu whispered a few words to Cixian. Cixian instructed a page-boy to bring a small gold box, from which he took out a pill, placed it in a bowl, dissolved it"},{"paragraph":30,"mentions":1,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"于是漱芳拉了王恂下棋，文泽观局。子玉同宝珠看那墨兰，赞不绝口；南湘、仲清、次贤同坐在醉翁床闲话。南湘道：「静宜兄，还记得「只有酒狂名下士，醉吟许上岳阳楼」佳句否？」","en":"Thereupon Shufang drew Wang Xun into a game of chess while Wenze looked on. Ziyu and Baozhu admired the ink-painted orchid, praising it without end. Nanxiang, Zhongqing, and Cixian sat together on the Drunken-Scholar's Couch in easy conversation. Nanxiang said: \\"Brother Jingyi, do you still recall those fine lines:"},{"paragraph":31,"mentions":2,"tokens":["刘文泽","文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"：「我与他直如此缘悭，要接谈的福分都没有。」一面想，怔怔的看着宝珠，宝珠也怔怔的看着子玉，四目勾留，都出了神。刘文泽一回头看见这光景，轻轻的向子玉肩上一拍道：「瑶卿好不好？」子玉当是问琴言，便道：「他的《惊梦》这一出，直是天上神仙。」宝珠亸然一笑。子玉回想过来，自知所问非所答，幸而话未说错，随同文泽走到南湘这边来。仲清问次贤，可有好灯谜被人打去？次贤道：「就是昨日","en":"stared absently at Baozhu, and Baozhu too was staring absently at Ziyu. Four eyes met and both fell into a trance. Liu Wenze, turning his head and seeing the scene, gave Ziyu a light tap on the shoulder and said quietly: \\"What do you make of Yaoqing?\\" Ziyu, thinking he was asking about Qinyan, replied: \\"His performance of 'The Interrupted Dream' is straight from heaven among"},{"paragraph":35,"mentions":1,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"封情书，就不是灯谜，也香艳极了。况且隐藏药名、花名，恰切不移。这猜着的人，真是个绝世聪明人了，可借不知是谁？」文泽道：「这两封书，都是静宜先生的手笔么？」次贤道：「那封原书，是度香的手笔。」说着，王恂已经下完了棋，倒输了漱芳三子。子玉因夜色已深，随同南湘等告辞；子玉并说度香来园，先为致意，改日专诚再来的话，次贤答应着，送出各人上车而散。再听下回分解。","en":"strain. The person clever enough to solve them must truly be a peerless wit. What a pity we do not know who it was.\\" Wenze said: \\"Are both these letters written in Master Jingyi's hand?\\" Cixian replied: \\"The original letter is in Duxiang's hand.\\" As he spoke, Wang Xun had already finished his chess game, having lost three stones to Shufang. Ziyu, the night being already"}],"10":[{"paragraph":9,"mentions":1,"tokens":["刘文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"次日，子云即去拜望子玉，彼此道了些景仰渴想的话，就约定于十九日晚间一叙。出来顺道到王恂、刘文泽、史南湘等处看望，俱未晤见。回来想道：「这梅庾香果然名不虚传，玉侬又属意于他，将来见了面，不消说是他的人了。」又想这：「玉侬的脾气，差不多的人都猜摸不着，倘或一言不合，就可以决绝的。即使梅庾香是个多情人，也未必能像我这样体贴。","en":"intimate dinner on the evening of the nineteenth. On his way back, Ziyun stopped at the residences of Wang Xun, Liu Wenze, and Shi Nanxiang to pay courtesy visits, but found none of them at home. Returning to his own residence, he reflected: \\"This Mei Yuxiang is indeed everything his stellar reputation suggests. Yunong is already deeply drawn to him, and once they meet,"}],"13":[{"paragraph":7,"mentions":1,"tokens":["前舟"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"金笺的小楷，却是一人一幅，写得停匀娟秀。一幅是度香主人，一幅是静宜逸士，一幅是竹君词客，一幅是剑潭山人，一幅是前舟外史，一幅是庸庵居士。像是几首和韵七律诗。再看上款，是媚香嘱和《长河修禊》七律六章原韵，春航心里更加起敬。想道：","en":"of Duxiang\\", \\"The Recluse Jingyi\\", \\"The Lyricist Zhujun\\", \\"The Mountain Man Jiantan\\", \\"The Unofficial Historian Qianzhou\\", and \\"The Lay Scholar Yong'an\\". They appeared to be matching seven-character regulated verse poems. Looking closer at the dedication, it read: \\"By Meixiang's request, matching the original rhymes of the six seven-character verses on the *Purification"}],"14":[{"paragraph":32,"mentions":1,"tokens":["刘文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这官衔是刘文泽编成的，席中惟有南湘一人知道，春航尚是创闻。高品道：「还有一个官衔你没有说。」蕙芳道：「好像没有了。」高品道：「还有监造兔园册子呢。」南湘又笑。蕙芳不曾理会，即与兰保、玉林在各人面前敬了几杯酒。春航前次已见过玉林，看他丰致嫣然，虽逊蕙芳一筹，然比起从","en":"This string of titles had been composed by Liu Wenze; of those present, only Nanxiang knew their origin, while to Chunhang it was entirely new. Gao Pin said, \\"There is one title you have left out.\\" Huifang said, \\"It seems there was nothing more.\\" Gao Pin said, \\"You have omitted Superintendent of the Compilation"}],"15":[{"paragraph":6,"mentions":1,"tokens":["刘文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"再说子玉在家无趣，趁他们吃酒时，便带了云儿去找刘文泽、史南湘。","en":"Now, Ziyu found little enjoyment at home; while the others were drinking, he took Yun'er along and went to find Liu Wenze and Shi Nanxiang."},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":10,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"先到了文泽处，不在家，去找南湘，恰好文泽的车也到南湘门口。子玉道：「我方才找你。」文泽道：「失候。我去找冯子佩，适值他进城去了。」说着遂一同进去，到南湘书房坐了。伺候南湘的龙儿送了茶道：「我们少爷，这时候还没有起身呢！」说罢进去了，一盏茶时候，见南湘科头赤脚，","en":"He went first to Wenze's house, but Wenze was not at home. He went on to find Nanxiang, and just as he arrived Wenze's carriage also pulled up at Nanxiang's gate. Ziyu said, \\"I was just looking for you.\\" Wenze said, \\"I missed calling on you earlier. I went to find Feng Zipei,"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":4,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"文泽的跟班进去，一问琴言不在家，听得里头说道，就是刘大人带到春喜园去了。文泽一个没趣，子玉倒觉喜欢。南湘道：「那里去？我还没有吃饭，对门不是妙香堂素兰家么，咱们就找香畹去。」文泽道：「只怕也未必在家。叫人去问一问。「素兰却好在家，里头有人出来，请了进去，","en":"Wenze's attendant went inside to inquire; Qinyan was not at home — they heard from within that the Lord Liu had taken him to Chunxi Garden. Wenze was somewhat put out; Ziyu, on the other hand, felt quietly relieved. Nanxiang said, \\"Where to now? I haven't"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":4,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"南湘道：「此君丰韵，足并袁苏，为梨园三鼎足。」不多一会，素兰出来，与南湘、文泽见了，又与子玉相见。素兰把子玉细细打量了一番，问文泽道：「这位可姓梅？」文泽向子玉道：「又对出谎来了，你方才说不认识他，他怎么又认识你呢？」子玉真不明白，恰难分辩，倒是素兰道：「认是并不认得，被我一猜就猜着了。」南湘道：「我恰不信，那里有猜得这么准。","en":"Yuan and Su as one of the three pillars of the pear garden.\\" Before long, Sulan came out, greeted Nanxiang and Wenze, and was introduced to Ziyu. Sulan looked Ziyu over carefully and then asked Wenze: \\"Is this young gentleman surnamed Mei?\\" Wenze said to Ziyu, \\"Another lie exposed — you just claimed not to know him, yet he already knows you. How can that be?\\" Ziyu"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":2,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"诚人，谁知他倒善于撒谎。」说得子玉两颊微红，这个委屈，无人可诉。细看素兰的面貌，与自己觉有些相像，恐怕被南湘、文泽看出说笑，他便走开，去看旁边字画。南湘对文泽道：","en":"He looked closely at Sulan's features and noticed a certain resemblance to himself; fearing that Nanxiang and Wenze might notice and make sport of it, he moved away and went to look at the calligraphy and paintings on the nearby wall. Nanxiang said to Wenze:"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":1,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「你可看得出香畹像谁？」文泽道；「像庾香，我第一回见庾香，我就要说他，因为他面嫩，所以没有说出来。」子玉权当不听见，由他们议论。素兰道：「你们不要糟蹋他，怎么将我比他？」说罢拉了子玉过来，到这边坐下。南湘道：「我们还没有吃饭，你快拿饭来。」素兰即吩咐厨房备饭。子玉虽见过素兰的《","en":"\\"Can you see who Xiangwan resembles?\\" Wenze said, \\"He resembles Yuxiang. The very first time I saw Yuxiang, I was going to say so, but because he looked so young, I held back.\\" Ziyu pretended not to hear and let them talk among themselves. Sulan said, \\"Don't make sport of him — how could you compare"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":10,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"随又与南湘、文泽斟了，文泽问道：「你今日倒不上戏园子去？」素兰道：「今日没有我的戏，可以不去。」子玉见了素兰也是幽闲贞静一派，心里就契重他。素兰一抬头，见子玉只管偷看他，不觉一笑，便有一种幽情艳思摇漾出来，子玉把眼一低。文泽笑道：「同了庾香出来，我们有多少算不来处。","en":"He then poured cups for Nanxiang and Wenze. Wenze asked: \\"Are you not going to the theater today?\\" Sulan said, \\"There is no role for me today, so I may stay away.\\" Seeing Sulan's quiet, serene, and composed manner, Ziyu felt a deep affinity in his heart. Sulan raised his eyes and, noticing that"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":4,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"白明白，教你知道，不教他白费了这片心。」子玉听了，便如哑子吃黄连，说不出苦来，两眼眶的酸眼泪，只好望肚子里咽。文泽、南湘连连点头道：「这真难得。」文泽又道：「玉侬于庾香的情，可为二十四分了，不知庾香与玉侬的情怎样，你可知道？」素兰道：「怎么不知道？也是瑶卿说的。」又将徐子云将假琴言试子玉的情节，说了一番，听得南湘、文泽笑了又赞，赞了又笑。子玉十分难受，只得说道：","en":"express the bitterness. The moisture in the corners of his eyes he could only force back down into his chest. Wenze and Nanxiang nodded repeatedly: \\"This is truly exceptional.\\" Wenze added: \\"Yunong's feeling for Yuxiang must amount to twenty-four parts deep. I wonder what Yuxiang's feeling for Yunong is? Do you know?\\" Sulan said, \\"How could I not know? That too was"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":1,"tokens":["前舟"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"分，竟是有一无二的。」子云道：「你怎么知道他去找玉侬？是他一人去的么。」宝珠道：「是香畹对我讲的，他恰与竹君、前舟二人同去，香畹还送了他一柄扇子，他们倒也合式了。」次贤道：「我看前日庾香、玉侬二人，真可谓用志不纷，乃凝于神。","en":"know he went to find Yunong? Did he go alone?\\" Baozhu said, \\"It was Xiangwan who told me. He went with Zhujun and Qianzhou together; Xiangwan also gave him a fan. They were well suited to each other.\\" Cixian said, \\"I think those two — Yuxiang and Yunong — are truly what one might call 'minds focused and undivided, their spirit crystallized in each other.'"}],"16":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["刘文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"或把酒清谈，或题诗分韵，所来往者刘文泽、颜仲清等为最密。而怡园徐度香一月间亦过访几次，或遇，或不遇。盖度香局面阔大，现处福地，为富贵神仙，所以干谒者纷纷而来，应酬甚繁。","en":"Sometimes they would drink wine and converse freely, or compose poetry and assign rhymes; of these companions Liu Wenze and Yan Zhongqing were the closest. Xu Duxiang from the Garden of Contentment also paid several visits during the month, though they did not always meet. Because Duxiang commanded a grand presence and currently occupied a position of prosperity, he was"}],"17":[{"paragraph":3,"mentions":2,"tokens":["前舟"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「庾香，后日有一件极好的事，来与你商量。」子玉便问道：「何事？」高品道：「十五日是媚香生日。今日大家商议，并订前舟与你合成一剂六君子汤，凑一公分，找个宽敞的地方，把那些知名宝贝，都叫将来热闹一天，请湘帆与媚香做生日，你道好不好？」子玉道：「好极，好极！但不知在何处聚会？」王恂道：「我家亦可，但无花园子，不如前舟园里好。我们主人六个，添上湘帆七个，媚香、瑶卿、香畹","en":"affair?\\" Gao Pin said: \\"The fifteenth is Meixiang's birthday. Today we all deliberated and agreed to join forces with Qianzhou and yourself to form a 'Six Gentlemen Decoction'—pooling our funds to find a spacious pavilion, inviting all those renowned beauties for a day of lively festivity, and celebrating the birthdays of Xiangfan and Meixiang. What say you to this?\\" Ziyu said:"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":1,"tokens":["前舟"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"成十个。」众人道：「如此更妙。」子玉道：「如今我们商议起来，怎样邀客。」王恂道：「你作一小札与怡园徐、萧二公，前舟以及余人，我们明日自去知会。」于是大家直谈至二更方散。子玉送了诸人，独坐凝思了一回，想道：「后日之会，足成千古，不晓琴言病体能否痊愈？那时琼林十树，自然要推杜若为先，不识大夫蕙比我玉侬何如？想起待田君光景，是个有才有智的人，必另有一种深情。人各有长，","en":"Xun said: \\"You draft a brief note to the two gentlemen Xu and Xiao of the Garden of Contentment, as well as to Qianzhou and the others, and tomorrow we shall notify them ourselves.\\" Thus they conversed straight on until the second watch before dispersing. After Ziyu had seen them off, he sat alone in deep contemplation for a while, reflecting: \\"The gathering the day after"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":5,"tokens":["刘文泽","文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"到了明日，王恂、史南湘等，就到刘文泽家来讲了，文泽甚为高兴，说明日就在倚剑眠琴之室布置。恰好兰蕙芬芳，又有芍药、海棠等花开满。少停。即去知会群花，于明日辰刻毕集。因说道：「明日花林中，恐有几个不能来。我知道秦琪官害眼，杜琴言亦患病未痊。昨晚我见素兰，谈及庾香在彼处坐了半日，去访琴言，恰","en":"The next day, Wang Xun, Shi Nanxiang, and the others went to Liu Wenze's house and informed him. Wenze was highly delighted, declaring that the following day they would arrange the festivities right there in the 'Sword Reclining, Zither Sleeping' studio. As it happened, orchids and thoroughworts were emitting their sweet"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":2,"tokens":["刘文泽","文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"自负，以干谒为耻，未尝怀刺一谒要津，宁居萧寺，玉人作伴，名士同声。蕙芳又替他结交了许多好友，如徐度香、萧静宜、刘文泽、史南湘、颜仲清、王恂等。仲清前与春航不睦，原是激励春航之意；经高品将其中情节剖明，又说起仲清仍送五十金作浇裹之费，春航自然十分感激敬佩。仲清叫蕙芳为之转弯，更觉比前相好。惟有子玉，尚未谋面。是日知文泽等为蕙芳做生日，心上虽十分欢喜，又因他二人交好，","en":"men of the same voice. Huifang also helped him befriend many worthy companions, such as Xu Duxiang, Xiao Jingyi, Liu Wenze, Shi Nanxiang, Yan Zhongqing, and Wang Xun. Zhongqing's previous discord with Chunhang had originally been intended to spur Chunhang onward; after Gao Pin illuminated the underlying circumstances, and mentioned that Zhongqing was still sending fifty"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":4,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"文泽于绝早即在倚剑眠琴室中铺设起来，因为题目是做生日，略须点缀：中间挂了一幅《群仙高会图》。一切古玩铺设，俱极精致。长廊内，湘帘之外，摆列着十余盆蕙花，趁着和风微漾，香气袭人。文泽正在廊前独立，见前面走进一人，远远望见，知是蕙芳华服而来，上了阶沿，即恭恭","en":"Wenze had the 'Sword Reclining, Zither Sleeping' study arranged from the very break of dawn. Because the theme was a birthday celebration, some subtle adornment was required: in the center hung a scroll painting of 'Picture of the Immortals' Grand Assembly.'"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":2,"tokens":["前舟","文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"媚香一向洒脱，今日忽然拘礼，不是倒累了你了。」遂进室内，与诸人相见，群旦亦都见毕，叙齿坐下。子云道：「蒙庾香、前舟及诸兄折柬相招，今日之举，可为极盛。昨已饱读庾香珠玉，今日尚觉齿有余芬。又复当此群花大会，使弟等附骥餐芳，实为快事。」次贤道：「丹山彩凤，深巷乌衣，裙屐风流无过于此。而寒皋野鹤亦可翱翔其间乎？」文泽、王恂等同说道：「度香、静宜两先生，名士班头，骚坛牛","en":"themselves by seniority, and settled down. Ziyun said: \\"Thanks to the kind invitation by letter from Yuxiang, Qianzhou, and all the gentlemen, today's occasion is truly a grand gathering. Yesterday I drank my fill of reading Yuxiang's pearls and jade, and even today my teeth still carry their lingering fragrance. And now we find ourselves in this great assembly of flowers,"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":1,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"在车辙里了。」说得众人大笑道：「卓然妙语，待寿翁来罚其三大觞。」蕙芳似觉脸红，宝珠道：「今日的客，尚短几人？」文泽道：「就止寿翁一人。花部中未到的尚有四人：琴言、琪官都有病，早来辞了，桂保、春喜是必来的。等湘帆一到，就可坐了。」","en":"three great cups.\\" Huifang seemed to blush slightly. Baozhu said: \\"How many guests are still to arrive today?\\" Wenze said: \\"Just the birthday-star, one person. Among the flower contingent, four are absent: Qinyan and Qiguan are both ill and sent their regrets early this morning; Guibao and Chunxi will certainly be here. Once Xiangfan arrives, we can take our seats.\\""},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":3,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"文泽即命家人摆起三桌席来，因问道：「今日之坐，还是叙齿，还是推寿翁寿母上坐？」春航、蕙芳同道：「这断断不敢，自然叙齿为妙。」众人也说叙齿罢了。文泽送酒，先定中间一席。论齿是次贤为长，次贤自知不能推逊，只得依了，并坐者为高品，次是仲清；左首一席，子云为首，","en":"Wenze then gave the order for the servants to lay out three tables. He asked: \\"For today's seating, shall we go by seniority, or shall we place the birthday honorees at the head?\\" Chunhang and Huifang said together: \\"We absolutely cannot accept that; seniority"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":1,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，南湘、高品在傍为宝珠指点。蕙芳道：「你们三人下我一个。就赢了也不算稀奇。」宝珠道：「我偏不用人教也赢得你。」文泽道：「今日我们亦算极乐了，可惜花部中少了两人，那个还不要紧，第一是琴言不来，使庾香不能畅意。」子云道：「可不是！琴言的病颇为古怪，精神疲软，饮食不思，已经十余天了，不见好。」次贤道：「我昨日诊他的脉，似积劳，兼之感愤忧郁，昨日痰中竟有血点，非静养数月","en":"one; even if you win it is hardly a surprise.\\" Baozhu said: \\"I can win against you without any coaching at all.\\" Wenze said: \\"Today we have had real pleasure. It is a pity that two are absent from the flower contingent. The other is no great matter, but first and foremost Qinyan's absence has prevented Yuxiang from being fully at ease.\\" Ziyun said: \\"Indeed! Qinyan's"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":2,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"于是以年齿为先后，仍系次贤为首，次子云，次高品，次南湘，次文泽，次仲清，次春航，次王恂，次子玉，共是九人。王恂已将子玉叫醒，净净脸，素兰取出一颗醒酒丸给子玉吃了。子玉不好意思，只得勉强扎挣。素兰见子玉不语不言，似醉非醉，心上猜着是为琴言未来。一因人多不好解慰他，二因提起琴言反恐倒勾他的心事，非惟不能宽解，越增愁","en":"proceeded in order of age, with Cixian again taking the lead, followed by Ziyun, then Gao Pin, then Nanxiang, then Wenze, then Zhongqing, then Chunhang, then Wang Xun, and finally Ziyu, making nine people in all. Wang Xun had already roused Ziyu and had him wash his face; Sulan brought out a sobering pill and gave it to Ziyu to ingest. Ziyu felt embarrassed and forced"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":5,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"道：「绝妙！着此句便分得清界限，不至笼统不分。竹君始终是个妙才。」南湘道：「不敢，不敢！认题还认得清楚。」轮到文泽了，文泽道：「此句对了才有关键，不然气散了。这雄蛱蝶倒有些难对。」因细细的凝思，仲清道：「快交卷子，外边吹打要开门了。」文泽道：「有了。鸳鸯虽小总相亲。」次贤、子云道：「这却对得好，又工又切。」南湘道：「也亏他。」文泽就放下笔，仲清道：「怎么一句就算","en":"marvelous talent.\\" Nanxiang said: \\"I wouldn't dare claim so! I merely recognize the theme clearly.\\" It came to Wenze's turn; Wenze said: \\"This line must be matched well to form the pivot, otherwise the energy will dissipate. These male butterflies are rather hard to match.\\" He thought deeply about it. Zhongqing said: \\"Hurry and hand in your paper; outside the musicians"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":1,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"混。」即对道：「玉如合璧定琼瑶。纤腰扭入灵和柳」众人皆赞道：「这姊妹花，琼瑶玉实在对得好。局势又振得整齐了。」文泽便接道：「倾国倾城世无偶。软到人间铁石肠。」众人道：「妙、妙！这句要对得工力悉敌才好。」仲清想了一想，又笑了一笑，写道：「春回世上支离叟。」春航道：「这实在对得奇妙。」再看下句是：「嫣然一笑百媚生。」便接道：「缠头争掷黄金轻。郑樱桃是真殊艳。」","en":"'sister flowers,' 'Qiongyao and jade', the match is excellent. The poem's energy has been pulled back into shape.\\" Wenze then continued:\\n\\n\\"A city-toppling beauty without equal in the world;\\nmelts even this world's heart of iron and stone.\\"\\n\\nEveryone said: \\"Wonderful! This line needs a match of equal force.\\" Zhongqing thought a moment, then laughed slightly and wrote:"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":1,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"王恂对道：「冯子都非浪得名。迟迟长昼当初夏。」文泽道：「冯子都如今有个冯子佩，倒像弟兄呢。」子云道：「冯子佩原不错，他有一种脾气，他偏不肯在群花堆里取乐。」王兰保冷笑道：「他自然不肯在我们堆里，他见我们还要生气呢。」子玉道：「何故？」桂保接口道：「他有他的心肠。」子玉接道：「绮席花筵日易夜。英华美可","en":"Wang Xun matched:\\n\\n\\"Feng Zidu, his fame no empty claim;\\nslowly the long days pass in the early summer.\\"\\n\\nWenze said: \\"Feng Zidu. Nowadays there is a Feng Zipei; they seem like brothers.\\" Ziyun said: \\"Feng Zipei is actually not bad; he has one particular trait: he simply refuses to take pleasure among the flower company.\\" Wang Lanbao said with a cold laugh: \\"Of"},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":2,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"道：「强盗看经，屠户成佛，卓然竟生出好心来，晓得珍惜了，这也难得。」接道：「莫把花枝忽抛掷。愿如王献买桃根。」文泽联道：「可笑王戎钻李核。」仲清笑道：「又来煞了，你们心上毕竟有些不干净。」又看文泽写道：「一旦天生好玉郎。」仲清联道：「忍教天地错阴阳。只闻雌霓成神女。」众人道：「此是规讽之辞，倒不是刻薄，世间竟亦不能无此事。但不在我辈中耳。」春航联道：「莫变雄风当","en":"continued:\\n\\n\\"Let not the flower branch be lightly cast aside;\\nwould that we could, like Wang Xian, buy a Taogen.\\"\\n\\nWenze linked:\\n\\n\\"How laughable that Wang Rong bored through the plum pits.\\"\\n\\nZhongqing laughed: \\"Here we go again, straying into impurity; your hearts still have something unclean in them.\\" Then he saw what Wenze had written next:\\n\\n\\"Once heaven gives birth"},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":1,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"白的还好，其余似觉老气横秋。琪官性情虽烈，其温柔处亦颇耐人怜爱，不如比为杏花。」众人道：「好个杏花，极妥当。」文泽道：「说起菊花有黄有白，你们可晓得东园里新来一个妓女，叫白菊花，可知其人么？」众人皆说：「不晓。」","en":"winning. Better to liken him to the apricot blossom.\\" Everyone agreed: \\"A fine apricot blossom, perfectly fitting.\\" Wenze said: \\"Speaking of chrysanthemums, yellow or white, do you all know that in the eastern garden a new courtesan has recently arrived, called White Chrysanthemum? Have you heard anything about her?\\" Everyone said they had not."},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":1,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"花谱中添了琪官，惟琴言尚未痊愈。高品、文泽因南湘说过，「一客不来罚我做东一日。」子玉是日不到，罚了南湘一天，南湘甚为乐从。即在他家里又叙了一日。惟有子玉、琴言皆未痊愈。正是：数点梅花娇欲坠，月轮又下竹桥西。未知如何，且听下回分解。","en":"Qiguan was added to the flower register; only Qinyan had still not recovered. Gao Pin and Wenze held Nanxiang to what he had said: \\"If one guest is absent, I'll be fined to host a day.\\" Since Ziyu did not come that day, Nanxiang was fined a day of hosting; Nanxiang was thoroughly happy to oblige. Another day's gathering was held at his residence."}],"20":[{"paragraph":5,"mentions":1,"tokens":["刘文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"且说子玉是在家养病，不出大门，高品为河间胡太尊请去修志，刘文泽是他岳母惦记他，来接他并其室吴氏，同到直隶总督衙门去了。此中已少了三人，只有子云、次贤、南湘、仲清、春航、王恂六人，不时往来。","en":"at all. Gao Pin had been invited by the prefect of Hejian, Lord Hu, to assist in compiling a local gazetteer. Liu Wenze's mother-in-law had been missing him and had come to fetch him along with his wife née Wu to the office of the Viceroy of Zhili. So three of the group were gone; only Ziyun, Cixian, Nanxiang, Zhongqing, Chunhang, and Wang Xun — six people — continued"}],"24":[{"paragraph":3,"mentions":1,"tokens":["前舟"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"卓然如云行水流，随处遇合，竟无成心，凡事出以天趣。且辞锋尖利，而独于所好者，便不忍加一刻薄语，亦其情有专用处。前舟与阁下，大致相似，和平浑厚，蔼然可亲，所谓宁人负我，毋我负人者也。至于我亦非忘情，但不能轻易用情。用时容易，到完结处便艰难。若使孟浪用之，而无归束，则情太泛鹜，反为所累。莫若将自己的情，暂借与人，看人之用情处，如有欠缺不到，或险阻不通，有难挽回难收拾","en":"water. His wit is sharp, yet toward those he favors, he never utters a cruel syllable; his is a devoted passion. Qianzhou resembles you—possessing a mild, thick kindness, preferring to let others wrong him rather than wronging them. As for me, I forget no feeling, yet I spend it rarely. It is easy to begin and hard to end; if I were to throw it about without closure, I"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":1,"tokens":["前舟"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"共是十个。」王恂道：「这就是十美班了。」桂保道：「陪客尚未定，你们是一定在数的。听得度香已写书子到保定府去，请前舟回来商议，只怕就是这件事。」王恂道：「也近了，今日已是二十六日了，还有十天，就演得全这些新戏吗？」玉林笑道：「你好记性，还有个闰五月，难道一月多，还演不出来？」王恂笑道：「我真胡涂，静坐了几天，真是山中忘甲子了。」仲清道：「听说琴言患病未好，如今能去","en":"list isn't entirely settled yet, but you two are certainly included. I heard Duxiang wrote to Baoding to invite Qianzhou back, likely just for this occasion.\\" Wang Xun noted, \\"It's drawing close. Today is already the twenty-sixth. Are ten days enough to prepare all these new plays?\\" Yulin laughed, \\"You've forgotten the intercalary fifth month! We still have over a month"}],"25":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":5,"tokens":["刘文泽","文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说前回书中，玉林、桂保在王恂处，讲起怡园演习新戏，预备华公子逛园。流光荏苒，倏忽一月，刘文泽已回。书中所讲这班名士，华公子向来往来者就是刘文泽一人，其余多未谋面。此时文泽之父刘守正已升了礼部尚书，是以文泽偕其妻星夜赶回，未免有些庆贺之事。又适子云写书前往，文泽回京已有半月，诸事已毕。","en":"preparation for Young Master Hua's garden visit. Time flew swiftly; in the blink of an eye a month passed, and Liu Wenze had returned. Of this circle of distinguished scholars, the one Young Master Hua had long been acquainted with was Liu Wenze alone; the rest he had mostly not yet met. Wenze's father, Liu Shouzheng, had by now been promoted to Minister of Rites, and"},{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"到了初六那日，乘着早凉，辰刻就到怡园来。一车两马，服御鲜华，进了园门，即有人通报去了。文泽一面观望园中景致，一面慢慢的走。这怡园逛的人虽多，记得清路径的竟少。","en":"two horses, his attire fresh and splendid; as he entered the garden gate, a servant went ahead to announce him. Wenze meanwhile admired the garden's scenery as he walked slowly. Though many people had visited the Garden of Contentment, those who could remember their way around were surprisingly few."},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":3,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"当时子云接进文泽，到含万楼下坐定，子云即问了些保定光景。文泽讲了一遍，便问子云道：「今日除华公子之外，有何佳客？」子云道：「几个年老纱帽头，同华公子是说不来的。平时来往那些人，系有生有熟。席间若有一个道学先生，就使通席不快，所以止请了我们常叙的几位，除高卓然没有回来","en":"At that moment Ziyun welcomed Wenze in, and they seated themselves below the Tower of Myriad Containment. Ziyun first asked about the situation in Baoding; Wenze recounted his news, then asked Ziyun: \\"Apart from Young Master Hua, what other notable guests are expected today?\\" Ziyun said:"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":2,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"文泽便问次贤在何处，子云道：「静宜因今日新戏出场，内中有些关节，并声律尚有些不谐处，亲自在那里一一指点，少停就来的。」正说之间，张仲雨到了，子云迎接进来，文泽起身相见。见仲雨的服饰，今日与平日不同，往常仲雨是个从九品衔，今日冠服，忽然是个六品，与他一样，","en":"Wenze then asked where Cixian was. Ziyun said: \\"Jingyi is directing today's new plays in person. There are still a number of passages where the staging is not quite right, and the musical modes remain somewhat discordant in places, so he is correcting each"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":3,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"文泽对子云道：「张老二实在算一把好手，各样精明。出去不消说是个能员，将来必定名利双收的。」子云笑道：「名利是一定双收，上司一定欢喜，就是百姓吃苦些。」文泽大笑，仲雨也笑道：「这倒被你猜着，若说将来不要钱，就是我自己也不肯作此欺人之语。况且我这个官，原是花","en":"Wenze said to Ziyun: \\"Zhang the Second is truly a capable fellow — sharp and shrewd in every way. Once he takes up his post, he will undoubtedly prove a most efficient official, and fame and fortune are sure to follow.\\" Ziyun laughed: \\"Fame and fortune he"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":1,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"愿代诸君浮一大白。」大家笑说：「很好。」酒筵已齐，家人即捧酒来，子云送酒安席。东边是华公子首座，仲雨作陪。西边文泽上座，次贤作陪。子云在华公子席上作主人。","en":"bore jars forward — Ziyun poured and set seats — Young Master Hua held chief east seat with Zhongyu attending; Wenze chief west with Cixian attending; Ziyun played host beside Young Master Hua's table."},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":4,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"华公子道：「没有客了，就是五人，何妨并作一席，隔远了不好说话；再一开戏，讲话更听不见了。」文泽道：「既如此，并作一桌罢。」子云道：「也好，但是挤了，换个圆桌罢，只是不恭些。」华公子道：「好说，兄弟亦算不得客，二哥这么拘礼，以后就不敢奉扰了。」子云连声答应，家人们即在中间摆了一张圆桌，重将杯盘摆好，撤了两边。戏台上已打动锣鼓，只见戏房内婷婷袅袅","en":"Seated far apart, conversation is difficult; and once the opera begins, we shall not hear each other at all.\\" Wenze said: \\"In that case, let us combine into one table.\\" Ziyun said: \\"Very well, though it will be rather crowded — let us exchange for a round table instead. I only fear it may seem insufficiently formal.\\" Young Master Hua said: \\"Pray do not stand on ceremony!"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":1,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"个时辰。华公子赞了几声，吩咐了一句话，珊枝出去了一回，就有十六个人，抬上八张桌子，赏了八十吊钱。主人照样发赏，文泽也赏了八桌，仲雨、次贤各赏了四桌。","en":"tables, and eighty strings of cash were bestowed as reward. The host distributed his rewards in the same fashion; Wenze too rewarded eight tables, while Zhongyu and Cixian rewarded four apiece."},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":1,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"极得意的，只有媚香与香畹的《独占》，瑶卿与玉侬的《惊梦》《寻梦》，都是绝妙无双，人家唱不来的，可惜偏又雷同。」文泽道：「何不叫他们两人同唱，各尽其妙，做个珠联璧合，岂不更好吗？」次贤、仲雨皆说：「极妙。虽然是工力悉敌，究竟亦有些异同处，亦可借此细细品题。」华公子大笑道：「这倒新鲜有趣，从未有两人同唱的，就是《寻梦》这一出，可以同唱。」子云即传与戏班，在两厢伺候，","en":"'The Interrupted Dream' and 'Pursuing the Dream' are peerless — no one else performs them — pity they overlap.\\" Wenze said: \\"Why not pair the two sides and sing together — each perfecting his part — pearls strung on one string?\\" Cixian and Zhongyu both said: \\"Excellent — though evenly matched there will still be shades to savor.\\" Young Master Hua laughed: \\"Fresh — I"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":2,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"目视子云。子云会意，也自知酒量不敌，便说道：「实在贱量不能多饮，愿将门杯以当大斗罢。」华公子犹不肯依，经次贤、文泽、仲雨都来解劝，说：「非特度香不能，就是我们都也陪不来的，以小杯罚他三杯罢。」华公子也知子云酒量平常，只得依了。众人请子云连饮了三杯，自己却用大杯一杯一杯的不用人让，一连饮了十几杯，尚觉喝采不住，又逼住了文泽饮了三杯，次贤、仲雨饮了五六杯。华公子忽又","en":"cannot stomach more — let my door cup stand for your great dipper.\\" Young Master Hua still refused until Cixian, Wenze, and Zhongyu mediated: \\"Not only Duxiang — none of us could match those cups — fine him three small cups instead.\\" Knowing Ziyun drank little, Young Master Hua yielded. They made Ziyun drain three cups in succession while he himself, needing no urging,"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":1,"tokens":["前舟"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「这表走快了。」子云道：「难得仁弟今日高兴，我早上说的要尽兴，总要至三更四更，今日不要进城了，在此屈一宵罢。况前舟与仲雨皆是城外人，他们是不怕关城的。」华公子见子云留他夜饮，心中甚是乐从，又看这吟秋水榭实在精致，就住一夜亦不妨。忽又听见城外不怕关城之语，心上又有些踌踌躇躇的。","en":"— as I said this morning we should revel to third or fourth watch — stay tonight — do not re-enter the city — Qianzhou and Zhongyu live outside the walls — they fear no gate.\\" Hearing both an invitation to lodge and the remark about outsiders needing no gate, Young Master Hua wavered — charmed by the pavilion yet uneasy about staying."},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":1,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这边十旦进来，子云命他们换了便衣，重换了一个大圆桌面，把残肴收去，另换几样来。文泽道：「今日星北可谓尽兴，我见他从没这样留恋的。」子云道：「他心上犹以为未足，我若认真留他，他就不去了。他那个林珊枝急得什么似的，尽对我做眼色，只怕还有些醋意。」仲雨道：「何消说得。林珊枝不是登春班出身吗，进去了不到三年，如今华公子的事，可以作得一半主","en":"had them change into plain clothes, swapped for a larger round table, cleared scraps and ordered fresh dishes. Wenze said: \\"Today Xinbei may be said to have enjoyed himself to the full — I have never seen him so loath to leave.\\" Ziyun answered: \\"In his own heart he still thought it not enough. Had I pressed him in earnest to stay, he would not have gone at all. That"},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":1,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"又独要你与瑶卿唱戏，他这眼力却也不低，一面之间，就赏识如此，你可感激他么？」琴言把子云看了一看，低着头不言语。文泽道：「玉侬今日亦不可无知己之感，星北之倾倒，亦不下庾香，你明日倒去见见他为是。」","en":"appreciate you so. Are you not grateful to him?\\" Qinyan gave Ziyun a look, then lowered his head and said nothing. Wenze said: \\"Yunong, you too should not be without the feeling of one who has found a friend who knows him. Xinbei's infatuation is no less than Yuxiang's — you would do well to go and see him tomorrow.\\""},{"paragraph":30,"mentions":1,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"你说话太直了，那位张二爷也不是好说话的人。」琴言尚是呜咽。宝珠把华公子所赏之物拿出来与他比了，却小一些儿。那边文泽是绝早过来，已坐了一日，酒已过量，也要回去歇息。这十旦伺候了一天，又唱了戏，也都困乏，走的亦都要先走。子云因天气尚热，自己也觉困倦，就撤了席，又吃了西瓜、莲藕，送了客出园，诸旦也各自回去。琴言这一句话，便生出无数苦况来，虽徐子云也难荫庇，何况子玉。不","en":"brought out the gift Young Master Hua had bestowed to compare, noting it was indeed a bit smaller. Meanwhile, Wenze, having arrived extremely early and sat for the entire day drinking past his limit, also wanted to return and rest. The ten performers had served all day and sung their plays, and being exhausted, those who needed to leave also wanted to depart first."}],"30":[{"paragraph":4,"mentions":4,"tokens":["文泽","刘文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子想起六月二十一日在怡园观剧，说秋凉了请度香过来。因想十五日是家宴之辰，不便请客，即定于十四日，请子云、次贤、文泽等，在西园中铺设了几处，并有灯戏。为他们是城外人，日间断不能尽兴，于下贴时说明了夜宴。此日正是秋试二场，刘文泽为什么不应举呢？这一科大主考即系文泽之父大宗伯刘守正，副主考系王文辉，已升了阁学，陆宗沅、杨芳猷、周锡爵、孙亮功一班可可的一齐分房，将那一班","en":"would be a family banquet and inconvenient for guests, he set the date for the fourteenth, inviting Ziyun, Cixian, Wenze, and others. He arranged several spots in the West Garden and prepared lantern plays. Because they lived outside the city, a daytime gathering would definitely not be enough for them to fully enjoy themselves, so he specified a night banquet in the invitation."},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":2,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"饰的，领着四个人上来，铺设桌面，摆了两席。戏房便作起乐来，随后银盘金碗，玉液琼浆献上来。华公子起身安席，子云、文泽等推让，欲要并作一席，也换个圆桌，华公子执定不肯，遂让次贤首坐，文泽次之，那一桌子云首坐，仲雨次之，聘才与自己作陪。","en":"soon silver plates, golden bowls, and fine wine were served. Young Master Hua stood up to seat the guests. Ziyun, Wenze, and the others politely declined, suggesting they combine into one table and use a round one instead, but Young Master Hua insisted. Consequently, Cixian took the seat of honor at the first table, with Wenze next to him. At the other table, Ziyun took"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":1,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"笑道：「此系抄袭吾兄旧文，殊觉数见不鲜。」子云道：「唱的甚好，贞静的却极贞静，放浪的却极放浪，没有一人雷同。」文泽道：「这出戏我倒没有见他们唱过。」次贤道：「如今秦淮河也冷落了。就是从前马湘兰的相貌，也只中等，并有金莲不称之说。」子云道：「湘兰小像我却见过，文采丰韵却是有的。」聘才、仲雨也随声附和，讲了一阵。华公子酒兴便发起来，便劝诸人畅饮了几杯。子云留心今日不","en":"sang very well. The demure ones were extremely demure, and the wild ones were extremely wild; no two were alike.\\" Wenze added, \\"I've never seen them perform this play before.\\" Cixian said, \\"The Qinhuai has lost much of its old glamour. Even Ma Xianglan's looks back then were only average, and there was even talk that her golden lotuses were not up to the rest.\\" Ziyun"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":4,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"蕙芳敬到子云面前，子云问起春航场中文字得意么，蕙芳道：「前日史竹君说他的很好，是必中的。」文泽在那席听了笑道：「我听得你在家，天天的焚香祷告，湘帆就文章不佳，也是必要中的。」蕙芳笑道：「谁说的？中举可以祷告得来，我倒愿替众人祷告了。」华公子问道：「你们说的什么？」子云正要回言，蕙芳忙斟了一杯酒来劝子云，子云被他缠住，却不能说。华公子呆呆的看着","en":"day, Shi Zhujun said his essays were very good and he will definitely pass.\\" Hearing this from the other table, Wenze laughed and said, \\"I heard you burn incense and pray every day at home. Even if Xiangfan's essays are poor, he will still pass.\\" Huifang smiled, \\"Who said that? If passing exams could be achieved by praying, I'd be willing to pray for everyone.\\" Young"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":1,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"是朝亲夕见的，如今倒像是相逢陌路，对面无言，未免有些感慨。即叫他走近，问了些话，要问起子玉来，却又缩住。次贤、文泽也问了几句。","en":"change. He called him closer, asked a few questions, and was about to ask about Ziyu, but held back. Cixian and Wenze also asked a few questions."},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":1,"tokens":["刘文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"都为熟识。华公子即令其坐在聘才之上，将要问话，子佩便笑道：「好！如此热闹请客，却不来叫我一声，要我闯上门来。」刘文泽道：「恐怕你应酬忙。知道空闲，我早上就带了你来了。」说得众人笑了，子佩也不理会，便把那些个相公看了一看，即让合席饮了两杯酒，才又自己吃了几箸菜。","en":"and said, \\"Great! You have such a lively banquet, yet you didn't even invite me, forcing me to crash the party.\\" Liu Wenze said, \\"I thought you were busy with social engagements. If I had known you were free, I would have brought you along this morning.\\" Everyone laughed. Zipei ignored it, glanced at the actors, and then proposed a toast of two cups to the whole table before"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":1,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「今日和我妻舅归自荣，同到他的妻舅乌大傻家替他婶娘祝寿。」仲雨听了要笑，子云道：「有了乌大傻，自然就不妥了。」文泽点点头道：「这套话倒必定可听，快说罢。」子佩道：","en":"wanted to laugh when he heard this, and Ziyun said, \\"With Wu Dasha there, things naturally wouldn't go well.\\" Wenze nodded, \\"This story is definitely worth hearing; hurry up and tell us.\\" Zipei continued:"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":2,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"戏的在内，大家公议：「每人凑钱十吊，共得九十吊，遂叫了全福班演戏。归自荣高兴，与一个姓吕的串了一出《独占》。」文泽道：「归自荣本生得好，就是不该同小老婆另住在城外。听说仍旧窘迫得很。」子佩丢个眼色，文泽不说了，萧次贤冷笑一声，聘才像要说话又不说。","en":"Quanfu Troupe to perform. Gui Zirong was in high spirits and performed 'Exclusive Possession' with a man named Lü.\\" Wenze interjected, \\"Gui Zirong is quite handsome himself; he should never have set up a separate household outside the city with his concubine. I hear he's still very short of money.\\" Zipei shot him a warning glance, and Wenze fell silent. Xiao Cixian gave"},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":1,"tokens":["刘文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"道了，要告他。我想一定是此事了。」冯子佩道：「有点像，钱是归自荣与大傻两个分用的，如今倒是乌大傻一人倒运了。」刘文泽道：「这个乌大傻子，也生得特奇，又呆又傻，倒是个戏癖。城外十个戏园，他每天必处处走到，一个园子里至少也走个四五回。歪着肩膀，最可厌的是穿双破皂靴，混混沌沌的走去走来。略有一面之交就斜着身子站住了，人又不留他，没奈何又走过去。我不看戏便罢，若看戏必遇他","en":"sounds plausible. The money was split between Gui Zirong and Dasha, but now Wu Dasha is the only one in trouble.\\" Liu Wenze said, \\"This Wu Dasha is truly bizarre. He's dumb and foolish, yet he's obsessed with opera. There are ten theaters outside the city, and he visits every single one of them every day, visiting each theater at least four or five times. He shuffles about"},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":2,"tokens":["刘文泽","文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"有一分羞涩；又见徐子云身旁站着蕙芳、宝珠，见蕙芳看看他，便凑着子云讲些话，又凑着宝珠讲些话；又见宝珠微笑；又见刘文泽与萧次贤站着，在一处彼此俯耳低言，大约是品评他的意思。原来文泽与蕙芳倒不是讲冯子佩，倒讲的是归自荣。","en":"glanced at him, then leaned towards Ziyun to whisper a few words, and then towards Baozhu, who smiled. He also saw Liu Wenze and Xiao Cixian standing together, whispering in each other's ears, probably discussing him. In fact, Wenze and Huifang were not talking about Feng Zipei at all; they were talking about Gui Zirong."},{"paragraph":30,"mentions":1,"tokens":["刘文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"称某给事为业师，某孝廉为课友，而一班无耻好色者，亦欲相为征逐。归自荣与叶女住宅，就与蕙芳相近，故蕙芳知之甚详。刘文泽也去吃过酒的。但去吃酒的。自荣必要作主人相陪，故此有些人不愿去。","en":"him. The residence of Gui Zirong and the Ye girl was close to Huifang's, so Huifang knew the details very well. Liu Wenze had also gone there to drink. However, when people went to drink, Zirong insisted on acting as the host and keeping them company, so some people were unwilling to go."}],"31":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":2,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"少顷，二人下台，子佩便指着文泽骂道：「你是不懂好歹的，我在台上费力，你倒在那里说长道短的批评我。」文泽极口叫冤道：「我何尝批评你，你这般瞎挑眼？我与静宜先生说闲话。」次贤道：「真是讲闲话。况且你唱得如此绝妙，赞不住口，尚何评论之有？」华公子笑道：「我听得他们说，你倒真像个阎婆惜。","en":"A moment later, the two men stepped down from the stage. Zipei immediately pointed at Wenze and scolded, \\"You really do not know good from bad. I exhausted myself on that stage, yet you sit down here chattering and endlessly picking apart my performance.\\" Wenze cried foul at the top of his lungs, \\"When did I ever critique you? Why are you picking"},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":1,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"酒耽搁，不能使你们一试所长。此刻尚早，会诗的，不妨吟几句；会画的，不妨画几笔，不必谦让。」诸旦默默无言，子云与文泽站起来道：「妙，妙！待我来分派。」即对着蕙芳道：「媚香是长于诗的，瑶卿是长于丹青的，静芳是长于舞剑的，香畹是长于书法的，佩仙是长于填词的，蕊香是长于猜谜诙谐的，瘦香是长于品箫的，小梅是长于吹笙的。可惜玉侬又病了，他倒会一套《平沙落雁》。」华公子便命叫","en":"excel in painting, brush a few strokes. There is no need for false modesty.\\" The dans remained silent. Ziyun and Wenze stood up and said, \\"Splendid, splendid! Let us assign the tasks.\\" Turning to Huifang, he said, \\"Meixiang excels in poetry, Yaoqing is skilled in painting, Jingfang is a master of the sword dance, Xiangwan possesses beautiful calligraphy, Peixian is adept"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":1,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"绝。华公子念道：良宵灯月赏秋光，丝竹纷纷斗两厢。\\n我道嫦娥畏岑寂，遣风吹送上华堂。华公子念罢，拍案叫绝，次贤、文泽、子云俱绝口称妙，说道：「你们闹了一天，被他只用二十八个字，非特说尽，而且有余，我辈反不能如此。」华公子又念了两遍，只是赞叹。","en":"hall.'\\n\\nWhen Young Master Hua finished reading, he slapped the table and cried out in sheer admiration. Cixian, Wenze, and Ziyun were equally effusive in their praise, remarking, \\"You all have been making merry all day, yet he has captured the entire essence of it in a mere twenty-eight characters. He has said all there is to say, with meaning still lingering in the"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":2,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"文泽道：「好是极好了，第三句还要斟酌几个字。」蕙芳道：「就请一改。」文泽道：「可改作「想是嫦娥怕孤寂」，诗意较淡远些。」大家都说改的极好。仲雨、聘才暗暗吃惊，不料他们个个如此，向来疑他们有代笔，今日面试，是的确无疑了。惟冯子佩也不来看，桌子上放有一大盘桂","en":"Wenze said, \\"It is truly superb, though the third line might benefit from a slight refinement of a few characters.\\" Huifang humbly replied, \\"Please, I invite you to correct it.\\" Wenze suggested, \\"Perhaps we could change it to 'I imagine Chang'e must fear the"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":1,"tokens":["前舟"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"湘道：「我们这些文章倒要早早的作起来，刻成一集，刷印几十本，交他带回。其分金，各人量力而行。或者如度香、静宜、前舟，也可叫他们出一分。","en":"subscription funds, let each man contribute according to his means. Perhaps we can also ask Duxiang, Jingyi, and Qianzhou to contribute a share as well."},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":2,"tokens":["前舟","文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"明日，南湘、仲清即致札与子云、前舟诸人，数日后都送了些分金，并有几首歌行。南湘、仲清看了，点过分金是：子云二十四，文泽十六，次贤十二，共五十二两。仲清道：「我们共有六分，每人八两，共凑成一百两也就够了。」南湘道：「很够了。」于是又致札众人，两三日间都要凑足。诗文共遗集，俱已发刻停妥，","en":"The following day, Nanxiang and Zhongqing wrote letters to Ziyun, Qianzhou, and several others. A few days later, the subscription funds arrived, along with several verses and songs. Nanxiang and Zhongqing tallied the contributions: Ziyun gave twenty-four taels, Wenze gave sixteen, and Cixian gave twelve, bringing the total"}],"32":[{"paragraph":10,"mentions":3,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"虽未见过春航，于他儿子们书房内，见他些笔墨东西，也久已倾倒，惟恐不得其人为憾。今中了南元，十分欢喜。从此春航与文泽、王恂又成了世谊，更加亲爱。惟有孙氏昆仲颇难浃洽，然亦不得不往来，惟淡交而已。高品代枪之银已收清，共得了一千六百金。张仲雨过手，在花处讲定二千四百金，从中扣出去八百金，又索花姓谢仪二百金，也得了千金，自己享用。便从藩经历上加捐了正指挥，即在坊里当起差","en":"regretting only that they had not secured him themselves. From then on, Chunhang formed a generational friendship with Wenze and Wang Xun, growing even closer. Only the Sun brothers were difficult to get along with, though they had to maintain some interaction, keeping it purely formal. Gao Pin collected the silver for taking the exam as a substitute, receiving a total of"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":3,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"从此归自荣成了一个衣冠禽兽了。一日，文泽的家人从外面抄了一张来送与文泽看，恰好南湘、仲清都在那里。大家看时，只见写道：勘得归自荣，家本书香，父曾攀桂；心耽铜臭，性爱游花。\\n浪迹都门，骗人弱息；缩头陋巷，拥彼淫娼。恣挑达于风月场中，攫钱财于鸳鸯被底。臀有肤而尽堪凿空，面无皮而岂解包羞。贪酒食","en":"From then on, Gui Zirong became known as a \\"beast in human clothing\\". One day, Wenze's servant copied down the judgment from outside and brought it to show Wenze, just when Nanxiang and Zhongqing happened to be there. As they read it, it said: \\"Upon investigation of Gui Zirong: His family originally belonged to the scholarly class, his"}],"35":[{"paragraph":6,"mentions":1,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"再说王恂、颜仲清、文泽、春航，从十三日至十五日都在怡园赏灯饮酒。子玉也去了一天，因想去年此日初见琴言，今年似成隔世，不觉伤感了一回。新年上，诸名旦彼此纷纷请客，热闹了十余日。到了十七日，王恂、颜仲清飞了札来与子玉。","en":"Returning to Wang Xun, Yan Zhongqing, Liu Wenze, and Tian Chunhang—from the thirteenth to the fifteenth, they had all been at the Garden of Contentment, admiring lanterns and drinking wine. Ziyu had also joined them for one day. Remembering how he had first met Qinyan on this very day last year, and"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":1,"tokens":["刘文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"旦中有几个不得来，都有堂会戏，不能分身。宝珠之外，来的是蕙芳、素兰、玉林、漱芳四人。这边名士，怡园二位之外，是刘文泽、颜仲清、王恂、田春航、梅子玉五人。共十二人。众客到齐，宝珠先叩谢了。","en":"in total. On the side of the famous scholars, apart from the two hosts of the Garden of Contentment, there were Liu Wenze, Yan Zhongqing, Wang Xun, Tian Chunhang, and Mei Ziyu—five in total. Together, they made twelve. Once all the guests had assembled, Baozhu first bowed in gratitude to everyone."},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":1,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"挤，两桌又离开了。」子云道：「依我，把两张大方桌并拢来，就可坐了。」摆好了坐位，是东西对面八坐，南北对面四坐。文泽、仲清、王恂、春航、子玉、次贤、子云坐了东西，上下是蕙芳、素兰、玉林、漱芳、宝珠。宝珠坐了末位。","en":"together; then we can all sit.\\" The seating was arranged: eight facing east and west, four facing north and south. Wenze, Zhongqing, Wang Xun, Chunhang, Ziyu, Cixian, and Ziyun took the east-west seats, while the upper and lower seats were occupied by Huifang, Sulan, Yulin, Shufang, and Baozhu. Baozhu took the very last seat."},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":8,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"大不小镀金杯子，外面极细攒花，底下一个座子，如钟里轮盘一样，下有四个小车轮。次贤拿了出来，放在桌上，却不见动。文泽道：「怎样不走？」把他推了一推，略动一动，便又住了。众人不解其故。次贤笑道：「你应了喝一杯，他便会走了。」文泽道：「只要他会走，我就喝一杯。」次贤便拿了杯子放在自斟壶前斟满了一杯，便道：「请宝贝转身敬刘老爷一杯。」那只杯子便四轮飞动，对着文泽走来。文","en":"dials, with four tiny wheels underneath. Cixian took them out and placed them on the table, but they didn't move. Wenze asked, \\"Why aren't they moving?\\" He gave one a push; it moved slightly and then stopped again. The others couldn't understand the mechanism. Cixian smiled, \\"Once you accept to drink a cup, it will walk.\\" Wenze said, \\"As long as it walks, I will drink"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":1,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"酒！」那杯子果然望次贤走来。蕙芳大笑，众人亦皆欢喜道：「被他识破机关了。」次贤笑道：「好个聪明贼，果然利害。」文泽即问蕙芳所以然的缘故，蕙芳笑道：「等我再试一遍，方可相信。」于是又把杯子看了看，记好了，斟了酒，说声：「敬徐老爷酒！」那杯便送到子云面前。子云笑道：「十二个人，怎样单是他看得出？我偏不信。」","en":"rejoiced, saying, \\"He has seen through the trick.\\" Cixian laughed, \\"What a clever thief, quite formidable indeed.\\" Wenze immediately asked Huifang for the explanation. Huifang smiled, \\"Let me try it one more time before you can believe it.\\" So he inspected the cup again, noted the position, poured the wine, and announced: \\"A cup of wine for Lord Xu!\\" The cup was delivered"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":9,"tokens":["前舟","文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"次贤道：「今日雅集，不可无令。前舟你是首坐，出个令，大家顽顽罢。」文泽道：「甚好。但我的令没甚新鲜的，待我想想看。」想了一回道：「我们今天是十二个人，还是念句唐诗飞觞罢，用数目字飞。第一个飞一字，一字到谁谁喝酒。接飞二字，到那人，那人也照样喝酒。又飞三字，一轮到十二为止。错者罚酒，可","en":"Cixian said, \\"Today's elegant gathering must have a drinking game. Qianzhou, since you hold the first seat, propose a game for us all to play.\\" Wenze agreed, \\"Very well. But my games aren't particularly novel, let me think for a moment.\\" After some thought, he said, \\"There are twelve of us today. Let's pass the cup by reciting"},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":4,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"次贤把筹和了一和，递给文泽，先掣了一枝，把筹筒搁过一边。王恂道：「何不一同抽出，按着次序说不好吗？」次贤笑道：「那就太便宜了，后头可以细想改换，再罚不成酒了。」文泽看那筹时，服饰门，美人名玉环，注：「飞七言唐诗二句，集《毛诗》说并头花。」文泽想一想，出坐走了几步道：「这倒不是","en":"Cixian shuffled the lots and handed the tube to Wenze to draw first. Wang Xun asked, \\"Why not have everyone draw their lots first and then proceed in order?\\" Cixian replied, \\"That would be too easy. People would have too much time to overthink and avoid penalties.\\" Wenze's lot was for the 'Adornment' category,"},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":5,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"文泽道：「想得好好的又忘了，再想不起什么花。」偶见酒杯是个鸡缸，倒便触着了两句，念道：「鸡既鸣矣，冠绥双止。鸡冠是个并头花。」并坐是剑潭，该贺两杯。仲清道：「你且饮了再贺。」文泽欣然，自己饮了两杯。仲清便掣筹，文泽道：「你的贺酒还没有喝呢！」仲清道：「你","en":"Wenze said, \\"I had it well in mind and then lost it — now I cannot think of a single flower.\\" Then, catching sight of his wine cup, which was a chicken-pattern beaker, he hit upon two lines from the *Mao Shi*: \\"'The rooster (ji) has crowed; the crest (guan)"},{"paragraph":30,"mentions":1,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"星儿惜玉怜香，只合守蓬窗茆屋梅花账。」旁边子玉拍手称妙道：「好个温柔旖旎！倒转来，偏这样凑拍，倒比原文还好。」文泽道：「这是《访素》的曲文，是一枝上的，我们也贺一杯。」这边王恂掣了枝是鸟门的，美人名飞燕，花名也是并蒂花。王恂素来文思略迟，只得思索起来。看着素兰掷了个么四，也在那里凝思。忽见素兰想着了两句，念道：「月明云淡露花浓，人在蓬莱第几宫。」春航赞道：「更妙","en":"and praised its tender elegance, remarking that the adapted pairing felt even better than the original context. Wenze pointed out that the lines came from *Visiting Su* in a specific aria sequence and deserved another toast. Back on the scholars' side, Wang Xun had drawn the category of birds, with the beauty 'Feiyan' (Flying Swallow), requiring a paired-stem flower."},{"paragraph":31,"mentions":1,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"贺了一杯。这边王恂想着了，说道：「我用裴虔余一句，温飞卿一句，合着是：玉搔头袅凤双飞，燕钗落处无声腻。」子云、文泽大赞道：「妙，妙！此二句如一句，实在接得妙。」王恂又说道：「奉时辰牡，颜如渥丹。是并蒂牡丹花。」众人尚未开口，仲清道：「菜还没有上得一半，烧猪倒先拿了出来。」众人不解，留心四顾，王恂道：「那里有什么烧猪？」仲清笑道：「就是你想吃烧猪，你说得「奉时辰牡","en":"\\"'The jade hairpin sways, twin phoenixes fly; where the swallow-pin falls, the silence grows soft.'\\" Ziyun and Wenze praised the seamless linkage. Wang Xun then offered 'paired-stem peony' from the *Mao Shi*. Before anyone could respond, Zhongqing joked, \\"Half the dishes haven't even been served yet, and the roast pig has already appeared.\\" People looked around in"},{"paragraph":35,"mentions":1,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"了一杯。漱芳又掷了个么二，也想了一想，念道：「月上东墙，最可人星明月朗。」子云道：「好！该贺一杯。」众人喝过。文泽道：「你自己令也应交卷了，只管看着人交卷，难道你这腹稿还没有打完么？」子云笑道：「快了。」于是又看蕙芳掷了一个么四，想了半刻工夫，念着《偷曲》上的两句道：「山入寒空月影横，阑干畔，有玉人闲凭。」子云道：「更好，该贺个双杯。我也交卷了，我就用温飞卿《采","en":"the stars are clear and the moon is bright.'\\" Ziyun again praised, \\"Good! That deserves a cup.\\" Everyone drank. Wenze teased Ziyun, \\"It's time you submitted your own lines. You just keep watching others turn theirs in. Could it be that your mental draft isn't finished yet?\\" Ziyun chuckled, \\"Almost done.\\" He then watched Huifang roll a one and a four. After half a quarter"},{"paragraph":36,"mentions":1,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"越好了，真是他们的比我们的好。」王恂道：「词出佳人口，信然。」春航道：「他们也实在敏捷，我们只好甘拜下风了。」文泽道：「难为他们句句贴切，也从没有人罚过一杯，倒叫人贺了好几十杯。」子玉道：「我早说我们不及他们。他们若行我们的令，只怕比我们总要好些。然而也是时候了，可以收令吃饭罢。」子云道：「等他们轮完了歇罢。他们也煞费苦心，争这一杯贺酒。」","en":"indeed true.\\" Chunhang added, \\"They are also remarkably quick-witted; we have no choice but to concede defeat.\\" Wenze pointed out, \\"It's impressive how perfectly fitting every single one of their lines is. None of them have been penalized a single cup, yet they've earned dozens of toasts.\\" Ziyu said, \\"I said from the beginning that we couldn't match them. If they played"}],"37":[{"paragraph":3,"mentions":2,"tokens":["刘文泽","文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"今日之约，刘文泽、颜仲清、田春航不来，因为是春航会同年团拜，文泽、王恂是座师的世兄，故大家请了他。春航并请仲清，仲清新受感冒，两处都辞了。王恂也辞了那边，清早就约同子玉到怡园，次贤、子云接进梅崦坐下。这梅崦是个梅花样式，五间一处，共有五处。长廊曲槛钩连，绿萼红香围绕","en":"For today's gathering, Liu Wenze, Yan Zhongqing, and Tian Chunhang did not attend. Chunhang was attending a New Year gathering of his examination year-mates. The examination cohort had invited Wenze and Wang Xun as sons of their examiners. Chunhang had also invited Zhongqing, but Zhongqing"},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":1,"tokens":["前舟"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"不开，我们都唱过一堂的了。」王恂道：「何以今日这么多呢？」桂保道：「再忙半个月也就闲了。」宝珠道：「我见湘帆、前舟在那里，剑潭何以不来？」王恂道：「身子不爽快。」桂保谓子玉道：「今年我们还是头一回见面。」子玉道：「正是，我却出来过几次，总没有见你。」宝珠道：「今日香畹与静芳苦了，处处有他们的戏，是再不能来了。」子云道：「我算有六七人可来，谁晓得都不能来。」将到午","en":"replied that they would be busy for another half month before things quieted down. Baozhu added, \\"I saw Xiangfan and Qianzhou there; why did Jiantan not come?\\" Wang Xun explained that he was unwell. Guibao turned to Ziyu and said, \\"This is the first time we have met this year.\\" Ziyu agreed, noting that although he had been out several times, he had never run into him. Baozhu"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":2,"tokens":["前舟"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"吃了些点心，又喝了几杯酒。王恂问蕙芳道：「你见湘帆、前舟没有？」蕙芳道：「原是为他们在那里，所以耽搁了好一回，将我的戏挪上了才来的。我今天见了一个老名士，说是前舟的业师，相貌清古，有六旬之外了。」子云道：「姓什么？」蕙芳道：「姓得有些古怪，我想想着，好像姓瞿，穿着六品服饰，觉得议论风生，无人不敬爱他。」子","en":"They ate a few pastries and drank several more cups of wine. Wang Xun asked Huifang, \\"Have you seen Xiangfan and Qianzhou?\\" Huifang replied, \\"It was because they were there that I was held up for so long. My performance was moved earlier so I could come. I saw a remarkable old gentleman of letters there today, said to be Qianzhou's teacher. He had a refined, old-fashioned"},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":1,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"几十杯酒，各有醉意，便也不能再饮。三杯之后，吃过了饭，略坐了一坐，子玉、王恂告辞，子云又约了明日。到明日又添了文泽、春航，名旦中也添了几个，又在怡园叙了一日。陆素兰单请子玉、琴言二人，又叙了一日，这一日清谈小叙，更为有趣。一连叙了三日，子玉也心满意足，人也乏了。徐子云要请屈道生，却好史南湘已到京，作一个诗酒大会。子玉不能推辞，只得赴约。且听下回分解。","en":"while, and then Ziyu and Wang Xun took their leave. Ziyun invited them back for the following day. The next day, Wenze and Chunhang joined the party, as did several more of the famous performers, and they spent another day together at the Garden of Contentment. Lu Sulan gave a small private gathering for Ziyu and Qinyan alone, a quiet, intimate day of conversation, even"}],"38":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"且说徐子云请了屈公来，并请南湘、仲清、文泽、春航、王恂、子玉作陪，仍在梅崦中。王恂是日为孙亮功请去有事，因李元茂吉期已定，要招赘过来。亮功因两位贤郎是不懂事的，一切皆托王恂料理，王恂所以不能前来。","en":"To return to our story: Xu Ziyun had invited Master Qu to attend, with Nanxiang, Zhongqing, Wenze, Chunhang, Wang Xun, and Ziyu as companions, again in the Plum Knoll. Wang Xun on this particular day had been called away by Sun Lianggong on an important matter: the wedding date had been fixed for Li Yuanmao, who was to be adopted into the Sun household"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":1,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"才品者咸比为杜少陵、孟东野。但其赋性高旷，不善治家，常为贫乏所累。后复游京师应举，两试不第，馆于刘尚书家，教过文泽两年。继为华公子请去教书，又逗留了三年，仍归乡里。守令钦其贤，举了孝廉方正，铨选了江西一个苦缺知县，任满题升了南昌府通判。去年夫人又病故了，剩了孑然一身，并无亲丁骨肉。","en":"for the examinations but failed twice, took a post as a tutor in the household of Minister Liu, where he taught Wenze for two years. He was then engaged by the young master of the Hua family to teach, remaining there another three years before finally returning to his native place. The local magistrates, admiring his virtuous reputation, recommended him through the"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":1,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"湘，南湘道：「这是我乡前辈，如何敢抗礼。」才定了仲清。东席第二是南湘，西席第二是春航。东席第三是子玉，西席三是文泽。子云东席作主，次贤西席作陪。宝珠、琴言在东，蕙芳、素兰在西，一一坐了。主人让酒，客皆饮了几杯。道生道：「我将前日先见的苏媚香谈起。」西席的人个个细听。道生道：「我这看相不论气色，部位是要论的，然尚在其次。我看全身的神骨、举止行动、坐相、立相，并口音","en":"the east table was Nanxiang; second on the west was Chunhang. Third on the east was Ziyu; third on the west was Wenze. Ziyun presided at the east table while Cixian acted as second host at the west. Baozhu and Qinyan sat on the east side; Huifang and Sulan on the west. Everyone took their places. The host circulated wine and the guests each drank a few cups. Qu said,"},{"paragraph":39,"mentions":1,"tokens":["刘文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"。」道翁道：「想与此数君自必水乳。」这一日，屈道翁足足讲了一日，人也乏了。吃完了饭，散坐了一会，也就二更光景。刘文泽系旧学生，不敢问难。宝珠问子云要柄扇子，求道翁题诗，子云索性叫取四柄扇子出来，给四旦每人一柄。于是宝珠拂几，蕙芳移砚，素兰磨墨，琴言润毫，共求道翁留题。道翁也十分高兴，遂将各人的大概，每人写了七律一首，半行半草的一笔虞世南，并落了双款。四旦谢了，谈了","en":"After finishing the meal they sat about in a relaxed manner for a while; it was already about the second watch. Liu Wenze, being a former student of his, did not venture to ask difficult questions. Baozhu asked Ziyun for a folding fan so that he could request a poem from Master Qu; Ziyun went further and had four fans brought out, one for each of the four performers. Thereupon"}],"43":[{"paragraph":18,"mentions":1,"tokens":["前舟"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"还容易。我与瑶卿、香畹三人可以凑得六百金，王氏弟兄、佩仙、庾香可以凑得四百金。」次贤道：「我来一分，出二百金，前舟可出三百金，庸庵、竹君二人可出三百金。庾香、湘帆、剑潭不必派他，凑起来已得一千八百了。若要三千，还少一千二百两，不消说是度香包圆了。」子云道：「难道华星北倒干干净净，一文不花，这么便宜。」蕙芳道：「据我说，不必要他出钱。如今与他讲，就是一总要他拿出来","en":"and Yuxiang could manage four hundred.\\" \\"I shall contribute my share of two hundred taels,\\" said Cixian, \\"and Qianzhou can put in three hundred; Yong'an and Zhujun together can provide three hundred. We need not call on Yuxiang, Xiangfan, or Jiantan. All told we would have one thousand eight hundred. If three thousand is the target, we are still short one thousand two"}],"44":[{"paragraph":20,"mentions":1,"tokens":["前舟"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"庾香是个秀才，也可考么？」子云道：「可以。」琴言道：「你自然也去的。」子云道：「现任官不准考，我已补了缺。就是前舟，只怕也不能的了，五月前后总可得缺。」","en":"said Qinyan. \\"Active officials are not permitted to sit,\\" said Ziyun. \\"I have already taken up a post. And as for Qianzhou — I fear he cannot enter either; he will likely receive his assignment sometime around the fifth month.\\""}],"45":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["刘文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"昨日子云又请了屈道生、梅子玉、史南湘、颜仲清、田春航、刘文泽、王恂等，并有诸名旦全来，会了一日。因南湘、春航次早要入场，所以散得甚早。","en":"The day before, Ziyun had once again invited Qu Daosheng, Mei Ziyu, Shi Nanxiang, Yan Zhongqing, Tian Chunhang, Liu Wenze, Wang Xun, and others. Together with all the leading actors, they had gathered for an entire day. Since Nanxiang and Chunhang were to enter the examination hall the following morning, the gathering disbanded quite early."},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":1,"tokens":["刘文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"颜夫人是从没有阻过他的。子玉到了辰刻，因是仙坛，衣冠而去。是日一早，屈道生同金吉甫先到，随后颜仲清、刘文泽、王恂一齐都来了，子玉到了，各人与吉甫相见，叙了些彼此仰慕的话。只有史南湘、田春航在场中未来。相公们到的是宝珠、蕙芳、素兰、玉林、漱芳、兰保、桂保、春喜、琪官、连琴言刚是十人。","en":"dress. Early that morning, Qu Daosheng and Jin Jifu had already arrived. They were followed by Yan Zhongqing, Liu Wenze, Wang Xun, and finally Ziyu. They exchanged words of long admiration with Jifu. Shi Nanxiang and Tian Chunhang were still at the examination grounds. Among the performers who came were Baozhu, Huifang, Sulan, Yulin, Shufang, Lanbao, Guibao, Chunxi, and"},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":1,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"消说是华公子。」子云道：「竟连前日的事，都说出来了。你知道明珠、珊瑚的故事么？」仲清道：「我不知这句的故事。」文泽道：「明珠是他有十婢，皆以珠字为名，这珊瑚就是林珊枝了。」又看写的是：","en":"week's quarrel appears. Do you know the pearl and coral story?\\" Zhongqing shook his head. \\"I don't know that line.\\" Wenze explained, \\"The pearls were his ten maids, all named with 'pearl.' The coral is Lin Shanzhi.\\" The next lines read:"},{"paragraph":31,"mentions":1,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"酒狂词客何纷纷，眼底直欲空人群。\\n举杯渴酌洞庭水，掉头笑看吴山云。\\n文泽道：「这必是竹君、卓然二公了。」众人说道：「正是的，怎么把他二人写得如此活跳，真非仙笔不能。」又见写道：","en":"mortal throng.\\nRaise the cup, drink deep from Dongting's tide,\\nTurn your head, laugh at Mount Wu's clouds wide.\\"\\nWenze said, \\"That must be Zhujun and Zhuoran.\\" Everyone cried out in agreement. \\"How vividly drawn! Only an immortal brush could manage such a feat.\\" Next:"},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":1,"tokens":["前舟"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"刘晨子晋求仙去，十丈红尘阻前路。\\n均是龙华会上人，名场同日欣知遇。\\n次贤道：「这是前舟、庸庵了。」众人说是。王恂道：「我们这些人都说完了，看以后还说谁。」只见又写道：","en":"all were guests at Dragon-Flower feast,\\nSame day they knew joy in fame's bright field.\\"\\nCixian noted, \\"That is Qianzhou and Yong'an.\\" Wang Xun added, \\"We've all been named. Let's see who follows.\\" Next:"},{"paragraph":39,"mentions":1,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"。子云哈哈大笑道：「愿意了，愿意了！这也不是轻易遇得着的。」就让众人到承荫堂，铺了红毡，次贤、子云扶道生坐了，文泽、仲清拉过琴言来拜了八拜，道生受了。","en":"rare!\\" He led everyone to the Hall of Inherited Shade and spread a red carpet. Cixian and Ziyun seated Daosheng. Wenze and Zhongqing gently drew Qinyan forward to perform eight deep bows, and Daosheng graciously received them."},{"paragraph":41,"mentions":1,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云便请入席。第一席是道生、子玉、吉甫、王胡子、琴言，二席是仲清、文泽、王恂、子云、次贤，九个名旦分为两桌，各自叙齿坐了三、四两席。琴言坐在下手，拘拘谨谨，也不举箸，甚觉可怜。倒是道生体恤他，道：「凡遇热闹场中，当言的即言，也不必过于拘谨，但存着个后辈的分寸就是了。」","en":"the table. The first table sat Daosheng, Ziyu, Jifu, Old Wang Beard, and Qinyan. The second seated Zhongqing, Wenze, Wang Xun, Ziyun, and Cixian. The nine actors split two more tables by age. Qinyan sat quietly at the foot, his chopsticks untouched, looking pitifully constrained. Daosheng comforted him gently. \\"In lively gatherings, speak when speech is due. Do not"}],"46":[{"paragraph":3,"mentions":1,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"诸名士于二十八日早上陆续皆到。是日子玉、春航、南湘、仲清、文泽、王恂，共是六位，惟吉甫因感冒未到。园内屈氏父子，与次贤、主人四位，都在含万楼下坐了。道翁道：「这个含万楼是本《易经》「含万物而化光」句摘下，因为园中的主楼，故取此名。但就本意是言干道之大，此名似乎不甚相宜，度香以为何如？我见楼上现供着赐书，何不就改","en":"On the twenty-eighth morning the gentlemen arrived piecemeal: Ziyu, Chunhang, Nanxiang, Zhongqing, Wenze and Wang Xun—six—while Jifu stayed home with a chill. The Qu father and son, Cixian and their host — four in all — sat below the Tower of Myriad Containment. Daoweng explained: \\"This tower borrows from the *Book of Changes*: 'embracing the myriad things,"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":1,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"面花。\\n道翁赞道：「好极了，却移不到别处去。」仲清笑道：「有先生的珠玉在前，我等实难附尾，不过聊以塞责而已。」文泽道：「此处我竟没有来游玩过。」王恂道：「我也没有，到护香廊就住了。」南湘道：「我去年看菊花，是从这里走过，倒游了一游。」子云引道，过了一座木桥，从竹林走出，是片空地，有几间敞厅，立着鹄棚，旁边还有一条马路，望东北上编些竹篱，高高矮矮，护着几处屋宇。同","en":"smiled. \\"With your pearls before us, we can hardly do more than follow at the tail; it is only to fill the gap.\\" Wenze said, \\"I have never once come and looked at this place.\\" Wang Xun said, \\"Nor I. I always stopped at the colonnade.\\" Nanxiang said, \\"I came through here last year to see the chrysanthemums, and did have a look round.\\"\\n\\nZiyun led the way over a wooden"},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":1,"tokens":["前舟"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，好酬春色正温柔。\\n道翁大赞道：「此与湘帆兄一样手笔，今日看诸兄题的联句，正是一人一样性灵，原不能强合的，就是前舟还没有题过。」","en":"repay the spring, tender and warm.\\"\\n\\nDaoweng praised parity with Xiangfan—each man's spirit showed distinct—only Qianzhou had yet to write."},{"paragraph":31,"mentions":2,"tokens":["前舟","文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"红桥斜跨，山上有泉，翻银滚雪，屋边皆树，云护烟笼，赞道：「我看园中以此处为第一，这榭名也好，就每层有一副对子。前舟题第一层，竹君题第二层，剑潭题第三层。必皆有惊人好句，老夫洗耳恭听。」三人不能推让，先看文泽的第一层是：","en":"first place in the garden, and the name of the pavilion is good too. Each storey should have its couplet. Let Qianzhou inscribe the first, Zhujun the second and Jiantan the third. They will all have startling lines in them, and this old man will listen with washed ears.\\"\\n\\nThe three could not decline. They looked first at Wenze's, for the lowest storey:"},{"paragraph":48,"mentions":3,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"回来，这个平泉庄胜于古人多矣。」便数今天添的对子，已有了二十二副，内有最多者是子玉与他自己，其余也有两副的，惟文泽、王恂只有一副，未免不公，于是烦王恂、文泽各撰一副，又改稻庄为红雪西庄。先是文泽念了出来，是：","en":"and there were twenty-two of them, of which Ziyu and he himself had the most, and the others two apiece; only Wenze and Wang Xun had but one each, which was hardly fair. So he asked Wenze and Wang Xun each to compose another, and changed the rice hamlet to the Red Snow West Manor. Wenze recited his first:"},{"paragraph":52,"mentions":1,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"着那些牡丹花，更为绚烂。已撤了护花的幛子。子云备了两席，一席是道翁、南湘、子玉、琴仙、次贤，一席是仲清、春航、文泽、王恂、子云。","en":"screens gone. Two tables waited—one for Daoweng, Nanxiang, Ziyu, Qinxian, Cixian; one for Zhongqing, Chunhang, Wenze, Wang Xun, Ziyun."},{"paragraph":53,"mentions":1,"tokens":["前舟"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"裁衣，二来是各人的性灵。今日高超的是剑潭，沉着的是竹君，细腻风光的是庾香，风华绮丽的是湘帆，秀润工稳的是庸庵、前舟，潇洒跌宕的是静宜，就是度香那副集句，也觉得落落大方。正是各人自立一帜，无从评定甲乙。你们看这二十四副对子，好在虚字少，尽是实字多，便见得力量。若教外边那些名宿做起来，不知要添多少虚字在里头，才凑得成、捏得拢呢。」众名士一齐佩服。子云道：「先生何不将","en":"the lofty one; Zhujun the weighty; Yuxiang has the delicate scene; Xiangfan the rich and splendid; Yong'an and Qianzhou the polished and well-turned; Jingyi the free and unconstrained; and even Duxiang's set of borrowed lines has an easy largeness about it. Each has planted his own banner, and there is no ranking them first and second.\\n\\n\\"Look at these twenty-four couplets:"}],"47":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":2,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"进士，南湘中了二十一名，春航中了三十四名，两人不消说都欢喜，把个蕙芳、兰保也乐得说不出来。南湘此番在京，借住在文泽处，因去年乃翁赴任时，将住宅卖去。蕙芳因春航在文泽处，虽彼此相安，但他出进虽没人说话，也常要到门房走走，因此觉得不甚便当。","en":"Since his father had sold their residence upon leaving for his post last year, Nanxiang had been boarding with Wenze. Though Chunhang also stayed there and they lived amicably enough, Huifang often had to pass through the gatehouse, making visits less than convenient."},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":1,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"行的。但你令尊在家，拘拘束束，不甚畅快，须到外边去才好。」琴仙也应了。蕙芳谈了许久，方才辞出，见了春航、南湘、文泽，均将此话说明，度香要请他们二人过去，春航道：「竹君可以去，我这几日就想接家母与内人来，房子终要找的，省得挪来挪去。」南湘道：「我也看去不去，也在两可。」春航明日面辞了子云，说要接家眷来京，子云也不好相强。蕙芳也找着一所房子，甚是合式，就在鸣珂坊，与","en":"outside.\\" Qinxian agreed. After chatting at length, Huifang took his leave, sought out Chunhang, Nanxiang, and Wenze, and conveyed Ziyun's invitation to the garden. Chunhang said: \\"Zhujun can go, but I plan to bring my mother and wife to the capital in a few days. We will need a house eventually; it saves moving back and forth.\\" Nanxiang said: \\"I will see; it could"}],"48":[{"paragraph":36,"mentions":2,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云也送了六百，文泽送了二百，道翁的盘费很富足了。子云、次贤各备车马跟着，一直送出城外，直到十里之外皇华亭。只见南湘、仲清、文泽、金粟、王恂、子玉、春航，领着那蕙芳、宝珠、素兰、漱芳、玉林、兰保、桂保、琪官、春喜九个名旦，在皇华亭等候。道翁等连忙下车，极口辞谢。各人皆要","en":"Ziyun also gifted six hundred pieces of silver, and Wenze gave two hundred, ensuring Daoweng's travel funds were exceedingly abundant. Ziyun and Cixian each prepared their own carriages and followed closely behind, escorting them ten li beyond the city wall to the Imperial Envoys' Pavilion, ten miles away."}],"49":[{"paragraph":13,"mentions":1,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"玉，目下少年中有景星凤凰之誉。」苏侯点点头。子云又道：「已故翰林院编修颜庄之子名仲清，现任礼部尚书刘大人之子名文泽，内阁学士王大人之子名恂。此外，还有苏州拔贡生高品，湖南优贡生萧次贤。这几位都是名下无虚，与田修撰、史庶常朝夕观摩，是门生往来无间的。其余不知其他，不敢滥举。」苏侯听了，掀髯大笑：「怎么你举的人，多半是我的年侄？你不要阿私所好，叫我听了喜欢。」子云笑","en":"the late Hanlin Compiler Yan Zhuang, named Zhongqing; the son of the current Minister of Rites Lord Liu, named Wenze; and the son of Academician of the Grand Secretariat Lord Wang, named Xun. In addition, there is the Suzhou specially recommended graduate Gao Pin, and the Hunan honored graduate Xiao Cixian. These gentlemen fully live up to their reputations. They study"}],"50":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":7,"tokens":["刘文泽","文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"且说刘文泽补了吏部主事，与徐子云同在勋司，未免也要常常上衙门。这些公子官儿，那里认真当差，不过讲究些车马衣服，借着上衙门的日子，可以出来散散。戏馆歌楼，三朋四友，甚是有兴。一日，文泽回来，路过林春喜门口，着人问了春喜在家，文泽下了车进去。远远望见春喜穿着白纻丝","en":"Liu Wenze, having secured a post as a secretary in the Ministry of Personnel, now served in the same honors bureau as Xu Ziyun and was obliged to make frequent appearances at the yamen. Yet these young gentlemen-officials hardly took their duties seriously; their"},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":2,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"文泽笑道：「若是真的，他也不肯给你，知你不是个赏鉴家。」春喜笑道：「好就是了，何必论真假。」文泽见春喜两间书室倒很幽雅。前面一个见方院子，种些花草，摆些盆景，支了一个小卷篷。后面一带北窗墙子内，种四五棵芭蕉，叶上两面皆写满了字，有真有行，大小不一，问春喜","en":"Wenze laughed. \\"If it were truly genuine, he would never have parted with it, knowing full well you are no connoisseur.\\" Chunxi smiled in return. \\"As long as it is pleasing to the eye, why bicker over true or false?\\" Wenze noticed that Chunxi's two-room study"},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":3,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"给我学字的么？我若写在纸上，教人看了笑话。这个蕉叶便又好些。我还画些草虫在上面，我给你瞧，不知像不像。」便拉了文泽走到后面，把一张小蕉叶攀下来，给文泽看，是画些蜻蜓、螳螂、促织、蜘蛛各样的草虫。文泽笑道：「这倒亏你，很有点意思，只怕你学出来，比瑶卿还要好些。」春喜道：「瑶卿近来我有些恨他。他的画自然比我好，但他学了两三年，我是今年才学的。春间请教请教他，不是笑我","en":"far more forgiving. I even painted a few insects on them. Let me show you—tell me if they look real.\\" He pulled Wenze to the back, pulled down a small banana leaf, and showed him paintings of various insects: dragonflies, praying mantises, crickets, spiders, and bees. Wenze chuckled. \\"This is quite inventive of you, rather charming! I fear that once you master this,"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":8,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"的看。我总要画好了才给他看呢。我问静宜要了许多稿子，静宜说我照着他画，倒不要看那芥子园的画谱。」又笑嘻嘻的对着文泽道：「我与你画把扇子。」文泽道：「此时我不要，等你学好了再画。」春喜道：「你们势利，怎见得我此时就画得不好？你若有好团扇，我就加意画了。」说罢就跑了进去，拿了一柄团扇出来，画着一枝杨柳，有一个螳螂捕蝉。那翅张开，一翅在螳螂身下压住，很像嘶出那急声来。","en":"copy his work from life, telling me to ignore those 'Mustard Seed Garden' painting manuals.\\" Smiling brightly at Wenze, he offered, \\"Let me paint a fan for you.\\" Wenze replied, \\"I don't want one right now. I shall wait until you have truly mastered the art.\\" Chunxi protested, \\"How snobbish you all are! How do you know my painting isn't good enough already? If you have"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":3,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"文泽见了大喜，问道：「怎么今日不约而同，都到这里来？」仲清道：「庸庵要到蕊香那里去，却遇见玉艳，想同到新开的庄子里去坐坐。见你的车在门口，所以进来。」文泽道：「莫非就是那唐和尚开的安吉堂么？闻得那地方倒好，他又将寺里的几间房子也通了过去，我们就去。」春喜","en":"Wenze was overjoyed to see them and asked, \\"How is it that you all arrived together here today, without even arranging it?\\" Zhongqing explained, \\"Yong'an was on his way to see Ruixiang, but ran into Yuyan. We thought we might go sit for a while at the newly"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":2,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"额字画，看得出汗。」再看两边墙上两个大横披，一个姓马的写的字，其恶俗已到不堪，那一幅画甚离奇，是画的张生游寺。文泽等又笑了一阵。掌柜的进来张罗了一会，亲手倒了几杯茶出去，遂换走堂进来点菜。王恂道：「这里的生炒翅子、烧鸭子是出名的，就要这两样。」各人又分要了好些，皆是凉菜多，热菜少。走堂的先摆上酒杯、小菜，果碟倒也精致。送上陈绍、木瓜、百花、惠泉四壶酒来，放下一搭","en":"vulgar it was unbearable—and the other was a bizarre, eccentric painting of Scholar Zhang visiting the temple. Wenze and the others shared another laugh. The manager bustled about for a moment, personally pouring them several cups of tea before retreating, replaced by a waiter who came in to take their orders. Wang Xun said, \\"Their stir-fried shark fin and roast duck"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":3,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"文泽问起子玉，还是前月初七日送行时见他。仲清道：「庾香以后大约未必肯出门的了，我们去看过他几次，他又病了几天，俨然去年夏天的模样。他这个元神，此时正跟着玉侬在长江里守风，只怕要送他到了南昌，才肯回来呢。」琪官听了，眉颦起来，神情之间，颇有感慨，说道：「初","en":"Wenze asked after Ziyu, noting he hadn't seen him since they saw him off on the seventh of the previous month. Zhongqing sighed, \\"Since Yuxiang left, it's unlikely he's willing to step out of the house. We've visited him a few times, and he's fallen ill again"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":1,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"桂保道：「好，说得剪截。」文泽道：「旧管是个圭字，新收一个木字，是桂字。开除了土字，实在是杜字。」王恂道：「旧管是个寺字，新收一个言字，是诗字。开除了土字，实在是讨字。」桂保道：「这个比从前的田字讲得好了。我说旧管是个一字，新收一个史字，是吏字。开除了口字，实在是丈字。」","en":"Guibao praised him, \\"Excellent, very neat and sharp.\\" Wenze followed, \\"The 'Old Stock' is gui (圭, jade tablet). The 'New Intake' is 'wood' (木), forming gui (桂, osmanthus). 'Remove' 'earth' (土), and the 'Actual Remainder' is du (杜).\\" Wang Xun said, \\"The 'Old Stock' is 'temple' (寺). The 'New Intake' is 'speech'"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":2,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"字，是个阊字。开除了曰字，实在是间字。」仲清道：「我旧管是贱字，新收三点水，是溅字。开除了贝字，实在是浅字。」文泽道：「我旧管是波字，新收一个女字，是婆字。开除了波字，实在是女字。」春喜道：「怎么说？闹错了。旧管是波字。怎么开除也是波字？新收是女字，怎么实在又是女字？内中少了运化。」桂保道：「这要罚的。」文泽笑道：「我说错了，我是想得好好儿的。」便说道：「开除是","en":"three water drops (氵), forming 'splash' (溅). 'Remove' 'shell' (贝), and the 'Actual Remainder' is 'shallow' (浅).\\" Wenze said, \\"My 'Old Stock' is 'wave' (波). The 'New Intake' is 'woman' (女), forming 'old woman' (婆). 'Remove' 'wave' (波), and the 'Actual Remainder' is 'woman' (女).\\" Chunxi immediately caught the error, \\"Wait, what are you saying? You've botched it! The 'Old"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":4,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"文泽笑道：「正是汝字。」桂保道：「太不自然，要罚一杯。」文泽笑道：「不与你们来了。」饮了一杯，王恂道：「旧管是眇字，新收三点水，是渺字，开除了目字，实在是沙字。」桂保道：「旧管是士字，新收了口字，是吉字。开除了一字，实在是个古字。」文泽道：「这张口可惜生","en":"Wenze laughed, \\"Indeed, it is ru.\\" Guibao judged, \\"Too unnatural and forced; you must drink a penalty cup.\\" Wenze, still laughing, conceded, \\"I'm not playing with you all anymore,\\" and drank his cup. Wang Xun took his turn: \\"The 'Old Stock' is 'blind' (眇)."},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":3,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"元，另娶韩丞相之女为妻，一旦把奴休了，是令人气愤不过等。」把他头一段口白分作三段，这就通身文气都接了。」仲清、文泽、王恂道：「这都改得好，但如今讲究唱昆腔的也不少，怎么就不晓得这些毛病呢？」春喜道：「唱清曲的人，原不用口白，他来改正他做什么？唱戏曲的课师，教曲时总是先教曲文，后将口白接写一篇，挤在一处，没有分开段落，所以沿袭下来，总是这样。」众人正在谈得高兴，只","en":"speech into three separate sections, the emotional current runs smoothly through the entire scene.\\" Zhongqing, Wenze, and Wang Xun praised him, \\"Those revisions are brilliant! But since there are so many who study Kunqu deeply these days, how is it they don't recognize these flaws?\\" Chunxi sighed, \\"Those who sing 'pure songs' (qingqu) don't use spoken text anyway,"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":1,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"文泽道：「那倒不消，我们闻了那气味就要醉的。」唐和尚道：「如今田老爷是贵人了，他搬出后，我也没有见着他。好容易一年之内，中举、中进士、中状元，这是天上文曲星，人间岂常有的？不是我说，也幸遇见了那位苏相公，倒被他管好了。未见那苏相公以前，田老爷又不是如今的","en":"Wenze joked, \\"That won't be necessary; we only need to catch a whiff of the atmosphere in there and we'd be intoxicated.\\" Monk Tang chuckled, \\"Now that Master Tian has become a nobleman, I haven't even caught a glimpse of him since he moved out. To pass the"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":2,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"唐和尚道：「我听得说，这位苏相公如今也出了班子，田老太太认他为义子，宅里都称他为二老爷，是真的么？」文泽道：「没有的话。苏相公也没有住在那里，他们下人称呼他为苏大爷是真的。」唐和尚道：「这苏相公本来好，斯斯文文，和和气气，见了我们也是待得一样，必恭必敬，不当我们是个和尚，少了头发看待。不像那个什么琴相公，在华府里的，见人板着脸，一点笑容也没有。」王恂道","en":"recognized him as her adopted son, and everyone in the household now addresses him as 'Second Master'. Is it true?\\" Wenze dismissed it, \\"Nonsense. Master Su doesn't even live there. The servants calling him 'Master Su' is true enough, though.\\" Tang sighed appreciatively, \\"This Master Su has always been a fine person—so refined, so gentle, so amiable. He treats us monks"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":2,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"肉，自己咬下了两块。人都说他为嫖割股，你们说这个自行伤可笑不可笑？」于是大家大笑，道：「那潘三本不是个东西。」文泽道：「我知道你与奚十一相好。」唐和尚道：「这奚大老爷闹得很，今年生了毒疮，几乎性命不保，还是我医好他的。如今他也要到班了，七月内有缺就是他的。我想人生聚散是一定的。去年有位富三老爷，是魏大爷相好，魏大爷托我照应，才选了湖北。有个贵大爷，是富三爷的相好","en":"ridiculous?\\" The whole room roared with laughter, agreeing, \\"That Pan the Third was never any good to begin with.\\" Wenze said, \\"I know you are close friends with Xi Eleven.\\" Monk Tang nodded solemnly, \\"That Elder Master Xi has had a terrible time of it. This year he broke out in poisonous sores and very nearly lost his life! It was I who finally cured him. Now, his time"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":3,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"再不弹的了。你说这也算深于情了。」仲清道：「吉甫的人本沈静高雅，于这些文玩无上无不精通。」大家谈论，日已西沉，文泽等也要散了，王恂叫走堂的报账，文泽又抢作东，两人争执，谦让一回。唐和尚对着走堂的把嘴扭了一扭，走堂的出去交代了柜上，进来说道：「这帐两位少爷不用争会，唐大爷已会过了。」文泽道：「这怎么说？」王恂道：「断无此理。」唐和尚笑道：「些须敬意，三位少爷肯赏脸","en":"art or scholarly pursuit that he has not mastered.\\" As they conversed, the sun began to sink in the west, and Wenze and the others prepared to depart. Wang Xun called the waiter to settle the bill, but Wenze fiercely insisted on playing the host, and the two playfully argued back and forth, each yielding to the other. Monk Tang subtly twisted his mouth in a signal"}],"52":[{"paragraph":3,"mentions":1,"tokens":["刘文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"戏，演得是联珠班。春航陪着一班名士在花园挹爽斋观演联锦班。那一天大媒是徐子云，客是萧次贤、高品、南湘、颜仲清、刘文泽、王恂、梅子玉。近日子玉病已好了，勉强打起精神出来。这八个名旦不消说都在园中，那聚星堂上一个也不去，尽是一班中年的脚色，与那些寻常的旦脚，在那里应酬。","en":"principal matchmaker that day was Xu Ziyun, and the guests included Xiao Cixian, Gao Pin, Nanxiang, Yan Zhongqing, Liu Wenze, Wang Xun, and Mei Ziyu. Ziyu had only recently recovered from his illness, forcing himself to rally his spirits to attend. Naturally, all eight famous dan actors remained in the garden; not a single one went to the Gathering Stars Hall, which was left"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":2,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"王文辉要推华公子首坐，华公子不肯。子云意欲邀他进园，与诸名士会会，华公子也不愿在外，便同了子云进园，文泽等齐齐站起，华公子上前见礼。除文泽之外，都不认识，内中见一个最年轻的，觉得如月光珠彩，凤举霞轩，骨重神清，风华雅丽，心里一惊，觉眼中从未见过这样人。子玉见华公子的品貌，也暗暗称赞：「清华贵重，仪表天然，果是不凡。」华公子一一见了，问明了子云。华公子道","en":"meet the gathered scholars; preferring not to remain in the outer hall, Young Master Hua gladly accompanied him. Wenze and the others rose in unison. Aside from Wenze, Young Master Hua knew none of them. Yet among the group, his eyes fell upon the youngest—a youth possessing a moon-bright radiance and a phoenix-like poise, his spirit clear and his elegance transcending"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":1,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"华公子又与高品、南湘、仲清、王恂、文泽、次贤各讲了些话，知高品才从苏州来，问了些江苏风景。偶然见素兰的扇子一面画的甚细，要了过来，看了一会。又见那一面写着小楷，题目是《断肠词》。华公子道：「肠何可以轻断？」子玉见了，又觉不安。华公子低低吟了一遍，又问素兰道：「这是你自己的么？」素兰道：「","en":"Young Master Hua then conversed with Gao Pin, Nanxiang, Zhongqing, Wang Xun, Wenze, and Cixian. Learning that Gao Pin had just arrived from Suzhou, he asked about the landscapes of Jiangsu. By chance, he noticed Sulan holding a fan with exceedingly delicate painting on one side and asked to look at it. Turning it over, he saw neat,"}],"54":[{"paragraph":4,"mentions":1,"tokens":["刘文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"初九日派了几位阅卷大臣，苏候又做了总裁，华公子派了搜捡官，徐子云派了收卷官，刘文泽派了弥封官，张仲雨派了巡逻官。初十日一早入场，首试题目是《拟汉诏》、《拟唐疏》、《五经条解》、《五代南北朝年号考》、《治河策》、《问酌六科则例》《增损盐法利弊》、《正本清源论》八题。二试是《大礼赋》、《大乐赋》、《大搜赋》。三试《拟杜少陵北征诗》、《","en":"were assigned: Su the Marquis again chief examiner, Young Master Hua inspection officer, Ziyun receiving officer, Wenze sealing officer, and Zhang Zhongyu patrol officer. On the morning of the tenth they entered the hall. First session had eight questions: *Draft Han Edict*, *Draft Tang Memorial*, *Exegesis of the Five Classics*, *Examination of Era Names from Five Dynasties"}],"57":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["刘文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"绮香，生得婉娴柔静，贤淑无双，又且绣口锦心，才能咏絮。于十月初十日，请了华公子的夫人苏浣香、田春航的夫人浣兰、刘文泽的夫人吴紫烟、颜仲清的夫人王蓉华、梅子玉的夫人琼华、王恂的夫人孙佩秋。此时园中菊花开满，五色斑烂。是日晴光和蔼，风不扬尘，小毛衣服都用不着，绵的尽够了。袁绮香一早带了十二红婢，还有几个家人媳妇，先到园里候客。那日次贤、高品、南湘皆回避了。那十二红都是","en":"the tenth day of the tenth month, she invited Hua Gongzi's wife, Su Huanxiang; Tian Chunhang's wife, Huanlan; Liu Wenze's wife, Wu Ziyan; Yan Zhongqing's wife, Wang Ronghua; Mei Ziyu's wife, Qionghua; and Wang Xun's wife, Sun Peiqiu. By this time, the garden's chrysanthemums were in full bloom, a brilliant tapestry of five colors. The day's sunlight was gentle, the wind"},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":1,"tokens":["刘文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"到巳初一刻，刘文泽的夫人吴紫烟先到，车进了园门，即换肩舆，抬到宝香堂前下轿，珠围翠绕的，带了四个丫鬟。绮香迎接上堂，彼此见了礼。绮香笑道：「今日算你早，我是辰刻过来的。」紫烟道：「我今天卯正就起来，昨日姐姐说要辰正毕集的。已经到巳初了，谁知这些姐姐们还没有一个来。」","en":"At the first quarter of the si hour, Liu Wenze's wife, Wu Ziyan, arrived first. Her carriage entered the garden gate, and she immediately transferred to a shoulder-sedan, which carried her directly to the Hall of Treasured Fragrance. Resplendent in pearls and kingfisher ornaments, she was accompanied"}],"60":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["刘文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"年已过，又到元宵，六街三市，火树银花，好不热闹。子云于十三日请了华公子、田春航、梅子玉、史南湘、高品、颜仲清、刘文泽、王恂、萧次贤、金粟、屈勤先，并九香园诸人，作一大会。琴仙见了华公子，尚有些不安，华公子也不问起前事，以礼相待。此时琴仙已出了旦党，入了士党，但从前作旦时傲睨一切，此刻倒谦谦自守起来，因此上下诸人更加尊重他，绝没有一个人笑他。琴仙对了那些名旦，还是从","en":"hosted a grand gathering for Young Master Hua, Tian Chunhang, Mei Ziyu, Shi Nanxiang, Gao Pin, Yan Zhongqing, Liu Wenze, Wang Xun, Xiao Cixian, Jin Su, Qu Qinxian, and the entire company of Nine-Fragrance Garden. Seeing Young Master Hua, Qinxian still felt a trace of unease, yet Hua asked nothing of past affairs, treating him with utmost courtesy. By now, Qinxian had"},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":1,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"呢？」仲清道：「自然单画人，一并的画去，后就缀小传一篇。刻石之后，可以拓出来，或裱册页，或裱手卷，皆可传世。」文泽道：「做两块好，就镶嵌在东西两楹。」王恂道：「若画杜仙女，就画他在采莲船上的样子。」吉甫道：「玉侬梦见那面镜子，必非无因。我画条龙执着这面镜子，就做头幅，好不好？」大家说道：「好。」子玉道：「这云龙人必猜有个寓意在里头呢。」子云道：「这十一篇传赞，各","en":"stone, rubbings can be made and mounted as album leaves or handscrolls to be passed down through generations.\\" Wenze suggested, \\"It would be best to make two stone panels, inset into the eastern and western pillars.\\" Wang Xun added, \\"If painting Fairy Du, paint her as she appeared on the lotus-picking boat.\\" Jifu said, \\"Yunong's dream of that mirror cannot be without"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":1,"tokens":["文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"也奇怪，想必文字有灵，前生缘法，子云拈了道翁，子玉拈了杜仙女、琴仙，金粟拈了宝珠，春航拈了蕙芳，仲清拈了琪官，文泽拈了春喜，南湘拈了兰保，王恂拈了桂保，高品拈了玉林，次贤拈了漱芳，单拈不着素兰，只好送与华公子去作了。众人分派已定，子玉说道：「做传容易，画画难，还要刻石，更须时日，不知几天可以告成？」吉甫道：「不消多日，碑是磨现成的，一面画，一面就叫季十矮子找人刻","en":"drew Daoweng; Ziyu drew Fairy Du and Qinxian; Jin Su drew Baozhu; Chunhang drew Huifang; Zhongqing drew Qiguan; Wenze drew Chunxi; Nanxiang drew Lanbao; Wang Xun drew Guibao; Gao Pin drew Yulin; and Cixian drew Shufang. Sulan alone was not drawn, so that assignment was sent to Young Master Hua. The tasks distributed, Ziyu said, \\"Writing biographies is easy, but painting"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":1,"tokens":["刘文泽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"个狗小子，也只配做剃头的。」琴仙又看第九方，画一株梅花，有一只喜鹊，梅花下有一个仙女，题曰：报春花史林仙。看有刘文泽一首小赋：","en":"maiden standing beneath. The title read: \\"Baochun Flower Historian, Immortal Lin.\\" Below it was a short rhapsody by Liu Wenze:"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":1,"tokens":["前舟"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"抒写，对玉貌而傍徨。\\n琴仙道：「好赋。正是松风竹雨，仙露明珠，将你那清腴娟秀，都一齐刻画出来。」春喜道：「这是前舟在那里认真做赋，忘了题目了。」琴仙道：「却也是你的光景。」再看第十方，是一个桂树下有个仙女，姿致风流，青眸善盼，题曰：","en":"immortal dew and bright pearls, perfectly capturing your lean elegance and delicate beauty.\\" Chunxi replied, \\"This is Qianzhou taking his rhapsody too seriously and forgetting the subject entirely.\\" Qinxian noted, \\"Yet it captures your essence perfectly.\\" He then looked at the tenth panel, showing a fairy maiden standing beneath a cassia tree, exuding a romantic grace with a"}]}`),"char-10":JSON.parse(`{"1":[{"paragraph":46,"mentions":1,"tokens":["高品"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"然后同王恂到了书房，问起仲清，为高品、南湘请去。子玉说起前日所见南湘的《花选》过于失实，王恂道：「竹君的《花选》，据实而言，尚恐说不到，何以为失实？现在那些宝贝得了这番品题，又长了些声价，你也应该见过这些人。」子玉听了，知王恂也有旦癖，又是个好为附会的人，便不说了。","en":"Afterward, he accompanied Wang Xun to the study and asked after Zhongqing, learning that he had been invited out by Gao Pin and Nanxiang. Ziyu mentioned that the \\"Selection of Flowers\\" he had seen Nanxiang carrying the other day was excessively exaggerated. Wang Xun replied, \\"As for Zhujun's 'Selection of Flowers,' practically speaking, one should rather fear it falls short;"}],"2":[{"paragraph":26,"mentions":2,"tokens":["高品"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"年纪倒有二十六岁，《五经》还不曾念完，文理实在欠通，却又酷好掉文，满口之乎者也，腐气可掏。有个苏州拔贡生高品，与他相熟，送他两个诨名：一个是「虫蛀千字文」。又因他那个红鼻子，有时擦得放光透亮，又叫做「起阳狗肾」。乃弟嗣元，生得枭唇露齿，又是个吊眼皮，右边一只眼睛高高吊起，像是朱笔圈了半圈。文理与乃兄不相上下，却喜批评乃兄的不通。又犯了口吃的毛病，有时议论起","en":"obscure terminology, peppering his speech with archaic particles in a manner that reeked of pedantry. A certain Gao Pin, a senior licentiate from Suzhou well-acquainted with him, had bestowed upon him two derogatory monikers: one was \\"Worm-Eaten Thousand Character Classic.\\" Because of his inflamed nose, which sometimes shone with a greasy luster, he was also dubbed \\"The"}],"6":[{"paragraph":23,"mentions":3,"tokens":["高品","卓然"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"了一番。只见对面楼上来了几个，先是右待郎的少君刘文泽做主，请了史给事的少君史南湘、吴阁学的外甥张仲雨、姑苏名士高品、国子监司业沈公之子沈伯才、天津镇守海口巴总兵之子巴霖，这两位就是孙氏弟兄的妻舅。还有一个本京人，原任江苏知县之子冯子佩，尚未到来。这一班人，子玉除了南湘、文泽之外，恰不认识。这刘文泽字前舟，系中州世家，已得了二品荫生。这人最是和气，性情阔大，蔼然可","en":"included Shi Nanxiang, son of Censor Shi; Zhang Zhongyu, nephew of Grand Academician Wu; the renowned Suzhou scholar Gao Pin; Shen Bocai, son of Imperial College Director Shen; and Ba Lin, son of Regional Commander Ba, the coastal defender of Tianjin. The latter two were brothers-in-law to the Sun brothers. A native of the capital, Feng Zipei, son of the former Jiangsu county"},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":1,"tokens":["高品"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，这就是你不该。你既然有三位尊客，就不应请那两个恶客，教人食不下咽，不过看着裙带上的情分罢了。」说得众人大笑。高品道：「最好，最好，我们今日就并在一处，为什么食不下咽？有了「虫蛀千字文」，「叠韵双声谱」，还胜如《汉书》下酒呢。」史南湘道：「怕什么？搬过来，搬过来！正席上有许多老前辈在那里，巴老三想必也不动手的。」王恂只得叫将那边两桌，就搬过这边，一同坐下，南湘道","en":"lose his appetite. It is only out of respect for family ties that I endure them.\\" The room erupted in laughter. Gao Pin added, \\"Excellent! Excellent! Let us all sit together today—why should anyone lose their appetite? With the 'Worm-Eaten Thousand Character Classic' and the 'Rhyme-and-Alliteration Compendium' among us, it beats using the History of the Former Han as"},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":3,"tokens":["高品"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"孙少爷到。」嗣徽昆仲先到正席上见了礼，然后上楼，众人都笑面相迎。嗣徽举眼一望，见了许多人，便作了一个公揖。见了高品、沈伯才，心中甚是吃惊，暗道：「偏偏今日运气不佳，遇见了这两个冤家。」嗣元见了巴霖，也觉心跳，也与众人见了礼，巴霖勉勉强强，作了半个揖。楼上分了四桌。刘文泽道：「都是相好，也不必推让，随意坐最好」。大家都要远着孙氏弟兄，便乱坐起来。刘文泽、沈伯才、巴","en":"forced smiles from the crowd. Sweeping his gaze across the room, Sihui offered a general bow. Catching sight of Gao Pin and Shen Bocai, alarm gripped his heart; he thought, \\"What wretched luck today—running into these two arch-enemies.\\" Siyuan, spotting Ba Lin, felt his stomach drop; he paid his respects, to which Ba Lin responded with a begrudging half-bow. The upper"},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":4,"tokens":["高品"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"高品对着沈伯才笑道：「天下又红又光的，是什么东西，不准说好的，要说顶脏的东西。」伯才已明白是说嗣徽的鼻子，便笑道：「你且说一个样子来。」高品道：「我说：红而光，腊尽春回狗起阳。」众人忍不住一笑。嗣徽明白，瞪了高品一眼，道：「恶用是硎硎者为哉？鸡鸣狗吠相闻","en":"With a sly grin, Gao Pin turned to Shen Bocai, \\"In all the world, what thing is both red and shiny? You cannot offer an elegant answer—only the most vulgar thing you can imagine.\\" Bocai instantly understood the allusion to Sihui's nose and smiled, \\"Give me an example first.\\""},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":3,"tokens":["高品"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"句：红红红红而光，一一一一团火球飞上床。」众人笑得难忍，将要高声笑起来。颜仲清道：「这一烧真烧得个红而光了。」高品道：「这一烧倒烧成了孙老二的三字经。」众人不解其说，高品道：「那救火的时候，自然说来、来、来！快、快、快！救、救、救！搬什物的抢、抢、抢！逃命的跑、跑、跑！风是呼、呼、呼！火是烘、烘、烘！烧着东西，爆起来哔、哔、哔！剥、剥、剥！人声嘈杂，嘻、嘻、嘻！","en":"nearly shouting in amusement. Yan Zhongqing said, \\"With a fire like that, it truly becomes entirely red and shiny.\\" Gao Pin added, \\"That fire has inspired Old Second Sun's Three-Character Classic.\\" When the others looked puzzled, Gao Pin explained, \\"During a fire, people naturally yell: 'Come, come, come! Quick, quick, quick! Save it, save it, save it! Grab the valuables—grab,"},{"paragraph":37,"mentions":1,"tokens":["卓然"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"文泽对子玉道：「初九日弟备小酌，屈吾兄一叙，作个清谈雅集。人不多，就是竹君、剑潭、庸庵、卓然几位，吾兄断不可推辞。」子玉应允，又谢了。王恂、聘才、元茂也同道了谢，一径先回。那些人又谈了一会，也各散去。不知后事如何，且听下回分解。","en":"a visit—a refined discourse and elegant assembly. It will be an intimate group: just Zhujun, Jiantan, Yong'an, Zhuoran, and a few others. Elder Brother must absolutely not decline.\\" Ziyu agreed, expressing his deep gratitude. Wang Xun, Pincai, and Yuanmao offered their thanks in turn before departing. The remaining guests lingered in conversation for a while longer before"}],"7":[{"paragraph":6,"mentions":4,"tokens":["高品"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"且说文泽所请的容颜仲清、王恂、史南湘已经到了，随后梅子玉、高品一同到门。家人引着走过大厅，到了花厅之旁垂花门进去，系石子砌成的一条甬道，两边都是太湖石迭成高高低低的假山，衬着参参差差的寒树。远远望去，却也有台有亭，布置得十分幽雅。转了两三个弯，过了一座石桥，甬路旁是一色的，都是绿竹，绕着一带红阑，迎面便是五间卷","en":"invited guests—Yan Zhongqing, Wang Xun, and Shi Nanxiang—had already arrived, followed shortly by Mei Ziyu and Gao Pin at the gate. A servant guided them past the main hall, through a flowered gate beside the reception hall, and onto a pebble-paved path. On either side, irregular artificial hills of Lake Tai rocks were artfully arranged, interspersed with sparse, graceful"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":9,"tokens":["高品"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「今日我们可为软红尘中，一时雅集。」仲清坐在高品肩下，高品即凑着仲清耳边轻轻的说了一句，仲清哑然失笑。众人问仲清道：「他说什么？」仲清向高品道：「我说罢。」高品摇了摇头。仲清道：「那第七字对得尤妙。」说着两人相视而笑。南湘最是性急，便道：「你们说了，我情愿吃一杯。」高品道：「喝十杯再说。」文泽晓得","en":"the red dust of the world, we can enjoy a fleeting moment of refined assembly.\\" Zhongqing was seated just below Gao Pin. Gao Pin leaned close to Zhongqing's ear and whispered something, causing Zhongqing to break into a silent laugh. The others asked Zhongqing, \\"What did he say?\\" Zhongqing turned to Gao Pin, \\"Shall I tell them?\\" Gao Pin shook his head. Zhongqing said,"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":7,"tokens":["高品"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，真对得工稳。」文泽道：「卓兄，我出一对你对，却不许思索。如对得好，我吃三杯。对不出，罚十杯。不好，罚五杯。」高品道：「从来说出对容易，对对难。对不出三杯，对不好一杯，如何？」南湘道：「也要看上对出得难不难，你且说来。」文泽向子玉道：「要借重大名，就是「子玉人如玉」。」仲清道：「这倒不容易呢。」一语未了，高品道：「我已对着了，你喝三杯。」文泽道：「你说。」南湘道","en":"cannot pause to think. If it's good, I'll drink three cups; if you fail, you drink ten; if it's mediocre, five.\\" Gao Pin negotiated, \\"It's always easy to set a line, but hard to match it. How about three cups if I fail, and one if it's mediocre?\\" Nanxiang added, \\"It depends on how difficult the line is. Let's hear it.\\" Wenze turned to Ziyu, \\"I must borrow your esteemed"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":9,"tokens":["高品"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"文泽道「双」字，仲清对「孤」字，高品对「八」，字子玉对「九」字，王恂道：「不好了，顺着数儿就是十罢。」南湘道：「是了，我这个字倒有些难下，也罢，对「三」字罢。」文泽道「辇」宇。南湘道：「我晓得一定是这句诗。」子玉抢对了一个「琴」字，王恂对了「车」字，南湘对了「船」字，只有高品未对。文泽","en":"Wenze presented '双' (Double/Pair): Zhongqing matched '孤' (Solitary), Gao Pin matched '八' (Eight), Ziyu matched '九' (Nine), and Wang Xun lamented, \\"Oh no, I suppose I must follow the sequence with '十' (Ten).\\" Nanxiang pondered, \\"That's right, my character is a bit tricky to place. Very well, I'll match '三' (Three).\\" Finally, Wenze"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":2,"tokens":["高品"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"不然总要罚十杯酒的。」再看王恂对的是「十乌日里驭车回」。王恂道：「我的对坏了。」文泽道：「就是十乌二字不连。」高品道：「前舟又错了，日中有乌，尧时十日并出，难道不是十乌么？」文泽道：「这却强词夺理，到底勉强些。」于是公论推子玉第一、南湘第二、仲清第三、王恂第四、高品居末，就依名次轮作考官。","en":"(十乌日里驭车回)' Wang Xun admitted, \\"My match is ruined.\\" Wenze noted, \\"It's just that the 'ten ravens' don't connect.\\" Gao Pin argued, \\"Qianzhou, you are in the wrong again. The sun contains the golden raven; in Emperor Yao's time, ten suns appeared at once. Are those not ten ravens?\\" Wenze countered, \\"That's a bit of a stretch, quite a forced argument.\\" The group's consensus"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":3,"tokens":["卓然","高品"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"文泽道：「还有卓然的罚酒未饮，刚才到底说什么，笑得这样。如果实在说得好，免罚何妨。」南湘道：「若说了，非但不能免罚，还要倍罚。」文泽道：「莫非又是糟蹋我么？」仲清道：「然也。」文泽道：「只要糟蹋得有理，罚酒也可以少减。」高品道：「想来五杯是不能免的。若要再加，万万来不","en":"Wenze reminded, \\"Zhuoran still hasn't drunk his penalty wine. What on earth did he say to make you laugh like that? If it's truly clever, we might waive the fine.\\" Nanxiang replied, \\"If he tells you, not only will the fine stand, it will be doubled.\\" Wenze narrowed his eyes,"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":11,"tokens":["卓然","高品"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"文泽道：「卓然将来死了，定坐拔舌地狱。」小厮斟了酒。高品道：「五杯一口气喝，定要醉倒。还是与各人豁一拳，或者可以希冀。」随顺手一个个豁完，却也有输有赢。各饮毕，子玉作令官，一个个出了四字，是「费影收肠」。南湘对的是「惊声放胆」，王恂是「融香浣乳」，文泽是「翻么小舌","en":"Wenze said, \\"Zhuoran, when you die, you are certainly destined for the Hell of Pulled-Out Tongues.\\" A servant poured the wine. Gao Pin negotiated, \\"Drinking five cups in one breath will surely leave me drunk. Perhaps if I play finger-guessing games with everyone, there's"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":2,"tokens":["高品"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"高品道：「我的「鸟」与「雀」总是一样，你的「鸟」字若换了「雀」字不好么？」文泽想了一想，却也有理。子玉就只取了仲清、王恂两副对句，其余文泽、高品罚了酒。","en":"Gao Pin argued, \\"My '鸟' (bird) and your '雀' (sparrow) are essentially identical. If your 'niao' were changed to 'que,' wouldn't that also be an improvement?\\" Wenze considered this and conceded the point. Ultimately, Ziyu accepted only Zhongqing's and Wang Xun's"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":4,"tokens":["高品"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"以下轮着南湘出令，出了一个「春」字，文泽对「夏」字，高品对「正」字。王恂道：「平对平使得么？」众人道：「使得，已经对过了。」王恂道「晨」字，仲清是「秋」字，子玉是「冬」字。南湘又出「月」字。高品道：「竹君的心思与众不同，这两字必定不连的，我对「阳」字。」王恂对「霜」，子玉对「雪」，仲清对「空」。文泽道：「","en":"turn passed to Nanxiang to set the game. He presented the character '春' (spring): Wenze matched '夏' (summer), and Gao Pin matched '正' (upright/primary). Wang Xun questioned, \\"Can a level-tone character be matched with another level-tone?\\" The group agreed, \\"Certainly—it has been done before.\\" Wang Xun matched '晨' (morning/dawn), Zhongqing matched '秋' (autumn), and Ziyu"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":1,"tokens":["高品"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「我「乌」字。」高品道：「我就是「龟」字。」文泽道：","en":"\\"'乌' (raven).\\" Gao Pin countered, \\"I match '龟' (tortoise).\\" Wenze replied:"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":2,"tokens":["高品","卓然"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「原来如此，失敬，失敬。」众人哗然大笑。南湘道：「这是你自画供招，以后尊名竟改作高龟何如？」高品自知失口，缩不转来，便道：「这两字杜撰，不如转赠吾兄。史龟二字，本是古人名，最典雅的。」文泽道：「你听卓然这张嘴，自己落了便宜，又移到别人身上去了。」大家笑了一回，静听南湘出对。","en":"shouldn't we change your honorable name to Gao Gui (High Tortoise)?\\" Realizing his slip and unable to retract it, Gao Pin deflected, \\"These two characters are somewhat contrived—better to bestow them upon our elder brother instead. The two characters 'Shi Gui' actually form an ancient personal name, most refined and classical.\\" Wenze noted, \\"Listen to Zhuoran's silver tongue—caught"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":2,"tokens":["卓然","高品"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"不若剑潭的「秋空一盘鹰」浑脱，还该让他第一。庾香的「冬雪一敲驴」，庸庵的「晨霜一丰貂」，都对得很工。最不好的是卓然的「正阳一伏龟」，这「正阳」二字如何加得上？」高品笑问文泽道：「贵处是那里？」","en":"donkey (冬雪一敲驴)' and Yong'an's 'Morning frost one-lush sable (晨霜一丰貂)' are both skillfully matched. The worst is Zhuoran's 'Upright-sun one-prostrate tortoise. (正阳一伏龟)' How can 'upright sun' (zheng yang) possibly apply to a tortoise?\\" Gao Pin laughed and asked Wenze, \\"Where exactly is your esteemed place of origin?\\""},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":1,"tokens":["高品"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"文泽道：「你这狗头，实在恨不死人，你还想翻供么？」大家想想高品的话，又笑得了不得。原来文泽正是河南正阳县人，刚刚合着这句对，你道巧不巧。文泽又灌了他一大杯酒，方出了气。","en":"make a man want to die of frustration—are you trying to retract your confession?\\" When the group realized what Gao Pin meant, they laughed uncontrollably. It turned out Wenze was a native of Zhengyang County in Henan—perfectly aligning with Gao Pin's line. Was it not an extraordinary coincidence? Wenze poured him another large cup of wine to vent his indignation."},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":1,"tokens":["高品"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"以下仲清做令官，一个个字出的对是「丝发白日如新」六字，高品属的是「签毛朱天入长」。子玉对的是「镜颜华年对好。」南湘是「竹唇朱声吹慢。」王恂是「剪衣乌时试拂」。文泽是「草麻黄朝起视」。仲清写出上联是「白发如丝日日新」。","en":"served as game-master, presenting six characters for everyone to match: '丝发白日如新' (silk, hair, white, day, as, new). Gao Pin assembled: '签毛朱天入长' (signature, feather, vermilion, sky, enter, long). Ziyu matched: '镜颜华年对好' (mirror, complexion, glorious, year, face, good). Nanxiang matched: '竹唇朱声吹慢' (bamboo, lip, crimson, sound, blow, slow). Wang Xun matched: '剪衣乌时试拂' (scissors,"},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":3,"tokens":["高品","卓然"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"底不及庾香的稳当，而且句子大方，不落纤巧，诸公以为然否？」几句话说得众人很服。南湘向来不肯让人，此时亦甚首肯。高品道：「然则我以「天」对「日」，比庾香的更好，为什么又不取我的呢？」仲清道：「等我写出来，你讲给我听。」先写王恂的是「乌衣试剪时时拂」。众人道：「这句也自然得很。」仲清道：「这回考试，除了卓然，原是一榜尽赐及第的。」高品笑道：「留心眼睛，我这本卷子是打","en":"cleverness. Do you gentlemen agree?\\" These words convinced everyone. Nanxiang, who rarely conceded, nodded in agreement. Gao Pin interjected, \\"But my use of 'sky' to match 'day' is even better than Yuxiang's—why was my submission ignored?\\" Zhongqing replied, \\"Write it out and explain it.\\" He first wrote Wang Xun's: 'Raven-black robes, newly cut and tried on, brushed smooth time"},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":2,"tokens":["高品"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"只说够他对的就是了。」文泽问道：「在什么书上？」仲清道：「《史氏外编》。」王恂、文泽才明白过来，复又笑声大作。高品道：「你们混说乱道，难道《四子书》都记不得？这就是《孟子》所说一毛不拔、追豚入笠之扬朱，所以谓之「朱毛入笠」。这才算得用古入化呢。」仲清道：「那「天天长」三字怎讲？」高品道：「你这试官真是胡涂，他既是一毛不拔，自然天天长了。」众人听了，这一阵笑，若不","en":"\\"Outer Compilation of Mr. Shi.\\" Wang Xun and Wenze finally understood, breaking into fresh peals of laughter. Gao Pin retorted, \\"You're all spouting nonsense—haven't you memorized *The Four Books*? This comes directly from Mencius's description of Yang Zhu—'who would not pull out a single hair'—chasing a young pig into a sedge-hat. Hence, 'vermilion feathers entering"},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":1,"tokens":["高品"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"然后王恂作令官，出的是「香尽南人消国美。」文泽对的是」曲多东妓谱山名」。仲清对的是「赋难东士炼都学」。高品对的是「斗长西圣驾方齐」。","en":"mountain-names. (曲多东妓谱山名)' Zhongqing matched: 'Rhapsody difficulty, Eastern scholars, refined, capital learning. (赋难东士炼都学)' Gao Pin matched: 'Combat long, Western sages, conveyed, region, equal-level. (斗长西圣驾方齐)'"},{"paragraph":30,"mentions":1,"tokens":["高品"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"众人留心高品对的，一个个都是平正通达的字。文泽道：","en":"The group scrutinized Gao Pin's match, finding each character level, regular, and coherent. Wenze noted:"},{"paragraph":31,"mentions":2,"tokens":["卓然","高品"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「此番卓然大概要取第一了，字字对得很稳。」子玉对的是「情深西旦感昆名」。南湘的是」图多西士画名园」。一一对毕，王恂写出出句，是「香销南国美人尽」。文泽对的是「曲谱东山名妓多。」仲清是「赋炼东都学士难」。高品是「斗驾西方齐圣长」。子玉是「情感西昆名旦深」。南湘是","en":"\\"This time, Zhuoran is likely taking first place—every character matches with immense stability.\\" Ziyu matched: 'Deep feeling, Western dan-performer, moves Kun, fame.' Nanxiang matched: 'Many paintings, Western scholars, paint famous gardens.' As they finished, Wang Xun"},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":3,"tokens":["高品"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"高品道：「我没有见过主考阅文要请教士子。典故却有，若告诉了你，只说我通关节中的了。」仲清道：「他这典故，出在东土大唐。」高品道：「剑潭是主考至亲，倒应回避，不许乱说。」原来王恂却没有看过《西游记》，只管呆呆的看着粉板。南湘正在喝酒，忽见高品用手搭着凉篷。","en":"Gao Pin replied, \\"I've never heard of a chief examiner asking candidates to explain their allusions. There is indeed an allusion, but if I reveal it, you'll accuse me of manipulating the exam.\\" Zhongqing interjected, \\"His allusion stems from the Eastern Land"},{"paragraph":34,"mentions":2,"tokens":["高品"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"主人要罚高品的酒，高品再三央求，喝了一杯。","en":"The host moved to fine Gao Pin more wine; Gao Pin pleaded earnestly and ultimately drank only a single cup."},{"paragraph":35,"mentions":4,"tokens":["高品"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"末了是高品出令。高品一口气说了六个字，是「千里言召禾口」。仲清想道：「通共只有七个字，他一说就是六个，难道不怕人想着么？必是用拆字法来混人」。便道：「你这六个字可是「重诏和」三字么？若不说明。我们就罢考了。」高品被他猜着，只得笑嘻嘻的点点头。子玉对了「卓言贯」","en":"Finally, it was Gao Pin's turn to lead. He rattled off six characters in a single breath: '千里言召禾口' (thousand, li, speech, summon, grain, mouth). Zhongqing mused, \\"That's only seven characters total, yet he delivers six at once. Does he really think no one will see through it?"},{"paragraph":36,"mentions":1,"tokens":["高品"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"。」文泽道：「我就对「一欢心鸡」。」王恂道：「我对「第长年龟」。」子玉对了「超元精人」，南湘对了「一精神龙。」高品背着人写了上联，搁着笔，把大众的看了一回，鼻子里笑了一笑，就用纸蘸着酒，把粉板上的字一齐擦了。众人都诧异道：","en":"(rank-long-year-tortoise).\\" Ziyu matched: '超元精人' (surpassing-primal-refined-person). Nanxiang matched: '一精神龙' (one-spirit-dragon). Gao Pin turned his back, wrote out his opening line, set down his brush, and inspected everyone's submissions. With a quiet snort of amusement, he took a wine-dampened paper and wiped the writing-board clean. The group was astonished:"},{"paragraph":37,"mentions":5,"tokens":["高品","卓然"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"写的时候，我瞧见起头是「凤诏」两个字。」子玉想了想道：「莫非「凤诏九重和喜气」这句诗？」南湘道：「一点不错。」高品道：「不是，不是。」仲清道：「我们且各自记出对句来，就明白了。」子玉道：「我的「人言超卓贯元精」这句却不见好，也没有什么不通。」南湘道：「他是因他号卓然，这「卓贯元精」，因他受不住的原故。」仲清道：「我的是「兔毫一管定高标」，必定因「兔高」二字，犯了","en":"phoenix-decree from the nine heavens brings harmonious joyful air (凤诏九重和喜气)'?\\" Nanxiang confirmed, \\"Exactly right.\\" Gao Pin denied it, \\"No, no.\\" Zhongqing suggested, \\"Let us each recount our own matching line; then it will become clear.\\" Ziyu offered, \\"My line—'A person of speech who surpasses Zhuo and penetrates to the primal essence (人言超卓贯元精)'—isn't particularly impressive,"},{"paragraph":38,"mentions":3,"tokens":["高品"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这园子点缀得很幽雅。」文泽道：「这算什么园子，不及徐度香怡园十分之一，几时我同你去逛逛。」这里宾主二人讲着，那高品对仲清道：「你可晓得京里又来了一个精品么？」仲清笑道：「想是高品的弟兄。」高品道：「这人却也可以做得我的弟兄，闻他也是南京人，现寓在宏济寺内，却没有与他往来。看他人甚风雅，而光景很阔。你可晓得是什么人？」仲清道：「这又奇了，你们同在庙里倒不认得，来问","en":"of Xu Duxiang's Garden of Contentment. Someday I'll take you there for a stroll.\\" As host and guest conversed, Gao Pin asked Zhongqing, \\"Did you know another exceptional individual has recently arrived in the capital?\\" Zhongqing smiled, \\"I suppose it must be one of your brothers.\\" Gao Pin clarified, \\"He could indeed be my brother. I hear he is also from Nanjing and currently"}],"9":[{"paragraph":28,"mentions":1,"tokens":["高卓然"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"。」南湘道：「瑶卿，我记得你还灌我一大碗酒。」众人笑道：「这人醉胡涂了，到底饮了多少酒来？」南湘道：「今日我同高卓然、张仲雨，带了王静芳、李佩仙在酒楼上饮了一天，也不晓得有多少，他们都醉得先走了。我送静芳回去，顺路到庸庵家，问知出外逛灯，我也去逛灯。也不知赶车的什么意思，就拉我到这里，园门口的人说你们在里面赏灯，就扶了我进来。」一面说，就从怀里掏出一团灯谜字条，大","en":"still befuddled from drink. How much did you actually consume in the end?\\" Nanxiang said: \\"Today I went with Gao Zhuoran and Zhang Zhongyu, bringing Wang Jingfang and Li Peixian, and spent the whole day drinking at the winehouse. I do not know how much it was; they all got drunk and left before me. I saw Jingfang home, then dropped by Yong'an's place on the way. Learning"}],"10":[{"paragraph":35,"mentions":2,"tokens":["卓然","高品"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"不妨。足下好客，可惜前日同来的一班好友都不在此。」子云道：「他们是常来的，不妨另日再叙。」子玉道：「此外尚有个卓然高品。」子云道：「我也认识。」琴言道：「这个名字倒起得别致。」子云举杯照子玉道：「难得玉侬开了金口，我们当浮一大白。」子玉饮毕，又照了次贤，也饮干了。","en":"Ziyun, perceiving that Ziyu and Qinyan were already mutually and deeply drawn to each other, suggested: \\"Did not Brother Yuxiang say he had something to attend to? Why not send someone home with word? We could then drink freely to our hearts' absolute content.\\" Ziyu hedged politely: \\"The matter is a small one, and putting it off until tomorrow will cause no harm. You are a truly generous host, and it is only a pity the whole company of fine friends who came the other day is not here.\\" Ziyun assured him: \\"They are often here, and there will be many other occasions for another gathering.\\" Ziyu added: \\"Apart from them, there is still one of truly outstanding and uncommon character.\\" Ziyun confirmed: \\"Him I know as well.\\" Qinyan said: \\"Now that is a name with a highly distinctive quality to it.\\" Ziyun raised his cup toward Ziyu, declaring: \\"Rarely does Yunong open his golden lips, so we ought all to drain a full cup.\\" After Ziyu had drained his, he raised one toward Cixian, who also drained his to the very dregs."}],"12":[{"paragraph":7,"mentions":1,"tokens":["高品"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"复绕道而行，东瞻泰岱，西谒华山，直到十一月底才到京，寓居城南宏济寺，就与高品前后隔院住着。一切同乡年谊，未暇探访，独自一人，日日在酒楼戏馆，作乐陶情。幸亏此地的妓女生得不好，扎着两条裤腿，插着满头纸花，挺着胸脯，肠肥脑满，粉面油头；吃葱蒜，喝烧刀，热炕暖似阳台，秘戏劳于校猎，把春航女色之心，收拾得干干净净。见唱戏的相公，却好","en":"month. He took lodgings at Hongji Temple in the southern part of the city, living in the courtyard just adjacent to Gao Pin's. All the fellow provincials and old acquaintances he had yet to visit could wait; alone, he spent his days at wine houses and opera theaters, finding pleasure and solace. Fortunately, the singing-girls here were by no means attractive — they wore their"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":1,"tokens":["高品"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"的苦中寻乐。他预先存着一个主意，是」财尽而交绝」的一句，若能乐得一天，算一天，实在到水尽山穷时，方肯歇手。此时高品与春航已经认识。","en":"count that one day gained; only when he had truly reached the end of all resources would he stop. By this point, Gao Pin and Chunhang had already become acquainted."},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":5,"tokens":["高品"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"日夕聚在一处，甚为莫逆。高品也常于谑浪之中，寓些规劝之意。春航口虽唯唯，而心实不以为然，倒反要拉了高品出去，高品也应酬了几回。高品现在刑部候补七品小京官，一切车马服饰，外面应酬也就不易，所以不能如春航这样。而且他又不喜欢他那些相公，说他所爱的一班不好，春航不服。及见了李玉林来看","en":"They gathered together morning and evening and were on the most intimate terms. Gao Pin would often weave words of gentle remonstrance into his banter. Chunhang would mouth his agreement while inwardly dissenting, and would even try to drag Gao Pin out with him; Gao Pin went along a few times. Gao Pin was currently a supplementary seventh-rank"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":1,"tokens":["高品"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一日，高品过来，适值春航吃饭，青蔬半碟，白饭一盂。","en":"One day Gao Pin came over and happened to find Chunhang at his meal — half a dish of plain vegetables and a bowl of white rice."},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":4,"tokens":["高品","高卓然"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"苍头小子，侍立两旁。那一个俊俏大跟班早已走了，春航谈笑从容，恬然自适。高品道：「自待如此之薄，而待人又如此之厚，我看你不及小旦多矣。」春航骤然听了，当是高品奚落他，又知他是诙谐惯的，也不介意，问道：「何以见得呢？」高品道：「看你现在的服食起居，那一样及得小旦，何于人有情，于己忘情若此。且吾兄景况，我已深知，也不过与我高卓然","en":"The dashing senior manservant had long since departed. Chunhang talked and laughed easily, entirely at his ease. Gao Pin said: \\"You treat yourself so sparingly, yet you treat others with such lavish generosity — I must say you fall far short of the little players in this.\\" Chunhang, hearing this suddenly, thought Gao Pin was mocking him; yet knowing that mockery was habitual"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":2,"tokens":["高品"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"笑道：「我始以阁下为达人，今听你这些话，你尚未达。你读二十年书，连性理二字都不解，也来论白道黑，我替你说了。」高品道：「倒要请教。」春航道：「真实无妄便是诚，自诚而明便是性。有一分假处，有一分虚处，便不得谓诚了。」高品道：「自然。难道真实无妄，指闹相公的么？」","en":"characters 'nature' and 'principle' — yet you come to lecture me on right and wrong. Let me explain it for you.\\" Gao Pin said: \\"Please do enlighten me.\\" Chunhang said: \\"True and without falsehood — that is sincerity. From sincerity one reaches clarity — that is human nature. If there is one part falseness, one part emptiness, then sincerity is forfeit.\\" Gao Pin said: \\"Granted."},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":1,"tokens":["卓然"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"若既重色，自不敢淫。又最不解的是财色二字并重。既爱人之色，而又吝已之财。以烂臭之粪土，换奇香之宝花，孰轻孰重？卓然当能辨之。」","en":"exchanging rotten, stinking dung for a rare and fragrant treasure flower, which is heavier and which lighter? Zhuoran should be able to judge.\\""},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":6,"tokens":["高品"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"高品听了这一席话，却也无处可驳。便道：「情之所钟，正在我辈，难道我是不通人道的么？所以劝你者，以君床头金尽，我又无囊可解。足下将来，虽能封到荥阳郡公，恐此辈中，竟无▉国夫人。乌巾少年，纵驰名于酒肆。而鹑衣小丐，恐忽饿于花街。窃恐为郑元和所笑耳。」春航笑道","en":"Gao Pin, having heard this speech, had no ready answer. He then said: \\"The deepest feeling belongs to people like us — am I someone who does not understand human sentiment? My reason for advising you is that your bedside gold is entirely gone, and I have no"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":2,"tokens":["高品"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「这湘帆怎样的人？」高品道：「也是我辈。我去年对你说过的：样样精致，是个精品。如今是样样精光了。」仲清笑问：「怎样？」高品便将他方才的议论，与到京所为的事，一一说了。又道：「此人却真可惜，才貌双全，胸襟阔大，就是爱闹，太无收束。他也是你们金陵人，此时住家扬州。他说他的夫人母","en":"\\"What sort of person is this Xiangfan?\\" Gao Pin said: \\"Also one of our kind. I mentioned him to you last year — exquisite in every way, a truly refined specimen. Nowadays he is exquisite in a different sense — having polished himself clean of everything.\\" Zhongqing smiled and asked: \\"How so?\\" Gao"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":2,"tokens":["高品"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"仲清道：「也好。你为我先容。」高品即同了仲清进去，仲清先已望见一个少年，神光似玉，宝气如珠，可不就是去年酒楼上所见的？高品与他们介绍了。春航见了仲清，也觉面熟。","en":"Zhongqing said: \\"A fine idea. Go in and introduce me.\\" Gao Pin immediately brought Zhongqing inside. Zhongqing caught sight first of a young man — luminous as jade, radiant as a pearl — was this not the very one he had seen in the wine house the previous year? Gao Pin introduced them. Chunhang, seeing Zhongqing,"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":2,"tokens":["高品"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"戚。二人说的意气相投，又系亲戚，已十分相契，后来便谈起肺腑来。仲清见春航去年服饰何等华美，如今已不似从前，再想高品的话说他精光，一无所有，也不知他所阔的是些什么人？便问道：「闻足下颇有狎优之癖，但不知赏识的那几个？可能不负品题否？」高品接口道：「他的赏识，与人不同，我说给你听：「咭咭咯咯梆子腔，咿咿哑哑唱二簧。\\n裤花白似秋云薄，上得巫山屁亦香。」","en":"Chunhang's dress, which had been so elegantly fine the previous year, was now quite unlike what it had been; recalling Gao Pin's words that he had polished himself clean and had nothing left, he was also curious about the caliber of people he had been so lavish with. He asked: \\"I hear you have a considerable fondness for young actors — but which ones have you been admiring?"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":3,"tokens":["高品"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这班善男信女，配做了玉瑟瑶琴，还了普天下八万三千大心愿，成了个欢喜世界，我便如弥勒一笑，永不合口，岂不快活？」高品道：「你那金屋中，我必要送你副对子。」即念道：「月明瑶岛三千里，人在蓬莱第一峰。」春航道：「这副对子，也题得不切。」高品道：「切得很，上联切你的粉白黛绿，下联切你的长袖轻裙。」仲清、春航都不甚解。高品道：「有了这副对子，人才知道他这金屋中，前面要开棚","en":"creating a world of joy; and then I, like Maitreya, would smile a smile that never closed — how happy would that be?\\" Gao Pin said: \\"For your golden chamber, I shall certainly compose you a couplet.\\" He then recited:\\n\\n\\"In the bright moon of the jade isle, three thousand li wide;\\nThe person stands at the very summit of the Penglai peak.\\"\\n\\nChunhang said: \\"That couplet doesn't"},{"paragraph":31,"mentions":5,"tokens":["高品"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"步走回庙中，恰懊悔不曾问得那一班的小旦。进了庙门，就把衣裳脱下，交田安收拾，换去泥靴，身上只穿了一件夹袄，来到高品屋里坐下。高品见他身上不穿袍子，且下雨寒冷，便问他何以不多穿件衣服？春航答以被雨沾湿，叫田安烤去了。高品即于衣包内，取出一件袍子与他穿了。春航即坐下说道：「我今日虽然跌了一交，沾了些泥，但这一交实在跌得有趣。闹了两个多月的相公，不及这一交受用。天假奇","en":"and handed them to Tian An to clean, changed out of his muddy boots, and in only a lined jacket went to sit in Gao Pin's room. Gao Pin, seeing that he wore no outer robe, and that the rain had made the weather cold, asked why he was not wearing more. Chunhang explained that the rain had soaked his clothes and he had had Tian An dry them out. Gao Pin took a robe from"},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":5,"tokens":["高品"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"为乎泥中？赋也。\\n春航笑着，又将那相公的相貌衣裳，连那骡子车围的颜色都说了，问道：「你可识得是那一班的相公？」高品想了一会道：「据你说来，不是陆素兰，就是金漱芳，不然就是袁宝珠。」春航道；「金漱芳在联殊班，我见过他的戏，生得瘦瘦儿的，不是。至于陆素兰、袁宝珠我却不认得，不知到底是谁？」高品道：「袁宝珠是不大穿素色衣裳的。你说这光景，也不大很像陆素兰。要不然是苏蕙","en":"clothing, and even the color of the mule-cart's curtain, and asked: \\"Do you know which troupe this actor belongs to?\\" Gao Pin thought for a moment and said: \\"From your description, it must be either Lu Sulan, or Jin Shufang — or else Yuan Baozhu.\\" Chunhang said: \\"Jin Shufang is in the Lianzhu troupe and I have seen his performance — he is rather thin and spare-looking; not"},{"paragraph":41,"mentions":3,"tokens":["卓然","高品"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"济于事。除非要将徐度香的家私分一半与他，才够他挥霍。但人到断炊，也不成件事了。依我想，我们如今再帮他百金，存在卓然处，教他相机行事，慢慢点化他。或者凭卓然那张嘴，倒还劝得转他，也未可知。仲清亦以为然。王恂即备了百金，交与仲清送至高品处。未知后事如何，且听下回分解。","en":"fire going is in a sorry state. In my view, we might help him with another hundred taels right now, to be held at Zhuoran's, who can dispense it as circumstances warrant, and gradually enlighten him. Perhaps relying on Zhuoran's way with words, he might yet be brought around — it is not entirely impossible.\\" Zhongqing agreed. Wang Xun immediately prepared a hundred taels"}],"13":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":2,"tokens":["高品"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说仲清激怒春航之后，即将王恂所备之百金送至高品处，为春航薪水之费。春航闷坐了两日，米煤催逼，告贷无门。经高品款留，只得暂时寄食。","en":"After Zhongqing had provoked Chunhang into anger, he sent the hundred taels that Wang Xun had prepared to Gao Pin, to cover Chunhang's daily expenses of firewood and food. Chunhang sat brooding for two days; pressed on all sides for rice, coal, and the repayment of debts, with nowhere to turn for a loan, he accepted Gao Pin's kind offer to stay and was thus obliged"},{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["高品"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一日，用了饭，高品拜客去了，春航即到戏园来，一心想着苏蕙芳，又没有钱听戏，只好站在戏园门口，候着那蕙芳出进。将到开戏时候，果然见蕙芳坐了车，到门口下来，偏偏有一群人进来看戏，一挤把春航挤在背后，却彼此不能照面。春航心里甚恨，急把身子挤出来，蕙芳已进去了，只得呆呆的不动","en":"One day, after eating, Gao Pin went out to pay calls, and Chunhang went to the theater, his heart entirely fixed upon Su Huifang. Having no money to watch the opera, he could only stand at the entrance, waiting to catch a glimpse of Huifang going in or coming out. Just as the performance"},{"paragraph":33,"mentions":1,"tokens":["高品"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"高品已经睡了，春航不好去惊动他，一径到自己房内。田安伏在桌上瞌睡，春航剔亮了灯，叫醒了田安，说道：「快去泡茶。」田安擦擦眼睛，见一个美少年，只道是位公子，便急急的泡茶去了。蕙芳坐下，看他行李萧条，心里着实难过。便叫跟班的将衣裳、票子拿上来，道：「这五套衣","en":"Gao Pin had already gone to bed. Chunhang, not wanting to disturb him, went directly to his own room. Tian An was dozing over the table. Chunhang trimmed the lamp brighter and woke Tian An. \\"Go and make tea, quickly.\\" Tian An rubbed his eyes, and seeing a beautiful"}],"14":[{"paragraph":15,"mentions":6,"tokens":["高品"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「温飞卿诗有「秦王女骑红尾凤。」蕙芳又念道：「跨凤随郎三万里。一日香心思百回，闲时又逐炉烟起。」方才念完，只见高品进来道：「好诗！有如此娇音，方配念这香艳的佳章。但诗中有一句，要改三个字，更觉贴切。」蕙芳走上一步，见了道：「昨夜要来请安，你已睡了。」高品笑道：「这么说，你们已是睡过一夜的了。」蕙芳碎了一口道：「我们昨夜直谈到此刻。」高品道：「脸上气色不像。」春航","en":"a hundred times;\\nAt leisure it rises again with the smoke from the censer.\\"\\n\\nHe had just finished reading when Gao Pin walked in. \\"What a fine poem! Only such a sweet and winsome voice is fit to recite these fragrant and elegant verses. But there is one line in the poem that would be even more apt and fitting with three words changed.\\" Huifang stepped forward. When he"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":1,"tokens":["高品"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"蕙芳却呆呆的听着，春航笑道：「你自会卜，倒不会详。」高品也笑了。","en":"intently, as if lost in thought. Chunhang laughed: \\"You cast the divination yourself, yet you cannot interpret it.\\" Gao Pin laughed too."},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":3,"tokens":["高品"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"蕙芳要问高品时，见窗外脚步响，有个人影来影去。春航问：「是谁？」听得咳嗽一声，应道：「是我，寻高老爷有句话说。」高品听口声便道：「妙兮，妙兮。」出来一望，果然是庙里的唐和尚，问道：「你有什么话说？」唐和尚便笑嘻嘻的钻将进来，与春航见了，看见了蕙芳，便合着掌道：「","en":"Huifang was about to ask Gao Pin's opinion when footsteps were heard outside the window as a shadow passed back and forth. Chunhang asked, \\"Who is it?\\" A cough sounded, followed by a reply: \\"It is I. I have a word to say to Lord Gao.\\" Gao Pin recognized the voice at once and said, \\"Ah,"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":11,"tokens":["高品"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"道：「高老爷，你、你、你。」又不说了，嘻着嘴笑。蕙芳道：「我已对了。」即念道：「如瓢浮水面，顶圆而光。」春航、高品都笑说道：「对得好，敏捷且好。」唐和尚笑道：「多谢、多谢，小僧有幸得逢菩萨赞扬，倒没有说我的像鸡巴。」便拉了高品出去，在院子里讲了几句话，便自去了。高品复又进来，三人同吃了饭。蕙芳要听春航弹琴，便把琴取了，解了琴囊，放在桌上道：「弹罢！可要焚香？」春","en":"have already matched it,\\" and recited: \\"Like a gourd floating on water, the top is round and bald.\\" Chunhang and Gao Pin both laughed and said, \\"Wonderfully matched, quick-witted and apt!\\" Tang the Monk laughed and said, \\"Many thanks, many thanks! This little monk has the great good fortune of being praised by the bodhisattva — and at least he did not say my head was like"},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":3,"tokens":["高品"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"春航道：「这套琴就只三段。」蕙芳道：「太短，再弹长的。」高品笑道：「湘帆，媚香嫌你快，又嫌你短。你总得贴张千娇百美膏才好。」春航道：「胡说！」蕙芳要去撕高品的嘴，高品便深深作揖道：「宽恕小生这一次罢。」惹得蕙芳倒笑了。蕙芳要春航弹《胡笳十八拍》，又要弹《洞天春晓》，说道：「这两套我听萧静宜弹得最好，他并有琴箫","en":"Chunhang said, \\"This suite has only three sections.\\" Huifang said, \\"Too short, play a longer one.\\" Gao Pin laughed: \\"Xiangfan, Meixiang finds your piece too fast and too short. You had better go and paste up a placard advertising some thousand-charm, hundred-beauty remedy.\\" Chunhang said, \\"Nonsense!\\" Huifang made to pinch Gao Pin's mouth shut; Gao Pin bowed"},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":5,"tokens":["高品"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，恍如见湘娥啼竹，列子御风，鸣呜咽咽，如怨如慕，如泣如诉。真是拔剑斲地，搔首问天，清风瑟瑟，从窗隙中来。蕙芳与高品，都正襟危坐，静气敛容的听着。忽然七弦六徽二分上低了，五弦六徽上高了，四弦九徽上也差了几分。春航道：「奇了，宫商为何忽乱起来？」高品、蕙芳却听不出。春航又把弦和了一和，和不准，即住手问高品：「庙里有弹琴的人么？」高品道：「胡琴或者和尚会拉，琴是没有人","en":"sword-strokes and probe the heavens; a cool wind stirred and rustled in through the cracks of the window. Huifang and Gao Pin both sat upright and composed, listening with breath held and expression gathered. Suddenly the seventh string at the second division of the sixth position went flat, the fifth string at the sixth position went sharp, and the fourth string at the ninth"},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":10,"tokens":["高品","高卓然","卓然"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"高品急出来看时，不是别人，恰是史南湘左手挽着王兰保，右手携了李玉林，面上已有了几分酒意。又见玉林手内拈了一枝杏花，后面又跟着三四个人。高品见自己的跟班也在院子里，高品问道：「你从何处来？」南湘道：「你叫相公瞒着我，倒问我从何处来？我今日同了静芳到怡园，他","en":"Gao Pin hurried out to look, and who should it be but Shi Nanxiang, his left hand clasped around Wang Lanbao's arm and his right hand holding Li Yulin, already a little flushed with wine. Yulin held a sprig of apricot blossom in his hand, and three or four more"},{"paragraph":30,"mentions":5,"tokens":["高品"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"高品的跟班同厨子把酒看肴摆了上来。大家在圆桌上坐了。南湘与春航又谈了些琴谱文艺，彼此均各敬服。高品道：「当今史竹君，是梨园的狄梁公；田湘帆，是戏班的李药师。」南湘道：「你又胡言乱道了。」春航道：「怎么说？我倒不明白。」高品道：「竹君序那《燕台花选》，这些","en":"Gao Pin's attendant and the cook brought out wine and dishes. They all sat around a round table. Nanxiang and Chunhang talked further about qin scores and literary arts, each finding much to admire in the other. Gao Pin said, \\"Today's Shi Zhujun is the Di Renjie"},{"paragraph":31,"mentions":2,"tokens":["高品"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"梁冀下马。今见苏郎唱戏，田子跟车。一副好对，持赠媚香罢。」蕙芳睃着南湘道：「你何苦也学着那嚼舌头的人挖苦我。」高品道：「这话是恨我已深，其实我与你无仇无怨，何必这样恶狠狠的？」蕙芳道：「你再说，我就卸你的底了。」高品道：「尽管卸，我却不怕。」蕙芳便念道：「请筵享官、赏戴貂翎、会馆副总裁、戏园行走、书画厂校对、兼管南城街道厅、各梨园乐部、稽察各处新闻事务、到一处祭","en":"Huifang gave Nanxiang a sidelong glance and said, \\"Why must you also imitate that sharp-tongued fellow and mock me?\\" Gao Pin said, \\"These words are spoken as if you have a deep grudge against me, when in truth I bear you no enmity at all. Why so harsh?\\" Huifang said, \\"Say another word and I'll expose your secrets.\\" Gao Pin said, \\"Go ahead and expose them, I am not afraid.\\""},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":3,"tokens":["高品"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这官衔是刘文泽编成的，席中惟有南湘一人知道，春航尚是创闻。高品道：「还有一个官衔你没有说。」蕙芳道：「好像没有了。」高品道：「还有监造兔园册子呢。」南湘又笑。蕙芳不曾理会，即与兰保、玉林在各人面前敬了几杯酒。春航前次已见过玉林，看他丰致嫣然，虽逊蕙芳一筹，然比起从前赏识的一班相公，却高得多。见他桃腮粉腻，莲脸香","en":"composed by Liu Wenze; of those present, only Nanxiang knew their origin, while to Chunhang it was entirely new. Gao Pin said, \\"There is one title you have left out.\\" Huifang said, \\"It seems there was nothing more.\\" Gao Pin said, \\"You have omitted Superintendent of the Compilation of the Rabbit Garden Catalogue.\\" Nanxiang laughed again. Huifang paid no attention to this,"},{"paragraph":36,"mentions":1,"tokens":["高品"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"道：「我不爱饮了，适可而止。」兰保道：「那由不得你，你不闻」失意睚眦间，白刃相交加」么？」南湘、春航看着他们，高品对着王兰保作嘴作脸，要他罚蕙芳的酒。李玉林则斜身单香肩，嫣然而笑。兰保也笑道：「你真不喝？」蕙芳有些怕他，只得赔着笑道：「兰哥饶了我罢。」玉林也再三替他讨情，兰保终是不肯，犹罚了蕙芳一杯，方才开交。大家又饮过了一会，忽见蕙芳家内有人来叫蕙芳。蕙芳出去","en":"decide. Have you not heard: 'Between feuding enemies, bare blades cross'?\\" Nanxiang and Chunhang watched them, while Gao Pin pulled faces at Wang Lanbao, urging him to impose more forfeit wine on Huifang. Li Yulin reclined on one shoulder, smiling languidly. Lanbao also laughed: \\"Are you truly not going to drink?\\" Huifang was a little afraid of him, and could only smile along,"},{"paragraph":37,"mentions":3,"tokens":["高品"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"蕙芳进来，春航问起何事？蕙芳道：「家内有人寻我，我回他去了。」高品道：「是谁？蕙芳道：「不认得。来人说叫什么奚十一，是广东人。」高品道：「好累赘姓，兜头一撇，握颈三拳，中间便丝丝的搅不清，这要假充个大老官。东方之夷有九种，不知他是那一种。」蕙芳道：「你倒好在庙门口，摆个测字摊子。」说得大家笑了。高品道：「今日清饮无","en":"and Chunhang asked what the matter was. Huifang replied, \\"Someone at home came looking for me; I sent him away.\\" Gao Pin asked, \\"Who was it?\\" Huifang said, \\"I don't know him. The servant said his name was something like Xi Eleven, a Cantonese man.\\" Gao Pin said, \\"What a cumbersome surname! One stroke sweeping down at the top, three punches gripping at the neck, with tangled"},{"paragraph":38,"mentions":8,"tokens":["高品"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"高品道：「我们三个人从《四书》上找那个奚字，要从第一个，说到第十一个，说差了照字数罚酒。他们三个人，替我们分消。」春航道：「《四书》上未必有这许多奚字。」南湘道：「就有也不能凑数。」高品道：「不过罚几杯酒就是了，何妨试他一试，我先说。」即说道：「奚。」春","en":"Gao Pin said, \\"The three of us will find the character 'xi' (奚) in *The Four Books*, starting from the first occurrence and going to the eleventh. Whoever makes an error drinks a number of cups equal to the number of characters in the passage. Those three will"},{"paragraph":39,"mentions":5,"tokens":["高品"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"轮到南湘，南湘便顿住了口，一时倒想不出来。高品道：「罚了五杯，我代你说。」南湘又想了一会没有，只得饮了三杯，兰保代了两杯。高品说道：「是亦为政，奚……」南湘道：「怎么我就想不着。」春航也想了一会道：「虞不用百里奚……」南湘拍着桌子道：「罚得冤！有庳之人奚……」春航、高品都赞好，应轮到高品说第七个","en":"When it came to Nanxiang's turn, Nanxiang fell silent, unable for the moment to recall anything. Gao Pin said, \\"I was penalized five cups, let me say it for you.\\" Nanxiang thought a while longer and could not recall a passage, so he drank three cups while Lanbao drank two on his behalf. Gao Pin said: \\"'This too is governance, for what reason...'\\" Nanxiang"},{"paragraph":40,"mentions":1,"tokens":["高品"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"大家都笑起来。高品道：「都要罚。第七个奚字轮到我说，为什么要你们抢说？」李玉林便斟起罚酒来，南湘、春航只图说得爽快，倒也意不在罚。南湘饮了五杯，兰保代了两杯。春航饮了三杯，蕙芳代了四杯。","en":"Everyone burst out laughing. Gao Pin said, \\"You have all earned forfeits. The seventh 'xi' was my turn to cite, so why did you both rush in?\\" Li Yulin duly poured the forfeit cups. Nanxiang and Chunhang had been so eager to recite that they had quite forgotten about the penalties. Nanxiang"},{"paragraph":41,"mentions":16,"tokens":["高品"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"高品催南湘说第八个奚字，南湘道：「第七个你还没有说，要罚。」因便叫兰保斟酒。高品道：「岂有此理！你们都抢说了，叫我说出什么来？还要罚我，天理良心何在？」李玉林也替高品说情，南湘只得依了，便道：「以粟易之。曰：许子奚……」春航道：「第九个到少。」便想了一想","en":"Gao Pin pressed Nanxiang to cite the eighth 'xi'; Nanxiang said, \\"You have not yet given the seventh, so you must be penalized.\\" He called upon Lanbao to pour wine. Gao Pin said, \\"This is outrageous! You both rushed in and said it before me. What am I supposed"}],"16":[{"paragraph":33,"mentions":1,"tokens":["高品"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"今日子玉出门，只与素兰谈了半日，所访不遇，倒遇见了丈人，好不纳闷。意欲去望高品，又嫌路远，且出门过久，又恐高堂见责，只得怏怏而回。","en":"Instead, he had the misfortune of running into his father-in-law—a truly vexing encounter. He considered visiting Gao Pin, but the distance was great, and having been away so long, he feared a reprimand upon returning home. Defeated, he had no choice but to head back in low spirits."}],"17":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":2,"tokens":["卓然","高品"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉即把日间一一过访不遇事说过。先是王恂开言道：「今日我们都在卓然斋中，交会田湘帆与媚香，又遇见竹君前来。那湘帆果是吾辈，与媚香相处的光景，真令人羡慕。」高品道：「湘帆此时是六根全净，五蕴皆空，守定了约法三章，不许你胡行乱走，始信人间果然多是惧内的，怪不得庸庵、竹君辈，牢守闺房，不奉将令不敢妄离一步。违了，晚间夹棍","en":"upon each of them earlier in the day to no avail. Wang Xun was the first to speak: \\"Today we were all gathered in Zhuoran's studio, where we met with Tian Xiangfan and Meixiang, and chanced upon Zhujun who arrived later. Xiangfan is truly a kindred spirit. The way he and Meixiang interact is genuinely enviable.\\" Gao Pin chimed in: \\"Xiangfan is now a man whose six senses"},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":4,"tokens":["卓然","高品"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"经如此，又何怪四畏堂中规矩乎！」说得众人要笑，仲清道：「你也是门内出身，如今隔远了，就夸口了。」南湘道：「我见卓然与他细君书，如属员与上司禀帖一样，有受恩深重，浃髓沦肌等语。」众人大笑，高品道：「岂有此理！你这个谎也撒得不像。」众人又说笑了一阵，高品道：「庾香，后日有一件极好的事，来与你商量。」子玉便问道：「何事？」高品道：「十五日是媚香生日。今日大家商议，并订","en":"\\"You yourself emerged from behind those very doors; now that you are far away, you boast.\\" Nanxiang said: \\"I saw Zhuoran's letter to his wife—it read like a subordinate's petition to a superior, filled with phrases such as 'deeply indebted to your grace' and 'seeping into the marrow and soaking the flesh.'\\" Everyone burst into uproarious laughter. Gao Pin said: \\"Preposterous!"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":1,"tokens":["高品"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"又替他结交了许多好友，如徐度香、萧静宜、刘文泽、史南湘、颜仲清、王恂等。仲清前与春航不睦，原是激励春航之意；经高品将其中情节剖明，又说起仲清仍送五十金作浇裹之费，春航自然十分感激敬佩。仲清叫蕙芳为之转弯，更觉比前相好。惟有子玉，尚未谋面。是日知文泽等为蕙芳做生日，心上虽十分欢喜，又因他二人交好，竟人人共知，翻有些不好意思，意欲不去，又不好却众人情面，只好践诺。","en":"Wang Xun. Zhongqing's previous discord with Chunhang had originally been intended to spur Chunhang onward; after Gao Pin illuminated the underlying circumstances, and mentioned that Zhongqing was still sending fifty taels of silver for his living expenses, Chunhang was naturally filled with the deepest gratitude and admiration. Zhongqing had Huifang smooth things over"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":2,"tokens":["高品","卓然"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"仲清道：「竹君快人，开口立见，今日之集，皆系至好，正可畅叙幽情，不拘形迹为妙。」只见高品笑道：「今日王母早来，只有南极仙翁，迟迟不到，难道半路上撞着了小行者的筋斗云，碰伤了小寿星，因此行走不便么；不然，或是又滑倒在车辙里了。」说得众人大笑道：「卓然妙语，待寿翁来罚其三大觞。」蕙芳似觉脸红，宝珠道：「今日的客，尚短几人？」文泽道：「就止寿","en":"closest of friends; it would be best to speak freely of what lies in the heart, without standing on ceremony.\\" Then Gao Pin laughed and said: \\"Today the Queen Mother of the West has arrived early, and it is only the Old Immortal of the South Pole who is coming late. Could it be that halfway here he ran into the somersault cloud of the Little Pilgrim and was struck, injuring"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":1,"tokens":["高品"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"自然叙齿为妙。」众人也说叙齿罢了。文泽送酒，先定中间一席。论齿是次贤为长，次贤自知不能推逊，只得依了，并坐者为高品，次是仲清；左首一席，子云为首，次南湘，次子玉；右首一席，田春航为首，次王恂，文泽作陪。是每席三位。","en":"was first set in order. By age, Cixian was eldest; knowing he could not refuse, he took the seat of honor, with Gao Pin beside him, then Zhongqing. The left-hand table had Ziyun at the head, then Nanxiang, then Ziyu. The right-hand table had Tian Chunhang at the head, then Wang Xun, with Wenze as host. There were three guests at each table."},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":1,"tokens":["高品"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"保到太湖石畔，同坐在芍药栏边闲话；玉林、漱芳已醉卧在海棠花下；兰保在池畔钓鱼；宝珠与蕙芳对弈，素兰观局，南湘、高品在傍为宝珠指点。蕙芳道：「你们三人下我一个。就赢了也不算稀奇。」宝珠道：「我偏不用人教也赢得你。」文泽道：「今日我们亦算极乐了，可惜花部中少了两人，那个还不要紧，第一是琴言不来，使庾香不能畅意。」子云道：「可不是！琴言的病颇为古怪，精神疲软，饮食不思","en":"was fishing by the pond. Baozhu and Huifang were playing chess, with Sulan watching the game, while Nanxiang and Gao Pin stood by offering Baozhu advice. Huifang said: \\"Three of you against my one; even if you win it is hardly a surprise.\\" Baozhu said: \\"I can win against you without any coaching at all.\\" Wenze said: \\"Today we have had real pleasure. It is a pity that two"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":1,"tokens":["高品"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"于是以年齿为先后，仍系次贤为首，次子云，次高品，次南湘，次文泽，次仲清，次春航，次王恂，次子玉，共是九人。王恂已将子玉叫醒，净净脸，素兰取出一颗醒酒丸给子玉吃了。子玉不好意思，只得勉强扎挣。素兰见子玉不语不言，似醉非醉，心上猜着是为琴言未来。一因人多不好解慰他，二因提起琴言反恐倒勾他的心事，非惟","en":"So they proceeded in order of age, with Cixian again taking the lead, followed by Ziyun, then Gao Pin, then Nanxiang, then Wenze, then Zhongqing, then Chunhang, then Wang Xun, and finally Ziyu, making nine people in all. Wang Xun had already roused Ziyu and had him wash his face; Sulan brought out a sobering pill and gave it to Ziyu to ingest. Ziyu felt"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":1,"tokens":["高品"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"春风吹不散。散花天女好新奇。」众人也写了，注上「云」字，齐说道：「接得很妙，第三句一开，使人便有生发了。」应到高品，也不思索，即写道：「剪彩为花撒天半。花情花貌越精神。」众人皆道：「好！」一一写了。","en":"together: \\"A very fine continuation. With the opening of the third line, one feels inspiration rising.\\" It came to Gao Pin, who wrote without overthinking: \\"Cutting silk to make flowers, scattering them across half the sky; / The feeling and features of the flowers grow ever more spirited.\\" Everyone said: \\"Splendid!\\" and wrote it down one by one."},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":2,"tokens":["高品"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"众人又赞道：「好！又提得清楚。「底下是王恂，略费思索，写道：「玉人又恐占千秋。婵娟疑窃嫦娥药。」大家正要赞好，高品道：「这句忒骂得恶，难道个个都像月宫里的兔子？」众人大笑起来，王恂倒觉不安。众旦便骂高品道：「惟有他，是生平不肯说好话的，将来罚他作个哑子。」","en":"thousand autumns; / Chanjuan seems to have stolen Chang'e's elixir.\\" Everyone was just about to praise it when Gao Pin said: \\"This line scolds too viciously; surely not every one of them is like the rabbit in the moon palace?\\" Everyone burst out laughing, and Wang Xun felt rather uneasy. The beauties all scolded Gao Pin: \\"It is only him, who never has a good word to"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":2,"tokens":["高品"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"高品道：「奇了，人家骂你们，我替你们不平，自然也有不像兔子的，你们倒骂我，真是好人难做。」以下要子玉了，子玉心上正想着琴言，觉得无情无绪，众人亦都明白。子玉虽极意遮饰，终究思绪不佳，不得已，勉强写道：「顾盼曾回玉女眸。鸾篦亲掠云鬟绿。」春航道：「此系上妆","en":"Gao Pin said: \\"How strange. Other people scold you all, and I defend your honor, yet you scold me. Truly no good deed goes unpunished.\\" It was now Ziyu's turn; Ziyu's mind was on Qinyan, feeling hollow and listless, as everyone well understood. Though Ziyu tried"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":2,"tokens":["高品"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"」二轮又到次贤，遂写道：「元白诗原结莲社。红氍毹上艳情多。」子云接道：「惯唱《丁娘十索》歌。葑菲彩无遗下体。」高品道：「妙、妙！这句待我对一句好的。」群旦听了料定又要取笑他们，便都围拢来看着高品写的什么。","en":"\\"Practiced in singing 'Lady Ding's Ten Requests';\\nthe plain and beautiful, no humble part left unremarked.\\"\\n\\nGao Pin said: \\"Wonderful! For this line let me produce a good match.\\" The young beauties, hearing this, suspected another jest at their expense and all crowded around to watch what Gao Pin was writing."},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":5,"tokens":["高品","卓然"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"高品带笑，慢慢的写将出来，道：「雨云行得到中阿。」众人又笑起来，群旦将高品乱啐乱打的一阵。子云笑道：「这是我不好，斗出他这一句来。」南湘道：「虽然游戏，也不好过于刻薄，改一字就救转来了，将「得」字改做「岂」字罢。」群旦方才依了。高品道：「罢了，众怒难犯。","en":"Gao Pin, smiling, wrote out slowly:\\n\\n\\"Rain and clouds, one travels all the way to Zhong'a.\\"\\n\\nEveryone burst out laughing, and the beauties all spat at him and pummeled him in a flurry. Ziyun laughed: \\"It is my fault, for I provoked that line from him.\\" Nanxiang"},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":1,"tokens":["高品"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"花？子云道：「琴言色艺过佳，而性情过冷，比为梅花最是相称，且其酷爱梅，不属庾香将谁属耶？」众人说道；「很是。」高品道：「只怕和靖先生不依，庾香割了他靴革幼子了。」","en":"since his passionate love of the plum is not for Yuxiang's sake, then whose?\\" Everyone agreed: \\"Quite right.\\" Gao Pin said: \\"Only I fear that Lin Hejing would not consent, for Yuxiang would have taken away his leather-shod little son.\\""},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":1,"tokens":["高品"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉不觉脸红。仲清道：「琪官呢？」子云道：「琪官性情刚烈，相貌极好。似欠旖旎风流。比他为菊花罢。」高品道：「菊花种数不一，有白有黄，或红或紫，白的还好，其余似觉老气横秋。琪官性情虽烈，其温柔处亦颇耐人怜爱，不如比为杏花。」众人道：「好个杏花，极妥当。」文泽道：「说起菊花有黄有白，你们可晓得东园里新来一个妓女，叫白菊花，可知其人么？」众人皆说：「不晓。","en":"appearance extremely fine; he somewhat lacks a gentle, flowing charm. Let him be likened to the chrysanthemum.\\" Gao Pin said: \\"Chrysanthemums vary in variety: some white, some yellow, some red, some purple. The white ones are fine, but the rest tend to give a feeling of austere autumnal severity. Qiguan, though his temperament is fierce, has a tenderness in him that is"},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":1,"tokens":["高品"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"高品道：「天下事须瞒不过我。我知此人从广西跟了一个千总进京，如今千总弃了他出京去了，因此落在门户中。倒也生得素净，故有此雅号。但是两广人裹足者少，都系六寸肤圆光致致，双跌着地，行走如风。人倒极风骚的。」仲清道：「这就是你各处稽察新闻事务的头衔了。」众人又","en":"Gao Pin said: \\"There is nothing in the world that I cannot find out. I know that she came from Guangxi with a company commander who brought her to the capital; the commander has now abandoned her and left the city, so she ended up in the pleasure quarter. She"},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":1,"tokens":["高品"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"花谱中添了琪官，惟琴言尚未痊愈。高品、文泽因南湘说过，「一客不来罚我做东一日。」子玉是日不到，罚了南湘一天，南湘甚为乐从。即在他家里又叙了一日。惟有子玉、琴言皆未痊愈。正是：数点梅花娇欲坠，月轮又下竹桥西。未知如何，且听下回分解。","en":"Qiguan was added to the flower register; only Qinyan had still not recovered. Gao Pin and Wenze held Nanxiang to what he had said: \\"If one guest is absent, I'll be fined to host a day.\\" Since Ziyu did not come that day, Nanxiang was fined a day of hosting; Nanxiang was thoroughly happy to oblige. Another day's gathering was held at his"}],"18":[{"paragraph":15,"mentions":1,"tokens":["高品"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"儿的，倒先要在东园、西厂落几天，见见市面，自然就不知羞耻，老练起来。如行院中不好的打下来，又到此两处。这个就是高品所说，从广西新来的白菊花了。聘才看他举止，尚有几分羞涩。旁边一个小儿，捧上一面琵琶，那人接了，弹了一套《昭君怨》，便惹得门口看的人益发多了。","en":"better houses were demoted to these two places. This was none other than the White Chrysanthemum (Bai Juhua) that Gao Pin had spoken of, newly arrived from Guangxi. Watching her behavior, Pincai could see she still had a measure of bashfulness about her. A small boy came up beside her and offered a pipa lute. She took it and played a suite of \\"Wang Zhaojun's Lament\\" (昭君怨),"}],"20":[{"paragraph":5,"mentions":1,"tokens":["高品"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"且说子玉是在家养病，不出大门，高品为河间胡太尊请去修志，刘文泽是他岳母惦记他，来接他并其室吴氏，同到直隶总督衙门去了。此中已少了三人，只有子云、次贤、南湘、仲清、春航、王恂六人，不时往来。","en":"Let us speak of Ziyu: he was at home recuperating from his illness and not going out at all. Gao Pin had been invited by the prefect of Hejian, Lord Hu, to assist in compiling a local gazetteer. Liu Wenze's mother-in-law had been missing him and had come to fetch him along with his wife née Wu to the office of the Viceroy of Zhili. So three of the group"}],"24":[{"paragraph":3,"mentions":1,"tokens":["卓然"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"。终日相对，娓娓无倦容，其情可见在此。竹君恃才傲物，卓荦不群。唯用情处为甚恳挚，虽其狂态难掩，而究少克伐之心。卓然如云行水流，随处遇合，竟无成心，凡事出以天趣。且辞锋尖利，而独于所好者，便不忍加一刻薄语，亦其情有专用处。前舟与阁下，大致相似，和平浑厚，蔼然可亲，所谓宁人负我，毋我负人者也。至于我亦非忘情，但不能轻易用情。用时容易，到完结处便艰难。若使孟浪用之，而","en":"Zhongqing laughed, \\"That is entirely another species of love. As I see it, Xiangfan's devotion to Meixiang was born initially of physical desire. He squandered oceans of silver, and upon gazing at such transcendent loveliness, he endured insult without rage and mockery without shame. He was like a mortal who had caught a glimpse of heaven, desperate to gaze upon it every waking hour. When Meixiang finally took pity on his hidden suffering and recognized his tireless patience—yielding but a fraction of warmth to acknowledge him—Xiangfan revealed his elegant speech and gentle demeanor. He was humble without lewd intent, possessing a pure sincerity that eventually softened Meixiang's heart. Once he was moved, they clung to each other like lacquer, their bond growing firmer with each passing day. In the beginning, Xiangfan scarcely considered Meixiang's station; he saw only that flower-like face and tender disposition. Yet, upon finding him stern, unapproachable, and ultimately capable of aiding and advising him, his love transformed into deep respect, and that respect deepened his love. It was like a friend's earnest warning or a stone from another mountain used for polishing jade—his wrongs were righted without the need for preaching. Compared to Yuxiang, they are like Sima Xiangru and Yang Xiong: sharing the same craft, yet playing an entirely different tune. Only those who love beauty without succumbing to debauchery can hold true passion; feelings born of sheer lust do not stem from one's true nature. Take Pan the Third, for instance—he covets Meixiang, but would you call that 'passion'?\\" Wang Xun countered, \\"It is still a kind of feeling. If he felt nothing at all, he wouldn't spare him a single thought.\\" Zhongqing laughed dismissively, \\"If Pan possessed true feeling, he would never lust after Meixiang so basely. His lust is the very proof of his heartlessness.\\" Wang Xun chuckled, \\"That logic feels a bit forced. Passion can be both upright and crooked. Pan's is a crooked lust, unlike Xiangfan's, but to say he felt absolutely nothing—why then would he persist in pestering him five times over?\\" Zhongqing smiled, \\"The answer is simple. If Pan truly loved Meixiang, he wouldn't insist on making him his 'adopted son.' Being casual friends without any lewd thoughts would suffice. Had Meixiang accepted his silver without yielding any physical joy, I fear Pan would have hated him to the very marrow of his bones. Who heaps insult upon the one they supposedly love? If someone slights me when I have done them no offense, yet I can still forgive them—that is love. When feeling is reduced to crawling inside a miser's chest, Heaven's gate of passion will have to be torn down and rebuilt by a new generation of immortals.\\" Wang Xun clapped his hands in delight. \\"You part the veils of mystery! I see it clearly now. You are truly a transcendent master of passion.\\" He then asked, \\"And what of Duxiang's passion?\\" Zhongqing replied, \\"Duxiang is a grand spendthrift, yet he carries himself with effortless ease and vast tolerance. His love is wide but never promiscuous, his spirit strong but never arrogant. For him, the boundary between self and other dissolves entirely; he is the very host of passion.\\" He continued, \\"Xiao Cixian is like a wild crane or an idle cloud, retaining the habits of a wandering scholar. Yet in moments of stillness, none can match him; one could converse with him all day without weariness—his passion reveals itself in that quiet endurance. Nanxiang is proud of his talent and can be fierce, but where his feelings run earnest, he shows little cruelty, moving as freely as cloud and water. His wit is sharp, yet toward those he favors, he never utters a cruel syllable; his is a devoted passion. Qianzhou resembles you—possessing a mild, thick kindness, preferring to let others wrong him rather than wronging them. As for me, I forget no feeling, yet I spend it rarely. It is easy to begin and hard to end; if I were to throw it about without closure, I would surely drown. It is better to lend my passion out and watch others. Where their feelings crack or block, I lend a little of mine to complete theirs, and in doing so, complete my own. Passion is the world's common treasure; it need not be hoarded for oneself.\\" Wang Xun nodded thoughtfully, \\"That is a vast philosophy, turning all under heaven into one unified feeling and assigning each its proper place. Even sacrificing one's life for duty springs from this same source. At a rough glance, Zhu Jia and Guo Jie lent their passion out in this way. You, my friend, are a knight of passion.\\" Zhongqing waved off the praise, \\"You flatter me undeservedly; natures simply differ. At Duxiang's, I hear much of Young Master Hua. Though we have not met, his generous feeling matches Duxiang's source, though it flows from a different stream. Duxiang honors him greatly. As for Wei Pincai, Feng Zipei, and Pan the Third, they are mere worms devouring the grain of passion. To be near them rots the body, and to follow them rots the heart—they were born to plague decent folk. Then there is Xi Eleven, who ruins actors by trapping them in a wooden barrel. Many have been poisoned by him. Qiguan was caught in it, but broke the barrel through sheer strength, tearing his hands raw; they are still healing. Xi is a true bandit of passion. And your bookworm brother-in-law, along with his counterpart, haven't the faintest idea what feeling is. Their joy and grief are entirely alien to mankind.\\" Wang Xun laughed, \\"Those fools—every vulgar joke belongs to them. Sun Laoda recently gained another brother-in-law, much like Pincai but even duller. He is bound to make a scene.\\""}],"25":[{"paragraph":6,"mentions":1,"tokens":["高卓然"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"华公子是说不来的。平时来往那些人，系有生有熟。席间若有一个道学先生，就使通席不快，所以止请了我们常叙的几位，除高卓然没有回来，此外是史、颜、田、王、梅，分作三席。那晓昨日一齐辞了，可可的这么凑巧，竟一个都不能来。」文泽便问何故，子云道：「庾香旧病又发了。史竹君昨日醉坏了，竟至呕血不能出房。湘帆说是没有会过华公子，不肯来。庸庵为是这两天，他夫人要弄璋了，一步不离伺候","en":"moralist at the table, the whole company would be ill at ease, so I invited only our usual circle. Apart from Gao Zhuoran, who has not yet returned, there were Shi, Yan, Tian, Wang, and Mei — enough for three tables. Who would have expected that yesterday they all declined at once? By sheer coincidence, not a single one could come.\\" Wenze asked why. Ziyun said: \\"Yuxiang's"}],"30":[{"paragraph":4,"mentions":1,"tokens":["高品"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"齐分房，将那一班知名之士回避了一大半。内中除徐子云、史南湘是前科举人，萧次贤是高尚自居，无心问世，只有田春航、高品入场。如子玉、王恂、文泽、仲清等皆遵例回避。子玉在家闷闷不乐，又因琴言杳无音信，内外隔绝，又不能传递消息，几次要去访问聘才，又因华府威严，豪奴气焰。故而子玉不肯前去，只得静坐书斋，闷坐而已。","en":"Cixian, who considered himself above worldly affairs and had no intention of participating, only Tian Chunhang and Gao Pin entered the examination hall. Ziyu, Wang Xun, Wenze, and Zhongqing all withdrew according to the rules. Ziyu stayed at home, brooding unhappily. Moreover, because there was no news from Qinyan and they were completely cut off from each other, unable"}],"31":[{"paragraph":17,"mentions":1,"tokens":["高品"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"为看破，其实情怀未断，犹时一念及，涕泪潸潸，不能自解。十五日到王文辉家一走，王恂、仲清约定明日午刻去望田春航、高品。子玉已吃过了早饭，在书房等候。不多一会，史、颜诸人已到，南湘坐了，与子玉叙谈。仲清、王恂先进内室，见了颜夫人，略坐一坐即出来。喝了一杯茶，即催子玉同走。","en":"Wenhui's home on the fifteenth, where he agreed to accompany Wang Xun and Zhongqing to visit Tian Chunhang and Gao Pin at noon the following day. Ziyu had already eaten breakfast and was waiting in his study. Soon enough, Shi, Yan, and the others arrived. Nanxiang took a seat and chatted with Ziyu, while Zhongqing and Wang Xun proceeded into the inner chambers to greet"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":3,"tokens":["高品"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"外间已套上车，子玉也不换衣服，云儿恐怕寒冷，包上了几件棉衣。上了车，来到春航、高品寓处一问，都已回寓，遂同下车进内，一直走到里面。只听高品一片笑声，夹着些燕语莺声在内。到春航斋中，见苏蕙芳、李玉林在内。高品、春航见了四人进来，不胜欢喜，让坐了，苏、李二相公也都见了。","en":"several layers of cotton garments. They boarded the carriage and headed straight for the residence of Chunhang and Gao Pin. Upon inquiring, they learned that both men had already returned to their quarters, so the group disembarked and walked straight inside. From within, they could hear Gao Pin's boisterous laughter mingled with the delicate, melodic voices of companions."},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":11,"tokens":["高品","卓然"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"略谈了几句，仲清便问闱中的事。春航、高品多属得意。仲清道：「湘帆的文章请教过了，是一定得意的。卓然的文章，快拿出来看看，想来定有出人头地的好处。」高品道：「不好，不好，不必看他。」王恂道：「什么话！就不好也要看看。」南湘道：「这三道题，卓然一定见长，就不看也不妨。」子玉道：「到底看看怎样。","en":"After exchanging a few pleasantries, Zhongqing asked about the civil service examinations. Both Chunhang and Gao Pin seemed quite pleased with their prospects. Zhongqing said, \\"I have already seen Xiangfan's essays, and I am certain of his success. Zhuoran, you must bring out your essays for us to read; I imagine they possess an excellence that towers above the rest.\\""},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":6,"tokens":["高品","卓然"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"前日在华府中，怎样题诗画画等事，细述了一遍，听得众人欢喜。又叫他们念出来，各人赞了一回，尤赞玉林的词更为工妙。高品道：「强将之下自无弱兵。你们看佩仙这首词，外边那些头巾纱帽作得出来么？」子玉道：「果然。就是华公子这几个字也改得好。」又问了琴言几句，玉林、蕙芳也细细说了，子玉又发起怔来。忽然高品的小使进来请他，说有客要会。高品即忙出去，有好一刻工夫尚不进来。南湘道","en":"recite the poems aloud. Everyone offered their praise, singling out Yulin's lyric as the most masterfully crafted. Gao Pin said, \\"Beneath a strong general, there are no weak troops. Looking at Peixian's opening lyric, could those hack scholars in their square caps outside ever produce such work?\\" Ziyu agreed, \\"Indeed. Even Young Master Hua's edits were brilliantly done.\\""},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":3,"tokens":["高品"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"蕙芳道：「难得你们诸公可巧全都在这里，今日我作个东道，请你们何如？」王恂道：「甚好。」高品道：「相公不是要请分子？」蕙芳笑道：「被你猜着了，我真要请分子。」众人当是顽话，都应允了。蕙芳命人到饭庄子上备了一桌菜来，众家人相帮摆好，蕙芳即恭恭敬敬的安了席。众人诧异道：「媚香今日忽庄严如此，想来真要请分子么？」蕙芳应道：「我早说过，几时见相公的","en":"play the host today and invite you all to a feast? What do you say?\\" Wang Xun agreed, \\"That sounds excellent.\\" Gao Pin teased, \\"Xianggong, you aren't going to hit us up for subscription funds, are you?\\" Huifang laughed, \\"You caught me! I truly am seeking subscriptions.\\" They all thought he was merely jesting and readily agreed. Huifang ordered a servant to arrange for"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":1,"tokens":["高品"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"传如何？」蕙芳道：「更好，这原算略节，用不得的。」子玉道：「大文章你们都作了，我们作什么呢？我只好作篇赞罢。」高品道：「赞也很好，我作篇祭文倒沉痛些。」仲清道：「我们何不约齐了他们几个弟子，到黄昏人静后去祭他一祭，并多凑些盘费给他何如？」春航等都说这更好了，蕙芳即叩头谢了，慌得众人齐来扶起。从此人人皆视蕙芳如畏友，连顽笑都不肯了。南湘道：「他定于何日起灵？」蕙芳","en":"claimed the major literary pieces; what is left for me to write? I suppose I can only compose a piece of praise.\\" Gao Pin said, \\"A piece of praise is wonderful, but I shall write a funeral ode, as the tone is far more heavy and mournful.\\" Zhongqing then suggested, \\"Why don't we gather all of his former disciples, and when twilight falls and the streets are quiet, we can"},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":1,"tokens":["高品"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"天井内东边，又有一重小门，进了门有三四间小屋。春航、高品与蕙芳等都在其内，有一个老僧陪着。春航、蕙芳迎将出来。","en":"eastern courtyard, they passed through another small door into a space with three or four small rooms. Chunhang, Gao Pin, Huifang, and their party were inside, accompanied by an old monk. Chunhang and Huifang stepped out to greet them."},{"paragraph":30,"mentions":1,"tokens":["高品"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"锦秋墩去逛罢。」蕙芳即将祭筵就叫在那屋里摆起来。蕙芳上香，素兰奠酒，漱芳执壶，宝珠上菜，桂保焚纸，春航、南湘、高品同行了一个礼，五旦连连叩头代谢。","en":"Shufang held the pitcher, Baozhu arranged the dishes, and Guibao burned the paper offerings. Chunhang, Nanxiang, and Gao Pin bowed respectfully in unison, while the five dans kowtowed repeatedly in solemn gratitude."},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":2,"tokens":["高品"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"亭，四围远眺，数十里城池村落，尽在目前，倒也有趣。春航道：「今日目击荒凉，心殊难受。及到此处，觉得眼界一空。」高品道：「这个锦秋墩，我竟没有到过，竹君想来是游过的了。」南湘道：「我是第一次。我因前日偶见前人有《题锦秋墩》诗，所以知道。大远的路，谁到此间来？」仲清道：「其实也好。天天在热闹地方，也应冷落一回。」南湘道：「这个寿佛寺就冷落够了。剑潭，你说惟清心者能叩","en":"desolation today has left my heart heavy with sorrow. But arriving here, I feel my vision suddenly clear and expand.\\" Gao Pin said, \\"I have actually never been to Brook Autumn Mound before. I assume Zhujun has visited here in the past?\\" Nanxiang replied, \\"This is my first time as well. I only knew of it because I chanced upon an ancient poem titled 'Inscription on Jinqiu Mound'"},{"paragraph":34,"mentions":2,"tokens":["高品","高卓然"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"南湘心中发恶，便痛喝了一大碗酒，对着一带远山舒啸起来，清风四起，林木为摇。高品道：「看你们哭的哭，笑的笑，胸中都有如此块垒，独我高卓然胸中空空洞洞，如无肠国民一般。","en":"out a long, howling cry toward the distant mountains. The wind rose from all sides, violently shaking the trees. Gao Pin said, \\"Look at you all, some weeping and others laughing. Every one of you harbors such heavy burdens in your chest. I, Gao Zhuoran, am the only one with a chest utterly empty, like a citizen of the legendary gutless nation."},{"paragraph":35,"mentions":1,"tokens":["高品"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"啸，不过形狂；\\n阮籍之悲，亦云气馁。古人登高作赋，感慨系焉。我们今日聊且一吟何如？」南湘道：「好，你先起句。」高品道：「悲壮淋漓，莫如填首《贺新凉》，我得了起句在此。」即念道：世事君知否？古今来桑田沧海，不堪回首。高。只有词人清兴好，日日狂歌对酒。史。正秋在断云残柳。","en":"Why don't we improvise some verses today to ease our minds?\\" Nanxiang agreed, \\"A fine idea! You start us off.\\" Gao Pin said, \\"For something truly stirring and mournful, nothing suits better than composing to the tune of 'Hexinliang'. I have the opening lines ready right here.\\" He then chanted aloud:\\n\\n\\"Do you know the ways of the world or not?\\nThrough the ages, seas turn"}],"32":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":6,"tokens":["高品"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，到了初八日方见晴明。场中定于初十日出榜，初九日一早即报起来。凡下场的个个意马心猿，到了这几天，寝食俱废，就是高品、春航亦未能免俗。春航初八日晚上太睡早了，睡不着，重又起来，至高品房中，见高品尚未安睡，二人谈起心事来。春航叹了一口气道：「我的名心原淡，中不中倒也无妨，就是对不住苏媚香，半年期望之心白白孤负了。科名虽不足贵，但古今名士才人，断无不从科名而起。」高品","en":"candidates who had taken the exams were restless; during these days, they lost their appetite and sleep. Even Gao Pin and Chunhang were no exception. On the night of the eighth, Chunhang went to bed too early and couldn't sleep. He got up again and went to Gao Pin's room, finding him still awake, and the two began to share their thoughts. Chunhang sighed and said, \\"I've"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":14,"tokens":["高品","卓然"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"买得几出戏，学他作什么？」胡裁缝尚是啰嗦，好一回才去。已是上灯时候，蕙芳长叹一声，忍不住叫套车到春航处去，先与高品道喜。及到了宏济寺中，却是冷清清的。进内先见了高品的家人，问他，那人答应道：「方才报是报来，我们老爷说恐怕不是，不晓得什么缘故。」蕙芳走到里面，只见高品与春航对坐下棋，照应他坐了，春航便触起心事来，便把棋子一掳，说：「输了，不必下了。」高品也便歇了。","en":"let out a long sigh and couldn't resist calling for a carriage to go to Chunhang's place, first to congratulate Gao Pin. When he arrived at Hongji Temple, it was quiet and desolate. He went in and first saw Gao Pin's servant, and asked him. The servant replied, \\"An announcement did come just now, but our master says he's afraid it's a mistake, we don't know why.\\" Huifang"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":3,"tokens":["高品"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"道：「明早同高老爷报喜的一同来领赏就是了。」众人道：「明日二位老爷不是十吊二十吊的赏，重重的要赏几百吊钱呢。」高品道：「是了，你明日来。」春航乐极了，因高品不放心，也有些疑心起来，恐怕报喜来诳他，只管发怔。蕙芳笑道：「报已报完了二百几十名，人都要疑心，难道人人全是假的么？」仲清道：「不必疑心，此刻已三更天，城门也都开了，叫你管家骑匹快马先看了榜来。我们也不回去，","en":"masters won't be giving out just ten or twenty strings; they'll be giving generous rewards of hundreds of strings.\\" Gao Pin said, \\"That's right, come tomorrow.\\" Chunhang was so happy he was in a daze, but Gao Pin couldn't put his mind at rest, suspecting the news-bringers might be deceiving him, and just sat there blankly. Huifang laughed, \\"Over two hundred names have been"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":7,"tokens":["高品","卓然"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"人畅饮，到底喜多愁少了，猜拳行令，闹到五更以后，看榜的始回，说道：「田老爷是不错，榜上果然第二名。」这一句话把高品唬呆了，急问道：「我怎样？」那人道：「八十一名是叫高品三，年四十岁，江南淮安府山阳县监生。」高品气得发昏，说声：「呸！」那人便拿出《题名录》来，众人细细看了，果无高品在内。蕙芳笑道：「中的人我也不认得，我就晓得这两个，一个是叶茂林的女婿叫作窑子归，这","en":"finally returned, saying, \\"Master Tian is indeed correct; he is the second name on the board.\\" This sentence stunned Gao Pin, who urgently asked, \\"What about me?\\" The man replied, \\"The eighty-first name is someone called Gao Pinsan, forty years old, from Shanyang County, Huai'an Prefecture, Jiangnan, Imperial Academy Student.\\" Gao Pin was so furious he almost fainted, spitting"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":2,"tokens":["高品"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"了南元，十分欢喜。从此春航与文泽、王恂又成了世谊，更加亲爱。惟有孙氏昆仲颇难浃洽，然亦不得不往来，惟淡交而已。高品代枪之银已收清，共得了一千六百金。张仲雨过手，在花处讲定二千四百金，从中扣出去八百金，又索花姓谢仪二百金，也得了千金，自己享用。便从藩经历上加捐了正指挥，即在坊里当起差来。高品已于十月初二日回苏州去了。春航在庙里寂寞，文泽邀至家中，王恂又欲相留，春航","en":"brothers were difficult to get along with, though they had to maintain some interaction, keeping it purely formal. Gao Pin collected the silver for taking the exam as a substitute, receiving a total of one thousand six hundred taels. Zhang Zhongyu, as the middleman, had negotiated two thousand four hundred taels with the Hua family, taking an eight-hundred-tael cut and also"}],"33":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["高品"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"道，南湘随任同行，且到明年会试再来。诸名士、名旦送行，又叙了几日。光阴甚快，不觉又到腊月中旬。且说子玉因南湘、高品出京，又少了两个知己。前月王阁学来对颜夫人说，不是冬底，就是春初，要与子玉毕姻。","en":"for a few days to reminisce. Time flew by, and soon it was the middle of the twelfth month. With Nanxiang and Gao Pin out of the capital, Ziyu found himself missing two close confidants. Last month, Academician Wang of the Grand Secretariat visited Madam Yan, proposing that Ziyu should be married either by the end of winter or early spring."}],"44":[{"paragraph":20,"mentions":1,"tokens":["卓然"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"恐怕遇着那冬烘考官，就要委屈了。殿试工夫，竹君不及湘帆，若试宏词，竹君倒要擅长了。我看今年庾香是必得的，剑潭、卓然也有九分。」子云道：「你自己呢，一发拿得稳了。」次贤道：「也不去考，我自知无福。」子云道：「这叫什么话？你不应举也罢了，还可以说得无心进取。这宏词原是品定海内人才，就是那些老前辈退居林下的，还来应考，岂有全才如你，倒不去的？那时我托人硬把你荐了，由不","en":"examination, Zhujun would have the advantage. My view is that Yuxiang is certain to pass this year, and Jiantan and Zhuoran each have a nine-in-ten chance.\\" \\"And you yourself,\\" said Ziyun, \\"are a foregone conclusion.\\" \\"I am not entering,\\" said Cixian. \\"I know my own lack of fortune in such things.\\" \\"What sort of talk is that?\\" said Ziyun. \\"If you choose not to sit for the"}],"45":[{"paragraph":31,"mentions":1,"tokens":["卓然"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"酒狂词客何纷纷，眼底直欲空人群。\\n举杯渴酌洞庭水，掉头笑看吴山云。\\n文泽道：「这必是竹君、卓然二公了。」众人说道：「正是的，怎么把他二人写得如此活跳，真非仙笔不能。」又见写道：","en":"deep from Dongting's tide,\\nTurn your head, laugh at Mount Wu's clouds wide.\\"\\nWenze said, \\"That must be Zhujun and Zhuoran.\\" Everyone cried out in agreement. \\"How vividly drawn! Only an immortal brush could manage such a feat.\\" Next:"}],"49":[{"paragraph":13,"mentions":1,"tokens":["高品"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"道：「已故翰林院编修颜庄之子名仲清，现任礼部尚书刘大人之子名文泽，内阁学士王大人之子名恂。此外，还有苏州拔贡生高品，湖南优贡生萧次贤。这几位都是名下无虚，与田修撰、史庶常朝夕观摩，是门生往来无间的。其余不知其他，不敢滥举。」苏侯听了，掀髯大笑：「怎么你举的人，多半是我的年侄？你不要阿私所好，叫我听了喜欢。」子云笑道：「这个门生怎敢，至于老师的同年故旧，门生却也不","en":"of the Grand Secretariat Lord Wang, named Xun. In addition, there is the Suzhou specially recommended graduate Gao Pin, and the Hunan honored graduate Xiao Cixian. These gentlemen fully live up to their reputations. They study day and night with Compiler Tian and Bachelor Shi, and I associate with them closely. As for the rest, I do not know them well and dare not recommend"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":2,"tokens":["高卓然","卓然"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"们都是年谊。」南湘道：「原是年伯，但从前却不大往来。」子云道：「闻考宏词定于八月初一日，如今只有两月多了，怎么高卓然还不见来？」春航道：「他连信也没有一封，不知在家做什么，真荒唐极了。」次贤道：「我想卓然必是羁留在什么地方，大约下月总会到来。他在家里是要本省督抚保荐的。」","en":"exam is set for the first day of the eighth month, which is only a little over two months away. Why hasn't Gao Zhuoran arrived yet?\\" Chunhang said, \\"He hasn't even sent a single letter. Who knows what he is doing at home—it's utterly absurd.\\" Cixian surmised, \\"I imagine Zhuoran must be delayed somewhere; he will probably arrive next month. He needs the governor of his"}],"52":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["高品"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说光阴甚快，六月将过，又交七月，高品到了，住在怡园，与南湘同寓在清凉诗境。带了本省抚台的文书，一咨礼部，一咨府尹，保荐应考博学宏词。四方名宿，纷纷渐到。已定于八月初十日开考。","en":"Time flew. The sixth month passed and the seventh began. Gao Pin arrived and took lodging at the Garden of Contentment, sharing the Cool and Tranquil Poetic Realm with Nanxiang. He carried with him his provincial governor's letters of recommendation—one bound for the Ministry of Rites, the other for the prefectural"},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":1,"tokens":["高品"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"陪了这几位在聚星堂观戏，演得是联珠班。春航陪着一班名士在花园挹爽斋观演联锦班。那一天大媒是徐子云，客是萧次贤、高品、南湘、颜仲清、刘文泽、王恂、梅子玉。近日子玉病已好了，勉强打起精神出来。这八个名旦不消说都在园中，那聚星堂上一个也不去，尽是一班中年的脚色，与那些寻常的旦脚，在那里应酬。","en":"watch the Lianjin Troupe. The principal matchmaker that day was Xu Ziyun, and the guests included Xiao Cixian, Gao Pin, Nanxiang, Yan Zhongqing, Liu Wenze, Wang Xun, and Mei Ziyu. Ziyu had only recently recovered from his illness, forcing himself to rally his spirits to attend. Naturally, all eight famous dan actors remained in the garden; not a single one went to the"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":6,"tokens":["高品"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"看戏，一面欢笑，好不高兴。子玉见那些名旦之中，就只少了琴言，触景伤情，颇有一人向隅之惨，众人也都会意。忽不见了高品，子云命书童去找他，找到戏房后头，找着了。见高品在那里教王兰保的戏，兰保点头而笑。高品出来，装出正经样子，连笑话也都不说一句。少顷，王兰保来请点戏，送到子云面前，子云点了一出《乔醋》，高品点了一出《当巾》。《乔醋》唱了，《当巾》却是兰保扮了小生，倒作","en":"agonizing sense of being 'one person alone in a corner.' The others silently understood his melancholy. At one point, Gao Pin suddenly vanished. Ziyun sent a pageboy to search for him, eventually discovering him behind the stage, cheerfully coaching Wang Lanbao on his performance while Lanbao nodded with a smile. When Gao Pin returned, he put on a deeply solemn face, not uttering"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":1,"tokens":["高品"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"仔细一想，便大笑起来。高品只是微笑，众人心里早已明白。又听得兰保唱那《玉抱肚》的曲子道：","en":"After a moment's thought, the entire room erupted in uproarious laughter. Gao Pin merely smiled faintly, for everyone already understood exactly what he was hinting at. Then Lanbao began to sing the aria *Yu Bao Du*:"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":2,"tokens":["高品"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"肠如路，双轮一碾一嗟吁，怎笑倚。\\n兰保唱到此，也要笑了，子云等连声喝采，诸人乱叫起「好」来。春航满面通红，指着高品骂道：「我只道你别过了一年，自然也改恶从善，谁道还是这副歪心肝。」高品道：「这才骂得奇，我又讲了什么？这不是自己栽了筋斗埋怨地皮么？」","en":"laughed. Ziyun and the others shouted their applause, cheering wildly. Chunhang blushed a deep scarlet, pointing at Gao Pin as he cursed, \\"I thought that after a year away, you would naturally have reformed your wicked ways, but who could have guessed you still have that same crooked heart!\\" Gao Pin retorted, \\"Now that is a strange accusation. What did I say? Is this not"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":2,"tokens":["高品"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"华公子又与高品、南湘、仲清、王恂、文泽、次贤各讲了些话，知高品才从苏州来，问了些江苏风景。偶然见素兰的扇子一面画的甚细，要了过来，看了一会。又见那一面写着小楷，题目是《断肠词》。华公子道：「肠何可以轻断？」子玉见了，又觉不安。华公子低低吟了一遍，又问素兰道：「这是","en":"Young Master Hua then conversed with Gao Pin, Nanxiang, Zhongqing, Wang Xun, Wenze, and Cixian. Learning that Gao Pin had just arrived from Suzhou, he asked about the landscapes of Jiangsu. By chance, he noticed Sulan holding a fan with exceedingly delicate painting on one side and asked to look"}],"53":[{"paragraph":15,"mentions":1,"tokens":["高品"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一日，子云正与静宜、南湘、高品闲话，只见书童拿了一包书信进来。子云一看封面，是屈道翁在南京途中寄来的，心中一喜。拆了总封，里头有十几封信与各相好，却都是琴言笔迹，说自己跌坏了膀子不能写，无非是些道谢等语，内有怀怡园诸同人五古一篇，并沿途七律八首。又见琴言另有一封信，子云拆开，内里","en":"One day, Ziyun was chatting idly with Jingyi, Nanxiang, and Gao Pin when a pageboy brought in a bundle of letters. Ziyun looked at the cover and saw it was sent by Qu Daoweng en route from Nanjing. His heart leapt with joy.\\n\\nHe broke the main seal and found over ten letters addressed to various friends—all written in"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":1,"tokens":["高品"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"积恨，恨东流、不接西流水。肠断矣！写此纸。\\n子云等看了大奇，道：「不料玉侬竟能与庾香那首工力悉敌，一样沉痛。」高品道：「玉侬学问几时长的？我去年没有见他能如此。」次贤道：「这是新进长的，不料受乃翁陶熔了几天，就这些进境。若过两年，不知要好到怎样呢！」南湘道：「我只道庾香这首词是绝唱，不能和的，谁又想和出这一首来，我看倒非玉侬不能。」又见另写着一纸道：","en":"great astonishment. \\"Who could have expected Yunong to match Yuxiang's piece in both skill and profound sorrow?\\"\\n\\nGao Pin said, \\"When did Yunong's learning advance so much? I did not see him capable of this last year.\\"\\n\\nCixian said, \\"This is fresh growth; to think that after only a few days of his adoptive father's molding, he has made such progress. In another two years,"}],"54":[{"paragraph":4,"mentions":3,"tokens":["高品"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这三场子玉甚是得意，第一试共有八百人，就贴去了五百，第二场止三百名了，第三场出榜时，只取了六十名。王恂已被落，高品取在四十九，仲清取在二十七，子玉取在第二。另期殿试，子玉文星照命，也占鳌头，共取了三十二名。仲清、高品才高运蹇，皆被落。此科最年轻者就是子玉一人，授了编修之职，颜夫人好不喜欢。正是身经三试，压倒群英，比中状元难得多了。子玉见仲清、高品、王恂等落第，心","en":"cut; after session two, only three hundred remained; after session three, only sixty. Wang Xun was eliminated; Gao Pin placed forty-ninth, Zhongqing twenty-seventh, and Ziyu second. At palace-level final selection, Ziyu's star burned bright: he took top place and, among thirty-two selected, was appointed compiler. Zhongqing and Gao Pin, talented but unlucky, were both"}],"57":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["高品"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"蔼，风不扬尘，小毛衣服都用不着，绵的尽够了。袁绮香一早带了十二红婢，还有几个家人媳妇，先到园里候客。那日次贤、高品、南湘皆回避了。那十二红都是十五六岁，有的已是云鬓堆鸦，有的还是垂髫刷翠，却一样的盈盈秋水，窄窄弓鞋。绮香夫人带了群婢在宝香堂伺候。今日宝香堂另是一番铺设，一色的锦裀绣褥，翠幕银屏，中间堆了七层菊花。","en":"'Red' maids, along with several married serving-women, into the garden to await her guests. On this day, Cixian, Gao Pin, and Nanxiang had tactfully avoided the inner grounds. The twelve Red maids were all about fifteen or sixteen years of age. Some already wore their hair in towering cloud-buns like crows' wings, while others still wore hanging tresses brushed with kingfisher"}],"59":[{"paragraph":22,"mentions":2,"tokens":["高品"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"着人前来等语。子玉不觉泪如泉涌，万箭攒心，毫无主意，也不忍再看。便吩咐套车到怡园找子云，谁知次贤、子云、南湘、高品没有一个在园子里，子玉更加着急。跟班们不知何事，又不敢问子玉，便又到九香楼，进去见诸名旦都在园中，南湘、高品、金粟都在这里。子玉不及叙话，一脸悲愁，就将琴仙给众人之信与他们看了，个个洒泪。再不料琴仙一出京，就遭此大难，真令人意想不到。蕙芳道「如今没有","en":"carriage to take him to the Garden of Contentment to find Ziyun. To his dismay, neither Cixian, Ziyun, Nanxiang, nor Gao Pin were at the garden. Ziyu grew even more frantic. The footmen, unaware of what had happened, didn't dare to ask Ziyu and drove him on to the Nine-Fragrance Tower. Going inside, he found that all the famous dans were gathered in the garden, and Nanxiang,"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":1,"tokens":["高品"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"江南去接玉侬回来，并办道翁葬事。但今年不能到了。」子云即回，要告诉次贤商量此事。子玉也无心在九香楼，便即回家。高品，史南湘金粟与那些名旦，各惆怅无欢。子云回园与次贤说了，次贤更痛得伤心，一夜之间，便摹了道翁神像。明日邀同众名士在九香楼为位而哭，设奠三日。华公子得了信，也来哭奠。一个九香园倒成了屈道翁的丧居了，就没有穿孝的人。","en":"discuss the matter with him. With no heart to remain at the Nine-Fragrance Tower, Ziyu also went straight home. Gao Pin, Shi Nanxiang, Jin Su, and the famous dans were left feeling melancholic and devoid of any joy. When Ziyun returned to the garden and recounted the events to Cixian, Cixian was even more profoundly grief-stricken; over the course of a single night, he"}],"60":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["高品"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说新年已过，又到元宵，六街三市，火树银花，好不热闹。子云于十三日请了华公子、田春航、梅子玉、史南湘、高品、颜仲清、刘文泽、王恂、萧次贤、金粟、屈勤先，并九香园诸人，作一大会。琴仙见了华公子，尚有些不安，华公子也不问起前事，以礼相待。此时琴仙已出了旦党，入了士党，但从前作旦时傲睨一切，此刻倒谦谦自守起来，因此上下诸人更加尊重他，绝没有一个人笑他。琴仙对了","en":"On the thirteenth, Ziyun hosted a grand gathering for Young Master Hua, Tian Chunhang, Mei Ziyu, Shi Nanxiang, Gao Pin, Yan Zhongqing, Liu Wenze, Wang Xun, Xiao Cixian, Jin Su, Qu Qinxian, and the entire company of Nine-Fragrance Garden. Seeing Young Master Hua, Qinxian still felt a trace of unease, yet Hua asked nothing of past affairs, treating him with utmost courtesy."},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":1,"tokens":["高品"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"翁，子玉拈了杜仙女、琴仙，金粟拈了宝珠，春航拈了蕙芳，仲清拈了琪官，文泽拈了春喜，南湘拈了兰保，王恂拈了桂保，高品拈了玉林，次贤拈了漱芳，单拈不着素兰，只好送与华公子去作了。众人分派已定，子玉说道：「做传容易，画画难，还要刻石，更须时日，不知几天可以告成？」吉甫道：「不消多日，碑是磨现成的，一面画，一面就叫季十矮子找人刻，大约十几天是必要的，嵌好这些碑，也要几天","en":"Baozhu; Chunhang drew Huifang; Zhongqing drew Qiguan; Wenze drew Chunxi; Nanxiang drew Lanbao; Wang Xun drew Guibao; Gao Pin drew Yulin; and Cixian drew Shufang. Sulan alone was not drawn, so that assignment was sent to Young Master Hua. The tasks distributed, Ziyu said, \\"Writing biographies is easy, but painting is difficult, and carving stone takes even longer. How many"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":3,"tokens":["高品","高卓然","卓然"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"瘦字倒有些像，别样真令我惭愧死了。」再看第七方画的仙女，在两棵玉树之下，有玉树凌风之致，题的是娟娟花史李仙，是高品的诗。琴仙道：「高卓然肯说好话吗？」玉林道：「这一回倒没有刻薄人。」蕙芳道：「这首诗，算卓然极要好的了。」琴仙看是：","en":"swaying elegance in the wind. The title read: \\"Juanjuan Flower Historian, Immortal Li,\\" accompanied by a poem by Gao Pin. Qinxian asked, \\"Is Gao Zhuoran actually capable of saying nice things?\\" Yulin replied, \\"For once, he hasn't been caustic.\\" Huifang added, \\"For Zhuoran, this poem counts as extremely affectionate.\\" Qinxian read it:"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":4,"tokens":["卓然"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"也不甚好，还有些刻薄，你看帐里梦中等句，有什么好呢？」蕙芳道：「这倒没有什么。不过写的娇艳尊贵处。」宝珠道：「卓然这等诗，就算他的好心了。若要他做庄重些，他也未尝不愿，但他那油嘴油舌说这惯一派。你们看他生平说过几句正经话来？吉甫说他去年到京来有个笑话。卓然有个表叔，请他吃饭，还有好几位客坐在那里，表叔问他道：「你去年回家，见我家里可好么？」卓然道：「很好，前月表","en":"about. He is merely describing your enchanting beauty and noble status.\\" Baozhu added, \\"A poem like this from Zhuoran is as close to good intentions as he gets. If you wanted him to be more solemn, he might not be unwilling, but he is too accustomed to his glib, smooth-talking ways. Think about it—how many serious things has he ever said in his life? Jifu told us a"},{"paragraph":38,"mentions":3,"tokens":["高品"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"便将祝文拿出来。高品道：「好的，我就读起来。」高品高声朗读，诸名士倾耳而听。听得高品读道：","en":"He then brought out the invocation text. Gao Pin said, \\"Very well, I shall read it aloud.\\" Gao Pin read it in a loud, clear voice, while the scholars listened closely. They heard Gao Pin read:"}]}`),"char-11":JSON.parse(`{"6":[{"paragraph":23,"mentions":2,"tokens":["张仲雨"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"与聘才、元茂款接了一番。只见对面楼上来了几个，先是右待郎的少君刘文泽做主，请了史给事的少君史南湘、吴阁学的外甥张仲雨、姑苏名士高品、国子监司业沈公之子沈伯才、天津镇守海口巴总兵之子巴霖，这两位就是孙氏弟兄的妻舅。还有一个本京人，原任江苏知县之子冯子佩，尚未到来。这一班人，子玉除了南湘、文泽之外，恰不认识。这刘文泽字前舟，系中州世家，已得了二品荫生。这人最是和气，性","en":"assembled, hosted by Liu Wenze, son of the Right Vice-Minister. His guests included Shi Nanxiang, son of Censor Shi; Zhang Zhongyu, nephew of Grand Academician Wu; the renowned Suzhou scholar Gao Pin; Shen Bocai, son of Imperial College Director Shen; and Ba Lin, son of Regional Commander Ba, the coastal defender of Tianjin. The latter two were brothers-in-law to the Sun brothers."},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":1,"tokens":["张仲雨"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"四桌。刘文泽道：「都是相好，也不必推让，随意坐最好」。大家都要远着孙氏弟兄，便乱坐起来。刘文泽、沈伯才、巴霖、张仲雨坐了一席；史南湘、颜仲清、高品拉了子玉过来，坐了一席；聘才、元茂坐了一席；嗣徽、嗣元坐了一席，王恂只好两席轮流作陪。孙嗣徽又之乎者也的闹了一会，问了魏、李二位姓名、籍贯。一面就摆上菜喝酒。高品见嗣徽的脸上疙瘩更多了好些，喝了几杯酒，那个红鼻子如经霜辣","en":"to distance themselves from the Sun brothers, everyone scrambled for seats. Liu Wenze, Shen Bocai, Ba Lin, and Zhang Zhongyu claimed one table; Shi Nanxiang, Yan Zhongqing, and Gao Pin pulled Ziyu to a second; Pincai and Yuanmao took a third; leaving Sihui and Siyuan isolated at the fourth, with Wang Xun moving between tables to act as host. Sun Sihui, adopting his pedantic"},{"paragraph":36,"mentions":1,"tokens":["张仲雨"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"席间那个张仲雨与聘才叙起来是亲戚，讲得很投机。聘才又把合席的人都恭维拉拢了一会。子玉又见那些相公，到正席上去劝酒的劝酒，讲话的讲话；颇觉有趣。又见他的舅舅王文辉，分外比人高兴，后又看了一出戏。正席上刘侍郎、梅学士、吴阁学、沈司业先散。子玉见他父亲走了，天也不早，也","en":"At the tables, Zhang Zhongyu and Pincai discovered a shared family connection through marriage and struck up a fast friendship. Pincai dedicated his time to cultivating goodwill, offering compliments to everyone seated nearby. Ziyu watched with quiet amusement as the opera performers"}],"8":[{"paragraph":6,"mentions":12,"tokens":["张仲雨","仲雨"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"见一人走来，对着他点点头，元茂颇觉面善，一时想不起来。那人便走到聘才背后拍一拍肩，说声：「高兴」！聘才回头见是张仲雨，便满面堆下笑来，连忙让坐。问道：「二哥独自一人来，还有人同来的？」仲雨道：「我那里有工夫听戏？清早到锦春园华公府走了一走，出来又到怡园徐二爷处商量件事，遂同起盛银号潘老三在天香楼吃了饭。昨日宏济寺的唐和尚，有件事约我在这里等他。」说罢拿出了玉烟壶，","en":"as he hastily offered his seat. \\"Second Brother!\\" he exclaimed. \\"Are you alone, or did you come with company?\\" Zhang Zhongyu replied, \\"When do I ever have the leisure to watch operas? Early this morning I visited the Hua residence at Jinchun Garden, then went to Master Xu's place at the Garden of Contentment to discuss a matter. Afterward, I dined at Tianxiang Pavilion with"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲雨"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「他叫什么？」仲雨未及回答，那相公急应道：「我叫二喜。」就问：「你能贵姓？」聘才与他说了。又问元茂道：「前日你在苏州会馆听戏，你和孙大少爷说话，你们相好有交情么？」","en":"\\"What is his name?\\" Before Zhongyu could answer, the performer eagerly chimed in, \\"My name is Erxi.\\" He then turned to Pincai, \\"And your honorable surname?\\" Pincai provided his name. Erxi then addressed Yuanmao, \\"The other day at the Suzhou Guild Hall, you were conversing with Young Master"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":2,"tokens":["张仲雨","仲雨"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"露水一般，心里喜欢极了，倒突突的跳，喉咙里痒痒的说不出话来。那相公便坐着不动。换了一出《嫖院》，便又一个相公到张仲雨身边，也坐着不走。聘才问他的名字，叫保珠。台上又换一出《女弹词》，一出场，聘才认得是琪官。看他打扮得十分香艳，颇有花含晓露，月印暗川之致，两边楼上喝采不迭。仲雨道：「这个就是琪官。」聘才点头含笑道：「这琪官比去年更觉好了。「元茂也认不清楚，只与二喜说","en":"leave. The next play, 'Visiting the Courtyard,' commenced, and another performer approached, seating himself beside Zhang Zhongyu and lingering there. Pincai asked his name and learned it was Baozhu. On stage, the scene shifted to 'Female Ballad-Singing.' The moment the actor made his entrance, Pincai recognized Qiguan. His attire was exquisitely alluring, exuding the delicate"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":4,"tokens":["仲雨"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"珠便拉了元茂的手道：「到那个馆子？」聘才看这两个相公。心里不大喜欢，因是元茂花钱，与他无干，乐得热闹热闹，便对仲雨道：「二哥同走罢，我们去饮一杯。」仲雨道：「你们先请，我还要候一候。」聘才道：「同走罢，这时候不来是未必来的了。」便拉了仲雨同下楼来，却忘还了戏钱。看坐的上来拉住四儿道：「慢些走，你们没有给戏钱。」聘才听了，住了步，问元茂，仲雨道」是我的，交代掌柜的","en":"not entirely pleased, but since Yuanmao was footing the bill, he was content to join the revelry. He turned to Zhongyu and invited him, \\"Second Brother, come along! Let us share a few cups.\\" Zhongyu demurred, \\"You go ahead; I still have someone to wait for.\\" Pincai urged, \\"Come with us! If they have not arrived by now, they likely will not come at all.\\" With that, he"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":9,"tokens":["仲雨"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"才出了戏园，两个跟兔的跟着。聘才问仲雨道：「那个馆子好？」仲雨道：「前面的春阳馆就很好。」不多几步，走进了馆子，掌柜的都站了起来，叫声」张老爷，新年好！升官发财。」又作了个揖，仲雨也应酬了几句。拣了个雅座，仲雨首坐，元茂第二，聘才第三，二喜、保珠一凳坐了。走堂的送了茶，便请点菜。仲雨让元","en":"No sooner had they exited the theater than their two young companions fell into step behind them. Pincai asked Zhongyu, \\"Which restaurant is best?\\" Zhongyu replied, \\"The Chunyang Restaurant just ahead is quite excellent.\\" A few short steps brought them inside, where the manager immediately rose to his feet. \\"Master Zhang, a happy New Year to you! May you rise in rank"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲雨"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"来，拿着杯子一瞧，道：「原来这杯酒是干巴巴的，你就这么饮了罢。」二喜就拿杯子送到元茂嘴边，元茂乐极，一饮就干。仲雨、聘才齐声说「好」！保珠道：「这个笑话实在说得有趣。」便也斟了一杯酒，送到聘才嘴边，叫道：「干爸爸饮这杯。」聘才也喜欢，干了。","en":"it is.'\\" With that, Erxi raised his own cup to Yuanmao's lips. Overjoyed, Yuanmao drained it in a single gulp. Zhongyu and Pincai erupted in cheers of \\"Bravo!\\" Baozhu added, \\"That joke was truly delightful.\\" He then poured a cup of wine, brought it to Pincai's lips, and called out affectionately, \\"Godfather, drink this cup.\\" Pincai, highly amused, drank it down."},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":2,"tokens":["仲雨"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"保珠又斟了一杯，送到仲雨面前，也叫了一声干爸爸，仲雨也干了。","en":"Baozhu poured another cup, brought it to Zhongyu, and again called out, \\"Godfather!\\" Zhongyu drank it as well."},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲雨"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，淋淋漓漓，标了一桌。李元茂的脑门子，又痒又辣，便伏在二喜肩上抬不起头。保珠笑得坐不牢，已塌下凳子，坐在地上。仲雨笑的翻了一身酒。聘才笑的腹痛，捧住了肚子。","en":"unable to lift his head. Baozhu laughed so hard he lost his balance, slipping off his stool and onto the floor. Zhongyu laughed until he spilled wine all over himself, while Pincai clutched his aching sides."},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":10,"tokens":["张仲雨","仲雨"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"二喜便斟了酒与张仲雨豁了一拳。仲雨输了，元茂便催仲雨唱。仲雨道：「这不难。」饮了一杯酒，唱了个《马头调》，大家却赞声」好」。第二杯又系仲雨输了，要说笑话。仲雨抬头，见屋子里钉着一个小神龛，供一张赵玄坛骑个黑虎，即对二喜道：「你们见了有钱的老斗，便喜欢道：「财神爷到了，肯","en":"Erxi then poured wine and engaged Zhang Zhongyu in a round. Zhongyu lost, and Yuanmao eagerly demanded a song. \\"That is simple enough,\\" Zhongyu replied. He downed a cup of wine and sang a verse of the 'Horse-Head Tune,' drawing cheers of approval from the group. Zhongyu lost the second round as well,"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲雨"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"我说这皮杯，还去敬李老爷。」二喜又拿着酒对了元茂，元茂道：「好吗，你们今日拿我开心当顽儿，我今番再不上当了。」仲雨道：「李老大，你不吃这一杯，我再编个笑话来骂你。」聘才道：「呸！原来是银样蜡枪头，这么不中用，一说就不敢了。」元茂想道：「说是说不过他们的，管他，天下无难事，只要老面皮，占便宜的，总是好的。」便道：「我倒不像你们这些人，怕害躁，来，来，来！你看我再饮","en":"wine at Yuanmao, who protested, \\"Enough! You have made me your plaything all day. I will not fall for it again.\\" Zhongyu teased, \\"Eldest Brother Li, if you refuse this cup, I shall invent another joke to mock you.\\" Pincai spat in mock disgust, \\"Bah! A silver spearhead made of wax—so useless! One word and he loses his nerve.\\" Yuanmao reasoned internally, \\"I cannot out-talk"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲雨"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这里，我走了七八个戏园子，那一处不寻到？」二喜、保珠见了和尚都请了安，聘才、元茂也站起来招呼。和尚都作了揖，与仲雨一凳坐了。聘才看那和尚相貌，是个紫糖色方脸，两撇浓须，有四十来岁，戴个绒僧帽，穿件宝蓝绸狐皮僧袍，腰拴黄丝绦，足下挖云青缎毛儿窝，也没有出家人的光景，定是酒肉和尚。","en":"greetings, while Pincai and Yuanmao rose to acknowledge him. The monk returned their bows and took a seat beside Zhongyu. Pincai appraised the newcomer: a square face the color of dark sugar, two thick mustaches, perhaps forty years of age. He wore a velvet monk's cap and a sapphire-blue silk robe lined with fox fur, tied at the waist with a yellow silk sash. On his feet"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":2,"tokens":["仲雨"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"但看他倒也和颜悦色，很会张罗。当下即问了聘才、元茂姓名寓处，便对仲雨道：「二老爷，明日事完了，不是姑苏会馆，就是天庆堂，再约上你这两位令友，与这两位相公，咱们高高兴兴乐一天。今日实在不好耽搁，那边人已到齐了，就候你去成事。」仲雨道：「不用忙，你也吃一钟，咱们就走。」那和尚将胡子抹了一抹，嘻着嘴吃了一钟酒，吃了一片火腿","en":"remarkably pleasant and accommodating. After inquiring after Pincai and Yuanmao's names and lodgings, he turned to Zhongyu. \\"Second Master, when tomorrow's affairs are concluded, we shall gather at either the Suzhou Guild Hall or the Tianqing Hall. Bring your two esteemed friends and these two young performers, and we shall enjoy a grand day of revelry. I truly cannot linger"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":6,"tokens":["仲雨"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一样，没有说错呀。」唐和尚见有聘才、元茂在坐，便也假装斯文，缩回手来，说道：「你们糟蹋佛门弟子，是有罪过的。」仲雨、聘才大笑。唐和尚又催仲雨起身，仲雨道：「再略坐片时也不妨。」二喜见壁上挂着一个葫芦，指着问唐和尚道：「这个像什么？」唐和尚笑道：「这个像你的嘴。」二喜道：「不通，不通！怎么说像我的嘴，分明像你的脑袋，光光儿的，一根毛没有。」和尚笑道：「原是光的。你","en":"feigned scholarly dignity, withdrawing his hand. \\"To mock a disciple of the Buddha is a grave sin,\\" he chided. Zhongyu and Pincai burst into laughter. Tang again urged Zhongyu to leave. \\"A brief delay will do no harm,\\" Zhongyu replied. Erxi pointed to a gourd hanging on the wall and asked Tang, \\"What does that resemble?\\" Tang chuckled, \\"It looks just like your mouth.\\""}],"9":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["张仲雨"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"了许顺，借了十吊钱的票子，分作两张，写了一封字，叫四儿送与叶茂林，分给二喜、保珠。后来子玉盘问，聘才、元茂只推张仲雨请去听戏下馆子，却将实情瞒过了。","en":"Ye Maolin to distribute between Erxi and Baozhu. Later, when Ziyu asked, Pincai and Yuanmao simply claimed that Zhang Zhongyu had treated them to opera and a restaurant, keeping the truth concealed."},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":1,"tokens":["张仲雨"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"道：「瑶卿，我记得你还灌我一大碗酒。」众人笑道：「这人醉胡涂了，到底饮了多少酒来？」南湘道：「今日我同高卓然、张仲雨，带了王静芳、李佩仙在酒楼上饮了一天，也不晓得有多少，他们都醉得先走了。我送静芳回去，顺路到庸庵家，问知出外逛灯，我也去逛灯。也不知赶车的什么意思，就拉我到这里，园门口的人说你们在里面赏灯，就扶了我进来。」一面说，就从怀里掏出一团灯谜字条，大家看时：","en":"befuddled from drink. How much did you actually consume in the end?\\" Nanxiang said: \\"Today I went with Gao Zhuoran and Zhang Zhongyu, bringing Wang Jingfang and Li Peixian, and spent the whole day drinking at the winehouse. I do not know how much it was; they all got drunk and left before me. I saw Jingfang home, then dropped by Yong'an's place on the way. Learning he had gone out"}],"13":[{"paragraph":21,"mentions":1,"tokens":["张仲雨"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"原来这张老爷就是张仲雨。这潘老爷叫潘其观，是本京富翁，有百万家财，开了三个银号，两个当铺，又开了一个香料铺，也捐一个六品职衔。原籍山西，在京已住了两代。为人鄙吝龌龊，刻薄顽蠢，又是个色鬼，水陆并行昼夜不倦。却有一个好处，是个怕老婆的都元帅。此刻他续娶的媳妇倒有八九分姿色，","en":"This Master Zhang was none other than Zhang Zhongyu. The Master Pan was Pan Qiguan, a wealthy man of the capital with a vast fortune. He owned three silver houses, two pawnshops, and a spice shop, and had purchased a sixth-rank official title. His family originally hailed from Shanxi but had lived in"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":2,"tokens":["张仲雨","仲雨"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"看中了苏蕙芳。今日拉了张仲雨来，要替他说合。仲雨想：「这蕙芳人品高雅，未必肯跟潘其观。」就支支吾吾不愿作成。经其观再三恳求，许以金帛重谢。只得同来，见景生情罢了。来到蕙芳家内坐下，说了些闲话。","en":"He had set his sights on Su Huifang. Today he had dragged Zhang Zhongyu along to act as a go-between. Zhongyu thought to himself that a person of Huifang's refined character was unlikely to agree to follow Pan Qiguan, so he was evasive and reluctant to help. However, after Pan pleaded with him repeatedly and promised a heavy"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":3,"tokens":["张仲雨","仲雨"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"枝短烟袋，露出半个绿皮烟荷包。淡黄眼珠，红丝缠满，笑瞇嘻的低声下气，装出许多谦温样子。蕙芳无奈，只得坐下陪着。张仲雨看着蕙芳，却像要说话又不说的光景。蕙芳低了头，一回站起来，到窗前看那盆内种的兰花，心上却忆着田春航，又不好回他们出去，无精打采的坐立不安。那潘其观坐着不动，也不开口，眼睛只注着蕙芳。张仲雨道：「咱们也不必找地方，就在这里摆个酒儿，随便弄两样菜不好么？","en":"voice, putting on a grand show of humble warmth. Huifang had no choice but to sit down and keep them company. Zhang Zhongyu kept looking at him with the air of a man about to speak who does not speak. Huifang sat with his head down, then got up and went to the window to look at the orchid in its pot, thinking all the while of Tian Chunhang; but he could not well turn them"},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":1,"tokens":["张仲雨"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"张仲雨心上诧异，暗想道：「这也奇了，不料苏蕙芳倒喜欢潘其观，难道钱可通神，我的财运来了，好发他一注大财。」","en":"Zhang Zhongyu was inwardly astonished. He thought it strange that Su Huifang actually seemed to like Pan Qiguan. He wondered if money truly could move the gods, and rejoiced that his own luck had arrived, anticipating a massive windfall."},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲雨"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一个大钱也不能，只要你肯，我什么都肯。」蕙芳心里已有了主意，对着潘其观把眼一睃，把潘其观的三魂七魄都勾了出来。仲雨也得意洋洋，把指头敲着桌子，不住的喊好。蕙芳道：「潘三爷，你既心上有我，你今日必得畅饮一天，不可藏着量儿。」其观道：「拿大杯来！」","en":"settled by now, and gave Pan Qiguan a sidelong look that drew the three souls and seven spirits clean out of him. Zhongyu was hugely pleased too, drumming his fingers on the table and calling out well done, well done. Huifang said, \\"Third Master Pan, since you have me in your heart, you must drink freely today and keep nothing back.\\" Pan Qiguan called, \\"Bring the big cups!\\""},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":4,"tokens":["仲雨","张仲雨"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「潘三爷，我今日本来要和你饮个成双杯，实在酒量小，不能饮，你饮这双杯。」潘其观点头播脑的饮了。又斟上两杯，对着仲雨道：「张老爷，你也饮个成双杯。」仲雨笑道：「你叫我和谁成双？」蕙芳道：「你和我成双好不好？今日请你先和潘三爷成双。」仲雨把蕙芳额上弹了一弹，道：「我也配？」蕙芳逼着他干，他也就干了。此时潘、张两人的酒，已有了七分，才又吃了两样菜。蕙芳便到房中换了一身","en":"cannot; you drink the pair.\\" Pan Qiguan bobbed his head and drank them off. Huifang poured two more and turned to Zhongyu. \\"Master Zhang, you drink a paired cup too.\\" Zhongyu laughed, \\"And who am I to pair with?\\" Huifang said, \\"Will you pair with me? But today you must pair with Third Master Pan first.\\" Zhongyu flicked Huifang on the forehead. \\"Am I fit for it?\\" Huifang"},{"paragraph":30,"mentions":3,"tokens":["仲雨"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"日我打算出去张罗，偏偏你这财神爷来了．可肯通融一肩？」潘其观道：「要多少？」蕙芳道：「不多，二百两。」潘三目视仲雨，仲雨道：「你瞧，这蕙芳难道只值二百银子，你潘老三就支支吾吾起来。横竖前后一样。」其观停了半晌，向套裤里摸出一个皮帐夹，有一搭钱票，十吊八吊的凑起来。凑了二百吊京钱。递与蕙芳道：「二百吊先拿去使罢。」蕙芳谢了一声，便塞在靴掖子里，又道：「怎么好受了你","en":"you accommodate me?\\" Pan Qiguan said, \\"How much?\\" Huifang said, \\"Not much. Two hundred taels.\\"\\n\\nPan glanced at Zhongyu, and Zhongyu said, \\"Look at that. Is Huifang worth no more than two hundred taels, that Third Pan should start hemming and hawing? It comes to the same thing first or last.\\" Pan waited a good while, then fished a leather note-case out of his leggings"},{"paragraph":31,"mentions":5,"tokens":["仲雨"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"值席的拿了半碗饭来，蕙芳吃了几口，仰着头靠在椅背上，只说不中用，疼得很。仲雨道：「吃青果便可消得。」蕙芳又吃了几个青果，仍说不好。潘三过来，把嘴凑近蕙芳脸上，想要个乖乖，说道：「你张开口待我望望。」蕙芳便把袖子掩了脸道：「这如何望得见？总为着敬你的皮杯。只要你多吃几钟，我就不疼了。」潘三道：「真么？」便饮了一大碗，问道：「可","en":"rice. Huifang ate a few mouthfuls, then leaned his head back against the chair. \\"It is no use. It hurts badly.\\" Zhongyu said, \\"Eat green olives and it will dissolve.\\" Huifang ate a few olives and still said it was no better.\\n\\nPan came over and put his face close to Huifang's, meaning to get a kiss out of it. \\"Open your mouth and let me look.\\" Huifang covered his face"},{"paragraph":34,"mentions":14,"tokens":["张仲雨","仲雨"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"下乱摸，摸着了炕，重新爬上来。心里细细的想，在那里吃的酒。虽在醉中，还被他想着了苏蕙芳，便又在炕上摸索，摸着了张仲雨，便当是蕙芳了，一把搂紧，口里道：「好儿子，好心肝」的叫不绝声，便乱拉乱扯，把棉被早已撩下地了。又把仲雨的衣裳尽力的扯，扯破了一件夹袄，手也酸了；将自己的裤带，用力扯断，倒不将裤子往下脱，只管往上拉，那一条尿裤，已是湿透，连褥子都浸湿了，却拉不下来，","en":"had been drinking. Drunk as he was, he arrived at Su Huifang; and so he groped about the kang, and got hold of Zhang Zhongyu and took him for Huifang, and clutched him tight, calling out, \\"Good boy — sweetheart —\\" without stopping, and hauling and pulling at him until the quilt was long since on the floor.\\n\\nHe tugged at Zhongyu's clothes with all his might until he had torn"},{"paragraph":35,"mentions":6,"tokens":["张仲雨"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"潘其观道：「怎么说，你冒充张仲雨来唬我？」这一场闹。闹醒了一家人，那些打杂的，看门的，都点了灯进来，觉得酒气直冲。上前一照，只见张仲雨站着，脚下踏了棉被，潘其观坐在地上，满面花花绿绿，光着一只脚，将手指着张仲雨。众人见了，忍不住大笑，扶了潘其观起来。张仲雨走近把潘其观一认，潘其观也","en":"Pan Qiguan said, \\"What is this? Are you passing yourself off as Zhang Zhongyu to frighten me?\\" The uproar woke the whole household, and the odd-job men and the gatekeepers came in with lamps, and were met by a wall of wine-stench. Holding the lights up they saw Zhang Zhongyu standing with the quilt under his feet, and Pan Qiguan"},{"paragraph":36,"mentions":3,"tokens":["张仲雨"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"张仲雨道：「这倒难怪他，华公子是惹不得的。」潘其观无可奈何，只可惜了二百吊钱，倒买张仲雨吐了他一脸，打了他一个嘴巴，只好慢慢的日后商量，再作道理，同了张仲雨郁郁而去。","en":"Zhang Zhongyu said that one could hardly blame Huifang for that, as Young Master Hua was not someone to be trifled with. Pan Qiguan had no recourse. He could only bitterly regret the two hundred strings of cash, which had effectively bought him nothing but a face"}],"15":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["张仲雨"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"却说子玉在王恂处谈了半天回家。李先生已经解馆，要张罗盘缠，魏聘才替他拉了一纤。托张仲雨问西客借了一票银子，占了些空头，有二百余金，添补些衣服，也叫了几天相公。李元茂要在京寄籍，性全也只得由他。","en":"tutoring post and needed to arrange travel funds; Wei Pincai had found a financial connection for him, asking Zhang Zhongyu to borrow a draft of silver from Xi Rong, which included a measure of empty credit amounting to over two hundred taels. With this, Master Li supplemented his clothing and also hired young protégés for several days. Li Yuanmao wished to register his household"}],"17":[{"paragraph":31,"mentions":1,"tokens":["张仲雨"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"士并那些名旦都到宝珠新寓来，从午刻起直至子刻止。是日专以行令猜枚，清歌檀板，亦极欢而散。内中子玉因病不到。添了张仲雨，热闹场中最为趋奉的。","en":"clapper-beat, and they dispersed having fully enjoyed themselves. Among them Ziyu did not come owing to illness. Zhang Zhongyu was added to the company, always the most eager to please in a festive scene."}],"18":[{"paragraph":8,"mentions":3,"tokens":["张仲雨","仲雨"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"信步走到伏虎桥边，想起张仲雨住在吴宅，即向门房中一问，却好在家，即请进去坐了。仲雨问了些寒温，吃了一杯茶，略坐了一坐。仲雨道：「老弟如今进城，是难得出城的，何不找个地方坐坐，听出戏解个闷儿。」聘才道：「很好。这两天实也劳乏了，要去就去。」于是二人同了出来，到了戏园拣个地方坐下。","en":"Wandering aimlessly to the edge of the Tiger-Subduing Bridge (Fuhu Qiao), he recalled that Zhang Zhongyu lived at the Wu residence nearby. He asked at the gatehouse and, as luck would have it, Zhongyu was at home and invited him in to sit. After a few pleasantries and a serving of tea, Zhongyu soon spoke: \\"Now that my little brother is in the city, it must"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":5,"tokens":["仲雨"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"仲雨道：「这两个郎舅至亲，天生一对废物，照应他做什么？」是日，这几出戏，觉得陈腐欠新，仲雨坐不住，说道：「去罢！」算给了坐儿钱，与出聘才同上了酒楼，小酌叙谈。仲雨见聘才似乎兴致不佳，不像从前光景，因问道：「听见老弟进了华公府，那里局面宽大，且华公子是爱交","en":"Zhongyu said: \\"Those two brothers-in-law are a pair of born good-for-nothings if ever there was one. What is the point of looking after them?\\" The plays that day felt stale and old-fashioned, making Zhongyu restless enough to say: \\"Let us go.\\" He paid for the"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":6,"tokens":["仲雨"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"聘才道：「那十样呢？」仲雨道：「一团和气，二等才情，三斤酒量，四季衣服，五声音律，六品官衔，七言诗句，八面张罗，九流通透，十分应酬。」聘才摇摇头道：「要这许多？」仲雨道：「底下每句还要加个不字呢！一团和气要不变，二等才情要不露，三斤酒量要不醉，四季衣服要不当，五声音律要不错，","en":"Pincai said: \\"What are the ten qualities?\\" Zhongyu said: \\"A full measure of amiability; a second-tier degree of talent; three jin's capacity for wine; four-seasons appropriate dress; mastery of the five musical scales; an official rank of the sixth grade; skill at the seven-syllable verse; ability to"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲雨"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"打动他的心了。这教做放线雀儿，几十丈线放了出去终究收得回来，只不要可惜小本钱。」聘才点点头道：「承教，随教！」仲雨又道：「譬如你同华公子交接过了，你看他是什么脾气，喜的是什么样，恶的是什么样，自然是顺他意见。","en":"Just don't begrudge the small initial outlay.\\" Pincai nodded and said: \\"I am much obliged and truly grateful!\\" Zhongyu continued: \\"For instance, once you've established a connection with the young master, observe what his temperament is, what pleases him and what he dislikes, and naturally follow his preferences."},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":2,"tokens":["仲雨"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"才，陈平之智，诸葛之谋，也不过如此，能把天下人的性情脾气，如写在手掌中，弟当以门生贴来拜老师，庶可传授心法。」仲雨笑道：「我都与你说了，还拜什么老师？依着做去包管不错，将来有了好处，不要忘了老师，就算你门生的良心了。」说罢彼此又笑，不觉就过了半天。仲雨算清了账同了出来，说道：「老弟，你进城罢。我还有事，不得奉陪。」说罢，拱拱手去了。其时天气尚早，一路行来，远远望","en":"student's card and pay formal respects as a disciple, so that the method of the heart may be properly transmitted.\\" Zhongyu laughed: \\"I've already told you everything. What is there left to bow to a teacher for? Follow what I have said, and it is guaranteed not to go wrong. In the future, if good things come to you, do not forget your teacher. That is all the good conscience"}],"19":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲雨"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说魏聘才自得仲雨传授，依法行之，先于林珊枝面前献尽殷懃，又于八龄班赔尽辛苦。珊枝本系联锦部有名小旦，继进登春班，华公子看中了他，遂以重价买进。后来之八龄班皆系珊枝所教。这林珊枝不消说是音律精通了。魏聘才本是个伶俐人，昆曲唱得绝好，就是吹弹也应酬的上来。更兼旧年一路同","en":"Following Zhongyu's instructions, Pincai put them into practice: he first lavished every effort on winning Lin Shanzhi's favor, and then painstakingly cultivated the goodwill of the Eight Ages. Shanzhi had originally been a celebrated young dan actor in the Lianjin troupe;"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":4,"tokens":["张仲雨","仲雨"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"着实懊恼，意欲收拾蕙芳，又怕他的交游阔大，帮他的人多。二者淫心未断，尚欲再图实在。又心疼这二百吊钱，倒有些疑心张仲雨与蕙芳串通作弄他，就对仲雨唠唠叨叨，说些影射的话。仲雨受了这冤枉，真是无处可伸，便恨起潘三来。他既疑我，我索性坑他一坑，打算要串通蕙芳来算计他。潘三又因保定府城有几间布铺，亲去查点一番，耽搁了两月回来。清闲无事，与老婆闹了几场，受了些闷气，无人可解。","en":"actually get what he wanted. He was also smarting over the two hundred strings of cash, and had begun to suspect that Zhang Zhongyu had colluded with Huifang to make a fool of him, so he made veiled, insinuating remarks to Zhongyu. Zhongyu, having been unjustly blamed, truly had nowhere to air his grievance, and came to resent Pan Qiguan. \\"Since he suspects me anyway, I might as"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":1,"tokens":["张仲雨"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"蕙芳又笑道：「我方才说，三爷是逛惯剃头篷子的，拿我这里当作一样。我听张仲雨说，潘三爷是大方得很的，只要中意那人，不但三百五百，就是一千八百吊都肯。怎么三爷又瞧得中我，你在我面上才花过二百吊钱，马上就要捞本儿。要说二百吊钱，不但三爷看不上，就是我姓苏的也不当事，难道三爷喝一杯酒，听一个曲儿，还不赏个百十吊钱吗？也像那些小本经","en":"used to frequenting the barber's sheds, you're treating my place as just the same kind of thing. I heard from Zhang Zhongyu that Third Master Pan is most generous: if he sets his heart on someone, not only three or five hundred, even one or two thousand strings he'll spend freely. How is it that Third Master also takes a liking to me, yet after spending a mere two hundred"}],"21":[{"paragraph":15,"mentions":1,"tokens":["张仲雨"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"忙，一面招陪他出了门，只道没有事了。谁晓得第二天一早，兵马司就是一枝火签，一条链子，拿掌柜的套了就走。还是求了张仲雨，花了几十吊钱，去讲了情，只打了二十，才放出来；又送了两桌酒席与张二爷。他们说是魏什么才，方才听你骂他，想必就是这个魏聘才了。」琴言道：「管他是不是，横竖叫魏聘才的总不是东西就是了。」因又问道：「那日你同庾香来，遇见我师傅请客。那一回的说话，还没有说","en":"together with a chain. They slipped it round the proprietor and marched him away. In the end he had to appeal to Zhang Zhongyu and spend dozens of strings securing intercession. Even then he received twenty strokes before they released him, and afterward he had to send two banquet tables to Second Master Zhang. They said the culprit was named Wei Something-cai. Hearing you curse"}],"24":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":2,"tokens":["张仲雨","仲雨"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"新闻，你听见没有？」王恂道：「那两天因你弟妹身上不好。我天天候医生，有些照料，没有出门。」仲清道：「我昨日听得张仲雨讲的，有个开银号的潘三，从三月间想买苏蕙芳作干儿子。头一回是拉着张老二同去缠扰媚香，没有法儿，媚香故意殷殷懃勤。待那潘三借了他二百吊钱，听得说要敬他皮杯时，假装鱼骨鲠了喉。后来把他们灌得烂醉，竟到不省人事，却叫他们在客房内同睡。那姓潘的便滚了下来，在","en":"been waiting on the doctor every day and haven't stepped foot outside.\\" Zhongqing leaned in. \\"Just yesterday, Zhang Zhongyu was telling me about a certain Pan the Third, who runs a silver shop. Ever since the third month, he has been badgering Su Huifang, insisting on taking him as an adopted son. At first, he dragged Zhang the Second along to pester Meixiang. Left with no"},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲雨"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"道：「李元茂吃什么呢？」仲清笑道：「李元茂颟颟顸顸，七窍闭塞，要吃大黄、芒硝，方才打得通他这些浊污。」王恂又问仲雨，仲清答道：「在可善可恶之间，尚识好人，天良未昧。」二人刚说得有趣，忽见李玉林同着桂保来，见过了，遂即坐下，因问道：「这两日不见你们出来，在家作些什么？」王恂道：「也常出去的，我倒总不见你们。」桂保道：「我们近日在怡园演习新戏。」仲清道：「什么新戏呢","en":"He needs a heavy dose of rhubarb and mirabilite to purge the muck from his system.\\" Wang Xun then asked about Zhongyu. Zhongqing replied, \\"He hovers somewhere between good and ill. He still recognizes decent folk, so his conscience isn't entirely dead.\\" As they bantered, Li Yulin arrived with Guibao; after exchanging greetings, they took their seats. Zhongqing asked,"}],"25":[{"paragraph":6,"mentions":1,"tokens":["张仲雨"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"是没有会过华公子，不肯来。庸庵为是这两天，他夫人要弄璋了，一步不离伺候。剑潭见诸人不来，也就辞了。昨日只得邀了张仲雨，倒是同华公子相识的。余外就是静宜，共有五人，只有两席。他们没有会过华公子，不晓得是怎么一个富贵骄奢的气概，所以不肯来。你也长见的，其实也不见怎样，不过气势自高，侍从华美而已。","en":"step. Jiantan, seeing that no one else was coming, also sent his regrets. Yesterday I had no choice but to invite Zhang Zhongyu, who does happen to be acquainted with Young Master Hua. Besides him there is only Jingyi — five of us in all, which leaves just two tables. The others have never met Young Master Hua and have no idea what sort of lordly, extravagant manner he cuts,"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":7,"tokens":["张仲雨","仲雨"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，子云道：「静宜因今日新戏出场，内中有些关节，并声律尚有些不谐处，亲自在那里一一指点，少停就来的。」正说之间，张仲雨到了，子云迎接进来，文泽起身相见。见仲雨的服饰，今日与平日不同，往常仲雨是个从九品衔，今日冠服，忽然是个六品，与他一样，想必又加捐了。因问仲雨道：「恭喜！恭喜！几时捐升的？连我都不给一个信，恐怕要吃你的喜酒么！」仲雨笑道：「好，你远远的躲着，恐怕问你","en":"discordant in places, so he is correcting each one himself. He will be along shortly.\\" While they were speaking, Zhang Zhongyu arrived. Ziyun went out to welcome him in, and Wenze rose to greet him. Looking at Zhongyu's attire, Wenze noticed it was different from the usual: formerly Zhongyu had held the humble rank of a vice ninth-grade officer, yet today his cap and robes were"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲雨"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"去不消说是个能员，将来必定名利双收的。」子云笑道：「名利是一定双收，上司一定欢喜，就是百姓吃苦些。」文泽大笑，仲雨也笑道：「这倒被你猜着，若说将来不要钱，就是我自己也不肯作此欺人之语。况且我这个官，原是花了本钱来的，比不得你们这些有福之人，一出书房就得了官。我将来不过看什么钱可要不可要就是了。」说得众人皆笑。次贤即从屏后出来，大家见了，诸名旦也都随着出来见过。大","en":"superiors will certainly be delighted — only the common folk may suffer somewhat.\\" Wenze burst into hearty laughter. Zhongyu too laughed and said: \\"You have guessed exactly right. If I were to claim I would never take a single coin, I myself would be too ashamed to utter such a self-deceiving lie. Besides, this office of mine was purchased with capital — I am not like you"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲雨"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"如蒙颔赏，鄙人愿代诸君浮一大白。」大家笑说：「很好。」酒筵已齐，家人即捧酒来，子云送酒安席。东边是华公子首座，仲雨作陪。西边文泽上座，次贤作陪。子云在华公子席上作主人。","en":"was ready — servants bore jars forward — Ziyun poured and set seats — Young Master Hua held chief east seat with Zhongyu attending; Wenze chief west with Cixian attending; Ziyun played host beside Young Master Hua's table."},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲雨"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"：「我见他举止似乎没熟练，然而秀外慧中，觉有出尘之致。」就点了一出，又将各人的戏也都点了。送到文泽面前，文泽、仲雨、次贤，大家公商点了几出。开了场，加官出来，献上世受国恩」，那林珊枝就走上来，拿出一个赏封望台上一抛，文泽等亦各赏了。","en":"selected a piece for Qinyan and chose plays for all the rest as well. The program was passed to Wenze; Wenze, Zhongyu, and Cixian conferred together and added several more selections. The performance opened with the auspicious prologue, after which the \\"Conferring of Blessings\\" figure appeared, presenting the inscription \\"Generations Blessed by Imperial Grace.\\" Lin"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲雨"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"了几声，吩咐了一句话，珊枝出去了一回，就有十六个人，抬上八张桌子，赏了八十吊钱。主人照样发赏，文泽也赏了八桌，仲雨、次贤各赏了四桌。","en":"bestowed as reward. The host distributed his rewards in the same fashion; Wenze too rewarded eight tables, while Zhongyu and Cixian rewarded four apiece."},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲雨"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"无双，人家唱不来的，可惜偏又雷同。」文泽道：「何不叫他们两人同唱，各尽其妙，做个珠联璧合，岂不更好吗？」次贤、仲雨皆说：「极妙。虽然是工力悉敌，究竟亦有些异同处，亦可借此细细品题。」华公子大笑道：「这倒新鲜有趣，从未有两人同唱的，就是《寻梦》这一出，可以同唱。」子云即传与戏班，在两厢伺候，又命把桌子往上挪了。宝珠、琴言出去上妆。不多一回，听得豪竹哀丝，铮鏦嘹亮。","en":"not pair the two sides and sing together — each perfecting his part — pearls strung on one string?\\" Cixian and Zhongyu both said: \\"Excellent — though evenly matched there will still be shades to savor.\\" Young Master Hua laughed: \\"Fresh — I have never seen two sing the same piece together — even 'Pursuing the Dream' may be doubled.\\" Ziyun relayed orders to the troupe"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":2,"tokens":["仲雨"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"云。子云会意，也自知酒量不敌，便说道：「实在贱量不能多饮，愿将门杯以当大斗罢。」华公子犹不肯依，经次贤、文泽、仲雨都来解劝，说：「非特度香不能，就是我们都也陪不来的，以小杯罚他三杯罢。」华公子也知子云酒量平常，只得依了。众人请子云连饮了三杯，自己却用大杯一杯一杯的不用人让，一连饮了十几杯，尚觉喝采不住，又逼住了文泽饮了三杯，次贤、仲雨饮了五六杯。华公子忽又对着宝","en":"stomach more — let my door cup stand for your great dipper.\\" Young Master Hua still refused until Cixian, Wenze, and Zhongyu mediated: \\"Not only Duxiang — none of us could match those cups — fine him three small cups instead.\\" Knowing Ziyun drank little, Young Master Hua yielded. They made Ziyun drain three cups in succession while he himself, needing no urging, emptied a"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲雨"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"走快了。」子云道：「难得仁弟今日高兴，我早上说的要尽兴，总要至三更四更，今日不要进城了，在此屈一宵罢。况前舟与仲雨皆是城外人，他们是不怕关城的。」华公子见子云留他夜饮，心中甚是乐从，又看这吟秋水榭实在精致，就住一夜亦不妨。忽又听见城外不怕关城之语，心上又有些踌踌躇躇的。","en":"this morning we should revel to third or fourth watch — stay tonight — do not re-enter the city — Qianzhou and Zhongyu live outside the walls — they fear no gate.\\" Hearing both an invitation to lodge and the remark about outsiders needing no gate, Young Master Hua wavered — charmed by the pavilion yet uneasy about staying."},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲雨"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"云道：「他心上犹以为未足，我若认真留他，他就不去了。他那个林珊枝急得什么似的，尽对我做眼色，只怕还有些醋意。」仲雨道：「何消说得。林珊枝不是登春班出身吗，进去了不到三年，如今华公子的事，可以作得一半主呢。」子云命家人取些醒酒丸来，用开水化了，分给众人，吃毕散步一回，酒已消尽。子云命将桌子摆在廊前，上面只点四盏素玻璃灯，两旁两枝的照，重新入席，就猜拳行令起来。","en":"his was frantic past describing, forever making eyes at me — I suspect there was a touch of jealousy in it too.\\" Zhongyu said: \\"That goes without saying. Was not Lin Shanzhi bred up in the Dengchun troupe? Not three years in the household, and already he can settle half of Young Master Hua's affairs.\\" Ziyun had the servants fetch sobering pills, dissolved them in hot water"},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":2,"tokens":["仲雨"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"：「别人说我也罢，就是度香不该。他既知我与庾香相好，今日又讲这些话来，拿我当什么人看待？越想越气，便淌下泪来。仲雨已经醉了，见了琴言如此光景，便冷笑一声，说道：「你这个相公真有些古怪，难道倒赞坏了？人家用尽心费尽力，还巴结不到这一赞呢。」琴言本已有气，正愁没有处发作，听到此便忍不住说道：「我也不要人赞，我也不会巴结人。他就势利大，也是大他的。我不比那会巴结的人，","en":"exactly does he view me?\\" The more he thought, the angrier he grew, until tears finally spilled down his cheeks. Zhongyu was already drunk, and seeing Qinyan in such a state, he let out a cold sneer and said: \\"This actor here is truly peculiar! Could it be that he's been praised so much it's ruined him? Others might exhaust their hearts and strength and still not manage"},{"paragraph":30,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲雨"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云知琴言说话生硬，得罪了仲雨，便解释道：「玉侬今日又吃醉了，瑶卿你同他到那边顽顽，等他醒醒酒再来。」宝珠即拉了琴言到里边去了，劝他道：「你说话太直了，那位张二爷也不是好说话的人。」琴言尚是呜咽。宝珠把华公子所赏之物拿出来与他比了，却小一些儿。那边文泽是绝早过来，已坐了一日，酒已","en":"Ziyun knew Qinyan's blunt words had deeply offended Zhongyu, so he mediated: \\"Yunong has simply drunk too much today — Yaoqing, take him over there to amuse yourselves until the wine wears off, and then come back.\\" Baozhu immediately pulled Qinyan inside and gently chided him: \\"You spoke far too bluntly — that"}],"26":[{"paragraph":14,"mentions":3,"tokens":["张仲雨","仲雨"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"明日早饭后，聘才带了四儿，坐了大鞍车，即出城找着了叶茂林，茂林就搭了聘才的车到长庆处来。劈面遇见了张仲雨，两边停了车，茂林让过一边，等聘才出来说话。仲雨问起聘才，聘才把华公子托他之事说了。仲雨道：「怪不得他前天如此高兴，总赏了一百多金子，又将自己的玉佩，给了琴言、宝珠。」","en":"out of the city to find Ye Maolin. Maolin rode with him to Changqing's residence. Along the way, they ran into Zhang Zhongyu. Both carts halted, and Maolin yielded the right of way as Pincai stepped out to speak. When Zhongyu asked about their errand, Pincai explained the Young Master's commission. \\"No wonder he was so generous the other day,\\" Zhongyu said. \\"He bestowed over"}],"27":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["张仲雨"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"欲想个法子收拾他，叫他总不安神，自然就进府来。聘才没有别法，找了张仲雨一次，也没有见着。打算仍叫赶车的及三小等去闹，但要耽搁几天才好，不然恐被他们看出来。华公子是一时高兴，况且他的声色，享用不尽，自然也不专于一人身上。","en":"peace and had no choice but to enter the mansion. Pincai had no better plan at hand. He went once to look for Zhang Zhongyu, but failed to find him. He intended to send the carter, San Xiao, and the others to make another disturbance, only waiting a few days so that the people at Changqing's would not see the design too plainly. Young Master Hua's favor had been a passing"},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":5,"tokens":["张仲雨","仲雨"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"又叫他奚老土。此人初进京来，尚有一口广东话，不甚清楚，此刻渐渐说起官话来了。他却与两个人往来，且系相好，一个是张仲雨，一个是潘其观。张仲雨是惯向热闹场中走动，帐局子里逢迎，看见奚十一这样浪花浪费，打听得他家的底子，便已结交得很熟。及奚十一银子用完，要拉账的时节，仲雨即向潘三银号内，替他借了一万，本是九扣，仲雨又扣了一千上腰，奚十一实得八千，但要用时，只得依了。如今","en":"barely intelligible, but now he was sliding into mandarin speech. He kept company with two others on good terms: Zhang Zhongyu and Pan Qiguan. Zhongyu haunted the bustling haunts and flattered the account shops. Seeing Xi Eleven's wave-rider spending, he had ferreted out his family's bottom line and befriended him thoroughly. When Xi's silver ran dry and loans were due, Zhongyu"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":2,"tokens":["张仲雨","仲雨"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"闲话休烦。一日张仲雨在奚十一寓所吃早饭，宾主三人叫了两个相公。仲雨是个贪财不贪色的，这些相公面上都是假应酬，不在里头讲究，而奚、姬两位，则舍此别无所好，奚十一更是下作，一饭之间，也要进去两次。从前还只一个，如今又添了巴英官，更比春兰巴结的好。巴英官肌肤虽黑，却光亮滑泽，","en":"Enough of these reports; let us return to the day-to-day life of the household. One day Zhang Zhongyu breakfasted at Xi Eleven's lodgings; the host and two guests summoned two young actors. Zhongyu chased coin, not flesh; in those circles he feigned manners and never indulged truly, while Xi and Ji, without this, had no hobby. Xi Eleven was especially"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":4,"tokens":["仲雨"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"是日饮酒之间，奚十一叫春兰进去了一回，出来坐了一坐；又叫巴英官进去了。仲雨不知其故，只道有事，便与亮轩讲些闲话。这两个相公，一个是蓉官，一个是春林，皆是奚十一常叫的。蓉官对着春林做眼色，春林笑了一笑。亮轩也做眉做眼的，仲雨偶然看见，却不晓得什么，也不便问。蓉官忽问仲雨道：「你能有个相好姓魏的，他初到京时，我就认识他，却不见","en":"Chunlan came back out and sat for a while, but Xi soon called Ba Yingguan in as well; the comings and goings made Zhongyu wonder what business was being conducted behind the inner door. Zhongyu guessed his errands and chatted with Liangxuan. The two actors, Rongguan and Chunlin, were Xi's usual calls. Rongguan signaled Chunlin, and Chunlin smiled. Liangxuan too rolled his"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":5,"tokens":["仲雨"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"仲雨笑道：「这也是外头的议论。若说华府里，田地甚多，我听得有四十几个庄头，一年论租，就抵得一府分的钱漕，自然也算个极豪富的人家了。」亮轩点点头：「我们东家也常提起，说华公子是他的世叔，华公爷是我老东家提台老大人的老师。有这么一个好世交，我们东家竟不拉拢。","en":"Zhongyu laughed. \\"That is the talk outside. Still, the Hua lands run to forty-odd estates, and a year's rent from them would answer for a whole prefecture's grain tax. They are rich enough, certainly.\\" Liangxuan nodded. \\"My patron often speaks of it — that Young"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":3,"tokens":["仲雨"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"奚十一笑了笑，方说道：「有点小事都清理了。」便道：「我方才失陪你们，干几杯罢。」仲雨道：「喝得多了。」奚十一道：「好话，快再干两杯，我们豁几拳罢。」仲雨道：「也好。」奚十一就与仲雨、亮轩、蓉官、春林豁了十拳，起初还叫得清，后来便叫出怪声。广东人豁拳是最难听的，像叫些杀狗杀鸭的字音。","en":"Xi smiled and then said, \\"Small errands—cleared.\\" He added, \\"Sorry to leave you; a few more cups?\\" Zhongyu said, \\"Enough wine.\\" Xi pressed, \\"Good words—two more rounds, and we'll finger-guess.\\" Zhongyu agreed, \\"Fine.\\" Xi guessed ten rounds with Zhongyu, Liangxuan, Rongguan, and Chunlin. At first his calls were distinct and orderly; as the wine mounted, his"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":4,"tokens":["仲雨"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"豁完了拳，讲些闲话，仲雨忽然问奚十一道：「如今有个顶好的相公叫琴言，在秋水堂住，他的师傅叫长庆，你曾见过么？」奚十一道：「没曾见，听是听得说过，是好的。」仲雨正要说时，蓉官道：「好什么？只得两三出戏。你叫他陪酒，终席不说话。\\n要他斟钟酒，是没有的事。」春林道：「好沉架子，到","en":"When the finger-guessing was over and they had fallen to idle talk, Zhongyu suddenly asked Xi Eleven, \\"There's a prime actor called Qinyan lodging at Autumn-Water Hall with his teacher Changqing. Have you met him?\\" Xi replied, \\"Not seen, but heard he's good.\\" Zhongyu was about to say more when Rongguan cut in. \\"Good in what"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":3,"tokens":["仲雨"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"欢他。他师傅曹长庆，也是个古怪脾气，就是一门只爱钱，钱到了手，又不睬人了。」奚十一听了这些话，心上着实不信，对仲雨道：「你停一停，同我去看看，到底怎样？」仲雨道：「别处都去，他那里我不去，况前日我还骂了他。」众人吃了饭，又坐了一回，仲雨告辞去了。两个相公又闹了好一回方去。","en":"odd temper, loves only silver, and with silver in hand, ignores people.\\" Xi refused to believe it and said to Zhongyu, \\"Wait, come with me, and see how it is.\\" Zhongyu replied, \\"I'll go anywhere but there, and the other day I cursed him.\\" They finished the meal and remained seated for a time, but Zhongyu soon took his leave. The two actors stayed behind to make merry"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲雨"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"奚十一过了夜，明日早饭后，想起仲雨所说的琴言这么利害，到底不信，必要去试试。过瘾之后，同了姬亮轩，带了春兰、巴英官，自己换了件新纱衫子，坐了车，叫春兰、巴英官同跨了车沿，亮轩另雇一个车，到秋水堂来。","en":"Xi Eleven spent the night turning Zhongyu's remarks over in his mind. The next morning after breakfast, still unable to believe that Qinyan could be so unapproachable, he resolved to test the matter for himself. After taking opium, along with Ji Liangxuan, Chunlan, and Ba Yingguan, he wore a"}],"30":[{"paragraph":6,"mentions":2,"tokens":["张仲雨","仲雨"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"是日张仲雨一早进来，先在聘才处吃了早饭，与张、顾诸人谈笑了半天。到得午正时候，拉了聘才、林珊枝来逛西园。仲雨从前也不过到过一两处，聘才虽经游过两回，也未全到。","en":"That day, Zhang Zhongyu arrived early. After having breakfast at Pincai's place, he spent half the day chatting and laughing with Zhang, Gu, and the others. Around noon, he pulled Pincai and Lin Shanzhi along to stroll through the West Garden. Zhongyu had only visited one or"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲雨"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"当下仲雨、聘才二人，跟着珊枝，顺着山路径，高低斜曲，穿入一个神仙洞内。从左边上去，几树丹桂，不到十余步，至一带曲廊，作凹字形，罘□轻幕，帘栊半遮。珊枝引入看时，共是七间，两楹如翼外张，中间平厦三间，后面玻璃大窗，逼近池畔。室中陈设华美，署名「归鸿小渚」。下有","en":"Following Shanzhi along a rocky path that rose, dipped, and twisted, Zhongyu and Pincai entered a grotto. They went up on the left, passing a few osmanthus trees. Within a short walk of about ten paces, they reached a curved corridor shaped like a concave 'U', with … light hangings, the blinds half-drawn. When Shanzhi led them"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":3,"tokens":["仲雨"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"室中不染一尘，几案桌椅尽用湘竹凑成，退光漆面。左右两行修竹，几处秋声动人。阑前摆着一张棋桌，放着两个洋漆棋盒，仲雨道：「此间颇为幽静，却洗尽繁华气象。」珊枝道：「公子虽爱热闹，其实也喜清静。」仲雨走下阶来，沿池而行，渡过红桥，对面一个白石平台，雕栏如玉；上面三间平榭，垂了湘帘。进去一看，觉得一片晶光射目，寒侵肌肤，为夏间避暑之地。一切桌凳几案，尽是玻璃面子。两旁","en":"rustling stirring the heart. A chess table was placed in front of the railing, with two foreign-lacquer chess boxes. Zhongyu said, \\"How peaceful it is here—all that ostentatious splendour falls away.\\" Shanzhi replied, \\"Although the Young Master loves liveliness, he actually enjoys tranquility as well.\\" Zhongyu walked down the steps, went along the pond, and crossed the red"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":2,"tokens":["张仲雨","仲雨"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"基深敞，中间靠外是三面阑干，上挂彩幔，下铺绒毯，便是戏台，两边退室通着戏房。宾主重新叙礼，将要坐时，魏聘才同着张仲雨出来。一一相见了礼，遂即叙齿坐下，讲了些寒温，献过了三道茶。只见两个六品服饰的，领着四个人上来，铺设桌面，摆了两席。戏房便作起乐来，随后银盘金碗，玉液琼浆献上来。华公子起身安席，子云、文泽等推让，欲要并作一席，也换个圆桌，华公子执定不肯，遂让次贤首坐","en":"to the backstage. The host and guests exchanged greetings again. Just as they were about to sit, Wei Pincai and Zhang Zhongyu came out. They all greeted each other one by one, and then sat down according to age. After some small talk and three rounds of tea, two men in sixth-rank official attire led four people in to set the tables, arranging two banquets. The musicians backstage"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲雨"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"了。就是从前马湘兰的相貌，也只中等，并有金莲不称之说。」子云道：「湘兰小像我却见过，文采丰韵却是有的。」聘才、仲雨也随声附和，讲了一阵。华公子酒兴便发起来，便劝诸人畅饮了几杯。子云留心今日不见琴言，便问道：「我闻得琴言近在尊府，今日何以不见？」华公子道：「这孩子脾气虽有些古怪，却还老实，如今派在内书房，少刻就出来的。」子云又留心看去，却又不见林珊枝与那八龄班，心","en":"rest.\\" Ziyun replied, \\"I've seen a portrait of Xianglan; she definitely had literary grace and charm.\\" Pincai and Zhongyu echoed their agreement and they discussed it for a while. Young Master Hua's mood for drinking rose, and he urged everyone to drink heartily. Ziyun noticed that Qinyan was nowhere to be seen today, so he asked, \\"I heard that Qinyan is currently at your"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":1,"tokens":["张仲雨"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"他缠住，却不能说。华公子呆呆的看着蕙芳，等着子云说来，文泽见了便道：「待我说罢。」蕙芳对着文泽丢了个眼色，这边张仲雨笑道：「媚香，今日人多嘴杂，你就要掩人的口，也掩不住这许多。」蕙芳道：「要掩人口作什么？我也没有怕说的，你们爱说就说罢。」笑着走到那边来敬文泽。那边宝珠，华公子赏了一杯酒，他吃过谢了。华公子道：「今日这出戏也唱得好，淡装浓抹，各有所宜。」宝珠微笑不言","en":"waiting for Ziyun to explain. Seeing this, Wenze said, \\"Let me tell you.\\" Huifang shot a glance at Wenze, while Zhang Zhongyu laughed, \\"Meixiang, there are too many tongues wagging here today. Even if you could silence one, you couldn't silence them all.\\" Huifang replied, \\"Why would I want to silence anyone? I have nothing to be afraid of; say whatever you like.\\" He smiled"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲雨"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「蕙芳道：「我有什么说的？」仲雨忽然笑道：「你事急，就借着人作护身符，如今你又忘恩负义了。」说得众人不解，蕙芳怔了一怔，脸上不觉红起来。华公子看了，想起前日的话，动了些怜念，料有些隐情不好讲，慢慢的问度香罢了，便倒把别的话支开。当下谈笑间，饮了许多酒，戏唱过了好几出，吃过了两道点心","en":"Huifang said, \\"What do I have to say?\\" Zhongyu suddenly laughed, \\"When you were in a crisis, you used someone as a shield, and now you are being ungrateful.\\" This puzzled everyone. Huifang paused for a moment, his face unwittingly flushing red. Young Master Hua saw this and, recalling what was said"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲雨"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"下去，华公子道：「为何不欢而散？你且说来。」子佩道：「今日和我妻舅归自荣，同到他的妻舅乌大傻家替他婶娘祝寿。」仲雨听了要笑，子云道：「有了乌大傻，自然就不妥了。」文泽点点头道：「这套话倒必定可听，快说罢。」子佩道：","en":"with my brother-in-law Gui Zirong to the house of his brother-in-law Wu Dasha, to celebrate his aunt's birthday.\\" Zhongyu wanted to laugh when he heard this, and Ziyun said, \\"With Wu Dasha there, things naturally wouldn't go well.\\" Wenze nodded, \\"This story is definitely worth hearing; hurry up and tell us.\\" Zipei continued:"},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":4,"tokens":["仲雨","张仲雨"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"头没脑的叫人怎样，只得一哄而散。自荣是不能走的，还有大傻几个至交在那里，我便一直到这里来。」众人听了也都称奇，仲雨道：「我也猜着八分了。这事还是为着归自荣起的，乌大傻不过听了衬戏，吃了镶边酒，便替归自荣担了个苦海的干系。」冯子佩道：「我倒不知，你知是为着什么？」仲雨道：「我也是猜测。我听得人说：乌大傻子造了张假房契，替归自荣借了六百吊钱，听得借主知道了，要告他。","en":"a few of Dasha's close friends stayed behind, so I came straight here.\\" Everyone was amazed upon hearing this. Zhongyu said, \\"I have a pretty good idea what happened. This matter actually stems from Gui Zirong. Wu Dasha was just an extra, caught in the crossfire, and ended up bearing the brunt of Gui Zirong's disaster.\\" Feng Zipei asked, \\"I don't know about that. Do"},{"paragraph":31,"mentions":1,"tokens":["张仲雨"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"张仲雨是更相熟的，就是聘才尚未知道。","en":"Zhang Zhongyu knew him even better; Pincai, however, knew nothing of these affairs."}],"31":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["张仲雨"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"坐到此刻，颇不耐烦。」子云道：「已交十五日的子时，到天明已快，请撤了席，止了戏，大家谈谈，天明我们也要散了。」张仲雨道：「此刻早已开城了，要走也可以走。」华公子道：「忙什么，到辰刻散不迟。」即吩咐撤席止戏，家人整顿茶具，泡好了香茗送来。子云留心不见琴言，但见珊枝靠着屏风有些倦态。华公子查起琴言来，珊枝回道：「他身子不快，睡了。」原来琴言每逢热闹中便触起他心事，就要","en":"Let us clear the feast and stop the opera. We can talk a while longer, and when dawn breaks, we shall disperse.\\" Zhang Zhongyu interjected, \\"The city gates are already open by now; those who wish to leave may do so.\\" Young Master Hua said, \\"What is the rush? Dispersing at the hour of Chen will not be too late.\\" He then ordered the feast cleared and the opera halted, as the servants"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲雨"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"还要斟酌几个字。」蕙芳道：「就请一改。」文泽道：「可改作「想是嫦娥怕孤寂」，诗意较淡远些。」大家都说改的极好。仲雨、聘才暗暗吃惊，不料他们个个如此，向来疑他们有代笔，今日面试，是的确无疑了。惟冯子佩也不来看，桌子上放有一大盘桂花，他便撮了一把，问书童讨了一条红线，自己捏着这一头，叫书童捏着那一头，一朵一朵的堆在线上，顷刻结成了一个大花球。手中轻轻的抛了几抛，走过","en":"silence.' It gives the poetic mood a more remote and ethereal quality.\\" Everyone agreed that the change was excellent. Zhongyu and Pincai were secretly astonished; they never expected such profound talent from all of them. They had previously suspected them of using ghostwriters, but seeing them tested in person today proved beyond a doubt that their skills were genuine. Only"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":1,"tokens":["张仲雨"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"你猜猜。」念道：「惊天动地怒如雷，一去谁知不复来。\\n比似疆场发浩叹，古人征战几时回。」桂保笑道：「也是爆竹。」张仲雨道：「方才嫌子佩的不响，所以他第一句就从响字作出来。」此时晓风飘飘，晨钟已鸣，东方发白，华公子即催兰保舞剑。兰保扎起双袖，掣出青锋，先展个门户，却也抑扬顿挫，满眼生光，到后来竟是一道寒光，连人也看不见了。大家痛赞了一阵。兰保舞完，已是红霞满天，朝曦欲","en":"battlefields,\\nWhen do the warriors of old ever return from war?'\\n\\nGuibao laughed again, \\"That is also a firecracker.\\" Zhang Zhongyu noted, \\"He was just mocking Zipei's riddle for being mute, which is why he made sure his very first line started with a loud noise.\\" By now, the dawn breeze was drifting softly through the air, the morning bells were tolling, and the eastern sky was"}],"32":[{"paragraph":8,"mentions":1,"tokens":["张仲雨"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"罢，名利二字是有一定的。现在你们不比外人，我对你们直讲罢，一千六百两银子卖掉了一个举人，这个杠花就是我中的，是张仲雨的过手，明日就要讨帐去了。」春航、南湘、仲清、蕙芳都埋怨他几句。高品道：「我岂不知此事原作不得，我也有个想头在内，或者今科不当中，或者我竟能名利双收，也未可知。况且我要回南一走，家内有几件大事急于要办，妙手空空的，亦殊难堪。如今倒罢了，虽不能巴结与湘","en":"provincial graduate degree for one thousand six hundred taels of silver. This 'Bier-pole Hua' is the one I sat for. Zhang Zhongyu was the middleman, and tomorrow I will go and collect the money.\\" Chunhang, Nanxiang, Zhongqing, and Huifang all scolded him. Gao Pin said, \\"I know this shouldn't be done, but I had a thought: either I wouldn't pass this time, or I might actually achieve"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":1,"tokens":["张仲雨"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"又成了世谊，更加亲爱。惟有孙氏昆仲颇难浃洽，然亦不得不往来，惟淡交而已。高品代枪之银已收清，共得了一千六百金。张仲雨过手，在花处讲定二千四百金，从中扣出去八百金，又索花姓谢仪二百金，也得了千金，自己享用。便从藩经历上加捐了正指挥，即在坊里当起差来。高品已于十月初二日回苏州去了。春航在庙里寂寞，文泽邀至家中，王恂又欲相留，春航两处时相寄榻。又兼蕙芳照旧相陪，便安心乐","en":"collected the silver for taking the exam as a substitute, receiving a total of one thousand six hundred taels. Zhang Zhongyu, as the middleman, had negotiated two thousand four hundred taels with the Hua family, taking an eight-hundred-tael cut and also demanding a two-hundred-tael 'thank you' fee from the Hua family, thus netting a thousand taels for himself to enjoy. He"}],"33":[{"paragraph":7,"mentions":2,"tokens":["张仲雨","仲雨"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"们真不知魏聘才宿娼，被坊官拿住送交刑部么？」子玉吃了一惊，道：「有这等事！怎么就送刑部呢？」素兰道：「我是听得张仲雨讲的。如今仲雨是正指挥，所以知道这事，已有四五天了。","en":"asked, \\"Such a thing happened! How did it go to the Ministry of Punishments?\\" Sulan replied, \\"I heard it from Zhang Zhongyu. Zhongyu is now a commander, so he knows about this; it happened four or five days ago."},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲雨"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"素兰道：「据仲雨讲，是瞒着华公子，况且又是个假名假姓。大约脸总丢了，也不至有什么大罪。又听说魏聘才新捐了一个从九品，审实了，这功名只怕也革的了。」子玉听了，甚替聘才着急，连说道：「这怎么好！就是我们那位李世兄，也在外边胡闹。夏间去嫖，连衣服都被人剥了。亲友们都知道，","en":"Sulan said, \\"According to Zhongyu, they are keeping it a secret from Young Master Hua, and besides, he used a fake name. It's likely he's just lost face, and it won't amount to a major crime. I also heard Wei Pincai recently purchased a minor official rank; if convicted, that title might"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":1,"tokens":["张仲雨"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"惊不小，急问道：「这话是谁说的？为着什么事，你从何处打听来？」子玉随口说道：「是一个认识的人，就是魏世兄的亲戚张仲雨说的。他也讲得不甚明白，倒像是狎妓饮酒被坊官拿去的。」颜夫人听了，骂了一声：「下作东西！作这些不爱脸的事，如今便怎样呢，难道华府里也不管他吗？」子玉道：「听得魏世兄在城外的日子多，这件事改着个假名假姓，说姓李，大约还瞒着华府里。又有人说，他新捐了个从","en":"\\"Who told you this? What happened, and where did you hear it?\\" Ziyu casually replied, \\"It was an acquaintance, Zhang Zhongyu, a relative of Wei. He wasn't very clear, but it sounds like he was caught drinking with prostitutes by the ward official.\\" Hearing this, Madam Yan cursed, \\"What a despicable creature! Doing such shameless things—what will happen now? Is the Hua family"}],"34":[{"paragraph":22,"mentions":2,"tokens":["张仲雨"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"到了明日，聘才发贴请客，请的是富三爷、贵大爷、奚十一、潘三、张仲雨、杨梅窗。是日辞了两个，贵大爷病了，张仲雨有事不能来。即补了冯子佩、唐和尚，宾主共七位。聘才叫了蓉官来陪富三，着人到篷子里叫了天香、翠官前来。不多一刻，两个剃头的也坐了大骡车，有一个人跟着，走进寺来。冯子佩是认识的，小剃头的先与子佩请了安，然后向聘才","en":"invitations for a gathering. His guests included Master Fu the Third, Gui the Eldest, Xi Eleven, Pan the Third, Zhang Zhongyu, and Yang Meichuang. Two sent their regrets—Gui was ill, and Zhang had other matters to attend to—so Feng Zipei and Monk Tang were brought in to fill their seats, making a total of seven host and guests. Pincai summoned Rongguan to accompany Fu the Third,"}],"36":[{"paragraph":8,"mentions":1,"tokens":["张仲雨"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"宏济寺住，同了奚十一、潘三、杨八一班混账人天天的闹，是什么剃头的，又是什么大和尚、小和尚，开赌宿娼，闹得不像。张仲雨也不与他往来了。」 　　 琴言问起子玉来，宝珠道：「前日我们在怡园叙了一日。」便将前日怎样喝酒，怎样行令，次贤新制的酒壶、杯子都说了，琴言着实羡慕。又说那首诗，度香也刻了，庾香见了怎样思念感伤的神色，一一说给琴言，琴言听了也就感伤起来。蕙芳道：「你既","en":"the Third, and Yang Eight—barbers, monks big and small—gambling and visiting prostitutes. It's a disgrace. Even Zhang Zhongyu no longer associates with him.\\" When Qinyan asked about Ziyu, Baozhu recounted, \\"The day before yesterday, we spent the whole day together at the Garden of Contentment.\\" He described how they drank, played games, and used Cixian's newly designed wine"}],"50":[{"paragraph":22,"mentions":1,"tokens":["张仲雨"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"孙宅去找他，谁知元茂同了他两个舅子下通州赴考去了，只好认了晦气。到出京那几日，一起一起的饯行，潘其观、奚十一、张仲雨、冯子佩、杨梅窗、张笑梅、顾月卿、唐和尚等轮流作饯，唐和尚的庄子好不热闹，聘才又辞了几天行。","en":"up to his departure from the capital, farewell banquets were thrown one after another. Pan Qiguan, Xi Eleven, Zhang Zhongyu, Feng Zipei, Yang Meichuang, Zhang Xiaomei, Gu Yueqing, Monk Tang, and others took turns hosting him. Tang's establishment was exceptionally lively, and Pincai ended up postponing his departure for several more days."}],"52":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["张仲雨"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"在内。这回春航娶亲，贺客纷纷，很为热闹，请酒演戏，内外铺设，也成了个锦天花地。一个蕙芳如何料理得开？子云去请了张仲雨来帮忙，管了账房并指点铺设一切。","en":"into a brocaded wonderland of flowers. How could Huifang possibly manage it all alone? Ziyun therefore invited Zhang Zhongyu to assist, overseeing the accounting room and directing the setup of all affairs."},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":1,"tokens":["仲雨"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"仲雨这些事是最在行的，诸事调度得很有章程。新房内自有苏府的人来铺设。春航的母舅张桐孙已带了家眷往直省候补去了，今奉差来京，也帮着春航张罗。初六那一日有两处戏酒，一处在聚星堂，请的是乡试座师礼部尚书刘守正、座师内阁学士王文辉、会试房师兵部郎中杨方猷，鸿胪寺","en":"Zhongyu was exceptionally adept at such matters, managing every arrangement with methodical precision. Within the bridal chamber, the Su household's own people handled the elaborate preparations. Chunhang's uncle, Zhang Tongsun, who had previously taken his"},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":1,"tokens":["张仲雨"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"苏蕙芳一会儿走了来，又被张仲雨叫了去账房帮忙，倒比别人还忙些。","en":"Su Huifang kept rushing back and forth, but Zhang Zhongyu repeatedly dragged him back to the accounting room to help, leaving him far busier than anyone else."},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":1,"tokens":["张仲雨"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"妆奁到了，挤满了街道，二千名抬夫，也就与出兵一样。只见众家人带领抬夫头儿，纷纷搬运。张仲雨跑过来，跑过去，指这样，说那样。门外人声嘈杂，苏蕙芳发赏封，上号簿，一个人那里打发得开，又叫了兰保、素兰来相帮，足足闹了两三个时辰，尚未清楚。里头许三姐也帮着手忙脚乱，同着那些陪房的摆这样，安那样，闹得一身的汗，一件绸衫子沾住了背心，腰也酸了，脚也疼","en":"coordination of a marching army. The household servants led the porter chiefs, directing the endless transport of goods. Zhang Zhongyu darted back and forth, pointing here, instructing there. Outside, the roar of voices was deafening. Su Huifang distributed reward envelopes and tallied the registry books, but he could scarcely keep pace with the chaos, prompting him to call Lanbao and"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":5,"tokens":["张仲雨","仲雨"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"坐了席，开了戏，那边王文辉、张仲雨进来，在华公子面前张罗了一番。华公子要请仲雨坐席，仲雨道：「今日我竟没有这个福分。」春航谢妆已回，也请仲雨入席，仲雨道：「外面一个媚香，如何照应得来？不可叫他怨我。」便拱拱手走开，指着子云道：「总是你好作成。」笑出去了。王文辉跷起了朝靴，手捋长髯，与","en":"Once they were seated, the opera resumed. Wang Wenhui and Zhang Zhongyu came in, attending to Young Master Hua for a time. Young Master Hua invited Zhongyu to join the banquet, but Zhongyu joked, \\"Today, I simply lack that fortune.\\" Chunhang, having returned from his formal thanks at the Su household, also invited Zhongyu"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":1,"tokens":["张仲雨"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"么顽笑！」周锡爵道：「媚香不要理他，你到这里来，咱们谈谈。」蕙芳到那边席上去打了一转通关，又到这边来打了一转。张仲雨又把蕙芳叫了去了，诸人已坐了一天，到迎亲时刻尚早，也各自暂散。","en":"us chat.\\" Huifang made a round of toasts at their table, then returned to make another round at Wenhui's. Soon, Zhang Zhongyu called him away once more. Having sat for the entire day, and with the bridal procession still some time away, the guests temporarily dispersed."}],"54":[{"paragraph":4,"mentions":1,"tokens":["张仲雨"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"初九日派了几位阅卷大臣，苏候又做了总裁，华公子派了搜捡官，徐子云派了收卷官，刘文泽派了弥封官，张仲雨派了巡逻官。初十日一早入场，首试题目是《拟汉诏》、《拟唐疏》、《五经条解》、《五代南北朝年号考》、《治河策》、《问酌六科则例》《增损盐法利弊》、《正本清源论》八题。二试是《大礼赋》、《大乐赋》、《大搜赋》。三试《拟杜少陵北征诗》、《韩昌黎南山诗》，皆","en":"again chief examiner, Young Master Hua inspection officer, Ziyun receiving officer, Wenze sealing officer, and Zhang Zhongyu patrol officer. On the morning of the tenth they entered the hall. First session had eight questions: *Draft Han Edict*, *Draft Tang Memorial*, *Exegesis of the Five Classics*, *Examination of Era Names from Five Dynasties and North–South*, *Policy on"}],"58":[{"paragraph":4,"mentions":1,"tokens":["张仲雨"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"奚十一叹口气道：「人情势利，早知如此，我若省俭些，非但不欠账，而且还有余，何必要受人这些气！今日若不是唐和尚、张仲雨做保，这潘三准不肯借钱，还要逼还欠账。就是潘三，他也借过我的钱，我何尝要过利钱？不料此时将对扣的帐来借给我，你想，这个交情可叹不可叹。我本来零零碎碎使了他三千银子，他如今加上利钱，就算四千。再借给我二千两做盘缠，就要我写了一万银子的欠票，到江南太爷任","en":"have saved. I'd owe nothing and still have a surplus. Why must I swallow such insults! Today, if Monk Tang and Zhang Zhongyu hadn't stood surety, Pan the Third would never have lent a copper and would have pressed the debt. Pan borrowed from me once. Did I ever charge interest? Now he lends to me at compound rates. Think how touching that friendship is. In bits and pieces"}]}`),"char-12":{6:[{paragraph:23,mentions:2,tokens:["沈伯才"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"几个，先是右待郎的少君刘文泽做主，请了史给事的少君史南湘、吴阁学的外甥张仲雨、姑苏名士高品、国子监司业沈公之子沈伯才、天津镇守海口巴总兵之子巴霖，这两位就是孙氏弟兄的妻舅。还有一个本京人，原任江苏知县之子冯子佩，尚未到来。这一班人，子玉除了南湘、文泽之外，恰不认识。这刘文泽字前舟，系中州世家，已得了二品荫生。这人最是和气，性情阔大，蔼然可亲，尤好结交，与徐子云、华",en:"Nanxiang, son of Censor Shi; Zhang Zhongyu, nephew of Grand Academician Wu; the renowned Suzhou scholar Gao Pin; Shen Bocai, son of Imperial College Director Shen; and Ba Lin, son of Regional Commander Ba, the coastal defender of Tianjin. The latter two were brothers-in-law to the Sun brothers. A native of the capital, Feng Zipei, son of the former Jiangsu county magistrate,"},{paragraph:27,mentions:2,tokens:["沈伯才"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"到。」嗣徽昆仲先到正席上见了礼，然后上楼，众人都笑面相迎。嗣徽举眼一望，见了许多人，便作了一个公揖。见了高品、沈伯才，心中甚是吃惊，暗道：「偏偏今日运气不佳，遇见了这两个冤家。」嗣元见了巴霖，也觉心跳，也与众人见了礼，巴霖勉勉强强，作了半个揖。楼上分了四桌。刘文泽道：「都是相好，也不必推让，随意坐最好」。大家都要远着孙氏弟兄，便乱坐起来。刘文泽、沈伯才、巴霖、张仲",en:'from the crowd. Sweeping his gaze across the room, Sihui offered a general bow. Catching sight of Gao Pin and Shen Bocai, alarm gripped his heart; he thought, "What wretched luck today—running into these two arch-enemies." Siyuan, spotting Ba Lin, felt his stomach drop; he paid his respects, to which Ba Lin responded with a begrudging half-bow. The upper floor was arranged'},{paragraph:28,mentions:3,tokens:["沈伯才","伯才"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"高品对着沈伯才笑道：「天下又红又光的，是什么东西，不准说好的，要说顶脏的东西。」伯才已明白是说嗣徽的鼻子，便笑道：「你且说一个样子来。」高品道：「我说：红而光，腊尽春回狗起阳。」众人忍不住一笑。嗣徽明白，瞪了高品一眼，道：「恶用是硎硎者为哉？鸡鸣狗吠相闻，而达乎四",en:`With a sly grin, Gao Pin turned to Shen Bocai, "In all the world, what thing is both red and shiny? You cannot offer an elegant answer—only the most vulgar thing you can imagine." Bocai instantly understood the allusion to Sihui's nose and smiled, "Give me an example first." Gao Pin replied, "I'll`}]},"char-13":{6:[{paragraph:23,mentions:2,tokens:["巴霖"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"主，请了史给事的少君史南湘、吴阁学的外甥张仲雨、姑苏名士高品、国子监司业沈公之子沈伯才、天津镇守海口巴总兵之子巴霖，这两位就是孙氏弟兄的妻舅。还有一个本京人，原任江苏知县之子冯子佩，尚未到来。这一班人，子玉除了南湘、文泽之外，恰不认识。这刘文泽字前舟，系中州世家，已得了二品荫生。这人最是和气，性情阔大，蔼然可亲，尤好结交，与徐子云、华星北均称莫逆。那个张仲雨是扬",en:"Grand Academician Wu; the renowned Suzhou scholar Gao Pin; Shen Bocai, son of Imperial College Director Shen; and Ba Lin, son of Regional Commander Ba, the coastal defender of Tianjin. The latter two were brothers-in-law to the Sun brothers. A native of the capital, Feng Zipei, son of the former Jiangsu county magistrate, had yet to arrive. Ziyu recognized no one in this"},{paragraph:26,mentions:1,tokens:["巴霖"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"巴霖道：「王大哥，这就是你不该。你既然有三位尊客，就不应请那两个恶客，教人食不下咽，不过看着裙带上的情分罢了。」说得众人大笑。高品道：「最好，最好，我们今日就并在一处，为什么食不下咽？有了「虫蛀千字文」，「叠韵双声谱」，还胜如《汉书》下酒呢。」史南湘道：",en:`Ba Lin chimed in, "Elder Brother Wang, this is where you erred. If you have three honored guests, you shouldn't have invited those two disagreeable ones—they make a man lose his appetite. It is only out of respect for family ties that I endure them." The room`},{paragraph:27,mentions:3,tokens:["巴霖"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"许多人，便作了一个公揖。见了高品、沈伯才，心中甚是吃惊，暗道：「偏偏今日运气不佳，遇见了这两个冤家。」嗣元见了巴霖，也觉心跳，也与众人见了礼，巴霖勉勉强强，作了半个揖。楼上分了四桌。刘文泽道：「都是相好，也不必推让，随意坐最好」。大家都要远着孙氏弟兄，便乱坐起来。刘文泽、沈伯才、巴霖、张仲雨坐了一席；史南湘、颜仲清、高品拉了子玉过来，坐了一席；聘才、元茂坐了一席",en:'gripped his heart; he thought, "What wretched luck today—running into these two arch-enemies." Siyuan, spotting Ba Lin, felt his stomach drop; he paid his respects, to which Ba Lin responded with a begrudging half-bow. The upper floor was arranged with four tables. Liu Wenze said, "We are all friends here—no need for formalities; sit wherever you please." Eager to distance'},{paragraph:28,mentions:1,tokens:["巴霖"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"众人又笑。沈伯才笑道：「我也有一句：红而光，屎急肛门脱痔疮。」众人恐正席上听见，不敢放声，然已忍不住笑声满座。巴霖道：「我也有一句，比你们的说得略要干净些。」即说道：「红而光，酒糟鼻子悬中央。」高品笑道：「不好了，教你说穿了题，以后就没有文章了。」嗣徽道：「好不通。这些东西，有什么红，有什么光？」即说道：「红而光……」便顿住了，再说不出来。",en:`reach the main tables below, the men swallowed their laughter, though muffled sniggers swept through the room. Ba Lin added, "I have one as well—perhaps slightly more respectable than yours: Red and shiny—a wine-blossomed nose hanging dead center on the face." Gao Pin laughed, "No good—you've exposed the subject entirely. Now there's nothing left to say." Sihui interjected,`},{paragraph:29,mentions:4,tokens:["巴霖"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"烘、烘、烘！烧着东西，爆起来哔、哔、哔！剥、剥、剥！人声嘈杂，嘻、嘻、嘻！出、出、出！不是一部《三字经》么？」巴霖道：「孙老二还有两门专经，你们知道没有？」高品笑道：「我倒不晓得他还有专经。」巴霖道：「打手铳，倒溺壶，这两门是他的专经。」众人听他骂得太恶，倒不晓得他有何寓意，便再问他。巴霖道：「也是个三字经，打手统是捋、捋、捋，倒溺壶是别、别、别。」众人大笑。子",en:`People scream in chaos—heehee, heehee, heehee! Out, out, out!' Is that not a complete Three-Character Classic?" Ba Lin interjected, "Old Second Sun has two specialized Classics—do you know them?" Gao Pin laughed, "I had no idea." Ba Lin elaborated, "Firing a hand-gun, and emptying a chamber-pot—these are his two specialized Classics." Uncertain of the vicious implication,`}]},"char-14":JSON.parse(`{"6":[{"paragraph":23,"mentions":1,"tokens":["冯子佩"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子监司业沈公之子沈伯才、天津镇守海口巴总兵之子巴霖，这两位就是孙氏弟兄的妻舅。还有一个本京人，原任江苏知县之子冯子佩，尚未到来。这一班人，子玉除了南湘、文泽之外，恰不认识。这刘文泽字前舟，系中州世家，已得了二品荫生。这人最是和气，性情阔大，蔼然可亲，尤好结交，与徐子云、华星北均称莫逆。那个张仲雨是扬州人，生得俊秀灵警，是进京来赶异路功名的，就住在他舅舅吴阁学家。一","en":"coastal defender of Tianjin. The latter two were brothers-in-law to the Sun brothers. A native of the capital, Feng Zipei, son of the former Jiangsu county magistrate, had yet to arrive. Ziyu recognized no one in this group save for Nanxiang and Wenze. Liu Wenze, courtesy name Qianzhou, hailed from a prominent Zhongzhou family and held a second-rank hereditary title. Known"},{"paragraph":36,"mentions":2,"tokens":["冯子佩"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"业先散。子玉见他父亲走了，天也不早，也要回去。刚起身时，忽见一个美少年上楼来。文泽的家人说道：「冯少爷来了！」冯子佩上前与众人见礼，子玉见他还不过十八九岁，生得貌如美女，十分妩媚。刘文泽道：「人家都要散了，怎么这时候才来？」冯子佩道：「我早上进城到锦春园华府去拜年，原打算不耽搁的。华星北定要拉住吃了饭，又听了他们几出戏，才放我走，还是急急的赶出来的。」子玉同了元茂","en":"beautiful young man suddenly ascended the stairs. Wenze's servant announced, \\"Young Master Feng has arrived!\\" Feng Zipei stepped forward, offering his respects to the room. Ziyu observed that he was merely eighteen or nineteen, possessing a loveliness rivaling that of a beautiful young woman, thoroughly captivating in his presence. Liu Wenze asked, \\"Everyone is about to"}],"15":[{"paragraph":7,"mentions":1,"tokens":["冯子佩"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"先到了文泽处，不在家，去找南湘，恰好文泽的车也到南湘门口。子玉道：「我方才找你。」文泽道：「失候。我去找冯子佩，适值他进城去了。」说着遂一同进去，到南湘书房坐了。伺候南湘的龙儿送了茶道：「我们少爷，这时候还没有起身呢！」说罢进去了，一盏茶时候，见南湘科头赤脚，披着件女棉袄出来道：「你们来得好早。」子玉见了，便笑道：「我吃过了饭才来的。」文泽道：「好模样，拿你","en":"Nanxiang's gate. Ziyu said, \\"I was just looking for you.\\" Wenze said, \\"I missed calling on you earlier. I went to find Feng Zipei, but he had just gone into the city.\\" So saying, they went in together and sat down in Nanxiang's study. Long'er, the attendant who served Nanxiang, brought tea and said, \\"Our young master hasn't got up yet!\\" He then went back inside; about the time"}],"17":[{"paragraph":25,"mentions":2,"tokens":["冯子佩"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"王恂对道：「冯子都非浪得名。迟迟长昼当初夏。」文泽道：「冯子都如今有个冯子佩，倒像弟兄呢。」子云道：「冯子佩原不错，他有一种脾气，他偏不肯在群花堆里取乐。」王兰保冷笑道：「他自然不肯在我们堆里，他见我们还要生气呢。」子玉道：「何故？」桂保接口道：「他有他的心肠。」子玉接道：「绮席花筵日易夜。英华美可咏同车。」二轮又到次贤，遂","en":"fame no empty claim;\\nslowly the long days pass in the early summer.\\"\\n\\nWenze said: \\"Feng Zidu. Nowadays there is a Feng Zipei; they seem like brothers.\\" Ziyun said: \\"Feng Zipei is actually not bad; he has one particular trait: he simply refuses to take pleasure among the flower company.\\" Wang Lanbao said with a cold laugh: \\"Of course he won't join our crowd; he actually gets"}],"19":[{"paragraph":4,"mentions":4,"tokens":["冯子佩","子佩"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一日，打听华公子出门去了，聘才约了张笑梅出城。笑梅要找冯子佩，二人同车即到冯子佩家来。这子佩是与华公子最熟的，已与聘才见过，彼此合式。冯子佩也是个宦家子弟，只因早丧严亲，又积些宦囊，其母钟爱，任凭他游荡歌场，结交豪贵，后来家业渐渐萧条。又亏了几个好友帮扶，所以觉得银钱应手，服御鲜华，其一种娇憨柔媚的情况，却令","en":"that the young master had gone out, Pincai invited Zhang Xiaomei to come out of the city. Xiaomei wanted to find Feng Zipei, so the two shared a carriage straight to Feng Zipei's house. This Zipei was the most familiar with Young Master Hua; he had already met Pincai, and the two hit it off well. Feng Zipei was also the son of an official family, but because he had lost his"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":3,"tokens":["子佩"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这天张、魏两人出来，带着一个小使，到了子佩门口，着小使进去问了。刚好在家，请了进去，到书房坐下。聘才是初次登堂，看那屋子是朝北两间，铺设倒也华丽，就觉得满桌子东西，残书、笔、砚、玩器等物颠颠倒倒乱杂无章。壁间挂些箫管、琵琶，又有刀箭等物。聘才对笑梅说道：「小冯这么一个样儿，怎么屋子里东西，也","en":"That day, Zhang and Wei came out, brought a small page boy, and arrived at Zipei's gate; they had the boy go in to inquire. Fortunately, he was at home and invited them in, leading them to sit in the study. This was Pincai's first visit. Seeing that the room consisted of two north-facing bays and was quite splendidly furnished, he"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子佩"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「正是来给二太爷请安的。」便把子佩脸上闻了一闻，又道：「好香！到不是二太爷，直是个小哥儿。」子佩道：「你又浪，闹得二太爷心上受不得。」聘才在旁大笑，三人厮混一阵，然后坐了，却大家讲不出什么话来。」","en":"\\"Indeed, we have come to pay our respects to Lord Number Two.\\" He then pressed his face close to smell Zipei's cheek and added: \\"So fragrant! You're no Lord Number Two, you're practically a little young master.\\" Zipei said: \\"You're being frivolous again, acting up so that Lord Number Two can hardly bear it.\\" Pincai laughed heartily from the side. The three"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":3,"tokens":["子佩","冯子佩"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"听得门口有人嚷道：「冯老二在家吗？」子佩接着道：「没有在家。」聘才听得声音很熟，只见一个直闯进来，道：「好阿！你在洞里头，还答应不在家。」众人一看，原来是杨梅窗，皆是熟识的，更为热闹了，大家说些无非是游戏欢乐的话。四人商议道：「难道今日说些闲话，就算了事不成，可不辜负了韶光么？」笑梅道：「","en":"From outside came the sound of someone shouting: \\"Is Feng Number Two at home?\\" Zipei answered back: \\"Not at home.\\" Pincai thought the voice sounded very familiar, and then saw someone barge straight in, saying: \\"Well, well! You're hiding in your cave and yet you answer that you're not at home.\\" They all looked and saw it was Yang Meichuang;"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":1,"tokens":["冯子佩"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"走堂的见是四个少年，且认得杨、冯二人，便觉高兴，知道今日热闹的。杨八爷道：「吃什么？」冯子佩对着走堂的道：「你报上来。」走堂的一一报了数十样，四人就点了五六样，先吃起来再说。走堂的先烫上四壶黄酒，一桌果碟儿，遂一样一样摆上来。四人饮了一回，又说些笑话，梅窗道：「咱们就这么算了，叫走堂的也瞧不起，叫个人罢。」聘才是最高兴的，便道：「很好，叫谁","en":"Feng, perked up immediately and knew today would be lively. Master Yang the Eighth said: \\"What shall we eat?\\" Feng Zipei turned to the waiter and said: \\"Recite the menu for us.\\" The waiter recited dozens of dishes one by one, and the four of them ordered five or six items, deciding to start eating first and see about the rest later. The waiter first warmed four pots of"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":4,"tokens":["子佩"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「我叫蓉官罢。」又问子佩，子佩道：「叫了三人，也就热闹。我不叫，我算吃镶边酒罢。」梅窗笑道：「你自己算了相公罢。「子佩听了，含了一口酒，望着梅窗劈面喷来，梅窗一闪，身上却洒了好些。梅窗道：「何必一句话如此着急，必定说着了你的真病。」大家一笑。就将衫子脱下要些烧酒喷了，放在檐","en":"\\"I'll call Rongguan.\\" He then asked Zipei; Zipei said: \\"With three already summoned, that's quite lively enough. I won't call anyone; I'll just drink the 'border-trimming wine.'\\" Meichuang laughed: \\"You might as well be the young protégé yourself.\\" Hearing this, Zipei held a mouthful of wine"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":1,"tokens":["冯子佩"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"闹事，便又问二喜道：「你就说来，大家听听。」二喜道：「有一位广东奚十一老爷，你们相好不相好？」三人说都不相识，冯子佩道：「我会过这人，却不相好，你有话尽说。」二喜道：「这奚老爷是在京候选的，听说带了几万银子进来，要捐一个大官。谁知用动了，就凑不上了，只捐了一个知州。这个人真算个阔手，他一进京先认识登春班春兰，就天天把春兰放在屋里，衣裳、金镯子、热车等类，就不用讲了","en":"Xi the Eleventh from Guangdong; are you gentlemen acquainted with him?\\" The three said they did not know him. Feng Zipei said: \\"I have met this man, but we are not close; speak your mind freely.\\" Erxi said: \\"This Lord Xi is a candidate for office in the capital. I hear he brought tens of thousands of taels of silver with him, intending to purchase a high official post."},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":1,"tokens":["冯子佩"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"得要死，就蹲了下去。」说到此，张、魏二人就大乐起来，说：「该！该！这样东西必有天报。酒又换了，我们共贺一杯。」冯子佩也不言语，杨梅窗道：","en":"him right! Such a thing must have its heaven-sent retribution. More wine; let's all raise a cup to celebrate.\\" Feng Zipei said nothing; Yang Meichuang said:"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":2,"tokens":["冯子佩","子佩"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"说得众人个个大笑称奇。冯子佩道：「这个狗鸡巴蛋的，实在可恨，他不管什么人，当着年轻貌美的，总可以顽得的，他也不瞧自己的样儿。」梅窗笑道：「你这么恨他，莫非看过他的宝贝桶子么？」子佩把梅窗啐了两口。梅窗道：「他这个桶子，咱们京里不知会做不会做？」笑梅笑道：「你也要学样子么？」梅窗","en":"This tale set everyone laughing and marveling at the strangeness of it. Feng Zipei said: \\"That dog-cocked bastard, he really is hateful. He doesn't care who anyone is; if he sees a young good-looking person he thinks they're fair game. And he doesn't even look at himself.\\" Meichuang laughed: \\"You're so indignant. Can it be that you've"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子佩"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"天气将晚，笑梅、聘才皆要进城，只得算了账。梅窗又与二喜说定，明日开发。梅窗让聘才等一同进城，他却住在城外，又到子佩处，两个同吃了一回烟，拉了子佩，到胭脂巷玉天仙家去了。","en":"Meichuang declined to accompany Pincai and the others into the city; since he lived outside the city, he went back to Zipei's place, and the two of them had a smoke of opium together; then Meichuang dragged Zipei off to Yutianxian's house in Rouge Lane."}],"21":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["冯子佩"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"分很好，又因华公子待他有些颜面，银钱又宽展起来，便有些小人得志，就不肯安分了。内有顾月卿、张笑梅，外有杨梅窗、冯子佩一班人朝欢暮乐，所见所闻，无非势力钻营等事，是以渐渐心肥胆大。从前在梅宅有士燮学士在家，虽不来管教他，自然畏惧的。而且子玉所结交的，都是些公子名士，没有那些游荡之人。譬如马困槽枥之中，虽欲泛驾也就不能。此时是任凭所欲，无所忌惮。","en":"triumph and would no longer keep his place. Within were Gu Yueqing and Zhang Xiaomei; outside Yang Meichuang, Feng Zipei, and such company — nightly revelry — and whatever he saw and heard ran to schemes of influence and trimming to power; his heart grew fat and his daring swelled. Formerly at the Mei residence Academician Mei had been at home: though he did not lecture"}],"24":[{"paragraph":3,"mentions":1,"tokens":["冯子佩"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"动，虽未与之谋面，但其豪爽是常听见的。我知其用情阔大，与度香同源异流，所以度香常赞他，也很佩服他。至若魏聘才、冯子佩、潘三等，真可谓情中之蠹，近其人则蠹身，顺其情则蠹心。天生这班人，在正人堆里作崇。还听得有个奚十一，专爱糟蹋相公，有一个木桶哄人，不到手不歇，受其荼毒者不少。前日琪官竟为所骗，幸其性烈，毁其木桶而出，双手竟刮得稀烂，至今尚未全好，此是情中的盗贼。若你","en":"matches Duxiang's source, though it flows from a different stream. Duxiang honors him greatly. As for Wei Pincai, Feng Zipei, and Pan the Third, they are mere worms devouring the grain of passion. To be near them rots the body, and to follow them rots the heart—they were born to plague decent folk. Then there is Xi Eleven, who ruins actors by trapping them in a wooden barrel."}],"26":[{"paragraph":8,"mentions":1,"tokens":["冯子佩"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"是喜欢，所以任凭华公子怎样繁华奢侈，到绝不疑心有别样事来。即如十珠群婢，天天闹在一堆，也绝无妒忌。再如林珊枝、冯子佩等也不过形迹可疑，其实并无干涉，此也是各人情性，不比那奚十一等专讲究这些事情，不在色之好歹。","en":"jealousy. Even with the Ten Pearls tumbling together in his presence daily, she felt no envy. As for Lin Shanzhi and Feng Zipei, they were no more than suspicious appearances, with no real entanglement. After all, everyone's temperament is different, and he was not obsessed with carnal indulgences like Xi Eleven."}],"30":[{"paragraph":22,"mentions":3,"tokens":["冯子佩","子佩"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"道：「缘何三更半夜的才来？」华公子道：「想必关在城里，无歇处了。」候了好一回，才听得脚步声，两盏小明角灯引路，冯子佩抢步上前，与华公子见了礼，又与众人相见了，却也都为熟识。华公子即令其坐在聘才之上，将要问话，子佩便笑道：「好！如此热闹请客，却不来叫我一声，要我闯上门来。」刘文泽道：「恐怕你应酬忙。知道空闲，我早上就带了你来了。」说得众人笑了，子佩也不理会，便把那些","en":"with nowhere to stay.\\" They waited for quite a while before hearing footsteps. Guided by two small horn lanterns, Feng Zipei hurried forward. He greeted Young Master Hua and the others, as they were all acquainted. Young Master Hua seated him above Pincai. Just as he was about to ask him a question, Zipei smiled and said, \\"Great! You have such a lively banquet, yet you didn't"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":3,"tokens":["子佩"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"华公子见他光景饿了，便问道：「你今日在何处？怎么这时候才来？」子佩摇摇头道：「不要说起。」才又吃了一块苹果，接着说道：「绝好一局，弄得不欢而散。」说到此，却又懒说下去，华公子道：「为何不欢而散？你且说来。」子佩道：「今日和我妻舅归自荣，同到他的妻舅乌大傻家替他婶娘祝寿。」仲雨听了要笑，子云道：「有了乌大傻，自然就不","en":"Seeing that he seemed hungry, Young Master Hua asked, \\"Where were you today? Why are you so late?\\" Zipei shook his head, \\"Don't mention it.\\" He ate a piece of apple and continued, \\"It was a perfectly good gathering, but it ended in unhappiness.\\" Having said this, he seemed reluctant to continue. Young Master Hua pressed, \\"Why did it end unhappily? Tell"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子佩"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"兴，与一个姓吕的串了一出《独占》。」文泽道：「归自荣本生得好，就是不该同小老婆另住在城外。听说仍旧窘迫得很。」子佩丢个眼色，文泽不说了，萧次贤冷笑一声，聘才像要说话又不说。","en":"have set up a separate household outside the city with his concubine. I hear he's still very short of money.\\" Zipei shot him a warning glance, and Wenze fell silent. Xiao Cixian gave a cold laugh. Pincai seemed about to speak, but held back."},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子佩"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子佩道：「他们爱串戏罢了，偏又拉上我。」华公子道：「不错，你的戏是唱得最好的，我看比他们还强些。今日串的是什么呢？」子佩道：「和别人串也好，偏偏大傻子死缠住了，要与他唱《活捉》。本来戏名就不吉利，大傻生得又呆又笨，种种不在行，难以尽述，看的人也不住的笑。","en":"Zipei said, \\"They just love acting, but they insisted on dragging me into it.\\" Young Master Hua said, \\"That's true, you are the best at singing; I think you're even better than them. What did you perform today?\\" Zipei replied, \\"Singing with anyone else would"},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":8,"tokens":["冯子佩","子佩"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"雨道：「我也猜着八分了。这事还是为着归自荣起的，乌大傻不过听了衬戏，吃了镶边酒，便替归自荣担了个苦海的干系。」冯子佩道：「我倒不知，你知是为着什么？」仲雨道：「我也是猜测。我听得人说：乌大傻子造了张假房契，替归自荣借了六百吊钱，听得借主知道了，要告他。我想一定是此事了。」冯子佩道：「有点像，钱是归自荣与大傻两个分用的，如今倒是乌大傻一人倒运了。」刘文泽道：「这个乌","en":"Wu Dasha was just an extra, caught in the crossfire, and ended up bearing the brunt of Gui Zirong's disaster.\\" Feng Zipei asked, \\"I don't know about that. Do you know the reason?\\" Zhongyu replied, \\"It's just a guess. I heard someone say that Wu Dasha forged a property deed to borrow six hundred strings of cash for Gui Zirong. The creditor found out and wanted to sue him."},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":6,"tokens":["子佩","冯子佩"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"聘才问道：「你会的是什么？」子佩道：「我会的是：《前诱》、《后诱》、《反诳》、《挑帘》、《裁衣》等戏。」聘才笑道：「也不对，竟唱不来。」华公子身子后边，站着几个八龄班内的，有一个对林珊枝低低说道：「魏师爷何不唱《活捉》，前日不是见他唱过的？」华公子早已听见，便向聘才道：「你何不同他","en":"Pincai asked, \\"What do you know?\\" Zipei replied, \\"I know 'Prior Enticement', 'Later Enticement', 'Counter-Deception', 'Lifting the Curtain', and 'Cutting Cloth'.\\" Pincai laughed, \\"That's not right either; we simply can't perform.\\" Behind Young Master Hua stood a few boys from the Eight-Ages"},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子佩","冯子佩"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"不认识一般。华公子已离席，走到台前，众客亦皆站起静看。华公子道：「奇怪！居然像个好妇人，今日倒要压倒群英了。」子佩听得众人赞他，略有一分羞涩；又见徐子云身旁站着蕙芳、宝珠，见蕙芳看看他，便凑着子云讲些话，又凑着宝珠讲些话；又见宝珠微笑；又见刘文泽与萧次贤站着，在一处彼此俯耳低言，大约是品评他的意思。原来文泽与蕙芳倒不是讲冯子佩，倒讲的是归自荣。","en":"He really does look like a beautiful woman; today he's going to outshine all the beauties.\\" Hearing the praise, Zipei felt a bit bashful. He saw Huifang and Baozhu standing beside Xu Ziyun. Huifang glanced at him, then leaned towards Ziyun to whisper a few words, and then towards Baozhu, who smiled. He also saw Liu Wenze and Xiao Cixian standing together, whispering"},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子佩"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"华公子是不喜与闻这些事情，故不理会，只顾看子佩出神，忽叫斟大杯酒来。家人捧上一个大玉杯，华公子叫送到子云面前。未知子云饮与不饮，且听下回分解。","en":"Young Master Hua disliked hearing about these matters, so he ignored them and simply gazed spellbound at Zipei. Suddenly, he called for a large cup of wine. A servant brought a large jade goblet, and Young Master Hua told him to present it to Ziyun. Whether Ziyun drinks it or not, listen to the next chapter to find out."}],"31":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["子佩"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说华公子看到得意处，把酒来敬子云诸人，合席只得满饮了一杯，共赞聘才、子佩作得出神入妙，非寻常戏脚所能。","en":"the company. The entire table had no choice but to drain their cups in unison, collectively praising Pincai and Zipei for an acting performance so divine and marvelous that it lay far beyond the reach of ordinary theater players."},{"paragraph":2,"mentions":3,"tokens":["子佩","冯子佩"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"少顷，二人下台，子佩便指着文泽骂道：「你是不懂好歹的，我在台上费力，你倒在那里说长道短的批评我。」文泽极口叫冤道：「我何尝批评你，你这般瞎挑眼？我与静宜先生说闲话。」次贤道：「真是讲闲话。况且你唱得如此绝妙，赞不住口，尚何评论之有？」华公子笑道：「我听得他们说，你倒真像","en":"A moment later, the two men stepped down from the stage. Zipei immediately pointed at Wenze and scolded, \\"You really do not know good from bad. I exhausted myself on that stage, yet you sit down here chattering and endlessly picking apart my performance.\\" Wenze cried foul at the top of his lungs, \\"When did I ever"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":2,"tokens":["冯子佩","子佩"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"淡远些。」大家都说改的极好。仲雨、聘才暗暗吃惊，不料他们个个如此，向来疑他们有代笔，今日面试，是的确无疑了。惟冯子佩也不来看，桌子上放有一大盘桂花，他便撮了一把，问书童讨了一条红线，自己捏着这一头，叫书童捏着那一头，一朵一朵的堆在线上，顷刻结成了一个大花球。手中轻轻的抛了几抛，走过来挂在华公子衣襟上。华公子取下闻了一闻，笑道：「你辛辛苦苦的结成，你自己受用罢。」子","en":"ghostwriters, but seeing them tested in person today proved beyond a doubt that their skills were genuine. Only Feng Zipei paid no attention to the literary proceedings. Seeing a large plate heaped with osmanthus blossoms on the table, he gathered a handful, asked a page boy for a red thread, and holding one end while the boy held the other, he began threading the blossoms"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":3,"tokens":["冯子佩","子佩"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"不如赤壁夜游时。」桂保想了一想，笑道：「公子说的，是风花雪月四样，真作得好。」华公子道：「真心灵，一猜就着。」冯子佩道：「我说一个你猜：未用时千包万裹，到用时粉身碎骨。\\n谁知一肚黑心肝，也能撺上云霄里。」桂保笑道：「这是爆竹。」华公子道：「这样不通谜子也要人猜。」子佩道：「何以见得不通？」华公子笑道：「爆竹自然要他响，你这放不响的爆竹要他何用？」众人笑了。聘才道：","en":"Moon. It is truly well-crafted.\\" Young Master Hua praised him, \\"What a sharp mind to guess it on the first try.\\" Feng Zipei piped up, \\"I will tell one for you to guess: Before it is used, it is wrapped in a thousand layers; when it is used, its body is shattered and its bones are broken. Who knew that with a belly full of a black heart, it could still soar into the clouds?\\""},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":2,"tokens":["冯子佩"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云等又将零星玩物，分赏众旦毕，各人同散，华公子直送出穿堂方回。惟冯子佩困乏已甚，已在留青精舍榻上睡了，聘才也自归房，华公子吩咐书童好好伺候冯子佩，一面也进内室。","en":"separate ways. Young Master Hua escorted them all the way out to the main vestibule before turning back. Only Feng Zipei, who was thoroughly exhausted, had already fallen fast asleep on a couch in the Quiet-Green Studio. Pincai also retired to his own room. Young Master Hua instructed the page boys to attend carefully to Feng Zipei, while he himself finally retired to"}],"34":[{"paragraph":15,"mentions":1,"tokens":["冯子佩"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"聘才初一日拜年，初二日听戏，初三日寓里大排筵席，请一班浮浪子弟如冯子佩、杨梅窗、乌大傻等，带了一群下作相公，天天的欢呼畅饮，清曲锣鼓，闹得竹嘈丝杂，酒池肉林，一连五日，方才少息，也去了三百吊钱。到初九日，忽然有人高兴要开赌，劝聘才做头家。聘才自思近来财运颇好，或者可以赢些钱，即于初九日晚上开起赌来。或是摇滩，或是掷骰，","en":"to operas. On the third day, he threw a grand banquet at his lodgings, inviting a crowd of idle dandies—such as Feng Zipei, Yang Meichuang, and Wu Dasha—along with a flock of lowly young male companions. Every day was filled with raucous cheers and heavy drinking, accompanied by the clatter of gongs and pure melodies. It was a chaotic din of silk strings and bamboo flutes,"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":1,"tokens":["冯子佩"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"足足一千两，摇了五十滩，已输了大半。及到清账时输完了，还添出一百余两。是日聘才也输了三百两。唐和尚赢了一百两，冯子佩赢了四百两。","en":"additional hundred-plus taels. Pincai also lost three hundred taels that day. Monk Tang won one hundred taels, and Feng Zipei won four hundred."},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":2,"tokens":["冯子佩","子佩"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"与他饯行。后日是十四，约他出来住一宿。」并对奚十一、潘三道：「奉屈二位来叙一叙，可肯赏脸么？」奚、潘二人应了。冯子佩道：「你倒不请我。」聘才道：「你天天在这里，难道还要下请帖么？」子佩道：「我将梅窗也拉来。」聘才道：「很好。」众赌客算了帐，到五更时各散了，又送了玉天仙回去。","en":"you two gentlemen will deign to join us for a gathering. Will you do me the honor?\\" Xi and Pan both accepted. Feng Zipei chimed in, \\"Yet you don't invite me.\\" Pincai retorted, \\"You're here every day; must I send you a formal invitation?\\" Zipei said, \\"I'll drag Meichuang along as well.\\" Pincai agreed, \\"Very well.\\" The gamblers settled their accounts and dispersed around"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":1,"tokens":["冯子佩"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"冯子佩即与聘才同榻，聘才道：「我看近来好虚名而不讲实际的多。即如华公子、徐度香一班人，挥金如土，是大老官的脾气。但于那些相公，未免过于看得尊贵，当他与自己一样。","en":"Feng Zipei shared Pincai's bed that night. Pincai said, \\"It seems to me that lately there are many who love empty fame and care nothing for substance. Take Young Master Hua, Xu Duxiang, and that set: they scatter gold like dust—the temperament of grand lords indeed."},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":2,"tokens":["冯子佩","子佩"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"老斗的，身分也叫这些书呆子作坏了。他们见了，连个安也不请，说话连个奴才也不称，也要讲究字画琴棋，真真的可恶！」冯子佩道：「可不是，若常这么样，还有谁叫他？难道这许多相公竟靠着徐度香诸公么？一辈子连个有势有利的人都不认得，真是些个胡涂虫。」聘才道：「后日我要叫几个相公，也做个胜会。至于那几个假斯文的，我一概不要。你想想叫谁好？」子佩道：","en":"humble word in conversation, and they must go on about calligraphy, painting, the qin, and chess—truly detestable!\\" Feng Zipei said, \\"Exactly so. If it were always like that, who would still engage them? Surely all these actors cannot live off Xu Duxiang and his gentlemen alone? To pass a whole lifetime without knowing a single man of power or means—they are muddle-headed worms"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":5,"tokens":["子佩"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"。近来有两个人倒很好，叫他也便宜，而且你还可以常使唤他，相貌也与袁宝珠、苏蕙芳相并。」聘才道：「叫什么名字？」子佩道：「一个叫卓天香，一个叫张翠官。」聘才道：「现在那班里？」子佩道：「在整容班。」聘才道：「整容班这班名很生，我竟没有领教过。」子佩道：「是软篷子里小剃头。」聘才笑道：「呸！你怎么说这些人？」子佩道：「你别轻看他，他比相公还红呢！你瞧那得月的脑袋怎样","en":"please. In looks they stand comparison with Yuan Baozhu and Su Huifang.\\" Pincai asked, \\"What are their names?\\" Zipei said, \\"One is called Zhuo Tianxiang, the other Zhang Cuiguan.\\" Pincai asked, \\"Which troupe are they in now?\\" Zipei said, \\"The Zhengrong troupe.\\" Pincai said, \\"The Zhengrong troupe—that name is unfamiliar; I have never had the pleasure.\\" Zipei said, \\"They"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":4,"tokens":["冯子佩","子佩"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"贴请客，请的是富三爷、贵大爷、奚十一、潘三、张仲雨、杨梅窗。是日辞了两个，贵大爷病了，张仲雨有事不能来。即补了冯子佩、唐和尚，宾主共七位。聘才叫了蓉官来陪富三，着人到篷子里叫了天香、翠官前来。不多一刻，两个剃头的也坐了大骡车，有一个人跟着，走进寺来。冯子佩是认识的，小剃头的先与子佩请了安，然后向聘才请安。聘才仔细看他，果然生得俊俏，眉目清澄，肌肤洁白，打扮的式样也","en":"Zhang Zhongyu, and Yang Meichuang. Two sent their regrets—Gui was ill, and Zhang had other matters to attend to—so Feng Zipei and Monk Tang were brought in to fill their seats, making a total of seven host and guests. Pincai summoned Rongguan to accompany Fu the Third, and sent someone to the stall to fetch Tianxiang and Cuiguan. Before long, the two barber boys arrived at"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":2,"tokens":["子佩"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"明日一早即来伺候，聘才、子佩方才起来。两个剃头的便问聘才找出梳篦，替他梳发，梳完了又捶了一会。那一个也与子佩梳了，然后吃过早饭，开了烟灯，大家吃烟。富三爷先来，唐和尚见富三爷来了，就带了得月进来。天香、翠官与富三、和尚都请了安。富三却不认识，问他是谁，在那一班的，聘才就说是全福","en":"Early the next morning, they arrived to serve before Pincai and Zipei had even risen. The two barbers asked Pincai to find his combs and began dressing his hair; once finished, they gave him a massage. The other barber did the same for Zipei. After breakfast, the opium lamps were lit, and everyone partook. Fu the Third"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":1,"tokens":["冯子佩"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"们的棚子，多会儿发财呢？」富三因接向杨八道：「你要留神呀，不要像乌家的事，看完了找到你门上去。」说罢大家大笑。冯子佩忽然皱了眉说声不好，便到院子里吐起来。慌得大家同来看他。吐了一会，就脸红头晕，满身发热。聘才忙叫他到炕上躺了。躺了一会，越发不好，便要回去。聘才便吩咐套车，自有他跟班的送他回去了。将近点灯时候，聘才即吩咐点灯。聘才新制了一架玻璃灯屏，摆在炕上，画着二","en":"affair, having people chase you down to your doorstep after your reading.\\" The room erupted in laughter. Suddenly, Feng Zipei furrowed his brow, muttered that he felt unwell, and rushed out into the courtyard to vomit. Startled, everyone hurried out to check on him. After retching for a while, his face flushed red, he grew dizzy, and his whole body radiated feverish heat. Pincai"}],"50":[{"paragraph":22,"mentions":1,"tokens":["冯子佩"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"他，谁知元茂同了他两个舅子下通州赴考去了，只好认了晦气。到出京那几日，一起一起的饯行，潘其观、奚十一、张仲雨、冯子佩、杨梅窗、张笑梅、顾月卿、唐和尚等轮流作饯，唐和尚的庄子好不热闹，聘才又辞了几天行。","en":"departure from the capital, farewell banquets were thrown one after another. Pan Qiguan, Xi Eleven, Zhang Zhongyu, Feng Zipei, Yang Meichuang, Zhang Xiaomei, Gu Yueqing, Monk Tang, and others took turns hosting him. Tang's establishment was exceptionally lively, and Pincai ended up postponing his departure for several more days."}]}`),"char-15":JSON.parse(`{"4":[{"paragraph":35,"mentions":1,"tokens":["湘帆"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，有些仙气。」仲清道：「此人是个清狂绝俗，潇洒不羁的人。为何赏识的又是那一班相公，真令人不解。」再看落款是：「湘帆醉笔。」也不知其姓名，因叫店家上来，问他可认得这人。店家答道：「这位老爷是头一回来，方才算账，他们二爷交了现钱去的，倒没有问他姓名住处。」仲清道：「这首词好得很，是个才子之笔，使你蓬荜生辉，你千万留了他，不要涂刮了。」店家答应了下去。春喜道：「这人来","en":"ones he appreciates are that company of young performers. Truly baffling.\\" They then looked at the signature: \\"Xiangfan—written drunk.\\" They could not tell his family name or given name, so they called the restaurant keeper and asked whether he recognized the man. The keeper answered, \\"This lord came here for the first time today. When they settled the bill, his second"}],"12":[{"paragraph":4,"mentions":5,"tokens":["春航","湘帆"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"此书中紧要人。你道是谁？前回书中，萧次贤说有两封情书的灯谜，被人打去了，可惜没有问得这人姓名。原来这人姓田，名春航，号湘帆，年二十三岁。也是金陵人，却寄居扬州。自幼失怙。母张氏，名门世族，淹通经史。二十五岁上生了春航，二十八岁上，春航之父田浩中了进士，即殁于京师。这田夫人苦节抚孤，教养兼任，幸藉其兄张桐孙太守不时周济。这春航的学问，多半得于母教。幼有凤毛之誉，长","en":"solved by someone whose name he had unfortunately failed to ask. This person's surname was Tian, his given name Chunhang, his style Xiangfan, and he was twenty-three years old. Also a native of Jinling, he was residing in Yangzhou. He had lost his father while still young. His mother, née Zhang, came from a distinguished family of long standing and was well versed in the"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"流，胸襟则卓荦潇洒。在庠序时，人就谓其鸡群鹤立。但时运未来，三试不中。娶妻颜氏，德容兼备，是个广文先生之女，与春航琴瑟和谐。","en":"He had a distinguished and imposing appearance — luminous as a jade mountain, clear as autumn water. His disposition was graceful and cultivated; his bearing was outstanding and free. In the school, people said he stood among the crowd like a crane among chickens. But his luck had not yet come — he failed three times in the provincial examinations. He had taken a wife from the Yan family — virtuous and comely, daughter of a district school instructor — and they were harmonious together, like qin and zither in tune."},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":3,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"去年正月内，田夫人见其子困守乡园，终非长策；且当年其夫的同榜进士，如今置身青云者也不少，遂令春航游学京师，命一老家人田安随了。半被出门，先到杭州，后到苏州，两处的年谊故旧，几个当道显贵，共相帮扶。春航在那两处，勾留了半年，诗文著作传抄殆遍。时下谓其可与侯太史、屈大令争名，因此囊橐充盈，黄白满箧。不消说题花载酒，访翠眠香，几至乐而忘返。及接了他太","en":"father's fellow jinshi from the same examination year had by now risen to prominent positions. So she directed Chunhang to go to the capital to pursue his studies, with the old family servant Tian An accompanying him. Departing from home, he first went to Hangzhou, then to Suzhou, where old friends and current acquaintances, as well as several influential officials, all"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":2,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"不好，扎着两条裤腿，插着满头纸花，挺着胸脯，肠肥脑满，粉面油头；吃葱蒜，喝烧刀，热炕暖似阳台，秘戏劳于校猎，把春航女色之心，收拾得干干净净。见唱戏的相公，却好似南边，便专心致力的听戏。又不听昆腔，倒爱听乱弹，因此被几个下作的相公迷住。春航这片情，真似个散钱满地，毫无贯串。且系心慈面热，只要人待得他好，他就将这人当作宝贝一样，断不肯割爱。到京数月，倒也没有干过一件","en":"Mount Wu's mountain terrace, and practiced their secret arts like exhausted hunters after a day's chase — so that Chunhang's appetite for women was thoroughly extinguished. Seeing the young gentleman-actors, who in their way resembled those of the south, he devoted himself wholeheartedly to watching opera. And he did not care for kunqu, but loved luantan, and so was captivated"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":2,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"春航这点囊橐，那里经得大闹，过了年，竟花得干净了。后来就尽当衣服，衣服将要当完，这些相公有些看得出他的光景来，渐渐的与他疏远。这春航是个胸襟阔大的人，却也毫不介意。","en":"What little money Chunhang had could not possibly withstand such wholesale dissipation; by the time the new year passed, it was entirely spent. Afterward he began to pawn clothes one after another; as the clothes dwindled, some of the performers began to sense his circumstances"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"寻乐。他预先存着一个主意，是」财尽而交绝」的一句，若能乐得一天，算一天，实在到水尽山穷时，方肯歇手。此时高品与春航已经认识。","en":"Though Tian An repeatedly remonstrated with him, Chunhang paid no attention and continued finding pleasure in hardship just the same. He had a prior philosophical conviction of his own: \\"When funds are exhausted, friendships dissolve\\" — if he could enjoy himself one more day, he would count that one day gained;"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":3,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"日夕聚在一处，甚为莫逆。高品也常于谑浪之中，寓些规劝之意。春航口虽唯唯，而心实不以为然，倒反要拉了高品出去，高品也应酬了几回。高品现在刑部候补七品小京官，一切车马服饰，外面应酬也就不易，所以不能如春航这样。而且他又不喜欢他那些相公，说他所爱的一班不好，春航不服。及见了李玉林来看高品，那一种娟媚韶秀的丰致，比蓉官","en":"evening and were on the most intimate terms. Gao Pin would often weave words of gentle remonstrance into his banter. Chunhang would mouth his agreement while inwardly dissenting, and would even try to drag Gao Pin out with him; Gao Pin went along a few times. Gao Pin was currently a supplementary seventh-rank minor official at the Ministry of Punishments; keeping up carriages,"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一日，高品过来，适值春航吃饭，青蔬半碟，白饭一盂。","en":"One day Gao Pin came over and happened to find Chunhang at his meal — half a dish of plain vegetables and a bowl of white rice."},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":2,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"苍头小子，侍立两旁。那一个俊俏大跟班早已走了，春航谈笑从容，恬然自适。高品道：「自待如此之薄，而待人又如此之厚，我看你不及小旦多矣。」春航骤然听了，当是高品奚落他，又知他是诙谐惯的，也不介意，问道：「何以见得呢？」高品道：「看你现在的服食起居，那一样及得小旦，何于人有情，于己忘情若此。且吾兄景况，我","en":"manservant and a young boy stood in attendance on either side. The dashing senior manservant had long since departed. Chunhang talked and laughed easily, entirely at his ease. Gao Pin said: \\"You treat yourself so sparingly, yet you treat others with such lavish generosity — I must say you fall far short of the little players in this.\\" Chunhang, hearing this suddenly, thought"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":2,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"春航哑然一笑道：「我始以阁下为达人，今听你这些话，你尚未达。你读二十年书，连性理二字都不解，也来论白道黑，我替你说了。」高品道：「倒要请教。」春航道：「真实无妄便是诚，自诚而明便是性。有一分假处，有一分虚处，便不得谓诚了。」高品道：「自然。难道真实无妄，","en":"Chunhang gave a wordless laugh and said: \\"I used to take you for a man of true understanding. Having heard you now, I see you have not yet attained it. You have read twenty years of books and still do not understand even the two characters 'nature' and 'principle'"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"春航道：「纵横十万里，上下五千年，那有比相公好的东西？不爱相公，这等人也不足比数了。若说爱相公有一分假处，此人便通身是假的。于此而不用吾真，恶乎用吾真？既爱相公有一分虚处，此人便通身是虚的，于此而不用吾实，恶乎用吾实？况性即理，理即天，不安其性，何处索理","en":"Chunhang said: \\"Ranging across ten thousand li in every direction, up and down five thousand years of history — where is there anything finer than these young players? Anyone who does not love them is not worth counting. If there were one part falseness in one's"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":4,"tokens":["春航","田湘帆","湘帆"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"封到荥阳郡公，恐此辈中，竟无▉国夫人。乌巾少年，纵驰名于酒肆。而鹑衣小丐，恐忽饿于花街。窃恐为郑元和所笑耳。」春航笑道：「大丈夫岂与守钱虏同日语？自我得之，自我失之，亦复何憾？」二人正讲得热闹，忽见高品的下人来说：「颜少爷来拜老爷。」高品即出去，到了自己屋里，见了仲清坐下，问有好几日不见，仲清道：「自从灯节逛灯之后，便着了凉，病了好几日，已有半个多月不曾出门，在","en":"find himself starving in the flower streets. I privately fear you may end up laughed at by Zheng Yuanhe himself.\\" Chunhang laughed: \\"Would a true man be spoken of in the same breath as a miser who hoards money? What I gained by myself, I lose by myself — what regret is there in that?\\" The two were deep in their lively exchange when a servant of Gao Pin's came to say: \\"Young"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":1,"tokens":["湘帆"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「这湘帆怎样的人？」高品道：「也是我辈。我去年对你说过的：样样精致，是个精品。如今是样样精光了。」仲清笑问：「怎样？」高品便将他方才的议论，与到京所为的事，一一说了。又道：「此人却真可惜，才貌双全，胸襟阔大，就是爱闹，太无收束。他也是你们金陵人，此时住家扬州","en":"\\"What sort of person is this Xiangfan?\\" Gao Pin said: \\"Also one of our kind. I mentioned him to you last year — exquisite in every way, a truly refined specimen. Nowadays he is exquisite in a different sense — having polished himself clean of everything.\\" Zhongqing smiled and asked: \\"How"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"。」高品即同了仲清进去，仲清先已望见一个少年，神光似玉，宝气如珠，可不就是去年酒楼上所见的？高品与他们介绍了。春航见了仲清，也觉面熟。","en":"a pearl — was this not the very one he had seen in the wine house the previous year? Gao Pin introduced them. Chunhang, seeing Zhongqing, also felt he looked familiar."},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":3,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"仲清说起去年在酒楼见了那首词，倾倒至今，真恨相见之晚。春航也想起那日相见，便彼此说些仰慕的话。仲清把他的家世细细问了一遍，始知春航的泰山，果是他的本家叔父。不过仲清在京久了，所以不知这门亲戚。二人说的意气相投，又系亲戚，已十分相契，后来便谈起肺腑来。仲清见春航去年服饰何等华美，如今已不似从前，再想高品的话说","en":"in the wine house last year he had been full of admiration, and truly regretted that they had not met sooner. Chunhang also recalled that encounter, and they exchanged words of mutual esteem. Zhongqing asked in detail about his family background, and learned that Chunhang's father-in-law was indeed his own relative by a collateral line — Zhongqing had simply been so"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":5,"tokens":["春航","湘帆"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"仲清大笑，春航涨红了脸说道：「放屁！你这个屁，倒有些香。只可惜白香山那句好诗，夹在你那三个屁里头。」仲清笑道：「说正经话，吾兄赏识的到底是谁？」春航道：「各部名花，我未曾全览，想亦妍媸不等。我也不过逢场作戏，所谓未能免俗，聊复尔尔。大约诸名班中，要推登春的玉美、全","en":"Zhongqing burst out laughing. Chunhang's face went red and he said: \\"You are farting! Though that fart of yours has a certain fragrance about it. It's just a pity you've buried Bai Juyi's fine line inside your three stinking verses.\\" Zhongqing laughed: \\"In all seriousness — who exactly have"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":8,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"春航道：「这有什么错不错，原是一时寄兴；况且各人赏识不同。大凡赏识两字，须要自己做出眼力来，不必随声附和。此辈中倒不必要他充斯文，一充斯文转恐失之造作，倒不妨有相公习气，方是天真烂漫。我如得志，便不惜黄金十万，起金屋数重，轻裙长袖侍于前，粉白黛绿居于后，","en":"Chunhang said: \\"What is there to be wrong or right about? It was a passing fancy. Besides, different people have different taste. When it comes to appraising these matters, one must develop one's own discernment and not simply echo others. This crowd need not"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一日，春航又在戏园看戏，却看的是联珠班。一个人冷冷落落的，在下场门背暗的地方坐了。看见蓉官的戏，心上便又喜欢。正看到得意处，忽见前面一张桌子，来了一个三十来岁胖子，反穿着草上霜，同着一个二十几岁伶伶俐俐的人坐下，背后站着一个跟班。那胖子是一口京话，那一个是南边","en":"One day Chunhang was again at the theater watching the opera — this time the Lianzhu troupe. He sat alone in cold isolation at a spot behind the exit door, in shadow. Watching Rongguan's performance, he felt his heart stirring with pleasure again. Just as he was absorbed"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"忽然看见前面桌上那两个，便抢步上来，照应了，就坐在中间。春航如今的衣服，大非从前可比，不过剩了家常所穿的几件旧衣，又坐在背暗处；越觉得颜色黯淡，并不见蓉官过来照应他。只听得蓉官说道：「二老爷，昨日有人很感你的情。」那胖子道：「是谁？」蓉官道：「联锦班的二喜，说你很疼他，给他好些东西，在你家住了一夜，有没有？」","en":"sight of those two at the table in front, he quickened his steps and greeted them, then sat down in the middle. Chunhang's clothing was by now utterly unlike what it had been — he had only a few everyday old garments left — and moreover he was sitting in the shadow; his appearance was all the dimmer and darker for it, and Rongguan did not come over to acknowledge him at"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":4,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"要不然你教我，我就拜你做师傅。你怎样教我，我就怎样学你。」那后生一面笑，一面把他脸上拧了一把。蓉官一回头，见了春航，却把眼睛一低，又扑转来一注，却又别转了头。半晌又回转来，上上下下，把春航一看，像要招呼又止住的光景。春航心里颇疑，想道：「难道他看不清？此时仲春，人还穿着小中毛，春航已是一身棉衣。且这几日阴雨连绵，地下难走，又坐不起车。","en":"from you.\\" The young man smiled and gave Rongguan's cheek a pinch. Rongguan turned his head and caught sight of Chunhang; he lowered his eyes briefly, then cast them back for a lingering look — then turned away again. After a long moment he turned back again and looked Chunhang up and down, in a manner that seemed to want to acknowledge him but then stopped itself. Chunhang"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"扯扯富三的衣裳，道：「你瞧，蓉官倒巴结那个人，难道这种人，倒有什么巴结处么？」富三道：「那也难说的。」蓉官辞了春航，又到富三处来。聘才笑向蓉官道：「好阔老斗。」蓉官脸上一红，道：「他真阔过来。他倒从没有欠人的开发，要人替担帐。」少停，富三等即带了蓉官，又叫了一个相公出去了。","en":"that be, to have anything worth paying court to?\\" Fu the Third said: \\"Hard to say.\\" Rongguan took his leave of Chunhang and returned to Fu the Third's side. Pincai said with a smirk to Rongguan: \\"Some grand old patron, eh?\\" Rongguan's face reddened and he said: \\"He really was grand, once. He never left debts for others to settle on his behalf.\\" After a short while, Fu"},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":2,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"天又蒙蒙的下起细雨来，春航也无心再看，付了戏钱。出得门来，地下已滑得似油一样。不多几时，只见全福班的翠宝坐着车，劈面过来，见了他，扭转了头，竟过去了。春航心里颇为不乐，只得低着头，慢慢找那干的地方。","en":"The sky had turned to a fine drizzle. Chunhang had no more heart for watching; he paid what he owed and left. Outside, the ground was already slippery as oil. After a while, the carriage of Cuibao of the Quanfu troupe came straight toward him; Cuibao caught sight of him, turned his head away, and"},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":3,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"车马又多，那里还有干土？前面又有一个大骡车，下了帘子，车沿上坐着个人，与一个赶车的如飞的冲过来。道路又窄，已到春航面前，那骡子把头一昂，已碰着春航的肩，春航一闪踏了个滑，站立不牢，栽了一交。这一交倒也栽得凑巧，就沾了一身烂泥，脸上却没有沾着。车内人见了，唬了一大跳，忙把帘子掀起，探出身子来，莺声呖呖道：「快拉住了牲口，搀起那人来。」","en":"drawn, a person perched on the carriage rail beside the driver. The road was too narrow; the cart was already upon Chunhang. The mule tossed its head and knocked against Chunhang's shoulder; Chunhang swerved, stepped on a slippery patch, lost his footing, and went sprawling. The fall was rather well-timed in one respect — he was splattered head to foot with mud, yet his face"},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":2,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"赶车的早已跳下来，把牲口勒住了，跟班的也下来，扶起春航。春航又羞又怒，将要骂那车夫，只见那坐车的，陪着满面笑，从车中探出身子，说道：「受惊了！赶车的不好，照应不到，污了衣裳怎么好？」即把赶车的骂了几句。","en":"The driver had already leaped down and reined in the mule; the manservant also jumped down to help Chunhang up. Chunhang, burning with shame and rage, was on the verge of scolding the driver, when he saw the one riding in the carriage — smiling profusely and leaning out from inside — saying: \\"You must have had a dreadful fright! The driver was careless and"},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"春航一见，原来是个绝色的相公，就有一片灵光，从车内飞出来，把自己眼光罩住，那一腔怒气，不知消到何处去了。只见那相公生得如冰雪抟成，琼瑶琢就，韵中生韵，香外含香。","en":"Chunhang looked—and saw before him a young actor of surpassing, unearthly beauty. A sudden flash of transcendent light seemed to stream from within the carriage, bathing his vision in radiance. In that instant, every trace of his burning anger vanished into the"},{"paragraph":30,"mentions":2,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"正似明月梨花，一身缟素；恰称兰心蕙质，竟体清芬。春航看得呆了，安得有卢家郁金堂，石家锦步幛置此佳人，就把五百年的冤孽，三千劫的魔障，尽跌了出来，也忘了自己辱在泥涂，即笑盈盈的把两只泥手，扶着车沿说道：「不妨，不妨，这是我自不小心，偶然失足，衣服都是旧的，污了不足惜，幸勿有扰尊意。」说罢在旁连连拱手，道","en":"pure, unsullied reflection of his orchid heart and sweet-grass spirit, exuding a breathtaking, unblemished purity. Chunhang gazed at him, utterly spellbound. Could the fabled Turmeric Hall of the Lu family or the opulent brocade screens of Shi Chong ever have sheltered a beauty such as this? In that fleeting moment, all the karmic debts of five hundred lifetimes and the romantic"},{"paragraph":31,"mentions":4,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"春航拖泥带水的，一步步走回庙中，恰懊悔不曾问得那一班的小旦。进了庙门，就把衣裳脱下，交田安收拾，换去泥靴，身上只穿了一件夹袄，来到高品屋里坐下。高品见他身上不穿袍子，且下雨寒冷，便问他何以不多穿件衣服？春航答以被雨沾湿，叫田安烤去了。高品即于衣包内，取出","en":"Chunhang, dripping mud and water, made his way step by step back to the temple, regretting all the while that he had not thought to ask which troupe this small-role actor belonged to. Entering the temple gate, he took off his clothes and handed them to Tian An"},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":5,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"其雨其雨，梨园之东。\\n有美一人，其车既攻。匪车之攻，胡为乎泥中？赋也。\\n春航笑着，又将那相公的相貌衣裳，连那骡子车围的颜色都说了，问道：「你可识得是那一班的相公？」高品想了一会道：「据你说来，不是陆素兰，就是金漱芳，不然就是袁宝珠。」春航道；「金漱芳在联殊班，我见过他的戏，生得瘦瘦儿的，不是。至于陆素兰、袁宝珠我却不认得，不","en":"Not the carriage moves swiftly —\\nWhy is he in the midst of the mud?\\"\\n\\nIt is in the mode of direct presentation.\\nChunhang laughed and then described the young actor's appearance and clothing, and even the color of the mule-cart's curtain, and asked: \\"Do you know which troupe this actor belongs to?\\" Gao Pin thought for a moment and said: \\"From your description, it must be"},{"paragraph":33,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"次日天晴了，春航绝早起来，把衣裳晒晾干了，刷净了泥，换了一双靴子，心里想去听戏，又苦于无资，竟无可典之物。","en":"The next day the sky had cleared. Chunhang rose very early, hung out his clothes to air and dry, brushed away the mud, changed into a new pair of boots, and felt the urge to go and hear some opera — but was tormented by the lack of funds, having nothing left to pawn."},{"paragraph":34,"mentions":2,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"。饭也不吃，一连看了五天联锦班，才见着那个相公一面。看他唱了一出《独占》，访问他的姓名，却正是苏蕙芳。蕙芳偶在春航身边走过，认得是前日跌在泥里那一位，又见他衣裳一身斑点，未免一笑，但不好意思来照应他。春航见蕙芳对他一笑，便如逢玉女投壶，天公开口，便喜欢得说不出来。千思万想，可借不能叫他一回。又看他这样局面，似乎不肯轻易陪酒，断非纸条飞去随叫随来的光景。不得主意，","en":"the scene *Exclusive Possession*, then asked his name — it was indeed Su Huifang. Huifang happened to pass near Chunhang, recognized him as the one who had tumbled in the mud the other day, and, noticing his clothes still mottled with stains, could not help smiling faintly — but felt too awkward to come over and acknowledge him. Chunhang, seeing Huifang smile at him, felt"},{"paragraph":35,"mentions":2,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"春航只当不听见，在炕上和衣卧了，心里只想着蕙芳。田安出去，嘴里却不住咕咕噜噜的抱怨，春航也有些踌躇。","en":"Chunhang simply let it wash over him; he lay on the heated bed fully clothed, thinking only of Huifang. Tian An went out, muttering and grumbling without pause. Chunhang was also somewhat at a loss."},{"paragraph":37,"mentions":5,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"过了一夜，次早写了一封书，也不明说，隐隐约约似要乞援的话，命张和送去。春航在家盼望佳音，少顷张和回来，却是空手，连回书也没有，说道：「他们门上说，颜少爷知道了，就送回信来。」春航想他必定打算银子，吃了饭，候了一会。忽见颜仲清着人来，来人手里拿上一轴画，说：「我们少爷，给老爷请安。这轴画请老爷题一题，叫小的候着带了回去。」春","en":"things plainly, but hinting obliquely in terms that suggested a plea for help — and sent Zhanghe to deliver it. Chunhang waited at home for good news; before long Zhanghe returned empty-handed, without even a reply letter, and said: \\"The gatekeepers said Young Master Yan had received the note and would send a reply shortly.\\" Chunhang assumed he must be working out the"},{"paragraph":38,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"此是英雄千古厄，岂同飘泊狭邪儿？\\n鹑衣百结破羊裘，高唱莲花未解羞。\\n若使妖姬无烈性，此生终老不回头。\\n春航心里想道：「他虽骂得刻毒，但理却不错，怎样的来翻他？」便略略构思，题起笔来，一挥而就，写道：","en":"heroine's fierce and steadfast devotion,\\nHis life would have withered away, a wanderer never to return homeward.\\"\\n\\nChunhang thought to himself: \\"Though his mockery cuts deep, his reasoning strikes true—how am I to counter such words?\\" Gathering his thoughts for but a moment, he took up the brush and, with a single, unbroken sweep of his wrist, wrote:"},{"paragraph":39,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"不易知。\\n盖世才华信不虚，风流犹见敝衣余。\\n五陵年少休相薄，后日功名若个如。\\n落了款，用了印章，卷好交与来人。春航气闷，又独自出外去了。","en":"its silk wrapper, and handed it to the messenger. Weighed down by a heavy heart and an air of quiet desolation, Chunhang walked out into the world alone."}],"13":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":3,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说仲清激怒春航之后，即将王恂所备之百金送至高品处，为春航薪水之费。春航闷坐了两日，米煤催逼，告贷无门。经高品款留，只得暂时寄食。","en":"After Zhongqing had provoked Chunhang into anger, he sent the hundred taels that Wang Xun had prepared to Gao Pin, to cover Chunhang's daily expenses of firewood and food. Chunhang sat brooding for two days; pressed on all sides for rice, coal, and the repayment of debts, with nowhere to"},{"paragraph":2,"mentions":3,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一日，用了饭，高品拜客去了，春航即到戏园来，一心想着苏蕙芳，又没有钱听戏，只好站在戏园门口，候着那蕙芳出进。将到开戏时候，果然见蕙芳坐了车，到门口下来，偏偏有一群人进来看戏，一挤把春航挤在背后，却彼此不能照面。春航心里甚恨，急把身子挤出来，蕙芳已进去了，只得呆呆的不动，候他出来。却","en":"One day, after eating, Gao Pin went out to pay calls, and Chunhang went to the theater, his heart entirely fixed upon Su Huifang. Having no money to watch the opera, he could only stand at the entrance, waiting to catch a glimpse of Huifang going in or coming out. Just as the performance was about to begin, he did indeed"},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":2,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"春航想道：「不料联锦班内，有这些好相公，果然名不虚传。」足足候了三个多时辰，始见蕙芳低着头出来，前面两个美少年，服饰辉煌，两个跟班，夹着垫子，抱着衣包，同蕙芳上车去了。春航知蕙芳没看见他，郁郁的走回来。","en":"Chunhang thought to himself that he never would have expected the Lianjin troupe to have such fine performers, proving their fame was no exaggeration. He waited a good six hours and more before seeing Huifang emerge with his head lowered. Two splendidly dressed"},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":2,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"过了一宵，明日又到戏园门口候了一天，却没有会见，此日便为虚度，嗟叹不已。盖春航执迷已久，一时难悟，天天去寻联锦班，候着蕙芳。一连十余日，蕙芳却也看见前次跌在泥里的人，每逢上车下车之时，总站在戏园门口，如醉如痴，目不转睛的看他，心里十分诧异。因细看他的相貌，恰神清骨秀，风雅宜人，面目虽带几分憔悴，而珊珊玉骨，情韵盎然。蕙芳心上，","en":"the theater entrance. Yet again he failed to see him, letting the day slip by in vain while sighing endlessly. Chunhang had been caught in this obsession for so long that he could not easily awaken from it, going every day to seek out the Lianjin troupe and wait for Huifang. For more than ten days in a row, Huifang did notice the man who had previously fallen in the mud."},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一日，春航好运到了，也是各人的缘分：正跟着蕙芳的车，蕙芳留神看见，便起了几分怜念的心肠。一进了门，便叫跟班的请他进来。跟班的出去。","en":"One day, Chunhang's luck finally turned, perhaps by the hand of destiny. He was following Huifang's carriage as usual when Huifang, paying special attention, felt a stir of tender pity in his heart. As soon as he entered his gate, he told his manservant to invite the"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":8,"tokens":["春航","田湘帆"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"瞧了春航两眼道：「老爷是寻我们相公的？我们相公叫请老爷里面吃茶呢！」春航喜出望外，倒立定了。走不进去。跟班的又请了一遍，春航终是羞羞涩涩的不好意思。忽见里面又有人出来说，请那一位跟着车走的老爷进去。春航只得整一整衣裳，随了跟班的进了大门，便是一个院落，两边扎","en":"He looked Chunhang up and down. \\"Is your honour looking for our master? Our master asks your honour in to take tea.\\" Chunhang was overjoyed beyond expectation, yet he stood rooted to the spot, unable to step forward. The manservant invited him a second time, but Chunhang"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":3,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"蕙芳即让春航进内，走出了客厅，从西边篱笆内进去，一个小院子。是一并五间：东边隔一间是客房，预备着不速之客的卧处。中间空着两间作小书厅，西边两间套房，是蕙芳的卧榻。春航先在中间炕上坐下，见上面挂着八幅仇十洲工笔《群仙高会图》，两边尽是楠木嵌琉璃窗，地下铺着三蓝绒毯","en":"Huifang then invited Chunhang inside. They left the reception hall, passing through the western bamboo fence into a small courtyard containing a row of five rooms. The easternmost room was set aside as a guest room for unexpected visitors. The middle two were kept open as a small"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":3,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"诗。」便问道：「这是和你的原韵，想必诗学是极渊深的。」蕙芳笑道：「草草涂鸦，不过凑几句白话罢了，会作什么诗？」春航道：「原唱呢，为何不写出来？」蕙芳道：「去年袁宝珠替我写了一幅，人家拿去看，遗失了。」春航再将蕙芳细细的看了一看，又道：「我看你举止清高，吐属娴雅，绝不类优伶中人。你是几时到京来学戏的？」蕙芳脸上便有愧色，叹了一口气道：「问我的出身，原也是清白人家。","en":"\\"So he knows how to compose poetry,\\" Chunhang thought, and then asked, \\"These are matched to your own rhymes. Your knowledge of poetry must be very deep.\\" Huifang laughed. \\"Idle scribbling — a few plain phrases strung together. What poetry is there in it?\\" Chunhang said, \\"And the original verses"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":2,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「请坐了，好说。」春航坐下，蕙芳道：「我小时候随宦云南，八岁上母亲死了，到十二岁父亲被上司参劾，一气成病，不到一月即故。本来两袖清风，毫无私蓄，就有些须囊橐，都被几个亲戚长随，豆分瓜剖的去了，单剩了一个老家人与我。在云南住了一年多。可怜举目无亲，那些势利场中，谁肯照拂，全","en":"\\"Please sit, and I will tell you.\\" Chunhang sat down, and Huifang said:\\n\\n\\"As a child I went with my father to his post in Yunnan. My mother died when I was eight. When I was twelve my father was impeached by his superior, took it so bitterly that he fell ill, and was dead within the month. He"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":2,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"春航道：「自然处馆了。」蕙芳道：「他却不处馆，他的行为到有些像你，到今年也才二十七岁。他进京来便天天听戏，钱都听完了，戏却听会了，认识了许多的相公，遂作了教戏的师傅。遇着那年乡试不中，他便烧了那些文章，入了联锦班作了小生。」春航道：「这到是达人所为，毫无","en":"Chunhang said, \\"He would have taken a tutor's place, of course.\\" Huifang said, \\"He did not take a tutor's place. His conduct was rather like yours, in fact. He is only twenty-seven this year. When he came up to the capital he went to the theatre every day, until"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":6,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"春航听了，也着实伤心，便道：「五年中星移物换，倒尝了多少世态。」又安慰了几句，吃了两杯茶，蕙芳便问春航道；「你既好听戏，于各班中可曾赏识几个脚色么？」春航笑道：「我是重色而轻艺，于戏文全不讲究，脚色高低，也不懂得，惟取其有姿色者，视为至宝。起初孟浪，眼界","en":"Hearing this, Chunhang was much grieved. \\"In five years the stars have shifted and things have changed, and you have tasted a great deal of the world.\\" He said a few words of comfort, and they drank two cups of tea.\\n\\nThen Huifang said, \\"Since you are so fond of the theatre,"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":4,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"春航道：「我也不为别的。」蕙芳便正色问道：「你为什么？」春航道：「只要姿色好，情性好，我就为他死也情愿。」蕙芳道：「人家好，干你什么事，要为他死？你且说那可宝处？」春航道：「你听我说，我辈作客数千里外，除了二三知己外，尚有四等好友得之最难，即得了又常有美","en":"Chunhang said, \\"It is for no other reason.\\" Huifang asked gravely, \\"Then what is your reason?\\" Chunhang said, \\"Only let the looks be fine and the nature be fine, and I would die for such a person willingly.\\" Huifang said, \\"What is it to you that somebody else"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":2,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"蕙芳点头道：「不错，真是好的。第二，想必是好地了。」春航道：「是的。一丘一壑，山水清幽，却好移步换形，引人入胜。第三，是好书，要不着一死句，不着一闲笔，便令人探索不尽。」蕙芳也点点头。春航道：「第四，便是性灵中发出来的几首好诗，也不必执定抱杜尊韩，有一句两句，能道人所不能道者，便可与古人争胜。」","en":"Huifang nodded. \\"True enough — that is a fine thing. The second, I suppose, must be fine country.\\" Chunhang said, \\"It is. A hill and a hollow, water and mountain clear and secluded, and the view changing at every step so that one is drawn further in. The third is fine books — books with not one dead sentence and not one idle stroke in them, so that a man may"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"蕙芳道：「是极，你真是个风雅通人。」春航道：「此四友是好的了，然也有不能全好处。好天，一月能有几回？往往有上半天好，下半天变起来，便把上半天，也改坏了。到人意阑珊，便怕风怕雨的，不敢久留。好地，一省能有几处？有必须徒步始通的地方，或险仄，或幽阻，沙石荆棘，十里八里的远，便令人困乏起来，往往","en":"Huifang praised him as a person of refined and universal understanding. Chunhang countered that while these four friends are indeed fine, each has its imperfection. He asked how many days of fine weather there are in a month. Often the morning is beautiful and by afternoon it changes, spoiling even the morning's beauty. When one's"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":3,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"蕙芳笑道：「宝友二字甚奇，我们并不知自己有可宝处。」春航道：「玉软香温，花浓雪艳，是为宝色。环肥燕瘦，肉腻骨香，是为宝体。明眸善睐，巧笑工颦，是为宝容。千娇侧聚，百媚横生，是为宝态。憨啼吸露，娇语嗔花，是为宝情。珠钿刻翠，金佩飞霞，是为宝妆。再益以清歌妙舞，檀板金尊，宛转关生，轻盈欲堕，则又谓之宝艺、宝人","en":"term \\"treasure friend\\" quite remarkable, and confessed they had no idea they possessed anything worth treasuring. Chunhang elaborated: \\"Soft as jade, warm as perfume, flowering with richness, gleaming like snow, that is the treasure of beauty. Rounded like Lady Huan, slender like Lady Yan, flesh smooth and bone fragrant, that is the treasure of the body. Bright eyes that"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":4,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"春航道：「茶烟琴韵，风雨鸡鸣，思我故人，寸心千里，若非素心晨夕，何以言欢？而萧寺生愁，残灯寂寞，又安得有二三知己共耐凄凉？惟有你们这些好相公，一语半言，沁入心骨，遂令转百炼钢为绕指柔。再如你这样天仙化人，就使可望而不可即，使我学善才之见观音，一步一拜，也","en":"Chunhang went on: \\"Tea-smoke and the sound of the qin, wind and rain and the cock crowing at night, thinking of an old friend with a heart that reaches a thousand li — without a kindred spirit to share morning and evening, where is the joy in it? And in a bleak"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"春航也不推辞，二人就在花梨四仙桌上对酌，各自吐了些肺腑。此时蕙芳心里，已是十分贴切，全没有半点势利心肠。","en":"Chunhang made no show of refusal. The two sat across from each other at the small huali-wood table and drank, each pouring out what was deepest in their hearts. By this time Huifang's own heart was completely drawn in, without a trace of calculating self-interest."},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":4,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"当下吃毕了饭，又让到里边屋里坐了一坐，便吩咐跟班的，叫外面套车，送田老爷回寓。蕙芳挽住了春航的手道：「今日订交，此生勿负。我苏蕙芳如有虚言，有如皎日。你以后不必出来，我非早即晚，天天来看你一次。你须自己保重，努力前程。幸勿为我辈丧名，使外人物议。」春航听了，转爱为敬，直感入骨髓，已流下泪来。两人相视呜咽了一会，唯有那些跟班及使唤的人不解其意","en":"told the manservant to hitch up the carriage outside and take Master Tian back to his lodgings. Huifang clasped Chunhang's hand and said that they had become friends today, and must not betray this friendship for the rest of their lives. He swore that if he, Su Huifang, spoke a single false word, the bright sun would be his witness. He told Chunhang he need not come out"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":2,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这边蕙芳也就睡了，却细细把春航的说话记了一遍，又把他的光景想了多时。到睡了时，就见春航在面前，变了华冠丽服，仪容严肃的相貌，令人生畏；又变了一个中年的人，穿着一品服饰。恍恍惚惚作了一夜乱梦，到明日早上，就起得迟了。","en":"Huifang then went to bed, carefully recalling everything Chunhang had said and pondering his situation for a long time. When he fell asleep, he dreamt of Chunhang appearing before him, dressed in magnificent robes and an imposing crown, his expression so stern it inspired awe. Then Chunhang transformed into a middle-aged"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":1,"tokens":["田春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"得坐下陪着。张仲雨看着蕙芳，却像要说话又不说的光景。蕙芳低了头，一回站起来，到窗前看那盆内种的兰花，心上却忆着田春航，又不好回他们出去，无精打采的坐立不安。那潘其观坐着不动，也不开口，眼睛只注着蕙芳。张仲雨道：「咱们也不必找地方，就在这里摆个酒儿，随便弄两样菜不好么？」潘其观道：「很好，家里又清净。」蕙芳道：「好是好，我今日不能久陪二位，就要走，姑苏会馆有戏，第二","en":"his head down, then got up and went to the window to look at the orchid in its pot, thinking all the while of Tian Chunhang; but he could not well turn them out, and he sat and stood again, listless and ill at ease. Pan Qiguan did not stir and did not open his mouth, but kept his eyes fixed on Huifang.\\n\\nZhang Zhongyu said, \\"We need not go looking for a place. Let us have"},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":5,"tokens":["春航","田春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"夹单纱五套衣服，并潘三的二百吊钱票，带了一副铺盖，一总交跟班的拿出来，放在车上。蕙芳上了车，跟班跨了沿，一齐向春航寓处来。才到了胡衕口，月光下见一人站着，赶车的一看，却认得就是田春航，便住了车，叫道：「老者爷，我们正到你那里去。」蕙芳和跟班的听见，一齐跳下车来，蕙芳拉住春航道：「你又在这里做什么？」春航道：「我候你一天不见来，我就不想活。我已在你门口立了多时，不","en":"carriage. Huifang mounted the carriage, his manservant rode on the footboard, and they headed together toward Chunhang's lodgings. Just as they reached the entrance of the alley they saw a figure standing in the moonlight, and the driver, recognising Tian Chunhang, pulled up. \\"Your honour! We were just on our way to you.\\"\\n\\nHuifang and the servant sprang down together,"},{"paragraph":33,"mentions":4,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"高品已经睡了，春航不好去惊动他，一径到自己房内。田安伏在桌上瞌睡，春航剔亮了灯，叫醒了田安，说道：「快去泡茶。」田安擦擦眼睛，见一个美少年，只道是位公子，便急急的泡茶去了。蕙芳坐下，看他行李萧条，心里着实难过。便叫跟班的将衣裳、票子拿上来，道：「这五套衣服都是我平日穿","en":"Gao Pin had already gone to bed. Chunhang, not wanting to disturb him, went directly to his own room. Tian An was dozing over the table. Chunhang trimmed the lamp brighter and woke Tian An. \\"Go and make tea, quickly.\\" Tian An rubbed his eyes, and seeing a beautiful youth took him for a young"},{"paragraph":37,"mentions":4,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这边蕙芳与春航早上起来，洗洗脸，吃了点心。蕙芳见壁上挂了张琴。即问春航道：「你会弹琴么？」春航道：「略知一二。」蕙芳道：「何不弹一曲听听？」未知春航弹与不弹，且听下回分解。","en":"Meanwhile Huifang and Chunhang rose in the morning, washed, and ate a little. Huifang noticed a qin hanging on the wall. \\"Do you play the qin?\\" Chunhang said, \\"A little.\\" Huifang said, \\"Then why not play a piece and let me hear it?\\" Whether Chunhang played or not, hear it told in"}],"14":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":5,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说蕙芳要春航抚琴，春航道：「少坐一坐。」便目不转睛的看着蕙芳，蕙芳笑道：「难道你还认不仔细，只管发呆作什么？」春航笑道：「我看卿旁妍侧媚，变态百出，如花光露气，晚日迎风，眼光捉不住，倒越看越不能仔细。」蕙芳啐了一口，立起来把春航的钮子解开，替他脱下衣裳。春航道：","en":"Huifang had been asking Chunhang to play the qin, and Chunhang said, \\"Just a moment.\\" He kept his eyes fixed on Huifang without blinking. Huifang laughed and said, \\"Can you really not make me out yet? Why do you keep staring so blankly?\\" Chunhang laughed and replied, \\"I look at you"},{"paragraph":2,"mentions":2,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"蕙芳笑嘻嘻的拿了镜子，倚着春航一照，映出两个玉人。春航看镜中的蕙芳，正如莲花解语，秋水无尘，便略略点一点头，回转脸来，却好碰着蕙芳的脸，蕙芳把脸一侧，起了半边红晕。","en":"Huifang smiled as he took up a mirror and held it beside Chunhang, and it reflected back two figures of jade. Chunhang looked at Huifang's image in the mirror. There he was, like a lotus that could speak, like autumn water without a speck of dust. Seeing this, Chunhang gave a slight nod. When he turned his face back,"},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"春航便觉心上一荡，禁不得一阵异香，直透入鼻孔与心孔里来。","en":"Chunhang felt his heart stir; he could not resist a wave of strange fragrance that penetrated directly into his nostrils and the innermost chambers of his heart."},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"此心已不能自主，忽急急的转念道：他是我患难中知己，岂可稍涉邪念，便敛了敛神。蕙芳一笑走开了。春航换了新衣，依然丰姿奕奕，神采飞扬，与从前一样。","en":"the slightest impure thought? He steadied his spirit and composed himself. Huifang gave a smile and moved away. Chunhang, now dressed in his new clothes, was once again resplendent in bearing and radiant in spirit, just as he had always been."},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，樱桃花映银丝栊。\\n绿云欹侧燕钗堕，年年锦字春机红。\\n蕙芳道：「好诗！这派诗是学温、李的三十六体，纤秾之极。」春航道：「偶一为之，亦只能貌似耳。」蕙芳又念下去道：","en":"This style derives from the 'Thirty-Six Forms' of Wen Tingyun and Li Shangyin, exquisitely lush and delicate.\\" Chunhang replied, \\"It was written on a whim; I can only approximate their manner, no more.\\" Huifang read on:"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，\\n星眸欲妒春云娇。\\n蕙芳叫一声「好」又道：「近行前来百媚生，兀得不引了人魂灵，临去秋波」，犹未足喻其妙也。」春航道：「光景倒像你。」蕙芳道：「我也配？」又念下去是：","en":"she turned to go, and that autumn glance', even those lines are insufficient to convey this poem's subtlety.\\" Chunhang said, \\"The image seems to be you.\\" Huifang said, \\"Am I worthy of it?\\" He read on:"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":5,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"娇嫌锦帐银钩重。\\n蕙芳道：「好浓艳工稳。我见犹怜，你是为谁而作？既「日近云鬟身不动」了，又何必天天上戏园呢？」春航便走过来，轻轻的靠在蕙芳椅背上道：「此人难道算不得戏园中人？从前思近芳泽而不能，如今倒也如愿而偿了。」蕙芳道：「是谁？是我们班里的么？」春航点头说「是」。蕙芳道：「等我想一想象谁？上二句纤腰抱月，星眸妒云，非袁瑶卿不足当此二语。下两句软爱罗轻，娇嫌帐","en":"If he is 'daily beside cloudlike tresses, his body does not stir,' why must you haunt the theater every day?\\" Chunhang walked over and leaned lightly against the back of Huifang's chair. \\"Could this person perhaps not be reckoned among the theater folk? Before, I longed to draw near such fragrant grace and could not; now, it seems, my wish is fulfilled.\\" Huifang said,"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"只格一扇玻璃屏。\\n蕙芳便掩卷想了一想道：「好美人，花容月貌。好才子，绣口锦心。悬蜻蜓三字说什么的，想有典故。」春航道：「李义山诗「晓帘串断蜻蜓翼，罗屏但有空青色。」蕙芳道：「这首我见过偶然忘了，看你底下怎样转接呢。」又念道：","en":"embroidered lips and a brocade heart. What does 'a dragonfly hangs' refer to? I suspect there is an allusion.\\" Chunhang said, \\"Li Yishan's (Li Shangyin's) poem: 'At dawn the curtain's strings break a dragonfly's wing; on the gauze screen there is only an empty blue expanse.'\\" Huifang said, \\"I have seen that poem. I had momentarily forgotten it. Let me see how you make"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":4,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"。\\n妾貌常如月二分，郎心莫学文三变。\\n蕙芳道：「须得如此一开，底下便生出一番话来。文三变，可是说你变了心么？」春航道：「是用《艺文序》上：「唐文章无虑三变」的一句。」蕙芳看着春航道：「这么想来，你也算不得有良心的人。」春航道：「何出此言？」蕙芳道：「他的貌呢也不能常如月二分，你的心自必至文三变了。」春航笑道：「论诗那可以如此认真？便是十成死句了。」蕙芳一笑，又念","en":"only then does what follows have room to breathe. 'Wen Sanbian', is that to say you have changed your heart?\\" Chunhang replied, \\"I am drawing on a line from the Preface to the 'Arts and Literature Preface' (艺文序): 'Tang literature changed no fewer than three times.'\\" Huifang looked at Chunhang and said, \\"So by that reckoning, you too cannot be counted a man of good conscience.\\""},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"明皇与兄弟同处，妃子窃宁王玉笛吹之，因此忤旨。可是用这个典故么？」春航道：「也可算得，但搭不上「宫人愁倚」四字。我是用《集异记》上，帝至蜀，月夜登楼，故贵纪侍者红桃，歌妃所制《凉州曲》，上御贵纪玉笛倚之，吹罢相视掩泣的事。」蕙芳点头，又念道：","en":"flute and played it, and for this she incurred the imperial displeasure. Is that the allusion you are using?\\" Chunhang said, \\"That interpretation can stand, but it does not quite fit the phrase 'the palace lady leans in grief.' My source is a passage in the 'Record of Strange Gatherings' (集异记): when the Emperor fled to Shu, on a moonlit night he ascended a tower, and"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":4,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"情人。底下便是结语了。」念道：「翠毛么凤拖红尾。」蕙芳道：「此句劈空而来，笔势奇崛，又推开了。凤有红尾的么？」春航道：「温飞卿诗有「秦王女骑红尾凤。」蕙芳又念道：「跨凤随郎三万里。一日香心思百回，闲时又逐炉烟起。」方才念完，只见高品进来道：「好诗！有如此娇音，方配念这香艳的佳章。但诗中有一句，要改三个字，更觉贴切。」蕙芳走上一步，见了道：「昨夜要来请安，你已睡了","en":"of nowhere. The brushwork is bold and startling, and then it opens up again. Does a phoenix have a red tail?\\" Chunhang said, \\"Wen Feiqing's (Wen Tingyun's) poem has the line: 'The Qin King's daughter rode upon a red-tailed phoenix.'\\" Huifang continued:\\n\\n\\"Astride the phoenix, following my lord for thirty thousand li.\\nOne day, this fragrant heart turns over a hundred times;"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"蕙芳却呆呆的听着，春航笑道：「你自会卜，倒不会详。」高品也笑了。","en":"Huifang listened intently, as if lost in thought. Chunhang laughed: \\"You cast the divination yourself, yet you cannot interpret it.\\" Gao Pin laughed too."},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":3,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"蕙芳要问高品时，见窗外脚步响，有个人影来影去。春航问：「是谁？」听得咳嗽一声，应道：「是我，寻高老爷有句话说。」高品听口声便道：「妙兮，妙兮。」出来一望，果然是庙里的唐和尚，问道：「你有什么话说？」唐和尚便笑嘻嘻的钻将进来，与春航见了，看见了蕙芳，便合着掌道：「阿弥陀佛，原来菩萨降临，小僧有失迎接，","en":"about to ask Gao Pin's opinion when footsteps were heard outside the window as a shadow passed back and forth. Chunhang asked, \\"Who is it?\\" A cough sounded, followed by a reply: \\"It is I. I have a word to say to Lord Gao.\\" Gao Pin recognized the voice at once and said, \\"Ah, how delightful!\\" He stepped out and looked: sure enough, it was Tang the Monk from the temple."},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":5,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"上，便道：「高老爷，你、你、你。」又不说了，嘻着嘴笑。蕙芳道：「我已对了。」即念道：「如瓢浮水面，顶圆而光。」春航、高品都笑说道：「对得好，敏捷且好。」唐和尚笑道：「多谢、多谢，小僧有幸得逢菩萨赞扬，倒没有说我的像鸡巴。」便拉了高品出去，在院子里讲了几句话，便自去了。高品复又进来，三人同吃了饭。蕙芳要听春航弹琴，便把琴取了，解了琴囊，放在桌上道：「弹罢！可要焚香","en":"Huifang said, \\"I have already matched it,\\" and recited: \\"Like a gourd floating on water, the top is round and bald.\\" Chunhang and Gao Pin both laughed and said, \\"Wonderfully matched, quick-witted and apt!\\" Tang the Monk laughed and said, \\"Many thanks, many thanks! This little monk has the great good fortune of being praised by the bodhisattva — and at least he did not say my"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"春航和了一会琴，一三两弦低些收不紧，只得和了个慢商，把一弦三弦各慢徽，再将二四五六七诸弦，仍用五音调法调好。散挑五，名指按十勾三。散挑三，中指按十勾一。弹了几个《陈抟得道仙翁》。又点了些泛音，弹起《结客少年场》这套琴来。从四弦九徽上泛起，勾二挑六，勾四挑","en":"Chunhang sat tuning the qin for a while. The first and third strings were a little flat and could not be tightened properly, so he settled on the Man Shang tuning (慢商). He slackened both the first and third strings by a peg, then adjusted the second, fourth,"},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":3,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"千秋今事业，意气在少年。\\n二十岁以下，当头大哥前。\\n三八多一龄，二哥我比肩。\\n白日指天青，酹酒无丁宁。\\n春航要站起来，蕙芳把手按住春航的手道：「正好听，快弹下去。」春航道：「弹完了。」蕙芳道：「怎么这么快？」","en":"In the white light of day I point to the blue sky above,\\nPouring out the wine libation, wordless, in silence.\\"\\n\\nChunhang made to rise, but Huifang pressed his hand down: \\"This is just the finest part, please play on.\\" Chunhang said, \\"The piece is finished.\\" Huifang said, \\"How can it be over so soon?\\""},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":5,"tokens":["春航","湘帆"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"春航道：「这套琴就只三段。」蕙芳道：「太短，再弹长的。」高品笑道：「湘帆，媚香嫌你快，又嫌你短。你总得贴张千娇百美膏才好。」春航道：「胡说！」蕙芳要去撕高品的嘴，高品便深深作揖道：「宽恕小生这一次罢。」惹得蕙芳倒笑了。蕙芳要春航弹《胡笳十八拍》，又要弹《","en":"Chunhang said, \\"This suite has only three sections.\\" Huifang said, \\"Too short, play a longer one.\\" Gao Pin laughed: \\"Xiangfan, Meixiang finds your piece too fast and too short. You had better go and paste up a placard advertising some thousand-charm, hundred-beauty"},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":4,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"隙中来。蕙芳与高品，都正襟危坐，静气敛容的听着。忽然七弦六徽二分上低了，五弦六徽上高了，四弦九徽上也差了几分。春航道：「奇了，宫商为何忽乱起来？」高品、蕙芳却听不出。春航又把弦和了一和，和不准，即住手问高品：「庙里有弹琴的人么？」高品道：「胡琴或者和尚会拉，琴是没有人会弹的。」春航道：「必有会弹琴的人在外听着，所以琴声变了。」春航说完，忽听院子内狂笑起来。倒把高","en":"string at the sixth position went sharp, and the fourth string at the ninth position was off by several fractions. Chunhang said, \\"How strange. Why have the tones suddenly gone out of order?\\" Gao Pin and Huifang could not detect it. Chunhang tried to retune the strings but could not bring them right, and so he stopped and asked Gao Pin: \\"Is there anyone in the temple who"},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":5,"tokens":["田湘帆","春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"问高品道：「你又几时会弹琴，你要学琴，须我教你。方才这《水仙操》倒也弹得好。」高品道：「我何尝会弹？弹琴的就是田湘帆。」南湘已听见仲清讲过田湘帆的才学，便道：「既是田湘帆，何不出来会我史竹君？」高品道：「我为介绍。」说到此，蕙芳已出来见了，即便拉了南湘进去。南湘道：「咦，你也在这里，不料今日高卓然的斋堂倒成了石季伦的金谷。」那边春航亦迎出来，彼此相见，未免道了些仰","en":"Immortal Melody' just now was rather well played.\\" Gao Pin said, \\"When did I ever play? The one playing is Tian Xiangfan.\\" Nanxiang had already heard of Tian Xiangfan's talents from Zhongqing, and said, \\"Since it is Tian Xiangfan, why does he not come out and meet Shi Zhujun?\\" Gao Pin said, \\"Allow me to make the introduction.\\" At that moment Huifang had already come out"},{"paragraph":30,"mentions":5,"tokens":["春航","田湘帆","湘帆"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"高品的跟班同厨子把酒看肴摆了上来。大家在圆桌上坐了。南湘与春航又谈了些琴谱文艺，彼此均各敬服。高品道：「当今史竹君，是梨园的狄梁公；田湘帆，是戏班的李药师。」南湘道：「你又胡言乱道了。」春航道：「怎么说？我倒不明白。」高品道：「竹君序那《燕台花选》，这些小旦，便为公门桃李，兔丝、马勃尽是药笼中物，这不是狄梁公么","en":"Gao Pin's attendant and the cook brought out wine and dishes. They all sat around a round table. Nanxiang and Chunhang talked further about qin scores and literary arts, each finding much to admire in the other. Gao Pin said, \\"Today's Shi Zhujun is the Di Renjie of the pear-garden world; Tian Xiangfan is the Li Yaoshi of the theater troupe.\\" Nanxiang said, \\"You are talking"},{"paragraph":31,"mentions":1,"tokens":["湘帆"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"南湘也大笑道：「湘帆真是韵人，绝代佳人以一跌感之，倒是从来未有之事。古闻孙寿堕妆，梁冀下马。今见苏郎唱戏，田子跟车。一副好对，持赠媚香罢。」蕙芳睃着南湘道：「你何苦也学着那嚼舌头的人挖苦我。」高品道：「这话是恨我已深，其实我与你无仇无怨，何必这样恶狠狠的？」蕙芳道：「你","en":"Nanxiang burst out laughing too: \\"Xiangfan is truly a man of rare romantic sentiment! A peerless beauty moved to feeling by a single fall, that is something that has never happened before. Of old we heard that Sun Shou's falling make-up brought Liang Ji down from his horse. Today we see Su Lang"},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":2,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这官衔是刘文泽编成的，席中惟有南湘一人知道，春航尚是创闻。高品道：「还有一个官衔你没有说。」蕙芳道：「好像没有了。」高品道：「还有监造兔园册子呢。」南湘又笑。蕙芳不曾理会，即与兰保、玉林在各人面前敬了几杯酒。春航前次已见过玉林，看他丰致嫣然，虽逊蕙芳一筹，然比起从前赏识的一班相公，却高得多。见他桃","en":"This string of titles had been composed by Liu Wenze; of those present, only Nanxiang knew their origin, while to Chunhang it was entirely new. Gao Pin said, \\"There is one title you have left out.\\" Huifang said, \\"It seems there was nothing more.\\" Gao Pin said, \\"You have omitted Superintendent of the Compilation of the Rabbit Garden Catalogue.\\" Nanxiang laughed again. Huifang"},{"paragraph":33,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"又看那王兰保，却是史南湘最得意的，春航倒有些怕他。柳眉贴翠，含娇处亦复含嗔。凤眼斜睃，似有情亦似有怒。径行自遂，倜傥不羁。年纪十七岁，是个武旦，学得一手好拳脚。南湘是个放浪形骸之外的人，从前初识兰保时，也曾大闹过几场，以后倒又相好起来。兰保也知南湘的性情、脾气，倒与他十分贴切。每到南湘醉","en":"Then he noticed Wang Lanbao, the one Shi Nanxiang held in highest favor, and Chunhang felt a touch of awe before him. Willow eyebrows pressed close and green, containing both coquetry and vexation. Phoenix eyes cast sidelong glances that seemed to carry both sentiment and suppressed anger. He went his own way entirely, free and unconstrained."},{"paragraph":34,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"今日席上唯春航不善饮酒，南湘那里肯依，便猜拳行令的百般闹起来。","en":"At the table that day, only Chunhang could not hold his wine well, and Nanxiang would not hear of excuses. They began finger-guessing contests and drinking forfeits, creating lively chaos all around."},{"paragraph":35,"mentions":4,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"偏是春航输得多了，以后便不肯饮。南湘命兰保斟了一杯酒，去灌春航。兰保即拿着酒来，走到春航面前，蕙芳知春航不能饮酒，便凑着兰保的手饮了。","en":"Chunhang kept losing, and after a while refused to drink any more. Nanxiang ordered Lanbao to pour a cup and make Chunhang drink it. Lanbao rose and walked over to Chunhang with the wine; but Huifang, knowing that Chunhang could not hold his drink, leaned forward"},{"paragraph":36,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"要蕙芳饮。蕙芳道：「我不爱饮了，适可而止。」兰保道：「那由不得你，你不闻」失意睚眦间，白刃相交加」么？」南湘、春航看着他们，高品对着王兰保作嘴作脸，要他罚蕙芳的酒。李玉林则斜身单香肩，嫣然而笑。兰保也笑道：「你真不喝？」蕙芳有些怕他，只得赔着笑道：「兰哥饶了我罢。」玉林也再三替他讨情，兰保终是不肯，犹罚了蕙芳一杯，方才开交。大家又饮过了一会，忽见蕙芳家内有人来叫","en":"\\"That is not for you to decide. Have you not heard: 'Between feuding enemies, bare blades cross'?\\" Nanxiang and Chunhang watched them, while Gao Pin pulled faces at Wang Lanbao, urging him to impose more forfeit wine on Huifang. Li Yulin reclined on one shoulder, smiling languidly. Lanbao also laughed: \\"Are you truly not going to drink?\\" Huifang was a little afraid of"},{"paragraph":37,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"蕙芳进来，春航问起何事？蕙芳道：「家内有人寻我，我回他去了。」高品道：「是谁？蕙芳道：「不认得。来人说叫什么奚十一，是广东人。」高品道：「好累赘姓，兜头一撇，握颈三拳，中间便丝丝的搅不清，这要假充个大老官。东方之夷有九种，不知他是那一种。」蕙芳道：「你倒好在庙门口","en":"Huifang came back inside, and Chunhang asked what the matter was. Huifang replied, \\"Someone at home came looking for me; I sent him away.\\" Gao Pin asked, \\"Who was it?\\" Huifang said, \\"I don't know him. The servant said his name was something like Xi Eleven, a Cantonese man.\\" Gao Pin said,"},{"paragraph":38,"mentions":3,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"道：「我们三个人从《四书》上找那个奚字，要从第一个，说到第十一个，说差了照字数罚酒。他们三个人，替我们分消。」春航道：「《四书》上未必有这许多奚字。」南湘道：「就有也不能凑数。」高品道：「不过罚几杯酒就是了，何妨试他一试，我先说。」即说道：「奚。」春航道：「那一句书的奚字，要说明白。」高品道：「奚取于三家的奚。」南湘便道：「子奚……女奚。」高品道：「多说了一句，","en":"drinks a number of cups equal to the number of characters in the passage. Those three will serve as our seconds.\\" Chunhang said, \\"There may not be that many instances of 'xi' in *The Four Books*.\\" Nanxiang said, \\"Even if there are, we couldn't get through them all.\\" Gao Pin said, \\"We'll simply drink a few cups of forfeit; there is no harm in trying. I'll go first.\\" He said:"},{"paragraph":39,"mentions":3,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"。」南湘又想了一会没有，只得饮了三杯，兰保代了两杯。高品说道：「是亦为政，奚……」南湘道：「怎么我就想不着。」春航也想了一会道：「虞不用百里奚……」南湘拍着桌子道：「罚得冤！有庳之人奚……」春航、高品都赞好，应轮到高品说第七个，春航便抢说道：「则子事我者也，奚．…．」南湘便指着高品道；「如此则与禽兽奚……」","en":"Gao Pin said: \\"'This too is governance, for what reason...'\\" Nanxiang said, \\"How could I not think of that one!\\" Chunhang thought for a while and said: \\"'Yu did not employ Baili Xi...'\\" Nanxiang slapped the table: \\"Unfairly penalized! 'The people of Youbi, for what reason...'\\" Chunhang and Gao Pin both applauded this. It was now Gao Pin's turn to cite the seventh instance,"},{"paragraph":40,"mentions":2,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"大家都笑起来。高品道：「都要罚。第七个奚字轮到我说，为什么要你们抢说？」李玉林便斟起罚酒来，南湘、春航只图说得爽快，倒也意不在罚。南湘饮了五杯，兰保代了两杯。春航饮了三杯，蕙芳代了四杯。","en":"seventh 'xi' was my turn to cite, so why did you both rush in?\\" Li Yulin duly poured the forfeit cups. Nanxiang and Chunhang had been so eager to recite that they had quite forgotten about the penalties. Nanxiang drank five cups and Lanbao drank two for him. Chunhang drank three cups and Huifang drank four for him."},{"paragraph":41,"mentions":7,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"叫我说出什么来？还要罚我，天理良心何在？」李玉林也替高品说情，南湘只得依了，便道：「以粟易之。曰：许子奚……」春航道：「第九个到少。」便想了一想道：「与礼之轻者而比之奚与礼之重者而比之奚。」蕙芳便顿足道：「你何必要说两句？」高品道：「好呵，罚九杯。」蕙芳道：「这不能。」高品那里肯依，先罚蕙芳五杯，再罚了春航四杯。南湘忽然想着了两句，忍不住不说，也顾不得罚酒，便一","en":"finally relented. Nanxiang then said: \\"'To exchange millet for it.' Therefore, 'Master Xu, for what reason...'\\" Chunhang said, \\"The ninth is left to me.\\" He thought for a while, then said: \\"'Compare it with the lesser ritual, for what reason? Compare it with the greater ritual, for what reason?'\\" Huifang stamped his foot: \\"Why must you say two lines?\\" Gao Pin said, \\"Excellent,"}],"15":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":3,"tokens":["春航","田湘帆"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说史南湘进内与仲清、王恂见了、喝了几杯茶、王恂问其所从来、南湘将日间的事，一一说了，又将春航、蕙芳的光景说了一会。王恂、仲清羡慕不已。仲清道：「不料苏媚香竟能这样，从此田湘帆倒可以收心改过了。」也将前日题画规劝之事说了，又说春航且有徽愠。南湘道：「改日我与你们和事如何？」又问起子玉来，仲清道：「庾香日间在此，他的李先生于月初选了安徽知县，就","en":"asked him where he had been, and Nanxiang recounted the day's events one by one, then spoke at some length about Chunhang and Huifang. Wang Xun and Zhongqing found themselves unable to conceal their profound admiration. Zhongqing said, \\"Who would have thought Su Meixiang capable of this? Henceforth, Tian Xiangfan may truly shed his past and turn over a new leaf.\\" He then"},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":1,"tokens":["田湘帆"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"非玉侬之戏不看，非玉侬的之酒不喝的了。」漱芳笑道：「玉侬行事还没媚香的奇，近来闻他天天到宏济寺去一回。有个什么田湘帆，也是个风流名士，闹到不堪。后来见了媚香的戏，便天天跟着他的车，他往东就往东，他往西就往西，跟了整个月。媚香怜念他，与他一谈，倒谈成了知己，如今是莫逆得很，不可一日不见。」次贤笑道：「有这等事！我看媚香真算个鹘伶渌老不寻常，竟有人笼络得住他么．这人必","en":"remarkable as Meixiang's. I hear that lately Meixiang goes to Hongji Temple once a day. There is a certain Tian Xiangfan there, a renowned man of romantic temperament, who has created quite a stir. He once saw Meixiang perform and thereafter followed his carriage every single day: wherever Meixiang went east, he went east; wherever Meixiang went west, he went west, for"}],"17":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":3,"tokens":["田湘帆","湘帆"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉即把日间一一过访不遇事说过。先是王恂开言道：「今日我们都在卓然斋中，交会田湘帆与媚香，又遇见竹君前来。那湘帆果是吾辈，与媚香相处的光景，真令人羡慕。」高品道：「湘帆此时是六根全净，五蕴皆空，守定了约法三章，不许你胡行乱走，始信人间果然多是惧内的，怪不得庸庵、竹君辈，牢守闺房，不奉将令不敢妄离一步。违了，晚间夹棍利害。","en":"avail. Wang Xun was the first to speak: \\"Today we were all gathered in Zhuoran's studio, where we met with Tian Xiangfan and Meixiang, and chanced upon Zhujun who arrived later. Xiangfan is truly a kindred spirit. The way he and Meixiang interact is genuinely enviable.\\" Gao Pin chimed in: \\"Xiangfan is now a man whose six senses are entirely purified, his five skandhas"},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":3,"tokens":["湘帆"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"湘帆还是对着个半雌半雄的人，已经如此，又何怪四畏堂中规矩乎！」说得众人要笑，仲清道：「你也是门内出身，如今隔远了，就夸口了。」南湘道：「我见卓然与他细君书，如属员与上司禀帖一样，有受恩深重，浃髓沦肌等语。」众人大笑，高品道：「岂有此理！你这个谎也撒得不像","en":"\\"And Xiangfan is only dealing with a partner who is half-feminine and half-masculine, yet already he is brought to such a state! Is it any wonder about the strict rules within the Hall of the Four Fears?\\" This caused everyone to laugh. Zhongqing said: \\"You yourself"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":6,"tokens":["田春航","春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"却说田春航自与蕙芳订交之后，足不出户。蕙芳每日不论早晚。必来一次，或清谈或小饮，并时进箴砭之语，所以春航已心满意足，只有研磨经籍，挥洒词翰。本来是三冬富足，倚马万言，一时名动京师，当道者皆欲罗致门下。无奈春航磊落自负，以干谒为耻，未尝怀刺一谒要津，宁居萧寺，玉","en":"Now let us speak of Tian Chunhang. Since forging his bond with Huifang, he had not set foot outside the temple grounds. Huifang came without fail once a day, whether morning or evening, sometimes for pure conversation, sometimes for a modest drink, occasionally offering words of admonishment"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":1,"tokens":["湘帆"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，尚短几人？」文泽道：「就止寿翁一人。花部中未到的尚有四人：琴言、琪官都有病，早来辞了，桂保、春喜是必来的。等湘帆一到，就可坐了。」","en":"Qiguan are both ill and sent their regrets early this morning; Guibao and Chunxi will certainly be here. Once Xiangfan arrives, we can take our seats.\\""},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":4,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话言未完，春航已到，大家重新叙礼，群芳亦都见了，未免取笑的取笑，诙谐的诙谐。宝珠与素兰拉过红毡铺地，摆了两张交椅，要请春航、蕙芳并坐受拜。二人如何肯坐，急行收了。此时春航、蕙芳二人真觉口众我寡，只好听凭他们取笑；若回答两句，又惹出许多话来。子玉颇敬春航仪容之洒落，","en":"Before Wenze had finished speaking, Chunhang had already arrived. Everyone exchanged greetings afresh, and all the beauties were also introduced. Banter and teasing naturally followed. Baozhu and Sulan drew out a red felt mat and placed it on the floor, setting up two folding chairs, intending"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":2,"tokens":["春航","田春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"文泽即命家人摆起三桌席来，因问道：「今日之坐，还是叙齿，还是推寿翁寿母上坐？」春航、蕙芳同道：「这断断不敢，自然叙齿为妙。」众人也说叙齿罢了。文泽送酒，先定中间一席。论齿是次贤为长，次贤自知不能推逊，只得依了，并坐者为高品，次是仲清；左首一席，子云为首，次南湘，次子玉；右首一席，田春航为首，次王恂，文泽作陪。是每席三位。","en":"He asked: \\"For today's seating, shall we go by seniority, or shall we place the birthday honorees at the head?\\" Chunhang and Huifang said together: \\"We absolutely cannot accept that; seniority is the natural arrangement.\\" Everyone agreed to go by seniority. Wenze arranged the wines, and the center table was first set in order. By age, Cixian was eldest; knowing he could"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"云道：「今日起意是因媚香，引得百花齐放，胜唐宫之剪彩。弟意欲仰观诸兄珠玉，先作一联句何如？」众人道：「最好。」春航道：「古体呢，近体？」次贤道：「近体发挥难透，人多恐易平直，不如古体罢。」","en":"pearls and jade of all the gentlemen. How about we compose a linked verse first?\\" Everyone said: \\"Excellent.\\" Chunhang said: \\"In the ancient style, or the modern style?\\" Cixian said: \\"The modern style is difficult to develop fully, and with so many people it might easily become flat and straightforward. It would be better to use the ancient style.\\""},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"于是以年齿为先后，仍系次贤为首，次子云，次高品，次南湘，次文泽，次仲清，次春航，次王恂，次子玉，共是九人。王恂已将子玉叫醒，净净脸，素兰取出一颗醒酒丸给子玉吃了。子玉不好意思，只得勉强扎挣。素兰见子玉不语不言，似醉非醉，心上猜着是为琴言未来。一因人多不好解慰他，二因提起琴言反恐倒勾他的心事，非惟不能宽解，越增愁闷了，反倒走开，","en":"Cixian again taking the lead, followed by Ziyun, then Gao Pin, then Nanxiang, then Wenze, then Zhongqing, then Chunhang, then Wang Xun, and finally Ziyu, making nine people in all. Wang Xun had already roused Ziyu and had him wash his face; Sulan brought out a sobering pill and gave it to Ziyu to ingest. Ziyu felt embarrassed and forced himself to pull it together. Seeing"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「化工细选无瑕琢。」众人道：「此句亦出得好，又转韵了。」仲清接着写道：「一一雕镌设眉目。费尽龙宫十斛珠。」轮到春航了，接道：「截来碧海双枝玉。小玉生嗔碧玉愁。」众人又赞道：「好！又提得清楚。「底下是王恂，略费思索，写道：「玉人又恐占千秋。婵娟疑窃嫦娥药。」大家正要赞好，高品道：「这句忒骂得恶，难道个个都像月宫里的兔子？」众人大笑起来，王恂倒觉不安。众旦便骂高品道","en":"carved and engraved, laying out eyes and brows; / Exhausting the Dragon Palace's ten pecks of pearls.\\" It was Chunhang's turn; he continued: \\"Cutting a pair of jade branches from the azure sea; / Little Jade feels a flash of anger, Green Jade feels sorrow.\\" Everyone praised again: \\"Good! It lifts the theme clearly again.\\" Next was Wang Xun; he thought for a bit and wrote:"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":2,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"得无情无绪，众人亦都明白。子玉虽极意遮饰，终究思绪不佳，不得已，勉强写道：「顾盼曾回玉女眸。鸾篦亲掠云鬟绿。」春航道：「此系上妆时了，底下倒要细细摹写呢。」子玉此时想着琴言唱那《惊梦》的神情，所以有」曾回玉女眸」一句。众人不解其故，不过见其兴致不佳，故尔意不在诗，空衍了些。该又是次贤，接道：「镜里芙蓉睡新足。宛转歌成白纻词。」又转到子云，接道：「娇柔解唱红绡曲。","en":"glance in passing, that jade-girl's eyes turned back once;\\nluan-comb sweeping gently across cloudy-green tresses.\\"\\n\\nChunhang said: \\"This takes us to the dressing scene, so the continuation will need to describe things finely.\\" Ziyu at this moment was thinking of the expression Qinyan had worn while performing 'The Interrupted Dream,' which accounted for the line 'that jade-girl's"},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「忍教天地错阴阳。只闻雌霓成神女。」众人道：「此是规讽之辞，倒不是刻薄，世间竟亦不能无此事。但不在我辈中耳。」春航联道：「莫变雄风当大王。画堂终日开良宴。」众人又复笑起来。高品道：「诗言志，解铃便是系铃人。若我做了，又不是了。」此下应是王恂，王恂道：「可以收了，轮到庾香作结罢。」写道：「扇底窥郎留半面。拾得瑶光一片明。」众人齐赞道：「好！应结句了，这一结倒不容易","en":"cautionary and admonishing verse, not vicious mockery. Such things do indeed exist in this world, though not among us.\\" Chunhang linked:\\n\\n\\"Let not the male wind turn into a great king;\\nin the painted hall, the fine banquet is held day by day.\\"\\n\\nEveryone laughed again. Gao Pin said: \\"Poetry expresses the will; the one who ties the bell must untie it. If I were to write this one,"},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"？」众人皆道：「断无不来之理，如有不到者罚他作一东，再叙一天。」宝珠道；「只怕我没有这脸面，断乎不能全来的。」春航道：「为什么不来？况且你是个花王，这些群花是要来朝贺的。就是我们看花人，赏到国色天香没有不踊跃从事。」南湘道：「你交给我，如有一人不到，罚我作东一天，两人不到，罚我作东两天。」宝珠道：「真么？明日酒醒了，不要又想不起了。」独子玉默然不语，大家说说笑笑","en":"another gathering.\\" Baozhu said: \\"I fear I don't have that standing; surely not everyone will come on my account.\\" Chunhang said: \\"Why would they not? And besides, you are the king of flowers, and these assembled blossoms will naturally come to pay homage. As for us flower-admirers, when we encounter beauty as striking as national-fragrance and heavenly-perfume, how could"}],"19":[{"paragraph":18,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"是日已是傍晚，可可走到蕙芳门口，恰就遇着蕙芳从春航处回来。蕙芳一见是潘三，心上着实吃了一惊，只得跳下车来，让潘三爷进内。潘三便搀着蕙芳的手，喘吁吁走进里面，到客房坐下。蕙芳便问道：「潘三爷，这几天总不见你，在那里发财？你能总不肯赏驾。记得那一天是因华公子住在城外，传了我去，实在短伺候，你不要怪，咱们","en":"that day; as chance would have it, he arrived at Huifang's gate at the very moment Huifang was returning from Chunhang's place. Huifang, seeing it was Pan Qiguan, was inwardly startled but had no choice; he jumped down from his carriage and invited the Third Master Pan inside. Pan Qiguan seized Huifang's hand and puffed along into the inner room, where they sat down"}],"20":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"。知道潘三是色大胆小，果然中计而去，又哄过了一次。虽然得了他一个金镯，蕙芳心中也着实踌躇，恐怕明日又来，只好到春航寓内躲避几天，再看罢了。潘三一路丧气而回，幸怕他的老婆，不敢公然在外胡闹，不然只怕蕙芳虽然伶俐，也就难招架了。今天又空闹了一场，只好慢慢儿再将银钱巴结他，买转他的心来。","en":"still genuinely troubled in his heart, fearing Pan would come back the next day. The only recourse was to move to Chunhang's lodgings and hide for a few days, then see. Pan Qiguan went home in low spirits; fortunately he was afraid of his wife and dared not cause scenes openly outside the home — otherwise, even clever as Huifang was, it might have been hard to hold him off."},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"志，刘文泽是他岳母惦记他，来接他并其室吴氏，同到直隶总督衙门去了。此中已少了三人，只有子云、次贤、南湘、仲清、春航、王恂六人，不时往来。","en":"the office of the Viceroy of Zhili. So three of the group were gone; only Ziyun, Cixian, Nanxiang, Zhongqing, Chunhang, and Wang Xun — six people — continued to meet from time to time."},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，孙宅的陆夫人之类，也觉得热闹。王恂与仲清这怡园之约，就不能去了。是日子云、次贤知道了，也去拜拜寿，适遇南湘、春航皆在，就约了回来。仲清、王恂说如客散得早，也来赴约。","en":"of this, Ziyun and Cixian also went to offer birthday congratulations; there they happened to find Nanxiang and Chunhang both present, so they invited them to come back with them. Zhongqing and Wang Xun said that if the guests dispersed early, they would also come to keep the appointment."},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":2,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"有几十株苍松，黛色参天的遮断眼界，树杪处微露碧瓦数鳞，朱楼一角。此间颇觉清风荡漾，水石清寒，飘飘乎有凌虚之想。春航道：「奇奥！文心一至于此，即匡庐之香炉峰，何以过之。」南湘道：「前似王麓台，此似萧尺木，幽邃处却不险仄。」子云道：「此皆静宜手笔，布置时曾数易其稿。」次贤道：「也亏那几株松树，不然也就一望易尽。」春航道：「正不知静宜先生胸中有多少丘壑，的是驱排河岳神","en":"and stones breathed a clean chill, and one felt a floating sensation, as if ascending above the mortal realm. Chunhang exclaimed: \\"How wondrous and profound! Even the utmost of literary imagination could go no further; even the Incense Burner Peak of Mount Lu could offer nothing superior.\\" Nanxiang said: \\"The earlier scenery resembled Wang Lutai's style; this evokes"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"料其词翰如此。」子云道：「华公子天分极高，不过工夫稍浅，亦其势位所误。若论书、画、诗、词，倒与其境遇相反的。」春航道：「若仅闻于流俗之口，几乎失是人矣。即此联句，可见其胸次之雅；即此书法，可见其意气之豪。」说罢，远远望见水榭边，荡出两个花艇来，白舫青帘尚隔着红桥绿柳，咿哑柔橹之声，宛转彩莲之曲，正是水光如镜，楼台倒影，飞燕低掠，游鱼仰吹，须臾之间已过红桥，慢慢拢","en":"truth, his calligraphy, painting, poetry, and lyrics run rather contrary to what one might expect of his station.\\" Chunhang agreed: \\"If one listened only to the gossip of the common crowd, one would almost miss the man entirely. From this couplet alone, one sees the elegance of his mind; from this calligraphy alone, one sees the heroic gallantry of his spirit.\\" As they spoke,"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"巧山，下是绿阴千树，金弹离离，结满了梅子，青黄各半，把个梅崦遮住，看不清楚。对岸树石蒙茸，却不知还有多少亭院。春航问南湘道：「这园子里共游过几处了？」南湘道：「到却到过许多回，逛却没有逛到。一喝酒就是一天，那里能逛。约有七八处逛过。」宝珠道：「我同瘦香是逛完的了。」蕙芳道：「我就是桂岭、菊畦、兰径没有到过，其余也都逛完。」","en":"was thickly overgrown with trees and rocks; how many more pavilions and courts it concealed one could not know. Chunhang asked Nanxiang: \\"How many parts of this garden have you toured so far?\\" Nanxiang said: \\"I've been here many times, but I've never actually toured it properly. A drinking session takes the whole day — when would one find time to stroll about? I've been"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":2,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"道：「客也饿了，此刻将近午正，可以坐罢。」只见四个小童托上四个金漆盘来，放着几碗杏酪，分送各人面前，各人吃了。春航道：「索性上那两层再回来坐罢。」于是转上楼梯，上了第二层，略小了些，是四面样式，空出一转回廊，有阑干回护，也有雕窗隔作八处，古玩器皿一样的精雅。望见东北角上柳阴中，泊着龙舟，有三丈多高，舟身子是刻成彩画一条青龙，中间却是五六层架子装起，纯用五彩绸缎绫","en":"four gold-lacquered trays with several bowls of apricot-kernel porridge, which were distributed to each person. Chunhang said: \\"Why not go up to the upper two stories and then come back to sit?\\" So they turned up the stairway to the second story, which was somewhat smaller — four-sided in design, with an open corridor running around it with railings on all sides, and carved"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，名花五人。子云便要穿衣，经史、田三位止住，只得就便服送了酒，依齿而坐。东首是南湘，子云命兰保坐在肩下。西首是春航，肩下是蕙芳。\\n上面是次贤，肩下是漱芳。","en":"attire, seating by seniority. To the east sat Nanxiang; Ziyun asked Lanbao to sit at his shoulder. To the west sat Chunhang, with Huifang at his shoulder. At the head sat Cixian, with Shufang at his shoulder."},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":2,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"陪饮一小杯，即与张顺豁十拳。李逵赢拳，张顺吃酒；张顺赢拳，李逵喝开水。」众人看了皆笑。次贤先饮了门面杯，南湘、春航陪了一杯。即与子云猜拳，子云饮了六杯酒，次贤饮了四杯茶。众人道：「倒也有趣。」又见拿了一个上来，看筹是南湘的。那面是：「武松醉夺快活林。」下注：无三不过岗，先满饮三杯。对面为蒋门神，要连胜三拳方过，再打通关一转。」南湘道：「这一回太多了，三杯我就喝，","en":"Zhang Shun wins, Li Kui drinks plain water.\\" Everyone laughed. Cixian first drained the opening cup; Nanxiang and Chunhang accompanied with one cup each. Then he finger-guessed with Ziyun; Ziyun drank six cups of wine, Cixian drank four cups of plain water. Everyone said: \\"Quite entertaining.\\" Then another was retrieved; the tally was Nanxiang's. The inscription read: \\"Wu"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":8,"tokens":["田春航","春航","湘帆"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"的就不是了。」即将酒饮尽。素兰一想，倒被宝珠讨了便宜。再拿那一根筹看时，是蕙芳的。再看那面，众人就笑起来，只有田春航强住了笑，脸上却有些红。原来这一根筹偏偏是蕙芳，也是捉弄潘三的报应。上写着：「潘金莲雪天戏叔。」注：「三杯，并坐左边的为武松。第一杯要露出了胸，一手搭在武松肩上，叫声「叔叔，你饮这一杯。」第二杯要自吃半杯，又道：「叔叔，你若有心就吃这半杯儿残酒。」第","en":"him. Now the second tally was looked at — it was Huifang's. When everyone saw it they burst out laughing; only Tian Chunhang managed to suppress his laughter, though his face showed some color. As it happened, this tally fell to Huifang — which was rather a case of karmic retribution for the Pan Qiguan business. The inscription read: \\"Pan Jinlian Flirts with Her Brother-in-Law"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"」注：「先饮一大杯，首二坐为金刚，每人豁三拳。」蕙芳道：「他就这等便宜，我偏这么啰嗦。」兰保照令行了，与南湘、春航各豁了三拳。","en":"through all that trouble.\\" Lanbao followed the game rules and finger-guessed three rounds each with Nanxiang and Chunhang."},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一杯。」众人道：「这还可以，在不即不离之间。况且真是个姓金的，怎么遇得这般凑巧？」漱芳只得弹起琵琶，敬了南湘、春航、次贤三人。","en":"what an extraordinary coincidence!\\" Shufang had no choice but to take up the pipa, and offered cups to Nanxiang, Chunhang, and Cixian."},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":6,"tokens":["田春航","春航","湘帆"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"再看葫芦内筹是田春航。春航急看那一面，想一想，又说声：「不好！」众人又复拍手大笑道：「今日就是媚香与湘帆牵缠不清。」蕙芳红着脸道：「这是你们有心做成的，不然为什么单是这两根筹这么样呢？」次贤道：「冤枉冤哉！算我有心捡出的，难道你们又有心捡过去吗？」原来筹上写的是：「一丈","en":"The next gourd retrieved contained Tian Chunhang's tally. Chunhang quickly looked at the inscription, thought for a moment, and said: \\"Terrible!\\" Everyone burst out clapping and laughing again: \\"Today Meixiang and Xiangfan are clearly bound together by fate.\\" Huifang's face reddened and he said: \\"You've"},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"天色已晚，南湘、春航要回，小使送上衣帽，各人穿戴，谢了主人并次贤，绕道出园。子云道：「今日本有一事要烦两兄。园中各处的对联尚须添设几副，今日倒被龙舟耽误了，迟日再请一游，并约庾香、剑潭诸君何如？」史、田二人应了，遂上车而去。这边相公五人，也各陆续散去。这回怡园二次宴客，","en":"The day was now late. Nanxiang and Chunhang wished to leave; small attendants brought their outer garments and hats, they dressed and put them on, thanked the host and Cixian, and took the roundabout path out of the garden. Ziyun said: \\"Today there was actually one matter I had meant to trouble"}],"21":[{"paragraph":11,"mentions":3,"tokens":["田湘帆","湘帆"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「什么笑话？你快快说罢。」素兰道：「媚香的生日，田湘帆做了一篇小序，大家说做得好，度香便抄了。那一天，庾香来，静宜便将小序给庾香看，庾香也赞了几声。度香在旁说道：「湘帆好一个浓艳文心，愈艳愈好，愈浓愈好。」度香正赞湘帆的文章，庾香忽说道：「玉侬自然在玉艳之上，玉艳虽好，尚逊瑶卿、媚香一筹，而玉侬则玉树琼","en":"\\"What joke — say it now.\\" Sulan said: \\"On Meixiang's birthday Tian Xiangfan wrote a short preface — everyone praised it — Duxiang copied it. The day Yuxiang came Jingyi showed him the piece; Yuxiang admired it. Standing by, Duxiang said: 'Xiangfan's style — the thicker the richer — the richer the better.' Jingyi and Duxiang"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":1,"tokens":["湘帆"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一媚香尖利不肯吃亏的，偏偏吃了这闷亏；又听得他为潘三缠不清楚，媚香却不肯告诉人，人都传说出来，说媚香也怕他，到湘帆处躲了好几天，如今是交代下人：若是潘三来，总回不在家，又说他床后开了一个门，通得厨房，为避潘三之计。","en":"loss; also how Pan the Third plagued him — Meixiang would not tell — gossip said Meixiang feared him and hid at Xiangfan's for days — now he instructed servants: if Pan the Third called, always answer not at home — rumor added he had opened a door behind his bed through to the kitchen to dodge Pan the Third."}],"24":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["湘帆"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"。到四月里又去闹他，偏偏碰着假查夜的来，唬得潘三跑了，倒丢了一个金镯。」王恂笑道：「媚香原是个顶尖利的人，就是湘帆能服他。这潘银匠自然要上当的。」仲清道：「还听得那个李元茂，在东园闹了一个大笑话。」王恂道：「怎么样？」仲清道：「有人看见李元茂在土窑子，一个人去嫖，被些土棍打进去，将他剥个干净。李元茂围了草帘子，不能出来，惹得看的人，把那土窑子都挤倒了。后来不知怎","en":"terrified, he fled, losing a gold bangle in the process.\\" Wang Xun chuckled, \\"Meixiang is as sharp as a needle. Only Xiangfan could ever tame him. A mere silversmith was destined to be played for a fool.\\" Zhongqing continued, \\"I also heard that Li Yuanmao made a spectacular fool of himself over in the East Garden.\\" When Wang Xun asked how, Zhongqing elaborated, \\"Someone spotted"},{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["湘帆"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"说容或有之。」王恂道：「吾兄之论，如楞严说法，绝无翳障，以此观庾香、琴言之情，正是极深极正，就在人人之上了。若湘帆、媚香之情，较之庾香、琴言，又将何如呢？」","en":"stands deepest and straightest, elevating it far beyond common folk. How, then, does it compare to the bond between Xiangfan and Meixiang?\\""},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":5,"tokens":["湘帆"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"仲清笑道：「那又是一种。我看湘帆之爱媚香，起初却是为色起见。已花了无数冤钱，一旦遇见这样绝色，故辱之而不怒，笑之而不耻，犹之下界凡人，望见了天仙，自然要想刻刻去瞻仰的。及到媚香怜其难诉之隐情，感其不怨之劳苦，似欲稍加颜色，令其自明。及亲见湘帆吐属之雅，容貌之秀，而且低首下心，竭力尽","en":"Zhongqing laughed, \\"That is entirely another species of love. As I see it, Xiangfan's devotion to Meixiang was born initially of physical desire. He squandered oceans of silver, and upon gazing at such transcendent loveliness, he endured insult without rage and mockery without shame. He was like a mortal who had caught a glimpse of"}],"25":[{"paragraph":6,"mentions":1,"tokens":["湘帆"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"可可的这么凑巧，竟一个都不能来。」文泽便问何故，子云道：「庾香旧病又发了。史竹君昨日醉坏了，竟至呕血不能出房。湘帆说是没有会过华公子，不肯来。庸庵为是这两天，他夫人要弄璋了，一步不离伺候。剑潭见诸人不来，也就辞了。昨日只得邀了张仲雨，倒是同华公子相识的。余外就是静宜，共有五人，只有两席。他们没有会过华公子，不晓得是怎么一个富贵骄奢的气概，所以不肯来。你也长见的，","en":"has flared up again. Shi Zhujun drank himself sick yesterday — vomiting blood, unable even to leave his room. Xiangfan says he has never met Young Master Hua and refuses to come. Yong'an's wife is about to give birth any day now, so he will not leave her side for a single step. Jiantan, seeing that no one else was coming, also sent his regrets. Yesterday I had no choice"}],"30":[{"paragraph":4,"mentions":1,"tokens":["田春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"可可的一齐分房，将那一班知名之士回避了一大半。内中除徐子云、史南湘是前科举人，萧次贤是高尚自居，无心问世，只有田春航、高品入场。如子玉、王恂、文泽、仲清等皆遵例回避。子玉在家闷闷不乐，又因琴言杳无音信，内外隔绝，又不能传递消息，几次要去访问聘才，又因华府威严，豪奴气焰。故而子玉不肯前去，只得静坐书斋，闷坐而已。","en":"exam, and Xiao Cixian, who considered himself above worldly affairs and had no intention of participating, only Tian Chunhang and Gao Pin entered the examination hall. Ziyu, Wang Xun, Wenze, and Zhongqing all withdrew according to the rules. Ziyu stayed at home, brooding unhappily. Moreover, because there was no news from Qinyan and they were completely cut off from each other,"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":2,"tokens":["春航","湘帆"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"蕙芳敬到子云面前，子云问起春航场中文字得意么，蕙芳道：「前日史竹君说他的很好，是必中的。」文泽在那席听了笑道：「我听得你在家，天天的焚香祷告，湘帆就文章不佳，也是必要中的。」蕙芳笑道：「谁说的？中举可以祷告得来，我倒愿替众人祷告了。」华公子问道：「你们说的什么？」子云正要回言，蕙","en":"When Huifang offered wine to Ziyun, Ziyun asked how Chunhang's examination essays went. Huifang replied, \\"The other day, Shi Zhujun said his essays were very good and he will definitely pass.\\" Hearing this from the other table, Wenze laughed and said, \\"I heard you burn incense and pray every day at home. Even"}],"31":[{"paragraph":17,"mentions":1,"tokens":["田春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"其间。名为看破，其实情怀未断，犹时一念及，涕泪潸潸，不能自解。十五日到王文辉家一走，王恂、仲清约定明日午刻去望田春航、高品。子玉已吃过了早饭，在书房等候。不多一会，史、颜诸人已到，南湘坐了，与子玉叙谈。仲清、王恂先进内室，见了颜夫人，略坐一坐即出来。喝了一杯茶，即催子玉同走。","en":"brief walk to Wang Wenhui's home on the fifteenth, where he agreed to accompany Wang Xun and Zhongqing to visit Tian Chunhang and Gao Pin at noon the following day. Ziyu had already eaten breakfast and was waiting in his study. Soon enough, Shi, Yan, and the others arrived. Nanxiang took a seat and chatted with Ziyu, while Zhongqing and Wang Xun proceeded into the inner chambers"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":3,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"外间已套上车，子玉也不换衣服，云儿恐怕寒冷，包上了几件棉衣。上了车，来到春航、高品寓处一问，都已回寓，遂同下车进内，一直走到里面。只听高品一片笑声，夹着些燕语莺声在内。到春航斋中，见苏蕙芳、李玉林在内。高品、春航见了四人进来，不胜欢喜，让坐了，苏、李二相公也都见了。","en":"wrapped him in several layers of cotton garments. They boarded the carriage and headed straight for the residence of Chunhang and Gao Pin. Upon inquiring, they learned that both men had already returned to their quarters, so the group disembarked and walked straight inside. From within, they could hear Gao Pin's boisterous laughter mingled with the delicate, melodic voices"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":4,"tokens":["春航","湘帆"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"略谈了几句，仲清便问闱中的事。春航、高品多属得意。仲清道：「湘帆的文章请教过了，是一定得意的。卓然的文章，快拿出来看看，想来定有出人头地的好处。」高品道：「不好，不好，不必看他。」王恂道：「什么话！就不好也要看看。」南湘道：「这三道题，卓然一定见长，就不看也不妨。」子玉道：「到底看看","en":"After exchanging a few pleasantries, Zhongqing asked about the civil service examinations. Both Chunhang and Gao Pin seemed quite pleased with their prospects. Zhongqing said, \\"I have already seen Xiangfan's essays, and I am certain of his success. Zhuoran, you must bring out your essays for us to read; I imagine they possess an excellence that towers above"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"发起怔来。忽然高品的小使进来请他，说有客要会。高品即忙出去，有好一刻工夫尚不进来。南湘道：「什么人这么长谈？」春航道：「近来卓然有些古怪，找他的不一而足，却非寻常往来，都是俗陋不堪的人。前日我的小使见他的管家，拿了好几封银包进来，问他，他说不知谁的。」仲清道：「是了，卓然也穷极了，自然要作这个买卖。况且这篇文字是信手写的，不然何至忙到如此。」南湘道：「不错，你听","en":"hurriedly left the room and did not return for a very long time. Nanxiang asked, \\"Who could be talking for so long?\\" Chunhang explained, \\"Zhuoran has been acting rather odd lately. He receives an endless stream of visitors, but they are not his usual acquaintances; they are all dreadfully vulgar and unrefined people. The other day, my page boy saw his servant bring in several"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":4,"tokens":["春航","湘帆"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，一齐站起道：「此等高义，今人所难。我等自当盥沐敬书，表其万一。且香雪有如此高弟令子，即落魄而死，亦无遗恨。」春航与子玉更觉赞叹不置。南湘道：「这篇传你自己作的么？」蕙芳道：「都是实话，就是少些文气。」仲清道：「也好，请湘帆润色润色就好了。」即说道：「我与他作篇诔。」王恂道：「我作几首挽诗罢。」南湘道：「我作墓志。」春航道：「把他的作了略节，我另作一篇传如何？」","en":"pupil and so bright a son, even though Fragrant-Snow died in obscurity, he surely harbors no lingering regrets.\\" Chunhang and Ziyu were particularly vocal in their unceasing praise. Nanxiang asked, \\"Did you write this biography yourself?\\" Huifang replied, \\"It contains only the raw facts; it lacks literary polish.\\" Zhongqing suggested, \\"It is quite good, though having Xiangfan"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":1,"tokens":["湘帆"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"再祭奠？且外面俗眼甚多，反为诸公添些物议。」南湘道：「这倒不妨，他也是士林中人，人也知道，且到那几日再议。我看湘帆，似不能少此一举，我辈附尾，亦无不可。」今日有蕙芳这一请，诸人动了恻隐之念，不能尽欢，到了初更，各自散了。","en":"man of the scholarly circles, and people are aware of that. Let us decide when the day draws nearer. Looking at Xiangfan, it seems he cannot do without this gesture, and there is no harm in the rest of us following his lead.\\" Moved by Huifang's plea, which stirred deep feelings of pity and melancholy within them, the group found little joy in further merriment. By the"},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":2,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"浩然亭上，与那些相公一叙，不很好吗？」仲清道：「果然好，我未想到。如庸庵、庾香不来，我们四人罢了。」于是又同到春航处约定，即叫春航备了酒肴，于午刻在那里等候。","en":"of that. If Yong'an and Yuxiang cannot join us, the four of us will suffice.\\" They then proceeded together to Chunhang's residence to finalize the arrangements, instructing him to prepare food and wine and to wait for them there at noon."},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":2,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"天井内东边，又有一重小门，进了门有三四间小屋。春航、高品与蕙芳等都在其内，有一个老僧陪着。春航、蕙芳迎将出来。","en":"In the eastern courtyard, they passed through another small door into a space with three or four small rooms. Chunhang, Gao Pin, Huifang, and their party were inside, accompanied by an old monk. Chunhang and Huifang stepped out to greet them."},{"paragraph":30,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一奠，我们往锦秋墩去逛罢。」蕙芳即将祭筵就叫在那屋里摆起来。蕙芳上香，素兰奠酒，漱芳执壶，宝珠上菜，桂保焚纸，春航、南湘、高品同行了一个礼，五旦连连叩头代谢。","en":"libations of wine, Shufang held the pitcher, Baozhu arranged the dishes, and Guibao burned the paper offerings. Chunhang, Nanxiang, and Gao Pin bowed respectfully in unison, while the five dans kowtowed repeatedly in solemn gratitude."},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"余，已到了墩前。此墩巍然若山，上有梵宇，顶上建一大亭，名浩然亭，四围远眺，数十里城池村落，尽在目前，倒也有趣。春航道：「今日目击荒凉，心殊难受。及到此处，觉得眼界一空。」高品道：「这个锦秋墩，我竟没有到过，竹君想来是游过的了。」南湘道：「我是第一次。我因前日偶见前人有《题锦秋墩》诗，所以知道。大远的路，谁到此间来？」仲清道：「其实也好。天天在热闹地方，也应冷落一","en":"the city walls and surrounding villages stretching for dozens of li in every direction—a truly captivating view. Chunhang sighed, \\"Witnessing such desolation today has left my heart heavy with sorrow. But arriving here, I feel my vision suddenly clear and expand.\\" Gao Pin said, \\"I have actually never been to Brook Autumn Mound before. I assume Zhujun has visited here in"},{"paragraph":33,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"上头都知道了。」大家都笑起来。蕙芳预备了两桌蔬菜，四样点心，就借庙中厨房作起来，九人于地下铺上垫子，席地围坐。春航与蕙芳相交了半年，久成道义之交，今复见其仗义疏财，深情感旧，愈加敬畏。再想起自己去年及春间的光景，竟至潦倒穷途，势将沟壑。若非蕙芳成就，虽满腹珠玑，也不能到今日。对西风之衰飒，怆秋景之萧条，烟霏霏而欲雨，云黯黯而常阴，不觉悲从中来，泪落不已。众人不解","en":"cooked in the temple's borrowed kitchen. The nine of them spread out cushions on the ground and sat in a circle. Chunhang and Huifang had been friends for half a year, developing a bond rooted in deep mutual respect. Seeing Huifang's incredible generosity today, and witnessing his profound loyalty to his past, Chunhang revered him even more. This led Chunhang to recall"}],"32":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":6,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"初八日方见晴明。场中定于初十日出榜，初九日一早即报起来。凡下场的个个意马心猿，到了这几天，寝食俱废，就是高品、春航亦未能免俗。春航初八日晚上太睡早了，睡不着，重又起来，至高品房中，见高品尚未安睡，二人谈起心事来。春航叹了一口气道：「我的名心原淡，中不中倒也无妨，就是对不住苏媚香，半年期望之心白白孤负了。科名虽不足贵，但古今名士才人，断无不从科名而起。」高品道：「","en":"who had taken the exams were restless; during these days, they lost their appetite and sleep. Even Gao Pin and Chunhang were no exception. On the night of the eighth, Chunhang went to bed too early and couldn't sleep. He got up again and went to Gao Pin's room, finding him still awake, and the two began to share their thoughts. Chunhang sighed and said, \\"I've always cared"},{"paragraph":2,"mentions":3,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"却说苏蕙芳惦记春航，亦复一夜不能安睡，比到起身时，已是巳正时候，连忙梳洗，即着人到外面打听可曾报动，那人去了。随后有个京官，着人来叫蕙芳去陪着登高，蕙芳那有心绪，回他进城去了。停了好一回，钟上已交午初，打听人转来道：「外间已报过四十名了，田老爷还没有在内，倒是那个姓归","en":"Meanwhile, Su Huifang was worrying about Chunhang and spent a sleepless night. By the time he rose, it was already mid-morning. He hurriedly washed and dressed, and sent someone outside to inquire if any announcements had been made. The person left. Afterwards, a capital official sent someone to ask"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":11,"tokens":["春航","湘帆"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"花了多少钱，方买得几出戏，学他作什么？」胡裁缝尚是啰嗦，好一回才去。已是上灯时候，蕙芳长叹一声，忍不住叫套车到春航处去，先与高品道喜。及到了宏济寺中，却是冷清清的。进内先见了高品的家人，问他，那人答应道：「方才报是报来，我们老爷说恐怕不是，不晓得什么缘故。」蕙芳走到里面，只见高品与春航对坐下棋，照应他坐了，春航便触起心事来，便把棋子一掳，说：「输了，不必下了。」","en":"already time to light the lamps. Huifang let out a long sigh and couldn't resist calling for a carriage to go to Chunhang's place, first to congratulate Gao Pin. When he arrived at Hongji Temple, it was quiet and desolate. He went in and first saw Gao Pin's servant, and asked him. The servant replied, \\"An announcement did come just now, but our master says he's afraid it's"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":6,"tokens":["春航","田春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"听得嚷道：「田老爷大喜，中的是南元。」春航一听，喜不可言，把箸子摔过一边，连忙走出位来，蕙芳也乐不可支。诸人是皆欢喜，忙看条子，是」中式第二名，田春航，年二十三岁江南上元县附贡生。」方才放心。报喜的讨赏钱，蕙芳带了些票子来，递给春航。春航先赏了十吊钱，道：「明早同高老爷报喜的一同来领赏就是了","en":"They heard someone shouting, \\"Great joy to Master Tian! He has passed as Nanyuan.\\" Hearing this, Chunhang was overjoyed beyond words; he threw his chopsticks aside and hurried from his seat, and Huifang too was ecstatic. Everyone was delighted and quickly looked at the slip: \\"Successful Candidate, Second Place: Tian Chunhang, age twenty-three, from Shangyuan"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":5,"tokens":["春航","湘帆"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"比外人，我对你们直讲罢，一千六百两银子卖掉了一个举人，这个杠花就是我中的，是张仲雨的过手，明日就要讨帐去了。」春航、南湘、仲清、蕙芳都埋怨他几句。高品道：「我岂不知此事原作不得，我也有个想头在内，或者今科不当中，或者我竟能名利双收，也未可知。况且我要回南一走，家内有几件大事急于要办，妙手空空的，亦殊难堪。如今倒罢了，虽不能巴结与湘帆作个同年，但不叫抬杠的做年伯，","en":"'Bier-pole Hua' is the one I sat for. Zhang Zhongyu was the middleman, and tomorrow I will go and collect the money.\\" Chunhang, Nanxiang, Zhongqing, and Huifang all scolded him. Gao Pin said, \\"I know this shouldn't be done, but I had a thought: either I wouldn't pass this time, or I might actually achieve both fame and fortune. Besides, I needed to take a trip back south; I"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"少顷，天色大明，红日已上，春航要出去见房师，并谒座师，各人也都散了。以后会同年、请吃酒，一连忙了半个月。","en":"Shortly after, the sky grew completely light and the red sun rose. Chunhang needed to go out to pay his respects to his examining master and the chief examiner, and everyone dispersed. Afterwards, there were meetings with classmates and celebratory banquets, keeping them busy for half a month."},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":5,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"春航出于第四房孙亮功门下，相见之后，亮功久已闻名，就是刘尚书、王阁学，虽未见过春航，于他儿子们书房内，见他些笔墨东西，也久已倾倒，惟恐不得其人为憾。今中了南元，十分欢喜。从此春航与文泽、王恂又成了世谊，更加亲爱。惟有孙氏昆仲颇难浃洽，然亦不得不往来，惟淡","en":"Chunhang had been passed by the fourth-room examiner, Sun Lianggong. Upon their meeting, Lianggong was extremely pleased that he had placed Nanyuan. He had long heard of Chunhang's reputation, as even Minister Liu and Academician Wang, though they had never met"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":2,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"已。仲清道：「这是天理昭彰，报应不爽。若没有那皂隶一闹，又有谁人知道？此等污秽东西算个孝廉，真辱抹杀多少人。」春航道：「如今世上竟不成事了。你看此中漏网者固多，冤枉者亦复不少。前日瑶卿说，我们同年与他最好，教他画画的那个南京人金粟，本是个名士，性情磊落，大雅不群。因初到京时寄居在某显宦家，也是自不检束，他的跟班与彼内眷有私，竟将相如、文君之事，疑到此君身上，因此","en":"would have known? For such a filthy creature to be counted a provincial graduate truly insults so many people.\\" Chunhang said, \\"Nothing in the world goes right these days. Look how many slip through the net, while many others are wrongly accused. The other day Yaoqing was saying that the man who is closest to our classmates and teaches him painting, a native of Nanjing"}],"33":[{"paragraph":5,"mentions":1,"tokens":["湘帆"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"看此等名士，竟遭此劫，天之妒才果如是耶！」因向宝珠道：「我听见人说，你之待此公，与此公之待你，亦不亚于蕙芳之待湘帆。且你于此公失意后，更觉亲密，一切旅费悉赖你周全。此等居心，尤为难得，真令世俗衣冠中人愧煞。此公亦甚知感激。」子玉一面说话，但见宝珠默默无言，眼眶一红，长叹一声，道：「同是天涯沦落人，相逢何必曾相识。」不禁落下泪来。子玉因无意中数语，竟触动宝珠心事，","en":"that the way you treat this gentleman, and the way he treats you, is no less than the devotion Huifang showed to Xiangfan. Moreover, since his misfortune, you have grown closer, fully providing for his travel expenses. Such a heart is exceedingly rare and puts the so-called scholars of our time to shame. This gentleman is also deeply grateful.\\" As Ziyu spoke, Baozhu remained"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"玩好等物。且幸所捐名次在前，约半年可选。因此胆壮心豪，与从前大不相同了。在店里住了两日，嫌他嘈杂，即租了宏济寺春航住的房子，高车大马，大阔起来。也不到梅宅去看望。蓉官、玉天仙时常往来，聘才以百金分送二人，又给了些零星玩好，日日征歌斗酒，自然有那一班气味相投的与他亲密。","en":"before. After staying at the inn for two days and finding it too noisy, he rented the house at Hongji Temple where Chunhang used to live. With a grand carriage and horses, he began to live extravagantly. He didn't even visit the Mei residence. Rongguan and Yutianxian visited frequently; Pincai distributed a hundred taels between them and gave them miscellaneous trinkets."}],"34":[{"paragraph":20,"mentions":1,"tokens":["田春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"又有田春航等这一班书呆架弄，因此越抬越高，连笑话也说不得一句。可笑那些相公装那样假斯文，油不油，醋不醋的，不是与这个同心，又是与那个知己。我真不信，难道他们对于那些粗卤的人，也能这样？我看他们就是会哄这班书呆子老斗的，身分也叫这些书呆子作坏了。他们见了，连个安","en":"\\"Then there are Tian Chunhang and that crowd of bookworms propping them up, so they get puffed higher and higher, until one cannot venture a single joke at their expense. It is laughable how those actors put on such phony refinement—neither oil nor vinegar—now of one heart with this"}],"35":[{"paragraph":6,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"再说王恂、颜仲清、文泽、春航，从十三日至十五日都在怡园赏灯饮酒。子玉也去了一天，因想去年此日初见琴言，今年似成隔世，不觉伤感了一回。新年上，诸名旦彼此纷纷请客，热闹了十余日。到了十七日，王恂、颜仲清飞了札来与子玉。","en":"Returning to Wang Xun, Yan Zhongqing, Liu Wenze, and Tian Chunhang—from the thirteenth to the fifteenth, they had all been at the Garden of Contentment, admiring lanterns and drinking wine. Ziyu had also joined them for one day. Remembering how he had first met Qinyan on this very day last year, and feeling as if a"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":1,"tokens":["田春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"堂会戏，不能分身。宝珠之外，来的是蕙芳、素兰、玉林、漱芳四人。这边名士，怡园二位之外，是刘文泽、颜仲清、王恂、田春航、梅子玉五人。共十二人。众客到齐，宝珠先叩谢了。","en":"scholars, apart from the two hosts of the Garden of Contentment, there were Liu Wenze, Yan Zhongqing, Wang Xun, Tian Chunhang, and Mei Ziyu—five in total. Together, they made twelve. Once all the guests had assembled, Baozhu first bowed in gratitude to everyone."},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"」子云道：「依我，把两张大方桌并拢来，就可坐了。」摆好了坐位，是东西对面八坐，南北对面四坐。文泽、仲清、王恂、春航、子玉、次贤、子云坐了东西，上下是蕙芳、素兰、玉林、漱芳、宝珠。宝珠坐了末位。","en":"The seating was arranged: eight facing east and west, four facing north and south. Wenze, Zhongqing, Wang Xun, Chunhang, Ziyu, Cixian, and Ziyun took the east-west seats, while the upper and lower seats were occupied by Huifang, Sulan, Yulin, Shufang, and Baozhu. Baozhu took the very last seat."},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"文泽奇得了不得，说道：「你能个个走到我才佩服，不然也是碰着的。」次贤道：「合席都要走到的。」于是敬仲清、王恂、春航、子玉以及五旦，走来走去，又稳，酒又一滴都不洒出来。喜得个个眉飞色舞，别人叫又不灵，个个称奇。","en":"otherwise, it's just luck.\\" Cixian replied, \\"It must visit everyone at the table.\\" He then toasted Zhongqing, Wang Xun, Chunhang, Ziyu, and the five performers. The cup rolled back and forth, smoothly and steadily, without spilling a single drop. Everyone was overjoyed and dancing with delight. Yet when others tried to command it, it failed to respond, leaving everyone marveling"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":2,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"字，又在第五，轮到次贤，杯子就到次贤面前。次贤喝了，念道：「愿陪鸾鹤回三山。」数到仲清，喝了酒，把酒斟了，走到春航面前，道：「罗帐四垂红烛背。」春航喝了，道：「好个「罗帐四垂红烛背」，香艳无比。」把酒喝了，即斟了酒，念道：「刺绣五纹添弱线。」数到宝珠。宝珠喝了酒，说道：「六字本来少，偏轮到我，只怕要罚酒了。」子玉道：「六字亦有。」","en":"crane back to the three mountains.\\" Counting to Zhongqing, he drank the wine, poured another cup, walked over to Chunhang, and recited, \\"The silk bed-curtains droop low on all four sides behind the red candle.\\" Chunhang drank it and praised, \\"What a fine line, 'The silk bed-curtains droop low on all four sides behind the red candle,' incomparably fragrant and alluring.\\""},{"paragraph":30,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"只得思索起来。看着素兰掷了个么四，也在那里凝思。忽见素兰想着了两句，念道：「月明云淡露花浓，人在蓬莱第几宫。」春航赞道：「更妙！」子玉道：「我们说的句子，倒没有他们的香艳。」素兰道：「你们是诗，我们是曲，占了这点便宜。你们又要人名，又要并头、并蒂就难了。」漱芳道：「我才把他们行过的要想两句，再想不出来。幸亏不行这个令，不然要罚死了。」王恂尚未想出，次贤道：「这是","en":"moon is bright, the clouds thin, the flowers heavy with dew; in which palace of Penglai does the beloved dwell?'\\" Chunhang praised it as even finer. Ziyu said, \\"The performers' lines are more fragrant and sensual than ours.\\" Sulan replied, \\"The scholars have harder constraints with the person's name and the specific flower type.\\" Shufang chimed in, \\"I can hardly compose"},{"paragraph":31,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"字，且是李长吉的《美人梳头歌》，你又记错是温飞卿，该罚一杯。」王恂道：「名字我说错了，似乎「燕」字没有记错。」春航道：「或者别的选本作「燕」字亦论不得的。总之这两句好。」于是大家也贺了一杯。","en":"Wang Xun conceded, \\"I got the author's name wrong, but it seems I didn't misremember the 'swallow' character.\\" Chunhang mediated, \\"Perhaps other anthologies use the 'swallow' character. In any case, the couplet itself is good.\\" Thus, they all toasted him a cup."},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"只见宝珠掷了两个二，便念道：「今夜凄凉有四星。」众人大赞道：「这句实在巧妙，全不费力。」各贺一杯。春航掣了颜色门的，美人名红拂，花名是个连理花。亦想了一回，说道：「我上句用韦庄，下句用杜，合着是：千枝万枝红艳春，钓竿欲拂珊瑚树。花名是「既溥既长，春日载阳。」长春是连理花。」众人赞了几句，也贺了一杯。漱芳掷了一个么四，即念道：「月移花影，疑是玉人来。」","en":"stars.'\\" Everyone enthusiastically praised it: \\"This line is truly clever and effortless.\\" They each toasted a cup. Chunhang had drawn a lot from the colors category, featuring the beauty 'Hongfu' (Red Whisk), with the required flower being an 'intertwined flower.' After a moment's thought, he recited his lines, using Wei Zhuang for the first and Du Fu for the second, combining"},{"paragraph":33,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"《送红线》诗一句，孟浩然《登襄城楼》一句，合着是：还似洛妃乘雾去，更凝神女弄珠游。」子玉方才念完，次贤、仲清、春航等大赞道：「方才飞的以此为第一，好在对得工稳。旖旎风光，却是庾香本色。」子玉又说并头花道：「月出皎兮，季女思饥。月季是并头花。」众人道：「这个花名也好极，我们应贺三杯，方可赏此佳句。」子玉谦了几句。又见素兰掷了一个么六，也想了一想，凑起《酒楼》上两句","en":"the mist away; gazing still as the river deity plays with pearls.'\\" As soon as Ziyu finished, Cixian, Zhongqing, Chunhang, and the others lauded him: \\"Of all the lines recited so far, this is the first and best. It's wonderfully balanced and graceful. Such tender and romantic charm is exactly Yuxiang's style.\\" Ziyu then provided his paired-head flower: \\"'When the moon rises"},{"paragraph":36,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"》一句道：「列长空数行新雁。」次贤道：「他们越说越好了，真是他们的比我们的好。」王恂道：「词出佳人口，信然。」春航道：「他们也实在敏捷，我们只好甘拜下风了。」文泽道：「难为他们句句贴切，也从没有人罚过一杯，倒叫人贺了好几十杯。」子玉道：「我早说我们不及他们。他们若行我们的令，只怕比我们总要好些。然而也是时候了，可以收令吃饭罢。」子云道：「等他们轮完了歇罢。他们也","en":"theirs are better than ours.\\" Wang Xun agreed, \\"Fine words come from the mouths of beauties—it is indeed true.\\" Chunhang added, \\"They are also remarkably quick-witted; we have no choice but to concede defeat.\\" Wenze pointed out, \\"It's impressive how perfectly fitting every single one of their lines is. None of them have been penalized a single cup, yet they've earned dozens"}],"37":[{"paragraph":3,"mentions":3,"tokens":["田春航","春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"今日之约，刘文泽、颜仲清、田春航不来，因为是春航会同年团拜，文泽、王恂是座师的世兄，故大家请了他。春航并请仲清，仲清新受感冒，两处都辞了。王恂也辞了那边，清早就约同子玉到怡园，次贤、子云接进梅崦坐下。这梅崦是个梅花样式，五间一处，共有五处。长廊曲槛钩连，绿萼红香围绕。外边望着，也认","en":"For today's gathering, Liu Wenze, Yan Zhongqing, and Tian Chunhang did not attend. Chunhang was attending a New Year gathering of his examination year-mates. The examination cohort had invited Wenze and Wang Xun as sons of their examiners. Chunhang had also invited Zhongqing, but Zhongqing had recently caught a chill,"},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":1,"tokens":["湘帆"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"色分派不开，我们都唱过一堂的了。」王恂道：「何以今日这么多呢？」桂保道：「再忙半个月也就闲了。」宝珠道：「我见湘帆、前舟在那里，剑潭何以不来？」王恂道：「身子不爽快。」桂保谓子玉道：「今年我们还是头一回见面。」子玉道：「正是，我却出来过几次，总没有见你。」宝珠道：「今日香畹与静芳苦了，处处有他们的戏，是再不能来了。」子云道：「我算有六七人可来，谁晓得都不能来。」","en":"Guibao replied that they would be busy for another half month before things quieted down. Baozhu added, \\"I saw Xiangfan and Qianzhou there; why did Jiantan not come?\\" Wang Xun explained that he was unwell. Guibao turned to Ziyu and said, \\"This is the first time we have met this year.\\" Ziyu agreed, noting that although he had been out several times, he had never run into"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":1,"tokens":["湘帆"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"吃了些点心，又喝了几杯酒。王恂问蕙芳道：「你见湘帆、前舟没有？」蕙芳道：「原是为他们在那里，所以耽搁了好一回，将我的戏挪上了才来的。我今天见了一个老名士，说是前舟的业师，相貌清古，有六旬之外了。」子云道：「姓什么？」蕙芳道：「姓得有些古怪，我想想着，好像姓瞿，穿着六品服饰，觉得议论风生，无人不敬爱他","en":"They ate a few pastries and drank several more cups of wine. Wang Xun asked Huifang, \\"Have you seen Xiangfan and Qianzhou?\\" Huifang replied, \\"It was because they were there that I was held up for so long. My performance was moved earlier so I could come. I saw a remarkable old gentleman of letters there today, said to be Qianzhou's teacher. He had a refined,"},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"酒，各有醉意，便也不能再饮。三杯之后，吃过了饭，略坐了一坐，子玉、王恂告辞，子云又约了明日。到明日又添了文泽、春航，名旦中也添了几个，又在怡园叙了一日。陆素兰单请子玉、琴言二人，又叙了一日，这一日清谈小叙，更为有趣。一连叙了三日，子玉也心满意足，人也乏了。徐子云要请屈道生，却好史南湘已到京，作一个诗酒大会。子玉不能推辞，只得赴约。且听下回分解。","en":"then Ziyu and Wang Xun took their leave. Ziyun invited them back for the following day. The next day, Wenze and Chunhang joined the party, as did several more of the famous performers, and they spent another day together at the Garden of Contentment. Lu Sulan gave a small private gathering for Ziyu and Qinyan alone, a quiet, intimate day of conversation, even more delightful"}],"38":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"且说徐子云请了屈公来，并请南湘、仲清、文泽、春航、王恂、子玉作陪，仍在梅崦中。王恂是日为孙亮功请去有事，因李元茂吉期已定，要招赘过来。亮功因两位贤郎是不懂事的，一切皆托王恂料理，王恂所以不能前来。","en":"To return to our story: Xu Ziyun had invited Master Qu to attend, with Nanxiang, Zhongqing, Wenze, Chunhang, Wang Xun, and Ziyu as companions, again in the Plum Knoll. Wang Xun on this particular day had been called away by Sun Lianggong on an important matter: the wedding date had been fixed for Li Yuanmao, who was to be adopted into the Sun household as"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":1,"tokens":["田春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"田春航前日已经会过，唯仲清、子玉初次识荆，见了那仙风道骨的相貌，况且又是父执，自然十分恭敬。道生见仲清骨秀神清，知是不凡。又看子玉温然玉立，皎若珠光，秀外慧中，神怡气肃，又不是那徒有外貌的一派，心中十分大喜，想道：「梅铁庵可为有子矣。」便与子玉说些江西事情","en":"Tian Chunhang had met him the day before, but Zhongqing and Ziyu were making his acquaintance for the first time. Seeing that otherworldly, Taoist-sage bearing, and mindful moreover that he was a friend of his father's generation, Ziyu naturally showed the deepest"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"西首定要南湘，南湘道：「这是我乡前辈，如何敢抗礼。」才定了仲清。东席第二是南湘，西席第二是春航。东席第三是子玉，西席三是文泽。子云东席作主，次贤西席作陪。宝珠、琴言在东，蕙芳、素兰在西，一一坐了。主人让酒，客皆饮了几杯。道生道：「我将前日先见的苏媚香谈起。」西席的人个个细听。道生道：「我这看相不论气色，部位是要论的，然尚在其次。我看全身的神骨","en":"position?\\" And so Zhongqing was given that seat instead. Second on the east table was Nanxiang; second on the west was Chunhang. Third on the east was Ziyu; third on the west was Wenze. Ziyun presided at the east table while Cixian acted as second host at the west. Baozhu and Qinyan sat on the east side; Huifang and Sulan on the west. Everyone took their places. The host circulated"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"春航道：「兰亭聚讼纷纷，即定武本亦有二刻。真伪已分，究何以辨？」道生道：「兰亭刻于唐太宗贞观年，先太宗为秦王时，得于僧辨才处。贞观十年，始命汤普、冯承素、诸葛贞、赵模，各临拓以赐近臣。当时褚遂良、欧阳询各有临本，人并崇尚。所谓定武本者，欧临是也。\\n唐绢本","en":"Chunhang said, \\"The Preface to the Orchid Pavilion has been debated endlessly, and even the Dingwu edition is said to exist in two versions. Now that the question of authentic and spurious has been settled, how does one tell them apart?\\" Qu said, \\"The Orchid"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"春航又道：「人说汉之碑，宋之帖，可以只立千古，淳化、大观、绛帖、潭帖，此四帖可好？」道生道：「以鄙见论，以淳化为第一，次大观，次绛帖，又次潭帖。然宋人常谓潭帖在阁帖之上，又谓淳化创始，兼以王着摹手不高，未及大观之精美。然淳化气运朴厚，大观光彩浮动，比之诗","en":"Chunhang also said, \\"People say that Han stelae and Song model calligraphy books each stand supreme for their era. The four great model books — Chunhua, Daguan, Jiang tie, and Tan tie — how do they compare?\\" Qu said, \\"In my view, Chunhua ranks first, Daguan second,"},{"paragraph":38,"mentions":1,"tokens":["湘帆"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"君相好么？」素兰在旁道：「他的画画弹琴，皆是此君教的。前月他们还逛了两天翠微山呢。他之待此君，也不亚于蕙芳之待湘帆了。」宝珠一笑，道：「何至于此？」子玉道：「前在瑶卿处，见其笔墨高雅之至，大有唐六如的光景。」道翁道：「不特笔墨似六如，命宫磨蝎也似六如，却是怪事。何以古今若合，此又不可以言理不言数了。我明日尚要拜他去。」子云忙道：「何不为我先容？得此良友，也是快事","en":"spent two days together at Cuiwei Mountain. His regard for this gentleman is no less than Meixiang's regard for Xiangfan.\\" Baozhu smiled and said, \\"Surely not quite to that degree.\\" Ziyu said, \\"I once saw at Yaoqing's some of his brushwork — supremely elegant and refined, with much of the quality of Tang Liuru.\\" Master Qu said, \\"Not only is his brushwork like Tang Liuru's"}],"43":[{"paragraph":17,"mentions":1,"tokens":["湘帆"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"两字，似欠着落。」即摆了一个四，两个五，念道：「一色杏花红十里。」子云道：「这个更摆得好。状元归去马如飞，此是湘帆的预兆，我们公贺，就是媚香也应贺一杯。」蕙芳听子云说得好，也觉喜笑颜开的饮了一杯。琴言取过骰子，摆了一个四、两个三，说道：「你们都说杏花，我却说句桃花。」念道：「桃花流水杳然去。」子云道：「很好，原没有限定杏花，各样皆可说得的。」与次贤各饮了一杯。宝","en":"better,\\" said Ziyun, \\"'Triumphant, the new laureate rides home swift as a flying horse.' This is a happy omen for Xiangfan. Let us all drink, Meixiang included.\\" Pleased by Ziyun's apt remark, Huifang smiled warmly and drank. Qinyan took the dice, set a four and two threes, and said: \\"You have all spoken of apricot blossoms, but I shall speak of the peach.\\" He recited: \\"'Peach"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":1,"tokens":["湘帆"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"兄、佩仙、庾香可以凑得四百金。」次贤道：「我来一分，出二百金，前舟可出三百金，庸庵、竹君二人可出三百金。庾香、湘帆、剑潭不必派他，凑起来已得一千八百了。若要三千，还少一千二百两，不消说是度香包圆了。」子云道：「难道华星北倒干干净净，一文不花，这么便宜。」蕙芳道：「据我说，不必要他出钱。如今与他讲，就是一总要他拿出来，他也肯，但是玉侬只好在他家一辈子了。」子云点头","en":"can put in three hundred; Yong'an and Zhujun together can provide three hundred. We need not call on Yuxiang, Xiangfan, or Jiantan. All told we would have one thousand eight hundred. If three thousand is the target, we are still short one thousand two hundred, which means, it goes without saying, Duxiang makes up the rest.\\" \\"Surely Hua Xingbei is not let off entirely"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":2,"tokens":["田春航","春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"却值田春航来看蕙芳，蕙芳即与他吃了饭，谈了一会，春航去了。茂林已在外面候了多时。定更后了，茂林提了灯笼，照着蕙芳，到了长庆家。也不找琴言，找了伍麻子，请了长庆媳妇出来。蕙芳见他扎了白包头，穿了孝衫，下面倒是条长绿绸裤子，白布弓鞋，黄瘦脸儿，长挑身材，三十来岁年","en":"It happened that Tian Chunhang came to call on Huifang, and the two of them dined and talked for a while before Chunhang left. Maolin had by then been waiting outside for some time. After the first watch, Maolin took up a lantern, lit the way for Huifang, and the two arrived at the"}],"44":[{"paragraph":18,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这是琴言出师第二日，琴言原要今日进去，适子云于初六日要请客，一来与南湘、春航送场，并请屈道生，约子玉、仲清等相陪。今日已是初四，索性到初七进去，并说写个字贴与华公子，说他过了假期，一因身子不快，二因留他逛几天。所以琴言倒也心安，乐得多顽几日。","en":"household that day, but Ziyun was planning a banquet on the sixth day of the month — to send off Nanxiang and Chunhang, and to host Master Qu Daosheng, with Ziyu, Zhongqing, and others invited to keep them company. As today was only the fourth, they resolved to wait until the seventh for Qinyan to go back, and to draft a note to Young Master Hua explaining that after"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":3,"tokens":["湘帆"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"：「已四十天了，怎么这样快？」琴言道：「我在府里，又觉日子慢，在外面又觉得快了。」子云对次贤道：「这两天竹君、湘帆都在那里抱佛脚呢。湘帆无怪乎其然，他要在媚香跟着争个脸。竹君也坐得定能写字作文，可见功名心切，是人人不免的。」次贤道：「今年有两条道路，不中进士，还可以考试博学宏词。中了宏词科，比那进士不好些么？」子云道：「比中进士难多着呢，我是不能想这个好出身。想","en":"crawl,\\" said Qinyan, \\"and out here they seem to race.\\" Ziyun said to Cixian: \\"These past two days both Zhujun and Xiangfan have been cramming for the examinations. It is understandable for Xiangfan — he wants to make a name for himself under Meixiang's admiring eye. As for Zhujun, the fact that he can sit still long enough to write and compose shows how keen his ambition"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":2,"tokens":["湘帆"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"次贤道：「他二人本事不相上下，湘帆是当行出色之文，竹君是才气比纵横，恐怕遇着那冬烘考官，就要委屈了。殿试工夫，竹君不及湘帆，若试宏词，竹君倒要擅长了。我看今年庾香是必得的，剑潭、卓然也有九分。」子云道：「你自己呢，一发拿得稳了。」次贤道：「也不去考，我自知无福。」子云道：「这叫什么话","en":"\\"Their abilities are about evenly matched,\\" said Cixian. \\"Xiangfan's style is exceptionally polished and in the right vein; Zhujun's gifts are more wide-ranging and bold. If they meet with an examiner who is conservative, he will likely be undervalued. In palace examination composition, Zhujun falls short of Xiangfan;"}],"45":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":2,"tokens":["田春航","春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"昨日子云又请了屈道生、梅子玉、史南湘、颜仲清、田春航、刘文泽、王恂等，并有诸名旦全来，会了一日。因南湘、春航次早要入场，所以散得甚早。","en":"The day before, Ziyun had once again invited Qu Daosheng, Mei Ziyu, Shi Nanxiang, Yan Zhongqing, Tian Chunhang, Liu Wenze, Wang Xun, and others. Together with all the leading actors, they had gathered for an entire day. Since Nanxiang and Chunhang were to enter the examination hall the following morning, the gathering disbanded quite early."},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":1,"tokens":["田春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"生同金吉甫先到，随后颜仲清、刘文泽、王恂一齐都来了，子玉到了，各人与吉甫相见，叙了些彼此仰慕的话。只有史南湘、田春航在场中未来。相公们到的是宝珠、蕙芳、素兰、玉林、漱芳、兰保、桂保、春喜、琪官、连琴言刚是十人。","en":"Zhongqing, Liu Wenze, Wang Xun, and finally Ziyu. They exchanged words of long admiration with Jifu. Shi Nanxiang and Tian Chunhang were still at the examination grounds. Among the performers who came were Baozhu, Huifang, Sulan, Yulin, Shufang, Lanbao, Guibao, Chunxi, and Qiguan. Qinyan made ten in total."}],"46":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"上？却也好看。」次贤称善。子云即叫书童找出了八张大宣纸，照着屏风大小裁好了，送到海棠春圃，请道翁亲笔自书。此时春航、南湘场事已毕，子云定了二十八日，请诸名士游园，以辰初毕集。是日不设筵宴，恐误了游兴，止于几处备了小酌茶点。凡近水者坐船，离水远者步行，须以一日之内游尽。王胡子住了两日回寓，将《图书集成》装了五大车，送进怡园，子云只得收了，就放在含万楼上，也就摆满了","en":"eight sheets of fine xuan cut to the screen and deliver them to the Crabapple Arbour for Daoweng's own brush. Chunhang and Nanxiang had finished their examinations; Ziyun fixed the twenty-eighth for a garden tour, gathering at the beginning of the chen hour. No full banquet—only light wine and tea en route; near water they boated, far from water they walked—to finish"},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"诸名士于二十八日早上陆续皆到。是日子玉、春航、南湘、仲清、文泽、王恂，共是六位，惟吉甫因感冒未到。园内屈氏父子，与次贤、主人四位，都在含万楼下坐了。道翁道：「这个含万楼是本《易经》「含万物而化光」句摘下，因为园中的主楼，故取此名。但就本意是言干道之大，此名似乎不甚相宜，度香以为何如？我见楼上现","en":"On the twenty-eighth morning the gentlemen arrived piecemeal: Ziyu, Chunhang, Nanxiang, Zhongqing, Wenze and Wang Xun—six—while Jifu stayed home with a chill. The Qu father and son, Cixian and their host — four in all — sat below the Tower of Myriad Containment. Daoweng explained: \\"This tower borrows from the *Book of Changes*:"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":1,"tokens":["湘帆"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"满芍药花，此时未开。道翁道：「这牡丹香国，繁华已极，可改名为宝香堂，后一进题为护香廊。这宝香堂须添一副对子，请湘帆兄罢。」","en":"inscribed the Fragrance-Guarding Colonnade. The Hall of Treasured Fragrance must have a couplet added. Brother Xiangfan, if you please.\\""},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"春航要逊，诸人不依，只得遵了。想了一联，写出是：","en":"Chunhang declined until overruled and produced:"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":2,"tokens":["湘帆","春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"设花神牌位。中间一进，署名为红茶仙馆，两边都有厢房。道翁道：「此处既供设花神，索性做个花神庙，改名为蕊珠仙府，湘帆兄可再咏一联。」春航应了，想了一想，写了出来。众人看是：","en":"it a temple of the Flower Goddess outright and rename it the Immortal Mansion of the Pearl of Stamens. Brother Xiangfan, another couplet from you.\\" Chunhang assented, thought a moment, and wrote it out. They read:"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":2,"tokens":["湘帆","春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"花雨散缤纷，娇舞霓裳云贴地；风情吹旖旎，轻摇月佩步凌虚。\\n道翁笑道：「湘帆兄的是妙才，写得如此风流香艳，真把那花情花魂都写出来了。」春航自谦了几句，众人也帮着赞好。","en":"soft—moon-pendants gently sway, footsteps tread the void.\\"\\n\\nDaoweng laughed that such wit bodied forth flower soul; Chunhang demurred; praise followed."},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":1,"tokens":["湘帆"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"千金买良夜，好酬春色正温柔。\\n道翁大赞道：「此与湘帆兄一样手笔，今日看诸兄题的联句，正是一人一样性灵，原不能强合的，就是前舟还没有题过。」","en":"thousand in gold buys this perfect night—well to repay the spring, tender and warm.\\"\\n\\nDaoweng praised parity with Xiangfan—each man's spirit showed distinct—only Qianzhou had yet to write."},{"paragraph":52,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"天，映着那些牡丹花，更为绚烂。已撤了护花的幛子。子云备了两席，一席是道翁、南湘、子玉、琴仙、次贤，一席是仲清、春航、文泽、王恂、子云。","en":"blazing—protective screens gone. Two tables waited—one for Daoweng, Nanxiang, Ziyu, Qinxian, Cixian; one for Zhongqing, Chunhang, Wenze, Wang Xun, Ziyun."},{"paragraph":53,"mentions":1,"tokens":["湘帆"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"道：「这也不然，一来相体裁衣，二来是各人的性灵。今日高超的是剑潭，沉着的是竹君，细腻风光的是庾香，风华绮丽的是湘帆，秀润工稳的是庸庵、前舟，潇洒跌宕的是静宜，就是度香那副集句，也觉得落落大方。正是各人自立一帜，无从评定甲乙。你们看这二十四副对子，好在虚字少，尽是实字多，便见得力量。若教外边那些名宿做起来，不知要添多少虚字在里头，才凑得成、捏得拢呢。」众名士一齐佩","en":"writes out of his own nature. Today Jiantan is the lofty one; Zhujun the weighty; Yuxiang has the delicate scene; Xiangfan the rich and splendid; Yong'an and Qianzhou the polished and well-turned; Jingyi the free and unconstrained; and even Duxiang's set of borrowed lines has an easy largeness about it. Each has planted his own banner, and there is no ranking them first"}],"47":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"说诸名士那日在怡园分题了些对子，经道翁一番赏识，俱极欣喜，后又看了那篇序文，真是五体投地，不能不服。就是南湘、春航，是最不轻易服人的，此时也是真心拜倒。明日子云又请金吉甫到园，将那些联额看了，吉甫亦甚佩服。请道翁用真行字，写了十六扇屏风，吉甫荐的季十矮子在园中刻起来。","en":"praise left them glowing with joy; reading his preface afterward moved them to true admiration. Even Nanxiang and Chunhang, usually slow to bow to anyone, yielded in genuine respect. The next day Ziyun invited Jin Jifu to the garden to view the paired couplets and plaques; Jifu, too, voiced high praise. Daoweng was invited to brush the characters in flowing cursive for a"},{"paragraph":2,"mentions":3,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"到了四月十一日，春航、南湘报中进士，南湘中了二十一名，春航中了三十四名，两人不消说都欢喜，把个蕙芳、兰保也乐得说不出来。南湘此番在京，借住在文泽处，因去年乃翁赴任时，将住宅卖去。蕙芳因春航在文泽处，虽彼此相安，但他出进虽没人说话，也常要到门房走走，因此觉得不甚便当。","en":"On the eleventh day of the fourth month, Chunhang and Nanxiang were posted to the rolls of new jinshi graduates—Nanxiang placing twenty-first and Chunhang thirty-fourth. Their delight went without saying, while Huifang and Lanbao were too overjoyed for words. Since his father had sold their residence"},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":6,"tokens":["春航","湘帆"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"又见南湘也中了，想他们二人的才学，是必入馆选的，即与春航、南湘商量，何不合租一所房子。他二人甚愿意，就托蕙芳留心，蕙芳又托人问了几处，皆不合意。一日来到子云处，说及此事，子云道：「何不到我园中来，也热闹些。且道翁已选了南昌府通判，不日就要赴任，玉侬是要同去的了，你们搬进来，不好么？」蕙芳道：「我是不搬进来","en":"\\"Over by Osmanthus Ridge, the Osmanthus Grove Mountain Lodge has over thirty rooms—ample space for Zhujun and Xiangfan. Tell them I said so, and there is no need to look elsewhere. If their families arrive later, they can search for a house then. I shall choose a day soon to formally invite them.\\" Huifang agreed, then visited Cixian and Qinxian for a while. Knowing he"}],"48":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":8,"tokens":["田春航","春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"田春航、史南湘殿试过了，正是万言满策，铁画银钩。春航竟占了鳌头，大魁天下，授了修撰之职。南湘在二甲第四，点了庶常。雁塔题名，杏林赐宴，好不有兴，比起去年春间的春航来，就天壤之别了。这春航偏是姓苏的与他有缘。去年亏了苏蕙芳遂了他的心愿，本以风月因缘，倒成了道","en":"Following the palace examination, Tian Chunhang and Shi Nanxiang had both achieved brilliant success. Their policy responses were vast and profound, and their calligraphy possessed the vigor of iron strokes and silver hooks. Chunhang actually took first place as the Zhuangyuan and was granted the"},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"苏侯初见了春航这般人物，心上十分中意，意欲附为婚姻，问他已有了妻室，暗暗叹息。","en":"When Marquis Su first met a man of Chunhang's caliber, he was immensely pleased and wished to forge a marriage alliance. Upon discovering that Chunhang already had a wife, he sighed secretly in disappointment."},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":3,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"且说春航搬进了新宅，凡车马服饰，一切器用，尽是蕙芳一人之力。蕙芳数年所积，也就运用一空。此时蕙芳已辞了班子，常常过来与春航照应。春航要留他在宅里住，他又不肯。","en":"After Chunhang moved into his new residence, his carriages, attire, and household furnishings were all arranged entirely through Huifang's efforts. Huifang exhausted the savings he had accumulated over many years for this purpose. By now, he had left the theater troupe"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":3,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"但春航大大小小的事，皆系他一人调度，春航万分感激，意欲分任其劳，实在又不及他精明周到。蕙芳又是个好胜脾气，就是没有办过的，他先就访问了，想得澈底澄清，一无翳障，不要春航费一点心。就是那个许贵，也十分灵慧，惟有那老田安，只可看门而已。","en":"Nevertheless, every significant and trivial matter was managed solely by Huifang. Chunhang was profoundly grateful and wished to share the burden, yet he could not match Huifang's sharp intellect and meticulous nature. Huifang was inherently competitive. Even for matters he had never handled, he would first make inquiries and think them through"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":6,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一日，春航正与蕙芳商议要接家眷，无人可托的话，蕙芳愿身任其劳。忽然到了家信，是其太夫人的谕帖。春航连忙拆读，一看之后，不觉泪下。蕙芳心惊，便在春航背后同看。原来春航的夫人，于二月内暴病而亡。太夫人伤心万状，家中止有一老仆，并一仆妇，诸事草草，甚望春航会试回来。","en":"One day, as Chunhang and Huifang were discussing the need to fetch Chunhang's family and how no one else could be entrusted with the task, Huifang volunteered to go himself. Suddenly, a letter arrived containing an instruction note from Chunhang's mother. Chunhang read it"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":4,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"春航看完，一悲一喜，喜的是慈母将来，晨昏得事，悲的是朱弦已断，中馈无人。且春航又是个钟情人，想起在家时，钗荆裙布，唱随之乐，不觉大恸起来。蕙芳十分劝慰，劝道：「老太太不日就到，你极该打起精神才好。如今倒自己苦坏了，教老太太见了不更伤感么？」春航只得暂止悲","en":"Reading this, Chunhang was torn between grief and joy. He rejoiced that his loving mother was coming, allowing him to care for her morning and evening, but he grieved that his marital bond was broken and the inner chambers left empty. Being a man of deep feeling, he recalled"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":2,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"过了十余日，田太夫人已到，春航接到良乡，母子相见，悲欢各半。太夫人在路已知春航中了状元，因此更念起亡媳来。","en":"Over ten days later, Madam Tian arrived, and Chunhang met her at Liangxiang. Mother and son reunited with a mixture of tears and smiles. Having heard on the road that he had become the Zhuangyuan, she remembered her departed daughter-in-law all the more poignantly."},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":4,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"春航又拜见了舅父、舅母，无人不为春航喜欢。进了城，他母舅在春航处暂住了几日，赁了住房，方才搬去，春航在太夫人面前说起蕙芳的好处，也是落难才唱戏的，如今已出了班子，他父亲在云南做过州同，是个书香之后，在京甚为相得，一切都赖藉他。因此田太夫人待蕙芳甚好，蕙芳","en":"Chunhang greeted his uncle and aunt, and everyone rejoiced for his success. Upon entering the city, his uncle stayed temporarily at Chunhang's residence before renting a place and moving out. Before his mother, Chunhang spoke highly of Huifang, explaining how"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"却说史南湘馆选后，便搬进怡园，在清凉诗境住了。他的脾气又与春航两样，把那些同年同馆朋友不放在眼里，也不出去应酬，天天与屈道翁、萧次贤、徐子云一班人，诗酒陶情。","en":"Garden of Contentment and took up residence at the Cool and Tranquil Poetic Realm. His temperament differed from Chunhang's; he looked down upon his cohort friends and avoided social engagements. Day after day, he indulged in wine and poetry with Qu Daoweng, Xiao Cixian, Xu Ziyun, and their refined circle."},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":4,"tokens":["湘帆"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"阁前，南湘道：「去年静宜有个《水浒传》的酒令，媚香掣着了《潘金莲雪天戏叔》，媚香那个神色，再没有这么好笑，不料湘帆今日竟能如此了。」金粟道：「湘帆真不负媚香。」说着，叹了一口气。南湘道：「也幸遇着了媚香，若遇了别人，未必有这管教他的本领。若天天朝歌夜弦，只怕湘帆真要做郑元和了。可惜，可惜！媚香若是个女身，此刻就是状元夫人了，偏又要多生出个雀儿来，教湘帆有欲难遂，","en":"expression during \\"Pan Jinlian Teases Her Brother-in-Law in the Snow\\" was incomparably amusing, and marveling that Xiangfan could rival it today. Jin Su agreed that Xiangfan did not disgrace Meixiang's memory, then let out a soft sigh. Nanxiang mused that it was fortunate he had met Meixiang, for with anyone else, his wild nature could not have been tamed, and he might have"},{"paragraph":36,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"费很富足了。子云、次贤各备车马跟着，一直送出城外，直到十里之外皇华亭。只见南湘、仲清、文泽、金粟、王恂、子玉、春航，领着那蕙芳、宝珠、素兰、漱芳、玉林、兰保、桂保、琪官、春喜九个名旦，在皇华亭等候。道翁等连忙下车，极口辞谢。各人皆要把盏。","en":"Pavilion, ten miles away. Waiting there at the pavilion were Nanxiang, Zhongqing, Wenze, Jin Su, Wang Xun, Ziyu, and Chunhang, alongside Huifang and the nine famous performers: Baozhu, Sulan, Shufang, Yulin, Lanbao, Guibao, Qiguan, and Chunxi. Daoweng hurried down from his carriage and thanked everyone repeatedly, as they all eagerly wished to raise a cup in a final parting"}],"49":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":5,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"且说春航断弦之后，田夫人又上了年纪，没有媳妇，总是不惯，不得已命春航从权选择清门。春航犹豫未决，意欲先觅个小星，又以北人生硬，总乏娇柔，只得先于老婆子、家人媳妇里头，找个细致的来服侍太夫人。那知道京里这些老婆子，是一万个里头拣不出一个好的来。一日雇了两个来，","en":"Meanwhile, after Chunhang lost his wife, Madam Tian, feeling her age and unaccustomed to running a household without a daughter-in-law, urged Chunhang to seek a new match from a respectable family. Chunhang hesitated, initially inclined to take a concubine first. Yet, finding"},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":7,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"会缝衣写算，针线活计是不用说了。蕙芳也闻得三姐之名，收拾过潘三，想是个伶俐人，也想见见他，问他怎样收拾的。便与春航说了，举荐他进来，春航不好推辞，一口应允。这三姐因收拾潘三之后，心上也有些惧怕潘三要来报仇，故此小三在家，闲了两三个月，才得进了这个门子。后又见春航点了状元，老太太来了，也没有个中意的人伺候，所以想把他三姐带进，也便当些，省得一个少妇孤零零的住在外面","en":"clever woman. Curious to meet her and learn exactly how she had dealt with Pan the Third, he recommended her to Chunhang, who readily agreed. Ever since the Pan the Third affair, Third Sister had harbored a lingering fear of retaliation; thus, she had remained idle at home for two or three months until this opportunity arose. Seeing that Chunhang had recently been named"},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":2,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一日，春航不在家，蕙芳独坐在书房里。老太太知道蕙芳来了，便叫三姐送点心出来。三姐托了碟子，到书房门口，先咳嗽了一声，然后进来，笑容满面的叫了一声：「苏大爷！」蕙芳也带着笑，回叫了一声「三姐！」三姐道：「这是老太太给你的。」说着，将碟子送到蕙芳手边。蕙芳见他十指","en":"One day, Chunhang was away from home, and Huifang sat alone in the study. Knowing Huifang was there, the old madam sent Third Sister out with some pastries. Carrying the small dish, Third Sister paused at the study door and gave a soft cough before entering, her face"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":7,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"却说春航要续弦，选择清门之语，传入苏侯耳内，正合他意。便在武选司郎中杨方猷面前，略露了些口风，似要他去对春航说，托人来求的意思。杨方猷是春航的房师，心中甚喜，即来与春航讲了，叫他请人去求亲。春航倒有些踌躇，因苏家是世禄之家，门庭烜赫，自己虽成了名，依然寒素，","en":"Meanwhile, rumors that Chunhang sought a new match from a pure, respectable family reached the ears of Su the Marquis, fitting his own desires perfectly. He dropped a few subtle hints before Yang Fangyou, Director of the Bureau of Military Appointments, suggesting he convey to Chunhang"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，把个次贤喝得大醉。南湘掉了水里，家人救了出来，已是喝了几口水。今日腹胀腰疼，起不来。次贤也是昏昏沉沉的睡了。春航到他们房里谈了一会，打听华公子去了，才到子云处来。","en":"stomach was bloated and his back ached, making him unable to rise, while Cixian slept in a heavy, groggy stupor. Chunhang visited their rooms to chat briefly, and upon learning Young Master Hua had departed, he finally went to see Ziyun."},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":11,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"此时子云在宝香堂，见了春航进来，连忙迎接，彼此谈了些话。春航问他与苏侯是师生，可知他家的细底。子云道：「你问他做甚？」春航将杨方猷的话对子云讲了，子云连忙称贺道：「恭喜，恭喜！这个喜，比你中状元还要大些。」春航笑道：「不过显官罢了，知道成与不成，吾兄倒先贺起来。」子云道：「显","en":"Ziyun was in the Hall of Treasured Fragrance. Seeing Chunhang enter, he hurried to welcome him, and they exchanged pleasantries. Chunhang asked whether Ziyun, being a student of Su the Marquis, knew the intimate details of his household. \\"Why do you ask?\\" Ziyun asked. Chunhang recounted Yang Fangyou's words. Ziyun"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"请了进去。子云请了安，又进去见了师母，说他夫人与师母请安，苏夫人也问了好。苏侯让进内书房坐下，谈了一会，子云将春航春间断弦，闻二世妹贤淑之名，奉母命求亲的话说了。苏侯故作沉吟道：「看田修撰文才品貌，是极好的，而且也是个旧家，但不知品行如何，我最怕的是轻薄少年。年兄既是至交，必深知道。」子云道：「这田修撰的品行，是人人尽知，也不须门生多讲，老师可以问得出来。真是廉","en":"replied. Su the Marquis then invited him into the inner study to sit. After chatting for a while, Ziyun relayed Chunhang's situation: that he had lost his wife in the spring, had heard of the second young lady's virtuous reputation, and was acting on his mother's command to seek a marriage alliance. Su the Marquis feigned thoughtful deliberation. \\"Looking at Compiler Tian's"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"气又热了。」子云道：「门生回去，叫门生媳妇择个日子，请师母与世妹逛园。」苏侯道：「等天气秋凉再看罢。」子云又问春航之事，苏侯道：「年兄为此而来，老夫怎好推却，请致意田修撰就是了。」子云深深打了一恭谢了。苏侯又问他椿萱在任安好，想常有府报回来，又问令兄在淮扬也好？子云道：「家严是前月打发家人进京来的，托赖安善，僚属军民以及外洋客商，尽皆静谧，物阜年丰，颇称安逸。家","en":"Marquis replied, \\"Let us wait until the autumn weather turns cool.\\" Ziyun then steered the conversation back to Chunhang's proposal. Su the Marquis said, \\"Since you have come for this purpose, how could I refuse? Please convey my assent to Compiler Tian.\\" Ziyun made a deep bow of gratitude. Su the Marquis then asked about the well-being of Ziyun's parents at their posts,"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":1,"tokens":["湘帆"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"科也就算好了，已经有好几位坐了一品。」又讲了些别的话。子云坐久了，见时候不早，告辞出城。在车内想了一会，道：「湘帆太便宜了，不如等他来求我，我再与他讲。」便一径自回宅子去了。","en":"for so long, Ziyun took his leave and departed the city. In his carriage, he pondered for a moment and thought, \\"Xiangfan got off too easily; I'd better wait for him to come beg me before I tell him.\\" And with that, he headed straight home."},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":14,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"明日，春航果然来找子云，子云只推宅里有事，叫春航在南湘、次贤处等了一日。明日又来，子云又不见他。春航明知子云故意作难，然心上又恐怕此事不谐，只得忍耐了性气，第三日又来，才见了子云。子云笑道：「这几日，吾弟有甚么要紧事，连日来找我？」春航笑道：「已经三顾了。我知","en":"The next day, Chunhang indeed came looking for Ziyun, but Ziyun merely claimed there was business in the inner household and left Chunhang waiting in Nanxiang and Cixian's quarters all day. The following day, Chunhang came again, and again Ziyun avoided him. Chunhang knew"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":4,"tokens":["春航","湘帆"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"春航笑道：「礼数是不会错的，或者你那神色之间，有些错处也未可知。」南湘瞅着春航道：「我倒请教你，什么叫神色之间有些错呢？」大家也就不言语了。次贤问子云道：「湘帆的事如何？」子云道：「可成。」又将苏侯问他访些真才实学的人，就将对苏侯所举那几个，一一讲来。又","en":"Chunhang smiled and suggested, \\"Your formal etiquette might not have been wrong, but perhaps there was something amiss in your expression or demeanor.\\" Nanxiang glared at Chunhang and demanded, \\"I'd like you to explain to me—what exactly does \\"something amiss"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"四人谈了一会，春航辞回，将子云去说亲的话，一一告禀，太夫人甚为欢喜。即又请子云说定了，择日先过帖子，俟定日之后，再行纳采。","en":"The four chatted a while longer before Chunhang took his leave and returned home. He reported everything Ziyun had said about the marriage proposal to his mother, and Madam Tian was delighted. She immediately asked Ziyun to finalize the agreement and choose an auspicious day to exchange the preliminary"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":9,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"后来定于七月初七日。春航将此事与蕙芳说明，蕙芳也替他欢喜。春航又述子云之言，说这位苏小姐像你竟到九分。蕙芳笑道：「这不是糟蹋人么？一个千金小姐像了我，还说好，我们算什么人呢？」春航道：「只怕未必如你。若果然像你，我就心满意足了，当他菩萨供养，天天拜他。」蕙芳笑道：「你嘴里常","en":"Eventually, the date was set for the seventh day of the seventh month. Chunhang explained the matter to Huifang, who also rejoiced for him. Chunhang then recounted Ziyun's words, saying, \\"He says this Miss Su resembles you nine parts out of ten.\\" Huifang laughed, \\"Isn't that just insulting her? For a young lady of a noble house"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"春航道：「你也应该成个家才好，就是配得上你的人少。」蕙芳道：「这话倒也不错，我也这么想。我们对亲，好人家是不肯的，那小户人家的女儿，我又不要。况且我们这些人，被那些无耻的东西闹得不像个样子，谁肯信我们是清清白白的呢？","en":"Chunhang said, \\"You really ought to settle down and start a family yourself, though there are few who are worthy of you.\\" Huifang replied, \\"That's true enough, and I've thought the same. For a match with us, good families won't agree to it, and I wouldn't want"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":4,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"家之女，倒不如娶大家之婢，那礼貌性德倒是见惯的，也没有那小模小样。就是一件，只怕主人已先受用，这倒十有八九。」春航笑道：「这是必有之事。我想度香家的丫鬟就不少。」蕙芳道：「度香自然是有好的，他家的闺范也好，从没有遇见丫鬟们到园里来，况且隔着一条街，也不便来。只闻得华公子的丫鬟最多，而且都好。我们有一回在他家唱戏，看见帘子内有一大群，有男装的，有女装的，粉白黛绿，","en":"fear the master of the house may have already taken his pleasure with her—that's true nine times out of ten.\\" Chunhang laughed, \\"That is an inevitable fact. I imagine Duxiang's household has quite a few maids.\\" Huifang said, \\"Duxiang naturally has good ones, and the inner household discipline is excellent; I've never encountered the maids coming out into the garden."},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":4,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"道：「这爱字也没有什么要紧，爱好之心，自然各人难免的。这三姐不但人生得好，而且还灵慧异常，倒是个贞节妇人呢。」春航笑道：「灵慧有之，贞节未确。」蕙芳笑道：「你没听见他收拾过潘三么？」春航笑道：「也有所闻，那是潘三这般嘴脸，自然应收拾的。你方才说爱好之心，人人有之。设使你做了潘三，他就不忍收拾你了。」蕙芳道：「你何不试试他？他在你这里，就想收拾你，也不敢的。」春航","en":"anyone. This Third Sister is not only beautiful, but exceptionally intelligent—and she is a chaste woman at that.\\" Chunhang laughed, \\"Intelligent, yes; chaste, I'm not so sure.\\" Huifang smiled, \\"Haven't you heard how she dealt with Pan the Third?\\" Chunhang chuckled, \\"I've heard something of it, but with a face like Pan the Third's, he naturally deserved to be dealt with."},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"春航去了，蕙芳正走出来，忽听得咭咭咯咯之声，一回头看是三姐。蕙芳笑面相迎，三姐也笑盈盈的说道：「好几天不见你来。」蕙芳道：「我倒天天来的，就不见你出来。」三姐道：「老爷出门去了？」三姐把蕙芳腰间的表套子看了一看，道：「这个我也会做，我还会做戳纱的荷包。」","en":"Just as Chunhang left and Huifang stepped out, he suddenly heard a soft, tinkling laugh. Turning his head, he saw it was Third Sister. Huifang greeted her with a smile, and Third Sister, beaming, said, \\"I haven't seen you come around for days.\\" Huifang replied, \\"I actually"}],"50":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说春航已聘了苏侯的小姐，只等七月七日完毕婚姻。五月过了，正是日长炎夏，火伞如焚。","en":"By this time, Chunhang was already formally betrothed to the daughter of Marquis Su, waiting only for the seventh day of the seventh month to complete the marriage rites. The fifth month had slipped away; the days grew long in the blazing height of midsummer, the sun beating"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":3,"tokens":["湘帆"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"还挣着不动，又有那一哭，到底为着什么事来？幸亏度香催道翁走了，不然，他见了也要猜疑。」文泽道：「可不是？庾香与湘帆比起来，正是苦乐不同。湘帆非但与媚香朝夕相亲，如今又对了阔亲，偏偏又是个姓苏的，而且才貌双全。你道湘帆的运气好不好？我看咱们这一班朋友，就是他一个得意。」仲清道：「自然。」王恂道：「竹君近来倒没有从前的意兴，这是何故？」仲清道：「竹君么，他因不得鼎甲","en":"that, Daoweng would surely have grown suspicious.\\" Wenze nodded. \\"Is it not so? When you compare Yuxiang with Xiangfan, the contrast in their suffering and joy is stark. Not only does Xiangfan enjoy the constant, intimate company of Meixiang from dawn to dusk, but now he has secured a highly prestigious marriage—coincidentally also to someone surnamed Su, who possesses"}],"52":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":4,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"且说春航吉期已到，这苏侯是个阔家，大姑娘嫁与华公子，妆奁就值百万。今知春航是个寒士，把京东的田庄批了二百顷，拨了两名庄头，六房家人男妇，十个丫鬟，至珠宝古玩、陈设铺垫，以及衣服被褥、箱盒桌椅器皿之类，送奁那一日，用了二千名人夫，苏夫人犹以为薄，不及大姑娘十分","en":"By now, the auspicious day for Chunhang's wedding had arrived. Su the Marquis, commanding immense wealth, had already married his elder daughter to Young Master Hua with a dowry valued at a million taels. Knowing Chunhang was a humble scholar without such means, the Marquis assigned him two"},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":3,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"仲雨这些事是最在行的，诸事调度得很有章程。新房内自有苏府的人来铺设。春航的母舅张桐孙已带了家眷往直省候补去了，今奉差来京，也帮着春航张罗。初六那一日有两处戏酒，一处在聚星堂，请的是乡试座师礼部尚书刘守正、座师内阁学士王文辉、会试房师兵部郎中杨方猷，鸿胪寺卿周锡爵、光禄少卿陆宗沅，这两位是同乡前辈兼有年谊。张桐孙陪了这几位","en":"methodical precision. Within the bridal chamber, the Su household's own people handled the elaborate preparations. Chunhang's uncle, Zhang Tongsun, who had previously taken his family to await an official appointment in a provincial post, now returned to the capital on a formal assignment and also helped coordinate the festivities. On the sixth day, there were two distinct"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云面前，子云点了一出《乔醋》，高品点了一出《当巾》。《乔醋》唱了，《当巾》却是兰保扮了小生，倒作得人情逼肖。春航是个聪明人，已知高品奚落他，便说道：「这李亚仙真是个女中豪杰，前赚郑元和是遵母命，后来是感于至情。若我作了郑元和，宁当身子上衣衫，不当这巾。你们不听得这两条网巾绳子是李亚仙亲手打的么？」高品道：「只怕衣裳有了泥，当不得了。你不听得来兴唱道：「相公，你","en":"concluded, Lanbao took on the male lead in *Pawned Headscarf*, performing the role with striking, lifelike realism. Chunhang, possessing a quick wit, instantly realized Gao Pin was subtly mocking him and said, \\"This Li Yaxian is truly a heroine among women. First she tricked Zheng Yuanhe in obedience to her mother's command, but later she was moved by genuine devotion. If"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，应怜辱在泥涂，回肠如路，双轮一碾一嗟吁，怎笑倚。\\n兰保唱到此，也要笑了，子云等连声喝采，诸人乱叫起「好」来。春航满面通红，指着高品骂道：「我只道你别过了一年，自然也改恶从善，谁道还是这副歪心肝。」高品道：「这才骂得奇，我又讲了什么？这不是自己栽了筋斗埋怨地皮么？」","en":"Lanbao himself nearly broke character and laughed. Ziyun and the others shouted their applause, cheering wildly. Chunhang blushed a deep scarlet, pointing at Gao Pin as he cursed, \\"I thought that after a year away, you would naturally have reformed your wicked ways, but who could have guessed you still have that same crooked heart!\\" Gao Pin retorted, \\"Now that is a strange"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":3,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"春航尚要骂他，只见家人进来禀道：「苏府妆奁已到。」一片吹打之声。春航请了子云、次贤一同迎接上去。送奁的是苏府几位本家亲戚，内中有华公子，绣衣金带，玉貌如仙。春航尚是初见，已久仰这位连衿的大名，接进了聚星堂，齐齐见礼。","en":"Chunhang was about to continue his scolding when a servant rushed in to announce, \\"The Su household's trousseau has arrived!\\" Outside, a cacophony of festive music flared. Chunhang invited Ziyun and Cixian to join him in welcoming the procession. Among the Su"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"华公子见了刘尚书、王文辉是父执，便请了安，其余都行平礼。春航与华公子系是新亲，无甚话说，不过彼此道些仰慕之意。幸有王文辉、徐子云帮着张罗，应酬了那几位新亲，颇不寂寞。","en":"Young Master Hua offered them respectful bows; to all the rest, he extended the courteous salutations of peers. As Chunhang and Young Master Hua were newly related and entirely unfamiliar with one another, they could only exchange polite, formal words of mutual admiration. Fortunately, Wang Wenhui and Xu Ziyun helped enliven the atmosphere, graciously attending to the new"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这样，安那样，闹得一身的汗，一件绸衫子沾住了背心，腰也酸了，脚也疼了，喝了一碗凉茶，把扇子扇了一会，再来收拾。春航忙进城谢妆去了。","en":"she paused only to gulp a bowl of cool tea and fan herself briefly before diving back into the work. Meanwhile, Chunhang hurriedly entered the city to formally express his gratitude for the dowry."},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"起来，就是子玉比他小了三岁，华公子就坐在子玉之上。众人见他直爽，也不让了。华公子见这班人都是潇洒出尘的相貌，将春航比起子玉来，稍逊一筹，而神情洒脱过之，可算瑜、亮并生了。","en":"their insisting. Young Master Hua looked across the circle of transcendently refined figures; he felt that while Chunhang was perhaps slightly less dazzling than Ziyu, his free-spirited demeanor surpassed him—it was as though Zhou Yu and Zhuge Liang had been born into the same era."},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"开了戏，那边王文辉、张仲雨进来，在华公子面前张罗了一番。华公子要请仲雨坐席，仲雨道：「今日我竟没有这个福分。」春航谢妆已回，也请仲雨入席，仲雨道：「外面一个媚香，如何照应得来？不可叫他怨我。」便拱拱手走开，指着子云道：「总是你好作成。」笑出去了。王文辉跷起了朝靴，手捋长髯，与华公子、徐子云讲了一番话，也就踱了出去。","en":"Young Master Hua invited Zhongyu to join the banquet, but Zhongyu joked, \\"Today, I simply lack that fortune.\\" Chunhang, having returned from his formal thanks at the Su household, also invited Zhongyu to sit. Zhongyu replied, \\"With one 'Meixiang' out there, how can I possibly manage it all? I dare not let him resent me.\\" Cupping his hands, he stepped away, pointing at"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":3,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"春航请客宽了公服，唱了一出戏。华公子道：「天气热，倒不用唱戏了，也叫他们歇歇。」八旦上来，华公子不见蕙芳，便问春航道：「怎么不见那位状元夫人，还在账房里么？」春航不好意思回答。子云听了，笑道：「如今闹出两位状元夫人，倒与《燕子笺》上的《诰圆》一样了。」华","en":"Chunhang changed out of his formal robes to host his guests and sang a single scene himself. Young Master Hua suggested, \\"In this heat, there is no need to force performances; let them rest.\\" As the eight famed dans approached, Young Master Hua, noticing Huifang's"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":4,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"忽见林珊枝走来，华公子便叫取衣服过来，穿戴了，辞了春航，说道：「弟还要到舍亲处有事，明早送轿来再会罢。」一拱而别。外面送奁来那几位，早已去了。诸人送下了阶，单是那春航送出。素兰见拿了他的扇子，便跟了出来。到上车时，华公子始见素兰送他，知他要那扇子，但又心爱此词，不忍释手，便对素兰笑道：「你好不解事，今日","en":"Suddenly, Lin Shanzhi arrived. Young Master Hua called for his outer garments, dressed, and took his leave of Chunhang, saying, \\"I still have matters to attend to with my relatives. I shall send my sedan tomorrow morning so we may meet again.\\" With a bow, he departed. The other Su relatives who had delivered the trousseau had long since left. Everyone escorted him down"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":1,"tokens":["田湘帆"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"的出来，进房时就除下，不更好看么？」大家又笑，文辉把扇子在蕙芳肩上打了两下，笑着骂道：「你这尖酸刻薄鬼，怪不得田湘帆被你管得服服贴贴，一强也不敢强。但你也只有今天一天了，明日就有个真状元夫人来，看你又怎样？」蕙芳脸一红，道：「岂有此理，这是什么顽笑！」周锡爵道：「媚香不要理他，你到这里来，咱们谈谈。」蕙芳到那边席上去打了一转通关，又到这边来打了一转。张仲雨又把蕙芳","en":"the shoulder twice with his fan, scolding with a smile, \\"You sharp-tongued, caustic little ghost! No wonder Tian Xiangfan is kept so thoroughly in line by you; he wouldn't dare rebel even a little. But you only have today left to reign supreme. Tomorrow, the true 'Madam Zhuangyuan' arrives—we shall see how you fare then!\\" Huifang's face flushed red, \\"What nonsense! What"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":2,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"那苏府繁荣不能细述。明日辰刻，春航先行了亲迎之礼，随后子云并一班迎亲的押了花轿到苏府来，一切交代排场已毕，花轿回来，一路笙歌鼎沸，仪从纷纭，满街车填马塞，好不热闹。进了门，请出新人，拜了花烛，珠围翠绕，玉暖花香，说不尽富贵风流，温柔旖旎。外面那些宾客及诸名士，又足足闹了一日。到晚间春","en":"boundless splendor of the Su household defies detailed description. The following morning at the hour of the dragon, Chunhang performed the formal rite of fetching the bride. Ziyun and the groom's escort accompanied the bridal sedan to the Su mansion. After all the ceremonial exchanges and displays were completed, the sedan returned, heralded by a deafening crescendo of festive"}],"53":[{"paragraph":7,"mentions":3,"tokens":["田春航","春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"明正大，无一毫闇昧之心，难道一人只许有一个知己，不准有两个么？」素兰道：「若论知己，自然越多越好。就以蕙芳之与田春航，瑶卿之与之金吉甫而论，春航固是蕙芳的知己，吉甫固是瑶卿的知己。蕙芳之待春航，瑶卿之待吉甫，也是报知己之报了。事虽不同，情则一也。然而他们待外人也是这样，心里却有权衡，外面若无轩轾，不露出厚薄来。所以人也不能说他们，也不能妒他们。若琴言之心，没有一点","en":"and never two?\\"\\n\\nSulan replied, \\"When it comes to confidants, naturally the more the better. Take Huifang with Tian Chunhang, and Yaoqing with Jin Jifu: Chunhang is certainly Huifang's confidant, and Jifu is certainly Yaoqing's confidant. Huifang's treatment of Chunhang and Yaoqing's treatment of Jifu are their ways of repaying that understanding. The circumstances differ,"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"时搬出，不入数内。开了一个单子给与宝珠，宝珠大乐，谢了谢，道：「这几日不必搬出，到开市那几天，搬到那边去罢。」春航知道他们要开铺子，又闻得华公子、徐度香帮了许多物件，也要与蕙芳些东西。但系苏小姐过门未久，虽然鱼水情深，但将蕙芳之事骤然说起，恐他疑心，要吃醋起来，只得托辞要了二百两赤金，送与蕙芳添买货物。","en":"no need to move these out in the next few days. We can transfer them over when we are closer to opening.\\"\\n\\nWhen Chunhang heard that they were opening a shop and that Young Master Hua and Xu Duxiang had contributed so many items, he also wanted to give Huifang something. However, he had recently married Miss Su, and though their marital affection was deep, he feared that"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"蕙芳本想不受，但恐春航心上过不去，又见宝珠、素兰得了多少东西，自己又有好胜之心，只得收了，托子云着人到苏杭添置一切。子云封了金子，开了一个清单，写了一封书，着人到他乃兄署中，叫管总的徐福亲自制办。","en":"Huifang initially wanted to decline, but fearing he would hurt Chunhang's feelings—and seeing how much Baozhu and Sulan had acquired, which stirred his own competitive spirit—he felt compelled to accept. He asked Ziyun to send someone to Suzhou and Hangzhou to handle the remaining procurements. Ziyun sealed the gold, drafted"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"却说子玉自前日春航处见了诸名旦，单少了琴言一人，又感伤了数日。一夜在睡梦中，忽见云儿走来道：「少爷，琴言回来了。」子玉听了大喜，即问道：「在哪里？」云儿道「就在门外。」子玉忙到大门外一望，只见烟水茫茫，查无涯涘，便失惊道：「这是什么地方？」迷迷离离，心无主意，沿着江堤","en":"Since seeing all the famous performers at Chunhang's the other day—with only Qinyan absent—Ziyu had remained steeped in melancholy for days. One night, in the midst of a dream, he suddenly saw Yun'er approach and say, \\"Young Master, Qinyan has returned.\\"\\n\\nZiyu was overjoyed and quickly asked, \\"Where"}],"57":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["田春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"且说徐子云的夫人袁绮香，生得婉娴柔静，贤淑无双，又且绣口锦心，才能咏絮。于十月初十日，请了华公子的夫人苏浣香、田春航的夫人浣兰、刘文泽的夫人吴紫烟、颜仲清的夫人王蓉华、梅子玉的夫人琼华、王恂的夫人孙佩秋。此时园中菊花开满，五色斑烂。是日晴光和蔼，风不扬尘，小毛衣服都用不着，绵的尽够了。袁绮香一早带了十二红婢，还有几个家人媳妇，先到园里候客。那日次贤、高品、南湘皆回","en":"famous 'willow-fluff' poetry. On the tenth day of the tenth month, she invited Hua Gongzi's wife, Su Huanxiang; Tian Chunhang's wife, Huanlan; Liu Wenze's wife, Wu Ziyan; Yan Zhongqing's wife, Wang Ronghua; Mei Ziyu's wife, Qionghua; and Wang Xun's wife, Sun Peiqiu. By this time, the garden's chrysanthemums were in full bloom, a brilliant tapestry of five colors. The day's"}],"58":[{"paragraph":11,"mentions":1,"tokens":["田状元"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"也有一座小桥，对岸一个坐落，闻得里头有欢笑之声。奚十一问道：「那边是谁？」大傻道：「那边就是王兰官的住房。今日田状元与史翰林在这里。」奚十一就不便过去，在池畔站了一会。见那边园门口走进一人来，穿着新衣、新帽、新靴，手提着马鞭子，昂昂的走上了小石桥。","en":"a building whence laughter came. Xi asked who it was, and Big Fool explained, \\"Those are Wang Lanbao's rooms. Tian the zhuangyuan and Shi the Hanlin are there today.\\" Xi thought it impolite to intrude and stood by the pond awhile. At the garden gate someone entered in a new coat, hat, and boots, whip in hand, striding onto the little stone bridge."}],"60":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["田春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说新年已过，又到元宵，六街三市，火树银花，好不热闹。子云于十三日请了华公子、田春航、梅子玉、史南湘、高品、颜仲清、刘文泽、王恂、萧次贤、金粟、屈勤先，并九香园诸人，作一大会。琴仙见了华公子，尚有些不安，华公子也不问起前事，以礼相待。此时琴仙已出了旦党，入了士党，但从前作旦时傲睨一切，此刻倒谦谦自守起来，因此上下诸人更加尊重他，绝没","en":"lanterns blazed in bustling splendor. On the thirteenth, Ziyun hosted a grand gathering for Young Master Hua, Tian Chunhang, Mei Ziyu, Shi Nanxiang, Gao Pin, Yan Zhongqing, Liu Wenze, Wang Xun, Xiao Cixian, Jin Su, Qu Qinxian, and the entire company of Nine-Fragrance Garden. Seeing Young Master Hua, Qinxian still felt a trace of unease, yet Hua asked nothing of past affairs,"},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"神若定要十二位，也可凑得上，只要把屈道翁做了芙蓉城主，再借重玉侬的前生所说那杜仙女，凑上玉侬，不是十二位了？」春航道：「妙，妙！此像要画得像，不必说真姓真名，缀个别号，每人做一篇赞语，说得似真似幻的，要与人花两合。」子玉道：「这个图怎样的好呢？还是单画人，还是补景呢？」仲清道：「自然单画人，一并的画去，后就缀小传一篇。刻石之后，可以拓出来，或裱册页，或裱手卷，皆","en":"City, and borrow the Fairy Du from Yunong's past-life vision. Add Yunong himself, and does that not make twelve?\\" Chunhang exclaimed, \\"Brilliant, brilliant! The portraits must capture their likenesses, but we need not use their true names—we can append style names instead. Each will have a eulogy, written to sound half-real and half-illusory, blending the person and the"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"做二阄，其余九人分作九阄。说也奇怪，想必文字有灵，前生缘法，子云拈了道翁，子玉拈了杜仙女、琴仙，金粟拈了宝珠，春航拈了蕙芳，仲清拈了琪官，文泽拈了春喜，南湘拈了兰保，王恂拈了桂保，高品拈了玉林，次贤拈了漱芳，单拈不着素兰，只好送与华公子去作了。众人分派已定，子玉说道：「做传容易，画画难，还要刻石，更须时日，不知几天可以告成？」吉甫道：「不消多日，碑是磨现成的，一","en":"and past-life affinities were at play, Ziyun drew Daoweng; Ziyu drew Fairy Du and Qinxian; Jin Su drew Baozhu; Chunhang drew Huifang; Zhongqing drew Qiguan; Wenze drew Chunxi; Nanxiang drew Lanbao; Wang Xun drew Guibao; Gao Pin drew Yulin; and Cixian drew Shufang. Sulan alone was not drawn, so that assignment was sent to Young Master Hua. The tasks distributed, Ziyu said,"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春航"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴仙再看第三方，画一个仙女，云鬟雾縠，清艳绝伦，手拈一枝蕙花，琴仙已知是蕙芳。看题的是：锦文花史苏仙。是春航一篇跋语：","en":"sprig. Qinxian instantly knew it was Huifang. The title read: \\"Jinwen Flower Historian, Immortal Su.\\" Beside it was Chunhang's colophon:"}]}`),"char-17":JSON.parse(`{"32":[{"paragraph":23,"mentions":1,"tokens":["金粟"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"：「如今世上竟不成事了。你看此中漏网者固多，冤枉者亦复不少。前日瑶卿说，我们同年与他最好，教他画画的那个南京人金粟，本是个名士，性情磊落，大雅不群。因初到京时寄居在某显宦家，也是自不检束，他的跟班与彼内眷有私，竟将相如、文君之事，疑到此君身上，因此辞出。不意这位显宦明于责人，昧于责己，怀恨在胸，借此发挥，将此君亦另案锻炼，又带累了几个名士一并斥革，你说冤枉不冤枉","en":"Yaoqing was saying that the man who is closest to our classmates and teaches him painting, a native of Nanjing named Jin Su, is fundamentally a true scholar who is open and upright, elegant and unworldly. Because he was staying at the house of a certain high official when he first arrived in the capital, and wasn't careful about his conduct, his servant had an affair with"}],"33":[{"paragraph":5,"mentions":1,"tokens":["金粟"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"绝非世俗纱帽之作。又见一个小地罩内，左边挂一个横幅，是宝珠自己的倚竹图小照，右边挂着四幅小屏，是教他画画的那个金粟画的花卉。子玉看了，不禁一叹，说道：「天下事真是有幸有不幸。你看此等名士，竟遭此劫，天之妒才果如是耶！」因向宝珠道：「我听见人说，你之待此公，与此公之待你，亦不亚于蕙芳之待湘帆。且你于此公失意后，更觉亲密，一切旅费悉赖你周全。此等居心，尤为难得，真令","en":"leaning against bamboo, and on the right hung four small screens featuring flowers painted by his art teacher, Jin Su. Upon seeing this, Ziyu sighed softly, \\"There is indeed fortune and misfortune in the world. To think that such a great scholar has met this fate—heaven truly envies talent!\\" He turned to Baozhu and added, \\"I have heard that the way you treat this gentleman,"}],"35":[{"paragraph":35,"mentions":1,"tokens":["金粟"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，阑干畔，有玉人闲凭。」子云道：「更好，该贺个双杯。我也交卷了，我就用温飞卿《采莲曲》上的两句，凑起来是：绿萍金粟莲茎短，露重花多香不消。」大家说好，次贤道：「这两句很佳，可惜「不」字与「茎」字不对。」","en":"Yulin rolled a four and a five. After contemplating for a while, he recited two lines from *The Scolding in the Pavilion*: \\"'For the one in my heart, the old heart-sickness stirs. The coy Lord of Spring, his spring-heart leans toward the small plum twigs.'\\" Huifang smiled and commented, \\"This excerpt from *The Scolding in the Pavilion* is much better than your earlier *Hearing the Bells*.\\" Thus, everyone toasted two cups. Ziyun said, \\"It's my turn to show my inadequacy.\\" He drew a lot from the flora category: the beauty 'Lianxiang' (莲香) and an intertwined flower. Desiring to produce truly fine lines, he didn't speak hastily, polishing his thoughts while watching the others roll the dice. He saw Baozhu roll a two and a four, and after a moment's thought, Baozhu recited a lyric from *Spring Sleep*: \\"'Starry eyes rub with fatigue; a whole sheet of beauty-fragrance blends.'\\" Ziyun praised, \\"Excellent! That deserves a toast.\\" Everyone raised a cup. Shufang rolled a one and a two, paused to think, and recited, \\"'The moon climbs the eastern wall—most lovely when the stars are clear and the moon is bright.'\\" Ziyun again praised, \\"Good! That deserves a cup.\\" Everyone drank. Wenze teased Ziyun, \\"It's time you submitted your own lines. You just keep watching others turn theirs in. Could it be that your mental draft isn't finished yet?\\" Ziyun chuckled, \\"Almost done.\\" He then watched Huifang roll a one and a four. After half a quarter of an hour, Huifang recited two lines from *Stealing the Song*: \\"'The mountain enters the cold sky, the moon's shadow crosses; by the balustrade, a jade beauty leans at leisure.'\\" Ziyun praised, \\"Even better! That deserves a double cup. And now, I am ready to submit my lines. I will use two lines from Wen Tingyun's *Lotus-Picking Song*, combining them to: 'Green duckweed, golden millet, the lotus stems are short; the dew is heavy, the flowers many, the fragrance does not fade.'\\" Everyone voiced their approval. Cixian said, \\"These two lines are quite beautiful. It's just a pity that the character 'not' (不) and 'stem' (茎) don't form a perfect poetic match.\\""}],"38":[{"paragraph":38,"mentions":1,"tokens":["吉甫"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"京巨族。论起世家来，与子云、星北不相上下，想诸公自必相熟的。」子云道：「是那一位？」道翁道：「此君姓金名粟，号吉甫，可相好么？」众人同道：「久闻其名，恨未一见。」道翁道：「若论考据学问品行，当今可以数一数二了。他也有一部说部，是说平倭寇的事，我将他这书的名字忘了。曾经看过一遍，笔下极为雄健。将两个逆首定江王、静海丞相骂得真真痛快，实在是才人之笔。」次贤道：「此辈","en":"him well.\\" Ziyun said, \\"Who might that be?\\" Master Qu said, \\"His family name is Jin, given name Li, style name Jifu — are you acquainted with him?\\" Everyone said together, \\"We have long heard his name but have never yet had the honour of meeting him.\\" Master Qu said, \\"In scholarship, learning, and personal character he is among the very first or second in the world"}],"45":[{"paragraph":8,"mentions":1,"tokens":["金吉甫"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"玉道：「几时请他来扶乩，我好看看。」子云道：「我留他住下就是为此。要不然，就是明日，我们把几位相好的都请来。那金吉甫我也往还过了，人极风雅，明日一并请来，结个仙缘罢。」子玉笑道：「我是必来的。」","en":"agreed. \\"I am putting him up for just that purpose. Otherwise, tomorrow we will gather all our friends. I have met Jin Jifu, a most refined gentleman, and we will invite him too to seal a fairy bond.\\" Ziyu laughed brightly, \\"I will certainly come.\\""},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":2,"tokens":["金吉甫","吉甫"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"颜夫人是从没有阻过他的。子玉到了辰刻，因是仙坛，衣冠而去。是日一早，屈道生同金吉甫先到，随后颜仲清、刘文泽、王恂一齐都来了，子玉到了，各人与吉甫相见，叙了些彼此仰慕的话。只有史南湘、田春航在场中未来。相公们到的是宝珠、蕙芳、素兰、玉林、漱芳、兰保、桂保、春喜、琪官、连琴言刚是十人。","en":"arrived at the chen hour. Since it was an immortal altar, he went in full dress. Early that morning, Qu Daosheng and Jin Jifu had already arrived. They were followed by Yan Zhongqing, Liu Wenze, Wang Xun, and finally Ziyu. They exchanged words of long admiration with Jifu. Shi Nanxiang and Tian Chunhang were still at the examination grounds. Among the performers who came were"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":2,"tokens":["金粟"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"梅花一枝开春先，瑶琴三尺弹鹍弦。\\n红愁绿怨泪沾袖，明月一年几度圆。\\n道生写了。仲清对金粟道：「这四句像是说庾香与玉侬的。」金粟点头。子玉看了，分明一个梅字，一个琴字，也知道是说他们二人的，心里又想道：「难道坡仙今日要将这十九个人全写入诗内么？」子云与诸人也都看了，蕙芳呆呆的看着乩盘，只见道生又照着乩上写了四句是：","en":"longing, tears soak the sleeves,\\nHow many times each year does the bright moon wax full?\\"\\nZhongqing turned to Jin Su and whispered, \\"These lines sound like Yuxiang and Yunong.\\" Jin nodded in agreement. Ziyu plainly saw the characters mei (plum) and qin (zither), and he knew they spoke of the two of them. He wondered whether Su meant to gather all nineteen of them into"},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":3,"tokens":["吉甫"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"名园公子人中英，于彼于此俱有情。\\n珠辉宝气联星斗，金光灿烂云霞明。\\n道生写了，对着子云、吉甫道：「这像是说你们二位呢。」子云、吉甫俱说「惭愧！惭愧！」宝珠看了，也知道带着他，且与吉甫相联，心甚喜欢。只见又写道：","en":"treasure light thread through the Dipper,\\nGolden radiance and rosy clouds shine bright.\\"\\nDaosheng turned to Ziyun and Jifu. \\"This seems to describe you two.\\" Both replied, \\"We are unworthy!\\" Baozhu knew he was included, linked with Jifu, and he was deeply pleased. Next came:"},{"paragraph":38,"mentions":1,"tokens":["吉甫"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"动颜色，即道：「玉侬若得道翁先生栽培，真是精金入冶，美玉成器。只求道翁不以寒微为鄙，玉侬岂有不愿之理？」次贤与吉甫等都赞成道：「这是极好的事，大约今日合当父子相逢，不然杜兰仙何以特判出来，又单叫道翁上前，说明前因后果，不是也要撮合这件事么？可见数已前定。」子云接口道：「可勿三思，请到承荫堂一拜就算了。」道生想道：「我看着琴言虽系优伶，却无半点习气，度香早说过他多","en":"the forge, fair jade carved to ware. Only do not scorn his humble birth. How could Yunong refuse?\\" Cixian and Jifu wholeheartedly approved. \\"Nothing could be better. Today, father and son were meant to meet. Else why would Du Lanxiang have singled out the judgment and called Old Gentleman forward to explain cause and effect, except to bring this about? The numbers"},{"paragraph":41,"mentions":1,"tokens":["吉甫"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云便请入席。第一席是道生、子玉、吉甫、王胡子、琴言，二席是仲清、文泽、王恂、子云、次贤，九个名旦分为两桌，各自叙齿坐了三、四两席。琴言坐在下手，拘拘谨谨，也不举箸，甚觉可怜。倒是道生体恤他，道：「凡遇热闹场中，当言的即言，也不必过于拘谨，但存着个后辈的分寸就是了。」","en":"Ziyun invited everyone to the table. The first table sat Daosheng, Ziyu, Jifu, Old Wang Beard, and Qinyan. The second seated Zhongqing, Wenze, Wang Xun, Ziyun, and Cixian. The nine actors split two more tables by age. Qinyan sat quietly at the foot, his chopsticks untouched, looking pitifully constrained. Daosheng comforted him"},{"paragraph":42,"mentions":1,"tokens":["吉甫"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"道生喝了几杯酒，便与子玉、吉甫、王胡子谈些闲话。王胡子道：「屈老先生，晚生这个请仙的本事如何？你说我是赚人么？」道生笑道：「今日之事却真稀奇，若不是我亲眼见的，亲手写的，凭谁告诉我，我也不信。」又道：「胡兄，你往常请仙，也有这么灵异么？」胡子道：「今年过扬州时，在一个盐商家扶乩，","en":"After a few cups, Daosheng chatted comfortably with Ziyu, Jifu, and Old Wang Beard. Old Wang asked, \\"Old Gentleman Qu, how was my spirit-planchette today? Do you still say I cheat people?\\" Daosheng smiled warmly. \\"Today was a marvel. I would not believe it from hearsay had I not seen and copied it with my own eyes.\\""},{"paragraph":45,"mentions":1,"tokens":["吉甫"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"宝珠道：「我们前生，就不知道是什么人转生的。吉甫说他也会请，我要看看，总未遇巧。」素兰笑道：「你的前生不是说是个尼姑呢？」宝珠不觉得脸一红，笑道：「你怎么知道？」素兰道：「我听见你自己说的。」宝珠笑道：「我竟忘记了。」","en":"Baozhu wondered aloud, \\"Who knows what we were in our past lives? Jifu says he can summon spirits too. I keep hoping to see it, but I never get the chance.\\" Sulan laughed teasingly. \\"They say you were a nun in a former life?\\" Baozhu flushed deeply. \\"How would you know that?\\" Sulan smirked. \\"I heard you say so yourself.\\""},{"paragraph":46,"mentions":1,"tokens":["吉甫"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"因远远的看着吉甫一笑，大家也不觉笑了。","en":"He cast Jifu a warm smile from across the room, and everyone laughed along without quite knowing why."}],"46":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":2,"tokens":["金吉甫","吉甫"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，就使徐、庾复生，也不能涂改一字。」子云道：「是石刻好呢，还是木刻好呢？」道翁道：「论长久，自然是石刻。前日见金吉甫相熟的那个季十矮子，刻工尚好，不过价值大些，然此是市井的常理。你莫若找吉甫将他荐来一刻，是极妙的。不是说要刻在含万楼屏风上？却也好看。」次贤称善。子云即叫书童找出了八张大宣纸，照着屏风大小裁好了，送到海棠春圃，请道翁亲笔自书。此时春航、南湘场事已毕，","en":"asked: \\"Stone inscription or woodblock?\\" Daoweng said: \\"For longevity, stone. That carver Ji the Tenth who knows Jin Jifu does honest work—dearer than common, but markets are markets. Ask Jifu to recommend him for the cutting. Was it meant for the Tower of Myriad Containment screen? Splendid display.\\" Cixian approved. Ziyun had pages fetch eight sheets of fine xuan cut"},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":1,"tokens":["吉甫"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"诸名士于二十八日早上陆续皆到。是日子玉、春航、南湘、仲清、文泽、王恂，共是六位，惟吉甫因感冒未到。园内屈氏父子，与次贤、主人四位，都在含万楼下坐了。道翁道：「这个含万楼是本《易经》「含万物而化光」句摘下，因为园中的主楼，故取此名。但就本意是言干道之大，此名似乎不甚相宜，度香以为何如？我见楼上现供着赐书，何不就改为赐书楼，未知可否？」子","en":"twenty-eighth morning the gentlemen arrived piecemeal: Ziyu, Chunhang, Nanxiang, Zhongqing, Wenze and Wang Xun—six—while Jifu stayed home with a chill. The Qu father and son, Cixian and their host — four in all — sat below the Tower of Myriad Containment. Daoweng explained: \\"This tower borrows from the *Book of Changes*: 'embracing the myriad things, transforming their splendour.'"},{"paragraph":55,"mentions":1,"tokens":["吉甫"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"道翁自谦一番，又道：「可惜今日吉甫未来，又少了许多名作。明日想他也就大好了，请他来看了，斟酌斟酌再刻。」诸名士皆以为然，直饮到三更，方才尽欢而散。不知后事如何，且听下回分解。","en":"Daoweng demurred, then sighed that Jifu had missed the day—and with him many fine lines—though by tomorrow he would likely mend; they should invite him to read and polish before carving. All agreed and drank till the third watch before parting in high spirits. What followed, hear in the next"}],"47":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":3,"tokens":["金吉甫","吉甫"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"喜，后又看了那篇序文，真是五体投地，不能不服。就是南湘、春航，是最不轻易服人的，此时也是真心拜倒。明日子云又请金吉甫到园，将那些联额看了，吉甫亦甚佩服。请道翁用真行字，写了十六扇屏风，吉甫荐的季十矮子在园中刻起来。","en":"Even Nanxiang and Chunhang, usually slow to bow to anyone, yielded in genuine respect. The next day Ziyun invited Jin Jifu to the garden to view the paired couplets and plaques; Jifu, too, voiced high praise. Daoweng was invited to brush the characters in flowing cursive for a sixteen-panel screen, and Ji the Tenth Dwarf, whom Jifu recommended, set to carving them within"}],"48":[{"paragraph":12,"mentions":1,"tokens":["金粟"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"班名旦，不是垂帘度曲，就是对酒当歌。南湘素有才名，如今加上个翰林名号，更有那求文求诗的接踵而来。他又怕烦，常请金粟、子玉等代笔。至于不要紧的，连琴仙、蕙芳、素兰、宝珠的佳章都有在里面，好在人人说好，没有一个看得出来。南湘本要接夫人来京，一因任上两大人无人侍奉，二因他夫人利害，常要阻他的清兴，劝他戒酒。南湘有些惧内，本来只好狂饮狂游，鳏居倒也不妨。","en":"a Hanlin title, requests for essays and poems poured in endlessly. Detesting the nuisance, he frequently asked Jin Su, Ziyu, and others to write on his behalf. For less important pieces, even Qinxian, Huifang, Sulan, and Baozhu supplied exquisite verses. Everyone praised the work, and no one could tell the difference. Nanxiang had intended to bring his wife to the capital,"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":1,"tokens":["吉甫"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，郁郁的想念，被南湘道破了，只得强起精神。也因闷坐无聊，便随着他到吟秋榭去。南湘忽又说：「我们何不去请了庾香、吉甫两人来，作个清谈雅集，倒也有趣。」琴仙听了，正合他意，便道：「很好，你打发人去请来。」南湘道：「你找张纸来，我写个字帖儿去。」琴仙找了一张诗笺，南湘写了两行狂草，着家人骑了快马，即刻请了金少爷、梅少爷来。","en":"along to the Autumn-Chant Waterside Pavilion.\\n\\nNanxiang said suddenly, \\"Why do we not send and ask Yuxiang and Jifu over, and make an elegant gathering of it with some quiet talk? That would be pleasant.\\" This was exactly what Qinxian wanted. \\"Very good,\\" he said. \\"Send someone to fetch them.\\" Nanxiang said, \\"Find me a sheet of paper and I will write a note.\\"\\n\\nQinxian"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":1,"tokens":["金粟"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"家人奉命先到梅宅投了字帖，却好金粟正在子玉处，吃了早饭，正想同子玉到怡园来。二人看了字，吩咐来人先去了。","en":"Following his orders, the servant first delivered the note to the Mei residence. As it happened, Jin Su was already at Ziyu's home, having finished breakfast and intending to accompany Ziyu to the Garden of Contentment. The two read the note, instructed the messenger to go ahead, and set out themselves."},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":1,"tokens":["金粟"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉、金粟都是随身便服，各带了书童，坐车到怡园。自有南湘的家人引进，知道主人在吟秋榭，便从山边小径抄入练秋阁前，下了船。这个船是天天有人伺候的，不须找人荡桨。双桨分开，哑哑轧扎的，从莲萍菱芡中荡去，见白鹭横飞，绿杨倒挂，已觉妙不可言。穿过了红桥，望见吟秋榭边，","en":"Ziyu and Jin Su arrived in everyday attire, each accompanied by a pageboy, and rode in a carriage to the Garden of Contentment. Nanxiang's servant guided them. Upon learning that the hosts were at the waterside pavilion, they took a shortcut along a hillside path, arrived"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":7,"tokens":["金粟"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"金粟、子玉上了岸，进了第一层，听得楼上叮叮当当的响，又听得南湘朗吟东坡的《水调歌头》道：「我欲乘风归去，只恐琼楼玉宇，高处不胜寒。」当的一声，像把个玻璃钵击碎了，遂狂笑进来。金粟笑道：「何物狂奴，悲歌击节？」南湘见金粟等进来，益发大笑。金粟道：「此是端午","en":"Ziyu and Jin Su went ashore and entered the first tier. From above, they heard the clinking of glasses and Nanxiang loudly reciting Su Shi's \\"Prelude to Water Tune,\\" chanting about riding the wind home and fearing the jade towers and high altitudes. A loud crash followed,"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":1,"tokens":["金粟"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"南湘道：「只怕还有些清而不平，平而不清的。」金粟道：「文章之妙，在各人领略，究竟也无甚凭据。我看庾子山为文，用字不检，一篇之内，前后迭出。今人虽无其妙处，也无此毛病。宋之问以土囊谋人佳句，试看佳句何如？王勃《滕王阁序》最传诵者，为落霞秋水一联，然亦不过写景而已。」南湘道：「我们今日作何消遣？你看天","en":"Nanxiang mused that some works were clear but not level, while others were level but not clear. Jin Su replied that the marvel of literature lies in each reader's individual comprehension, and there is no absolute standard. He pointed out that Yu Xin's writing often carelessly repeated characters within a single piece, a flaw modern writers avoided despite"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":1,"tokens":["金粟"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"面的浮萍，即说道：「这个燕子今年去了，明年还会回来么？」子玉道：「怎么不会来？管保这两个燕子明年又在这里了。」金粟笑道：「何以拿得这样稳呢？」子玉道：「似曾相识燕归来」，不是就是去年的么？」琴仙道：「无可奈何花落去」呢？难道落花还会吹上枝么？」子玉道：「花落重开也是一样，不过暂时落劫罢了。」琴仙道：「落花劫也太多，有落在水里的，有落在圂里的。若落在水里的还好，到","en":"back next year?\\" Ziyu said, \\"How could they not? I'll warrant these two swallows will be here again next year.\\" Jin Su laughed. \\"How can you be so sure of it?\\" Ziyu said, \\"'Swallows return that seem once to have been known' — are they not last year's birds?\\" Qinxian said, \\"And 'Helpless, the flowers fall away'? Can fallen blossom be blown back onto the branch?\\" Ziyu"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":2,"tokens":["金粟"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"道：「你看这鸭子是一群同着走，倒没有一个离群的。」子玉道：「人生在世，倒没有这些物类快活，毫无拘束。」南湘对着金粟微笑，金粟点点头，听着他们讲话。子玉道：「人生离合也没有什么一定，你看天上的云，总是望一边去的。你不见今日是两来的云，东边的会遇着西边的么？」琴仙仰首看天，道：「只怕有横风来吹散他。」子玉道：「那边有横风来吹得散，难道这边没有横风来吹合他？」琴仙笑道","en":"\\"A man in this world is not so happy as these creatures. Nothing binds them at all.\\" Nanxiang smiled across at Jin Su, and Jin Su nodded, and the two of them listened.\\n\\nZiyu said, \\"There is nothing fixed about meeting and parting in a life either. Look at the clouds up there — they all go one way. Do you not see that today the clouds come from two quarters? Will the"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":3,"tokens":["金粟"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"南湘叫摆过酒来，家童摆好了。金粟道：「庾香、玉侬过来喝一杯罢。」一面把船荡到练秋阁前，南湘道：「去年静宜有个《水浒传》的酒令，媚香掣着了《潘金莲雪天戏叔》，媚香那个神色，再没有这么好笑，不料湘帆今日竟能如此了。」金粟道：「湘帆真不负媚香。」说着，叹了一口气。南湘道：「也幸遇着了媚香","en":"Nanxiang ordered the wine to be served, and the pageboys quickly set the table. Jin Su invited Yuxiang and Yunong to share a cup. As the boat drifted near Refining Autumn Loft, Nanxiang recalled Jingyi's \\"Water Margin\\" drinking game from the previous year, remembering how Meixiang's expression during \\"Pan Jinlian Teases Her Brother-in-Law"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":6,"tokens":["金粟"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「要到稻庄去，就要走围墙边那带河，过了水闸，全是大河。从菊畦背后，就到了稻庄，还可以到桃花源，就到不得兰径。」金粟道：「这里路我没有走过，就这样去。」于是一路的荡去，又觉别开生面。金粟道：「庾香你也该临别赠言，做首诗赠玉侬。」子玉道：「我们联句罢。」金粟道：「这个恐不能，各人是各人的情意，未必联得上来。」琴仙道：「前日静宜画了一柄扇子，是个《怡园饯别图》，度香于","en":"you come out at the rice hamlet, and you can go on to Peach Blossom Spring — but you cannot get to Orchid Path.\\" Jin Su said, \\"I have never gone that way. Let us do it so.\\"\\n\\nAnd so they drifted on, and the prospect opened out quite differently. Jin Su said, \\"Yuxiang, you ought to give him a word at parting. Make Yunong a poem.\\" Ziyu said, \\"Let us do linked verses.\\" Jin"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":5,"tokens":["金粟"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"来了。」琴仙犹带着泣，听南湘念道：「明朝送别长亭畔。忍牵衣、道声珍重，此心更乱。」南湘念到此，也几乎念不出来。金粟听了，也觉惨然难忍。琴仙已放声大哭，南湘勉强又念道：「门外天涯……」将词稿放下道：「我不念了。」斟了一杯酒喝了，便跷脚而卧，口中吟道：「一声《河满子》，双泪落君前。哀猿夜吟，令人肠断。」琴仙痛哭了一会，子玉勉强劝住了，把绢子替他拭了眼泪，琴仙还望着那","en":"of yourself' —\\nthe heart is more distracted than before.\\"\\n\\nNanxiang could barely get the words out himself, and Jin Su, hearing them, found it hard to bear. Qinxian broke into loud weeping. Nanxiang forced out, \\"Beyond the gate, the world's end —\\" and then put the sheet down. \\"I will read no further.\\" He poured himself a cup, drank it, and lay back with his feet up,"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":2,"tokens":["金粟"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云还要留金粟、子玉小饮，子玉坐在此倒觉心酸，便同金粟各自回去。","en":"Ziyun attempted to keep Jin Su and Ziyu for a small drink, but sitting there only deepened Ziyu's heartache, so he and Jin Su quietly departed for their respective homes."},{"paragraph":36,"mentions":1,"tokens":["金粟"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"送了二百，道翁的盘费很富足了。子云、次贤各备车马跟着，一直送出城外，直到十里之外皇华亭。只见南湘、仲清、文泽、金粟、王恂、子玉、春航，领着那蕙芳、宝珠、素兰、漱芳、玉林、兰保、桂保、琪官、春喜九个名旦，在皇华亭等候。道翁等连忙下车，极口辞谢。各人皆要把盏。","en":"the Imperial Envoys' Pavilion, ten miles away. Waiting there at the pavilion were Nanxiang, Zhongqing, Wenze, Jin Su, Wang Xun, Ziyu, and Chunhang, alongside Huifang and the nine famous performers: Baozhu, Sulan, Shufang, Yulin, Lanbao, Guibao, Qiguan, and Chunxi. Daoweng hurried down from his carriage and thanked everyone repeatedly, as they all eagerly wished to"}],"49":[{"paragraph":13,"mentions":1,"tokens":["金粟"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"。想现任官，在京也不能考的。」苏侯道：「屈道生么？他是孝廉方正，可惜了，屈在下位。不然倒好保他。还有那南京名宿金粟，也因限于成例不能保举的，真真令人可惜。此外呢？」子云道：「此外尚有几个，都是英才未发的人。翰林院侍读学士梅公之子名子玉，目下少年中有景星凤凰之誉。」苏侯点点头。子云又道：「已故翰林院编修颜庄之子名仲清，现任礼部尚书刘大人之子名文泽，内阁学士王大人之","en":"relegated to a lower post. Otherwise, it would be good to sponsor him. There is also the famous Nanjing scholar Jin Su, who is restricted by established regulations and cannot be recommended—truly a regrettable thing. Who else?\\" Ziyun continued, \\"There are a few others whose brilliant talents are yet unrevealed. The son of the Hanlin Reader-in-Waiting Mr. Mei, named"}],"50":[{"paragraph":21,"mentions":3,"tokens":["吉甫"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"那三个相公看着唐和尚胁肩谄笑，好不难看。仲清道：「连日未见瑶卿。」琪官道：「瑶卿近日从着吉甫学琴呢，竟是足不出户。吉甫也真好静，他当日教过梅卿弹琴，自梅卿死后，他的《梅花三弄》是再不弹的了。你说这也算深于情了。」仲清道：「吉甫的人本沈静高雅，于这些文玩无上无不精通。」大家谈论，日已西沉，文泽等也要散了，王恂叫走堂的报账，文泽又抢作东，两人争","en":"repulsive. Zhongqing said, \\"I haven't seen Yaoqing for days.\\" Qiguan replied, \\"Yaoqing has been studying the guqin with Jifu recently; he practically never steps out of the house. Jifu truly loves his peace and quiet. Back in the day, he taught Meiqing how to play the qin, but ever since Meiqing passed away, he has completely refused to play 'Three Variations on the Plum Blossom'"}],"53":[{"paragraph":7,"mentions":3,"tokens":["金吉甫","吉甫"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"之心，难道一人只许有一个知己，不准有两个么？」素兰道：「若论知己，自然越多越好。就以蕙芳之与田春航，瑶卿之与之金吉甫而论，春航固是蕙芳的知己，吉甫固是瑶卿的知己。蕙芳之待春航，瑶卿之待吉甫，也是报知己之报了。事虽不同，情则一也。然而他们待外人也是这样，心里却有权衡，外面若无轩轾，不露出厚薄来。所以人也不能说他们，也不能妒他们。若琴言之心，没有一点曲折，这样就是这样","en":"\\"When it comes to confidants, naturally the more the better. Take Huifang with Tian Chunhang, and Yaoqing with Jin Jifu: Chunhang is certainly Huifang's confidant, and Jifu is certainly Yaoqing's confidant. Huifang's treatment of Chunhang and Yaoqing's treatment of Jifu are their ways of repaying that understanding. The circumstances differ, but the feeling is the same."}],"59":[{"paragraph":22,"mentions":1,"tokens":["金粟"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"没有一个在园子里，子玉更加着急。跟班们不知何事，又不敢问子玉，便又到九香楼，进去见诸名旦都在园中，南湘、高品、金粟都在这里。子玉不及叙话，一脸悲愁，就将琴仙给众人之信与他们看了，个个洒泪。再不料琴仙一出京，就遭此大难，真令人意想不到。蕙芳道「如今没有别的，快找度香来商量。」于是打发人找寻子云。找着了子云，到了九香园，见了子玉的光景，急急的拆开信看了，已觉涕泪潸潸","en":"Tower. Going inside, he found that all the famous dans were gathered in the garden, and Nanxiang, Gao Pin, and Jin Su were there as well. Bypassing any pleasantries, his face a mask of sorrow, Ziyu showed them the letters Qinxian had sent. Every single one of them shed tears. It was truly unimaginable that Qinxian would suffer such a massive calamity the moment he left"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":1,"tokens":["金粟"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"回来，并办道翁葬事。但今年不能到了。」子云即回，要告诉次贤商量此事。子玉也无心在九香楼，便即回家。高品，史南湘金粟与那些名旦，各惆怅无欢。子云回园与次贤说了，次贤更痛得伤心，一夜之间，便摹了道翁神像。明日邀同众名士在九香楼为位而哭，设奠三日。华公子得了信，也来哭奠。一个九香园倒成了屈道翁的丧居了，就没有穿孝的人。","en":"him. With no heart to remain at the Nine-Fragrance Tower, Ziyu also went straight home. Gao Pin, Shi Nanxiang, Jin Su, and the famous dans were left feeling melancholic and devoid of any joy. When Ziyun returned to the garden and recounted the events to Cixian, Cixian was even more profoundly grief-stricken; over the course of a single night, he traced and painted a"}],"60":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["金粟"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"三市，火树银花，好不热闹。子云于十三日请了华公子、田春航、梅子玉、史南湘、高品、颜仲清、刘文泽、王恂、萧次贤、金粟、屈勤先，并九香园诸人，作一大会。琴仙见了华公子，尚有些不安，华公子也不问起前事，以礼相待。此时琴仙已出了旦党，入了士党，但从前作旦时傲睨一切，此刻倒谦谦自守起来，因此上下诸人更加尊重他，绝没有一个人笑他。琴仙对了那些名旦，还是从前一样，并不生疏。是","en":"Young Master Hua, Tian Chunhang, Mei Ziyu, Shi Nanxiang, Gao Pin, Yan Zhongqing, Liu Wenze, Wang Xun, Xiao Cixian, Jin Su, Qu Qinxian, and the entire company of Nine-Fragrance Garden. Seeing Young Master Hua, Qinxian still felt a trace of unease, yet Hua asked nothing of past affairs, treating him with utmost courtesy. By now, Qinxian had left the circle of performers to"},{"paragraph":2,"mentions":2,"tokens":["吉甫"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴仙一身历尽艰辛，此时才觉魔难尽释。然回想萧寺凄凉，孤灯残月，真如梦觉。次贤又将琴仙从前的梦境，向吉甫细细的说了一遍。吉甫因笑向子云、次贤道：「九香楼绝好一个花园，百花全有，如今单有一个花神牌位，且在隐僻处，与土地祠一样，岂不亵渎花神？我拟借他们九个作个九香花史，众位以为何如？」","en":"monastery, the lone lamp, and the waning moon, it all seemed like waking from a dream. Cixian then recounted to Jifu in detail the dreamscapes Qinxian had once described. Smiling, Jifu turned to Ziyun and Cixian: \\"Nine-Fragrance Tower is a superb garden holding every kind of flower, yet currently there is only one flower-god tablet hidden away in a secluded corner"},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":1,"tokens":["吉甫"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"明日一一画出，就请你润色润色，就刻石供养在这九香楼下，做个花神。但只有九个，凑不出十二个来。」众人亦同说大妙。吉甫道：「我倒有一个主意，但不知可行不可行？」","en":"deities. But with only nine, we cannot make a full set of twelve.\\" Everyone agreed this was an excellent plan. Jifu added, \\"I do have an idea, though I'm not sure if it will work.\\""},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":4,"tokens":["吉甫"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云问道：「怎样呢？」吉甫道：「花神若定要十二位，也可凑得上，只要把屈道翁做了芙蓉城主，再借重玉侬的前生所说那杜仙女，凑上玉侬，不是十二位了？」春航道：「妙，妙！此像要画得像，不必说真姓真名，缀个别号，每人做一篇赞语，说得似真似幻的，要与人花两合。」子玉道：「这个图怎样的好呢","en":"Ziyun asked what it was. Jifu explained, \\"If we must have twelve flower deities, we can make up the number. We need only cast Qu Daoweng as the Lord of Furong City, and borrow the Fairy Du from Yunong's past-life vision. Add Yunong himself, and does that not make twelve?\\" Chunhang"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":2,"tokens":["金粟","吉甫"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"仙女、屈琴仙分做二阄，其余九人分作九阄。说也奇怪，想必文字有灵，前生缘法，子云拈了道翁，子玉拈了杜仙女、琴仙，金粟拈了宝珠，春航拈了蕙芳，仲清拈了琪官，文泽拈了春喜，南湘拈了兰保，王恂拈了桂保，高品拈了玉林，次贤拈了漱芳，单拈不着素兰，只好送与华公子去作了。众人分派已定，子玉说道：「做传容易，画画难，还要刻石，更须时日，不知几天可以告成？」吉甫道：「不消多日，碑","en":"possessed a spirit and past-life affinities were at play, Ziyun drew Daoweng; Ziyu drew Fairy Du and Qinxian; Jin Su drew Baozhu; Chunhang drew Huifang; Zhongqing drew Qiguan; Wenze drew Chunxi; Nanxiang drew Lanbao; Wang Xun drew Guibao; Gao Pin drew Yulin; and Cixian drew Shufang. Sulan alone was not drawn, so that assignment was sent to Young Master Hua. The tasks"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":1,"tokens":["吉甫"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"有俊友，名成身立，清贵高华，好不有兴。子云写了一札与华公子为素兰作传。这边次贤妙腕灵思，画了十天才成。画成又请吉甫一一的改好，画一个，刻一个，倒也甚快。子云因受了感冒甚重，不敢用心，嘱将道翁、琴仙、杜仙女画在一幅，并求子玉作赞。到二十七日，连传赞都也刻起，系是各人书丹。二十八日就搬往九香楼镶嵌，一日完工。","en":"wielding his wondrous brush and nimble mind, spent ten full days completing the paintings. As each was finished, Jifu meticulously refined it; they painted one and carved one, proceeding with remarkable speed. Ziyun, suffering from a severe cold, dared not overexert himself, so he asked that Daoweng, Qinxian, and Fairy Du be combined into a single panel, and requested"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":1,"tokens":["金粟"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"道：「凭他怎样讲，那里还算得我们？」看第四方，一个仙女月佩霓裳，十分娇艳，手捧明珠一颗，题曰：弄珠花史袁仙。有金粟赞曰：","en":"robes and lunar pendants, cradling a luminous pearl. The title read: \\"Nongzhu Flower Historian, Immortal Yuan.\\" Jin Su's eulogy read:"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":1,"tokens":["吉甫"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"华月光满，蓬山路长。既美且都，亦风而雅。\\n学士满宫，首推大舍。\\n琴仙道：「瑶卿之秾艳韶华，却一齐被静宜画出来，吉甫赞出来了。」宝珠道：「算花神罢了，我也配这样？」看第五方，画一个仙女，意致飘洒，素艳欲流，手拈兰花一朵，题曰：素心花史陆仙。下有小传，为华公子撰：","en":"houses.\\"\\n\\nQinxian noted, \\"Yaoqing's stunning, youthful radiance has been perfectly captured by Jingyi's brush and Jifu's praise.\\" Baozhu replied, \\"Even as a flower god, am I truly worthy of this?\\" They looked at the fifth panel, depicting a fairy maiden with an aura of flowing, unadorned grace, lightly holding a single orchid. The title read: \\"Suxin Flower Historian,"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":2,"tokens":["吉甫"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这等诗，就算他的好心了。若要他做庄重些，他也未尝不愿，但他那油嘴油舌说这惯一派。你们看他生平说过几句正经话来？吉甫说他去年到京来有个笑话。卓然有个表叔，请他吃饭，还有好几位客坐在那里，表叔问他道：「你去年回家，见我家里可好么？」卓然道：「很好，前月表婶又生了个表弟。」那表叔一听唬呆了，想道：我三四年不回家，怎样会生了儿子？当着人又不好问他，那些客虽也听得不顺耳，","en":"accustomed to his glib, smooth-talking ways. Think about it—how many serious things has he ever said in his life? Jifu told us a joke about his visit to the capital last year. Zhuoran has a distant uncle who invited him to dinner, with several other guests present. The uncle asked him, 'When you went home last year, did you find my family well?' Zhuoran replied, 'Very"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":1,"tokens":["金吉甫"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"人看了，大家拿来评定一会，又各自斟酌一会，再公同推敲一会，尽善尽美了，宝珠便誊在一处。诸名士纷纷已到，华公子、金吉甫也都到了。大家果然要祭花神，宝珠等拦住了，然犹摆了香案，各名士奠酒焚香，就没有下拜。然后在九香楼下摆了四席，序齿而坐。这一聚，正是人人意满，个个心欢，毫无不足之处。而且罗列珍馐，横陈肴错，花香人气，缭绕一堂。","en":"transcribed them all together into a clean copy. The famous scholars began arriving one by one, and Young Master Hua and Jin Jifu soon joined them. True to their word, the scholars intended to offer sacrifices to the flower gods, but Baozhu and the others stopped them. Nevertheless, an incense table was set up, and the scholars poured libations and burned incense, though they stopped"}]}`),"char-20":{1:[{paragraph:4,mentions:2,tokens:["李性全","性全"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"子玉随了回去，即入了泮，在本省过了一回乡试未中，仍随任进京，因回南不便，遂以上舍生肄业成均，现从了浙江一个名宿李性全读书。这性全系士燮乡榜门生，是个言方行矩的道学先生。颜夫人将此子爱如珍宝，读书之外时不离身。宅中丫鬟仆妇甚多，仆妇三十岁以下，丫鬟十五岁以上者，皆不令其服侍子玉，恐为引诱。而子玉亦能守身如玉，虽在罗绮丛中，却无纨绔习气，不佩罗囊而自丽，不傅香粉而自华",en:"journey south inconvenient, he enrolled as a senior student in the Imperial Academy and currently studies under Li Xingquan, a renowned scholar from Zhejiang. This Li Xingquan, a former examinee passed by Shixie in the provincial exams, is a strict neo-Confucian teacher of meticulous words and rigorous conduct. Lady Yan treasures her son beyond measure, keeping him close"}],2:[{paragraph:8,mentions:5,tokens:["性全"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"这边子玉引李、魏二人到了书房，性全已知道他儿子来了，等他叩见过了，然后与魏聘才见礼，问了姓名，性全让他上坐，聘才只是不肯。子玉想了一想：「先生父子乍见，定然有些说话。」就引聘才到对面船房内坐下，云儿与俊儿送了茶。聘才笑道、「世兄可还认得小弟么？」子玉道：「面善的很，实在想不起了。」聘",en:"In the study, Ziyu guided Li and Wei to meet Li Xingquan, who was already aware of his son's arrival. Once the son had offered his filial respects, introductions were made with Wei Pincai. Li Xingquan courteously offered Pincai the seat of honor, an offer Pincai repeatedly declined. Ziyu, sensing that father"},{paragraph:9,mentions:1,tokens:["性全"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"喝了一会茶，说了些南边年岁光景，聘才知道元茂不能熬夜，起身告辞，性全也体谅他们路上辛苦，就叫元茂跟了过去，子玉送他们进屋，见已铺设好了，说声：「早些安歇罢！」也就叫俊儿提灯，照进上房去了。",en:"affairs in the south. Pincai, aware that Yuanmao could not abide late hours, eventually rose to take his leave. Li Xingquan, understanding the exhaustion of their travels, sent Yuanmao along with him. Ziyu escorted them to their quarters, ensuring everything was appropriately arranged. Bidding them to rest early, he called for Jun'er to light a lantern and made his way back"}],4:[{paragraph:3,mentions:2,tokens:["李性全","性全"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"雪才止了。真个琼妆世界，玉琢乾坤，一派好景。那李性全先生，清早起来冒了寒，头晕咳嗽，仍上床躺了，觉得心里烦闷，不令子玉等读书。性全自己精于药理，便叫书僮去抓了几味发散药吃了，蒙头安睡。子玉命两个书僮，在书房外好好伺候，自己到了一个小三间书屋，名为二十四琴斋。这块匾额，还是其祖文穆公手笔。子玉无聊，翻出",en:"world adorned in jade and glass, the heavens and earth carved in pure white—a scene of surpassing beauty. Master Li Xingquan had risen early and braved the chill, only to develop a dizzy head and a cough. Feeling out of sorts, he returned to bed and excused Ziyu and the others from their studies. Being well-versed in pharmacology, he had his page-boy fetch several doses of"}],5:[{paragraph:38,mentions:1,tokens:["李性全"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"家无趣了。」聘才笑道：「若果如此，那一天可以见着琴官的戏了。」子玉一笑，道：「我还有一点事。」说罢进去了。晚间李性全回来，进门时已见满堂灯彩，照耀辉煌。望见大厅上，梅学士与夫人及子玉，围着一群仆妇，在神像前上供。",en:'smiled and said: "There is still something else I must attend to." And he went back inside. That evening, when Li Xingquan returned home, entering the gate he already saw the whole hall illuminated with lanterns in brilliant splendor. Looking toward the main hall, he saw Scholar Mei with his wife and Ziyu, surrounded by a group of servants and their wives, offering sacrificial'},{paragraph:39,mentions:1,tokens:["性全"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"急忙来到书房，见书房中也点着两对红烛、四盏素玻璃灯，元茂上前叩了头。聘才也来辞岁，性全连忙还礼，即同了他们到老师、师母跟前辞岁，士燮挡住了。颜夫人即吩咐子玉出去叩贺先生，梅学士即领了子玉，来到书房，彼此贺毕，便摆上酒肴。",en:"burning within. Yuanmao went forward to bow in greeting. Pincai also came to offer the New Year's salutation. Xingquan hastily returned the courtesies, then led them to pay their New Year's respects to their Teacher and Teacher's Wife. Scholar Mei stopped them from the full formality of bowing. Lady Yan immediately instructed Ziyu to go out and offer New Year's greetings"},{paragraph:40,mentions:2,tokens:["性全"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"梅学士恭恭敬敬与性全斟了酒，性全连称不敢；又要与聘才、元茂斟酒，聘才连忙接过酒杯，自己放好了，依次坐下。",en:"Scholar Mei with great reverence filled a cup of wine for Xingquan; Xingquan kept demurring that he could not accept such an honor. Mei then made to fill cups for Pincai and Yuanmao as well. Pincai quickly took the wine cup himself, set it in place, and they all took their seats in proper order."},{paragraph:41,mentions:2,tokens:["李性全","性全"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"士燮是个言方行矩的人，更配上那个李性全，席间无非讲些修身立行，勉励子玉的话。李元茂拘拘束束，菜也不敢吃，坐着好不难受。倒是聘才还能假充老实，学些迂腐的话，与他们谈谈。不多一会，也就散了席。梅学士又在外坐了一会，讲了好些话，然后同了子玉进去。性全、元茂等亦各安寝，且待下回分解。",en:"Scholar Mei was a man of strict speech and upright conduct, and now paired with Li Xingquan, the conversation at the table was nothing but discourse on self-cultivation and moral rectitude, all words of exhortation to Ziyu. Li Yuanmao sat stiff and constrained, hardly daring to eat, in considerable discomfort. Only Pincai managed to pretend"}],9:[{paragraph:2,mentions:1,tokens:["李性全"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"过了两日，已是元宵佳节，李性全带着元茂，到会馆中吃年酒去了，聘才出去逛灯未回。子玉一人正在无聊，恰好梅进进来说道：「刘少爷、颜少爷、王少爷，请少爷出去逛灯，都在门口等着。」子玉禀过父母，梅进即叫套了车，云儿跟着出来。仲清等却在车里等着，见子玉出来便下了车。刘文泽道：「如此良宵，千",en:'Two days later came the Lantern Festival. Li Xingquan took Yuanmao to a New Year banquet at the guild hall, while Pincai had gone out to view the lanterns and had not yet returned. Ziyu sat alone with nothing to do when Mei Jin came in and announced: "Young Master Liu, Young Master Yan, and Young Master'}],15:[{paragraph:2,mentions:1,tokens:["性全"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"他拉了一纤。托张仲雨问西客借了一票银子，占了些空头，有二百余金，添补些衣服，也叫了几天相公。李元茂要在京寄籍，性全也只得由他。",en:"hired young protégés for several days. Li Yuanmao wished to register his household registration in the capital; Xingquan had no choice but to let him do as he wished."},{paragraph:3,mentions:3,tokens:["李性全","性全"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"爷，老爷放了江西学差，报喜的现在门口。」子玉听了也觉喜欢，便同着梅进到里头报与颜夫人知道，颜夫人欣喜更不必说。李性全就同元茂、聘才到上头去道了喜。少顷，士燮回家，有些同僚亲友陆续而来，一连忙了几日。便接着李先生赴任日期，士燮又与先生饯行。到动身那一日，子玉同了元茂、聘才直送出城外三十五里，到宿店住下。性全嘱咐他一番，又教训了元茂几句道：「庾香年纪虽小于你，学问却做",en:"pleased at this news; he went with Mei Jin inside to report it to Lady Yan, whose delight goes without saying. Li Xingquan, together with Yuanmao and Pincai, went upstairs to offer their congratulations. Before long, Shixie returned home; colleagues and relatives and friends came calling one after another, and they were kept busy for several days on end. Then came the date"},{paragraph:5,mentions:1,tokens:["性全"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"颜仲清帮同亮功押了回来，士燮备酒相待。是日不请外客，就请聘才、元茂相陪。这李元茂今日福至心灵，说话竟清楚起来。性全出京时留下二百两银子与他，元茂买了几件衣裳，混身光亮。亮功眼力本是平常，今见了元茂团头大脸，书气满容，便许为佳士，大有余润之意，便问起他的姻事来。仲清早已看明，便竭力赞扬。李元茂不知就里，乐得了不得，心里着实感激仲清。且按下这边。",en:"Yuanmao had, at this auspicious moment, achieved a sudden clarity of mind — his speech became quite articulate. When Xingquan left the capital, he had left two hundred taels of silver for Yuanmao; Yuanmao purchased several items of clothing and was now presentable from head to toe. Lianggong's discernment was ordinarily rather limited, but now, seeing Yuanmao's broad face and"}],39:[{paragraph:1,mentions:1,tokens:["李性全"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"话说王恂前日不能赴怡园之约，因为孙亮功请去商办喜事，也替他张罗了几天。定于二月初十日招赘，也不多几天了。新年李性全寄了几百两银子来与元茂，并写个禀帖与王文辉，要替他儿子办喜事。王文辉不耐烦作媒，俱令王恂代劳。李元茂求着了魏聘才，求其代制一切。魏聘才闹了一个多月，花的，输的，丢了好些银钱，窃案又未能破，心上也有些烦闷起来，不得主意。今见李元茂来求他，当日原是他与王",en:"matter. The ceremony was set for the tenth day of the second month, which was not many days off. At the New Year, Li Xingquan had sent several hundred taels of silver to Yuanmao, along with a letter to Wang Wenhui asking him to arrange his son's marriage. Wang Wenhui had no patience for matchmaking and delegated everything to Wang Xun. Li Yuanmao then sought out Wei Pincai"}]},"char-21":JSON.parse(`{"2":[{"paragraph":24,"mentions":2,"tokens":["孙嗣徽","嗣徽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"己房中吃了饭，与其妻室蓉华讲了些话，来到王恂书斋，恰值王恂才回。刚说得一两句话，有王恂两个内舅前来看望：一个叫孙嗣徽，一个叫孙嗣元，本是王文辉同乡同年孙亮功部郎之子。这嗣徽、嗣元两个，真所谓难兄难弟。","en":"had barely exchanged a few words when two of Wang Xun's brothers-in-law arrived to pay a visit. One was named Sun Sihui, the other Sun Siyuan, both sons of Ministry Director Sun Lianggong, a fellow provincial and examination graduate of Wang Wenhui. These two brothers were truly a matched pair of ineptitude."},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":1,"tokens":["嗣徽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"将他们的外貌内才比起王恂来，真有天渊之隔。这嗣徽生得缩颈堆腮，脸色倒还白净，就是肺火太重，一年四季总是满脸的红疙瘩，已堆得面无余地，而鼻上更多，已变了一个红鼻子。","en":"physical appearance and intellectual capacity, the difference was as vast as that between heaven and the abyss. Sihui possessed a hunched neck and bulging cheeks, his complexion passably fair were it not marred by a severe excess of internal heat. Year-round, his face was blanketed in a dense crop of red pustules, leaving virtually no skin untouched, with the affliction"},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":1,"tokens":["虫蛀千字文"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"念完，文理实在欠通，却又酷好掉文，满口之乎者也，腐气可掏。有个苏州拔贡生高品，与他相熟，送他两个诨名：一个是「虫蛀千字文」。又因他那个红鼻子，有时擦得放光透亮，又叫做「起阳狗肾」。乃弟嗣元，生得枭唇露齿，又是个吊眼皮，右边一只眼睛高高吊起，像是朱笔圈了半圈。文理与乃兄不相上下，却喜批评乃兄的不通。又犯了口吃的毛病，有时议论起来，期期艾艾，愈着急愈说不清楚。高品也送他一","en":"licentiate from Suzhou well-acquainted with him, had bestowed upon him two derogatory monikers: one was \\"Worm-Eaten Thousand Character Classic.\\" Because of his inflamed nose, which sometimes shone with a greasy luster, he was also dubbed \\"The Aroused Dog Penis.\\" His younger brother, Siyuan, was afflicted with an owl-like beak and protruding teeth, coupled with drooping eyelids, his right eye"},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":2,"tokens":["嗣徽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"是日来到王宅，适文辉请客，客将到了。王恂即同他到书房内来。仲清躲避不及，只得见了，同王恂陪着坐下。嗣徽先对仲清说道；今日天朗气清，所以愚兄弟正其衣冠，翩然而来奉看的。」王恂、仲清忍不住要笑。嗣徽又对王恂说道：「适值尊驾出门，不知去向，若不是「鸟倦飞而知还」，则虽引弓而射之，亦徒兴弋人之慕矣。」仲清正要回言，那嗣元道：","en":"Unable to avoid them, Zhongqing politely exchanged greetings and sat down beside Wang Xun to keep them company. Sihui initiated the conversation, addressing Zhongqing pompously, \\"Today the heavens are clear and the air is crisp, thus my brother and I have straightened our garments and drifted hither to pay our respects.\\" Wang Xun and Zhongqing struggled to suppress"},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":4,"tokens":["嗣徽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「哥、哥、哥你这句话说、说错了，怎么把鸟来比起人来，你、你、你还要将箭射、射、射他，那就更岂有此理了。」嗣徽道：「老二，你到底腹中空空如也，不知运化书卷之妙。这是我腹笥便便，不啻若自其口出。这句「鸟倦飞而知还」，是出在《古文观止》上的。若说鸟不可以比人，那《大学》上为什么说「可以人而不如鸟乎」呢？」仲清暗笑道：天下也有这样蠢材，便道：「大哥的鸟论极通，岂特","en":"c-c-compare a bird to a human, and furthermore, you w-w-wish to shoot an arrow at him? That is simply p-p-preposterous.\\" Sihui retorted disdainfully, \\"Number Two, your mind is a hollow void, utterly devoid of the subtle alchemy of scholarship. This flows effortlessly from my profound erudition, tumbling spontaneously from my lips. This phrase, 'the weary bird knows to return,'"},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":1,"tokens":["嗣徽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"是：「先生将何之。」家兄就、就、就将「牛何之」做了起头。先、先生拿笔叉、叉、叉了几叉，痛骂了一顿。」这一番说得嗣徽羞忿难耐，便在屋子里乱踱起来，说道：「屁话，屁话！」便起身告辞。王恂也恐他们弟兄斗气，不便挽留，同仲清送了出来。","en":"t-t-teacher aggressively crossed it out with his brush and delivered a scathing reprimand.\\" This recounting left Sihui so overwhelmed with shame and fury that he began pacing wildly around the room, sputtering, \\"Bullshit! Bullshit!\\" before storming out to take his leave. Wang Xun, fearing their sibling rivalry might escalate unpleasantly, deemed it unwise to insist they"},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":1,"tokens":["嗣徽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"说话，适值王桂保进来，见了亮功并王恂、仲清，也站在一边。亮功看看桂保，对他儿子说道：「你们回去，不要说什么。」嗣徽兄弟会意答应，于是亮功即拉了桂保进去。","en":"Lianggong glanced at Guibao before instructing his sons, \\"Return home immediately, and utter not a single word.\\" Sihui and his brother, understanding the implication, voiced their assent. Lianggong then took Guibao by the arm and led him inside."}],"4":[{"paragraph":25,"mentions":4,"tokens":["孙嗣徽","嗣徽","虫蛀千字文"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"王恂看是孙嗣徽，两车相对，王恂问道：「你往那里去？」嗣徽道：「只因家父夫妻反目，噬肤灭鼻，几几乎血流漂杵。有一王大夫，以人治人，有以去其旧染之污，睨而视之，曰无伤也。今病小愈，不能不绥之斯来耳。」王恂笑了一笑道：「我回来就来的。」嗣徽应了，匆匆而去。仲清道：「此君","en":"Wang Xun looked and saw it was Sun Sihui. The two carriages drew up face to face. Wang Xun asked, \\"Where are you headed?\\" Sihui replied, \\"Owing to the fact that my father and his wife have been at cross purposes—consuming and obliterating, with blood nearly flowing in rivers—a physician surnamed"}],"6":[{"paragraph":5,"mentions":2,"tokens":["嗣徽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一个，名叫佩秋，生得德容兼备，爱若掌珠，十八岁嫁与王家去了。还有个白头的大姑娘，是不能嫁人的，新年已二十九岁。嗣徽二十六，嗣元二十四，这两个废物，都已娶了亲。嗣徽娶的沈氏，是国子监司业沈恭之女，名字叫做芸姑。生得齐齐整整，伶俐聪明，嫁了过来，见了那样丈夫，便想自寻短见，被他的丫鬟苦劝，只得自己怨命。后来回了娘家，不肯过来。","en":"eldest daughter, her hair prematurely white, destined to remain unwed; this New Year marked her twenty-ninth year. Sihui, at twenty-six, and Siyuan, at twenty-four, were two thoroughly useless men who had nonetheless both taken wives. Sihui had married Miss Shen, named Yungu, daughter of the Imperial College Director Shen Gong. Neat, clever, and endearing, she was driven"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":3,"tokens":["嗣徽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"那位司业公，是个古板道学人，将女儿教训了一顿，送了过来。这沈姑娘实在无法，又遇嗣徽淫欲无度，那个红鼻子常在他脸上擦来擦去，闹得沈姑娘肉麻难忍，后来只得将一个陪房的大丫头，叫嗣徽收了。这丫头名叫松儿，生得板门似的一扇八寸长的脚，人倒极风骚的，嗣徽本先偷上了几次，试用过他那件器物，倒是个好材料，便爱如珍宝，竟有专房之宠。这沈姑娘如何还","en":"stern lecture, he sent his daughter back. Miss Shen was truly driven to her wit's end. Adding to her misery was Sihui's boundless lust; he would constantly rub his red nose against her face, provoking a revulsion she could scarcely endure. Ultimately, she was forced to surrender her personal dowry maid to him. This maid, named Song'er, possessed feet a full eight inches"},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":1,"tokens":["虫蛀千字文"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"咽，不过看着裙带上的情分罢了。」说得众人大笑。高品道：「最好，最好，我们今日就并在一处，为什么食不下咽？有了「虫蛀千字文」，「叠韵双声谱」，还胜如《汉书》下酒呢。」史南湘道：「怕什么？搬过来，搬过来！正席上有许多老前辈在那里，巴老三想必也不动手的。」王恂只得叫将那边两桌，就搬过这边，一同坐下，南湘道：「庾香，你今日就看见好戏好人了，你才信我不是言过其实呢。」子玉笑道：","en":"\\"Excellent! Excellent! Let us all sit together today—why should anyone lose their appetite? With the 'Worm-Eaten Thousand Character Classic' and the 'Rhyme-and-Alliteration Compendium' among us, it beats using the History of the Former Han as a relish for our wine!\\" Shi Nanxiang said, \\"What is there to fear? Bring them over! Bring them over! With so many venerable elders at the main tables,"},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":5,"tokens":["嗣徽","孙嗣徽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"只见王家的家人报导：「孙少爷到。」嗣徽昆仲先到正席上见了礼，然后上楼，众人都笑面相迎。嗣徽举眼一望，见了许多人，便作了一个公揖。见了高品、沈伯才，心中甚是吃惊，暗道：「偏偏今日运气不佳，遇见了这两个冤家。」嗣元见了巴霖，也觉心跳，也与众人见了礼，巴霖勉勉强强，作了半个揖。楼上分了四桌。刘","en":"Just then, the Wang household servant announced, \\"The young Sun masters have arrived.\\" Sihui and his brother first offered their respects at the main tables before ascending the stairs, welcomed by forced smiles from the crowd. Sweeping his gaze across the room, Sihui offered a general bow. Catching sight of Gao Pin and Shen Bocai, alarm gripped"},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":3,"tokens":["嗣徽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"高品对着沈伯才笑道：「天下又红又光的，是什么东西，不准说好的，要说顶脏的东西。」伯才已明白是说嗣徽的鼻子，便笑道：「你且说一个样子来。」高品道：「我说：红而光，腊尽春回狗起阳。」众人忍不住一笑。嗣徽明白，瞪了高品一眼，道：「恶用是硎硎者为哉？鸡鸣狗吠相闻，而达乎四境。」众人又笑。沈伯才笑道：「我也有一句：红而光，屎急肛门脱痔疮。」众人恐正席上听见","en":"offer an elegant answer—only the most vulgar thing you can imagine.\\" Bocai instantly understood the allusion to Sihui's nose and smiled, \\"Give me an example first.\\" Gao Pin replied, \\"I'll say: Red and shiny—the year ends, spring returns, and a dog's lust awakens.\\" The group struggled to suppress their laughter. Sihui, catching the insult, glared at Gao Pin and retorted,"}],"8":[{"paragraph":6,"mentions":1,"tokens":["孙嗣徽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"前请了安，又照应了聘才，对着元茂也弯了弯腰。元茂擦擦眼睛，聚起了眼光，把那相公一看，原来是前日在会馆里唱戏的，孙嗣徽极口称赞他。那相公便靠着张仲雨坐了，仲雨却冷冷的。聘才问仲雨道：","en":"focused his gaze, and realized it was the same performer he had seen at the guild hall days earlier—the very one Sun Sihui had praised so extravagantly. The performer seated himself beside Zhang Zhongyu, though Zhongyu's demeanor remained icy. Pincai turned to Zhongyu and asked:"},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":4,"tokens":["嗣徽","孙嗣徽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"：「孙大少爷也在这里，方才走出去。」聘才一想。知他认得这些相公，便说道：「你去请孙大少爷进来。」四儿忙赶出去，嗣徽尚在柜上说话，也带着一个相公，那相公先上车走了。嗣徽也认不清四儿，听得有人请他，便又进来，方知是元茂、聘才，见了二喜、保珠，笑道：「今日二公，何其乐也。「元茂、聘才作了揖，二喜、保珠请了安，复又坐将下来。聘才就将元茂今日丢了银子，此时没有开发，许明日","en":"rushed in and announced, \\"Young Master Sun is here! He just stepped out.\\" Pincai saw an immediate lifeline. Knowing Sihui was familiar with these performers, he ordered, \\"Go quickly and invite him in!\\" Si'er hurried out. Sihui was still at the counter, chatting with a performer who had just boarded a carriage to leave. Though he barely recognized Si'er, hearing someone"},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":5,"tokens":["嗣徽","孙嗣徽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"嗣徽听了心里一惊，便道：「余力不能举百钧，任重而道远，恐难担也。」聘才只得又再三央求，嗣徽勉强答应，说道：「明日可以与则与之，人而无信，不知其可也。」即对二喜、保珠道：「来，余与尔言，盍去诸？明日亲送之门，毋逼人太甚也。」两个相公不能明白，嗣徽只得说了几","en":"Hearing this, Sihui feigned profound shock and quoted dramatically, \\"'One whose strength cannot lift a hundred jun cannot bear a heavy burden on a long road'—I fear I am unequal to the task!\\" Pincai pleaded with him at length until Sihui finally, reluctantly, agreed. \\"What"}],"18":[{"paragraph":8,"mentions":1,"tokens":["孙嗣徽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"乏了，要去就去。」于是二人同了出来，到了戏园拣个地方坐下。看了两三出戏，也有些相公陪着说话。远远望见李元茂同着孙嗣徽，在对面楼下。聘才过去，讲了几句话，又过来。","en":"with them. Across the way, on the lower level of the opposite gallery, Pincai spotted Li Yuanmao together with Sun Sihui. Pincai went over, exchanged a few words, and came back."},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":5,"tokens":["嗣徽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"了账同了出来，说道：「老弟，你进城罢。我还有事，不得奉陪。」说罢，拱拱手去了。其时天气尚早，一路行来，远远望见嗣徽、元茂两人在前转弯去了。聘才想道：「他们到何处去？」便悄悄的跟了来。到一条小胡衕，只见闲人塞满，都在人家门口瞧。聘才曾听得人说，有个东园是婊子聚会之处，便也随着众人，站住望将进去。见那一家是茅茨土墙，里头有两间草屋。又见嗣徽、元茂就在他前头站立。望着","en":"you company.\\" With that, he bowed and departed. It was still early. As Pincai walked along the way, he spotted Sihui and Yuanmao in the distance, just rounding a corner ahead. Pincai thought: \\"Where are they going?\\" and quietly followed. He entered a small alleyway packed with idle onlookers, all crowded at someone's doorway peering in. Pincai had heard people say"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":4,"tokens":["孙嗣徽","嗣徽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"面唱，其声凄惨，唱得聘才流下泪来，想道：「这人倒是个钟情人，历诉生平受尽难苦，不知那个负心人何处去了。」只听得孙嗣徽道：「阿哟不好了，我身上的东西竟是空空如也，可恶！可恶！」蹬着脚，叹一口气道：「咳！君子无故，玉不去身，他竟卷而怀之。我以后便如丧不佩起来，看他便能奈我何！」元茂道：「京中这剪绺的实在可恨。我去年拿了家父十两银子与魏老聘去看戏，到戏园子门口，绊了一交","en":"feeling. As she recounts her whole life's suffering, I wonder where that heartless man has gone.\\" Then he heard Sun Sihui say: \\"Alas, alas. The things on my body are now completely empty. How vexing! How vexing!\\" He stamped his foot and sighed: \\"Ha! A gentleman has no cause to remove his jade from his person, yet it has been rolled up and carried away in his bosom. From"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":1,"tokens":["嗣徽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"嗣徽道：「美哉，美哉！价廉而工省。明日我与汝姑一试之，若迟迟吾行，恐为捷足先得，则虽悔莫追矣。只要其乐陶陶，又何论十目所视。」聘才听他仍是咬文嚼字，满口胡柴，忍住笑，只好由他罢了。到了路口，各人分路。聘才听得后面车声磷磷，直走过去，聘才连忙让开，只见坐在","en":"Sihui said: \\"Splendid, splendid! Cheap in price and little work required. Tomorrow I shall take you along and give it a try, cousin. If we delay our journey, the nimble-footed may get there first, and though we repent it will be too late. As long as one finds"}],"23":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":2,"tokens":["孙嗣徽","嗣徽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"烟钱铺内，换了十张票子，元茂一张张的点清了装在槟榔口袋里，挂在衫子衿上。候不到吃饭，即带了王保出门，去找他阿舅孙嗣徽。恰值嗣徽不在家，嗣元请进，谈了一回，留他吃了便饭。元茂与嗣元是不大讲得来的，又因嗣元常要驳他的说话，所以就坐了不长久，辞了嗣元，信步行去，心里忘不了前次那个弹琵琶的妇人。","en":"lapel of his robe. Unable even to wait for a meal, he immediately took Wang Bao and went out to seek his uncle, Sun Sihui. As it happened, Sihui was not at home; Siyuan invited him in, they conversed for a while, and Siyuan kept him for a simple meal. Yuanmao and Siyuan had never much seen eye to eye, and since Siyuan frequently contradicted him, Yuanmao did not linger"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":1,"tokens":["孙嗣徽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"且说孙嗣徽今日出门是找他一个亲戚，系姑表妻舅，姓姬叫作亮轩，江苏常州府金匮县人，向办刑钱，屡食重聘，因其品行不端，以致闻风畏惕。且学问平常，专靠巴结，因声名传开了，近省地方竟弄不出个馆地来。只得带了些银钱货物进京，希图结交显宦，弄个大馆出来。于孙亮功谊有葭莩，","en":"Meanwhile, Sun Sihui had gone out that day to seek a relative, a cousin-in-law named Ji Liangxuan, a native of Jinkui County in Changzhou Prefecture, Jiangsu. Ji had long worked as a legal and financial secretary, earning hefty salaries, but due to his unsavory character,"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":1,"tokens":["孙嗣徽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这日孙嗣徽请他吃饭听戏，先听了凤台班的戏，带了凤林，拣了个馆子，进雅座坐了。这姬先生倒有一个俊俏的跟班，年纪约十五六岁，是徽州人，在剃头铺里学徒弟的，叫作巴老英。","en":"On this day, Sun Sihui invited him to dine and listen to an opera. First, they enjoyed a performance by the Fengtai Troupe, then brought along the actor Fenglin, chose a restaurant, and settled into a private elegant room. This Mr. Ji was accompanied by a rather handsome young"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":2,"tokens":["嗣徽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"亮轩见其眉目清俊，以青蚨十千买得，改名英官，打扮起来也还好看。日间是主仆称呼，晚间为妻妾侍奉。当下嗣徽见了也觉垂涎。二人点了菜，凤林敬了几杯酒，那巴英官似气忿忿的站在后面。凤林最伶透，便知他是个卯君，忙招呼了他，问了姓，叫了几声巴二爷，方才踱了出去，姬亮轩才放了心。如今见了京中小旦，觉比外省的好了几倍：第一是款式好，第二是衣服好，第三是应酬好，说话好","en":"By day they maintained the guise of master and servant, but by night he served as a concubine. Upon seeing him, Sihui could not help but drool with desire. The two ordered dishes, and Fenglin offered a few toasts of wine. Ba Yingguan stood behind them, seemingly brimming with resentful anger. Fenglin, being exceptionally perceptive, realized the boy was a fellow practitioner"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":1,"tokens":["嗣徽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"譬如此刻夏天，便是一件衫子，戴上凉帽，进到衙门来一群的三四个，最不肯一人独来，开发随便一两二两皆可。」嗣徽道：「这么便宜！若是一个进来，我便逾东家墙而搂之可乎？」","en":"four—they absolutely refuse to come alone. Their fee is casually set at one or two taels, any amount will do.\\" Sihui said, \\"So cheap! If one came alone, could I then scale the host's wall and embrace him?\\""},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":2,"tokens":["嗣徽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"亮轩笑道：「妹丈取笑了，东家的墙岂可逾得？就太晚了，二更三更，宅门也还叫得开的。」嗣徽道：「三更叫门，大惊小怪的，到底有些不便。你何不开个后门倒便当些，人不能测度的。」亮轩即正正经经的讲道：「妹丈真真是个趣人，取笑得岂有此理。我们作朋友的，第一讲究是品行，这后门要堵得紧紧的，一个屁都放不出来了，才使东家放心呢。」嗣徽尚是不懂，连问何故","en":"Even if it is quite late, the second or third watch of the night, the mansion gates can still be called open.\\" Sihui replied, \\"Calling at the gates during the third watch causes such a fuss and commotion; it remains rather inconvenient. Why not open a back door? It would be far more convenient, and no one would be the wiser.\\" Liangxuan, speaking with solemn earnestness,"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":6,"tokens":["嗣徽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"荐出去的，或到半年三月又回来了。到得徒弟孝敬老师，一世能碰见几个？真不如你们作相公的好了。」说着自己也就大笑。嗣徽看这凤林道：「凤凰于飞，于彼中林，亦既见止，我心则喜焉。」凤林笑道：「你又通文了，我们班子里，倒也用得着你。那个撂着鼻子秃秃秃狗才狗才的，倒绝像是你，何必这么满口之乎者也，知道你念过书就是了。」亮轩笑道：「此是孙少爷的书香本色。若是我们作师爷的，二位","en":"respect to their master? It truly cannot compare to you young gentlemen!\\" Saying this, he burst into laughter. Sihui looked at Fenglin and quoted awkwardly: \\"'The phoenixes fly together, resting in that central forest. Seeing him, my heart is filled with joy.'\\" Fenglin laughed, \\"You're showing off your literary flair again! In our troupe, we could certainly use you."},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":1,"tokens":["嗣徽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这一句说到亮轩心上来，便笑道：「这小童倒也亏他，驴子、小妾两样，他都作全了。」嗣徽道：「奇哉！什么叫作驴子、小妾？吾愿闻其详。」亮轩道：「我今只用他一个跟班，譬如你住西城，我住南城，若有话商量，我必要从城根下骑了驴子过来。有了他，便写一信，叫他送给官，便代了步，不算驴子么？我们作客的人，日里各处散散，也挨过去了。晚间一人独宿，实在","en":"he smiled: \\"I must give credit to this little boy. He perfectly fulfills two roles: both donkey and concubine.\\" Sihui exclaimed, \\"How extraordinary! What do you mean by donkey and concubine? I wish to hear the details.\\" Liangxuan explained, \\"Right now, I employ him purely as a servant. For example, if you live in the West City and I in the South City, and we need to"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":4,"tokens":["嗣徽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"嗣徽道：「这件事，愿学焉。绥之斯来，盎于背，将入门，则茅塞之矣，如之何则可。而国人皆曰：若大路然。吾斯之未能信，明以教我，请尝试之。」凤林不晓得他说些什么，便送了一杯酒，又暗数他脸上的疙瘩，及鼻子上的红糟点儿，共有三十余处，问道：「你到底说话叫人明白才好","en":"Sihui replied, \\"This matter, I wish to learn of it. Comforting him when he comes, nourishing his back; upon entering the door, the mind is suddenly enlightened. How should one proceed? And all the countrymen say: it is like a great road. I cannot yet believe"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":6,"tokens":["嗣徽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"凤林把嗣徽脸上，轻轻的打了一掌，两个眼瞪瞪儿的说道：「人家嫌你这红鼻子，我倒爱他。」索性把嗣徽的脸捧了乱擦，跳下来笑道：「也算打了个手铳罢。嗣徽赶过来，要拧他的嘴，凤林跑出屋子，嗣徽赶出去，凤林又进来了，嗣徽便狠起那斑斑驳驳的面皮道：「你若到我手，我决不放你起","en":"Fenglin lightly slapped Sihui's face, glaring at him with wide eyes, \\"Others may despise this red nose of yours, but I quite love it.\\" He then boldly grabbed Sihui's face and rubbed it vigorously, jumped down, and laughed, \\"Consider that a hand-job!\\" Sihui chased after him, intent"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":2,"tokens":["嗣徽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"凤林又敬了亮轩几杯，那个巴英官红着脸，在廊下走来走去。姬亮轩叫他来装烟，他也不理，又去了。嗣徽见了说道：「大哥，方才小弟要请教你的话，我只知泌水洋洋，可以乐饥。至于蒸豚之味，未曾尝过，不识其中之妙，到底有甚好处，与妻子好合如何？」亮轩笑道：「据我想来，原是各有好处，但人人常说男便于女。」嗣徽道：「你且把其中之妙谈谈，使我也豁然贯通。」亮轩笑道","en":"Ji Liangxuan called him in to prepare the tobacco pipe, but he ignored him and walked away again. Seeing this, Sihui said, \\"Elder brother, earlier I wished to ask for your instruction. I only know that the vast, flowing waters of the Mi River can soothe hunger. As for the taste of steamed piglet, I have yet to taste it, nor do I comprehend its subtle wonders. What"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":4,"tokens":["嗣徽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"道：「你这个赶车的，实在讲得透彻。你那辆车是什么车？像是辆河南篷子车。罚你三杯酒，不准说了，说得人这么寒嘇。」嗣徽道：「快哉，快哉！竟是闻所未闻。小弟船倒天天坐的，车却总坐不进。到了门口，竟非人力可通，又恐坐着了粪车，则人皆掩鼻而过矣。」亮轩笑道：「也有个法子，就是粪车，也可坐得的。大木耳一个，水泡软了，拿来作你的帽子，又作车里的垫子，那管粪车，也就坐得了。」嗣","en":"wagon. I fine you three cups of wine—you are forbidden from speaking further! You speak with such vulgarity.\\" Sihui exclaimed, \\"Splendid, splendid! Truly unheard of! I ride the boat every day, but I can never manage to board the cart. Upon reaching the gate, it seems beyond human strength to pass through; and I fear that if I sit in a dung cart, people will cover"}],"24":[{"paragraph":4,"mentions":1,"tokens":["虫蛀千字文"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"仲清道：「虫蛀千字文」要给他吃碗墨水，才好免得随口胡言。」王恂道：「李元茂吃什么呢？」仲清笑道：「李元茂颟颟顸顸，七窍闭塞，要吃大黄、芒硝，方才打得通他这些浊污。」王恂又问仲雨，仲清答道：「在可善可恶之间，尚识好人，天良未昧。」二人刚说得有趣，忽见李玉林同着桂保来，见过","en":"Zhongqing said, \\"That worm-eaten 'Thousand-Character Classic' needs to be force-fed a bowl of ink to stop his loose talk.\\" Wang Xun asked what remedy Li Yuanmao should be prescribed. Zhongqing laughed, \\"Yuanmao is so profoundly dull that all seven of his orifices are blocked tight. He needs a heavy dose of rhubarb and mirabilite to purge the muck from his system.\\" Wang Xun then asked about Zhongyu. Zhongqing replied, \\"He hovers somewhere between good and ill. He still recognizes decent folk, so his conscience isn't entirely dead.\\" As they bantered, Li Yulin arrived with Guibao; after exchanging greetings, they took their seats. Zhongqing asked, \\"We haven't seen you for two days. Have you been busy at home?\\" Wang Xun added, \\"I go out often, yet I never seem to run into you.\\" Guibao explained, \\"We've been rehearsing new plays over at the Garden of Contentment.\\" When Zhongqing asked which ones, Yulin replied, \\"The sixth of the sixth month is the Lotus Birthday, and Young Master Hua plans to tour the garden. Since Duxiang knows he loves the opera, he consulted Jingyi. Jingyi said that Young Master Hua has already heard all the ordinary plays, and no troupe could possibly surpass his own Eight Ages company. Therefore, it would be better to pick the brightest stars from several different companies, assemble them into one grand cast, and compose entirely fresh pieces. It will be unlike anything outside ears have ever heard—altogether new.\\" Zhongqing nodded approvingly, \\"That sounds wonderful. But what plays have they chosen?\\" Yulin said, \\"Once, the scholar Mao Shengshan listed several titles in his commentary on 'Story of the Pipa'—a collection he called 'Stone to Mend Heaven'—which had never been set to music.\\""}],"39":[{"paragraph":6,"mentions":2,"tokens":["嗣徽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"元茂与新娘拜了花烛，送入新房，坐床撒帐，饮了交杯，复又请新郎上席，坐了华筵。那嗣徽、嗣元陪了一回，王恂、仲清即要移席到新房中畅饮。大家进了新房，仲清道：「今日可以看新人的。」便要走到床前。床前本有两个伴送的老妇人，还有两个小丫鬟侍立。嗣元恐怕仲清看了他的姐姐，便跑到床前把帐门把住，口内连说了几个「看」字，然后挣出「不得」两字，惹得","en":"curtains, drank from the crossed cups, and then the groom was called back out to sit at the great banquet table. Sihui and Siyuan kept them company for a while, until Wang Xun and Zhongqing proposed moving the party into the bridal chamber to drink more freely. Everyone filed into the bridal chamber. Zhongqing said, \\"Tonight we get to look at the new bride,\\" and made"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":2,"tokens":["孙嗣徽","嗣徽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"。」聘才道：「什么贵恙？」亮轩道：「听得腿上生了疖子，所以不出来。」这一席却分了三路，子玉、仲清、王恂是一路，孙嗣徽兄弟是一路，聘才、亮轩又是一路，故此不能热闹。王恂作人素来和蔼，见同席都不能接洽，勉强要和合起来。此刻在新房里坐位乱坐的，无有推让。聘才与亮轩坐了一面，仲清与子玉坐了一面，元茂在上首独坐了一面，王恂与嗣徽坐在下首。","en":"with Ziyu, whom he eyed with private admiration: \\"This young master Mei is a fine-looking man. Set beside that Sun Sihui, who might be Cen Peng or Ma Wu straight off the stage.\\" Pincai asked Ji Liangxuan, \\"I haven't seen your master come out in days, what's he doing at home?\\" Liangxuan said, \\"My master has been indisposed these past couple of days and hasn't been able"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":2,"tokens":["嗣徽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"正是」。子玉微笑。元茂道：「我非但算不得清，而且也听不清，真是葫芦牵倒扁豆藤。」聘才笑道：「忙中遇着腿缠筋。」嗣徽道：「亲亲也，凡有血气者莫不尊亲。亲亲人也，仁者人也。」嗣元听了乃兄开口，就要驳起来，道：「这话、话，不、不通，你、你说凡有血、血、血气者，莫不、不、不尊亲，都、都、都是你、你的亲，我、我、我想就、就、就只有螃、螃、螃蟹没有、有、血，甲、甲、甲鱼还、","en":"Pincai laughed and said, \\"And in the middle of it all you run into a man with his legs all wrapped in creepers.\\" Sihui said, \\"Kin love is the way of kin, whosoever has blood and breath cannot but honor his kin. To love one's kin is humanity; humanity is humanity itself.\\" Siyuan, hearing his elder brother open his mouth, immediately set about refuting him. \\"Th-th-that"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":2,"tokens":["嗣徽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"亲戚么？」龙王大惊道：「快些放他去罢，不然他要与我攀亲了，不要攀出蛤蟆亲戚来。」说得聘才、王恂、子玉几乎笑倒。嗣徽与亮轩知道是骂他们，因回答不出来，只好忍气。嗣元见骂了他们，倒反笑起来，道：「好、好个王八亲戚，好、好个蛤蟆亲、亲、亲戚。」王恂道：「我也有个笑话。一个妓女是个瞎子，有人去嫖他，他虽看不见，却分得人的等次来。那一天接了三个客，老鸨问他道：「姑娘，你猜","en":"no desire for a toad as a cousin.\\"' At this, Pincai, Wang Xun, and Ziyu nearly fell off their seats laughing. Sihui and Liangxuan, knowing themselves to be the butt of the joke and having no reply, had to swallow their indignation. Siyuan, however, seeing those two mocked, laughed all the louder. \\"A f-f-fine turtle kinsman!\\" he cried. \\"A f-f-fine toad r-r-relation!\\""},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":1,"tokens":["嗣徽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"菜碗，吓得众人面面相觑。嗣元见姐姐骂了，即跳起身来，也帮着乱骂。大家无趣，急忙起身走了出来，急急的各散。元茂、嗣徽也难收罗，只得送出，看上车而回。","en":"everyone scrambled to their feet and hurried out, going their separate ways as fast as they could. Yuanmao and Sihui were left with no way to rein things in and could only see the departing guests to their carriages before going back inside."},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":1,"tokens":["嗣徽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"问，没有去。又各处找寻，找到了聘才处，找着了。元茂尚不肯回去，聘才力劝，方同了来人回家，犹不肯进房，在书房中同嗣徽说闲话。晚间亮功回来，即说了元茂几句，陆夫人也责备了元茂一番，然究竟心上有些对不住元茂，半说半劝的叫他进房。元茂也没奈何，只得进去，心上犹记着那天的模样，总不能高兴。","en":"with the messenger, though he still would not go into the inner chambers and sat in the study chatting idly with Sihui instead. When Lianggong returned that evening he gave Yuanmao a talking-to, and Madam Lu reproved him as well, though at heart she felt they had somewhat wronged Yuanmao, and between scolding and coaxing persuaded him to go in. Yuanmao had no choice"}],"50":[{"paragraph":28,"mentions":1,"tokens":["孙嗣徽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"聘才出京之日，唐和尚直送到十里长亭，洒泪而别。聘才回家接了父母，同往湖北，后来书中就没有他的事了。要叙李元茂、孙嗣徽在通州小考，闹了一个小小的笑话，且俟下回分解。","en":"From this point on, the book has no further business with his affairs. The narrative now turns to Li Yuanmao and Sun Sihui taking their preliminary examinations in Tongzhou, where a small, comical mishap unfolds. But to know the details, you must await the next chapter."}],"51":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":4,"tokens":["孙嗣徽","嗣徽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"昆仲都冒了顺天籍贯，府县考过了，到通州院考，租了寓，进了场。元茂遇见了旧日窗稿，是先生改好的，便直笔而抄之。这孙嗣徽如何会做文章？遇见一个同窗朋友，是个廪生，托其代请枪手。那人与他请了一个人，讲定了八十两银子，写了契约。在场内与孙嗣徽枪了两文一诗。这个嗣元自己又不能作文，又没有雇着枪手。不得已在卷子上一阵乱写，不知写了一篇什么东西。发案之日，嗣徽、元茂竟进了。覆了","en":"across one of his old essay drafts, previously corrected by his teacher, and copied it verbatim. But what did Sun Sihui know of writing prose? He encountered a schoolmate, a stipend student, and commissioned him to hire a ghostwriter. They agreed upon eighty taels of silver and drew up a contract. Inside the hall, this hired hand produced two essays and one poem for Sun"},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":2,"tokens":["嗣徽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"元茂、嗣徽看了，也不知嗣元卷子上写了什么，嗣徽倒暗暗喜欢，与元茂进去叩见宗师。宗师见了元茂，倒也没有讲话。","en":"Yuanmao and Sihui, entirely ignorant of what Siyuan had written on his scroll, read the placard in confusion. Sihui secretly rejoiced and went in with Yuanmao to pay respects to the examiner. The examiner saw Yuanmao but offered no comment."},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":2,"tokens":["孙嗣徽","嗣徽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"孙嗣徽穿了蓝衫皂靴，把那个红糟脸擦得光亮，大摇大摆，踱上前去。宗师见了，觉得他与诸人不同，甚是可笑。见他名字与孙嗣元像是弟兄，使问道：「有个孙嗣元是你兄弟么？」嗣徽道：「是门生舍弟。」文宗笑道：「你兄弟有什么毛病么？」","en":"Sun Sihui, clad in a blue scholar's robe and black boots, had scrubbed his wine-mottled face until it gleamed. With an exaggerated swagger, he stepped forward. The examiner found his appearance starkly different from the others and utterly comical. Noting that"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":4,"tokens":["嗣徽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"嗣徽随口答应道：「舍弟有个结巴的毛病，说话愈急愈说不出，此其一。左眼皮高吊起，时时要流眼泪，此其二。若到门生说话，他即要驳起来，此其三。」文宗听了，笑了一笑，诸生也要笑时，只得忍住。嗣徽得意洋洋的，把肩摆了一摆，自己看看脚上的皂靴。文宗正色问道：「你那兄","en":"Sihui glibly replied, \\"First, my younger brother suffers from a stammer; the more rushed he is, the less he can speak. Second, his left eyelid is drawn up, constantly watering. Third, whenever your disciple speaks, he insists on contradicting. These are his"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":3,"tokens":["嗣徽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"嗣徽上了马，元茂坐了车，一同回寓，嗣元被州官叫了去了。却又得了个喜信，亮功放了安徽凤阳府。嗣徽心中大喜，就想回家，等着下科再花些银子，找人枪一枪，就可以拔贡了，无奈为嗣元的文卷尚未问明，只得再待两天。元茂得了一个秀才，也就心满意足，如今又娶了亲，心中一无","en":"Sihui mounted a horse, Yuanmao took a carriage, and together they returned to their lodging, Siyuan having already been summoned by the prefectural official. Then came glad tidings: Lianggong had been appointed to Fengyang Prefecture in Anhui. Sihui was overjoyed"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":1,"tokens":["嗣徽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，两人并着走，见他胸前高高的两个乳，元茂鼻子望空嗅嗅，觉有些汗香，心上有几分爱他，却又不敢问他。同进了寓，只见嗣徽的房门也锁着，不见一个人，缝穷的便跟了进来，看他开了房门，便靠在房门上，望着房里。元茂在炕上找了个青缎小搭连，坐在房门口凳上，一五一十的数了四十大钱，递与缝穷的。缝穷的接了，笑道：「这钱太少，请高升些。」一手将钱望篮子里放了，笑嘻嘻的一脚跨进了房门，","en":"fondness blossomed in his heart, though he dared not make an overture. They entered the lodging together. Seeing Sihui's door locked and no one around, the mender followed him in. As he opened his door, she leaned casually against the frame, peering inside. Yuanmao found a small black satin purse on the kang, sat on a stool by the door, and carefully counted out forty"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":5,"tokens":["嗣徽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"恰好嗣徽回来，望望元茂的房门没有锁，把手一推，却是闩着，知道元茂在内，便叫了一声：「开门，青天白日关了门做什么？」元茂听了，吃了一惊，伏着不动。嗣徽又推了一推，元茂只得应道：「我肚子疼，要躺一会起来，不要来推门吵闹人。」嗣徽倒也不疑心，一移步间，踢着一样东西","en":"As chance would have it, Sihui returned just then. Seeing Yuanmao's door unpadlocked, he pushed it, only to find it bolted from the inside. Knowing Yuanmao was within, he called out, \\"Open the door! Why are you locked up in broad daylight?\\" Hearing this, Yuanmao was startled and froze,"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":7,"tokens":["嗣徽","孙嗣徽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"嗣徽看清，想撞破他，恐元茂脸上下不来。且看缝穷的生得少艾，便想要半路截留，便先到门口等他。那缝穷婆出来，嗣徽拦住了门，问道：「你方才在里头做什么？」那缝穷婆笑嘻嘻的扭着头，看嗣徽穿着芙蓉布汗衫，脚下是皂靴，知道是位老爷，说道：「方才有位爷们，叫我缝补小衣","en":"Sihui, having seen everything clearly, wanted to expose him, but feared causing Yuanmao too much embarrassment. Moreover, seeing that the mender was young and attractive, he decided to intercept her. He waited by the outer gate. When she emerged, Sihui blocked"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":4,"tokens":["嗣徽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"明日早饭后，嗣徽到门口望了几次，尚不见来。心里一想，有些下人在面前，不便行事，把几个家人尽行打发出门，叫他去探听嗣元消息与到远处去买物去了。知元茂是要睡中觉的，到他房门口望了一望，见元茂在炕上躺着，闭了眼，当他睡着了。急到门口来，见那缝穷婆已坐在门坎上。今日打扮得不","en":"The next morning, after breakfast, Sihui checked the gate several times, but she had not yet arrived. Thinking that the presence of servants would make his intended actions inconvenient, he dispatched all his retainers on various errands—some to inquire about Siyuan, others to buy goods far"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":4,"tokens":["嗣徽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"嗣徽低低的说道：「天气热，脱了衣服罢。」缝穷的点点头，便将衫子脱了。他脸上是被太阳晒黑的，身上倒还白净，凸出两个灰色奶头，嗣徽摸了两把。又叫他脱去小衣，缝穷的抿着嘴笑，不肯脱，嗣徽便解了的他的带子，替他脱了。请教到妙处，倒也光肥可玩。就是颜色不甚好看，像","en":"Sihui whispered, \\"It's hot. Take off your clothes.\\" The mender nodded and slipped off her blouse. Though her face was tanned dark by the sun, her body was quite fair, bearing two greyish nipples, which Sihui eagerly fondled. He then asked her to remove her"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":10,"tokens":["嗣徽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"且说那元茂并未睡着，嗣徽与他对面房，有人进来，岂有听不见的？况那缝穷婆今日穿了木底鞋，鞋内又衬了高底，七寸长的花鞋，今日变了五寸。虽轻轻的走，总有咭咯之声。嗣徽当元茂睡着了，也不防他，把全副的精神施出来，那张躺椅响得好不热闹。元茂轻轻地走到嗣徽房门口，侧着耳朵听去，那响声在","en":"Meanwhile, Yuanmao was not asleep at all. With Sihui in the room directly opposite, how could he fail to hear someone entering? Furthermore, the mender wore wooden-soled shoes today, with raised heels inside; her seven-inch shoes from yesterday had seemingly shrunk to five. Despite her light steps, the"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":4,"tokens":["嗣徽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"听得嗣徽笑道：「我倒问你，你怎么知道我是个老爷？难道昨日那人不是位老爷么？」缝穷婆道：「他不是老爷。」嗣徽暗喜，想道：「他必看出我龟头上那个黑斑，知是主贵的，待我问他。」又道：「我身有样主贵，你若说出来我才服你，若说不出来，不过想讹我一吊钱。」那缝穷婆道：「","en":"Yuanmao heard Sihui laugh and ask, \\"I must ask you, how did you know I was a master? Was the man from yesterday not a master?\\" The mender replied, \\"He is no master.\\" Sihui, secretly delighted, thought, \\"She must have noticed the dark spot on the head of my member and recognized"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":1,"tokens":["嗣徽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"乐呢。」元茂正要问他，他到房门口把门一推，见闩着，双手乱搡，那薄板门将要破了，元茂摇摇手，嗣元不懂，仍是乱搡。嗣徽听嗣元回来，心内惊慌，定一定神，倒生了个急智，随手拉一件衣裳，撕破了一块，叫他拿出针线来缝，便开了门。嗣元进去，见一个缝穷的鬓发蓬松，面有愧色，坐在凳子缝衣。嗣元一见生了气。","en":"you... you lot are enjoying yourselves at home!\\" Yuanmao was about to ask what had happened when Siyuan shoved Sihui's door. Finding it bolted, he began pushing frantically with both hands, threatening to splinter the thin wooden panels. Yuanmao waved his hands frantically to warn him off, but Siyuan, uncomprehending, continued to violently shake the door. Inside,"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":3,"tokens":["嗣徽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"笑了一笑。元茂仔细看他，比昨日标致了好些，脚也小了，但心里恨他没有情义，还说他不像老爷，又嫌他笨不在行，尽巴结嗣徽，为他穿了双皂靴，便不理他，瞅着他缝衣。嗣元腿疼，便往躺椅上一躺，不料一边的铁搭已断，一侧滚了下来。嗣徽呵呵大笑道：「言悖而出者，亦悖而入。人倒没有滚，自己倒滚了。」嗣元更有了气，爬了起来，一脚踢翻了躺椅，骂道：「我肏你的娘！」往炕上就躺，口中牵蔓葛","en":"recalling her mockery that he didn't resemble a master, her complaints of his clumsiness, and her fawning over Sihui simply because he wore black boots. He ignored her completely, glaring coldly as she sewed. Siyuan, his legs throbbing with pain, threw himself onto the reclining chair. Unexpectedly, an iron support on one side had snapped, and he tumbled straight to"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":3,"tokens":["嗣徽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"嗣徽道：「人若一之，我百之。人若十之，我千之。」元茂笑起来。嗣元听得明白，又在里头狗肏狗卵的骂个不清，忽然一伸手，在席子上摸着一块湿漉漉的，沾了一手，连忙望地下一摔，听得「嗒」的一声。嗣元恨极了，即将席子扯下地来，叫小使进来，把马褥子铺了，便烂脓烂血的大","en":"Sihui said, \\"'If another man succeed by one effort, I will use a hundred efforts. If another man succeed by ten, I will use a thousand.'\\" Yuanmao burst out laughing. Siyuan heard this exchange clearly and started up again from the inner room, cursing \\"dog-fucked\\""},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":5,"tokens":["嗣徽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"少顷，嗣元要找汗衫更换，小使找了一会，找到外间，就是方才缝的那一件。嗣元一看，火上添油，问嗣徽道：「我、我、我这件汗衫只穿了一回，好端端的怎、怎、怎么会破了，要缝起来呢？又怎、怎、怎么破的是小衿呢？这不、不、不是有心撕、撕、撕破的？」嗣徽道：「缁衣之好兮，敝予又改造兮。」嗣元道：「倒是□余又该□兮。满口之乎者也，倒像是个通、通朋友，不过花、花","en":"mender had just finished patching. Siyuan took one look, and it was like pouring oil on a fire. He demanded of Sihui, \\"I... I... I've only worn this undershirt once! Why was a perfectly good shirt torn and in need of mending? And why... why... why is it torn right at the lapel? Was this not intentionally ripped... ripped... ripped?\\" Sihui retorted with a literary quotation,"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":1,"tokens":["嗣徽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"且说李元茂侥幸了这个秀才，也十分得意。见了孙氏，便夸奖他的才学，说嗣徽是代枪的，嗣元不通，以致打了板子。","en":"self-satisfaction. In the presence of the Sun family, he loudly boasted of his own scholarly prowess, casually dropping that Sihui had relied on a ghostwriter, and that Siyuan's utter incompetence was the true cause of his beating."},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":1,"tokens":["嗣徽"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"未免彼此贪爱。况元茂学问也长了许多，孙氏又比不得那缝穷婆尝过那冲烦疲难的滋味，自然当是人生之乐止于如此。元茂将嗣徽与缝穷的光景，并听的声息，细细的描摹与孙氏听。孙氏笑得不休，又说道：「自然你也是这样的。」元茂道：「我没有，我岂肯要这种人。」孙氏半疑半信，又盘诘了一番，元茂只说没有。那元茂真是胡涂人，所说的话一会儿又忘了。一手摸着孙氏那个东西，觉得饱满可爱，而且蓬","en":"existence was to be found right here. Yuanmao then proceeded to vividly describe everything he had witnessed between Sihui and the mender, detailing the sights and the explicit sounds he had overheard, painting a meticulous picture for Madam Sun. She laughed uncontrollably, teasing, \\"Naturally, you behaved exactly the same way.\\" Yuanmao vehemently denied it. \\"I did no such"}]}`),"char-22":JSON.parse(`{"2":[{"paragraph":24,"mentions":2,"tokens":["孙嗣元","嗣元"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"与其妻室蓉华讲了些话，来到王恂书斋，恰值王恂才回。刚说得一两句话，有王恂两个内舅前来看望：一个叫孙嗣徽，一个叫孙嗣元，本是王文辉同乡同年孙亮功部郎之子。这嗣徽、嗣元两个，真所谓难兄难弟。","en":"a few words when two of Wang Xun's brothers-in-law arrived to pay a visit. One was named Sun Sihui, the other Sun Siyuan, both sons of Ministry Director Sun Lianggong, a fellow provincial and examination graduate of Wang Wenhui. These two brothers were truly a matched pair of ineptitude."},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":2,"tokens":["嗣元","迭韵双声谱"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"品，与他相熟，送他两个诨名：一个是「虫蛀千字文」。又因他那个红鼻子，有时擦得放光透亮，又叫做「起阳狗肾」。乃弟嗣元，生得枭唇露齿，又是个吊眼皮，右边一只眼睛高高吊起，像是朱笔圈了半圈。文理与乃兄不相上下，却喜批评乃兄的不通。又犯了口吃的毛病，有时议论起来，期期艾艾，愈着急愈说不清楚。高品也送他一个混号，叫做「迭韵双声谱」，这两个废物真是一对。","en":"nose, which sometimes shone with a greasy luster, he was also dubbed \\"The Aroused Dog Penis.\\" His younger brother, Siyuan, was afflicted with an owl-like beak and protruding teeth, coupled with drooping eyelids, his right eye permanently slanted upwards as if half-circled by a vermilion brush. His intellectual prowess mirrored his brother's, yet he delighted in critiquing"},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":1,"tokens":["嗣元"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"恂说道：「适值尊驾出门，不知去向，若不是「鸟倦飞而知还」，则虽引弓而射之，亦徒兴弋人之慕矣。」仲清正要回言，那嗣元道：","en":"at it, it would merely arouse the envy of the fowler.\\" Zhongqing was on the verge of formulating a reply when Siyuan interjected:"},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":3,"tokens":["嗣元"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"古文的姓都知道。」嗣徽只道仲清果真佩服他，便意气扬扬，脸上的红疙瘩，如出花灌了浆一样，一颗颗的亮澄澄起来，便对嗣元道：「老二，但凡我们读书人，天分记性是并行不悖，缺一不可的。」嗣元道；「敢、敢、敢子，若不是记性好，也不、不、不把狗来对人了。若不是天分好，也不把牛来对先生了。」说着大笑，那只吊眼皮的眼睛已淌下泪来。那嗣徽便生了气，两腮鼓起就像癞虾蟆一样。仲清故意问","en":"The red lumps on his face swelled and shone one by one, like smallpox pustules filling with pus. He turned to Siyuan, \\"Number Two, for us scholars, natural talent and a robust memory must advance in tandem, neither can be lacking.\\" Siyuan scoffed, \\"B-b-brilliant! If your memory were not so exceptional, you w-w-wouldn't have mistaken a dog for a human. And if your talent"},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":1,"tokens":["嗣元"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"翻、翻、翻出来看，原来是草字头的苟字，不是反犬旁的狗字。」仲清笑了一笑道：「若不是狗记错了，倒是一副好对子。」嗣元道：「又一日，先生出了一个做起讲的题、题、题目，是：「先生将何之。」家兄就、就、就将「牛何之」做了起头。先、先生拿笔叉、叉、叉了几叉，痛骂了一顿。」这一番说得嗣徽羞忿难耐，便在屋子里乱踱起来，说道：「屁话，屁话！」便起身告辞。王恂也恐他们弟兄斗气，不","en":"let out a soft laugh and commented, \\"If not for the canine confusion, it would have been an excellent couplet.\\" Siyuan continued, \\"On another occasion, the teacher set a theme for the opening argument of an essay: 'Where is the master going?' My brother immediately b-b-began his essay with 'Where is the ox going?' The t-t-teacher aggressively crossed it out with his"}],"6":[{"paragraph":5,"mentions":1,"tokens":["嗣元"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"秋，生得德容兼备，爱若掌珠，十八岁嫁与王家去了。还有个白头的大姑娘，是不能嫁人的，新年已二十九岁。嗣徽二十六，嗣元二十四，这两个废物，都已娶了亲。嗣徽娶的沈氏，是国子监司业沈恭之女，名字叫做芸姑。生得齐齐整整，伶俐聪明，嫁了过来，见了那样丈夫，便想自寻短见，被他的丫鬟苦劝，只得自己怨命。后来回了娘家，不肯过来。","en":"prematurely white, destined to remain unwed; this New Year marked her twenty-ninth year. Sihui, at twenty-six, and Siyuan, at twenty-four, were two thoroughly useless men who had nonetheless both taken wives. Sihui had married Miss Shen, named Yungu, daughter of the Imperial College Director Shen Gong. Neat, clever, and endearing, she was driven to thoughts of despair the"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":2,"tokens":["嗣元"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这嗣元娶的是巴氏，名字叫做来凤。父亲巴天宠，是上江凤阳人，清白出身。自小当兵，生得一表人材，精于弓马，又得了军功，年才四十余岁，已升到总兵之职，现在天津镇守海口。听了媒人谎话，将个爱女嫁了嗣元。","en":"Siyuan had married a woman of the Ba clan, named Laifeng. Her father, Ba Tianchong, hailed from Fengyang in Anhui, a man of clean and respectable lineage. A soldier since his youth, possessing a striking countenance and mastery in archery and horsemanship,"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":11,"tokens":["嗣元","孙嗣元"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，凤眼含威而有情，性气燥烈异常，少小娇痴已惯，可怜十七岁就嫁了过来。他只道文官之子是个风流佳婿，蕴藉才郎，一见嗣元那个猴头狗脑的嘴脸，又是期期艾艾，一口结巴，就在帐里哭了半日。到晚嗣元上床，要与他脱衣，就被他打个嘴巴。嗣元半边脸，已打得似个向阳桃子，便嚷将起来，似狗狺的一般，揎拳掳臂，也想来打巴姑娘。巴姑娘趁他走近身时，便站将起来，索性的劈胸一拳，把嗣元打了一交","en":"son of a civil official to be a paragon of romantic elegance and literary refinement. However, upon beholding Siyuan's monkey-like, dog-faced visage, accompanied by his stuttering, halting speech, she wept inconsolably in the bridal chamber for half the day. That evening, when Siyuan climbed into bed and attempted to undress her, she delivered a sharp slap across his"},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":2,"tokens":["嗣元"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"望，见了许多人，便作了一个公揖。见了高品、沈伯才，心中甚是吃惊，暗道：「偏偏今日运气不佳，遇见了这两个冤家。」嗣元见了巴霖，也觉心跳，也与众人见了礼，巴霖勉勉强强，作了半个揖。楼上分了四桌。刘文泽道：「都是相好，也不必推让，随意坐最好」。大家都要远着孙氏弟兄，便乱坐起来。刘文泽、沈伯才、巴霖、张仲雨坐了一席；史南湘、颜仲清、高品拉了子玉过来，坐了一席；聘才、元茂","en":"Shen Bocai, alarm gripped his heart; he thought, \\"What wretched luck today—running into these two arch-enemies.\\" Siyuan, spotting Ba Lin, felt his stomach drop; he paid his respects, to which Ba Lin responded with a begrudging half-bow. The upper floor was arranged with four tables. Liu Wenze said, \\"We are all friends here—no need for formalities; sit wherever you please.\\""},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":3,"tokens":["嗣元"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"众人看了他那神色，又各大笑。嗣元呵呵的笑起来，那只吊眼睛索落落的滴泪，说道：「我、我、我有一句：红红红红而光，一一一一团火球飞上床。」众人笑得难忍，将要高声笑起来。颜仲清道：「这一烧真烧得个红而光了。」高品道：「这一烧倒烧成了孙老二的三字经。」众人不解其说，高品道：「那救火的时候，","en":"Observing his flustered expression, the room erupted into even louder laughter. Siyuan burst into guffaws, tears streaming from his drooping eye, and stuttered, \\"I-I-I have one: Red-red-red and sh-sh-sh-shiny—a-a-a-a fireball f-f-f-flies up onto the b-b-bed.\\" The crowd laughed uncontrollably, nearly shouting in amusement. Yan Zhongqing"}],"23":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":4,"tokens":["嗣元"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"元茂一张张的点清了装在槟榔口袋里，挂在衫子衿上。候不到吃饭，即带了王保出门，去找他阿舅孙嗣徽。恰值嗣徽不在家，嗣元请进，谈了一回，留他吃了便饭。元茂与嗣元是不大讲得来的，又因嗣元常要驳他的说话，所以就坐了不长久，辞了嗣元，信步行去，心里忘不了前次那个弹琵琶的妇人。","en":"he immediately took Wang Bao and went out to seek his uncle, Sun Sihui. As it happened, Sihui was not at home; Siyuan invited him in, they conversed for a while, and Siyuan kept him for a simple meal. Yuanmao and Siyuan had never much seen eye to eye, and since Siyuan frequently contradicted him, Yuanmao did not linger long. Taking his leave of Siyuan, he wandered aimlessly,"}],"39":[{"paragraph":6,"mentions":3,"tokens":["嗣元"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"元茂与新娘拜了花烛，送入新房，坐床撒帐，饮了交杯，复又请新郎上席，坐了华筵。那嗣徽、嗣元陪了一回，王恂、仲清即要移席到新房中畅饮。大家进了新房，仲清道：「今日可以看新人的。」便要走到床前。床前本有两个伴送的老妇人，还有两个小丫鬟侍立。嗣元恐怕仲清看了他的姐姐，便跑到床前把帐门把住，口内连说了几个「看」字，然后挣出「不得」两字，惹得众人都","en":"drank from the crossed cups, and then the groom was called back out to sit at the great banquet table. Sihui and Siyuan kept them company for a while, until Wang Xun and Zhongqing proposed moving the party into the bridal chamber to drink more freely. Everyone filed into the bridal chamber. Zhongqing said, \\"Tonight we get to look at the new bride,\\" and made as if to approach"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":2,"tokens":["嗣元"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"叫嗣元过来，嗣元不肯，拿张凳子在床面前坐着。姬亮轩向子玉笑嘻嘻道：「梅大先生是不常出来，小弟今日还是头一回识荆。如高兴，歇天何不到敝东处来走走，敝东是极好相与的。」子玉不知他的东家是谁，含糊答应。即私问王恂，王恂答以奚十一，子玉便是一腔忿恨，也不理他。亮轩","en":"Someone called Siyuan to come over, but he would not leave; he pulled up a stool and planted himself in front of the bed-curtain. Ji Liangxuan turned to Ziyu with a grinning smile and said, \\"Elder Master Mei rarely goes out in company, and today is the first time I have had"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":2,"tokens":["嗣元"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"是葫芦牵倒扁豆藤。」聘才笑道：「忙中遇着腿缠筋。」嗣徽道：「亲亲也，凡有血气者莫不尊亲。亲亲人也，仁者人也。」嗣元听了乃兄开口，就要驳起来，道：「这话、话，不、不通，你、你说凡有血、血、血气者，莫不、不、不尊亲，都、都、都是你、你的亲，我、我、我想就、就、就只有螃、螃、螃蟹没有、有、血，甲、甲、甲鱼还、还有、有血，王、王、王八也是你、你、你亲戚、戚了。我就没有这","en":"whosoever has blood and breath cannot but honor his kin. To love one's kin is humanity; humanity is humanity itself.\\" Siyuan, hearing his elder brother open his mouth, immediately set about refuting him. \\"Th-th-that s-s-saying,\\" he stuttered, \\"is n-n-not right. You s-say whoever has b-b-blood and breath honors their k-k-kin, meaning everyone is your kin. I th-think only the"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":2,"tokens":["嗣元"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"我攀亲了，不要攀出蛤蟆亲戚来。」说得聘才、王恂、子玉几乎笑倒。嗣徽与亮轩知道是骂他们，因回答不出来，只好忍气。嗣元见骂了他们，倒反笑起来，道：「好、好个王八亲戚，好、好个蛤蟆亲、亲、亲戚。」王恂道：「我也有个笑话。一个妓女是个瞎子，有人去嫖他，他虽看不见，却分得人的等次来。那一天接了三个客，老鸨问他道：「姑娘，你猜今日三个客是何等样人？」瞎妓道：「头一个是秀才，","en":"Liangxuan, knowing themselves to be the butt of the joke and having no reply, had to swallow their indignation. Siyuan, however, seeing those two mocked, laughed all the louder. \\"A f-f-fine turtle kinsman!\\" he cried. \\"A f-f-fine toad r-r-relation!\\" Wang Xun said, \\"I have a joke of my own. There was a blind prostitute, and when men came to her she couldn't see them, but"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":1,"tokens":["嗣元"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"在这里撒村！你妈才是天老呢，你祖奶奶才是天老呢！」话言未了，打出一个东西来，砸破了两个菜碗，吓得众人面面相觑。嗣元见姐姐骂了，即跳起身来，也帮着乱骂。大家无趣，急忙起身走了出来，急急的各散。元茂、嗣徽也难收罗，只得送出，看上车而回。","en":"curtain and smashed two dishes of food. Everyone was so startled they looked at one another in mute bewilderment. Siyuan, seeing his sister had started cursing, leapt to his feet and joined in. The party broke up at once in embarrassment; everyone scrambled to their feet and hurried out, going their separate ways as fast as they could. Yuanmao and Sihui were left with"}],"51":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["嗣元"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"朋友，是个廪生，托其代请枪手。那人与他请了一个人，讲定了八十两银子，写了契约。在场内与孙嗣徽枪了两文一诗。这个嗣元自己又不能作文，又没有雇着枪手。不得已在卷子上一阵乱写，不知写了一篇什么东西。发案之日，嗣徽、元茂竟进了。覆了试，元茂也还勉强得来，嗣徽仍是请人代做。到发落之日，忽然挂了一块牌出来，上写道：","en":"silver and drew up a contract. Inside the hall, this hired hand produced two essays and one poem for Sun Sihui. Siyuan, however, could neither write nor had he secured a ghostwriter. Driven by desperation, he scrawled wildly across his examination paper, producing heaven knows what sort of gibberish. When the results were posted, Sihui and Yuanmao had both advanced."},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":1,"tokens":["孙嗣元"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"查看宛平县童生孙嗣元文卷，字体草率，一字两格，方言俗语，杂字一篇，无两字可连，无一句可讲，是否系染狂疾，抑或是其本真，殊为可怪。仰通州知州协同宛平县教谕，严为究问，以正功令，毋得混蒙徇纵。速，速！","en":"\\"Upon review of the examination script of Sun Siyuan, candidate of Wanping county: the calligraphy is chaotic, with single characters sprawled across two squares; the text is a jumble of local slang and assorted vulgarities, lacking any two coherent characters or a single intelligible sentence. Whether"},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":1,"tokens":["嗣元"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"元茂、嗣徽看了，也不知嗣元卷子上写了什么，嗣徽倒暗暗喜欢，与元茂进去叩见宗师。宗师见了元茂，倒也没有讲话。","en":"Yuanmao and Sihui, entirely ignorant of what Siyuan had written on his scroll, read the placard in confusion. Sihui secretly rejoiced and went in with Yuanmao to pay respects to the examiner. The examiner saw Yuanmao but offered no comment."},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":2,"tokens":["孙嗣元"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"孙嗣徽穿了蓝衫皂靴，把那个红糟脸擦得光亮，大摇大摆，踱上前去。宗师见了，觉得他与诸人不同，甚是可笑。见他名字与孙嗣元像是弟兄，使问道：「有个孙嗣元是你兄弟么？」嗣徽道：「是门生舍弟。」文宗笑道：「你兄弟有什么毛病么？」","en":"examiner found his appearance starkly different from the others and utterly comical. Noting that his name resembled Sun Siyuan's and suggesting brotherhood, the examiner asked, \\"Is Sun Siyuan your brother?\\" Sihui replied, \\"He is your disciple's younger brother.\\" The examiner smiled and asked, \\"Does your brother suffer from some affliction?\\""},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":3,"tokens":["嗣元"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"嗣徽上了马，元茂坐了车，一同回寓，嗣元被州官叫了去了。却又得了个喜信，亮功放了安徽凤阳府。嗣徽心中大喜，就想回家，等着下科再花些银子，找人枪一枪，就可以拔贡了，无奈为嗣元的文卷尚未问明，只得再待两天。元茂得了一个秀才，也就心满意足，如今又娶了亲，心中一无牵挂。却喜丈人与他父亲同在一省，便","en":"Sihui mounted a horse, Yuanmao took a carriage, and together they returned to their lodging, Siyuan having already been summoned by the prefectural official. Then came glad tidings: Lianggong had been appointed to Fengyang Prefecture in Anhui. Sihui was overjoyed and wished to return home immediately, planning to spend more silver on ghostwriters for"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":2,"tokens":["嗣元"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"日早饭后，嗣徽到门口望了几次，尚不见来。心里一想，有些下人在面前，不便行事，把几个家人尽行打发出门，叫他去探听嗣元消息与到远处去买物去了。知元茂是要睡中觉的，到他房门口望了一望，见元茂在炕上躺着，闭了眼，当他睡着了。急到门口来，见那缝穷婆已坐在门坎上。今日打扮得不同，梳得光光的元宝头，绞光了鬓脚，插了一枝花，穿一件蓝夏布衫子，手中带上烧料镯子、铜戒指，回头见了嗣","en":"make his intended actions inconvenient, he dispatched all his retainers on various errands—some to inquire about Siyuan, others to buy goods far away. Knowing Yuanmao habitually took a midday nap, he peeked into his room and saw Yuanmao lying on the kang with his eyes closed, assuming him to be asleep. Rushing to the outer gate, he found the mender already sitting on"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":1,"tokens":["孙嗣元"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子碰着小肚子，你当是里头响吗？滑出滑进的，倒教我痒的难受。」元茂听了，心中好不有气，想候他出来，骂他两句，忽见孙嗣元从外边进来。","en":"Yuanmao burned with fury, resolving to intercept her as she left and deliver a harsh scolding. But just then, Sun Siyuan stumbled in from outside."},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":7,"tokens":["孙嗣元","嗣元"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"孙嗣元因文卷之事，在州里押了一日。今日州官问他，他倒期期艾艾的顶撞了州官，本要打他几板，因他是孙亮功的儿子，留他体面，送到宛平教谕处戒斥。他又将教官得罪了，教官气极，遂将他牵到通州学明伦堂上，叫门斗按在板凳上，结结实实打了二十竹板，打得嗣元杀猪似的叫起来，","en":"Due to the scandal surrounding his examination script, Sun Siyuan had been detained at the prefectural yamen for a day. When the prefectural official interrogated him today, Siyuan, stammering and belligerent, talked back. The official, intending to order a beating, relented out of respect for Siyuan's father, Sun"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":2,"tokens":["嗣元"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"也小了，但心里恨他没有情义，还说他不像老爷，又嫌他笨不在行，尽巴结嗣徽，为他穿了双皂靴，便不理他，瞅着他缝衣。嗣元腿疼，便往躺椅上一躺，不料一边的铁搭已断，一侧滚了下来。嗣徽呵呵大笑道：「言悖而出者，亦悖而入。人倒没有滚，自己倒滚了。」嗣元更有了气，爬了起来，一脚踢翻了躺椅，骂道：「我肏你的娘！」往炕上就躺，口中牵蔓葛的混骂。嗣徽踱到外间，反拢着手，踱了几步。缝","en":"Understanding perfectly what had transpired, Siyuan cursed, \\"Where did this shameless, rotten slut come from, running into our room, locking the door to do... do... do what filthy business?! Get... get the hell out of here!\\" He kicked her basket over. Though the mender dared not explode, her temper flared."},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":2,"tokens":["嗣元"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"嗣徽道：「人若一之，我百之。人若十之，我千之。」元茂笑起来。嗣元听得明白，又在里头狗肏狗卵的骂个不清，忽然一伸手，在席子上摸着一块湿漉漉的，沾了一手，连忙望地下一摔，听得「嗒」的一声。嗣元恨极了，即将席子扯下地来，叫小使进来，把马褥子铺了，便烂脓烂血的大骂。嗣徽自知理短，不敢回言，只作不闻。那个缝穷的实在也听不得","en":"will use a hundred efforts. If another man succeed by ten, I will use a thousand.'\\" Yuanmao burst out laughing. Siyuan heard this exchange clearly and started up again from the inner room, cursing \\"dog-fucked\\" and \\"dog-bollocks\\" without a pause. Suddenly, he reached out and touched a soaking wet patch on the sleeping mat. Recoiling, he frantically wiped his hand on the"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":7,"tokens":["嗣元"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"少顷，嗣元要找汗衫更换，小使找了一会，找到外间，就是方才缝的那一件。嗣元一看，火上添油，问嗣徽道：「我、我、我这件汗衫只穿了一回，好端端的怎、怎、怎么会破了，要缝起来呢？又怎、怎、怎么破的是小衿呢？这不、不、不是有心撕、撕、撕破的？」嗣徽道：「缁衣之好兮，敝予","en":"A short while later, Siyuan sought a clean undershirt to change into. A young servant rummaged about and finally found one in the outer room—it was the very garment the mender had just finished patching. Siyuan took one look, and it was like pouring oil on a fire. He demanded of"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":1,"tokens":["嗣元"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"且说李元茂侥幸了这个秀才，也十分得意。见了孙氏，便夸奖他的才学，说嗣徽是代枪的，嗣元不通，以致打了板子。","en":"loudly boasted of his own scholarly prowess, casually dropping that Sihui had relied on a ghostwriter, and that Siyuan's utter incompetence was the true cause of his beating."}]}`),"char-23":JSON.parse(`{"1":[{"paragraph":13,"mentions":3,"tokens":["袁宝珠","宝珠","瑶卿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琼楼珠树袁宝珠\\n宝珠姓袁氏，字瑶卿，年十六岁。姑苏人。隶联锦部。善丹青，娴吟咏。其演《鹊桥》、《密誓》、《惊梦》、《寻梦》等出，艳夺明霞，朗涵仙露。正使玉环失宠，杜女无华。\\n纤音遏云，柔情如水。《霓裳》一曲，描来天宝风流。春梦重寻，谱出香闺思怨。平时则清光奕奕，软","en":"Yuan Baozhu: A Pearl Tree of the Jade Pavilion. Baozhu's surname is Yuan, his style name Yaoqing, and he is sixteen years of age. A native of Suzhou, he belongs to the Lianjin troupe. He is highly skilled in painting and fluent in poetry. When he performs pieces"}],"2":[{"paragraph":35,"mentions":1,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"辉坐了。文辉问他哥哥兰保为什么不来，桂保道：「今日本都在怡园逛了一天，徐老爷知道这里请客，才打发我来的。兰保、宝珠、蕙芳、漱芳、玉林都还没有散，只怕总要到四五更天才散呢。」文辉道：「这徐度香也算人间第一个快乐人了。」陆宗沅道：「听说他这个怡园共花了五十多万银子才造成。」杨方猷道：「本来地方也大，也造得过于精致。」文辉道：「我前月逛了一天，还没有逛到一半。」桂保说","en":"the Garden of Contentment. Master Xu only dispatched me here upon learning you were hosting a banquet. Lanbao, Baozhu, Huifang, Shufang, and Yulin have not yet dispersed; I suspect they will linger until the fourth or fifth watch.\\" Wenhui said, \\"This Xu Duxiang is truly the most carefree and joyous man in the mortal realm.\\" Lu Zongyuan added, \\"I have heard that constructing"}],"4":[{"paragraph":32,"mentions":1,"tokens":["瑶卿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"日蕊香说起两人来，刚说时就有人来打断了，没有说下去。」王恂问道：「这两人怎样？」春喜道：「好极了，那个琴官，与瑶卿不相上下。那个琪官，与蕊香难定高低。此刻都还没有上台，但一天已有三五处叫他。前日度香见了，也大加赏赞，即赏了好些东西，把他们的衣服通身重做了几套。","en":"never finished.\\" Wang Xun asked, \\"What are these two like?\\" Chunxi said, \\"Excellent. That Qinguan is on a par with Yaoqing. That Qiguan—it is hard to say who ranks higher, him or Ruixiang. Neither has appeared on stage yet, but every day there are already three to five requests for them. The other day Duxiang saw them and praised them tremendously, immediately giving them"}],"5":[{"paragraph":6,"mentions":1,"tokens":["袁宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"素心朝夕，其余泛泛者，惟以礼相待，如愿相偿而已。史南湘《花选》中的八个名旦日夕来游，子云尽皆珍爱，而尤宠异者惟袁宝珠。这一片钟情爱色之心，却与别人不同，视这些好相公与那奇珍异宝、好鸟名花一样，只有爱惜之心，却无褒狎之念，所以这些名旦，个个与他忘形略迹，视他为慈父恩母。甘雨祥云，无话不可尽言，无情不可径遂。那个萧次贤更是清高恬淡，玩意不留。","en":"performers from Shi Nanxiang's Selection of Flowers came and went daily. Ziyun treasured them all, but singled out Yuan Baozhu for particular affection. His feeling of love and appreciation for beautiful performers was quite different from others. He regarded these fine young opera players as he would rare treasures, fine birds, and celebrated flowers. He held only a caring"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":1,"tokens":["袁宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一日，子云在堂会中，见了新来的琴官、琪官两个，十分赞赏，叹为创见，正与那八个名旦一气相孚，才生了物色的念头。叫袁宝珠改日同他们到园来。又见他们的服饰未美，即连夜制造了几套，赏给了他们，这两个相公自然感激的了。但那个琴官，却又不然。且先将他的出身略叙一叙。","en":"stand alongside the eight famous dan performers. This kindled his desire to cultivate their acquaintance. He asked Yuan Baozhu to bring them to the garden another day. Seeing that their clothing was not yet fine enough, he immediately had several new outfits made overnight and presented them as gifts. The two performers were naturally grateful. But this Qinguan was different"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":5,"tokens":["袁宝珠","宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"是日琪官感冒，不能起来，袁宝珠先到琴官寓里。这个宝珠的容貌，《花选》中已经说过了，性格温柔，貌如处女。他也爱这琴官的相貌与己彷佛，虽是初交，倒与夙好一般。两人已谈心过几回，琴官也重宝珠的人品，是个洁身自爱的人。宝珠又将子云的好处，细细说给他听，琴官便也放了好些心。二人同上了车，琴","en":"That day, Qiguan had caught a cold and could not get up, so Yuan Baozhu came first to Qinguan's lodgings. Baozhu's appearance had already been described in the Selection of Flowers: his nature gentle and yielding, his looks like a maiden's. He too was attracted to Qinguan, whose appearance resembled his own. Though they"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":2,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"不多一刻进了怡园，宝珠询知子云今日在海棠春圃。这海棠春圃，平台曲榭。密室洞房，接接连连共有二十余间。宝珠引了进去，到了三间套房之内，子云正与次贤在那里围炉斗酒，见了这二人进来，都喜孜孜的笑面相迎。","en":"Not long after, they entered the Garden of Contentment. Baozhu asked and learned that Ziyun was that day at the Crabapple Spring Court. This Crabapple Spring Court had open terraces and winding covered galleries, intimate chambers and secluded rooms, all connecting in a continuous chain of over twenty bays. Baozhu"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":1,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"日容貌，华装艳服，更加妍丽了些。但见他那生生怯怯、畏畏缩缩的神情。教人怜惜之心，随感而发，便命他坐下。琴官挨着宝珠坐了，子云笑盈盈的问道：「前日我们乍见，未能深谈，你将你的出身家业、怎样入班的缘故，细细讲给我听。」琴官见问他的出身，便提动他的积恨，不知不觉的面泛桃花，眼含珠泪，定了一定神，但又不好不对，只得学着官话，撇去苏音，把他的家世叙了一番。说到他父母双亡，","en":"bearing. Feelings of tender regard arose in them unbidden, and they invited him to sit. Qinguan sat close beside Baozhu. Ziyun smiled warmly and said: \\"When we first met the other day, we could not speak at length. Please tell me in detail about your background, your family, and how you came to enter the theater troupe.\\" When asked about his background, Qinguan's accumulated"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":2,"tokens":["瑶卿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"唱戏的？可借天地间有这一种灵秀，不钟于香闺秀阁，而钟于舞榭歌楼，不钗而冠，不裙而履，真是恨事。」子云道：「他与瑶卿，真可谓享单云瑞雪，方驾千里，使易冠履而裙钗，恐江东二乔犹难比数。想是造物之心，欲使此辈中出几个传人，一洗向来凡陋之习，也未可知。」即对琴官道：「我们这里是比不得别处，你不必怕生，你各样都照着瑶卿，他怎样你也怎样。要知我们的为人，你细细问他就知道了。","en":"Wearing a cap instead of hairpins, shoes instead of skirts. It is truly a lamentable matter.\\" Ziyun said: \\"He and Yaoqing truly could be called a matched pair soaring under auspicious clouds, racing a thousand li abreast. If their hats and shoes were exchanged for hairpins and skirts, I fear even the Two Beauties east of the River could scarcely be compared with them. It"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":1,"tokens":["瑶卿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"瑶卿在这里，并不当他相公看待，一切称呼。都不照外头一样，可以大家称号，请安也可不用。你若高兴，空闲时，可以常到这里来，倒不必要存什么规矩，存了规矩，就生疏了。」琴官也只得答应了，再将他们二人看看，都是骨格不凡，清和可近，已知不是寻常人了。次贤对子云道：「","en":"\\"Here Yaoqing is not treated as an ordinary performer. All forms of address are different from the outside world: everyone addresses each other by style names, and formal salutations are not required. If you are inclined, please come here often in your free time."},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":7,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"」次贤想了一回道：「改为琴言，号玉侬，可好么？」子云道：「很好，这琴言二字，又新又雅；\\n玉侬之号，雅称其人。」宝珠叫琴官道谢，琴官又起身请了两个安。次贤道：「方才已说过的了，怎么又请起安来？」子云道：「我们立下章程，凡遇年节庆贺大事，准你们请安，其余常见一概不用。老爷二字，永远不许出口。称我竟是度香，称他竟是静宜。」琴言站起身来说道：「这个怎么敢？」子云道：「你","en":"two characters 'Qinyan' are both fresh and elegant; and 'Yunong' as a style name suits the person perfectly.\\" Baozhu told Qinguan to express his thanks; Qinguan rose and made two bows. Cixian said: \\"We have already said all this, why are you bowing again?\\" Ziyun said: \\"Let us establish a rule: on festival days and occasions for congratulations you may bow; in all other"}],"6":[{"paragraph":26,"mentions":2,"tokens":["袁宝珠","宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"天还问你要饭吃，拉住了你，你倒忘了？」南湘侧耳而听，听这说话诧异，将要问时。王恂笑道：「冤哉！冤哉！那个那里是袁宝珠，那是顶黑的黑相公，偏偏他的名字也叫保珠，庾香一听就当是你定的第一名。我也想着要分辨，就被那保环缠住，没有这个空儿。「南湘大笑，子玉才知道另是个保珠，不是《花选》上的宝珠。","en":"perplexed, preparing to ask for clarification. Wang Xun laughed loudly, \\"What a misunderstanding! That was not Yuan Baozhu at all—that was the darkest of the dark-class performers, whose name also happened to be Baozhu. Yuxiang heard the name and immediately assumed him to be your top choice. I was about to explain, but Baohuan had me so entangled that I never had the chance.\\""},{"paragraph":30,"mentions":1,"tokens":["袁宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"》上的《侠隐》，子玉悄悄的向聘才道：「戏倒罢了，只不晓得有琴官的戏没有？」一语未了，只听得楼下有人嚷道：「没有袁宝珠的戏，是断不依的。」","en":"but I wonder if Qinguan is in any of these.\\" Before he finished speaking, a voice from below shouted, \\"Without Yuan Baozhu's performance, I absolutely refuse!\\""},{"paragraph":31,"mentions":2,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"说道：「就是在徐老爷那里，唱一出再去何妨；况且定戏时，怎样交代你的？」那人道：「这出《惊梦》有个新来的琴官，比宝珠还好。大人不信，叫他先唱一出瞧瞧，如果不中大人的意，再赶着去叫宝珠来，包管不误。」刘侍郎道：「也罢，唱了《瑶台》之后，就唱《惊梦》也使得。」那人答应几个「是！」看着文辉不言语，也就进戏房去了。聘才向子玉道：「你听见没有？」子玉点头，心上很感激文辉。","en":"man explained, \\"In this 'The Interrupted Dream,' there is a newly arrived performer, Qinguan, who surpasses even Baozhu. If Your Lordship doubts this, let him sing one piece first—if he fails to meet your expectations, I will rush off immediately to fetch Baozhu, guaranteeing no delay.\\" Vice-Minister Liu intervened, \\"Very well, then—after 'The Jade Terrace' concludes,"}],"7":[{"paragraph":11,"mentions":1,"tokens":["瑶卿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"」主人只得照数领了，合席也各饮了一杯。南湘道：「如此饮酒，罚来罚去，也觉无味。前日我们打了一天诗牌，却极有趣。瑶卿打成两首绝好的，可惜他们今日又在怡园。咱们何不再想一个新鲜酒令。」刘文泽道：「今日我们将那对诗的令，行一行罢。」子玉问道：「怎样对诗？」仲清道：「这是极容易的，出令的把一句诗拆开了，一个个的说给人对，凑起来文义通的免饮，一字不连，罚一杯。往往闹出笑话","en":"\\"Drinking and penalizing like this feels a bit dull. The poetry tile game we played the other day was delightful. Yaoqing composed two superb pieces, though it's a pity they are at the Garden of Contentment today. Why don't we devise a new drinking game?\\" Liu Wenze proposed, \\"Let's play the poetry-matching game today.\\" Ziyu asked, \\"How does one match poetry?\\" Zhongqing"}],"9":[{"paragraph":22,"mentions":4,"tokens":["袁宝珠","宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"层楼，隐隐约约，看视不明，尚未见一盏灯火。忽见亭子前面太湖石山洞，一对明灯照出一双玉人来。走到面前看时，一个是袁宝珠，一个是金漱芳。仲清问道：「你们藏在那里？」宝珠道：「我们在前面小船室下棋。」文泽道：「相公阿曾点个只眼？」宝珠、漱芳都笑了一笑。座中就是子玉不认得，那日虽见漱芳的《题曲》，也是上妆容貌。此时看他骨香肉腻，玉洁晶莹；宝珠亭亭玉立，弱不胜衣，便想道：「","en":"the pavilion, a pair of bright lanterns lit the way for two jade-like figures. Coming closer, one proved to be Yuan Baozhu, and the other Jin Shufang. Zhongqing asked: \\"Where have you been hiding?\\" Baozhu replied: \\"We were playing chess in the little boat room at the front.\\" Wenze said: \\"And did either of you contrive to make an eye?\\" Baozhu and Shufang both smiled. Of those"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":2,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"可惜无酒，负此花灯。」听得次贤说道：「如此良夜，诸兄何不小饮几杯。」即吩咐取酒来。不一会，小厮们取了四壶酒交给宝珠、漱芳，走到各人面前，将茶碗撤去，把茶几揭起了一层盖子，便是一个镶成的攒盒，共有十二碟果菜，银杯象箸都镶在里面，十分精巧。宝珠、漱芳都斟了酒，次贤说：「请！」大家浅斟细酌起来。酒过数巡，台下云锣一响，四处的烟火放完，只见各处树梢上颤巍巍的挂起无数彩灯","en":"at once ordered wine to be brought. In a short while the page-boys brought four jars of wine and handed them to Baozhu and Shufang, who went before each guest, removed the teacups, and lifted a layer off the tea-tables. This revealed inlaid tiered boxes within, each containing twelve plates of fruits and dishes, with silver cups and ivory chopsticks fitted inside, all"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":4,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，小厮先拿了一碗温水与他漱了口，又说道：「你们好乐！」仲清道：「你且坐下，歇歇再说。」扶上亭子，他就坐在地下，宝珠等上去见他，他把头点点。文泽道：「你在那里喝得这样？」南湘又摇摇头。宝珠到次贤耳边说了几句话，次贤命小厮去拿了一个小小的金盒子，取出一丸药来，放在碗内，用开水化了，递给宝珠，捧到南湘身边，弯了腰给他喝，南湘摇头不要。宝珠道：「这是醒酒汤，喝了就好了。","en":"said: \\"Sit down first. Rest and then tell us.\\" They helped him up into the pavilion, and he sat on the floor. Baozhu and the others went up to greet him, and he nodded to them. Wenze asked: \\"Where have you been drinking to reach this state?\\" Nanxiang shook his head again. Baozhu whispered a few words to Cixian. Cixian instructed a page-boy to bring a small gold box,"},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":1,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"黄鹤楼，你怎么认不清了？」南湘近前一看，狂笑起来，说道：「原来静宜也在这里，你们到底几时来的？」众人听了又笑，宝珠、漱芳拉他到亭外看了一会，南湘方知道是怡园，细细一想，便又大笑。将要问时，忽然满园的金鼓盈天，爆声大发，风驰火骤，声势骇人，四面八方，百兽齐集，尽是五色绸纱糊的，彩画得毛片逼真：一边驰出一队象灯，一边驰出一队虎灯；一边驰出一队犀牛，一边驰出一队狮子；","en":"into wild laughter, saying: \\"So Jingyi is here too. When exactly did all of you arrive?\\" Everyone laughed again. Baozhu and Shufang drew him outside the pavilion and showed him around a while. Only then did Nanxiang understand they were in the Garden of Contentment, and thinking it through carefully, he laughed loudly again. Just as he was about to ask something, the"},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":2,"tokens":["袁宝珠","宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"甚佳，琴床画桌，金鼎铜壶，斑然可爱。正中悬着一额，是屈本立写的「宜春阁」三字，一边是陆素兰写的几幅小楷，一边是袁宝珠画的几幅墨兰，中间地上点着一盏仿古鸡足银灯，有四尺高，上面托着个九瓣莲花灯盏，点着九穗，照得满屋通明。一一坐了，次贤道：「我们何不再饮几杯？」众人道：「我们在亭子上已饮多了，可以不必酒了，倒是清谈罢。」南湘道：「我今日的酒不晓得怎样醒的？」宝珠道：","en":"several panels of small-script calligraphy by Sulan, and on the other side, several panels of ink-painted orchids by Yuan Baozhu. In the middle of the floor stood a lamp imitating an ancient chicken-foot design in silver, some four feet tall. It held a nine-petal lotus lamp-basin above, burning nine wicks, which filled the whole room with bright light. Everyone sat down. Cixian"},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":3,"tokens":["瑶卿","宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「我们今日醒眼观醉。眼倒也有趣。」南湘道：「瑶卿，我记得你还灌我一大碗酒。」众人笑道：「这人醉胡涂了，到底饮了多少酒来？」南湘道：「今日我同高卓然、张仲雨，带了王静芳、李佩仙在酒楼上饮了一天，也不晓得有多少，他们都醉得先走了。我送静芳回去，顺路到庸庵家，问知出外逛灯，我也去逛灯。也不知赶车的什么意","en":"\\"We who were sober today watched others in their cups, and that also had its charms.\\" Nanxiang said: \\"Yaoqing, I recall that you poured a great bowl of wine down my throat.\\" Everyone laughed and said: \\"This fellow is still befuddled from drink. How much did you actually consume in the end?\\" Nanxiang said: \\"Today I went with Gao Zhuoran and Zhang Zhongyu, bringing"},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":4,"tokens":["宝珠","瑶卿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"笑道：「小弟早已认过，吾兄尚还刻刻在心。」南湘道：「以后你们这一班，见我们不许请安，只许称号，如违了要罚的。」宝珠道：「这倒与度香、静宜一样脾气，就是这样便了。」王恂道：「庾香，你看这瑶卿，与你去年戏园所见的怎样？这真伪可能相混么？」子玉笑道：「瓦砾岂可僭称珠玉？那个名字，叫他改了才好。」宝珠不解，便问王恂，王恂就将去年所见保珠，子玉听错的话说了，宝珠嫣然而笑。","en":"us you must not bow in salutation. You may only address us by our courtesy names. Violators will be penalized.\\" Baozhu said: \\"This is exactly the same disposition as Duxiang and Jingyi, so it shall be.\\" Wang Xun said: \\"Yuxiang, look at this Yaoqing. How does he compare to what you saw at the theater last year? Could the real and the fake possibly be confused?\\" Ziyu laughed:"},{"paragraph":30,"mentions":1,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"于是漱芳拉了王恂下棋，文泽观局。子玉同宝珠看那墨兰，赞不绝口；南湘、仲清、次贤同坐在醉翁床闲话。南湘道：「静宜兄，还记得「只有酒狂名下士，醉吟许上岳阳楼」佳句否？」","en":"Thereupon Shufang drew Wang Xun into a game of chess while Wenze looked on. Ziyu and Baozhu admired the ink-painted orchid, praising it without end. Nanxiang, Zhongqing, and Cixian sat together on the Drunken-Scholar's Couch in easy conversation. Nanxiang said: \\"Brother Jingyi, do you still recall those fine lines: 'Only the poet-drunkard is"},{"paragraph":31,"mentions":7,"tokens":["宝珠","瑶卿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"教酒满洞庭湖，只怕史竹君早已醉死了。静宜先生，明日可与他写个竹醉图。」次贤点头微笑。子玉乘他们说话时，悄悄的问宝珠道：「这两天可曾见你们同班的琴官？」宝珠听了，把子玉打量了一番，问道：「你同琴官相好么？」倒把子玉问住了，很不好意思，只得答道：「向未交接，不过闻名思慕。」宝珠道：「他如今不叫琴官，改名为琴言，今日可惜迟来一步，度香带他赴席去了。」子玉心里想道：「我","en":"tomorrow.\\" Cixian nodded and smiled faintly. Taking advantage of the others' conversation, Ziyu quietly asked Baozhu: \\"These past two days, have you seen Qinyan from your troupe?\\" Baozhu, hearing this, looked Ziyu over carefully and asked: \\"Are you and Qinyan close friends?\\" This question rather caught Ziyu off guard. Quite embarrassed, he could only answer: \\"We have"},{"paragraph":33,"mentions":2,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉道：「好个春灯谜面子。」宝珠道：「我最爱傅粉郎君一联。」南湘道：「我们这里只有庾香算得傅粉郎君，你爱他么？」宝珠笑了一笑，子玉倒臊得脸都红了。再看那封回书是：","en":"Ziyu exclaimed: \\"What a fine puzzle in the guise of a Lantern Festival riddle!\\" Baozhu said: \\"I love most the couplet about the 'powder-faced young gentleman.'\\" Nanxiang said: \\"Among us here, only Yuxiang qualifies as a powder-faced young gentleman. Do you admire him?\\" Baozhu gave a little smile, and Ziyu's cheeks turned thoroughly red"}],"10":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴言自去年谒见子云之后，也随着一班名花天天常到怡园，子云爱之不亚于宝珠。但琴言生性高傲，冷冷落落，不善应酬，任凭黄金满斗，也买不动他一笑。一切古玩饮食衣服，只要他心爱，徐子云无不供给，也算相待十分，琴言未尝不知感恩，却只算得半个知己。自那进京这一天路上见了子玉，便认得是梦中救他出陷坑的人，时时刻刻放在心上。又姑苏会馆唱","en":"celebrated beauties in their daily visits to the Garden of Contentment, where Ziyun favored him no less than he did Baozhu. Yet Qinyan was of an aloof and arrogant nature, preferring solitude to social pleasantries; though one might offer him a full measure of gold, it could not buy so much as a single smile. Whatever antiques, delicacies, or fine garments caught his fancy,"},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":3,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"恐他是个青年轻薄寡情短行之人。又恐他豪贵骄奢要人趋奉的人。但细看他温存骨格，像个厚道正人，断不至此。一日又梦见宝珠变了他的模样，与自己唱了一出《惊梦》，又想不出这个理来。次日，子云到园来，次贤讲起昨晚诸诺人来园看灯，并子玉打着了琴言的灯谜，即将子玉的才貌痛赞了一番。子云听了，心里颇为喜欢，即道：「这个梅庾香，他虽不认得我，我去年恰见过他。我们也有世谊，他令祖相国","en":"his bearing, he seemed a man of genuine goodness who surely could not be so base. Then one day he dreamed that Baozhu had taken on Ziyu's appearance and performed the scene of the 'The Interrupted Dream' with him, leaving him utterly bewildered. The following day, when Ziyun came to the garden, Cixian spoke at length of the young gentlemen who had come to view the lanterns"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":2,"tokens":["袁宝珠","宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这里袁宝珠用手帕替他擦了泪痕，就将史南湘的醉态，及妆点情形，说得琴言欢喜了，便同在一张床榻上坐着道：「看昨日这几个打灯谜的人，内中一个叫梅庾香的，年纪不过十七八岁，相貌生得最好。」琴言道：「这人也姓梅么？」宝珠道：「他曾问起你来。」琴言沉吟道：「姓梅的他说会过","en":"Here, Yuan Baozhu used a handkerchief to wipe away the tear-stains on Qinyan's face. He then described Shi Nanxiang's drunken antics and his adorned appearance in such amusing detail that Qinyan's spirits lifted, and they sat together on the daybed. Baozhu said: \\"Among"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":14,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"宝珠道：「便是奇怪得很，我因他就只问你一个，只道你们自然在一处饮过酒。问他可与你相好，他支吾了一句，说什么向未交接，不过闻声思慕，似乎不像见过的。又说看见你《惊梦》这出戏唱得很好。」琴言想道：「不要这姓梅的，就是那天看戏的梅公子。」因问宝珠道：「这梅公子","en":"Baozhu replied: \\"That is precisely what was so strange about it. Because he asked after you alone, I naturally assumed you must have shared drinks together at some point. When I asked if he was on intimate terms with you, he hedged a bit, saying something along"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":3,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"况且你又不是女孩子，怕什么配对不配对，难道真把你配了梅庾香不成？」说得次贤、宝珠都笑起来。宝珠道：「不要说了，他已经明白过来了。我们何不去请了庾香来与他见一见。」子云道：「知道是他不是他，我自有道理。」宝珠、琴言即在怡园吃了晚饭，坐到二更而回。","en":"to fear in talk of a 'match'? Could I really be marrying you off to Mei Yuxiang?\\" This remark made Cixian and Baozhu both burst into laughter. Baozhu interjected: \\"Say no more, for he has already understood. Why don't we simply invite Yuxiang here to meet him?\\" Ziyun said: \\"I have my own method of determining whether it is truly him or not.\\" Baozhu and Qinyan dined"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":1,"tokens":["瑶卿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"据瑶卿说来，与玉侬改了名字，他全然不知，可见素未浃洽。","en":"According to Yaoqing's account, Yuxiang knew nothing whatsoever of the name change arranged for Yunong, which clearly demonstrates that the two have never shared true intimacy."},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":1,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"个移花接木之计，先把玉侬藏了，另觅一个像玉侬的人，用言打动他，看他如何，自然就试出来了。」主意已定，即向次贤、宝珠说知。","en":"naturally reveal everything.\\" With his mind firmly made up, he disclosed the intricacies of his plan to Cixian and Baozhu."},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":1,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉想起宝珠改名之言，知道玉侬就是琴官，却喜出望外，便深深一揖，道了谢，仍令小厮囊好。子云试他道：「闻说吾兄与玉侬相与最深，可是真的么？」子玉道：「弟因家君管教极严，平素足不出户，就只开春初六那日，在姑苏会馆看见他一出《惊梦》的戏，有人说起他的名字叫琴官，觉得色","en":"Recalling what Baozhu had revealed about the change of name, Ziyu now fully understood that Yunong was none other than Qinguan, and a wave of joy washed over him beyond all expectation. He made a deep and respectful bow of thanks and then directed his page boy to carefully"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":3,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"于陌路人之理。琴言之于弟，犹陌路人也。弟已忘情于彼，彼又安能用情于弟乎?」子云道：「据吾兄品评琴言，比前日所见宝珠何如？」子玉因想琴言、宝珠都是子云宠爱，未便轩轾，便道：「大凡品花，必须于既上妆之后，观其体态。又必于已卸妆之后，视其姿容。且必平素熟悉其意趣，熟闻其语言，方能识其情性之真。弟于宝珠、琴言均止一见，一系上妆，一系卸妆，正如走马看花，难分深浅。」子云道","en":"direct such feeling toward me?\\" Ziyun pressed: \\"According to your own judgment, how does Qinyan compare to the Baozhu you met the other day?\\" Ziyu, mindful that both Qinyan and Baozhu enjoyed Ziyun's favor and unwilling to elevate one at the expense of the other, replied diplomatically: \\"Generally speaking, to truly evaluate a flower, one must observe its form and bearing"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":2,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"正说着，只见宝珠同着花枝招展的一个人来，子玉一看不是别人，就是朝思暮想的琴言，心里暗暗吃惊。又听得子云道：「玉侬，你的意中人在此，过来见了。」琴言嫣然一笑，走上来请了一个安，倒弄得子玉坐不是，站不是，呆呆的只管看那琴言。那琴言又对子云也请了安。宝珠道：「庾香，我竟遵","en":"Just as they were engaged in conversation, Baozhu arrived gracefully, adorned like a flowering branch, accompanied by another figure. When Ziyu looked, he saw it was none other than the very person for whom he had yearned day and night: Qinyan. His heart gave a secret, powerful start of surprise. Then"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":2,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「是这样脱俗最好，玉侬何不也是这样？」琴言微微的一笑，不言语。子玉看看琴言，又看看宝珠，觉宝珠比琴言，面目清艳了好些，吐属轻倩了好些，举止闲雅了好些。心里寻思道：","en":"Yunong not do the same?\\" Qinyan offered a faint smile but remained silent. Ziyu looked first at Qinyan, then at Baozhu, and felt that Baozhu surpassed Qinyan in luminous beauty, possessed a lighter and more charming manner of speech, and exhibited a far more leisurely elegance in his movements. He found himself pondering:"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":5,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"不绝口，徐子云又钟情到这样，真令人不解。「一面想，那神色之间，微露出不然之意来。子云却早窥出，颇得意用计之妙。宝珠道：「你们彼此相思已久，今日初次见面，也该说两句知心话，亲热亲热，为什么大家冷冰冰的，都不言语。」说着就拉着琴言的手，送到子玉手内。子云道：「可不是，不要因我们在这里碍眼，不好意思。」说得子玉更觉接不是，不接又不是的，只得装作解手出来，又在窗外看了一","en":"had already keenly detected it and was secretly delighted that his clever stratagem was working so effectively. Baozhu said: \\"You have long yearned for each other, and today marks your very first meeting, so surely you ought to exchange a few heartfelt words and display some affection. Why are you both as cold as ice, refusing to speak a single word?\\" As he spoke, he"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":1,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一点。又道：「好心思，你可晓得度香的主意么？」子玉又把头摇一摇。琴言用一个指头，将子玉的额抬起来，道：「我听得宝珠说，你背地里很问我，我很感你的情。今日见了面，这里又没有第三个人，为什么倒生分起来？」子玉被他盘问得没法，只得勉强的道：「玉侬，我听说你性气甚是高傲，所以我敬你。为什么到京几天，就迷了本性呢？」琴言道：","en":"Duxiang's plan?\\" Ziyu shook his head once more. Qinyan raised Ziyu's chin with one finger and said: \\"I heard from Baozhu that behind my back you asked quite extensively about me, and I am profoundly touched by your feeling. Now that we have met today, and there is no third person present to disturb us, why remain so distant?\\" Ziyu, pressed to the point where he had no"},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":1,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"正急的无可如何，只听得镜屏里轻轻的一响，子云、次贤、宝珠都在镜屏之外，迎面笑盈盈的走进来，那琴言一影就不见了，把个子玉吓得迷迷糊糊的。只听得子云笑道：「好个坐怀不乱的柳下惠，失敬，失敬！就是骂我徐度香太挖苦些。」子玉一回转头来，那知众人都在镜屏对面套间之内。子玉与次贤见了礼，即向子云告辞道：「今日出门忘了","en":"hovering on the very edge of despair, a soft, distinct sound was heard at the mirror screen. Ziyun, Cixian, and Baozhu, their faces adorned with smiles, walked in gracefully from the other side of the screen. At that precise instant, the figure of Qinyan vanished without a single trace, leaving Ziyu utterly dazed and bewildered. Then he heard Ziyun laughing brightly:"},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":4,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"次贤道：「小弟才来，正拟畅谈衷曲，足下拂然欲去，是怪我奉陪得迟了。」宝珠一手拉着子玉进套间屋内，道：「你且再看看你的意中人，不要哭坏了他。」子玉见一人背坐着在那里哭泣，只道就是刚才的那个琴言。因想他既知哭泣，尚能悔过，意欲于酒席中间，慢慢的用言语感化他。那晓得他倒转过脸来，用手帕擦擦眼泪，看着子玉道：「庾香，你的心我知道","en":"your honor fully intends to leave in displeasure. Am I to blame for arriving too late to properly escort you?\\" Baozhu gently took Ziyu's hand and led him into the inner suite, urging: \\"Come and have another look at your heart's true beloved; do not let him weep himself sick on your account.\\" Ziyu saw a figure sitting quietly with his back turned, weeping softly. Thinking"},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":1,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"平知己。可巧是吾兄猜着，不枉弟一番作合之心。」子玉道：「却之不恭，受之有愧，当为玉侬珍重藏之。」琴言面有豫色。宝珠见了，将唐诗改了一字念道：「寻常一样琴前月，才有梅花便不同。」子云、次贤同声赞道：「琴字改得好。」","en":"unworthy, yet I shall treasure it carefully on Yunong's behalf.\\" A delicate shadow of pleasure crossed Qinyan's face. Baozhu, observing this, recited a line of Tang poetry with one character cleverly changed:\\n\\n'The same moonlight as always shines upon the qin;\\nOnly with the plum blossom is it no longer ordinary.'\\n\\nZiyun and Cixian together praised the verse: \\"The change of"},{"paragraph":33,"mentions":4,"tokens":["宝珠","瑶卿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉看琴言颜色微愠，知是宝珠以他名字为戏，便道：「若非瑶卿胸有智珠，不能改得如此敏妙。」子云等还道是寻常赞语，惟有琴言深感子玉之情，替他报复了这个琴字。次贤道：「今日玉侬，何以一言不发？」子云道：「他本来像息夫人似的，将来静宜可将那「花如解语还多事，石不能言最可人」，替他写一副","en":"Ziyu, noticing a slight flash of annoyance cross Qinyan's face, understood that Baozhu was playfully using the character 'qin' in his name, and so said: \\"If Yaoqing did not possess brilliance like a luminous pearl within his breast, he could not have made such a quick and exquisitely clever substitution.\\" The others took this for ordinary"},{"paragraph":36,"mentions":2,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"宝珠道：「我们今日何不以玉侬说话为令，他说一句话，我们合席饮一杯。」子云笑道：「这令很新，就是这样。」子玉道：「说一句话，合席饮一杯酒，这个令未免酒太多。他和谁说，谁饮一杯不好么？」琴言点头。宝珠道：「这个恐怕有弊。」子云道：「不妨，就吃醉了，我有醒酒丸","en":"Baozhu proposed: \\"Why do we not make a forfeit rule for this evening based on Yunong's speaking? Every time he says a sentence, the whole table drinks a cup.\\" Ziyun laughed warmly: \\"What a novel rule. Let it be so.\\" Ziyu reasoned: \\"For every sentence spoken,"},{"paragraph":37,"mentions":1,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"道：「替人做媒，回来迟了。」也饮一杯。琴言把子玉看了一看，都不言语，回转头来问子云道：「这园梅花共有多少株？」宝珠咳嗽一声，子云道：「约有二千株。」该是一杯。","en":"absolutely nothing; then he turned back and asked Ziyun: \\"How many plum trees does this garden have in total?\\" Baozhu gave a slight, knowing cough. Ziyun replied: \\"Approximately two thousand trees.\\" That was another cup."},{"paragraph":38,"mentions":5,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"宝珠过来，替子云斟了，就便向子云耳边说了一句。琴言道：「你们改令，是要罚十杯。」子玉道：「没有人改的。」宝珠过来要与子玉斟酒，琴言把子玉的杯子拿了道：「我又没有和他说话，为什么要给他酒吃呢？」宝珠道：「他和你说话也是一样。」琴言道：「这个我不依。」子玉倒","en":"Baozhu came over and filled Ziyun's cup, then leaned over and whispered something secretively in his ear. Qinyan warned: \\"If you change the rules, the penalty is ten cups.\\" Ziyu put in: \\"No one changed anything.\\" Baozhu came over to fill Ziyu's cup. Qinyan"},{"paragraph":39,"mentions":1,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云虽曾经握过，此时也只能艳羡而已。子玉忆起日间那个琴言的手，又粗又黑，始知必非一人。宝珠心生一计，便道：","en":"that daytime Qinyan, rough and dark, and understood at long last that they must be two different people entirely. Baozhu thought of a clever scheme and asked:"},{"paragraph":40,"mentions":2,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「你们大家看他的纤纤玉手作什么？」琴言把手一缩，宝珠随即取了这杯酒，送在子玉手内。琴言向子玉道：「这杯酒你偏不要吃。」子玉答应。子云道：「玉侬你该替我作主人，敬客一杯才是。」宝珠接口道：「况这个令，那头一句话，就不算向庾香说的，难道这句话也是和别人说的不成？」琴言想了一想，这话有理，只得一笑。","en":"\\"Why is everyone staring at his slender, delicate hand?\\" At this, Qinyan hastily drew back his hand, and Baozhu immediately seized the cup and placed it directly in Ziyu's hand. Qinyan turned to Ziyu: \\"You must not drink this cup.\\" Ziyu said nothing in reply. Ziyun instructed: \\"Yunong, you should represent me as host and offer a cup to our honored guest.\\" Baozhu"},{"paragraph":41,"mentions":1,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉饮完酒，便问宝珠道：「方才这个玉侬，到底是谁？」","en":"When Ziyu had finished drinking, he turned and asked Baozhu: \\"Who exactly was that Yunong just now?\\""},{"paragraph":42,"mentions":1,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"宝珠笑道：「这个要问你的玉侬。」子云笑着唤道：「玉龄！你再来给梅少爷瞧瞧。」只见里面套间内走出一个人来，却是头里那个假琴言，垂手正色，侍立在子云身旁。这假琴言是华公子家八龄班内的一个，名字叫玉龄，本是子云家人，送给华公子。因其面貌有些相像，所以叫回应用。","en":"Baozhu laughed brightly: \\"That is something you must ask your own Yunong.\\" Ziyun, still laughing, called out: \\"Yuling! Come and show yourself again for Master Mei.\\" From the inner suite there emerged a person. It was the false Qinyan from before, standing with"},{"paragraph":43,"mentions":1,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云道：「吾兄若不饮这杯酒，是真怪小弟了。玉龄你替我喝一杯，代我赔罪。」玉龄果将那一杯也斟了，大大的饮了一口。宝珠给他几片春橘过酒，又饮了两口方才饮完。子玉没法，只得一口气饮了一半，吃了些水果。琴言又挤了些春橘水在酒内，然后慢慢的饮干。","en":"drink a cup in my name and make my sincere apologies.\\" Yuling duly poured that cup as well and took a large sip. Baozhu offered him a few sections of spring orange to go with it, and after two more sips he finished. Ziyu, with no way out, drained the first half of his cup in one breath, ate a little fruit, and then, while Qinyan squeezed some spring orange juice into"},{"paragraph":44,"mentions":1,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"心里觉得十分难受，勉强的道：「稍有空闲，即当相聚。」大家送到上车地方，大有依依不舍之意，一直望他车子出了园门，宝珠、琴言也各上车回去。欲知后事，再听下回分解。","en":"of reluctance to part; they watched his carriage until it passed completely through the garden gate, and then Baozhu and Qinyan each mounted their own carriage and departed. What happened next, hear it told in the following chapter."}],"11":[{"paragraph":27,"mentions":2,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"是闺秀口气。我略比你长了几年，就说不到这样秀韵，这真是勉强不来的。」苏小姐只是含笑，又贺了一杯。那边红香低低对宝珠说道：「你听各人行的令，真像各人的语言情性，连相貌都像，这是什么缘故？若教彼此换一个过儿，就便都不像本人了。」宝珠等微笑。袁夫人又取过骰子来，掷了一个观灯十五夜。","en":"responded with a serene smile as another round of wine was shared. Beyond the curtain, Hongxiang leaned close to Baozhu, whispering, \\"Have you noticed? Each lady's verse perfectly mirrors her own voice, her deepest feelings, even her very appearance. If you were to exchange the verses among them, the words would utterly fail to suit the speaker.\\" Baozhu and the other"},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":1,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"词。这几句如见姐姐扶着婢女，一步步的走来，又像姐姐在园里看灯的光景，令人羡慕。」于是各贺了一杯。此时华夫人便叫宝珠等，同着两家的丫鬟到后房去吃饭。","en":"of your garden. It fills the heart with an admiring envy.\\" As they shared celebratory cups, Lady Hua instructed Baozhu and the other attendants to retire to the back rooms with the visiting maids to partake of their own feast."},{"paragraph":42,"mentions":2,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"」红雯笑道：「我是说你的，你闷在心里，不要闷出病来，倒直说了罢。」掌珠把红雯一推，红雯没有留心，往后一跌，靠在宝珠身上，踏了他的金莲。宝珠皱着眉，一手扶在红雯肩上，一手摸着自己的鞋尖，摸了一会。把红雯背上打了两下。众人又笑。","en":"Furious, Zhangzhu shoved Hongwen hard. Caught entirely off guard, Hongwen stumbled backward, crashing heavily into Baozhu and landing squarely upon her tightly bound feet. Baozhu winced in pain, placing one hand on Hongwen's shoulder for balance while frantically rubbing the tip of her embroidered shoe with the other. After soothing the ache for a moment, she delivered"}],"12":[{"paragraph":19,"mentions":1,"tokens":["袁宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"。湘帆可惜有闹相公之名，无闹相公之实。天下相公出在京城，京城相公聚在联锦班。史竹君的《曲台花选》，品题最允，如袁宝珠、苏蕙芳等方配称名花，而且诗词书画无一不佳，直可作我辈良友。若翠宝、玉美等，不过狐媚迎人，蛾眉善妒，视钱财为性命，以衣服作交情，今日迎新，明朝弃旧，湘帆何其孟浪用情若此？」春航听了，半晌不语，俯首而思。仲清道：「足下莫非懊悔赏识错了么？」","en":"capital are assembled in the Lianjin troupe. Shi Zhujun's Opera Stage Flower Selection ranks them most fairly: Yuan Baozhu, Su Huifang, and such as these alone may be called celebrated flowers — and moreover they are accomplished in poetry, lyrics, calligraphy, and painting without exception, truly capable of being our good companions. As for Cuibao, Yumei, and the like,"},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":4,"tokens":["袁宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"围的颜色都说了，问道：「你可识得是那一班的相公？」高品想了一会道：「据你说来，不是陆素兰，就是金漱芳，不然就是袁宝珠。」春航道；「金漱芳在联殊班，我见过他的戏，生得瘦瘦儿的，不是。至于陆素兰、袁宝珠我却不认得，不知到底是谁？」高品道：「袁宝珠是不大穿素色衣裳的。你说这光景，也不大很像陆素兰。要不然是苏蕙芳，不错的，定是苏媚香，那真是冰壶秋月，清绝无尘，生得不肥不瘦","en":"Pin thought for a moment and said: \\"From your description, it must be either Lu Sulan, or Jin Shufang — or else Yuan Baozhu.\\" Chunhang said: \\"Jin Shufang is in the Lianzhu troupe and I have seen his performance — he is rather thin and spare-looking; not him. As for Lu Sulan and Yuan Baozhu, I do not recognize either — I cannot say who this was.\\" Gao Pin said: \\"Yuan Baozhu"}],"13":[{"paragraph":8,"mentions":1,"tokens":["袁宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"的。」蕙芳笑道：「草草涂鸦，不过凑几句白话罢了，会作什么诗？」春航道：「原唱呢，为何不写出来？」蕙芳道：「去年袁宝珠替我写了一幅，人家拿去看，遗失了。」春航再将蕙芳细细的看了一看，又道：「我看你举止清高，吐属娴雅，绝不类优伶中人。你是几时到京来学戏的？」蕙芳脸上便有愧色，叹了一口气道：「问我的出身，原也是清白人家。父亲也曾作过官。」春航立起来道：「失敬了，我原说不","en":"poetry is there in it?\\" Chunhang said, \\"And the original verses — why are they not written out?\\" Huifang said, \\"Yuan Baozhu wrote them out for me last year, and somebody took them away to look at and lost them.\\"\\n\\nChunhang looked him over again, and said, \\"Your bearing is refined and your speech is elegant. You are nothing like a person of the theatre. When did you come up"}],"14":[{"paragraph":9,"mentions":1,"tokens":["袁瑶卿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"。」蕙芳道：「是谁？是我们班里的么？」春航点头说「是」。蕙芳道：「等我想一想象谁？上二句纤腰抱月，星眸妒云，非袁瑶卿不足当此二语。下两句软爱罗轻，娇嫌帐重，非金瘦香却也不称。是他二人么？」春航摇摇头。蕙芳道：「然则是谁呢？」春航道：「还有一人能兼二人之妙，你倒猜不着他。」蕙芳道：「我真猜不着，你老实说了罢。」春航笑道：「我老实说，是个寓言空空的，如果有人像他，就算","en":"resemble? The upper couplet, 'a waist of embracing moonlight, star-eyes jealous of clouds', could only describe Yuan Yaoqing. The lower couplet, 'soft love for gauze, coy dislike of heavy curtains', fits none but Jin Shouxiang. Is it those two?\\" Chunhang shook his head. Huifang said, \\"Then who is it?\\" Chunhang said, \\"There is one person who combines the charms of both, and"},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":1,"tokens":["瑶卿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"来？」南湘道：「你叫相公瞒着我，倒问我从何处来？我今日同了静芳到怡园，他们都在家，留我吃了饭。佩仙也在座，还有瑶卿、瘦香两个。吃完了饭，佩仙家内有人来叫他，度香问起来，方知道是你叫的，我就辞了度香同来。」即指玉林手内的花道：「今日就在那里赏杏花。」又问高品道：「你又几时会弹琴，你要学琴，须我教你。方才这《水仙操》倒也弹得好。」高品道：「我何尝会弹？弹琴的就是田湘","en":"to the Garden of Contentment; they were all at home and kept me for dinner. Peixian was there too, along with Yaoqing and Shouxiang. After dinner, someone came from Peixian's household to fetch him. Duxiang asked about it and that's how I learned you had summoned them, so I took leave of Duxiang and came along.\\" He pointed at the blossom in Yulin's hand and said, \\"We"}],"15":[{"paragraph":7,"mentions":1,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"园唱了一出《定情》。」文泽道：「那个叫杜玉侬？我们怎么也没有见过。」南湘道：「好得很。据度香、静宜品题，似乎在宝珠之上，我却不认得。庾香今日何不同我们去赏鉴赏鉴？」子玉听了，才知不是问他定亲，然却是初出茅庐，不比他们舞席歌场闹惯的了，却躁得回答不出了。文泽再三盘问，只得答道：「这玉侬就是琴言，你们也都见过的。」文泽道：「真冤枉杀人，我们不要说没有见过，连这名字都","en":"it we've never seen him?\\" Nanxiang said, \\"Splendid! According to Duxiang and Jingyi's assessment, he surpasses Baozhu — yet I don't know him. Yuxiang, why not take us today to have a look?\\" Only now did Ziyu understand that this was not about his betrothal; but still, this was his first step out of the thatched cottage, nothing like these worldly habitués of song halls"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":1,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"出极艳来。年纪是十七岁，穿一件莲花色绉绸绵袄，星眸低缬，香辅微开，真令人消魂荡魄。便暗暗十分赞叹，也不在琴言、宝珠之下，只不知性情脾气怎样。外面已送进酒肴来，三人也不推让，随意坐了。素兰斟酒，谓子玉道：「你是头一回来，须先敬你。」子玉接了。","en":"bewitch the soul and stir the spirit. Ziyu secretly praised him greatly: he was in no way inferior to Qinyan or Baozhu. He only wondered what his character and temperament might be. The food and wine were already being brought in from outside; the three sat down without ceremony and helped themselves. Sulan poured wine and said to Ziyu: \\"This is your first visit — I"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":3,"tokens":["瑶卿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"有一日瑶卿在此，我与他说起来，瑶卿便把你们的情节，说了一个透彻。玉侬以后自己也说出来道：「我有些像你，见我如见你一样。」所以时常到我这里来，并不是与我真心相好，不过借我作幅画图小影，你道这情深不深？人家费了这片心，难得你今日来，我所以替他明白明白，教你知道，不","en":"\\"One day Yaoqing was here, and I brought it up with him; Yaoqing then laid out your situation in full. After that, Yunong himself admitted it: 'I am somewhat like you. To see me is to see you.' So it is for that reason that he comes here so often. It is not that he is"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":3,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"那日徐子云也在旗亭送行回来，且不进宅，一径到园，即到次贤屋里，始知次贤在桃花坞赏桃花，还有宝珠、漱芳两个，子云就到桃花坞来。虽是自己园中，也不能天天游览，数日之间，已见桃花开满，烂若晴霞，映着一水盈盈，草茵如绣，真觉春光已满。走进了第三重，始见曲榭之中，次贤与宝珠、漱芳在那里喝酒。见了子云，宝珠、漱芳已迎上来，次贤也笑面相迎。","en":"Cixian's room — where he learned that Cixian was in the Peach Blossom Dell enjoying the peach blossoms, along with Baozhu and Shufang. Ziyun came to the grove at once. Though it was within his own garden, he could not wander through it every day; in just a few days, the peach blossoms had opened in full — blazing like morning radiance, reflected in a clear expanse of water,"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":3,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"次贤问道：「今日送行的人多么？」子云道：「人倒不少，庾香、剑潭送到前站宿店去了，要明日才回。」即指着宝珠笑道：」惟有他们同队中，不见有一个人在那里送行，只怕这位老先生，生平也没有叫过他们。」宝珠笑道：「这位梅大人，每逢戏酒，叫我们也伺候过几回，人倒谦雅的，就总没有赏过一句话儿。倒不料他生出那么一个风流的公子。这梅庾香前日竟在香畹处吃饭，还到玉侬处，没有","en":"him off to the first inn overnight, so they will not be back until tomorrow.\\" He then pointed with a smile at Baozhu: \\"I dare say none of those in their party were here to see him off; I suspect this elder gentleman has never once invited any of them throughout his life.\\" Baozhu laughed: \\"This Lord Mei, whenever there was a theater feast, would summon us to attend"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":6,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这两人既相得了，将来必要找出多少苦恼的事情来，你们慢慢的看着他们罢。」当下这四人喝了一会酒，看了一会花，次贤对宝珠道：「度香所刻那十六个酒令，你们看见没有？」宝珠道：「怎么没有看见。」子云道：「你们今日何不也照这令行几个出来，也见见你们的心思。」宝珠尚未回答，漱芳道：「这个我们只怕行不来，一来心思欠灵，二来这唐诗与《诗经》也不甚熟，那里能说得这样凑拍？除非在家里","en":"— just watch them slowly unfold.\\" The four of them drank for a while and enjoyed the blossoms. Cixian said to Baozhu: \\"Those sixteen drinking-game lines that Duxiang had engraved — have you seen them?\\" Baozhu said, \\"Of course we have.\\" Ziyun said, \\"Why don't you two today compose a few rounds of your own in the same vein? It would give us a chance to see what your"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":3,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「这不是寻烦恼么？」漱芳道：「我且掷着色样再想。」他也掷了好几掷，掷着了「苏秦背剑」，便道：「这更难了。」忽见宝珠问次贤道：「《诗经》上有一句什么永叹？我记不真。」次贤道：「每有良朋，况也永叹。」宝珠道：「有是有了一个，只就是不甚好。」子云道：「你且说来。」宝珠念道：绿暗红稀，梦好更寻难，你晚妆楼上杏花残。懒画眉，况也永叹。","en":"several times before getting \\"Su Qin Turns His Back on His Sword\\" (苏秦背剑). He said, \\"This is even harder.\\" Then Baozhu was seen asking Cixian: \\"There is a line in *The Classic of Poetry* about \\"sighing without end.\\" I can't recall it exactly.\\" Cixian said:\\n\\n\\"'Whenever I have good companions,\\nAll the more do I sigh without end.'\\"\\n\\nBaozhu said, \\"Good, that's one. Only"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":1,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"次贤、子云赞道：「说得很好，第一个就这么通，真是难得。就这《诗经》一句稍差了些，然而也还说得过。」宝珠道：「这《诗经》实在难于凑拍，又要依这个韵，觉得更难了。」漱芳道：「我想的更不好。《诗经》上不是有一句「莫我肯顾」么？」子云道：「有。你快说。」漱芳要念时，重又顿住，觉有些羞涩，次贤又催，只得念道：苏秦背剑，北阙休上书，误你玉堂金马三学士。不是路，莫","en":"first one! Truly exceptional. The one line from *The Classic of Poetry* is slightly less apt, but it still works.\\" Baozhu said, \\"The Classic of Poetry is genuinely difficult to fit rhythmically, and with the rhyme scheme adding another constraint, it gets even harder.\\" Shufang said, \\"What I've thought up is even less polished. Is there not a line in *The Classic of Poetry*"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":3,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云道：「这个说得甚好，竟句句凑拍。」次贤道：「倒实在难为他。」宝珠道：「他的比我好，不比我的杂凑。」便觉两颊微红，大有愧色。子云安慰道：「你的也好，不过你的题目宽泛些，难于贴切。他这苏秦背剑的题目就好，所以比你的容易见长。」宝珠得了这一番宽慰，稍为意解。便又掷了一个「紫燕穿帘」，便道：「这个题目倒好。」便细细的想，","en":"excellently done. Every phrase fits in perfect cadence.\\" Cixian said, \\"It really is a remarkable achievement.\\" Baozhu said, \\"His is better than mine. It leaves mine looking rather mediocre.\\" Yet slight color rose in both cheeks, and there was clear chagrin in his expression. Ziyun offered comfort: \\"Yours is fine too. Only your topic was broader and more general, making"},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":4,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"问我道：「你看见没有？」他方才说的，倒像那昨日的神气。」宝珠也笑道：「今日他又回来了。」漱芳又掷，掷了一个，「花开蝶满枝」。漱芳想了一会，说道：花开蝶满枝，是妾断肠时，我是散相思的五瘟使。蝶恋花，春日迟迟。次贤等大赞道：「这个更好。」宝珠道：「他总比我的说得好，我今日的两个都不及他。」便又掷了一个「打破锦屏风","en":"\\"Have you seen it?\\" His manner just now in reciting that passage was exactly like his frantic demeanor yesterday.\\" Baozhu laughed too: \\"Today it came back again.\\" Shufang threw again and got \\"Butterflies Fill the Blossoming Branches\\" (花开蝶满枝). Shufang thought for a while, then said:\\n\\n\\"Butterflies fill the blossoming branches.\\nThis is the season of my breaking heart.\\nI am"},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":1,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"敲响帘拢。月儿高，何以穿我墉。\\n子云等大赞，子云道：「这个实在妙极了，就在那十六令中也是上等。我们恭贺三杯。」宝珠始为解颜欢喜。漱芳心里又着急起来．恐怕再行，不能及他，便道：「算了罢！实在费心得很，我不掷了。」子云道：「这令原也费心，但只五个，他得了三个。你才两个，你再掷一个罢？」漱芳道：","en":"those sixteen forfeits, it would rank in the top tier. Let us drink three cups in congratulation.\\" Only then did Baozhu truly smile with satisfaction. Shufang began to feel anxious again, fearing that another round would leave him unable to match this, and said: \\"Let's leave it here. It's really quite taxing on the mind. I won't throw anymore.\\" Ziyun said, \\"This game"},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":1,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"用那一句？」子云想了一想，笑道：「《西厢》上可用的恰又不是这个韵。」四人在花下坐了，子云问起琴言今日何以不来，宝珠道：「今日他又替我到堂会里去了。他就有一样好处，他唱戏时并不很留心关目，他那丰韵生得好，就将他自己的神情，行乎所当行，倒比那戏文上的老关目还好些。所以才有人说他生疏，也有人说他神妙。」子云笑道：「以后梅庾香，大约非玉侬之戏不看，非玉侬的之酒不喝的了。","en":"happen not to fit this rhyme.\\" The four of them sat under the flowers; Ziyun asked why Qinyan had not come today. Baozhu said, \\"Today he went again to a private banquet in my place. He has one particular virtue: when he performs, he does not pay close attention to the prescribed stage business; but his natural elegance and charm are such that his own expression and bearing,"}],"17":[{"paragraph":3,"mentions":1,"tokens":["瑶卿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，好极！但不知在何处聚会？」王恂道：「我家亦可，但无花园子，不如前舟园里好。我们主人六个，添上湘帆七个，媚香、瑶卿、香畹、佩仙、静芳、蕊香、瘦香、小梅共是八个，要三席才可坐，醵分之说，不能预定多少，只好办了再算。」众人道：「极是。」子玉便呆呆的。仲清笑道：「庸庵你这差使办得不周到，要讨人怪的。」王恂尚未回答，南湘道：「何所见而言？」仲清道：「你不见庸庵点将，把一","en":"would be better in Qianzhou's garden. With the six of us as hosts, plus Xiangfan, that makes seven; Meixiang, Yaoqing, Xiangwan, Peixian, Jingfang, Ruixiang, Shouxiang, and Xiaomei make eight. We shall require three tables to seat everyone. As for the pooled funds, we cannot fix an amount in advance; we must simply make the arrangements and settle the accounts thereafter.\\""},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":1,"tokens":["袁宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，忽听外面说：「徐老爷同萧老爷来了。」众人一齐出厅迎接，只见子云同了次贤翩翩的，俨似太原公子裼裘而来，后面随着袁宝珠、王兰保二人。再后还有八个清俊书童，拿着衣包、铜盆、漱盂等物。","en":"welcome them; there came Ziyun and Cixian, moving gracefully as scions of great families draped in their furs, with Yuan Baozhu and Wang Lanbao following behind. Further back were eight bright-faced and handsome young attendants carrying clothing bundles, bronze basins, and rinsing vessels."},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":1,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"因此行走不便么；不然，或是又滑倒在车辙里了。」说得众人大笑道：「卓然妙语，待寿翁来罚其三大觞。」蕙芳似觉脸红，宝珠道：「今日的客，尚短几人？」文泽道：「就止寿翁一人。花部中未到的尚有四人：琴言、琪官都有病，早来辞了，桂保、春喜是必来的。等湘帆一到，就可坐了。」","en":"priceless. When the birthday-star arrives, let him be fined three great cups.\\" Huifang seemed to blush slightly. Baozhu said: \\"How many guests are still to arrive today?\\" Wenze said: \\"Just the birthday-star, one person. Among the flower contingent, four are absent: Qinyan and Qiguan are both ill and sent their regrets early this morning; Guibao and Chunxi will certainly"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":1,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话言未完，春航已到，大家重新叙礼，群芳亦都见了，未免取笑的取笑，诙谐的诙谐。宝珠与素兰拉过红毡铺地，摆了两张交椅，要请春航、蕙芳并坐受拜。二人如何肯坐，急行收了。此时春航、蕙芳二人真觉口众我寡，只好听凭他们取笑；若回答两句，又惹出许多话来。子玉颇敬春航仪容之洒落，与蕙芳正是冰壶秋月，相映生辉。又复品评诸花，各有佳妙，只不见琴言前","en":"exchanged greetings afresh, and all the beauties were also introduced. Banter and teasing naturally followed. Baozhu and Sulan drew out a red felt mat and placed it on the floor, setting up two folding chairs, intending to ask Chunhang and Huifang to sit together and receive obeisance. The two of them absolutely refused to sit, so the mat was quickly put away. By now"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":1,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"定完后，王桂保、林春喜来了，皆见过了。正席上令漱芳、玉林、春喜伺候；左席上令宝珠、兰保、素兰；右席上则蕙芳、桂保二人。分派已定，各人坐了，慢慢的浅斟缓酌起来，正是：","en":"arrived and were introduced all around. At the center table, Shufang, Yulin, and Chunxi attended; at the left table, Baozhu, Lanbao, and Sulan; at the right table, Huifang and Guibao. The assignments made, everyone took their seats and began to pour slowly, drinking at a leisurely pace. It was truly:"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":3,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"撤去残肴，备上香茗鲜果。春喜与桂保到太湖石畔，同坐在芍药栏边闲话；玉林、漱芳已醉卧在海棠花下；兰保在池畔钓鱼；宝珠与蕙芳对弈，素兰观局，南湘、高品在傍为宝珠指点。蕙芳道：「你们三人下我一个。就赢了也不算稀奇。」宝珠道：「我偏不用人教也赢得你。」文泽道：「今日我们亦算极乐了，可惜花部中少了两人，那个还不要紧，第一是琴言不来，使庾香不能畅意。」子云道：「可不是！琴言","en":"drunk themselves into a stupor and lay asleep beneath the crabapple blossoms. Lanbao was fishing by the pond. Baozhu and Huifang were playing chess, with Sulan watching the game, while Nanxiang and Gao Pin stood by offering Baozhu advice. Huifang said: \\"Three of you against my one; even if you win it is hardly a surprise.\\" Baozhu said: \\"I can win against you without"},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":1,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"就画一幅群花斗艳图何如！」众皆应道：「妙极！我们何不将人花比拟一回，总要从公，不可各存偏见。」于是大家评定：以宝珠为牡丹，蕙芳为芍药，素兰为莲花，玉林为碧桃，漱芳为海棠，兰保为玫瑰，桂保为芙蓉，春喜小而多才，人人钟爱为兰花。八人品题尽合，因又想到琴言、琪官为何花？子云道：「琴言色艺过佳，而性情过冷，比为梅花最是相称，且其酷爱梅，不属庾香将谁属耶？」众人说道；「很","en":"the people and the flowers, fairly assessed, without personal bias.\\" So they deliberated together and decided: Baozhu as the peony; Huifang as the herbaceous peony; Sulan as the lotus; Yulin as the green peach blossom; Shufang as the crabapple; Lanbao as the rose; Guibao as the cotton rose. Chunxi, small in stature yet richly talented and beloved by all, was assigned"},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":3,"tokens":["瑶卿","宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"极风骚的。」仲清道：「这就是你各处稽察新闻事务的头衔了。」众人又笑了。子云道：「今日一叙之后，盛筵难再。十八日瑶卿移寓，诸同人可以移樽一叙否？」众人皆道：「断无不来之理，如有不到者罚他作一东，再叙一天。」宝珠道；「只怕我没有这脸面，断乎不能全来的。」春航道：「为什么不来？况且你是个花王，这些群花是要来朝贺的。就是我们看花人，赏到国色天香没有不踊跃从事。」南湘道：","en":"Ziyun said: \\"After today's gathering, such a magnificent feast will be hard to convene again. On the eighteenth, Yaoqing is moving to new lodgings; would all the gentlemen be willing to move the wine-jars there for another gathering?\\" Everyone agreed: \\"There is absolutely no reason not to come. Anyone who fails to attend will be fined to host a day's feast, and we'll have"},{"paragraph":30,"mentions":1,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"次贤道：「夜已深了，我们可以散罢。」于是大家各起，宝珠又订十八日之期，皆应允了，风雨不阻，遂各登舆四散。明日蕙芳踵门叩谢，惟有子玉病了，不曾进去。","en":"Cixian said: \\"The night is already deep, so we can disperse.\\" So everyone rose; Baozhu confirmed the date of the eighteenth, everyone agreed, come rain or shine. Then they each mounted their carriages and scattered in all directions. The next day, Huifang went around to call and express thanks; only Ziyu was ill and did not receive him."},{"paragraph":31,"mentions":1,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"到了十八日，果然诸名士并那些名旦都到宝珠新寓来，从午刻起直至子刻止。是日专以行令猜枚，清歌檀板，亦极欢而散。内中子玉因病不到。添了张仲雨，热闹场中最为趋奉的。","en":"On the eighteenth, all the celebrated gentlemen and the celebrated young dan actors did indeed come to Baozhu's new lodgings, from the wu hour until the zi hour. That day the entertainment was confined to drinking games and guessing forfeits, clear singing and clapper-beat, and they dispersed having fully enjoyed themselves. Among them Ziyu did not come owing"}],"18":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说琴言病体恹恹，闭门谢客，只有同班中几个相好时来宽慰。宝珠、素兰又说子玉前日的光景，又不能常来看你，托我们传话，千万保重等语，琴言更加伤感。自患病以来，各处不去，怡园亦屏迹已久。奈其师长庆靠他做个摇钱树，因其久病，不能见客，便也少了好些兴头。","en":"closed to visitors; only a few close friends from the same troupe came by from time to time to offer comfort. Baozhu and Sulan also passed on word from Ziyu, recounting his recent days and explaining his inability to visit often, yet urging Qinyan to take the utmost care of his health. Hearing these messages, Qinyan only grew more heavy-hearted. Since falling ill,"}],"19":[{"paragraph":14,"mentions":3,"tokens":["袁宝珠","宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"机巧扭坏了，琪官这两只手却刮得稀烂，血淋淋的，也就哭骂出来。他因小脑袋疼痛，也就躲了。琪官回去告诉了师傅，他与袁宝珠相好，又告诉了宝珠，宝珠气极，便进怡园与徐老爷说了。徐老爷就大怒道：「天下有这种东西，就容他这么样，这还了得！」又晓得了玉林之事，即着人去向坊里，连夜把玉林要了出来。一面打算告诉巡城都老爷，要搜他那个桶子，办他。徐老爷是个正直人，说话是不知避人的，不","en":"his own vital part in agony, retreated to hide. Qiguan went back and told his teacher; and since he is close to Yuan Baozhu, he also told Baozhu. Baozhu was furious and went into the Garden of Contentment to tell Lord Xu. Lord Xu was outraged and said: 'How can the world contain such a creature, that anyone would tolerate him behaving like this? This is beyond endurance!'"}],"20":[{"paragraph":10,"mentions":3,"tokens":["宝珠","瑶卿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"次贤笑道：「所谓「打鸭惊鸳鸯」，今日见了。」大家正看得有趣，又见船中走出几枝花来。一只船内是宝珠、漱芳，一只船内是蕙芳、素兰，共是五个。舟人把舟泊近阑干，南湘道：「芙蓉未开，水榭减色。有此众芳一渡，庶不寂寞。湘娥洛神，江湄游戏，我度香先生当以玉佩要之。」大家笑了一笑，群旦上来都见过了。次贤道：「你们看静芳窄袖踟蹰的，越显得风流跌宕。竹君之赞语「","en":"was watching with interest, they saw figures stepping out of the boats like blossoming flowers: one boat held Baozhu and Shufang, the other Huifang and Sulan — five people in all. The boatmen moored the craft against the railing; Nanxiang said: \\"The hibiscus has not yet opened, and the water pavilion lacks a certain brilliance. With all this company of flowers making"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":1,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「这园子里共游过几处了？」南湘道：「到却到过许多回，逛却没有逛到。一喝酒就是一天，那里能逛。约有七八处逛过。」宝珠道：「我同瘦香是逛完的了。」蕙芳道：「我就是桂岭、菊畦、兰径没有到过，其余也都逛完。」","en":"session takes the whole day — when would one find time to stroll about? I've been to perhaps seven or eight places.\\" Baozhu said: \\"I have toured it completely with Shouxiang.\\" Huifang said: \\"I haven't been to Osmanthus Ridge, the Chrysanthemum Beds, or Orchid Path; all the rest I've seen.\\""},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":1,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云坐了主位，左右为素兰、宝珠二人。饮酒的话头，无非是那几套，且慢讲他。再看那龙舟已到阁前，盘盘旋旋，来来往往，荡个不了。","en":"Ziyun took the host's seat, with Sulan and Baozhu on either side. The table talk was the usual sort; let us not linger over it. The dragon boat had now drawn up before the pavilion and was circling round and round, coming and going without end."},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":9,"tokens":["宝珠","瑶卿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"张三郎，不瞅不睬的，你且饮这一杯罢。」引得众人笑起来。素兰本待要饮，因为众人一笑，便脸上红晕了一层，便把嘴向着宝珠一呶，说道：「阎婆惜在那边，你叫他饮罢。」宝珠也嗤的一笑。子云又拿一杯对着宝珠道：「如何，你饮不饮？」宝珠接了杯子，对着素兰道：「你上了当了，你看筹上不饮的是阎婆惜，饮的就不是了。」即将酒饮尽。素兰一想，倒被宝珠讨了便宜。再拿那一根筹看时，是蕙芳的。","en":"Sulan was originally going to drink, but the laughter made a flush rise on his face, and he pursed his lips toward Baozhu and said: \\"Yan Poxi is over there — ask him to drink.\\" Baozhu also gave a titter. Ziyun then took a cup and said to Baozhu: \\"What do you say — will you drink?\\" Baozhu took the cup, turned to Sulan, and said: \\"You fell into the trap — look at the tally:"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":10,"tokens":["宝珠","瑶卿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"我们各浮一大白。」于是合席又贺了一杯，更把蕙芳臊得了不得，便道：「从此难星也过完了，等我可以取笑人了。」看筹是宝珠的。那面是：「王婆楼上说风情。」看了注，蕙芳笑道：「今番却有报应了，不料也有人做那好样儿与人看了。」宝珠的脸已经红晕了半边。令是三杯酒：第一杯是敬右邻为西门庆，也做成挑帘的样子，将扇子打西门庆一下，敬这一杯。第二杯要西门庆跪地，一手捏着金莲的鞋尖，敬","en":"\\"From now on my unlucky stars have all passed. Now it will be my turn to laugh at people.\\" The next tally was Baozhu's; the inscription read: \\"Wang Po Discusses Romantic Intrigue Upstairs.\\" Seeing the annotation, Huifang laughed: \\"Now this is karmic retribution — who expected that someone else would also put on a fine show for people to watch.\\" Baozhu's face had already"},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":1,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"蕙芳道：「有人跪了你敬酒，还不好？还要怎样？」宝珠道：「你要人跪你，方才何不代我行了这个令？」此一回酒已饮到红日沉西，也就吃了饭。","en":"Huifang said: \\"Someone knelt to offer you wine — and you're still not satisfied? What more do you want?\\" Baozhu said: \\"If you wanted someone to kneel to you, why didn't you take my tally and perform it for me?\\" This round of drinking lasted until the red sun was setting in the west, and then they had their meal."}],"21":[{"paragraph":11,"mentions":1,"tokens":["瑶卿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"湘帆好一个浓艳文心，愈艳愈好，愈浓愈好。」度香正赞湘帆的文章，庾香忽说道：「玉侬自然在玉艳之上，玉艳虽好，尚逊瑶卿、媚香一筹，而玉侬则玉树琼花，似非人间花谱中可以位置。」静宜、度香初听了不知他说些什么，后来想了出来：「他误听「愈浓、愈艳」，当是问你与琪官那个好？他就所以说出这两句来，惹得静宜、度香笑个不了。庾香也想出错来，便着实不好意思，又支吾遮饰了几句。这么看","en":"you or Qiguan ranks higher — he answered: 'Yunong naturally above Yuyan — Yuyan though fine still falls short of Yaoqing and Meixiang — while Yunong stands like trees of jade and blossoms of pearl — no place on human flower-lists.' Jingyi and Duxiang laughed until they could not stand — Yuxiang saw his error — deeply embarrassed — covered with a few mumbled words — so"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":2,"tokens":["宝珠","瑶卿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"」素兰问道：「那个魏聘才？你因甚骂他？」琴言便将帕子掩了脸，索性哭个不止。素兰只得再三解劝，劝得住了哭，把前日宝珠、蕙芳行的酒令说给琴言听。说瑶卿还罢了，第一媚香尖利不肯吃亏的，偏偏吃了这闷亏；又听得他为潘三缠不清楚，媚香却不肯告诉人，人都传说出来，说媚香也怕他，到湘帆处躲了好几天，如今是交代下人：若是潘三来，总回不在家，又说他床后开了一个门，通得厨房，为避潘三","en":"sleeve and wept without stopping; Sulan coaxed until he ceased, then told the drinking game the other day with Baozhu and Huifang — Yaoqing was middling — Meixiang sharp and unwilling to lose yet had swallowed that dull loss; also how Pan the Third plagued him — Meixiang would not tell — gossip said Meixiang feared him and hid at Xiangfan's for days — now he instructed"}],"24":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"言一出《惊梦》，犹是不识姓名，未通款曲。及怡园赏灯之夕，就有瑶琴灯谜为庾香打着，因此度香就请庾香与琴言相会。闻宝珠讲，那一天先将个假琴言勾搭庾香，庾香生气欲走，而真琴言始出，已是两泪交流，此心全许。以后偏是会少离多，因之成病，人皆猜是相思。即媚香生日这一日，琴言因病不来，庾香便觉着心神不定，后来生起病来。据我看来，庾香即是一个钟情人，也想不出这情苗，从何处发出？","en":"lantern festival at the Garden of Contentment, Yuxiang solved the lute riddle, and Duxiang brought them together. Baozhu mentioned that a fake Qinyan was sent to tease him first, and Yuxiang was so offended he nearly stormed out. Only when the true Qinyan appeared, weeping, were their hearts pledged to one another. Since then, their rare meetings only seemed to breed illness;"},{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"倒像是三生前定，隔世重逢，是呼吸相通的了。此即是庾香、琴言之情根，似已支支节节，布得满地，你尚说没有么？但又闻宝珠讲，琴言留意庾香，已在怡园未会之前，就是初六那一天望见庾香之后，便恍恍惚惚，思及梦寐，这却猜不透，因果之说容或有之。」王恂道：「吾兄之论，如楞严说法，绝无翳障，以此观庾香、琴言之情，正是极深极正，就在人人之上了。若湘帆、媚香之情，较之庾香、琴言，又将","en":"as breath. The roots and branches of their bond already spread in every direction—how can you say none exists? Baozhu claims that Qinyan had taken note of Yuxiang even before the gathering at the Garden of Contentment, wandering in a dreamlike daze ever since catching a glimpse of him on the sixth day of the New Year. That part remains a mystery to me, and perhaps karma"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":1,"tokens":["瑶卿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"脚十个，此外生、净、老、丑有二十余个，是五六班凑成的。」仲清道：「旦脚十个是谁？」桂保道：「我们两个之外，尚有瑶卿、媚香、香畹、静芳、瘦香、小梅，后来又添了玉侬、玉艳，共是十个。」王恂道：「这就是十美班了。」桂保道：「陪客尚未定，你们是一定在数的。听得度香已写书子到保定府去，请前舟回来商议，只怕就是这件事。」王恂道：「也近了，今日已是二十六日了，还有十天，就演得","en":"companies.\\" Zhongqing asked, \\"Who are the ten dan performers?\\" Guibao replied, \\"Besides the two of us, there are Yaoqing, Meixiang, Xiangwan, Jingfang, Shouxiang, and Xiaomei. Yunong and Yuyan joined later, making ten in all.\\" Wang Xun said, \\"That makes a Ten-Beauties company.\\" Guibao added, \\"The guest list isn't entirely settled yet, but you two are certainly included."},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":1,"tokens":["瑶卿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"个却也好几样，内中就是玉侬脾气冷些，其余没有什么脾气。」玉林道：「讲情性风雅，心地聪敏，不慕势利，意气自豪，是瑶卿。一尘不染，灵慧空明，胸有别才，心怀好胜，是媚香。温文俊雅，出言有章，和而不流，婉而有致，要算香畹。言语爽直，风度高超，雅俗咸宜，毫无拘束，是静芳。恬静安详，言语妥贴，是瘦香。","en":"and a keen, penetrating mind—someone who doesn't chase power and possesses a proud, independent spirit—that is Yaoqing. Spotless and bright, harboring a fiercely rivalrous talent, that is Meixiang. For gentle grace, carefully measured speech, harmonious yet firm, and sweetly poised—that would be Xiangwan. Frank talk, a lofty manner, welcoming to both high and low with"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":1,"tokens":["瑶卿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"道：「那一天玉侬没有来，怪不得那位梅公子是无精打采的，话也不说，酒也不喝，略喝了几杯，就出席躺着去了。后约定到瑶卿家里去，他答应了，也没有来。王恂道：「听得前日他倒与素兰、琴言逛了一天运河呢。」桂保点点头道：「口恶！怪不得玉侬回来病就好了。」当下四人说说笑笑，已过了二更，桂保、玉林也要回去，就告辞了，各自上车而回。仲清、王恂又谈了一回，各自回房不提。下回是怡园请","en":"noticeably. He was completely silent, sipped very little, eventually lay down, and though he promised to visit Yaoqing's house, he never came.\\" Wang Xun said, \\"I hear that the other day he spent a whole day on the canal with Sulan and Qinyan.\\" Guibao nodded and clicked his tongue. \\"Well I never! No wonder Yunong came home cured.\\" So the four of them talked and laughed"}],"25":[{"paragraph":13,"mentions":4,"tokens":["宝珠","袁宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"打动锣鼓，只见戏房内婷婷袅袅走出十枝花来，莲步略移，香风已到，捧着牙笏，走到席前边朝上叩了一个头，站起来。先是宝珠、蕙芳、素兰三人上来，又对华公子请了一安，将牙笏呈上。华公子知道这一班小旦都是子云得意人，袁宝珠更是宠爱，天天在园里的，也就世故起来，便搀住宝珠手道：「你们这本戏共演了几天了？」宝珠道：「一个多月了，是各人分开演的，一个人不过三五出戏。」华公子就随意","en":"already wafting — each holding an ivory tablet. They approached the banquet, knelt together, and rose again. First Baozhu, Huifang, and Sulan stepped forward, bowed to Young Master Hua, and presented their ivory tablets. Young Master Hua knew that this troupe of young dan actors were all Ziyun's prized favorites, and that Yuan Baozhu was especially cherished and lived in"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":1,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"大杯，先敬了次贤一杯。次贤自觉得逸兴霞飞，十分得意，即连饮了三大觞。华公子亦陪了三杯。又命家人把酒送到台上，命宝珠、素兰、琴言、蕙芳，各饮三杯，并将席间果品赏了四碟，四旦遥遥叩谢。又劝合席各饮了三大杯。","en":"Master Hua matched him with three cups of his own. He then ordered a servant to carry wine to the stage, commanding Baozhu, Sulan, Qinyan, and Huifang each to drink three cups, and sent four dishes of fruit from the banquet table as a gift; the four dan actors bowed their thanks from afar. He then urged everyone at the table to drink three more great cups apiece."},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":4,"tokens":["宝珠","瑶卿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"将群旦叫上来。群花听了，即荡动兰桨，往水榭边来，上了岸，在阑外雁排侍立。华公子便指名叫了四个进来：蕙芳、琴言、宝珠、素兰。华公子对着四旦说道：「方才《峨嵋山群仙》一出，虽全部出场，未尽态度。你们可将各人得意之戏说一出来。」四旦听了，想了一想，各说了一出。子云道：「此尚非极得意的，只有媚香与香畹的《独占》，瑶卿与玉侬的《惊梦》《寻梦》，都是绝妙无双，人家唱不来的，","en":"and drew up in goose formation beyond the railing. Young Master Hua called four men in by name: Huifang, Qinyan, Baozhu, Sulan. To them he said: \\"In 'Immortals of Mount Emei' just now the whole cast stood forth but not every gesture appeared. Each of you name a piece you do best.\\" The four thought and each named one. Ziyun said: \\"Those are not yet your acme — only Meixiang"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":2,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"杯一杯一杯的不用人让，一连饮了十几杯，尚觉喝采不住，又逼住了文泽饮了三杯，次贤、仲雨饮了五六杯。华公子忽又对着宝珠、琴言说道：「你们尽管唱，唱完了不妨再唱。」又复细细看了一回，对众人道：「此两人各有妙处，正如五雀六燕，轻重适均；\\n赵后杨妃，瘦肥自合。宝珠则柔情脉脉，我见犹怜；琴言则秀骨珊珊，谁堪遣此。离之则独绝，合之则两全。度香仁兄，今日真怡我情矣！」子云见华公","en":"still shouted praise — forced Wenze through three more and Cixian and Zhongyu five or six. Suddenly he turned to Baozhu and Qinyan: \\"Sing on — when done, sing again.\\" He studied them again minutely and told the company: \\"These two each have marvels — like five sparrows and six swallows, weight in balance — Lady Zhao and Consort Yang, lean and plump each right. Baozhu's"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":2,"tokens":["宝珠","袁宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"且说戏台上那两个唱完了，不准下来，还要再唱。宝珠见华公子如此赏识，自然十分高兴。又见他看了一遍，还要再看，心上便越要加些精神，做些态度出来，一来要起公子爱慕之心，二来也与度香脸上增些体面，比起先一出，更唱得出色。这琴言心上却是不愿，只因听华公子是得罪不得的，只得受些委屈。又想起十人中单叫他们两人，","en":"On the stage the two who had finished were not allowed to come down; they were to sing again. Baozhu, seeing how Young Master Hua admired them, was naturally delighted; and seeing that he had watched once and wanted to watch again, he put still more spirit into it and made more of his gestures — partly to catch the young master's fancy, and partly to"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":1,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"看看天色已是将上灯时候，觉得去留两难，又见他跟来的人，都整整齐齐站在阶下，心上要走不走的；又看宝珠、琴言将要唱完，便对子云道：「我还进城罢。」珊枝听了接口道：「将要关城了，公子既要进城，就要快些赶呢。」华公子听了没奈何，只得起身穿戴衣冠，谢了子云，又辞了众人。","en":"lamp-lighting — stay or go tore at him; his train stood in neat ranks below the steps — he half wished to leave; Baozhu and Qinyan were finishing their song — he said to Ziyun: \\"I had better return to the city.\\" Shanzhi cut in: \\"Gates will shut — if you go, hurry.\\" Young Master Hua had no choice — rose, dressed formal wear, thanked Ziyun and took leave of the company."},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":5,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"此时宝珠、琴言已卸装下来送客，华公子执着琴言的手道：「你这戏实在唱得好，可夸京城独步。歇一天你进府来，我还要细细请教。」说着便将身上一块汉玉双龙佩，扣着一个荷包扯下来，给了琴言，琴言请安谢了。华公子已走了两步，忽又回转来对着宝珠道：「你们两个真是棋逢敌手，难","en":"By now Baozhu and Qinyan had washed off greasepaint and came to see guests off. Young Master Hua clasped Qinyan's hand: \\"Your singing tops the capital — rest a day then visit my mansion — I have much to ask in detail.\\" From his waist he unclasped a Han jade paired-dragon"},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":3,"tokens":["宝珠","瑶卿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"今日这十旦，若论头一个得意的，自然是琴言，其次要算宝珠了。宝珠此时却颇欢喜，惟有琴言终是冷冷的。子云便问琴言道：「你今日又得了一个知己。华公子是难得赞人的，你一上来他就留心你，以后又独要你与瑶卿唱戏，他这眼力却也不低，一面之间，就赏识如此，你可感激他么？」琴言把子云看了一看，低着头不言语。文泽道：「玉侬","en":"the ten dan performers that day, the one with most cause for satisfaction was of course Qinyan, and after him Baozhu. Baozhu glowed inwardly; only Qinyan stayed cool as frost. Ziyun asked Qinyan: \\"Today you have gained another connoisseur. Young Master Hua praises hardly anyone, yet from the moment you came up he had his eye on you, and afterwards he would have none"},{"paragraph":30,"mentions":3,"tokens":["瑶卿","宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云知琴言说话生硬，得罪了仲雨，便解释道：「玉侬今日又吃醉了，瑶卿你同他到那边顽顽，等他醒醒酒再来。」宝珠即拉了琴言到里边去了，劝他道：「你说话太直了，那位张二爷也不是好说话的人。」琴言尚是呜咽。宝珠把华公子所赏之物拿出来与他比了，却小一些儿。那边文泽是绝早过来，已坐了一日，酒已过量，也要回去歇息。这十旦伺候了一天","en":"knew Qinyan's blunt words had deeply offended Zhongyu, so he mediated: \\"Yunong has simply drunk too much today — Yaoqing, take him over there to amuse yourselves until the wine wears off, and then come back.\\" Baozhu immediately pulled Qinyan inside and gently chided him: \\"You spoke far too bluntly — that Second Master Zhang is not someone who takes things lightly, you"}],"26":[{"paragraph":5,"mentions":4,"tokens":["袁宝珠","宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"。华公子又问了一遍，珊枝说道：「好是好的，也是徐二老爷钟爱的，听说外边不肯应酬。」华公子道：「徐二老爷钟爱的是袁宝珠，不爱他。」珊枝道：「听见徐二老爷爱他与袁宝珠差不多。又听得说，徐二老爷在他身上已花过好几千银子了。」华公子不语，少顷又说道：「前日我听得魏师爷说起那琴言好得很，我却今日才见。有个什么梅少爷和他最好，徐二爷倒是假的。」珊枝道：「其中的细底，奴才也不知","en":"is also Second Master Xu's darling. Word has it he refuses to entertain anyone else.\\" \\"Second Master Xu favors Yuan Baozhu, not him,\\" the Young Master countered. \\"I hear Second Master Xu cherishes them both equally,\\" Shanzhi replied. \\"They say he has already spent thousands of silver taels on Qinyan.\\" The Young Master fell silent. After a little while, he spoke again. \\"The"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":2,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"到巳正方才起身，净了脸，丫鬟替他梳了发，穿好了衣裳。华夫人恐他酒后伤身，便叫小丫鬟送出一盏参汤，公子吃了。只见宝珠进来回道：「珊枝在外面请示爷，昨晚叫他去请魏师爷，今早要请不要请？」华公子略一踌躇道：「叫他去请魏师爷，到留青精舍吃早饭。」宝珠答应去了。华公子到上房，华夫人晓妆已完，丫鬟侍立两旁。公子见夫人淡扫蛾眉，薄施脂粉，双鬟腻绿，高髻盘云，很有些象那苏蕙芳的","en":"the wine might have harmed his constitution, sent a maid with a bowl of medicinal ginseng soup, which he drank. Baozhu then entered to report, \\"Shanzhi is waiting outside to ask for your instructions. Do you still wish to invite Secretary Wei, as you ordered last night?\\" The Young Master hesitated briefly before replying, \\"Tell him to invite Secretary Wei to breakfast"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":1,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"知道，若长久了，是必定厌恶的。让我弄他进来，叫他受两年苦，方可以出我之气。」主意定了，便又说道：「公子何不就将宝珠、琴言买了进来？配上府里这八个，也成十个了，不是就比外边的班子好么？」","en":"him suffer for two years, and then my spite will be fully vented.' Aloud, he suggested, \\"Why not purchase both Baozhu and Qinyan? Join them with your eight to make ten—would that not easily surpass the outside troupes?\\""},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":2,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"华公子道：「我闻得这两个都是度香所爱，不好去夺他。」聘才道：「度香所爱的是宝珠，琴言不是真喜欢的。公子若当真喜欢他，晚生倒认识，而且常照顾他。他的师傅叫长庆，最爱的是钱，听得公子要，必十分巴结，送上门来的。」华公子倒踌躇不定，心上总碍着徐子云，又因琴言进来，也只得九人，宝珠是断乎不能买的，因此犹豫。聘才再三解说，竭力怂慂，才把","en":"Duxiang's favorites; it would be hard to wrest them away,\\" the Young Master replied. \\"Duxiang truly cherishes Baozhu, not Qinyan,\\" Pincai countered. \\"If the Master desires him, I can assure you it is possible. I know his master, Changqing, quite well, and often patronize his troupe. Changqing loves silver above all else. If he learns the Master wants him, he will crawl"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":1,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"起聘才，聘才把华公子托他之事说了。仲雨道：「怪不得他前天如此高兴，总赏了一百多金子，又将自己的玉佩，给了琴言、宝珠。」","en":"day,\\" Zhongyu said. \\"He bestowed over a hundred gold pieces and even gave his own jade pendants to Qinyan and Baozhu.\\""},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":1,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"老爷，不是我不受抬举，实在孩子怪可怜的。是去年十月才到京，我买了他，一教就会，模样儿也好，差不多最有名的蕙芳、宝珠，也赶不上他。你能猜：","en":"the tenth month of last year. I bought him, and he has been a quick study with a handsome face. Even Huifang and Baozhu at the height of their fame could hardly rival him. You can judge for yourself:\\""}],"27":[{"paragraph":9,"mentions":1,"tokens":["袁宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"斟钟酒，是没有的事。」春林道：「好沉架子，到他家去看他，倒是从不会客的。就是从前的王吉庆、李春芳，如今红字号的袁宝珠、苏蕙芳，也没有这么大架子。要他中意的，才陪着坐一坐；不中意的，简直的不理，赏他东西谢也不谢一声，也没有见他给人请安。」奚十一道：「这么样的相公，没有遇见我。若遇见我时，他要这样起来，我就骂这婊子养的，他能咬掉我的卵子？」仲雨冷笑道：「别说你这奚老土","en":"such airs with it! Go to his house and he never receives anybody. Wang Jiqing and Li Chunfang in their day, or Yuan Baozhu and Su Huifang who are the great names now — none of them ever gave themselves such airs. He will sit down with the ones he takes to; the ones he does not take to he simply ignores. Make him a present and he does not thank you for it, and nobody has"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":5,"tokens":["瑶卿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"事，又没人逼你，且缓缓的想个法儿。」琴言道：「有什么法想？你忘了他们有个魏聘才，肯救我这条命么？只有一句，倒是瑶卿害了我了。」素兰道：「怎么说是瑶卿害你？」琴言又淌了些泪，不言语，素兰疑心，连声的问，琴言叹了口气道：「若使大年初六那一天，瑶卿去唱了那出《惊梦》，我便不上台，也就干干净净，直到如今没什么丢不开的事。偏要我去当灾替死，害得人半年以来，心上没有一刻快乐","en":"think of some way out.\\" Qinyan lamented, \\"What path? Forget Wei Pincai; would he spare my life? It's all because Yaoqing ruined me.\\" Sulan asked, \\"How did Yaoqing ruin you?\\" Qinyan wept mutely, and as Sulan pressed, he sighed: \\"Had Yaoqing sung 'The Interrupted Dream' on the sixth day of the New Year, I wouldn't have mounted the stage. I was clean until then, with no attachments."}],"30":[{"paragraph":12,"mentions":1,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"是罗列着海错山珍，说不尽腥浓肥脆。清谈妙语，佐以诙谐。那边席上，聘才问次贤怡园的光景。次贤略述了几处。随后即见宝珠、蕙芳、素兰、漱芳、玉林、兰保、桂保，春喜、琪官等九个，又凑上一个，作了一出《秦淮河看花大会》，有幽闲的，有妖冶的，有静婉的，有风流的，极尽靡艳之致，众人尽皆喝采。子云、次贤等就于此出中间放了赏。华公子对着笑道：「此系抄袭吾兄旧文，殊觉数见不鲜。」子","en":"Pincai asked Cixian about the sights of the Garden of Contentment. Cixian briefly described a few places. Next came Baozhu, Huifang, Sulan, Shufang, Yulin, Lanbao, Guibao, Chunxi, Qiguan—nine in total—plus one more, performing the play 'Flower-Viewing Assembly on the Qinhuai'. Some were demure, some coquettish, some quiet and gentle, and some romantic, exhibiting the utmost"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":3,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"的口，也掩不住这许多。」蕙芳道：「要掩人口作什么？我也没有怕说的，你们爱说就说罢。」笑着走到那边来敬文泽。那边宝珠，华公子赏了一杯酒，他吃过谢了。华公子道：「今日这出戏也唱得好，淡装浓抹，各有所宜。」宝珠微笑不言，华公子即问蕙芳之事，宝珠笑道：「我不晓得。」华公子笑道：「你们自相卫护，这般可恶，将来总问得出来。」便又叫过蕙芳来，蕙芳只得过来，华公子道：「我是性急","en":"say whatever you like.\\" He smiled and walked over to offer wine to Wenze. Over there, Young Master Hua rewarded Baozhu with a cup of wine, which Baozhu drank before offering his thanks. Young Master Hua said, \\"The singing in today's play was excellent too; whether lightly powdered or heavily made up, each suited their role.\\" Baozhu smiled but said nothing. Young Master"},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":3,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"公子道：「奇怪！居然像个好妇人，今日倒要压倒群英了。」子佩听得众人赞他，略有一分羞涩；又见徐子云身旁站着蕙芳、宝珠，见蕙芳看看他，便凑着子云讲些话，又凑着宝珠讲些话；又见宝珠微笑；又见刘文泽与萧次贤站着，在一处彼此俯耳低言，大约是品评他的意思。原来文泽与蕙芳倒不是讲冯子佩，倒讲的是归自荣。","en":"today he's going to outshine all the beauties.\\" Hearing the praise, Zipei felt a bit bashful. He saw Huifang and Baozhu standing beside Xu Ziyun. Huifang glanced at him, then leaned towards Ziyun to whisper a few words, and then towards Baozhu, who smiled. He also saw Liu Wenze and Xiao Cixian standing together, whispering in each other's ears, probably discussing him."}],"31":[{"paragraph":3,"mentions":2,"tokens":["瑶卿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"画几笔，不必谦让。」诸旦默默无言，子云与文泽站起来道：「妙，妙！待我来分派。」即对着蕙芳道：「媚香是长于诗的，瑶卿是长于丹青的，静芳是长于舞剑的，香畹是长于书法的，佩仙是长于填词的，蕊香是长于猜谜诙谐的，瘦香是长于品箫的，小梅是长于吹笙的。可惜玉侬又病了，他倒会一套《平沙落雁》。」华公子便命叫他起来，又吩咐珊枝拿了琵琶来。家人把些笔砚乐器都搬了出来，分摆在各处。","en":"said, \\"Splendid, splendid! Let us assign the tasks.\\" Turning to Huifang, he said, \\"Meixiang excels in poetry, Yaoqing is skilled in painting, Jingfang is a master of the sword dance, Xiangwan possesses beautiful calligraphy, Peixian is adept at composing lyrics, Ruixiang has a gift for riddles and witty banter, Shouxiang is masterful with the vertical flute, and Xiaomei"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":1,"tokens":["袁宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这边袁宝珠摊了一幅绢在画案上，左右凝思，画些什么呢？","en":"Meanwhile, Yuan Baozhu had spread a piece of fine silk across the painting desk, pondering deeply on what subject he ought to paint."},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":2,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"想了好一回，不得主意。蕙芳、素兰立在面前低低的问道：「你画什么？我们好先定主意，打起腹稿来。」宝珠正想不出头路，便扯着他们走到栏前，商量画些什么才好，限时刻的，又不能用工笔。若写几笔兰竹也不合景。蕙芳道：「我想了一个题目在这里，但不知合你的意否？依我只须画一个小手卷，用黑笔写三两处楼台，加些丛林修竹。远近布置，上面画一个月，用花青水烘他几片彩云烟","en":"\\"What are you going to paint? Tell us, so we might fix upon a theme and begin drafting our poems in our minds.\\" Baozhu, still lacking a clear direction, pulled them over to the railing to discuss what would be best to paint. Time was pressing, so he could not employ the meticulous gongbi style; yet, merely dashing off a few strokes of orchids or bamboo would not suit"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":1,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"笔甚快，毫无拘束，已觉面有喜色。那边蕙芳等三人挤在一处。只见李玉林俯首凝思，素兰把串香珠数个不了，蕙芳只管看着宝珠落笔，尚暗暗的指点他。","en":"close, fearing they might disturb him and spoil the painting. Watching carefully from a distance, Cixian noted that Baozhu's brush moved with swift, unfettered grace, and a look of bright satisfaction had already begun to dawn on his face. Over on the other side, Huifang and his two companions clustered closely together. Li Yulin bowed his head in deep concentration, while"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":1,"tokens":["袁宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"花部中曾受业于香雪者，现有四人：袁宝珠、王桂保、金漱芳、陆素兰，或学画，或学诗，皆为高弟，此四人也共凑百金，连蕙芳的共有四百金。母子二人并一老仆三人，雇舟由运河而回，也就极宽裕了。","en":"Among the pupils in the flower-register who had studied under Fragrant-Snow, four still remained: Yuan Baozhu, Wang Guibao, Jin Shufang, and Lu Sulan. Whether they had studied painting or poetry, all were his advanced disciples. These four pupils pooled together an additional one hundred taels. Combined with Huifang's contribution, the total came to four hundred"},{"paragraph":30,"mentions":1,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"道：「人已齐了，就奠一奠，我们往锦秋墩去逛罢。」蕙芳即将祭筵就叫在那屋里摆起来。蕙芳上香，素兰奠酒，漱芳执壶，宝珠上菜，桂保焚纸，春航、南湘、高品同行了一个礼，五旦连连叩头代谢。","en":"laid out in the room. Huifang offered the incense, Sulan poured the libations of wine, Shufang held the pitcher, Baozhu arranged the dishes, and Guibao burned the paper offerings. Chunhang, Nanxiang, and Gao Pin bowed respectfully in unison, while the five dans kowtowed repeatedly in solemn gratitude."},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":2,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"呢？」蕙芳道：「你几时见鬼吃过人？我前日听那和尚说，每到阴风暗雨的时候，或是夜深，叫的叫，哭的哭，是常有的。」宝珠道：「你们听见怡园闹鬼没有？」蕙芳道：「没有。」素兰问道：「怎么闹鬼？」宝珠道：「看桂花厅一个小使叫春儿，爱吃果子，每逢赏花请客的果子，他捡了藏在一个坛子里。那天晚间，有个大马猴知道了，便来偷吃。春儿睡了，听得满地抛果子响，问又不答。拿灯出来，又照不","en":"howls and the rain is dark, or in the deep hours of the night, strange cries and weeping are a common occurrence.\\" Baozhu asked, \\"Have any of you heard about the ghost haunting the Garden of Contentment?\\" Huifang shook his head, \\"No.\\" Sulan asked eagerly, \\"What kind of ghost is it?\\" Baozhu recounted, \\"There was a page boy named Chun'er in the Osmanthus Hall who had a great"},{"paragraph":33,"mentions":1,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"景之萧条，烟霏霏而欲雨，云黯黯而常阴，不觉悲从中来，泪落不已。众人不解其故，独蕙芳略知其故，亦已泪满秋波。再经宝珠等一问，愈忍不住。念起从前落难光景，若非香雪提携，早已十死八九了，到此不觉的放声一哭，哭得众人个个悲酸。","en":"puzzled by his sudden weeping, but Huifang, guessing the reason, soon found his own eyes brimming with tears. When Baozhu and the others asked what was wrong, Huifang could no longer hold back his sorrow. Remembering his own days of hardship, and realizing that without Fragrant-Snow's guidance, he surely would have perished ten times over, he broke down and wailed aloud,"}],"32":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，是不必说了。」心上要到春航那里去，犹恐见面有些难以为情。意欲报了再去，心上十分焦急，比春航倒还胜几分。一回见宝珠着人来问信，素兰、玉林着人来问信，闹的蕙芳坐立不安。欲到戏园中，恐怕被人钩搭住了，闷闷的歪在炕上，拿本闲书消遣，看了两页又放下。","en":"results before going, but his heart was burning with anxiety, perhaps even more so than Chunhang's. A while later, Baozhu sent someone to ask for news, and then Sulan and Yulin also sent people to inquire, making Huifang so restless he could neither sit nor stand. He wanted to go to the theater but feared getting entangled with someone, so he lay sullenly on the kang, picked"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":1,"tokens":["瑶卿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"此等污秽东西算个孝廉，真辱抹杀多少人。」春航道：「如今世上竟不成事了。你看此中漏网者固多，冤枉者亦复不少。前日瑶卿说，我们同年与他最好，教他画画的那个南京人金粟，本是个名士，性情磊落，大雅不群。因初到京时寄居在某显宦家，也是自不检束，他的跟班与彼内眷有私，竟将相如、文君之事，疑到此君身上，因此辞出。不意这位显宦明于责人，昧于责己，怀恨在胸，借此发挥，将此君亦另案","en":"goes right these days. Look how many slip through the net, while many others are wrongly accused. The other day Yaoqing was saying that the man who is closest to our classmates and teaches him painting, a native of Nanjing named Jin Su, is fundamentally a true scholar who is open and upright, elegant and unworldly. Because he was staying at the house of a certain high"}],"33":[{"paragraph":4,"mentions":5,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"众赶车的喧喧嚷嚷，开让不来。子玉的车下了帘子，与一个车相并，子玉从玻璃窗内一望，却好那人也转过脸来望他，原来是宝珠。子玉见了，不觉一笑，宝珠问道：「你从那里来？还到那里去？」子玉道：「我从城里回来，不到那里去了。」宝珠道：「何不到我寓里谈谈，我们也有两月不见了。」子玉一想回去尚早，也可借此散散，便道：「甚好！」一边车已走开，子玉在前，宝珠在后，同到了门口，下了车","en":"alongside another. Looking through the glass window, he saw the person inside turning to look at him as well—it was Baozhu. Seeing him, Ziyu couldn't help but smile. Baozhu asked, \\"Where are you coming from? And where are you going?\\" Ziyu replied, \\"I'm coming back from the city; I'm not going anywhere.\\" Baozhu suggested, \\"Why not come to my place for a chat? We haven't seen"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":7,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"两枝腊梅，那边还有两盆唐花。壁上所挂字画，皆是前人名迹，绝非世俗纱帽之作。又见一个小地罩内，左边挂一个横幅，是宝珠自己的倚竹图小照，右边挂着四幅小屏，是教他画画的那个金粟画的花卉。子玉看了，不禁一叹，说道：「天下事真是有幸有不幸。你看此等名士，竟遭此劫，天之妒才果如是耶！」因向宝珠道：「我听见人说，你之待此公，与此公之待你，亦不亚于蕙芳之待湘帆。且你于此公失意后","en":"certainly not the typical pieces of common officials. In a small alcove, on the left hung a horizontal scroll of Baozhu's portrait leaning against bamboo, and on the right hung four small screens featuring flowers painted by his art teacher, Jin Su. Upon seeing this, Ziyu sighed softly, \\"There is indeed fortune and misfortune in the world. To think that such a great scholar"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":5,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"躇道：「若吃饭回去就迟了。前日这么大雪，你想必积了些雪水，我们何不煮雪烹茶，请了香畹来作个清谈雅会，不好吗？」宝珠笑道：「很好，到底你总与别人不同。」一面着人去邀素兰，一面吩咐把火盆抬到外间去，将茶炉搬过来，并搬出全副茶具。子玉见地上先放了一个大铜盘，后将一个古铜茶炉座在盘内。那炉约有一尺多高，身圆如斗，下有鼎足，炉身两孔，炉口圆小，从火盆内夹了些焰炭，又加上些","en":"water. Why don't we boil snow to brew tea, and invite Xiangwan for a refined conversation—wouldn't that be nice?\\" Baozhu smiled, \\"Very well, you are indeed different from others.\\" He sent someone to invite Sulan while ordering the brazier to be moved outside and the tea stove brought over, along with the complete set of tea utensils. Ziyu saw a large bronze tray placed"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":7,"tokens":["宝珠","瑶卿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，叫作没有法就是了。」素兰道：「如今见了我们也是生生的，觉得心上总是忧郁不开的光景。」子玉听了，不禁叹了一声。宝珠见水开了，自己于博古厨内取出一个玉茶缸，配了四种名茶，自己亲手泡好了，把盖子盖上。又取出三个粉定茶杯，分作三杯，又将开水添满茶缸，仍旧盖了。子玉道：「要你亲手自制，倒累了。」宝珠道：「你们尝尝，这茶味可好么？」子玉与素兰喝了两口，觉得清香满口，沁入心","en":"like his heart is always clouded with a lingering melancholy.\\" Ziyu listened and could not help but sigh. When Baozhu saw the water boiling, he took a jade tea caddy from the curio cabinet, blended four famous teas, and brewed it himself, placing the lid on. He then brought out three Ding-kiln porcelain cups, divided the tea into three portions, filled the caddy with"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":1,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这已算明白了，怎么又送部呢？」素兰道：「闻说有位巡城都老爷，访得吏目诈赃，改供私放，把这案提上去，送了刑部。」宝珠道：「如今魏聘才是在监里了？应该，应该。但华公子怎么不替他料理呢？」","en":"testimony, and releasing people privately, so he escalated the case and sent it to the Ministry of Punishments.\\" Baozhu added, \\"So Wei Pincai is now in prison? He deserves it. But why hasn't Young Master Hua taken care of him?\\""}],"34":[{"paragraph":21,"mentions":1,"tokens":["袁宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「相公们总不过如此。近来有两个人倒很好，叫他也便宜，而且你还可以常使唤他，相貌也与袁宝珠、苏蕙芳相并。」聘才道：「叫什么名字？」子佩道：「一个叫卓天香，一个叫张翠官。」聘才道：「现在那班里？」子佩道：「在整容班。」聘才道：「整容班这班名很生，我竟没有领教过。」子佩道：「是软篷子里小剃头。」聘才笑道：「呸！你怎么说这些人？」子佩道：「你别","en":"them is cheap, and what is more, you can send for them whenever you please. In looks they stand comparison with Yuan Baozhu and Su Huifang.\\" Pincai asked, \\"What are their names?\\" Zipei said, \\"One is called Zhuo Tianxiang, the other Zhang Cuiguan.\\" Pincai asked, \\"Which troupe are they in now?\\" Zipei said, \\"The Zhengrong troupe.\\" Pincai said, \\"The Zhengrong troupe—that name"}],"35":[{"paragraph":7,"mentions":1,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉看时，才知道明日是宝珠的生日，请名士、名旦在他寓里一叙，子云便要在他园里辰刻毕集。子玉作了回札应允。","en":"Upon reading it, Ziyu learned that the following day was Baozhu's birthday. Famous scholars and performers were invited to gather at Baozhu's residence, and Ziyun wanted everyone to assemble at his garden by the chen hour. Ziyu wrote a reply accepting the invitation."},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":1,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"高，一块四尺余高。有一株大玉兰花，树身已有一抱有余，就倚着那块大石。那小石边也有一棵红茶花，是千层起楼的，名为宝珠山茶，已有六尺多高，开出千朵红花，娇艳无比。就在那里起了二十四间房子，把这两棵花围在中间。又添了些玉兰、山茶、迎春等花，芬芳满院。","en":"Beside the smaller stone grew a red camellia tree of the \\"thousand-tiered rising tower\\" variety, known as the Baozhu Camellia. Already over six feet tall, it bloomed with a thousand red flowers of unparalleled beauty. Twenty-four rooms had been built right there, enclosing these two flowering trees in the center. Additional magnolias, camellias, and winter jasmines"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":1,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"里面即刻了十二个花神，系嵌在墙上。次贤因宝珠命名之意与此相同，故要在此处。且厌平时酒菜不能翻新，三日前即把酒菜器皿通身亲手检点，意欲与平日不同。是日绝早即将子云行厨挪到仙馆厢房里来。次贤每一样菜开一个做法，怎样烹调，怎样脍炙，油盐酱醋各有分量。费了一日心，配成三十二样菜。","en":"Inside, twelve Flower Deities were carved into the walls. Because the meaning of Baozhu's name resonated so well with this setting, Cixian insisted on hosting the gathering here. Furthermore, dissatisfied with the inability to innovate ordinary banquet dishes, he had personally inspected the wine, food, and utensils three days in advance,"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":2,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"是日名旦中有几个不得来，都有堂会戏，不能分身。宝珠之外，来的是蕙芳、素兰、玉林、漱芳四人。这边名士，怡园二位之外，是刘文泽、颜仲清、王恂、田春航、梅子玉五人。共十二人。众客到齐，宝珠先叩谢了。","en":"attend that day, as they all had private theatrical engagements and couldn't be in two places at once. Besides Baozhu, the attendees were Huifang, Sulan, Yulin, and Shufang—four in total. On the side of the famous scholars, apart from the two hosts of the Garden of Contentment, there were Liu Wenze, Yan Zhongqing, Wang Xun, Tian Chunhang, and Mei Ziyu—five in total."},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":4,"tokens":["瑶卿","宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"庾香，此诗如何，可好么？」子玉道：「诗意甚好，但何以单刻这一首，想是新咏。」子云道：「这是玉侬近日怀梅崦的诗，瑶卿抄了他的出来，也是个望梅止渴的意思，我故把他刻了。真是花是人非，吾兄尚忆去年否？」几句话提起子玉的心事，不觉一阵悲酸，忍住了，也不言语，走开了。仲清道：「玉侬近日也学做诗了？」宝珠道：「我搜他的，已有二十余首，就不肯给人瞧，这首是无意中看见的。」大家","en":"one poem? It must be a new composition.\\" Ziyun explained, \\"This is Yunong's recent poem longing for Plum Knoll. Yaoqing copied it out for him. It's meant to quench his thirst by gazing at plums, so I had it carved. Truly, the flowers remain but the people have changed—do you still remember last year, brother?\\" These few words struck a chord in Ziyu's heart, bringing a"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":1,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"了，走到王恂面前住了。文泽道：「怎么我叫他就不灵？」重新拿了过来放在面前，又说了一遍，那杯子又往下首走去，到了宝珠面前住了。文泽道：「作怪。」子玉道：「此中必有原故，你摸不着。」众人皆猜不出机巧。只见次贤又把杯子取了过来，又说：「敬刘老爷一杯。」那杯子又往文泽面前来了。文泽奇得了不得，说道：「你能个个走到我才佩服，不然也是碰着的。」次贤道：「合席都要走到的。」于","en":"work when I call it?\\" He brought it back in front of himself and repeated the command, but the cup rolled down to Baozhu and stopped. \\"How bizarre,\\" Wenze muttered. Ziyu said, \\"There must be a hidden trick to this that you haven't grasped.\\" None of the others could guess the secret. They watched as Cixian retrieved the cup and said again, \\"A cup for Lord Liu.\\" The cup"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":4,"tokens":["瑶卿","宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"叫不应他。」子玉把酒饮了，细看轮盘里，已懂了八分，便笑道：「我也来试试，不知灵不灵。」斟了酒，说道：「这杯酒敬瑶卿！」那杯子便对着宝珠走来，走到面前，碰着箸子住了。蕙芳拍手笑道：「又一个人知道了。」子玉也甚欢喜，宝珠饮了酒，便道：「我是不服，偏要想想。」子玉又将杯子拿起来细看，被宝珠一手抢来，四面揣摹。仲清便问子玉道：「你怎么看出来的？」子玉道：「待我再试一试。","en":"most of it, smiled and said, \\"Let me try too and see if it works.\\" He poured the wine and said, \\"This cup goes to Yaoqing!\\" The cup rolled directly toward Baozhu, stopping right in front of him, bumping against his chopsticks. Huifang clapped his hands and laughed, \\"Now someone else has figured it out.\\" Ziyu was also very pleased. After Baozhu drank the wine, he said, \\"I"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":2,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"里就有这些凑巧数目飞出来？」文泽道：「你们也能，只怕唐诗还比我们熟些。如果那数目飞不出来，便照数目多少罚酒。」宝珠道：「譬如要飞十二，飞不出就要罚十二杯么？」文泽道：「自然。」子云道：「这也过多，且到临时再斟酌罢。前舟你且起令，看飞到谁。」文泽道：「我们坐在东边的，转过去自下而上，你们在西边的，须自上而下，方顺手。」次贤道：「不差，请先喝令杯。」便斟了一杯，走到","en":"better than we do. If you can't come up with the number, you simply drink penalty cups equal to that number.\\" Baozhu asked, \\"For instance, if I have to recite twelve and can't, do I have to drink twelve penalty cups?\\" Wenze confirmed, \\"Naturally.\\" Ziyun interjected, \\"That's too much; let's deliberate on it when the time comes. Qianzhou, start the game and let's see"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":2,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"烛背。」春航喝了，道：「好个「罗帐四垂红烛背」，香艳无比。」把酒喝了，即斟了酒，念道：「刺绣五纹添弱线。」数到宝珠。宝珠喝了酒，说道：「六字本来少，偏轮到我，只怕要罚酒了。」子玉道：「六字亦有。」","en":"poured another, and recited, \\"Embroidering five patterns requires adding delicate thread.\\" The count landed on Baozhu. Baozhu drank the wine and said, \\"Lines with the word 'six' are already rare, and of course it lands on me. I'm afraid I'll have to drink a penalty.\\" Ziyu encouraged, \\"There are indeed lines with 'six.'\\""},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":3,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"宝珠想了一会，道：「此句是谁喝酒，我没有算过。」念道：「床上翠屏开六扇。」数到玉林，玉林道：「这句不要是你编的。」素兰道：「你还说天天念诗，连花蕊夫人《宫词》都不记得了。」玉林笑道：正是。我恐怕他有心要我喝酒。」便喝了道：「要说七字了。」想了有半刻工夫，","en":"Baozhu thought for a moment and said, \\"I haven't calculated whose turn this line will land on.\\" He recited, \\"On the bed, the emerald screen opens six panels.\\" The count landed on Yulin. Yulin quipped, \\"I hope you didn't just make this line up.\\" Sulan teased,"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":2,"tokens":["宝珠","瑶卿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"漱芳也只得喝了一杯。宝珠喝了，想了一会，飞出一句道：「南陌青楼十二重。」飞到子玉。子玉喝了酒，道：「已经十二了，还要飞吗？」次贤道：「座中媚香还没有轮到。轮到了他，我们再换令罢。如今只可飞十三了。」子玉飞出一句是：「娉娉袅袅十三余。」飞到了仲清，仲清喝了酒，想了一想道：「这","en":"Shufang had no choice but to drink a cup. Baozhu drank his, thought for a moment, and recited a line: \\"On the southern path, the green towers stand twelve tiers high.\\" It landed on Ziyu. Ziyu drank the wine and asked, \\"We're already at twelve, do we still need to continue?\\" Cixian replied, \\"It hasn't"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":1,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"不联者，罚三杯。如美人应用何花，筹上各自注明，不得错用。」大家看了一看，说道：「此令太难，一时如何集得起来？」宝珠、蕙芳道：「此令我们是不能的，只好你们七个人去行。」仲清道：「倒是集《毛诗》凑花名不易。若说唐诗要飞两句，也不过与方才的数目差不多。」","en":"upon it; substituting them is not permitted.\\" Upon hearing the rules, everyone said it was extremely difficult. Baozhu and Huifang said, \\"We won't be able to play this. It's better if only you seven gentlemen play.\\" Zhongqing said, \\"The hardest part is matching the flower names from the *Mao Shi*. Composing the two Tang lines shouldn't be much harder than our previous"},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":1,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"个天之类，两句中也须还他两个人字、两个天字，如人人、天天等字更佳，各人贺双杯，说不出罚三杯，余皆照此。」蕙芳、宝珠听明了，又说了一遍道：「也不容易，幸亏我们的曲子，还有几枝在肚里。」子云谓次贤道：「索性叫香畹、佩仙坐到这里来，好在一处掷骰，我们与他二人换个坐儿。」次贤、子云与玉林、素兰换了坐位。","en":"two congratulatory cups from each person; anyone unable to produce the lines must drink three cups.\\" Huifang and Baozhu repeated the rules, noting it wasn't easy, though they still had many lyrics committed to memory. Ziyun then instructed Cixian to have Xiangwan and Peixian switch seats so the performers could roll the dice in one designated area, and the seating was"},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":1,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"只见宝珠掷了两个二，便念道：「今夜凄凉有四星。」众人大赞道：「这句实在巧妙，全不费力。」各贺一杯。春航掣了颜色门的，美人名红拂，花名是个连理花。亦想了一回，说道：「我上句用韦庄，下句用杜，合着是：千枝万枝红艳春，钓竿欲拂珊瑚树。花名是「既溥既长，春日载阳。」","en":"Just then, Baozhu rolled double twos and recited: \\"'Tonight, in this desolation, there are four stars.'\\" Everyone enthusiastically praised it: \\"This line is truly clever and effortless.\\" They each toasted a cup. Chunhang had drawn a lot from the colors category, featuring"},{"paragraph":35,"mentions":1,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"丑了。」掣了一根，是花木门的，美人名莲香，花是连理花。子云心上要想两句好的出来，不肯轻说。一面看着他们掷骰，见宝珠掷了一个二四，想了一想，念出《春睡》上的曲文道：「星眼倦摩呵，一片美人香和。」子云道：「好！也该贺。」大家各贺了一杯。漱芳又掷了个么二，也想了一想，念道：「月上东墙，最可人星明月朗。」子云道：「好！该贺一杯。」众人喝过。文泽道：「你自己令也应交卷了，","en":"truly fine lines, he didn't speak hastily, polishing his thoughts while watching the others roll the dice. He saw Baozhu roll a two and a four, and after a moment's thought, Baozhu recited a lyric from *Spring Sleep*: \\"'Starry eyes rub with fatigue; a whole sheet of beauty-fragrance blends.'\\" Ziyun praised, \\"Excellent! That deserves a toast.\\" Everyone raised a cup. Shufang"},{"paragraph":36,"mentions":1,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"宝珠将眼睛看了子云一看，心中若有所思。次贤道：「不是这两字，也与庾香一样可以贺三杯。子云等诸位喝两杯也罢了。」再说花名道：「南有乔木，堇荼如饴。木堇是连理花。」众人道：「这两句却自然，该贺两杯。」这一天大家思索也都乏了，都要吃饭。子云道：「尚早，再看他们","en":"Baozhu cast a thoughtful glance at Ziyun. Cixian continued, \\"Even without a perfect match on those two characters, his lines are just as worthy of a three-cup toast as Yuxiang's. But let's settle for Ziyun and the rest of us drinking two cups.\\" Ziyun then announced"},{"paragraph":37,"mentions":4,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"于是轮到宝珠，掷了一个重二，即念《密誓》上一句道：「问双星，朝朝暮暮，争似我和卿。」众人说妙，又贺了一杯。大家看着宝珠一笑，宝珠不觉脸上一红，于是大家更笑起来，宝珠亦只得垂头微哂。不觉又到漱芳，已是每人轮了三次，也要收令了，掷了一个重四，也就念《窥浴》的曲子道：","en":"When it was Baozhu's turn, he rolled double twos and recited a line from *The Secret Vow*: \\"Ask the twin stars—morning and evening, how can they compare to you and me?\\" Everyone praised it as wonderful and toasted him a cup. They all looked at Baozhu and smiled. Baozhu,"}],"36":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"前回书讲的宝珠生日，在怡园乐了一天，正是人生悲乐不同。却说琴言在华府，因元宵之日，华公子命其与八龄演戏，是日琴言身子不快，且兼感伤往日，是以神情寂寞，兴致不佳。","en":"The last chapter told of Baozhu's birthday and their joyful day at the Garden of Contentment, showing how the joys and sorrows of human life vary. Meanwhile, at the Hua estate, on the day of the Lantern Festival, Young Master Hua had ordered Qinyan and the Eight-Ages boys to perform"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":1,"tokens":["袁宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"只见众人纷纷的忙乱，伍麻子捧了一包孝衣进来。又见袁宝珠、苏蕙芳、陆素兰来了，琴言即忙招接三人，一同坐下。","en":"Outside, amidst the bustling crowd, Wu Mazi brought in a bundle of mourning clothes. Then Yuan Baozhu, Su Huifang, and Lu Sulan arrived. Qinyan quickly welcomed them, and they sat down together."},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":3,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"问了他师傅的事，然后问起他新年光景。琴言略将近事说了几句。宝珠道：「你既回来，告了几天假？」琴言道：「早上是林珊枝来告诉的，我也没有见着公子，说办完丧事就回去，也没有限定几天。」素兰道：「总得告一个月的假，等出了殡才可进去，不然也对不住你师娘。」琴言道：「可不是。」蕙芳道：「索性告假告个长假，不去也罢了。究竟你","en":"about his teacher's passing, then asked about his life since the New Year. Qinyan briefly recounted recent events. Baozhu asked, \\"Since you're back, how many days of leave did you get?\\" Qinyan replied, \\"Lin Shanzhi came to tell me this morning. I didn't see the young master myself. He only said to return after the funeral, without specifying how many days.\\" Sulan said,"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":3,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"闹，是什么剃头的，又是什么大和尚、小和尚，开赌宿娼，闹得不像。张仲雨也不与他往来了。」 　　 琴言问起子玉来，宝珠道：「前日我们在怡园叙了一日。」便将前日怎样喝酒，怎样行令，次贤新制的酒壶、杯子都说了，琴言着实羡慕。又说那首诗，度香也刻了，庾香见了怎样思念感伤的神色，一一说给琴言，琴言听了也就感伤起来。蕙芳道：「你既回来，少不得我们要快聚几天，不知明日可以不可以","en":"prostitutes. It's a disgrace. Even Zhang Zhongyu no longer associates with him.\\" When Qinyan asked about Ziyu, Baozhu recounted, \\"The day before yesterday, we spent the whole day together at the Garden of Contentment.\\" He described how they drank, played games, and used Cixian's newly designed wine pots and cups, making Qinyan deeply envious. He also mentioned the poem"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":1,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"到了明早，宝珠着人送了信来，道：「本定今日，因度香有事，遂改明日辰刻在怡园叙集。」琴言应了，梳洗毕，独坐凝思：「今日空闲无事，不如去看看庾香罢。」因想去年梅夫人待的光景，去谅也无妨。主意定了，换了一身素服，吩咐套了车，一面告诉师娘去谢谢同班的人。到了外间，忽然又转","en":"The next morning, Baozhu sent a message: \\"We originally planned for today, but Duxiang has matters to attend to, so we've changed the gathering at the Garden of Contentment to the chen hour tomorrow.\\" Qinyan agreed. After washing up, he sat alone in thought: \\"Since I have nothing"}],"37":[{"paragraph":4,"mentions":6,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"个人中花来，不是你爱花不爱人么？」子云笑道：「你不过是这么说呀，前日约得好好儿的，怎么此刻还不见来呢？」少顷，宝珠、桂保来了，见过了。子云道：「怎么这时候还只得你们两个人来？」宝珠道：「今日恐有个不能来。玉侬还没有来吗？」桂保道：「今日联锦是五包堂会，联珠是四包堂会。大约尽唱昆戏，脚色分派不开，我们都唱过一堂的了。」王恂道：「何以今日这么多呢？」桂保道：「再忙半","en":"mean! We made perfectly good arrangements the other day, so why have they not arrived yet?\\" A short while later, Baozhu and Guibao arrived and exchanged greetings. Ziyun asked, \\"Only the two of you, even at this hour?\\" Baozhu answered, \\"I fear some may be unable to attend today. Has Yunong not arrived either?\\" Guibao explained, \\"Today Lianjin has five private engagements"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":3,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这样，今日却要倒转来。」便拉定琴言坐了首席，子玉并之。桂保坐了二席，王恂并之，不准再逊，逊者罚酒十杯。子云又叫宝珠坐在上面，宝珠要推时，见蕙芳来了。子云道：「好，好，你来坐了，次贤相并。」蕙芳不肯坐在次贤之上。次贤道：「今日所定之席，皆是你们为上，我们为次，你不见已定了两位吗？」蕙芳只得依了，下面宝珠也只得坐在子云之上。坐定了，王恂笑道：「外边馆子上，若便依这坐","en":"alongside. There was to be no more yielding places: anyone who tried would have to drink ten cups. Ziyun then called on Baozhu to sit in the upper position. Just as Baozhu was about to decline, Huifang arrived. Ziyun welcomed him warmly, \\"Splendid, do sit down, Cixian will be beside you.\\" Huifang was reluctant to sit above Cixian, but Cixian reassured him, \\"Today's arrangement"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":1,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"宝珠看琴言的眼睛似像哭肿的，想是为师傅了。子云也看出来，太息了一声道：「玉侬真是个多情人，长庆待他也不算好，他还哭得这样，这也难得。」众人尽皆太息。琴言听了，触起昨日的气来，便脸有怒容。又见子玉在旁，总是为他而起，他一阵酸楚，流下泪来。众人齐相劝慰，殊不","en":"Baozhu noticed that Qinyan's eyes looked swollen from weeping and guessed it must be on account of his teacher. Ziyun had also noticed this and sighed quietly. \\"Yunong is truly a tender-hearted soul,\\" he said. \\"Changqing did not treat him particularly well,"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":1,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，你说的是主字，连上犬字，不是骂他吗？」蕙芳也笑。子云骂桂保道：「你这小狐精，近来很作怪，偏有这些油嘴油舌。」宝珠道：「我有个木字，加一划是本字，移上去是未字。」子云笑道：「我有个脱胎法，未字减一笔是木字，移下去是本字。」众皆大笑。","en":"chided Guibao, \\"You little fox-spirit! You've been full of mischief lately, with that slick tongue of yours.\\" Baozhu chimed in, \\"I have one: take the character for 'wood' (木), add a stroke to make it 'root' (本), and move it to the top to make it 'not yet' (未).\\" Ziyun laughed, \\"I have a variation on that: take 'not yet' (未), remove a stroke to make 'wood' (木), and move"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":2,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"字，移上去是干字。」大家说道：「好。」蕙芳道：「我有个杳字，加一笔是查字，移上去是香字。」众人赞道：「更好！」宝珠道：「我有个丁字，加一笔是于字，移上去是亍字。」子云道：「这字却冷些。」子玉道：「也可用。」宝珠道：「彳亍二字也不算冷。」琴言道：「我有个卜字，加一笔是上字，移上去是下字。」次贤道：「这个好得很。」桂保道：「我有个白字，加一笔是自字，移上去是百字。」","en":"'investigate' (查), and move it to the top to make it 'fragrant' (香).\\" The company praised this one even more highly. Baozhu suggested, \\"I have the character 丁, add a stroke to make it 'in' (于), and move it to the top to make it 'step' (亍).\\" Ziyun said, \\"That character is rather obscure.\\" Ziyu countered, \\"It is acceptable enough.\\" Baozhu defended it, \\"彳 and 亍 aren't so very"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":2,"tokens":["瑶卿","宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"次贤道：「很好，就请庾香、玉侬先对起来。」子玉道：「还是你与媚香先对，次度香、瑶卿，次庸庵、蕊香，末后轮到我们罢。」子云道：「也罢，你作个先锋，他作个后劲，把我们放在中间，容易讨好些。」次贤道：「头难，头难，我一时想不出好的。我前日见瘦香的《题曲》唱得甚好，就出《题曲》罢。」蕙芳道：「《题曲》就可以对《偷诗》。」宝珠道：「将现成人","en":"Yuxiang and Yunong start.\\" Ziyu suggested, \\"It would be better if you and Meixiang go first, then Duxiang and Yaoqing, then Yong'an and Ruixiang, and we shall go last.\\" Ziyun agreed to this arrangement, \\"You take the vanguard, and he brings up the rear; that leaves us in the middle, where it is easier to make a good showing.\\" Cixian said, \\"Hard to begin, hard to begin!"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":2,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"应子云出对了，子云出了《踏月》的上对，宝珠想了一想，对了《扫花》。桂保道：「好极了。」子云道：「论对却好，但两个字似乎平仄都要相配，扫字也是仄声。此中稍欠工稳。」次贤道：「你却论得是。据我想来，戏目虽多，内中可对者却也甚少，下一字须讲平仄，上一字尚可恕，不比泛对故实，可以随我们去搜索，此是有","en":"Ziyun's turn to put forward a title, and he offered the first half of a couplet: *Treading on the Moon* (踏月). Baozhu thought for a moment and paired it with *Sweeping Flowers* (扫花). Guibao said, \\"Excellent.\\" Ziyun said, \\"The pairing is good in terms of meaning, but when two-character opera titles are matched, the level and oblique tones should contrast. 扫 (sweep),"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":1,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"蕙芳道：「势字怎么对得牝字？」子玉一想，不觉抚掌大笑道：「妙极，妙极！就是势字才可对得牝字，真是绝对。」琴言与宝珠尚未明白，子云、王恂也想出来了，也笑起来，赞道：「真好心思，把这两字当这两件东西，真是异想天开了。」四旦尚未想出，蕙芳犹呆呆的想，王恂道：「你们尚未想着，你们不知男子阳为势吗？」蕙芳等恍然大悟，便都笑起来，都也说好。蕙芳真喝了三杯，余皆贺一杯。","en":"laughing. \\"Marvellous, utterly marvellous! Only 势 could possibly pair with 牝. A truly perfect match.\\" Qinyan and Baozhu had not yet understood it. Ziyun and Wang Xun, having worked it out, also began laughing and said, \\"A brilliant conceit, to treat those two characters as those two things: a truly inspired stroke of imagination.\\" The four performers had not yet grasped"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":2,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云出了《打店》，宝珠对了《逃关》。宝珠出了《抢娇》，子云对了《杀惜》。都为工稳，贺了一杯。王恂出了《草桥》，桂保对了《麻地》，忽又说道：「这地字还差半个字，我改作《絮阁》罢。」王恂道：「这《絮阁》借对得好，可贺半杯。」桂保出了《花婆》，王恂想了一会，对了《火判》。大家已","en":"Ziyun then offered *Attacking the Inn* (打店), and Baozhu matched it with *Fleeing the Pass* (逃关). Baozhu proposed *Seizing the Beauty* (抢娇), which Ziyun matched with *Killing Poxi* (杀惜). Both were judged good matches and toasted with a cup. Wang Xun brought forth *Grass Bridge* (草桥), and Guibao paired it with"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":5,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"又到子云，子云出了《跌雪》，宝珠道：「这个宽了，便宜了我。」既又说道：「这个跌字也不容易。」遂想了一想，对了《堕冰》。一齐赞好，道：「好个《跌雪》、《堕冰》，真是一副好对，是一意化作两层法。」蕙芳谓宝珠道：「你想个难的给他对。」宝珠点点头。子云道：「你何故要他难我，无非想我罚杯酒。","en":"It came round to Ziyun again, and he offered *Tumbling in the Snow* (跌雪). Baozhu said, \\"That is a broad one, making it easy for me.\\" He quickly added, \\"Though the word 'tumble' is not so easy either.\\" After a moment's thought, he matched it with *Falling on the Ice* (堕冰). Everyone praised this in unison, \\"What a fine pair! *Tumbling"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":4,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，易字好似信字。」大家齐声赞道：「这个更好，该贺双杯。」各贺了。子云道：「《见鬼》。」大家没有留心。停了一会，宝珠催其出对，子云笑道：「你倒不对，还来催我。」宝珠道：「你还没有出对，叫我对什么呢？」子云道：「我方才说的《见鬼》，就是这对。」宝珠一想，果然有这个戏目，便对了《离魂》。子云点点头道：「对也对得好。」贺了半杯。宝珠出了《吃糠》，子云对了《泼粥》。","en":"double cups.\\" And so they toasted. Ziyun said, \\"*Seeing the Ghost* (见鬼).\\" No one paid attention. After a pause, Baozhu pressed him to produce a title. Ziyun laughed, \\"You haven't answered, and now you're hurrying me?\\" Baozhu countered, \\"You haven't given a title. What am I supposed to match?\\" Ziyun said, \\"I said it just now: *Seeing the Ghost* (见鬼) is my title.\\" Baozhu"}],"38":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云因屈道生是个高雅好静的人，名旦中止叫了四个，宝珠、漱芳、蕙芳、素兰。漱芳有恙不能前来，格外又知会了琴言。是日屈公先到，与子云、次贤叙了好些旧话。","en":"Qu Daosheng was a man of refined tastes who preferred quieter company, Ziyun had invited only four performers: Baozhu, Shufang, Huifang, and Sulan. Shufang was indisposed and unable to attend; as an added guest, Qinyan was also notified. That day Master Qu arrived first and spent a good while in conversation with Ziyun and Cixian, catching up on old times."},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":1,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"抗礼。」才定了仲清。东席第二是南湘，西席第二是春航。东席第三是子玉，西席三是文泽。子云东席作主，次贤西席作陪。宝珠、琴言在东，蕙芳、素兰在西，一一坐了。主人让酒，客皆饮了几杯。道生道：「我将前日先见的苏媚香谈起。」西席的人个个细听。道生道：「我这看相不论气色，部位是要论的，然尚在其次。我看全身的神骨、举止行动、坐相、立相，并口音言语，分人清浊，观人心地，以定休咎","en":"Ziyu; third on the west was Wenze. Ziyun presided at the east table while Cixian acted as second host at the west. Baozhu and Qinyan sat on the east side; Huifang and Sulan on the west. Everyone took their places. The host circulated wine and the guests each drank a few cups. Qu said, \\"I shall begin with Su Meixiang, whom I met the other day.\\" Everyone at the west table"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":1,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，他一二年内，必有一番作为，就要改行的。后来收成怎样，此事还远，我也不必说。若说，静宜又要驳我了。」再看素兰、宝珠，大致相仿，与蕙芳也不差什么，就没有讲他们出身。又道：「出污泥而不滓，就是他们三人的大概了。」看到了琴言，道生道：「这位有些不像，如今还在班里么？」次贤道：「现在班里，而且是个五月榴花照眼明，雅俗共赏，是个顶红的。」琴言笑了一笑。道生道：「雅或有之，","en":"far off, and I shall not venture to say. If I did, Jingyi would dispute me again.\\" He then looked at Sulan and Baozhu — their general qualities were much the same — and at Huifang as well, finding no great difference; for these three he made no comment about their origins. He said, \\"Emerging from the mud unsullied — that is the general impression these three give.\\""},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":1,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"有些对戏目的对子。」道生道：「有数十条，也记不得了。」次贤道：「我们前日几个人，也凑了好些。」又指琴言、蕙芳、宝珠三人道：「这三个还有一个王桂保，他们也对了许多，比我们还好些。」便叫人到他书房拿出一个单子，并上次所行之令也写在上面，注了各人姓名。道生看了，连声赞好，道：「不料这四位竟能如此，竟是我辈，老夫今日真有幸也。他们贵行中我却也见过许多，不过写几笔兰竹，涂","en":"now.\\" Cixian said, \\"We ourselves produced a good many the other day,\\" and, gesturing toward Qinyan, Huifang, and Baozhu, he added, \\"These three, along with one Wang Guibao, matched a great number of pairs — and their results were somewhat better than ours.\\" He sent a servant to his study to fetch a sheet of paper on which the results of that session had been written out,"},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":1,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"七言绝句及近体诗非其所好，只备诗中一格，原不欲后人学诗，仅学其五七言绝句小诗也。」此一番议论，议论得个个首肯，宝珠、蕙芳等亦颇能领会。","en":"those shorter, simpler pieces.' This discourse was so cogent that everyone present nodded in agreement, and even Baozhu, Huifang, and the others were quite capable of following it."},{"paragraph":38,"mentions":4,"tokens":["宝珠","瑶卿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"人人言之发指的。既有此骂，也是快事，将来倒要找一部读读。」道翁道：「但其人时运太坏，未能大用其才，真真可惜。」宝珠忙接道：「何幸此君，今日竟遇知己。」道翁道：「瑶卿与此君相好么？」素兰在旁道：「他的画画弹琴，皆是此君教的。前月他们还逛了两天翠微山呢。他之待此君，也不亚于蕙芳之待湘帆了。」宝珠一笑，道：「何至于此？」子玉道：「前在瑶卿处，见其笔墨高雅之至，大有唐六","en":"his luck in life has been very poor, and his great talents have never been fully employed. It is a true shame.\\" Baozhu quickly said, \\"How fortunate this gentleman is — to find, today, a true friend who understands him.\\" Master Qu said, \\"Are you on close terms with this gentleman, Yaoqing?\\" Sulan, who was beside Baozhu, said, \\"He taught Yaoqing painting, calligraphy,"},{"paragraph":39,"mentions":3,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"宝珠道：「此君疏懒太甚，不好交游的。」道翁道：「想与此数君自必水乳。」这一日，屈道翁足足讲了一日，人也乏了。吃完了饭，散坐了一会，也就二更光景。刘文泽系旧学生，不敢问难。宝珠问子云要柄扇子，求道翁题诗，子云索性叫取四柄扇子出来，给四旦每人一柄。于是宝珠拂","en":"Baozhu said, \\"This gentleman is rather reclusive and not fond of society.\\" Master Qu said, \\"With these gentlemen I think he would find himself perfectly at ease.\\" That day Master Qu had talked at length from beginning to end — everyone was weary. After finishing"}],"41":[{"paragraph":25,"mentions":4,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"病急须救，偏是斜阳迟下楼，刚饮得一杯酒。《梁州序》\\n公子对夫人道：「如此丽句，不可不浮一大白。」将大杯斟了，叫宝珠敬夫人一杯。宝珠擎杯双膝跪下，夫人道：「我量浅不能饮这大杯，还请自饮罢。」遂把这大杯内酒倒出一小杯来，叫宝珠送与公子。宝珠又跪到公子面前，公子一口干了。","en":"\\"For lines so beautiful as these, we cannot but drink a full great cup.\\" A large cup was poured, and he called Baozhu to present it to his lady with a bow. Baozhu raised the cup with both hands and sank to her knees. His lady said: \\"My capacity is too small for such a large cup—pray drink it yourself.\\" She poured from the large cup into a small one and told Baozhu to"}],"42":[{"paragraph":8,"mentions":1,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"到了素兰寓处，却值素兰未回，意欲回家，又属烦闷。想宝珠离此不远，不如找他谈谈也好。才出得素兰门口，见两人站在街心。偶抬头一看，一个是圆脸，生得混混沌沌，脚下倒是一双皂靴。一个生得獐头鼠目，便帽上拖着一绺长红帽纬。","en":"Sulan had not yet returned home. He considered going back but felt far too restless for that. He thought that Baozhu's lodgings were not far from here, and it would be just as well to go and find him for a chat. He had barely stepped out of Sulan's gate when he noticed two men standing in the middle of the street. He happened to glance up. One had a round, blank, bovine"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":1,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"无奈何，只好由他们讲。只听得背后一直促促，脚步接着脚步，衣裳碰着衣裳，顺风吹来鼻中，觉有狐臊气。急行几步，到了宝珠门口。叫小孩子进去问时，也不在家。琴言见那两人又在后头站着，心中气极，便急急的回去，那两人也就急急的跟来。琴言到了自己门口，一直低了头进去了。","en":"against sleeve, and with the wind at his back came a coarse, rancid smell. He quickened his pace and soon reached Baozhu's door. He sent the boy in to inquire, but Baozhu was not at home either. Qinyan saw that the two men had planted themselves behind him once more. With anger boiling inside him, he turned and walked briskly back toward home, and the two men came hurrying"},{"paragraph":35,"mentions":1,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴言今日找着了宝珠、素兰、商量师师娘要钱之事。不知宝、素二人有何良策，且听下回分解。","en":"As for Qinyan, that same day he had managed to find both Baozhu and Sulan to discuss the matter of his master's widow's demands for money. As to what Baozhu and Sulan proposed as a plan, listen to the following chapter."}],"43":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说琴言是晚听姬亮轩、乌大傻说了多少瞎话，更加烦闷，幸他们就出去了。候到二更，不见宝珠、素兰过来，只得睡了。一夜无眠，到了次早，即叫小使去请他二人来。","en":"more clouded. Fortunately they soon took their leave. He waited until the second watch, yet seeing no sign of Baozhu or Sulan, he had little choice but to retire for the night in solitude. He lay restless through the long night. At the first touch of dawn, he dispatched a servant boy to summon the two of them."},{"paragraph":2,"mentions":7,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"是日，素兰清早已为王文辉叫去。少顷，宝珠过来。宝珠道：「昨日失候，我到三更才回的，他们也忘了，没有对我讲。方才你们五儿说起来，方知道。两三天总不见你，为什么不出来散散闷？今日度香约赏杏花，咱们可同去了。」琴言道：「可以。我这两日偶然感冒，觉得疲倦，今日也想出去散散。且假期已满，也要打算进城","en":"That morning, Sulan had already been called away by Wang Wenhui at an early hour. Presently Baozhu arrived. \\"I missed you yesterday,\\" said Baozhu. \\"I did not return until the third watch, and no one thought to tell me. Your Wu'er only just mentioned it just now. I haven't seen you these two or three days — why haven't you come out to take the air?"},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":9,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"只见素兰走来，琴言、宝珠让坐了。琴言道：「你早上那里去？」素兰道：「今早王大人叫我去，我当是什么紧要事，原来很不要紧的一句话。我与剑潭、庸庵谈了一会，方才到家。知道你请我，不知有何差委？」宝珠将方才的话与素兰讲了，素兰拍手笑道：「果然，果然不出我们所料！我真佩服他。据我说是","en":"Just then Sulan walked in, and Qinyan and Baozhu invited him to sit. \\"Where did you go so early?\\" asked Qinyan. \\"Lord Wang sent for me this morning,\\" said Sulan. \\"I thought it must be something urgent, but it turned out to be quite a trifling matter. I had a chat with Jiantan and Yong'an, and only"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":1,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"桌上看着几本册页，见他们进来，笑面相迎，说道：「今日可谓不速之客三人来。」三人笑了一笑，且不坐下，就看那册页。宝珠先抢了那本画的，那两人也凑着同看，有山水，也有花卉，却画得甚好，原来蕙芳新求屈道翁画的。看到末后一页，是一个美人倚阑惆怅的光景，阑外落花满地，双燕飞来，像是：「落花人独立，微雨燕双飞」的诗意。琴言触动了当年那个灯谜，忽忽如有所感，看题着一首绝句，琴言","en":"three uninvited guests.\\" The three smiled, but did not sit down at once, turning instead to look at the albums. Baozhu was the first to seize the painted one, and the other two clustered round to look with him. There were landscapes and flower studies, all rendered with great skill, as Huifang had newly commissioned them from Master Qu Daoweng. On the last page was a"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":3,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"独自增惆怅，芳草天涯人未归。\\n又将那一本字也看了。蕙芳让三人坐下，问道：「你们还是不约而同，还是约了同来的。」宝珠道：「约齐来的，我们同到度香处看杏花罢。」蕙芳道：「今日又有局吗？」宝珠道：「局是没有，也算个不速之客何妨？」蕙芳点首笑应。素兰、宝珠的衣服与车都来了，二人即换了衣服。蕙芳进内也换了，又问道：「你们同来竟一无所事，单为看花么？」素兰道：「事有一件，到","en":"sit, and asked: \\"Did you all arrive together by chance, or was this arranged?\\" \\"We came by arrangement,\\" said Baozhu. \\"Let us all go together to Duxiang's to see the apricot blossoms.\\" \\"Is there a banquet today?\\" asked Huifang. \\"No banquet,\\" said Baozhu. \\"Call it three uninvited guests — what is the harm?\\" Huifang nodded and smiled his assent. Sulan's and Baozhu's"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":2,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"宝珠等走上扶梯，进得楼来，次贤、子云笑面相迎，见了琴言、蕙芳等更加欢喜，说道：「今日倒料不着你们来。」宝珠道：「都是我请来的。」又对次贤道：「瘦香身子不快，不来了。」","en":"Baozhu and the others climbed the staircase into the upper room. Cixian and Ziyun came forward with smiling faces; seeing Qinyan and Huifang among the visitors, they were all the more pleased, saying: \\"We hardly expected you today.\\" \\"I brought them all,\\" said"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":2,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"次贤、子云看他四人今日打扮分外好看，艳的艳，雅的雅，倒像有心比赛的一般。此刻都还穿着小毛外褂，琴言是玄狐耳绒，宝珠是玄狐抓仁，蕙芳是云狐抓仁，素兰是骨牌块云狐干尖。四人相对，就是珊瑚玉树交枝，瑶草琪花弄色，觉得楼外千枝红杏，比不上楼中四个玉人。次贤、子云虽时常相对，此刻亦还顾盼频频。子云道：「今日无肴，只有小饮，你们饿了，就吃起来罢。」蕙芳道：「我真有些饿了。」","en":"pains to outshine the others. All four still wore their short fur outer jackets. Qinyan wore dark fox-ear velvet, Baozhu wore dark fox with a raked-claw pattern, Huifang wore cloud-fox with a raked-claw pattern, and Sulan wore cloud-fox cut in domino-block points. Seen together, they were like coral trees and jade branches intertwined, like rare orchids and spirit-flowers"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":3,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"的，何以忽然如此。次贤问道：「媚香有什么心事么？」蕙芳道：「没有。」子云道：「方才很高兴的，此刻为何不乐呢？」宝珠等也看出蕙芳有些不快。蕙芳不语，停一会说道：「花能开几日？」次贤接道：「七十年。」蕙芳道：「何以能七十年？」次贤道：「人生在世，以七十年算，活一年开一年。」蕙芳道：「今年的花，不是去年的花。」子云道：「有去年花，就有今年花。」蕙芳又道：「今年的花，留","en":"mind?\\" asked Cixian. \\"No,\\" said Huifang. \\"You were quite merry just now,\\" said Ziyun. \\"What has come over you?\\" Baozhu and the others also noticed that Huifang seemed ill at ease. Huifang said nothing for a while, then spoke: \\"How many days can a flower bloom?\\" \\"Seventy years,\\" rejoined Cixian. \\"How can that be?\\" \\"A person lives, by our reckoning, seventy years, and"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":1,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"」次贤道：「那更委屈了。你是浙人，自然夸赞江瑶。若说那干江瑶，真像那从良老妓，回忆当年，姿态全无，余腥尚在。」宝珠问次贤道：「食品之内，究以何物为第一？」次贤道：「我口不同于人口，不敢定。以我所好，以鱼为第一。」琴言、蕙芳皆道：「说得是。」次贤道：「食品中也分作几样。如人品不同，有仙品，有神品，有逸品，有妙品，有宜烹龙煮凤，有宜吸月餐露，使其相反，两不为佳。故往","en":"the grace of her prime is gone, yet a faint smell of the old trade lingers still.\\" \\"Among all edible things,\\" Baozhu asked Cixian, \\"what would you rank first?\\" \\"My palate differs from most,\\" said Cixian, \\"and I dare not pronounce. Personally, I would put fish above all else.\\" \\"Well said,\\" agreed Qinyan and Huifang together. \\"Among foods, as among people,\\" Cixian continued,"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":4,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"宝珠对琴言道：「上一回对戏目的对，你出四个字的，以后我也想着一副。」琴言道：「是什么？」宝珠道：「《游湖借伞》，《搜山打车》。」琴言道：「真好，工稳之极。」蕙芳道：「就是《别母乱箭》，可以对《训子单刀》。」素兰道：「这么对，还有《闹朝扑犬》，也可对得《打","en":"\\"Last time you were matching opera titles,\\" Baozhu said to Qinyan, \\"and you gave a set of four characters. Since then I thought of a couplet of my own.\\" \\"What is it?\\" asked Qinyan. \\"'Borrowing an Umbrella on the Lake'\\" said Baozhu, \\"matched with 'Searching the Mountain, Driving the Cart.'\\" \\"Excellent."},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":2,"tokens":["宝珠","瑶卿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"吃过了饭，又下楼逛了一会，过了小山，过了石梁，便是留春坞。就在留春坞内煮茗清谈。宝珠对子云将琴言的师娘要他出师，及蕙芳、素兰的主意说了一遍。子云道：「若果如此，倒也很好。」便问蕙芳道：「你们有这力量作此义举么？」蕙芳道：「若说力量，原也勉强，但集腑成裘，也还容易。我与瑶卿、香畹三人可以凑得六百金，王氏弟兄、佩仙、庾香可以凑得四百金。","en":"the stone bridge to reach the Spring-Lingering Dell. There, over brewed tea, they fell into easy conversation. Baozhu recounted to Ziyun the matter of Qinyan's master's wife demanding the release of his indenture, together with the plans that Huifang and Sulan had proposed. \\"If that is truly the case,\\" said Ziyun, \\"it would be very good indeed.\\" He turned to Huifang"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":1,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"庆奶奶嘴里，好像画眉哨的一般，我有几分怯他。」蕙芳道：「人说他倒是个直性人，顺了他的毛，倒也易的很的。」琴言、宝珠、素兰先回去了。","en":"direct sort of person,\\" said Huifang. \\"Stroke her the right way and she will be quite easy to deal with.\\" Qinyan, Baozhu, and Sulan went home ahead."}],"44":[{"paragraph":13,"mentions":2,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"珊枝又对宝珠丢个眼色，宝珠也劝道：「珊枝的话说得是。琴言若果真心向着公子，就有人替他出师，他也不肯瞒着公子，必来禀明一声。如果他来禀明公子，难道公子不肯与他出师？这个人又胡涂，又没有良心，还要他人作什么呢？况去年原是他自己要来的，今年又是他自己要去的，公子待他的","en":"Shanzhi then caught Baozhu's eye, and Baozhu also sought to console him: \\"Shanzhi speaks rightly. If Qinyan's heart had truly been with the young master, then even if someone had arranged his release, he would not have concealed it but would have come to inform the young master"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":1,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"那日蕙芳出门去了，琴言便到怡园来。此时梨花已开，子云、次贤与宝珠在梨院闲谈，琴言进来相见了。次贤笑道：「玉侬，如今由你自己作主了，不如辞了华府，到这里来罢。」琴言笑道：「我倒很愿，意但怎样去辞那边呢！」子云笑道：「那还了得？华星北必说我夺其所好，这官司还打得清么？不要弄到叩阍起来。到初七日也可回去了，你是几时出来","en":"the Garden of Contentment on his own. The pear blossoms were now in bloom; Ziyun and Cixian were chatting with Baozhu in the Pear Blossom Courtyard when Qinyan arrived and greeted them. \\"Yunong,\\" laughed Cixian, \\"now that you are your own master, why not resign from the Hua household and come to live here?\\" \\"I would truly like nothing better,\\" said Qinyan with a laugh."},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":1,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"是那些老前辈退居林下的，还来应考，岂有全才如你，倒不去的？那时我托人硬把你荐了，由不得你不去。」次贤笑而不答。宝珠道：「若考中了，作什么官呢？」子云道：「翰林院编修。」琴言道：「庾香是个秀才，也可考么？」子云道：「可以。」琴言道：「你自然也去的。」子云道：「现任官不准考，我已补了缺。就是前舟，只怕也不能的了，五月前后总可得缺。」","en":"your name by force — you will have no choice but to go.\\" Cixian smiled but said nothing. \\"If one passes,\\" asked Baozhu, \\"what office does one hold?\\" \\"Compiler in the Hanlin Academy,\\" said Ziyun. \\"Can Yuxiang take the examination?\\" asked Qinyan. \\"He is only a xiucai.\\" \\"He can,\\" said Ziyun. \\"You yourself will surely go,\\" said Qinyan. \\"Active officials are not permitted"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":4,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这边琴言尚不知缘故，似乎听得将箱子送来。知珊枝去了，忙走出来，见子云面貌失色，靠在椅上。宝珠与次贤还看那信，琴言过来要看，次贤意欲藏过，子云道：「给他看看，这是那里说起？华星北真不是人，听了谁的话，这般糟蹋人，可恼！可恼！」琴言不看此信还可，看了不由得伤心起来，一字字看去，忽然一腔怒气，直涌上来，眼前一阵乌黑，喉中如物噎住，透不得气，两眼一","en":"delivered. Hearing Shanzhi's departure, he hurried out, only to find Ziyun pale and slumped in his chair while Baozhu and Cixian pored over the letter. Qinyan stepped forward to read it. Cixian instinctively moved to hide the pages, but Ziyun intervened. \\"Let him see,\\" he said bitterly. \\"Where do such unfounded claims even originate? Hua Xingbei proves himself devoid"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":2,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「失言，失言！你是优贡，已不在秀才之列了。」次贤道：「我固是个秀才，但你也是个举人。」子云道：「我原不通的。」宝珠要解琴言的愁闷，便笑向次贤道：「优贡，优贡，我们这优班，还在贡班之上。我们念起书来，就真是那学而优，适或作了官，又成了仕而优了。」次贤笑道：「这还了得？非但骂我，连度香也骂在里头了。」宝珠深深赔罪道：「恕我无心之言。」子云也笑了，琴言方止了哭。","en":"juren.\\" \\"A most unaccomplished one,\\" Ziyun replied self-deprecatingly. Wishing to lift Qinyan's spirits further, Baozhu laughed and addressed Cixian playfully. \\"Tribute scholar, tribute scholar... we performers of the youyi actually outrank the tribute scholars! When we apply ourselves to study, we truly embody the saying, 'learning and, when opportunity arises, excelling.'"},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":2,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"？叫作落在其中，跳不出来。就一年有一万银子，成了个大富翁，又算得什么？总也离不了小旦二字。我是决意要改行的。」宝珠道：「我的心也与你一样，但不知天从人愿否？」是夜三旦在园中谈谈说说，琴言亦解了许多愁闷。子云对蕙芳道：「玉侬在你那里也是不便，你不能在家陪着他，不如叫他到我这里住几天罢。以后再作这个道理，总要与他想个万全的法子。」蕙芳道：「起初原不过想留他一两天就进","en":"'young female impersonator.' Yet, I am absolutely resolved to change my path.\\" \\"My heart beats the same as yours,\\" Baozhu agreed softly. \\"Only heaven knows whether our deepest wishes will be granted.\\" That night, the three performers lingered in the garden, exchanging confidences and gentle banter that helped ease Qinyan's lingering sorrow. Later, Ziyun spoke privately"},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":1,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"且说珊枝回去，华公子便问到怡园见了度香怎样光景，珊枝道：「今日见他们在梨花园内，奴才进去见琴言、宝珠，琴言见了奴才，即躲开了。徐老爷问了公子好，将帖儿拆开看了一会，一句话也没有讲，就只冷笑一声。萧老爷说不及写回字了，回去与公子请安，我们明日见了公子当面讲罢。奴才将箱子交给他们门上，也就收了。」华公子打发珊枝去后，心上想子云必定认个不是，自将琴言送来","en":"arrived, I found them gathered in the Pear Blossom Courtyard,\\" Shanzhi reported. \\"As I entered, I saw Qinyan and Baozhu standing there, but the moment Qinyan spotted me, he quickly moved away. Lord Xu formally asked after the young master's health. He then opened the letter and read it for a long moment in utter silence, offering only a single, chilling laugh. Lord Xiao"}],"45":[{"paragraph":12,"mentions":1,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"文泽、王恂一齐都来了，子玉到了，各人与吉甫相见，叙了些彼此仰慕的话。只有史南湘、田春航在场中未来。相公们到的是宝珠、蕙芳、素兰、玉林、漱芳、兰保、桂保、春喜、琪官、连琴言刚是十人。","en":"Jifu. Shi Nanxiang and Tian Chunhang were still at the examination grounds. Among the performers who came were Baozhu, Huifang, Sulan, Yulin, Shufang, Lanbao, Guibao, Chunxi, and Qiguan. Qinyan made ten in total."},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":1,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"气联星斗，金光灿烂云霞明。\\n道生写了，对着子云、吉甫道：「这像是说你们二位呢。」子云、吉甫俱说「惭愧！惭愧！」宝珠看了，也知道带着他，且与吉甫相联，心甚喜欢。只见又写道：","en":"bright.\\"\\nDaosheng turned to Ziyun and Jifu. \\"This seems to describe you two.\\" Both replied, \\"We are unworthy!\\" Baozhu knew he was included, linked with Jifu, and he was deeply pleased. Next came:"},{"paragraph":45,"mentions":3,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"宝珠道：「我们前生，就不知道是什么人转生的。吉甫说他也会请，我要看看，总未遇巧。」素兰笑道：「你的前生不是说是个尼姑呢？」宝珠不觉得脸一红，笑道：「你怎么知道？」素兰道：「我听见你自己说的。」宝珠笑道：「我竟忘记了。」","en":"Baozhu wondered aloud, \\"Who knows what we were in our past lives? Jifu says he can summon spirits too. I keep hoping to see it, but I never get the chance.\\" Sulan laughed teasingly. \\"They say you were a nun in a former life?\\" Baozhu flushed deeply. \\"How would"}],"48":[{"paragraph":12,"mentions":2,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"闲时又有宝珠、素兰、兰保、漱芳等一班名旦，不是垂帘度曲，就是对酒当歌。南湘素有才名，如今加上个翰林名号，更有那求文求诗的接踵而来。他又怕烦，常请金粟、子玉等代笔。至于不要紧的，连琴仙、蕙芳、素兰、宝珠的佳章都有在里面，好在人人说好，没有一个看得出来。南湘本要接夫","en":"During their leisure time, renowned performers like Baozhu, Sulan, Lanbao, and Shufang would join them, either singing behind screens or drinking and harmonizing with their melodies. Nanxiang already possessed a literary reputation, and now, adorned with a Hanlin title, requests for essays and poems poured in"},{"paragraph":36,"mentions":1,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"次贤各备车马跟着，一直送出城外，直到十里之外皇华亭。只见南湘、仲清、文泽、金粟、王恂、子玉、春航，领着那蕙芳、宝珠、素兰、漱芳、玉林、兰保、桂保、琪官、春喜九个名旦，在皇华亭等候。道翁等连忙下车，极口辞谢。各人皆要把盏。","en":"Nanxiang, Zhongqing, Wenze, Jin Su, Wang Xun, Ziyu, and Chunhang, alongside Huifang and the nine famous performers: Baozhu, Sulan, Shufang, Yulin, Lanbao, Guibao, Qiguan, and Chunxi. Daoweng hurried down from his carriage and thanked everyone repeatedly, as they all eagerly wished to raise a cup in a final parting toast."}],"50":[{"paragraph":4,"mentions":2,"tokens":["瑶卿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"叶攀下来，给文泽看，是画些蜻蜓、螳螂、促织、蜘蛛各样的草虫。文泽笑道：「这倒亏你，很有点意思，只怕你学出来，比瑶卿还要好些。」春喜道：「瑶卿近来我有些恨他。他的画自然比我好，但他学了两三年，我是今年才学的。春间请教请教他，不是笑我，就是薄我，问他的法子，他又不肯说。","en":"chuckled. \\"This is quite inventive of you, rather charming! I fear that once you master this, you might even surpass Yaoqing.\\" Chunxi sighed, \\"Lately, I harbor a bit of resentment toward Yaoqing. Naturally, his painting is superior to mine, but he has been studying for two or three years, while I only began this spring. Whenever I went to consult him, he would either mock"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":2,"tokens":["瑶卿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"的。」文泽道：「我不管你留不留，我只要这把，你落了款罢。」春喜只得落了款，送与文泽。文泽道：「看你这画，已经比瑶卿好了，字也写得好。」春喜道：「瑶卿原只会画兰竹与几笔花卉，山水尚是乱画的，草虫他更不会。此时说我比他好，我也不安，将来或者赶得上他。」正说话间，只见仲清、王恂同着琪官、桂保进来。","en":"signed the fan and presented it to Wenze. Wenze praised him, \\"Looking at this painting, you are already better than Yaoqing, and your calligraphy is excellent too.\\" Chunxi replied modestly, \\"Yaoqing only ever knew how to paint orchids, bamboo, and a few simple flowers; his landscapes are just messy strokes, and he certainly cannot paint insects. To say I am better than him"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":2,"tokens":["瑶卿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"那三个相公看着唐和尚胁肩谄笑，好不难看。仲清道：「连日未见瑶卿。」琪官道：「瑶卿近日从着吉甫学琴呢，竟是足不出户。吉甫也真好静，他当日教过梅卿弹琴，自梅卿死后，他的《梅花三弄》是再不弹的了。你说这也算深于情了。」仲清道：「吉甫的人本沈静高雅，于这些文玩无上无不精通。」大家谈论，日已西沉，文泽等也要散了，王恂叫走","en":"shoulders in his obsequious, fawning smile and found the sight utterly repulsive. Zhongqing said, \\"I haven't seen Yaoqing for days.\\" Qiguan replied, \\"Yaoqing has been studying the guqin with Jifu recently; he practically never steps out of the house. Jifu truly loves his peace and quiet. Back in the day, he taught Meiqing how to play the qin, but ever since Meiqing passed"}],"53":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["袁宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"悔。一日，即命家人去叫素兰，说明叫他带了前日的扇子来。那日素兰正在蕙芳处商议开那古董铺的事情，苏、陆之外，尚有袁宝珠、金漱芳、王兰保、李玉林要来，大家商议那古董书画等物公凑些起来，也就不少。况且怡园花木极多，尽可分些来应用。我们何不先开起来，再到南边制办，也未尝不可。若要等买齐了，就有两三月耽搁去了。","en":"day.\\n\\nAt the time, Sulan was at Huifang's place discussing their plans to open an antique shop. Beyond Su and Lu, Baozhu, Shufang, Lanbao, and Yulin also intended to join. They reasoned that if everyone pooled their antiques, books, and paintings, it would amount to a substantial collection. Moreover, the Garden of Contentment was rich with flowers and trees, which could"},{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"来，能有几样？而且也没有很好的东西，奇书名画更少，开张起来，空空的什么样子？若尽靠些花木，不成个花局子了么？」宝珠道：「要凑东西其实也不难。若说书画，前日我见度香园中晒晾，也数不清有多少。一种书有十几部的，他要这许多作什么？法帖重的很多，若画那似假似真的也有几十箱，横竖将来总饱蠹鱼的了，分些来他岂有不肯的？至于古玩，好的自然不好去要他。他那不爱的东西，要几件来，","en":"what kind of shop would that be? If we rely solely on flowers and plants, wouldn't it just become a florist's?\\"\\n\\nBaozhu replied, \\"In truth, gathering stock isn't so difficult. As for books and paintings, the other day I saw Duxiang airing his collection in the garden, and there were countless volumes. He has dozens of copies of the same book—what does he need so many"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":1,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"。但是你们后来这个行业倒难，这碗饭也不是终于好吃的。」素兰道：「如今我们几个人，现在想出一条道路。」就将蕙芳、宝珠等要开书画、古董，并些针线、香料、花卉、绸缎等物合成一个大铺子的话说了。公子点头道：「这倒罢了，你们这几个人也只好老于是乡。这个铺子几时开呢？」素兰道：「此时货物都不全，所有东西皆要到苏杭去置买。先想凑些书画等件，布置起来，原不当买卖作，不过这几个人","en":"forever.\\"\\n\\nSulan replied, \\"Right now, several of us are trying to find a new path.\\" He then recounted how Huifang, Baozhu, and the others planned to pool calligraphy, paintings, antiques, needlework, incense, flowers, and silks to open a large shop.\\n\\nYoung Master Hua nodded. \\"That is acceptable. You lot are best suited to live out your days in such pursuits. When will this"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":3,"tokens":["瑶卿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"无一毫闇昧之心，难道一人只许有一个知己，不准有两个么？」素兰道：「若论知己，自然越多越好。就以蕙芳之与田春航，瑶卿之与之金吉甫而论，春航固是蕙芳的知己，吉甫固是瑶卿的知己。蕙芳之待春航，瑶卿之待吉甫，也是报知己之报了。事虽不同，情则一也。然而他们待外人也是这样，心里却有权衡，外面若无轩轾，不露出厚薄来。所以人也不能说他们，也不能妒他们。若琴言之心，没有一点曲折，","en":"Sulan replied, \\"When it comes to confidants, naturally the more the better. Take Huifang with Tian Chunhang, and Yaoqing with Jin Jifu: Chunhang is certainly Huifang's confidant, and Jifu is certainly Yaoqing's confidant. Huifang's treatment of Chunhang and Yaoqing's treatment of Jifu are their ways of repaying that understanding. The circumstances differ, but the feeling"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":1,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"了。」素兰道：「题个什么名字呢？」蕙芳道：「我想题为九香楼可好么？」素兰道：「好个九香楼，妙极，妙极！」又请了宝珠、漱芳、玉林、兰保等来，大家看了，都极喜欢，同赞素兰能干，叫华公子这般倾倒起来，又赞他题的曲子。素兰颇为得意。","en":"you think?\\"\\n\\n\\"A fine name—Nine Fragrance Tower. Exquisite, truly exquisite!\\" Sulan praised.\\n\\nThey then invited Baozhu, Shufang, Yulin, Lanbao, and the others to come see. Everyone examined the goods and was overjoyed. They praised Sulan's capability in winning Young Master Hua over so completely, and applauded the lyric he had composed. Sulan felt quite proud."},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":3,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"明日，宝珠等到子云处，将华公子赏给素兰的东西，一一说了，并要子云回去，也把账单看了，点出：花玻璃灯二十对，大小玻璃杂器四十件，料珠灯八盏，各色洋呢十板，各色纱衣料一百匹、各色贡缎二十匹、各色湖绉一百匹、各色绸绫一百匹，座钟四架、挂钟四架，洋表二十个，真古铜器一","en":"The next day, Baozhu and the others went to Ziyun's place and recounted one by one the items Young Master Hua had bestowed upon Sulan. They then asked Ziyun to go back, look through his own ledgers, and pick out items to contribute.\\n\\nZiyun selected a long list: twenty pairs"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":1,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"蕙芳本想不受，但恐春航心上过不去，又见宝珠、素兰得了多少东西，自己又有好胜之心，只得收了，托子云着人到苏杭添置一切。子云封了金子，开了一个清单，写了一封书，着人到他乃兄署中，叫管总的徐福亲自制办。","en":"Huifang initially wanted to decline, but fearing he would hurt Chunhang's feelings—and seeing how much Baozhu and Sulan had acquired, which stirred his own competitive spirit—he felt compelled to accept. He asked Ziyun to send someone to Suzhou and Hangzhou to handle the remaining procurements. Ziyun sealed the gold, drafted a detailed manifest, wrote a letter,"}],"57":[{"paragraph":26,"mentions":1,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"」红雪道：「我虽没有闻过你的脚，但常见你用松子粉浆缠足带，不是香的？」红薇被他说着了，两颊通红，只得喝了一杯。宝珠又掣了一枝是：「十指纤纤玉笋红。」看来看去，就是个小翠指甲尚是红的，要他喝了一杯。红雪掣了一枝是：「天赐胭脂一抹腮。」看红雯喝了两杯酒，两颊尚是红的，也逼他喝了一杯。","en":"foot-binding bands with pine powder. Are they not fragrant?\\" Hongwei flushed a deep crimson and quickly drank the cup. Baozhu drew another slip: \\"Ten fingers slender, like red jade shoots.\\" Looking around, she noticed that only Xiaocui's fingernails were currently painted red, so she made her drink. Hongxue then drew: \\"Heaven gifts a smear of rouge upon the cheeks.\\" Hongwen"}],"58":[{"paragraph":4,"mentions":1,"tokens":["袁宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"他们这个，九香楼有的是内造货，什么王府里赏他的，苏州也不及他好。我要买也要不了多少钱。」奚十一也知道这个铺子是袁宝珠、苏蕙芳等开的，却因近日心绪不佳，没有去逛。如今有了盘缠，明日借此可以逛逛，便答应了。","en":"stock, gifts from princely houses, and Suzhou can't match it. It wouldn't cost much.\\" Xi knew the shop was run by Yuan Baozhu, Su Huifang, and the others. Lately he had been in no mood to browse, but now he had travel money and could go tomorrow, so he agreed."},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":1,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"是发卖苏杭花绣衣料，一切洋货俱全，还有一块是内看金珠宝玉、四时花卉。此时那九个名旦均已出班，内有未满师者，也是宝珠、蕙芳共同帮他们出了师，一齐搬在里头居住。里面有个花园，园里也有几十间房子，九旦就住在园里。将一所正楼名为九香楼，园即为九香园。","en":"and seasonal flowers. The nine celebrated actors had all left their troupes. For those not yet fully trained, Baozhu and Huifang had jointly seen them through their apprenticeships, and all had moved in to live. There was a garden inside with dozens of rooms, where the nine dwelt. The main tower was named Nine-Fragrance Tower, and the garden was Nine-Fragrance Garden."}],"60":[{"paragraph":5,"mentions":1,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴仙分做二阄，其余九人分作九阄。说也奇怪，想必文字有灵，前生缘法，子云拈了道翁，子玉拈了杜仙女、琴仙，金粟拈了宝珠，春航拈了蕙芳，仲清拈了琪官，文泽拈了春喜，南湘拈了兰保，王恂拈了桂保，高品拈了玉林，次贤拈了漱芳，单拈不着素兰，只好送与华公子去作了。众人分派已定，子玉说道：「做传容易，画画难，还要刻石，更须时日，不知几天可以告成？」吉甫道：「不消多日，碑是磨现成","en":"spirit and past-life affinities were at play, Ziyun drew Daoweng; Ziyu drew Fairy Du and Qinxian; Jin Su drew Baozhu; Chunhang drew Huifang; Zhongqing drew Qiguan; Wenze drew Chunxi; Nanxiang drew Lanbao; Wang Xun drew Guibao; Gao Pin drew Yulin; and Cixian drew Shufang. Sulan alone was not drawn, so that assignment was sent to Young Master Hua. The tasks distributed,"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":1,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"列宿之精，群芳之祖。\\n左英琼瑶，右青珊瑚。\\n一气二气，同归殊途。\\n五色炫彩，九华流香。\\n心花意蕊，文运之祥。\\n宝珠道：「这几篇赞语实在做得好。若将我们实事叙在里头，虽然不致辱身，究竟也为贱行。」蕙芳道：「可不是！你看那些花谱花评，虽将那些人赞得色艺俱佳，究不免梨园习气。我们这一关倒可以算跳出了。」素兰等皆点首浩叹。","en":"their fragrance.\\nThe flower of the heart, the stamen of the mind; an auspicious sign for the destiny of letters.\\"\\n\\nBaozhu said, \\"These eulogies are truly magnificent. If our actual deeds were recorded within, though it might not disgrace us, it would still reflect our lowly past.\\" Huifang agreed, \\"Exactly! Look at those flower registers and critiques—though they praise"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":2,"tokens":["瑶卿","宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"车，云锦缝裳。金枝翠羽，玉佩明璫。\\n华月光满，蓬山路长。既美且都，亦风而雅。\\n学士满宫，首推大舍。\\n琴仙道：「瑶卿之秾艳韶华，却一齐被静宜画出来，吉甫赞出来了。」宝珠道：「算花神罢了，我也配这样？」看第五方，画一个仙女，意致飘洒，素艳欲流，手拈兰花一朵，题曰：素心花史陆仙。下有小传，为华公子撰：","en":"elegant and refined.\\nAmong the scholars filling the palace, she is the first of the great houses.\\"\\n\\nQinxian noted, \\"Yaoqing's stunning, youthful radiance has been perfectly captured by Jingyi's brush and Jifu's praise.\\" Baozhu replied, \\"Even as a flower god, am I truly worthy of this?\\" They looked at the fifth panel, depicting a fairy maiden with an aura of flowing, unadorned"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":1,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这首诗究竟也不甚好，还有些刻薄，你看帐里梦中等句，有什么好呢？」蕙芳道：「这倒没有什么。不过写的娇艳尊贵处。」宝珠道：「卓然这等诗，就算他的好心了。若要他做庄重些，他也未尝不愿，但他那油嘴油舌说这惯一派。你们看他生平说过几句正经话来？吉甫说他去年到京来有个笑话。卓然有个表叔，请他吃饭，还有好几位客坐在那里，表叔问他道：「你去年回家，见我家里可好么？」卓然道：「很","en":"Huifang replied, \\"That is nothing to worry about. He is merely describing your enchanting beauty and noble status.\\" Baozhu added, \\"A poem like this from Zhuoran is as close to good intentions as he gets. If you wanted him to be more solemn, he might not be unwilling, but he is too accustomed to his glib, smooth-talking ways. Think about it—how many serious things has he"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":1,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"就是竹君的诗，与静宜、庾香这两个赞语，倒是切定题目说的。」琴仙道：「都切得很。你将这些诗更换了人，便不像了。」宝珠道：「只有静芳那一首，再不能更换的。」琴仙再看第十一方，画一个杏花，下有一个仙女，珠腰玉衱，十分妩媚，题曰：及第花史。知是琪官，看颜仲清的序文：","en":"are all very fitting. If you swapped the poems around to different people, they wouldn't make sense anymore.\\" Baozhu added, \\"Only Jingfang's piece is absolutely irreplaceable.\\" Qinxian then looked at the eleventh panel, depicting an apricot blossom with a fairy maiden standing beneath it, her pearl sash and jade pendants looking utterly captivating. The title read:"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":4,"tokens":["宝珠","瑶卿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴仙就在九香楼吃了饭，坐了闲谈。宝珠忽然说道：「今日众兄弟都在一处，我想我们这十个人，同在京师沉沦菊部，如今个个跳了出来，虽然其中受苦的受苦，安逸的安逸，但自此以后，只要各人安分守已，想必没有风波出来。但我们这一班人，也算不得世间少有的。那一班名士将我们抬举到这个地位，那倒是世间少有，","en":"Qinxian stayed at Nine-Fragrance Tower for a meal, and they sat chatting idly. Baozhu suddenly spoke up: \\"Today, all of us brothers are gathered together. I was thinking, the ten of us sank together into the mire of the capital's theater world, and now, every one of us has leapt free. Though some among us suffered greatly and others found"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":2,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"明日，琴仙先到九香楼将赞与众人看了，大家拿来评定一会，又各自斟酌一会，再公同推敲一会，尽善尽美了，宝珠便誊在一处。诸名士纷纷已到，华公子、金吉甫也都到了。大家果然要祭花神，宝珠等拦住了，然犹摆了香案，各名士奠酒焚香，就没有下拜。然后在九香楼下摆了四席，序齿而坐。这一聚，正是人人意满，个个心欢，毫无不足之处。而且罗列珍馐，横陈肴错，花香人气，缭绕一堂。","en":"evaluate them, each pondering their own words, then collectively polishing the lines until they were perfect. Baozhu then transcribed them all together into a clean copy. The famous scholars began arriving one by one, and Young Master Hua and Jin Jifu soon joined them. True to their word, the scholars intended to offer sacrifices to the flower gods, but Baozhu and"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":4,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"酒至半酣，宝珠避席致辞说：「宝珠等十人同入迷津，今登觉岸。将来勉盖前愆，勤修后果，得齿于人，皆诸贵人提拔之力。但感恩有心，报德无力，唯有日爇清香一炷，以祝诸贵人福寿绵长，荣华白首。昨日我等十人公同商议，亦欲在九香楼上，供设诸贵人文星禄位，也照样刻石，朝夕顶礼皈依，","en":"When the wine had brought a pleasant flush to everyone, Baozhu left his seat to address the room: \\"The ten of us, including myself, entered the delusive ford together, and today we have reached the shore of awakening. If in the future we can strive to amend our past faults, diligently cultivate good karma, and stand"},{"paragraph":34,"mentions":1,"tokens":["袁宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"步障，红锦貂褕。浩歌落落，噀玉喷珠。\\n太白自赏，击缺唾壶。朔风横空，雪花如掌。\\n吹角轮台，久无嗣响。\\n第十首是袁宝珠题的《仙中上品》：","en":"large as palms.\\nThe horn sounds at Luntai, and for a long time, there is no echoing response.\\"\\n\\nThe tenth was Yuan Baozhu's *Upper Grade Among Immortals*:"},{"paragraph":37,"mentions":5,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"素兰与春喜各画几日，摹上了石，将赞语书丹，共有二十余日完竣。择于三月三日，供设九香楼上，为长生禄位。琴仙过来与宝珠商量，必须作一篇祝文，方表诚意，宝珠等深以为然。于是十人公同斟酌，凑成一篇文，改削了几遍，倒也不见联缀痕迹。宝珠道：「明日公祝，须请齐了诸名士来。再，我们跳出梨园，从前一切的所有之物，都用不着了，孽根须净，色界尽除，将那所存的钗钿首饰，当着众名士，一","en":"of the third month to install the longevity tablets on the upper floor of Nine-Fragrance Tower. Qinxian came to Baozhu to discuss the matter, saying that they must compose a formal invocation text to demonstrate their sincerity; Baozhu and the others agreed completely. Thus, the ten of them deliberated together and pieced together a text, revising and polishing it several"},{"paragraph":39,"mentions":1,"tokens":["袁宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"维年月日，九香楼弟子花史袁宝珠等，谨爇百和之香，酿百花之酒，献于诸文星之座而祝曰：\\n维彼文星，川岳之灵，左奎右璧，纬史经纶。故在天为列宿，在世为传人。其光明也如火，其和煦也如春。其根于性也，为纲常伦纪；其见于词也，为变化奇神。言必由中，情多自妙。天籁一声，空号万窍。\\n绪触而纷，丝","en":"\\"On this day of this month of this year, the disciples of Nine-Fragrance Tower, Flower Historian Yuan Baozhu and the others, respectfully burn incense of a hundred blends and brew wine of a hundred flowers, offering them before the seats of the literary stars, and pray thus: These literary stars are the spirits of rivers and peaks; with Kui on the left and"}]}`),"char-24":JSON.parse(`{"1":[{"paragraph":14,"mentions":3,"tokens":["苏蕙芳","蕙芳","媚香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，几曾见小旦中有这样好人？」南湘道：「你那天看的不知是什么班子，自然没有好的了。」子玉再看第二题的是：瑶台璧月苏蕙芳\\n蕙芳姓苏氏，字媚香，年十七岁。姑苏人。","en":"you watched that day; naturally, you saw no one worthwhile.\\" Ziyu then looked at the second entry, which read: Su Huifang: A Jade Moon over the Jasper Terrace. Huifang's surname is Su, his courtesy name Meixiang, and he is seventeen years of age. A native of Suzhou."}],"2":[{"paragraph":35,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"。文辉问他哥哥兰保为什么不来，桂保道：「今日本都在怡园逛了一天，徐老爷知道这里请客，才打发我来的。兰保、宝珠、蕙芳、漱芳、玉林都还没有散，只怕总要到四五更天才散呢。」文辉道：「这徐度香也算人间第一个快乐人了。」陆宗沅道：「听说他这个怡园共花了五十多万银子才造成。」杨方猷道：「本来地方也大，也造得过于精致。」文辉道：「我前月逛了一天，还没有逛到一半。」桂保说：「我","en":"Garden of Contentment. Master Xu only dispatched me here upon learning you were hosting a banquet. Lanbao, Baozhu, Huifang, Shufang, and Yulin have not yet dispersed; I suspect they will linger until the fourth or fifth watch.\\" Wenhui said, \\"This Xu Duxiang is truly the most carefree and joyous man in the mortal realm.\\" Lu Zongyuan added, \\"I have heard that constructing"}],"4":[{"paragraph":31,"mentions":1,"tokens":["苏媚香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"五会了。每一会必有一样顽意儿，或是行令，或是局戏。今日度香要叫我们做诗，出了个《冰床》题目，各人做七律一首，教苏媚香考了第一。」仲清道：「你记得他的诗么？」春喜道：「我只记得他中间四句。」即念道：","en":"write poems. He set the topic The Ice Sledge, with each person writing one seven-character regulated poem, and Su Meixiang was judged first.\\" Zhongqing asked, \\"Do you remember his poem?\\" Chunxi said, \\"I only remember the middle four lines.\\" He then recited:"}],"5":[{"paragraph":19,"mentions":1,"tokens":["媚香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「他肚子里比我们强得多呢！我们如今考起来，只怕媚香还考不过他。」子云听了，更加欢喜，便问琴官道：「你到底念过书没有？」琴官道：「也念过五六年的书。」次贤道：「念过些什么书呢？」琴官道：「《四书》之外，念了一部《事类赋》，两本唐诗。」子云道：「也够了，你可会做诗？」琴官道：「不会做。」宝殊道：「那是他","en":"\\"His mind is far stronger than ours! If we were tested right now, I'm afraid even Meixiang could not surpass him.\\" Ziyun was even more pleased and asked Qinguan: \\"Tell me honestly, have you studied books?\\" Qinguan replied: \\"I have studied for five or six years.\\" Cixian asked: \\"What have you read?\\" Qinguan replied: \\"Besides *The Four Books*,"}],"6":[{"paragraph":33,"mentions":2,"tokens":["苏蕙芳","苏媚香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"湘道：「这个算好吗，只怕也难入品题。」子玉知南湘故意讥诮他，便问仲清，仲清道：「这就是《花选》上第二的瑶台璧月苏蕙芳。」子玉叹道：「天地钟灵尽于此矣，我竟如夏虫不可语冰，难怪竹君怪我。」南湘哈哈大笑道：「我也不怪的，幸你自行检举。」文泽道：「怎么？庾香连苏媚香也不认识。」南湘道：「他是秀才不出门，焉知天下事。」少顷《瑶台》唱完，便是《惊梦》。","en":"intentionally baiting him, Ziyu turned to Zhongqing. Zhongqing explained, \\"This is the Selection of Flowers's number two — Su Huifang, A Jade Moon over the Jasper Terrace.\\" Ziyu marveled, \\"All the spiritual essence of heaven and earth is concentrated here. I was truly a summer insect, unable to conceive of ice. No wonder Zhujun reproached me.\\" Nanxiang laughed heartily, \\"I don't reproach"},{"paragraph":34,"mentions":1,"tokens":["苏蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉倒有些不放心，恐琴官也未必压得下这苏蕙芳，且先聚精会神等着。上场门口，帘子一掀，琴官已经见过二次，这面目记得逼真的了。手锣响处，莲步移时，香风已到，正如八月十五月圆夜，龙宫赛宝，宝气上腾，月光下接，似云非云的，结成了一个五彩祥云华盖，其光华色艳非世间之物可比。这一道光射将过来，把子玉的眼光","en":"Anxious that Qinguan might struggle to match Su Huifang's brilliance, Ziyu focused his entire attention on the stage. The entrance curtain was swept aside, revealing Qinguan—the very same youth he had glimpsed twice before, whose delicate features were flawlessly engraved in his memory. At the resonant strike"}],"7":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":2,"tokens":["苏蕙芳","蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说子玉从会馆回来，将琴官的戏足足想了两日，以谓天下之美莫过于此。又将苏蕙芳、陆素兰、金漱芳、李玉林的色艺品评，都为绝顶。细细核来，蕙芳的神色尤胜于诸人，次则素兰可以匹敌。然较比琴官起来，毫厘之间终觉稍逊。又想：","en":"full days reflecting on Qinguan's performance, convinced it was the pinnacle of worldly beauty. He also appraised Su Huifang, Lu Sulan, Jin Shufang, and Li Yulin, finding them all to be utterly superlative. Yet upon careful comparison, Huifang's spirit and bearing surpassed the rest, with Sulan as his only true equal. But when measured against Qinguan, even by the finest margin,"}],"12":[{"paragraph":19,"mentions":1,"tokens":["苏蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"惜有闹相公之名，无闹相公之实。天下相公出在京城，京城相公聚在联锦班。史竹君的《曲台花选》，品题最允，如袁宝珠、苏蕙芳等方配称名花，而且诗词书画无一不佳，直可作我辈良友。若翠宝、玉美等，不过狐媚迎人，蛾眉善妒，视钱财为性命，以衣服作交情，今日迎新，明朝弃旧，湘帆何其孟浪用情若此？」春航听了，半晌不语，俯首而思。仲清道：「足下莫非懊悔赏识错了么？」","en":"assembled in the Lianjin troupe. Shi Zhujun's Opera Stage Flower Selection ranks them most fairly: Yuan Baozhu, Su Huifang, and such as these alone may be called celebrated flowers — and moreover they are accomplished in poetry, lyrics, calligraphy, and painting without exception, truly capable of being our good companions. As for Cuibao, Yumei, and the like, they are nothing"},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":2,"tokens":["苏蕙芳","苏媚香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"、袁宝珠我却不认得，不知到底是谁？」高品道：「袁宝珠是不大穿素色衣裳的。你说这光景，也不大很像陆素兰。要不然是苏蕙芳，不错的，定是苏媚香，那真是冰壶秋月，清绝无尘，生得不肥不瘦，一个鸡子脸儿，常穿件素色衣裳，在联锦班。史竹君定他是第二名。」春航道：「尚是第二名，第一名是谁？难道还有比他好的么？」高品道：「第一名是袁宝珠，过两天开沟的时候，你就看见了。」春航道：「为","en":"wearing pale-colored garments. From your description, it doesn't quite sound like Lu Sulan either. Then it must be Su Huifang — yes, it must be Su Meixiang. A truly ice-clear autumn sky of purity, absolutely spotless and refined. He is neither heavy nor slight in build, with a face like a hen's egg, and habitually wears pale-colored garments. He is in the Lianjin troupe. Shi"},{"paragraph":34,"mentions":3,"tokens":["苏蕙芳","蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"六吊钱，心中大喜。饭也不吃，一连看了五天联锦班，才见着那个相公一面。看他唱了一出《独占》，访问他的姓名，却正是苏蕙芳。蕙芳偶在春航身边走过，认得是前日跌在泥里那一位，又见他衣裳一身斑点，未免一笑，但不好意思来照应他。春航见蕙芳对他一笑，便如逢玉女投壶，天公开口，便喜欢得说不出来。千思万想，可借不能叫他一回。又看他这样局面，似乎不肯轻易陪酒，断非纸条飞去随叫随来的光","en":"that young actor. He watched him perform the scene *Exclusive Possession*, then asked his name — it was indeed Su Huifang. Huifang happened to pass near Chunhang, recognized him as the one who had tumbled in the mud the other day, and, noticing his clothes still mottled with stains, could not help smiling faintly — but felt too awkward to come over and acknowledge him."},{"paragraph":35,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"春航只当不听见，在炕上和衣卧了，心里只想着蕙芳。田安出去，嘴里却不住咕咕噜噜的抱怨，春航也有些踌躇。","en":"Chunhang simply let it wash over him; he lay on the heated bed fully clothed, thinking only of Huifang. Tian An went out, muttering and grumbling without pause. Chunhang was also somewhat at a loss."}],"13":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":5,"tokens":["苏蕙芳","蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一日，用了饭，高品拜客去了，春航即到戏园来，一心想着苏蕙芳，又没有钱听戏，只好站在戏园门口，候着那蕙芳出进。将到开戏时候，果然见蕙芳坐了车，到门口下来，偏偏有一群人进来看戏，一挤把春航挤在背后，却彼此不能照面。春航心里甚恨，急把身子挤出来，蕙芳已进去了，只得呆呆的不动，候他出来。却又看见了许多上等相公，与蕙","en":"day, after eating, Gao Pin went out to pay calls, and Chunhang went to the theater, his heart entirely fixed upon Su Huifang. Having no money to watch the opera, he could only stand at the entrance, waiting to catch a glimpse of Huifang going in or coming out. Just as the performance was about to begin, he did indeed see Huifang arrive in a carriage and step out at the entrance."},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":3,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"春航想道：「不料联锦班内，有这些好相公，果然名不虚传。」足足候了三个多时辰，始见蕙芳低着头出来，前面两个美少年，服饰辉煌，两个跟班，夹着垫子，抱着衣包，同蕙芳上车去了。春航知蕙芳没看见他，郁郁的走回来。","en":"such fine performers, proving their fame was no exaggeration. He waited a good six hours and more before seeing Huifang emerge with his head lowered. Two splendidly dressed beautiful young men walked ahead of him, and two manservants carrying cushions and clothing bundles followed, and they all boarded his carriage and were gone. Chunhang, knowing Huifang had not seen"},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":5,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，明日又到戏园门口候了一天，却没有会见，此日便为虚度，嗟叹不已。盖春航执迷已久，一时难悟，天天去寻联锦班，候着蕙芳。一连十余日，蕙芳却也看见前次跌在泥里的人，每逢上车下车之时，总站在戏园门口，如醉如痴，目不转睛的看他，心里十分诧异。因细看他的相貌，恰神清骨秀，风雅宜人，面目虽带几分憔悴，而珊珊玉骨，情韵盎然。蕙芳心上，已明知此人为他而来，也未免有情，屡以秋波相赠","en":"for so long that he could not easily awaken from it, going every day to seek out the Lianjin troupe and wait for Huifang. For more than ten days in a row, Huifang did notice the man who had previously fallen in the mud. Every time he got in or out of his carriage, that man was always standing by the theater entrance, staring at him with unblinking, entranced devotion."},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":2,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一日，春航好运到了，也是各人的缘分：正跟着蕙芳的车，蕙芳留神看见，便起了几分怜念的心肠。一进了门，便叫跟班的请他进来。跟班的出去。","en":"One day, Chunhang's luck finally turned, perhaps by the hand of destiny. He was following Huifang's carriage as usual when Huifang, paying special attention, felt a stir of tender pity in his heart. As soon as he entered his gate, he told his manservant to invite the gentleman inside. The manservant went out."},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":3,"tokens":["苏蕙芳","蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"笆。此时二月下旬，正值百花齐放，满院的嫣红姹紫，秾艳芬芳。上面小小三间客厅，也有钟鼎琴书，十分精雅。不多一刻，苏蕙芳出来，穿一副素色珍珠皮衣服，上前来请安。春航即一把拉住了手，却是柔荑一握，春笋纤纤。二人并立了，差不多高。原来蕙芳也十七岁了，蕙芳对着春航笑道：「天天见面，尚未知贵籍大名。前日辱在泥涂，深感盛情原宥。至屡蒙青眼，实幸及三生。」春航心上十分诧异道：「吐","en":"hall, furnished with ancient bronzes and zithers and books, exquisite and elegant in every detail. Before long, Su Huifang emerged wearing a plain-colored pearl-trimmed fur garment, and stepped forward to offer a courteous greeting. Chunhang immediately took his hand, finding it as soft as fresh spring shoots, delicate and slender. The two stood side by side, almost exactly"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":4,"tokens":["蕙芳","媚香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"蕙芳即让春航进内，走出了客厅，从西边篱笆内进去，一个小院子。是一并五间：东边隔一间是客房，预备着不速之客的卧处。中间空着两间作小书厅，西边两间套房，是蕙芳的卧榻。春航先在中间炕上坐下，见上面挂着八幅仇十洲工笔《群仙高会图》，两边尽是楠木嵌琉璃窗，地下铺着","en":"Huifang then invited Chunhang inside. They left the reception hall, passing through the western bamboo fence into a small courtyard containing a row of five rooms. The easternmost room was set aside as a guest room for unexpected visitors. The middle two were"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":5,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「原来他会作诗。」便问道：「这是和你的原韵，想必诗学是极渊深的。」蕙芳笑道：「草草涂鸦，不过凑几句白话罢了，会作什么诗？」春航道：「原唱呢，为何不写出来？」蕙芳道：「去年袁宝珠替我写了一幅，人家拿去看，遗失了。」春航再将蕙芳细细的看了一看，又道：「我看你举止清高，吐属娴雅，绝不类优伶中人。你是几时到京来学戏的？」蕙芳脸","en":"Chunhang thought, and then asked, \\"These are matched to your own rhymes. Your knowledge of poetry must be very deep.\\" Huifang laughed. \\"Idle scribbling — a few plain phrases strung together. What poetry is there in it?\\" Chunhang said, \\"And the original verses — why are they not written out?\\" Huifang said, \\"Yuan Baozhu wrote them out for me last year, and somebody took them"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":2,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「请坐了，好说。」春航坐下，蕙芳道：「我小时候随宦云南，八岁上母亲死了，到十二岁父亲被上司参劾，一气成病，不到一月即故。本来两袖清风，毫无私蓄，就有些须囊橐，都被几个亲戚长随，豆分瓜剖的去了，单剩了一个老家人与我。在云南住了一年多。可怜举目无亲，那些势利场中，谁肯照拂，全仗老家人肩","en":"\\"Please sit, and I will tell you.\\" Chunhang sat down, and Huifang said:\\n\\n\\"As a child I went with my father to his post in Yunnan. My mother died when I was eight. When I was twelve my father was impeached by his superior, took it so bitterly that he fell ill, and was dead within the month. He had always gone with empty"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":2,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"春航道：「自然处馆了。」蕙芳道：「他却不处馆，他的行为到有些像你，到今年也才二十七岁。他进京来便天天听戏，钱都听完了，戏却听会了，认识了许多的相公，遂作了教戏的师傅。遇着那年乡试不中，他便烧了那些文章，入了联锦班作了小生。」春航道：「这到是达人所为，毫无拘疑。」蕙芳道：「他收留","en":"Chunhang said, \\"He would have taken a tutor's place, of course.\\" Huifang said, \\"He did not take a tutor's place. His conduct was rather like yours, in fact. He is only twenty-seven this year. When he came up to the capital he went to the theatre every day, until his money was all listened away — but by then he had the operas"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":4,"tokens":["蕙芳","媚香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"春航听了，也着实伤心，便道：「五年中星移物换，倒尝了多少世态。」又安慰了几句，吃了两杯茶，蕙芳便问春航道；「你既好听戏，于各班中可曾赏识几个脚色么？」春航笑道：「我是重色而轻艺，于戏文全不讲究，脚色高低，也不懂得，惟取其有姿色者，视为至宝。起初孟浪，眼界未清，一遇冶容，便为倾国。及瞻仰玉颜，才觉妙住菩萨现莲花宝座内，非下界凡人所得彷佛。前此真","en":"have tasted a great deal of the world.\\" He said a few words of comfort, and they drank two cups of tea.\\n\\nThen Huifang said, \\"Since you are so fond of the theatre, are there any in the troupes whose work you have come to admire?\\" Chunhang laughed. \\"I set beauty above art. I understand nothing whatever of the pieces, and cannot tell a good part from a bad one; I only"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":3,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"春航道：「我也不为别的。」蕙芳便正色问道：「你为什么？」春航道：「只要姿色好，情性好，我就为他死也情愿。」蕙芳道：「人家好，干你什么事，要为他死？你且说那可宝处？」春航道：「你听我说，我辈作客数千里外，除了二三知己外，尚有四等好友得之最难，即得了又常有美中不足的不好处，就说可宝，","en":"Chunhang said, \\"It is for no other reason.\\" Huifang asked gravely, \\"Then what is your reason?\\" Chunhang said, \\"Only let the looks be fine and the nature be fine, and I would die for such a person willingly.\\" Huifang said, \\"What is it to you that somebody else is fine, that you should die for him? Tell"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":2,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"蕙芳点头道：「不错，真是好的。第二，想必是好地了。」春航道：「是的。一丘一壑，山水清幽，却好移步换形，引人入胜。第三，是好书，要不着一死句，不着一闲笔，便令人探索不尽。」蕙芳也点点头。春航道：「第四，便是性灵中发出来的几首好诗，也不必执定抱杜尊韩，有一句","en":"Huifang nodded. \\"True enough — that is a fine thing. The second, I suppose, must be fine country.\\" Chunhang said, \\"It is. A hill and a hollow, water and mountain clear and secluded, and the view changing at every step so that one is drawn further in. The third"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"蕙芳道：「是极，你真是个风雅通人。」春航道：「此四友是好的了，然也有不能全好处。好天，一月能有几回？往往有上半天好，下半天变起来，便把上半天，也改坏了。到人意阑珊，便怕风怕雨的，不敢久留。好地，一省能有几处？有必须徒步始通的地方，或险仄，或幽阻，沙石荆棘","en":"Huifang praised him as a person of refined and universal understanding. Chunhang countered that while these four friends are indeed fine, each has its imperfection. He asked how many days of fine weather there are in a month. Often the morning is beautiful and"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":3,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"蕙芳笑道：「宝友二字甚奇，我们并不知自己有可宝处。」春航道：「玉软香温，花浓雪艳，是为宝色。环肥燕瘦，肉腻骨香，是为宝体。明眸善睐，巧笑工颦，是为宝容。千娇侧聚，百媚横生，是为宝态。憨啼吸露，娇语嗔花，是为宝情。珠钿刻翠，金佩飞霞，是为宝妆。再益以清歌妙","en":"Huifang laughed, finding the term \\"treasure friend\\" quite remarkable, and confessed they had no idea they possessed anything worth treasuring. Chunhang elaborated: \\"Soft as jade, warm as perfume, flowering with richness, gleaming like snow, that is the treasure"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":3,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"百炼钢为绕指柔。再如你这样天仙化人，就使可望而不可即，使我学善才之见观音，一步一拜，也都愿意，何敢尚有他望？」蕙芳听了，便止不住流下泪来，便道：「你的心，我知道了，不用说了。你且把到京以来，近日的光景，说给我听。」春航就细细把去冬至今，说了一遍。蕙芳又笑起来道：「你真是一片痴情，十分妄想，却又难为你这两条腿，天天的跑，又站在戏园门口不动。」春航道：「若不是你，便","en":"Sudhana before Guanyin, bowing at every step, I would do it willingly. What further should I dare hope for?\\"\\n\\nHuifang could not keep the tears back. \\"I know your heart. You need say no more. Now tell me how you have been living since you came to the capital.\\" Chunhang told him the whole of it, from last winter to that day. Huifang laughed again. \\"You are all one fond"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"春航也不推辞，二人就在花梨四仙桌上对酌，各自吐了些肺腑。此时蕙芳心里，已是十分贴切，全没有半点势利心肠。","en":"other at the small huali-wood table and drank, each pouring out what was deepest in their hearts. By this time Huifang's own heart was completely drawn in, without a trace of calculating self-interest."},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":2,"tokens":["蕙芳","苏蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"当下吃毕了饭，又让到里边屋里坐了一坐，便吩咐跟班的，叫外面套车，送田老爷回寓。蕙芳挽住了春航的手道：「今日订交，此生勿负。我苏蕙芳如有虚言，有如皎日。你以后不必出来，我非早即晚，天天来看你一次。你须自己保重，努力前程。幸勿为我辈丧名，使外人物议。」春航听了，转爱为敬，直感入骨髓，已流下泪来。两人相视呜咽了一会，唯有那些跟班及使唤的","en":"When the meal was finished, they moved to the inner room and sat for a little while. Huifang then told the manservant to hitch up the carriage outside and take Master Tian back to his lodgings. Huifang clasped Chunhang's hand and said that they had become friends today, and must not betray this friendship for the rest of their lives. He swore"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这边蕙芳也就睡了，却细细把春航的说话记了一遍，又把他的光景想了多时。到睡了时，就见春航在面前，变了华冠丽服，仪容严肃的相貌，令人生畏；又变了一个中年的人，穿着一品服饰。恍恍惚惚作了一夜乱梦，到明日早上，就起得迟了。","en":"Huifang then went to bed, carefully recalling everything Chunhang had said and pondering his situation for a long time. When he fell asleep, he dreamt of Chunhang appearing before him, dressed in magnificent robes and an imposing crown, his expression so stern"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":2,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"已是早饭时，才洗了脸，吃了点心。跟班的进来道：「外面有客。」蕙芳问道：「是谁？」跟班的道：「是伏虎桥张老爷，同着开起盛银号的潘三爷。」蕙芳只得穿了衣服，出来见了。","en":"time when he finally washed his face and ate a light meal. His manservant came in. \\"There are visitors outside.\\" Huifang said, \\"Who is it?\\" The man said, \\"Master Zhang from Fuhu Bridge, and Third Master Pan of the Qisheng silver house.\\" Huifang had no choice but to dress and go out to them."},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":3,"tokens":["苏蕙芳","蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"看中了苏蕙芳。今日拉了张仲雨来，要替他说合。仲雨想：「这蕙芳人品高雅，未必肯跟潘其观。」就支支吾吾不愿作成。经其观再三恳求，许以金帛重谢。只得同来，见景生情罢了。来到蕙芳家内坐下，说了些闲话。","en":"He had set his sights on Su Huifang. Today he had dragged Zhang Zhongyu along to act as a go-between. Zhongyu thought to himself that a person of Huifang's refined character was unlikely to agree to follow Pan Qiguan, so he was evasive and reluctant to help. However, after Pan pleaded"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":9,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"色镶鞋，胸前衣衿上挂着一枝短烟袋，露出半个绿皮烟荷包。淡黄眼珠，红丝缠满，笑瞇嘻的低声下气，装出许多谦温样子。蕙芳无奈，只得坐下陪着。张仲雨看着蕙芳，却像要说话又不说的光景。蕙芳低了头，一回站起来，到窗前看那盆内种的兰花，心上却忆着田春航，又不好回他们出去，无精打采的坐立不安。那潘其观坐着不动，也不开口，眼睛只注着蕙芳。张仲雨道：「咱们也不必找地方，就在这里摆个","en":"veins. He smiled ingratiatingly, speaking in a low, obsequious voice, putting on a grand show of humble warmth. Huifang had no choice but to sit down and keep them company. Zhang Zhongyu kept looking at him with the air of a man about to speak who does not speak. Huifang sat with his head down, then got up and went to the window to look at the orchid in its pot, thinking"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":2,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"那晓得潘其观最会闹酒，越喝越不醉，酒下了肚，嘴里就没有好话，便伸出那又短又肥挺硬的那只手来，搀住了蕙芳的手道：「好孩子，怎么你总不去瞧瞧我，我很想你。每见了你的戏，晚上就做梦，倒亲亲热热的长在一块儿顽，醒了便觉得困乏。你真害死我了，我又没有儿子，要这一分大家财作什么？你与我做个干儿子，咱们爷儿俩天天的乐，不好吗？」蕙芳听了，几乎气得哭出来，眼睛一红，","en":"cup. As the wine went down his talk grew fouler. He put out that short, fat, stiff hand of his and took hold of Huifang's.\\n\\n\\"Good child, why do you never come and see me? I think of you sorely. Every time I have seen you act I dream of you that night — the two of us close and warm together and playing all night long — and I wake up worn out. You are the death of me. And"},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":1,"tokens":["苏蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"张仲雨心上诧异，暗想道：「这也奇了，不料苏蕙芳倒喜欢潘其观，难道钱可通神，我的财运来了，好发他一注大财。」","en":"Zhang Zhongyu was inwardly astonished. He thought it strange that Su Huifang actually seemed to like Pan Qiguan. He wondered if money truly could move the gods, and rejoiced that his own luck had arrived, anticipating a massive windfall."},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"不说两回。常说道：「只要你能有心向他，他就拿个银号给你。」即向潘其观道：「这话不是你亲口说的么？」其观点点头。蕙芳笑道：「你有几个银号？一个相公给一个，京城里有几百个相公，难道你有几百个银号不成？」","en":"would make him a present of a silver house.'\\" Then, to Pan Qiguan: \\"Were those not your own words?\\" Pan nodded.\\n\\nHuifang laughed. \\"And how many silver houses have you? One apiece to every boy in the trade — there are some hundreds of us in the capital. Have you some hundreds of silver houses?\\""},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":2,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"潘其观道：「别人要想我一个大钱也不能，只要你肯，我什么都肯。」蕙芳心里已有了主意，对着潘其观把眼一睃，把潘其观的三魂七魄都勾了出来。仲雨也得意洋洋，把指头敲着桌子，不住的喊好。蕙芳道：「潘三爷，你既心上有我，你今日必得畅饮一天，不可藏着量儿。」其观道：「拿大杯来！」","en":"else might want a single copper of mine and not get it. If only you are willing, there is nothing I will not do.\\" Huifang had his plan settled by now, and gave Pan Qiguan a sidelong look that drew the three souls and seven spirits clean out of him. Zhongyu was hugely pleased too, drumming his fingers on the table and calling out well done, well done. Huifang said, \\"Third"},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":6,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"蕙芳便亲手去拿了两只大杯，将酒斟满了，一人敬了一杯：又斟了两杯道：「潘三爷，我今日本来要和你饮个成双杯，实在酒量小，不能饮，你饮这双杯。」潘其观点头播脑的饮了。又斟上两杯，对着仲雨道：「张老爷，你也饮个成双杯。」仲雨笑道：「你叫我和谁成双？」蕙芳道：「你","en":"Huifang went and fetched two large cups with his own hands, filled them, and pressed one on each of them. Then he poured two more. \\"Third Master Pan, I meant to drink a paired cup with you today, but my head is weak and I cannot; you drink the pair.\\" Pan Qiguan"},{"paragraph":30,"mentions":11,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"已到申末酉初时候，蕙芳见他们尚未沉醉，便试他一试道：「潘三爷，有句话论理不当说，我们没有什么交情。但是，我急了，我欠人家一票银子，约明日还他。今日我打算出去张罗，偏偏你这财神爷来了．可肯通融一肩？」潘其观道：「要多少？」蕙芳道：「不多，二百两。」潘三目视仲雨，仲雨道：「你","en":"By now it was between the shen and you hours. Seeing they were not yet dead drunk, Huifang tried them. \\"Third Master Pan, by rights I ought not to say this, for we are nothing to one another. But I am hard pressed. I owe a note of silver that must be paid tomorrow, and I meant to go out today and raise it — and here is the god of wealth himself"},{"paragraph":31,"mentions":9,"tokens":["蕙芳","苏媚香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"值席的拿了半碗饭来，蕙芳吃了几口，仰着头靠在椅背上，只说不中用，疼得很。仲雨道：「吃青果便可消得。」蕙芳又吃了几个青果，仍说不好。潘三过来，把嘴凑近蕙芳脸上，想要个乖乖，说道：「你张开口待我望望。」蕙芳便把袖子掩了脸道：「这如何望得见？总为着敬你的皮杯。只要你多吃几钟，我就","en":"The man on duty brought half a bowl of rice. Huifang ate a few mouthfuls, then leaned his head back against the chair. \\"It is no use. It hurts badly.\\" Zhongyu said, \\"Eat green olives and it will dissolve.\\" Huifang ate a few olives and still said it was no better.\\n\\nPan came over and put his face close to"},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":5,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"蕙芳安排已毕，一面叫套车，一面到自己房中开了箱子，拣出小毛棉夹单纱五套衣服，并潘三的二百吊钱票，带了一副铺盖，一总交跟班的拿出来，放在车上。蕙芳上了车，跟班跨了沿，一齐向春航寓处来。才到了胡衕口，月光下见一人站着，赶车的一看，却认得就是田春航，便住了车，","en":"Having made all these arrangements, Huifang ordered his carriage to be hitched. He went to his own room, opened his chest, and selected five sets of clothing made of lightly padded cotton, lightweight silk, and single-layer gauze. He packed these together with the two-hundred-string cash notes"},{"paragraph":33,"mentions":2,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"睡，春航剔亮了灯，叫醒了田安，说道：「快去泡茶。」田安擦擦眼睛，见一个美少年，只道是位公子，便急急的泡茶去了。蕙芳坐下，看他行李萧条，心里着实难过。便叫跟班的将衣裳、票子拿上来，道：「这五套衣服都是我平日穿过的，你不嫌旧，使收着。这票子送你作旅费。本来打算请你过去住，恐旁观不雅。你若短少了东西，只管问我。」春航道：「这如何使得？我断不好受。」蕙芳道：「你不受，便","en":"Tian An rubbed his eyes, and seeing a beautiful youth took him for a young gentleman and hurried off to get it.\\n\\nHuifang sat down, and looking at how bare the lodging was felt a real pang. He had his man bring in the clothes and the notes. \\"These five suits are things I have worn myself. If you do not mind them being old, keep them. And take these notes for your travelling"},{"paragraph":34,"mentions":2,"tokens":["苏蕙芳","蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"半撤在裤挡里头。模模糊糊的在地下乱摸，摸着了炕，重新爬上来。心里细细的想，在那里吃的酒。虽在醉中，还被他想着了苏蕙芳，便又在炕上摸索，摸着了张仲雨，便当是蕙芳了，一把搂紧，口里道：「好儿子，好心肝」的叫不绝声，便乱拉乱扯，把棉被早已撩下地了。又把仲雨的衣裳尽力的扯，扯破了一件夹袄，手也酸了；将自己的裤带，用力扯断，倒不将裤子往下脱，只管往上拉，那一条尿裤，已是湿透","en":"climbed back up, and set himself to think out where it was he had been drinking. Drunk as he was, he arrived at Su Huifang; and so he groped about the kang, and got hold of Zhang Zhongyu and took him for Huifang, and clutched him tight, calling out, \\"Good boy — sweetheart —\\" without stopping, and hauling and pulling at him until the quilt was long since on the floor.\\n\\nHe"},{"paragraph":35,"mentions":3,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"道：「奇怪！」潘其观道：「怪奇！」二人前前后后的一想，便拍手大笑了一会。此时已经天明，太阳也出来了。潘其观便问蕙芳藏在那里，原来蕙芳交代了一番说话，方才出门。打杂的道：「昨夜你们两位老爷睡了，不料华公子住在城外，打发人来把蕙芳叫去。这位老爷谁敢违拗他，只怕今日带进了城，要住好几天才回来。」","en":"clapped their hands and laughed a good while. By this time it was light and the sun was up.\\n\\nPan Qiguan asked where Huifang was hiding — Huifang having left his instructions before going out. The odd-job man said, \\"Last night, after your honours were asleep, who should send but Young Master Hua, who is out of town, and he had Huifang fetched away. Who would dare cross that"},{"paragraph":37,"mentions":3,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这边蕙芳与春航早上起来，洗洗脸，吃了点心。蕙芳见壁上挂了张琴。即问春航道：「你会弹琴么？」春航道：「略知一二。」蕙芳道：「何不弹一曲听听？」未知春航弹与不弹，且听下回分解。","en":"Meanwhile Huifang and Chunhang rose in the morning, washed, and ate a little. Huifang noticed a qin hanging on the wall. \\"Do you play the qin?\\" Chunhang said, \\"A little.\\" Huifang said, \\"Then why not play a piece and let me hear it?\\" Whether Chunhang played or not, hear"}],"14":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":5,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说蕙芳要春航抚琴，春航道：「少坐一坐。」便目不转睛的看着蕙芳，蕙芳笑道：「难道你还认不仔细，只管发呆作什么？」春航笑道：「我看卿旁妍侧媚，变态百出，如花光露气，晚日迎风，眼光捉不住，倒越看越不能仔细。」蕙芳啐了一口，立起来把春航的钮子解开，替他脱下衣裳。春","en":"Huifang had been asking Chunhang to play the qin, and Chunhang said, \\"Just a moment.\\" He kept his eyes fixed on Huifang without blinking. Huifang laughed and said, \\"Can you really not make me out yet? Why do you keep staring so blankly?\\" Chunhang laughed and"},{"paragraph":2,"mentions":4,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"蕙芳笑嘻嘻的拿了镜子，倚着春航一照，映出两个玉人。春航看镜中的蕙芳，正如莲花解语，秋水无尘，便略略点一点头，回转脸来，却好碰着蕙芳的脸，蕙芳把脸一侧，起了半边红晕。","en":"Huifang smiled as he took up a mirror and held it beside Chunhang, and it reflected back two figures of jade. Chunhang looked at Huifang's image in the mirror. There he was, like a lotus that could speak, like autumn water without a speck of dust. Seeing this,"},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"此心已不能自主，忽急急的转念道：他是我患难中知己，岂可稍涉邪念，便敛了敛神。蕙芳一笑走开了。春航换了新衣，依然丰姿奕奕，神采飞扬，与从前一样。","en":"times of hardship; how could I allow the slightest impure thought? He steadied his spirit and composed himself. Huifang gave a smile and moved away. Chunhang, now dressed in his new clothes, was once again resplendent in bearing and radiant in spirit, just as he had always been."},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":2,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"蕙芳坐了，在书案上翻了一翻书，翻着一本诗稿，半真半行的字，有数十页，面上题着《燕台旅稿》。蕙芳随手一揭，见是一首七言古诗，题是《恼公》诗，便低低的念起来道：","en":"Huifang sat down and idly leafed through the books on the writing desk. He came upon a manuscript of poems, written in a hand halfway between regular and running script, running to several dozen pages, with the title \\"Travel Drafts from Yantai\\" (燕台旅稿) inscribed"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":2,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"帘钩戛玉声玲珑，樱桃花映银丝栊。\\n绿云欹侧燕钗堕，年年锦字春机红。\\n蕙芳道：「好诗！这派诗是学温、李的三十六体，纤秾之极。」春航道：「偶一为之，亦只能貌似耳。」蕙芳又念下去道：","en":"one side, the swallow-tail hairpin falls.\\nYear after year the brocade characters bloom red on the spring loom.\\n\\nHuifang said, \\"A fine poem! This style derives from the 'Thirty-Six Forms' of Wen Tingyun and Li Shangyin, exquisitely lush and delicate.\\" Chunhang replied, \\"It was written on a whim; I can only approximate their manner, no more.\\" Huifang read on:"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"远山寸碧双眉翠，鲛绡半染胭脂泪。\\n玳瑁梁间燕子飞，鸳鸯瓦上狸奴睡。\\n蕙芳道：「好工致，韵亦转得脆，狸奴句胜似燕子．再搭上鸳鸯瓦，更新。」再念道：","en":"of rouge-laden tears.\\nIn the painted beams the swallows fly;\\nOn the mandarin-duck tiles the cat lies asleep.\\"\\n\\nHuifang said, \\"What fine craftsmanship, and the rhyme turns crisply. The line about the cat surpasses the one about the swallows, and placed against the mandarin-duck tiles, it becomes all the more fresh and original.\\" He read on:"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":2,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"飘烟抱月一尺腰，\\n星眸欲妒春云娇。\\n蕙芳叫一声「好」又道：「近行前来百媚生，兀得不引了人魂灵，临去秋波」，犹未足喻其妙也。」春航道：「光景倒像你。」蕙芳道：「我也配？」又念下去是：","en":"smoke, of clasped moonlight, a single foot around.\\nStar-bright eyes jealous of the spring clouds' proud allure.\\"\\n\\nHuifang called out \\"Wonderful!\\" and added: \\"'She drew near, and a hundred charms were born; she turned to go, and that autumn glance', even those lines are insufficient to convey this poem's subtlety.\\" Chunhang said, \\"The image seems to be you.\\" Huifang said,"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":7,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"玉螭细细盘条脱，金雀双双飞步摇。\\n多情郎似桐花凤，日近云鬟身不动。\\n软爱香罗雾觳轻，娇嫌锦帐银钩重。\\n蕙芳道：「好浓艳工稳。我见犹怜，你是为谁而作？既「日近云鬟身不动」了，又何必天天上戏园呢？」春航便走过来，轻轻的靠在蕙芳椅背上道：「此人难道算不得戏园中人？从前思近芳泽而不能，如今倒也如愿而偿了。」蕙芳道：「是谁？是我们班里的么？」春航点头说「是」。蕙芳","en":"for fragrant gauze, the mist of fine silk light;\\nCoy disdain for brocade curtains, the silver hooks too heavy.\\"\\n\\nHuifang said, \\"How richly gorgeous, how even and assured. Even I feel tenderness looking at it. But for whom did you write it? If he is 'daily beside cloudlike tresses, his body does not stir,' why must you haunt the theater every day?\\" Chunhang walked over"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":2,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"画栏珠箔悬蜻蜓，碧桃一树开娉婷。\\n朝朝花下许郎看，只格一扇玻璃屏。\\n蕙芳便掩卷想了一想道：「好美人，花容月貌。好才子，绣口锦心。悬蜻蜓三字说什么的，想有典故。」春航道：「李义山诗「晓帘串断蜻蜓翼，罗屏但有空青色。」蕙芳道：「这首我见过偶然忘了，看你底下怎样转接呢。」又念道：","en":"after morning she permits the young man to gaze at her flowers,\\nOnly a single pane of glass stands between them.\\"\\n\\nHuifang closed the volume and pondered a moment. \\"What a beauty, fair as flowers, bright as the moon. What a fine talent with embroidered lips and a brocade heart. What does 'a dragonfly hangs' refer to? I suspect there is an allusion.\\" Chunhang said, \\"Li Yishan's"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":4,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"郎彩桃花比侬面，桃花易见侬难见。\\n妾貌常如月二分，郎心莫学文三变。\\n蕙芳道：「须得如此一开，底下便生出一番话来。文三变，可是说你变了心么？」春航道：「是用《艺文序》上：「唐文章无虑三变」的一句。」蕙芳看着春航道：「这么想来，你也算不得有良心的人。」春航道：「何出此言？」蕙芳道：「他的貌呢也不能常如月二分，你的心自必至文三","en":"will always be like the moon at the second day,\\nBut your heart, I pray, will not follow Wen Sanbian's example.\\"\\n\\nHuifang said, \\"It must open this way, only then does what follows have room to breathe. 'Wen Sanbian', is that to say you have changed your heart?\\" Chunhang replied, \\"I am drawing on a line from the Preface to the 'Arts and Literature Preface' (艺文序): 'Tang literature"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"罗帏寂寞真珠房，麝脐龙髓怜余香。\\n锦鳞三十六难寄，碧箫吹断云天长。\\n蕙芳点头叹道：「人生世上，离合悲欢，是一定有的。」又念下去道：","en":"brocade carp-scales are too hard to convey;\\nThe jade flute blows broken, cloud and sky stretch without end.\\"\\n\\nHuifang nodded and sighed: \\"In this life, partings and reunions, joy and sorrow, they are all fixed and certain.\\" He continued reading:"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"绿绣笙囊挂东壁，无花无言春寂寂。\\n怨女思弹桑妇筝，宫人愁倚杨纪笛。\\n蕙芳道：「好巧对。这桑妇筝、杨妃笛实在借对得工巧。上句自然是用的《罗敷陌上桑》了。这杨纪笛，我记得张祜诗「小窗静院无人见，闲把宁王玉笛吹」；又曾看过《贵妃外传》：","en":"wronged woman yearns to pluck the Sang-fu zither string;\\nThe palace lady leans in grief upon Yang Fei's flute.\\"\\n\\nHuifang said, \\"What a clever parallel. The pairing of 'Sang-fu's zither' and 'Yang Fei's flute' is truly an ingenious oblique correspondence. The upper line naturally alludes to Luo Fu of the 'Luofu on the Mulberry Path.' But this 'Yang Fei's flute' brings to"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"是用《集异记》上，帝至蜀，月夜登楼，故贵纪侍者红桃，歌妃所制《凉州曲》，上御贵纪玉笛倚之，吹罢相视掩泣的事。」蕙芳点头，又念道：","en":"jade flute and played along, and when it was done they looked at each other and covered their faces and wept.\\" Huifang nodded, then read on:"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":7,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"海棠醉堕蝴蝶飞，柳绵无力情依依。\\n井底水如妾心意，路旁尘惹君身衣。\\n蕙芳便觉凄然，作色道：「一往情深，缠绵悱恻，好个有情人。底下便是结语了。」念道：「翠毛么凤拖红尾。」蕙芳道：「此句劈空而来，笔势奇崛，又推开了。凤有红尾的么？」春航道：「温飞卿诗有「秦王女骑红尾凤。」蕙芳又念道：「跨凤随郎三万里。一日香心思百回，闲时又逐","en":"the bottom of the well is like my heart's intent;\\nThe dust on the roadside clings to the garment of my lord.\\"\\n\\nHuifang felt a pang of sadness, and his expression changed. \\"Such depth of emotion, such lingering tenderness. What a devoted soul. This must be the closing passage.\\" He read:\\n\\n\\"A tiny phoenix with emerald feathers trails its red tail.\\"\\n\\nHuifang said, \\"This"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"蕙芳却呆呆的听着，春航笑道：「你自会卜，倒不会详。」高品也笑了。","en":"Huifang listened intently, as if lost in thought. Chunhang laughed: \\"You cast the divination yourself, yet you cannot interpret it.\\" Gao Pin laughed too."},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":5,"tokens":["蕙芳","媚香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"蕙芳要问高品时，见窗外脚步响，有个人影来影去。春航问：「是谁？」听得咳嗽一声，应道：「是我，寻高老爷有句话说。」高品听口声便道：「妙兮，妙兮。」出来一望，果然是庙里的唐和尚，问道：「你有什么话说？」唐和尚便笑嘻嘻的钻将进来，与春航见了，看见了蕙芳，便合着","en":"Huifang was about to ask Gao Pin's opinion when footsteps were heard outside the window as a shadow passed back and forth. Chunhang asked, \\"Who is it?\\" A cough sounded, followed by a reply: \\"It is I. I have a word to say to Lord Gao.\\" Gao Pin recognized the"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":8,"tokens":["蕙芳","媚香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「若锥处囊中，颖脱而出。」蕙芳笑了一笑，唐和尚便夺了帽子戴上，便道：「高老爷，你、你、你。」又不说了，嘻着嘴笑。蕙芳道：「我已对了。」即念道：「如瓢浮水面，顶圆而光。」春航、高品都笑说道：「对得好，敏捷且好。」唐和尚笑道：「多谢、多谢，小僧有幸得逢菩萨赞扬，倒没有说我的像鸡巴。」","en":"\\"Like an awl inside a bag, the tip pierces through and emerges.\\" Huifang gave a small smile. Tang the Monk snatched his hat back and put it on, then started, \\"Lord Gao, you, you, you...\\" and said nothing more, just grinning. Huifang said, \\"I have already matched it,\\" and recited: \\"Like a gourd floating on water, the top is"},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":2,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"业，意气在少年。\\n二十岁以下，当头大哥前。\\n三八多一龄，二哥我比肩。\\n白日指天青，酹酒无丁宁。\\n春航要站起来，蕙芳把手按住春航的手道：「正好听，快弹下去。」春航道：「弹完了。」蕙芳道：「怎么这么快？」","en":"point to the blue sky above,\\nPouring out the wine libation, wordless, in silence.\\"\\n\\nChunhang made to rise, but Huifang pressed his hand down: \\"This is just the finest part, please play on.\\" Chunhang said, \\"The piece is finished.\\" Huifang said, \\"How can it be over so soon?\\""},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":5,"tokens":["蕙芳","媚香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"春航道：「这套琴就只三段。」蕙芳道：「太短，再弹长的。」高品笑道：「湘帆，媚香嫌你快，又嫌你短。你总得贴张千娇百美膏才好。」春航道：「胡说！」蕙芳要去撕高品的嘴，高品便深深作揖道：「宽恕小生这一次罢。」惹得蕙芳倒笑了。蕙芳要春航弹《胡笳十八拍》，又要弹《洞天春晓》，说道：「这两套我","en":"Chunhang said, \\"This suite has only three sections.\\" Huifang said, \\"Too short, play a longer one.\\" Gao Pin laughed: \\"Xiangfan, Meixiang finds your piece too fast and too short. You had better go and paste up a placard advertising some thousand-charm, hundred-beauty remedy.\\" Chunhang said, \\"Nonsense!\\" Huifang made"},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":2,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"六七段，恍如见湘娥啼竹，列子御风，鸣呜咽咽，如怨如慕，如泣如诉。真是拔剑斲地，搔首问天，清风瑟瑟，从窗隙中来。蕙芳与高品，都正襟危坐，静气敛容的听着。忽然七弦六徽二分上低了，五弦六徽上高了，四弦九徽上也差了几分。春航道：「奇了，宫商为何忽乱起来？」高品、蕙芳却听不出。春航又把弦和了一和，和不准，即住手问高品：「庙里有弹琴的人么？」高品道：「胡琴或者和尚会拉，琴是","en":"split sword-strokes and probe the heavens; a cool wind stirred and rustled in through the cracks of the window. Huifang and Gao Pin both sat upright and composed, listening with breath held and expression gathered. Suddenly the seventh string at the second division of the sixth position went flat, the fifth string at the sixth position went sharp, and the fourth string"},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":2,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"帆。」南湘已听见仲清讲过田湘帆的才学，便道：「既是田湘帆，何不出来会我史竹君？」高品道：「我为介绍。」说到此，蕙芳已出来见了，即便拉了南湘进去。南湘道：「咦，你也在这里，不料今日高卓然的斋堂倒成了石季伦的金谷。」那边春航亦迎出来，彼此相见，未免道了些仰慕的话。玉林、兰保也与春航见了，与蕙芳坐在一处。南湘对着高品道：「卓然既叫相公，自然有酒，不要装呆，快拿出来罢。","en":"why does he not come out and meet Shi Zhujun?\\" Gao Pin said, \\"Allow me to make the introduction.\\" At that moment Huifang had already come out to greet him, and promptly drew Nanxiang inside. Nanxiang said, \\"Well! You are here too. I had no idea that Gao Zhuoran's monastic chamber would today become Shi Jilun's Golden Valley!\\" Chunhang also came forward to meet him, and"},{"paragraph":30,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"兔丝、马勃尽是药笼中物，这不是狄梁公么？湘帆弄到精光，昨夜有个夤夜私奔的红拂来，这不是李药师么？」大家都笑，唯蕙芳红了脸道：「前日既然楼上跌下来，倒不变成了鳖，或是跌折了腿也好。」高品笑道：「楼上跌下来，总还平常，只怕在戏园门口跌在车辙里，被骡子踏杀了，那倒可怕。」南湘问起来，高品就一五一十的说了，羞得春航无地可容。","en":"certain 'Red Whisk' came eloping with him in the dead of night. Is that not Li Yaoshi?\\" Everyone laughed, except Huifang, who reddened and said, \\"For falling off that upper balcony the other day, it would have been better if you had turned into a snapping turtle, or at least broken a leg.\\" Gao Pin laughed: \\"Tumbling off an upper balcony is still fairly ordinary. What is"},{"paragraph":31,"mentions":4,"tokens":["媚香","蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"真是韵人，绝代佳人以一跌感之，倒是从来未有之事。古闻孙寿堕妆，梁冀下马。今见苏郎唱戏，田子跟车。一副好对，持赠媚香罢。」蕙芳睃着南湘道：「你何苦也学着那嚼舌头的人挖苦我。」高品道：「这话是恨我已深，其实我与你无仇无怨，何必这样恶狠狠的？」蕙芳道：「你再说，我就卸你的底了。」高品道：「尽管卸，我却不怕。」蕙芳便念道：「请筵享官、赏戴貂翎、会馆副总裁、戏园行走、书画","en":"Su Lang performing onstage, and Tian Zi chasing the carriage. A splendid parallel couplet, let me present it to Meixiang.\\" Huifang gave Nanxiang a sidelong glance and said, \\"Why must you also imitate that sharp-tongued fellow and mock me?\\" Gao Pin said, \\"These words are spoken as if you have a deep grudge against me, when in truth I bear you no enmity at all. Why so harsh?\\""},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":3,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这官衔是刘文泽编成的，席中惟有南湘一人知道，春航尚是创闻。高品道：「还有一个官衔你没有说。」蕙芳道：「好像没有了。」高品道：「还有监造兔园册子呢。」南湘又笑。蕙芳不曾理会，即与兰保、玉林在各人面前敬了几杯酒。春航前次已见过玉林，看他丰致嫣然，虽逊蕙芳一筹，然比起从前赏识的一班相公，却高得多。见他桃腮粉腻，莲脸香生，另有一种体态丰姿。见他对高品更","en":"knew their origin, while to Chunhang it was entirely new. Gao Pin said, \\"There is one title you have left out.\\" Huifang said, \\"It seems there was nothing more.\\" Gao Pin said, \\"You have omitted Superintendent of the Compilation of the Rabbit Garden Catalogue.\\" Nanxiang laughed again. Huifang paid no attention to this, and poured several cups of wine for Lanbao, Yulin,"},{"paragraph":35,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"偏是春航输得多了，以后便不肯饮。南湘命兰保斟了一杯酒，去灌春航。兰保即拿着酒来，走到春航面前，蕙芳知春航不能饮酒，便凑着兰保的手饮了。","en":"ordered Lanbao to pour a cup and make Chunhang drink it. Lanbao rose and walked over to Chunhang with the wine; but Huifang, knowing that Chunhang could not hold his drink, leaned forward and drank it from Lanbao's hand for him."},{"paragraph":36,"mentions":11,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"兰保笑道：「这干你什么事？要你越俎而代？」蕙芳笑道：「这叫做借他人之杯酒，浇自己之垒块。」兰保道：「既然如此，倒请多干几杯。」便斟了几满杯酒，要蕙芳饮。蕙芳道：「我不爱饮了，适可而止。」兰保道：「那由不得你，你不闻」失意睚眦间，白刃相交加」么？」南湘、春航看着他们，高品对着王兰保作嘴作脸，要他罚","en":"Lanbao laughed: \\"What does this have to do with you? Must you step in and act in another's place?\\" Huifang laughed: \\"This is what is called borrowing another's cup of wine to wash away one's own sorrows.\\" Lanbao said, \\"In that case, please drain a few more cups.\\" He poured several full cups and pressed Huifang to drink them. Huifang said, \\"I have had enough,"},{"paragraph":37,"mentions":4,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"蕙芳进来，春航问起何事？蕙芳道：「家内有人寻我，我回他去了。」高品道：「是谁？蕙芳道：「不认得。来人说叫什么奚十一，是广东人。」高品道：「好累赘姓，兜头一撇，握颈三拳，中间便丝丝的搅不清，这要假充个大老官。东方之夷有九种，不知他是那一种。」蕙芳道：「你倒","en":"Huifang came back inside, and Chunhang asked what the matter was. Huifang replied, \\"Someone at home came looking for me; I sent him away.\\" Gao Pin asked, \\"Who was it?\\" Huifang said, \\"I don't know him. The servant said his name was something like Xi Eleven, a"},{"paragraph":40,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"们抢说？」李玉林便斟起罚酒来，南湘、春航只图说得爽快，倒也意不在罚。南湘饮了五杯，兰保代了两杯。春航饮了三杯，蕙芳代了四杯。","en":"forgotten about the penalties. Nanxiang drank five cups and Lanbao drank two for him. Chunhang drank three cups and Huifang drank four for him."},{"paragraph":41,"mentions":10,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"：「以粟易之。曰：许子奚……」春航道：「第九个到少。」便想了一想道：「与礼之轻者而比之奚与礼之重者而比之奚。」蕙芳便顿足道：「你何必要说两句？」高品道：「好呵，罚九杯。」蕙芳道：「这不能。」高品那里肯依，先罚蕙芳五杯，再罚了春航四杯。南湘忽然想着了两句，忍不住不说，也顾不得罚酒，便一气说道：「南面而征北狄怨，曰：奚……以其小者．信其大者，奚……」兰保便跳起来道：","en":"said: \\"'Compare it with the lesser ritual, for what reason? Compare it with the greater ritual, for what reason?'\\" Huifang stamped his foot: \\"Why must you say two lines?\\" Gao Pin said, \\"Excellent, nine cups of forfeit.\\" Huifang said, \\"This can't be right.\\" Gao Pin would not give way; first he imposed five cups on Huifang, then four more on Chunhang. Nanxiang suddenly thought"}],"15":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":2,"tokens":["蕙芳","苏媚香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说史南湘进内与仲清、王恂见了、喝了几杯茶、王恂问其所从来、南湘将日间的事，一一说了，又将春航、蕙芳的光景说了一会。王恂、仲清羡慕不已。仲清道：「不料苏媚香竟能这样，从此田湘帆倒可以收心改过了。」也将前日题画规劝之事说了，又说春航且有徽愠。南湘道：「改日我与你们和事如何？」又问起子玉来，仲清道：「庾香日间在此，他的李先生于月初选了安徽知县，就要动身","en":"he had been, and Nanxiang recounted the day's events one by one, then spoke at some length about Chunhang and Huifang. Wang Xun and Zhongqing found themselves unable to conceal their profound admiration. Zhongqing said, \\"Who would have thought Su Meixiang capable of this? Henceforth, Tian Xiangfan may truly shed his past and turn over a new leaf.\\" He then recounted"},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":4,"tokens":["媚香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"也有人说他神妙。」子云笑道：「以后梅庾香，大约非玉侬之戏不看，非玉侬的之酒不喝的了。」漱芳笑道：「玉侬行事还没媚香的奇，近来闻他天天到宏济寺去一回。有个什么田湘帆，也是个风流名士，闹到不堪。后来见了媚香的戏，便天天跟着他的车，他往东就往东，他往西就往西，跟了整个月。媚香怜念他，与他一谈，倒谈成了知己，如今是莫逆得很，不可一日不见。」次贤笑道：「有这等事！我看媚香","en":"drink at no feast where Yunong is not present.\\" Shufang laughed: \\"Yunong's conduct is not yet as remarkable as Meixiang's. I hear that lately Meixiang goes to Hongji Temple once a day. There is a certain Tian Xiangfan there, a renowned man of romantic temperament, who has created quite a stir. He once saw Meixiang perform and thereafter followed his carriage every single"}],"17":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":2,"tokens":["媚香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉即把日间一一过访不遇事说过。先是王恂开言道：「今日我们都在卓然斋中，交会田湘帆与媚香，又遇见竹君前来。那湘帆果是吾辈，与媚香相处的光景，真令人羡慕。」高品道：「湘帆此时是六根全净，五蕴皆空，守定了约法三章，不许你胡行乱走，始信人间果然多是惧内的，怪不得庸庵、竹君辈，牢守闺房，不奉将令不敢妄离一步。违了，晚间夹棍利害。","en":"Xun was the first to speak: \\"Today we were all gathered in Zhuoran's studio, where we met with Tian Xiangfan and Meixiang, and chanced upon Zhujun who arrived later. Xiangfan is truly a kindred spirit. The way he and Meixiang interact is genuinely enviable.\\" Gao Pin chimed in: \\"Xiangfan is now a man whose six senses are entirely purified, his five skandhas rendered void."},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":3,"tokens":["媚香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"」众人又说笑了一阵，高品道：「庾香，后日有一件极好的事，来与你商量。」子玉便问道：「何事？」高品道：「十五日是媚香生日。今日大家商议，并订前舟与你合成一剂六君子汤，凑一公分，找个宽敞的地方，把那些知名宝贝，都叫将来热闹一天，请湘帆与媚香做生日，你道好不好？」子玉道：「好极，好极！但不知在何处聚会？」王恂道：「我家亦可，但无花园子，不如前舟园里好。我们主人六个，添","en":"splendid affair, and I have come to discuss it with you.\\" Ziyu asked: \\"What affair?\\" Gao Pin said: \\"The fifteenth is Meixiang's birthday. Today we all deliberated and agreed to join forces with Qianzhou and yourself to form a 'Six Gentlemen Decoction'—pooling our funds to find a spacious pavilion, inviting all those renowned beauties for a day of lively festivity, and celebrating"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":5,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"却说田春航自与蕙芳订交之后，足不出户。蕙芳每日不论早晚。必来一次，或清谈或小饮，并时进箴砭之语，所以春航已心满意足，只有研磨经籍，挥洒词翰。本来是三冬富足，倚马万言，一时名动京师，当道者皆欲罗致门下。无奈春航磊落自负，以干谒为耻，未尝怀刺一谒要津，宁居萧寺，玉人作伴，","en":"Now let us speak of Tian Chunhang. Since forging his bond with Huifang, he had not set foot outside the temple grounds. Huifang came without fail once a day, whether morning or evening, sometimes for pure conversation, sometimes for a modest drink, occasionally offering words of admonishment and needle-sharp advice. As"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":5,"tokens":["蕙芳","媚香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"。长廊内，湘帘之外，摆列着十余盆蕙花，趁着和风微漾，香气袭人。文泽正在廊前独立，见前面走进一人，远远望见，知是蕙芳华服而来，上了阶沿，即恭恭敬敬的行起大礼来。文泽连忙扶起道：「媚香何故如此，应让我先与你祝寿才是。」蕙芳道：「贱齿之辰，上邀诸贵人眷顾，使蕙芳何以克当。昨日本要到各处辞谢，又恐怪我不受抬举；且今日大罗天上，众仙齐集，使芳辈鸡犬偕升，虽不得仙，亦可脱俗","en":"standing alone before the corridor when he saw a figure approach from the front; gazing from afar, he knew it was Huifang arriving in splendid attire. Upon stepping onto the edge of the stairs, Huifang immediately bowed with the utmost respect and reverence in a grand ceremony. Wenze hurriedly helped him up, saying: \\"Why do you act so, Meixiang? You should allow me first"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":3,"tokens":["蕙芳","媚香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"诸人正在叙谈，只见传帖人引着子玉进来，蕙芳虽不认识，心中却已猜着，上前叩谢。子玉搀住道：「这可是媚香么？我庾香闻名久慕，觌面无缘，今幸仰企下风，已觉清芬竟体。」蕙芳连称不敢，看了子玉仪容，心中暗暗赞赏：「真是天上日星，人间鸾凤，有一段孚瑜和粹之情，皎皎乎有出群之致。怪不得杜玉侬倾倒如此，与我","en":"While everyone was exchanging courtesies, they saw the servant who had received the letter leading Ziyu in. Though Huifang did not recognize him, he had already guessed his identity in his heart, and stepped forward to bow and give thanks. Ziyu supported him, saying: \\"Can this be Meixiang? I, Yuxiang, have long admired your name but lacked the fate to meet you face to face;"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":2,"tokens":["蕙芳","媚香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"蕙芳抢上几步行了礼，子云、次贤两边扶起来道：「媚香一向洒脱，今日忽然拘礼，不是倒累了你了。」遂进室内，与诸人相见，群旦亦都见毕，叙齿坐下。子云道：「蒙庾香、前舟及诸兄折柬相招，今日之举，可为极盛。昨已饱读庾香珠玉，今日尚觉齿有余芬。又复当此群花大会，使弟","en":"Huifang stepped forward several paces to bow; Ziyun and Cixian each helped him up from one side and said: \\"Meixiang has always been easy and unconstrained, so why so formal today? Surely you are putting us to too much trouble.\\" They then entered the room and"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"碰伤了小寿星，因此行走不便么；不然，或是又滑倒在车辙里了。」说得众人大笑道：「卓然妙语，待寿翁来罚其三大觞。」蕙芳似觉脸红，宝珠道：「今日的客，尚短几人？」文泽道：「就止寿翁一人。花部中未到的尚有四人：琴言、琪官都有病，早来辞了，桂保、春喜是必来的。等湘帆一到，就可坐了。」","en":"out laughing: \\"Zhuoran's wit is priceless. When the birthday-star arrives, let him be fined three great cups.\\" Huifang seemed to blush slightly. Baozhu said: \\"How many guests are still to arrive today?\\" Wenze said: \\"Just the birthday-star, one person. Among the flower contingent, four are absent: Qinyan and Qiguan are both ill and sent their regrets early this morning;"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":3,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"已到，大家重新叙礼，群芳亦都见了，未免取笑的取笑，诙谐的诙谐。宝珠与素兰拉过红毡铺地，摆了两张交椅，要请春航、蕙芳并坐受拜。二人如何肯坐，急行收了。此时春航、蕙芳二人真觉口众我寡，只好听凭他们取笑；若回答两句，又惹出许多话来。子玉颇敬春航仪容之洒落，与蕙芳正是冰壶秋月，相映生辉。又复品评诸花，各有佳妙，只不见琴言前来，殊觉怦怦欲动。","en":"drew out a red felt mat and placed it on the floor, setting up two folding chairs, intending to ask Chunhang and Huifang to sit together and receive obeisance. The two of them absolutely refused to sit, so the mat was quickly put away. By now Chunhang and Huifang felt they were outnumbered and simply submitted to the general raillery; to answer back would only invite more."},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"文泽即命家人摆起三桌席来，因问道：「今日之坐，还是叙齿，还是推寿翁寿母上坐？」春航、蕙芳同道：「这断断不敢，自然叙齿为妙。」众人也说叙齿罢了。文泽送酒，先定中间一席。论齿是次贤为长，次贤自知不能推逊，只得依了，并坐者为高品，次是仲清；左首一席，子云为首，次南湘，次子玉；右首一席，田春航为首，次王恂，文泽作陪。是每席三位。","en":"today's seating, shall we go by seniority, or shall we place the birthday honorees at the head?\\" Chunhang and Huifang said together: \\"We absolutely cannot accept that; seniority is the natural arrangement.\\" Everyone agreed to go by seniority. Wenze arranged the wines, and the center table was first set in order. By age, Cixian was eldest; knowing he could not refuse,"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"定完后，王桂保、林春喜来了，皆见过了。正席上令漱芳、玉林、春喜伺候；左席上令宝珠、兰保、素兰；右席上则蕙芳、桂保二人。分派已定，各人坐了，慢慢的浅斟缓酌起来，正是：","en":"table, Shufang, Yulin, and Chunxi attended; at the left table, Baozhu, Lanbao, and Sulan; at the right table, Huifang and Guibao. The assignments made, everyone took their seats and began to pour slowly, drinking at a leisurely pace. It was truly:"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":2,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"肴，备上香茗鲜果。春喜与桂保到太湖石畔，同坐在芍药栏边闲话；玉林、漱芳已醉卧在海棠花下；兰保在池畔钓鱼；宝珠与蕙芳对弈，素兰观局，南湘、高品在傍为宝珠指点。蕙芳道：「你们三人下我一个。就赢了也不算稀奇。」宝珠道：「我偏不用人教也赢得你。」文泽道：「今日我们亦算极乐了，可惜花部中少了两人，那个还不要紧，第一是琴言不来，使庾香不能畅意。」子云道：「可不是！琴言的病颇","en":"themselves into a stupor and lay asleep beneath the crabapple blossoms. Lanbao was fishing by the pond. Baozhu and Huifang were playing chess, with Sulan watching the game, while Nanxiang and Gao Pin stood by offering Baozhu advice. Huifang said: \\"Three of you against my one; even if you win it is hardly a surprise.\\" Baozhu said: \\"I can win against you without any coaching"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":1,"tokens":["媚香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"典册，自有群公大手笔在。山人寒瘦之语，不称金谷繁华，反使名花减色。」众人道：「太谦了。」子云道：「今日起意是因媚香，引得百花齐放，胜唐宫之剪彩。弟意欲仰观诸兄珠玉，先作一联句何如？」众人道：「最好。」春航道：「古体呢，近体？」次贤道：「近体发挥难透，人多恐易平直，不如古体罢。」","en":"beauty of the famous flowers.\\" Everyone said: \\"You are too modest.\\" Ziyun said: \\"Today's idea arose because of Meixiang, drawing forth the blooming of a hundred flowers, surpassing even the cut silk flowers of the Tang palace. I would like to gaze upon the pearls and jade of all the gentlemen. How about we compose a linked verse first?\\" Everyone said: \\"Excellent.\\" Chunhang"},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"斗艳图何如！」众皆应道：「妙极！我们何不将人花比拟一回，总要从公，不可各存偏见。」于是大家评定：以宝珠为牡丹，蕙芳为芍药，素兰为莲花，玉林为碧桃，漱芳为海棠，兰保为玫瑰，桂保为芙蓉，春喜小而多才，人人钟爱为兰花。八人品题尽合，因又想到琴言、琪官为何花？子云道：「琴言色艺过佳，而性情过冷，比为梅花最是相称，且其酷爱梅，不属庾香将谁属耶？」众人说道；「很是。」高品道","en":"flowers, fairly assessed, without personal bias.\\" So they deliberated together and decided: Baozhu as the peony; Huifang as the herbaceous peony; Sulan as the lotus; Yulin as the green peach blossom; Shufang as the crabapple; Lanbao as the rose; Guibao as the cotton rose. Chunxi, small in stature yet richly talented and beloved by all, was assigned the orchid. The eight"},{"paragraph":30,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"次贤道：「夜已深了，我们可以散罢。」于是大家各起，宝珠又订十八日之期，皆应允了，风雨不阻，遂各登舆四散。明日蕙芳踵门叩谢，惟有子玉病了，不曾进去。","en":"agreed, come rain or shine. Then they each mounted their carriages and scattered in all directions. The next day, Huifang went around to call and express thanks; only Ziyu was ill and did not receive him."}],"19":[{"paragraph":17,"mentions":5,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"再说潘其观自从被蕙芳哄骗之后，心中着实懊恼，意欲收拾蕙芳，又怕他的交游阔大，帮他的人多。二者淫心未断，尚欲再图实在。又心疼这二百吊钱，倒有些疑心张仲雨与蕙芳串通作弄他，就对仲雨唠唠叨叨，说些影射的话。仲雨受了这冤枉，真是无处可伸，便恨起潘三来。他既疑我，我索性坑他一坑，","en":"Now let us speak of Pan Qiguan: since being tricked and humiliated by Huifang, he had been genuinely vexed, wishing to settle scores with Huifang but fearing his wide connections and numerous supporters. At the same time his lascivious urge had not been extinguished and he still hoped to actually get what he wanted. He was also"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":10,"tokens":["蕙芳","苏蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"是日已是傍晚，可可走到蕙芳门口，恰就遇着蕙芳从春航处回来。蕙芳一见是潘三，心上着实吃了一惊，只得跳下车来，让潘三爷进内。潘三便搀着蕙芳的手，喘吁吁走进里面，到客房坐下。蕙芳便问道：「潘三爷，这几天总不见你，在那里发财？你能总不肯赏驾。记得那一天是因华公子住在城外，传了我去，实","en":"It was already evening that day; as chance would have it, he arrived at Huifang's gate at the very moment Huifang was returning from Chunhang's place. Huifang, seeing it was Pan Qiguan, was inwardly startled but had no choice; he jumped down from his carriage and invited the Third Master Pan inside. Pan Qiguan seized Huifang's hand"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":12,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"蕙芳道：「虽然戒了酒，既到我这里，也要应个景儿。」便满脸带笑，拿了一个大玉杯，斟得满满的，双手送去。那潘三原未戒酒，不过怕酒误事。今见蕙芳如此，便忍不住笑嘻嘻道：「可尽这一壶，不许再添了。」蕙芳也不理他，于是两人对饮，又吃些扁食之类。潘三已有醉意，喝来喝","en":"Huifang said: \\"Even if you've given up wine, since you've come to my place you must keep up appearances.\\" With a smiling face, he took up a large jade cup, filled it to the brim, and presented it with both hands. Pan Qiguan had not actually given up drinking;"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":4,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"蕙芳又笑道：「我方才说，三爷是逛惯剃头篷子的，拿我这里当作一样。我听张仲雨说，潘三爷是大方得很的，只要中意那人，不但三百五百，就是一千八百吊都肯。怎么三爷又瞧得中我，你在我面上才花过二百吊钱，马上就要捞本儿。要说二百吊钱，不但三爷看不上，就是我姓苏的也不","en":"Huifang laughed again: \\"I just said, Third Master is used to frequenting the barber's sheds, you're treating my place as just the same kind of thing. I heard from Zhang Zhongyu that Third Master Pan is most generous: if he sets his heart on someone, not only"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":4,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"想一想，只好再把银钱巴结他，便道：「知你是个阔相公，手笔大，常要用钱，打今日起，如少钱，便即到我铺子里来取。」蕙芳道：「我怎么好来？不要叫三奶奶晓得了，一顿臭骂，害得你还要受苦呢！」潘三笑道：「胡闹，你实对我说，到底少钱不少钱？」蕙芳想一想道：「这东西被我刻薄了，他还不懂，还想拿钱来买我，索性赚这胡涂虫，也好给田郎作膏火之费。便带笑道：「钱是怎么不要呢，我不好讲","en":"wanted to appear generous, so he couldn't resort to brute force. Thinking it over, the only recourse was to win Huifang over with more money. He said: \\"I know you're a free-spending young protégé with a big style, always needing cash. Starting today, whenever you're short of money, just come to my shop and take what you need.\\" Huifang said: \\"How could I go there? We can't"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":7,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"自己抬了膀子看了一回，对蕙芳道：「将这个配上就好了，你要就给你罢。」只管抬着膀子，却不见取下来。蕙芳走近身边，谢了一声，将镯子取下，刚刚带上了手，却被潘三拦腰抱住，口口心肝儿子，脸上嗅个不住，便就抠抠摸摸起来。此番蕙芳真没有法，再讲什么话，潘三是再不理的了。打定主意今日是不肯空","en":"He raised his arm and studied the bracelet for a while, then said to Huifang: \\"Pair it with this one and it would look perfect. If you want it, take it.\\" He kept raising his arm but made no move to remove it. Huifang moved close beside him, thanked him, and began to take the bracelet off his wrist; the moment it was slipped onto"}],"20":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":2,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"前回书中，讲到潘三缠住蕙芳，到至急处忽有人嚷进来，蕙芳故作一惊说：「了不得了！是坊官老爷们查夜。」潘三是个有钱胆小的人，自然怕事，只得溜了。","en":"The previous chapter told how Pan Qiguan had Huifang cornered at the crucial moment when someone suddenly came shouting, and Huifang feigned alarm and cried: \\"Dreadful — it's the ward officials come to do their inspection!\\" Pan Qiguan was a wealthy man of timid nature, naturally afraid of causing trouble,"},{"paragraph":2,"mentions":3,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"原来蕙芳于下厨房时，即算定潘三今日必不罢休，即叫家里人假装坊官查夜，并请了两个坊卒，到潘三歪缠不清的时候，便嚷将进来。知道潘三是色大胆小，果然中计而去，又哄过了一次。虽然得了他一个金镯，蕙芳心中也着实踌躇，恐怕明日又来，只好到春航寓内躲避几天，再看罢了。潘三","en":"In fact, when Huifang had gone to the kitchen earlier, he had calculated that Pan Qiguan would certainly not let him off tonight, and so had instructed the household servants to pretend to be ward officials conducting the nightly inspection, and had also brought in two actual"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":2,"tokens":["蕙芳","媚香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"笑道：「所谓「打鸭惊鸳鸯」，今日见了。」大家正看得有趣，又见船中走出几枝花来。一只船内是宝珠、漱芳，一只船内是蕙芳、素兰，共是五个。舟人把舟泊近阑干，南湘道：「芙蓉未开，水榭减色。有此众芳一渡，庶不寂寞。湘娥洛神，江湄游戏，我度香先生当以玉佩要之。」大家笑了一笑，群旦上来都见过了。次贤道：「你们看静芳窄袖踟蹰的，越显得风流跌宕。竹君之赞语「翩若惊鸿，婉若游龙」，","en":"they saw figures stepping out of the boats like blossoming flowers: one boat held Baozhu and Shufang, the other Huifang and Sulan — five people in all. The boatmen moored the craft against the railing; Nanxiang said: \\"The hibiscus has not yet opened, and the water pavilion lacks a certain brilliance. With all this company of flowers making the crossing, it will no longer"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"：「到却到过许多回，逛却没有逛到。一喝酒就是一天，那里能逛。约有七八处逛过。」宝珠道：「我同瘦香是逛完的了。」蕙芳道：「我就是桂岭、菊畦、兰径没有到过，其余也都逛完。」","en":"about? I've been to perhaps seven or eight places.\\" Baozhu said: \\"I have toured it completely with Shouxiang.\\" Huifang said: \\"I haven't been to Osmanthus Ridge, the Chrysanthemum Beds, or Orchid Path; all the rest I've seen.\\""},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云便要穿衣，经史、田三位止住，只得就便服送了酒，依齿而坐。东首是南湘，子云命兰保坐在肩下。西首是春航，肩下是蕙芳。\\n上面是次贤，肩下是漱芳。","en":"seniority. To the east sat Nanxiang; Ziyun asked Lanbao to sit at his shoulder. To the west sat Chunhang, with Huifang at his shoulder. At the head sat Cixian, with Shufang at his shoulder."},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":16,"tokens":["蕙芳","媚香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"上了当了，你看筹上不饮的是阎婆惜，饮的就不是了。」即将酒饮尽。素兰一想，倒被宝珠讨了便宜。再拿那一根筹看时，是蕙芳的。再看那面，众人就笑起来，只有田春航强住了笑，脸上却有些红。原来这一根筹偏偏是蕙芳，也是捉弄潘三的报应。上写着：「潘金莲雪天戏叔。」注：「三杯，并坐左边的为武松。第一杯要露出了胸，一手搭在武松肩上，叫声「叔叔，你饮这一杯。」第二杯要自吃半杯，又道：","en":"Sulan thought about it and realized that Baozhu had outwitted him. Now the second tally was looked at — it was Huifang's. When everyone saw it they burst out laughing; only Tian Chunhang managed to suppress his laughter, though his face showed some color. As it happened, this tally fell to Huifang — which was rather a case of karmic retribution for the Pan Qiguan business."},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"于是再看筹时是兰保的。那面是：「鲁智深醉打山门。」注：「先饮一大杯，首二坐为金刚，每人豁三拳。」蕙芳道：「他就这等便宜，我偏这么啰嗦。」兰保照令行了，与南湘、春航各豁了三拳。","en":"\\"First drain one large cup; the first two seats are the Guardian Kings; finger-guess three rounds with each.\\" Huifang said: \\"He gets off so easily, while I had to go through all that trouble.\\" Lanbao followed the game rules and finger-guessed three rounds each with Nanxiang and Chunhang."},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":10,"tokens":["媚香","蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"再看葫芦内筹是田春航。春航急看那一面，想一想，又说声：「不好！」众人又复拍手大笑道：「今日就是媚香与湘帆牵缠不清。」蕙芳红着脸道：「这是你们有心做成的，不然为什么单是这两根筹这么样呢？」次贤道：「冤枉冤哉！算我有心捡出的，难道你们又有心捡过去吗？」原来筹上写的是：「一丈青捉王矮虎。」注：「后成夫妇，与并坐的手牵红巾，饮三个交杯，合席共贺一杯。」春","en":"inscription, thought for a moment, and said: \\"Terrible!\\" Everyone burst out clapping and laughing again: \\"Today Meixiang and Xiangfan are clearly bound together by fate.\\" Huifang's face reddened and he said: \\"You've arranged this on purpose — otherwise why would only these two tallies come out like this?\\" Cixian said: \\"An absolutely unjust accusation! Say I purposely chose"},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"蕙芳道：「有人跪了你敬酒，还不好？还要怎样？」宝珠道：「你要人跪你，方才何不代我行了这个令？」此一回酒已饮到红日沉西，也就吃了饭。","en":"Huifang said: \\"Someone knelt to offer you wine — and you're still not satisfied? What more do you want?\\" Baozhu said: \\"If you wanted someone to kneel to you, why didn't you take my tally and perform it for me?\\" This round of drinking lasted until the red sun"}],"21":[{"paragraph":11,"mentions":2,"tokens":["媚香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「什么笑话？你快快说罢。」素兰道：「媚香的生日，田湘帆做了一篇小序，大家说做得好，度香便抄了。那一天，庾香来，静宜便将小序给庾香看，庾香也赞了几声。度香在旁说道：「湘帆好一个浓艳文心，愈艳愈好，愈浓愈好。」度香正赞湘帆的文章，庾香忽说道：「玉侬自然在玉艳之上，玉艳虽好，尚逊瑶卿、媚香一筹，","en":"\\"What joke — say it now.\\" Sulan said: \\"On Meixiang's birthday Tian Xiangfan wrote a short preface — everyone praised it — Duxiang copied it. The day Yuxiang came Jingyi showed him the piece; Yuxiang admired it. Standing by, Duxiang said: 'Xiangfan's style — the thicker the richer — the richer the better.'"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":4,"tokens":["蕙芳","媚香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"问道：「那个魏聘才？你因甚骂他？」琴言便将帕子掩了脸，索性哭个不止。素兰只得再三解劝，劝得住了哭，把前日宝珠、蕙芳行的酒令说给琴言听。说瑶卿还罢了，第一媚香尖利不肯吃亏的，偏偏吃了这闷亏；又听得他为潘三缠不清楚，媚香却不肯告诉人，人都传说出来，说媚香也怕他，到湘帆处躲了好几天，如今是交代下人：若是潘三来，总回不在家，又说他床后开了一个门，通得厨房，为避潘三之计。","en":"wept without stopping; Sulan coaxed until he ceased, then told the drinking game the other day with Baozhu and Huifang — Yaoqing was middling — Meixiang sharp and unwilling to lose yet had swallowed that dull loss; also how Pan the Third plagued him — Meixiang would not tell — gossip said Meixiang feared him and hid at Xiangfan's for days — now he instructed servants:"}],"22":[{"paragraph":18,"mentions":2,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"先在船里。我要等他们将酒席什物等类齐备了，省得临时短少，也就要去了。」看那素兰为人，又精细，又聪明，差不多赶上蕙芳，不过尚少蕙芳赚潘三的辣手，较之他人，也就算足智多谋了。","en":"then we shall be off too.\\" Observe what a man this Sulan was: precise and clever both, very nearly the match of Huifang, wanting only Huifang's ruthless touch that gulled Pan the Third; set against the general run of men, he might well be called deep in wit and full of stratagem."},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":3,"tokens":["媚香","苏媚香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"过来瞧。」琴言过来，也从窗缝里瞧了一瞧，便道：「这些蠢人，看他作什么？」素兰指着那下手坐的那一个道：「这就是与媚香缠扰的潘三。」琴言道：「哎哟！这个样子，亏媚香认识他，倒又怎么能哄得他？」素兰道：「你没有见，昨日那两个，比他还要凶恶十倍呢！」琴言叹了一口气，走转来坐了。子玉道：「潘三是何等样人？」素兰也把他们的事，说了一遍，子玉连声道：「可恶！可恶！这潘三竟敢如","en":"to look at?\\" Sulan pointed to the one seated in the lower place: \\"That is the Pan the Third who kept pestering Meixiang.\\" Qinyan cried: \\"Aiyo! Such a creature — a wonder Meixiang could endure his acquaintance; and however did he contrive to gull him?\\" Sulan said: \\"You did not see them — yesterday's two were ten times fiercer than he!\\" Qinyan sighed, walked back, and sat"}],"24":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":5,"tokens":["苏蕙芳","媚香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"妹身上不好。我天天候医生，有些照料，没有出门。」仲清道：「我昨日听得张仲雨讲的，有个开银号的潘三，从三月间想买苏蕙芳作干儿子。头一回是拉着张老二同去缠扰媚香，没有法儿，媚香故意殷殷懃勤。待那潘三借了他二百吊钱，听得说要敬他皮杯时，假装鱼骨鲠了喉。后来把他们灌得烂醉，竟到不省人事，却叫他们在客房内同睡。那姓潘的便滚了下来，在自己鞋里撒了一泡溺，后来醒了。查起来，他家","en":"telling me about a certain Pan the Third, who runs a silver shop. Ever since the third month, he has been badgering Su Huifang, insisting on taking him as an adopted son. At first, he dragged Zhang the Second along to pester Meixiang. Left with no choice, Meixiang put on a show of profound hospitality. After lending Pan two hundred strings of cash, he feigned a fishbone caught"},{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["媚香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"有之。」王恂道：「吾兄之论，如楞严说法，绝无翳障，以此观庾香、琴言之情，正是极深极正，就在人人之上了。若湘帆、媚香之情，较之庾香、琴言，又将何如呢？」","en":"straightest, elevating it far beyond common folk. How, then, does it compare to the bond between Xiangfan and Meixiang?\\""},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":11,"tokens":["媚香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"仲清笑道：「那又是一种。我看湘帆之爱媚香，起初却是为色起见。已花了无数冤钱，一旦遇见这样绝色，故辱之而不怒，笑之而不耻，犹之下界凡人，望见了天仙，自然要想刻刻去瞻仰的。及到媚香怜其难诉之隐情，感其不怨之劳苦，似欲稍加颜色，令其自明。及亲见湘帆吐属之雅，容貌之秀，而且低首下心，竭力尽命，又不","en":"Zhongqing laughed, \\"That is entirely another species of love. As I see it, Xiangfan's devotion to Meixiang was born initially of physical desire. He squandered oceans of silver, and upon gazing at such transcendent loveliness, he endured insult without rage and mockery without shame. He was like a mortal who had caught a glimpse of heaven, desperate to gaze"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":1,"tokens":["媚香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，此外生、净、老、丑有二十余个，是五六班凑成的。」仲清道：「旦脚十个是谁？」桂保道：「我们两个之外，尚有瑶卿、媚香、香畹、静芳、瘦香、小梅，后来又添了玉侬、玉艳，共是十个。」王恂道：「这就是十美班了。」桂保道：「陪客尚未定，你们是一定在数的。听得度香已写书子到保定府去，请前舟回来商议，只怕就是这件事。」王恂道：「也近了，今日已是二十六日了，还有十天，就演得全这些","en":"Zhongqing asked, \\"Who are the ten dan performers?\\" Guibao replied, \\"Besides the two of us, there are Yaoqing, Meixiang, Xiangwan, Jingfang, Shouxiang, and Xiaomei. Yunong and Yuyan joined later, making ten in all.\\" Wang Xun said, \\"That makes a Ten-Beauties company.\\" Guibao added, \\"The guest list isn't entirely settled yet, but you two are certainly included. I heard"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":1,"tokens":["媚香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"脾气。」玉林道：「讲情性风雅，心地聪敏，不慕势利，意气自豪，是瑶卿。一尘不染，灵慧空明，胸有别才，心怀好胜，是媚香。温文俊雅，出言有章，和而不流，婉而有致，要算香畹。言语爽直，风度高超，雅俗咸宜，毫无拘束，是静芳。恬静安详，言语妥贴，是瘦香。","en":"proud, independent spirit—that is Yaoqing. Spotless and bright, harboring a fiercely rivalrous talent, that is Meixiang. For gentle grace, carefully measured speech, harmonious yet firm, and sweetly poised—that would be Xiangwan. Frank talk, a lofty manner, welcoming to both high and low with a free spirit, is Jingfang. Quiet ease and perfectly apt words belong to Shouxiang."},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":1,"tokens":["媚香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"第一知己，竟会眠思梦想得害起病来。这梅公子是谁呢？」仲清道：「难道你还没有见过这人，怎么想不起来？」王恂道：「媚香生日，那一位顶年轻，生得顶好的，就是梅公子，号庾香。」桂保想了一想，道：「是了，是了，果然不错。论容貌与玉侬一对，但他倒合得来玉侬这脾气吗？」玉林道：「那一天玉侬没有来，怪不得那位梅公子是无精打采的，话也不说，酒也不喝，略喝了几杯，就出席躺着去了。后","en":"\\"Quick of spirit and nimble of speech, with a graceful bearing—that is Xiaomei. Highly versatile and nursing a romantic self-regard—\\" Yulin nodded toward Guibao, \\"that is him. A secret heart that few can ever truly grasp, steadfast until the seas run dry—that is Yunong. Pure fidelity, entirely heedless of personal gain—that is Yuyan. As for me, I have no merit whatsoever; I am dull, and people despise me. That is who I am.\\" Guibao interrupted, \\"You sell yourself far too short! Here is my verdict on you: fragrant restraint and pleasant grace, neither overly proud nor lowly base, harboring neither intense love nor bitter hatred—that is Peixian.\\" Zhongqing and Wang Xun applauded, \\"Sharp indeed! Ruixiang's insight grows by the day.\\" Yulin modestly demurred. Wang Xun then asked for their judgment on Rongguan, Erxi, Yumei, Chunlin, and Fenglin—the outsiders. Guibao laughed, \\"They belong to an entirely different school! We are the disciples of the Yuqing gate, crusading for the Zhou; they are of the Tongtian sect, aiding the tyrants—they are like the tortoise-spirit and Shen Gongbao. They possess uncanny tricks and are highly dangerous. When fate forces us to sit together, we tread very softly and dare not jest. Peixian's scandal—was it not Rongguan who exposed it? Qiguan's agony—did Erxi not engineer it? Honestly, I fear for Du Yunong. He offends absolutely everyone, and his foes are multiplying. His memory is terribly weak; after only a few days, he forgets faces completely, and everyone despises his cold pride. He is even cool toward Duxiang. The only one he calls his life's soulmate is Young Master Mei; he was actually sick with longing for him! Who exactly is this Master Mei?\\" Zhongqing clarified, \\"You met him—Young Master Mei, styled Yuxiang.\\" Guibao recalled, \\"Ah, yes! His beauty certainly makes a handsome match for Yunong, but does Yunong's temper truly suit him?\\" Yulin added, \\"That day when Yunong was absent, no wonder Yuxiang drooped so noticeably. He was completely silent, sipped very little, eventually lay down, and though he promised to visit Yaoqing's house, he never came.\\" Wang Xun said, \\"I hear that the other day he spent a whole day on the canal with Sulan and Qinyan.\\" Guibao nodded and clicked his tongue. \\"Well I never! No wonder Yunong came home cured.\\" So the four of them talked and laughed until the second watch was well past. Finally, the actors took their leave and rode their carriages home, while Zhongqing and Wang Xun talked a while longer before retiring for the night. As for the upcoming feast at the Garden of Contentment, the new plays, and how Young Master Hua will respond—you must hear the next installment to find out."}],"25":[{"paragraph":13,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"鼓，只见戏房内婷婷袅袅走出十枝花来，莲步略移，香风已到，捧着牙笏，走到席前边朝上叩了一个头，站起来。先是宝珠、蕙芳、素兰三人上来，又对华公子请了一安，将牙笏呈上。华公子知道这一班小旦都是子云得意人，袁宝珠更是宠爱，天天在园里的，也就世故起来，便搀住宝珠手道：「你们这本戏共演了几天了？」宝珠道：「一个多月了，是各人分开演的，一个人不过三五出戏。」华公子就随意把各人","en":"wafting — each holding an ivory tablet. They approached the banquet, knelt together, and rose again. First Baozhu, Huifang, and Sulan stepped forward, bowed to Young Master Hua, and presented their ivory tablets. Young Master Hua knew that this troupe of young dan actors were all Ziyun's prized favorites, and that Yuan Baozhu was especially cherished and lived in the garden"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"杯。次贤自觉得逸兴霞飞，十分得意，即连饮了三大觞。华公子亦陪了三杯。又命家人把酒送到台上，命宝珠、素兰、琴言、蕙芳，各饮三杯，并将席间果品赏了四碟，四旦遥遥叩谢。又劝合席各饮了三大杯。","en":"three cups of his own. He then ordered a servant to carry wine to the stage, commanding Baozhu, Sulan, Qinyan, and Huifang each to drink three cups, and sent four dishes of fruit from the banquet table as a gift; the four dan actors bowed their thanks from afar. He then urged everyone at the table to drink three more great cups apiece."},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":2,"tokens":["蕙芳","媚香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"合鄙意。」就将群旦叫上来。群花听了，即荡动兰桨，往水榭边来，上了岸，在阑外雁排侍立。华公子便指名叫了四个进来：蕙芳、琴言、宝珠、素兰。华公子对着四旦说道：「方才《峨嵋山群仙》一出，虽全部出场，未尽态度。你们可将各人得意之戏说一出来。」四旦听了，想了一想，各说了一出。子云道：「此尚非极得意的，只有媚香与香畹的《独占》，瑶卿与玉侬的《惊梦》《寻梦》，都是绝妙无双，人","en":"pavilion, landed, and drew up in goose formation beyond the railing. Young Master Hua called four men in by name: Huifang, Qinyan, Baozhu, Sulan. To them he said: \\"In 'Immortals of Mount Emei' just now the whole cast stood forth but not every gesture appeared. Each of you name a piece you do best.\\" The four thought and each named one. Ziyun said: \\"Those are not yet your"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"从身上解下一块玉佩来，赏了宝珠，宝珠亦谢了。此时十旦都送出来，华公子踉踉跄跄，犹几番回顾，对着琴言、宝珠，以及蕙芳、素兰等八人说：「你们没有事可常来走走。」说着话，已到了含万楼，复又一揖，辞了子云及众人，上了椅轿，林珊枝、八龄之外，尚有十六个亲随，五个有职人员，扶了轿轩，软步如飞，过岭穿林而去。这十旦直送出园门，又请安送了。华公子下了轿，仍坐上绿围车，尚对那些名","en":"All ten performers escorted them out; Young Master Hua reeled yet turned again and again toward Qinyan, Baozhu, Huifang, Sulan and the rest: \\"When idle, visit often.\\" At the Tower of Myriad Containment he bowed once more to Ziyun and guests, boarded his sedan chair — Shanzhi and Eight Ages aside, sixteen personal attendants and five titled servants shouldered the poles"}],"26":[{"paragraph":7,"mentions":2,"tokens":["苏蕙芳","蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"去了。华公子到上房，华夫人晓妆已完，丫鬟侍立两旁。公子见夫人淡扫蛾眉，薄施脂粉，双鬟腻绿，高髻盘云，很有些象那苏蕙芳的相貌，便坐下了，讲了些闲话，说在夫人房里吃饭，把昨日看的戏一一讲了，说八龄班万不及一；又说夫人的相貌，像那个蕙芳。华夫人听了，心中却有些不悦，也不言语。他们夫妻本来琴瑟相和，极恩爱的。就是华公子心爱奢华，却不淫荡。","en":"rouge, glossy green tresses, and a high chignon piled like clouds, he realized she bore a striking resemblance to Su Huifang. He sat down and exchanged pleasantries, announcing he would dine in her quarters. He excitedly recounted the previous day's opera, declaring the Eight Ages Troupe lacking even a tenth of their skill, and casually mentioned her resemblance to Huifang."},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"：「师老爷，不是我不受抬举，实在孩子怪可怜的。是去年十月才到京，我买了他，一教就会，模样儿也好，差不多最有名的蕙芳、宝珠，也赶不上他。你能猜：","en":"capital in the tenth month of last year. I bought him, and he has been a quick study with a handsome face. Even Huifang and Baozhu at the height of their fame could hardly rival him. You can judge for yourself:\\""}],"27":[{"paragraph":9,"mentions":1,"tokens":["苏蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"是没有的事。」春林道：「好沉架子，到他家去看他，倒是从不会客的。就是从前的王吉庆、李春芳，如今红字号的袁宝珠、苏蕙芳，也没有这么大架子。要他中意的，才陪着坐一坐；不中意的，简直的不理，赏他东西谢也不谢一声，也没有见他给人请安。」奚十一道：「这么样的相公，没有遇见我。若遇见我时，他要这样起来，我就骂这婊子养的，他能咬掉我的卵子？」仲雨冷笑道：「别说你这奚老土，就是你","en":"it! Go to his house and he never receives anybody. Wang Jiqing and Li Chunfang in their day, or Yuan Baozhu and Su Huifang who are the great names now — none of them ever gave themselves such airs. He will sit down with the ones he takes to; the ones he does not take to he simply ignores. Make him a present and he does not thank you for it, and nobody has ever seen him make"}],"30":[{"paragraph":12,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"着海错山珍，说不尽腥浓肥脆。清谈妙语，佐以诙谐。那边席上，聘才问次贤怡园的光景。次贤略述了几处。随后即见宝珠、蕙芳、素兰、漱芳、玉林、兰保、桂保，春喜、琪官等九个，又凑上一个，作了一出《秦淮河看花大会》，有幽闲的，有妖冶的，有静婉的，有风流的，极尽靡艳之致，众人尽皆喝采。子云、次贤等就于此出中间放了赏。华公子对着笑道：「此系抄袭吾兄旧文，殊觉数见不鲜。」子云道：","en":"Cixian about the sights of the Garden of Contentment. Cixian briefly described a few places. Next came Baozhu, Huifang, Sulan, Shufang, Yulin, Lanbao, Guibao, Chunxi, Qiguan—nine in total—plus one more, performing the play 'Flower-Viewing Assembly on the Qinhuai'. Some were demure, some coquettish, some quiet and gentle, and some romantic, exhibiting the utmost alluring"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":13,"tokens":["蕙芳","媚香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"蕙芳敬到子云面前，子云问起春航场中文字得意么，蕙芳道：「前日史竹君说他的很好，是必中的。」文泽在那席听了笑道：「我听得你在家，天天的焚香祷告，湘帆就文章不佳，也是必要中的。」蕙芳笑道：「谁说的？中举可以祷告得来，我倒愿替众人祷告了。」华公子问道：「你们说","en":"When Huifang offered wine to Ziyun, Ziyun asked how Chunhang's examination essays went. Huifang replied, \\"The other day, Shi Zhujun said his essays were very good and he will definitely pass.\\" Hearing this from the other table, Wenze laughed and said, \\"I heard you"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":2,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「蕙芳道：「我有什么说的？」仲雨忽然笑道：「你事急，就借着人作护身符，如今你又忘恩负义了。」说得众人不解，蕙芳怔了一怔，脸上不觉红起来。华公子看了，想起前日的话，动了些怜念，料有些隐情不好讲，慢慢的问度香罢了，便倒把别的话支开。当下谈笑间，饮了许多酒，戏唱","en":"Huifang said, \\"What do I have to say?\\" Zhongyu suddenly laughed, \\"When you were in a crisis, you used someone as a shield, and now you are being ungrateful.\\" This puzzled everyone. Huifang paused for a moment, his face unwittingly flushing red. Young Master"},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":3,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"看。华公子道：「奇怪！居然像个好妇人，今日倒要压倒群英了。」子佩听得众人赞他，略有一分羞涩；又见徐子云身旁站着蕙芳、宝珠，见蕙芳看看他，便凑着子云讲些话，又凑着宝珠讲些话；又见宝珠微笑；又见刘文泽与萧次贤站着，在一处彼此俯耳低言，大约是品评他的意思。原来文泽与蕙芳倒不是讲冯子佩，倒讲的是归自荣。","en":"beautiful woman; today he's going to outshine all the beauties.\\" Hearing the praise, Zipei felt a bit bashful. He saw Huifang and Baozhu standing beside Xu Ziyun. Huifang glanced at him, then leaned towards Ziyun to whisper a few words, and then towards Baozhu, who smiled. He also saw Liu Wenze and Xiao Cixian standing together, whispering in each other's ears, probably discussing"},{"paragraph":30,"mentions":2,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"久已不齿，而自荣犹常常的口称某给事为业师，某孝廉为课友，而一班无耻好色者，亦欲相为征逐。归自荣与叶女住宅，就与蕙芳相近，故蕙芳知之甚详。刘文泽也去吃过酒的。但去吃酒的。自荣必要作主人相陪，故此有些人不愿去。","en":"of shameless lechers also wanted to mingle with him. The residence of Gui Zirong and the Ye girl was close to Huifang's, so Huifang knew the details very well. Liu Wenze had also gone there to drink. However, when people went to drink, Zirong insisted on acting as the host and keeping them company, so some people were unwilling to go."}],"31":[{"paragraph":3,"mentions":3,"tokens":["蕙芳","媚香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，不妨吟几句；会画的，不妨画几笔，不必谦让。」诸旦默默无言，子云与文泽站起来道：「妙，妙！待我来分派。」即对着蕙芳道：「媚香是长于诗的，瑶卿是长于丹青的，静芳是长于舞剑的，香畹是长于书法的，佩仙是长于填词的，蕊香是长于猜谜诙谐的，瘦香是长于品箫的，小梅是长于吹笙的。可惜玉侬又病了，他倒会一套《平沙落雁》。」华公子便命叫他起来，又吩咐珊枝拿了琵琶来。家人把些笔砚乐","en":"remained silent. Ziyun and Wenze stood up and said, \\"Splendid, splendid! Let us assign the tasks.\\" Turning to Huifang, he said, \\"Meixiang excels in poetry, Yaoqing is skilled in painting, Jingfang is a master of the sword dance, Xiangwan possesses beautiful calligraphy, Peixian is adept at composing lyrics, Ruixiang has a gift for riddles and witty banter, Shouxiang"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":2,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"想了好一回，不得主意。蕙芳、素兰立在面前低低的问道：「你画什么？我们好先定主意，打起腹稿来。」宝珠正想不出头路，便扯着他们走到栏前，商量画些什么才好，限时刻的，又不能用工笔。若写几笔兰竹也不合景。蕙芳道：「我想了一个题目在这里，但不知合你的意否？依我只须画一个小手卷，用黑笔写","en":"He thought for a long while but could not settle on an idea. Huifang and Sulan stood before him, whispering, \\"What are you going to paint? Tell us, so we might fix upon a theme and begin drafting our poems in our minds.\\" Baozhu, still lacking a clear direction, pulled them over to the railing to discuss what would be"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":2,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"次贤与诸人不便来看，又恐怕他画坏了。次贤远远留心，觉得下笔甚快，毫无拘束，已觉面有喜色。那边蕙芳等三人挤在一处。只见李玉林俯首凝思，素兰把串香珠数个不了，蕙芳只管看着宝珠落笔，尚暗暗的指点他。","en":"unfettered grace, and a look of bright satisfaction had already begun to dawn on his face. Over on the other side, Huifang and his two companions clustered closely together. Li Yulin bowed his head in deep concentration, while Sulan continuously slipped a string of fragrant prayer beads through his fingers. Huifang kept his eyes fixed on Baozhu's brushwork, quietly offering"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":2,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"乎近来个个说他们的才貌，正是羞死从前那一班爱钱的相公了。」次贤又替他略略的润色了几处，竟成一幅好画。华公子即问蕙芳道：「你们题的想是有了？」蕙芳道：「有是有了，只是不好。」便站在桌边，找了一张笺纸，写了一首七绝。华公子念道：良宵灯月赏秋光，丝竹纷纷斗两厢。\\n我道嫦娥畏岑寂，遣风吹送上华堂。华公子念罢，拍案叫绝，次贤、文泽、子云俱绝口称妙，说道：「你们闹了一天，被","en":"Cixian lightly touched up a few spots, and it truly became a masterful painting. Young Master Hua then turned to Huifang and asked, \\"I trust you have your inscribed poems ready?\\" Huifang replied, \\"We have them, but I fear they are rather poor.\\" Standing by the desk, he found a piece of fine stationery and wrote down a seven-character quatrain. Young Master Hua read it"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"文泽道：「好是极好了，第三句还要斟酌几个字。」蕙芳道：「就请一改。」文泽道：「可改作「想是嫦娥怕孤寂」，诗意较淡远些。」大家都说改的极好。仲雨、聘才暗暗吃惊，不料他们个个如此，向来疑他们有代笔，今日面试，是的确无疑了。惟冯子佩也不来看，桌子上放有一大盘桂花，他便撮了一把，问书童讨了一条红线，自己捏着","en":"said, \\"It is truly superb, though the third line might benefit from a slight refinement of a few characters.\\" Huifang humbly replied, \\"Please, I invite you to correct it.\\" Wenze suggested, \\"Perhaps we could change it to 'I imagine Chang'e must fear the lonely silence.' It gives the poetic mood a more remote and ethereal quality.\\" Everyone agreed that the change was"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"。第三句嫦娥二字，与前首相同，不若改作「广寒宫殿层层启」，不好么？」素兰道：「果然改得好。」始而子云恐素兰不及蕙芳，及到此刻才放了心。再看玉林的填词，填的《一痕沙》小令，看词是：娇舞酣歌深院，绣幕锦屏香软。珠履客三千，集群贤。月若有情留住，人若有情休去。","en":"\\"Indeed, that is a wonderful improvement.\\" At first, Ziyun had worried that Sulan's skills might fall short of Huifang's, but only now did his heart truly settle. They then looked at Yulin's lyric, composed to the tune of 'A Trace of Sand'. The lyric read:\\n\\n'Tender dances and drunken songs fill the deep courtyard,\\nAmidst embroidered curtains and brocade screens, the"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"要换几字：「集群贤」换作「会群仙」，乱啼声「换作」只三更」，可好么？」众人一齐道：「好。」次贤叫他们快些写上，蕙芳、玉林都要素兰代写，华公子不依，只得各自写了。大家又赏叹一回，于是静坐，听珊枝的琵琶与春喜的笙。珊枝斜坐着拨动檀槽，只见指法如雨洒芭蕉，声韵如滩头流水，满怀春色，绕乱一堂。加之笙韵高低，声声应和。听得人人色舞眉飞，四肢愉快。弹了《月儿高》一套，大家也","en":"The crowd voiced their unanimous approval. Cixian urged them to quickly copy their final drafts onto the scroll. Huifang and Yulin both wanted Sulan to write it out for them, but Young Master Hua would not allow it, insisting they each write their own. After another round of admiration and praise, they sat quietly to listen to Shanzhi's pipa and Chunxi's sheng. Shanzhi"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":1,"tokens":["苏蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"春航、高品寓处一问，都已回寓，遂同下车进内，一直走到里面。只听高品一片笑声，夹着些燕语莺声在内。到春航斋中，见苏蕙芳、李玉林在内。高品、春航见了四人进来，不胜欢喜，让坐了，苏、李二相公也都见了。","en":"boisterous laughter mingled with the delicate, melodic voices of companions. Upon entering Chunhang's study, they found Su Huifang and Li Yulin inside. Seeing the four men arrive, Gao Pin and Chunhang were overjoyed and quickly offered them seats, while the two xianggong, Su and Li, also stepped forward to exchange greetings."},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":2,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"蕙芳说起前日在华府中，怎样题诗画画等事，细述了一遍，听得众人欢喜。又叫他们念出来，各人赞了一回，尤赞玉林的词更为工妙。高品道：「强将之下自无弱兵。你们看佩仙这首词，外边那些头巾纱帽作得出来么？」子玉道：「果然。就是华公子这几个字也改得好。」又问了琴言几句","en":"Huifang then recounted the events of the previous evening at the Hua mansion, detailing how they had composed poems and painted scenes. The group listened with great delight, asking them to recite the poems aloud. Everyone offered their praise, singling out"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":8,"tokens":["蕙芳","媚香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"蕙芳道：「难得你们诸公可巧全都在这里，今日我作个东道，请你们何如？」王恂道：「甚好。」高品道：「相公不是要请分子？」蕙芳笑道：「被你猜着了，我真要请分子。」众人当是顽话，都应允了。蕙芳命人到饭庄子上备了一桌菜来，众家人相帮摆好，蕙芳即恭恭敬敬的安了席。众","en":"Huifang broke the silence, \\"It is truly a rare occasion that all you gentlemen happen to be gathered here. How about I play the host today and invite you all to a feast? What do you say?\\" Wang Xun agreed, \\"That sounds excellent.\\" Gao Pin teased, \\"Xianggong,"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":12,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"蕙芳便在靴掖里拿出几页纸来，像是写的一篇文字，递与首坐史南湘道：「竹君先生，我今日请分子就是为此。你看了，待我再说。」众人不解，都凑近来看时，题目写的是《香雪先生传》。蕙芳又叫跟班的拿进一个小包，解开一并送上。诸人看是《香雪遗稿》，共两本，诗文并列。南湘","en":"Huifang then drew several sheets of paper from his boot, which looked like a formal essay, and handed them to the guest of honor, Shi Nanxiang, saying, \\"Master Zhujun, this is the very reason I am asking for subscriptions today. Please read it, and then I shall"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":3,"tokens":["媚香","蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"我们约齐了，到二十九日夜二更，到彼一祭就结了，他们那些徒弟，媚香自去张罗罢。」众人说道：「很好。」蕙芳道：「祭也可以不必，也不敢当。况庙宇窄小，也无容身之地，赐些笔墨已荣耀极了，何敢当再祭奠？且外面俗眼甚多，反为诸公添些物议。」南湘道：「这倒不妨，他也是士林中人，人也知道，且到那几日再议。我看湘帆，似不能少此一举","en":"and proceed there to perform a single sacrificial rite to conclude the matter. As for the rest of his disciples, Meixiang, you may arrange that yourself.\\" Everyone voiced their agreement: \\"Excellent.\\" Huifang, however, protested, \\"The sacrifice is entirely unnecessary, and I truly dare not accept such an honor. Furthermore, the temple is cramped and has barely any room"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"了。」南湘道：「很够了。」于是又致札众人，两三日间都要凑足。诗文共遗集，俱已发刻停妥，印刷一百部，用银六十两，蕙芳一人出了。","en":"been successfully carved into blocks, and one hundred copies were printed at a cost of sixty taels, all of which Huifang paid for entirely on his own."},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"花部中曾受业于香雪者，现有四人：袁宝珠、王桂保、金漱芳、陆素兰，或学画，或学诗，皆为高弟，此四人也共凑百金，连蕙芳的共有四百金。母子二人并一老仆三人，雇舟由运河而回，也就极宽裕了。","en":"were his advanced disciples. These four pupils pooled together an additional one hundred taels. Combined with Huifang's contribution, the total came to four hundred taels. This generous sum would easily provide the mother, son, and their old servant with ample funds to hire a boat and travel comfortably back home via the canal."},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"弥陀殿，尚不见一人。只见大雄宝殿，西边坍了一角，风摇树动，落叶成堆，凄凉已极。才见一人从殿后走出来。仲清认的是蕙芳的人，见了垂手站住。仲清问道：「他们在那里？」那人道：「尚在后面，待小的引道。」走到殿后，西边一个门内是一带危楼，门窗全无。走过了才是三间小屋，堆满灵柩，约有二三十具。见一柩前，有一小桌，点着香蜡，想就是了。","en":"scene of absolute desolation. Finally, a man emerged from behind the hall. Zhongqing recognized him as one of Huifang's servants. Upon seeing them, the servant stood respectfully with his hands by his sides. Zhongqing asked, \\"Where are they?\\" The servant replied, \\"They are in the back. Please allow me to lead the way.\\" They walked past the main hall and through a western"},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":2,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"天井内东边，又有一重小门，进了门有三四间小屋。春航、高品与蕙芳等都在其内，有一个老僧陪着。春航、蕙芳迎将出来。","en":"courtyard, they passed through another small door into a space with three or four small rooms. Chunhang, Gao Pin, Huifang, and their party were inside, accompanied by an old monk. Chunhang and Huifang stepped out to greet them."},{"paragraph":30,"mentions":3,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"南湘道：「这么个所在，阴惨怕人，怪不得有人不肯来。」蕙芳忙拖过条板凳放在上面，请他们坐了。仲清道：「人已齐了，就奠一奠，我们往锦秋墩去逛罢。」蕙芳即将祭筵就叫在那屋里摆起来。蕙芳上香，素兰奠酒，漱芳执壶，宝珠上菜，桂保焚纸，春航、南湘、高品同行了一个礼，五旦连连叩头代谢。","en":"Nanxiang said, \\"What a grim and dreadful place this is. It is no wonder some refused to come.\\" Huifang hurriedly dragged a wooden bench over and invited them to sit. Zhongqing said, \\"Now that everyone is here, let us pour our libations and then head straight over to Brook Autumn Mound for our stroll.\\" Huifang immediately ordered the sacrificial feast"},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":2,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"甚多，我看晚间只怕有鬼。」漱芳道：「亏那和尚只有一个徒弟，一个香火，竟不怕。若果真有鬼，和尚怎么好好儿的呢？」蕙芳道：「你几时见鬼吃过人？我前日听那和尚说，每到阴风暗雨的时候，或是夜深，叫的叫，哭的哭，是常有的。」宝珠道：「你们听见怡园闹鬼没有？」蕙芳道：「没有。」素兰问道：「怎么闹鬼？」宝珠道：「看桂花厅一个小使叫春儿，爱吃果子，每逢赏花请客的果子，他捡了藏在","en":"attendant, is entirely unafraid. If there truly were ghosts, how could the monk remain so perfectly unharmed?\\" Huifang chimed in, \\"When have you ever seen a ghost eat a man? Just the other day, I heard the monk say that whenever the wind howls and the rain is dark, or in the deep hours of the night, strange cries and weeping are a common occurrence.\\" Baozhu asked, \\"Have"},{"paragraph":33,"mentions":4,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"天。到第三天将晚的时候，看得那猴儿进来，又想偷果子吃，才明白了。不然，差不多闹到上头都知道了。」大家都笑起来。蕙芳预备了两桌蔬菜，四样点心，就借庙中厨房作起来，九人于地下铺上垫子，席地围坐。春航与蕙芳相交了半年，久成道义之交，今复见其仗义疏财，深情感旧，愈加敬畏。再想起自己去年及春间的光景，竟至潦倒穷途，势将沟壑。若非蕙芳成就，虽满腹珠玑，也不能到今日。对西风之","en":"hadn't discovered it, the rumors would have reached the masters' ears for certain!\\" The group erupted in laughter. Huifang had prepared two tables of vegetarian dishes and four kinds of snacks, which they cooked in the temple's borrowed kitchen. The nine of them spread out cushions on the ground and sat in a circle. Chunhang and Huifang had been friends for half a year,"},{"paragraph":37,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"当哭，颜。听呜呜击破秦人缶。且一醉，莫僝僽田。大家吟了一遍，哈哈大笑。天要下雨，遂无心久留，急忙收拾。南湘搭了蕙芳的车，仲清搭了素兰的车，一路而回。到得家时，已萧萧疏疏落起细雨来。不知后事如何，且听下回分解。","en":"threatened to pour, they lost all desire to linger and hurriedly packed up their belongings. Nanxiang caught a ride in Huifang's carriage, while Zhongqing rode in Sulan's, and they journeyed back home. By the time they arrived, a fine, scattered drizzle had begun to fall. To know what happened next, you must listen to the following chapter."}],"32":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["苏媚香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"起来，至高品房中，见高品尚未安睡，二人谈起心事来。春航叹了一口气道：「我的名心原淡，中不中倒也无妨，就是对不住苏媚香，半年期望之心白白孤负了。科名虽不足贵，但古今名士才人，断无不从科名而起。」高品道：「可恨今年这一班主考房官，把人回避得干干净净，我们再若不中，未免太冷淡了。若到明日此刻不见动静，就不必想了。」春航道：「不要到此刻，点灯时不来，便已绝望。若据前日那两","en":"\\"I've always cared little for fame, so it doesn't matter much whether I pass or not, but I'd feel I've let Su Meixiang down, wasting half a year of his expectations. Although exam degrees aren't the most precious thing, throughout history, famous scholars and talented men have almost without exception started their careers this way.\\" Gao Pin said, \\"It's hateful that"},{"paragraph":2,"mentions":6,"tokens":["苏蕙芳","蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"却说苏蕙芳惦记春航，亦复一夜不能安睡，比到起身时，已是巳正时候，连忙梳洗，即着人到外面打听可曾报动，那人去了。随后有个京官，着人来叫蕙芳去陪着登高，蕙芳那有心绪，回他进城去了。停了好一回，钟上已交午初，打听人转来道：「外间已报过四十名了，田老爷还没有在内，倒是","en":"Meanwhile, Su Huifang was worrying about Chunhang and spent a sleepless night. By the time he rose, it was already mid-morning. He hurriedly washed and dressed, and sent someone outside to inquire if any announcements had been made. The person left. Afterwards, a capital"},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":4,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"候，尚不得信，闷绝无聊，忽见跟班的手里托着一个盒子，上面放着一盘枣糕，进来说道：「胡裁缝送来的，有话要面求。」蕙芳道：「他有什么话讲？既然他亲自送来，收了他的就是了。」胡裁缝也走进来，作了一个揖。蕙芳让他坐了。胡裁缝道：「今日倒闲空在家，不出门走走？外面登高，游玩的颇热闹。又是报举人的日子，潘三爷的女婿中了，好不热闹，挤满一铺子人，报喜钱赏了一百吊。这胡衕外的一","en":"sat a plate of date cake. He came in and said, \\"Tailor Hu sent this, and has something to ask you in person.\\" Huifang said, \\"What does he have to say? Since he delivered it himself, just accept it.\\" Tailor Hu then walked in and bowed. Huifang offered him a seat. Tailor Hu said, \\"You're free at home today, not going out for a walk? The double-ninth outings outside are"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":10,"tokens":["蕙芳","媚香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"你若肯收了作徒弟，歇两年我就不作裁缝，就像作老太爷一般了。」蕙芳听了，好不厌烦，便道：「我将要改行不唱戏了，那里还要收徒弟？况且我也不会教人。你儿子要学戏，还是到那乱弹班里好，学两个月就可出台。我们唱昆腔的学了一辈子，还不得人家说声好。一个月花了多少钱，方买得几出戏，学他作什么？」胡裁缝尚是啰嗦，好一回才去。已是","en":"him as an apprentice, in a couple of years I won't be a tailor anymore, and I'll be just like an old master.\\" Huifang was extremely annoyed hearing this, and said, \\"I'm about to change professions and stop singing operas, why would I take on an apprentice? Besides, I don't know how to teach people. If your son wants to learn opera, he's better off going to a Luantan"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":3,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"听得嚷道：「田老爷大喜，中的是南元。」春航一听，喜不可言，把箸子摔过一边，连忙走出位来，蕙芳也乐不可支。诸人是皆欢喜，忙看条子，是」中式第二名，田春航，年二十三岁江南上元县附贡生。」方才放心。报喜的讨赏钱，蕙芳带了些票子来，递给春航。春航先赏了十吊钱，道：「明早同高老爷报喜的一同来领赏就是了。」众人道：「明日二位老爷不是十吊二十吊的赏，重重","en":"Hearing this, Chunhang was overjoyed beyond words; he threw his chopsticks aside and hurried from his seat, and Huifang too was ecstatic. Everyone was delighted and quickly looked at the slip: \\"Successful Candidate, Second Place: Tian Chunhang, age twenty-three, from Shangyuan County, Jiangnan, Attached Tribute Student.\\" Only then did they relax. The news-bringers asked"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":3,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"十岁，江南淮安府山阳县监生。」高品气得发昏，说声：「呸！」那人便拿出《题名录》来，众人细细看了，果无高品在内。蕙芳笑道：「中的人我也不认得，我就晓得这两个，一个是叶茂林的女婿叫作窑子归，这三十四名归自荣就是。一个是潘三的女婿叫作杠花，他老子叫花三胡子，在杠房抬杠出身，如今大发财，开了几处杠房，这六十三名花中桂就是。」高品再把第一张《题名录》看了一遍，略生喜色，不","en":"out a copy of the *Title Register*. They all looked closely, and indeed, Gao Pin's name was nowhere to be found. Huifang laughed, \\"I don't know the others who passed, but I do know these two: one is Ye Maolin's son-in-law, known as 'Brothel Gui', and this thirty-fourth name, Gui Zirong, is him. The other is Pan the Third's son-in-law, called 'Bier-pole Hua'. His father"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"坊里当起差来。高品已于十月初二日回苏州去了。春航在庙里寂寞，文泽邀至家中，王恂又欲相留，春航两处时相寄榻。又兼蕙芳照旧相陪，便安心乐意，与文泽、仲清等交相琢磨，闲时作些诗赋，习学殿试工夫。南湘也写了几天殿试卷子，以后又不写了，且按下不题。","en":"invited by Wenze to his home, and Wang Xun also wanted him to stay; Chunhang often slept over at both places. With Huifang still keeping him company as usual, he felt content and happy, studying and discussing with Wenze, Zhongqing, and the others, writing poetry and prose in his spare time, and preparing for the Palace Examination. Nanxiang also practiced writing Palace"}],"33":[{"paragraph":5,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"不幸。你看此等名士，竟遭此劫，天之妒才果如是耶！」因向宝珠道：「我听见人说，你之待此公，与此公之待你，亦不亚于蕙芳之待湘帆。且你于此公失意后，更觉亲密，一切旅费悉赖你周全。此等居心，尤为难得，真令世俗衣冠中人愧煞。此公亦甚知感激。」子玉一面说话，但见宝珠默默无言，眼眶一红，长叹一声，道：「同是天涯沦落人，相逢何必曾相识。」不禁落下泪来。子玉因无意中数语，竟触动宝","en":"added, \\"I have heard that the way you treat this gentleman, and the way he treats you, is no less than the devotion Huifang showed to Xiangfan. Moreover, since his misfortune, you have grown closer, fully providing for his travel expenses. Such a heart is exceedingly rare and puts the so-called scholars of our time to shame. This gentleman is also deeply grateful.\\" As Ziyu"}],"34":[{"paragraph":21,"mentions":1,"tokens":["苏蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「相公们总不过如此。近来有两个人倒很好，叫他也便宜，而且你还可以常使唤他，相貌也与袁宝珠、苏蕙芳相并。」聘才道：「叫什么名字？」子佩道：「一个叫卓天香，一个叫张翠官。」聘才道：「现在那班里？」子佩道：「在整容班。」聘才道：「整容班这班名很生，我竟没有领教过。」子佩道：「是软篷子里小剃头。」聘才笑道：「呸！你怎么说这些人？」子佩道：「你别轻看他，","en":"and what is more, you can send for them whenever you please. In looks they stand comparison with Yuan Baozhu and Su Huifang.\\" Pincai asked, \\"What are their names?\\" Zipei said, \\"One is called Zhuo Tianxiang, the other Zhang Cuiguan.\\" Pincai asked, \\"Which troupe are they in now?\\" Zipei said, \\"The Zhengrong troupe.\\" Pincai said, \\"The Zhengrong troupe—that name is unfamiliar;"}],"35":[{"paragraph":10,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"是日名旦中有几个不得来，都有堂会戏，不能分身。宝珠之外，来的是蕙芳、素兰、玉林、漱芳四人。这边名士，怡园二位之外，是刘文泽、颜仲清、王恂、田春航、梅子玉五人。共十二人。众客到齐，宝珠先叩谢了。","en":"all had private theatrical engagements and couldn't be in two places at once. Besides Baozhu, the attendees were Huifang, Sulan, Yulin, and Shufang—four in total. On the side of the famous scholars, apart from the two hosts of the Garden of Contentment, there were Liu Wenze, Yan Zhongqing, Wang Xun, Tian Chunhang, and Mei Ziyu—five in total. Together, they made twelve."},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"就可坐了。」摆好了坐位，是东西对面八坐，南北对面四坐。文泽、仲清、王恂、春航、子玉、次贤、子云坐了东西，上下是蕙芳、素兰、玉林、漱芳、宝珠。宝珠坐了末位。","en":"Xun, Chunhang, Ziyu, Cixian, and Ziyun took the east-west seats, while the upper and lower seats were occupied by Huifang, Sulan, Yulin, Shufang, and Baozhu. Baozhu took the very last seat."},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"：「何不就拿出来试试？」次贤道：「少时行令时便用他，就只有两个。这两个叫银匠改了四五次，费了一个月工夫才成。」蕙芳道：「快拿出来瞧瞧，一样可以喝得的，何必定要行令呢。」次贤便叫人到房中拿了一个花梨匣子出来，却有两个不大不小镀金杯子，外面极细攒花，底下一个座子，如钟里轮盘一样，下有四个小车轮。次贤拿了出来，放在桌上，却不见动。文泽道：「怎样不走？」把他推了一推，略","en":"them. I had the silversmith alter them four or five times, and it took a whole month of effort to perfect them.\\" Huifang urged, \\"Bring them out quickly for us to see. We can drink from them all the same; why must we wait for the game?\\" Cixian instructed a servant to bring a rosewood box from the room. Inside were two moderately sized gold-plated cups, exquisitely engraved"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":4,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"蕙芳便把杯子四面看了，却一点记号都没有。及看座子里那轮盘中，有一个绝小的小针，好像指南针一样，却是呆的，心上想道：「或者这一个针的缘故。」便斟了一杯酒，暗记着针头所向，把他对着次贤，说声：「敬萧老爷酒！」那杯子果然望次贤走来。蕙芳大笑，众人亦皆欢喜道：「","en":"Huifang examined the cup from all sides but found absolutely no markings. However, looking into the dial within the base, he noticed an incredibly tiny needle, much like a compass, but stationary. He thought to himself, \\"Perhaps it's because of this needle.\\""},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":2,"tokens":["媚香","蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"于是也把座子下看了一遍，斟了酒，说道：「敬媚香一杯！」那杯错走到子玉面前，引得众人大笑。子云笑道：「真有些古怪，我也叫不应他。」子玉把酒饮了，细看轮盘里，已懂了八分，便笑道：「我也来试试，不知灵不灵。」斟了酒，说道：「这杯酒敬瑶卿！」那杯子便对着宝珠走来，走到面前，碰着箸子住了。蕙芳拍手笑道：「","en":"So Ziyun also inspected the underside of the base, poured some wine, and said, \\"A cup for Meixiang!\\" But the cup mistakenly rolled over to Ziyu, causing everyone to burst into laughter. Ziyun laughed and admitted, \\"This really is a bit peculiar; I can't command it either.\\" Ziyu drank the wine, closely examined the dial mechanism, and, having understood"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":2,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"杯子放远了些，说道：「敬徐老爷一杯！」那杯子果然直走到子云面前。子云称异，喝了。子玉笑道：「是了，不错的了。」蕙芳对子玉道：「你恐怕走的远，故放远些。我看静宜于近处则斟得浅，于远处便斟得满。此杯想是要重了才得远呢。」子玉点头道：「果然。」次贤道：「可恶之极，轻重远近都被他知道了。」王恂问子玉道：「到底你从何处看出？」子玉道：「你们何尝不看，但总看轮盘外面，没有看","en":"away, and called out, \\"A cup for Lord Xu!\\" The cup rolled straight to Ziyun. Ziyun marveled and drank the wine. Huifang said to Ziyu, \\"You must have thought it would roll far, so you placed it further back. I noticed that Jingyi poured less for short distances and filled it for long distances. I suppose this cup needs to be heavier to travel far.\\" Ziyu nodded, \\"Exactly.\\""},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":6,"tokens":["媚香","蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，想了一会，飞出一句道：「南陌青楼十二重。」飞到子玉。子玉喝了酒，道：「已经十二了，还要飞吗？」次贤道：「座中媚香还没有轮到。轮到了他，我们再换令罢。如今只可飞十三了。」子玉飞出一句是：「娉娉袅袅十三余。」飞到了仲清，仲清喝了酒，想了一想道：「这一飞，轮到数目皆要喝酒，等媚香飞一句收令罢。要十几的数目相连，也就少了。」即念道：「花面丫头十三四。」瑶卿、媚香各饮一","en":"wine and asked, \\"We're already at twelve, do we still need to continue?\\" Cixian replied, \\"It hasn't landed on Meixiang yet. Once it reaches him, we can change the game. For now, we must proceed to thirteen.\\" Ziyu recited a line: \\"Graceful and slender, she is just over thirteen.\\" It landed on Zhongqing. Zhongqing drank the wine, pondered for a moment, and said, \\"With"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"了一回，次贤道：「我有一个令，就费心些，但是今日坐中却好都是喜欢行令的，想必不嫌烦碎，我们就照这个令行一行。」蕙芳道：「你不要又拿《水浒传》来顽笑人了。」次贤笑道：「你还记得雪天戏叔么？那日也就够你受了。」即叫书童到书架上把第三筒牙筹取来。少顷，书童捧了出来，众人见是象牙筒，内有满满的一筒小筹，一根大筹。次贤先抽出大筹给众人看时，是个百美名的酒令。大筹上刻着「百","en":"everyone here today seems to enjoy playing, I suspect you won't find it too tedious. Let's play a round of this one.\\" Huifang warned, \\"Don't bring out something from *Water Margin* to mock people again.\\" Cixian laughed, \\"Do you still remember the 'Teasing the Uncle in the Snow' trick? That day was certainly enough for you.\\" He then ordered a page boy to fetch the third tube"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，罚三杯。如美人应用何花，筹上各自注明，不得错用。」大家看了一看，说道：「此令太难，一时如何集得起来？」宝珠、蕙芳道：「此令我们是不能的，只好你们七个人去行。」仲清道：「倒是集《毛诗》凑花名不易。若说唐诗要飞两句，也不过与方才的数目差不多。」","en":"substituting them is not permitted.\\" Upon hearing the rules, everyone said it was extremely difficult. Baozhu and Huifang said, \\"We won't be able to play this. It's better if only you seven gentlemen play.\\" Zhongqing said, \\"The hardest part is matching the flower names from the *Mao Shi*. Composing the two Tang lines shouldn't be much harder than our previous numbers game.\\""},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"人、两个天之类，两句中也须还他两个人字、两个天字，如人人、天天等字更佳，各人贺双杯，说不出罚三杯，余皆照此。」蕙芳、宝珠听明了，又说了一遍道：「也不容易，幸亏我们的曲子，还有几枝在肚里。」子云谓次贤道：「索性叫香畹、佩仙坐到这里来，好在一处掷骰，我们与他二人换个坐儿。」次贤、子云与玉林、素兰换了坐位。","en":"and earn two congratulatory cups from each person; anyone unable to produce the lines must drink three cups.\\" Huifang and Baozhu repeated the rules, noting it wasn't easy, though they still had many lyrics committed to memory. Ziyun then instructed Cixian to have Xiangwan and Peixian switch seats so the performers could roll the dice in one designated area, and the"},{"paragraph":30,"mentions":2,"tokens":["媚香","苏蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"大家赞了几声，次贤道：「并且这花名与唐诗多联合的，我们共贺一杯。对坐的是媚香，应贺两杯。」那苏蕙芳掷了一个二五，正在那里凝思，这边要他贺酒，他只得喝了两杯，倒凑着两句，念道：「全没有半星儿惜玉怜香，只合守蓬窗茆屋梅花账。」旁边子玉拍手称妙道：「好个温柔旖旎！倒转来，偏这样凑拍，倒比原文还好。」文泽道：「这是《访素》的曲文，是","en":"Zhongqing's effort. Cixian noted, \\"The flower matches your Tang lines perfectly. We should all toast one cup, and Meixiang, sitting opposite, should toast two.\\" Huifang had just rolled a two and a five and was still contemplating his lines when asked to drink the toasts. After drinking, he delivered his two lyric lines: \\"'Not even half a star of pity for jade or fragrance—fit"},{"paragraph":33,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉掣了个地理门，美人名洛神，花是并头花。想了两句不见甚佳，才要另想，只见蕙芳掷了一个么三，想了一想，念着《偷诗》上两句道：「恨无眠残月窗西，更难听孤雁嘹呖。」子玉赞道：「实在绣口锦心，愧煞我辈。」子云道：「这个令，叫我们行，也没有这些好句。」大家满贺了一杯。子玉得了，即道：「我用冷朝阳《送红线》诗一句，孟浩然《登襄城楼》一句","en":"flower. He thought of two lines but felt they weren't quite right. Just as he was about to think of new ones, he saw Huifang roll a one and a three. Huifang paused, then recited two lines from *Stealing the Poem*: \\"'Hating my sleeplessness by the waning moon west of the window; harder still to hear the lone goose cry.'\\" Ziyu praised him, \\"Truly a brocade heart and an embroidered"},{"paragraph":35,"mentions":2,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"玉林掷了一个四五，想了一回，念出《絮阁》上两句道：「为着个意中人，把心病挑。俏东君，春心偏向小梅梢。」蕙芳笑道：「这出《絮阁》比《闻铃》好得多了。」于是各贺了两杯。子云道：「我就献丑了。」掣了一根，是花木门的，美人名莲香，花是连理花。子云心上要想两句好的出来，不肯轻说。一面看着他们掷骰，见宝珠掷了一个二四，想了一想，念出《春睡》上的曲文道：「星眼倦摩呵，","en":"heart, the old heart-sickness stirs. The coy Lord of Spring, his spring-heart leans toward the small plum twigs.'\\" Huifang smiled and commented, \\"This excerpt from *The Scolding in the Pavilion* is much better than your earlier *Hearing the Bells*.\\" Thus, everyone toasted two cups. Ziyun said, \\"It's my turn to show my inadequacy.\\" He drew a lot from the flora category: the"}],"36":[{"paragraph":6,"mentions":1,"tokens":["苏蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"只见众人纷纷的忙乱，伍麻子捧了一包孝衣进来。又见袁宝珠、苏蕙芳、陆素兰来了，琴言即忙招接三人，一同坐下。","en":"Outside, amidst the bustling crowd, Wu Mazi brought in a bundle of mourning clothes. Then Yuan Baozhu, Su Huifang, and Lu Sulan arrived. Qinyan quickly welcomed them, and they sat down together."},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":2,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"去，也没有限定几天。」素兰道：「总得告一个月的假，等出了殡才可进去，不然也对不住你师娘。」琴言道：「可不是。」蕙芳道：「索性告假告个长假，不去也罢了。究竟你也不是卖与他们的。」宝珠道：「在那里好倒算好，就是拘束些。且同事中没有一个知心的人，未免孤另些。」蕙芳道：「当日林珊枝也算不得什么，此刻见了我们，那一种大模大样。他就忘了从前同班子唱戏，他还唱乱弹时候，多油腔","en":"wait until after the burial to return; otherwise, you'll be letting your teacher's wife down.\\" Qinyan agreed. Huifang added, \\"You might as well ask for a long leave and just not go back. After all, you didn't sell yourself to them.\\" Baozhu reasoned, \\"It has its advantages, though it's a bit restrictive. And without any close confidants among your peers, it must be lonely.\\""},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":2,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴言道：「魏聘才搬了出去了，不知可在庾香处？」蕙芳道：「魏聘才么，如今倒更阔了。就在宏济寺住，同了奚十一、潘三、杨八一班混账人天天的闹，是什么剃头的，又是什么大和尚、小和尚，开赌宿娼，闹得不像。张仲雨也不与他往来了。」 　　 琴言问起子玉来，宝珠道：「前日我们在怡园叙了一日。」便将前日怎样喝酒，怎样","en":"Qinyan asked, \\"Wei Pincai has moved out. Do you know if he's with Yuxiang?\\" Huifang scoffed, \\"Wei Pincai? He's even more arrogant now. He lives at Hongji Temple and causes trouble every day with a bunch of scoundrels like Xi Eleven, Pan the Third, and Yang Eight—barbers, monks big and small—gambling and visiting prostitutes. It's a"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":1,"tokens":["苏蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"且把东西赏他，或者他受了赏，回心转意也未可定。」潘三想道：「这孩子比苏蕙芳更强，可惜我没有带结票子来赏他，或他得了钱就巴结我，也未可知。」奚十一道：「我有样东西送你，你可不要嫌轻。」便从怀里掏出个锦匣子，揭开了盖，是一对透水全绿的翡翠镯子，光华射目。","en":"perhaps once he receives the reward, he'll change his mind.\\" Pan the Third thought, \\"This boy is even tougher than Su Huifang. If only I had brought some bank notes to reward him, perhaps he would fawn over me if he got some money.\\" Xi Eleven spoke up, \\"I have something to give you, and I hope you won't find it too meager.\\" He pulled a brocade box from his robe, opened the"}],"37":[{"paragraph":5,"mentions":3,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"定琴言坐了首席，子玉并之。桂保坐了二席，王恂并之，不准再逊，逊者罚酒十杯。子云又叫宝珠坐在上面，宝珠要推时，见蕙芳来了。子云道：「好，好，你来坐了，次贤相并。」蕙芳不肯坐在次贤之上。次贤道：「今日所定之席，皆是你们为上，我们为次，你不见已定了两位吗？」蕙芳只得依了，下面宝珠也只得坐在子云之上。坐定了，王恂笑道：「外边馆子上，若便依这坐法，便可倒贴开发。」众皆微笑","en":"drink ten cups. Ziyun then called on Baozhu to sit in the upper position. Just as Baozhu was about to decline, Huifang arrived. Ziyun welcomed him warmly, \\"Splendid, do sit down, Cixian will be beside you.\\" Huifang was reluctant to sit above Cixian, but Cixian reassured him, \\"Today's arrangement puts all of you above us. Have you not seen that two have already been settled?\\""},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"来，他说了一声，留下个片子，到如今还没有见着他。你是那里见他的？」琴言骂了一声道：「这魏聘才始终不是个东西。」蕙芳道：「早就不是个东西，何须你说。」子玉又问琴言，琴言含泪说道：「原是我不好，我到他寓里，要他同我去看你。」子玉听到此，一阵心酸，眼皮上已红了一点。众人尽听他说，王恂道：「你看他，他怎样待你？」琴言道：「聘才起先还好，如今有一班坏人在那里引诱。」子云问","en":"each other. Where did you see him?\\" Qinyan cursed, \\"That Wei Pincai has never been anything but a scoundrel.\\" Huifang agreed, \\"He was a scoundrel long before that. You needn't tell us.\\" Ziyu pressed Qinyan to continue. With tears in his eyes, Qinyan confessed, \\"The fault was mine. I went to his lodgings and asked him to come with me to see you.\\" At these words a sharp"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":6,"tokens":["蕙芳","媚香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"蕙芳听了，皱了皱眉，问道：「你怎样呢？」琴言也恨极了，索性细细的将奚十一故意先走，后聘才撵了潘三，奚十一忽又送菜来，后奚十一、潘三、和尚先后的闯进，并将席间诸般戏侮，与砸了他的镯子，都说了出来。子玉听了，甚是生气，说道：「这是聘才的坏，定是他设的计，故意","en":"Huifang frowned and asked, \\"And what happened to you?\\" Qinyan's anger had by now reached such a pitch that he went ahead and recounted the whole story in detail: how Xi Eleven had made a point of leaving early, how Pincai had then sent Pan the Third away, how"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":4,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「一个大字加一点是太字，移上去是犬字，照这么样也说一个。」子云笑道：「这是犬令，谁耐烦行他。」桂保笑嘻嘻的对着蕙芳道：「你说一个。」蕙芳想了一想，道：「一个王字加一点是玉字，移上去是主字，不比你那犬字好些吗？」桂保点点头道：「真好。」忽又笑道：「你可不该，方才度香骂我，你又骂了度香了。」蕙芳道：「我几时骂他？」众人也不解，桂保道：「他是主人，你说的是主字，连上犬","en":"sequence just like this.\\" Ziyun laughed, \\"This is a dog's game; who has the patience for it?\\" Guibao grinned at Huifang and prompted, \\"You give one.\\" Huifang thought for a moment and offered, \\"Take the character for 'king' (王) and add a dot to make it 'jade' (玉). Move the dot to the top and it becomes 'host' (主). Is that not better than your dog?\\" Guibao nodded in agreement,"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":2,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"道：「只怕就是几个，被他们想完了。」桂保道：「我还有一个十字，加一划是士字，移上去是干字。」大家说道：「好。」蕙芳道：「我有个杳字，加一笔是查字，移上去是香字。」众人赞道：「更好！」宝珠道：「我有个丁字，加一笔是于字，移上去是亍字。」子云道：「这字却冷些。」子玉道：「也可用。」宝珠道：「彳亍二字也不算冷。」琴言道：「我有个卜字，加一笔是上字，移上去是下字。」次贤","en":"(十), add a stroke to make it 'scholar' (士), and move it to the top to make it 'shield' (干).\\" Everyone approved. Huifang added, \\"I have the character for 'dark' (杳), add a stroke to make it 'investigate' (查), and move it to the top to make it 'fragrant' (香).\\" The company praised this one even more highly. Baozhu suggested, \\"I have the character 丁, add a stroke to make"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":4,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"吃了些点心，又喝了几杯酒。王恂问蕙芳道：「你见湘帆、前舟没有？」蕙芳道：「原是为他们在那里，所以耽搁了好一回，将我的戏挪上了才来的。我今天见了一个老名士，说是前舟的业师，相貌清古，有六旬之外了。」子云道：「姓什么？」蕙芳道：「姓得有些古怪，我想想着，好像姓瞿，穿着六品服饰，觉得议论风生","en":"They ate a few pastries and drank several more cups of wine. Wang Xun asked Huifang, \\"Have you seen Xiangfan and Qianzhou?\\" Huifang replied, \\"It was because they were there that I was held up for so long. My performance was moved earlier so I could come. I saw a remarkable old gentleman of letters there today, said to be Qianzhou's"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":7,"tokens":["媚香","蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"次贤道：「很好，就请庾香、玉侬先对起来。」子玉道：「还是你与媚香先对，次度香、瑶卿，次庸庵、蕊香，末后轮到我们罢。」子云道：「也罢，你作个先锋，他作个后劲，把我们放在中间，容易讨好些。」次贤道：「头难，头难，我一时想不出好的。我前日见瘦香的《题曲》唱得甚好，就出《题曲》罢。」蕙芳道：「《题曲》就可以对《偷诗》。」","en":"Cixian agreed, \\"Excellent. Let Yuxiang and Yunong start.\\" Ziyu suggested, \\"It would be better if you and Meixiang go first, then Duxiang and Yaoqing, then Yong'an and Ruixiang, and we shall go last.\\" Ziyun agreed to this arrangement, \\"You take the vanguard, and he brings up the rear; that leaves us in the middle, where it is easier to make a good showing.\\" Cixian"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「这该贺了。」各人都贺一杯。到了子玉，出的是《看袜》，琴言对的是《借靴》。大家说道：「这个对得好，要贺两杯。」蕙芳道：「一杯也够了，这对子也对得快。若两杯两杯的贺起来，将人喝醉了，倒对不好了。」次贤道：「说得是，以后顶好的方贺一杯，好的贺半杯，平平的不贺。」于是各贺了一杯。","en":"paired it with *Borrowing the Boot* (借靴). The company exclaimed, \\"Beautifully paired! That deserves two toasts.\\" Huifang interjected, \\"One cup is enough. That was a quick answer, too. If we keep drinking two cups at a time, we'll all be too drunk to make good matches.\\" Cixian agreed, \\"Quite right. Henceforth, we shall have a full toast for the very best pairings, half"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"众人道：「这个对得有趣，满贺一杯。」琴言道：「巧在一醉一醒，这倒难得的。」轮到次贤，次贤道：「我出《撇斗》。」蕙芳道：「好个《撇斗》。」想了一想道：「我对《搜杯》。」次贤道：「也好个《搜杯》，这里面工稳，贺一满杯。」大家喝了。","en":"easy match to find.\\" When it came to Cixian's turn, he offered, \\"I shall propose *Flinging the Dipper* (撇斗).\\" Huifang said, \\"A fine title, *Flinging the Dipper* (撇斗)!\\" After a moment's thought, he replied, \\"I shall match it with *Searching for the Cup* (搜杯).\\" Cixian praised him, \\"And a fine answer, *Searching for the Cup* (搜杯)! The wording matches exactly. A toast,"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":4,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"停了一会，次贤催他出对，蕙芳道：「我有一个对，恐怕没有对的，因此迟疑。」次贤道：「若真没有对的，也只好喝一杯过去。你且说来，教我想想也好。」蕙芳道：「《女盗》有名《牝贼》，这两字却新奇，你对出来，我情愿喝三杯。」次贤道：「真的？」众人也暗暗想了一回，对不出来。子云道：「这对难对","en":"After a pause, Cixian pressed Huifang to produce the next title. Huifang hesitated, \\"I have one in mind, but I fear it may have no possible answer.\\" Cixian encouraged him, \\"If there really is no match, we can drink a cup and move on. Go on, tell us. Let me think it over.\\" Huifang explained,"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":4,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"次贤道：「要喝的。那《势利》又叫《势僧》，这不是绝对么？」蕙芳道：「势字怎么对得牝字？」子玉一想，不觉抚掌大笑道：「妙极，妙极！就是势字才可对得牝字，真是绝对。」琴言与宝珠尚未明白，子云、王恂也想出来了，也笑起来，赞道：「真好心思，把这两字当这两件东西，真是异想天开了。」四旦尚未想出，蕙芳犹呆呆的想，王恂道：「","en":"drink. Now: *Power and Profit* (势利) also goes by the name *The Snobbish Monk* (势僧). Is that not a perfect pairing?\\" Huifang said, \\"How can 势 pair with 牝?\\" Ziyu thought for a moment, then clapped his hands and burst out laughing. \\"Marvellous, utterly marvellous! Only 势 could possibly pair with 牝. A truly perfect match.\\" Qinyan and Baozhu had not yet understood it. Ziyun and"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":3,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，没有新鲜的，偶想起《桃花扇》上有出《哄丁》，便把《哄丁》借对了，众人极口赞妙，各贺了满杯。次贤出了《饭店》，蕙芳对了《茶房》。蕙芳出了《拔眉》，子云道：「这更难对了。」次贤对了《开眼》。蕙芳道：「这真工巧极了。」次贤道：「还有《刺目》觉得更好些，就只刺字是个仄声。」子玉道：「这两个都好，倒像是天造地设，再没有比他好的了。」","en":"Everyone was full of admiration, and each drank a full cup in toast. Cixian offered *The Eating House* (饭店), and Huifang matched it with *The Tea-House* (茶房). Huifang offered *Plucking the Eyebrow* (拔眉), and Ziyun said, \\"This is even harder to match.\\" Cixian matched it with *Opening the Eye* (开眼). Huifang said, \\"Now that is truly clever and precise.\\" Cixian said, \\"There"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":3,"tokens":["蕙芳","媚香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"不容易。」遂想了一想，对了《堕冰》。一齐赞好，道：「好个《跌雪》、《堕冰》，真是一副好对，是一意化作两层法。」蕙芳谓宝珠道：「你想个难的给他对。」宝珠点点头。子云道：「你何故要他难我，无非想我罚杯酒。」蕙芳笑道：「正是。」子云向宝珠道：「你尽管出难的来。」宝珠想了一会，出了《扶头》。子云笑道：「这个真不容易。」忽然把桌子一拍道：「有个好对，我对《切脚》，你们说好","en":"pair! *Tumbling in the Snow* (跌雪) and *Falling on the Ice* (堕冰): one idea rendered beautifully in two layers.\\" Huifang urged Baozhu, \\"Give him a hard one.\\" Baozhu nodded, but Ziyun asked, \\"Why put him up to making things hard for me? You just want me to drink a penalty cup.\\" Huifang laughed, \\"Exactly.\\" Ziyun challenged Baozhu, \\"Go on—give me your hardest.\\" Baozhu thought"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"次贤道：「又轮到我了，我也学庾香惠顾人，出个容易的。」出了《酒楼》，蕙芳对了《书馆》，便说道：「我也学玉侬的连环出法，我就用书字出个《改书》。」次贤道：「你就难我，我偏要对个好的。」因想了一会，对了《追信》。","en":"said, \\"My turn again. I'll follow Yuxiang's example and offer an easy one.\\" He offered *The Tavern* (酒楼), and Huifang matched it with *The Study* (书馆). Huifang then said, \\"I'll follow Yunong's linked pattern too, using 书 again in *Revising the Letter* (改书).\\" Cixian said, \\"Trying to make it hard for me? Then I'll give you a really good match.\\" After thinking for a moment,"}],"38":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云因屈道生是个高雅好静的人，名旦中止叫了四个，宝珠、漱芳、蕙芳、素兰。漱芳有恙不能前来，格外又知会了琴言。是日屈公先到，与子云、次贤叙了好些旧话。","en":"man of refined tastes who preferred quieter company, Ziyun had invited only four performers: Baozhu, Shufang, Huifang, and Sulan. Shufang was indisposed and unable to attend; as an added guest, Qinyan was also notified. That day Master Qu arrived first and spent a good while in conversation with Ziyun and Cixian, catching up on old times."},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"只见四旦约齐同来，蕙芳已经认识，四人都上前请安。道生拱了手，命他们坐了，细细看了一番，又问了三人名号，谓子云道：「如今京里的相公，一发比从前好了。」子云道：「今日本不应叫他们来伺候，因他们尚不十分恶劣，还可以捧研拂笺。况他们前日听得先生来了，要瞻仰瞻仰老名士。若得齿颊余芬","en":"Just then the four performers arrived together. Huifang he already knew; all four came forward to pay their respects. Qu clasped his hands in return, bade them be seated, and looked them over carefully, asking the names of three of them. He said to Ziyun, \\"The young performers in the capital today are even"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":3,"tokens":["蕙芳","苏媚香","媚香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"清。东席第二是南湘，西席第二是春航。东席第三是子玉，西席三是文泽。子云东席作主，次贤西席作陪。宝珠、琴言在东，蕙芳、素兰在西，一一坐了。主人让酒，客皆饮了几杯。道生道：「我将前日先见的苏媚香谈起。」西席的人个个细听。道生道：「我这看相不论气色，部位是要论的，然尚在其次。我看全身的神骨、举止行动、坐相、立相，并口音言语，分人清浊，观人心地，以定休咎。但头一句就恐有","en":"presided at the east table while Cixian acted as second host at the west. Baozhu and Qinyan sat on the east side; Huifang and Sulan on the west. Everyone took their places. The host circulated wine and the guests each drank a few cups. Qu said, \\"I shall begin with Su Meixiang, whom I met the other day.\\" Everyone at the west table listened attentively. Qu said, \\"In my physiognomy"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一番作为，就要改行的。后来收成怎样，此事还远，我也不必说。若说，静宜又要驳我了。」再看素兰、宝珠，大致相仿，与蕙芳也不差什么，就没有讲他们出身。又道：「出污泥而不滓，就是他们三人的大概了。」看到了琴言，道生道：「这位有些不像，如今还在班里么？」次贤道：「现在班里，而且是个五月榴花照眼明，雅俗共赏，是个顶红的。」琴言笑了一笑。道生道：「雅或有之，俗恐未必。我看他身","en":"would dispute me again.\\" He then looked at Sulan and Baozhu — their general qualities were much the same — and at Huifang as well, finding no great difference; for these three he made no comment about their origins. He said, \\"Emerging from the mud unsullied — that is the general impression these three give.\\" When his gaze reached Qinyan, Qu said, \\"This one is rather different."},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"又闻得有些对戏目的对子。」道生道：「有数十条，也记不得了。」次贤道：「我们前日几个人，也凑了好些。」又指琴言、蕙芳、宝珠三人道：「这三个还有一个王桂保，他们也对了许多，比我们还好些。」便叫人到他书房拿出一个单子，并上次所行之令也写在上面，注了各人姓名。道生看了，连声赞好，道：「不料这四位竟能如此，竟是我辈，老夫今日真有幸也。他们贵行中我却也见过许多，不过写几笔兰","en":"remember them now.\\" Cixian said, \\"We ourselves produced a good many the other day,\\" and, gesturing toward Qinyan, Huifang, and Baozhu, he added, \\"These three, along with one Wang Guibao, matched a great number of pairs — and their results were somewhat better than ours.\\" He sent a servant to his study to fetch a sheet of paper on which the results of that session had been"},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"句及近体诗非其所好，只备诗中一格，原不欲后人学诗，仅学其五七言绝句小诗也。」此一番议论，议论得个个首肯，宝珠、蕙芳等亦颇能领会。","en":"shorter, simpler pieces.' This discourse was so cogent that everyone present nodded in agreement, and even Baozhu, Huifang, and the others were quite capable of following it."},{"paragraph":37,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"道生道：「此不过略为缠束，不使放散，读「胫跗丰妍，底平指敛」，似又非今日之紧紧缠小，必使尖如莲瓣也。」蕙芳道：「这个尺寸是怎样？身长七尺一寸，肩广一尺六寸，怎样算法？若依今日之尺寸，只怕没有这般长大人。」道生道：「这是汉尺，比起今日工部营造尺来，只得七寸五分。而营造尺比起民间裁尺，只得九寸三分。依营造尺折算则七七四尺九，五七三寸五，再加七分五，为五尺三寸","en":"not at all like the tight and severe binding of today that forces feet into the pointed shape of a lotus petal.\\" Huifang said, \\"And how do those measurements work out? Body height seven feet one inch; shoulders one foot six inches wide — how is this calculated? By today's measurements, no one could be as tall as that.\\" Qu said, \\"These are Han dynasty measurements. Against"},{"paragraph":38,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"瑶卿与此君相好么？」素兰在旁道：「他的画画弹琴，皆是此君教的。前月他们还逛了两天翠微山呢。他之待此君，也不亚于蕙芳之待湘帆了。」宝珠一笑，道：「何至于此？」子玉道：「前在瑶卿处，见其笔墨高雅之至，大有唐六如的光景。」道翁道：「不特笔墨似六如，命宫磨蝎也似六如，却是怪事。何以古今若合，此又不可以言理不言数了。我明日尚要拜他去。」子云忙道：「何不为我先容？得此良友，","en":"Only last month they spent two days together at Cuiwei Mountain. His regard for this gentleman is no less than Meixiang's regard for Xiangfan.\\" Baozhu smiled and said, \\"Surely not quite to that degree.\\" Ziyu said, \\"I once saw at Yaoqing's some of his brushwork — supremely elegant and refined, with much of the quality of Tang Liuru.\\" Master Qu said, \\"Not only is his brushwork"},{"paragraph":39,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"泽系旧学生，不敢问难。宝珠问子云要柄扇子，求道翁题诗，子云索性叫取四柄扇子出来，给四旦每人一柄。于是宝珠拂几，蕙芳移砚，素兰磨墨，琴言润毫，共求道翁留题。道翁也十分高兴，遂将各人的大概，每人写了七律一首，半行半草的一笔虞世南，并落了双款。四旦谢了，谈了一会各散。不知后事如何，且听下回分解。","en":"had four fans brought out, one for each of the four performers. Thereupon Baozhu wiped the small table clean, Huifang shifted the ink-stone into position, Sulan ground the ink, and Qinyan moistened the brush — all four together asked Master Qu to write a tribute. Master Qu was greatly pleased; he captured the general character of each person and composed a regulated"}],"43":[{"paragraph":3,"mentions":4,"tokens":["媚香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"前已想到，而且商量了一回，但是未必然之事，所以没有对人讲起。」宝珠道：「你说佩服的是谁？」素兰道：「那一天我与媚香闲谈，偶然讲起玉侬来，媚香说他师娘…」素兰说到此，便从窗外望了一望，说道：「此处说话，那边听不真么？」琴言道：「听不见的。」素兰道：「媚香说他师娘与他师父一样利害，只怕这一辈子要靠在玉侬身上。玉侬虽不唱戏，究竟没有出师。若论玉侬的钱，也就不少，看来此","en":"nothing about it to anyone.\\" \\"And who is it you say you admire?\\" asked Baozhu. \\"One day I was chatting idly with Meixiang,\\" said Sulan, \\"and Yunong's name happened to come up. Meixiang said his master's wife—\\" At this point Sulan glanced out the window and said: \\"Can they hear us from over there?\\" \\"No, they cannot,\\" said Qinyan. Sulan continued: \\"Meixiang said his master's"},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"二人即同坐了琴言的车，到蕙芳寓处。","en":"The two of them rode together in Qinyan's carriage to the place where Huifang was staying."},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":3,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"却值蕙芳在寓，三人进内，只见蕙芳在书桌上看着几本册页，见他们进来，笑面相迎，说道：「今日可谓不速之客三人来。」三人笑了一笑，且不坐下，就看那册页。宝珠先抢了那本画的，那两人也凑着同看，有山水，也有花卉，却画得甚好，原来蕙芳新求屈道翁画的。看到末后一页，是一个","en":"It happened that Huifang was at home. The three of them entered, and found Huifang at the writing table looking over several album leaves. He rose with a smile to welcome them, saying: \\"Today I have indeed received three uninvited guests.\\" The three smiled, but did not sit down"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":7,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"春色关心燕燕飞，杏花细雨不沾衣。\\n倚阑独自增惆怅，芳草天涯人未归。\\n又将那一本字也看了。蕙芳让三人坐下，问道：「你们还是不约而同，还是约了同来的。」宝珠道：「约齐来的，我们同到度香处看杏花罢。」蕙芳道：「今日又有局吗？」宝珠道：「局是没有，也算个不速之客何妨？」蕙芳点首笑应。素兰、宝珠的衣服与车都来了，二人即换了衣服。蕙芳进内也换了，又问道","en":"fragrant grasses stretch to heaven, you have yet to come.\\"\\n\\nThey looked through the calligraphy album as well. Huifang invited the three to sit, and asked: \\"Did you all arrive together by chance, or was this arranged?\\" \\"We came by arrangement,\\" said Baozhu. \\"Let us all go together to Duxiang's to see the apricot blossoms.\\" \\"Is there a banquet today?\\" asked Huifang. \\"No"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"宝珠等走上扶梯，进得楼来，次贤、子云笑面相迎，见了琴言、蕙芳等更加欢喜，说道：「今日倒料不着你们来。」宝珠道：「都是我请来的。」又对次贤道：「瘦香身子不快，不来了。」","en":"climbed the staircase into the upper room. Cixian and Ziyun came forward with smiling faces; seeing Qinyan and Huifang among the visitors, they were all the more pleased, saying: \\"We hardly expected you today.\\" \\"I brought them all,\\" said Baozhu. And then, turning to Cixian: \\"Shouxiang is unwell and could not come.\\""},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":2,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"人今日打扮分外好看，艳的艳，雅的雅，倒像有心比赛的一般。此刻都还穿着小毛外褂，琴言是玄狐耳绒，宝珠是玄狐抓仁，蕙芳是云狐抓仁，素兰是骨牌块云狐干尖。四人相对，就是珊瑚玉树交枝，瑶草琪花弄色，觉得楼外千枝红杏，比不上楼中四个玉人。次贤、子云虽时常相对，此刻亦还顾盼频频。子云道：「今日无肴，只有小饮，你们饿了，就吃起来罢。」蕙芳道：「我真有些饿了。」子云吩咐先拿几样","en":"their short fur outer jackets. Qinyan wore dark fox-ear velvet, Baozhu wore dark fox with a raked-claw pattern, Huifang wore cloud-fox with a raked-claw pattern, and Sulan wore cloud-fox cut in domino-block points. Seen together, they were like coral trees and jade branches intertwined, like rare orchids and spirit-flowers vying in colour, so that the thousand red apricot"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":11,"tokens":["蕙芳","媚香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子填了工尺，倒也唱得合拍。却只填了这一出《入梦》，其余不知唱得唱不得。明日与你们班里教师商量，可以谱他出来。」蕙芳道：「那倒可惜了。我听这曲文甚好，还是你自己按谱罢，若与我们教师，他便乱涂乱改，要顺他的口，去的去，添的添，改到不通而后止。若能移宫换羽，两下酌改就好了，除非要请教那位屈先生。」次贤道：「他偏这音律上不甚讲究。弹琴之外，一无所好。你与他讲，他又说三代","en":"Tomorrow I shall consult the musicians in your troupe and see if the whole can be scored.\\" \\"What a shame,\\" said Huifang. \\"I thought the text very fine. You had better score it yourself. If you give it to our musicians, they will smear and alter it until it conforms to their own mouths, cutting here, adding there, corrupting it past all sense. Unless one could ask Master"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"」宝珠问次贤道：「食品之内，究以何物为第一？」次贤道：「我口不同于人口，不敢定。以我所好，以鱼为第一。」琴言、蕙芳皆道：「说得是。」次贤道：「食品中也分作几样。如人品不同，有仙品，有神品，有逸品，有妙品，有宜烹龙煮凤，有宜吸月餐露，使其相反，两不为佳。故往往我说这样好，他说这样不好。《孟子》曰：口之于味也有同嗜焉。","en":"Cixian, \\"and I dare not pronounce. Personally, I would put fish above all else.\\" \\"Well said,\\" agreed Qinyan and Huifang together. \\"Among foods, as among people,\\" Cixian continued, \\"there are distinctions: celestial rank, divine rank, transcendent rank, exquisite rank. Some are fit to simmer dragon and boil phoenix, others fit to drink moonlight and dine on dew. Force"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":8,"tokens":["蕙芳","媚香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，以后我也想着一副。」琴言道：「是什么？」宝珠道：「《游湖借伞》，《搜山打车》。」琴言道：「真好，工稳之极。」蕙芳道：「就是《别母乱箭》，可以对《训子单刀》。」素兰道：「这么对，还有《闹朝扑犬》，也可对得《打店偷鸡》。」子云笑道：「到底他们记得熟，可以不假思索。」次贤道：「自然，我们虽也记得几个，究竟是半生半熟的。」子云道：「我有一个摆骰子的顽意儿，试试你们的心","en":"Cart.'\\" \\"Excellent. Perfectly balanced,\\" said Qinyan. \\"Then there is 'Parting from Mother amid Flying Arrows,'\\" said Huifang, \\"which matches 'Admonishing the Son with a Single Saber.'\\" \\"In that vein,\\" said Sulan, \\"'Raising a Ruckus at Court, Pouncing on a Dog' matches 'Attacking the Inn; Stealing the Chicken.'\\" \\"They clearly know the repertoire through and through,\\" laughed"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":5,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"了饭，又下楼逛了一会，过了小山，过了石梁，便是留春坞。就在留春坞内煮茗清谈。宝珠对子云将琴言的师娘要他出师，及蕙芳、素兰的主意说了一遍。子云道：「若果如此，倒也很好。」便问蕙芳道：「你们有这力量作此义举么？」蕙芳道：「若说力量，原也勉强，但集腑成裘，也还容易。我与瑶卿、香畹三人可以凑得六百金，王氏弟兄、佩仙、庾香可以凑得四百金。」次贤道：「我来一分，出二百金，前","en":"Ziyun the matter of Qinyan's master's wife demanding the release of his indenture, together with the plans that Huifang and Sulan had proposed. \\"If that is truly the case,\\" said Ziyun, \\"it would be very good indeed.\\" He turned to Huifang and asked: \\"Do you have the means to carry out this righteous act?\\" \\"In terms of means,\\" said Huifang, \\"it would be a stretch, but gathering"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":2,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这边四旦个个喜欢，辞了次贤，也同去找了叶茂林，告知此事。茂林一口应承，又对蕙芳道：「停一会儿，你与我同去。我年纪老了，笨嘴笨舌的，恐说不圆转，你在旁帮个腔儿。那位庆奶奶嘴里，好像画眉哨的一般，我有几分怯他。」蕙芳道：「人说他倒是个直性人，顺了他的毛，倒也易的很的。」琴言、宝珠、素兰先回去了。","en":"Cixian, and went together to find Ye Maolin and inform him of the matter. Maolin agreed at once, then said to Huifang: \\"Come with me in a little while. I am old, my tongue is clumsy, and I fear I may not manage the delicate turns of speech. Please be on hand to back me up. That Madam Qing — her tongue runs like a birdsong, and I confess I find her somewhat formidable.\\""},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":2,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"蕙芳与茂林练了一番话，约定晚饭后同去，蕙芳也便回来。","en":"Huifang and Maolin rehearsed what they would say, agreed to go together after supper, and Huifang then returned home."},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":8,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"却值田春航来看蕙芳，蕙芳即与他吃了饭，谈了一会，春航去了。茂林已在外面候了多时。定更后了，茂林提了灯笼，照着蕙芳，到了长庆家。也不找琴言，找了伍麻子，请了长庆媳妇出来。蕙芳见他扎了白包头，穿了孝衫，下面倒是条长绿绸裤子，白布弓鞋，黄瘦脸儿，长挑身材，三十来岁年纪，像个","en":"It happened that Tian Chunhang came to call on Huifang, and the two of them dined and talked for a while before Chunhang left. Maolin had by then been waiting outside for some time. After the first watch, Maolin took up a lantern, lit the way for Huifang, and the two arrived at the Changqing household. They"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":3,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"钱？况且这个人是善人，成全了他也好。」长庆媳妇道：「我也不管什么，只要他花得起钱，能依我的数，就教他来出师。」蕙芳道：「婶娘，你到底要多少钱，说个定数儿，我好去讲，或是添得上来，添不上来，再说…」长庆媳妇道：「老老实实，是三千两上好纹银，我也肯了。他能不能？他若不能，我还候着华公子。他是个有名花钱的主儿，或者一万八千都可以呢。不然还有徐老爷，他是爱他的，更好说话","en":"is willing to spend the money and meet my figure, I will let him come and arrange the release.\\" \\"Auntie,\\" said Huifang, \\"what is your actual figure? Name a definite sum, so that I may go and negotiate. Whether they can meet it or not, we can speak again...\\" \\"Plain and simple,\\" said the widow: \\"three thousand taels of good silver, nothing less, and I will agree. Can he"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":5,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"茂林这个老头子，倒是一条软麻绳，嫂子长，嫂子短，口甜心苦，把个长庆媳妇，像个躁头骡子似的，倒捆住了，只得应允。蕙芳道：「你倒担承了，不知那边花得起，花不起。若真凑不起来，倒叫婶娘见怪，空费了半天唇舌。」茂林笑道：「你倒胆小，就是他凑不上来，短了一千八百，你这个红人儿替他张罗张罗，值什么事？横竖他也不至负你。」蕙芳道：「只好如此，且看缘法。」于是约定了明日早饭后就","en":"the widow like a headstrong mule until she was bound fast and could only consent. \\"You've agreed to this,\\" said Huifang, \\"but we don't know whether they can afford it. If they can't raise the money, auntie will blame us, and all this talk will have been for nothing.\\" \\"You are losing your nerve,\\" laughed Maolin. \\"Even if they come up a thousand eight hundred short, your"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":7,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"明日一早，蕙芳就到怡园，子云尚未过来。在次贤处等候，一连两起的人，将子云请了过来，说明此事。子云也甚喜欢，就传总管的，叫他去开了二千四百两的一张银票，格外又一张五十两的，赏与茂林。蕙芳也不耽搁，急忙回去吃了饭，找了茂林，先将五十两送了他，茂林感激不尽，即同到长庆媳","en":"Early the next morning, Huifang went to the Garden of Contentment. Ziyun had not yet arrived. He waited at Cixian's rooms, and after two rounds of messengers had been sent, Ziyun came over. The matter was explained to him. Ziyun was very pleased, and summoned his chief steward, instructing"}],"44":[{"paragraph":3,"mentions":2,"tokens":["苏蕙芳","蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，还是我们老爷愿意与他出师的。昨日，我们管总的叫我去到日新银号，开了一张二千四百两的银票，又一张五十两的，交与苏蕙芳，替琴言出师的。方才我们在路上，还见他同蕙芳坐在一车，又到我们园里去了。看这光景，想是我们老爷要使唤他。","en":"Rixin Bank to draw a draft for two thousand four hundred taels and another for fifty taels, which was handed to Su Huifang to arrange the release on Qinyan's behalf. Just now, on the road, we saw Qinyan and Huifang sitting together in the same carriage, on their way back to our master's garden. From the look of things, our master intends to keep him close."},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":2,"tokens":["蕙芳","媚香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"那日蕙芳出门去了，琴言便到怡园来。此时梨花已开，子云、次贤与宝珠在梨院闲谈，琴言进来相见了。次贤笑道：「玉侬，如今由你自己作主了，不如辞了华府，到这里来罢。」琴言笑道：「我倒很愿，意但怎样去辞那边呢！」子云笑道：「那还了得？华星北必说我夺其所好，这官司还打得","en":"That day Huifang had gone out, and Qinyan came to the Garden of Contentment on his own. The pear blossoms were now in bloom; Ziyun and Cixian were chatting with Baozhu in the Pear Blossom Courtyard when Qinyan arrived and greeted them. \\"Yunong,\\" laughed Cixian, \\"now"},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":5,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"只见蕙芳来了，见了琴言光景，着实诧异，问了缘故，便拍手称快道：「天下有这么好事，真求也求不到，还哭什么呢？」次贤又将子云不要他们唱戏，要他们在园里的话说了。蕙芳道：「这是极好的，只怕我们生了这个下贱的命，未必能有此清福。我这两年内就想要改行，但又无行可改。这","en":"Just then, Huifang arrived at the garden. Seeing Qinyan's red, tear-streaked face, he was thoroughly surprised. However, upon hearing the full story, he clapped his hands in absolute delight. \\"There is no better fortune in all the world!\\" he exclaimed. \\"One could not beg"}],"45":[{"paragraph":12,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"王恂一齐都来了，子玉到了，各人与吉甫相见，叙了些彼此仰慕的话。只有史南湘、田春航在场中未来。相公们到的是宝珠、蕙芳、素兰、玉林、漱芳、兰保、桂保、春喜、琪官、连琴言刚是十人。","en":"Shi Nanxiang and Tian Chunhang were still at the examination grounds. Among the performers who came were Baozhu, Huifang, Sulan, Yulin, Shufang, Lanbao, Guibao, Chunxi, and Qiguan. Qinyan made ten in total."},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，一个琴字，也知道是说他们二人的，心里又想道：「难道坡仙今日要将这十九个人全写入诗内么？」子云与诸人也都看了，蕙芳呆呆的看着乩盘，只见道生又照着乩上写了四句是：","en":"them. He wondered whether Su meant to gather all nineteen of them into his poem. Ziyun and the others read on. Huifang stared blankly at the tray as Daosheng copied four more lines from the planchette:"},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"春江水涨轻航出，蕙质兰心人第一。\\n大贾空存惜玉心，分香浪费金条脱。\\n蕙芳看了两句，喜动颜色，及看到「分香浪费金条脱」，不觉脸上又微泛红潮，怕人题起潘三的故事。止有道生不懂，吟哦了几遍。众人心里想道：「怎么这些事神仙都会知道？这也奇极了！」各各骇异。又见写道：","en":"soul on earth.\\nGreat merchants hoard their pity for fair jade,\\nIncense wasted, golden armlets vainly poured.\\"\\nHuifang brightened at the first pair. When he reached \\"incense wasted, golden armlets,\\" his cheeks flushed faintly, as he dreaded any mention of Pan the Third's affair. Only Daosheng did not catch the allusion, and he chanted the lines repeatedly. Everyone thought"},{"paragraph":42,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"二次就要算今日了。往常请时，却没有这么灵异。」子云笑道：「今日说我们的诗中，也有两句说着隐情，不过谑而未虐。」蕙芳咳嗽一声，惹得各席都笑了。","en":"not so sharp.\\" Ziyun laughed. \\"Today's poems merely hinted at private matters. They were playful, not cruel.\\" Huifang coughed lightly, and every table erupted in laughter."}],"47":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":2,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"到了四月十一日，春航、南湘报中进士，南湘中了二十一名，春航中了三十四名，两人不消说都欢喜，把个蕙芳、兰保也乐得说不出来。南湘此番在京，借住在文泽处，因去年乃翁赴任时，将住宅卖去。蕙芳因春航在文泽处，虽彼此相安，但他出进虽没人说话，也常要到门房走走，因此觉得不甚便当。","en":"jinshi graduates—Nanxiang placing twenty-first and Chunhang thirty-fourth. Their delight went without saying, while Huifang and Lanbao were too overjoyed for words. Since his father had sold their residence upon leaving for his post last year, Nanxiang had been boarding with Wenze. Though Chunhang also stayed there and they lived amicably enough, Huifang often had to pass"},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":9,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"又见南湘也中了，想他们二人的才学，是必入馆选的，即与春航、南湘商量，何不合租一所房子。他二人甚愿意，就托蕙芳留心，蕙芳又托人问了几处，皆不合意。一日来到子云处，说及此事，子云道：「何不到我园中来，也热闹些。且道翁已选了南昌府通判，不日就要赴任，玉侬是要同去的了，你们搬进来，不好么？」蕙芳道：「我是不搬进来。」子云道：「你也搬进来。」蕙芳道：「我要搬进来，还","en":"Nanxiang had also passed, and certain that both men's talents would earn them selection for the Hanlin Academy, Huifang suggested they rent a residence together. The two readily agreed and asked him to keep watch for a suitable place. Huifang asked acquaintances about several places, but none quite pleased them. One day he visited Ziyun and raised the matter. Ziyun said:"}],"48":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["苏蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"点了庶常。雁塔题名，杏林赐宴，好不有兴，比起去年春间的春航来，就天壤之别了。这春航偏是姓苏的与他有缘。去年亏了苏蕙芳遂了他的心愿，本以风月因缘，倒成了道义肝胆，使春航一腔感激，不得不向正路上走，因此成就了功名学问。今年会试，房官虽荐了他的卷子，大总裁已经驳落。内中有一位总裁，姓苏，名臣泰，现任兵部大堂，翰林出身，后又承袭了侯爵，就是华公子的泰山。看了春航的文字，大","en":"during the previous spring. It seemed Chunhang was destined to cross paths with the surname Su. The year before, Su Huifang had helped him fulfill a romantic wish that ultimately blossomed into profound brotherhood and righteousness, guiding Chunhang firmly onto the proper path and enabling his academic and official triumphs. In this year's metropolitan examination, although"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":3,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"且说春航搬进了新宅，凡车马服饰，一切器用，尽是蕙芳一人之力。蕙芳数年所积，也就运用一空。此时蕙芳已辞了班子，常常过来与春航照应。春航要留他在宅里住，他又不肯。","en":"moved into his new residence, his carriages, attire, and household furnishings were all arranged entirely through Huifang's efforts. Huifang exhausted the savings he had accumulated over many years for this purpose. By now, he had left the theater troupe and frequently came over to assist. Chunhang tried to persuade him to live in the residence, but Huifang declined."},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"但春航大大小小的事，皆系他一人调度，春航万分感激，意欲分任其劳，实在又不及他精明周到。蕙芳又是个好胜脾气，就是没有办过的，他先就访问了，想得澈底澄清，一无翳障，不要春航费一点心。就是那个许贵，也十分灵慧，惟有那老田安，只可看门而已。","en":"Nevertheless, every significant and trivial matter was managed solely by Huifang. Chunhang was profoundly grateful and wished to share the burden, yet he could not match Huifang's sharp intellect and meticulous nature. Huifang was inherently competitive. Even for matters he had never handled, he would first make inquiries and think"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":3,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一日，春航正与蕙芳商议要接家眷，无人可托的话，蕙芳愿身任其劳。忽然到了家信，是其太夫人的谕帖。春航连忙拆读，一看之后，不觉泪下。蕙芳心惊，便在春航背后同看。原来春航的夫人，于二月内暴病而亡。太夫人伤心万状，家中止有一老仆，并一仆妇，诸事草草，甚望春航会试回来。适值春航","en":"One day, as Chunhang and Huifang were discussing the need to fetch Chunhang's family and how no one else could be entrusted with the task, Huifang volunteered to go himself. Suddenly, a letter arrived containing an instruction note from Chunhang's mother. Chunhang read it and instantly"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":3,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"母将来，晨昏得事，悲的是朱弦已断，中馈无人。且春航又是个钟情人，想起在家时，钗荆裙布，唱随之乐，不觉大恸起来。蕙芳十分劝慰，劝道：「老太太不日就到，你极该打起精神才好。如今倒自己苦坏了，教老太太见了不更伤感么？」春航只得暂止悲痛，明日就为太夫人收拾上房，铺陈一切。吩咐下人，从今以后称呼蕙芳为苏大爷。蕙芳也感激春航相待之意。","en":"chambers left empty. Being a man of deep feeling, he recalled their simple married life together and wept bitterly. Huifang comforted him earnestly, advising that since his mother would arrive shortly, he must maintain his strength to avoid causing her even greater sorrow. Chunhang forced himself to restrain his grief. The next day, he prepared the main rooms for his mother"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":3,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"拜见了舅父、舅母，无人不为春航喜欢。进了城，他母舅在春航处暂住了几日，赁了住房，方才搬去，春航在太夫人面前说起蕙芳的好处，也是落难才唱戏的，如今已出了班子，他父亲在云南做过州同，是个书香之后，在京甚为相得，一切都赖藉他。因此田太夫人待蕙芳甚好，蕙芳更加相安了。","en":"temporarily at Chunhang's residence before renting a place and moving out. Before his mother, Chunhang spoke highly of Huifang, explaining how hardship had driven him to the stage but that he had now left it. He noted that Huifang's father had once served as a subprefect in Yunnan and that he came from a scholarly lineage. In the capital, they suited each other perfectly, and"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"素有才名，如今加上个翰林名号，更有那求文求诗的接踵而来。他又怕烦，常请金粟、子玉等代笔。至于不要紧的，连琴仙、蕙芳、素兰、宝珠的佳章都有在里面，好在人人说好，没有一个看得出来。南湘本要接夫人来京，一因任上两大人无人侍奉，二因他夫人利害，常要阻他的清兴，劝他戒酒。南湘有些惧内，本来只好狂饮狂游，鳏居倒也不妨。","en":"he frequently asked Jin Su, Ziyu, and others to write on his behalf. For less important pieces, even Qinxian, Huifang, Sulan, and Baozhu supplied exquisite verses. Everyone praised the work, and no one could tell the difference. Nanxiang had intended to bring his wife to the capital, but his elders at home required attendance, and his wife possessed a fierce temper,"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":5,"tokens":["媚香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"家童摆好了。金粟道：「庾香、玉侬过来喝一杯罢。」一面把船荡到练秋阁前，南湘道：「去年静宜有个《水浒传》的酒令，媚香掣着了《潘金莲雪天戏叔》，媚香那个神色，再没有这么好笑，不料湘帆今日竟能如此了。」金粟道：「湘帆真不负媚香。」说着，叹了一口气。南湘道：「也幸遇着了媚香，若遇了别人，未必有这管教他的本领。若天天朝歌夜弦，只怕湘帆真要做郑元和了。可惜，可惜！媚香若是个","en":"Refining Autumn Loft, Nanxiang recalled Jingyi's \\"Water Margin\\" drinking game from the previous year, remembering how Meixiang's expression during \\"Pan Jinlian Teases Her Brother-in-Law in the Snow\\" was incomparably amusing, and marveling that Xiangfan could rival it today. Jin Su agreed that Xiangfan did not disgrace Meixiang's memory, then let out a soft sigh. Nanxiang mused"},{"paragraph":36,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云、次贤各备车马跟着，一直送出城外，直到十里之外皇华亭。只见南湘、仲清、文泽、金粟、王恂、子玉、春航，领着那蕙芳、宝珠、素兰、漱芳、玉林、兰保、桂保、琪官、春喜九个名旦，在皇华亭等候。道翁等连忙下车，极口辞谢。各人皆要把盏。","en":"Waiting there at the pavilion were Nanxiang, Zhongqing, Wenze, Jin Su, Wang Xun, Ziyu, and Chunhang, alongside Huifang and the nine famous performers: Baozhu, Sulan, Shufang, Yulin, Lanbao, Guibao, Qiguan, and Chunxi. Daoweng hurried down from his carriage and thanked everyone repeatedly, as they all eagerly wished to raise a cup in a final parting toast."}],"49":[{"paragraph":3,"mentions":6,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一日，赶车的周小三与蕙芳说起他的三姐，情愿进来伺候老太太，又夸奖他三姐粗粗细细件件皆能，还会缝衣写算，针线活计是不用说了。蕙芳也闻得三姐之名，收拾过潘三，想是个伶俐人，也想见见他，问他怎样收拾的。便与春航说了，举荐他进来，春航不好推辞，一口应允。这三姐因收拾潘三之后，心上也","en":"One day, the carriage driver Zhou Xiaosan mentioned his Third Sister to Huifang, saying she was willing to come in and serve the old madam. He boasted that she was highly capable in all tasks, both rough and delicate, could sew, read, and calculate—and her needlework was beyond compare. Huifang, who had heard of Third Sister's formidable"},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":17,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一日，春航不在家，蕙芳独坐在书房里。老太太知道蕙芳来了，便叫三姐送点心出来。三姐托了碟子，到书房门口，先咳嗽了一声，然后进来，笑容满面的叫了一声：「苏大爷！」蕙芳也带着笑，回叫了一声「三姐！」三姐道：「这是老太太给你的。」说着，将碟子送到蕙芳手边。蕙芳见他十指尖尖，套了银","en":"One day, Chunhang was away from home, and Huifang sat alone in the study. Knowing Huifang was there, the old madam sent Third Sister out with some pastries. Carrying the small dish, Third Sister paused at the study door and gave a soft cough before entering, her face wreathed in a bright smile as she"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":3,"tokens":["苏媚香","媚香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"他姊姊归宁时，也还同来走走。说也奇怪，这句话我此时对你讲，你必不信。如成了，你一见面，就明白他姊妹二人相貌，与苏媚香真是一模一样。大世妹还只有七分相像，二世妹竟有九分，比媚香还要娇柔些，艳丽些。媚香到底是个男身，自然不及女子娇媚。」话未说完，春航就乐起来，道：「这话果然么？我有些不信。怎么同了姓，又会同了相貌呢？」不觉大笑起来。子云听了，也是好笑，说道：「信不信由","en":"I tell you. If the match succeeds and you see her, you will realize that the two sisters look exactly like Su Meixiang! The elder sister resembles him perhaps seven parts out of ten, but the younger sister is a nine-part likeness, though even more tender and radiant than Meixiang. After all, Meixiang is a man, and naturally cannot match the delicate charm of a woman.\\""},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":1,"tokens":["媚香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"还是有恩于他，怎么还要续弦呢？」春航臊得满脸通红，说道：「岂有此理，吾兄怎么讲起这些顽话来。弟固不足惜，兄应为媚香留一地步。」子云笑道：「这是他的话，关我甚事？」春航笑道：「吾兄也顽得我够了，到底怎样，如今倒不是他求我，是我求他了。」子云道：「你肯去求他吗？若专心去求，跟紧了他，一个月两个月后，自然他发起善心来，应许你了。」春航听他句句机锋，心上有些气，面上有些","en":"is outrageous! How can you make such jokes? It is no matter to mock me, but you should leave some respect for Meixiang's memory.\\" Ziyun smiled, \\"Those were his words, what does it have to do with me?\\" Chunhang forced a smile, \\"You have toyed with me enough. What is the real outcome? Now it is not he who is asking me, but I who am begging him.\\" Ziyun asked, \\"Are you willing"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":10,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"后来定于七月初七日。春航将此事与蕙芳说明，蕙芳也替他欢喜。春航又述子云之言，说这位苏小姐像你竟到九分。蕙芳笑道：「这不是糟蹋人么？一个千金小姐像了我，还说好，我们算什么人呢？」春航道：「只怕未必如你。若果然像你，我就心满意足了，当他菩萨供养，天天拜他。」蕙芳笑道：「你嘴里常说，我就没见","en":"Eventually, the date was set for the seventh day of the seventh month. Chunhang explained the matter to Huifang, who also rejoiced for him. Chunhang then recounted Ziyun's words, saying, \\"He says this Miss Su resembles you nine parts out of ten.\\" Huifang laughed, \\"Isn't that just insulting her? For a young lady of a noble house to look like me, and for that to"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"春航道：「你也应该成个家才好，就是配得上你的人少。」蕙芳道：「这话倒也不错，我也这么想。我们对亲，好人家是不肯的，那小户人家的女儿，我又不要。况且我们这些人，被那些无耻的东西闹得不像个样子，谁肯信我们是清清白白的呢？","en":"said, \\"You really ought to settle down and start a family yourself, though there are few who are worthy of you.\\" Huifang replied, \\"That's true enough, and I've thought the same. For a match with us, good families won't agree to it, and I wouldn't want a daughter from a petty, low-class home. Furthermore, people like us have had our reputations so ruined by those shameless"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":3,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"有那小模小样。就是一件，只怕主人已先受用，这倒十有八九。」春航笑道：「这是必有之事。我想度香家的丫鬟就不少。」蕙芳道：「度香自然是有好的，他家的闺范也好，从没有遇见丫鬟们到园里来，况且隔着一条街，也不便来。只闻得华公子的丫鬟最多，而且都好。我们有一回在他家唱戏，看见帘子内有一大群，有男装的，有女装的，粉白黛绿，也望不清楚。」春航道：「将来苏侯赠嫁过来，我想必有几","en":"of ten.\\" Chunhang laughed, \\"That is an inevitable fact. I imagine Duxiang's household has quite a few maids.\\" Huifang said, \\"Duxiang naturally has good ones, and the inner household discipline is excellent; I've never encountered the maids coming out into the garden. Besides, we're separated by a street, so it wouldn't be convenient. I've only heard that Young Master"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":3,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"蕙芳道：「这爱字也没有什么要紧，爱好之心，自然各人难免的。这三姐不但人生得好，而且还灵慧异常，倒是个贞节妇人呢。」春航笑道：「灵慧有之，贞节未确。」蕙芳笑道：「你没听见他收拾过潘三么？」春航笑道：「也有所闻，那是潘三这般嘴脸，自然应收拾的。你方才说爱好之","en":"Huifang countered, \\"The word \\"like\\" is of no great consequence; a heart that appreciates beauty is naturally unavoidable for anyone. This Third Sister is not only beautiful, but exceptionally intelligent—and she is a chaste woman at that.\\" Chunhang laughed,"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"蕙芳此时闲着，一人在寓里也闷，唯有到各相好处走走。","en":"Left with idle time, Huifang felt bored staying alone in his quarters and decided his only recourse was to visit his various acquaintances."},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":12,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"春航去了，蕙芳正走出来，忽听得咭咭咯咯之声，一回头看是三姐。蕙芳笑面相迎，三姐也笑盈盈的说道：「好几天不见你来。」蕙芳道：「我倒天天来的，就不见你出来。」三姐道：「老爷出门去了？」三姐把蕙芳腰间的表套子看了一看，道：「这个我也会做，我还会做戳纱的荷包。」蕙芳笑道：","en":"Just as Chunhang left and Huifang stepped out, he suddenly heard a soft, tinkling laugh. Turning his head, he saw it was Third Sister. Huifang greeted her with a smile, and Third Sister, beaming, said, \\"I haven't seen you come around for days.\\" Huifang replied, \\"I actually come every"}],"50":[{"paragraph":8,"mentions":1,"tokens":["媚香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"事来？幸亏度香催道翁走了，不然，他见了也要猜疑。」文泽道：「可不是？庾香与湘帆比起来，正是苦乐不同。湘帆非但与媚香朝夕相亲，如今又对了阔亲，偏偏又是个姓苏的，而且才貌双全。你道湘帆的运气好不好？我看咱们这一班朋友，就是他一个得意。」仲清道：「自然。」王恂道：「竹君近来倒没有从前的意兴，这是何故？」仲清道：「竹君么，他因不得鼎甲，因此挫了锐气。如今看他倒有避热就凉","en":"the contrast in their suffering and joy is stark. Not only does Xiangfan enjoy the constant, intimate company of Meixiang from dawn to dusk, but now he has secured a highly prestigious marriage—coincidentally also to someone surnamed Su, who possesses both peerless beauty and talent. Tell me, is Xiangfan's luck not extraordinary? Among our entire circle of friends, he is"}],"52":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，有个八九十间，还有个小花园在内。这回春航娶亲，贺客纷纷，很为热闹，请酒演戏，内外铺设，也成了个锦天花地。一个蕙芳如何料理得开？子云去请了张仲雨来帮忙，管了账房并指点铺设一切。","en":"Inside and out, the lavish decorations transformed the venue into a brocaded wonderland of flowers. How could Huifang possibly manage it all alone? Ziyun therefore invited Zhang Zhongyu to assist, overseeing the accounting room and directing the setup of all affairs."},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":1,"tokens":["苏蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"苏蕙芳一会儿走了来，又被张仲雨叫了去账房帮忙，倒比别人还忙些。","en":"Su Huifang kept rushing back and forth, but Zhang Zhongyu repeatedly dragged him back to the accounting room to help, leaving him far busier than anyone else."},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":1,"tokens":["苏蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"名抬夫，也就与出兵一样。只见众家人带领抬夫头儿，纷纷搬运。张仲雨跑过来，跑过去，指这样，说那样。门外人声嘈杂，苏蕙芳发赏封，上号簿，一个人那里打发得开，又叫了兰保、素兰来相帮，足足闹了两三个时辰，尚未清楚。里头许三姐也帮着手忙脚乱，同着那些陪房的摆这样，安那样，闹得一身的汗，一件绸衫子沾住了背心，腰也酸了，脚也疼了，喝了一碗凉茶，把扇子扇了一会，再来收拾。春航忙进","en":"Zhang Zhongyu darted back and forth, pointing here, instructing there. Outside, the roar of voices was deafening. Su Huifang distributed reward envelopes and tallied the registry books, but he could scarcely keep pace with the chaos, prompting him to call Lanbao and Sulan to assist. The commotion dragged on for four to six hours and was still not fully settled. Inside, Xu"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":1,"tokens":["媚香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"罗了一番。华公子要请仲雨坐席，仲雨道：「今日我竟没有这个福分。」春航谢妆已回，也请仲雨入席，仲雨道：「外面一个媚香，如何照应得来？不可叫他怨我。」便拱拱手走开，指着子云道：「总是你好作成。」笑出去了。王文辉跷起了朝靴，手捋长髯，与华公子、徐子云讲了一番话，也就踱了出去。","en":"returned from his formal thanks at the Su household, also invited Zhongyu to sit. Zhongyu replied, \\"With one 'Meixiang' out there, how can I possibly manage it all? I dare not let him resent me.\\" Cupping his hands, he stepped away, pointing at Ziyun with a laugh, \\"It is always you who loves to play the matchmaker!\\" and walked out smiling. Wang Wenhui, tipping his official"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"春航请客宽了公服，唱了一出戏。华公子道：「天气热，倒不用唱戏了，也叫他们歇歇。」八旦上来，华公子不见蕙芳，便问春航道：「怎么不见那位状元夫人，还在账房里么？」春航不好意思回答。子云听了，笑道：「如今闹出两位状元夫人，倒与《燕子笺》上的《诰圆》一样了。」华公子一想，自觉失言，便不再问。见素兰美丽风流，亭亭可爱，即叫他上前，说道：「你去年写在那《良宵风月图","en":"no need to force performances; let them rest.\\" As the eight famed dans approached, Young Master Hua, noticing Huifang's absence, asked Chunhang, \\"Why do I not see that 'Madam Zhuangyuan'—is he still trapped in the accounting room?\\" Chunhang was too embarrassed to answer. Hearing this, Ziyun laughed, \\"Now we have a confusion of two 'Madam Zhuangyuans,' just as in *Gaoyuan*,"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":6,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"道：「这话说得是。」诸名士在园内谈心，却说那聚星堂上，王文辉见诸名旦一个不来，颇觉岑寂，又不好意思去叫他们。想蕙芳在账房里，便叫了他出来。蕙芳也累苦了，乐得出来歇歇，便到文辉席上来，就在文辉旁边坐了。此处是两席，那席是刘守正、周锡爵、杨方猷，这席是王文辉、陆宗沅、张桐孙。文辉道：「这几天我知道你也累极了，所以叫你出来歇歇，此刻也应没有什么事了。」蕙芳道：「也没有","en":"Wenhui found the absence of the famous dans rather dreary but felt too embarrassed to summon them. Remembering Huifang was in the accounting room, he called him out instead. Utterly exhausted, Huifang was glad for the chance to rest and went to sit beside Wenhui. The hall was divided into two tables: one seated Liu Shouzheng, Zhou Xijue, and Yang Fangyou; the other seated"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":4,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"王文辉道：「有、有、有！如果我放了督抚，我难带的东西都与你留下。」蕙芳笑道：「难带的东西想是粗笨的，你不要拿些木器家伙，什么铁炉子、铁火盒，寄放在我处，我是不领情的。」陆宗沅、张桐孙笑起来，王文辉也笑，把扇子打了蕙芳一下：「你薄我，这还了得。」蕙芳也笑。文辉手弄长髯，蕙芳道：「你那胡子怎么倒黑起来了？想是遵姨太太命染黑","en":"plenty, I have plenty! If I am appointed Governor-General, I will leave all the difficult-to-carry items with you.\\" Huifang laughed, \\"Those 'difficult-to-carry' items are probably just heavy, clumsy junk! Do not try to dump wooden furniture, iron stoves, or heavy braziers on me—I will not thank you for it.\\" Lu Zongyuan and Zhang Tongsun chuckled, and Wang Wenhui laughed too,"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":6,"tokens":["蕙芳","媚香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"」刘守正道：「这一染，就直染到胸前呢。」文辉道：「嚼你的舌头。」陆宗沅道：「怎么你把这尺寸都量得清清楚楚的？」蕙芳道：「带着假胡子好。你索性把真胡子剃掉了，出门时带了假的出来，进房时就除下，不更好看么？」大家又笑，文辉把扇子在蕙芳肩上打了两下，笑着骂道：「你这尖酸刻薄鬼，怪不得田湘帆被你管得服服贴贴，一强也不敢强。但你也只有今天一天了，明日就有个真状元夫人来，看","en":"good-naturedly, \\"Bite your tongue!\\" Lu Zongyuan asked, \\"How is it that you have measured these dimensions so precisely?\\" Huifang interjected, \\"Wearing a fake beard is best. You should just shave off the real one entirely. Wear the fake one when you go out, and take it off when you enter your chambers—wouldn't that look much better?\\" The room erupted in laughter again. Wenhui tapped"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"不尽富贵风流，温柔旖旎。外面那些宾客及诸名士，又足足闹了一日。到晚间春航进房，见了新人，果然应了子云的话，真像蕙芳，便万种温存，十分美满，真是佳人才子，玉女仙郎，占尽了人间香福矣。","en":"and looked upon his new bride, he found Ziyun's words to be perfectly true—she bore a striking resemblance to Huifang. He lavished her with every tenderness, achieving perfect harmony. Truly, it was a match of a gifted scholar and a peerless beauty, a jade gentleman and a celestial maiden, monopolizing all the fragrant fortunes of the human world."},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":1,"tokens":["苏蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"胞姊妹，一样娇柔，分不出次第来。看他们二人，倒像在那里见过的一般，想不出来，惟觉眼中很熟，想去想来，原来有些像苏蕙芳，怪不得像见过的了。看徐子云的夫人袁绮香是冰肌玉骨，雍容大雅，真是林下风流，与子云恰是一对佳偶。刘少奶奶娟秀可爱，颜少奶奶秀丽超群，甚是洒落，王少奶奶静婉和妍，与刘少奶奶彷佛。","en":"as if she had met them somewhere before. After pondering for a moment, she realized they bore a resemblance to Su Huifang—no wonder they seemed familiar! She then observed Xu Ziyun's wife, Yuan Qixiang, noting her icy-fair skin, jade-like bones, and profoundly elegant demeanor; she possessed a truly transcendent charm, making her a perfect match for Ziyun. Liu's daughter-in-law"}],"53":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"起来，方知将夫人写画的桃花扇子与了他，甚是懊悔。一日，即命家人去叫素兰，说明叫他带了前日的扇子来。那日素兰正在蕙芳处商议开那古董铺的事情，苏、陆之外，尚有袁宝珠、金漱芳、王兰保、李玉林要来，大家商议那古董书画等物公凑些起来，也就不少。况且怡园花木极多，尽可分些来应用。我们何不先开起来，再到南边制办，也未尝不可。若要等买齐了，就有两三月耽搁去了。","en":"to summon Sulan, specifically instructing him to bring that fan from the other day.\\n\\nAt the time, Sulan was at Huifang's place discussing their plans to open an antique shop. Beyond Su and Lu, Baozhu, Shufang, Lanbao, and Yulin also intended to join. They reasoned that if everyone pooled their antiques, books, and paintings, it would amount to a substantial collection."},{"paragraph":2,"mentions":2,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"蕙芳道：「如今我们几个人凑起那古玩来，能有几样？而且也没有很好的东西，奇书名画更少，开张起来，空空的什么样子？若尽靠些花木，不成个花局子了么？」宝珠道：「要凑东西其实也不难。若说书画，前日我见度香园中晒晾，也数不清有多少。一种书有十几部的，他要这许多作什","en":"Huifang countered, \\"If just the few of us pool our antiques right now, how many pieces could we actually gather? We don't have truly exquisite items, and rare books or famous paintings are even scarcer. If we open the doors and the shelves are empty, what kind"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"人之善。但是你们后来这个行业倒难，这碗饭也不是终于好吃的。」素兰道：「如今我们几个人，现在想出一条道路。」就将蕙芳、宝珠等要开书画、古董，并些针线、香料、花卉、绸缎等物合成一个大铺子的话说了。公子点头道：「这倒罢了，你们这几个人也只好老于是乡。这个铺子几时开呢？」素兰道：「此时货物都不全，所有东西皆要到苏杭去置买。先想凑些书画等件，布置起来，原不当买卖作，不过这","en":"eaten forever.\\"\\n\\nSulan replied, \\"Right now, several of us are trying to find a new path.\\" He then recounted how Huifang, Baozhu, and the others planned to pool calligraphy, paintings, antiques, needlework, incense, flowers, and silks to open a large shop.\\n\\nYoung Master Hua nodded. \\"That is acceptable. You lot are best suited to live out your days in such pursuits. When"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":3,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"们皆是光明正大，无一毫闇昧之心，难道一人只许有一个知己，不准有两个么？」素兰道：「若论知己，自然越多越好。就以蕙芳之与田春航，瑶卿之与之金吉甫而论，春航固是蕙芳的知己，吉甫固是瑶卿的知己。蕙芳之待春航，瑶卿之待吉甫，也是报知己之报了。事虽不同，情则一也。然而他们待外人也是这样，心里却有权衡，外面若无轩轾，不露出厚薄来。所以人也不能说他们，也不能妒他们。若琴言之心","en":"one confidant, and never two?\\"\\n\\nSulan replied, \\"When it comes to confidants, naturally the more the better. Take Huifang with Tian Chunhang, and Yaoqing with Jin Jifu: Chunhang is certainly Huifang's confidant, and Jifu is certainly Yaoqing's confidant. Huifang's treatment of Chunhang and Yaoqing's treatment of Jifu are their ways of repaying that understanding. The circumstances"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":2,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"且说蕙芳等昨日早上见华公子叫了素兰进城，后来打听得一夜未归，今日又将一日，尚未见他回来，心里猜疑为什么事耽搁两日。再着人到素兰处打听，恰好素兰已回。少顷，素兰到蕙芳处来，讲华公子要他题那《桃花曲》，并待他一番光景，赏他好些东西，这铺子竟可开成了。","en":"Meanwhile, Huifang and the others had seen Young Master Hua summon Sulan into the city the previous morning. Later, they found out he had not returned all night, and as the second day dragged on with still no sign of him, they began to wonder what matter could have delayed"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":2,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"蕙芳也甚喜欢，即同到素兰处，点了两枝蜡，开了箱子，一件一件的看了，对素兰道：「这些东西若全买起来，也要好几千银子，而且未必有这好材料。再到度香处添几样，就可添可不添了。我明日就把橱柜制办起来，叫花儿匠来收拾花草。八月中秋竟可以开了。」素兰道：「题个什么名","en":"Huifang was also immensely pleased. They immediately went to Sulan's quarters, lit two candles, opened the crates, and examined the items one by one.\\n\\nHuifang turned to Sulan and said, \\"If we had to buy all this, it would cost several thousand taels of silver,"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":3,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「这几日不必搬出，到开市那几天，搬到那边去罢。」春航知道他们要开铺子，又闻得华公子、徐度香帮了许多物件，也要与蕙芳些东西。但系苏小姐过门未久，虽然鱼水情深，但将蕙芳之事骤然说起，恐他疑心，要吃醋起来，只得托辞要了二百两赤金，送与蕙芳添买货物。","en":"opening a shop and that Young Master Hua and Xu Duxiang had contributed so many items, he also wanted to give Huifang something. However, he had recently married Miss Su, and though their marital affection was deep, he feared that bringing up Huifang so abruptly might arouse her suspicion and jealousy. Forced to find an excuse, he requested two hundred taels of pure"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"蕙芳本想不受，但恐春航心上过不去，又见宝珠、素兰得了多少东西，自己又有好胜之心，只得收了，托子云着人到苏杭添置一切。子云封了金子，开了一个清单，写了一封书，着人到他乃兄署中，叫管总的徐福亲自制办。","en":"Huifang initially wanted to decline, but fearing he would hurt Chunhang's feelings—and seeing how much Baozhu and Sulan had acquired, which stirred his own competitive spirit—he felt compelled to accept. He asked Ziyun to send someone to Suzhou and Hangzhou"}],"58":[{"paragraph":4,"mentions":1,"tokens":["苏蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，九香楼有的是内造货，什么王府里赏他的，苏州也不及他好。我要买也要不了多少钱。」奚十一也知道这个铺子是袁宝珠、苏蕙芳等开的，却因近日心绪不佳，没有去逛。如今有了盘缠，明日借此可以逛逛，便答应了。","en":"from princely houses, and Suzhou can't match it. It wouldn't cost much.\\" Xi knew the shop was run by Yuan Baozhu, Su Huifang, and the others. Lately he had been in no mood to browse, but now he had travel money and could go tomorrow, so he agreed."},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"苏杭花绣衣料，一切洋货俱全，还有一块是内看金珠宝玉、四时花卉。此时那九个名旦均已出班，内有未满师者，也是宝珠、蕙芳共同帮他们出了师，一齐搬在里头居住。里面有个花园，园里也有几十间房子，九旦就住在园里。将一所正楼名为九香楼，园即为九香园。","en":"seasonal flowers. The nine celebrated actors had all left their troupes. For those not yet fully trained, Baozhu and Huifang had jointly seen them through their apprenticeships, and all had moved in to live. There was a garden inside with dozens of rooms, where the nine dwelt. The main tower was named Nine-Fragrance Tower, and the garden was Nine-Fragrance Garden."},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":1,"tokens":["苏蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"媳妇回扬州去了，此话绝无对证。三人讲了些闲话，奚十一便问大傻子，那些相公在什么地方。大傻道：「今日就只王兰官、苏蕙芳在家，其余都出门去了。」奚十一道：「我要看看花，你同我们去。」大傻便领了奚、姬二人，从东边进了一重门，见是一带游廊，假山层迭，花木扶疏，大大小小盆景有几千盆，有楼有阁，有台有池，甚是有趣。来到一所正楼之下，见有冷金笺写的一匾为「九香楼」，是殿元公手笔","en":"three chatted, and Xi Eleven asked Big Fool where the actors were. Big Fool replied, \\"Today only Wang Lanbao and Su Huifang are home, the rest are out.\\" Xi demanded, \\"I want to see the flowers, so take us.\\" Big Fool led Xi and Ji through an east door into a gallery of layered rockwork, scattered trees, and thousands of pots large and small. There were pavilions, terraces,"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"我，要打我。我们才买了两盆金橘，两盆佛手，要抬回去，被他摘得干干净净，气人不气人？问问他，他开口就骂人。」那边蕙芳、兰保都出来看，却不认得英官，也不认得姬亮轩。","en":"of Buddha's-hand to carry home, and he stripped them bare. Is it maddening or not? Ask him, he cursed first.\\" Huifang and Lanbao came out to look, but they knew neither Yingguan nor Ji Liangxuan."},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":2,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"奚十一听了许久，忍不住出来，见众人劝开了，但心中甚怒。望见芙蓉花外站着两个玉人，认得是蕙芳、兰保，觉得光辉相映，不觉涎垂起来，便说道：「你们这些相公好不讲理，怎么无缘无故的就打起人来？」蕙芳一看，认的是奚十一，便拉了兰保进去了。奚十一大怒，他也不管有客，便闯过桥去，亮轩跟着。大傻子一想这事情有些不好，便把灯收了，自己躲起来，免得带累他受气","en":"could not stay inside. Everyone had separated, but he was furious. Beyond the hibiscus two jade figures stood, Huifang and Lanbao, their light reflecting between them until his mouth watered. He challenged them, \\"You actors are unreasonable. Why hit someone for nothing?\\" Huifang recognized Xi Eleven, pulled Lanbao, and went inside. Xi raged. Ignoring the guests, he charged"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"」奚十一大怒，即将桌子一掀，碗盏砸了好些，大骂起来，里头也大骂。奚十一如何能忍，要赶进去打架，亮轩却劝住，只见蕙芳、兰保出来，对奚十一点点头，道：「尊驾为什么发气，到小店来照顾什么？敢是敝伙计们得罪了。」奚十一听了，火上添油，圆睁两眼，大喝道：「你别支起那屁架子，我照顾你？我要带你到安吉堂吃饭，还要留你过夜呢。」","en":"answered from within. He could not endure it and would have rushed in to fight, but Liangxuan restrained him. Huifang and Lanbao emerged, nodded to Xi, and asked, \\"Why the anger, sir? What business brings you to our humble shop? Did our people offend you?\\" Xi felt like oil was poured on fire, his eyes rounded, and he roared, \\"Drop that pose! I patronize you? I'd take"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"蕙芳气得满面通红，尚未回答，兰保已大怒，说道：「这个人真混账，认也认不得，就闹起来，敢是个疯子？」奚十一听了，抢过来就抓兰保，兰保已按住他的手，说道：「你要怎样？」奚十一也不回言，那只手又飞过一掌来，兰保一闪，就将他胁下一扠，奚十一踉踉跄跄，直跌出去，奚","en":"Huifang flushed crimson, not yet speaking, when Lanbao flared, \\"What a brute! Barely introduced and he makes a scene. Is he a madman?\\" Xi lunged for Lanbao, but Lanbao caught his hand and demanded, \\"What do you want?\\" Xi said nothing, but his other hand flew."}],"59":[{"paragraph":3,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「要便人要天天有的，折差、塘报那一日没有？你写起来，我去寄就是了。」琴仙于是哀哀切切，写了几封信与子玉、子云、蕙芳诸人，要他们专人来接他回去，子云信内并封着屈道翁遗言。写了一天，刘喜托便寄了。后来寺中又做起法事来，男女混杂，游人挤满。琴仙屋里常有人来张张望望的，琴仙好不气闷。刘喜见度日艰难，就算京里有人来接他们，也须两月之久，就到年底去了。便想出个法子，卖了两件","en":"and send them.\\" With a sorrowful heart, Qinxian poured his grief into several letters addressed to Ziyu, Ziyun, Huifang, and the others, pleading with them to send someone specifically to take him back. In the letter to Ziyun, he also enclosed Qu Daoweng's dying testament. After a full day of writing, Liu Xi entrusted the letters to a courier. Later on, the temple began"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"信面上是：「江西学政梅宅梅庾香少爷手启，屈勤先寄。」心中大喜，知琴仙到了江西任所了，便忙拆开，看见还有与子云、蕙芳、素兰、琪官的信，且搁过一边。拆开自己的信，见一张白纸写着「哀启者」，大为骇然，想道：「难道道翁有什么缘故了？」遂细细的看下去，不觉泪珠点点的落将下来。","en":"had reached the post in Jiangxi. He hurriedly tore it open, noticing there were also letters addressed to Ziyun, Huifang, Sulan, and Qiguan, which he temporarily set aside. Opening his own letter, he saw a plain sheet of paper bearing the words, \\"A Notice of Bereavement.\\" He was deeply shocked, thinking to himself, \\"Could something have happened to Daoweng?\\" He read on"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉不及叙话，一脸悲愁，就将琴仙给众人之信与他们看了，个个洒泪。再不料琴仙一出京，就遭此大难，真令人意想不到。蕙芳道「如今没有别的，快找度香来商量。」于是打发人找寻子云。找着了子云，到了九香园，见了子玉的光景，急急的拆开信看了，已觉涕泪潸潸。","en":"tears. It was truly unimaginable that Qinxian would suffer such a massive calamity the moment he left the capital. Huifang said, \\"There is nothing else to be done right now; we must find Duxiang quickly to discuss this.\\" They immediately sent people out to search for Ziyun. When they found Ziyun and he arrived at the Nine-Fragrance Garden, he saw Ziyu's state, hurriedly"}],"60":[{"paragraph":5,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"其余九人分作九阄。说也奇怪，想必文字有灵，前生缘法，子云拈了道翁，子玉拈了杜仙女、琴仙，金粟拈了宝珠，春航拈了蕙芳，仲清拈了琪官，文泽拈了春喜，南湘拈了兰保，王恂拈了桂保，高品拈了玉林，次贤拈了漱芳，单拈不着素兰，只好送与华公子去作了。众人分派已定，子玉说道：「做传容易，画画难，还要刻石，更须时日，不知几天可以告成？」吉甫道：「不消多日，碑是磨现成的，一面画，一","en":"affinities were at play, Ziyun drew Daoweng; Ziyu drew Fairy Du and Qinxian; Jin Su drew Baozhu; Chunhang drew Huifang; Zhongqing drew Qiguan; Wenze drew Chunxi; Nanxiang drew Lanbao; Wang Xun drew Guibao; Gao Pin drew Yulin; and Cixian drew Shufang. Sulan alone was not drawn, so that assignment was sent to Young Master Hua. The tasks distributed, Ziyu said, \\"Writing"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"也应祭一祭花神，明日我们方可聚会。这个花神就是我们的像，若叫他们来祭，我们也当不起，就是我们十个人祭一祭罢。」蕙芳等皆以为是，便设了酒果，焚了好香，十人齐齐拜了。琴仙看东楹嵌的第一方画，上云下水，云水中间，隐着一龙，露出一爪，托着一面镜子，上题曰：《品花宝鉴》。刻着次贤的赞语是：","en":"own likenesses; we could not bear it if others came to worship them. We ten must perform the rites ourselves.\\" Huifang and the others agreed completely. They set out wine and fruit, burned fine incense, and all ten bowed in unison. Qinxian then examined the first panel inset on the eastern pillar: clouds above and water below, with a dragon hidden in the space between,"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"。\\n心花意蕊，文运之祥。\\n宝珠道：「这几篇赞语实在做得好。若将我们实事叙在里头，虽然不致辱身，究竟也为贱行。」蕙芳道：「可不是！你看那些花谱花评，虽将那些人赞得色艺俱佳，究不免梨园习气。我们这一关倒可以算跳出了。」素兰等皆点首浩叹。","en":"our actual deeds were recorded within, though it might not disgrace us, it would still reflect our lowly past.\\" Huifang agreed, \\"Exactly! Look at those flower registers and critiques—though they praise people for their beauty and skill, they can never shake off the taint of the theater. This time, we can finally say we have leapt past that barrier.\\" Sulan and the others"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴仙再看第三方，画一个仙女，云鬟雾縠，清艳绝伦，手拈一枝蕙花，琴仙已知是蕙芳。看题的是：锦文花史苏仙。是春航一篇跋语：","en":"and misty garments, of peerless, ethereal beauty, holding a single orchid sprig. Qinxian instantly knew it was Huifang. The title read: \\"Jinwen Flower Historian, Immortal Su.\\" Beside it was Chunhang's colophon:"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"屋于群玉山头；何幸启九迭银屏，窥素面于瑶台月下。\\n琴仙道：「这个跋语跋得甚切，「狡狯神通均出三昧」二语尤妙。」蕙芳笑道：「凭他怎样讲，那里还算得我们？」看第四方，一个仙女月佩霓裳，十分娇艳，手捧明珠一颗，题曰：弄珠花史袁仙。有金粟赞曰：","en":"colophon is profoundly apt; the line 'Her playful magic all springs from true samadhi' is especially brilliant.\\" Huifang laughed, \\"No matter how they dress it up, how can any of this truly be us?\\" They moved to the fourth panel, showing a breathtakingly beautiful fairy maiden adorned in rainbow robes and lunar pendants, cradling a luminous pearl. The title read: \\"Nongzhu"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"有玉树凌风之致，题的是娟娟花史李仙，是高品的诗。琴仙道：「高卓然肯说好话吗？」玉林道：「这一回倒没有刻薄人。」蕙芳道：「这首诗，算卓然极要好的了。」琴仙看是：","en":"asked, \\"Is Gao Zhuoran actually capable of saying nice things?\\" Yulin replied, \\"For once, he hasn't been caustic.\\" Huifang added, \\"For Zhuoran, this poem counts as extremely affectionate.\\" Qinxian read it:"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"得好，将佩仙浓香秀韵一齐写出来了。」玉林道：「这首诗究竟也不甚好，还有些刻薄，你看帐里梦中等句，有什么好呢？」蕙芳道：「这倒没有什么。不过写的娇艳尊贵处。」宝珠道：「卓然这等诗，就算他的好心了。若要他做庄重些，他也未尝不愿，但他那油嘴油舌说这惯一派。你们看他生平说过几句正经话来？吉甫说他去年到京来有个笑话。卓然有个表叔，请他吃饭，还有好几位客坐在那里，表叔问他道","en":"carries a hint of mockery. Look at lines like 'within the bedcurtains' and 'in dreams'—what is so good about those?\\" Huifang replied, \\"That is nothing to worry about. He is merely describing your enchanting beauty and noble status.\\" Baozhu added, \\"A poem like this from Zhuoran is as close to good intentions as he gets. If you wanted him to be more solemn, he might not be unwilling,"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":4,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"多少恩仇报不成。\\n琴仙赞道：「这首七古，实在做得好，念去比《公孙大娘舞剑器行》还刻画得入细。」王兰保笑而不言。蕙芳道：「去年奚十一闹来，幸亏着他，我就没有法了。」素兰道：「原来你也怕奚十一，难道他比潘三还利害么？」蕙芳道：「潘三是个无用的人，那奚十一闹起来，就与前日魏聘才使来的车夫一样，你怕不怕？」兰保道：「那天适或我不在家，你便怎样？」蕙芳道：「我就躲开不出来","en":"are even more vivid than in *Ballad of Lady Gongsun's Sword Dance*.\\" Wang Lanbao merely smiled without speaking. Huifang said, \\"When Xi Eleven caused that uproar last year, we were lucky to have him, or I would have been completely at a loss.\\" Sulan asked, \\"So even you were afraid of Xi Eleven? Is he really more formidable than Pan the Third?\\" Huifang replied, \\"Pan the"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"朝朝之琼树。谁不曰人间绝世，亦何愧仙处无双。若论六宫粉黛，定让龙头；以云一岁花司，是真凤尾。\\n琴仙痛赞了一会。蕙芳道：「你看这些诗文，各有体裁，正是格律不混，体制判然，都是作手，难定优劣。」琴仙道：「虽是些小文章，但吉光片羽，彩散人间，终胜雀屏五色。有此一赞，也不孤负我们数年辛苦了。」众人都皆欢喜。","en":"governing flowers, she is truly the phoenix tail among them.\\"\\n\\nQinxian offered fervent praise for a long while. Huifang said, \\"Look at these poems and prose pieces; each has its own distinct style and structure. The meters are never confused, the forms are sharply defined—they are all masterworks, hard to rank in excellence.\\" Qinxian replied, \\"Though they are but short"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"言赞语一首，刻在上面。你们想这个报答可好么？」素兰道：「这个是极妙，但我们的诗配不上他们。且请谁画这些像呢？」蕙芳道：「就是瑶卿，你与小梅两人分画罢，也不必画服饰，不衫不履的最妙。我们今晚先把赞语做起，明日与他们看看，然后再画。我们就各人还各人的礼，一个赞也不甚费力。」","en":"exceptionally brilliant idea, but our poetry is no match for theirs. And who could we ask to paint these portraits?\\" Huifang said, \\"Yaoqing and Xiaomei can split the painting between them. There's no need to paint formal attire—depicting them in casual, unbuttoned ease would be best. Let us first draft the eulogies tonight, show them to the scholars tomorrow, and then begin"},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":1,"tokens":["苏蕙芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"秋夕，拥花春朝。洞房香暖，金殿声高。\\n心香吐萼，意蕊含苞。曰富曰康，如宾如友。\\n妻子好合，父母眉寿。\\n第八首是苏蕙芳题的《仙中华品》：","en":"others as guests and friends.\\nHusband and wife in perfect union, his parents enjoying long life.\\"\\n\\nThe eighth was Su Huifang's *Splendid Grade Among Immortals*:"}]}`),"char-25":JSON.parse(`{"1":[{"paragraph":18,"mentions":3,"tokens":["陆素兰","素兰","香畹"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"碧海珊枝陆素兰\\n素兰姓陆氏，字香畹，年十六岁。姑苏人。","en":"Lu Sulan: A Coral Branch in the Azure Sea. Sulan's surname is Lu, his style name Xiangwan, and he is sixteen years of age. A native of Suzhou."}],"6":[{"paragraph":35,"mentions":1,"tokens":["陆素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"心相照的光景，还说不认得，要怎样才算认得呢？」大家都微笑看着子玉，子玉有口难辩，不觉脸红起来。这出唱过，又看了陆素兰的《舞盘》、金漱芳的《题曲》、李玉林的《偷诗》，都是无上上品，香艳绝伦，子玉唯有向南湘认错而已。","en":"knowingly at Ziyu, who, devoid of any defense, felt his face flush deeply. Following this piece, they watched Lu Sulan in 'Dancing on the Tray,' Jin Shufang in 'Inscribing the Song,' and Li Yulin in 'Stealing the Poem'—all superlative performers of unmatched, fragrant brilliance. Ziyu could only bow his head to Nanxiang, acknowledging the magnitude of his earlier error."}],"7":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":2,"tokens":["陆素兰","素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说子玉从会馆回来，将琴官的戏足足想了两日，以谓天下之美莫过于此。又将苏蕙芳、陆素兰、金漱芳、李玉林的色艺品评，都为绝顶。细细核来，蕙芳的神色尤胜于诸人，次则素兰可以匹敌。然较比琴官起来，毫厘之间终觉稍逊。又想：","en":"reflecting on Qinguan's performance, convinced it was the pinnacle of worldly beauty. He also appraised Su Huifang, Lu Sulan, Jin Shufang, and Li Yulin, finding them all to be utterly superlative. Yet upon careful comparison, Huifang's spirit and bearing surpassed the rest, with Sulan as his only true equal. But when measured against Qinguan, even by the finest margin, they"}],"9":[{"paragraph":27,"mentions":1,"tokens":["陆素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"明两暗的西洋房。此中点缀得甚佳，琴床画桌，金鼎铜壶，斑然可爱。正中悬着一额，是屈本立写的「宜春阁」三字，一边是陆素兰写的几幅小楷，一边是袁宝珠画的几幅墨兰，中间地上点着一盏仿古鸡足银灯，有四尺高，上面托着个九瓣莲花灯盏，点着九穗，照得满屋通明。一一坐了，次贤道：「我们何不再饮几杯？」众人道：「我们在亭子上已饮多了，可以不必酒了，倒是清谈罢。」南湘道：「我今日的酒不","en":"Welcoming Spring, in the calligraphy of Qu Benli. On one side hung several panels of small-script calligraphy by Sulan, and on the other side, several panels of ink-painted orchids by Yuan Baozhu. In the middle of the floor stood a lamp imitating an ancient chicken-foot design in silver, some four feet tall. It held a nine-petal lotus lamp-basin above, burning nine wicks,"},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":1,"tokens":["香畹"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"此二君何如？你看他们的相貌、才艺，你评评，还是我说谎的么？」又指着两边的书画道：「你再看看，这是瑶卿画的，那是香畹写的，你看外边那班假名士，能够如这班真相公吗？」","en":"he pointed at the calligraphy and paintings on the walls, \\"this is painted by Yaoqing, and that is written by Xiangwan. Compare the outside crowd of pseudo-scholars. Can any of them match these real performers?\\","}],"10":[{"paragraph":6,"mentions":1,"tokens":["陆香畹"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"？」宝珠笑道：「那天我又没有唱戏，那里知道是他不是他？」琴言呆呆的想了半晌，又问宝珠道：「他的相貌可同我们班里陆香畹差不多？就只眼睛长些，觉得光彩照人；鼻子直些，觉得满面秀气，是不是呢？」宝珠道：「这么说。你们很熟的了，为什么要瞒着人呢？」琴言无言可答，想起那天的梦来，便道：「你同这姓梅的相好几年了？」宝珠道：「昨日才见面的。」琴言道：「我不信。若是昨日才见，怎么","en":"lost in thought for a long while before asking Baozhu again: \\"Does his appearance roughly resemble that of Lu Xiangwan from our troupe? Except that the eyes are somewhat longer and seem to radiate a brilliant light, and the nose is a little straighter, lending the whole face an air of elegant refinement. Is that accurate?\\" Baozhu laughed: \\"From the way you describe him,"}],"12":[{"paragraph":32,"mentions":3,"tokens":["陆素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"那相公的相貌衣裳，连那骡子车围的颜色都说了，问道：「你可识得是那一班的相公？」高品想了一会道：「据你说来，不是陆素兰，就是金漱芳，不然就是袁宝珠。」春航道；「金漱芳在联殊班，我见过他的戏，生得瘦瘦儿的，不是。至于陆素兰、袁宝珠我却不认得，不知到底是谁？」高品道：「袁宝珠是不大穿素色衣裳的。你说这光景，也不大很像陆素兰。要不然是苏蕙芳，不错的，定是苏媚香，那真是冰壶","en":"troupe this actor belongs to?\\" Gao Pin thought for a moment and said: \\"From your description, it must be either Lu Sulan, or Jin Shufang — or else Yuan Baozhu.\\" Chunhang said: \\"Jin Shufang is in the Lianzhu troupe and I have seen his performance — he is rather thin and spare-looking; not him. As for Lu Sulan and Yuan Baozhu, I do not recognize either — I cannot say who"}],"15":[{"paragraph":8,"mentions":4,"tokens":["素兰","香畹"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"里头说道，就是刘大人带到春喜园去了。文泽一个没趣，子玉倒觉喜欢。南湘道：「那里去？我还没有吃饭，对门不是妙香堂素兰家么，咱们就找香畹去。」文泽道：「只怕也未必在家。叫人去问一问。「素兰却好在家，里头有人出来，请了进去，到客厅坐下，送了茶。文泽问子玉道」香畹你见过没有？」子玉道：「没有。」","en":"hand, felt quietly relieved. Nanxiang said, \\"Where to now? I haven't eaten yet — isn't that Miaoxiang Hall, where Sulan lives, right across the lane? Let's go and find Xiangwan.\\" Wenze said, \\"I'm not sure he'll be at home either. Send someone to ask.\\" As it happened, Sulan was indeed at home; someone came out from inside and invited them in. They sat down in the reception"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":4,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"南湘道：「此君丰韵，足并袁苏，为梨园三鼎足。」不多一会，素兰出来，与南湘、文泽见了，又与子玉相见。素兰把子玉细细打量了一番，问文泽道：「这位可姓梅？」文泽向子玉道：「又对出谎来了，你方才说不认识他，他怎么又认识你呢？」子玉真不明白，恰难分辩，倒是素兰道：「认是并不认得，被我一猜就猜着了。」南湘道：「我恰不信，","en":"elegance and charm stands alongside Yuan and Su as one of the three pillars of the pear garden.\\" Before long, Sulan came out, greeted Nanxiang and Wenze, and was introduced to Ziyu. Sulan looked Ziyu over carefully and then asked Wenze: \\"Is this young gentleman surnamed Mei?\\" Wenze said to Ziyu, \\"Another lie exposed — you just claimed not to know him, yet he already"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":1,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"们试出来了，还赖说不认识。我们当庾香是个至诚人，谁知他倒善于撒谎。」说得子玉两颊微红，这个委屈，无人可诉。细看素兰的面貌，与自己觉有些相像，恐怕被南湘、文泽看出说笑，他便走开，去看旁边字画。南湘对文泽道：","en":"flushed slightly; the injustice of it was such that he had no one to whom he could complain. He looked closely at Sulan's features and noticed a certain resemblance to himself; fearing that Nanxiang and Wenze might notice and make sport of it, he moved away and went to look at the calligraphy and paintings on the nearby wall. Nanxiang said to Wenze:"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":6,"tokens":["香畹","素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「你可看得出香畹像谁？」文泽道；「像庾香，我第一回见庾香，我就要说他，因为他面嫩，所以没有说出来。」子玉权当不听见，由他们议论。素兰道：「你们不要糟蹋他，怎么将我比他？」说罢拉了子玉过来，到这边坐下。南湘道：「我们还没有吃饭，你快拿饭来。」素兰即吩咐厨房备饭。子玉虽","en":"\\"Can you see who Xiangwan resembles?\\" Wenze said, \\"He resembles Yuxiang. The very first time I saw Yuxiang, I was going to say so, but because he looked so young, I held back.\\" Ziyu pretended not to hear and let them talk among themselves. Sulan said, \\"Don't make sport of him"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":14,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"随又与南湘、文泽斟了，文泽问道：「你今日倒不上戏园子去？」素兰道：「今日没有我的戏，可以不去。」子玉见了素兰也是幽闲贞静一派，心里就契重他。素兰一抬头，见子玉只管偷看他，不觉一笑，便有一种幽情艳思摇漾出来，子玉把眼一低。文泽笑道：「同了庾香出来，我们有多少算不来处。」子玉不解。文泽笑道：「有了你，譬如逛灯那一天","en":"He then poured cups for Nanxiang and Wenze. Wenze asked: \\"Are you not going to the theater today?\\" Sulan said, \\"There is no role for me today, so I may stay away.\\" Seeing Sulan's quiet, serene, and composed manner, Ziyu felt a deep affinity in his heart. Sulan raised his eyes and, noticing that Ziyu kept stealing glances at him, broke into an involuntary"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":5,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"南湘连连点头道：「这真难得。」文泽又道：「玉侬于庾香的情，可为二十四分了，不知庾香与玉侬的情怎样，你可知道？」素兰道：「怎么不知道？也是瑶卿说的。」又将徐子云将假琴言试子玉的情节，说了一番，听得南湘、文泽笑了又赞，赞了又笑。子玉十分难受，只得说道：「些须小事，一经人道，便添出无数枝叶来了。」当下素兰又遣人去问，琴言尚未回来。吃过饭，讲了些闲话，子玉便要素兰写的字","en":"for Yuxiang must amount to twenty-four parts deep. I wonder what Yuxiang's feeling for Yunong is? Do you know?\\" Sulan said, \\"How could I not know? That too was told to me by Yaoqing.\\" He then recounted the whole episode of Xu Ziyun testing Ziyu with the false Qinyan, and Nanxiang and Wenze laughed and praised it by turns. Ziyu found this all very difficult to bear,"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":4,"tokens":["香畹"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"逢戏酒，叫我们也伺候过几回，人倒谦雅的，就总没有赏过一句话儿。倒不料他生出那么一个风流的公子。这梅庾香前日竟在香畹处吃饭，还到玉侬处，没有遇见。据香畹说，他待玉侬的情分，竟是有一无二的。」子云道：「你怎么知道他去找玉侬？是他一人去的么。」宝珠道：「是香畹对我讲的，他恰与竹君、前舟二人同去，香畹还送了他一柄扇子，他们倒也合式了。」次贤道：「我看前日庾香、玉侬二人，","en":"word with us. Little did we expect him to produce such a romantic-hearted son. This Mei Yuxiang was actually at Xiangwan's place for dinner the other day, and then went over to Yunong's place without finding him. According to Xiangwan, the depth of his feeling for Yunong is truly unparalleled.\\" Ziyun said, \\"How do you know he went to find Yunong? Did he go alone?\\" Baozhu"}],"16":[{"paragraph":24,"mentions":10,"tokens":["陆素兰","素兰","香畹"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"鸟声聒碎，花影横披，不觉有些疲倦，因忆古人「风暖鸟声碎，日高花影重」二语体物之工。复想起陆素兰那日待我的光景，又寻出素兰写的扇子，细细的看了一回，因又想道：「我也要送他些东西才好。遂检出古砚一方，好香墨两匣，徐松陵墨兰册页十二方，团扇一柄，即将前日所作送春二律，用小楷写好，始而欲遣人送去。继因长昼闷人，遂起了访友的兴致，寻芳的念头。到上房禀过","en":"deepens the flowers' shadows,\\" marvelling at their exquisite capture of the scene. His thoughts then drifted to Lu Sulan and the warmth shown to him that day. Seeking out the fan Sulan had inscribed, he studied it closely, thinking, \\"I truly ought to give him something in return.\\" He selected an antique inkstone, two boxes of fine scented ink, an album of twelve ink orchids"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":2,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"心思奇不奇，不是为你是为谁？」子玉听了便觉一阵心酸，止不住流下泪来，要说话。喉间若有物噎住说不出，只呆呆的看着素兰。素兰又道：「到底你们是怎样的交情？我是你的功臣，为你也费了些神。因我有些像你，所以常来对我讲些懵懂话儿。我说你这片心，不知人家知道不知道？","en":"efforts, tears began to fall. He tried to speak, but the words caught in his throat, leaving him to gaze blankly at Sulan. Sulan pressed on gently, \\"What kind of bond is this between you two? I have tried my best to help you. Because I bear a slight resemblance to you, he often comes to pour out his vague, half-formed thoughts to me. I cannot help but wonder: do you think"},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":3,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"不妨对我说说。你当面不好意思的对他讲，我替你代说，自然你也有一番思念他的心肠，何妨说给我听听。」子玉只是不语，素兰料着是不肯说的，「我们同到他家去瞧瞧罢？」子玉略一踌躇道：「去也使得。」于是素兰即同子玉走出门来，不多几步，即到了秋水堂门口，见有五六辆车歇着。素兰道：","en":"clearly harbor deep longing for him; why not share it with me?\\" Ziyu remained silent. Sensing his reluctance, Sulan suggested, \\"Shall we go together and visit him?\\" Ziyu hesitated briefly before agreeing, \\"We might as well.\\" Sulan led Ziyu out the door, and a few steps later, they arrived at the gate of Qiushui Hall, where five or six carriages were already parked."},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":1,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"？」子玉心上略有一分不自在，不晓里面所请是何客，玉侬陪与不陪？又想起他家里请客，断无不陪之礼。毫无主意，只听凭素兰进退。","en":"must naturally attend to their guests and could hardly refuse them. Lacking a better idea, he simply followed Sulan's lead."},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":3,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"素兰回到自己家门口，唤人往琴言处打听，不多一刻，来说琴言卧病在床，请客是他师傅长庆请分子，是部里几位经承先生，还是吃的早饭，不多一回就散的。素兰道：「再请到里面坐着等罢。」子玉听见心中略定，只得重进里面。无精打采的坐下。素兰只管笑嘻嘻的问长问短，又问你到","en":"Sulan returned to his own gate and sent someone to inquire at Qinyan's residence. Shortly after, the messenger returned, reporting that Qinyan was confined to his bed with an illness. The guests had been invited by his master, Changqing; they were several"},{"paragraph":30,"mentions":1,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"素兰亦觉凄楚，便淌下泪来，半晌劝道：「你们两人前生竟有些瓜葛，不然何至于此？以君才貌而论，是人人怜爱的。但似玉侬之冰雪心肠，独为你缠绵宛转。","en":"Deeply moved, Sulan shed a few tears of his own. After a long silence, he offered words of comfort: \\"You two must have shared a profound bond in a past life; how else could it have come to this? With your talents and bearing, you are naturally cherished by all. But it is"},{"paragraph":31,"mentions":1,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"侬不足为庾香赏识，非庾香不足为玉侬眷恋。《国风》好色而不淫，其庾香、玉侬之谓乎！」子玉听了，感激度香万分，且爱素兰之聪慧，不枉《曲台花谱》中定作探花郎也。","en":"refer precisely to you and Yunong?\\" Hearing this, Ziyu felt boundless gratitude toward Duxiang and marvelled at Sulan's perceptive insight. It was no wonder the \\"Opera Stage Flower Catalogue\\" had crowned him with the title of Tanhua."},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":3,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"因谈了许多时候，素兰又请子玉随意用了些点心，着人再到琴言处探望。来人回来道：「起先之客倒散了。偏又来了一班人，说要叫琴言，长庆回他不在家，那些人不肯去，坐着等候。长庆因不认识他们，便不应酬，自到房里吃烟去了。被他们闯进去，将长庆的烟枪抢了，要到兵马司衙门出首他。长庆无法","en":"They conversed for a long while before Sulan offered Ziyu refreshments and sent another messenger to check on Qinyan. The messenger returned with troubling news: \\"The first group of guests has left, but unfortunately, another group arrived demanding to see Qinyan. Changqing told them he was not"},{"paragraph":33,"mentions":1,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"今日子玉出门，只与素兰谈了半日，所访不遇，倒遇见了丈人，好不纳闷。意欲去望高品，又嫌路远，且出门过久，又恐高堂见责，只得怏怏而回。","en":"Ziyu had spent half the day out, only managing a conversation with Sulan; every other friend he had sought was absent. Instead, he had the misfortune of running into his father-in-law—a truly vexing encounter. He considered visiting Gao Pin, but the distance was great, and having been away so long, he feared a reprimand upon"}],"17":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说子玉从素兰处回来，见过高堂，即向书房中来。晚饭毕，一轮月上，辉映花间，和风微来，天云四皎，遂把湘帘卷起，倚阑而望。忽见小厮进来禀道：「高、史、颜、王诸少爷同来。」子玉正在怅望，今见齐来，不胜之喜，遂请进同坐。","en":"When Ziyu returned from Sulan's and had paid his respects to his mother, he made his way to his study. The evening meal being finished, a solitary moon arose, casting its silvery radiance among the blossoms. A gentle breeze whispered past, and the heavens and clouds were swept clean"},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":1,"tokens":["香畹"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"！但不知在何处聚会？」王恂道：「我家亦可，但无花园子，不如前舟园里好。我们主人六个，添上湘帆七个，媚香、瑶卿、香畹、佩仙、静芳、蕊香、瘦香、小梅共是八个，要三席才可坐，醵分之说，不能预定多少，只好办了再算。」众人道：「极是。」子玉便呆呆的。仲清笑道：「庸庵你这差使办得不周到，要讨人怪的。」王恂尚未回答，南湘道：「何所见而言？」仲清道：「你不见庸庵点将，把一个极要","en":"better in Qianzhou's garden. With the six of us as hosts, plus Xiangfan, that makes seven; Meixiang, Yaoqing, Xiangwan, Peixian, Jingfang, Ruixiang, Shouxiang, and Xiaomei make eight. We shall require three tables to seat everyone. As for the pooled funds, we cannot fix an amount in advance; we must simply make the arrangements and settle the accounts thereafter.\\" Everyone"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":1,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"去知会群花，于明日辰刻毕集。因说道：「明日花林中，恐有几个不能来。我知道秦琪官害眼，杜琴言亦患病未痊。昨晚我见素兰，谈及庾香在彼处坐了半日，去访琴言，恰值他师傅请客没有进去，琴言亦未知庾香去访他。明日就使他们两个不来，也有八人，很为热闹的了。庾香、静宜想一定来的。」南湘道：「席间行令，新鲜的甚少，太难了又恐座客一时不能，须得雅俗共赏，易知易能的，又要避熟。\\n射覆","en":"attend. I know Qin Qiguan suffers an eye ailment, and Du Qinyan is also ill and not yet recovered. Last night I saw Sulan, who mentioned that Yuxiang sat there for half the day, then went to visit Qinyan; it happened that his master was hosting guests so he did not enter, and Qinyan remained unaware that Yuxiang had come to visit him. Even if those two do not come tomorrow,"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":1,"tokens":["陆素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"偕升，虽不得仙，亦可脱俗，故尔谨遵台命，鞠跽前来。」文泽道：「此亦同人盛举，瞻仰倾城，为借花献佛耳。」说话间，陆素兰、李玉林、金漱芳同到，随后高、史、颜、王四人偕来，蕙芳一一都谢了。","en":"gazing upon a city-toppling beauty, merely borrowing the flower to offer to Buddha.\\" While they were speaking, Lu Sulan, Li Yulin, and Jin Shufang arrived together, followed by the four—Gao, Shi, Yan, and Wang; Huifang thanked them all one by one."},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":1,"tokens":["陆素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"日星，人间鸾凤，有一段孚瑜和粹之情，皎皎乎有出群之致。怪不得杜玉侬倾倒如此，与我田郎可谓瑜亮并生矣！」子玉又与陆素兰等相见，忽听外面说：「徐老爷同萧老爷来了。」众人一齐出厅迎接，只见子云同了次贤翩翩的，俨似太原公子裼裘而来，后面随着袁宝珠、王兰保二人。再后还有八个清俊书童，拿着衣包、铜盆、漱盂等物。","en":"Tian, they might be called twin paragons, a Zhou Yu and a Zhuge Liang born in the same age!\\" Ziyu then greeted Lu Sulan and the others. Suddenly they heard from outside: \\"Master Xu and Master Xiao have arrived!\\" Everyone went out from the hall together to welcome them; there came Ziyun and Cixian, moving gracefully as scions of great families draped in their furs, with"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":1,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话言未完，春航已到，大家重新叙礼，群芳亦都见了，未免取笑的取笑，诙谐的诙谐。宝珠与素兰拉过红毡铺地，摆了两张交椅，要请春航、蕙芳并坐受拜。二人如何肯坐，急行收了。此时春航、蕙芳二人真觉口众我寡，只好听凭他们取笑；若回答两句，又惹出许多话来。子玉颇敬春航仪容之洒落，与蕙芳正是冰壶秋月，相映生辉。又复品评诸花，各有佳妙，只不见琴言前来，殊","en":"greetings afresh, and all the beauties were also introduced. Banter and teasing naturally followed. Baozhu and Sulan drew out a red felt mat and placed it on the floor, setting up two folding chairs, intending to ask Chunhang and Huifang to sit together and receive obeisance. The two of them absolutely refused to sit, so the mat was quickly put away. By now Chunhang"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":1,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"定完后，王桂保、林春喜来了，皆见过了。正席上令漱芳、玉林、春喜伺候；左席上令宝珠、兰保、素兰；右席上则蕙芳、桂保二人。分派已定，各人坐了，慢慢的浅斟缓酌起来，正是：","en":"introduced all around. At the center table, Shufang, Yulin, and Chunxi attended; at the left table, Baozhu, Lanbao, and Sulan; at the right table, Huifang and Guibao. The assignments made, everyone took their seats and began to pour slowly, drinking at a leisurely pace. It was truly:"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":1,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"慰他几句，与他瀹茗添香，助起他的精神来。他又不要疑我乐即忘忧，当此群花大会，便就忘了他，那时更觉闷上加闷。偏偏素兰又在此，不然他还可以过去排解排解。咳！眼前虽则如云，其奈匪我思存何。此时子玉神色惨淡，只推醉出席，去倚炕而卧，众人也不理会。且酒肴已多，不胜其量，亦各离席散坐。","en":"sorrows. Thinking so during this grand flower gathering, he would feel all the more wretched. To make matters worse, Sulan was right here too; otherwise, he might at least have gone to him for comfort. He sighed: though the scene before his eyes was full of people like clouds, he whom his heart sought was not here. At this moment Ziyu's expression grew somber; he merely"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":1,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"茗鲜果。春喜与桂保到太湖石畔，同坐在芍药栏边闲话；玉林、漱芳已醉卧在海棠花下；兰保在池畔钓鱼；宝珠与蕙芳对弈，素兰观局，南湘、高品在傍为宝珠指点。蕙芳道：「你们三人下我一个。就赢了也不算稀奇。」宝珠道：「我偏不用人教也赢得你。」文泽道：「今日我们亦算极乐了，可惜花部中少了两人，那个还不要紧，第一是琴言不来，使庾香不能畅意。」子云道：「可不是！琴言的病颇为古怪，精","en":"asleep beneath the crabapple blossoms. Lanbao was fishing by the pond. Baozhu and Huifang were playing chess, with Sulan watching the game, while Nanxiang and Gao Pin stood by offering Baozhu advice. Huifang said: \\"Three of you against my one; even if you win it is hardly a surprise.\\" Baozhu said: \\"I can win against you without any coaching at all.\\" Wenze said: \\"Today"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":2,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"次贤为首，次子云，次高品，次南湘，次文泽，次仲清，次春航，次王恂，次子玉，共是九人。王恂已将子玉叫醒，净净脸，素兰取出一颗醒酒丸给子玉吃了。子玉不好意思，只得勉强扎挣。素兰见子玉不语不言，似醉非醉，心上猜着是为琴言未来。一因人多不好解慰他，二因提起琴言反恐倒勾他的心事，非惟不能宽解，越增愁闷了，反倒走开，找别人说话。文泽命小厮于每位座前，列一小几，置放笔砚一副，","en":"Xun, and finally Ziyu, making nine people in all. Wang Xun had already roused Ziyu and had him wash his face; Sulan brought out a sobering pill and gave it to Ziyu to ingest. Ziyu felt embarrassed and forced himself to pull it together. Seeing that Ziyu was silent and listless, half-drunk and half-sober, Sulan guessed in his heart that it was because Qinyan had not"},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":1,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"」众皆应道：「妙极！我们何不将人花比拟一回，总要从公，不可各存偏见。」于是大家评定：以宝珠为牡丹，蕙芳为芍药，素兰为莲花，玉林为碧桃，漱芳为海棠，兰保为玫瑰，桂保为芙蓉，春喜小而多才，人人钟爱为兰花。八人品题尽合，因又想到琴言、琪官为何花？子云道：「琴言色艺过佳，而性情过冷，比为梅花最是相称，且其酷爱梅，不属庾香将谁属耶？」众人说道；「很是。」高品道：「只怕和靖","en":"personal bias.\\" So they deliberated together and decided: Baozhu as the peony; Huifang as the herbaceous peony; Sulan as the lotus; Yulin as the green peach blossom; Shufang as the crabapple; Lanbao as the rose; Guibao as the cotton rose. Chunxi, small in stature yet richly talented and beloved by all, was assigned the orchid. The eight assignments all felt fitting."}],"18":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说琴言病体恹恹，闭门谢客，只有同班中几个相好时来宽慰。宝珠、素兰又说子玉前日的光景，又不能常来看你，托我们传话，千万保重等语，琴言更加伤感。自患病以来，各处不去，怡园亦屏迹已久。奈其师长庆靠他做个摇钱树，因其久病，不能见客，便也少了好些兴头。","en":"visitors; only a few close friends from the same troupe came by from time to time to offer comfort. Baozhu and Sulan also passed on word from Ziyu, recounting his recent days and explaining his inability to visit often, yet urging Qinyan to take the utmost care of his health. Hearing these messages, Qinyan only grew more heavy-hearted. Since falling ill, he had gone"}],"20":[{"paragraph":4,"mentions":1,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"系忧闷而起，或到怡园时，偏值琴言不来；或到琴言寓里，偏又逢着他们有事，不是他师傅请客，就是有人坐着。又不便再寻素兰，子玉亦觉得无可奈何，只好怅恨缘悭而已。这边琴言在家，并不知子玉来过几次，又听得子玉害病，心上更是悲酸，因为没有到过梅宅，不便自去。正是一点怜才慕色之心，无可宽解，惟有短叹长吁，形诸梦寐。看官，你道子玉去寻琴言，为什么他的师傅总不拉拢呢？一来子玉是逢","en":"either his teacher Changqing was entertaining guests, or someone was sitting there. He also could not easily go to Sulan's again; Ziyu felt utterly helpless and could only mourn the grudging lot of fate. Qinyan, at home, did not know how many times Ziyu had come by; and hearing that Ziyu was ill, he felt all the more heartsick — yet since he had never once called at the"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":2,"tokens":["素兰","香畹"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「所谓「打鸭惊鸳鸯」，今日见了。」大家正看得有趣，又见船中走出几枝花来。一只船内是宝珠、漱芳，一只船内是蕙芳、素兰，共是五个。舟人把舟泊近阑干，南湘道：「芙蓉未开，水榭减色。有此众芳一渡，庶不寂寞。湘娥洛神，江湄游戏，我度香先生当以玉佩要之。」大家笑了一笑，群旦上来都见过了。次贤道：「你们看静芳窄袖踟蹰的，越显得风流跌宕。竹君之赞语「翩若惊鸿，婉若游龙」，真觉得","en":"figures stepping out of the boats like blossoming flowers: one boat held Baozhu and Shufang, the other Huifang and Sulan — five people in all. The boatmen moored the craft against the railing; Nanxiang said: \\"The hibiscus has not yet opened, and the water pavilion lacks a certain brilliance. With all this company of flowers making the crossing, it will no longer be desolate."},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":1,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"素兰道：「桂岭在前山前，兰径、菊畦是在后山后，过涧去一片大空地，有一所庄院，便是菊畦。那兰径是山下，到半山，高高下下的长廊曲径，最好顽的所在。菊畦过去还有个稻庄。有桔槔戽水，像个村落，渔帘蟹簖，各样都有。还有两个鹤栏、鹿棚，也近在那里。」","en":"Sulan said: \\"Osmanthus Ridge is in front of the front hill; Orchid Path and the Chrysanthemum Beds are behind the back hill. You cross the ravine into a large open space where there is a village-style compound — that's the Chrysanthemum Beds. Orchid Path is"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":1,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云坐了主位，左右为素兰、宝珠二人。饮酒的话头，无非是那几套，且慢讲他。再看那龙舟已到阁前，盘盘旋旋，来来往往，荡个不了。","en":"Ziyun took the host's seat, with Sulan and Baozhu on either side. The table talk was the usual sort; let us not linger over it. The dragon boat had now drawn up before the pavilion and was circling round and round, coming and going without end."},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":6,"tokens":["素兰","香畹"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"贤道：「不消说，是并肩坐的这两个了，且仍是你自饮，用是用不着他们，但劝是要劝的。」子云带笑饮了一杯，又将一杯对素兰道：「香畹你是个好人，你莫要学那阎婆惜，心上只记着张三郎，不瞅不睬的，你且饮这一杯罢。」引得众人笑起来。素兰本待要饮，因为众人一笑，便脸上红晕了一层，便把嘴向着宝珠一呶，说道：「阎婆惜在那边，你叫他饮罢。」宝珠也嗤的一笑。子云又拿一杯对着宝珠道：「如","en":"There's no need for them, but you still have to invite them.\\" Ziyun laughed and drank one cup, then offered a cup to Sulan: \\"Xiangwan — you are a good person; you mustn't imitate that Yan Poxi, who only had Zhang Sanlang in his heart and paid attention to nothing else. Just drink this cup.\\" This set everyone laughing. Sulan was originally going to drink, but the laughter"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":2,"tokens":["陆素兰","素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"泥里，那时莲钩倒摸不着，摸着的是条驴腿。」说得众人哄然狂笑起来，把个金漱芳笑得闪了腰，直跌到次贤怀里。王兰保、陆素兰笑得走开了。宝珠道：「此又是报应，天理昭彰，一毫不爽的。」大家笑得春航十分难受，又不好认真，只得忍住道：「竹君刻薄，应该罚他一个恶令。」南湘笑道：「我是据实而言，何刻薄之有？」蕙芳道：「你也够了，不要说嘴，晓得也有失风时候。」次贤笑道：「瑶卿，此令如","en":"laughter; Jin Shufang laughed so hard he twisted at the waist and tumbled straight into Cixian's lap. Wang Lanbao and Lu Sulan laughed and moved away. Baozhu said: \\"Another case of heavenly retribution — perfectly clear and precise.\\" Everyone kept laughing, which made Chunhang quite uncomfortable; yet unable to take it seriously, he had to hold it in and say: \\"Zhujun's mockery"}],"21":[{"paragraph":4,"mentions":2,"tokens":["香畹"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「已经病了，这也没法，但是我劝他切莫要病上加病。他若晓得我病，你就不必瞒他，只说我的病不要紧，几天就好的。你说香畹这个最好的，常可以找他去谈谈，只要郁闷一开，自然好得快了。」这句话，聘才却不甚懂，便也答应了。子玉又道：「我也不能去看他，他见香畹就是了。」子玉一面说，神色之间，便觉惨淡。聘才明白这病，为琴言而起，便又想道：「庾香真是个无用之人，既然爱那琴言，何妨常","en":"heap illness on illness. If he hears I am ill, do not hide it — say mine is slight and will clear in days. Say Xiangwan is the kindest soul — he may often seek him out and talk away gloom — then recovery comes faster.\\" Pincai did not fully grasp this but agreed. Ziyu added: \\"I cannot visit him myself — seeing Xiangwan will do.\\" As he spoke his look grew bleak. Pincai"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":6,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"再说琴言在床卧了，觉得阵阵心酸，淌了许多眼泪，左思右想，不能明白。忽想起素兰那日之言，说同庾香前来，因为师傅请客，不得进内，说到此又被人打断。这几天又寻不着他，何不再寻他来一问，便知庾香的光景了。即着人去寻素兰，素兰回家即换了便服过来，这边琴言接着，就在房里坐下。素兰道：「你寻我有什么事？莫非又要我做庾香的替身么？」琴言笑道","en":"Qinyan lay on the bed — wave on wave of acid grief — tears without end — could not puzzle it out. He recalled Sulan's words that day — he and Yuxiang had come but the master was feasting guests and could not enter — then someone cut the tale short; these days he could not find Sulan — sent for him; Sulan changed to plain dress and came; Qinyan received him and they"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":1,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「什么笑话？你快快说罢。」素兰道：「媚香的生日，田湘帆做了一篇小序，大家说做得好，度香便抄了。那一天，庾香来，静宜便将小序给庾香看，庾香也赞了几声。度香在旁说道：「湘帆好一个浓艳文心，愈艳愈好，愈浓愈好。」度香正赞湘帆的文章，庾香忽说道：「玉侬自然在玉艳之上，玉艳虽好，尚逊瑶卿、","en":"\\"What joke — say it now.\\" Sulan said: \\"On Meixiang's birthday Tian Xiangfan wrote a short preface — everyone praised it — Duxiang copied it. The day Yuxiang came Jingyi showed him the piece; Yuxiang admired it. Standing by, Duxiang said: 'Xiangfan's style — the thicker the richer —"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":3,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"素兰安慰道：「哭什么？你病还没有好些，就这么伤心，正是雪上加霜了，所以我不肯对你讲，知道你要伤心的」。琴言忽又蹬足道：「这魏聘才真不是个东西，无缘无故的糟蹋人，玷污人，造言生事。」素兰问道：「那个魏聘才？你因甚骂他？」琴言便将帕子掩了脸，索性哭个不止。素","en":"Sulan soothed: \\"Why weep — you are barely mending — grief only heaps frost on snow — that is why I would not tell.\\" Qinyan stamped: \\"Wei Pincai is less than human — slandering and staining people for nothing.\\" Sulan asked who Wei Pincai was; Qinyan hid his"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":3,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴言听了这些话，略有笑容。素兰便问魏聘才是何人，琴言略把去年搭船进京，及住在梅宅的话，说了几句，即对素兰道：「细听起来，这魏聘才真是个小人，你问他怎的，不如不提他为妙。」素兰道：「不为别的，我昨日在春阳楼吃饭，听得说，掌柜的闹了一件事，得罪了华公府一个师爷，便送到兵马司，打了二十","en":"Hearing this, Qinyan smiled a little. Sulan asked who Wei Pincai was, and Qinyan gave him a few words about coming up to the capital by boat the year before and lodging at the Mei house, and then said, \\"When one listens closely, this Wei Pincai is a mean sort of man. Why ask about him? Better"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":1,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"也姓魏，叫什么才，却是华公府里的。」琴言道：「我却听得他说，如今住在城里，不在庾香处了，我也没有问他在那里。」素兰道：「我听走堂的说起来，却说得原原委委。新年上，这姓魏的同了几个人，带着保珠、二喜，吃了五十几吊钱，掌柜的因不认识，写账的时候，想必说了什么话。","en":"Hua mansion.\\" Qinyan said: \\"I heard him say he lives in the city now — not at Yuxiang's — I did not ask where.\\" Sulan said: \\"The waiters told the tale end to end. New Year's week this Wei and others brought Baozhu and Erxi — fifty-odd strings — the boss did not know him and must have spoken out of turn when tallying credit.\\""},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":12,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"聘才的总不是东西就是了。」因又问道：「那日你同庾香来，遇见我师傅请客。那一回的说话，还没有说完，到底讲什么？」素兰就把那一天子玉的光景，细细述了一遍，又道：「我也为你说得口渴了，你茶都没有一碗。」琴言笑道：「说话说得要紧，忘了吩咐，快沏茶来。」素兰吃了两口茶，便笑道：「庾香与你倒是一样的心肠，竟是一副板印出来的。」琴言道：「怎么一样呢？」素兰道：「我看你屋子里及","en":"found my master entertaining guests, you never finished what you had begun to tell me. What exactly was said?\\"\\n\\nSulan recounted in careful detail all that had happened with Ziyu that day. At the end he complained, \\"I have talked myself thirsty for your sake, and you have not offered me so much as one bowl of tea.\\"\\n\\nQinyan smiled. \\"The story had reached such a vital"}],"22":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":3,"tokens":["陆素兰","素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说前回书中，陆素兰应许了琴言约子玉出来相会，话便说了这一句，明日恰好是端午，是没有工夫的。偏又接连唱了三天堂会戏，素兰身子也乏了，又静养几天。这边琴言是度日如年，天天使人来问他，把个素兰弄得没有主意。又因自己寓中来往人多，也不甚便。若借人地方，或是酒楼饭馆，一发不好说","en":"The last chapter told how Lu Sulan promised Qinyan that he would arrange for Ziyu to come out for a meeting. But no sooner was the promise spoken than the next day proved to be the Dragon Boat Festival, when there was no leisure to be had; and then came three days running of private engagement"},{"paragraph":2,"mentions":3,"tokens":["陆素兰","香畹","素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"面上字迹，写着梅少爷手启，端端正正，不像子云、次贤笔迹，因想道：「或是叫书童写的也未可知。即拆开一看，第一行是陆素兰谨启，庾香公子吟坛云云。」心中倒觉跳了一跳，香畹何故作札来，莫非玉侬有什么缘故么？遂即一字字的细看，看完了又看，至两三遍，脸上便自然发出笑来，便对云儿道：「你去叫来人候一候，我即写回信。」云儿出去了，子玉又看了一遍，便觉心花大开，病已去了九分，遂即忙","en":"Ziyun or Cixian, and thought: \\"Perhaps he set a page-boy to write it.\\" He opened it, and the first line read: \\"Lu Sulan respectfully addresses the poetic altar of Master Yuxiang\\" — at which his heart gave a leap. Why should Xiangwan be writing to him? Could something be afoot concerning Yunong? He read it word by word, and having finished, read it again, two and three"},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":2,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"才进二门，就听得一片嚷闹之声。素兰吃了一惊，便轻了脚步，走到东边一间客房，从窗缝里望去：只见有两个人，一个坐着，一个站在中间捶台拍桌子的骂人。素兰看了，着实害怕。只见那坐着的穿一件青绸衫子，有三十来岁，黑油油一脸的横肉，手里拿着两个铁球，冷言冷语，半闹半劝；那一个也有三十余岁，生得短","en":"He was just inside the second gate when he heard an uproar of shouting. Startled, Sulan lightened his step, slipped into the guest room on the east side, and peered through a crack in the window. There were two men: one seated, the other standing in the middle of the room, pounding the table and cursing. The sight frightened Sulan badly."},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":3,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"素兰正在窗缝里偷瞧，已惊呆了，不提防他们出来，急走时，已被那短衫子的看见了，便道：「你这个小杂种，又是谁，往那里跑，快过来，你爷爷正要找你呢。」素兰急得没有命的跑了出来，那人也赶出大门，幸亏素兰跑的快已回去了。这条胡衕却是短的，两家斜对门，都在胡衕口边。","en":"Sulan, still spying at the window-crack, had been struck quite dumb, and did not think of their coming out; as he hurried away the short-jacketed one caught sight of him and shouted: \\"And who are you, you little bastard? Where are you running? Come here —"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":3,"tokens":["陆素兰","素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这边陆素兰跑了回去，吓得心头乱跳，两颊飞红，几乎哭出来了。急到房中坐了，定了定神。好一回心上又惦记着琴官，受了这一场辱骂，不知气得怎么样子。欲要过去看他，恐又遇见那两个，踌躇了半晌，到底放心不下，只得叫人先去看了，没有人，方才三步两步忙忙的过去。到琴言房里，只","en":"Lu Sulan, meanwhile, had run home so frightened that his heart pounded wildly and both cheeks flamed scarlet; he had very nearly burst into tears. He hurried to his room, sat down, and steadied his spirit. But after a while his heart went back to Qinguan: after"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":1,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"说罢，就大哭起来，说得素兰也自哭了，意欲劝他，听他这些话，方才又见了这两个人，越想越替他难受，便也同哭个不住。","en":"So saying, he burst into loud weeping, and his words set Sulan weeping too. He had meant to console him; but hearing such talk, with those two men fresh before his eyes, he felt sorrier for him the more he thought, and so wept on with him and could not stop."},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":4,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"二人正正对哭了半个时辰。琴言见素兰为他如此伤心，心中十分感激，便拉了素兰的手，重新又哭，素兰见琴言拉着他哭，知道是感激他的意思，便又想道：「琴言如此才貌，偏有如此磨折，是天地竟妒这些有才貌的人了。我素兰也是花中数一数二的，若天地也要妒忌起来，也把这些磨折来磨我，便与玉侬一样，那时节恐","en":"The two of them wept face to face for a full hour. Qinyan, seeing Sulan grieve so on his account, was filled with gratitude; he took Sulan's hand and wept afresh. Sulan, feeling Qinyan clasp him as he cried, knew it was meant in thankfulness, and thought: \\"With such talent and such beauty, Qinyan meets with such torment"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":2,"tokens":["陆素兰","素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"去拿了两盆脸水，泡了两碗茶，各自退出。这边两人虽止了哭，却讲不出话来，仍是呜呜咽咽的，含着眼泪。又停了好一回，陆素兰开口道：「日间的事，是我目睹的，我也替你伤心死了。那个人像是个土包，只不知怎样闹起来的？可晓得他是那里人？」琴言停了一停，尚是带着哭道：「这两人也没有认识他的，据他们讲是极凶恶的样子，不知是那里来的？无缘无故的就闹起来。这就是我苦命人，命中注定有这些","en":"ceased, could bring out no words, but still sat swallowing sobs, their eyes brimming. After another long pause, Lu Sulan spoke: \\"What happened today I saw with my own eyes, and I am grieved to death for you. That fellow looks like some country clod — only how did it all begin? Do you know where he is from?\\" Qinyan waited a moment, and answered, still weeping: \\"No one here"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":7,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"但是这魏狗才，于我有何仇恨，定要糟蹋我，逼我死呢？」素兰道：「前日我原对你讲过，叫你留点神，不要得罪他，果然他已先下手了。」又想道：「究竟也是我们胡猜，也作不得准的。」琴言不语，呆呆的，又道：「横竖我也就死了，再有事，我也不怕。」素兰道：「你竟说傻话，死活是命中注定的，难道你自己去寻死不成？况且你当真死了","en":"\\"But this dog Wei — what hatred does he bear me, that he must trample me so and hound me to my death?\\" Sulan said: \\"I told you the other day to be on your guard and not to offend him — and see, he has struck the first blow.\\" Then he added: \\"Though after all this is only our guessing, and can't be taken for certain.\\" Qinyan said nothing, staring blankly; then:"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":1,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴言也倦极了，伏枕而卧，倒又熟睡起来。梦见素兰与子玉先在船中，自己刚刚要上船来，忽见岸上跑出两人：一个穿青的，光着脊梁，盘着辫子，赶上来一把揪了过去，骂道：「你这小杂种，日间装病不见人，怎么如今又跑到这里来了？」琴言哭喊救命，把身子用力一挣，却自己仍在床上，惊得一身冷汗，已是红日满窗。","en":"Qinyan, utterly spent, sank upon his pillow and fell fast asleep after all. He dreamed that Sulan and Ziyu were already in the boat, and he himself just stepping aboard, when suddenly two men came running out upon the bank: one in dark clothes, bare to the waist, queue coiled on his head, rushed up, seized him, and hauled him back, cursing: \\"You"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":2,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"听得窗外鹦鹉说起话来，道：「昨日的人又来了。」又把琴言唬了一大跳，只道又是他两个人来找他。原来素兰候了一回，不见琴言过来，只得着人来请，对他师傅说是同到怡园去的。长庆应允，就催琴言起来。净了脸，吃了一碗冰燕，命跟班的捡出几件衣裳包了，带上车，辞了长庆，即到素兰处来。","en":"again!\\" — and it gave Qinyan another great start, thinking those two had indeed come back for him. In fact it was Sulan who, having waited a while without sign of Qinyan, had sent a man to fetch him, with word to his master that they were going together to the Garden of Contentment. Changqing gave his consent and hurried Qinyan up. He washed his face, ate a bowl of iced"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":3,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"见了素兰，问道：「你昨日可约定庾香到这里来没有？」素兰道：「我是约他一直上船的，我犹恐他找不着，又着人假充怡园的人领他去了，此时一定先在船里。我要等他们将酒席什物等类齐备了，省得临时短少，也就要去了。」看那素兰为人，又精细，又聪明，差不多赶上蕙芳，不过尚少蕙","en":"On seeing Sulan he asked: \\"Did you settle with Yuxiang yesterday that he should come here?\\" Sulan said: \\"I arranged for him to go straight to the boat. And lest he fail to find it, I sent a man besides, passing as one of the Garden of Contentment people, to guide him"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":1,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"些点心，走到上房，颜夫人尚未起来。子玉在外间叫丫鬟梳了发，又复出来，各处尚是静悄悄的。再到书房来，心上想道：「素兰如此多情，况已屡次扰他，他虽然不在这上头讲究，我却过意不去。若给他银钱又恐被他着恼，当是轻看了他，只好送他些个东西罢。」","en":"in the outer room and came out again; everywhere all was still and quiet. Returning to his study, he thought: \\"Sulan has shown me such feeling, and I have put him to trouble again and again. He may set no store by such things, but I cannot rest easy on it. If I gave him silver he might well take offense, as though I held him cheap; best send him a few things instead.\\""},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":3,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这一缠绕，看表上已到巳初一刻，子玉即忙上车，往大东门来。路又远，出得城时，已是午初，素兰早已先到了，一面又叫人在路口探望。少顷，望见子玉乘车而来，下了车，素兰衣冠楚楚的迎上岸来，请安问好。同上了船，便与子玉除了冠，脱了外面的衣服，素兰也换了便服。子玉谢道：「多感雅意，十分周匝，使我负薪顿释，得畅衿怀。\\n领受盛情，何以图报？」","en":"Great East Gate. The way was long, and by the time he was out of the city it was the beginning of the wu hour. Sulan had long since arrived ahead of him, and had besides posted a man at the head of the road to watch. Before long, catching sight of Ziyu's cart approaching, he came up the bank in his neat and elegant dress to welcome him as he alighted, paying his respects"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":3,"tokens":["素兰","香畹"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"素兰笑道：「效力不周，偏偏玉侬今日病势加重，不能出来。又因昨日有两个无赖，把玉侬痛骂一顿，因此气坏了。我昨日既约你出来，今日又不好来辞，只好我们二人权坐一坐，再散罢。我因玉侬病重，也觉心绪不佳。总之好事多磨，是一点不错的。」几句话说得子玉如冰水淋身，默然","en":"Sulan smiled: \\"My poor services have fallen short. As luck would have it, Yunong's illness has taken a turn for the worse today, and he cannot come out. Yesterday, besides, two ruffians gave him a savage tongue-lashing, and rage has made him iller still. Having"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":6,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"说着便已红了眼睛，摇着头道：「这也奇了，这也实在奇了。」素兰见了忍不住要笑出来，便对子玉道：「我们如今同去找玉侬罢，去看看他的病何如？」子玉想了一想，道：「也可不必了，既然此地还见不着，就到那里必要生出别故来，也是见不着的。」素兰说：「他现病在床，怎么会见不着呢？」子玉道：「前日你我同去那一回，玉侬不病在床吗","en":"he spoke his eyes had already reddened, and he shook his head, saying: \\"It is strange — it is strange indeed.\\" Sulan could scarcely keep from laughing, and said to him: \\"Come, let us go together now and find Yunong, and see how his illness does.\\" Ziyu considered a moment and said: \\"Better not. Since I cannot meet him even here, some fresh hindrance would be sure to"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":7,"tokens":["香畹","素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"玉侬，倒可以会会，如像玉侬，则当日怡园已经唐突过了，何必再叫婢学夫人呢！不但不愿见那人，而且于玉侬实有所不忍。香畹，你是个明白人，想能见到，非我故作矫情。」素兰道：「你的话也是，你是不肯见他，我偏叫他出来。」子玉尚要拦阻，已见素兰从后舱唤出一个如花似玉的人来。子玉乍见倒有些模糊，一来于琴言只叙过一次，二来这几月琴言容貌又消瘦了好些。从前是国色天香，清腴华艳。如今","en":"mistress a second time? Not only am I unwilling to see this person: for Yunong's own sake I could not bear it. Xiangwan, you are a man of understanding and will surely see my meaning — this is no affectation of nicety in me.\\" Sulan said: \\"What you say is all very well; but though you will not see him, I mean to call him out all the same.\\" Ziyu was still trying to prevent"},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":1,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"又见他说一句，哭一声，不觉一股心酸，直透出来，也就忍不住哭了。到闹得素兰没有主意，见两人凄凄楚楚，倒像死别生离的光景，不知不觉也哭起来。","en":"of bitterness drive straight up through his heart, and could hold back no longer, but wept too. It ended with Sulan quite at a loss: watching the two of them so desolate — for all the world like parting at death or separation in life — before he knew it he was weeping with them."},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":5,"tokens":["素兰","香畹"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"三人哭作一团，到底还是素兰先住，便劝道：「今日请你们来，原为乐一天，何必哭哭啼啼。且已经半天过了，不到晚就要赶城，能有几个时辰欢乐，不如大家笑笑罢。」子玉勉强答应道：「香畹之言极是，玉侬也不必伤心了。」琴言道：「有什么欢笑呢？我们在怡园一叙，直到如今，是五个月。再候第二次欢叙","en":"The three wept in one knot, till at last it was Sulan who first came to himself and urged them: \\"I asked you here today for a day of pleasure — why all this sobbing and wailing? Half the day is gone already, and before evening we must race for the city. We have but a few hours left for gladness; better"},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":3,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"此时船已开行，素兰的家人把酒肴都摆上来，素兰一面敬酒，一面劝，子玉、琴言只得坐了，悲从中来，无言相对，尚复何心饮酒。经素兰苦劝，只得勉强饮了几杯，终究是强为欢笑，亦不知何所为而然。在琴言心上，终觉得生离死别，只此一面，以后像不能见面的光景。子玉也觉得像是无缘，料定是不","en":"By this time the boat was under way, and Sulan's servants set out the wine and dishes. Sulan poured the wine, urging and coaxing; Ziyu and Qinyan could only take their seats, but with sorrow flooding up in them they sat wordless, face to face — what heart had they left for drinking? Under Sulan's"},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":1,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，一面看那琴言，如蔷薇濯露，芍药笼烟，真是王子乔、石公子一派人物，就与他同坐一坐，也觉大有仙缘，不同庸福。又看素兰，另有一种丰神可爱，芳姿绰约，举止雅驯，也就称得上珠联璧合。今日这一会，倒觉是绝世难逢的，便就欢乐顿出，忧愁渐解。琴言看子玉是瑶柯琪树，秋月冰壶，其一段柔情密意，没有一样与人同处。正是傅粉何郎，熏香荀令，休说那王谢风流，一班乌衣子弟也未必赶得上他。若","en":"Shi. Merely to sit beside him felt like a profound karmic blessing, far beyond vulgar fortune. He then looked at Sulan, who possessed a different kind of loveliness—graceful in bearing, refined and elegant in every gesture—truly a perfect match of pearl and jade. This gathering today felt like a once-in-a-lifetime chance; sudden joy welled up, and their sorrows gradually"},{"paragraph":30,"mentions":1,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这素兰看他二人相对忘言，情周意匝，眉无言而欲语，眼乍合而又离，正是一双佳偶，绾就同心，倒像把普天下的才子佳人，都压将下来。难怪这边是暮想朝思，那边是忘餐废寝。既然大家都生得如此，自然天要妒忌的，只有离多会少了。若使他们天天常在一处，也不显得天所珍惜，秘而不","en":"Sulan watched the two of them facing each other, words forgotten but feelings encompassing and complete. Their brows were silent yet wishing to speak; their eyes just met then pulled away. They were truly a perfect pair, their hearts tied in a single knot,"},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":5,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"旁边，一弹一唱。止觉得欢声如迅雷出地，狂笑似奔流下滩，惊得琴言欲躲进后舱，子玉便把船窗下了，却不晓得是什么人。素兰从窗缝里看时，对琴言道：「过来瞧。」琴言过来，也从窗缝里瞧了一瞧，便道：「这些蠢人，看他作什么？」素兰指着那下手坐的那一个道：「这就是与媚香缠扰的潘三。」琴言道：「哎哟！这个样子，亏媚香认识他，倒又怎么能哄得他？」素兰道：「你没有见，昨日那两个，比他","en":"Qinyan in alarm made to hide in the rear cabin, and Ziyu let down the boat window, wondering who they might be. Sulan, looking through the crack of the window, said to Qinyan: \\"Come and see.\\" Qinyan came and peeped in his turn, then said: \\"Those vulgar louts — what is there to look at?\\" Sulan pointed to the one seated in the lower place: \\"That is the Pan the Third who"},{"paragraph":33,"mentions":1,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"素兰笑道：「各人有各人的乐处，他们不如此就不算乐。」看看红日将近沉西，子玉此时心中甚是快乐，竟有乐而忘返之意。","en":"Sulan laughed: \\"Each person finds pleasure in their own way — if they did not behave like this, they would not consider it pleasure.\\" Looking on, the red sun was nearing the western horizon. Ziyu's heart at this moment was full of joy — he almost felt the"},{"paragraph":34,"mentions":2,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴言心上虽知天色已晚，却也不忍催迫。素兰恐晚了，不能进城，便叫船家快些摇摆，天不早了，于是一面即收拾起来。子玉便将带来之物，分送二人，二人不好推辞，只得收了。子玉又将那包里散碎银，分赏了素兰、琴言的人，又说辛苦了你们，众人叩头谢赏。","en":"Qinyan knew in his heart that the day was growing late, yet could not bear to hurry the parting. Sulan, fearing that if it grew later they could not enter the city, called to the boatmen to ply their oars faster, for the hour pressed; and meanwhile they began to pack up. Ziyu then divided the things he had brought between the two of them, and they, unable"},{"paragraph":35,"mentions":1,"tokens":["香畹"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"的手道：「我们迟日再叙罢，诸事须要自解才好。」又流下泪来，琴言也哽咽道：「你放心去罢，将要关城了，咱们见面不在香畹处，就在怡园两处。」子玉点了点头，只得硬了心肠，各自上车。车夫怕晚了，加上一鞭，急急的跑了。","en":"answered, choking: \\"Go, and set your heart at rest; the gates will soon be closing. When we meet, it will be either at Xiangwan's or at the Garden of Contentment — one place or the other.\\" Ziyu nodded, and could only harden his heart as each mounted his cart. The carters, fearing the hour, laid on a lash apiece, and away they rattled at a gallop."}],"24":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":3,"tokens":["陆素兰","素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"：「我还听得说，那魏聘才进了华公府，就变了相，在外边很不安分：闹了春阳馆，送了掌柜的，打了二十还不要紧。又听得陆素兰对人说，魏聘才买出华公府一个车夫，一个三小子，去糟蹋琴言，直骂了半天。琴言的人磕头请安赔了不是，又送了他几吊钱才走。「王恂道：「奇了，这几天就有这许多事。我们从前看了这两个人都是斯斯文文的，再不料如今作出这些事来，真是知人知面不知心了。」仲清道：「我","en":"uproar at the Chunyang Restaurant—the proprietor was beaten twenty strokes, and that wasn't even the worst of it. Lu Sulan says Pincai hired a groom and a page boy from the Hua household to ruthlessly bully Qinyan. They hurled abuse for half the day, until Qinyan's people were forced to kowtow, apologize, and pay them several strings of cash just to make them leave.\\" Wang"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":1,"tokens":["香畹"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"生、净、老、丑有二十余个，是五六班凑成的。」仲清道：「旦脚十个是谁？」桂保道：「我们两个之外，尚有瑶卿、媚香、香畹、静芳、瘦香、小梅，后来又添了玉侬、玉艳，共是十个。」王恂道：「这就是十美班了。」桂保道：「陪客尚未定，你们是一定在数的。听得度香已写书子到保定府去，请前舟回来商议，只怕就是这件事。」王恂道：「也近了，今日已是二十六日了，还有十天，就演得全这些新戏吗","en":"asked, \\"Who are the ten dan performers?\\" Guibao replied, \\"Besides the two of us, there are Yaoqing, Meixiang, Xiangwan, Jingfang, Shouxiang, and Xiaomei. Yunong and Yuyan joined later, making ten in all.\\" Wang Xun said, \\"That makes a Ten-Beauties company.\\" Guibao added, \\"The guest list isn't entirely settled yet, but you two are certainly included. I heard Duxiang wrote"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":1,"tokens":["香畹"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"意气自豪，是瑶卿。一尘不染，灵慧空明，胸有别才，心怀好胜，是媚香。温文俊雅，出言有章，和而不流，婉而有致，要算香畹。言语爽直，风度高超，雅俗咸宜，毫无拘束，是静芳。恬静安详，言语妥贴，是瘦香。","en":"is Meixiang. For gentle grace, carefully measured speech, harmonious yet firm, and sweetly poised—that would be Xiangwan. Frank talk, a lofty manner, welcoming to both high and low with a free spirit, is Jingfang. Quiet ease and perfectly apt words belong to Shouxiang."},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":1,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"也不说，酒也不喝，略喝了几杯，就出席躺着去了。后约定到瑶卿家里去，他答应了，也没有来。王恂道：「听得前日他倒与素兰、琴言逛了一天运河呢。」桂保点点头道：「口恶！怪不得玉侬回来病就好了。」当下四人说说笑笑，已过了二更，桂保、玉林也要回去，就告辞了，各自上车而回。仲清、王恂又谈了一回，各自回房不提。下回是怡园请客，演出新戏，不知华公子看了如何，且听下回分解。","en":"Yaoqing's house, he never came.\\" Wang Xun said, \\"I hear that the other day he spent a whole day on the canal with Sulan and Qinyan.\\" Guibao nodded and clicked his tongue. \\"Well I never! No wonder Yunong came home cured.\\" So the four of them talked and laughed until the second watch was well past. Finally, the actors took their leave and rode their carriages home, while"}],"25":[{"paragraph":13,"mentions":1,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"见戏房内婷婷袅袅走出十枝花来，莲步略移，香风已到，捧着牙笏，走到席前边朝上叩了一个头，站起来。先是宝珠、蕙芳、素兰三人上来，又对华公子请了一安，将牙笏呈上。华公子知道这一班小旦都是子云得意人，袁宝珠更是宠爱，天天在园里的，也就世故起来，便搀住宝珠手道：「你们这本戏共演了几天了？」宝珠道：「一个多月了，是各人分开演的，一个人不过三五出戏。」华公子就随意把各人的都点","en":"holding an ivory tablet. They approached the banquet, knelt together, and rose again. First Baozhu, Huifang, and Sulan stepped forward, bowed to Young Master Hua, and presented their ivory tablets. Young Master Hua knew that this troupe of young dan actors were all Ziyun's prized favorites, and that Yuan Baozhu was especially cherished and lived in the garden every day."},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":1,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"先敬了次贤一杯。次贤自觉得逸兴霞飞，十分得意，即连饮了三大觞。华公子亦陪了三杯。又命家人把酒送到台上，命宝珠、素兰、琴言、蕙芳，各饮三杯，并将席间果品赏了四碟，四旦遥遥叩谢。又劝合席各饮了三大杯。","en":"matched him with three cups of his own. He then ordered a servant to carry wine to the stage, commanding Baozhu, Sulan, Qinyan, and Huifang each to drink three cups, and sent four dishes of fruit from the banquet table as a gift; the four dan actors bowed their thanks from afar. He then urged everyone at the table to drink three more great cups apiece."},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":2,"tokens":["素兰","香畹"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"叫上来。群花听了，即荡动兰桨，往水榭边来，上了岸，在阑外雁排侍立。华公子便指名叫了四个进来：蕙芳、琴言、宝珠、素兰。华公子对着四旦说道：「方才《峨嵋山群仙》一出，虽全部出场，未尽态度。你们可将各人得意之戏说一出来。」四旦听了，想了一想，各说了一出。子云道：「此尚非极得意的，只有媚香与香畹的《独占》，瑶卿与玉侬的《惊梦》《寻梦》，都是绝妙无双，人家唱不来的，可惜偏","en":"up in goose formation beyond the railing. Young Master Hua called four men in by name: Huifang, Qinyan, Baozhu, Sulan. To them he said: \\"In 'Immortals of Mount Emei' just now the whole cast stood forth but not every gesture appeared. Each of you name a piece you do best.\\" The four thought and each named one. Ziyun said: \\"Those are not yet your acme — only Meixiang and"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":1,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"解下一块玉佩来，赏了宝珠，宝珠亦谢了。此时十旦都送出来，华公子踉踉跄跄，犹几番回顾，对着琴言、宝珠，以及蕙芳、素兰等八人说：「你们没有事可常来走走。」说着话，已到了含万楼，复又一揖，辞了子云及众人，上了椅轿，林珊枝、八龄之外，尚有十六个亲随，五个有职人员，扶了轿轩，软步如飞，过岭穿林而去。这十旦直送出园门，又请安送了。华公子下了轿，仍坐上绿围车，尚对那些名旦点头","en":"performers escorted them out; Young Master Hua reeled yet turned again and again toward Qinyan, Baozhu, Huifang, Sulan and the rest: \\"When idle, visit often.\\" At the Tower of Myriad Containment he bowed once more to Ziyun and guests, boarded his sedan chair — Shanzhi and Eight Ages aside, sixteen personal attendants and five titled servants shouldered the poles and flew"}],"27":[{"paragraph":13,"mentions":2,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"我，只要你自己想，自己定了主意才好，也不必哭了。我是有事要出门，偏偏天福、天寿又进戏园去了。你若气闷，不如去请素兰来与你顽顽，他今日不下园子，你们是讲得来的。」一面说，就走出来了，叫人去请素兰即便过来。","en":"for yourself. And do not cry. I must go out; Tianfu and Tianshou are at the theatre. If you are dull, send for Sulan; he is not on the stage today, and the two of you can talk.\\" With that he went out, and sent for Sulan at once."},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":8,"tokens":["陆素兰","素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"且说陆素兰来，见了琴言问道：「何事？」只见琴言又是娇啼满面，歪倒在炕上。素兰安慰道：「你又怎么，你师傅请我来有何话说？」琴言道：「我今番真要死了，不比从前还可捱得下去。」素兰忙问何事，琴言就把长庆的话述了一遍。素兰也觉吃惊，发怔了半天，方问道：「你师傅的意思怎","en":"Meanwhile, Lu Sulan arrived and asked Qinyan: \\"What's wrong?\\" He found him tear-stained and collapsed on the kang. Sulan comforted him: \\"Again? Why did you fetch me?\\" Qinyan answered, \\"This time I truly die; it's not like before when I was merely enduring.\\" Sulan pressed"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":1,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"素兰道：「你们若合了式，魏聘才那种东西，非特不能欺你，且要巴结你呢！但我有一句话，你倒不要怪我：譬如我们这班人与人相好，原是要论心的，但也不好太过。譬如度香、庾香两人，待你的情分是一样的。不过，庾香专在你身上，不肯移情于人，所以你就为这上头，也就专为他，","en":"Sulan advised, \\"If you suit his taste, Wei Pincai cannot harm you; he must instead flatter you. But I have a word to say — do not take it amiss. Our sort befriend hearts, yet we must not fall into excess. Duxiang and Yuxiang favor you equally. Yuxiang is fixated"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":1,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"素兰道：「杀身图报，难道我辈做不出来？但也要看什么事。你为庾香捐躯，是为什么？问你，你自己也就说不出；你死了也不算什么忠臣烈士，节妇义夫。明白人还说你可怜，是一个情痴，胡涂人便说你是个呆子。甚至于胡猜到另有他故。且庾香到你死后，他不能不看破了。他上有父母","en":"Sulan sighed, \\"Die for love? We can. But weigh the cause. To die for Yuxiang—why? You yourself cannot articulate it. Dead, you would be no loyal minister and no martyr, no chaste wife and no righteous husband; the clear-sighted will pity you as a fool of feeling,"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":5,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"说到此处，自己笑起来，琴言也就笑了，叫道：「兰哥，兰哥！我真佩服你，你这些见解从何处得来？」素兰忽要走动，问道：「后面那小院子，可解手么？」琴言道：「有毛厕，倒还干净。」素兰就开了房后一扇小门，上了毛房。只听得叩门之声，见院子内东基角上有一小后门，叩得乱响，即问道：「是那个？」外面应道：「我是对门王兰保，叫我送西瓜来与琴言的。」琴言听了，叫人开","en":"Qinyan laughed too, and then cried: \\"Brother Lan, Brother Lan! I utterly admire you; whence comes such insight?\\" Sulan wanted the privy, and asked whether there was one in the small court behind. Qinyan said, \\"There is a latrine, and quite a clean one.\\" Sulan opened the little rear door and went out.\\n\\nPresently there was a knocking, and the postern in the east corner"},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":5,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"只见素兰忽然回头，看见窗缝里有个影子，便问：「是谁？」那两个噗哧的一笑，跑了出来。素兰要出来看时，琴言道：「看他做什么，自然是福、寿这两个顽皮了。」素兰终不放心，也因前日吓怕了，叫人关上门，别叫人进来。春兰对巴英官道：「他们说琴官不在家，在床上坐的不是吗？」","en":"Sulan suddenly turned, saw a shadow in the window crack, and asked, \\"Who's there?\\" The two tittered and bolted. Sulan rose to look, but Qinyan said, \\"Why look? It is naturally Tianfu and Tianshou making mischief.\\" Sulan was still uneasy, still frightened from"},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":3,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"长庆受了这一场打骂，不敢哼一声，关上门，即叫人到兰保处找回琴言，素兰连兰保也送了过来。大家说起这奚十一一味凶蛮，真是可怕，只怕其中又有人调唆出来，日后还不肯干休。一个魏聘才冤仇未解，又添出个奚十一来，如何是好？说得长庆更无主意，越发害怕，琴言只是哭泣。兰保道：「我有一个好主意，只劝得玉侬依了，倒是妥当的。你们明天就送","en":"Changqing took that beating mutely, shut the gate, and sent someone to Lanbao's house for Qinyan. Sulan had sent Lanbao back as well. They all spoke of Xi Eleven's savage, lawless temper and agreed that a man who could erupt so suddenly was frightening indeed. Perhaps someone had stirred him up, and he wouldn't rest. The feud with Wei Pincai was unsettled,"}],"28":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":2,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"见，意欲就去别他一别，犹恐见面彼此伤心，耳目又多，诸多未便；欲写信与他，方寸已乱，万语千言，无从下笔，只好谆托素兰转致。便又想了一会，即将自己常常拭泪的那方罗帕，拣了四味药另包了，将帕子包好，外面再将纸封了，交与素兰，托他见了子玉面交。","en":"was a tangled knot of sorrow. Ten thousand words could not find their way to the brush, so he could only entreat Sulan to convey his innermost feelings. After much thought, he took the silk handkerchief he always used to dry his tears, selected four medicinal herbs and wrapped them separately, enclosed them in the handkerchief, sealed the entire bundle in an outer paper,"},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":2,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"且说琴言临行之际，所留之物托素兰面交子玉。素兰打算过几日，请子玉过来，与他面谈衷曲。","en":"As for the items Qinyan had left behind at parting, which were entrusted to Sulan to give to Ziyu, Sulan planned to invite Ziyu over in a few days to speak with him heart to heart."},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":3,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"却说子玉自五月内与琴言一叙之后，直至今日，并非没有访过琴言，但其中有多少错误。这一日天气凉爽，早饭后到素兰处，先叫云儿问了在家，素兰闻知甚喜，忙出迎进。只见房内走出两人来：子玉看时，认得一个是王兰保；一个是琪官，因多时不见他，即看了他一看。见他杏脸搓酥，柳眉耸翠，光彩奕奕，袅娜婷婷，年纪与素兰彷佛，身量略小些，上前见了。","en":"countless misunderstandings had intervened. One cool, pleasant day, after his morning meal, Ziyu made his way to Sulan's place. He first had Yun inquire if he was home; upon hearing this, Sulan was delighted and hurried out to welcome him in. However, two others emerged from the room: Ziyu recognized one as Wang Lanbao, and the other as Qiguan. Not having seen Qiguan"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":3,"tokens":["香畹","素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉道：「今日实不料香畹处尚有佳客。」兰保道：「这就是你的小姨子，你们会过亲没有？」子玉道：「这是什么话？那里有这个称呼？」素兰道：「这个称呼倒也通。」琪官也不好意思，便道：「静芳不要取笑。」兰保道：「这倒也不算取笑，你是玉侬的师弟，可不是他的小姨吗？」子玉笑道：「岂有此理","en":"Ziyu said, \\"I truly did not expect Xiangwan to be hosting such distinguished guests today.\\" Lanbao teased, \\"This is your little sister-in-law. Have you two paid your familial respects yet?\\" Ziyu replied, \\"What kind of talk is this? Where does such a title come from?\\" Sulan chimed in, \\"Actually,"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":13,"tokens":["素兰","香畹"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，说道：「我实在不晓得你们说的是什么，我是不出大门的，这两天又没人到我那里，如何晓得外面的事？」琪官笑了一笑，素兰道：「你真不知道，我只得告诉你，你且坐稳了。静芳、玉艳，你两个扶住了他，待我再说。」子玉道：「香畹一向直爽，今日何故作这些态度？想来也没有什么奇事，故作惊人之语耳。」素兰又把子玉看了又看，惹得兰保、琪官皆笑。子玉看他们光景，着实心疑，便道：「香畹，你","en":"me these past two days. How could I know of matters in the outside world?\\" Qiguan offered a small smile, while Sulan said, \\"Since you truly don't know, I have no choice but to tell you. But brace yourself. Jingfang, Yuyan, you two support him while I explain.\\" Ziyu replied, \\"Xiangwan, you have always been straightforward. Why adopt these dramatic airs today? Surely"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":4,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，也就如出尘离世的一样。」便又滚下泪来，出了一回神，重把那几味药看了又看，只认得一样是芍药，其余皆不认识，因对素兰道：「玉侬寄这几味药，必有深意，但不知是什么药，你可叫人拿到药铺问明，叫他就写在包上。」素兰道：「说的是。」就要叫人，琪官道：「不用，跟我的人就认得，他在药铺里当过伙计。」琪官即叫那人进来，把这四味药给他认，那人看了，便说道：「这味是牵牛，这是独活，","en":"moment of stunned silence, he examined the medicinal herbs once more. Recognizing only the peony root, he turned to Sulan, \\"Yunong sending these herbs must carry a profound, hidden meaning. But I do not know what they are. Could you have someone take them to the apothecary to inquire, and write their names on the packets?\\" Sulan agreed, \\"A sensible idea,\\" and was about"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":1,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"又对子玉，把从前魏聘才同船，一路在舟中下作的模样讲了好些。忽又想起奚十一来，复咬牙切齿的骂几句。素兰让子玉吃饭，子玉心绪不佳，便要早回，辞了一径回去，车上便觉四肢不舒起来。","en":"they previously shared passage. The mere mention of Xi Eleven caused them to grit their teeth and curse his name. Sulan urged Ziyu to eat, but his spirits were too low. Desiring an early departure, he took his leave and headed straight home. Already in the carriage, he began to feel an unnatural unease creeping into his limbs."},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":1,"tokens":["香畹"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"日之内有时昏愦，有时清楚，昏愦时糊胡涂涂，不闻不见的光景；清楚时与好人一样。睡梦中呓语喃喃，有时叫玉侬，有时唤香畹，有时大骂奚十一、魏聘才诸人。颜夫人十分着急，颜仲清、王恂三天两日常来看视，心中虽是明白，却也无法可治。二人商量，又不好对颜夫人讲，只好婉言解慰而已。颜夫人每听子玉睡梦之中，必呼玉侬二字，心上便疑心子玉在外有什么勾当，便当玉侬是个女人，心有说不出的隐","en":"appeared as healthy as anyone else. In his sleep, he muttered incessantly—sometimes calling for \\"Yunong,\\" sometimes \\"Xiangwan,\\" and at times, vehemently cursing Xi Eleven and Wei Pincai. Lady Yan was frantic with worry. Yan Zhongqing and Wang Xun visited every few days; they understood the root of the malady but were powerless to cure it. After discussing the matter, they felt"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":1,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"了，我就请他来与你相见。这日刚刚是少爷猜着。过了两天就请了少爷来喝酒，叫小的来伺候。自从那一天才认识。第二次是素兰邀游运河，陪了半天。就这两回，这是句句实话。夫人不信，只管问魏师爷。且少爷出门，夫人是晓得的。」话未说完，便止不住流下泪来。聘才道：「这都是实话，真真没有见过三面。」颜夫人听了，心中不解，所以又看琴言神气，实在可怜，心中想道：「怎么半年光景，就见过两","en":"later, there was a feast, and I was called to serve. That was our first true meeting. The second time was when Sulan invited us boating on the canal, where we spent half a day. It was only those two times. This is the absolute truth. If Madame does not believe me, please ask Secretary Wei. Besides, Madame surely knows of the young master's outings.\\" Before he could"}],"29":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"在他身上拍了两下，因想颜夫人在外，不好叫他庾香，只得改口叫了声：「少爷！」此时子玉犹在梦中，道是到了七夕，已在素兰处会见琴言，三人就在庭心中，摆列花果，煮茗谈心，故念出那两句《长恨歌》来。魂梦既酣，一时难醒。琴言又见他笑起来，又说道：「我当是「黄泉碧落两难寻」呢。」说到此将手一拍，转身又向里睡着。琴言此时眼泪越多了，只好怔怔的望着，不好再叫。见子玉把头摇了一摇道","en":"remained trapped in his dream. He believed it was the night of the Seventh Eve, that he was already meeting Qinyan at Sulan's house, the three of them sitting together in the courtyard sharing fruit, tea, and intimate conversation. It was this dream that brought the lines of the *Song of Everlasting Sorrow* to his lips. His dreaming soul was plunged so deep that it could"},{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["香畹"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"么！你还当是大东门外么？」琴言要高声叫，又哽咽了，喉咙叫不出来，只把手拍他。那子玉忽然睁开眼来，对着琴言道：「香畹，这回又亏了你，费了如此的心，我以后便放了心了。」琴言又往前凑了一凑，拍着肩道：「少爷！琴言在这里看你，你病可好些么？」子玉心上模模糊糊，眼前花花绿绿，看不分明，便冷笑了一声。琴言又说了一遍，子玉便哈哈大笑起来道：「你已试过了我一回，难道我还认不得你","en":"emotion; he could only pat his shoulder in silence. Suddenly, Ziyu opened his eyes, fixing his gaze toward Qinyan. \\"Xiangwan,\\" he said warmly, \\"once again you have saved me. With such devotion, my heart can finally rest easy.\\" Qinyan leaned closer, resting a gentle hand on his shoulder. \\"Young Master, Qinyan is here. Are you feeling better?\\" But Ziyu's mind remained clouded,"}],"30":[{"paragraph":12,"mentions":1,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"山珍，说不尽腥浓肥脆。清谈妙语，佐以诙谐。那边席上，聘才问次贤怡园的光景。次贤略述了几处。随后即见宝珠、蕙芳、素兰、漱芳、玉林、兰保、桂保，春喜、琪官等九个，又凑上一个，作了一出《秦淮河看花大会》，有幽闲的，有妖冶的，有静婉的，有风流的，极尽靡艳之致，众人尽皆喝采。子云、次贤等就于此出中间放了赏。华公子对着笑道：「此系抄袭吾兄旧文，殊觉数见不鲜。」子云道：「唱的","en":"about the sights of the Garden of Contentment. Cixian briefly described a few places. Next came Baozhu, Huifang, Sulan, Shufang, Yulin, Lanbao, Guibao, Chunxi, Qiguan—nine in total—plus one more, performing the play 'Flower-Viewing Assembly on the Qinhuai'. Some were demure, some coquettish, some quiet and gentle, and some romantic, exhibiting the utmost alluring charm."}],"31":[{"paragraph":3,"mentions":2,"tokens":["香畹"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"云与文泽站起来道：「妙，妙！待我来分派。」即对着蕙芳道：「媚香是长于诗的，瑶卿是长于丹青的，静芳是长于舞剑的，香畹是长于书法的，佩仙是长于填词的，蕊香是长于猜谜诙谐的，瘦香是长于品箫的，小梅是长于吹笙的。可惜玉侬又病了，他倒会一套《平沙落雁》。」华公子便命叫他起来，又吩咐珊枝拿了琵琶来。家人把些笔砚乐器都搬了出来，分摆在各处。次贤道：「我来点将：先点玉侬与瘦香把","en":"he said, \\"Meixiang excels in poetry, Yaoqing is skilled in painting, Jingfang is a master of the sword dance, Xiangwan possesses beautiful calligraphy, Peixian is adept at composing lyrics, Ruixiang has a gift for riddles and witty banter, Shouxiang is masterful with the vertical flute, and Xiaomei plays the mouth-organ beautifully. It is only a pity that Yunong has"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":1,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"想了好一回，不得主意。蕙芳、素兰立在面前低低的问道：「你画什么？我们好先定主意，打起腹稿来。」宝珠正想不出头路，便扯着他们走到栏前，商量画些什么才好，限时刻的，又不能用工笔。若写几笔兰竹也不合景。蕙芳道：「我想了一个题目在这里，但不知合你的意否？依我只须画一个小手卷，用黑笔写三两处","en":"He thought for a long while but could not settle on an idea. Huifang and Sulan stood before him, whispering, \\"What are you going to paint? Tell us, so we might fix upon a theme and begin drafting our poems in our minds.\\" Baozhu, still lacking a clear direction, pulled them over to the railing to discuss what would be best to paint."},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":1,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"恐怕他画坏了。次贤远远留心，觉得下笔甚快，毫无拘束，已觉面有喜色。那边蕙芳等三人挤在一处。只见李玉林俯首凝思，素兰把串香珠数个不了，蕙芳只管看着宝珠落笔，尚暗暗的指点他。","en":"Huifang and his two companions clustered closely together. Li Yulin bowed his head in deep concentration, while Sulan continuously slipped a string of fragrant prayer beads through his fingers. Huifang kept his eyes fixed on Baozhu's brushwork, quietly offering him subtle guidance."},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":2,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"挂在华公子衣襟上。华公子取下闻了一闻，笑道：「你辛辛苦苦的结成，你自己受用罢。」子佩接了，又到那边弄琵琶去了。素兰、玉林也都写出来。先看素兰的是：满泛金樽玉液浓，秋光和霭似春容。\\n嫦娥宫殿层层启，照澈珠帘十二重。","en":"string this together; you should enjoy it yourself.\\" Zipei took it back and wandered off to fiddle with a pipa. Sulan and Yulin had also finished writing their pieces. First, they looked at Sulan's poem:\\n\\n'The golden goblets brim with rich jade nectar,\\nThe autumn light is as warm and gentle as a face of spring,\\nThe gates of Chang'e's palace unlatch tier upon tier,\\nAs"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":2,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，竟是元、白同时了。」子云道：「也要改两字。第三句嫦娥二字，与前首相同，不若改作「广寒宫殿层层启」，不好么？」素兰道：「果然改得好。」始而子云恐素兰不及蕙芳，及到此刻才放了心。再看玉林的填词，填的《一痕沙》小令，看词是：娇舞酣歌深院，绣幕锦屏香软。珠履客三千，集群贤。月若有情留住，人若有情休去。","en":"previous poem. Would it not be better to change it to 'The gates of the Cold Moon palace unlatch tier upon tier'?\\" Sulan agreed, \\"Indeed, that is a wonderful improvement.\\" At first, Ziyun had worried that Sulan's skills might fall short of Huifang's, but only now did his heart truly settle. They then looked at Yulin's lyric, composed to the tune of 'A Trace of Sand'. The"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":1,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"群贤」换作「会群仙」，乱啼声「换作」只三更」，可好么？」众人一齐道：「好。」次贤叫他们快些写上，蕙芳、玉林都要素兰代写，华公子不依，只得各自写了。大家又赏叹一回，于是静坐，听珊枝的琵琶与春喜的笙。珊枝斜坐着拨动檀槽，只见指法如雨洒芭蕉，声韵如滩头流水，满怀春色，绕乱一堂。加之笙韵高低，声声应和。听得人人色舞眉飞，四肢愉快。弹了《月儿高》一套，大家也赞了一回。","en":"approval. Cixian urged them to quickly copy their final drafts onto the scroll. Huifang and Yulin both wanted Sulan to write it out for them, but Young Master Hua would not allow it, insisting they each write their own. After another round of admiration and praise, they sat quietly to listen to Shanzhi's pipa and Chunxi's sheng. Shanzhi sat at an angle, his fingers"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":1,"tokens":["陆素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"花部中曾受业于香雪者，现有四人：袁宝珠、王桂保、金漱芳、陆素兰，或学画，或学诗，皆为高弟，此四人也共凑百金，连蕙芳的共有四百金。母子二人并一老仆三人，雇舟由运河而回，也就极宽裕了。","en":"flower-register who had studied under Fragrant-Snow, four still remained: Yuan Baozhu, Wang Guibao, Jin Shufang, and Lu Sulan. Whether they had studied painting or poetry, all were his advanced disciples. These four pupils pooled together an additional one hundred taels. Combined with Huifang's contribution, the total came to four hundred taels. This generous sum would easily"},{"paragraph":30,"mentions":1,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"面，请他们坐了。仲清道：「人已齐了，就奠一奠，我们往锦秋墩去逛罢。」蕙芳即将祭筵就叫在那屋里摆起来。蕙芳上香，素兰奠酒，漱芳执壶，宝珠上菜，桂保焚纸，春航、南湘、高品同行了一个礼，五旦连连叩头代谢。","en":"stroll.\\" Huifang immediately ordered the sacrificial feast to be laid out in the room. Huifang offered the incense, Sulan poured the libations of wine, Shufang held the pitcher, Baozhu arranged the dishes, and Guibao burned the paper offerings. Chunhang, Nanxiang, and Gao Pin bowed respectfully in unison, while the five dans kowtowed repeatedly in solemn gratitude."},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":2,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「若到此地位，也不得不住。晚间月明风静，或者有些鬼狐来盘桓盘桓，也未尝不佳。」高品道：「剑潭总喜作违心之论。」素兰道：「我若是一个人，就是日里也不敢进去。」桂保道：「那些棺材破烂的甚多，我看晚间只怕有鬼。」漱芳道：「亏那和尚只有一个徒弟，一个香火，竟不怕。若果真有鬼，和尚怎么好好儿的呢？」蕙芳道：「你几时见鬼吃过人？我前日听那和尚说，每到阴风暗雨的时候，或是夜深","en":"might come by for a visit—that wouldn't be so bad.\\" Gao Pin said, \\"Jiantan always delights in contrary talk.\\" Sulan said, \\"If I were alone, I wouldn't dare set foot in there even in broad daylight.\\" Guibao added, \\"There are so many broken and rotting coffins in there. I am certain the place must be haunted at night.\\" Shufang reasoned, \\"It is amazing that the monk,"},{"paragraph":37,"mentions":1,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"破秦人缶。且一醉，莫僝僽田。大家吟了一遍，哈哈大笑。天要下雨，遂无心久留，急忙收拾。南湘搭了蕙芳的车，仲清搭了素兰的车，一路而回。到得家时，已萧萧疏疏落起细雨来。不知后事如何，且听下回分解。","en":"and hurriedly packed up their belongings. Nanxiang caught a ride in Huifang's carriage, while Zhongqing rode in Sulan's, and they journeyed back home. By the time they arrived, a fine, scattered drizzle had begun to fall. To know what happened next, you must listen to the following chapter."}],"32":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"心上要到春航那里去，犹恐见面有些难以为情。意欲报了再去，心上十分焦急，比春航倒还胜几分。一回见宝珠着人来问信，素兰、玉林着人来问信，闹的蕙芳坐立不安。欲到戏园中，恐怕被人钩搭住了，闷闷的歪在炕上，拿本闲书消遣，看了两页又放下。","en":"with anxiety, perhaps even more so than Chunhang's. A while later, Baozhu sent someone to ask for news, and then Sulan and Yulin also sent people to inquire, making Huifang so restless he could neither sit nor stand. He wanted to go to the theater but feared getting entangled with someone, so he lay sullenly on the kang, picked up a leisurely book to distract himself,"}],"33":[{"paragraph":5,"mentions":1,"tokens":["香畹"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"定，等老人家家信回来再看。」宝珠道：「今日我倒得了两样菜，不晓得你肯赏脸在这里吃饭么？若肯在这里吃饭，我便约了香畹来，大家叙叙。」","en":"Baozhu then said, \\"I just got two nice dishes today; would you do me the honor of dining here? If so, I'll invite Xiangwan over, and we can catch up.\\""},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":5,"tokens":["香畹","素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉踌躇道：「若吃饭回去就迟了。前日这么大雪，你想必积了些雪水，我们何不煮雪烹茶，请了香畹来作个清谈雅会，不好吗？」宝珠笑道：「很好，到底你总与别人不同。」一面着人去邀素兰，一面吩咐把火盆抬到外间去，将茶炉搬过来，并搬出全副茶具。子玉见地上先放了一个大铜盘，后将一个古铜茶炉座在盘内。那炉约有一尺多高，身圆如斗，下有鼎足，炉身两孔，炉口圆小","en":"snowfall the other day; you must have collected some snow water. Why don't we boil snow to brew tea, and invite Xiangwan for a refined conversation—wouldn't that be nice?\\" Baozhu smiled, \\"Very well, you are indeed different from others.\\" He sent someone to invite Sulan while ordering the brazier to be moved outside and the tea stove brought over, along with the complete"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":7,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，那处是步步不离规矩的，闲散惯的人也是不便的。八月十四那一天，我看玉侬出来伺候，就是勉强，叫作没有法就是了。」素兰道：「如今见了我们也是生生的，觉得心上总是忧郁不开的光景。」子玉听了，不禁叹了一声。宝珠见水开了，自己于博古厨内取出一个玉茶缸，配了四种名茶，自己亲手泡好了，把盖子盖上。又取出三个粉定茶杯，分作三杯，又将开水添满茶缸，仍旧盖了。子玉道：「要你亲手自制","en":"the eighth month, I saw Yunong come out to serve; it was clearly forced, a matter of having no other choice.\\" Sulan added, \\"Now when he sees us, there is a strangeness about him; it feels like his heart is always clouded with a lingering melancholy.\\" Ziyu listened and could not help but sigh. When Baozhu saw the water boiling, he took a jade tea caddy from the curio"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":1,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"讯明是实，相应开释等情。」子玉道：「这已算明白了，怎么又送部呢？」素兰道：「闻说有位巡城都老爷，访得吏目诈赃，改供私放，把这案提上去，送了刑部。」宝珠道：「如今魏聘才是在监里了？应该，应该。但华公子怎么不替他料理呢？」","en":"established the facts, they were promptly released.\\" Ziyu said, \\"Since it's settled, why send it to the Ministry?\\" Sulan replied, \\"I heard a patrolling censor discovered the official was extorting bribes, altering testimony, and releasing people privately, so he escalated the case and sent it to the Ministry of Punishments.\\" Baozhu added, \\"So Wei Pincai is now in prison?"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":2,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"素兰道：「据仲雨讲，是瞒着华公子，况且又是个假名假姓。大约脸总丢了，也不至有什么大罪。又听说魏聘才新捐了一个从九品，审实了，这功名只怕也革的了。」子玉听了，甚替聘才着急，连说道：「这怎么好！就是我们那位李世兄，也在外边胡闹。夏间去嫖，连衣服都被人剥了。亲","en":"Sulan said, \\"According to Zhongyu, they are keeping it a secret from Young Master Hua, and besides, he used a fake name. It's likely he's just lost face, and it won't amount to a major crime. I also heard Wei Pincai recently purchased a minor official rank;"}],"35":[{"paragraph":10,"mentions":1,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"是日名旦中有几个不得来，都有堂会戏，不能分身。宝珠之外，来的是蕙芳、素兰、玉林、漱芳四人。这边名士，怡园二位之外，是刘文泽、颜仲清、王恂、田春航、梅子玉五人。共十二人。众客到齐，宝珠先叩谢了。","en":"private theatrical engagements and couldn't be in two places at once. Besides Baozhu, the attendees were Huifang, Sulan, Yulin, and Shufang—four in total. On the side of the famous scholars, apart from the two hosts of the Garden of Contentment, there were Liu Wenze, Yan Zhongqing, Wang Xun, Tian Chunhang, and Mei Ziyu—five in total. Together, they made twelve. Once all"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":1,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"了。」摆好了坐位，是东西对面八坐，南北对面四坐。文泽、仲清、王恂、春航、子玉、次贤、子云坐了东西，上下是蕙芳、素兰、玉林、漱芳、宝珠。宝珠坐了末位。","en":"Chunhang, Ziyu, Cixian, and Ziyun took the east-west seats, while the upper and lower seats were occupied by Huifang, Sulan, Yulin, Shufang, and Baozhu. Baozhu took the very last seat."},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":1,"tokens":["陆素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"到谁谁喝酒。接飞二字，到那人，那人也照样喝酒。又飞三字，一轮到十二为止。错者罚酒，可好么？」众人都说：「好。」陆素兰与金漱芳等道：「这个苦了我们，搜索枯肠，那里就有这些凑巧数目飞出来？」文泽道：「你们也能，只怕唐诗还比我们熟些。如果那数目飞不出来，便照数目多少罚酒。」宝珠道：「譬如要飞十二，飞不出就要罚十二杯么？」文泽道：「自然。」子云道：「这也过多，且到临时再斟","en":"up to twelve. Those who make a mistake must drink a penalty cup, how does that sound?\\" Everyone agreed, \\"Good.\\" Lu Sulan, Jin Shufang, and the others protested, \\"This is hard on us; we'll have to rack our brains, where will we find such convenient numbers to recite?\\" Wenze replied, \\"You can do it; I fear you might know Tang poetry even better than we do. If you can't come"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":3,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"想了一会，道：「此句是谁喝酒，我没有算过。」念道：「床上翠屏开六扇。」数到玉林，玉林道：「这句不要是你编的。」素兰道：「你还说天天念诗，连花蕊夫人《宫词》都不记得了。」玉林笑道：正是。我恐怕他有心要我喝酒。」便喝了道：「要说七字了。」想了有半刻工夫，飞到王恂道：「门前才下七香车。」王恂喝了，飞出八字是薛逢《夜宴赠妓》的「愁傍翠蛾深八字」。数到了子云，子云喝了酒，","en":"screen opens six panels.\\" The count landed on Yulin. Yulin quipped, \\"I hope you didn't just make this line up.\\" Sulan teased, \\"You claim to recite poetry every day, yet you don't even remember Lady Huarui's 'Palace Lyrics.'\\" Yulin laughed, \\"Exactly. I fear he intentionally wanted me to drink.\\" He drank the cup and said, \\"Now for a seven-character line.\\" After pondering"},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":2,"tokens":["香畹","素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"皆照此。」蕙芳、宝珠听明了，又说了一遍道：「也不容易，幸亏我们的曲子，还有几枝在肚里。」子云谓次贤道：「索性叫香畹、佩仙坐到这里来，好在一处掷骰，我们与他二人换个坐儿。」次贤、子云与玉林、素兰换了坐位。","en":"noting it wasn't easy, though they still had many lyrics committed to memory. Ziyun then instructed Cixian to have Xiangwan and Peixian switch seats so the performers could roll the dice in one designated area, and the seating was adjusted accordingly."},{"paragraph":30,"mentions":3,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"上的，我们也贺一杯。」这边王恂掣了枝是鸟门的，美人名飞燕，花名也是并蒂花。王恂素来文思略迟，只得思索起来。看着素兰掷了个么四，也在那里凝思。忽见素兰想着了两句，念道：「月明云淡露花浓，人在蓬莱第几宫。」春航赞道：「更妙！」子玉道：「我们说的句子，倒没有他们的香艳。」素兰道：「你们是诗，我们是曲，占了这点便宜。你们又要人名，又要并头、并蒂就难了。」漱芳道：「我才把","en":"'Feiyan' (Flying Swallow), requiring a paired-stem flower. His composition was progressing slowly. Meanwhile, Sulan rolled a one and a four. After deep thought, he recited, \\"'The moon is bright, the clouds thin, the flowers heavy with dew; in which palace of Penglai does the beloved dwell?'\\" Chunhang praised it as even finer. Ziyu said, \\"The performers' lines are"},{"paragraph":33,"mentions":1,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"月出皎兮，季女思饥。月季是并头花。」众人道：「这个花名也好极，我们应贺三杯，方可赏此佳句。」子玉谦了几句。又见素兰掷了一个么六，也想了一想，凑起《酒楼》上两句念道：「蓦现出嫦娥月殿，绝胜仇池小有天。」众人也说好，又都贺了。","en":"excellent. We must toast three cups to properly reward these beautiful lines.\\" Ziyu modestly deflected the praise. Sulan was then seen rolling a one and a six. After a moment of thought, he pieced together two lines from *The Tavern*: \\"'Suddenly Chang'e appears in the moon palace, surpassing even Qiuchi's little heaven.'\\" Everyone agreed it was wonderful, and again, they"},{"paragraph":36,"mentions":1,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"自然，该贺两杯。」这一天大家思索也都乏了，都要吃饭。子云道：「尚早，再看他们掷几回。他们到底比我们少用些心。」素兰掷了一个重四，即想出一句《窥浴》上的曲文道：「两人合一副肠和胃。」仲清拍案叫绝道：「这个是天籁，我们快贺三杯。」于是合席又贺了三杯。玉林掷了个重三，也念《小宴》一句道：「列长空数行新雁。」次贤道：「他们越说越好了，真是他们的比我们的好。」王恂道：「词","en":"Let's watch them roll the dice a few more times. After all, their game requires less mental strain than ours.\\" Sulan rolled double fours and instantly recalled a line from *Peeking at the Bath*: \\"'Two people become one set of intestines and stomach.'\\" Zhongqing slammed his hand on the table in sheer delight, exclaiming, \\"This is heavenly inspiration! We must quickly"}],"36":[{"paragraph":6,"mentions":1,"tokens":["陆素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"只见众人纷纷的忙乱，伍麻子捧了一包孝衣进来。又见袁宝珠、苏蕙芳、陆素兰来了，琴言即忙招接三人，一同坐下。","en":"amidst the bustling crowd, Wu Mazi brought in a bundle of mourning clothes. Then Yuan Baozhu, Su Huifang, and Lu Sulan arrived. Qinyan quickly welcomed them, and they sat down together."},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":2,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"你既回来，告了几天假？」琴言道：「早上是林珊枝来告诉的，我也没有见着公子，说办完丧事就回去，也没有限定几天。」素兰道：「总得告一个月的假，等出了殡才可进去，不然也对不住你师娘。」琴言道：「可不是。」蕙芳道：「索性告假告个长假，不去也罢了。究竟你也不是卖与他们的。」宝珠道：「在那里好倒算好，就是拘束些。且同事中没有一个知心的人，未免孤另些。」蕙芳道：「当日林珊枝也","en":"didn't see the young master myself. He only said to return after the funeral, without specifying how many days.\\" Sulan said, \\"You must ask for at least a month's leave and wait until after the burial to return; otherwise, you'll be letting your teacher's wife down.\\" Qinyan agreed. Huifang added, \\"You might as well ask for a long leave and just not go back. After all,"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":1,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"们要快聚几天，不知明日可以不可以？」宝珠道：「明日他也无事。」琴言道：「师傅新死，于理有碍，须消停数日才可。」素兰道：「若消停数日，你就要进城了。况大家叙叙，清谈消遣，也没有什么妨碍。你又不是孝子，怕什么？」宝珠道：「我去问度香，明日、后日皆可。」三人坐了好些时候，要走了，琴言拉住了不肯放，众人不忍相离，只得坐下。后又来了王桂保、李玉林、金漱芳，大家直等了送殓，","en":"either.\\" But Qinyan demurred, \\"My teacher has just died. It's contrary to propriety; we should wait a few days.\\" Sulan countered, \\"If we wait a few days, you'll have to return to the city. Besides, a quiet gathering for conversation and relaxation won't hurt anything. You're not a filial son in formal mourning—what are you afraid of?\\" Baozhu promised, \\"I'll go ask Duxiang;"}],"37":[{"paragraph":4,"mentions":1,"tokens":["香畹"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"爽快。」桂保谓子玉道：「今年我们还是头一回见面。」子玉道：「正是，我却出来过几次，总没有见你。」宝珠道：「今日香畹与静芳苦了，处处有他们的戏，是再不能来了。」子云道：「我算有六七人可来，谁晓得都不能来。」将到午正，桂保往外一望，道：「玉侬来了！」大家一齐望着他进来。子玉见他比去年高了好些，穿一套素淡衣裳，走入梅花林内，觉得人花一色，耀眼鲜明。大家含笑相迎，琴言上","en":"year.\\" Ziyu agreed, noting that although he had been out several times, he had never run into him. Baozhu said, \\"Xiangwan and Jingfang are having a hard time of it today, as they are scheduled to perform everywhere and simply cannot get away.\\" Ziyun said, \\"I thought I could count on six or seven people, but who could have known they would all be unavailable?\\" As midday"},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":1,"tokens":["陆素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"了饭，略坐了一坐，子玉、王恂告辞，子云又约了明日。到明日又添了文泽、春航，名旦中也添了几个，又在怡园叙了一日。陆素兰单请子玉、琴言二人，又叙了一日，这一日清谈小叙，更为有趣。一连叙了三日，子玉也心满意足，人也乏了。徐子云要请屈道生，却好史南湘已到京，作一个诗酒大会。子玉不能推辞，只得赴约。且听下回分解。","en":"as did several more of the famous performers, and they spent another day together at the Garden of Contentment. Lu Sulan gave a small private gathering for Ziyu and Qinyan alone, a quiet, intimate day of conversation, even more delightful than the others. Over three days in a row they met and feasted, and Ziyu felt perfectly content, though by now he was quite worn out."}],"38":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云因屈道生是个高雅好静的人，名旦中止叫了四个，宝珠、漱芳、蕙芳、素兰。漱芳有恙不能前来，格外又知会了琴言。是日屈公先到，与子云、次贤叙了好些旧话。","en":"refined tastes who preferred quieter company, Ziyun had invited only four performers: Baozhu, Shufang, Huifang, and Sulan. Shufang was indisposed and unable to attend; as an added guest, Qinyan was also notified. That day Master Qu arrived first and spent a good while in conversation with Ziyun and Cixian, catching up on old times."},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":1,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"席第二是南湘，西席第二是春航。东席第三是子玉，西席三是文泽。子云东席作主，次贤西席作陪。宝珠、琴言在东，蕙芳、素兰在西，一一坐了。主人让酒，客皆饮了几杯。道生道：「我将前日先见的苏媚香谈起。」西席的人个个细听。道生道：「我这看相不论气色，部位是要论的，然尚在其次。我看全身的神骨、举止行动、坐相、立相，并口音言语，分人清浊，观人心地，以定休咎。但头一句就恐有些不对","en":"east table while Cixian acted as second host at the west. Baozhu and Qinyan sat on the east side; Huifang and Sulan on the west. Everyone took their places. The host circulated wine and the guests each drank a few cups. Qu said, \\"I shall begin with Su Meixiang, whom I met the other day.\\" Everyone at the west table listened attentively. Qu said, \\"In my physiognomy"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":1,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"据我看，他一二年内，必有一番作为，就要改行的。后来收成怎样，此事还远，我也不必说。若说，静宜又要驳我了。」再看素兰、宝珠，大致相仿，与蕙芳也不差什么，就没有讲他们出身。又道：「出污泥而不滓，就是他们三人的大概了。」看到了琴言，道生道：「这位有些不像，如今还在班里么？」次贤道：「现在班里，而且是个五月榴花照眼明，雅俗共赏，是个顶红的。」琴言笑了一笑。道生道：「雅或","en":"is still far off, and I shall not venture to say. If I did, Jingyi would dispute me again.\\" He then looked at Sulan and Baozhu — their general qualities were much the same — and at Huifang as well, finding no great difference; for these three he made no comment about their origins. He said, \\"Emerging from the mud unsullied — that is the general impression these three"},{"paragraph":38,"mentions":1,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"其人时运太坏，未能大用其才，真真可惜。」宝珠忙接道：「何幸此君，今日竟遇知己。」道翁道：「瑶卿与此君相好么？」素兰在旁道：「他的画画弹琴，皆是此君教的。前月他们还逛了两天翠微山呢。他之待此君，也不亚于蕙芳之待湘帆了。」宝珠一笑，道：「何至于此？」子玉道：「前在瑶卿处，见其笔墨高雅之至，大有唐六如的光景。」道翁道：「不特笔墨似六如，命宫磨蝎也似六如，却是怪事。何以","en":"today, a true friend who understands him.\\" Master Qu said, \\"Are you on close terms with this gentleman, Yaoqing?\\" Sulan, who was beside Baozhu, said, \\"He taught Yaoqing painting, calligraphy, and the qin. Only last month they spent two days together at Cuiwei Mountain. His regard for this gentleman is no less than Meixiang's regard for Xiangfan.\\" Baozhu smiled and said,"},{"paragraph":39,"mentions":1,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，不敢问难。宝珠问子云要柄扇子，求道翁题诗，子云索性叫取四柄扇子出来，给四旦每人一柄。于是宝珠拂几，蕙芳移砚，素兰磨墨，琴言润毫，共求道翁留题。道翁也十分高兴，遂将各人的大概，每人写了七律一首，半行半草的一笔虞世南，并落了双款。四旦谢了，谈了一会各散。不知后事如何，且听下回分解。","en":"the four performers. Thereupon Baozhu wiped the small table clean, Huifang shifted the ink-stone into position, Sulan ground the ink, and Qinyan moistened the brush — all four together asked Master Qu to write a tribute. Master Qu was greatly pleased; he captured the general character of each person and composed a regulated poem of seven-character lines for each, written"}],"42":[{"paragraph":7,"mentions":1,"tokens":["香畹"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"气忿忿的重新躺下，思前想后，毫无主意。伤心了一会，又想道：「我每逢想不透的，经香畹一说就明白了，此事非与他商量不可。」主意定了，带了跟他的小孩子，随身便服，走出门来。","en":"After grieving for a while, he thought again: \\"Every time I cannot see my way through something, one word from Xiangwan makes it abundantly clear. I must go and talk this over with him.\\" His mind made up, he called the young boy who attended him, changed into everyday clothes, and walked out the door."},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":3,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"到了素兰寓处，却值素兰未回，意欲回家，又属烦闷。想宝珠离此不远，不如找他谈谈也好。才出得素兰门口，见两人站在街心。偶抬头一看，一个是圆脸，生得混混沌沌，脚下倒是一双皂靴。一个生得獐头鼠目，便帽上拖着一绺长红帽纬。","en":"He went to Sulan's lodgings, but found that Sulan had not yet returned home. He considered going back but felt far too restless for that. He thought that Baozhu's lodgings were not far from here, and it would be just as well to go and find him for a chat. He had barely"},{"paragraph":35,"mentions":1,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴言今日找着了宝珠、素兰、商量师师娘要钱之事。不知宝、素二人有何良策，且听下回分解。","en":"As for Qinyan, that same day he had managed to find both Baozhu and Sulan to discuss the matter of his master's widow's demands for money. As to what Baozhu and Sulan proposed as a plan, listen to the following chapter."}],"43":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说琴言是晚听姬亮轩、乌大傻说了多少瞎话，更加烦闷，幸他们就出去了。候到二更，不见宝珠、素兰过来，只得睡了。一夜无眠，到了次早，即叫小使去请他二人来。","en":"clouded. Fortunately they soon took their leave. He waited until the second watch, yet seeing no sign of Baozhu or Sulan, he had little choice but to retire for the night in solitude. He lay restless through the long night. At the first touch of dawn, he dispatched a servant boy to summon the two of them."},{"paragraph":2,"mentions":2,"tokens":["素兰","香畹"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"是日，素兰清早已为王文辉叫去。少顷，宝珠过来。宝珠道：「昨日失候，我到三更才回的，他们也忘了，没有对我讲。方才你们五儿说起来，方知道。两三天总不见你，为什么不出来散散闷？今日度香约赏杏花，咱们可同去了。」琴言道：「可以。我这两日偶然感冒，觉得疲倦，今日也想出去","en":"That morning, Sulan had already been called away by Wang Wenhui at an early hour. Presently Baozhu arrived. \\"I missed you yesterday,\\" said Baozhu. \\"I did not return until the third watch, and no one thought to tell me. Your Wu'er only just mentioned it just now. I haven't"},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":13,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"只见素兰走来，琴言、宝珠让坐了。琴言道：「你早上那里去？」素兰道：「今早王大人叫我去，我当是什么紧要事，原来很不要紧的一句话。我与剑潭、庸庵谈了一会，方才到家。知道你请我，不知有何差委？」宝珠将方才的话与素兰讲了，素兰拍手笑道：「果然，果然不出我们所料！我真","en":"Just then Sulan walked in, and Qinyan and Baozhu invited him to sit. \\"Where did you go so early?\\" asked Qinyan. \\"Lord Wang sent for me this morning,\\" said Sulan. \\"I thought it must be something urgent, but it turned out to be quite a trifling matter. I had a chat with"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":4,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，我们同到度香处看杏花罢。」蕙芳道：「今日又有局吗？」宝珠道：「局是没有，也算个不速之客何妨？」蕙芳点首笑应。素兰、宝珠的衣服与车都来了，二人即换了衣服。蕙芳进内也换了，又问道：「你们同来竟一无所事，单为看花么？」素兰道：「事有一件，到怡园再讲罢。」蕙芳道：「何不先讲讲，此刻还早，到度香处尚可略迟。」素兰就将琴言的师娘要他出师的话，略说了几句。蕙芳道：「何如？我","en":"banquet,\\" said Baozhu. \\"Call it three uninvited guests — what is the harm?\\" Huifang nodded and smiled his assent. Sulan's and Baozhu's clothes and carriages soon arrived; the two changed into fresh garments. Huifang went inside and changed as well, then asked: \\"You came all this way together without any purpose? Simply to see the flowers?\\" \\"There is one matter to discuss,\\""},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":1,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"看，艳的艳，雅的雅，倒像有心比赛的一般。此刻都还穿着小毛外褂，琴言是玄狐耳绒，宝珠是玄狐抓仁，蕙芳是云狐抓仁，素兰是骨牌块云狐干尖。四人相对，就是珊瑚玉树交枝，瑶草琪花弄色，觉得楼外千枝红杏，比不上楼中四个玉人。次贤、子云虽时常相对，此刻亦还顾盼频频。子云道：「今日无肴，只有小饮，你们饿了，就吃起来罢。」蕙芳道：「我真有些饿了。」子云吩咐先拿几样点心来，随后就摆","en":"velvet, Baozhu wore dark fox with a raked-claw pattern, Huifang wore cloud-fox with a raked-claw pattern, and Sulan wore cloud-fox cut in domino-block points. Seen together, they were like coral trees and jade branches intertwined, like rare orchids and spirit-flowers vying in colour, so that the thousand red apricot boughs outside the tower could not match the four"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":1,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"去年的花。」子云道：「有去年花，就有今年花。」蕙芳又道：「今年的花，留得到明年么？」子云道：「看留的人怎样？」素兰道：「你们忽然学起参禅来。」琴言道：「据我看，是开花不如不开好。」宝珠道：「何故？我说花谢不如不谢好。」蕙芳道：「不谢也是不谢的花。你听玉侬说，荔枝鲜的时候何等佳妙，及干了，便觉酸得可厌。何以形貌变而气味也会变呢？大约人过了几年，也就是清而变浊，细而","en":"last until next year?\\" \\"That depends on those who tend them.\\" \\"You have all suddenly taken up Chan riddles,\\" said Sulan. \\"In my view,\\" said Qinyan, \\"it would be better if flowers never bloomed at all.\\" \\"Why? I say it would be better if they never fell,\\" said Baozhu. \\"A flower that cannot fall is a flower that cannot bloom,\\" said Huifang. \\"Listen to what Yunong just said."},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":4,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「《游湖借伞》，《搜山打车》。」琴言道：「真好，工稳之极。」蕙芳道：「就是《别母乱箭》，可以对《训子单刀》。」素兰道：「这么对，还有《闹朝扑犬》，也可对得《打店偷鸡》。」子云笑道：「到底他们记得熟，可以不假思索。」次贤道：「自然，我们虽也记得几个，究竟是半生半熟的。」子云道：「我有一个摆骰子的顽意儿，试试你们的心思。」叫取三颗骰子来，蕙芳道：「又是那个飞曲文的么","en":"Flying Arrows,'\\" said Huifang, \\"which matches 'Admonishing the Son with a Single Saber.'\\" \\"In that vein,\\" said Sulan, \\"'Raising a Ruckus at Court, Pouncing on a Dog' matches 'Attacking the Inn; Stealing the Chicken.'\\" \\"They clearly know the repertoire through and through,\\" laughed Ziyun, \\"and recall it without the least effort.\\" \\"Naturally,\\" said Cixian, \\"— we know"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":2,"tokens":["素兰","香畹"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"又下楼逛了一会，过了小山，过了石梁，便是留春坞。就在留春坞内煮茗清谈。宝珠对子云将琴言的师娘要他出师，及蕙芳、素兰的主意说了一遍。子云道：「若果如此，倒也很好。」便问蕙芳道：「你们有这力量作此义举么？」蕙芳道：「若说力量，原也勉强，但集腑成裘，也还容易。我与瑶卿、香畹三人可以凑得六百金，王氏弟兄、佩仙、庾香可以凑得四百金。」次贤道：「我来一分，出二百金，前舟可出","en":"matter of Qinyan's master's wife demanding the release of his indenture, together with the plans that Huifang and Sulan had proposed. \\"If that is truly the case,\\" said Ziyun, \\"it would be very good indeed.\\" He turned to Huifang and asked: \\"Do you have the means to carry out this righteous act?\\" \\"In terms of means,\\" said Huifang, \\"it would be a stretch, but gathering fur"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":1,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"嘴里，好像画眉哨的一般，我有几分怯他。」蕙芳道：「人说他倒是个直性人，顺了他的毛，倒也易的很的。」琴言、宝珠、素兰先回去了。","en":"person,\\" said Huifang. \\"Stroke her the right way and she will be quite easy to deal with.\\" Qinyan, Baozhu, and Sulan went home ahead."}],"45":[{"paragraph":12,"mentions":1,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"齐都来了，子玉到了，各人与吉甫相见，叙了些彼此仰慕的话。只有史南湘、田春航在场中未来。相公们到的是宝珠、蕙芳、素兰、玉林、漱芳、兰保、桂保、春喜、琪官、连琴言刚是十人。","en":"Nanxiang and Tian Chunhang were still at the examination grounds. Among the performers who came were Baozhu, Huifang, Sulan, Yulin, Shufang, Lanbao, Guibao, Chunxi, and Qiguan. Qinyan made ten in total."},{"paragraph":33,"mentions":1,"tokens":["香畹"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"清芬竟体是兰香，王树琪花列两行。\\n十树琼花十样锦，春风喜气满华堂。\\n众人道：「首句是香畹，次句是佩仙、玉艳，三句总说，末句是小梅。」子云掐指一算，名花已有了八人，只少静芳、蕊香两人了。又见写道：","en":"brocades,\\nSpring wind and festive air fill halls with light.\\"\\nThey deciphered the lines together. \\"The first line is Xiangwan. The second is Peixian and Yuyan. The third sums them up, and the last line is Xiaomei.\\" Ziyun counted on his fingers. Eight flowers were named, leaving only Jingfang and Ruixiang missing. Next:"},{"paragraph":45,"mentions":2,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"宝珠道：「我们前生，就不知道是什么人转生的。吉甫说他也会请，我要看看，总未遇巧。」素兰笑道：「你的前生不是说是个尼姑呢？」宝珠不觉得脸一红，笑道：「你怎么知道？」素兰道：「我听见你自己说的。」宝珠笑道：「我竟忘记了。」","en":"in our past lives? Jifu says he can summon spirits too. I keep hoping to see it, but I never get the chance.\\" Sulan laughed teasingly. \\"They say you were a nun in a former life?\\" Baozhu flushed deeply. \\"How would you know that?\\" Sulan smirked. \\"I heard you say so yourself.\\" Baozhu laughed self-consciously. \\"I had forgotten.\\""}],"48":[{"paragraph":12,"mentions":2,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"闲时又有宝珠、素兰、兰保、漱芳等一班名旦，不是垂帘度曲，就是对酒当歌。南湘素有才名，如今加上个翰林名号，更有那求文求诗的接踵而来。他又怕烦，常请金粟、子玉等代笔。至于不要紧的，连琴仙、蕙芳、素兰、宝珠的佳章都有在里面，好在人人说好，没有一个看得出来。南湘本要接夫人来京","en":"During their leisure time, renowned performers like Baozhu, Sulan, Lanbao, and Shufang would join them, either singing behind screens or drinking and harmonizing with their melodies. Nanxiang already possessed a literary reputation, and now, adorned with a Hanlin title, requests for essays and poems poured in endlessly."},{"paragraph":36,"mentions":1,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"备车马跟着，一直送出城外，直到十里之外皇华亭。只见南湘、仲清、文泽、金粟、王恂、子玉、春航，领着那蕙芳、宝珠、素兰、漱芳、玉林、兰保、桂保、琪官、春喜九个名旦，在皇华亭等候。道翁等连忙下车，极口辞谢。各人皆要把盏。","en":"Zhongqing, Wenze, Jin Su, Wang Xun, Ziyu, and Chunhang, alongside Huifang and the nine famous performers: Baozhu, Sulan, Shufang, Yulin, Lanbao, Guibao, Qiguan, and Chunxi. Daoweng hurried down from his carriage and thanked everyone repeatedly, as they all eagerly wished to raise a cup in a final parting toast."}],"52":[{"paragraph":11,"mentions":1,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"运。张仲雨跑过来，跑过去，指这样，说那样。门外人声嘈杂，苏蕙芳发赏封，上号簿，一个人那里打发得开，又叫了兰保、素兰来相帮，足足闹了两三个时辰，尚未清楚。里头许三姐也帮着手忙脚乱，同着那些陪房的摆这样，安那样，闹得一身的汗，一件绸衫子沾住了背心，腰也酸了，脚也疼了，喝了一碗凉茶，把扇子扇了一会，再来收拾。春航忙进城谢妆去了。","en":"and tallied the registry books, but he could scarcely keep pace with the chaos, prompting him to call Lanbao and Sulan to assist. The commotion dragged on for four to six hours and was still not fully settled. Inside, Xu Third Sister frantically helped the dowry attendants arrange this and place that; drenched in sweat, her silk shirt clinging to her back, her waist"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":1,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云听了，笑道：「如今闹出两位状元夫人，倒与《燕子笺》上的《诰圆》一样了。」华公子一想，自觉失言，便不再问。见素兰美丽风流，亭亭可爱，即叫他上前，说道：「你去年写在那《良宵风月图》上的诗，我已裱成了手卷，并请人题了好些，实在画也画得好，字也写得好，人人称赞。」","en":"the finale of *The Swallow Letter*!\\" Realizing he had misspoken, Young Master Hua dropped the subject. Noticing Sulan's graceful and captivating beauty, he called him forward and said, \\"That poem you inscribed on the *Fine Night, Wind and Moon* scroll last year—I have had it mounted as a handscroll and invited many others to add their inscriptions. In truth, the painting"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":1,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"即对子云道：「此君风韵不减袁、苏，貌类琴言，而聪明过之。」赞得素兰好不喜欢。华公子又问子玉道：「弟与尊兄虽初次识面，但心契已久。有个魏聘才，是府上搬出来，在弟处住了半年，常常提及阁下，并有一事倒要请教。」子玉不知问他何事，即答道：「魏世兄也时常提及尊府，但未识荆，不敢晋谒，不知有何赐教？」华公子道：「事本细微，但一","en":"charm rivals that of Yuan and Su, and while his appearance resembles Qinyan's, his intelligence surpasses his.\\" Sulan was utterly delighted by the praise. Young Master Hua then addressed Ziyu, \\"Though you and I meet face-to-face for the first time, our hearts have long been aligned. A certain Wei Pincai, who moved out of your esteemed residence, lodged with me for half"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":3,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"华公子又与高品、南湘、仲清、王恂、文泽、次贤各讲了些话，知高品才从苏州来，问了些江苏风景。偶然见素兰的扇子一面画的甚细，要了过来，看了一会。又见那一面写着小楷，题目是《断肠词》。华公子道：「肠何可以轻断？」子玉见了，又觉不安。华公子低低吟了一遍，又问素兰道：「这是你自己的么？」素兰道：「字与画都是胡乱涂写的，这词…」即指着子玉道：「就是梅少爷送玉侬","en":"Learning that Gao Pin had just arrived from Suzhou, he asked about the landscapes of Jiangsu. By chance, he noticed Sulan holding a fan with exceedingly delicate painting on one side and asked to look at it. Turning it over, he saw neat, small script titled *Heartbreak Lyrics*. Young Master Hua said, \\"How can the intestines be broken so casually?\\" Hearing this, Ziyu once"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":7,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「弟还要到舍亲处有事，明早送轿来再会罢。」一拱而别。外面送奁来那几位，早已去了。诸人送下了阶，单是那春航送出。素兰见拿了他的扇子，便跟了出来。到上车时，华公子始见素兰送他，知他要那扇子，但又心爱此词，不忍释手，便对素兰笑道：「你好不解事，今日这个好日子，你拿这《断肠词》扇出来，不教人忌讳的么？」一面说，把自己扇袋里的扇子取出来，与素兰道：「给你这一柄罢。」素兰请","en":"down the steps, though Chunhang alone saw him all the way out. Seeing Young Master Hua still holding his fan, Sulan followed them to the carriage. As Young Master Hua stepped up, he realized Sulan had come to retrieve it, but he loved the lyric too much to part with it. Smiling at Sulan, he chided, \\"You are truly tactless. On such an auspicious day, why bring out"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":2,"tokens":["陆素兰","素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「好词。这扇子那里来的？」公子道：「是陆素兰的。我爱这首词，所以带了他回来。」华夫人道：「这首词甚好，但不像是送朋友的。若送朋友，怎么有这「只道今生常厮守，盼银塘不隔秋河汉」呢？若说夫妇离别之词，又不像，说是赠妓的，也不甚像。然而语至情真，却有可取。」华公子笑道：「你真好眼力，这一评真评得不错","en":"\\"A fine lyric. Where did this fan come from?\\" Young Master Hua replied, \\"It belongs to Lu Sulan. I loved the lyric, so I brought it back.\\" Lady Hua said thoughtfully, \\"The lyric is excellent, but it does not read like a poem for an ordinary friend. If for a friend, why include lines like, 'I only thought this life we would forever stay together,"}],"53":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":3,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说前回书中，华公子将自己扇子与素兰换了，后被华夫人问起来，方知将夫人写画的桃花扇子与了他，甚是懊悔。一日，即命家人去叫素兰，说明叫他带了前日的扇子来。那日素兰正在蕙芳处商议开那古董铺的事情，苏、陆之外，尚有袁宝珠、金漱芳、王兰保、李玉林要来，大家商议那古董书画等物公凑些起来，也就不少","en":"The story continues from the previous chapter. After Young Master Hua had swapped fans with Sulan, Lady Hua had asked about it, and only then did he realize with deep regret that he had given away the peach-blossom fan painted and inscribed by his own wife. One day, he dispatched a servant to summon Sulan, specifically instructing him to bring that"},{"paragraph":2,"mentions":4,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"开张，中秋前后尽来得及了。」漱芳、兰保同声说：「好！」又说：「就这么着，我们大家去找度香商量。」正商议间，忽见素兰的人进来说：「华公子打发人叫，立等进城。」素兰道：「他叫几个人？」那人道「就叫你一个，说叫带了扇子去。」素兰道：「我道他叫我作什么，原来是为这把扇子。」蕙芳道：「这扇子一定是他夫人写的了，所以来要回去。」素兰就辞了众人，到家换了衣服，带了人上车，一径","en":"They added, \\"Let's settle it then. We will all go find Duxiang to discuss this.\\"\\n\\nJust as they were deliberating, Sulan's servant hurried in and reported, \\"Young Master Hua has sent someone to summon you. He is waiting for you to enter the city immediately.\\"\\n\\nSulan asked, \\"How many of us did he call for?\\"\\n\\n\\"Just you alone,\\" the servant replied. \\"He specifically said to"},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":1,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"珊枝道：「我不知道，或者要你写什么。」素兰在珊枝房里略坐了一坐，珊枝道「公子在园中，就去见见罢，省得他等。」","en":"Shanzhi said, \\"I have no idea. Perhaps he wants you to write something.\\"\\n\\nSulan sat in Shanzhi's room for a short while before Shanzhi urged him, \\"The young master is in the garden. You should go see him now and spare him the wait.\\""},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":1,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"于是珊枝领着素兰径入园来。只见秋色斑斓，灿然可爱。问了园童，方知在潭水房山。二人登高涉水，过竹穿林的走了好些地方。到了门口，珊枝先回明了。","en":"And so Shanzhi led Sulan straight into the garden. The autumn colors were vibrant, dazzling, and utterly charming. After asking a garden boy, they learned Young Master Hua was at the Pond-Water Rock-House. The two of them climbed heights and crossed waters, weaving through bamboo"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":7,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"素兰进来见了公子，公子正在那里画扇子，旁边站着个小丫鬟，还有两个小书童，素兰请过安，站在一边，华公子命他坐了，素兰见公子所画的扇子，也是两枝红白桃花，设色鲜明，甚是可爱。华公子知他爱看，便递给他道：「你看看有什么毛病么？」素兰接了过去，看了道：「兼工带写","en":"Sulan went in and paid his respects. Young Master Hua was in the midst of painting a fan, flanked by a little maid and two young pageboys. After Sulan bowed and stood to the side, Young Master Hua invited him to sit. Sulan saw that the fan Young Master Hua"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":17,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"成？况且我又奉承你作什么？好歹自然要分得清，岂可没人之善。但是你们后来这个行业倒难，这碗饭也不是终于好吃的。」素兰道：「如今我们几个人，现在想出一条道路。」就将蕙芳、宝珠等要开书画、古董，并些针线、香料、花卉、绸缎等物合成一个大铺子的话说了。公子点头道：「这倒罢了，你们这几个人也只好老于是乡。这个铺子几时开呢？」素兰道：「此时货物都不全，所有东西皆要到苏杭去置买","en":"\\"If our writings and paintings were passed off under another's name,\\" Sulan continued, \\"I fear not only would they fail to draw praise, they would be thoroughly mocked for their flaws.\\"\\n\\nYoung Master Hua laughed. \\"There is some truth to that, but people can still distinguish genuine quality from the bad. If your brushwork truly"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":15,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"了，不禁狂叫好道：「你这首真是黄绢幼妇，可称绝妙。恰是题画的桃花，何等凄清宛转，动人情味。」连吟了四五遍，忽将素兰看了一会，素兰低了头。公子凄然动容，叹了一声，又问素兰道：「你这首词是何寓意，要说得这样？」素兰道：「也没有寓意。公子是画的桃花，况今秋天，似乎不能与春日赏桃花一样题法。」公子道：「这个自然，但你另有寓意。不然，何以要说「恨随流水，人想当时，何处重相","en":"delicate, haunting melancholy that moves the heart.\\" After reciting it four or five times, he suddenly gazed long at Sulan. Sulan lowered his head. Young Master Hua's expression softened with sorrow; he sighed and asked, \\"What is the hidden allegory in this lyric, that you speak in such a way?\\"\\n\\nSulan replied, \\"There is no allegory. You painted peach blossoms, and in this"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":5,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"天色将晚，素兰告辞，公子道：「你若没有事，你今天住在这里，不必出城了。」素兰一怔，尚未答应，公子笑道：「这有何妨，难道是瓜田李下么？」素兰不语。公子又笑道：「我教你住在这里，也有个意思。先不是说那刻丝顾绣的东西？你若住在此，我晚上就教他们翻出来，明日你看看可用得，","en":"As evening approached, Sulan rose to take his leave.\\n\\nYoung Master Hua said, \\"If you have no pressing matters, stay here tonight. There is no need to rush out of the city.\\"\\n\\nSulan was momentarily taken aback and hesitated to agree.\\n\\nYoung Master Hua smiled and said, \\"What harm is"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":4,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"素兰在珊枝房内歇了，珊枝听得素兰在公子面前赞他好，十分欢喜，就与素兰谈心，又要与他换帖。素兰虽不满珊枝，但见他这番相待，也乐得送情，应许了与他结盟。二人谈了半夜，方各安睡。","en":"Sulan rested in Shanzhi's room. Shanzhi, overjoyed to hear that Sulan had praised him in front of Young Master Hua, poured out his heart and proposed exchanging pledge cards to become sworn brothers. Although Sulan did not entirely respect him, seeing Shanzhi"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":5,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"卷十二个，册页二十本。」把十珠婢忙个半天，才找全了，堆了几张桌子。公子吃过饭，点清了，也一样一样的搬到外边，叫素兰点了，珊枝与他开了一篇账单。素兰见了，喜不可言，这也再想不到的事情，竟有了半个古董铺了。在珊枝处吃了饭，珊枝帮他一样样装好，装了几木箱，用棉花碎纸塞了空处，免得车上碰坏，也收拾到下午时候。华公子出来，素兰谢了，说了多少感恩的话。公子道：「我昨日与你讲","en":"several tables. After lunch, Young Master Hua checked the inventory and had the items carried outside one by one. Sulan tallied them while Shanzhi wrote out a manifest.\\n\\nSulan was overjoyed beyond words; this was completely unexpected—he suddenly had half an antique shop's worth of inventory!\\n\\nAfter eating at Shanzhi's, Shanzhi helped him pack everything carefully into"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":4,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"且说蕙芳等昨日早上见华公子叫了素兰进城，后来打听得一夜未归，今日又将一日，尚未见他回来，心里猜疑为什么事耽搁两日。再着人到素兰处打听，恰好素兰已回。少顷，素兰到蕙芳处来，讲华公子要他题那《桃花曲》，并待他一番光景，赏他好些东西，这铺子竟可开成了。","en":"Meanwhile, Huifang and the others had seen Young Master Hua summon Sulan into the city the previous morning. Later, they found out he had not returned all night, and as the second day dragged on with still no sign of him, they began to wonder what matter could have delayed him for two days. They sent someone to Sulan's house"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":6,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"蕙芳也甚喜欢，即同到素兰处，点了两枝蜡，开了箱子，一件一件的看了，对素兰道：「这些东西若全买起来，也要好几千银子，而且未必有这好材料。再到度香处添几样，就可添可不添了。我明日就把橱柜制办起来，叫花儿匠来收拾花草。八月中秋竟可以开了。」素兰道：「题个什么名字呢？」蕙芳道：「我","en":"Huifang was also immensely pleased. They immediately went to Sulan's quarters, lit two candles, opened the crates, and examined the items one by one.\\n\\nHuifang turned to Sulan and said, \\"If we had to buy all this, it would cost several thousand taels of silver, and we still might not find materials this good. Once we"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":1,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"明日，宝珠等到子云处，将华公子赏给素兰的东西，一一说了，并要子云回去，也把账单看了，点出：花玻璃灯二十对，大小玻璃杂器四十件，料珠灯八盏，各色洋呢十板，各色纱衣料一百匹、各色贡缎二十匹、各色湖绉一百匹、各色绸绫一百匹，座钟四架、挂钟四架，洋表二十个，真古铜器一件，赝古铜器七件，碧霞玺带板","en":"Baozhu and the others went to Ziyun's place and recounted one by one the items Young Master Hua had bestowed upon Sulan. They then asked Ziyun to go back, look through his own ledgers, and pick out items to contribute.\\n\\nZiyun selected a long list: twenty pairs of floral glass lamps, forty large and small assorted glass vessels, eight bead-strung lamps; ten boards of assorted"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":1,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"蕙芳本想不受，但恐春航心上过不去，又见宝珠、素兰得了多少东西，自己又有好胜之心，只得收了，托子云着人到苏杭添置一切。子云封了金子，开了一个清单，写了一封书，着人到他乃兄署中，叫管总的徐福亲自制办。","en":"Huifang initially wanted to decline, but fearing he would hurt Chunhang's feelings—and seeing how much Baozhu and Sulan had acquired, which stirred his own competitive spirit—he felt compelled to accept. He asked Ziyun to send someone to Suzhou and Hangzhou to handle the remaining procurements. Ziyun sealed the gold, drafted a detailed manifest, wrote a letter, and sent"}],"59":[{"paragraph":21,"mentions":1,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"是：「江西学政梅宅梅庾香少爷手启，屈勤先寄。」心中大喜，知琴仙到了江西任所了，便忙拆开，看见还有与子云、蕙芳、素兰、琪官的信，且搁过一边。拆开自己的信，见一张白纸写着「哀启者」，大为骇然，想道：「难道道翁有什么缘故了？」遂细细的看下去，不觉泪珠点点的落将下来。","en":"the post in Jiangxi. He hurriedly tore it open, noticing there were also letters addressed to Ziyun, Huifang, Sulan, and Qiguan, which he temporarily set aside. Opening his own letter, he saw a plain sheet of paper bearing the words, \\"A Notice of Bereavement.\\" He was deeply shocked, thinking to himself, \\"Could something have happened to Daoweng?\\" He read on carefully,"}],"60":[{"paragraph":5,"mentions":1,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"珠，春航拈了蕙芳，仲清拈了琪官，文泽拈了春喜，南湘拈了兰保，王恂拈了桂保，高品拈了玉林，次贤拈了漱芳，单拈不着素兰，只好送与华公子去作了。众人分派已定，子玉说道：「做传容易，画画难，还要刻石，更须时日，不知几天可以告成？」吉甫道：「不消多日，碑是磨现成的，一面画，一面就叫季十矮子找人刻，大约十几天是必要的，嵌好这些碑，也要几天。我们这一叙，总在九香园了，索性多歇","en":"Qiguan; Wenze drew Chunxi; Nanxiang drew Lanbao; Wang Xun drew Guibao; Gao Pin drew Yulin; and Cixian drew Shufang. Sulan alone was not drawn, so that assignment was sent to Young Master Hua. The tasks distributed, Ziyu said, \\"Writing biographies is easy, but painting is difficult, and carving stone takes even longer. How many days until it is finished?\\" Jifu replied, \\"It"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":1,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉同了琴仙回家，正是内有韵妻，外有俊友，名成身立，清贵高华，好不有兴。子云写了一札与华公子为素兰作传。这边次贤妙腕灵思，画了十天才成。画成又请吉甫一一的改好，画一个，刻一个，倒也甚快。子云因受了感冒甚重，不敢用心，嘱将道翁、琴仙、杜仙女画在一幅，并求子玉作赞。到二十七日，连传赞都也刻起，系是各人书丹。二十八日就搬往九香楼镶嵌，一日完工。","en":"secure, he was in the highest of spirits. Ziyun wrote a letter to Young Master Hua, requesting a biography for Sulan. Meanwhile, Cixian, wielding his wondrous brush and nimble mind, spent ten full days completing the paintings. As each was finished, Jifu meticulously refined it; they painted one and carved one, proceeding with remarkable speed. Ziyun, suffering from"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":1,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"行。」蕙芳道：「可不是！你看那些花谱花评，虽将那些人赞得色艺俱佳，究不免梨园习气。我们这一关倒可以算跳出了。」素兰等皆点首浩叹。","en":"can never shake off the taint of the theater. This time, we can finally say we have leapt past that barrier.\\" Sulan and the others nodded, sighing in deep resonance."},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":2,"tokens":["香畹","素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"钟嵘评诗，谓颜延之镂金错彩，不如谢康乐初日芙蓉。素面风流，是为绝艳，仙殆莲花化身者欤？\\n琴仙笑道：「这几句倒比香畹的小照还画得像些。这「紫绡衣行吟风露间，」与「莲花化身」之说，却移不到他人的，真是你。」素兰笑道：「我如何敢当？大抵既赞花神，自然就要竭力赞扬的了。」琴仙再看第六方仙女，纤纤弱质，乘辕舞凌风，有掌上轻盈之态，头上戴着金步摇，题曰：纤纤花史金仙。下是萧","en":"very incarnation of the lotus?\\"\\n\\nQinxian laughed and said, \\"These lines capture her likeness even better than Xiangwan's small portrait. The descriptions of 'purple silk robes wandering amidst the wind and dew' and 'the incarnation of the lotus' could apply to no one else—it is truly you.\\" Sulan smiled, \\"How could I ever deserve such praise? I suppose that since they"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":1,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"念去比《公孙大娘舞剑器行》还刻画得入细。」王兰保笑而不言。蕙芳道：「去年奚十一闹来，幸亏着他，我就没有法了。」素兰道：「原来你也怕奚十一，难道他比潘三还利害么？」蕙芳道：「潘三是个无用的人，那奚十一闹起来，就与前日魏聘才使来的车夫一样，你怕不怕？」兰保道：「那天适或我不在家，你便怎样？」蕙芳道：「我就躲开不出来了。」琴仙问奚十一怎样，兰保将他的样子学了一回，琴仙","en":"Xi Eleven caused that uproar last year, we were lucky to have him, or I would have been completely at a loss.\\" Sulan asked, \\"So even you were afraid of Xi Eleven? Is he really more formidable than Pan the Third?\\" Huifang replied, \\"Pan the Third is a useless coward. But when Xi Eleven starts a riot, he's just like the carriage driver Wei Pincai sent the other day—would"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":1,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"来？他们称我们为花史，我们就称他们为文星，仿司空《诗品》，各作四言赞语一首，刻在上面。你们想这个报答可好么？」素兰道：「这个是极妙，但我们的诗配不上他们。且请谁画这些像呢？」蕙芳道：「就是瑶卿，你与小梅两人分画罢，也不必画服饰，不衫不履的最妙。我们今晚先把赞语做起，明日与他们看看，然后再画。我们就各人还各人的礼，一个赞也不甚费力。」","en":"of us will compose a four-character eulogy to be carved alongside them. What do you think of this repayment?\\" Sulan responded, \\"This is an exceptionally brilliant idea, but our poetry is no match for theirs. And who could we ask to paint these portraits?\\" Huifang said, \\"Yaoqing and Xiaomei can split the painting between them. There's no need to paint formal attire—depicting"},{"paragraph":33,"mentions":1,"tokens":["陆素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"朝阳，灿灿流霞。金盘承露，粉壁笼纱。\\n庄严妙相，天女笄珈。玉佩自鸣，貂褕为饰。\\n云近蓬莱，望之五色。\\n第九首是陆素兰题的《仙中豪品》：","en":"as his ornament.\\nThe clouds draw near Penglai, and gazing upon them, they shine in five colors.\\"\\n\\nThe ninth was Lu Sulan's *Bold Grade Among Immortals*:"},{"paragraph":37,"mentions":1,"tokens":["素兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"素兰与春喜各画几日，摹上了石，将赞语书丹，共有二十余日完竣。择于三月三日，供设九香楼上，为长生禄位。琴仙过来与宝珠商量，必须作一篇祝文，方表诚意，宝珠等深以为然。于是十人公同斟酌，凑成一篇文，改削了几遍，倒也不见联缀痕迹。宝珠道：「明日公祝，须请齐了诸名","en":"Sulan and Chunxi spent several days painting, then traced the designs onto the stone and inscribed the eulogies in vermilion. In total, the work took over twenty days to complete. They chose the third day of the third month to install the longevity tablets"}]}`),"char-26":JSON.parse(`{"1":[{"paragraph":21,"mentions":3,"tokens":["金漱芳","漱芳","瘦香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"嵰山艳雪金漱芳\\n漱芳姓金氏，字瘦香，年十五岁。姑苏人。隶联珠部。秀骨珊珊，柔情脉脉。工吟咏吹箫，善弈棋，楚楚有林下风致。其演戏最多，而尤擅名者，为《题曲》一出。","en":"Jin Shufang: Luminous Snow on Mount Qian. Shufang's surname is Jin, his courtesy name Shouxiang, and he is fifteen years of age. A native of Suzhou, he belongs to the Lianzhu troupe. His elegant bones are delicate and translucent; his tender feelings flow in continuous"}],"2":[{"paragraph":35,"mentions":1,"tokens":["漱芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"问他哥哥兰保为什么不来，桂保道：「今日本都在怡园逛了一天，徐老爷知道这里请客，才打发我来的。兰保、宝珠、蕙芳、漱芳、玉林都还没有散，只怕总要到四五更天才散呢。」文辉道：「这徐度香也算人间第一个快乐人了。」陆宗沅道：「听说他这个怡园共花了五十多万银子才造成。」杨方猷道：「本来地方也大，也造得过于精致。」文辉道：「我前月逛了一天，还没有逛到一半。」桂保说：「我们今日","en":"Contentment. Master Xu only dispatched me here upon learning you were hosting a banquet. Lanbao, Baozhu, Huifang, Shufang, and Yulin have not yet dispersed; I suspect they will linger until the fourth or fifth watch.\\" Wenhui said, \\"This Xu Duxiang is truly the most carefree and joyous man in the mortal realm.\\" Lu Zongyuan added, \\"I have heard that constructing his Garden"}],"6":[{"paragraph":35,"mentions":1,"tokens":["金漱芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"不认得，要怎样才算认得呢？」大家都微笑看着子玉，子玉有口难辩，不觉脸红起来。这出唱过，又看了陆素兰的《舞盘》、金漱芳的《题曲》、李玉林的《偷诗》，都是无上上品，香艳绝伦，子玉唯有向南湘认错而已。","en":"any defense, felt his face flush deeply. Following this piece, they watched Lu Sulan in 'Dancing on the Tray,' Jin Shufang in 'Inscribing the Song,' and Li Yulin in 'Stealing the Poem'—all superlative performers of unmatched, fragrant brilliance. Ziyu could only bow his head to Nanxiang, acknowledging the magnitude of his earlier error."}],"7":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["金漱芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说子玉从会馆回来，将琴官的戏足足想了两日，以谓天下之美莫过于此。又将苏蕙芳、陆素兰、金漱芳、李玉林的色艺品评，都为绝顶。细细核来，蕙芳的神色尤胜于诸人，次则素兰可以匹敌。然较比琴官起来，毫厘之间终觉稍逊。又想：","en":"Qinguan's performance, convinced it was the pinnacle of worldly beauty. He also appraised Su Huifang, Lu Sulan, Jin Shufang, and Li Yulin, finding them all to be utterly superlative. Yet upon careful comparison, Huifang's spirit and bearing surpassed the rest, with Sulan as his only true equal. But when measured against Qinguan, even by the finest margin, they all fell slightly"}],"9":[{"paragraph":22,"mentions":3,"tokens":["金漱芳","漱芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，看视不明，尚未见一盏灯火。忽见亭子前面太湖石山洞，一对明灯照出一双玉人来。走到面前看时，一个是袁宝珠，一个是金漱芳。仲清问道：「你们藏在那里？」宝珠道：「我们在前面小船室下棋。」文泽道：「相公阿曾点个只眼？」宝珠、漱芳都笑了一笑。座中就是子玉不认得，那日虽见漱芳的《题曲》，也是上妆容貌。此时看他骨香肉腻，玉洁晶莹；宝珠亭亭玉立，弱不胜衣，便想道：「这两个姿色似可","en":"bright lanterns lit the way for two jade-like figures. Coming closer, one proved to be Yuan Baozhu, and the other Jin Shufang. Zhongqing asked: \\"Where have you been hiding?\\" Baozhu replied: \\"We were playing chess in the little boat room at the front.\\" Wenze said: \\"And did either of you contrive to make an eye?\\" Baozhu and Shufang both smiled. Of those present, only Ziyu did"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":2,"tokens":["漱芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"酒，负此花灯。」听得次贤说道：「如此良夜，诸兄何不小饮几杯。」即吩咐取酒来。不一会，小厮们取了四壶酒交给宝珠、漱芳，走到各人面前，将茶碗撤去，把茶几揭起了一层盖子，便是一个镶成的攒盒，共有十二碟果菜，银杯象箸都镶在里面，十分精巧。宝珠、漱芳都斟了酒，次贤说：「请！」大家浅斟细酌起来。酒过数巡，台下云锣一响，四处的烟火放完，只见各处树梢上颤巍巍的挂起无数彩灯来，有","en":"ordered wine to be brought. In a short while the page-boys brought four jars of wine and handed them to Baozhu and Shufang, who went before each guest, removed the teacups, and lifted a layer off the tea-tables. This revealed inlaid tiered boxes within, each containing twelve plates of fruits and dishes, with silver cups and ivory chopsticks fitted inside, all of exquisite"},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":2,"tokens":["漱芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"门走将出来，说道：「有趣，有趣！几作了刘玄石一醉三年，险些儿被人埋在地下。」仲清道：「你酒已醒了，还说醉话。」漱芳已拧了一块湿手巾来，南湘擦了脸道：「这是什么地方？」众人皆笑，次贤笑道：「竹君，这是黄鹤楼，你怎么认不清了？」南湘近前一看，狂笑起来，说道：「原来静宜也在这里，你们到底几时来的？」众人听了又笑，宝珠、漱芳拉他到亭外看了一会，南湘方知道是怡园，细细一想","en":"nearly buried alive.\\" Zhongqing said: \\"Your head has cleared, so why are you still talking drunken nonsense?\\" Shufang had wrung out a damp cloth. Nanxiang wiped his face and asked: \\"Where are we?\\" Everyone laughed. Cixian smiled and said: \\"Zhujun, this is Yellow Crane Tower. How can you not recognize it?\\" Nanxiang looked around and burst into wild laughter, saying:"},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":1,"tokens":["漱芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"条，大家看时：一个是「春风一曲费缠头」，一个是「马儿快快随」，都打戏名，一个是《赏秋》，一个是《赶车》。宝珠对漱芳笑道：「你的一个，我的一个，都被他猜着了。」南湘笑道：「原来是你们做的。」即对子玉道：「庾香，此二君何如？你看他们的相貌、才艺，你评评，还是我说谎的么？」又指着两边的书画道：「你再看看，这是瑶卿画的，那是香畹写的，你看外边那班假名士，能够如这班真相公","en":"Both were theater-title riddles, one being 'Appreciating Autumn' and the other 'Driving the Cart'. Baozhu said to Shufang with a laugh: \\"One is yours, one is mine, and he solved them both.\\" Nanxiang laughed: \\"So you two made them!\\" He then turned to Ziyu and said: \\"Yuxiang, what do you make of these two? Judging from their looks and talents, am I telling the truth or not?"},{"paragraph":30,"mentions":1,"tokens":["漱芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"于是漱芳拉了王恂下棋，文泽观局。子玉同宝珠看那墨兰，赞不绝口；南湘、仲清、次贤同坐在醉翁床闲话。南湘道：「静宜兄，还记得「只有酒狂名下士，醉吟许上岳阳楼」佳句否？」","en":"Thereupon Shufang drew Wang Xun into a game of chess while Wenze looked on. Ziyu and Baozhu admired the ink-painted orchid, praising it without end. Nanxiang, Zhongqing, and Cixian sat together on the Drunken-Scholar's Couch in easy conversation. Nanxiang said: \\"Brother"},{"paragraph":35,"mentions":1,"tokens":["漱芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"文泽道：「这两封书，都是静宜先生的手笔么？」次贤道：「那封原书，是度香的手笔。」说着，王恂已经下完了棋，倒输了漱芳三子。子玉因夜色已深，随同南湘等告辞；子玉并说度香来园，先为致意，改日专诚再来的话，次贤答应着，送出各人上车而散。再听下回分解。","en":"is in Duxiang's hand.\\" As he spoke, Wang Xun had already finished his chess game, having lost three stones to Shufang. Ziyu, the night being already deep, took his leave together with Nanxiang and the others. Ziyu also conveyed that when Duxiang returned to the garden he would first pay his respects, and that he would come again in earnest on another day. Cixian replied"}],"12":[{"paragraph":32,"mentions":2,"tokens":["金漱芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"衣裳，连那骡子车围的颜色都说了，问道：「你可识得是那一班的相公？」高品想了一会道：「据你说来，不是陆素兰，就是金漱芳，不然就是袁宝珠。」春航道；「金漱芳在联殊班，我见过他的戏，生得瘦瘦儿的，不是。至于陆素兰、袁宝珠我却不认得，不知到底是谁？」高品道：「袁宝珠是不大穿素色衣裳的。你说这光景，也不大很像陆素兰。要不然是苏蕙芳，不错的，定是苏媚香，那真是冰壶秋月，清绝无","en":"actor belongs to?\\" Gao Pin thought for a moment and said: \\"From your description, it must be either Lu Sulan, or Jin Shufang — or else Yuan Baozhu.\\" Chunhang said: \\"Jin Shufang is in the Lianzhu troupe and I have seen his performance — he is rather thin and spare-looking; not him. As for Lu Sulan and Yuan Baozhu, I do not recognize either — I cannot say who this was.\\" Gao"}],"14":[{"paragraph":9,"mentions":1,"tokens":["金瘦香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「是」。蕙芳道：「等我想一想象谁？上二句纤腰抱月，星眸妒云，非袁瑶卿不足当此二语。下两句软爱罗轻，娇嫌帐重，非金瘦香却也不称。是他二人么？」春航摇摇头。蕙芳道：「然则是谁呢？」春航道：「还有一人能兼二人之妙，你倒猜不着他。」蕙芳道：「我真猜不着，你老实说了罢。」春航笑道：「我老实说，是个寓言空空的，如果有人像他，就算那人罢了。」蕙芳也不追求，又念道：","en":"describe Yuan Yaoqing. The lower couplet, 'soft love for gauze, coy dislike of heavy curtains', fits none but Jin Shouxiang. Is it those two?\\" Chunhang shook his head. Huifang said, \\"Then who is it?\\" Chunhang said, \\"There is one person who combines the charms of both, and you simply cannot guess him.\\" Huifang said, \\"I truly cannot guess; tell me plainly.\\" Chunhang laughed"},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":1,"tokens":["瘦香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"南湘道：「你叫相公瞒着我，倒问我从何处来？我今日同了静芳到怡园，他们都在家，留我吃了饭。佩仙也在座，还有瑶卿、瘦香两个。吃完了饭，佩仙家内有人来叫他，度香问起来，方知道是你叫的，我就辞了度香同来。」即指玉林手内的花道：「今日就在那里赏杏花。」又问高品道：「你又几时会弹琴，你要学琴，须我教你。方才这《水仙操》倒也弹得好。」高品道：「我何尝会弹？弹琴的就是田湘帆。」","en":"Garden of Contentment; they were all at home and kept me for dinner. Peixian was there too, along with Yaoqing and Shouxiang. After dinner, someone came from Peixian's household to fetch him. Duxiang asked about it and that's how I learned you had summoned them, so I took leave of Duxiang and came along.\\" He pointed at the blossom in Yulin's hand and said, \\"We were enjoying"}],"15":[{"paragraph":18,"mentions":3,"tokens":["漱芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"那日徐子云也在旗亭送行回来，且不进宅，一径到园，即到次贤屋里，始知次贤在桃花坞赏桃花，还有宝珠、漱芳两个，子云就到桃花坞来。虽是自己园中，也不能天天游览，数日之间，已见桃花开满，烂若晴霞，映着一水盈盈，草茵如绣，真觉春光已满。走进了第三重，始见曲榭之中，次贤与宝珠、漱芳在那里喝酒。见了子云，宝珠、漱芳已迎上来，次贤也笑面相迎。","en":"where he learned that Cixian was in the Peach Blossom Dell enjoying the peach blossoms, along with Baozhu and Shufang. Ziyun came to the grove at once. Though it was within his own garden, he could not wander through it every day; in just a few days, the peach blossoms had opened in full — blazing like morning radiance, reflected in a clear expanse of water, with the"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":1,"tokens":["漱芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云笑道：「静宜，今日竟偏我独乐了。」次贤道：「我知道你今日早回，先已虚左而待。」漱芳道：「你不见摆了四个坐儿么！？」子云即在次贤对面坐了。","en":"me out of your pleasures.\\" Cixian said, \\"Knowing you would return early today, I left a seat waiting for you.\\" Shufang said, \\"Did you not notice there are four places set?\\" Ziyun sat down across from Cixian."},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":1,"tokens":["漱芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"没有？」宝珠道：「怎么没有看见。」子云道：「你们今日何不也照这令行几个出来，也见见你们的心思。」宝珠尚未回答，漱芳道：「这个我们只怕行不来，一来心思欠灵，二来这唐诗与《诗经》也不甚熟，那里能说得这样凑拍？除非在家里把几种书翻出来，拣对路的一个个凑，才凑得成呢。」宝珠道：「我们真自惭愧，这些姑娘们也与我们差不多年纪，怎么他们就有这样慧心香口，我们就这样笨。」子云道","en":"own in the same vein? It would give us a chance to see what your minds can produce.\\" Before Baozhu could answer, Shufang said: \\"I'm afraid we won't be able to manage it — in the first place our wits are not nimble enough, and in the second, we are not very familiar with the Tang poetry or *The Classic of Poetry*, so how could we produce anything as perfectly synchronized"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":1,"tokens":["漱芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「这不是寻烦恼么？」漱芳道：「我且掷着色样再想。」他也掷了好几掷，掷着了「苏秦背剑」，便道：「这更难了。」忽见宝珠问次贤道：「《诗经》上有一句什么永叹？我记不真。」次贤道：「每有良朋，况也永叹。」宝珠道：「有是有了一个，只就是不甚好。」子云道：「你且说来。」宝珠念道：绿暗红","en":"\\"This is nothing but inviting vexation!\\" Shufang said, \\"Let me throw to see what pattern I get before I start thinking.\\" He too threw several times before getting \\"Su Qin Turns His Back on His Sword\\" (苏秦背剑). He said, \\"This is even harder.\\" Then Baozhu was seen asking Cixian: \\"There is a line in *The"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":2,"tokens":["漱芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"得。就这《诗经》一句稍差了些，然而也还说得过。」宝珠道：「这《诗经》实在难于凑拍，又要依这个韵，觉得更难了。」漱芳道：「我想的更不好。《诗经》上不是有一句「莫我肯顾」么？」子云道：「有。你快说。」漱芳要念时，重又顿住，觉有些羞涩，次贤又催，只得念道：苏秦背剑，北阙休上书，误你玉堂金马三学士。不是路，莫我肯顾。","en":"genuinely difficult to fit rhythmically, and with the rhyme scheme adding another constraint, it gets even harder.\\" Shufang said, \\"What I've thought up is even less polished. Is there not a line in *The Classic of Poetry* that goes 'None would look to me'?\\" Ziyun said, \\"There is. Say it quickly.\\" Shufang was about to recite, then hesitated, feeling a touch of shyness. Cixian"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":2,"tokens":["漱芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云等大赞。漱芳道：「你们知道他这「四边静，爱而不见」，是说得什么？」次贤笑道：「大有春恨怀人之致。」子云也笑。漱芳笑道：「不是。他昨日飞去一个秦吉了。我昨日到他那里去，正遇着他急急的跑出房来，四下张看。","en":"Ziyun and the others praised it greatly. Shufang said, \\"Do you know what this \\"all around is still, cherished but unseen\\" of his is really about?\\" Cixian smiled: \\"There is a deep charm of spring longing and yearning for someone.\\" Ziyun also laughed. Shufang laughed: \\"That's not it. Yesterday a talking"},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":3,"tokens":["漱芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"问我道：「你看见没有？」他方才说的，倒像那昨日的神气。」宝珠也笑道：「今日他又回来了。」漱芳又掷，掷了一个，「花开蝶满枝」。漱芳想了一会，说道：花开蝶满枝，是妾断肠时，我是散相思的五瘟使。蝶恋花，春日迟迟。次贤等大赞道：「这个更好。」宝珠道：「他总比我的说得好，我今日的两个都不及他。」便又掷了一个「打破锦屏风」，便道：「这个题目恰好，然难也","en":"that passage was exactly like his frantic demeanor yesterday.\\" Baozhu laughed too: \\"Today it came back again.\\" Shufang threw again and got \\"Butterflies Fill the Blossoming Branches\\" (花开蝶满枝). Shufang thought for a while, then said:\\n\\n\\"Butterflies fill the blossoming branches.\\nThis is the season of my breaking heart.\\nI am the Five-Pestilence Emissary who scatters lovesickness."},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":2,"tokens":["漱芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"何以穿我墉。\\n子云等大赞，子云道：「这个实在妙极了，就在那十六令中也是上等。我们恭贺三杯。」宝珠始为解颜欢喜。漱芳心里又着急起来．恐怕再行，不能及他，便道：「算了罢！实在费心得很，我不掷了。」子云道：「这令原也费心，但只五个，他得了三个。你才两个，你再掷一个罢？」漱芳道：","en":"the top tier. Let us drink three cups in congratulation.\\" Only then did Baozhu truly smile with satisfaction. Shufang began to feel anxious again, fearing that another round would leave him unable to match this, and said: \\"Let's leave it here. It's really quite taxing on the mind. I won't throw anymore.\\" Ziyun said, \\"This game is indeed taxing, but he has completed"},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":3,"tokens":["漱芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「适或色样重了呢？」次贤道：「重了不算，须要不重的才有趣。」漱芳不得已，掷了好几个重迭色样，然后才掷出一个楚汉争锋，便道：「掷了这个，就算完结了。」子云应允。漱芳便构思起来，一人独自走到桃花丛中去了。子云等也到花丛中游玩，漱芳道：「我想倒想着了一个，就是《唐诗》这一句还有些牵强，若除了这一句，我又找不出第二句来，","en":"comes up again as a repeat?\\" Cixian said, \\"A repeat doesn't count. It must be a new one to hold any interest.\\" Shufang had no choice and threw several repeated patterns before finally getting \\"Chu and Han Contend for Supremacy\\" (楚汉争锋). He said, \\"Now that I've thrown this, I'll call it the last one.\\" Ziyun agreed. Shufang composed himself in thought and walked off alone"},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":1,"tokens":["漱芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"些。所以才有人说他生疏，也有人说他神妙。」子云笑道：「以后梅庾香，大约非玉侬之戏不看，非玉侬的之酒不喝的了。」漱芳笑道：「玉侬行事还没媚香的奇，近来闻他天天到宏济寺去一回。有个什么田湘帆，也是个风流名士，闹到不堪。后来见了媚香的戏，便天天跟着他的车，他往东就往东，他往西就往西，跟了整个月。媚香怜念他，与他一谈，倒谈成了知己，如今是莫逆得很，不可一日不见。」次贤笑","en":"on, Mei Yuxiang will probably watch no theater but Yunong's and drink at no feast where Yunong is not present.\\" Shufang laughed: \\"Yunong's conduct is not yet as remarkable as Meixiang's. I hear that lately Meixiang goes to Hongji Temple once a day. There is a certain Tian Xiangfan there, a renowned man of romantic temperament, who has created quite a stir. He once saw"}],"17":[{"paragraph":3,"mentions":1,"tokens":["瘦香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"恂道：「我家亦可，但无花园子，不如前舟园里好。我们主人六个，添上湘帆七个，媚香、瑶卿、香畹、佩仙、静芳、蕊香、瘦香、小梅共是八个，要三席才可坐，醵分之说，不能预定多少，只好办了再算。」众人道：「极是。」子玉便呆呆的。仲清笑道：「庸庵你这差使办得不周到，要讨人怪的。」王恂尚未回答，南湘道：「何所见而言？」仲清道：「你不见庸庵点将，把一个极要紧的人遗漏了，岂不要招人","en":"six of us as hosts, plus Xiangfan, that makes seven; Meixiang, Yaoqing, Xiangwan, Peixian, Jingfang, Ruixiang, Shouxiang, and Xiaomei make eight. We shall require three tables to seat everyone. As for the pooled funds, we cannot fix an amount in advance; we must simply make the arrangements and settle the accounts thereafter.\\" Everyone agreed. Ziyu sat in a daze. Zhongqing"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":1,"tokens":["金漱芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"亦可脱俗，故尔谨遵台命，鞠跽前来。」文泽道：「此亦同人盛举，瞻仰倾城，为借花献佛耳。」说话间，陆素兰、李玉林、金漱芳同到，随后高、史、颜、王四人偕来，蕙芳一一都谢了。","en":"city-toppling beauty, merely borrowing the flower to offer to Buddha.\\" While they were speaking, Lu Sulan, Li Yulin, and Jin Shufang arrived together, followed by the four—Gao, Shi, Yan, and Wang; Huifang thanked them all one by one."},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":1,"tokens":["漱芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"定完后，王桂保、林春喜来了，皆见过了。正席上令漱芳、玉林、春喜伺候；左席上令宝珠、兰保、素兰；右席上则蕙芳、桂保二人。分派已定，各人坐了，慢慢的浅斟缓酌起来，正是：","en":"the seating was settled, Wang Guibao and Lin Chunxi arrived and were introduced all around. At the center table, Shufang, Yulin, and Chunxi attended; at the left table, Baozhu, Lanbao, and Sulan; at the right table, Huifang and Guibao. The assignments made, everyone took their seats and began to pour slowly, drinking at a leisurely pace. It was truly:"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":1,"tokens":["漱芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"家人们撤去残肴，备上香茗鲜果。春喜与桂保到太湖石畔，同坐在芍药栏边闲话；玉林、漱芳已醉卧在海棠花下；兰保在池畔钓鱼；宝珠与蕙芳对弈，素兰观局，南湘、高品在傍为宝珠指点。蕙芳道：「你们三人下我一个。就赢了也不算稀奇。」宝珠道：「我偏不用人教也赢得你。」文泽道：「今日我们亦算极乐了，可惜花部中少了两人，那个还不要紧，第一是琴言不来，使","en":"fresh fruit. Chunxi and Guibao went to the Taihu stone rockery and sat chatting by the peony hedge. Yulin and Shufang had drunk themselves into a stupor and lay asleep beneath the crabapple blossoms. Lanbao was fishing by the pond. Baozhu and Huifang were playing chess, with Sulan watching the game, while Nanxiang and Gao Pin stood by offering Baozhu advice. Huifang"},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":1,"tokens":["漱芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"何不将人花比拟一回，总要从公，不可各存偏见。」于是大家评定：以宝珠为牡丹，蕙芳为芍药，素兰为莲花，玉林为碧桃，漱芳为海棠，兰保为玫瑰，桂保为芙蓉，春喜小而多才，人人钟爱为兰花。八人品题尽合，因又想到琴言、琪官为何花？子云道：「琴言色艺过佳，而性情过冷，比为梅花最是相称，且其酷爱梅，不属庾香将谁属耶？」众人说道；「很是。」高品道：「只怕和靖先生不依，庾香割了他靴革","en":"decided: Baozhu as the peony; Huifang as the herbaceous peony; Sulan as the lotus; Yulin as the green peach blossom; Shufang as the crabapple; Lanbao as the rose; Guibao as the cotton rose. Chunxi, small in stature yet richly talented and beloved by all, was assigned the orchid. The eight assignments all felt fitting. They then wondered what flowers Qinyan and Qiguan should"}],"20":[{"paragraph":10,"mentions":2,"tokens":["漱芳","瘦香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"次贤笑道：「所谓「打鸭惊鸳鸯」，今日见了。」大家正看得有趣，又见船中走出几枝花来。一只船内是宝珠、漱芳，一只船内是蕙芳、素兰，共是五个。舟人把舟泊近阑干，南湘道：「芙蓉未开，水榭减色。有此众芳一渡，庶不寂寞。湘娥洛神，江湄游戏，我度香先生当以玉佩要之。」大家笑了一笑，群旦上来都见过了。次贤道：「你们看静芳窄袖踟蹰的，越显得风流跌宕。竹君之赞语「翩若惊","en":"watching with interest, they saw figures stepping out of the boats like blossoming flowers: one boat held Baozhu and Shufang, the other Huifang and Sulan — five people in all. The boatmen moored the craft against the railing; Nanxiang said: \\"The hibiscus has not yet opened, and the water pavilion lacks a certain brilliance. With all this company of flowers making the crossing,"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":1,"tokens":["瘦香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"过几处了？」南湘道：「到却到过许多回，逛却没有逛到。一喝酒就是一天，那里能逛。约有七八处逛过。」宝珠道：「我同瘦香是逛完的了。」蕙芳道：「我就是桂岭、菊畦、兰径没有到过，其余也都逛完。」","en":"time to stroll about? I've been to perhaps seven or eight places.\\" Baozhu said: \\"I have toured it completely with Shouxiang.\\" Huifang said: \\"I haven't been to Osmanthus Ridge, the Chrysanthemum Beds, or Orchid Path; all the rest I've seen.\\""},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":1,"tokens":["漱芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"止住，只得就便服送了酒，依齿而坐。东首是南湘，子云命兰保坐在肩下。西首是春航，肩下是蕙芳。\\n上面是次贤，肩下是漱芳。","en":"Lanbao to sit at his shoulder. To the west sat Chunhang, with Huifang at his shoulder. At the head sat Cixian, with Shufang at his shoulder."},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":2,"tokens":["漱芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"再看筹是漱芳的，那面是：「金翠莲酒楼卖唱。要弹琵琶，敬鲁达、李忠、史进各一杯。」众人道：「这还可以，在不即不离之间。况且真是个姓金的，怎么遇得这般凑巧？」漱芳只得弹起琵琶，敬了南湘、春航、次贤三人。","en":"The next tally was Shufang's; the inscription read: \\"Jin Cuilian Selling Her Singing in the Wine-House. She must play the pipa and offer a respectful cup to Lu Da, Li Zhong, and Shi Jin each.\\" Everyone said: \\"This one is still manageable — on the edge between closeness and distance."},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":2,"tokens":["金漱芳","瘦香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"南湘大笑道：「香尘沾膝还可以，只不要跪在烂泥里，那时莲钩倒摸不着，摸着的是条驴腿。」说得众人哄然狂笑起来，把个金漱芳笑得闪了腰，直跌到次贤怀里。王兰保、陆素兰笑得走开了。宝珠道：「此又是报应，天理昭彰，一毫不爽的。」大家笑得春航十分难受，又不好认真，只得忍住道：「竹君刻薄，应该罚他一个恶令。」南湘笑道：「我是据实而言，何刻薄之有？」蕙芳道：「你也够了，不要说嘴，晓","en":"of reach, and what you'd grasp would be a donkey's leg.\\" This set everyone into wild uncontrollable laughter; Jin Shufang laughed so hard he twisted at the waist and tumbled straight into Cixian's lap. Wang Lanbao and Lu Sulan laughed and moved away. Baozhu said: \\"Another case of heavenly retribution — perfectly clear and precise.\\" Everyone kept laughing, which made Chunhang"}],"24":[{"paragraph":5,"mentions":1,"tokens":["瘦香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"丑有二十余个，是五六班凑成的。」仲清道：「旦脚十个是谁？」桂保道：「我们两个之外，尚有瑶卿、媚香、香畹、静芳、瘦香、小梅，后来又添了玉侬、玉艳，共是十个。」王恂道：「这就是十美班了。」桂保道：「陪客尚未定，你们是一定在数的。听得度香已写书子到保定府去，请前舟回来商议，只怕就是这件事。」王恂道：「也近了，今日已是二十六日了，还有十天，就演得全这些新戏吗？」玉林笑道","en":"ten dan performers?\\" Guibao replied, \\"Besides the two of us, there are Yaoqing, Meixiang, Xiangwan, Jingfang, Shouxiang, and Xiaomei. Yunong and Yuyan joined later, making ten in all.\\" Wang Xun said, \\"That makes a Ten-Beauties company.\\" Guibao added, \\"The guest list isn't entirely settled yet, but you two are certainly included. I heard Duxiang wrote to Baoding to invite"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":1,"tokens":["瘦香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"出言有章，和而不流，婉而有致，要算香畹。言语爽直，风度高超，雅俗咸宜，毫无拘束，是静芳。恬静安详，言语妥贴，是瘦香。","en":"manner, welcoming to both high and low with a free spirit, is Jingfang. Quiet ease and perfectly apt words belong to Shouxiang."}],"30":[{"paragraph":12,"mentions":1,"tokens":["漱芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"说不尽腥浓肥脆。清谈妙语，佐以诙谐。那边席上，聘才问次贤怡园的光景。次贤略述了几处。随后即见宝珠、蕙芳、素兰、漱芳、玉林、兰保、桂保，春喜、琪官等九个，又凑上一个，作了一出《秦淮河看花大会》，有幽闲的，有妖冶的，有静婉的，有风流的，极尽靡艳之致，众人尽皆喝采。子云、次贤等就于此出中间放了赏。华公子对着笑道：「此系抄袭吾兄旧文，殊觉数见不鲜。」子云道：「唱的甚好，","en":"sights of the Garden of Contentment. Cixian briefly described a few places. Next came Baozhu, Huifang, Sulan, Shufang, Yulin, Lanbao, Guibao, Chunxi, Qiguan—nine in total—plus one more, performing the play 'Flower-Viewing Assembly on the Qinhuai'. Some were demure, some coquettish, some quiet and gentle, and some romantic, exhibiting the utmost alluring charm. Everyone"}],"31":[{"paragraph":3,"mentions":2,"tokens":["瘦香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"媚香是长于诗的，瑶卿是长于丹青的，静芳是长于舞剑的，香畹是长于书法的，佩仙是长于填词的，蕊香是长于猜谜诙谐的，瘦香是长于品箫的，小梅是长于吹笙的。可惜玉侬又病了，他倒会一套《平沙落雁》。」华公子便命叫他起来，又吩咐珊枝拿了琵琶来。家人把些笔砚乐器都搬了出来，分摆在各处。次贤道：「我来点将：先点玉侬与瘦香把琴箫和起来；再点瑶卿画一幅，媚香、香畹、佩仙对景吟诗，题在","en":"beautiful calligraphy, Peixian is adept at composing lyrics, Ruixiang has a gift for riddles and witty banter, Shouxiang is masterful with the vertical flute, and Xiaomei plays the mouth-organ beautifully. It is only a pity that Yunong has fallen ill, for he plays a wonderful rendition of 'Wild Geese Alighting on Level Sand'.\\" Hearing this, Young Master Hua ordered him"},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":1,"tokens":["漱芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴言不得已，双锁蛾眉，把弦和起来。这边漱芳依谱吹箫。琴言一来心神不佳，而且手生，生生涩涩的弹了一套《平沙》。","en":"Left with no other choice, Qinyan drew his delicate brows together and began to tune the strings. Beside him, Shufang followed the musical score and began to blow softly upon the xiao. Qinyan's mind was profoundly troubled, and his fingers were out of practice; thus, he ground out a rendition of 'Wild Geese Alighting on Level Sand' that sounded harsh and halting."},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":2,"tokens":["瘦香","漱芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「琴本难学，也还亏他。」次贤道：「想你不长弹，生疏了。」琴言道：「有半年不学了，方才第四段第三句几乎想不出来。瘦香的箫，比从前更好了。」漱芳道：「我是向老师课学。静宜先生隔三日必教我一吹，所以不生。」琴言默然，抚今追昔，颇觉感慨，几乎落下泪来，只得退后站了。次贤、子云亦颇恻然怜念。","en":"not touched the instrument for half a year. Just now, I nearly forgot the third phrase of the fourth movement. Shouxiang's flute playing, however, is even better than it was before.\\" Shufang explained, \\"I study diligently under my master. Master Jingyi tutors me in the flute every third day without fail, which is why I have not grown rusty.\\" Qinyan fell silent. Reflecting"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":1,"tokens":["金漱芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"花部中曾受业于香雪者，现有四人：袁宝珠、王桂保、金漱芳、陆素兰，或学画，或学诗，皆为高弟，此四人也共凑百金，连蕙芳的共有四百金。母子二人并一老仆三人，雇舟由运河而回，也就极宽裕了。","en":"pupils in the flower-register who had studied under Fragrant-Snow, four still remained: Yuan Baozhu, Wang Guibao, Jin Shufang, and Lu Sulan. Whether they had studied painting or poetry, all were his advanced disciples. These four pupils pooled together an additional one hundred taels. Combined with Huifang's contribution, the total came to four hundred taels. This generous"},{"paragraph":30,"mentions":1,"tokens":["漱芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"坐了。仲清道：「人已齐了，就奠一奠，我们往锦秋墩去逛罢。」蕙芳即将祭筵就叫在那屋里摆起来。蕙芳上香，素兰奠酒，漱芳执壶，宝珠上菜，桂保焚纸，春航、南湘、高品同行了一个礼，五旦连连叩头代谢。","en":"sacrificial feast to be laid out in the room. Huifang offered the incense, Sulan poured the libations of wine, Shufang held the pitcher, Baozhu arranged the dishes, and Guibao burned the paper offerings. Chunhang, Nanxiang, and Gao Pin bowed respectfully in unison, while the five dans kowtowed repeatedly in solemn gratitude."},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":1,"tokens":["漱芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"作违心之论。」素兰道：「我若是一个人，就是日里也不敢进去。」桂保道：「那些棺材破烂的甚多，我看晚间只怕有鬼。」漱芳道：「亏那和尚只有一个徒弟，一个香火，竟不怕。若果真有鬼，和尚怎么好好儿的呢？」蕙芳道：「你几时见鬼吃过人？我前日听那和尚说，每到阴风暗雨的时候，或是夜深，叫的叫，哭的哭，是常有的。」宝珠道：「你们听见怡园闹鬼没有？」蕙芳道：「没有。」素兰问道：「怎","en":"added, \\"There are so many broken and rotting coffins in there. I am certain the place must be haunted at night.\\" Shufang reasoned, \\"It is amazing that the monk, with only one novice and an altar attendant, is entirely unafraid. If there truly were ghosts, how could the monk remain so perfectly unharmed?\\" Huifang chimed in, \\"When have you ever seen a ghost eat a man? Just"}],"35":[{"paragraph":10,"mentions":1,"tokens":["漱芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"是日名旦中有几个不得来，都有堂会戏，不能分身。宝珠之外，来的是蕙芳、素兰、玉林、漱芳四人。这边名士，怡园二位之外，是刘文泽、颜仲清、王恂、田春航、梅子玉五人。共十二人。众客到齐，宝珠先叩谢了。","en":"engagements and couldn't be in two places at once. Besides Baozhu, the attendees were Huifang, Sulan, Yulin, and Shufang—four in total. On the side of the famous scholars, apart from the two hosts of the Garden of Contentment, there were Liu Wenze, Yan Zhongqing, Wang Xun, Tian Chunhang, and Mei Ziyu—five in total. Together, they made twelve. Once all the guests had assembled,"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":1,"tokens":["漱芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"坐位，是东西对面八坐，南北对面四坐。文泽、仲清、王恂、春航、子玉、次贤、子云坐了东西，上下是蕙芳、素兰、玉林、漱芳、宝珠。宝珠坐了末位。","en":"Cixian, and Ziyun took the east-west seats, while the upper and lower seats were occupied by Huifang, Sulan, Yulin, Shufang, and Baozhu. Baozhu took the very last seat."},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":5,"tokens":["金漱芳","漱芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"酒。接飞二字，到那人，那人也照样喝酒。又飞三字，一轮到十二为止。错者罚酒，可好么？」众人都说：「好。」陆素兰与金漱芳等道：「这个苦了我们，搜索枯肠，那里就有这些凑巧数目飞出来？」文泽道：「你们也能，只怕唐诗还比我们熟些。如果那数目飞不出来，便照数目多少罚酒。」宝珠道：「譬如要飞十二，飞不出就要罚十二杯么？」文泽道：「自然。」子云道：「这也过多，且到临时再斟酌罢。前","en":"twelve. Those who make a mistake must drink a penalty cup, how does that sound?\\" Everyone agreed, \\"Good.\\" Lu Sulan, Jin Shufang, and the others protested, \\"This is hard on us; we'll have to rack our brains, where will we find such convenient numbers to recite?\\" Wenze replied, \\"You can do it; I fear you might know Tang poetry even better than we do. If you can't come up with the"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":2,"tokens":["漱芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"句了。」因想了一会，念道：「宝扇迎归九华帐。」一数数到素兰，素兰喝了酒，飞出十字道：「闺里佳人年十余。」数到了漱芳，漱芳道：「我轮到两回了。」只得喝了酒，道：「幸亏还记得一句「十一月中长至夜」。」便对宝珠道：「你喝一杯罢！」宝珠道：「你自己也要喝一杯，十字还在你身上呢。」","en":"offered a ten-character line: \\"The beautiful lady in the boudoir is just over ten years old.\\" The count fell to Shufang, who complained, \\"It's landed on me twice now.\\" He had no choice but to drink, saying, \\"Fortunately, I remember the line, 'In the eleventh month, the night of the winter solstice is long.'\\" He then turned to Baozhu, \\"You drink a cup!\\" Baozhu replied,"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":1,"tokens":["漱芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"漱芳也只得喝了一杯。宝珠喝了，想了一会，飞出一句道：「南陌青楼十二重。」飞到子玉。子玉喝了酒，道：「已经十二了，还要飞吗？」次贤道：「座中媚香还没有轮到。轮到了他，我们再换令罢。如今只可飞十三了。」子玉飞出一句是：「娉娉袅袅十三余。」飞到了仲清，仲清喝了","en":"Shufang had no choice but to drink a cup. Baozhu drank his, thought for a moment, and recited a line: \\"On the southern path, the green towers stand twelve tiers high.\\" It landed on Ziyu. Ziyu drank the wine and asked, \\"We're already at twelve, do we still need"},{"paragraph":30,"mentions":1,"tokens":["漱芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"的句子，倒没有他们的香艳。」素兰道：「你们是诗，我们是曲，占了这点便宜。你们又要人名，又要并头、并蒂就难了。」漱芳道：「我才把他们行过的要想两句，再想不出来。幸亏不行这个令，不然要罚死了。」王恂尚未想出，次贤道：「这是《琴挑》一枝上的，我们各贺一杯。」众人喝了。","en":"ours.\\" Sulan replied, \\"The scholars have harder constraints with the person's name and the specific flower type.\\" Shufang chimed in, \\"I can hardly compose even by borrowing lines from what has just been spoken. I'm lucky not to be in the hard game.\\" Wang Xun still didn't have an answer, so Cixian identified Huifang's lines as being from *Flirting with a Zither* and called"},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":1,"tokens":["漱芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"着是：千枝万枝红艳春，钓竿欲拂珊瑚树。花名是「既溥既长，春日载阳。」长春是连理花。」众人赞了几句，也贺了一杯。漱芳掷了一个么四，即念道：「月移花影，疑是玉人来。」众人道：「这句自然，好得很，该贺两杯。」皆喝了。","en":"bright.' Everlasting spring (长春) is the intertwined flower.\\" The group offered words of praise and toasted him a cup. Shufang then rolled a one and a four, immediately reciting: \\"'The moon shifts the flower-shadows—one suspects a jade beauty arrives.'\\" Everyone exclaimed, \\"This line is natural and absolutely excellent; it deserves a double toast.\\" And so they all drank."},{"paragraph":35,"mentions":1,"tokens":["漱芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"二四，想了一想，念出《春睡》上的曲文道：「星眼倦摩呵，一片美人香和。」子云道：「好！也该贺。」大家各贺了一杯。漱芳又掷了个么二，也想了一想，念道：「月上东墙，最可人星明月朗。」子云道：「好！该贺一杯。」众人喝过。文泽道：「你自己令也应交卷了，只管看着人交卷，难道你这腹稿还没有打完么？」子云笑道：「快了。」于是又看蕙芳掷了一个么四，想了半刻工夫，念着《偷曲》上的两","en":"sheet of beauty-fragrance blends.'\\" Ziyun praised, \\"Excellent! That deserves a toast.\\" Everyone raised a cup. Shufang rolled a one and a two, paused to think, and recited, \\"'The moon climbs the eastern wall—most lovely when the stars are clear and the moon is bright.'\\" Ziyun again praised, \\"Good! That deserves a cup.\\" Everyone drank. Wenze teased Ziyun, \\"It's time you"},{"paragraph":37,"mentions":1,"tokens":["漱芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"卿。」众人说妙，又贺了一杯。大家看着宝珠一笑，宝珠不觉脸上一红，于是大家更笑起来，宝珠亦只得垂头微哂。不觉又到漱芳，已是每人轮了三次，也要收令了，掷了一个重四，也就念《窥浴》的曲子道：「意中人，人中意。」众皆大赞道：「这一结，方把今日这些人都结在里面，都是个意中人，人中意了。我们应照字数各贺了六杯吃饭。」大家也高兴饮了，吃完饭，漱口、更衣已毕。钟上已是亥末，大家","en":"which only made everyone laugh even more. He had no choice but to lower his head with a faint smile. Soon it was Shufang's turn again. Since everyone had now rolled three times, it was time to conclude the game. He rolled double fours and recited a lyric from *Peeking at the Bath*: \\"The one in the heart, the heart among people.\\" Everyone highly praised him: \\"This conclusion"}],"36":[{"paragraph":8,"mentions":1,"tokens":["金漱芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"明日、后日皆可。」三人坐了好些时候，要走了，琴言拉住了不肯放，众人不忍相离，只得坐下。后又来了王桂保、李玉林、金漱芳，大家直等了送殓，拜了，然后才散。琴言穿了孝袍，似乎明日不好出门，只得约定三日后再叙。又叫伍麻子到华府求珊枝转为告假一月，俟出殡后方得进城。华公子准了，又拿了一个衣箱回来，琴言方才放心。","en":"to leave, Qinyan clung to them, and, reluctant to part, they sat back down. Later, Wang Guibao, Li Yulin, and Jin Shufang arrived. They all stayed until the coffin was sealed, paid their respects, and then departed. Since Qinyan was wearing mourning robes, it seemed improper to go out the next day, so they agreed to meet again in three days. He also sent Wu Mazi to the"}],"37":[{"paragraph":15,"mentions":1,"tokens":["瘦香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「也罢，你作个先锋，他作个后劲，把我们放在中间，容易讨好些。」次贤道：「头难，头难，我一时想不出好的。我前日见瘦香的《题曲》唱得甚好，就出《题曲》罢。」蕙芳道：「《题曲》就可以对《偷诗》。」宝珠道：「将现成人家方才对过的，你又拣了来，这么就牵扯不清了。你先罚一杯。」蕙芳道：「不算就是了，又要罚什么。」子云道：「要罚的，不然尽对对不喝酒了。」即罚了蕙芳一杯。蕙芳想","en":"Cixian said, \\"Hard to begin, hard to begin! I can't think of a good one just now. The day before yesterday I saw Shouxiang perform *Inscribing the Song* (题曲) and he sang it beautifully, so I shall take that as my opening.\\" Huifang immediately responded, \\"*Inscribing the Song* (题曲) could certainly be paired with *Stealing the Poem* (偷诗).\\" Baozhu interjected, \\"You’ve just"}],"38":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":2,"tokens":["漱芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云因屈道生是个高雅好静的人，名旦中止叫了四个，宝珠、漱芳、蕙芳、素兰。漱芳有恙不能前来，格外又知会了琴言。是日屈公先到，与子云、次贤叙了好些旧话。","en":"Daosheng was a man of refined tastes who preferred quieter company, Ziyun had invited only four performers: Baozhu, Shufang, Huifang, and Sulan. Shufang was indisposed and unable to attend; as an added guest, Qinyan was also notified. That day Master Qu arrived first and spent a good while in conversation with Ziyun and Cixian, catching up on old times."}],"43":[{"paragraph":3,"mentions":1,"tokens":["瘦香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"未必有存余。若四五千吊钱可以出得师，我们代他张罗张罗，或是几个相好中凑凑，也可凑得一半。就说的是你、王氏弟兄、瘦香、佩仙等，想没有不肯的。若能凑出一半，那一半就容易了。」宝珠道：「出师之后怎样呢？」素兰道：「那倒没有商量到这一层。只要出了师，这身子就是自己的了。那自然由得你。」宝珠道：「若在华府中，也与不出师一样，由不得他。」素兰道「华公子也没有买他，他师父当日","en":"friends. A few of his close acquaintances might each contribute a share. I am speaking of you, the Wang brothers, Shouxiang, Peixian, and the rest. Surely none of them would refuse. If we could gather half, the other half would be easier.\\" \\"And what happens after the release?\\" asked Baozhu. \\"We did not get that far in our discussion,\\" said Sulan. \\"So long as he is released,"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":1,"tokens":["瘦香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云笑面相迎，见了琴言、蕙芳等更加欢喜，说道：「今日倒料不着你们来。」宝珠道：「都是我请来的。」又对次贤道：「瘦香身子不快，不来了。」","en":"pleased, saying: \\"We hardly expected you today.\\" \\"I brought them all,\\" said Baozhu. And then, turning to Cixian: \\"Shouxiang is unwell and could not come.\\""}],"45":[{"paragraph":12,"mentions":1,"tokens":["漱芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"玉到了，各人与吉甫相见，叙了些彼此仰慕的话。只有史南湘、田春航在场中未来。相公们到的是宝珠、蕙芳、素兰、玉林、漱芳、兰保、桂保、春喜、琪官、连琴言刚是十人。","en":"Chunhang were still at the examination grounds. Among the performers who came were Baozhu, Huifang, Sulan, Yulin, Shufang, Lanbao, Guibao, Chunxi, and Qiguan. Qinyan made ten in total."},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":4,"tokens":["漱芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"上前虔诚默祷，一连叩了九个头。先焚了一通风符，次云符，又鹤符。候了约有半刻时候，要请两位仙童扶乩，便点了玉林、漱芳，二人扶上。又有半刻工夫，不见运动，王胡子又磕了头，再焚个催符。玉林、漱芳呆呆的扶着，见那乩像有些动，玉林把手一拨，便旋转起来，满盘走了一回，画了无数的圈子。玉林疑是漱芳，漱芳疑是玉林，两人对着微笑。那乩画了一回，略停一停，忽又运动，上下往来，成了两","en":"talismans. After about a quarter-hour, he needed two \\"immortal youths\\" to hold the planchette, so he named Yulin and Shufang. Another quarter-hour passed, but there was still no motion. Old Wang kowtowed again and burned a hastening charm. Yulin and Shufang held the carrier woodenly. Suddenly, the planchette stirred slightly. Yulin gave it a push, and it spun, tracing endless"},{"paragraph":30,"mentions":2,"tokens":["漱芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"更有清才萧颖士，漱芳六艺精文史。\\n闲云不肯出山来，赋价曾高洛阳纸。\\n道生道：「这位是静宜了。」漱芳看见第二句，心中暗喜神仙赞静宜，也带着他的名字，可谓附尾了。一面看写的道：","en":"\\"Clear talent Xiao Yingshi, Shufang's six arts shine,\\nIdle clouds refuse the mountains' call,\\nHis fu once priced above Luoyang's fine paper.\\"\\nDaosheng nodded. \\"That must be Jingyi.\\" Shufang thrilled at the second line. The immortal had praised Jingyi and slipped in his own name. They read"},{"paragraph":43,"mentions":2,"tokens":["漱芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"也笑道：「我也略猜着此，但不知是怎样个始末，何妨与我说明？」子云道：「我要说，又怕有人不依，我不说罢。」玉林对漱芳说道：「起初乩动的时候，我总当着你的手动，我想把我的手不动，教你写不成。后来，不由得我的手也跟着动起来了。」漱芳道：「可不是，我先也打量是你作诡，及至写了一句诗，我还疑惑是作出来的，后来才知不是了。」春喜道：「我们扶的时候手要不动，那乩自己就会跳起来","en":"you tell me?\\" Ziyun deflected gracefully. \\"If I speak, someone may object. I will keep silent.\\" Yulin turned to Shufang and whispered, \\"When the planchette first moved, I thought your hand moved it. I tried to hold my hand perfectly still so you could not write. But later, my own hand moved completely against my will.\\" Shufang agreed, \\"I thought you were tricking too!"}],"46":[{"paragraph":53,"mentions":1,"tokens":["金漱芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"正饮酒间，王兰保、金漱芳、秦琪官、林春喜同来见了，即分开坐了，谈了些闲话。子云道：「今日这二十四副对子，清芬浓艳，各尽所长。但我看来，始终要推道翁先生的赐书楼、承荫堂冠冕堂皇了。」众名士道：「自然，我们到底觉得力薄，那里能这样大方，这是勉强不来的。」道翁道：「这也不然，一来","en":"While they were at their food and wine, Wang Lanbao, Jin Shufang, Qin Qiguan and Lin Chunxi all came in and paid their respects, and sat down apart, and there was some idle talk.\\n\\nZiyun said, \\"These twenty-four couplets today are fresh or rich by turns, and every man has done his best. But to my mind Master Qu's,"}],"48":[{"paragraph":12,"mentions":1,"tokens":["漱芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"闲时又有宝珠、素兰、兰保、漱芳等一班名旦，不是垂帘度曲，就是对酒当歌。南湘素有才名，如今加上个翰林名号，更有那求文求诗的接踵而来。他又怕烦，常请金粟、子玉等代笔。至于不要紧的，连琴仙、蕙芳、素兰、宝珠的佳章都有在里面，好在人人说好，没有一个看得出来。南湘本要接夫人来京，一因任上两","en":"During their leisure time, renowned performers like Baozhu, Sulan, Lanbao, and Shufang would join them, either singing behind screens or drinking and harmonizing with their melodies. Nanxiang already possessed a literary reputation, and now, adorned with a Hanlin title, requests for essays and poems poured in endlessly. Detesting the nuisance,"},{"paragraph":36,"mentions":1,"tokens":["漱芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"跟着，一直送出城外，直到十里之外皇华亭。只见南湘、仲清、文泽、金粟、王恂、子玉、春航，领着那蕙芳、宝珠、素兰、漱芳、玉林、兰保、桂保、琪官、春喜九个名旦，在皇华亭等候。道翁等连忙下车，极口辞谢。各人皆要把盏。","en":"Wenze, Jin Su, Wang Xun, Ziyu, and Chunhang, alongside Huifang and the nine famous performers: Baozhu, Sulan, Shufang, Yulin, Lanbao, Guibao, Qiguan, and Chunxi. Daoweng hurried down from his carriage and thanked everyone repeatedly, as they all eagerly wished to raise a cup in a final parting toast."}],"53":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["金漱芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，即命家人去叫素兰，说明叫他带了前日的扇子来。那日素兰正在蕙芳处商议开那古董铺的事情，苏、陆之外，尚有袁宝珠、金漱芳、王兰保、李玉林要来，大家商议那古董书画等物公凑些起来，也就不少。况且怡园花木极多，尽可分些来应用。我们何不先开起来，再到南边制办，也未尝不可。若要等买齐了，就有两三月耽搁去了。","en":"the time, Sulan was at Huifang's place discussing their plans to open an antique shop. Beyond Su and Lu, Baozhu, Shufang, Lanbao, and Yulin also intended to join. They reasoned that if everyone pooled their antiques, books, and paintings, it would amount to a substantial collection. Moreover, the Garden of Contentment was rich with flowers and trees, which could easily"},{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["漱芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一切俱好，器皿什物皆有。我们一班人全进去，也住不满他。只要作些橱柜等物，一完备就可开张，中秋前后尽来得及了。」漱芳、兰保同声说：「好！」又说：「就这么着，我们大家去找度香商量。」正商议间，忽见素兰的人进来说：「华公子打发人叫，立等进城。」素兰道：「他叫几个人？」那人道「就叫你一个，说叫带了扇子去。」素兰道：「我道他叫我作什么，原来是为这把扇子。」蕙芳道：「这扇子","en":"place. Once we build a few display cabinets, we'll be ready to open. We could easily make it by mid-autumn.\\"\\n\\nShufang and Lanbao chimed in unison, \\"Excellent!\\" They added, \\"Let's settle it then. We will all go find Duxiang to discuss this.\\"\\n\\nJust as they were deliberating, Sulan's servant hurried in and reported, \\"Young Master Hua has sent someone to summon you. He"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":2,"tokens":["漱芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"。所以他视度香也算一个知已。」华公子道：「这么看起来，我还不如度香。这也是各人的性情，勉强不来的。」又问：「那漱芳呢？」素兰道：「漱芳是个和而不同的，外面虽和顺，内里却有把持。」公子道：「你看我的珊枝如何？你要直说，不许恭惟他。」素兰一想，这个倒定要恭惟几句才好，若实说了，是要闹出乱子来的，便道：「这个人还有什么议论呢？又忠直，又正派，知恩报恩，还有什么说话。公","en":"inferior to Duxiang. This too is a matter of individual temperament; it cannot be forced.\\" He then asked, \\"What about Shufang?\\"\\n\\nSulan said, \\"Shufang harmonizes but maintains his own stance. He appears compliant on the outside, but holds firm on the inside.\\"\\n\\nYoung Master Hua asked, \\"And what do you think of my Shanzhi? Speak honestly, I forbid you to flatter him.\\"\\n\\nSulan thought"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":1,"tokens":["漱芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"素兰道：「题个什么名字呢？」蕙芳道：「我想题为九香楼可好么？」素兰道：「好个九香楼，妙极，妙极！」又请了宝珠、漱芳、玉林、兰保等来，大家看了，都极喜欢，同赞素兰能干，叫华公子这般倾倒起来，又赞他题的曲子。素兰颇为得意。","en":"think?\\"\\n\\n\\"A fine name—Nine Fragrance Tower. Exquisite, truly exquisite!\\" Sulan praised.\\n\\nThey then invited Baozhu, Shufang, Yulin, Lanbao, and the others to come see. Everyone examined the goods and was overjoyed. They praised Sulan's capability in winning Young Master Hua over so completely, and applauded the lyric he had composed. Sulan felt quite proud."}],"60":[{"paragraph":5,"mentions":1,"tokens":["漱芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"仙，金粟拈了宝珠，春航拈了蕙芳，仲清拈了琪官，文泽拈了春喜，南湘拈了兰保，王恂拈了桂保，高品拈了玉林，次贤拈了漱芳，单拈不着素兰，只好送与华公子去作了。众人分派已定，子玉说道：「做传容易，画画难，还要刻石，更须时日，不知几天可以告成？」吉甫道：「不消多日，碑是磨现成的，一面画，一面就叫季十矮子找人刻，大约十几天是必要的，嵌好这些碑，也要几天。我们这一叙，总在九香","en":"drew Qiguan; Wenze drew Chunxi; Nanxiang drew Lanbao; Wang Xun drew Guibao; Gao Pin drew Yulin; and Cixian drew Shufang. Sulan alone was not drawn, so that assignment was sent to Young Master Hua. The tasks distributed, Ziyu said, \\"Writing biographies is easy, but painting is difficult, and carving stone takes even longer. How many days until it is finished?\\" Jifu replied,"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":2,"tokens":["瘦香","漱芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"裁成九华帐，鲛珠穿作十重帘。\\n隐身阆苑依琼树，返劫归真典玉签。\\n只恐留仙留不住，晓风吹上绿云尖。\\n琴仙道：「将瘦香的神情骨相全写出来。」漱芳笑道：「我这个瘦字倒有些像，别样真令我惭愧死了。」再看第七方画的仙女，在两棵玉树之下，有玉树凌风之致，题的是娟娟花史李仙，是高品的诗。琴仙道：「高卓然肯说好话吗？」玉林道：「这一回倒没有刻薄人。」蕙芳道：「这首诗，算卓然极要","en":"the green clouds.\\"\\n\\nQinxian said, \\"He has captured the very spirit and bone of 'slender fragrance' perfectly.\\" Shufang laughed, \\"The word 'slender' bears some resemblance to me, but the rest makes me want to die of shame.\\" They looked at the seventh panel, which depicted a fairy maiden standing gracefully beneath two jade trees, exuding an air of swaying elegance in"},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":1,"tokens":["金漱芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"自在，具广设施。亦无我欲，亦无我私。\\n素月流天，照靡有遗。青空无云，霄露自降。\\n大钟中虚，寸挺可撞。\\n第二首是金漱芳题的《仙中逸品》：","en":"accord.\\nThe great bell is hollow within—strike it with but an inch of wood, and it will ring.\\"\\n\\nThe second was Jin Shufang's *Escaped Grade Among Immortals*:"}]}`),"char-27":JSON.parse(`{"1":[{"paragraph":24,"mentions":3,"tokens":["李玉林","玉林","佩仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"玉树临风李玉林\\n玉林姓李氏，字佩仙，年十五岁。扬州人。","en":"Li Yulin: A Jade Tree Facing the Wind. Yulin's surname is Li, his courtesy name Peixian, and he is fifteen years of age. A native of Yangzhou."}],"2":[{"paragraph":35,"mentions":1,"tokens":["玉林"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"哥兰保为什么不来，桂保道：「今日本都在怡园逛了一天，徐老爷知道这里请客，才打发我来的。兰保、宝珠、蕙芳、漱芳、玉林都还没有散，只怕总要到四五更天才散呢。」文辉道：「这徐度香也算人间第一个快乐人了。」陆宗沅道：「听说他这个怡园共花了五十多万银子才造成。」杨方猷道：「本来地方也大，也造得过于精致。」文辉道：「我前月逛了一天，还没有逛到一半。」桂保说：「我们今日逛了梅","en":"Master Xu only dispatched me here upon learning you were hosting a banquet. Lanbao, Baozhu, Huifang, Shufang, and Yulin have not yet dispersed; I suspect they will linger until the fourth or fifth watch.\\" Wenhui said, \\"This Xu Duxiang is truly the most carefree and joyous man in the mortal realm.\\" Lu Zongyuan added, \\"I have heard that constructing his Garden of Contentment"}],"6":[{"paragraph":35,"mentions":1,"tokens":["李玉林"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"认得呢？」大家都微笑看着子玉，子玉有口难辩，不觉脸红起来。这出唱过，又看了陆素兰的《舞盘》、金漱芳的《题曲》、李玉林的《偷诗》，都是无上上品，香艳绝伦，子玉唯有向南湘认错而已。","en":"Following this piece, they watched Lu Sulan in 'Dancing on the Tray,' Jin Shufang in 'Inscribing the Song,' and Li Yulin in 'Stealing the Poem'—all superlative performers of unmatched, fragrant brilliance. Ziyu could only bow his head to Nanxiang, acknowledging the magnitude of his earlier error."}],"7":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["李玉林"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说子玉从会馆回来，将琴官的戏足足想了两日，以谓天下之美莫过于此。又将苏蕙芳、陆素兰、金漱芳、李玉林的色艺品评，都为绝顶。细细核来，蕙芳的神色尤胜于诸人，次则素兰可以匹敌。然较比琴官起来，毫厘之间终觉稍逊。又想：","en":"performance, convinced it was the pinnacle of worldly beauty. He also appraised Su Huifang, Lu Sulan, Jin Shufang, and Li Yulin, finding them all to be utterly superlative. Yet upon careful comparison, Huifang's spirit and bearing surpassed the rest, with Sulan as his only true equal. But when measured against Qinguan, even by the finest margin, they all fell slightly short."}],"9":[{"paragraph":28,"mentions":1,"tokens":["李佩仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"还灌我一大碗酒。」众人笑道：「这人醉胡涂了，到底饮了多少酒来？」南湘道：「今日我同高卓然、张仲雨，带了王静芳、李佩仙在酒楼上饮了一天，也不晓得有多少，他们都醉得先走了。我送静芳回去，顺路到庸庵家，问知出外逛灯，我也去逛灯。也不知赶车的什么意思，就拉我到这里，园门口的人说你们在里面赏灯，就扶了我进来。」一面说，就从怀里掏出一团灯谜字条，大家看时：一个是「春风一曲费缠","en":"consume in the end?\\" Nanxiang said: \\"Today I went with Gao Zhuoran and Zhang Zhongyu, bringing Wang Jingfang and Li Peixian, and spent the whole day drinking at the winehouse. I do not know how much it was; they all got drunk and left before me. I saw Jingfang home, then dropped by Yong'an's place on the way. Learning he had gone out to see the lanterns, I went too. I do"}],"12":[{"paragraph":10,"mentions":1,"tokens":["李玉林"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"车马服饰，外面应酬也就不易，所以不能如春航这样。而且他又不喜欢他那些相公，说他所爱的一班不好，春航不服。及见了李玉林来看高品，那一种娟媚韶秀的丰致，比蓉官等似要好些，便此心自讼了几日。","en":"Chunhang admired, saying that the crowd Chunhang loved were not remarkable, and Chunhang disagreed. But then, when Li Yulin came to visit Gao Pin, and Chunhang saw that particular graceful, tender, elegant beauty — which seemed somewhat finer than Rongguan and the others — he spent a few days privately revising his own opinion."}],"14":[{"paragraph":18,"mentions":3,"tokens":["李玉林","玉林"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"就把这对牛弹琴对出来。」蕙芳也不去想他，随口说道：「没有对。」高品道：「见兔放箭。」蕙芳略停一停道：「你们那个李玉林倒属兔，今年十六岁，你去叫了玉兔儿来吧。」春航也要高品去叫玉林，高品也高兴，即打发人叫玉林去了。又吩附备了几样菜。","en":"is no match.\\" Gao Pin said, \\"Seeing a hare, one releases the arrow.\\" Huifang paused a moment, then said, \\"Your Li Yulin is born in the year of the rabbit and he is sixteen this year. Why not go and call that jade rabbit to us?\\" Chunhang also wanted Gao Pin to summon Yulin, and Gao Pin was delighted at the idea; he immediately sent someone to fetch Yulin, and also ordered"},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":6,"tokens":["李玉林","玉林","佩仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"高品急出来看时，不是别人，恰是史南湘左手挽着王兰保，右手携了李玉林，面上已有了几分酒意。又见玉林手内拈了一枝杏花，后面又跟着三四个人。高品见自己的跟班也在院子里，高品问道：「你从何处来？」南湘道：「你叫相公瞒着我，倒问我从何处来？我今日同了静芳到怡园，他们都在家，留我吃了饭。佩仙也在座，还有瑶卿、瘦香两个。吃完了饭","en":"and who should it be but Shi Nanxiang, his left hand clasped around Wang Lanbao's arm and his right hand holding Li Yulin, already a little flushed with wine. Yulin held a sprig of apricot blossom in his hand, and three or four more people followed behind. Gao Pin noticed that his own attendant was in the courtyard, and asked, \\"Where have you come from?\\" Nanxiang said,"},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":2,"tokens":["玉林"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一个官衔你没有说。」蕙芳道：「好像没有了。」高品道：「还有监造兔园册子呢。」南湘又笑。蕙芳不曾理会，即与兰保、玉林在各人面前敬了几杯酒。春航前次已见过玉林，看他丰致嫣然，虽逊蕙芳一筹，然比起从前赏识的一班相公，却高得多。见他桃腮粉腻，莲脸香生，另有一种体态丰姿。见他对高品更觉绸缪，倒像各分出了疆界来。","en":"Catalogue.\\" Nanxiang laughed again. Huifang paid no attention to this, and poured several cups of wine for Lanbao, Yulin, and the others at the table. Chunhang had met Yulin once before; now he saw that Yulin's grace and charm, though falling a step short of Huifang's, was far superior to the general run of young protégés he had previously admired. He noticed the peach-blushed"},{"paragraph":36,"mentions":2,"tokens":["李玉林","玉林"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"那由不得你，你不闻」失意睚眦间，白刃相交加」么？」南湘、春航看着他们，高品对着王兰保作嘴作脸，要他罚蕙芳的酒。李玉林则斜身单香肩，嫣然而笑。兰保也笑道：「你真不喝？」蕙芳有些怕他，只得赔着笑道：「兰哥饶了我罢。」玉林也再三替他讨情，兰保终是不肯，犹罚了蕙芳一杯，方才开交。大家又饮过了一会，忽见蕙芳家内有人来叫蕙芳。蕙芳出去问道：「什么事？那两个醉汉怎样了？」来人答","en":"Chunhang watched them, while Gao Pin pulled faces at Wang Lanbao, urging him to impose more forfeit wine on Huifang. Li Yulin reclined on one shoulder, smiling languidly. Lanbao also laughed: \\"Are you truly not going to drink?\\" Huifang was a little afraid of him, and could only smile along, saying, \\"Lan-ge, please let me off.\\" Yulin pleaded on Huifang's behalf repeatedly, but"},{"paragraph":40,"mentions":1,"tokens":["李玉林"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"大家都笑起来。高品道：「都要罚。第七个奚字轮到我说，为什么要你们抢说？」李玉林便斟起罚酒来，南湘、春航只图说得爽快，倒也意不在罚。南湘饮了五杯，兰保代了两杯。春航饮了三杯，蕙芳代了四杯。","en":"Gao Pin said, \\"You have all earned forfeits. The seventh 'xi' was my turn to cite, so why did you both rush in?\\" Li Yulin duly poured the forfeit cups. Nanxiang and Chunhang had been so eager to recite that they had quite forgotten about the penalties. Nanxiang drank five cups and Lanbao drank two for him. Chunhang drank three cups and Huifang drank four for him."},{"paragraph":41,"mentions":5,"tokens":["李玉林","玉林"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"还没有说，要罚。」因便叫兰保斟酒。高品道：「岂有此理！你们都抢说了，叫我说出什么来？还要罚我，天理良心何在？」李玉林也替高品说情，南湘只得依了，便道：「以粟易之。曰：许子奚……」春航道：「第九个到少。」便想了一想道：「与礼之轻者而比之奚与礼之重者而比之奚。」蕙芳便顿足道：「你何必要说两句？」高品道：「好呵，罚九杯。」蕙芳道：「这不能。」高品那里肯依，先罚蕙芳五杯，","en":"it before me. What am I supposed to say now? And yet you want to penalize me? Where is heaven and conscience?\\" Li Yulin also spoke up on Gao Pin's behalf, and Nanxiang finally relented. Nanxiang then said: \\"'To exchange millet for it.' Therefore, 'Master Xu, for what reason...'\\" Chunhang said, \\"The ninth is left to me.\\" He thought for a while, then said: \\"'Compare it"},{"paragraph":42,"mentions":1,"tokens":["李玉林"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"南湘先送了兰保回去，又送李玉林到门口。","en":"Nanxiang first saw Lanbao home, then escorted Li Yulin to his gate."},{"paragraph":43,"mentions":1,"tokens":["玉林"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"玉林留他进去，南湘道：「天不早了，改日再见罢。」便一径回家。经王恂门口走过，南湘忽然口渴，便叫跟班的进去一问王少爷可睡了没有？跟班的走到门房说知，管门的到书房，探看王恂、颜仲清尚未安睡。门上回过，王恂等便叫请进，史南湘进来。未知后事如何，且听下回分解。","en":"Yulin invited him to come inside; Nanxiang said, \\"It is already late, let us meet again another day.\\" He turned and went straight home. Passing by Wang Xun's gate, Nanxiang suddenly felt thirsty, and sent his attendant inside to ask whether young Master Wang"}],"17":[{"paragraph":3,"mentions":1,"tokens":["佩仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"知在何处聚会？」王恂道：「我家亦可，但无花园子，不如前舟园里好。我们主人六个，添上湘帆七个，媚香、瑶卿、香畹、佩仙、静芳、蕊香、瘦香、小梅共是八个，要三席才可坐，醵分之说，不能预定多少，只好办了再算。」众人道：「极是。」子玉便呆呆的。仲清笑道：「庸庵你这差使办得不周到，要讨人怪的。」王恂尚未回答，南湘道：「何所见而言？」仲清道：「你不见庸庵点将，把一个极要紧的人","en":"Qianzhou's garden. With the six of us as hosts, plus Xiangfan, that makes seven; Meixiang, Yaoqing, Xiangwan, Peixian, Jingfang, Ruixiang, Shouxiang, and Xiaomei make eight. We shall require three tables to seat everyone. As for the pooled funds, we cannot fix an amount in advance; we must simply make the arrangements and settle the accounts thereafter.\\" Everyone agreed."},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":1,"tokens":["李玉林"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"不得仙，亦可脱俗，故尔谨遵台命，鞠跽前来。」文泽道：「此亦同人盛举，瞻仰倾城，为借花献佛耳。」说话间，陆素兰、李玉林、金漱芳同到，随后高、史、颜、王四人偕来，蕙芳一一都谢了。","en":"upon a city-toppling beauty, merely borrowing the flower to offer to Buddha.\\" While they were speaking, Lu Sulan, Li Yulin, and Jin Shufang arrived together, followed by the four—Gao, Shi, Yan, and Wang; Huifang thanked them all one by one."},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":1,"tokens":["玉林"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"定完后，王桂保、林春喜来了，皆见过了。正席上令漱芳、玉林、春喜伺候；左席上令宝珠、兰保、素兰；右席上则蕙芳、桂保二人。分派已定，各人坐了，慢慢的浅斟缓酌起来，正是：","en":"was settled, Wang Guibao and Lin Chunxi arrived and were introduced all around. At the center table, Shufang, Yulin, and Chunxi attended; at the left table, Baozhu, Lanbao, and Sulan; at the right table, Huifang and Guibao. The assignments made, everyone took their seats and began to pour slowly, drinking at a leisurely pace. It was truly:"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":1,"tokens":["玉林"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"家人们撤去残肴，备上香茗鲜果。春喜与桂保到太湖石畔，同坐在芍药栏边闲话；玉林、漱芳已醉卧在海棠花下；兰保在池畔钓鱼；宝珠与蕙芳对弈，素兰观局，南湘、高品在傍为宝珠指点。蕙芳道：「你们三人下我一个。就赢了也不算稀奇。」宝珠道：「我偏不用人教也赢得你。」文泽道：「今日我们亦算极乐了，可惜花部中少了两人，那个还不要紧，第一是琴言不","en":"fragrant tea and fresh fruit. Chunxi and Guibao went to the Taihu stone rockery and sat chatting by the peony hedge. Yulin and Shufang had drunk themselves into a stupor and lay asleep beneath the crabapple blossoms. Lanbao was fishing by the pond. Baozhu and Huifang were playing chess, with Sulan watching the game, while Nanxiang and Gao Pin stood by offering Baozhu advice."},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":1,"tokens":["玉林"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「妙极！我们何不将人花比拟一回，总要从公，不可各存偏见。」于是大家评定：以宝珠为牡丹，蕙芳为芍药，素兰为莲花，玉林为碧桃，漱芳为海棠，兰保为玫瑰，桂保为芙蓉，春喜小而多才，人人钟爱为兰花。八人品题尽合，因又想到琴言、琪官为何花？子云道：「琴言色艺过佳，而性情过冷，比为梅花最是相称，且其酷爱梅，不属庾香将谁属耶？」众人说道；「很是。」高品道：「只怕和靖先生不依，庾","en":"they deliberated together and decided: Baozhu as the peony; Huifang as the herbaceous peony; Sulan as the lotus; Yulin as the green peach blossom; Shufang as the crabapple; Lanbao as the rose; Guibao as the cotton rose. Chunxi, small in stature yet richly talented and beloved by all, was assigned the orchid. The eight assignments all felt fitting. They then wondered"}],"19":[{"paragraph":8,"mentions":1,"tokens":["玉林"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，便道：「很好，叫谁呢？」梅窗笑道：「我意中人却多，又喜欢新鲜，不比人家天天总叫那个人。我前日见联珠班内有个叫玉林，生得很好，一下台就有人同了出去，想是很红的。」聘才道：「料没有琴官好。」梅窗道：「那个琴官？」聘才就把新年看戏的话，略述了些，又道：「这琴官除了梅庾香之外，其余见了总是冰冷的，恐怕叫他不来。」梅窗道：「那里有叫不动的相公，今日你就叫他。」聘才心内想","en":"people who always call the same person every day. The day before yesterday I saw a boy in the Lianzhu troupe named Yulin, very handsome; the moment he stepped off stage someone took him out, so he must be very popular.\\" Pincai said: \\"I expect he's not as good as Qinguan.\\" Meichuang said: \\"Which Qinguan?\\" Pincai briefly recounted the story of watching the opera at New Year's,"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":1,"tokens":["玉林"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"只见那走堂的进来道：「琴官、玉林都说病着不能来，蓉官就来。」聘才原料琴官不来的，只好罢了。倒是杨梅窗心上不快，说道：「怎么叫三个人，倒有两个不来？不知是真病呢，还是推托的？笑梅道：「自然是真病，推托什么。」聘才道：「还有个琪官也是很好的，我正月里叫过他几回，倒是全来的。」聘才又写了","en":"Then the waiter came in and said: \\"Qinguan and Yulin both say they're ill and can't come; Rongguan is coming.\\" Pincai had originally expected Qinguan wouldn't come, so he simply let it be. But Yang Meichuang was displeased in his heart and said: \\"How is it that of three people called, two are not coming?"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":3,"tokens":["玉林"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"道：「你们班里的琪官，还有联珠的蓉官。」二喜道：「蓉官，我出门时见他到三合楼去的，只怕还没有散。」梅窗道：「那玉林是你们同班的，他真有病吗？」二喜道：「玉林阿！不要说起，他同琪官前日都闹了一件事，几乎闹出人命来。他们的师傅，此刻还不依，要去告那个人。琪官今日也不能来的。」于是大家问起什么事，二喜道：「说来话长，且喝两钟再说。」众人又干了几杯。聘才听说琪官闹事，便","en":"the house I saw him going to the Sanhe Restaurant; I expect they haven't broken up yet.\\" Meichuang said: \\"That Yulin is in your troupe too — is he truly ill?\\" Erxi said: \\"Ah, Yulin! Don't even mention it. He and Qiguan both got involved in an incident the day before yesterday, nearly resulting in a loss of life. Their teacher still refuses to let it go and is going"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":15,"tokens":["玉林"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"。坊官们大半是他们一路的，送了去拘禁起来，百般的挫辱，还要师傅拿钱去赎，极少也要百十吊。这是奚十一的行为。你说玉林与琪官怎样闹事呢？就是这奚十一，头一次在玉林家吃酒。玉林是忠厚人，不会奉承的。他却看上了玉林，就是一套衣裳，一对镯子，又赏他师傅四十吊，因此动了火。第二回单请他，叫玉林陪他，并不多请人，他又赏一百吊。玉林是嫌他那个样子，总和他生生儿的，他心上就恼了。","en":"bring money to ransom them, at the very least a hundred strings or so. This is Xi Eleven's behavior. Now, how did Yulin and Qiguan get involved? This same Xi Eleven first drank at Yulin's house. Yulin is an honest, gentle sort, not skilled at flattery. But Xi Eleven took a fancy to him and gave him a set of clothing, a pair of bracelets, and forty strings of cash for"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":3,"tokens":["玉林"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"诉了宝珠，宝珠气极，便进怡园与徐老爷说了。徐老爷就大怒道：「天下有这种东西，就容他这么样，这还了得！」又晓得了玉林之事，即着人去向坊里，连夜把玉林要了出来。一面打算告诉巡城都老爷，要搜他那个桶子，办他。徐老爷是个正直人，说话是不知避人的，不知有人怎样通了风。奚十一也怕闹事，又因银子用完了，西帐也不拉了，赶着在吏部花了钱，告了个资斧不继，出京去了。闻说到天津去了，","en":"such a creature, that anyone would tolerate him behaving like this? This is beyond endurance!' He then learned of Yulin's situation as well, and immediately sent someone to the ward office to have Yulin released overnight. At the same time he considered reporting the matter to the Metropolitan Circuit Censor, intending to have Xi Eleven's barrel confiscated and Xi Eleven"}],"24":[{"paragraph":4,"mentions":3,"tokens":["李玉林","玉林"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，方才打得通他这些浊污。」王恂又问仲雨，仲清答道：「在可善可恶之间，尚识好人，天良未昧。」二人刚说得有趣，忽见李玉林同着桂保来，见过了，遂即坐下，因问道：「这两日不见你们出来，在家作些什么？」王恂道：「也常出去的，我倒总不见你们。」桂保道：「我们近日在怡园演习新戏。」仲清道：「什么新戏呢？」玉林道：「闻得六月初六日荷花生日，华公子要来逛园。度香为他是爱听戏的，即与","en":"between good and ill. He still recognizes decent folk, so his conscience isn't entirely dead.\\" As they bantered, Li Yulin arrived with Guibao; after exchanging greetings, they took their seats. Zhongqing asked, \\"We haven't seen you for two days. Have you been busy at home?\\" Wang Xun added, \\"I go out often, yet I never seem to run into you.\\" Guibao explained, \\"We've been"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":7,"tokens":["玉林","佩仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"止于批《琵琶记》内题出这几个戏名是：《李陵返汉》、《燕丹灭秦》、《诸葛延年》、《明妃归汉》等事，共有八九种。」玉林道：「如今静宜又添了四种是：「《金谷园绿珠投楼》、《马嵬驿杨妃随驾》、《李谪仙夜郎奉诏》、《杜拾遗金殿承恩》，这四本戏更觉热闹，差不多要全部出场。」仲清道：「这四种更妙，为普天下才子佳人吐气。马嵬赐缳之事，千古伤心。且羯胡之叛，祸在国忠，于玉妃何罪？","en":"'Prince Dan Destroys Qin,' 'Zhuge Yan Nian,' and 'The Bright Consort Returns to Han'—eight or nine in total.\\" Yulin continued, \\"Jingyi has added four more: 'Green Pearl Throws Herself from the Golden Valley Garden,' 'Consort Yang Follows the Carriage at Mawei Post,' 'Li the Banished Immortal Receives the Edict at Yelang,' and 'Du the Remonstrator Honored in the Golden"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":3,"tokens":["玉林"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，其实如何吃得这么许多。」说完就同坐了。厨房内闻得有相公，便多备了八个碟子，添了四样菜。先把黄酒、小吃送上来。玉林、桂保各敬了酒，便谈谈讲讲，浅斟低酌了一回。仲清、王恂又问了些近日的事，见玉林不肯喝酒，因问道：「你的酒量很好，为什么今日不喝？」玉林道：「这两天嗓子哑了，受了热，所以不敢喝酒。」仲清又叫拿些水果出来，仲清道：「喝酒不行令，是断不能爽快的。人少又行不","en":"dining, added eight more small dishes and four substantial ones. Yellow wine and little savory bites came first. Yulin and Guibao offered toasts, and the conversation flowed easily as they savored the mellow wine. Zhongqing and Wang Xun asked for more news, but noticing that Yulin was abstaining, they asked why. Yulin explained that his throat was hoarse from the summer"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":2,"tokens":["玉林"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"方才王恂日间听了仲清品评各人的情境，因想起《花谱》中诸旦都也讲究情分的。因问玉林、桂保道：「你们此刻在怡园演习，那十个人，你可晓得他们有几种情性，脾气是那个最好相与，可讲得来么？」桂保道：「这十个却也好几样，内中就是玉侬脾气冷些，其余没有什么脾气。」玉林道：「讲情性风雅，心地聪敏，不慕势利，意气自豪，是瑶卿。一尘不染，灵慧空明，","en":"naturally led his thoughts to the actors of the Catalogue of Flowers and their own emotional temperaments. He asked Yulin and Guibao, \\"Of the ten of you rehearsing at the Garden of Contentment, do you know everyone's true temperament? Whose company is the easiest to keep?\\" Guibao replied, \\"There are ten entirely different sorts. Yunong is by far the coldest, but the rest"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":5,"tokens":["佩仙","玉林"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"的，就是我了。」桂保道：「这是你自己不好下赞语，这考语待我出吧：芳洁自守，风雅宜人，不亢不卑，无好无恶，这些是佩仙。」仲清、王恂同道：「这考语出得很切，足见蕊香近日识见又长了好些。」玉林道：「我却当不起这考语。」王恂道：「还有几个人索性请你批评批评。」桂保笑道：「是谁？」王恂道：「蓉官、二喜、玉美、春林、凤林，这些人又是怎样？」桂保笑道：「这又是一路，不与我们往","en":"nimble of speech, with a graceful bearing—that is Xiaomei. Highly versatile and nursing a romantic self-regard—\\" Yulin nodded toward Guibao, \\"that is him. A secret heart that few can ever truly grasp, steadfast until the seas run dry—that is Yunong. Pure fidelity, entirely heedless of personal gain—that is Yuyan. As for me, I have no merit whatsoever; I am dull, and"}],"25":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["玉林"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说前回书中，玉林、桂保在王恂处，讲起怡园演习新戏，预备华公子逛园。流光荏苒，倏忽一月，刘文泽已回。书中所讲这班名士，华公子向来往来者就是刘文泽一人，其余多未谋面。此时文泽之父刘守正已升了礼部尚书，是以文泽偕其妻星夜赶回，未免有些庆贺之事。又适子云写书前往，文泽回京已","en":"In the previous chapter, Yulin and Guibao at Wang Xun's place were speaking of the new plays being rehearsed at the Garden of Contentment in preparation for Young Master Hua's garden visit. Time flew swiftly; in the blink of an eye a month passed, and Liu Wenze had returned. Of this"}],"30":[{"paragraph":12,"mentions":1,"tokens":["玉林"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"腥浓肥脆。清谈妙语，佐以诙谐。那边席上，聘才问次贤怡园的光景。次贤略述了几处。随后即见宝珠、蕙芳、素兰、漱芳、玉林、兰保、桂保，春喜、琪官等九个，又凑上一个，作了一出《秦淮河看花大会》，有幽闲的，有妖冶的，有静婉的，有风流的，极尽靡艳之致，众人尽皆喝采。子云、次贤等就于此出中间放了赏。华公子对着笑道：「此系抄袭吾兄旧文，殊觉数见不鲜。」子云道：「唱的甚好，贞静的","en":"of the Garden of Contentment. Cixian briefly described a few places. Next came Baozhu, Huifang, Sulan, Shufang, Yulin, Lanbao, Guibao, Chunxi, Qiguan—nine in total—plus one more, performing the play 'Flower-Viewing Assembly on the Qinhuai'. Some were demure, some coquettish, some quiet and gentle, and some romantic, exhibiting the utmost alluring charm. Everyone applauded."}],"31":[{"paragraph":3,"mentions":2,"tokens":["佩仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「妙，妙！待我来分派。」即对着蕙芳道：「媚香是长于诗的，瑶卿是长于丹青的，静芳是长于舞剑的，香畹是长于书法的，佩仙是长于填词的，蕊香是长于猜谜诙谐的，瘦香是长于品箫的，小梅是长于吹笙的。可惜玉侬又病了，他倒会一套《平沙落雁》。」华公子便命叫他起来，又吩咐珊枝拿了琵琶来。家人把些笔砚乐器都搬了出来，分摆在各处。次贤道：「我来点将：先点玉侬与瘦香把琴箫和起来；再点瑶","en":"Yaoqing is skilled in painting, Jingfang is a master of the sword dance, Xiangwan possesses beautiful calligraphy, Peixian is adept at composing lyrics, Ruixiang has a gift for riddles and witty banter, Shouxiang is masterful with the vertical flute, and Xiaomei plays the mouth-organ beautifully. It is only a pity that Yunong has fallen ill, for he plays a wonderful rendition"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":1,"tokens":["李玉林"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"诸人不便来看，又恐怕他画坏了。次贤远远留心，觉得下笔甚快，毫无拘束，已觉面有喜色。那边蕙芳等三人挤在一处。只见李玉林俯首凝思，素兰把串香珠数个不了，蕙芳只管看着宝珠落笔，尚暗暗的指点他。","en":"begun to dawn on his face. Over on the other side, Huifang and his two companions clustered closely together. Li Yulin bowed his head in deep concentration, while Sulan continuously slipped a string of fragrant prayer beads through his fingers. Huifang kept his eyes fixed on Baozhu's brushwork, quietly offering him subtle guidance."},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":1,"tokens":["玉林"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"公子衣襟上。华公子取下闻了一闻，笑道：「你辛辛苦苦的结成，你自己受用罢。」子佩接了，又到那边弄琵琶去了。素兰、玉林也都写出来。先看素兰的是：满泛金樽玉液浓，秋光和霭似春容。\\n嫦娥宫殿层层启，照澈珠帘十二重。","en":"together; you should enjoy it yourself.\\" Zipei took it back and wandered off to fiddle with a pipa. Sulan and Yulin had also finished writing their pieces. First, they looked at Sulan's poem:\\n\\n'The golden goblets brim with rich jade nectar,\\nThe autumn light is as warm and gentle as a face of spring,\\nThe gates of Chang'e's palace unlatch tier upon tier,\\nAs the radiant"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":1,"tokens":["玉林"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，不若改作「广寒宫殿层层启」，不好么？」素兰道：「果然改得好。」始而子云恐素兰不及蕙芳，及到此刻才放了心。再看玉林的填词，填的《一痕沙》小令，看词是：娇舞酣歌深院，绣幕锦屏香软。珠履客三千，集群贤。月若有情留住，人若有情休去。","en":"that Sulan's skills might fall short of Huifang's, but only now did his heart truly settle. They then looked at Yulin's lyric, composed to the tune of 'A Trace of Sand'. The lyric read:\\n\\n'Tender dances and drunken songs fill the deep courtyard,\\nAmidst embroidered curtains and brocade screens, the fragrance is soft.\\nThree thousand guests with pearled shoes,\\nGather the"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":1,"tokens":["玉林"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"字：「集群贤」换作「会群仙」，乱啼声「换作」只三更」，可好么？」众人一齐道：「好。」次贤叫他们快些写上，蕙芳、玉林都要素兰代写，华公子不依，只得各自写了。大家又赏叹一回，于是静坐，听珊枝的琵琶与春喜的笙。珊枝斜坐着拨动檀槽，只见指法如雨洒芭蕉，声韵如滩头流水，满怀春色，绕乱一堂。加之笙韵高低，声声应和。听得人人色舞眉飞，四肢愉快。弹了《月儿高》一套，大家也赞了一","en":"voiced their unanimous approval. Cixian urged them to quickly copy their final drafts onto the scroll. Huifang and Yulin both wanted Sulan to write it out for them, but Young Master Hua would not allow it, insisting they each write their own. After another round of admiration and praise, they sat quietly to listen to Shanzhi's pipa and Chunxi's sheng. Shanzhi sat at an"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":1,"tokens":["李玉林"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"品寓处一问，都已回寓，遂同下车进内，一直走到里面。只听高品一片笑声，夹着些燕语莺声在内。到春航斋中，见苏蕙芳、李玉林在内。高品、春航见了四人进来，不胜欢喜，让坐了，苏、李二相公也都见了。","en":"mingled with the delicate, melodic voices of companions. Upon entering Chunhang's study, they found Su Huifang and Li Yulin inside. Seeing the four men arrive, Gao Pin and Chunhang were overjoyed and quickly offered them seats, while the two xianggong, Su and Li, also stepped forward to exchange greetings."},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":3,"tokens":["玉林","佩仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"蕙芳说起前日在华府中，怎样题诗画画等事，细述了一遍，听得众人欢喜。又叫他们念出来，各人赞了一回，尤赞玉林的词更为工妙。高品道：「强将之下自无弱兵。你们看佩仙这首词，外边那些头巾纱帽作得出来么？」子玉道：「果然。就是华公子这几个字也改得好。」又问了琴言几句，玉林、蕙芳也细细说了，子玉又发起怔来。忽然高品的小使进来请他，说有客要会。高品即忙出去，有好一刻工","en":"listened with great delight, asking them to recite the poems aloud. Everyone offered their praise, singling out Yulin's lyric as the most masterfully crafted. Gao Pin said, \\"Beneath a strong general, there are no weak troops. Looking at Peixian's opening lyric, could those hack scholars in their square caps outside ever produce such work?\\" Ziyu agreed, \\"Indeed. Even"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":1,"tokens":["玉林"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一笑坐下。高品道：「可惜少了一客。」蕙芳问是少谁，高品道：「今日倒不可少潘三。」蕙芳啐了一声，一连敬了几杯酒，玉林也帮着敬酒，吃了几样菜。","en":"really should not be without Pan the Third.\\" Huifang spat in mock disgust, then poured several rounds of wine, with Yulin helping to serve the drinks and dishes."}],"32":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["玉林"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"到春航那里去，犹恐见面有些难以为情。意欲报了再去，心上十分焦急，比春航倒还胜几分。一回见宝珠着人来问信，素兰、玉林着人来问信，闹的蕙芳坐立不安。欲到戏园中，恐怕被人钩搭住了，闷闷的歪在炕上，拿本闲书消遣，看了两页又放下。","en":"anxiety, perhaps even more so than Chunhang's. A while later, Baozhu sent someone to ask for news, and then Sulan and Yulin also sent people to inquire, making Huifang so restless he could neither sit nor stand. He wanted to go to the theater but feared getting entangled with someone, so he lay sullenly on the kang, picked up a leisurely book to distract himself, read two"}],"35":[{"paragraph":10,"mentions":1,"tokens":["玉林"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"是日名旦中有几个不得来，都有堂会戏，不能分身。宝珠之外，来的是蕙芳、素兰、玉林、漱芳四人。这边名士，怡园二位之外，是刘文泽、颜仲清、王恂、田春航、梅子玉五人。共十二人。众客到齐，宝珠先叩谢了。","en":"theatrical engagements and couldn't be in two places at once. Besides Baozhu, the attendees were Huifang, Sulan, Yulin, and Shufang—four in total. On the side of the famous scholars, apart from the two hosts of the Garden of Contentment, there were Liu Wenze, Yan Zhongqing, Wang Xun, Tian Chunhang, and Mei Ziyu—five in total. Together, they made twelve. Once all the"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":1,"tokens":["玉林"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"摆好了坐位，是东西对面八坐，南北对面四坐。文泽、仲清、王恂、春航、子玉、次贤、子云坐了东西，上下是蕙芳、素兰、玉林、漱芳、宝珠。宝珠坐了末位。","en":"Ziyu, Cixian, and Ziyun took the east-west seats, while the upper and lower seats were occupied by Huifang, Sulan, Yulin, Shufang, and Baozhu. Baozhu took the very last seat."},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":3,"tokens":["玉林"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"宝珠想了一会，道：「此句是谁喝酒，我没有算过。」念道：「床上翠屏开六扇。」数到玉林，玉林道：「这句不要是你编的。」素兰道：「你还说天天念诗，连花蕊夫人《宫词》都不记得了。」玉林笑道：正是。我恐怕他有心要我喝酒。」便喝了道：「要说七字了。」想了有半刻工夫，飞到王恂道：「门前才下七香车。」王恂喝了，飞出八字是薛逢《夜宴赠妓》的「愁傍翠","en":"turn this line will land on.\\" He recited, \\"On the bed, the emerald screen opens six panels.\\" The count landed on Yulin. Yulin quipped, \\"I hope you didn't just make this line up.\\" Sulan teased, \\"You claim to recite poetry every day, yet you don't even remember Lady Huarui's 'Palace Lyrics.'\\" Yulin laughed, \\"Exactly. I fear he intentionally wanted me to drink.\\" He drank"},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":2,"tokens":["佩仙","玉林"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"。」蕙芳、宝珠听明了，又说了一遍道：「也不容易，幸亏我们的曲子，还有几枝在肚里。」子云谓次贤道：「索性叫香畹、佩仙坐到这里来，好在一处掷骰，我们与他二人换个坐儿。」次贤、子云与玉林、素兰换了坐位。","en":"easy, though they still had many lyrics committed to memory. Ziyun then instructed Cixian to have Xiangwan and Peixian switch seats so the performers could roll the dice in one designated area, and the seating was adjusted accordingly."},{"paragraph":31,"mentions":1,"tokens":["玉林"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"只见玉林掷了一个二四，念了《闻铃》两句道：「长空孤雁添悲哽，峨嵋山下少人行。」众人也说：「好。」子云道：「就是情景凄凉些。」也各贺了一杯。这边王恂想着了，说道：「我用裴虔余一句，温飞卿一句，合着是：玉搔头袅凤双飞，燕钗落处无声腻。」子云、文泽大赞道：「妙，妙","en":"Yulin rolled a two and a four and recited two lines from *Hearing the Bells*: \\"'A lone goose in the vast sky deepens the grief; beneath Emei few travelers pass.'\\" Everyone agreed it was good, though Ziyun noted the mood was rather bleak; nevertheless, they"},{"paragraph":35,"mentions":1,"tokens":["玉林"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"玉林掷了一个四五，想了一回，念出《絮阁》上两句道：「为着个意中人，把心病挑。俏东君，春心偏向小梅梢。」蕙芳笑道：「这出《絮阁》比《闻铃》好得多了。」于是各贺了两杯。子云道：「我就献丑了。」掣了一根，是花木门的，美人名莲香，花是连理花。子云心上要想两句好的","en":"Yulin rolled a four and a five. After contemplating for a while, he recited two lines from *The Scolding in the Pavilion*: \\"'For the one in my heart, the old heart-sickness stirs. The coy Lord of Spring, his spring-heart leans toward the small plum twigs.'\\""},{"paragraph":36,"mentions":1,"tokens":["玉林"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"句《窥浴》上的曲文道：「两人合一副肠和胃。」仲清拍案叫绝道：「这个是天籁，我们快贺三杯。」于是合席又贺了三杯。玉林掷了个重三，也念《小宴》一句道：「列长空数行新雁。」次贤道：「他们越说越好了，真是他们的比我们的好。」王恂道：「词出佳人口，信然。」春航道：「他们也实在敏捷，我们只好甘拜下风了。」文泽道：「难为他们句句贴切，也从没有人罚过一杯，倒叫人贺了好几十杯。」","en":"is heavenly inspiration! We must quickly toast three cups.\\" And so the entire table toasted another three cups. Yulin rolled double threes and recited a line from *The Small Banquet*: \\"'Across the vast sky, rows of new geese.'\\" Cixian said, \\"Their lines are getting better and better; truly, theirs are better than ours.\\" Wang Xun agreed, \\"Fine words come from the mouths"}],"36":[{"paragraph":8,"mentions":1,"tokens":["李玉林"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"问度香，明日、后日皆可。」三人坐了好些时候，要走了，琴言拉住了不肯放，众人不忍相离，只得坐下。后又来了王桂保、李玉林、金漱芳，大家直等了送殓，拜了，然后才散。琴言穿了孝袍，似乎明日不好出门，只得约定三日后再叙。又叫伍麻子到华府求珊枝转为告假一月，俟出殡后方得进城。华公子准了，又拿了一个衣箱回来，琴言方才放心。","en":"when they tried to leave, Qinyan clung to them, and, reluctant to part, they sat back down. Later, Wang Guibao, Li Yulin, and Jin Shufang arrived. They all stayed until the coffin was sealed, paid their respects, and then departed. Since Qinyan was wearing mourning robes, it seemed improper to go out the next day, so they agreed to meet again in three days. He also sent"}],"37":[{"paragraph":8,"mentions":1,"tokens":["佩仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"：「这三个恶煞，怎么你一齐都遇见了，这也实在为难你。」次贤、王恂皆笑。桂保道：「那个奚十一，我倒没碰见他，就是佩仙、玉艳吃了他的大亏。」琴言道：「我是两次了。」王恂谓桂保道：「你若遇见了奚十一，便怎样呢？」桂保道：「我若遇见了他，也叫他看看桶子，叫个赶车的顽顽他。」说得众人大笑。蕙芳道：「我们如何想个法儿收拾他？」次贤笑道：「你若要收拾他，须得用个苦肉计，恐怕你","en":"Cixian and Wang Xun both laughed. Guibao added, \\"That Xi Eleven, I have never had dealings with him myself, but Peixian and Yuyan suffered badly at his hands.\\" Qinyan noted, \\"For me it has been twice now.\\" Wang Xun asked Guibao what he would do if he ran into Xi Eleven. Guibao replied, \\"If I ran into him, I would have him take a look at the barrel too and let a carter"}],"43":[{"paragraph":3,"mentions":1,"tokens":["佩仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"存余。若四五千吊钱可以出得师，我们代他张罗张罗，或是几个相好中凑凑，也可凑得一半。就说的是你、王氏弟兄、瘦香、佩仙等，想没有不肯的。若能凑出一半，那一半就容易了。」宝珠道：「出师之后怎样呢？」素兰道：「那倒没有商量到这一层。只要出了师，这身子就是自己的了。那自然由得你。」宝珠道：「若在华府中，也与不出师一样，由不得他。」素兰道「华公子也没有买他，他师父当日又没有","en":"of his close acquaintances might each contribute a share. I am speaking of you, the Wang brothers, Shouxiang, Peixian, and the rest. Surely none of them would refuse. If we could gather half, the other half would be easier.\\" \\"And what happens after the release?\\" asked Baozhu. \\"We did not get that far in our discussion,\\" said Sulan. \\"So long as he is released, this person"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":1,"tokens":["佩仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"作此义举么？」蕙芳道：「若说力量，原也勉强，但集腑成裘，也还容易。我与瑶卿、香畹三人可以凑得六百金，王氏弟兄、佩仙、庾香可以凑得四百金。」次贤道：「我来一分，出二百金，前舟可出三百金，庸庵、竹君二人可出三百金。庾香、湘帆、剑潭不必派他，凑起来已得一千八百了。若要三千，还少一千二百两，不消说是度香包圆了。」子云道：「难道华星北倒干干净净，一文不花，这么便宜。」蕙芳","en":"make a coat. The three of us, Yaoqing, Xiangwan, and I, could put together six hundred taels; the Wang brothers, Peixian, and Yuxiang could manage four hundred.\\" \\"I shall contribute my share of two hundred taels,\\" said Cixian, \\"and Qianzhou can put in three hundred; Yong'an and Zhujun together can provide three hundred. We need not call on Yuxiang, Xiangfan, or Jiantan."}],"45":[{"paragraph":12,"mentions":1,"tokens":["玉林"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"了，子玉到了，各人与吉甫相见，叙了些彼此仰慕的话。只有史南湘、田春航在场中未来。相公们到的是宝珠、蕙芳、素兰、玉林、漱芳、兰保、桂保、春喜、琪官、连琴言刚是十人。","en":"Tian Chunhang were still at the examination grounds. Among the performers who came were Baozhu, Huifang, Sulan, Yulin, Shufang, Lanbao, Guibao, Chunxi, and Qiguan. Qinyan made ten in total."},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":5,"tokens":["玉林"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"王胡子上前虔诚默祷，一连叩了九个头。先焚了一通风符，次云符，又鹤符。候了约有半刻时候，要请两位仙童扶乩，便点了玉林、漱芳，二人扶上。又有半刻工夫，不见运动，王胡子又磕了头，再焚个催符。玉林、漱芳呆呆的扶着，见那乩像有些动，玉林把手一拨，便旋转起来，满盘走了一回，画了无数的圈子。玉林疑是漱芳，漱芳疑是玉林，两人对着微笑。那乩画了一回，略停一停，忽又运动，上下往来，","en":"crane talismans. After about a quarter-hour, he needed two \\"immortal youths\\" to hold the planchette, so he named Yulin and Shufang. Another quarter-hour passed, but there was still no motion. Old Wang kowtowed again and burned a hastening charm. Yulin and Shufang held the carrier woodenly. Suddenly, the planchette stirred slightly. Yulin gave it a push, and it spun,"},{"paragraph":33,"mentions":1,"tokens":["佩仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"清芬竟体是兰香，王树琪花列两行。\\n十树琼花十样锦，春风喜气满华堂。\\n众人道：「首句是香畹，次句是佩仙、玉艳，三句总说，末句是小梅。」子云掐指一算，名花已有了八人，只少静芳、蕊香两人了。又见写道：","en":"festive air fill halls with light.\\"\\nThey deciphered the lines together. \\"The first line is Xiangwan. The second is Peixian and Yuyan. The third sums them up, and the last line is Xiaomei.\\" Ziyun counted on his fingers. Eight flowers were named, leaving only Jingfang and Ruixiang missing. Next:"},{"paragraph":43,"mentions":1,"tokens":["玉林"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"道生也笑道：「我也略猜着此，但不知是怎样个始末，何妨与我说明？」子云道：「我要说，又怕有人不依，我不说罢。」玉林对漱芳说道：「起初乩动的时候，我总当着你的手动，我想把我的手不动，教你写不成。后来，不由得我的手也跟着动起来了。」漱芳道：「可不是，我先也打量是你作诡，及至写了一句诗，我还疑惑是作出来的，后来才知不是了。」春喜道：「我们扶的时候手要不动，那乩自己就会","en":"the story? Will you tell me?\\" Ziyun deflected gracefully. \\"If I speak, someone may object. I will keep silent.\\" Yulin turned to Shufang and whispered, \\"When the planchette first moved, I thought your hand moved it. I tried to hold my hand perfectly still so you could not write. But later, my own hand moved completely against my will.\\" Shufang agreed, \\"I thought you"}],"48":[{"paragraph":36,"mentions":1,"tokens":["玉林"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一直送出城外，直到十里之外皇华亭。只见南湘、仲清、文泽、金粟、王恂、子玉、春航，领着那蕙芳、宝珠、素兰、漱芳、玉林、兰保、桂保、琪官、春喜九个名旦，在皇华亭等候。道翁等连忙下车，极口辞谢。各人皆要把盏。","en":"Jin Su, Wang Xun, Ziyu, and Chunhang, alongside Huifang and the nine famous performers: Baozhu, Sulan, Shufang, Yulin, Lanbao, Guibao, Qiguan, and Chunxi. Daoweng hurried down from his carriage and thanked everyone repeatedly, as they all eagerly wished to raise a cup in a final parting toast."}],"53":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["李玉林"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"兰，说明叫他带了前日的扇子来。那日素兰正在蕙芳处商议开那古董铺的事情，苏、陆之外，尚有袁宝珠、金漱芳、王兰保、李玉林要来，大家商议那古董书画等物公凑些起来，也就不少。况且怡园花木极多，尽可分些来应用。我们何不先开起来，再到南边制办，也未尝不可。若要等买齐了，就有两三月耽搁去了。","en":"Huifang's place discussing their plans to open an antique shop. Beyond Su and Lu, Baozhu, Shufang, Lanbao, and Yulin also intended to join. They reasoned that if everyone pooled their antiques, books, and paintings, it would amount to a substantial collection. Moreover, the Garden of Contentment was rich with flowers and trees, which could easily be shared to supply"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":1,"tokens":["玉林"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"：「题个什么名字呢？」蕙芳道：「我想题为九香楼可好么？」素兰道：「好个九香楼，妙极，妙极！」又请了宝珠、漱芳、玉林、兰保等来，大家看了，都极喜欢，同赞素兰能干，叫华公子这般倾倒起来，又赞他题的曲子。素兰颇为得意。","en":"fine name—Nine Fragrance Tower. Exquisite, truly exquisite!\\" Sulan praised.\\n\\nThey then invited Baozhu, Shufang, Yulin, Lanbao, and the others to come see. Everyone examined the goods and was overjoyed. They praised Sulan's capability in winning Young Master Hua over so completely, and applauded the lyric he had composed. Sulan felt quite proud."}],"60":[{"paragraph":5,"mentions":1,"tokens":["玉林"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"拈了杜仙女、琴仙，金粟拈了宝珠，春航拈了蕙芳，仲清拈了琪官，文泽拈了春喜，南湘拈了兰保，王恂拈了桂保，高品拈了玉林，次贤拈了漱芳，单拈不着素兰，只好送与华公子去作了。众人分派已定，子玉说道：「做传容易，画画难，还要刻石，更须时日，不知几天可以告成？」吉甫道：「不消多日，碑是磨现成的，一面画，一面就叫季十矮子找人刻，大约十几天是必要的，嵌好这些碑，也要几天。我们这","en":"drew Huifang; Zhongqing drew Qiguan; Wenze drew Chunxi; Nanxiang drew Lanbao; Wang Xun drew Guibao; Gao Pin drew Yulin; and Cixian drew Shufang. Sulan alone was not drawn, so that assignment was sent to Young Master Hua. The tasks distributed, Ziyu said, \\"Writing biographies is easy, but painting is difficult, and carving stone takes even longer. How many days until"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":1,"tokens":["玉林"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"第七方画的仙女，在两棵玉树之下，有玉树凌风之致，题的是娟娟花史李仙，是高品的诗。琴仙道：「高卓然肯说好话吗？」玉林道：「这一回倒没有刻薄人。」蕙芳道：「这首诗，算卓然极要好的了。」琴仙看是：","en":"Li,\\" accompanied by a poem by Gao Pin. Qinxian asked, \\"Is Gao Zhuoran actually capable of saying nice things?\\" Yulin replied, \\"For once, he hasn't been caustic.\\" Huifang added, \\"For Zhuoran, this poem counts as extremely affectionate.\\" Qinxian read it:"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":2,"tokens":["佩仙","玉林"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，梦中羞作雨云仙。\\n珊瑚枕上生红晕，翡翠楼头锁绿烟。\\n谪往天台守孤另，碧桃流水自年年。\\n琴仙道：「真说得好，将佩仙浓香秀韵一齐写出来了。」玉林道：「这首诗究竟也不甚好，还有些刻薄，你看帐里梦中等句，有什么好呢？」蕙芳道：「这倒没有什么。不过写的娇艳尊贵处。」宝珠道：「卓然这等诗，就算他的好心了。若要他做庄重些，他也未尝不愿，但他那油嘴油舌说这惯一派。你们看他生平","en":"blossoms and flowing waters continue year after year.\\"\\n\\nQinxian said, \\"This is truly well-said; it perfectly captures Peixian's rich fragrance and elegant charm.\\" Yulin countered, \\"Actually, this poem isn't very good, and it still carries a hint of mockery. Look at lines like 'within the bedcurtains' and 'in dreams'—what is so good about those?\\" Huifang replied, \\"That is nothing"},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":1,"tokens":["玉林"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"娟妍，清风往还。望彼竹林，客有笑颜。\\n濯足清涧，抱琴禅关。江皋有梅，篱落有菊。\\n小窗分茶，松花自熟。\\n第三首是玉林题的《仙中趣品》：","en":"chrysanthemums by the hedge.\\nBoiling tea by a small window, the pine pollen ripens on its own.\\"\\n\\nThe third was Yulin's *Witty Grade Among Immortals*:"}]}`),"char-28":JSON.parse(`{"1":[{"paragraph":27,"mentions":3,"tokens":["王兰保","兰保","静芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"火树银花王兰保\\n兰保姓王氏，字静芳，年十七岁。扬州人。隶联锦部。翩若惊鸿，婉若游龙。通词翰，善武技，性尤烈，不屈豪贵，真玉中之铮铮有声者。","en":"Wang Lanbao: Silver Flowers on a Fiery Tree. Lanbao's surname is Wang, his courtesy name Jingfang, and he is seventeen years of age. A native of Yangzhou. He belongs to the Lianjin troupe. He glides like a startled swan and curves like a swimming dragon. Well-versed"},{"paragraph":30,"mentions":1,"tokens":["兰保"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"秋水芙蓉王桂保\\n桂保即兰保之弟，字蕊香，年十五岁，与兄同部。似兰斯馨，如花解语。明眸善睐，皓齿流芳。嬉戏自出天真，娇憨皆生风趣。能翰墨，工牙拍，喜行令诸局戏。善解人意，虽寂寥寡欢者，见之亦为畅满。意态姿媚，而自为范围。其演《乔醋》一出，香亸红酣，真令潘骑省心醉欲死矣。又演《相","en":"Wang Guibao: Lotus in the Autumn Waters. Guibao is the younger brother of Lanbao; his courtesy name is Ruixiang, and he is fifteen years of age, belonging to the same troupe as his brother. He exudes the fragrance of an orchid and is like a flower that understands human speech. His bright eyes are adept at casting enchanting glances;"}],"2":[{"paragraph":35,"mentions":2,"tokens":["兰保"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"陆宗沅坐了第三席，孙亮功坐了第四席，文辉坐了主席。桂保斟了一巡酒，杨方猷命他入席，对着王文辉坐了。文辉问他哥哥兰保为什么不来，桂保道：「今日本都在怡园逛了一天，徐老爷知道这里请客，才打发我来的。兰保、宝珠、蕙芳、漱芳、玉林都还没有散，只怕总要到四五更天才散呢。」文辉道：「这徐度香也算人间第一个快乐人了。」陆宗沅道：「听说他这个怡园共花了五十多万银子才造成。」杨方","en":"which Yang Fangyou invited him to join the table, seating him opposite Wang Wenhui. Wenhui asked why his brother Lanbao had not attended. Guibao explained, \\"Today we spent the entire day touring the Garden of Contentment. Master Xu only dispatched me here upon learning you were hosting a banquet. Lanbao, Baozhu, Huifang, Shufang, and Yulin have not yet dispersed; I suspect"}],"9":[{"paragraph":28,"mentions":2,"tokens":["王静芳","静芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"我记得你还灌我一大碗酒。」众人笑道：「这人醉胡涂了，到底饮了多少酒来？」南湘道：「今日我同高卓然、张仲雨，带了王静芳、李佩仙在酒楼上饮了一天，也不晓得有多少，他们都醉得先走了。我送静芳回去，顺路到庸庵家，问知出外逛灯，我也去逛灯。也不知赶车的什么意思，就拉我到这里，园门口的人说你们在里面赏灯，就扶了我进来。」一面说，就从怀里掏出一团灯谜字条，大家看时：一个是「春风","en":"you actually consume in the end?\\" Nanxiang said: \\"Today I went with Gao Zhuoran and Zhang Zhongyu, bringing Wang Jingfang and Li Peixian, and spent the whole day drinking at the winehouse. I do not know how much it was; they all got drunk and left before me. I saw Jingfang home, then dropped by Yong'an's place on the way. Learning he had gone out to see the lanterns, I"}],"14":[{"paragraph":29,"mentions":3,"tokens":["王兰保","静芳","兰保"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"高品急出来看时，不是别人，恰是史南湘左手挽着王兰保，右手携了李玉林，面上已有了几分酒意。又见玉林手内拈了一枝杏花，后面又跟着三四个人。高品见自己的跟班也在院子里，高品问道：「你从何处来？」南湘道：「你叫相公瞒着我，倒问我从何处来？我今日同了静芳到怡园，他们都在家，留我吃了饭。佩仙也在座，还有瑶卿、瘦","en":"Gao Pin hurried out to look, and who should it be but Shi Nanxiang, his left hand clasped around Wang Lanbao's arm and his right hand holding Li Yulin, already a little flushed with wine. Yulin held a sprig of apricot blossom in his hand, and three or four more people followed behind. Gao Pin noticed that his own attendant was in the courtyard, and asked, \\"Where"},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":1,"tokens":["兰保"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「还有一个官衔你没有说。」蕙芳道：「好像没有了。」高品道：「还有监造兔园册子呢。」南湘又笑。蕙芳不曾理会，即与兰保、玉林在各人面前敬了几杯酒。春航前次已见过玉林，看他丰致嫣然，虽逊蕙芳一筹，然比起从前赏识的一班相公，却高得多。见他桃腮粉腻，莲脸香生，另有一种体态丰姿。见他对高品更觉绸缪，倒像各分出了疆界来。","en":"Garden Catalogue.\\" Nanxiang laughed again. Huifang paid no attention to this, and poured several cups of wine for Lanbao, Yulin, and the others at the table. Chunhang had met Yulin once before; now he saw that Yulin's grace and charm, though falling a step short of Huifang's, was far superior to the general run of young protégés he had previously admired. He noticed the"},{"paragraph":33,"mentions":4,"tokens":["王兰保","兰保"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"又看那王兰保，却是史南湘最得意的，春航倒有些怕他。柳眉贴翠，含娇处亦复含嗔。凤眼斜睃，似有情亦似有怒。径行自遂，倜傥不羁。年纪十七岁，是个武旦，学得一手好拳脚。南湘是个放浪形骸之外的人，从前初识兰保时，也曾大闹过几场，以后倒又相好起来。兰保也知南湘的性情、脾气，","en":"Then he noticed Wang Lanbao, the one Shi Nanxiang held in highest favor, and Chunhang felt a touch of awe before him. Willow eyebrows pressed close and green, containing both coquetry and vexation. Phoenix eyes cast sidelong glances that seemed to carry both sentiment and suppressed"},{"paragraph":35,"mentions":3,"tokens":["兰保"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"偏是春航输得多了，以后便不肯饮。南湘命兰保斟了一杯酒，去灌春航。兰保即拿着酒来，走到春航面前，蕙芳知春航不能饮酒，便凑着兰保的手饮了。","en":"Chunhang kept losing, and after a while refused to drink any more. Nanxiang ordered Lanbao to pour a cup and make Chunhang drink it. Lanbao rose and walked over to Chunhang with the wine; but Huifang, knowing that Chunhang could not hold his drink, leaned forward and drank it from Lanbao's hand for him."},{"paragraph":36,"mentions":6,"tokens":["兰保","王兰保"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"兰保笑道：「这干你什么事？要你越俎而代？」蕙芳笑道：「这叫做借他人之杯酒，浇自己之垒块。」兰保道：「既然如此，倒请多干几杯。」便斟了几满杯酒，要蕙芳饮。蕙芳道：「我不爱饮了，适可而止。」兰保道：「那由不得你，你不闻」失意睚眦间，白刃相交加」么？」南湘、春","en":"Lanbao laughed: \\"What does this have to do with you? Must you step in and act in another's place?\\" Huifang laughed: \\"This is what is called borrowing another's cup of wine to wash away one's own sorrows.\\" Lanbao said, \\"In that case, please drain a few more"},{"paragraph":39,"mentions":1,"tokens":["兰保"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"轮到南湘，南湘便顿住了口，一时倒想不出来。高品道：「罚了五杯，我代你说。」南湘又想了一会没有，只得饮了三杯，兰保代了两杯。高品说道：「是亦为政，奚……」南湘道：「怎么我就想不着。」春航也想了一会道：「虞不用百里奚……」南湘拍着桌子道：「罚得冤！有庳之人奚……」春航、高品都赞好，应轮到高品说第七个，春航便抢说道：「则子事我者也，奚．…．」南湘便指着高品道；「如此","en":"say it for you.\\" Nanxiang thought a while longer and could not recall a passage, so he drank three cups while Lanbao drank two on his behalf. Gao Pin said: \\"'This too is governance, for what reason...'\\" Nanxiang said, \\"How could I not think of that one!\\" Chunhang thought for a while and said: \\"'Yu did not employ Baili Xi...'\\" Nanxiang slapped the table: \\"Unfairly penalized!"},{"paragraph":40,"mentions":1,"tokens":["兰保"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"七个奚字轮到我说，为什么要你们抢说？」李玉林便斟起罚酒来，南湘、春航只图说得爽快，倒也意不在罚。南湘饮了五杯，兰保代了两杯。春航饮了三杯，蕙芳代了四杯。","en":"Chunhang had been so eager to recite that they had quite forgotten about the penalties. Nanxiang drank five cups and Lanbao drank two for him. Chunhang drank three cups and Huifang drank four for him."},{"paragraph":41,"mentions":4,"tokens":["兰保","王兰保"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"高品催南湘说第八个奚字，南湘道：「第七个你还没有说，要罚。」因便叫兰保斟酒。高品道：「岂有此理！你们都抢说了，叫我说出什么来？还要罚我，天理良心何在？」李玉林也替高品说情，南湘只得依了，便道：「以粟易之。曰：许子奚……」春航道：「第九个到少。」便想了一想道：「与礼之轻者而比之奚与礼之重者而比之奚。」蕙芳便顿足道：「你何","en":"the eighth 'xi'; Nanxiang said, \\"You have not yet given the seventh, so you must be penalized.\\" He called upon Lanbao to pour wine. Gao Pin said, \\"This is outrageous! You both rushed in and said it before me. What am I supposed to say now? And yet you want to penalize me? Where is heaven and conscience?\\" Li Yulin also spoke up on Gao Pin's behalf, and Nanxiang finally"},{"paragraph":42,"mentions":1,"tokens":["兰保"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"南湘先送了兰保回去，又送李玉林到门口。","en":"Nanxiang first saw Lanbao home, then escorted Li Yulin to his gate."}],"17":[{"paragraph":3,"mentions":1,"tokens":["静芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"处聚会？」王恂道：「我家亦可，但无花园子，不如前舟园里好。我们主人六个，添上湘帆七个，媚香、瑶卿、香畹、佩仙、静芳、蕊香、瘦香、小梅共是八个，要三席才可坐，醵分之说，不能预定多少，只好办了再算。」众人道：「极是。」子玉便呆呆的。仲清笑道：「庸庵你这差使办得不周到，要讨人怪的。」王恂尚未回答，南湘道：「何所见而言？」仲清道：「你不见庸庵点将，把一个极要紧的人遗漏了","en":"Qianzhou's garden. With the six of us as hosts, plus Xiangfan, that makes seven; Meixiang, Yaoqing, Xiangwan, Peixian, Jingfang, Ruixiang, Shouxiang, and Xiaomei make eight. We shall require three tables to seat everyone. As for the pooled funds, we cannot fix an amount in advance; we must simply make the arrangements and settle the accounts thereafter.\\" Everyone agreed. Ziyu"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王兰保"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"面说：「徐老爷同萧老爷来了。」众人一齐出厅迎接，只见子云同了次贤翩翩的，俨似太原公子裼裘而来，后面随着袁宝珠、王兰保二人。再后还有八个清俊书童，拿着衣包、铜盆、漱盂等物。","en":"came Ziyun and Cixian, moving gracefully as scions of great families draped in their furs, with Yuan Baozhu and Wang Lanbao following behind. Further back were eight bright-faced and handsome young attendants carrying clothing bundles, bronze basins, and rinsing vessels."},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":1,"tokens":["兰保"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"定完后，王桂保、林春喜来了，皆见过了。正席上令漱芳、玉林、春喜伺候；左席上令宝珠、兰保、素兰；右席上则蕙芳、桂保二人。分派已定，各人坐了，慢慢的浅斟缓酌起来，正是：","en":"were introduced all around. At the center table, Shufang, Yulin, and Chunxi attended; at the left table, Baozhu, Lanbao, and Sulan; at the right table, Huifang and Guibao. The assignments made, everyone took their seats and began to pour slowly, drinking at a leisurely pace. It was truly:"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":1,"tokens":["兰保"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"家人们撤去残肴，备上香茗鲜果。春喜与桂保到太湖石畔，同坐在芍药栏边闲话；玉林、漱芳已醉卧在海棠花下；兰保在池畔钓鱼；宝珠与蕙芳对弈，素兰观局，南湘、高品在傍为宝珠指点。蕙芳道：「你们三人下我一个。就赢了也不算稀奇。」宝珠道：「我偏不用人教也赢得你。」文泽道：「今日我们亦算极乐了，可惜花部中少了两人，那个还不要紧，第一是琴言不来，使庾香不能畅意。」子云道","en":"peony hedge. Yulin and Shufang had drunk themselves into a stupor and lay asleep beneath the crabapple blossoms. Lanbao was fishing by the pond. Baozhu and Huifang were playing chess, with Sulan watching the game, while Nanxiang and Gao Pin stood by offering Baozhu advice. Huifang said: \\"Three of you against my one; even if you win it is hardly a surprise.\\" Baozhu said:"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王兰保"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"文泽道：「冯子都如今有个冯子佩，倒像弟兄呢。」子云道：「冯子佩原不错，他有一种脾气，他偏不肯在群花堆里取乐。」王兰保冷笑道：「他自然不肯在我们堆里，他见我们还要生气呢。」子玉道：「何故？」桂保接口道：「他有他的心肠。」子玉接道：「绮席花筵日易夜。英华美可咏同车。」二轮又到次贤，遂写道：「元白诗原结莲社。红氍毹上艳情多。」子云接道：「惯唱《丁娘十索》歌。葑菲彩无遗下","en":"is actually not bad; he has one particular trait: he simply refuses to take pleasure among the flower company.\\" Wang Lanbao said with a cold laugh: \\"Of course he won't join our crowd; he actually gets annoyed when he sees us.\\" Ziyu said: \\"Why so?\\" Guibao cut in: \\"He has his own feelings about it.\\" Ziyu continued:\\n\\n\\"Brocade seat and flower banquet, day turns easily to night;"},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":1,"tokens":["兰保"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"拟一回，总要从公，不可各存偏见。」于是大家评定：以宝珠为牡丹，蕙芳为芍药，素兰为莲花，玉林为碧桃，漱芳为海棠，兰保为玫瑰，桂保为芙蓉，春喜小而多才，人人钟爱为兰花。八人品题尽合，因又想到琴言、琪官为何花？子云道：「琴言色艺过佳，而性情过冷，比为梅花最是相称，且其酷爱梅，不属庾香将谁属耶？」众人说道；「很是。」高品道：「只怕和靖先生不依，庾香割了他靴革幼子了。」","en":"Huifang as the herbaceous peony; Sulan as the lotus; Yulin as the green peach blossom; Shufang as the crabapple; Lanbao as the rose; Guibao as the cotton rose. Chunxi, small in stature yet richly talented and beloved by all, was assigned the orchid. The eight assignments all felt fitting. They then wondered what flowers Qinyan and Qiguan should be. Ziyun said: \\"Qinyan's"}],"20":[{"paragraph":9,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王兰保"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"橹之声，宛转彩莲之曲，正是水光如镜，楼台倒影，飞燕低掠，游鱼仰吹，须臾之间已过红桥，慢慢拢桥，慢慢拢过来。只见王兰保掖起罗衫，盘了辫发，鬓边倒插一枝榴花，手中拿一根小小的紫竹篙，一面撑，一面赶那些家凫野鸭，倒惊得鸳鸯、溪鸟乱飞起来。又有一个白鹭鸶，竟迎着阑干翩然而来，到了檐前，把翅一侧，已飞上山岩去了。","en":"bubbles. In an instant they had passed the red bridge and drifted slowly, slowly in to moor. One could now see Wang Lanbao with the hem of his silk robe tucked up, his braid coiled atop his head, a pomegranate blossom tucked behind his ear; holding a slender purple-bamboo punting pole, he pushed the boat along while shooing away the domestic and wild ducks, startling the"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":3,"tokens":["静芳","王兰保"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一渡，庶不寂寞。湘娥洛神，江湄游戏，我度香先生当以玉佩要之。」大家笑了一笑，群旦上来都见过了。次贤道：「你们看静芳窄袖踟蹰的，越显得风流跌宕。竹君之赞语「翩若惊鸿，婉若游龙」，真觉得摹拟入神。」南湘道：「静芳之倜傥，媚香之灵慧，瑶卿之柔婉，瘦香之妍静，香畹之丰韵，皆是天仙化人。若以其艺而观，则赵飞燕之掌上舞，张静婉之帐中歌，可以彷佛。」子云请客登舟，南湘等上得船","en":"Everyone laughed. All the young dan actors came up and made their greetings all around. Cixian said: \\"Look at the way Jingfang's narrow-sleeve movement stops and starts with an ease and flow — it really brings out an air of free and graceful charm. Zhujun's praising words — 'Gliding like a startled wild goose, swaying like a wandering dragon' — one feels truly captures the essence.\\""},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":1,"tokens":["兰保"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"圆桌。此会是宾主四人，名花五人。子云便要穿衣，经史、田三位止住，只得就便服送了酒，依齿而坐。东首是南湘，子云命兰保坐在肩下。西首是春航，肩下是蕙芳。\\n上面是次贤，肩下是漱芳。","en":"him; so they sent round the wine in informal attire, seating by seniority. To the east sat Nanxiang; Ziyun asked Lanbao to sit at his shoulder. To the west sat Chunhang, with Huifang at his shoulder. At the head sat Cixian, with Shufang at his shoulder."},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":1,"tokens":["兰保"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"再打通关一转。」南湘道：「这一回太多了，三杯我就喝，这通关免了罢。」子云道：「免是不能免的，况且你是个大量。」兰保道：「打通关或用半杯，或一杯分作三消罢。」众人亦皆依了。南湘吃了三杯，即与春航豁起拳来，倒也连胜了三拳，又打了一个通关，共吃了十二杯酒。","en":"let the general round be waived.\\" Ziyun said: \\"Waiving is not allowed; and moreover you have a great capacity.\\" Lanbao said: \\"For the general round, perhaps use half a cup, or split one cup into three portions.\\" Everyone agreed. Nanxiang drank three cups, then began finger-guessing with Chunhang, and actually won three rounds in a row; then played out the general round;"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":2,"tokens":["兰保"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「况且是你亲手写在筹上的，如今怎好翻悔？」南湘道：「你如要改令，方才我们又何必照样呢？」蕙芳无奈，踌躇了半天，兰保笑道：「报应之快，如今是真要上那姓潘的当了。」众人不甚明白，只道是筹上的潘金莲，却不晓得兰保是听见潘三的事。春航心内明白，只低头不语。蕙芳听了一发脸红，也不理他，只得拿了一杯酒，站起来靠着宝珠道：「叔叔，你吃这杯罢？」宝珠正在吃菜，不提防蕙芳叫他这一","en":"to change the game, why did we follow ours as prescribed?\\" Huifang had no choice and hesitated for a long time. Lanbao laughed: \\"Retribution comes swiftly — now you're truly going to play Pan Jinlian's role for real.\\" The company did not entirely understand, assuming Lanbao meant only the Pan Jinlian on the tally — not knowing that Lanbao had heard about the Pan Qiguan"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":2,"tokens":["兰保"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"于是再看筹时是兰保的。那面是：「鲁智深醉打山门。」注：「先饮一大杯，首二坐为金刚，每人豁三拳。」蕙芳道：「他就这等便宜，我偏这么啰嗦。」兰保照令行了，与南湘、春航各豁了三拳。","en":"They then looked at the next tally — it was Lanbao's. The inscription read: \\"Lu Zhishen Drunken at the Mountain Gate.\\" The annotation: \\"First drain one large cup; the first two seats are the Guardian Kings; finger-guess three rounds with each.\\" Huifang said: \\"He gets off so easily, while I had to go"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":2,"tokens":["王兰保","静芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"要跪在烂泥里，那时莲钩倒摸不着，摸着的是条驴腿。」说得众人哄然狂笑起来，把个金漱芳笑得闪了腰，直跌到次贤怀里。王兰保、陆素兰笑得走开了。宝珠道：「此又是报应，天理昭彰，一毫不爽的。」大家笑得春航十分难受，又不好认真，只得忍住道：「竹君刻薄，应该罚他一个恶令。」南湘笑道：「我是据实而言，何刻薄之有？」蕙芳道：「你也够了，不要说嘴，晓得也有失风时候。」次贤笑道：「瑶卿","en":"uncontrollable laughter; Jin Shufang laughed so hard he twisted at the waist and tumbled straight into Cixian's lap. Wang Lanbao and Lu Sulan laughed and moved away. Baozhu said: \\"Another case of heavenly retribution — perfectly clear and precise.\\" Everyone kept laughing, which made Chunhang quite uncomfortable; yet unable to take it seriously, he had to hold it in and say: \\"Zhujun's"}],"24":[{"paragraph":5,"mentions":1,"tokens":["静芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"、老、丑有二十余个，是五六班凑成的。」仲清道：「旦脚十个是谁？」桂保道：「我们两个之外，尚有瑶卿、媚香、香畹、静芳、瘦香、小梅，后来又添了玉侬、玉艳，共是十个。」王恂道：「这就是十美班了。」桂保道：「陪客尚未定，你们是一定在数的。听得度香已写书子到保定府去，请前舟回来商议，只怕就是这件事。」王恂道：「也近了，今日已是二十六日了，还有十天，就演得全这些新戏吗？」玉","en":"\\"Who are the ten dan performers?\\" Guibao replied, \\"Besides the two of us, there are Yaoqing, Meixiang, Xiangwan, Jingfang, Shouxiang, and Xiaomei. Yunong and Yuyan joined later, making ten in all.\\" Wang Xun said, \\"That makes a Ten-Beauties company.\\" Guibao added, \\"The guest list isn't entirely settled yet, but you two are certainly included. I heard Duxiang wrote to Baoding"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":1,"tokens":["静芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"心怀好胜，是媚香。温文俊雅，出言有章，和而不流，婉而有致，要算香畹。言语爽直，风度高超，雅俗咸宜，毫无拘束，是静芳。恬静安详，言语妥贴，是瘦香。","en":"poised—that would be Xiangwan. Frank talk, a lofty manner, welcoming to both high and low with a free spirit, is Jingfang. Quiet ease and perfectly apt words belong to Shouxiang."}],"27":[{"paragraph":21,"mentions":4,"tokens":["王兰保","兰保"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"小门，上了毛房。只听得叩门之声，见院子内东基角上有一小后门，叩得乱响，即问道：「是那个？」外面应道：「我是对门王兰保，叫我送西瓜来与琴言的。」琴言听了，叫人开了门。那人挑着四个西瓜进来，说道：「兰保说，这瓜好，送给你的。我从着后门进来，省了半里路。」琴言叫人封了二百钱给他，回去道谢，又问兰保在家，那人道在家，仍往后门去了。素兰解手毕，琴言即开了一个瓜，两人吃时，甚","en":"a knocking, and the postern in the east corner rattled. \\"Who is there?\\" A voice answered from outside, \\"It is Wang Lanbao from across the way, sending melons over for Qinyan.\\" Qinyan had the gate opened, and a porter carried in four watermelons and said that Lanbao thought well of the fruit and had come by the back gate to save half a li of walking. Qinyan gave him two"},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":4,"tokens":["兰保"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"长庆受了这一场打骂，不敢哼一声，关上门，即叫人到兰保处找回琴言，素兰连兰保也送了过来。大家说起这奚十一一味凶蛮，真是可怕，只怕其中又有人调唆出来，日后还不肯干休。一个魏聘才冤仇未解，又添出个奚十一来，如何是好？说得长庆更无主意，越发害怕，琴言只是哭泣。兰保道：「我有一个好主意，只劝得玉侬依了，倒是妥当","en":"Changqing took that beating mutely, shut the gate, and sent someone to Lanbao's house for Qinyan. Sulan had sent Lanbao back as well. They all spoke of Xi Eleven's savage, lawless temper and agreed that a man who could erupt so suddenly was frightening indeed. Perhaps someone had stirred him up, and he wouldn't rest. The feud"}],"28":[{"paragraph":4,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王兰保"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"日天气凉爽，早饭后到素兰处，先叫云儿问了在家，素兰闻知甚喜，忙出迎进。只见房内走出两人来：子玉看时，认得一个是王兰保；一个是琪官，因多时不见他，即看了他一看。见他杏脸搓酥，柳眉耸翠，光彩奕奕，袅娜婷婷，年纪与素兰彷佛，身量略小些，上前见了。","en":"delighted and hurried out to welcome him in. However, two others emerged from the room: Ziyu recognized one as Wang Lanbao, and the other as Qiguan. Not having seen Qiguan for some time, Ziyu took a closer look. His apricot face was like kneaded cream, his willow brows arched like verdant peaks. Radiant and gracefully slender, he appeared about the same age as Sulan, though"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":4,"tokens":["兰保","静芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉道：「今日实不料香畹处尚有佳客。」兰保道：「这就是你的小姨子，你们会过亲没有？」子玉道：「这是什么话？那里有这个称呼？」素兰道：「这个称呼倒也通。」琪官也不好意思，便道：「静芳不要取笑。」兰保道：「这倒也不算取笑，你是玉侬的师弟，可不是他的小姨吗？」子玉笑道：「岂有此理。」说着遂各坐下。","en":"Ziyu said, \\"I truly did not expect Xiangwan to be hosting such distinguished guests today.\\" Lanbao teased, \\"This is your little sister-in-law. Have you two paid your familial respects yet?\\" Ziyu replied, \\"What kind of talk is this? Where does such a title come from?\\" Sulan chimed in, \\"Actually, the title makes some sense.\\" Qiguan felt embarrassed"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":5,"tokens":["静芳","兰保"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"门的，这两天又没人到我那里，如何晓得外面的事？」琪官笑了一笑，素兰道：「你真不知道，我只得告诉你，你且坐稳了。静芳、玉艳，你两个扶住了他，待我再说。」子玉道：「香畹一向直爽，今日何故作这些态度？想来也没有什么奇事，故作惊人之语耳。」素兰又把子玉看了又看，惹得兰保、琪官皆笑。子玉看他们光景，着实心疑，便道：「香畹，你且说来。」素兰又怔了一怔道：「说倒有些难说，有件","en":"small smile, while Sulan said, \\"Since you truly don't know, I have no choice but to tell you. But brace yourself. Jingfang, Yuyan, you two support him while I explain.\\" Ziyu replied, \\"Xiangwan, you have always been straightforward. Why adopt these dramatic airs today? Surely it cannot be anything so astonishing; you are merely trying to startle me.\\" Sulan looked at Ziyu"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":1,"tokens":["兰保"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"独活，这是芍药，这是防己。」琪官拿起笔来写了，却想不出意思。素兰道：「他离开了你，便是独活了，我懂得这一味。」兰保道：「防己是防自己的身子，好叫你放心。那两样实在想不出来。」子玉含着眼泪道：「玉侬的心事全见于此，这芍药一名将离，言进了华府是已经离的了。既离了，自然是独活了。独活在华府中，难道浮沉俯仰与众人一样？自然自己必定小心谨慎，刻刻预防，守身如玉。这牵牛没有","en":"riddle. Sulan offered, \\"He has been separated from you, so he is now 'living alone' (Duhuo). I understand that one.\\" Lanbao added, \\"Fangji means to 'guard oneself,' telling you to rest assured. But I truly cannot fathom the other two.\\" Ziyu, tears shimmering in his eyes, said softly, \\"Yunong's entire heart is revealed here. This peony, Shaoyao, is also known as Jiangli, meaning"}],"30":[{"paragraph":12,"mentions":1,"tokens":["兰保"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"脆。清谈妙语，佐以诙谐。那边席上，聘才问次贤怡园的光景。次贤略述了几处。随后即见宝珠、蕙芳、素兰、漱芳、玉林、兰保、桂保，春喜、琪官等九个，又凑上一个，作了一出《秦淮河看花大会》，有幽闲的，有妖冶的，有静婉的，有风流的，极尽靡艳之致，众人尽皆喝采。子云、次贤等就于此出中间放了赏。华公子对着笑道：「此系抄袭吾兄旧文，殊觉数见不鲜。」子云道：「唱的甚好，贞静的却极贞","en":"Garden of Contentment. Cixian briefly described a few places. Next came Baozhu, Huifang, Sulan, Shufang, Yulin, Lanbao, Guibao, Chunxi, Qiguan—nine in total—plus one more, performing the play 'Flower-Viewing Assembly on the Qinhuai'. Some were demure, some coquettish, some quiet and gentle, and some romantic, exhibiting the utmost alluring charm. Everyone applauded."}],"31":[{"paragraph":3,"mentions":2,"tokens":["静芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"」诸旦默默无言，子云与文泽站起来道：「妙，妙！待我来分派。」即对着蕙芳道：「媚香是长于诗的，瑶卿是长于丹青的，静芳是长于舞剑的，香畹是长于书法的，佩仙是长于填词的，蕊香是长于猜谜诙谐的，瘦香是长于品箫的，小梅是长于吹笙的。可惜玉侬又病了，他倒会一套《平沙落雁》。」华公子便命叫他起来，又吩咐珊枝拿了琵琶来。家人把些笔砚乐器都搬了出来，分摆在各处。次贤道：「我来点将","en":"us assign the tasks.\\" Turning to Huifang, he said, \\"Meixiang excels in poetry, Yaoqing is skilled in painting, Jingfang is a master of the sword dance, Xiangwan possesses beautiful calligraphy, Peixian is adept at composing lyrics, Ruixiang has a gift for riddles and witty banter, Shouxiang is masterful with the vertical flute, and Xiaomei plays the mouth-organ beautifully."},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":3,"tokens":["兰保"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"竹。」张仲雨道：「方才嫌子佩的不响，所以他第一句就从响字作出来。」此时晓风飘飘，晨钟已鸣，东方发白，华公子即催兰保舞剑。兰保扎起双袖，掣出青锋，先展个门户，却也抑扬顿挫，满眼生光，到后来竟是一道寒光，连人也看不见了。大家痛赞了一阵。兰保舞完，已是红霞满天，朝曦欲上。今日是中秋，各人未免俱各有事，都告辞起身。华公子不便再留，整衣送客。","en":"through the air, the morning bells were tolling, and the eastern sky was turning white. Young Master Hua urged Lanbao to perform his sword dance. Lanbao rolled up his double sleeves, drew a gleaming blade, and struck an opening stance. The movements were rhythmic and powerful, filling the room with blinding flashes of light, until at the very end, there was nothing"}],"36":[{"paragraph":7,"mentions":2,"tokens":["王静芳","静芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"宝珠道：「他如今要我们叫他为三爷，若叫他三哥，他就爱理不理的。他也只好在那八龄面前装声势，充老手。你不记得从前王静芳在燕□堂要打他么？如今见了静芳，还不瞅不睬的，记着前恨呢。」琴言道：「华公子的情性，虽算不得十分古怪，然有时却也捉摸不定。偏是他上去，怎么说怎么好，没有碰过钉子，这也是各人缘分了。真是随机应变，总没有一句答不上来，也算难为他。」素兰道：「我听得说，他","en":"dares to throw his weight around and act the veteran in front of the Eight Ages. Don't you remember when Wang Jingfang almost beat him up at the Yan… Hall? Now, when he sees Jingfang, he completely ignores him, still holding a grudge.\\" Qinyan said, \\"Young Master Hua's temper isn't entirely eccentric, but it's unpredictable. Yet whenever Shanzhi is summoned, whatever"}],"37":[{"paragraph":4,"mentions":1,"tokens":["静芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"」桂保谓子玉道：「今年我们还是头一回见面。」子玉道：「正是，我却出来过几次，总没有见你。」宝珠道：「今日香畹与静芳苦了，处处有他们的戏，是再不能来了。」子云道：「我算有六七人可来，谁晓得都不能来。」将到午正，桂保往外一望，道：「玉侬来了！」大家一齐望着他进来。子玉见他比去年高了好些，穿一套素淡衣裳，走入梅花林内，觉得人花一色，耀眼鲜明。大家含笑相迎，琴言上前先见","en":"agreed, noting that although he had been out several times, he had never run into him. Baozhu said, \\"Xiangwan and Jingfang are having a hard time of it today, as they are scheduled to perform everywhere and simply cannot get away.\\" Ziyun said, \\"I thought I could count on six or seven people, but who could have known they would all be unavailable?\\" As midday approached, Guibao"}],"42":[{"paragraph":15,"mentions":1,"tokens":["兰保"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"见过的，又记不清，请了安。那个大傻子，他们却见过他，在园子里听衬戏的，便也请了安。大傻子迷迷盹盹的说道：「今日兰保的《盗令》、《杀舟》，桂保的《相约》、《相骂》，实是个名人家数，他人做不来的。」亮轩道：「你们还认得我么？」天福道：「有些面善，想不起来，好像那里见过的。」天寿眼瞪瞪的看了一会，问道：「你能是不是去年同一位吃烟的老爷来？那位吃烟的同我师父打起来，还是","en":"member at the garden theater, and they greeted him as well. Dasha, in his vague and muddled way, said: \\"Today Lanbao's 'Stealing the Token' and 'Killing in the Boat,' and Guibao's 'The Rendezvous' and 'Mutual Scolding,' those are the true accomplishments of a master. No one else can do what they do.\\" Liangxuan said, \\"Do you still know me?\\" Tianfu said, \\"The face is"}],"45":[{"paragraph":12,"mentions":1,"tokens":["兰保"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，各人与吉甫相见，叙了些彼此仰慕的话。只有史南湘、田春航在场中未来。相公们到的是宝珠、蕙芳、素兰、玉林、漱芳、兰保、桂保、春喜、琪官、连琴言刚是十人。","en":"were still at the examination grounds. Among the performers who came were Baozhu, Huifang, Sulan, Yulin, Shufang, Lanbao, Guibao, Chunxi, and Qiguan. Qinyan made ten in total."},{"paragraph":33,"mentions":1,"tokens":["静芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"气满华堂。\\n众人道：「首句是香畹，次句是佩仙、玉艳，三句总说，末句是小梅。」子云掐指一算，名花已有了八人，只少静芳、蕊香两人了。又见写道：","en":"sums them up, and the last line is Xiaomei.\\" Ziyun counted on his fingers. Eight flowers were named, leaving only Jingfang and Ruixiang missing. Next:"},{"paragraph":44,"mentions":1,"tokens":["兰保"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琪官道：「这神仙也不知怎么来的，就这样快，就像在这园子里一样，真是心动神知了。」兰保道：「那杜兰仙与玉侬同姓，所以关切得很，把他的前事都说出来了，总成了这件好事。」","en":"They are so swift, as if they live right here in this garden. Truly, 'the mind moves, and the spirit knows.'\\" Lanbao noted thoughtfully, \\"Du Lanxiang shared Yunong's surname. She cared for him. She told his whole story and brought about this wonderful blessing.\\""}],"46":[{"paragraph":53,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王兰保"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"正饮酒间，王兰保、金漱芳、秦琪官、林春喜同来见了，即分开坐了，谈了些闲话。子云道：「今日这二十四副对子，清芬浓艳，各尽所长。但我看来，始终要推道翁先生的赐书楼、承荫堂冠冕堂皇了。」众名士道：「自然，我们到底觉得力薄，那里能这样大方，这是勉强不来的。」道翁道：「这也不","en":"While they were at their food and wine, Wang Lanbao, Jin Shufang, Qin Qiguan and Lin Chunxi all came in and paid their respects, and sat down apart, and there was some idle talk.\\n\\nZiyun said, \\"These twenty-four couplets today are fresh or rich by turns, and every man has done his best. But to my mind"}],"47":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["兰保"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"到了四月十一日，春航、南湘报中进士，南湘中了二十一名，春航中了三十四名，两人不消说都欢喜，把个蕙芳、兰保也乐得说不出来。南湘此番在京，借住在文泽处，因去年乃翁赴任时，将住宅卖去。蕙芳因春航在文泽处，虽彼此相安，但他出进虽没人说话，也常要到门房走走，因此觉得不甚便当。","en":"graduates—Nanxiang placing twenty-first and Chunhang thirty-fourth. Their delight went without saying, while Huifang and Lanbao were too overjoyed for words. Since his father had sold their residence upon leaving for his post last year, Nanxiang had been boarding with Wenze. Though Chunhang also stayed there and they lived amicably enough, Huifang often had to pass through the"}],"48":[{"paragraph":12,"mentions":1,"tokens":["兰保"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"闲时又有宝珠、素兰、兰保、漱芳等一班名旦，不是垂帘度曲，就是对酒当歌。南湘素有才名，如今加上个翰林名号，更有那求文求诗的接踵而来。他又怕烦，常请金粟、子玉等代笔。至于不要紧的，连琴仙、蕙芳、素兰、宝珠的佳章都有在里面，好在人人说好，没有一个看得出来。南湘本要接夫人来京，一因","en":"During their leisure time, renowned performers like Baozhu, Sulan, Lanbao, and Shufang would join them, either singing behind screens or drinking and harmonizing with their melodies. Nanxiang already possessed a literary reputation, and now, adorned with a Hanlin title, requests for essays and poems poured in endlessly. Detesting"},{"paragraph":36,"mentions":1,"tokens":["兰保"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"出城外，直到十里之外皇华亭。只见南湘、仲清、文泽、金粟、王恂、子玉、春航，领着那蕙芳、宝珠、素兰、漱芳、玉林、兰保、桂保、琪官、春喜九个名旦，在皇华亭等候。道翁等连忙下车，极口辞谢。各人皆要把盏。","en":"Wang Xun, Ziyu, and Chunhang, alongside Huifang and the nine famous performers: Baozhu, Sulan, Shufang, Yulin, Lanbao, Guibao, Qiguan, and Chunxi. Daoweng hurried down from his carriage and thanked everyone repeatedly, as they all eagerly wished to raise a cup in a final parting toast."}],"52":[{"paragraph":5,"mentions":4,"tokens":["王兰保","兰保"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"触景伤情，颇有一人向隅之惨，众人也都会意。忽不见了高品，子云命书童去找他，找到戏房后头，找着了。见高品在那里教王兰保的戏，兰保点头而笑。高品出来，装出正经样子，连笑话也都不说一句。少顷，王兰保来请点戏，送到子云面前，子云点了一出《乔醋》，高品点了一出《当巾》。《乔醋》唱了，《当巾》却是兰保扮了小生，倒作得人情逼肖。春航是个聪明人，已知高品奚落他，便说道：「这李亚仙","en":"vanished. Ziyun sent a pageboy to search for him, eventually discovering him behind the stage, cheerfully coaching Wang Lanbao on his performance while Lanbao nodded with a smile. When Gao Pin returned, he put on a deeply solemn face, not uttering a single joke. Shortly after, Wang Lanbao came forward to request their choices for the repertoire, presenting the list to Ziyun."},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":1,"tokens":["兰保"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云道：「他是沾的露，你又怎么说他沾的泥呢？」众人皆笑。作到来兴进去，轿夫出来赶打，兰保跌了一交，便改了口白，说道：「罢了！罢了！被他一路赶来，跌了一身泥垢。且喜七叔赠我这件衣衫，我且去当了，也可听得两天。阿哟！兀的不想杀小生也。」众人听了，个个骇异道：「忽然讲些什么？」","en":"laughter. When the scene reached the point where Laixing went inside and the sedan-carriers chased and beat him, Lanbao staged a dramatic tumble and improvised his spoken lines, exclaiming, \\"Enough! Enough! Chased all this way, I've fallen and covered myself in mud and dirt. Happily, Seventh Uncle gifted me this garment; I shall go pawn it, which should pay for a couple"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":1,"tokens":["兰保"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"仔细一想，便大笑起来。高品只是微笑，众人心里早已明白。又听得兰保唱那《玉抱肚》的曲子道：","en":"laughter. Gao Pin merely smiled faintly, for everyone already understood exactly what he was hinting at. Then Lanbao began to sing the aria *Yu Bao Du*:"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":1,"tokens":["兰保"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"我只得门前窥伺，跟随他绣幰香车。忍羞惭要乞青眸顾，应怜辱在泥涂，回肠如路，双轮一碾一嗟吁，怎笑倚。\\n兰保唱到此，也要笑了，子云等连声喝采，诸人乱叫起「好」来。春航满面通红，指着高品骂道：「我只道你别过了一年，自然也改恶从善，谁道还是这副歪心肝。」高品道：「这才骂得奇，我又讲了什么？这不是自己栽了筋斗埋怨地皮么？」","en":"each turn of the twin wheels draws a sigh—how can I smile and lean on them?\\"\\nAs he reached the end of the line, Lanbao himself nearly broke character and laughed. Ziyun and the others shouted their applause, cheering wildly. Chunhang blushed a deep scarlet, pointing at Gao Pin as he cursed, \\"I thought that after a year away, you would naturally have reformed your wicked"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":1,"tokens":["兰保"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"纷纷搬运。张仲雨跑过来，跑过去，指这样，说那样。门外人声嘈杂，苏蕙芳发赏封，上号簿，一个人那里打发得开，又叫了兰保、素兰来相帮，足足闹了两三个时辰，尚未清楚。里头许三姐也帮着手忙脚乱，同着那些陪房的摆这样，安那样，闹得一身的汗，一件绸衫子沾住了背心，腰也酸了，脚也疼了，喝了一碗凉茶，把扇子扇了一会，再来收拾。春航忙进城谢妆去了。","en":"envelopes and tallied the registry books, but he could scarcely keep pace with the chaos, prompting him to call Lanbao and Sulan to assist. The commotion dragged on for four to six hours and was still not fully settled. Inside, Xu Third Sister frantically helped the dowry attendants arrange this and place that; drenched in sweat, her silk shirt clinging to her back,"}],"53":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王兰保"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"人去叫素兰，说明叫他带了前日的扇子来。那日素兰正在蕙芳处商议开那古董铺的事情，苏、陆之外，尚有袁宝珠、金漱芳、王兰保、李玉林要来，大家商议那古董书画等物公凑些起来，也就不少。况且怡园花木极多，尽可分些来应用。我们何不先开起来，再到南边制办，也未尝不可。若要等买齐了，就有两三月耽搁去了。","en":"Sulan was at Huifang's place discussing their plans to open an antique shop. Beyond Su and Lu, Baozhu, Shufang, Lanbao, and Yulin also intended to join. They reasoned that if everyone pooled their antiques, books, and paintings, it would amount to a substantial collection. Moreover, the Garden of Contentment was rich with flowers and trees, which could easily be shared"},{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["兰保"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"好，器皿什物皆有。我们一班人全进去，也住不满他。只要作些橱柜等物，一完备就可开张，中秋前后尽来得及了。」漱芳、兰保同声说：「好！」又说：「就这么着，我们大家去找度香商量。」正商议间，忽见素兰的人进来说：「华公子打发人叫，立等进城。」素兰道：「他叫几个人？」那人道「就叫你一个，说叫带了扇子去。」素兰道：「我道他叫我作什么，原来是为这把扇子。」蕙芳道：「这扇子一定是","en":"we build a few display cabinets, we'll be ready to open. We could easily make it by mid-autumn.\\"\\n\\nShufang and Lanbao chimed in unison, \\"Excellent!\\" They added, \\"Let's settle it then. We will all go find Duxiang to discuss this.\\"\\n\\nJust as they were deliberating, Sulan's servant hurried in and reported, \\"Young Master Hua has sent someone to summon you. He is waiting"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":1,"tokens":["兰保"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"个什么名字呢？」蕙芳道：「我想题为九香楼可好么？」素兰道：「好个九香楼，妙极，妙极！」又请了宝珠、漱芳、玉林、兰保等来，大家看了，都极喜欢，同赞素兰能干，叫华公子这般倾倒起来，又赞他题的曲子。素兰颇为得意。","en":"name—Nine Fragrance Tower. Exquisite, truly exquisite!\\" Sulan praised.\\n\\nThey then invited Baozhu, Shufang, Yulin, Lanbao, and the others to come see. Everyone examined the goods and was overjoyed. They praised Sulan's capability in winning Young Master Hua over so completely, and applauded the lyric he had composed. Sulan felt quite proud."}],"58":[{"paragraph":11,"mentions":2,"tokens":["王兰官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"了长庆的媳妇回扬州去了，此话绝无对证。三人讲了些闲话，奚十一便问大傻子，那些相公在什么地方。大傻道：「今日就只王兰官、苏蕙芳在家，其余都出门去了。」奚十一道：「我要看看花，你同我们去。」大傻便领了奚、姬二人，从东边进了一重门，见是一带游廊，假山层迭，花木扶疏，大大小小盆景有几千盆，有楼有阁，有台有池，甚是有趣。来到一所正楼之下，见有冷金笺写的一匾为「九香楼」，是殿","en":"checked. The three chatted, and Xi Eleven asked Big Fool where the actors were. Big Fool replied, \\"Today only Wang Lanbao and Su Huifang are home, the rest are out.\\" Xi demanded, \\"I want to see the flowers, so take us.\\" Big Fool led Xi and Ji through an east door into a gallery of layered rockwork, scattered trees, and thousands of pots large and small. There were pavilions,"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":1,"tokens":["兰保"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"打我。我们才买了两盆金橘，两盆佛手，要抬回去，被他摘得干干净净，气人不气人？问问他，他开口就骂人。」那边蕙芳、兰保都出来看，却不认得英官，也不认得姬亮轩。","en":"Buddha's-hand to carry home, and he stripped them bare. Is it maddening or not? Ask him, he cursed first.\\" Huifang and Lanbao came out to look, but they knew neither Yingguan nor Ji Liangxuan."},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":2,"tokens":["兰保"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"奚十一听了许久，忍不住出来，见众人劝开了，但心中甚怒。望见芙蓉花外站着两个玉人，认得是蕙芳、兰保，觉得光辉相映，不觉涎垂起来，便说道：「你们这些相公好不讲理，怎么无缘无故的就打起人来？」蕙芳一看，认的是奚十一，便拉了兰保进去了。奚十一大怒，他也不管有客，便闯过桥去，亮轩跟着。大傻子一想这事情有些不好，便把灯收了，自己躲起来，免得带累他受气。奚十","en":"stay inside. Everyone had separated, but he was furious. Beyond the hibiscus two jade figures stood, Huifang and Lanbao, their light reflecting between them until his mouth watered. He challenged them, \\"You actors are unreasonable. Why hit someone for nothing?\\" Huifang recognized Xi Eleven, pulled Lanbao, and went inside. Xi raged. Ignoring the guests, he charged across"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":1,"tokens":["兰保"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一大怒，即将桌子一掀，碗盏砸了好些，大骂起来，里头也大骂。奚十一如何能忍，要赶进去打架，亮轩却劝住，只见蕙芳、兰保出来，对奚十一点点头，道：「尊驾为什么发气，到小店来照顾什么？敢是敝伙计们得罪了。」奚十一听了，火上添油，圆睁两眼，大喝道：「你别支起那屁架子，我照顾你？我要带你到安吉堂吃饭，还要留你过夜呢。」","en":"from within. He could not endure it and would have rushed in to fight, but Liangxuan restrained him. Huifang and Lanbao emerged, nodded to Xi, and asked, \\"Why the anger, sir? What business brings you to our humble shop? Did our people offend you?\\" Xi felt like oil was poured on fire, his eyes rounded, and he roared, \\"Drop that pose! I patronize you? I'd take you to Anjitang"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":5,"tokens":["兰保"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"蕙芳气得满面通红，尚未回答，兰保已大怒，说道：「这个人真混账，认也认不得，就闹起来，敢是个疯子？」奚十一听了，抢过来就抓兰保，兰保已按住他的手，说道：「你要怎样？」奚十一也不回言，那只手又飞过一掌来，兰保一闪，就将他胁下一扠，奚十一踉踉跄跄，直跌出去，奚十一自知要跌，幸记得后头有张","en":"Huifang flushed crimson, not yet speaking, when Lanbao flared, \\"What a brute! Barely introduced and he makes a scene. Is he a madman?\\" Xi lunged for Lanbao, but Lanbao caught his hand and demanded, \\"What do you want?\\" Xi said nothing, but his other hand flew. Lanbao dodged and jabbed him under the ribs,"}],"60":[{"paragraph":5,"mentions":1,"tokens":["兰保"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"前生缘法，子云拈了道翁，子玉拈了杜仙女、琴仙，金粟拈了宝珠，春航拈了蕙芳，仲清拈了琪官，文泽拈了春喜，南湘拈了兰保，王恂拈了桂保，高品拈了玉林，次贤拈了漱芳，单拈不着素兰，只好送与华公子去作了。众人分派已定，子玉说道：「做传容易，画画难，还要刻石，更须时日，不知几天可以告成？」吉甫道：「不消多日，碑是磨现成的，一面画，一面就叫季十矮子找人刻，大约十几天是必要的，","en":"and Qinxian; Jin Su drew Baozhu; Chunhang drew Huifang; Zhongqing drew Qiguan; Wenze drew Chunxi; Nanxiang drew Lanbao; Wang Xun drew Guibao; Gao Pin drew Yulin; and Cixian drew Shufang. Sulan alone was not drawn, so that assignment was sent to Young Master Hua. The tasks distributed, Ziyu said, \\"Writing biographies is easy, but painting is difficult, and carving stone"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":1,"tokens":["兰保"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"吉甫的嘴也不能让他。」又看第八方，画一个仙女，玉貌锦衣，腰悬秋水，似公孙大娘模样。题曰：侠隐花史王仙。琴仙知是兰保，下看史南湘的七古：","en":"legendary sword-dancer Lady Gongsun. The title read: \\"Xiayin Flower Historian, Immortal Wang.\\" Qinxian knew this was Lanbao, and read the seven-character ancient verse by Shi Nanxiang below it:"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":4,"tokens":["王兰保","兰保"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"请看世上黄衫客，多少恩仇报不成。\\n琴仙赞道：「这首七古，实在做得好，念去比《公孙大娘舞剑器行》还刻画得入细。」王兰保笑而不言。蕙芳道：「去年奚十一闹来，幸亏着他，我就没有法了。」素兰道：「原来你也怕奚十一，难道他比潘三还利害么？」蕙芳道：「潘三是个无用的人，那奚十一闹起来，就与前日魏聘才使来的车夫一样，你怕不怕？」兰保道：「那天适或我不在家，你便怎样？」蕙芳道：「","en":"exceptionally well-crafted. Reading it, the details are even more vivid than in *Ballad of Lady Gongsun's Sword Dance*.\\" Wang Lanbao merely smiled without speaking. Huifang said, \\"When Xi Eleven caused that uproar last year, we were lucky to have him, or I would have been completely at a loss.\\" Sulan asked, \\"So even you were afraid of Xi Eleven? Is he really more formidable than Pan"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":1,"tokens":["静芳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"与静宜、庾香这两个赞语，倒是切定题目说的。」琴仙道：「都切得很。你将这些诗更换了人，便不像了。」宝珠道：「只有静芳那一首，再不能更换的。」琴仙再看第十一方，画一个杏花，下有一个仙女，珠腰玉衱，十分妩媚，题曰：及第花史。知是琪官，看颜仲清的序文：","en":"fitting. If you swapped the poems around to different people, they wouldn't make sense anymore.\\" Baozhu added, \\"Only Jingfang's piece is absolutely irreplaceable.\\" Qinxian then looked at the eleventh panel, depicting an apricot blossom with a fairy maiden standing beneath it, her pearl sash and jade pendants looking utterly captivating. The title read: \\"Jidi Flower Historian.\\""},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王兰保"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"诙谐，淳于隐藏。颠倒四座，纵横满堂。\\n言不为虐，行不失方。悠哉悠哉，聊复尔尔。\\n弥勒一笑，皆大欢喜。\\n第四首是王兰保题的《仙中狂品》：","en":"taking things as they come.\\nWith a single smile from Maitreya, everyone is filled with great joy.\\"\\n\\nThe fourth was Wang Lanbao's *Wild Grade Among Immortals*:"}]}`),"char-29":JSON.parse(`{"1":[{"paragraph":30,"mentions":3,"tokens":["王桂保","桂保","蕊香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"秋水芙蓉王桂保\\n桂保即兰保之弟，字蕊香，年十五岁，与兄同部。似兰斯馨，如花解语。明眸善睐，皓齿流芳。嬉戏自出天真，娇憨皆生风趣。能翰墨，工牙拍，喜行令诸局戏。善解人意，虽寂寥寡欢者，见之亦为畅满。意态姿媚，而自为范围。其演《乔醋》一出，香亸红酣，真令潘骑省心醉欲死","en":"Wang Guibao: Lotus in the Autumn Waters. Guibao is the younger brother of Lanbao; his courtesy name is Ruixiang, and he is fifteen years of age, belonging to the same troupe as his brother. He exudes the fragrance of an orchid and is like a flower that understands"},{"paragraph":50,"mentions":3,"tokens":["桂保"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"见王恂问那人道：「你这相公叫什么名字？」那人道：「叫保珠。」子玉听了，忍不住一笑。又见王恂问道：「你不在桂保处么？」那人道：「桂保处人多，前日出来的。这保珠就住在桂保间壁，少爷今日叫保珠伺候？」王恂支吾，那保珠便拉了王恂的手问道：「到什么地方去，也是时候了。」王恂道：「改日罢。」那相公便缠住了王恂，要带他吃饭。子玉实在坐不住了，又恐王恂要拉他同去，不如先走","en":"\\"He's called Baozhu.\\" Hearing this, Ziyu couldn't suppress a laugh. He then heard Wang Xun ask, \\"Aren't you with Guibao?\\" The man answered, \\"There are too many people at Guibao's place; he left there a few days ago. This Baozhu lives right next door to Guibao. Will the young master call for Baozhu to serve him today?\\" Wang Xun offered a noncommittal reply. That Baozhu"}],"2":[{"paragraph":32,"mentions":3,"tokens":["王桂保","桂保"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"亮功正要与他儿子说话，适值王桂保进来，见了亮功并王恂、仲清，也站在一边。亮功看看桂保，对他儿子说道：「你们回去，不要说什么。」嗣徽兄弟会意答应，于是亮功即拉了桂保进去。","en":"Lianggong was on the verge of addressing his sons when Wang Guibao entered the courtyard. Spotting Lianggong, along with Wang Xun and Zhongqing, he also stepped respectfully aside. Lianggong glanced at Guibao before instructing his sons, \\"Return home immediately, and utter not a single word.\\" Sihui and his brother,"},{"paragraph":35,"mentions":6,"tokens":["桂保"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"却说孙亮功同了桂保进来，见过主人。不多一刻，客已全到，便安起席来。这些客都是文辉同年，论年纪孙亮功最长，因系姻亲，便让兵部员外杨方猷坐了首席。对面是光禄寺少卿周锡爵。监察御史陆宗沅坐了第三席，孙亮功坐了第四席，文辉坐了主席。桂保斟了一巡酒，杨方猷命他入席，对着王文辉坐","en":"Meanwhile, Sun Lianggong entered with Guibao and formally greeted the host. Within a short time, all the guests had arrived, and they arranged themselves for the banquet. These guests were all Wang Wenhui's fellow graduates. As Sun Lianggong was the eldest and a relative by marriage, they offered"},{"paragraph":36,"mentions":3,"tokens":["蕊香","桂保"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"上了几样菜，文辉道：「这样清饮无趣，蕊香你出个令罢。」桂保道：「打擂最好，什么都放得进去。」孙亮功道：「完了！把个令祖宗请了来了。」文辉命人取了六个钱来。周锡爵道：「这杯分个大小才好。」杨方猷道：「我们两个一杯三开罢。「陆宗沅道：「未免太少些，你们一杯两开，我们都是一杯一开何如？」俱各依允","en":"After several dishes were served, Wenhui proposed, \\"Drinking plainly like this lacks flavor. Ruixiang, why don't you initiate a drinking game?\\" Guibao suggested, \\"The '擂' (lei/challenge) game is best, it accommodates any rule.\\" Sun Lianggong groaned, \\"We are doomed! We have invited the very patriarch of drinking games.\\" Wenhui instructed the servants"},{"paragraph":37,"mentions":3,"tokens":["桂保"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，我们六个人竟以六杯为率，不必增减，准他一杯化作几杯就是了。也没有闷雷霹雷，那个猜着，就依令而行，最为剪截。」桂保便问杨方猷道：「第一杯怎样喝？」杨方猷道：「一杯化作三杯，找人豁拳。」又问孙亮功：「第二三杯怎样喝？」亮功道：「两杯都装作小旦敬人。」周锡爵道：「我们这样的胡子，倒有些难装。」亮功道：「只要做作得好，便有胡子也不妨。」桂保又问陆宗沅道：「第四杯呢？」","en":"whoever guesses correctly simply executes the game's designated action. That is the most straightforward method.\\" Guibao then turned to Yang Fangyou, \\"What is the rule for the first cup?\\" Yang Fangyou replied, \\"One cup becomes three, finger-guessing with your partner.\\" He then asked Sun Lianggong, \\"What about the second and third cups?\\" Lianggong decreed, \\"Both cups entail"},{"paragraph":39,"mentions":2,"tokens":["桂保"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"周锡爵道：「两杯化作六杯，花字飞觞。」桂保先问文辉道：「几个？」文辉道：「一个。」顺手便问亮功道：「几个？」亮功伸着两指道：「就是两个。」桂保笑道：「好猜手，一猜就着。」放开手看时，正是两个。遂取了三个杯子，斟满了酒，放在亮功面前。亮功道：「这是杨四兄的令，就和你豁。」杨方猷道：「我是半杯说","en":"Xijue proposed, \\"Two cups become six, utilizing a 'flying toast' featuring the character for 'flower' (hua).\\" Guibao first addressed Wang Wenhui, \\"How many?\\" Wenhui answered, \\"One.\\" Without pausing, he asked Lianggong, \\"How many?\\" Lianggong raised two fingers, \\"Exactly two.\\" Guibao laughed, \\"An excellent guesser, correct on the very first try.\\" Opening his hand, he"},{"paragraph":40,"mentions":2,"tokens":["桂保"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"气的道「敬杨老爷一杯酒，务必赏个脸儿。」说着，把眼睛四下里飞了一转，宛然联锦班内京丑谭八的丑态，引得合席大笑，桂保笑得如花枝乱颤，杨方猷只得饮了一杯。孙亮功掐了一枝梅花，插在帽边，又取了一个大杯，捻手蹑脚的走到陆宗沅面前，斟了酒道：「陆都老爷是向来疼我的，敬你这一杯。」陆宗沅道：「这大杯如何使得？」孙亮功道：「想来都老爷是要吃皮杯的。」说罢呷了一口，送到宗沅嘴边","en":"grotesque antics of the famous comic actor Tan Ba from the Lianjin troupe. The entire table convulsed with laughter, Guibao shaking like a branch of blossoms in the wind. Yang Fangyou had no choice but to down the cup. Sun Lianggong then plucked a sprig of plum blossom, tucked it jauntily into the brim of his hat, seized a large cup, and crept stealthily toward Lu Zongyuan."},{"paragraph":41,"mentions":16,"tokens":["桂保"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"众人道：「这个断使不得，改一句罚十杯。」桂保斟了一杯酒道：「请孙老爷后庭花饮酒。」众人重新又笑。亮功把桂保拧了一把，也喝了。下手是王文辉飞觞，桂保把嘴向孙亮功一呶，文辉会意，便道：「桃花细逐杨花落。」轮应陆宗沅、孙亮功各一杯。陆宗沅因亮功喷了他酒，便道：「无可奈何花落去。」接着杨方猷便道：「索","en":"The group protested unanimously, \\"Absolutely not! Changing a single word incurs a ten-cup penalty.\\" Guibao poured a cup and said, \\"I invite Master Sun to savor the 'Rear Courtyard Flowers' wine.\\" The table erupted into laughter once more. Lianggong pinched Guibao playfully and drank the wine. Next, it was Wang Wenhui's turn to issue a flying toast. Guibao"},{"paragraph":42,"mentions":2,"tokens":["桂保"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"文辉赏了桂保二十两银子，桂保谢了，走到书房来找王恂、仲清，谈了一会，说道：「我们班里新来了两个：一个叫琴官，一个叫琪官，生得色艺俱佳，只怕史竹君的《花选》又要翻刻了。」又坐了一会也自回去。不知后事如何，且听下回分解。","en":"Wenhui rewarded Guibao with twenty taels of silver. After expressing his gratitude, Guibao made his way to the study in search of Wang Xun and Zhongqing. They conversed for a time before Guibao revealed, \\"Two new performers have recently joined our troupe, one named Qinguan,"}],"4":[{"paragraph":32,"mentions":4,"tokens":["蕊香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"四岁，若教他学上两年，怕赶不上他们？」春喜道：「我原不肯做的，他们定要我做。今日大家的诗，都也没有什么好，但就蕊香与我倒了平仄，因此蕊香定了第七，我定了第八，我以后再不做这不通诗了。等我学了一年，再与他们来。」又说道：「我们班里来了两个新脚色，一个叫琴官，一个叫琪官，你们见过没有？」仲清道，「前日蕊香说起两人来，刚说时就有人来打断了，没有说下去。」王恂问道：「这","en":"at all, but they absolutely insisted I do. Today none of the poems were anything remarkable; it was only that Ruixiang and I got the tonal pattern wrong. As a result, Ruixiang was placed seventh and I was placed eighth. Never again shall I write such incompetent poetry. Let me study for a year and then come back and compete with them.\\" Then he added, \\"Two new performers"}],"17":[{"paragraph":3,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蕊香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"？」王恂道：「我家亦可，但无花园子，不如前舟园里好。我们主人六个，添上湘帆七个，媚香、瑶卿、香畹、佩仙、静芳、蕊香、瘦香、小梅共是八个，要三席才可坐，醵分之说，不能预定多少，只好办了再算。」众人道：「极是。」子玉便呆呆的。仲清笑道：「庸庵你这差使办得不周到，要讨人怪的。」王恂尚未回答，南湘道：「何所见而言？」仲清道：「你不见庸庵点将，把一个极要紧的人遗漏了，岂不","en":"With the six of us as hosts, plus Xiangfan, that makes seven; Meixiang, Yaoqing, Xiangwan, Peixian, Jingfang, Ruixiang, Shouxiang, and Xiaomei make eight. We shall require three tables to seat everyone. As for the pooled funds, we cannot fix an amount in advance; we must simply make the arrangements and settle the accounts thereafter.\\" Everyone agreed. Ziyu sat in a"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":1,"tokens":["桂保"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"红，宝珠道：「今日的客，尚短几人？」文泽道：「就止寿翁一人。花部中未到的尚有四人：琴言、琪官都有病，早来辞了，桂保、春喜是必来的。等湘帆一到，就可坐了。」","en":"flower contingent, four are absent: Qinyan and Qiguan are both ill and sent their regrets early this morning; Guibao and Chunxi will certainly be here. Once Xiangfan arrives, we can take our seats.\\""},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":2,"tokens":["王桂保","桂保"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"定完后，王桂保、林春喜来了，皆见过了。正席上令漱芳、玉林、春喜伺候；左席上令宝珠、兰保、素兰；右席上则蕙芳、桂保二人。分派已定，各人坐了，慢慢的浅斟缓酌起来，正是：","en":"Once the seating was settled, Wang Guibao and Lin Chunxi arrived and were introduced all around. At the center table, Shufang, Yulin, and Chunxi attended; at the left table, Baozhu, Lanbao, and Sulan; at the right table, Huifang and Guibao. The assignments made, everyone took their seats and"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":1,"tokens":["桂保"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"家人们撤去残肴，备上香茗鲜果。春喜与桂保到太湖石畔，同坐在芍药栏边闲话；玉林、漱芳已醉卧在海棠花下；兰保在池畔钓鱼；宝珠与蕙芳对弈，素兰观局，南湘、高品在傍为宝珠指点。蕙芳道：「你们三人下我一个。就赢了也不算稀奇。」宝珠道：「我偏不用人教也赢得你。」文泽道：「今日我们亦算极乐了，可惜花部中","en":"The servants cleared away the remaining dishes and set out fragrant tea and fresh fruit. Chunxi and Guibao went to the Taihu stone rockery and sat chatting by the peony hedge. Yulin and Shufang had drunk themselves into a stupor and lay asleep beneath the crabapple blossoms. Lanbao was fishing by the pond. Baozhu and Huifang were playing chess, with Sulan"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":1,"tokens":["桂保"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"脾气，他偏不肯在群花堆里取乐。」王兰保冷笑道：「他自然不肯在我们堆里，他见我们还要生气呢。」子玉道：「何故？」桂保接口道：「他有他的心肠。」子玉接道：「绮席花筵日易夜。英华美可咏同车。」二轮又到次贤，遂写道：「元白诗原结莲社。红氍毹上艳情多。」子云接道：「惯唱《丁娘十索》歌。葑菲彩无遗下体。」高品道：「妙、妙！这句待我对一句好的。」群旦听了料定又要取笑他们，便都","en":"cold laugh: \\"Of course he won't join our crowd; he actually gets annoyed when he sees us.\\" Ziyu said: \\"Why so?\\" Guibao cut in: \\"He has his own feelings about it.\\" Ziyu continued:\\n\\n\\"Brocade seat and flower banquet, day turns easily to night;\\nin splendor and beauty, worthy of the 'Same Carriage' ode.\\"\\n\\nThe second round came to Cixian, who wrote:\\n\\n\\"Yuan and Bai's poems,"},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":1,"tokens":["桂保"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"从公，不可各存偏见。」于是大家评定：以宝珠为牡丹，蕙芳为芍药，素兰为莲花，玉林为碧桃，漱芳为海棠，兰保为玫瑰，桂保为芙蓉，春喜小而多才，人人钟爱为兰花。八人品题尽合，因又想到琴言、琪官为何花？子云道：「琴言色艺过佳，而性情过冷，比为梅花最是相称，且其酷爱梅，不属庾香将谁属耶？」众人说道；「很是。」高品道：「只怕和靖先生不依，庾香割了他靴革幼子了。」","en":"herbaceous peony; Sulan as the lotus; Yulin as the green peach blossom; Shufang as the crabapple; Lanbao as the rose; Guibao as the cotton rose. Chunxi, small in stature yet richly talented and beloved by all, was assigned the orchid. The eight assignments all felt fitting. They then wondered what flowers Qinyan and Qiguan should be. Ziyun said: \\"Qinyan's art and beauty are"}],"24":[{"paragraph":4,"mentions":2,"tokens":["桂保"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"通他这些浊污。」王恂又问仲雨，仲清答道：「在可善可恶之间，尚识好人，天良未昧。」二人刚说得有趣，忽见李玉林同着桂保来，见过了，遂即坐下，因问道：「这两日不见你们出来，在家作些什么？」王恂道：「也常出去的，我倒总不见你们。」桂保道：「我们近日在怡园演习新戏。」仲清道：「什么新戏呢？」玉林道：「闻得六月初六日荷花生日，华公子要来逛园。度香为他是爱听戏的，即与静宜商量","en":"still recognizes decent folk, so his conscience isn't entirely dead.\\" As they bantered, Li Yulin arrived with Guibao; after exchanging greetings, they took their seats. Zhongqing asked, \\"We haven't seen you for two days. Have you been busy at home?\\" Wang Xun added, \\"I go out often, yet I never seem to run into you.\\" Guibao explained, \\"We've been rehearsing new plays"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":8,"tokens":["桂保"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"元礼上无忧国之心，下无束师之律，罪应摒弃。若要将这些事翻转来，此外尚多呢。」王恂道：「在怡园演习的共有几人？」桂保道：「旦脚十个，此外生、净、老、丑有二十余个，是五六班凑成的。」仲清道：「旦脚十个是谁？」桂保道：「我们两个之外，尚有瑶卿、媚香、香畹、静芳、瘦香、小梅，后来又添了玉侬、玉艳，共是十个。」王恂道：「这就是十美班了。」桂保道：「陪客尚未定，你们是一定在","en":"to reverse these historical wrongs, so many more would remain.\\" Wang Xun asked how many actors were rehearsing. Guibao replied, \\"Ten female roles, alongside twenty-some sheng, jing, lao, and chou actors drawn from five or six different companies.\\" Zhongqing asked, \\"Who are the ten dan performers?\\" Guibao replied, \\"Besides the two of us, there are Yaoqing, Meixiang, Xiangwan,"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":3,"tokens":["桂保"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"西下，仲清叫人卷起帘子，就把桌子挪到廊前，摆了四个座儿。王恂道：「便饭，没有为你们添菜，我这里却比不得度香。」桂保道：「好说，你的便饭我也吃得记不清了，东成居也作不出来。度香处也过于糜费，其实如何吃得这么许多。」说完就同坐了。厨房内闻得有相公，便多备了八个碟子，添了四样菜。先把黄酒、小吃送上来。玉林、桂保各敬了酒，便谈谈讲讲，浅斟低酌了一回。仲清、王恂又问了些近","en":"Xun said, \\"It will just be a plain meal with no extra dishes; I certainly cannot match Duxiang's extravagance.\\" Guibao waved it off, \\"You say that, but I have lost count of the plain feasts I've enjoyed here. The Dongcheng Kitchen couldn't possibly equal this. Duxiang spends far too much—who can even eat such massive spreads anyway?\\" They took their seats. The kitchen,"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":2,"tokens":["桂保"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"方才王恂日间听了仲清品评各人的情境，因想起《花谱》中诸旦都也讲究情分的。因问玉林、桂保道：「你们此刻在怡园演习，那十个人，你可晓得他们有几种情性，脾气是那个最好相与，可讲得来么？」桂保道：「这十个却也好几样，内中就是玉侬脾气冷些，其余没有什么脾气。」玉林道：「讲情性风雅，心地聪敏，不慕势利，意气自豪，是瑶卿。一尘不染，灵慧空明，胸有别","en":"his thoughts to the actors of the Catalogue of Flowers and their own emotional temperaments. He asked Yulin and Guibao, \\"Of the ten of you rehearsing at the Garden of Contentment, do you know everyone's true temperament? Whose company is the easiest to keep?\\" Guibao replied, \\"There are ten entirely different sorts. Yunong is by far the coldest, but the rest are mild"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":8,"tokens":["桂保","蕊香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"心灵口敏，仪秀态妍，是小梅。泛应有余，风流自赏。」把嘴向着桂保道：「这是他。别有会心，人难索解，海枯石烂，节操不移，这是玉侬。把洁守贞，不计利害，是玉艳。至于我则无长可取，碌碌庸人，使人嫌弃的，就是我了。」桂保道：「这是你自己不好下赞语，这考语待我出吧：芳洁自守，风雅宜人，不亢不卑，无好无恶，这些是佩仙。」仲清","en":"a graceful bearing—that is Xiaomei. Highly versatile and nursing a romantic self-regard—\\" Yulin nodded toward Guibao, \\"that is him. A secret heart that few can ever truly grasp, steadfast until the seas run dry—that is Yunong. Pure fidelity, entirely heedless of personal gain—that is Yuyan. As for me, I have no merit whatsoever; I am dull, and people despise me. That"}],"25":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["桂保"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说前回书中，玉林、桂保在王恂处，讲起怡园演习新戏，预备华公子逛园。流光荏苒，倏忽一月，刘文泽已回。书中所讲这班名士，华公子向来往来者就是刘文泽一人，其余多未谋面。此时文泽之父刘守正已升了礼部尚书，是以文泽偕其妻星夜赶回，未免有些庆贺之事。又适子云写书前往，文泽回京已有半月","en":"In the previous chapter, Yulin and Guibao at Wang Xun's place were speaking of the new plays being rehearsed at the Garden of Contentment in preparation for Young Master Hua's garden visit. Time flew swiftly; in the blink of an eye a month passed, and Liu Wenze had returned. Of this circle of"}],"30":[{"paragraph":12,"mentions":1,"tokens":["桂保"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"谈妙语，佐以诙谐。那边席上，聘才问次贤怡园的光景。次贤略述了几处。随后即见宝珠、蕙芳、素兰、漱芳、玉林、兰保、桂保，春喜、琪官等九个，又凑上一个，作了一出《秦淮河看花大会》，有幽闲的，有妖冶的，有静婉的，有风流的，极尽靡艳之致，众人尽皆喝采。子云、次贤等就于此出中间放了赏。华公子对着笑道：「此系抄袭吾兄旧文，殊觉数见不鲜。」子云道：「唱的甚好，贞静的却极贞静，放","en":"Contentment. Cixian briefly described a few places. Next came Baozhu, Huifang, Sulan, Shufang, Yulin, Lanbao, Guibao, Chunxi, Qiguan—nine in total—plus one more, performing the play 'Flower-Viewing Assembly on the Qinhuai'. Some were demure, some coquettish, some quiet and gentle, and some romantic, exhibiting the utmost alluring charm. Everyone applauded. Ziyun, Cixian,"}],"31":[{"paragraph":3,"mentions":2,"tokens":["蕊香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"派。」即对着蕙芳道：「媚香是长于诗的，瑶卿是长于丹青的，静芳是长于舞剑的，香畹是长于书法的，佩仙是长于填词的，蕊香是长于猜谜诙谐的，瘦香是长于品箫的，小梅是长于吹笙的。可惜玉侬又病了，他倒会一套《平沙落雁》。」华公子便命叫他起来，又吩咐珊枝拿了琵琶来。家人把些笔砚乐器都搬了出来，分摆在各处。次贤道：「我来点将：先点玉侬与瘦香把琴箫和起来；再点瑶卿画一幅，媚香、香","en":"is a master of the sword dance, Xiangwan possesses beautiful calligraphy, Peixian is adept at composing lyrics, Ruixiang has a gift for riddles and witty banter, Shouxiang is masterful with the vertical flute, and Xiaomei plays the mouth-organ beautifully. It is only a pity that Yunong has fallen ill, for he plays a wonderful rendition of 'Wild Geese Alighting on Level"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":5,"tokens":["桂保"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"吹弹过了，要桂保的诗谜来了。桂保道：「是人给我猜，还是我给人猜呢？」华公子道：「我给你猜。」随口念道：「碧纹浅笑起参差，今岁春来已较迟。\\n我道灞桥诗思少，不如赤壁夜游时。」桂保想了一想，笑道：「公子说的，是风花雪月四样，真作得好。」华公子道：「真心灵，一猜就着。」冯","en":"Once the instrumental performances concluded, it was time for Guibao's poetic riddles. Guibao asked, \\"Am I to present riddles for others to guess, or shall others present them for me?\\" Young Master Hua replied, \\"I will give you one to guess.\\" He then recited offhand:\\n\\n'Green ripples break into a shallow, uneven smile,"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王桂保"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"花部中曾受业于香雪者，现有四人：袁宝珠、王桂保、金漱芳、陆素兰，或学画，或学诗，皆为高弟，此四人也共凑百金，连蕙芳的共有四百金。母子二人并一老仆三人，雇舟由运河而回，也就极宽裕了。","en":"Among the pupils in the flower-register who had studied under Fragrant-Snow, four still remained: Yuan Baozhu, Wang Guibao, Jin Shufang, and Lu Sulan. Whether they had studied painting or poetry, all were his advanced disciples. These four pupils pooled together an additional one hundred taels. Combined with Huifang's contribution, the total came to four hundred taels. This"},{"paragraph":30,"mentions":1,"tokens":["桂保"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"齐了，就奠一奠，我们往锦秋墩去逛罢。」蕙芳即将祭筵就叫在那屋里摆起来。蕙芳上香，素兰奠酒，漱芳执壶，宝珠上菜，桂保焚纸，春航、南湘、高品同行了一个礼，五旦连连叩头代谢。","en":"offered the incense, Sulan poured the libations of wine, Shufang held the pitcher, Baozhu arranged the dishes, and Guibao burned the paper offerings. Chunhang, Nanxiang, and Gao Pin bowed respectfully in unison, while the five dans kowtowed repeatedly in solemn gratitude."},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":1,"tokens":["桂保"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"些鬼狐来盘桓盘桓，也未尝不佳。」高品道：「剑潭总喜作违心之论。」素兰道：「我若是一个人，就是日里也不敢进去。」桂保道：「那些棺材破烂的甚多，我看晚间只怕有鬼。」漱芳道：「亏那和尚只有一个徒弟，一个香火，竟不怕。若果真有鬼，和尚怎么好好儿的呢？」蕙芳道：「你几时见鬼吃过人？我前日听那和尚说，每到阴风暗雨的时候，或是夜深，叫的叫，哭的哭，是常有的。」宝珠道：「你们听","en":"delights in contrary talk.\\" Sulan said, \\"If I were alone, I wouldn't dare set foot in there even in broad daylight.\\" Guibao added, \\"There are so many broken and rotting coffins in there. I am certain the place must be haunted at night.\\" Shufang reasoned, \\"It is amazing that the monk, with only one novice and an altar attendant, is entirely unafraid. If there truly were ghosts,"}],"36":[{"paragraph":8,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王桂保"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"：「我去问度香，明日、后日皆可。」三人坐了好些时候，要走了，琴言拉住了不肯放，众人不忍相离，只得坐下。后又来了王桂保、李玉林、金漱芳，大家直等了送殓，拜了，然后才散。琴言穿了孝袍，似乎明日不好出门，只得约定三日后再叙。又叫伍麻子到华府求珊枝转为告假一月，俟出殡后方得进城。华公子准了，又拿了一个衣箱回来，琴言方才放心。","en":"long time, but when they tried to leave, Qinyan clung to them, and, reluctant to part, they sat back down. Later, Wang Guibao, Li Yulin, and Jin Shufang arrived. They all stayed until the coffin was sealed, paid their respects, and then departed. Since Qinyan was wearing mourning robes, it seemed improper to go out the next day, so they agreed to meet again in three days. He"}],"37":[{"paragraph":4,"mentions":6,"tokens":["桂保"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"花来，不是你爱花不爱人么？」子云笑道：「你不过是这么说呀，前日约得好好儿的，怎么此刻还不见来呢？」少顷，宝珠、桂保来了，见过了。子云道：「怎么这时候还只得你们两个人来？」宝珠道：「今日恐有个不能来。玉侬还没有来吗？」桂保道：「今日联锦是五包堂会，联珠是四包堂会。大约尽唱昆戏，脚色分派不开，我们都唱过一堂的了。」王恂道：「何以今日这么多呢？」桂保道：「再忙半个月也","en":"perfectly good arrangements the other day, so why have they not arrived yet?\\" A short while later, Baozhu and Guibao arrived and exchanged greetings. Ziyun asked, \\"Only the two of you, even at this hour?\\" Baozhu answered, \\"I fear some may be unable to attend today. Has Yunong not arrived either?\\" Guibao explained, \\"Today Lianjin has five private engagements and Lianzhu"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":1,"tokens":["桂保"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"？我是不坐的。」子玉道：「应是庸庵。」子云道：「往日原是这样，今日却要倒转来。」便拉定琴言坐了首席，子玉并之。桂保坐了二席，王恂并之，不准再逊，逊者罚酒十杯。子云又叫宝珠坐在上面，宝珠要推时，见蕙芳来了。子云道：「好，好，你来坐了，次贤相并。」蕙芳不肯坐在次贤之上。次贤道：「今日所定之席，皆是你们为上，我们为次，你不见已定了两位吗？」蕙芳只得依了，下面宝珠也只得","en":"reversing the order.\\" He took Qinyan by the arm and settled him firmly in the seat of honour, placing Ziyu beside him. Guibao took the second seat, with Wang Xun alongside. There was to be no more yielding places: anyone who tried would have to drink ten cups. Ziyun then called on Baozhu to sit in the upper position. Just as Baozhu was about to decline, Huifang arrived. Ziyun"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":3,"tokens":["桂保"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"了得，只怕你们今日也不能见我的。」子云道：「这三个恶煞，怎么你一齐都遇见了，这也实在为难你。」次贤、王恂皆笑。桂保道：「那个奚十一，我倒没碰见他，就是佩仙、玉艳吃了他的大亏。」琴言道：「我是两次了。」王恂谓桂保道：「你若遇见了奚十一，便怎样呢？」桂保道：「我若遇见了他，也叫他看看桶子，叫个赶车的顽顽他。」说得众人大笑。蕙芳道：「我们如何想个法儿收拾他？」次贤笑道","en":"into all three of those fiends at once! You must have had a dreadful time.\\" Cixian and Wang Xun both laughed. Guibao added, \\"That Xi Eleven, I have never had dealings with him myself, but Peixian and Yuyan suffered badly at his hands.\\" Qinyan noted, \\"For me it has been twice now.\\" Wang Xun asked Guibao what he would do if he ran into Xi Eleven. Guibao replied, \\"If"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":6,"tokens":["王桂保","桂保"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"王桂保对着子云笑道：「我有个一字化为三字的令，我说给你听，说不出者罚一杯。」子云道：「你且说来。」桂保道：「一个大字加一点是太字，移上去是犬字，照这么样也说一个。」子云笑道：「这是犬令，谁耐烦行他。」桂保笑嘻嘻的对着蕙芳道：「你说一个。」蕙芳想了一想，道：","en":"Wang Guibao turned to Ziyun with a smile and proposed, \\"I have a game: turn one character into three. I'll show you how. Anyone who can't give another must drink a cup.\\" Ziyun invited him to proceed. Guibao explained, \\"Take the character for 'great' (大) and add"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":3,"tokens":["桂保"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"贤道：「这个永字些须欠一点儿，也只好算个薄氷。然眼前的却也没有多少。」王恂道：「只怕就是几个，被他们想完了。」桂保道：「我还有一个十字，加一划是士字，移上去是干字。」大家说道：「好。」蕙芳道：「我有个杳字，加一笔是查字，移上去是香字。」众人赞道：「更好！」宝珠道：「我有个丁字，加一笔是于字，移上去是亍字。」子云道：「这字却冷些。」子玉道：「也可用。」宝珠道：「彳","en":"examples that come readily to mind.\\" Wang Xun said, \\"I fear there are only a few, and they have all been taken.\\" Guibao proposed another, \\"I have the character for 'ten' (十), add a stroke to make it 'scholar' (士), and move it to the top to make it 'shield' (干).\\" Everyone approved. Huifang added, \\"I have the character for 'dark' (杳), add a stroke to make it 'investigate'"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蕊香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"次贤道：「很好，就请庾香、玉侬先对起来。」子玉道：「还是你与媚香先对，次度香、瑶卿，次庸庵、蕊香，末后轮到我们罢。」子云道：「也罢，你作个先锋，他作个后劲，把我们放在中间，容易讨好些。」次贤道：「头难，头难，我一时想不出好的。我前日见瘦香的《题曲》唱得甚好，就出《题曲》罢。」蕙芳道：「《题曲》就可以对《偷诗》。」宝珠道：「将现成人家方才对过的，","en":"start.\\" Ziyu suggested, \\"It would be better if you and Meixiang go first, then Duxiang and Yaoqing, then Yong'an and Ruixiang, and we shall go last.\\" Ziyun agreed to this arrangement, \\"You take the vanguard, and he brings up the rear; that leaves us in the middle, where it is easier to make a good showing.\\" Cixian said, \\"Hard to begin, hard to begin! I can't think of a good"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":4,"tokens":["桂保"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"应子云出对了，子云出了《踏月》的上对，宝珠想了一想，对了《扫花》。桂保道：「好极了。」子云道：「论对却好，但两个字似乎平仄都要相配，扫字也是仄声。此中稍欠工稳。」次贤道：「你却论得是。据我想来，戏目虽多，内中可对者却也甚少，下一字须讲平仄，上一字尚可恕，不比泛对故实，可以随我们去搜索，此是有数的。与其平仄调而字面不工，","en":"couplet: *Treading on the Moon* (踏月). Baozhu thought for a moment and paired it with *Sweeping Flowers* (扫花). Guibao said, \\"Excellent.\\" Ziyun said, \\"The pairing is good in terms of meaning, but when two-character opera titles are matched, the level and oblique tones should contrast. 扫 (sweep), like 踏 (tread), has an oblique tone, so there is a slight imperfection here.\\""},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":2,"tokens":["桂保"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云出了《打店》，宝珠对了《逃关》。宝珠出了《抢娇》，子云对了《杀惜》。都为工稳，贺了一杯。王恂出了《草桥》，桂保对了《麻地》，忽又说道：「这地字还差半个字，我改作《絮阁》罢。」王恂道：「这《絮阁》借对得好，可贺半杯。」桂保出了《花婆》，王恂想了一会，对了《火判》。大家已经赞好要贺，王恂道：「慢着，我还要改。」又改了《草相》，众人道：「更好，新奇之极。」各贺了。","en":"Poxi* (杀惜). Both were judged good matches and toasted with a cup. Wang Xun brought forth *Grass Bridge* (草桥), and Guibao paired it with *Hemp Ground* (麻地), then suddenly paused. \\"The character for 'ground' here is half a character off,\\" he mused. \\"Let me change it to *The Scolding in the Pavilion* (絮阁).\\" Wang Xun praised the revision: \\"This borrowed pairing of *The Scolding"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":1,"tokens":["桂保"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"到了王恂，王恂出了《花鼓》。桂保想来想去，没有对，急得脸都红了。","en":"It was Wang Xun's turn again, and he offered *Flower Drum* (花鼓). Guibao thought and thought, but no match came. He grew so flustered that his face turned red."},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":2,"tokens":["桂保"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"王恂催他，桂保道：「不料这个倒没有对的。只有《闻铃》上那个《雨铃》好对，却不是戏目。《草桥》这桥字也不甚对，其余我想不出来，我喝一杯罢。」桂保喝了半杯酒，出了个《跪池》，王恂对了《投井》，大家说好，也贺了半杯。到了子玉，子玉出了《折柳》。子云笑道：「庾香惠顾着玉侬","en":"Wang Xun pressed him. Guibao said, \\"I didn't expect this one to stump me. The only good match is the *Bell in the Rain* (雨铃) in *Hearing the Bells* (闻铃), but that is not an opera title. *Grass Bridge* (草桥) is not really a perfect match either, as the 'bridge' does not quite fit."},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":3,"tokens":["蕊香","桂保"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"到了王恂，出了个《冥判》。次贤道：「这不容易。这个判字半虚半实，蕊香只怕要罚酒。」桂保想了一回，道：「有一个好对，就新些，却不是老戏。《空谷香》上有出《佛医》，我对《佛医》。」次贤道：「果然好，非但不罚，还要贺呢。」桂保道：「我想出一个难的来了，我出《惊丑》。」王恂想了一会道：「我有个好对，这四个字比起来，还是一样的","en":"Infernal Judge* (冥判). Cixian warned, \\"This is not easy. That word for 'judge' is half concrete and half abstract; Ruixiang may well be penalized.\\" Guibao thought for a while and said, \\"I have a good match, though it comes from a newer play. In *Empty Valley Fragrance* (空谷香) there is a scene called *The Buddhist Healer* (佛医). I shall match it with *The Buddhist Healer* (佛医).\\""}],"38":[{"paragraph":16,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王桂保"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「有数十条，也记不得了。」次贤道：「我们前日几个人，也凑了好些。」又指琴言、蕙芳、宝珠三人道：「这三个还有一个王桂保，他们也对了许多，比我们还好些。」便叫人到他书房拿出一个单子，并上次所行之令也写在上面，注了各人姓名。道生看了，连声赞好，道：「不料这四位竟能如此，竟是我辈，老夫今日真有幸也。他们贵行中我却也见过许多，不过写几笔兰竹，涂几首七言绝句，也是半通不通的。","en":"many the other day,\\" and, gesturing toward Qinyan, Huifang, and Baozhu, he added, \\"These three, along with one Wang Guibao, matched a great number of pairs — and their results were somewhat better than ours.\\" He sent a servant to his study to fetch a sheet of paper on which the results of that session had been written out, with the participants' names noted against each"}],"42":[{"paragraph":15,"mentions":1,"tokens":["桂保"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"那个大傻子，他们却见过他，在园子里听衬戏的，便也请了安。大傻子迷迷盹盹的说道：「今日兰保的《盗令》、《杀舟》，桂保的《相约》、《相骂》，实是个名人家数，他人做不来的。」亮轩道：「你们还认得我么？」天福道：「有些面善，想不起来，好像那里见过的。」天寿眼瞪瞪的看了一会，问道：「你能是不是去年同一位吃烟的老爷来？那位吃烟的同我师父打起来，还是你能拉开的。」","en":"Dasha, in his vague and muddled way, said: \\"Today Lanbao's 'Stealing the Token' and 'Killing in the Boat,' and Guibao's 'The Rendezvous' and 'Mutual Scolding,' those are the true accomplishments of a master. No one else can do what they do.\\" Liangxuan said, \\"Do you still know me?\\" Tianfu said, \\"The face is familiar; I cannot place it. I feel I have seen you somewhere.\\""}],"45":[{"paragraph":12,"mentions":1,"tokens":["桂保"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"与吉甫相见，叙了些彼此仰慕的话。只有史南湘、田春航在场中未来。相公们到的是宝珠、蕙芳、素兰、玉林、漱芳、兰保、桂保、春喜、琪官、连琴言刚是十人。","en":"at the examination grounds. Among the performers who came were Baozhu, Huifang, Sulan, Yulin, Shufang, Lanbao, Guibao, Chunxi, and Qiguan. Qinyan made ten in total."},{"paragraph":33,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蕊香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"堂。\\n众人道：「首句是香畹，次句是佩仙、玉艳，三句总说，末句是小梅。」子云掐指一算，名花已有了八人，只少静芳、蕊香两人了。又见写道：","en":"and the last line is Xiaomei.\\" Ziyun counted on his fingers. Eight flowers were named, leaving only Jingfang and Ruixiang missing. Next:"}],"48":[{"paragraph":36,"mentions":1,"tokens":["桂保"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，直到十里之外皇华亭。只见南湘、仲清、文泽、金粟、王恂、子玉、春航，领着那蕙芳、宝珠、素兰、漱芳、玉林、兰保、桂保、琪官、春喜九个名旦，在皇华亭等候。道翁等连忙下车，极口辞谢。各人皆要把盏。","en":"Xun, Ziyu, and Chunhang, alongside Huifang and the nine famous performers: Baozhu, Sulan, Shufang, Yulin, Lanbao, Guibao, Qiguan, and Chunxi. Daoweng hurried down from his carriage and thanked everyone repeatedly, as they all eagerly wished to raise a cup in a final parting toast."}],"50":[{"paragraph":5,"mentions":1,"tokens":["桂保"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"山水尚是乱画的，草虫他更不会。此时说我比他好，我也不安，将来或者赶得上他。」正说话间，只见仲清、王恂同着琪官、桂保进来。","en":"might catch up to him.\\" Just as they were speaking, Zhongqing and Wang Xun walked in, accompanied by Qiguan and Guibao."},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":2,"tokens":["蕊香","桂保"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"文泽见了大喜，问道：「怎么今日不约而同，都到这里来？」仲清道：「庸庵要到蕊香那里去，却遇见玉艳，想同到新开的庄子里去坐坐。见你的车在门口，所以进来。」文泽道：「莫非就是那唐和尚开的安吉堂么？闻得那地方倒好，他又将寺里的几间房子也通了过去，我们就去。」春喜道：「怪热的天，在这里不好吗？」桂保道：「那里也好，内中有几间屋子，摆满","en":"all arrived together here today, without even arranging it?\\" Zhongqing explained, \\"Yong'an was on his way to see Ruixiang, but ran into Yuyan. We thought we might go sit for a while at the newly opened establishment. Seeing your carriage parked outside, we decided to come in here first.\\" Wenze guessed, \\"Could it be the 'Anji Hall' opened by Monk Tang? I've heard excellent"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":1,"tokens":["桂保"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"间一个冰桶，拿了些西瓜、鲜核桃、杏仁、大桃儿、葡萄、雪藕之类，浸在冰里。首坐仲清，次文泽，次王恂，琪官、春喜、桂保相间而坐。来了几样菜，各人随意小酌闲谈。","en":"perfectly in the ice. Zhongqing took the seat of honor, followed by Wenze, then Wang Xun, with Qiguan, Chunxi, and Guibao interspersed among them. Once a few dishes arrived, they sipped their wine and chatted at their leisure."},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":1,"tokens":["桂保"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"桂保对王恂道：「从前我在怡园，行那一个字化作三个字的令，你一个也没有想得出来。我如今又想了一个拆字法，分作四柱，叫做旧管、新收、开除、实在四项。譬如这个酒字…」一面说，一面在桌子上写道：「旧管一个酉字，新收一个三点水，便成了一个酒字。开除了酉字中间的一字","en":"Guibao turned to Wang Xun and said, \\"Back in the Garden of Contentment, when we played that game of turning one character into three, you couldn't come up with a single one. Well, I've just thought of a new character-dissection game. It's divided into four"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":2,"tokens":["桂保"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琪官道：「我也有一个，旧管是个金字，新收一个则字。」说到此，便写了一个铡字：「开除了一个贝字，实在是个钊字。」桂保道：「金字加个则，是个什么字？」琪官道：「有这个字，我却一时说不出来。」春喜道：「这字好像是铡草的铡。」琪官道：「正是。」桂保道：「以后不兴说这种冷字。若要说这种冷字，字典上翻一翻，就说不尽。且教人认不真，有甚趣味？」琪官被驳得在理，也不言语。仲清道","en":"point, he traced the character 铡. \\"'Remove' the shell character (贝), and the 'Actual Remainder' is zhao (钊).\\" Guibao looked puzzled, \\"What character is formed by adding 'rule' to 'gold'?\\" Qiguan admitted, \\"It is a real character, but I can't quite say it aloud at the moment.\\" Chunxi offered, \\"It looks like the zha in zhacao (铡草, chopping fodder).\\" Qiguan nodded, \\"Exactly.\\""},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":2,"tokens":["桂保"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"桂保道：「好，说得剪截。」文泽道：「旧管是个圭字，新收一个木字，是桂字。开除了土字，实在是杜字。」王恂道：「旧管是个寺字，新收一个言字，是诗字。开除了土字，实在是讨字。」桂保道：「这个比从前的田字讲得好了。我说旧管是个一字，新收一个史字，是吏字。开除了口","en":"Guibao praised him, \\"Excellent, very neat and sharp.\\" Wenze followed, \\"The 'Old Stock' is gui (圭, jade tablet). The 'New Intake' is 'wood' (木), forming gui (桂, osmanthus). 'Remove' 'earth' (土), and the 'Actual Remainder' is du (杜).\\" Wang Xun said, \\"The 'Old"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":1,"tokens":["桂保"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"女字。」春喜道：「怎么说？闹错了。旧管是波字。怎么开除也是波字？新收是女字，怎么实在又是女字？内中少了运化。」桂保道：「这要罚的。」文泽笑道：「我说错了，我是想得好好儿的。」便说道：「开除是皮字，不是波字。」琪官笑道：「这是什么字，一个婆字少了皮字？」春喜道：「要把那三点水揪下来，把女字抬上去，不是个汝字？」","en":"Intake' is 'woman', how can the 'Actual Remainder' also be 'woman'? There's no transformation happening at all!\\" Guibao ruled, \\"That definitely calls for a penalty!\\" Wenze laughed, \\"I misspoke! I had it perfectly straight in my head.\\" He corrected himself, \\"The 'Removal' should be 'skin' (皮), not 'wave' (波).\\" Qiguan chuckled, \\"What character is left if you take 'skin'"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":5,"tokens":["桂保"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"文泽笑道：「正是汝字。」桂保道：「太不自然，要罚一杯。」文泽笑道：「不与你们来了。」饮了一杯，王恂道：「旧管是眇字，新收三点水，是渺字，开除了目字，实在是沙字。」桂保道：「旧管是士字，新收了口字，是吉字。开除了一字，实在是个古字。」文泽道：「这张口可惜生下了些，凑不拢，也要抬上","en":"Wenze laughed, \\"Indeed, it is ru.\\" Guibao judged, \\"Too unnatural and forced; you must drink a penalty cup.\\" Wenze, still laughing, conceded, \\"I'm not playing with you all anymore,\\" and drank his cup. Wang Xun took his turn: \\"The 'Old Stock' is 'blind' (眇). The 'New Intake' is the three water"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":4,"tokens":["桂保"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一手拍着桌子道：「你听，两月夫妻，一旦孤另。」桂保道：「你真讲得不错。」又道：「你知道唱南曲，有用一凡工尺的没有？」春喜道：「南曲是没有一凡的，是人人尽知。惟有一处，我问过你令兄，他是个刺杀旦。我问他南曲笛子上有一凡没有，他也说没有。我说你做《刺梁》那一出，是南北合套，梁冀所唱之曲皆系南曲，到看报时","en":"the table, Chunxi demonstrated: \\"Listen: 'Two months as husband and wife— snap —in a single dawn left alone.'\\" Guibao praised him, \\"You explain it brilliantly.\\" He then asked, \\"Do you know if the yi-fan pitch is ever used when singing Southern tunes?\\" Chunxi replied confidently, \\"It is common knowledge that Southern tunes do not use yi-fan. There is only one single"}],"60":[{"paragraph":5,"mentions":1,"tokens":["桂保"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"拈了道翁，子玉拈了杜仙女、琴仙，金粟拈了宝珠，春航拈了蕙芳，仲清拈了琪官，文泽拈了春喜，南湘拈了兰保，王恂拈了桂保，高品拈了玉林，次贤拈了漱芳，单拈不着素兰，只好送与华公子去作了。众人分派已定，子玉说道：「做传容易，画画难，还要刻石，更须时日，不知几天可以告成？」吉甫道：「不消多日，碑是磨现成的，一面画，一面就叫季十矮子找人刻，大约十几天是必要的，嵌好这些碑，也","en":"drew Baozhu; Chunhang drew Huifang; Zhongqing drew Qiguan; Wenze drew Chunxi; Nanxiang drew Lanbao; Wang Xun drew Guibao; Gao Pin drew Yulin; and Cixian drew Shufang. Sulan alone was not drawn, so that assignment was sent to Young Master Hua. The tasks distributed, Ziyu said, \\"Writing biographies is easy, but painting is difficult, and carving stone takes even longer."},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":1,"tokens":["桂保"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"蟾宫花史王仙。知是桂保，有王恂五古一首：","en":"\\"Changong Flower Historian, Immortal Wang.\\" Knowing this was Guibao, he read the five-character ancient verse by Wang Xun:"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":2,"tokens":["蕊香","桂保"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"浦，七夕诉离忧。\\n唯此一轮月，梯虹亦难求。\\n安得张丽华，缟素来嬉游。\\n琴仙道：「好诗，好诗！读之令人口齿俱香。蕊香真像嫦娥。」桂保道：「不是我，这是蟾宫花史。」众人说道：「这些诗词赞语，他们倒是争奇角胜，那里记着本人？就是竹君的诗，与静宜、庾香这两个赞语，倒是切定题目说的。」琴仙道：「都切得很。你将这些诗更换了人，便不像了。」宝珠道：「只有静芳那一首，再不能更换","en":"silk robes?\\"\\n\\nQinxian exclaimed, \\"Good poem, good poem! Reading it leaves a lingering fragrance in the mouth. Ruixiang truly looks like Chang'e.\\" Guibao replied, \\"It's not me; it's the Changong Flower Historian.\\" The others chimed in, \\"With all these poems, lyrics, and eulogies, they're just competing with each other in cleverness and skill; who among them actually remembers"},{"paragraph":31,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王桂保"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"晴光争明。云辉锦集，月满川盈。《霓裳》一曲，《箫韶》九成。不矜不庄，或休或暇。\\n惠而好我，是曰柳下。\\n第七首是王桂保题的《仙中乐品》：","en":"sometimes resting, sometimes at leisure.\\nKind and pleasing to us—he is truly like Liuxia Hui.\\"\\n\\nThe seventh was Wang Guibao's *Joyous Grade Among Immortals*:"}]}`),"char-30":JSON.parse(`{"1":[{"paragraph":32,"mentions":3,"tokens":["林春喜","春喜","小梅"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"天上玉麟林春喜\\n春喜姓林氏，字小梅，年十四岁。姑苏人。","en":"Lin Chunxi: A Jade Qilin from the Heavens. Chunxi's surname is Lin, his courtesy name Xiaomei, and he is fourteen years of age. A native of Suzhou."}],"4":[{"paragraph":30,"mentions":3,"tokens":["林春喜","春喜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"后看是一个相公，也要下车。仲清等连忙止住，那相公便挪出身子，生得香雕粉捏，玉裹金妆，原来是《花选》上最小的那个林春喜。王恂问道：「你从那里来？」春喜道：「我从怡园回来，你们也到怡园去么？」仲清道：「我们是看雪景的，也就转去了。」王恂道：「我们何不就上小街那个酒楼坐坐，也可望望野景。」春喜道：「如果你们高兴，我也奉陪。」仲清说：「很好。」就转回车来，到了小街，有个馆","en":"he only leaned out of the carriage—carved and powdered like jade, gilded and ornamented—it was none other than Lin Chunxi, the youngest of the performers listed in the Selection of Flowers. Wang Xun asked, \\"Where are you coming from?\\" Chunxi replied, \\"I am coming back from the Garden of Contentment. Are you going there too?\\" Zhongqing said, \\"We are just looking at the snow"},{"paragraph":31,"mentions":2,"tokens":["春喜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"仲清索性叫把窗子开了，也望得好远地方。点了菜，三人闲谈了一会。春喜道：「这月里我们八个人，在怡园三日一聚，作消寒会，今日是第五会了。每一会必有一样顽意儿，或是行令，或是局戏。今日度香要叫我们做诗，出了个《冰床》题目，各人做七律一首，教苏媚香考了第一。」仲清道：「你记得他的诗么？」春喜道：「我只记得他中间四句。」即念","en":"the windows thrown open, and the view extended a great distance. They ordered food and chatted idly for a while. Chunxi said, \\"This month the eight of us have been holding gatherings at the Garden of Contentment every three days—a Winter Solstice club. Today is the fifth meeting. At each meeting there must be one entertainment, sometimes a drinking game, sometimes a parlor"},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":4,"tokens":["春喜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"与坦途同。\\n谁言青海填难满，不信蓬山路未通。\\n都说他运用灵妙，不着一死句，所以胜于他人。」王恂道：「你的呢？」春喜道」我的不好，也记不得了。」仲清道：「只怕你是第八了。」春喜嘻嘻的笑道：「被你一猜就猜着。」王恂道：「这难怪他，他方十四岁，若教他学上两年，怕赶不上他们？」春喜道：「我原不肯做的，他们定要我做。今日大家的诗，都也没有什么好，但就蕊香与我倒了平仄，因此","en":"wonderfully inspired, without a single flat line, which is why he surpassed the others.\\" Wang Xun asked, \\"And yours?\\" Chunxi said, \\"Mine was not good; I cannot remember it.\\" Zhongqing teased, \\"I imagine you came eighth.\\" Chunxi laughed sheepishly, \\"You guessed it on the first try.\\" Wang Xun reasoned, \\"No wonder; he is only fourteen years old. If he were to study for two years,"},{"paragraph":33,"mentions":2,"tokens":["春喜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"人，却又有些扬州话在里头。再看那四个相公，却非名下青钱，不过花中凡艳。王恂认得一个是蓉官，那三个都不认得，因问春喜。春喜道：「穿染貂的是玉美，穿倭刀的是四喜，穿水獭的是全福。都是剑春班的。」只见那位少年，将这边楼上望了一望，也就背转身子坐了。听得那些相公，燕语莺声，光筹交错，好也就背转身子坐了。听得那些相公，燕语莺声，光筹交错，好不热闹。这边三个人相形之下，颇自","en":"blossoms of the flower world. Wang Xun recognized one as Rongguan; the other three he did not know, and so asked Chunxi. Chunxi explained, \\"The one in tinted sable is Yumei; the one in Japanese-sword-patterned fur is Si Xi; the one in otter is Quanfu. All three are from the Jianchun company.\\" Just then, the young man glanced over at this balcony once, then turned his"},{"paragraph":35,"mentions":3,"tokens":["春喜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"只见那少年问居人要了笔砚，在粉墙之上写了几句，便带着四个相公下楼去了。仲清等也不喝了，吩咐跟班的去算了账，带了春喜走到西楼来，只见墨渖淋漓，字体丰劲，一笔好草书，写了一首《浪淘沙》，其词曰：\\n红日已西斜，笑看云霞。玉龙鳞散满天涯。我盼春风来万里，吹尽瑶花。世事莫争夸，无念非差。蓬莱仙子挽云车。醉问大罗天上客，彩凤谁家？仲清、王恂看了都点头称赞。春喜道：「这首词倒","en":"stairs and left. Zhongqing and the others also stopped drinking, told the attendants to settle the bill, took Chunxi with them, and came over to the west balcony. There, in flowing strokes of dense ink, in a fine bold cursive hand, he had written a ci poem to the tune *Waves Scouring Sand*:\\nThe red sun has already sloped to the west—\\nI smile, watching cloud and rosy"}],"5":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["林春喜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"前回说林春喜与仲清等，讲起在怡园作消寒赋诗之会。我今要将怡园之事序起来：有个公子班头，文人领袖，姓徐名子云，号度香，是浙江山阴县人。说他家世，真是当今数一数二的，七世簪缨之内，是祖孙宰相，父子尚书，兄弟督抚。单讲这位徐子云的本支，其父名震，由翰林出身，现做了大学","en":"The previous chapter told of Lin Chunxi and Zhongqing discussing the poetry-gathering at the Garden of Contentment. Now let us set the stage for that garden. There was a prince among young noblemen, a leader of literary men, by the name of Xu Ziyun, style name Duxiang, a native of Shanyin"}],"15":[{"paragraph":8,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春喜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"文泽的跟班进去，一问琴言不在家，听得里头说道，就是刘大人带到春喜园去了。文泽一个没趣，子玉倒觉喜欢。南湘道：「那里去？我还没有吃饭，对门不是妙香堂素兰家么，咱们就找香畹去。」文泽道：「只怕也未必在家。叫人去问一问。「素兰却好在家，里头有人出来，请了进去，到客厅坐下，送了茶。文泽问子玉道」香畹你见过没有？」子玉道：","en":"attendant went inside to inquire; Qinyan was not at home — they heard from within that the Lord Liu had taken him to Chunxi Garden. Wenze was somewhat put out; Ziyu, on the other hand, felt quietly relieved. Nanxiang said, \\"Where to now? I haven't eaten yet — isn't that Miaoxiang Hall, where Sulan lives, right across the lane? Let's go and find Xiangwan.\\" Wenze said, \\"I'm"}],"17":[{"paragraph":3,"mentions":1,"tokens":["小梅"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「我家亦可，但无花园子，不如前舟园里好。我们主人六个，添上湘帆七个，媚香、瑶卿、香畹、佩仙、静芳、蕊香、瘦香、小梅共是八个，要三席才可坐，醵分之说，不能预定多少，只好办了再算。」众人道：「极是。」子玉便呆呆的。仲清笑道：「庸庵你这差使办得不周到，要讨人怪的。」王恂尚未回答，南湘道：「何所见而言？」仲清道：「你不见庸庵点将，把一个极要紧的人遗漏了，岂不要招人怪么？","en":"hosts, plus Xiangfan, that makes seven; Meixiang, Yaoqing, Xiangwan, Peixian, Jingfang, Ruixiang, Shouxiang, and Xiaomei make eight. We shall require three tables to seat everyone. As for the pooled funds, we cannot fix an amount in advance; we must simply make the arrangements and settle the accounts thereafter.\\" Everyone agreed. Ziyu sat in a daze. Zhongqing laughed:"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春喜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"珠道：「今日的客，尚短几人？」文泽道：「就止寿翁一人。花部中未到的尚有四人：琴言、琪官都有病，早来辞了，桂保、春喜是必来的。等湘帆一到，就可坐了。」","en":"contingent, four are absent: Qinyan and Qiguan are both ill and sent their regrets early this morning; Guibao and Chunxi will certainly be here. Once Xiangfan arrives, we can take our seats.\\""},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":2,"tokens":["林春喜","春喜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"定完后，王桂保、林春喜来了，皆见过了。正席上令漱芳、玉林、春喜伺候；左席上令宝珠、兰保、素兰；右席上则蕙芳、桂保二人。分派已定，各人坐了，慢慢的浅斟缓酌起来，正是：","en":"Once the seating was settled, Wang Guibao and Lin Chunxi arrived and were introduced all around. At the center table, Shufang, Yulin, and Chunxi attended; at the left table, Baozhu, Lanbao, and Sulan; at the right table, Huifang and Guibao. The assignments made, everyone took their seats and began to pour"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春喜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"家人们撤去残肴，备上香茗鲜果。春喜与桂保到太湖石畔，同坐在芍药栏边闲话；玉林、漱芳已醉卧在海棠花下；兰保在池畔钓鱼；宝珠与蕙芳对弈，素兰观局，南湘、高品在傍为宝珠指点。蕙芳道：「你们三人下我一个。就赢了也不算稀奇。」宝珠道：「我偏不用人教也赢得你。」文泽道：「今日我们亦算极乐了，可惜","en":"The servants cleared away the remaining dishes and set out fragrant tea and fresh fruit. Chunxi and Guibao went to the Taihu stone rockery and sat chatting by the peony hedge. Yulin and Shufang had drunk themselves into a stupor and lay asleep beneath the crabapple blossoms. Lanbao was fishing by the pond. Baozhu and Huifang were playing chess,"},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春喜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"存偏见。」于是大家评定：以宝珠为牡丹，蕙芳为芍药，素兰为莲花，玉林为碧桃，漱芳为海棠，兰保为玫瑰，桂保为芙蓉，春喜小而多才，人人钟爱为兰花。八人品题尽合，因又想到琴言、琪官为何花？子云道：「琴言色艺过佳，而性情过冷，比为梅花最是相称，且其酷爱梅，不属庾香将谁属耶？」众人说道；「很是。」高品道：「只怕和靖先生不依，庾香割了他靴革幼子了。」","en":"lotus; Yulin as the green peach blossom; Shufang as the crabapple; Lanbao as the rose; Guibao as the cotton rose. Chunxi, small in stature yet richly talented and beloved by all, was assigned the orchid. The eight assignments all felt fitting. They then wondered what flowers Qinyan and Qiguan should be. Ziyun said: \\"Qinyan's art and beauty are exceptional, yet his temperament"}],"24":[{"paragraph":5,"mentions":1,"tokens":["小梅"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"十余个，是五六班凑成的。」仲清道：「旦脚十个是谁？」桂保道：「我们两个之外，尚有瑶卿、媚香、香畹、静芳、瘦香、小梅，后来又添了玉侬、玉艳，共是十个。」王恂道：「这就是十美班了。」桂保道：「陪客尚未定，你们是一定在数的。听得度香已写书子到保定府去，请前舟回来商议，只怕就是这件事。」王恂道：「也近了，今日已是二十六日了，还有十天，就演得全这些新戏吗？」玉林笑道：「你","en":"performers?\\" Guibao replied, \\"Besides the two of us, there are Yaoqing, Meixiang, Xiangwan, Jingfang, Shouxiang, and Xiaomei. Yunong and Yuyan joined later, making ten in all.\\" Wang Xun said, \\"That makes a Ten-Beauties company.\\" Guibao added, \\"The guest list isn't entirely settled yet, but you two are certainly included. I heard Duxiang wrote to Baoding to invite Qianzhou"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":1,"tokens":["小梅"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"心灵口敏，仪秀态妍，是小梅。泛应有余，风流自赏。」把嘴向着桂保道：「这是他。别有会心，人难索解，海枯石烂，节操不移，这是玉侬。把洁守贞，不计利害，是玉艳。至于我则无长可取，碌碌庸人，使人嫌弃的，就是我了。」桂保道：「这是你自己不好下赞语，这考语待我出吧：芳洁自守，风雅宜人，不","en":"\\"Quick of spirit and nimble of speech, with a graceful bearing—that is Xiaomei. Highly versatile and nursing a romantic self-regard—\\" Yulin nodded toward Guibao, \\"that is him. A secret heart that few can ever truly grasp, steadfast until the seas run dry—that is Yunong. Pure fidelity, entirely heedless of personal gain—that is"}],"30":[{"paragraph":12,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春喜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，佐以诙谐。那边席上，聘才问次贤怡园的光景。次贤略述了几处。随后即见宝珠、蕙芳、素兰、漱芳、玉林、兰保、桂保，春喜、琪官等九个，又凑上一个，作了一出《秦淮河看花大会》，有幽闲的，有妖冶的，有静婉的，有风流的，极尽靡艳之致，众人尽皆喝采。子云、次贤等就于此出中间放了赏。华公子对着笑道：「此系抄袭吾兄旧文，殊觉数见不鲜。」子云道：「唱的甚好，贞静的却极贞静，放浪的却","en":"Contentment. Cixian briefly described a few places. Next came Baozhu, Huifang, Sulan, Shufang, Yulin, Lanbao, Guibao, Chunxi, Qiguan—nine in total—plus one more, performing the play 'Flower-Viewing Assembly on the Qinhuai'. Some were demure, some coquettish, some quiet and gentle, and some romantic, exhibiting the utmost alluring charm. Everyone applauded. Ziyun, Cixian, and"}],"31":[{"paragraph":3,"mentions":2,"tokens":["小梅"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"卿是长于丹青的，静芳是长于舞剑的，香畹是长于书法的，佩仙是长于填词的，蕊香是长于猜谜诙谐的，瘦香是长于品箫的，小梅是长于吹笙的。可惜玉侬又病了，他倒会一套《平沙落雁》。」华公子便命叫他起来，又吩咐珊枝拿了琵琶来。家人把些笔砚乐器都搬了出来，分摆在各处。次贤道：「我来点将：先点玉侬与瘦香把琴箫和起来；再点瑶卿画一幅，媚香、香畹、佩仙对景吟诗，题在上面；再点珊枝与小","en":"lyrics, Ruixiang has a gift for riddles and witty banter, Shouxiang is masterful with the vertical flute, and Xiaomei plays the mouth-organ beautifully. It is only a pity that Yunong has fallen ill, for he plays a wonderful rendition of 'Wild Geese Alighting on Level Sand'.\\" Hearing this, Young Master Hua ordered him to be roused from his sleep and told Shanzhi to fetch"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春喜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"次贤叫他们快些写上，蕙芳、玉林都要素兰代写，华公子不依，只得各自写了。大家又赏叹一回，于是静坐，听珊枝的琵琶与春喜的笙。珊枝斜坐着拨动檀槽，只见指法如雨洒芭蕉，声韵如滩头流水，满怀春色，绕乱一堂。加之笙韵高低，声声应和。听得人人色舞眉飞，四肢愉快。弹了《月儿高》一套，大家也赞了一回。","en":"write their own. After another round of admiration and praise, they sat quietly to listen to Shanzhi's pipa and Chunxi's sheng. Shanzhi sat at an angle, his fingers striking the sandalwood frets like rain showering upon plantain leaves, the melody flowing like water over a river shoal. A chaotic, vibrant spring filled the hall, perfectly complemented by the rising and"}],"45":[{"paragraph":12,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春喜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"相见，叙了些彼此仰慕的话。只有史南湘、田春航在场中未来。相公们到的是宝珠、蕙芳、素兰、玉林、漱芳、兰保、桂保、春喜、琪官、连琴言刚是十人。","en":"examination grounds. Among the performers who came were Baozhu, Huifang, Sulan, Yulin, Shufang, Lanbao, Guibao, Chunxi, and Qiguan. Qinyan made ten in total."},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春喜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"道生与琴言拜送了杜兰仙，重新焚香换酒，众名士一齐下拜，换了琪官、春喜上来扶乩。道生道：「今日坡仙必有佳作，我们当盥漱恭读。」只见乩上写道：","en":"off the Goddess Du Lanxiang. Fresh incense and wine were brought. Every gentleman knelt together, and Qiguan and Chunxi took the planchette. Daosheng said, \\"Today the Immortal of the Slope will surely leave us a masterpiece. We should rinse our mouths and read with reverence.\\" The planchette wrote:"},{"paragraph":33,"mentions":1,"tokens":["小梅"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，王树琪花列两行。\\n十树琼花十样锦，春风喜气满华堂。\\n众人道：「首句是香畹，次句是佩仙、玉艳，三句总说，末句是小梅。」子云掐指一算，名花已有了八人，只少静芳、蕊香两人了。又见写道：","en":"together. \\"The first line is Xiangwan. The second is Peixian and Yuyan. The third sums them up, and the last line is Xiaomei.\\" Ziyun counted on his fingers. Eight flowers were named, leaving only Jingfang and Ruixiang missing. Next:"},{"paragraph":43,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春喜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"也跟着动起来了。」漱芳道：「可不是，我先也打量是你作诡，及至写了一句诗，我还疑惑是作出来的，后来才知不是了。」春喜道：「我们扶的时候手要不动，那乩自己就会跳起来，比你们头一回还动得快。」","en":"thought you were tricking too! After the first verse, I still suspected artifice. Only then did I know it was real.\\" Chunxi added, \\"When we held it, if we kept perfectly still, the planchette jumped faster than it did in your first round.\\""}],"46":[{"paragraph":53,"mentions":1,"tokens":["林春喜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"正饮酒间，王兰保、金漱芳、秦琪官、林春喜同来见了，即分开坐了，谈了些闲话。子云道：「今日这二十四副对子，清芬浓艳，各尽所长。但我看来，始终要推道翁先生的赐书楼、承荫堂冠冕堂皇了。」众名士道：「自然，我们到底觉得力薄，那里能这样大方，这是勉强不来的。」道翁道：「这也不然，一来相体裁衣，二来是","en":"While they were at their food and wine, Wang Lanbao, Jin Shufang, Qin Qiguan and Lin Chunxi all came in and paid their respects, and sat down apart, and there was some idle talk.\\n\\nZiyun said, \\"These twenty-four couplets today are fresh or rich by turns, and every man has done his best. But to my mind Master Qu's, for the Tower of Imperial Bestowals"}],"48":[{"paragraph":29,"mentions":1,"tokens":["林小梅"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"么还忍得住，便也泪流满面。琪官又道：「你从前给我那个水晶猫儿，我还当着宝贝一样。现在天天学字，拿他做镇纸。去年林小梅要我的，我不肯给他。我说是哥哥路上给我的，我要留着他。」琴仙道：「你给我那琥珀扇坠儿，我也留着。」便也执着琪官的手道：「我此去，也不知怎样，我这般苦命，料是没有什么好处的。还是你们在京里好，大家相帮着，还有个照应。我如今出了京，只好听我的运气，好好歹","en":"— I keep it like a treasure. I am at my characters every day now and I use it for a paperweight. Last year Lin Xiaomei wanted it of me and I would not give it up. I told him my brother gave it me on the road and I meant to keep it.\\" Qinxian said, \\"And I have kept the amber fan-pendant you gave me.\\"\\n\\nHe took Qiguan's hand too, and said, \\"Where I am going I cannot tell."},{"paragraph":36,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春喜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"外皇华亭。只见南湘、仲清、文泽、金粟、王恂、子玉、春航，领着那蕙芳、宝珠、素兰、漱芳、玉林、兰保、桂保、琪官、春喜九个名旦，在皇华亭等候。道翁等连忙下车，极口辞谢。各人皆要把盏。","en":"Chunhang, alongside Huifang and the nine famous performers: Baozhu, Sulan, Shufang, Yulin, Lanbao, Guibao, Qiguan, and Chunxi. Daoweng hurried down from his carriage and thanked everyone repeatedly, as they all eagerly wished to raise a cup in a final parting toast."}],"50":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":6,"tokens":["林春喜","春喜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"真当差，不过讲究些车马衣服，借着上衙门的日子，可以出来散散。戏馆歌楼，三朋四友，甚是有兴。一日，文泽回来，路过林春喜门口，着人问了春喜在家，文泽下了车进去。远远望见春喜穿着白纻丝衫子，面前放着一个玻璃冰碗，自己在那里刷藕，见了文泽，连忙笑盈盈的出来。文泽道：「你也总不到我那里去，你前日要我那白磁冰桶，我倒替你找了一个，而且很好，不大不小的，我明日送来给你。」春喜道","en":"theaters and song-houses with their wide circles of friends. One day, returning from the yamen, Wenze passed by Lin Chunxi's door. He sent a servant to inquire if Chunxi was at home, and upon hearing he was, stepped down from his carriage and went inside. From a distance, he caught sight of Chunxi dressed in a pristine white raw-silk summer robe. Before him sat a crystal-clear"},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":4,"tokens":["春喜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"文泽笑道：「若是真的，他也不肯给你，知你不是个赏鉴家。」春喜笑道：「好就是了，何必论真假。」文泽见春喜两间书室倒很幽雅。前面一个见方院子，种些花草，摆些盆景，支了一个小卷篷。后面一带北窗墙子内，种四五棵芭蕉，叶上两面皆写满了字，有真有行，大小不一，问春喜道：「这是你写的么？悬空着倒也难写。」春喜道：「我想「书","en":"laughed. \\"If it were truly genuine, he would never have parted with it, knowing full well you are no connoisseur.\\" Chunxi smiled in return. \\"As long as it is pleasing to the eye, why bicker over true or false?\\" Wenze noticed that Chunxi's two-room study was exceptionally serene and tasteful. In the front was a square courtyard planted with an array of flowers and grasses,"},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春喜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"看，是画些蜻蜓、螳螂、促织、蜘蛛各样的草虫。文泽笑道：「这倒亏你，很有点意思，只怕你学出来，比瑶卿还要好些。」春喜道：「瑶卿近来我有些恨他。他的画自然比我好，但他学了两三年，我是今年才学的。春间请教请教他，不是笑我，就是薄我，问他的法子，他又不肯说。","en":"is quite inventive of you, rather charming! I fear that once you master this, you might even surpass Yaoqing.\\" Chunxi sighed, \\"Lately, I harbor a bit of resentment toward Yaoqing. Naturally, his painting is superior to mine, but he has been studying for two or three years, while I only began this spring. Whenever I went to consult him, he would either mock me or brush"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":6,"tokens":["春喜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，倒不要看那芥子园的画谱。」又笑嘻嘻的对着文泽道：「我与你画把扇子。」文泽道：「此时我不要，等你学好了再画。」春喜道：「你们势利，怎见得我此时就画得不好？你若有好团扇，我就加意画了。」说罢就跑了进去，拿了一柄团扇出来，画着一枝杨柳，有一个螳螂捕蝉。那翅张开，一翅在螳螂身下压住，很像嘶出那急声来。那螳螂两臂扎住了蝉项，口去咬他，两眼鼓起，头上两须一横一竖，像动的一","en":"fan for you.\\" Wenze replied, \\"I don't want one right now. I shall wait until you have truly mastered the art.\\" Chunxi protested, \\"How snobbish you all are! How do you know my painting isn't good enough already? If you have a fine round silk fan, I shall paint it with utmost care.\\" With that, he ran inside and emerged holding a round fan. Painted upon it was a graceful"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":2,"tokens":["春喜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"以进来。」文泽道：「莫非就是那唐和尚开的安吉堂么？闻得那地方倒好，他又将寺里的几间房子也通了过去，我们就去。」春喜道：「怪热的天，在这里不好吗？」桂保道：「那里也好，内中有几间屋子，摆满了花卉，大天篷凉爽得很。倒是那里好。」即催了春喜，换了衣裳，都上车，到了安吉堂对门车厂里，卸了车。文泽等走进，掌柜的忙出柜迎接，即引到后面一个密室，却是三间，隔去一间，并预备了床","en":"things about that place; they say he's even connected a few rooms from the temple to it. Let's all go there!\\" Chunxi objected, \\"On such a sweltering day? Isn't it fine right here?\\" Guibao chimed in, \\"It's lovely there too. Inside, there are several rooms overflowing with fresh flowers, and the large awnings make it delightfully cool. That is the place to be.\\" They"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春喜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"香，中间一个冰桶，拿了些西瓜、鲜核桃、杏仁、大桃儿、葡萄、雪藕之类，浸在冰里。首坐仲清，次文泽，次王恂，琪官、春喜、桂保相间而坐。来了几样菜，各人随意小酌闲谈。","en":"chilling perfectly in the ice. Zhongqing took the seat of honor, followed by Wenze, then Wang Xun, with Qiguan, Chunxi, and Guibao interspersed among them. Once a few dishes arrived, they sipped their wine and chatted at their leisure."},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":2,"tokens":["春喜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"春喜道：「这个容易，也不至于罚的。我就从天字说起，旧管是个天字，新收一个竹字，便合成了笑字。开除了人字，实在是个竺字。」众人赞道：「好。」琪官道：「我也有一个，旧管是个金字，新收一个则字。」说到此，便写了一个铡字：「开除了一个贝字，实在是个钊字。」桂保道","en":"Chunxi quickly spoke up, \\"That's easy enough; no one will need to be penalized. I shall start with the character for 'sky' (天). The 'Old Stock' is tian (天). The 'New Intake' is the bamboo radical (⺮), combining to form the character for 'laugh' (笑). 'Remove'"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":3,"tokens":["春喜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琪官道：「我的旧管是串字，新收了心字，是患字。开除了口字，实在是忠字。」春喜道：「我旧管是昌字，新收门字，是个阊字。开除了曰字，实在是间字。」仲清道：「我旧管是贱字，新收三点水，是溅字。开除了贝字，实在是浅字。」文泽道：「我旧管是波字，新收一个女字，是婆字。开除了波字，实在是女字。」春喜道：「怎么说？闹错了。旧管是波字。怎么","en":"Intake' is 'heart' (心), forming 'worry' (患). 'Remove' 'mouth' (口), and the 'Actual Remainder' is 'loyal' (忠).\\" Chunxi chimed in, \\"My 'Old Stock' is 'prosperous' (昌). The 'New Intake' is 'door' (门), forming chang (阊). 'Remove' 'say' (曰), and the 'Actual Remainder' is 'between' (间).\\" Zhongqing added, \\"My 'Old Stock' is 'cheap' (贱). The 'New Intake' is the three water"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":5,"tokens":["春喜","小梅"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"些，也用不着抬女字的那么使劲。」众皆大笑。琪官道：「旧管是胡字，新收三点水，是湖字。开除了沽字，实在是月字。」春喜道：「旧管是邑字，新收个才字，是挹字。开除了口字，实在是把字。」文泽道：「这个令没有什么意思，我不说了，还说别样罢。」饮了几杯酒，只听得隔壁唱起来，众人听是唱的《南浦》道：「无限别离情，两月夫妻，一旦孤另。」桂保谓春喜道：「小梅你近来很讲究唱法，南曲","en":"three water drops (氵), forming 'lake' (湖). 'Remove' gu (沽, to buy), and the 'Actual Remainder' is 'moon' (月).\\" Chunxi said, \\"The 'Old Stock' is 'city' (邑). The 'New Intake' is 'talent' (才), forming 'draw water' (挹). 'Remove' 'mouth' (口), and the 'Actual Remainder' is 'hold' (把).\\" Wenze sighed, \\"This game has lost its charm. I won't play anymore; let's talk of something"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":5,"tokens":["春喜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"着桌子道：「你听，两月夫妻，一旦孤另。」桂保道：「你真讲得不错。」又道：「你知道唱南曲，有用一凡工尺的没有？」春喜道：「南曲是没有一凡的，是人人尽知。惟有一处，我问过你令兄，他是个刺杀旦。我问他南曲笛子上有一凡没有，他也说没有。我说你做《刺梁》那一出，是南北合套，梁冀所唱之曲皆系南曲，到看报时唱的「酒困潦倒」这「潦倒」上的工尺，就吹出一凡。因为邬飞霞接唱北曲，不","en":"Slapping his hand sharply on the table, Chunxi demonstrated: \\"Listen: 'Two months as husband and wife— snap —in a single dawn left alone.'\\" Guibao praised him, \\"You explain it brilliantly.\\" He then asked, \\"Do you know if the yi-fan pitch is ever used when singing Southern tunes?\\" Chunxi replied confidently,"}],"60":[{"paragraph":5,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春喜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"想必文字有灵，前生缘法，子云拈了道翁，子玉拈了杜仙女、琴仙，金粟拈了宝珠，春航拈了蕙芳，仲清拈了琪官，文泽拈了春喜，南湘拈了兰保，王恂拈了桂保，高品拈了玉林，次贤拈了漱芳，单拈不着素兰，只好送与华公子去作了。众人分派已定，子玉说道：「做传容易，画画难，还要刻石，更须时日，不知几天可以告成？」吉甫道：「不消多日，碑是磨现成的，一面画，一面就叫季十矮子找人刻，大约十","en":"Daoweng; Ziyu drew Fairy Du and Qinxian; Jin Su drew Baozhu; Chunhang drew Huifang; Zhongqing drew Qiguan; Wenze drew Chunxi; Nanxiang drew Lanbao; Wang Xun drew Guibao; Gao Pin drew Yulin; and Cixian drew Shufang. Sulan alone was not drawn, so that assignment was sent to Young Master Hua. The tasks distributed, Ziyu said, \\"Writing biographies is easy, but painting is difficult,"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春喜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"沾裳。吮纤毫而抒写，对玉貌而傍徨。\\n琴仙道：「好赋。正是松风竹雨，仙露明珠，将你那清腴娟秀，都一齐刻画出来。」春喜道：「这是前舟在那里认真做赋，忘了题目了。」琴仙道：「却也是你的光景。」再看第十方，是一个桂树下有个仙女，姿致风流，青眸善盼，题曰：","en":"on the bamboo, of immortal dew and bright pearls, perfectly capturing your lean elegance and delicate beauty.\\" Chunxi replied, \\"This is Qianzhou taking his rhapsody too seriously and forgetting the subject entirely.\\" Qinxian noted, \\"Yet it captures your essence perfectly.\\" He then looked at the tenth panel, showing a fairy maiden standing beneath a cassia tree, exuding"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":1,"tokens":["小梅"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"们想这个报答可好么？」素兰道：「这个是极妙，但我们的诗配不上他们。且请谁画这些像呢？」蕙芳道：「就是瑶卿，你与小梅两人分画罢，也不必画服饰，不衫不履的最妙。我们今晚先把赞语做起，明日与他们看看，然后再画。我们就各人还各人的礼，一个赞也不甚费力。」","en":"our poetry is no match for theirs. And who could we ask to paint these portraits?\\" Huifang said, \\"Yaoqing and Xiaomei can split the painting between them. There's no need to paint formal attire—depicting them in casual, unbuttoned ease would be best. Let us first draft the eulogies tonight, show them to the scholars tomorrow, and then begin the painting. We will each"},{"paragraph":30,"mentions":1,"tokens":["林春喜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"千仞，好风吹衣。秋庭仰望，月明星稀。\\n古松自挺，碧萝难依。太华入云，蓬莱隔水。\\n谁登其峰，徒兴仰止。\\n第六首是林春喜题的《仙中和品》：","en":"the clouds, Penglai lies across the waters.\\nWho can climb its peak? One can only gaze up in awe.\\"\\n\\nThe sixth was Lin Chunxi's *Harmonious Grade Among Immortals*:"},{"paragraph":37,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春喜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"素兰与春喜各画几日，摹上了石，将赞语书丹，共有二十余日完竣。择于三月三日，供设九香楼上，为长生禄位。琴仙过来与宝珠商量，必须作一篇祝文，方表诚意，宝珠等深以为然。于是十人公同斟酌，凑成一篇文，改削了几遍，倒也不见联缀痕迹。宝珠道：「明日公祝，须请齐了诸名士来。","en":"Sulan and Chunxi spent several days painting, then traced the designs onto the stone and inscribed the eulogies in vermilion. In total, the work took over twenty days to complete. They chose the third day of the third month to install the longevity tablets on the upper"}]}`),"char-31":JSON.parse(`{"1":[{"paragraph":52,"mentions":1,"tokens":[],"kind":"identified-reference","zh":"车里坐着一个老年的，外面坐了两个妙童，都不过十四五岁。","en":"Ziyu couldn't stop laughing to himself all the way. \\"Why do these people turn their minds so hazy and blind, failing to distinguish black from white, all for a few young dan? If a truly peerless beauty were to appear right now, I fear they would actually say he looked terrible.\\" Lost in these thoughts along the way, his carriage suddenly became wedged in a crowded bottleneck. Ziyu caught a waft of a pure, fresh fragrance—neither orchid nor musk—and peeked out through the glass window on the curtain. He saw a carriage opposite them. Inside sat an elderly man, and on the outside sat two wondrous young boys, both no more than fourteen or fifteen.","identityNote":{"en":"Chapter 2 identifies the three carriage occupants retrospectively as Qinyan, Qiguan and Ye Maolin.","zh":"第2回回叙此番挤车，明言同车者为琴官、琪官与叶茂林。"}}],"2":[{"paragraph":12,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琪官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"粮船拥挤，就走了四个多月。见他们天天的学戏，倒也听会了许多。我们这个船上，有五个孩子，顶好的有两个：一个小旦叫琪官，年十四岁。他的颜色就像花粉和了胭脂水，勾匀的搓成，一弹就破的。另有一股清气，晕在眉梢眼角里头。唱起戏来，比那画眉、黄鹂的声音还要清脆几分。","en":"of their melodies by ear. Aboard our vessel were five youths, and the two most brilliant were a young dan named Qiguan, fourteen years of age. His complexion was like rouge and fine powder masterfully blended, forming a flawless visage that seemed fragile enough to shatter at a touch. A singular aura of fresh purity lingered about his brows and the corners of his eyes."},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":3,"tokens":["琪官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"说的就是我见的，那一班人却像从南边来的模样。」便又问道：「你说那个顶好的叫什么名字？」聘才道：「叫琴官。那个叫琪官。」子玉道：「琴官进城那一天穿的什么衣裳？」聘才道：「都是蓝绉绸皮袄，酱色呢得胜褂。」子玉见衣服已经对了，又问：「他一人一个车呢，还与人同坐一个车？」聘才道：「他与琪官、叶茂林同坐一个车，那车围是蓝布的，骡子是白的。」子玉又道：「那叶茂林有多少岁数了","en":"asked, \\"What did you say the most beautiful one was named?\\" Pincai replied, \\"He is named Qinguan. The other is Qiguan.\\" Ziyu pressed on, \\"What garments was Qinguan wearing on the day he entered the city?\\" Pincai described, \\"Both wore fur coats of blue crepe silk beneath outer riding jackets of dark brown wool.\\" Ziyu, noting the match in attire, probed further, \\"Did"},{"paragraph":42,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琪官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"赏了桂保二十两银子，桂保谢了，走到书房来找王恂、仲清，谈了一会，说道：「我们班里新来了两个：一个叫琴官，一个叫琪官，生得色艺俱佳，只怕史竹君的《花选》又要翻刻了。」又坐了一会也自回去。不知后事如何，且听下回分解。","en":"time before Guibao revealed, \\"Two new performers have recently joined our troupe, one named Qinguan, the other Qiguan. Both are exquisitely beautiful and remarkably talented. I fear Shi Zhujun's Selection of Flowers will require yet another printing.\\" He lingered a while longer before finally departing for home. As for what unfolded next, you must listen to the following"}],"3":[{"paragraph":7,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琪官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琪官定于腊月初十日上台，其余各自跟他师傅，也有在联锦班的，也有过别班里去的。聘才又问他的寓处，说在杨柳巷联锦班总寓内。聘才道：「改日过来奉看。」茂林道：「这如何敢当，只好顺便去逛逛。」说着许顺已同了金二回来，已经说妥，定于正月初六日在姑苏会馆，不论分包不","en":"Qiguan was slated to make his stage debut on the tenth day of the twelfth month. The others had followed their respective masters—some joining the Lianjin Troupe, others scattering to different companies. Pincai asked for Ye's residence and was told he resided"}],"4":[{"paragraph":32,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琪官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"第八，我以后再不做这不通诗了。等我学了一年，再与他们来。」又说道：「我们班里来了两个新脚色，一个叫琴官，一个叫琪官，你们见过没有？」仲清道，「前日蕊香说起两人来，刚说时就有人来打断了，没有说下去。」王恂问道：「这两人怎样？」春喜道：「好极了，那个琴官，与瑶卿不相上下。那个琪官，与蕊香难定高低。此刻都还没有上台，但一天已有三五处叫他。前日度香见了，也大加赏赞，即赏","en":"with them.\\" Then he added, \\"Two new performers have come to our company. One is called Qinguan, one is called Qiguan. Have you met them?\\" Zhongqing said, \\"The other day Ruixiang mentioned the two of them, but just as he was starting to say something, someone interrupted and he never finished.\\" Wang Xun asked, \\"What are these two like?\\" Chunxi said, \\"Excellent. That"}],"5":[{"paragraph":8,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琪官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一日，子云在堂会中，见了新来的琴官、琪官两个，十分赞赏，叹为创见，正与那八个名旦一气相孚，才生了物色的念头。叫袁宝珠改日同他们到园来。又见他们的服饰未美，即连夜制造了几套，赏给了他们，这两个相公自然感激的了。但那个琴官，却又不然。且先将他的出身略叙一叙。","en":"One day, at a theatrical gathering, Ziyun encountered two newly arrived performers, Qinguan and Qiguan, and was greatly impressed. He marveled that such talent was unprecedented, seeing that they were perfectly suited to stand alongside the eight famous dan performers. This kindled his desire to cultivate their acquaintance. He asked Yuan Baozhu to bring"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琪官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"是日琪官感冒，不能起来，袁宝珠先到琴官寓里。这个宝珠的容貌，《花选》中已经说过了，性格温柔，貌如处女。他也爱这琴官的相貌与己彷佛，虽是初交，倒与夙好一般。两人已谈心过几回，琴官也重宝珠的人品，是个洁身自爱的人。宝珠又将子云的好处，细细说给他听，琴官便也放了好","en":"That day, Qiguan had caught a cold and could not get up, so Yuan Baozhu came first to Qinguan's lodgings. Baozhu's appearance had already been described in the Selection of Flowers: his nature gentle and yielding, his looks like a maiden's. He too was attracted to Qinguan,"}],"8":[{"paragraph":6,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琪官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"戏，只与聘才说话。聘才说起琴官，仲雨道：「我也见过这人，相貌倒好，就是人冷些。如今是天天在怡园徐度香处。还有个琪官，略比他和气些。」聘才道：「这个琴官，是我们梅庾香最得意的。」仲两道：「他也喜欢琴官吗？我倒不大见他出来。」元茂却呆呆听着，见有一个相公走来，到张仲雨面前请了安，又照应了聘才，对着元茂也弯了弯腰。元茂擦擦眼睛，聚起了眼光，把那相公一看，原来是前日在会","en":"temperament runs rather cold. These days he is constantly at Xu Duxiang's Garden of Contentment. There is also Qiguan, who is somewhat more amiable.\\" Pincai noted, \\"This Qinguan is the one our Mei Yuxiang treasures above all.\\" Zhongyu raised an eyebrow. \\"He fancies Qinguan as well? I rarely see him out and about.\\" Yuanmao sat in a daze, listening quietly, when a young"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":3,"tokens":["琪官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"院》，便又一个相公到张仲雨身边，也坐着不走。聘才问他的名字，叫保珠。台上又换一出《女弹词》，一出场，聘才认得是琪官。看他打扮得十分香艳，颇有花含晓露，月印暗川之致，两边楼上喝采不迭。仲雨道：「这个就是琪官。」聘才点头含笑道：「这琪官比去年更觉好了。「元茂也认不清楚，只与二喜说话，又看看保珠，却没有余情照应到台上。那保珠见元茂喜欢他，也挨了过来。二喜便拦着他，不叫","en":"stage, the scene shifted to 'Female Ballad-Singing.' The moment the actor made his entrance, Pincai recognized Qiguan. His attire was exquisitely alluring, exuding the delicate grace of a blossom kissed by morning dew or the moon reflected in a tranquil stream. A thunderous ovation erupted from both galleries. \\"That is Qiguan,\\" Zhongyu noted. Pincai smiled and nodded,"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琪官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琪官唱完，进了场，卸了妆，在帘子边站了一站，望见了聘才，即微微的一笑。聘才对他点点头。又见他衣裘华美，靴帽时新，迥非从前模样，意谓其必过来招呼。果见他进了戏房，候了一会，猛一抬头，只见他已坐在对面楼上，同着前日唱《题曲》的那个小旦，陪着两个华冠丽服的人。","en":"When Qiguan concluded his performance, he exited the stage, removed his makeup, and paused at the edge of the curtain. Catching sight of Pincai, he offered a faint, graceful smile. Pincai returned the nod. He noted that Qiguan was now arrayed in splendid furs, complete"}],"17":[{"paragraph":5,"mentions":2,"tokens":["秦琪官","玉艳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"王恂道：「是呀，我真该打，一时竟忘了琴言，是必要他来的。还有那个秦琪官号玉艳的也叫了他来，凑成十个。」众人道：「如此更妙。」子玉道：「如今我们商议起来，怎样邀客。」王恂道：「你作一小札与怡园徐、萧二公，前舟以及余人，我们明日自去知会。」于是大家直谈至二更方散。子玉送了诸人，独坐凝思了一回，想道：「后日之会，足成千古，不","en":"\\"Quite right, I deserve a reprimand! I entirely forgot Qinyan for a moment, yet he absolutely must come. And that Qin Qiguan, styled Yuyan, should be summoned too, making it a perfect ten.\\" Everyone said: \\"That is even better.\\" Ziyu said: \\"Now that we have discussed it, how shall we invite the guests?\\" Wang Xun said: \\"You draft a brief note to the two gentlemen Xu and Xiao"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":1,"tokens":["秦琪官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"芬芳，又有芍药、海棠等花开满。少停。即去知会群花，于明日辰刻毕集。因说道：「明日花林中，恐有几个不能来。我知道秦琪官害眼，杜琴言亦患病未痊。昨晚我见素兰，谈及庾香在彼处坐了半日，去访琴言，恰值他师傅请客没有进去，琴言亦未知庾香去访他。明日就使他们两个不来，也有八人，很为热闹的了。庾香、静宜想一定来的。」南湘道：「席间行令，新鲜的甚少，太难了又恐座客一时不能，须得雅","en":"hour the next day. Wenze said: \\"Tomorrow among the floral forest, I fear a few may be unable to attend. I know Qin Qiguan suffers an eye ailment, and Du Qinyan is also ill and not yet recovered. Last night I saw Sulan, who mentioned that Yuxiang sat there for half the day, then went to visit Qinyan; it happened that his master was hosting guests so he did not enter, and"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琪官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"其三大觞。」蕙芳似觉脸红，宝珠道：「今日的客，尚短几人？」文泽道：「就止寿翁一人。花部中未到的尚有四人：琴言、琪官都有病，早来辞了，桂保、春喜是必来的。等湘帆一到，就可坐了。」","en":"today?\\" Wenze said: \\"Just the birthday-star, one person. Among the flower contingent, four are absent: Qinyan and Qiguan are both ill and sent their regrets early this morning; Guibao and Chunxi will certainly be here. Once Xiangfan arrives, we can take our seats.\\""},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琪官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"花，玉林为碧桃，漱芳为海棠，兰保为玫瑰，桂保为芙蓉，春喜小而多才，人人钟爱为兰花。八人品题尽合，因又想到琴言、琪官为何花？子云道：「琴言色艺过佳，而性情过冷，比为梅花最是相称，且其酷爱梅，不属庾香将谁属耶？」众人说道；「很是。」高品道：「只怕和靖先生不依，庾香割了他靴革幼子了。」","en":"all, was assigned the orchid. The eight assignments all felt fitting. They then wondered what flowers Qinyan and Qiguan should be. Ziyun said: \\"Qinyan's art and beauty are exceptional, yet his temperament is exceedingly cool. Likening him to the plum blossom is most apt; and since his passionate love of the plum is not for Yuxiang's sake, then whose?\\" Everyone agreed:"},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":3,"tokens":["琪官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉不觉脸红。仲清道：「琪官呢？」子云道：「琪官性情刚烈，相貌极好。似欠旖旎风流。比他为菊花罢。」高品道：「菊花种数不一，有白有黄，或红或紫，白的还好，其余似觉老气横秋。琪官性情虽烈，其温柔处亦颇耐人怜爱，不如比为杏花。」众人道：「好个杏花，极妥当。」文泽道：「说起菊花有黄有白","en":"Ziyu could not help blushing. Zhongqing said: \\"And Qiguan?\\" Ziyun said: \\"Qiguan's temperament is fierce and upright, his appearance extremely fine; he somewhat lacks a gentle, flowing charm. Let him be likened to the chrysanthemum.\\" Gao Pin said: \\"Chrysanthemums vary in variety: some white, some yellow, some"},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琪官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"花谱中添了琪官，惟琴言尚未痊愈。高品、文泽因南湘说过，「一客不来罚我做东一日。」子玉是日不到，罚了南湘一天，南湘甚为乐从。即在他家里又叙了一日。惟有子玉、琴言皆未痊愈。正是：数点梅花娇欲坠，月轮又下竹桥西。未知如何，且听下回分解。","en":"Qiguan was added to the flower register; only Qinyan had still not recovered. Gao Pin and Wenze held Nanxiang to what he had said: \\"If one guest is absent, I'll be fined to host a day.\\" Since Ziyu did not come that day, Nanxiang was fined a day of hosting;"}],"19":[{"paragraph":10,"mentions":3,"tokens":["琪官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"道：「怎么叫三个人，倒有两个不来？不知是真病呢，还是推托的？笑梅道：「自然是真病，推托什么。」聘才道：「还有个琪官也是很好的，我正月里叫过他几回，倒是全来的。」聘才又写了条子去叫琪官，梅窗另叫了二喜。走堂的道：「琪官打发人去叫了。二喜在那边陪客已经吃过饭，就散了。」","en":"Xiaomei said: \\"Naturally they are truly ill; what is there to make excuses about?\\" Pincai said: \\"There is also Qiguan, who is very good; I called him a few times in the first month, and he always came.\\" Pincai then wrote a slip to call Qiguan, and Meichuang separately called Erxi. The waiter said: \\"Someone has been sent to call Qiguan. Erxi has already finished eating"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":6,"tokens":["琪官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"闹了一阵，只不见蓉官、琪官到来。笑梅道：「奇了，今日是忌辰，倒叫不出相公来。」二喜道：「还有那个？」笑梅道：「你们班里的琪官，还有联珠的蓉官。」二喜道：「蓉官，我出门时见他到三合楼去的，只怕还没有散。」梅窗道：「那玉林是你们同班的，他真有病吗？」二喜道：「玉林阿！不要说起，他","en":"They had been making merry for a while when still neither Rongguan nor Qiguan had arrived. Xiaomei said: \\"How strange. Today is a memorial anniversary, yet we can't even call out any young protégés.\\" Erxi said: \\"Who else is there?\\" Xiaomei said: \\"Qiguan from your troupe, and Rongguan from Lianzhu.\\" Erxi said: \\"As for Rongguan,"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":6,"tokens":["琪官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"们大半是他们一路的，送了去拘禁起来，百般的挫辱，还要师傅拿钱去赎，极少也要百十吊。这是奚十一的行为。你说玉林与琪官怎样闹事呢？就是这奚十一，头一次在玉林家吃酒。玉林是忠厚人，不会奉承的。他却看上了玉林，就是一套衣裳，一对镯子，又赏他师傅四十吊，因此动了火。第二回单请他，叫玉林陪他，并不多请人，他又赏一百吊。玉林是嫌他那个样子，总和他生生儿的，他心上就恼了。第三回","en":"to ransom them, at the very least a hundred strings or so. This is Xi Eleven's behavior. Now, how did Yulin and Qiguan get involved? This same Xi Eleven first drank at Yulin's house. Yulin is an honest, gentle sort, not skilled at flattery. But Xi Eleven took a fancy to him and gave him a set of clothing, a pair of bracelets, and forty strings of cash for his teacher,"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":4,"tokens":["琪官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「你快说罢。」二喜也喝了酒，又说道：「这琪官也苦极了，手又缩不出来，便使起性子来，不顾疼痛，用力乱扭，把那机巧扭坏了，琪官这两只手却刮得稀烂，血淋淋的，也就哭骂出来。他因小脑袋疼痛，也就躲了。琪官回去告诉了师傅，他与袁宝珠相好，又告诉了宝珠，宝珠气极，便进怡园与徐老爷说了。徐老爷就大怒道：「天","en":"\\"Get on with it.\\" Erxi drank some wine and continued: \\"Qiguan was also in a terrible state. His hands couldn't be withdrawn, and he became furious; ignoring the pain, he wrenched and twisted with all his strength until the mechanism was broken. Qiguan's two hands were scraped raw, dripping blood; he too came out"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琪官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"说罢自己也笑了。聘才心中暗忖道：「倒不料琴官、琪官，既唱了戏，还这么傲性子，有骨气，这也奇了。」即问二喜道这奚十一到底是什么人？这样横行霸道，又这样有钱？」二喜道：「我听得春兰讲，说也是个少爷，他家祖太爷做过布政司，他父亲现做提督呢。」聘才道：「如今春兰呢？」二喜道：「同出去了。」于是大家又谈谈笑笑","en":"Having said this, Erxi laughed himself. Pincai thought privately: \\"Who would have expected that Qinguan and Qiguan, even as performers, should be so proud and dignified, so steadfast in their principles. That is something to marvel at.\\" He then asked Erxi who exactly this Xi Eleven was, and how he could behave so lawlessly and still have so much money. Erxi said:"}],"21":[{"paragraph":11,"mentions":3,"tokens":["玉艳","琪官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"了几声。度香在旁说道：「湘帆好一个浓艳文心，愈艳愈好，愈浓愈好。」度香正赞湘帆的文章，庾香忽说道：「玉侬自然在玉艳之上，玉艳虽好，尚逊瑶卿、媚香一筹，而玉侬则玉树琼花，似非人间花谱中可以位置。」静宜、度香初听了不知他说些什么，后来想了出来：「他误听「愈浓、愈艳」，当是问你与琪官那个好？他就所以说出这两句来，惹得静宜、度香笑个不了。庾香也想出错来，便着实不好意思，","en":"at first did not catch Yuxiang's drift — then realized: he misheard 'thick and rich' as asking which of you or Qiguan ranks higher — he answered: 'Yunong naturally above Yuyan — Yuyan though fine still falls short of Yaoqing and Meixiang — while Yunong stands like trees of jade and blossoms of pearl — no place on human flower-lists.' Jingyi and Duxiang laughed until"}],"24":[{"paragraph":3,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琪官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"。天生这班人，在正人堆里作崇。还听得有个奚十一，专爱糟蹋相公，有一个木桶哄人，不到手不歇，受其荼毒者不少。前日琪官竟为所骗，幸其性烈，毁其木桶而出，双手竟刮得稀烂，至今尚未全好，此是情中的盗贼。若你那位虫蛀的舅爷与你那位贵连襟，则道地是个胡涂虫，不知情为何物，正是悲愉哀乐悉与人异者也。」王恂笑道：「这几个废物，心孔里不知生些什么东西在内，世间的丑态叫他们作尽。孙","en":"Then there is Xi Eleven, who ruins actors by trapping them in a wooden barrel. Many have been poisoned by him. Qiguan was caught in it, but broke the barrel through sheer strength, tearing his hands raw; they are still healing. Xi is a true bandit of passion. And your bookworm brother-in-law, along with his counterpart, haven't the faintest idea what feeling is. Their"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":3,"tokens":["玉艳","琪官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"。」仲清道：「旦脚十个是谁？」桂保道：「我们两个之外，尚有瑶卿、媚香、香畹、静芳、瘦香、小梅，后来又添了玉侬、玉艳，共是十个。」王恂道：「这就是十美班了。」桂保道：「陪客尚未定，你们是一定在数的。听得度香已写书子到保定府去，请前舟回来商议，只怕就是这件事。」王恂道：「也近了，今日已是二十六日了，还有十天，就演得全这些新戏吗？」玉林笑道：「你好记性，还有个闰五月，","en":"replied, \\"Besides the two of us, there are Yaoqing, Meixiang, Xiangwan, Jingfang, Shouxiang, and Xiaomei. Yunong and Yuyan joined later, making ten in all.\\" Wang Xun said, \\"That makes a Ten-Beauties company.\\" Guibao added, \\"The guest list isn't entirely settled yet, but you two are certainly included. I heard Duxiang wrote to Baoding to invite Qianzhou back, likely just"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":2,"tokens":["玉艳","琪官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"风流自赏。」把嘴向着桂保道：「这是他。别有会心，人难索解，海枯石烂，节操不移，这是玉侬。把洁守贞，不计利害，是玉艳。至于我则无长可取，碌碌庸人，使人嫌弃的，就是我了。」桂保道：「这是你自己不好下赞语，这考语待我出吧：芳洁自守，风雅宜人，不亢不卑，无好无恶，这些是佩仙。」仲清、王恂同道：「这考语出得很切，足见蕊香近日识见又长了好些。」玉林道：「我却当不起这考语。」","en":"grasp, steadfast until the seas run dry—that is Yunong. Pure fidelity, entirely heedless of personal gain—that is Yuyan. As for me, I have no merit whatsoever; I am dull, and people despise me. That is who I am.\\" Guibao interrupted, \\"You sell yourself far too short! Here is my verdict on you: fragrant restraint and pleasant grace, neither overly proud nor lowly base,"}],"26":[{"paragraph":13,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琪官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子的好胜脾气，似乎怕人说他剿袭度香之意。于是即与聘才同吃了晚饭，席间聘才又把琴言情性才艺，讲得个锦上添花，又将琪官也保举了一番，直到定更后才散。","en":"Duxiang, he supped with Pincai, their conversation overflowing with praise for Qinyan's talents, and even commending Qiguan, until they parted after the first watch."}],"28":[{"paragraph":4,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琪官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"饭后到素兰处，先叫云儿问了在家，素兰闻知甚喜，忙出迎进。只见房内走出两人来：子玉看时，认得一个是王兰保；一个是琪官，因多时不见他，即看了他一看。见他杏脸搓酥，柳眉耸翠，光彩奕奕，袅娜婷婷，年纪与素兰彷佛，身量略小些，上前见了。","en":"welcome him in. However, two others emerged from the room: Ziyu recognized one as Wang Lanbao, and the other as Qiguan. Not having seen Qiguan for some time, Ziyu took a closer look. His apricot face was like kneaded cream, his willow brows arched like verdant peaks. Radiant and gracefully slender, he appeared about the same age as Sulan, though slightly smaller in stature."},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琪官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"道：「这就是你的小姨子，你们会过亲没有？」子玉道：「这是什么话？那里有这个称呼？」素兰道：「这个称呼倒也通。」琪官也不好意思，便道：「静芳不要取笑。」兰保道：「这倒也不算取笑，你是玉侬的师弟，可不是他的小姨吗？」子玉笑道：「岂有此理。」说着遂各坐下。见桌上杯盘狼籍，似吃饭的光景，素兰叫人收拾了，便亲送一碗茶来，问道：「你今日之来甚奇，想必已经知道了。」子玉听了又","en":"of talk is this? Where does such a title come from?\\" Sulan chimed in, \\"Actually, the title makes some sense.\\" Qiguan felt embarrassed and protested, \\"Jingfang, please don't joke.\\" Lanbao countered, \\"It hardly counts as a joke. You are Yunong's junior apprentice-brother, does that not make you his little sister-in-law?\\" Ziyu laughed, \\"That is utterly absurd.\\" With that,"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":4,"tokens":["琪官","玉艳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"不到琴言身上来，说道：「我实在不晓得你们说的是什么，我是不出大门的，这两天又没人到我那里，如何晓得外面的事？」琪官笑了一笑，素兰道：「你真不知道，我只得告诉你，你且坐稳了。静芳、玉艳，你两个扶住了他，待我再说。」子玉道：「香畹一向直爽，今日何故作这些态度？想来也没有什么奇事，故作惊人之语耳。」素兰又把子玉看了又看，惹得兰保、琪官皆笑。子玉看他们光景，着实心疑，便","en":"front gates, and no one has visited me these past two days. How could I know of matters in the outside world?\\" Qiguan offered a small smile, while Sulan said, \\"Since you truly don't know, I have no choice but to tell you. But brace yourself. Jingfang, Yuyan, you two support him while I explain.\\" Ziyu replied, \\"Xiangwan, you have always been straightforward. Why adopt"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":4,"tokens":["琪官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"侬寄这几味药，必有深意，但不知是什么药，你可叫人拿到药铺问明，叫他就写在包上。」素兰道：「说的是。」就要叫人，琪官道：「不用，跟我的人就认得，他在药铺里当过伙计。」琪官即叫那人进来，把这四味药给他认，那人看了，便说道：「这味是牵牛，这是独活，这是芍药，这是防己。」琪官拿起笔来写了，却想不出意思。素兰道：「他离开了你，便是独活了，我懂得这一味。」兰保道：「防己是防","en":"inquire, and write their names on the packets?\\" Sulan agreed, \\"A sensible idea,\\" and was about to call for a servant. Qiguan interrupted, \\"No need. The servant who accompanied me will recognize them; he used to work in an apothecary.\\" Qiguan summoned the man and showed him the four herbs. The man inspected them and stated, \\"This is morning-glory (Qianniu), this is angelica"}],"30":[{"paragraph":12,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琪官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"诙谐。那边席上，聘才问次贤怡园的光景。次贤略述了几处。随后即见宝珠、蕙芳、素兰、漱芳、玉林、兰保、桂保，春喜、琪官等九个，又凑上一个，作了一出《秦淮河看花大会》，有幽闲的，有妖冶的，有静婉的，有风流的，极尽靡艳之致，众人尽皆喝采。子云、次贤等就于此出中间放了赏。华公子对着笑道：「此系抄袭吾兄旧文，殊觉数见不鲜。」子云道：「唱的甚好，贞静的却极贞静，放浪的却极放浪","en":"Cixian briefly described a few places. Next came Baozhu, Huifang, Sulan, Shufang, Yulin, Lanbao, Guibao, Chunxi, Qiguan—nine in total—plus one more, performing the play 'Flower-Viewing Assembly on the Qinhuai'. Some were demure, some coquettish, some quiet and gentle, and some romantic, exhibiting the utmost alluring charm. Everyone applauded. Ziyun, Cixian, and the others"}],"37":[{"paragraph":8,"mentions":1,"tokens":["玉艳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"三个恶煞，怎么你一齐都遇见了，这也实在为难你。」次贤、王恂皆笑。桂保道：「那个奚十一，我倒没碰见他，就是佩仙、玉艳吃了他的大亏。」琴言道：「我是两次了。」王恂谓桂保道：「你若遇见了奚十一，便怎样呢？」桂保道：「我若遇见了他，也叫他看看桶子，叫个赶车的顽顽他。」说得众人大笑。蕙芳道：「我们如何想个法儿收拾他？」次贤笑道：「你若要收拾他，须得用个苦肉计，恐怕你不肯。","en":"Wang Xun both laughed. Guibao added, \\"That Xi Eleven, I have never had dealings with him myself, but Peixian and Yuyan suffered badly at his hands.\\" Qinyan noted, \\"For me it has been twice now.\\" Wang Xun asked Guibao what he would do if he ran into Xi Eleven. Guibao replied, \\"If I ran into him, I would have him take a look at the barrel too and let a carter have his"}],"45":[{"paragraph":12,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琪官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"叙了些彼此仰慕的话。只有史南湘、田春航在场中未来。相公们到的是宝珠、蕙芳、素兰、玉林、漱芳、兰保、桂保、春喜、琪官、连琴言刚是十人。","en":"grounds. Among the performers who came were Baozhu, Huifang, Sulan, Yulin, Shufang, Lanbao, Guibao, Chunxi, and Qiguan. Qinyan made ten in total."},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琪官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"道生与琴言拜送了杜兰仙，重新焚香换酒，众名士一齐下拜，换了琪官、春喜上来扶乩。道生道：「今日坡仙必有佳作，我们当盥漱恭读。」只见乩上写道：","en":"bowed to see off the Goddess Du Lanxiang. Fresh incense and wine were brought. Every gentleman knelt together, and Qiguan and Chunxi took the planchette. Daosheng said, \\"Today the Immortal of the Slope will surely leave us a masterpiece. We should rinse our mouths and read with reverence.\\" The planchette wrote:"},{"paragraph":33,"mentions":1,"tokens":["玉艳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"清芬竟体是兰香，王树琪花列两行。\\n十树琼花十样锦，春风喜气满华堂。\\n众人道：「首句是香畹，次句是佩仙、玉艳，三句总说，末句是小梅。」子云掐指一算，名花已有了八人，只少静芳、蕊香两人了。又见写道：","en":"halls with light.\\"\\nThey deciphered the lines together. \\"The first line is Xiangwan. The second is Peixian and Yuyan. The third sums them up, and the last line is Xiaomei.\\" Ziyun counted on his fingers. Eight flowers were named, leaving only Jingfang and Ruixiang missing. Next:"},{"paragraph":44,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琪官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琪官道：「这神仙也不知怎么来的，就这样快，就像在这园子里一样，真是心动神知了。」兰保道：「那杜兰仙与玉侬同姓，所以关切得很，把他的前事都说出来了，总成了这件好事。」","en":"Qiguan marveled, \\"Who knows how immortals come? They are so swift, as if they live right here in this garden. Truly, 'the mind moves, and the spirit knows.'\\" Lanbao noted thoughtfully, \\"Du Lanxiang shared Yunong's surname. She cared for him. She told his whole"}],"46":[{"paragraph":53,"mentions":1,"tokens":["秦琪官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"正饮酒间，王兰保、金漱芳、秦琪官、林春喜同来见了，即分开坐了，谈了些闲话。子云道：「今日这二十四副对子，清芬浓艳，各尽所长。但我看来，始终要推道翁先生的赐书楼、承荫堂冠冕堂皇了。」众名士道：「自然，我们到底觉得力薄，那里能这样大方，这是勉强不来的。」道翁道：「这也不然，一来相体裁衣","en":"While they were at their food and wine, Wang Lanbao, Jin Shufang, Qin Qiguan and Lin Chunxi all came in and paid their respects, and sat down apart, and there was some idle talk.\\n\\nZiyun said, \\"These twenty-four couplets today are fresh or rich by turns, and every man has done his best. But to my mind Master Qu's, for the Tower"}],"48":[{"paragraph":26,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琪官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"明日，道翁还有事进城。琪官因与琴仙一同来京，且同一师傅学戏，如今见他跳出樊笼，得以出京，心里甚为感慨，便单请琴仙过来话别。因想请琴仙，必须请子玉，又托琴仙转约子玉于初六日同去。琴仙应了，果然把子玉请了出来。子玉那日先到文辉处拜寿，耽搁了一早晨，吃了面，即便辞回。王恂留住不放，","en":"The following day, Daoweng had affairs to attend to in the city. Qiguan, who had traveled to the capital with Qinxian and trained under the same master, felt a deep wave of emotion seeing his friend escape their constrained life and prepare to leave the capital. He decided to invite Qinxian over alone to bid him a proper"},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琪官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉喜欢，一径就到琪官寓处，进去见琴仙已等了好一会，还有一个老年人在那里说话。见了子玉，那人就站起身来。作别而去，琴仙还谢了一声。琪官送客转来，请子玉到他书房里坐下。子玉问起方才这人，琴仙道：「他叫叶茂林，是我们教戏的师傅，闻我要出京，今日送了几样东西来。」子玉见琴仙面似","en":"Ziyu hurried joyfully to Qiguan's lodgings. Upon entering, he found that Qinxian had been waiting for quite some time, engaged in conversation with an elderly man. Seeing Ziyu arrive, the man stood up, bid his farewells, and departed, with Qinxian offering a word of thanks. After seeing"},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琪官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琪官见他们两人四目相泣，一样的神色，知道九分。但自己想着从前的事，不免也有些悲楚。三人坐了许久，都不言语。","en":"Observing them gaze at each other through tear-filled eyes, sharing the exact same sorrowful expression, Qiguan understood their feelings almost entirely. Recalling his own past hardships, he could not help but feel a surge of melancholy. The three of them sat together for a long time in profound silence."},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":5,"tokens":["琪官","玉艳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琪官与琴仙坐在一凳，拉着琴仙的手说道：「琴哥，你如今是好了，上了岸，看我们落在水里。想我们同来的十个人，到京后死的死，散的散，就剩下你我两个。你如今又要去了，就只有我一个。想到咱们在船上的时候，那几个又是不投机的。哥哥，你说咱们两个生在一处，死在一处。有","en":"Qiguan sat on one stool with Qinxian and took his hand. \\"Brother Qin, you are all right now — you have got ashore, and you can look back and see the rest of us still in the water. Think of it: ten of us came up together, and since we reached the capital some"},{"paragraph":30,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琪官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琪官道：「琴哥，不要哭了，我想你那义父是个好人，绝不至像那易老西儿，将人买去几个月，又不要了，那是何等俗物！况你这义父，又无亲生儿子，待你好是不用说的了。你人又聪明，不比我生得笨。他教你读起书来，飞黄腾达，也是意中之事。将来自然必念着患难弟兄。那时我们还","en":"Qiguan comforted him gently, urging Brother Qin not to cry. He reassured him that his foster father was a truly good man, vastly different from vulgar men like Yi Laoxi who purchase someone for a few months only to discard them later. He pointed out that since"},{"paragraph":31,"mentions":5,"tokens":["琪官","玉艳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"不愿唱戏。」琴仙道：「你来找我，要我活着才好。适我已经死了，你就怎样？不如你先寄封书来问问，得了我的信再来。」琪官道：「何必说死说活呢？哥哥总喜欢诅怨自己。」子玉道：「是极了，玉侬总要咒自己。譬如去年你进华府的时候，你也口口声声咒自己要死，如今偏好好儿的出来了。那时怎想到今日？那时既想不到今日，自然今日也想不到后日。焉知不应了玉艳的说话？我劝你放开些罢。若说玉艳","en":"Qiguan pressed on: \\"Besides, the whole way there is fine hills and fine water, more than you can look at — you will not be dull. And next year my apprenticeship is out and I may do as I please. I shall find someone going that way and come with him to find you."},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":5,"tokens":["琪官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"里，不觉凄然有感。见一个绝小的方锦匣子，揭开看时，是六颗骰子。琴仙放在手中，重新入席，拿了个空碟儿，对着子玉、琪官说道：「三心和同，有始有终。掷个全红。」璫琅一声掷下，却也奇怪，倒像有神明佑护着他，却好碰着六个全红。子玉大喜，琴仙也觉开怀。琪官笑了一笑，取骰子在手，也对着琴仙、子玉说道：「三心和同，后是相逢，二十四红。」又说道：「你们看我掷。」琴仙、子玉看时，也","en":"six dice inside. He took them in his hand, came back to the table, set out an empty saucer, and said to Ziyu and Qiguan, \\"Three hearts in accord, a beginning and an end. Let it come up all red.\\"\\n\\nDown they went with a clatter — and, strangely enough, as though some spirit were shielding him, all six came up red. Ziyu was delighted, and Qinxian's heart lifted.\\n\\nQiguan"},{"paragraph":33,"mentions":4,"tokens":["琪官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这一回也谈了许久，琴仙恐他义父回来，只得要早散，琪官也不好久留他。子玉想后日送他的人多，不好说话，便从身上解下一个小玉琴，送与琴仙道：「此是我常佩的东西，给你算个记念罢。」琴仙接了，一阵心酸，也从身边解下个五色玉梅花，递与子玉道：「这也是我常佩的。」子玉也收了，各人佩上。子玉道：「明日一天怎样？」琴仙","en":"talked a long while, until Qinxian, afraid his foster father might come back, insisted on breaking up early, and Qiguan could not well keep him. Ziyu, thinking that the day after tomorrow there would be too many people seeing him off for any word to pass between them, untied a small jade qin from his own dress and gave it to Qinxian. \\"I wear this always. Keep it for a"},{"paragraph":36,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琪官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"十里之外皇华亭。只见南湘、仲清、文泽、金粟、王恂、子玉、春航，领着那蕙芳、宝珠、素兰、漱芳、玉林、兰保、桂保、琪官、春喜九个名旦，在皇华亭等候。道翁等连忙下车，极口辞谢。各人皆要把盏。","en":"and Chunhang, alongside Huifang and the nine famous performers: Baozhu, Sulan, Shufang, Yulin, Lanbao, Guibao, Qiguan, and Chunxi. Daoweng hurried down from his carriage and thanked everyone repeatedly, as they all eagerly wished to raise a cup in a final parting toast."}],"50":[{"paragraph":5,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琪官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"花卉，山水尚是乱画的，草虫他更不会。此时说我比他好，我也不安，将来或者赶得上他。」正说话间，只见仲清、王恂同着琪官、桂保进来。","en":"future, I might catch up to him.\\" Just as they were speaking, Zhongqing and Wang Xun walked in, accompanied by Qiguan and Guibao."},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":1,"tokens":["玉艳"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"文泽见了大喜，问道：「怎么今日不约而同，都到这里来？」仲清道：「庸庵要到蕊香那里去，却遇见玉艳，想同到新开的庄子里去坐坐。见你的车在门口，所以进来。」文泽道：「莫非就是那唐和尚开的安吉堂么？闻得那地方倒好，他又将寺里的几间房子也通了过去，我们就去。」春喜道：「怪热的天，在这里不好吗？」桂保道：「那里也好，内中有几间屋子，摆满了花卉，大天篷凉爽","en":"today, without even arranging it?\\" Zhongqing explained, \\"Yong'an was on his way to see Ruixiang, but ran into Yuyan. We thought we might go sit for a while at the newly opened establishment. Seeing your carriage parked outside, we decided to come in here first.\\" Wenze guessed, \\"Could it be the 'Anji Hall' opened by Monk Tang? I've heard excellent things about that"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琪官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"盘小盘香，中间一个冰桶，拿了些西瓜、鲜核桃、杏仁、大桃儿、葡萄、雪藕之类，浸在冰里。首坐仲清，次文泽，次王恂，琪官、春喜、桂保相间而坐。来了几样菜，各人随意小酌闲谈。","en":"roots, all chilling perfectly in the ice. Zhongqing took the seat of honor, followed by Wenze, then Wang Xun, with Qiguan, Chunxi, and Guibao interspersed among them. Once a few dishes arrived, they sipped their wine and chatted at their leisure."},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琪官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，他又病了几天，俨然去年夏天的模样。他这个元神，此时正跟着玉侬在长江里守风，只怕要送他到了南昌，才肯回来呢。」琪官听了，眉颦起来，神情之间，颇有感慨，说道：「初六那一日，我请他们叙了半日，虽然彼此啼哭，却也还劝得住，不料至皇华亭，彼此变成这形象，我此时想起，还替他们伤心。」王恂道：「那天幸是没有生人在那里，若有生人见了他们这个光景，岂不好笑？玉侬倒还遮饰得过，有","en":"I imagine he won't be willing to 'return' until he feels he has safely escorted him all the way to Nanchang.\\" Qiguan frowned deeply upon hearing this, his expression filled with poignant sorrow. He murmured, \\"On the sixth, when I hosted them for half a day, although they wept together, they could still be consoled. I never imagined that by the time they reached the"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":4,"tokens":["琪官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"罚的。我就从天字说起，旧管是个天字，新收一个竹字，便合成了笑字。开除了人字，实在是个竺字。」众人赞道：「好。」琪官道：「我也有一个，旧管是个金字，新收一个则字。」说到此，便写了一个铡字：「开除了一个贝字，实在是个钊字。」桂保道：「金字加个则，是个什么字？」琪官道：「有这个字，我却一时说不出来。」春喜道：「这字好像是铡草的铡。」琪官道：「正是。」桂保道：「以后不兴","en":"character for 'person' (人), and the 'Actual Remainder' is the character zhu (竺).\\" The others cheered, \\"Excellent!\\" Qiguan said, \\"I have one too. The 'Old Stock' is 'gold' (金). The 'New Intake' is 'rule' (则).\\" Reaching this point, he traced the character 铡. \\"'Remove' the shell character (贝), and the 'Actual Remainder' is zhao (钊).\\" Guibao looked puzzled, \\"What character"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琪官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琪官道：「我的旧管是串字，新收了心字，是患字。开除了口字，实在是忠字。」春喜道：「我旧管是昌字，新收门字，是个阊字。开除了曰字，实在是间字。」仲清道：「我旧管是贱字，新收三点水，是溅字。开除了贝字，实在是浅字。」文泽道：「我旧管是波字，新收一个女字，是婆","en":"Qiguan said, \\"My 'Old Stock' is 'string together' (串). The 'New Intake' is 'heart' (心), forming 'worry' (患). 'Remove' 'mouth' (口), and the 'Actual Remainder' is 'loyal' (忠).\\" Chunxi chimed in, \\"My 'Old Stock' is 'prosperous' (昌). The 'New Intake' is 'door'"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琪官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"也要抬上些才好。」众人皆笑。桂保道：「这个批评未免吹毛求疵。就算略差些，也用不着抬女字的那么使劲。」众皆大笑。琪官道：「旧管是胡字，新收三点水，是湖字。开除了沽字，实在是月字。」春喜道：「旧管是邑字，新收个才字，是挹字。开除了口字，实在是把字。」文泽道：「这个令没有什么意思，我不说了，还说别样罢。」饮了几杯酒，只听得隔壁唱起来，众人听是唱的《南浦》道：「无限别离","en":"doesn't require nearly as much effort as hauling that 'woman' (女) character around!\\" The others laughed even harder. Qiguan said, \\"The 'Old Stock' is hu (胡). The 'New Intake' is the three water drops (氵), forming 'lake' (湖). 'Remove' gu (沽, to buy), and the 'Actual Remainder' is 'moon' (月).\\" Chunxi said, \\"The 'Old Stock' is 'city' (邑). The 'New Intake' is 'talent' (才), forming"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琪官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"翰」，非用五六五出调高唱不可。既惊变矣，则仓皇失措之神自在言外。且下文还有社稷摧残等语，慢腾腾低唱是何神理？」琪官道：「这也论得极是。我想那些口白，也都有不妥当处，一气说完，后来唱出，全无头绪，若断章摘句起来，几至不通。」春喜道：「可是不么。譬如《阳告》一出，出场时一口说尽，所以后头唱的曲文，与口白文气不接。如今班中唱的个个是如此。要依我，就改他口白。」桂保道：","en":"lines speak of the empire being shattered and ruined. What emotional sense does it make to sing it slow and low?\\" Qiguan chimed in, \\"That is an exceedingly precise critique. I've always felt that the spoken passages (koubai) often have inappropriate moments as well. They rush through them all in one breath, and by the time they start singing, the flow is entirely disjointed."},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琪官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"那三个相公看着唐和尚胁肩谄笑，好不难看。仲清道：「连日未见瑶卿。」琪官道：「瑶卿近日从着吉甫学琴呢，竟是足不出户。吉甫也真好静，他当日教过梅卿弹琴，自梅卿死后，他的《梅花三弄》是再不弹的了。你说这也算深于情了。」仲清道：「吉甫的人本沈静高雅，于这些文玩无上无不精通。」大家谈论，日已西沉，文泽等也要散了，王恂叫走堂的报账","en":"obsequious, fawning smile and found the sight utterly repulsive. Zhongqing said, \\"I haven't seen Yaoqing for days.\\" Qiguan replied, \\"Yaoqing has been studying the guqin with Jifu recently; he practically never steps out of the house. Jifu truly loves his peace and quiet. Back in the day, he taught Meiqing how to play the qin, but ever since Meiqing passed away, he has completely"}],"59":[{"paragraph":21,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琪官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"江西学政梅宅梅庾香少爷手启，屈勤先寄。」心中大喜，知琴仙到了江西任所了，便忙拆开，看见还有与子云、蕙芳、素兰、琪官的信，且搁过一边。拆开自己的信，见一张白纸写着「哀启者」，大为骇然，想道：「难道道翁有什么缘故了？」遂细细的看下去，不觉泪珠点点的落将下来。","en":"in Jiangxi. He hurriedly tore it open, noticing there were also letters addressed to Ziyun, Huifang, Sulan, and Qiguan, which he temporarily set aside. Opening his own letter, he saw a plain sheet of paper bearing the words, \\"A Notice of Bereavement.\\" He was deeply shocked, thinking to himself, \\"Could something have happened to Daoweng?\\" He read on carefully, and before"}],"60":[{"paragraph":5,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琪官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"阄。说也奇怪，想必文字有灵，前生缘法，子云拈了道翁，子玉拈了杜仙女、琴仙，金粟拈了宝珠，春航拈了蕙芳，仲清拈了琪官，文泽拈了春喜，南湘拈了兰保，王恂拈了桂保，高品拈了玉林，次贤拈了漱芳，单拈不着素兰，只好送与华公子去作了。众人分派已定，子玉说道：「做传容易，画画难，还要刻石，更须时日，不知几天可以告成？」吉甫道：「不消多日，碑是磨现成的，一面画，一面就叫季十矮子","en":"Ziyun drew Daoweng; Ziyu drew Fairy Du and Qinxian; Jin Su drew Baozhu; Chunhang drew Huifang; Zhongqing drew Qiguan; Wenze drew Chunxi; Nanxiang drew Lanbao; Wang Xun drew Guibao; Gao Pin drew Yulin; and Cixian drew Shufang. Sulan alone was not drawn, so that assignment was sent to Young Master Hua. The tasks distributed, Ziyu said, \\"Writing biographies is easy, but"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琪官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"芳那一首，再不能更换的。」琴仙再看第十一方，画一个杏花，下有一个仙女，珠腰玉衱，十分妩媚，题曰：及第花史。知是琪官，看颜仲清的序文：","en":"sash and jade pendants looking utterly captivating. The title read: \\"Jidi Flower Historian.\\" Knowing this was Qiguan, he read the preface by Yan Zhongqing:"},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":1,"tokens":["秦琪官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"明月，腹晒斜曛。悠悠青天，落落人群。\\n醉死醉生，我不与闻。碧海骑鲸，瑶京散发。\\n冠裳自嘉，奈此仙骨。\\n第五首是秦琪官题的《仙中高品》：","en":"the Jade Capital.\\nThough robes and caps are fine enough, they cannot bind his immortal bones.\\"\\n\\nThe fifth was Qin Qiguan's *Lofty Grade Among Immortals*:"}]}`),"char-32":JSON.parse(`{"3":[{"paragraph":13,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蓉官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"儿？」便侧转身向胖子坐了，一只手搭在胖子肩上。那先坐的两个相公，便跳将下去，摔着袖子走了。只听得那胖子说道：「蓉官，怎么两三月不见你的影儿？你也总不进城来瞧我，好个红相公。我前日在四香堂等你半天，你竟不来。是什么缘故呢？」那蓉宫脸上一红，即一手拉着那胖子的手道：「三老爷今日有气．前日四香堂叫我，我本要来的，实在腾不出这个空儿。天也迟了，一进城就出不得城。在你书房","en":"arrived earlier promptly stood, flicked their sleeves in mild disdain, and departed. The stout man's voice boomed: \\"Rongguan, why has neither hide nor hair been seen of you these past two or three months? You never venture into the city to visit me, you sought-after darling. I waited half the day for you at Sixiang Hall, and you never showed. What is the meaning of this?\\""},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":5,"tokens":["蓉官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"蓉官没有说完，把那胖子笑得眼皮裹着眼睛，没了缝，把蓉官嘴上一拧，骂道：「好个贫嘴的小么儿。这是偶然的事情，那里是常打架吗。」聘才听得这话，说得尖酸有趣。一面细看他的相貌，也十分可爱，年纪不过十五六岁，一个瓜子脸儿，秀眉横黛，美目流波，两腮露着酒凹，耳上穿","en":"Before Rongguan could finish, the stout man erupted into laughter, his eyes crinkling until they vanished into mere slits. He affectionately pinched Rongguan's lips, scolding gently, \\"You sharp-tongued little imp. That was but a rare occurrence—it is not as if they"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":3,"tokens":["蓉官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"三出是《南浦》，很熟的曲文，用脚在板凳上踏了两板，就倒了一杯茶，一手擎着慢慢的喝。可巧那胖子要下来走动，把手向蓉官肩上一扶，蓉官身子一幌，碰着了聘才的膀子，茶碗一侧，淋淋漓漓把聘才的袍子泼湿了一大块。那胖子同蓉官，着实过意不去，赔了不是，聘才倒不好意思，笑道：「这有什么要紧，干一干就好了。」说着自己将手巾拭了。","en":"and sipped it slowly. Just then, the stout man moved to stand. Seeking balance, he pressed his hand heavily upon Rongguan's shoulder. Rongguan swayed, inadvertently colliding with Pincai's arm. The teacup tipped, spilling its contents and leaving a large, dark stain across Pincai's robe. The stout man and Rongguan were instantly mortified, offering profuse apologies. Pincai,"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蓉官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"道：「富三爷那里不照应你，这点事你就这么着。况且富三爷是为朋友的，下次瞧瞧有好玉器，他们多照顾你一点就够了。」蓉官接口道：「这老头子好讨人嫌：弯着腰，托着那浪盘子，天天在人空里挤来挤去，一点好东西都没有。谁要买，德古斋还少吗？」卖玉器的只得忍气吞声，拿了碎烟壶走了出去，嘴里咕噜道：「闹扬气，充朋友，照顾我也配？有钱尽闹相公。」又挤到别处去了。聘才心里甚是感激，连","en":"on behalf of a friend. Next time you procure decent jade, they will offer you their custom. Leave it at that.\\" Rongguan chimed in with a delicate sneer, \\"This old relic is an absolute plague. He hobbles through the aisles, thrusting that wretched tray at everyone, without a single piece of merit to his name. If one truly desires jade, does the Degu Zhai shop not exist?\\""},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蓉官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"番。聘才已知富三是个热心肠，多情多义的人；那个贵大爷却是个谨慎小心，安分守己的一路。当下三人，倒闲谈了好一会。蓉官又到对面楼上去了，聘才望着他，又去与那黑脸大汉讲话。","en":"Master Gui was cautious, proper, and anchored in convention. The three men conversed effortlessly. Meanwhile, Rongguan had drifted back to the opposite gallery to converse with the dark-faced behemoth."},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蓉官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"探出身子看他出了戏园，才住了笑。这边富三看了，也拍手称快，聘才更乐得了不得。但不知这个人，是个什么阔人，少顷等蓉官来问他。只见那黑大汉已起身，带了四个相公，昂昂然大踏步的出去了。那些没有带去的相公，又分头各去找人。","en":"Pincai could not help but wonder about the identity of the fearsome, wealthy patron upstairs, resolving to ask Rongguan upon his return. Shortly after, the dark-faced man rose, gathered four young actors, and strode out with imperious arrogance. The remaining actors swiftly dispersed, seeking out other patrons."},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":2,"tokens":["蓉官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"不一刻，蓉官又过来坐下，富三笑道：「空巴结他，也不带你去，磨了半天，一顿饭都磨不出来。」蓉官点着头道：「不错，我磨他。他叫我，我也不去。这位老爷子不是好相交的。」","en":"Moments later, Rongguan glided back to their table. Fu the Third teased him, \\"A waste of flattery, it seems. He didn't even take you with him. You hovered around him for half the day and couldn't even secure a dinner invitation.\\" Rongguan nodded coolly. \\"Indeed, I hovered."},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":2,"tokens":["蓉官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"富三道：「这人是那里人，姓什么？」蓉官道：「是广东人，我只听得人都称他奚大老爷，我也是才认识他。且他也到京未久，他就待春兰待得好。今日春兰身上穿那件玄狐腿子的，是奚大老爷身上脱下来，现叫毛毛匠改小的。」说罢即凑着富三耳边问了一句，富三道：「怎么你今日又有空儿？」蓉官笑嘻嘻的两手搭着富三的","en":"Fu asked, \\"Where is he from, and what is his name?\\" Rongguan replied softly, \\"He hails from Guangdong. I only hear him called Great Lord Xi, and I have only just made his acquaintance. He is new to the capital, yet he treats Chunlan with obsessive favor. That black fox-leg coat Chunlan wore today? Slipped right"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蓉官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"在靴革幼里拿出个靴页子来，取一张钱票，交与他跟班给看座儿的，连这位老爷的戏钱也在里头。聘才又再三谢了。于是带了蓉官，一同出来。","en":"to settle the bill—graciously covering Pincai's ticket as well. Pincai offered profound thanks. Together, with Rongguan in tow, they exited the theater."},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":2,"tokens":["蓉官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"他们是有车来的，聘才搭了蓉官的车，四儿也跨了车沿，跟兔坐了车尾。聘才在车里随口的说笑，哄得蓉官十分欢喜，又赞他的相貌，要算京城第一。","en":"They had arrived by carriage. Pincai shared a carriage with Rongguan, while Si'er rode the shaft, and Rongguan's boy clung to the back. Within the carriage, Pincai conversed with effortless charm, drawing delighted laughter from Rongguan. He praised the youth's beauty, declaring him without equal in all the capital."},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":2,"tokens":["蓉官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"说说笑笑己到了一个馆子，一同进去，拣了雅座坐了。走堂的上来，张罗点了菜，蓉官斟了酒。只听得隔壁燕语莺声，甚为热闹。蓉官从板缝里望时，就是那个奚大老爷带了春兰，还有三个相公在那里。聘才问富三道：「老太爷的讳，上下是那两个字？」","en":"refined restaurant, securing a secluded, elegant private room. A waiter appeared promptly to take their order, and Rongguan gracefully poured the wine. From the adjacent room drifted a chorus of voices, bright and musical as swallows and orioles. Peering through a slender crack in the wooden partition, Rongguan whispered, \\"It is that Great Lord Xi. He has Chunlan and three"},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":2,"tokens":["蓉官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「我这个功名是看得见的，要升官也难得个拣选，不是同知，就是通判，并无他途。」聘才道：「将来总不止于同、通的。」蓉官笑道：「你瞧我将来怎样？」聘才笑道：「你将来是要到月宫里去，会成仙呢。」富三、贵大皆笑，蓉官罚了聘才一杯酒道：「你此时倒会说话，为什么见了那个卖玉器的，就说不出来？」聘才笑道：「今日幸遇见了三爷、大爷，不然我真被他缠不清了。」富三道：「这种人是怕硬欺","en":"other road for me.\\" Pincai countered smoothly, \\"Surely a man of your caliber will not be halted at such ranks.\\" Rongguan, eyes sparkling with amusement, leaned forward. \\"And what grand destiny do you foresee for me?\\" Pincai laughed warmly, \\"For you? You shall ascend to the Moon Palace and take your place among the immortals.\\" Fu the Third and Master Gui erupted into laughter."},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":3,"tokens":["蓉官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"蓉官道：「那奚老爷的爷们，好不利害，将这老王推推搡搡的，我怕跌了他，把他那浪盘子的臭杂碎全砸了，不绝了他的命？倒幸亏没有砸掉多少，只砸了两个料嘴子，一个料烟壶。有一个爷们更恶，在他脖子那个灰包上一扌叉，那老王噎了一口气，两个白眼珠一翻，好不怕人。这个奚大","en":"Rongguan shuddered delicately. \\"Lord Xi's men are utterly ruthless. The way they shoved and battered Old Wang—I feared he would fall and shatter that miserable tray of his entirely. It could have killed the old wretch! Luckily, only two glass nozzles and a snuff"},{"paragraph":35,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蓉官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这是海南大纨袴，到京里来想闹点声名，做个冤桶的。此时只晓得他排行是十一，就称呼他为奚十一。那个砸碗的相公，就是蓉官说的春兰了。","en":"Eleventh.' The defiant actor who had shattered the bowls alongside him was none other than Chunlan, the youth Rongguan had spoken of earlier."},{"paragraph":36,"mentions":2,"tokens":["蓉官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"富三与聘才、贵大都在门口看了一会进来。蓉官吐了吐舌，说道：「好不怕人！这才算个标子。」富三笑道：「这种标也标得无趣，但不知为什么事闹起来？」蓉官道：「这位奚大老爷的下作脾气，是讲不出来的。」于是富三与聘才、贵大豁了一会拳，此时天气尚短，他们也要进城。贵大爷先抢会帐，聘才又要作东，富三爷道：「","en":"Pincai, and Master Gui watched the spectacle from the doorway for a long while before returning to their seats. Rongguan stuck out his tongue playfully. \\"Terrifying! Now that is what I call a proper spectacle.\\" Fu the Third laughed, \\"Such crude spectacles hold no true interest. But what exactly ignited the quarrel, I wonder?\\" Rongguan sighed, \\"Lord Xi's vulgar, venomous"},{"paragraph":37,"mentions":2,"tokens":["蓉官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"订交。只是我是个白身人。仰扳不上。」富三、贵大同说：「罚你！咱们哥儿们论什么，你不嫌我们粗卤就是了。」富三赏了蓉官八吊钱，跟兔两吊钱。蓉官谢了赏，辞了贵大爷与聘才先去了。","en":"company too crude, that is all that matters.\\" Before departing, Fu the Third pressed eight strings of cash into Rongguan's hands, and two strings upon his young attendant. Rongguan offered profound thanks, bidding farewell to Master Gui and Pincai before taking his leave."}],"4":[{"paragraph":33,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蓉官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"中鸾凤。听他口音，也像江宁人，却又有些扬州话在里头。再看那四个相公，却非名下青钱，不过花中凡艳。王恂认得一个是蓉官，那三个都不认得，因问春喜。春喜道：「穿染貂的是玉美，穿倭刀的是四喜，穿水獭的是全福。都是剑春班的。」只见那位少年，将这边楼上望了一望，也就背转身子坐了。听得那些相公，燕语莺声，光筹交错，好也就背转身子坐了。听得那些相公，燕语莺声，光筹交错，好不热闹","en":"celebrated names or proven talent, no more than common blossoms of the flower world. Wang Xun recognized one as Rongguan; the other three he did not know, and so asked Chunxi. Chunxi explained, \\"The one in tinted sable is Yumei; the one in Japanese-sword-patterned fur is Si Xi; the one in otter is Quanfu. All three are from the Jianchun company.\\" Just then, the young man"},{"paragraph":34,"mentions":2,"tokens":["蓉官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"蓉官道：「我们这二联班，是堂会戏多，几个唱昆腔的好相公总在堂会里，园子里是不大来的。你这么一个雅人，倒怎么不爱听昆腔，倒爱听乱弹？」那少年笑道：「我是讲究人，不讲究戏，与其戏雅而人俗，不如人雅而戏俗。」又听得那玉美讲道：「都是唱戏，分什么昆腔乱弹。就算昆","en":"Rongguan replied, \\"Our two Lian companies mostly do private banquet performances; the few good performers who sing Kunqu are always at banquets and rarely come to the public gardens. A refined person such as yourself—how is it that you do not appreciate Kunqu"},{"paragraph":35,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蓉官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"：「这首词好得很，是个才子之笔，使你蓬荜生辉，你千万留了他，不要涂刮了。」店家答应了下去。春喜道：「这人来历，蓉官总应晓得，待我见他时一问，便知此人是何等样人了。」三人说着，亦即下楼各散。未知后事如何，且听下回分解。","en":"preserve it and do not scrub it off.\\" The keeper agreed and went off. Chunxi said, \\"As for this man's background, Rongguan ought to know. When I see him I will ask, and then we will know what manner of person this is.\\" The three then talked a while more, descended the stairs, and each went their separate ways. As to what happened next, listen to the following chapter for"}],"5":[{"paragraph":36,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蓉官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「前日戏园里，蓉官说他青姨奶奶、白姨奶奶打架起来，摔这样，砸那样，我当是顽话。今日看来是真的了。」回去尚早，出了城，打发了车，又从戏园门口，各处逛了一逛而回。","en":"\\"The other day at the theater, Rongguan mentioned that Concubine Qing and Concubine Bai had come to blows, throwing this, smashing that. I took it for a joke. Today it turns out to be quite true.\\" The hour was still early to return home; he left the city, dismissed the carriage, strolled past"}],"12":[{"paragraph":10,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蓉官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"航这样。而且他又不喜欢他那些相公，说他所爱的一班不好，春航不服。及见了李玉林来看高品，那一种娟媚韶秀的丰致，比蓉官等似要好些，便此心自讼了几日。","en":"Gao Pin, and Chunhang saw that particular graceful, tender, elegant beauty — which seemed somewhat finer than Rongguan and the others — he spent a few days privately revising his own opinion."},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蓉官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，想亦妍媸不等。我也不过逢场作戏，所谓未能免俗，聊复尔尔。大约诸名班中，要推登春的玉美、全福的翠宝，其余联珠的蓉官，也还可以，想都是有目共赏的。」仲清笑了一笑道：「叶公好龙，未见真龙；\\n郑人梦鹿，终是假鹿。湘帆可惜有闹相公之名，无闹相公之实。天下相公出在京城，京城相公聚在联锦班。史竹君的《曲台花选》，品题最允，如袁宝珠、苏蕙芳等方配称名花，而且诗词书画无一不佳，","en":"making do. Among the main troupes, I would put Dengchun's Yumei and Quanfu's Cuibao at the top; and Lianzhu's Rongguan is also passable. I suppose these are the ones that meet with general appreciation.\\" Zhongqing gave a small smile and said: \\"Lord Ye was fond of dragons — yet when a real dragon appeared, he took fright. The man of Zheng dreamed of a deer — yet in the"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":2,"tokens":["蓉官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一日，春航又在戏园看戏，却看的是联珠班。一个人冷冷落落的，在下场门背暗的地方坐了。看见蓉官的戏，心上便又喜欢。正看到得意处，忽见前面一张桌子，来了一个三十来岁胖子，反穿着草上霜，同着一个二十几岁伶伶俐俐的人坐下，背后站着一个跟班。那胖子是一口京话，那一个是南边人，原来就是富三与魏聘才。不多一刻，蓉官卸了妆，已坐在对面楼上，与一个少年说话。","en":"this time the Lianzhu troupe. He sat alone in cold isolation at a spot behind the exit door, in shadow. Watching Rongguan's performance, he felt his heart stirring with pleasure again. Just as he was absorbed in enjoyment, he noticed a table in front of him where a plump man of about thirty sat down, wearing a fur-lined coat inside out, accompanied by a clever-looking young"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":3,"tokens":["蓉官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"了，就坐在中间。春航如今的衣服，大非从前可比，不过剩了家常所穿的几件旧衣，又坐在背暗处；越觉得颜色黯淡，并不见蓉官过来照应他。只听得蓉官说道：「二老爷，昨日有人很感你的情。」那胖子道：「是谁？」蓉官道：「联锦班的二喜，说你很疼他，给他好些东西，在你家住了一夜，有没有？」那胖子道：","en":"garments left — and moreover he was sitting in the shadow; his appearance was all the dimmer and darker for it, and Rongguan did not come over to acknowledge him at all. He only heard Rongguan say: \\"Second Master, someone was very grateful for your kindness yesterday.\\" The plump man said: \\"Who was that?\\" Rongguan said: \\"Erxi of the Lianzhu troupe — he says you are very good"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蓉官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"喝了几钟酒，天晚了，出不了城，就留他住下。早上逛了庙，他要买了几样零碎东西，就出去的。这二喜倒罢了，肯巴结。」蓉官道：「此刻是尽讲究巴结了。我们的师傅不好，当年教戏时，就没有教会巴结。」","en":"wanted to buy a few small things and went out. This Erxi is all right — he knows how to make himself agreeable.\\" Rongguan said: \\"Nowadays everyone is about making themselves agreeable. Our master was not good enough — when he was teaching us to perform, he forgot to teach us how to make ourselves agreeable.\\""},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":3,"tokens":["蓉官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"那个后生，将手搭在蓉官肩上道：「你也只要会巴结，富三老爷难道还不爱你么？」蓉官道：「我说过不会巴结。要不然你教我，我就拜你做师傅。你怎样教我，我就怎样学你。」那后生一面笑，一面把他脸上拧了一把。蓉官一回头，见了春航，却把眼睛一低，又扑转来一注，却又别转了头。半晌又回转来，","en":"The young man put his hand on Rongguan's shoulder and said: \\"You too just need to know how to make yourself agreeable — would Master Fu the Third not like you then?\\" Rongguan said: \\"I've said I don't know how. If you would teach me, I would take you as my master. However you teach me, that's"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":6,"tokens":["蓉官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"靴子也沾了些泥，迥非从前的模样。蓉官因此骇异，心里也想道：这分明是田老爷，怎么穷了？冷冷清清的一人坐着。意欲过去照应，又恐不是。及仔细看清了，才过去请了一个安，坐下，倒说了好一会话。富三却不留心，聘才见了，便扯扯富三的衣裳，道：「你瞧，蓉官倒巴结那个人，难道这种人，倒有什么巴结处么？」","en":"His boots were also stained with mud — utterly unlike his former appearance. Rongguan was therefore startled, and inwardly thought: \\"It looks plainly like Master Tian — but how has he come down to this? Sitting there all alone in the cold and quiet.\\" He was inclined to go over and acknowledge him, but feared it might not be him. After"}],"19":[{"paragraph":9,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蓉官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「我叫蓉官罢。」又问子佩，子佩道：「叫了三人，也就热闹。我不叫，我算吃镶边酒罢。」梅窗笑道：「你自己算了相公罢。「子佩听了，含了一口酒，望着梅窗劈面喷来，梅窗一闪，身上却洒了好些。梅窗道：「何必一句话如此着急，必定说着了你的真病。」大家一笑。就将衫子脱下要些烧","en":"\\"I'll call Rongguan.\\" He then asked Zipei; Zipei said: \\"With three already summoned, that's quite lively enough. I won't call anyone; I'll just drink the 'border-trimming wine.'\\" Meichuang laughed: \\"You might as well be the young protégé yourself.\\" Hearing this, Zipei held"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蓉官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"只见那走堂的进来道：「琴官、玉林都说病着不能来，蓉官就来。」聘才原料琴官不来的，只好罢了。倒是杨梅窗心上不快，说道：「怎么叫三个人，倒有两个不来？不知是真病呢，还是推托的？笑梅道：「自然是真病，推托什么。」聘才道：「还有个琪官也是很好的，我正月里叫过他几回，倒是全来的。」聘才又写了条子去叫琪官，梅窗另","en":"Then the waiter came in and said: \\"Qinguan and Yulin both say they're ill and can't come; Rongguan is coming.\\" Pincai had originally expected Qinguan wouldn't come, so he simply let it be. But Yang Meichuang was displeased in his heart and said: \\"How is it that of three people called, two are not coming? I wonder if they are truly ill, or just making"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":3,"tokens":["蓉官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"闹了一阵，只不见蓉官、琪官到来。笑梅道：「奇了，今日是忌辰，倒叫不出相公来。」二喜道：「还有那个？」笑梅道：「你们班里的琪官，还有联珠的蓉官。」二喜道：「蓉官，我出门时见他到三合楼去的，只怕还没有散。」梅窗道：「那玉林是你们同班的，他真有病吗？」二喜道：「玉林阿！不要说","en":"They had been making merry for a while when still neither Rongguan nor Qiguan had arrived. Xiaomei said: \\"How strange. Today is a memorial anniversary, yet we can't even call out any young protégés.\\" Erxi said: \\"Who else is there?\\" Xiaomei said: \\"Qiguan from your troupe, and Rongguan from Lianzhu.\\" Erxi said: \\"As for"}],"21":[{"paragraph":8,"mentions":4,"tokens":["蓉官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"想道，是你，决不躲的。再看庾香满脸飞红，装起瞌睡来，我怕他不好意思，只好辞了出来。走到门房门口，见跟那联珠班内蓉官的得子与那些三爷们讲话，我知道是蓉官了。玉侬，你想蓉官这种东西，交他做什么？\\n就叫个相公，也不用瞒人。我真不懂我们这个兄弟的脾气。我也知道你为了他，很有一番情。他起初却很惦记你。又听得人说，他找你几回，你不见他，他所以心就冷了。你不问我，我不便说，你","en":"doze. I feared to shame him, so I could only take my leave. At the gatehouse I saw Dezi, the page belonging to Rongguan of the Lianzhu troupe, chatting with several of the young gentlemen. Then I knew the hidden man was Rongguan. Yunong, think of it—what possible reason has he to associate with a creature like that?\\n\\n\\"Even if he chooses to amuse himself with an actor,"}],"24":[{"paragraph":8,"mentions":2,"tokens":["蓉官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"了好些。」玉林道：「我却当不起这考语。」王恂道：「还有几个人索性请你批评批评。」桂保笑道：「是谁？」王恂道：「蓉官、二喜、玉美、春林、凤林，这些人又是怎样？」桂保笑道：「这又是一路，不与我们往来的。我们是玉虚门下弟子，是兴周伐纣的，他们是通天教主门人，是助纣为虐的。这些人是龟灵圣母、申公豹等类，却也有些旁门左道的神通，倒也利害。我们那一日运气不好？与他们同席，便","en":"indeed! Ruixiang's insight grows by the day.\\" Yulin modestly demurred. Wang Xun then asked for their judgment on Rongguan, Erxi, Yumei, Chunlin, and Fenglin—the outsiders. Guibao laughed, \\"They belong to an entirely different school! We are the disciples of the Yuqing gate, crusading for the Zhou; they are of the Tongtian sect, aiding the tyrants—they are like the tortoise-spirit"}],"27":[{"paragraph":6,"mentions":3,"tokens":["蓉官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"叫春兰进去了一回，出来坐了一坐；又叫巴英官进去了。仲雨不知其故，只道有事，便与亮轩讲些闲话。这两个相公，一个是蓉官，一个是春林，皆是奚十一常叫的。蓉官对着春林做眼色，春林笑了一笑。亮轩也做眉做眼的，仲雨偶然看见，却不晓得什么，也不便问。蓉官忽问仲雨道：「你能有个相好姓魏的，他初到京时，我就认识他，却不见得怎样。前日我在富三爷家见他，体面得了不得，大鞍子热车，跟班","en":"being conducted behind the inner door. Zhongyu guessed his errands and chatted with Liangxuan. The two actors, Rongguan and Chunlin, were Xi's usual calls. Rongguan signaled Chunlin, and Chunlin smiled. Liangxuan too rolled his eyes; Zhongyu glimpsed it but didn't grasp it and didn't ask. Rongguan suddenly asked Zhongyu: \\"You know a patron surnamed Wei. I met him first"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蓉官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"」仲雨道：「喝得多了。」奚十一道：「好话，快再干两杯，我们豁几拳罢。」仲雨道：「也好。」奚十一就与仲雨、亮轩、蓉官、春林豁了十拳，起初还叫得清，后来便叫出怪声。广东人豁拳是最难听的，像叫些杀狗杀鸭的字音。","en":"words—two more rounds, and we'll finger-guess.\\" Zhongyu agreed, \\"Fine.\\" Xi guessed ten rounds with Zhongyu, Liangxuan, Rongguan, and Chunlin. At first his calls were distinct and orderly; as the wine mounted, his tongue tangled and the cries became strange animal noises. Cantonese finger-guessing was notorious for sounding ugly, as though men were shouting the words used to slaughter"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蓉官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"公叫琴言，在秋水堂住，他的师傅叫长庆，你曾见过么？」奚十一道：「没曾见，听是听得说过，是好的。」仲雨正要说时，蓉官道：「好什么？只得两三出戏。你叫他陪酒，终席不说话。\\n要他斟钟酒，是没有的事。」春林道：「好沉架子，到他家去看他，倒是从不会客的。就是从前的王吉庆、李春芳，如今红字号的袁宝珠、苏蕙芳，也没有这么大架子。要他中意的，才陪着坐一坐；不中意的，简直的不理，","en":"Changqing. Have you met him?\\" Xi replied, \\"Not seen, but heard he's good.\\" Zhongyu was about to say more when Rongguan cut in. \\"Good in what way? He has two or three pieces and no more. Call him to pour the wine and he will not open his mouth the whole feast; and as for his pouring you a cup, the thing has never been known.\\" Chunlin added, \\"And such airs with it! Go"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蓉官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"蓉官道：「未必。或者出来见一见，就算高情了。要待你好断不能。我见他待人没有好过，就是见那几位大人们，也是冷冷的。倒是他两个师弟天福、天寿会应酬，相貌又不好，人也不喜欢他。他师傅曹长庆，也是个古怪脾气，就是一门只爱钱，钱到了手，又不睬人了。」奚十一听了这些","en":"Rongguan said, \\"Unlikely. Maybe a glimpse counts as a favor, but treat you well? Never. I've never seen him warm; even to great officials, he's cold. His junior disciples Tianfu and Tianshou butter people up, but they have ugly faces and folk dislike them. His"}],"29":[{"paragraph":20,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蓉官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"有嫌琴言的，有爱造言生事的，七张八嘴，改头换面，添起枝叶，把个子玉、琴言说得无所不至。不料王通政在人家席上遇着蓉官、二喜等类，就把子玉、琴言的事说得活龙活现。文辉本看过子玉之病，也觉得病的有些古怪，只不晓得是相思病。今听了这些话，心上着实不爽快，因想道：","en":"relationship between Ziyu and Qinyan sounded utterly unspeakable. One evening, Wang Wenhui ran into the actors Rongguan and Erxi at a lavish feast. There, he heard the yarn spun as vividly as living dragons. He had seen Ziyu's sickness with his own eyes and had thought it odd at the time, but he had never once guessed it was lovesickness. Listening to the wild tales now,"}],"33":[{"paragraph":8,"mentions":6,"tokens":["蓉官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"那一日魏聘才请富三爷在蓉官寓里喝酒，富三爷想起一件事来，先进城去了。聘才便不进城，叫蓉官去叫了一个媳妇，名叫玉天仙，就借蓉官寓里过夜。将近二更，尚在那里喝酒唱曲。有个吏目郁泰孙来查夜，走了进来，与聘才认识的，且同过席听过戏的。聘才见是郁吏目，便放了心，让他入座，吏目不肯，聘才","en":"That day, Wei Pincai invited Lord Fu the Third to drink at Rongguan's residence. Lord Fu suddenly remembered something and went into the city first. Pincai stayed behind, instructing Rongguan to fetch a young woman named Yutianxian to spend the night at Rongguan's place. Approaching the second watch, they were still"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":2,"tokens":["蓉官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"去与太太请安，说我只好转托人，碰他的运气罢。」梅进回去照直说了，颜夫人也无法，只得听其自然。且说聘才在监里许了蓉官与玉天仙许多银子，叫他们跟着他的口供，说系那日吏目请他在蓉官寓处吃酒，叫了媳妇玉天仙。饮酒中间，要问聘才借银一千两，聘才不允，因此口角。","en":"said. Madam Yan was at a loss and could only let things take their course. Meanwhile, in prison, Pincai promised Rongguan and Yutianxian a large sum of silver, instructing them to align their testimonies with his. He told them to claim that the official had invited him to drink at Rongguan's residence and had called for the woman, Yutianxian. During the drinking, the official"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":2,"tokens":["蓉官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"那日锁拿之后，又逼索钱五百吊改供卖放。蓉官所供一样。部里审了两堂，彼此口供相对。华公子已知道了，欲待不管，心里又有些不安，只得着人到刑部里与他托情关照，因此轻办了好些。将吏目革职，聘才杖了二十，玉天仙逐出境外，蓉官释放回家，结了案。","en":"the arrest that day, he extorted another five hundred strings of cash to alter his testimony and release them. Rongguan's testimony was identical. The Ministry held two hearings, and their testimonies matched. Young Master Hua had already learned of this; initially wanting to ignore it, he felt uneasy and had to send someone to the Ministry of Punishments to put in a"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蓉官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，与从前大不相同了。在店里住了两日，嫌他嘈杂，即租了宏济寺春航住的房子，高车大马，大阔起来。也不到梅宅去看望。蓉官、玉天仙时常往来，聘才以百金分送二人，又给了些零星玩好，日日征歌斗酒，自然有那一班气味相投的与他亲密。","en":"live. With a grand carriage and horses, he began to live extravagantly. He didn't even visit the Mei residence. Rongguan and Yutianxian visited frequently; Pincai distributed a hundred taels between them and gave them miscellaneous trinkets. Engaging in daily drinking and singing, he naturally drew close to a group of like-minded individuals."},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":4,"tokens":["蓉官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"刑部的禁卒，便皱着眉走进去。聘才的人见了，即忙通报。富三已走进院子，听得咭咭咯咯打鼓板。小使开了风门，见聘才与蓉官迎出来，蓉官便抢上一步，哈了一哈腰，就来拉手。富三把他拧了一把，蓉官便将富三的手扭转来。富三骂道：「小兔子闹什么？」摆脱了手，忙与聘才见了，问了好，便道：「恭喜！恭喜！那几天我实在放心不下，司里头又没有认识的人，也不能进来瞧你。到你进了城，正要来看你","en":"Third entered the courtyard, he heard the clattering of castanets. A servant opened the wind door, and Pincai and Rongguan came out to greet him. Rongguan stepped forward, bowed slightly, and reached out for his hand. Lord Fu the Third gave him a pinch, and Rongguan twisted his hand back. Lord Fu the Third scolded, \\"What are you messing around for, little rabbit?\\" Breaking"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蓉官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"脚穿大红镶鞋，拿了一枝水烟袋来，替他师父装烟。和尚也不让客，就吸起来。富三见了，着实爱慕，弯流流两眼只管看他。蓉官站在聘才背后，对着富三作手作脚的，引得富三笑道：「唐大哥，这位是你徒弟么？我倒像见过他。」","en":"guests and started smoking. Upon seeing him, Fu the Third was thoroughly captivated, his eyes lingering on the boy. Rongguan, standing behind Pincai, gestured playfully at Fu the Third, prompting Fu the Third to smile and ask, \\"Brother Tang, is this your disciple? I feel like I've seen him before.\\""},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蓉官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"滋味的。」说得富三大笑道：「真是个爽快人。」三人谈了好一回。富三见那小和尚生得实在可爱，不觉垂涎起来。又见他与蓉官坐在一凳，彼此交头接耳的说话。","en":"while. Seeing the young monk was truly adorable, Fu the Third couldn't help but drool. He also noticed him and Rongguan sitting on the same bench, whispering intimately to each other."},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":13,"tokens":["蓉官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"杯箸。富三道：「你可不要费事。」聘才道：「没有什么可吃的。」于是分宾主坐了，富三叫得月也坐了。唐和尚命得月同着蓉官斟酒。富三见果碟小吃已摆满了一桌，便道：「作什么，都拿开，留四碟就够了。」便叫留下山鸡丝、火腿、倭瓜子、杏仁。蓉官道：「慢些，慢些！」便抢了一碟橘子，又抓了一把金橘道：「你不爱吃，还有人爱吃呢。」一连上了九样菜，倒也很好滋味。蓉官夹了一个肉圆飒噻到唐","en":"took their seats as host and guests, and Fu the Third invited Deyue to sit as well. Monk Tang ordered Deyue and Rongguan to pour the wine. Seeing the table filled with small fruit plates, Fu the Third said, \\"What is all this? Take them away; just keep four plates, that will be enough.\\" He requested to keep the shredded pheasant, ham, pumpkin seeds, and almonds. Rongguan"},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蓉官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"富三进，城又重托了唐和尚，蓉官也自回去。不知后事如何，且听下回分解。","en":"Fu the Third entered the city, having entrusted Monk Tang with the important matter once more, while Rongguan also returned home. What happens next will be revealed in the following chapter."}],"34":[{"paragraph":22,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蓉官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"、潘三、张仲雨、杨梅窗。是日辞了两个，贵大爷病了，张仲雨有事不能来。即补了冯子佩、唐和尚，宾主共七位。聘才叫了蓉官来陪富三，着人到篷子里叫了天香、翠官前来。不多一刻，两个剃头的也坐了大骡车，有一个人跟着，走进寺来。冯子佩是认识的，小剃头的先与子佩请了安，然后向聘才请安。聘才仔细看他，果然生得俊俏，眉目清澄，肌肤洁白，打扮的式样也与相公一般。天香的面色虽白，细看皮","en":"Zipei and Monk Tang were brought in to fill their seats, making a total of seven host and guests. Pincai summoned Rongguan to accompany Fu the Third, and sent someone to the stall to fetch Tianxiang and Cuiguan. Before long, the two barber boys arrived at the temple in a large mule cart, accompanied by a servant. The younger barber, recognizing Zipei, paid his respects to"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蓉官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"手，且知道他爱得月，便叫得月陪了他。杨八坐了第三，聘才叫天香挨着他。潘三坐了第四，自己与唐和尚坐了主位，只不见蓉官来。饮酒之间，撒村笑骂，嘈杂到个不成样子。还是富三稳重些，不过与翠官说些顽笑话，尚不至十分村俗。奚十一手拿了杯子灌那得月，一手伸在得月屁股后头，闹得得月一个腰扭来扭去，两个肩膀闪得一高一低，水汪汪的两只眼睛，看着奚十一，一手推住了酒杯。奚十一道：「你","en":"next to him. Pan the Third sat in the fourth seat, while Pincai and Monk Tang occupied the host's positions. Only Rongguan was absent. As the wine flowed, the conversation devolved into vulgar shouting and coarse jokes, becoming a chaotic, unsightly mess. Fu the Third remained somewhat composed; he merely exchanged a few playful jests with Cuiguan without descending into"}],"35":[{"paragraph":3,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蓉官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"人瞧。众人见聘才有事，不便再留，况已交卯初，大家都要作别。此时已经开城，富三与杨八也要回去。外面正在套车，只见蓉官坐了车来。","en":"Third and Yang Eight were also preparing to return. While their carriages were being harnessed outside, they saw Rongguan arriving in a cart."},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":2,"tokens":["蓉官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"富三的家人道：「客要散了，你才来。」蓉官甩着袖子，急急走进来，见了众人，请了安，见要散的样子。富三道：「好红相公！十四日叫了，要十五日才来。」蓉官见了天香、翠官，便冷笑道：「既然大家要散了，也要回去。我还要叫剃头的剃头呢。」说罢，把腰一弯，竟自去了。两个剃头的甚是局促，众人也没有话说，各人","en":"Fu the Third's servant quipped, \\"The guests are about to disperse, and only now do you arrive.\\" Rongguan flicked his sleeves and hurried in. After greeting everyone and noting the imminent departure, he heard Fu the Third tease, \\"What a sought-after darling! Invited for the fourteenth, yet you only show up on the fifteenth.\\" Seeing Tianxiang and Cuiguan,"}]}`),"char-33":JSON.parse(`{"3":[{"paragraph":23,"mentions":2,"tokens":["春兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「这人是那里人，姓什么？」蓉官道：「是广东人，我只听得人都称他奚大老爷，我也是才认识他。且他也到京未久，他就待春兰待得好。今日春兰身上穿那件玄狐腿子的，是奚大老爷身上脱下来，现叫毛毛匠改小的。」说罢即凑着富三耳边问了一句，富三道：「怎么你今日又有空儿？」蓉官笑嘻嘻的两手搭着富三的肩，把他揉了几揉。","en":"him called Great Lord Xi, and I have only just made his acquaintance. He is new to the capital, yet he treats Chunlan with obsessive favor. That black fox-leg coat Chunlan wore today? Slipped right off Lord Xi's own back and sent straight to the furrier to be tailored down.\\" Rongguan leaned in close, whispering something into Fu the Third's ear. Fu laughed, \\"How is"},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"坐了。走堂的上来，张罗点了菜，蓉官斟了酒。只听得隔壁燕语莺声，甚为热闹。蓉官从板缝里望时，就是那个奚大老爷带了春兰，还有三个相公在那里。聘才问富三道：「老太爷的讳，上下是那两个字？」","en":"Peering through a slender crack in the wooden partition, Rongguan whispered, \\"It is that Great Lord Xi. He has Chunlan and three other actors with him.\\" Turning back, Pincai respectfully addressed Fu the Third: \\"May I ask the honorable name of your late father?\\""},{"paragraph":30,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"那掌柜的又去安慰那相公，嘻嘻的笑说道：「春兰做什么与大老爷这么呕气，你瞧崭新的玄狐腿子溅了油了，快拿烧酒来擦。」就有伙计们拿了烧酒，掌柜的替他抹干净了。一面把那位奚老爷请了出来，另到一间屋子坐了，拉了那相公上前，劝他赔个不是。那相公只管哭，不肯赔礼，那姓奚的，见掌柜的如此张罗，也有些过意不去，","en":"The proprietor went to console the actor and said with a giggling laugh, \\"Chunlan, why must you war with the Great Lord? Look at this magnificent new black fox-leg coat—it is splattered with grease! Quickly, fetch some spirits to clean it.\\" Servants rushed forward with alcohol, and the proprietor meticulously scrubbed the fur clean."},{"paragraph":35,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"大纨袴，到京里来想闹点声名，做个冤桶的。此时只晓得他排行是十一，就称呼他为奚十一。那个砸碗的相公，就是蓉官说的春兰了。","en":"dubbing him 'Xi the Eleventh.' The defiant actor who had shattered the bowls alongside him was none other than Chunlan, the youth Rongguan had spoken of earlier."}],"19":[{"paragraph":12,"mentions":11,"tokens":["春兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"带了几万银子进来，要捐一个大官。谁知用动了，就凑不上了，只捐了一个知州。这个人真算个阔手，他一进京先认识登春班春兰，就天天把春兰放在屋里，衣裳、金镯子、热车等类，就不用讲了。春兰的戏最多的，他于春兰每一出戏，做十几副行头，首饰都是金的，只怕就要值万把银子。春兰的师傅，故意把春兰叫回，呕他赚他，零零碎碎，又花得不少。后来替春兰出师，又花了五千吊，春兰就跟了他，天天","en":"Magistrate. This man truly considers himself a big spender; as soon as he arrived in the capital, he first got to know Chunlan of the Dengchun troupe, and kept Chunlan in his rooms every day — the clothes, gold bracelets, heated carriages, and such things need not even be mentioned. Chunlan has the most stage appearances; for every one of Chunlan's roles, he made a dozen sets"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":2,"tokens":["春兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"还这么傲性子，有骨气，这也奇了。」即问二喜道这奚十一到底是什么人？这样横行霸道，又这样有钱？」二喜道：「我听得春兰讲，说也是个少爷，他家祖太爷做过布政司，他父亲现做提督呢。」聘才道：「如今春兰呢？」二喜道：「同出去了。」于是大家又谈谈笑笑，又喝了一回酒。看看天气将晚，笑梅、聘才皆要进城，只得算了账。梅窗又与二喜说定，明日开发。梅窗让聘才等一同进城，他却住在城外，","en":"this Xi Eleven was, and how he could behave so lawlessly and still have so much money. Erxi said: \\"I heard from Chunlan that he too is the son of a well-born family. His grandfather served as a Provincial Administration Commissioner, and his father is currently serving as Provincial Military Commander.\\" Pincai said: \\"What about Chunlan now?\\" Erxi said: \\"Went out with"}],"27":[{"paragraph":5,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"究，而奚、姬两位，则舍此别无所好，奚十一更是下作，一饭之间，也要进去两次。从前还只一个，如今又添了巴英官，更比春兰巴结的好。巴英官肌肤虽黑，却光亮滑泽，得个油字诀，所以爱的人最多，姬亮轩醉后也曾对人讲过。","en":"he had to slip inside twice. Once there was only one boy, but now Ba Yingguan was added, even more devoted than Chunlan. Ba Yingguan's skin, though dark, was sleek and glossy—the oil trick—so lovers swarmed, as Ji Liangxuan, drunk, had told people."},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"是日饮酒之间，奚十一叫春兰进去了一回，出来坐了一坐；又叫巴英官进去了。仲雨不知其故，只道有事，便与亮轩讲些闲话。这两个相公，一个是蓉官，一个是春林，皆是奚十一常叫的。蓉官对着春林做眼色，春林笑了一笑。亮轩也做眉做眼的，仲雨偶然看见，却不晓得什么，也不便问。蓉官忽问仲雨道：「你","en":"That day, while wine was being passed around, Xi Eleven first summoned Chunlan inside. Chunlan came back out and sat for a while, but Xi soon called Ba Yingguan in as well; the comings and goings made Zhongyu wonder what business was being conducted behind the inner door. Zhongyu guessed his errands and chatted with Liangxuan."},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":2,"tokens":["春兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"奚十一过了夜，明日早饭后，想起仲雨所说的琴言这么利害，到底不信，必要去试试。过瘾之后，同了姬亮轩，带了春兰、巴英官，自己换了件新纱衫子，坐了车，叫春兰、巴英官同跨了车沿，亮轩另雇一个车，到秋水堂来。","en":"be so unapproachable, he resolved to test the matter for himself. After taking opium, along with Ji Liangxuan, Chunlan, and Ba Yingguan, he wore a fresh gauze jacket and took a carriage. Chunlan and Ba Yingguan rode on the footboards, while Liangxuan hired another cart, and they set off to Autumn-Water Hall."},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":2,"tokens":["春兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"刚走到里面，这边奚十一已到门，春兰、英官下来，进去问了，回说不在家。奚十一听了，先有一分怒气，自己也就下来，刚刚走进了门，姬亮轩尚在门外，只见一人笑嘻嘻的上前说道：「老爷是找那一个的？若是找相公们的，没有一个在屋里。」说罢，便迎面站住，也不说个请字。奚十一见了就有了三分气。正要开口，","en":"Just inside, Xi Eleven reached the gate. Chunlan and Ba Yingguan descended and asked within. When answered that no one was home, Xi felt anger rising and entered himself. Liangxuan was still outside when a man stepped up grinning: \\"Sir, seeking whom? If actors, none are inside.\\" He blocked the way"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":2,"tokens":["春兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"当下两人就进去房内坐了。英官、春兰即在外间坐下。那人送了两钟茶上来，有些认得春兰，问了来历，进去告知长庆。 　　长庆道：「已经回说不在家，也就不必应酬他了。」又想道：「这姓奚的，虽听得他是个冤大头，但是个没味的人，多少相公上了他的当，没处伸冤，琴言是断乎讲不来的。不然叫天福、天寿回来","en":"Both entered the inner seating area, while Yingguan and Chunlan remained in the outer room. The man served two cups of tea, recognized Chunlan, asked their provenance, and informed Changqing. Changqing said, \\"I already said I'm not home, so there's no need to entertain.\\" He thought, \\"This Xi, I've heard he's a sucker"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"举眼看他，相貌魁梧，身材高大，满脸的烟气，似有怒容。那一个是个獐头鼠目，短小身材。又见两个俊俏跟班，一个认得是春兰，就请客房坐下。奚十一道：「我姓奚，想来你也知道，不用我说。我听得你这里有个琴言，特来会会他，快些叫他出来。」长庆赔笑道：「琴言偏偏不在家，进城去了。」","en":"with anger; his companion was weasel-snouted and mouse-eyed, short, with two handsome tail-boys. He recognized Chunlan and ushered them into the guest room. Xi said, \\"I am surnamed Xi. You must have heard of me, so there's no need for much speech. I hear you keep a Qinyan here; I have come specifically to meet him. Bring him out at once.\\" Changqing smiled apologetically:"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"们也是世交，你对他说，是我叫他，他也不好意思不放回的。」说罢，便解开了两个扣子。长庆替他脱了衫子，折好了，交与春兰，即请他到吃烟去处，亮轩也随了进去。","en":"he cannot refuse to give face.\\" He undid two buttons. Changqing peeled off his jacket, folded it, handed it to Chunlan, and ushered him into the smoking room; Liangxuan followed."},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"奚十一的法宝是随身带的，春兰便从一个口袋中，一样一样的拿出来，摆在炕上。长庆陪了，给他烧了几口，心上又起了坏主意，赔着笑道：「小的还有两个徒弟：「一个叫天福，一个叫天寿，今日先叫他们伺候，迟日再叫琴言到府上来，不知大老爷可肯赏脸？」奚十一既吹动了烟，即懒得起来。又想他如此殷懃，","en":"Xi's smoking apparatus traveled with him; Chunlan unpacked it from a pocket piece by piece onto the kang. Changqing attended him and burned several bowls. A wicked idea struck him, and he smiled: \\"This small one has two more disciples, one named Tianfu and one Tianshou. Today let them serve you, and"},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"天福就在奚十一对面躺下，天寿坐在炕沿上。亮轩拖张凳子近着炕边，看他们吃烟，春兰、巴英官在房门口帘子边望着。只见天寿爬在奚十一身上，看他手上的翡翠镯子，天福也斜着身子，隔着灯盘拉了奚十一的手，两人同看。亮轩也来炕上躺了，两个相公就在炕沿轮流烧烟。天福挨了奚十一，天寿靠了姬亮轩，两边唧唧哝哝的讲话。亮轩不顾天热，就把天寿搂在怀里，","en":"and Tianshou perched on the edge of the kang. Liangxuan dragged a stool beside the kang, watching them smoke. Chunlan and Ba Yingguan peered from the doorway curtain. Tianshou climbed beside Xi, studying his jade bracelet, while Tianfu leaned across the lamp tray, holding Xi's hand; both admired him. Liangxuan climbed onto the kang, and the two actors took turns burning"},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":2,"tokens":["春兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"春兰、巴英官看不入眼，便走出去，各处闲逛。走到里面，看见些堂客们，知系长庆的家眷。又见东边一个小门半掩着，二人便推开进去，见静悄悄的，有株大梅树。上面三间屋子，东边的窗心糊的绿纱，里面下了卷帘。二人一步步的走到窗前，从窗缝里张时，见床上坐着两个绝色的相公","en":"Chunlan and Ba Yingguan couldn't stomach it. They wandered inward and saw some women—Changqing's kin. The small east door was ajar, so they pushed through into quietness. There was a big plum tree and three rooms; the east windows had green gauze with the blinds"},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":5,"tokens":["春兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"看时，琴言道：「看他做什么，自然是福、寿这两个顽皮了。」素兰终不放心，也因前日吓怕了，叫人关上门，别叫人进来。春兰对巴英官道：「他们说琴官不在家，在床上坐的不是吗？」巴英官道：「那个呢？」春兰道：「是素兰。待我们与老爷说了，好不依他。」于是二人又到房门口，见他们还挤在一处，听得奚十一道：「琴言到底几时回来？」天福正要回言，春兰即说道：「他们哄老爷的，琴言现在里头","en":"mischief.\\" Sulan was still uneasy, still frightened from before, and ordered the door barred to all visitors. Chunlan told Ba Yingguan, \\"They told the Master that Qinyan wasn't home, but isn't he sitting right there on the bed?\\" Ba asked, \\"Who's the other?\\" Chunlan replied, \\"It's Sulan. Wait till we tell the Master; he won't spare them.\\" They returned to the door and"},{"paragraph":30,"mentions":3,"tokens":["春兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"门。长庆赶来说道：「这是我的亲戚姓伍的住的，钥匙他带出去了，房里也没有什么看头。」奚十一欲要打进去，又似踌躇，春兰道：「小的亲眼看见，还有英官同见的，如今必躲在床底下了。」长庆道：「青天白日你见了鬼了。」春兰道：「我倒没有见鬼，你尽说鬼话。」奚十一怒气冲天，忍耐不住，两三脚踢开了门进去，团团一看，春兰把帐子揭起，床下也看了，只不见人。","en":"is my kinsman Wu's room; the keys were carried off, and there's nothing worth seeing inside.\\" Xi hesitated, but Chunlan interjected: \\"This small one saw him, and so did Ba Yingguan; he must be under the bed.\\" Changqing protested, \\"In broad daylight, you are seeing ghosts!\\" Chunlan shot back, \\"I saw no ghosts; you're the one talking ghost-talk.\\" Xi could endure no more."}],"40":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"花便大闹了一场，奚十一软话央求，将来遇有好的再配，方才开交。那奚十一的为人，真是可笑，一味的弃旧怜新。从前买了春兰，也待得甚好，不到半年就冷淡了。去年得了巴英官，如获至宝，如今又弄上了得月、卓天香，将英官也疏远起来。","en":"character was truly laughable — he was forever abandoning the old to dote upon the new. Previously he had bought Chunlan and treated him very well, but grew tired of him in under half a year. Last year he had acquired Ba Yingguan, whom he treasured like a rare gem; but now he had entangled himself with Deyue and Zhuo Tianxiang, and had already grown cold toward Ba Yingguan."},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":2,"tokens":["春兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"那巴英官心中气忿，便与春兰闲谈说道：「从前老土待我们怎样，如今是有一个忘一个，你心上倒放得开么？」春兰道：「我从前主意错了。与我出了师，我当他是个有情有义的，那晓得是个没有良心的。看他所做的事，全不管伤天害理。从前那个桶子，也不知骗了多少人。听得说还有些好人家的孩子，被他哄了","en":"Ba Yingguan, harboring a heart full of indignation, fell to chatting idly with Chunlan one day and said, \\"Chunlan, think of how Old Clod used to treat us — and now it's one forgotten for the next. Can you really take that lying down?\\" Chunlan said, \\"I was foolish in the past. When he bought out my apprenticeship, I truly thought him a"},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"春兰道：「这桶子是西洋造法，口小底大，里头像钟似的叮叮当当的响。他将一样东西扔下去，叫那人用手取出来。中间一层板，有两个洞，一个洞内只容得一只手。若两手都伸了进去，他便将桶内的机巧拨动，两手锁住，再退不出来。耸着屁股，那就随他一五一十的顽罢。我头一次就上","en":"Chunlan said, \\"The barrel was constructed in a Western fashion — narrow at the top and wide at the bottom, with something inside that clinked and chimed like a bell. He would toss an item down into it and tell the person to fetch it out with their hands. There"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":2,"tokens":["春兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"心也罢了。从前还常常的赏东西，如今是赏也稀少了，到像该应拿屁股孝敬他的。这个人偏不生疮。烂掉了，倒大家干净。」春兰道：「你还有旧主人在此，他如过于冷淡你，你可以告假，仍跟姬师爷，我看还比跟他好些。」英官道：「那姬师爷更不好，如果好，我也不跳槽了。那个人肉麻得很，又小气，一天闹人几回，才给几十个钱，还搭几个小钱在里头，所以我更不愿跟他。我在家做手艺时何等舒畅，打条","en":"somehow manages not to break out in sores! If his parts rotted clean off, we'd all be well rid of the trouble.\\" Chunlan said, \\"You still have your former master here. If Xi Eleven grows too cold toward you, you could ask for leave and go back to serving Master Ji — I think that would still be better than staying with him.\\" Ba Yingguan said, \\"That Master Ji is even worse"}],"42":[{"paragraph":25,"mentions":2,"tokens":["春兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"又见亮轩嘻着嘴说道：「我那敝东，其实很好交的。你是不知道他的脾气，若混熟了，只怕还离不开呢。」大傻道：「不见那春兰么？」亮轩道：「春兰固然。本来钱也花多了，自应心悦诚服的了。我那英官呢，借去用两天，就用到如今不肯送还。这个小东西也恋着他，将我往日多少恩情付之流水。这也不能怪他，从来说白鸽子望旺处飞，也是人之常情。况且我这敝东，在京里也算个阔老斗，就与那华公子、徐","en":"yet. Once you were used to him, I dare say you would not want to be without him.\\" Dasha said, \\"What became of Chunlan, then?\\" Liangxuan said, \\"Chunlan, certainly. He spent a great deal of money there, and one ought to be grateful. But my own Yingguan — he borrowed him for a couple of days and has kept him to this hour and will not send him back. And the little creature"}],"45":[{"paragraph":34,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"春兰秋桂非凡种，香色由来人所重。\\n尽待神仙闲品题，群花齐向天门拥。\\n子云道：「他们都说完了，就只有道翁先生与胡兄了。」王胡子拈着长须，候着乩上说他。道生道：「我这老朽，恐怕未必能附诸名士名花之后，且如何能邀坡仙齿芬一粲？」只见乩上又写道：","en":"\\"Spring orchid, autumn cassia, no common breed,\\nFragrance and hue the world has long held dear,\\nWait till immortals idly taste each name,\\nAll blooms together crowd Heaven's gate the same.\\"\\nZiyun said, \\"That finishes them. Only Old Gentleman Qu and Brother Hu remain.\\" Old Wang stroked his beard, eagerly waiting to be named. Daosheng said, \\"This worn-out frame hardly deserves a place after such masters and flowers. How could I ever win Su's smile?\\" The planchette wrote again:"}],"47":[{"paragraph":14,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"十一道：「我等不及了，我要过那瘾。」那人道：「索性上了药，你再和唐师父吃烟。等这药性发一发，就好动手了。」此时春兰、英官也站在书房门口观望。","en":"first, and you can smoke with Master Tang. Once the medicine takes effect, I can begin my work.\\" By this time, Chunlan and Yingguan were also hovering at the study door to watch."},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"菊花自知失言，便跑了进去。阳善修听得有人说要五寸，抬头一看，见门口有两个孩子站着，便当是他们讲的，也笑了一笑。春兰脸倒红了一红，英官鼻子里哼了一声。","en":"Yang Shanxiu looked up and, seeing the two servant boys at the door, assumed they had spoken and smiled as well. Chunlan blushed deeply, while Yingguan gave a haughty snort."},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"出来，把一条药线嵌进。一连四刀，嵌了四条。菊花看了，在那里发抖，抖得牙齿对碰，扑在板壁上，那板壁也刷刺刺的响。春兰、英官吐出了舌头，缩不进去。唐和尚不忍看，躺着吹烟。那人又掏出一个锡盒子，取出一片鲜红带血的肉来，中间还剜了一个眼。又见他把那把小刀在龟头上戳了几刀，又冒出血来，将那片肉贴上，再用药敷好。通身又上了药，扎了两三根药线，把个象牙片子在头上按了几按，砑得","en":"embedded. Trembling so hard her teeth chattered, Juhua leaned against the wooden partition, making it creak softly. Chunlan and Yingguan stuck out their tongues in shock and could not pull them back. Unable to bear the sight, Monk Tang lay down and smoked. The man then took out a tin box and extracted a piece of bright red, bloodied meat, pierced through the middle with a"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":3,"tokens":["春兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"东人叫做地羊，是常吃的。我也不知吃过多少了。」阳善修对唐和尚道：「昨日讲的药本先给我，我好去配药。」奚十一即叫春兰去对姨奶奶讲，要一封银子出来。菊花听了，先进去开了箱，取出一封银子，交与春兰送出。阳善修接了，收拾了药包物件，叫春兰、巴英官扶了奚十一进内去躺罢，同了唐和尚出去了。奚十一果然每天服药一次，阳善修每到午正时候便来上药，一连十余日，竟已长好。后来菊花也不","en":"give me the medicine money we agreed upon yesterday, so I can go prepare the herbs.\\" Xi Eleven immediately told Chunlan to go to the concubine and fetch a wrapped packet of silver. Hearing this, Juhua hurried inside, opened the chest, took out the silver, and handed it to Chunlan to bring out. Yang accepted it, packed his medicines and tools, and told Chunlan and Ba Yingguan"}],"58":[{"paragraph":4,"mentions":2,"tokens":["春兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，菊花梳了头，好不纳闷。无意之间到外边来散步，走到跟班房门口，见关着门，里面有笑声。菊花轻轻的在门缝里一张，见春兰弯着腰在炕边，看有四只脚站在一处。菊花一见，即把袖子掩了口，听巴英官说道：「你倒会长，怎么他不会长，总是这样的？」春兰道：「也觉长了些，没有你的长得快就是了。你人虽短，他倒长呢，与老爷的差不多了。」英官道：「老爷如今的还不及我了。」说话之间，两人的脚","en":"to the attendants' quarters. The door was shut, but laughter came from within. Juhua peeped through the crack. Chunlan was bent over the kang, and four feet stood together on it. At once she clapped her sleeve to her mouth. She heard Ba Yingguan say, \\"You're the one who grows, so how come he doesn't? He is always the same.\\" Chunlan replied, \\"He's grown a bit, just not"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":1,"tokens":["春兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"上罢。」亮轩听了，便与英官扯上裤子，系好了，见自己衣里露出个膝盖来，才记得没有穿裤子，连忙站起，走了出去。这边春兰与老婆子将英官扶出，放在他自己炕上去了。","en":"Yingguan, tied the waist, saw his own knee bare beneath the coat, remembered his missing trousers, stood, and fled. Chunlan and the old woman helped Yingguan to his own kang."}]}`),"char-34":{3:[{paragraph:14,mentions:3,tokens:["小福"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"着一只小金环，衣裳华美，香气袭人。这蓉官瞅着那胖子说道：「三老爷你好冤，人说你常在全福班听戏，花了三千吊钱，替小福出师。你瞧瞧小福在对面楼上，他竟不过来呢。」那胖子道：「那里来这些话，小福我才见过一两面，谁说替他出师。你尽造谣言。」蓉官道：「倒不是我造谣言，有人说的。」蓉官又对那人道：「大老爷是不爱听昆腔的，爱听高腔杂耍儿。」那人道：「不是我不爱听，我实在不懂，",en:`victim too well. Word has it you frequent the Quanfu Troupe, squandering three thousand strings of cash to buy out Xiaofu's indenture. Look there—Xiaofu sits in the opposite gallery, yet he does not even deign to cross the room to greet you." The stout man protested, "What absolute drivel! I have seen Xiaofu barely twice. Who claims I bought his contract? You are nothing`}]},"char-35":{4:[{paragraph:33,mentions:1,tokens:["玉美"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"再看那四个相公，却非名下青钱，不过花中凡艳。王恂认得一个是蓉官，那三个都不认得，因问春喜。春喜道：「穿染貂的是玉美，穿倭刀的是四喜，穿水獭的是全福。都是剑春班的。」只见那位少年，将这边楼上望了一望，也就背转身子坐了。听得那些相公，燕语莺声，光筹交错，好也就背转身子坐了。听得那些相公，燕语莺声，光筹交错，好不热闹。这边三个人相形之下，颇自觉有些郊寒岛瘦起来。听得那",en:'Rongguan; the other three he did not know, and so asked Chunxi. Chunxi explained, "The one in tinted sable is Yumei; the one in Japanese-sword-patterned fur is Si Xi; the one in otter is Quanfu. All three are from the Jianchun company." Just then, the young man glanced over at this balcony once, then turned his back and sat down again. They could hear the young performers'},{paragraph:34,mentions:1,tokens:["玉美"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"倒怎么不爱听昆腔，倒爱听乱弹？」那少年笑道：「我是讲究人，不讲究戏，与其戏雅而人俗，不如人雅而戏俗。」又听得那玉美讲道：「都是唱戏，分什么昆腔乱弹。就算昆腔曲文好些，也是古人做的，又不是你们自己编的。乱弹戏不过粗些，于神情总是一理。最可笑那些人，只讲昆腔不爱二簧。你们二联班内，将来那几个出了班子，不唱戏时，班里就没有支得住的人，只怕听的人就少。这班子还要散呢。」",en:'would rather have a vulgar opera with refined people than a refined opera with vulgar people." They also heard Yumei add, "It is all opera-singing; why distinguish between Kunqu and clapper style? Even granting that Kunqu has finer verse, it was still composed by the ancients and not by yourselves. The clapper style is merely rougher; in terms of conveying feeling'}],12:[{paragraph:19,mentions:2,tokens:["玉美"],kind:"named-mention",zh:`航道：「各部名花，我未曾全览，想亦妍媸不等。我也不过逢场作戏，所谓未能免俗，聊复尔尔。大约诸名班中，要推登春的玉美、全福的翠宝，其余联珠的蓉官，也还可以，想都是有目共赏的。」仲清笑了一笑道：「叶公好龙，未见真龙；
郑人梦鹿，终是假鹿。湘帆可惜有闹相公之名，无闹相公之实。天下相公出在京城，京城相公聚在联锦班。史竹君的《曲台花选》，品题最允，如袁宝珠、苏蕙芳等方配称`,en:`itself — as they say, unable to escape convention, just making do. Among the main troupes, I would put Dengchun's Yumei and Quanfu's Cuibao at the top; and Lianzhu's Rongguan is also passable. I suppose these are the ones that meet with general appreciation." Zhongqing gave a small smile and said: "Lord Ye was fond of dragons — yet when a real dragon appeared, he took`}],22:[{paragraph:32,mentions:1,tokens:["玉美"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"「你可认得那些相公么？」琴言道：「我竟一个都不相识，不知是那一班的？素兰道：「我都认识。坐在怀里的，是登春班的玉美，那弹弦子的叫春林，唱的是叫凤林，皆是凤台班的。」子玉道：「看他们如此作乐，其实有何乐处？他若见了我们这番光景，自然倒说寂寥无味了。」",en:'said: "I know not one of them — what troupe are they?" Sulan said: "I know them all. The one held in his arms is Yumei of the Dengchun troupe; the one at the strings is called Chunlin, and the singer Fenglin — both of the Fengtai troupe." Ziyu said: "Look at them at their pleasures — what pleasure is really in it? And were they to see this scene of ours, no doubt they'}],24:[{paragraph:8,mentions:1,tokens:["玉美"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"林道：「我却当不起这考语。」王恂道：「还有几个人索性请你批评批评。」桂保笑道：「是谁？」王恂道：「蓉官、二喜、玉美、春林、凤林，这些人又是怎样？」桂保笑道：「这又是一路，不与我们往来的。我们是玉虚门下弟子，是兴周伐纣的，他们是通天教主门人，是助纣为虐的。这些人是龟灵圣母、申公豹等类，却也有些旁门左道的神通，倒也利害。我们那一日运气不好？与他们同席，便小小心心的待",en:'insight grows by the day." Yulin modestly demurred. Wang Xun then asked for their judgment on Rongguan, Erxi, Yumei, Chunlin, and Fenglin—the outsiders. Guibao laughed, "They belong to an entirely different school! We are the disciples of the Yuqing gate, crusading for the Zhou; they are of the Tongtian sect, aiding the tyrants—they are like the tortoise-spirit and'}]},"char-36":{4:[{paragraph:33,mentions:1,tokens:["四喜"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"却非名下青钱，不过花中凡艳。王恂认得一个是蓉官，那三个都不认得，因问春喜。春喜道：「穿染貂的是玉美，穿倭刀的是四喜，穿水獭的是全福。都是剑春班的。」只见那位少年，将这边楼上望了一望，也就背转身子坐了。听得那些相公，燕语莺声，光筹交错，好也就背转身子坐了。听得那些相公，燕语莺声，光筹交错，好不热闹。这边三个人相形之下，颇自觉有些郊寒岛瘦起来。听得那美少年说道：「我",en:'asked Chunxi. Chunxi explained, "The one in tinted sable is Yumei; the one in Japanese-sword-patterned fur is Si Xi; the one in otter is Quanfu. All three are from the Jianchun company." Just then, the young man glanced over at this balcony once, then turned his back and sat down again. They could hear the young performers on that side chattering like orioles and'},{paragraph:34,mentions:1,tokens:["四喜"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"不爱二簧。你们二联班内，将来那几个出了班子，不唱戏时，班里就没有支得住的人，只怕听的人就少。这班子还要散呢。」四喜道：「依我说，总是一样，二簧也是戏，昆腔也是戏，学了什么就唱什么。」蓉官笑道：「是了，不必论戏，咱们喝酒。」又听得他们猜拳行令的喝了一会酒。那少年又说道：「我听戏却不听曲文，尽听音调。非不知昆腔之志和音雅，但如读宋人诗，声调和平，而情少激越。听筝琵弦",en:'no one left who can hold things together, and audiences will likely dwindle. The company might even disband." Si Xi said, "As I see it, it is all the same. Erhuang is opera, Kunqu is opera. Learn whichever you learn and sing whichever you sing." Rongguan laughed, "Enough, let us not talk about opera. Let us drink." They could then be heard playing finger-guessing'}],18:[{paragraph:13,mentions:1,tokens:["四喜"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"年纪，却生的好看：瓜子脸儿，带着几点俏麻点儿，梳个丁字头，两鬓惺忪，插了一枝花。身上穿得素净，脚下拖了一双尖头四喜堆绒蝠的高底鞋，也到凳上坐下，与那两个讲话。听他口音不像北边，倒像南方人。一身儿堆着俊俏，觉得比众不同。听得那一个丑的唱起来，唱道：俊郎君，天天门口眼睁睁，瞧得奴动情，盼得你眼昏。等一等，巫山云雨霎时成，只要京钱二百文。聘才听了好笑，又想道：虽然淫词",en:`"Then there are those who have all sorts of faults and do not mix with people at all. They just stay in their rooms with their wives and concubines and enjoy themselves in isolation. With those, too, you must discover one or two things they enjoy; then meet those preferences, offer small tokens of loyalty and faithfulness, and never ask them for anything. Naturally they will set their minds at ease, saying: 'That man has a bit of genuine sincerity, and he's not just trying to exploit me.' Once they've swallowed that bait, you can manage them however you like. This is what's called 'fishing for the golden cicada.' As for one's general manner, though one must be amiable, one also cannot be spineless through and through. Those who have no relevance and serve no purpose, such as Yan Jian'an and Wang Qingyun, don't bother with them; mingling indiscriminately with them serves no purpose at all. Among the household retinue, there are those who cannot say a single useful word inside, yet are masters at bamboozling outsiders. You must see clearly for yourself: those worth attending to, attend to; those not worth attending to, don't attend to. If you attend to those who are useless, the ones who matter will look down on you." Pincai burst out laughing when he heard all this: "Elder brother is truly the foremost great talent of our time. Chen Ping's stratagems and Zhuge Liang's plans are no more than this. You can describe the temperament and character of every sort of person in the world as if you had written them on the palm of your hand. Your little brother ought to come to you with a student's card and pay formal respects as a disciple, so that the method of the heart may be properly transmitted." Zhongyu laughed: "I've already told you everything. What is there left to bow to a teacher for? Follow what I have said, and it is guaranteed not to go wrong. In the future, if good things come to you, do not forget your teacher. That is all the good conscience a student needs." With that, both laughed, and before they knew it, half the day had passed. Zhongyu settled the bill and they came out together. Zhongyu said: "Little brother, go back into the city now. I have some business to attend to and cannot keep you company." With that, he bowed and departed. It was still early. As Pincai walked along the way, he spotted Sihui and Yuanmao in the distance, just rounding a corner ahead. Pincai thought: "Where are they going?" and quietly followed. He entered a small alleyway packed with idle onlookers, all crowded at someone's doorway peering in. Pincai had heard people say that the East Garden was where prostitutes gathered, so he joined the crowd and stood watching. In one household, a thatched-wall mud enclosure containing two thatched rooms, he saw Sihui and Yuanmao standing just ahead of him. They were looking at two women seated on a long bench. Both were around twenty years old, fat-faced and full-bellied, their hair greased and their faces powdered, wearing rather showy clothing. He saw one woman say to Sihui: "Come in and sit." She laughed and simpered, making Sihui and Yuanmao itch with desire. They hovered on the edge of entering but not quite entering, staring in a daze. He also saw an awkward-looking man over forty squatting on the ground, wearing a short jacket belted at the waist. A large pouch hung from it, big enough to hold two strings of cash. Then from behind the curtain walked out a woman of around twenty or so, rather good-looking. She had an oval face with a charming scattering of freckles, her hair done in a T-style knot with her temples soft and loose, a flower tucked in her hair. She wore plain clothes, and on her feet she had a pair of pointed-toe "four-happiness bats" high-soled shoes with pile ornaments. She sat down on the bench and chatted with the other two. Her speech sounded different from northern speakers, more like a southerner. From head to toe she possessed an appealing prettiness noticeably different from the others. He heard one of the plainer-looking women begin to sing:

"Fine young lord,
Every day at the gate you stare and stare,
Your staring sets my heart astir,
Your longing has blurred your very eyes.
Wait a while.
Cloud and rain on Mount Wu, done in an instant,
All for a mere two hundred copper cash."

Pincai found this amusing, and then thought: though it is a crude and lewd ditty, the feeling expressed is truthful. He listened again: the homely one had turned and was singing directly at Sihui and Yuanmao:`}]},"char-38":JSON.parse(`{"1":[{"paragraph":50,"mentions":4,"tokens":["保珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"见王恂问那人道：「你这相公叫什么名字？」那人道：「叫保珠。」子玉听了，忍不住一笑。又见王恂问道：「你不在桂保处么？」那人道：「桂保处人多，前日出来的。这保珠就住在桂保间壁，少爷今日叫保珠伺候？」王恂支吾，那保珠便拉了王恂的手问道：「到什么地方去，也是时候了。」王恂道：「改日罢。」那相公便缠住了王恂，要带他","en":"He heard Wang Xun ask the man, \\"What is this boy's name?\\" The man replied, \\"He's called Baozhu.\\" Hearing this, Ziyu couldn't suppress a laugh. He then heard Wang Xun ask, \\"Aren't you with Guibao?\\" The man answered, \\"There are too many people at Guibao's place; he left there a few days ago. This Baozhu lives right next door to Guibao. Will the"},{"paragraph":56,"mentions":1,"tokens":["保珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这么看来，「有目共赏」的一句，竟是妄言了。把方才这个保珠比他，做他的舆儓，也还不配。」子玉一路想到了家；不知后事如何。且听下回分解。","en":"Looking at it this way, the phrase 'universally appreciated' has indeed proven to be an empty boast. To compare that Baozhu from earlier to this one—he would not even be fit to serve as his lowliest menial.\\" Ziyu pondered this all the way home. To know what happens next, please listen to the explanation in the following chapter."}],"5":[{"paragraph":22,"mentions":1,"tokens":["保珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"所以天下的至宝，惟有美色为第一，如果真美色，天下人没有不爱的。子玉前日在戏园的光景，倒像那个保珠沾染了他什么，那片心应该永远不动才是。谁知一个琴官，见了两次，还如电光石火，一过不留，心里就时时的思念。何况他人，其自守本不如子玉，又能与美人朝夕相见，自然爱慕更切，把个百炼钢化为绕指柔了。聘才自知与琴官无缘，巴结不上，虽也爱其容貌，其实恨其性情。如","en":"is no one in the world who does not love it. Ziyu's experience at the theater the other day had been such that Baozhu seemed to have made some impression on him; his heart ought to have been forever unmoved. Yet who would have known that after only two encounters with Qinguan, it was like a flash of lightning or a spark of flint, passing in an instant without a trace,"}],"6":[{"paragraph":26,"mentions":2,"tokens":["保珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"侧耳而听，听这说话诧异，将要问时。王恂笑道：「冤哉！冤哉！那个那里是袁宝珠，那是顶黑的黑相公，偏偏他的名字也叫保珠，庾香一听就当是你定的第一名。我也想着要分辨，就被那保环缠住，没有这个空儿。「南湘大笑，子玉才知道另是个保珠，不是《花选》上的宝珠。","en":"That was not Yuan Baozhu at all—that was the darkest of the dark-class performers, whose name also happened to be Baozhu. Yuxiang heard the name and immediately assumed him to be your top choice. I was about to explain, but Baohuan had me so entangled that I never had the chance.\\" Nanxiang burst into hearty laughter, and Ziyu finally realized it had been a completely different"}],"8":[{"paragraph":8,"mentions":4,"tokens":["保珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"痒痒的说不出话来。那相公便坐着不动。换了一出《嫖院》，便又一个相公到张仲雨身边，也坐着不走。聘才问他的名字，叫保珠。台上又换一出《女弹词》，一出场，聘才认得是琪官。看他打扮得十分香艳，颇有花含晓露，月印暗川之致，两边楼上喝采不迭。仲雨道：「这个就是琪官。」聘才点头含笑道：「这琪官比去年更觉好了。「元茂也认不清楚，只与二喜说话，又看看保珠，却没有余情照应到台上。那","en":"approached, seating himself beside Zhang Zhongyu and lingering there. Pincai asked his name and learned it was Baozhu. On stage, the scene shifted to 'Female Ballad-Singing.' The moment the actor made his entrance, Pincai recognized Qiguan. His attire was exquisitely alluring, exuding the delicate grace of a blossom kissed by morning dew or the moon reflected in a tranquil"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":1,"tokens":["保珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"两个黑相公，夹着个怯老斗，把个李元茂左顾右盼，应接不暇。保珠、二喜抢装烟，抢倒茶，一个挨紧了膀子，一个挤紧了腿。李元茂得意洋洋，乐得心花大放。","en":"performers, the timid, country-bred patron found himself entirely overwhelmed, unable to attend to both at once. Baozhu and Erxi vied for his attention, competing to prepare his pipe and pour his tea. One pressed warmly against his shoulder, while the other squeezed intimately against his leg. Li Yuanmao was in seventh heaven, his heart blossoming with absolute delight."},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":2,"tokens":["保珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「今日在什么地方？」元茂不懂，只把头点。又听得保珠问道：「今日咱们上那个馆子，我伺候你罢。」元茂支吾，说不出来。二喜又道：「今天才开了两三家，若去迟了，恐怕没有坐儿。」元茂心里想道：「这两个却都好，看这光景，两个都要去的，但恐所带的银子不够。」又想道：「两人给他十二吊钱，吃五六吊钱的酒菜，也够了。」","en":"\\"Where shall we go today?\\" Unsure of what was being asked, Yuanmao simply nodded. Then Baozhu chimed in, \\"Which restaurant shall we visit today? Allow me to wait upon you.\\" Yuanmao stammered, unable to form a coherent reply. Erxi pressed, \\"Only two or three establishments have opened today. If we delay, there may not be any tables left.\\" Yuanmao"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":5,"tokens":["保珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"声」张老爷，新年好！升官发财。」又作了个揖，仲雨也应酬了几句。拣了个雅座，仲雨首坐，元茂第二，聘才第三，二喜、保珠一凳坐了。走堂的送了茶，便请点菜。仲雨让元茂、聘才，二人又推仲雨先点，仲雨要的是瓦块鱼，烩鸭腰，聘才要的是炸肫、火腿。保殊要的是白蛤豆腐、炒虾仁。二喜要的是炒鱼片、卤牲口、黄焖肉。元茂道：「我喜欢吃鸡，我就是鸡罢。」走堂的及二喜都笑。拿了两壶酒，几碟","en":"elegant private room, with Zhongyu taking the seat of honor, Yuanmao the second, and Pincai the third. Erxi and Baozhu squeezed onto a single stool together. A waiter served tea and presented the menu. Zhongyu offered the choice to Yuanmao and Pincai, who deferred back to him. Zhongyu ordered tile-shaped fish and braised duck kidneys, while Pincai requested fried gizzards"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":1,"tokens":["保珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"原来这杯酒是干巴巴的，你就这么饮了罢。」二喜就拿杯子送到元茂嘴边，元茂乐极，一饮就干。仲雨、聘才齐声说「好」！保珠道：「这个笑话实在说得有趣。」便也斟了一杯酒，送到聘才嘴边，叫道：「干爸爸饮这杯。」聘才也喜欢，干了。","en":"Yuanmao's lips. Overjoyed, Yuanmao drained it in a single gulp. Zhongyu and Pincai erupted in cheers of \\"Bravo!\\" Baozhu added, \\"That joke was truly delightful.\\" He then poured a cup of wine, brought it to Pincai's lips, and called out affectionately, \\"Godfather, drink this cup.\\" Pincai, highly amused, drank it down."},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":1,"tokens":["保珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"保珠又斟了一杯，送到仲雨面前，也叫了一声干爸爸，仲雨也干了。","en":"Baozhu poured another cup, brought it to Zhongyu, and again called out, \\"Godfather!\\" Zhongyu drank it as well."},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":1,"tokens":["保珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"酒就从鼻孔里倒冲出来，绝像撒出两条黄溺，淋淋漓漓，标了一桌。李元茂的脑门子，又痒又辣，便伏在二喜肩上抬不起头。保珠笑得坐不牢，已塌下凳子，坐在地上。仲雨笑的翻了一身酒。聘才笑的腹痛，捧住了肚子。","en":"table. His forehead tingling and burning, Yuanmao buried his face in Erxi's shoulder, unable to lift his head. Baozhu laughed so hard he lost his balance, slipping off his stool and onto the floor. Zhongyu laughed until he spilled wine all over himself, while Pincai clutched his aching sides."},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":1,"tokens":["保珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"老虎来了，逢人就要吃的。」你瞧上头到底是财神爷骑黑老虎，还是穷老斗跨黑相公？」聘才拍案叫绝，元茂掩着鼻孔要笑，保珠却仰面看那龛。二喜便斟了一杯酒，送到仲雨面前道：「该罚，你挖苦得利害。」仲雨接过来，饮了道：「这里却没有怕相公的穷老斗。」又与二喜豁第三杯，二喜输了，要敬仲雨皮杯。仲雨道：「咱们倒不用这么着，方才李老爷那杯没有吃得好，这杯我烦你转敬他。」二喜便拿着杯","en":"performer?\\" Pincai slammed the table in absolute delight, Yuanmao pinched his nose to stifle his laughter, while Baozhu tipped his head back to study the shrine. Erxi poured a cup of wine and presented it to Zhongyu, declaring, \\"A penalty for you! Your mockery is far too sharp.\\" Zhongyu accepted the cup and drank, remarking, \\"Fortunately, there are no poor patrons terrified"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":3,"tokens":["保珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"是圆的，还是叫他敬皮杯罢」这一阵笑，却也笑得可听，元茂笑出眼泪来，骂道：「你这个恶人，明日就要变哑叭子。「笑得保珠滚在聘才怀里，二喜便过来，把聘才打了一下，道：「那里有这样坏人，骂人骂入骨的。」第三杯偏偏又是二喜输了，二喜拿着酒道：「怎样唱？你吩咐。」聘才即板起脸来道：「你听了张老爷的话，不听我的话，你就瞧不起我，我今儿不依你。」二喜吃惊道：「我没有得罪你。」聘","en":"Tears streaming from his eyes, Yuanmao scolded, \\"You wicked man! You will surely be struck dumb by tomorrow!\\" Baozhu laughed until he collapsed into Pincai's lap. Erxi marched over and slapped Pincai lightly on the arm. \\"Is there anyone more wicked than you? Your insults cut straight to the bone!\\" By some twist of fate, Erxi lost the third round. Holding the wine,"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":1,"tokens":["保珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"聘才忽见一个和尚走进来，口中说道：「我的二老爷！你在这里，我走了七八个戏园子，那一处不寻到？」二喜、保珠见了和尚都请了安，聘才、元茂也站起来招呼。和尚都作了揖，与仲雨一凳坐了。聘才看那和尚相貌，是个紫糖色方脸，两撇浓须，有四十来岁，戴个绒僧帽，穿件宝蓝绸狐皮僧袍，腰拴黄丝绦，足下挖云青缎毛儿窝，也没有出家人的光景，定是酒肉和尚。","en":"monk exclaimed. \\"Here you are! I have scoured seven or eight theaters looking for you!\\" Seeing the monk, Erxi and Baozhu both offered respectful greetings, while Pincai and Yuanmao rose to acknowledge him. The monk returned their bows and took a seat beside Zhongyu. Pincai appraised the newcomer: a square face the color of dark sugar, two thick mustaches, perhaps forty"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":1,"tokens":["保珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"保珠笑嘻嘻的道：「唐老爷，你那位少爷，倒没有带出来？」唐和尚笑道：「岂有此理！和尚连奶奶都没有，那里来的少爷？」二喜道：「你那位少爷，也与奶奶一样。」唐和尚一手就伸到二喜脸上来。二喜笑道：「我说和奶奶的模样长得一样，没有说错呀。」唐和尚见有聘才、元茂在坐","en":"Baozhu smiled playfully. \\"Master Tang, did you not bring your young son with you?\\" Monk Tang barked a laugh. \\"Preposterous! A monk doesn't even have a wife, where would I get a son?\\" Erxi retorted, \\"Your 'son' looks just like a wife anyway.\\" Tang reached out"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":3,"tokens":["保珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"聘才、元茂又与保珠豁了一轮拳，保珠也敬了两次皮杯。，二喜又要了几样莱，重又闹了好一回，已点了半枝蜡烛。约有定更后了。两个相公都也困乏，两个跟兔在风门口站着。李元茂不知颠倒，饮汤饮酒，除下帽子，头上热气腾腾，如蒸笼一般。聘才道：「咱们也好散了。」轻轻的凑着元茂耳边道：「","en":"Pincai and Yuanmao played another round of games with Baozhu, who offered two more skin-cups. Erxi ordered several more dishes, and the revelry continued for some time, well past the lighting of the candles, deep into the first watch of the night. The two performers were growing weary, and the two servants stood"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":4,"tokens":["保珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"」又到元茂耳边一凑道：「你到我家里去，我伺候你。」元茂听了这句，心里又喜又急，脸上发起烧来，只顾看着聘才发怔。保珠、二喜猜不出什么意思。聘才只得对元茂道：「丢了这包银子，如今怎样呢？」元茂道：「原是还有些东西在内，一齐偷去了。」保珠道：「什么？」元茂道：「银子，在戏园门口，叫小利割去了」二喜道：「我同你出来，没有见小利。」元茂道：「进门时丢的。「二喜道：「进门时","en":"Yuanmao felt a surge of joy mixed with intense panic, his face burning hot. He could only stare blankly at Pincai. Baozhu and Erxi were utterly bewildered by his behavior. Left with no alternative, Pincai finally spoke up, \\"Now that the silver has been lost, what are we to do?\\" Yuanmao added miserably, \\"There were other things in that pouch—it was all taken together.\\" \\"What"},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":1,"tokens":["保珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"保珠道：「我倒没有什么不相信。况且二位老爷都是头一回的交情，决没有安心漂我们的。但我们回去，是要交账的。再是新年上，更难空手回去。非但难见师傅，也对不住跟的人。","en":"Baozhu replied, \\"I have no particular reason to doubt you. After all, this is our first meeting; you would hardly set out to deliberately cheat us. But when we return, we must present our accounts to our master. And during the New Year, returning empty-handed"},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":4,"tokens":["保珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"饭就吃不成了。李老爷，你既然不肯打发人回去，如今这么着，劳你能驾送我回去，对我师傅说一声，你赏不赏都不要紧。」保珠道：「你这话说的很是，只要咱们师傅知道了，就好了，咱们要什么钱。」把个李元茂急得无法，脸上胀的通红，一句话也说不出来。聘才只得说道：「咱们认识了，难道就这一回，没有后来的交情了？你要他同去，对你师傅说，也不怕你师傅不依，但我倒没有见过，相公要请出师傅","en":"\\"We only ask that you find some way to spare us this hardship,\\" Baozhu pleaded. He turned to Erxi, \\"Brother Xi, is that not fair?\\" Yuanmao insisted, \\"I am telling you the truth, yet you refuse to believe me! I had eight pieces of silver today, well over ten taels, loose in a pouch, and the thief took the pouch and all."},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":2,"tokens":["保珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"远，恐难担也。」聘才只得又再三央求，嗣徽勉强答应，说道：「明日可以与则与之，人而无信，不知其可也。」即对二喜、保珠道：「来，余与尔言，盍去诸？明日亲送之门，毋逼人太甚也。」两个相公不能明白，嗣徽只得说了几句平话。保珠、二喜见嗣徽担了，也就没法，只得勉勉强强，谢了一声而去。孙嗣徽恐他们又要他担起馆子帐来，便急急的走了。","en":"given,\\" he intoned solemnly. \\"'A man without integrity, who knows what becomes of him?'\\" He then turned to Erxi and Baozhu. \\"Come, let me speak plainly with you. Why not take your leave now? Tomorrow I shall personally deliver the funds to your door. Do not press people too harshly.\\" Finding his classical rhetoric incomprehensible, Sihui was forced to repeat his guarantee"}],"9":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["保珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"言可答，各自安睡。到了次日，只得央了许顺，借了十吊钱的票子，分作两张，写了一封字，叫四儿送与叶茂林，分给二喜、保珠。后来子玉盘问，聘才、元茂只推张仲雨请去听戏下馆子，却将实情瞒过了。","en":"drafts. Wrapping them with a letter, they had Si'er deliver the money to Ye Maolin to distribute between Erxi and Baozhu. Later, when Ziyu asked, Pincai and Yuanmao simply claimed that Zhang Zhongyu had treated them to opera and a restaurant, keeping the truth concealed."},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":1,"tokens":["保珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"真伪可能相混么？」子玉笑道：「瓦砾岂可僭称珠玉？那个名字，叫他改了才好。」宝珠不解，便问王恂，王恂就将去年所见保珠，子玉听错的话说了，宝珠嫣然而笑。","en":"name should be changed.\\" Baozhu was puzzled and asked Wang Xun. Wang Xun told the story of having seen the fake Baozhu the previous year and of Ziyu's mishearing. Baozhu gave a sweet smile."}],"21":[{"paragraph":14,"mentions":1,"tokens":["保珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"在庾香处了，我也没有问他在那里。」素兰道：「我听走堂的说起来，却说得原原委委。新年上，这姓魏的同了几个人，带着保珠、二喜，吃了五十几吊钱，掌柜的因不认识，写账的时候，想必说了什么话。","en":"not ask where.\\" Sulan said: \\"The waiters told the tale end to end. New Year's week this Wei and others brought Baozhu and Erxi — fifty-odd strings — the boss did not know him and must have spoken out of turn when tallying credit.\\""}]}`),"char-40":JSON.parse(`{"5":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":[],"kind":"identified-reference","zh":"夫人袁氏，年方二十三岁，是现任云南巡抚袁浩之女。","en":"His mother had gone to Guangdong to accompany his father's posting; only Ziyun himself remained in the capital. This Ziyun was cultivated and elegant in appearance, distinguished and peerless in character, magnanimous beyond measure, and deeply versed in the classics and histories. He was twenty-five years of age, holding a sinecure post as a departmental secretary through hereditary privilege, and at twenty-two had also passed the provincial examinations as a juren. His wife, née Yuan, was twenty-three years old, daughter of Yuan Hao, the current Governor of Yunnan. She was surpassingly beautiful, supremely virtuous, and possessed literary gifts of the orchid and cassia. She and Ziyun were perfectly matched, a talented man and a beauty, loving and mutually respectful, as lute paired with jade se. They already had one son and one daughter.","identityNote":{"en":"Ziyun’s wife is identified here by her maiden surname; chapter 57 supplies Qixiang’s full name.","zh":"此处以袁氏称子云之妻，第57回明言其名袁绮香。"}}],"11":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":4,"tokens":["袁夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「这些相公对了你们怎样的光景，到底有甚好处？」子云笑道：「这些人你都见过，也听过他们的戏，难道还说不好？」袁夫人道：「我见他们唱戏时，也不过摹拟那闺阁的模样。至于下妆时，也还生得清清秀秀。若要说他是无价的至宝，我就不知。据我看来，似乎还不及我这几个丫头。」子云道：「你们眼里看着，自然是女孩子好。但我们在外边酒席上，断不能带着女孩子，便有伤雅道。这些相公的好处，","en":"laid eyes on them and heard their songs. Can you truly claim they lack a certain exquisite charm?\\" \\"To my eye,\\" Mrs. Yuan replied, \\"they merely mimic the delicate graces of sheltered maidens when they perform. Even unadorned, they are certainly fair and fragile. Yet to elevate them as matchless, priceless treasures escapes my understanding. They seem scarcely more refined"},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":1,"tokens":["袁夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"次早袁夫人检出了十样玩好，都是重价之珍，开了一个单子是：「琼瑶玉连环七宝钗翠羽扇珊瑚搔头镂金博山炉青瑶玉琴珍沉水香瑟柱奇楠香串玛瑙印章」先着人送去。遂于十二红丫鬟中带了红雪，红霙、红香、红玉、红薇、红雯六个，都是盈盈十五，窈窕多姿，识字能书，工诗善绣。伺候夫人","en":"At the break of dawn, Mrs. Yuan meticulously selected ten exquisite curios of immense value and drafted an inventory. It listed a jade interlocking ring crafted of jasper and nephrite, a hairpin inlaid with seven treasures, a fan formed of vibrant kingfisher feathers, a coral hair"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":4,"tokens":["袁夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这日华夫人知其胞妹浣兰小姐要来，复又见徐府中送了十样珍玩，知袁夫人也要来，与华公子清早拜过了家庙，供过了佛。公子本要再与夫人家宴一天，因他姨妹与盟嫂来，只好回避。不一会苏小姐已到，香车到了穿堂，用软肩舆一直抬进了内堂院子里，四个丫鬟扶了小姐下轿，华夫人出接，姐妹二人见了礼，华公子也进来见过了。公子问过他岳父岳母的安","en":"would attend, Lady Hua was further delighted by the arrival of the Xu household's ten precious curios, signaling Mrs. Yuan's impending visit. Rising early, she and the young master offered reverent respects at the ancestral shrine and the Buddhist altar. The young master had intended to honor his wife with another private banquet, but the arrival of her sister and sworn-sister"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":7,"tokens":["袁夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"说着自己先笑了。袁夫人也笑道：「灯却可以看得，几千人是用不着，二三百人是要呢。我抢先同了姐妹们于十一日试了一天，后来就有些官客们，接接连连闹到十八日，也没有空得一日。又因你们都在城里，只得日间来看，不能晚上赏玩，所以没有来请。」华夫人也甚为羡慕。袁夫人又对苏小姐道：「承年","en":"She laughed at her own fanciful tale. Mrs. Yuan smiled in return: \\"You certainly could have viewed the lanterns. We hardly needed thousands of men, though two or three hundred were indeed employed. We ladies hurried ahead on the eleventh to privately test their glow. Thereafter, various gentlemen"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":2,"tokens":["袁夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"三人谈谈笑笑，饮了一会，袁夫人道；「我新见人行一个酒令，倒也有趣：用五句成语凑成一串，但嫌其没有韵，而且第四五句，还添两个虚字在里头，略欠自然。他第一句用古文，第二句用唐诗，第三句用骨牌名，第四句用曲牌名，第五句用《时宪书》，凭人自己检用，便容易了。我们如今六个骰子，随手掷出什么","en":"The three ladies shared wine, laughter, and elegant conversation until Mrs. Yuan spoke: \\"I recently learned a highly entertaining wine-game. It strings together five set phrases, though I find fault with its lack of rhyme, and the final two phrases rely on unnatural filler words. That version draws arbitrarily from classical prose,"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":1,"tokens":["袁夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「姐姐先行个样儿出来。」袁夫人取过骰子，掷了几掷，成了色样，是个群鸦噪凤。便望着骰盆想了一会，说道：「我献丑了，说得不好。你们不要笑话。」即念道：群鸦噪凤，箫鸣凤下空，分明伯劳飞燕各西东。五更转，甘与子同梦。","en":"\\"Elder sister, pray set the example for us.\\" Gathering the dice, Mrs. Yuan cast them into the tray, landing upon the pattern 'A Flock of Crows Cawing in the Wind.' She gazed at the ivory faces, lost in quiet reflection for a moment, before murmuring, \\"I shall venture a modest attempt. Pray do not laugh if it falls short.\\" She"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":1,"tokens":["袁夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"袁夫人笑道：「你凡事总有一番谦退。及至行出令来，必定又十分用心，不肯让人一毫。」华夫人也笑了，即取过骰子，掷了几掷，掷了个铁索缆孤舟的色样，便想了一想，即念道：","en":"Mrs. Yuan laughed gently: \\"You are forever modest in your claims. Yet when your turn arrives, you summon immense effort, refusing to let anyone surpass you by even a hair's breadth.\\" Lady Hua smiled, took up the dice, and threw the pattern 'Iron Chains Mooring"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":1,"tokens":["袁夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"袁夫人道：「何如？我说你必有警人之句，这五句如一句，比我的好得多了。这句《续西厢》更用得有趣。再要看兰妹的。想必更好，定是后来居上。」华夫人犹谦了几句。","en":"Mrs. Yuan exclaimed, \\"What did I tell you? I knew you possessed verses to astonish the ear. These five lines flow as a single breath, far surpassing my own meager attempt. Using a phrase from the *Sequel to the Western Chamber* shows particular wit. Now we must"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":2,"tokens":["袁夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"袁夫人赞道：「我说后来居上是不错的，兰妹这个令真教我五体投地，惟有贺一个满杯罢。」苏小姐颇自得意，喜孜孜的倒谦了一句。华夫人也赞道：「果然好。但也是掷着了那个好色样，成全了他。」也贺了一杯，并命伺候丫鬟们，每人都饮一杯酒，作个大犒三军，公贺将军挂印。十珠、","en":"\\"I said the last would surpass the first, and so it has,\\" Mrs. Yuan praised warmly. \\"Sister Lan's verse leaves me in absolute admiration; I can offer nothing less than a brimming cup in congratulation.\\" Immensely pleased, Miss Su smiled while offering a gentle disclaimer. \\"It is truly fine,\\" Lady Hua agreed, \\"though"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":2,"tokens":["袁夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"袁夫人再掷，掷了一个色样，是落红满地。袁夫人要争奇取胜，不肯就说，细细的想了一会，想成了一个也甚得意。便念道：落红满地，拭翠敛蛾眉，只是昨宵今日清减了小腰围。","en":"Taking the dice once more, Mrs. Yuan rolled the pattern 'Fallen Red Petals Blanketing the Ground.' Determined to maintain her supremacy and refusing to speak in haste, she pondered deeply before composing a verse that brought her quiet satisfaction. She recited:\\n\\n\\"Fallen red petals blanketing"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":2,"tokens":["袁夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"赞道：「姐姐这个实在好极，怎么能说这般蕴藉风流。为什么我说不到这样，觉得有点粗气。这个我们该贺。」各贺了一杯。袁夫人笑道：「你是李、杜大家，我是温、李靡艳，如何比得上你来？」华夫人笑道：「这首绝妙，与题相称。我想姐姐是骂二哥天天带着相公，在园里喝醉了回来，教姐姐腰围都清减了。」袁夫人颇不好意思，说道：「你来取笑我，你留心了色样，这是有还礼的。」华夫人、苏小姐皆笑，","en":"blunt and coarse by comparison. We must surely congratulate you for this.\\" They each raised a celebratory cup. Mrs. Yuan laughed, \\"Your verses echo the grand, sweeping style of Li Bai and Du Fu, whilst I linger in the delicate, ornate shadows of Wen Tingyun and Li Shangyin. How can they be compared?\\" Lady Hua smiled knowingly. \\"It is absolutely exquisite and perfectly"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":1,"tokens":["袁夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"华夫人取过骰子，掷了一个二士入桃源。也构思了一会，想着了几句妙语。但方才取笑了袁夫人，如今说出来，又恐他要报复，不觉迟迟的红泛桃腮。若改换了，便觉可惜，只得念道：","en":"quiet moment gathering her thoughts, quickly weaving together several exquisite phrases. Yet, having just teased Mrs. Yuan, she feared a swift retaliation if she voiced them aloud. A sudden hesitation seized her, a rosy blush spreading across her peach-blossom cheeks. Finding it a pity to discard the lovely lines, she reluctantly recited:"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":1,"tokens":["袁夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"苏小姐听了，对着华夫人微笑。袁夫人笑道：「你怎么忽然想起初嫁的时候来？这几句可谓风华旖旎已极。如见熏香对景，画眉人偎倚妆台，喃喃私语。","en":"Hearing this, Miss Su turned a knowing, luminous smile toward Lady Hua. Mrs. Yuan laughed softly: \\"What possessed you to suddenly dream of the days when you were newly wed? These phrases represent the very pinnacle of romantic, entwined devotion. One can almost envision a fragrant-hearted beauty leaning against her dressing mirror,"},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":2,"tokens":["袁夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"华夫人先赞了好。袁夫人道：「你这个可谓温柔香艳之至矣，又恰是闺秀口气。我略比你长了几年，就说不到这样秀韵，这真是勉强不来的。」苏小姐只是含笑，又贺了一杯。那边红香低低对宝珠说道：「你听各人行的令，真像各人的语言情性，连相貌都像，这是什么缘故？若教彼此换一个过儿，就便都不像","en":"Lady Hua was the first to offer her praise. Mrs. Yuan said, \\"Your verse achieves the very ultimate in gentle warmth and fragrant allure, capturing precisely the pure voice of a sheltered maiden from a noble house. Being a few years your senior, I find I can no longer summon such delicate, exquisite innocence."},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":1,"tokens":["袁夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"苏小姐道：「这是姐姐的本地风光、可以把那些百鸟百兽，神龙癞象，火树银花，一齐说出来，做个热闹灯节了。」袁夫人笑道：「我也这么想，但我未必有这力量。」想了一会凑不上来，只得重换了，念道：观灯十五夜，未醉岂劳扶，一声声道不如归去。步步娇，谓行多露。","en":"fire-blossomed trees and cascading silver flowers, conjuring the grand, festive spectacle of your lantern festival.\\" Mrs. Yuan laughed: \\"That was indeed my intention, yet I fear my pen lacks the power to capture it.\\" After struggling fruitlessly to weave the grand imagery together, she set the thought aside and recited instead:\\n\\n\\"Viewing lanterns on the fifteenth night,\\nWhat"},{"paragraph":30,"mentions":1,"tokens":["袁夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这边伺候的人，已少了好些。袁夫人听得后房也在那里当啷当啷的掷骰子，有些嗤嗤的笑，与互相褒贬讥诮之声。苏小姐道：「他们在那里行令呢，不知行出来的怎样？」华夫人笑道：","en":"With the attendants withdrawn, the room grew intimately quiet. Yet from the back chambers, Mrs. Yuan could discern the intermittent, sharp clatter of dice, mingled with bursts of laughter and the playful barbs of mutual teasing. \\"They are playing the wine game as well,\\" Miss Su noted. \\"I wonder what manner of verses they are managing to compose?\\" Lady"},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":2,"tokens":["袁夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"袁夫人道：「这个也把你的情韵都写出来，我如见你在花阴之下，绿妥红酣，劳情自遣，真是碧桃花下神仙侣。」华夫人道：「觉得我的出语总平些，没有姐姐的灵警。今日终是姐姐考第一，一片的香腻光泽，都在字里头透出来，我只好甘拜下风。」袁夫人道：「那里！清华明艳，都被你们","en":"Mrs. Yuan smiled warmly. \\"This, too, captures the entirety of your sentiment and grace. It is as if I behold you resting in the cool shade of the blossoms, surrounded by a lush abundance of red and green, gently dispelling the quiet longings of your heart. You"},{"paragraph":33,"mentions":2,"tokens":["袁夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，只剩一斗，天下闺秀分起来，到我分不到一合了。」说得华夫人、苏小姐皆笑。苏小姐道：「姐姐说那个小才女是谁家？」袁夫人道：「这人你们不认得么？是王质夫年伯的第二个女儿，名叫琼华，我们都是世姐妹。」华夫人道：「是通政司卿那位王年伯么？我们倒没有往来过。」苏小姐道：「这王琼华怎样好呢？」袁夫人道：「他今年十七岁，相貌是没有比得上他的，与二位真可鼎足为三。我前日请他们姐妹","en":"charming exaggeration, Miss Su asked, \\"And who is this 'small talent' you speak of?\\" \\"Do you truly not know her?\\" Mrs. Yuan asked in mild surprise. \\"She is the second daughter of our Senior Kinsman Wang Zhifu, named Wang Qionghua. We are all sworn sisters.\\" \\"Would that be the Senior Kinsman Wang currently serving as Supervisor of the Court of Transmission?\\" Lady Hua mused."},{"paragraph":34,"mentions":1,"tokens":["袁夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「这首诗姐姐可记得不记得？」袁夫人道：「不记得，改日我抄一篇出来送给你。」于是各人饮了一杯酒，又吃了些菜。听后房那些婢女们好掷得高兴，说笑的说笑，罚酒的罚酒。苏小姐又掷了一个格子眼，笑道：「这个好无趣。」想了一会。","en":"\\"Does Elder Sister happen to remember the verses of this poem?\\" Miss Su asked eagerly. \\"I cannot recall it fully,\\" Mrs. Yuan admitted, \\"but on another day, I shall transcribe it carefully and send it to you.\\" They each drank another cup of wine and ate a little. From the back room, the lively commotion of the maids grew louder: a chorus of laughter, teasing jokes, and the"},{"paragraph":36,"mentions":1,"tokens":["袁夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"袁夫人道：「你还说这格子眼无趣，倒成了这个好令，实在自然得很。」这一人三转，也有好一会工夫了。华夫人道：「停一停再行罢，我们且吃些菜，不是这么空费心的。」且搁下外边，说后房那些美婢．也在那里行令。有说得好，有说得不好，也有自己说不出，要找人代说的。虽不敢十","en":"Mrs. Yuan smiled in admiration: \\"You claimed the 'Lattice-Work Eyes' pattern lacked inspiration, yet it has yielded you this delicate, beautiful entry. It is wonderfully natural and unaffected.\\" Having progressed through several rounds, a pleasant stretch of the"},{"paragraph":41,"mentions":1,"tokens":["袁夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"住了红雪的嘴。红雪急忙用手解开，大家笑得弯了腰。 　　明珠一笑，袖子带着酒杯，砸了一个。外面夫人们也听得明白，袁夫人笑道：「他们还比我们会乐。」这边红玉掷了一个八不就，便道：「这个名色也难，凑不成的换了罢。」宝珠道：「怎么凑不成，我替你凑，包你一凑就凑上，总不教你八不就。」红玉道：「你说顽话呢，还是正经话？你若刻薄我，我就撕你的嘴。」宝珠道：「我是不喜欢刻薄人的。","en":"wine cup entirely off the table. The raucous merriment drifted clearly to the ladies in the outer room, prompting Mrs. Yuan to laugh, \\"They are proving vastly more entertaining than we are.\\" Meanwhile, Hongyu threw the pattern 'Eight Refusals' and immediately groaned, \\"This pattern is far too difficult. It cannot be assembled; allow me to throw again.\\" Baozhu interjected,"},{"paragraph":44,"mentions":2,"tokens":["袁夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"掉了，头发也弄得蓬蓬的，便把手掠了一会，骂荷珠道：「顽得这般粗卤。说说罢了，就要认真。」这一会闹，闹得华夫人、袁夫人都按捺不住了，便叫家人媳妇进来查问，不许他们顽笑。群婢才息声静气的，赶紧的吃了一碗饭，都出来伺候。夫人们看这一班顽婢，有闹得花朵歪斜的，鬓发蓬松的，还有些背转脸去要笑的，还有些气忿忿以眉眼记恨的，不觉好笑，只得对着爱珠等说道：「你们这么大了，怎么还这","en":"no right to take it to such violent extremes.\\" The chaotic commotion had now reached a pitch that Lady Hua and Mrs. Yuan could no longer ignore. They dispatched a senior married maidservant to investigate and strictly forbid any further rough play. The cluster of maids fell instantly into a terrified silence, hurriedly composing themselves and finishing their bowls of"},{"paragraph":46,"mentions":3,"tokens":["袁夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"光景似将要说，红香扯扯他的袖子，叫他不要说。爱珠道：「他们说的也多，也记不清了。」苏小姐急于要听，便对华夫人、袁夫人道：「他们是惧怕主人不敢说，你们叫他说他就说了。」华夫人也知道这些婢女有些小聪明，都也说得几个好的出来，便对袁夫人微笑。袁夫人本是个风流跌宕的人，心上也要显显他的丫鬟的才学，便说道：「你们说的只要通，就说说也不妨。若说出来不通，便各人跪着罚一大杯酒。","en":"a great many verses, I cannot recall them all clearly.\\" Eager to hear the tale, Miss Su turned to Lady Hua and Mrs. Yuan: \\"They are terrified of their mistresses and dare not speak. But if you command them to recite, they surely will.\\" Knowing full well her maids possessed razor-sharp wits and had likely composed highly entertaining verses, Lady Hua exchanged an amused"},{"paragraph":47,"mentions":1,"tokens":["袁夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"替他们讨饶道：「二位姐姐，看我面上，恕他们初次。虽是风流口过，也亏他们心灵口敏。将他们这个功，抵消这个过罢。」袁夫人道：「二妹说了，我也不敢不依，但也须警戒警戒他们。不然说惯了，一发肆无忌惮的。」便与华夫人评定这六个令，太恶者罚一大觞酒，打手掌三板，以示薄责；其次者罚酒免责。于是红雪、红霙、荷珠、宝珠受了责罚；爱珠、红雯单罚了酒。群婢受罚起来好不羞愧，又喝了这些急","en":"grant them credit for their lightning-quick wits and nimble tongues. Let their poetic merit cancel their fault.\\" Mrs. Yuan sighed in concession, \\"Since Second Sister has spoken for them, I dare not refuse her request. Yet we must still admonish them; if we do not, they will grow accustomed to such license and become completely unbridled.\\" She and Lady Hua then passed judgment"},{"paragraph":48,"mentions":1,"tokens":["袁夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"袁夫人见天色不早，也要散席，便笑对华夫人道：「你再掷一个色样，好好的说几句收令，也可解秽。」便叫一面拿饭。华夫人见天色也是时候，不好过迟，便命上菜吃饭。即取过骰子，掷了一个金菊对芙蓉，心里暗喜，这个名色甚好，便细细的一想，成了一个，念道：金菊对芙蓉，盘花卷","en":"Noticing the shadows lengthening as the day grew late, Mrs. Yuan realized the banquet must draw to a close. She smiled and turned to Lady Hua: \\"Throw the dice one final time and weave a few well-turned phrases to conclude our game. Let it be something pure and beautiful to cleanse the air after all this foolishness.\\""},{"paragraph":49,"mentions":2,"tokens":["袁夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"袁夫人、苏小姐称赞不已。华夫人又劝他们二人喝了两杯酒，然后吃饭。洗漱已毕，袁夫人见夕阳欲下，不可迟延，便道谢告辞。华夫人、苏小姐带着十珠群婢送上了轿。六红扶着轿子，细行软步，一直到了穿堂外才上了车，流水般的走了。","en":"Mrs. Yuan and Miss Su praised the verse endlessly. Lady Hua warmly urged them both to drink two final cups, after which the rice was served and the magnificent meal gracefully concluded. Following the washing and rinsing of hands, Mrs. Yuan noted the evening sun"}],"12":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["袁夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说袁夫人自华府回来，到家已晚，换了衣服，卸了花钿，便与子云说起所行的令，并将婢女们的也说了，子云连声说好。","en":"After Mrs. Yuan returned from the Hua household that evening, she arrived home late, changed her clothes and removed her ornaments, and then told Ziyun all about the wine-game they had played, including the maids' entries. Ziyun praised it all enthusiastically."},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":1,"tokens":["袁夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"及至袁夫人知道，已经传遍，也无可如何了。","en":"By the time Mrs. Yuan found out, it had already spread everywhere, and there was nothing to be done about it."}],"52":[{"paragraph":22,"mentions":1,"tokens":["袁绮香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"明日，苏夫人请了他大姑奶奶浣香与徐子云夫人袁绮香去陪新，吃扶头卯酒。田太夫人请了王文辉的陆氏夫人，带了他大姑奶奶蓉华并媳妇孙少奶奶佩秋，又请刘守正的夫人，没有来，他媳妇吴少奶奶紫烟来了。周锡爵、杨方猷、陆宗沅的夫人都辞了。","en":"The next day, Lady Su invited her elder daughter Huanxiang and Xu Ziyun's wife, Yuan Qixiang, to accompany the bride and partake in the morning wine. Old Madam Tian invited Wang Wenhui's wife, Madam Lu, who brought along her elder daughter Ronghua and her daughter-in-law, Madam Sun Peiqiu. She also invited the wife of Liu Shouzheng, who could"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":1,"tokens":["袁绮香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"人，倒像在那里见过的一般，想不出来，惟觉眼中很熟，想去想来，原来有些像苏蕙芳，怪不得像见过的了。看徐子云的夫人袁绮香是冰肌玉骨，雍容大雅，真是林下风流，与子云恰是一对佳偶。刘少奶奶娟秀可爱，颜少奶奶秀丽超群，甚是洒落，王少奶奶静婉和妍，与刘少奶奶彷佛。","en":"realized they bore a resemblance to Su Huifang—no wonder they seemed familiar! She then observed Xu Ziyun's wife, Yuan Qixiang, noting her icy-fair skin, jade-like bones, and profoundly elegant demeanor; she possessed a truly transcendent charm, making her a perfect match for Ziyun. Liu's daughter-in-law was graceful and endearing; Yan's daughter-in-law was exceptionally beautiful"}],"54":[{"paragraph":7,"mentions":1,"tokens":["袁绮香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"道：「这是你近来瘦了些，终是有个外甥，自然累得慌了。我看苏氏姊妹，浣香华妍，像朵白牡丹。浣兰清艳，像是粉芍药。袁绮香像莲花，香能及远，觉有潇洒出尘之致。」","en":"eye Huanxiang, richly radiant, resembles a white peony; Huanlan, clear and lovely, a pink herbaceous peony; and Yuan Qixiang a lotus, whose fragrance carries afar and whose air is free and untainted by the dust of the world.\\""},{"paragraph":38,"mentions":1,"tokens":["袁绮香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"暗的解释，遂成就了良缘爱果，自然也不像那梦中措大的光景。若像那梦中光景，岂不要将个琼华小姐气死了么？明日也请了袁绮香、苏浣香、浣兰、吴紫烟、王蓉华、孙佩秋来陪新人，群仙高会，又叙了一日。华夫人因是父亲得意门生，又是年伯母来请他，所以欣然而来。至排场热闹，与田家一样，不能细述。以后子玉闺房之乐，真是乐不可言。一个仕女班头，一个才人魁首，或早起看花，或迟眠玩月，或分题","en":"ridiculous dream seduction scene. Had that dream become reality, Qionghua would have died of outrage. Next day Yuan Qixiang, Huanxiang, Huanlan, Ziyan, Ronghua, and Peiqiu came to accompany the bride—a gathering of near-immortals that lasted another full day. Lady Hua came gladly because Ziyu was her father's prized disciple and Lady Yan had invited her personally. The scale"}],"57":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":3,"tokens":["袁绮香","绮香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"且说徐子云的夫人袁绮香，生得婉娴柔静，贤淑无双，又且绣口锦心，才能咏絮。于十月初十日，请了华公子的夫人苏浣香、田春航的夫人浣兰、刘文泽的夫人吴紫烟、颜仲清的夫人王蓉华、梅子玉的夫人琼华、王恂的夫人孙佩秋。此时园中菊花开满，五色斑烂。是日晴光和蔼，风不扬尘，小毛衣服都用不着","en":"Xu Ziyun's wife, Yuan Qixiang, possessed a gentle, quiet grace and unparalleled virtue. With a heart of brocade and lips that embroidered verse, her talents rivaled Xie Daoyun's famous 'willow-fluff' poetry. On the tenth day of the tenth month, she invited Hua Gongzi's wife, Su Huanxiang;"},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":2,"tokens":["绮香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"到巳初一刻，刘文泽的夫人吴紫烟先到，车进了园门，即换肩舆，抬到宝香堂前下轿，珠围翠绕的，带了四个丫鬟。绮香迎接上堂，彼此见了礼。绮香笑道：「今日算你早，我是辰刻过来的。」紫烟道：「我今天卯正就起来，昨日姐姐说要辰正毕集的。已经到巳初了，谁知这些姐姐们还没有一个来。」","en":"Hall of Treasured Fragrance. Resplendent in pearls and kingfisher ornaments, she was accompanied by four maids. Qixiang welcomed her into the hall, and they exchanged warm courtesies. Qixiang smiled, saying, \\"You are early today. I have been here since the chen hour.\\" Ziyan replied, \\"I rose exactly at the mao hour. Yesterday, elder sister, you said we should all be gathered"},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":4,"tokens":["绮香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"绮香道：「也差不多了，大约浣香来得迟些，自然先到浣兰处同来的。」家人媳妇报导：「王大姑奶奶与少奶奶、梅家少奶奶齐来了。」说罢，轿子已齐到堂前。姑嫂三位下了轿，一群仆妇、丫鬟随在后头。绮香一一迎接，见琼华打扮，今日分外妖艳，比陪新那一日，更添了几分娇娆姽婳","en":"Qixiang said, \\"It is nearly time. Huanxiang will likely be the latest; she will naturally have gone to Huanlan's first so they could arrive together.\\" Just then, a serving-woman announced, \\"The elder and younger Wang ladies, along with the Mei family's young"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":1,"tokens":["袁绮香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"袁绮香接下台阶，苏氏姊妹笑盈盈的上前见礼，然后与佩秋、紫烟、蓉华、琼华都见了，各人挽着手，喜笑颜开，叙了一番。","en":"Yuan Qixiang stepped down to meet them on the stairs. The Su sisters stepped forward with radiant smiles and curtsied, then exchanged greetings with Peiqiu, Ziyan, Ronghua, and Qionghua. Each took another's arm, their faces bright with joy, and they conversed warmly"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":6,"tokens":["绮香","袁绮香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"苏氏姊妹见了琼华，分外亲爱，琼华见了浣香、浣兰，也十分亲热。这一班姊妹，大约同是瑶池会上人，都有夙契。绮香道：「今日我们众姊妹都是通家世好。苏家二浣，王氏双华，本是同胞，不用说了。我们一共七人，今日仿他竹林七贤，做个桃园结义，大家团拜一拜，以后遇着，就不许谦让。愚姐痴长，不识众位妹妹意下如何？」众佳人都应道：「甚妙。」浣香道：「妹子前日就有这心，今日正打","en":"well have all been immortals from the Jade Pool banquet, as each pair seemed linked by deep, preordained karma. Qixiang said, \\"Today, we sisters are all from families with generations of friendship. The two Huans of the Su clan and the two Huas of the Wangs are blood sisters, which goes without saying. There are seven of us in total. Today, let us emulate the Seven Sages"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":2,"tokens":["绮香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琼华对绮香道：「大姐姐，我们今日之来，非为哺啜，原为游园。若这一坐，天又短，只怕就逛不成了。列位姐姐心里怎样？」绮香笑道：「我不过借逛园之名，约妹妹们叙叙。若真要逛园，这五六里一片大地方，山石荦确，又难行走，况你那金莲三寸还不满，如何走得来？」浣兰道：「据我想","en":"Qionghua addressed Qixiang, saying, \\"Eldest sister, we came today not simply to feast, but to stroll through the garden. If we merely sit here, the day is short, and I fear we may not manage a walk at all. What do all of you sisters think?\\" Qixiang smiled warmly and replied, \\"I"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":2,"tokens":["绮香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"个船游他一转，望着那些景致，似乎比岸上还好些。」佩秋道：「说得是，又省力。若上山去，只怕也走乏了，还能游么？」绮香道：「既是这样，我们到吟秋榭顶上去，也望得个全景，就在那里坐罢。」于是一群粉黛，都出了宝香堂后院，到了风露清吟馆那边下了船。主人只有七个，那七家的丫鬟、仆妇共有四十余人，用了十几个小船，一齐荡到吟秋榭来。众佳人望着芙蓉如锦，空水澄鲜，岩岫如屏，寒林错","en":"\\"That makes sense, and it saves our strength. If we climbed, we would be exhausted before we even began our tour.\\" Qixiang concluded, \\"Since that is the case, let us go to the top of Autumn-Chant Waterside Pavilion. We can take in the entire prospect and simply sit there.\\" And so, the whole bevy of beauties left the rear courtyard of the Hall of Treasured Fragrance, boarded"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":3,"tokens":["绮香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"绮香命红雪、红云、红玉调丝品竹，小拍清歌。绮香道：「可惜我们酒量都是有限。我新年无事，与我们老爷编了一个酒令，行起来颇为热闹，不论多少人，都放得进去。」浣香笑道：「这么说来，竟不是个酒令，是个阵图了。」绮香道：「却也有阵图在内。」蓉华道：「你且说这个令是","en":"Qixiang ordered Hongxue, Hongyun, and Hongyu to tune the strings and pipes, accompanying light, clear songs with small clappers. Qixiang said, \\"It is a pity our limits with wine are so constrained. During the New Year, having some idle hours, I compiled a drinking"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":1,"tokens":["绮香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"绮香道：「要行这个令，只好如此。我这个令叫做「秦灭六国」，又叫做「六国伐秦」。今天好在七人，正合秦、楚、齐、赵、韩、魏、燕七国，有七根筹，掣谁是谁，六国并力伐这秦国。还有小筹数十根，是七国的人物，掣着那一国的，就归那一国。」","en":"Qixiang explained, \\"To run this game, we must do exactly that. The game is called 'Qin Destroys the Six States,' and also 'The Six States Attack Qin.' Today, the seven of us fit perfectly, representing the seven states of Qin, Chu, Qi, Zhao, Han, Wei, and Yan."},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":3,"tokens":["绮香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"绮香道：「我们且先点起将来，设有不合使唤的，便不中用。出去战败了，倒累主人罚酒。」就先点自己的丫鬟，点了红香、红玉、红雪、红雯、红薇、红莲、红霙、红娟，其余那四个不能饮酒。浣香的十珠都可使唤，全点了。浣兰的四个丫鬟，只点了一个小翠，才十三岁，生得很好，且","en":"Qixiang continued, \\"First, we must select those who can actually drink. Anyone unsuited for it will be useless. If you are routed in battle, you will only burden your mistress with penalty wine.\\" She began by choosing from her own maids, picking Hongxiang, Hongyu,"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":2,"tokens":["绮香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"浣兰道：「我把田单的火车驱过来，看你有什么御敌的妙计。」紫烟道：「就是我国没有勇将，若能掣着了项重瞳就好了。」绮香道：「且慢高兴，我秦国是兵强将勇，没有一个弱兵。待我且先派定了人数再说。他们共二十四人，我用六个，你们一家用三个。」即叫浣香的爱珠、花珠过来，道：「你两人到我大国来立些功业，不要在你那个小国埋没。」爱珠、花珠笑了，站了过来。绮香自己点了爱珠、花珠、红","en":"Ziyan said, \\"Even if my state lacks a champion, drawing the double-pupiled Xiang Yu would be more than enough.\\" Qixiang responded, \\"Do not celebrate just yet. My Qin fields strong generals; there is not a single weak soldier among them. Let me balance the numbers first. We have twenty-four servants. I will use six, and each of you will use three.\\" She then called out"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":3,"tokens":["绮香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"分派定了，绮香叫拿七个小筹来，先掣秦国的。爱珠掣了是白起，花珠掣的是商君，红香掣的是韩非子，红玉掣的是吕不韦，红雪掣的是李斯，红霙掣的是赵高。绮香笑道：「如何，你看我们文武皆全。」收过了筒，取紫烟楚国的筹来，侍香掣的是令尹子兰，红薇掣的是高唐神女，赠珠掣的是宋玉。","en":"With the assignments set, Qixiang called for the seven small lot-tubes and drew for Qin first. Aizhu drew Bai Qi; Huazhu drew Lord Shang; Hongxiang drew Han Feizi; Hongyu drew Lü Buwei; Hongxue drew Li Si; and Hongying drew Zhao Gao. Qixiang laughed triumphantly, \\"You see? Both civil"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":2,"tokens":["绮香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"掣了孟尝君，稍可解嘲。再掣琼华的韩国，蕊珠掣了张子房，青琴掣了博浪椎，珍珠掣了圯上老人。琼华笑道：「我早说的，绮香姐姐你仔细博浪椎、荆轲匕首，好不利害。就是高唐神女、醇酒妇人教你受用罢。」红薇道：「奶奶且慢喜欢，只怕奶奶手下也有个笑话出来呢！」绮香道：「不用讲，拿出谱来。」大家看时，见写道：","en":"Qingqin drew the Bolang hammer, and Zhenzhu drew the old man at the bridge. Qionghua laughed, \\"I warned you, Sister Qixiang! You had best mind the Bolang hammer and Jing Ke's dagger. Let the Gaotang Goddess and the wine-woman deal with you instead.\\" Hongwei cautioned, \\"Madam, do not rejoice too soon. Your own side might have a joke coming as well!\\" Qixiang said, \\"There is"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":2,"tokens":["绮香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"人看了，笑道：「今日这个笑话，必定闹得不少。不知谁国谁人先出？且把他们这些谱看看是怎样的，可有些丑态在里头？」绮香道：「都有些，且不要看。若看了，必惹得他们这个喜欢，那个发气，莫如定了人再看。」于是折了枝菊花来，命小丫鬟点鼓，到了蓉花，鼓已住了。蓉华笑道：「我这三员勇将正好出这个头阵，试试手段。」秋莲、画珠，红雯三个就上来，旁边又摆了一桌酒肴。秋莲把两个骰子一掷","en":"thickly today! Who will go first? Let us examine the rule sheets. Will there be any truly ridiculous moments?\\" Qixiang advised, \\"There certainly will be, but it is better not to read ahead. Reading the rules now will only make some gleeful and others cross. It is better to establish the players first.\\" And so, they broke off a chrysanthemum branch and had a young maid"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":2,"tokens":["绮香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"便除下胡子，指着花珠道：「我看你的笑话。」骰子掷了，是画珠，画珠是蔺相如。蓉花道：「廉颇无用，要看这相如了。」绮香看蔺相如的谱：「如败了，三杯俱系赵王代饮。」蓉华笑道：「画姑娘你须仔细些，不要丧师辱国，反累我喝酒。」画珠道：「奶奶放心，看我赢他。」无奈行的是猜枚令，画珠藏了三个瓜子，三次都被花珠猜着，画珠好不惭愧，只得说道：「这酒我自喝罢。」绮香道：「那不能，你","en":"dice fell to Yazhu, representing Lin Xiangru. Ronghua said, \\"Lian Po has failed us; now it is time for Xiangru.\\" Qixiang read Lin Xiangru's entry: \\"If defeated, all three penalty cups must be drunk by the King of Zhao in his stead.\\" Ronghua laughed nervously, \\"Miss Yazhu, please be careful! Do not disgrace the army and force me to drink.\\" Yazhu reassured her, \\"Rest easy,"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":1,"tokens":["绮香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"小，见了这个令，先害怕起来。两手框了一条线，那十个指头就不住的发颤，惹得众佳人又笑，他自己也笑起来，越笑越颤。绮香道：「看来这个鸡爪风更不济事，蓉妹不如带了他们来跪献三杯罢。」蓉华笑道：「尚可背城一战。」两人将线交了一回，红雯也赢了一次，只打了两下手，喝了两小杯，余请旁人代了。","en":"sight made the beauties laugh, and she herself began to laugh. The harder she laughed, the worse her hands shook. Qixiang said, \\"This 'claw-wind' affliction will simply not do. Rongmei, perhaps you should just kneel with your troops and offer the three cups of surrender.\\" Ronghua laughed stubbornly, \\"We can still fight with our backs to the wall!\\" They crossed the string"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":5,"tokens":["绮香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"绮香笑向蓉华道：「你三将出马，败了八阵，虽不算全军覆没，也不过一息尚存。你看谱上：「如九阵中只胜一阵者，虽免跪献之辱，也须领队前来纳降。」蓉华笑道：「这也不难。」便斟了一杯酒，走到绮香面前福了一福，绮香也还了一礼，笑而受之。那画珠、秋莲、红雯，只得也向花","en":"Qixiang smiled at Ronghua and said, \\"Your three generals have taken the field and lost eight rounds. While it is not quite a total rout, you are certainly on your last gasp. Look at the rule book: 'If, out of nine rounds, you win only one, you escape the humiliation"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":3,"tokens":["绮香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"绮香点了一出《刘唐》，是单，是净脚戏，看各人手中个个皆有。绮香笑道：「生、旦不应到，各罚一杯。」绮香又点了一出《闹庄》，也是净脚戏，生、旦俱不应到，红薇又到了，又罚一杯。红薇不服，说道：「这出戏也要让我们国王点了。」紫烟道：「不错，我们上了他的当了。」紫","en":"Qixiang named *Liu Tang*, a solo performance for a painted-face character. Every outstretched hand held a nut. She laughed, \\"The sheng and dan should not appear in this scene. Each of you must drink one cup.\\" She then named *Naozhuang*, another painted-face"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":5,"tokens":["绮香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"浣香，数宝珠出马。浣香笑道：「这是我们的福将，四公子中的魁首，看你们什么人来抵敌罢。」那边数到了红雪，是李斯。绮香道：「好个对手。」看谱：「信陵君是运筹点将令。」就拿上一筒酒筹来，宝珠掣了一枝看时，是「蜡照半笼金翡翠。」注：「席中戴金条脱、玉钏者饮一杯。」绮香道：「这一句只怕都要喝一杯。」七位佳人都喝了，独浣兰不喝。绮香问他，浣兰道：「这杯没有我的酒。」绮香不信","en":"the Four Lords. Let us see who dares to meet him.\\" On Qin's side, the lot fell to Hongxue, representing Li Si. Qixiang said, \\"A worthy foe indeed.\\" The rule book stated: \\"Lord Xinling utilizes the 'plan and deploy' rule.\\" They brought out a tube filled with poetic wine lines. Baozhu drew a slip: \\"Candlelight half-holds kingfisher gold.\\" The annotation read: \\"Whoever"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":2,"tokens":["绮香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"绮香道：「宝丫头了不得，真是个勇将。」红雪又掣了一枝是：「暗中惟觉睡鞋香。」说道：「这句倒难。」绮香道：「你一个个闻去，是谁的香，就叫他喝酒。」红雪笑道：「若要闻，那就…」便笑了不说。又说道：「我知道了，我来敬个人。」","en":"Qixiang praised her, \\"Miss Bao is formidable indeed, a true champion.\\" Hongxue then drew a slip: \\"In the dark, only the scent of sleeping shoes.\\" She frowned, \\"This line is too difficult.\\" Qixiang instructed, \\"Sniff each one in turn. Whoever's scent matches"},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":1,"tokens":["绮香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"笑道：「《书经》上「惟三月哉生魄，哉生明。」哉字可作起句，怎么说没有哉字起句呢？」众佳人笑道：「这却说得是。」绮香笑道：「这唾沫可以免了。」后又换字顶了几句。红雪输了一杯。","en":"can certainly open a sentence. How can you say no line begins with it?\\" The beauties agreed, \\"That holds true.\\" Qixiang laughed, \\"The spit-wine penalty is remitted.\\" They exchanged a few more linked lines, and Hongxue ultimately lost one cup."},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":2,"tokens":["绮香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"出令。掌珠掷了么二三，红雪掷了四五六。掌珠跪在浣香面前求救出令，把个华夫人笑得不止，便道：「出什么令呢？」便对绮香道：「我有一个集词牌成韵的，两句三字，一句七字，要凑拍。」便念道：「宴清都，清平乐，八声甘州金缕曲。姐姐也照样说一个。」绮香道：「这个倒难，词牌我也不甚熟，比不得你是长填词的，这倒被你难倒了。我喝一杯罢。」","en":"Huanxiang, begging for a command, and Madam Hua could not stop laughing. \\"What command?\\" she asked, turning to Qixiang. \\"I have a rhyme made of lyric titles: two three-character lines and one seven-character line, tightly fitted.\\" She recited, \\"*Feast in the Celestial Capital*, *Music of Peace*, *Basheng Ganzhou*, *Jinlü Qu*. Sister, see if you can match it.\\" Qixiang"},{"paragraph":30,"mentions":4,"tokens":["绮香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"浣香道：「姐姐不要谦，请说来。」绮香想了一想，也念道：「高阳台，尉迟杯，貂裘换酒醉蓬莱。」浣香道：「拜服，拜服，姐姐说得这样凑拍，还说不熟呢！」那五位佳人都赞道：「两人都说得好，我们公贺一杯，为两盟主寿。再请多说几个，大家听听。」浣香道：「就是七个字的难凑些，只怕也没有多少呢。」又念道","en":"Huanxiang urged, \\"Sister, do not be modest. Go on.\\" Qixiang thought for a moment and recited, \\"*Gaoyang Terrace*, *Yuchi Cup*, *Sable Coat Exchanged for Wine*, *Drunk in Penglai*.\\" Huanxiang was impressed, \\"I bow to you! I bow! You fitted it so neatly and still claim unfamiliarity!\\" The other five raised their"},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":1,"tokens":["绮香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"皆仿此。所贺之酒，数多则通场分喝。蓉华道：「这个酒了不得，若照贺例喝酒，譬如要一百贺的，难道也贺一百杯不成？」绮香道：「一百杯也不多，我们现在有三十余人，一家不过分得三杯酒，怕什么？」","en":"by the congratulation schedule—say a pattern worth a hundred toasts—surely we are not to drink a hundred cups?\\" Qixiang said, \\"A hundred cups is not so many. There are more than thirty of us here now; each would get no more than three cups apiece. What is there to fear?\\""},{"paragraph":33,"mentions":2,"tokens":["绮香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"了。红娟出了一个食指，一个小指，红玉偏偏出了一个小指，刚刚凑成一百两极，是个双尾蝎。浣香道：「这个就六十贺。」绮香道：「这倒好，叫通场伺候的都喝一杯。」红玉两手齐出，是一个食指，两个小指，红娟出了一个小指，是一百三极，凑成了玉鲫鱼背，又是一百贺。佩秋道：「这酒实在消得多，不论多少总通场一杯罢。」于是又通贺了一杯。红娟出了两个大指，一个食指，红玉出了一个大指，又凑","en":"made exactly 'a hundred with two extremes'—the Double-Tailed Scorpion. Huanxiang said, \\"That is sixty toasts.\\" Qixiang said, \\"Excellent—let every attendant in the hall drink a cup as well.\\" Hongyu threw with both hands—one forefinger and two little fingers—and Hongjuan put out a little finger: 'a hundred with three extremes,' completing the Jade Carp's Back, worth another"},{"paragraph":35,"mentions":2,"tokens":["绮香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"斗帐樱桃熟。」荷珠道：「你不要的呢？」红霙道：「我不要的是：春入眉心两点愁。」众佳人都赞道：「说得好。」浣香对绮香道：「姐姐，足见你强将手下无弱兵。你的婢女都是这样绣口锦心，真令人羡慕之至。」绮香道：「他们虽然记得几句诗，然那里及得尊婢们般般皆会。」荷珠听他主人称赞红霙，心中有些不服，便说道：「这四句却说得好，但忘了你是赵高，一个老公，也配用这些东西？」","en":"'Spring entering the brow with two points of sorrow.'\\" The beauties all cried, \\"Well said!\\" Huanxiang said to Qixiang, \\"Sister, it is plain that under a strong general there are no weak soldiers. That your very maids should have such embroidered mouths and brocade hearts—it makes one envious beyond measure.\\" Qixiang said, \\"They may remember a few lines of verse, but"},{"paragraph":36,"mentions":1,"tokens":["绮香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"不胜羞。。你要的是：鸳鸯帐下香犹暖。你不要的是：嫁个萧郎爱远游。」浣香听了，笑骂荷珠道：「荷儿怎么这般轻薄？」绮香正笑着，尚未开口，红霙气极要打起荷珠来，荷珠再四的赔礼，群珠又与他央求，红霙方才饶他。众佳人笑道：「荷姑娘这几句太刻薄，幸遇着人多，不然是挨定□姑娘的打。」到了小翠的鸡鸣来了，小翠上来就有些发怯。看谱是接牌令。","en":"young Xiao who loves to roam afar.'\\" At this Huanxiang laughingly scolded Hezhu: \\"He'er, how can you be so saucy?\\" Qixiang was still laughing and had not yet spoken when Hongying, in a fury, made to strike Hezhu; Hezhu apologized over and over, the other maids pleaded for her, and only then did Hongying let her off. The beauties laughed, \\"Miss Hezhu's lines were far too"},{"paragraph":37,"mentions":2,"tokens":["绮香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"么头对么，二头接二，接死了罚酒。小翠暗喜。两人就在地下接起来，小翠接死了三次，便发急起来，不知道要怎样奈何他。绮香道：「今番有好令来了。」把谱一翻是：「鸡鸣出关三杯酒，都要装着鸡啼，从板凳下钻过去钻过来三次。」众佳人掩口胡卢。小翠听了这个，倒投其所好，毫不为难，便咮咮□□的学起鸡叫来，学了几声，即从凳下钻了三次，惹得众人大笑。浣兰道：「姐姐你好心，故意点他来作笑","en":"floor, and Xiaocui was blocked three times running. She began to fret, not knowing what would be done with her. Qixiang said, \\"Now comes a fine rule,\\" and turned up the book: for the cock-crow to pass the barrier—three cups; the player must imitate a rooster's cry and crawl under the bench, through and back, three times. The beauties hid their laughter behind their hands."},{"paragraph":39,"mentions":1,"tokens":["绮香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"绮香笑对浣兰道：「妹妹你手下那些鸡鸣狗盗怎么好？又要作出好模样来了。」浣兰气忿忿的道：「罢了！罢了！今日教姐姐的威风施尽，我只好慢慢的报仇。将来掣着了西楚霸王，巨鹿一战，才消得这口气呢。」众佳人笑道：「还有一个韩国在那里，兵书尚未出来，只好盼他打胜仗了。","en":"Qixiang said to Huanlan with a laugh, \\"Sister, what is to be done with those cock-crowers and dog-thieves of yours? They will be making a fine show of themselves again.\\" Huanlan said indignantly, \\"Enough, enough. Today my elder sister has had her pride out to"},{"paragraph":40,"mentions":2,"tokens":["绮香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"三姐道：「这回姐妹们可饶了我罢。」二珠、四红如何肯依？浣兰笑对绮香道：「你这个无道强秦，到底要怎样？五国已给你吞食尽了，还要纵容这些豺狼虎豹去吃人。」绮香笑得伏桌难应。三姐被他们围住。毫不容情，心生一计，想道：「这些骚货实在可恶，我今也顾不得作笑话，也叫他们作些笑话出来。」","en":"pleaded, \\"Sisters, spare me this round.\\" But the two Pearls and four Reds would not yield. Huanlan laughed at Qixiang, \\"Your lawless Qin—what more do you want? You've swallowed five whole states and still set wolves on people.\\" Qixiang laughed so hard she bent over the table, entirely unable to answer. Sanjie, pinned mercilessly, hatched a desperate plan. \\"These minxes"},{"paragraph":42,"mentions":1,"tokens":["绮香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"快，不然叫你一窝子六个滚在一堆。」那六个人我一句，你一句，把三姐骂了好一会，众佳人方才笑完，紫烟一人尚有余笑。绮香对浣兰道：「妹妹，你这个三姐真好，我拿个丫鬟与你换了罢。」浣兰道：「姐姐要他作什么，他是只会装狗的。。」紫烟笑道：「姐姐你招集这些亡命作甚，你真作秦始皇么？」大家又笑起来。","en":"Sanjie roundly before the beauties finally stopped laughing—though Ziyan still had a few giggles left in her. Qixiang said to Huanlan, \\"Sister, your Sanjie is wonderful. I would trade you a maid for her.\\" Huanlan replied, \\"What would you do with her? She only plays the dog.\\" Ziyan laughed, \\"Sister, why recruit these desperadoes? Are you playing the First Emperor of"},{"paragraph":48,"mentions":1,"tokens":["绮香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"打得的。」佩秋道：「你若像了秋莲的廉颇，就不好了。」紫烟道：「也不要像我们荆轲的匕首。」你一句，我一句的说笑。绮香笑道：「谅此孤军深入重地，焉有生还之理？」便命六人一齐上前，与青琴对敌。","en":"warned, \\"Do not be Qiulian's Lian Po.\\" Ziyan chimed in, \\"Nor our Jing Ke's dagger.\\" Banter flew across the room. Qixiang laughed heartily, \\"This lone army, deep in enemy land—can it possibly return alive?\\" She confidently ordered six of her maids forward at once against Qingqin."},{"paragraph":49,"mentions":2,"tokens":["绮香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"雷、劈雷，将二珠、四红打得个个心惊胆怯，琼华好不得意，只管点头微笑，说道：「一将功成万骨枯。」众佳人齐声称贺。绮香笑道：「这还了得？你是个顶小的小妹妹，公然欺侮大姐姐来，这般可恶。你敢与我对敌么？」那五个佳人同声说道：「这有什么不敢？如果七妹胆怯，我们一齐相帮。」琼华笑道：「妹子愿避三舍，如必不获命，也只可秣马厉兵，与姐姐周旋。」绮香笑道：「众志成城，坚不可破，","en":"Qionghua glowed, nodding and smiling, \\"One general's merit; ten thousand bones dry.\\" The beauties cheered wildly. Qixiang laughed, \\"How dare you! The youngest little sister bullying the eldest sister—it is outrageous! Will you face me?\\" The five cried out, \\"Why not? If seventh sister flinches, we will all help!\\" Qionghua smiled gracefully, \\"I would willingly yield three"},{"paragraph":50,"mentions":1,"tokens":["绮香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"浣香见天色已晚，便要进城，浣兰要留他，浣香不肯，定要回去。绮香见太阳已落，也不好挽留，只得先送了浣香，便说道：「你们是不要紧，又不赶城，到三更再散不迟。」十珠婢收拾零星，大家都下船渡过了河，直送到山下，上了轿出园。","en":"seeing the approaching dusk, wished to return to the city. Huanlan urged her to stay, but she gently refused. Qixiang saw that the sun had set and could not insist. She saw Huanxiang off first, then said to the others, \\"The rest of you need not rush to the gate. Stay until the third watch if you like.\\" The Ten Pearls tidied up; they all boated across the river, walked"},{"paragraph":51,"mentions":2,"tokens":["绮香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"群婢也都来了，煮茗清谈了一会，已点上灯。紫烟要打马吊，便拉了蓉华、佩秋二人打起马吊来。琼华看见有一匣诗牌，便与绮香、浣兰三人在一桌打了一副，足足打到二更后，琼华方成了一首七律，绮香差了一韵斗不成。浣兰牌起得不好，尚差了十数字，琼华将牌摊出，那边蓉华等也过来看时，只见斗的是：","en":"ma-diao and pulled Ronghua and Peiqiu into a game. Qionghua spotted a box of poetry cards and played a hand with Qixiang and Huanlan until past the second watch. Qionghua completed one beautifully regulated octet; Qixiang missed one rhyme and could not finish; Huanlan's draw was poor and was still ten characters short. Qionghua proudly spread her cards on the table, and"},{"paragraph":52,"mentions":4,"tokens":["绮香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"相妒，照彻楼台分外鲜。\\n那五位佳人同声赞道：「这首诗倒像做成的，那里像斗出来的？真是字字稳当，且切今日之事。」绮香又笑道：「我最爱是：「任说朝朝依玉树，终应步步让金莲」这一联，为我辈闺阁吐气。不然，这个园几成了那几个名旦的梨园了。」蓉华道：「姐姐，那几个名旦你见过没有？闻得二哥天天带他们在园里。」绮香道：「若说这几个名旦，倒也生得很好，我也只见过五六个，到年节下","en":"composed—how could it possibly be 'drawn' from random cards? Every word sits firmly, and it perfectly fits today.\\" Qixiang laughed, \\"I love most the couplet\\n\\n'Though morning after morning men lean on jade trees,\\nStep after step must yield to golden lotus feet'\\n\\n—it truly vents our women's breath. Otherwise, this garden might have become nothing but an opera yard for those"},{"paragraph":53,"mentions":1,"tokens":["绮香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"留余艳，拾翠寻芳趁此时。\\n到了园门，各自上车，在车里又各相辞谢了几句，方才坐了绣□，碾动双轮，群婢各登车随后，绮香也与十二红各上车而回。不知后事如何，且听下回分解。","en":"and settled into their embroidered carriages as the wheels turned. The maids mounted carriages behind them, and Qixiang, accompanied by the twelve Reds, rode safely home. What followed—hear the next chapter."}]}`),"char-42":JSON.parse(`{"5":[{"paragraph":30,"mentions":1,"tokens":["林珊枝"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"来，上席、中席、下席，各色赏耗共一千多吊，不但没有讨好，他倒说我俗恶不堪，以后我就再不敢请他的了。他有一个亲随林珊枝，真花八千两银子买的。」聘才听了，点头微笑，说道：「这个阔公子，与他拉交情，是不容易的。」富三道：「难，难，除非真有本领，教他佩服了，不然，就是巴结到二十四分，这个人是最喜奉承的。」说到此，便已摆上饭来，一壶酒，四碟菜，一只火锅。富三道：「今日却是便","en":"declaring me vulgar and intolerable. Since then I have never dared invite him again. He has a personal attendant named Lin Shanzhi who genuinely cost eight thousand taels of silver.\\" Pincai nodded with a slight smile and said: \\"Befriending this wealthy nobleman would indeed be no easy matter.\\" Fu the Third said: \\"Difficult indeed, unless one possesses true abilities that earn his"}],"16":[{"paragraph":10,"mentions":1,"tokens":["林珊枝"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"了，说道：「我这里到不拘人多人少，只要人好，是你的好朋友。自然不用讲了。说请你去讲一声，请他来就是了。」即吩咐林珊枝传谕总办，将魏师爷修金钦馔说定，富三连连答应几个「是」！又进去见了华夫人，就辞了，一径出城，通知了魏聘才，请其明日就去。","en":"close friend, there is nothing to discuss. Tell him he is invited and ask him to come.\\" He immediately instructed Lin Shanzhi to inform the chief steward that Master Wei's stipend and board were arranged. Fu the Third agreed repeatedly, paid his respects to Madam Hua, and then hurried out of the city to inform Wei Pincai, urging him to arrive the next day."}],"18":[{"paragraph":11,"mentions":1,"tokens":["林珊枝"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"我知道他府里有个林珊枝，是他的亲随。」说到此便竖起大拇指来道：「是个这一分儿的，言听计从，寸步不离，你先要打通这个关节，这关节通了就容易了。还有那个八龄班，也是不离左右的，小孩子们有甚识见，给点小便宜就得了。慢慢儿一言半语吹进他耳朵里去，今日听见说魏师爷好，明日又听见说魏","en":"\\"I know there is someone in his household called Lin Shanzhi, his personal attendant.\\" He put up a thumb as he spoke: \\"He is a person of this caliber. His word is followed, his plan is adopted, and he never leaves the young master's side. You must first work through this connection; once that gate is opened, everything"}],"19":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":4,"tokens":["林珊枝","珊枝"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说魏聘才自得仲雨传授，依法行之，先于林珊枝面前献尽殷懃，又于八龄班赔尽辛苦。珊枝本系联锦部有名小旦，继进登春班，华公子看中了他，遂以重价买进。后来之八龄班皆系珊枝所教。这林珊枝不消说是音律精通了。魏聘才本是个伶俐人，昆曲唱得绝好，就是吹弹也应酬的上来。更兼旧年一路同着班子来，船中又听会了许多","en":"Following Zhongyu's instructions, Pincai put them into practice: he first lavished every effort on winning Lin Shanzhi's favor, and then painstakingly cultivated the goodwill of the Eight Ages. Shanzhi had originally been a celebrated young dan actor in the Lianjin troupe; he later joined the Dengchun troupe, and Young Master Hua, having taken a liking to him, purchased"},{"paragraph":2,"mentions":3,"tokens":["林珊枝","珊枝"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一日，林珊枝教玉龄唱曲，适值聘才闲闯进来，珊枝就请他坐了，一面教着。刚刚这曲子是聘才最得意的，便在旁帮起腔来，五音不乱，唇齿分明，竟唱得出神入妙，把个林珊枝倒惊倒了。即由此相好，就在华公子面前，朝朝暮暮，称赞聘才。","en":"One day, Lin Shanzhi was teaching Yuling to sing an aria when Pincai happened to wander in. Shanzhi invited him to sit while he continued the lesson. As it happened, this aria was one of Pincai's favorites, so he began to sing along from the sidelines; his pitch was flawless"},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":1,"tokens":["珊枝"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"华公子是最信珊枝的，他又不轻易赞人，他肯赞好，必是真好了，心上就有了这个人。那八龄班内的都是些苏、扬人，脾气自然相合。聘才会讨好，今日送这个一把扇子，明日送那个一个荷囊，总是称心称意，小孩子喜欢的东西，觉得这位师爷实在知趣。至于管总的、办事的，尤巴结得周到，不到一月","en":"Young Master Hua placed the most trust in Shanzhi; since Shanzhi did not praise people lightly, if he was willing to praise someone, they must truly be excellent. Thus, Pincai gained a firm place in the young master's heart. The members of the Eight-Ages Troupe were all from Suzhou and Yangzhou, so"}],"21":[{"paragraph":3,"mentions":1,"tokens":["林珊枝"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"几日没人来，便觉气闷，聘才来了，也稍可排解。问那华公府内光景，聘才即把华公子称赞得上天下地选不出来，又夸其亲随林珊枝及八龄班怎样的好，就说琴言也不能及他。","en":"the Hua mansion, Pincai praised Young Master Hua as unequalled under heaven, boasted how fine were his attendant Lin Shanzhi and the Eight Ages troupe — and said even Qinyan could not match them."}],"25":[{"paragraph":13,"mentions":1,"tokens":["林珊枝"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，又将各人的戏也都点了。送到文泽面前，文泽、仲雨、次贤，大家公商点了几出。开了场，加官出来，献上世受国恩」，那林珊枝就走上来，拿出一个赏封望台上一抛，文泽等亦各赏了。","en":"\\"Conferring of Blessings\\" figure appeared, presenting the inscription \\"Generations Blessed by Imperial Grace.\\" Lin Shanzhi then stepped forward, took out a reward packet, and tossed it toward the stage. Wenze and the others likewise presented their rewards."},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":1,"tokens":["珊枝"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"路送迎祖饯，昂藏慷慨，跌宕多姿，把个李谪仙魂魄都做出来。及到唱完，已有一个时辰。华公子赞了几声，吩咐了一句话，珊枝出去了一回，就有十六个人，抬上八张桌子，赏了八十吊钱。主人照样发赏，文泽也赏了八桌，仲雨、次贤各赏了四桌。","en":"done, a full two hours had passed. Young Master Hua uttered several words of praise and gave one brief order; Shanzhi went out for a moment, and then sixteen men came in bearing eight tables, and eighty strings of cash were bestowed as reward. The host distributed his rewards in the same fashion; Wenze too rewarded eight tables, while Zhongyu and Cixian rewarded four"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":5,"tokens":["珊枝"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"两璧，恐一尺之缣，难比七襄之锦。」华公子道：「岂敢！岂敢！仁兄谦的太过，理应罚酒。」即敬了子云一杯。华公子就叫珊枝，命八龄班上来。这八龄班，是每逢赴席总跟出来的，并带了自己行头。珊枝带上来，对子云叩头。子云忙命家童搀起，连声赞「好」，旁人也随声附和。华公子道：「仙娥之外，原有魔女，如不厌丑陋，也叫他们唱一出，以博一笑何如？」大家说道：「甚好，若得如此，真是珠联璧","en":"humble — a penalty toast is in order!\\" And he at once toasted Ziyun with a cup. Then Young Master Hua called for Shanzhi and ordered the Eight Ages troupe to come up. This the Eight Ages troupe was one he brought along whenever he attended a banquet, complete with their own costumes and stage properties. Shanzhi led them up, and they kowtowed to Ziyun. Ziyun hastily ordered"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":1,"tokens":["珊枝"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"众人看是辉煌闪烁的一盘金锞子，有方胜的，有如意的，有梅花的，有菱角的，一两多重一个，约有百十个，分赏十旦。珊枝分毕，十旦叩谢了，子云亦忙道了谢。","en":"water-chestnut tips — each above one tael, perhaps a hundred pieces — portioned among the ten performers. After Shanzhi handed them out the ten kowtowed thanks; Ziyun hastened thanks as well."},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":2,"tokens":["林珊枝","珊枝"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"便叫林珊枝取他自己之大玉斗来。珊枝看天色不早，知道公子的脾气，闹开了就不论昼夜的，口虽只管答应，呆呆的不动，目视子云。子云会意，也自知酒量不敌，便说道：「实在贱量不能多饮，愿将门杯以当大斗罢。」华公子犹不肯依，经次贤、文泽、仲雨都来解劝，说：「非特度香不能，就","en":"He ordered Lin Shanzhi to bring his own great jade wine-cup. Shanzhi saw the hour late and knew his master's temper — once roused he would go day or night — though he answered aloud he stood frozen, eyes on Ziyun. Ziyun took the hint; knowing his drinking could not match,"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":5,"tokens":["林珊枝","珊枝"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"此时人人畅快，只有那林珊枝，见公子如此眷恋，心上不免动气，脸上却不敢露出。又看天色不早，表上将近酉正，若再闹下去便进不得城的，但又不敢上前催他，只得出去，先叫人去留了城门，重走上来，站在公子背后。只管看着子云，众人亦皆明白，皆因不好催促。适值华公子出外小解，珊枝便对子云请了一","en":"All sat transported — only Lin Shanzhi, watching his master's infatuation, seethed inwardly yet dared not show it. The hour pressed toward you — linger longer and the city gates would shut — yet he could not urge aloud — slipped out and told retainers to hold the gate open, then returned"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":1,"tokens":["珊枝"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"两难，又见他跟来的人，都整整齐齐站在阶下，心上要走不走的；又看宝珠、琴言将要唱完，便对子云道：「我还进城罢。」珊枝听了接口道：「将要关城了，公子既要进城，就要快些赶呢。」华公子听了没奈何，只得起身穿戴衣冠，谢了子云，又辞了众人。","en":"wished to leave; Baozhu and Qinyan were finishing their song — he said to Ziyun: \\"I had better return to the city.\\" Shanzhi cut in: \\"Gates will shut — if you go, hurry.\\" Young Master Hua had no choice — rose, dressed formal wear, thanked Ziyun and took leave of the company."},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":2,"tokens":["林珊枝","珊枝"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，以及蕙芳、素兰等八人说：「你们没有事可常来走走。」说着话，已到了含万楼，复又一揖，辞了子云及众人，上了椅轿，林珊枝、八龄之外，尚有十六个亲随，五个有职人员，扶了轿轩，软步如飞，过岭穿林而去。这十旦直送出园门，又请安送了。华公子下了轿，仍坐上绿围车，尚对那些名旦点头嘱咐。侍从人都上了马，车夫恐怕关城，加上一鞭，那车便似飞的一样去了，幸珊枝早留了城，不然竟赶不上了。","en":"visit often.\\" At the Tower of Myriad Containment he bowed once more to Ziyun and guests, boarded his sedan chair — Shanzhi and Eight Ages aside, sixteen personal attendants and five titled servants shouldered the poles and flew over hill and grove. The ten performers saw them to the garden gate and bowed farewell. Young Master Hua shifted to his green-canopied carriage and"},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":2,"tokens":["林珊枝"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"泽道：「今日星北可谓尽兴，我见他从没这样留恋的。」子云道：「他心上犹以为未足，我若认真留他，他就不去了。他那个林珊枝急得什么似的，尽对我做眼色，只怕还有些醋意。」仲雨道：「何消说得。林珊枝不是登春班出身吗，进去了不到三年，如今华公子的事，可以作得一半主呢。」子云命家人取些醒酒丸来，用开水化了，分给众人，吃毕散步一回，酒已消尽。子云命将桌子摆在廊前，上面只点四盏素玻","en":"heart he still thought it not enough. Had I pressed him in earnest to stay, he would not have gone at all. That Lin Shanzhi of his was frantic past describing, forever making eyes at me — I suspect there was a touch of jealousy in it too.\\" Zhongyu said: \\"That goes without saying. Was not Lin Shanzhi bred up in the Dengchun troupe? Not three years in the household, and already"}],"26":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":5,"tokens":["林珊枝","珊枝"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"又见爱珠提了一盏绛纱灯走出来道：「差不多要定更了，此刻还要传林珊枝进来呢！」宝珠问道：「叫林珊枝做什么？」爱珠道：「我知道什么事？自然是有要紧事了。」爱珠穿了木底小弓鞋，走快了，觉得咭咭咯咯的响。走到角门口，找着了管事的老婆子说了。老婆子又找了内管门，才到外间跟班房来，找着了林珊枝，便说：「爷叫你呢。」林珊枝正在院","en":"carrying a crimson gauze lantern and said, \\"It is almost the first watch, yet we are still supposed to summon Lin Shanzhi!\\" \\"Why call for Lin Shanzhi?\\" Baozhu asked. \\"How should I know? It must be something urgent,\\" Aizhu replied. Wearing wooden-soled bow shoes, her rapid steps clattered sharply against the floor. Reaching the side gate, she relayed the message to the senior"},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":9,"tokens":["珊枝","林珊枝"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"爱珠把绛纱灯提起，在珊枝脸上一照，笑了一笑，道：「你把脸喝得红红儿的，上去准要碰钉子。」珊枝笑道：「我几时喝酒？你那灯笼是红的，映到人家脸上来，倒说我醉了。」爱珠也笑了一笑，就领了珊枝慢慢而行，进了内室，听得公子正在与那些丫鬟说笑。爱珠先进去。说：「珊枝来了！」公子即传上来","en":"Aizhu lifted the amber lantern to Shanzhi's face, smiling playfully. \\"Your face is flushed red from drinking; you are sure to meet a rebuff when you go in.\\" Shanzhi chuckled, \\"When did I drink? It's your red lantern reflecting on my face that makes you think I'm drunk.\\" Aizhu smiled again and"},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":4,"tokens":["珊枝"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"珊枝道：「每逢朔望，他们总清早来的，门上只道爷没有起身，便挡住不叫进来。班子里的人来请安，号簿上是不挂的。就是那个琴言，从前他师傅也领他来过，不过没有进来。」华公子道：「那琴言是谁的徒弟？」珊枝道：「是长庆的徒弟。」公子道：「长庆，你的师傅也不是叫长庆吗","en":"\\"They always arrive early on the first and fifteenth of the month,\\" Shanzhi explained. \\"But the gatekeepers, seeing the Master is not yet awake, turn them away. When actors come to pay their respects, their names are not even entered in the register. Even that boy Qinyan was once brought here by his master, though he never made"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":6,"tokens":["珊枝"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"公子道：「你瞧这琴言怎样？」珊枝不言语。华公子又问了一遍，珊枝说道：「好是好的，也是徐二老爷钟爱的，听说外边不肯应酬。」华公子道：「徐二老爷钟爱的是袁宝珠，不爱他。」珊枝道：「听见徐二老爷爱他与袁宝珠差不多。又听得说，徐二老爷在他身上已花过好几千银子了。」华公子不语，少顷又说道：「","en":"\\"And what do you think of this Qinyan?\\" the Young Master asked. Shanzhi remained silent. When pressed again, he finally answered, \\"He is good enough, but he is also Second Master Xu's darling. Word has it he refuses to entertain anyone else.\\" \\"Second Master Xu favors Yuan Baozhu, not him,\\" the Young Master countered. \\"I"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":3,"tokens":["珊枝"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"掌珠一面打扇，一面看着公子与珊枝讲话，便心不在扇，一扇子扇脱了手，掉下地来，明珠嗤的一笑，掌珠红了脸，慌忙捡起。华公子倒笑了，道：「你们难道没有听过戏，听说到戏连心都没有了。歇天我就叫那一班人进来唱一天，请奶奶听，你们大家都托托福。」爱珠多嘴说道：「什么好班子？难道比咱们府里的还好","en":"always the Eight Ages Troupe.\\" \\"You could learn,\\" the Young Master laughed. \\"Female actors are not so uncommon.\\" Shanzhi offered a faint smile. After standing for a moment longer without receiving further orders, he took his leave, finding three or four of the maids still gathered around the brazier. He exchanged a few words with them before departing. Once the fragrant"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":1,"tokens":["珊枝"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"净了脸，丫鬟替他梳了发，穿好了衣裳。华夫人恐他酒后伤身，便叫小丫鬟送出一盏参汤，公子吃了。只见宝珠进来回道：「珊枝在外面请示爷，昨晚叫他去请魏师爷，今早要请不要请？」华公子略一踌躇道：「叫他去请魏师爷，到留青精舍吃早饭。」宝珠答应去了。华公子到上房，华夫人晓妆已完，丫鬟侍立两旁。公子见夫人淡扫蛾眉，薄施脂粉，双鬟腻绿，高髻盘云，很有些象那苏蕙芳的相貌，便坐下了，","en":"constitution, sent a maid with a bowl of medicinal ginseng soup, which he drank. Baozhu then entered to report, \\"Shanzhi is waiting outside to ask for your instructions. Do you still wish to invite Secretary Wei, as you ordered last night?\\" The Young Master hesitated briefly before replying, \\"Tell him to invite Secretary Wei to breakfast at the Quiet-Green Retreat.\\" Baozhu"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":1,"tokens":["林珊枝"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"人听了甚是喜欢，所以任凭华公子怎样繁华奢侈，到绝不疑心有别样事来。即如十珠群婢，天天闹在一堆，也绝无妒忌。再如林珊枝、冯子佩等也不过形迹可疑，其实并无干涉，此也是各人情性，不比那奚十一等专讲究这些事情，不在色之好歹。","en":"harbored jealousy. Even with the Ten Pearls tumbling together in his presence daily, she felt no envy. As for Lin Shanzhi and Feng Zipei, they were no more than suspicious appearances, with no real entanglement. After all, everyone's temperament is different, and he was not obsessed with carnal indulgences like Xi Eleven."},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":4,"tokens":["林珊枝","珊枝"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"且说华公子在夫人房内吃过饭，谈谈笑笑已过了午正，却忘了魏聘才在留青精舍等他。却说林珊枝去请魏聘才，聘才已起身多时，将要吃饭，忽听得华公子请吃早饭，叫他到留青精舍去。聘才这一喜，倒像金殿传胪一样，疾忙穿了靴，换了一件新衣，拿把团扇，摇摇摆摆，也不及与张、顾二位说知，就同了珊枝出园，犹一路恭惟，或叫老珊，或称老弟，挨肩擦背，好一回才到了留","en":"conversation carried them past noon, completely forgetting that Wei Pincai was waiting at the Quiet-Green Retreat. When Lin Shanzhi came to summon him, Pincai had been awake for some time and was just about to eat. Hearing that the Young Master had invited him to breakfast, he was as elated as a scholar hearing his name called at the palace examinations. He hurriedly pulled on his"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":7,"tokens":["林珊枝","珊枝"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这边林珊枝在洗红轩外边等候，与那些十珠婢闲谈，又不能上去请他。赠珠道：「我先到上房听得说，爷与奶奶吃饭，两人讲得热闹，只怕不出来了。」珊枝道：「这怎么好呢？一早把个魏师爷请在留青精舍里，等到此刻，一个多时辰，我也觉得饿了。你们吃过早饭么？」明珠道：「我们是早吃","en":"Meanwhile, Lin Shanzhi waited outside the Crimson Wash Pavilion, chatting with the Ten Pearls, unable to ascend and disturb the Master. Zengzhu said, \\"Earlier, I heard the Master dining with Madame upstairs. Their conversation was quite lively, so he is unlikely to emerge"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":5,"tokens":["珊枝"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"来问，华公子想起早上之约，已经迟了，只好吃晚饭的了，便就从侧边一个角门走出去，却只与留青精舍隔一个院子。 　　珊枝疾忙先去照应了，聘才连忙走出到窗前，华公子已到，聘才便请了一个安。华公子一手拉住说道：「本约足下早上过来谈谈，不料我昨日多吃了酒，今日起来又睡着了，倒叫你久待，可曾用过早饭么？」聘才只得说吃过了。倒是珊枝见聘才饿了半日，心中不忍，说道：「师爷从巳初进","en":"through a side gate that opened directly onto the courtyard of the Quiet-Green Retreat, only one courtyard away. Shanzhi hurried ahead to receive him, and Pincai stepped forward to the window as the Young Master arrived. Pincai bowed, but the Young Master seized his hand. \\"I meant to speak with you this morning, but yesterday's wine made me oversleep, keeping you waiting."},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":1,"tokens":["林珊枝"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"进府里去，他是好了，我就苦了。况且才十五岁，到出师还有五年，怕不替我挣个几万银子，你想叫我如何舍得？他不比那个林珊枝，从前他性气又不好，油饼也吃多了，到常要怄我，我所以把他换了登春班的绣芳。绣芳出师，就得了八千吊，人人知道的。如今这琴言比绣芳又强了几倍。师老爷求你对公子说，长庆如今就剩这一个好徒弟，要靠他一辈子过活。其余几个小孩子，都是不中用的，倒赔钱做衣服。一月","en":"completes his apprenticeship, would he not earn tens of thousands for me? How can I relinquish him? He is not like Lin Shanzhi, who had a surly temper, ate too many oil cakes, and constantly vexed me until I traded him for Xiufang. When Xiufang graduated, he brought in eight thousand strings of cash—everyone knows this. Qinyan surpasses Xiufang many times over. Secretary, I"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":1,"tokens":["林珊枝"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"林听得口风不甚松动，也只好上车去了。辞了出来，找到了聘才，将长庆的话一字不隐，全说了。聘才无可奈何，只得回去叫林珊枝回了，说没有找着长庆，迟日再去。不知琴言祸福如何，再听下回分解。","en":"took a cart and left. He found Pincai and repeated Changqing's words verbatim. Helpless, Pincai returned and had Shanzhi report that he could not locate Changqing, deciding to try again later. Whether this would decide Qinyan's fate remains to be seen in the next installment."}],"28":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":3,"tokens":["珊枝"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"分文不要。聘才见他小心赔礼，且说一钱不要，便甚得意，只道他一怒之后，使他愧悔送上门来，应了前日所说的话，便找了珊枝，请公子出来说了，华公子道：「为何不要身价呢？」聘才说：「他的意思恐怕孩子不懂规矩，二来如有错处，公子厌了，他仍可以领了出去，所以他不敢领价。」公子点了点头道：「这也使得，明日进来就是了。但既进了我的府，无论领价不领价，外面是不准陪酒唱戏的。」聘才道","en":"successfully shamed them into delivering the goods directly to his door, exactly as he had predicted. He then sought out Lin Shanzhi, had the Young Master called, and made his report. Young Master Hua asked, \\"Why ask no price?\\" Pincai replied, \\"First, he fears the child may not know the proper rules; second, if there is any fault and your lordship wearies of him, he can still quietly"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":6,"tokens":["珊枝"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"聘才与元茂略谈几句，即便出来，一径回华府，到自己房中坐下，细细的想了一回，没有主意。即来找珊枝，把方才颜夫人托他话，都说与珊枝，又加上些话。又说我与这个兄弟是三代世交，且我这梅老伯母，止他一子，人极聪明，相貌生得也极齐整，你只当行好事，怎么成全成全他。倘能医好了这个病，我也感激你不尽。」珊枝道：「我有什么法子？只好禀明了公子，说你说的，叫他去","en":"straight back to the Hua mansion, sat in his room, and pondered deeply, yet no plan came to mind. He sought out Shanzhi, repeated Lady Yan's desperate plea, added his own embellishments, and pleaded, \\"This brother and I are bound by three generations of friendship. Madame Mei has only this one son, a clever and handsome youth. Please, do this good deed and help cure him."},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":2,"tokens":["珊枝"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"你道珊枝是什么意思，敢作主意叫他出来？原来琴言刚进来半月光景，连华夫人都疼他，时常赏他东西。又常说：「这孩子老实，不像个唱戏的。」因此珊枝便动了酸意。想道：「我进来了三年多，也算第一分的人，他才进来几天，就这么样。脑袋又好，将来不要把我压下去。」如此一想，便","en":"Why did Shanzhi dare to orchestrate such a scheme? Qinyan had only been in the mansion for half a month, yet even Lady Hua doted on him, frequently bestowing gifts and praising him: \\"This child is honest; he doesn't act like a theatrical performer at all.\\" This favoritism"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":3,"tokens":["珊枝"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"珊枝道：「我无缘无故的，哄你作什么？你只管放心：半天之内公子也不下来。即使叫你，我与你说，告假回去看师傅的病去就来的。公子若不说什么，很好；要是说什么，我自会答应。可有一层，你去只管去，可要早些回来。再者，你今既去，千万把他的病治好了，再去第二回，可就难","en":"Shanzhi replied, \\"Why would I lie to you for no reason? Rest easy. The Young Master won't descend from his quarters for half the day. Even if he calls for you, I will simply say you took leave to visit your sick teacher and will return shortly. If there's any"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":2,"tokens":["珊枝"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"日无话，好容易盼到天明，恰好又天从人愿，华公子身子不爽快，在夫人房里不出来。琴言便更放了心，忙忙的吃了饭，来找珊枝，说：「怎样出去？我是不认得路径。」珊枝道：「你同魏师爷出去，他们就不好问什么；就使他们有话，也传不到里头去。」琴言只得折口气来找聘才，聘才见了心中甚喜，脸上却装了冷冷的说：「你去只管去，要谨慎些。将来闹穿了，可别说我同你去的。」琴言答应了，即同聘才","en":"remained in Lady Hua's quarters, not emerging. Tremendously relieved, Qinyan quickly ate his meal and sought out Shanzhi. \\"How do I get out? I don't know the way.\\" Shanzhi instructed, \\"Go with Secretary Wei. The gatekeepers won't ask questions, and even if they do, the rumors won't pierce the inner walls.\\" Qinyan swallowed his pride and found Pincai. Pincai was inwardly"}],"29":[{"paragraph":15,"mentions":10,"tokens":["林珊枝","珊枝"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，只见总门口有人拿了大簿子记上一笔，琴言知道是上号簿。聘才先叫四儿将银包拿进房去，放在钱柜内锁好。一同进来找着林珊枝，珊枝见琴言回来，即笑道：「怎么去了许多时，想必医的病好了。」琴言面有惭色，便问道：「公子可曾传我？」珊枝道：「怎么没传？传了两三回，不见你回来，公子大发气，已着人叫你师傅去了。」琴言听了，吃这一惊不小，满面通红，说不出话来。聘才道：「他是不禁恐唬的","en":"goings. Pincai had Si'er carry the silver straight to his room to lock it safely in a chest, while he went to find Lin Shanzhi. When Shanzhi saw Qinyan, he said with a smile, \\"You have been gone so long; your illness must surely have healed by now.\\" Qinyan flushed with shame and asked timidly, \\"Did the Young Master summon me?\\" Shanzhi replied coldly, \\"He summoned you two or"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":1,"tokens":["珊枝"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话未说完，聘才就连忙问道：「你看见什么，只管说来我听，或者我可以就给你办来。」珊枝道：「不是别的。我见沙回子家里有一个金丝拧成的一个花篮，不过二两重，手工倒贵。我又见他自己泡茶的一把时大彬的宜兴茶壶，盖子上嵌着一块翡翠，是没有比他再好的了。我这个搬指都比不上。那金花篮我还了他四十两，他也肯了，那茶壶我还了他二十四两，他还不肯。明日","en":"Before he could even finish, Pincai pressed eagerly, \\"What things? I will fetch them for you immediately.\\" Shanzhi smiled with satisfaction. \\"They belong to Sha Huizi. One is a flower basket woven entirely of gold wire—barely two liang in weight, but the craftsmanship is unimaginably fine. The other is his Shi Dabin Yixing teapot, set with a piece of perfect jade"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":1,"tokens":["珊枝"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"聘才道：「茶壶用久了，所以才能够这样好。你既爱这两样，我就买来奉送。那纱也不必退，还留着送人罢。」珊枝笑道：「怎好这样。我若一定不要，倒显得不好，只得生受了。」说了一回，就回房去了。","en":"\\"Old pots ripen beautifully with age. I will buy them both for you, and you may keep the gauze as an extra gift.\\" Shanzhi laughed, his mood completely lifted. \\"I suppose I cannot refuse empty-handed, so I will accept them grudgingly.\\" With that, he turned and returned to his room."},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":1,"tokens":["珊枝"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"到了留青精舍，珊枝问起琴言之事，琴言只得大略说了一说。","en":"Later, at the Quiet-Green Retreat, Shanzhi gently questioned Qinyan, and Qinyan outlined the true events of the day in quiet murmurs."},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":1,"tokens":["珊枝"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"珊枝不信，心中有些动疑，说：「怎么无缘无故的会害起病来？见你戏的也不止他一个，难道人人见了你，就都为你害病吗？我倒不晓得，你们有这些情分，还是另有缘故呢？」一片话，说的琴言臊的了不得，又不敢驳回他，吊桶落在他井里，只好忍住这气罢了。","en":"Shanzhi listened, his brow furrowed in doubt. \\"Why would he fall gravely ill for nothing? Many people saw your play, yet not all of them fell ill. Is there some deeper bond between you, or perhaps something else entirely?\\" Qinyan burned with shame. Unable to"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":4,"tokens":["珊枝","林珊枝"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"过了几日，子玉究竟放心不下，便回了母亲，借看聘才为名，去看琴言，恰好见着聘才。聘才又求珊枝，把琴言叫出来，说了有一个多时辰的话，子玉方才放心而去。华府中人多嘴杂，且各存一心，过了几日，就有人将此事传到华公子耳中。华公子听了着实有气，便叫珊枝上来问了一遍，珊枝替辩了几句，华公子也说了他几句，以后不准琴言出门，将他派往洗红居，交与十珠婢看管，","en":"using the pretext of visiting Pincai, solely to see Qinyan once more. He met with Pincai and relentlessly begged Shanzhi, until they finally called Qinyan out to see him. They talked for more than two hours, and only then did Ziyu's heart feel truly at peace. But within the sprawling Hua mansion, there were countless watchful eyes and wagging tongues, each harboring its"}],"30":[{"paragraph":6,"mentions":1,"tokens":["林珊枝"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"是日张仲雨一早进来，先在聘才处吃了早饭，与张、顾诸人谈笑了半天。到得午正时候，拉了聘才、林珊枝来逛西园。仲雨从前也不过到过一两处，聘才虽经游过两回，也未全到。","en":"he spent half the day chatting and laughing with Zhang, Gu, and the others. Around noon, he pulled Pincai and Lin Shanzhi along to stroll through the West Garden. Zhongyu had only visited one or two spots before, and although Pincai had toured it twice, he hadn't seen everything either."},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":2,"tokens":["珊枝"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"当下仲雨、聘才二人，跟着珊枝，顺着山路径，高低斜曲，穿入一个神仙洞内。从左边上去，几树丹桂，不到十余步，至一带曲廊，作凹字形，罘□轻幕，帘栊半遮。珊枝引入看时，共是七间，两楹如翼外张，中间平厦三间，后面玻璃大窗，逼近池畔。室中陈设华美，署名「归鸿小渚」。下有小跋数行，是华公自叙","en":"Following Shanzhi along a rocky path that rose, dipped, and twisted, Zhongyu and Pincai entered a grotto. They went up on the left, passing a few osmanthus trees. Within a short walk of about ten paces, they reached a curved corridor shaped like a concave 'U', with …"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":2,"tokens":["珊枝"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"面。左右两行修竹，几处秋声动人。阑前摆着一张棋桌，放着两个洋漆棋盒，仲雨道：「此间颇为幽静，却洗尽繁华气象。」珊枝道：「公子虽爱热闹，其实也喜清静。」仲雨走下阶来，沿池而行，渡过红桥，对面一个白石平台，雕栏如玉；上面三间平榭，垂了湘帘。进去一看，觉得一片晶光射目，寒侵肌肤，为夏间避暑之地。一切桌凳几案，尽是玻璃面子。两旁两架云母屏风，中间一口大缸，一缸清水，养些","en":"foreign-lacquer chess boxes. Zhongyu said, \\"How peaceful it is here—all that ostentatious splendour falls away.\\" Shanzhi replied, \\"Although the Young Master loves liveliness, he actually enjoys tranquility as well.\\" Zhongyu walked down the steps, went along the pond, and crossed the red bridge. Opposite was a white stone terrace with jade-like carved railings. On it stood"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":1,"tokens":["林珊枝"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"以不见？」华公子道：「这孩子脾气虽有些古怪，却还老实，如今派在内书房，少刻就出来的。」子云又留心看去，却又不见林珊枝与那八龄班，心内思想，今日如此盛举，为何又不见这些人？难道都在戏房里扮戏么？这出戏唱完了，华公子就传十旦上来敬酒。众人一齐上来，肥瘦纤浓，各极其妙。子云看九人之外添了一个全福班的全贵，也很娇娆艳丽，风致动人。都请过了安，齐齐的手捧金杯，分头敬酒。","en":"well-behaved. He's now assigned to the inner study and will come out shortly.\\" Ziyun looked around again and didn't see Lin Shanzhi or the Eight-Ages Troupe either. He wondered to himself, on such a grand occasion today, why are these people missing too? Could they all be backstage getting in makeup? After the play ended, Young Master Hua summoned the ten Dan actors to come up and"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":1,"tokens":["珊枝"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"就命在碧纱栊前摆了一个长桌，室中焚了几炉好香，献上香茗。众人坐了，正觉秋光如画，清洗心脾。子云偶回头时，又只见珊枝同着琴言上来，对着子云等请了安。子云等忙招呼了。","en":"autumn scenery was like a painting, cleansing their hearts and minds. When Ziyun casually looked back, he saw Shanzhi leading Qinyan up. They bowed to Ziyun and the others. Ziyun and the rest quickly greeted them."},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":1,"tokens":["林珊枝"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"反诳》、《挑帘》、《裁衣》等戏。」聘才笑道：「也不对，竟唱不来。」华公子身子后边，站着几个八龄班内的，有一个对林珊枝低低说道：「魏师爷何不唱《活捉》，前日不是见他唱过的？」华公子早已听见，便向聘才道：「你何不同他唱《活捉》呢？」聘才尚要支吾，经不得众人齐声参赞，聘才只得依了。子佩笑道：「唱便唱，不要又闹出刑部的案来，将魏老大锁了去。」众人都笑了。子佩颇觉欣然，便又","en":"we simply can't perform.\\" Behind Young Master Hua stood a few boys from the Eight-Ages Troupe. One whispered to Lin Shanzhi, \\"Why doesn't Master Wei sing 'Capturing Alive'? Didn't we see him sing it the other day?\\" Young Master Hua had already heard this and said to Pincai, \\"Why don't you sing 'Capturing Alive' with him?\\" Pincai was still trying to hedge, but unable to withstand"}],"31":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":3,"tokens":["珊枝"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"走。」华公子道：「忙什么，到辰刻散不迟。」即吩咐撤席止戏，家人整顿茶具，泡好了香茗送来。子云留心不见琴言，但见珊枝靠着屏风有些倦态。华公子查起琴言来，珊枝回道：「他身子不快，睡了。」原来琴言每逢热闹中便触起他心事，就要伤心。又见冯子佩与聘才串戏，眼中颇瞧他们不起，转托珊枝托病而去。","en":"and brought in freshly brewed fragrant tea. Ziyun looked around and noticed that Qinyan was missing, seeing only Shanzhi leaning wearily against a screen. When Young Master Hua asked about Qinyan's whereabouts, Shanzhi replied, \\"He was feeling unwell, so he has gone to sleep.\\" The truth was that whenever Qinyan found himself amidst such bustling crowds, it stirred the"},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":2,"tokens":["珊枝"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"谐的，瘦香是长于品箫的，小梅是长于吹笙的。可惜玉侬又病了，他倒会一套《平沙落雁》。」华公子便命叫他起来，又吩咐珊枝拿了琵琶来。家人把些笔砚乐器都搬了出来，分摆在各处。次贤道：「我来点将：先点玉侬与瘦香把琴箫和起来；再点瑶卿画一幅，媚香、香畹、佩仙对景吟诗，题在上面；再点珊枝与小梅笙、琵琶竞奏；再点蕊香猜几个灯谜，说个笑话；末点静芳舞剑，溜亮风生，亦可如渔阳参挝矣","en":"Geese Alighting on Level Sand'.\\" Hearing this, Young Master Hua ordered him to be roused from his sleep and told Shanzhi to fetch the pipa. The servants brought out brushes, inkstones, and musical instruments, setting them up at various stations around the room. Cixian said, \\"Let me act as the marshal and assign the roles: First, I call upon Yunong and Shouxiang to blend"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":2,"tokens":["珊枝"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"道：「好。」次贤叫他们快些写上，蕙芳、玉林都要素兰代写，华公子不依，只得各自写了。大家又赏叹一回，于是静坐，听珊枝的琵琶与春喜的笙。珊枝斜坐着拨动檀槽，只见指法如雨洒芭蕉，声韵如滩头流水，满怀春色，绕乱一堂。加之笙韵高低，声声应和。听得人人色舞眉飞，四肢愉快。弹了《月儿高》一套，大家也赞了一回。","en":"insisting they each write their own. After another round of admiration and praise, they sat quietly to listen to Shanzhi's pipa and Chunxi's sheng. Shanzhi sat at an angle, his fingers striking the sandalwood frets like rain showering upon plantain leaves, the melody flowing like water over a river shoal. A chaotic, vibrant spring filled the hall, perfectly complemented"}],"33":[{"paragraph":19,"mentions":2,"tokens":["林珊枝","珊枝"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"聘才进了自己屋子，尚有一起一起的人来问他，唯不见华公子打发人来，聘才真道他不知此事，便放了心。到了第三日，见林珊枝进来，两手捧了一大封，像是银子，放在桌上，说道：「这是公子送你的。」说完转身就走，聘才「道谢」两字尚说不及，已去远了。聘才见此光景，与平日不同，有些疑异，遂看银包，上面写着：「赆仪二百两。」心中跳了一跳，沉思了一回，已经明白，但一时不得主意，欲候珊枝","en":"Master Hua. Pincai genuinely believed he was unaware of the matter, which put his mind at ease. On the third day, Lin Shanzhi entered, holding a large package wrapped in both hands, resembling silver. He placed it on the table and said, \\"This is a gift from the young master.\\" With that, he turned and walked away. Pincai hadn't even managed to say the words \\"thank you\\" before"}],"36":[{"paragraph":4,"mentions":7,"tokens":["林珊枝","珊枝"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"蛋无缘无故的闹上门来，因此堕落在此。又想魏聘才虽不是个好人，然尚有一言半语，道着我的心事，如今他又出去了。那个林珊枝倒像是半个主儿一般，先要小心谨慎的奉承他才喜欢，不然他就要撮弄人。如今索性把我撵出去了，倒也自在，自然也可以不到师父处去了。若得皇天保佑，使我做个清白人，我就饥寒一世，也自愿意。不然人说前做过戏子，后做过奴才，好听不好听，人还看得起么？琴言越想越气，","en":"he had at least occasionally spoken words that touched Qinyan's heart, yet now he was gone too. Then there was Lin Shanzhi, who acted like half a master; one had to flatter him carefully to please him, otherwise he would stir up trouble. \\"If only they would just cast me out entirely, I would be free,\\" Qinyan thought. \\"Then, naturally, I wouldn't have to return to my teacher's"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":2,"tokens":["林珊枝"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"问了他师傅的事，然后问起他新年光景。琴言略将近事说了几句。宝珠道：「你既回来，告了几天假？」琴言道：「早上是林珊枝来告诉的，我也没有见着公子，说办完丧事就回去，也没有限定几天。」素兰道：「总得告一个月的假，等出了殡才可进去，不然也对不住你师娘。」琴言道：「可不是。」蕙芳道：「索性告假告个长假，不去也罢了。究竟你也不是卖与他们的。」宝珠道：「在那里好倒算好，就是拘","en":"recounted recent events. Baozhu asked, \\"Since you're back, how many days of leave did you get?\\" Qinyan replied, \\"Lin Shanzhi came to tell me this morning. I didn't see the young master myself. He only said to return after the funeral, without specifying how many days.\\" Sulan said, \\"You must ask for at least a month's leave and wait until after the burial to return; otherwise,"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":1,"tokens":["珊枝"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"金漱芳，大家直等了送殓，拜了，然后才散。琴言穿了孝袍，似乎明日不好出门，只得约定三日后再叙。又叫伍麻子到华府求珊枝转为告假一月，俟出殡后方得进城。华公子准了，又拿了一个衣箱回来，琴言方才放心。","en":"go out the next day, so they agreed to meet again in three days. He also sent Wu Mazi to the Hua estate to ask Shanzhi to request a one-month leave for him, waiting until after the burial to return to the city. Young Master Hua approved and sent back a chest of clothes, which finally put Qinyan's mind at ease."}],"41":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["珊枝"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一日在园中归鸿小渚倚阑垂钓，珊枝与金、玉二龄，还有一个小丫鬟香儿，在傍伺候。金龄找了一个大瓷瓯，走下池边贮了水。华公子钓了一回，得了三寸长的一个小鱼，已觉满心欢喜。见那池水清冷，每于潆流洄互处，把些铜皮嵌在石脚，那流水过来便有琤琮之声，如琴筑一般。又见水面上飞了无数的花瓣，一个红鲤","en":"he was leaning on the railing at Returning Geese Islet in the garden, rod in hand, fishing at the water's edge. Shanzhi and the two pages Jinling and Yuling attended him, along with a little maidservant named Xiang'er. Jinling had fetched a large porcelain basin and filled it with water at the pond's edge to hold any catch. The young master had been fishing for a while"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":2,"tokens":["林珊枝","珊枝"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，再过了猗香亭，就通方才来的路，要坐什么船？」花珠原是爱顽，并非不认得路径，只得独自出去。将到藤花书屋前，只见林珊枝正走来，口中嚷道：「花姑娘来了，想必在留仙院了。」花珠待要问时，只见藤花架边走出一群人来，是六珠并两个老婆子，还有几个小丫鬟。爱珠对花珠道：「在什么地方，你也不给个信，叫我们满园的瞎找。」花珠道：「我们是坐船过去的，还到不多时，有人在岸上也应瞧得见。","en":"truly not knowing the way, had no choice but to go alone. When she was nearly at the wisteria-bower study, she saw Lin Shanzhi coming toward her, calling out, \\"Huazhu is here; they must all be at the Liuxian Courtyard.\\" Before Huazhu could ask anything, a group emerged from beside the wisteria trellis. It was the Six Zhus, two older maidservants, and several young girls. Aizhu"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":1,"tokens":["珊枝"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"想了一想，叫爱珠去问珊枝找管屋的书童要了钥匙来。不一会，爱珠取了进来，公子叫他开了两个博古橱，携着夫人细细看那橱中，尽是古铜、旧玉等物。又将抽屉一开，见有一个紫檀木匣，开了盖子，看是个手卷，签上写着「花蕊夫人小像，管夫人画」。华夫人笑道：「这个就很好。」公子扯开看时，是个绢","en":"After a moment's thought, he called Aizhu to go and ask Shanzhi to fetch the key from the study-boy in charge of the storeroom. Presently Aizhu returned with it, and the young master had her unlock two antique cabinets, then led his lady over to examine them at leisure. They were filled with ancient bronzes, old"},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":2,"tokens":["珊枝"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"得清真本色。你唱惯了搭白的戏曲，所以一时洗不干净。若不会听的，怕不定你第一？」花珠方才服了，因又问道：「奶奶听珊枝的怎样？」华夫人道：「珊枝也是戏曲，倒是琴言虽然生些，还得清字意。」","en":"have ranked you first?\\" Only then did Huazhu accept the verdict, and she asked, \\"Mistress, what did you think of Shanzhi's singing?\\" Madam Hua replied, \\"Shanzhi also has the theatrical style. As for Qinyan, though still raw in some ways, he still achieves that quality of purity and meaning.\\""},{"paragraph":37,"mentions":1,"tokens":["珊枝"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"台，便进内室。园里这两个老婆子收拾东西，虽有两个小丫头帮着他，一次也还拿不完。来时有六珠帮他拿些，如今只得央求珊枝、金龄、玉龄帮他拿了几样。","en":"in a single trip. On the way in, the Six Zhus had helped carry some items; now they had no recourse but to beg Shanzhi, Jinling, and Yuling to carry several loads for them."},{"paragraph":39,"mentions":3,"tokens":["珊枝"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"将方才填的词看了一会，同吃了晚饭。忽又高兴，到了洗红轩，因想起琴言如何还不进来，像已过了假期了，即叫小丫头去唤珊枝进来。小丫头去了一会，同了珊枝上前。公子问道：「琴言是那天告假的？」珊枝道：「正月二十四日。」公子道：「正月二十四日，今日已是三月初二了。他告一个月假，怎么过了七八天还不回来？」","en":"not come back, though his leave seemed already to have run over. He called a little maidservant to go and summon Shanzhi. The maid went and presently came back with Shanzhi. The young master asked: \\"What day did Qinyan take his leave?\\" Shanzhi replied: \\"The twenty-fourth day of the first month.\\" The young master said: \\"The twenty-fourth of the first month—and today is"},{"paragraph":40,"mentions":2,"tokens":["珊枝"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"珊枝不言语，停了一停，又说道：「想必有事，自然要完了事才进来。」公子道：「我想他也没有什么事，明日叫人出城找他，问他几时进来。」珊枝答应了。","en":"Shanzhi said nothing for a moment, then offered: \\"He must have some matter to attend to; no doubt he will come back once it is settled.\\" The young master said: \\"I cannot think what matter he could have. Tomorrow I will send someone out of the city to find him"}],"44":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":2,"tokens":["珊枝"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说琴言出师之日，就是华公子赏花之日。明日，华公子吩咐珊枝着人去叫琴言回来，珊枝派了一个外跟班姚贤，一早出城。到了长庆寓处，见了伍麻子。说假期已过，叫他进城。","en":"indenture, Young Master Hua was hosting a flower-viewing gathering. The next morning Young Master Hua ordered Shanzhi to send someone to summon Qinyan back to the household. Shanzhi dispatched an outer attendant named Yao Xian, who set out early for the city gate. Arriving at the Changqing lodgings, he found Wu Mazi and delivered word that the leave period had expired"},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":1,"tokens":["林珊枝"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"又带他去？这也实在是个奇闻。况我们公子待琴言怎样的恩典，一月给他师父二百银，格外还有赏赐。他的分儿，在府里除了林珊枝，还有谁比得上他？他竟绝不感恩，辞也不辞，竟同人走了。我想天下竟有这样忘恩负义的人，我回去禀明了公子，定然要拿转来，这就看他的造化罢。」孟七听了，笑道：「那里的话，这是谁哄你的？琴言好好的在这里，何曾同什么江南人出京。这是讹言，听不得的。」姚贤道：「","en":"treated Qinyan — paying his teacher two hundred taels a month, on top of extra gifts — who in the household, besides Lin Shanzhi, enjoys a better position than he did? And yet he shows not a shred of gratitude, makes no farewell, and just walks off with someone else. I tell you, there are truly people in this world devoid of all conscience. When I report back to our young master,"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":2,"tokens":["珊枝"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"姚贤吃了饭，道了谢，就进城来见了珊枝，将琴言近日的事，先照伍麻子，后照孟七、胡八的话，没有少说一句，说得顺口，还添了好些。又说路上见他与一个相公同车，想是陪酒去了。珊枝听了，呆了一会，说道：「这是什么话？是真的，还是假的？我要照你的话回，若有假的在里头，就了不得了。」","en":"Yao Xian finished his meal, offered his thanks, and returned to the city, where he reported to Shanzhi. He relayed Qinyan's recent doings — first as Mazi had told them, then as Meng Qi and Hu Ba had reported — without leaving out a single word, and with his tongue loosened, he added a good many embellishments of his own. He also said that on the road"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":7,"tokens":["珊枝","林珊枝"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"姚贤道：「我怎敢撒谎？这是徐老爷家的孟七爷，并奚家的胡八爷，讲得有凭据，我敢添一句，对出谎来，是好耍的么？」珊枝心里细想道：「琴言何敢如此负恩？非特公子白疼了他，我也白白的照应他一番了。」又转念道：「看他的心总是勉强在此，心上又有什么梅少爷，自然在外面快乐。但到徐老爷处也还罢了。怎么连魏聘才、奚十一都陪酒来了？就不顾自己身分，也应留公子脸面。翡翠镯子也不算什么","en":"family's household — with witnesses to what was said. Would I dare add a word? Is it something to jest about?\\" Shanzhi turned it over in his mind: \\"How could Qinyan be so ungrateful? Not only has the young master loved him for nothing — I have taken care of him for nothing as well.\\" Then the thought shifted: \\"Looking at his heart, he has always been reluctant to be here,"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":9,"tokens":["珊枝"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"华公子在那里笑得有趣，忽见太湖石洞穴像有人偷望，便问一声：「谁在太湖石背后？」倒把珊枝唬了一跳，忙走上前，垂手站立。公子道：「你来为什么又不上来，要躲在石后？」珊枝道：「奴才方才走来，听得公子正说着话，故在太湖石后瞧一瞧，再上来。」公子道：「有什么话说？」珊枝道：「今早打发姚贤去叫琴言，姚贤回来了。」公子道：「琴言呢？」珊枝道：「琴言","en":"aperture of the Taihu rock something seemed to be spying on them. He called out: \\"Who is behind the Taihu rock?\\" Shanzhi gave a start and quickly stepped forward, standing with hands at his sides. \\"Why did you come and then not come forward — what were you doing hiding behind the rock?\\" said the young master. \\"I arrived just now,\\" said Shanzhi, \\"and hearing the young master"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":1,"tokens":["珊枝"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"四珠婢听了，也觉诧异。那蕊珠尚跪在地下呆呆的看着珊枝讲话，自己忘其所以，花片落了一头，还拿一片花瓣在嘴里嚼了一会，吐在爱珠手上，爱珠瞅了他一眼。","en":"hearing all this, were also astonished. And Ruizhu, still kneeling on the ground, had been staring blankly at Shanzhi as he spoke, lost in a dream of her own: a shower of petals had fallen all over her head, and she was idly chewing a petal in her mouth, which she then spat out onto Aizhu's hand. Aizhu gave her a look."},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":2,"tokens":["珊枝"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"以不早与他出师！要到我这里来了，才卖弄他的家私，替他出起师来。这琴言实在可恨。那一样待差了他，一心向着那边！」珊枝婉言劝道：「公子请息怒，琴言本来进京未久，他师父又是个不会教训的，由他的性儿惯了。在这里半年，不要说没有委屈处，就走遍天涯，也找不出这地方。不晓得他为什么，背地里总是颦眉泪眼的。他另有心事，讲不出来。这种没良心的人，公子还放他心上作什么！据奴才想，倒","en":"truly detestable. In what particular was he treated poorly? And yet his heart was always with that other quarter!\\" Shanzhi gently soothed him: \\"Young master, please calm your anger. Qinyan came to the capital only recently, and his shifu was the sort who let him have his own way and spoiled him. He spent half a year here, and I can say not only was he not badly treated —"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":2,"tokens":["珊枝"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"珊枝又对宝珠丢个眼色，宝珠也劝道：「珊枝的话说得是。琴言若果真心向着公子，就有人替他出师，他也不肯瞒着公子，必来禀明一声。如果他来禀明公子，难道公子不肯与他出师？这个人又胡涂，又没有良心，还要他人作什么呢？况去年原是他自己要来的，今年又是他自己要去的，公","en":"Shanzhi then caught Baozhu's eye, and Baozhu also sought to console him: \\"Shanzhi speaks rightly. If Qinyan's heart had truly been with the young master, then even if someone had arranged his release, he would not have concealed it but would have come to inform"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":1,"tokens":["珊枝"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"虽有个垫子垫着，膝盖也跪得很疼，又遇着要小便起来，满脸飞红，那要笑要哭的光景，令人可怜。公子生了这一回气，又听珊枝、宝珠说话，就忘了他还跪着。","en":"to cry, which was rather pitiable. The young master had worked himself up into a rage and then been calmed by Shanzhi's and Baozhu's words, and had quite forgotten that Ruizhu was still kneeling."},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":2,"tokens":["珊枝"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"开道：「冤不冤，跪了这半天。」找个僻静地方小解去了。华公子起身回夫人房内，宝珠、爱珠随了进去，珍珠等蕊珠同行。珊枝慢慢的送公子出了园，正要走时，忽然一把花瓣撒了他一头，急回头看时，见蕊珠、珍珠骂道：「人家跪着，你倒在石洞里偷看人，瞎掉你的眼睛。」珊枝道：「明日还要挨打呢。」说着也就走开了。","en":"mistress's quarters; Baozhu and Aizhu followed him in. Zhenzhu waited for Ruizhu, and the two walked together. Shanzhi slowly escorted the young master out of the garden, and was just turning to leave when a handful of petals was thrown over her head. She spun around to see Ruizhu and Zhenzhu scolding her: \\"Someone was kneeling right there, and you were spying through"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":3,"tokens":["珊枝"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，欲行不可，欲罢不能，惟是无情无绪的光景。华夫人又宽解了一回，华公子只得暂为放开。过了一夜，明早忽又恼起来，叫珊枝将琴言的衣箱什物装了车，写了个帖儿，着珊枝亲到怡园，面交度香，看他怎样。珊枝只得遵命而行。","en":"Through the night his grievance lay unresolved, and the next morning it flared up again without warning. He ordered Shanzhi to have Qinyan's clothing-chests and belongings loaded into a cart, wrote a letter, and directed Shanzhi to deliver it in person to the Garden of Contentment and hand it directly to Duxiang, to see what he would make of it. Shanzhi had no choice but"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":3,"tokens":["珊枝"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"禀道：「华公子打发人来，要面见老爷，还有几个箱子送来。」子云诧异，道：「什么箱子？叫来人进来。」话言未了，只见珊枝已走到梨院。琴言望见珊枝，早躲进屋后，潜身听他所为何事。珊枝见子云、次贤，请过了安，说道：「公子与二位老爷请安，有一封信在此。」便双手呈上。子云接来，看见封面上有「皮箱四个，面交徐二老爷查收」，才即问了华公子好，将书拆开，次贤在旁同看，只见写道：","en":"brought several trunks.\\" Ziyun was puzzled. \\"What trunks? Have the visitor come in.\\" Before the words were out, Shanzhi had already walked into the Pear Blossom Courtyard. Qinyan caught sight of Shanzhi and immediately retreated behind the house to listen in concealment, wondering what business had brought him. Shanzhi greeted Ziyun and Cixian formally, and said: \\"The"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":3,"tokens":["珊枝"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"布，并候通履。\\n子云看了，正不知从何说起，不白之冤，有口难辩，气得两手冰冷，与次贤面面相观，冷笑了几声。次贤问珊枝道：「你公子对你说什么？」珊枝道：「没有讲什么，就叫小的将琴言的箱子交明老爷，问有回信没有回信。」子云气得说不出来，次贤道：「奇了，这话从何说起？此时也不及写回字，明日我同徐老爷见你公子当面讲罢。」珊枝答应了「是」，退了出去，将箱子送来交与门上，自行","en":"cold with anger. He and Cixian looked at each other in silence, and exchanged a few cold laughs. Cixian asked Shanzhi: \\"What did your young master say to you?\\" \\"Nothing in particular,\\" said Shanzhi. \\"He only asked me to deliver Qinyan's trunks clearly to his lordship and to ask whether there was any reply.\\" Ziyun was too angry to speak. Cixian said: \\"Strange — how did"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":1,"tokens":["珊枝"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这边琴言尚不知缘故，似乎听得将箱子送来。知珊枝去了，忙走出来，见子云面貌失色，靠在椅上。宝珠与次贤还看那信，琴言过来要看，次贤意欲藏过，子云道：「给他看看，这是那里说起？华星北真不是人，听了谁的话，这般糟蹋人，可恼！可恼！」琴言不看此信还可，看了不由得伤心起来，一字字看去，忽然一腔怒气，直涌上来","en":"remained unaware of the exact reason for the visit, yet he gathered that his trunks had been delivered. Hearing Shanzhi's departure, he hurried out, only to find Ziyun pale and slumped in his chair while Baozhu and Cixian pored over the letter. Qinyan stepped forward to read it. Cixian instinctively moved to hide the pages, but Ziyun intervened. \\"Let him see,\\" he said"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":1,"tokens":["林珊枝"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"陪他了。索性罢了，断了这个交情，也不要紧。」说道：「玉侬不必哭了，你的好处，都是共见的，这些话有谁信他？一定是林珊枝从中调唆，以至如此，连我也怪到这样。我想你那一处不可安身，岂必定要仗着他？既将你的箱子送了来，你也索性不必去见他了。再去见他，必遭羞辱，且在这里住几天，再作商量。」琴言犹是呜呜咽咽的，道了谢，说道：「你这样恩义待我，叫我没齿不忘，又为我受这些气恼，总","en":"stop your crying. Your pure character is clear to everyone, so who could possibly believe these venomous words? Lin Shanzhi must have stirred up trouble from within, twisting the truth until even I am painted with the same brush. As I see it, the Hua estate is no place for you to find peace. Why should you depend on him any longer? Since your trunks have already been sent"},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":3,"tokens":["珊枝"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"且说珊枝回去，华公子便问到怡园见了度香怎样光景，珊枝道：「今日见他们在梨花园内，奴才进去见琴言、宝珠，琴言见了奴才，即躲开了。徐老爷问了公子好，将帖儿拆开看了一会，一句话也没有讲，就只冷笑一声。萧老爷说不及写回字了，回去与公子请安，我们明日见了公子当面讲罢。","en":"Meanwhile, Shanzhi returned to the Hua household. Young Master Hua eagerly demanded to know how Duxiang had reacted upon receiving the letter at the garden. \\"When I arrived, I found them gathered in the Pear Blossom Courtyard,\\" Shanzhi reported. \\"As I entered, I saw Qinyan"}],"45":[{"paragraph":28,"mentions":1,"tokens":["林珊枝"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"。你知道明珠、珊瑚的故事么？」仲清道：「我不知这句的故事。」文泽道：「明珠是他有十婢，皆以珠字为名，这珊瑚就是林珊枝了。」又看写的是：","en":"\\"I don't know that line.\\" Wenze explained, \\"The pearls were his ten maids, all named with 'pearl.' The coral is Lin Shanzhi.\\" The next lines read:"}],"52":[{"paragraph":17,"mentions":1,"tokens":["林珊枝"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"忽见林珊枝走来，华公子便叫取衣服过来，穿戴了，辞了春航，说道：「弟还要到舍亲处有事，明早送轿来再会罢。」一拱而别。外面送奁来那几位，早已去了。诸人送下了阶，单是那春航送出。素兰见拿了他的扇子，便跟了出来。到上车时，华公子始见素兰送他，知他要那扇子，但又心爱此词","en":"Suddenly, Lin Shanzhi arrived. Young Master Hua called for his outer garments, dressed, and took his leave of Chunhang, saying, \\"I still have matters to attend to with my relatives. I shall send my sedan tomorrow morning so we may meet again.\\" With a bow, he departed. The"}],"53":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["珊枝"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"夫人写的了，所以来要回去。」素兰就辞了众人，到家换了衣服，带了人上车，一径到华府来，先到门房应酬了几句话，再到珊枝处问了缘故。","en":"heading straight for the Hua residence. After exchanging a few pleasantries at the gatehouse, he made his way to Shanzhi's quarters to ask about the reason for the summons."},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":3,"tokens":["珊枝"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"珊枝道：「我不知道，或者要你写什么。」素兰在珊枝房里略坐了一坐，珊枝道「公子在园中，就去见见罢，省得他等。」","en":"Shanzhi said, \\"I have no idea. Perhaps he wants you to write something.\\"\\n\\nSulan sat in Shanzhi's room for a short while before Shanzhi urged him, \\"The young master is in the garden. You should go see him now and spare him the wait.\\""},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":2,"tokens":["珊枝"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"于是珊枝领着素兰径入园来。只见秋色斑斓，灿然可爱。问了园童，方知在潭水房山。二人登高涉水，过竹穿林的走了好些地方。到了门口，珊枝先回明了。","en":"And so Shanzhi led Sulan straight into the garden. The autumn colors were vibrant, dazzling, and utterly charming. After asking a garden boy, they learned Young Master Hua was at the Pond-Water Rock-House. The two of them climbed heights and crossed waters, weaving"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":1,"tokens":["珊枝"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"不能，不过中等的。」素兰请安谢了，道：「府上中等的，就是外头上等的了。」正说间，香儿领着两个书童，拿了酒盒来。珊枝见素兰喝酒，想没有什么差使，便走开了。华公子道：「喝一杯润润诗肠，好得佳句。」素兰道：「今日真要出丑，恐石子里榨不出油来。」公子道：「不用谦，况且是曲，一发熟极生巧。」素兰接过酒壶，与公子斟了，自己也斟了一杯，心中好不思索。且看那潭水房山的景致，屋是","en":"Xiang'er led two pageboys in, carrying a wine box. Seeing Sulan drinking and figuring he had no errands to run, Shanzhi slipped away.\\n\\nYoung Master Hua said, \\"Drink a cup to moisten your poetic spirit and draw out fine lines.\\"\\n\\nSulan replied, \\"I fear I will truly make a fool of myself today; you cannot squeeze oil from a stone.\\"\\n\\n\\"No need to be modest,\\" Young Master Hua"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":3,"tokens":["珊枝"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"勉强不来的。」又问：「那漱芳呢？」素兰道：「漱芳是个和而不同的，外面虽和顺，内里却有把持。」公子道：「你看我的珊枝如何？你要直说，不许恭惟他。」素兰一想，这个倒定要恭惟几句才好，若实说了，是要闹出乱子来的，便道：「这个人还有什么议论呢？又忠直，又正派，知恩报恩，还有什么说话。公子恩能逾格，珊枝公而忘私，城外人都是这么讲。」公子大笑道：「这句话有些违心之论。我闻珊","en":"compliant on the outside, but holds firm on the inside.\\"\\n\\nYoung Master Hua asked, \\"And what do you think of my Shanzhi? Speak honestly, I forbid you to flatter him.\\"\\n\\nSulan thought for a moment, realizing he absolutely had to offer some flattery here; telling the blunt truth would only invite trouble. He said, \\"What is there to criticize about him? He is loyal, upright,"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":2,"tokens":["珊枝"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"回手。不过是这个意思。」素兰起初当是戏言，及听了这话，甚是感激，便道：「果然，天也晚了，也恐赶不出城，我也要与珊枝谈谈，就在他那里住罢。」公子道：「很好，我就去看那些东西。」说罢，带了小丫鬟进去了，一径到夫人房里，将素兰的和词给他瞧。夫人看了，赞好道：「是今天题的么？字不是你写的，是珊枝写的么？比往日好多了。」华公子笑道：「正是。」又道：「前日库房楼上那几箱的花","en":"is getting late, and I fear I wouldn't make it out of the city gates in time anyway. I also wish to chat with Shanzhi, so I will lodge in his quarters.\\"\\n\\n\\"Excellent,\\" Young Master Hua said. \\"I will go inspect those items now.\\"\\n\\nWith that, he took the little maid and went inside, heading straight for his wife's chambers to show her Sulan's lyric.\\n\\nLady Hua read it and"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":3,"tokens":["珊枝"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"素兰在珊枝房内歇了，珊枝听得素兰在公子面前赞他好，十分欢喜，就与素兰谈心，又要与他换帖。素兰虽不满珊枝，但见他这番相待，也乐得送情，应许了与他结盟。二人谈了半夜，方各安睡。","en":"Sulan rested in Shanzhi's room. Shanzhi, overjoyed to hear that Sulan had praised him in front of Young Master Hua, poured out his heart and proposed exchanging pledge cards to become sworn brothers. Although Sulan did not entirely respect him, seeing Shanzhi treat him with"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":5,"tokens":["珊枝"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"有枕簟、桌围、椅披，各色铺垫料，并零件荷囊、扇袋的花片子，共装了两大箱，算起价来，也值数千金，叫人抬出去，放在珊枝屋里。公子又问宝珠要出那文房什物以及玩器、书画闲放着不用的那本帐来。宝珠找了出来，公子看了，把笔点出了几十样是：「新坑大端砚四方、中端砚六方、歙石砚十方、假铜雀砚二方，徽墨二十匣、印色一斤，田黄石图章两匣、青田石图章两匣、寿山石图章十匣、昌化石图章十","en":"contents were easily worth thousands of taels of silver. Young Master Hua ordered them carried out and placed in Shanzhi's room.\\n\\nHe then asked Baozhu to bring the inventory ledger for the unused study items, curios, and calligraphy and paintings. Once Baozhu found it, Young Master Hua reviewed it and marked off dozens of items with his brush: \\"Four new-pit large Duan"}]}`),"char-43":{2:[{paragraph:40,mentions:1,tokens:["谭八"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"猷面前，请了一个安，娇声娇气的道「敬杨老爷一杯酒，务必赏个脸儿。」说着，把眼睛四下里飞了一转，宛然联锦班内京丑谭八的丑态，引得合席大笑，桂保笑得如花枝乱颤，杨方猷只得饮了一杯。孙亮功掐了一枝梅花，插在帽边，又取了一个大杯，捻手蹑脚的走到陆宗沅面前，斟了酒道：「陆都老爷是向来疼我的，敬你这一杯。」陆宗沅道：「这大杯如何使得？」孙亮功道：「想来都老爷是要吃皮杯的。」",en:"eyes darted flirtatiously around the table, perfectly mimicking the grotesque antics of the famous comic actor Tan Ba from the Lianjin troupe. The entire table convulsed with laughter, Guibao shaking like a branch of blossoms in the wind. Yang Fangyou had no choice but to down the cup. Sun Lianggong then plucked a sprig of plum blossom, tucked it jauntily into the brim"}]},"char-44":{5:[{paragraph:30,mentions:3,tokens:["小顺儿"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"轰了出去。你想这个标劲儿，他也不管人的脸上下得来下不来，就是随他性儿。那一日我原冒失些，我爱听《十不闲》，有个小顺儿是《十不闲》中的状元了，我想他必定也喜欢他。那个小顺儿上了妆，刚走上来，他见了就登时的怒容满面，冷笑了一声，他跟班的连忙把这小顺儿轰了下去，叫我脸上好下不来。看他以后，便话也不说，笑也不笑，才上了十几样菜，他就急于要走，再留不住，只得让他去了。还算赏",en:"was somewhat careless: I am fond of the *Ten Non-Idle Acts* variety songs, and there is a young performer named Xiaoshun'er who is the very champion of that genre. I thought surely he would like him too. When Xiaoshun'er came out in full costume and walked on, Young Master Hua's face instantly turned furious. He let out a cold laugh, and his attendants at once drove Xiaoshun'er"}]},"char-45":JSON.parse(`{"8":[{"paragraph":7,"mentions":1,"tokens":["二喜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「他叫什么？」仲雨未及回答，那相公急应道：「我叫二喜。」就问：「你能贵姓？」聘才与他说了。又问元茂道：「前日你在苏州会馆听戏，你和孙大少爷说话，你们相好有交情么？」","en":"\\"What is his name?\\" Before Zhongyu could answer, the performer eagerly chimed in, \\"My name is Erxi.\\" He then turned to Pincai, \\"And your honorable surname?\\" Pincai provided his name. Erxi then addressed Yuanmao, \\"The other day at the Suzhou Guild Hall, you were conversing with Young Master Sun. Are the two of you well acquainted?\\""},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":4,"tokens":["二喜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"元茂想道：「这个相公很多情，见了我他就记在心里，这也难得的，便含着两个黄眼珠，细细的睃着他。二喜索性过来，与他一凳坐了，问道：「你能常听戏，你喜欢那一家的戏？」元茂便支吾了两句。二喜把元茂的短烟袋装好了烟，吸着了送过来，元茂甚是得意，那两只眼，愈觉水汪汪的含着露水一般，心里喜欢极了，倒突突的跳，喉咙里痒痒的说不出话来。那相公便坐着不动。换了一出","en":"meeting is rare indeed.\\" And so, with his amber eyes fixed intently upon the young man, he observed him closely. Erxi unabashedly shifted closer, sharing the same bench as Yuanmao. \\"Do you often attend the theater?\\" he asked. \\"Which troupe do you favor?\\" Yuanmao mumbled a vague, noncommittal reply. Erxi deftly prepared a pinch of tobacco in Yuanmao's short pipe, lit"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":1,"tokens":["二喜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"两个黑相公，夹着个怯老斗，把个李元茂左顾右盼，应接不暇。保珠、二喜抢装烟，抢倒茶，一个挨紧了膀子，一个挤紧了腿。李元茂得意洋洋，乐得心花大放。","en":"the timid, country-bred patron found himself entirely overwhelmed, unable to attend to both at once. Baozhu and Erxi vied for his attention, competing to prepare his pipe and pour his tea. One pressed warmly against his shoulder, while the other squeezed intimately against his leg. Li Yuanmao was in seventh heaven, his heart blossoming with absolute delight."},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":1,"tokens":["二喜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"面楼上，同着前日唱《题曲》的那个小旦，陪着两个华冠丽服的人。不多一会，那两人带着他们走了，聘才好不扫兴。只听得二喜问元茂道：","en":"departed, taking the performers with them. Pincai felt a profound sense of disappointment. Just then, he heard Erxi ask Yuanmao:"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":1,"tokens":["二喜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"今日在什么地方？」元茂不懂，只把头点。又听得保珠问道：「今日咱们上那个馆子，我伺候你罢。」元茂支吾，说不出来。二喜又道：「今天才开了两三家，若去迟了，恐怕没有坐儿。」元茂心里想道：「这两个却都好，看这光景，两个都要去的，但恐所带的银子不够。」又想道：「两人给他十二吊钱，吃五六吊钱的酒菜，也够了。」便问聘才道：「我们走罢。」保珠便拉了元茂的手道：「到那个馆子？」聘","en":"restaurant shall we visit today? Allow me to wait upon you.\\" Yuanmao stammered, unable to form a coherent reply. Erxi pressed, \\"Only two or three establishments have opened today. If we delay, there may not be any tables left.\\" Yuanmao thought to himself, \\"Both are delightful company, and it seems they both wish to come. But I fear the silver I brought will not suffice.\\""},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":8,"tokens":["二喜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"来，叫声」张老爷，新年好！升官发财。」又作了个揖，仲雨也应酬了几句。拣了个雅座，仲雨首坐，元茂第二，聘才第三，二喜、保珠一凳坐了。走堂的送了茶，便请点菜。仲雨让元茂、聘才，二人又推仲雨先点，仲雨要的是瓦块鱼，烩鸭腰，聘才要的是炸肫、火腿。保殊要的是白蛤豆腐、炒虾仁。二喜要的是炒鱼片、卤牲口、黄焖肉。元茂道：「我喜欢吃鸡，我就是鸡罢。」走堂的及二喜都笑。拿了两壶酒","en":"selected an elegant private room, with Zhongyu taking the seat of honor, Yuanmao the second, and Pincai the third. Erxi and Baozhu squeezed onto a single stool together. A waiter served tea and presented the menu. Zhongyu offered the choice to Yuanmao and Pincai, who deferred back to him. Zhongyu ordered tile-shaped fish and braised duck kidneys, while Pincai requested"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":2,"tokens":["二喜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"再豁第二杯，二喜输了。二喜道：「有一人请客，没有钱买酒，拿一只空杯子，放在客人面前。主人说请，客人不动手。","en":"The second round was played, and this time Erxi lost. Erxi began his penalty: \\"There was once a man hosting a banquet, but he had no money for wine. He placed an empty cup before his guest. The host said, 'Please, drink,' but the guest did not move."},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":1,"tokens":["二喜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，客人道：「酒还没有来，请什么？」主人家就走过来，拿着杯子一瞧，道：「原来这杯酒是干巴巴的，你就这么饮了罢。」二喜就拿杯子送到元茂嘴边，元茂乐极，一饮就干。仲雨、聘才齐声说「好」！保珠道：「这个笑话实在说得有趣。」便也斟了一杯酒，送到聘才嘴边，叫道：「干爸爸饮这杯。」聘才也喜欢，干了。","en":"cup, and said, 'Ah, it seems this wine is utterly bone-dry. You had best drink it just as it is.'\\" With that, Erxi raised his own cup to Yuanmao's lips. Overjoyed, Yuanmao drained it in a single gulp. Zhongyu and Pincai erupted in cheers of \\"Bravo!\\" Baozhu added, \\"That joke was truly delightful.\\" He then poured a cup of wine, brought it to Pincai's lips, and called"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":2,"tokens":["二喜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"豁第三杯又是元茂赢了。二喜便含着一口酒，双手捧了元茂的脸，口对口的灌下。元茂心里快活，脸上害躁，已咽了半口，忽低着头一笑，这口酒就从鼻孔里倒冲出来，绝像撒出两条黄溺，淋淋漓漓，标了一桌。李元茂的脑门子，又痒又辣，便伏在二喜肩上抬不起头。保珠笑得坐不牢，已塌下凳子，坐在地上。仲","en":"The third round saw Yuanmao victorious. Erxi took a mouthful of wine, cradled Yuanmao's face in both hands, and delivered the wine mouth-to-mouth. Yuanmao was in raptures, though his face flushed with embarrassment. Just as he swallowed half the mouthful, he suddenly lowered his head and chuckled."},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":1,"tokens":["二喜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"二喜带笑拍着元茂的胸，元茂才抬起了头，闭了眼，张开口，鼻孔里还觉痒的，打了几个嚏喷，停了多时，方才说道：「有什么好笑？」众人见他这光景，又笑了一会，吃了几样菜。","en":"Laughing, Erxi patted Yuanmao's chest until he finally raised his head. His eyes closed, his mouth agape, his nostrils still tickling, he let out several loud sneezes. After a long pause, he finally asked, \\"What is so funny?\\" Seeing his bewildered state, the others"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":8,"tokens":["二喜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"二喜便斟了酒与张仲雨豁了一拳。仲雨输了，元茂便催仲雨唱。仲雨道：「这不难。」饮了一杯酒，唱了个《马头调》，大家却赞声」好」。第二杯又系仲雨输了，要说笑话。仲雨抬头，见屋子里钉着一个小神龛，供一张赵玄坛骑个黑虎，即对二喜道：「你们见了有钱的老斗，便喜欢道：","en":"Erxi then poured wine and engaged Zhang Zhongyu in a round. Zhongyu lost, and Yuanmao eagerly demanded a song. \\"That is simple enough,\\" Zhongyu replied. He downed a cup of wine and sang a verse of the 'Horse-Head Tune,' drawing cheers of approval from the"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":2,"tokens":["二喜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"元茂便如醍醐灌顶，乐不可言。大家听他喉咙里头咭咯咭咯的，咽了三咽。二喜又斟了酒，轮到聘才了。第一拳是二喜输了，唱了一枝《九连环》。","en":"poured over his crown; his joy was beyond words. The others listened as he audibly gulped three distinct times. Erxi poured more wine, and it was Pincai's turn. Erxi lost the first round and sang a verse of the 'Nine Linked Rings'."},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":8,"tokens":["二喜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"皮杯罢」这一阵笑，却也笑得可听，元茂笑出眼泪来，骂道：「你这个恶人，明日就要变哑叭子。「笑得保珠滚在聘才怀里，二喜便过来，把聘才打了一下，道：「那里有这样坏人，骂人骂入骨的。」第三杯偏偏又是二喜输了，二喜拿着酒道：「怎样唱？你吩咐。」聘才即板起脸来道：「你听了张老爷的话，不听我的话，你就瞧不起我，我今儿不依你。」二喜吃惊道：「我没有得罪你。」聘才道：「你虽然没有","en":"wicked man! You will surely be struck dumb by tomorrow!\\" Baozhu laughed until he collapsed into Pincai's lap. Erxi marched over and slapped Pincai lightly on the arm. \\"Is there anyone more wicked than you? Your insults cut straight to the bone!\\" By some twist of fate, Erxi lost the third round. Holding the wine, he asked, \\"How shall I sing it? You command.\\" Feigning"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":1,"tokens":["二喜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"聘才忽见一个和尚走进来，口中说道：「我的二老爷！你在这里，我走了七八个戏园子，那一处不寻到？」二喜、保珠见了和尚都请了安，聘才、元茂也站起来招呼。和尚都作了揖，与仲雨一凳坐了。聘才看那和尚相貌，是个紫糖色方脸，两撇浓须，有四十来岁，戴个绒僧帽，穿件宝蓝绸狐皮僧袍，腰拴黄丝绦，足下挖云青缎毛儿窝，也没有出家人的光景，定是酒肉和尚。","en":"Master!\\" the monk exclaimed. \\"Here you are! I have scoured seven or eight theaters looking for you!\\" Seeing the monk, Erxi and Baozhu both offered respectful greetings, while Pincai and Yuanmao rose to acknowledge him. The monk returned their bows and took a seat beside Zhongyu. Pincai appraised the newcomer: a square face the color of dark sugar, two thick mustaches, perhaps"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":5,"tokens":["二喜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"珠笑嘻嘻的道：「唐老爷，你那位少爷，倒没有带出来？」唐和尚笑道：「岂有此理！和尚连奶奶都没有，那里来的少爷？」二喜道：「你那位少爷，也与奶奶一样。」唐和尚一手就伸到二喜脸上来。二喜笑道：「我说和奶奶的模样长得一样，没有说错呀。」唐和尚见有聘才、元茂在坐，便也假装斯文，缩回手来，说道：「你们糟蹋佛门弟子，是有罪过的。」仲雨、聘才大笑。唐和尚又催仲雨起身，仲雨道：「","en":"with you?\\" Monk Tang barked a laugh. \\"Preposterous! A monk doesn't even have a wife, where would I get a son?\\" Erxi retorted, \\"Your 'son' looks just like a wife anyway.\\" Tang reached out to pinch Erxi's cheek. Erxi dodged, laughing, \\"I only said he looks like a wife, I wasn't wrong!\\" Noting Pincai and Yuanmao's presence, the monk feigned scholarly dignity, withdrawing"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":1,"tokens":["二喜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"聘才、元茂又与保珠豁了一轮拳，保珠也敬了两次皮杯。，二喜又要了几样莱，重又闹了好一回，已点了半枝蜡烛。约有定更后了。两个相公都也困乏，两个跟兔在风门口站着。李元茂不知颠倒，饮汤饮酒，除下帽子，头上热气腾腾，如蒸笼一般。聘才道：「咱们也好散了。」轻轻的凑着元茂耳边道：「你拿那东西出来，交给柜上算钱罢。」元茂","en":"Pincai and Yuanmao played another round of games with Baozhu, who offered two more skin-cups. Erxi ordered several more dishes, and the revelry continued for some time, well past the lighting of the candles, deep into the first watch of the night. The two performers were growing weary, and the two servants stood waiting by the wind-break door. Utterly"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":6,"tokens":["二喜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"二喜走出来道：「你们在院子里商量些什么？」二人重又进屋，坐下。二喜便说：「天不早了。」又到元茂耳边一凑道：「你到我家里去，我伺候你。」元茂听了这句，心里又喜又急，脸上发起烧来，只顾看着聘才发怔。保珠、二喜猜不出什么意思。聘才只得对元茂道：「丢了这包银子，","en":"Erxi stepped out and asked, \\"What are you two discussing out here?\\" They returned inside and took their seats. \\"It is growing late,\\" Erxi noted. He leaned intimately into Yuanmao's ear and whispered, \\"Come back to my place; I will take good care of you.\\""},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":5,"tokens":["二喜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"求你能那里转一转手，省得我们为难。」即对二喜道：「喜哥，可不是这样么？」元茂道：「与你们说，你们不信。我今日是带着八块银子，足有十两多。也没有包，装在一个搭链袋里，他倒连袋子都拿去了。此时要我们别处去借，那里去借？不是个难题目难人。」二喜鼻子里哼了一声道：「此时尚早，你何不叫你们二爷回去取了来","en":"\\"We only ask that you find some way to spare us this hardship,\\" Baozhu pleaded. He turned to Erxi, \\"Brother Xi, is that not fair?\\" Yuanmao insisted, \\"I am telling you the truth, yet you refuse to believe me! I had eight pieces of silver today, well over ten taels, loose in a pouch, and the thief took the pouch and all. To ask us to borrow money at"},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":2,"tokens":["二喜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"重而道远，恐难担也。」聘才只得又再三央求，嗣徽勉强答应，说道：「明日可以与则与之，人而无信，不知其可也。」即对二喜、保珠道：「来，余与尔言，盍去诸？明日亲送之门，毋逼人太甚也。」两个相公不能明白，嗣徽只得说了几句平话。保珠、二喜见嗣徽担了，也就没法，只得勉勉强强，谢了一声而去。孙嗣徽恐他们又要他担起馆子帐来，便急急的走了。","en":"be given,\\" he intoned solemnly. \\"'A man without integrity, who knows what becomes of him?'\\" He then turned to Erxi and Baozhu. \\"Come, let me speak plainly with you. Why not take your leave now? Tomorrow I shall personally deliver the funds to your door. Do not press people too harshly.\\" Finding his classical rhetoric incomprehensible, Sihui was forced to repeat his"}],"9":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["二喜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"元茂无言可答，各自安睡。到了次日，只得央了许顺，借了十吊钱的票子，分作两张，写了一封字，叫四儿送与叶茂林，分给二喜、保珠。后来子玉盘问，聘才、元茂只推张仲雨请去听戏下馆子，却将实情瞒过了。","en":"into two drafts. Wrapping them with a letter, they had Si'er deliver the money to Ye Maolin to distribute between Erxi and Baozhu. Later, when Ziyu asked, Pincai and Yuanmao simply claimed that Zhang Zhongyu had treated them to opera and a restaurant, keeping the truth concealed."}],"12":[{"paragraph":22,"mentions":1,"tokens":["二喜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，并不见蓉官过来照应他。只听得蓉官说道：「二老爷，昨日有人很感你的情。」那胖子道：「是谁？」蓉官道：「联锦班的二喜，说你很疼他，给他好些东西，在你家住了一夜，有没有？」那胖子道：","en":"Master, someone was very grateful for your kindness yesterday.\\" The plump man said: \\"Who was that?\\" Rongguan said: \\"Erxi of the Lianzhu troupe — he says you are very good to him, gave him quite a number of things, and he stayed at your house for a night. Is that right?\\" The plump man said:"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":1,"tokens":["二喜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"他。那日魏老爷同他进城喝了几钟酒，天晚了，出不了城，就留他住下。早上逛了庙，他要买了几样零碎东西，就出去的。这二喜倒罢了，肯巴结。」蓉官道：「此刻是尽讲究巴结了。我们的师傅不好，当年教戏时，就没有教会巴结。」","en":"In the morning they visited a temple, and then he said he wanted to buy a few small things and went out. This Erxi is all right — he knows how to make himself agreeable.\\" Rongguan said: \\"Nowadays everyone is about making themselves agreeable. Our master was not good enough — when he was teaching us to perform, he forgot to teach us how to make ourselves agreeable.\\""}],"19":[{"paragraph":10,"mentions":2,"tokens":["二喜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"托什么。」聘才道：「还有个琪官也是很好的，我正月里叫过他几回，倒是全来的。」聘才又写了条子去叫琪官，梅窗另叫了二喜。走堂的道：「琪官打发人去叫了。二喜在那边陪客已经吃过饭，就散了。」","en":"the first month, and he always came.\\" Pincai then wrote a slip to call Qiguan, and Meichuang separately called Erxi. The waiter said: \\"Someone has been sent to call Qiguan. Erxi has already finished eating with some guests over there, and they are just breaking up.\\""},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":9,"tokens":["二喜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"走堂的知会了二喜，不多一刻，二喜就过来，对各人请过安，就在梅窗肩下坐了。斟了一巡酒，送了一巡菜，便问道：「今日席间还叫谁？」梅窗道：「叫的都是有病的，不能来。」聘才见了二喜，便不大欢喜，因正月里吃了他多少刻薄话。二喜倒不记在心，且那日开发，聘才明日即已送去，没有漂他","en":"The waiter informed Erxi; before long, Erxi came over, greeted everyone in turn, and sat down beside Meichuang. After pouring a round of wine and presenting a round of food, he asked: \\"Who else is called to the table today?\\" Meichuang said: \\"The ones called are all ill and cannot"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":9,"tokens":["二喜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"闹了一阵，只不见蓉官、琪官到来。笑梅道：「奇了，今日是忌辰，倒叫不出相公来。」二喜道：「还有那个？」笑梅道：「你们班里的琪官，还有联珠的蓉官。」二喜道：「蓉官，我出门时见他到三合楼去的，只怕还没有散。」梅窗道：「那玉林是你们同班的，他真有病吗？」二喜道：「玉林阿！不要说起，他同琪官前日都闹了一件事，几乎闹出人命来。他们的师傅，此刻","en":"arrived. Xiaomei said: \\"How strange. Today is a memorial anniversary, yet we can't even call out any young protégés.\\" Erxi said: \\"Who else is there?\\" Xiaomei said: \\"Qiguan from your troupe, and Rongguan from Lianzhu.\\" Erxi said: \\"As for Rongguan, when I left the house I saw him going to the Sanhe Restaurant; I expect they haven't broken up yet.\\" Meichuang said: \\"That Yulin"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":1,"tokens":["二喜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「你快说罢。」二喜也喝了酒，又说道：「这琪官也苦极了，手又缩不出来，便使起性子来，不顾疼痛，用力乱扭，把那机巧扭坏了，琪官这两只手却刮得稀烂，血淋淋的，也就哭骂出来。他因小脑袋疼痛，也就躲了。琪官回去告诉了师傅，他与袁宝珠相好，又告诉了宝珠，宝珠气极，便进怡园与徐老爷","en":"\\"Get on with it.\\" Erxi drank some wine and continued: \\"Qiguan was also in a terrible state. His hands couldn't be withdrawn, and he became furious; ignoring the pain, he wrenched and twisted with all his strength until the mechanism was broken. Qiguan's two hands were scraped"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":3,"tokens":["二喜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"啐了两口。梅窗道：「他这个桶子，咱们京里不知会做不会做？」笑梅笑道：「你也要学样子么？」梅窗笑了一笑。聘才笑对二喜道：「你讲得这么清楚，这桶子你想必看过的了。」二喜脸上一红，便斜睃了一眼，就要拧聘才的嘴。梅窗道：「他未必要用着桶子。」二喜又将梅窗拧了两把，说道：「咱们作买卖的人，有钱就好，何必那样拿身分呢。可惜他们不像你能会看风水，所以才吃了这场苦。」","en":"Xiaomei laughed: \\"Are you thinking of copying the design?\\" Meichuang gave a little laugh. Pincai laughed and said to Erxi: \\"You've described it so clearly, you must have had a look at the barrel yourself.\\" Erxi's face reddened, and with a sideways glance he reached over to pinch Pincai's mouth. Meichuang said: \\"He probably doesn't need to use the barrel.\\" Erxi then gave"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":4,"tokens":["二喜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"说罢自己也笑了。聘才心中暗忖道：「倒不料琴官、琪官，既唱了戏，还这么傲性子，有骨气，这也奇了。」即问二喜道这奚十一到底是什么人？这样横行霸道，又这样有钱？」二喜道：「我听得春兰讲，说也是个少爷，他家祖太爷做过布政司，他父亲现做提督呢。」聘才道：「如今春兰呢？」二喜道：「同出去了。」于是大家又谈谈笑笑，又喝了一回酒。看看天气将晚，笑梅、聘才皆要进城，只得","en":"Having said this, Erxi laughed himself. Pincai thought privately: \\"Who would have expected that Qinguan and Qiguan, even as performers, should be so proud and dignified, so steadfast in their principles. That is something to marvel at.\\" He then asked Erxi who exactly this"}],"21":[{"paragraph":14,"mentions":1,"tokens":["二喜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"处了，我也没有问他在那里。」素兰道：「我听走堂的说起来，却说得原原委委。新年上，这姓魏的同了几个人，带着保珠、二喜，吃了五十几吊钱，掌柜的因不认识，写账的时候，想必说了什么话。","en":"where.\\" Sulan said: \\"The waiters told the tale end to end. New Year's week this Wei and others brought Baozhu and Erxi — fifty-odd strings — the boss did not know him and must have spoken out of turn when tallying credit.\\""}],"24":[{"paragraph":8,"mentions":2,"tokens":["二喜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"。」玉林道：「我却当不起这考语。」王恂道：「还有几个人索性请你批评批评。」桂保笑道：「是谁？」王恂道：「蓉官、二喜、玉美、春林、凤林，这些人又是怎样？」桂保笑道：「这又是一路，不与我们往来的。我们是玉虚门下弟子，是兴周伐纣的，他们是通天教主门人，是助纣为虐的。这些人是龟灵圣母、申公豹等类，却也有些旁门左道的神通，倒也利害。我们那一日运气不好？与他们同席，便小小心","en":"Ruixiang's insight grows by the day.\\" Yulin modestly demurred. Wang Xun then asked for their judgment on Rongguan, Erxi, Yumei, Chunlin, and Fenglin—the outsiders. Guibao laughed, \\"They belong to an entirely different school! We are the disciples of the Yuqing gate, crusading for the Zhou; they are of the Tongtian sect, aiding the tyrants—they are like the tortoise-spirit"}],"29":[{"paragraph":20,"mentions":1,"tokens":["二喜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"言的，有爱造言生事的，七张八嘴，改头换面，添起枝叶，把个子玉、琴言说得无所不至。不料王通政在人家席上遇着蓉官、二喜等类，就把子玉、琴言的事说得活龙活现。文辉本看过子玉之病，也觉得病的有些古怪，只不晓得是相思病。今听了这些话，心上着实不爽快，因想道：","en":"between Ziyu and Qinyan sounded utterly unspeakable. One evening, Wang Wenhui ran into the actors Rongguan and Erxi at a lavish feast. There, he heard the yarn spun as vividly as living dragons. He had seen Ziyu's sickness with his own eyes and had thought it odd at the time, but he had never once guessed it was lovesickness. Listening to the wild tales now, his heart"}],"51":[{"paragraph":26,"mentions":1,"tokens":["二喜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"」孙氏即给他四十两银子，说道：「你快去还了正经账目，不要去混花消了。」元茂大喜，得了银子，又起了邪念，想到：「二喜待我这两年颇为不薄，如今远别，怎好不给他十吊钱。但这四十两只够还账，不能有余，怎么好呢？」想了半夜，想出一个方法，去年借聘才的金镯子，若取了出来，照时价换了，可以多得五六十吊钱，可不是帐也还了，别敬也有了。","en":"nonsense!\\" Overjoyed at receiving the silver, Yuanmao's corrupt thoughts quickly resurfaced. He reasoned to himself: \\"Erxi has treated me exceptionally well these past two years. Now that we are parting for a distant place, how can I justify not giving him ten strings of cash? But these forty taels are barely enough to cover my debts, leaving no surplus. What am I to do?\\""},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":2,"tokens":["二喜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"色，换了十四换，元茂不肯。又到一家，倒又少了半换，只得十三换半。元茂心中纳闷，把镯子带上手，一路的闯去。忽然见二喜坐着车，劈面过来，见了元茂忙下来，一把拉住，说道：「今日叫我找着了。我听得你要出京，又知道你中了秀才，也不知找你多少回，我们也多时没有坐坐了。」便拉着元茂，上了车。元茂本来想他，便忘了要事，一径同到了二喜寓处。","en":"half. Frustrated and brooding, Yuanmao slipped the bracelet onto his wrist and stalked down the street. Suddenly, Erxi's carriage appeared, heading straight toward him. Seeing Yuanmao, Erxi hastily jumped down and grabbed him tight. \\"I've finally found you today!\\" Erxi cried. \\"I heard you were leaving the capital, and that you'd passed your licentiate exams. I've searched"},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":16,"tokens":["二喜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"进了客房，二喜道：「你此番去了，几时才来？你倒忍心撇得下我么？」说罢，便窜在元茂怀里道：「我跟你去罢！你去了，我在京里也没有疼我的人，不如咱苦苦乐乐的在一块儿。」说到此，两眼红红的，像要淌下泪来。元茂见了，好不伤心，也擦了眼睛，道：「若说跟我去的话，此时不用说他，","en":"Once inside the guest room, Erxi clung to him and asked, \\"You're leaving this time—when will you return? Can you truly bear to cast me aside?\\" With that, he buried his face in Yuanmao's chest and pleaded, \\"Let me go with you! Once you leave, there will be no one in this capital who"},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":6,"tokens":["二喜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"二喜知觉，把手伸过来一攥，仰着脸，望了元茂哈哈哈的几声，把手一紧，元茂一酥，说道：「了不得了。」便侧转身子来，把二喜紧紧的一搂，也算了春风一度，把裤裆擦了一擦。二喜又与元茂上了几口烟，一手把着元茂的手放在自己的脸上，道：「从前有位张少爷，也与我相好，我也","en":"Sensing his arousal, Erxi reached down and gave him a firm squeeze. Tilting his face upward, he let out a few bright peals of laughter while tightening his grip. Yuanmao went weak with pleasure, gasping, \\"This is unbearable!\\" He turned, pulled Erxi tightly against him, and they"},{"paragraph":30,"mentions":1,"tokens":["二喜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"元茂睡了一觉醒来，见烟灯也收了，叫了一声：「二喜！」不见答应，擦擦眼睛，走了出来。只见那边房里，欢呼畅饮。","en":"When Yuanmao finally woke from his slumber, he found the opium lamp had been cleared away. He called out, \\"Erxi!\\" but received no answer. Rubbing his bleary eyes, he walked out of the room. From an adjacent chamber, the sounds of boisterous cheering and heavy drinking drifted out."},{"paragraph":31,"mentions":2,"tokens":["二喜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"有些人，还有几个相公，唱的唱，豁拳的豁拳。元茂见跟二喜的人站在门口，叫了他过来，问道：「二喜呢？」那人道：「在那里陪酒。」说了，又站到那里去了。元茂此时酒已醒了，一想心中有事，便一径出来。到了家，方知镯子被他狼去，心里甚急，再去找他，又不在家了，一肚子苦说不出来，丧气而回。孙氏问他为何出去了大半天才回，","en":"accompanied by several actors. Some were singing, while others bellowed as they played drinking-fist games. Spotting Erxi's attendant standing near the door, Yuanmao called him over and asked, \\"Where is Erxi?\\" The man replied curtly, \\"He's in there, keeping the guests company,\\" before turning away and resuming his post. Now fully sober, the reality of his pressing errands"}]}`),"char-47":JSON.parse(`{"1":[{"paragraph":4,"mentions":5,"tokens":["士燮","铁庵"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"此书不着姓名，究不知何代何年何地何人所作。书中开首说一极忘情之人，生一极钟情之子。这人姓梅，名士燮，号铁庵．江南金陵人氏；是个阀阅世家，现任翰林院侍读学士，寓居城南鸣珂里。其祖名鼎，曾任吏部尚书；其父名羹调，曾任文华殿大学士，三代单传。士燮于十七岁中了进士，入了翰林，迄今已二十九年，行年四十六岁了。家世本是金、张，经术复师马、郑。贵胃偏崇儒素，词","en":"detached from feeling, who sires a son profoundly devoted to feeling. The father's surname is Mei, his personal name Shixie, and his style name Tie'an, a native of Jinling in Jiangnan. Born into an illustrious lineage, he currently holds the post of Reader-in-Waiting at the Hanlin Academy, residing in Mingke Lane in the southern sector of the city. His grandfather, Ding,"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":4,"tokens":["士燮"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这颜庄在日，与士燮既系郎舅至亲，又有雷陈至契。不料于三十岁即赴召玉楼，他夫人郑氏绝食殉节。那时仲清年甫三龄，士燮抚养在家，又与郑氏夫人请旌表烈。仲清在士燮处，到十九岁上中了个副车。是年士燮与其作伐，赘于同乡同年现任通政司王文辉家为婿。这王文辉是颜夫人的表兄，与仲清亲上","en":"When Yan Zhuang was alive, he shared not only the intimate bond of a brother-in-law with Shixie but also a profound friendship akin to that of Lei and Chen. Tragically, he was summoned to the Jade Pavilion at the mere age of thirty, and his wife, Lady Zheng, starved herself to death to preserve her chastity and follow him. At that time, Zhongqing"}],"2":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":4,"tokens":["士燮"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"人，大约还不满四席了。」王文辉又到里头去见了颜夫人，彼此道了些家常闲话，即提起他次女琼华十六岁了，尚未字人，托士燮留心物色。士燮答应，随又说道：「择女婿也是一件难事，尽有外貌甚好，内里平常。也有小时聪明，大来变坏的。」颜夫人接口说道：「这总是各人的姻缘。非但拣女婿难，就是要替你外甥定一头亲事也是不容易的。文辉道：「要像外甥这样好的，那里去选呢？」正说着，只见一个","en":"pleasantries, he mentioned that his second daughter, Qionghua, was now sixteen and yet to be betrothed, entrusting Shixie to seek out a suitable match. Shixie agreed, yet added a caveat, \\"Choosing a son-in-law is a daunting endeavor. There are those with handsome exteriors who prove unremarkable within, equally, some show early brilliance only to falter in adulthood.\\" Lady"},{"paragraph":2,"mentions":2,"tokens":["士燮"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"士燮道：「这称呼是小门生，不知那里来的？这魏聘才又是谁呢？」王文辉道：「世愚侄，不要是魏老仁的儿子么？」士燮道：「只怕是的，今年夏间接着老仁的信，说要打发他儿子进京弄一小功名，托我收留照应的话。若论老魏人品，实在下作，惟在你我面上，还算有点真情。」文辉道","en":"Shixie pondered, \\"'Your devoted later student', what a peculiar title. I wonder where he hails from? And who might this Wei Pincai be?\\" Wang Wenhui suggested, \\"'Your humble nephew of the next generation', could it be the son of Wei Laoren?\\" Shixie nodded, \\"I"},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":1,"tokens":["士燮"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"既是他儿子远来投奔，老弟也是义无所辞的。」士燮叫梅进进来问了，果然是他。一个是西席李先生之子。吩咐梅进：","en":"his son has traveled this great distance to seek refuge, you are bound by duty and cannot well turn him away.\\" Shixie summoned Mei Jin to verify their identities, and indeed, one was the son of Mr. Li, the resident tutor. He then instructed Mei Jin:"},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":1,"tokens":["士燮"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「请他们在花厅上坐，说我就出来。」文辉也就起身告辞，士燮送到门口，转身到花厅垂花门首，即叫跟班的到书房去请少爷出来，遂即踱进花厅。","en":"to take a seat in the flower hall and inform them I shall be out shortly.\\" Wenhui then rose to take his leave. Shixie saw him to the door, turned back to the hanging flower gate of the hall, and instructed his attendant to summon the young master from the study before strolling inside."},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":3,"tokens":["士燮"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"；下首一个身材笨拙，面色微黄，浓眉近视，俱约有二十几岁光景。那上首的跄步上前，满面笑容，口称老伯，就跪下叩头。士燮还礼不迭，起来看道：「老世台的尊范，与令尊竟是一模一样。」聘才正要答应，李元茂已高高的作了一个揖，然后徐徐跪下，如拜神的拜了四拜。士燮两手扶起，说道：「你令尊正盼望你来，一路辛苦了。」那李元茂掀唇动齿的咕噜了一句，也听不明白。士燮让他们坐了，聘才道：","en":"end stepped forward, his face all smiles, addressed him as \\"Uncle,\\" and dropped to his knees in a deep kowtow. Shixie hastily returned the courtesy, studied him for a moment, and said, \\"You carry the distinguished bearing of your family, you are the very image of your father.\\" Pincai was about to reply when Li Yuanmao raised his clasped hands high in a sweeping bow,"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":3,"tokens":["士燮"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「士燮问了他父母好。子玉出来，见过了礼，士燮即叫子玉引元茂去见他父亲，子玉即同了元茂、聘才到书房去了。士燮吩咐家人许顺，收拾书房后身另院的两间屋子，给他们暂且住下。","en":"Shixie courteously asked after his parents' health. When Ziyu emerged and exchanged formal greetings, Shixie promptly instructed him to escort Yuanmao to meet his father. Ziyu then led both Yuanmao and Pincai toward the study. Meanwhile, Shixie ordered the"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":1,"tokens":["士燮"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"元茂到上屋去拜见了颜夫人，又将南边带来的土仪与他父亲的书信一并呈上，书中无非恳切求照应的话。另有致王文辉一信，士燮叫他迟日亲自送去。这聘才本是个聪明人，又经乃父陶镕，这一张嘴，真个千伶百俐，善于哄骗，所以在梅宅不到十天，满宅的人都说他好。子玉虽与其两道，然觉此人也无可厌处，尚可藉以盘桓，遣此岑寂。","en":"with earnest pleas for continued patronage and care. Among the missives was a letter addressed to Wang Wenhui, Shixie instructed Pincai to deliver it personally at a later date. Pincai was inherently clever and had been thoroughly molded by his father's worldly tutelage. His tongue possessed a thousand nimble tricks, endlessly adept at charming and cajoling. Consequently,"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":2,"tokens":["士燮","梅铁庵"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"送去。适文辉一早出门未回，王恂也不在家，只得请颜仲清会了。聘才见仲清一表非凡，叙了一番寒温，知是文辉之婿，又是士燮的内侄，免不得恭惟一番。正要告辞，只见一个跟班捧着一包衣服进来说：「老爷回来了。」聘才只得坐下。停了一会，听得外面有说话的声音，像是定班子唱戏的话。然后靴声秃秃，见一个大方脸，花白长须，三品服饰，仪容甚伟，貂裘耀目，粉底皂靴，走将进来。聘才知是主人，","en":"demeanor, Pincai engaged him in polite pleasantries. Learning that Zhongqing was Wenhui's son-in-law as well as Shixie's nephew by marriage, Pincai was generous with his flattery. He was just preparing to take his leave when a servant entered, bearing a bundle of clothes, and announced, \\"The master has returned.\\" Pincai felt obliged to remain seated. After a brief pause,"}],"5":[{"paragraph":39,"mentions":1,"tokens":["士燮"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"房中也点着两对红烛、四盏素玻璃灯，元茂上前叩了头。聘才也来辞岁，性全连忙还礼，即同了他们到老师、师母跟前辞岁，士燮挡住了。颜夫人即吩咐子玉出去叩贺先生，梅学士即领了子玉，来到书房，彼此贺毕，便摆上酒肴。","en":"hastily returned the courtesies, then led them to pay their New Year's respects to their Teacher and Teacher's Wife. Scholar Mei stopped them from the full formality of bowing. Lady Yan immediately instructed Ziyu to go out and offer New Year's greetings to the Teacher. Scholar Mei then personally escorted Ziyu to the study; they exchanged congratulations, and wine and food were"},{"paragraph":41,"mentions":1,"tokens":["士燮"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"士燮是个言方行矩的人，更配上那个李性全，席间无非讲些修身立行，勉励子玉的话。李元茂拘拘束束，菜也不敢吃，坐着好不难受。倒是聘才还能假充老实，学些迂腐的话，与他们谈谈。不多一会，也就散了席。梅学士又在外坐了一会，讲了好些话，然后同了子玉进去。性全、元茂等亦","en":"Scholar Mei was a man of strict speech and upright conduct, and now paired with Li Xingquan, the conversation at the table was nothing but discourse on self-cultivation and moral rectitude, all words of exhortation to Ziyu. Li Yuanmao sat stiff and constrained,"}],"6":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["士燮"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"左庶子郑、通政司王、光禄寺少卿周、国子监司业张、吏科给事中史、掌山西道陆、兵部员外郎杨、工部郎中孙、共十二位。士燮看了比去年人更少了，叫小厮拿两副帖，到书房里去与魏、李两位少爷。","en":"Yang; and Director of the Ministry of Works Sun. Noting that there were even fewer names than the previous year, Scholar Mei instructed a young servant to convey two sets of cards to the study for the young gentlemen, Wei and Li."},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":1,"tokens":["士燮"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"：「王少爷、颜少爷来了多时了，诸位老爷早已到齐。」遂一直引至正座，见已开了戏。座中诸老辈，子玉尚有几位不认识，士燮指点他一一见了礼，这些老前辈个个称赞不休。随后聘才、元茂上来与王文辉见礼。聘才还生得伶俐，这元茂又系近视眼，再加上那套衣服，转动不便，一个揖作完，站起来，不料把文辉的帽子碰歪在一边。文辉连忙整好，元茂也涨红了脸，就想走开。","en":"operatic performance was already underway. Among the distinguished elders, there were several Ziyu had yet to meet; Scholar Mei pointed them out, and Ziyu offered his respects to each, receiving lavish praise in return. Pincai and Yuanmao then stepped forward to greet Wang Wenhui. Pincai, nimble and composed, managed the introduction smoothly; Yuanmao, however, hindered by his"}],"15":[{"paragraph":3,"mentions":3,"tokens":["士燮"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，说得琴言着实感激，并与琴言约定了，明日同子玉前来相会。回来与子玉说知，子玉便添了一件心事，一夜未曾睡着。是夕士燮在尚书房值宿未回。到了次日，子玉正要打算和聘才去看琴言。忽见门上梅进满面笑容的进来，说道：「恭喜少爷，老爷放了江西学差，报喜的现在门口。」子玉听了也觉喜欢，便同着梅进到里头报与颜夫人知道，颜夫人欣喜更不必说。李性全就同元茂、聘才到上头去道了喜。少顷，","en":"this, and Ziyu found himself with yet another thing to weigh on his heart, and lay awake all night. That evening, Shixie was on night duty at the Imperial Study and had not come home. The next day, Ziyu was just making plans to go with Pincai to see Qinyan when suddenly Mei Jin, the gatekeeper, came in with a face full of smiles and announced: \\"Congratulations to the young"},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":5,"tokens":["士燮"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"士燮也择于三月初十日动身，今日已是初五了。颜夫人与士燮说道：「新年上，孙家太太为媒，与王表嫂面订了二姑娘，将玉簪子为定。你如今又远行了，也须过个礼，不是这样就算的，别要教人怪起来。」士燮笑道：「你不说我竟想不起，这个是必要的，明日就请孙伯敬为媒就是了。」","en":"Shixie had also chosen the tenth of the third month for his own departure, and today was already the fifth. Lady Yan said to Shixie: \\"At the New Year, Madam Sun acted as matchmaker and a verbal agreement was reached with Cousin Wang's wife for the second daughter,"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":1,"tokens":["士燮"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"次日，颜夫人备了彩盒礼帖，请亮功来，送了过去。文辉处回礼丰盛，有颜仲清帮同亮功押了回来，士燮备酒相待。是日不请外客，就请聘才、元茂相陪。这李元茂今日福至心灵，说话竟清楚起来。性全出京时留下二百两银子与他，元茂买了几件衣裳，混身光亮。亮功眼力本是平常，今见了元茂团头大脸，书气满容，便许为佳士，大有余润之意，便问起他的姻事来。仲清早已看明，便竭","en":"them. The return gifts from the Wenhui household were lavish; Yan Zhongqing helped Lianggong bring them back, and Shixie hosted a wine reception. That day no outside guests were invited; only Pincai and Yuanmao were asked to keep the company. This Li Yuanmao had, at this auspicious moment, achieved a sudden clarity of mind — his speech became quite articulate. When Xingquan"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":4,"tokens":["士燮"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"那李元茂，也不是个佳婿，呆头呆脑的，那一天作个揖，就将我的帽子碰歪，只好娶这样媳妇。」便应允了。为这件事，特到士燮处来，将亮功之意达之士燮。士燮大喜，就请了聘才、元茂出来，聘才自然一口赞成，元茂十分畅满。士燮就与元茂代写了求允帖，交与文辉，于初六日过了礼帖。这是千里姻缘，百年前定，李元茂这个呆子巴不得明日就赘了过去，才可免指头儿告了消乏。","en":"knocked my hat askew with his head. They'll suit each other perfectly.\\" So he agreed. He went specifically to Shixie's residence to convey Lianggong's intentions. Shixie was greatly pleased; he called Pincai and Yuanmao out, Pincai naturally gave his wholehearted approval, and Yuanmao was thoroughly delighted. Shixie then wrote on Yuanmao's behalf a letter formally"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":2,"tokens":["士燮"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"少顷，士燮送了客出去，便叫出子玉来，教训了一番。又叮嘱了元茂、聘才几句。然后与夫人别了，即上车起程，颜仲清、王恂、魏聘才、李元茂一起随后，颜夫人领着子玉，并有些仆妇丫鬟一群的车，也送出城来。城外是王文辉、孙亮功等十几个同年至好，一齐在旗亭饯别。士燮盘桓了一会，","en":"Shortly afterward, Shixie finished seeing off other guests and called Ziyu out to deliver a thorough admonition. He then also gave a few words of instruction to Yuanmao and Pincai. After that he bade farewell to Lady Yan, mounted his carriage, and departed. Yan Zhongqing, Wang"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":1,"tokens":["士燮"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"士燮又勉励了子玉几句，子玉也只得同仲清等哭泣而回，且按下不题。","en":"Shixie offered a few more words of encouragement to Ziyu; Ziyu had no choice but to return weeping with Zhongqing and the others. But let us leave that aside."}],"16":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["梅士燮"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说前回书中梅士燮赴任之后，一切家事，内而颜夫人掌管，外而许顺经理，井井有条。子玉仍系读书，经籍之外研磨诸子百家。到花晨月夕，则有二三知己，明窗净几，共事笔砚。","en":"After Academician Mei Shixie departed for his post, Lady Yan assumed charge of the inner household while Xu Shun managed affairs without, leaving the estate in perfect order. Ziyu continued his studies, delving into the various philosophical schools alongside his classical texts."}],"21":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["士燮"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"有顾月卿、张笑梅，外有杨梅窗、冯子佩一班人朝欢暮乐，所见所闻，无非势力钻营等事，是以渐渐心肥胆大。从前在梅宅有士燮学士在家，虽不来管教他，自然畏惧的。而且子玉所结交的，都是些公子名士，没有那些游荡之人。譬如马困槽枥之中，虽欲泛驾也就不能。此时是任凭所欲，无所忌惮。","en":"This installment turns again to Wei Pincai. After dwelling in the Hua mansion for more than a month he had cultivated everyone above and below with such thorough success that Young Master Hua granted him some dignity and his purse grew easier; thereupon he began to show the petty man's triumph and would no longer keep his place. Within were Gu Yueqing and Zhang Xiaomei; outside Yang Meichuang, Feng Zipei, and such company — nightly revelry — and whatever he saw and heard ran to schemes of influence and trimming to power; his heart grew fat and his daring swelled. Formerly at the Mei residence Academician Mei had been at home: though he did not lecture Pincai, fear naturally restrained him. Moreover Ziyu kept company only with gentlemen of name — none of those idle roamers. Like a horse stalled in its manger, however much it wished to bolt the traces it could not. Now he might indulge every whim without scruple."}],"38":[{"paragraph":9,"mentions":1,"tokens":["梅铁庵"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"神清，知是不凡。又看子玉温然玉立，皎若珠光，秀外慧中，神怡气肃，又不是那徒有外貌的一派，心中十分大喜，想道：「梅铁庵可为有子矣。」便与子玉说些江西事情，说道：「令尊大人严拒情面，杜绝苞苴，一省人都比他为司马光、文彦博。士子们感戴是不用说了。」又问些子玉去年乡试的事，子玉一一答了。道生看他言词清蔼，气象虚冲，自然已是个饱学，心里要想试试他，且到饮酒时慢慢的考他。","en":"was no mere person of outward graces alone. His heart was greatly pleased, and he thought to himself: 'Old Mei Tie'an may indeed be said to have a worthy son.' He spoke to Ziyu about matters in Jiangxi, saying, 'Your honoured father strictly refuses to be swayed by personal connections and absolutely bars the door to bribes and gifts — the entire province compares him"}],"49":[{"paragraph":13,"mentions":1,"tokens":["梅铁庵"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"也不能尽知。」苏侯笑道：「这是老夫戏言，年兄岂肯阿私所好，你方才说这几位，就是那两位明经，我不知道他家世。至于梅铁庵、王质夫、刘定之，及已故的颜穆堂，还有你令泰山袁海楼，与史庶常的令尊史鉴湖，都是我们同年。现在还以还有些做部属司官的，有几位做州县的。这也是人生不齐之数。我们这一科也就算好了，已经有好几位坐了一品。」又讲了些别的话。子云坐久了，见时候不早，告辞出城。","en":"ones you just mentioned—I didn't know the family backgrounds of those two provincial graduates. But as for Mei Tie'an, Wang Zhifu, Liu Dingzhi, the late Yan Mutang, as well as your father-in-law Yuan Hailou and Shi's father Shi Jianhu, we all passed in the same year. Now, some serve as ministry directors, some as prefects and magistrates. This is the uneven fate of"}],"55":[{"paragraph":13,"mentions":2,"tokens":["梅铁庵"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"质夫、刘敬之都好么？」道翁道：「甚好！我见他们一班的后人，个个都是佳品。」石翁道：「都好么？」道翁道：「第一是梅铁庵的令郎名子玉，号庾香，竟是人中鸾凤。今年若考宏词，是必中的。」石翁笑道：「宏词科也没有什么稀奇，熟读《事类赋》三部就取得中宏词。」道翁道：「这是你老先生没有考上，所以题起你的牢骚来。」石翁道：「这也不然，我倒是公论。那梅铁庵的令郎怎么好呢？」道翁道：","en":"every one of them is of outstanding character.\\" Shiweng asked, \\"All of them?\\" Daoweng said, \\"The foremost is Mei Tie'an's son, named Ziyu, styled Yuxiang. He is truly a phoenix among men. If he sits for the Erudite Scholar exam this year, he is certain to pass.\\" Shiweng laughed, \\"The Erudite Scholar exam is nothing special. Anyone who thoroughly memorizes the three volumes"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":1,"tokens":["梅士燮"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"观音庵。到了里面，见两进重门，四面皆通，铺设精雅，满壁图书，尽是名人题咏，内中见有侯石翁的诗文，又见有江西学使梅士燮一副对子。琴仙见往来游玩的，也有士人，也有商贾，也有乡农，也有妇女们，摆着几张茶桌子，栏外就是满湖的荷花。和尚便泡了两碗茶来，刘喜请琴仙坐了，他拿了茶碗又到一处去坐。琴仙见那些人走来走去，只管的看他，有几个村里的妇人，瓦盆大的脸，鳊鱼宽的脚，凸着肚子","en":"inscriptions by famous figures. Among them, he spotted poetry and prose by Hou Shiweng, as well as a couplet by Mei Shixie, the Education Commissioner of Jiangxi. Qinxian noticed that the visitors strolling about included scholars, merchants, farmers, and women. Several tea tables were set up, and just beyond the balustrade lay a lake entirely blanketed in lotus flowers."}],"59":[{"paragraph":9,"mentions":4,"tokens":["梅士燮","梅侍郎"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"且说梅士燮在江西学院任上，取士有方，文风大振。而且扬芳表烈，阐微显幽，奏了十数件要事，九重大悦，即将梅士燮一月三迁，先升了詹事府正詹事，又升了都察院左副都御史，复升吏部左侍郎，现着来京供职。江西学政改放了陆宗沅。梅侍郎近又得了家信，已知子玉取了宏词，授职编修，","en":"Meanwhile, Mei Shixie, during his tenure as the Education Commissioner of Jiangxi, had proven exceptionally skilled at selecting scholars, greatly revitalizing the literary culture of the region. Furthermore, he praised virtue and honored martyrs, bringing hidden merits to"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":1,"tokens":["梅侍郎"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"制台讲起：「江西有个通判屈本立，可认得么？」梅侍郎答以相好。制台就将屈本立死在南京，其行李盘费为三个长随窃逃，侯石翁代他嗣子报了，行文到江西。昨接江西巡抚移文，内开：","en":"Governor-General asked, \\"There was an Assistant Prefect in Jiangxi named Qu Benli; were you acquainted with him?\\" Vice Minister Mei replied that they had been close friends. The Governor-General then explained that Qu Benli had passed away in Nanjing, and that his luggage and travel funds had been stolen by three of his senior servants, who had subsequently fled. Hou Shiweng had"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":5,"tokens":["梅侍郎","士燮"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"衣物等须交还他嗣子收领。那二犯现收禁江宁县监，还有从犯一名汪升，已经身故了。但不知他嗣子下落，须问石翁便知。\\n梅侍郎听了，心里颇为恺恻，又想：「道翁并无嗣子，想是近来过继的了。」便辞了制台，到凤凰山来拜石翁。石翁连忙接进，先道了喜，叙了契阔，即问宦囊如何。士燮笑道：「晚生靠祖宗的余荫，稍有几亩薄田，尽够饔飧，无须另积囊橐。论江西，虽不算富厚之邦，也算膏腴之地。若不","en":"as the whereabouts of his adopted son are unknown, we must ask Shiweng to ascertain this.\\"\\nUpon hearing this, Vice Minister Mei felt a profound sense of sorrow. He thought to himself, \\"Daoweng had no heir; this adopted son must be a recent development.\\" He took his leave of the Governor-General and headed to Phoenix Mountain to visit Shiweng. Shiweng hurriedly welcomed him in,"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":5,"tokens":["梅侍郎"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"。琴仙穿了孝衣，帏间俯伏，知是子玉的父亲，心里虽喜，然倒有些虚心，恐他风闻前事，问起他的根本来，甚是惶恐。只见梅侍郎进来上了香，奠了酒，行了礼，请出琴仙来。琴仙上前叩谢了。梅侍郎挽起，先把琴仙一看，点了一点头，叹了一声，道：「道翁可为有子。」便问：「世兄尊庚多少？」琴仙答道：「十七岁。」梅侍郎又问道翁怎样病故，及现在他的光景，琴仙细细说了一遍。梅侍郎叹道：「尊公在","en":"The next day, Vice Minister Mei first sent someone to the Huguo Temple to announce that he would be coming in person. He then dispatched a servant with a monetary condolence gift in Daoweng's name and prepared a sacrificial table before making his way to the temple. Flustered, Liu"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":2,"tokens":["梅侍郎"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"梅侍郎半信不信的道：「明日我且去看看，问问地方，可以买得，就是那块。」琴仙一面看那梅侍郎的相貌，却与子玉半点不像，生得身瘦而长，一脸秋霜，凛然可畏，将近五十岁光景。","en":"Half-believing, Vice Minister Mei replied, \\"I will go and take a look tomorrow. I'll inquire about the location, and if it can be purchased, that specific plot will do.\\" As they spoke, Qinxian quietly studied Vice Minister Mei's features, noting that he bore not the slightest resemblance"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":3,"tokens":["士燮","梅侍郎"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"此时琴仙称呼士燮为大人，自己为晚生。梅侍郎道：「你尊公与我二十年交好，祖上还有年谊，你叫我为世叔，自己称侄就是了。方才这个称呼，倒觉疏远。」说了些话，也就去了。琴仙心内安稳，且十分感激，意欲求他携带进京，尚有几天耽搁，且慢慢商量罢。明日，带了刘喜即去拜谢，梅侍郎命家","en":"At that moment, Qinxian was addressing Shixie as 'Your Excellency' and referring to himself as 'your humble junior.' Vice Minister Mei corrected him, saying, \\"Your father and I were close friends for twenty years, and our ancestors also shared long-standing ties. You should call me 'Uncle' and refer"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":5,"tokens":["梅侍郎","士燮"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这两日，梅侍郎托人找买坟地，尚无回信。晚间睡了，梦见屈道翁纱帽红袍，欣然而来。士燮见了大奇，便问他为何这样打扮？道翁也不讲明，执着士燮的手道：「明公不忘故旧，仗义恤孤，泉下人衔环难报，小女现寓莫愁湖畔，乞以骸骨付之，死且不朽。小儿流落无所依栖，想万间广厦，可借一枝","en":"Over those two days, Vice Minister Mei had entrusted someone with finding and purchasing a burial plot, but he had yet to receive a reply. That night, as he slept, he dreamed of Qu Daoweng, dressed in a black gauze cap and red robes, approaching him with a joyful expression. Shixie was greatly"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":1,"tokens":["士燮"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"说毕，足起烟云，冉冉凌空而去。士燮醒来，把这梦中的言语细细详了一会，心里已有几分明白：「出于淤泥而临清」与「既往不咎」，想他这个义子必是个小旦出身。这也不必论他，只要人好，总是一样。又想：「看这道翁像成了神，莫非莫愁湖畔果有他女儿的坟么？昨琴仙请仙之说，又见什么杜仙女，竟是真的了。」","en":"With those words, clouds and mist swelled beneath his feet, and he slowly drifted upward into the sky. When Shixie awoke, he carefully pondered the words spoken in the dream, gradually coming to an understanding. The phrases \\"emerges from the mud yet blossoms over clear water\\" and \\"let the past remain in the past\\" suggested that this adopted son must have originated"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":10,"tokens":["梅侍郎","士燮"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"不多一会，琴仙过来，就同他吃了早饭，梅侍郎且不说梦，要他同去逛莫愁湖，琴仙欣然，梅侍郎与琴仙各坐了轿，家人骑马，出了城，沿着城墙走去，约有二里路已到了。此时正是严冬天气，已下过了几场大雪，梅侍郎恐旷野寒冷，轿中披了玄狐斗篷。及进了斑竹林中，反觉春风和煦，如二月间天气，绝不寒冷。那些竹树花草依","en":"Shortly thereafter, Qinxian arrived and shared breakfast with him. Vice Minister Mei did not mention the dream, but instead invited Qinxian to accompany him on an excursion to Mochou Lake, which Qinxian happily accepted. Vice Minister Mei and Qinxian each took a sedan chair, while the servants rode on horseback. They exited the city"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":9,"tokens":["士燮","梅侍郎"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"到了二十四日，江宁诸绅士闻了士燮这个义举，来送葬者数百人，或作诗，或作歌行，或作文，或题祠中联额，士燮一一看了，等祠成之后，一齐刻在祠内。是日祠已竖了梁柱，头门、二门、正上厅三楹，两厢房后楼三楹，余平厦六间。规模粗定，士燮不能等待，发了二千金与家中老总管梅成督造，又画了杜仙女像，命","en":"On the twenty-fourth, having heard of Shixie's righteous undertaking, hundreds of Jiangning's gentry came to attend the funeral. Some composed poems, some wrote songs and ballads, others drafted essays, and some offered couplets and plaques for the shrine. Shixie reviewed each one carefully, planning"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":1,"tokens":["士燮"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"送葬之日，侯石翁被绅士拉了同去，也来走了一走。见琴仙尚是有气，话也不与他讲，石翁不乐，心里既恨琴仙，又妒士燮，一到就走，拜也没有拜一拜。后来诸绅士又有高兴的出来倡捐，这个十两，那个二十，集腋成裘，又凑了数千金。把这屈公祠扩充起来，起了好些亭台楼阁。莫愁湖中造了湖心亭、九曲红桥，又造了几个船，以为春夏游湖之乐。屈公墓、杜仙女墓前，都建石牌坊、华表柱、翁仲，余","en":"to speak a single word to him, Shiweng felt deeply displeased. Harboring hatred for Qinxian and jealousy toward Shixie, he left almost immediately without even offering a single bow of respect. Later, several enthusiastic members of the gentry stepped forward to spearhead a fundraising effort; one donated ten taels, another twenty, and bit by bit, they amassed several"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":1,"tokens":["梅侍郎"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"梅侍郎于二十八日开船在船上也是寂寞，倒将琴仙当着子玉一样，朝夕相依。又见他稳重灵警，十分契爱，又试他书本上虽未用过功，而诗词杂艺颇觉聪明，因想到京后，慢慢的再教他读书，学作文字。惟琴仙绝不敢题起认得子玉，心里还怕问他的出身，如果问他，只好撒两句谎，支吾遮饰","en":"Vice Minister Mei set sail on the twenty-eighth. Feeling lonely on the boat, he treated Qinxian just as he would Ziyu, keeping him by his side from morning till night. Observing Qinxian's steady demeanor and sharp intellect, Mei grew exceedingly fond of him. Testing the"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":5,"tokens":["梅侍郎","士燮"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"过了几日，又得了梅侍郎家信。头站人已回，说二十三日就到了，便把子玉急上加急。若父亲回来拘管住他，那就要闷死了。正是悲尽欢来，到了二十二日，子玉同了仲清接出三十里之外，住了宿店。等到定更时侯，头站才到，却是新收的家人，子玉不相认识，店家与他说了，才进来叩见，说老爷的轿子也就","en":"A few days later, a letter arrived from Vice Minister Mei. The advance party had returned, reporting that he would arrive on the twenty-third, which made Ziyu even more frantic. If his father returned and kept him under strict confinement, he would suffocate to death. It was truly a case of sorrow reaching"},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":2,"tokens":["士燮"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"士燮道：「这个是我的小儿，那个是我的内侄颜剑潭。」又对子玉、仲清道：「这是屈道生先生的令郎，同我进京的，其中缘故，此是也不及细说。你们见见，将来要在一处的。」子玉始而大骇，继而大乐，竟乐得笑将出来。琴仙见了子玉，笑容满面，也觉喜欢，上前与二人见了礼，彼此","en":"Shixie said, \\"This is my youngest son, and that is my nephew by marriage, Yan Jiantan.\\" He then turned to Ziyu and Zhongqing and said, \\"This is the son of the scholar Qu Daosheng, who traveled with me to the capital. There are reasons behind this that I don't"},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":2,"tokens":["士燮","梅侍郎"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"那边士燮已安歇，琴仙困乏已甚，支持不住，便躺在炕上，子玉、仲清也都在炕上坐了。家人们出去，今日幸喜云儿没跟来，仲清也是新用的人，都不认识琴仙，故此一宵无话。后来三人都也困乏，便都躺下，人静之后，细细的谈起来。此刻子玉、琴仙在一个枕上和衣而卧，竟把嫌疑也忘了，","en":"Meanwhile, Shixie had already gone to rest. Qinxian was exhausted beyond measure and couldn't hold on any longer, so he lay down on the kang, while Ziyu and Zhongqing sat beside him. The servants left the room; fortunately, Yun'er had not come along today, and Zhongqing"},{"paragraph":31,"mentions":2,"tokens":["士燮","梅侍郎"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"士燮起来，急急的叫上车进城，三十里路甚快，一个多时辰已到了。梅侍郎且不到家，先宿了庙，明日五鼓时分上朝复命。子玉先将琴仙在书房里安顿了。梅进、云儿一见琴仙，个个骇异，又猜是他，又猜不是他。若说是他，为何老爷与他抗礼？且又穿着素服，像个有孝的人。若说不是他","en":"Shixie rose and urgently called for the carriages to head into the city. The thirty-li journey went very quickly, and they arrived in a little over two hours. Vice Minister Mei didn't go straight home; instead, he lodged at a temple first, preparing to attend"},{"paragraph":34,"mentions":8,"tokens":["士燮","梅侍郎"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"明日，士燮面圣回家，合家迎接。琼华拜见了公公，士燮十分喜欢。颜夫人同着谈了一回，后将琴仙的事委委婉婉说了出来，就说他唱过戏，屈道翁见他人品好，所以收为义子。将子玉害病的话，却隐藏不题。士燮道：「我已猜着了几分。」也将屈道翁梦中之言说了，又道：「前事也不必论他。","en":"The next day, Shixie had his audience with the Emperor and returned home, where the entire family gathered to welcome him. Qionghua paid her respects to her father-in-law, and Shixie was extremely pleased. Lady Yan chatted with him for a while, and then gently and tactfully"}]}`),"char-48":JSON.parse(`{"1":[{"paragraph":6,"mentions":2,"tokens":["王文辉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"燮抚养在家，又与郑氏夫人请旌表烈。仲清在士燮处，到十九岁上中了个副车。是年士燮与其作伐，赘于同乡同年现任通政司王文辉家为婿。这王文辉是颜夫人的表兄，与仲清亲上加亲，翁婿甚为相得。那一位姓史名南湘，号竹君，是湖广汉阳人，现年二十四岁，已中了本省解元。父亲史曾望现为吏科给事中。这两人同是才高八斗，学富五车，但两人的情性却又各不相同。仲清是孤高自洁，坦白为怀。将他的学问","en":"supplementary candidate. That same year, Shixie acted as matchmaker, arranging for him to marry into the family of Wang Wenhui, the current Commissioner of the Transmission Office, who shared both a hometown and examination cohort with Shixie. As Wang Wenhui was Lady Yan's cousin, this union layered family ties upon family ties, and father-in-law and son-in-law found great harmony"},{"paragraph":45,"mentions":1,"tokens":["文辉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"接进了子玉。先同到内里去见了表舅母陆氏夫人。这夫人已是文辉续娶的了，今年才四十岁。又见了王恂的妻室孙氏，那是表嫂。仲清的妻室蓉华，那是表姊。还有个琼华小姐没有出来，因听得他父亲前日说那子玉的好处，其口风似要与他联姻的话，所以不肯出来见这表兄了。陆夫人见子玉，真是见一回爱一回，留他坐了，问了一会家常话，子玉告","en":"Ziyu inside. First, they went to the inner quarters to pay respects to his maternal aunt, Lady Lu. This lady was Wenhui's second wife and was only forty years old this year. He also greeted Wang Xun's wife, Lady Sun, his cousin-in-law. Zhongqing's wife, Ronghua, was his older female cousin. There was also a Miss Qionghua who did not come out to meet him; having heard"}],"2":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":5,"tokens":["王文辉","文辉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"里，一路想那所见的绝色美童。到了家，见门口一车三马，认得王通政的家人，知道通政在此。便进来到书房，见他父亲陪着王文辉在那里说话，上前见了，说道：「方才到舅舅处请安。」文辉笑容可掬的道：「我一早出来，还未到家。」子玉站在一旁，见文辉说：「开春同年团拜，已定了联锦班，在姑苏会馆唱戏。这回只怕人不多，现在放外任与出差的不少，大约不过三四桌人。」梅学士道：「袁海楼巡抚云南","en":"he knew the Commissioner was within. Proceeding to the study, he found his father engaged in conversation with Wang Wenhui. Ziyu stepped forward to offer his greetings, saying, \\"I have just returned from paying respects to my uncle.\\" Wenhui, his face wreathed in smiles, replied, \\"I departed early this morning and had not yet returned.\\" Ziyu stood respectfully aside as Wenhui"},{"paragraph":2,"mentions":2,"tokens":["王文辉","文辉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"士燮道：「这称呼是小门生，不知那里来的？这魏聘才又是谁呢？」王文辉道：「世愚侄，不要是魏老仁的儿子么？」士燮道：「只怕是的，今年夏间接着老仁的信，说要打发他儿子进京弄一小功名，托我收留照应的话。若论老魏人品，实在下作，惟在你我面上，还算有点真情。」文辉道：「若论老魏，原是个上等聪明人，要发科甲也很可发的，就是阴骘损","en":"devoted later student', what a peculiar title. I wonder where he hails from? And who might this Wei Pincai be?\\" Wang Wenhui suggested, \\"'Your humble nephew of the next generation', could it be the son of Wei Laoren?\\" Shixie nodded, \\"I suspect you are right. This past summer, I received a letter from Laoren mentioning his intent to send his son to the capital to secure a modest"},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":1,"tokens":["文辉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「请他们在花厅上坐，说我就出来。」文辉也就起身告辞，士燮送到门口，转身到花厅垂花门首，即叫跟班的到书房去请少爷出来，遂即踱进花厅。","en":"\\"Invite them to take a seat in the flower hall and inform them I shall be out shortly.\\" Wenhui then rose to take his leave. Shixie saw him to the door, turned back to the hanging flower gate of the hall, and instructed his attendant to summon the young master from the study before strolling inside."},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王文辉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"次日聘才、元茂到上屋去拜见了颜夫人，又将南边带来的土仪与他父亲的书信一并呈上，书中无非恳切求照应的话。另有致王文辉一信，士燮叫他迟日亲自送去。这聘才本是个聪明人，又经乃父陶镕，这一张嘴，真个千伶百俐，善于哄骗，所以在梅宅不到十天，满宅的人都说他好。子玉虽与其两道，然觉此人也无可厌处，尚可藉以盘桓，遣此岑寂。","en":"each brimming with earnest pleas for continued patronage and care. Among the missives was a letter addressed to Wang Wenhui, Shixie instructed Pincai to deliver it personally at a later date. Pincai was inherently clever and had been thoroughly molded by his father's worldly tutelage. His tongue possessed a thousand nimble tricks, endlessly adept at charming and cajoling."},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":4,"tokens":["王文辉","文辉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"次早聘才带了他的小子四儿，将王文辉的信送去。适文辉一早出门未回，王恂也不在家，只得请颜仲清会了。聘才见仲清一表非凡，叙了一番寒温，知是文辉之婿，又是士燮的内侄，免不得恭惟一番。正要告辞，只见一个跟班捧着一包衣服进来说：「老爷回来了。」聘才只得坐下。停了一会，听得外面有说话的声音，像是","en":"The following morning, Pincai took his young servant, Si'er, to deliver Wang Wenhui's letter. As it happened, Wenhui had departed early and had not yet returned, and Wang Xun was likewise away from home, leaving Pincai no option but to request an audience with Yan Zhongqing. Upon meeting Zhongqing and observing his striking demeanor,"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":3,"tokens":["文辉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"文辉让聘才坐下，自己就盘起腿来，仲清坐在靠窗凳上。聘才见这大模厮样的架子，心里筹划了一筹划，便站起来道：「小侄在诸位老伯荫庇之下，一切全仗栽培。家父曾吩咐过小侄，说大人的尊范，必要位至极品。趁如今拜识拜识，将来可以提拔寒畯。」说罢取出书子来双手呈上，文辉","en":"Wenhui invited Pincai to take a seat, settling himself comfortably with legs crossed, while Zhongqing occupied a stool by the window. Observing Wenhui's grandiose, self-important posture, Pincai carefully calculated his approach before rising to his feet and"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":1,"tokens":["文辉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"后来到底转荐没有呢？」聘才茫然，并不曾见有此事，只得恭身道谢。又说：「也没有转荐。」文辉道：「想必他又听了什么闲话了。但此时令尊还是处馆，还仍旧做那勾当？」聘才道：","en":"unaware of the matter, could only bow deeply in feigned gratitude and reply, \\"No such recommendation came to pass.\\" Wenhui said, \\"He must have caught wind of some unsavory gossip. Is your father still teaching, or is he still dabbling in those shady affairs?\\" Pincai answered:"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":1,"tokens":["文辉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「此刻家父在一个盐务里司事，比处馆略宽展些。」文辉道：","en":"father serves as a clerk in a salt administration office, which offers slightly more latitude than teaching.\\" Wenhui nodded approvingly:"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":4,"tokens":["文辉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「这倒好。一年有多少修金呢？」聘才道：「也有三百金。」文辉道：「也够浇裹了。论起来我做了三品京堂，一年的俸银，也不过如此。」说罢又仰面而笑。聘才也无话可说，正想告辞，忽见一个俊俏跟班，打扮得十分华丽，凑着文辉耳边说了一句话。聘才是乖觉人，知道有事，便起身告辞，文辉要送出去，聘才道：「还同颜大哥有话讲，大人请","en":"\\"That is much better. What is his annual remuneration?\\" Pincai replied, \\"He earns around three hundred taels.\\" Wenhui said, \\"That should suffice for daily expenses. Truth be told, as a third-rank metropolitan official, my own annual stipend scarcely amounts to more.\\" With that, he threw his head back and laughed. Left with nothing further to say, Pincai was contemplating"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王文辉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"讲了些话，来到王恂书斋，恰值王恂才回。刚说得一两句话，有王恂两个内舅前来看望：一个叫孙嗣徽，一个叫孙嗣元，本是王文辉同乡同年孙亮功部郎之子。这嗣徽、嗣元两个，真所谓难兄难弟。","en":"other Sun Siyuan, both sons of Ministry Director Sun Lianggong, a fellow provincial and examination graduate of Wang Wenhui. These two brothers were truly a matched pair of ineptitude."},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":1,"tokens":["文辉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"是日来到王宅，适文辉请客，客将到了。王恂即同他到书房内来。仲清躲避不及，只得见了，同王恂陪着坐下。嗣徽先对仲清说道；今日天朗气清，所以愚兄弟正其衣冠，翩然而来奉看的。」王恂、仲清忍不住要笑。嗣徽又对王恂说道：「适值尊驾出门，不知去向，若不是「鸟倦飞而知还」，则虽引弓而射","en":"On this particular day, they arrived at the Wang residence precisely as Wenhui was hosting a banquet, the guests on the verge of assembling. Wang Xun promptly ushered them into the study. Unable to avoid them, Zhongqing politely exchanged greetings and sat down beside Wang Xun to keep them company. Sihui initiated the conversation,"},{"paragraph":35,"mentions":6,"tokens":["文辉","王文辉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"却说孙亮功同了桂保进来，见过主人。不多一刻，客已全到，便安起席来。这些客都是文辉同年，论年纪孙亮功最长，因系姻亲，便让兵部员外杨方猷坐了首席。对面是光禄寺少卿周锡爵。监察御史陆宗沅坐了第三席，孙亮功坐了第四席，文辉坐了主席。桂保斟了一巡酒，杨方猷命他入席，对着王文辉坐了。文辉问他哥哥兰保为什么不来，桂保道：「今日本都在怡园逛了一","en":"a short time, all the guests had arrived, and they arranged themselves for the banquet. These guests were all Wang Wenhui's fellow graduates. As Sun Lianggong was the eldest and a relative by marriage, they offered the seat of honor to Yang Fangyou, a Vice Director in the Ministry of War. Seated opposite him was Zhou Xijue, Vice Minister of the Court of Imperial Entertainments."},{"paragraph":36,"mentions":3,"tokens":["文辉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"上了几样菜，文辉道：「这样清饮无趣，蕊香你出个令罢。」桂保道：「打擂最好，什么都放得进去。」孙亮功道：「完了！把个令祖宗请了来了。」文辉命人取了六个钱来。周锡爵道：「这杯分个大小才好。」杨方猷道：「我们两个一杯三开罢。「陆宗沅道：「未免太少些，你们一杯两开，我们都是","en":"After several dishes were served, Wenhui proposed, \\"Drinking plainly like this lacks flavor. Ruixiang, why don't you initiate a drinking game?\\" Guibao suggested, \\"The '擂' (lei/challenge) game is best, it accommodates any rule.\\" Sun Lianggong groaned, \\"We are doomed! We have invited the very"},{"paragraph":37,"mentions":1,"tokens":["文辉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"文辉道：「不必累赘，我们六个人竟以六杯为率，不必增减，准他一杯化作几杯就是了。也没有闷雷霹雷，那个猜着，就依令而行，最为剪截。」桂保便问杨方猷道：「第一杯怎样喝？」杨方猷道：「一杯化作三杯，找人豁拳。」又问孙亮功：「第二三杯怎样喝？」亮功道：「两杯都装作","en":"Wenhui said, \\"Let us not overcomplicate matters. The six of us will strictly adhere to six cups each, without addition or subtraction. Whoever wins a cup may divide it into as many smaller portions as they wish. Furthermore, let us dispense with complex rules"},{"paragraph":39,"mentions":2,"tokens":["文辉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"周锡爵道：「两杯化作六杯，花字飞觞。」桂保先问文辉道：「几个？」文辉道：「一个。」顺手便问亮功道：「几个？」亮功伸着两指道：「就是两个。」桂保笑道：「好猜手，一猜就着。」放开手看时，正是两个。遂取了三个杯子，斟满了酒，放在亮功面前。亮功道：「这是杨四兄的令，就和你豁。」杨方猷道：「我是半杯说过的。」","en":"cups become six, utilizing a 'flying toast' featuring the character for 'flower' (hua).\\" Guibao first addressed Wang Wenhui, \\"How many?\\" Wenhui answered, \\"One.\\" Without pausing, he asked Lianggong, \\"How many?\\" Lianggong raised two fingers, \\"Exactly two.\\" Guibao laughed, \\"An excellent guesser, correct on the very first try.\\" Opening his hand, he revealed precisely two coins."},{"paragraph":41,"mentions":5,"tokens":["王文辉","文辉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"得，改一句罚十杯。」桂保斟了一杯酒道：「请孙老爷后庭花饮酒。」众人重新又笑。亮功把桂保拧了一把，也喝了。下手是王文辉飞觞，桂保把嘴向孙亮功一呶，文辉会意，便道：「桃花细逐杨花落。」轮应陆宗沅、孙亮功各一杯。陆宗沅因亮功喷了他酒，便道：「无可奈何花落去。」接着杨方猷便道：「索性一总喝两杯罢。」亮功道：「很好，你说罢。」杨方本猷道：「笑隔荷花共人语。」桂保斟了两杯，孙","en":"The table erupted into laughter once more. Lianggong pinched Guibao playfully and drank the wine. Next, it was Wang Wenhui's turn to issue a flying toast. Guibao directed a conspicuous pout toward Sun Lianggong, and Wenhui, catching the hint, recited, \\"'Peach blossoms drift lazily, following the falling willow flowers.'\\" The count dictated that Lu Zongyuan and Sun Lianggong"},{"paragraph":42,"mentions":1,"tokens":["文辉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"文辉赏了桂保二十两银子，桂保谢了，走到书房来找王恂、仲清，谈了一会，说道：「我们班里新来了两个：一个叫琴官，一个叫琪官，生得色艺俱佳，只怕史竹君的《花选》又要翻刻了。」又坐了一会也自回去。不知后事如何，且听下回分解。","en":"Wenhui rewarded Guibao with twenty taels of silver. After expressing his gratitude, Guibao made his way to the study in search of Wang Xun and Zhongqing. They conversed for a time before Guibao revealed, \\"Two new performers have recently joined our troupe,"}],"6":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王文辉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说年年交代，只在除夕，明日又是元旦，未免有些庆贺之事。忙了两天，至初三日，王文辉处就有知单并三副帖子来，知单上开的是：户部侍郎刘、内阁学士吴、翰林院侍读学士梅、詹事府正詹事庄、左庶子郑、通政司王、光禄寺少卿周、国子监司业张、吏科给事中史、掌山西道陆、兵部员外郎杨、工部郎中孙、共十二位。士燮看了比去年人更少了，叫小厮拿两副帖，到书","en":"festivities, on the third day, an invitation notice and three sets of calling cards arrived from the household of Wang Wenhui. The notice detailed an assembly of twelve guests: Vice Minister of Revenue Liu; Academician of the Grand Secretariat Wu; Hanlin Reader-in-Waiting Mei; Chief Administrator of the Office of the Heir Apparent Zhuang; Left Junior Steward Zheng; Commissioner"},{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王文辉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"到了初五日，颜夫人也要请客，请了他表嫂王文辉的陆氏夫人，并他家孙氏少奶奶，与两位表侄女，又请了孙亮功的陆氏夫人，与其大姑娘，并两位少奶奶，就是孙大姑娘辞了不来。","en":"the fifth day, Lady Yan likewise prepared to host a gathering. She extended invitations to her cousin-in-law, Wang Wenhui's wife, Madam Lu, along with that household's young mistress née Sun and his two cousin-nieces. She also invited the wife of Sun Lianggong, Madam Lu, together with her eldest daughter and two young mistresses—though the eldest Miss Sun politely declined."},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":2,"tokens":["王文辉","文辉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"三十九岁。这两位夫人都是续娶的。虽在中年，却还生得少艾，不过像三十来岁的人，而且性爱秾华，其服饰与少年人一样。王文辉的夫人生得风流窈窕，是个直性爽快人，与文辉琴瑟和谐。这孙家的陆夫人，容貌也与乃姊彷佛，但性情悍妒，本将亮功有些看不起，又为他前妻遗下来三个宝贝，都是绝世无双，心头眼底刻刻生烦，闲来只好将亮功解个闷儿。这亮功从前的前妻，是极丑陋的，也接接连连生了一女两","en":"Sharing a fondness for opulent splendor, they adorned themselves with the vibrant elegance of much younger women. Wang Wenhui's wife possessed a lithe and graceful demeanor, complemented by a candid, spirited nature that harmonized perfectly with her husband. The Sun family's Madam Lu mirrored her elder sister's beauty but harbored a fierce, jealous temperament. She had always"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":1,"tokens":["文辉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"那一日，文辉的夫人带了二女一媳，香车绣撵的到了梅宅。","en":"On that day, Wenhui's wife, accompanied by two daughters and one young daughter-in-law, arrived at the Mei residence in their fragrant carriages and embroidered sedan-chairs."},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":1,"tokens":["文辉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"虽见过两次，看今日装饰起来愈觉娇艳，颜夫人也深知其所适非人，便心里十分疼爱起来。当下各人见礼已毕，谈起家常来，文辉的夫人，总称赞子玉，似有欣羡之意。亮功的夫人笑道：「姐姐，你的外甥固好，就我的外甥女也不错。你既然这样心爱，你何不将我的外甥女，配了你的外甥，也如我将我的外甥，配了你的外甥女一样。你们亲上加亲，教我也沾个四门亲的光儿不好吗？」颜夫人初听，竟摸不清楚，","en":"marriages, Lady Yan felt a profound compassion for them. Once the greetings concluded and casual chatter resumed, Wang Wenhui's wife lavishly praised Ziyu with obvious admiration. Lianggong's wife laughed and said, \\"Sister, your nephew is undoubtedly fine, but my niece is equally matched. Since you hold him in such high regard, why not pair my niece with your nephew, just as"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":5,"tokens":["文辉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"文辉的夫人道：「姑太太是什么话，咱们至亲，那里还有这些客话。倒是我的孩子配不上外甥是真的。姑太太想必不肯作主，还要让姑老爷得知，姑老爷心里怎样？」颜夫人道：「我们老爷也久有此心，在家也常说起来。去年表兄来托我们做媒，我就要说出来，刚刚有件什么事情来，就打","en":"Wang Wenhui's wife replied, \\"Aunt, what kind of talk is that? We are close family; there is no need for such formality. The truth is, my children might not be worthy of your nephew. Aunt must be deferring the decision to her lord husband—how does he feel about it?\\""},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":3,"tokens":["王文辉","文辉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"见已开了戏。座中诸老辈，子玉尚有几位不认识，士燮指点他一一见了礼，这些老前辈个个称赞不休。随后聘才、元茂上来与王文辉见礼。聘才还生得伶俐，这元茂又系近视眼，再加上那套衣服，转动不便，一个揖作完，站起来，不料把文辉的帽子碰歪在一边。文辉连忙整好，元茂也涨红了脸，就想走开。","en":"offered his respects to each, receiving lavish praise in return. Pincai and Yuanmao then stepped forward to greet Wang Wenhui. Pincai, nimble and composed, managed the introduction smoothly; Yuanmao, however, hindered by his nearsightedness and cumbersome attire, struggled to maneuver. As he rose from his bow, he accidentally bumped Wenhui's hat, knocking it askew. Wenhui quickly"},{"paragraph":31,"mentions":5,"tokens":["王文辉","文辉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉等往下看时，却是王文辉在那里发气，见一个人只管赔着笑，又向文辉请安。又听文辉说道：「就是在徐老爷那里，唱一出再去何妨；况且定戏时，怎样交代你的？」那人道：「这出《惊梦》有个新来的琴官，比宝珠还好。大人不信，叫他先唱一出瞧瞧，如果不中大人的意，再赶着去叫宝珠来，包管不误。」","en":"Ziyu and the others peered over the balcony: Wang Wenhui was throwing a tantrum. A man stood beside him, bowing repeatedly and offering placating smiles. Wenhui snapped, \\"Even at Master Xu's house, what harm is there in singing a single piece before leaving? Besides, when this opera was arranged, what were"},{"paragraph":36,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王文辉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"。聘才又把合席的人都恭维拉拢了一会。子玉又见那些相公，到正席上去劝酒的劝酒，讲话的讲话；颇觉有趣。又见他的舅舅王文辉，分外比人高兴，后又看了一出戏。正席上刘侍郎、梅学士、吴阁学、沈司业先散。子玉见他父亲走了，天也不早，也要回去。刚起身时，忽见一个美少年上楼来。文泽的家人说道：「冯少爷来了！」冯子佩上前与众人见礼，子玉见他还不过十八九岁，生得貌如美女，十分妩媚。刘文","en":"performers circulated among the main tables, pouring wine and engaging in lively banter. He also noted his uncle, Wang Wenhui, who appeared more exuberantly animated than anyone else in the room. Another operatic piece commenced. At the primary tables, Vice-Minister Liu, Scholar Mei, Grand Academician Wu, and Director Shen were the first to depart. Noting his father's absence"}],"11":[{"paragraph":33,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王质夫"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"分不到一合了。」说得华夫人、苏小姐皆笑。苏小姐道：「姐姐说那个小才女是谁家？」袁夫人道：「这人你们不认得么？是王质夫年伯的第二个女儿，名叫琼华，我们都是世姐妹。」华夫人道：「是通政司卿那位王年伯么？我们倒没有往来过。」苏小姐道：「这王琼华怎样好呢？」袁夫人道：「他今年十七岁，相貌是没有比得上他的，与二位真可鼎足为三。我前日请他们姐妹来看灯，他在席上就成了一首《灯月","en":"truly not know her?\\" Mrs. Yuan asked in mild surprise. \\"She is the second daughter of our Senior Kinsman Wang Zhifu, named Wang Qionghua. We are all sworn sisters.\\" \\"Would that be the Senior Kinsman Wang currently serving as Supervisor of the Court of Transmission?\\" Lady Hua mused. \\"We have rarely interacted with that household.\\" \\"What manner of girl is this Wang"}],"15":[{"paragraph":5,"mentions":1,"tokens":["文辉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"次日，颜夫人备了彩盒礼帖，请亮功来，送了过去。文辉处回礼丰盛，有颜仲清帮同亮功押了回来，士燮备酒相待。是日不请外客，就请聘才、元茂相陪。这李元茂今日福至心灵，说话竟清楚起来。性全出京时留下二百两银子与他，元茂买了几件衣裳，混身光亮。亮功眼力本是平常，今见了元茂团头大脸，书气满容，便许为佳士，大有余润","en":"decorative gift boxes with formal betrothal documents and asked Lianggong to convey them. The return gifts from the Wenhui household were lavish; Yan Zhongqing helped Lianggong bring them back, and Shixie hosted a wine reception. That day no outside guests were invited; only Pincai and Yuanmao were asked to keep the company. This Li Yuanmao had, at this auspicious moment,"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":3,"tokens":["王文辉","文辉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"却说孙亮功回去与陆夫人商量，要将大女儿许与元茂，陆夫人冷笑了几声，不发一言，亮功不敢再说。然主意已定，明日去托王文辉为媒，文辉踌躇了半天，心里想道：「这个白人儿，怎好嫁人？」因又想道：「那李元茂，也不是个佳婿，呆头呆脑的，那一天作个揖，就将我的帽子碰歪，只好娶这样媳妇。」便应允了。为这件事，特到士燮处来，将亮功之意达之士燮。士燮大喜，就请了聘才、元茂出来，聘才自然","en":"Lianggong did not dare press her further. Nevertheless, his mind was made up, and the next day he went to ask Wang Wenhui to act as matchmaker. Wenhui hesitated at length, thinking to himself: \\"How can this pallid creature be given in marriage?\\" But then he thought again: \\"That Li Yuanmao is no great match either. He is a dull-headed fellow if ever there was one; the day"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":2,"tokens":["王文辉","文辉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，即上车起程，颜仲清、王恂、魏聘才、李元茂一起随后，颜夫人领着子玉，并有些仆妇丫鬟一群的车，也送出城来。城外是王文辉、孙亮功等十几个同年至好，一齐在旗亭饯别。士燮盘桓了一会，文辉等进城。天色不早，颜夫人也只得带了仆妇丫鬟洒泪先回。子玉、仲清、聘才、元茂与些家人们，随到店中住了一夜，明日叩别。","en":"group of female servants and maids, also accompanied him in carriages out of the city. Outside the city gate, Wang Wenhui, Sun Lianggong, and a dozen or so fellow examination graduates and close friends were all gathered at a roadside inn to host a farewell feast. Shixie lingered for a while; Wenhui and the others then reentered the city. As the sky was growing late, Lady"}],"16":[{"paragraph":32,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王文辉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"胡衕方才坐好。小厮跨上车沿，只见迎面两马一车，走的泼风似的，劈面冲来，偏偏是王通政，子玉躲避不及，只得要下来。王文辉连忙摇手止住，问了几句话，也就点点头开车走了。","en":"Commissioner Wang, charging headlong in their direction. With no time to yield, Ziyu prepared to step down, but Wang Wenhui quickly waved him off, exchanged a few brief words, nodded, and drove away."}],"27":[{"paragraph":4,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王文辉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"是个直隶州，若得个美缺，一二年就可发财；又知他是个大手笔，不过胡涂公子，官将来怕不是替我做的，便去求孙亮功转托王文辉，竟是一说就妥。真是物以类聚，又是个爱淘毛厕的，臭味相投。进门住了几天，看出东家脾气，便要巴结，已将巴英官送他用了几回，奚十一心上极为畅快。那巴英官伺候过大老爷，在师爷面前，越发骄纵起来。况又得了几件新衣，裱糊好了，觉得更加光彩。姬亮轩每到情急求他，","en":"young gentleman, he reckoned the post would in practice be his own to run. He had begged Sun Lianggong to speak to Wang Wenhui, and it was settled at once. Birds of a feather, another sewer-raker of matching stench, within days he had read his patron's temper and set out to curry favor. He had already lent Ba Yingguan several times, and Xi was delighted. Ba Yingguan, having"}],"29":[{"paragraph":20,"mentions":1,"tokens":["文辉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"添起枝叶，把个子玉、琴言说得无所不至。不料王通政在人家席上遇着蓉官、二喜等类，就把子玉、琴言的事说得活龙活现。文辉本看过子玉之病，也觉得病的有些古怪，只不晓得是相思病。今听了这些话，心上着实不爽快，因想道：","en":"embroidered the rumors, until the relationship between Ziyu and Qinyan sounded utterly unspeakable. One evening, Wang Wenhui ran into the actors Rongguan and Erxi at a lavish feast. There, he heard the yarn spun as vividly as living dragons. He had seen Ziyu's sickness with his own eyes and had thought it odd at the time, but he had never once guessed it was lovesickness."},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":2,"tokens":["文辉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"来琴瑟之间就不能专好的了。」回家就叫他儿子王恂问了一回，王恂只好含含糊糊的说了几句，又与子玉剖辨，说断不至此，文辉终有些疑心。陆夫人听见了，虽未过门，倒先替女儿吃起醋来了，便向文辉说道：「若论玉哥儿，相貌是极好的，所以去年孙亲家母作媒，我就应许了。如今你自然不管，这怎么好？亲尚未成，倒先弄些笑话出来，将来若是一味的混闹，叫琼姑过去，如何过得日子？亲翁在家还能拘管","en":"\\"The affairs of young men fiercely resist all restraint,\\" Wang Wenhui reasoned with himself, \\"and one can only play along when at a feast. Besides, Ziyu is only eighteen—the very bud of youth just forming. Why would he let himself sink into such scandalous depths? Just last year, we joyfully betrothed our beloved daughter"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":2,"tokens":["王文辉","文辉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"到底这些小旦有什么好处，羞也不羞。」陆夫人气头上，倒连王文辉也教训了一顿。文辉只是赔笑，不敢作声，说：「事情呢，实在稀奇，我暗中窃访，连恂儿都知道他们才见过两三面。","en":"these young dan? Have they absolutely no shame?\\" In the heat of her fury, Lady Lu turned her righteous anger upon Wang Wenhui as well. He could only force a hollow smile, not daring to speak out of turn. Finally, he offered gently, \\"The matter is indeed strange, but I have looked into it carefully. Even Xun knows the truth of it—they have only ever met two or three times.\\""},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":1,"tokens":["文辉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"」陆夫人冷笑了一声道：「这些下作脾气是出于本心，我见多了，拘管得那一个住？从来说贼不改性，管住身管不住心的。」文辉听这些话，明明的逼到自己身上来，只得呵呵一笑，踱了出来，往书房里去了。陆夫人气极了，又在他女儿琼姑面前，把子玉讲了又讲。琼姑低头不语，心中也有些不耐烦。本知道是个风流夫婿，却不道是这样轻薄，应着一句常说的话「才人行短」了。便又想起哥哥、姊夫，常说子玉","en":"bind the heart. Thieves do not suddenly change their nature.\\" Hearing himself so pointedly targeted by her wrath, Wenhui laughed a hollow, uncomfortable laugh and quickly escaped to the quiet refuge of his study. Left alone with her indignation, Lady Lu turned her endless railing upon her daughter, Qionggu. Qionggu remained perfectly silent, though a quiet impatience stirred"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王文辉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"已精神复旧，惟见了母亲总有些惶恐不安的光景。颜夫人爱子之心十分体贴，又知儿子并无苟且之行，绝不提起琴言的事。那王文辉亲自来过几次，陆夫人也来过。一回在颜夫人面前，也不好说得，但有些话里讥讽，暗藏褒贬，似乎叫亲家以后留点神，不要放纵他的意思。又见子玉病已痊愈，看其相貌翩翩，实是佳婿，又像个真诚谨厚的人，就把疑心消去一半。","en":"perceptive grace; knowing that he had committed no truly shameful deed, she never once spoke Qinyan's name aloud. Wang Wenhui came to visit several times, as did Lady Lu. Before Lady Yan could even speak plainly, Lady Lu would needle her with sharp, pointed barbs—speaking as if warning a close kin to keep careful watch and cease her endless indulgence. Yet, seeing Ziyu fully"}],"30":[{"paragraph":4,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王文辉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"兴，于下贴时说明了夜宴。此日正是秋试二场，刘文泽为什么不应举呢？这一科大主考即系文泽之父大宗伯刘守正，副主考系王文辉，已升了阁学，陆宗沅、杨芳猷、周锡爵、孙亮功一班可可的一齐分房，将那一班知名之士回避了一大半。内中除徐子云、史南湘是前科举人，萧次贤是高尚自居，无心问世，只有田春航、高品入场。如子玉、王恂、文泽、仲清等皆遵例回避。子玉在家闷闷不乐，又因琴言杳无音信，","en":"The chief examiner this time was Wenze's father, Minister of Rites Liu Shouzheng, and the associate examiner was Wang Wenhui, who had been promoted to Academician of the Grand Secretariat. Lu Zongyuan, Yang Fangyou, Zhou Xijue, and Sun Lianggong—this group of notable figures all served as associate examiners, which meant more than half of the well-known scholars had to avoid"}],"31":[{"paragraph":17,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王文辉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"席，绝不与闻，惟独坐一室，茗碗香炉，周旋其间。名为看破，其实情怀未断，犹时一念及，涕泪潸潸，不能自解。十五日到王文辉家一走，王恂、仲清约定明日午刻去望田春航、高品。子玉已吃过了早饭，在书房等候。不多一会，史、颜诸人已到，南湘坐了，与子玉叙谈。仲清、王恂先进内室，见了颜夫人，略坐一坐即出来。喝了一杯茶，即催子玉同走。","en":"thoughts drifted to Qinyan, tears would stream down his face, a sorrow he could not ease. He took a brief walk to Wang Wenhui's home on the fifteenth, where he agreed to accompany Wang Xun and Zhongqing to visit Tian Chunhang and Gao Pin at noon the following day. Ziyu had already eaten breakfast and was waiting in his study. Soon enough, Shi, Yan, and the others arrived. Nanxiang"}],"32":[{"paragraph":10,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王阁学"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"春航出于第四房孙亮功门下，相见之后，亮功久已闻名，就是刘尚书、王阁学，虽未见过春航，于他儿子们书房内，见他些笔墨东西，也久已倾倒，惟恐不得其人为憾。今中了南元，十分欢喜。从此春航与文泽、王恂又成了世谊，更加亲爱。惟有孙氏昆仲颇难浃洽，然亦不得不往来，惟淡交而已。高品代枪之银已收清，共得了一千六百金。张仲雨过手，在花处","en":"extremely pleased that he had placed Nanyuan. He had long heard of Chunhang's reputation, as even Minister Liu and Academician Wang, though they had never met Chunhang, had seen his writing and calligraphy in their sons' studies and greatly admired him, regretting only that they had not secured him themselves. From then on, Chunhang formed a generational friendship with Wenze and"}],"33":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王阁学"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"再来。诸名士、名旦送行，又叙了几日。光阴甚快，不觉又到腊月中旬。且说子玉因南湘、高品出京，又少了两个知己。前月王阁学来对颜夫人说，不是冬底，就是春初，要与子玉毕姻。","en":"month. With Nanxiang and Gao Pin out of the capital, Ziyu found himself missing two close confidants. Last month, Academician Wang of the Grand Secretariat visited Madam Yan, proposing that Ziyu should be married either by the end of winter or early spring."},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":2,"tokens":["文辉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"梅进来到王宅，文辉传进，问了来意。梅进禀明，文辉冷笑了一声，道：「那魏聘才，我一见他，就知道不是个东西。你们老爷定要留他，幸而如今出去了。这件事怎样去说，且刑部里绝无相好。你回去与太太请安，说我只好转托人，碰他的运气罢。」梅进回去照直说了，颜夫人也无法，只得听其自然。","en":"Mei Jin arrived at the Wang residence. Wenhui called him in and asked the reason for his visit. Mei Jin explained the situation, and Wenhui sneered, saying, \\"That Wei Pincai—I knew the moment I saw him that he was nothing good. Your master insisted on keeping him; fortunately, he has left now. How"}],"39":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":4,"tokens":["王文辉","文辉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"去商办喜事，也替他张罗了几天。定于二月初十日招赘，也不多几天了。新年李性全寄了几百两银子来与元茂，并写个禀帖与王文辉，要替他儿子办喜事。王文辉不耐烦作媒，俱令王恂代劳。李元茂求着了魏聘才，求其代制一切。魏聘才闹了一个多月，花的，输的，丢了好些银钱，窃案又未能破，心上也有些烦闷起来，不得主意。今见李元茂来求他，当日原是他与王文辉为媒，意欲借此到文辉处走动，作个幌子，","en":"off. At the New Year, Li Xingquan had sent several hundred taels of silver to Yuanmao, along with a letter to Wang Wenhui asking him to arrange his son's marriage. Wang Wenhui had no patience for matchmaking and delegated everything to Wang Xun. Li Yuanmao then sought out Wei Pincai and begged him to take charge of all the arrangements. Wei Pincai had been carousing for"},{"paragraph":2,"mentions":2,"tokens":["王文辉","文辉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"聘才明日去拜王文辉，文辉进衙门去了，王恂接待。又同去见了亮功，说了些客套，无非是现在客途，无人照料，一切尚求包涵等语。亮功道：「原是爱亲结亲，这些烦文，一概删去。我也不要破费他一钱，一切在我就是了。」即留聘才吃饭。","en":"The following day Pincai called on Wang Wenhui, but Wenhui had gone into the yamen; Wang Xun received him instead. They then went together to pay their respects to Lianggong, exchanged the usual pleasantries, mentioning that they were currently sojourning away from home with no one to look after"}],"43":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王文辉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"是日，素兰清早已为王文辉叫去。少顷，宝珠过来。宝珠道：「昨日失候，我到三更才回的，他们也忘了，没有对我讲。方才你们五儿说起来，方知道。两三天总不见你，为什么不出来散散闷？今日度香约赏杏花，咱们可同去了。」琴言道：「可以。我这两日偶然感冒，觉得疲倦，今日也想出去散散。且假期已","en":"That morning, Sulan had already been called away by Wang Wenhui at an early hour. Presently Baozhu arrived. \\"I missed you yesterday,\\" said Baozhu. \\"I did not return until the third watch, and no one thought to tell me. Your Wu'er only just mentioned it just now. I haven't seen you these two or three days — why haven't"}],"48":[{"paragraph":26,"mentions":1,"tokens":["文辉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴仙过来话别。因想请琴仙，必须请子玉，又托琴仙转约子玉于初六日同去。琴仙应了，果然把子玉请了出来。子玉那日先到文辉处拜寿，耽搁了一早晨，吃了面，即便辞回。王恂留住不放，陆夫人也留他。子玉是一腔心事，如何留得住？只得将实话悄悄的告诉了仲清。仲清与王恂说了，方才放他出来。","en":"along on the sixth. Qinxian agreed and successfully brought Ziyu out. That morning, Ziyu had gone to celebrate Wenhui's birthday and was delayed for hours; after eating longevity noodles, he tried to excuse himself, but Wang Xun and Madam Lu firmly insisted he stay. Burdened with a heart full of sorrowful thoughts, he found it impossible to remain. He quietly confided"}],"49":[{"paragraph":13,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王质夫"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"知。」苏侯笑道：「这是老夫戏言，年兄岂肯阿私所好，你方才说这几位，就是那两位明经，我不知道他家世。至于梅铁庵、王质夫、刘定之，及已故的颜穆堂，还有你令泰山袁海楼，与史庶常的令尊史鉴湖，都是我们同年。现在还以还有些做部属司官的，有几位做州县的。这也是人生不齐之数。我们这一科也就算好了，已经有好几位坐了一品。」又讲了些别的话。子云坐久了，见时候不早，告辞出城。在车内想","en":"mentioned—I didn't know the family backgrounds of those two provincial graduates. But as for Mei Tie'an, Wang Zhifu, Liu Dingzhi, the late Yan Mutang, as well as your father-in-law Yuan Hailou and Shi's father Shi Jianhu, we all passed in the same year. Now, some serve as ministry directors, some as prefects and magistrates. This is the uneven fate of human life."}],"52":[{"paragraph":3,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王文辉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"了，今奉差来京，也帮着春航张罗。初六那一日有两处戏酒，一处在聚星堂，请的是乡试座师礼部尚书刘守正、座师内阁学士王文辉、会试房师兵部郎中杨方猷，鸿胪寺卿周锡爵、光禄少卿陆宗沅，这两位是同乡前辈兼有年谊。张桐孙陪了这几位在聚星堂观戏，演得是联珠班。春航陪着一班名士在花园挹爽斋观演联锦班。那一天大媒是徐子云，客是萧次贤、高品、南湘、颜仲清、刘文泽、王恂、梅子玉。近日子玉","en":"was at the Gathering Stars Hall, hosting Chunhang's examination mentors—Liu Shouzheng, the Minister of Rites; Wang Wenhui, Academician of the Grand Secretariat; Yang Fangyou, Director of the Ministry of War; alongside Zhou Xijue, the Chief Minister of the Court of State Ceremonial, and Lu Zongyuan, the Deputy Minister of the Court of Imperial Entertainments, both of whom"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":2,"tokens":["王文辉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"华公子见了刘尚书、王文辉是父执，便请了安，其余都行平礼。春航与华公子系是新亲，无甚话说，不过彼此道些仰慕之意。幸有王文辉、徐子云帮着张罗，应酬了那几位新亲，颇不寂寞。","en":"Recognizing Minister Liu and Wang Wenhui as venerable elders of his father's generation, Young Master Hua offered them respectful bows; to all the rest, he extended the courteous salutations of peers. As Chunhang and Young Master Hua were newly related and entirely unfamiliar with one another,"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王文辉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"王文辉要推华公子首坐，华公子不肯。子云意欲邀他进园，与诸名士会会，华公子也不愿在外，便同了子云进园，文泽等齐齐站起，华公子上前见礼。除文泽之外，都不认识，内中见一个最年轻的，觉得如月光珠彩，凤举霞轩，骨重神清，风华雅丽，心里一惊，觉眼中从未见过这样人。子玉","en":"At the banquet, Wang Wenhui attempted to yield the seat of honor to Young Master Hua, but Young Master Hua steadfastly refused. Ziyun proposed bringing him into the garden to meet the gathered scholars; preferring not to remain in the outer hall, Young Master Hua gladly accompanied"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":2,"tokens":["王文辉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"坐了席，开了戏，那边王文辉、张仲雨进来，在华公子面前张罗了一番。华公子要请仲雨坐席，仲雨道：「今日我竟没有这个福分。」春航谢妆已回，也请仲雨入席，仲雨道：「外面一个媚香，如何照应得来？不可叫他怨我。」便拱拱手走开，指着子云道：「总是你好作成。」笑出去了。王文辉跷起了朝靴，手捋","en":"Once they were seated, the opera resumed. Wang Wenhui and Zhang Zhongyu came in, attending to Young Master Hua for a time. Young Master Hua invited Zhongyu to join the banquet, but Zhongyu joked, \\"Today, I simply lack that fortune.\\" Chunhang, having returned from his formal thanks at the Su household, also"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":7,"tokens":["王文辉","文辉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"的。」仲清道：「未必，如果是他夫人写的，怎肯给人？」次贤道：「这话说得是。」诸名士在园内谈心，却说那聚星堂上，王文辉见诸名旦一个不来，颇觉岑寂，又不好意思去叫他们。想蕙芳在账房里，便叫了他出来。蕙芳也累苦了，乐得出来歇歇，便到文辉席上来，就在文辉旁边坐了。此处是两席，那席是刘守正、周锡爵、杨方猷，这席是王文辉、陆宗沅、张桐孙。文辉道：「这几天我知道你也累极了，所以","en":"Cixian agreed, \\"That is a fair point.\\" While the scholars chatted in the garden, back in the Gathering Stars Hall, Wang Wenhui found the absence of the famous dans rather dreary but felt too embarrassed to summon them. Remembering Huifang was in the accounting room, he called him out instead. Utterly exhausted, Huifang was glad for the chance to rest and went to sit beside Wenhui."},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":4,"tokens":["王文辉","文辉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"王文辉道：「有、有、有！如果我放了督抚，我难带的东西都与你留下。」蕙芳笑道：「难带的东西想是粗笨的，你不要拿些木器家伙，什么铁炉子、铁火盒，寄放在我处，我是不领情的。」陆宗沅、张桐孙笑起来，王文辉也笑，把扇子打了蕙芳一下：「你薄我，这还了得。」蕙芳也笑。文","en":"Wang Wenhui replied, \\"I have plenty, I have plenty! If I am appointed Governor-General, I will leave all the difficult-to-carry items with you.\\" Huifang laughed, \\"Those 'difficult-to-carry' items are probably just heavy, clumsy junk! Do not try to dump wooden furniture,"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":2,"tokens":["质夫","文辉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，我们的胡子不是染的。」那边席上的刘尚书、周锡爵、杨方猷都笑起来，惟有张桐孙是个道学人，不会顽笑。周锡爵道：「质夫，你那乌须药的方子，可是你孙亲家传你的？」文辉道：「他那几根胡子，要用什么乌须药？」既而一想，便大笑起来。陆宗沅也明白，也笑了。","en":"burst into laughter. Only Zhang Tongsun, a rigid neo-Confucian scholar, remained unamused. Zhou Xijue called out, \\"Zhifu, did that black-beard prescription of yours come from your Sun-family in-laws?\\" Wenhui replied dismissively, \\"With those few sparse hairs of his, what use would he have for black-beard medicine?\\" But upon reflecting on the hidden implication, he burst"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":4,"tokens":["文辉","质夫"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"刘守正与杨方猷不解其故，连声的问，文辉就将亮功女儿漆头发的一事讲出来，听得众人皆笑，连张桐孙也笑起来。周锡爵道：「既是这么着，质夫，你何不到班里借个假胡子带着，省得这乌黑的东西，沾染了你们如夫人的脸。」刘守正道：「这一染，就直染到胸前呢。」文辉道：「嚼你的舌头。」陆宗沅道：「怎么你把这尺","en":"Liu Shouzheng and Yang Fangyou, not understanding the context, pressed for an explanation. Wenhui then recounted the old story of Lianggong's daughter dyeing her hair, which sent everyone into fits of laughter—even Zhang Tongsun chuckled. Zhou Xijue suggested, \\"If that is the case, Zhifu, why not borrow a fake beard from the theater troupe? It would"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王文辉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"明日，苏夫人请了他大姑奶奶浣香与徐子云夫人袁绮香去陪新，吃扶头卯酒。田太夫人请了王文辉的陆氏夫人，带了他大姑奶奶蓉华并媳妇孙少奶奶佩秋，又请刘守正的夫人，没有来，他媳妇吴少奶奶紫烟来了。周锡爵、杨方猷、陆宗沅的夫人都辞了。","en":"Xu Ziyun's wife, Yuan Qixiang, to accompany the bride and partake in the morning wine. Old Madam Tian invited Wang Wenhui's wife, Madam Lu, who brought along her elder daughter Ronghua and her daughter-in-law, Madam Sun Peiqiu. She also invited the wife of Liu Shouzheng, who could not attend, though her daughter-in-law, Madam Wu Ziyan, came in her stead. The wives of Zhou"}],"54":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":4,"tokens":["王质夫","文辉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"进京，托他带了三千金回来。说子玉年已十九，可以完婚，若要等我任满回来，要到明年冬天，适或又有调动。更觉迟了。况王质夫又系至亲至好，一切可托仲清料理，不丰不俭，叫颜夫人办了这件亲事。又与子玉一个谕帖，说近日寄来诗文颇有些进境。今秋有宏词之试，你要自己明白，如可以自信去得，即求人保荐。如果不能自信，也不必好此虚名。颜夫人问子玉道：「你父亲问你信得过再去，信不过就不用去","en":"marry; if they waited for his return at end of term, it might be next winter or later if transfer came. Since Wang Zhifu was a close kinsman and trusted friend, everything could be entrusted to Zhongqing. The wedding should be done appropriately, neither lavish nor mean. He sent Ziyu a separate instruction: Ziyu's recent writings showed progress; with the autumn special"},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王文辉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"谦谨了许多。拜了保荐老师刘尚书，是熟极的，及谒阅卷老师，苏侯见了子玉，就想起子云之言，真是吉星鸾凤，喜不可言。王文辉与陆夫人心中半喜半闷，喜的是子玉考中，闷的是王恂、仲清不中，但接着要办女儿的喜事，也就喜多闷少。","en":"then to exam reader Su the Marquis. Seeing Ziyu, Su remembered Ziyun's words and thought him truly auspicious. Wang Wenhui and Madam Lu felt mixed joy and frustration: glad for Ziyu's success, vexed at Wang Xun and Zhongqing's failure, though the coming daughter wedding shifted them toward joy."},{"paragraph":37,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王文辉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"自己的郎君才得十九岁，已能如此，真是难得。但听得从前有个什么琴言，害他病过几场，如今不知这琴言又怎样了。」却说王文辉定了九月十九日吉期，颜夫人写了家信，说子玉已中宏词，又即完姻，一切交与仲清办理。","en":"But I have heard there was some Qinyan who made him ill more than once. What has become of this Qinyan now?\\"\\n\\nWang Wenhui fixed the nineteenth of the ninth month for the wedding, and Lady Yan wrote home to say that Ziyu had passed the Broad Learning examination and was to be married at once, and that everything had been put in Zhongqing's hands."}],"55":[{"paragraph":13,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王质夫"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"。自今以后，将焚弃笔砚，善刀而藏，不作身后虚名之想，浮沉于半刺间，以终老是身足矣。」石翁也太息几声，又问道：「王质夫、刘敬之都好么？」道翁道：「甚好！我见他们一班的后人，个个都是佳品。」石翁道：「都好么？」道翁道：「第一是梅铁庵的令郎名子玉，号庾香，竟是人中鸾凤。今年若考宏词，是必中的。」石翁笑道：「宏词科也没有什么稀奇，熟读《事类赋》三部就取得中宏词。」道翁道：","en":"until the end of my days will be enough for me.\\" Shiweng also sighed deeply a few times, then asked, \\"Are Wang Zhifu and Liu Jingzhi doing well?\\" Daoweng replied, \\"Very well! I have seen the descendants of their circle, and every one of them is of outstanding character.\\" Shiweng asked, \\"All of them?\\" Daoweng said, \\"The foremost is Mei Tie'an's son, named Ziyu, styled"}],"59":[{"paragraph":21,"mentions":1,"tokens":["王文辉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"再说子玉见父亲超升了侍郎，喜出望外。已得了江西所发之信，计日早可到京，为何至今未到。颜夫人盼望，更不必说，王文辉也是常来问信。那日已是腊月十五，早上送了一封信来，子玉看信面上是：「江西学政梅宅梅庾香少爷手启，屈勤先寄。」心中大喜，知琴仙到了江西任所了，便忙拆开，看见还有与子云、蕙芳、素兰、琪官的信，且搁过一边。拆开自己的信，见一张白纸写着「哀启者」，大为骇然，","en":"reached the capital long ago. Why was he still not here? Lady Yan's anxious anticipation goes without saying, and Wang Wenhui also came by frequently to ask for news. That day was already the fifteenth of the twelfth month. In the morning, a letter was delivered, and Ziyu saw the inscription on the envelope: \\"For the personal attention of Young Master Mei Yuxiang at the Mei"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":1,"tokens":["文辉"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"清好，即同到上房来。士燮昨日半夜起身，也乏极了，即忙坐下，靠在枕上，问了子玉家内一番事，又问仲清妻子都好，兼询文辉近况。爷儿三个谈了一会，士燮惦记琴仙，问家人：「怎么屈大爷的车子还不到来？」家人道：「总也快了。」不多一时，门外又车声辚辚，仲清、子玉想道：「不知那个屈大爷，想是任上同回来的。」只见一人照了灯笼，一个美少年走进来，仲清、子玉大奇，灯光之下，不甚分明，","en":"asked Ziyu about matters at home. He then asked Zhongqing if his wife and children were well, and asked about Wenhui's recent situation. After the three men had chatted for a while, Shixie remembered Qinxian and asked his servants, \\"Why hasn't Master Qu's carriage arrived yet?\\" A servant replied, \\"It should be here any moment.\\" Shortly after, the rumble of carriage"}]}`),"char-49":JSON.parse(`{"2":[{"paragraph":24,"mentions":1,"tokens":["孙亮功"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"王恂书斋，恰值王恂才回。刚说得一两句话，有王恂两个内舅前来看望：一个叫孙嗣徽，一个叫孙嗣元，本是王文辉同乡同年孙亮功部郎之子。这嗣徽、嗣元两个，真所谓难兄难弟。","en":"brothers-in-law arrived to pay a visit. One was named Sun Sihui, the other Sun Siyuan, both sons of Ministry Director Sun Lianggong, a fellow provincial and examination graduate of Wang Wenhui. These two brothers were truly a matched pair of ineptitude."},{"paragraph":30,"mentions":1,"tokens":["孙亮功"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"刚到二门口，可巧碰见孙亮功进来，孙氏弟兄站在一边。","en":"Just as they reached the inner gate, it happened that Sun Lianggong was making his entrance, and the Sun brothers respectfully stood aside."},{"paragraph":31,"mentions":2,"tokens":["亮功"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"王恂、仲清上前见了礼，亮功问道：「客到齐了么？」王恂道：「没有。」仲清看亮功虽是个紫糖色扁脸，蹋鼻子，但五官端正，又有了几根胡须，比两位贤郎好看多了。","en":"Wang Xun and Zhongqing stepped forward to exchange greetings. Lianggong asked, \\"Have all the guests assembled?\\" Wang Xun replied, \\"Not yet.\\" Zhongqing observed Lianggong closely, noting his purplish-brown complexion and flat nose. Yet, his features were properly aligned, and accompanied by a modest beard, he presented a"},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":4,"tokens":["亮功"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"亮功正要与他儿子说话，适值王桂保进来，见了亮功并王恂、仲清，也站在一边。亮功看看桂保，对他儿子说道：「你们回去，不要说什么。」嗣徽兄弟会意答应，于是亮功即拉了桂保进去。","en":"Lianggong was on the verge of addressing his sons when Wang Guibao entered the courtyard. Spotting Lianggong, along with Wang Xun and Zhongqing, he also stepped respectfully aside. Lianggong glanced at Guibao before instructing his sons, \\"Return home immediately,"},{"paragraph":35,"mentions":5,"tokens":["孙亮功","亮功"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"却说孙亮功同了桂保进来，见过主人。不多一刻，客已全到，便安起席来。这些客都是文辉同年，论年纪孙亮功最长，因系姻亲，便让兵部员外杨方猷坐了首席。对面是光禄寺少卿周锡爵。监察御史陆宗沅坐了第三席，孙亮功坐了第四席，文辉坐了主席。桂保斟了一巡酒，杨方猷命他入席，对着","en":"Meanwhile, Sun Lianggong entered with Guibao and formally greeted the host. Within a short time, all the guests had arrived, and they arranged themselves for the banquet. These guests were all Wang Wenhui's fellow graduates. As Sun Lianggong was the eldest and a relative by"},{"paragraph":36,"mentions":1,"tokens":["孙亮功"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"上了几样菜，文辉道：「这样清饮无趣，蕊香你出个令罢。」桂保道：「打擂最好，什么都放得进去。」孙亮功道：「完了！把个令祖宗请了来了。」文辉命人取了六个钱来。周锡爵道：「这杯分个大小才好。」杨方猷道：「我们两个一杯三开罢。「陆宗沅道：「未免太少些，你们一杯两开，我们都是一杯一开何如？」俱各依允。桂保伸出一个拳来，问文辉吃多少杯？","en":"initiate a drinking game?\\" Guibao suggested, \\"The '擂' (lei/challenge) game is best, it accommodates any rule.\\" Sun Lianggong groaned, \\"We are doomed! We have invited the very patriarch of drinking games.\\" Wenhui instructed the servants to fetch six coins. Zhou Xijue advised, \\"This cup should be divided into larger and smaller portions.\\" Yang Fangyou proposed, \\"Let the two"},{"paragraph":37,"mentions":3,"tokens":["孙亮功","亮功"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"个猜着，就依令而行，最为剪截。」桂保便问杨方猷道：「第一杯怎样喝？」杨方猷道：「一杯化作三杯，找人豁拳。」又问孙亮功：「第二三杯怎样喝？」亮功道：「两杯都装作小旦敬人。」周锡爵道：「我们这样的胡子，倒有些难装。」亮功道：「只要做作得好，便有胡子也不妨。」桂保又问陆宗沅道：「第四杯呢？」陆宗沅道：「把瓜子抓一把，数到谁就是谁。」桂保道：","en":"the first cup?\\" Yang Fangyou replied, \\"One cup becomes three, finger-guessing with your partner.\\" He then asked Sun Lianggong, \\"What about the second and third cups?\\" Lianggong decreed, \\"Both cups entail impersonating a young female performer presenting wine.\\" Zhou Xijue interjected, \\"With our prominent beards, that will prove somewhat challenging to act out.\\" Lianggong reassured"},{"paragraph":39,"mentions":6,"tokens":["亮功"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"周锡爵道：「两杯化作六杯，花字飞觞。」桂保先问文辉道：「几个？」文辉道：「一个。」顺手便问亮功道：「几个？」亮功伸着两指道：「就是两个。」桂保笑道：「好猜手，一猜就着。」放开手看时，正是两个。遂取了三个杯子，斟满了酒，放在亮功面前。亮功道：「这是杨四兄的令，就和你豁。」杨方猷道：「我是半杯说过的。」亮功道「豁起来再讲。」可可响了三响，亮功输了","en":"'flower' (hua).\\" Guibao first addressed Wang Wenhui, \\"How many?\\" Wenhui answered, \\"One.\\" Without pausing, he asked Lianggong, \\"How many?\\" Lianggong raised two fingers, \\"Exactly two.\\" Guibao laughed, \\"An excellent guesser, correct on the very first try.\\" Opening his hand, he revealed precisely two coins. He then arranged three cups, filled them brimming with wine, and placed"},{"paragraph":40,"mentions":7,"tokens":["亮功","孙亮功"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"第二三杯即系亮功自己的令，便道：「这装小旦倒是作法自弊了。也罢，让我来敬两个人。」随站起来，左手拿了杯酒，右手掩了胡子，把头扭了两扭，笑迷迷软腰细步的走到杨方猷面前，请了一个安，娇声娇气的道「敬杨老爷一杯酒，务必赏个脸儿。」说着，把眼睛四下里飞了一转，宛然联锦班内京","en":"The second and third cups fell under Lianggong's own rule. He sighed, \\"This female impersonation has truly backfired on me. Very well, allow me to toast two gentlemen.\\" Rising to his feet, he clasped a cup of wine in his left hand, obscured his beard with his right, tilted his head coquettishly twice,"},{"paragraph":41,"mentions":22,"tokens":["亮功","孙亮功"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"众人道：「这个断使不得，改一句罚十杯。」桂保斟了一杯酒道：「请孙老爷后庭花饮酒。」众人重新又笑。亮功把桂保拧了一把，也喝了。下手是王文辉飞觞，桂保把嘴向孙亮功一呶，文辉会意，便道：「桃花细逐杨花落。」轮应陆宗沅、孙亮功各一杯。陆宗沅因亮功喷了他酒，便道：「无可奈何花落去。」接着杨方猷便道：「索性一总喝两杯罢。」亮功道：「很好，你说罢。」杨方本猷道：","en":"said, \\"I invite Master Sun to savor the 'Rear Courtyard Flowers' wine.\\" The table erupted into laughter once more. Lianggong pinched Guibao playfully and drank the wine. Next, it was Wang Wenhui's turn to issue a flying toast. Guibao directed a conspicuous pout toward Sun Lianggong, and Wenhui, catching the hint, recited, \\"'Peach blossoms drift lazily, following the falling"}],"6":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["孙亮功"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"到了初五日，颜夫人也要请客，请了他表嫂王文辉的陆氏夫人，并他家孙氏少奶奶，与两位表侄女，又请了孙亮功的陆氏夫人，与其大姑娘，并两位少奶奶，就是孙大姑娘辞了不来。","en":"Lu, along with that household's young mistress née Sun and his two cousin-nieces. She also invited the wife of Sun Lianggong, Madam Lu, together with her eldest daughter and two young mistresses—though the eldest Miss Sun politely declined."},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":5,"tokens":["亮功"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"。王文辉的夫人生得风流窈窕，是个直性爽快人，与文辉琴瑟和谐。这孙家的陆夫人，容貌也与乃姊彷佛，但性情悍妒，本将亮功有些看不起，又为他前妻遗下来三个宝贝，都是绝世无双，心头眼底刻刻生烦，闲来只好将亮功解个闷儿。这亮功从前的前妻，是极丑陋的，也接接连连生了一女两男，后娶了这位美貌佳人，便当着菩萨供养。这个陆夫人，也是自小娇憨惯的。到了如今二十余年，已是四十来岁人，性","en":"mirrored her elder sister's beauty but harbored a fierce, jealous temperament. She had always held her husband, Lianggong, in slight contempt, a disdain compounded by the presence of his three exceptionally gifted children from his first marriage—constant thorns in her side. In her idle moments, she would amuse herself by tormenting him. Lianggong's late first wife had"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":1,"tokens":["亮功"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"夫人也深知其所适非人，便心里十分疼爱起来。当下各人见礼已毕，谈起家常来，文辉的夫人，总称赞子玉，似有欣羡之意。亮功的夫人笑道：「姐姐，你的外甥固好，就我的外甥女也不错。你既然这样心爱，你何不将我的外甥女，配了你的外甥，也如我将我的外甥，配了你的外甥女一样。你们亲上加亲，教我也沾个四门亲的光儿不好吗？」颜夫人初听，竟摸不清楚，后来想着了，就笑道：「姊姊好口齿，这么","en":"greetings concluded and casual chatter resumed, Wang Wenhui's wife lavishly praised Ziyu with obvious admiration. Lianggong's wife laughed and said, \\"Sister, your nephew is undoubtedly fine, but my niece is equally matched. Since you hold him in such high regard, why not pair my niece with your nephew, just as I matched my nephew with your niece? We would forge a closer bond,"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":6,"tokens":["亮功"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"家也常说起来。去年表兄来托我们做媒，我就要说出来，刚刚有件什么事情来，就打断了，没有能说，至今还耿耿在心的。」亮功的夫人冒冒失失道：「就这样罢，儿女之事，娘也可以作得主的，定要父亲吗？」颜夫人道：「若别家呢，我就不敢做主，自然要等他父亲答应。若说这外甥女，是我们二人商量过许多回了，都是一心一意的，只要表嫂肯赏脸就是了。」文辉的夫人道：「我们也是这样。」亮功的夫人","en":"I was on the verge of suggesting it, but an interruption prevented me. It has lingered in my mind ever since.\\" Lianggong's wife, bold and direct, said, \\"Then let us settle it right here and now! In matters concerning children, a mother has the right to decide—must we always wait for the father?\\" Lady Yan answered, \\"Were it another family, I would not dare decide alone"}],"15":[{"paragraph":4,"mentions":3,"tokens":["孙伯敬","孙亮功","亮功"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"今又远行了，也须过个礼，不是这样就算的，别要教人怪起来。」士燮笑道：「你不说我竟想不起，这个是必要的，明日就请孙伯敬为媒就是了。」正说话间，孙亮功来拜，士燮出见，问了起程日子，便说起他的夫人的意思来，说：「新年与王家订亲，彼此是娘儿们行事，究竟也须行过礼，方才成个局面。况你此去也须三年才回，不应似这样草草。」士燮道：「我们正商量到此，原打算来请吾兄。明日先过个帖，","en":"Shixie laughed: \\"Without you to remind me, I would have entirely forgotten. It is certainly necessary — I'll ask Sun Bojing to act as matchmaker tomorrow.\\" While they were still talking, Sun Lianggong came to pay a visit. Shixie received him and, after asking about Sun's planned travel date, brought up his wife's thoughts on the matter, saying: \\"At New Year we arranged an"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":3,"tokens":["亮功"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"次日，颜夫人备了彩盒礼帖，请亮功来，送了过去。文辉处回礼丰盛，有颜仲清帮同亮功押了回来，士燮备酒相待。是日不请外客，就请聘才、元茂相陪。这李元茂今日福至心灵，说话竟清楚起来。性全出京时留下二百两银子与他，元茂买了几件衣裳，混身光亮。亮功眼力本是平常，今见了元茂团头大脸，书气满容，便","en":"The next day, Lady Yan prepared decorative gift boxes with formal betrothal documents and asked Lianggong to convey them. The return gifts from the Wenhui household were lavish; Yan Zhongqing helped Lianggong bring them back, and Shixie hosted a wine reception. That day no outside guests were invited; only Pincai and Yuanmao were asked to keep the company."},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":3,"tokens":["孙亮功","亮功"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"却说孙亮功回去与陆夫人商量，要将大女儿许与元茂，陆夫人冷笑了几声，不发一言，亮功不敢再说。然主意已定，明日去托王文辉为媒，文辉踌躇了半天，心里想道：「这个白人儿，怎好嫁人？」因又想道：「那李元茂，也不是个佳婿，呆头呆脑的，那一天作个揖，就将我的帽子碰歪，只好娶","en":"Now let us speak of Sun Lianggong, who returned home and discussed with Madam Lu the idea of betrothing his eldest daughter to Yuanmao. Madam Lu laughed coldly several times without saying a word; Lianggong did not dare press her further. Nevertheless, his mind was made up, and the next"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":1,"tokens":["孙亮功"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"起程，颜仲清、王恂、魏聘才、李元茂一起随后，颜夫人领着子玉，并有些仆妇丫鬟一群的车，也送出城来。城外是王文辉、孙亮功等十几个同年至好，一齐在旗亭饯别。士燮盘桓了一会，文辉等进城。天色不早，颜夫人也只得带了仆妇丫鬟洒泪先回。子玉、仲清、聘才、元茂与些家人们，随到店中住了一夜，明日叩别。","en":"female servants and maids, also accompanied him in carriages out of the city. Outside the city gate, Wang Wenhui, Sun Lianggong, and a dozen or so fellow examination graduates and close friends were all gathered at a roadside inn to host a farewell feast. Shixie lingered for a while; Wenhui and the others then reentered the city. As the sky was growing late, Lady Yan could only"}],"23":[{"paragraph":9,"mentions":1,"tokens":["孙亮功"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"的传说开来。过后元茂因王保失手打破了茶碗，打了他两个嘴巴，王保不平，便将那日的事告诉众人，从此又复传扬开去，连孙亮功也略略知道了，自然过门之后，要教训女婿起来。此是后话不提。","en":"the resentful boy recounted the events of that day to the servants, and the story circulated further until even Sun Lianggong heard whispers of it. Naturally, after the marriage, he would take his son-in-law to task—but that is a story for later."},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":1,"tokens":["孙亮功"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"平常，专靠巴结，因声名传开了，近省地方竟弄不出个馆地来。只得带了些银钱货物进京，希图结交显宦，弄个大馆出来。于孙亮功谊有葭莩，遂送了一分厚礼，托其吹嘘汲引。已经来了两月，却也认得数人，正是十分谄笑，一味谦恭。","en":"hoped to curry favor with high-ranking officials and land a lucrative assignment. Relying on his distant ties to Sun Lianggong, he sent a lavish gift, begging for his patronage and recommendation. Having been in the capital for two months, he had managed to acquaint himself with a few people, acting with utmost obsequiousness and unctuous humility."}],"27":[{"paragraph":4,"mentions":1,"tokens":["孙亮功"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"班不远，且是个直隶州，若得个美缺，一二年就可发财；又知他是个大手笔，不过胡涂公子，官将来怕不是替我做的，便去求孙亮功转托王文辉，竟是一说就妥。真是物以类聚，又是个爱淘毛厕的，臭味相投。进门住了几天，看出东家脾气，便要巴结，已将巴英官送他用了几回，奚十一心上极为畅快。那巴英官伺候过大老爷，在师爷面前，越发骄纵起来。况又得了几件新衣，裱糊好了，觉得更加光彩。姬亮轩每到","en":"open-handed but a muddle-headed young gentleman, he reckoned the post would in practice be his own to run. He had begged Sun Lianggong to speak to Wang Wenhui, and it was settled at once. Birds of a feather, another sewer-raker of matching stench, within days he had read his patron's temper and set out to curry favor. He had already lent Ba Yingguan several times, and Xi was delighted."}],"30":[{"paragraph":4,"mentions":1,"tokens":["孙亮功"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"文泽为什么不应举呢？这一科大主考即系文泽之父大宗伯刘守正，副主考系王文辉，已升了阁学，陆宗沅、杨芳猷、周锡爵、孙亮功一班可可的一齐分房，将那一班知名之士回避了一大半。内中除徐子云、史南湘是前科举人，萧次贤是高尚自居，无心问世，只有田春航、高品入场。如子玉、王恂、文泽、仲清等皆遵例回避。子玉在家闷闷不乐，又因琴言杳无音信，内外隔绝，又不能传递消息，几次要去访问聘才，","en":"Wenhui, who had been promoted to Academician of the Grand Secretariat. Lu Zongyuan, Yang Fangyou, Zhou Xijue, and Sun Lianggong—this group of notable figures all served as associate examiners, which meant more than half of the well-known scholars had to avoid the exams due to conflict of interest. Among them, except for Xu Ziyun and Shi Nanxiang, who were already provincial graduates"}],"32":[{"paragraph":10,"mentions":2,"tokens":["孙亮功","亮功"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"春航出于第四房孙亮功门下，相见之后，亮功久已闻名，就是刘尚书、王阁学，虽未见过春航，于他儿子们书房内，见他些笔墨东西，也久已倾倒，惟恐不得其人为憾。今中了南元，十分欢喜。从此春航与文泽、王恂又成了世谊，更加亲爱。惟有孙氏昆仲颇难浃洽，然亦不得不往来，惟淡交而已。高品代枪","en":"Chunhang had been passed by the fourth-room examiner, Sun Lianggong. Upon their meeting, Lianggong was extremely pleased that he had placed Nanyuan. He had long heard of Chunhang's reputation, as even Minister Liu and Academician Wang, though they had never met Chunhang, had seen his writing and calligraphy in their"}],"38":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":2,"tokens":["孙亮功","亮功"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"且说徐子云请了屈公来，并请南湘、仲清、文泽、春航、王恂、子玉作陪，仍在梅崦中。王恂是日为孙亮功请去有事，因李元茂吉期已定，要招赘过来。亮功因两位贤郎是不懂事的，一切皆托王恂料理，王恂所以不能前来。","en":"Xun, and Ziyu as companions, again in the Plum Knoll. Wang Xun on this particular day had been called away by Sun Lianggong on an important matter: the wedding date had been fixed for Li Yuanmao, who was to be adopted into the Sun household as a son-in-law. Since Sun's two sons were not yet capable of managing such affairs, everything had been entrusted to Wang Xun, and so"}],"39":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["孙亮功"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说王恂前日不能赴怡园之约，因为孙亮功请去商办喜事，也替他张罗了几天。定于二月初十日招赘，也不多几天了。新年李性全寄了几百两银子来与元茂，并写个禀帖与王文辉，要替他儿子办喜事。王文辉不耐烦作媒，俱令王恂代劳。李元茂求着了魏聘才，求其代制一切。魏聘才闹了一个多月，花的，输的，丢了好些银钱，","en":"to our story: Wang Xun had been unable to keep his appointment at the Garden of Contentment the other day, for Sun Lianggong had engaged him to help arrange the wedding, and he had spent several days running about on the matter. The ceremony was set for the tenth day of the second month, which was not many days off. At the New Year, Li Xingquan had sent several hundred taels"},{"paragraph":2,"mentions":2,"tokens":["亮功"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"聘才明日去拜王文辉，文辉进衙门去了，王恂接待。又同去见了亮功，说了些客套，无非是现在客途，无人照料，一切尚求包涵等语。亮功道：「原是爱亲结亲，这些烦文，一概删去。我也不要破费他一钱，一切在我就是了。」即留聘才吃饭。","en":"Wenhui had gone into the yamen; Wang Xun received him instead. They then went together to pay their respects to Lianggong, exchanged the usual pleasantries, mentioning that they were currently sojourning away from home with no one to look after things, and begged for his forbearance. Lianggong said, \\"We are joining hands because we love the same family; all this formality"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":1,"tokens":["亮功"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"未必能美。我也有些风闻，只要不像那两位弟兄的相貌就好了。」到了吉时，都送元茂到了孙宅，孙宅鼓乐迎接。此位姑娘系亮功前室所生，如今这位夫人也不甚钟爱他，故此一切从简。女客只有陆氏夫人的嫂子，就是陆宗沅的夫人，带了小女儿前来。男家早上道过喜了。倒是姬亮轩在那里假热闹，心上想闹闹新房，自有两位废物招接。","en":"the Sun residence, where he was welcomed with drums and music. The young lady in question was the daughter of Lianggong's first wife; the current Madam Sun did not dote on her especially, and so the whole affair was conducted simply. Among the female guests, only the sister-in-law of Madam Lu, the wife of Lu Zongyuan, had come, bringing her young daughter. The groom's"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":2,"tokens":["亮功"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"孙氏见丈夫两三天不回，心上急了，禀明了父母。亮功大怒，陆夫人也有了气，便着人到梅宅上一问，没有去。又各处找寻，找到了聘才处，找着了。元茂尚不肯回去，聘才力劝，方同了来人回家，犹不肯进房，在书房中同嗣徽说闲话。晚间亮功回来，即说了元茂几句，陆夫人也责备了元茂一番，然究竟心上有些对不住元茂，半说半劝的","en":"seeing her husband fail to return for two or three days, grew anxious and reported the matter to her parents. Lianggong was furious; Madam Lu too was displeased, and she sent someone to the Mei household to inquire, but he was not there. After searching everywhere, he was found at Pincai's. Yuanmao still refused to go back; only after Pincai pressed him earnestly did"}],"51":[{"paragraph":7,"mentions":1,"tokens":["亮功"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"嗣徽上了马，元茂坐了车，一同回寓，嗣元被州官叫了去了。却又得了个喜信，亮功放了安徽凤阳府。嗣徽心中大喜，就想回家，等着下科再花些银子，找人枪一枪，就可以拔贡了，无奈为嗣元的文卷尚未问明，只得再待两天。元茂得了一个秀才，也就心满意足，如今又娶了亲，心中一无牵挂。却喜丈人与他父亲同在一省，便可同了媳妇回去，在任乐几年。也为嗣元","en":"returned to their lodging, Siyuan having already been summoned by the prefectural official. Then came glad tidings: Lianggong had been appointed to Fengyang Prefecture in Anhui. Sihui was overjoyed and wished to return home immediately, planning to spend more silver on ghostwriters for the next examination to secure a tribute student position. Alas, because the matter of Siyuan's"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":1,"tokens":["孙亮功"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"孙嗣元因文卷之事，在州里押了一日。今日州官问他，他倒期期艾艾的顶撞了州官，本要打他几板，因他是孙亮功的儿子，留他体面，送到宛平教谕处戒斥。他又将教官得罪了，教官气极，遂将他牵到通州学明伦堂上，叫门斗按在板凳上，结结实实打了二十竹板，打得嗣元杀猪似的叫起来，口又结巴，带着南边话「入娘、入娘」的乱骂，门斗也恨他，狠狠的打了几下，打得嗣元两腿紫烂，一步一","en":"belligerent, talked back. The official, intending to order a beating, relented out of respect for Siyuan's father, Sun Lianggong, wishing to preserve some face. Instead, Siyuan was sent to the Wanping county instructor for reprimand. There, he managed to offend the instructor as well. The instructor, trembling with rage, dragged Siyuan to the Minglun Hall of the Tongzhou academy,"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":1,"tokens":["亮功"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"了棍子要打嗣元，元茂连忙解劝分开了，两个还斗嘴斗舌的闹了半天。到五更，大家起来，收拾了，天明上车而回。到了家，亮功见大儿子与女婿进了学，也甚欢喜。又恨嗣元不通，出了大丑，痛骂了一顿。嗣元回房，又被他媳妇巴氏羞辱了一顿，他的气苦无门可诉，只好在外面逢人便说，他乃兄是代枪进学的，又在他炕上闹了缝穷的，所以大不吉利，害他吃了苦。众人听了这些话，不过一笑而已。","en":"finally rose, packed their belongings, and at daybreak, boarded a carriage to return home. Upon their arrival, Lianggong was overjoyed to see his eldest son and son-in-law had passed their examinations. Yet, infuriated by Siyuan's incompetence and the massive public embarrassment he had caused, Lianggong delivered a blistering scolding. Retreating to his room, Siyuan faced"},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":1,"tokens":["孙亮功"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"孙亮功到领凭之后，即到通州写了四个太平船赴任，自然的一样饯行热闹。惟有王恂的夫人，见父亲哥嫂一齐出京，未免凄凉悲苦，在母家住了几日。陆夫人也疼爱到十分，又不能带他赴任，只好劝慰他一番。元茂与孙氏是同去的。元茂外间有些亏空，这两天追逼起来，孙氏虽有些妆资，但","en":"After receiving his official posting documents, Sun Lianggong traveled to Tongzhou to hire four peaceful riverboats for the journey to his new post. Naturally, this was accompanied by the usual lively rounds of farewell banquets. Only Wang Xun's wife, seeing her father, brothers, and sister-in-law all departing"}],"52":[{"paragraph":20,"mentions":1,"tokens":["亮功"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"刘守正与杨方猷不解其故，连声的问，文辉就将亮功女儿漆头发的一事讲出来，听得众人皆笑，连张桐孙也笑起来。周锡爵道：「既是这么着，质夫，你何不到班里借个假胡子带着，省得这乌黑的东西，沾染了你们如夫人的脸。」刘守正道：「这一染，就直染到胸前呢。」文辉道：「嚼你的舌头。」陆宗沅道：「怎么你把这尺寸都量得","en":"Yang Fangyou, not understanding the context, pressed for an explanation. Wenhui then recounted the old story of Lianggong's daughter dyeing her hair, which sent everyone into fits of laughter—even Zhang Tongsun chuckled. Zhou Xijue suggested, \\"If that is the case, Zhifu, why not borrow a fake beard from the theater troupe? It would save that black dye from rubbing off onto"}]}`),"char-50":{2:[{paragraph:35,mentions:3,tokens:["杨方猷"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"保进来，见过主人。不多一刻，客已全到，便安起席来。这些客都是文辉同年，论年纪孙亮功最长，因系姻亲，便让兵部员外杨方猷坐了首席。对面是光禄寺少卿周锡爵。监察御史陆宗沅坐了第三席，孙亮功坐了第四席，文辉坐了主席。桂保斟了一巡酒，杨方猷命他入席，对着王文辉坐了。文辉问他哥哥兰保为什么不来，桂保道：「今日本都在怡园逛了一天，徐老爷知道这里请客，才打发我来的。兰保、宝珠、蕙",en:"fellow graduates. As Sun Lianggong was the eldest and a relative by marriage, they offered the seat of honor to Yang Fangyou, a Vice Director in the Ministry of War. Seated opposite him was Zhou Xijue, Vice Minister of the Court of Imperial Entertainments. Investigating Censor Lu Zongyuan took the third seat, Sun Lianggong the fourth, while Wenhui presided as the host. Guibao"},{paragraph:36,mentions:1,tokens:["杨方猷"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"么都放得进去。」孙亮功道：「完了！把个令祖宗请了来了。」文辉命人取了六个钱来。周锡爵道：「这杯分个大小才好。」杨方猷道：「我们两个一杯三开罢。「陆宗沅道：「未免太少些，你们一杯两开，我们都是一杯一开何如？」俱各依允。桂保伸出一个拳来，问文辉吃多少杯？",en:`servants to fetch six coins. Zhou Xijue advised, "This cup should be divided into larger and smaller portions." Yang Fangyou proposed, "Let the two of us split a cup three ways." Lu Zongyuan countered, "That seems too meager. Why don't you two divide a cup in half, while the rest of us take one full cup each? How does that sound?" Everyone nodded in agreement. Guibao extended`},{paragraph:37,mentions:2,tokens:["杨方猷"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"个人竟以六杯为率，不必增减，准他一杯化作几杯就是了。也没有闷雷霹雷，那个猜着，就依令而行，最为剪截。」桂保便问杨方猷道：「第一杯怎样喝？」杨方猷道：「一杯化作三杯，找人豁拳。」又问孙亮功：「第二三杯怎样喝？」亮功道：「两杯都装作小旦敬人。」周锡爵道：「我们这样的胡子，倒有些难装。」亮功道：「只要做作得好，便有胡子也不妨。」桂保又问陆宗沅道：「第四杯呢？」陆宗沅道：",en:`simply executes the game's designated action. That is the most straightforward method." Guibao then turned to Yang Fangyou, "What is the rule for the first cup?" Yang Fangyou replied, "One cup becomes three, finger-guessing with your partner." He then asked Sun Lianggong, "What about the second and third cups?" Lianggong decreed, "Both cups entail impersonating a young female`},{paragraph:39,mentions:1,tokens:["杨方猷"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"猜就着。」放开手看时，正是两个。遂取了三个杯子，斟满了酒，放在亮功面前。亮功道：「这是杨四兄的令，就和你豁。」杨方猷道：「我是半杯说过的。」亮功道「豁起来再讲。」可可响了三响，亮功输了三拳，便道：「今日拳运不佳，让了你罢。」",en:`them before Lianggong. Lianggong said, "This follows Brother Yang's rule, I challenge you to finger-guessing." Yang Fangyou reminded him, "I specifically wagered half a cup." Lianggong dismissed it, "We will settle the portions after the match." They played three rapid rounds, and Lianggong lost all three. Resigned, he said, "My luck at finger-guessing is dismal today, I`},{paragraph:40,mentions:2,tokens:["杨方猷"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"是作法自弊了。也罢，让我来敬两个人。」随站起来，左手拿了杯酒，右手掩了胡子，把头扭了两扭，笑迷迷软腰细步的走到杨方猷面前，请了一个安，娇声娇气的道「敬杨老爷一杯酒，务必赏个脸儿。」说着，把眼睛四下里飞了一转，宛然联锦班内京丑谭八的丑态，引得合席大笑，桂保笑得如花枝乱颤，杨方猷只得饮了一杯。孙亮功掐了一枝梅花，插在帽边，又取了一个大杯，捻手蹑脚的走到陆宗沅面前，斟了",en:'beard with his right, tilted his head coquettishly twice, and, wearing a beguiling smile, minced delicately toward Yang Fangyou with a swaying gait. Executing a demure curtsy, he cooed in a sickeningly sweet voice, "I present Master Yang with a cup of wine, please do me the honor of accepting." As he spoke, his eyes darted flirtatiously around the table, perfectly mimicking the'},{paragraph:41,mentions:1,tokens:["杨方猷"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"会意，便道：「桃花细逐杨花落。」轮应陆宗沅、孙亮功各一杯。陆宗沅因亮功喷了他酒，便道：「无可奈何花落去。」接着杨方猷便道：「索性一总喝两杯罢。」亮功道：「很好，你说罢。」杨方本猷道：「笑隔荷花共人语。」桂保斟了两杯，孙亮功喝了。轮着桂保飞花，想了一想，说道：「好将花下承金粉。」数到又是亮功，众人说：「好。」亮功道：「不好，不好。这句是杜撰的，不是古人诗。」桂保道：",en:`Zongyuan, still vexed by the wine sprayed in his face, quoted, "'Helplessly, the flowers fall and drift away.'" Yang Fangyou quickly followed, "Let us combine them and drink two cups together." Lianggong agreed enthusiastically, "Excellent, proceed." Yang Fangyou recited, "'Laughing across the lotus flowers, sharing words with another.'" Guibao poured two cups, and Sun Lianggong`}],30:[{paragraph:4,mentions:1,tokens:["杨芳猷"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"正是秋试二场，刘文泽为什么不应举呢？这一科大主考即系文泽之父大宗伯刘守正，副主考系王文辉，已升了阁学，陆宗沅、杨芳猷、周锡爵、孙亮功一班可可的一齐分房，将那一班知名之士回避了一大半。内中除徐子云、史南湘是前科举人，萧次贤是高尚自居，无心问世，只有田春航、高品入场。如子玉、王恂、文泽、仲清等皆遵例回避。子玉在家闷闷不乐，又因琴言杳无音信，内外隔绝，又不能传递消息，几",en:"associate examiner was Wang Wenhui, who had been promoted to Academician of the Grand Secretariat. Lu Zongyuan, Yang Fangyou, Zhou Xijue, and Sun Lianggong—this group of notable figures all served as associate examiners, which meant more than half of the well-known scholars had to avoid the exams due to conflict of interest. Among them, except for Xu Ziyun and Shi Nanxiang,"}],49:[{paragraph:5,mentions:2,tokens:["杨方猷"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"却说春航要续弦，选择清门之语，传入苏侯耳内，正合他意。便在武选司郎中杨方猷面前，略露了些口风，似要他去对春航说，托人来求的意思。杨方猷是春航的房师，心中甚喜，即来与春航讲了，叫他请人去求亲。春航倒有些踌躇，因苏家是世禄之家，门庭烜赫，自己虽成了名，依然寒素，因此有些不愿。且未知那位小姐怎样，也要留心一访。但系座师愿与他联姻",en:"family reached the ears of Su the Marquis, fitting his own desires perfectly. He dropped a few subtle hints before Yang Fangyou, Director of the Bureau of Military Appointments, suggesting he convey to Chunhang that he should send an intermediary to propose. Yang Fangyou was Chunhang's examiner-teacher; delighted by the prospect, he immediately relayed this to Chunhang, urging"},{paragraph:9,mentions:1,tokens:["杨方猷"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"堂，见了春航进来，连忙迎接，彼此谈了些话。春航问他与苏侯是师生，可知他家的细底。子云道：「你问他做甚？」春航将杨方猷的话对子云讲了，子云连忙称贺道：「恭喜，恭喜！这个喜，比你中状元还要大些。」春航笑道：「不过显官罢了，知道成与不成，吾兄倒先贺起来。」子云道：「显官什么要紧，又不要借他声势。但这个苏侯是我的中举座师，又是家兄会试房师，又是家严的盟弟，两重年谊，一重世",en:`Su the Marquis, knew the intimate details of his household. "Why do you ask?" Ziyun asked. Chunhang recounted Yang Fangyou's words. Ziyun immediately offered his congratulations. "Congratulations, congratulations! This joy is even greater than your taking first place in the imperial examinations!" Chunhang laughed, "It's nothing but a connection to high office, and you start`}],52:[{paragraph:3,mentions:1,tokens:["杨方猷"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"航张罗。初六那一日有两处戏酒，一处在聚星堂，请的是乡试座师礼部尚书刘守正、座师内阁学士王文辉、会试房师兵部郎中杨方猷，鸿胪寺卿周锡爵、光禄少卿陆宗沅，这两位是同乡前辈兼有年谊。张桐孙陪了这几位在聚星堂观戏，演得是联珠班。春航陪着一班名士在花园挹爽斋观演联锦班。那一天大媒是徐子云，客是萧次贤、高品、南湘、颜仲清、刘文泽、王恂、梅子玉。近日子玉病已好了，勉强打起精神出",en:"Chunhang's examination mentors—Liu Shouzheng, the Minister of Rites; Wang Wenhui, Academician of the Grand Secretariat; Yang Fangyou, Director of the Ministry of War; alongside Zhou Xijue, the Chief Minister of the Court of State Ceremonial, and Lu Zongyuan, the Deputy Minister of the Court of Imperial Entertainments, both of whom were elder fellow-townsmen and old acquaintances."},{paragraph:17,mentions:1,tokens:["杨方猷"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"便叫了他出来。蕙芳也累苦了，乐得出来歇歇，便到文辉席上来，就在文辉旁边坐了。此处是两席，那席是刘守正、周锡爵、杨方猷，这席是王文辉、陆宗沅、张桐孙。文辉道：「这几天我知道你也累极了，所以叫你出来歇歇，此刻也应没有什么事了。」蕙芳道：「也没有什么忙，借此倒可跟着张二爷学学。那张二爷实在可以，大大小小，没有一点遗漏。」陆宗沅道：「这是张老二的专门本事。大概遇着这些事情",en:'and went to sit beside Wenhui. The hall was divided into two tables: one seated Liu Shouzheng, Zhou Xijue, and Yang Fangyou; the other seated Wang Wenhui, Lu Zongyuan, and Zhang Tongsun. Wenhui said kindly, "I know you have been worked to the bone these past days, so I called you out to rest. By now, the heavy work should be finished." Huifang replied, "It is not too busy'},{paragraph:19,mentions:1,tokens:["杨方猷"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"陆宗沅笑道：「你不要带着人说，我们的胡子不是染的。」那边席上的刘尚书、周锡爵、杨方猷都笑起来，惟有张桐孙是个道学人，不会顽笑。周锡爵道：「质夫，你那乌须药的方子，可是你孙亲家传你的？」文辉道：「他那几根胡子，要用什么乌须药？」既而一想，便大笑起来。陆宗沅也明白，也笑了。",en:'Zongyuan laughed, "Speak for yourself! Our beards are not dyed." At the other table, Minister Liu, Zhou Xijue, and Yang Fangyou all burst into laughter. Only Zhang Tongsun, a rigid neo-Confucian scholar, remained unamused. Zhou Xijue called out, "Zhifu, did that black-beard prescription of yours come from your Sun-family in-laws?" Wenhui replied dismissively, "With those few'},{paragraph:20,mentions:1,tokens:["杨方猷"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"刘守正与杨方猷不解其故，连声的问，文辉就将亮功女儿漆头发的一事讲出来，听得众人皆笑，连张桐孙也笑起来。周锡爵道：「既是这么着，质夫，你何不到班里借个假胡子带着，省得这乌黑的东西，沾染了你们如夫人的脸。」刘守正道：「这一染，就直染到胸前呢。」文辉道：「嚼你的舌头。」",en:`Liu Shouzheng and Yang Fangyou, not understanding the context, pressed for an explanation. Wenhui then recounted the old story of Lianggong's daughter dyeing her hair, which sent everyone into fits of laughter—even Zhang Tongsun chuckled. Zhou Xijue suggested, "If that is the case,`},{paragraph:22,mentions:1,tokens:["杨方猷"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"辉的陆氏夫人，带了他大姑奶奶蓉华并媳妇孙少奶奶佩秋，又请刘守正的夫人，没有来，他媳妇吴少奶奶紫烟来了。周锡爵、杨方猷、陆宗沅的夫人都辞了。",en:"who could not attend, though her daughter-in-law, Madam Wu Ziyan, came in her stead. The wives of Zhou Xijue, Yang Fangyou, and Lu Zongyuan all politely declined."}]},"char-51":{2:[{paragraph:35,mentions:1,tokens:["周锡爵"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"全到，便安起席来。这些客都是文辉同年，论年纪孙亮功最长，因系姻亲，便让兵部员外杨方猷坐了首席。对面是光禄寺少卿周锡爵。监察御史陆宗沅坐了第三席，孙亮功坐了第四席，文辉坐了主席。桂保斟了一巡酒，杨方猷命他入席，对着王文辉坐了。文辉问他哥哥兰保为什么不来，桂保道：「今日本都在怡园逛了一天，徐老爷知道这里请客，才打发我来的。兰保、宝珠、蕙芳、漱芳、玉林都还没有散，只怕总",en:"they offered the seat of honor to Yang Fangyou, a Vice Director in the Ministry of War. Seated opposite him was Zhou Xijue, Vice Minister of the Court of Imperial Entertainments. Investigating Censor Lu Zongyuan took the third seat, Sun Lianggong the fourth, while Wenhui presided as the host. Guibao poured a round of wine, after which Yang Fangyou invited him to join the"},{paragraph:36,mentions:1,tokens:["周锡爵"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"个令罢。」桂保道：「打擂最好，什么都放得进去。」孙亮功道：「完了！把个令祖宗请了来了。」文辉命人取了六个钱来。周锡爵道：「这杯分个大小才好。」杨方猷道：「我们两个一杯三开罢。「陆宗沅道：「未免太少些，你们一杯两开，我们都是一杯一开何如？」俱各依允。桂保伸出一个拳来，问文辉吃多少杯？",en:`doomed! We have invited the very patriarch of drinking games." Wenhui instructed the servants to fetch six coins. Zhou Xijue advised, "This cup should be divided into larger and smaller portions." Yang Fangyou proposed, "Let the two of us split a cup three ways." Lu Zongyuan countered, "That seems too meager. Why don't you two divide a cup in half, while the rest of us take`},{paragraph:37,mentions:1,tokens:["周锡爵"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"样喝？」杨方猷道：「一杯化作三杯，找人豁拳。」又问孙亮功：「第二三杯怎样喝？」亮功道：「两杯都装作小旦敬人。」周锡爵道：「我们这样的胡子，倒有些难装。」亮功道：「只要做作得好，便有胡子也不妨。」桂保又问陆宗沅道：「第四杯呢？」陆宗沅道：「把瓜子抓一把，数到谁就是谁。」桂保道：",en:'and third cups?" Lianggong decreed, "Both cups entail impersonating a young female performer presenting wine." Zhou Xijue interjected, "With our prominent beards, that will prove somewhat challenging to act out." Lianggong reassured him, "So long as the performance is convincing, a beard poses no obstacle." Guibao then asked Lu Zongyuan, "And the fourth cup?" Lu Zongyuan'},{paragraph:38,mentions:1,tokens:["周锡爵"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"「这杯便宜了。」又问周锡爵道：「五六两杯行什么令？」",en:'"That cup got off lightly." He then asked Zhou Xijue, "What are the rules for the fifth and sixth cups?"'},{paragraph:39,mentions:1,tokens:["周锡爵"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"周锡爵道：「两杯化作六杯，花字飞觞。」桂保先问文辉道：「几个？」文辉道：「一个。」顺手便问亮功道：「几个？」亮功伸着两指道：「就是两个。」桂保笑道：「好猜手，一猜就着。」放开手看时，正是两个。遂取了三个杯子，斟满了酒，放在亮功面前。亮功道：「这是杨四兄的令",en:`Zhou Xijue proposed, "Two cups become six, utilizing a 'flying toast' featuring the character for 'flower' (hua)." Guibao first addressed Wang Wenhui, "How many?" Wenhui answered, "One." Without pausing, he asked Lianggong, "How many?" Lianggong raised two fingers,`},{paragraph:41,mentions:5,tokens:["周锡爵"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"，众人说：「好。」亮功道：「不好，不好。这句是杜撰的，不是古人诗。」桂保道：「怎么是杜撰？现在是陆龟蒙的诗。」周锡爵道：「不错的，你不能不喝这杯。」亮功道：「他想了半天，有心飞到我的。他若能随口说两句飞着我，我就喝。」桂保道：「真么？你不要赖。」亮功道：「不赖，不赖。」桂保一连说了三句道：「月满花香记得无」，「漱齿花前酒半酣」，「楼上花枝笑独眠」。」众人拍手称妙，",en:'belongs to no ancient poet." Guibao retorted, "Fabricated? It is a genuine line from the poetry of Lu Guimeng." Zhou Xijue confirmed, "He is quite correct, you cannot escape this cup." Lianggong grumbled, "He pondered for an age, deliberately engineering it to land on me. If he can recite two more lines off the cuff that land on me, I will drink." Guibao challenged, "Truly?'}],30:[{paragraph:4,mentions:1,tokens:["周锡爵"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"二场，刘文泽为什么不应举呢？这一科大主考即系文泽之父大宗伯刘守正，副主考系王文辉，已升了阁学，陆宗沅、杨芳猷、周锡爵、孙亮功一班可可的一齐分房，将那一班知名之士回避了一大半。内中除徐子云、史南湘是前科举人，萧次贤是高尚自居，无心问世，只有田春航、高品入场。如子玉、王恂、文泽、仲清等皆遵例回避。子玉在家闷闷不乐，又因琴言杳无音信，内外隔绝，又不能传递消息，几次要去访",en:"examiner was Wang Wenhui, who had been promoted to Academician of the Grand Secretariat. Lu Zongyuan, Yang Fangyou, Zhou Xijue, and Sun Lianggong—this group of notable figures all served as associate examiners, which meant more than half of the well-known scholars had to avoid the exams due to conflict of interest. Among them, except for Xu Ziyun and Shi Nanxiang, who were already"}],52:[{paragraph:3,mentions:1,tokens:["周锡爵"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"日有两处戏酒，一处在聚星堂，请的是乡试座师礼部尚书刘守正、座师内阁学士王文辉、会试房师兵部郎中杨方猷，鸿胪寺卿周锡爵、光禄少卿陆宗沅，这两位是同乡前辈兼有年谊。张桐孙陪了这几位在聚星堂观戏，演得是联珠班。春航陪着一班名士在花园挹爽斋观演联锦班。那一天大媒是徐子云，客是萧次贤、高品、南湘、颜仲清、刘文泽、王恂、梅子玉。近日子玉病已好了，勉强打起精神出来。这八个名旦不",en:"Rites; Wang Wenhui, Academician of the Grand Secretariat; Yang Fangyou, Director of the Ministry of War; alongside Zhou Xijue, the Chief Minister of the Court of State Ceremonial, and Lu Zongyuan, the Deputy Minister of the Court of Imperial Entertainments, both of whom were elder fellow-townsmen and old acquaintances. Zhang Tongsun hosted these dignitaries as they watched"},{paragraph:17,mentions:1,tokens:["周锡爵"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"账房里，便叫了他出来。蕙芳也累苦了，乐得出来歇歇，便到文辉席上来，就在文辉旁边坐了。此处是两席，那席是刘守正、周锡爵、杨方猷，这席是王文辉、陆宗沅、张桐孙。文辉道：「这几天我知道你也累极了，所以叫你出来歇歇，此刻也应没有什么事了。」蕙芳道：「也没有什么忙，借此倒可跟着张二爷学学。那张二爷实在可以，大大小小，没有一点遗漏。」陆宗沅道：「这是张老二的专门本事。大概遇着",en:'chance to rest and went to sit beside Wenhui. The hall was divided into two tables: one seated Liu Shouzheng, Zhou Xijue, and Yang Fangyou; the other seated Wang Wenhui, Lu Zongyuan, and Zhang Tongsun. Wenhui said kindly, "I know you have been worked to the bone these past days, so I called you out to rest. By now, the heavy work should be finished." Huifang replied, "It'},{paragraph:19,mentions:2,tokens:["周锡爵"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"陆宗沅笑道：「你不要带着人说，我们的胡子不是染的。」那边席上的刘尚书、周锡爵、杨方猷都笑起来，惟有张桐孙是个道学人，不会顽笑。周锡爵道：「质夫，你那乌须药的方子，可是你孙亲家传你的？」文辉道：「他那几根胡子，要用什么乌须药？」既而一想，便大笑起来。陆宗沅也明白，也笑了。",en:'Lu Zongyuan laughed, "Speak for yourself! Our beards are not dyed." At the other table, Minister Liu, Zhou Xijue, and Yang Fangyou all burst into laughter. Only Zhang Tongsun, a rigid neo-Confucian scholar, remained unamused. Zhou Xijue called out, "Zhifu, did that black-beard prescription of yours come from your Sun-family in-laws?" Wenhui replied dismissively,'},{paragraph:20,mentions:2,tokens:["周锡爵"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"刘守正与杨方猷不解其故，连声的问，文辉就将亮功女儿漆头发的一事讲出来，听得众人皆笑，连张桐孙也笑起来。周锡爵道：「既是这么着，质夫，你何不到班里借个假胡子带着，省得这乌黑的东西，沾染了你们如夫人的脸。」刘守正道：「这一染，就直染到胸前呢。」文辉道：「嚼你的舌头。」陆宗沅道：「怎么你把这尺寸都量得清清楚楚的？」蕙芳道：「带着假胡子好。你索性把真胡子剃掉了，出",en:`of Lianggong's daughter dyeing her hair, which sent everyone into fits of laughter—even Zhang Tongsun chuckled. Zhou Xijue suggested, "If that is the case, Zhifu, why not borrow a fake beard from the theater troupe? It would save that black dye from rubbing off onto your ladies' faces." Liu Shouzheng added, "Once it rubs off, it stains right down to the chest!" Wenhui cursed`},{paragraph:22,mentions:1,tokens:["周锡爵"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"请了王文辉的陆氏夫人，带了他大姑奶奶蓉华并媳妇孙少奶奶佩秋，又请刘守正的夫人，没有来，他媳妇吴少奶奶紫烟来了。周锡爵、杨方猷、陆宗沅的夫人都辞了。",en:"Liu Shouzheng, who could not attend, though her daughter-in-law, Madam Wu Ziyan, came in her stead. The wives of Zhou Xijue, Yang Fangyou, and Lu Zongyuan all politely declined."}]},"char-52":{2:[{paragraph:35,mentions:2,tokens:["陆宗沅"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"。这些客都是文辉同年，论年纪孙亮功最长，因系姻亲，便让兵部员外杨方猷坐了首席。对面是光禄寺少卿周锡爵。监察御史陆宗沅坐了第三席，孙亮功坐了第四席，文辉坐了主席。桂保斟了一巡酒，杨方猷命他入席，对着王文辉坐了。文辉问他哥哥兰保为什么不来，桂保道：「今日本都在怡园逛了一天，徐老爷知道这里请客，才打发我来的。兰保、宝珠、蕙芳、漱芳、玉林都还没有散，只怕总要到四五更天才散",en:"War. Seated opposite him was Zhou Xijue, Vice Minister of the Court of Imperial Entertainments. Investigating Censor Lu Zongyuan took the third seat, Sun Lianggong the fourth, while Wenhui presided as the host. Guibao poured a round of wine, after which Yang Fangyou invited him to join the table, seating him opposite Wang Wenhui. Wenhui asked why his brother Lanbao had"},{paragraph:36,mentions:1,tokens:["陆宗沅"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"把个令祖宗请了来了。」文辉命人取了六个钱来。周锡爵道：「这杯分个大小才好。」杨方猷道：「我们两个一杯三开罢。「陆宗沅道：「未免太少些，你们一杯两开，我们都是一杯一开何如？」俱各依允。桂保伸出一个拳来，问文辉吃多少杯？",en:`divided into larger and smaller portions." Yang Fangyou proposed, "Let the two of us split a cup three ways." Lu Zongyuan countered, "That seems too meager. Why don't you two divide a cup in half, while the rest of us take one full cup each? How does that sound?" Everyone nodded in agreement. Guibao extended a fist and asked Wenhui how many cups he wagered.`},{paragraph:37,mentions:2,tokens:["陆宗沅"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"都装作小旦敬人。」周锡爵道：「我们这样的胡子，倒有些难装。」亮功道：「只要做作得好，便有胡子也不妨。」桂保又问陆宗沅道：「第四杯呢？」陆宗沅道：「把瓜子抓一把，数到谁就是谁。」桂保道：",en:'Lianggong reassured him, "So long as the performance is convincing, a beard poses no obstacle." Guibao then asked Lu Zongyuan, "And the fourth cup?" Lu Zongyuan instructed, "Grab a handful of melon seeds, count them out, and whoever the count lands on must drink." Guibao commented:'},{paragraph:40,mentions:8,tokens:["陆宗沅","陆都老爷","宗沅"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"合席大笑，桂保笑得如花枝乱颤，杨方猷只得饮了一杯。孙亮功掐了一枝梅花，插在帽边，又取了一个大杯，捻手蹑脚的走到陆宗沅面前，斟了酒道：「陆都老爷是向来疼我的，敬你这一杯。」陆宗沅道：「这大杯如何使得？」孙亮功道：「想来都老爷是要吃皮杯的。」说罢呷了一口，送到宗沅嘴边。宗沅站起来笑道：「这个免劳照顾。」大家狂笑起来，亮功忍不住要笑，酒咽不及，喷了陆宗沅一脸。众人一发哄",en:`of plum blossom, tucked it jauntily into the brim of his hat, seized a large cup, and crept stealthily toward Lu Zongyuan. Filling the cup, he crooned, "The Metropolitan Censor Lu has always showered me with affection, I dedicate this cup to you." Lu Zongyuan protested, "How am I to manage such a massive cup?" Sun Lianggong teased, "I assume the Censor prefers a 'skin cup'`},{paragraph:41,mentions:3,tokens:["陆宗沅"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"。亮功把桂保拧了一把，也喝了。下手是王文辉飞觞，桂保把嘴向孙亮功一呶，文辉会意，便道：「桃花细逐杨花落。」轮应陆宗沅、孙亮功各一杯。陆宗沅因亮功喷了他酒，便道：「无可奈何花落去。」接着杨方猷便道：「索性一总喝两杯罢。」亮功道：「很好，你说罢。」杨方本猷道：「笑隔荷花共人语。」桂保斟了两杯，孙亮功喝了。轮着桂保飞花，想了一想，说道：「好将花下承金粉。」数到又是亮功，",en:`hint, recited, "'Peach blossoms drift lazily, following the falling willow flowers.'" The count dictated that Lu Zongyuan and Sun Lianggong each drink a cup. Lu Zongyuan, still vexed by the wine sprayed in his face, quoted, "'Helplessly, the flowers fall and drift away.'" Yang Fangyou quickly followed, "Let us combine them and drink two cups together." Lianggong agreed`}],6:[{paragraph:1,mentions:1,tokens:["掌山西道陆"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"、内阁学士吴、翰林院侍读学士梅、詹事府正詹事庄、左庶子郑、通政司王、光禄寺少卿周、国子监司业张、吏科给事中史、掌山西道陆、兵部员外郎杨、工部郎中孙、共十二位。士燮看了比去年人更少了，叫小厮拿两副帖，到书房里去与魏、李两位少爷。",en:"Entertainments Zhou; Director of Studies of the Imperial College Zhang; Supervising Secretary of the Personnel Office Shi; Circuit Censor for Shanxi Lu; Vice Director of the Ministry of War Yang; and Director of the Ministry of Works Sun. Noting that there were even fewer names than the previous year, Scholar Mei instructed a young servant to convey two sets of cards to the study for the young gentlemen,"},{paragraph:3,mentions:1,tokens:["宗沅"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"这王、孙两家的陆氏夫人，是嫡堂姊妹，王家的陆氏夫人，是陆御史宗沅的堂妹，他亲哥哥叫陆宗淮，现任四川臬司。",en:"and Sun households, respectively—were first cousins. The Madam Lu of the Wang family was the paternal cousin of Censor Lu Zongyuan; her own elder brother, Lu Zonghuai, currently served as Judicial Commissioner of Sichuan."},{paragraph:4,mentions:1,tokens:["陆宗沅"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"孙家的陆氏夫人，是陆宗沅的胞妹。王家的陆夫人年四十一岁，孙家的陆夫人年三十九岁。这两位夫人都是续娶的。虽在中年，却还生得少艾，不过像三十来岁的人，而且性爱秾华，其服饰与少年人一样。王文辉的夫人生得风流窈窕，是个直性爽快人，与文辉琴瑟和谐。这孙家的陆夫人，容貌也与乃姊彷佛，但",en:"The Madam Lu of the Sun family was Lu Zongyuan's full sister. The Wang family's Madam Lu was forty-one, while the Sun family's Madam Lu was thirty-nine. Both women were second wives. Though entering middle age, they retained a remarkably youthful grace, appearing scarcely thirty. Sharing a fondness"}],30:[{paragraph:4,mentions:1,tokens:["陆宗沅"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"宴。此日正是秋试二场，刘文泽为什么不应举呢？这一科大主考即系文泽之父大宗伯刘守正，副主考系王文辉，已升了阁学，陆宗沅、杨芳猷、周锡爵、孙亮功一班可可的一齐分房，将那一班知名之士回避了一大半。内中除徐子云、史南湘是前科举人，萧次贤是高尚自居，无心问世，只有田春航、高品入场。如子玉、王恂、文泽、仲清等皆遵例回避。子玉在家闷闷不乐，又因琴言杳无音信，内外隔绝，又不能传递",en:"Shouzheng, and the associate examiner was Wang Wenhui, who had been promoted to Academician of the Grand Secretariat. Lu Zongyuan, Yang Fangyou, Zhou Xijue, and Sun Lianggong—this group of notable figures all served as associate examiners, which meant more than half of the well-known scholars had to avoid the exams due to conflict of interest. Among them, except for Xu Ziyun and"}],39:[{paragraph:5,mentions:1,tokens:["陆宗沅"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"宅，孙宅鼓乐迎接。此位姑娘系亮功前室所生，如今这位夫人也不甚钟爱他，故此一切从简。女客只有陆氏夫人的嫂子，就是陆宗沅的夫人，带了小女儿前来。男家早上道过喜了。倒是姬亮轩在那里假热闹，心上想闹闹新房，自有两位废物招接。",en:"the whole affair was conducted simply. Among the female guests, only the sister-in-law of Madam Lu, the wife of Lu Zongyuan, had come, bringing her young daughter. The groom's family had offered their congratulations in the morning. It was Ji Liangxuan who was making a show of festivity; he was privately hoping to rowdy up the bridal chamber, and had the two useless brothers"}],52:[{paragraph:3,mentions:1,tokens:["陆宗沅"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"处在聚星堂，请的是乡试座师礼部尚书刘守正、座师内阁学士王文辉、会试房师兵部郎中杨方猷，鸿胪寺卿周锡爵、光禄少卿陆宗沅，这两位是同乡前辈兼有年谊。张桐孙陪了这几位在聚星堂观戏，演得是联珠班。春航陪着一班名士在花园挹爽斋观演联锦班。那一天大媒是徐子云，客是萧次贤、高品、南湘、颜仲清、刘文泽、王恂、梅子玉。近日子玉病已好了，勉强打起精神出来。这八个名旦不消说都在园中，那",en:"Director of the Ministry of War; alongside Zhou Xijue, the Chief Minister of the Court of State Ceremonial, and Lu Zongyuan, the Deputy Minister of the Court of Imperial Entertainments, both of whom were elder fellow-townsmen and old acquaintances. Zhang Tongsun hosted these dignitaries as they watched a performance by the Lianzhu Troupe. Meanwhile, Chunhang hosted a circle"},{paragraph:17,mentions:2,tokens:["陆宗沅"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"苦了，乐得出来歇歇，便到文辉席上来，就在文辉旁边坐了。此处是两席，那席是刘守正、周锡爵、杨方猷，这席是王文辉、陆宗沅、张桐孙。文辉道：「这几天我知道你也累极了，所以叫你出来歇歇，此刻也应没有什么事了。」蕙芳道：「也没有什么忙，借此倒可跟着张二爷学学。那张二爷实在可以，大大小小，没有一点遗漏。」陆宗沅道：「这是张老二的专门本事。大概遇着这些事情，这账房非他不可。」文",en:'divided into two tables: one seated Liu Shouzheng, Zhou Xijue, and Yang Fangyou; the other seated Wang Wenhui, Lu Zongyuan, and Zhang Tongsun. Wenhui said kindly, "I know you have been worked to the bone these past days, so I called you out to rest. By now, the heavy work should be finished." Huifang replied, "It is not too busy now. It is a good chance to learn from Second'},{paragraph:18,mentions:1,tokens:["陆宗沅"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"留下。」蕙芳笑道：「难带的东西想是粗笨的，你不要拿些木器家伙，什么铁炉子、铁火盒，寄放在我处，我是不领情的。」陆宗沅、张桐孙笑起来，王文辉也笑，把扇子打了蕙芳一下：「你薄我，这还了得。」蕙芳也笑。文辉手弄长髯，蕙芳道：「你那胡子怎么倒黑起来了？想是遵姨太太命染黑的。」文辉笑道：「这更胡说了。」便自己看看胡须道：「老了，你们这些少年人，虽然与我们讲些顽笑话，心上是很",en:'junk! Do not try to dump wooden furniture, iron stoves, or heavy braziers on me—I will not thank you for it." Lu Zongyuan and Zhang Tongsun chuckled, and Wang Wenhui laughed too, tapping Huifang lightly with his fan. "You mock me? This is too much!" Huifang smiled as well. As Wenhui stroked his long beard, Huifang said, "How has your beard grown so black? I suppose you'},{paragraph:19,mentions:2,tokens:["陆宗沅"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"陆宗沅笑道：「你不要带着人说，我们的胡子不是染的。」那边席上的刘尚书、周锡爵、杨方猷都笑起来，惟有张桐孙是个道学人，不会顽笑。周锡爵道：「质夫，你那乌须药的方子，可是你孙亲家传你的？」文辉道：「他那几根胡子，要用什么乌须药？」既而一想，便大笑起来。陆宗沅也",en:'Lu Zongyuan laughed, "Speak for yourself! Our beards are not dyed." At the other table, Minister Liu, Zhou Xijue, and Yang Fangyou all burst into laughter. Only Zhang Tongsun, a rigid neo-Confucian scholar, remained unamused. Zhou Xijue called out, "Zhifu, did that'},{paragraph:20,mentions:1,tokens:["陆宗沅"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"带着，省得这乌黑的东西，沾染了你们如夫人的脸。」刘守正道：「这一染，就直染到胸前呢。」文辉道：「嚼你的舌头。」陆宗沅道：「怎么你把这尺寸都量得清清楚楚的？」蕙芳道：「带着假胡子好。你索性把真胡子剃掉了，出门时带了假的出来，进房时就除下，不更好看么？」大家又笑，文辉把扇子在蕙芳肩上打了两下，笑着骂道：「你这尖酸刻薄鬼，怪不得田湘帆被你管得服服贴贴，一强也不敢强。但你",en:`added, "Once it rubs off, it stains right down to the chest!" Wenhui cursed good-naturedly, "Bite your tongue!" Lu Zongyuan asked, "How is it that you have measured these dimensions so precisely?" Huifang interjected, "Wearing a fake beard is best. You should just shave off the real one entirely. Wear the fake one when you go out, and take it off when you enter your chambers—wouldn't`},{paragraph:22,mentions:1,tokens:["陆宗沅"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"夫人，带了他大姑奶奶蓉华并媳妇孙少奶奶佩秋，又请刘守正的夫人，没有来，他媳妇吴少奶奶紫烟来了。周锡爵、杨方猷、陆宗沅的夫人都辞了。",en:"attend, though her daughter-in-law, Madam Wu Ziyan, came in her stead. The wives of Zhou Xijue, Yang Fangyou, and Lu Zongyuan all politely declined."}],59:[{paragraph:9,mentions:1,tokens:["陆宗沅"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"，即将梅士燮一月三迁，先升了詹事府正詹事，又升了都察院左副都御史，复升吏部左侍郎，现着来京供职。江西学政改放了陆宗沅。梅侍郎近又得了家信，已知子玉取了宏词，授职编修，又知娶了媳妇，心中大乐，即日起身还京。官场应酬无暇细述，自然纷纷的阻道送行。梅侍郎于十一月初一日起程，正是一帆风送滕王阁。行了十日，到了南京，要在家耽搁几天，祭扫坟墓，查理田园，周恤亲戚。到了两日，第",en:"and finally to Left Vice Minister of the Ministry of Personnel, with orders to return to the capital for duty. Lu Zongyuan was appointed to replace him as the Education Commissioner of Jiangxi. Recently, Vice Minister Mei had also received letters from home, learning that Ziyu had successfully passed the Erudite Scholastic examination, had been appointed as a Compiler, and"}]},"char-53":JSON.parse(`{"3":[{"paragraph":18,"mentions":9,"tokens":["富三爷","富三","富伦"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"他，就不敢强，道：「三爷，你能怎么说，怎么好。」那胖子就叫跟班的给他四百钱，卖玉器的尚要争论，那一位也说道：「富三爷那里不照应你，这点事你就这么着。况且富三爷是为朋友的，下次瞧瞧有好玉器，他们多照顾你一点就够了。」蓉官接口道：「这老头子好讨人嫌：弯着腰，托着那浪盘子，天天在人空里挤来挤去，一点好东西都没有。谁要买，德古斋还少吗？」卖玉器的只得忍气吞声，拿了碎烟壶走","en":"to hand the peddler four hundred cash. The old man opened his mouth to protest, but the lean man cut him off. \\"Third Master Fu patronizes you constantly. Why squabble over such a trifle? He acts on behalf of a friend. Next time you procure decent jade, they will offer you their custom. Leave it at that.\\" Rongguan chimed in with a delicate sneer, \\"This old relic is an absolute"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":1,"tokens":["富三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"了他是那一处人，现在当什么差？聘才道：「小弟是江宁府人，才到京，尚未谋干什么。此时寓在鸣珂坊梅世伯梅大人处。」富三道：「江宁是个好地方，我小时候跟着我们老爷子到过江宁。那时我们老爷子做江宁藩司，我才十二岁，后来升了广东巡抚。你方才说鸣珂坊的梅大人，他也在广东做过学差，与我们老爷子很相好。以后大家都回了京，我们老爷子做了侍郎，不上一年，就不在了。","en":"secured a position. I currently reside as a guest in the Mingke Lane estate of my family's old friend, Lord Mei.\\" Fu the Third's eyes lit up. \\"Jiangning is a magnificent place. In my youth, I accompanied my late father there when he served as Provincial Treasurer. I was but twelve years old. He was later promoted to Governor of Guangdong. The Lord Mei you speak of—he served"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":1,"tokens":["富三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"哥儿很聪明，人也生得好，年纪也有十六七岁了，不知娶过媳妇儿没有？」聘才一一回答了，又与贵大爷寒喧一番。聘才已知富三是个热心肠，多情多义的人；那个贵大爷却是个谨慎小心，安分守己的一路。当下三人，倒闲谈了好一会。蓉官又到对面楼上去了，聘才望着他，又去与那黑脸大汉讲话。","en":"inquiries gracefully, engaging Master Gui in polite conversation. He quickly discerned the nature of his companions: Fu the Third was a man of fiery generosity and deep sentiment, while Master Gui was cautious, proper, and anchored in convention. The three men conversed effortlessly. Meanwhile, Rongguan had drifted back to the opposite gallery to converse with the dark-faced behemoth."},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":2,"tokens":["富三爷","富三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"嘴子砸了好些，弯了腰捡了一样，盘里倒又落下两样，心里想拚着这条老命讹他一讹，看看那位老爷的相貌，先就害怕，更非富三爷可比，只得含着眼泪一步步的走下楼来。下了楼，才一路骂出戏园，看得那些相公个个大笑，都探出身子看他出了戏园，才住了笑。这边富三看了，也拍手称快，聘才更乐得了不得。但不知这个人，是个什么阔人，少顷等蓉官来问他。只见那黑大汉已起身，带了四个相公，昂昂然大踏","en":"assailant, but one glance at the man's terrifying visage convinced him otherwise—this was no reasonable soul like Fu the Third. Eyes brimming with humiliated tears, the old man stumbled down the stairs and fled the theater, cursing into the wind. The actors in the gallery erupted into peals of laughter, leaning over the railings to watch his undignified retreat before settling"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":1,"tokens":["富三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"不一刻，蓉官又过来坐下，富三笑道：「空巴结他，也不带你去，磨了半天，一顿饭都磨不出来。」蓉官点着头道：「不错，我磨他。他叫我，我也不去。这位老爷子不是好相交的。」","en":"Moments later, Rongguan glided back to their table. Fu the Third teased him, \\"A waste of flattery, it seems. He didn't even take you with him. You hovered around him for half the day and couldn't even secure a dinner invitation.\\" Rongguan nodded coolly. \\"Indeed, I hovered. But had he called for me, I would not have"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":4,"tokens":["富三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"富三道：「这人是那里人，姓什么？」蓉官道：「是广东人，我只听得人都称他奚大老爷，我也是才认识他。且他也到京未久，他就待春兰待得好。今日春兰身上穿那件玄狐腿子的，是奚大老爷身上脱下来，现叫毛毛匠改小的。」说罢即凑着富三耳边问了一句，富三道：「怎么你今日又有","en":"back and sent straight to the furrier to be tailored down.\\" Rongguan leaned in close, whispering something into Fu the Third's ear. Fu laughed, \\"How is it you find yourself with free time today?\\" Rongguan offered a radiant smile, resting both hands on Fu's shoulders and giving them a gentle, affectionate knead."},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":3,"tokens":["富三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"富三见聘才人品活动，又系梅氏世谊，便道：「魏大哥，今日这戏没有听头，咱们找个地方喝一钟去罢？」聘才见富三是个慷慨爽快的人，便有心要拉拢他，说道：「今日幸会，但先要说明赏兄弟的脸作个东。」富三笑道：「使得。」就在靴革幼里拿出个靴页子来，取一张钱票，交与他跟","en":"Observing Pincai's elegant bearing and mindful of his connection to the Mei family, Fu the Third suggested, \\"Brother Wei, the opera has lost its flavor today. Shall we find a quiet place for a few cups of wine?\\" Recognizing Fu's generous, open-hearted nature, Pincai sought to deepen their acquaintance. \\"It would be a great pleasure, provided you"},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":1,"tokens":["富三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"官斟了酒。只听得隔壁燕语莺声，甚为热闹。蓉官从板缝里望时，就是那个奚大老爷带了春兰，还有三个相公在那里。聘才问富三道：「老太爷的讳，上下是那两个字？」","en":"that Great Lord Xi. He has Chunlan and three other actors with him.\\" Turning back, Pincai respectfully addressed Fu the Third: \\"May I ask the honorable name of your late father?\\""},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":4,"tokens":["富三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"富三不解所问，倒是贵太爷明白，即对富三说道：「他问大叔官名是叫什么？」富三道：「你问我们老爷的名字么，我们老爷叫富安世。」聘才即站起身来道：「怪不得了，三爷是个大贤人之后。你们老大人，在我们南京地方已成了神。三年前，地方上百姓，共捐了几千银子，造了一个名","en":"Fu the Third looked mildly confused, but Master Gui understood perfectly. \\"He is asking for your father's official name,\\" Gui clarified. Fu smiled, \\"You ask after my father? He was known as Fu Anshi.\\" Pincai immediately rose from his seat, his expression filled with"},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":3,"tokens":["富三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"贵大爷道：「这个话倒也可信。大叔在江南年数本久，自知府升到藩司，也有十几年，自然恋着那地方上了。」富三道：「我们老爷在江宁十六年，自知府到藩司，没有出过省，真与南京人有缘。我是生在江宁府衙门里的，所以我会说几句南京话。」聘才又将贵大爷恭惟一番。贵大爷道：「我这个功名是看得见的，要升官也难得个拣选，不是同知，就是通判，并无他途。」聘才道：「将来总不止于","en":"Provincial Treasurer over more than a decade. It is only natural he forged a deep bond with the land and its people.\\" Fu the Third recovered his voice, adding, \\"My father spent sixteen years in Jiangning, never once leaving the province as he climbed the ranks. He truly shared a destiny with the people of Nanjing. I was born within the walls of the Jiangning Prefectural compound,"},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":1,"tokens":["富三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"的，又装腔做作了。」蓉官低低的说道：「不好了，那位奚大老爷又翻了，不知骂谁？」便到板壁缝里去望他们。这边聘才与富三、贵大都静悄悄的听，听得一个相公说道：「你倒开口就骂人。好便宜的鸡巴，做起菜来，你口里还吃不尽呢。」听得那人又骂道：「我最恨那装腔做作的，一天一个样子。」又听得那相公说道：「就算我装腔做作了，你也不能打死了我。」又听得那人骂道：「我倒不打死你，我想攘","en":"again. Who is he cursing this time?\\" He pressed his eye to the crack in the partition. At their table, Pincai, Fu the Third, and Master Gui fell utterly silent, straining to listen. Through the thin wood, a young actor shot back, \\"You cannot open your mouth without cursing. Cock is cheap enough with you — cook it up as a dish and your own mouth could never finish it.\\" The"},{"paragraph":36,"mentions":7,"tokens":["富三","富三爷"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"富三与聘才、贵大都在门口看了一会进来。蓉官吐了吐舌，说道：「好不怕人！这才算个标子。」富三笑道：「这种标也标得无趣，但不知为什么事闹起来？」蓉官道：「这位奚大老爷的下作脾气，是讲不出来的。」于是富三与聘才、贵大豁了一会拳，此时天气尚短，他们也要进城。贵大","en":"Fu the Third, Pincai, and Master Gui watched the spectacle from the doorway for a long while before returning to their seats. Rongguan stuck out his tongue playfully. \\"Terrifying! Now that is what I call a proper spectacle.\\" Fu the Third laughed, \\"Such crude spectacles"},{"paragraph":37,"mentions":2,"tokens":["富三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"聘才说：「一定来的，咱们从此订交。只是我是个白身人。仰扳不上。」富三、贵大同说：「罚你！咱们哥儿们论什么，你不嫌我们粗卤就是了。」富三赏了蓉官八吊钱，跟兔两吊钱。蓉官谢了赏，辞了贵大爷与聘才先去了。","en":"this day forth. Yet I am but a commoner, without rank or title. I hardly dare aspire to your exalted company.\\" Fu the Third and Master Gui objected in unison: \\"You must drink a penalty cup for such words! What do empty titles matter among brothers? So long as you do not find our company too crude, that is all that matters.\\" Before departing, Fu the Third pressed eight strings"}],"5":[{"paragraph":23,"mentions":1,"tokens":["富三爷"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一日，天气晴和，雪也化了，聘才想起富三爷来，要进城去看他，便叫四儿去雇了一辆车坐了，望东城来。对面遇着一群车马，泼风似的冲将过来，先是一个顶马，又一对引马，接着一辆绿围车，旁边开着门。聘才探出身子一看，只觉电光似的，一闪就过去了。就这一闪之中，见是个美少年，英眉秀目，丰采如神，若朝阳之丽云","en":"One day the weather turned clear and mild. The snow had melted, and Pincai thought of Fu the Third and wished to go into the city to visit him. He had his boy Si'er hire a carriage and set off toward the Eastern City. Coming from the opposite direction was a crowd of horses and carriages rushing forward like the wind. First came a mounted outrider,"},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":7,"tokens":["富三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"进了穿堂，便是正厅，两边有六间厢房。富三早已站在正房檐下，迎将出来。聘才抢步上前，拉了手。富三即引到正厅后，另有两间小书房内坐了，问了几句寒温。聘才道：「这几天下雪耽搁了，不然，前日就要过来奉拜的，在家好不纳闷，惟有刻刻的想念三爷。」富三道：「彼此，彼此。」此处是富三的书房，离内屋已近，只","en":"Through the passageway was the main hall, flanked by six wing-rooms on either side. Fu the Third was already standing beneath the eaves of the main house, coming forward to welcome him. Pincai hurried up and clasped his hands in greeting. Fu the Third led him behind the main hall to sit in a pair of small study rooms, exchanging polite inquiries"},{"paragraph":30,"mentions":2,"tokens":["富三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"。他有一个亲随林珊枝，真花八千两银子买的。」聘才听了，点头微笑，说道：「这个阔公子，与他拉交情，是不容易的。」富三道：「难，难，除非真有本领，教他佩服了，不然，就是巴结到二十四分，这个人是最喜奉承的。」说到此，便已摆上饭来，一壶酒，四碟菜，一只火锅。富三道：「今日却是便饭，没有什么吃的。」二人对酌阔谈，聘才听得里头有些娘儿们说话，说得甚热闹，不一刻就像两人口角，","en":"Pincai nodded with a slight smile and said: \\"Befriending this wealthy nobleman would indeed be no easy matter.\\" Fu the Third said: \\"Difficult indeed, unless one possesses true abilities that earn his admiration. Otherwise, however assiduously one flatters and courts him, this is precisely the sort of person who most enjoys being flattered.\\" Just as they were saying this, the"},{"paragraph":31,"mentions":1,"tokens":["富三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"富三欲待不管，因聘才在此，听得不好意思，便走了进去。","en":"Fu the Third tried to ignore it, but with Pincai present he felt embarrassed, and went inside."},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":2,"tokens":["富三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"聘才静听，只听得出富三声口，说「有客，有客」的两句。那些女人说话就略低了些，疏疏落落的犹有些牵藤蔓葛。富三走了出来，与聘才喝了一杯酒，里头又闹起来。","en":"Pincai listened quietly and could make out Fu the Third's voice saying \\"There's a guest, there's a guest\\" once or twice. The women's voices dropped slightly, trailing off in sporadic murmuring. Fu the Third came back out and drank a cup of wine with Pincai; then the noise inside started up again."},{"paragraph":33,"mentions":3,"tokens":["富三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"富三坐不住，又跑了进去，这一回闹得很热闹，就富三进去，也弹压不下，倒越闹得更甚。又听得富三嚷道：「你们也替我做点脸儿，不是这样的。」又听得一个娘儿们，带着哭带着嚷的，就是说话太急些，外边听得不甚清楚。","en":"Fu the Third could not sit still and ran back inside; this time the commotion was very loud. Even with Fu the Third there trying to suppress it, it only grew worse. They could also hear Fu the Third shouting: \\"Have some consideration for me, this is simply not done!\\""},{"paragraph":34,"mentions":3,"tokens":["富三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"聘才无心喝酒，也不便问，先要饭吃了。富三又出来，聘才看他心神不定，便告辞了，又谢了饭。富三见聘才已经吃饭，里头又闹得这样，便也不好留他，只得说道：「今日简慢极了，别要笑话，内人一出门，这些人就没有了拘束，乱吵起来。」聘才也不好答应，一径出来，富三送出大门，看上了车方回。","en":"heart for drinking, and it would have been awkward to ask questions, so he simply asked for the meal to be served. Fu the Third came out again; Pincai could see that his composure was quite unsettled. He took his leave and expressed thanks for the meal. Fu the Third saw that Pincai had already eaten and the commotion inside was still so bad; he could hardly urge him to stay."}],"11":[{"paragraph":4,"mentions":1,"tokens":["富三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"且说那华公子年方二十一岁，其容貌虽见于魏聘才之目，性情述于富三之口，究未得其详。这华公子气焰虽豪，性情却极纯粹。不过在那起居服食上，享用些富贵豪华之福。养尊处优，不喜酬应。\\n骑射既精，词赋更妙。也曾千卷罗胸，不难七步随口。这华夫人母家姓苏，父名臣泰，也是功臣之后，世袭列侯，现任兵部尚书。并无嗣子，只生二女：长名","en":"Though his striking figure had fleetingly caught the eye of Wei Pincai and his temperament had been hinted at by Fu the Third, his true nature remained untold. Young Master Hua possessed an extravagant, commanding bearing, yet his heart was uncommonly pure and genuine. He immersed himself freely in the worldly delights of fine delicacies, luxurious dwellings, and the boundless"}],"12":[{"paragraph":21,"mentions":1,"tokens":["富三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，反穿着草上霜，同着一个二十几岁伶伶俐俐的人坐下，背后站着一个跟班。那胖子是一口京话，那一个是南边人，原来就是富三与魏聘才。不多一刻，蓉官卸了妆，已坐在对面楼上，与一个少年说话。下来又在楼下坐了一会，即走到这边来，一路路请安照应人。","en":"stood a manservant. The plump man spoke in pure Beijing speech; the other was from the south. These were in fact Fu the Third and Wei Pincai. Before long, Rongguan had removed his stage makeup and was sitting in the gallery upstairs talking with a young man. He came down again and sat for a moment in the lower area, then walked over toward this side, greeting and acknowledging"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":1,"tokens":["富三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"那个后生，将手搭在蓉官肩上道：「你也只要会巴结，富三老爷难道还不爱你么？」蓉官道：「我说过不会巴结。要不然你教我，我就拜你做师傅。你怎样教我，我就怎样学你。」那后生一面笑，一面把他脸上拧了一把。蓉官一回头，见了春航，却把眼睛一低，又扑转来一注，却又别转了头。半晌又回转来，上上下下，把春航一看，像要招呼","en":"hand on Rongguan's shoulder and said: \\"You too just need to know how to make yourself agreeable — would Master Fu the Third not like you then?\\" Rongguan said: \\"I've said I don't know how. If you would teach me, I would take you as my master. However you teach me, that's how I'll learn from you.\\" The young man smiled and gave Rongguan's cheek a pinch. Rongguan turned his head"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":5,"tokens":["富三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，怎么穷了？冷冷清清的一人坐着。意欲过去照应，又恐不是。及仔细看清了，才过去请了一个安，坐下，倒说了好一会话。富三却不留心，聘才见了，便扯扯富三的衣裳，道：「你瞧，蓉官倒巴结那个人，难道这种人，倒有什么巴结处么？」富三道：「那也难说的。」蓉官辞了春航，又到富三处来。聘才笑向蓉官道：「好阔老斗。」蓉官脸上一红，道：「他真阔过来。他倒从没有欠人的开发，要人替担帐。」","en":"carefully and satisfying himself, he went over, made a greeting bow, sat down, and they talked quite a good while. Fu the Third paid no attention; but Pincai noticed and tugged at Fu the Third's sleeve, saying: \\"Look there — Rongguan is actually paying court to that person. What sort of person could that be, to have anything worth paying court to?\\" Fu the Third said: \\"Hard to"}],"16":[{"paragraph":4,"mentions":1,"tokens":["富三爷"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"样，绝无一点关切心肠。长安虽好，非久恋之乡，不如自己弄得一居停主人，或可附翼攀鳞，弄些好处出来，亦未可定。我想富三爷交游最阔，求他觅一机会，不甚为难。」主意定了，就坐车进城，来到金牌楼富宅，先着小使到门上一问。","en":"better to find a host of my own; perhaps I could catch the coattails of the powerful and gain some advantage. Third Master Fu has the widest circle of acquaintances. Asking him to find me an opportunity shouldn't be too difficult.\\" Having made up his mind, he took a carriage into the city to the Fu residence at the Golden Archway. A young servant went to the gate to inquire."},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":6,"tokens":["富三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"进屋内炕上坐。聘才道：「兄弟来过几次，总值大爷出门，偏偏遇不着。」贵大爷道：「兄弟差使忙，轻易不出城，倒常想同富三哥出城找吾兄逛一天，不是他没有空，就是我有事，再停两天就好了。」又讲了些闲话，聘才留心屋内却也收拾干净，一并是三间，东边隔去了一间做书房。院子内东边是粉墙，西边一个月亮门，内有一扇屏风挡着，想必是内室了。只见炕上挂一幅蓝地白字的回文诗句，一幅冷金笺对","en":"the entrance to the study, a young servant lifted a fragrant-colored inner curtain. Stepping inside, Pincai saw Third Master Fu toss his cards onto the table, give a great yawn, and stretch his back. Seeing Pincai, he stood up with a grin and said, \\"It has been too long. How have you been?\\" Pincai shook his hand. Two other men were in the room, one facing south and the other"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":3,"tokens":["富三爷","富三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"老八的风水是高明的，我们内城多半是请他瞧的。」聘才便又拉拢起来，只有那个阎简安是冷冰冰的，只与富、贵两人讲话。富三爷道：「歇了罢，这牌打得闷人，就是我输了，算账罢。」阎简安便道：「怎么就歇？方才打了两转。」梅窗道：「算了，不用来了。」于是，大家起身散坐，点筹马，是阎、富两人输了。聘才道：「倒是我吵散了。」富三一手捶着腰道：「我本来不喜欢这个，输了钱还惹闷。」阎简安","en":"their properties.\\" Pincai engaged him further, though Yan Jian'an sat coldly aside, speaking only with Fu and Gui. Third Master Fu complained, \\"Let's stop here. This card game is insufferably dull, and I've been losing. Let's settle our accounts.\\" Yan Jian'an countered, \\"Why stop so soon? We've only played two rounds.\\" Meichuang agreed, \\"Let it be; no need to continue.\\" Everyone"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":1,"tokens":["富三爷"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，所以叫他在府里住着。华公子是更不对的。杨梅窗是个土篾片，但知势利，毫无所能。又是个里八府的人，怯头怯脑。因与富三爷是干兄弟，又拉拢了些半生半熟的阔老，仗着看风水为名，胡吹乱讲的一味贪财，或与地主勾通，或与花儿匠工头连手，赚下人的钱，也捐了个从九候选，至于堪舆之学，实在不懂。是日谈次，倒与聘才合了式，便要与聘才换帖，聘才是乐得拉拢的，便十分应酬。只有那位老阎是势利","en":"ability. Hailing from the inner provinces, he was timid and apprehensive. Relying on his sworn brotherhood with Fu the Third, he cultivated relations with wealthy acquaintances, using geomancy as a guise to make wild boasts and extract money. He colluded with landowners and conspired with landscape gardeners to cheat people, eventually purchasing a candidate status of the"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":3,"tokens":["富三","富三爷"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"聘才便同到富三家里来，又坐了一回，便把心事讲起。富三爷道：「既然如此，何不就挪到舍下来，盘桓几时。」重又说道：「我们舅太爷府中朋友最多。今日听得老阎说，辞了那位出去，如今正少人呢。」聘才道：「舅太爷是那一位？」富三道：「你不记得去年在城外，瞧见那十几辆车，车内那个","en":"Pincai then accompanied Fu the Third back to his residence for a brief visit, taking the opportunity to share his thoughts. Third Master Fu suggested, \\"In that case, why not simply move in here and stay for a while?\\" He added, \\"In our uncle-by-marriage's household, friends are incredibly"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":2,"tokens":["富三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"又遂问道：「他家去做朋友，不知要办些什么事？」富三道：「办什么呢？陪着喝酒，陪着看戏，闲空时写两封不要紧的书札。你还会弹唱，是更合他的心意了。这人本是个顶好的好人，只要尽拿高帽子孝敬他，他就喜欢，违拗他，他就冷了。我瞧你趋跄很好，人也圆到，你肚子里自然很通透的了。我们舅太爷笔底下也来的，去年老佛爷叫","en":"He pressed further, \\"What sort of duties does a private secretary perform there?\\" Fu the Third laughed, \\"Duties? You accompany him drinking, attend the theater, and draft a few unimportant letters during your leisure hours. Since you can also play and sing, you will suit his tastes perfectly. He is fundamentally a good person; if you flatter him"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":2,"tokens":["富三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"明日，富三就到华公府来，见了华公子，就荐聘才进府，帮办杂务。华公子应了，说道：「我这里到不拘人多人少，只要人好，是你的好朋友。自然不用讲了。说请你去讲一声，请他来就是了。」即吩咐林珊枝传谕总办，将魏师爷修金钦馔说定，富三连连答应几个「是」！又进去见了华夫人，就","en":"The following day, Fu the Third arrived at the Hua mansion, met Young Master Hua, and recommended Pincai as a secretary to handle miscellaneous affairs. Young Master Hua agreed, saying, \\"I have no strict limit on staff here. As long as the person is capable and your close friend, there"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":7,"tokens":["富三爷","富三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"明早富三爷即遣人带了两辆车来接聘才，聘才即拜别颜夫人并子玉，又辞了元茂，收拾停妥，带了四儿一径上车。先到富宅略叙片时，富三亲送到华府。到了门口，富三先着人回进去，并说魏师爷来了。聘才在车内一望这门面，就觉威严得了不得，就是南京总督衙门，也无此高大。门前一座大照","en":"Early the next morning, Fu the Third sent two carriages to collect Pincai. After bidding farewell to Lady Yan, Ziyu, and Yuanmao, Pincai gathered his belongings, brought Si'er along, and boarded the carriage. They first stopped at the Fu residence for a brief visit before Fu the Third personally"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":2,"tokens":["富三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"正是个锦天绣地，令人目炫神乱。富三与聘才就坐在椅子上，等有两盏茶时候，忽见一个书童出来说：「公子今日不爽快，请三爷与师爷到东花园和各位师爷们见见，就请魏师爷在东花园与张师爷、顾师爷在一块儿住罢。」富三又说：「替我请安。」聘才也站起身道：「替我亦说到。」小厮答应了「是」。窗外那个书童就","en":"It was a realm of embroidered splendor, enough to dazzle the eyes and bewilder the mind. Fu the Third and Pincai took their seats, waiting for the time it takes to drink two cups of tea. Suddenly, a page boy emerged and announced, \\"The Young Master is feeling unwell today. He invites the Third Master and the Master Secretary to the East Garden to meet"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":2,"tokens":["富三","富三爷"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"那东花园却在前面东首，聘才跟着富三，重新向外弯弯转转，尽走的回廊，处处多有人伺候。华府规矩：每一重门，有一个总管，有事出进都要登号簿的。聘才走了半天，心中也记不清过了多少庭院。及走到穿堂后身，东首有一条夹巷，觉有半里路长。又进了一重门，才见一个花园。这花园却也不小，有亭有台，有山有水","en":"The East Garden lay to the front and east. Pincai followed Fu the Third through a maze of winding corridors, encountering attendants at every turn. The Hua mansion operated under strict rules: each gate had a steward, and every entry and exit was recorded in a ledger. After walking for quite some time, Pincai lost track"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":2,"tokens":["富三爷","富三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"阎、王二老便道：「好说，好说，东人慕名请来的，自然是个名下无虚的了，我们都要请教。」聘才连声说：「不敢。」富三爷道：「这魏老大是我的把弟，且系南城外梅大人的世侄，极有本事，最够朋友的。此刻新来府中，一切都不在行，先生们自然要携带携带，都是一家人，倒不要生分才好。我明日见了我们舅太爷，还要面托的。」又对聘才道：「咱们到里头屋子，瞧瞧住那一间？」又同聘才到了里头一","en":"possess genuine talent. We look forward to learning from you.\\" Pincai repeatedly murmured, \\"I would not dare.\\" Third Master Fu interjected, \\"Brother Wei is my sworn brother and a close nephew of Lord Mei from outside the south city. He is highly capable and a true friend. Being new to the household, he naturally needs your guidance. We are all one family now, so let us not be"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":4,"tokens":["富三爷","富三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「公子送了一桌酒席，就请三爷和各位师爷陪着魏师爷喝钟酒，公子说不要见怪，实在坐不下，不能来陪，又给三爷道乏。」富三爷站起来道了谢。又道：「时候也不早了，刚是吃饭时候了。」大家就在中间屋子里圆桌上吃起来，无拘无束，甚为畅快。聘才见这席菜，只是上不完，大碗、中碗、大碟、小碟通计有四十多样。众人直饮到二更，富三方辞了众人出去。他的家人提灯伺候，聘才送到园门，富三又唠唠叨","en":"Just as Fu the Third was preparing to leave, someone entered and announced, \\"The Young Master has sent a banquet and requests that the Third Master and the secretaries accompany Master Wei for a few cups of wine. The Young Master apologizes for not joining you, but he is"}],"18":[{"paragraph":9,"mentions":1,"tokens":["富三爷"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"进了华公府，那里局面宽大，且华公子是爱交接的，近来光景自然大有起色了。」聘才道：「仁兄不问，弟亦不便说起。始而富三爷讲起华公子有孟尝之名，门下食客数百人。弟进去了，门客却不少，都是些势利透顶人，不是挤那个，就是杀这个。弟进去一月有余，华公子只是冷冷的，若长如此光景，弟倒错了主意了。」仲雨道：「你见过华公子几次？」聘才道：「见倒见过几次，不过随便寒暄几句，就走开了。","en":"better lately.\\" Pincai said: \\"If elder brother hadn't asked, I would not have brought it up myself. At first, Third Master Fu told me that the young master Hua held the reputation of Lord Mengchang, keeping hundreds of retainers at his table. I went in to find plenty of retainers indeed, yet they are all thoroughly mercenary people, constantly plotting to squeeze one out or"}],"27":[{"paragraph":6,"mentions":1,"tokens":["富三爷"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，却不晓得什么，也不便问。蓉官忽问仲雨道：「你能有个相好姓魏的，他初到京时，我就认识他，却不见得怎样。前日我在富三爷家见他，体面得了不得，大鞍子热车，跟班亦骑上马。他如今做了什么官了？」仲雨道：「尚未得官，在华公府里当师爷，发了财，自然就阔了。」亮轩道：「我听得人说，华公府富贵无比，除了皇帝就算他家，是真的么？」","en":"surnamed Wei. I met him first when he came to the capital, and he was nothing special then. The other day at Master Fu the Third's, he had a grand saddle, hot carriage, and lackeys mounted. What office does he hold now?\\" Zhongyu replied, \\"No office yet; he's a secretary at Young Master Hua's, struck silver, and is naturally plush.\\" Liangxuan added, \\"I hear Young Master Hua's house"}],"33":[{"paragraph":8,"mentions":2,"tokens":["富三爷"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"那一日魏聘才请富三爷在蓉官寓里喝酒，富三爷想起一件事来，先进城去了。聘才便不进城，叫蓉官去叫了一个媳妇，名叫玉天仙，就借蓉官寓里过夜。将近二更，尚在那里喝酒唱曲。有个吏目郁泰孙来查夜，走了进来，与聘才认识的，且同过席听过戏的。聘才见是郁吏目，便放了心，让他入座，吏目不肯","en":"That day, Wei Pincai invited Lord Fu the Third to drink at Rongguan's residence. Lord Fu suddenly remembered something and went into the city first. Pincai stayed behind, instructing Rongguan to fetch a young woman named Yutianxian to spend the night at Rongguan's place. Approaching the second watch,"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":15,"tokens":["富三爷","富三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"却说富三爷闻得聘才闹了事，便在部里打听了几日，自己无路可通。后闻华公子替他托了情，才放了心。后又听见聘才辞馆出来，便又惦记着放心不下，意欲邀他回家。一日，起早出城来找聘才，只见寺门口一班人在那里啰唣。富三爷下车时，见一个披着件青布老羊皮大袄，戴一顶旧秋帽，有三","en":"Meanwhile, Lord Fu the Third, upon hearing of Pincai's trouble, spent several days inquiring at the Ministry but found no way through. He only felt relieved after learning that Young Master Hua had interceded on his behalf. Later, hearing that Pincai had left his patron, his concerns"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":16,"tokens":["富三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"两撇浓胡子，又缩了出去。聘才道：「唐大哥进来坐。」那人道：「停一回再来。」聘才道：「就请进来，这位客就是我说的富三老爷，他正要会会你。」唐和尚便撬开风门，走将进来。聘才与富三站起，唐和尚满面堆下笑来，说道：「原来这是富三老爷，今日僧人有幸，瞻仰了大贵人。」富三也说：「久仰得很。」与他拉了手，和尚一屁股就坐在椅子上，把富三上下瞧了两眼。富三看这和尚也就生得异样，五","en":"down.\\" The man replied, \\"I'll come back in a moment.\\" Pincai insisted, \\"Please, come in. This guest is the Master Fu the Third I mentioned; he wants to meet you.\\" Monk Tang then pried open the wind door and walked in. Pincai and Fu the Third stood up, and Monk Tang, with a face full of smiles, said, \\"So this is Master Fu the Third; today, this humble monk is truly fortunate"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":3,"tokens":["富三爷","富三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"意洋洋的道：「小徒叫得月，今年十五岁了，念经唱曲都也将就，就是爱顽皮，我总不许他出门，三老爷不知从何处见他？」富三爷笑得两眼瞇，齐说道：「待我想来。」想了一回，忽然的大笑道：「呸！我记错了，我认是大悲庵的姑子，实在像得很。」说得聘才大笑，小和尚涨红了脸。唐和尚笑道：「三老爷取笑。」聘才道：「叫他装个姑子，却也看不出来。我们这唐大哥是第一个快乐人，吃的、穿的、用的、","en":"singing, but he's quite mischievous, so I never allow him out. Master Third, where might you have seen him?\\" Master Fu the Third, eyes crinkling with a smile, said, \\"Let me think.\\" After a moment's thought, he suddenly laughed heartily and said, \\"Bah! I remembered wrong; I thought it was the nun from the Great Compassion Convent. The resemblance is striking.\\" Pincai roared with"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":6,"tokens":["富三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"钟上已交正午，才见聘才的人来摆桌子，放杯箸。富三道：「你可不要费事。」聘才道：「没有什么可吃的。」于是分宾主坐了，富三叫得月也坐了。唐和尚命得月同着蓉官斟酒。富三见果碟小吃已摆满了一桌，便道：「作什么，都拿开，留四碟就够了。」便叫留下山鸡丝、火腿、倭瓜子、杏仁。蓉官道：「慢些，慢些！」便抢了一碟橘","en":"It was already noon when Pincai's servants arrived to set the table and arrange the cups and chopsticks. Fu the Third said, \\"Please don't go to any trouble.\\" Pincai replied, \\"There isn't much to eat.\\" Thus, they took their seats as host and guests, and Fu the Third invited Deyue to sit as well. Monk Tang ordered Deyue and Rongguan to pour the wine. Seeing the table"},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":1,"tokens":["富三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"富三进，城又重托了唐和尚，蓉官也自回去。不知后事如何，且听下回分解。","en":"Fu the Third entered the city, having entrusted Monk Tang with the important matter once more, while Rongguan also returned home. What happens next will be revealed in the following chapter."}],"34":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["富三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说聘才送了富三出门，唐和尚即叫人去请他兄弟。聘才刚进屋子，只见李元茂闯将进来道：「今日才寻着你，店铺里那一家不访到，原来搬在这里。」聘才道：「我也搬出来不多几日，因为有些事情，所以还没有来看你，并看庾香。」即问：「庾香近来可好？」元茂道：「好是好的，前月王家写信与","en":"After seeing Fu the Third out, Pincai had Monk Tang send someone to invite Tang's younger brother over. Pincai had just stepped back indoors when Li Yuanmao barged in, declaring, \\"I've finally tracked you down today! There isn't an establishment I haven't scoured, only to find"},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":2,"tokens":["富三爷"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"以，两个缺是一天到的，却是湖北在前。如今作个弊，将贵州放在前面，也无妨碍。虽然一倒转来，也是个作弊。我兄弟说与富三爷没什么交情，不犯把这大情白送给他。贵州一任抵不得湖北一年，这是人人知道的。此事还要你去对他说。」聘才道：「这个自然。但不知令弟可拿得稳？」和尚道：「千稳万稳，并不是撞木钟。事成了才要，你能担这担子么？」聘才道：「这有什么不能，富三爷是有钱的人，且做事","en":"upside down like this is still an act of corruption. My brother noted that he has no personal ties with Master Fu the Third, so there's no reason to give away such a massive favor for nothing. Everyone knows that a full term in Guizhou cannot match a single year in Hubei. You will have to be the one to explain this to him.\\" Pincai replied, \\"Naturally. But I wonder, is your"},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":1,"tokens":["富三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"。」又坐了一坐，即自回房，见元茂和衣睡着，已经鼻息如雷，聘才叫醒了他，又另将一副铺盖给他睡了，自己也便安息。把富三的事想了一会，又将自己的帐算了一会，已到五更。略睡片时，即见天明，便叫起家人，吩咐套车进城。净了脸，吃了点心，穿好衣裳，李元茂尚未睡醒。","en":"thunder. Pincai woke him, provided him with a separate set of bedding, and finally lay down to rest. He pondered Fu the Third's affair for a time, then calculated his own debts, and soon it was the fifth watch. After a brief doze, day broke. He called the servants to harness the carriage, washed his face, ate some morning snacks, and donned his clothes, all while Li Yuanmao"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":1,"tokens":["富三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，翻一个身将被蒙了头，又睡着了。聘才好不烦躁，看这光景是不肯起来，只得叫四儿在家看守屋子，另带小使骑了马出门找富三去了。","en":"no choice but to leave Si'er behind to watch the house, taking a young page with him to ride into town and find Fu the Third."},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":1,"tokens":["富三爷"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"却说元茂睡到巳正方才起来，擦擦眼睛，见四儿在房里扫地抹桌子。元茂便问道：「你主人那里去了？」四儿道：「到富三爷那里去了。」元茂下炕穿了衣裳，走到外间，四儿送了脸水，泡了茶，又送上点心。元茂又吸了几袋水烟，吐了一地的痰，四儿扫干净了。元茂问道：「你可知道几时回来？」四儿道：「拿不定。」元茂道：「昨晚有几句要紧话没有讲，就睡着了。我若去了再来，又恐遇不着他，不如","en":"wiping the tables in the room. Yuanmao asked, \\"Where has your master gone?\\" Si'er replied, \\"He went to Master Fu the Third's place.\\" Yuanmao got off the kang, put on his clothes, and walked to the outer room. Si'er brought him wash water, brewed tea, and served some snacks. Yuanmao smoked several pipes of water tobacco, spitting phlegm all over the floor, which Si'er dutifully"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":8,"tokens":["富三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"再说聘才到了富三宅里，将事必成的话说了，富三甚是欢喜。问起要多少钱，聘才道：「钱却要的不少，他说此缺到任的规矩就有三万，十分中给他一分不为过多，定要三千两银子才办。我与和尚再三说了，只打了个八折，再要减时，他断不肯。」富三沉吟了一回，道：「二千四百银却也不多，几时要","en":"Meanwhile, Pincai arrived at Fu the Third's residence and conveyed that the matter was all but guaranteed, much to Fu the Third's delight. When asked how much it would cost, Pincai replied, \\"The sum required is not small. He said that the customary income upon taking up this post is thirty thousand"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":3,"tokens":["富三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"掌柜的道：「若早两天也不难，但今天已是二十六了，这两天也忙得很，恐怕凑不上来。」富三道：「你家凑不上来，还有谁家凑得上来？」掌柜的道：「三爷，你难道不知道近来银号的银子家家都窄，而且也真少，外面的帐又归还不进来。看这两天能收下来，如能足数固好，不然有多少兑多少罢。」富三道：「票上写多少呢？」掌柜的道：「依我也不用票子，三十日三爷来兑","en":"twenty-sixth, and these next couple of days are extremely busy; I'm afraid we won't be able to scrape it all together.\\" Fu the Third retorted, \\"If your establishment can't gather the funds, who else could?\\" The manager explained, \\"Third Master, surely you must know that cash is tight across all the exchange houses right now, and reserves are genuinely low, while outstanding debts"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":6,"tokens":["富三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"掌柜的只得应了，出了一千四百两。聘才对富三说：「叫他分开了写，两张五百，一张四百，适或人家今年使不了这许多，留两张明年来取呢。」富三道：「有理。」就照数开了三张。富三收了票子，别了掌柜的，上了车，再找两个银号，都说不能。富三没法，别家都是生的，没有往来，只得回家与三奶奶商量，拿了四十两金叶子","en":"Having no other choice, the manager agreed and issued a draft for one thousand four hundred taels. Pincai advised Fu the Third, \\"Tell him to write it out in separate drafts: two for five hundred and one for four hundred. Just in case the recipient cannot use so much this year, they can keep two drafts to withdraw next year.\\" Fu the Third agreed, \\"That makes sense.\\" The drafts"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":1,"tokens":["富三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"到二十九日，富三果然得了湖北，彼此大喜，即到寺中谢了聘才与和尚。到明日，即将银票交与他兄弟，从一千之内又扣出二百为拉纤提缆之费，独自得了。将所零之二百两，分一百两与聘才，聘才倒实得了一千三百两。自己进城取了一半现银回来，又在城外换了些钱，得意扬扬，十分高兴，所有账目","en":"On the twenty-ninth, Fu the Third indeed secured the post in Hubei. Everyone was overjoyed, and Fu the Third hurried to the temple to thank Pincai and the monk. The next day, the bank drafts were handed over to Tang's brother, who skimmed off another two hundred from the one thousand"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":1,"tokens":["富三爷"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"去，是个极旷野的地方，难道他起了兵马来围住不成？」聘才道：「虽然如此，我倒不为输了钱，又不为怕出什么事，实因是富三爷要起身了，我要请请他，与他饯行。后日是十四，约他出来住一宿。」并对奚十一、潘三道：「奉屈二位来叙一叙，可肯赏脸么？」奚、潘二人应了。冯子佩道：「你倒不请我。」聘才道：「你天天在这里，难道还要下请帖么？」子佩道：「我将梅窗也拉来。」聘才道：「很好。」众","en":"said, \\"Even so, my pausing isn't due to losing money, nor is it from fear of trouble. The truth is that Master Fu the Third is preparing to depart, and I wish to host a farewell banquet for him. The day after tomorrow is the fourteenth; I plan to invite him to stay over for a night.\\" He then addressed Xi and Pan: \\"I hope you two gentlemen will deign to join us for a gathering."},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":2,"tokens":["富三爷","富三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"到了明日，聘才发贴请客，请的是富三爷、贵大爷、奚十一、潘三、张仲雨、杨梅窗。是日辞了两个，贵大爷病了，张仲雨有事不能来。即补了冯子佩、唐和尚，宾主共七位。聘才叫了蓉官来陪富三，着人到篷子里叫了天香、翠官前来。不多一刻，两个剃头的也坐了大骡车，有一个人跟着，走进寺来。冯子佩是认识的，小剃","en":"The next day, Pincai sent out invitations for a gathering. His guests included Master Fu the Third, Gui the Eldest, Xi Eleven, Pan the Third, Zhang Zhongyu, and Yang Meichuang. Two sent their regrets—Gui was ill, and Zhang had other matters to attend to—so Feng Zipei and Monk Tang were brought in to fill their seats, making a total of seven host and"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":5,"tokens":["富三爷","富三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"两个剃头的便问聘才找出梳篦，替他梳发，梳完了又捶了一会。那一个也与子佩梳了，然后吃过早饭，开了烟灯，大家吃烟。富三爷先来，唐和尚见富三爷来了，就带了得月进来。天香、翠官与富三、和尚都请了安。富三却不认识，问他是谁，在那一班的，聘才就说是全福班的。随后奚十一、潘三同来。奚十一带了巴英官，潘三带了个学徒弟的小伙计，拿他竟当做跟班的。大家一齐相见了。潘三见了天香、翠官，","en":"massage. The other barber did the same for Zipei. After breakfast, the opium lamps were lit, and everyone partook. Fu the Third was the first guest to arrive, and upon seeing him, Monk Tang brought Deyue in. Tianxiang and Cuiguan paid their respects to Fu the Third and the monk. Fu the Third, not recognizing them, asked who they were and which troupe they belonged to; Pincai"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":2,"tokens":["富三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"」聘才因叫翠官、天香过来见了，说：「这就是很会看风水的杨八老爷，你们何不求他去看看你们的棚子，多会儿发财呢？」富三因接向杨八道：「你要留神呀，不要像乌家的事，看完了找到你门上去。」说罢大家大笑。冯子佩忽然皱了眉说声不好，便到院子里吐起来。慌得大家同来看他。吐了一会，就脸红头晕，满身发热。聘才忙叫他到炕上躺了。躺了一会，越发不好，便要回去。聘才便吩咐套车，自有他跟","en":"fengshui. Why don't you beg him to inspect your stall and tell you when you'll strike it rich?\\" Catching the joke, Fu the Third chimed in, \\"You'd better be careful, Yang Eight! Make sure you don't end up like that Wu family affair, having people chase you down to your doorstep after your reading.\\" The room erupted in laughter. Suddenly, Feng Zipei furrowed his brow, muttered"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":2,"tokens":["富三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"父天天这么着吗？」得月「呸」了一声，涨红了脸，扭转头不看。唐和尚合着掌道：「阿弥陀佛！罪过，罪过！」此时坐的是富三首席，聘才叫翠官陪了他。第二是奚十一，唐和尚知他是个阔手，且知道他爱得月，便叫得月陪了他。杨八坐了第三，聘才叫天香挨着他。潘三坐了第四，自己与唐和尚坐了主位，只不见蓉官来。饮酒之间，撒村笑骂，嘈杂到个不成样子。还是富三稳重些，不过与翠官说些顽笑话，尚","en":"pressed his palms together and chanted, \\"Amitabha! Sinful, how sinful!\\" By this time, the seating was arranged. Fu the Third took the seat of honor, with Pincai assigning Cuiguan to accompany him. Xi Eleven took the second seat; knowing Xi was a generous spender who had a fondness for Deyue, Monk Tang told Deyue to sit with him. Yang Eight took the third seat, and Pincai had"},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":6,"tokens":["富三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"富三歪转身子，拉过翠官问道：「你在铺子里做这买卖，究竟也无甚好处，不如跟我到湖北去罢，可愿不愿呢？」翠官听了道：「你肯带我去吗，你就是我的亲爸爸了。」说罢，便靠在富三怀里，把脸挨近富三嘴边，又说道：「我是不比相公，要花钱出师。当年讲明学徒弟不过三年，如今","en":"Fu the Third twisted his body around, pulled Cuiguan close, and asked, \\"Plying your trade in that shop doesn't seem to offer much of a future. Why don't you come with me to Hubei instead? Are you willing?\\" Upon hearing this, Cuiguan replied, \\"If you're willing to"},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":5,"tokens":["富三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"聘才道：「你跟三爷去很好，还有什么不愿的吗。虽然比不得相公出师，也要赏你师父几吊钱。」富三道：「这个自然。」翠官道：「当真的了？」富三道：「当真的了。」翠官便索性扒上富三身上，将头在富三肩上碰了几碰，说道：「我就磕头谢了！好三老爷，好亲爸爸！」富三乐得受不得。潘三见得月躺在奚十一怀里，天香躺在对面，杨八也想吹一口，便坐在炕沿上，歪转身子，","en":"Even though you don't need an actor's formal release fee, we should still tip your master a few strings of cash.\\" Fu the Third agreed, \\"Naturally.\\" Cuiguan asked, \\"Is it truly settled?\\" Fu the Third replied, \\"It is settled.\\" Cuiguan practically climbed onto Fu the Third, rubbing his head affectionately against Fu the Third's shoulder and saying, \\"Then I shall kowtow in thanks!"}],"35":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["富三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「去也去远了，还看他做甚么。」富三道：「你且进去查点东西，开了单子来，明早好报。」和尚见种菜的形色慌张，便疑心起来，把话吓他，说他通同引贼，明日就送他到坊里去，不怕他不认。便叫大家先到他屋里搜一搜，搜了一回，毫无所有，只见一个老婆子在土炕上发抖。和尚道：「你那伙计呢，怎么不见？」种菜","en":"\\"The thief is long gone; what's the use of looking?\\" Fu the Third said, \\"Just go in and inventory the losses. Make a list so we can report it in the morning.\\" The monk, noting the gardener's panic, grew suspicious. He intimidated the gardener, accusing him of colluding with the thief, threatening to hand him over to"},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":2,"tokens":["富三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，有十五两金子、二百两银子。拜匣内有三十几两散碎银，二两鸦片烟，还有几样零件玉器。衣包内是几件大毛衣服。幸亏赚富三的银子并有些钱票都放在别处，没有拿去。算起来已过一千余金。聘才即草草的开了一个单子，拿出来给众人瞧。众人见聘才有事，不便再留，况已交卯初，大家都要作别。此时已经开城，富三与杨八也要回去。外面正在套车，只见蓉官坐了车来。","en":"jade ornaments. The clothing bundle had held a few heavy fur garments. Fortunately, the silver he had earned from Fu the Third, along with some bank notes, had been stored elsewhere and remained untouched. Calculating the losses, it amounted to over a thousand taels. Pincai hastily drafted a list and brought it out for everyone to see. Seeing that Pincai was preoccupied, the"},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":2,"tokens":["富三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"富三的家人道：「客要散了，你才来。」蓉官甩着袖子，急急走进来，见了众人，请了安，见要散的样子。富三道：「好红相公！十四日叫了，要十五日才来。」蓉官见了天香、翠官，便冷笑道：「既然大家要散了，也要回去。我还要叫剃头的剃头呢。」说罢，把腰一弯，竟自去了。两个","en":"Fu the Third's servant quipped, \\"The guests are about to disperse, and only now do you arrive.\\" Rongguan flicked his sleeves and hurried in. After greeting everyone and noting the imminent departure, he heard Fu the Third tease, \\"What a sought-after darling! Invited"}],"50":[{"paragraph":20,"mentions":2,"tokens":["富三","富三爷"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"年生了毒疮，几乎性命不保，还是我医好他的。如今他也要到班了，七月内有缺就是他的。我想人生聚散是一定的。去年有位富三老爷，是魏大爷相好，魏大爷托我照应，才选了湖北。有个贵大爷，是富三爷的相好，他们是朝夕不离的，也得了湖北的同知。如今魏大爷又要到湖北去了，他们这三位相好，仍旧聚在一处，岂不是缘分么？譬如你们三位，也是天天相见的，在京做官是一样，将来如果都放了外任，一","en":"think that the gatherings and partings in a person's life are preordained by fate. Last year, there was a wealthy Third Master Fu, a close companion of Master Wei. Master Wei asked me to look after him, and he eventually drew an assignment in Hubei. There was also an Elder Master Gui, a close companion of Third Master Fu; the two were inseparable from dawn to dusk, and he too received"}]}`),"char-54":{3:[{paragraph:20,mentions:2,tokens:["贵大爷"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"几年不走动了。闻得他家玉哥儿很聪明，人也生得好，年纪也有十六七岁了，不知娶过媳妇儿没有？」聘才一一回答了，又与贵大爷寒喧一番。聘才已知富三是个热心肠，多情多义的人；那个贵大爷却是个谨慎小心，安分守己的一路。当下三人，倒闲谈了好一会。蓉官又到对面楼上去了，聘才望着他，又去与那黑脸大汉讲话。",en:'handsome, perhaps sixteen or seventeen now. Has he taken a bride?" Pincai answered the inquiries gracefully, engaging Master Gui in polite conversation. He quickly discerned the nature of his companions: Fu the Third was a man of fiery generosity and deep sentiment, while Master Gui was cautious, proper, and anchored in convention. The three men conversed effortlessly. Meanwhile,'},{paragraph:28,mentions:4,tokens:["贵大爷","贵大"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"贵大爷道：「这个话倒也可信。大叔在江南年数本久，自知府升到藩司，也有十几年，自然恋着那地方上了。」富三道：「我们老爷在江宁十六年，自知府到藩司，没有出过省，真与南京人有缘。我是生在江宁府衙门里的，所以我会说几句南京话。」聘才又将贵大爷恭惟一番。贵大爷道：「",en:'Master Gui nodded thoughtfully. "The sentiment is entirely credible. His Excellency served in Jiangnan for many years, rising steadily from Prefect to Provincial Treasurer over more than a decade. It is only natural he forged a deep bond with the land and its people."'},{paragraph:29,mentions:1,tokens:["贵大"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"装腔做作了。」蓉官低低的说道：「不好了，那位奚大老爷又翻了，不知骂谁？」便到板壁缝里去望他们。这边聘才与富三、贵大都静悄悄的听，听得一个相公说道：「你倒开口就骂人。好便宜的鸡巴，做起菜来，你口里还吃不尽呢。」听得那人又骂道：「我最恨那装腔做作的，一天一个样子。」又听得那相公说道：「就算我装腔做作了，你也不能打死了我。」又听得那人骂道：「我倒不打死你，我想攘死你。",en:'cursing this time?" He pressed his eye to the crack in the partition. At their table, Pincai, Fu the Third, and Master Gui fell utterly silent, straining to listen. Through the thin wood, a young actor shot back, "You cannot open your mouth without cursing. Cock is cheap enough with you — cook it up as a dish and your own mouth could never finish it." The deep voice roared'},{paragraph:36,mentions:5,tokens:["贵大","贵大爷"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"富三与聘才、贵大都在门口看了一会进来。蓉官吐了吐舌，说道：「好不怕人！这才算个标子。」富三笑道：「这种标也标得无趣，但不知为什么事闹起来？」蓉官道：「这位奚大老爷的下作脾气，是讲不出来的。」于是富三与聘才、贵大豁了一会拳，此时天气尚短，他们也要进城。贵大爷先抢会帐，",en:'Fu the Third, Pincai, and Master Gui watched the spectacle from the doorway for a long while before returning to their seats. Rongguan stuck out his tongue playfully. "Terrifying! Now that is what I call a proper spectacle." Fu the Third laughed, "Such crude spectacles hold no true interest.'},{paragraph:37,mentions:2,tokens:["贵大","贵大爷"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"聘才说：「一定来的，咱们从此订交。只是我是个白身人。仰扳不上。」富三、贵大同说：「罚你！咱们哥儿们论什么，你不嫌我们粗卤就是了。」富三赏了蓉官八吊钱，跟兔两吊钱。蓉官谢了赏，辞了贵大爷与聘才先去了。",en:'Yet I am but a commoner, without rank or title. I hardly dare aspire to your exalted company." Fu the Third and Master Gui objected in unison: "You must drink a penalty cup for such words! What do empty titles matter among brothers? So long as you do not find our company too crude, that is all that matters." Before departing, Fu the Third pressed eight strings of cash into'}],5:[{paragraph:28,mentions:1,tokens:["贵大爷"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"的尚未回答，富三道：「今日你嫂子不在家，回娘家去了，你今日就在这里吃饭，咱们说说话儿。」聘才连忙答应，又问：「贵大爷今日可来？」富三道：「不定。昨日听他说有事，要到锦春园求华公子说情，谅来此刻去了。」聘才听说锦春园的华公子，便问道：「我正要问那个华公子。」就将那路上看见的光景，车夫口内说的话，述了一遍。富三道：「赶车的知道什么！这华公子名光宿，号星北。他的老爷子是",en:`visit her parents. Stay and have a meal with me today, and we can chat." Pincai readily agreed, then asked: "Will Eldest Brother be coming today?" Fu the Third replied: "I'm not sure. I heard him say yesterday he had business and needed to go to Jinchun Garden to ask Young Master Hua to put in a good word. I imagine he has gone there by now." Hearing of Young Master Hua of Jinchun`},{paragraph:35,mentions:1,tokens:["贵大爷"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"聘才又到贵大爷处，没有在家，投刺而去。聘才在车里想道：",en:"Pincai then called on Master Gui's house; he was not at home, so Pincai left his card and departed. Riding in the carriage, Pincai reflected:"}],16:[{paragraph:5,mentions:6,tokens:["贵大","贵大爷"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"聘才听说三爷不在家，在对门贵大老爷处打牌，小使出来，聘才道：「贵大爷我去年却拜过他，未曾见着，今日正好拜他。」即到对门来，传进片子，听得里面叫：「请！」开了两扇中门，聘才进去，却是小小一个院落，只见贵大爷从正厅上出来，迎上前，与聘才拉了手，让聘才进屋内炕上坐。聘才道：「兄弟来过几",en:`Pincai learned that the Third Master was not at home, but was playing cards across the street at Lord Gui's residence. When the servant came out, Pincai said, "I left a card for Lord Gui last year but never had the chance to meet him; today is the perfect opportunity to pay my respects." He went straight to the opposite gate and sent in his calling card.`},{paragraph:6,mentions:3,tokens:["贵大爷","贵大"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"「怎么不认得？他们茔地的树，还是我种的呢。」贵大爷道：「这杨老八的风水是高明的，我们内城多半是请他瞧的。」聘才便又拉拢起来，只有那个阎简安是冷冰冰的，只与富、贵两人讲话。富三爷道：「歇了罢，这牌打得闷人，就是我输了，算账罢。」阎简安便道：「怎么就歇？方才打了两转。」梅窗道：「算了，不用来了。」于是，",en:`"How could I not be? I planted the trees on their ancestral burial ground myself." Lord Gui put in, "Old Yang the Eighth's geomancy is outstanding; most families in the inner city ask him to assess their properties." Pincai engaged him further, though Yan Jian'an sat coldly aside, speaking only with Fu and Gui. Third Master Fu complained, "Let's`}],34:[{paragraph:22,mentions:2,tokens:["贵大爷"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"到了明日，聘才发贴请客，请的是富三爷、贵大爷、奚十一、潘三、张仲雨、杨梅窗。是日辞了两个，贵大爷病了，张仲雨有事不能来。即补了冯子佩、唐和尚，宾主共七位。聘才叫了蓉官来陪富三，着人到篷子里叫了天香、翠官前来。不多一刻，两个剃头的也坐了大骡车，有一个人跟着，走进寺来。冯子佩是认识的，小剃头的先与",en:"The next day, Pincai sent out invitations for a gathering. His guests included Master Fu the Third, Gui the Eldest, Xi Eleven, Pan the Third, Zhang Zhongyu, and Yang Meichuang. Two sent their regrets—Gui was ill, and Zhang had other matters to attend to—so Feng Zipei and Monk Tang were brought in to fill their seats, making a total of seven host and guests. Pincai"}],50:[{paragraph:20,mentions:1,tokens:["贵大爷"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"了，七月内有缺就是他的。我想人生聚散是一定的。去年有位富三老爷，是魏大爷相好，魏大爷托我照应，才选了湖北。有个贵大爷，是富三爷的相好，他们是朝夕不离的，也得了湖北的同知。如今魏大爷又要到湖北去了，他们这三位相好，仍旧聚在一处，岂不是缘分么？譬如你们三位，也是天天相见的，在京做官是一样，将来如果都放了外任，一个做抚台，一个做藩台，一个做臬台，仍旧的聚在一个城内，岂不",en:"Master Wei. Master Wei asked me to look after him, and he eventually drew an assignment in Hubei. There was also an Elder Master Gui, a close companion of Third Master Fu; the two were inseparable from dawn to dusk, and he too received a post as a sub-prefect in Hubei. Now, Master Wei is also heading to Hubei! These three close companions will be reunited once again in the exact same"}]},"char-55":JSON.parse(`{"5":[{"paragraph":25,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"听他说有一百几十匹马，七八十个大骡子，你说这人家阔不阔？」聘才道：「他姓什么？」赶车的道：「他姓华，人家都叫他华公子。」聘才道：「马上那些人，自然是家人了，车里头那些孩子，倒像相公模样的，又是什么人呢？」赶车的道：","en":"that's wealthy?\\" Pincai asked: \\"What is his surname?\\" The driver replied: \\"His surname is Hua, people all call him Young Master Hua.\\" Pincai asked: \\"The men on horseback must be his household servants; but those children in the carriages, who look like opera performers, what are they?\\" The driver said:"},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":7,"tokens":["华公子","光宿","星北"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这里吃饭，咱们说说话儿。」聘才连忙答应，又问：「贵大爷今日可来？」富三道：「不定。昨日听他说有事，要到锦春园求华公子说情，谅来此刻去了。」聘才听说锦春园的华公子，便问道：「我正要问那个华公子。」就将那路上看见的光景，车夫口内说的话，述了一遍。富三道：「赶车的知道什么！这华公子名光宿，号星北。他的老爷子是世袭一等公，现做镇西将军。因祖上功劳很大，他从十八岁上当差，就","en":"Third replied: \\"I'm not sure. I heard him say yesterday he had business and needed to go to Jinchun Garden to ask Young Master Hua to put in a good word. I imagine he has gone there by now.\\" Hearing of Young Master Hua of Jinchun Garden, Pincai asked: \\"I was just going to ask about that Young Master Hua.\\" He then recounted what he had seen on the road and what the driver had told"}],"6":[{"paragraph":23,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华星北"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，恰不认识。这刘文泽字前舟，系中州世家，已得了二品荫生。这人最是和气，性情阔大，蔼然可亲，尤好结交，与徐子云、华星北均称莫逆。那个张仲雨是扬州人，生得俊秀灵警，是进京来赶异路功名的，就住在他舅舅吴阁学家。一切手谈博弈，吹竹弹丝，各色在行，捐了个九品前程，是个热闹场中的趣人。这高品是苏州人，号卓然，是个拔贡生。聪明绝世，博览群书，善于诙谐，每出一语，往往颠倒四座。与","en":"generous spirit and approachability, he deeply valued friendship and was exceptionally close to Xu Ziyun and Hua Xingbei. Zhang Zhongyu, a quick-witted and handsome Yangzhou native, had traveled to the capital seeking an alternative path to officialdom, lodging with his uncle, Grand Academician Wu. Masterful in chess, qin, flute, and all manner of entertainments, he had"},{"paragraph":36,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华星北"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"分妩媚。刘文泽道：「人家都要散了，怎么这时候才来？」冯子佩道：「我早上进城到锦春园华府去拜年，原打算不耽搁的。华星北定要拉住吃了饭，又听了他们几出戏，才放我走，还是急急的赶出来的。」子玉同了元茂、聘才告辞，诸人都送到楼门口，文泽、王恂、仲清送下楼来。","en":"city to pay my New Year's respects to the Hua household at Jinchun Garden, intending a brief visit. However, Hua Xingbei absolutely insisted I stay for dinner and forced me to watch several more pieces of opera before letting me leave; I rushed here as quickly as I could.\\" Ziyu, alongside Yuanmao and Pincai, bid their farewells; the entire group accompanied them to the"}],"10":[{"paragraph":42,"mentions":2,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"龄！你再来给梅少爷瞧瞧。」只见里面套间内走出一个人来，却是头里那个假琴言，垂手正色，侍立在子云身旁。这假琴言是华公子家八龄班内的一个，名字叫玉龄，本是子云家人，送给华公子。因其面貌有些相像，所以叫回应用。这就是子云移花接木之计。","en":"his sides, composed and upright, attending quietly beside Ziyun. This false Qinyan was a member of the troupe of Young Master Hua's household, a boy named Yuling, who had originally been a page in Ziyun's household and later given to Young Master Hua. Because his face bore a certain resemblance to the real Qinyan's, he had been called upon and cleverly used for the occasion. This,"}],"11":[{"paragraph":4,"mentions":4,"tokens":["华公子","华光宿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"且说那华公子年方二十一岁，其容貌虽见于魏聘才之目，性情述于富三之口，究未得其详。这华公子气焰虽豪，性情却极纯粹。不过在那起居服食上，享用些富贵豪华之福。养尊处优，不喜酬应。\\n骑射既精，词赋更妙。也曾千卷罗胸，不难七步随口。这华夫人母家姓苏，父名臣泰，也是功臣之后","en":"The young master Hua was then twenty-one years of age. Though his striking figure had fleetingly caught the eye of Wei Pincai and his temperament had been hinted at by Fu the Third, his true nature remained untold. Young Master Hua possessed an extravagant, commanding"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":3,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这日华夫人知其胞妹浣兰小姐要来，复又见徐府中送了十样珍玩，知袁夫人也要来，与华公子清早拜过了家庙，供过了佛。公子本要再与夫人家宴一天，因他姨妹与盟嫂来，只好回避。不一会苏小姐已到，香车到了穿堂，用软肩舆一直抬进了内堂院子里，四个丫鬟扶了小姐下轿，华夫人出接，姐妹二人见了礼，华公子也进来见过了。公子问过他岳父岳母的安，将要坐下，家人","en":"arrival of the Xu household's ten precious curios, signaling Mrs. Yuan's impending visit. Rising early, she and the young master offered reverent respects at the ancestral shrine and the Buddhist altar. The young master had intended to honor his wife with another private banquet, but the arrival of her sister and sworn-sister necessitated his polite withdrawal. Before long, Miss"}],"13":[{"paragraph":35,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"太阳也出来了。潘其观便问蕙芳藏在那里，原来蕙芳交代了一番说话，方才出门。打杂的道：「昨夜你们两位老爷睡了，不料华公子住在城外，打发人来把蕙芳叫去。这位老爷谁敢违拗他，只怕今日带进了城，要住好几天才回来。」","en":"instructions before going out. The odd-job man said, \\"Last night, after your honours were asleep, who should send but Young Master Hua, who is out of town, and he had Huifang fetched away. Who would dare cross that gentleman? I dare say he has taken him into the city today and it will be some days before he is back.\\""},{"paragraph":36,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"张仲雨道：「这倒难怪他，华公子是惹不得的。」潘其观无可奈何，只可惜了二百吊钱，倒买张仲雨吐了他一脸，打了他一个嘴巴，只好慢慢的日后商量，再作道理，同了张仲雨郁郁而去。","en":"Zhang Zhongyu said that one could hardly blame Huifang for that, as Young Master Hua was not someone to be trifled with. Pan Qiguan had no recourse. He could only bitterly regret the two hundred strings of cash, which had effectively bought him nothing but a face full of vomit from Zhang Zhongyu and a hard slap in the bargain. He had"}],"16":[{"paragraph":7,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"余就难讲了。」原来这个阎简安，是个半生半熟的老篾片，却与华公有旧，嫌其心窄嘴臭，脾气古怪，所以叫他在府里住着。华公子是更不对的。杨梅窗是个土篾片，但知势利，毫无所能。又是个里八府的人，怯头怯脑。因与富三爷是干兄弟，又拉拢了些半生半熟的阔老，仗着看风水为名，胡吹乱讲的一味贪财，或与地主勾通，或与花儿匠工头连手，赚下人的钱，也捐了个从九候选，至于堪舆之学，实在不懂。是","en":"the old master and even served on campaigns with him. My standing is quite different from those other friends; the young master treats me with the courtesy due a senior. The rest are another matter entirely.\\" In truth, Yan Jian'an was a half-seasoned, half-green sycophant. He had old ties with Young Master Hua, who tolerated his narrow-mindedness, foul language, and peculiar"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":2,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"正少人呢。」聘才道：「舅太爷是那一位？」富三道：「你不记得去年在城外，瞧见那十几辆车，车内那个貂裘绣蟒的，叫做华公子就是。」聘才心中十分欢喜，想道：这华公子势焰熏天，若得合了式，弄个小小的出身，也还容易。","en":"procession of carriages outside the city last year, with that man in a sable coat and embroidered python robe? That is Young Master Hua.\\" Pincai was inwardly delighted, realizing that Young Master Hua's influence reached the heavens. If he could ingratiate himself and secure even a minor official position, his path would be much easier."},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":2,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"明日，富三就到华公府来，见了华公子，就荐聘才进府，帮办杂务。华公子应了，说道：「我这里到不拘人多人少，只要人好，是你的好朋友。自然不用讲了。说请你去讲一声，请他来就是了。」即吩咐林珊枝传谕总办，将魏师爷修金钦馔说定，富三连连答应几个「是」！又进去见了华夫人，就辞了，一径出城，通知了魏","en":"The following day, Fu the Third arrived at the Hua mansion, met Young Master Hua, and recommended Pincai as a secretary to handle miscellaneous affairs. Young Master Hua agreed, saying, \\"I have no strict limit on staff here. As long as the person is capable and your close friend, there is nothing to discuss. Tell him he is invited"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"身时，再进去叩谢。」李元茂在旁，闻得聘才要进华府，心中有些难过，道：「你去了只剩了我，且你也少了个伴儿。我闻得华公子脾气不好，你倒不要去吃钉板，还是在此罢，过年再说。」聘才道：「各人有各人的打算，我如今比不上你了。你是知县少爷，享现成的福，我不但自己不能受用，还要顾家呢！」子玉听到这句，便知不能强留，只得进去与颜夫人说了。颜夫人道：「既然如此，只好听他自去罢。但老","en":"bound for the Hua household. \\"If you leave, I will be here alone, and you will lose a companion. I have heard Young Master Hua has a difficult temper; you had better not go and invite trouble. Stay here instead, and we can reconsider after the New Year.\\" Pincai sighed, \\"Everyone has their own path, and my situation is not like yours. You are the son of a county magistrate, enjoying"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"人又在一个院落，当下都请来见了。阎简安道：「不料前日一见，今日就进我们府中来，有这等奇事。」聘才道：「小弟多蒙华公子谬爱，招之门下。无奈铅刀袜线，一无所能，诸事全仗老先生们教训。」","en":"day, you would join our household today? What a curious turn of events.\\" Pincai replied, \\"I am deeply indebted to Young Master Hua for his misguided favor in bringing me here. I fear I possess little talent and must rely entirely on your esteemed guidance.\\""}],"18":[{"paragraph":6,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"诸人；不对的是阎简安、王卿云诸人。聘才也只好各人安分，合式的便往来密些，不对的便疏远些。惟郁郁不乐者，尚未见过华公子一面。而且一无所事，不过天天与众人厮混，正是「两餐老米饭，一枕黑甜乡」而已。","en":"still not come face to face? The several times he had asked for an audience, he was put off with the excuse that the young master was busy. Those he did meet and mingle with were all dubious characters. There was also that class of arrogant household servants who put on great airs: they would meet him with merely a perfunctory bow, openly take the superior seat, and speak in nothing"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":4,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"聘才同上了酒楼，小酌叙谈。仲雨见聘才似乎兴致不佳，不像从前光景，因问道：「听见老弟进了华公府，那里局面宽大，且华公子是爱交接的，近来光景自然大有起色了。」聘才道：「仁兄不问，弟亦不便说起。始而富三爷讲起华公子有孟尝之名，门下食客数百人。弟进去了，门客却不少，都是些势利透顶人，不是挤那个，就是杀这个。弟进去一月有余，华公子只是冷冷的，若长如此光景，弟倒错了主意了。」","en":"Zhongyu asked: \\"I heard you have entered the Hua family mansion. Given the grandeur of that establishment, and that the young master Hua loves social connections, things must naturally have taken a great turn for the better lately.\\" Pincai said: \\"If elder brother hadn't asked, I would not have brought it up myself. At first, Third Master Fu told me that the young master Hua held the"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"好处来；连那七个字没有的，也会寻出机会来。总之，各人的缘法。从来说」时来风送滕王阁，运退雷轰荐福碑。」我知道这华公子是极好相与的，现有多少人从他府里走动，弄出多少好处来。我教你个法儿，要他与你相好很不难。这人我也认得，从前他也托过我事情。","en":"roughnecks. Then two characters: 'half-schooled'. Then three: 'knows how to grovel'. Then four: 'curries favour with the master within'. Then five: 'a lackey who calls you brother'. Then six: 'keeps up a front on his ancestors'. Then seven: 'bores through cracks and crannies to cadge a windfall'. That constitutes the third tier.\\" Pincai said: \\"Do not look down on the third tier."},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"放线雀儿，几十丈线放了出去终究收得回来，只不要可惜小本钱。」聘才点点头道：「承教，随教！」仲雨又道：「譬如你同华公子交接过了，你看他是什么脾气，喜的是什么样，恶的是什么样，自然是顺他意见。","en":"thumb as he spoke: \\"He is a person of this caliber. His word is followed, his plan is adopted, and he never leaves the young master's side. You must first work through this connection; once that gate is opened, everything else becomes easy. There is also that group of the Eight Ages always at the young master's elbow. Children lack great discernment, so offering them a small advantage"}],"19":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"魏聘才自得仲雨传授，依法行之，先于林珊枝面前献尽殷懃，又于八龄班赔尽辛苦。珊枝本系联锦部有名小旦，继进登春班，华公子看中了他，遂以重价买进。后来之八龄班皆系珊枝所教。这林珊枝不消说是音律精通了。魏聘才本是个伶俐人，昆曲唱得绝好，就是吹弹也应酬的上来。更兼旧年一路同着班子来，船中又听会了许多戏文，到京后又三天两天的听戏，自然又添了好些曲子。","en":"had originally been a celebrated young dan actor in the Lianjin troupe; he later joined the Dengchun troupe, and Young Master Hua, having taken a liking to him, purchased him at a high price. The eight pages who came afterward had all been trained by Shanzhi. Needless to say, this Lin Shanzhi was thoroughly schooled in music and song. Wei Pincai was by nature a quick-witted person,"},{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这曲子是聘才最得意的，便在旁帮起腔来，五音不乱，唇齿分明，竟唱得出神入妙，把个林珊枝倒惊倒了。即由此相好，就在华公子面前，朝朝暮暮，称赞聘才。","en":"From that moment on, they became close friends, and Shanzhi would praise Pincai morning and night in front of Young Master Hua."},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"华公子是最信珊枝的，他又不轻易赞人，他肯赞好，必是真好了，心上就有了这个人。那八龄班内的都是些苏、扬人，脾气自然相合。聘才会讨好，今日送这个一把扇子，明日送那个一个荷囊，总是称心称意，小孩子喜欢的东西，觉得这位师爷实在知趣。至于管总的、办事的，尤巴结得周到","en":"Young Master Hua placed the most trust in Shanzhi; since Shanzhi did not praise people lightly, if he was willing to praise someone, they must truly be excellent. Thus, Pincai gained a firm place in the young master's heart. The members of the Eight-Ages Troupe were"},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":2,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一日，打听华公子出门去了，聘才约了张笑梅出城。笑梅要找冯子佩，二人同车即到冯子佩家来。这子佩是与华公子最熟的，已与聘才见过，彼此合式。冯子佩也是个宦家子弟，只因早丧严亲，又积些宦囊，其母钟爱，任凭他游荡歌场，结交豪贵，后来家业渐渐萧条。又亏了几个好友帮扶，所以觉得银","en":"One day, having learned that the young master had gone out, Pincai invited Zhang Xiaomei to come out of the city. Xiaomei wanted to find Feng Zipei, so the two shared a carriage straight to Feng Zipei's house. This Zipei was the most familiar with Young Master Hua; he had already met Pincai, and"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，喘吁吁走进里面，到客房坐下。蕙芳便问道：「潘三爷，这几天总不见你，在那里发财？你能总不肯赏驾。记得那一天是因华公子住在城外，传了我去，实在短伺候，你不要怪，咱们相好的日子正长呢。」潘三见蕙芳殷懃委宛，便把从前的气忿消了一半，便慢慢的说道：「我来做什么，我也知道你嫌我，二百吊钱倒买张老二吐了我一脸酒。兔子藏在窟窿里，叫野猫馋着嘴空想呢。」蕙芳听了这话十分有气，只得","en":"Where have you been making your fortune? You rarely honor us with a visit. I recall that the other day, because the young master Hua was staying outside the city, I was summoned there and was truly remiss in attending to you. Please don't hold it against me. We have plenty of time ahead of us to be friends.\\" Pan Qiguan, seeing Huifang so warm and gracious, felt half his former"}],"20":[{"paragraph":9,"mentions":3,"tokens":["华光宿","华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"古铜壶，插着几枝竹箭，中悬一额，曰：「停云叙雨之斋。」旁有一联，其句云：拜石有时具袍笏。看云无处不神仙。署款为华光宿。南湘失惊道：「此华公子手笔，不料其词翰如此。」子云道：「华公子天分极高，不过工夫稍浅，亦其势位所误。若论书、画、诗、词，倒与其境遇相反的。」春航道：「若仅闻于流俗之口，几乎失是人矣。即此联句，可见其胸次之雅；即此书法，可见其意气之豪。」说罢，远远望","en":"court robes and hat;\\nGazing at clouds, there is nowhere one is not a celestial immortal.\\"\\n\\nThe signature read: Hua Guangsu. Nanxiang exclaimed in surprise: \\"This is Young Master Hua's brushwork—I had no idea his literary arts reached such heights.\\" Ziyun replied: \\"Young Master Hua possesses exceptionally high natural talent; his application has merely been somewhat shallow,"}],"21":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"此回书又要讲那魏聘才，在华府中住了一月有余，上上下下皆用心周旋的十分很好，又因华公子待他有些颜面，银钱又宽展起来，便有些小人得志，就不肯安分了。内有顾月卿、张笑梅，外有杨梅窗、冯子佩一班人朝欢暮乐，所见所闻，无非势力钻营等事，是以渐渐心肥胆大。从前在梅宅有士燮学士在家，虽不来管教他，自然畏惧的。而且子玉所结交的，都是些公子名士，没有","en":"the Hua mansion for more than a month he had cultivated everyone above and below with such thorough success that Young Master Hua granted him some dignity and his purse grew easier; thereupon he began to show the petty man's triumph and would no longer keep his place. Within were Gu Yueqing and Zhang Xiaomei; outside Yang Meichuang, Feng Zipei, and such company — nightly revelry"},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"聘才猜着了几分，进来问了好些话。子玉因这几日没人来，便觉气闷，聘才来了，也稍可排解。问那华公府内光景，聘才即把华公子称赞得上天下地选不出来，又夸其亲随林珊枝及八龄班怎样的好，就说琴言也不能及他。","en":"felt stifled — Pincai's presence eased him somewhat. Asked how things stood at the Hua mansion, Pincai praised Young Master Hua as unequalled under heaven, boasted how fine were his attendant Lin Shanzhi and the Eight Ages troupe — and said even Qinyan could not match them."}],"24":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"烂醉，竟到不省人事，却叫他们在客房内同睡。那姓潘的便滚了下来，在自己鞋里撒了一泡溺，后来醒了。查起来，他家说被华公子叫了去，姓潘的吵了一夜，没有法儿也只得回去。到四月里又去闹他，偏偏碰着假查夜的来，唬得潘三跑了，倒丢了一个金镯。」王恂笑道：「媚香原是个顶尖利的人，就是湘帆能服他。这潘银匠自然要上当的。」仲清道：「还听得那个李元茂，在东园闹了一个大笑话。」王恂道：「","en":"the guest room. Pan rolled out of bed, relieved himself into his own boot, and woke in a stupor. When told that Young Master Hua had summoned them away, Pan raged through the night before slinking home in defeat. In the fourth month, he returned to pester them again, only to run headlong into a fake night watch; terrified, he fled, losing a gold bangle in the process.\\" Wang Xun"},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"借与人用，吾兄又是个情中之侠了。」仲清道：「何敢当此谬赞。但人性各有所近，不能强使附合。即我在度香处，闻得那个华公子的举动，虽未与之谋面，但其豪爽是常听见的。我知其用情阔大，与度香同源异流，所以度香常赞他，也很佩服他。至若魏聘才、冯子佩、潘三等，真可谓情中之蠹，近其人则蠹身，顺其情则蠹心。天生这班人，在正人堆里作崇。还听得有个奚十一，专爱糟蹋相公，有一个木桶哄人，","en":"Zhongqing waved off the praise, \\"You flatter me undeservedly; natures simply differ. At Duxiang's, I hear much of Young Master Hua. Though we have not met, his generous feeling matches Duxiang's source, though it flows from a different stream. Duxiang honors him greatly. As for Wei Pincai, Feng Zipei, and Pan the Third, they are mere worms devouring the grain of passion. To be near"},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":2,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"倒总不见你们。」桂保道：「我们近日在怡园演习新戏。」仲清道：「什么新戏呢？」玉林道：「闻得六月初六日荷花生日，华公子要来逛园。度香为他是爱听戏的，即与静宜商量。静宜说：「华公子是爱新鲜热闹的，若说寻常的戏，他都已听过，而且这几个班子也未必能赛过他的八龄班。我想不若把各班中，挑出几个来，集个大成班，我再谱出些新戏来，便不与外间的相同，也就耳目一新了。」仲清道：「这倒","en":"Contentment.\\" When Zhongqing asked which ones, Yulin replied, \\"The sixth of the sixth month is the Lotus Birthday, and Young Master Hua plans to tour the garden. Since Duxiang knows he loves the opera, he consulted Jingyi. Jingyi said that Young Master Hua has already heard all the ordinary plays, and no troupe could possibly surpass his own Eight Ages company. Therefore, it would be"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"桂保、玉林也要回去，就告辞了，各自上车而回。仲清、王恂又谈了一回，各自回房不提。下回是怡园请客，演出新戏，不知华公子看了如何，且听下回分解。","en":"before retiring for the night. As for the upcoming feast at the Garden of Contentment, the new plays, and how Young Master Hua will respond—you must hear the next installment to find out."}],"25":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":2,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说前回书中，玉林、桂保在王恂处，讲起怡园演习新戏，预备华公子逛园。流光荏苒，倏忽一月，刘文泽已回。书中所讲这班名士，华公子向来往来者就是刘文泽一人，其余多未谋面。此时文泽之父刘守正已升了礼部尚书，是以文泽偕其妻星夜赶回，未免有些庆贺之事。又适子云写书前往，文泽回京已有半月，诸事已毕。","en":"Wang Xun's place were speaking of the new plays being rehearsed at the Garden of Contentment in preparation for Young Master Hua's garden visit. Time flew swiftly; in the blink of an eye a month passed, and Liu Wenze had returned. Of this circle of distinguished scholars, the one Young Master Hua had long been acquainted with was Liu Wenze alone; the rest he had mostly not yet"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":5,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"当时子云接进文泽，到含万楼下坐定，子云即问了些保定光景。文泽讲了一遍，便问子云道：「今日除华公子之外，有何佳客？」子云道：「几个年老纱帽头，同华公子是说不来的。平时来往那些人，系有生有熟。席间若有一个道学先生，就使通席不快，所以止请了我们常叙的几位，除高卓然没有回来，此外是史、颜、田、王、梅，分作三席。那晓昨日一齐辞了，可可的这么凑巧，竟一个都","en":"Containment. Ziyun first asked about the situation in Baoding; Wenze recounted his news, then asked Ziyun: \\"Apart from Young Master Hua, what other notable guests are expected today?\\" Ziyun said: \\"A few elderly gentlemen in their gauze caps would have nothing to say to Young Master Hua — they care only for rank and stipend. Among those we regularly associate with, some know Hua and some"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"了。」说得众人皆笑。次贤即从屏后出来，大家见了，诸名旦也都随着出来见过。大家又坐谈了一会，只见家人上前禀道：「华公子快到门了。」子云吩咐速备椅轿，在园门伺候，即请次贤陪着文泽等，自己忙整理衣冠，迎出含万楼来。","en":"introduced as well. They all sat chatting for a while longer when a household servant came forward and announced: \\"Young Master Hua is nearly at the gate.\\" Ziyun ordered sedan chairs prepared at once and stationed at the garden gate, then asked Cixian to keep Wenze and the others company while he himself hastily straightened his cap and robes and went out from the Tower of Myriad"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":2,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"许多脚步声音，只见一个六品服饰的人过假山来。又见四个也是衣冠带的，扶着椅轿，中间坐着那彩云皓月、玉裹金装的一位华公子，后头一群人，大大小小，约有二十余个人跟着。将近阶前，子云降阶而迎。华公子一见子云，即忙下轿，恭身上前，与子云相见，问了好，即携着手同上了阶，进了含万楼，重新见礼。","en":"the artificial hill. Behind him came four more, also in cap and robes, steadying a sedan-chair, and in it sat Young Master Hua, in silk that shone like the bright moon and gold stitched into the cloth; and behind him again came a train of twenty and more, great and small. As they neared the steps Ziyun went down to meet him. The moment Young Master Hua saw Ziyun he got out of"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":7,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"原来华公爷与徐相国，已是二十年至好，又同在军营两年，有苔岑之谊，金石之交。徐子云与华公子，他们又订金兰，重修世好。子云比华公子长了五岁，华公子以长兄相待，甚是恭敬。当时子云即让华公子坐了，家人献过了茶，华公子道：「早几日就要过来请安，因连日有随驾差使，而且天气又热，恐妨起居。今天稍为凉快，正可与吾兄快谈半日。只可惜一城之隔，不能秉烛夜游","en":"served two campaigns together — friendship moss-thick as hill herbs, oath-bound as metal and stone. Xu Ziyun and Young Master Hua had sworn brotherhood and revived the tie between houses. Ziyun was five years elder; Young Master honored him as elder brother — courteous and yielding. At once Ziyun yielded Young Master Hua the seat of honor while servants poured tea. Young Master"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":2,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"弟当奉迓高轩。」子云道：「甚好！甚好！如遇不得出城之日，必来相扰。府上西园布置极佳，若能通到东园，则更妙矣。」华公子道：「隔着中间多少正房，是通不来的；且东园为宾客聚居，杂人甚多，无从点缀。」正说之间，只听后面鼓乐之声。子云即让华公子进内，过了穿堂，走到承荫堂阶前，堂上三人都到廊下款接，公子一一见了，皆系交好。","en":"shall trouble you. Your Western Garden is superbly laid — could it join the Eastern Garden it would be finer.\\" Young Master Hua said: \\"So many main halls stand between — cannot link — and the east quarter lodges many guests — mixed folk — nowhere to ornament.\\" While they spoke drums and pipes sounded behind; Ziyun urged Young Master Hua inward; past the vestibule they reached"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":2,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，不当清听。如蒙颔赏，鄙人愿代诸君浮一大白。」大家笑说：「很好。」酒筵已齐，家人即捧酒来，子云送酒安席。东边是华公子首座，仲雨作陪。西边文泽上座，次贤作陪。子云在华公子席上作主人。","en":"everyone.\\" All agreed it was good — wine was ready — servants bore jars forward — Ziyun poured and set seats — Young Master Hua held chief east seat with Zhongyu attending; Wenze chief west with Cixian attending; Ziyun played host beside Young Master Hua's table."},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":7,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"华公子道：「没有客了，就是五人，何妨并作一席，隔远了不好说话；再一开戏，讲话更听不见了。」文泽道：「既如此，并作一桌罢。」子云道：「也好，但是挤了，换个圆桌罢，只是不恭些。」华公子道：「好说，兄弟亦算不得客，二哥这么拘礼，以后就不敢奉扰了。」子云连声答应，","en":"Young Master Hua said: \\"There are no further guests — just the five of us. Why not merge into a single table? Seated far apart, conversation is difficult; and once the opera begins, we shall not hear each other at all.\\" Wenze said: \\"In that case, let us combine into"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"》，是正生戏，赐以御酒金花，一路送迎祖饯，昂藏慷慨，跌宕多姿，把个李谪仙魂魄都做出来。及到唱完，已有一个时辰。华公子赞了几声，吩咐了一句话，珊枝出去了一回，就有十六个人，抬上八张桌子，赏了八十吊钱。主人照样发赏，文泽也赏了八桌，仲雨、次贤各赏了四桌。","en":"grave — conjuring Li Bai's wandering soul entire. By the time the singing was done, a full two hours had passed. Young Master Hua uttered several words of praise and gave one brief order; Shanzhi went out for a moment, and then sixteen men came in bearing eight tables, and eighty strings of cash were bestowed as reward. The host distributed his rewards in the same fashion; Wenze"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":3,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"位女仙一并站在山顶，底下云彩盘旋，天花灿烂，又焚些百和、龙涎，香烟缭绕，人气氤氲，把一座戏台，直放在彩云端里。华公子喝采不住，大家亦齐声相和，便畅饮了好几杯。再看台上共是十个，正是人间天上，色界香城。这个是国色天姿，那个是风鬟云鬓。\\n这个是灵蛇盘髻，那个是堕马新妆。这个是捧心效邻女之颦，那个是秀色忘君王之餐。这个是金梁却月，婵娟百宝之钗；那个是翠羽瑶璫，天女六铢之","en":"presence mingling with the mist, until the entire stage seemed transported into the midst of brilliant clouds. Young Master Hua applauded without cease, and the whole company joined in with enthusiastic acclaim, drinking freely round after round. Looking again at the stage, all ten performers were displayed — truly a vision spanning heaven and earth, a realm of color and a city"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":9,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这两本戏却做了多时，子云见华公子兴致甚高，便命止了戏，叫上那十个仙女带妆上前，一人各敬一大杯。华公子毫不推辞，笑而受之；也要众人照样，大家酒量皆不能及，只得换了小杯，也各饮了十杯。华公子又把群旦叫到面前看了一回，向子云道：「小弟去年托张老二选了八个，合成一班，如今看起来，不如他们远","en":"Those two performances had taken a great deal of time. Ziyun, seeing that Young Master Hua's spirits were running exceedingly high, ordered the plays stopped and summoned the ten immortal maidens forward, still in full stage makeup, to toast him — each one presenting a great cup. Young Master Hua refused not a single one, smiling as he accepted"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":3,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"钟上时已未末，撤了席，华公子起身道：「本为逛园而来，今日又来不及了，但是荷花是要看的。」子云命将席挪到吟秋水榭，一面预备采莲船，就命十旦扮作采莲女子，下池荡桨；一面让客到水榭来。华公子等进了水榭，一望尽是荷花，红香芬馥，翠盖缤纷，好个色天香界，遂又入席坐定。只见四五个小舟，荡入","en":"By now the clock showed nearly the end of the wei hour; the banquet was cleared. Young Master Hua rose and said: \\"I came to stroll the garden — today again there was no time — yet the lotus must be seen.\\" Ziyun had the feast carried to the Autumn-Chant Waterside Pavilion, ordered lotus-gathering boats prepared, and told the ten performers to dress"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":4,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云笑道：「正合鄙意。」就将群旦叫上来。群花听了，即荡动兰桨，往水榭边来，上了岸，在阑外雁排侍立。华公子便指名叫了四个进来：蕙芳、琴言、宝珠、素兰。华公子对着四旦说道：「方才《峨嵋山群仙》一出，虽全部出场，未尽态度。你们可将各人得意之戏说一出来。」四旦听了，想了一想，各说了一出。子云道：「此尚非极得意的，只有媚香与香畹的《独占》，瑶卿与玉侬的《惊梦》《","en":"order, they plied orchid oars toward the pavilion, landed, and drew up in goose formation beyond the railing. Young Master Hua called four men in by name: Huifang, Qinyan, Baozhu, Sulan. To them he said: \\"In 'Immortals of Mount Emei' just now the whole cast stood forth but not every gesture appeared. Each of you name a piece you do best.\\" The four thought and each named one."},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云只顾点头微笑，华公子拍案叫绝，道：「快哉！快哉！我今日始信人间真有绝色，深悔从前将些嫫拇、无盐，也置之绣帏金屋。」又高声说道：「唯怪我度香仁兄秘藏佳丽，独享眼福，不肯早以示人，直到餍足之后，才招客共赏，分明使人饫其余味。今日没有别的，我先罚你十巨觞再说。」","en":"Ziyun only nodded and smiled. Young Master Hua smacked the table and cried: \\"Splendid! Splendid! Today I first believe peerless beauty exists under heaven — I deeply regret filling embroidered curtains with Momu and Wuyan look-alikes.\\" He added loudly: \\"I blame Elder Brother Duxiang for hoarding"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":4,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"虽只管答应，呆呆的不动，目视子云。子云会意，也自知酒量不敌，便说道：「实在贱量不能多饮，愿将门杯以当大斗罢。」华公子犹不肯依，经次贤、文泽、仲雨都来解劝，说：「非特度香不能，就是我们都也陪不来的，以小杯罚他三杯罢。」华公子也知子云酒量平常，只得依了。众人请子云连饮了三杯，自己却用大杯一杯一杯的不用人让，一连饮了十几杯，尚觉喝采不住，又逼住了文泽饮了三杯，次贤、仲雨","en":"match, he said: \\"My shallow capacity truly cannot stomach more — let my door cup stand for your great dipper.\\" Young Master Hua still refused until Cixian, Wenze, and Zhongyu mediated: \\"Not only Duxiang — none of us could match those cups — fine him three small cups instead.\\" Knowing Ziyun drank little, Young Master Hua yielded. They made Ziyun drain three cups in succession"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":4,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"且说戏台上那两个唱完了，不准下来，还要再唱。宝珠见华公子如此赏识，自然十分高兴。又见他看了一遍，还要再看，心上便越要加些精神，做些态度出来，一来要起公子爱慕之心，二来也与度香脸上增些体面，比起先一出，更唱得出色。这琴言心上却是不愿，只因听华公子是得罪不得的，只得受些委屈。又想起十人中单叫他们两人，就恨还有","en":"the stage the two who had finished were not allowed to come down; they were to sing again. Baozhu, seeing how Young Master Hua admired them, was naturally delighted; and seeing that he had watched once and wanted to watch again, he put still more spirit into it and made more of his gestures — partly to catch the young master's fancy, and partly to do Duxiang credit — so that"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":4,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"敢上前催他，只得出去，先叫人去留了城门，重走上来，站在公子背后。只管看着子云，众人亦皆明白，皆因不好催促。适值华公子出外小解，珊枝便对子云请了一安，低低的讲道：「求二老爷劝我们爷少喝些酒，早些回去，要关城了。若不能进城，御前差使无有定准的，恐有迟误，不是顽的。」子云点了点头，道：「你说的很是，也是时候了。」华公子进来见珊枝与子云说话，便问珊枝道：「天气还早呢？」珊","en":"he could not urge aloud — slipped out and told retainers to hold the gate open, then returned and stood behind Young Master Hua, eyes pleading at Ziyun; everyone understood but none wished to prompt. When Young Master Hua stepped out briefly to relieve himself, Shanzhi bowed low to Ziyun and whispered: \\"Beg Second Master persuade our lord to drink less and return soon — the gates"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"看宝珠、琴言将要唱完，便对子云道：「我还进城罢。」珊枝听了接口道：「将要关城了，公子既要进城，就要快些赶呢。」华公子听了没奈何，只得起身穿戴衣冠，谢了子云，又辞了众人。","en":"song — he said to Ziyun: \\"I had better return to the city.\\" Shanzhi cut in: \\"Gates will shut — if you go, hurry.\\" Young Master Hua had no choice — rose, dressed formal wear, thanked Ziyun and took leave of the company."},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":5,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"此时宝珠、琴言已卸装下来送客，华公子执着琴言的手道：「你这戏实在唱得好，可夸京城独步。歇一天你进府来，我还要细细请教。」说着便将身上一块汉玉双龙佩，扣着一个荷包扯下来，给了琴言，琴言请安谢了。华公子已走了两步，忽又回转来对着宝珠道：「你们两个真是棋逢敌手，难分高下。你是我度香兄心爱的，","en":"By now Baozhu and Qinyan had washed off greasepaint and came to see guests off. Young Master Hua clasped Qinyan's hand: \\"Your singing tops the capital — rest a day then visit my mansion — I have much to ask in detail.\\" From his waist he unclasped a Han jade paired-dragon pendant with purse and gave it to Qinyan — Qinyan bowed thanks. Young Master"},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"华公子进城不提。","en":"Young Master Hua's ride back to the city needs no further tale."},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":2,"tokens":["星北","华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这边十旦进来，子云命他们换了便衣，重换了一个大圆桌面，把残肴收去，另换几样来。文泽道：「今日星北可谓尽兴，我见他从没这样留恋的。」子云道：「他心上犹以为未足，我若认真留他，他就不去了。他那个林珊枝急得什么似的，尽对我做眼色，只怕还有些醋意。」仲雨道：「何消说得。林珊枝不是登春班出身吗，进去了不到三年，如今华公子的事，可以作得一半主呢。」子云命家","en":"Lin Shanzhi bred up in the Dengchun troupe? Not three years in the household, and already he can settle half of Young Master Hua's affairs.\\" Ziyun had the servants fetch sobering pills, dissolved them in hot water and shared them round; when all had taken them they strolled about a while and the wine was quite gone. Ziyun then had the table set out before the verandah, with only"},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":2,"tokens":["华公子","星北"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"的，自然是琴言，其次要算宝珠了。宝珠此时却颇欢喜，惟有琴言终是冷冷的。子云便问琴言道：「你今日又得了一个知己。华公子是难得赞人的，你一上来他就留心你，以后又独要你与瑶卿唱戏，他这眼力却也不低，一面之间，就赏识如此，你可感激他么？」琴言把子云看了一看，低着头不言语。文泽道：「玉侬今日亦不可无知己之感，星北之倾倒，亦不下庾香，你明日倒去见见他为是。」","en":"glowed inwardly; only Qinyan stayed cool as frost. Ziyun asked Qinyan: \\"Today you have gained another connoisseur. Young Master Hua praises hardly anyone, yet from the moment you came up he had his eye on you, and afterwards he would have none but you and Yaoqing sing. His discernment is no mean thing — on a single meeting to appreciate you so. Are you not grateful to him?\\" Qinyan"},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":2,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"次贤道：「我看华公子，倒是个怜香惜玉的人，外面传闻之言是不可信，今日这一天终是温温和和，并没有什么公子脾气。玉侬见人也不可一味太冷淡了。」琴言被众人讲得，似乎要他去亲近华公子的意思，便气忿忿的无处发泄，因想道：「别人说我也罢，就是度香不该。他既知我与庾香相好，今日又讲这","en":"Cixian said, \\"I see Young Master Hua as a man who truly cherishes fragrance and pities jade — the rumors outside are simply not to be believed. Throughout this whole day he has been mild and warm, without a trace of a spoiled young master's arrogance. Yunong — you really shouldn't remain"},{"paragraph":30,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"酒再来。」宝珠即拉了琴言到里边去了，劝他道：「你说话太直了，那位张二爷也不是好说话的人。」琴言尚是呜咽。宝珠把华公子所赏之物拿出来与他比了，却小一些儿。那边文泽是绝早过来，已坐了一日，酒已过量，也要回去歇息。这十旦伺候了一天，又唱了戏，也都困乏，走的亦都要先走。子云因天气尚热，自己也觉困倦，就撤了席，又吃了西瓜、莲藕，送了客出园，诸旦也各自回去。琴言这一句话，便生","en":"someone who takes things lightly, you must be careful.\\" Qinyan was still sobbing softly. Baozhu brought out the gift Young Master Hua had bestowed to compare, noting it was indeed a bit smaller. Meanwhile, Wenze, having arrived extremely early and sat for the entire day drinking past his limit, also wanted to return and rest. The ten performers had served all day and sung their plays,"}],"26":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":4,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说华公子进城到得府时，已上灯好一会。到上房坐了一坐，华夫人问了些怡园光景，华公子略说了些，便叫两个小丫鬟提了灯笼，走到星栊卧室来。只见灯光之下，照见那十婢，都着一色的白罗大绸衫子，头上挽了麻姑髻儿，后头仍拖着大辫子，当头插一球素馨花，下截是青罗镶花边裤，微露","en":"Word has it that by the time Young Master Hua returned to his city mansion, the evening lamps had long been lit. He rested briefly in the main hall while Lady Hua asked about the affairs at the Garden of Contentment. After sharing a few details, he summoned two young maids to carry lanterns and"},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":2,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"些丫鬟说笑。爱珠先进去。说：「珊枝来了！」公子即传上来，珊枝在窗前站着，见公子盘腿坐在醉翁床上，旁边站着四珠。华公子见了珊枝便道：「你去请魏师爷到留青精舍里来，我从这边过去有话说。」珊枝回道：「已定过更了，东园门早上了锁，就是三堂的总门也锁了，没有什么要紧话，请爷明早讲罢。况要开两三重门，从东园去请来，差不多就二更了，只怕师爷们也要安歇了。」林珊枝知道找魏聘才定是","en":"my face that makes you think I'm drunk.\\" Aizhu smiled again and led him slowly into the inner chambers, where the Young Master was chatting and laughing with the maids. Aizhu entered first to announce his arrival, and the Master called him forward. Standing by the window, Shanzhi saw the Young Master sitting cross-legged on a Drunken-Elder couch, flanked by four of the Pearls."},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"有起身，便挡住不叫进来。班子里的人来请安，号簿上是不挂的。就是那个琴言，从前他师傅也领他来过，不过没有进来。」华公子道：「那琴言是谁的徒弟？」珊枝道：「是长庆的徒弟。」公子道：「长庆，你的师傅也不是叫长庆吗？」珊枝答应：「是。奴才本在联锦班，后进登春的。」公子道：「为什么要进登春呢？」珊枝道：「那长庆的脾气不好，奴才伤触了他，他因把奴才挑换了登春的绣芳。绣芳出了师","en":"always arrive early on the first and fifteenth of the month,\\" Shanzhi explained. \\"But the gatekeepers, seeing the Master is not yet awake, turn them away. When actors come to pay their respects, their names are not even entered in the register. Even that boy Qinyan was once brought here by his master, though he never made it inside.\\" \\"Whose apprentice is Qinyan?\\" the Young"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":5,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"公子道：「你瞧这琴言怎样？」珊枝不言语。华公子又问了一遍，珊枝说道：「好是好的，也是徐二老爷钟爱的，听说外边不肯应酬。」华公子道：「徐二老爷钟爱的是袁宝珠，不爱他。」珊枝道：「听见徐二老爷爱他与袁宝珠差不多。又听得说，徐二老爷在他身上已花过好几千银子了。」华公子不语，少顷又说道：「前日我听得魏师","en":"\\"And what do you think of this Qinyan?\\" the Young Master asked. Shanzhi remained silent. When pressed again, he finally answered, \\"He is good enough, but he is also Second Master Xu's darling. Word has it he refuses to entertain anyone else.\\" \\"Second Master Xu favors Yuan Baozhu, not him,\\" the Young Master"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":4,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"珠一面打扇，一面看着公子与珊枝讲话，便心不在扇，一扇子扇脱了手，掉下地来，明珠嗤的一笑，掌珠红了脸，慌忙捡起。华公子倒笑了，道：「你们难道没有听过戏，听说到戏连心都没有了。歇天我就叫那一班人进来唱一天，请奶奶听，你们大家都托托福。」爱珠多嘴说道：「什么好班子？难道比咱们府里的还好吗？」华公子笑道：「你们也是十个，叫你们扮生，他们扮旦，合串一出，就知道人家的好处了。","en":"Zhangzhu, meanwhile, had been fanning the Master while listening to their conversation. Her mind wandered, and the fan slipped from her grasp, tumbling to the floor. Mingzhu let out a muffled giggle, and Zhangzhu, flushing deeply, hurriedly retrieved it. The Young Master laughed aloud. \\"Have you never"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":4,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"到了明早，华公子到底尚为酒困，身子有些疲软，早上就起得迟了。直到巳正方才起身，净了脸，丫鬟替他梳了发，穿好了衣裳。华夫人恐他酒后伤身，便叫小丫鬟送出一盏参汤，公子吃了。只见宝珠进来回道：「珊枝在外面请示爷，昨晚叫他去请魏师爷，今早要请不要请？」华公子略一踌躇道：「叫","en":"The following morning, still sluggish from the previous night's wine, Young Master Hua rose late. It was not until the hour of Si that he finally washed his face, allowed the maids to comb his hair, and dressed for the day. Lady Hua, concerned that the wine might have harmed his constitution, sent a maid with a bowl of medicinal ginseng"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"无比，单看时觉得很好，及种到牡丹台上，不是效颦邻女，就是婢学夫人，愈增羞涩之态。」华夫人听了甚是喜欢，所以任凭华公子怎样繁华奢侈，到绝不疑心有别样事来。即如十珠群婢，天天闹在一堆，也绝无妒忌。再如林珊枝、冯子佩等也不过形迹可疑，其实并无干涉，此也是各人情性，不比那奚十一等专讲究这些事情，不在色之好歹。","en":"Lady Hua had several times suggested taking Huazhu and Baozhu as concubines, but the Young Master always refused. \\"Once they become concubines, their charm will fade,\\" he would say. \\"It is better to let them serve for a few years and then arrange marriages with handsome youths—a truly meritorious deed. Furthermore, if you were plain-looking, I might"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":2,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"且说华公子在夫人房内吃过饭，谈谈笑笑已过了午正，却忘了魏聘才在留青精舍等他。却说林珊枝去请魏聘才，聘才已起身多时，将要吃饭，忽听得华公子请吃早饭，叫他到留青精舍去。聘才这一喜，倒像金殿传胪一样，疾忙穿了靴，换了一件新衣，拿把团扇，摇摇摆摆，也不及与张、顾二位说","en":"The Young Master ate with Lady Hua, and their laughter and conversation carried them past noon, completely forgetting that Wei Pincai was waiting at the Quiet-Green Retreat. When Lin Shanzhi came to summon him, Pincai had been awake for some time and was just about to"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":2,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"饿花了。」就同珊枝到一间屋子来。夏天是不用热的，荤荤素素菜都有，珊枝吃了，擦擦手，仍坐下与那些丫鬟顽笑，只不见华公子出来。看看已到未正，珊枝道：「这怎么好，到底出来不出来？叫人家等着。爱姐姐请你去说一声，说魏师爷还在留青精舍等着呢。」爱珠道：「我不会回，要回你自去回。」珊枝道：「好姐姐，我若进得去还求你？」又迟延了一回，爱珠故意刁难，倒是荷珠做好人进去了。半个时辰","en":"Lin Shanzhi waited outside the Crimson Wash Pavilion, chatting with the Ten Pearls, unable to ascend and disturb the Master. Zengzhu said, \\"Earlier, I heard the Master dining with Madame upstairs. Their conversation was quite lively, so he is unlikely to emerge anytime soon.\\" Shanzhi sighed, \\"What is to be done? Secretary Wei has been summoned since dawn and has waited over"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":6,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"适见荷珠来问，华公子想起早上之约，已经迟了，只好吃晚饭的了，便就从侧边一个角门走出去，却只与留青精舍隔一个院子。 　　珊枝疾忙先去照应了，聘才连忙走出到窗前，华公子已到，聘才便请了一个安。华公子一手拉住说道：「本约足下早上过来谈谈，不料我昨日多吃了酒，今日起来又睡着了，","en":"Seeing Hezhu inquire, the Young Master suddenly recalled his morning appointment. Realizing it was already late, and that he could only offer supper now, he slipped through a side gate that opened directly onto the courtyard of the Quiet-Green Retreat, only one courtyard away. Shanzhi hurried"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"府里，自然会改变的。无论其改变不改变，既进了府，此生就不要想见庾香的面了。」再又想道：「琴言这等古怪脾气，此刻华公子是不知道，若长久了，是必定厌恶的。让我弄他进来，叫他受两年苦，方可以出我之气。」主意定了，便又说道：「公子何不就将宝珠、琴言买了进来？配上府里这八个，也成十个了，不是就比外边的班子好么？」","en":"\\"I lavished great effort in buying those eight, intending to form a troupe that would eclipse all outsiders,\\" the Young Master lamented. \\"Who would have guessed that outsiders would eclipse us instead? Have you seen their acting?\\" Catching his drift, Pincai flattered him further. \\"I have seen them. Eclipsing outsiders is not difficult; fine flowers need not crowd a garden. Simply"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":4,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"华公子道：「我闻得这两个都是度香所爱，不好去夺他。」聘才道：「度香所爱的是宝珠，琴言不是真喜欢的。公子若当真喜欢他，晚生倒认识，而且常照顾他。他的师傅叫长庆，最爱的是钱，听得公子要，必十分巴结，送上门来的。」华公子倒踌躇不定，心上总碍着徐子云，又因琴言进来","en":"\\"I hear both are Duxiang's favorites; it would be hard to wrest them away,\\" the Young Master replied. \\"Duxiang truly cherishes Baozhu, not Qinyan,\\" Pincai countered. \\"If the Master desires him, I can assure you it is possible. I know his master, Changqing, quite well, and often patronize his troupe. Changqing loves silver above all else. If"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"茂林就搭了聘才的车到长庆处来。劈面遇见了张仲雨，两边停了车，茂林让过一边，等聘才出来说话。仲雨问起聘才，聘才把华公子托他之事说了。仲雨道：「怪不得他前天如此高兴，总赏了一百多金子，又将自己的玉佩，给了琴言、宝珠。」","en":"yielded the right of way as Pincai stepped out to speak. When Zhongyu asked about their errand, Pincai explained the Young Master's commission. \\"No wonder he was so generous the other day,\\" Zhongyu said. \\"He bestowed over a hundred gold pieces and even gave his own jade pendants to Qinyan and Baozhu.\\""},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"句话要商量。」长庆听了，登时满面添花的趋奉起来，师老爷长，师老爷短，看聘才是个聪明伶俐人，便极意应酬，说道：「华公子待我最有恩的，况且我有两个徒弟在府里，公子的恩典真是天高地厚，说不尽的。」吃了杯茶，又说些话，长庆便把烟灯开了出来，请聘才、茂林躺躺。茂林道：「我是不吃的，倒是你陪着魏师老爷躺躺罢，而且说话便当。」聘才道：「我也是初学不会烧。」长庆便烧了一口上好了，","en":"person of no consequence, greeting him coolly. Maolin interjected, \\"This is Secretary Wei, the closest confidant of Young Master Hua. Hearing of your fame, he has come especially to discuss a matter of business.\\" Changqing instantly bloomed with obsequious warmth, calling him \\"Secretary this\\" and \\"Secretary that.\\" Recognizing Pincai's cleverness, he eagerly courted him. \\"Young Master"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":4,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"做衣服。一月内陪了三五天酒，还要生出事来。」聘才正要回言，叶茂林笑迷迷，拈着胡子讲道：「老庆，事情是好商量的。华公子行事，难道你不知道？人家要巴结进去也难，他来找你，就是你的造化，如中了意，不要说你一辈子，就两辈子也不难。将来你也可进府，巴结个执事，赏个十几品的官衔，好不体面，不强如吃这戏饭么？」聘才道：「喳！叶先生的话讲得痛快。你想见一面就赏这许多金子，若认真要","en":"strings of cash—everyone knows this. Qinyan surpasses Xiufang many times over. Secretary, I beg you to plead with the Young Master. He is my only fine disciple, my lifelong reliance. The other boys are worthless; they only cost me money for costumes, attend a few wine banquets a month, and constantly cause trouble...\\" Pincai was about to reply when Ye Maolin stroked his beard and"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"手，头也不回，上车去了。长庆要送也来不及，只得邀了茂林，再进屋子。茂林道：「他一怒去了，你有话可以对我直讲。这华公子是得罪不得的，魏师爷进府，一路混说，必要闹出事来，那时怎么好呢？」长庆道：「并不是我不知进退，实在我这棵摇钱树，舍不得他，我也要问问他愿不愿，歇两天再给你信。求你先替我说两句好话，回复他，成不成再说罢。」叶茂林听得口风不甚松动，也只好上车去了。辞了出","en":"escort him, Changqing dragged Maolin back inside. \\"He left in wrath,\\" Maolin warned. \\"Speak plainly! Offending Young Master Hua is ill-advised. When Wei returns with gossip, a storm will brew. What will you do then?\\" \\"I am not dull,\\" Changqing replied. \\"But he is my cash tree; I cannot bear it. I must also ask whether he is willing. Give me two days and I will send you word."}],"27":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"。聘才没有别法，找了张仲雨一次，也没有见着。打算仍叫赶车的及三小等去闹，但要耽搁几天才好，不然恐被他们看出来。华公子是一时高兴，况且他的声色，享用不尽，自然也不专于一人身上。","en":"another disturbance, only waiting a few days so that the people at Changqing's would not see the design too plainly. Young Master Hua's favor had been a passing enthusiasm; with such a multitude of voices, faces, and pleasures at his command, he was not likely to remain devoted to one person alone."},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":3,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"得有四十几个庄头，一年论租，就抵得一府分的钱漕，自然也算个极豪富的人家了。」亮轩点点头：「我们东家也常提起，说华公子是他的世叔，华公爷是我老东家提台老大人的老师。有这么一个好世交，我们东家竟不拉拢。小弟是常劝他去走走。东家说，这是从前在军营保举的老师，那时华公子还小，说起来也未必知道，所以不肯去。就是现在那位徐中堂，做两广总督的，也是老师在军营同拜的，如今只有二少","en":"prefecture's grain tax. They are rich enough, certainly.\\" Liangxuan nodded. \\"My patron often speaks of it — that Young Master Hua is an uncle of his own generation, and that the old Duke Hua was the teacher of my former patron, the Provincial Military Commander. With a family connection as good as that, and yet my patron will not cultivate it. I am forever urging him to call. He"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"言自那日从怡园回后，直到今日总是啼哭，自己也不晓得为着什么，一味的悲苦，倒像有什么大事的，心中七上八下：一来为华公子赏识了他，将来必叫他进府唱戏，那时府里多少人，怎生应酬得来；二来每逢热闹之场独独不见庾香，故此越想越觉伤心，倒不料得聘才即来，说要买他。","en":"Qinyan had wept daily, himself unsure why, feeling only grief, as if calamity loomed. His mind was roiling: first, Young Master Hua favored him and was soon summoning him to the mansion—how would he navigate that crowd? Second, at every lively scene Yuxiang was absent, so his sorrow deepened. He had never expected Pincai would come wanting to buy him."},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":2,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"了。若叫他当场压下我来，又叫我没脸，所以我不得不用心，偏又惹出这件事来。岂不是始终是瑶卿害的？」素兰道：「我看华公子这个人，倒也没有什么不好，我也没有见他糟蹋过人。你若心上没有牵挂的事，倒可以去混几年，或者倒有些好处，也不可知。就是不能会见庾香的苦了。」琴言道：「就算华公子是个好人，难道魏聘才就不教坏他么？」","en":"putting my whole heart into it. This sparked everything. It is always Yaoqing's fault.\\" Sulan countered, \\"I've seen Young Master Hua; he harbors no cruelty. I've never seen him ruin actors. If there are no worries in your heart, a few years there might bring profit; it is only missing Yuxiang that hurts you.\\" Qinyan replied, \\"Even if Hua is good, won't Wei Pincai corrupt him?\\""},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"磨；一心在内，如道士炼丹，你受得受不得？那时只怕真要死了，这是四层。你若进去了，或者仍可出来，也不定的。我听得华公子，最喜成人之美。若打听你们两人，有这样至死不变的交情，倒因此成全作合起来也不可知。即或不然，你歇几天，也可告个假出来，到我这里，去请庾香来会一会，倒可无拘束。你心上若当他与奚十一、潘三一流人，我可以替他出结：断不至此。依我这么想，是进去的为妙。」","en":"alchemy; bearing that is true death. That is four. If you enter the mansion, there may be a way out. I've heard the Young Master loves uniting devoted lovers. If he learns of your deathless bond, he might unite you, or on rest days, you could leave, visit me, and call Yuxiang freely. And if in your heart you take him for one of the Xi Eleven or Pan the Third sort, I will go bail"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":2,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"压他一压，且看怎样。便满面堆着笑道：「不瞒大老爷说，我们班里近日串了几出新戏，前在怡园演了一个月，才上台。前日华公子即在徐老爷处见了，就把他们叫了进府，唱了两天了，还要三天才得唱完。琴言的戏又多，华公子又喜欢他。若是别处，就可以叫回来，惟有这个府里，小的们是不敢去的。大老爷或与公子有交情，倒可以打发管家拿个贴子，去要了出来。如果合老爷的意，就将他留着使唤都使得。小","en":"said: \\"In truth, our troupe lately staged new plays. After a month at the Garden, they just opened. The other day, Young Master Hua saw them at Lord Xu's and summoned them to the mansion. They have sung for two days, with three days remaining. Qinyan's roles are many, and the Young Master favors him. Anywhere else we would recall him, but for that mansion, we small folk dare not"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"然真不在家，也就罢了。不是我自己夸口，大概通京城相公，也没有一个不晓得我的。你若懂窍，过两天领他来见见我。就是华公子，我们也是世交，你对他说，是我叫他，他也不好意思不放回的。」说罢，便解开了两个扣子。长庆替他脱了衫子，折好了，交与春兰，即请他到吃烟去处，亮轩也随了进去。","en":"boast lightly; every actor in the capital knows me. If you can read cues, bring him to call in a few days. Even Young Master Hua and I are family friends; you tell him I summoned him, and he cannot refuse to give face.\\" He undid two buttons. Changqing peeled off his jacket, folded it, handed it to Chunlan, and ushered him into the smoking room; Liangxuan followed."},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子不懂规矩，有伺候不到之处，叫他权且进来，伺候两月看看，好不好再说。譬如有事，你原可以去请个假，叫他出来几天。华公子见他不能出来唱戏，自然必有赏赐，那时你就有财有势，闲人也不敢上门了。进去后，即或不合使唤，仍旧打发出来，可不原是一样？你若先要身价，且争多嫌少恼了他，也是不好的。进去了，死死活活都是他府里的人了。」话未说完，素兰先就拍手叫妙，又道：「好主意，曹老板你","en":"frightened, while Qinyan only wept. Lanbao offered, \\"I have a sound plan, if Yunong agrees. Tomorrow, deliver him to Young Master Hua's. If they offer a ransom, refuse. Say the boy might breach etiquette, so let him serve on trial for two months, then judge. If there is trouble, request leave and bring him out on days off. When the Young Master sees him not on stage, he must reward"}],"28":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":2,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"赔礼，且说一钱不要，便甚得意，只道他一怒之后，使他愧悔送上门来，应了前日所说的话，便找了珊枝，请公子出来说了，华公子道：「为何不要身价呢？」聘才说：「他的意思恐怕孩子不懂规矩，二来如有错处，公子厌了，他仍可以领了出去，所以他不敢领价。」公子点了点头道：「这也使得，明日进来就是了。但既进了我的府，无论领价不领价，外面是不准陪酒唱戏的。」聘才道：「这个自然，长庆能有几","en":"had no choice but to beseech Ye Maolin once more, and together they made their way to Secretary Wei's study in the Young Master Hua mansion. There they offered thorns on their bare backs to beg pardon, pledging to hand the boy over immediately without taking a single string of cash. Seeing him so meek and compliant, and refusing all purchase money, Pincai swelled with triumph."},{"paragraph":2,"mentions":2,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一回，心中甚喜，即拨在留青精舍伺候。又领他到华夫人处叩见，华夫人见他弱质婷婷，毫无优伶习气，也说了个「好」字，华公子是更不必说。琴言心上总是惦记子玉，也只好暗中洒泪，背地长吁。过了几天，见华公子脾气是正正经经的，没有什么歪缠之处，便也略觉放心。惟见了魏聘才，只是息夫人不言的光景，聘才也无可奈何，就要用计收拾他，此时也断乎不能。","en":"The next morning, Changqing delivered Qinyan to the Hua mansion. The Young Master scrutinized him again in fine detail, found himself exceedingly pleased, and assigned him to attend to them at the Quiet-Green Retreat. Qinyan was also led in to kowtow before Lady Hua. Observing his frail, graceful form and noting the complete absence"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":2,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"其中的深情，他们必知，伯母何不问问他们。」颜夫人道：「此时那个琴言呢？」聘才道：「琴言前在怡园学了什么新戏，为华公子赏识了。」说到此处，又半站起来说：「小侄受老伯与老伯母的厚恩，实在感激不尽，知道世兄是为这个小旦害成了这一场大病，荒废诗书，糟蹋身子，所以倒设法怂慂华公子买他。不料事有凑巧，有个姓奚的，为琴言在那里闹起来，要收拾他们。琴言的师傅害怕，不得主意，小侄因","en":"demanded, \\"Where is Qinyan now?\\" Pincai replied, \\"Qinyan was studying new plays at the Garden of Contentment, and Young Master Hua favored him—\\" He half-rose from his seat. \\"This nephew owes you and the lord deep kindness. Knowing elder brother's illness stemmed from that actor—wasting his studies and ruining his health—I urged Young Master Hua to purchase him. Unexpectedly, a Mr."},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"是日无话，好容易盼到天明，恰好又天从人愿，华公子身子不爽快，在夫人房里不出来。琴言便更放了心，忙忙的吃了饭，来找珊枝，说：「怎样出去？我是不认得路径。」珊枝道：「你同魏师爷出去，他们就不好问什么；就使他们有话，也传不到里头去。」琴言只得折口气来找聘才，聘才见了心中甚喜，脸上却装了冷冷的说：「你去只","en":"The day passed without incident. Finally, dawn broke, and heaven itself seemed to smile upon their endeavor. The Young Master felt unwell and remained in Lady Hua's quarters, not emerging. Tremendously relieved, Qinyan quickly ate his meal and sought out Shanzhi. \\"How do I get out? I don't know the way.\\" Shanzhi instructed, \\"Go with Secretary Wei. The gatekeepers won't ask"}],"29":[{"paragraph":8,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"尝看不破呢？若看不破时，就是独活的反面了，幸而看的破，尚有今日。」说着又哈哈的笑起来。琴言道：「我在华府很好，华公子那人也是极正经的，且府中上上下下都待我极好，你很不必惦念。」子玉笑道：「你真好么？」琴言道：「真好，你不信问魏师爷。」子玉道：「真好就好了，问他作什么？」便又笑了。琴言道：「只要你的病好得快，我便更好。你若好得慢，我也就不甚好了。你若一分病没有，我便","en":"otherwise, there would be no today.\\" He laughed once more. Qinyan continued, \\"I am doing very well at the Hua estate. Young Master Hua is a very proper gentleman, and everyone, high and low, treats me kindly. You need not fret over me.\\" Ziyu asked, searching his eyes, \\"Are you truly well?\\" Qinyan nodded, \\"Truly. You may ask Wei.\\" Ziyu smiled warmly, \\"If it is good, then it is good."},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"比唱戏到底好多了。我前日只道与你永无见面之期，不料今日如此快叙，我心中此刻百忧尽去，毫无不足。只惜我没会见过这华公子，不然，我也可以来会会你，既是魏师爷同你出来」，说到此，便问琴言道：「聘才同你到什么地方？」琴言道：「先前他也进来，叫了你好几声，扶你起来坐的，你没有留心。此时想在上房同太太说话。」子玉即低低的说道：「从前的嫌隙，也不必记他了，以后倒和好些为是。今日","en":"never meet again, yet today came so swiftly, and all my worries are gone. My only shame is that I have never met Young Master Hua, or I might have been able to visit you myself. Did Wei go with you?\\" He asked where Pincai was. Qinyan replied, \\"He came in, called out to you, and helped you sit up, but you must have missed him. He is in the upper halls with Madame now.\\" Ziyu said"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":4,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，把琴言叫出来，说了有一个多时辰的话，子玉方才放心而去。华府中人多嘴杂，且各存一心，过了几日，就有人将此事传到华公子耳中。华公子听了着实有气，便叫珊枝上来问了一遍，珊枝替辩了几句，华公子也说了他几句，以后不准琴言出门，将他派往洗红居，交与十珠婢看管，不与外人通问，便与拘禁牢笼一般。幸亏十珠婢都是多情爱好的，倒着实照应他。若是别人在此，也是求之不得的。这琴官一来年纪","en":"wagging tongues, each harboring its own secret agenda. After a few days, someone carried the tale directly to Young Master Hua. The Young Master grew absolutely furious. He summoned Shanzhi at once. Shanzhi pled desperately on Qinyan's behalf, but was fiercely scolded for his efforts. As a direct consequence, Young Master Hua barred Qinyan from ever going out again. He confined"}],"30":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说琴言从子玉处回来，华公子虽未知其细底，但责其私行出府，殊属不知规矩，姑念初犯，权且免责，把他拨在内室，这是里外不通的所在。一日，独坐在水晶山畔，对着几丛凤仙花垂泪，心中想到人生在世，不能立身扬名，作些事业，仅与那些皮相平人混在一堆，光阴易过，则与草木同朽。即如草木开了花，人","en":"Of Qinyan's return from Ziyu's, the Young Master Hua knew no particulars, yet blamed him for leaving the mansion without permission, a serious breach of discipline. Thinking it a first offense, he waived punishment for the moment and reassigned him to the inner chambers—a secluded place isolated from"},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"此日是八月十二，华公子想起六月二十一日在怡园观剧，说秋凉了请度香过来。因想十五日是家宴之辰，不便请客，即定于十四日，请子云、次贤、文泽等，在西园中铺设了几处，并有灯戏。为他们是城外人，日间断不能尽兴，于下贴时说明了夜宴。此日正是秋试二场，刘文泽为什么不应举呢？这一科大主考","en":"Today was the twelfth of the eighth month. Young Master Hua remembered the play at the Garden of Contentment on the twenty-first of the sixth month, when he had said he would invite Duxiang over once the autumn air cooled. Thinking that the fifteenth would be a family banquet and inconvenient for guests, he set"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":3,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"且说十四日早，子云与次贤商议道：「今日华公子请我作通宵之饮，且闻赏灯，他今日必有一番热闹局面，并闻五大名班合唱。」即传家人分派跟班，检点衣服什物，零星珍宝赏需等类。总管预备好了，交与家人点过，免得临时短少。说着已到未初，当下二人早吃了早饭，穿了衣裳，上车一径往华府来。 　　且说华公子亲自往各处","en":"On the morning of the fourteenth, Ziyun discussed with Cixian: \\"Today Young Master Hua has invited us for an all-night feast and to view lanterns. There must be quite a lively scene today, and I heard five famous troupes will perform together.\\" He then ordered his servants to assign attendants, check clothes and belongings, and prepare"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"却说华公子宴客，今日共有三处：日间在恩庆堂设宴观戏。","en":"As for Young Master Hua's banquet today, it was held in three places: during the day, a banquet and theatrical performance in the Enqing Hall."},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":4,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"酉戌二时，在西园小平山观杂技。夜间在留青精舍演灯戏。华公子已冠带出来，先在恩庆堂前候客。却好萧、徐、刘三客约会了同来，进了大门，下了车，里头另换肩舆抬进，直进了垂花门，到大厅下轿。华公子出迎叙礼。即开了中门，宾主四人，慢慢的走进来，又走了两进，才是恩庆堂。萧次贤是初次登堂，便留心观望。这恩庆堂极为壮丽，崇轮","en":"Xiaoping Mountain in the West Garden. Later that night, a lantern play would be staged at the Quiet-Green Retreat. Young Master Hua had already come out fully dressed and was waiting for the guests in front of the Enqing Hall. Right then, Xiao, Xu, and Liu arrived together. They entered the main gate, got out of their carriages, changed into sedan chairs inside, and went straight"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":4,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"花大会》，有幽闲的，有妖冶的，有静婉的，有风流的，极尽靡艳之致，众人尽皆喝采。子云、次贤等就于此出中间放了赏。华公子对着笑道：「此系抄袭吾兄旧文，殊觉数见不鲜。」子云道：「唱的甚好，贞静的却极贞静，放浪的却极放浪，没有一人雷同。」文泽道：「这出戏我倒没有见他们唱过。」次贤道：「如今秦淮河也冷落了。就是从前马湘兰的相貌，也只中等，并有金莲不称之说。」子云道：「湘兰小","en":"charm. Everyone applauded. Ziyun, Cixian, and the others gave rewards right in the middle of the performance. Young Master Hua smiled and said, \\"This is cribbed from your own old programme, elder brother — one sees it rather too often.\\" Ziyun said, \\"They sang very well. The demure ones were extremely demure, and the wild ones were extremely wild; no two were alike.\\" Wenze added,"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":7,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，天天的焚香祷告，湘帆就文章不佳，也是必要中的。」蕙芳笑道：「谁说的？中举可以祷告得来，我倒愿替众人祷告了。」华公子问道：「你们说的什么？」子云正要回言，蕙芳忙斟了一杯酒来劝子云，子云被他缠住，却不能说。华公子呆呆的看着蕙芳，等着子云说来，文泽见了便道：「待我说罢。」蕙芳对着文泽丢了个眼色，这边张仲雨笑道：「媚香，今日人多嘴杂，你就要掩人的口，也掩不住这许多。」蕙","en":"Huifang smiled, \\"Who said that? If passing exams could be achieved by praying, I'd be willing to pray for everyone.\\" Young Master Hua asked, \\"What are you talking about?\\" Ziyun was about to answer, but Huifang hurriedly poured Ziyun a cup of wine and kept urging him to drink, giving him no chance to answer. Young Master Hua stared blankly at Huifang, waiting for Ziyun to explain. Seeing"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":2,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"」仲雨忽然笑道：「你事急，就借着人作护身符，如今你又忘恩负义了。」说得众人不解，蕙芳怔了一怔，脸上不觉红起来。华公子看了，想起前日的话，动了些怜念，料有些隐情不好讲，慢慢的问度香罢了，便倒把别的话支开。当下谈笑间，饮了许多酒，戏唱过了好几出，吃过了两道点心。华公子起身道：「请到园中散散罢。」次贤、子云道：「甚好，本来酒已多了。」诸客一同起身，就有四五个家人，急忙从","en":"are being ungrateful.\\" This puzzled everyone. Huifang paused for a moment, his face unwittingly flushing red. Young Master Hua saw this and, recalling what was said a few days ago, felt a bit of pity. He guessed there was some hidden matter that was hard to speak of. He decided to ask Duxiang about it later, at his leisure, and changed the subject. Amidst the chatting and laughing,"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"却说东西两园，在正厅两旁，处处有门户通入。当下华公子引着众人，即从游廊内绕过了几处庭院，又到一个回廊，见壁间嵌着一块祝枝山草书木刻，约有六尺多高。众人正待看时，只见一个跟班的走来一推，却是一扇门作成的，当面便是绿阴满目，水声潺潺。大家推让进园，走过红桥，是一个青石台，三面也有白石短阑，支了一个小绿绸幔","en":"The East and West Gardens flanked the main hall, with doorways connecting them everywhere. Young Master Hua led the group through the covered walkways, bypassing several courtyards until they reached a winding corridor. There, inset into the wall, was a woodblock carving of Zhu Zhishan's cursive script, over six chi tall. Just as everyone was about to admire"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":2,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云等欲要坐下，华公子让到里面去，从屏后走进，便见一个所在，里窄外宽，三面如扇面。绮窗雕槅，中间用乌木、象牙、紫檀、黄杨作成极细的花样。此中隔作五六处，前面不用帘子，是一带碧纱栊。众人到阁前看时，底下是一道清溪，有两个小画舫泊着。对面也是水阁，却通垂了湘帘。华公子就命在碧","en":"Ziyun and the others were about to sit down, but Young Master Hua ushered them further inside. Walking behind a screen, they found a space that was narrow on the inside and wide on the outside, shaped like a fan on three sides. The beautiful windows were carved, with the centerpieces made of ebony, ivory, red sandalwood,"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":3,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"当下众人清谈了好一回。已是申正时候，华公子便命摆了几个果碟，几样小吃，小酌起来，又叫了群旦进来伺候。对面水阁上却安放了一班十锦杂耍，便上起场来，说了好些笑话，作了一回像声，又说了一回《龙图公案》。次贤等不甚喜听，便与群旦猜枚行令，彼此传觞。华公子又叫了一档变戏法儿的，耍了一回。堪堪月色将上，","en":"The group chatted leisurely for a long time. It was already around four in the afternoon. Young Master Hua ordered several fruit plates and snacks to be served, and they began to drink lightly. He also called the group of Dan actors in to attend to them. On the opposite water pavilion, a troupe of ten-variety acrobats began their performance, telling jokes,"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":4,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"华公子怔了一怔，道：「好，就请进来，却无生客在此。」聘才道：「缘何三更半夜的才来？」华公子道：「想必关在城里，无歇处了。」候了好一回，才听得脚步声，两盏小明角灯引路，冯子佩抢步上前，与华公子见了礼，又与众人相见了，却也都为熟识。华公子即令其坐在聘才之上，将","en":"Young Master Hua was slightly taken aback and said, \\"Alright, invite him in; there are no strangers here anyway.\\" Pincai asked, \\"Why is he arriving in the middle of the night?\\" Young Master Hua said, \\"He must have been locked inside the city with nowhere to stay.\\" They"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":2,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"华公子见他光景饿了，便问道：「你今日在何处？怎么这时候才来？」子佩摇摇头道：「不要说起。」才又吃了一块苹果，接着说道：「绝好一局，弄得不欢而散。」说到此，却又懒说下去，华公子道：「为何不欢而散？你且说来。」子佩道：「今日和我妻舅归自荣，同到他的妻舅乌大傻家","en":"Seeing that he seemed hungry, Young Master Hua asked, \\"Where were you today? Why are you so late?\\" Zipei shook his head, \\"Don't mention it.\\" He ate a piece of apple and continued, \\"It was a perfectly good gathering, but it ended in unhappiness.\\" Having said this, he seemed reluctant to continue."},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子佩道：「他们爱串戏罢了，偏又拉上我。」华公子道：「不错，你的戏是唱得最好的，我看比他们还强些。今日串的是什么呢？」子佩道：「和别人串也好，偏偏大傻子死缠住了，要与他唱《活捉》。本来戏名就不吉利，大傻生得又呆又笨，种种不在行，难以尽述，看的人也不住的笑。正到进场的时候，我将帕子套住了他，忽然走进","en":"Zipei said, \\"They just love acting, but they insisted on dragging me into it.\\" Young Master Hua said, \\"That's true, you are the best at singing; I think you're even better than them. What did you perform today?\\" Zipei replied, \\"Singing with anyone else would have been fine, but that idiot Dasha pestered me to death and insisted on singing 'Capturing"},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":4,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"笑道：「他也是我们浙江人，我看他书倒像念过的。」张仲雨道：「也不见得，我虽不懂文理，我见他那字就不成个样子。」华公子道：「别讲这些人，管他傻不傻。子佩你会唱戏，你何不上台唱一出，显显本领；况且多少赏鉴家都在此，或者巴结的上，于你有点好处。」子佩啐了一口道：「我又不是相公，要巴结谁？」徐子云道：「谁又当你是相公？就是顾曲登场，也是风流自赏的事。况你具此美貌，不教人赞","en":"Zhang Zhongyu said, \\"Not necessarily. Although I don't understand literature much, his handwriting is a disgrace.\\" Young Master Hua said, \\"Stop talking about these people, who cares if he's foolish or not. Zipei, you know how to sing; why don't you get on stage and perform a piece to show off your skills? Besides, there are many connoisseurs here; if you impress them, it might be"},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":2,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"」子佩道：「我会的是：《前诱》、《后诱》、《反诳》、《挑帘》、《裁衣》等戏。」聘才笑道：「也不对，竟唱不来。」华公子身子后边，站着几个八龄班内的，有一个对林珊枝低低说道：「魏师爷何不唱《活捉》，前日不是见他唱过的？」华公子早已听见，便向聘才道：「你何不同他唱《活捉》呢？」聘才尚要支吾，经不得众人齐声参赞，聘才只得依了。子佩笑道：「唱便唱，不要又闹出刑部的案来，将魏","en":"the Curtain', and 'Cutting Cloth'.\\" Pincai laughed, \\"That's not right either; we simply can't perform.\\" Behind Young Master Hua stood a few boys from the Eight-Ages Troupe. One whispered to Lin Shanzhi, \\"Why doesn't Master Wei sing 'Capturing Alive'? Didn't we see him sing it the other day?\\" Young Master Hua had already heard this and said to Pincai, \\"Why don't you sing 'Capturing"},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":2,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"众人甚觉骇异，如不认识一般。华公子已离席，走到台前，众客亦皆站起静看。华公子道：「奇怪！居然像个好妇人，今日倒要压倒群英了。」子佩听得众人赞他，略有一分羞涩；又见徐子云身旁站着蕙芳、宝珠，见蕙芳看看他，便凑着子云讲些话，又凑着宝珠讲些话；又见宝珠微笑；又见刘文泽与萧次贤站着，在一处彼","en":"Everyone was astonished, as if they didn't recognize him. Young Master Hua left his seat and walked to the front of the stage, and the guests all stood up to watch quietly. Young Master Hua said, \\"Strange! He really does look like a beautiful woman; today he's going to outshine all the beauties.\\" Hearing the praise, Zipei felt"},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":2,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"华公子是不喜与闻这些事情，故不理会，只顾看子佩出神，忽叫斟大杯酒来。家人捧上一个大玉杯，华公子叫送到子云面前。未知子云饮与不饮，且听下回分解。","en":"Young Master Hua disliked hearing about these matters, so he ignored them and simply gazed spellbound at Zipei. Suddenly, he called for a large cup of wine. A servant brought a large jade goblet, and Young Master Hua told him to present it to Ziyun. Whether Ziyun drinks"}],"31":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说华公子看到得意处，把酒来敬子云诸人，合席只得满饮了一杯，共赞聘才、子佩作得出神入妙，非寻常戏脚所能。","en":"Young Master Hua, watching the performance with sheer delight, raised his wine cup to toast Ziyun and the rest of the company. The entire table had no choice but to drain their cups in unison, collectively praising Pincai and Zipei for an acting performance so divine"},{"paragraph":2,"mentions":3,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"评你，你这般瞎挑眼？我与静宜先生说闲话。」次贤道：「真是讲闲话。况且你唱得如此绝妙，赞不住口，尚何评论之有？」华公子笑道：「我听得他们说，你倒真像个阎婆惜。你若化了女身，也是个不安本分的。」子佩道：「好吗！你们逼我上台，又要取笑我。」徐子云问聘才道：「魏兄这音律实在精妙，将来尚要请教，如闲时可到敝园走走。」聘才连连答应道：「晚生是无师传授，都是听会的，就是上台也是","en":"Furthermore, you sang so superbly that we could not stop praising you; what room could there possibly be for criticism?\\" Young Master Hua laughed, \\"From what I heard them say, you truly resembled Yan Poxi on stage. If you had been born into a woman's body, you would certainly be a restless one.\\" Zipei retorted, \\"Well, isn't this fine! You force me onto the stage, and then you make a laughingstock"},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":2,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"华公子又叫诸旦上来，不用衣帽，俱穿随身便服，都令序齿坐在一边，便道：「我知你们于戏曲之外，各有一长，或是诗词，或是书画，或是丝竹等技。今日与前次俱以戏酒耽搁，不能使你们一试所长。此刻尚早，会诗的，不妨吟几句；会画的，不妨画几笔，不必谦让。」诸旦默默无言，子","en":"Young Master Hua summoned the dans once again. Without their stage robes or hats, and dressed entirely in their everyday attire, he had them sit in a row according to their age. He then said, \\"I know that beyond the operatic arts, each of you possesses your own unique"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"洞箫倒吹得和平。华公子摇摇头道：「琴声不佳，箫声倒好。」子云道：「琴本难学，也还亏他。」次贤道：「想你不长弹，生疏了。」琴言道：「有半年不学了，方才第四段第三句几乎想不出来。瘦香的箫，比从前更好了。」漱芳道：「我是向老师课学。静宜先生隔三日必教我一吹，所以不生。」琴言默然","en":"The melody of the xiao, however, flowed with a gentle and peaceful grace. Young Master Hua shook his head and commented, \\"The sound of the qin is poor, but the xiao is quite lovely.\\" Ziyun interjected, \\"The qin is inherently difficult to master; we must still give him credit.\\" Cixian added, \\"I imagine you have not practiced in a long time,"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":6,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"不到半个时辰，已经画完，成了二尺余长一个小横幅。华公子与子云等走近来，赞不绝口。华公子看了甚是欢喜，大赞道：「却实在亏他，怎么能够如此。无怪乎近来个个说他们的才貌，正是羞死从前那一班爱钱的相公了。」次贤又替他略略的润色了几处，竟成一幅好画。华公子即问蕙芳道：「你们题的想是有了？」蕙芳道：「有是有了，只是","en":"In less than an hour, the painting was complete—a small, horizontal scroll spanning just over two feet. Young Master Hua, Ziyun, and the rest gathered around, their praise unceasing. Young Master Hua was absolutely delighted, praising him loudly: \\"It is truly a marvel that he could achieve such a feat. It is no wonder that lately everyone speaks so highly of their talent"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":2,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"线，自己捏着这一头，叫书童捏着那一头，一朵一朵的堆在线上，顷刻结成了一个大花球。手中轻轻的抛了几抛，走过来挂在华公子衣襟上。华公子取下闻了一闻，笑道：「你辛辛苦苦的结成，你自己受用罢。」子佩接了，又到那边弄琵琶去了。素兰、玉林也都写出来。先看素兰的是：满泛金樽玉液浓，秋光和霭似春容。\\n嫦娥宫殿层层启，照澈珠帘十二重。","en":"formed a large, fragrant flower ball. Tossing it lightly in his hands a few times, he walked over and hung it upon Young Master Hua's lapel. The Young Master plucked it off, inhaled its sweet scent, and laughed, \\"You went through such painstaking effort to string this together; you should enjoy it yourself.\\" Zipei took it back and wandered off to fiddle with a pipa. Sulan and Yulin"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"华公子一样赞好，道：「工力悉敌，竟是元、白同时了。」子云道：「也要改两字。第三句嫦娥二字，与前首相同，不若改作「广寒宫殿层层启」，不好么？」素兰道：「果然改得好。」始而子云恐素兰不及蕙芳，及到此刻才放了心。再看玉林的填词，填的《一痕沙》小令，看词是：娇舞酣","en":"Young Master Hua offered the same high praise, saying, \\"Their craftsmanship is equally matched; it is as if the great poets Yuan Zhen and Bai Juyi have appeared in the same age.\\" Ziyun added, \\"I would also suggest changing two characters. The 'Chang'e' in the third line"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":2,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"莫听晓鸡鸣，乱啼声。看者都是满面笑容，越发说好，道：「真是柔情香口，纸上如生，能不令人爱煞也。」华公子道：「实在极好，但我要换几字：「集群贤」换作「会群仙」，乱啼声「换作」只三更」，可好么？」众人一齐道：「好。」次贤叫他们快些写上，蕙芳、玉林都要素兰代写，华公子不依，只得各自写了。大家又赏叹一回，于是静坐，听珊枝的琵琶与春喜的笙。珊枝斜坐着拨动檀槽，","en":"flowing from a fragrant mouth; it comes alive on the paper. How could one not be completely captivated by it?\\" Young Master Hua said, \\"It is truly excellent, but I would like to swap a few characters: change 'Gather the worthies together' to 'Meet with the immortals,' and change 'chaotic, early cries' to 'it is only the third watch.' Does that sound agreeable?\\" The crowd voiced"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":6,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"吹弹过了，要桂保的诗谜来了。桂保道：「是人给我猜，还是我给人猜呢？」华公子道：「我给你猜。」随口念道：「碧纹浅笑起参差，今岁春来已较迟。\\n我道灞桥诗思少，不如赤壁夜游时。」桂保想了一想，笑道：「公子说的，是风花雪月四样，真作得好。」华公子道：「真心灵，一猜就着。」冯子佩道：「我说一个你猜：未用时千包万裹，到用时粉身碎骨。","en":"poetic riddles. Guibao asked, \\"Am I to present riddles for others to guess, or shall others present them for me?\\" Young Master Hua replied, \\"I will give you one to guess.\\" He then recited offhand:\\n\\n'Green ripples break into a shallow, uneven smile,\\nThis year, the spring has arrived somewhat late.\\nI say the poetic inspiration at Bashang bridge feels thin,\\nIt cannot compare to the"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":2,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云等又将零星玩物，分赏众旦毕，各人同散，华公子直送出穿堂方回。惟冯子佩困乏已甚，已在留青精舍榻上睡了，聘才也自归房，华公子吩咐书童好好伺候冯子佩，一面也进内室。","en":"others distributed assorted trinkets among the dans as rewards, and the guests all scattered their separate ways. Young Master Hua escorted them all the way out to the main vestibule before turning back. Only Feng Zipei, who was thoroughly exhausted, had already fallen fast asleep on a couch in the Quiet-Green Studio. Pincai also retired to his own room. Young Master Hua instructed"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"的词更为工妙。高品道：「强将之下自无弱兵。你们看佩仙这首词，外边那些头巾纱帽作得出来么？」子玉道：「果然。就是华公子这几个字也改得好。」又问了琴言几句，玉林、蕙芳也细细说了，子玉又发起怔来。忽然高品的小使进来请他，说有客要会。高品即忙出去，有好一刻工夫尚不进来。南湘道：「什么人这么长谈？」春航道：「近来卓然有些古怪，找他的不一而足，却非寻常往来，都是俗陋不堪的人。","en":"lyric, could those hack scholars in their square caps outside ever produce such work?\\" Ziyu agreed, \\"Indeed. Even Young Master Hua's edits were brilliantly done.\\" He then asked a few questions about Qinyan, and Yulin and Huifang recounted the details of his quiet departure. Upon hearing this, Ziyu fell into a frozen daze. Suddenly, Gao Pin's page boy entered to summon him, announcing"}],"33":[{"paragraph":6,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"还不是玉侬安身立命处。玉侬之志，岂肯长受委屈的？」子玉道：「我听得待他甚好，有甚委屈处？」宝珠道：「好原好，但华公子那人究竟不能十分体贴人的。度香这么样待玉侬，尚不能得玉侬欢心，那边能如度香这么样么？","en":"heard they treat him very well; what wrongs could he suffer?\\" Baozhu said, \\"Being treated well is one thing, but Young Master Hua is not entirely considerate. Even Duxiang's treatment couldn't win Yunong's heart; how could that place compare to Duxiang's?"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"位巡城都老爷，访得吏目诈赃，改供私放，把这案提上去，送了刑部。」宝珠道：「如今魏聘才是在监里了？应该，应该。但华公子怎么不替他料理呢？」","en":"to the Ministry of Punishments.\\" Baozhu added, \\"So Wei Pincai is now in prison? He deserves it. But why hasn't Young Master Hua taken care of him?\\""},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"素兰道：「据仲雨讲，是瞒着华公子，况且又是个假名假姓。大约脸总丢了，也不至有什么大罪。又听说魏聘才新捐了一个从九品，审实了，这功名只怕也革的了。」子玉听了，甚替聘才着急，连说道：「这怎么好！就是我们那位李世兄，也在外边胡闹。夏间去嫖，连衣服都被人剥了。亲友们都知道，闹得很不好看。不","en":"Sulan said, \\"According to Zhongyu, they are keeping it a secret from Young Master Hua, and besides, he used a fake name. It's likely he's just lost face, and it won't amount to a major crime. I also heard Wei Pincai recently purchased a minor official rank; if convicted, that title might be stripped as well.\\" Hearing this, Ziyu felt anxious"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"那日锁拿之后，又逼索钱五百吊改供卖放。蓉官所供一样。部里审了两堂，彼此口供相对。华公子已知道了，欲待不管，心里又有些不安，只得着人到刑部里与他托情关照，因此轻办了好些。将吏目革职，聘才杖了二十，玉天仙逐出境外，蓉官释放回家，结了案。","en":"release them. Rongguan's testimony was identical. The Ministry held two hearings, and their testimonies matched. Young Master Hua had already learned of this; initially wanting to ignore it, he felt uneasy and had to send someone to the Ministry of Punishments to put in a good word, which resulted in a much lighter sentence. Official Yu was dismissed from his post, Pincai received"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"聘才进了自己屋子，尚有一起一起的人来问他，唯不见华公子打发人来，聘才真道他不知此事，便放了心。到了第三日，见林珊枝进来，两手捧了一大封，像是银子，放在桌上，说道：「这是公子送你的。」说完转身就走，聘才「道谢」两字尚说不及，已去远了。聘才见此光景，与平日不同，有些疑异，遂看银包，上面写着：「赆仪二百两。」","en":"After Pincai entered his room, groups of people came to inquire about him, but he saw no one sent by Young Master Hua. Pincai genuinely believed he was unaware of the matter, which put his mind at ease. On the third day, Lin Shanzhi entered, holding a large package wrapped in both hands, resembling silver. He placed it on the table and said, \\"This is a gift from the"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"聘才在华府里仅有十个月，在外面招摇撞骗，所得银钱却也不少。华公子于修金之外，尚多遗赠。聘才捐了个从九，品花去四百余金，作衣服及浪花浪费共有二千金。此时除前日二百金之外，尚存三百金，还有些玩好等物。且幸所捐名次在前，约半年可选。因此胆壮心豪，与从前大不相同了。在店里住了两日，嫌他嘈杂，即租了宏济寺春航住的房子，高车","en":"yet through deceit and trickery outside, he had amassed quite a sum of money. Aside from his regular stipend, Young Master Hua had bestowed many gifts upon him. Pincai spent over four hundred taels to buy a minor rank of the ninth grade, and squandered another two thousand on clothes and extravagance. By this time, excluding the two hundred taels from the previous day, he still"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"却说富三爷闻得聘才闹了事，便在部里打听了几日，自己无路可通。后闻华公子替他托了情，才放了心。后又听见聘才辞馆出来，便又惦记着放心不下，意欲邀他回家。一日，起早出城来找聘才，只见寺门口一班人在那里啰唣。富三爷下车时，见一个披着件青布老羊皮大袄，戴一顶旧秋帽，有三十多岁，口中在那里撒村混骂。富三爷听他说道：「原来这么不是朋","en":"spent several days inquiring at the Ministry but found no way through. He only felt relieved after learning that Young Master Hua had interceded on his behalf. Later, hearing that Pincai had left his patron, his concerns returned, and he intended to invite him home. One morning, he went out of the city early to find Pincai and saw a group of people making a racket at the temple"}],"34":[{"paragraph":19,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"冯子佩即与聘才同榻，聘才道：「我看近来好虚名而不讲实际的多。即如华公子、徐度香一班人，挥金如土，是大老官的脾气。但于那些相公，未免过于看得尊贵，当他与自己一样。","en":"Pincai said, \\"It seems to me that lately there are many who love empty fame and care nothing for substance. Take Young Master Hua, Xu Duxiang, and that set: they scatter gold like dust—the temperament of grand lords indeed. But they hold those young actors in altogether too exalted a regard, treating them as their own equals."}],"36":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"前回书讲的宝珠生日，在怡园乐了一天，正是人生悲乐不同。却说琴言在华府，因元宵之日，华公子命其与八龄演戏，是日琴言身子不快，且兼感伤往日，是以神情寂寞，兴致不佳。","en":"how the joys and sorrows of human life vary. Meanwhile, at the Hua estate, on the day of the Lantern Festival, Young Master Hua had ordered Qinyan and the Eight-Ages boys to perform a play. Qinyan, feeling unwell and grieving over the past, wore a desolate expression and lacked any spirit for the performance."},{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"那日在台上，演到中情所感，不觉真哭起来。华公子以为无故生悲，十分不悦，叫下来痛斥了一番，有几日不叫上去。琴言独居一室，来往无人，且与那些跟班小使气味不投，凿枘相处。","en":"On stage that day, moved by the tender sentiments of the play, he could not help but weep real tears. Young Master Hua, assuming he was mourning for no reason, was deeply displeased; he called Qinyan down and sharply reprimanded him, not summoning him again for several days. Qinyan remained alone in his room without visitors. Finding the tempers of the servants and attendants"},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"的光景，较之今日，真有天渊之别。即有伺候不到处，度香非但没有形之于色，并且不藏之于心，反百般的安慰体贴。此日的华公子，喜欢时便也与度香彷佛，及不合他的意时，不是发烦，就是挑斥，元宵那一日竟至诟斥起来，与诸奴相等。那一班逢迎巴结的见了，便欣欣得意，似乎也有今日，从此便可堕入轮回，永无超升之理。主儿多叫一回，同伙多恨一回。主儿多赏一回，同伙多骂一回。那带诮带骂、冷言冷","en":"showing anger but harbored no resentment, instead offering every comfort and consideration. On the other hand, when Young Master Hua was in a good mood, he seemed somewhat like Duxiang, but the moment things displeased him, he would grow irritated and fault-finding. On the Lantern Festival, he had even resorted to scolding, treating Qinyan like any other servant. The sycophantic attendants"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"龄面前装声势，充老手。你不记得从前王静芳在燕□堂要打他么？如今见了静芳，还不瞅不睬的，记着前恨呢。」琴言道：「华公子的情性，虽算不得十分古怪，然有时却也捉摸不定。偏是他上去，怎么说怎么好，没有碰过钉子，这也是各人缘分了。真是随机应变，总没有一句答不上来，也算难为他。」素兰道：「我听得说，他们府里，没有一个不巴结他，就是三代老家人，也要在他面前周旋周旋。那魏聘才是叫","en":"back, how many days of leave did you get?\\" Qinyan replied, \\"Lin Shanzhi came to tell me this morning. I didn't see the young master myself. He only said to return after the funeral, without specifying how many days.\\" Sulan said, \\"You must ask for at least a month's leave and wait until after the burial to return; otherwise, you'll be letting your teacher's wife down.\\" Qinyan agreed."},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"散。琴言穿了孝袍，似乎明日不好出门，只得约定三日后再叙。又叫伍麻子到华府求珊枝转为告假一月，俟出殡后方得进城。华公子准了，又拿了一个衣箱回来，琴言方才放心。","en":"estate to ask Shanzhi to request a one-month leave for him, waiting until after the burial to return to the city. Young Master Hua approved and sent back a chest of clothes, which finally put Qinyan's mind at ease."},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"些话来哄琴言，要他喜欢，说庾香近来也不出门赴席听戏，常托我对你说，在那里放宽了心，不要惦记着他，他慢慢的去结交华公子，自然可以常见面了。聘才无非要他安心久坐，等奚十一来。无奈琴言急于要走，酒也不喝，菜也不吃，呆呆的坐着，如芒刺在背的光景。","en":"asked him to pass on a message: \\"Tell him to relax, not to worry about me, and to slowly build a relationship with Young Master Hua; naturally, you'll be able to see each other often.\\" Pincai's only goal was to keep Qinyan comfortably seated until Xi Eleven arrived. Qinyan, however, was anxious to leave; he neither drank nor ate, but sat stiffly, as if sitting on pins and needles."}],"37":[{"paragraph":10,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华星北"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云大笑，次贤道：「十日之叙，已无此福，若华星北之福，真是福如东海了。」说得众人大笑。琴言与子玉此时，已觉十分畅满。","en":"laughed heartily. Cixian quipped, \\"Even ten days together are too much good fortune for him! What if he had Hua Xingbei's luck? Now that would be good fortune as vast as the Eastern Sea!\\" Everyone laughed at this remark. By now, Qinyan and Ziyu were both filled with contentment."}],"38":[{"paragraph":5,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"少陵、孟东野。但其赋性高旷，不善治家，常为贫乏所累。后复游京师应举，两试不第，馆于刘尚书家，教过文泽两年。继为华公子请去教书，又逗留了三年，仍归乡里。守令钦其贤，举了孝廉方正，铨选了江西一个苦缺知县，任满题升了南昌府通判。去年夫人又病故了，剩了孑然一身，并无亲丁骨肉。","en":"post as a tutor in the household of Minister Liu, where he taught Wenze for two years. He was then engaged by the young master of the Hua family to teach, remaining there another three years before finally returning to his native place. The local magistrates, admiring his virtuous reputation, recommended him through the 'filial and upright' examination channel. He was selected"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"华公子知道他来，出城拜了他，送了三百金。屈公得了五百金，又到那些古玩铺买了好些书籍、名帖等类。从前相好中有寒士者，也分送了好些，目下所余无几了。","en":"Young Master Hua, learning of his arrival, came out of the city to pay a formal call and gave him three hundred taels. With five hundred taels in hand, Master Qu went round the antique shops and bought a good many books and famous rubbings. He also distributed a fair"},{"paragraph":38,"mentions":1,"tokens":["星北"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"道翁又道：「都中现有一个极博雅的人，年纪虽轻，与我是旧交，也是个南京巨族。论起世家来，与子云、星北不相上下，想诸公自必相熟的。」子云道：「是那一位？」道翁道：「此君姓金名粟，号吉甫，可相好么？」众人同道：「久闻其名，恨未一见。」道翁道：「若论考据学问品行，当今可以数一数二了。他也有一部说部，是说平倭寇的事，我将他这书的名字忘了。曾经看过一遍，笔下","en":"mine, and also from a great Nanjing family. In terms of family standing, his lineage is on a par with Ziyun's and Xingbei's, and I am sure you all know him well.\\" Ziyun said, \\"Who might that be?\\" Master Qu said, \\"His family name is Jin, given name Li, style name Jifu — are you acquainted with him?\\" Everyone said together, \\"We have long heard his name but have never yet"}],"41":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说华公子自琴言告假之后，假期已满，不见回来，心上有些思念他。","en":"Qinyan had taken his leave of absence, the appointed time had long since passed with no sign of his return, and Young Master Hua found himself missing the boy more with each passing day."},{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"日在园中归鸿小渚倚阑垂钓，珊枝与金、玉二龄，还有一个小丫鬟香儿，在傍伺候。金龄找了一个大瓷瓯，走下池边贮了水。华公子钓了一回，得了三寸长的一个小鱼，已觉满心欢喜。见那池水清冷，每于潆流洄互处，把些铜皮嵌在石脚，那流水过来便有琤琮之声，如琴筑一般。又见水面上飞了无数的花瓣，一个红鲤鱼游来游去，吃那飞花，见了钓丝上的饵，便来吞了。","en":"Xiang'er. Jinling had fetched a large porcelain basin and filled it with water at the pond's edge to hold any catch. The young master had been fishing for a while and caught a small fish barely three inches long, yet felt quite pleased with himself. He observed how the water ran cold and clear, and how at certain eddying bends the builders had set copper strips into the stone bases"},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"华公子急把钓竿一拽，丝纶已断，那鱼连钓吞下半截，断丝尚浮在水面。公子看了，一时高兴，便叫金龄、玉龄去将小船撑过来。","en":"The young master gave a sharp tug on his rod, but the line snapped—the fish had swallowed the hook whole up to the midpoint, and the broken end of the line floated on the water. Delighted by the spectacle, the young master called out to Jinling and Yuling to bring the"},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，两边栏杆，船头有个亭子，中舱摆个小花梨圆桌。船篷上是绿油布顶，垂下白绫飞沿。金龄、玉龄在两头荡桨，荡了过来。华公子见此春光明媚，桃李齐芳，即叫小丫鬟去请夫人出来逛园。","en":"brought the craft over to the islet. Seeing the spring day so radiant—peach and plum blossoms vying in loveliness—the young master at once sent the little maidservant to invite his mistress to come out and enjoy the garden."},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":4,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"约有两刻工夫，听得环佩琤琤，华夫人带了明珠、花珠、荷珠、赠珠四个女婢过来，华公子笑面相迎。华夫人道：「这两日天气甚好，我本来也想逛逛。方才香儿说你在这里钓鱼，我从西书房夹道中走来，倒也不远。我又叫老婆子收拾些食品过来。」华公子道：「我本有此意，你倒预先办妥了。」二人凭阑观玩了一会，华公子道：「我们何不下船逛逛池子？」四珠即扶了夫","en":"ornaments announced the arrival of Madam Hua, attended by four maidservants—Mingzhu, Huazhu, Hezhu, and Zengzhu. The young master stepped forward with a smile to welcome her. Madam Hua said: \\"The weather has been so fine these past two days—I had been meaning to take a stroll. A moment ago Xiang'er told me you were here fishing, and I came by way of the passage alongside the west"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":2,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"花，红绿相间，春风和煦，众鸟齐鸣。过了几处亭台，又绕过了潭水房山，到了留仙院，见修竹里一个院落，开了无数碧桃。华公子道：「此处最佳，就到留仙院去罢。」荷珠将船系好，搭了跳板，华公子上了岸，四珠扶夫人，从桃花林下欹欹斜斜的一条路进去，也有几个堆灵石。过了个小石梁，接着一个石门。进了石门，是个亭子，名为惜芳亭，过去就是留仙院的游廊。","en":"light breeze drifted past; the ripples shimmered deep green as the craft glided slowly beneath a small bridge. The young master and his lady admired the ancient wisteria that twined over the bridge railings and the garden rocks, hanging in dense, feathery masses down to the water's surface, while beneath them the stream gave off a clear, jade-like chime. They passed the little"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"华公子看得高兴，对夫人道：「如此春光，不可不赏。这些蝴蝶儿倒比我们还顽得热闹。这园中最多的要算桃花，我们也该祭他一祭，何不取那百花露酿的竹叶春酒来，浇灌他一番。」","en":"The young master watched with great delight and said to his lady: \\"With spring so glorious around us, we must not fail to appreciate it. These butterflies make merry more thoroughly than we do ourselves. The garden is most celebrated for its peach blossoms—we ought to"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"个汉玉觞，贮了一觞酒，将桌子抬到廊前，摆了这三样宝贝，再将博山炉焚了百合香。华夫人道：「怎样，要拜不要拜呢？」华公子道：「不用拜罢。我们去拣顶好的花，将这酒去浇在他根上罢。」二人就走到林下，公子拣了一棵红碧桃，夫人拣了一棵白碧桃，公子先浇了半杯，夫人也浇了。二人笑盈盈的在花下赏玩。","en":"Shanzhi to fetch the key from the study-boy in charge of the storeroom. Presently Aizhu returned with it, and the young master had her unlock two antique cabinets, then led his lady over to examine them at leisure. They were filled with ancient bronzes, old jades, and similar treasures. Opening a drawer, he found a rosewood box; lifting the lid, he saw it contained a hand scroll,"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"公子、夫人看了，好不快乐。华公子叫取两个锦褥来，就铺在花下，与夫人对面坐了。摆了攒盒，把那百花春对饮了几杯。华夫人道：「何不叫他们吹唱一回，以尽雅兴。」公子道：「很好，你就分派他们唱起来。」夫人将十珠分了五对，吩咐道：「你们各拣一枝，总要有句桃花在里头的。我派定了对，不是此唱彼吹，","en":"The young master and his lady watched with great amusement. The young master called for two brocade cushions to be brought out and spread beneath the flowers; the two of them sat facing each other there. A lacquered partitioned box was laid out before them, and they"},{"paragraph":30,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"像不是肯居人下的光景。但不知自己落到这个地位，也就无法。所谓「做此官，行此礼」，若妄自高傲，也真是胡涂人了。」华公子笑而不语。夫人赏那十珠的，记了一等是钗环，二等是香粉。","en":"At the mention of Qinyan, the young master turned to his lady and said: \\"That boy Qinyan is truly something of a puzzle. We have treated him well by any measure, and yet one always senses that he carries some private grievance in his heart. He has been on leave for over a month now, with no sign"},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"只得鼓起了眼睛，瞅了他一眼。那一个老婆子低低叹口气道：「咳，从来说人老珠黄不值钱，你还同他们一般见识呢？」这边华公子忽然念那《牡丹亭》上的两句道：「良辰美景奈何天，赏心乐事谁家院。」华夫人笑道：「《牡丹亭》的《游园惊梦》，可称旖旎风光，香温玉软。但我读曲时，想那柳梦梅的光景似乎配不上丽娘。」公子道：「我也这么想，觉柳梦梅有些粗气，自然不及丽娘。至于那《元人百种曲》","en":"\\"Alas, as they say, a pearl grown old and yellowed is worth nothing. Why bother arguing with them?\\" At this point the young master suddenly recited two lines from The Peony Pavilion: \\"A fine day and a beautiful scene, what good are they? Joy in the heart and delight in the eye, whose garden holds them?\\" His lady laughed, \\"The 'A Stroll in the Garden and the Interrupted Dream' scene"},{"paragraph":39,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这边华公子直送夫人到房内坐了，又将方才填的词看了一会，同吃了晚饭。忽又高兴，到了洗红轩，因想起琴言如何还不进来，像已过了假期了，即叫小丫头去唤珊枝进来。小丫头去了一会，同了珊枝上前。公子问道：「琴言是那天告假的？」珊枝道：「正月二十四日。」公子道：「正月二十四","en":"Meanwhile, the young master had personally escorted his lady to her rooms and seen her seated, then looked over the lyrics they had composed that afternoon a while longer, and the two of them dined together. Afterward, in high spirits, he went to the Crimson Wash Pavilion, and"}],"42":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"安顿几天，再进华府。一日早饭后，卧在房中，见他师娘进来，琴言连忙站起。师娘叫他坐了，说道：「从前你进华府，不知华公子怎样对你师父讲的，师父也没有对我说过。他在时我诸事不管，如今是要我支持门户了。我想我们一年总要三千吊钱才够花消。你看那天福、天寿挣得出来吗？你没有进华府时，一月内极少也挣得二三百吊钱。如今你又不进班子，这钱自然要出在华府里，想他们也不肯白使唤人。你与","en":"to speak. \\"When you first entered the Hua household, I never knew what terms your master had agreed upon with Young Master Hua, nor did your master ever tell me. While he was alive I stayed out of these matters entirely, but now I am the one who must keep this household afloat. As I reckon it, we need at least three thousand strings of cash a month to cover our expenses. Can"},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"少钱，这倒是件难事。况且公子近来待我又不如从前，这话怎好去问他？」想来想去，不得主意，答不出来。他师娘心上疑着华公子待琴言不知怎样好，自然要一千就是一千，要二千就是二千。这几天在琴言身上盘算，把个心想昏了。又恐琴言存着坏心，道是师父死了，便可撒开。所以长庆媳妇的心，想钱倒与长庆一样，可称良偶。便要紧挤住了琴言，做个靠山吃山、靠水吃水的主意。见琴言不语，便生疑虑，又","en":"meet with easily. Now his widow is asking me to fix a monthly sum, which is a difficult thing to do. Furthermore, the young master has not been as warm toward me as he used to be. How could I possibly bring up money with him?\\" He turned the problem over and over in his mind without arriving at any answer, leaving him entirely unable to reply. His master's widow, for her part, imagined"},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"了一声道：「我不信，我也不知细底。你师父是不知自己要死，若知道自己要死，也早对我说了。我听得去年你没有进去时，华公子就打发人出来说要买你，他可是不肯花钱的主儿？一个人凭良心过日子，怎么师父一死，你就变起心来？」琴言听了这些话，已气得要哭，只得忍住了，说道：「这话只好等我进去了再商量，我自己是没有留一个钱。去年及新年得的赏赐，就是前天那一包银子。","en":"to die. If he had known, he would have told me everything long ago. I heard that last year, before you went in, Young Master Hua sent people out to say he wanted to buy out your contract. Is he the sort of man who would be stingy with money? A person should act in good conscience. How is it that the moment your master dies, you change your tune?\\" Qinyan, stung nearly to tears"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"到此，不觉失笑道：「你这话是那里听来的。」伍麻子道：「我们有一班朋友，闲着没有事，聚在一处就讲这些话。城里一个华公子，城外一个大园子里的徐老爷，这两家富贵，讲一年也讲不完。说那徐老爷的园子里山子石底下，埋着十缸银，十缸金。那看金子的财神爷是一头黄毛，看银子的财神爷是一头的白毛。到半夜里，他两个便坐在园墙上吓人，还要拿金锭、银锭子打人。有时运的被他打着了，就捡了金银","en":"fellows, and when we have nothing to do we gather together and talk about things like this. In the city there's a Young Master Hua, and outside the city there's an Old Master Xu in a big garden estate. Between those two wealthy families you could talk for a year without running out of stories. They say that beneath the garden rocks on Old Master Xu's estate, there are ten urns of"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"日多少恩情付之流水。这也不能怪他，从来说白鸽子望旺处飞，也是人之常情。况且我这敝东，在京里也算个阔老斗，就与那华公子、徐少爷也不相上下，而且他们都是世交。前日那位徐少爷来，适值敝东不在家，他就到我书房来坐了好半日。送他出去时，他再三的约我去逛园。」大傻道：「你去没有呢？」亮轩道：「我始而倒打算去，况且他往来那一班公子名士，都也与我相好。后来我想他还没有做过外任，未","en":"and that is human nature.\\n\\n\\"Besides, my patron is reckoned a great old rake in the capital — quite the equal of Young Master Hua or young Xu, and the families are old friends. The other day Young Master Xu came, and my patron happened to be out, so he came and sat in my study half the day. When I saw him out he begged me over and over to come and see the garden.\\" Dasha said, \\"And"}],"43":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":3,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"儿才好。」宝珠道：「什么难事，你且说来。但你想不到的，只怕我也想不到。」琴言道：「昨日，我那师娘问我进华府时，华公子对你师父是怎样讲的，可曾得过他家的钱。又说家中一年的浇裹，须得两千四百吊钱，要我给他二百吊钱一月，说定了方叫我进城。我想去年原为奚十一的事送我进去，我进去了也没有见着师父，不知其中是怎样的。今师娘忽然问我要二百吊钱一月，叫我怎么打算得出来？又要我去对","en":"may fare no better.\\" \\"Yesterday my master's wife questioned me about the day I entered the Hua household — what Young Master Hua's young lord said to my shifu, and whether my shifu had ever received money from them. She also said that the household costs two thousand four hundred strings a month, and demanded that I pay her two hundred strings a month, saying she would not let"},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":2,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"。据我说是出师的妙，你且应承他出师。」琴言道：「好容易的话，你倒轻轻的一口断定了。这三千头打那里来，我岂能去对华公子讲的？」素兰道：「定要三千？二千呢？可以不可以？」宝珠道：「这事有点边儿了。请你来商量，你第一句答应出师，第二句就劈断银价，这是胸有成竹的话，岂不是可成么？」琴言道：「也要个旁人去说，三千、二千，我也不能对他讲的。」宝珠问素兰道：「就算只要二千，你有","en":"settle the matter in a single breath. Where are the three thousand taels to come from? And could I possibly ask Young Master Hua for such a thing?\\" \\"Must it be exactly three thousand?\\" said Sulan. \\"What about two thousand — would that do?\\" \\"Now we're getting somewhere,\\" said Baozhu. \\"We invite you to help us think, and your first word is 'agree to the release,' while your second"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华星北"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"庾香、湘帆、剑潭不必派他，凑起来已得一千八百了。若要三千，还少一千二百两，不消说是度香包圆了。」子云道：「难道华星北倒干干净净，一文不花，这么便宜。」蕙芳道：「据我说，不必要他出钱。如今与他讲，就是一总要他拿出来，他也肯，但是玉侬只好在他家一辈子了。」子云点头道：「说得是。我想你们都不甚宽余，一时仗义挤了出来，恐后来自己受困。如今通不用费心，在我一人身上，只要你们","en":"still short one thousand two hundred, which means, it goes without saying, Duxiang makes up the rest.\\" \\"Surely Hua Xingbei is not let off entirely without spending a single coin?\\" said Ziyun. \\"In my view,\\" said Huifang, \\"there is no need to involve him. If we go to him and demand the full sum all at once, he might agree, but then Yunong would be in his household for the"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":2,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"得好！若有几千银子，我也不着急了。原是为的两手空空，所以为难。我前日不是和琴言商量么，我说我要靠你的了，你去对华公子说，可一月给我二百吊钱。他又说不能，也不敢去对他说。我说你既不能拿钱回来，难道将我吊在西风里么？况且华公子在他面上也没花过什么钱。我说你何不请个人去对他讲，拿个三五千两银子来出了师，以后就由你怎样。我有了这一总银子，也可过得一世，自然不向你要养老送终","en":"difficulty. The other day I discussed it with Qinyan. I told him I would be depending on him, and asked him to go to Young Master Hua and arrange for a monthly payment of two hundred strings. He said he could not, and dared not raise it himself. I told him: if you cannot bring money back, do you expect to leave me dangling in the autumn wind? Besides, the young master has not spent"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":3,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"是添得上来，添不上来，再说…」长庆媳妇道：「老老实实，是三千两上好纹银，我也肯了。他能不能？他若不能，我还候着华公子。他是个有名花钱的主儿，或者一万八千都可以呢。不然还有徐老爷，他是爱他的，更好说话。我忙什么！」蕙芳冷笑道：「婶娘但听华公子的声名，三千五千两原不算什么。但是华公子近来不甚喜欢他。非但不肯替他出师，只怕还要打发他出来。婶娘在外头如何知道？我们是常到他","en":"thousand taels of good silver, nothing less, and I will agree. Can he manage it or not? If he cannot, I will wait for Young Master Hua. He has a reputation as a free spender, so ten thousand or eight thousand might not be beyond him. Or there is still Lord Xu, who is fond of Qinyan, and would be easier to approach. I am in no hurry!\\" \\"Auntie, you have heard of Young Master Hua's reputation,\\""},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"心，叶先生请独用罢。」即对琴言道：「你去收拾收拾，辞辞师父的灵，谢谢师娘的恩，就同我到那边去，我再同你进城去谢华公子，也不宜迟了。」琴言依了他，带回的东西也不多，叫人帮了那小使收拾捆扎停当。蕙芳叫人一担挑了回家，又拿出十吊钱的票子，代琴言分赏众人。琴言穿了衣帽，拜了师父的灵，倒也伤心哭了一会。又向师娘拜辞，长庆媳妇也着实伤心，掉了好些眼泪，又嘱咐了几句话。茂林见此","en":"master's wife for her care, and come with me to the other side. Then we shall go into the city together to thank Young Master Hua, as there is no time to lose.\\" Qinyan did as instructed. His things were few; he called someone to help his young attendant pack and bind them. Huifang sent them all back ahead in a carrying-load, and took out a draft for ten strings as a parting gift"}],"44":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":2,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说琴言出师之日，就是华公子赏花之日。明日，华公子吩咐珊枝着人去叫琴言回来，珊枝派了一个外跟班姚贤，一早出城。到了长庆寓处，见了伍麻子。说假期已过，叫他进城。","en":"Now, on the very day Qinyan was released from his indenture, Young Master Hua was hosting a flower-viewing gathering. The next morning Young Master Hua ordered Shanzhi to send someone to summon Qinyan back to the household. Shanzhi dispatched an outer attendant named Yao Xian, who set out early for the city gate. Arriving at the"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"华公子在那里笑得有趣，忽见太湖石洞穴像有人偷望，便问一声：「谁在太湖石背后？」倒把珊枝唬了一跳，忙走上前，垂手站立。公子道：「你来为什么又不上来，要躲在石后？」珊枝道：「奴才方才走来，听得公子正说着话，故在太湖石后瞧一瞧，再上来。」公子道：「有什么话说？」","en":"Young Master Hua was enjoying the scene thoroughly when he suddenly noticed that through the aperture of the Taihu rock something seemed to be spying on them. He called out: \\"Who is behind the Taihu rock?\\" Shanzhi gave a start and quickly stepped forward, standing with"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"华公子听了这些话，不觉大怒，把脸都气得白了，连说：「有这等事！可恨！可恨！琴言丧尽天良，人间少有。而度香笑里藏刀，欺人太甚，难道我就罢了不成！你明日还叫姚贤去，务必把他叫来，我问问他，是何缘故。我也不管什么徐度香，我自然不能依他，与他评个理，天下有这么欺人","en":"Hearing all this, Young Master Hua was overcome with fury; the colour drained from his face. He kept saying: \\"Can this be true! Outrageous! Outrageous! Qinyan has utterly lost all human conscience — the like of it is rarely seen. And Duxiang — smiling on the outside, a blade within —"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"你还跪着。」蕊珠站起来，曲着腰，将膝盖揉了揉，徜徜徉徉的走开道：「冤不冤，跪了这半天。」找个僻静地方小解去了。华公子起身回夫人房内，宝珠、爱珠随了进去，珍珠等蕊珠同行。珊枝慢慢的送公子出了园，正要走时，忽然一把花瓣撒了他一头，急回头看时，见蕊珠、珍珠骂道：「人家跪着，你倒在石洞里偷看人，瞎掉你的眼睛。」珊枝道：「明日还要挨打呢。」说着也就走开了。","en":"finally said: \\"I could kneel until tomorrow and still not remember it. You had better just give me my punishment.\\" The young master laughed in spite of himself. \\"Get up,\\" he said. \\"I had forgotten you were still kneeling.\\" Ruizhu stood, bent over, rubbed her knees, and sauntered off saying: \\"What bad luck — kneeling all that time for nothing.\\" She went off to find a secluded corner"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"公子回房，见了夫人，欲不题起，心上又忍不住，就将子云与琴言出师的事说了。华夫人道：「什么叫作出师？」华公子道：「当年他师父也是花钱买的，所以挣的钱都归他师父。有人替他出了师，那就不算师父的人，由他自己作主了。昨日度香花二千四百两与琴言出师的。」华夫人道：「这么说，琴言就是度香的人了。」公子道：「可不是么！我心上实在有气，度香眼底无人，也不告诉我一声，公然","en":"The young master returned to his rooms, and seeing the mistress, he tried not to broach the subject — but could not hold it back, and told her of Ziyun's arrangement of Qinyan's release from indenture. \\"What does 'release from indenture' mean?\\" asked Madam Hua. \\"In the"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":2,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"们老爷是至好，何必为着琴言，伤了世交的情份。我劝你可以不必，琴言到底算个优伶，若闹起来，这狎优二字就难免了。」华公子素来敬爱夫人的，听他心平气和的讲，心中的气亦消了一大半，口内答应了一句：「说得是。」但又舍不得琴言。忽又转念过来，欲行不可，欲罢不能，惟是无情无绪的光景。华夫人又宽解了一回，华公子只得暂为放开。过了一夜，明早忽又恼起来，叫珊枝将琴言的衣箱什物装了车，","en":"this becomes a quarrel, both families will earn an unpleasant reputation for keeping company with such people.\\" The young master, who had always held his wife in great esteem, heard her speak with calm and reason, and felt more than half his anger dissipate. He murmured: \\"You are right.\\" Yet he could not quite let Qinyan go from his heart. He went back and forth in his mind —"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"六日要请客，一来与南湘、春航送场，并请屈道生，约子玉、仲清等相陪。今日已是初四，索性到初七进去，并说写个字贴与华公子，说他过了假期，一因身子不快，二因留他逛几天。所以琴言倒也心安，乐得多顽几日。","en":"today was only the fourth, they resolved to wait until the seventh for Qinyan to go back, and to draft a note to Young Master Hua explaining that after his leave expired, Qinyan had felt unwell and had been kept a few days for some fresh air. So Qinyan was quite at ease and enjoyed these extra days of leisure."},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华星北"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"由你自己作主了，不如辞了华府，到这里来罢。」琴言笑道：「我倒很愿，意但怎样去辞那边呢！」子云笑道：「那还了得？华星北必说我夺其所好，这官司还打得清么？不要弄到叩阍起来。到初七日也可回去了，你是几时出来的？」琴言道：「正月二十七。」子云道：「已四十天了，怎么这样快？」琴言道：「我在府里，又觉日子慢，在外面又觉得快了。」子云对次贤道：「这两天竹君、湘帆都在那里抱佛脚呢","en":"better,\\" said Qinyan with a laugh. \\"But how would one go about resigning?\\" \\"Heaven forbid!\\" laughed Ziyun. \\"Hua Xingbei would say I had stolen his favourite — that lawsuit might never be settled. Watch out it does not end up in an imperial complaint. By the seventh day you can go back. When did you leave in the first place?\\" \\"The twenty-seventh of the first month,\\" said"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":2,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"正说话间，忽然管门的进来禀道：「华公子打发人来，要面见老爷，还有几个箱子送来。」子云诧异，道：「什么箱子？叫来人进来。」话言未了，只见珊枝已走到梨院。琴言望见珊枝，早躲进屋后，潜身听他所为何事。珊枝见子云、次贤，请过了安，说道：「公子与二位老爷请安，有一封信在此。」便双手呈上。子云接来，","en":"While they were talking, the gatekeeper came in to announce: \\"Young Master Hua has sent someone who wishes to see the master in person, and has also brought several trunks.\\" Ziyun was puzzled. \\"What trunks? Have the visitor come in.\\" Before the words were out, Shanzhi had already walked into the Pear Blossom Courtyard. Qinyan caught"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华星北"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，见子云面貌失色，靠在椅上。宝珠与次贤还看那信，琴言过来要看，次贤意欲藏过，子云道：「给他看看，这是那里说起？华星北真不是人，听了谁的话，这般糟蹋人，可恼！可恼！」琴言不看此信还可，看了不由得伤心起来，一字字看去，忽然一腔怒气，直涌上来，眼前一阵乌黑，喉中如物噎住，透不得气，两眼一翻，望后便倒。把子云、次贤、宝珠皆唬呆了，连忙扶住了他。子云掐定人中，次贤一手扶住了","en":"pages, but Ziyun intervened. \\"Let him see,\\" he said bitterly. \\"Where do such unfounded claims even originate? Hua Xingbei proves himself devoid of all honor, blindly swallowing slanders to heap abuse upon an innocent. It is utterly outrageous.\\" Qinyan had maintained his composure until his eyes met the cruel words. Reading the letter line by line, a violent surge of fury"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华星北"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云见琴言如此，甚是伤心，因想道：「华星北过于欺人，不问真假。我本要与他讲个明白，但我去剖辩，倒长了他的志气，道是去招陪他了。索性罢了，断了这个交情，也不要紧。」说道：「玉侬不必哭了，你的好处，都是共见的，这些话有谁信他？一定是林珊枝从中调唆，以至如此，连我也怪到这样。我想你那一处不可安身，","en":"Seeing Qinyan in such distress, Ziyun felt an ache of sympathy. \\"Hua Xingbei has gone too far,\\" he thought to himself. \\"To hurl such insults without verifying a single fact is intolerable. I had intended to go and clear the air, but to defend myself now would only look like groveling. Better to leave things as they are. Severing"},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":2,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"且说珊枝回去，华公子便问到怡园见了度香怎样光景，珊枝道：「今日见他们在梨花园内，奴才进去见琴言、宝珠，琴言见了奴才，即躲开了。徐老爷问了公子好，将帖儿拆开看了一会，一句话也没有讲，就只冷笑一声。萧老爷说不及写回字了，回去与公子请安，我们明日见了公子当面讲罢。奴才将箱子交","en":"Meanwhile, Shanzhi returned to the Hua household. Young Master Hua eagerly demanded to know how Duxiang had reacted upon receiving the letter at the garden. \\"When I arrived, I found them gathered in the Pear Blossom Courtyard,\\" Shanzhi reported. \\"As I entered, I saw Qinyan and Baozhu standing there, but the moment Qinyan"}],"45":[{"paragraph":28,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"石崇王恺人争羡，世德勋门荷天眷。\\n只惜豪华怒碎琴，明珠减价珊瑚贱。\\n仲清道：「这不消说是华公子。」子云道：「竟连前日的事，都说出来了。你知道明珠、珊瑚的故事么？」仲清道：「我不知这句的故事。」文泽道：「明珠是他有十婢，皆以珠字为名，这珊瑚就是林珊枝了。」又看写的是：","en":"vented rage at a qin,\\nBright pearls cheapened, coral branches priced less.\\"\\nZhongqing exclaimed, \\"That can only be Young Master Hua.\\" Ziyun agreed, \\"Even last week's quarrel appears. Do you know the pearl and coral story?\\" Zhongqing shook his head. \\"I don't know that line.\\" Wenze explained, \\"The pearls were his ten maids, all named with 'pearl.' The coral is Lin Shanzhi.\\" The next"}],"46":[{"paragraph":40,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华光宿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"亭中可容三席，下面东手就是方才的练秋阁了。道翁道：「怎么又走回来了？」看亭子里有副对子，是他的学生华光宿的，也还用得，便对子云道：「你于此处，何不再集一副成语？」子云道：「我料着道翁还要考我，我已想就了。」即写道：幽岫含云，深溪蓄翠；\\n横藤碍路，弱柳低人。","en":"said, \\"How is it that we have come round again?\\" He looked at the couplet hanging there, which was by his pupil Hua Guangsu and would serve well enough, and said to Ziyun, \\"Why not gather another couplet of set phrases for this spot?\\" Ziyun said, \\"I guessed Daoweng would examine me again, and I have one ready.\\" He wrote at once:\\n\\nHidden gorges cradle cloud, deep streams hoard"}],"48":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"房官虽荐了他的卷子，大总裁已经驳落。内中有一位总裁，姓苏，名臣泰，现任兵部大堂，翰林出身，后又承袭了侯爵，就是华公子的泰山。看了春航的文字，大加赞赏道：「此人才调不凡，虽掞藻摛华，过于靡丽，倒是个词臣格调，可以黼黻太平。」大总裁犹以为未可。及看他《五经》通明，策对平允，遂中了他三十四名。苏侯到填榜时，拆对墨卷，见他这一笔楷字，心中大喜，知他殿试必在前列，果然被他中","en":"examiners, Su Chentai, the Minister of War, who possessed a Hanlin background and was a hereditary marquis as well as Young Master Hua's father-in-law, greatly admired Chunhang's essay. He praised Chunhang's ornate yet elegant style as perfectly suited for a peaceful reign. Observing that Chunhang's understanding of *The Five Classics* was profound and his policy responses were balanced,"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"今日已是五月初四，道翁定于初七日起身，众名士饯行已过。今日道翁一早进城，为华公子请去了。南湘来找次贤、子云，都不在园里，即到春风沉醉轩来，只见琴仙手托香腮，在那里颦眉泪眼，见南湘进来，连忙起身。南湘笑道：「我道你此番自然长了学问，谁知还是那样见识。人生离合悲欢，是一定之理，各人免不来的，何必作那儿女嗫嚅、楚囚相对的光景？快不要这","en":"seventh. The scholars' farewell banquets had already concluded. Early that morning, Daoweng went into the city at Young Master Hua's invitation. Nanxiang came searching for Cixian and Ziyun, but finding neither in the garden, he proceeded to the Pavilion of Spring Breeze Drunk. There he found Qinxian with his chin resting in his hand, his brows knitted and his eyes wet with tears."},{"paragraph":35,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"家人押了行李先走，自己与琴仙到了辰初方才上车。其时送行的不计其数。道翁一班老友，有到园中来的，有在城外等候的。华公子本要出城亲送，道翁再三阻了，没有来，止打发家人代叩送行，预先送了程仪六百金。","en":"Daoweng's old friends had either come directly to the garden or were waiting patiently outside the city walls. Young Master Hua had fervently intended to accompany them out of the city, but Daoweng repeatedly and firmly refused the honor; consequently, Young Master Hua did not come in person, but instead sent his servants to bow in farewell and presented a generous travel gift"}],"49":[{"paragraph":5,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"云与苏侯最好，且慢禀高堂，先找子云访问。到了怡园门口，见有一辆绿围车，八匹马挤在一边，知道有客，跟班问明了，是华公子在园。春航便先到清凉诗境找南湘去了。","en":"eight horses crowded to one side, realizing there was a guest. Inquiring with the attendants, he learned that Young Master Hua was in the garden. Chunhang therefore decided to head first to the Cool and Tranquil Poetic Realm to find Nanxiang."},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":2,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"却说华公子为琴言之事，与子云有了嫌隙，如何又到怡园来呢？这华公子是一时气性，写了那封恶札。过了两日，使有些自悔了。谁知子云只当没有事的一般，又不来招陪他，心内殊觉无趣。后与屈道翁送行，道翁倒把子云的好处说了一番。","en":"But why had Young Master Hua returned to the Garden of Contentment after his rift with Ziyun over Qinyan? Young Master Hua had written that harsh, severing letter in a fit of sudden temper. After two days had passed, he began to regret it. Yet Ziyun carried on as if nothing had"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":2,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"又说起扶乩，琴言与他前世原是父女，并将那首诗通身念给他听。华公子听了，心中着实骇然。道翁又赞琴言多少好处，现在认为义子，带他到任。华公子冰消雨霁，倒有几分过意不去。","en":"he himself had been father and daughter in a former life, and he recited the entire poem to him. Hearing this, Young Master Hua was deeply shaken. Daoweng then went on to praise Qinyan's many fine qualities, mentioning that he had now taken him as an adopted son and would be bringing him along to his new post. Young Master Hua's anger dissolved like ice melting after a rain,"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":4,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"再将琴言细细一想，真没有甚么不好，倒冤了他，便也赞了几句。道翁去后，次贤又来，才将这事澈底澄清的讲了一番，华公子始悔自己孟浪，又念与子云两代世交，为这点事绝交，是给人要议论的。又因他是个盟兄，只得尽个弟道，下口气先去招陪他。先是道翁、次贤已将华公子懊悔之意与子云讲过。子云是大度包容的，既是他先来，岂尚有芥蒂之意？便与从前一样相待，绝不题起那事。华公子忍不住，只","en":"voiced his praise. After Daoweng left, Cixian arrived and clarified the entire matter thoroughly. Only then did Young Master Hua fully repent his rashness, mindful of the generations of deep friendship between their families. To break ties over such a trivial matter would surely invite public ridicule. Recognizing his duty as an elder sworn brother, he swallowed his pride and"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华星北"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，是极好的好人。这还别管他。我为什么说比中状元还要喜呢？我那两位世妹，真是绝世无双，有名的苏氏二乔。大世妹就是华星北的夫人，今年二十一岁了，名叫浣香。方才说的二世妹，叫浣兰，一母所生的。若结了这个亲，就要叫你喜欢得说不出来，那时你才信我这句话。」春航听他说得这样好，似信不信的，便道：「怎样的好处，你如此称赞？你且把他的大概说说，你见过这人吗？」子云道「怎么没有见过","en":"the Su family are truly unparalleled in this world, famous as the Two Qiaos of the Su clan. The elder sister is Young Master Hua's wife, now twenty-one, named Huanxiang. The younger sister you just mentioned is Huanlan, born of the same mother. If you secure this match, you will be so overjoyed you won't be able to speak; only then will you believe my words.\\" Hearing Ziyun praise"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云过了两日，回拜华公子，进城顺路到了苏府。正值苏侯下衙门回来，请了进去。子云请了安，又进去见了师母，说他夫人与师母请安，苏夫人也问了好。苏侯让进内书房坐下，谈了一会，子云将春航春间断弦，闻二世妹贤淑之名，奉母命求亲的话说了。苏侯故作沉吟道：「看田修撰文才品貌，是极好的，而","en":"Two days later, Ziyun returned Young Master Hua's visit, and on his way back through the city, he stopped at the Su residence. Su the Marquis had just returned from his office and invited him in. Ziyun paid his respects and then went inside to greet the Madam, conveying his wife's regards, to which"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华星北"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"苏侯大乐，留子云小饮，问近日见华星北无有。子云答以方才从那里来。苏侯又问：「园中想必收拾得更好了，我竟一二年没有来逛园子。」子云道：「比初成时又更好了些，花木比从前繁盛了，池子也开通了。」苏侯道：「我这几年也实在忙，竟没有一日空闲，倒是你们师母心上想来逛逛，如今天气又热了。」子云道：「","en":"Greatly pleased, Su the Marquis kept Ziyun for a small drink. He asked if Ziyun had seen Young Master Hua recently, and Ziyun replied that he had just come from there. Su the Marquis then asked, \\"Your garden must be even more beautifully arranged now; I haven't been there for a stroll in a year or two.\\" Ziyun said, \\"It is somewhat better than when first"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"不少。」蕙芳道：「度香自然是有好的，他家的闺范也好，从没有遇见丫鬟们到园里来，况且隔着一条街，也不便来。只闻得华公子的丫鬟最多，而且都好。我们有一回在他家唱戏，看见帘子内有一大群，有男装的，有女装的，粉白黛绿，也望不清楚。」春航道：「将来苏侯赠嫁过来，我想必有几个丫鬟，如果有好的在内，我送一个与你。」蕙芳笑道：「多谢，多谢！那时我只好在这里伺候一辈子，算田、苏两姓","en":"to proper manners and virtuous conduct, without that narrow-minded pettiness. There is only one issue: I fear the master of the house may have already taken his pleasure with her—that's true nine times out of ten.\\" Chunhang laughed, \\"That is an inevitable fact. I imagine Duxiang's household has quite a few maids.\\" Huifang said, \\"Duxiang naturally has good ones, and the"}],"52":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"且说春航吉期已到，这苏侯是个阔家，大姑娘嫁与华公子，妆奁就值百万。今知春航是个寒士，把京东的田庄批了二百顷，拨了两名庄头，六房家人男妇，十个丫鬟，至珠宝古玩、陈设铺垫，以及衣服被褥、箱盒桌椅器皿之类，送奁那一日，用了二千名人夫，苏夫人犹以为薄，不及大姑娘十分之七，于铺箱时铺了两万两白银、三千两黄金。","en":"Chunhang's wedding had arrived. Su the Marquis, commanding immense wealth, had already married his elder daughter to Young Master Hua with a dowry valued at a million taels. Knowing Chunhang was a humble scholar without such means, the Marquis assigned him two hundred qing of estates in the eastern suburbs, complete with two head stewards, six families of household servants, and ten"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"家人进来禀道：「苏府妆奁已到。」一片吹打之声。春航请了子云、次贤一同迎接上去。送奁的是苏府几位本家亲戚，内中有华公子，绣衣金带，玉貌如仙。春航尚是初见，已久仰这位连衿的大名，接进了聚星堂，齐齐见礼。","en":"invited Ziyun and Cixian to join him in welcoming the procession. Among the Su relatives escorting the dowry was Young Master Hua—dressed in embroidered robes and a golden belt, his features as radiant as an immortal. Though meeting this famed new brother-in-law for the first time, Chunhang had long admired his reputation. He ushered him into the Gathering Stars Hall, where they"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":2,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"华公子见了刘尚书、王文辉是父执，便请了安，其余都行平礼。春航与华公子系是新亲，无甚话说，不过彼此道些仰慕之意。幸有王文辉、徐子云帮着张罗，应酬了那几位新亲，颇不寂寞。","en":"Recognizing Minister Liu and Wang Wenhui as venerable elders of his father's generation, Young Master Hua offered them respectful bows; to all the rest, he extended the courteous salutations of peers. As Chunhang and Young Master Hua were newly related and entirely unfamiliar with one another, they could only exchange polite, formal words of mutual admiration."},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":11,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"王文辉要推华公子首坐，华公子不肯。子云意欲邀他进园，与诸名士会会，华公子也不愿在外，便同了子云进园，文泽等齐齐站起，华公子上前见礼。除文泽之外，都不认识，内中见一个最年轻的，觉得如月光珠彩，凤举霞轩，骨重神清，风华雅丽，心里一惊，觉眼中从未见过这样人。子玉见华公子的","en":"At the banquet, Wang Wenhui attempted to yield the seat of honor to Young Master Hua, but Young Master Hua steadfastly refused. Ziyun proposed bringing him into the garden to meet the gathered scholars; preferring not to remain in the outer hall, Young Master Hua gladly accompanied him. Wenze and the others rose in unison. Aside from"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":3,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"坐了席，开了戏，那边王文辉、张仲雨进来，在华公子面前张罗了一番。华公子要请仲雨坐席，仲雨道：「今日我竟没有这个福分。」春航谢妆已回，也请仲雨入席，仲雨道：「外面一个媚香，如何照应得来？不可叫他怨我。」便拱拱手走开，指着子云道：「总是你好作成。」笑出去了。王文辉跷起了朝靴，手捋长髯，与华公子、徐子云","en":"Once they were seated, the opera resumed. Wang Wenhui and Zhang Zhongyu came in, attending to Young Master Hua for a time. Young Master Hua invited Zhongyu to join the banquet, but Zhongyu joked, \\"Today, I simply lack that fortune.\\" Chunhang, having returned from his formal thanks at the Su household, also invited Zhongyu to sit. Zhongyu replied, \\"With one 'Meixiang'"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":3,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"春航请客宽了公服，唱了一出戏。华公子道：「天气热，倒不用唱戏了，也叫他们歇歇。」八旦上来，华公子不见蕙芳，便问春航道：「怎么不见那位状元夫人，还在账房里么？」春航不好意思回答。子云听了，笑道：「如今闹出两位状元夫人，倒与《燕子笺》上的《诰圆》一样了。」华公子一想，自觉失言，便不再问。见","en":"Chunhang changed out of his formal robes to host his guests and sang a single scene himself. Young Master Hua suggested, \\"In this heat, there is no need to force performances; let them rest.\\" As the eight famed dans approached, Young Master Hua, noticing Huifang's absence, asked Chunhang, \\"Why do I not see that 'Madam Zhuangyuan'—is he still trapped in the accounting"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":3,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"即对子云道：「此君风韵不减袁、苏，貌类琴言，而聪明过之。」赞得素兰好不喜欢。华公子又问子玉道：「弟与尊兄虽初次识面，但心契已久。有个魏聘才，是府上搬出来，在弟处住了半年，常常提及阁下，并有一事倒要请教。」子玉不知问他何事，即答道：「魏世兄也时常提及尊府，但未识荆，不敢晋谒，不知有何赐教？」华公子道：「事本细微，但一时不能索解。闻得","en":"Turning to Ziyun, Young Master Hua continued, \\"This gentleman's charm rivals that of Yuan and Su, and while his appearance resembles Qinyan's, his intelligence surpasses his.\\" Sulan was utterly delighted by the praise. Young Master Hua then addressed Ziyu, \\"Though you and I meet face-to-face"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":4,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"华公子又与高品、南湘、仲清、王恂、文泽、次贤各讲了些话，知高品才从苏州来，问了些江苏风景。偶然见素兰的扇子一面画的甚细，要了过来，看了一会。又见那一面写着小楷，题目是《断肠词》。华公子道：「肠何可以轻断？」子玉见了，又觉不安。华公子低低吟了一遍，又问素兰道","en":"Young Master Hua then conversed with Gao Pin, Nanxiang, Zhongqing, Wang Xun, Wenze, and Cixian. Learning that Gao Pin had just arrived from Suzhou, he asked about the landscapes of Jiangsu. By chance, he noticed Sulan holding a fan with exceedingly delicate painting"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":4,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"忽见林珊枝走来，华公子便叫取衣服过来，穿戴了，辞了春航，说道：「弟还要到舍亲处有事，明早送轿来再会罢。」一拱而别。外面送奁来那几位，早已去了。诸人送下了阶，单是那春航送出。素兰见拿了他的扇子，便跟了出来。到上车时，华公子始见素兰送他，知他要那扇子，但又心爱此词，不忍释手，","en":"Suddenly, Lin Shanzhi arrived. Young Master Hua called for his outer garments, dressed, and took his leave of Chunhang, saying, \\"I still have matters to attend to with my relatives. I shall send my sedan tomorrow morning so we may meet again.\\" With a bow, he departed. The other Su relatives who had"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"却说华夫人清早起来梳妆，群珠伺候打扮停妥，华公子进来，在妆台边坐了一会，忽然笑道：「不知二妹心里此时怎样，还是苦，还是乐？」华夫人笑了一笑，道：「亏你作姐夫的讲出这句话来。」群珠也都微笑。华夫人见公子的手内扇子，不是前日写的那一把，要过来看了一看，把这词念了一遍，道：","en":"That morning, Lady Hua rose early to perform her toilette, attended flawlessly by her Pearl Maids. Young Master Hua entered, sitting by the dressing table for a moment before suddenly smiling, \\"I wonder what Second Sister is feeling in her heart right now—is it bitterness, or joy?\\" Lady Hua smiled back, \\"It is a shame for a brother-in-law to speak such words.\\" The"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":3,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"道今生常厮守，盼银塘不隔秋河汉」呢？若说夫妇离别之词，又不像，说是赠妓的，也不甚像。然而语至情真，却有可取。」华公子笑道：「你真好眼力，这一评真评得不错。这首词是一个人送琴言的，可不是夫妇不像夫妇，朋友不像朋友，妓又不像妓么？然而写这片情，真写得消魂动魄。」华夫人道：「是度香作的么？」华公子道：「不是，是梅庾香，就是琴言向日的知己。」华夫人问道：「前日我写的扇子呢","en":"\\"A fine lyric. Where did this fan come from?\\" Young Master Hua replied, \\"It belongs to Lu Sulan. I loved the lyric, so I brought it back.\\" Lady Hua said thoughtfully, \\"The lyric is excellent, but it does not read like a poem for an ordinary friend. If for a friend, why include lines like, 'I only thought this life"}],"53":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说前回书中，华公子将自己扇子与素兰换了，后被华夫人问起来，方知将夫人写画的桃花扇子与了他，甚是懊悔。一日，即命家人去叫素兰，说明叫他带了前日的扇子来。那日素兰正在蕙芳处商议开那古董铺的事情，苏、陆之外，尚有袁宝珠、金漱芳、王兰保、李玉林要来，大家商议那古董书画等物公凑","en":"The story continues from the previous chapter. After Young Master Hua had swapped fans with Sulan, Lady Hua had asked about it, and only then did he realize with deep regret that he had given away the peach-blossom fan painted and inscribed by his own wife. One day, he dispatched a servant to summon Sulan, specifically"},{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"得及了。」漱芳、兰保同声说：「好！」又说：「就这么着，我们大家去找度香商量。」正商议间，忽见素兰的人进来说：「华公子打发人叫，立等进城。」素兰道：「他叫几个人？」那人道「就叫你一个，说叫带了扇子去。」素兰道：「我道他叫我作什么，原来是为这把扇子。」蕙芳道：「这扇子一定是他夫人写的了，所以来要回去。」素兰就辞了众人，到家换了衣服，带了人上车，一径到华府来，先到门房应","en":"all go find Duxiang to discuss this.\\"\\n\\nJust as they were deliberating, Sulan's servant hurried in and reported, \\"Young Master Hua has sent someone to summon you. He is waiting for you to enter the city immediately.\\"\\n\\nSulan asked, \\"How many of us did he call for?\\"\\n\\n\\"Just you alone,\\" the servant replied. \\"He specifically said to bring the fan.\\"\\n\\n\\"I wondered why he was calling for"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":2,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"素兰进来见了公子，公子正在那里画扇子，旁边站着个小丫鬟，还有两个小书童，素兰请过安，站在一边，华公子命他坐了，素兰见公子所画的扇子，也是两枝红白桃花，设色鲜明，甚是可爱。华公子知他爱看，便递给他道：「你看看有什么毛病么？」素兰接了过去，看了道：「兼工带写，得意得神。钱舜举、徐熙合为一手。」公子道：「前日那把扇子带来没有？那是人家的，那一天我没有理会","en":"Sulan went in and paid his respects. Young Master Hua was in the midst of painting a fan, flanked by a little maid and two young pageboys. After Sulan bowed and stood to the side, Young Master Hua invited him to sit. Sulan saw that the fan Young Master Hua was painting also depicted branches of red and"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":2,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"置起来，原不当买卖作，不过这几个人没有事，在那里坐了，作个公局的意思。至于要等置齐物件，必要到十月才能完备。」华公子道：「要些什么东西，定要到苏杭去，京里置不出来？」素兰道：「那里便宜。至于花绣刻丝等物皆是苏杭来的。」公子道：「定要那些东西么？依我倒不要。若卖那些东西，倒俗了。」素兰笑道：「不过有这些东西搭配着热闹些，不然也与那些书画铺一样。且既作买卖，那伙计的薪","en":"continued, \\"I fear not only would they fail to draw praise, they would be thoroughly mocked for their flaws.\\"\\n\\nYoung Master Hua laughed. \\"There is some truth to that, but people can still distinguish genuine quality from the bad. If your brushwork truly resembled the tracing exercises of a child or the embroidery patterns of a little maid, could anyone really call it good? Besides,"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":4,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"恋。齐纨皎洁，写他红粉娟妍。恨随流水，人想当时，何处重相见？韶华在眼轻消遣，过后思量总可怜。休负了，金樽浅。\\n华公子看了，不禁狂叫好道：「你这首真是黄绢幼妇，可称绝妙。恰是题画的桃花，何等凄清宛转，动人情味。」连吟了四五遍，忽将素兰看了一会，素兰低了头。公子凄然动容，叹了一声，又问素兰道：「你这首词是何寓意，要说得这样？」素兰道：「也没有寓意。公子是画的桃花，况今","en":"spent,\\nOnly in hindsight does it all seem so pitiable.\\nDo not betray it now—\\nThough the golden cup be shallow.\\"\\n\\nYoung Master Hua read it and could not help but cry out in wild praise: \\"This piece is truly a masterpiece, exquisite beyond words. It captures the painted peach blossoms perfectly, brimming with a delicate, haunting melancholy that moves the heart.\\" After reciting it"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"到夫人房里，将素兰的和词给他瞧。夫人看了，赞好道：「是今天题的么？字不是你写的，是珊枝写的么？比往日好多了。」华公子笑道：「正是。」又道：「前日库房楼上那几箱的花绣片子，听得说都坏了，还有好的在里面么？」夫人道：「那六个箱子，坏的算起来，也不过三分，有七分好的，而且倒是顶好的材料，如今新的还不及他。我已将好的挑了出来，分给十珠了。此刻还有三箱存着，要挑还可挑得出两","en":"As evening approached, Sulan rose to take his leave.\\n\\nYoung Master Hua said, \\"If you have no pressing matters, stay here tonight. There is no need to rush out of the city.\\"\\n\\nSulan was momentarily taken aback and hesitated to agree.\\n\\nYoung Master Hua smiled and said, \\"What harm is there? Do you fear gossip about 'adjusting"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":2,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"明日，华公子吩咐将那三个箱子抬下楼来，再叫十珠婢挑选，选出两箱可用，都是些绣蟒以及刻丝顾绣的裙料、褂料，还有枕簟、桌围、椅披，各色铺垫料，并零件荷囊、扇袋的花片子，共装了两大箱，算起价来，也值数千金，叫人抬出去，放在珊枝屋里。公子又问宝珠要出那文房什物以及玩器、","en":"The next day, Young Master Hua ordered the three chests brought downstairs and had the maids sort through them. They managed to pick out two chests of usable items: embroidered python-robe panels, carved-silk and Gu embroidery fabrics for skirts and jackets, as well as materials for"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":2,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"且说蕙芳等昨日早上见华公子叫了素兰进城，后来打听得一夜未归，今日又将一日，尚未见他回来，心里猜疑为什么事耽搁两日。再着人到素兰处打听，恰好素兰已回。少顷，素兰到蕙芳处来，讲华公子要他题那《桃花曲》，并待他一番光景，赏他好些东西，这铺子竟可开成了。","en":"Meanwhile, Huifang and the others had seen Young Master Hua summon Sulan into the city the previous morning. Later, they found out he had not returned all night, and as the second day dragged on with still no sign of him, they began to wonder what matter could have delayed him for two days. They sent someone"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"？」素兰道：「好个九香楼，妙极，妙极！」又请了宝珠、漱芳、玉林、兰保等来，大家看了，都极喜欢，同赞素兰能干，叫华公子这般倾倒起来，又赞他题的曲子。素兰颇为得意。","en":"others to come see. Everyone examined the goods and was overjoyed. They praised Sulan's capability in winning Young Master Hua over so completely, and applauded the lyric he had composed. Sulan felt quite proud."},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":2,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"明日，宝珠等到子云处，将华公子赏给素兰的东西，一一说了，并要子云回去，也把账单看了，点出：花玻璃灯二十对，大小玻璃杂器四十件，料珠灯八盏，各色洋呢十板，各色纱衣料一百匹、各色贡缎二十匹、各色湖绉一百匹、各色绸绫一百匹，座钟四架、挂钟四架，洋表二十个，真古铜器一件，赝古铜器七件，碧","en":"The next day, Baozhu and the others went to Ziyun's place and recounted one by one the items Young Master Hua had bestowed upon Sulan. They then asked Ziyun to go back, look through his own ledgers, and pick out items to contribute.\\n\\nZiyun selected a long list: twenty pairs of floral glass lamps, forty large and small assorted glass vessels, eight bead-strung"}],"54":[{"paragraph":4,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"初九日派了几位阅卷大臣，苏候又做了总裁，华公子派了搜捡官，徐子云派了收卷官，刘文泽派了弥封官，张仲雨派了巡逻官。初十日一早入场，首试题目是《拟汉诏》、《拟唐疏》、《五经条解》、《五代南北朝年号考》、《治河策》、《问酌六科则例》《增损盐法利弊》、《正本清源论》八题。二试是《大礼赋》、《大乐赋》、《","en":"On the ninth, examining ministers were assigned: Su the Marquis again chief examiner, Young Master Hua inspection officer, Ziyun receiving officer, Wenze sealing officer, and Zhang Zhongyu patrol officer. On the morning of the tenth they entered the hall. First session had eight questions: *Draft Han Edict*, *Draft Tang Memorial*, *Exegesis of the Five"}],"57":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"且说徐子云的夫人袁绮香，生得婉娴柔静，贤淑无双，又且绣口锦心，才能咏絮。于十月初十日，请了华公子的夫人苏浣香、田春航的夫人浣兰、刘文泽的夫人吴紫烟、颜仲清的夫人王蓉华、梅子玉的夫人琼华、王恂的夫人孙佩秋。此时园中菊花开满，五色斑烂。是日晴光和蔼，风不扬尘，小毛衣服都用不着，绵的尽够了。袁绮香一早带了十二红婢，还有几个家人媳妇，先到园里候客。那日","en":"her talents rivaled Xie Daoyun's famous 'willow-fluff' poetry. On the tenth day of the tenth month, she invited Hua Gongzi's wife, Su Huanxiang; Tian Chunhang's wife, Huanlan; Liu Wenze's wife, Wu Ziyan; Yan Zhongqing's wife, Wang Ronghua; Mei Ziyu's wife, Qionghua; and Wang Xun's wife, Sun Peiqiu. By this time, the garden's chrysanthemums were in full bloom, a brilliant"}],"59":[{"paragraph":23,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"无欢。子云回园与次贤说了，次贤更痛得伤心，一夜之间，便摹了道翁神像。明日邀同众名士在九香楼为位而哭，设奠三日。华公子得了信，也来哭奠。一个九香园倒成了屈道翁的丧居了，就没有穿孝的人。","en":"spirit tablet and wept before it, holding a memorial ceremony that lasted for three days. Upon hearing the news, Young Master Hua also came to offer his condolences and weep. The Nine-Fragrance Garden had essentially transformed into Qu Daoweng's mourning hall, lacking only people wearing mourning white."}],"60":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":4,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说新年已过，又到元宵，六街三市，火树银花，好不热闹。子云于十三日请了华公子、田春航、梅子玉、史南湘、高品、颜仲清、刘文泽、王恂、萧次贤、金粟、屈勤先，并九香园诸人，作一大会。琴仙见了华公子，尚有些不安，华公子也不问起前事，以礼相待。此时琴仙已出了旦党，入了士党，但从前作旦时傲睨一切，此刻倒谦谦自守起来，因此上下诸人更加尊重","en":"trees and flowered lanterns blazed in bustling splendor. On the thirteenth, Ziyun hosted a grand gathering for Young Master Hua, Tian Chunhang, Mei Ziyu, Shi Nanxiang, Gao Pin, Yan Zhongqing, Liu Wenze, Wang Xun, Xiao Cixian, Jin Su, Qu Qinxian, and the entire company of Nine-Fragrance Garden. Seeing Young Master Hua, Qinxian still felt a trace of unease, yet Hua asked nothing"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":2,"tokens":["华星北","华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"就做云龙那一幅，作好了，你再给我改改。」子云道：「自然是借重你们二位。那十篇如今是这样，各人拈阄，拈到谁是谁。华星北也叫他做一篇在内。」南湘道：「甚好。」于是写起阄来，将屈道翁与杜仙女、屈琴仙分做二阄，其余九人分作九阄。说也奇怪，想必文字有灵，前生缘法，子云拈了道翁，子玉拈了杜仙女、琴仙，金粟拈了宝珠，春航拈了蕙芳，仲清拈了琪官，文泽拈了春喜，南湘拈了兰保，王恂拈","en":"must rely on you both. As for the other ten pieces, let us draw lots to see who gets which. We should ask Hua Xingbei to write one as well.\\" Nanxiang agreed it was a fine idea. And so they prepared the lots, grouping Qu Daoweng, Fairy Du, and Qu Qinxian into two draws, and the remaining nine into nine draws. Curiously enough, as if the written word possessed a spirit"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉同了琴仙回家，正是内有韵妻，外有俊友，名成身立，清贵高华，好不有兴。子云写了一札与华公子为素兰作传。这边次贤妙腕灵思，画了十天才成。画成又请吉甫一一的改好，画一个，刻一个，倒也甚快。子云因受了感冒甚重，不敢用心，嘱将道翁、琴仙、杜仙女画在一幅，并求子玉作赞。到二十七日，连传赞都也刻起，系是各人书丹。二十八日就搬往九香楼镶嵌，一日完工。","en":"without, his fame established and his station secure, he was in the highest of spirits. Ziyun wrote a letter to Young Master Hua, requesting a biography for Sulan. Meanwhile, Cixian, wielding his wondrous brush and nimble mind, spent ten full days completing the paintings. As each was finished, Jifu meticulously refined it; they painted one and carved one, proceeding with remarkable"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"神罢了，我也配这样？」看第五方，画一个仙女，意致飘洒，素艳欲流，手拈兰花一朵，题曰：素心花史陆仙。下有小传，为华公子撰：","en":"single orchid. The title read: \\"Suxin Flower Historian, Immortal Lu.\\" Beneath it was a short biography composed by Young Master Hua:"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华公子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"将赞与众人看了，大家拿来评定一会，又各自斟酌一会，再公同推敲一会，尽善尽美了，宝珠便誊在一处。诸名士纷纷已到，华公子、金吉甫也都到了。大家果然要祭花神，宝珠等拦住了，然犹摆了香案，各名士奠酒焚香，就没有下拜。然后在九香楼下摆了四席，序齿而坐。这一聚，正是人人意满，个个心欢，毫无不足之处。而且罗列珍馐，横陈肴错，花香人气，缭绕一堂。","en":"Baozhu then transcribed them all together into a clean copy. The famous scholars began arriving one by one, and Young Master Hua and Jin Jifu soon joined them. True to their word, the scholars intended to offer sacrifices to the flower gods, but Baozhu and the others stopped them. Nevertheless, an incense table was set up, and the scholars poured libations and burned incense,"}]}`),"char-56":JSON.parse(`{"3":[{"paragraph":6,"mentions":1,"tokens":["曹长庆"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"鲜，脚色怎样齐全，小旦怎样装束好看，园子里怎样热闹，堂会戏怎样排场，说得聘才十分高兴。问起同船的人来，知琴官在曹长庆处，现今患了几天病，也渐渐好了。","en":"thoroughly enchanted. Inquiring after their fellow passengers from the boat, he learned that Qinguan was residing with Cao Changqing; having suffered a brief illness, he was now on the mend."}],"15":[{"paragraph":7,"mentions":1,"tokens":["曹长庆"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"没有的，我也不知道他住在什么地方。」南湘道：「你又撒谎。」文泽道：「若是那一个，我倒打听了，只知道他叫琴官，是曹长庆新买的徒弟，住在樱桃巷秋水堂。」南湘道：「走罢！」即向龙儿吩咐外面套车。子玉道：「我是不去。」南湘道：「好，好！有了心上人，连朋友都不要了，你是要一人独乐的。」便拉了子玉上车，一径往樱桃巷琴言处来。","en":"have made some inquiries. I only know he is called Qinguan (Qinyan), that he is the newly purchased disciple of Cao Changqing, and that he lives at Qiushui Hall in Cherry Lane.\\" Nanxiang said, \\"Let's go!\\" He called out to Long'er to have the carriage brought round. Ziyu said, \\"I am not going.\\" Nanxiang said, \\"Very well, very well! Now that you have a beloved, you no longer"}],"16":[{"paragraph":28,"mentions":1,"tokens":["长庆"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"素兰回到自己家门口，唤人往琴言处打听，不多一刻，来说琴言卧病在床，请客是他师傅长庆请分子，是部里几位经承先生，还是吃的早饭，不多一回就散的。素兰道：「再请到里面坐着等罢。」子玉听见心中略定，只得重进里面。无精打采的坐下。素兰只管笑嘻嘻的问长问短，又问你到底待那玉侬何如？子玉被问不过，只得说道：「玉侬之事，其说甚长。」就把魏聘才途中","en":"returned, reporting that Qinyan was confined to his bed with an illness. The guests had been invited by his master, Changqing; they were several clerks from the Board who had come for an early meal and would soon be departing. Sulan invited Ziyu, \\"Please, come inside and wait.\\" Relieved by the news, Ziyu returned indoors, taking a seat with a heavy heart. Sulan maintained a"},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":4,"tokens":["长庆"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"候，素兰又请子玉随意用了些点心，着人再到琴言处探望。来人回来道：「起先之客倒散了。偏又来了一班人，说要叫琴言，长庆回他不在家，那些人不肯去，坐着等候。长庆因不认识他们，便不应酬，自到房里吃烟去了。被他们闯进去，将长庆的烟枪抢了，要到兵马司衙门出首他。长庆无法，只得赔礼，又请了他间壁槽房李四、缎子王三两人解劝，闲人哄满了一堂，正在那里闹不清楚呢。」子玉听了，长叹一","en":"troubling news: \\"The first group of guests has left, but unfortunately, another group arrived demanding to see Qinyan. Changqing told them he was not at home, but they refused to leave and sat down to wait. Since Changqing did not know them and refused to entertain them, he retreated to his room to smoke. The men forced their way in, snatched his opium pipe, and threatened to"}],"18":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["长庆"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"日的光景，又不能常来看你，托我们传话，千万保重等语，琴言更加伤感。自患病以来，各处不去，怡园亦屏迹已久。奈其师长庆靠他做个摇钱树，因其久病，不能见客，便也少了好些兴头。","en":"he had gone nowhere at all; even the Garden of Contentment he had long since ceased to visit. But his teacher Changqing depended on him as a money tree, and with Qinyan ill for so long and unable to receive clients, Changqing had lost a good deal of his enthusiasm."},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":1,"tokens":["长庆"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"脚，那时只得比做狗了。此是做师傅的刻板面目。琴言自去年腊月到京，迄今四个月，徐子云已去白金数千，不为不多，是以长庆待琴言分外好。","en":"time, Xu Ziyun had already spent several thousand taels of silver. This was no small sum, and it explained why Changqing treated Qinyan exceptionally well."}],"20":[{"paragraph":4,"mentions":3,"tokens":["长庆"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"叹长吁，形诸梦寐。看官，你道子玉去寻琴言，为什么他的师傅总不拉拢呢？一来子玉是逢场作戏，不是常在外面的人，是以长庆不相认识，且不晓得子玉是何等地位，不过当他一个年轻读书人，无甚相与处。二来子玉在琴言身上，也没有花过一个钱。子玉与琴言是神交心契，自然想不到这些上来。那长庆则惟在钱多，却不在人好。那下作相公们的脾气，总是这样，那长庆生性如此，是始终不变的。","en":"have come; sometimes when he went to Qinyan's lodgings, there was always some inconvenience — either his teacher Changqing was entertaining guests, or someone was sitting there. He also could not easily go to Sulan's again; Ziyu felt utterly helpless and could only mourn the grudging lot of fate. Qinyan, at home, did not know how many times Ziyu had come by; and hearing"}],"21":[{"paragraph":5,"mentions":1,"tokens":["长庆"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"恰好长庆出门去了，聘才便径进琴言卧室。只见绿窗深闭，小院无人，庭前一棵梅树，结满了一树黄梅，红绽半边，地下也落了几个。忽听得一声：「客来了，莫要进来！」抬头一看，檐下却挂了一个白鹦鹉，见聘才便说起话来。对面厢房内，走出一人，便来挡住道：「相公病着，不能见客，","en":"As it happened Changqing had gone out; Pincai walked straight into Qinyan's bedchamber. Green windows were tightly shut; the small yard stood empty; a plum tree bore clusters of yellow fruit, half flushed red on one side, several fallen on the ground. Suddenly a voice cried:"}],"22":[{"paragraph":17,"mentions":2,"tokens":["长庆"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"言唬了一大跳，只道又是他两个人来找他。原来素兰候了一回，不见琴言过来，只得着人来请，对他师傅说是同到怡园去的。长庆应允，就催琴言起来。净了脸，吃了一碗冰燕，命跟班的捡出几件衣裳包了，带上车，辞了长庆，即到素兰处来。","en":"had sent a man to fetch him, with word to his master that they were going together to the Garden of Contentment. Changqing gave his consent and hurried Qinyan up. He washed his face, ate a bowl of iced bird's-nest, had his attendant pick out a few garments and wrap them in a bundle to take on the cart, took his leave of Changqing, and went straight to Sulan's."}],"26":[{"paragraph":4,"mentions":4,"tokens":["长庆"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"簿上是不挂的。就是那个琴言，从前他师傅也领他来过，不过没有进来。」华公子道：「那琴言是谁的徒弟？」珊枝道：「是长庆的徒弟。」公子道：「长庆，你的师傅也不是叫长庆吗？」珊枝答应：「是。奴才本在联锦班，后进登春的。」公子道：「为什么要进登春呢？」珊枝道：「那长庆的脾气不好，奴才伤触了他，他因把奴才挑换了登春的绣芳。绣芳出了师，才买这琴言，不过半年多呢。」","en":"here by his master, though he never made it inside.\\" \\"Whose apprentice is Qinyan?\\" the Young Master asked. \\"He is Changqing's apprentice.\\" \\"Changqing... wasn't your master also named Changqing?\\" \\"Yes,\\" Shanzhi replied. \\"This servant originally belonged to the Lianjin Troupe before joining the Dengchun Troupe.\\" \\"Why did you switch?\\" \\"Changqing has a terrible temper, and I"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":1,"tokens":["长庆"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"去夺他。」聘才道：「度香所爱的是宝珠，琴言不是真喜欢的。公子若当真喜欢他，晚生倒认识，而且常照顾他。他的师傅叫长庆，最爱的是钱，听得公子要，必十分巴结，送上门来的。」华公子倒踌躇不定，心上总碍着徐子云，又因琴言进来，也只得九人，宝珠是断乎不能买的，因此犹豫。聘才再三解说，竭力怂慂，才把华公子说动了，便道：「你明日且先去，看看可行则行，如他们不愿，也就罢了。就买进","en":"not Qinyan,\\" Pincai countered. \\"If the Master desires him, I can assure you it is possible. I know his master, Changqing, quite well, and often patronize his troupe. Changqing loves silver above all else. If he learns the Master wants him, he will crawl to oblige and deliver the boy gift-wrapped.\\" The Young Master hesitated, weighed down by the thought of Xu Ziyun. Furthermore,"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":1,"tokens":["长庆"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"明日早饭后，聘才带了四儿，坐了大鞍车，即出城找着了叶茂林，茂林就搭了聘才的车到长庆处来。劈面遇见了张仲雨，两边停了车，茂林让过一边，等聘才出来说话。仲雨问起聘才，聘才把华公子托他之事说了。仲雨道：「怪不得他前天如此高兴，总赏了一百多金子，又将自己的玉佩，给了琴言、宝珠。」","en":"breakfast, Pincai took Si'er and a large saddle-cart out of the city to find Ye Maolin. Maolin rode with him to Changqing's residence. Along the way, they ran into Zhang Zhongyu. Both carts halted, and Maolin yielded the right of way as Pincai stepped out to speak. When Zhongyu asked about their errand, Pincai explained the Young Master's commission. \\"No wonder he was so"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":6,"tokens":["长庆"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"到了琴言门口，叶茂林先下来，同了聘才进内。恰好长庆在家，请进坐了。长庆打量了聘才一回，又因是叶茂林同来，便当是不要紧人，淡淡招呼了几句。茂林道：「这位魏师老爷，是华公府的师老爷，与公子是最相好的，闻你的大名，特来相访。还有一句话要商量。」长庆听了，登时满面添花的趋奉起来，师老爷长，师老爷短，看聘才是","en":"Arriving at Qinyan's door, Maolin alighted first and entered alongside Pincai. Fortunately, Changqing was home and invited them to sit. Changqing looked Pincai over, and because he had come in Ye Maolin's company took him for a person of no consequence, greeting him coolly. Maolin interjected, \\"This is Secretary Wei, the closest confidant of Young Master"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":1,"tokens":["长庆"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"长庆听了，想了一想道：「师老爷，不是我不受抬举，实在孩子怪可怜的。是去年十月才到京，我买了他，一教就会，模样儿也好，差不多最有名的蕙芳、宝珠，也赶不上他。你能猜：","en":"Changqing listened, pondering for a moment. \\"Secretary, it is not that I refuse the honor, but the lad is truly pitiful. He had only reached the capital in the tenth month of last year. I bought him, and he has been a quick study with a handsome face. Even Huifang"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":6,"tokens":["长庆"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"所以把他换了登春班的绣芳。绣芳出师，就得了八千吊，人人知道的。如今这琴言比绣芳又强了几倍。师老爷求你对公子说，长庆如今就剩这一个好徒弟，要靠他一辈子过活。其余几个小孩子，都是不中用的，倒赔钱做衣服。一月内陪了三五天酒，还要生出事来。」聘才正要回言，叶茂林笑迷迷，拈着胡子讲道：「老庆，事情是好商量的。华公子行事，难道你不知道？人家要巴结进去也难，他来找你，就是你的","en":"seven months have passed. Not to mention others, Second Master Xu alone has poured oceans of wealth upon him.\\" Changqing stretched out his hand. \\"This much! My purse is vast, but the money is spent as fast as it is earned. You see my household of over twenty mouths? We rely entirely on him. If he goes to the mansion, he will thrive, but I will founder. He is only fifteen;"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":6,"tokens":["长庆"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"叶茂林目视长庆，长庆见他生气，便赔着笑道：「师老爷不要动气，请坐，再商量。」聘才道：「商量什么？我也没有这么大工夫讲这些空头话。叶先生你坐坐罢，我要走了。」说罢一径出来，叶茂林跟在后头，拉住了聘才，聘才低低的说道：「我在六合馆等你。」故意洒脱手，头也不回，上车去了","en":"Ye Maolin eyed Changqing, who, seeing the rage, smiled placatingly. \\"Secretary, please calm down. Sit, let us discuss this.\\" \\"Discuss what?\\" Pincai retorted. \\"I have no patience for hollow talk. Maolin, you may sit, but I am leaving.\\" He marched out, and Maolin chased after"}],"27":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["长庆"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说聘才从长庆处回来，听其口风狡猾，似要万金身价。","en":"When Wei Pincai returned from Changqing's place, he had heard the man's slippery tone clearly enough: Changqing seemed to be naming a price of ten thousand taels for the boy's person."},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":1,"tokens":["长庆"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"豁完了拳，讲些闲话，仲雨忽然问奚十一道：「如今有个顶好的相公叫琴言，在秋水堂住，他的师傅叫长庆，你曾见过么？」奚十一道：「没曾见，听是听得说过，是好的。」仲雨正要说时，蓉官道：「好什么？只得两三出戏。你叫他陪酒，终席不说话。\\n要他斟钟酒，是没有的事。」春林道：「好沉架子，到他家去看他，倒是从不会客的。就是从前的王吉庆、李春芳，如今红字号的袁宝","en":"Zhongyu suddenly asked Xi Eleven, \\"There's a prime actor called Qinyan lodging at Autumn-Water Hall with his teacher Changqing. Have you met him?\\" Xi replied, \\"Not seen, but heard he's good.\\" Zhongyu was about to say more when Rongguan cut in. \\"Good in what way? He has two or three pieces and no more. Call him to pour the wine and he will not open his mouth the whole feast;"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":1,"tokens":["曹长庆"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"待人没有好过，就是见那几位大人们，也是冷冷的。倒是他两个师弟天福、天寿会应酬，相貌又不好，人也不喜欢他。他师傅曹长庆，也是个古怪脾气，就是一门只爱钱，钱到了手，又不睬人了。」奚十一听了这些话，心上着实不信，对仲雨道：「你停一停，同我去看看，到底怎样？」仲雨道：「别处都去，他那里我不去，况前日我还骂了他。」众人吃了饭，又坐了一回，仲雨告辞去了。两个相公又闹了好一回方","en":"junior disciples Tianfu and Tianshou butter people up, but they have ugly faces and folk dislike them. His teacher Cao Changqing has an odd temper, loves only silver, and with silver in hand, ignores people.\\" Xi refused to believe it and said to Zhongyu, \\"Wait, come with me, and see how it is.\\" Zhongyu replied, \\"I'll go anywhere but there, and the other day I cursed him.\\" They"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":1,"tokens":["长庆"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这边琴言正在悲悲楚楚的时候，前日长庆见聘才生气走了，虽托叶茂林为他婉言，总不见茂林回信，心上有些狐疑。又想起五月间，有两个人闹来，送了四吊钱，赔了多少礼方去，听得传说是华公府的车夫。昨日听得聘才口风利害，似乎必要来的，便十分担着担子，进来与琴言商量。琴言自那日从怡园回后，直到今日总是啼","en":"Meanwhile, Qinyan was miserable. Changqing, seeing Pincai storm off, had begged Ye Maolin to mediate, but with no word returned, he grew uneasy. He remembered the two men raising a row in the fifth month, requiring a four-string payoff and apologies, rumored to be Hua mansion carters. With yesterday's"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":4,"tokens":["长庆"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"长庆进来，见了琴言啼哭，不知为着何事，便安慰他两句，就说起聘才来说的话，去的光景，要寻事生端，叫你唱不成戏的意思，我不知你心内如何。若进去了，快活倒是快活的，不过是一世奴才，永作华府家人了。琴言听了，不由得放声大哭起来。长庆没了主意，又安慰他。琴言带哭说","en":"Changqing came in and found Qinyan crying, and not knowing what it was about said a word or two to comfort him; then he told him what Pincai had said, and how he had gone off, and that they meant to pick a quarrel and see to it that he should not perform at all."},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":2,"tokens":["长庆"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"当下两人就进去房内坐了。英官、春兰即在外间坐下。那人送了两钟茶上来，有些认得春兰，问了来历，进去告知长庆。 　　长庆道：「已经回说不在家，也就不必应酬他了。」又想道：「这姓奚的，虽听得他是个冤大头，但是个没味的人，多少相公上了他的当，没处伸冤，琴言是断乎讲不来的。不然叫天福、天寿回来，或者有些甜头，也未可知。一面即打发人到戏园去叫，一面自己穿了衣裳、鞋","en":"remained in the outer room. The man served two cups of tea, recognized Chunlan, asked their provenance, and informed Changqing. Changqing said, \\"I already said I'm not home, so there's no need to entertain.\\" He thought, \\"This Xi, I've heard he's a sucker and tasteless. Many actors have been ruined with no redress, and Qinyan is hopeless with him. Or I could summon Tianfu and"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":1,"tokens":["长庆"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"：「你又怎么，你师傅请我来有何话说？」琴言道：「我今番真要死了，不比从前还可捱得下去。」素兰忙问何事，琴言就把长庆的话述了一遍。素兰也觉吃惊，发怔了半天，方问道：「你师傅的意思怎样？」琴言道：「师傅也没有主意，似乎两难，只有我死了，便了结了。」素兰道：「你开口就说死，事情须细细的商量。况现在并没有闹事，又没人逼你，且缓缓的想个法儿。」琴言道：「有什么法想？你忘了","en":"time I truly die; it's not like before when I was merely enduring.\\" Sulan pressed for answers, and Qinyan relayed Changqing's dilemma. Sulan was shocked and silent, then asked, \\"What is your teacher's intent?\\" Qinyan replied, \\"Teacher is undecided; both paths are hard. Only my death can close it.\\" Sulan admonished, \\"Death is your first word. Think slowly. Besides, no trouble"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":2,"tokens":["长庆"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"且说长庆出来见了奚十一，请了个安，举眼看他，相貌魁梧，身材高大，满脸的烟气，似有怒容。那一个是个獐头鼠目，短小身材。又见两个俊俏跟班，一个认得是春兰，就请客房坐下。奚十一道：「我姓奚，想来你也知道，不用我说。我听得你这里有个琴言，特来会会他，快些叫他出来。」","en":"Meanwhile, Changqing came out to Xi Eleven, bowed, and studied him. Xi was burly and tall, his smoky face dark with anger; his companion was weasel-snouted and mouse-eyed, short, with two handsome tail-boys. He recognized Chunlan and ushered them into the guest room. Xi"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":1,"tokens":["长庆"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"日进城。没有的话，快叫出来，为什么要躲着不见人？躲别人也罢了，难道你不打听打听，我是躲得过的么？你不要发昏。」长庆看势头不好，像是有意来的，便一面赔笑支吾，一面打算个搪塞他的法子，只得把大帽子，且压他一压，且看怎样。便满面堆着笑道：「不瞒大老爷说，我们班里近日串了几出新戏，前在怡园演了一个月，才上台。前日华公子即在徐老爷处见了，就把他们叫了进府，唱了两天了，还要","en":"him? You might hide others, but didn't you ask who I am? Do you think you can hide from me? Don't play stupid.\\" Changqing saw his ill intent, smiled, and stalled, planning a delay; he had to deploy a big hat first to intimidate him. Heaping on smiles, he said: \\"In truth, our troupe lately staged new plays. After a month at the Garden, they just opened. The other day, Young"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":1,"tokens":["长庆"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"天领他来见见我。就是华公子，我们也是世交，你对他说，是我叫他，他也不好意思不放回的。」说罢，便解开了两个扣子。长庆替他脱了衫子，折好了，交与春兰，即请他到吃烟去处，亮轩也随了进去。","en":"and I are family friends; you tell him I summoned him, and he cannot refuse to give face.\\" He undid two buttons. Changqing peeled off his jacket, folded it, handed it to Chunlan, and ushered him into the smoking room; Liangxuan followed."},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":2,"tokens":["长庆"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"奚十一的法宝是随身带的，春兰便从一个口袋中，一样一样的拿出来，摆在炕上。长庆陪了，给他烧了几口，心上又起了坏主意，赔着笑道：「小的还有两个徒弟：「一个叫天福，一个叫天寿，今日先叫他们伺候，迟日再叫琴言到府上来，不知大老爷可肯赏脸？」奚十一既吹动了烟，即懒得起来。又想他如此殷懃，便也点点头，说：「叫来看看。」长庆着人叫了天福、","en":"Xi's smoking apparatus traveled with him; Chunlan unpacked it from a pocket piece by piece onto the kang. Changqing attended him and burned several bowls. A wicked idea struck him, and he smiled: \\"This small one has two more disciples, one named Tianfu and one Tianshou. Today let them serve you, and another day I will bring Qinyan to your mansion, if the Great Master"},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":1,"tokens":["长庆"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"请过了安，又见亮轩。长庆叫他们来陪着烧烟，自己抽空走了。","en":"After bowing, they greeted Liangxuan. Changqing had them attend the pipe, and then slipped away."},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":1,"tokens":["长庆"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"春兰、巴英官看不入眼，便走出去，各处闲逛。走到里面，看见些堂客们，知系长庆的家眷。又见东边一个小门半掩着，二人便推开进去，见静悄悄的，有株大梅树。上面三间屋子，东边的窗心糊的绿纱，里面下了卷帘。二人一步步的走到窗前，从窗缝里张时，见床上坐着两个绝色的相公：「一个坐着不言语，一个低低说话，春兰却都认得。」","en":"Chunlan and Ba Yingguan couldn't stomach it. They wandered inward and saw some women—Changqing's kin. The small east door was ajar, so they pushed through into quietness. There was a big plum tree and three rooms; the east windows had green gauze with the blinds drawn. They crept to the window and peeked through the crack. There were two peerless"},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":3,"tokens":["长庆"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"都跌倒了，问春兰道：「你见琴言在那里？」春兰道：「在后面，有个小门进去。「奚十一十分大怒，不管好歹，直闯进去。长庆业已听见，忙忙的从内迎将出来，劈面撞着，即赔笑问道：「大老爷要往那去？里面都是内眷住的。」奚十一嚷道：「我不看你的婆娘。「说了又要走，长庆已知漏了风，琴言守门的人已经看见，便进内报信去了。这边长庆如何挡得住？被奚十一一扌叉，踉踉跄跄跌倒了。","en":"\\"Where's Qinyan?\\" Chunlan pointed: \\"Behind, through the small gate.\\" Xi was beyond furious and stormed inward. Changqing heard the commotion and rushed to intercept him, smiling: \\"Great Master, where are you bound? Inside are the women's quarters.\\" Xi roared, \\"I am not here for your women!\\" and tried again. Changqing knew word had leaked—the gatekeeper must have seen and"},{"paragraph":30,"mentions":2,"tokens":["长庆"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"奚十一走进院子，只见下了窗子，就戳破窗心，望了一望，不见其人，便转到中间，见房门锁着，便要钥匙开门。长庆赶来说道：「这是我的亲戚姓伍的住的，钥匙他带出去了，房里也没有什么看头。」奚十一欲要打进去，又似踌躇，春兰道：「小的亲眼看见，还有英官同见的，如今必躲在床底下了。」长庆道：「青天白日你见了鬼了。」春兰道：「我倒没有见鬼，你尽说鬼话。」奚十一怒气冲天，","en":"lowered; he poked the gauze, found it empty, turned to the center, and found the door locked. He demanded the keys. Changqing ran up: \\"That is my kinsman Wu's room; the keys were carried off, and there's nothing worth seeing inside.\\" Xi hesitated, but Chunlan interjected: \\"This small one saw him, and so did Ba Yingguan; he must be under the bed.\\" Changqing protested, \\"In broad"},{"paragraph":31,"mentions":5,"tokens":["长庆"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"院子里有个后门虚掩着，就知从这门出去了，便气得不可开交，先把琴言床帐扯下，顺手将桌子一翻，零星物件，打得满地。长庆见了心中甚怒，又不敢发作。想要分辩两句，不防奚十一一把揪住，连扇了五个嘴巴。长庆气极欲要动手，自己力不能敌，红着半边脸，高声说道：「我的祖太爷，你放手咱们外面讲。你受了谁的赚，凭空来吵闹，我虽吃了戏饭，也没有见无缘无故的打上门来，我们到街上去讲理。」","en":"down Qinyan's bed-curtains first, then overturned the table and sent the small things smashing about the floor. Changqing was furious and dared not show it; and when he tried to say a word in his own defence Xi seized hold of him and gave him five slaps one after the other. Changqing wanted to strike back but was overmatched, half his face turning red. He shouted, \\"My ancestor,"},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":3,"tokens":["长庆"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"长庆受了这一场打骂，不敢哼一声，关上门，即叫人到兰保处找回琴言，素兰连兰保也送了过来。大家说起这奚十一一味凶蛮，真是可怕，只怕其中又有人调唆出来，日后还不肯干休。一个魏聘才冤仇未解，又添出个奚十一来，如何是好？说得长庆更无主意，越发害怕，琴言只是哭泣。兰","en":"Changqing took that beating mutely, shut the gate, and sent someone to Lanbao's house for Qinyan. Sulan had sent Lanbao back as well. They all spoke of Xi Eleven's savage, lawless temper and agreed that a man who could erupt so suddenly was frightening indeed."}],"28":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":5,"tokens":["长庆"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说长庆被打之后甚是着急，只得仍去央求叶茂林，同到华公府聘才书房负荆请罪，情愿先送进来，分文不要。聘才见他小心赔礼，且说一钱不要，便甚得意，只道他一怒之后，使他愧悔送上门来，应了前日所说的话，便找了珊枝，请公子出来说了，华公子道：「为何不要身价呢？」聘才说：","en":"Word came that after his beating, Changqing was beside himself. He had no choice but to beseech Ye Maolin once more, and together they made their way to Secretary Wei's study in the Young Master Hua mansion. There they offered thorns on their bare backs to beg pardon, pledging to hand the boy"},{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["长庆"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"至明日，长庆即把琴言送到华府，公子又细细的打量了一回，心中甚喜，即拨在留青精舍伺候。又领他到华夫人处叩见，华夫人见他弱质婷婷，毫无优伶习气，也说了个「好」字，华公子是更不必说。琴言心上总是惦记子玉，也只好暗中洒泪，背地长吁。过了几天，见华公子脾气是正正经经的，没","en":"The next morning, Changqing delivered Qinyan to the Hua mansion. The Young Master scrutinized him again in fine detail, found himself exceedingly pleased, and assigned him to attend to them at the Quiet-Green Retreat. Qinyan was also led in to kowtow before Lady Hua. Observing"}],"37":[{"paragraph":6,"mentions":2,"tokens":["长庆"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"宝珠看琴言的眼睛似像哭肿的，想是为师傅了。子云也看出来，太息了一声道：「玉侬真是个多情人，长庆待他也不算好，他还哭得这样，这也难得。」众人尽皆太息。琴言听了，触起昨日的气来，便脸有怒容。又见子玉在旁，总是为他而起，他一阵酸楚，流下泪来。众人齐相劝慰，殊不知琴言别有悲伤，并不是为了长庆。众人既不知道，又不便告诉人，闷在心里，越想越气，要忍也忍不","en":"his teacher. Ziyun had also noticed this and sighed quietly. \\"Yunong is truly a tender-hearted soul,\\" he said. \\"Changqing did not treat him particularly well, and yet he has wept like this for him; that is rare indeed.\\" Everyone present sighed in sympathy. When Qinyan heard this, it stirred up yesterday's resentment, casting an expression of anger across his face. Then"}],"42":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["长庆"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说琴言在怡园与子玉叙了几日，颇觉十分畅满。到长庆葬事过了，忙了两三天，琴言辛苦了，身子有些不快起来，意欲安顿几天，再进华府。一日早饭后，卧在房中，见他师娘进来，琴言连忙站起。师娘叫他坐了，说道：「从前你进华府，不知华公子怎样对你师父讲的，师父也没有对我说过。他在时我诸事不管，如今是要我支持门户了。","en":"delightful days at the Garden of Contentment in the company of Ziyu, feeling thoroughly content and at ease. After Changqing's funeral concluded, the ensuing bustle of two or three days left Qinyan rather worn out and slightly unwell. He thought to rest quietly for a few more days before returning to the Hua household. One morning after breakfast, he was resting in his room"},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":1,"tokens":["长庆"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"二千。这几天在琴言身上盘算，把个心想昏了。又恐琴言存着坏心，道是师父死了，便可撒开。所以长庆媳妇的心，想钱倒与长庆一样，可称良偶。便要紧挤住了琴言，做个靠山吃山、靠水吃水的主意。见琴言不语，便生疑虑，又道：「你怎么不说话？多少总要有个定数。」琴言道：「当日师父将我送进华府，原是避难，我实不知是怎样讲的。华府有钱给他，没有钱给他，我也不知。且我进去之后，从没有见着","en":"consider himself free and cut loose from her. Thus, Changqing's widow, possessing much the same appetite for money as Changqing himself had, proved a well-matched pair in that respect. She pressed Qinyan hard, determined to use him as her meal ticket. Seeing him remain silent, she grew suspicious and spoke again. \\"Why do you not speak? Whatever the amount, there must be a settled"},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":2,"tokens":["长庆"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"那伍麻子在旁，见大傻子先走了，看这位又是心神不定，像有心事，倒也猜不着他要跑。那长庆的媳妇，自从丈夫死后，家里还是第一回开张留客，叫伍麻子好好照料，不要待慢了老斗，故常在窗前站立。那两个孩子本来不会说话，夹七夹八的。亮轩更坐不住，横竖迟早皆走，吃完了，嗽了口，对天福道：「今日扰了你们，我只好明日补情的了，今日却没有带钱。」天福听了，","en":"were frightened and fell silent.\\n\\nWu Mazi was a man who knew nothing of proper conduct, and reckoned that since Changqing was dead his cousin depended entirely on him. If the first business after reopening went like this it would look bad for him, and he had been the one who urged the visitors to stay. His temper flared. \\"Master Ji, that is not a reasonable way to talk."},{"paragraph":30,"mentions":1,"tokens":["长庆"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"伍麻子虽不认的字，但长庆生前将票子叫他取钱，也不知取了若干。一字到十字这几个，凭你怎样字写，他都认得。灯下一看见是两吊，便叫道：「姬老爷转来！」亮轩欲待不理他，已跟进了门，只得应道：「还有什么？」伍麻子道：「这两吊钱怎样，是赏我的么？那相公开发，酒席钱呢？」亮轩道：「我不晓","en":"Wu Mazi could not read, but Changqing in his lifetime had sent him to fetch money against notes many times over. The characters from one to ten, however they were written, he knew every one. He held the notes under the lantern: two strings of cash. \\"Master Ji! Come back!\\"\\n\\nLiangxuan would"}],"43":[{"paragraph":21,"mentions":1,"tokens":["长庆"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"航来看蕙芳，蕙芳即与他吃了饭，谈了一会，春航去了。茂林已在外面候了多时。定更后了，茂林提了灯笼，照着蕙芳，到了长庆家。也不找琴言，找了伍麻子，请了长庆媳妇出来。蕙芳见他扎了白包头，穿了孝衫，下面倒是条长绿绸裤子，白布弓鞋，黄瘦脸儿，长挑身材，三十来岁年纪，像个嘴尖舌利的人。见了蕙芳却不认识，问茂林道：「这位是谁？」茂林道：「这是班里的苏大相公。」蕙芳上前见了礼，","en":"some time. After the first watch, Maolin took up a lantern, lit the way for Huifang, and the two arrived at the Changqing household. They did not seek out Qinyan but found Wu Mazi and asked for the widow, the wife of Changqing. Huifang saw a woman emerge who wore a white mourning kerchief and a white hemp jacket, below which she had on a long green silk skirt with white"}],"44":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["长庆"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴言出师之日，就是华公子赏花之日。明日，华公子吩咐珊枝着人去叫琴言回来，珊枝派了一个外跟班姚贤，一早出城。到了长庆寓处，见了伍麻子。说假期已过，叫他进城。","en":"household. Shanzhi dispatched an outer attendant named Yao Xian, who set out early for the city gate. Arriving at the Changqing lodgings, he found Wu Mazi and delivered word that the leave period had expired and Qinyan was to return to the city."},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":1,"tokens":["长庆"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"正月二十七日，小价琴言因其师长庆病故，告假一月，经理丧葬，今已逾假数日。弟于昨日着家人姚贤出城唤彼回来，始知吾兄已为琴言出师，并已收用。今将其箱笼什物一并送上，祈即查收转交，想琴言断无颜面前来自取也。但闻此子下流已甚，曾于各处陪酒，不择所从，惟利是爱，弟闻之发指。本欲拘回重处，犹恐","en":"\\"On the twenty-seventh day of the first month, my household page Qinyan, following the death of his shifu Changqing, was granted one month's leave to manage the funeral arrangements. As this leave has now been exceeded by several days, I sent my man Yao Xian to the city outskirts yesterday to summon him back, and only then learned that my elder brother had arranged"}],"58":[{"paragraph":11,"mentions":1,"tokens":["长庆"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"又说他那日晚上，还给了他们十几吊钱，亮轩似信不信的。后来伍麻子即跟了长庆的媳妇回扬州去了，此话绝无对证。三人讲了些闲话，奚十一便问大傻子，那些相公在什么地方。大傻道：「今日就只王兰官、苏蕙芳在家，其余都出门去了。」奚十一道：「我要看看花，你同我们去。」大傻便领了奚、姬二人，从东边进了一重门，见是一带游廊，假山层迭，花木扶","en":"He also claimed he had given them over a dozen strings of cash that night, which Ji half believed. Later Wu the Pockmark had followed Changqing's widow back to Yangzhou, so the story could not be checked. The three chatted, and Xi Eleven asked Big Fool where the actors were. Big Fool replied, \\"Today only Wang Lanbao and Su Huifang are home, the rest are out.\\" Xi demanded, \\"I want to see the flowers, so take us.\\" Big Fool led Xi and Ji through an east door into a gallery of layered rockwork, scattered trees, and thousands of pots large and small. There were pavilions, terraces, and pools, all quite charming. Below a main tower hung a cold-gold placard reading \\"Nine-Fragrance Tower\\" in the zhuangyuan's own brush. Xi and Ji toured the garden. By the pond were willows, hibiscus, chrysanthemums, and a small bridge, across from which was a building whence laughter came. Xi asked who it was, and Big Fool explained, \\"Those are Wang Lanbao's rooms. Tian the zhuangyuan and Shi the Hanlin are there today.\\" Xi thought it impolite to intrude and stood by the pond awhile. At the garden gate someone entered in a new coat, hat, and boots, whip in hand, striding onto the little stone bridge."}]}`),"char-57":{1:[{paragraph:6,mentions:1,tokens:["史曾望"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"表兄，与仲清亲上加亲，翁婿甚为相得。那一位姓史名南湘，号竹君，是湖广汉阳人，现年二十四岁，已中了本省解元。父亲史曾望现为吏科给事中。这两人同是才高八斗，学富五车，但两人的情性却又各不相同。仲清是孤高自洁，坦白为怀。将他的学问与子玉比较起来，子玉是纯粹一路，仲清是旷达一路。一切人情物理，仲清不过略观大概，不求甚解。子玉则钩探索隐，精益求精。",en:"years old and had already claimed the title of Jieyuan—the top scholar in his provincial examination. His father, Shi Zengwang, currently served as a Supervising Secretary in the Ministry of Personnel. Both young men possessed towering intellects and learning profound enough to fill five carts, yet their temperaments could not have been more distinct. Zhongqing was solitary,"}],49:[{paragraph:13,mentions:1,tokens:["史鉴湖"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"就是那两位明经，我不知道他家世。至于梅铁庵、王质夫、刘定之，及已故的颜穆堂，还有你令泰山袁海楼，与史庶常的令尊史鉴湖，都是我们同年。现在还以还有些做部属司官的，有几位做州县的。这也是人生不齐之数。我们这一科也就算好了，已经有好几位坐了一品。」又讲了些别的话。子云坐久了，见时候不早，告辞出城。在车内想了一会，道：「湘帆太便宜了，不如等他来求我，我再与他讲。」便一径自",en:`Tie'an, Wang Zhifu, Liu Dingzhi, the late Yan Mutang, as well as your father-in-law Yuan Hailou and Shi's father Shi Jianhu, we all passed in the same year. Now, some serve as ministry directors, some as prefects and magistrates. This is the uneven fate of human life. But our cohort has done well; quite a few have reached the first rank." They spoke of other matters for a`}]},"char-58":{2:[{paragraph:1,mentions:1,tokens:["袁海楼"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"年团拜，已定了联锦班，在姑苏会馆唱戏。这回只怕人不多，现在放外任与出差的不少，大约不过三四桌人。」梅学士道：「袁海楼巡抚云南，苏列侯奉命山右。其余学差者有二人，司道出京者三人，余下不过此眼前数人，大约还不满四席了。」王文辉又到里头去见了颜夫人，彼此道了些家常闲话，即提起他次女琼华十六岁了，尚未字人，托士燮留心物色。士燮答应，随又说道：「择女婿也是一件难事，尽有外貌",en:'official duties, we will likely fill no more than three or four tables." Academician Mei said, "Provincial Governor Yuan Hailou is in Yunnan, and Marquis Su has been ordered to Shanxi. Two others are serving as Education Commissioners, while three have departed the capital as Provincial Administration and Surveillance Commissioners. The remainder are merely the few of us present,'}],5:[{paragraph:2,mentions:1,tokens:["袁浩"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"现年二十五岁。由一品萌生，得了员外郎在部行走。二十二岁，又中了一个举人。夫人袁氏，年方二十三岁，是现任云南巡抚袁浩之女。生得花容绝代，贤淑无双，而且蕙质兰心，颂椒咏絮，正与子云是瑶琴玉瑟，才子佳人，夫妻相敬如宾，十分和爱，已生了一子一女。",en:"also passed the provincial examinations as a juren. His wife, née Yuan, was twenty-three years old, daughter of Yuan Hao, the current Governor of Yunnan. She was surpassingly beautiful, supremely virtuous, and possessed literary gifts of the orchid and cassia. She and Ziyun were perfectly matched, a talented man and a beauty, loving and mutually respectful, as lute paired"}],49:[{paragraph:12,mentions:1,tokens:["海楼"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"也比不上他。」子云道：「总是天恩祖德，家父一路算平稳，没有遇着风波。至于家岳也就遇着好些蹭蹬的事。」苏侯道：「海楼先生过于耿直，我想做他的属员是不容易的。」又问道：「今年有个点庶常的叫史南湘，是大名道史同年的儿子。这人倒有些才名，只不见他出来。」子云笑道：「史竹君是个清高疏放人，现寓在门生园里，老师有教训他的话？」苏侯道：「也没有什么话。我就听得有人说，他见那些",en:'storms. As for my father-in-law, he has met with several stumbles along the way." Su the Marquis commented, "Mr. Hailou is overly upright and unbending; I imagine being his subordinate is no easy task." He then asked, "This year, a new Hanlin bachelor named Shi Nanxiang was selected; he is the son of Intendant Shi of Daming, who passed the same year as I did. This man'},{paragraph:13,mentions:1,tokens:["袁海楼"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"所好，你方才说这几位，就是那两位明经，我不知道他家世。至于梅铁庵、王质夫、刘定之，及已故的颜穆堂，还有你令泰山袁海楼，与史庶常的令尊史鉴湖，都是我们同年。现在还以还有些做部属司官的，有几位做州县的。这也是人生不齐之数。我们这一科也就算好了，已经有好几位坐了一品。」又讲了些别的话。子云坐久了，见时候不早，告辞出城。在车内想了一会，道：「湘帆太便宜了，不如等他来求我，",en:`graduates. But as for Mei Tie'an, Wang Zhifu, Liu Dingzhi, the late Yan Mutang, as well as your father-in-law Yuan Hailou and Shi's father Shi Jianhu, we all passed in the same year. Now, some serve as ministry directors, some as prefects and magistrates. This is the uneven fate of human life. But our cohort has done well; quite a few have reached the first rank." They`}]},"char-59":JSON.parse(`{"5":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":[],"kind":"identified-reference","zh":"单讲这位徐子云的本支，其父名震，由翰林出身，现做了大学士，总督两广。","en":"The previous chapter told of Lin Chunxi and Zhongqing discussing the poetry-gathering at the Garden of Contentment. Now let us set the stage for that garden. There was a prince among young noblemen, a leader of literary men, by the name of Xu Ziyun, style name Duxiang, a native of Shanyin County in Zhejiang. Speaking of his family lineage, it was truly among the foremost of the age, boasting seven generations of official distinction, with grandfathers and grandsons serving as prime ministers, fathers and sons as Ministers of State, and brothers as governors-general. Of Xu Ziyun's own line, his father, named Zhen, rose through the Hanlin Academy and now served as Grand Secretary and Governor-General of the Two Guang provinces. His elder brother, Zirong, also a Hanlin graduate, had served as a censor and been appointed Inspector of the Huai-Yang Circuit.","identityNote":{"en":"Xu Zhen is introduced as Ziyun’s father, with his given name and office.","zh":"此处以子云之父的身份，明言其名震及所任官职。"}}],"24":[{"paragraph":5,"mentions":2,"tokens":["徐中堂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，由守备起来，在军营出力，今作了提台。度香说与他有世谊，因鄙其为人，是以不与往来。从前华公爷作大经略，平倭寇，徐中堂是副经略，同在军营。那时老奚才作四川游击，是华公爷、徐中堂保举起来，即得了副将，旋升总兵，前年又升了江南提督。籍系广东嘉应州，家道甚丰，足有正千万的事业，又在省城当了个洋行总商。他共有兄弟十二人，有作官的，有当商的。他本要捐个道台，因花动了银子，凑不","en":"Zhongqing laughed heartily. \\"What a vile mouth! Mao was merely teasing his readers. He only listed titles in his commentary on *Story of the Pipa*, such as 'Li Ling Returns to Han,' 'Prince Dan Destroys Qin,' 'Zhuge Yan Nian,' and 'The Bright Consort Returns to Han'—eight or nine in total.\\" Yulin continued, \\"Jingyi has added four more: 'Green Pearl Throws Herself from the Golden Valley Garden,' 'Consort Yang Follows the Carriage at Mawei Post,' 'Li the Banished Immortal Receives the Edict at Yelang,' and 'Du the Remonstrator Honored in the Golden Hall.' These require huge casts, with nearly everyone on stage.\\" Zhongqing nodded, \\"Those four are magnificent; they give vent to the sorrows of lovers and scholars across the world. The silken noose at Mawei breaks every heart. As for An Lushan's rebellion, the fault lay squarely with Yang Guozhong—what crime did the Lady commit? Popular tales love to slander the harem. The scandalous bath scene appears in neither the Old nor the New Book of Tang; it stems entirely from Yuan Zhen's cheap line about washing the child in the golden-rooster tent, which posterity mistakenly took as historical proof. It is hateful. The traitorous minister was executed, and the army was pacified—that was reasonable enough. But Chen Yuanli lacked both a loyal heart and proper troop discipline, and should have been cast out. If we were to reverse these historical wrongs, so many more would remain.\\" Wang Xun asked how many actors were rehearsing. Guibao replied, \\"Ten female roles, alongside twenty-some sheng, jing, lao, and chou actors drawn from five or six different companies.\\" Zhongqing asked, \\"Who are the ten dan performers?\\" Guibao replied, \\"Besides the two of us, there are Yaoqing, Meixiang, Xiangwan, Jingfang, Shouxiang, and Xiaomei. Yunong and Yuyan joined later, making ten in all.\\" Wang Xun said, \\"That makes a Ten-Beauties company.\\" Guibao added, \\"The guest list isn't entirely settled yet, but you two are certainly included. I heard Duxiang wrote to Baoding to invite Qianzhou back, likely just for this occasion.\\" Wang Xun noted, \\"It's drawing close. Today is already the twenty-sixth. Are ten days enough to prepare all these new plays?\\" Yulin laughed, \\"You've forgotten the intercalary fifth month! We still have over a month remaining.\\" Wang Xun chuckled at his own absentmindedness, \\"I've been so secluded lately, I've completely lost track of the days.\\" Zhongqing then asked if Qinyan was still ill. Yulin replied, \\"After spending that day on the canal with Yuxiang, he mended almost immediately.\\" Wang Xun smiled, \\"Joy truly lifts the spirit.\\" Zhongqing then asked if Qiguan's hands had healed. At this, Yulin lowered his eyes, his brows knit together, a dark shadow of anger crossing his face. When they pressed him for the reason, Guibao explained that Zhongqing's mention of Qiguan had touched a raw nerve. He recounted the horrific trick Xi Eleven had played with the wooden barrel at the workshop. Zhongqing and Wang Xun cursed aloud. \\"That such vile people exist—how do their victims manage to live?\\" Guibao sighed, \\"He is currently hiding out in Tianjin, but he may yet return.\\" Zhongqing asked about Xi's background, and Guibao traced it back: \\"Xi the Eleventh's stock is by no means humble. His forebears were merchants in the foreign trade; his grandfather rose to Provincial Administration Commissioner on military merit. His father inherited the rank of Cloud Cavalry Commandant, began as a garrison major, distinguished himself in the field, and is now Provincial Military Commander. Duxiang says the families are old connections, but he despises the man and will have nothing to do with him. Years ago, when Duke Hua was Grand Commandant and put down the Japanese pirates, Grand Secretary Xu served as his deputy, and both were with the army. Old Xi was then only a brigade sub-commander in Sichuan; it was Duke Hua and Grand Secretary Xu who recommended him. He was made a vice-brigade general, was soon promoted to Regional Commander, and the year before last rose to Provincial Military Commander of Jiangnan. The family is registered at Jiaying Department in Guangdong and is exceedingly rich — a full ten million in property — and holds the post of senior merchant of a foreign hong in the provincial capital. He has twelve brothers in all, some in office and some in trade. He meant to purchase a circuit intendant's seat, but having already spent the silver he could not make up the sum, and settled for a departmental magistracy — and he is very nearly due for appointment.\\" Wang Xun recalled that his own elders knew the man, who was also nicknamed 'Xi Old Opium' because of the ten thousand taels and more he made peddling raw opium. As Yulin and Guibao rose to leave, Wang Xun pressed them to stay for supper, sending word to the kitchen."}],"27":[{"paragraph":7,"mentions":1,"tokens":["徐中堂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"弟是常劝他去走走。东家说，这是从前在军营保举的老师，那时华公子还小，说起来也未必知道，所以不肯去。就是现在那位徐中堂，做两广总督的，也是老师在军营同拜的，如今只有二少爷在京里。我前日在街上看见他，坐着辆飞沿后挡车，有七八匹马跟着，相貌很体面，我看他将来也要做督抚的。我们东家也是不肯去，不知道什么脾气。」仲雨笑道：「徐二爷原是个顶阔的阔人，他与华公子真是一对。前日我","en":"Zhongyu laughed. \\"That is the talk outside. Still, the Hua lands run to forty-odd estates, and a year's rent from them would answer for a whole prefecture's grain tax. They are rich enough, certainly.\\" Liangxuan nodded. \\"My patron often speaks of it — that Young Master Hua is an uncle of his own generation, and that the old Duke Hua was the teacher of my former patron, the Provincial Military Commander. With a family connection as good as that, and yet my patron will not cultivate it. I am forever urging him to call. He says the tie came of a recommendation in camp, that Young Master Hua was a child at the time and would not know him if he heard the name; and so he will not go. It is the same with Grand Secretary Xu, who is Governor-General of Guangdong and Guangxi now — he and my old master were sworn brothers in the same camp. Only the Second Young Master is left in the capital. I saw him in the street the other day, in a carriage with flying eaves and seven or eight horses behind it, and a very handsome presence; I should say he will be a governor himself one day. And still my patron will not call. There is no knowing his temper.\\" Zhongyu laughed. \\"Second Master Xu is a very great spender indeed — he and Young Master Hua make a pair. The other day I begged and exerted myself a great deal on your patron's behalf, and he knows nothing about it, and I have never told him. By rights your patron owes me heavy thanks.\\" Liangxuan pressed to know what the matter was, but Zhongyu only smiled. \\"You will hear in good time. There is no need to speak of it now.\\" Just then Xi Eleven came out, shuffling in a pair of fine woven-grass sandals, triple-dyed fragrant-cloud trousers, and a pheasant-pattern ramie jacket, with Ba Yingguan behind holding a black lacquer foreign fan traced in gold, fanning at him now light now hard as he came out grinning. Liangxuan stood up and Zhongyu nodded to him; Xi sat down, and Zhongyu asked, \\"Have you been busy today?\\""}],"38":[{"paragraph":8,"mentions":1,"tokens":["徐中堂"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"从前徐中堂在京时，也与他相好，并有些事情请教他，又请他代代笔，作些诗文，所以子云以长者相待。史南湘是同乡后辈，不消说是认识的了。","en":"In former times, when Grand Secretary Xu had been in the capital, he too had been on friendly terms with Master Qu, had consulted him on various matters, and had engaged him from time to time to compose poems and prose pieces on his behalf — which is why Ziyun treated him with the deference due to an elder. Shi Nanxiang was a younger native of the same region, and it goes without saying that he was already acquainted with him."}],"55":[{"paragraph":13,"mentions":1,"tokens":["晓山"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"年点状元的那个田君，他的父亲也算我的门生，中了进士，就不在了。他的母舅张桐孙也与我相好。这徐公子自然不用讲了，晓山相公可为善人裕后。」道翁将怡园诸人分题的对子念与，石翁也赞了几联，说道：「倒不料一班小孩子居然能这样，真是英雄出少年，我辈老头儿，倒要退避三舍了。」","en":"now gone. His uncle Zhang Tongsun is also a good friend of mine. Young Master Xu goes without saying; Minister Xiaoshan's goodness naturally blesses his descendants.\\" Daoweng then recited the matched couplets composed by the various scholars at the Garden of Contentment. Shiweng praised several of them, saying, \\"I never expected a group of children to be capable of such"}],"56":[{"paragraph":32,"mentions":1,"tokens":["晓山"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"道：「都是一班正正经经的，倒也没有那种假好人。徐度香、梅庾香之外，还有几人也是名士。」石翁笑道：「徐度香么，是晓山相国的公子，他与你相好么？」琴仙道：「是，现在先君还有一封遗书与他，托他照应的。」","en":"I knew a few other respectable scholars.\\" Lord Hou smiled knowingly. \\"Xu Duxiang, the esteemed son of Minister Xiaoshan. Are you two close?\\" Qinxian nodded stiffly. \\"Yes. My late father left a letter specifically asking him to look after me.\\""}]}`),"char-60":{5:[{paragraph:1,mentions:1,tokens:["子容"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"内，是祖孙宰相，父子尚书，兄弟督抚。单讲这位徐子云的本支，其父名震，由翰林出身，现做了大学士，总督两广。其兄名子容，也是翰林出身，由御史放了淮扬巡道。",en:"Academy and now served as Grand Secretary and Governor-General of the Two Guang provinces. His elder brother, Zirong, also a Hanlin graduate, had served as a censor and been appointed Inspector of the Huai-Yang Circuit."}]},"char-61":{6:[{paragraph:31,mentions:1,tokens:["刘侍郎"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"惊梦》有个新来的琴官，比宝珠还好。大人不信，叫他先唱一出瞧瞧，如果不中大人的意，再赶着去叫宝珠来，包管不误。」刘侍郎道：「也罢，唱了《瑶台》之后，就唱《惊梦》也使得。」那人答应几个「是！」看着文辉不言语，也就进戏房去了。聘才向子玉道：「你听见没有？」子玉点头，心上很感激文辉。",en:`first—if he fails to meet your expectations, I will rush off immediately to fetch Baozhu, guaranteeing no delay." Vice-Minister Liu intervened, "Very well, then—after 'The Jade Terrace' concludes, 'The Interrupted Dream' will do perfectly." The man eagerly agreed with a chorus of "Yes, yes, sirs!" and, seeing Wenhui mollified, hurried into the theater room. Pincai nudged Ziyu, "Did`},{paragraph:36,mentions:1,tokens:["刘侍郎"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"那些相公，到正席上去劝酒的劝酒，讲话的讲话；颇觉有趣。又见他的舅舅王文辉，分外比人高兴，后又看了一出戏。正席上刘侍郎、梅学士、吴阁学、沈司业先散。子玉见他父亲走了，天也不早，也要回去。刚起身时，忽见一个美少年上楼来。文泽的家人说道：「冯少爷来了！」冯子佩上前与众人见礼，子玉见他还不过十八九岁，生得貌如美女，十分妩媚。刘文泽道：「人家都要散了，怎么这时候才来？」冯子",en:"more exuberantly animated than anyone else in the room. Another operatic piece commenced. At the primary tables, Vice-Minister Liu, Scholar Mei, Grand Academician Wu, and Director Shen were the first to depart. Noting his father's absence and the late hour, Ziyu also prepared to leave. Just as he rose, a stunningly beautiful young man suddenly ascended the stairs. Wenze's servant"}],25:[{paragraph:1,mentions:1,tokens:["刘守正"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"。流光荏苒，倏忽一月，刘文泽已回。书中所讲这班名士，华公子向来往来者就是刘文泽一人，其余多未谋面。此时文泽之父刘守正已升了礼部尚书，是以文泽偕其妻星夜赶回，未免有些庆贺之事。又适子云写书前往，文泽回京已有半月，诸事已毕。",en:"Master Hua had long been acquainted with was Liu Wenze alone; the rest he had mostly not yet met. Wenze's father, Liu Shouzheng, had by now been promoted to Minister of Rites, and so Wenze and his wife had travelled back day and night, with all the attendant congratulations to be received. Ziyun's letter of invitation happened to arrive just then; Wenze had already been back"}],30:[{paragraph:4,mentions:1,tokens:["刘守正"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"人，日间断不能尽兴，于下贴时说明了夜宴。此日正是秋试二场，刘文泽为什么不应举呢？这一科大主考即系文泽之父大宗伯刘守正，副主考系王文辉，已升了阁学，陆宗沅、杨芳猷、周锡爵、孙亮功一班可可的一齐分房，将那一班知名之士回避了一大半。内中除徐子云、史南湘是前科举人，萧次贤是高尚自居，无心问世，只有田春航、高品入场。如子玉、王恂、文泽、仲清等皆遵例回避。子玉在家闷闷不乐，又",en:"examinations. Why didn't Liu Wenze participate? The chief examiner this time was Wenze's father, Minister of Rites Liu Shouzheng, and the associate examiner was Wang Wenhui, who had been promoted to Academician of the Grand Secretariat. Lu Zongyuan, Yang Fangyou, Zhou Xijue, and Sun Lianggong—this group of notable figures all served as associate examiners, which meant more than"}],32:[{paragraph:10,mentions:1,tokens:["刘尚书"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"春航出于第四房孙亮功门下，相见之后，亮功久已闻名，就是刘尚书、王阁学，虽未见过春航，于他儿子们书房内，见他些笔墨东西，也久已倾倒，惟恐不得其人为憾。今中了南元，十分欢喜。从此春航与文泽、王恂又成了世谊，更加亲爱。惟有孙氏昆仲颇难浃洽，然亦不得不往来，惟淡交而已。高品代枪之银已收清，共得了一千六百金。张仲雨过手",en:"Lianggong was extremely pleased that he had placed Nanyuan. He had long heard of Chunhang's reputation, as even Minister Liu and Academician Wang, though they had never met Chunhang, had seen his writing and calligraphy in their sons' studies and greatly admired him, regretting only that they had not secured him themselves. From then on, Chunhang formed a generational friendship"}],38:[{paragraph:5,mentions:1,tokens:["刘尚书"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"名重一时，爱其才品者咸比为杜少陵、孟东野。但其赋性高旷，不善治家，常为贫乏所累。后复游京师应举，两试不第，馆于刘尚书家，教过文泽两年。继为华公子请去教书，又逗留了三年，仍归乡里。守令钦其贤，举了孝廉方正，铨选了江西一个苦缺知县，任满题升了南昌府通判。去年夫人又病故了，剩了孑然一身，并无亲丁骨肉。",en:"later came to the capital to sit for the examinations but failed twice, took a post as a tutor in the household of Minister Liu, where he taught Wenze for two years. He was then engaged by the young master of the Hua family to teach, remaining there another three years before finally returning to his native place. The local magistrates, admiring his virtuous reputation, recommended"},{paragraph:6,mentions:1,tokens:["刘尚书"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"跟了有五六年，颇有良心，其余是些不关痛痒的。屈公虽则一肩行李，生平所藏金石玩器、名书古画，倒有好几箱。到京来，刘尚书念旧，见其宦囊萧索，赠了他二百金。",en:"several trunks with bronze and stone antiques, precious books, and old paintings. When he arrived in the capital, Minister Liu, mindful of their old connection, saw that Qu's official purse was thin and presented him with two hundred taels of silver."}],52:[{paragraph:3,mentions:1,tokens:["刘守正"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"带了家眷往直省候补去了，今奉差来京，也帮着春航张罗。初六那一日有两处戏酒，一处在聚星堂，请的是乡试座师礼部尚书刘守正、座师内阁学士王文辉、会试房师兵部郎中杨方猷，鸿胪寺卿周锡爵、光禄少卿陆宗沅，这两位是同乡前辈兼有年谊。张桐孙陪了这几位在聚星堂观戏，演得是联珠班。春航陪着一班名士在花园挹爽斋观演联锦班。那一天大媒是徐子云，客是萧次贤、高品、南湘、颜仲清、刘文泽、王",en:"there were two distinct banquet sites. One was at the Gathering Stars Hall, hosting Chunhang's examination mentors—Liu Shouzheng, the Minister of Rites; Wang Wenhui, Academician of the Grand Secretariat; Yang Fangyou, Director of the Ministry of War; alongside Zhou Xijue, the Chief Minister of the Court of State Ceremonial, and Lu Zongyuan, the Deputy Minister of the Court of"},{paragraph:10,mentions:1,tokens:["刘尚书"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"华公子见了刘尚书、王文辉是父执，便请了安，其余都行平礼。春航与华公子系是新亲，无甚话说，不过彼此道些仰慕之意。幸有王文辉、徐子云帮着张罗，应酬了那几位新亲，颇不寂寞。",en:"Recognizing Minister Liu and Wang Wenhui as venerable elders of his father's generation, Young Master Hua offered them respectful bows; to all the rest, he extended the courteous salutations of peers. As Chunhang and Young Master Hua were newly related and entirely unfamiliar"},{paragraph:17,mentions:1,tokens:["刘守正"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"想蕙芳在账房里，便叫了他出来。蕙芳也累苦了，乐得出来歇歇，便到文辉席上来，就在文辉旁边坐了。此处是两席，那席是刘守正、周锡爵、杨方猷，这席是王文辉、陆宗沅、张桐孙。文辉道：「这几天我知道你也累极了，所以叫你出来歇歇，此刻也应没有什么事了。」蕙芳道：「也没有什么忙，借此倒可跟着张二爷学学。那张二爷实在可以，大大小小，没有一点遗漏。」陆宗沅道：「这是张老二的专门本事。",en:'was glad for the chance to rest and went to sit beside Wenhui. The hall was divided into two tables: one seated Liu Shouzheng, Zhou Xijue, and Yang Fangyou; the other seated Wang Wenhui, Lu Zongyuan, and Zhang Tongsun. Wenhui said kindly, "I know you have been worked to the bone these past days, so I called you out to rest. By now, the heavy work should be finished." Huifang'},{paragraph:19,mentions:1,tokens:["刘尚书"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"陆宗沅笑道：「你不要带着人说，我们的胡子不是染的。」那边席上的刘尚书、周锡爵、杨方猷都笑起来，惟有张桐孙是个道学人，不会顽笑。周锡爵道：「质夫，你那乌须药的方子，可是你孙亲家传你的？」文辉道：「他那几根胡子，要用什么乌须药？」既而一想，便大笑起来。陆宗沅也明白，也笑了。",en:'Lu Zongyuan laughed, "Speak for yourself! Our beards are not dyed." At the other table, Minister Liu, Zhou Xijue, and Yang Fangyou all burst into laughter. Only Zhang Tongsun, a rigid neo-Confucian scholar, remained unamused. Zhou Xijue called out, "Zhifu, did that black-beard prescription of yours come from your Sun-family in-laws?" Wenhui replied'},{paragraph:20,mentions:2,tokens:["刘守正"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"刘守正与杨方猷不解其故，连声的问，文辉就将亮功女儿漆头发的一事讲出来，听得众人皆笑，连张桐孙也笑起来。周锡爵道：「既是这么着，质夫，你何不到班里借个假胡子带着，省得这乌黑的东西，沾染了你们如夫人的脸。」刘守正道：「这一染，就直染到胸前呢。」文辉道：「嚼你的",en:`Liu Shouzheng and Yang Fangyou, not understanding the context, pressed for an explanation. Wenhui then recounted the old story of Lianggong's daughter dyeing her hair, which sent everyone into fits of laughter—even Zhang Tongsun chuckled. Zhou Xijue suggested, "If`},{paragraph:22,mentions:1,tokens:["刘守正"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"与徐子云夫人袁绮香去陪新，吃扶头卯酒。田太夫人请了王文辉的陆氏夫人，带了他大姑奶奶蓉华并媳妇孙少奶奶佩秋，又请刘守正的夫人，没有来，他媳妇吴少奶奶紫烟来了。周锡爵、杨方猷、陆宗沅的夫人都辞了。",en:"brought along her elder daughter Ronghua and her daughter-in-law, Madam Sun Peiqiu. She also invited the wife of Liu Shouzheng, who could not attend, though her daughter-in-law, Madam Wu Ziyan, came in her stead. The wives of Zhou Xijue, Yang Fangyou, and Lu Zongyuan all politely declined."}],54:[{paragraph:2,mentions:1,tokens:["刘尚书"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"不来，外面的排场是必要的。剑潭倒还明白，表妹一切吩咐他就是了。」坐一坐，别了颜夫人回去，将子玉、仲清、王恂托了刘尚书保了。",en:`head; cousin may leave her orders with him."

He sat a while, took his leave of Lady Yan and went home, and got Minister Liu to recommend Ziyu, Zhongqing and Wang Xun.`},{paragraph:4,mentions:1,tokens:["刘尚书"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"，压倒群英，比中状元难得多了。子玉见仲清、高品、王恂等落第，心甚不安，并不以此自得，反谦谨了许多。拜了保荐老师刘尚书，是熟极的，及谒阅卷老师，苏侯见了子玉，就想起子云之言，真是吉星鸾凤，喜不可言。王文辉与陆夫人心中半喜半闷，喜的是子玉考中，闷的是王恂、仲清不中，但接着要办女儿的喜事，也就喜多闷少。",en:"On the ninth, examining ministers were assigned: Su the Marquis again chief examiner, Young Master Hua inspection officer, Ziyun receiving officer, Wenze sealing officer, and Zhang Zhongyu patrol officer. On the morning of the tenth they entered the hall. First session had eight questions: *Draft Han Edict*, *Draft Tang Memorial*, *Exegesis of the Five Classics*, *Examination of Era Names from Five Dynasties and North–South*, *Policy on River Control*, *Inquiry into the Six-Department Regulations*, *On the Pros and Cons of Salt Law Reforms*, and *On Rectifying the Root and Clearing the Source*. Second session had three grand fu compositions: *Great Rites Rhapsody*, *Great Music Rhapsody*, and *Great Hunt Rhapsody*. Third required imitative poems: *In the Style of Du Fu's Northern Expedition* and *Han Changli's South Mountain Poem*, plus original rhymes. Ziyu performed strongly across all three. From about eight hundred in session one, five hundred were cut; after session two, only three hundred remained; after session three, only sixty. Wang Xun was eliminated; Gao Pin placed forty-ninth, Zhongqing twenty-seventh, and Ziyu second. At palace-level final selection, Ziyu's star burned bright: he took top place and, among thirty-two selected, was appointed compiler. Zhongqing and Gao Pin, talented but unlucky, were both dropped. Ziyu was the youngest candidate in this cohort. Lady Yan was overjoyed—this success was said to be even harder than a standard zhuangyuan. Yet seeing his close friends fail, Ziyu felt uneasy rather than proud, and became more modest. He paid respects to recommender Liu and then to exam reader Su the Marquis. Seeing Ziyu, Su remembered Ziyun's words and thought him truly auspicious. Wang Wenhui and Madam Lu felt mixed joy and frustration: glad for Ziyu's success, vexed at Wang Xun and Zhongqing's failure, though the coming daughter wedding shifted them toward joy."}]},"char-62":{6:[{paragraph:23,mentions:2,tokens:["吴阁学"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"王、颜二人又与聘才、元茂款接了一番。只见对面楼上来了几个，先是右待郎的少君刘文泽做主，请了史给事的少君史南湘、吴阁学的外甥张仲雨、姑苏名士高品、国子监司业沈公之子沈伯才、天津镇守海口巴总兵之子巴霖，这两位就是孙氏弟兄的妻舅。还有一个本京人，原任江苏知县之子冯子佩，尚未到来。这一班人，子玉除了南湘、文泽之外，恰不认识。这刘文泽字前舟，系中州世家，已得了二品荫生。这人",en:"of the Right Vice-Minister. His guests included Shi Nanxiang, son of Censor Shi; Zhang Zhongyu, nephew of Grand Academician Wu; the renowned Suzhou scholar Gao Pin; Shen Bocai, son of Imperial College Director Shen; and Ba Lin, son of Regional Commander Ba, the coastal defender of Tianjin. The latter two were brothers-in-law to the Sun brothers. A native of the capital, Feng"},{paragraph:36,mentions:1,tokens:["吴阁学"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"上去劝酒的劝酒，讲话的讲话；颇觉有趣。又见他的舅舅王文辉，分外比人高兴，后又看了一出戏。正席上刘侍郎、梅学士、吴阁学、沈司业先散。子玉见他父亲走了，天也不早，也要回去。刚起身时，忽见一个美少年上楼来。文泽的家人说道：「冯少爷来了！」冯子佩上前与众人见礼，子玉见他还不过十八九岁，生得貌如美女，十分妩媚。刘文泽道：「人家都要散了，怎么这时候才来？」冯子佩道：「我早上进",en:`else in the room. Another operatic piece commenced. At the primary tables, Vice-Minister Liu, Scholar Mei, Grand Academician Wu, and Director Shen were the first to depart. Noting his father's absence and the late hour, Ziyu also prepared to leave. Just as he rose, a stunningly beautiful young man suddenly ascended the stairs. Wenze's servant announced, "Young Master Feng has`}]},"char-63":{6:[{paragraph:5,mentions:1,tokens:["沈恭"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"姑娘，是不能嫁人的，新年已二十九岁。嗣徽二十六，嗣元二十四，这两个废物，都已娶了亲。嗣徽娶的沈氏，是国子监司业沈恭之女，名字叫做芸姑。生得齐齐整整，伶俐聪明，嫁了过来，见了那样丈夫，便想自寻短见，被他的丫鬟苦劝，只得自己怨命。后来回了娘家，不肯过来。",en:"thoroughly useless men who had nonetheless both taken wives. Sihui had married Miss Shen, named Yungu, daughter of the Imperial College Director Shen Gong. Neat, clever, and endearing, she was driven to thoughts of despair the moment she arrived at her new home and laid eyes upon her husband. Only the desperate pleas of her maidservant stayed her hand, leaving her to resign herself to a bitter fate. She"},{paragraph:23,mentions:3,tokens:["沈公","沈司业"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"偏有那司业沈公，年老健谈，拉住了子玉，见他这样丰神秀澈，如神仙中人，想起他那位娇客来，真觉人道中，有天仙化人、魑魅魍魉两途。便问了目下所读何书，所习何文的话，子玉一一答了。子玉尚是年轻，被这些老前辈，你一句我一句的赞，倒赞得他很不好意思。沈大人放了手，子玉等告退，",en:"Just then, Imperial College Director Shen—elderly but famously talkative—seized Ziyu's arm. Struck by his extraordinary, almost ethereal beauty, and remembering his own son-in-law, he mused that the human realm held two extremes: celestial beings walking the earth, and monstrous demons. He asked"},{paragraph:36,mentions:1,tokens:["沈司业"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"的劝酒，讲话的讲话；颇觉有趣。又见他的舅舅王文辉，分外比人高兴，后又看了一出戏。正席上刘侍郎、梅学士、吴阁学、沈司业先散。子玉见他父亲走了，天也不早，也要回去。刚起身时，忽见一个美少年上楼来。文泽的家人说道：「冯少爷来了！」冯子佩上前与众人见礼，子玉见他还不过十八九岁，生得貌如美女，十分妩媚。刘文泽道：「人家都要散了，怎么这时候才来？」冯子佩道：「我早上进城到锦春",en:`Another operatic piece commenced. At the primary tables, Vice-Minister Liu, Scholar Mei, Grand Academician Wu, and Director Shen were the first to depart. Noting his father's absence and the late hour, Ziyu also prepared to leave. Just as he rose, a stunningly beautiful young man suddenly ascended the stairs. Wenze's servant announced, "Young Master Feng has arrived!" Feng Zipei`}]},"char-64":{6:[{paragraph:7,mentions:1,tokens:["巴天宠"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"这嗣元娶的是巴氏，名字叫做来凤。父亲巴天宠，是上江凤阳人，清白出身。自小当兵，生得一表人材，精于弓马，又得了军功，年才四十余岁，已升到总兵之职，现在天津镇守海口。听了媒人谎话，将个爱女嫁了嗣元。",en:"Siyuan had married a woman of the Ba clan, named Laifeng. Her father, Ba Tianchong, hailed from Fengyang in Anhui, a man of clean and respectable lineage. A soldier since his youth, possessing a striking countenance and mastery in archery and horsemanship, his martial prowess had propelled him to the rank of Regional Commander by his"}]},"char-65":{6:[{paragraph:3,mentions:1,tokens:["陆宗淮"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"这王、孙两家的陆氏夫人，是嫡堂姊妹，王家的陆氏夫人，是陆御史宗沅的堂妹，他亲哥哥叫陆宗淮，现任四川臬司。",en:"cousins. The Madam Lu of the Wang family was the paternal cousin of Censor Lu Zongyuan; her own elder brother, Lu Zonghuai, currently served as Judicial Commissioner of Sichuan."}]},"char-68":{6:[{paragraph:1,mentions:1,tokens:["詹事府正詹事庄"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"事。忙了两天，至初三日，王文辉处就有知单并三副帖子来，知单上开的是：户部侍郎刘、内阁学士吴、翰林院侍读学士梅、詹事府正詹事庄、左庶子郑、通政司王、光禄寺少卿周、国子监司业张、吏科给事中史、掌山西道陆、兵部员外郎杨、工部郎中孙、共十二位。士燮看了比去年人更少了，叫小厮拿两副帖，到书房里去与魏、李两位少爷。",en:"twelve guests: Vice Minister of Revenue Liu; Academician of the Grand Secretariat Wu; Hanlin Reader-in-Waiting Mei; Chief Administrator of the Office of the Heir Apparent Zhuang; Left Junior Steward Zheng; Commissioner of the Transmission Office Wang; Vice Minister of the Court of Imperial Entertainments Zhou; Director of Studies of the Imperial College Zhang; Supervising Secretary of the Personnel Office Shi; Circuit Censor"}]},"char-69":{6:[{paragraph:1,mentions:1,tokens:["左庶子郑"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"初三日，王文辉处就有知单并三副帖子来，知单上开的是：户部侍郎刘、内阁学士吴、翰林院侍读学士梅、詹事府正詹事庄、左庶子郑、通政司王、光禄寺少卿周、国子监司业张、吏科给事中史、掌山西道陆、兵部员外郎杨、工部郎中孙、共十二位。士燮看了比去年人更少了，叫小厮拿两副帖，到书房里去与魏、李两位少爷。",en:"Grand Secretariat Wu; Hanlin Reader-in-Waiting Mei; Chief Administrator of the Office of the Heir Apparent Zhuang; Left Junior Steward Zheng; Commissioner of the Transmission Office Wang; Vice Minister of the Court of Imperial Entertainments Zhou; Director of Studies of the Imperial College Zhang; Supervising Secretary of the Personnel Office Shi; Circuit Censor for Shanxi Lu; Vice Director"}]},"char-70":{6:[{paragraph:1,mentions:1,tokens:["国子监司业张"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"来，知单上开的是：户部侍郎刘、内阁学士吴、翰林院侍读学士梅、詹事府正詹事庄、左庶子郑、通政司王、光禄寺少卿周、国子监司业张、吏科给事中史、掌山西道陆、兵部员外郎杨、工部郎中孙、共十二位。士燮看了比去年人更少了，叫小厮拿两副帖，到书房里去与魏、李两位少爷。",en:"Zheng; Commissioner of the Transmission Office Wang; Vice Minister of the Court of Imperial Entertainments Zhou; Director of Studies of the Imperial College Zhang; Supervising Secretary of the Personnel Office Shi; Circuit Censor for Shanxi Lu; Vice Director of the Ministry of War Yang; and Director of the Ministry of Works Sun. Noting that there were even fewer names than the previous year, Scholar Mei instructed"}]},"char-72":JSON.parse(`{"3":[{"paragraph":35,"mentions":1,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，他也照数全给，断不肯短少。这是海南大纨袴，到京里来想闹点声名，做个冤桶的。此时只晓得他排行是十一，就称呼他为奚十一。那个砸碗的相公，就是蓉官说的春兰了。","en":"Lord Xi reveled in this extravagant cup of pleasure; inflate the bill as one might, he paid without a whisper of complaint, utterly refusing to appear stingy. He was a quintessential southern profligate, come to the capital to make a name for himself and to"}],"14":[{"paragraph":36,"mentions":1,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"什么事？那两个醉汉怎样了？」来人答道：「那两个闹了一夜，早上都回去了。方才来了一个面生人，说是广东人，姓奚，叫奚十一老爷。慕你的名，在家候着。」蕙芳道：「什么样儿？不要又是潘其观一类人。」来人道：「看他光景很阔，带着四个跟班，三十来岁年纪。」蕙芳道：「回他去罢，说今日不回去呢。」来人去了。","en":"and left early this morning. Just now someone unfamiliar has called, saying he is a Cantonese gentleman named Xi, Xi Eleven. He greatly admires your name and is waiting at home.\\" Huifang said, \\"What sort of man is he? Don't tell me he is another Pan Qiguan type.\\" The servant said, \\"By appearances he is quite well-off, and he has four attendants with him, around"},{"paragraph":37,"mentions":3,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"蕙芳进来，春航问起何事？蕙芳道：「家内有人寻我，我回他去了。」高品道：「是谁？蕙芳道：「不认得。来人说叫什么奚十一，是广东人。」高品道：「好累赘姓，兜头一撇，握颈三拳，中间便丝丝的搅不清，这要假充个大老官。东方之夷有九种，不知他是那一种。」蕙芳道：「你倒好在庙门口，摆个测字摊子。」说得大家笑了。高品道：「今日清饮无趣，何不拿奚十一来做个令？」南湘道：「奚十一怎么","en":"away.\\" Gao Pin asked, \\"Who was it?\\" Huifang said, \\"I don't know him. The servant said his name was something like Xi Eleven, a Cantonese man.\\" Gao Pin said, \\"What a cumbersome surname! One stroke sweeping down at the top, three punches gripping at the neck, with tangled silk threads in the middle that will never sort themselves out, and he wants to pass himself off as a great"}],"18":[{"paragraph":22,"mentions":2,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"家。这陶妈妈家里有三个姑娘，内中一个好的名叫玉天仙，是扬州人，生得风骚娇俏。这两天接着一个大嫖客，就是广东那个奚十一。陶妈妈打听他的家世，知他是海南大家，家有千万之富，兄弟十人，都作道府大员。老太爷是现任提台，家里开着洋行。又访他是个大冤桶，便想发他一票大财。无奈那几个姑娘不大懂他的话，兼之奚十大员。老太爷是现任提台，家里开着洋行。又访他是个大冤桶，便想发他一票大","en":"vivacious and coquettishly attractive. These past two days she had received a big-spending patron, none other than Xi Eleven from Guangdong. Madam Tao had investigated his background and learned that he was from a wealthy family in Hainan with assets in the millions. His ten brothers all held posts as circuit intendants and prefects, their father was a serving Provincial Military"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":2,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"因此，奚十一不大喜欢。陶妈妈知道菊花是广西人，又生得好看，必定勾得住他，所以把他接了过来，认为义女。登时换了崭新的衣服，与诸姊妹相见，菊花与玉天仙尤为相爱。菊花受尽了狼狈，到此已如出了地狱，心里还有甚不足，一心就候那奚十一来。","en":"As a result, Xi Eleven was not greatly pleased. Madam Tao knew that Chrysanthemum hailed from Guangxi and was also very good-looking. Confident that Chrysanthemum could hold his interest, Madam Tao brought her over and formally adopted her as a foster daughter. At once new"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":9,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"且说这奚十一自到京来，不上半年，银子已花去数万，尽填在粪窖里。有人劝他何不娶个妾。他是游荡惯的，见了那良家之女子，甚为厌恶，惟在娼妓队里物色，又没有合意的。一日陶妈妈转来请他，说他家新到了一个广西人。奚十一听见是广西的便满心欢喜，叫个小跟班带了烟具，也不坐车，昂","en":"Now, this Xi Eleven had been in the capital for less than half a year, yet he had already spent tens of thousands of taels of silver, dumping it all into a cesspool. Someone advised him to take a concubine. Being a habitual wanderer, he found respectable women of good families"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":2,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"奚十一在那里一连宿了七八天，每一天也花几十吊钱，老鸨便欲砍起斧子来：本人身上作衣服，打首饰制铺垫，是不必说了，还有那些姑娘们，要这样，要那样，连老鸨婆、帮闲、捞毛的，没有一个不打把式。好在奚十一爽快性成，从无吝啬。","en":"Xi Eleven stayed there seven or eight days running. Each day he spent several dozen strings of cash, and the madam was already sharpening her ax. He paid for clothing on the person, jewelry to make, and furnishing for the room, all of which went without saying."},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":7,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"菊花见奚十一这个雄纠纠的相貌，比从前的相好更胜一倍。又知道是个大老爷，在京候选的，便起了从良之念。奚十一本为物色小星而来，见菊花这般美貌，又是个极在行的，便也要买他为妾。倒是那个老鸨不甚愿意，菊花方来几天，且并非他的人，又无身价可勒，只想留他在家多弄些钱，若从良","en":"Chrysanthemum saw that Xi Eleven's powerful and vigorous manner surpassed her previous love by twice over. Knowing he was a great gentleman waiting in the capital for an official appointment, she conceived the desire to become a proper wife. Xi Eleven had originally come searching for"}],"19":[{"paragraph":12,"mentions":1,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，且喝两钟再说。」众人又干了几杯。聘才听说琪官闹事，便又问二喜道：「你就说来，大家听听。」二喜道：「有一位广东奚十一老爷，你们相好不相好？」三人说都不相识，冯子佩道：「我会过这人，却不相好，你有话尽说。」二喜道：「这奚老爷是在京候选的，听说带了几万银子进来，要捐一个大官。谁知用动了，就凑不上了，只捐了一个知州。这个人真算个阔手，他一进京先认识登春班春兰，就天天把春","en":"Qiguan was involved in an incident, asked Erxi: \\"Tell us about it, so we can all hear.\\" Erxi said: \\"There is a Lord Xi the Eleventh from Guangdong; are you gentlemen acquainted with him?\\" The three said they did not know him. Feng Zipei said: \\"I have met this man, but we are not close; speak your mind freely.\\" Erxi said: \\"This Lord Xi is a candidate for office in the"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":3,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"锁门，瞧是瞧不见什么。他看上了那人，要是不顺手的，便哄他到内室去瞧桶儿。人家听见里头响，自然爬在那桶边上瞧了，奚十一就拿些东西，或是金银锞子，或是翡翠顽意等类，都是贵重的东西，望桶里一扔，说你能捡出来，就是你的。那人如何知道细底，便伸手下去。原来中间那层板子有两个孔儿，一个只放得一只手，摸不着，又伸下那只手，他就拿钥匙往锁门里一拨，这两只手再退不出来，桶又提不起来","en":"inner room to look at the barrel. Hearing it ring inside, a person would naturally lean over the edge to look; Xi Eleven would then take some things — gold or silver ingots, or jade trinkets, all valuable items — and toss them into the barrel, saying that whatever they could fish out would be theirs. How could the victim know the secret mechanism? They would reach a hand"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":1,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"了出来。一面打算告诉巡城都老爷，要搜他那个桶子，办他。徐老爷是个正直人，说话是不知避人的，不知有人怎样通了风。奚十一也怕闹事，又因银子用完了，西帐也不拉了，赶着在吏部花了钱，告了个资斧不继，出京去了。闻说到天津去了，只怕躲几天就要来的，所以玉林气坏了，琪官也病了，手还没有好，怎么得出来？说完了，你们吃一大杯罢，我舌头也干了。」","en":"mechanism was broken. Qiguan's two hands were scraped raw, dripping blood; he too came out weeping and cursing. Xi Eleven, his own vital part in agony, retreated to hide. Qiguan went back and told his teacher; and since he is close to Yuan Baozhu, he also told Baozhu. Baozhu was furious and went into the Garden of Contentment to tell Lord Xu. Lord Xu was outraged and said:"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":1,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"说罢自己也笑了。聘才心中暗忖道：「倒不料琴官、琪官，既唱了戏，还这么傲性子，有骨气，这也奇了。」即问二喜道这奚十一到底是什么人？这样横行霸道，又这样有钱？」二喜道：「我听得春兰讲，说也是个少爷，他家祖太爷做过布政司，他父亲现做提督呢。」聘才道：「如今春兰呢？」二喜道：「同出去了。」于是大家又谈谈笑笑，又喝了一回酒。看看天气将晚，笑梅、聘才皆要进城，只得算了账。梅","en":"dignified, so steadfast in their principles. That is something to marvel at.\\" He then asked Erxi who exactly this Xi Eleven was, and how he could behave so lawlessly and still have so much money. Erxi said: \\"I heard from Chunlan that he too is the son of a well-born family. His grandfather served as a Provincial Administration Commissioner, and his father is currently serving"}],"24":[{"paragraph":3,"mentions":1,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"至若魏聘才、冯子佩、潘三等，真可谓情中之蠹，近其人则蠹身，顺其情则蠹心。天生这班人，在正人堆里作崇。还听得有个奚十一，专爱糟蹋相公，有一个木桶哄人，不到手不歇，受其荼毒者不少。前日琪官竟为所骗，幸其性烈，毁其木桶而出，双手竟刮得稀烂，至今尚未全好，此是情中的盗贼。若你那位虫蛀的舅爷与你那位贵连襟，则道地是个胡涂虫，不知情为何物，正是悲愉哀乐悉与人异者也。」王恂笑道","en":"near them rots the body, and to follow them rots the heart—they were born to plague decent folk. Then there is Xi Eleven, who ruins actors by trapping them in a wooden barrel. Many have been poisoned by him. Qiguan was caught in it, but broke the barrel through sheer strength, tearing his hands raw; they are still healing. Xi is a true bandit of passion. And your bookworm"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":3,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"佩仙缘何发恼起来？」桂保见问，对仲清道：「都是你问起琪官，触起他的伤心事来。」仲清忙问何事？玉林不语，桂保就把奚十一送坊之事述了一遍，听得仲清、王恂大怒起来，同说道：「天下竟有这等人，叫他们怎样过得日子？」桂保道：「如今躲在天津未回呢，只怕终久还要回来的。」仲清道：「这奚十一到底是怎样人？」桂保道：「奚十一的出身倒不小呢，听得说他祖上是洋商，他祖老太爷作到布政司，","en":"reason, Guibao explained that Zhongqing's mention of Qiguan had touched a raw nerve. He recounted the horrific trick Xi Eleven had played with the wooden barrel at the workshop. Zhongqing and Wang Xun cursed aloud. \\"That such vile people exist—how do their victims manage to live?\\" Guibao sighed, \\"He is currently hiding out in Tianjin, but he may yet return.\\" Zhongqing asked"}],"26":[{"paragraph":8,"mentions":1,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"如十珠群婢，天天闹在一堆，也绝无妒忌。再如林珊枝、冯子佩等也不过形迹可疑，其实并无干涉，此也是各人情性，不比那奚十一等专讲究这些事情，不在色之好歹。","en":"entanglement. After all, everyone's temperament is different, and he was not obsessed with carnal indulgences like Xi Eleven."}],"27":[{"paragraph":3,"mentions":1,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这回书却要另叙一人。前回书中是耳闻其事，今日必须亲见其人。你道是谁？就是那奚十一。在长芦盐务里躲了一月，恰值来了一帮洋船，他家是个洋商，又旧有首尾，便汇了两万银子，又搭凑了五千银子的洋货，就重新阔起来。况木桶已坏，事情也就冷了。即便回京，仍旧一味的混闹。","en":"you heard his name and the outline of his doings; now you must see the man himself. Who is he? None other than Xi Eleven. He had hidden for a month at the Changlu salt administration when, by good fortune, a fleet of foreign ships put in. Xi's family were foreign merchants and had old connections in that trade, so he remitted twenty thousand taels and gathered another"},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":9,"tokens":["奚十一","奚正绅"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这奚十一既是个大家子弟，难道就没有个名氏？他的官名叫做奚正绅，那些人将十一叫惯了。岭南人的口头话，十一两字是个土字，因又叫他奚老土。此人初进京来，尚有一口广东话，不甚清楚，此刻渐渐说起官话来了。他却与两个人往来，且系相好，一个是张仲雨，一个是潘其观。张仲雨是","en":"Xi Eleven came from a great clan, so had he no proper name? His formal name was Xi Zhengshen, but folk had called him Eleven so long that it stuck. In Lingnan speech the two characters for \\"eleven\\", 十 over 一, make up the character 土, \\"earth\\" — so they dubbed him"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":2,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"闲话休烦。一日张仲雨在奚十一寓所吃早饭，宾主三人叫了两个相公。仲雨是个贪财不贪色的，这些相公面上都是假应酬，不在里头讲究，而奚、姬两位，则舍此别无所好，奚十一更是下作，一饭之间，也要进去两次。从前还只一个，如今又添了巴英官，更比春兰巴结的好。巴英官肌肤虽黑，却光亮滑泽，得个油字","en":"of these reports; let us return to the day-to-day life of the household. One day Zhang Zhongyu breakfasted at Xi Eleven's lodgings; the host and two guests summoned two young actors. Zhongyu chased coin, not flesh; in those circles he feigned manners and never indulged truly, while Xi and Ji, without this, had no hobby. Xi Eleven was especially low; even during one meal"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":2,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"是日饮酒之间，奚十一叫春兰进去了一回，出来坐了一坐；又叫巴英官进去了。仲雨不知其故，只道有事，便与亮轩讲些闲话。这两个相公，一个是蓉官，一个是春林，皆是奚十一常叫的。蓉官对着春林做眼色，春林笑了一笑。亮轩也做眉做眼的，仲雨偶然看见，却不晓得什么，也不便问。蓉官忽问仲雨道","en":"That day, while wine was being passed around, Xi Eleven first summoned Chunlan inside. Chunlan came back out and sat for a while, but Xi soon called Ba Yingguan in as well; the comings and goings made Zhongyu wonder what business was being conducted behind the inner door. Zhongyu guessed his errands and chatted"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":2,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"不晓得，我也没告诉他。论理，你东家应该重重谢我呢。」亮轩忙问何事？仲雨笑道：「久后便知，此事也不必说了。」只见奚十一出来，趿着双细草网凉鞋，穿条三缸青香云纱裤，披着件野鸡葛汗衫，背后巴英官拿着柄黑漆描金鬼子扇，笑嘻嘻一轻一重的乱扑出来。亮轩出席相迎，仲雨也照应了。奚十一坐下，仲雨道：「你今日有什么事这么忙？」","en":"matter was, but Zhongyu only smiled. \\"You will hear in good time. There is no need to speak of it now.\\" Just then Xi Eleven came out, shuffling in a pair of fine woven-grass sandals, triple-dyed fragrant-cloud trousers, and a pheasant-pattern ramie jacket, with Ba Yingguan behind holding a black lacquer foreign fan traced in gold, fanning at him now light now hard as he came"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":3,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"奚十一笑了笑，方说道：「有点小事都清理了。」便道：「我方才失陪你们，干几杯罢。」仲雨道：「喝得多了。」奚十一道：「好话，快再干两杯，我们豁几拳罢。」仲雨道：「也好。」奚十一就与仲雨、亮轩、蓉官、春林豁了十拳，起初还叫得清，后来便叫出怪声。广东人豁拳是最难听","en":"Xi smiled and then said, \\"Small errands—cleared.\\" He added, \\"Sorry to leave you; a few more cups?\\" Zhongyu said, \\"Enough wine.\\" Xi pressed, \\"Good words—two more rounds, and we'll finger-guess.\\" Zhongyu agreed, \\"Fine.\\" Xi guessed ten rounds with Zhongyu,"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":4,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"豁完了拳，讲些闲话，仲雨忽然问奚十一道：「如今有个顶好的相公叫琴言，在秋水堂住，他的师傅叫长庆，你曾见过么？」奚十一道：「没曾见，听是听得说过，是好的。」仲雨正要说时，蓉官道：「好什么？只得两三出戏。你叫他陪酒，终席不说话。\\n要他斟钟酒，是没有的事。」春林道：「好沉架子，到他家去看他，","en":"When the finger-guessing was over and they had fallen to idle talk, Zhongyu suddenly asked Xi Eleven, \\"There's a prime actor called Qinyan lodging at Autumn-Water Hall with his teacher Changqing. Have you met him?\\" Xi replied, \\"Not seen, but heard he's good.\\" Zhongyu was about to say more when Rongguan cut in. \\"Good in what way? He has two or three"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":1,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"、天寿会应酬，相貌又不好，人也不喜欢他。他师傅曹长庆，也是个古怪脾气，就是一门只爱钱，钱到了手，又不睬人了。」奚十一听了这些话，心上着实不信，对仲雨道：「你停一停，同我去看看，到底怎样？」仲雨道：「别处都去，他那里我不去，况前日我还骂了他。」众人吃了饭，又坐了一回，仲雨告辞去了。两个相公又闹了好一回方去。","en":"them. His teacher Cao Changqing has an odd temper, loves only silver, and with silver in hand, ignores people.\\" Xi refused to believe it and said to Zhongyu, \\"Wait, come with me, and see how it is.\\" Zhongyu replied, \\"I'll go anywhere but there, and the other day I cursed him.\\" They finished the meal and remained seated for a time, but Zhongyu soon took his leave."},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":1,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"奚十一过了夜，明日早饭后，想起仲雨所说的琴言这么利害，到底不信，必要去试试。过瘾之后，同了姬亮轩，带了春兰、巴英官，自己换了件新纱衫子，坐了车，叫春兰、巴英官同跨了车沿，亮轩另雇一个车，到秋水堂来。","en":"Xi Eleven spent the night turning Zhongyu's remarks over in his mind. The next morning after breakfast, still unable to believe that Qinyan could be so unapproachable, he resolved to test the matter for himself. After taking opium, along with Ji Liangxuan, Chunlan,"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":3,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"刚走到里面，这边奚十一已到门，春兰、英官下来，进去问了，回说不在家。奚十一听了，先有一分怒气，自己也就下来，刚刚走进了门，姬亮轩尚在门外，只见一人笑嘻嘻的上前说道：「老爷是找那一个的？若是找相公们的，没有一个在屋里。」说罢，便迎面站住，也不说个请字。奚十一见了就有了三分气","en":"Just inside, Xi Eleven reached the gate. Chunlan and Ba Yingguan descended and asked within. When answered that no one was home, Xi felt anger rising and entered himself. Liangxuan was still outside when a man stepped up grinning: \\"Sir, seeking whom? If actors, none are inside.\\""},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":1,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"那人才退了两步，说：「请大老爷进屋子里喝茶。」即开了二门，奚十一同亮轩进内，走过了庭心，上了客厅，却是三间：东边隔去了一间，算客房。对面两间，一边是门房，一边空着。","en":"The man stepped back, \\"Please, Master, have tea inside,\\" and opened the inner gate. Xi and Liangxuan crossed the courtyard and entered the salon, which spanned three bays: The east was partitioned as a guest room. Opposite were two bays: one gate room, and one empty."},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":1,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"不来的。不然叫天福、天寿回来，或者有些甜头，也未可知。一面即打发人到戏园去叫，一面自己穿了衣裳、鞋袜出来，款待奚十一。","en":"informed Changqing. Changqing said, \\"I already said I'm not home, so there's no need to entertain.\\" He thought, \\"This Xi, I've heard he's a sucker and tasteless. Many actors have been ruined with no redress, and Qinyan is hopeless with him. Or I could summon Tianfu and Tianshou; maybe there are sweets to be had.\\" He sent for them from the theater, donned his coat and boots,"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":1,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"全作合起来也不可知。即或不然，你歇几天，也可告个假出来，到我这里，去请庾香来会一会，倒可无拘束。你心上若当他与奚十一、潘三一流人，我可以替他出结：断不至此。依我这么想，是进去的为妙。」","en":"rest days, you could leave, visit me, and call Yuxiang freely. And if in your heart you take him for one of the Xi Eleven or Pan the Third sort, I will go bail for him: it will never come to that. As I see it, going in is the better course.\\""},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":2,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"且说长庆出来见了奚十一，请了个安，举眼看他，相貌魁梧，身材高大，满脸的烟气，似有怒容。那一个是个獐头鼠目，短小身材。又见两个俊俏跟班，一个认得是春兰，就请客房坐下。奚十一道：「我姓奚，想来你也知道，不用我说。我听得你这里有个琴言，特来会会他，快些叫他出来。」长庆赔笑道：「","en":"Meanwhile, Changqing came out to Xi Eleven, bowed, and studied him. Xi was burly and tall, his smoky face dark with anger; his companion was weasel-snouted and mouse-eyed, short, with two handsome tail-boys. He recognized Chunlan and ushered them into the guest room. Xi said, \\"I am surnamed Xi."},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":1,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"奚十一听了，皱皱眉说道：「天天不进城，偏今日进城。没有的话，快叫出来，为什么要躲着不见人？躲别人也罢了，难道你不打听打听，我是躲得过的么？你不要发昏。」长庆看势头不好，像是有意来的，便一面赔笑支吾，一面打算个搪塞他的法子，只得把大帽子，且压他一压，且看怎样","en":"Xi frowned: \\"He's not in the city every day; why today of all days? Nonsense! Bring him out quickly. Why hide him? You might hide others, but didn't you ask who I am? Do you think you can hide from me? Don't play stupid.\\" Changqing saw his ill intent, smiled,"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":2,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"说到此，便近奚十一身边。将扇子扇着，又笑嘻嘻的道：「请宽宽衫子，如要炕上躺躺，小的倒有老泥烟。」奚十一见他如此小心，气也消了，发作不出来；且闻留他吃烟，正投其所好，便道：「既然真不在家，也就罢了。不是我自己夸口，大概通京城相公，也没有一个不晓得我的。你若懂窍，过两天领","en":"Saying this, he stepped close to Xi, fanned him, and grinned: \\"Loosen your jacket. Lie on the kang if you like; I have aged mud opium.\\" Seeing such deference, Xi's anger faded, and he couldn't explode. Hearing opium offered—exactly his vice—he said, \\"If he is truly away, let it be. I do"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":3,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"奚十一的法宝是随身带的，春兰便从一个口袋中，一样一样的拿出来，摆在炕上。长庆陪了，给他烧了几口，心上又起了坏主意，赔着笑道：「小的还有两个徒弟：「一个叫天福，一个叫天寿，今日先叫他们伺候，迟日再叫琴言到府上来，不知大老爷可肯赏脸？」奚十一既吹动了烟，即懒得","en":"Xi's smoking apparatus traveled with him; Chunlan unpacked it from a pocket piece by piece onto the kang. Changqing attended him and burned several bowls. A wicked idea struck him, and he smiled: \\"This small one has two more disciples, one named Tianfu"},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":5,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"天福就在奚十一对面躺下，天寿坐在炕沿上。亮轩拖张凳子近着炕边，看他们吃烟，春兰、巴英官在房门口帘子边望着。只见天寿爬在奚十一身上，看他手上的翡翠镯子，天福也斜着身子，隔着灯盘拉了奚十一的手，两人同看。亮轩也来炕上躺了，两个相公就在炕沿轮流烧烟。天福挨了奚十一，天寿","en":"Tianfu lay opposite Xi, and Tianshou perched on the edge of the kang. Liangxuan dragged a stool beside the kang, watching them smoke. Chunlan and Ba Yingguan peered from the doorway curtain. Tianshou climbed beside Xi, studying his jade bracelet, while Tianfu leaned across"},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":6,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"英官道：「那个呢？」春兰道：「是素兰。待我们与老爷说了，好不依他。」于是二人又到房门口，见他们还挤在一处，听得奚十一道：「琴言到底几时回来？」天福正要回言，春兰即说道：「他们哄老爷的，琴言现在里头，同着素兰坐在床上说话，还说在城里唱戏呢？」奚十一听了心如火发，便跳起身就走出来，天福、天寿两边拉住，奚十一摔手，两个都跌倒了，问春兰道：「你见琴言在那里？」春兰道：「在","en":"replied, \\"It's Sulan. Wait till we tell the Master; he won't spare them.\\" They returned to the door and still heard Xi asking, \\"When does Qinyan return?\\" Tianfu was about to answer when Chunlan cut in: \\"They lied, Master! Qinyan is inside talking with Sulan on the bed, and they told you he was singing in the city!\\" When Xi heard this, his heart caught fire, and he leapt"},{"paragraph":30,"mentions":3,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"奚十一走进院子，只见下了窗子，就戳破窗心，望了一望，不见其人，便转到中间，见房门锁着，便要钥匙开门。长庆赶来说道：「这是我的亲戚姓伍的住的，钥匙他带出去了，房里也没有什么看头。」奚十一欲要打进去，又似踌躇，春兰道：「小的亲眼看见，还有英官同见的，如今必躲在","en":"Xi entered the yard. The windows were lowered; he poked the gauze, found it empty, turned to the center, and found the door locked. He demanded the keys. Changqing ran up: \\"That is my kinsman Wu's room; the keys were carried off, and there's nothing worth"},{"paragraph":31,"mentions":7,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"奚十一见房后有重小门开着，走去一望，院子里有个后门虚掩着，就知从这门出去了，便气得不可开交，先把琴言床帐扯下，顺手将桌子一翻，零星物件，打得满地。长庆见了心中甚怒，又不敢发作。想要分辩两句，不防奚十一一把揪住，连扇了五个嘴巴。长庆气极欲要动手，自己力不能敌","en":"Xi saw that a small rear door stood open, looked into the yard, and found the back gate on the latch; and knowing they had got away he was beside himself. He tore down Qinyan's bed-curtains first, then overturned the table and sent the small things smashing"},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":3,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"长庆受了这一场打骂，不敢哼一声，关上门，即叫人到兰保处找回琴言，素兰连兰保也送了过来。大家说起这奚十一一味凶蛮，真是可怕，只怕其中又有人调唆出来，日后还不肯干休。一个魏聘才冤仇未解，又添出个奚十一来，如何是好？说得长庆更无主意，越发害怕，琴言只是哭泣。兰保道：「我有一个好主意，只劝得玉侬依了，倒是妥当的。你们明天就送他到华公府，他府里要赏你身价，你万","en":"the gate, and sent someone to Lanbao's house for Qinyan. Sulan had sent Lanbao back as well. They all spoke of Xi Eleven's savage, lawless temper and agreed that a man who could erupt so suddenly was frightening indeed. Perhaps someone had stirred him up, and he wouldn't rest. The feud with Wei Pincai was unsettled, and now Xi had joined in; what then? Changqing felt even"}],"28":[{"paragraph":6,"mentions":2,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"走到里间来，兰保、琪官看着他，也有些凄楚。素兰道：「你细听着这五月内的事情。」便一五一十的将魏聘才怎样的来说，奚十一怎样来闹，他与兰保怎样的劝，怎样的出主意，又怎样的躲避奚十一，又怎样的送进华府，临行时怎样哭泣嘱咐，又将不受身价并可告假出来的话，细细的述了一遍，又安慰了几句。","en":"carefully to what transpired this fifth month.\\" He then recounted the entire ordeal: how Wei Pincai had schemed, how Xi Eleven had caused a chaotic scene, how he and Lanbao had tried to intervene and devise a plan, how Qinyan had hidden from Xi Eleven, and finally, how he was sent into the Hua mansion. He detailed his tearful parting instructions, his refusal of the purchase"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":1,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"又对子玉，把从前魏聘才同船，一路在舟中下作的模样讲了好些。忽又想起奚十一来，复咬牙切齿的骂几句。素兰让子玉吃饭，子玉心绪不佳，便要早回，辞了一径回去，车上便觉四肢不舒起来。","en":"despicable behavior Wei Pincai had exhibited on the boat when they previously shared passage. The mere mention of Xi Eleven caused them to grit their teeth and curse his name. Sulan urged Ziyu to eat, but his spirits were too low. Desiring an early departure, he took his leave and headed straight home. Already in the carriage, he began to feel an unnatural unease creeping"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":1,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，有时清楚，昏愦时糊胡涂涂，不闻不见的光景；清楚时与好人一样。睡梦中呓语喃喃，有时叫玉侬，有时唤香畹，有时大骂奚十一、魏聘才诸人。颜夫人十分着急，颜仲清、王恂三天两日常来看视，心中虽是明白，却也无法可治。二人商量，又不好对颜夫人讲，只好婉言解慰而已。颜夫人每听子玉睡梦之中，必呼玉侬二字，心上便疑心子玉在外有什么勾当，便当玉侬是个女人，心有说不出的隐情；因又想子玉不","en":"he muttered incessantly—sometimes calling for \\"Yunong,\\" sometimes \\"Xiangwan,\\" and at times, vehemently cursing Xi Eleven and Wei Pincai. Lady Yan was frantic with worry. Yan Zhongqing and Wang Xun visited every few days; they understood the root of the malady but were powerless to cure it. After discussing the matter, they felt they could not reveal the truth to Lady Yan,"}],"34":[{"paragraph":15,"mentions":1,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"室与他放头。第一日来的人还少，第二日渐渐多了，第三日便挤满了屋子。一人传两，两人传三，引了两个大赌客来，一个是奚十一，一个是潘三，各带重资。","en":"packed to the brim. Word spread from one to two, from two to three, eventually drawing in two major gamblers: Xi Eleven and Pan the Third, both arriving with heavy purses."},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":3,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"奚十一大赢，赢了八百五十余两，将五十余两分赏众小旦与聘才小使，自己收了八百两。奚十一看上了小和尚，赏了他十个中锭。玉天仙又得了二百四十两头钱。内中有个唐经承，就是和尚的兄弟，对着和尚道：「明日我劝你们别赌了。我先前进来时，门外有两个交头接耳的，像是坊里人，","en":"Xi Eleven won big—over eight hundred and fifty taels. He distributed fifty-odd taels as tips among the young female impersonators and Pincai's servants, pocketing the remaining eight hundred for himself. Xi Eleven took a liking to the young novice monk and tipped"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":1,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"到了明日，聘才发贴请客，请的是富三爷、贵大爷、奚十一、潘三、张仲雨、杨梅窗。是日辞了两个，贵大爷病了，张仲雨有事不能来。即补了冯子佩、唐和尚，宾主共七位。聘才叫了蓉官来陪富三，着人到篷子里叫了天香、翠官前来。不多一刻，两个剃头的也坐了大骡车，有一个人跟着，走进寺来。冯子佩是认识的，小剃头的先与子佩请了","en":"next day, Pincai sent out invitations for a gathering. His guests included Master Fu the Third, Gui the Eldest, Xi Eleven, Pan the Third, Zhang Zhongyu, and Yang Meichuang. Two sent their regrets—Gui was ill, and Zhang had other matters to attend to—so Feng Zipei and Monk Tang were brought in to fill their seats, making a total of seven host and guests. Pincai summoned"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":3,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，就带了得月进来。天香、翠官与富三、和尚都请了安。富三却不认识，问他是谁，在那一班的，聘才就说是全福班的。随后奚十一、潘三同来。奚十一带了巴英官，潘三带了个学徒弟的小伙计，拿他竟当做跟班的。大家一齐相见了。潘三见了天香、翠官，笑道：「你们怎么也跑了来？」奚十一道：「看来，魏大爷要开篷子做掌柜的了。」富三方晓得是剃头的，便哈哈大笑道：「原来是他们，不是班子里的，倒也","en":"were and which troupe they belonged to; Pincai smoothly claimed they were from the Quanfu Troupe. Soon after, Xi Eleven and Pan the Third arrived together. Xi Eleven had brought Ba Yingguan, while Pan the Third was accompanied by a young apprentice whom he was treating as a servant. Greetings were exchanged all around. Upon seeing Tianxiang and Cuiguan, Pan the Third"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":1,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"四出春画。屋内挂了八盏玻璃灯，中间挂一个彩灯，地下又点了四枝地照，两边生了两个火盆，中间摆了一个圆桌。安了席，奚十一看那灯屏上的春画，对潘三笑道：「老三，你看那挨嘴巴的很像是你。」潘三道：「那个搂着人的也像你，就只少个桶儿。」富三看到末后一幅，不觉大笑道：「岂有此理！魏老大不该不该，真是对景挂画。你们大家来瞧，这不是两个和尚鸡奸么？」","en":"below. Two braziers were stoked on either side, and a round banquet table was set in the middle. Once seated, Xi Eleven studied the erotic scenes on the lamp-screen and joked to Pan the Third, \\"Old Third, take a look at the one getting slapped—doesn't it look just like you?\\" Pan the Third retorted, \\"And the one embracing someone looks just like you, only missing your"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":5,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"众人看了，一齐大笑。奚十一对着得月道：「你师父天天这么着吗？」得月「呸」了一声，涨红了脸，扭转头不看。唐和尚合着掌道：「阿弥陀佛！罪过，罪过！」此时坐的是富三首席，聘才叫翠官陪了他。第二是奚十一，唐和尚知他是个阔手，且知道他爱得月，便叫得月陪了他。杨八坐了第三，聘才叫天香挨着","en":"Everyone looked and erupted in laughter. Xi Eleven turned to Deyue and teased, \\"Does your master do this every day?\\" Deyue spat out a \\"Pah!\\", his face flushing crimson, and turned his head away, refusing to look. Monk Tang pressed his palms together and chanted, \\"Amitabha! Sinful, how sinful!\\" By this"},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":3,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"有潘三与聘才无人可闹。聘才笑道：「我们今日只好轮着来闹这个老和尚了。」便互相与唐和尚豁了几拳。闹了一个多时辰，奚十一瘾来了，便叫巴英官拿出烟具来。灯是开现成的，奚十一躺下，叫得月陪他吹烟，两个剃头的也有烟瘾。都聚拢来。唐和尚见了，即连打了两个呵欠，伸了个懒腰。看得奚十一瘾大，等不及，便到自己房中过瘾去了。","en":"they engaged in a lively game of finger-guessing with Monk Tang. After they had carried on for over two hours, Xi Eleven's craving for opium struck, and he ordered Ba Yingguan to bring out the smoking gear. The lamps were already lit; Xi Eleven lay down and commanded Deyue to join him in smoking. The two barbers, also being addicts, crowded around as well. Seeing this,"},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":1,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"上富三身上，将头在富三肩上碰了几碰，说道：「我就磕头谢了！好三老爷，好亲爸爸！」富三乐得受不得。潘三见得月躺在奚十一怀里，天香躺在对面，杨八也想吹一口，便坐在炕沿上，歪转身子，压在天香身上。得月上好了一口，杨八接了过来，拨开毛冗冗的胡子，抽了一抽，口涎直流下来，点点滴滴，烟枪上也沾了好些，他就把皮袖子擦擦嘴再抽。枪又堵住了，天香欲替他通通，身子被他压住难动。杨八便","en":"Master, good dear father!\\" Fu the Third was overwhelmed with delight. Pan the Third, observing Deyue lounging in Xi Eleven's arms and Tianxiang lying opposite them, decided he wanted a puff of opium as well. He moved to the edge of the kang, twisted his body, and leaned heavily against Tianxiang. Deyue finished preparing a pipe of opium, and Yang Eight took it. Parting his"},{"paragraph":30,"mentions":7,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"道：「这个我也是初学。」便勉强吸了一口，烧得很焦枯臭，放下枪。天香道：「你别压住了我，我替你烧。」那边得月枕在奚十一手上，奚十一又摸他的屁股。得月要起来，奚十一将一条腿压住了他，得月无法，只好任其抚摩。奚十一一盒子烟已完了，便叫巴英官拿烟来。英官远远的站在一边，正在那里发气。奚十一叫了两三声，方才答道：「没有了。」奚十一道：「怎么没有？我还有个大盒子在袋里。」英官","en":"Tianxiang said, \\"Stop pinning me down like this; I'll prepare it for you.\\" Meanwhile, Deyue was resting his head on Xi Eleven's arm as Xi Eleven continued to grope his backside. Deyue tried to rise, but Xi Eleven pinned him down with one leg; with no other recourse, Deyue had to endure the fondling. Xi Eleven finished an entire box of opium and called for Ba Yingguan to bring"},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":3,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"得月忙取时，不提防将灯碰翻，「当」的一声，把个玻璃罩子砸破了，还溅了奚十一一脸的油。得月颇不好意思，奚十一道：「不妨。」忙将手巾抹了，坐了过来，要盆水净了脸。一件猞狮裘上也洒了几点，也抹干净了。聘才的人忙换了一盏灯，擦了盘子。得月将盒子揭开看时，果然是空的。奚十一道：「这便怎么好？去问唐大爷要些来罢。」聘才道：「有，有，有","en":"carelessly knocked the lamp over with a loud clatter, shattering the glass chimney and splashing oil all over Xi Eleven's face. Deyue was deeply mortified, but Xi Eleven brushed it off, saying, \\"It's nothing.\\" He quickly wiped his face with a towel, sat up, and asked for a basin of water to wash up properly. A few drops had also splashed onto his lynx-fur coat, which"}],"36":[{"paragraph":4,"mentions":1,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，永无超升之理。主儿多叫一回，同伙多恨一回。主儿多赏一回，同伙多骂一回。那带诮带骂、冷言冷语的，叫人难受。总恨奚十一那个忘八蛋无缘无故的闹上门来，因此堕落在此。又想魏聘才虽不是个好人，然尚有一言半语，道着我的心事，如今他又出去了。那个林珊枝倒像是半个主儿一般，先要小心谨慎的奉承他才喜欢，不然他就要撮弄人。如今索性把我撵出去了，倒也自在，自然也可以不到师父处去了。若","en":"the more they cursed him. Their mocking, sarcastic remarks were hard to bear. He deeply resented that bastard Xi Eleven for causing trouble at his door for no reason, which had led to his current plight. He also thought of Wei Pincai; though not a good man, he had at least occasionally spoken words that touched Qinyan's heart, yet now he was gone too. Then there was Lin"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":1,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴言道：「魏聘才搬了出去了，不知可在庾香处？」蕙芳道：「魏聘才么，如今倒更阔了。就在宏济寺住，同了奚十一、潘三、杨八一班混账人天天的闹，是什么剃头的，又是什么大和尚、小和尚，开赌宿娼，闹得不像。张仲雨也不与他往来了。」 　　 琴言问起子玉来，宝珠道：「前日我们在怡园叙了一日。」便将前日怎样喝酒，怎样行令，次贤新制的酒壶、杯子都说了，琴言着实羡慕。又说那","en":"even more arrogant now. He lives at Hongji Temple and causes trouble every day with a bunch of scoundrels like Xi Eleven, Pan the Third, and Yang Eight—barbers, monks big and small—gambling and visiting prostitutes. It's a disgrace. Even Zhang Zhongyu no longer associates with him.\\" When Qinyan asked about Ziyu, Baozhu recounted, \\"The day before yesterday, we spent the"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":8,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"有缘千里来相会了。」琴言含羞含怒的急忙洒脱了手。聘才知他害羞，急了是要哭的，忙支开潘三，扯他坐下，要问他时，见奚十一说道：「你如今在华府里可好？」琴言只得答应了「好。」奚十一道：「你可认得我？」琴言举眼看他是一个黑大汉子，颇觉威风凛凛，有些怕他，便说道：「不相认识。」奚十一哈哈大笑，走近琴言身边。琴言要站起来，奚十一双手按住了他的肩头，琴言低了头，心中乱跳。奚十一","en":"Du I talk about every day; he's now called Master Du Qin.\\" To Qinyan, he added, \\"These are my closest friends: Master Xi, Third Master Pan, my landlord Monk Tang, and his little novice. Those two are from the troupe; you probably don't know them, so let's all get acquainted.\\" With no choice, Qinyan bowed to them. The monk, knowing he came from the Hua estate, pressed his"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":1,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"奚十一是个粗卤人，尽讲实事的，但面目之好歹也分得出来。此时见了琴言，却是生平未见过的宝贝，心中着实大动。","en":"Xi Eleven was a coarse and vulgar man who cared only for raw desires, but he could easily distinguish a beautiful face. Seeing Qinyan now, he felt he had laid eyes on an unprecedented treasure, and his heart was deeply stirred."},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":4,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"肚子，几步就走了出去。聘才与和尚连忙相送，潘三尚坐着不动，黄瞪瞪眼睛只管看着琴言，看得琴言一腔怒气，不能发作。奚十一拉了聘才，走到和尚房中，对聘才作了一个揖道：「今日我要求你行件好事。方才这个人，我实在爱他。我若叫他陪酒，是一定不肯的。」聘才不等说完，忙摇头道：「不肯，不肯！不肯，定的。」奚十一道：「况且他已改了行，也难强他。如今我有一个妙计，我们去了，你留他吃饭","en":"After scheming for a moment, Xi Eleven stood up and said, \\"I'm leaving.\\" Thrusting out his belly, he strode out the door in a few paces. Pincai and the monk hurried to see him off, while Pan the Third remained seated, his eyes wide and fixed on Qinyan, watching him with an intensity that"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":1,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这些人都去了，自然没有人来，便问聘才道：「今年见过庾香几次了？」聘才随口说道：「三次了。」琴言又问道：「我听得奚十一是个坏人，为什么与他相好？」聘才道：「也没有什么很相好，看他也是个爽快人。」琴言道：「那个姓潘的，我也知道他。」聘才道：「那是个买卖老实人，就这和尚也极通世务的。」琴言心里暗笑，也不便驳他。","en":"times have you seen Yuxiang this year?\\" Pincai casually replied, \\"Three times.\\" Qinyan asked further, \\"I've heard Xi Eleven is a bad man. Why are you friends with him?\\" Pincai deflected, \\"We aren't that close. He just seems like a straightforward fellow.\\" Qinyan added, \\"And that man named Pan, I know of him too.\\" Pincai said, \\"He's just an honest businessman, and even the"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":8,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"却说奚十一跨上车，叫车夫狠狠的几鞭，那骡子一口气就跑了回去。奚十一到寓处，即进他的书房，吩咐家人问姨奶奶要了昨日晚上送来的四样菜、两样点心出来，送到魏老爷那里去，又教了他一番说话。也不进房，就在书房内炕上开了灯，叫巴英官打泡，急急的吹了三十口大口烟，已有三钱，","en":"Meanwhile, Xi Eleven climbed into his carriage and ordered the driver to whip the mule fiercely, racing all the way back in one breath. Upon arriving at his residence, he went straight to his study and ordered his servant to ask his concubine for the four dishes and two"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":1,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，常托我对你说，在那里放宽了心，不要惦记着他，他慢慢的去结交华公子，自然可以常见面了。聘才无非要他安心久坐，等奚十一来。无奈琴言急于要走，酒也不喝，菜也不吃，呆呆的坐着，如芒刺在背的光景。","en":"naturally, you'll be able to see each other often.\\" Pincai's only goal was to keep Qinyan comfortably seated until Xi Eleven arrived. Qinyan, however, was anxious to leave; he neither drank nor ate, but sat stiffly, as if sitting on pins and needles."},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":10,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"正要催饭，只听得院子里一阵脚步响，已撬了风门进来，琴言见奚十一，心里就慌，站了起来。聘才笑盈盈的说道：「来得正好，主人来陪客了。」奚十一笑道：「我知道此刻尚未吃完，竭诚来敬琴言一杯。」便叫巴英官拖过凳子，就朝南坐了。一手执壶，一手擎杯，斟好了，直送到琴言嘴边。琴言接又不好，不接又不好，急得满脸通红。聘才道：「这","en":"him to eat, the sound of hurried footsteps echoed in the courtyard. The wind-door was pried open, and in walked Xi Eleven. Qinyan panicked and immediately stood up. Pincai smiled warmly, \\"Perfect timing—the host has arrived to keep the guest company.\\" Xi Eleven laughed, \\"I knew you hadn't finished yet. I've come in all sincerity to toast Qinyan.\\" He had Ba Yingguan pull"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":1,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"又叫换个杯子来，琴言道：「不必，不必，就拿来我也不喝。」奚十一道：「那不能，也不多劝你，一人劝你三杯。」潘三满拟这杯酒，他若喝了，琴言便亲了他的□嘴一样，偏又砸了，甚是扫兴。还想重来敬他，被聘才拦住。唐和尚不知好歹，斟了半杯道：「阿弥陀佛，华公府是小寺的大施主，老太太装过三世佛的金身，少奶奶塑过送子观音像，舍了","en":"replacement cup, Qinyan flatly refused. \\"There is no need, no need at all. Even if you bring it, I will not drink.\\" Xi Eleven insisted, \\"That won't do. We won't press you too hard—just three cups from each of us.\\" Pan the Third had been eagerly anticipating that if Qinyan drank from that cup, it would be as if they had kissed; seeing it smashed utterly ruined his mood. He tried"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":2,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"起，请起，我喝一口，下不为例。」便在光头上拿了杯子，喝了一口。想一想，恐人喝他的剩酒，索性干了。立起身来想走，奚十一推住了，和尚抱了他的腿，跪着在他膝上碰头。琴言只得坐下，真急了，便厉声正色的说道：「今日请教各位，待要怎样？」聘才连忙说道：「不喝酒了，倒是大家谈谈罢。」拉了和尚起来。琴言道：「我有事不能再会了。」又要走，奚十一拦住不放，说道：「不喝酒就是了，坐一会","en":"Then, fearing someone else would drink his leftovers, he resolutely downed the rest. He stood up to leave, but Xi Eleven pushed him back down, while the monk threw his arms around Qinyan's legs and kowtowed against his knees. Forced to sit back down and genuinely angered, Qinyan spoke with stern severity: \\"May I ask what exactly you gentlemen intend today?\\" Pincai hurriedly"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":1,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"奚十一暗忖道：「这孩子真古怪，斗不上笋来。若不是他，我早已一顿臭骂，还要硬顽他一回。不过我怜惜他，他倒这般倔强，实属可恨。」又转念道：「向来说他骄傲，果真不错。我若施威，又碍着华府里。况他已不唱戏了，原不该叫他陪酒。","en":"Xi Eleven thought to himself, \\"This boy is truly strange; we just can't fit our joints together. If it were anyone else, I would have cursed them out and forced myself on them by now. But out of pity for him, he acts this stubborn. It's absolutely hateful.\\" He"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":1,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"回心转意也未可定。」潘三想道：「这孩子比苏蕙芳更强，可惜我没有带结票子来赏他，或他得了钱就巴结我，也未可知。」奚十一道：「我有样东西送你，你可不要嫌轻。」便从怀里掏出个锦匣子，揭开了盖，是一对透水全绿的翡翠镯子，光华射目。","en":"Huifang. If only I had brought some bank notes to reward him, perhaps he would fawn over me if he got some money.\\" Xi Eleven spoke up, \\"I have something to give you, and I hope you won't find it too meager.\\" He pulled a brocade box from his robe, opened the lid, and revealed a pair of translucent, flawlessly green jadeite bracelets, their brilliance dazzling the eyes."},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":8,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"聘才、和尚也睁睁的望着。聘才暗想道：「好出手，头一回就拿这样好东西赏他，看他要不要？」琴言也不来看，只低了头。奚十一道：「你试试，大小包管合式。」便叫琴言戴上。琴言站起来，正色的说道：「这个我断不敢受，况且我从不带镯子的。」琴言无心，伸出一手给他们看，是带镯子不带镯子的意思。奚十一误猜是要替他戴上的意思，便顺手把住了他的膀子，一拽过来，用力太重，琴言娇怯，站立不稳","en":"move—offering such a fine thing right away. Let's see if he takes it.\\" Qinyan didn't even look, keeping his head bowed. Xi Eleven urged, \\"Try them on, I guarantee the size is perfect,\\" and told Qinyan to put them on. Qinyan stood up and said sternly, \\"I absolutely dare not accept this. Furthermore, I never wear bracelets.\\" Without thinking, Qinyan held out his hand to show them—meaning"},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":3,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"拿来放在奚十一面前，又道：「一千吊的镯子，如今倒值三千吊了。」奚十一见了，越发气狠狠的骂了一会。潘三与唐和尚连说可惜。大约奚十一回去，只剩一个镯子，菊花必有一场大闹，正是癞蛤蟆想吃天鹅肉，也不料自己的福分。","en":"He brought them over and placed them in front of Xi Eleven, adding, \\"A bracelet worth a thousand strings is now worth three thousand.\\" Seeing this, Xi Eleven cursed even more viciously. Pan the Third and Monk Tang kept repeating what a pity it was. When Xi Eleven returned with only one bracelet left, Juhua would"}],"37":[{"paragraph":6,"mentions":1,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"人，闷在心里，越想越气，要忍也忍不住，把帕子掩了面，想道：「魏聘才这东西专会捏造谣言，将来必说我在他那里陪酒，奚十一赏镯子等语，不如我说了，也可叫人明白。况且谅无笑我的人。」又停了一会，问子玉道：「你几时见聘才的？」子玉道：「尚是去年十月内见过一次，如今住在城外宏济寺，也绝不到我家来。」","en":"Wei Pincai is always inventing rumours. He is sure to say I kept them company over wine at his lodgings, that Xi Eleven rewarded me with a bracelet, and so on. It would be better to speak up myself and let people know the truth. Besides, surely no one here would laugh at me.\\" He waited another moment, then asked Ziyu, \\"When did you last see Pincai?\\" Ziyu replied, \\"Not"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":1,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"你看他，他怎样待你？」琴言道：「聘才起先还好，如今有一班坏人在那里引诱。」子云问道：「是谁呢？」琴言道：「一个奚十一，一个潘其观，还有一个和尚，就是聘才的房东。」","en":"enough, but now a set of bad characters are leading him astray.\\" Ziyun asked who they were. Qinyan said, \\"One is Xi Eleven, another is Pan Qiguan, and a monk—Pincai's landlord.\\""},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":7,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"蕙芳听了，皱了皱眉，问道：「你怎样呢？」琴言也恨极了，索性细细的将奚十一故意先走，后聘才撵了潘三，奚十一忽又送菜来，后奚十一、潘三、和尚先后的闯进，并将席间诸般戏侮，与砸了他的镯子，都说了出来。子玉听了，甚是生气，说道：「这是聘才的坏，定是他设的计，故意叫他们糟蹋你的。」琴言道：「可不是他通同的么？幸亏我如今不唱戏了，他","en":"Qinyan's anger had by now reached such a pitch that he went ahead and recounted the whole story in detail: how Xi Eleven had made a point of leaving early, how Pincai had then sent Pan the Third away, how Xi Eleven had unexpectedly sent over some dishes, and how, one after another, Xi Eleven, Pan the Third, and the monk had all barged in. He detailed every manner of insult"}],"39":[{"paragraph":8,"mentions":1,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"识荆。如高兴，歇天何不到敝东处来走走，敝东是极好相与的。」子玉不知他的东家是谁，含糊答应。即私问王恂，王恂答以奚十一，子玉便是一腔忿恨，也不理他。亮轩又向元茂道：「舍表妹贤德无双，李大哥真有福气，结了这头好亲。我们太亲翁不久外放，不是四川夔州府，就是湖南辰州府。李大哥是娇客，将来同到任上，不要说是账房，只怕内外一切都要仰仗呢。」仲清听了好笑，忍不住道：「足下与孙府","en":"whose household was being spoken of, gave a vague reply, then quietly asked Wang Xun, who answered that it was Xi Eleven. A sudden surge of indignation filled Ziyu and he said nothing more. Liangxuan then turned to Yuanmao: \\"Your future wife, my cousin's cousin on the other side, is a paragon of virtue, Brother Li is truly fortunate to have arranged such a fine match."}],"40":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说前回书中，奚十一受了琴言之气，恨恨而回，心中很想收拾他，又想不出什么计策，惟有逢人便说琴言在外陪酒，怎样的待他好，还要来跟他。","en":"To return to our story: after the last encounter in which Xi Eleven had been humiliated by Qinyan and went home in a fury, he had been racking his mind for some way to exact his revenge. But, unable to think of any clever scheme, he had to content himself with spreading gossip wherever he went — claiming that Qinyan"},{"paragraph":2,"mentions":3,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"造了好些谣言，稍出了几分恶气。那一个镯子，菊花盘问起来，奚十一只说自不小心，失手砸了，菊花也无可奈何。偏有那巴英官告诉了，菊花便大闹了一场，奚十一软话央求，将来遇有好的再配，方才开交。那奚十一的为人，真是可笑，一味的弃旧怜新。从前买了春兰，也待得甚好，不到半年就冷淡了。去年得了巴英官，如获至宝，如今又弄上了得月","en":"to vent a portion of his bitter resentment. As for the matter of the bracelet, when Juhua cross-examined him, Xi Eleven simply claimed he had been careless, dropped it, and smashed it to pieces; Juhua could do nothing about it. As it happened, however, Ba Yingguan told her the truth, and Juhua raised a tremendous uproar. Xi Eleven pleaded softly and promised to match"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":9,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"闲话休题。且说奚十一那天一人独自到宏济寺来，和尚与聘才都出门去了，小和尚在自己一间房内，歪在炕上，朝里睡着。奚十一见他单穿个月白绸紧身，镶了花边，绿绉绸的套裤，剃得逼清的光头。奚十一看了动火，脱了外面长衣，倒身躺下，轻轻的解了他的带子，把裤子扯了一半下来，贴身服侍。得月","en":"But let us set idle chatter aside. To return to our story: one day Xi Eleven came alone to the Hongji Temple. Both the monk and Pincai had gone out; the young novice was in his own room, lying sideways on the kang facing the wall, fast asleep. Xi Eleven saw him wearing only a close-fitting moon-white silk inner jacket trimmed"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":1,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"得月跟着下来，往下就蹲，哗喇喇的一响，已是一大滩，臭不可当。奚十一掩着鼻子瞧那地下，还有些似脓似血的东西。","en":"squatted on the floor; with a great rushing sound he released a massive puddle — the stench was overpowering. Xi Eleven held his nose and peered at the floor; among the filth there seemed to be something resembling pus and blood."},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":3,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"奚十一找了些纸，抹了一会，裤裆上连带子上也沾了好些，一一抹了。得月皱着眉挪了挪，方才撒完了起来。不好叫人收拾，自己到煤炉里撮些灰掩上，扫净了。奚十一道：「我怎样好，快拿盆水来洗洗。」得月道：「我原说来不得，你不听。」便找了小沙盆，舀了些水，将块脚布与他，奚","en":"Xi Eleven found some paper and spent a good while wiping himself; the crotch of his trousers and even his sash ties had caught a fair amount, and he wiped them clean one by one. Deyue wrinkled his brow, shifted himself aside, and only then finished and rose. Since"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":8,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"得月重又躺下，奚十一好不扫兴。得月道：「我身子不快，且走肚子，懒得说话，你去罢。」奚十一只得出来，却好碰着卓天香进来，撞个满怀。奚十一道：「和尚与魏大爷都不在家，得月病了，懒应酬，不要进去了。」天香道：「我们还到魏老爷那边去坐坐罢，他虽不在家，也可坐得的。」奚十一无可无","en":"Deyue lay back down. Xi Eleven felt his mood thoroughly spoiled. Deyue said, \\"My body is unwell and my stomach is unsettled; I'm too lethargic to speak. You had better go.\\" Xi Eleven had no choice but to emerge, and happened to bump squarely into Zhuo Tianxiang coming in. Xi Eleven"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":2,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"衣服全当了，才得六十吊，又借了五吊钱，哈回回尚欠我们几吊钱，偏又遇他不着。如今求大老爷赏十五吊钱，了此事罢。」奚十一道：「这有什么要紧，横竖明日才还他。我们坐一坐，到潘三爷铺子里开张票子就是了。」天香道了谢，便与奚十一在一处坐着闲谈。","en":"we can't find him. So now I have come to beg the great master to bestow fifteen strings to settle this matter.\\" Xi Eleven said, \\"What is there to worry about — it isn't due until tomorrow anyway. Let's sit for a while, and then we'll go to Third Master Pan's shop and write a cash draft, and that will be that.\\" Tianxiang thanked him, and the two sat together chatting."},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":2,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"了他两吊钱。那晓得那个小回子才生了杨梅毒，尚未发出来，这一回倒过与天香了。天香此时后门口觉得焦辣辣的难受，要想奚十一与他杀杀火。奚十一见天香情动，便也高兴，两人不言而喻，闹了一回，聘才尚未回来。","en":"Tianxiang. Tianxiang at this moment was feeling a burning, scalding discomfort at his rear passage, and was hoping Xi Eleven might help quell the fire. Xi Eleven, seeing Tianxiang's passions aroused, was himself in high spirits; and so, by unspoken mutual understanding, the two had a vigorous tumble. Pincai had still not returned."},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":2,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"奚十一本要同他到潘三处取钱，忽然眼中冒火，两太阳疼胀，身子不快起来，便写了一个飞字叫天香自取。奚十一即回家，头晕眼花，扎挣不住。","en":"Xi Eleven had originally intended to go with him to Pan the Third's place to fetch the money, but suddenly felt a burning sensation in his eyes; his temples throbbed and swelled with pain, and a general malaise washed over him. He hastily dashed off a quick note"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":2,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"口中呻吟不已。菊花一夜不能安睡，明日见了那东西，吓了一跳，忙问其缘故，奚十一不肯直说，只推不知为什么忽然肿起来。菊花道：「请个医生来看看罢。」奚十一道：「唐和尚就很好，专医这些病症。」菊花便打发人去请。","en":"morning, when she saw the state of that organ, she was given a terrible fright. She hurriedly asked the cause, but Xi Eleven refused to speak plainly, merely claiming he had no idea why it had suddenly swollen up. Juhua said, \\"Let us invite a doctor to come take a look.\\" Xi Eleven said, \\"Master Tang the monk is excellent — he specializes in curing exactly these sorts of afflictions.\\""},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":6,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"原来唐和尚这几天见得月气色不正，指甲发青，知他受了毒气，便用了一剂攻毒泻火的泻药，昨日已泻了好几遍，适奚十一来承受了，由肾经直入心经。奚十一身子是空虚的，再与天香闹了一次，而天香又新染了哈小回子的疮毒，也叫奚十一收来。两毒齐发，甚为沉重。少顷，和尚来问其得病之由，奚十一只将天香的事说了，诊了脉，也用一剂泻药。谁知毒气甚深，打不下来，一连三日，更加沉重。肿溃","en":"purging decoction to attack the poison and reduce the fever. Yesterday Deyue had purged several times — just as Xi Eleven had come along to receive it, allowing the poison to enter directly from the kidney channel straight into the heart channel. Xi Eleven's constitution was already hollowed out, and then he had gone on to dally with Tianxiang, who had freshly contracted"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":1,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"了，才把那个子孙桩留了一寸有余。后来收了功，没头没脑，肉小皮宽，不知像个什么东西，要行房时，料想也不能了。此是奚十一的淫报。","en":"matter of the bedchamber, it was clear he would be incapable of it ever again. Such was the karmic retribution for Xi Eleven's lusts."}],"42":[{"paragraph":14,"mentions":1,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"。这日都在街上闲走，适相遇了，跟了琴言到门口。亮轩恍惚记得这个门，想了一会想着了，就猜方才见的是琴言。后又想起奚十一的话，说前月在聘才处叫他陪过酒，无疑是他。便与大傻讲了，大傻见亮轩高兴，欲赞成他进去，好吃个镶边酒，便道：「管他是与不是，既是相公寓里，总可以进得的，我们且进去坐坐，喝杯茶也好。」亮轩道：「你高兴就进去，我是奉陪的。」商量一会，才同了进去。","en":"a while it came to him. He guessed that the person he had seen just now was Qinyan. He then recalled something Xi Eleven had said, that the previous month he had met Qinyan at Pincai's place and had him as a drinking companion. This confirmed his guess. He shared his thought with Dasha. Dasha, seeing that Liangxuan was eager and wishing to second his enthusiasm in order"},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":1,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"看亮轩。亮轩想硬走出来，天寿拉住道：「不用忙，再坐坐。」亮轩不理，只要走，天福也来拉住。亮轩一想，不如拿出去年奚十一的手段来吓吓他，便喝道：「做什么！那里有天天带着开发来的！我们叫相公，是积了几回一总开发。你们这些不开眼的东西，还不放手，不要叫我生起气来，也照去年的样，给你们一顿打。」两个孩子怕他，不敢说话。伍麻子是个不懂规矩的人，道是长庆死了，他表姊全要仰仗他。","en":"no notice and made for the door, and Tianfu caught hold of him too.\\n\\nLiangxuan thought he might as well borrow Xi Eleven's trick from last year and frighten them, and he shouted, \\"What is this! Who goes about with his payment in his pocket day in and day out? When we engage a boy we settle several visits together in one sum. You ill-bred creatures — let go, or you will"},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":1,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"罢，不要在此啰唣，适或教我们老爷听见了，倒不好。」伍麻子见亮轩已进去了，又不好跟进去，再经那门公劝告他，知道是奚十一的寓处，恐怕闹出事来，只好转回，却也讲了好些淡话，匆匆回家交账。","en":"gone inside and he could not very well go in after him. With the gatekeeper's persuasion, and realizing this was Xi Eleven's lodgings and that making trouble there could lead to worse trouble for himself, he had no choice but to turn back, though not without venting his frustration at some length on the way home to give his account."},{"paragraph":34,"mentions":4,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"钱，这一吊还是后来加上的。那个忘八蛋肯接他的？他塞在你手里，就跑进去了。我想跟他进去，有个管门的出来解劝，说是奚十一的寓处。那奚十一是好惹的？去年凭空的来找琴官，将姐夫一摔一个大筋斗，半天爬不起来，桌椅板凳打得粉碎。倘今日又遇见了他，可不要白挨一顿打，连这三吊钱也没有，我所以只好接了回来。我岂不想他三十吊么？」长庆媳妇道：「都是你们这些瞎眼睛的，也不分个人鬼。分明","en":"ducked inside. I thought about following him in, but a gatekeeper came out to calm things down, saying it was Xi Eleven's lodgings. Is Xi Eleven someone to trifle with? Last year he came out of nowhere to make trouble over Qinyan, grabbed his brother-in-law and threw him over in a sprawling tumble. The man couldn't get up for ages, and the tables and chairs were smashed"}],"43":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，可曾得过他家的钱。又说家中一年的浇裹，须得两千四百吊钱，要我给他二百吊钱一月，说定了方叫我进城。我想去年原为奚十一的事送我进去，我进去了也没有见着师父，不知其中是怎样的。今师娘忽然问我要二百吊钱一月，叫我怎么打算得出来？又要我去对华公子讲，又说师父死了，我就变了心，又说华府也没有花过三千五千两。如今要我去对公子讲，要他出三千银子与我出师，出了师，才不要我的养膳。","en":"city until this was settled. As I recall, I was sent in last year because of the Hua family's matter concerning Xi Eleven; after I entered I never even met my shifu, and I still don't know the full story. Now, out of nowhere, my master's wife is demanding two hundred strings from me a month — how am I ever to manage that? She also wants me to speak to Young Master Hua myself."}],"44":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"去陪酒了。」姚贤一面想，一面走，忽前面来了两个熟人，一个二十九岁叫孟七，是徐子云的家人；一个三十九岁叫胡八，是奚十一的家人，都是本京人，那胡八与姚贤是两姨中表，这三个人都是相好的。这日胡八因主人患病无事，出来找了孟七听戏，想到馆子里去吃饭，遇见了姚贤，又是城里出来的，便一把拉住，各人问了好，便邀进了馆子，要了几样菜、两壶酒，细酌闲谈。孟七问起姚贤，倒有空出城闲逛，","en":"twenty-nine-year-old Meng Qi, a household man of Xu Ziyun's; the other was thirty-nine-year-old Hu Ba, a household man of Xi Eleven's. Both were natives of the capital. Hu Ba was Yao Xian's first cousin on the maternal side; all three were on friendly terms. That day Hu Ba, whose master was ill and had no errands, had come out to find Meng Qi to watch a performance, and then intended"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":1,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"。」又转念道：「看他的心总是勉强在此，心上又有什么梅少爷，自然在外面快乐。但到徐老爷处也还罢了。怎么连魏聘才、奚十一都陪酒来了？就不顾自己身分，也应留公子脸面。翡翠镯子也不算什么宝贝，就这么下作。偏在府里时装腔作势，十三太保的样儿，冷气逼人。原来也报应在我眼里。此时就要替你遮瞒也不能了，不如照直说罢。这是有骨气的人作的事，也可臊臊人的脸，他身分好，不像个唱戏的，全","en":"dare to tell lies?\\" said Yao Xian. \\"These are words spoken by Meng Qi of Lord Xu's household and Hu Ba of the Xi family's household — with witnesses to what was said. Would I dare add a word? Is it something to jest about?\\" Shanzhi turned it over in his mind: \\"How could Qinyan be so ungrateful? Not only has the young master loved him for nothing — I have taken"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":1,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"个八个人，若待他与众人一样，他必不相安。断没有将野鸡养成成家鸡的，坏了良心还有什么好处，只怕天也不容。况且那个奚十一，奴才虽不认识他，听说是极混账的人，也陪他喝酒，岂不辱抹杀人。奴才想这一件下作事，就不到徐老爷处，也可以不要他了。」公子听了珊枝的话，气略平了些。","en":"barnyard hen. His conscience ruined, what good can come of it? Heaven itself may not permit it. Besides, this Xi Eleven — I do not know him personally, but he is said to be a thoroughly disreputable man. To attend wine parties for such a one — is that not a disgrace? In my view, that single vulgarity alone, even setting aside the matter of Lord Xu, is enough reason not"}],"47":[{"paragraph":4,"mentions":3,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"且说那奚十一病好之后，已养了一月有余，此时性子减了好些，身体瘦了好些，烟瘾又大了好些。但奚十一这个孽障，虽经了这番痛苦，就应该痛改前非，保身节欲。谁知他身体一健，仍旧不安本分。况且内有菊花，外有巴英官，这两重前后门是封锁不来的，未免也要应酬应酬。无奈那厥物甚不妥","en":"Meanwhile, Xi Eleven, once recovered from his illness, had convalesced well over a month. His temper had mellowed somewhat, his frame had grown somewhat thinner, and his opium craving had grown somewhat stronger. But this creature of sin, having suffered such torment, ought"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":4,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一日要到宏济寺去谢唐和尚，封了五十两银子，叫英官拿了。到了寺门口，见间壁开了个饭庄子，挂着招牌，写着安吉堂。奚十一也不理会，到寺中见了得月，有些恨上心来，把他肩上狠狠的拧了一把。得月嚷道：「做什么使劲的拧我？」奚十一笑道：「你害得我好苦，病了一个多月不算，把那子孙桩也锯掉了半截，教我做了个废人，我好不恨你。」得月把眼狠狠的瞅了他一下，冷笑了一声，道：「你不知那里","en":"resentment, and he gave the boy's shoulder a vicious twist. Deyue cried out: \\"Why are you twisting me so hard?\\" Xi Eleven smiled grimly: \\"You made me suffer bitterly. Not only was I bedridden for a month, but you sawed off half my family pillar and left me a cripple. How could I not hate you?\\" Deyue shot him a fierce glare and sneered: \\"You picked it up God knows where,"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":5,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"只见唐和尚醉醺醺的回来，见了奚十一，满面春风的道：「恭喜，恭喜，如今是大好了。」奚十一笑道：「多谢，多谢，还亏了你。虽然如今做了歪脖子的老短，到底还留得一半。若用了那人的药，定然弄到斩草除根，净了身了。我也没有什么谢你，这一点东西算还你的药本罢。」说罢，作了一个揖，从英官手里接过来，","en":"Presently Monk Tang returned drunk, saw Xi Eleven, and beamed with a spring breeze in his face: \\"Congratulations, congratulations—you are fully recovered now.\\" Xi Eleven laughed: \\"Many thanks, many thanks, all owing to you. Though I am now a crooked-necked stump, at least half remains. Had I used that"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":1,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"二人讲了一会话，唐和尚道：「你如今想已不忌口了，我这个庄子有几样菜颇好，今日尝尝新。」奚十一道：「这个庄子是谁开的？开有几天了？」唐和尚道：「这所房子是我寺里的，前年师兄租与一家住了，吊死了两个人，那家就搬了出去。以后常常的闹鬼，所以闲空了一年。前月春阳馆的黄掌柜的来，看这屋子好开庄子，与我搭伙计，我出了四千吊钱，才开了三天。有个厨子会做几","en":"dietary restrictions. This dining house of mine serves a few excellent dishes; come try something new today.\\" Xi Eleven asked: \\"Who opened this place? How long has it been running?\\" Monk Tang replied: \\"The building belongs to my temple. The year before last, my senior brother rented it to a family, but two people hanged themselves, and the family moved out. Afterward,"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":3,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"若奚十一从前听了，不知怎样高兴，无奈如今大非昔比，眼前不见，耳中不闻，倒还好些。若听了那些话，见了那些人，心中一动，底下那脑袋就像要伸出来，这条筋偏又拳缩伸不直，好不难受，因此不敢动心。他也不怕人笑他，就将这个苦楚说给唐和尚听，听得唐和尚大笑不止，说道：「你","en":"In former days, Xi Eleven would have been thrilled beyond words to hear this, but alas, things were vastly different now. Out of sight and out of mind was better. Hearing such talk and seeing such people would stir his desires, and the stump below would try to rise, but that"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":1,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"。而且听得说人是不疼不痒的。这人叫阳善修，现寓在城外，想必你那个也可以接得。但据你说短了，不晓得能接长不能。」奚十一听了，满心欢喜，就立逼着唐和尚去请他来商量。","en":"sure yours can be grafted too. But since you say it is short, I do not know if he can lengthen it.\\" Hearing this, Xi Eleven was filled with joy and immediately pressed Monk Tang to fetch the man for a consultation."},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":2,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"那阳善修住得不远，不多一刻来了。唐和尚出来，照应他先在外间坐下。奚十一从里面看他，面貌颇不适观，衣裳蓝缕，有几分瞧不起他，也不出来，叫唐和尚与他说话。和尚将奚十一的毛病讲了。阳善修道：「讲接法也不同，先看各人的本源，再看各人的行货。譬如那老年人筋力衰的，是不能接的，就接了也是白接。若是本源好的，就烂掉了半截，只要有个根","en":"nearby and arrived in short order. Monk Tang went out and saw to seating him in the outer room first. From inside, Xi Eleven observed him: his face was rather unseemly, his clothes ragged, and Xi Eleven felt a touch of disdain, remaining inside and letting Tang speak with him. The monk explained Xi Eleven's affliction. Yang Shanxiu said: \\"Grafting methods vary. One must first"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":11,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"唐和尚同了他进去，奚十一勉强把腰松了一松，就坐下了。阳善修见奚十一才三十来岁，身材长大，像个本源未亏的人。但看他那威风凛凛的样子，不敢来问他，局局促促的站着。奚十一把手一招，叫他坐了。方才讲的话，奚十一早已听见，便道：「我这个病就有一样作怪，内中像有条筋扳住，胀起来，他就有","en":"Monk Tang brought him inside. Xi Eleven loosened his sash slightly and sat down. Seeing Xi Eleven was only in his thirties, tall and robust, Yang judged him a man whose fundamental vigor was intact. Yet, intimidated by his commanding, fierce demeanor, Yang dared not question him and stood"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":6,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"奚十一满心欢喜，便等不及唐和尚请他吃饭，即辞了回去，与菊花说知，菊花更加欢喜，便找了丁香油出来，绝早就吃饭，过了瘾，催奚十一睡了，将药调得浓浓的，敷满了他，将带子捆上。奚十一觉得那物先凉后热，一会儿火烧起来，胀得甚疼，便叫菊花把带子收紧，收紧了觉好些，一连","en":"Overjoyed, Xi Eleven could not even wait for Monk Tang's meal; he took his leave, went home, and told Juhua. She was even more delighted, fetching the clove oil at once. They ate supper very early, smoked their opium, and Juhua hurried Xi Eleven to bed. Mixing a thick paste"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":4,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"吃了早饭，唐和尚同了那人前来，奚十一到书房里陪他们坐了，阳善修问了昨夜的光景。菊花走将出来，从板壁缝里望那个医生，生得颇不顺眼，一个黄肿脸儿，约三十来岁年纪，有几根微须，身材短小，穿一件油晃晃的旧绸袄子，两只袖子破烂不堪。又见唐和尚的头剃得紫光油滑，穿件青绸夹袄，拿着把扇子扇着。听得那","en":"After breakfast, Monk Tang arrived with the doctor. Xi Eleven sat with them in the study, and Yang Shanxiu asked how the night had gone. Juhua crept out and peered through the cracks in the wooden partition. The doctor looked utterly unpresentable—a sallow, puffy face, about thirty years old, with a sparse beard"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":7,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"菊花见那人先调了半盏子药，将奚十一的带子解开，将水洗净，把绸子擦干了。菊花嫌那板缝小，还有些灰土嵌在里面，取下金耳挖来，把板缝里的灰剔得干干净净，眼光才望得到转弯处。见那人将药与他敷上，又拿一个绸套子套上，点了五寸长一枝香。奚十一与和尚躺下吹烟，菊花又见那人到窗前桌子上解了一包，取出","en":"Juhua saw the man mix half a cup of paste, untie Xi Eleven's band, wash him clean with water, and dry him with the silk. Displeased that the partition crack was too narrow and clogged with dust, she took her gold earpick and scraped the crack completely clean until she had a clear view around the corner. She"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":3,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"已上了好一会，菊花忍不住又走了出来瞧时，见那人说道：「香已点完了，药性也走到了。」身边又扯了一块青绉纱来，笑对奚十一道：「疼是一点不疼的，但你自己看了，我就下不得手，你须闭了眼。」奚十一听了，把绉纱在脸上捆了两道。叫他坐在炕沿上，把腿分开，搁在两张凳上。那人拿了药线放在一边，即蹲下身子，从竹筒里拣出两把小钢刀。菊花见了害怕，心里已突突的乱跳。见那人解下套子，那敷上","en":"burned down; the medicine has taken effect.\\" Pulling a strip of black crepe silk from his pocket, he smiled at Xi Eleven: \\"It will not hurt in the slightest, but if you watch, I will not have the nerve to strike. You must close your eyes.\\" Xi Eleven obliged, tying the crepe silk twice around his face. The man had him sit on the edge of the kang, legs spread and resting"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":6,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"唐和尚问道：「怎样？」奚十一道：「倒也不觉怎样，就是下身麻木，此时两腿一动也难动。」阳善修把他腿掇了下来，扶他睡下，说道：「每日吃煎药一服，我留下方子，你们自去抓罢。敷药我每天午正时来替你上，七日内包好。好之后切不可就使唤他，总要两三月之后，方可办事，不然是要受伤的。切记，切记","en":"Monk Tang asked: \\"How is it?\\" Xi Eleven replied: \\"I don't feel much of anything, just numbness below; it's hard to even move my legs right now.\\" Yang Shanxiu lifted his legs down, helped him lie flat, and said: \\"Drink one dose of decoction every day. I will leave the prescription; you can"}],"50":[{"paragraph":20,"mentions":1,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"人都说他为嫖割股，你们说这个自行伤可笑不可笑？」于是大家大笑，道：「那潘三本不是个东西。」文泽道：「我知道你与奚十一相好。」唐和尚道：「这奚大老爷闹得很，今年生了毒疮，几乎性命不保，还是我医好他的。如今他也要到班了，七月内有缺就是他的。我想人生聚散是一定的。去年有位富三老爷，是魏大爷相好，魏大爷托我照应，才选了湖北。有个贵大爷，是富三爷的相好，他们是朝夕不离的，也","en":"agreeing, \\"That Pan the Third was never any good to begin with.\\" Wenze said, \\"I know you are close friends with Xi Eleven.\\" Monk Tang nodded solemnly, \\"That Elder Master Xi has had a terrible time of it. This year he broke out in poisonous sores and very nearly lost his life! It was I who finally cured him. Now, his time for appointment is approaching; if there's a vacancy"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":1,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"还，便到孙宅去找他，谁知元茂同了他两个舅子下通州赴考去了，只好认了晦气。到出京那几日，一起一起的饯行，潘其观、奚十一、张仲雨、冯子佩、杨梅窗、张笑梅、顾月卿、唐和尚等轮流作饯，唐和尚的庄子好不热闹，聘才又辞了几天行。","en":"days leading up to his departure from the capital, farewell banquets were thrown one after another. Pan Qiguan, Xi Eleven, Zhang Zhongyu, Feng Zipei, Yang Meichuang, Zhang Xiaomei, Gu Yueqing, Monk Tang, and others took turns hosting him. Tang's establishment was exceptionally lively, and Pincai ended up postponing his departure for several more days."},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":2,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"白菊花未从良时与玉天仙同在一局，且甚相好，结为异姓姊妹，玉天仙长菊花两岁。菊花与奚十一讲了，要请玉天仙过来饯行，奚十一岂有不肯之理？即请了玉天仙到家。菊花出外迎接。到了里面见了礼，坐下各谈契阔。玉天仙道：「我见四妹从了良，又遇见这位多情的老爷，我便心上羡慕。不料的我的运气不好，去年吃了一场官司。我看这个魏大爷倒很有情，为我吃了这些苦，","en":"exceedingly close, having sworn an oath as adopted sisters; Yutianxian was the elder by two years. Juhua spoke with Xi Eleven, expressing her desire to invite Yutianxian over for a farewell meal. How could Xi Eleven possibly refuse? He immediately sent an invitation to Yutianxian. When she arrived, Juhua hurried out to welcome her. Once inside, they exchanged formal greetings,"}],"56":[{"paragraph":26,"mentions":1,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"见许多人影，从镜子里过去，就是那一班名士与一班名旦。自己忽将镜子反过来，隐隐的有好些人映在里面，好像是魏聘才、奚十一等类。正看时，那镜子忽转旋起来，光明如月，成了一颗大珠，颇觉有趣。忽然船舱外伸进一只蓝手，满臂的鳞甲，伸开五个大爪，把这面镜子抢去了。","en":"celebrated actors. He turned the mirror slightly, and the dim figures shifting within seemed to be Wei Pincai, Xi Eleven, and other men of their ilk. As he watched in utter fascination, the mirror suddenly began to spin. It grew as radiantly bright as the full moon, magically transforming into a single, massive pearl—a truly marvelous sight. But suddenly, a terrifying"}],"58":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":3,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"却说奚十一选了广西一个知州，是个极苦的地方，十分不乐，心上想告病不去。又因近着他家乡，且菊花是广西人，借此可以回家看看，因此竭力唆成。奚十一近来得了家信，洋行倒了，盐场又为海水冲了，家事不好。又听得老太翁得了腿疾，也要告病。又想家内兄弟都已回去，也轮不到他作主","en":"Xi Eleven had been selected as magistrate of a department in Guangxi. It was an extremely bitter posting, and he was thoroughly displeased, inclined to plead illness and not go. It lay near his home region, however, and Juhua was a Guangxi native, so he could"},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":1,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"别的帐局更不用说。奚十一竟至告贷无门。思前想后，不得主意。此时十月天气，日短夜长，日里在外头张罗，夜间开了灯，惟以吃烟为事。吃迷了，睡着不醒。一连几夜，把个菊花熬得清水直流。且自三月内修肾之后，虽然壮观了些，其实不中用。","en":"Other lenders need not be mentioned. Xi Eleven could not borrow a coin anywhere. He thought back and forward and found no plan. It was the tenth month, with days short and nights long. By day he scrounged abroad, and at night, with lamps lit, he did nothing but smoke opium. Lost in the pipe, he slept"},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":8,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"重脚轻，虽见头脑狰狞，其实根株疲软，只好停顿多而纵送少。菊花才二十几岁，火盆似的，如何能常吃那粗粝东西？一日，奚十一带了胡八出门去了，与唐和尚商量。一轮晴日，满照明窗，菊花梳了头，好不纳闷。无意之间到外边来散步，走到跟班房门口，见关着门，里面有笑声。菊花轻轻的在门缝里一张，见春兰弯着腰在炕边，看有四只脚站在一处。菊花一见，即把袖子掩了口，听巴英官说道：「你倒会长，","en":"was only in her twenties, a brazier of appetite. How could she constantly endure that coarse implement? One day Xi Eleven took Hu Eight out on business and went to consult Monk Tang. Under a clear sun filling the bright windows Juhua dressed her hair, thoroughly bored. Idly she strolled outside and came to the attendants' quarters. The door was shut, but laughter came from"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":17,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"奚十一忽从怀中摸出个纸包看看，重又揣好了。菊花问是什么东西，奚十一道：「宝贝。」菊花道：「给我瞧瞧。」奚十一道：「停一停，用的时候给你瞧。」菊花笑嘻嘻的一骨碌爬了过来，伏在奚十一身上，在怀里掏了出来，解开一看，是几条白绫带子，便道：「呸，这个宝贝！用也用了","en":"Xi Eleven suddenly fished a paper packet from his breast, glanced at it, and tucked it away again. Juhua asked what it was. Xi said it was a treasure. \\"Let me see,\\" she demanded. \\"Wait, when it's time to use it, I'll show you,\\" he replied. Juhua giggled, scrambled"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":5,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"奚十一知他难受，便把腰一弓，头到门口，忽然如针刺的一疼，急拔了出来。菊花坐起，披上衣服，道：「这带子怎么这般利害？」奚十一道：「你里头怎样的？」菊花道：「起头甚好，后来便如炭火一样，直烧到心里来。方才你吃的什么药？以后不要吃他了。」奚十一道：「太吃多了。那","en":"Xi Eleven knew she suffered. He arched his waist, pointed his head toward the door, then felt a stab like needles and yanked free in haste. Juhua sat up and threw on clothes, \\"How can a ribbon be that vicious?\\" Xi asked how it felt inside. Juhua shuddered, \\"Fine"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":2,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"到了明日，早饭后，奚十一即拉了姬亮轩，坐了车，巴英官骑了马，到了九香楼。奚十一下了车，见是大门里面竖着一块屏风，两旁放着金字招牌，一块是收买秦汉唐宋古玩书画，一块是发卖苏杭花绣衣料，一切洋货俱全，还有一块是内看金珠宝玉、四时花卉。此时那九个名旦均已出班，内有未满师者，也是宝","en":"The next morning after breakfast, Xi Eleven pulled Ji Liangxuan into a carriage, while Ba Yingguan rode horseback, and they reached Nine-Fragrance Tower. Xi stepped down to find a screen inside the main gate and gilt-lettered boards on either side. One was for buying Qin, Han, Tang, and Song antiquities,"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":3,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"奚十一、姬亮轩走进了大门，见门房两人站起招呼，一个便引他们进了二门。见上面是五间正屋，两边厢房。到了那东厢，便有个伙计出来招接，衣冠楚楚，相貌文雅，五十余岁年纪，请他们坐了，问了姓名，即有人送上茶来。奚十一四下张望，并不见班里一个，便问那人道：「这班掌柜的","en":"Xi Eleven and Ji Liangxuan entered the gate. Two gatemen stood to greet them, and one led them through the second gate. Above were five main bays with wings on either side. In the east wing a clerk came out to receive them. His hat and gown were neat, his face"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":1,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"奚十一道：「你在这里掌柜么？」大傻笑道：「闲着没有事，他们要我过来帮同照料。」姬亮轩从前打茶围上了大傻的当，后来已经说明，大傻倒说得好，我回去取钱来，你又走了。","en":"Xi Eleven asked, \\"Do you mind the shop here?\\" Big Fool smiled, \\"I have idle hands, so they asked me to help watch.\\" Ji Liangxuan had once been cheated by Big Fool at a tea-house visit. That misunderstanding was cleared up later, and Big Fool had said fairly that"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":5,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"晚上，还给了他们十几吊钱，亮轩似信不信的。后来伍麻子即跟了长庆的媳妇回扬州去了，此话绝无对证。三人讲了些闲话，奚十一便问大傻子，那些相公在什么地方。大傻道：「今日就只王兰官、苏蕙芳在家，其余都出门去了。」奚十一道：「我要看看花，你同我们去。」大傻便领了奚、姬二人，从东边进了一重门，见是一带游廊，假山层迭，花木扶疏，大大小小盆景有几千盆，有楼有阁，有台有池，甚是有趣","en":"Pockmark had followed Changqing's widow back to Yangzhou, so the story could not be checked. The three chatted, and Xi Eleven asked Big Fool where the actors were. Big Fool replied, \\"Today only Wang Lanbao and Su Huifang are home, the rest are out.\\" Xi demanded, \\"I want to see the flowers, so take us.\\" Big Fool led Xi and Ji through an east door into a gallery of layered rockwork,"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":7,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"见他才二十几岁，好生面善，想了一想，像是从前潘三那个赶车的，如今体面多了。那人一见了奚十一，低着头过去。大傻子道：「你应认得这人。」奚十一道：「好像潘三从前那个赶车的一样。」大傻道：「可不是他？如今他靠着他女人的福，不赶车，做了状元公的家人了。」奚十一逛了一会，重到九香楼下来，园中有许多灌园的浇灌花木，还有几个扎花匠修剪花树，与那小使们川","en":"The young man looked barely twenty, yet his face seemed familiar. Xi studied him for a moment and recognized Pan the Third's former driver, now dressed and strutting with a dignity far beyond his old station. The man, seeing Xi Eleven, lowered his head and passed by. Big Fool said, \\"You ought to know him.\\" Xi agreed,"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":1,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一人骂道：「不是那个小狗肏的？连那佛手也摘了两个。」就听得大闹起来，有个小孩子声音乱骂乱嚷的。大傻子走了出去。奚十一懒的起身，但听得像巴英官的声音与人嚷闹，便叫亮轩出去看看。见一丛人围着，走上前，见英官揪住了一个人，那人把马鞭子打了他几下，英官号啕哭骂道：「你骂我兔崽子，你是驴崽子！将老婆的众去讹钱，讹到了手，如今要充二爷了。」","en":"wretch took two Buddha's-hand citrons too!\\" A child's voice cursed and yelled. Big Fool went out to investigate. Xi was too lazy to rise but thought it sounded like Ba Yingguan quarreling and told Liangxuan to look. A crowd had gathered. Yingguan had seized someone who had struck him with a whip. Yingguan howled, \\"You call me rabbit, but you're a donkey colt! You"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":5,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"奚十一听了许久，忍不住出来，见众人劝开了，但心中甚怒。望见芙蓉花外站着两个玉人，认得是蕙芳、兰保，觉得光辉相映，不觉涎垂起来，便说道：「你们这些相公好不讲理，怎么无缘无故的就打起人来？」蕙芳一看，认的是奚十一，便拉了兰保进去了。奚十一大怒，他也不管有客，便","en":"Xi Eleven had listened for a long time and could not stay inside. Everyone had separated, but he was furious. Beyond the hibiscus two jade figures stood, Huifang and Lanbao, their light reflecting between them until his mouth watered. He challenged them, \\"You"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":4,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"听得里面有人说道：「你们就出去见他，怕他怎么？这个无耻下作的东西，打了他也不要紧。」奚十一大怒，即将桌子一掀，碗盏砸了好些，大骂起来，里头也大骂。奚十一如何能忍，要赶进去打架，亮轩却劝住，只见蕙芳、兰保出来，对奚十一点点头，道：「尊驾为什么发气，到小店来照顾什么？敢是敝伙计们得罪了。」奚十一听了，火上添油，圆睁两眼，大喝道：「你别支起那屁","en":"inside said, \\"Go out and see him, what's to fear? He is shameless trash, just beat him and it will be no matter.\\" Xi exploded, flipped the table, smashed bowls and dishes, and cursed. Curses answered from within. He could not endure it and would have rushed in to fight, but Liangxuan restrained him. Huifang and Lanbao emerged, nodded to Xi, and asked, \\"Why the anger,"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":8,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"蕙芳气得满面通红，尚未回答，兰保已大怒，说道：「这个人真混账，认也认不得，就闹起来，敢是个疯子？」奚十一听了，抢过来就抓兰保，兰保已按住他的手，说道：「你要怎样？」奚十一也不回言，那只手又飞过一掌来，兰保一闪，就将他胁下一扠，奚十一踉踉跄跄，直跌出去，奚十一自知要跌，幸记得后头有张桌子，把左手一扶，腰里使劲，扭转身来。因他身子高大，脚下虚浮，往前一撞，","en":"not yet speaking, when Lanbao flared, \\"What a brute! Barely introduced and he makes a scene. Is he a madman?\\" Xi lunged for Lanbao, but Lanbao caught his hand and demanded, \\"What do you want?\\" Xi said nothing, but his other hand flew. Lanbao dodged and jabbed him under the ribs, sending Xi staggering straight backward. Knowing he would fall, he remembered a table"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":4,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"到了家，进了房，见菊花捆绉纱包头，两太阳帖了两个小红膏药，两眼水汪汪的靠在枕上。奚十一将花袖给他看了，菊花才有笑容，软洋洋的坐不起来。奚十一道：「怎么样？」菊花道：「今日觉得不舒服。」奚十一摸他的手有些发热，便笑道：「昨日弄伤了？」菊花笑道：「或者脱衣时冒了风。你出去后忽然就疼起来。」奚十一又开灯吃烟，菊花也吃了几口。","en":"plaster on each temple. Her eyes were wet and languid as she leaned against the pillow, too weak to sit upright. Xi showed her the sleeves, and she smiled at last and lay limp, unable to sit. Xi asked what was wrong. Juhua said, \\"I feel unwell today.\\" Her hand felt warm, and Xi smiled, \\"Did you hurt yourself yesterday undressing?\\" Juhua smiled, \\"Or caught a chill."},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":2,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"奚十一越想越气，心上想个法子要收拾他们，又因有些阔人护着，他自己相与的都是些没有势力的，又因出京已近，闹出事来于功名有碍，只能罢了。菊花一连病了几日，奚十一的春药不能发试，心中便闷。","en":"The angrier Xi thought, the more he plotted revenge. Yet powerful patrons shielded the shop, and his own circle lacked influence. His departure was near, and a scandal might harm his career, so he had to let it drop. Juhua was ill several days running. Xi's spring"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":2,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一日，唐和尚送行，约了潘三来，潘三打发人来说：「跌坏了鼻子，要避风，不能来。」奚十一、唐和尚都疑潘三怪了，是托辞的。那日奚十一见了得月，想与他叙叙，无奈唐和尚在前，只得忍住，酒也多喝了几杯，烟又多吹了几口，到二更后才回，醉醺醺的。底下那东西甚是作怪，时刻直竖起来，头上痒飕飕的，好不难受。看看菊花口里哼哼唧唧的，身上火炭一般，嘴唇皮结","en":"invited Pan the Third. Pan sent word that he had broken his nose and must avoid the wind, so he could not come. Xi and Monk Tang suspected Pan was sulking and making excuses. That day Xi saw Deyue and wished to renew acquaintance, but with Monk Tang present he held back. He drank extra cups, smoked extra pipes, and only returned past the second watch, thoroughly"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":7,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"英官强头强脑的打了几口，便出去。奚十一叫住了，英官靠着门，望着奚十一道：「有什么事？」奚十一道：「走来！」英官不应，奚十一笑道：「你来，我有样东西给你看看。」英官方慢慢的走来，道：「看什么？不是又有了翡翠镯子了。」奚十一坐起，拉了过来，抱了他。英官冷笑道：「闹什么鬼？我又不是得月、卓天香","en":"Yingguan sullenly blew a few draws and left. Xi called him back. Yingguan leaned on the door and looked at Xi, asking, \\"What is it?\\" Xi said, \\"Come here.\\" Yingguan did not move. Xi smiled, \\"Come, I have something to show you.\\" Yingguan approached slowly and asked, \\"What, more jade bracelets?\\" Xi sat"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":5,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"岁起，到如今大约着一千人没有，八百人总有多无少。里头长了一层厚膜，就如炉子搪上一层泥一样，凭你怎样，他也不疼。奚十一驰骤了一回，头上忽又疼起来，四面的筋爆涨，如春笋经雷，参参怒长，一股气往顶上直冒。奚十一不顾死活，一顿乱春。英官见他如此发狂，便把上脑箍的劲使出来，趁奚十一顶得紧紧的，便在他根子边一箍，箍得那绫带反松了一线。奚十一提不起来，觉内中一阵阵的如热油炸他那","en":"hundred at least. Inside grew a thick membrane, like stove lining, so however you used him, he hardly felt pain. Xi Eleven galloped a while, then his tip hurt again, with veins swelling on every side like spring bamboo after thunder, shooting upward. Reckless, he thrust wildly. Yingguan, seeing him so frenzied, used the \\"upper brain-hoop\\" grip. While Xi pressed deep, he"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":6,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"众家人听见这一响。连忙过来看时，见篷塌了半边，并未压人，不知主人与英官何故躺倒。忙将灯照时，见奚十一的阳物血淋淋的只有半截，再看英官的屁股，也是血淋淋的，脏头拖出三四寸。众人个个失色，便大惊小怪乱闹起来，忙报与菊花知道。菊花听了，急得一身透汗，也顾不得病，穿上衣裳，着了裤子，袜子也穿不及，趿上鞋，把衣衿掩好，只扣了外面钮子，直跌直晃的出来。姬亮轩也","en":"canopy had fallen but crushed no one, yet why the master and Yingguan lay flat they could not tell. Lamps showed Xi Eleven's member bloody and half gone. Yingguan's buttocks were bloody too, with a bloody three- or four-inch length of flesh protruding. Everyone paled and raised a clamor, and they sent word to Juhua. She broke out in a cold sweat, forgot her sickness, threw"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":1,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"些。此时心里痛苦，再想不起自己没有穿裤子。菊花坐在炕上，亮轩蹲在地下，却是对面，中间放了一个蜡灯。菊花一手摸着奚十一心坎，回头看他服事英官。只见亮轩两腿中间垂着一根肉柱，头锐根粗，倒有四寸来长，好个怪样。亮轩身子微动，那物也摆来摆去。菊花看了，心中一动，便扭转了头，又不好意思说他。但门外还有些人，若被他们看见了，也是不便。又看了两眼，心中突突的乱跳，只得说道：「姬","en":"his robe, he lifted his front hem, too distraught to recall he wore no trousers. Juhua sat on the kang, hand on Xi's chest, and glanced back at Ji tending Yingguan. She saw between Ji's legs a flesh column hanging, the tip sharp and root thick, near four inches, grotesque. When Ji moved, it swayed. Her heart jumped, and she looked away, too shy to speak. Yet people"},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":1,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"同他去看英官，阳善修也与他几味药吃了，说道：「这个不要紧，明日就缩进去的。」阳善修去了，菊花就在书房中睡，陪了奚十一。这一唬，倒把个菊花的病唬好了。叫家人把顶篷支好，扫去了灰土。","en":"medicines too, saying, \\"This is nothing, tomorrow it'll retract.\\" Yang left, and Juhua slept in the study beside Xi. The shock cured Juhua's illness. Servants propped the canopy and swept the dust."},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":2,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"奚十一上了药，便止了痛。明日阳善修复来。过了十余日，伤痕平复。阳善修说道：「从此你要戒淫才好，若再把根子弄散了，那就有性命之忧，不如吃两剂寒凉药，断了性罢。」奚十一无奈，与菊花商量，菊花也只得由他。遂听了阳善修，吃了十剂凉药，从此春蚕如死，再不起性了。又谢","en":"With medicine applied, Xi's pain stopped. Yang Shanxiu came the next day, and after ten-odd days the wound closed. Yang said, \\"From now on abstain. If you damage the root again, life is at risk. Better to take cooling drafts and kill the urge altogether.\\" Xi had no choice, so"},{"paragraph":30,"mentions":1,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"奚十一病好之后，带了菊花赴任，潘三打发伙计同去讨账。唐和尚倒十分惆怅，又请了几天，临行与得月送出城外，倒算个全始全终的交情了。潘三因脸上有病，不好见风，这月内总不出门。","en":"After Xi Eleven recovered, he took Juhua to his post. Pan the Third sent clerks along to collect the debt. Monk Tang was quite melancholy and kept him several extra days. On leaving, he and Deyue escorted Xi beyond the city, cementing a friendship complete in courtesy."},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":1,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"叙起他们一件闲事来。今年六月初六，唐和尚生日，请潘三、奚十一在庙里吃面，又备了两桌送与白菊花、石氏。石氏处是打发得月送去。这石氏见了得月那个模样，中心甚是爱他，给了他许多东西，便要他做干儿子。得月岂有不肯，便拜了干娘，以后常常叫他来走动。得月若来，必陪着石氏吃饭，或时抹牌顽耍。又知道潘三爱男风，必想得月，不许","en":"their affairs, on the sixth day of the sixth month, which was Monk Tang's birthday, he invited Pan the Third and Xi Eleven to the temple for noodles, and sent two tables to Bai Juhua and to Lady Shi. Lady Shi's table went by Deyue. Lady Shi took one look at Deyue and loved him, gave him many gifts, and asked him to be her godson. Deyue agreed at once, kowtowed to his godmother,"},{"paragraph":38,"mentions":3,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"因用力太猛，将那银指甲打断，既薄且尖，竟将潘三的鼻子尖刮断，故此流得满面的血。潘三痛不可忍，忙忙跑出，就请了与奚十一修肾的那个阳善修医治，也与他配了个假鼻子。潘三因在家不能医治，又怕他女人再打，竟不敢回家，就在城里他的那个靴铺内住着，日日请那阳善修进城与他诊视，服药两月有余，方见大好。从此各处传说，又有人赠他个美名，叫做抓三爷，又叫大眼三儿。奚十一断肾那几天，正是","en":"nose, hence the blood. Pan could not bear the pain, fled, and sent for Yang Shanxiu, the same who had repaired Xi Eleven's kidney, to fit a false nose. Pan could not heal at home and feared his wife's fists. He dared not return, lodged at his boot shop in the city, and had Yang come daily for two months before he mended. Tales spread, and people gave him a fine name: \\"Scratch"}],"60":[{"paragraph":17,"mentions":6,"tokens":["奚十一"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"。\\n琴仙赞道：「这首七古，实在做得好，念去比《公孙大娘舞剑器行》还刻画得入细。」王兰保笑而不言。蕙芳道：「去年奚十一闹来，幸亏着他，我就没有法了。」素兰道：「原来你也怕奚十一，难道他比潘三还利害么？」蕙芳道：「潘三是个无用的人，那奚十一闹起来，就与前日魏聘才使来的车夫一样，你怕不怕？」兰保道：「那天适或我不在家，你便怎样？」蕙芳道：「我就躲开不出来了。」琴仙问奚十","en":"than in *Ballad of Lady Gongsun's Sword Dance*.\\" Wang Lanbao merely smiled without speaking. Huifang said, \\"When Xi Eleven caused that uproar last year, we were lucky to have him, or I would have been completely at a loss.\\" Sulan asked, \\"So even you were afraid of Xi Eleven? Is he really more formidable than Pan the Third?\\" Huifang replied, \\"Pan the Third is a useless coward."}]}`),"char-73":JSON.parse(`{"8":[{"paragraph":6,"mentions":1,"tokens":["潘老三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"人同来的？」仲雨道：「我那里有工夫听戏？清早到锦春园华公府走了一走，出来又到怡园徐二爷处商量件事，遂同起盛银号潘老三在天香楼吃了饭。昨日宏济寺的唐和尚，有件事约我在这里等他。」说罢拿出了玉烟壶，递与聘才，聘才接了过来。元茂此时方想起是初六那一天见过的，重叙了几句寒温。仲雨又将烟壶递与元茂，元茂不知好歹，当着闻痧药的，一闻即连打了七八个嚏喷，眼泪鼻涕一齐出来，惹得仲","en":"Master Xu's place at the Garden of Contentment to discuss a matter. Afterward, I dined at Tianxiang Pavilion with Third Brother Pan of the Qisheng Bank. Yesterday, Monk Tang of the Hongji Monastery arranged to meet me here on business.\\" As he spoke, he produced a jade snuff bottle and handed it to Pincai, who accepted it graciously. Yuanmao suddenly recalled having met Zhongyu on"}],"13":[{"paragraph":20,"mentions":1,"tokens":["潘三爷"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"洗了脸，吃了点心。跟班的进来道：「外面有客。」蕙芳问道：「是谁？」跟班的道：「是伏虎桥张老爷，同着开起盛银号的潘三爷。」蕙芳只得穿了衣服，出来见了。","en":"in. \\"There are visitors outside.\\" Huifang said, \\"Who is it?\\" The man said, \\"Master Zhang from Fuhu Bridge, and Third Master Pan of the Qisheng silver house.\\" Huifang had no choice but to dress and go out to them."},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":4,"tokens":["潘其观","潘三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"原来这张老爷就是张仲雨。这潘老爷叫潘其观，是本京富翁，有百万家财，开了三个银号，两个当铺，又开了一个香料铺，也捐一个六品职衔。原籍山西，在京已住了两代。为人鄙吝龌龊，刻薄顽蠢，又是个色鬼，水陆并行昼夜不倦。却有一个好处，是个怕老婆的都元帅。此刻他续娶的媳妇倒有八九分姿色，就是性情悍妒异常。","en":"This Master Zhang was none other than Zhang Zhongyu. The Master Pan was Pan Qiguan, a wealthy man of the capital with a vast fortune. He owned three silver houses, two pawnshops, and a spice shop, and had purchased a sixth-rank official title. His family originally hailed from Shanxi but had lived in the capital for"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":2,"tokens":["潘其观","其观"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"看中了苏蕙芳。今日拉了张仲雨来，要替他说合。仲雨想：「这蕙芳人品高雅，未必肯跟潘其观。」就支支吾吾不愿作成。经其观再三恳求，许以金帛重谢。只得同来，见景生情罢了。来到蕙芳家内坐下，说了些闲话。","en":"go-between. Zhongyu thought to himself that a person of Huifang's refined character was unlikely to agree to follow Pan Qiguan, so he was evasive and reluctant to help. However, after Pan pleaded with him repeatedly and promised a heavy reward of gold and silk, he had no choice but to come along, intending to just see how things played out. They arrived at Huifang's house, sat"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":1,"tokens":["潘其观"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"你看这潘其观怎生模样：","en":"Consider the appearance of this Pan Qiguan:"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":6,"tokens":["潘其观"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"景。蕙芳低了头，一回站起来，到窗前看那盆内种的兰花，心上却忆着田春航，又不好回他们出去，无精打采的坐立不安。那潘其观坐着不动，也不开口，眼睛只注着蕙芳。张仲雨道：「咱们也不必找地方，就在这里摆个酒儿，随便弄两样菜不好么？」潘其观道：「很好，家里又清净。」蕙芳道：「好是好，我今日不能久陪二位，就要走，姑苏会馆有戏，第二出就是我的戏。」潘其观道：「那不要紧，不去亦使得","en":"while of Tian Chunhang; but he could not well turn them out, and he sat and stood again, listless and ill at ease. Pan Qiguan did not stir and did not open his mouth, but kept his eyes fixed on Huifang.\\n\\nZhang Zhongyu said, \\"We need not go looking for a place. Let us have the wine here — get up a couple of dishes, why not?\\" Pan Qiguan said, \\"Very good. It is quieter at home.\\""},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":2,"tokens":["潘其观"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"那晓得潘其观最会闹酒，越喝越不醉，酒下了肚，嘴里就没有好话，便伸出那又短又肥挺硬的那只手来，搀住了蕙芳的手道：「好孩子，怎么你总不去瞧瞧我，我很想你。每见了你的戏，晚上就做梦，倒亲亲热热的长在一块儿顽，醒了便觉得困乏。你真害死我了，我又没有儿子，要这一分大家财作","en":"Little did he know that Pan Qiguan was a seasoned drinker who only grew more obnoxious with every cup. As the wine went down his talk grew fouler. He put out that short, fat, stiff hand of his and took hold of Huifang's.\\n\\n\\"Good child, why do you never come and see me? I think of you sorely."},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":1,"tokens":["潘其观"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"张仲雨心上诧异，暗想道：「这也奇了，不料苏蕙芳倒喜欢潘其观，难道钱可通神，我的财运来了，好发他一注大财。」","en":"Zhang Zhongyu was inwardly astonished. He thought it strange that Su Huifang actually seemed to like Pan Qiguan. He wondered if money truly could move the gods, and rejoiced that his own luck had arrived, anticipating a massive windfall."},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":3,"tokens":["潘三爷","潘其观","其观"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"即便凑趣道：「潘三爷真个逢人就说你好，赞你的相貌，赞你的性情才技，没有一天不说两回。常说道：「只要你能有心向他，他就拿个银号给你。」即向潘其观道：「这话不是你亲口说的么？」其观点点头。蕙芳笑道：「你有几个银号？一个相公给一个，京城里有几百个相公，难道你有几百个银号不成？","en":"He fell in with it at once. \\"Third Master Pan tells everyone he meets how fine you are — your looks, your temper, your gifts. Not a day but he says it twice. He is always saying, 'If only he would give me his heart, I would make him a present of a silver house.'\\" Then, to Pan Qiguan: \\"Were those"},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":5,"tokens":["潘其观","潘三爷","其观"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"潘其观道：「别人要想我一个大钱也不能，只要你肯，我什么都肯。」蕙芳心里已有了主意，对着潘其观把眼一睃，把潘其观的三魂七魄都勾了出来。仲雨也得意洋洋，把指头敲着桌子，不住的喊好。蕙芳道：「潘三爷，你既心上有我，你今日必得畅饮一天，不可藏着量儿。」其观道：「拿","en":"Pan Qiguan said, \\"Anyone else might want a single copper of mine and not get it. If only you are willing, there is nothing I will not do.\\" Huifang had his plan settled by now, and gave Pan Qiguan a sidelong look that drew the three souls and seven spirits clean"},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":4,"tokens":["潘三爷","潘其观","潘三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"蕙芳便亲手去拿了两只大杯，将酒斟满了，一人敬了一杯：又斟了两杯道：「潘三爷，我今日本来要和你饮个成双杯，实在酒量小，不能饮，你饮这双杯。」潘其观点头播脑的饮了。又斟上两杯，对着仲雨道：「张老爷，你也饮个成双杯。」仲雨笑道：「你叫我和谁成双？」蕙芳道：「你和我成双好不好？今日请你先和潘三爷成双。」仲雨把蕙芳额上弹了一弹，道：","en":"fetched two large cups with his own hands, filled them, and pressed one on each of them. Then he poured two more. \\"Third Master Pan, I meant to drink a paired cup with you today, but my head is weak and I cannot; you drink the pair.\\" Pan Qiguan bobbed his head and drank them off. Huifang poured two more and turned to Zhongyu. \\"Master Zhang, you drink a paired cup too.\\" Zhongyu laughed,"},{"paragraph":30,"mentions":15,"tokens":["潘三爷","潘其观","潘三","潘老三","其观"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"已到申末酉初时候，蕙芳见他们尚未沉醉，便试他一试道：「潘三爷，有句话论理不当说，我们没有什么交情。但是，我急了，我欠人家一票银子，约明日还他。今日我打算出去张罗，偏偏你这财神爷来了．可肯通融一肩？」潘其观道：「要多少？」蕙芳道：「不多，二百两。」潘三目视仲雨，仲雨道：「你瞧，这蕙芳难道只值二百银子，你潘老三就","en":"By now it was between the shen and you hours. Seeing they were not yet dead drunk, Huifang tried them. \\"Third Master Pan, by rights I ought not to say this, for we are nothing to one another. But I am hard pressed. I owe a note of silver that must be paid tomorrow, and I meant to go out today and raise it — and here is the god of wealth himself walked in. Would you accommodate"},{"paragraph":31,"mentions":7,"tokens":["潘三","其观","潘其观"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"蕙芳吃了几口，仰着头靠在椅背上，只说不中用，疼得很。仲雨道：「吃青果便可消得。」蕙芳又吃了几个青果，仍说不好。潘三过来，把嘴凑近蕙芳脸上，想要个乖乖，说道：「你张开口待我望望。」蕙芳便把袖子掩了脸道：「这如何望得见？总为着敬你的皮杯。只要你多吃几钟，我就不疼了。」潘三道：「真么？」便饮了一大碗，问道：「可好些么？」蕙芳点点头，其观又饮了两杯，才住了手。蕙芳便又呼","en":"Zhongyu said, \\"Eat green olives and it will dissolve.\\" Huifang ate a few olives and still said it was no better.\\n\\nPan came over and put his face close to Huifang's, meaning to get a kiss out of it. \\"Open your mouth and let me look.\\" Huifang covered his face with his sleeve. \\"How could you see anything? It all came of giving you the skin-cup. Only drink a few more cups"},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":1,"tokens":["潘三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"蕙芳安排已毕，一面叫套车，一面到自己房中开了箱子，拣出小毛棉夹单纱五套衣服，并潘三的二百吊钱票，带了一副铺盖，一总交跟班的拿出来，放在车上。蕙芳上了车，跟班跨了沿，一齐向春航寓处来。才到了胡衕口，月光下见一人站着，赶车的一看，却认得就是田春航，便住了车，叫道：「老者爷，我们正到你那里去。」蕙芳和跟班的听见，一齐跳下车来，蕙芳拉住春","en":"cotton, lightweight silk, and single-layer gauze. He packed these together with the two-hundred-string cash notes Pan had given him, added a set of bedding, and had his manservant carry it all out and load it onto the carriage. Huifang mounted the carriage, his manservant rode on the footboard, and they headed together toward Chunhang's lodgings. Just as they reached"},{"paragraph":34,"mentions":14,"tokens":["潘其观","其观","潘三爷","潘老三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"且说潘、张两人，醉到不醒人事。睡到四更，潘其观翻一个身，即骨碌碌的滚下炕来，在地上坐着，想要小解，各处摸那夜壶。摸着了自己一只鞋，拉下裤子，就在那鞋里撤了一泡尿，大半撤在裤挡里头。模模糊糊的在地下乱摸，摸着了炕，重新爬上来。心里细细的想，在那里吃的酒。虽在醉中，还被他想着了苏蕙芳，便又在炕上摸索","en":"Meanwhile Pan and Zhang slept the night through dead to the world. At the fourth watch Pan Qiguan turned over and went rolling off the kang onto the floor, where he sat wanting to make water and groped about him for the chamber pot. What his hand found was one of"},{"paragraph":35,"mentions":11,"tokens":["潘其观"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"潘其观道：「怎么说，你冒充张仲雨来唬我？」这一场闹。闹醒了一家人，那些打杂的，看门的，都点了灯进来，觉得酒气直冲。上前一照，只见张仲雨站着，脚下踏了棉被，潘其观坐在地上，满面花花绿绿，光着一只脚，将手指着张仲雨。众人见了，忍不住大笑，扶了潘其观起来。张仲雨","en":"Pan Qiguan said, \\"What is this? Are you passing yourself off as Zhang Zhongyu to frighten me?\\" The uproar woke the whole household, and the odd-job men and the gatekeepers came in with lamps, and were met by a wall of wine-stench. Holding the lights up they saw"},{"paragraph":36,"mentions":1,"tokens":["潘其观"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"张仲雨道：「这倒难怪他，华公子是惹不得的。」潘其观无可奈何，只可惜了二百吊钱，倒买张仲雨吐了他一脸，打了他一个嘴巴，只好慢慢的日后商量，再作道理，同了张仲雨郁郁而去。","en":"Zhongyu said that one could hardly blame Huifang for that, as Young Master Hua was not someone to be trifled with. Pan Qiguan had no recourse. He could only bitterly regret the two hundred strings of cash, which had effectively bought him nothing but a face full of vomit from Zhang Zhongyu and a hard slap in the bargain. He had no choice but to bide his time and figure things"}],"14":[{"paragraph":36,"mentions":1,"tokens":["潘其观"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"回去了。方才来了一个面生人，说是广东人，姓奚，叫奚十一老爷。慕你的名，在家候着。」蕙芳道：「什么样儿？不要又是潘其观一类人。」来人道：「看他光景很阔，带着四个跟班，三十来岁年纪。」蕙芳道：「回他去罢，说今日不回去呢。」来人去了。","en":"admires your name and is waiting at home.\\" Huifang said, \\"What sort of man is he? Don't tell me he is another Pan Qiguan type.\\" The servant said, \\"By appearances he is quite well-off, and he has four attendants with him, around thirty years old.\\" Huifang said, \\"Go back and tell him to leave, and say I am not returning today.\\" The servant left."}],"19":[{"paragraph":17,"mentions":3,"tokens":["潘其观","潘三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"再说潘其观自从被蕙芳哄骗之后，心中着实懊恼，意欲收拾蕙芳，又怕他的交游阔大，帮他的人多。二者淫心未断，尚欲再图实在。又心疼这二百吊钱，倒有些疑心张仲雨与蕙芳串通作弄他，就对仲雨唠唠叨叨，说些影射的话。仲雨受了这冤枉，真是无处可伸，便恨起潘三来。他既疑我，我索性","en":"Now let us speak of Pan Qiguan: since being tricked and humiliated by Huifang, he had been genuinely vexed, wishing to settle scores with Huifang but fearing his wide connections and numerous supporters. At the same time his lascivious urge had not been extinguished and he still hoped"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":7,"tokens":["潘三","潘三爷"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"是日已是傍晚，可可走到蕙芳门口，恰就遇着蕙芳从春航处回来。蕙芳一见是潘三，心上着实吃了一惊，只得跳下车来，让潘三爷进内。潘三便搀着蕙芳的手，喘吁吁走进里面，到客房坐下。蕙芳便问道：「潘三爷，这几天总不见你，在那里发财？你能总不肯赏驾。记得那一天是因华公子住在城外，传了我去，实在短伺候，你不要怪，咱们相好的日子正长呢。」潘","en":"arrived at Huifang's gate at the very moment Huifang was returning from Chunhang's place. Huifang, seeing it was Pan Qiguan, was inwardly startled but had no choice; he jumped down from his carriage and invited the Third Master Pan inside. Pan Qiguan seized Huifang's hand and puffed along into the inner room, where they sat down in the reception room. Huifang said: \\"Third"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":11,"tokens":["潘三","潘三爷"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"蕙芳道：「虽然戒了酒，既到我这里，也要应个景儿。」便满脸带笑，拿了一个大玉杯，斟得满满的，双手送去。那潘三原未戒酒，不过怕酒误事。今见蕙芳如此，便忍不住笑嘻嘻道：「可尽这一壶，不许再添了。」蕙芳也不理他，于是两人对饮，又吃些扁食之类。潘三已有醉意，喝来喝去，又添了一壶，见蕙芳桃花两颊，秋水双波，顾盼生娇，媚态百出，把个潘三的故态又引出来了，叹口气道：「你","en":"appearances.\\" With a smiling face, he took up a large jade cup, filled it to the brim, and presented it with both hands. Pan Qiguan had not actually given up drinking; he simply feared wine would impair his plans. Seeing Huifang's manner now, he could not help grinning and saying: \\"All right, finish this whole pot, no refills.\\" Huifang paid no attention to his conditions; the two"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":2,"tokens":["潘三爷","潘三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"蕙芳又笑道：「我方才说，三爷是逛惯剃头篷子的，拿我这里当作一样。我听张仲雨说，潘三爷是大方得很的，只要中意那人，不但三百五百，就是一千八百吊都肯。怎么三爷又瞧得中我，你在我面上才花过二百吊钱，马上就要捞本儿。要说二百吊钱，不但三爷看不上，就是我姓苏的也不当事，难道三爷喝一杯酒，听一个曲儿，还不赏个百十吊钱吗？也像那些小本经纪人，叫一","en":"frequenting the barber's sheds, you're treating my place as just the same kind of thing. I heard from Zhang Zhongyu that Third Master Pan is most generous: if he sets his heart on someone, not only three or five hundred, even one or two thousand strings he'll spend freely. How is it that Third Master also takes a liking to me, yet after spending a mere two hundred strings here you're already"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":7,"tokens":["潘三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"潘三此时色心艳艳，又要装作大方，倒不能粗卤起来，想一想，只好再把银钱巴结他，便道：「知你是个阔相公，手笔大，常要用钱，打今日起，如少钱，便即到我铺子里来取。」蕙芳道：「我怎么好来？不要叫三奶奶晓得了，一顿臭骂，害得你还要受苦呢！」潘三笑道：「胡闹，你实对","en":"At this moment Pan Qiguan's lascivious heart was blazing; and yet he also wanted to appear generous, so he couldn't resort to brute force. Thinking it over, the only recourse was to win Huifang over with more money. He said: \\"I know you're a free-spending young protégé with a"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":4,"tokens":["潘三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"配上就好了，你要就给你罢。」只管抬着膀子，却不见取下来。蕙芳走近身边，谢了一声，将镯子取下，刚刚带上了手，却被潘三拦腰抱住，口口心肝儿子，脸上嗅个不住，便就抠抠摸摸起来。此番蕙芳真没有法，再讲什么话，潘三是再不理的了。打定主意今日是不肯空回白转的，况且又把个金镯子出脱了，脸上已觉得十分光彩。蕙芳只得装作笑容，见他衣襟上挂着个小牙梳子，便把他的胡须梳了一回。正在危","en":"thanked him, and began to take the bracelet off his wrist; the moment it was slipped onto Huifang's own hand, Pan Qiguan grabbed him around the waist, murmuring endless endearments, \\"my heart, my darling,\\" nuzzling and sniffing at his face incessantly, and then began groping and pawing. This time Huifang was truly in a difficult position; saying anything more would be"}],"20":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":2,"tokens":["潘三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"前回书中，讲到潘三缠住蕙芳，到至急处忽有人嚷进来，蕙芳故作一惊说：「了不得了！是坊官老爷们查夜。」潘三是个有钱胆小的人，自然怕事，只得溜了。","en":"The previous chapter told how Pan Qiguan had Huifang cornered at the crucial moment when someone suddenly came shouting, and Huifang feigned alarm and cried: \\"Dreadful — it's the ward officials come to do their inspection!\\" Pan Qiguan was a wealthy man of timid nature, naturally afraid of causing"},{"paragraph":2,"mentions":4,"tokens":["潘三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"原来蕙芳于下厨房时，即算定潘三今日必不罢休，即叫家里人假装坊官查夜，并请了两个坊卒，到潘三歪缠不清的时候，便嚷将进来。知道潘三是色大胆小，果然中计而去，又哄过了一次。虽然得了他一个金镯，蕙芳心中也着实踌躇，恐怕明日又来，只好到春航寓内躲避几天，再看罢了。潘三一路丧气而回，幸怕他的","en":"In fact, when Huifang had gone to the kitchen earlier, he had calculated that Pan Qiguan would certainly not let him off tonight, and so had instructed the household servants to pretend to be ward officials conducting the nightly inspection, and had also brought in two actual ward constables; at the moment when Pan Qiguan's harassment became"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":2,"tokens":["潘三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"根筹看时，是蕙芳的。再看那面，众人就笑起来，只有田春航强住了笑，脸上却有些红。原来这一根筹偏偏是蕙芳，也是捉弄潘三的报应。上写着：「潘金莲雪天戏叔。」注：「三杯，并坐左边的为武松。第一杯要露出了胸，一手搭在武松肩上，叫声「叔叔，你饮这一杯。」第二杯要自吃半杯，又道：「叔叔，你若有心就吃这半杯儿残酒。」第三杯要站起来，装作怒容自饮，合席陪饮三杯。」当下蕙芳就不肯，","en":"some color. As it happened, this tally fell to Huifang — which was rather a case of karmic retribution for the Pan Qiguan business. The inscription read: \\"Pan Jinlian Flirts with Her Brother-in-Law on a Snowy Day.\\" The annotation: \\"Three cups; the person seated to the left is Wu Song. For the first cup, one must reveal the chest, place one hand on Wu Song's shoulder, and"}],"21":[{"paragraph":12,"mentions":3,"tokens":["潘三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"得住了哭，把前日宝珠、蕙芳行的酒令说给琴言听。说瑶卿还罢了，第一媚香尖利不肯吃亏的，偏偏吃了这闷亏；又听得他为潘三缠不清楚，媚香却不肯告诉人，人都传说出来，说媚香也怕他，到湘帆处躲了好几天，如今是交代下人：若是潘三来，总回不在家，又说他床后开了一个门，通得厨房，为避潘三之计。","en":"Huifang — Yaoqing was middling — Meixiang sharp and unwilling to lose yet had swallowed that dull loss; also how Pan the Third plagued him — Meixiang would not tell — gossip said Meixiang feared him and hid at Xiangfan's for days — now he instructed servants: if Pan the Third called, always answer not at home — rumor added he had opened a door behind his bed through to the kitchen"}],"22":[{"paragraph":18,"mentions":1,"tokens":["潘三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"将酒席什物等类齐备了，省得临时短少，也就要去了。」看那素兰为人，又精细，又聪明，差不多赶上蕙芳，不过尚少蕙芳赚潘三的辣手，较之他人，也就算足智多谋了。","en":"was: precise and clever both, very nearly the match of Huifang, wanting only Huifang's ruthless touch that gulled Pan the Third; set against the general run of men, he might well be called deep in wit and full of stratagem."},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":3,"tokens":["潘三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴言过来，也从窗缝里瞧了一瞧，便道：「这些蠢人，看他作什么？」素兰指着那下手坐的那一个道：「这就是与媚香缠扰的潘三。」琴言道：「哎哟！这个样子，亏媚香认识他，倒又怎么能哄得他？」素兰道：「你没有见，昨日那两个，比他还要凶恶十倍呢！」琴言叹了一口气，走转来坐了。子玉道：「潘三是何等样人？」素兰也把他们的事，说了一遍，子玉连声道：「可恶！可恶！这潘三竟敢如此妄想。幸","en":"\\"Those vulgar louts — what is there to look at?\\" Sulan pointed to the one seated in the lower place: \\"That is the Pan the Third who kept pestering Meixiang.\\" Qinyan cried: \\"Aiyo! Such a creature — a wonder Meixiang could endure his acquaintance; and however did he contrive to gull him?\\" Sulan said: \\"You did not see them — yesterday's two were ten times fiercer than he!\\" Qinyan"}],"24":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":3,"tokens":["潘三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"道：「那两天因你弟妹身上不好。我天天候医生，有些照料，没有出门。」仲清道：「我昨日听得张仲雨讲的，有个开银号的潘三，从三月间想买苏蕙芳作干儿子。头一回是拉着张老二同去缠扰媚香，没有法儿，媚香故意殷殷懃勤。待那潘三借了他二百吊钱，听得说要敬他皮杯时，假装鱼骨鲠了喉。后来把他们灌得烂醉，竟到不省人事，却叫他们在客房内同睡。那姓潘的便滚了下来，在自己鞋里撒了一泡溺，后","en":"haven't stepped foot outside.\\" Zhongqing leaned in. \\"Just yesterday, Zhang Zhongyu was telling me about a certain Pan the Third, who runs a silver shop. Ever since the third month, he has been badgering Su Huifang, insisting on taking him as an adopted son. At first, he dragged Zhang the Second along to pester Meixiang. Left with no choice, Meixiang put on a show of profound"},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":6,"tokens":["潘三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"如子云、相如，同工异曲。世唯好色不淫之人始有真情，若一涉淫亵，情就是淫亵上生的，不是性分中出来的。譬如方才说的潘三，心上也是想着媚香，难道说他也是钟情的不成？」王恂道：「也要算情，若说不是情，他也不想了。」仲清笑道：「潘三若有情，倒绝不想媚香，其想媚香正是其无情处。」王恂笑道：「此语有些矫强了！不过情有邪正，潘三之情，是邪情、淫情，非湘帆可比。若定说他于媚香毫没","en":"succumbing to debauchery can hold true passion; feelings born of sheer lust do not stem from one's true nature. Take Pan the Third, for instance—he covets Meixiang, but would you call that 'passion'?\\" Wang Xun countered, \\"It is still a kind of feeling. If he felt nothing at all, he wouldn't spare him a single thought.\\" Zhongqing laughed dismissively, \\"If Pan possessed true feeling,"}],"25":[{"paragraph":7,"mentions":1,"tokens":["潘老三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，凑不上两竿。偏偏刘老大又在保定，不然是五百两，我断不能饶过他的。如今这个正指挥，一总也花到四千头，还是起盛的潘老三替我垫了五百两才成的。」","en":"guard commander's post cost me close to four thousand taels all told, and even then it was only possible because Old Pan the Third of the Qisheng Silver Exchange advanced five hundred taels on my behalf.\\""}],"27":[{"paragraph":4,"mentions":5,"tokens":["潘其观","潘三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"此人初进京来，尚有一口广东话，不甚清楚，此刻渐渐说起官话来了。他却与两个人往来，且系相好，一个是张仲雨，一个是潘其观。张仲雨是惯向热闹场中走动，帐局子里逢迎，看见奚十一这样浪花浪费，打听得他家的底子，便已结交得很熟。及奚十一银子用完，要拉账的时节，仲雨即向潘三银号内，替他借了一万，本是九扣，仲雨又扣了一千上腰，奚十一实得八千，但要用时，只得依了。如今有了银子，就先","en":"but now he was sliding into mandarin speech. He kept company with two others on good terms: Zhang Zhongyu and Pan Qiguan. Zhongyu haunted the bustling haunts and flattered the account shops. Seeing Xi Eleven's wave-rider spending, he had ferreted out his family's bottom line and befriended him thoroughly. When Xi's silver ran dry and loans were due, Zhongyu went to Pan"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":1,"tokens":["潘三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"来也不可知。即或不然，你歇几天，也可告个假出来，到我这里，去请庾香来会一会，倒可无拘束。你心上若当他与奚十一、潘三一流人，我可以替他出结：断不至此。依我这么想，是进去的为妙。」","en":"could leave, visit me, and call Yuxiang freely. And if in your heart you take him for one of the Xi Eleven or Pan the Third sort, I will go bail for him: it will never come to that. As I see it, going in is the better course.\\""}],"31":[{"paragraph":21,"mentions":1,"tokens":["潘三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"过，几时见相公的酒可是白喝的吗？」大家一笑坐下。高品道：「可惜少了一客。」蕙芳问是少谁，高品道：「今日倒不可少潘三。」蕙芳啐了一声，一连敬了几杯酒，玉林也帮着敬酒，吃了几样菜。","en":"missing one guest.\\" When Huifang asked who was missing, Gao Pin replied, \\"Today, we really should not be without Pan the Third.\\" Huifang spat in mock disgust, then poured several rounds of wine, with Yulin helping to serve the drinks and dishes."}],"32":[{"paragraph":3,"mentions":1,"tokens":["潘三爷"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，作了一个揖。蕙芳让他坐了。胡裁缝道：「今日倒闲空在家，不出门走走？外面登高，游玩的颇热闹。又是报举人的日子，潘三爷的女婿中了，好不热闹，挤满一铺子人，报喜钱赏了一百吊。这胡衕外的一家也中了，我常与他作衣裳的。寓在宏济寺的高老爷也中了八十一名，如今城外已报一百多名了。」蕙芳听了，忙问道：「宏济寺的高老爷中了，还有位田老爷也寓在寺内，可曾中么？」胡裁缝道：「我没听见","en":"walk? The double-ninth outings outside are quite lively. It's also the day the provincial graduates are announced. Third Master Pan's son-in-law has passed, and it's so lively; the shop is packed with people, and they gave out a hundred strings of cash as reward. A family outside the alley here also passed, I often make clothes for him. Master Gao staying at Hongji Temple also passed"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":2,"tokens":["潘三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"在内。蕙芳笑道：「中的人我也不认得，我就晓得这两个，一个是叶茂林的女婿叫作窑子归，这三十四名归自荣就是。一个是潘三的女婿叫作杠花，他老子叫花三胡子，在杠房抬杠出身，如今大发财，开了几处杠房，这六十三名花中桂就是。」高品再把第一张《题名录》看了一遍，略生喜色，不觉叹口气道：「也罢，名利二字是有一定的。现在你们不比外人，我对你们直讲罢，一千六百两银子卖掉了一个举人，","en":"Ye Maolin's son-in-law, known as 'Brothel Gui', and this thirty-fourth name, Gui Zirong, is him. The other is Pan the Third's son-in-law, called 'Bier-pole Hua'. His father is Hua the Third, nicknamed 'The Beard', who started out carrying biers in a funeral parlor, then made a fortune and opened several parlors himself. This sixty-third name Hua Zhonggui is him.\\" Gao Pin"}],"34":[{"paragraph":15,"mentions":1,"tokens":["潘三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一日来的人还少，第二日渐渐多了，第三日便挤满了屋子。一人传两，两人传三，引了两个大赌客来，一个是奚十一，一个是潘三，各带重资。","en":"brim. Word spread from one to two, from two to three, eventually drawing in two major gamblers: Xi Eleven and Pan the Third, both arriving with heavy purses."},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":1,"tokens":["潘三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"明日潘三要开赌，带了两叵罗的松江锭，足足一千两，摇了五十滩，已输了大半。及到清账时输完了，还添出一百余两。是日聘才也输了三百两。唐和尚赢了一百两，冯子佩赢了四百两。","en":"The next day, Pan the Third wanted to be the banker. He brought two baskets of Songjiang silver ingots—a full one thousand taels. After rolling the fantan fifty times, he had already lost the greater half. By the time accounts were settled, he had lost everything and owed an additional"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":1,"tokens":["潘三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"了钱，又不为怕出什么事，实因是富三爷要起身了，我要请请他，与他饯行。后日是十四，约他出来住一宿。」并对奚十一、潘三道：「奉屈二位来叙一叙，可肯赏脸么？」奚、潘二人应了。冯子佩道：「你倒不请我。」聘才道：「你天天在这里，难道还要下请帖么？」子佩道：「我将梅窗也拉来。」聘才道：「很好。」众赌客算了帐，到五更时各散了，又送了玉天仙回去。","en":"day after tomorrow is the fourteenth; I plan to invite him to stay over for a night.\\" He then addressed Xi and Pan: \\"I hope you two gentlemen will deign to join us for a gathering. Will you do me the honor?\\" Xi and Pan both accepted. Feng Zipei chimed in, \\"Yet you don't invite me.\\" Pincai retorted, \\"You're here every day; must I send you a formal invitation?\\" Zipei"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":1,"tokens":["潘三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"到了明日，聘才发贴请客，请的是富三爷、贵大爷、奚十一、潘三、张仲雨、杨梅窗。是日辞了两个，贵大爷病了，张仲雨有事不能来。即补了冯子佩、唐和尚，宾主共七位。聘才叫了蓉官来陪富三，着人到篷子里叫了天香、翠官前来。不多一刻，两个剃头的也坐了大骡车，有一个人跟着，走进寺来。冯子佩是认识的，小剃头的先与子佩请了安，然","en":"Pincai sent out invitations for a gathering. His guests included Master Fu the Third, Gui the Eldest, Xi Eleven, Pan the Third, Zhang Zhongyu, and Yang Meichuang. Two sent their regrets—Gui was ill, and Zhang had other matters to attend to—so Feng Zipei and Monk Tang were brought in to fill their seats, making a total of seven host and guests. Pincai summoned Rongguan to accompany"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":3,"tokens":["潘三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"得月进来。天香、翠官与富三、和尚都请了安。富三却不认识，问他是谁，在那一班的，聘才就说是全福班的。随后奚十一、潘三同来。奚十一带了巴英官，潘三带了个学徒弟的小伙计，拿他竟当做跟班的。大家一齐相见了。潘三见了天香、翠官，笑道：「你们怎么也跑了来？」奚十一道：「看来，魏大爷要开篷子做掌柜的了。」富三方晓得是剃头的，便哈哈大笑道：「原来是他们，不是班子里的，倒也好。」","en":"which troupe they belonged to; Pincai smoothly claimed they were from the Quanfu Troupe. Soon after, Xi Eleven and Pan the Third arrived together. Xi Eleven had brought Ba Yingguan, while Pan the Third was accompanied by a young apprentice whom he was treating as a servant. Greetings were exchanged all around. Upon seeing Tianxiang and Cuiguan, Pan the Third laughed and asked,"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":2,"tokens":["潘三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"灯，中间挂一个彩灯，地下又点了四枝地照，两边生了两个火盆，中间摆了一个圆桌。安了席，奚十一看那灯屏上的春画，对潘三笑道：「老三，你看那挨嘴巴的很像是你。」潘三道：「那个搂着人的也像你，就只少个桶儿。」富三看到末后一幅，不觉大笑道：「岂有此理！魏老大不该不该，真是对景挂画。你们大家来瞧，这不是两个和尚鸡奸么？」","en":"table was set in the middle. Once seated, Xi Eleven studied the erotic scenes on the lamp-screen and joked to Pan the Third, \\"Old Third, take a look at the one getting slapped—doesn't it look just like you?\\" Pan the Third retorted, \\"And the one embracing someone looks just like you, only missing your bucket.\\" Fu the Third's gaze reached the final panel, and he couldn't help"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":1,"tokens":["潘三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"翠官陪了他。第二是奚十一，唐和尚知他是个阔手，且知道他爱得月，便叫得月陪了他。杨八坐了第三，聘才叫天香挨着他。潘三坐了第四，自己与唐和尚坐了主位，只不见蓉官来。饮酒之间，撒村笑骂，嘈杂到个不成样子。还是富三稳重些，不过与翠官说些顽笑话，尚不至十分村俗。奚十一手拿了杯子灌那得月，一手伸在得月屁股后头，闹得得月一个腰扭来扭去，两个肩膀闪得一高一低，水汪汪的两只眼睛，","en":"Monk Tang told Deyue to sit with him. Yang Eight took the third seat, and Pincai had Tianxiang sit next to him. Pan the Third sat in the fourth seat, while Pincai and Monk Tang occupied the host's positions. Only Rongguan was absent. As the wine flowed, the conversation devolved into vulgar shouting and coarse jokes, becoming a chaotic, unsightly mess. Fu the Third remained"},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":1,"tokens":["潘三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"说着将他脸上又闻一闻。只有潘三与聘才无人可闹。聘才笑道：「我们今日只好轮着来闹这个老和尚了。」便互相与唐和尚豁了几拳。闹了一个多时辰，奚十一瘾来了，便叫巴英官拿出烟具来。灯是开现成的，奚十一躺下，叫得月陪他吹烟，两个剃头的也有烟瘾。都聚拢来。唐和尚见了，即连打了两个呵欠，伸了个懒","en":"As he spoke, he leaned in and sniffed Tianxiang's face again. Only Pan the Third and Pincai were left without someone to dally with. Pincai laughed and said, \\"It seems today we'll just have to take turns pestering this old monk.\\" With that, they engaged in a lively game of finger-guessing with Monk Tang. After they had carried on"},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":1,"tokens":["潘三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"」翠官便索性扒上富三身上，将头在富三肩上碰了几碰，说道：「我就磕头谢了！好三老爷，好亲爸爸！」富三乐得受不得。潘三见得月躺在奚十一怀里，天香躺在对面，杨八也想吹一口，便坐在炕沿上，歪转身子，压在天香身上。得月上好了一口，杨八接了过来，拨开毛冗冗的胡子，抽了一抽，口涎直流下来，点点滴滴，烟枪上也沾了好些，他就把皮袖子擦擦嘴再抽。枪又堵住了，天香欲替他通通，身子被他","en":"\\"Then I shall kowtow in thanks! Good Third Master, good dear father!\\" Fu the Third was overwhelmed with delight. Pan the Third, observing Deyue lounging in Xi Eleven's arms and Tianxiang lying opposite them, decided he wanted a puff of opium as well. He moved to the edge of the kang, twisted his body, and leaned heavily against Tianxiang. Deyue finished preparing a pipe of opium,"}],"36":[{"paragraph":8,"mentions":1,"tokens":["潘三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴言道：「魏聘才搬了出去了，不知可在庾香处？」蕙芳道：「魏聘才么，如今倒更阔了。就在宏济寺住，同了奚十一、潘三、杨八一班混账人天天的闹，是什么剃头的，又是什么大和尚、小和尚，开赌宿娼，闹得不像。张仲雨也不与他往来了。」 　　 琴言问起子玉来，宝珠道：「前日我们在怡园叙了一日。」便将前日怎样喝酒，怎样行令，次贤新制的酒壶、杯子都说了，琴言着实羡慕。又说那首诗，","en":"arrogant now. He lives at Hongji Temple and causes trouble every day with a bunch of scoundrels like Xi Eleven, Pan the Third, and Yang Eight—barbers, monks big and small—gambling and visiting prostitutes. It's a disgrace. Even Zhang Zhongyu no longer associates with him.\\" When Qinyan asked about Ziyu, Baozhu recounted, \\"The day before yesterday, we spent the whole day together"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":6,"tokens":["潘三爷","潘三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这是我天天说的第一个有名的杜大相公，如今是叫杜琴爷。」又对琴言道：「这几位都是我的至好，那位是奚大老爷，那位是潘三爷，这位是我的房东唐佛爷，这位是他的小佛子，那两个也是班里头的，你想必不认识，都见见罢。」琴言无奈，只得对众人哈了一哈腰。和尚知道是华府来的，便合着掌把腰弯了几弯，笑迷迷的说道：「多礼，多礼！请坐，琴爷。」潘三倒白对琴言作了一个揖，琴言照应和尚时，没有","en":"about every day; he's now called Master Du Qin.\\" To Qinyan, he added, \\"These are my closest friends: Master Xi, Third Master Pan, my landlord Monk Tang, and his little novice. Those two are from the troupe; you probably don't know them, so let's all get acquainted.\\" With no choice, Qinyan bowed to them. The monk, knowing he came from the Hua estate, pressed his hands together,"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":2,"tokens":["潘三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"自己思算了一会，立起身来道：「我要走了。」便腆起肚子，几步就走了出去。聘才与和尚连忙相送，潘三尚坐着不动，黄瞪瞪眼睛只管看着琴言，看得琴言一腔怒气，不能发作。奚十一拉了聘才，走到和尚房中，对聘才作了一个揖道：「今日我要求你行件好事。方才这个人，我实在爱他。我若叫他陪酒，是一定不肯的。」聘才不等说完，忙摇头道：「不肯，不肯！不肯，定的。」奚十一","en":"Thrusting out his belly, he strode out the door in a few paces. Pincai and the monk hurried to see him off, while Pan the Third remained seated, his eyes wide and fixed on Qinyan, watching him with an intensity that filled Qinyan with an unexpressible rage. Xi Eleven pulled Pincai into the monk's room and bowed to him, saying, \\"Today I must beg you to do a good deed. I am truly"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":2,"tokens":["潘三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"聘才进来对潘三道：「和尚请你说话。」潘三不得已，迟延的出去，尚回顾了几次。聘才把天香、翠官也打发走了，便故意的对琴言道：「好了，清净了，我也被他们闹昏了，闹得一屋子俗臭不堪。我们如今清清净净谈谈，吃了早饭再去，自然有一会耽搁。」琴言一想，在聘才处吃饭也不妨。况且这","en":"Pincai went in and told Pan the Third, \\"The monk wants to speak with you.\\" Reluctantly, Pan the Third dawdled out, looking back several times. Pincai then sent Tianxiang and Cuiguan away and feigned relief to Qinyan, \\"Ah, finally some peace and quiet. I was getting dizzy with all their noise,"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":4,"tokens":["潘三","潘三爷"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"了巴英官，忙忙的踩开大步，一直到聘才处来。心里喜道：「我若能弄上了他，这京里的大老官，就要算我奚老土了。」再说潘三到和尚房里，和尚把奚十一的计与他说了，潘三乐极，连称妙计，便在和尚房中等候，心里想道：「这个活宝，就与他坐一坐，喝一杯就够了，还想顽他么？就叫他顽我，我也愿意。他若肯顽我，自然也肯给我顽了。」一面胡思乱想，口中淌出馋涎来，便咬着牙把手在脖子后捶了两捶","en":"the Clod, will be the greatest patron in the capital.\\" Back at the temple, the monk relayed Xi Eleven's plan to Pan the Third. Pan the Third was ecstatic, praising the brilliant scheme, and waited in the monk's room. He thought wildly, \\"This living treasure—just sitting with him and having a drink will be enough. Would he really want to play with me? Even if he only wanted"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":8,"tokens":["潘三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"面前，要他喝。琴言一手按住了杯子，对聘才道：「你知道我是从不喝酒的。」奚十一还要强他，只听得切切促促脚步声，见潘三同了和尚进来。潘三嚷道：「巧极了，被我闯了好筵席了。」和尚也说道：「原来魏老爷请客，也不虚邀我一声。」潘三弯着腰，耸着肩，急急的几步抢上来道：「待我来敬一杯。」便拿过琴言的杯子来道：「这酒凉了，我替喝了罢。」便一口干了，把杯子在嘴唇上擦了一转，斟了半","en":"\\"You know I never drink.\\" Xi Eleven continued to press him. Just then, quick, hurried footsteps were heard, and Pan the Third entered with the monk. Pan the Third shouted, \\"Perfect timing! I've crashed a fine feast.\\" The monk chimed in, \\"Master Wei hosts a banquet and doesn't even offer a polite invitation to me.\\" Pan the Third hunched his back, hitched his shoulders, and hurried"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":1,"tokens":["潘三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"又叫换个杯子来，琴言道：「不必，不必，就拿来我也不喝。」奚十一道：「那不能，也不多劝你，一人劝你三杯。」潘三满拟这杯酒，他若喝了，琴言便亲了他的□嘴一样，偏又砸了，甚是扫兴。还想重来敬他，被聘才拦住。唐和尚不知好歹，斟了半杯道：「阿弥陀佛，华公府是小寺的大施主，老太太装过三世佛的金身，少奶奶塑过送子观音像，舍了三年的灯油。如今他府里爷们光降，我出家人无以为","en":"not drink.\\" Xi Eleven insisted, \\"That won't do. We won't press you too hard—just three cups from each of us.\\" Pan the Third had been eagerly anticipating that if Qinyan drank from that cup, it would be as if they had kissed; seeing it smashed utterly ruined his mood. He tried to press another toast but was blocked by Pincai. Monk Tang, completely lacking in tact, poured half"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":1,"tokens":["潘三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"且把东西赏他，或者他受了赏，回心转意也未可定。」潘三想道：「这孩子比苏蕙芳更强，可惜我没有带结票子来赏他，或他得了钱就巴结我，也未可知。」奚十一道：「我有样东西送你，你可不要嫌轻。」便从怀里掏出个锦匣子，揭开了盖，是一对透水全绿的翡翠镯子，光华射目。","en":"I'll give him the gift; perhaps once he receives the reward, he'll change his mind.\\" Pan the Third thought, \\"This boy is even tougher than Su Huifang. If only I had brought some bank notes to reward him, perhaps he would fawn over me if he got some money.\\" Xi Eleven spoke up, \\"I have something to give you, and I hope you won't find it too meager.\\""},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":2,"tokens":["潘三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"潘三伸一伸舌头道：「这个宝贝，只有你有。别人从何处得来？这对镯子，城里一千吊钱也找不出来。」不住「啧啧啧」的几声。聘才、和尚也睁睁的望着。聘才暗想道：「好出手，头一回就拿这样好东西赏他，看他要不要？」琴言也不来看，只低了头。奚十一道：「你试试，大小包管合","en":"Pan the Third clicked his tongue and said, \\"A treasure like this, only you would have. Where could anyone else find one? You couldn't find a pair of bracelets like this in the whole city for a thousand strings of cash.\\" He continued clicking his tongue in awe. Pincai"},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":1,"tokens":["潘三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"拿来放在奚十一面前，又道：「一千吊的镯子，如今倒值三千吊了。」奚十一见了，越发气狠狠的骂了一会。潘三与唐和尚连说可惜。大约奚十一回去，只剩一个镯子，菊花必有一场大闹，正是癞蛤蟆想吃天鹅肉，也不料自己的福分。","en":"bracelet worth a thousand strings is now worth three thousand.\\" Seeing this, Xi Eleven cursed even more viciously. Pan the Third and Monk Tang kept repeating what a pity it was. When Xi Eleven returned with only one bracelet left, Juhua would surely raise a massive uproar. It was precisely the case of a toad longing for swan meat, completely unaware of its own meager lot in life."}],"37":[{"paragraph":7,"mentions":1,"tokens":["潘其观"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"样待你？」琴言道：「聘才起先还好，如今有一班坏人在那里引诱。」子云问道：「是谁呢？」琴言道：「一个奚十一，一个潘其观，还有一个和尚，就是聘才的房东。」","en":"bad characters are leading him astray.\\" Ziyun asked who they were. Qinyan said, \\"One is Xi Eleven, another is Pan Qiguan, and a monk—Pincai's landlord.\\""},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":3,"tokens":["潘三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"蕙芳听了，皱了皱眉，问道：「你怎样呢？」琴言也恨极了，索性细细的将奚十一故意先走，后聘才撵了潘三，奚十一忽又送菜来，后奚十一、潘三、和尚先后的闯进，并将席间诸般戏侮，与砸了他的镯子，都说了出来。子玉听了，甚是生气，说道：「这是聘才的坏，定是他设的计，故意叫他们糟蹋你的。」琴言道：「可不是他通同的么？幸亏我如今不唱戏了，他们还不敢十分怎样。不然还","en":"recounted the whole story in detail: how Xi Eleven had made a point of leaving early, how Pincai had then sent Pan the Third away, how Xi Eleven had unexpectedly sent over some dishes, and how, one after another, Xi Eleven, Pan the Third, and the monk had all barged in. He detailed every manner of insult and mockery they had subjected him to at the table, and how he had smashed"}],"40":[{"paragraph":10,"mentions":1,"tokens":["潘三爷"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"钱，偏又遇他不着。如今求大老爷赏十五吊钱，了此事罢。」奚十一道：「这有什么要紧，横竖明日才还他。我们坐一坐，到潘三爷铺子里开张票子就是了。」天香道了谢，便与奚十一在一处坐着闲谈。","en":"\\"What is there to worry about — it isn't due until tomorrow anyway. Let's sit for a while, and then we'll go to Third Master Pan's shop and write a cash draft, and that will be that.\\" Tianxiang thanked him, and the two sat together chatting."},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":1,"tokens":["潘三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"奚十一本要同他到潘三处取钱，忽然眼中冒火，两太阳疼胀，身子不快起来，便写了一个飞字叫天香自取。奚十一即回家，头晕眼花，扎挣不住。","en":"Xi Eleven had originally intended to go with him to Pan the Third's place to fetch the money, but suddenly felt a burning sensation in his eyes; his temples throbbed and swelled with pain, and a general malaise washed over him. He hastily dashed off a quick note and told Tianxiang to go collect it himself. Xi Eleven"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":3,"tokens":["潘三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"无事不成巧，说起来真可笑。却说潘三店内有个小伙计，叫许老三，只得十六岁，生得颇为标致。潘三久想弄他，哄骗过他几次，竟骗不上手。那孩子有一样毛病，爱喝一钟，多喝了就要睡。正月十五日，众伙计都回家过节，潘三单留住了老三，在小账房同他喝酒。许老三已醉了，在炕上睡着。","en":"But as the saying goes, coincidence makes the story; and this tale is truly laughable to tell. In Pan the Third's shop there was a young assistant named Xu Laosan; he was only sixteen years of age, and possessed quite a handsome appearance. Pan the Third had long coveted him and had tried to coax and deceive him on several occasions, but had unexpectedly never"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":1,"tokens":["潘三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"潘三早安排了毒计，到剃头铺里找了些剃二回的短发，与刮下来的头发，藏在身边，乘他醉了，便强奸了一回，将头发揌进，以后叫他痒起来，好来就他。那许老三醒来，已被他奸了，要叫喊时，又顾着脸，只得委委屈屈受了。","en":"Pan the Third had long since laid his venomous scheme. He had gone to the barber's shop and gathered some short-clipped hair trimmings and shavings, hiding them on his person. Taking advantage of the boy's drunken stupor, he forcibly violated him; he then stuffed"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":3,"tokens":["潘三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"谁知从此得了毛病。明知上了潘三的当，放了东西，心中甚恨，忍住了仍不理他。潘三自以为得计，必当移舟就岸，那知许老三怀恨在心。他有个姐夫周小三，即与潘三赶车，为人颇有血性，倒是个路见不平拔刀相助的朋友。","en":"have known that from then on he would develop a persistent malady. Knowing perfectly well he had fallen prey to Pan the Third's trick and had something planted inside him, he harbored a deep hatred in his heart, yet suppressed it, ignoring the man entirely. Pan the Third, congratulating himself on his success, assumed the boat would naturally drift toward the bank. Little did"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":1,"tokens":["潘三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"许老三上当之后，即告诉了姐夫，姐夫即要与潘三吵闹，倒是老三止住了，商量个妙计报他。","en":"Laosan immediately informed his brother-in-law. His brother-in-law was ready to go raise a violent clamor with Pan the Third right then and there, but Laosan held him back, and together they deliberated on a clever stratagem to exact their revenge."},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":1,"tokens":["潘三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"回娘家去了。或者请了王八奶奶来，不然请葛家姑娘？」三姐道：「不好。这些门户中人，非亲非戚，他们也未必肯来。况且潘三认得这些人。」","en":"Those women of the professional gates are neither kith nor kin — they might not be willing to come. Moreover, Pan the Third is acquainted with such women.\\""},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":8,"tokens":["潘三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"过了一夜，明日老二到潘三处搬老三的铺盖，潘三知事发了，心中有些惧怕，只得将言留他。经周小三力劝，留下铺盖，把老二劝回。潘三感激小三不尽，谢了小三，小三道：「三爷如果真心要提拔我的舅子，明日我去劝他来。这孩子胡涂，我开导他几句，他就明白了。明日倒有件凑巧事，不晓三爷肯赏脸不肯","en":"A night passed. The next morning, the second brother went to Pan the Third's establishment to remove Laosan's bedding. Pan the Third, sensing the affair had come to light, was gripped by fear and desperately tried to detain him with words. Through Zhou Xiaosan's forceful persuasion, the bedding was left behind, and the second"},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":5,"tokens":["潘三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"便「三姐、三姐」的叫了两声。听得里头答应了，这又娇又嫩的声音，就觉入耳。潘三听得咭咭咯咯的高低响，到了门后，手望门上一扶，露出两个银指甲道：「要什么？」小三道：「三爷初次来，你也该出来见个礼。况且三爷是有年纪的人，父母一样，不要害臊。」三姐笑了一声，道：「我厨房有事，还没有净手。老三嘴馋得很，不能帮我也罢，我装一碟，他到要吃","en":"Sister! Third Sister!\\" A voice answered from within — a voice so tender and delicate it enchanted the ear at once. Pan the Third heard the sharp click-clack of high-heeled wooden soles; reaching the doorway, a hand rested upon the frame, revealing two silver nail guards, and a voice asked: \\"What is it?\\" Xiaosan said, \\"Third Master honors us for the first time; you ought to come"},{"paragraph":31,"mentions":1,"tokens":["潘三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"两人已吃了一会酒，只听得打门之声，又听得连叫两声「小三！」小三即忙去开门。潘三听得一声「了不得了！」倒吃了一惊，又听说了好些话。","en":"door was heard, followed by two urgent shouts of \\"Xiaosan! Xiaosan!\\" Xiaosan hurriedly went to open the door. Pan the Third heard a cry of \\"Disaster!\\" — which gave him quite a start — followed by a flurry of urgent words."},{"paragraph":33,"mentions":5,"tokens":["潘三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"小三进来向潘三道：「三爷请坐坐，我叫老三来陪你，我要出去劝解一件事，就回来的。」潘三道：「我也走罢。」小三道：「忙什么，我即刻回来的。」潘三心上为着老三，正好等小三去了，招陪他。口虽说走，身却不动。小三叫老三出来，老三终是不肯。小三骂了一声：「胡涂小子！」只得叫声","en":"Xiaosan came back inside and said to Pan the Third, \\"Third Master, please sit for a moment. I will tell Laosan to come keep you company. I must go out and mediate an affair, but I will be right back.\\" Pan the Third said, \\"I will leave as well.\\" Xiaosan said, \\"What's the rush? I'll be back in an instant.\\""},{"paragraph":34,"mentions":4,"tokens":["潘三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"三姐笑将出来，潘三见了，神魂消荡。见他是瓜子脸儿，一双凤眼，梳了个大元宝头，插上一枝花。身上穿件茄花色布衫子，却是绿布洗了泛成的颜色，底下隐约是条月白绸绵裤。绝小的一对金莲，不过三寸。身材不长不短，不肥不瘦。香喷喷一脸笑容，对了潘三福了一福。潘三见了，色心已动，连忙还","en":"Third Sister emerged with a laugh; catching sight of her, Pan the Third's soul soared beyond the heavens. He saw she had a melon-seed face and a pair of phoenix eyes; her hair was combed into a large ingot-shaped coil, adorned with a single blossom. She wore an eggplant-purple cotton blouse — originally green cotton, washed"},{"paragraph":35,"mentions":8,"tokens":["潘三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"潘三乐得受不得，便道：「奶奶何不请坐过来。要你这么劳动，心上不安。」三姐笑了一笑，即叫声：「老三，三兄弟，你出来。」老三道：「我不来，你陪他罢。」三姐笑道：「你不来陪你的人，倒要我替你陪，那里有这样倔强的孩子，怪不得人要暗算你。」潘三听了这话有因，即道：","en":"Pan the Third was overwhelmed with delight; he said, \\"Lady, why not come sit over here? I am truly uneasy making you exert yourself so.\\" Third Sister smiled and called out, \\"Laosan, Third Brother, come out!\\" Laosan replied, \\"I'm not coming; you keep him company.\\""},{"paragraph":36,"mentions":5,"tokens":["潘三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"不要嫌路远，又在小铺里买来。」老三答应，亦不点灯，趁着月色去了。三姐道：「我关了门，他到大街上去，有一会呢。」潘三见他去关门，心中想道：「可以下手了。这婆娘很有勾我的意，我不可辜负他。」三姐进来坐了。潘三此际欲火中烧，脸皮发赤，走过来道：「奶奶再饮这一杯。」便挨近了，在凳边坐下。三姐故意要走开，潘三即扯住袖子，三姐低着头只顾笑。潘三心迷意乱，大着胆放下杯子，双手","en":"light of the moon. Third Sister said, \\"I will close the door; going to the main street will take him some time.\\" Pan the Third, seeing her go to bolt the door, thought to himself: \\"Now is the time to strike. This woman has been making eyes at me; I must not disappoint her.\\" Third Sister returned and sat down. Pan the Third, by this time, was consumed by the fires of lust, his"},{"paragraph":37,"mentions":5,"tokens":["潘三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"三姐将手隔过，道：「使不得，三爷你好不正经，调戏良家妇女。我若喊起来，你就没脸了。」潘三道：「我的娘，你施点恩罢！」三姐道：「你真看上我？好便宜，那里有这么容易的事情！你把我太看轻了。」潘三道：「奶奶，你要肯施恩，你怎么说怎么好。」三姐一手推他的脸，一手把住他的手，摸他的金镯子。潘三明白，心上想道：「他想这个，也顾不得了。」即除下来道：","en":"acting improperly, taking liberties with a respectable woman. If I were to cry out, you would lose all face.\\" Pan the Third pleaded, \\"My mother, bestow a little mercy upon me!\\" Third Sister said, \\"Have you truly taken a fancy to me? It's not as cheap and easy as that! You have underestimated me entirely.\\" Pan the Third said, \\"Lady, if you are willing to bestow this grace,"},{"paragraph":38,"mentions":10,"tokens":["潘三","潘三爷"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"三姐先坐在一边，潘三把长衣解开，扯了裤子，正想挨扰来，忽听得背后脚步响。回头一看，吓了一跳，连忙掖了裤子。只见周小三已到前面，大喝了一声，一把揪住，骂道：「好大胆的忘八蛋，原来你竟不是人！」潘三吓得目瞪口呆。三姐忙说道：「潘三爷方才要小解找溺壶，你当是什么？」小三忙道：","en":"Third Sister first sat down to one side. Pan the Third unfastened his long robe and pulled down his trousers; just as he was about to press himself against her, he suddenly heard footsteps behind him. Turning his head, he was given a terrible fright, and hastily tried to pull his trousers back up. Zhou Xiaosan"},{"paragraph":39,"mentions":11,"tokens":["潘三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"潘三道：「奶奶，你劝劝。」小三道：「你想罢，你愿出一千银子，你就乖乖的答应送来。你不愿，我就捆你起来，送你到官。」潘三道：「我愿，我愿！但如何要得一千银子？我身边有三百吊钱的票子，给你罢。」小三道：「三百吊钱算什么？」三姐道：「你也摸摸良心，三爷待你这样","en":"Pan the Third cried out, \\"Lady, please speak a word of persuasion!\\" Xiaosan threatened, \\"Think it over! If you are willing to hand over a thousand taels of silver, then agree to it obediently. If you refuse, I will tie you up and deliver you to the magistrate!\\" Pan"},{"paragraph":40,"mentions":1,"tokens":["潘三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"吃了早饭，到了小三家，见门不闩，推了进去。见三姐坐在屋里，引着小狗儿顽。潘三咳嗽一声，三姐满面堆下笑来。","en":"the door unbolted, he pushed it open and entered. He saw Third Sister sitting in the room, teasing a small dog. Pan the Third coughed once, and Third Sister's face immediately bloomed into a radiant smile."},{"paragraph":41,"mentions":6,"tokens":["潘三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"潘三道：「昨日几乎唬死我。」三姐道：「他不过想钱罢了，他真心要拿你？」潘三道：「屋里没有人？」三姐道：「有什么人？」潘三道：「我去闩了门。」三姐道：「今日天气暖，脱了衣服爽快些。」又道：「溺急了。」跑到后院子去小便，回头对潘三道：「你先脱光了罢，进被窝去","en":"Pan the Third said, \\"Yesterday I was nearly frightened to death.\\" Third Sister scoffed, \\"He only wanted the money; did you think he truly intended to seize you?\\" Pan the Third asked, \\"Is there anyone else in the house?\\" Third Sister replied, \\"Who else would there"},{"paragraph":42,"mentions":13,"tokens":["潘三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"潘三道：「快些来罢！」要来扯他，三姐笑道：「关了房门。」刚转身，只听得外面嚷道：「做的好事！」一阵脚步响。潘三一听，魂不附体。只见周小三领着他两个舅子，拿着雪亮的刀，又有一条粗麻绳，上前将潘三按住，拉下炕来。许老二一连三四拳，骂道：「你这狗鸡巴亏的，肛了","en":"Pan the Third urged, \\"Come quickly!\\" and reached out to pull her. Third Sister laughed and said, \\"Close the bedroom door.\\" Just as she turned around, a voice from outside roared, \\"A fine deed you're doing!\\" followed by the thunderous clatter of footsteps. Pan the"},{"paragraph":43,"mentions":7,"tokens":["潘三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"潘三俯首无词，穿了裤子鞋袜，然后向小三说道：「你既然是为人报仇，就不应要我的钱。」小三道：「要你什么钱？」潘三道：「非但钱，还有八两重的金镯子。」小三道：「你回去与我打官司就是了。」三姐道：「潘三，你要打官司早些说，我好习学口供，省得上堂时说得不好。」潘","en":"Pan the Third hung his head, utterly bereft of words. He put on his trousers, shoes, and socks, and then said to Xiaosan, \\"Since you were seeking revenge for another, you should not have taken my money.\\" Xiaosan retorted, \\"What money of yours did I take?\\" Pan the"},{"paragraph":44,"mentions":1,"tokens":["潘三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"那兄妹夫妻四人犹大笑了一会，三姐道：「这潘三也被我们收拾苦了，亏二哥能下这毒手。」老二道：「我还没有使劲，恐怕挖了他的肠子出来。」三姐道：「那三百吊钱，我有个主意，不知两位哥哥肯依不肯依。」老大、老二道：「这件事是妹子的功劳，凭妹子怎样，我们无有不依。」三姐道：「将一百吊钱给你妹夫，叫他做本钱","en":"three siblings and Zhou Xiaosan continued to laugh uproariously for quite some time. Third Sister said, \\"This Pan the Third has been thoroughly dealt with by us; it is all thanks to Second Brother's willingness to execute such a ruthless plan.\\" Second Brother laughed, \\"I didn't even use my full strength; I was afraid of digging his intestines out!\\" Third Sister said, \\"As"},{"paragraph":45,"mentions":1,"tokens":["潘三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"那兄弟两个都说「很是。」小三今早将这票子，已同潘三对了外票，是预先商量停妥的，便拿出来交与三姐。三姐分派定了，又说道：「倒是三兄弟的毛病要紧，与他治好了方好。」","en":"The two brothers both agreed, \\"Very right.\\" Xiaosan had already exchanged the notes for cash with Pan the Third that very morning — a detail prearranged — and he now brought the money out and handed it to Third Sister. Once she had finished distributing it, she added, \\"However, Third Brother's ailment is the most pressing matter; we must cure him first and foremost.\\""}],"45":[{"paragraph":26,"mentions":1,"tokens":["潘三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"贾空存惜玉心，分香浪费金条脱。\\n蕙芳看了两句，喜动颜色，及看到「分香浪费金条脱」，不觉脸上又微泛红潮，怕人题起潘三的故事。止有道生不懂，吟哦了几遍。众人心里想道：「怎么这些事神仙都会知道？这也奇极了！」各各骇异。又见写道：","en":"pair. When he reached \\"incense wasted, golden armlets,\\" his cheeks flushed faintly, as he dreaded any mention of Pan the Third's affair. Only Daosheng did not catch the allusion, and he chanted the lines repeatedly. Everyone thought to themselves, \\"How can the immortal know such secrets? It is marvelous!\\" More lines appeared:"}],"47":[{"paragraph":18,"mentions":1,"tokens":["潘三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"再说潘三自那日受了周小三这番荼毒回去，唬了一场大病，二十几天才起得来。这口气闷在心里，无从发泄，还算小事。","en":"Let us return to Pan the Third. After suffering Zhou Xiaosan's brutal torment that day, he went home and fell gravely ill with a severe fever, unable to rise from his bed for over twenty days. The stifling resentment lodged in his chest with nowhere to vent was still the lesser of"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":5,"tokens":["潘三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"那许老二抠了他一抠，又放了些东西在内，潘三回来趁早想法还好，偏偏又病了整个月，如今又隔了多时，里头倒像生了虫，痒得难忍。老婆面前也讲不出来，每到痒时只好隔着裤子抠抠擦擦，无奈全不中用。要想找个人替他医医这痒病，自己已是这些年纪，又这般相貌，断难启齿。那一日实在难忍了，只得要老年失节。想家内人","en":"When Xu Laoer had violated him, he had left something behind inside. Had Pan the Third sought a remedy early on, it might have been manageable, but he had languished in sickness for a full month. Now, after so much time had passed, it felt as though worms were crawling inside him, the itch unbearable. He could not speak of it to his wife;"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":8,"tokens":["潘三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"甚苦，在班里分包钱，他与我有些情分。」即到戏园中找着了桂枝，也带他上了馆子，又许他几件衣裳。桂枝心里喜欢，当是潘三念旧，还要与他叙叙，便极力巴结。潘三见他光景甚好，痒病便发作了。便把他的病根告诉了他，问他可有医方。桂枝听了，笑了一会，说道：「这没有医方，就有医方，想你能也断乎不肯的。」潘三道：「我倒肯，只怕人家倒不肯。你若肯医我这个病，我愿重重谢你。」桂枝笑了一","en":"playhouse, took him to a restaurant, and promised him several sets of clothes. Guizhi was delighted, thinking Pan the Third was reminiscing about old times and seeking his company again, and flattered him eagerly. Seeing him so well-disposed, Pan the Third felt his itch flare up. He confessed the root of his affliction and asked if he knew a cure. Guizhi laughed for a while"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":5,"tokens":["潘三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"到了次日，桂枝果然来了。进了小账房内，也照昨日的样，只是不济，就用三牲也祭不起他，把个潘三急得无可奈何，两人白白的坐了半天而散。潘三正在纳闷，忽见一个伙计进来说道：「周家那找零的银子二十九两七钱，打发人来取。」潘三道：「我早已秤好在此。」将天秤架下抽屉一开，只见几个砝码在内，不见银包。又从各处找了，也不见有。潘三明知桂枝偷去，只得叫伙计重","en":"tried as they had the day before, but to no avail—even a grand sacrifice of three meats could not have raised it. Pan the Third was frantic with frustration, and the two sat idle for half the day before parting. Pan the Third was brooding when a clerk came in and said: \\"The Zhou household sent someone for their twenty-nine taels and seven mace of change silver.\\" Pan the Third"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":14,"tokens":["潘三","潘三爷"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"痒得利害，偶然想起卓天香也十七八岁了，又是他的老主顾，叫他来商量商量倒可以，即叫人去叫了天香来。天香来了，见了潘三，请了安。潘三甚是欢喜，又同他到小账房里，摆出一盘盒子菜、一碟熏鱼、一碟瓜子、一壶陈木瓜酒，与他谈心。天香见潘三喜眉笑脸，乜斜着眼睛，扭头扭脑，不像往日的样子，心里想他今日高兴，必有一番缠扰，吃了一会，天香过去与潘三一凳坐了。潘三搂着，一手摸他那物，","en":"him over to sound him out might work,\\" he thought, and sent someone to fetch Tianxiang. Tianxiang arrived, saw Pan the Third, and paid his respects. Pan the Third was delighted, taking him into the small account room. He laid out a box of assorted delicacies, a plate of smoked fish, a dish of melon seeds, and a pot of aged papaya wine, pouring his heart out to him. Seeing"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":6,"tokens":["潘三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"潘三道：「我也不恼你，但我今日不高兴与你做这件事。」天香只得走开坐了，又道：「三爷，要梳发不要？」潘三道：「也好，倒梳梳发罢。」天香与潘三梳起发来。潘三问道：「你们给人顽的时候，内里怎样快活？」天香笑道：「有什么快活，这是伺候人的差使，快活是在人快活呢。","en":"Pan the Third said: \\"I am not angry with you, but I am not in the mood for this today.\\" Tianxiang could only step aside and sit down, asking: \\"Third Master, shall I comb your hair?\\" Pan the Third said: \\"Alright, comb it then.\\" As Tianxiang combed his hair, Pan the"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":6,"tokens":["潘三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"那里有什么方法！」想了一想，忽又说道：「有，有，有！有一个人与我们同行，听他说医好一个人，说是用手挖出来的。」潘三笑道：「这个如何放得进手？」天香道：「手是放不进，指头是伸得进的。」潘三道：「适或长了毛，指头也挖不出来。」天香道：「他有方法。他说长毛也要经过人精才长，没有经过是不长的，不过那东西不得出来。」潘三道：「既这么说，有三个月的，大约还可以治得？」天香道","en":"exclaimed: \\"Yes, yes, yes! There is a man in our trade who said he cured someone once. He said he dug it out by hand.\\" Pan the Third laughed: \\"How could a hand fit inside?\\" Tianxiang said: \\"A hand won't fit, but a finger can reach.\\" Pan the Third said: \\"If hair has grown, a finger won't be able to dig it out.\\" Tianxiang said: \\"He has his methods. He says the hair only grows after"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":2,"tokens":["潘三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"到明日去找那人，告知缘故。那人笑道：「潘三叫你来请我么？这事我早知道。他正月里拿这个法子收拾了许老三，许三姐才设计哄他，许老二就用他的法子收拾他，许老二早告诉了我。许老三吃了多少荞麦面，还吃了泻药，泻不出来。还是我传他的法子。听说三姐将银耳挖替他挖干净的，才不至成了毛病。潘三这个人真不是个东","en":"The next day, Tianxiang sought out the man and explained the situation. The man laughed: \\"Pan the Third sent you to fetch me? I knew about this long ago. In the first month, Pan the Third used this very trick to ruin Xu Laosan. Xu's Third Sister devised a scheme to trick him, and Xu Laoer used Pan the Third's own method to ruin him in return. Xu Laoer"},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":7,"tokens":["潘三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"天香再三的替潘三央求。那人道：「既然要我去治好他的病，你去对他说，要送我三百吊钱。他这个毛病还花三百吊买来的，何况要治好？他应该加一倍才是。」天香即将这话去对潘三讲了，潘三道：「不知取得出来取不出来？如果真能取出来，我就给他三百吊。但叮嘱他别告诉人。」天香去了歇了两","en":"Tianxiang pleaded on Pan the Third's behalf again and again. The man finally said: \\"If you insist I go cure his illness, tell him he must give me three hundred strings of cash. It cost him three hundred strings to buy this affliction in the first place; to cure it, he should pay double.\\""},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":6,"tokens":["潘三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"潘三道：「必定要金的，银的使不得？」那人道：「定要金的，银的万使不得。」说罢去了。潘三疑他赚这二两金子，但用二两低银打了，镀了金，等他来。明日那人果然来了，将耳挖放进，替他掏得个干净。潘三也算略尝滋味，先给了一百吊钱，那人把这耳挖果然要了，潘三以为得计。","en":"Pan the Third asked: \\"Must it be gold? Will silver not do?\\" The man replied: \\"It must absolutely be gold. Silver will not do under any circumstances.\\" With that, he left. Suspecting the man was trying to swindle him out of the two taels of gold, Pan the Third used"},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":7,"tokens":["潘三","潘三爷"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"可言。一日，想将那金耳挖到银匠铺里打两个戒指。银匠说是镀金的，他还不信，及到试金石上刮了出来，果然是银的。便恨潘三赚他，起了狠心，找了天香，要他去对潘三讲，不应欺他，他如今把这耳挖做了凭据，逢人便说是潘三爷要他挖屁股的，叫他一辈子怎样做人？天香果然说了，潘三无奈，只得托天香去说，叫他不要声扬，再给他些钱。后来讲来讲去，那人只是不依，又给了三百吊。以后那人与天香串","en":"believe it, the man had him test it on the touchstone, and indeed, it proved to be silver underneath. Enraged that Pan the Third had cheated him, malice filled his heart. He sought out Tianxiang and demanded he tell Pan the Third that he should not have deceived him. Now, he would use the earpick as proof and tell everyone he met that Pan the Third had hired him to dig out his"}],"49":[{"paragraph":3,"mentions":3,"tokens":["潘三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"情愿进来伺候老太太，又夸奖他三姐粗粗细细件件皆能，还会缝衣写算，针线活计是不用说了。蕙芳也闻得三姐之名，收拾过潘三，想是个伶俐人，也想见见他，问他怎样收拾的。便与春航说了，举荐他进来，春航不好推辞，一口应允。这三姐因收拾潘三之后，心上也有些惧怕潘三要来报仇，故此小三在家，闲了两三个月，才得进了这个门子。后又见春航点了状元，老太太来了，也没有个中意的人伺候，所以想","en":"needlework was beyond compare. Huifang, who had heard of Third Sister's formidable reputation from the time she taught Pan the Third a lesson, figured she must be a sharp and clever woman. Curious to meet her and learn exactly how she had dealt with Pan the Third, he recommended her to Chunhang, who readily agreed. Ever since the Pan the Third affair, Third Sister had harbored a lingering"},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":3,"tokens":["潘三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"十指尖尖，套了银甲，就接了放下，道：「请三姐叫我的名子，谢老太太的赏。」三姐答应了，把蕙芳打量一番，蕙芳便触起潘三的事，想要问他，却又不敢。三姐慧眼一观，已瞧出蕙芳像要问他什么，便呆呆的看着蕙芳，等他问来。蕙芳被他不转眼的看着，倒有些不好意思，心中想道：「我看他这个光景，就问了他，他也未必怪我。」便笑盈盈的走近一步，叫了一声：「三姐！我有一句话要问你，又怕你要恼","en":"reward.\\" Third Sister agreed and then stood looking Huifang over carefully. Her presence reminded Huifang of the Pan the Third affair; he wanted to ask her about it but felt a bit timid. With her perceptive eyes, Third Sister could already tell he had a question lingering on his lips, so she simply gazed at him blankly, waiting for him to speak. Being stared at so unblinkingly"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":3,"tokens":["潘三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"但人生得好，而且还灵慧异常，倒是个贞节妇人呢。」春航笑道：「灵慧有之，贞节未确。」蕙芳笑道：「你没听见他收拾过潘三么？」春航笑道：「也有所闻，那是潘三这般嘴脸，自然应收拾的。你方才说爱好之心，人人有之。设使你做了潘三，他就不忍收拾你了。」蕙芳道：「你何不试试他？他在你这里，就想收拾你，也不敢的。」春航笑：「一发胡说了。」忽然跟班的来请，道：「房师杨老爷有要紧话商","en":"Chunhang laughed, \\"Intelligent, yes; chaste, I'm not so sure.\\" Huifang smiled, \\"Haven't you heard how she dealt with Pan the Third?\\" Chunhang chuckled, \\"I've heard something of it, but with a face like Pan the Third's, he naturally deserved to be dealt with. As you just said, a heart that appreciates beauty is universal. If you had been Pan the Third, she wouldn't have had the heart"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":2,"tokens":["潘三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"就叫你兄弟。」便接口叫了一声：「兄弟！」蕙芳也叫了一声：「姐姐！」三姐又道：「我前日真怪你有点冒失，怎么你问起潘三那事来？这事干我什么事，那是你姐夫做的事情，与三兄弟报仇，我瞧还没有瞧见潘三是什么样儿呢！这句话你若问了别人，只怕就不好。幸亏是我，我因为是你问我，我所以不肯恼你，若第二人我依他么？兄弟，我明日送你对荷包，你只别告诉人说我给你的。你若说了，惹得这个又","en":"Third Sister then said, \\"The other day, I really did think you were a bit too forward. Why did you ask about the Pan the Third affair? What does that business have to do with me? That was your brother-in-law's doing, taking revenge for Third Brother. I haven't even laid eyes on what Pan the Third looks like! If you had asked anyone else that question, it might have caused trouble."}],"50":[{"paragraph":18,"mentions":1,"tokens":["潘三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"时同走。这魏大爷以后非但不要花钱，倒还可以使他的钱。谁料婊子之中，也有这等有情有义的人，不是奇事吗？最可笑是那潘三，他因欠玉天仙的嫖钱不能还，他就引他的表侄去逛，留他表侄住下，他就偷跑了。","en":"someone of such deep feeling and profound loyalty? Is it not a marvel? But the most ridiculous story is about Pan the Third. Because he couldn't pay his brothel debts to Yutianxian, he actually lured his own cousin's nephew there to visit her. He left his nephew behind as collateral and quietly slipped away himself!\\""},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":1,"tokens":["潘老三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"即至要走，那些捞毛的要钱，又不叫他走。他表侄没法，只得同那婊子坐了车回家，当了两票当，才打发了婊子。他表侄忙至潘老三家内告知，家中大闹了一场。","en":"where he pawned two valuable items just to pay her off and send her away. The nephew then rushed furiously to Pan the Third's house to expose him, and a massive, chaotic family uproar ensued!\\""},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":2,"tokens":["潘老三","潘三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"潘老三没法，只得将手腕上的肉，自己咬下了两块。人都说他为嫖割股，你们说这个自行伤可笑不可笑？」于是大家大笑，道：「那潘三本不是个东西。」文泽道：「我知道你与奚十一相好。」唐和尚道：「这奚大老爷闹得很，今年生了毒疮，几乎性命不保，还是我医好他的。如今他也要到","en":"\\"Backed into a corner with no way out, Pan the Third actually bit two chunks of flesh right off his own wrist! Now everyone jokes that he 'carved his own flesh for the sake of whoring'. Tell me, isn't such self-mutilation utterly ridiculous?\\" The whole room roared with laughter, agreeing, \\"That Pan the"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":1,"tokens":["潘其观"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"还没有归还，便到孙宅去找他，谁知元茂同了他两个舅子下通州赴考去了，只好认了晦气。到出京那几日，一起一起的饯行，潘其观、奚十一、张仲雨、冯子佩、杨梅窗、张笑梅、顾月卿、唐和尚等轮流作饯，唐和尚的庄子好不热闹，聘才又辞了几天行。","en":"drop. In the days leading up to his departure from the capital, farewell banquets were thrown one after another. Pan Qiguan, Xi Eleven, Zhang Zhongyu, Feng Zipei, Yang Meichuang, Zhang Xiaomei, Gu Yueqing, Monk Tang, and others took turns hosting him. Tang's establishment was exceptionally lively, and Pincai ended up postponing his departure for several more days."}],"58":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":2,"tokens":["潘三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"也要告病。又想家内兄弟都已回去，也轮不到他作主，不如且到广西走走，看看局面怎样。但此时已经盘费全无，而且又欠了潘三四千银子，急于要还，日来催逼，把个挥金如土的奚十一闹得走头无路起来。潘三是个大帐局，一天之内往来的保家不少，听说奚家的洋行倒了，盐场漂了，人口如风，已传遍了。","en":"better to try Guangxi and see how matters stood. By now, however, his travel funds were gone, and he still owed Pan the Third three or four thousand taels, urgently due. Dunned day and night, Xi Eleven, who had once scattered gold like dirt, was driven to his wits' end. Pan the Third ran a large lending house. In a single day many guarantors passed through its doors. Word that"},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":3,"tokens":["潘三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"：「人情势利，早知如此，我若省俭些，非但不欠账，而且还有余，何必要受人这些气！今日若不是唐和尚、张仲雨做保，这潘三准不肯借钱，还要逼还欠账。就是潘三，他也借过我的钱，我何尝要过利钱？不料此时将对扣的帐来借给我，你想，这个交情可叹不可叹。我本来零零碎碎使了他三千银子，他如今加上利钱，就算四千。再借给我二千两做盘缠，就要我写了一万银子的欠票，到江南太爷任上先还五千，","en":"still have a surplus. Why must I swallow such insults! Today, if Monk Tang and Zhang Zhongyu hadn't stood surety, Pan the Third would never have lent a copper and would have pressed the debt. Pan borrowed from me once. Did I ever charge interest? Now he lends to me at compound rates. Think how touching that friendship is. In bits and pieces I used three thousand of his silver."},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":2,"tokens":["潘三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"见他才二十几岁，好生面善，想了一想，像是从前潘三那个赶车的，如今体面多了。那人一见了奚十一，低着头过去。大傻子道：「你应认得这人。」奚十一道：「好像潘三从前那个赶车的一样。」大傻道：「可不是他？如今他靠着他女人的福，不赶车，做了状元公的家人了。」奚十一逛了一会，重到九香楼下来，园中有许多灌园的浇灌","en":"The young man looked barely twenty, yet his face seemed familiar. Xi studied him for a moment and recognized Pan the Third's former driver, now dressed and strutting with a dignity far beyond his old station. The man, seeing Xi Eleven, lowered his head and passed by. Big Fool said, \\"You ought to know him.\\" Xi agreed, \\"He looks like Pan's former driver.\\" Big Fool confirmed,"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":3,"tokens":["潘三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一日，唐和尚送行，约了潘三来，潘三打发人来说：「跌坏了鼻子，要避风，不能来。」奚十一、唐和尚都疑潘三怪了，是托辞的。那日奚十一见了得月，想与他叙叙，无奈唐和尚在前，只得忍住，酒也多喝了几杯，烟又多吹了几口，到二更后才回，醉醺醺的。底下那东西甚是作怪，时刻直竖起来，头上痒飕飕的","en":"One day Monk Tang came to see him off and had invited Pan the Third. Pan sent word that he had broken his nose and must avoid the wind, so he could not come. Xi and Monk Tang suspected Pan was sulking and making excuses. That day Xi saw Deyue and wished to renew acquaintance, but with Monk Tang present he held back."},{"paragraph":30,"mentions":2,"tokens":["潘三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"奚十一病好之后，带了菊花赴任，潘三打发伙计同去讨账。唐和尚倒十分惆怅，又请了几天，临行与得月送出城外，倒算个全始全终的交情了。潘三因脸上有病，不好见风，这月内总不出门。","en":"After Xi Eleven recovered, he took Juhua to his post. Pan the Third sent clerks along to collect the debt. Monk Tang was quite melancholy and kept him several extra days. On leaving, he and Deyue escorted Xi beyond the city, cementing a friendship complete in courtesy. Pan the Third, due to facial trouble, avoided the"},{"paragraph":31,"mentions":13,"tokens":["潘三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"却说潘三脸上害什么病呢？也有个缘故。潘三今年五十岁，若他的元配在这里，倒也五十三岁，已别过了十余年。潘三四十岁上又娶了一房，是山西人，姓石，其父在京里开个油盐酱醋的小铺子，发了些财，开了个小小账局。这个石氏颇有几分姿色，潘三看中了，娶他已有十年。石氏才二十八","en":"What ailed Pan the Third's face? There was a cause. Pan was fifty, and had his first wife lived, she would be fifty-three, but they had parted over ten years before. At forty Pan had taken a second wife, a Shanxi woman surnamed Lady Shi. Her father ran a small oil, salt, and"},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":3,"tokens":["潘三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"叙起他们一件闲事来。今年六月初六，唐和尚生日，请潘三、奚十一在庙里吃面，又备了两桌送与白菊花、石氏。石氏处是打发得月送去。这石氏见了得月那个模样，中心甚是爱他，给了他许多东西，便要他做干儿子。得月岂有不肯，便拜了干娘，以后常常叫他来走动。得月若来，必陪着石氏吃饭，或时抹牌顽耍。又知道潘三爱男风，必想得","en":"To relate one of their affairs, on the sixth day of the sixth month, which was Monk Tang's birthday, he invited Pan the Third and Xi Eleven to the temple for noodles, and sent two tables to Bai Juhua and to Lady Shi. Lady Shi's table went by Deyue. Lady Shi took one look at Deyue and loved him, gave him many gifts, and asked him to be her godson. Deyue agreed at once, kowtowed"},{"paragraph":34,"mentions":7,"tokens":["潘其观","潘三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"潘其观驮了个小小石碑，尚不知觉，一心倒想顽那得月。后来也有些疑心，看出石氏待得月的情景。过了两月，心生一计。一日，候着得月进来，半路截留，邀他到一间书房内，开了一个灯，与他吃烟。潘三睡在得月后头，摸摸索索，得月不肯。潘三道：「你若不依我，我便不许你进来。你","en":"Pan Qiguan carried that little stone tablet on his back without noticing, his mind only on sporting with Deyue. Later he grew suspicious and read how Lady Shi treated Deyue. After two months he formed a plan. One day he intercepted Deyue halfway to a visit, pulled"},{"paragraph":35,"mentions":3,"tokens":["潘三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"石氏那日约定得月早饭后来的，等了好一会，还不见来，心里也恐潘三半路打劫。他悄悄的到书房来，见关上门，更加疑心。听了一听，觉两人切切促促的私语，听不明白，便轻轻的走到窗下来。见又下了卷窗，便将舌尖舔破了纸一望，见潘三抱着得月坐在身上，两脸相偎，索索的动。一看心中大怒，想要骂起来，又想道：「不如在门口候这老兔子出来","en":"That day Lady Shi had arranged for Deyue to come after breakfast. She waited long without him and feared Pan would intercept. Quietly she went to the study and found the door shut, raising more suspicion. Listening, she heard whispers she could not make out, and crept to the window. The blind was down, but she licked a hole in the paper and saw Pan holding"},{"paragraph":36,"mentions":2,"tokens":["潘三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"石氏怒容满面，狠狠的瞅了他一眼。潘三一脚跨出来，石氏站起，一把将胡子揪牢。潘三魂不附体，低了头，一动也不敢动。","en":"Lady Shi's face was full of wrath as she glared. Pan stepped out, Lady Shi rose and seized his beard full. Pan's soul fled, and he hung his head, motionless."},{"paragraph":37,"mentions":1,"tokens":["潘三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"了，你如今又想肏人，你何不弯转你的屌子来，善你自己的？他是我的干儿子，你胆包了身，你敢顽他？」便使劲一个嘴巴，潘三「啊哟」一声，血流满面，也顾不得胡子，死命的挣脱了，胡子已挦去了半边。石氏怒气未息，把得月光头上凿了几个栗暴，脸上拧了两把。得月战战兢兢，双膝跪下求饶，石氏又可怜他，拧了他的耳朵，同了进去。","en":"not bend your own rod into yourself? He's my godson, how dare you touch him?\\" She slapped with all her might. Pan cried out as blood streamed. He could not mind his beard and wrenched free, with half the whiskers torn away. Lady Shi still raged. She rapped Deyue's head, twisted his cheeks. Deyue trembled, knelt, and begged. Pitying him, she dragged him by the ear"},{"paragraph":38,"mentions":6,"tokens":["潘三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"且说潘三被石氏这一掌，如何就打得这般利害，满面流血呢？原来石氏带了两个银指甲，一抓戳在潘三鼻子上，因用力太猛，将那银指甲打断，既薄且尖，竟将潘三的鼻子尖刮断，故此流得满面的血。潘三痛不可忍，忙忙跑出，就请了与奚十一修肾的那个阳善修医治，也与他配了个假鼻子。潘","en":"How could a single slap from Lady Shi have left Pan's whole face running with blood? She wore two silver fingernail guards, and one swipe caught Pan's nose. The guard was thin and sharp and snapped, slicing off the tip of his nose, hence the blood. Pan could not bear the pain, fled, and sent for Yang"}],"60":[{"paragraph":17,"mentions":2,"tokens":["潘三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"细。」王兰保笑而不言。蕙芳道：「去年奚十一闹来，幸亏着他，我就没有法了。」素兰道：「原来你也怕奚十一，难道他比潘三还利害么？」蕙芳道：「潘三是个无用的人，那奚十一闹起来，就与前日魏聘才使来的车夫一样，你怕不怕？」兰保道：「那天适或我不在家，你便怎样？」蕙芳道：「我就躲开不出来了。」琴仙问奚十一怎样，兰保将他的样子学了一回，琴仙也觉好笑。蕙芳道：「听得奚十一出京去","en":"been completely at a loss.\\" Sulan asked, \\"So even you were afraid of Xi Eleven? Is he really more formidable than Pan the Third?\\" Huifang replied, \\"Pan the Third is a useless coward. But when Xi Eleven starts a riot, he's just like the carriage driver Wei Pincai sent the other day—would you be afraid or not?\\" Lanbao asked, \\"What would you have done if I hadn't been home that"}]}`),"char-74":{3:[{paragraph:18,mentions:2,tokens:["老王"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"聘才待要发作，只见那个胖子伸过手来，将那卖玉器的一扯，就指着他说道：「老王，你别要这么着。」聘才连忙招呼，那胖子倒真动了气，又道：「老王，你别要混懵。怎么拿个松香壶儿不值一百钱，赚人二两银。砸碎了就要六两。你瞧他南边人老实，不懂你那懵劲儿，你就懵开了。我姓富的在这里，你不能。」那卖玉器的见了他，就不敢强，道：「三爷，你能怎",en:`temper, the stout man reached across the table, seizing the peddler by the arm. Pointing a thick finger, he warned, "Old Wang, enough of your tricks." Pincai offered a grateful nod, but the stout man's anger was genuine. "Old Wang, do not try your swindles here. A lump of pine-resin is barely worth a hundred cash, yet you tried to fleece him for two taels. Now that it is broken,`},{paragraph:29,mentions:2,tokens:["老王"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"蓉官道：「那奚老爷的爷们，好不利害，将这老王推推搡搡的，我怕跌了他，把他那浪盘子的臭杂碎全砸了，不绝了他的命？倒幸亏没有砸掉多少，只砸了两个料嘴子，一个料烟壶。有一个爷们更恶，在他脖子那个灰包上一扌叉，那老王噎了一口气，两个白眼珠一翻，好不怕人。这个奚大老爷的性子也太暴，适或扌叉死了他，也要偿",en:`Rongguan shuddered delicately. "Lord Xi's men are utterly ruthless. The way they shoved and battered Old Wang—I feared he would fall and shatter that miserable tray of his entirely. It could have killed the old wretch! Luckily, only two glass nozzles and a snuff bottle were lost. One of the servants was particularly vicious; he struck Old Wang directly on that`}],45:[{paragraph:8,mentions:1,tokens:["老王"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"乐不均，我被那王胡子缠得发昏，要消这样，要消那样，据他的想头，差不多把他带来的东西都消在这里才好。」子云道：「老王的胡子越发长了。其实这个人，倒也不讨人嫌，就是利心过于重些。《古今图书集成》我虽有一部，这个也只好我们留下罢。这部书也不过如聋子的耳朵，摆设而已。留他住两天，倒要看看他扶乩的本事，是哄人的不是。」子玉道：「他会扶乩么？」次贤道：「他说去年在岳阳楼，遇",en:`this be sold and that be sold. By his own lights, he would unload his entire pack right here." Ziyun laughed. "Old Wang's beard grows longer every year. The man himself is not so trying, only his greed runs high. I own a *Complete Collection of Illustrations and Writings from Antiquity to the Present* already, but we may as well keep this set too. They are like a deaf`}]},"char-75":JSON.parse(`{"8":[{"paragraph":6,"mentions":1,"tokens":["唐和尚"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"听戏？清早到锦春园华公府走了一走，出来又到怡园徐二爷处商量件事，遂同起盛银号潘老三在天香楼吃了饭。昨日宏济寺的唐和尚，有件事约我在这里等他。」说罢拿出了玉烟壶，递与聘才，聘才接了过来。元茂此时方想起是初六那一天见过的，重叙了几句寒温。仲雨又将烟壶递与元茂，元茂不知好歹，当着闻痧药的，一闻即连打了七八个嚏喷，眼泪鼻涕一齐出来，惹得仲雨、聘才都笑。仲雨问聘才在梅宅光景","en":"discuss a matter. Afterward, I dined at Tianxiang Pavilion with Third Brother Pan of the Qisheng Bank. Yesterday, Monk Tang of the Hongji Monastery arranged to meet me here on business.\\" As he spoke, he produced a jade snuff bottle and handed it to Pincai, who accepted it graciously. Yuanmao suddenly recalled having met Zhongyu on the sixth day of the month, and they exchanged"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":6,"tokens":["唐和尚"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"保珠笑嘻嘻的道：「唐老爷，你那位少爷，倒没有带出来？」唐和尚笑道：「岂有此理！和尚连奶奶都没有，那里来的少爷？」二喜道：「你那位少爷，也与奶奶一样。」唐和尚一手就伸到二喜脸上来。二喜笑道：「我说和奶奶的模样长得一样，没有说错呀。」唐和尚见有聘才、元茂在坐，便也假装斯文，缩回手来，说道：「你们糟蹋佛门弟子，是有","en":"Baozhu smiled playfully. \\"Master Tang, did you not bring your young son with you?\\" Monk Tang barked a laugh. \\"Preposterous! A monk doesn't even have a wife, where would I get a son?\\" Erxi retorted, \\"Your 'son' looks just like a wife anyway.\\" Tang reached out to pinch Erxi's cheek. Erxi dodged,"}],"14":[{"paragraph":17,"mentions":4,"tokens":["唐和尚"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"是谁？」听得咳嗽一声，应道：「是我，寻高老爷有句话说。」高品听口声便道：「妙兮，妙兮。」出来一望，果然是庙里的唐和尚，问道：「你有什么话说？」唐和尚便笑嘻嘻的钻将进来，与春航见了，看见了蕙芳，便合着掌道：「阿弥陀佛，原来菩萨降临，小僧有失迎接，罪过，罪过。怪不得昨晚一夜的祥云瑞雨，今早佛殿上观世音旁边，一尊龙女香菩萨不见了，原来在这里。」蕙芳也认得这个唐和尚，听了","en":"Pin recognized the voice at once and said, \\"Ah, how delightful!\\" He stepped out and looked: sure enough, it was Tang the Monk from the temple. Gao Pin asked, \\"What do you have to say?\\" Tang the Monk grinned and squeezed himself inside. He greeted Chunhang, then caught sight of Huifang and pressed his palms together: \\"Amituofo! A bodhisattva has descended to our realm! This"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":2,"tokens":["唐和尚"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「若锥处囊中，颖脱而出。」蕙芳笑了一笑，唐和尚便夺了帽子戴上，便道：「高老爷，你、你、你。」又不说了，嘻着嘴笑。蕙芳道：「我已对了。」即念道：「如瓢浮水面，顶圆而光。」春航、高品都笑说道：「对得好，敏捷且好。」唐和尚笑道：「多谢、多谢，小僧有幸得逢菩萨赞扬，倒没有说我的像鸡巴。」便拉了高品出去，","en":"\\"Like an awl inside a bag, the tip pierces through and emerges.\\" Huifang gave a small smile. Tang the Monk snatched his hat back and put it on, then started, \\"Lord Gao, you, you, you...\\" and said nothing more, just grinning. Huifang said, \\"I have already matched it,\\" and recited: \\"Like a gourd floating on water, the top is round and bald.\\" Chunhang and Gao"}],"33":[{"paragraph":23,"mentions":2,"tokens":["唐和尚"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"才道：「唐大哥进来坐。」那人道：「停一回再来。」聘才道：「就请进来，这位客就是我说的富三老爷，他正要会会你。」唐和尚便撬开风门，走将进来。聘才与富三站起，唐和尚满面堆下笑来，说道：「原来这是富三老爷，今日僧人有幸，瞻仰了大贵人。」富三也说：「久仰得很。」与他拉了手，和尚一屁股就坐在椅子上，把富三上下瞧了两眼。富三看这和尚也就生得异样，五短身材，穿一件青绉细羊皮僧袍","en":"\\"Everyone calls him Master Tang, but he insists on being called Brother Tang.\\" Before Pincai could finish his sentence, the wind door rattled, and a head wearing a brown felt hat with trimmed edges and a thick mustache popped in, then quickly withdrew. Pincai called out, \\"Brother Tang,"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":2,"tokens":["唐和尚"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"来。」想了一回，忽然的大笑道：「呸！我记错了，我认是大悲庵的姑子，实在像得很。」说得聘才大笑，小和尚涨红了脸。唐和尚笑道：「三老爷取笑。」聘才道：「叫他装个姑子，却也看不出来。我们这唐大哥是第一个快乐人，吃的、穿的、用的、顽的，件件都好。」唐和尚道：「阿弥陀佛，出家人有什么好。我师兄在日把我拘束住了，如今比从前却舒服些。原先这屋子里有位田老爷，住了一年，也是天天有","en":"Compassion Convent. The resemblance is striking.\\" Pincai roared with laughter, while the young monk blushed deeply. Monk Tang chuckled, \\"Master Third, you jest.\\" Pincai added, \\"If you dressed him as a nun, no one could tell. Our Brother Tang here is a man of true pleasure; whatever he eats, wears, uses, or plays with is of the finest quality.\\" Monk Tang replied, \\"Amitabha,"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":6,"tokens":["唐和尚"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"的人来摆桌子，放杯箸。富三道：「你可不要费事。」聘才道：「没有什么可吃的。」于是分宾主坐了，富三叫得月也坐了。唐和尚命得月同着蓉官斟酒。富三见果碟小吃已摆满了一桌，便道：「作什么，都拿开，留四碟就够了。」便叫留下山鸡丝、火腿、倭瓜子、杏仁。蓉官道：「慢些，慢些！」便抢了一碟橘子，又抓了一把金橘道：「你不爱吃，还有人爱吃呢。」一连上了九样菜，倒也很好滋味。蓉官夹了一","en":"isn't much to eat.\\" Thus, they took their seats as host and guests, and Fu the Third invited Deyue to sit as well. Monk Tang ordered Deyue and Rongguan to pour the wine. Seeing the table filled with small fruit plates, Fu the Third said, \\"What is all this? Take them away; just keep four plates, that will be enough.\\" He requested to keep the shredded pheasant, ham, pumpkin"},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":1,"tokens":["唐和尚"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"富三进，城又重托了唐和尚，蓉官也自回去。不知后事如何，且听下回分解。","en":"Fu the Third entered the city, having entrusted Monk Tang with the important matter once more, while Rongguan also returned home. What happens next will be revealed in the following chapter."}],"34":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["唐和尚"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说聘才送了富三出门，唐和尚即叫人去请他兄弟。聘才刚进屋子，只见李元茂闯将进来道：「今日才寻着你，店铺里那一家不访到，原来搬在这里。」聘才道：「我也搬出来不多几日，因为有些事情，所以还没有来看你，并看庾香。」即问：「庾香近来可好？」元茂道：「好是好的，前月王家写信与太老师，明年","en":"After seeing Fu the Third out, Pincai had Monk Tang send someone to invite Tang's younger brother over. Pincai had just stepped back indoors when Li Yuanmao barged in, declaring, \\"I've finally tracked you down today! There isn't an establishment I haven't scoured, only to find you've moved here.\\" Pincai"},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":1,"tokens":["唐和尚"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"到了三更，四儿来请聘才，说唐和尚请说话。聘才来到和尚房中，见炕上开了灯，屋中点了两枝蜡，照得雪亮，铜炉内火焰熏人。旁边小方桌上有几碟残肴，一把烧酒壶，却不见和尚。聘才坐下等他，等了一回才来，说道：「偏偏要解手，忽然水泄起来。」叫人打了盆水，净了手，坐了说道：「日间所说的事，方才兄弟","en":"At the third watch, Si'er came to inform Pincai that Monk Tang wished to speak with him. Pincai went to the monk's room, where he saw a lamp lit on the kang and two candles burning in the room, casting a snow-bright glow. A copper brazier radiated a smoky heat. On a small square table nearby sat a few dishes of"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":2,"tokens":["唐和尚"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"回到寓中，先见了唐和尚，将说妥的事告诉了，然后取出三张票子，点过一千二百两的数目，叫他收藏了。若二十九日不得，即将原票退还。唐和尚笑嘻嘻的道：「断无不得之理，这二百两是我们两人应得的，只要给他一千就够了。」聘才道：「我要进去换衣裳了。」一直走到自己房里，见元茂尚在那里，又","en":"Upon returning to his lodgings, he first sought out Monk Tang and relayed the agreed-upon terms. He then produced the three drafts, counted out the sum of one thousand two hundred taels, and had the monk store them safely, reminding him that if the post was not secured by the twenty-ninth, the original drafts must"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":1,"tokens":["唐和尚"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"现银回来，又在城外换了些钱，得意扬扬，十分高兴，所有账目尽行清还，过年热闹是不必说。晚上竟把玉天仙接到寺中，请唐和尚过来守岁，绝早关了山门。一夜的泥筒花炮放不绝声。","en":"the Third hurried to the temple to thank Pincai and the monk. The next day, the bank drafts were handed over to Tang's brother, who skimmed off another two hundred from the one thousand as a \\"brokerage fee\\" and kept it entirely for himself. As for the remaining two hundred taels of surplus, he split it, giving one hundred to Pincai. In the end, Pincai netted a solid"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":1,"tokens":["唐和尚"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"唐和尚恐元旦日有人来行香，适或见了玉天仙，到底在他寺里，有些不便。将近天明，即催聘才将车送他回去。","en":"Monk Tang worried that incense-offering worshippers might come on New Year's Day; if they were to spot Yutianxian within the temple grounds, it would be rather inconvenient. Thus, just as dawn approached, he urged Pincai to send her back via carriage."},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":1,"tokens":["唐和尚"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"了两叵罗的松江锭，足足一千两，摇了五十滩，已输了大半。及到清账时输完了，还添出一百余两。是日聘才也输了三百两。唐和尚赢了一百两，冯子佩赢了四百两。","en":"had lost everything and owed an additional hundred-plus taels. Pincai also lost three hundred taels that day. Monk Tang won one hundred taels, and Feng Zipei won four hundred."},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":1,"tokens":["唐和尚"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"的，像是坊里人，恐怕闹出事来，都不稳便。」聘才已是惊弓之鸟，听了便有些胆怯，说道：「我也乏了，歇两天再顽罢。」唐和尚道：「若说不高兴倒可以，至于怕外头有什么缘故，你们只管放心。」即对着聘才说道：「你的住房旁边是个菜园，有两三亩大，内有五六间草房，种菜的带着家小在里面，另有门出入。你院子里不是有重门通的？我嫌不谨慎，故封锁了。如外头有什么缘故，便开了那重门，从菜园里","en":"medium ingots. Yutianxian collected another two hundred and forty taels in banker's fees. Among the crowd was Clerk Tang, the monk's brother, who advised the monk, \\"I urge you all to stop gambling tomorrow. When I came in earlier, I saw two men whispering outside the door; they looked like ward constables. If trouble erupts, it won't be safe for anyone.\\" Pincai, already"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":1,"tokens":["唐和尚"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"请的是富三爷、贵大爷、奚十一、潘三、张仲雨、杨梅窗。是日辞了两个，贵大爷病了，张仲雨有事不能来。即补了冯子佩、唐和尚，宾主共七位。聘才叫了蓉官来陪富三，着人到篷子里叫了天香、翠官前来。不多一刻，两个剃头的也坐了大骡车，有一个人跟着，走进寺来。冯子佩是认识的，小剃头的先与子佩请了安，然后向聘才请安。聘才仔细看他，果然生得俊俏，眉目清澄，肌肤洁白，打扮的式样也与相公一","en":"Yang Meichuang. Two sent their regrets—Gui was ill, and Zhang had other matters to attend to—so Feng Zipei and Monk Tang were brought in to fill their seats, making a total of seven host and guests. Pincai summoned Rongguan to accompany Fu the Third, and sent someone to the stall to fetch Tianxiang and Cuiguan. Before long, the two barber boys arrived at the temple in"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":1,"tokens":["唐和尚"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"问聘才找出梳篦，替他梳发，梳完了又捶了一会。那一个也与子佩梳了，然后吃过早饭，开了烟灯，大家吃烟。富三爷先来，唐和尚见富三爷来了，就带了得月进来。天香、翠官与富三、和尚都请了安。富三却不认识，问他是谁，在那一班的，聘才就说是全福班的。随后奚十一、潘三同来。奚十一带了巴英官，潘三带了个学徒弟的小伙计，拿他竟当做跟班的。大家一齐相见了。潘三见了天香、翠官，笑道：「你们","en":"the opium lamps were lit, and everyone partook. Fu the Third was the first guest to arrive, and upon seeing him, Monk Tang brought Deyue in. Tianxiang and Cuiguan paid their respects to Fu the Third and the monk. Fu the Third, not recognizing them, asked who they were and which troupe they belonged to; Pincai smoothly claimed they were from the Quanfu Troupe. Soon after,"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":3,"tokens":["唐和尚"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"众人看了，一齐大笑。奚十一对着得月道：「你师父天天这么着吗？」得月「呸」了一声，涨红了脸，扭转头不看。唐和尚合着掌道：「阿弥陀佛！罪过，罪过！」此时坐的是富三首席，聘才叫翠官陪了他。第二是奚十一，唐和尚知他是个阔手，且知道他爱得月，便叫得月陪了他。杨八坐了第三，聘才叫天香挨着他。潘三坐了第四，自己与唐和尚坐了主位，只不见蓉官来。饮酒之间，撒村笑骂，嘈杂到个","en":"this every day?\\" Deyue spat out a \\"Pah!\\", his face flushing crimson, and turned his head away, refusing to look. Monk Tang pressed his palms together and chanted, \\"Amitabha! Sinful, how sinful!\\" By this time, the seating was arranged. Fu the Third took the seat of honor, with Pincai assigning Cuiguan to accompany him. Xi Eleven took the second seat; knowing Xi was a generous"},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":2,"tokens":["唐和尚"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"说着将他脸上又闻一闻。只有潘三与聘才无人可闹。聘才笑道：「我们今日只好轮着来闹这个老和尚了。」便互相与唐和尚豁了几拳。闹了一个多时辰，奚十一瘾来了，便叫巴英官拿出烟具来。灯是开现成的，奚十一躺下，叫得月陪他吹烟，两个剃头的也有烟瘾。都聚拢来。唐和尚见了，即连打了两个呵欠，伸了个懒腰。看得奚十一瘾大，等不及，便到自己房中过瘾去了。","en":"have to take turns pestering this old monk.\\" With that, they engaged in a lively game of finger-guessing with Monk Tang. After they had carried on for over two hours, Xi Eleven's craving for opium struck, and he ordered Ba Yingguan to bring out the smoking gear. The lamps were already lit; Xi Eleven lay down and commanded Deyue to join him in smoking. The two barbers,"}],"36":[{"paragraph":11,"mentions":1,"tokens":["唐和尚"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"动粗，便解释道：「他在华府里规矩甚严，一年没有见过生人，自然拘束了。」这边潘三抓耳揉腮，垂涎已甚，却不敢怎样，唐和尚只好心中妄想而已。聘才便问琴言道：「你今日怎么能出来？」琴言将他师傅死了，告了一月假：「今日来看你，还要你同我…」说到此，又不好意思说出来，聘才已经明白，便道：「要我同你到那里去。」琴言只得说道：「要你同我去见见梅太太与庾香。」聘才笑了一笑，点点头道","en":"called Master Du Qin.\\" To Qinyan, he added, \\"These are my closest friends: Master Xi, Third Master Pan, my landlord Monk Tang, and his little novice. Those two are from the troupe; you probably don't know them, so let's all get acquainted.\\" With no choice, Qinyan bowed to them. The monk, knowing he came from the Hua estate, pressed his hands together, bowed repeatedly, and"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":1,"tokens":["唐和尚"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"。他若肯顽我，自然也肯给我顽了。」一面胡思乱想，口中淌出馋涎来，便咬着牙把手在脖子后捶了两捶，鼻子里哼了两声。唐和尚看了好笑，便道：「潘三爷做什么，脖子涨的疼么？」潘三也笑了。奚十一的人送了菜来，要面见聘才，四儿同了进去。来人道：「家爷说，有位琴爷在这里，家爷从前不知道，冒犯了，深自懊悔。本来要请琴爷过去坐坐，恐怕不肯赏脸，叫我送了几样菜来，请大爷代家爷转敬琴爷消","en":"fantasies, drool leaked from his mouth; he gritted his teeth, pounded the back of his neck twice, and snorted. Monk Tang found it amusing and asked, \\"What are you doing, Third Master Pan? Does your neck hurt?\\" Pan the Third laughed along. Just then, Xi Eleven's servant arrived with the dishes and asked to see Pincai. Si'er brought him in. The servant announced, \\"My master"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":1,"tokens":["唐和尚"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"不会喝酒，你放了，我慢慢的喝。」聘才让潘三坐下，说道：「我真不能，你等他慢慢的喝罢。」潘三只得放手坐了，聘才与唐和尚拿两张凳子坐在下面。琴言见潘三将杯子在嘴上擦了一转，十分恼怒，已知他们一党，有心欺侮他，若翻转脸来，犹恐吃亏。","en":"down, saying, \\"He really can't. Just let him drink it slowly.\\" Pan the Third finally let go and sat. Pincai and Monk Tang pulled up two stools and sat lower down. Seeing that Pan the Third had rubbed the cup on his mouth, Qinyan was immensely disgusted. He knew now they were in league to humiliate him, but feared that if he openly turned on them, he would suffer for it."},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":2,"tokens":["唐和尚"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"人劝你三杯。」潘三满拟这杯酒，他若喝了，琴言便亲了他的□嘴一样，偏又砸了，甚是扫兴。还想重来敬他，被聘才拦住。唐和尚不知好歹，斟了半杯道：「阿弥陀佛，华公府是小寺的大施主，老太太装过三世佛的金身，少奶奶塑过送子观音像，舍了三年的灯油。如今他府里爷们光降，我出家人无以为敬，借花献佛，小琴爷请喝这钟。」捧了杯子，打了个稽首，口中念道：「南无大慈大悲救苦救难观世音菩萨！","en":"kissed; seeing it smashed utterly ruined his mood. He tried to press another toast but was blocked by Pincai. Monk Tang, completely lacking in tact, poured half a cup and said, \\"Amitabha! The noble Hua estate is a great patron of our humble temple. The old lady adorned the Three-World Buddha with gold, the young mistress commissioned the Guanyin who brings sons, and they"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":1,"tokens":["唐和尚"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"骂大嚷，更兼身高力大，聘才如何拉得住他，只得将头顶住了他，连说道：「总是我不好！你要打打我，要打打我。」潘三与唐和尚还在旁边火上添油，助纣为虐。奚十一被聘才顶住，不能上前，又想琴言已跑出寺门，谅已上车走远，不好追赶，只得罢了。气得两眼直竖，肚皮挺起，坐下发喘。","en":"Eleven's chest, pleading repeatedly, \\"It's all my fault! If you must hit someone, hit me! Hit me!\\" Pan the Third and Monk Tang stood by, adding fuel to the fire and aiding the tyrant. Blocked by Pincai, and realizing Qinyan had likely run out the temple gates, boarded his carriage, and gone too far to catch, Xi Eleven finally gave up. His eyes bulging with anger, his belly heaving,"},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":1,"tokens":["唐和尚"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"拿来放在奚十一面前，又道：「一千吊的镯子，如今倒值三千吊了。」奚十一见了，越发气狠狠的骂了一会。潘三与唐和尚连说可惜。大约奚十一回去，只剩一个镯子，菊花必有一场大闹，正是癞蛤蟆想吃天鹅肉，也不料自己的福分。","en":"thousand strings is now worth three thousand.\\" Seeing this, Xi Eleven cursed even more viciously. Pan the Third and Monk Tang kept repeating what a pity it was. When Xi Eleven returned with only one bracelet left, Juhua would surely raise a massive uproar. It was precisely the case of a toad longing for swan meat, completely unaware of its own meager lot in life."}],"37":[{"paragraph":7,"mentions":1,"tokens":[],"kind":"identified-reference","zh":"还有一个和尚，就是聘才的房东。","en":"Qinyan said, \\"I saw him yesterday and he told me he had met you three times this year.\\" Ziyu replied, \\"That is quite untrue. The most absurd instance was at dawn on New Year's Day when he came banging on the gate. The doorman had only just gotten out of bed and dressed. Pincai said a word or two, left a calling card, and to this day we have not seen each other. Where did you see him?\\" Qinyan cursed, \\"That Wei Pincai has never been anything but a scoundrel.\\" Huifang agreed, \\"He was a scoundrel long before that. You needn't tell us.\\" Ziyu pressed Qinyan to continue. With tears in his eyes, Qinyan confessed, \\"The fault was mine. I went to his lodgings and asked him to come with me to see you.\\" At these words a sharp pang went through Ziyu, and his eyes began to redden. Everyone listened intently as Qinyan continued. Wang Xun asked, \\"And how did he treat you?\\" Qinyan explained, \\"Pincai used to be decent enough, but now a set of bad characters are leading him astray.\\" Ziyun asked who they were. Qinyan said, \\"One is Xi Eleven, another is Pan Qiguan, and a monk—Pincai's landlord.\\"","identityNote":{"en":"Qinyan refers to Pincai’s monk landlord, Tang, while recounting the earlier harassment.","zh":"琴言追述受辱之事，以聘才房东的身份指唐和尚。"}}],"40":[{"paragraph":14,"mentions":1,"tokens":["唐和尚"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"西，吓了一跳，忙问其缘故，奚十一不肯直说，只推不知为什么忽然肿起来。菊花道：「请个医生来看看罢。」奚十一道：「唐和尚就很好，专医这些病症。」菊花便打发人去请。","en":"idea why it had suddenly swollen up. Juhua said, \\"Let us invite a doctor to come take a look.\\" Xi Eleven said, \\"Master Tang the monk is excellent — he specializes in curing exactly these sorts of afflictions.\\" Juhua accordingly sent someone to fetch him."},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":1,"tokens":["唐和尚"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"原来唐和尚这几天见得月气色不正，指甲发青，知他受了毒气，便用了一剂攻毒泻火的泻药，昨日已泻了好几遍，适奚十一来承受了，由肾经直入心经。奚十一身子是空虚的，再与天香闹了一次，而天香又新染了哈小回子的疮毒，也叫奚十一收来。两毒齐发，甚为沉重。少顷，和尚来问其得病之","en":"Now, the monk Tang had for several days observed that Deyue's complexion was irregular and his fingernails were turning blue; knowing he had absorbed some toxic substance, he had administered a purging decoction to attack the poison and reduce the fever. Yesterday Deyue"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":1,"tokens":["唐和尚"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"菊花见了，好不伤心，又不敢埋怨他，只得求神许愿，尽心调治。换了两三个医生，倒成了蜡烛卸。还是唐和尚知道了，用了上好的至宝丹敷了，才把那个子孙桩留了一寸有余。后来收了功，没头没脑，肉小皮宽，不知像个什么东西，要行房时，料想也不能了。此是奚十一的淫报。","en":"two or three times, but the afflicted organ merely melted away like a dripping candle-stub. At last, it was the monk Tang who, having learned of the situation, applied the finest quality Zhibao Dan salve, and so managed to preserve an inch or more of that Pillar of Posterity. After the wound finally healed over, it was left a limbless, headless stump, the flesh withered"}],"47":[{"paragraph":5,"mentions":1,"tokens":["唐和尚"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一日要到宏济寺去谢唐和尚，封了五十两银子，叫英官拿了。到了寺门口，见间壁开了个饭庄子，挂着招牌，写着安吉堂。奚十一也不理会，到寺中见了得月，有些恨上心来，把他肩上狠狠的拧了一把。得月嚷道：「做什么使劲的拧我？」奚十一笑道：「你害得我好苦，病了一个多月不算，把那子孙桩也锯掉了","en":"One day he went to Hongji Temple to thank Monk Tang, wrapping fifty taels of silver for Yingguan to carry. At the temple gate, he noticed a new dining house next door, its signboard reading Peaceful Fortune Hall. Paying it no mind, he entered the temple, where the sight of Deyue roused his resentment,"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":4,"tokens":["唐和尚"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"只见唐和尚醉醺醺的回来，见了奚十一，满面春风的道：「恭喜，恭喜，如今是大好了。」奚十一笑道：「多谢，多谢，还亏了你。虽然如今做了歪脖子的老短，到底还留得一半。若用了那人的药，定然弄到斩草除根，净了身了。我也没有什么谢你，这一点东西算还你的药本罢。」说罢，作了一","en":"Presently Monk Tang returned drunk, saw Xi Eleven, and beamed with a spring breeze in his face: \\"Congratulations, congratulations—you are fully recovered now.\\" Xi Eleven laughed: \\"Many thanks, many thanks, all owing to you. Though I am now a crooked-necked stump, at least"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":2,"tokens":["唐和尚"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"二人讲了一会话，唐和尚道：「你如今想已不忌口了，我这个庄子有几样菜颇好，今日尝尝新。」奚十一道：「这个庄子是谁开的？开有几天了？」唐和尚道：「这所房子是我寺里的，前年师兄租与一家住了，吊死了两个人，那家就搬了出去。以后常常的闹鬼，所以闲空了一年。前月春阳馆的黄掌柜的来，看","en":"They talked a while before Monk Tang said: \\"By now you must be off your dietary restrictions. This dining house of mine serves a few excellent dishes; come try something new today.\\" Xi Eleven asked: \\"Who opened this place? How long has it been running?\\" Monk Tang replied: \\"The building"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":2,"tokens":["唐和尚"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"中一动，底下那脑袋就像要伸出来，这条筋偏又拳缩伸不直，好不难受，因此不敢动心。他也不怕人笑他，就将这个苦楚说给唐和尚听，听得唐和尚大笑不止，说道：「你拚得再病一个月，我替你治好他。」奚十一道：「怎样治？」和尚笑道：「我将些烂药把那条筋烂掉了，省得他要痛，岂不好么？」奚十一道：「不好，适或一齐烂完了，怎样呢，难道还长得出来？我们广东倒有个接树法子，用海狗肾接他，不知","en":"agonizing pain, so he dared not let his thoughts wander. Unafraid of being mocked, he recounted his misery to Monk Tang. Tang laughed uncontrollably and said: \\"If you are willing to risk another month in bed, I can have it cured for you.\\" Xi Eleven asked: \\"How?\\" The monk laughed: \\"I will use some caustic powder to rot that tendon away, sparing you the pain. Would that"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":2,"tokens":["唐和尚"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"唐和尚拍手笑道：「巧极，巧极！怎么没有？方才一个杨八爷，叫梅窗，一个张师爷，叫笑梅，是魏大爷的相好，常到这里来，我也与他相好。他们二人在间壁吃饭，我送烟过去，与他们讲了半天。那张笑梅有个亲戚是苏州人，专门行这一道，替人配眼珠子，配鼻子，配牙，这却都是假的。","en":"Monk Tang clapped his hands and laughed: \\"Perfect, perfect! Of course there is! Just now a Master Yang the Eighth, named Meichuang, and a Master Zhang, named Xiaomei—an intimate of Master Wei—were eating next door. I often see them here, and we are well acquainted."},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":1,"tokens":["唐和尚"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"唐和尚已经访明了住处，就叫人去请那阳善修。","en":"Tang had already learned his lodgings and sent someone to invite Yang Shanxiu."},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":2,"tokens":["唐和尚"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"那阳善修住得不远，不多一刻来了。唐和尚出来，照应他先在外间坐下。奚十一从里面看他，面貌颇不适观，衣裳蓝缕，有几分瞧不起他，也不出来，叫唐和尚与他说话。和尚将奚十一的毛病讲了。阳善修道：「讲接法也不同，先看各人的本源，再看各人的行货。譬如那老年人筋力衰的，是不能接的，就接了也是白接。若是本","en":"Yang Shanxiu lived nearby and arrived in short order. Monk Tang went out and saw to seating him in the outer room first. From inside, Xi Eleven observed him: his face was rather unseemly, his clothes ragged, and Xi Eleven felt a touch of disdain, remaining inside and letting Tang speak with him. The monk explained"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":5,"tokens":["唐和尚"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"唐和尚同了他进去，奚十一勉强把腰松了一松，就坐下了。阳善修见奚十一才三十来岁，身材长大，像个本源未亏的人。但看他那威风凛凛的样子，不敢来问他，局局促促的站着。奚十一把手一招，叫他坐了。方才讲的话，奚十一早已听见，便道：「我这个病就有一样作怪，内中像有条筋扳","en":"Monk Tang brought him inside. Xi Eleven loosened his sash slightly and sat down. Seeing Xi Eleven was only in his thirties, tall and robust, Yang judged him a man whose fundamental vigor was intact. Yet, intimidated by his commanding, fierce demeanor, Yang dared"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":1,"tokens":["唐和尚"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"奚十一满心欢喜，便等不及唐和尚请他吃饭，即辞了回去，与菊花说知，菊花更加欢喜，便找了丁香油出来，绝早就吃饭，过了瘾，催奚十一睡了，将药调得浓浓的，敷满了他，将带子捆上。奚十一觉得那物先凉后热，一会儿火烧起来，胀得甚疼，便叫菊花把带子收紧，收紧了觉好些，一连收了三次，方才止痛。奚十","en":"Overjoyed, Xi Eleven could not even wait for Monk Tang's meal; he took his leave, went home, and told Juhua. She was even more delighted, fetching the clove oil at once. They ate supper very early, smoked their opium, and Juhua hurried Xi Eleven to bed. Mixing a thick paste of the medicine, she coated him"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":2,"tokens":["唐和尚"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"吃了早饭，唐和尚同了那人前来，奚十一到书房里陪他们坐了，阳善修问了昨夜的光景。菊花走将出来，从板壁缝里望那个医生，生得颇不顺眼，一个黄肿脸儿，约三十来岁年纪，有几根微须，身材短小，穿一件油晃晃的旧绸袄子，两只袖子破烂不堪。又见唐和尚的头剃得紫光油滑，穿件青绸夹袄，拿","en":"After breakfast, Monk Tang arrived with the doctor. Xi Eleven sat with them in the study, and Yang Shanxiu asked how the night had gone. Juhua crept out and peered through the cracks in the wooden partition. The doctor looked utterly unpresentable—a sallow, puffy face, about thirty"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":1,"tokens":["唐和尚"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"十一一口烟含在嘴里，答不出话来。菊花在外听了，当是奚十一只要四寸，便着了急，失口说了一声道：「极短也要五寸。」唐和尚忍不住笑了一声。奚十一听得出口声，便咳嗽了一声。菊花自知失言，便跑了进去。阳善修听得有人说要五寸，抬头一看，见门口有两个孩子站着，便当是他们讲的，也笑了一笑。春兰脸倒红了一红，英官鼻子里哼了一声。","en":"grew anxious that he would settle for four inches and blurted out: \\"It must be five inches at the very least!\\" Monk Tang could not help but chuckle. Hearing her voice, Xi Eleven coughed loudly. Knowing she had misspoken, Juhua fled back inside. Hearing someone demand five inches, Yang Shanxiu looked up and, seeing the two servant boys at the door, assumed they had spoken"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":1,"tokens":["唐和尚"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"嵌了四条。菊花看了，在那里发抖，抖得牙齿对碰，扑在板壁上，那板壁也刷刺刺的响。春兰、英官吐出了舌头，缩不进去。唐和尚不忍看，躺着吹烟。那人又掏出一个锡盒子，取出一片鲜红带血的肉来，中间还剜了一个眼。又见他把那把小刀在龟头上戳了几刀，又冒出血来，将那片肉贴上，再用药敷好。通身又上了药，扎了两三根药线，把个象牙片子在头上按了几按，砑得光光的，才把绸套子套了。解开了蒙眼","en":"Chunlan and Yingguan stuck out their tongues in shock and could not pull them back. Unable to bear the sight, Monk Tang lay down and smoked. The man then took out a tin box and extracted a piece of bright red, bloodied meat, pierced through the middle with a hole. He scored the glans with his scalpel several times, drawing more blood, then applied the piece of meat and"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":3,"tokens":["唐和尚"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"唐和尚问道：「怎样？」奚十一道：「倒也不觉怎样，就是下身麻木，此时两腿一动也难动。」阳善修把他腿掇了下来，扶他睡下，说道：「每日吃煎药一服，我留下方子，你们自去抓罢。敷药我每天午正时来替你上，七日内包好。好之后切不可就使唤他，总要两三月之后，方可办事，不然","en":"Monk Tang asked: \\"How is it?\\" Xi Eleven replied: \\"I don't feel much of anything, just numbness below; it's hard to even move my legs right now.\\" Yang Shanxiu lifted his legs down, helped him lie flat, and said: \\"Drink one dose of decoction every day. I will leave"}],"50":[{"paragraph":6,"mentions":1,"tokens":["唐和尚"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"：「庸庵要到蕊香那里去，却遇见玉艳，想同到新开的庄子里去坐坐。见你的车在门口，所以进来。」文泽道：「莫非就是那唐和尚开的安吉堂么？闻得那地方倒好，他又将寺里的几间房子也通了过去，我们就去。」春喜道：「怪热的天，在这里不好吗？」桂保道：「那里也好，内中有几间屋子，摆满了花卉，大天篷凉爽得很。倒是那里好。」即催了春喜，换了衣裳，都上车，到了安吉堂对门车厂里，卸了车。文","en":"carriage parked outside, we decided to come in here first.\\" Wenze guessed, \\"Could it be the 'Anji Hall' opened by Monk Tang? I've heard excellent things about that place; they say he's even connected a few rooms from the temple to it. Let's all go there!\\" Chunxi objected, \\"On such a sweltering day? Isn't it fine right here?\\" Guibao chimed in, \\"It's lovely there too. Inside,"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":4,"tokens":["唐和尚"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"着鹅毛扇子。见了众人，满面堆下笑来，抢步上前，和着双手，半揖半叩的见文泽等三人，又与桂保等三人拉了拉手，原来是唐和尚。文泽让他坐了，唐和尚鞠躬如也，坐在炕沿上。走堂的倒了一钟茶给他，唐和尚道：「这茶不好，你另沏壶雨前，放些珠兰在里面。少爷们在此，好好的伺候。」走堂的笑嘻嘻的答应了。唐和尚道：「今日少爷们这么高兴，到小庄来。」王恂道：「我们来过多回了。」和尚笑道：「","en":"ankles, and cool mesh shoes of black thread, while casually waving a goose-feather fan. It was none other than Monk Tang. Seeing the gathered company, his face instantly broke into an obsequious, beaming smile. He hurried forward, clasping his hands, bowing and half-kowtowing to Wenze and the other two gentlemen, then shook hands warmly with Guibao and the other actors."},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":1,"tokens":["唐和尚"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"文泽道：「那倒不消，我们闻了那气味就要醉的。」唐和尚道：「如今田老爷是贵人了，他搬出后，我也没有见着他。好容易一年之内，中举、中进士、中状元，这是天上文曲星，人间岂常有的？不是我说，也幸遇见了那位苏相公，倒被他管好了。未见那苏相公以前，田老爷又不是如今的魏大爷一样？天天锁着房门，在戏园子里过日子。那位","en":"joked, \\"That won't be necessary; we only need to catch a whiff of the atmosphere in there and we'd be intoxicated.\\" Monk Tang chuckled, \\"Now that Master Tian has become a nobleman, I haven't even caught a glimpse of him since he moved out. To pass the provincial, metropolitan, and palace examinations—and take first place as the Zhuangyuan—all within a single year! He is the"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":5,"tokens":["唐和尚"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"唐和尚道：「我听得说，这位苏相公如今也出了班子，田老太太认他为义子，宅里都称他为二老爷，是真的么？」文泽道：「没有的话。苏相公也没有住在那里，他们下人称呼他为苏大爷是真的。」唐和尚道：「这苏相公本来好，斯斯文文，和和气气，见了我们也是待得一样，必恭必敬，不","en":"Monk Tang continued, \\"I've heard rumors that this Master Su has also left his troupe. They say Old Madam Tian has recognized him as her adopted son, and everyone in the household now addresses him as 'Second Master'. Is it true?\\" Wenze dismissed it, \\"Nonsense."},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":1,"tokens":["唐和尚"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"股，你们说这个自行伤可笑不可笑？」于是大家大笑，道：「那潘三本不是个东西。」文泽道：「我知道你与奚十一相好。」唐和尚道：「这奚大老爷闹得很，今年生了毒疮，几乎性命不保，还是我医好他的。如今他也要到班了，七月内有缺就是他的。我想人生聚散是一定的。去年有位富三老爷，是魏大爷相好，魏大爷托我照应，才选了湖北。有个贵大爷，是富三爷的相好，他们是朝夕不离的，也得了湖北的同知","en":"\\"That Pan the Third was never any good to begin with.\\" Wenze said, \\"I know you are close friends with Xi Eleven.\\" Monk Tang nodded solemnly, \\"That Elder Master Xi has had a terrible time of it. This year he broke out in poisonous sores and very nearly lost his life! It was I who finally cured him. Now, his time for appointment is approaching; if there's a vacancy in the seventh"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":4,"tokens":["唐和尚"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"那三个相公看着唐和尚胁肩谄笑，好不难看。仲清道：「连日未见瑶卿。」琪官道：「瑶卿近日从着吉甫学琴呢，竟是足不出户。吉甫也真好静，他当日教过梅卿弹琴，自梅卿死后，他的《梅花三弄》是再不弹的了。你说这也算深于情了。」仲清道：「吉甫的人本沈静高雅，于这些文玩无上无不精通。」大","en":"The three actors, however, watched Monk Tang hunching his shoulders in his obsequious, fawning smile and found the sight utterly repulsive. Zhongqing said, \\"I haven't seen Yaoqing for days.\\" Qiguan replied, \\"Yaoqing has been studying the guqin with Jifu recently; he practically never steps out"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":2,"tokens":["唐和尚"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"赴考去了，只好认了晦气。到出京那几日，一起一起的饯行，潘其观、奚十一、张仲雨、冯子佩、杨梅窗、张笑梅、顾月卿、唐和尚等轮流作饯，唐和尚的庄子好不热闹，聘才又辞了几天行。","en":"one after another. Pan Qiguan, Xi Eleven, Zhang Zhongyu, Feng Zipei, Yang Meichuang, Zhang Xiaomei, Gu Yueqing, Monk Tang, and others took turns hosting him. Tang's establishment was exceptionally lively, and Pincai ended up postponing his departure for several more days."},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":1,"tokens":["唐和尚"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"聘才出京之日，唐和尚直送到十里长亭，洒泪而别。聘才回家接了父母，同往湖北，后来书中就没有他的事了。要叙李元茂、孙嗣徽在通州小考，闹了一个小小的笑话，且俟下回分解。","en":"On the day Wei Pincai finally departed the capital, Monk Tang escorted him all the way to the ten-li farewell pavilion, shedding genuine tears as they parted. Pincai returned to his hometown, collected his parents, and they all journeyed together to Hubei. From this point on, the book has no further business with"}],"58":[{"paragraph":4,"mentions":2,"tokens":["唐和尚"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"根株疲软，只好停顿多而纵送少。菊花才二十几岁，火盆似的，如何能常吃那粗粝东西？一日，奚十一带了胡八出门去了，与唐和尚商量。一轮晴日，满照明窗，菊花梳了头，好不纳闷。无意之间到外边来散步，走到跟班房门口，见关着门，里面有笑声。菊花轻轻的在门缝里一张，见春兰弯着腰在炕边，看有四只脚站在一处。菊花一见，即把袖子掩了口，听巴英官说道：「你倒会长，怎么他不会长，总是这样的？","en":"she constantly endure that coarse implement? One day Xi Eleven took Hu Eight out on business and went to consult Monk Tang. Under a clear sun filling the bright windows Juhua dressed her hair, thoroughly bored. Idly she strolled outside and came to the attendants' quarters. The door was shut, but laughter came from within. Juhua peeped through the crack. Chunlan was bent"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":3,"tokens":["唐和尚"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一日，唐和尚送行，约了潘三来，潘三打发人来说：「跌坏了鼻子，要避风，不能来。」奚十一、唐和尚都疑潘三怪了，是托辞的。那日奚十一见了得月，想与他叙叙，无奈唐和尚在前，只得忍住，酒也多喝了几杯，烟又多吹了几口，到二更后才回，醉醺醺的。底下那东西甚是作怪，时刻直竖起来","en":"One day Monk Tang came to see him off and had invited Pan the Third. Pan sent word that he had broken his nose and must avoid the wind, so he could not come. Xi and Monk Tang suspected Pan was sulking and making excuses. That day Xi saw Deyue and wished to renew acquaintance,"},{"paragraph":30,"mentions":1,"tokens":["唐和尚"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"奚十一病好之后，带了菊花赴任，潘三打发伙计同去讨账。唐和尚倒十分惆怅，又请了几天，临行与得月送出城外，倒算个全始全终的交情了。潘三因脸上有病，不好见风，这月内总不出门。","en":"After Xi Eleven recovered, he took Juhua to his post. Pan the Third sent clerks along to collect the debt. Monk Tang was quite melancholy and kept him several extra days. On leaving, he and Deyue escorted Xi beyond the city, cementing a friendship complete in courtesy. Pan the Third, due to facial trouble, avoided the wind and did not go out that month."},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":1,"tokens":["唐和尚"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"叙起他们一件闲事来。今年六月初六，唐和尚生日，请潘三、奚十一在庙里吃面，又备了两桌送与白菊花、石氏。石氏处是打发得月送去。这石氏见了得月那个模样，中心甚是爱他，给了他许多东西，便要他做干儿子。得月岂有不肯，便拜了干娘，以后常常叫他来走动。得月若来，必陪着石氏吃饭，或时抹牌顽耍。又知道潘三爱","en":"To relate one of their affairs, on the sixth day of the sixth month, which was Monk Tang's birthday, he invited Pan the Third and Xi Eleven to the temple for noodles, and sent two tables to Bai Juhua and to Lady Shi. Lady Shi's table went by Deyue. Lady Shi took one look at Deyue and loved him, gave him many gifts, and asked him to be her"}]}`),"char-79":{3:[{paragraph:13,mentions:1,tokens:["青姨奶奶"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"我，我本要来的，实在腾不出这个空儿。天也迟了，一进城就出不得城。在你书房里住，原很好，三奶奶也很疼我，就听不得青姨奶奶骂小子，打丫头，摔这样，砸那样，再和白姨奶奶打起架来，教你两边张罗不开。明儿早上，好晒我在书房里，你躲着不出来了。」",en:'leave. Residing in your study is a joy, and the Third Mistress dotes upon me. Yet, I cannot bear the clamor of Concubine Qing scolding the boys, beating the maids, and shattering porcelain, only to brawl with Concubine Bai. You are left caught in the middle, utterly helpless. And come morning, I am left stranded in the study while you hide away, refusing to show your face!"'}],5:[{paragraph:36,mentions:1,tokens:["青姨奶奶"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"「前日戏园里，蓉官说他青姨奶奶、白姨奶奶打架起来，摔这样，砸那样，我当是顽话。今日看来是真的了。」回去尚早，出了城，打发了车，又从戏园门口，各处逛了一逛而回。",en:'"The other day at the theater, Rongguan mentioned that Concubine Qing and Concubine Bai had come to blows, throwing this, smashing that. I took it for a joke. Today it turns out to be quite true." The hour was still early to return home; he left the city, dismissed the carriage, strolled past the theater gates and various'}]},"char-80":{3:[{paragraph:13,mentions:1,tokens:["白姨奶奶"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"，一进城就出不得城。在你书房里住，原很好，三奶奶也很疼我，就听不得青姨奶奶骂小子，打丫头，摔这样，砸那样，再和白姨奶奶打起架来，教你两边张罗不开。明儿早上，好晒我在书房里，你躲着不出来了。」",en:'the clamor of Concubine Qing scolding the boys, beating the maids, and shattering porcelain, only to brawl with Concubine Bai. You are left caught in the middle, utterly helpless. And come morning, I am left stranded in the study while you hide away, refusing to show your face!"'}],5:[{paragraph:36,mentions:1,tokens:["白姨奶奶"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"「前日戏园里，蓉官说他青姨奶奶、白姨奶奶打架起来，摔这样，砸那样，我当是顽话。今日看来是真的了。」回去尚早，出了城，打发了车，又从戏园门口，各处逛了一逛而回。",en:'"The other day at the theater, Rongguan mentioned that Concubine Qing and Concubine Bai had come to blows, throwing this, smashing that. I took it for a joke. Today it turns out to be quite true." The hour was still early to return home; he left the city, dismissed the carriage, strolled past the theater gates and various other places,'}]},"char-81":{39:[{paragraph:10,mentions:2,tokens:["阿呆"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"客，老鸨问他道：「姑娘，你猜今日三个客是何等样人？」瞎妓道：「头一个是秀才，第二个是刑名师爷，第三个是近视眼的阿呆。」老鸨道：「你何以分得出来呢？」瞎妓道：「头一个上来，斯斯文文把我两边的股分开去，又合拢来，既作我的正面，又作我的反面。又听他说道：此处放轻，此处着重。一深一浅，是个作八股的法子。所以我知道他是秀才。第二个上来，弄了一回，把我细细的看。听他说道：左",en:'were?" The blind girl said, "The first was a scholar, the second was a criminal-law secretary, and the third was a nearsighted simpleton." The procuress said, "How could you tell them apart?" The blind girl said, "The first came up very properly and carefully parted my two legs, then brought them together again, made me face one way and then the other, and I heard him murmur: softer here,'}]},"char-85":{4:[{paragraph:25,mentions:1,tokens:["王大夫"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"王恂看是孙嗣徽，两车相对，王恂问道：「你往那里去？」嗣徽道：「只因家父夫妻反目，噬肤灭鼻，几几乎血流漂杵。有一王大夫，以人治人，有以去其旧染之污，睨而视之，曰无伤也。今病小愈，不能不绥之斯来耳。」王恂笑了一笑道：「我回来就来的。」嗣徽应了，匆匆而去。仲清道：「此君无所不用其文，真荒唐可笑。这「虫蛀千字文」，真生可为名，死可为谥，世间想无第二人似他的了。」王恂笑道：",en:`father and his wife have been at cross purposes—consuming and obliterating, with blood nearly flowing in rivers—a physician surnamed Wang has been treating man with man's own means to eradicate the old taint; looking askance at the situation, he says there is no injury. Now that the illness is somewhat better, one cannot but soothe and bring them around." Wang Xun smiled and said, "I will`}],56:[{paragraph:12,mentions:1,tokens:["王大夫"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"还不敢放在厨房里，恐伙计们嘴馋，来撕了几块去，倒请了这只狗了。」琴仙道：「你为何去了这半天才回？」刘喜道：「那王大夫今日到仪征县去了，要耽搁三四天才回。我只得去请了李大夫，也是个名医，住的远，来回有二十里路呢。」又问道：「老爷此刻怎样？」琴仙道：「还是这样。」刘喜道：「如果老爷有些长短便怎样呢？」琴仙又哭道：「如果有什么不好，我也是死。」刘喜叹了一声，到道翁房里来",en:'cur!" Changing the subject, Qinxian asked: "Why were you gone for so incredibly long?" Liu Xi explained tiredly: "Doctor Wang traveled to Yizheng today and will not return for three or four days. I had no choice but to track down Doctor Li. He is also famous, but lives very far away—a full twenty li there and back." He then asked how Daoweng was faring. Qinxian shook his head'}]},"char-86":JSON.parse(`{"1":[{"paragraph":4,"mentions":2,"tokens":["颜夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"为司马君实、赵清献一流人物。夫人颜氏，也是金陵大家，为左都御史颜尧臣之女，翰林院编修颜庄之妹，父兄皆已物故。这颜夫人今年四十四岁，真是德容兼备，贤淑无双，与梅学士唱随已二十余年。二十九岁上梦神人授玉，遂生了一个玉郎，取名子玉，号庾香。这梅子玉今年已十七岁了，生得貌如良玉，质比精金，宝贵如明珠在胎，光彩如华月升岫。而且天授神奇，胸罗斗宿，虽只十年诵读，已是万卷贯通。","en":"commands the stern awe of autumn. Contemporaries liken him to the great figures Sima Guang and Zhao Bian. His wife, Lady Yan, also hails from a prominent Jinling family; she is the daughter of Yan Yaochen, Left Censor-in-Chief, and the younger sister of Yan Zhuang, a Hanlin Compiler, though both her father and brother have since passed away. Lady Yan, now forty-four, embodies"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":1,"tokens":["颜夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"先生有事放学，子玉正在独坐，却有两个好友来看他。一个姓颜名仲清，号剑潭，现年二十三岁，即系已故编修颜庄之子，为颜夫人之侄。","en":"styled Jiantan; currently twenty-three years of age, he was the son of the late Compiler Yan Zhuang, making him Lady Yan's nephew."},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":1,"tokens":["颜夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"请旌表烈。仲清在士燮处，到十九岁上中了个副车。是年士燮与其作伐，赘于同乡同年现任通政司王文辉家为婿。这王文辉是颜夫人的表兄，与仲清亲上加亲，翁婿甚为相得。那一位姓史名南湘，号竹君，是湖广汉阳人，现年二十四岁，已中了本省解元。父亲史曾望现为吏科给事中。这两人同是才高八斗，学富五车，但两人的情性却又各不相同。仲清是孤高自洁，坦白为怀。将他的学问与子玉比较起来，子玉是纯","en":"of the Transmission Office, who shared both a hometown and examination cohort with Shixie. As Wang Wenhui was Lady Yan's cousin, this union layered family ties upon family ties, and father-in-law and son-in-law found great harmony together. The other visitor was surnamed Shi, named Nanxiang, and styled Zhujun. Hailing from Hanyang in Huguang, he was twenty-four years"},{"paragraph":41,"mentions":1,"tokens":["颜夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"的戏，与见过的小旦一毫不对，犹以南湘为妄言，借此以自消遣的，便也不放在心上了。李先生回来，仍在书房念了一会书，颜夫人然后叫了进去。","en":"so he put the matter out of his mind. Teacher Li returned; Ziyu studied in the study for a while longer before Lady Yan called him inside."},{"paragraph":43,"mentions":1,"tokens":["颜夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"禀过萱堂，颜夫人见今日天气寒冷，起了朔风，且是冬月中旬，便叫家人媳妇取出副葡萄的猞猁裘与他穿了，吩咐车里也换了白狐暖围。两个小使：一个云儿，一个俊儿，骑了马，先到他表母舅王通政宅内，适值通政出门去了，通政的少君出来接进。这王通政的少君，名字单叫个恂字，号庸庵，年方二","en":"Having informed his mother, Lady Yan noticed that the weather was freezing that day, with a sharp north wind blowing, and it being mid-winter, she had a servant woman bring out a grape-patterned lynx fur coat for him to wear. She also ordered the carriage interior changed to a warm white"}],"2":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":2,"tokens":["颜夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"苏列侯奉命山右。其余学差者有二人，司道出京者三人，余下不过此眼前数人，大约还不满四席了。」王文辉又到里头去见了颜夫人，彼此道了些家常闲话，即提起他次女琼华十六岁了，尚未字人，托士燮留心物色。士燮答应，随又说道：「择女婿也是一件难事，尽有外貌甚好，内里平常。也有小时聪明，大来变坏的。」颜夫人接口说道：「这总是各人的姻缘。非但拣女婿难，就是要替你外甥定一头亲事也是不容","en":"few of us present, hardly enough to occupy four tables.\\" Wang Wenhui then went into the inner chambers to greet Lady Yan. After exchanging familial pleasantries, he mentioned that his second daughter, Qionghua, was now sixteen and yet to be betrothed, entrusting Shixie to seek out a suitable match. Shixie agreed, yet added a caveat, \\"Choosing a son-in-law is a daunting"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":1,"tokens":["颜夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"次日聘才、元茂到上屋去拜见了颜夫人，又将南边带来的土仪与他父亲的书信一并呈上，书中无非恳切求照应的话。另有致王文辉一信，士燮叫他迟日亲自送去。这聘才本是个聪明人，又经乃父陶镕，这一张嘴，真个千伶百俐，善于哄骗，所以在梅宅不到十天，满宅的人都说他好。子玉虽与其两道，然觉此人也无可厌处，","en":"The following day, Pincai and Yuanmao visited the main residence to pay their respects to Lady Yan. They presented regional gifts brought from the south, alongside letters from their fathers, each brimming with earnest pleas for continued patronage and care. Among the missives was a letter addressed to Wang Wenhui, Shixie instructed Pincai to deliver"}],"3":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["颜夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"问：「大爷用过饭没有？」聘才道：「才从外头送信回来的。」许顺道，「既没用饭，何不就请在账房吃罢。」这许顺夫妇是颜夫人赔房过来的，一切银钱账目皆其经手。聘才进了账房，许顺要让聘才先吃，聘才不肯，拉他同坐了。","en":"offered, \\"If you have yet to eat, why not join us here in the accounts room?\\" This Xu Shun and his wife were part of Lady Yan's dowry household, entrusted with managing all the family's financial affairs. Pincai stepped inside, where Xu Shun graciously urged him to eat first. Pincai politely declined, drawing Xu Shun to sit and share the meal together."}],"5":[{"paragraph":39,"mentions":1,"tokens":["颜夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"对红烛、四盏素玻璃灯，元茂上前叩了头。聘才也来辞岁，性全连忙还礼，即同了他们到老师、师母跟前辞岁，士燮挡住了。颜夫人即吩咐子玉出去叩贺先生，梅学士即领了子玉，来到书房，彼此贺毕，便摆上酒肴。","en":"Year's respects to their Teacher and Teacher's Wife. Scholar Mei stopped them from the full formality of bowing. Lady Yan immediately instructed Ziyu to go out and offer New Year's greetings to the Teacher. Scholar Mei then personally escorted Ziyu to the study; they exchanged congratulations, and wine and food were set out."}],"6":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["颜夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"到了初五日，颜夫人也要请客，请了他表嫂王文辉的陆氏夫人，并他家孙氏少奶奶，与两位表侄女，又请了孙亮功的陆氏夫人，与其大姑娘，并两位少奶奶，就是孙大姑娘辞了不来。","en":"On the fifth day, Lady Yan likewise prepared to host a gathering. She extended invitations to her cousin-in-law, Wang Wenhui's wife, Madam Lu, along with that household's young mistress née Sun and his two cousin-nieces. She also invited the wife of Sun Lianggong, Madam Lu, together"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":8,"tokens":["颜夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"颜夫人领着一群仆妇丫鬟迎将出来，引进了内堂。这颜夫人虽四十外的人，尚觉丰采如仙，其面貌与子玉彷佛。颜夫人见琼华小姐更觉生得好了，清如浣雪，秀若餐霞，疑不食人间烟火食者。而蓉华小姐朗润清华，外妍内秀。那个孙氏少奶奶佩秋，媚妍婉妙，和顺如春。两夫人见过了礼，然","en":"Lady Yan, leading a retinue of female servants and maids, emerged to welcome them and guided them into the inner hall. Though past forty, Lady Yan possessed an almost immortal grace, her features closely resembling those of Ziyu. She found Miss Qionghua increasingly"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":5,"tokens":["颜夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"至亲，那里还有这些客话。倒是我的孩子配不上外甥是真的。姑太太想必不肯作主，还要让姑老爷得知，姑老爷心里怎样？」颜夫人道：「我们老爷也久有此心，在家也常说起来。去年表兄来托我们做媒，我就要说出来，刚刚有件什么事情来，就打断了，没有能说，至今还耿耿在心的。」亮功的夫人冒冒失失道：「就这样罢，儿女之事，娘也可以作得主的，定要父亲吗？」颜夫人道：「若别家呢，我就不敢做主，","en":"be worthy of your nephew. Aunt must be deferring the decision to her lord husband—how does he feel about it?\\" Lady Yan said, \\"My husband has long held this in his heart, often speaking of it at home. Last year, when our cousin came to act as a matchmaker, I was on the verge of suggesting it, but an interruption prevented me. It has lingered in my mind ever since.\\" Lianggong's"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":2,"tokens":["颜夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"众佳人微笑。颜夫人着丫鬟来请坐席，众佳人方才出来。这席分了两桌：三位夫人一桌，五位佳人一桌。席间两位陆夫人好不会讲，这边那几位少奶奶，也各兴致勃勃。唯有琼华小姐，今日心神不安，坐在席间说也不说，心里恨他的姨母将颜夫人的钗子戴在他头上，便觉得这个头，就有千斤之重，抬不起","en":"The beauties smiled knowingly. Lady Yan dispatched a maid to invite them to the banquet, and the young women obliged. The gathering was divided into two tables: the three noble ladies at one, and the five young women at the other. The two Madam Lus proved exceptionally engaging conversationalists,"}],"15":[{"paragraph":3,"mentions":2,"tokens":["颜夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"进满面笑容的进来，说道：「恭喜少爷，老爷放了江西学差，报喜的现在门口。」子玉听了也觉喜欢，便同着梅进到里头报与颜夫人知道，颜夫人欣喜更不必说。李性全就同元茂、聘才到上头去道了喜。少顷，士燮回家，有些同僚亲友陆续而来，一连忙了几日。便接着李先生赴任日期，士燮又与先生饯行。到动身那一日，子玉同了元茂、聘才直送出城外三十五里，到宿店住下。性全嘱咐他一番，又教训了元茂几句","en":"the good news is at the gate now.\\" Ziyu felt pleased at this news; he went with Mei Jin inside to report it to Lady Yan, whose delight goes without saying. Li Xingquan, together with Yuanmao and Pincai, went upstairs to offer their congratulations. Before long, Shixie returned home; colleagues and relatives and friends came calling one after another, and they were kept"},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":1,"tokens":["颜夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"士燮也择于三月初十日动身，今日已是初五了。颜夫人与士燮说道：「新年上，孙家太太为媒，与王表嫂面订了二姑娘，将玉簪子为定。你如今又远行了，也须过个礼，不是这样就算的，别要教人怪起来。」士燮笑道：「你不说我竟想不起，这个是必要的，明日就请孙伯敬为媒就是了。」正说话间，孙亮功来拜，士燮出见，问了起程日子","en":"Shixie had also chosen the tenth of the third month for his own departure, and today was already the fifth. Lady Yan said to Shixie: \\"At the New Year, Madam Sun acted as matchmaker and a verbal agreement was reached with Cousin Wang's wife for the second daughter, with a jade hairpin as a token of betrothal. Now you are going far away again. We must perform some formal"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":1,"tokens":["颜夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"次日，颜夫人备了彩盒礼帖，请亮功来，送了过去。文辉处回礼丰盛，有颜仲清帮同亮功押了回来，士燮备酒相待。是日不请外客，就请聘才、元茂相陪。这李元茂今日福至心灵，说话竟清楚起来。性全出京时留下二百两银子与他，元茂买了几件衣裳，混身光亮。亮功眼力本是平常，今见了元茂团","en":"The next day, Lady Yan prepared decorative gift boxes with formal betrothal documents and asked Lianggong to convey them. The return gifts from the Wenhui household were lavish; Yan Zhongqing helped Lianggong bring them back, and Shixie hosted a wine reception. That day no"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":2,"tokens":["颜夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉来，教训了一番。又叮嘱了元茂、聘才几句。然后与夫人别了，即上车起程，颜仲清、王恂、魏聘才、李元茂一起随后，颜夫人领着子玉，并有些仆妇丫鬟一群的车，也送出城来。城外是王文辉、孙亮功等十几个同年至好，一齐在旗亭饯别。士燮盘桓了一会，文辉等进城。天色不早，颜夫人也只得带了仆妇丫鬟洒泪先回。子玉、仲清、聘才、元茂与些家人们，随到店中住了一夜，明日叩别。","en":"admonition. He then also gave a few words of instruction to Yuanmao and Pincai. After that he bade farewell to Lady Yan, mounted his carriage, and departed. Yan Zhongqing, Wang Xun, Wei Pincai, and Li Yuanmao followed close behind. Lady Yan, leading Ziyu and a group of female servants and maids, also accompanied him in carriages out of the city. Outside the city gate,"}],"16":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["颜夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说前回书中梅士燮赴任之后，一切家事，内而颜夫人掌管，外而许顺经理，井井有条。子玉仍系读书，经籍之外研磨诸子百家。到花晨月夕，则有二三知己，明窗净几，共事笔砚。","en":"After Academician Mei Shixie departed for his post, Lady Yan assumed charge of the inner household while Xu Shun managed affairs without, leaving the estate in perfect order. Ziyu continued his studies, delving into the various philosophical schools alongside his classical texts. On fine mornings and moonlit evenings,"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":2,"tokens":["颜夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"比不上你了。你是知县少爷，享现成的福，我不但自己不能受用，还要顾家呢！」子玉听到这句，便知不能强留，只得进去与颜夫人说了。颜夫人道：「既然如此，只好听他自去罢。但老爷出门时，嘱咐我好生看待，且说他倒能办事。但此时也无甚多事，如果将来有事，再请他回来亦可。」","en":"must provide for my family.\\" Hearing this, Ziyu realized he could not insist and went to explain the matter to Lady Yan. She replied, \\"If that is the case, we have no choice but to let him go. Still, when your father left, he instructed me to treat him well, noting his capability. There is little for him to do here at present, but if the need arises in the future, we"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":1,"tokens":["颜夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"明早富三爷即遣人带了两辆车来接聘才，聘才即拜别颜夫人并子玉，又辞了元茂，收拾停妥，带了四儿一径上车。先到富宅略叙片时，富三亲送到华府。到了门口，富三先着人回进去，并说魏师爷来了。聘才在车内一望这门面，就觉威严得了不得，就是南京总督衙门，也无此高大。门前一座大照墙，用水磨砖砌成，上下镂花，并有花檐滴水，","en":"Early the next morning, Fu the Third sent two carriages to collect Pincai. After bidding farewell to Lady Yan, Ziyu, and Yuanmao, Pincai gathered his belongings, brought Si'er along, and boarded the carriage. They first stopped at the Fu residence for a brief visit before Fu the Third personally escorted him to the Hua mansion. At the gate, a messenger was sent"}],"18":[{"paragraph":7,"mentions":1,"tokens":["颜夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"路，走到鸣珂坊梅宅来，进去见子玉，卧病未愈，精神懒散。子玉问起聘才光景，聘才只得说好，随口撒了几句谎。又去见了颜夫人，道了谢，即出来找李元茂，只见锁了房门，遂复辞了子玉出门，冷冷清清，到何处去呢？","en":"was doing; Pincai could only speak positively, rattling off a few easy lies. He then went to pay his respects to Lady Yan and express his thanks. Coming out to find Li Yuanmao, he discovered his door locked. He took his leave of Ziyu again and went out, feeling lonely and desolate with nowhere to go."}],"20":[{"paragraph":6,"mentions":1,"tokens":["颜夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"花。此日是五月初一，正值王通政生日，虽不做寿，家中却也有些至交好友亲戚同年来贺，内里又有些太太姑娘们，如梅宅的颜夫人，孙宅的陆夫人之类，也觉得热闹。王恂与仲清这怡园之约，就不能去了。是日子云、次贤知道了，也去拜拜寿，适遇南湘、春航皆在，就约了回来。仲清、王恂说如客散得早，也来赴约。","en":"friends, relatives, and colleagues came to offer their congratulations, and indoors there were also ladies — such as Lady Yan from the Mei household and Madam Lu from the Sun household — so it was quite festive. Wang Xun and Zhongqing were thus unable to attend the Garden of Contentment appointment. On learning of this, Ziyun and Cixian also went to offer birthday congratulations;"}],"21":[{"paragraph":3,"mentions":2,"tokens":["颜夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"已到梅宅，进去见过颜夫人，即到子玉房中来。子玉已经病了月余，虽非沉痾，然觉意懒神疲，饮食大减，情兴索然。有时把些书本消遣，无奈精神一弱，百事不宜，独自一人不言不语，有咄咄书空气象。就是颜夫人，也猜不出儿子什么病来，只道其读书认真，心血有亏，便常把些参苓调理，无如药不对病，不","en":"Arriving at the Mei house he paid his respects to Lady Yan and went straight to Ziyu's chamber. Ziyu had now been ill over a month; though not gravely sick, he felt leaden and weary, ate far less than before, and his spirits flagged utterly. Sometimes he diverted himself with books, but his vitality was too"}],"22":[{"paragraph":19,"mentions":1,"tokens":["颜夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"续的檐溜滴了好一回。此时已不及再睡，即叫醒了云儿，天已大明，红日将出。净了脸，吃了茶，又用了些点心，走到上房，颜夫人尚未起来。子玉在外间叫丫鬟梳了发，又复出来，各处尚是静悄悄的。再到书房来，心上想道：「素兰如此多情，况已屡次扰他，他虽然不在这上头讲究，我却过意不去。若给他银钱又恐被他着恼，当是轻看了他，只好送他些个东西罢。」","en":"point of rising. He washed his face, drank his tea, took a few refreshments, and went to the upper rooms, where Lady Yan was not yet risen. Ziyu had a maid dress his hair in the outer room and came out again; everywhere all was still and quiet. Returning to his study, he thought: \\"Sulan has shown me such feeling, and I have put him to trouble again and again. He may set"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":3,"tokens":["颜夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"问时，只见云儿进来道：「徐老爷打发人来请，说客业已到齐了，就请少爷过去。」子玉也不及再问元茂，连忙便进上房，见颜夫人尚在梳头，子玉把出门的事告禀。颜夫人道：「你这几日身子好些，出去散散也好，只要早些回来，不要贪凉，坐在风口里。多叫几个人跟去，衣服也多包两件。」子玉禀道：「衣服包好了，也用不着多人，云儿一个就够了。」颜夫人道：「随你罢，须要早早回来，饮食也要小心。」","en":"the young master to come over now.\\" Ziyu, with no more time for Yuanmao, hurried in to the upper rooms, where Lady Yan was at her toilet, and announced his outing. Lady Yan said: \\"You have been better these last days, and an airing will do you good. Only come home early; don't go courting the cool or sitting in a draft. Take a few more people with you, and pack an extra"},{"paragraph":36,"mentions":1,"tokens":["颜夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉回来，已点了灯，颜夫人问起来，只得随口支吾了几句。不知后事如何，且听下回分解。","en":"Ziyu returned home; the lamps were already lit. Lady Yan asked where he had been; he could only give a vague answer to put her off. As for what happened next, listen to the following chapter to find out."}],"28":[{"paragraph":9,"mentions":7,"tokens":["颜夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"到了家中，见过颜夫人，便到书房躺下，自言自语，忽叹忽泣，如中酒一般。次日即大病起来，心神颠倒，语言无次，一日之内，哭泣数次。初时见有人尚能忍住，后来渐渐的忍不住。见了他萱堂，也自两泪交流，神昏色沮的的模样。颜夫人当他着了邪病，延医调治，甚至求签问卜，许愿祈神，一连十余日","en":"Upon returning home, he paid his respects to Lady Yan and then retired to his study. He lay down, muttering to himself, alternating between heavy sighs and sudden tears, as though intoxicated. By the following day, a severe illness had taken hold. His mind was in turmoil, his speech disjointed. Throughout"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":4,"tokens":["颜夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"团拜那一天，世叔看了琴言的戏回来，又听得他们说好，以后的事，小门生实是没有见闻，要问魏老聘才晓得他们的细底。」颜夫人便叫门上许顺，到华府请魏少爷过来有事相商。聘才却不晓得是这件事，近来与子玉颇觉疏远，竟有一个多月不来。今闻颜夫人相请，道是有些好事与他商量。隔了一日，便服御辉煌的出城，到了梅宅，见过了颜夫人。见颜夫人脸上似有忧闷的光景，聘才先问了江西的近况，可有家信","en":"the praises. After that, this student has witnessed nothing. You must ask Wei Pincai for the detailed truth.\\" Lady Yan immediately ordered the gatekeeper, Xu Shun, to go to the Hua mansion and invite Secretary Wei over, stating there was urgent business to discuss. Pincai had no inkling it concerned this matter. He had grown distant from Ziyu recently and hadn't visited"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":5,"tokens":["颜夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"讲了一回，颜夫人道：「子玉得了一个异样的病症。」便把病的光景说与聘才听，又将云儿、元茂的话也说了，便说：「小儿与这琴言到底有什么缘故？」聘才听了便觉得有些踌躇不安，良心发动，脸上露出愧色。停了一会，说道：「去年小侄进京，是搭了一班戏子的船，内中有个小旦叫琴言。今年团","en":"After exchanging pleasantries, Lady Yan cut to the chase. \\"Ziyu has contracted a strange illness,\\" she said, describing the symptoms and repeating the testimonies of Yun and Yuanmao. She pressed him, \\"What exactly is the bond between my son and this Qinyan?\\" Pincai felt a sudden wave of unease;"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":1,"tokens":["颜夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"颜夫人问道：「怎么就要二百银子一个月？这个人想来是个活宝了。既然这么要钱，你兄弟是没有钱的，怎么又认识他呢？」","en":"Lady Yan asked, \\"Why two hundred taels a month? Is this person considered some sort of living treasure? And since they demand so much money, and your brother has none, how did he even come to know him?\\""},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":1,"tokens":["颜夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"要钱，他师傅是非钱不行。小侄方才细想了，断无法子弄他来，必要和他师傅商量了，事方可行。他师傅又不肯讲白话的。」颜夫人道：「他师傅是怎样的？」聘才道：「难说话的很，在钱眼里过日子，要和他商量，除非多许他钱，尚不知他肯不肯。他怕得罪了那边，一年得不了这两千四百头就难了。我看这个东西要和他讲白话，是断断不能的。」","en":"hard, but there is no easy path. We must negotiate with the teacher, and the teacher will not accept empty talk.\\" Lady Yan pressed, \\"What kind of man is his teacher?\\" Pincai explained, \\"He is exceedingly difficult, a man who lives inside the eye of a coin. To negotiate with him, unless you promise a substantial sum, it is uncertain if he will agree. He fears offending the"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":1,"tokens":["颜夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"颜夫人听了这话，似乎要花些钱，便道：「只要把他叫得来，就给他钱也不要紧，但不知要用多少？」聘才道：「小侄再去见他讲讲看，总之小侄再没有不尽心的，先请伯母大人宽心。","en":"Hearing that money must be spent, Lady Yan said, \\"Just bring him here. I do not mind spending the money, but how much will it require?\\" Pincai replied, \\"This nephew will go and negotiate. I will spare no effort. Please set your mind at ease, Madame.\\""},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":1,"tokens":["颜夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「说着起身告辞，颜夫人又含泪道：「多费世兄的心，此刻我也不说什么了。既然如此，请你今日就去。如来得及，今日就赐一回信更好。」聘才答应了，即便告辞出来，看了看子玉。子玉见了聘才，虽在病中，却未忘前事，便合眼装睡，没有理他。","en":"With that, he rose to take his leave. Through her tears, Lady Yan said, \\"I am causing you much trouble, nephew. I will say no more for now. Since you are willing, please go today. If possible, a reply today would be best.\\" Pincai agreed. Before leaving, he looked in on Ziyu. Even in his severe illness, Ziyu had not"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":3,"tokens":["颜夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"聘才与元茂略谈几句，即便出来，一径回华府，到自己房中坐下，细细的想了一回，没有主意。即来找珊枝，把方才颜夫人托他话，都说与珊枝，又加上些话。又说我与这个兄弟是三代世交，且我这梅老伯母，止他一子，人极聪明，相貌生得也极齐整，你只当行好事，怎么成全成全他。倘能医好了这个病，我也感激你不尽。」珊枝道：「我有什么法子？只好禀明了公子，说你说的，叫他去看一看就是了。","en":"the Hua mansion, sat in his room, and pondered deeply, yet no plan came to mind. He sought out Shanzhi, repeated Lady Yan's desperate plea, added his own embellishments, and pleaded, \\"This brother and I are bound by three generations of friendship. Madame Mei has only this one son, a clever and handsome youth. Please, do this good deed and help cure him. I will owe you"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":4,"tokens":["颜夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"在车尾，不多一刻即到了梅宅。聘才也不候通报，同了琴言一直到了书房。许顺见了甚为诧异，却又不好拦阻，也跟了进来。颜夫人正在盼望，见许顺进来，似欲回什么话似的，颜夫人问：「有什么事？」许顺说：「魏大爷同了一个人，到像个唱戏的似的，小的不敢不回。」颜夫人道：「我知道，快请进来。」许顺去请，只见聘才同着一个十五六岁的孩子进来，不看也不觉得，细细一看，把颜夫人吃了一惊，倒像","en":"toward the study. The gatekeeper, Xu Shun, was startled but could not block their path, so he followed them in. Lady Yan was waiting anxiously. Seeing Xu Shun enter as if to make a report, she asked, \\"What is the matter?\\" Xu Shun replied, \\"Master Wei brought someone who looks like an actor. This lowly one dared not fail to report it.\\" Lady Yan said, \\"I know. Bring them"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":6,"tokens":["颜夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴言一进门时，原为子玉病重，出于情所难忍，故不顾吉凶祸福，也拼着颜夫人骂了几句。而且聘才在车上，一路上说了些利害话，心虚胆怯，只得战战兢兢上前，见夫人磕了一个头起来，低头傍立。颜夫人叫近前来，又打量了一回，即请聘才坐下。颜夫人道：「你是那里人？去年几时到京？怎么认识我们少爷？又怎么样相好？你实对我说，我不难为你。」琴言","en":"Driven by a love he could scarcely endure, he had ignored the risks of fortune and disaster, steeling himself for Lady Yan's harsh scolding. Pincai's threatening words in the carriage had left him timid and trembling. He approached, kowtowed deeply to the Lady, rose, and stood with his head bowed. Lady Yan called him closer, studied him intently once more, and bid Pincai"}],"29":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":3,"tokens":["颜夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"却说琴言到梅宅之时，心中十分害怕，满拟此番必有一场凌辱。及至见过颜夫人之后，不但不加呵叱，倒有怜恤之意，又命他去安慰子玉，却也意想不到。心中一喜一悲，但不知子玉是怎样光景，将何以慰之，只得遵了颜夫人的命，老着脸，走到子玉卧房来。见帘帏不卷，几案生尘，药鼎烟浓，香炉灰烬，一张小小的楠木床，垂下白轻绡帐。云儿先把帐子掀开，","en":"dread; he was entirely prepared to face a torrent of humiliation and abuse. Yet, to his astonishment, upon meeting Lady Yan, he was greeted not with scolding, but with a deep, compassionate pity. She gently ordered him to go and comfort Ziyu—a kindness he had never dared to anticipate. A surging tide of joy and sorrow overwhelmed him. Unsure of Ziyu's true condition or how"},{"paragraph":2,"mentions":2,"tokens":["颜夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"停了一停，说道：「独活、防己之下，应须添一味当归。」外面颜夫人听了，知是呓语，虽不能十分明白，也是一阵伤心，两泪交流，只管怔怔的瞅着聘才，聘才心上也觉凄楚，便说道：「玉侬你只管叫醒他。」琴言便叫了两声「少爷！」子玉嗤的一声笑道：「你好痴也！」又道：「云儿，你只管叫我作什么！这么近的路怕什么！你还当是大东门外么？","en":"duhuo and fangji there ought to be added one herb more — danggui, 'one who ought to return.'\\" Outside the door, Lady Yan heard his words and knew he was completely consumed by delirium. Though she could not parse the meaning of everything he said, a profound grief washed over her, and two streams of tears traced down her cheeks. She could only stare blankly at Pincai."},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":1,"tokens":["颜夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"颜夫人道：「他认不得人，这怎么好呢？」聘才也只得走到床前，叫了几声：「世兄，你心上的琴言特来看你，我扶起你来坐坐，你们说说话就好了。」聘才叫云儿拧块热手巾来，替他净了脸，擦了擦眼睛，扶他坐起，把床锦被迭了，在背后靠着。","en":"Lady Yan sighed, \\"He cannot even recognize anyone. What can we possibly do?\\" Hearing this, Pincai felt compelled to step up to the bedside. He called out several times, \\"Dear brother! The Qinyan you have been longing for has come especially to see you. Let me"},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":1,"tokens":["颜夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"颜夫人倒不肯进来，恐怕儿子心上愧惧，魏聘才也离得远远的。","en":"Lady Yan chose not to enter the room, fearing that her sudden presence might cause her son shame, while Wei Pincai respectfully kept his distance."},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":3,"tokens":["颜夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"颜夫人听了，对着聘才道：「此话说的奇怪。」又听琴言道：「我是为着你的病来的。」子玉笑道：「你真是玉侬，如何得来？就算你愿意来，人家如何肯放你来？」琴言道：「我真是玉侬，我已来了多时，是奉太太之命，叫我来看你；又亏魏师爷带我上来。我劝你自己宽心，不必忧郁，身","en":"Hearing this exchange, Lady Yan turned to Pincai and whispered, \\"Those words sound exceedingly strange.\\" She then heard Qinyan say softly, \\"I came because of your sickness.\\" Ziyu laughed dismissively. \\"If you truly were Yunong, how could you come here? Even if you were willing, would"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":1,"tokens":["颜夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"聘才见了忍不住的笑，那些丫鬟、仆妇也无人不笑。颜夫人点头叹息，见子玉两手扶着琴言的肩，要坐起来，先笑了一回。","en":"Pincai could not help but laugh along with him, and the maids and matrons in the room all joined in the mirth. Lady Yan nodded, a deep sigh escaping her lips. She watched as Ziyu, with both hands firmly grasping Qinyan's shoulders, tried to pull himself up, laughing the entire time."},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":1,"tokens":["颜夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"此时颜夫人见子玉只是欢笑不已，也便解去了多少愁闷。","en":"Seeing Ziyu laughing so freely and happily, much of the heavy gloom that had settled over Lady Yan's heart finally lifted."},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":1,"tokens":["颜夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"：「你见我几时撒谎来？」子玉点点头道：「真没有说过假话。」便自己定了定神，越想越乐，不禁大笑，欢声盈耳，外边的颜夫人也喜欢的笑起来，聘才更觉洋洋得意，低低的说道：「小侄看世兄今日竟会痊愈的了，这功劳全亏了琴言的师傅，虽然受了他那些刁难，倒还值得。」这边子玉已乐不可言，那里留神到外间？况且外间人又是私窥他的，病人精神有限，故而听不出来。子玉竟慢慢的跨下床来，琴言扶着","en":"greater joy bloomed within him, erupting into a resonant laughter that carried all the way to the outer room. Lady Yan smiled in response, and Pincai puffed up with pride, whispering, \\"Nephew sees that dear brother may heal completely today. The credit belongs to Qinyan's teacher. Though he vexed us endlessly, it was well worth it.\\" Ziyu paid no heed to the murmurs outside;"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":4,"tokens":["颜夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"便叫云儿道：「我觉饿了，有什么吃的，快拿些来。」颜夫人听了，即轻轻的走出，聘才等亦都跟了出来。颜夫人道：「怪事！怪事！直看不出他们什么意思来，这一对小人儿，却真也奇怪。今日实实亏了琴言，我倒要重重的赏他。」聘才嬉嬉笑道：「这也实在稀奇。伯母请看：世兄与琴言都是正大光明，一无苟且的。今日真亏了他，若不然，","en":"He then called out to Yun'er, \\"I feel hungry — bring me whatever there is to eat, and be quick.\\" Hearing this, Lady Yan quietly slipped out of the room, and Pincai quickly followed her. Lady Yan whispered in amazement, \\"Strange... truly strange. I simply cannot read those two little ones. But today, we truly owe everything to Qinyan. I will reward him heavily.\\" Pincai"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":4,"tokens":["颜夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴言答应，走了出来，即重到上房中堂内，颜夫人见了便笑吟吟的道：「今日真亏了你治好了少爷的病，但不教他再病才好。」琴言脸上一红，停了一停道：「少爷心地光明，没有看不透的事情，以后可保没有病了。」颜夫人又把琴言打量了一回，便道：「你今日去了，几时再来呢？」琴言道：「可以告假就来，请太太宽心。」颜夫","en":"Qinyan agreed and stepped out, making his way to the upper hall. Lady Yan smiled warmly at his approach and said, \\"Today we owe you a great debt; you have cured him completely. You must not let him fall sick again.\\" Qinyan flushed slightly, pausing before he spoke. \\"The Young Master is exceptionally bright; he sees through"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":4,"tokens":["颜夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"聘才见时候过久，便要同琴言回去，琴言也心内悬着，便叩辞颜夫人要去。颜夫人道：「你且略候一候，我还有话。」便自己进房，先着人叫了许顺进来，叫他秤了二百银子来，颜夫人道：「你交与魏少爷收了。」聘才叫交四儿拿了。又见一个仆妇拿着一包东西出来，付与琴言道：「这是太太赏你的，你收了再去谢赏。」聘才见是银镶小刀一把，大荷","en":"Pincai knew he must return with Qinyan. Qinyan, growing anxious about his long absence, quickly bid his farewells. Lady Yan raised a hand. \\"Wait. I have words for you.\\" She stepped into the inner room and called for Xu Shun, ordering him to weigh out two hundred taels of silver. \\"Give this to the young gentleman Wei,\\" she instructed. Pincai had Si'er take charge of the silver."},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":2,"tokens":["颜夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"备，而且反托聘才带琴言来，心中十分快意，自然更好得快了，不到十日便已精神复旧，惟见了母亲总有些惶恐不安的光景。颜夫人爱子之心十分体贴，又知儿子并无苟且之行，绝不提起琴言的事。那王文辉亲自来过几次，陆夫人也来过。一回在颜夫人面前，也不好说得，但有些话里讥讽，暗藏褒贬，似乎叫亲家以后留点神，不要放纵他的意思。又见子玉病已痊愈，看其相貌翩翩，实是佳婿，又像个真诚谨厚的人","en":"under ten days. Only when standing before his mother did a lingering shade of shame still color his features. But Lady Yan loved him with a fine, perceptive grace; knowing that he had committed no truly shameful deed, she never once spoke Qinyan's name aloud. Wang Wenhui came to visit several times, as did Lady Lu. Before Lady Yan could even speak plainly, Lady Lu would"}],"31":[{"paragraph":17,"mentions":1,"tokens":["颜夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"、高品。子玉已吃过了早饭，在书房等候。不多一会，史、颜诸人已到，南湘坐了，与子玉叙谈。仲清、王恂先进内室，见了颜夫人，略坐一坐即出来。喝了一杯茶，即催子玉同走。","en":"Nanxiang took a seat and chatted with Ziyu, while Zhongqing and Wang Xun proceeded into the inner chambers to greet Madam Yan, sitting for a brief moment before returning. After drinking a cup of tea, they urged Ziyu to depart with them."}],"33":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["颜夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"士、名旦送行，又叙了几日。光阴甚快，不觉又到腊月中旬。且说子玉因南湘、高品出京，又少了两个知己。前月王阁学来对颜夫人说，不是冬底，就是春初，要与子玉毕姻。","en":"Ziyu found himself missing two close confidants. Last month, Academician Wang of the Grand Secretariat visited Madam Yan, proposing that Ziyu should be married either by the end of winter or early spring."},{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["颜夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"颜夫人回说不好专主，须寄信到江西，俟其回信转来，再为定夺，子玉因此连王宅也不大去了。徐子云近日补了缺，衙门中添了些公事，不能天天在园。","en":"Madam Yan replied that she could not make the decision alone; she must send a letter to Jiangxi and wait for a reply before settling the matter. Because of this, Ziyu seldom visited the Wang residence. Recently, Xu Ziyun had filled a vacancy, which added public"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":6,"tokens":["颜夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"到上房见了颜夫人，颜夫人似有不悦之色，子玉也不敢问，呆呆的站在一边。颜夫人道：「你父亲有家书回来了，你作的事，他都知道，并且说我不能教训，你自去看罢。」便将家书递与子玉，子玉接了，来看时已唬得目定口呆。走到窗前，恭恭敬敬捧了，看了一遍，两颊通红，一言不发，只看着颜夫","en":"Upon reaching the main room, he saw Madam Yan, who appeared displeased. Ziyu dared not ask and stood dumbly to the side. Madam Yan said, \\"A letter from your father has arrived. He knows everything you've done and says I haven't disciplined you properly. See for yourself.\\" She handed the letter to"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":10,"tokens":["颜夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉听了，似有踌躇，欲说不说的光景。颜夫人又问了一声，子玉说道：「没有见着，而且得个信，说魏聘才不晓得闹了什么事，被人告了，前日已收在刑部监里。」颜夫人听了，吃惊不小，急问道：「这话是谁说的？为着什么事，你从何处打听来？」子玉随口说道：「是一个认识的人，就是魏世兄的亲戚张仲雨说的。他也讲得不","en":"Hearing this, Ziyu hesitated, appearing as if he wanted to speak but couldn't. When Madam Yan asked again, Ziyu said, \\"I didn't see him, but I received word that Wei Pincai has gotten into some trouble and was reported; the day before yesterday, he was detained in the Ministry of Punishments prison.\\" Startled, Madam Yan hurriedly asked, \\"Who"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":1,"tokens":["颜夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"出去了。这件事怎样去说，且刑部里绝无相好。你回去与太太请安，说我只好转托人，碰他的运气罢。」梅进回去照直说了，颜夫人也无法，只得听其自然。且说聘才在监里许了蓉官与玉天仙许多银子，叫他们跟着他的口供，说系那日吏目请他在蓉官寓处吃酒，叫了媳妇玉天仙。饮酒中间，要问聘才借银一千两，聘才不允，因此口角。","en":"and tell her I can only ask someone else to try his luck.\\" Mei Jin returned and reported exactly what was said. Madam Yan was at a loss and could only let things take their course. Meanwhile, in prison, Pincai promised Rongguan and Yutianxian a large sum of silver, instructing them to align their testimonies with his. He told them to claim that the official had invited"}],"35":[{"paragraph":8,"mentions":1,"tokens":["颜夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"到了明日，只说怡园请酒，禀明了颜夫人，即到王恂处，一同来到怡园。次贤那日要在红茶仙馆里面，一切都是他预备，不要子云费心，却说那红茶仙馆是去年新辟的，地方在梅崦之前，梨院海棠春圃之后，本是空地，只有一个亭子。亭外有两块英州灵石，一块有一丈二尺高，一块四尺余高。有一株大玉兰花，树身已有一抱","en":"When the next day arrived, Ziyu simply told Lady Yan he was invited for drinks at the Garden of Contentment. Having obtained her permission, he went to Wang Xun's place, and together they proceeded to the Garden of Contentment. That day, Cixian had arranged for everything to be hosted inside the Red Camellia"}],"39":[{"paragraph":3,"mentions":2,"tokens":["颜夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"到了前三日过礼，聘才只得去找元茂，免不得上去见了颜夫人，因有好几个月不去了，又为去年闹了事，甚是局促不安。颜夫人也不问其往事，淡淡问了几句话。聘才去见了子玉，子玉想起琴言前日的话，心上总有些怪他，也不似从前待他亲厚了。","en":"came the exchange of betrothal gifts, and Pincai had no choice but to go and find Yuanmao, which meant calling on Madam Yan as well. Having stayed away for several months and having caused that unpleasant scene the previous year, he was quite ill at ease. Madam Yan, for her part, asked nothing about past events and exchanged only a few bland words with him. When Pincai went"},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":1,"tokens":["颜夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"元茂的事是梅进代办，替他办了钗环簪镯、彩缎衣衫，并借了颜夫人的珠冠玉带、补服朝珠、蟒衣绣裙，共铺了十六盒，扎了亭子，也还像个局面。两个媒人押了去。孙家收了，回盒不过相称，也无甚珍异之物。","en":"affairs were handled by Mei Jin, who procured hairpins and bracelets, embroidered silks and gowns, and borrowed from Madam Yan a pearl crown, jade sash, official rank-badge robes with court beads, embroidered dragon skirt, and other finery, arranging everything in sixteen lacquered boxes and erecting a ceremonial bower to make a respectable display. The two matchmakers escorted"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":1,"tokens":["颜夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"到了吉期，自有梅宅家人料理，备了两桌酒，一席送颜夫人，一席待媒人，并请子玉、颜仲清作陪。仲清道：「元兄今夕真个到了群玉山头了。」王恂道：「一路荣华到白头。」子玉道：「犹道灯前相对影，愈揉双眼愈模糊。」此是近视眼洞房诗，今日可为元兄咏矣。」元茂道：「我说倒是近视眼好，就新人丑些，也看不清楚。」仲清道：「","en":"auspicious day the household of the Mei family saw to all the preparations, laying on two tables of wine, one for Madam Yan and one for the matchmakers, while inviting Ziyu and Yan Zhongqing to keep them company. Zhongqing said, \\"Brother Yuan, tonight you truly arrive at the summit of the Jade Mountain.\\" Wang Xun said, \\"A life of glory and splendor all the way to white-haired"}],"45":[{"paragraph":4,"mentions":1,"tokens":["颜夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"但因昨日人多，彼此未能畅谈衷曲。今日晚饭后，想趁着那一钩新月，去到怡园，也可畅叙一会，遂禀明了颜夫人、带了云儿，乘兴而来。进了怡园，却值子云未回，到了次贤处。子玉尚未进门，听得有人在那里高谈阔论。次贤见子玉来了，即忙出来，要请到里面。子玉问道：「何客？」次贤笑道：「不要紧，是个湖州王客人，贩些古董书画笔墨等货，来托消的。」","en":"take advantage of the crescent moon to visit the Garden of Contentment and talk freely for a while. He informed Lady Yan, brought Yun'er along, and set off on a whim. Upon entering the garden, he discovered that Ziyun had not yet returned, so he went directly to Cixian's quarters. Before Ziyu even stepped inside, he heard someone holding forth loudly within. When Cixian"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":1,"tokens":["颜夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"次日清晨，告禀颜夫人，要去看扶乩，并要问问自己前程。","en":"The next morning, he told Lady Yan that he was going to watch a spirit-planchette session and wished to inquire about his own prospects."},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":1,"tokens":["颜夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"颜夫人是从没有阻过他的。子玉到了辰刻，因是仙坛，衣冠而去。是日一早，屈道生同金吉甫先到，随后颜仲清、刘文泽、王恂一齐都来了，子玉到了，各人与吉甫相见，叙了些彼此仰慕的话。只有史南湘、田春航在场中未来。相公们到的是宝珠、蕙芳、素兰、玉林、漱芳、兰保、桂保、春","en":"Lady Yan never stood in his way. Ziyu arrived at the chen hour. Since it was an immortal altar, he went in full dress. Early that morning, Qu Daosheng and Jin Jifu had already arrived. They were followed by Yan Zhongqing, Liu Wenze, Wang Xun, and finally Ziyu."}],"49":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["颜夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说子玉送了琴仙回来，这一急一痛，便出了神，旧病复发，足足病了一月始愈。后来颜夫人已知琴仙出了京，道翁养为义子，倒也替他欢喜。","en":"mind drifted into a stupor; his old illness relapsed, and a full month passed before he recovered. Later, when Lady Yan learned that Qinxian had left the capital and had been taken by Qu Daoweng as an adopted son, she, too, felt a measure of relief and joy for him."}],"54":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":6,"tokens":["颜夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一日，梅学士的家书回来，与颜夫人说在任上很好，也取了多少真才实学的士子。现今有个进士，保荐博学宏词进京，托他带了三千金回来。说子玉年已十九，可以完婚，若要等我任满回来，要到明年冬天，适或又有调动。更觉迟了。况王质夫又系至亲至好，一切可托仲清料理，不丰不俭，叫颜夫人办了这件亲事。又与","en":"One day a family letter arrived from Academician Mei. He told Lady Yan that all was well at his post and that he had selected many genuinely learned scholars. One newly successful jinshi, recommended for the Broad Learning and Grand Diction exam, was bringing back three thousand taels on his behalf. Mei said Ziyu was now"},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":1,"tokens":["颜夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，子玉文星照命，也占鳌头，共取了三十二名。仲清、高品才高运蹇，皆被落。此科最年轻者就是子玉一人，授了编修之职，颜夫人好不喜欢。正是身经三试，压倒群英，比中状元难得多了。子玉见仲清、高品、王恂等落第，心甚不安，并不以此自得，反谦谨了许多。拜了保荐老师刘尚书，是熟极的，及谒阅卷老师，苏侯见了子玉，就想起子云之言，真是吉星鸾凤，喜不可言。王文辉与陆夫人心中半喜半闷，喜的","en":"Zhongqing and Gao Pin, talented but unlucky, were both dropped. Ziyu was the youngest candidate in this cohort. Lady Yan was overjoyed—this success was said to be even harder than a standard zhuangyuan. Yet seeing his close friends fail, Ziyu felt uneasy rather than proud, and became more modest. He paid respects to recommender Liu and then to exam reader Su the Marquis."},{"paragraph":37,"mentions":1,"tokens":["颜夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"如此，真是难得。但听得从前有个什么琴言，害他病过几场，如今不知这琴言又怎样了。」却说王文辉定了九月十九日吉期，颜夫人写了家信，说子玉已中宏词，又即完姻，一切交与仲清办理。","en":"What has become of this Qinyan now?\\"\\n\\nWang Wenhui fixed the nineteenth of the ninth month for the wedding, and Lady Yan wrote home to say that Ziyu had passed the Broad Learning examination and was to be married at once, and that everything had been put in Zhongqing's hands."},{"paragraph":38,"mentions":1,"tokens":["颜夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"是个男子，虽与子玉有些情分，究竟不能配偶，故将此模样，又生个琼华小姐出来，与琴言上妆时一样，岂不是个奇事？此事颜夫人久知，当日见了琴言即说像他媳妇。这么看起来，就是两家的像貌也是五百年前就定下的了。一见之后，又未免有些感触起来，忽又暗暗的解释，遂成就了良缘爱果，自然也不像那梦中措大的光景。若像那梦中光景，岂不要将个琼华小姐气死了么？明日也请了袁绮香、苏浣香、浣兰、","en":"despite deep attachment; thus heaven had made Qionghua with the same styled beauty as Qinyan in stage makeup. Lady Yan had recognized this long before and once said so on first seeing Qinyan. Seen this way, even two families' likenesses were set five hundred years before. Ziyu felt another wave of emotion but inwardly resolved himself and completed the marriage-fruit"}],"59":[{"paragraph":21,"mentions":1,"tokens":["颜夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"再说子玉见父亲超升了侍郎，喜出望外。已得了江西所发之信，计日早可到京，为何至今未到。颜夫人盼望，更不必说，王文辉也是常来问信。那日已是腊月十五，早上送了一封信来，子玉看信面上是：「江西学政梅宅梅庾香少爷手启，屈勤先寄。」心中大喜，知琴仙到了江西任所了，便忙拆开，看见还有与子云、蕙芳、素兰、琪官的信，且搁过一边。拆开自己的信，见一张白纸写着","en":"Jiangxi, and by his calculations, his father should have reached the capital long ago. Why was he still not here? Lady Yan's anxious anticipation goes without saying, and Wang Wenhui also came by frequently to ask for news. That day was already the fifteenth of the twelfth month. In the morning, a letter was delivered, and Ziyu saw the inscription on the envelope: \\"For the"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":2,"tokens":["颜夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云发了一千银子，打发家人星夜下了江南。子玉连天的悲苦，日间不敢进内，一来怕颜夫人问他，二来怕琼华小姐看出，正是他的苦楚，比人更胜几倍。但心上有这样心事，脸上如何装得过来？颜夫人倒疑心他怕见父亲，想是他父亲就回来，因此着急。惟有那琼华小姐，异样心灵，便料定他另有心事，再三盘诘，子玉只得直说了。琼华小姐也只好宽慰几句，见他这个光景，","en":"endless sorrow day after day. During the daytime, he didn't dare enter the inner quarters; firstly, he feared Lady Yan would question him, and secondly, he was afraid Miss Qionghua would see through him—his suffering was, after all, several times more profound than anyone else's. However, harboring such heavy matters in his heart, how could he possibly maintain a composed"},{"paragraph":31,"mentions":2,"tokens":["颜夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"若说不是他，面貌再没有这般相像的了。众人疑疑惑惑，猜不出来，又听得叫屈大爷，便知不是。子玉趁这空儿，就请仲清对颜夫人讲明，琼华也在旁听了，望着子玉笑，看着子玉含羞含愧，局促不安。颜夫人听了，也以为异，便道：「这个孩子本来原好，如今既做了屈家的儿子，从前的出身，倒也不必提起了，算他转了个劫罢。」","en":"couldn't be him. Taking advantage of this free moment, Ziyu asked Zhongqing to explain the situation clearly to Lady Yan. Qionghua listened from the side, smiling at Ziyu as she watched him flush with embarrassment and shame, squirming uneasily. Lady Yan found the whole thing quite strange as well, remarking, \\"This child was always inherently good. Now that he has become"},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":2,"tokens":["颜夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"仲清道：「此事要姑母与姑夫说明才好，不然外人见了，终要说的，倒教琴仙难为情。」颜夫人也应了，说道：「你姑夫重世交，又见他人好，决不看轻他的。」仲清见颜夫人应允了，也即告退。","en":"Aunt; otherwise, when outsiders see him, they are bound to talk, which will only cause Qinxian embarrassment.\\" Lady Yan agreed, saying, \\"Your uncle highly values old friendships, and seeing that the boy is of good character, he certainly won't look down on him.\\" Seeing that Lady Yan had agreed, Zhongqing took his leave."},{"paragraph":33,"mentions":3,"tokens":["颜夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"看看像不像？」琼华啐了一声，忽又说道：「你去同他进来见太太，我真要望望他。」子玉果然拉了琴仙进来，到内堂拜见了颜夫人。夫人见了，也甚疼他，便叫了一声：「屈大爷受苦了！」琴仙先进来，尚觉不安，及见颜夫人以礼相待，称他屈大爷，便安了心。琼华小姐在房门口偷望，果然像他，心中颇以为异，望了一望就进去了。颜夫人问了琴仙近况，琴仙略说了几句，也就告退。","en":"\\"Bring him in; I really do want to take a look at him.\\" Ziyu indeed led Qinxian inside to pay his respects to Lady Yan in the inner hall. Seeing him, the lady felt a deep sense of pity and called out, \\"Master Qu, you have suffered!\\" Qinxian had felt uneasy upon entering, but seeing Lady Yan treat him with such courtesy and address him as Master Qu, his heart settled."},{"paragraph":34,"mentions":3,"tokens":["颜夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"明日，士燮面圣回家，合家迎接。琼华拜见了公公，士燮十分喜欢。颜夫人同着谈了一回，后将琴仙的事委委婉婉说了出来，就说他唱过戏，屈道翁见他人品好，所以收为义子。将子玉害病的话，却隐藏不题。士燮道：「我已猜着了几分。」也将屈道翁梦中之言说了，又道：「前事也不必论他。这个孩子甚好，没有一点优伶习气，不说破真令人看不出来。」","en":"family gathered to welcome him. Qionghua paid her respects to her father-in-law, and Shixie was extremely pleased. Lady Yan chatted with him for a while, and then gently and tactfully recounted Qinxian's entire story, explaining that he had once sung in operas, and that Qu Daoweng, seeing his excellent character, had adopted him as his son. She deliberately hid the details"}]}`),"char-87":{1:[{paragraph:45,mentions:2,tokens:["陆氏夫人","陆夫人"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"接进了子玉。先同到内里去见了表舅母陆氏夫人。这夫人已是文辉续娶的了，今年才四十岁。又见了王恂的妻室孙氏，那是表嫂。仲清的妻室蓉华，那是表姊。还有个琼华小姐没有出来，因听得他父亲前日说那子玉的好处，其口风似要与他联姻的话，所以不肯出来见这表兄了。陆夫人见子玉，真是见一回爱一回，留他坐了，问了一",en:"He welcomed Ziyu inside. First, they went to the inner quarters to pay respects to his maternal aunt, Lady Lu. This lady was Wenhui's second wife and was only forty years old this year. He also greeted Wang Xun's wife, Lady Sun, his cousin-in-law. Zhongqing's wife, Ronghua, was his older female cousin. There was also a Miss Qionghua who did not come out to meet"}],6:[{paragraph:2,mentions:1,tokens:["陆氏夫人"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"到了初五日，颜夫人也要请客，请了他表嫂王文辉的陆氏夫人，并他家孙氏少奶奶，与两位表侄女，又请了孙亮功的陆氏夫人，与其大姑娘，并两位少奶奶，就是孙大姑娘辞了不来。",en:"Yan likewise prepared to host a gathering. She extended invitations to her cousin-in-law, Wang Wenhui's wife, Madam Lu, along with that household's young mistress née Sun and his two cousin-nieces. She also invited the wife of Sun Lianggong, Madam Lu, together with her eldest daughter and two young mistresses—though the eldest Miss Sun politely declined."},{paragraph:3,mentions:1,tokens:["陆氏夫人"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"这王、孙两家的陆氏夫人，是嫡堂姊妹，王家的陆氏夫人，是陆御史宗沅的堂妹，他亲哥哥叫陆宗淮，现任四川臬司。",en:"These two Madam Lus—of the Wang and Sun households, respectively—were first cousins. The Madam Lu of the Wang family was the paternal cousin of Censor Lu Zongyuan; her own elder brother, Lu Zonghuai, currently served as Judicial Commissioner of Sichuan."},{paragraph:4,mentions:1,tokens:["陆夫人"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"孙家的陆氏夫人，是陆宗沅的胞妹。王家的陆夫人年四十一岁，孙家的陆夫人年三十九岁。这两位夫人都是续娶的。虽在中年，却还生得少艾，不过像三十来岁的人，而且性爱秾华，其服饰与少年人一样。王文辉的夫人生得风流窈窕，是个直性爽快人，与文辉琴瑟和谐。这孙家的陆夫人，容貌也与乃姊彷佛，但性情悍妒，本将亮功有",en:"The Madam Lu of the Sun family was Lu Zongyuan's full sister. The Wang family's Madam Lu was forty-one, while the Sun family's Madam Lu was thirty-nine. Both women were second wives. Though entering middle age, they retained a remarkably youthful grace, appearing scarcely thirty. Sharing a fondness for opulent splendor, they adorned themselves"},{paragraph:10,mentions:1,tokens:["陆夫人"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"氏少奶奶佩秋，媚妍婉妙，和顺如春。两夫人见过了礼，然后两位少奶奶、一位姑娘，齐齐的拜见了颜夫人，各叙了些寒温。陆夫人问起子玉来，颜夫人说他父亲带他出门去了，琼华小姐心里始觉安稳。忽见仆妇报导：「孙家太太与少奶奶到。颜夫人也降阶迎接，陆氏夫人是常见的，那两位少奶奶虽见过两次，看今日装饰起来愈觉娇艳，颜夫人也深知其所适非人，便心里十分疼爱起来。当下各人见礼已毕，谈起家",en:`the young mistresses and the young lady offered a unified bow to Lady Yan, engaging in polite conversation. When Madam Lu asked about Ziyu, Lady Yan explained he had gone out with his father, bringing a sense of relief to Miss Qionghua's heart. Suddenly, a servant announced, "The Madam and young mistresses of the Sun family have arrived." Lady Yan stepped forward to greet`}],29:[{paragraph:21,mentions:1,tokens:["陆夫人"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"专好的了。」回家就叫他儿子王恂问了一回，王恂只好含含糊糊的说了几句，又与子玉剖辨，说断不至此，文辉终有些疑心。陆夫人听见了，虽未过门，倒先替女儿吃起醋来了，便向文辉说道：「若论玉哥儿，相貌是极好的，所以去年孙亲家母作媒，我就应许了。如今你自然不管，这怎么好？亲尚未成，倒先弄些笑话出来，将来若是一味的混闹，叫琼姑过去，如何过得日子？亲翁在家还能拘管，亲母是一味的溺爱",en:`that the situation was nowhere near as bad as the rumors claimed. But Wenhui's doubts remained deeply entrenched. Lady Lu happened to overhear the conversation. Though her daughter was not yet officially wed, the sharp sting of protective jealousy—a mother's bitter vinegar—already burned within her. She confronted Wenhui furiously: "Brother Yu's looks may be superb, and`},{paragraph:22,mentions:1,tokens:["陆夫人"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"到底这些小旦有什么好处，羞也不羞。」陆夫人气头上，倒连王文辉也教训了一顿。文辉只是赔笑，不敢作声，说：「事情呢，实在稀奇，我暗中窃访，连恂儿都知道他们才见过两三面。",en:'"What earthly good are these young dan? Have they absolutely no shame?" In the heat of her fury, Lady Lu turned her righteous anger upon Wang Wenhui as well. He could only force a hollow smile, not daring to speak out of turn. Finally, he offered gently, "The matter is indeed strange, but I have looked into it carefully. Even Xun knows the truth of it—they'},{paragraph:23,mentions:3,tokens:["陆夫人"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"你放心，我自去嘱咐表妹，以后管得严些，不准他出门，也就没事了。到今冬也好完娶，这件事琼姑过去了，或可拘住他。」陆夫人冷笑了一声道：「这些下作脾气是出于本心，我见多了，拘管得那一个住？从来说贼不改性，管住身管不住心的。」文辉听这些话，明明的逼到自己身上来，只得呵呵一笑，踱了出来，往书房里去了。陆夫人气极了，又在他女儿琼姑面前，把子玉讲了又讲。琼姑低头不语，心中也有些",en:'Qionggu crosses the threshold and takes her place in the household, perhaps her presence will naturally leash him." Lady Lu let out a bitter sneer. "Such ruinous habits spring directly from the heart. I have seen it time and again—you may leash the body, but you can never bind the heart. Thieves do not suddenly change their nature." Hearing himself so pointedly targeted by'},{paragraph:24,mentions:1,tokens:["陆夫人"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"亲总有些惶恐不安的光景。颜夫人爱子之心十分体贴，又知儿子并无苟且之行，绝不提起琴言的事。那王文辉亲自来过几次，陆夫人也来过。一回在颜夫人面前，也不好说得，但有些话里讥讽，暗藏褒贬，似乎叫亲家以后留点神，不要放纵他的意思。又见子玉病已痊愈，看其相貌翩翩，实是佳婿，又像个真诚谨厚的人，就把疑心消去一半。",en:"truly shameful deed, she never once spoke Qinyan's name aloud. Wang Wenhui came to visit several times, as did Lady Lu. Before Lady Yan could even speak plainly, Lady Lu would needle her with sharp, pointed barbs—speaking as if warning a close kin to keep careful watch and cease her endless indulgence. Yet, seeing Ziyu fully healed—so handsome, graceful, and carrying"}],48:[{paragraph:26,mentions:1,tokens:["陆夫人"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"六日同去。琴仙应了，果然把子玉请了出来。子玉那日先到文辉处拜寿，耽搁了一早晨，吃了面，即便辞回。王恂留住不放，陆夫人也留他。子玉是一腔心事，如何留得住？只得将实话悄悄的告诉了仲清。仲清与王恂说了，方才放他出来。",en:"birthday and was delayed for hours; after eating longevity noodles, he tried to excuse himself, but Wang Xun and Madam Lu firmly insisted he stay. Burdened with a heart full of sorrowful thoughts, he found it impossible to remain. He quietly confided the truth to Zhongqing, who then spoke to Wang Xun, finally securing Ziyu's release."}],52:[{paragraph:22,mentions:1,tokens:["陆氏夫人"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"明日，苏夫人请了他大姑奶奶浣香与徐子云夫人袁绮香去陪新，吃扶头卯酒。田太夫人请了王文辉的陆氏夫人，带了他大姑奶奶蓉华并媳妇孙少奶奶佩秋，又请刘守正的夫人，没有来，他媳妇吴少奶奶紫烟来了。周锡爵、杨方猷、陆宗沅的夫人都辞了。",en:"Yuan Qixiang, to accompany the bride and partake in the morning wine. Old Madam Tian invited Wang Wenhui's wife, Madam Lu, who brought along her elder daughter Ronghua and her daughter-in-law, Madam Sun Peiqiu. She also invited the wife of Liu Shouzheng, who could not attend, though her daughter-in-law, Madam Wu Ziyan, came in her stead. The wives of Zhou Xijue, Yang Fangyou,"},{paragraph:25,mentions:4,tokens:["陆夫人"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"坐的。」便走到西边去了。田老夫人见徐夫人决不肯坐，只得又让华夫人，华夫人又与徐夫人让了好一会，让不过徐夫人，经陆夫人也帮着田老夫人劝，他只得坐了。陆夫人坐东席第二，刘少奶奶坐第三，王少奶奶坐西席第二，颜少奶奶坐第三。田老夫人在东边作陪。陆夫人对田老夫人道：「太太，那边不用你过去张罗了。」便叫蓉姑道：「你在那边代作主人罢，省得田老太太走来走去的费事。」田老夫人满面笑",en:"Hua. Lady Hua and Madam Xu exchanged polite refusals for a long while until, unable to sway Madam Xu and with Madam Lu helping Old Madam Tian persuade her, Lady Hua finally took the seat. Madam Lu sat second at the east table, with Liu's daughter-in-law third; Wang's daughter-in-law sat second at the west table, with Yan's daughter-in-law third. Old Madam Tian sat at"},{paragraph:26,mentions:1,tokens:["陆夫人"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"再看那陆夫人，虽是四十以外中年人，骨格风华，穿衣打扮，尚极美丽。两颧微露，脸上生了几点雀斑，若远远望去尚是一个绝代佳人，像个智慧聪明、才干出众的人。",en:"Looking then at Madam Lu: though she was a middle-aged woman past forty, her bone structure, bearing, and impeccable sense of dress remained strikingly beautiful. Her cheekbones were slightly prominent, and a few freckles dotted her face, yet from a distance, she still appeared"},{paragraph:27,mentions:2,tokens:["陆夫人"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"陆夫人道：「想我太太真有天样大的福气，生这个状元儿子，娶这个天仙媳妇。你老人家只怕是王母下凡，灵妃转世，所以有这些仙子、仙女跟了你老人家下来。我们虽不算蟠桃会上人，今日却也沾了多少光，托了多少福。」田老夫人笑道：「我看太太的福气也就是全福了，自己是正二品的",en:'Madam Lu said, "I must say, Madam Tian possesses a fortune as vast as the heavens—giving birth to a Zhuangyuan son and welcoming a fairy-like daughter-in-law. You yourself must be the Queen Mother descending to the mortal realm, or a divine consort reincarnated,'},{paragraph:28,mentions:1,tokens:["陆夫人"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"子说了好一会话，然后告辞。徐夫人要留他逛园，华夫人说晚了，改日再来奉拜罢，遂带了群珠登舆而去。徐夫人也即告辞，陆夫人同了女、媳回去，刘少奶奶也回，田老夫人一一相送。不知后事如何，且听下回分解。",en:"pay her respects, and departed in her sedan chair with her Pearl Maids. Madam Xu then took her leave as well. Madam Lu returned home with her daughter and daughter-in-law, and Madam Liu's daughter-in-law also departed. Old Madam Tian escorted each of them out in turn. To know what happens next, listen to the next chapter's unraveling."}],54:[{paragraph:4,mentions:1,tokens:["陆夫人"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"多。拜了保荐老师刘尚书，是熟极的，及谒阅卷老师，苏侯见了子玉，就想起子云之言，真是吉星鸾凤，喜不可言。王文辉与陆夫人心中半喜半闷，喜的是子玉考中，闷的是王恂、仲清不中，但接着要办女儿的喜事，也就喜多闷少。",en:"reader Su the Marquis. Seeing Ziyu, Su remembered Ziyun's words and thought him truly auspicious. Wang Wenhui and Madam Lu felt mixed joy and frustration: glad for Ziyu's success, vexed at Wang Xun and Zhongqing's failure, though the coming daughter wedding shifted them toward joy."}]},"char-88":JSON.parse(`{"1":[{"paragraph":45,"mentions":1,"tokens":["孙氏"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"接进了子玉。先同到内里去见了表舅母陆氏夫人。这夫人已是文辉续娶的了，今年才四十岁。又见了王恂的妻室孙氏，那是表嫂。仲清的妻室蓉华，那是表姊。还有个琼华小姐没有出来，因听得他父亲前日说那子玉的好处，其口风似要与他联姻的话，所以不肯出来见这表兄了。陆夫人见子玉，真是见一回爱一回，留他坐了，问了一会家常话，子玉告退。","en":"Lu. This lady was Wenhui's second wife and was only forty years old this year. He also greeted Wang Xun's wife, Lady Sun, his cousin-in-law. Zhongqing's wife, Ronghua, was his older female cousin. There was also a Miss Qionghua who did not come out to meet him; having heard her father praise Ziyu's qualities a few days prior, and sensing his tone suggested arranging a"}],"6":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["孙氏"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"到了初五日，颜夫人也要请客，请了他表嫂王文辉的陆氏夫人，并他家孙氏少奶奶，与两位表侄女，又请了孙亮功的陆氏夫人，与其大姑娘，并两位少奶奶，就是孙大姑娘辞了不来。","en":"On the fifth day, Lady Yan likewise prepared to host a gathering. She extended invitations to her cousin-in-law, Wang Wenhui's wife, Madam Lu, along with that household's young mistress née Sun and his two cousin-nieces. She also invited the wife of Sun Lianggong, Madam Lu, together with her eldest daughter and two young mistresses—though the eldest Miss Sun politely declined."},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":1,"tokens":["佩秋"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"陆夫人就生了王恂的少奶奶一个，名叫佩秋，生得德容兼备，爱若掌珠，十八岁嫁与王家去了。还有个白头的大姑娘，是不能嫁人的，新年已二十九岁。嗣徽二十六，嗣元二十四，这两个废物，都已娶了亲。嗣徽娶的沈氏，是国子监司业沈恭之女，名字叫做芸姑。生得齐齐整整，伶俐聪明，嫁了过来，见了那样丈夫，便想自寻","en":"Madam Lu had borne but one child of her own—Wang Xun's wife. Named Peiqiu, she was a paragon of virtue and beauty, cherished like a precious pearl, and had been married into the Wang household at eighteen. There was also the eldest daughter, her hair prematurely white, destined to remain unwed; this New Year marked her twenty-ninth"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":2,"tokens":["孙氏","佩秋"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"彷佛。颜夫人见琼华小姐更觉生得好了，清如浣雪，秀若餐霞，疑不食人间烟火食者。而蓉华小姐朗润清华，外妍内秀。那个孙氏少奶奶佩秋，媚妍婉妙，和顺如春。两夫人见过了礼，然后两位少奶奶、一位姑娘，齐齐的拜见了颜夫人，各叙了些寒温。陆夫人问起子玉来，颜夫人说他父亲带他出门去了，琼华小姐心里始觉安稳。忽见仆妇报导：「孙家太太与少奶奶到。颜夫人也降阶迎接，陆氏夫人是常见的，那","en":"displaying an exquisite blend of outward beauty and inner refinement. The young mistress of the Sun household, Peiqiu, was charming, graceful, and gentle as spring. After the two noble ladies exchanged formal pleasantries, the young mistresses and the young lady offered a unified bow to Lady Yan, engaging in polite conversation. When Madam Lu asked about Ziyu, Lady"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":2,"tokens":["孙氏"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"氏少奶奶是没有见过子玉的，见镜屏里画着一个美少年，面粉唇朱，秀气成彩，光华耀目，觉眼中从未见过这样美貌人，便拉孙氏少奶奶同看道：「姑奶奶你看这画，画得好么？」孙氏少奶奶一笑道：「这个就是我们将来的二姑爷，真画得像。」蓉华与沈氏少奶奶都来看子玉的小照，惟有琼华不来，独自走到书桌边。随手将书一翻，见有一张花笺，写着几首七言绝句，题是《车中人》，像是见美人而有所思。看","en":"Finding the room refined and elegant, the young mistresses took their seats. The young mistress, née Ba, who had never laid eyes on Ziyu, noticed a portrait of a beautiful young man on a mirror screen—a face of flawless, powder-white skin and crimson lips, radiating an elegance that dazzled the eye, unlike anyone she had ever seen. Pulling the young mistress, née Sun, closer, she said, \\"Sister-in-law, look at this painting—isn't it remarkably done?\\" The young mistress, née Sun, smiled and replied, \\"That is our future second brother-in-law—a truly remarkable likeness.\\" Ronghua and the young mistress, née Shen, gathered to admire Ziyu's portrait, but Qionghua refused to approach, wandering alone to the writing desk. Idly flipping through a book, she discovered a leaf of floral-patterned stationery inscribed with several seven-character quatrains titled \\"The Person in the Carriage\\"—clearly verses born of longing for a fleetingly glimpsed beauty. Examining the final line of the third poem, she noticed it rhymed on the character 'qiong' (琼), invoking the immortal maiden Xu Feiqiong; the closing line of the fourth poem rhymed on 'hua' (华), invoking the immortal maiden Ruan Linghua."}],"52":[{"paragraph":22,"mentions":1,"tokens":["佩秋"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"姑奶奶浣香与徐子云夫人袁绮香去陪新，吃扶头卯酒。田太夫人请了王文辉的陆氏夫人，带了他大姑奶奶蓉华并媳妇孙少奶奶佩秋，又请刘守正的夫人，没有来，他媳妇吴少奶奶紫烟来了。周锡爵、杨方猷、陆宗沅的夫人都辞了。","en":"Tian invited Wang Wenhui's wife, Madam Lu, who brought along her elder daughter Ronghua and her daughter-in-law, Madam Sun Peiqiu. She also invited the wife of Liu Shouzheng, who could not attend, though her daughter-in-law, Madam Wu Ziyan, came in her stead. The wives of Zhou Xijue, Yang Fangyou, and Lu Zongyuan all politely declined."}],"54":[{"paragraph":5,"mentions":2,"tokens":["孙佩秋","佩秋"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一日，王恂的妻子孙佩秋与仲清的妻子蓉华，到琼华房里来贺喜，蓉华道：「妹夫恭喜，压倒了天下英才。如今是玉堂金马，才子神仙，比今科鼎甲还要体面了好些，这是妹妹的福气，我如何比得上来？」佩秋讲道：「二姑爷真是天下第一个才子，我听这些赴考宏词，从前中过鼎甲，点过翰林的也有在内，也","en":"One day Sun Peiqiu, Wang Xun's wife, and Ronghua, Zhongqing's wife, came to Qionghua's room to offer their congratulations. Ronghua said, \\"Joy to you, little sister! Your husband-to-be has borne down all the finest talents under heaven. Now he belongs to the Jade Hall"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":2,"tokens":["佩秋"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"就是田春帆新娶的夫人。这两姊妹真是才貌双全，世间少有的。」琼华道：「就是他们么？怪不得母亲回来这么夸奖他们。」佩秋道：「他们姊妹倒像双生似的，一模一样，比二位姑娘生得还要像些。」蓉华道：「我们虽是亲姊妹，其实不很像。你看二姑娘的秀艳风韵，倒像隐在肌肤眉目里面，像个碧纱笼罩着牡丹花，那花情、花韵，隐隐的要透在外面，然却不露出来。我近来已是老干横斜，绝无姿态。你不见","en":"rarely seen in this world.\\" \\"So it is they!\\" said Qionghua. \\"No wonder Mother praised them so upon her return.\\" Peiqiu said, \\"The two look almost like twins—more alike even than you sisters.\\" Ronghua replied, \\"Though we are sisters by blood, we do not greatly resemble each other. Look at Second Sister: her delicate radiance and charm seem hidden within her very skin"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":2,"tokens":["佩秋"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"蓉华道：「刘大嫂呢？」佩秋道：「刘大嫂倒像碧桃花儿似的。」琼华笑道：「刘大嫂小小巧巧，绝像樱桃花。他又会笑，又像含笑花。这个人最有趣的。」又问蓉华道：「那浣白夫人诗你题没有？我打算也要题一首。」蓉华道：「我实在心绪不佳，做出来也是不好，不如藏拙为妙。你是题的什么？你的歌行最好","en":"\\"And Mistress Liu?\\" Ronghua asked. \\"She is rather like a blossom on the green peach,\\" said Peiqiu. Qionghua laughed. \\"Mistress Liu is so small and dainty that she is exactly like cherry blossom. And since she is forever smiling, she resembles the smiling magnolia too. She is the most delightful person!\\" Then she asked Ronghua, \\"Did you write anything"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":3,"tokens":["佩秋"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"蓉华道：「你是不肯做，做了又不肯给人看。前日你的《七夕》诗，我就看得很好。为何有这样诗才，要秘不示人呢？」佩秋笑道：「我何曾做什么《七夕》诗？你从何处看来？」蓉华道：「我听哥哥念的，还赞得了不得，这是谁做的呢？」佩秋笑道：「或者就是你哥哥做的，做得不好，就说是我做的了。」琼华笑道：「嫂嫂，你说三百首很熟，你得意是那几首？」佩秋笑道：「我最爱念的是七绝杜牧之的","en":"poem for the *Double Seventh Festival* excellent. Why possess such a gift and keep it hidden from the world?\\" Peiqiu laughed. \\"When did I ever write a *Double Seventh Festival* poem? Where did you see it?\\" \\"I heard Brother recite it, praising it beyond measure. Who wrote it, then?\\" \\"Perhaps your brother wrote it himself, and finding it poor, said it was mine.\\" Qionghua"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":1,"tokens":["佩秋"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"若为容」。七律如崔颢之「岧峣太华俯咸京」，崔曙之「汉文皇帝有高台」，李白之「凤凰台上凤凰游」，你倒不得意么？」佩秋道：「我也有得意的，譬如那大家的诗力量大，我就不能学他。若小巧些的，意远情长，还容易领略些。」琼华道：「《唐诗三百首》，真是全唐诗中的精液，而温李七古止载义山《韩碑》一篇，便于初学津梁。若以我看去，一诗有一诗的好处，亦不可以优劣论。但我看时人多好做七","en":"had a high terrace,' Li Bai's 'On Phoenix Terrace the phoenixes once roamed.' Are you not pleased with them?\\"\\n\\nPeiqiu said, \\"I have my favourites too. The great masters' poems have such force that I cannot learn from them; the smaller, finer ones, with the meaning far off and the feeling long, are easier to take in.\\"\\n\\nQionghua said, \\"The *Three Hundred Tang Poems* is"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":1,"tokens":["佩秋"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"蓉华道：「你真论诗真切，将这些议论倒可以做一本诗话出来。」佩秋道：「我也看得出，却论不出来，说不真，说不透，倒教人驳起来。」琼华道：「五律自然以真挚为贵，其余写景写情总也容易，如杜少陵之：","en":"Ronghua praised her criticism as exact and said these ideas could form a proper poetry notebook. Peiqiu said she sensed such things too but could not articulate them with precision and feared rebuttal. Qionghua said, \\"For five-character regulated verse, profound sincerity is naturally most valued; describing scenes or emotions is otherwise quite easy."},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":1,"tokens":["佩秋"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"苦，他却不能如此写，倒不写真情，要写虚景，将些凄风苦雨，和在里面，虽也动人，究竟是虚话，何能如此篇字字真切。」佩秋笑道：「我就不喜欢这等诗，若学了他，不是成了白话么？」琼华道：「诗只要好，就是白话也一样好看。若极意雕琢，不能稳当，也不好看，倒反不如那白话呢。你看岑参《逢入京使》那一首：","en":"the weather and sorrow. Those might move someone, but next to words that rang absolutely true, they were empty. Peiqiu joked that if she disliked polished verse, wouldn't poetry just turn into plain speech? Qionghua answered that the best plain speech surpassed heavy carving. She cited Cen Shen's *Meeting the Capital Envoy*:"},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":1,"tokens":["佩秋"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，何以有羽翼。\\n落月满屋梁，犹疑照颜色。\\n如此径住。那「水深波浪阔，无使蛟龙得」也不要，倒觉含蓄不尽。」蓉华、佩秋都笑道：「真的，删了倒好。那个枫林青、关塞黑，真有些鬼气。这是你的卓见。还有什么可议的么？」琼华道：「还有僧皎然《访陆鸿渐》那一首，古不像古，律不像律，不知选家何意。其诗云：","en":"wide, / Do not let the water-dragons get you,' the poem would feel endlessly suggestive and implicit.\\" Ronghua and Peiqiu both laughed and agreed. \\"Truly, deleting them would be better! That green maple forest and dark pass really have a ghostly chill. What excellent insight! Are there any others to critique?\\" Qionghua said, \\"There is also the monk Jiaoran's poem *Visiting"},{"paragraph":31,"mentions":1,"tokens":["佩秋"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"绿蚁新醅酒，红泥小火炉。\\n晚来天欲雪，能饮一杯无？\\n此皆信手拈来，都成妙谛。」佩秋道：「姑娘论诗，深得三昧，若去考博学宏词，怕不是状元？又是当初的黄崇嘏了。」","en":"threatens snow,\\nCan you drink a cup with me or not?\\"\\nThis is all gathered easily yet achieves profound truth.\\" Peiqiu joked, \\"Miss, you discuss poetry with such mastery of the profound mysteries—if you took the Broad Learning exam, wouldn't you be the top scholar? You'd be another Huang Chonggu!\\""},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":2,"tokens":["佩秋"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琼华笑道：「单靠几句诗中用么？」佩秋道：「二姑娘从前那些诗，我见你还要叫你哥哥改。不是我说，你哥倒未必做得出来。若做得出来，不至三场就被贴了。」蓉华笑道：「这句话给哥哥听见，他是要不依你的。」佩秋笑道：「我是没有学过做诗，但我前日听他们说杜少陵的《北征》、韩昌黎的《南山》，我将他翻出来","en":"Qionghua laughed. \\"What use is a few lines of verse by themselves?\\" Peiqiu said, \\"Those poems the second young lady used to write — I saw you take them to your brother to correct. And I will say it: your brother could very likely not have written them. If he could, he would not have been struck off after three sessions.\\" Ronghua"},{"paragraph":33,"mentions":2,"tokens":["佩秋"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琼华道：「《北征》好像七十韵。」佩秋道：「你记得他有几个重韵在里头？」琼华道：「若说重韵，也只有一个日字，第三韵「朝野少暇日」，与二十七韵「呕泄卧数日」，这是的的确确是重的。」佩秋笑道：「还有「往者散何卒」与「几日休练卒」，与后「佳气上金阙」，下又是「洒扫数不阙」，虽是一字两用，也要算","en":"Qionghua said: \\"The 'Northern Expedition' has, I believe, about seventy rhymes.\\" Peiqiu said: \\"Can you recall how many repeated rhymes it contains?\\" Qionghua said: \\"As for repeated rhymes, there is only one clear case: the character 'ri' — the third rhyme, 'court and countryside seldom enjoy a day of leisure,' and the twenty-seventh rhyme,"},{"paragraph":34,"mentions":1,"tokens":["佩秋"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"眉马前死」么？至于《南山》诗，我虽看过，但一句也不记得，佶屈聱牙的，如何念得？且字又难认，嫂嫂你倒记得清么？」佩秋道：「我原是查了来，故意考你们的。若要念熟他，如何念得熟呢？且有一百韵之多，而字又难认。」","en":"to recite it? And the characters are hard even to make out. Sister-in-law, can you really keep it straight?\\"\\n\\nPeiqiu said, \\"I looked it up beforehand on purpose, to test you. As for learning it by heart — how could anyone? It runs to a hundred rhymes, and the characters are hard to read.\\""},{"paragraph":35,"mentions":2,"tokens":["佩秋"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琼华道：「你数错了。《南山》诗一百零二韵，内中一个重韵也没有，真与《子虚》、《上林》一样，非大力量不能。」佩秋道：「你说没有重韵，我说也有一韵，「尝升棠丘望，戢戢见相凑。」又云：「或散若瓦解，或赴若辐凑。」不是两个凑字？」琼华笑道：「你又论错了。「或赴若辐凑」的凑字，虽刻的是三点水，其意是辐凑之辏，是车字旁。我要请问嫂嫂，鸟兽的兽字去了犬旁，是读什么字？」佩","en":"equal of Sima Xiangru's *Zixu Fu* and *Shanglin Fu*, achievable only through extraordinary structural power.\\" Peiqiu said: \\"You claim there are no repeated rhymes, but I say there is one: 'Once I ascended the Tangqiu heights to gaze, and saw them densely converging' — a 'cou' rhyme. And then: 'Some scatter as if tiles shattering, some rush as if wheel-spokes converging'"},{"paragraph":36,"mentions":3,"tokens":["佩秋"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"：「那里有这种问法？就算熟极的，也不能记得第几韵是什么字。等我数下去。」即一韵一韵的念出来，笑道：「是瘦字。」佩秋道：「这实在难为他了，背得这么熟，想姑娘和韵是必定和得出来的。」琼华道：「这一百二韵，字虽难些，倒容易用。那《北征》诗，方才姐姐说的「不闻夏殷衰，中自诛褒妲。」这个「妲」字就难用得很，不知他们考上的是怎样用。姐夫、哥哥的也是用妲姬的妲字，大概除了这个","en":"which character. Let me count down to it.\\" And she recited it rhyme by rhyme, and laughed. \\"It is 'shou' — thin.\\"\\n\\nPeiqiu said, \\"That is really no small thing — to have it so pat. I am sure the young lady could match the rhymes if she chose.\\" Qionghua said, \\"These hundred and two rhymes are difficult characters, but easy enough to use. In the *Northern Expedition* — the"},{"paragraph":37,"mentions":2,"tokens":["佩秋"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"蓉华笑起来。琼华更觉含羞，停了一停，说道：「想是我哥哥跪过的。」佩秋笑道：「可惜我不配，若配时，你哥哥自然也要跪了。」蓉华道：「日子快了，我们姐妹也不能常在一处了。妹妹是个有福气的，不比我们。」又说道：「看看你外甥再来。」便出去了，佩秋也同了出去。琼华暗想道：「姐姐一肚子的牢骚，这也难怪他。但姐夫这样才学，终要高发的","en":"Ronghua laughed. Qionghua blushed the harder, paused, and said, \\"I suppose my brother has knelt for it before now.\\" Peiqiu laughed. \\"A pity I am not worth it. If I were, your brother would kneel too.\\"\\n\\nRonghua said, \\"The day is close, and we sisters shall not be together much longer. Little sister is the fortunate one — not like us.\\" Then she said, \\"I will come again and"},{"paragraph":38,"mentions":1,"tokens":["孙佩秋"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"那梦中措大的光景。若像那梦中光景，岂不要将个琼华小姐气死了么？明日也请了袁绮香、苏浣香、浣兰、吴紫烟、王蓉华、孙佩秋来陪新人，群仙高会，又叙了一日。华夫人因是父亲得意门生，又是年伯母来请他，所以欣然而来。至排场热闹，与田家一样，不能细述。以后子玉闺房之乐，真是乐不可言。一个仕女班头，一个才人魁首，或早起看花，或迟眠玩月，或分题拈韵，或论古辨疑，成了个闺房良友，自然","en":"become reality, Qionghua would have died of outrage. Next day Yuan Qixiang, Huanxiang, Huanlan, Ziyan, Ronghua, and Peiqiu came to accompany the bride—a gathering of near-immortals that lasted another full day. Lady Hua came gladly because Ziyu was her father's prized disciple and Lady Yan had invited her personally. The scale and excitement matched the Tian wedding and"}],"57":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["孙佩秋"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"请了华公子的夫人苏浣香、田春航的夫人浣兰、刘文泽的夫人吴紫烟、颜仲清的夫人王蓉华、梅子玉的夫人琼华、王恂的夫人孙佩秋。此时园中菊花开满，五色斑烂。是日晴光和蔼，风不扬尘，小毛衣服都用不着，绵的尽够了。袁绮香一早带了十二红婢，还有几个家人媳妇，先到园里候客。那日次贤、高品、南湘皆回避了。那十二红都是十五六岁，有的已是云鬓堆鸦，有的还是垂髫刷翠，却一样的盈盈秋水，窄窄","en":"Wenze's wife, Wu Ziyan; Yan Zhongqing's wife, Wang Ronghua; Mei Ziyu's wife, Qionghua; and Wang Xun's wife, Sun Peiqiu. By this time, the garden's chrysanthemums were in full bloom, a brilliant tapestry of five colors. The day's sunlight was gentle, the wind stirred no dust, and light fur garments were unneeded as padded clothes provided ample warmth. Early in the morning,"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":1,"tokens":["佩秋"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"袁绮香接下台阶，苏氏姊妹笑盈盈的上前见礼，然后与佩秋、紫烟、蓉华、琼华都见了，各人挽着手，喜笑颜开，叙了一番。","en":"on the stairs. The Su sisters stepped forward with radiant smiles and curtsied, then exchanged greetings with Peiqiu, Ziyan, Ronghua, and Qionghua. Each took another's arm, their faces bright with joy, and they conversed warmly for a while."},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":2,"tokens":["孙佩秋","佩秋"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「你要改什么行？大姑娘已改了大奶奶，你如今就想改大太太么？」说得众人笑了。序齿袁绮香二十五岁，吴紫烟二十三岁，孙佩秋、王蓉华皆二十二岁，苏浣香二十一，浣兰十九，王琼华十八居末。绮香命丫鬟们焚了一炉百和香，铺了一条大锦毯，七美顺着年次团团的拜了一拜，珠珞垂肩，云裳贴地，甚是好看。嗣后七美中称呼绮香为大姐，琼华为七妹，紫烟行二，佩秋行三，蓉华行四，浣香行五，浣兰行六，","en":"'madam'?\\" Everyone burst into laughter. Ranked by age: Yuan Qixiang was twenty-five; Wu Ziyan twenty-three; Sun Peiqiu and Wang Ronghua both twenty-two; Su Huanxiang twenty-one; Huanlan nineteen; and Wang Qionghua, at eighteen, was the youngest. Qixiang had the maids burn a censer of hundred-blend incense and spread a large brocade carpet. The seven beauties bowed in"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":1,"tokens":["佩秋"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"。」蓉华道：「据我想，登山不如临水，且闻得路路走得通的。不如坐个船游他一转，望着那些景致，似乎比岸上还好些。」佩秋道：「说得是，又省力。若上山去，只怕也走乏了，还能游么？」绮香道：「既是这样，我们到吟秋榭顶上去，也望得个全景，就在那里坐罢。」于是一群粉黛，都出了宝香堂后院，到了风露清吟馆那边下了船。主人只有七个，那七家的丫鬟、仆妇共有四十余人，用了十几个小船，一","en":"would be better to take a boat around once. The views from the water seem even finer than those from the shore.\\" Peiqiu agreed, \\"That makes sense, and it saves our strength. If we climbed, we would be exhausted before we even began our tour.\\" Qixiang concluded, \\"Since that is the case, let us go to the top of Autumn-Chant Waterside Pavilion. We can take in the entire"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":2,"tokens":["佩秋"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"且又灵变。又点了许三姐。琼华的四个丫头，点了一个青琴。蓉华两个丫头，点了一个秋莲。紫烟两个丫头，点了一个侍香。佩秋两个丫头，点了一个金凤。共二十四人。其余都命他们代酒。绮香即命拿过筹来，先是七人掣了，顺着年齿掣去，绮得掣着秦，紫烟掣着楚，佩秋掣着燕，蓉华掣着赵，浣香掣着魏，浣兰掣着齐，琼华掣着韩。浣香道：「姐姐，你今日受了大敌了，我们六国今番并力，定要杀你个片甲","en":"Qionghua's four maids, Qingqin was chosen. Ronghua picked Qiulian from her two maids. Ziyan selected Shixiang. Peiqiu chose Jinfeng. In total, there were twenty-four capable maids; the rest were ordered to drink on behalf of others when necessary. Qixiang then had the lots brought out. The seven mistresses drew first, in order of age: Qixiang drew Qin, Ziyan drew Chu,"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":2,"tokens":["佩秋"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"佩秋道：「我掣荆轲，也不至中铜柱的。」浣兰道：「我把田单的火车驱过来，看你有什么御敌的妙计。」紫烟道：「就是我国没有勇将，若能掣着了项重瞳就好了。」绮香道：「且慢高兴，我秦国是兵强将勇，没有一个弱兵。待我且先派定了人数再说。他们共二十四人，我用六个，你们","en":"Peiqiu chimed in, \\"If I draw Jing Ke, my dagger will not miss the bronze pillar.\\" Huanlan said, \\"I will unleash Tian Dan's fire-oxen against you. Let us see how you counter that.\\" Ziyan said, \\"Even if my state lacks a champion, drawing the double-pupiled Xiang"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":2,"tokens":["佩秋"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"赠珠掣的是宋玉。紫烟笑道：「完了，一个佞人，一个梦神，一个风流鬼，这如何打得仗来？」众佳人皆笑，也收过了。再掣佩秋的燕国小筹，金凤掣了荆轲，红莲掣了田光，红娟掣了骏马。佩秋道：「也不好，究竟是个不祥之兆。」蓉花笑道：「尚未出兵，倒已先砍了两个脑袋。」众人皆笑，又收过了。取蓉华的赵国来，秋莲掣了廉颇，画珠掣了蔺相如，红雯掣了平原君。蓉华道：「我这三根掣得好，大可折","en":"a romantic ghost. How can we possibly fight with them?\\" The others laughed and set Chu's tube aside. Next came Peiqiu's Yan lots: Jinfeng drew Jing Ke, Honglian drew Tian Guang, and Hongjuan drew a fine horse. Peiqiu sighed, \\"Not good. It feels ominous all the same.\\" Ronghua teased, \\"Before the army even marches, you have already lost two heads!\\" Laughter erupted again,"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":2,"tokens":["佩秋"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"？除非要用金钩挂胡子法子。」红雪道：「有钩子，早就预备的。」便在匣子里找出两个金钩来，挂在秋莲耳上，两边分开。佩秋想着他丈夫说的笑话，不留心说了出来道：「倒像人蝇拂子。」蓉华瞅了他一眼，道：「请问，这蝇拂子是谁家的？」一句话说得佩秋两颊微红，幸众人不解，也过去了。秋莲只得央求旁人代了这碗饭，便除下胡子，指着花珠道：「我看你的笑话。」骰子掷了，是画珠，画珠是蔺相如","en":"small box, she produced two gold hooks to hang from Qiulian's ears, parting the whiskers neatly to the sides. Peiqiu, suddenly recalling a joke her husband had told, blurted out, \\"She looks rather like a fly-whisk.\\" Ronghua shot her a sharp look and asked, \\"May I ask whose fly-whisk she resembles?\\" Peiqiu's cheeks flushed a delicate pink; fortunately, the others missed"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":1,"tokens":["佩秋"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"看时，是一对碧霞玺做成的镯子。众佳人道：「这真便宜了他。」那二十四个婢女，不是金的，就是玉的，满堂都喝了一杯。佩秋道：「五妹好个福将，一出来叫满堂喝酒。」红雪掣了一枝是：「玉搔头袅凤双飞。」注：「插金丝软凤钗者饮一杯。」红雪四下留心，戴此钗的却亦不少，只见爱珠与红雯在那里交线顽耍，爱珠交错了，被红雯打了一下，爱珠格格的笑，把个金丝双凤钗颤得乱飞。红雪斟了一杯酒，","en":"However, of the twenty-four maids present, all wore either gold or jade, meaning the entire hall was forced to drink. Peiqiu said, \\"Fifth sister's lucky star has made the whole room drink.\\" Hongxue then drew a slip: \\"Jade hairpin sways; phoenix pair in flight.\\" The annotation read: \\"Whoever wears gold-thread soft phoenix hairpins must drink.\\" Hongxue looked carefully around"},{"paragraph":31,"mentions":1,"tokens":["佩秋"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"于是又击鼓传花，传到佩秋的燕国，数骰子是金凤出马，为荆轲。那边数到了红玉，是吕不韦。荆轲行的是投壶令。浣兰道：「这令大约没有笑话了。」金凤投了一枝苏秦背剑，红玉投了一枝姜公钓鱼，那两枝都没有中，各人饮了两杯。转到红莲的田光出来，是个哑口令。各出一指，如大指为金，食指为木，中","en":"Then the drum beat and the flower passed again, coming round to Peiqiu's kingdom of Yan. The dice count sent Jinfeng forth as Jing Ke, while on the other side the count fell to Hongyu, as Lü Buwei. Jing Ke's appointed game was pitch-pot. Huanlan said, \\"This game, at least, should yield no jokes.\\" Jinfeng threw a shaft in"},{"paragraph":33,"mentions":1,"tokens":["佩秋"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"候的都喝一杯。」红玉两手齐出，是一个食指，两个小指，红娟出了一个小指，是一百三极，凑成了玉鲫鱼背，又是一百贺。佩秋道：「这酒实在消得多，不论多少总通场一杯罢。」于是又通贺了一杯。红娟出了两个大指，一个食指，红玉出了一个大指，又凑成了三赏一百，是个花兜肚，是十二贺。绮香等各饮一杯，红玉饮了两杯，红娟饮了三杯。这一回，通计喝了一百七十二杯酒。","en":"little finger: 'a hundred with three extremes,' completing the Jade Carp's Back, worth another hundred toasts. Peiqiu said, \\"This wine truly mounts up; whatever the count, let the whole company drink one cup and be done.\\" So another general toast was drunk. Hongjuan put out two thumbs and a forefinger, and Hongyu put out one thumb, making 'three rewards and a hundred'—the"},{"paragraph":48,"mentions":1,"tokens":["佩秋"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"非但与你主人争气，且与我等报仇。」浣香道：「这闷雷、劈雷是可以乱打的，你也不必容情，连他们的国王也可打得的。」佩秋道：「你若像了秋莲的廉颇，就不好了。」紫烟道：「也不要像我们荆轲的匕首。」你一句，我一句的说笑。绮香笑道：「谅此孤军深入重地，焉有生还之理？」便命六人一齐上前，与青琴对敌。","en":"avenge us all.\\" Huanxiang urged, \\"Dull and split thunder may strike wildly. Do not spare them—not even their king.\\" Peiqiu warned, \\"Do not be Qiulian's Lian Po.\\" Ziyan chimed in, \\"Nor our Jing Ke's dagger.\\" Banter flew across the room. Qixiang laughed heartily, \\"This lone army, deep in enemy land—can it possibly return alive?\\" She confidently ordered six of her maids forward"},{"paragraph":51,"mentions":1,"tokens":["佩秋"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"众姐妹方携着手，就近到了春风沉醉轩坐下。群婢也都来了，煮茗清谈了一会，已点上灯。紫烟要打马吊，便拉了蓉华、佩秋二人打起马吊来。琼华看见有一匣诗牌，便与绮香、浣兰三人在一桌打了一副，足足打到二更后，琼华方成了一首七律，绮香差了一韵斗不成。浣兰牌起得不好，尚差了十数字，琼华将牌摊出，那边蓉华等也过来看时，只见斗的是：","en":"brewing tea and talking until the lamps were finally lit. Ziyan wanted to play ma-diao and pulled Ronghua and Peiqiu into a game. Qionghua spotted a box of poetry cards and played a hand with Qixiang and Huanlan until past the second watch. Qionghua completed one beautifully regulated octet; Qixiang missed one rhyme and could not finish; Huanlan's draw was poor and"}]}`),"char-89":JSON.parse(`{"1":[{"paragraph":45,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蓉华"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"同到内里去见了表舅母陆氏夫人。这夫人已是文辉续娶的了，今年才四十岁。又见了王恂的妻室孙氏，那是表嫂。仲清的妻室蓉华，那是表姊。还有个琼华小姐没有出来，因听得他父亲前日说那子玉的好处，其口风似要与他联姻的话，所以不肯出来见这表兄了。陆夫人见子玉，真是见一回爱一回，留他坐了，问了一会家常话，子玉告退。","en":"only forty years old this year. He also greeted Wang Xun's wife, Lady Sun, his cousin-in-law. Zhongqing's wife, Ronghua, was his older female cousin. There was also a Miss Qionghua who did not come out to meet him; having heard her father praise Ziyu's qualities a few days prior, and sensing his tone suggested arranging a marriage between them, she felt shy and refused"}],"2":[{"paragraph":24,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蓉华"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"且说仲清到自己房中吃了饭，与其妻室蓉华讲了些话，来到王恂书斋，恰值王恂才回。刚说得一两句话，有王恂两个内舅前来看望：一个叫孙嗣徽，一个叫孙嗣元，本是王文辉同乡同年孙亮功部郎之子。这嗣徽、嗣元两个，真所谓难兄难弟。","en":"Meanwhile, Zhongqing had returned to his own quarters for a meal and conversed briefly with his wife, Ronghua, before heading to Wang Xun's study, arriving just as Wang Xun returned. They had barely exchanged a few words when two of Wang Xun's brothers-in-law arrived to pay a visit. One was named Sun Sihui, the other Sun Siyuan, both sons of Ministry Director"}],"6":[{"paragraph":10,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蓉华"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"的人，尚觉丰采如仙，其面貌与子玉彷佛。颜夫人见琼华小姐更觉生得好了，清如浣雪，秀若餐霞，疑不食人间烟火食者。而蓉华小姐朗润清华，外妍内秀。那个孙氏少奶奶佩秋，媚妍婉妙，和顺如春。两夫人见过了礼，然后两位少奶奶、一位姑娘，齐齐的拜见了颜夫人，各叙了些寒温。陆夫人问起子玉来，颜夫人说他父亲带他出门去了，琼华小姐心里始觉安稳。忽见仆妇报导：「孙家太太与少奶奶到。颜夫人","en":"fallen snow, as ethereal as one nourished by rosy dawn clouds, seemingly unburdened by mortal sustenance. Miss Ronghua, meanwhile, was luminous and bright, displaying an exquisite blend of outward beauty and inner refinement. The young mistress of the Sun household, Peiqiu, was charming, graceful, and gentle as spring. After the two noble ladies exchanged formal pleasantries,"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蓉华"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"除下钗子又不好，低了头，双波溶溶，几乎要羞得哭出来。他的母亲与颜夫人看了，皆微微的含笑，众少奶奶也都笑盈盈的。蓉华见妹子着实为难，便拉着他到阑干外看花，又到别处屋子里去逛，众少奶奶一齐跟着去了。亮功的夫人道：「我这个媒做得好么，你们两亲家，都应感激我，真个是郎才女貌，分毫不差。比不得我们那三个废物，两个废男，已经害了两位姑娘，还有个废女在家，难道也能害人么？这也","en":"embarrassment. Her mother and Lady Yan offered gentle smiles, while the young mistresses shared knowing grins. Ronghua, seeing her younger sister in such distress, took her hand and led her outside the balustrade to admire the flowers, continuing their stroll through the other rooms. The young mistresses followed. Lianggong's wife said, \\"Did I not play the matchmaker"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蓉华"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"便拉孙氏少奶奶同看道：「姑奶奶你看这画，画得好么？」孙氏少奶奶一笑道：「这个就是我们将来的二姑爷，真画得像。」蓉华与沈氏少奶奶都来看子玉的小照，惟有琼华不来，独自走到书桌边。随手将书一翻，见有一张花笺，写着几首七言绝句，题是《车中人》，像是见美人而有所思。看到第三首末句，是押的琼字韵，用的是仙女许飞琼；第四首末句是押的华字韵，用的是仙女阮凌华。","en":"mistress, née Sun, smiled and replied, \\"That is our future second brother-in-law—a truly remarkable likeness.\\" Ronghua and the young mistress, née Shen, gathered to admire Ziyu's portrait, but Qionghua refused to approach, wandering alone to the writing desk. Idly flipping through a book, she discovered a leaf of floral-patterned stationery inscribed with several seven-character"}],"52":[{"paragraph":22,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蓉华"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"日，苏夫人请了他大姑奶奶浣香与徐子云夫人袁绮香去陪新，吃扶头卯酒。田太夫人请了王文辉的陆氏夫人，带了他大姑奶奶蓉华并媳妇孙少奶奶佩秋，又请刘守正的夫人，没有来，他媳妇吴少奶奶紫烟来了。周锡爵、杨方猷、陆宗沅的夫人都辞了。","en":"in the morning wine. Old Madam Tian invited Wang Wenhui's wife, Madam Lu, who brought along her elder daughter Ronghua and her daughter-in-law, Madam Sun Peiqiu. She also invited the wife of Liu Shouzheng, who could not attend, though her daughter-in-law, Madam Wu Ziyan, came in her stead. The wives of Zhou Xijue, Yang Fangyou, and Lu Zongyuan all politely declined."},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蓉华"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，省得田老太太走来走去的费事。」田老夫人满面笑容，站起来说道：「若得姑奶奶张罗，就妙极的了。」说罢便福了两福，蓉华连忙还礼。陆夫人道：「太太实在多礼，小孩子也当得起你这么着？他们姐妹聚会还高兴不过，只怕你老人家过去，倒拘束了他们。」田老夫人见新妇这般天姿国色，不觉喜动颜开。再看华夫人，真是同胞姊妹，一样娇柔，分不出次第来。看他们二人，倒像在那里见过的一般，想不出","en":"Madam Tian, \\"Madam, there is no need for you to run back and forth to attend to us over here.\\" She then turned to Ronghua and said, \\"You act as host on that side, to spare Old Madam Tian the trouble of walking back and forth.\\" Old Madam Tian, her face wreathed in smiles, stood up and said, \\"If you would be so kind as to host, that would be wonderful.\\" With that, she offered"}],"54":[{"paragraph":5,"mentions":2,"tokens":["蓉华"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一日，王恂的妻子孙佩秋与仲清的妻子蓉华，到琼华房里来贺喜，蓉华道：「妹夫恭喜，压倒了天下英才。如今是玉堂金马，才子神仙，比今科鼎甲还要体面了好些，这是妹妹的福气，我如何比得上来？」佩秋讲道：「二姑爷真是天下第一个才子，我听这些赴考宏词，从前中过鼎甲，点过翰林的也有在内，也考不过二姑爷。二","en":"One day Sun Peiqiu, Wang Xun's wife, and Ronghua, Zhongqing's wife, came to Qionghua's room to offer their congratulations. Ronghua said, \\"Joy to you, little sister! Your husband-to-be has borne down all the finest talents under heaven. Now he belongs to the Jade Hall and Golden Horse Gate—a gifted"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":4,"tokens":["蓉华"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"蓉华见他妆台上摆设得甚是精雅，见桌上有一本诗集，蓉华翻看时，是南海杜军门浣白夫人的诗草，蓉华道：「这浣白夫人诗怎样？」琼华道：「诗也做得好，就是不脱闺门气，无甚体裁。」蓉华道：「你看那些题词呢，要算谁的好？」琼华道：「那瑶因女史十首七绝，就做得好。还有那","en":"Ronghua saw that every object upon her dressing table was arranged with exquisite taste. Noticing a poetry collection there, she leafed through it and found it was the verse manuscript of Lady Huanbai, wife of Commander Du of Nanhai. \\"What do you think of Lady"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":3,"tokens":["蓉华"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"蓉华道：「这两人我七月内都曾会过，有他们的诗么？我前日倒没有细看。」琼华翻了出来，蓉华看了道：「果然。这浣香、浣兰是苏年伯苏侯的女儿，浣香嫁与华家，浣兰就是田春帆新娶的夫人。这两姊妹真是才貌双全，世间少有的。」琼华道：「就是他们么？怪不得母亲回来这么夸奖","en":"\\"I met them both in the seventh month,\\" said Ronghua. \\"Are their poems here? I did not look closely the other day.\\" Qionghua turned them up, and after reading Ronghua exclaimed, \\"They are excellent indeed. Huanxiang and Huanlan are the daughters of our old family friend, the Marquis of Su. Huanxiang married"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":4,"tokens":["蓉华"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"蓉华道：「刘大嫂呢？」佩秋道：「刘大嫂倒像碧桃花儿似的。」琼华笑道：「刘大嫂小小巧巧，绝像樱桃花。他又会笑，又像含笑花。这个人最有趣的。」又问蓉华道：「那浣白夫人诗你题没有？我打算也要题一首。」蓉华道：「我实在心绪不佳，做出来也是不好，不如藏拙为妙。你是","en":"\\"And Mistress Liu?\\" Ronghua asked. \\"She is rather like a blossom on the green peach,\\" said Peiqiu. Qionghua laughed. \\"Mistress Liu is so small and dainty that she is exactly like cherry blossom. And since she is forever smiling, she resembles the smiling magnolia too. She is the"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":2,"tokens":["蓉华"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"蓉华道：「你是不肯做，做了又不肯给人看。前日你的《七夕》诗，我就看得很好。为何有这样诗才，要秘不示人呢？」佩秋笑道：「我何曾做什么《七夕》诗？你从何处看来？」蓉华道：「我听哥哥念的，还赞得了不得，这是谁做的呢？」佩秋笑道：「或者就是你哥哥做的，做得不好，","en":"\\"You simply refuse to write,\\" said Ronghua, \\"and when you do, you refuse to let anyone see it. I thought your poem for the *Double Seventh Festival* excellent. Why possess such a gift and keep it hidden from the world?\\" Peiqiu laughed. \\"When did I ever write a *Double Seventh Festival* poem?"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蓉华"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"蓉华道：「你喜欢，我也喜欢些。五古如孟郊之「慈母手中线，游子身上衣」，杜工部之「侍婢卖珠回，牵萝补茅屋」，写得这般沉痛。七古如李太白之《长相思》、《行路难》、《金陵酒肆》，岑参之《走马行》，杜少陵之《古柏行》、《公孙大娘舞剑器》，韩昌黎之《石鼓歌》，李义","en":"Ronghua said, \\"If you like them, then so do I. In the five-character ancient style there is Meng Jiao's 'The thread in the loving mother's hand, the coat on the wandering son's back,' and Du Fu's 'The waiting-maid comes back from selling her pearls, and drags"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蓉华"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"蓉华道：「你真论诗真切，将这些议论倒可以做一本诗话出来。」佩秋道：「我也看得出，却论不出来，说不真，说不透，倒教人驳起来。」琼华道：「五律自然以真挚为贵，其余写景写情总也容易，如杜少陵之：","en":"Ronghua praised her criticism as exact and said these ideas could form a proper poetry notebook. Peiqiu said she sensed such things too but could not articulate them with precision and feared rebuttal. Qionghua said, \\"For five-character regulated verse, profound"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蓉华"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"分为千里雁，辞根散作九秋蓬。\\n共看明月应垂泪，一夜乡心五处同。\\n这纯是血性语，几于天籁。香山诗当以此为第一。」蓉华道：「此是遭遇使然，所以人说穷而后工。」琼华道：「穷而后工也是有的。然后人未尝无此流离之苦，他却不能如此写，倒不写真情，要写虚景，将些凄风苦雨，和在里面，虽也动人，究竟是虚话，何能如此篇字字真切。」佩秋笑道：「我就不喜欢这等诗，若学了他，不是成了白话","en":"places.\\"\\nShe called this pure blood-and-bone language, bordering on natural divine sound, and Bai's finest poem. Ronghua said this proved the saying that \\"adversity makes the poet.\\" Qionghua agreed that misfortune helped, but added that many had been exiled yet could not write with such truth, instead turning out mere ornate scenes and stock phrases about the weather and"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":2,"tokens":["蓉华"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"玉楼天半起笙歌，风送宫嫔笑语和。\\n月殿影开闻夜漏，水晶帘卷近秋河。\\n字字如花瓣露珠一样，你说可爱不可爱？」蓉华道：「被你批了出来，真觉得醒眼些。你看那些诗，首首是好的，也有可议处没有呢？」琼华道：「那我不敢。我是什么人，敢议唐贤，不要教人笑我骂我么？」蓉华道：「这是我们的私见，有谁知道？」琼华道：「若说可议处也有呢，我就要议那诗祖宗那一首，少陵《梦太白》诗云","en":"rolled up close to the Autumn River.\\"\\n\\"Every word is like a petal or a dewdrop—wouldn't you say that is lovely?\\" Ronghua said that having it pointed out made her eyes open wider. \\"Looking at all these poems, every one is excellent—but do they have points you would criticize too?\\" Qionghua replied, \\"Oh, I wouldn't dare. Who am I to criticize the Tang sages? People would"},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蓉华"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"在罗网，何以有羽翼。\\n落月满屋梁，犹疑照颜色。\\n如此径住。那「水深波浪阔，无使蛟龙得」也不要，倒觉含蓄不尽。」蓉华、佩秋都笑道：「真的，删了倒好。那个枫林青、关塞黑，真有些鬼气。这是你的卓见。还有什么可议的么？」琼华道：「还有僧皎然《访陆鸿渐》那一首，古不像古，律不像律，不知选家何意。其诗云：","en":"waves are wide, / Do not let the water-dragons get you,' the poem would feel endlessly suggestive and implicit.\\" Ronghua and Peiqiu both laughed and agreed. \\"Truly, deleting them would be better! That green maple forest and dark pass really have a ghostly chill. What excellent insight! Are there any others to critique?\\" Qionghua said, \\"There is also the monk Jiaoran's"},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":2,"tokens":["蓉华"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"秋道：「二姑娘从前那些诗，我见你还要叫你哥哥改。不是我说，你哥倒未必做得出来。若做得出来，不至三场就被贴了。」蓉华笑道：「这句话给哥哥听见，他是要不依你的。」佩秋笑道：「我是没有学过做诗，但我前日听他们说杜少陵的《北征》、韩昌黎的《南山》，我将他翻出来看时，用的都是险韵。二位姑娘，我倒考你一考罢，你们说《北征》多少韵？」蓉华笑道：「这倒被你考倒了，你是数了来难人","en":"could very likely not have written them. If he could, he would not have been struck off after three sessions.\\" Ronghua laughed. \\"If our brother heard that he would not let you off.\\"\\n\\nPeiqiu laughed. \\"I have never learned to write verse. But the other day I heard them talking of Du Fu's *Northern Expedition* and Han Yu's *South Mountain*, and I looked them out and found"},{"paragraph":34,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蓉华"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"几日休练卒」之「卒」，乃是兵卒。「潼关百万师，往者散何卒」，此「卒」字，读促音，乃散何卒然之速也，韵本两收。」蓉华道：「妹妹实在好记性。我只记得几句，最佳的是「瘦妻面复光，痴女发自栉」，还「不闻夏殷衰，中自诛褒妲」，归美明皇，其意正大，不高于刘禹锡之「官军诛佞幸，天子舍妖姬」，白乐天之「六师不发无奈何，宛转蛾眉马前死」么？至于《南山》诗，我虽看过，但一句也不记得","en":"vanguard scattered!' the 卒 is read cu, and means how abruptly they scattered. The rhyme books take it under both.\\"\\n\\nRonghua said, \\"Sister, what a memory you have. I remember only a few lines. The finest are 'My thin wife's face has its light again; my foolish daughter combs her own hair,' and 'You do not hear that when Xia and Yin declined it was from within that Bao and"},{"paragraph":35,"mentions":2,"tokens":["蓉华"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，音嗅字。你不记得「因缘窥其湫，凝湛閟阴兽。」注：兽，畜产也。大约也是蛟龙所生的子，如虫的子为虾一样的光景。」蓉华道：「可惜你不能去考，你若去考时，倒是必取的。这些诗都能这么烂熟，真是亏你。」琼华笑道：「我却倒是因出了这两个题目，新近才看熟的。」蓉华道：「你拿那《南山》诗来给我瞧瞧。」","en":"most likely the offspring of a dragon, much as the spawn of an insect is a shrimp — something of that nature.\\" Ronghua said: \\"What a pity you cannot sit for the examination — if you could, you would certainly pass. To have all these poems so perfectly committed to memory is truly remarkable.\\" Qionghua laughed: \\"On the contrary, it was only because these two topics were"},{"paragraph":36,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蓉华"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琼华找了出来，蓉华看了两句，数了一数，问琼华道：「第七韵是什么字？」琼华笑道：「那里有这种问法？就算熟极的，也不能记得第几韵是什么字。等我数下去。」即一韵一韵的念出来，笑道：「是瘦字。」佩秋道：「这实在难为他了，背得这么熟，想姑娘和韵是必定和得出来的。」琼华道：「这一","en":"Qionghua fetched it out. Ronghua read a couple of lines, counted, and asked, \\"Which character is the seventh rhyme?\\" Qionghua laughed. \\"Whoever asks a thing that way? However well one knows it by heart, one cannot say which number rhyme is which character. Let me count down to it.\\""},{"paragraph":37,"mentions":2,"tokens":["蓉华"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"蓉华笑起来。琼华更觉含羞，停了一停，说道：「想是我哥哥跪过的。」佩秋笑道：「可惜我不配，若配时，你哥哥自然也要跪了。」蓉华道：「日子快了，我们姐妹也不能常在一处了。妹妹是个有福气的，不比我们。」又说道：「看看你外甥再来。」便出去了，佩秋也同了出去。琼华暗","en":"Ronghua laughed. Qionghua blushed the harder, paused, and said, \\"I suppose my brother has knelt for it before now.\\" Peiqiu laughed. \\"A pity I am not worth it. If I were, your brother would kneel too.\\"\\n\\nRonghua said, \\"The day is close, and we sisters shall not"},{"paragraph":38,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蓉华"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"也不像那梦中措大的光景。若像那梦中光景，岂不要将个琼华小姐气死了么？明日也请了袁绮香、苏浣香、浣兰、吴紫烟、王蓉华、孙佩秋来陪新人，群仙高会，又叙了一日。华夫人因是父亲得意门生，又是年伯母来请他，所以欣然而来。至排场热闹，与田家一样，不能细述。以后子玉闺房之乐，真是乐不可言。一个仕女班头，一个才人魁首，或早起看花，或迟眠玩月，或分题拈韵，或论古辨疑，成了个闺房良","en":"that dream become reality, Qionghua would have died of outrage. Next day Yuan Qixiang, Huanxiang, Huanlan, Ziyan, Ronghua, and Peiqiu came to accompany the bride—a gathering of near-immortals that lasted another full day. Lady Hua came gladly because Ziyu was her father's prized disciple and Lady Yan had invited her personally. The scale and excitement matched the Tian"}],"57":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蓉华"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"绣口锦心，才能咏絮。于十月初十日，请了华公子的夫人苏浣香、田春航的夫人浣兰、刘文泽的夫人吴紫烟、颜仲清的夫人王蓉华、梅子玉的夫人琼华、王恂的夫人孙佩秋。此时园中菊花开满，五色斑烂。是日晴光和蔼，风不扬尘，小毛衣服都用不着，绵的尽够了。袁绮香一早带了十二红婢，还有几个家人媳妇，先到园里候客。那日次贤、高品、南湘皆回避了。那十二红都是十五六岁，有的已是云鬓堆鸦，有的","en":"Gongzi's wife, Su Huanxiang; Tian Chunhang's wife, Huanlan; Liu Wenze's wife, Wu Ziyan; Yan Zhongqing's wife, Wang Ronghua; Mei Ziyu's wife, Qionghua; and Wang Xun's wife, Sun Peiqiu. By this time, the garden's chrysanthemums were in full bloom, a brilliant tapestry of five colors. The day's sunlight was gentle, the wind stirred no dust, and light fur garments were unneeded"},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":2,"tokens":["蓉华"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"仆妇、丫鬟随在后头。绮香一一迎接，见琼华打扮，今日分外妖艳，比陪新那一日，更添了几分娇娆姽婳。众姊妹序齿坐下，蓉华道：「我等二妹来，就等了多时，只道客已到齐了，谁知苏家二位还没有来。」绮香道：「蓉妹、佩妹为什么不把侄儿带了来？」蓉华道：「孩子们怕见生人，一见就哭，所以没有带来。」因问道：「怎么也不把侄儿、侄女带过来顽顽？」绮香道：「你侄儿感冒才好，恐过来又冒了风","en":"graceful charm than on the day she visited after her wedding. The sisters seated themselves according to age. Ronghua said, \\"We waited a very long time for our second sister. We thought every guest had already arrived, yet the two Su ladies are still not here.\\" Qixiang asked, \\"Rong-mei, Pei-mei, why didn't you bring the little boys?\\" Ronghua replied, \\"The children are"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蓉华"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"袁绮香接下台阶，苏氏姊妹笑盈盈的上前见礼，然后与佩秋、紫烟、蓉华、琼华都见了，各人挽着手，喜笑颜开，叙了一番。","en":"The Su sisters stepped forward with radiant smiles and curtsied, then exchanged greetings with Peiqiu, Ziyan, Ronghua, and Qionghua. Each took another's arm, their faces bright with joy, and they conversed warmly for a while."},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":2,"tokens":["蓉华"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"么行？大姑娘已改了大奶奶，你如今就想改大太太么？」说得众人笑了。序齿袁绮香二十五岁，吴紫烟二十三岁，孙佩秋、王蓉华皆二十二岁，苏浣香二十一，浣兰十九，王琼华十八居末。绮香命丫鬟们焚了一炉百和香，铺了一条大锦毯，七美顺着年次团团的拜了一拜，珠珞垂肩，云裳贴地，甚是好看。嗣后七美中称呼绮香为大姐，琼华为七妹，紫烟行二，佩秋行三，蓉华行四，浣香行五，浣兰行六，依次而坐","en":"Everyone burst into laughter. Ranked by age: Yuan Qixiang was twenty-five; Wu Ziyan twenty-three; Sun Peiqiu and Wang Ronghua both twenty-two; Su Huanxiang twenty-one; Huanlan nineteen; and Wang Qionghua, at eighteen, was the youngest. Qixiang had the maids burn a censer of hundred-blend incense and spread a large brocade carpet. The seven beauties bowed in a circle according"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蓉华"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"：「极高的所在，除非上山不可，但恐难走。」紫烟道：「我听说这园里有个缥缈亭是最高的，我们就到那缥缈亭上去罢。」蓉华道：「据我想，登山不如临水，且闻得路路走得通的。不如坐个船游他一转，望着那些景致，似乎比岸上还好些。」佩秋道：「说得是，又省力。若上山去，只怕也走乏了，还能游么？」绮香道：「既是这样，我们到吟秋榭顶上去，也望得个全景，就在那里坐罢。」于是一群粉黛，都","en":"difficult.\\" Ziyan suggested, \\"I hear there is a Pimiao Pavilion that is the absolute highest point. Let us go there.\\" Ronghua countered, \\"In my opinion, facing the water is better than climbing a mountain, and I hear that every path connects by boat. It would be better to take a boat around once. The views from the water seem even finer than those from the shore.\\" Peiqiu agreed,"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蓉华"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"到了吟秋榭，将三层游览过了，在第二层设了筵宴。众佳人酒量虽不算好，却也能饮几杯，最大者为吴紫烟、王蓉华。","en":"for wine was modest, yet each could manage a few cups. The strongest drinkers among them were Wu Ziyan and Wang Ronghua."},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蓉华"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"热闹，不论多少人，都放得进去。」浣香笑道：「这么说来，竟不是个酒令，是个阵图了。」绮香道：「却也有阵图在内。」蓉华道：「你且说这个令是怎样的？若要人多也不难，我们带着这些女兵，都叫过来，也就不少了。」","en":"a wine game at all—it is a battle chart!\\" Qixiang smiled, \\"There is indeed something of a battle chart to it.\\" Ronghua urged, \\"Tell us how this game works. If we need more people, we can easily call up all these 'soldier girls' of ours, and we will have plenty.\\""},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":3,"tokens":["蓉华"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"了。浣兰的四个丫鬟，只点了一个小翠，才十三岁，生得很好，且又灵变。又点了许三姐。琼华的四个丫头，点了一个青琴。蓉华两个丫头，点了一个秋莲。紫烟两个丫头，点了一个侍香。佩秋两个丫头，点了一个金凤。共二十四人。其余都命他们代酒。绮香即命拿过筹来，先是七人掣了，顺着年齿掣去，绮得掣着秦，紫烟掣着楚，佩秋掣着燕，蓉华掣着赵，浣香掣着魏，浣兰掣着齐，琼华掣着韩。浣香道：「","en":"and quick-witted thirteen-year-old, along with Miss Xu Sanjie. From Qionghua's four maids, Qingqin was chosen. Ronghua picked Qiulian from her two maids. Ziyan selected Shixiang. Peiqiu chose Jinfeng. In total, there were twenty-four capable maids; the rest were ordered to drink on behalf of others when necessary. Qixiang then had the lots brought out. The seven mistresses"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蓉华"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"宝珠、明珠、掌珠，浣兰留了许三姐、小翠，要了荷珠，紫烟留了侍香，要了红薇、赠珠，佩秋留了金凤，要了红莲、红娟，蓉华留了秋莲，要了红雯、画珠，琼华留了青琴，要了珍珠、蕊珠。","en":"kept Shixiang, taking Hongwei and Zengzhu to fill her ranks. Peiqiu kept Jinfeng and added Honglian and Hongjuan. Ronghua retained Qiulian, bringing in Hongwen and Yazhu. Finally, Qionghua kept Qingqin and rounded out her forces with Zhenzhu and Ruizhu."},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":3,"tokens":["蓉华"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"骏马。佩秋道：「也不好，究竟是个不祥之兆。」蓉花笑道：「尚未出兵，倒已先砍了两个脑袋。」众人皆笑，又收过了。取蓉华的赵国来，秋莲掣了廉颇，画珠掣了蔺相如，红雯掣了平原君。蓉华道：「我这三根掣得好，大可折秦国的锐气。」再掣浣香的魏国，宝珠掣了信陵君，明珠掣了侯生，掌珠掣了醇酒妇人，大家又笑起来。绮香道：「这倒难，又算酒，又算妇人，横竖一出马，就叫人开心的。」掌珠道","en":"Honglian drew Tian Guang, and Hongjuan drew a fine horse. Peiqiu sighed, \\"Not good. It feels ominous all the same.\\" Ronghua teased, \\"Before the army even marches, you have already lost two heads!\\" Laughter erupted again, and the tube was put away. For Zhao, Qiulian drew Lian Po, Yazhu drew Lin Xiangru, and Hongwen drew Lord Pingyuan. Ronghua beamed, \\"My three draws are excellent;"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":2,"tokens":["蓉华"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"。若看了，必惹得他们这个喜欢，那个发气，莫如定了人再看。」于是折了枝菊花来，命小丫鬟点鼓，到了蓉花，鼓已住了。蓉华笑道：「我这三员勇将正好出这个头阵，试试手段。」秋莲、画珠，红雯三个就上来，旁边又摆了一桌酒肴。秋莲把两个骰子一掷，掷了四点，是自己出马。秦国的爱珠、花珠、红香、红玉、红雪、红霙也过来。爱珠把骰子一掷，掷了二点，是花珠出马。花珠是商君，秋莲是廉颇。绮","en":"off a chrysanthemum branch and had a young maid beat the drum. The flower was passed around, and when it reached Ronghua, the drum abruptly stopped. Ronghua laughed confidently, \\"My three champions are perfectly fit to lead the vanguard and demonstrate their skill.\\" Qiulian, Yazhu, and Hongwen stepped forward to the staging area, where another table filled with wine and"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":4,"tokens":["蓉华"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"蓉华道：「好个廉颇，头一阵就打了败仗。」秋莲想跑开，被爱珠、花珠赶上，捉了过来，戴上假须，飘飘漾漾的。众婢女把他形容个淋漓尽致，罚了一杯酒，又盛了一碗饭要他吃。秋莲笑道：「你们也有良心，戴上这个东西，怎样吃得饭来？除非要用金钩挂胡子法子。」红雪道：「有钩","en":"Ronghua sighed playfully, \\"Brave Lian Po, the very first battle is lost.\\" Qiulian attempted to flee, but Aizhu and Huazhu swiftly caught her and tied on the false white whiskers, which fluttered comically in the air. The maids vividly painted the scene, fining"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蓉华"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，惹得众佳人又笑，他自己也笑起来，越笑越颤。绮香道：「看来这个鸡爪风更不济事，蓉妹不如带了他们来跪献三杯罢。」蓉华笑道：「尚可背城一战。」两人将线交了一回，红雯也赢了一次，只打了两下手，喝了两小杯，余请旁人代了。","en":"simply not do. Rongmei, perhaps you should just kneel with your troops and offer the three cups of surrender.\\" Ronghua laughed stubbornly, \\"We can still fight with our backs to the wall!\\" They crossed the string for a round, and miraculously, Hongwen managed to win one turn. She endured only two light hand-slaps and drank two small cups, while others graciously drank"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":2,"tokens":["蓉华"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"绮香笑向蓉华道：「你三将出马，败了八阵，虽不算全军覆没，也不过一息尚存。你看谱上：「如九阵中只胜一阵者，虽免跪献之辱，也须领队前来纳降。」蓉华笑道：「这也不难。」便斟了一杯酒，走到绮香面前福了一福，绮香也还了一礼，笑而受之。那画珠、秋莲、红雯，只得也向花珠万福。","en":"Qixiang smiled at Ronghua and said, \\"Your three generals have taken the field and lost eight rounds. While it is not quite a total rout, you are certainly on your last gasp. Look at the rule book: 'If, out of nine rounds, you win only one, you escape the humiliation of a kneeling"},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蓉华"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"。如彼出两手三指，此出一手二指，成了色样，是归出两手家。总以少数凑成多数，余皆仿此。所贺之酒，数多则通场分喝。蓉华道：「这个酒了不得，若照贺例喝酒，譬如要一百贺的，难道也贺一百杯不成？」绮香道：「一百杯也不多，我们现在有三十余人，一家不过分得三杯酒，怕什么？」","en":"for the larger, and so on throughout. When the toasts to be drunk grew numerous, the whole company divided them. Ronghua said, \\"This wine is no trifle. If we drink by the congratulation schedule—say a pattern worth a hundred toasts—surely we are not to drink a hundred cups?\\" Qixiang said, \\"A hundred cups is not so many. There are more than thirty of us here now; each would"},{"paragraph":48,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蓉华"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"只剩了一个青琴是博浪椎，谱上是：打擂有闷雷、劈雷，是打秦国通国中人马。琼华道：「就要看这一将成功了。」蓉华道：「琴儿，你须与主人争个脸。」青琴笑道：「我这椎是要椎椎打中的。」浣兰道：「你若赢了他们，非但与你主人争气，且与我等报仇。」浣香道：「这闷雷、劈雷是可以乱打的，你也不必容情，连他们的国王也可打得的。」佩秋道：「你若像了秋莲的廉颇，就不好了。」紫烟道","en":"'split thunder'—you may strike anyone in Qin, even the king.\\" Qionghua commanded, \\"This general must succeed.\\" Ronghua cheered, \\"Qin'er, win honor for your mistress!\\" Qingqin smiled confidently, \\"My hammer strikes true with every swing.\\" Huanlan added, \\"Beat them, and you avenge us all.\\" Huanxiang urged, \\"Dull and split thunder may strike wildly. Do not spare them—not"},{"paragraph":51,"mentions":2,"tokens":["蓉华"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"众姐妹方携着手，就近到了春风沉醉轩坐下。群婢也都来了，煮茗清谈了一会，已点上灯。紫烟要打马吊，便拉了蓉华、佩秋二人打起马吊来。琼华看见有一匣诗牌，便与绮香、浣兰三人在一桌打了一副，足足打到二更后，琼华方成了一首七律，绮香差了一韵斗不成。浣兰牌起得不好，尚差了十数字，琼华将牌摊出，那边蓉华等也过来看时，只见斗的是：","en":"maids followed, brewing tea and talking until the lamps were finally lit. Ziyan wanted to play ma-diao and pulled Ronghua and Peiqiu into a game. Qionghua spotted a box of poetry cards and played a hand with Qixiang and Huanlan until past the second watch. Qionghua completed one beautifully regulated octet; Qixiang missed one rhyme and could not finish; Huanlan's draw was"},{"paragraph":52,"mentions":1,"tokens":["蓉华"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「我最爱是：「任说朝朝依玉树，终应步步让金莲」这一联，为我辈闺阁吐气。不然，这个园几成了那几个名旦的梨园了。」蓉华道：「姐姐，那几个名旦你见过没有？闻得二哥天天带他们在园里。」绮香道：「若说这几个名旦，倒也生得很好，我也只见过五六个，到年节下，他们也过来贺节。不是我说，我们今日这一班人，倒有几个像他们。」这句话，就有紫烟想不出是谁，其余皆听得人说过。浣兰、琼华恐","en":"our women's breath. Otherwise, this garden might have become nothing but an opera yard for those famous actors.\\" Ronghua asked, \\"Sister, have you met those actors? I hear second brother brings them here daily.\\" Qixiang replied, \\"Those dan are handsome enough. I have seen five or six of them; at festivals, they come to pay their respects. Not to boast, but several among"}]}`),"char-90":JSON.parse(`{"1":[{"paragraph":45,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琼华"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"氏夫人。这夫人已是文辉续娶的了，今年才四十岁。又见了王恂的妻室孙氏，那是表嫂。仲清的妻室蓉华，那是表姊。还有个琼华小姐没有出来，因听得他父亲前日说那子玉的好处，其口风似要与他联姻的话，所以不肯出来见这表兄了。陆夫人见子玉，真是见一回爱一回，留他坐了，问了一会家常话，子玉告退。","en":"wife, Lady Sun, his cousin-in-law. Zhongqing's wife, Ronghua, was his older female cousin. There was also a Miss Qionghua who did not come out to meet him; having heard her father praise Ziyu's qualities a few days prior, and sensing his tone suggested arranging a marriage between them, she felt shy and refused to come out to meet this cousin. Lady Lu felt her affection"}],"2":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琼华"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"京者三人，余下不过此眼前数人，大约还不满四席了。」王文辉又到里头去见了颜夫人，彼此道了些家常闲话，即提起他次女琼华十六岁了，尚未字人，托士燮留心物色。士燮答应，随又说道：「择女婿也是一件难事，尽有外貌甚好，内里平常。也有小时聪明，大来变坏的。」颜夫人接口说道：「这总是各人的姻缘。非但拣女婿难，就是要替你外甥定一头亲事也是不容易的。文辉道：「要像外甥这样好的，那里","en":"inner chambers to greet Lady Yan. After exchanging familial pleasantries, he mentioned that his second daughter, Qionghua, was now sixteen and yet to be betrothed, entrusting Shixie to seek out a suitable match. Shixie agreed, yet added a caveat, \\"Choosing a son-in-law is a daunting endeavor. There are those with handsome exteriors who prove unremarkable within, equally,"}],"6":[{"paragraph":10,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琼华"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"颜夫人领着一群仆妇丫鬟迎将出来，引进了内堂。这颜夫人虽四十外的人，尚觉丰采如仙，其面貌与子玉彷佛。颜夫人见琼华小姐更觉生得好了，清如浣雪，秀若餐霞，疑不食人间烟火食者。而蓉华小姐朗润清华，外妍内秀。那个孙氏少奶奶佩秋，媚妍婉妙，和顺如春。两夫人见过了礼，然后两位少奶奶、一位姑娘，齐齐的拜见了颜夫人，各叙了些寒温。陆夫人问起子玉来，颜夫人说他父亲带他出门去了，","en":"forty, Lady Yan possessed an almost immortal grace, her features closely resembling those of Ziyu. She found Miss Qionghua increasingly radiant—as pristine as newly fallen snow, as ethereal as one nourished by rosy dawn clouds, seemingly unburdened by mortal sustenance. Miss Ronghua, meanwhile, was luminous and bright, displaying an exquisite blend of outward beauty and"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":3,"tokens":["琼华"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"夫人就对文辉的夫人拜了一拜，文辉的夫人也拜了。亮功的夫人实在爽快，将颜夫人头上仔细一看，拔下一枝玉燕钗，就走到琼华面前与他戴上，琼华两颊发頳，用手微拦。亮功的夫人笑道：「这是终身大事，不要害燥。」羞得琼华小姐置身无地，说又不好，避又不好，除下钗子又不好，低了头，双波溶溶，几乎要羞得哭出来。他的母亲与颜夫人看了，皆微微的含笑，众少奶奶也都笑盈盈的。蓉华见妹子着实为","en":"decisive, Lianggong's wife examined Lady Yan's hair, removed a jade swallow hairpin, and walked over to pin it in Qionghua's hair. Qionghua's cheeks flushed a deep crimson; she raised her hand in a gentle attempt to stop it. Lianggong's wife laughed, \\"This is the matter of a lifetime—do not be shy.\\" Mortified and unsure where to look, Qionghua could neither speak nor retreat,"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琼华"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"是最明白的，不比人家护短，就自己儿子好。也只有你妹夫才生得出这样好儿女来。」说得两位夫人皆笑。且说众少奶奶同着琼华小姐，逛到一处，是个三小间的套房，甚是精致。","en":"magnificent as these.\\" This prompted laughter from both ladies. Now, let us turn to the young mistresses and Miss Qionghua, who had wandered into a tranquil suite of three small, exquisitely refined rooms."},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琼华"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，画得好么？」孙氏少奶奶一笑道：「这个就是我们将来的二姑爷，真画得像。」蓉华与沈氏少奶奶都来看子玉的小照，惟有琼华不来，独自走到书桌边。随手将书一翻，见有一张花笺，写着几首七言绝句，题是《车中人》，像是见美人而有所思。看到第三首末句，是押的琼字韵，用的是仙女许飞琼；第四首末句是押的华字韵，用的是仙女阮凌华。","en":"truly remarkable likeness.\\" Ronghua and the young mistress, née Shen, gathered to admire Ziyu's portrait, but Qionghua refused to approach, wandering alone to the writing desk. Idly flipping through a book, she discovered a leaf of floral-patterned stationery inscribed with several seven-character quatrains titled \\"The Person in the Carriage\\"—clearly verses born of longing"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琼华"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琼华看了心里一惊，想道：这位表兄原来这般轻薄，他倒将我的名字拆开了押在韵里，适或被人见了怎好。遂趁他们在那里看画，即用指甲挖去了那两个字，脸上红红的，独自走了出去。","en":"Qionghua's heart leaped in shock. She thought, \\"Is my cousin truly so frivolous? He has fractured my very name, embedding its characters within his rhymes. What if someone were to discover this?\\" Seizing the moment while the others were absorbed by the portrait,"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琼华"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"才出来。这席分了两桌：三位夫人一桌，五位佳人一桌。席间两位陆夫人好不会讲，这边那几位少奶奶，也各兴致勃勃。唯有琼华小姐，今日心神不安，坐在席间说也不说，心里恨他的姨母将颜夫人的钗子戴在他头上，便觉得这个头，就有千斤之重，抬不起来。","en":"exceptionally engaging conversationalists, while the young mistresses sparkled with lively spirits. Only Miss Qionghua remained uneasy throughout the day, sitting quietly without uttering a word. She harbored a deep resentment toward her aunt for pinning Lady Yan's hairpin in her hair, feeling as though her head now weighed a thousand catties, unable to be lifted."}],"7":[{"paragraph":4,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琼华"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，心里定然怪我，这便怎样？我又无从与他分辩，这竟是个不白之冤。」继又想道：「既订了姻，就怪我也不妨。」子玉复因琼华两个字，触动琴官，一意缠绵，怜香慕色之心，从此而起。","en":"betrothal is settled, there's no harm even if she does blame me.\\" Ziyu was then led by the two characters of 'Qionghua' to think once more of Qinyan, becoming increasingly entangled in tender thoughts; his heart's yearning for beauty blossomed from this very moment."}],"11":[{"paragraph":33,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琼华","王琼华"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"苏小姐皆笑。苏小姐道：「姐姐说那个小才女是谁家？」袁夫人道：「这人你们不认得么？是王质夫年伯的第二个女儿，名叫琼华，我们都是世姐妹。」华夫人道：「是通政司卿那位王年伯么？我们倒没有往来过。」苏小姐道：「这王琼华怎样好呢？」袁夫人道：「他今年十七岁，相貌是没有比得上他的，与二位真可鼎足为三。我前日请他们姐妹来看灯，他在席上就成了一首《灯月词》，顷刻之间洋洋洒洒七八","en":"know her?\\" Mrs. Yuan asked in mild surprise. \\"She is the second daughter of our Senior Kinsman Wang Zhifu, named Wang Qionghua. We are all sworn sisters.\\" \\"Would that be the Senior Kinsman Wang currently serving as Supervisor of the Court of Transmission?\\" Lady Hua mused. \\"We have rarely interacted with that household.\\" \\"What manner of girl is this Wang Qionghua?\\" Miss Su pressed."}],"54":[{"paragraph":5,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琼华"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一日，王恂的妻子孙佩秋与仲清的妻子蓉华，到琼华房里来贺喜，蓉华道：「妹夫恭喜，压倒了天下英才。如今是玉堂金马，才子神仙，比今科鼎甲还要体面了好些，这是妹妹的福气，我如何比得上来？」佩秋讲道：「二姑爷真是天下第一个才子，我听这些赴考宏词，从前中过鼎甲，点过翰林的也有在内，也考不过二姑爷。二姑爷不是","en":"One day Sun Peiqiu, Wang Xun's wife, and Ronghua, Zhongqing's wife, came to Qionghua's room to offer their congratulations. Ronghua said, \\"Joy to you, little sister! Your husband-to-be has borne down all the finest talents under heaven. Now he belongs to the Jade Hall and Golden Horse Gate—a gifted scholar among immortals—and enjoys"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琼华"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"妆台上摆设得甚是精雅，见桌上有一本诗集，蓉华翻看时，是南海杜军门浣白夫人的诗草，蓉华道：「这浣白夫人诗怎样？」琼华道：「诗也做得好，就是不脱闺门气，无甚体裁。」蓉华道：「你看那些题词呢，要算谁的好？」琼华道：「那瑶因女史十首七绝，就做得好。还有那浣香、浣兰这几首七律，真是绣口锦心，香因慧果，这两人不知是那里人？」","en":"manuscript of Lady Huanbai, wife of Commander Du of Nanhai. \\"What do you think of Lady Huanbai's poems?\\" she asked. Qionghua answered, \\"They are well made, but they never quite shed the air of the inner chambers, and have little breadth of form.\\" \\"And among the prefatory verses—whose do you count best?\\" \\"The ten seven-character quatrains by the lady-scholar Yaoyin are excellent."},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琼华"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"蓉华道：「这两人我七月内都曾会过，有他们的诗么？我前日倒没有细看。」琼华翻了出来，蓉华看了道：「果然。这浣香、浣兰是苏年伯苏侯的女儿，浣香嫁与华家，浣兰就是田春帆新娶的夫人。这两姊妹真是才貌双全，世间少有的。」琼华道：「就是他们么？怪不得母亲回来这么夸奖他们。」佩秋道：「他们姊妹倒像双生似的，一模一样，比二位姑娘生得还要","en":"met them both in the seventh month,\\" said Ronghua. \\"Are their poems here? I did not look closely the other day.\\" Qionghua turned them up, and after reading Ronghua exclaimed, \\"They are excellent indeed. Huanxiang and Huanlan are the daughters of our old family friend, the Marquis of Su. Huanxiang married into the Hua family; Huanlan is Tian Chunhang's new wife. The sisters"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琼华"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"蓉华道：「刘大嫂呢？」佩秋道：「刘大嫂倒像碧桃花儿似的。」琼华笑道：「刘大嫂小小巧巧，绝像樱桃花。他又会笑，又像含笑花。这个人最有趣的。」又问蓉华道：「那浣白夫人诗你题没有？我打算也要题一首。」蓉华道：「我实在心绪不佳，做出来也是不好，不如藏拙为妙。你是题的什么？你的歌行最好，自然是长古了？」琼华笑道：「我昨日","en":"\\"And Mistress Liu?\\" Ronghua asked. \\"She is rather like a blossom on the green peach,\\" said Peiqiu. Qionghua laughed. \\"Mistress Liu is so small and dainty that she is exactly like cherry blossom. And since she is forever smiling, she resembles the smiling magnolia too. She is the most delightful person!\\" Then she asked Ronghua, \\"Did you write anything for Lady"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琼华"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"道：「我听哥哥念的，还赞得了不得，这是谁做的呢？」佩秋笑道：「或者就是你哥哥做的，做得不好，就说是我做的了。」琼华笑道：「嫂嫂，你说三百首很熟，你得意是那几首？」佩秋笑道：「我最爱念的是七绝杜牧之的几首，「折戟沉沙铁未销」，「烟笼寒水月笼沙」，「青山隐隐水迢迢」，「落魄江湖载酒行」，「银烛秋光冷画屏」，李义山之「君问归期未有期」，温飞卿之「冰簟银床梦不成」。七律","en":"measure. Who wrote it, then?\\" \\"Perhaps your brother wrote it himself, and finding it poor, said it was mine.\\" Qionghua laughed. \\"Sister-in-law, since you know the Three Hundred so well, which poems are your favorites?\\" Peiqiu answered, \\"Among seven-character quatrains I love Du Mu's 'The broken halberd, sunk in sand, has not yet rusted away,' 'Mist veils the cold stream"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琼华"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"不得意么？」佩秋道：「我也有得意的，譬如那大家的诗力量大，我就不能学他。若小巧些的，意远情长，还容易领略些。」琼华道：「《唐诗三百首》，真是全唐诗中的精液，而温李七古止载义山《韩碑》一篇，便于初学津梁。若以我看去，一诗有一诗的好处，亦不可以优劣论。但我看时人多好做七律，以其格局工整，可以写景，又可以传情，无如诗中最难学的就是他，我倒怕做，只好做七古。","en":"learn from them; the smaller, finer ones, with the meaning far off and the feeling long, are easier to take in.\\"\\n\\nQionghua said, \\"The *Three Hundred Tang Poems* is the very essence of all the Tang, and of the seven-character ancient poems of Wen and Li it prints only Shangyin's *Han Stele* — a good bridge for a beginner. But looking at them one by one, every poem has its"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琼华"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"论诗真切，将这些议论倒可以做一本诗话出来。」佩秋道：「我也看得出，却论不出来，说不真，说不透，倒教人驳起来。」琼华道：「五律自然以真挚为贵，其余写景写情总也容易，如杜少陵之：","en":"notebook. Peiqiu said she sensed such things too but could not articulate them with precision and feared rebuttal. Qionghua said, \\"For five-character regulated verse, profound sincerity is naturally most valued; describing scenes or emotions is otherwise quite easy. Take Du Fu's lines:\\""},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琼华"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，一夜乡心五处同。\\n这纯是血性语，几于天籁。香山诗当以此为第一。」蓉华道：「此是遭遇使然，所以人说穷而后工。」琼华道：「穷而后工也是有的。然后人未尝无此流离之苦，他却不能如此写，倒不写真情，要写虚景，将些凄风苦雨，和在里面，虽也动人，究竟是虚话，何能如此篇字字真切。」佩秋笑道：「我就不喜欢这等诗，若学了他，不是成了白话么？」琼华道：「诗只要好，就是白话也一样好看","en":"natural divine sound, and Bai's finest poem. Ronghua said this proved the saying that \\"adversity makes the poet.\\" Qionghua agreed that misfortune helped, but added that many had been exiled yet could not write with such truth, instead turning out mere ornate scenes and stock phrases about the weather and sorrow. Those might move someone, but next to words that rang absolutely"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琼华"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"露珠一样，你说可爱不可爱？」蓉华道：「被你批了出来，真觉得醒眼些。你看那些诗，首首是好的，也有可议处没有呢？」琼华道：「那我不敢。我是什么人，敢议唐贤，不要教人笑我骂我么？」蓉华道：「这是我们的私见，有谁知道？」琼华道：「若说可议处也有呢，我就要议那诗祖宗那一首，少陵《梦太白》诗云：","en":"open wider. \\"Looking at all these poems, every one is excellent—but do they have points you would criticize too?\\" Qionghua replied, \\"Oh, I wouldn't dare. Who am I to criticize the Tang sages? People would mock me and scold me!\\" Ronghua urged, \\"This is just our private view; who would know?\\" Qionghua said, \\"If you ask for points to criticize, then there are some. I would"},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琼华"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"不尽。」蓉华、佩秋都笑道：「真的，删了倒好。那个枫林青、关塞黑，真有些鬼气。这是你的卓见。还有什么可议的么？」琼华道：「还有僧皎然《访陆鸿渐》那一首，古不像古，律不像律，不知选家何意。其诗云：","en":"maple forest and dark pass really have a ghostly chill. What excellent insight! Are there any others to critique?\\" Qionghua said, \\"There is also the monk Jiaoran's poem *Visiting Lu Hongjian*. It is neither ancient style nor regulated verse; I do not know what the anthologists were thinking:\\""},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琼华"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琼华笑道：「单靠几句诗中用么？」佩秋道：「二姑娘从前那些诗，我见你还要叫你哥哥改。不是我说，你哥倒未必做得出来。若做得出来，不至三场就被贴了。」蓉华笑道：「这句话给哥哥听见，他是要不依你的。」佩秋笑道：「我是没有学过做诗，但我前日听他们说杜少陵的《北征》","en":"Qionghua laughed. \\"What use is a few lines of verse by themselves?\\" Peiqiu said, \\"Those poems the second young lady used to write — I saw you take them to your brother to correct. And I will say it: your brother could very likely not have written them. If he"},{"paragraph":33,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琼华"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琼华道：「《北征》好像七十韵。」佩秋道：「你记得他有几个重韵在里头？」琼华道：「若说重韵，也只有一个日字，第三韵「朝野少暇日」，与二十七韵「呕泄卧数日」，这是的的确确是重的。」佩秋笑道：「还有「往者散何卒」与「几日休练卒」，与后「佳气上金阙」，下又是「洒","en":"Qionghua said: \\"The 'Northern Expedition' has, I believe, about seventy rhymes.\\" Peiqiu said: \\"Can you recall how many repeated rhymes it contains?\\" Qionghua said: \\"As for repeated rhymes, there is only one clear case: the character 'ri' — the third rhyme, 'court"},{"paragraph":34,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琼华"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琼华道：「这不好算重，一个是阙门的阙，一个是阙略的阙，不过音同罢了，如何算得重韵？至于卒字韵更不是重。「至尊尚蒙尘，几日休练卒」之「卒」，乃是兵卒。「潼关百万师，往者散何卒」，此「卒」字，读促音，乃散何卒然之速也，韵本两收。」蓉华道：「妹妹实在好记性。我","en":"Qionghua said, \\"Those cannot count as repeats. One 阙 is the 阙 of a gate-tower, the other the 阙 of an omission — they merely sound alike; how can that be a repeated rhyme? And the 卒 rhyme is less of a repeat still. In 'The Most Honoured is still in the dust; what"},{"paragraph":35,"mentions":4,"tokens":["琼华"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琼华道：「你数错了。《南山》诗一百零二韵，内中一个重韵也没有，真与《子虚》、《上林》一样，非大力量不能。」佩秋道：「你说没有重韵，我说也有一韵，「尝升棠丘望，戢戢见相凑。」又云：「或散若瓦解，或赴若辐凑。」不是两个凑字？」琼华笑道：「你又论错了。「或赴若","en":"Qionghua said: \\"You have miscounted. The 'South Mountain' poem has one hundred and two rhymes, and among them there is not a single repeated rhyme — it is truly the equal of Sima Xiangru's *Zixu Fu* and *Shanglin Fu*, achievable only through extraordinary structural"},{"paragraph":36,"mentions":5,"tokens":["琼华"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琼华找了出来，蓉华看了两句，数了一数，问琼华道：「第七韵是什么字？」琼华笑道：「那里有这种问法？就算熟极的，也不能记得第几韵是什么字。等我数下去。」即一韵一韵的念出来，笑道：「是瘦字。」佩秋道：「这实在难为他了，背得这么熟，想姑娘和韵是必定和得出来的。」","en":"Qionghua fetched it out. Ronghua read a couple of lines, counted, and asked, \\"Which character is the seventh rhyme?\\" Qionghua laughed. \\"Whoever asks a thing that way? However well one knows it by heart, one cannot say which number rhyme is which character. Let"},{"paragraph":37,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琼华"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"蓉华笑起来。琼华更觉含羞，停了一停，说道：「想是我哥哥跪过的。」佩秋笑道：「可惜我不配，若配时，你哥哥自然也要跪了。」蓉华道：「日子快了，我们姐妹也不能常在一处了。妹妹是个有福气的，不比我们。」又说道：「看看你外甥再来。」便出去了，佩秋也同了出去。琼华暗想道：「姐姐","en":"Ronghua laughed. Qionghua blushed the harder, paused, and said, \\"I suppose my brother has knelt for it before now.\\" Peiqiu laughed. \\"A pity I am not worth it. If I were, your brother would kneel too.\\"\\n\\nRonghua said, \\"The day is close, and we sisters shall not be together much"},{"paragraph":38,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琼华"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"说谎，也是前定姻缘，皇天可怜子玉这一片苦心，因琴言是个男子，虽与子玉有些情分，究竟不能配偶，故将此模样，又生个琼华小姐出来，与琴言上妆时一样，岂不是个奇事？此事颜夫人久知，当日见了琴言即说像他媳妇。这么看起来，就是两家的像貌也是五百年前就定下的了。一见之后，又未免有些感触起来，忽又暗暗的解释，遂成就了良缘爱果，自然也不像那梦中措大的光景。若像那梦中光景，岂不要将","en":"in advance. Qinyan, being male, could never truly become spouse despite deep attachment; thus heaven had made Qionghua with the same styled beauty as Qinyan in stage makeup. Lady Yan had recognized this long before and once said so on first seeing Qinyan. Seen this way, even two families' likenesses were set five hundred years before. Ziyu felt another wave of emotion"},{"paragraph":39,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琼华"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一日，子玉在房中与琼华谈心，值馆中有事请他，即便穿衣出门。不意将个小锦囊落在地下。琼华拾起解开时，见折着两张字：一张认得是子玉笔迹，一首《金缕曲》，反复吟哦，甚觉悲楚，知是送别词。再看那一张，也是《金缕曲》，想是那人和的。又看了信笺写着琴言的名字，不觉心中甚喜，想道：「我","en":"One day Ziyu was talking privately with Qionghua when business from the academy called him out suddenly. In his haste he dropped a small old-brocade pouch on the floor. Qionghua picked it up and opened it, finding two folded sheets. One, in Ziyu's hand, was a *Jinlü Qu* and clearly a painful parting"},{"paragraph":40,"mentions":10,"tokens":["琼华"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"少顷，子玉回来，一时倒想不起锦囊，忽见挂在那边，便吃了一惊。琼华故作不见，只见子玉欲取不取，如有所思，颇为可笑。子玉忍不住把锦囊取了下来，捏了一捏，空空的，心甚着忙，知道琼华取了去了。别样倒还可以辩，惟有那信上有琴言的名字，如何辩得来？欲要问时，又不好径问，只时时偷望琼华一眼。琼华忍不住笑了一笑，子玉借此进言，便","en":"After a while Ziyu returned. At first the pouch went out of his head; then he saw it hanging there and started. Qionghua pretended not to see. Ziyu hovered, wanting to take it down and not taking it, with a thoughtful air that was rather comic. At last he could not help himself, took it down and squeezed it — empty. He was much alarmed, and knew Qionghua had taken what"},{"paragraph":41,"mentions":10,"tokens":["琼华"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"唤。墨和泪，请君玩。」这句也不消解，不过和墨和泪，请你看就是了。是这么解的不是？」子玉笑道：「解得一点不错。」琼华道：「我且问你，这人与你常相厮守，你却怎样位置他？」子玉道：「不过侍书捧研。」琼华道「侍书捧研，何用魂梦相唤？」子玉着了一分急，说道：「我说你是我的知己了，自然是洞见肺腑。谁道你也不能知我，何况他人？」琼华笑道：「我讲得这么透澈，怎说还不能知你呢？」","en":"Is that how it is explained, or not?\\" Ziyu smiled awkwardly and said, \\"Explained without the slightest error.\\" Qionghua asked, \\"Let me ask you: this person lived in constant intimacy with you, but what position did you actually place him in?\\" Ziyu said, \\"Merely an attendant for books and ink.\\" Qionghua countered, \\"An attendant for books and ink? What need to call each"}],"57":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琼华"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"。于十月初十日，请了华公子的夫人苏浣香、田春航的夫人浣兰、刘文泽的夫人吴紫烟、颜仲清的夫人王蓉华、梅子玉的夫人琼华、王恂的夫人孙佩秋。此时园中菊花开满，五色斑烂。是日晴光和蔼，风不扬尘，小毛衣服都用不着，绵的尽够了。袁绮香一早带了十二红婢，还有几个家人媳妇，先到园里候客。那日次贤、高品、南湘皆回避了。那十二红都是十五六岁，有的已是云鬓堆鸦，有的还是垂髫刷翠，却一","en":"Tian Chunhang's wife, Huanlan; Liu Wenze's wife, Wu Ziyan; Yan Zhongqing's wife, Wang Ronghua; Mei Ziyu's wife, Qionghua; and Wang Xun's wife, Sun Peiqiu. By this time, the garden's chrysanthemums were in full bloom, a brilliant tapestry of five colors. The day's sunlight was gentle, the wind stirred no dust, and light fur garments were unneeded as padded clothes provided"},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琼华"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"奶与少奶奶、梅家少奶奶齐来了。」说罢，轿子已齐到堂前。姑嫂三位下了轿，一群仆妇、丫鬟随在后头。绮香一一迎接，见琼华打扮，今日分外妖艳，比陪新那一日，更添了几分娇娆姽婳。众姊妹序齿坐下，蓉华道：「我等二妹来，就等了多时，只道客已到齐了，谁知苏家二位还没有来。」绮香道：「蓉妹、佩妹为什么不把侄儿带了来？」蓉华道：「孩子们怕见生人，一见就哭，所以没有带来。」因问道：「","en":"sisters-in-law alighted, followed by a large train of matrons and maids. Qixiang greeted each of them in turn. Qionghua's attire today was especially dazzling, possessing an even more bewitching and graceful charm than on the day she visited after her wedding. The sisters seated themselves according to age. Ronghua said, \\"We waited a very long time for our second sister."},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琼华"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"袁绮香接下台阶，苏氏姊妹笑盈盈的上前见礼，然后与佩秋、紫烟、蓉华、琼华都见了，各人挽着手，喜笑颜开，叙了一番。","en":"sisters stepped forward with radiant smiles and curtsied, then exchanged greetings with Peiqiu, Ziyan, Ronghua, and Qionghua. Each took another's arm, their faces bright with joy, and they conversed warmly for a while."},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":4,"tokens":["琼华","王琼华"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"苏氏姊妹见了琼华，分外亲爱，琼华见了浣香、浣兰，也十分亲热。这一班姊妹，大约同是瑶池会上人，都有夙契。绮香道：「今日我们众姊妹都是通家世好。苏家二浣，王氏双华，本是同胞，不用说了。我们一共七人，今日仿他竹林七贤，做个桃园结义，大家团拜一拜，以后遇着，就不许谦让。愚姐","en":"The Su sisters felt a special fondness for Qionghua at first sight, and Qionghua, in turn, was exceptionally warm toward Huanxiang and Huanlan. This circle of sisters might well have all been immortals from the Jade Pool banquet, as each pair seemed linked by deep, preordained karma. Qixiang said, \\"Today,"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琼华"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琼华对绮香道：「大姐姐，我们今日之来，非为哺啜，原为游园。若这一坐，天又短，只怕就逛不成了。列位姐姐心里怎样？」绮香笑道：「我不过借逛园之名，约妹妹们叙叙。若真要逛园，这五六里一片大地方，山石荦确，又难行走，况你那金莲三寸还不满，如何走得来？」浣兰道：「","en":"Qionghua addressed Qixiang, saying, \\"Eldest sister, we came today not simply to feast, but to stroll through the garden. If we merely sit here, the day is short, and I fear we may not manage a walk at all. What do all of you sisters think?\\" Qixiang smiled warmly"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":3,"tokens":["琼华"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"饮酒。浣香的十珠都可使唤，全点了。浣兰的四个丫鬟，只点了一个小翠，才十三岁，生得很好，且又灵变。又点了许三姐。琼华的四个丫头，点了一个青琴。蓉华两个丫头，点了一个秋莲。紫烟两个丫头，点了一个侍香。佩秋两个丫头，点了一个金凤。共二十四人。其余都命他们代酒。绮香即命拿过筹来，先是七人掣了，顺着年齿掣去，绮得掣着秦，紫烟掣着楚，佩秋掣着燕，蓉华掣着赵，浣香掣着魏，浣兰","en":"maids, she selected only Xiaocui, a pretty and quick-witted thirteen-year-old, along with Miss Xu Sanjie. From Qionghua's four maids, Qingqin was chosen. Ronghua picked Qiulian from her two maids. Ziyan selected Shixiang. Peiqiu chose Jinfeng. In total, there were twenty-four capable maids; the rest were ordered to drink on behalf of others when necessary. Qixiang then"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琼华"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"姐、小翠，要了荷珠，紫烟留了侍香，要了红薇、赠珠，佩秋留了金凤，要了红莲、红娟，蓉华留了秋莲，要了红雯、画珠，琼华留了青琴，要了珍珠、蕊珠。","en":"kept Jinfeng and added Honglian and Hongjuan. Ronghua retained Qiulian, bringing in Hongwen and Yazhu. Finally, Qionghua kept Qingqin and rounded out her forces with Zhenzhu and Ruizhu."},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琼华"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"姐掣出来，大家笑得如花枝乱颤，扎挣不住。原来小翠一根是鸡鸣，三姐一根是狗盗，幸亏荷珠掣了孟尝君，稍可解嘲。再掣琼华的韩国，蕊珠掣了张子房，青琴掣了博浪椎，珍珠掣了圯上老人。琼华笑道：「我早说的，绮香姐姐你仔细博浪椎、荆轲匕首，好不利害。就是高唐神女、醇酒妇人教你受用罢。」红薇道：「奶奶且慢喜欢，只怕奶奶手下也有个笑话出来呢！」绮香道：「不用讲，拿出谱来。」大家看","en":"dog-thief. Fortunately, Hezhu drew Lord Mengchang, which was just enough to laugh off the shame. They then drew for Qionghua's state of Han: Ruizhu drew Zhang Liang, Qingqin drew the Bolang hammer, and Zhenzhu drew the old man at the bridge. Qionghua laughed, \\"I warned you, Sister Qixiang! You had best mind the Bolang hammer and Jing Ke's dagger. Let the Gaotang Goddess and"},{"paragraph":43,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琼华"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琼华道：「我来灭秦了。他们也只有一个韩非子，只懂刑名，不懂兵法的。」数到蕊珠出马，是张良，是金门射策令，自己先出一句成语为题，将三个骰子摆出句中之意，将杯子盖了，叫那人也摆，摆出来相同的不论，如摆出来不同，请中人评论优劣，劣者罚酒。蕊珠将三个骰子摆了，将","en":"Qionghua said, \\"I will destroy Qin. They only have Han Feizi—a man of law and names, not of war.\\" The dice fell to Ruizhu, playing Zhang Liang. Her challenge was the \\"Golden Gate examination\\": she must propose an idiom, cover three dice under a cup showing the"},{"paragraph":47,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琼华"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"珠十分用心，无奈未得其妙，几着变化就迷住了，看看要输，宝珠要指点他，红香道：「谁教了，就算谁输，要照样罚酒。」琼华心甚着急，又不好教，看红香把他一个挂角将，就将死了。红香笑道：「今番得了。」查圯上老人的谱，是脱鞋置酒，遍敬席上。珍珠见了，说道：「这个断断使不得，怪脏的东西，那是什么样儿！」红香道：「不妨的。」便要来脱他的鞋。珍珠一跑，不防红雪在旁暗中把脚一勾，珍","en":"completely lost. Baozhu wanted to offer a hint, but Hongxiang warned, \\"Whoever teaches, loses. Same penalty.\\" Qionghua burned with worry but dared not speak. Hongxiang hung a corner checkmate—dead. Hongxiang smiled sweetly, \\"Got you this time.\\" The old man's book dictated: remove a shoe, fill it with wine, and toast the whole table. Zhenzhu cried out in horror, \\"Impossible!"},{"paragraph":48,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琼华"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"只剩了一个青琴是博浪椎，谱上是：打擂有闷雷、劈雷，是打秦国通国中人马。琼华道：「就要看这一将成功了。」蓉华道：「琴儿，你须与主人争个脸。」青琴笑道：「我这椎是要椎椎打中的。」浣兰道：「你若赢了他们，非但与你主人争气，且与我等报仇。」浣香道：「这闷雷、劈雷是可以乱打的，你也不必容情，连他们的国王也可打得的。」佩秋道：「你若像","en":"book stated: \\"The ring match has 'dull thunder' and 'split thunder'—you may strike anyone in Qin, even the king.\\" Qionghua commanded, \\"This general must succeed.\\" Ronghua cheered, \\"Qin'er, win honor for your mistress!\\" Qingqin smiled confidently, \\"My hammer strikes true with every swing.\\" Huanlan added, \\"Beat them, and you avenge us all.\\" Huanxiang urged, \\"Dull and split"},{"paragraph":49,"mentions":2,"tokens":["琼华"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"说也奇怪，被青琴一顿闷雷、劈雷，将二珠、四红打得个个心惊胆怯，琼华好不得意，只管点头微笑，说道：「一将功成万骨枯。」众佳人齐声称贺。绮香笑道：「这还了得？你是个顶小的小妹妹，公然欺侮大姐姐来，这般可恶。你敢与我对敌么？」那五个佳人同声说道：「这有什么不敢？如果七妹胆怯，我们一齐相帮。」琼华笑道：「妹子愿避三舍，如必","en":"Strangely, Qingqin's dull and split thunder-strikes left the two Pearls and four Reds trembling in defeat. Qionghua glowed, nodding and smiling, \\"One general's merit; ten thousand bones dry.\\" The beauties cheered wildly. Qixiang laughed, \\"How dare you! The youngest little sister bullying the eldest sister—it is outrageous! Will you face me?\\" The five cried out, \\"Why"},{"paragraph":51,"mentions":3,"tokens":["琼华"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"就近到了春风沉醉轩坐下。群婢也都来了，煮茗清谈了一会，已点上灯。紫烟要打马吊，便拉了蓉华、佩秋二人打起马吊来。琼华看见有一匣诗牌，便与绮香、浣兰三人在一桌打了一副，足足打到二更后，琼华方成了一首七律，绮香差了一韵斗不成。浣兰牌起得不好，尚差了十数字，琼华将牌摊出，那边蓉华等也过来看时，只见斗的是：","en":"talking until the lamps were finally lit. Ziyan wanted to play ma-diao and pulled Ronghua and Peiqiu into a game. Qionghua spotted a box of poetry cards and played a hand with Qixiang and Huanlan until past the second watch. Qionghua completed one beautifully regulated octet; Qixiang missed one rhyme and could not finish; Huanlan's draw was poor and was still ten characters"},{"paragraph":52,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琼华"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"也过来贺节。不是我说，我们今日这一班人，倒有几个像他们。」这句话，就有紫烟想不出是谁，其余皆听得人说过。浣兰、琼华恐绮香说出来，便不约而同的将闲话拦住他。又看将近三更，也要各散。绮香挽留不住，只得同散，便说道：「残月未尽，妹妹们可高兴，能走到园门口不能？」众佳人情愿都走，一对对的手灯相照，众姊妹你携我，我携你，一路说说笑笑，穿过了好些石门竹径。正是：","en":"resemble them.\\" Ziyan alone could not guess whom she meant; the others had heard people speak of them. Huanlan and Qionghua, fearing Qixiang would name names, quickly cut in with small talk. Near the third watch, they finally prepared to leave. Qixiang could not keep them any longer and said, \\"The waning moon still shines. Sisters, are you willing to walk to the garden gate?\\""}],"59":[{"paragraph":24,"mentions":3,"tokens":["琼华"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云发了一千银子，打发家人星夜下了江南。子玉连天的悲苦，日间不敢进内，一来怕颜夫人问他，二来怕琼华小姐看出，正是他的苦楚，比人更胜几倍。但心上有这样心事，脸上如何装得过来？颜夫人倒疑心他怕见父亲，想是他父亲就回来，因此着急。惟有那琼华小姐，异样心灵，便料定他另有心事，再三盘诘，子玉只得直说了。琼华小姐也只好宽慰几句，见他这个光景，也不好取笑他。","en":"dare enter the inner quarters; firstly, he feared Lady Yan would question him, and secondly, he was afraid Miss Qionghua would see through him—his suffering was, after all, several times more profound than anyone else's. However, harboring such heavy matters in his heart, how could he possibly maintain a composed facade? Lady Yan merely suspected that he was afraid of"},{"paragraph":31,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琼华"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"面貌再没有这般相像的了。众人疑疑惑惑，猜不出来，又听得叫屈大爷，便知不是。子玉趁这空儿，就请仲清对颜夫人讲明，琼华也在旁听了，望着子玉笑，看着子玉含羞含愧，局促不安。颜夫人听了，也以为异，便道：「这个孩子本来原好，如今既做了屈家的儿子，从前的出身，倒也不必提起了，算他转了个劫罢。」","en":"him. Taking advantage of this free moment, Ziyu asked Zhongqing to explain the situation clearly to Lady Yan. Qionghua listened from the side, smiling at Ziyu as she watched him flush with embarrassment and shame, squirming uneasily. Lady Yan found the whole thing quite strange as well, remarking, \\"This child was always inherently good. Now that he has become a son of"},{"paragraph":33,"mentions":4,"tokens":["琼华"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琼华小姐进房，子玉同了进来。琼华道：「如今好了，是不要做梦，天天的呼唤了。」子玉笑道：「我去同他进来见太太，你出去看看像不像？」琼华啐了一声，忽又说道：「你去同他进来见太太，我真要望望他。」子玉果然拉了琴仙进来，到内堂拜见了颜夫人。夫人见了，也甚疼他，便","en":"Miss Qionghua entered the room, and Ziyu followed her in. Qionghua said, \\"Well, things are fine now. You won't have to keep dreaming and calling out for him every single day.\\" Ziyu laughed, \\"I'm going to bring him in to meet my mother. Why don't you step outside and"},{"paragraph":34,"mentions":1,"tokens":["琼华"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"明日，士燮面圣回家，合家迎接。琼华拜见了公公，士燮十分喜欢。颜夫人同着谈了一回，后将琴仙的事委委婉婉说了出来，就说他唱过戏，屈道翁见他人品好，所以收为义子。将子玉害病的话，却隐藏不题。士燮道：「我已猜着了几分。」也将屈道翁梦中之言说了，又道：「前事也不必论他。这个孩子甚好，没有一点优","en":"day, Shixie had his audience with the Emperor and returned home, where the entire family gathered to welcome him. Qionghua paid her respects to her father-in-law, and Shixie was extremely pleased. Lady Yan chatted with him for a while, and then gently and tactfully recounted Qinxian's entire story, explaining that he had once sung in operas, and that Qu Daoweng, seeing his"}]}`),"char-92":{1:[{paragraph:6,mentions:2,tokens:["郑氏"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"这颜庄在日，与士燮既系郎舅至亲，又有雷陈至契。不料于三十岁即赴召玉楼，他夫人郑氏绝食殉节。那时仲清年甫三龄，士燮抚养在家，又与郑氏夫人请旌表烈。仲清在士燮处，到十九岁上中了个副车。是年士燮与其作伐，赘于同乡同年现任通政司王文辉家为婿。这王文辉是颜夫人的表兄，与仲清亲上加亲，翁婿甚为相得。那一位姓史名南湘，号竹君，是湖广汉阳人，现",en:"that of Lei and Chen. Tragically, he was summoned to the Jade Pavilion at the mere age of thirty, and his wife, Lady Zheng, starved herself to death to preserve her chastity and follow him. At that time, Zhongqing was barely three years old; Shixie brought him into his home to raise him and petitioned the court to erect a memorial arch honoring Lady Zheng's fierce devotion."}]},"char-94":JSON.parse(`{"40":[{"paragraph":22,"mentions":1,"tokens":["三姐"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"大哥拉住了，道：「不是打架的事，且商量。去邀了李三叔来，是他荐去的，我们讲理去，看他怎样？」三姐说道：「打架固不好，讲理也不好。这又没有伤痕，难道好到刑部里去相验么？依我想个法子，也叫他受用一回，叫他吃个闷亏，讲不出来。」","en":"the one who recommended Laosan for the post. We shall go and reason with him, and see what he has to say.\\" The third sister said, \\"Fighting certainly won't do, but trying to reason with him is no good either. There are no physical wounds to show; surely we cannot take this to the Ministry of Punishments for an official examination? As I see it, let me devise a method to make"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":3,"tokens":["三姐"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"那老大、老二道：「妹子倒说得好，他是个四五十岁人，怎样叫他吃这闷亏？」三姐笑道：「待我慢慢的想着。」原来那三姐才十九岁，生得十分标致，而且千伶百俐，会说会笑。若做了男子，倒是个有作为的，偏又叫他做了女身。想了一会，笑道：「我倒有个妙计，就是没有这个人。」那老二道：「要与兄弟报仇，就到水里去，火里去，我肯的。」三姐道：「这件","en":"speaks well, but he is a man of forty or fifty; how do you propose to make him swallow such a bitter pill?\\" The third sister laughed and said, \\"Let me think on it slowly.\\" Now, this third sister was barely nineteen years of age, exceedingly beautiful, and a thousand times clever and articulate, always ready with a smile and a word. Had she been born a man, she would have been"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":2,"tokens":["三姐"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"老二发气道：「这是什么话？既要赚人，难道还对人讲？」三姐道：「只消如此如此，这般这般，就是没有这个人。」老大想道：「你嫂子不中用，引不动人，且回娘家去了。或者请了王八奶奶来，不然请葛家姑娘？」三姐道：「不好。这些门户中人，非亲非戚，他们也未必肯来。况且潘三认得这些人。」","en":"is that? If we are planning to ensnare someone, do you think I would go about broadcasting it to others?\\" The third sister said, \\"It requires only this and that, such and such, but we lack the person to do it.\\" The eldest brother pondered: \\"Your sister-in-law is useless, she couldn't entice anyone, and besides, she has returned to her maiden home. Perhaps we should invite"},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":1,"tokens":["三姐"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"三姐啐了一口，骂道：「放狗屁，你何不等二嫂子来做幌子？」老二笑道：「还没有娶回来，谁耐烦等这一年半载。若已经娶在家里，怕不是就用他，还来求你？」","en":"The third sister spat in disgust and scolded, \\"You spout dog farts! Why don't you wait for your second sister-in-law to arrive and serve as the bait?\\" The second brother laughed: \\"She isn't married into the house yet! Who has the patience to wait half a year or a year?"},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":2,"tokens":["三姐"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「老二这句话，倒也讲得在理，除妹子，却无第二人可做。但是做了之后，老三是不用说了，就是妹夫，这个锅也砸定了。」三姐道：「那倒不妨，三吊钱一月，别处也弄得出来。这件事既商议定了，倒要趁早，你们去将你妹夫叫来。大家说明，也要他肯。」去叫周小三来家，三姐将方才商量的话说了，周小三无有不依，定于后日晚间行事。","en":"However, once it is done, leaving Laosan aside, your husband's rice bowl will certainly be smashed as well.\\" The third sister said, \\"That is of no consequence — three strings of cash a month can be scrounged up elsewhere. Since we have agreed on this course, it is best to act early. Go and fetch your brother-in-law. We must all be clear on the plan, and he must be willing.\\""},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":3,"tokens":["三姐"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"便「三姐、三姐」的叫了两声。听得里头答应了，这又娇又嫩的声音，就觉入耳。潘三听得咭咭咯咯的高低响，到了门后，手望门上一扶，露出两个银指甲道：「要什么？」小三道：「三爷初次来，你也该出来见个礼。况且三爷是有年纪的人，父母一样，不要害臊。」三姐笑了一声，道：「我","en":"He called out twice, \\"Third Sister! Third Sister!\\" A voice answered from within — a voice so tender and delicate it enchanted the ear at once. Pan the Third heard the sharp click-clack of high-heeled wooden soles; reaching the doorway, a hand rested upon the frame, revealing two silver"},{"paragraph":33,"mentions":3,"tokens":["三姐"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"等小三去了，招陪他。口虽说走，身却不动。小三叫老三出来，老三终是不肯。小三骂了一声：「胡涂小子！」只得叫声：「三姐出来。」三姐到门后道：「又做什么？」小三道：「你二哥又闹了事，要我去劝解。三爷在此，老三又不肯出来。我想三爷五十来岁的人，你做他女儿还小，你大方些，出来陪陪，我去就来。」三姐道：「我不会陪，我是妇人家，适或简慢了三爷怎好，三爷还是要怪你的。」潘三听了","en":"come out, but Laosan stubbornly refused. Xiaosan muttered a curse, \\"Muddle-headed boy!\\" and then called out, \\"Third Sister, come out.\\" Third Sister appeared at the doorway and asked, \\"What is it now?\\" Xiaosan said, \\"Your second brother has stirred up trouble again, and I must go and mediate. Third Master is here, and Laosan refuses to come out. I figure — Third Master is"},{"paragraph":34,"mentions":3,"tokens":["三姐"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"三姐笑将出来，潘三见了，神魂消荡。见他是瓜子脸儿，一双凤眼，梳了个大元宝头，插上一枝花。身上穿件茄花色布衫子，却是绿布洗了泛成的颜色，底下隐约是条月白绸绵裤。绝小的一对金莲，不过三寸。身材不长不短，不肥不瘦。香喷喷一脸笑容，对了潘三福了一福。潘三见了，色","en":"Third Sister emerged with a laugh; catching sight of her, Pan the Third's soul soared beyond the heavens. He saw she had a melon-seed face and a pair of phoenix eyes; her hair was combed into a large ingot-shaped coil, adorned with a single blossom. She wore an eggplant-purple"},{"paragraph":35,"mentions":10,"tokens":["三姐"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"潘三乐得受不得，便道：「奶奶何不请坐过来。要你这么劳动，心上不安。」三姐笑了一笑，即叫声：「老三，三兄弟，你出来。」老三道：「我不来，你陪他罢。」三姐笑道：「你不来陪你的人，倒要我替你陪，那里有这样倔强的孩子，怪不得人要暗算你。」潘三听了这话有因，即道：「小三在我家，也是亲人一样，奶奶就坐坐，谅也无妨。」三姐道：「我坐在","en":"overwhelmed with delight; he said, \\"Lady, why not come sit over here? I am truly uneasy making you exert yourself so.\\" Third Sister smiled and called out, \\"Laosan, Third Brother, come out!\\" Laosan replied, \\"I'm not coming; you keep him company.\\" Third Sister laughed and said, \\"You refuse to come out and entertain your own guest, and instead demand that I keep him company for you"},{"paragraph":36,"mentions":7,"tokens":["三姐"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"酒已完了，三姐道：「没有酒有，兄弟你去打半斤好烧酒来。方才这酒淡，你上大街去买，你不要嫌路远，又在小铺里买来。」老三答应，亦不点灯，趁着月色去了。三姐道：「我关了门，他到大街上去，有一会呢。」潘三见他去关门，心中想道：「可以下手了。这婆娘很有勾我的意，我不可辜负他","en":"The wine was soon exhausted. Third Sister said, \\"There is still wine to be had. Brother, go and buy half a catty of good strong spirits. The wine we just had was too mild. Go to the main street to buy it; don't be lazy about the distance and buy from a small corner stall.\\" Laosan voiced his"},{"paragraph":37,"mentions":6,"tokens":["三姐"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"三姐将手隔过，道：「使不得，三爷你好不正经，调戏良家妇女。我若喊起来，你就没脸了。」潘三道：「我的娘，你施点恩罢！」三姐道：「你真看上我？好便宜，那里有这么容易的事情！你把我太看轻了。」潘三道：「奶奶，你要肯施恩，你怎么说怎么好。」三姐一手推他的脸，一手","en":"Third Sister blocked his face with one hand and said, \\"You must not! Third Master, you are truly acting improperly, taking liberties with a respectable woman. If I were to cry out, you would lose all face.\\" Pan the Third pleaded, \\"My mother, bestow a little mercy"},{"paragraph":38,"mentions":5,"tokens":["三姐"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"三姐先坐在一边，潘三把长衣解开，扯了裤子，正想挨扰来，忽听得背后脚步响。回头一看，吓了一跳，连忙掖了裤子。只见周小三已到前面，大喝了一声，一把揪住，骂道：「好大胆的忘八蛋，原来你竟不是人！」潘三吓得目瞪口呆。三姐忙说道：「潘三爷方才要小解找溺壶，你当是什","en":"Third Sister first sat down to one side. Pan the Third unfastened his long robe and pulled down his trousers; just as he was about to press himself against her, he suddenly heard footsteps behind him. Turning his head, he was given a terrible fright, and hastily"},{"paragraph":39,"mentions":4,"tokens":["三姐"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"官。」潘三道：「我愿，我愿！但如何要得一千银子？我身边有三百吊钱的票子，给你罢。」小三道：「三百吊钱算什么？」三姐道：「你也摸摸良心，三爷待你这样好，今日就算他错了，你也须看他往日情分。你若知恩报恩，难道三爷真不懂得好歹么？」潘三道：「奶奶说得是，我是最懂交情的。小三，我们留个相与，我那一天不可照应你，何必定要今日？」小三道：「既如此，我们倒说明了，横竖人也被你","en":"hundred strings of cash; I will give them to you.\\" Xiaosan sneered, \\"What is three hundred strings of cash worth?\\" Third Sister interjected, \\"You should feel your own conscience as well! Third Master has treated you so well; even if he made a mistake today, you must consider past affections. If you know how to recognize grace and repay it, do you truly think Third Master won't"},{"paragraph":40,"mentions":2,"tokens":["三姐"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"吃了早饭，到了小三家，见门不闩，推了进去。见三姐坐在屋里，引着小狗儿顽。潘三咳嗽一声，三姐满面堆下笑来。","en":"eating breakfast, he arrived at Xiaosan's house. Finding the door unbolted, he pushed it open and entered. He saw Third Sister sitting in the room, teasing a small dog. Pan the Third coughed once, and Third Sister's face immediately bloomed into a radiant smile."},{"paragraph":41,"mentions":5,"tokens":["三姐"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"潘三道：「昨日几乎唬死我。」三姐道：「他不过想钱罢了，他真心要拿你？」潘三道：「屋里没有人？」三姐道：「有什么人？」潘三道：「我去闩了门。」三姐道：「今日天气暖，脱了衣服爽快些。」又道：「溺急了。」跑到后院子去小便，回头对潘三道：「你先脱光了罢，进被窝去。」潘三不敢不遵，刚脱下身来","en":"Pan the Third said, \\"Yesterday I was nearly frightened to death.\\" Third Sister scoffed, \\"He only wanted the money; did you think he truly intended to seize you?\\" Pan the Third asked, \\"Is there anyone else in the house?\\" Third Sister replied, \\"Who else would there be?\\" Pan the Third said, \\"I will go and bolt the door.\\" Third Sister"},{"paragraph":42,"mentions":2,"tokens":["三姐"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"潘三道：「快些来罢！」要来扯他，三姐笑道：「关了房门。」刚转身，只听得外面嚷道：「做的好事！」一阵脚步响。潘三一听，魂不附体。只见周小三领着他两个舅子，拿着雪亮的刀，又有一条粗麻绳，上前将潘三按住，拉下炕来。许老二一连三四拳，骂道：「你这狗鸡巴亏的，肛了我的兄弟，还想血我的妹子。」潘三","en":"Pan the Third urged, \\"Come quickly!\\" and reached out to pull her. Third Sister laughed and said, \\"Close the bedroom door.\\" Just as she turned around, a voice from outside roared, \\"A fine deed you're doing!\\" followed by the thunderous clatter of footsteps. Pan the Third, hearing this, felt his soul flee his body. He saw Zhou Xiaosan"},{"paragraph":43,"mentions":3,"tokens":["三姐"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"我的钱。」小三道：「要你什么钱？」潘三道：「非但钱，还有八两重的金镯子。」小三道：「你回去与我打官司就是了。」三姐道：「潘三，你要打官司早些说，我好习学口供，省得上堂时说得不好。」潘三一人，如何闹得过他们，只得忍气吞声，后门口又火焦火辣的难过，遂欲穿衣。周小三上前夺下道：「你还想穿衣出去么？」三姐道：「给他罢，遮遮他那个狗脸。」潘三穿了衣裳，往外便走。听得三姐笑","en":"money, but also an eight-tael gold bracelet.\\" Xiaosan scoffed, \\"Go back and file a lawsuit against me, then!\\" Third Sister chimed in, \\"Pan the Third, if you wish to file a lawsuit, say so early; I need to practice my confession so I don't stumble over my words when I appear in court.\\" Being but one man, how could Pan the Third possibly prevail against them? He had no choice"},{"paragraph":44,"mentions":3,"tokens":["三姐"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"那兄妹夫妻四人犹大笑了一会，三姐道：「这潘三也被我们收拾苦了，亏二哥能下这毒手。」老二道：「我还没有使劲，恐怕挖了他的肠子出来。」三姐道：「那三百吊钱，我有个主意，不知两位哥哥肯依不肯依。」老大、老二道：「这件事是妹子的功劳，凭妹子怎样，我们无有不依。」三姐道：「将一百吊钱给你妹夫","en":"The three siblings and Zhou Xiaosan continued to laugh uproariously for quite some time. Third Sister said, \\"This Pan the Third has been thoroughly dealt with by us; it is all thanks to Second Brother's willingness to execute such a ruthless plan.\\" Second Brother laughed, \\"I didn't even use my full strength; I was afraid of digging his intestines out!\\""},{"paragraph":45,"mentions":2,"tokens":["三姐"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"那兄弟两个都说「很是。」小三今早将这票子，已同潘三对了外票，是预先商量停妥的，便拿出来交与三姐。三姐分派定了，又说道：「倒是三兄弟的毛病要紧，与他治好了方好。」","en":"with Pan the Third that very morning — a detail prearranged — and he now brought the money out and handed it to Third Sister. Once she had finished distributing it, she added, \\"However, Third Brother's ailment is the most pressing matter; we must cure him first and foremost.\\""},{"paragraph":46,"mentions":1,"tokens":["三姐"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"许老大道：「这个有什么方法？」三姐道：「我闻得吃荞麦面，便可除肚里吃下的猪毛羊毛。你把这荞麦面做了汤元，包些糖，不要煮熟，带生的与他吃，吃两天试试。或者可以撒得出来。」那二人道：「这个最容易，我们回去就做些与他吃。」又坐了一坐，弟兄二人拿了钱也自回去。不知后事如何，且看下回分解。","en":"Xu Laoda asked, \\"What method is there for this?\\" Third Sister explained, \\"I have heard that eating buckwheat noodles can expel pig or sheep hair swallowed into the stomach. Take this buckwheat flour, make it into dumplings filled with sugar, but do not boil them completely through. Serve them to him slightly raw"}],"47":[{"paragraph":21,"mentions":1,"tokens":["三姐"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"重兑了。再看屋内墙上挂的一个表，也不见了。潘三恨声不已，因是找他来医病的，不便多说，忍气吞声，惟有暗恨周小三与三姐害他。","en":"on the wall was missing as well. Pan the Third fumed with endless resentment, secretly cursing Zhou Xiaosan and Third Sister for ruining him."},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":2,"tokens":["许三姐","三姐"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"到明日去找那人，告知缘故。那人笑道：「潘三叫你来请我么？这事我早知道。他正月里拿这个法子收拾了许老三，许三姐才设计哄他，许老二就用他的法子收拾他，许老二早告诉了我。许老三吃了多少荞麦面，还吃了泻药，泻不出来。还是我传他的法子。听说三姐将银耳挖替他挖干净的，才不至成了毛病。潘三这个人真不是个东西，极该得这个报应，由他罢了。」","en":"me? I knew about this long ago. In the first month, Pan the Third used this very trick to ruin Xu Laosan. Xu's Third Sister devised a scheme to trick him, and Xu Laoer used Pan the Third's own method to ruin him in return. Xu Laoer told me all about it. Xu Laosan ate so much buckwheat flour and took purgatives, but couldn't pass it. It was I who taught him the cure. I heard"}],"49":[{"paragraph":3,"mentions":10,"tokens":["三姐"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一日，赶车的周小三与蕙芳说起他的三姐，情愿进来伺候老太太，又夸奖他三姐粗粗细细件件皆能，还会缝衣写算，针线活计是不用说了。蕙芳也闻得三姐之名，收拾过潘三，想是个伶俐人，也想见见他，问他怎样收拾的。便与春航说了，举荐他进来，春航不好推辞，一口应允。这三姐因收拾潘三之后，心上也有些惧怕潘三","en":"One day, the carriage driver Zhou Xiaosan mentioned his Third Sister to Huifang, saying she was willing to come in and serve the old madam. He boasted that she was highly capable in all tasks, both rough and delicate, could sew, read, and calculate—and her needlework was beyond compare. Huifang, who had heard of Third"},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":15,"tokens":["三姐"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一日，春航不在家，蕙芳独坐在书房里。老太太知道蕙芳来了，便叫三姐送点心出来。三姐托了碟子，到书房门口，先咳嗽了一声，然后进来，笑容满面的叫了一声：「苏大爷！」蕙芳也带着笑，回叫了一声「三姐！」三姐道：「这是老太太给你的。」说着，将碟子送到蕙芳手边。蕙芳见他十指尖尖，套了银甲，就接了放下，道：「请三姐叫我的名子，谢","en":"Chunhang was away from home, and Huifang sat alone in the study. Knowing Huifang was there, the old madam sent Third Sister out with some pastries. Carrying the small dish, Third Sister paused at the study door and gave a soft cough before entering, her face wreathed in a bright smile as she called out, \\"Master Su!\\" Huifang returned the smile and called back, \\"Third Sister!\\""},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":1,"tokens":["三姐"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"蕙芳道：「这爱字也没有什么要紧，爱好之心，自然各人难免的。这三姐不但人生得好，而且还灵慧异常，倒是个贞节妇人呢。」春航笑道：「灵慧有之，贞节未确。」蕙芳笑道：「你没听见他收拾过潘三么？」春航笑道：「也有所闻，那是潘三这般嘴脸，自然应收拾的。你方才说爱好之心，人人有之。设使你做了潘三，他就不忍收拾你了。」蕙芳道：「","en":"word \\"like\\" is of no great consequence; a heart that appreciates beauty is naturally unavoidable for anyone. This Third Sister is not only beautiful, but exceptionally intelligent—and she is a chaste woman at that.\\" Chunhang laughed, \\"Intelligent, yes; chaste, I'm not so sure.\\" Huifang smiled, \\"Haven't you heard how she dealt with Pan the Third?\\" Chunhang chuckled, \\"I've heard"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":11,"tokens":["三姐"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"春航去了，蕙芳正走出来，忽听得咭咭咯咯之声，一回头看是三姐。蕙芳笑面相迎，三姐也笑盈盈的说道：「好几天不见你来。」蕙芳道：「我倒天天来的，就不见你出来。」三姐道：「老爷出门去了？」三姐把蕙芳腰间的表套子看了一看，道：「这个我也会做，我还会做戳纱的荷包。」蕙芳笑道：「何不赏我一个？」三姐笑道：「我的东西不给人","en":"Chunhang left and Huifang stepped out, he suddenly heard a soft, tinkling laugh. Turning his head, he saw it was Third Sister. Huifang greeted her with a smile, and Third Sister, beaming, said, \\"I haven't seen you come around for days.\\" Huifang replied, \\"I actually come every day, I just never see you come out.\\" Third Sister asked, \\"Has the master gone out?\\" She then glanced"}],"52":[{"paragraph":11,"mentions":1,"tokens":["许三姐"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"人声嘈杂，苏蕙芳发赏封，上号簿，一个人那里打发得开，又叫了兰保、素兰来相帮，足足闹了两三个时辰，尚未清楚。里头许三姐也帮着手忙脚乱，同着那些陪房的摆这样，安那样，闹得一身的汗，一件绸衫子沾住了背心，腰也酸了，脚也疼了，喝了一碗凉茶，把扇子扇了一会，再来收拾。春航忙进城谢妆去了。","en":"and Sulan to assist. The commotion dragged on for four to six hours and was still not fully settled. Inside, Xu Third Sister frantically helped the dowry attendants arrange this and place that; drenched in sweat, her silk shirt clinging to her back, her waist aching and her feet sore, she paused only to gulp a bowl of cool tea and fan herself briefly before diving back into"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":1,"tokens":["许三姐"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"见了婆婆，又与各位夫人也对拜了。六珠婢磕了田夫人的头，又与新人叩头贺喜。苏家赔房的一群丫鬟、仆妇十七八个，还有许三姐，都到华夫人面前来叩头，把三间花厅挤得满满的了。","en":"the bride. A group of seventeen or eighteen maids and servant women from the Su household's dowry, along with Xu Third Sister, all came forward to kowtow before Lady Hua, packing the three-room flower hall to the brim."},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":2,"tokens":["许三姐","三姐"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"看你们两位，一位是东华圣母，一位是南岳夫人，正是敌体。」新人坐了一坐，早已告退。这边太太们讲得好不投机，底下是许三姐张罗。徐家的红雪、红莲、红香、红玉、红梅、红月、红露、红霙八个，并华家六珠，与那些家人媳妇丫鬟们，整整坐了八桌。这八桌里头，有会说会笑的，有会喝会吃的，有抿着嘴不开口的，有缩着手不动箸的，各人有各人的模样。三姐八面张罗，满场飞舞。","en":"bride sat for a short while before withdrawing. The senior ladies conversed with lively enthusiasm. Below them, Xu Third Sister managed everything flawlessly. The eight 'Hong' maids of the Xu household—Hongxue, Honglian, Hongxiang, Hongyu, Hongmei, Hongyue, Honglu, and Hongying—along with the six Pearl Maids of the Hua household, plus all the servants and maids, filled exactly"}],"57":[{"paragraph":13,"mentions":1,"tokens":["许三姐"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"四个不能饮酒。浣香的十珠都可使唤，全点了。浣兰的四个丫鬟，只点了一个小翠，才十三岁，生得很好，且又灵变。又点了许三姐。琼华的四个丫头，点了一个青琴。蓉华两个丫头，点了一个秋莲。紫烟两个丫头，点了一个侍香。佩秋两个丫头，点了一个金凤。共二十四人。其余都命他们代酒。绮香即命拿过筹来，先是七人掣了，顺着年齿掣去，绮得掣着秦，紫烟掣着楚，佩秋掣着燕，蓉华掣着赵，浣香掣着魏","en":"Huanlan's four maids, she selected only Xiaocui, a pretty and quick-witted thirteen-year-old, along with Miss Xu Sanjie. From Qionghua's four maids, Qingqin was chosen. Ronghua picked Qiulian from her two maids. Ziyan selected Shixiang. Peiqiu chose Jinfeng. In total, there were twenty-four capable maids; the rest were ordered to drink on behalf of others when necessary."},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":1,"tokens":["许三姐"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"珠、花珠笑了，站了过来。绮香自己点了爱珠、花珠、红香、红玉、红雪、红霙，浣香自己留了宝珠、明珠、掌珠，浣兰留了许三姐、小翠，要了荷珠，紫烟留了侍香，要了红薇、赠珠，佩秋留了金凤，要了红莲、红娟，蓉华留了秋莲，要了红雯、画珠，琼华留了青琴，要了珍珠、蕊珠。","en":"Hongyu, Hongxue, and Hongying for her own forces. Huanxiang kept Baozhu, Mingzhu, and Zhangzhu. Huanlan retained Sanjie and Xiaocui, and added Hezhu. Ziyan kept Shixiang, taking Hongwei and Zengzhu to fill her ranks. Peiqiu kept Jinfeng and added Honglian and Hongjuan. Ronghua retained Qiulian, bringing in Hongwen and Yazhu. Finally, Qionghua kept Qingqin and rounded"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":2,"tokens":["三姐"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"看小翠掣一根，已经失笑，再看三姐掣出来，大家笑得如花枝乱颤，扎挣不住。原来小翠一根是鸡鸣，三姐一根是狗盗，幸亏荷珠掣了孟尝君，稍可解嘲。再掣琼华的韩国，蕊珠掣了张子房，青琴掣了博浪椎，珍珠掣了圯上老人。琼华笑道：「我早说的，绮香姐姐你仔细博浪椎、荆轲匕首，好不利害。就是高唐神女、醇","en":"When Xiaocui drew her lot, the ladies were already smiling. But when Sanjie's lot was revealed, everyone shook with laughter like trembling flower branches, barely able to sit upright. Xiaocui had drawn the rooster's crow, while Sanjie had drawn the dog-thief. Fortunately, Hezhu drew Lord Mengchang, which was just enough to"},{"paragraph":37,"mentions":1,"tokens":["三姐"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"能钻得这么灵便。」小翠钻完了，头上歪着个偏髻，嘻嘻的对着浣兰笑。浣兰视了他一个白眼，道：「你还乐得很呢。」酒是三姐代喝了。","en":"Huanlan. Huanlan rolled her eyes at her: \\"Aren't you pleased with yourself.\\" The wine was drunk on her behalf by Sanjie."},{"paragraph":38,"mentions":4,"tokens":["三姐"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"到了三姐上前，红霙口里作呼狗声。三姐道：「你运气好，别要赢我，你若赢了我，我真咬你一口。」翻出谱来，是五毒令。大指为虾蟆，食指为蛇，中指为蜈蚣，无名指为蝎虎，小指为蜘蛛。分胜负是蜘蛛吃蝎虎，蝎虎吃蜈蚣，蜈蚣吃蛇，蛇吃虾蟆，虾蟆吃蜘蛛。两人就猜起来。三姐想道：","en":"When Sanjie came forward, Hongying set up a dog-calling noise with her mouth. Sanjie said, \\"You are in luck—don't you beat me. If you beat me, I will truly give you a bite.\\" The book, turned up, showed the Five Venoms game: the thumb was the toad, the forefinger"},{"paragraph":39,"mentions":7,"tokens":["三姐"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"了西楚霸王，巨鹿一战，才消得这口气呢。」众佳人笑道：「还有一个韩国在那里，兵书尚未出来，只好盼他打胜仗了。」看三姐的令谱：「头一杯要装狗叫三声，第二三杯要伏在地下爬两步，作狗叫三声。」三姐笑道：「呸！这个令如何来得？我当狗盗是什么东西，原来要装狗的。我不来。」说着就跑，众佳人听了，都笑得了不得。只见花珠、爱珠、红香、红玉、红雪、红霙一齐赶上，围住了三姐，说道：「","en":"state of Han over there, and the book of strategy is not out yet; we can only hope they win.\\"\\n\\nThey looked at Sanjie's forfeit: \\"For the first cup, bark three times like a dog; for the second and third, go down on the ground, crawl two paces, and bark three times like a dog.\\" Sanjie laughed. \\"Faugh! How can such a rule stand? I thought a dog-thief was something else"},{"paragraph":40,"mentions":2,"tokens":["三姐"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"三姐道：「这回姐妹们可饶了我罢。」二珠、四红如何肯依？浣兰笑对绮香道：「你这个无道强秦，到底要怎样？五国已给你吞食尽了，还要纵容这些豺狼虎豹去吃人。」绮香笑得伏桌难应。三姐被他们围住。毫不容情，心生一计，想道：「这些骚货实在可恶，我今也顾不得作笑话，也叫","en":"Sanjie pleaded, \\"Sisters, spare me this round.\\" But the two Pearls and four Reds would not yield. Huanlan laughed at Qixiang, \\"Your lawless Qin—what more do you want? You've swallowed five whole states and still set wolves on people.\\" Qixiang laughed so hard"},{"paragraph":41,"mentions":7,"tokens":["三姐"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"说道：「姐妹们不要这样，你们让开些，我就伏在地上就是了。」诸人还不信，红雪道：「我们就站开些，谅你也不能跑。」三姐故意慢慢的曲着腰，伏将下去，见红雪与爱珠都是三寸金莲，裙边下微露一线的镶边花裤，叫了一声，众人又笑。三姐乘其不备，一转身把爱珠两脚一抱，把他的裤腿望上一捋，露出雪霜似的一节小腿。三姐就学作狗叫一声，一口咬定，两手在腿上乱抓，把个爱珠唬得神号鬼叫，浑身","en":"floor for you.\\" They still did not trust her, and Hongxue said, \\"We will stand clear — but you are not to run.\\"\\n\\nSanjie bent her back slowly and went down, and catching sight of Aizhu's and Hongxue's three-inch golden lotuses, and the flower-edged trousers just showing under their skirts, she gave a cry, and everyone laughed. Then, when they were off their guard, she"},{"paragraph":42,"mentions":3,"tokens":["三姐"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"红雪道：「不要将来，只怕出门就教狗咬的。」三姐笑道：「谁教你们太作恶了。我还容情，他们四个跑得快，不然叫你一窝子六个滚在一堆。」那六个人我一句，你一句，把三姐骂了好一会，众佳人方才笑完，紫烟一人尚有余笑。绮香对浣兰道：「妹妹，你这个三姐真好，我拿个丫鬟与你换了罢。」浣兰道：「姐姐要他作什么，他是","en":"Hongxue added, \\"No need to wait for later. She'll be bitten the moment she leaves the gate.\\" Sanjie laughed triumphantly, \\"Who told you to be so wicked? I was actually merciful. The other four ran fast, or else all six of you would be rolling in one heap.\\" The six berated Sanjie roundly before the beauties finally stopped laughing—though Ziyan still"}]}`),"char-95":JSON.parse(`{"18":[{"paragraph":22,"mentions":1,"tokens":["玉天仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"今日来接他的是个开门户的陶家。这陶妈妈家里有三个姑娘，内中一个好的名叫玉天仙，是扬州人，生得风骚娇俏。这两天接着一个大嫖客，就是广东那个奚十一。陶妈妈打听他的家世，知他是海南大家，家有千万之富，兄弟十人，都作道府大员。老太爷是现任提台，家里开着洋行。又访他是个大冤桶，便想发他一票大财。无奈那几个姑娘不大懂他的话，兼之奚十大员","en":"Tao household, an establishment keeper. This Madam Tao had three girls in her house; the best of them, known as Jade Celestial Fairy (Yutianxian), was a native of Yangzhou, born vivacious and coquettishly attractive. These past two days she had received a big-spending patron, none other than Xi Eleven from Guangdong. Madam Tao had investigated his background and learned that he was"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":1,"tokens":["玉天仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"道菊花是广西人，又生得好看，必定勾得住他，所以把他接了过来，认为义女。登时换了崭新的衣服，与诸姊妹相见，菊花与玉天仙尤为相爱。菊花受尽了狼狈，到此已如出了地狱，心里还有甚不足，一心就候那奚十一来。","en":"foster daughter. At once new clothing was found for her, and she was introduced to all her foster sisters. She and Jade Celestial Fairy became especially fond of each other. After suffering such terrible hardships, Chrysanthemum felt as if she had escaped hell, leaving her with nothing to complain about. With one heart she awaited the coming of Xi Eleven."}],"19":[{"paragraph":16,"mentions":1,"tokens":["玉天仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"窗又与二喜说定，明日开发。梅窗让聘才等一同进城，他却住在城外，又到子佩处，两个同吃了一回烟，拉了子佩，到胭脂巷玉天仙家去了。","en":"back to Zipei's place, and the two of them had a smoke of opium together; then Meichuang dragged Zipei off to Yutianxian's house in Rouge Lane."}],"33":[{"paragraph":8,"mentions":2,"tokens":["玉天仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"那一日魏聘才请富三爷在蓉官寓里喝酒，富三爷想起一件事来，先进城去了。聘才便不进城，叫蓉官去叫了一个媳妇，名叫玉天仙，就借蓉官寓里过夜。将近二更，尚在那里喝酒唱曲。有个吏目郁泰孙来查夜，走了进来，与聘才认识的，且同过席听过戏的。聘才见是郁吏目，便放了心，让他入座，吏目不肯，聘才便与他顽笑起来。那吏目即变转脸来道：「老魏，今日讲不得顽笑，你可知道公事公办么？」聘才还","en":"something and went into the city first. Pincai stayed behind, instructing Rongguan to fetch a young woman named Yutianxian to spend the night at Rongguan's place. Approaching the second watch, they were still drinking and singing. An official named Yu Taisun came for a night inspection; he recognized Pincai, having shared meals and watched plays with him before. Pincai felt"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":2,"tokens":["玉天仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"太请安，说我只好转托人，碰他的运气罢。」梅进回去照直说了，颜夫人也无法，只得听其自然。且说聘才在监里许了蓉官与玉天仙许多银子，叫他们跟着他的口供，说系那日吏目请他在蓉官寓处吃酒，叫了媳妇玉天仙。饮酒中间，要问聘才借银一千两，聘才不允，因此口角。","en":"was at a loss and could only let things take their course. Meanwhile, in prison, Pincai promised Rongguan and Yutianxian a large sum of silver, instructing them to align their testimonies with his. He told them to claim that the official had invited him to drink at Rongguan's residence and had called for the woman, Yutianxian. During the drinking, the official asked Pincai"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":1,"tokens":["玉天仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"郁吏目预先带有兵役，即将他们锁了，带回寓所。改作查夜拿获，诈赃卖放，勒写欠票等情。玉天仙又供郁吏目常到他家吹烟饮酒，半月前发贴请分子，分金未到，因此挟嫌，设计锁拿。","en":"caught during a night inspection, extorted bribes for their release, and forced them to sign promissory notes. Yutianxian also testified that Official Yu frequently visited her home to smoke opium and drink; half a month earlier, he had sent an invitation for a share of the money, but when it didn't arrive, he harbored a grudge and set a trap to arrest them."},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":1,"tokens":["玉天仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子已知道了，欲待不管，心里又有些不安，只得着人到刑部里与他托情关照，因此轻办了好些。将吏目革职，聘才杖了二十，玉天仙逐出境外，蓉官释放回家，结了案。","en":"a much lighter sentence. Official Yu was dismissed from his post, Pincai received twenty strokes of the cane, Yutianxian was expelled from the jurisdiction, and Rongguan was released to go home, thus concluding the case."},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":1,"tokens":["玉天仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"前大不相同了。在店里住了两日，嫌他嘈杂，即租了宏济寺春航住的房子，高车大马，大阔起来。也不到梅宅去看望。蓉官、玉天仙时常往来，聘才以百金分送二人，又给了些零星玩好，日日征歌斗酒，自然有那一班气味相投的与他亲密。","en":"grand carriage and horses, he began to live extravagantly. He didn't even visit the Mei residence. Rongguan and Yutianxian visited frequently; Pincai distributed a hundred taels between them and gave them miscellaneous trinkets. Engaging in daily drinking and singing, he naturally drew close to a group of like-minded individuals."}],"34":[{"paragraph":13,"mentions":1,"tokens":["玉天仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"。自己进城取了一半现银回来，又在城外换了些钱，得意扬扬，十分高兴，所有账目尽行清还，过年热闹是不必说。晚上竟把玉天仙接到寺中，请唐和尚过来守岁，绝早关了山门。一夜的泥筒花炮放不绝声。","en":"it goes without saying that his New Year was a boisterous and extravagant affair. That evening, he even brought Yutianxian to the temple, invited Monk Tang over to observe the New Year's vigil, and locked the temple gates quite early. A night of fireworks and tube-flares crackled endlessly."},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":1,"tokens":["玉天仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"唐和尚恐元旦日有人来行香，适或见了玉天仙，到底在他寺里，有些不便。将近天明，即催聘才将车送他回去。","en":"Monk Tang worried that incense-offering worshippers might come on New Year's Day; if they were to spot Yutianxian within the temple grounds, it would be rather inconvenient. Thus, just as dawn approached, he urged Pincai to send her back via carriage."},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":1,"tokens":["玉天仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"兴要开赌，劝聘才做头家。聘才自思近来财运颇好，或者可以赢些钱，即于初九日晚上开起赌来。或是摇滩，或是掷骰，又把玉天仙接了来，坐在内室与他放头。第一日来的人还少，第二日渐渐多了，第三日便挤满了屋子。一人传两，两人传三，引了两个大赌客来，一个是奚十一，一个是潘三，各带重资。","en":"opened the gambling tables on the evening of the ninth. Whether playing fantan or rolling dice, he again brought Yutianxian over to sit in the inner room and manage the banker's cut with him. The turnout was small on the first day, gradually increased on the second, and by the third day, the room was packed to the brim. Word spread from one to two, from two to three, eventually"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":1,"tokens":["玉天仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"是日聘才赢了二百余金，放了一百八十两的头，与玉天仙收了。","en":"That day, Pincai won over two hundred taels of silver, and together with Yutianxian, collected one hundred and eighty taels in the banker's cut."},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":2,"tokens":["玉天仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一大赢，赢了八百五十余两，将五十余两分赏众小旦与聘才小使，自己收了八百两。奚十一看上了小和尚，赏了他十个中锭。玉天仙又得了二百四十两头钱。内中有个唐经承，就是和尚的兄弟，对着和尚道：「明日我劝你们别赌了。我先前进来时，门外有两个交头接耳的，像是坊里人，恐怕闹出事来，都不稳便。」聘才已是惊弓之鸟，听了便有些胆怯，说道：「我也乏了，歇两天再顽罢。」唐和尚道：「若说不高","en":"eight hundred for himself. Xi Eleven took a liking to the young novice monk and tipped him ten medium ingots. Yutianxian collected another two hundred and forty taels in banker's fees. Among the crowd was Clerk Tang, the monk's brother, who advised the monk, \\"I urge you all to stop gambling tomorrow. When I came in earlier, I saw two men whispering outside the door; they"}],"42":[{"paragraph":34,"mentions":1,"tokens":["玉天仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"儿子，吃了抹抹嘴就走。当家的死后，今日还是头一回开市，就遇着两个混账东西，与前年那个开姜店姓杨的杨八一样，不是玉天仙还叫他姊夫呢。归根儿是他妈的白吃白喝。这些个不要脸的狗鸡巴□的，真他妈的可恶！」长庆媳妇叨叨了一回。到明日，伍麻子去照票子，谁知后来添的一吊还是张假的。又到奚十一寓处来找亮轩，倒被奚十一的家人骂了一顿。伍麻子受屈而回，只得自己赔上一吊钱，交清了账，唯","en":"very likeness of that Yang Eight from the ginger shop the year before last, and he only got away with it because Yutianxian still calls him brother-in-law. It comes down to eating and drinking scot-free, damn them. These shameless dog-cock-… things — they are truly, damnably vile!\\" Changqing's widow ranted on for some time. The next day Wu Mazi went to exchange the notes"}],"50":[{"paragraph":18,"mentions":3,"tokens":["玉天仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"北去了，这也是他运气好。正月里被贼一偷，偷去衣服、银钱等物，共有千金，也就把他的家私去了一半。后来他又包了那个玉天仙，每月一百五十吊钱，四五个月也支持不来，渐渐的当卖东西起来。我常常劝他道：「婊子无情，兔子无义，你的钱也干了，他的情也断了。」谁知这玉天仙竟不给人料着，他与魏大爷十分相得，竟拆散不开，倒拿出他的积蓄来，与他捐了分发，说定了嫁他，到出京时同走。这魏大爷","en":"worth a full thousand taels, wiping out half his fortune in one night. Later, he took a fancy to that courtesan Yutianxian, paying her a hundred and fifty strings of cash every month. He couldn't keep that up for more than four or five months before he had to start pawning his belongings. I often warned him, 'Prostitutes are heartless, and actors lack loyalty. Once your"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":4,"tokens":["玉天仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"却说魏聘才与玉天仙相好，倒得了他的嫖钱，捐了分发，掣着湖北，好不有兴。已另租了几间房子，从寺里搬出来，与玉天仙同居。这两日置备些出京物件，已买了一个丫头，雇了一个老婆子，玉天仙做起奶奶来。这玉天仙本是扬州瘦马，到京来颇有声名。但年纪已二十七岁，比聘才大了两年。相貌极为","en":"Meanwhile, Wei Pincai, having won the deep affection of Yutianxian and secured her financial backing, purchased his official posting and drew an assignment to Hubei, filling him with immense elation. He quickly rented a few rooms, moved out of the temple, and set up a household with Yutianxian. Over the past few days,"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":5,"tokens":["玉天仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"白菊花未从良时与玉天仙同在一局，且甚相好，结为异姓姊妹，玉天仙长菊花两岁。菊花与奚十一讲了，要请玉天仙过来饯行，奚十一岂有不肯之理？即请了玉天仙到家。菊花出外迎接。到了里面见了礼，坐下各谈契阔。玉天仙道：「我见四妹从了良，又遇见这位多情的老爷，我便心上羡慕。不料的我的运气","en":"Before Bai Juhua had left her profession, she and Yutianxian had worked in the same establishment and were exceedingly close, having sworn an oath as adopted sisters; Yutianxian was the elder by two years. Juhua spoke with Xi Eleven, expressing her desire to invite Yutianxian over for a farewell meal. How could"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":2,"tokens":["玉天仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"玉天仙道：「你见过你姐夫么？」菊花道：「姐夫也常来找我们老爷，所以我也看见过他几次，人才是没有说的。」玉天仙面有喜色，笑道：「只要裙里香，管他十二房。妹妹这么个人，妹夫岂有不一心一意的。你看那杨八妹夫也是个从九，再没有选期，尽仗着看风水，能赚多少人？他家里","en":"Yutianxian asked eagerly, \\"Have you met your brother-in-law?\\" Juhua replied, \\"He used to visit our master often, so I've seen him several times. There is absolutely nothing to criticize about his looks or demeanor.\\" Yutianxian's face lit up with undisguised joy,"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":1,"tokens":["玉天仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"玉天仙吃了饭，谢了菊花要回，菊花送出来。到了二门，两人还是依依的拉着手，站住说话。姬亮轩在书房里听得清清楚楚，便剜破窗纸，闭着一眼，睁着一眼，从窗隙里望将出去。","en":"After they finished their meal, Yutianxian thanked Juhua and prepared to leave. Juhua escorted her out. When they reached the second gate, the two women lingered, holding hands affectionately, reluctant to part, and stood there talking softly. Ji Liangxuan, who was sitting in the nearby study,"},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":1,"tokens":["玉天仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"先见一个老婆子拿了衣包，又一个小丫头拿了一根长烟袋、一把团扇。只见玉天仙一身华服，满头珠翠，很像个奶奶模样。","en":"clothes, followed by a young maidservant holding a long tobacco pipe and a round silk fan. Then, his eyes fell upon Yutianxian—draped in luxurious silks, her hair heavy with pearls and emeralds, looking every inch the grand, dignified madam."},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":2,"tokens":["玉天仙"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"口内流涎。谁料这个窗纸还是旧年糊的，风吹日晒，也脆极了。亮轩只顾偷看，把个额角靠在纸上，拍的一响，裂破了一块。玉天仙回头见窗内有人偷看他们，玉天仙也就走了出去。菊花送出二门，看上了车，转身回来，抬头望见亮轩的窗纸破处，他尚在里面偷看。欲要笑时，已勉强忍住，低着头进去了。","en":"his forehead hard against the paper. With a loud snap!, a large piece tore right open. Startled by the noise, Yutianxian turned her head, spotted someone spying on them from behind the window, and quickly hurried out. Juhua escorted her through the second gate, watched her safely into her carriage, and turned back. Looking up, she immediately noticed the jagged tear in"}]}`),"char-96":{6:[{paragraph:2,mentions:1,tokens:["陆氏夫人"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"到了初五日，颜夫人也要请客，请了他表嫂王文辉的陆氏夫人，并他家孙氏少奶奶，与两位表侄女，又请了孙亮功的陆氏夫人，与其大姑娘，并两位少奶奶，就是孙大姑娘辞了不来。",en:"that household's young mistress née Sun and his two cousin-nieces. She also invited the wife of Sun Lianggong, Madam Lu, together with her eldest daughter and two young mistresses—though the eldest Miss Sun politely declined."},{paragraph:4,mentions:4,tokens:["陆氏夫人","陆夫人"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"孙家的陆氏夫人，是陆宗沅的胞妹。王家的陆夫人年四十一岁，孙家的陆夫人年三十九岁。这两位夫人都是续娶的。虽在中年，却还生得少艾，不过像三十来岁的人，而且性爱秾华，其服饰与少年人一样。王文辉的夫人生得风流窈窕，是个直性爽快人，与文辉琴瑟和谐。这孙家的陆夫人，容貌也与乃",en:"The Madam Lu of the Sun family was Lu Zongyuan's full sister. The Wang family's Madam Lu was forty-one, while the Sun family's Madam Lu was thirty-nine. Both women were second wives. Though entering middle age, they retained a remarkably youthful grace, appearing"},{paragraph:5,mentions:1,tokens:["陆夫人"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"陆夫人就生了王恂的少奶奶一个，名叫佩秋，生得德容兼备，爱若掌珠，十八岁嫁与王家去了。还有个白头的大姑娘，是不能嫁人的，新年已二十九岁。嗣徽二十六，嗣元二十四，这两个废物，都已娶了亲。嗣徽娶的沈氏，是国子监司业沈恭之女，名字叫做芸姑。生得齐齐整整，伶俐聪明，",en:"Madam Lu had borne but one child of her own—Wang Xun's wife. Named Peiqiu, she was a paragon of virtue and beauty, cherished like a precious pearl, and had been married into the Wang household at eighteen. There was also the eldest daughter, her hair prematurely"},{paragraph:10,mentions:2,tokens:["孙家太太","陆氏夫人"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"见了颜夫人，各叙了些寒温。陆夫人问起子玉来，颜夫人说他父亲带他出门去了，琼华小姐心里始觉安稳。忽见仆妇报导：「孙家太太与少奶奶到。颜夫人也降阶迎接，陆氏夫人是常见的，那两位少奶奶虽见过两次，看今日装饰起来愈觉娇艳，颜夫人也深知其所适非人，便心里十分疼爱起来。当下各人见礼已毕，谈起家常来，文辉的夫人，总称赞子玉，似有欣羡之意。亮功的夫人笑道：「姐姐，你的外甥固好，就我",en:'announced, "The Madam and young mistresses of the Sun family have arrived." Lady Yan stepped forward to greet them. Madam Lu was a familiar presence, and while she had encountered the two young mistresses before, their elaborate attire today made them appear even more stunning. Fully aware of their unfortunate marriages, Lady Yan felt a profound compassion for them. Once the'}],7:[{paragraph:4,mentions:1,tokens:["孙家太太"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"。我见二姑娘看书的时候，翻出一张纸来看了看、用指甲挖破一处，仍旧夹在书里。」又笑道：「前日我听得二姑娘雪儿说，孙家太太做媒，将二姑娘配了少爷了，将二姑娘配了少爷了，二姑娘还戴了太太一根簪子回去。」子玉似信不信的问道：「我不信，你敢是撒谎的？」小丫鬟道：「我敢撒谎？我那天看着房没有敢走开，这是雪儿说的。只怕咱们家里人，都也知道。」子玉听了心内甚喜，猛想起这二表妹的容貌",en:`back in the book." She then laughed and added, "The other day, I heard the Second Miss's maid, Xue'er, say that Madam Sun acted as a matchmaker and betrothed the Second Miss to you, Young Master—she even took one of the Mistress's hairpins with her." Half-believing, Ziyu asked, "I don't believe it—are you making this up?" The maidservant protested, "Would I dare lie? I`}],15:[{paragraph:4,mentions:1,tokens:["孙家太太"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"士燮也择于三月初十日动身，今日已是初五了。颜夫人与士燮说道：「新年上，孙家太太为媒，与王表嫂面订了二姑娘，将玉簪子为定。你如今又远行了，也须过个礼，不是这样就算的，别要教人怪起来。」士燮笑道：「你不说我竟想不起，这个是必要的，明日就请孙伯敬为媒就是了。」正说话间，孙亮功来拜，士燮出见，问了起程日子，便说起他的夫人的意思来，说：",en:`third month for his own departure, and today was already the fifth. Lady Yan said to Shixie: "At the New Year, Madam Sun acted as matchmaker and a verbal agreement was reached with Cousin Wang's wife for the second daughter, with a jade hairpin as a token of betrothal. Now you are going far away again. We must perform some formal ceremony; one cannot simply leave it at`},{paragraph:14,mentions:2,tokens:["陆夫人"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"却说孙亮功回去与陆夫人商量，要将大女儿许与元茂，陆夫人冷笑了几声，不发一言，亮功不敢再说。然主意已定，明日去托王文辉为媒，文辉踌躇了半天，心里想道：「这个白人儿，怎好嫁人？」因又想道：「那李元茂，也不是个佳婿，呆头呆脑的，那一天作个揖，就将我的帽子碰歪，只好娶这样媳妇。」",en:"Now let us speak of Sun Lianggong, who returned home and discussed with Madam Lu the idea of betrothing his eldest daughter to Yuanmao. Madam Lu laughed coldly several times without saying a word; Lianggong did not dare press her further. Nevertheless, his mind was made up, and the next day he went to ask Wang Wenhui to act as matchmaker."}],20:[{paragraph:6,mentions:1,tokens:["陆夫人"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"初一，正值王通政生日，虽不做寿，家中却也有些至交好友亲戚同年来贺，内里又有些太太姑娘们，如梅宅的颜夫人，孙宅的陆夫人之类，也觉得热闹。王恂与仲清这怡园之约，就不能去了。是日子云、次贤知道了，也去拜拜寿，适遇南湘、春航皆在，就约了回来。仲清、王恂说如客散得早，也来赴约。",en:"offer their congratulations, and indoors there were also ladies — such as Lady Yan from the Mei household and Madam Lu from the Sun household — so it was quite festive. Wang Xun and Zhongqing were thus unable to attend the Garden of Contentment appointment. On learning of this, Ziyun and Cixian also went to offer birthday congratulations; there they happened to find"}],39:[{paragraph:5,mentions:1,tokens:["陆氏夫人"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"吉时，都送元茂到了孙宅，孙宅鼓乐迎接。此位姑娘系亮功前室所生，如今这位夫人也不甚钟爱他，故此一切从简。女客只有陆氏夫人的嫂子，就是陆宗沅的夫人，带了小女儿前来。男家早上道过喜了。倒是姬亮轩在那里假热闹，心上想闹闹新房，自有两位废物招接。",en:"welcomed with drums and music. The young lady in question was the daughter of Lianggong's first wife; the current Madam Sun did not dote on her especially, and so the whole affair was conducted simply. Among the female guests, only the sister-in-law of Madam Lu, the wife of Lu Zongyuan, had come, bringing her young daughter. The groom's family had offered their congratulations"},{paragraph:24,mentions:2,tokens:["陆夫人"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"孙氏见丈夫两三天不回，心上急了，禀明了父母。亮功大怒，陆夫人也有了气，便着人到梅宅上一问，没有去。又各处找寻，找到了聘才处，找着了。元茂尚不肯回去，聘才力劝，方同了来人回家，犹不肯进房，在书房中同嗣徽说闲话。晚间亮功回来，即说了元茂几句，陆夫人也责备了元茂一番，然究竟心上有些对不住元茂，半说半劝的叫他进房。元",en:"fail to return for two or three days, grew anxious and reported the matter to her parents. Lianggong was furious; Madam Lu too was displeased, and she sent someone to the Mei household to inquire, but he was not there. After searching everywhere, he was found at Pincai's. Yuanmao still refused to go back; only after Pincai pressed him earnestly did he agree to return with"}],51:[{paragraph:26,mentions:1,tokens:["陆夫人"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"通州写了四个太平船赴任，自然的一样饯行热闹。惟有王恂的夫人，见父亲哥嫂一齐出京，未免凄凉悲苦，在母家住了几日。陆夫人也疼爱到十分，又不能带他赴任，只好劝慰他一番。元茂与孙氏是同去的。元茂外间有些亏空，这两天追逼起来，孙氏虽有些妆资，但不肯与元茂花消。元茂问他要钱时，便骂起来，说：「不是叫相公，就是嫖婊子。我也不给你钱，你也不许出去。」此时元茂被人追急了，无词可对，",en:"capital at once, felt an acute sense of desolate sorrow, and chose to stay at her maternal home for a few days. Madam Lu loved her daughter dearly, but unable to bring her along to the new post, could only offer comforting words. Yuanmao and Madam Sun were to travel together. However, Yuanmao's outside debts were now pressing him hard. Although Madam Sun possessed a substantial"}]},"char-97":{6:[{paragraph:5,mentions:1,tokens:["芸姑"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"，新年已二十九岁。嗣徽二十六，嗣元二十四，这两个废物，都已娶了亲。嗣徽娶的沈氏，是国子监司业沈恭之女，名字叫做芸姑。生得齐齐整整，伶俐聪明，嫁了过来，见了那样丈夫，便想自寻短见，被他的丫鬟苦劝，只得自己怨命。后来回了娘家，不肯过来。",en:"twenty-four, were two thoroughly useless men who had nonetheless both taken wives. Sihui had married Miss Shen, named Yungu, daughter of the Imperial College Director Shen Gong. Neat, clever, and endearing, she was driven to thoughts of despair the moment she arrived at her new home and laid eyes upon her husband. Only the desperate pleas of her maidservant stayed her hand,"}]},"char-98":{6:[{paragraph:7,mentions:1,tokens:["来凤"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"这嗣元娶的是巴氏，名字叫做来凤。父亲巴天宠，是上江凤阳人，清白出身。自小当兵，生得一表人材，精于弓马，又得了军功，年才四十余岁，已升到总兵之职，现在天津镇守海口。听了媒人谎话，将个爱女嫁了嗣元。",en:"Siyuan had married a woman of the Ba clan, named Laifeng. Her father, Ba Tianchong, hailed from Fengyang in Anhui, a man of clean and respectable lineage. A soldier since his youth, possessing a striking countenance and mastery in archery and horsemanship, his martial prowess had propelled him to the rank"}]},"char-99":{6:[{paragraph:2,mentions:1,tokens:["孙大姑娘"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"他表嫂王文辉的陆氏夫人，并他家孙氏少奶奶，与两位表侄女，又请了孙亮功的陆氏夫人，与其大姑娘，并两位少奶奶，就是孙大姑娘辞了不来。",en:"invited the wife of Sun Lianggong, Madam Lu, together with her eldest daughter and two young mistresses—though the eldest Miss Sun politely declined."}],39:[{paragraph:20,mentions:2,tokens:["孙氏"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"那孙氏也猜不出他作什么。元茂费了半夜心，早上又睡着了。孙氏梳好了头，元茂才起来净脸时，就牢记着发顶里有纸包，急忙带上帽子，跑到外间，打开一看，却是漆黑的一根。",en:"Madam Sun could not imagine what he had been doing. Yuanmao had spent half the night at his maneuvers, and in the morning slept in. Madam Sun had long since finished combing her hair. When Yuanmao finally got up and was washing his face, he remembered the paper"},{paragraph:22,mentions:3,tokens:["孙氏"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"约过了半月，那一天事当败露。孙氏梳头时，觉得身上有些凉，叫丫鬟出去拿件半臂来穿，不料元茂已起来，见丫鬟拿了衣服进那间屋里去，他就跟了进去，不及关门。只见坐着一个人，身穿件大红紧身，披着一头银丝似的细发，有三尺余长，两道淡金色眉毛。李元茂心中唬了一大跳，当是遇见了鬼，欲要转身，心中想",en:"About half a month passed, and then one day the truth came out. While Madam Sun was combing her hair she felt a chill and called a maidservant to fetch her a sleeveless jacket from the other room. Yuanmao was already up, and seeing the maid carrying clothes into that other room, he followed along without enough time for the door"},{paragraph:23,mentions:1,tokens:["孙氏"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"原来孙氏那几天把香油调了灯煤，再和了柿漆。先梳好了，然后将油漆细细的刷上，比人的还光还亮。就是天天要洗一回，不然就难梳，而且也刷不上去。洗时用皂荚水一桶，用硼砂、明矾洗干净，晾得半干，然后梳挽，也要一个时辰。今日略迟了些，因此败露。元茂气哄哄的崛了出去，在魏",en:"As it happened, Madam Sun had for some time been mixing sesame oil with lampblack and then adding persimmon lacquer. She would first comb her hair out neatly and then carefully paint on the mixture, and the effect was sleeker and glossier than natural hair. The process required"},{paragraph:24,mentions:1,tokens:["孙氏"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"孙氏见丈夫两三天不回，心上急了，禀明了父母。亮功大怒，陆夫人也有了气，便着人到梅宅上一问，没有去。又各处找寻，找到了聘才处，找着了。元茂尚不肯回去，聘才力劝，方同了来人回家，犹不肯进房，在书房中同嗣徽说闲话。晚间亮功回来，即说了元茂几句，陆夫人也责备了元",en:"Madam Sun, seeing her husband fail to return for two or three days, grew anxious and reported the matter to her parents. Lianggong was furious; Madam Lu too was displeased, and she sent someone to the Mei household to inquire, but he was not there. After searching"},{paragraph:25,mentions:5,tokens:["孙氏"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"他进来，要他先上来赔话，坐着不动。灯光之下，元茂依然看了黑白分明，是个美人，心上便活动了些，只得先说了一句话，孙氏也慢慢的答了一句。元茂垂着头，闭着眼，想了一回，想得了一个绝妙的主意，跳将起来，对着孙氏嘻嘻的笑。孙氏见他回心转意，反倒拿腔作势要收服他，冷冷的不言语，自己对镜顾影，做作一番。元茂忍不住道：「你何妨对我直讲，要瞒我作什么？我们既成了夫妇，自然拆不开了",en:"Madam Sun, seeing him come in, wanted him to speak first and apologize, and sat without stirring. In the lamplight Yuanmao looked again and saw her distinctly black and white, a real beauty, and his heart softened a little. He spoke first. Madam Sun slowly replied."},{paragraph:26,mentions:3,tokens:["孙氏"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"孙氏被他说得喜欢，便也笑颜悦色起来，道：「此刻尚早，何不着人去买了，明日就可用了。」元茂道：「买了来，今晚就用，省得又染我一脸。」孙氏叫丫头出去告诉了管事的，叫他买一个网巾、一个髻子、一个燕尾，速速的办来。果然不多一刻，即买齐了。孙氏喜欢不尽，即刻熬了一",en:`Madam Sun was pleased by this, and her expression softened into smiles. She said, "It's still early, so why not send someone to buy it now so it's ready for tomorrow morning?" Yuanmao said, "Buy it now and we can use it tonight, saving my face from being smeared`},{paragraph:27,mentions:1,tokens:["孙氏"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"元茂又叫他索性把鬓脚及四围修去些，便不露出来。孙氏也叫老婆子用剃刀刮去一转，把眉毛也索性刮掉了，脸上也刮得光光的。把网巾戴上，真发盘了一圈，加上那假髻子，将簪子别好，扎上燕尾，额上戴上个翠翘，画了眉，真加了几分标致。",en:"Yuanmao then suggested she trim and shave back the temple-hair and the hairline all around so nothing would show. Madam Sun had an old serving-woman take a razor and shave all around the edges, and shaved off the eyebrows entirely as well; the fine down on her face was shaved smooth too. Then the hairnet was fitted on, the real hair coiled once around the base, the false"},{paragraph:28,mentions:3,tokens:["孙氏"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"晚上看了，竟是个醉杨妃一样。孙氏叫点了两枝大蜡，一前一后用两面镜子照了，觉得美不可言。元茂看了，也心花大开，走拢来，把他头上闻了一闻，将脸上擦了两擦，微有一点油，不像前头落色了。喜孜孜的支开了丫头，携手上床，同入鸳衾，开了一枝夜合花。元茂忽又想起前夜拔毛之事，便问孙氏道：「我闻得天",en:"By evening she looked for all the world like the Tipsy Lady Yang. Madam Sun had two large candles lit and used two mirrors, one in front and one behind, to admire herself from all angles, and she found the effect breathtaking. Yuanmao, looking at her, felt his heart blossom with delight; he stepped close, smelled the top of"},{paragraph:29,mentions:3,tokens:["孙氏"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"孙氏不肯，元茂道：「我还嫌你？如今我都替你这么样了，还隐藏作什么？」孙氏不语。元茂赤身下床，携了烛照，把被揭开，孙氏尚要遮掩，元茂见他身上真是雪霜似的，甚为可爱。",en:`Madam Sun refused. Yuanmao said, "Can you still be keeping things from me? After all I've done to fix things for you, what is there to hide?" Madam Sun said nothing. Yuanmao climbed naked out of bed, took up the candle, folded back the quilt. Madam Sun tried to`},{paragraph:30,mentions:1,tokens:["孙氏"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"看到那妙处，好似骑了一匹银鬃马，倒应了聘才的笑话，真像一相蝇拂子遮着。元茂忍不住笑了一声，把他拧了一把。孙氏骂道：「作什么，你原也是个近视眼，何不也闻闻？」元茂看动了心，放了灯，上床去了。秽事休题，且看下回分解。",en:`for all the world like a fly-whisk held over herself. Yuanmao could not suppress a laugh, and gave her a pinch. Madam Sun said, "What do you think you're doing? Aren't you yourself a nearsighted man? Why not have a good sniff as well?" Yuanmao, moved by what he had seen, set down the candle and climbed back into bed. What followed between them need not be told. As to what`}],51:[{paragraph:23,mentions:1,tokens:["孙氏"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"且说李元茂侥幸了这个秀才，也十分得意。见了孙氏，便夸奖他的才学，说嗣徽是代枪的，嗣元不通，以致打了板子。",en:"As for Li Yuanmao, his stroke of luck in securing the licentiate degree filled him with immense self-satisfaction. In the presence of the Sun family, he loudly boasted of his own scholarly prowess, casually dropping that Sihui had relied on a ghostwriter, and that Siyuan's utter incompetence was the true cause of his beating."},{paragraph:24,mentions:11,tokens:["孙氏"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"孙氏也觉光彩，到底丈夫算个读书人了。元茂看着孙氏虽然假眉、假发，但五官生得颇好，又高又胖，是个有福之相，比起缝穷婆来，虽没有他风骚，到底比他干净了好些。到了并头夜合之际，已离了二十来天，未免彼此贪爱。况元茂学问也长了许多，孙氏又比不得那缝穷婆尝过那冲烦疲",en:"Madam Sun also felt a glow of reflected glory; her husband was, at last, a recognized scholar. Yuanmao looked at her closely. Though she wore painted eyebrows and a false hairpiece, her features were pleasing. She was tall and pleasantly plump, possessing a countenance"},{paragraph:25,mentions:1,tokens:["孙氏"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"孙氏犹咬着牙，把他搡了两搡，元茂又上去巴结了一回方好。",en:"Her teeth still gritted in fury, Madam Sun shoved him away roughly several times. Yuanmao had to spend a long while fawning and coaxing before she finally softened."},{paragraph:26,mentions:4,tokens:["孙氏"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"，见父亲哥嫂一齐出京，未免凄凉悲苦，在母家住了几日。陆夫人也疼爱到十分，又不能带他赴任，只好劝慰他一番。元茂与孙氏是同去的。元茂外间有些亏空，这两天追逼起来，孙氏虽有些妆资，但不肯与元茂花消。元茂问他要钱时，便骂起来，说：「不是叫相公，就是嫖婊子。我也不给你钱，你也不许出去。」此时元茂被人追急了，无词可对，只得苦苦哀求他媳妇说，系进学费用，此时都应归还，并不是嫖",en:`daughter dearly, but unable to bring her along to the new post, could only offer comforting words. Yuanmao and Madam Sun were to travel together. However, Yuanmao's outside debts were now pressing him hard. Although Madam Sun possessed a substantial dowry, she adamantly refused to let Yuanmao squander it. Whenever he asked for money, she would scold him bitterly: "If you're`},{paragraph:31,mentions:3,tokens:["孙氏"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"想心中有事，便一径出来。到了家，方知镯子被他狼去，心里甚急，再去找他，又不在家了，一肚子苦说不出来，丧气而回。孙氏问他为何出去了大半天才回，元茂只得支吾说还账耽搁了。到晚上，元茂更加着急，梦中还是长吁短叹，孙氏也不解其故，一夜云雨稀疏，应名而已。孙氏疑他精力乏了，也不来惹他。",en:"he wasn't home. With a belly full of bitter grievances he dared not voice, he trudged back, utterly defeated. Madam Sun demanded to know why he had been out for half the day. Yuanmao could only stammer a weak excuse about being delayed by settling accounts. That night, his anxiety intensified; his sleep was plagued by deep sighs and restless moans. Madam Sun, oblivious"},{paragraph:32,mentions:1,tokens:["孙氏"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"还，才把那些零星馆子帐、相公开发及婊子嫖钱还个清楚。也到各处辞了行，遂同丈人出了京，到了凤阳府，住了一月，同着孙氏到他父亲任上去了。",en:"departed the capital alongside his father-in-law. They traveled to Fengyang, stayed for a month, and then Yuanmao and Madam Sun continued on to his father's official posting."}]},"char-101":{58:[{paragraph:31,mentions:5,tokens:["石氏"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"十余年。潘三四十岁上又娶了一房，是山西人，姓石，其父在京里开个油盐酱醋的小铺子，发了些财，开了个小小账局。这个石氏颇有几分姿色，潘三看中了，娶他已有十年。石氏才二十八岁，情性风骚。起初与潘三尚称恩爱，后来见潘三心不足，鬼头鬼脑，瞒着他外面偷鸡盗狗，因此从醋里生出恨，恨里生出厌来。潘三爱他生得好看，便从爱里生出顺，顺里生出怕来。一边越软，一边越硬，日久相沿，潘三成",en:"fifty-three, but they had parted over ten years before. At forty Pan had taken a second wife, a Shanxi woman surnamed Lady Shi. Her father ran a small oil, salt, and vinegar shop in the capital, made money, and opened a tiny lending house. Lady Shi was fairly good-looking. Pan fancied her and had been married to her for ten years. She was twenty-eight and her temperament was"},{paragraph:32,mentions:4,tokens:["石氏"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"叙起他们一件闲事来。今年六月初六，唐和尚生日，请潘三、奚十一在庙里吃面，又备了两桌送与白菊花、石氏。石氏处是打发得月送去。这石氏见了得月那个模样，中心甚是爱他，给了他许多东西，便要他做干儿子。得月岂有不肯，便拜了干娘，以后常常叫他来走动。得月若来，必陪着石氏吃饭，或时抹牌顽耍。又知道潘三爱男风，必想得月，不许他进来窥探，潘三竟不敢进来，只好暗地垂",en:"birthday, he invited Pan the Third and Xi Eleven to the temple for noodles, and sent two tables to Bai Juhua and to Lady Shi. Lady Shi's table went by Deyue. Lady Shi took one look at Deyue and loved him, gave him many gifts, and asked him to be her godson. Deyue agreed at once, kowtowed to his godmother, and afterward was often summoned to visit. When Deyue came he dined"},{paragraph:33,mentions:8,tokens:["石氏"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"得月来看干娘，那日天气很热，见石氏在房中将席子铺在地上，穿件没有领子的白罗布短袖汗衫，却也大镶大滚，只齐到腰间，穿条桃红纱裤，四寸金莲，甚是伶俏，两鬓茉莉花如雪，胸前映出个红纱兜肚，眉目澄清，肌肤白腻，实足动人。叫得月也在席上坐了，又叫小丫鬟拿了水果儿、冰梅汤、西瓜等类放在一边，叫小",en:"Deyue came to see his godmother on a very hot day. Lady Shi had spread a mat on the floor in her room and wore a collarless white ramie short summer shirt, wide-bordered, reaching only her waist, with peach-red gauze trousers and four-inch golden lotuses, looking quite fetching. She had jasmine white at both"},{paragraph:34,mentions:2,tokens:["石氏"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"潘其观驮了个小小石碑，尚不知觉，一心倒想顽那得月。后来也有些疑心，看出石氏待得月的情景。过了两月，心生一计。一日，候着得月进来，半路截留，邀他到一间书房内，开了一个灯，与他吃烟。潘三睡在得月后头，摸摸索索，得月不肯。潘三道：「你若不依我，我便不许你进来。你们娘儿两个做的事，当我不知道么？我不过不肯丢你们的脸。你若不依我，我",en:`tablet on his back without noticing, his mind only on sporting with Deyue. Later he grew suspicious and read how Lady Shi treated Deyue. After two months he formed a plan. One day he intercepted Deyue halfway to a visit, pulled him into a study, lit a lamp, and smoked with him. Pan lay behind Deyue, fumbling, but Deyue refused. Pan threatened, "Refuse and I'll forbid your`},{paragraph:35,mentions:3,tokens:["石氏"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"石氏那日约定得月早饭后来的，等了好一会，还不见来，心里也恐潘三半路打劫。他悄悄的到书房来，见关上门，更加疑心。听了一听，觉两人切切促促的私语，听不明白，便轻轻的走到窗下来。见又下了卷窗，便将舌尖舔破了纸一望，见潘三抱着得月坐在身上，两脸相偎，索索的动。一",en:"That day Lady Shi had arranged for Deyue to come after breakfast. She waited long without him and feared Pan would intercept. Quietly she went to the study and found the door shut, raising more suspicion. Listening, she heard whispers she could not make out, and crept"},{paragraph:36,mentions:2,tokens:["石氏"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"石氏怒容满面，狠狠的瞅了他一眼。潘三一脚跨出来，石氏站起，一把将胡子揪牢。潘三魂不附体，低了头，一动也不敢动。",en:"Lady Shi's face was full of wrath as she glared. Pan stepped out, Lady Shi rose and seized his beard full. Pan's soul fled, and he hung his head, motionless."},{paragraph:37,mentions:3,tokens:["石氏"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"石氏骂道：「你这不要脸的老忘八、老兔子，自己的屁股被人断出虫来，才花了钱请人挖干净了，你如今又想肏人，你何不弯转你的屌子来，善你自己的？他是我的干儿子，你胆包了身，你敢顽他？」便使劲一个嘴巴，潘三「啊哟」一声，血流满面，也顾不得胡子，死命的挣脱了，胡子已",en:`Lady Shi cursed, "Shameless old turtle, old rabbit! Your own backside wormed till you paid to have it dug clean, and now you want more. Why not bend your own rod into yourself? He's my godson, how dare you touch him?" She slapped with all her might. Pan cried`},{paragraph:38,mentions:2,tokens:["石氏"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"且说潘三被石氏这一掌，如何就打得这般利害，满面流血呢？原来石氏带了两个银指甲，一抓戳在潘三鼻子上，因用力太猛，将那银指甲打断，既薄且尖，竟将潘三的鼻子尖刮断，故此流得满面的血。潘三痛不可忍，忙忙跑出，就请了与奚十一修肾的那个阳善修医治，也与他配了个假鼻子。潘三因在",en:"How could a single slap from Lady Shi have left Pan's whole face running with blood? She wore two silver fingernail guards, and one swipe caught Pan's nose. The guard was thin and sharp and snapped, slicing off the tip of his nose, hence the blood. Pan could not bear the pain, fled, and"}]},"char-102":JSON.parse(`{"1":[{"paragraph":43,"mentions":1,"tokens":["云儿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"气寒冷，起了朔风，且是冬月中旬，便叫家人媳妇取出副葡萄的猞猁裘与他穿了，吩咐车里也换了白狐暖围。两个小使：一个云儿，一个俊儿，骑了马，先到他表母舅王通政宅内，适值通政出门去了，通政的少君出来接进。这王通政的少君，名字单叫个恂字，号庸庵，年方二十二岁。","en":"wear. She also ordered the carriage interior changed to a warm white fox-fur lining. Two young pages, one named Yun'er and the other Jun'er, rode ahead on horseback. First, they went to the residence of his maternal uncle, the Commissioner Wang. As it happened, the Commissioner had gone out, but his eldest son came out to welcome him in. This young master of the Wang"},{"paragraph":47,"mentions":1,"tokens":["云儿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"以疏于物色。你何不同我去听两出戏，使我广广眼界？」王恂道：「很好。」即吩咐套了车，备了马，就随身便服。子玉也叫云儿拿便帽来换了。王恂道：「那《花选》联锦有六个，联珠只有两个，自然听联锦了。」即同子玉到了戏园。子玉一进门，见人山人海坐满了一园，便有些懊悔，不愿进去。王恂引他从人缝里侧着身子挤到了台口，子玉见满池子坐的，没有一个好人，楼上楼下，略还有些象样的。看座儿","en":"\\"Very well.\\" He ordered a carriage prepared and horses saddled, and they changed into casual attire. Ziyu also had Yun'er fetch a casual hat to change into. Wang Xun noted, \\"The 'Selection of Flowers' lists six from Lianjin and only two from Lianzhu, so naturally we shall go hear Lianjin.\\" They then headed to the theater together. Upon entering, Ziyu saw a sea of humanity,"},{"paragraph":50,"mentions":2,"tokens":["云儿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"」王恂道：「改日罢。」那相公便缠住了王恂，要带他吃饭。子玉实在坐不住了，又恐王恂要拉他同去，不如先走为妙，便叫云儿去看车。云儿不一刻进来说：「都伺候了。」子玉即对王恂道：「我要回去了。」王恂知他坐不住，自己也觉得无趣，说道：","en":"could sit there no longer, and fearing Wang Xun might drag him along, decided it was best to leave first. He told Yun'er to go check the carriage. Yun'er came back a moment later and said, \\"It's ready.\\" Ziyu immediately said to Wang Xun, \\"I am going back.\\" Knowing Ziyu couldn't stand it, and feeling rather bored himself, Wang Xun said,"}],"2":[{"paragraph":8,"mentions":2,"tokens":["云儿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"问了姓名，性全让他上坐，聘才只是不肯。子玉想了一想：「先生父子乍见，定然有些说话。」就引聘才到对面船房内坐下，云儿与俊儿送了茶。聘才笑道、「世兄可还认得小弟么？」子玉道：「面善的很，实在想不起了。」聘才笑道：「从来说贵人多忘事，是不差的。那一年，世兄同着老伯母进京，小弟送到船上。世兄双手拉住了腰带，定要叫小弟同伴进京，老伯母好容易哄骗，方才放手，难道竟不记得了？","en":"moment to converse in private, tactfully escorted Pincai to the boat-shaped annex across the courtyard, where Yun'er and Jun'er soon served them tea. Pincai smiled warmly and asked, \\"Does my elder brother still recognize me?\\" Ziyu replied apologetically, \\"Your face is familiar, but I confess I cannot quite place you.\\" Pincai laughed, \\"They say men of distinction have"}],"4":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["云儿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"风燥，现在求雪，幸亏我们说着琴官，所以感召天和，样样献瑞。」聘才道：「今晚若下得一宿，明日我们就可以赏雪了。」云儿已拿了斗篷、风帽来，请子玉穿戴了进去。","en":"every side.\\" Pincai replied, \\"If it snows the whole night through, tomorrow we may go out to admire it.\\" By then, Yun'er had already fetched cloaks and wind-hoods, helping Ziyu put them on before leading him back inside."},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":1,"tokens":["云儿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"白鹇失素」句，叹赏古人工于摹绘。忽见天又阴得沉了，又悠悠扬扬的起来，那房上树上的雪，被风刮得如梨花乱舞。即吩咐云儿，叫厨房多备几样莱，请魏、李两位少爷赏雪。少顷，送过一桌佳肴，请了聘才、元茂过来一同赏玩。","en":"were swept up by the wind, scattering in a chaotic dance like falling pear blossoms. He immediately instructed Yun'er to have the kitchen prepare extra dishes, and invited the young gentlemen Wei and Li to come and admire the snow. Before long, a table of fine delicacies was laid out, and Pincai and Yuanmao arrived to enjoy the snowy vista together."},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":1,"tokens":["云儿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「我的不必拿去献丑罢。」子玉道：「这又何妨？我替你们写。」另用一张纸写了。又在回书后面，添了两句。封好了，打发云儿与健儿同去。","en":"separate sheet of paper, added two more lines to the end of his reply letter, sealed the whole thing, and sent Yun'er to go with the attendant."}],"6":[{"paragraph":20,"mentions":3,"tokens":["云儿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"闷的不高兴，见了子玉华冠丽服的出来，相形之下颇不相称，便赌气脱下衣裳，仍穿了便服，说道：「我不去了。」子玉就命云儿进去。禀知太太，将我的衣服拿一副出来，说李少爷要穿，云儿随即捧了一包出来。谁知子玉虽与元茂差不多高，而身材大小却差得远甚。元茂项粗腰大，不说别的，这领子就扣不上；束起腰来，短了三寸。子玉道：「不好，我的衣服你穿不得，不如穿我们老爷的罢。」又叫云儿进去","en":"tore off his clothes, reverting to his ordinary dress, declaring, \\"I will not go.\\" Ziyu immediately dispatched Yun'er to inform the Mistress and request a set of his own clothes for Young Master Li. Yun'er promptly returned with a bundle. Yet, while Ziyu and Yuanmao shared a similar height, their builds were vastly different: Yuanmao possessed a thick neck and a broad"}],"9":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["云儿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"聊，恰好梅进进来说道：「刘少爷、颜少爷、王少爷，请少爷出去逛灯，都在门口等着。」子玉禀过父母，梅进即叫套了车，云儿跟着出来。仲清等却在车里等着，见子玉出来便下了车。刘文泽道：「如此良宵，千金一刻，我们趁着灯月，倒是步行好些，把车跟在后头，回来再坐罢。」子玉道：「甚好。」四人慢慢的走，一路闲谈，不多时就到了灯市。","en":"lanterns. They are all waiting at the gate.\\" Ziyu reported to his parents, Mei Jin had the carriage harnessed, and Yun'er followed along. Zhongqing and the others were waiting in the carriage, stepping down when they saw Ziyu emerge. Liu Wenze said: \\"On such a fine night, worth a thousand gold pieces, let us take advantage of the lantern-lit moon and walk. That would be"}],"10":[{"paragraph":44,"mentions":1,"tokens":["云儿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"不多一会，子玉心里十分清爽，又把琴言饱看了一番，虽彼此衷曲不能在人前细剖，却已心许目成，意在不言之表了。子玉令云儿抱了瑶琴，向子云、次贤道了谢出来。琴言悄悄的问后会之期，子玉心里觉得十分难受，勉强的道：「稍有空闲，即当相聚。」大家送到上车地方，大有依依不舍之意，一直望他车子出了园门，宝珠、琴言也各上车回去。欲知后事，再听下回分解。","en":"pledge, an unspoken understanding conveyed beautifully through glance and expression. Ziyu directed his page boy Yun'er to take the jade qin, and then said his fond farewells to Ziyun and Cixian and took his leave. Qinyan quietly asked when they might meet again; Ziyu felt a great, heavy weight of pain in his heart, but forced himself to say: \\"As soon as a moment of leisure"}],"15":[{"paragraph":6,"mentions":1,"tokens":["云儿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"再说子玉在家无趣，趁他们吃酒时，便带了云儿去找刘文泽、史南湘。","en":"Now, Ziyu found little enjoyment at home; while the others were drinking, he took Yun'er along and went to find Liu Wenze and Shi Nanxiang."}],"21":[{"paragraph":7,"mentions":1,"tokens":["云儿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"闹的。始而我听得人家讲，我还不信。及至今日我去看他，我进去是向来不用通报的，一直到他书房外间，就听见笑声。他的云儿就忙的了不得，高高的喊一声：「有客来了！」及到我进去，庾香却是卧在床上，脸上发红，有些慌张的样子。我看屋子里又没人，笑声也不像他，也不理会了。","en":"be announced, I walked straight as far as the outer room of his study, where I heard laughter from within. His Yun'er suddenly became frantic and called at the top of his voice, 'A visitor!' When I entered, Yuxiang was lying on the bed, his face crimson and his manner flustered. No one else was visible, though the laughter had certainly not been his. I pretended not"}],"22":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":4,"tokens":["云儿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"那里学弹。忽又将琴翻转，将那琴铭诵了几遍。只觉绿阴满院，长日如年，想不出什么解闷的事来。正在情绪烦闷之时，忽见云儿拿了一封信进来，放在桌上，说怡园徐老爷送来的，明日请逛运河，并要回信呢。子玉取过书来一看，觉得封面上字迹，写着梅少爷手启，端端正正，不像子云、次贤笔迹，因想道：「或是叫书童写的也未可知。即拆开一看，第一行是陆素兰谨启，庾香公子吟坛云云。」心中倒觉跳了","en":"the long day stretched like a year, and he could think of nothing to dispel his tedium. Just as he sat fretting, Yun'er came in with a letter and laid it on the table, saying that Master Xu of the Garden of Contentment had sent it, with an invitation for an outing on the canal tomorrow, and that a reply was wanted. Ziyu took up the letter and saw the envelope inscribed"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":1,"tokens":["云儿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"得屋角都动，连忙闭上了窗，挑灯独坐，幸到天明时就住了，尚有那断断续续的檐溜滴了好一回。此时已不及再睡，即叫醒了云儿，天已大明，红日将出。净了脸，吃了茶，又用了些点心，走到上房，颜夫人尚未起来。子玉在外间叫丫鬟梳了发，又复出来，各处尚是静悄悄的。再到书房来，心上想道：「素兰如此多情，况已屡次扰他，他虽然不在这上头讲究，我却过意不去。若给他银钱又恐被他着恼，当是轻看","en":"dripping, now broken, now resumed, for a good while after. It was too late by then to sleep again, so he woke Yun'er. Day had fully come, and the red sun was on the point of rising. He washed his face, drank his tea, took a few refreshments, and went to the upper rooms, where Lady Yan was not yet risen. Ziyu had a maid dress his hair in the outer room and came out"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":2,"tokens":["云儿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"想不到你已经早起来了。」子玉道：「我今日出门有事，所以略早了些。」元茂道：「我有句话商量。」子玉正要问时，只见云儿进来道：「徐老爷打发人来请，说客业已到齐了，就请少爷过去。」子玉也不及再问元茂，连忙便进上房，见颜夫人尚在梳头，子玉把出门的事告禀。颜夫人道：「你这几日身子好些，出去散散也好，只要早些回来，不要贪凉，坐在风口里。多叫几个人跟去，衣服也多包两件。」子玉","en":"somewhat early.\\" Yuanmao said: \\"There is a matter I want to talk over with you.\\" Ziyu was about to ask what, when Yun'er came in: \\"Master Xu has sent a man to say the guests are all assembled, and requests the young master to come over now.\\" Ziyu, with no more time for Yuanmao, hurried in to the upper rooms, where Lady Yan was at her toilet, and announced his outing. Lady"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":2,"tokens":["云儿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"。」子玉道：「这件事也值得这么要紧，你对账房去说罢，总是一样的。」说着就走，元茂一把拉住道：「好人，好人，你着云儿去讲一声才好。我已向账房借过，不好意思再去说，恐怕碰钉子。」子玉没奈何，又叫云儿进来，到账房去说了。那边答应了，元茂才放子玉出来。","en":"the same thing.\\" And he made to go; but Yuanmao caught hold of him: \\"Good fellow, good fellow — you must send Yun'er to say a word for me. I have borrowed of the accounts room before, and am ashamed to go again for fear of a snub.\\" There was no help for it: Ziyu called Yun'er in once more and sent him to speak to the accounts room; and when word came back that it was"}],"28":[{"paragraph":4,"mentions":1,"tokens":["云儿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子玉自五月内与琴言一叙之后，直至今日，并非没有访过琴言，但其中有多少错误。这一日天气凉爽，早饭后到素兰处，先叫云儿问了在家，素兰闻知甚喜，忙出迎进。只见房内走出两人来：子玉看时，认得一个是王兰保；一个是琪官，因多时不见他，即看了他一看。见他杏脸搓酥，柳眉耸翠，光彩奕奕，袅娜婷婷，年纪与素兰彷佛，身量略小些，上前见了。","en":"had intervened. One cool, pleasant day, after his morning meal, Ziyu made his way to Sulan's place. He first had Yun inquire if he was home; upon hearing this, Sulan was delighted and hurried out to welcome him in. However, two others emerged from the room: Ziyu recognized one as Wang Lanbao, and the other as Qiguan. Not having seen Qiguan for some time, Ziyu took"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":6,"tokens":["云儿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，必呼玉侬二字，心上便疑心子玉在外有什么勾当，便当玉侬是个女人，心有说不出的隐情；因又想子玉不常出门，出门必有云儿随去。一日便唤云儿来细细追问，说：「你跟少爷出去，到底在些什么地方？那玉侬是谁？还是娼妓呢，还是什么样的人？」云儿起初不招，只说：「少爷出门，无非是怡园，及王少爷、史少爷儿处，并没有见个女人。小的如撒了谎，今天就活不过。」颜夫人想道：「好好问他，他必","en":"\\"Yunong\\" was a woman's name, she suspected a scandalous secret. Knowing Ziyu rarely ventured out, and never without Yun, she summoned the servant one day for a rigorous interrogation. \\"Where exactly have you been taking the young master?\\" she demanded. \\"Who is this Yunong? A courtesan, or someone else?\\" Yun initially denied everything, insisting, \\"The young master only"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":2,"tokens":["云儿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"讲了一回，颜夫人道：「子玉得了一个异样的病症。」便把病的光景说与聘才听，又将云儿、元茂的话也说了，便说：「小儿与这琴言到底有什么缘故？」聘才听了便觉得有些踌躇不安，良心发动，脸上露出愧色。停了一会，说道：「去年小侄进京，是搭了一班戏子的船，内中有个小旦叫琴言。今年团拜这一天，却好见着他的戏。后来世兄不知怎样认识的，听说在怡园打灯","en":"chase. \\"Ziyu has contracted a strange illness,\\" she said, describing the symptoms and repeating the testimonies of Yun and Yuanmao. She pressed him, \\"What exactly is the bond between my son and this Qinyan?\\" Pincai felt a sudden wave of unease; his conscience pricked, and a guilty flush colored his face. He hesitated before answering, \\"Last year, when this nephew entered"}],"29":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["云儿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"颜夫人的命，老着脸，走到子玉卧房来。见帘帏不卷，几案生尘，药鼎烟浓，香炉灰烬，一张小小的楠木床，垂下白轻绡帐。云儿先把帐子掀开，叫声：「少爷！琴言来看你了。」子玉正在半睡，叫了两声，似应似不应的。琴言便走近床边，就坐在床沿之上，举目细细看时，只见子玉面色黄瘦，憔悴了许多。琴言凑近枕边，低低的叫了一声，不觉泪如泉涌，滴了子玉一脸。只见子玉忽然的呵呵一笑，道：「七月","en":"and the incense ashes had long since grown cold. There sat a small nanmu wood bed, veiled in sheer white gauze. Yun'er was the first to lift the bed-curtain, calling out softly, \\"Young Master! Qinyan has come to see you.\\" Ziyu was caught in the twilight of sleep, murmuring two vague sounds that were neither fully an answer nor entirely silence. Qinyan approached the"},{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["云儿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"才心上也觉凄楚，便说道：「玉侬你只管叫醒他。」琴言便叫了两声「少爷！」子玉嗤的一声笑道：「你好痴也！」又道：「云儿，你只管叫我作什么！这么近的路怕什么！你还当是大东门外么？」琴言要高声叫，又哽咽了，喉咙叫不出来，只把手拍他。那子玉忽然睁开眼来，对着琴言道：「香畹，这回又亏了你，费了如此的心，我以后便放了心了。」琴言又往前凑了一凑，拍着肩道：「少爷！琴言在这里看你","en":"called out twice more, \\"Young Master!\\" Ziyu merely tittered and replied, \\"How foolish you are!\\" He then chided, \\"Yun'er, why keep calling? The road is so short, what is there to fear? Do you still think we are outside the Great East Gate?\\" Qinyan desperately wanted to shout to him, but his throat was tightly strangled by emotion; he could only pat his shoulder in silence."},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":1,"tokens":["云儿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"好呢？」聘才也只得走到床前，叫了几声：「世兄，你心上的琴言特来看你，我扶起你来坐坐，你们说说话就好了。」聘才叫云儿拧块热手巾来，替他净了脸，擦了擦眼睛，扶他坐起，把床锦被迭了，在背后靠着。","en":"especially to see you. Let me help you sit up; once you talk, you will surely feel better.\\" He then instructed Yun'er to wring out a hot towel. After washing Ziyu's face and gently wiping his eyes, Pincai carefully raised him into a sitting position, folding the brocade quilt to prop him up comfortably from behind."},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":2,"tokens":["云儿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"便叫云儿道：「我觉饿了，有什么吃的，快拿些来。」颜夫人听了，即轻轻的走出，聘才等亦都跟了出来。颜夫人道：「怪事！怪事！直看不出他们什么意思来，这一对小人儿，却真也奇怪。今日实实亏了琴言，我倒要重重的赏他。」聘才嬉嬉笑道：「这也实在稀奇。伯母请看：世兄与琴言都","en":"He then called out to Yun'er, \\"I feel hungry — bring me whatever there is to eat, and be quick.\\" Hearing this, Lady Yan quietly slipped out of the room, and Pincai quickly followed her. Lady Yan whispered in amazement, \\"Strange... truly strange. I simply cannot read those two little"}],"31":[{"paragraph":18,"mentions":1,"tokens":["云儿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"外间已套上车，子玉也不换衣服，云儿恐怕寒冷，包上了几件棉衣。上了车，来到春航、高品寓处一问，都已回寓，遂同下车进内，一直走到里面。只听高品一片笑声，夹着些燕语莺声在内。到春航斋中，见苏蕙芳、李玉林在内。高品、春航见了四人进来，不胜欢喜，让坐了，苏、李二相公也都见了。","en":"Outside, the carriage was already hitched. Ziyu did not even change his clothes, but Yun'er, fearing he might catch a chill, wrapped him in several layers of cotton garments. They boarded the carriage and headed straight for the residence of Chunhang and Gao Pin. Upon inquiring, they learned that both men had already returned to their quarters,"}],"33":[{"paragraph":4,"mentions":1,"tokens":["云儿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"过萱堂，乘舆进城，行不到半里，心里忽又踌躇起来，料聘才也未必在家，越想越不高兴，便说：「不去了，出城回去罢！」云儿勒转马头，赶车的倒转车来，出了城，忽然有几辆车塞满了路，还有一群骆驼挤在里头。众赶车的喧喧嚷嚷，开让不来。子玉的车下了帘子，与一个车相并，子玉从玻璃窗内一望，却好那人也转过脸来望他，原来是宝珠。子玉见了，不觉一笑，宝珠问道：「你从那里来？还到那里去？","en":"thought about it, the less enthusiastic he felt, so he said, \\"I won't go. Let's head out of the city and go back!\\" Yun'er reined in his horse, the driver turned the carriage around, and they left the city. Suddenly, several carriages blocked the road, with a herd of camels squeezed among them. The drivers shouted loudly, unable to clear the way. Ziyu lowered the curtain"}],"36":[{"paragraph":10,"mentions":1,"tokens":["云儿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"今我独自去，就算太太待我好，叫我进去，那门房里我总要去求他，适或碰起钉子来，他倒不许我进去呢？况且他家的人除了云儿之外，一个都不认识。」思前想后，不得主意，呆呆的站住。那小使进来说：「车已套了，到什么地方去？」琴言不语，又想了一回道：「不如去找聘才，仍同了他去，省费许多说话。他出来了，我去看看他，他也感情的。」","en":"lady treats me well and invites me in, I still have to beg the gatekeepers. What if they refuse me entry? Besides Yun'er, I don't know anyone there.\\" He pondered but couldn't decide, standing frozen. The servant came in and asked, \\"The carriage is ready. Where to?\\" Qinyan remained silent, thought a bit more, and said to himself, \\"I should go find Pincai and have him take"}],"45":[{"paragraph":4,"mentions":1,"tokens":["云儿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"但因昨日人多，彼此未能畅谈衷曲。今日晚饭后，想趁着那一钩新月，去到怡园，也可畅叙一会，遂禀明了颜夫人、带了云儿，乘兴而来。进了怡园，却值子云未回，到了次贤处。子玉尚未进门，听得有人在那里高谈阔论。次贤见子玉来了，即忙出来，要请到里面。子玉问道：「何客？」次贤笑道：「不要紧，是个湖州王客人，贩些古董书画笔墨等货，来托消的。」","en":"the crescent moon to visit the Garden of Contentment and talk freely for a while. He informed Lady Yan, brought Yun'er along, and set off on a whim. Upon entering the garden, he discovered that Ziyun had not yet returned, so he went directly to Cixian's quarters. Before Ziyu even stepped inside, he heard someone holding forth loudly within. When Cixian saw Ziyu arrive,"}],"53":[{"paragraph":18,"mentions":7,"tokens":["云儿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"却说子玉自前日春航处见了诸名旦，单少了琴言一人，又感伤了数日。一夜在睡梦中，忽见云儿走来道：「少爷，琴言回来了。」子玉听了大喜，即问道：「在哪里？」云儿道「就在门外。」子玉忙到大门外一望，只见烟水茫茫，查无涯涘，便失惊道：「这是什么地方？」迷迷离离，心无主意，沿着江堤走去，唯见白浪滔天，帆樯来往。走了一箭远路，忽又见云儿赶来道：「琴","en":"Qinyan absent—Ziyu had remained steeped in melancholy for days. One night, in the midst of a dream, he suddenly saw Yun'er approach and say, \\"Young Master, Qinyan has returned.\\"\\n\\nZiyu was overjoyed and quickly asked, \\"Where is he?\\"\\n\\n\\"Just outside the gate,\\" Yun'er replied.\\n\\nZiyu hurried out the main gate to look, but saw only vast, boundless mist and water, stretching endlessly"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":1,"tokens":["云儿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"把子玉一把搂紧。子玉大窘，只得叫道：「云儿快来！」那女郎又道：「呆郎，你叫什么？难道天下有女子调戏人的么？」子玉道：「你将何为？」那女郎道：「我也不过怜才爱貌的心，君固男子，岂无能为事耶？」子玉越急。正在无法，只见一个船拢将过来，船窗相对。却见琴言坐在舱里，吟他的《金缕曲》，凄惋欲泣。","en":"She pulled Ziyu into a tight embrace. Extremely embarrassed and distressed, Ziyu could only cry out, \\"Yun'er, come quickly!\\"\\n\\nThe woman mocked him again: \\"Foolish man, why are you shouting? Are there truly women in the world who seduce others unprovoked?\\"\\n\\n\\"What is your intention?\\" Ziyu demanded.\\n\\n\\"I merely have a heart that cherishes talent and loves beauty,\\""}],"59":[{"paragraph":28,"mentions":1,"tokens":["云儿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"那边士燮已安歇，琴仙困乏已甚，支持不住，便躺在炕上，子玉、仲清也都在炕上坐了。家人们出去，今日幸喜云儿没跟来，仲清也是新用的人，都不认识琴仙，故此一宵无话。后来三人都也困乏，便都躺下，人静之后，细细的谈起来。此刻子玉、琴仙在一个枕上和衣而卧，竟把嫌疑也忘了，琴仙便哝哝唧唧说出京时如何想念，在南京如何游玩，到莫愁湖亲见他前生坟墓，杜仙女怎样灵异，道翁临","en":"so he lay down on the kang, while Ziyu and Zhongqing sat beside him. The servants left the room; fortunately, Yun'er had not come along today, and Zhongqing was accompanied by newly hired men who didn't recognize Qinxian, so the night passed quietly without incident. Eventually, all three grew tired and lay down. Once the night was entirely quiet, they began to speak"},{"paragraph":31,"mentions":1,"tokens":["云儿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"里路甚快，一个多时辰已到了。梅侍郎且不到家，先宿了庙，明日五鼓时分上朝复命。子玉先将琴仙在书房里安顿了。梅进、云儿一见琴仙，个个骇异，又猜是他，又猜不是他。若说是他，为何老爷与他抗礼？且又穿着素服，像个有孝的人。若说不是他，面貌再没有这般相像的了。众人疑疑惑惑，猜不出来，又听得叫屈大爷，便知不是。子玉趁这空儿，就请仲清对颜夫人讲明，琼华也在旁听了，望着子玉笑，看","en":"the Emperor at the fifth watch the next morning. Ziyu first settled Qinxian in the study. As soon as Mei Jin and Yun'er saw Qinxian, they were utterly astonished, guessing first that it was him, and then that it wasn't. If it was him, why did the master treat him as an equal? And why was he wearing plain mourning clothes, like someone bereaved? If it wasn't him, how could"}]}`),"char-103":{1:[{paragraph:43,mentions:1,tokens:["俊儿"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"了朔风，且是冬月中旬，便叫家人媳妇取出副葡萄的猞猁裘与他穿了，吩咐车里也换了白狐暖围。两个小使：一个云儿，一个俊儿，骑了马，先到他表母舅王通政宅内，适值通政出门去了，通政的少君出来接进。这王通政的少君，名字单叫个恂字，号庸庵，年方二十二岁。",en:"the carriage interior changed to a warm white fox-fur lining. Two young pages, one named Yun'er and the other Jun'er, rode ahead on horseback. First, they went to the residence of his maternal uncle, the Commissioner Wang. As it happened, the Commissioner had gone out, but his eldest son came out to welcome him in. This young master of the Wang family had the single"}],2:[{paragraph:8,mentions:1,tokens:["俊儿"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"名，性全让他上坐，聘才只是不肯。子玉想了一想：「先生父子乍见，定然有些说话。」就引聘才到对面船房内坐下，云儿与俊儿送了茶。聘才笑道、「世兄可还认得小弟么？」子玉道：「面善的很，实在想不起了。」聘才笑道：「从来说贵人多忘事，是不差的。那一年，世兄同着老伯母进京，小弟送到船上。世兄双手拉住了腰带，定要叫小弟同伴进京，老伯母好容易哄骗，方才放手，难道竟不记得了？」子玉",en:`converse in private, tactfully escorted Pincai to the boat-shaped annex across the courtyard, where Yun'er and Jun'er soon served them tea. Pincai smiled warmly and asked, "Does my elder brother still recognize me?" Ziyu replied apologetically, "Your face is familiar, but I confess I cannot quite place you." Pincai laughed, "They say men of distinction have fleeting`},{paragraph:9,mentions:1,tokens:["俊儿"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"起身告辞，性全也体谅他们路上辛苦，就叫元茂跟了过去，子玉送他们进屋，见已铺设好了，说声：「早些安歇罢！」也就叫俊儿提灯，照进上房去了。",en:"them to their quarters, ensuring everything was appropriately arranged. Bidding them to rest early, he called for Jun'er to light a lantern and made his way back to the main house."}],4:[{paragraph:6,mentions:3,tokens:["俊儿"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"忽见俊儿拿了一封书信来，签子上写着梅少爷手展，旁有一行小字。内信笺一纸，诗笺四纸。认得仲清笔迹，便问俊儿是谁送来的。俊儿道：「是颜少爷的健儿。」子玉道：「叫他等一等。」拆开看时，信笺上写着是：昨与庸庵同居虚室。玉杯寒重，始知六出花飞；银烛光残，才见十分雪艳。",en:`Suddenly, Jun'er arrived bearing a letter. The envelope was inscribed, "For the hand of Master Mei," with a line of smaller characters beside it. Inside lay a single sheet of note-paper and four sheets of verse-paper. Recognizing Zhongqing's calligraphy, Ziyu asked Jun'er`}]},"char-104":{2:[{paragraph:6,mentions:1,tokens:["许顺"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"燮问了他父母好。子玉出来，见过了礼，士燮即叫子玉引元茂去见他父亲，子玉即同了元茂、聘才到书房去了。士燮吩咐家人许顺，收拾书房后身另院的两间屋子，给他们暂且住下。",en:"meet his father. Ziyu then led both Yuanmao and Pincai toward the study. Meanwhile, Shixie ordered the servant Xu Shun to prepare two rooms in the secluded courtyard behind the study for their temporary lodging."}],3:[{paragraph:1,mentions:3,tokens:["许顺"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"去吃点心。走到账房门口，忽见一个小厮，托着一个大方盘，内放一只火锅，两盘菜，热气腾腾的送进去了。随后见有管事的许顺跟着进去，见了聘才，便问：「大爷用过饭没有？」聘才道：「才从外头送信回来的。」许顺道，「既没用饭，何不就请在账房吃罢。」这许顺夫妇是颜夫人赔房过来的，一切银钱账目皆其经手。聘才进了账房，许顺要让聘才先吃，聘才不肯，拉他同坐了。",en:'tray—upon it rested a steaming hotpot and two freshly prepared dishes, all carried briskly inside. The head steward, Xu Shun, trailed closely behind. Catching sight of Pincai, Xu Shun paused to ask, "Has the young master dined?" Pincai replied, "I have only just returned from an errand." Xu Shun offered, "If you have yet to eat, why not join us here in the accounts room?"'},{paragraph:2,mentions:1,tokens:["许顺"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"吃过了饭，许顺泡了一碗酽茶递给聘才，说了一会闲话。",en:"When the meal concluded, Xu Shun brewed a bowl of deep, fragrant tea, offering it to Pincai as they fell into idle conversation."},{paragraph:3,mentions:2,tokens:["许顺"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"。略翻一翻，像品题小旦的。再拿几本看时，是不全的《缀白裘》。聘才道：「这两本书是自己的么？想来音律是讲究的。」许顺道：「那里懂什么音律，不知是那个爷们撂在这里的。」聘才要借去看看，许顺道：「只管拿去。」聘才袖了出来，到自己房里，歪在炕上，取那本《花选》看了一会，记清了八个名氏。一面想道：「原来京里有这样好小旦，怪不得外省人说：「要看戏，京里去。」相公非但好，个个",en:'found it to be *Pieced White Fur*. Pincai asked, "Are these books yours? You must have a keen ear for music." Xu Shun laughed, "What do I know of music? I have no idea which of the masters left them here." When Pincai asked to borrow them, Xu Shun agreed. Tucking them into his sleeve, Pincai returned to his room and reclined on the heated brick bed. He studied *Selection'},{paragraph:6,mentions:4,tokens:["许顺"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"先劳你的驾过来。」又问：「那位贵姓？」叶茂林道：「这是我们大掌班金二爷，来请梅大人定戏的。」聘才待再问时，只见许顺从上头下来说道：「大人吩咐，既是正月初五以前都有人定下，初六七也使得，就是不许分包。」那金二道：「不分包这句话，却不敢答应。正月里的戏，不要说我们联锦班，就是差不多的班子，那一天不分三包两包。许二爷劳你驾，再回一声罢。」许顺道：「已经回过了，是这么吩",en:`of our troupe. He has come to invite Lord Mei to arrange a performance." Before Pincai could inquire further, Xu Shun descended the stairs, announcing: "The Master has decreed that since the first five days of the New Year are already booked, the sixth or seventh will suffice—provided there is no splitting of contracts." Master Jin sighed, "'No splitting' is a promise`},{paragraph:7,mentions:2,tokens:["许顺"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"才又问他的寓处，说在杨柳巷联锦班总寓内。聘才道：「改日过来奉看。」茂林道：「这如何敢当，只好顺便去逛逛。」说着许顺已同了金二回来，已经说妥，定于正月初六日在姑苏会馆，不论分包不分包，只要点谁的戏，不短脚色就是了。许顺上去回明，付了定银各散。是晚子玉课期，未得与聘才闲谈。",en:'Pincai promised. "I would not dare presume," Maolin replied, "only drop by if you are passing through." Presently, Xu Shun and Master Jin returned, having struck an agreement: the performance was set for the sixth day of the first month at the Suzhou Guild Hall. Whether the contract was split mattered little, so long as the requested actors performed without omission. Xu'}],9:[{paragraph:1,mentions:1,tokens:["许顺"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"来开了。两人走到房中，聘才免不得将不小心丢银子的话，抱怨了元茂两句。元茂无言可答，各自安睡。到了次日，只得央了许顺，借了十吊钱的票子，分作两张，写了一封字，叫四儿送与叶茂林，分给二喜、保珠。后来子玉盘问，聘才、元茂只推张仲雨请去听戏下馆子，却将实情瞒过了。",en:"the silver. Yuanmao had no answer. They each went to sleep. The next day, they had no choice but to prevail upon Xu Shun to borrow a ten-string promissory note, which they divided into two drafts. Wrapping them with a letter, they had Si'er deliver the money to Ye Maolin to distribute between Erxi and Baozhu. Later, when Ziyu asked, Pincai and Yuanmao simply claimed that"}],16:[{paragraph:1,mentions:1,tokens:["许顺"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"话说前回书中梅士燮赴任之后，一切家事，内而颜夫人掌管，外而许顺经理，井井有条。子玉仍系读书，经籍之外研磨诸子百家。到花晨月夕，则有二三知己，明窗净几，共事笔砚。",en:"After Academician Mei Shixie departed for his post, Lady Yan assumed charge of the inner household while Xu Shun managed affairs without, leaving the estate in perfect order. Ziyu continued his studies, delving into the various philosophical schools alongside his classical texts. On fine mornings and moonlit evenings, he would gather with close friends by a bright"}],28:[{paragraph:10,mentions:1,tokens:["许顺"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"叔看了琴言的戏回来，又听得他们说好，以后的事，小门生实是没有见闻，要问魏老聘才晓得他们的细底。」颜夫人便叫门上许顺，到华府请魏少爷过来有事相商。聘才却不晓得是这件事，近来与子玉颇觉疏远，竟有一个多月不来。今闻颜夫人相请，道是有些好事与他商量。隔了一日，便服御辉煌的出城，到了梅宅，见过了颜夫人。见颜夫人脸上似有忧闷的光景，聘才先问了江西的近况，可有家信回来；又问起",en:`witnessed nothing. You must ask Wei Pincai for the detailed truth." Lady Yan immediately ordered the gatekeeper, Xu Shun, to go to the Hua mansion and invite Secretary Wei over, stating there was urgent business to discuss. Pincai had no inkling it concerned this matter. He had grown distant from Ziyu recently and hadn't visited for over a month. Hearing Lady Yan's summons,`},{paragraph:20,mentions:4,tokens:["许顺"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"即叫琴言坐在车里，放下车帘，自己跨沿，四儿坐在车尾，不多一刻即到了梅宅。聘才也不候通报，同了琴言一直到了书房。许顺见了甚为诧异，却又不好拦阻，也跟了进来。颜夫人正在盼望，见许顺进来，似欲回什么话似的，颜夫人问：「有什么事？」许顺说：「魏大爷同了一个人，到像个唱戏的似的，小的不敢不回。」颜夫人道：「我知道，快请进来。」许顺去请，只见聘才同着一个十五六岁的孩子进来，",en:'Mei residence. Pincai did not wait for an announcement; he led Qinyan straight toward the study. The gatekeeper, Xu Shun, was startled but could not block their path, so he followed them in. Lady Yan was waiting anxiously. Seeing Xu Shun enter as if to make a report, she asked, "What is the matter?" Xu Shun replied, "Master Wei brought someone who looks like an actor.'},{paragraph:21,mentions:1,tokens:["许顺"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"分明。颜夫人见此光景，倒反可怜，就请聘才同琴言到子玉房中来，自己与聘才在外间坐着，看他们所说何话，怎样情景。那许顺也直站到此刻，方才听明少爷的病源，也跟到卧房中细听。不知琴言怎样医好了子玉之病，且听下回分解。",en:"room, while she and Pincai remained in the outer room to listen to what they would say and observe the scene. Xu Shun, having stood by and finally understood the source of the young master's illness, followed them into the bedroom to listen closely. As to how Qinyan cured Ziyu's sickness, listen to the explanation in the next installment."}],29:[{paragraph:14,mentions:3,tokens:["许顺"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"便要同琴言回去，琴言也心内悬着，便叩辞颜夫人要去。颜夫人道：「你且略候一候，我还有话。」便自己进房，先着人叫了许顺进来，叫他秤了二百银子来，颜夫人道：「你交与魏少爷收了。」聘才叫交四儿拿了。又见一个仆妇拿着一包东西出来，付与琴言道：「这是太太赏你的，你收了再去谢赏。」聘才见是银镶小刀一把，大荷包一对，小荷包一对，帕子一方，洋表一个，梅花小锭十个，牙骨真金面扇子一",en:`farewells. Lady Yan raised a hand. "Wait. I have words for you." She stepped into the inner room and called for Xu Shun, ordering him to weigh out two hundred taels of silver. "Give this to the young gentleman Wei," she instructed. Pincai had Si'er take charge of the silver. A servant then brought out an elegant bundle, and Lady Yan presented it to Qinyan. "Madame rewards`}]},"char-105":{3:[{paragraph:1,mentions:1,tokens:["许顺夫妇"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"了聘才，便问：「大爷用过饭没有？」聘才道：「才从外头送信回来的。」许顺道，「既没用饭，何不就请在账房吃罢。」这许顺夫妇是颜夫人赔房过来的，一切银钱账目皆其经手。聘才进了账房，许顺要让聘才先吃，聘才不肯，拉他同坐了。",en:`errand." Xu Shun offered, "If you have yet to eat, why not join us here in the accounts room?" This Xu Shun and his wife were part of Lady Yan's dowry household, entrusted with managing all the family's financial affairs. Pincai stepped inside, where Xu Shun graciously urged him to eat first. Pincai politely declined, drawing Xu Shun to sit and share the meal together.`}]},"char-106":{2:[{paragraph:3,mentions:2,tokens:["梅进"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"既是他儿子远来投奔，老弟也是义无所辞的。」士燮叫梅进进来问了，果然是他。一个是西席李先生之子。吩咐梅进：",en:'traveled this great distance to seek refuge, you are bound by duty and cannot well turn him away." Shixie summoned Mei Jin to verify their identities, and indeed, one was the son of Mr. Li, the resident tutor. He then instructed Mei Jin:'}],9:[{paragraph:2,mentions:2,tokens:["梅进"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"过了两日，已是元宵佳节，李性全带着元茂，到会馆中吃年酒去了，聘才出去逛灯未回。子玉一人正在无聊，恰好梅进进来说道：「刘少爷、颜少爷、王少爷，请少爷出去逛灯，都在门口等着。」子玉禀过父母，梅进即叫套了车，云儿跟着出来。仲清等却在车里等着，见子玉出来便下了车。刘文泽道：「如此良宵，千金一刻，我们趁着灯月，倒是步行好些，把车跟在后头，回来再坐罢。」子玉道：「",en:`while Pincai had gone out to view the lanterns and had not yet returned. Ziyu sat alone with nothing to do when Mei Jin came in and announced: "Young Master Liu, Young Master Yan, and Young Master Wang invite you to go out and view the lanterns. They are all waiting at the gate." Ziyu reported to his parents, Mei Jin had the carriage harnessed, and Yun'er followed along.`}],15:[{paragraph:3,mentions:2,tokens:["梅进"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"知，子玉便添了一件心事，一夜未曾睡着。是夕士燮在尚书房值宿未回。到了次日，子玉正要打算和聘才去看琴言。忽见门上梅进满面笑容的进来，说道：「恭喜少爷，老爷放了江西学差，报喜的现在门口。」子玉听了也觉喜欢，便同着梅进到里头报与颜夫人知道，颜夫人欣喜更不必说。李性全就同元茂、聘才到上头去道了喜。少顷，士燮回家，有些同僚亲友陆续而来，一连忙了几日。便接着李先生赴任日期，",en:'and had not come home. The next day, Ziyu was just making plans to go with Pincai to see Qinyan when suddenly Mei Jin, the gatekeeper, came in with a face full of smiles and announced: "Congratulations to the young master — the master has been appointed Jiangxi Education Commissioner, and the messenger reporting the good news is at the gate now." Ziyu felt pleased at'}],33:[{paragraph:13,mentions:5,tokens:["梅进"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"很疏远。」颜夫人道：「但则聘才的事怎么好？其人虽不足惜，但究竟是老爷世交之子，打听个实信才好。」便叫个仆妇去传梅进进来，梅进即便走到阶下站住。颜夫人将聘才的事说了，叫他到王亲家老爷处，托他关照关照，到部里说个情也好。梅进应道：「奴才就去。但魏少爷的事情虽小，已经收在监里，连他的家人都不容进去送饭，不知怎么要如此严紧。只怕亲家老爷未必肯讲这个情。或者他那华府里有人",en:`he is still the son of your father's old friend. We need to find out the truth." She called for a maid to fetch Mei Jin, who soon arrived and stood below the steps. Madam Yan explained Pincai's situation, instructing him to go to Elder Wang and ask him to keep an eye on things, or perhaps put in a good word at the Ministry. Mei Jin replied, "I will go at once. But although`},{paragraph:14,mentions:3,tokens:["梅进"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"梅进来到王宅，文辉传进，问了来意。梅进禀明，文辉冷笑了一声，道：「那魏聘才，我一见他，就知道不是个东西。你们老爷定要留他，幸而如今出去了。这件事怎样去说，且刑部里绝无相好。你回去与太太请安，说我只好转托人，碰他的运气罢。」梅进回去照直说了，颜夫人也无法，",en:'Mei Jin arrived at the Wang residence. Wenhui called him in and asked the reason for his visit. Mei Jin explained the situation, and Wenhui sneered, saying, "That Wei Pincai—I knew the moment I saw him that he was nothing good. Your master insisted on keeping'}],39:[{paragraph:4,mentions:1,tokens:["梅进"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"元茂的事是梅进代办，替他办了钗环簪镯、彩缎衣衫，并借了颜夫人的珠冠玉带、补服朝珠、蟒衣绣裙，共铺了十六盒，扎了亭子，也还像个局面。两个媒人押了去。孙家收了，回盒不过相称，也无甚珍异之物。",en:"All the arrangements for Yuanmao's affairs were handled by Mei Jin, who procured hairpins and bracelets, embroidered silks and gowns, and borrowed from Madam Yan a pearl crown, jade sash, official rank-badge robes with court beads, embroidered dragon skirt, and other finery, arranging everything in sixteen lacquered"}],59:[{paragraph:31,mentions:1,tokens:["梅进"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"，三十里路甚快，一个多时辰已到了。梅侍郎且不到家，先宿了庙，明日五鼓时分上朝复命。子玉先将琴仙在书房里安顿了。梅进、云儿一见琴仙，个个骇异，又猜是他，又猜不是他。若说是他，为何老爷与他抗礼？且又穿着素服，像个有孝的人。若说不是他，面貌再没有这般相像的了。众人疑疑惑惑，猜不出来，又听得叫屈大爷，便知不是。子玉趁这空儿，就请仲清对颜夫人讲明，琼华也在旁听了，望着子玉",en:"report back to the Emperor at the fifth watch the next morning. Ziyu first settled Qinxian in the study. As soon as Mei Jin and Yun'er saw Qinxian, they were utterly astonished, guessing first that it was him, and then that it wasn't. If it was him, why did the master treat him as an equal? And why was he wearing plain mourning clothes, like someone bereaved? If it wasn't"},{paragraph:34,mentions:1,tokens:["梅进"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"没有一点优伶习气，不说破真令人看不出来。」颜夫人道：「看这个孩子，将来有些造化也未可定的。」士燮点头，索性叫了梅进进来，将琴仙之事与他说明：「都称呼为屈大爷，不许怠慢。如果怠慢了，我定不依。」士燮吩咐了，底下不敢不遵。以后众家人待琴仙，竟是规规矩矩，不敢有一分放肆处，琴仙故能相安。士燮即命收拾琴仙卧榻，日间叫他同着子玉在书房念书，又叫子玉尽心教他，不许轻看他。这",en:`quite possible he'll achieve some great fortune in the future." Shixie nodded in agreement. He then simply called Mei Jin into the room and explained Qinxian's situation to him clearly: "Everyone is to address him as Master Qu, and no one is permitted to show him the slightest disrespect. If anyone slights him, I will absolutely not forgive them." With Shixie's strict orders,`}]},"char-107":{8:[{paragraph:1,mentions:1,tokens:["虎儿"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"说子玉从刘文泽家饮酒回来，已是二更多天。先见过父母，换了衣裳，来寻聘才、元茂说话，却见静悄悄的，掩了房门。那边虎儿走来道：「少爷出去后，师爷就有人请出去了，今日不回来。李少爷、魏少爷吃了早饭出去的。」子玉道：",en:`Pincai and Yuanmao for a chat. Yet he found their quarters perfectly silent, the door closed fast. The servant boy Hu'er approached and said, "After Young Master went out, the private secretary was invited away and will not return tonight. Masters Li and Wei departed right after breakfast."`}],15:[{paragraph:7,mentions:1,tokens:["虎儿"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"湘道：「他起身多时了。我方才睡醒，听见你们二人来，我不及穿衣，随手拉着一件就出来的。」就有龙儿拿上脸水，还有个虎儿送出衣裳靴帽。南湘洗了脸，慢慢的穿戴起来，便笑嘻嘻的向子玉作了一个揖道：「恭喜，恭喜！你瞒着我们定的好情。」子玉只当说他定亲，倒害躁起来。文泽道：「定得什么情？」南湘道：「前日我在度香处，他说有个叫杜玉侬，是古往今来第一个名旦，被庾香独占去子。他们还",en:`time to dress properly and just grabbed whatever was at hand." Long'er brought in water for washing his face, and Hu'er brought out his clothes, boots, and cap. Nanxiang washed his face and slowly dressed and put on his cap, then with a cheerful smile made a bow to Ziyu and said: "Congratulations, congratulations! You've been hiding from us such a fine attachment." Ziyu`}]},"char-108":{1:[{paragraph:9,mentions:1,tokens:["书僮"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"见是来惯的，是少爷至好，便一直引到书房与子玉见了。仲清又同子玉进内见了姑母，然后出来与南湘坐下。三人讲了些话，书僮送上香茗。南湘见这室中清雅绝尘，一切陈设甚精且古，久知其胸次不凡，又见那清华尊贵的仪表，就是近日所选那《曲台花谱》中数人，虽然有此姿容，到底无此神骨。但见其谦谦自退，讷讷若虚，究不知他何所嗜好，若有些拘执鲜通，胶滞不化，也算不得全才了。便想来试他一试",en:"pay his respects to his aunt, then returned to sit with Nanxiang. After the three had exchanged pleasantries, a pageboy served fragrant tea. Nanxiang noted the room's transcendent elegance, its furnishings exquisite and touched with antiquity, fully aware of Ziyu's extraordinary inner mind. Observing his noble and luminous bearing, he thought that even the figures recently"}],4:[{paragraph:3,mentions:2,tokens:["书僮"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"好景。那李性全先生，清早起来冒了寒，头晕咳嗽，仍上床躺了，觉得心里烦闷，不令子玉等读书。性全自己精于药理，便叫书僮去抓了几味发散药吃了，蒙头安睡。子玉命两个书僮，在书房外好好伺候，自己到了一个小三间书屋，名为二十四琴斋。这块匾额，还是其祖文穆公手笔。子玉无聊，翻出谢惠连的《雪赋》阅看。",en:"returned to bed and excused Ziyu and the others from their studies. Being well-versed in pharmacology, he had his page-boy fetch several doses of dispersing medicine, swallowed them down, and went to sleep with his head covered. Ziyu instructed the two page-boys to wait quietly outside the study, then retreated to a small three-room studio named the Twenty-Four-Qin Study."}],6:[{paragraph:21,mentions:1,tokens:["书童"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"了外面的猞猁裘，子玉又将个大毛貂冠给他戴了，觉得毛茸茸的一大团，车里都要坐不下去，惹得子玉、聘才皆笑。带了四个书童出来，外面已套了两辆车，四匹马。子玉独坐一车，聘才、元茂同坐一车，一径来到姑苏会馆，车已歇满了。",en:"sphere that barely fit within the carriage. Ziyu and Pincai burst into irrepressible laughter. Accompanied by four book-boys, they found two carriages already harnessed with four horses waiting outside. Ziyu rode alone in one, while Pincai and Yuanmao shared the other. They made straight for the Suzhou Guild Hall, where carriages were already packed tightly."}]},"char-109":{2:[{paragraph:1,mentions:2,tokens:["仆妇"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"非但拣女婿难，就是要替你外甥定一头亲事也是不容易的。文辉道：「要像外甥这样好的，那里去选呢？」正说着，只见一个仆妇，手里拿着两个红帖走进二门。士燮问道：「有谁来了？」仆妇将帖呈上说道：「门上说是家乡来的，现在二门外等回话。」士燮看时，一个全帖上写着：世愚侄魏聘才；一个写着：门下晚学生李元茂。",en:'task." Wenhui sighed, "Where indeed could one find someone as exceptional as my nephew?" As they conversed, a maidservant passed through the middle gate bearing two red calling cards. Shixie asked who had arrived. Presenting the cards, the maidservant replied, "The gatekeeper reports they are visitors from our home province, waiting outside the middle gate for a response."'}]},"char-110":{1:[{paragraph:43,mentions:1,tokens:["家人媳妇"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"禀过萱堂，颜夫人见今日天气寒冷，起了朔风，且是冬月中旬，便叫家人媳妇取出副葡萄的猞猁裘与他穿了，吩咐车里也换了白狐暖围。两个小使：一个云儿，一个俊儿，骑了马，先到他表母舅王通政宅内，适值通政出门去了，通政的少君出来接进。这王通政的少君，名字单叫个恂字，号庸庵，年方二十二岁。",en:"noticed that the weather was freezing that day, with a sharp north wind blowing, and it being mid-winter, she had a servant woman bring out a grape-patterned lynx fur coat for him to wear. She also ordered the carriage interior changed to a warm white fox-fur lining. Two young pages, one named Yun'er and the other Jun'er, rode ahead on horseback. First, they went to the residence"}],11:[{paragraph:44,mentions:1,tokens:["家人媳妇"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"便把手掠了一会，骂荷珠道：「顽得这般粗卤。说说罢了，就要认真。」这一会闹，闹得华夫人、袁夫人都按捺不住了，便叫家人媳妇进来查问，不许他们顽笑。群婢才息声静气的，赶紧的吃了一碗饭，都出来伺候。夫人们看这一班顽婢，有闹得花朵歪斜的，鬓发蓬松的，还有些背转脸去要笑的，还有些气忿忿以眉眼记恨的，不觉好笑，只得对着爱珠等说道：「你们这么大了，怎么还这样顽皮？若不为着有客在此，",en:"chaotic commotion had now reached a pitch that Lady Hua and Mrs. Yuan could no longer ignore. They dispatched a senior married maidservant to investigate and strictly forbid any further rough play. The cluster of maids fell instantly into a terrified silence, hurriedly composing themselves and finishing their bowls of rice before marching back out to resume their attendance. The ladies"}]},"char-111":{7:[{paragraph:4,mentions:2,tokens:["小丫鬟"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"不明白起来。想把前日所咏的《车中人》翻出看看，再添两首，便取了出来。忽见三四两首，挖去了两个字，心甚诧异，即问小丫鬟道：「这两日谁到这里来看我的书？」小丫鬟道：「前日太太请客，有一班少奶奶，还有王家的二姑娘，都进来闲逛。那些少奶奶，将少爷的行乐图看了半天，那二姑娘看少爷的书，其余没有人进来。我见二姑娘看书的时候，翻出一张纸来看了看、用指甲挖破一处，仍旧夹在书里。」",en:`surprise, he noticed that two characters had been scraped away from the third and fourth poems. He immediately asked a small maidservant, "Who came in here to look at my books over the past two days?" The maidservant replied, "The day before yesterday, the Mistress hosted some guests—a group of young ladies and the Wang family's Second Miss, who all came in to look around. The young ladies`}]},"char-112":JSON.parse(`{"2":[{"paragraph":18,"mentions":1,"tokens":["四儿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"次早聘才带了他的小子四儿，将王文辉的信送去。适文辉一早出门未回，王恂也不在家，只得请颜仲清会了。聘才见仲清一表非凡，叙了一番寒温，知是文辉之婿，又是士燮的内侄，免不得恭惟一番。正要告辞，只见一个跟班捧着一包衣服进来说：「老爷回来了。」聘才只得坐下。停了一会，听得外面有说话的","en":"The following morning, Pincai took his young servant, Si'er, to deliver Wang Wenhui's letter. As it happened, Wenhui had departed early and had not yet returned, and Wang Xun was likewise away from home, leaving Pincai no option but to request an audience with Yan Zhongqing. Upon meeting Zhongqing and observing"}],"3":[{"paragraph":5,"mentions":1,"tokens":["四儿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"若论相貌，我看世界上未必赛得过琴官。」重新又将这八个人的光景逐一摹拟一番，又牢牢的记了一记。只见四儿跑进来说道：「同路来的叶先生找少爷说话，现在账房里。」聘才说：「这也奇了，他怎的到这里来。」就将《花谱》在枕头底下，带上房门出来。","en":"his eyes, vividly summoning the images of the eight performers described, etching them into his mind. Just then, Si'er came running in, breathless: \\"Master Ye, who traveled with you on the boat, is looking for the young master—he is waiting in the accounts room.\\" Pincai said, \\"How curious—why would he come here?\\" He slid the *Catalogue of Flowers* beneath his dressing"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":1,"tokens":["四儿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"次日，聘才记着叶茂林的话，吃了早饭想去听戏，叫四儿带了钱，换了衣裳。因元茂在书房读书，不好约他，独自步行出门，不多路就到了戏园地方。这条街共有五个园子，一路车马挤满，甚是难走。遍看联锦班的报子，今日没有戏，遇着传差，聘才心上不乐，只得再找别的班子。耳边听得一阵锣鼓响，走过了几家铺面，见一个戏园写着三","en":"vivid descriptions lingering in his mind, Pincai finished his breakfast, resolved to attend a play. He instructed Si'er to carry some coin and changed into fresh garments. Knowing Yuanmao was immersed in his studies, Pincai departed alone on foot. The theater district was a short distance away, a bustling thoroughfare lined with five distinct playhouses, choked with carriages"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":4,"tokens":["四儿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"。」又挤到别处去了。聘才心里甚是感激，连忙拉着富三的手道：「小弟粗卤，倒累三爷生气。」又向那人也拉了拉手，就叫四儿拿出二百大钱来，双手送上。富三笑道：「这算什么。」接过来，递与聘才的四儿道：「算我收了，给你罢。」四儿不敢接，聘才又笑道：「断不敢要三爷破钞，还请收了。」又将钱交与富三的家人，富三接过来，望桌上一扔道：「你太酸了！几个钱什么要紧，推来推去的推不了。」","en":"has caused Third Master undue aggravation.\\" He offered a respectful bow to the lean man as well, then instructed Si'er to present two hundred large cash to the stout man with both hands. Fu the Third laughed heartily, \\"What nonsense is this?\\" Taking the coins, he tossed them directly back to Si'er. \\"Consider it accepted. Now take it back.\\" Si'er hesitated, terrified"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":1,"tokens":["四儿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"他们是有车来的，聘才搭了蓉官的车，四儿也跨了车沿，跟兔坐了车尾。聘才在车里随口的说笑，哄得蓉官十分欢喜，又赞他的相貌，要算京城第一。","en":"They had arrived by carriage. Pincai shared a carriage with Rongguan, while Si'er rode the shaft, and Rongguan's boy clung to the back. Within the carriage, Pincai conversed with effortless charm, drawing delighted laughter from Rongguan. He praised the youth's beauty, declaring him without equal in all the capital."},{"paragraph":38,"mentions":1,"tokens":["四儿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"此时日已西沉，富、贵两人急急的赶城，聘才送了他们上车，同着四儿慢慢步行而归。到家时点了灯了，子玉、元茂都在书房夜课。聘才换了衣裳，趿着鞋，喝了几杯茶，坐了一回。","en":"Pincai escorted them to their carriage, watching them depart before slowly walking the darkening streets home with Si'er. By the time they arrived, the estate was bathed in lamplight. Ziyu and Yuanmao were sequestered in the study, immersed in their evening lessons. Pincai changed out of his street clothes, slipped into comfortable shoes, drank several cups of hot tea,"}],"5":[{"paragraph":23,"mentions":1,"tokens":["四儿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一日，天气晴和，雪也化了，聘才想起富三爷来，要进城去看他，便叫四儿去雇了一辆车坐了，望东城来。对面遇着一群车马，泼风似的冲将过来，先是一个顶马，又一对引马，接着一辆绿围车，旁边开着门。聘才探出身子一看，只觉电光似的，一闪就过去了。就这一闪之中，见是个美少年，英眉秀目，丰采如神，若朝阳之丽云霞，若丹凤之翔蓬岛，正好二","en":"snow had melted, and Pincai thought of Fu the Third and wished to go into the city to visit him. He had his boy Si'er hire a carriage and set off toward the Eastern City. Coming from the opposite direction was a crowd of horses and carriages rushing forward like the wind. First came a mounted outrider, then a pair of lead horses, then a carriage with its side-curtain"},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":1,"tokens":["四儿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"？今日想必出去赴席，所以带着班子。」一面说着，已进了东城，到了金牌楼，找着茶叶铺对门，一个大门口住了车。聘才命四儿投了片子，自己在车里等着，看墙上有两张封条：一张是原任兵部右堂，一张是户部江南清吏司。门房内有人拿了片子，往里头去了，不多一会，出来说：「请。」聘才下车，同着管门的进去，进了二门，是一个院子，上面是穿堂。","en":"and arrived at the Golden Archway. Finding a large doorway opposite a tea shop, the carriage stopped. Pincai had Si'er take in his calling card, waiting in the carriage himself. He saw two sealed notices on the wall: one for a former Vice-Minister of War, the other for the Jiangnan Bureau of the Ministry of Revenue. Someone in the gatehouse took the card and went inside;"}],"8":[{"paragraph":3,"mentions":1,"tokens":["四儿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"两块出来。」元茂又拣了两块，约有八九两了，一总放在搭链里，掖在腰间，把银子仍旧包了放好，锁了箱子。吃了饭，带了四儿，拿了马褥子，雇了车，急急往戏园来。","en":"rewrapped the remainder, and locked the trunk. After finishing their meal, they hired a carriage and, with his servant Si'er carrying a riding blanket, hurried off to the theater."},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":1,"tokens":["四儿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，又有些花架子，花花绿绿的。只管往前观看，信着脚步走，不防总径路口，横着一张矮长板凳，绊了一交，作了个倒栽葱，四儿正要来扶，旁边有一人走过来，双手将元茂拉起，替他拍去了身上灰土，笑嘻嘻的道：「瞧着路走，这交栽的不轻，幸亏我拉的快。倘或摔坏膀子，碰伤了脑袋，便怎样。不是图欢乐，倒是寻烦恼了。」","en":"wooden bench lying across the threshold. Tripping heavily over it, he fell forward like an uprooted plant. Just as Si'er rushed to help him, a bystander stepped forward, lifted Yuanmao by both arms, and brushed the dust from his robes. With a broad grin, the man chided, \\"Mind your step! That was no light fall. Fortunate I caught you so swiftly. If you had injured your"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":1,"tokens":["四儿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，我还要候一候。」聘才道：「同走罢，这时候不来是未必来的了。」便拉了仲雨同下楼来，却忘还了戏钱。看坐的上来拉住四儿道：「慢些走，你们没有给戏钱。」聘才听了，住了步，问元茂，仲雨道」是我的，交代掌柜的就是了。」看坐的答应。","en":"downstairs, entirely forgetting to pay for their theater seats. The attendant rushed forward, grabbing hold of Si'er. \\"Hold a moment! You haven't paid for your seats.\\" Hearing this, Pincai stopped and looked at Yuanmao. Zhongyu waved his hand dismissively, \\"Put it on my account. Just tell the manager.\\" The attendant nodded in agreement."},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":3,"tokens":["四儿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"请出师傅来对帐的。」保珠道：「这原是不认识的才这样，若伺候过三年两载，相熟了，原不用这样。」二人正在为难。只见四儿进来，道：「孙大少爷也在这里，方才走出去。」聘才一想。知他认得这些相公，便说道：「你去请孙大少爷进来。」四儿忙赶出去，嗣徽尚在柜上说话，也带着一个相公，那相公先上车走了。嗣徽也认不清四儿，听得有人请他，便又进来，方知是元茂、聘才，见了二喜、保珠，笑道","en":"well-acquainted, such measures would be unnecessary.\\" The two sides were locked in a tense impasse. Suddenly, Si'er rushed in and announced, \\"Young Master Sun is here! He just stepped out.\\" Pincai saw an immediate lifeline. Knowing Sihui was familiar with these performers, he ordered, \\"Go quickly and invite him in!\\" Si'er hurried out. Sihui was still at the counter,"},{"paragraph":31,"mentions":1,"tokens":["四儿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"掌柜看了一看，夹在帐里。走堂的送上一个灯笼，四儿接了，出了馆子，两人各低了头，一步步踱回。可谓乘兴而来，扫兴而返。未知后事如何，且听下回分解。","en":"The manager glanced at the slip and filed it away. A waiter brought out a lit lantern, which Si'er accepted, and they exited the restaurant. The two men trudged home step by step, their heads bowed in heavy silence. It could truly be said: they arrived riding the crest of high spirits, only to depart mired in bitter deflation. But as for what unfolded"}],"9":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":2,"tokens":["四儿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说魏聘才、李元茂回家时已三更，梅宅关了门落了锁，四儿敲了半天，才有人来开了。两人走到房中，聘才免不得将不小心丢银子的话，抱怨了元茂两句。元茂无言可答，各自安睡。到了次日，只得央了许顺，借了十吊钱的票子，分作两张，写了一封字，叫四儿送与叶茂林，分给二喜、保珠。后来子玉盘问，聘才、元茂只推张仲雨请去听戏下","en":"Yuanmao arrived home, it was past the third night-watch. The Mei household had already barred and bolted its gates. Si'er knocked for a long while before anyone came to open them. The two entered their rooms, and Pincai could not help voicing a few reproaches at Yuanmao for carelessly losing the silver. Yuanmao had no answer. They each went to sleep. The next day, they"}],"16":[{"paragraph":14,"mentions":1,"tokens":["四儿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"明早富三爷即遣人带了两辆车来接聘才，聘才即拜别颜夫人并子玉，又辞了元茂，收拾停妥，带了四儿一径上车。先到富宅略叙片时，富三亲送到华府。到了门口，富三先着人回进去，并说魏师爷来了。聘才在车内一望这门面，就觉威严得了不得，就是南京总督衙门，也无此高大。门前一座大照墙，用水磨砖砌成，上下镂花，并有花檐滴水，上盖琉璃瓦，约有三丈多高，七丈多宽。左","en":"collect Pincai. After bidding farewell to Lady Yan, Ziyu, and Yuanmao, Pincai gathered his belongings, brought Si'er along, and boarded the carriage. They first stopped at the Fu residence for a brief visit before Fu the Third personally escorted him to the Hua mansion. At the gate, a messenger was sent ahead to announce Master Wei's arrival. Peering from the carriage,"}],"21":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["四儿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一日，因张、顾二人有事，遂独自出城，雇了一辆十三太保玻璃热车，把四儿也打扮了，意气扬扬，特来看子玉之病。","en":"therefore went out of the city alone, hired a fashionable thirteen-panel glass-windowed heated carriage, dressed up Si'er as well, and with an air of triumph came expressly to inquire after Ziyu's illness."}],"26":[{"paragraph":14,"mentions":1,"tokens":["四儿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"明日早饭后，聘才带了四儿，坐了大鞍车，即出城找着了叶茂林，茂林就搭了聘才的车到长庆处来。劈面遇见了张仲雨，两边停了车，茂林让过一边，等聘才出来说话。仲雨问起聘才，聘才把华公子托他之事说了。仲雨道：「怪不得他前天如此高兴，总赏了一百多金子，又将自己的玉佩，给了琴言、宝珠。」","en":"The next morning, after breakfast, Pincai took Si'er and a large saddle-cart out of the city to find Ye Maolin. Maolin rode with him to Changqing's residence. Along the way, they ran into Zhang Zhongyu. Both carts halted, and Maolin yielded the right of way as Pincai stepped out to speak. When Zhongyu"}],"28":[{"paragraph":20,"mentions":1,"tokens":["四儿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"出了大门，即叫琴言坐在车里，放下车帘，自己跨沿，四儿坐在车尾，不多一刻即到了梅宅。聘才也不候通报，同了琴言一直到了书房。许顺见了甚为诧异，却又不好拦阻，也跟了进来。颜夫人正在盼望，见许顺进来，似欲回什么话似的，颜夫人问：「有什么事？」许顺说：「魏大爷同了一个人，到像个唱戏的似的，小的不敢不回。」颜夫人","en":"outside the gate, Qinyan was seated in the carriage, the curtains drawn tight. Pincai stood on the footboard, with Si'er riding on the tail. Before long, they arrived at the Mei residence. Pincai did not wait for an announcement; he led Qinyan straight toward the study. The gatekeeper, Xu Shun, was startled but could not block their path, so he followed them in. Lady Yan"}],"29":[{"paragraph":14,"mentions":1,"tokens":["四儿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一候，我还有话。」便自己进房，先着人叫了许顺进来，叫他秤了二百银子来，颜夫人道：「你交与魏少爷收了。」聘才叫交四儿拿了。又见一个仆妇拿着一包东西出来，付与琴言道：「这是太太赏你的，你收了再去谢赏。」聘才见是银镶小刀一把，大荷包一对，小荷包一对，帕子一方，洋表一个，梅花小锭十个，牙骨真金面扇子一把，琴言收了，与聘才进去谢了赏；聘才也含含糊糊的跟着谢了一声，即同出来","en":"him to weigh out two hundred taels of silver. \\"Give this to the young gentleman Wei,\\" she instructed. Pincai had Si'er take charge of the silver. A servant then brought out an elegant bundle, and Lady Yan presented it to Qinyan. \\"Madame rewards you. Take this, and then you may offer your thanks.\\" The bundle contained a delicate silver knife, a pair of large, exquisite"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":1,"tokens":["四儿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"进城已是申初时分了。到门口下来，一径跟着聘才进去，只见总门口有人拿了大簿子记上一笔，琴言知道是上号簿。聘才先叫四儿将银包拿进房去，放在钱柜内锁好。一同进来找着林珊枝，珊枝见琴言回来，即笑道：「怎么去了许多时，想必医的病好了。」琴言面有惭色，便问道：「公子可曾传我？」珊枝道：「怎么没传？传了两三回，不见你回来，公子大发气，已着人叫你师傅去了。」琴言听了，吃这一惊不","en":"man with a great ledger set down an entry, and Qinyan knew it was the register of comings and goings. Pincai had Si'er carry the silver straight to his room to lock it safely in a chest, while he went to find Lin Shanzhi. When Shanzhi saw Qinyan, he said with a smile, \\"You have been gone so long; your illness must surely have healed by now.\\" Qinyan flushed with shame"}],"34":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["四儿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这一年没有同榻，今日正好谈谈。」聘才无奈，只得由他。元茂不知好歹，吹了烟又要吃果子，停一回又要点心，把聘才那个四儿呼来唤去，忙个不了。聘才歪躺在一边，也不去理他。","en":"Yuanmao smoked his opium and then demanded fruit; a moment later, he called for snacks, bossing Pincai's servant Si'er around and keeping him endlessly busy. Pincai lay sprawled to one side, completely ignoring him."},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":1,"tokens":["四儿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"到了三更，四儿来请聘才，说唐和尚请说话。聘才来到和尚房中，见炕上开了灯，屋中点了两枝蜡，照得雪亮，铜炉内火焰熏人。旁边小方桌上有几碟残肴，一把烧酒壶，却不见和尚。聘才坐下等他，等了一回才来，说道：「偏偏要解手，忽然水泄起来。」叫人打了盆水，净了手，坐了说道：「日间","en":"At the third watch, Si'er came to inform Pincai that Monk Tang wished to speak with him. Pincai went to the monk's room, where he saw a lamp lit on the kang and two candles burning in the room, casting a snow-bright glow. A copper brazier radiated a smoky heat. On a small square"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":1,"tokens":["四儿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"人在家照应你。」元茂模模糊糊的应了一声，翻一个身将被蒙了头，又睡着了。聘才好不烦躁，看这光景是不肯起来，只得叫四儿在家看守屋子，另带小使骑了马出门找富三去了。","en":"asleep again. Exceedingly irritated and seeing that the man refused to rise, Pincai had no choice but to leave Si'er behind to watch the house, taking a young page with him to ride into town and find Fu the Third."},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":9,"tokens":["四儿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"却说元茂睡到巳正方才起来，擦擦眼睛，见四儿在房里扫地抹桌子。元茂便问道：「你主人那里去了？」四儿道：「到富三爷那里去了。」元茂下炕穿了衣裳，走到外间，四儿送了脸水，泡了茶，又送上点心。元茂又吸了几袋水烟，吐了一地的痰，四儿扫干净了。元茂问道：「你可知道几时回来？」四儿道：「拿不定。」元茂道：","en":"As for Yuanmao, he slept until the late morning before finally getting up. Rubbing his eyes, he saw Si'er sweeping the floor and wiping the tables in the room. Yuanmao asked, \\"Where has your master gone?\\" Si'er replied, \\"He went to Master Fu the Third's place.\\" Yuanmao got off the kang, put on his clothes, and walked to the outer room. Si'er brought him"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":2,"tokens":["四儿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"四儿先把菜摆好，又拿了木盘出去。元茂看菜，一碟是熏鸡，一碟是鸡蛋，一碟是肉丝，一碟像是面筋，看不清楚，拈了一块尝尝，果然是面筋。四儿拿了一小壶酒，一个酒杯子，替他斟了一杯，又出去了。元茂一面喝酒，一面看那铺设，颇为精致。两间套房，昨晚心中有事未曾留心，日","en":"Si'er first arranged the dishes, then took the wooden tray back out. Yuanmao inspected the food: one plate of smoked chicken, one of eggs, one of shredded meat, and one that looked like gluten. Unsure, he picked up a piece to taste—it was indeed gluten. Si'er"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":2,"tokens":["四儿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"四个大皮箱衣裳也就不少，那两个木箱与这两个大柜，定是放银子钱的。他还装穷哄我，今日断不能放过他。」便走了出来。四儿又拿进两样菜、一锡罐饭来，一样是羊肉，一样是炒肝。后来厨子又送了一个小火锅，一齐摆上。元茂吃了五碗饭，吃了些汤，把一碗羊肉吃了一大半，漱了口，吃了一袋烟，问四儿要了块槟榔，嚼了半天，坐着不走。","en":"He's feigning poverty to deceive me! I absolutely will not let him off the hook today.\\" He then walked back out. Si'er brought in two more dishes and a tin pot of rice: one dish was mutton, the other stir-fried liver. Later, the cook also sent in a small hotpot, all laid out together. Yuanmao devoured five bowls of rice, drank some soup, finished off more than half the"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":1,"tokens":["四儿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"被人讹住了，不要累死我么？怎么这般胡涂！」元茂道：「怕什么，这里有谁来？我坐了大半天，没有见一个人进来。况且有四儿在外面照应着。」聘才气他不过，也不理他，把一套火狐腿的皮袄脱了，换了一件随常穿的狐皮大袄，换了便帽，擦了脸，喝了茶。元茂便啰啰唦唦的要借钱，后来见聘才总不应允，便道：「你既没有钱，你那四个大皮箱内难道衣服也没有？况且我只借百十吊钱，似乎也不至拖累你。","en":"afraid of? Who would come here? I've been sitting here all day and haven't seen a single soul walk in. Besides, Si'er is outside keeping watch.\\" Pincai, too enraged to argue further and refusing to pay him any more attention, took off his fiery fox-leg fur coat, changed into his everyday fox fur robe, donned a casual cap, wiped his face, and drank some tea. Yuanmao"},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":1,"tokens":["四儿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，果然是空的。奚十一道：「这便怎么好？去问唐大爷要些来罢。」聘才道：「有，有，有！前日我得了几两老土烟。」便叫四儿到房里去取烟。","en":"\\"I have some! I have some! The other day, I got my hands on a few taels of fine native opium.\\" He then ordered Si'er to go to his room and fetch it."},{"paragraph":33,"mentions":1,"tokens":["四儿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"在这院子西边，一重门进去，一个小院子，一并两间。聘才只将院门锁了，因要伺候客，不能叫人看守屋子。此夜月明如昼，四儿走到门边，开了锁，将手推门，忽然的推不开。因想此门素来松的，忽然今日紧了，略用些力也推不开。","en":"he had been unable to spare anyone to stand guard over the rooms. The moon that night shone as bright as day. Si'er walked over to the gate, unlocked the padlock, and pushed on the door, but to his surprise, it wouldn't open. The door was usually loose, yet it had suddenly grown tight; even with a bit of force, it refused to budge."},{"paragraph":34,"mentions":1,"tokens":["四儿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"心中着实疑异，想道：「里头没有人，这块石头谁来顶的？」便蹲下身子拨过了石头，拿了灯罩，走进外间一照，不少东西，四儿略放了心。再走到里间细细一看，又照了一照，便吓了一大跳，只见大皮箱少了一个，炕上两个拜匣、一个衣包也不见了。即忙嚷将出来道：「老爷！不好了，被了窃了！」聘才心中甚慌，连忙赶去，到屋里看时，不知后事如何，且听下回分解。","en":"up the lamp cover, and stepped into the outer room to take a look. Noticing that nothing seemed to be missing, Si'er breathed a slight sigh of relief. However, as he walked into the inner room and took a closer, more careful look under the light of the lamp, he jumped in fright. One of the large leather trunks was missing, and the two caskets and a clothing bundle"}],"36":[{"paragraph":11,"mentions":1,"tokens":["四儿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"门，小使指点他一直过了两层殿，从东廊后另有一个院子进去。琴言低着头，并不留心别处，一直到了聘才院子里，见聘才的四儿出来，与他点点头，把风门一开。琴言方抬头望去，吃了一惊，见坐着一屋子的人，心中乱跳，脸已红了。欲待退出，聘才已迎将出来。只得定了定神，上前见了。聘才道：「今日缘何光降？令我梦想不到。」琴言红着脸答不上来。聘才对着众人道：「这是我天天说的第一个有名的杜","en":"his head down, he paid no attention to his surroundings until he reached Pincai's courtyard. Pincai's servant, Si'er, came out, nodded to him, and opened the wind-door. When Qinyan looked up, he was startled—the room was full of people. His heart pounded, and his face flushed. He wanted to retreat, but Pincai was already coming out to welcome him. Gathering his wits,"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":2,"tokens":["四儿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"里哼了两声。唐和尚看了好笑，便道：「潘三爷做什么，脖子涨的疼么？」潘三也笑了。奚十一的人送了菜来，要面见聘才，四儿同了进去。来人道：「家爷说，有位琴爷在这里，家爷从前不知道，冒犯了，深自懊悔。本来要请琴爷过去坐坐，恐怕不肯赏脸，叫我送了几样菜来，请大爷代家爷转敬琴爷消消气，家爷有事不能过来奉陪了。」聘才笑道：「怎么要你老爷费事？又几时得罪过琴爷？说得这样周到，我","en":"hurt?\\" Pan the Third laughed along. Just then, Xi Eleven's servant arrived with the dishes and asked to see Pincai. Si'er brought him in. The servant announced, \\"My master says that he didn't know Master Qin was here earlier and deeply regrets his offense. He originally wanted to invite Master Qin over to sit, but feared he wouldn't do him the honor, so he had me bring"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":1,"tokens":["四儿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"四儿去了不多一刻，就摆了酒菜上来，在个方桌子上。聘才道：「虽然便饭，也喝一杯酒。」琴言道：「不消了，就吃饭罢。」聘才不听，斟了一杯送过来，琴言只得接了，也回敬了聘才一杯。聘才喜出望外，也是平生第一次得意，难得两人对坐了。聘才随口的说些话来哄琴言，要他喜欢","en":"Not long after Si'er left, wine and dishes were set out on a square table. Pincai urged, \\"Though it's just a simple meal, let us share a cup of wine.\\" Qinyan declined, \\"There's no need, I will just eat.\\" But Pincai wouldn't listen, pouring a cup and handing it over. Qinyan"}]}`),"char-113":{4:[{paragraph:6,mentions:1,tokens:["健儿"],kind:"named-mention",zh:`子上写着梅少爷手展，旁有一行小字。内信笺一纸，诗笺四纸。认得仲清笔迹，便问俊儿是谁送来的。俊儿道：「是颜少爷的健儿。」子玉道：「叫他等一等。」拆开看时，信笺上写着是：昨与庸庵同居虚室。玉杯寒重，始知六出花飞；银烛光残，才见十分雪艳。冰山迭迭，围成云母屏风；宝塔层层，照见琉璃灯火。美人装罢，玉戏猫儿；罗汉堆来，球抛狮子。
黄昏选韵，白战分题；愧乏琼词，聊为砖引。`,en:`Recognizing Zhongqing's calligraphy, Ziyu asked Jun'er who had delivered it. "It was brought by Young Master Yan's personal attendant," Jun'er replied. Ziyu asked him to wait a moment, then broke the seal. The note read: "Yesterday, Yong'an and I sat together in a desolate room. Only when our jade cups grew heavy with cold did we realize the six-pointed flowers had begun to fly; only`},{paragraph:14,mentions:1,tokens:["健儿"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"不必拿去献丑罢。」子玉道：「这又何妨？我替你们写。」另用一张纸写了。又在回书后面，添了两句。封好了，打发云儿与健儿同去。",en:"paper, added two more lines to the end of his reply letter, sealed the whole thing, and sent Yun'er to go with the attendant."}]},"char-114":{7:[{paragraph:4,mentions:2,tokens:["雪儿"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"有人进来。我见二姑娘看书的时候，翻出一张纸来看了看、用指甲挖破一处，仍旧夹在书里。」又笑道：「前日我听得二姑娘雪儿说，孙家太太做媒，将二姑娘配了少爷了，将二姑娘配了少爷了，二姑娘还戴了太太一根簪子回去。」子玉似信不信的问道：「我不信，你敢是撒谎的？」小丫鬟道：「我敢撒谎？我那天看着房没有敢走开，这是雪儿说的。只怕咱们家里人，都也知道。」子玉听了心内甚喜，猛想起这",en:`and then place it back in the book." She then laughed and added, "The other day, I heard the Second Miss's maid, Xue'er, say that Madam Sun acted as a matchmaker and betrothed the Second Miss to you, Young Master—she even took one of the Mistress's hairpins with her." Half-believing, Ziyu asked, "I don't believe it—are you making this up?" The maidservant protested, "Would`}]},"char-115":{6:[{paragraph:6,mentions:1,tokens:["松儿"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"淫欲无度，那个红鼻子常在他脸上擦来擦去，闹得沈姑娘肉麻难忍，后来只得将一个陪房的大丫头，叫嗣徽收了。这丫头名叫松儿，生得板门似的一扇八寸长的脚，人倒极风骚的，嗣徽本先偷上了几次，试用过他那件器物，倒是个好材料，便爱如珍宝，竟有专房之宠。这沈姑娘如何还有妒心，恨不得他们如蛤蚧一般，常常的连在一处，也脱了他的罪孽。外面侍奉翁姑，颇为承顺，背地却时时垂泪。",en:"could scarcely endure. Ultimately, she was forced to surrender her personal dowry maid to him. This maid, named Song'er, possessed feet a full eight inches long—resembling wooden boards—yet she was wildly flirtatious. Sihui, having already had her a few times on the sly and tried out her equipment, found it prime material. Treasuring her deeply, he granted her almost"}]},"char-116":{6:[{paragraph:8,mentions:2,tokens:["伴送婆"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"揎拳掳臂，也想来打巴姑娘。巴姑娘趁他走近身时，便站将起来，索性的劈胸一拳，把嗣元打了一交，嗣元爬起来往外就跑，伴送婆、家人媳妇、陪房的丫头一齐拖住，再三的劝他，又将巴姑娘也劝了一会。这巴姑娘原也一时使气，仔细一想，原悔自己太冒失了，闹起来不好看，且兼娘家又远，照应不来，只得忍耐不语。嗣元嘴里乱说，被伴送婆掩了他的口，与他们卸了妆，脱了衣，再三的和解，服侍他们睡下，",en:"punch squarely on his chest, sending him tumbling head over heels. He scrambled up and fled to the door, where the attending matrons, servants, and maids frantically restrained him, spending hours mediating the dispute. Miss Ba, acting on a sudden surge of fury, soon regretted her rashness; realizing the unseemliness of a public scene and her family's inability to intervene from afar,"}]},"char-117":{6:[{paragraph:8,mentions:1,tokens:["乳母"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"和解，服侍他们睡下，方才出去。嗣元经了这两下，心已悔了，再不敢寻他，只得避在脚头，睡了一夜。过了几天，巴姑娘的乳母苦苦的喻以大义，说官家之女，怎好打起丈夫来，就是丈夫生得不好，也是各人前定的姻缘。巴姑娘原是个聪明人，也知木已成舟，不能怎样，只好独自洒泪。这嗣元过了几天，见他和平些了，便想也行个周公之礼。等他睡着了，便解开了他的衣裤。巴姑娘本要不依，一想吵闹起来便",en:"the blows, Siyuan dared not approach her again, keeping to the foot of the bed for the night. Days later, her wet nurse gently counseled her on propriety, arguing that an official's daughter must not strike her husband; regardless of his flaws, this was her predestined fate. Miss Ba, intelligent enough to recognize the finality of her situation, could only weep in private."}]},"char-118":{3:[{paragraph:18,mentions:1,tokens:["跟班的"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"你就懵开了。我姓富的在这里，你不能。」那卖玉器的见了他，就不敢强，道：「三爷，你能怎么说，怎么好。」那胖子就叫跟班的给他四百钱，卖玉器的尚要争论，那一位也说道：「富三爷那里不照应你，这点事你就这么着。况且富三爷是为朋友的，下次瞧瞧有好玉器，他们多照顾你一点就够了。」蓉官接口道：「这老头子好讨人嫌：弯着腰，托着那浪盘子，天天在人空里挤来挤去，一点好东西都没有。谁要买",en:'bravado vanished instantly. "Third Master, whatever you decree, so it shall be." The stout man motioned to his servant to hand the peddler four hundred cash. The old man opened his mouth to protest, but the lean man cut him off. "Third Master Fu patronizes you constantly. Why squabble over such a trifle? He acts on behalf of a friend. Next time you procure decent jade,'},{paragraph:24,mentions:1,tokens:["跟班"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"：「今日幸会，但先要说明赏兄弟的脸作个东。」富三笑道：「使得。」就在靴革幼里拿出个靴页子来，取一张钱票，交与他跟班给看座儿的，连这位老爷的戏钱也在里头。聘才又再三谢了。于是带了蓉官，一同出来。",en:`heartily, "As you wish." He drew a small leather folio from his boot, extracted a banknote, and handed it to his servant to settle the bill—graciously covering Pincai's ticket as well. Pincai offered profound thanks. Together, with Rongguan in tow, they exited the theater.`}],5:[{paragraph:28,mentions:2,tokens:["跟班的"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"桌，几张椅子，中间放了一个大铜煤炉，上面墙上一幅绢笺对子，旁边壁上一幅细巧洋画。炕上是宝蓝缎子的铺垫。只见一个跟班的走来，穿件素绸皮袄，一个皮帽子遮着眉毛，后头露着半个大发顶，托着茶盘，先将茶递与聘才。聘才道：「奶奶前替我请安。」跟班的尚未回答，富三道：「今日你嫂子不在家，回娘家去了，你今日就在这里吃饭，咱们说说话儿。」聘才连忙答应，又问：「贵大爷今日可来？」富三",en:'silk-scroll couplet, and beside it an intricate Western painting. The kang cushions were of sapphire-blue satin. A servant entered, wearing a plain silk fur-lined jacket and a fur hat pulled down over his eyebrows, revealing half of a large braided queue at the back. Carrying a tea tray, he first handed a cup to Pincai. Pincai said: "Please convey my respects to the Madam."'}],12:[{paragraph:21,mentions:1,tokens:["跟班"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"到得意处，忽见前面一张桌子，来了一个三十来岁胖子，反穿着草上霜，同着一个二十几岁伶伶俐俐的人坐下，背后站着一个跟班。那胖子是一口京话，那一个是南边人，原来就是富三与魏聘才。不多一刻，蓉官卸了妆，已坐在对面楼上，与一个少年说话。下来又在楼下坐了一会，即走到这边来，一路路请安照应人。",en:"wearing a fur-lined coat inside out, accompanied by a clever-looking young man of about twenty; behind them stood a manservant. The plump man spoke in pure Beijing speech; the other was from the south. These were in fact Fu the Third and Wei Pincai. Before long, Rongguan had removed his stage makeup and was sitting in the gallery upstairs talking with a young man. He came down"}]},"char-119":{5:[{paragraph:25,mentions:1,tokens:["卢大爷"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"他那所房子，周围就有三四里。他们有个管牲口的爷们卢大爷，我曾听他说有一百几十匹马，七八十个大骡子，你说这人家阔不阔？」聘才道：「他姓什么？」赶车的道：「他姓华，人家都叫他华公子。」聘才道：「马上那些人，自然是家人了，车里头那些孩子，倒像相公模样的，又是什么人呢？」赶车的道：",en:`"His residence takes up three or four li in circumference. They have a Master of Stables called Master Lu, and I once heard him say they have a hundred-odd horses and seventy or eighty large mules. Would you say that's wealthy?" Pincai asked: "What is his surname?" The driver replied: "His surname is Hua, people all call him Young Master Hua." Pincai asked:`}]},"char-120":{5:[{paragraph:24,mentions:1,tokens:["跟班"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"看他穿着绣蟒貂裘，华冠朝履，后面二三十匹跟班马，马上的人，都是簇新一样颜色的衣服。接着又有十几辆泥围的热车，车里坐着些粉装玉琢的孩子，也像小旦模样。后面又有四五辆大车，车上装些箱子、衣包，还有些茶炉、酒盒、行厨等物。那些赶车的，都是短袄绸裤，绫袜缎鞋，雄纠纠的好不威风。倒过了好一会。聘才想道：",en:"embroidered python-robe with sable cloak, a magnificent official hat, and court shoes. Behind him came twenty or thirty mounted attendants, all in freshly made uniforms of matching color. Then followed over ten cloth-curtained heated carriages, inside which sat some powder-and-jade-carved children, also resembling small dan performers. Behind these came four or five large carts laden with"},{paragraph:30,mentions:1,tokens:["跟班的"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"是《十不闲》中的状元了，我想他必定也喜欢他。那个小顺儿上了妆，刚走上来，他见了就登时的怒容满面，冷笑了一声，他跟班的连忙把这小顺儿轰了下去，叫我脸上好下不来。看他以后，便话也不说，笑也不笑，才上了十几样菜，他就急于要走，再留不住，只得让他去了。还算赏我脸，没有动着鞭子。他这坐一坐，我算起来，上席、中席、下席，各色赏耗共一千多吊，不但没有讨好，他倒说我俗恶不堪，以后",en:"full costume and walked on, Young Master Hua's face instantly turned furious. He let out a cold laugh, and his attendants at once drove Xiaoshun'er off, leaving me extremely mortified. After that he said not a word, gave not a smile. Barely ten dishes had been served when he grew eager to leave, and no amount of urging could detain him. I had to let him go. It was generous"}]},"char-121":JSON.parse(`{"1":[{"paragraph":52,"mentions":1,"tokens":[],"kind":"identified-reference","zh":"车里坐着一个老年的，外面坐了两个妙童，都不过十四五岁。","en":"Ziyu couldn't stop laughing to himself all the way. \\"Why do these people turn their minds so hazy and blind, failing to distinguish black from white, all for a few young dan? If a truly peerless beauty were to appear right now, I fear they would actually say he looked terrible.\\" Lost in these thoughts along the way, his carriage suddenly became wedged in a crowded bottleneck. Ziyu caught a waft of a pure, fresh fragrance—neither orchid nor musk—and peeked out through the glass window on the curtain. He saw a carriage opposite them. Inside sat an elderly man, and on the outside sat two wondrous young boys, both no more than fourteen or fifteen.","identityNote":{"en":"Chapter 2 identifies the three carriage occupants retrospectively as Qinyan, Qiguan and Ye Maolin.","zh":"第2回回叙此番挤车，明言同车者为琴官、琪官与叶茂林。"}}],"2":[{"paragraph":12,"mentions":1,"tokens":["茂林"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这里来的，就结了伴同走。本来要起旱，因车价过贵，想趁个便船从水路来，遂遇见了这两个戏子船在扬州。那个教师姓叶叫茂林．是苏州人。从前在过秦淮河卞家河房里，教过曲子，我认得他。承他好意，就叫我们搭他的船进京。在运河里粮船拥挤，就走了四个多月。见他们天天的学戏，倒也听会了许多。我们这个船上，有五个孩子，顶好的有两个：一个小旦叫琪官，年十四岁。他的颜色就像花粉和了胭脂水","en":"a passenger boat. It was then we encountered these theatrical vessels in Yangzhou. The master was a man named Ye Maolin, a native of Suzhou. He had previously taught singing at the Bian family's riverside estate on the Qinhuai, and I was acquainted with him. He graciously allowed us passage on his boat to the capital. Amidst the throngs of grain barges congesting the"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":2,"tokens":["叶茂林"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"绉绸皮袄，酱色呢得胜褂。」子玉见衣服已经对了，又问：「他一人一个车呢，还与人同坐一个车？」聘才道：「他与琪官、叶茂林同坐一个车，那车围是蓝布的，骡子是白的。」子玉又道：「那叶茂林有多少岁数了？」聘才道：「五十以外。」子玉不禁拍手笑道：「我已见过这两人，你果然赞得不错，真要算绝色了。」聘才大乐道：「何如，你几时见过的？」子玉就将那日挤了路，见四辆车都是些小孩子，头一","en":"each ride in his own carriage, or did they share one?\\" Pincai answered, \\"He shared a carriage with Qiguan and Ye Maolin. The carriage awning was of blue cloth, drawn by a white mule.\\" Ziyu asked, \\"And how old is this Ye Maolin?\\" Pincai said, \\"Past fifty.\\" Unable to contain himself, Ziyu clapped his hands and laughed, \\"I have already seen these two! Your praise is not"}],"3":[{"paragraph":6,"mentions":6,"tokens":["叶茂林","茂林"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"到了账房，见叶茂林同着个白胖面生的人在那里坐着，见聘才进来，都站起了，上前拉手问好。聘才道：「叶先生到此有何贵干？」叶茂林笑嘻嘻的道：「晓得尊驾在此，特来请安的。」聘才知道他是顺口的话，便道：「我还没有来奉拜，倒先劳你的驾过来。」又问：「那位贵姓？」叶茂林道：「这是我","en":"Upon entering the accounts room, he found Ye Maolin seated beside an unfamiliar, pale, and stout gentleman. At Pincai's entrance, both men rose to greet him warmly. Pincai asked, \\"Master Ye, what brings you to our humble residence?\\" Maolin beamed, \\"Knowing Your Excellency was here, I came especially to"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":1,"tokens":["茂林"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"他师傅，也有在联锦班的，也有过别班里去的。聘才又问他的寓处，说在杨柳巷联锦班总寓内。聘才道：「改日过来奉看。」茂林道：「这如何敢当，只好顺便去逛逛。」说着许顺已同了金二回来，已经说妥，定于正月初六日在姑苏会馆，不论分包不分包，只要点谁的戏，不短脚色就是了。许顺上去回明，付了定银各散。是晚子玉课期，未得与聘才闲谈。","en":"quarters in Yangliu Lane. \\"I shall come to pay my respects soon,\\" Pincai promised. \\"I would not dare presume,\\" Maolin replied, \\"only drop by if you are passing through.\\" Presently, Xu Shun and Master Jin returned, having struck an agreement: the performance was set for the sixth day of the first month at the Suzhou Guild Hall. Whether the contract was split mattered"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":1,"tokens":["叶茂林"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"次日，聘才记着叶茂林的话，吃了早饭想去听戏，叫四儿带了钱，换了衣裳。因元茂在书房读书，不好约他，独自步行出门，不多路就到了戏园地方。这条街共有五个园子，一路车马挤满，甚是难走。遍看联锦班的报子，今日没有戏，遇着传差，聘才心上不乐，只得再找别的班子。耳边听得一阵锣鼓响，走","en":"The following morning, with Ye Maolin's vivid descriptions lingering in his mind, Pincai finished his breakfast, resolved to attend a play. He instructed Si'er to carry some coin and changed into fresh garments. Knowing Yuanmao was immersed in his studies, Pincai departed alone on foot."},{"paragraph":40,"mentions":2,"tokens":["叶茂林"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"。见了子玉、元茂进来，，便嘻嘻的笑。元茂道：「今日什么事，到此刻才回？」又凑到他脑上一看道：「酒气醺醺，一定是叶茂林请你的，可曾见那些小孩子么？」聘才道：「我没有去找叶茂林，我倒听了联珠班的戏。那班里的相公，足有五六十个，都是生得很好的。遇见一个相好，是从前南京藩台的少爷，与我们也有世谊。他请我吃饭，叫了个相公，也是上等的。」子玉道：「大哥，你前日说那琴官脾气不好","en":"grin. Yuanmao asked, \\"What kept you abroad until this late hour?\\" Peering closer, he added, \\"You reek of wine! Did Ye Maolin invite you out? Did you happen to see any of those young actors?\\" Pincai laughed, \\"I did not seek out Ye Maolin. Instead, I attended a performance by the Lianzhu Troupe. That company boasts fifty or sixty young actors, all possessing exceptional grace."}],"5":[{"paragraph":10,"mentions":2,"tokens":["叶茂林"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"痛成病而死。遗下这个琴官无依无靠，赖其族叔收养。十三岁上叔叔又死，其婶不能守节，即行改嫁，遂以琴官卖入梨园。适叶茂林见了，又从戏班中买出，同了进京。这琴官六岁上，即认字读书，聪慧异常，过目成诵。到十三岁，也读了好些书，以及诗词杂览、小说稗官，都能了了。心既好高，性复爱洁，有山鸡舞镜、丹风栖梧之志。当其失足梨园时，已投缳数次，皆不得死，所以班中厌弃已久，琴官借以自完","en":"widowed aunt could not maintain her chastity and remarried, so she sold Qinguan into a theater troupe. Just then Ye Maolin happened to see him and bought him out of the troupe, taking him along to the capital. Qinguan had begun to learn characters at six, was exceptionally gifted, and could memorize anything upon a single reading. By thirteen he had read many books, including"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":1,"tokens":["叶茂林"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"见了琴官，十分快意，回家之后，急急的找了聘才，与他说知。聘才也有些喜欢，因将路上的光景，细说与子玉。原来聘才与叶茂林同行到济宁州时，那一班相公上岸去了，独见琴官在船中垂泪，便问了他好些心事，终不答应。及说到敢是不愿唱戏，恐辱没了父母的话，他方把聘才看了一眼。聘才从此便想进一步，竟不打量打量自己，把块帕子要替他拭泪，刚要拭时，被他一手抢去，扔在河里，即掩面哭起来，聘","en":"somewhat pleased as well, and proceeded to describe to Ziyu the scene on the road. It turned out that when Pincai and Ye Maolin had been traveling together and reached Jining Department, all the performers had gone ashore, but he found Qinguan alone in the boat, in tears. He asked about his troubles, but Qinguan would answer nothing. When Pincai suggested he might not want to"}],"8":[{"paragraph":3,"mentions":1,"tokens":["叶茂林"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"告诉他。」元茂道：「这恐怕使不得，倘或查问起来怎样回答？」聘才道：「如果不查更好，若一查起来，只说我们路上借了叶茂林的盘缠，他今日来讨，一时不好意思，所以还他的。」元茂道：「说倒也说得像，但旧年没有题过，恐怕不信。」聘才道：「这有什么不信？你只说向来只道我已还了，所以没有题起。」元茂又想了一想，径到他父亲房中，开了箱子，伸手在箱里摸索，摸着了一大包，有好几十两。打","en":"me?\\" \\"If he never asks, all the better,\\" Pincai reasoned. \\"If he does, merely say we borrowed travel funds from Ye Maolin on the road, and when he came to collect today, it would have been too embarrassing not to repay him at once.\\" \\"That sounds plausible,\\" Yuanmao admitted, \\"but since it was never mentioned before, he might doubt the tale.\\" \\"Why should he?\\" Pincai pressed."},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":1,"tokens":["叶茂林"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"。已开过台，做了两出，此刻唱的是《拾金》。元茂见不是小旦戏，便不看，他左顾右盼，四下里闲望，非但琴官等不见，连叶茂林也不在台上。","en":"wander in every direction, searching the hall. Yet not only were Qinguan and the others nowhere to be seen, even Ye Maolin was absent from the stage."}],"9":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["叶茂林"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"了元茂两句。元茂无言可答，各自安睡。到了次日，只得央了许顺，借了十吊钱的票子，分作两张，写了一封字，叫四儿送与叶茂林，分给二喜、保珠。后来子玉盘问，聘才、元茂只推张仲雨请去听戏下馆子，却将实情瞒过了。","en":"promissory note, which they divided into two drafts. Wrapping them with a letter, they had Si'er deliver the money to Ye Maolin to distribute between Erxi and Baozhu. Later, when Ziyu asked, Pincai and Yuanmao simply claimed that Zhang Zhongyu had treated them to opera and a restaurant, keeping the truth concealed."}],"10":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["叶茂林"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"得是梦中救他出陷坑的人，时时刻刻放在心上。又姑苏会馆唱戏那一日，见他同了一班公子，还有魏聘才、李元茂在座，问起叶茂林，始知这位公子就姓梅，已应了梅花树下之兆。从此，一缕幽情如沾泥柳絮，已被缠住。","en":"Hall, seeing Ziyu seated among a company of young gentlemen that included Wei Pincai and Li Yuanmao, he asked Ye Maolin and learned that this young master's surname was indeed Mei, fulfilling the omen beneath the plum tree. From that moment, a thread of tender feeling, like willow catkins clinging to the mud, had hopelessly entangled his heart."}],"15":[{"paragraph":3,"mentions":1,"tokens":["叶茂林"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"当晚子玉与聘才在书房闲话。那日是忌辰，日间聘才独自一人到樱桃巷去，找着了叶茂林，两人谈了半天。聘才拉他在扁食楼上吃了饭，即同到那些小旦寓处，打了几家茶围。末了到琴言处，琴言倒出来与聘才谈了几句，即问起子玉来。聘才就将子玉的心事，再装点了些，说得琴言着实感激，并与琴言约定了，明日同子玉前来相会。回来与子玉说知，子玉便添了一件心事","en":"the study. That day was a memorial anniversary, so Pincai had gone alone to Cherry Lane during the day and found Ye Maolin. The two talked for a long while, and Pincai treated him to a meal at the Flat-Dumpling Restaurant; they then went together to call on various young dan actors, visiting several tea parlors in a row. At the last stop they went to Qinyan's place; Qinyan"}],"26":[{"paragraph":14,"mentions":3,"tokens":["叶茂林","茂林"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"明日早饭后，聘才带了四儿，坐了大鞍车，即出城找着了叶茂林，茂林就搭了聘才的车到长庆处来。劈面遇见了张仲雨，两边停了车，茂林让过一边，等聘才出来说话。仲雨问起聘才，聘才把华公子托他之事说了。仲雨道：「怪不得他前天如此高兴，总赏了一百多金子，又将自己的玉佩，给了琴言、宝珠。」","en":"The next morning, after breakfast, Pincai took Si'er and a large saddle-cart out of the city to find Ye Maolin. Maolin rode with him to Changqing's residence. Along the way, they ran into Zhang Zhongyu. Both carts halted, and Maolin yielded the right of way as Pincai stepped out to speak. When Zhongyu asked about their errand, Pincai explained the Young Master's"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":1,"tokens":["叶茂林"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"说到此，便凑着聘才耳边说了好些，叶茂林听不清楚，只见聘才点头说道：「我自有道理，进来了还由得他？」又说了几句别的事，各人分道走了。","en":"Zhongyu then whispered at length into Pincai's ear. Ye Maolin could not hear the words, but saw Pincai nod emphatically. \\"I know my own mind,\\" Pincai muttered. \\"Once he is inside, will he not have to bend?\\" After exchanging a few more words, they parted ways."},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":5,"tokens":["叶茂林","茂林"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"到了琴言门口，叶茂林先下来，同了聘才进内。恰好长庆在家，请进坐了。长庆打量了聘才一回，又因是叶茂林同来，便当是不要紧人，淡淡招呼了几句。茂林道：「这位魏师老爷，是华公府的师老爷，与公子是最相好的，闻你的大名，特来相访。还有一句话要商量。」长庆听了，登时满面添花的趋奉起来","en":"Arriving at Qinyan's door, Maolin alighted first and entered alongside Pincai. Fortunately, Changqing was home and invited them to sit. Changqing looked Pincai over, and because he had come in Ye Maolin's company took him for a person of no consequence, greeting him coolly. Maolin interjected,"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":5,"tokens":["叶茂林","茂林"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"靠他一辈子过活。其余几个小孩子，都是不中用的，倒赔钱做衣服。一月内陪了三五天酒，还要生出事来。」聘才正要回言，叶茂林笑迷迷，拈着胡子讲道：「老庆，事情是好商量的。华公子行事，难道你不知道？人家要巴结进去也难，他来找你，就是你的造化，如中了意，不要说你一辈子，就两辈子也不难。将来你也可进府，巴结个执事，赏个十几品的官衔，好不体面，不强如吃这戏饭么？」聘才道：「喳！叶","en":"costumes, attend a few wine banquets a month, and constantly cause trouble...\\" Pincai was about to reply when Ye Maolin stroked his beard and smiled. \\"Old Qing, everything is negotiable. You know Young Master Hua's ways. Others crawl to enter his doors, yet he seeks you out. This is your great fortune! If he catches the Master's fancy, it secures not just one lifetime,"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":5,"tokens":["叶茂林","茂林"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"叶茂林目视长庆，长庆见他生气，便赔着笑道：「师老爷不要动气，请坐，再商量。」聘才道：「商量什么？我也没有这么大工夫讲这些空头话。叶先生你坐坐罢，我要走了。」说罢一径出来，叶茂林跟在后头，拉住了聘才，聘才低低的说道：「我在六合馆等你。」故意洒脱手，头也不回，","en":"Ye Maolin eyed Changqing, who, seeing the rage, smiled placatingly. \\"Secretary, please calm down. Sit, let us discuss this.\\" \\"Discuss what?\\" Pincai retorted. \\"I have no patience for hollow talk. Maolin, you may sit, but I am leaving.\\" He marched out, and Maolin"}],"27":[{"paragraph":12,"mentions":2,"tokens":["叶茂林","茂林"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这边琴言正在悲悲楚楚的时候，前日长庆见聘才生气走了，虽托叶茂林为他婉言，总不见茂林回信，心上有些狐疑。又想起五月间，有两个人闹来，送了四吊钱，赔了多少礼方去，听得传说是华公府的车夫。昨日听得聘才口风利害，似乎必要来的，便十分担着担子，进来与琴言商量。琴言自那日从怡园回后，直到今日总是啼哭，自己也不晓得为着什么，","en":"Meanwhile, Qinyan was miserable. Changqing, seeing Pincai storm off, had begged Ye Maolin to mediate, but with no word returned, he grew uneasy. He remembered the two men raising a row in the fifth month, requiring a four-string payoff and apologies, rumored to be Hua mansion carters. With yesterday's threatening tone from Pincai, it seemed"}],"28":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["叶茂林"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说长庆被打之后甚是着急，只得仍去央求叶茂林，同到华公府聘才书房负荆请罪，情愿先送进来，分文不要。聘才见他小心赔礼，且说一钱不要，便甚得意，只道他一怒之后，使他愧悔送上门来，应了前日所说的话，便找了珊枝，请公子出来说了，华公子道：「为何不要身价呢？」聘才说：「他的意思恐怕孩子不懂规矩，二来如有","en":"Word came that after his beating, Changqing was beside himself. He had no choice but to beseech Ye Maolin once more, and together they made their way to Secretary Wei's study in the Young Master Hua mansion. There they offered thorns on their bare backs to beg pardon, pledging to hand the boy over immediately without taking a single string of cash. Seeing"}],"30":[{"paragraph":29,"mentions":1,"tokens":["叶茂林"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"书，现在本籍安享。自荣在京八年未归，糟蹋了多少钱财。家中现有妻室，谎言断弦，娶了乌大傻之妹。又不甚合意，又娶了叶茂林之女为副室，另居城南。叶女在家时，即不安本分，喜交游，而自荣宠嬖特甚。奁资颇厚，被自荣乱为花费，不到两年化为乌有。","en":"already had a wife at home, but lied that he was a widower and married Wu Dasha's sister. Still unsatisfied, he took Ye Maolin's daughter as a concubine and lived separately in the southern part of the city. When the Ye girl was at home, she was not one to abide by the rules and loved to socialize, but Zirong doted on her obsessively. Her dowry was quite substantial, but Zirong"}],"32":[{"paragraph":8,"mentions":1,"tokens":["叶茂林"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"呸！」那人便拿出《题名录》来，众人细细看了，果无高品在内。蕙芳笑道：「中的人我也不认得，我就晓得这两个，一个是叶茂林的女婿叫作窑子归，这三十四名归自荣就是。一个是潘三的女婿叫作杠花，他老子叫花三胡子，在杠房抬杠出身，如今大发财，开了几处杠房，这六十三名花中桂就是。」高品再把第一张《题名录》看了一遍，略生喜色，不觉叹口气道：「也罢，名利二字是有一定的。现在你们不比外","en":"was nowhere to be found. Huifang laughed, \\"I don't know the others who passed, but I do know these two: one is Ye Maolin's son-in-law, known as 'Brothel Gui', and this thirty-fourth name, Gui Zirong, is him. The other is Pan the Third's son-in-law, called 'Bier-pole Hua'. His father is Hua the Third, nicknamed 'The Beard', who started out carrying biers in a funeral parlor,"}],"36":[{"paragraph":9,"mentions":1,"tokens":["叶茂林"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"到了接三那日，有些人来，便请了金三、叶茂林来张罗，同班的脚色之外，还有各班的并左右街邻，和馆子掌柜的，挤满了一屋，看烧了纸才散。琴言也乏极了，回房就睡了。","en":"On the third day of mourning rites, many people came. Jin San and Ye Maolin were invited to help manage things. Aside from actors in the same troupe, members of other troupes, neighbors, and restaurant owners crowded the house, only dispersing after the paper offerings were burned. Qinyan, exhausted, returned to his room and"}],"43":[{"paragraph":18,"mentions":2,"tokens":["叶茂林"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"也枨触起来，泪珠欲堕。子云问道：「这话谁去讲呢？须得个老成会说话的。若你们去，恐不中用。」蕙芳道：「此事少不得叶茂林，玉侬是他同来的，又是他教的戏，他也老成，会说话。」琴言连连点头道：「必得他去才妥。」子云道：「既如此，你们早些回去罢。今晚就请叶茂林去，讲妥了，我明日听信，碰玉侬的运气何如。我宅里还有点事；不能陪你们，要过那边去。」子云带了家人先出园去了，回到住宅","en":"be someone mature and persuasive. I fear you yourselves may not carry it off.\\" \\"The one indispensable person is Ye Maolin,\\" said Huifang. \\"He was the one who brought Yunong to the city, and he is the one who taught him to perform. Furthermore, he is steady and knows how to talk.\\" Qinyan nodded several times: \\"Only he will do.\\" \\"In that case, return early,\\" said Ziyun. \\"This"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":2,"tokens":["叶茂林","茂林"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这边四旦个个喜欢，辞了次贤，也同去找了叶茂林，告知此事。茂林一口应承，又对蕙芳道：「停一会儿，你与我同去。我年纪老了，笨嘴笨舌的，恐说不圆转，你在旁帮个腔儿。那位庆奶奶嘴里，好像画眉哨的一般，我有几分怯他。」蕙芳道：「人说他倒是个直性人，顺了他的毛，倒也易的很的。」琴言、宝珠、素兰先回去了。","en":"The four young performers departed in high spirits, took their leave of Cixian, and went together to find Ye Maolin and inform him of the matter. Maolin agreed at once, then said to Huifang: \\"Come with me in a little while. I am old, my tongue is clumsy, and I fear I may not manage the delicate turns of speech. Please be on hand to back me up. That Madam Qing — her"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":1,"tokens":["茂林"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"蕙芳与茂林练了一番话，约定晚饭后同去，蕙芳也便回来。","en":"Huifang and Maolin rehearsed what they would say, agreed to go together after supper, and Huifang then returned home."},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":7,"tokens":["茂林","叶茂林"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"却值田春航来看蕙芳，蕙芳即与他吃了饭，谈了一会，春航去了。茂林已在外面候了多时。定更后了，茂林提了灯笼，照着蕙芳，到了长庆家。也不找琴言，找了伍麻子，请了长庆媳妇出来。蕙芳见他扎了白包头，穿了孝衫，下面倒是条长绿绸裤子，白布弓鞋，黄瘦脸儿，长挑身材，三十来岁年纪，像个嘴尖舌利的人。见了蕙芳却不认识，问茂林道：「","en":"Tian Chunhang came to call on Huifang, and the two of them dined and talked for a while before Chunhang left. Maolin had by then been waiting outside for some time. After the first watch, Maolin took up a lantern, lit the way for Huifang, and the two arrived at the Changqing household. They did not seek out Qinyan but found Wu Mazi and asked for the widow, the wife"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":2,"tokens":["茂林"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"就得了整万吊钱。如今与他出师，这个人就是他的，他倒几个月就捞回本来。啧，啧，啧！有这便宜的事情，我也去干了。」茂林道：「嫂子不是这么说。譬如还唱戏呢，原可以挣得出来。若卖去作儿子，是要攻书、上学、娶亲，只有赔钱，那里能挣钱？况且这个人是善人，成全了他也好。」长庆媳妇道：「我也不管什么，只要他花得起钱，能依我的数，就教他来出师。」蕙芳道：「婶娘，你到底要多少钱，说","en":"this easy a bargain, I would go into the business myself.\\" \\"Sister-in-law, that is not quite how it works,\\" said Maolin. \\"Consider: if he were still performing, yes, he might earn that much. But if he is taken as a son for study, schooling, and a proper marriage, there is nothing but spending and no earning at all. Besides, this gentleman is a kind-hearted man, and helping"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":4,"tokens":["叶茂林","茂林"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"主意已定，口中还说要添，经不得叶茂林这个老头子，倒是一条软麻绳，嫂子长，嫂子短，口甜心苦，把个长庆媳妇，像个躁头骡子似的，倒捆住了，只得应允。蕙芳道：「你倒担承了，不知那边花得起，花不起。若真凑不起来，倒叫婶娘见怪，空费了半天唇舌。」茂林笑道：「你倒胆小，就是他凑不上来，短了一千八百，","en":"Her mind was made up, though her mouth still pressed for more. But old Ye Maolin was like a soft hemp rope, offering sweet words of 'sister-in-law' this, and 'sister-in-law' that. He worked the widow like a headstrong mule until she was bound fast and could only consent. \\"You've agreed to this,\\" said Huifang, \\"but we don't know whether"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":6,"tokens":["茂林"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，将子云请了过来，说明此事。子云也甚喜欢，就传总管的，叫他去开了二千四百两的一张银票，格外又一张五十两的，赏与茂林。蕙芳也不耽搁，急忙回去吃了饭，找了茂林，先将五十两送了他，茂林感激不尽，即同到长庆媳妇家来。蕙芳说：「费了多少力，他才凑了一千九百两，我代他借了五百两，一总开了一张票子在此，请收了。」茂林就代写了一张字据，与琴言收执。长庆媳妇见事成了，才备了几个碟","en":"a bank draft for two thousand four hundred taels, together with a separate draft for fifty taels as a gift for Maolin. Huifang wasted no time. He hurried back, ate quickly, found Maolin, and sent him the fifty taels first. Maolin was deeply grateful. They then went together to the widow's home. \\"With great effort,\\" said Huifang, \\"I managed to gather one thousand nine"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":2,"tokens":["茂林"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"明日，长庆媳妇谢了茂林一百吊钱，茂林倒也不想，已心满意足的了。谁知琴言命中磨蝎颇多，虽出了师，忽又生出气恼来。未知后事如何，且听下回分解。","en":"The following day the widow thanked Maolin with a gift of a hundred strings. Maolin had not been expecting it, and was well satisfied. But Qinyan's natal palace stood under Capricorn, the sign of a life dogged by slander: though he had now been released, a fresh source of trouble was about to"}],"48":[{"paragraph":27,"mentions":1,"tokens":["叶茂林"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"那人就站起身来。作别而去，琴仙还谢了一声。琪官送客转来，请子玉到他书房里坐下。子玉问起方才这人，琴仙道：「他叫叶茂林，是我们教戏的师傅，闻我要出京，今日送了几样东西来。」子玉见琴仙面似梨花，朱唇浅淡，眼睛哭得微肿，说不出那一种可怜可爱的模样，只呆呆的看着他。琴仙这两日千虑万愁，也不知从何处说起，倒一句话也没有，就只一汪眼泪，在眼皮里含着，只要题起心事，便一滴就下。","en":"Qiguan returned and invited Ziyu into his study. When Ziyu asked about the man, Qinxian explained that his name was Ye Maolin, their acting instructor, who had brought a few gifts upon hearing of his departure. Ziyu gazed at Qinxian, whose face was as pale as pear blossoms and whose lips were faintly colored, his eyes slightly swollen from crying. He possessed a pitiful and"}]}`),"char-122":{3:[{paragraph:6,mentions:4,tokens:["金二"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"才知道他是顺口的话，便道：「我还没有来奉拜，倒先劳你的驾过来。」又问：「那位贵姓？」叶茂林道：「这是我们大掌班金二爷，来请梅大人定戏的。」聘才待再问时，只见许顺从上头下来说道：「大人吩咐，既是正月初五以前都有人定下，初六七也使得，就是不许分包。」那金二道：「不分包这句话，却不敢答应。正月里的戏，不要说我们联锦班，就是差不多的班子，那一天不分三包两包。许二爷劳你驾",en:'me first." He then gestured to the stranger, "And your honorable companion?" Ye Maolin introduced him: "This is Master Jin the Second, the head manager of our troupe. He has come to invite Lord Mei to arrange a performance." Before Pincai could inquire further, Xu Shun descended the stairs, announcing: "The Master has decreed that since the first five days of the New Year are already'},{paragraph:7,mentions:1,tokens:["金二"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"寓处，说在杨柳巷联锦班总寓内。聘才道：「改日过来奉看。」茂林道：「这如何敢当，只好顺便去逛逛。」说着许顺已同了金二回来，已经说妥，定于正月初六日在姑苏会馆，不论分包不分包，只要点谁的戏，不短脚色就是了。许顺上去回明，付了定银各散。是晚子玉课期，未得与聘才闲谈。",en:'"I would not dare presume," Maolin replied, "only drop by if you are passing through." Presently, Xu Shun and Master Jin returned, having struck an agreement: the performance was set for the sixth day of the first month at the Suzhou Guild Hall. Whether the contract was split mattered little, so long as the requested actors performed without omission. Xu Shun ascended'}]},"char-123":{3:[{paragraph:31,mentions:1,tokens:["老三"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"掌柜的又将那三个相公也找了进来，吩咐伙计们照样办菜，拿上好的碗盏，与大老爷消气和事。掌柜的又说那走堂的道：「老三，你不会伺候。这砸碗的声音，是最好听的。你应该拿顶细料的磁碗出来，那就砸得又清又脆，也叫大老爷乐一乐。这半粗半细的磁器，砸起来声音也带些笨浊。你瞧大老爷当赏你五十吊，也只赏你四十吊了。」说得众伙计哈哈大笑，一面去扫地抹桌子。这一地的莱，已经有四条大狗",en:`demanding the finest porcelain to pacify the Great Lord's residual ire. The proprietor then said to the head waiter, "Old Three, you are an absolute fool! The shattering of fine porcelain is the sweetest music there is. You should have served him on our thinnest, most exquisite bowls—they shatter with a crisp, crystalline ring that would have delighted the Great Lord immensely.`}]},"char-124":{3:[{paragraph:29,mentions:1,tokens:["掌柜的"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"两个死命的解劝，口中不住的大老爷、干爹、干爸爸的求他不要生气。那个砸碗的相公也跑到院子里，鸣呜咽咽的哭起来了。掌柜的、走堂的一齐进来劝解，都不敢说一句话。尽陪着笑脸，大老爷长，大老爷短。",en:'who had dared smash the bowls dashed into the courtyard, collapsing into violent, racking sobs. The restaurant proprietor and a fleet of waiters rushed in, paralyzed by fear, offering terrified, obsequious smiles and murmuring a litany of "Great Lord" over and over.'},{paragraph:30,mentions:2,tokens:["掌柜的"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"那掌柜的又去安慰那相公，嘻嘻的笑说道：「春兰做什么与大老爷这么呕气，你瞧崭新的玄狐腿子溅了油了，快拿烧酒来擦。」就有伙计们拿了烧酒，掌柜的替他抹干净了。一面把那位奚老爷请了出来，另到一间屋子坐了，拉了那相公上前，劝他赔个不是。那相公只管哭，不肯赔礼，那姓奚的",en:'The proprietor went to console the actor and said with a giggling laugh, "Chunlan, why must you war with the Great Lord? Look at this magnificent new black fox-leg coat—it is splattered with grease! Quickly, fetch some spirits to clean it." Servants rushed forward'},{paragraph:31,mentions:1,tokens:["掌柜的"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"掌柜的又将那三个相公也找了进来，吩咐伙计们照样办菜，拿上好的碗盏，与大老爷消气和事。掌柜的又说那走堂的道：「老三，你不会伺候。这砸碗的声音，是最好听的。你应该拿顶细料的磁碗出来，那就砸得又清又脆，也叫大老爷乐一乐。这半粗半细的磁器，砸起来声音也带些笨浊。你瞧大老爷当赏你五十吊，也只赏你四十吊了。」说得众伙计哈哈大笑，一面去扫地抹桌子。这一",en:`The proprietor corralled the remaining three actors into the new room, dispatching his staff to recreate the feast exactly as before, demanding the finest porcelain to pacify the Great Lord's residual ire. The proprietor then said to the head waiter, "Old Three, you`},{paragraph:33,mentions:1,tokens:["掌柜的"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"你道这掌柜的，为什么巴结这个姓奚的。他知道这个姓奚的，是广东大富翁，又是阔少爷，现带了十几万银子进京，要捐个大官。已到了一月有余。",en:"Why, one might ask, did the proprietor debase himself so utterly for this Lord Xi? He knew the man was a colossal Cantonese plutocrat—a young heir of unimaginable wealth who had descended upon the capital bearing over a hundred thousand taels of silver, fully intending to purchase a prestigious"}]},"char-125":{1:[{paragraph:4,mentions:1,tokens:["鼎"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"一极钟情之子。这人姓梅，名士燮，号铁庵．江南金陵人氏；是个阀阅世家，现任翰林院侍读学士，寓居城南鸣珂里。其祖名鼎，曾任吏部尚书；其父名羹调，曾任文华殿大学士，三代单传。士燮于十七岁中了进士，入了翰林，迄今已二十九年，行年四十六岁了。家世本是金、张，经术复师马、郑。贵胃偏崇儒素，词臣竟屏纷华。蔼蔼乎心似春和，凛凛乎却貌如秋肃。人比他为司马君实、赵清献一流人物。夫",en:"Reader-in-Waiting at the Hanlin Academy, residing in Mingke Lane in the southern sector of the city. His grandfather, Ding, once served as Minister of Personnel, while his father, Gengdiao, was a Grand Secretary of the Wenhua Hall; for three generations, the family line has passed to a single heir. Shixie attained his jinshi degree at the age of seventeen and entered the"}]},"char-126":{1:[{paragraph:4,mentions:1,tokens:["羹调"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"名士燮，号铁庵．江南金陵人氏；是个阀阅世家，现任翰林院侍读学士，寓居城南鸣珂里。其祖名鼎，曾任吏部尚书；其父名羹调，曾任文华殿大学士，三代单传。士燮于十七岁中了进士，入了翰林，迄今已二十九年，行年四十六岁了。家世本是金、张，经术复师马、郑。贵胃偏崇儒素，词臣竟屏纷华。蔼蔼乎心似春和，凛凛乎却貌如秋肃。人比他为司马君实、赵清献一流人物。夫人颜氏，也是金陵大家，为左",en:"the southern sector of the city. His grandfather, Ding, once served as Minister of Personnel, while his father, Gengdiao, was a Grand Secretary of the Wenhua Hall; for three generations, the family line has passed to a single heir. Shixie attained his jinshi degree at the age of seventeen and entered the Hanlin Academy; twenty-nine years have elapsed since then, making"}]},"char-127":{1:[{paragraph:4,mentions:1,tokens:["颜庄"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"，凛凛乎却貌如秋肃。人比他为司马君实、赵清献一流人物。夫人颜氏，也是金陵大家，为左都御史颜尧臣之女，翰林院编修颜庄之妹，父兄皆已物故。这颜夫人今年四十四岁，真是德容兼备，贤淑无双，与梅学士唱随已二十余年。二十九岁上梦神人授玉，遂生了一个玉郎，取名子玉，号庾香。这梅子玉今年已十七岁了，生得貌如良玉，质比精金，宝贵如明珠在胎，光彩如华月升岫。而且天授神奇，胸罗斗宿，",en:"prominent Jinling family; she is the daughter of Yan Yaochen, Left Censor-in-Chief, and the younger sister of Yan Zhuang, a Hanlin Compiler, though both her father and brother have since passed away. Lady Yan, now forty-four, embodies a rare union of virtue and beauty, peerless in her gracious wisdom. She and Academician Mei have lived in harmonious partnership for over"},{paragraph:5,mentions:1,tokens:["颜庄"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"一日，先生有事放学，子玉正在独坐，却有两个好友来看他。一个姓颜名仲清，号剑潭，现年二十三岁，即系已故编修颜庄之子，为颜夫人之侄。",en:"named Zhongqing, and styled Jiantan; currently twenty-three years of age, he was the son of the late Compiler Yan Zhuang, making him Lady Yan's nephew."},{paragraph:6,mentions:1,tokens:["颜庄"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"这颜庄在日，与士燮既系郎舅至亲，又有雷陈至契。不料于三十岁即赴召玉楼，他夫人郑氏绝食殉节。那时仲清年甫三龄，士燮抚养在家，又与郑氏夫人请旌表烈。仲清在士燮处，到十九岁上中了个副车。是年士燮与其作伐，赘于同乡同年现任通政司王文辉家为婿。这王文辉是颜夫人的表兄",en:"When Yan Zhuang was alive, he shared not only the intimate bond of a brother-in-law with Shixie but also a profound friendship akin to that of Lei and Chen. Tragically, he was summoned to the Jade Pavilion at the mere age of thirty, and his wife, Lady Zheng, starved"}],49:[{paragraph:13,mentions:2,tokens:["颜庄","颜穆堂"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"英才未发的人。翰林院侍读学士梅公之子名子玉，目下少年中有景星凤凰之誉。」苏侯点点头。子云又道：「已故翰林院编修颜庄之子名仲清，现任礼部尚书刘大人之子名文泽，内阁学士王大人之子名恂。此外，还有苏州拔贡生高品，湖南优贡生萧次贤。这几位都是名下无虚，与田修撰、史庶常朝夕观摩，是门生往来无间的。其余不知其他，不敢滥举。」苏侯听了，掀髯大笑：「怎么你举的人，多半是我的年侄",en:'a resplendent star and a phoenix." Su the Marquis nodded. Ziyun went on, "The son of the late Hanlin Compiler Yan Zhuang, named Zhongqing; the son of the current Minister of Rites Lord Liu, named Wenze; and the son of Academician of the Grand Secretariat Lord Wang, named Xun. In addition, there is the Suzhou specially recommended graduate Gao Pin, and the Hunan honored'}]},"char-128":{1:[{paragraph:4,mentions:1,tokens:["颜尧臣"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"屏纷华。蔼蔼乎心似春和，凛凛乎却貌如秋肃。人比他为司马君实、赵清献一流人物。夫人颜氏，也是金陵大家，为左都御史颜尧臣之女，翰林院编修颜庄之妹，父兄皆已物故。这颜夫人今年四十四岁，真是德容兼备，贤淑无双，与梅学士唱随已二十余年。二十九岁上梦神人授玉，遂生了一个玉郎，取名子玉，号庾香。这梅子玉今年已十七岁了，生得貌如良玉，质比精金，宝贵如明珠在胎，光彩如华月升岫。而且",en:"Sima Guang and Zhao Bian. His wife, Lady Yan, also hails from a prominent Jinling family; she is the daughter of Yan Yaochen, Left Censor-in-Chief, and the younger sister of Yan Zhuang, a Hanlin Compiler, though both her father and brother have since passed away. Lady Yan, now forty-four, embodies a rare union of virtue and beauty, peerless in her gracious wisdom. She and"}]},"char-129":{3:[{paragraph:27,mentions:1,tokens:["富安世"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"三不解所问，倒是贵太爷明白，即对富三说道：「他问大叔官名是叫什么？」富三道：「你问我们老爷的名字么，我们老爷叫富安世。」聘才即站起身来道：「怪不得了，三爷是个大贤人之后。你们老大人，在我们南京地方已成了神。三年前，地方上百姓，共捐了几千银子，造了一个名宦祠，供了老大人的牌位。还有一位是江宁府某大老爷。这老大人生前爱民是不用说了，到归天之后，还恋着南京百姓，遇着瘟疫",en:`is asking for your father's official name," Gui clarified. Fu smiled, "You ask after my father? He was known as Fu Anshi." Pincai immediately rose from his seat, his expression filled with awe. "No wonder! Third Master is the descendant of a true sage. Your venerable father is revered as a living god in our Nanjing. Three years ago, the local populace gathered thousands`}]},"char-130":{5:[{paragraph:9,mentions:2,tokens:["杜琴师"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"这个琴官姓杜，父亲叫做杜琴师，以制琴弹琴为业，江苏缙绅子弟争相延请教琴，因此都称他为杜琴师。生了这个儿子就以琴字为名，叫为琴官。",en:"Qinguan's surname was Du. His father was known as Du Qinshi, Master Du the Qin-player, who made his living by crafting and performing on the qin zither. The sons of gentry throughout Jiangsu vied to invite him to give lessons, and so everyone called him Du Qinshi. When this son was born, he was named after the"},{paragraph:10,mentions:1,tokens:["杜琴师"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"琴官手掌有文，幼而即慧，父母爱如珍宝。到了十岁上，杜琴师忽为豪贵殴辱，气忿碎琴而卒。其母一年之后，亦悲痛成病而死。遗下这个琴官无依无靠，赖其族叔收养。十三岁上叔叔又死，其婶不能守节，即行改嫁，遂以琴官卖入梨园。适叶茂林见了，又从戏班中买出，同了进京。这琴官六岁上，即认字读书，聪慧异常，过目成诵。到十三岁，",en:"from earliest childhood; his parents loved him as their most precious treasure. When he reached ten years of age, Du Qinshi was suddenly humiliated and beaten by a powerful lord, smashed his qin in rage and grief, and died. His mother, a year later, also fell ill with sorrow and died. Left without support, the orphaned Qinguan was taken in by a clan uncle. When he was thirteen,"}]},"char-131":{5:[{paragraph:10,mentions:1,tokens:["其母"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"琴官手掌有文，幼而即慧，父母爱如珍宝。到了十岁上，杜琴师忽为豪贵殴辱，气忿碎琴而卒。其母一年之后，亦悲痛成病而死。遗下这个琴官无依无靠，赖其族叔收养。十三岁上叔叔又死，其婶不能守节，即行改嫁，遂以琴官卖入梨园。适叶茂林见了，又从戏班中买出，同了进京。这琴官六岁上，即认字读书，聪慧异常，过目成诵。到十三岁，也读了好些书，以及诗词杂览、小说",en:"Du Qinshi was suddenly humiliated and beaten by a powerful lord, smashed his qin in rage and grief, and died. His mother, a year later, also fell ill with sorrow and died. Left without support, the orphaned Qinguan was taken in by a clan uncle. When he was thirteen, this uncle too died. His widowed aunt could not maintain her chastity and remarried, so she sold Qinguan"}]},"char-132":{5:[{paragraph:10,mentions:1,tokens:["族叔"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"如珍宝。到了十岁上，杜琴师忽为豪贵殴辱，气忿碎琴而卒。其母一年之后，亦悲痛成病而死。遗下这个琴官无依无靠，赖其族叔收养。十三岁上叔叔又死，其婶不能守节，即行改嫁，遂以琴官卖入梨园。适叶茂林见了，又从戏班中买出，同了进京。这琴官六岁上，即认字读书，聪慧异常，过目成诵。到十三岁，也读了好些书，以及诗词杂览、小说稗官，都能了了。心既好高，性复爱洁，有山鸡舞镜、丹风栖梧",en:"a year later, also fell ill with sorrow and died. Left without support, the orphaned Qinguan was taken in by a clan uncle. When he was thirteen, this uncle too died. His widowed aunt could not maintain her chastity and remarried, so she sold Qinguan into a theater troupe. Just then Ye Maolin happened to see him and bought him out of the troupe, taking him along to the capital."}]},"char-133":{2:[{paragraph:2,mentions:2,tokens:["魏老仁","老仁"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"士燮道：「这称呼是小门生，不知那里来的？这魏聘才又是谁呢？」王文辉道：「世愚侄，不要是魏老仁的儿子么？」士燮道：「只怕是的，今年夏间接着老仁的信，说要打发他儿子进京弄一小功名，托我收留照应的话。若论老魏人品，实在下作，惟在你我面上，还算有点真情。」文辉道：「若论老魏，原是个上等聪明人，要发科甲也很可发的，就是阴骘损多了，成了个泼皮秀才。",en:`this Wei Pincai be?" Wang Wenhui suggested, "'Your humble nephew of the next generation', could it be the son of Wei Laoren?" Shixie nodded, "I suspect you are right. This past summer, I received a letter from Laoren mentioning his intent to send his son to the capital to secure a modest degree, entrusting him to my care. In truth, old Wei's character is utterly despicable,`}]},"char-134":JSON.parse(`{"38":[{"paragraph":6,"mentions":1,"tokens":["刘喜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"有几个下人，也是外面荐来的。只有一个长随叫刘喜，跟了有五六年，颇有良心，其余是些不关痛痒的。屈公虽则一肩行李，生平所藏金石玩器、名书古画，倒有好几箱。到京来，刘尚书念旧，见其宦囊萧索，赠了他二百金。","en":"He had a few servants, all of them engaged through outside recommendations. Only one, his personal attendant Liu Xi, had been with him for five or six years and was a man of some conscience; the rest were of no particular consequence. Though Master Qu travelled light in the way of baggage, a lifetime of collecting had filled several trunks with bronze and stone antiques,"}],"48":[{"paragraph":38,"mentions":1,"tokens":["刘喜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"窍一般，直瞪瞪两眼，一句话说不出，泪落如雨。子云、次贤慌了，救醒了琴仙，便说道：「快扶他上车罢。」道翁交代家人刘喜好好服侍。子云谓道翁道：「令郎与他们几年在一处，一刻要分手，自然是难忍的。道翁先生，我们倒不敢久留了，一路福星，请升舆罢。」道翁见琴仙如此，心内甚慌，与诸人作了一个揖，又握着子云、次贤的手道：「从此别后，只好魂梦相随。感激之私，令人口不能说。惟祝诸公","en":"When Qinxian had been brought round, they said, \\"Get him into the carriage, quickly.\\" Daoweng charged his servant Liu Xi to wait on him carefully.\\n\\nZiyun said to Daoweng, \\"Your son has been among them these several years, and to be parted in a moment is more than they can well bear. Master Qu, we dare not keep you longer. A lucky star go with you on the road — pray take"}],"55":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":2,"tokens":["刘喜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"住了。写了江船，做了旗子，制了衔牌，耽搁了三日。道翁于漕河两院都是相好，一概不惊动了，没有往拜。道翁有个长随叫刘喜，为人老实忠厚，四十多岁，跟随了五六年，跟过江宁侯石翁太史，善于烹调，如今叫他伺侯琴仙。这刘喜正是个老婆子一样，饥则问食，寒则问衣，琴仙甚得其力。开船之后，三天到了扬州。道翁怕那些商人缠扰，要来求诗求画，请吃酒，请听曲，便不上岸。","en":"river-conservancy offices, he chose not to disturb them and paid no visits. Daoweng had a longtime attendant named Liu Xi, an honest and loyal man in his forties who had served him for half a decade. Having previously worked under the eminent Hou Shiweng in Jiangning, Liu Xi was remarkably skilled at cooking, and Daoweng now assigned him to look after Qinxian. This Liu"},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":1,"tokens":["刘喜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"是日一早想着平山堂，要带琴仙去逛逛，便在船上吃早饭，叫刘喜去雇了一个小船，从小南门沿河绕西门而去。此日幸喜凉爽，天阴阴的没有太阳。琴仙看那一湾绿水，萍叶参差，两岸习习清风，吹得罗衫滉漾，甚是有趣。行了数里，见一个花园，围墙半倒，楼屋全欹，古木鸦啼，繁阴蝉噪，正是：","en":"and decided to take Qinxian there for a leisurely stroll. After taking their breakfast aboard the ship, he had Liu Xi hire a small skiff, which carried them from the Little South Gate along the winding river toward the west. Fortunately, the day was refreshingly cool, the sky veiled by clouds without a glaring sun. Qinxian gazed upon the winding stretch of jade-green"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":2,"tokens":["刘喜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"那和尚尚要挽留，道翁决意要走。琴仙见那开园门的几个人，问他刘喜要钱，刘喜给了一百大钱，尚还嫌少。和尚喝退了，直送出山门。道翁与琴仙下了船，仍坐船而回。只见往来游船甚多，一去一来，也有大半天。回来船已过关，等道翁、琴仙上了大船，即打了三回锣，抽了跳，开起船，趁着微风，到了瓜州，又要过关。这瓜州地方没有什么逛处，道","en":"to urge them to stay, but Daoweng was resolved to leave. At the garden gate, Qinxian saw the gatekeepers asking Liu Xi for money. Liu Xi gave them one hundred large cash, but they still complained it was too little. The monk shouted them down and escorted the guests straight out of the mountain gate. Daoweng and Qinxian boarded their skiff and rowed back. There were"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":1,"tokens":["刘喜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"道翁忆着侯石翁，要在此与他盘桓几日。一早带了琴仙并刘喜，雇了个凉篷子，由护城河摇到了旱西门，进城雇了肩舆，到凤凰山来访侯石翁。这个侯石翁，是个陆地神仙，今年已七十四岁。二十岁点了翰林，到如今已成了二十三科的老前辈，朝内已没有他的同年。此人从三十余岁就致仕而归，遨游天下三十余年。在凤凰山造了个花园，极为精","en":"Hou Shiweng and decided to linger here for a few days to visit him. Early the next morning, taking Qinxian and Liu Xi along, he hired a shaded skiff. They rowed from the city moat to the Hanxi Gate, entered the city, hired sedan chairs, and proceeded to Phoenix Mountain to call upon Hou Shiweng. This Hou Shiweng was a veritable immortal of the mortal realm, now seventy-four"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":2,"tokens":["刘喜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"道翁与琴仙到了园，叫刘喜先将名帖送进。琴仙见这个园四面尽编槿竹为篱，种些杂树。望着里头，疏疏落落，有几处亭台院宇，甚是清旷，却无围墙。不一会，刘喜同了一人出来，说请就将肩舆抬进。琴仙在轿窗里看时，高高下下，弯弯曲曲，有长松夹道，有修竹成林，有飞瀑如帘，有清泉作带，有三两处楼","en":"Upon arriving at the garden, Daoweng had Liu Xi send in his calling card first. Qinxian noticed that the garden was enclosed entirely by fences of woven hibiscus and bamboo, interspersed with various trees. Looking inside, he saw scattered pavilions and courtyards, exuding a clear and open atmosphere,"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":2,"tokens":["刘喜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"刘喜送早饭进来，琴仙也不肯吃。刘喜见他烦闷，便撺掇他去游玩，说道：「大爷坐在船上也闷得慌，不如进城逛逛。最好逛的是莫愁湖、秦淮河、报恩寺、雨花台、鸡鸣埭、玄武湖、燕子矶。小的同大爷进城散散闷，老爷总要晚上才回。」","en":"When Liu Xi brought breakfast in, Qinxian refused to eat. Seeing him so depressed, Liu Xi urged him to go sightseeing, saying, \\"Sitting on the boat is stifling for you, Young Master. It would be better to go into the city for a stroll. The best places to visit are"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":5,"tokens":["刘喜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴仙道：「我不高兴。怪热的天气，也不能走路。」刘喜道：「若别处还要走几步，若到莫愁湖、秦淮河、燕子矶，一直水路，坐了船去，不用走的。燕子矶我们前日走风，没有靠船，可惜明日就过了，开船再逛罢。今日去逛逛秦淮河，两边珠围翠绕，好不有趣呢。」琴仙道：「莫愁湖此去多远？」刘喜道：「也不多路，就在水西门一带。","en":"Qinxian replied, \\"I have no spirit for it. The weather is frightfully hot, and I cannot bear to walk.\\" Liu Xi said, \\"For other places you might have to walk a bit, but for Mochou Lake, the Qinhuai River, and Swallow Bluff, it is entirely by water. We can go by boat without walking at all. We missed docking at Swallow Bluff the day before yesterday due to the"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":3,"tokens":["刘喜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴仙见是昨日所过的那条河，也有十余里，才到了莫愁湖。刘喜道：「我们且先逛逛，再去寻坟。」便引琴仙进了观音庵。到了里面，见两进重门，四面皆通，铺设精雅，满壁图书，尽是名人题咏，内中见有侯石翁的诗文，又见有江西学使梅士燮一副对子。琴仙见往来游玩的，也有士人，也有商贾，也有乡农，也有妇女们，摆着几张茶桌子，栏外","en":"saw they were traveling along the same river as yesterday, and after about ten li, they arrived at Mochou Lake. Liu Xi suggested, \\"Let's tour around first, then go looking for the grave.\\" He led Qinxian into the Guanyin Convent. Inside, they passed through two sets of heavy doors. The layout was open on all sides, elegantly furnished, with walls entirely covered in books,"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":5,"tokens":["刘喜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"只见摇船的提了酒盒上前，刘喜问道：「这个坟地在什么地方呢？」琴仙道：「我如何知道，要去找呢！」刘喜道：「是那一家的？问了姓名方可去找。」琴仙一想，乩上并未判出姓名，便呆呆的想了一会，便说道：「我也不晓得姓什么。」刘喜笑道：「怎么亲戚的姓都忘了？那只好罢了，从何处找起？」琴仙道：","en":"Seeing the boatman come forward carrying the wine box, Liu Xi asked, \\"Where exactly is this grave located?\\" Qinxian replied, \\"How should I know? We have to look for it!\\" Liu Xi asked, \\"Which family does it belong to? We need a surname to even begin searching.\\" Qinxian thought for a moment, realizing the planchette"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":2,"tokens":["刘喜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"。琴仙心中甚异。只见那女郎双目澄澄的望着琴仙，琴仙也望着他。不一刻拢到岸来，那一群翠雀便刷的一声都飞向北去了，刘喜还拍一拍手赶他。刘喜问那女郎道：「湖那边有什么顽的地方没有？」女郎道：「那边是城墙，只有个杜仙女墓，看兰苕花、翡翠雀最好顽的。方才那一群翠雀就是杜仙女墓上的，他懒得飞，搭我的船过来。」","en":"the boat reached the shore, and with a collective rustle, the flock of kingfishers took flight toward the north; Liu Xi even clapped his hands to shoo them along. Liu Xi asked the girl, \\"Are there any fun places across the lake?\\" She replied, \\"Over there is just the city wall and the tomb of Du the Fairy—it's the best place to see orchids and kingfishers. That flock of"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":1,"tokens":["刘喜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"。到初一、月半，还有人过湖烧香呢。」琴仙道：「我也过湖看看，你肯渡我过去么？」女郎道：「你就下船来。」琴仙即叫刘喜拿了酒盒并香，叫船家先回船去。","en":"look. Are you willing to ferry me over?\\" The girl replied, \\"Just step onto the boat.\\" Qinxian immediately had Liu Xi bring the wine box and incense, and told their hired boatman to return and wait at the main ship."},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":1,"tokens":["刘喜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"下了船，那女郎荡动了桨，刘喜也拿了一枝桨帮着他荡。","en":"Once they boarded, the girl began to row with her oar, and Liu Xi took another oar to help her."},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":1,"tokens":["刘喜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"心，及走到了这个地方，翻觉尘心涤尽，栩栩欲仙。若能结庐在此，便比什么所在都好。扪苔剔藓的将那坟垄看了许久，便叫刘喜从火镰内取了火，点了香，浇了酒，将那带来几样果子也摆在坟前。","en":"anywhere else. He gazed at the grave mound for a long time, gently brushing away the moss and lichen. He then had Liu Xi strike a fire with his flint, light the incense, pour the wine, and arrange the various fruits they had brought before the tomb."},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":3,"tokens":["刘喜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"那女郎道：「我来帮你。」于是将荷花剥下一瓣，放在坟前，满满斟了一花瓣酒，将那些果子放在荷叶里，叫刘喜将那盒子拿开，问琴仙道：「你为什么不拜两拜？」琴仙道：「我即是他，他即是我。」那女郎笑道：「这是怎么讲，好呆话。既有了你，就没有他；\\n既还有他，就没有你。」琴仙听这话有些灵机，便看着女郎，女郎也看着琴仙。琴仙道：「你不知道我，只知道他。」女郎道：「我","en":"placed it before the grave, filled it to the brim with wine, and arranged the fruits on her lotus leaf. She told Liu Xi to take the box away, then asked Qinxian, \\"Why aren't you bowing?\\" Qinxian replied, \\"I am her, and she is me.\\" The girl laughed, \\"What do you mean by that? Such silly talk. If there is you, there is no her; if she still exists, there is no you.\\" Hearing"},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":4,"tokens":["刘喜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"天色尚早，刘喜又要去逛秦淮河，把船荡进了水西关。到了秦淮河，果见两边画楼绣幕，香气氤氲。只见那楼上有好些妓女，或一人凭阑的，或两三人倚肩的，或轻摇歌扇，露出那纤纤玉手的，或哝哝唧唧的轻启朱唇讲话的。有妍有妙，不是一样。那些妓女见了琴仙这个美貌，便唤姐姐、呼妹妹的，","en":"As it was still early, Liu Xi wanted to visit the Qinhuai River, so he had the boat rowed into the Water-West Pass. Arriving at the Qinhuai River, they indeed saw painted mansions and embroidered curtains lining both banks, the air thick with fragrant perfumes. On the balconies stood"}],"56":[{"paragraph":3,"mentions":2,"tokens":["刘喜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"靠在靠枕上，一面念给琴仙，大同小异写了十几封，又写了好些诗，足足写了大半天。傍晚风小了些，道翁知他写乏了，便叫刘喜同他上岸去散散。刘喜同了琴仙，到燕子矶上逛了一逛，又到宏济寺看了悬崖撒手处，再到了铁索缆孤舟，名胜不一而足，直到天黑而回。琴仙想和子玉的词，便卧在床想了半夜才妥。明日依然大风，不能开船，即写了这首词，又写了一封信。此外又写了两封，一与众名士，一与众弟","en":"Toward evening, the wind eased slightly. Knowing Qinxian was exhausted from his labors with the brush, Daoweng told Liu Xi to take the boy ashore for a leisurely walk. Liu Xi led Qinxian on a stroll around Swallow Bluff, then onward to Hongji Temple to gaze at the famed \\"Cliff-Edge Letting Go.\\" They continued to the \\"Iron Chain Mooring the Lone Boat,\\" taking in countless"},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":2,"tokens":["刘喜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"清楚，有时昏愦，若痰涌上来，便迷了心，连话也说不出来。兼之老年人了，大小便也不甚便，这些下人如何肯来服事？就只刘喜一人又兼买办，料理饮食，是以琴仙彻夜无眠，在中舱伺侯。偏遇了日日顶风，江中船来来往往，坏了多少。道翁自想：「此病未必能好，就好了，也是半身不遂之症。虽道路不多，但这个瘫痪人，到省去怎样见得上司？不如在此医好了，再去也不迟。」主意定了，叫人进城去租公馆","en":"himself was an awkward, humiliating ordeal. Why should common servants deign to wait upon such a burden? Only Liu Xi faithfully cooked and saw to their meals, leaving Qinxian to go without sleep night after night, standing vigil in the mid-cabin. On top of this misery came day after day of relentless headwinds; boats traveling up and down the river were wrecked in"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":1,"tokens":["刘喜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴仙唬得打颤，连忙叫人，刘喜偏有事去了，那三个不见个影儿，也不知在那里。琴仙战兢兢的走到房中，不防床前一个大乌黑的东西冲将出来，把琴仙一撞，「哎呀」一声，栽倒在地。","en":"Qinxian shook violently with fright and cried out for help. Liu Xi happened to be away on errands, and the other three servants were nowhere to be seen. Terrified, Qinxian crept slowly back toward his room. Without warning, a large, black mass shot out and slammed hard into his legs. He cried out \\"Aiyo!\\" and fell completely"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":2,"tokens":["刘喜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"好一回，爬起来，灯又灭了。再到外头来点了灯，重到房来，见地下有个小木盖子，将灯一照，床前一个大碗翻在那里。原来刘喜见琴仙天天不能吃饭，今日将莲子薏苡蒸了一只一百天的大肥笋鸭子与琴仙，也只吃了几块。刘喜又怕那几个同伴要偷吃，便将盖子盖了，放在床下。不防那里来了一个大狮毛狗，闻见了香味，倒来打扫一空，还把琴仙撞了一交。","en":"lamplight, he saw a large bowl overturned right before his bed. Seeing Qinxian unable to eat day after agonizing day, Liu Xi had specially steamed him a rich, hundred-day fat duck with lotus seeds and barley. Qinxian had managed only a few meager pieces. Fearing the other greedy men would steal the precious leftovers, Liu Xi had carefully covered the bowl and slid it deep"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":1,"tokens":["刘喜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴仙穿了个半臂，坐了一会，听得后头有响声，便又叫声张贵，不听得答应。琴仙又不敢去看，刘喜是请大夫没有回来，又问了一声：「是谁？」也没有答应。再听得一声很响，像似棺材暴起来，又像鬼叫了几声，琴仙好不害怕。想到佛前去求告，却又心惊肉跳的不敢前去。要不去，心又不安。重到道翁房里看时，见昏昏沉沉的睡着了，便放大了胆，烧了一炉香，就在院子里跪下，","en":"behind him, he called out nervously for Zhang Gui, but received no answer. He dared not go look for the source. Liu Xi was still out fetching the doctor. He asked, \\"Who is there?\\" but met only with dead silence. Suddenly, a loud, cracking noise echoed—sounding like a heavy coffin violently bursting open, followed by the chilling wail of ghosts. He was utterly terrified."},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":1,"tokens":["刘喜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"却好刘喜回来了，进来见了，拿扇子打下来，一脚踏死。琴仙已唬得满身寒毛直竖，眼泪汪汪，且遍体发烧，眼睛冒火。","en":"Just at that moment, Liu Xi returned to the room. Seeing the creature, he swiftly knocked it to the floor with a fan and crushed it underfoot. Qinxian was left paralyzed with fright. Every hair on his body stood on end, tears streamed endlessly down his face, and his entire body"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":5,"tokens":["刘喜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"刘喜与他放了蚊帐，看他床下只有一个空碗，便问道：「那鸭子呢？」琴仙道：「我不在房，一个大黑狗进来吃了。」刘喜骂了一声：「那里来这个害瘟疫的狗？我还不敢放在厨房里，恐伙计们嘴馋，来撕了几块去，倒请了这只狗了。」琴仙道：「你为何去了这半天才回？」刘喜道：「那","en":"Liu Xi quickly hung the mosquito net around the bed to comfort him. Noticing only an empty bowl discarded beneath the frame, he asked in confusion: \\"Where is the duck?\\" Qinxian sniffled and replied: \\"I was out of the room. A massive black dog sneaked in and"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":1,"tokens":["刘喜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴仙又到道翁的房来，只听得刘喜嚷道：「不好了，这些箱子到那里去了？」琴仙听了，慌忙出来，走到后面厢房里看时，就剩了几个书画箱，其余搬运一空。见张贵、汪升、钱德的李行都没有了，此刻还不回来？这门开着，岂没有人进来的，如何是好呢？况且盘费银子也都在箱内。老爷房内一个小扁箱，只有几件单","en":"Qinxian went again toward Daoweng's room and heard Liu Xi shout: \\"Disaster—where are those trunks?\\" Qinxian hurried out. In the rear wing only a few chests of paintings and books remained; everything else was gone. Zhang Gui, Wang Sheng, and Qian De's luggage bundles were nowhere to be seen—still not back?"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":2,"tokens":["刘喜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴仙与刘喜等到天明，绝无影响，方知三人偷了东西走了。琴仙却不是心疼东西，见道翁如此模样，设有不测，则殡殓之费皆无，如何是好？便哭了半日，只剩下一个刘喜，又不能分身寻觅。","en":"Qinxian and Liu Xi waited anxiously until the cold light of dawn, yet there was not a single trace of the missing servants. They finally realized the bitter truth: the three men had stolen their goods and fled into the night. Qinxian did not mourn the goods; seeing Daoweng"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":3,"tokens":["刘喜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"忽听得道翁叫人，琴仙急忙过去，见他歪转过身，当他要解手，问了他，摇摇头，心上要坐起来。琴仙叫刘喜来帮着扶起，把两个大靠枕靠了背。道翁道：「你们去找我那些诗文集来。」琴仙忙去开了箱，一部一部的搬过来。道翁问了书名，又过了目，叫留下一本近作诗稿子，一本书画册，其余都叫烧了。琴仙哭道：「这些诗文着你，一生的心血在内，正可留以传世，为何要烧了呢？」道翁","en":"turned on his side—Qinxian thought he needed the pot; asked; he shook his head; he wanted to sit up. Qinxian called Liu Xi to help raise him and propped his back with two large bolsters. Daoweng said: \\"Fetch my poetry and prose collections.\\" Qinxian opened the chests and carried the volumes over one by one. Daoweng asked the titles, looked them through, and said to keep"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":4,"tokens":["刘喜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"稚子有知，亦作感恩之雀。肝胆素照，神魂可通，不尽之言，伏惟矜察。七月七日屈本立绝笔。\\n琴仙看了。不觉恸倒在地，刘喜也哭了，道翁命刘喜扶起琴仙，琴仙独自倚床而哭，道翁道：「不必哭了，我累了你。殡殓之后，即埋我于江岸，也不必等过百日，你速速进京罢。你将我的文凭送到石翁处，托他在制台前缴了，要他与我做篇传。人虽不足传，但我一生之困苦艰难也就少有的。」琴仙只自掩面哭泣，","en":"with care. Seventh day of the seventh month: Qu Benli's final brush.\\n\\nQinxian read and collapsed to the floor; Liu Xi wept too. Daoweng told Liu Xi to raise Qinxian; Qinxian leaned on the bed and wept. Daoweng said: \\"No more crying—I've burdened you. After the funeral bury me on the riverbank; do not wait the full hundred days—hurry to Beijing. Take my credential certificate"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":6,"tokens":["刘喜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一世牢骚到白头，文章误我不封侯。\\n江山故国空文藻，重过南朝感旧游。\\n题罢，掷笔而逝。琴仙一见，又昏晕倒了，慌得刘喜神魂失措，一面哭，一面拍醒琴仙。琴仙跪在床前，抱了道翁双足，哭得昏而醒，醒而昏，足足哭了半天。刘喜连连解劝道：「大爷，事已如此，人死不能复生，料理后事要紧。这么个热天，也不宜耽搁。」琴仙那里肯听，又哭了好一会，直到泪枯声尽，人也起不来了。刘喜扶了他起","en":"the brush aside and peacefully breathed his last. At the horrifying sight, Qinxian fainted dead away once again. Liu Xi panicked, weeping openly as he gently slapped Qinxian's face to wake him. Qinxian knelt by the bed, desperately clasping Daoweng's cold feet, and wept until he swooned, woke, and swooned again, trapped in his grief for half the day. Liu Xi urged him"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":4,"tokens":["刘喜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴仙道：「这些事我都不知道，尽要仗你费点心的了。」刘喜道：「这个不消吩咐。」于是先将道翁扶下，易箦之后，点了香烛，焚了纸钱，昨日请的李大夫方来，闻得死了，即忙回转。刘喜出去料理，一个人又没有帮手。棺材买不到，只得向和尚买了那一口停放在后楼的，就去了二十二千大钱。其余做孝衣，叫吹鼓手，请僧念经，雇了一个厨","en":"shook his head helplessly: \\"I know absolutely nothing of these practical things. I must rely entirely on you.\\" Liu Xi squeezed his shoulder: \\"There is no need to even say it.\\" They first laid Daoweng's body down reverently; after the bedding was changed, they lit tall candles and began to burn paper money. Doctor Li, whom they had fetched yesterday, had only just arrived;"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":3,"tokens":["刘喜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"那日晚上，酸风动魄，微雨打窗，琴仙反复不寐，百感交并起来。在房里走了几步，脚下又虚飘飘的。听得刘喜鼻息如雷，琴仙走去看时，见枕头推在一边，仰着面，开着口，鼻孔朝天，鼾声大振，一手摸着心坎。又见一个耗子，在他铺上走去，闻他的鼻子。琴仙恐怕咬他，喝了一声，耗子跳了过去，琴仙也转身回铺。听得刘喜鼻子哼哼哼的叫了几声，便骂起来，忽然一抢出来，往外就跑，唬","en":"mind. He stood and walked a few steps across the room; his feet felt as light and insubstantial as air. Hearing Liu Xi's snores rumbling like thunder, he went over to check on him. Liu Xi's pillow was shoved aside; he lay face up, mouth wide open, nostrils pointed toward the ceiling, snoring magnificently with one hand resting heavily on his breast. A bold rat scurried"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":4,"tokens":["刘喜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴仙不解其故，倒唬得呆了。停了一会，不见响动，才大着胆走上前，见刘喜抱着树，又在那里打鼾。琴仙见他尚是睡着，便叫了几声，推了几推，刘喜方醒过来，问道：「做什么？」琴仙道：「你是什么缘故？睡梦中跑出来，抱住了树。」刘喜方揉揉眼，停了一停，道：「原来是梦。我方才见张贵来扯我的被窝，我正要捉他，问他的箱子，一赶出来抱住他，","en":"and stood frozen with fear. After a tense while, hearing no further commotion, he cautiously ventured closer. Liu Xi was still fiercely hugging the tree, snoring away once again. Realizing the man was merely sleepwalking, Qinxian called his name and shook his shoulder until Liu Xi finally woke up and asked: \\"What is it?\\" Qinxian asked: \\"What were you doing, running"},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":1,"tokens":["刘喜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴仙「哎哟」一声，原来是梦。睁眼看时，已是日高三丈，刘喜早已起身了。","en":"had all been a vivid dream. When he finally opened his eyes, the morning sun already stood high in the sky, and Liu Xi had been up for quite some time."},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":7,"tokens":["刘喜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴仙起来，刘喜伺候洗脸。琴仙呆呆的想那梦，件件都记得逼清，将两头藏过，单将中间的梦与刘喜说了，老爷像成了神，但是位分也不甚大。刘喜道：「只要成了神就是了，想必天上也会升转的。」刘喜一会儿就送上饭来，说要到侯老爷那里去，告诉老爷这件事情，要他将文凭找出来。琴仙道：「","en":"Qinxian rose, and Liu Xi waited on him as he washed. Qinxian sat in a stunned daze, turning the dream over in his mind, remembering every detail with striking clarity. He kept the beginning and the end to himself, telling Liu Xi only the middle: that his master seemed to have"},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":4,"tokens":["刘喜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"石翁问道：「怎么你又回来了，不曾跟去么？」刘喜将道翁归天之事，细细说了。又将遗言嘱托并张贵等偷去衣箱、银钱等物，并文凭也偷去了，如今少爷在寺里守灵，连衣食将要不给起来。石翁听大惊，道：「有这等事！我道是已经到任去了，那知道这个光景！」便也洒了几点泪。刘喜道：「此时总要求老爷想个法子才好。」石翁道","en":"Hou asked: \\"Why have you returned? Did you not go with them?\\" Liu Xi recounted the tragedy of Daoweng's passing in agonizing detail: his final wishes, how Zhang Gui and the others had absconded with clothes, silver, and the vital credential, and how the young master now kept a bleak vigil at the temple, nearly destitute"},{"paragraph":30,"mentions":1,"tokens":["刘喜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"那一种叫人怜惜疼爱的光景，也增了许多。琴仙心上不悦，身子移远些，石翁倒要凑近些，说道：「不料贤侄遭此大故，昨日刘喜来说了方知。不然，我还当往江西去了。前月初十日，我到江边，见你们已开了船，谁知道有这些事。如今你心上打算怎样？」琴仙心里很烦，但不得不回答几句，便说道：「承老伯的厚意，与先父张罗一切，甚是感激不尽。小侄的意思，且守过了百天，觅块地，将先人安葬了，那时","en":"pressed closer, saying: \\"I never imagined you would suffer such a devastating loss. I only learned of it when Liu Xi came to me yesterday. Otherwise, I would have assumed you were already bound for Jiangxi. On the tenth of last month, I went down to the river and saw that you had sailed. I never dreamed this would happen. What do you plan to do now?\\" Qinxian's heart"},{"paragraph":34,"mentions":1,"tokens":["刘喜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"日着人送了一担米、一担炭、四两银来，试试琴仙的心受不受，若受了，自然慢慢的还肯到他家里去。谁知琴仙执意不肯受，刘喜也不敢作主，只得原物璧还。石翁甚怒，骂他不受抬举，以后也就无颜再来。但心里一分恨，一分爱，一分怜，终日之间，方寸交战，作了许多诗。幸苏州巡抚请了他去，勾留两月始归。","en":"accepted the gifts, he might in time be coaxed into coming to his house. But Qinxian refused the offerings outright. Liu Xi dared not make the decision for him, and so he returned the gifts entirely intact. Lord Hou was furious, bitterly cursing the boy for not knowing his betters. Afterward, his pride left him too ashamed to ever visit the temple again. Yet, in the quiet"}],"59":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":3,"tokens":["刘喜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"三月以来，将琴仙所剩衣物尽行当卖。当时初冬时节，琴仙尚无棉衣，刘喜更不用说了。一日，刘喜劝道：「大爷，我看你年纪轻轻，也不可过于古板。我想那侯老爷一片真心待你，自己来请你过去，还送钱米来，这也就难得了。你倒不要错看这位老爷，是王侯将相都敬重他的。他的门生好不多呢，现任官、进士、举人不知多少，还有些夫人、小姐们拜他做","en":"Qinxian's remaining clothes. The early winter chill was setting in, yet Qinxian had no padded garments, let alone Liu Xi. One day, Liu Xi offered a gentle word of advice: \\"Young Master, you are still young, and you shouldn't be so rigid. I believe Lord Hou was sincere in his intentions. For him to personally invite you over and even send money and rice is quite rare. You"},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":3,"tokens":["刘喜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"刘喜道：「要便人要天天有的，折差、塘报那一日没有？你写起来，我去寄就是了。」琴仙于是哀哀切切，写了几封信与子玉、子云、蕙芳诸人，要他们专人来接他回去，子云信内并封着屈道翁遗言。写了一天，刘喜托便寄了。后来寺中又做起法事来，男女混杂，游人挤满。琴仙屋里常有","en":"Liu Xi replied, \\"There are couriers leaving every day—imperial dispatches and relay reports—when is there a day without one? Just write the letters, and I will go and send them.\\" With a sorrowful heart, Qinxian poured his grief into several letters addressed"},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":3,"tokens":["刘喜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"他米炭等物，倒去碰个钉子，虽然怀恨，但爱根未断，只得老了面皮，带了二十金，叫小童拿了，乘轿而来。到了门口，只见刘喜摆着个小摊子，无非乌菱、荸荠、瓜子、花生之类。又见壁上挂几张画，倒是生纸画的花卉，颜色鲜明，颇为可观。便问刘喜道：「这是谁画的？」刘喜道：「大爷画的。二十钱一张纸，弃了可惜，我拿来挂在这里。昨日倒有人说好，买了两张去，一张牡丹卖了二百钱，一张梅花卖了","en":"of silver, had his servant boy carry them, and rode his sedan chair to the temple. Arriving at the gate, he saw Liu Xi managing a small stall stocked with nothing more than water caltrops, water chestnuts, melon seeds, and peanuts. He also noticed a few paintings hung on the wall—floral pieces done on raw paper, their colors bright and quite striking. He asked Liu Xi,"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":3,"tokens":["刘喜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"几句话，犹如钢刀削了他的老牛皮，气得须眉欲竖，真是平生未有之事。羞恼变怒，欲要发作，但看琴仙不知走到何处去了，刘喜看着他的摊子不能进来。石翁只得收了银包，恨恨而出，便在刘喜面前，把琴仙痛斥了一顿，说他不识好歹，不受抬举，将来的事情，他一些不照管了，上轿而去。刘喜也摸不着头脑。","en":"the verge of an explosive outburst. However, realizing Qinxian had disappeared to who-knows-where, and seeing Liu Xi occupied with his stall and unable to enter, Shiweng had no choice but to pocket the silver and storm out in bitter resentment. Before leaving, he unleashed a vicious tirade at Liu Xi, scolding Qinxian for being ungrateful and refusing to be uplifted."},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":1,"tokens":["刘喜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"到收摊时进来煮饭，见琴仙尚在房里哭泣，刘喜又劝了他，讲了些懵懂话。琴仙又不能将石翁的歹意告诉他，只好闷在心里，惟有呜咽而已。暂且按下不题。","en":"When the stall closed for the day and Liu Xi came in to cook rice, he found Qinxian still weeping in his room. Liu Xi offered more clumsy words of comfort. Unable to speak of Shiweng's wicked intentions, Qinxian could only bottle up his sorrow, quietly choking on his sobs. We shall leave their"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":1,"tokens":["刘喜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"明日，先着人到护国寺问了，说要亲自过来，又遣人送了道翁一封奠仪，自己备了祭桌，到护国寺来。刘喜手忙脚乱，请个小和尚看了摊子，进来伺候。琴仙穿了孝衣，帏间俯伏，知是子玉的父亲，心里虽喜，然倒有些虚心，恐他风闻前事，问起他的根本来，甚是惶恐。只见梅侍郎进来上了香，奠了酒，行了礼，请出琴仙来。琴仙上前叩谢了。梅侍郎挽起，先把琴仙一看，点了一点头，叹","en":"condolence gift in Daoweng's name and prepared a sacrificial table before making his way to the temple. Flustered, Liu Xi paid a young monk to watch the stall and hurried inside to serve. Qinxian, dressed in mourning white, knelt behind the curtain. Knowing this was Ziyu's father, his heart swelled with joy, yet a nagging apprehension lingered, fearful that the man might"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":5,"tokens":["刘喜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"疏远。」说了些话，也就去了。琴仙心内安稳，且十分感激，意欲求他携带进京，尚有几天耽搁，且慢慢商量罢。明日，带了刘喜即去拜谢，梅侍郎命家人代琴仙写了领状，将失物领了出来，送还琴仙。琴仙从此得了生路，见两箱尽是他的衣服，尚余三百十七两银子，还有个金镯与零星几样玩器，便有恃不恐，与刘喜说葬事盘费都已有了，刘喜也甚喜欢。琴仙因是绸缎细毛衣服不好穿，就拿出几十两银子，只得","en":"Knowing Mei would be delayed for a few days, he decided to broach the subject gradually. The next day, he took Liu Xi with him to formally offer his thanks. Vice Minister Mei ordered a servant to write out a receipt on Qinxian's behalf, retrieved the lost items, and returned them to the boy. From then on, Qinxian finally had a means to survive. Seeing that the two trunks"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":1,"tokens":["刘喜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"将领回之银，送与梅侍郎，梅侍郎仍叫他收了。此番琴仙感激，真到二十分。梅侍郎因道翁梦中之语，绝不查问琴仙根底，因刘喜称呼大爷，便命家下人也称呼为屈大爷。梅侍郎要他叔侄称呼，琴仙不敢，仍称大人，自称名字，梅侍郎也只好由他了。","en":"Daoweng's words in the dream, Vice Minister Mei firmly refrained from inquiring into Qinxian's background. Noting that Liu Xi addressed him as \\"Young Master,\\" Mei ordered his household servants to respectfully refer to him as \\"Master Qu.\\" Although Vice Minister Mei wished for them to adopt the familiar address of uncle and nephew, Qinxian didn't dare, continuing to address"},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":1,"tokens":["刘喜"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"时如何想念，在南京如何游玩，到莫愁湖亲见他前生坟墓，杜仙女怎样灵异，道翁临终时怎样伤心，众长随逃窃后怎样受苦，刘喜怎样尽心服侍，侯石翁怎样戏谑，又将梅侍郎来访，他怎样仗义安葬建祠的话，细细述了，说得子玉悲乐相乘。","en":"Daoweng's final moments, the suffering he endured after the senior servants stole their belongings and fled, how Liu Xi had served him with utmost devotion, the lecherous harassment of Hou Shiweng, and finally, Vice Minister Mei's visit and how he had righteously arranged the burial and built the shrine. He recounted it all in meticulous detail, leaving Ziyu alternating"}]}`),"char-135":JSON.parse(`{"2":[{"paragraph":20,"mentions":1,"tokens":["侯石翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"又说侯石翁又硬荐了两个亲戚。只好代为设法，或转荐别处。","en":"\\"He also mentioned that Hou Shiweng had ruthlessly imposed two of his own relatives on him. He had no choice but to offer alternative arrangements or recommend him elsewhere."}],"12":[{"paragraph":6,"mentions":1,"tokens":["侯太史"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"州，后到苏州，两处的年谊故旧，几个当道显贵，共相帮扶。春航在那两处，勾留了半年，诗文著作传抄殆遍。时下谓其可与侯太史、屈大令争名，因此囊橐充盈，黄白满箧。不消说题花载酒，访翠眠香，几至乐而忘返。及接了他太夫人的手谕，催其速行进京，春航不得已，即择日起身。先寄了千金回家，又收了两个俊仆，裘马辉煌，妓女饯行，狎客祖道。一路上风花诗酒，游目骋怀，好不有兴。","en":"writings were copied and circulated almost everywhere. People of the day said he could rival the Hanlin compiler Hou and the district magistrate Qu in literary fame, and as a result his purse filled up nicely and his luggage box was full of gifts. Needless to say, there was also visiting the pleasure quarters and carousing with wine, calling on singing-girls and sleeping"}],"37":[{"paragraph":14,"mentions":5,"tokens":["侯石翁","石翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"书诗词的对子，却甚有趣。好像末后还有个对戏目的对子，是两个字的多，可惜没有细看。」子云道：「你看道生的诗文，与侯石翁如何？」次贤道：「据我看，是道翁高于石翁。石翁的才虽大，格却不高，且系驳杂不纯。道翁才也不小，其格纯正，却是可传之作。就是石翁也很佩服他的。」王恂道：「我们江宁的侯石翁么，他却自负天下第一才子。据我看来，也不见得。」子云道：「才是大的，博也博的，到他","en":"I regret I did not examine it carefully.\\" Ziyun asked, \\"How would you compare Daosheng's poetry and prose with Hou Shiweng's?\\" Cixian said, \\"In my estimation, Daoweng is the superior of the two. Shiweng has great talent, but his writing lacks distinction and is rather mixed and impure. Daoweng, too, is a man of considerable talent, and his writing has a pure, sound style;"}],"45":[{"paragraph":14,"mentions":1,"tokens":["侯石翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"。凭栏眺望，犹如身在蓬莱。想扬州盐商家那些花园，也算精工的了，如何比得上这里？再如平山堂、虹园也不能彷佛。至于侯石翁的起凤园，更不必提了。这边子云取出商彝、周□、汉鼎、秦盘，斟上百花酿，焚了百和香，中铺上一盘净沙，摆了一个仙乩。大家下楼冠带，盥漱已毕，重亲上楼。","en":"Yangzhou, artful as they were, simply could not compare. Even Pingshan Hall and Hong Garden fell short. As for Hou Shiweng's Qifeng Garden, it did not even bear mention. Here, Ziyun brought out Shang bronzes, Zhou bronzes, Han tripods, and Qin ritual dishes. He poured Hundred-Flowers brew, burned Hundred-Blend incense, spread clean sand on the tray, and set out the spirit"}],"55":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["侯石翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"于漕河两院都是相好，一概不惊动了，没有往拜。道翁有个长随叫刘喜，为人老实忠厚，四十多岁，跟随了五六年，跟过江宁侯石翁太史，善于烹调，如今叫他伺侯琴仙。这刘喜正是个老婆子一样，饥则问食，寒则问衣，琴仙甚得其力。开船之后，三天到了扬州。道翁怕那些商人缠扰，要来求诗求画，请吃酒，请听曲，便不上岸。","en":"and loyal man in his forties who had served him for half a decade. Having previously worked under the eminent Hou Shiweng in Jiangning, Liu Xi was remarkably skilled at cooking, and Daoweng now assigned him to look after Qinxian. This Liu Xi proved as fussy and attentive as an old matron, always asking if Qinxian was hungry when it was time to eat, or if he was cold when"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":1,"tokens":["侯石翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"礼之外，还要做架屏。一时扬州城里，竟选不出一个作家来。其实，翰林进士不少在这里，他们说做得不好，只得到江宁去找侯石翁老爷，送了十二色礼、六百银子，又请王大老爷王蒙山写了，又是三百两。他们说，那时你老人家若来了，只消一桌酒，又快又好，连写带做不消两天工夫，岂不省事。等你不来，教他们东找人西请人，好不为难。」","en":"here, but the merchants said their work wasn't good enough. They had no choice but to go to Jiangning to find Lord Hou Shiweng, presenting him with twelve kinds of gifts and six hundred taels of silver, and then they invited the great Lord Wang Mengshan to write the calligraphy for another three hundred taels. They said that if you, venerable sir, had been here, it would"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":4,"tokens":["侯石翁","石翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"道翁忆着侯石翁，要在此与他盘桓几日。一早带了琴仙并刘喜，雇了个凉篷子，由护城河摇到了旱西门，进城雇了肩舆，到凤凰山来访侯石翁。这个侯石翁，是个陆地神仙，今年已七十四岁。二十岁点了翰林，到如今已成了二十三科的老前辈，朝内已没有他的同年。此人从三十余岁就致仕而归，遨游","en":"Daoweng thought of Hou Shiweng and decided to linger here for a few days to visit him. Early the next morning, taking Qinxian and Liu Xi along, he hired a shaded skiff. They rowed from the city moat to the Hanxi Gate, entered the city, hired sedan chairs, and proceeded to Phoenix"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":6,"tokens":["石翁","侯石翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"不衫不履的，上前一把拉了道翁的手，把琴仙看了一看，也一把拉了他的手，拉进了三间书屋。道翁与他叙礼，命琴仙拜见。石翁问道：「这位郎君，与你是何瓜葛？」道翁道：「此是小儿。」石翁呵呵大笑，道：「俭腹人要充饱学，寒乞儿要装富翁，再醮妇还想学新嫁娘。你是个秃尾猢狲，怎么忽然有个小儿？难道这位玉郎是你口里吐出来的？」道翁笑道：「胡说，这原是我过继的螟蛉。」石翁又笑道：「原","en":"leading them both into a three-room study. After exchanging formal greetings, Daoweng instructed Qinxian to bow. Shiweng asked, \\"What relation is this young gentleman to you?\\" Daoweng replied, \\"He is my son.\\" Shiweng burst into a roaring laugh. \\"A man with an empty belly trying to pass as a great scholar, a beggar pretending to be a rich man, a remarried widow trying to"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":11,"tokens":["石翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"两人又对驳了一会，各自抚掌大笑。石翁即吩咐家人备出饭来，石翁是不饮酒的，拿出来陪道翁。琴仙不肯喝酒，道翁善饮，便一人自酌。石翁道：「我劝你也不必做官了，虽然得了别驾，究也难展骥足。你的相知也尽多，难道舍了这六品前程，竟没有饭吃么？」道翁叹道：「我并非老马恋栈，但也有个难处。你晓得我数十","en":"The two men debated back and forth for a while before clapping their hands and bursting into hearty laughter. Shiweng then ordered his servants to prepare a meal. Though Shiweng did not drink wine himself, he brought some out to accompany Daoweng. Qinxian declined the wine, while Daoweng, a fine drinker, poured for himself. Shiweng said, \\"I advise you, there's no need"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":4,"tokens":["石翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"道翁又将那篇序文念了，石翁赞了两声，道：「竟是一篇唐文，宋人四六无此谨严。但其中有两句，还要斟酌斟酌。」道翁道：「就请教，那两句呢？」石翁道：「琉璃研匣，翡翠笔床，是用《玉台序》。但他一浓一淡，相间成文，便入古格。他是「琉璃研匣，终日随身；\\n翡翠笔床，无时离手。」此等句倒好。","en":"Daoweng then recited the preface he had written. Shiweng praised it a few times, saying, \\"It is truly a piece of Tang-style prose; the parallel prose of the Song writers lacks such rigor. However, there are two lines within it that require a bit more deliberation.\\" Daoweng asked, \\"Please instruct me, which"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":11,"tokens":["石翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"石翁听了，始不为异，忽然悟了，说道：「可恶！可恶！」道翁也笑。石翁道：「你送我副对子，要说得真切，不要那隔靴搔痒的话。」道翁念道：「天下词人皆后辈。」石翁大笑道：「当不起，但马齿加长也还说得去。」道翁笑道：「下联倒难对呢。」又说道：「此地有个卢莫愁，借他","en":"At first, Shiweng did not find this strange, but suddenly he caught the meaning and cried out, \\"Abominable! Absolutely abominable!\\" Daoweng laughed as well. Shiweng demanded, \\"If you give me a couplet, it must be piercing and true, not some vague scratching-through-the-boot"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":1,"tokens":["侯石翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"逛，再去寻坟。」便引琴仙进了观音庵。到了里面，见两进重门，四面皆通，铺设精雅，满壁图书，尽是名人题咏，内中见有侯石翁的诗文，又见有江西学使梅士燮一副对子。琴仙见往来游玩的，也有士人，也有商贾，也有乡农，也有妇女们，摆着几张茶桌子，栏外就是满湖的荷花。和尚便泡了两碗茶来，刘喜请琴仙坐了，他拿了茶碗又到一处去坐。琴仙见那些人走来走去，只管的看他，有几个村里的妇人，瓦盆","en":"entirely covered in books, paintings, and inscriptions by famous figures. Among them, he spotted poetry and prose by Hou Shiweng, as well as a couplet by Mei Shixie, the Education Commissioner of Jiangxi. Qinxian noticed that the visitors strolling about included scholars, merchants, farmers, and women. Several tea tables were set up, and just beyond the balustrade lay a lake"}],"56":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["石翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴仙又将石翁所赠的诗，与道翁看了。道翁不觉动气，因说道：「此老游戏散漫，习与性成，老来还是这样。我就素鄙其人，不过爱其才耳。将这扇子撕了罢。」琴仙即将扇子撕得粉碎，一夜无话。","en":"Qinxian then showed Daoweng the poem Old Shiweng had gifted him. Daoweng's temper flared as he read it, and he scoffed: \\"That old man treats life as a trifling game and scatters his mind to the wind. His habits have calcified into his very nature, and even in his twilight years, he remains unchanged."},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":2,"tokens":["侯石翁","石翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"六月八日偕侯石翁游清凉山，登绝巘，为罡风吹落堕地，致伤腰足。归卧不起，呕血数斗，现寓白下萧寺中，弥留之际，旦夕间事也。伤哉！伤哉！素车无闻，青绳谁吊，骸轻蝉蜕，魂咽之潮。一抔之土何方，六尺之孤谁托？琴儿素蒙青眼，令其来依。呜呼？度香知我，自能慰我于九原也。残魂不馁，","en":"On the eighth day of the sixth month I climbed Qingliang Mountain with Hou Shiweng, reached a perilous summit, and was blown off the cliff by a squall; I struck the ground and injured my waist and legs. Since returning I have lain unable to rise and vomited many dou of blood. I lodge now in a humble temple at Baixia; I am at the last"},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":2,"tokens":["侯石翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"喜道：「偷去了么？那只好求侯老爷与制台讲明，想人已死了，也没有什么要紧的。」刘喜伺候了饭，脱了孝衫，便到凤凰山侯石翁处来。那侯石翁自从见道翁跌了这一交，甚不放心。隔了一日，来找道翁的船，已不见了，当是开了船，只道他已经到任，再不料他已经身故，心上又想起琴仙：「见了那首诗，不知是喜是恼，想来经我品题，自然欢喜。但看他生得这般妙丽，却冷冰冰的，少些风趣。可惜如此美男，","en":"enough. Surely the heavens grant promotions in due time.\\" Presently, he brought food and mentioned he must go to Lord Hou to report the matter and retrieve the credential. Qinxian protested: \\"The credential was in that clothes trunk, and it was stolen along with the rest. What can we do?\\" Liu Xi frowned: \\"Stolen too? Then we have no choice but to ask Lord Hou to explain"},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":4,"tokens":["石翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"石翁问道：「怎么你又回来了，不曾跟去么？」刘喜将道翁归天之事，细细说了。又将遗言嘱托并张贵等偷去衣箱、银钱等物，并文凭也偷去了，如今少爷在寺里守灵，连衣食将要不给起来。石翁听大惊，道：「有这等事！我道是已经到任去了，那知道这个光景！」便也洒了几点泪。刘喜","en":"Hou asked: \\"Why have you returned? Did you not go with them?\\" Liu Xi recounted the tragedy of Daoweng's passing in agonizing detail: his final wishes, how Zhang Gui and the others had absconded with clothes, silver, and the vital credential, and how the"},{"paragraph":30,"mentions":5,"tokens":["石翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"石翁过了一日，备了一桌祭筵，一副联额，亲到寺里来上香奠酒，痛哭了一场，倒哭得老泪盈盈，甚是伤感。琴仙在孝帏里也痛哭，心上想道：「此老倒也有些义气，听他这哭倒也不是假的。」石翁收了泪，叫自己带来的人挂了匾额，看了一看，叹口气，走进孝帏。琴仙忙叩头道谢，石翁","en":"A day later, Lord Hou prepared a sacrificial table adorned with a poetic couplet and an honorific plaque. He came in person to burn incense and pour libations, weeping loudly until old tears streamed down his face, appearing deeply moved. Inside the mourning curtain, Qinxian"},{"paragraph":31,"mentions":1,"tokens":["石翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"石翁道：「这是什么主意！你令先尊是湖北人，汨罗江是他的祖居。他数代单传，并无本家亲戚。你若到那里去，是没有一个人认得的。况如今又是孑然一身，东西都偷光了，回湖北这个念头可不必起了。京里人情势利，况你令尊也没有什么至交在京里。从来说：「人在人情在。」不是我","en":"Lord Hou protested: \\"What kind of plan is that! Your late father was a Hubei man, and the Miluo River was his ancestral home. For generations, his family line ran single and thin, leaving no kinsmen behind. If you were to return there, not a single soul would"},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":4,"tokens":["石翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"只生花老眼看定了他，口中虽说得正大光明，那神色之间，总不像个好人。心上又气又怕，脸已涨红，低了头，又不肯答应。石翁把琴仙的手握在掌中，两手轻轻的搓了几搓，笑迷迷的又问道：「前日扇上那首诗，看了可懂得么？」琴仙心中更气，把手缩进，将要哭了，便要站起来走开。石翁拉住道：「且慢，还有话说。你在京里时，认得些什么人？」琴仙想不理他，又不好，只得忍住了气道：「人也认得几个","en":"Seeing Lord Hou's flower-bright old eyes fixed intently upon him, Qinxian felt a cold chill. Though the man's words sounded high and fair, his lingering manner was distinctly not that of a good and honorable man. Qinxian was seized by a mixture of anger and fear; his"},{"paragraph":33,"mentions":2,"tokens":["石翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"石翁笑道：「了不得了，快不要去。这些纨袴公子，你如何同得来的！他外面虽与你相好，心上却不把你当作朋友。你倒不要多心，不是我说，你的年纪太小，又生得这好模样，京城的风气极坏，嘴贫舌薄，断断去不得。你去了，也要懊悔的。自然在我这里，你令尊九泉之下也放心。你拜","en":"Lord Hou laughed aloud. \\"Terrible, absolutely terrible! You must not go to him. How could you possibly keep company with those idle, silk-trousered sons of privilege? They may appear fond of you on the surface, but in the depths of their hearts, they do not truly"},{"paragraph":34,"mentions":4,"tokens":["石翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"石翁要扶他，琴仙已站了起来，离远了，石翁走出窗外，当着琴仙送他，尚可说两句。谁知琴仙竟已入帏。石翁无奈，只得走了回去。想了半日，明日着人送了一担米、一担炭、四两银来，试试琴仙的心受不受，若受了，自然慢慢的还肯到他家里去。谁知琴仙执意不肯受，刘喜也不敢作主","en":"Lord Hou tried to help him rise, but Qinxian was already on his feet, stubbornly keeping his distance. Lord Hou stepped outside the window to bid a lingering farewell, hoping he might still slip in a final word, but Qinxian had already withdrawn completely behind"}],"59":[{"paragraph":4,"mentions":3,"tokens":["侯石翁","石翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一日，侯石翁自苏州回来，闻知琴仙还在寺里，已到衣食不周，心上又念着他。因前此送他米炭等物，倒去碰个钉子，虽然怀恨，但爱根未断，只得老了面皮，带了二十金，叫小童拿了，乘轿而来。到了门口，只见刘喜摆着个小摊子，无非乌菱、荸荠、瓜子、花生之类。又见壁上挂几张画，倒是生","en":"One day, Hou Shiweng returned from Suzhou and learned that Qinxian was still staying at the temple, now struggling with inadequate food and clothing. His thoughts immediately turned back to the boy. Although he still harbored some resentment from being rebuffed when he previously"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":2,"tokens":["石翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴仙见了石翁，心里老大的一跳，只得上前见礼。石翁忘了前情，又握了他的手，说了几句话，坐了。琴仙勉强陪着，面上却是冰冷的。","en":"Qinxian's heart gave a violent lurch at the sight of Shiweng, but he forced himself to step forward and offer a polite greeting. Shiweng, choosing to forget their previous unpleasantness, grasped the boy's hand once more, exchanged a few pleasantries, and sat down. Qinxian reluctantly kept him company, his expression"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":1,"tokens":["石翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"石翁先将他的画赞了一番，想了一个赚他的法子来，便道：「老世兄，你心上也不急，这两天各处也应有回信来了。我在苏州时，又将你令尊的事告诉人，人人都也肯帮。但你在这寺里终究不便。你若搬到我家里，我的相好，也就是你令尊的相好，那时遇着人，必有见面之情，就好说了。","en":"Shiweng began by offering lavish praise for Qinxian's paintings, secretly formulating a plan to win him over. He then said, \\"My dear young friend, there is no need for you to worry so much. You should be receiving replies from various places in the next day"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":4,"tokens":["石翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"神情，那老面皮里紫光光的透出一团邪气。琴仙心里想要痛骂他一场，方可泄恨，但又因他是个老辈，只得暂时忍住不理他。石翁见他脸上红红的，当他面嫩不好答应，自然心上有些回心了。便叫小童将银子送过来，石翁亲手送与琴仙道：「这些须几两银子，先赎几件衣服穿了，明日我叫轿子来接你。」琴仙道声多谢，又说道：「前次所赏之物尚不敢受，如今更不敢受这赏赐。至于冻馁两字，是命中注定的。譬","en":"Hearing these words, Qinxian's face burned crimson with outrage. Observing Shiweng's demeanor, he noticed a purplish sheen radiating from the old man's face, exuding an undeniable aura of wickedness. Qinxian desperately wanted to unleash a torrent of curses to vent his anger, but mindful of the man's seniority, he forced himself to"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":1,"tokens":["石翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"到收摊时进来煮饭，见琴仙尚在房里哭泣，刘喜又劝了他，讲了些懵懂话。琴仙又不能将石翁的歹意告诉他，只好闷在心里，惟有呜咽而已。暂且按下不题。","en":"rice, he found Qinxian still weeping in his room. Liu Xi offered more clumsy words of comfort. Unable to speak of Shiweng's wicked intentions, Qinxian could only bottle up his sorrow, quietly choking on his sobs. We shall leave their plight there for now."},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":1,"tokens":["侯石翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"制台讲起：「江西有个通判屈本立，可认得么？」梅侍郎答以相好。制台就将屈本立死在南京，其行李盘费为三个长随窃逃，侯石翁代他嗣子报了，行文到江西。昨接江西巡抚移文，内开：","en":"that his luggage and travel funds had been stolen by three of his senior servants, who had subsequently fled. Hou Shiweng had reported the incident on behalf of Qu's adopted son and had dispatched an official dispatch to Jiangxi. Just yesterday, a reply had arrived from the Governor of Jiangxi, stating:"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":5,"tokens":["石翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"解前来，但此衣物等须交还他嗣子收领。那二犯现收禁江宁县监，还有从犯一名汪升，已经身故了。但不知他嗣子下落，须问石翁便知。\\n梅侍郎听了，心里颇为恺恻，又想：「道翁并无嗣子，想是近来过继的了。」便辞了制台，到凤凰山来拜石翁。石翁连忙接进，先道了喜，叙了契阔，即问宦囊如何。士燮笑道：「晚生靠祖宗的余荫，稍有几亩薄田，尽够饔飧，无须另积囊橐。论江西，虽不算富厚之邦，也算","en":"an accomplice, Wang Sheng, has already died. But as the whereabouts of his adopted son are unknown, we must ask Shiweng to ascertain this.\\"\\nUpon hearing this, Vice Minister Mei felt a profound sense of sorrow. He thought to himself, \\"Daoweng had no heir; this adopted son must be a recent development.\\" He took his leave of the Governor-General and headed to Phoenix Mountain"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":2,"tokens":["侯石翁","石翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"送葬之日，侯石翁被绅士拉了同去，也来走了一走。见琴仙尚是有气，话也不与他讲，石翁不乐，心里既恨琴仙，又妒士燮，一到就走，拜也没有拜一拜。后来诸绅士又有高兴的出来倡捐，这个十两，那个二十，集腋成裘，又凑了数千金。把这屈公祠扩充起来，起了好些亭台楼阁。莫愁湖中造了湖心亭","en":"On the day of the funeral, Hou Shiweng had been dragged along by the gentry and made a brief appearance. Seeing that Qinxian was still holding a grudge and refused to speak a single word to him, Shiweng felt deeply displeased. Harboring hatred for Qinxian and jealousy toward Shixie, he left"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":1,"tokens":["侯石翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"及再看到所有衣物尽为逃奴辈窃去，守棺萧寺，衣食全无，又屡遭侯石翁戏侮，本拟一死，又因旅榇无归，故尔暂延残喘，务祈设法着人前来等语。子玉不觉泪如泉涌，万箭攒心，毫无主意，也不忍再看。便吩咐套车到怡园找子云，谁知次贤、子云、南湘、高品没有一个在园子里，子玉更加着急。跟班们不知何事，又不敢问子玉，便又到九香楼，进去见诸","en":"desolate temple entirely bereft of food and clothing, and that he had been repeatedly harassed and humiliated by Hou Shiweng, Ziyu's heart shattered. The letter stated that Qinxian had intended to end his own life, but because the traveling coffin remained unburied, he was temporarily clinging to his fleeting breath, desperately praying that they would find a way to send someone"},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":1,"tokens":["侯石翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"如何游玩，到莫愁湖亲见他前生坟墓，杜仙女怎样灵异，道翁临终时怎样伤心，众长随逃窃后怎样受苦，刘喜怎样尽心服侍，侯石翁怎样戏谑，又将梅侍郎来访，他怎样仗义安葬建祠的话，细细述了，说得子玉悲乐相乘。","en":"servants stole their belongings and fled, how Liu Xi had served him with utmost devotion, the lecherous harassment of Hou Shiweng, and finally, Vice Minister Mei's visit and how he had righteously arranged the burial and built the shrine. He recounted it all in meticulous detail, leaving Ziyu alternating between grief and joy."}]}`),"char-136":JSON.parse(`{"23":[{"paragraph":13,"mentions":1,"tokens":["巴老英"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"了凤林，拣了个馆子，进雅座坐了。这姬先生倒有一个俊俏的跟班，年纪约十五六岁，是徽州人，在剃头铺里学徒弟的，叫作巴老英。","en":"attendant of about fifteen or sixteen, a native of Huizhou who had been an apprentice in a barber shop, named Ba Laoying."},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":3,"tokens":["英官","巴英官","巴二爷"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"亮轩见其眉目清俊，以青蚨十千买得，改名英官，打扮起来也还好看。日间是主仆称呼，晚间为妻妾侍奉。当下嗣徽见了也觉垂涎。二人点了菜，凤林敬了几杯酒，那巴英官似气忿忿的站在后面。凤林最伶透，便知他是个卯君，忙招呼了他，问了姓，叫了几声巴二爷，方才踱了出去，姬亮轩才放了心。如今见了京中小旦，觉比外省","en":"Seeing his delicate features, Liangxuan had purchased him for ten thousand copper cash, renaming him Yingguan. Dressed up, the boy looked quite charming. By day they maintained the guise of master and servant, but by night he served as a concubine. Upon seeing him, Sihui could not help but drool with desire. The two ordered dishes, and Fenglin offered a few"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":1,"tokens":["巴英官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"凤林又敬了亮轩几杯，那个巴英官红着脸，在廊下走来走去。姬亮轩叫他来装烟，他也不理，又去了。嗣徽见了说道：「大哥，方才小弟要请教你的话，我只知泌水洋洋，可以乐饥。至于蒸豚之味，未曾尝过，不识其中之妙，到底有甚好处，与妻子好合如何？」亮轩笑道：「据我想来，原是各有好处，但人人常说男便","en":"Fenglin offered several more toasts to Liangxuan. Meanwhile, Ba Yingguan, his face flushed with jealousy, paced back and forth under the veranda. Ji Liangxuan called him in to prepare the tobacco pipe, but he ignored him and walked away again. Seeing this, Sihui said, \\"Elder brother, earlier I wished to ask for your instruction."},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":1,"tokens":["巴英官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"口道：「不要胡讲了。天已晚了，我还有两处地方要去呢。吃饭吧。不然，我就先走了。」姬亮轩因同着相公吃酒，知道他的巴英官要吃醋，不敢尽欢，也就催饭，吃了要散，嗣徽只得吃饭。大家吃毕，嗣徽拿出两张票子共是五吊钱，开发了凤林，合着点子牌一张的么四。又算了饭帐，各自回去。","en":"visit. Let us eat. Otherwise, I will leave first.\\" Because Ji Liangxuan was drinking with an actor and knew his Ba Yingguan would grow jealous, he dared not fully indulge and urged the food to be served. After eating, they prepared to disperse; Sihui had no choice but to eat. Once everyone finished, Sihui brought out two paper notes totaling five strings of cash, paid Fenglin"}],"27":[{"paragraph":4,"mentions":2,"tokens":["巴英官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"转托王文辉，竟是一说就妥。真是物以类聚，又是个爱淘毛厕的，臭味相投。进门住了几天，看出东家脾气，便要巴结，已将巴英官送他用了几回，奚十一心上极为畅快。那巴英官伺候过大老爷，在师爷面前，越发骄纵起来。况又得了几件新衣，裱糊好了，觉得更加光彩。姬亮轩每到情急求他，竟是勉强应酬，不是那从前服贴光景。","en":"of matching stench, within days he had read his patron's temper and set out to curry favor. He had already lent Ba Yingguan several times, and Xi was delighted. Ba Yingguan, having waited on the Great Master himself, grew all the more insolent in the secretary's presence; and having got several new suits of clothes, freshly pressed, he felt himself finer still. Whenever Ji"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":2,"tokens":["巴英官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，不在里头讲究，而奚、姬两位，则舍此别无所好，奚十一更是下作，一饭之间，也要进去两次。从前还只一个，如今又添了巴英官，更比春兰巴结的好。巴英官肌肤虽黑，却光亮滑泽，得个油字诀，所以爱的人最多，姬亮轩醉后也曾对人讲过。","en":"Eleven was especially low; even during one meal he had to slip inside twice. Once there was only one boy, but now Ba Yingguan was added, even more devoted than Chunlan. Ba Yingguan's skin, though dark, was sleek and glossy—the oil trick—so lovers swarmed, as Ji Liangxuan, drunk, had told people."},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":1,"tokens":["巴英官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"是日饮酒之间，奚十一叫春兰进去了一回，出来坐了一坐；又叫巴英官进去了。仲雨不知其故，只道有事，便与亮轩讲些闲话。这两个相公，一个是蓉官，一个是春林，皆是奚十一常叫的。蓉官对着春林做眼色，春林笑了一笑。亮轩也做眉做眼的，仲雨偶然看见，却不晓得什么，也不便问。蓉官忽问仲雨道：「你能有个相好姓魏的，他初到京时，我就认","en":"around, Xi Eleven first summoned Chunlan inside. Chunlan came back out and sat for a while, but Xi soon called Ba Yingguan in as well; the comings and goings made Zhongyu wonder what business was being conducted behind the inner door. Zhongyu guessed his errands and chatted with Liangxuan. The two actors, Rongguan and Chunlin, were Xi's usual calls. Rongguan signaled Chunlin,"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":1,"tokens":["巴英官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"道：「久后便知，此事也不必说了。」只见奚十一出来，趿着双细草网凉鞋，穿条三缸青香云纱裤，披着件野鸡葛汗衫，背后巴英官拿着柄黑漆描金鬼子扇，笑嘻嘻一轻一重的乱扑出来。亮轩出席相迎，仲雨也照应了。奚十一坐下，仲雨道：「你今日有什么事这么忙？」","en":"pair of fine woven-grass sandals, triple-dyed fragrant-cloud trousers, and a pheasant-pattern ramie jacket, with Ba Yingguan behind holding a black lacquer foreign fan traced in gold, fanning at him now light now hard as he came out grinning. Liangxuan stood up and Zhongyu nodded to him; Xi sat down, and Zhongyu asked, \\"Have you been busy today?\\""},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":2,"tokens":["巴英官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"奚十一过了夜，明日早饭后，想起仲雨所说的琴言这么利害，到底不信，必要去试试。过瘾之后，同了姬亮轩，带了春兰、巴英官，自己换了件新纱衫子，坐了车，叫春兰、巴英官同跨了车沿，亮轩另雇一个车，到秋水堂来。","en":"unapproachable, he resolved to test the matter for himself. After taking opium, along with Ji Liangxuan, Chunlan, and Ba Yingguan, he wore a fresh gauze jacket and took a carriage. Chunlan and Ba Yingguan rode on the footboards, while Liangxuan hired another cart, and they set off to Autumn-Water Hall."},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":1,"tokens":["英官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"刚走到里面，这边奚十一已到门，春兰、英官下来，进去问了，回说不在家。奚十一听了，先有一分怒气，自己也就下来，刚刚走进了门，姬亮轩尚在门外，只见一人笑嘻嘻的上前说道：「老爷是找那一个的？若是找相公们的，没有一个在屋里。」说罢，便迎面站住，也不说个请字。奚十一见了就有了三分气。正要开口，倒是春","en":"Just inside, Xi Eleven reached the gate. Chunlan and Ba Yingguan descended and asked within. When answered that no one was home, Xi felt anger rising and entered himself. Liangxuan was still outside when a man stepped up grinning: \\"Sir, seeking whom? If actors, none are inside.\\" He blocked the way with no \\"please.\\""},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":1,"tokens":["英官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"当下两人就进去房内坐了。英官、春兰即在外间坐下。那人送了两钟茶上来，有些认得春兰，问了来历，进去告知长庆。 　　长庆道：「已经回说不在家，也就不必应酬他了。」又想道：「这姓奚的，虽听得他是个冤大头，但是个没味的人，多少相公上了他的当，没处伸冤，琴言是断乎讲不来的。不然叫天福、天","en":"Both entered the inner seating area, while Yingguan and Chunlan remained in the outer room. The man served two cups of tea, recognized Chunlan, asked their provenance, and informed Changqing. Changqing said, \\"I already said I'm not home, so there's no need to entertain.\\" He thought, \\"This Xi, I've heard"},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":2,"tokens":["巴英官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"天福就在奚十一对面躺下，天寿坐在炕沿上。亮轩拖张凳子近着炕边，看他们吃烟，春兰、巴英官在房门口帘子边望着。只见天寿爬在奚十一身上，看他手上的翡翠镯子，天福也斜着身子，隔着灯盘拉了奚十一的手，两人同看。亮轩也来炕上躺了，两个相公就在炕沿轮流烧烟。天福挨了奚十一，天寿靠了姬亮轩，两边唧唧哝哝的讲话。亮轩不顾天热，就把天寿搂在怀里，门口巴英","en":"Tianshou perched on the edge of the kang. Liangxuan dragged a stool beside the kang, watching them smoke. Chunlan and Ba Yingguan peered from the doorway curtain. Tianshou climbed beside Xi, studying his jade bracelet, while Tianfu leaned across the lamp tray, holding Xi's hand; both admired him. Liangxuan climbed onto the kang, and the two actors took turns burning the opium."},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":1,"tokens":["巴英官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"春兰、巴英官看不入眼，便走出去，各处闲逛。走到里面，看见些堂客们，知系长庆的家眷。又见东边一个小门半掩着，二人便推开进去，见静悄悄的，有株大梅树。上面三间屋子，东边的窗心糊的绿纱，里面下了卷帘。二人一步步的走到窗前，从窗缝里张时，见床上坐着两个绝色的相公：「一个","en":"Chunlan and Ba Yingguan couldn't stomach it. They wandered inward and saw some women—Changqing's kin. The small east door was ajar, so they pushed through into quietness. There was a big plum tree and three rooms; the east windows had green gauze with the blinds drawn. They"},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":2,"tokens":["巴英官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴言道：「看他做什么，自然是福、寿这两个顽皮了。」素兰终不放心，也因前日吓怕了，叫人关上门，别叫人进来。春兰对巴英官道：「他们说琴官不在家，在床上坐的不是吗？」巴英官道：「那个呢？」春兰道：「是素兰。待我们与老爷说了，好不依他。」于是二人又到房门口，见他们还挤在一处，听得奚十一道：「琴言到底几时回来？」天福正要回言，春兰即说道：「他们哄老爷的，琴言现在里头，同着素","en":"Sulan was still uneasy, still frightened from before, and ordered the door barred to all visitors. Chunlan told Ba Yingguan, \\"They told the Master that Qinyan wasn't home, but isn't he sitting right there on the bed?\\" Ba asked, \\"Who's the other?\\" Chunlan replied, \\"It's Sulan. Wait till we tell the Master; he won't spare them.\\" They returned to the door and still heard Xi"},{"paragraph":30,"mentions":1,"tokens":["英官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"亲戚姓伍的住的，钥匙他带出去了，房里也没有什么看头。」奚十一欲要打进去，又似踌躇，春兰道：「小的亲眼看见，还有英官同见的，如今必躲在床底下了。」长庆道：「青天白日你见了鬼了。」春兰道：「我倒没有见鬼，你尽说鬼话。」奚十一怒气冲天，忍耐不住，两三脚踢开了门进去，团团一看，春兰把帐子揭起，床下也看了，只不见人。","en":"there's nothing worth seeing inside.\\" Xi hesitated, but Chunlan interjected: \\"This small one saw him, and so did Ba Yingguan; he must be under the bed.\\" Changqing protested, \\"In broad daylight, you are seeing ghosts!\\" Chunlan shot back, \\"I saw no ghosts; you're the one talking ghost-talk.\\" Xi could endure no more. With two or three kicks, he shattered the door and searched"}],"34":[{"paragraph":23,"mentions":1,"tokens":["巴英官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"与富三、和尚都请了安。富三却不认识，问他是谁，在那一班的，聘才就说是全福班的。随后奚十一、潘三同来。奚十一带了巴英官，潘三带了个学徒弟的小伙计，拿他竟当做跟班的。大家一齐相见了。潘三见了天香、翠官，笑道：「你们怎么也跑了来？」奚十一道：「看来，魏大爷要开篷子做掌柜的了。」富三方晓得是剃头的，便哈哈大笑道：「原来是他们，不是班子里的，倒也好。」大家同坐着，顽笑了一阵","en":"they were from the Quanfu Troupe. Soon after, Xi Eleven and Pan the Third arrived together. Xi Eleven had brought Ba Yingguan, while Pan the Third was accompanied by a young apprentice whom he was treating as a servant. Greetings were exchanged all around. Upon seeing Tianxiang and Cuiguan, Pan the Third laughed and asked, \\"How did you two end up here?\\" Xi Eleven quipped, \\"By"},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":1,"tokens":["巴英官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"闹。聘才笑道：「我们今日只好轮着来闹这个老和尚了。」便互相与唐和尚豁了几拳。闹了一个多时辰，奚十一瘾来了，便叫巴英官拿出烟具来。灯是开现成的，奚十一躺下，叫得月陪他吹烟，两个剃头的也有烟瘾。都聚拢来。唐和尚见了，即连打了两个呵欠，伸了个懒腰。看得奚十一瘾大，等不及，便到自己房中过瘾去了。","en":"Monk Tang. After they had carried on for over two hours, Xi Eleven's craving for opium struck, and he ordered Ba Yingguan to bring out the smoking gear. The lamps were already lit; Xi Eleven lay down and commanded Deyue to join him in smoking. The two barbers, also being addicts, crowded around as well. Seeing this, Monk Tang let out two large yawns and stretched his back."},{"paragraph":30,"mentions":3,"tokens":["巴英官","英官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"上，奚十一又摸他的屁股。得月要起来，奚十一将一条腿压住了他，得月无法，只好任其抚摩。奚十一一盒子烟已完了，便叫巴英官拿烟来。英官远远的站在一边，正在那里发气。奚十一叫了两三声，方才答道：「没有了。」奚十一道：「怎么没有？我还有个大盒子在袋里。」英官又歇了半天，方说道：「洒了。」奚十一道：「洒了？你将盒子给我瞧。」","en":"no other recourse, Deyue had to endure the fondling. Xi Eleven finished an entire box of opium and called for Ba Yingguan to bring more. Yingguan stood far off to the side, sulking in a fit of pique. Xi Eleven called out two or three times before Yingguan finally answered, \\"There's none left.\\" Xi Eleven snapped, \\"What do you mean there's none left? I have a large box right"},{"paragraph":31,"mentions":1,"tokens":["巴英官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"巴英官气忿忿的走近来，把个大金盒子一扔，倒转了滚到灯边。","en":"Fuming with anger, Ba Yingguan marched over and flung the large gold box; it flipped and rolled right up to the lamp."}],"36":[{"paragraph":16,"mentions":2,"tokens":["巴英官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"要了昨日晚上送来的四样菜、两样点心出来，送到魏老爷那里去，又教了他一番说话。也不进房，就在书房内炕上开了灯，叫巴英官打泡，急急的吹了三十口大口烟，已有三钱，可以挨得半天了。心里想道：「送他些什么东西才好呢？」看着自己腰里一个八大件钢镶表值二百吊钱，将这表给他罢。又想道：「单是个表也不算什么贵重，只有那姨奶奶那对翡翠镯子，京里一时买不出来，把这个送他也体面极了。」即","en":"what to say. Without entering the inner rooms, Xi Eleven stayed in his study, lit a pipe on the kang, and had Ba Yingguan prepare the opium. He quickly took thirty large puffs, consuming three mace, enough to sustain him for half a day. He wondered, \\"What should I give him?\\" Looking at the steel-rimmed pocket watch at his waist, worth two hundred strings of cash, he considered"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":1,"tokens":["巴英官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"起来。聘才笑盈盈的说道：「来得正好，主人来陪客了。」奚十一笑道：「我知道此刻尚未吃完，竭诚来敬琴言一杯。」便叫巴英官拖过凳子，就朝南坐了。一手执壶，一手擎杯，斟好了，直送到琴言嘴边。琴言接又不好，不接又不好，急得满脸通红。聘才道：「这是主人敬客人之意，你不能干，喝一口罢。」琴言只得接了，喝了一口，把杯子放下，对聘才道：「我真喝不得了，已饱得难受，你陪着喝一钟罢。」","en":"company.\\" Xi Eleven laughed, \\"I knew you hadn't finished yet. I've come in all sincerity to toast Qinyan.\\" He had Ba Yingguan pull up a stool and sat facing south. Holding the pot in one hand and a cup in the other, he poured a full measure and thrust it right to Qinyan's lips. Trapped between accepting and refusing, Qinyan flushed a deep red. Pincai gently coaxed, \\"This is"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":1,"tokens":["巴英官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"他的巴英官在旁抿着嘴笑，走到院子里，捡了那碎镯子，共是三段，放在掌中拼好，说道：「待我花三钱银子镶他三截，也发个标，戴个三镶翡翠镯子，不知道人肯赏我不肯赏呢。」","en":"Ba Yingguan stood by, suppressing a smile. He went into the courtyard, gathered the shattered pieces of the bracelet—three in total—pieced them together in his palm, and said, \\"If I spend three mace of silver to mount these three sections, I can show off a fashionable"}],"40":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":3,"tokens":["巴英官","英官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"造了好些谣言，稍出了几分恶气。那一个镯子，菊花盘问起来，奚十一只说自不小心，失手砸了，菊花也无可奈何。偏有那巴英官告诉了，菊花便大闹了一场，奚十一软话央求，将来遇有好的再配，方才开交。那奚十一的为人，真是可笑，一味的弃旧怜新。从前买了春兰，也待得甚好，不到半年就冷淡了。去年得了巴英官，如获至宝，如今又弄上了得月、卓天香，将英官也疏远起来。","en":"been careless, dropped it, and smashed it to pieces; Juhua could do nothing about it. As it happened, however, Ba Yingguan told her the truth, and Juhua raised a tremendous uproar. Xi Eleven pleaded softly and promised to match it with an even finer one in the future, and only then was the matter settled. Xi Eleven's character was truly laughable — he was forever abandoning"},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":2,"tokens":["巴英官","英官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"那巴英官心中气忿，便与春兰闲谈说道：「从前老土待我们怎样，如今是有一个忘一个，你心上倒放得开么？」春兰道：「我从前主意错了。与我出了师，我当他是个有情有义的，那晓得是个没有良心的。看他所做的事，全不管伤天害理。从前那个桶子，也不知骗了多少人。听得说还有些好人","en":"Ba Yingguan, harboring a heart full of indignation, fell to chatting idly with Chunlan one day and said, \\"Chunlan, think of how Old Clod used to treat us — and now it's one forgotten for the next. Can you really take that lying down?\\" Chunlan said, \\"I was foolish"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":3,"tokens":["英官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"英官道：「索性待人有恒心也罢了。从前还常常的赏东西，如今是赏也稀少了，到像该应拿屁股孝敬他的。这个人偏不生疮。烂掉了，倒大家干净。」春兰道：「你还有旧主人在此，他如过于冷淡你，你可以告假，仍跟姬师爷，我看还比跟他好些。」英官道：「那姬师爷更不好，如果好，","en":"Ba Yingguan said, \\"It would be one thing if he could at least show some constancy in his treatment of people. In the past he used to frequently bestow rewards, but now even such gifts have become scarce — it's almost as if we owe him our buttocks in tribute. And"}],"42":[{"paragraph":25,"mentions":1,"tokens":["英官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"混熟了，只怕还离不开呢。」大傻道：「不见那春兰么？」亮轩道：「春兰固然。本来钱也花多了，自应心悦诚服的了。我那英官呢，借去用两天，就用到如今不肯送还。这个小东西也恋着他，将我往日多少恩情付之流水。这也不能怪他，从来说白鸽子望旺处飞，也是人之常情。况且我这敝东，在京里也算个阔老斗，就与那华公子、徐少爷也不相上下，而且他们都是世交。前日那位徐少爷来，适值敝东不在家，","en":"Liangxuan said, \\"Chunlan, certainly. He spent a great deal of money there, and one ought to be grateful. But my own Yingguan — he borrowed him for a couple of days and has kept him to this hour and will not send him back. And the little creature has taken to him, and all my past kindness is water under the bridge. One cannot blame him either: they say a white pigeon flies"}],"47":[{"paragraph":4,"mentions":1,"tokens":["巴英官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"。但奚十一这个孽障，虽经了这番痛苦，就应该痛改前非，保身节欲。谁知他身体一健，仍旧不安本分。况且内有菊花，外有巴英官，这两重前后门是封锁不来的，未免也要应酬应酬。无奈那厥物甚不妥当，不动作时倒也不觉怎样，此时原只剩了半截，没头没脑，颇不壮观。到动兴时，内中有一条筋胀得生疼，要勉强应酬几下，也是不能的，把个菊花心内急得无法，唯有暗中流泪。奚十一也觉抱愧，自己一想，今","en":"guessed that, once recovered, he would refuse to stay within his bounds? Moreover, with Juhua within the house and Ba Yingguan outside, locking his front and rear gates was impossible, and he could not help but make some effort to accommodate them. But alas, that wretched organ was in a sorry state. At rest it posed no issue, but now only a stunted stump remained—blunt and unseemly."},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":1,"tokens":["英官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一日要到宏济寺去谢唐和尚，封了五十两银子，叫英官拿了。到了寺门口，见间壁开了个饭庄子，挂着招牌，写着安吉堂。奚十一也不理会，到寺中见了得月，有些恨上心来，把他肩上狠狠的拧了一把。得月嚷道：「做什么使劲的拧我？」奚十一笑道：「你害得我好苦，病了一个多月不算，把那子孙桩也锯掉了半截，教我做了个废人，我","en":"One day he went to Hongji Temple to thank Monk Tang, wrapping fifty taels of silver for Yingguan to carry. At the temple gate, he noticed a new dining house next door, its signboard reading Peaceful Fortune Hall. Paying it no mind, he entered the temple, where the sight of Deyue roused his resentment, and he gave the boy's shoulder a vicious twist."},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":1,"tokens":["英官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"若用了那人的药，定然弄到斩草除根，净了身了。我也没有什么谢你，这一点东西算还你的药本罢。」说罢，作了一个揖，从英官手里接过来，双手送上。唐和尚连忙的辞道：「这如何使得？咱们弟兄怎样的交情，你竟把我当作外人看待，送起谢仪来，快请收回。」奚十一道：「你莫非嫌少么？」唐和尚连忙赔笑道：「岂有此理。」双手只管推来。奚十一道：「唐大哥，你不用这样，咱们交情原不在这上头。但","en":"no real gift to thank you with; take this trifle to cover your drug costs.\\" With a bow, he took the silver from Yingguan's hands and offered it with both. Monk Tang hurriedly declined: \\"How can this be? With our bond as brothers, you treat me like a stranger offering thank-you fees! Please, take it back.\\" Xi Eleven said: \\"Do you think it too little?\\" Monk Tang forced a"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":1,"tokens":["英官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"：「我等不及了，我要过那瘾。」那人道：「索性上了药，你再和唐师父吃烟。等这药性发一发，就好动手了。」此时春兰、英官也站在书房门口观望。","en":"you can smoke with Master Tang. Once the medicine takes effect, I can begin my work.\\" By this time, Chunlan and Yingguan were also hovering at the study door to watch."},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":1,"tokens":["英官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"了进去。阳善修听得有人说要五寸，抬头一看，见门口有两个孩子站着，便当是他们讲的，也笑了一笑。春兰脸倒红了一红，英官鼻子里哼了一声。","en":"seeing the two servant boys at the door, assumed they had spoken and smiled as well. Chunlan blushed deeply, while Yingguan gave a haughty snort."},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":1,"tokens":["英官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"把一条药线嵌进。一连四刀，嵌了四条。菊花看了，在那里发抖，抖得牙齿对碰，扑在板壁上，那板壁也刷刺刺的响。春兰、英官吐出了舌头，缩不进去。唐和尚不忍看，躺着吹烟。那人又掏出一个锡盒子，取出一片鲜红带血的肉来，中间还剜了一个眼。又见他把那把小刀在龟头上戳了几刀，又冒出血来，将那片肉贴上，再用药敷好。通身又上了药，扎了两三根药线，把个象牙片子在头上按了几按，砑得光光的","en":"Trembling so hard her teeth chattered, Juhua leaned against the wooden partition, making it creak softly. Chunlan and Yingguan stuck out their tongues in shock and could not pull them back. Unable to bear the sight, Monk Tang lay down and smoked. The man then took out a tin box and extracted a piece of bright red, bloodied meat, pierced through the middle with a hole. He scored"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":1,"tokens":["巴英官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"奶讲，要一封银子出来。菊花听了，先进去开了箱，取出一封银子，交与春兰送出。阳善修接了，收拾了药包物件，叫春兰、巴英官扶了奚十一进内去躺罢，同了唐和尚出去了。奚十一果然每天服药一次，阳善修每到午正时候便来上药，一连十余日，竟已长好。后来菊花也不回避了，到阳善修来上药时，在旁偷看。见奚十一那物壮了好些，但是刀痕虽合，一条一条的形迹尚在头上，更不好看，一块青，一块红，像","en":"and handed it to Chunlan to bring out. Yang accepted it, packed his medicines and tools, and told Chunlan and Ba Yingguan to help Xi Eleven inside to rest, before leaving with Monk Tang. Xi Eleven indeed took his medicine daily, and Yang Shanxiu came promptly at noon to change the dressing. After ten-odd days, it had miraculously grown whole. Later, Juhua stopped hiding"}],"58":[{"paragraph":4,"mentions":2,"tokens":["巴英官","英官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"着门，里面有笑声。菊花轻轻的在门缝里一张，见春兰弯着腰在炕边，看有四只脚站在一处。菊花一见，即把袖子掩了口，听巴英官说道：「你倒会长，怎么他不会长，总是这样的？」春兰道：「也觉长了些，没有你的长得快就是了。你人虽短，他倒长呢，与老爷的差不多了。」英官道：「老爷如今的还不及我了。」说话之间，两人的脚步又翻了转来，在前的此时在后，在后的忽又在前。菊花看得软洋洋的，牙齿","en":"bent over the kang, and four feet stood together on it. At once she clapped her sleeve to her mouth. She heard Ba Yingguan say, \\"You're the one who grows, so how come he doesn't? He is always the same.\\" Chunlan replied, \\"He's grown a bit, just not as fast as yours. You're short in the body, but he's long. It's almost like the master's now.\\" Yingguan said, \\"The master's doesn't"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":1,"tokens":["巴英官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"到了明日，早饭后，奚十一即拉了姬亮轩，坐了车，巴英官骑了马，到了九香楼。奚十一下了车，见是大门里面竖着一块屏风，两旁放着金字招牌，一块是收买秦汉唐宋古玩书画，一块是发卖苏杭花绣衣料，一切洋货俱全，还有一块是内看金珠宝玉、四时花卉。此时那九个名旦均已出班，内有未满师者，也是宝珠、蕙芳共同帮他们出了师，一","en":"The next morning after breakfast, Xi Eleven pulled Ji Liangxuan into a carriage, while Ba Yingguan rode horseback, and they reached Nine-Fragrance Tower. Xi stepped down to find a screen inside the main gate and gilt-lettered boards on either side. One was for buying Qin, Han, Tang, and Song antiquities, calligraphy, and painting. Another was for"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":3,"tokens":["巴英官","英官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"肏的？连那佛手也摘了两个。」就听得大闹起来，有个小孩子声音乱骂乱嚷的。大傻子走了出去。奚十一懒的起身，但听得像巴英官的声音与人嚷闹，便叫亮轩出去看看。见一丛人围着，走上前，见英官揪住了一个人，那人把马鞭子打了他几下，英官号啕哭骂道：「你骂我兔崽子，你是驴崽子！将老婆的众去讹钱，讹到了手，如今要充二爷了。」","en":"voice cursed and yelled. Big Fool went out to investigate. Xi was too lazy to rise but thought it sounded like Ba Yingguan quarreling and told Liangxuan to look. A crowd had gathered. Yingguan had seized someone who had struck him with a whip. Yingguan howled, \\"You call me rabbit, but you're a donkey colt! You sold your wife's cunt to swindle money, and now you play lord"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":1,"tokens":["英官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"橘，两盆佛手，要抬回去，被他摘得干干净净，气人不气人？问问他，他开口就骂人。」那边蕙芳、兰保都出来看，却不认得英官，也不认得姬亮轩。","en":"Is it maddening or not? Ask him, he cursed first.\\" Huifang and Lanbao came out to look, but they knew neither Yingguan nor Ji Liangxuan."},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":1,"tokens":["英官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"奈阳物已伤，适或再受了磕碰就不好了，嘴里骂了几句，也就出来。姬亮轩见奚十一不闹，自然更不敢闹，重到了九香楼下，英官收拾了烟枪，奚十一坐了一会，也就不大疼了。心中忿恨，来到外边，乌大傻躲得不见影儿，奚十一只得上车而回。","en":"cursed a few lines and left. Ji Liangxuan, seeing Xi quiet, dared not stir either. Back at Nine-Fragrance Tower, Yingguan packed the pipe. Xi sat until the worst pain passed, bitter at heart. Outside, Big Fool had vanished without a trace, leaving Xi no choice but to climb into his carriage and return home in humiliation."},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":2,"tokens":["英官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"里哼哼唧唧的，身上火炭一般，嘴唇皮结得很厚，鼻子里热气直冲，心里不忍。但可恨那东西，不知为什么不肯安静，便想着英官多时没有做这件事了，又想道：「这个兔子与别人不同，真是屁中之精，近来嫌我不好，勉勉强强的，今日我要收拾这个兔崽子。」酒醉模模糊糊，吃了四粒丸药，带了绫带，到书房叫英官来开上灯，叫他打烟。","en":"nose, and he pitied her. Yet the thing would not rest. He thought how long it had been since he had done that with Yingguan. He mused, \\"This rabbit isn't like others, he is the true cream of the backdoor. Lately he's sneered at my performance and only gone through the motions, so tonight I'll tame the brat.\\" Drunk and muddled, he swallowed four pellets, took the silk ribbons,"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":8,"tokens":["英官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"英官强头强脑的打了几口，便出去。奚十一叫住了，英官靠着门，望着奚十一道：「有什么事？」奚十一道：「走来！」英官不应，奚十一笑道：「你来，我有样东西给你看看。」英官方慢慢的走来，道：「看什么？不是又有了翡翠镯子了。」奚十一坐起，拉了过来，抱了他。英官冷笑道","en":"Yingguan sullenly blew a few draws and left. Xi called him back. Yingguan leaned on the door and looked at Xi, asking, \\"What is it?\\" Xi said, \\"Come here.\\" Yingguan did not move. Xi smiled, \\"Come, I have something to show you.\\" Yingguan approached slowly and asked,"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":2,"tokens":["巴英官","英官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"人说巴英官屁股里头像个皮袋，口边像铁箍。算他十三岁起，到如今大约着一千人没有，八百人总有多无少。里头长了一层厚膜，就如炉子搪上一层泥一样，凭你怎样，他也不疼。奚十一驰骤了一回，头上忽又疼起来，四面的筋爆涨，如春笋经雷，参参怒长，一股气往顶上直冒。奚十一不顾死活","en":"People said Ba Yingguan's rear was like a leather bag, the mouth rim like an iron hoop. From about thirteen to now, he had had perhaps not a thousand partners, but eight hundred at least. Inside grew a thick membrane, like stove lining, so however you used him, he hardly felt"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":2,"tokens":["英官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"众家人听见这一响。连忙过来看时，见篷塌了半边，并未压人，不知主人与英官何故躺倒。忙将灯照时，见奚十一的阳物血淋淋的只有半截，再看英官的屁股，也是血淋淋的，脏头拖出三四寸。众人个个失色，便大惊小怪乱闹起来，忙报与菊花知道。菊花听了，急得一身透汗，也顾不得病，穿上衣裳，着了裤子，袜子也穿不及，趿上鞋，把衣衿掩好，只扣了外面","en":"Servants heard the crash and ran in. Half the canopy had fallen but crushed no one, yet why the master and Yingguan lay flat they could not tell. Lamps showed Xi Eleven's member bloody and half gone. Yingguan's buttocks were bloody too, with a bloody three- or four-inch length of flesh protruding. Everyone paled and raised a clamor, and they sent word to Juhua. She"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":6,"tokens":["英官","巴英官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"那个医生还不见来，这边亮轩看见英官这个模样，也十分心疼，便细细的照料他一会，叫人烧了一盆热水，拿块布泡热了，与他揉，揉了一会，英官也醒转来。亮轩把蜡灯放在旁边，揉了一会，恐怕水溅了袍子，便将前衿提起些。此时心里痛苦，再想不起自己没有穿裤子。菊花坐在炕上，亮轩蹲在地下，却是对面，中间放","en":"The doctor did not come. Ji Liangxuan saw Yingguan's state and pitied him too. He tended him, ordered hot water, soaked a cloth, and pressed it until Yingguan woke. Ji set a candle nearby. Fearing a splash on his robe, he lifted his front hem, too distraught to recall he wore no trousers. Juhua sat on"},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":1,"tokens":["英官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"药和鸡皮捣烂了，与他洗净了血，敷上了药。也与从前一样的治法，留了一服药煎了与他吃，明日再来看罢。亮轩又同他去看英官，阳善修也与他几味药吃了，说道：「这个不要紧，明日就缩进去的。」阳善修去了，菊花就在书房中睡，陪了奚十一。这一唬，倒把个菊花的病唬好了。叫家人把顶篷支好，扫去了灰土。","en":"method as before. He left a decoction for him to drink and said he would return tomorrow. Ji went with him to Yingguan, and Yang gave him medicines too, saying, \\"This is nothing, tomorrow it'll retract.\\" Yang left, and Juhua slept in the study beside Xi. The shock cured Juhua's illness. Servants propped the canopy and swept the dust."},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":1,"tokens":["英官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"菊花便守了活寡。不知果然是真守，还是假守，这也不能查他。外面确做出那从良极正派的样子来，以博虚名。菊花恨极英官，等他脏头好了，痛打了一顿，撵他出去。姬亮轩馆地要紧，也只可忍心割爱。","en":"truly or for show could not be checked. Outwardly she played the utmost respectability to win a name. She hated Yingguan bitterly. When his wound healed she beat him soundly and drove him out. Ji Liangxuan needed his tutoring post and could only swallow the loss."},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":3,"tokens":["英官","巴英官"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"英官撵出之后，便到卓天香铺里去做了伙计。人爱他脑袋好，这个卵字号，倒也生意兴隆。虽然英官脏头上去些，但屁股里已经受了伤，竟成了内外痔。后又广与人交，不到一年之功，竟是众毒齐发，把个巴英官活活烂死，岂不是件大奇事！这也是他的恶报了。","en":"After his expulsion, Yingguan went to Zhuo Tianxiang's shop as a clerk. Men prized his \\"head,\\" and the \\"egg\\" trade thrived. Though the hanging tip was shortened, his rear had been injured. Inside and out he developed piles. Later he took many partners, and within a year every poison"}]}`),"char-137":JSON.parse(`{"17":[{"paragraph":28,"mentions":1,"tokens":["白菊花"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"爱，不如比为杏花。」众人道：「好个杏花，极妥当。」文泽道：「说起菊花有黄有白，你们可晓得东园里新来一个妓女，叫白菊花，可知其人么？」众人皆说：「不晓。」","en":"chrysanthemums, yellow or white, do you all know that in the eastern garden a new courtesan has recently arrived, called White Chrysanthemum? Have you heard anything about her?\\" Everyone said they had not."}],"18":[{"paragraph":15,"mentions":1,"tokens":["白菊花"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"厂落几天，见见市面，自然就不知羞耻，老练起来。如行院中不好的打下来，又到此两处。这个就是高品所说，从广西新来的白菊花了。聘才看他举止，尚有几分羞涩。旁边一个小儿，捧上一面琵琶，那人接了，弹了一套《昭君怨》，便惹得门口看的人益发多了。","en":"Likewise, those no longer of use in the better houses were demoted to these two places. This was none other than the White Chrysanthemum (Bai Juhua) that Gao Pin had spoken of, newly arrived from Guangxi. Watching her behavior, Pincai could see she still had a measure of bashfulness about her. A small boy came up beside her and offered a pipa lute. She took it and played a suite of \\"Wang"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":3,"tokens":["白菊花","菊花"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"要说这白菊花，是广西梧州府人，生得十分俊俏，嫁了一个姓宋的，是个不长进的人。这菊花善与人交，相识了一个营员姓张的，是湖广人。两人在广西十分相好，誓同偕老，已有数年。去年这个张营员，奉差进京，这白菊花倒是个有情有义的人，于是张营员走后，即带了些盘费，一个小丫头，赶","en":"As for this White Chrysanthemum, she hailed from Wuzhou Prefecture in Guangxi and was extraordinarily good-looking. She had been married to a man named Song, a shiftless fellow. Chrysanthemum was by nature good at making connections, and she had come to know a military officer surnamed"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":1,"tokens":["菊花"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"他就卖了些衣裳作路费，搭了个便船进京。及到京时，那姓张的早已差竣回去，以致菊花流落在此，只得倚门卖笑。","en":"the capital. When she arrived, Officer Zhang had long since completed his assignment and returned; as a result, Chrysanthemum found herself stranded in the capital, and had no choice but to lean on her doorway and smile for a living."},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":3,"tokens":["菊花"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"因此，奚十一不大喜欢。陶妈妈知道菊花是广西人，又生得好看，必定勾得住他，所以把他接了过来，认为义女。登时换了崭新的衣服，与诸姊妹相见，菊花与玉天仙尤为相爱。菊花受尽了狼狈，到此已如出了地狱，心里还有甚不足，一心就候那奚十一来。","en":"As a result, Xi Eleven was not greatly pleased. Madam Tao knew that Chrysanthemum hailed from Guangxi and was also very good-looking. Confident that Chrysanthemum could hold his interest, Madam Tao brought her over and formally adopted her as a foster daughter. At once new clothing was found for her, and she was introduced to all"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":4,"tokens":["白菊花","菊花"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"的步行而去。到了陶家，陶妈妈先出来见了，便极意的胁肩谄笑了一回，然后说道：「你们快请四姑娘出来。」不多一刻，见白菊花袅袅婷婷的，一身香艳，满面春情，上前见了，说了些话，彼此语音相对。奚十一看他相貌，正是娇如花，柔如水，甜如蜜，黏如饧，十分大喜，略问了几句话，便同进了房。便叫小跟班摆好了烟具，开了灯，一面吹，一面谈。这奚十一要吃大口烟的，菊花替他烧烟，先从半分一口起","en":"most eager of shoulder-hunched smiles, then said: \\"Come quickly and bring out Fourth Miss.\\" Not long afterward, White Chrysanthemum came out, graceful and swaying, fragrant in her attire, a spring-blossom expression on her face. She came forward to meet him, and they exchanged a few words, finding their speech perfectly matched to each other's. Xi Eleven looked at her appearance:"},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":9,"tokens":["菊花"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"菊花见奚十一这个雄纠纠的相貌，比从前的相好更胜一倍。又知道是个大老爷，在京候选的，便起了从良之念。奚十一本为物色小星而来，见菊花这般美貌，又是个极在行的，便也要买他为妾。倒是那个老鸨不甚愿意，菊花方来几天，且并非他的人，又无身价可勒，只想留他在家多弄些钱","en":"Chrysanthemum saw that Xi Eleven's powerful and vigorous manner surpassed her previous love by twice over. Knowing he was a great gentleman waiting in the capital for an official appointment, she conceived the desire to become a proper wife. Xi Eleven had originally"}],"36":[{"paragraph":16,"mentions":4,"tokens":["菊花"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"罢。又想道：「单是个表也不算什么贵重，只有那姨奶奶那对翡翠镯子，京里一时买不出来，把这个送他也体面极了。」即到菊花房里，听得唧唎唎的一声。举眼看时，原来菊花在净桶上解手，见了奚十一便笑了一笑。奚十一道：「怪不得香气熏人，我当着外头开沟呢。」菊花啐了一口道：「嚼你的舌头。」奚十一开了箱，四角里掏了一掏，掏着一个匣子，开了盖，看是了便揣在怀里，也不盖箱子盖，转身便走","en":"couldn't find their equal in the capital right now. Giving him those would be incredibly prestigious.\\" He went into Juhua's room and heard a splashing sound. Looking up, he saw Juhua using the chamber pot; she smiled at him. Xi Eleven said, \\"No wonder the fragrance is overpowering—I thought they were cleaning the drains outside.\\" Juhua spat, \\"Bite your tongue.\\" Xi Eleven"},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":1,"tokens":["菊花"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子，如今倒值三千吊了。」奚十一见了，越发气狠狠的骂了一会。潘三与唐和尚连说可惜。大约奚十一回去，只剩一个镯子，菊花必有一场大闹，正是癞蛤蟆想吃天鹅肉，也不料自己的福分。","en":"the Third and Monk Tang kept repeating what a pity it was. When Xi Eleven returned with only one bracelet left, Juhua would surely raise a massive uproar. It was precisely the case of a toad longing for swan meat, completely unaware of its own meager lot in life."}],"40":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":3,"tokens":["菊花"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"造了好些谣言，稍出了几分恶气。那一个镯子，菊花盘问起来，奚十一只说自不小心，失手砸了，菊花也无可奈何。偏有那巴英官告诉了，菊花便大闹了一场，奚十一软话央求，将来遇有好的再配，方才开交。那奚十一的为人，真是可笑，一味的弃旧怜新。从前买了春兰，也待得甚好，不到半年就冷淡了。去年得了巴英官，如获至宝，","en":"concocting such slander, he managed to vent a portion of his bitter resentment. As for the matter of the bracelet, when Juhua cross-examined him, Xi Eleven simply claimed he had been careless, dropped it, and smashed it to pieces; Juhua could do nothing about it. As it happened, however, Ba Yingguan told her the truth, and Juhua raised a tremendous uproar. Xi Eleven pleaded"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":3,"tokens":["菊花"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"口中呻吟不已。菊花一夜不能安睡，明日见了那东西，吓了一跳，忙问其缘故，奚十一不肯直说，只推不知为什么忽然肿起来。菊花道：「请个医生来看看罢。」奚十一道：「唐和尚就很好，专医这些病症。」菊花便打发人去请。","en":"He groaned without ceasing. Juhua could not find a moment's peaceful sleep all night, and the next morning, when she saw the state of that organ, she was given a terrible fright. She hurriedly asked the cause, but Xi Eleven refused to speak plainly, merely claiming he had no idea why"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":1,"tokens":["菊花"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"菊花见了，好不伤心，又不敢埋怨他，只得求神许愿，尽心调治。换了两三个医生，倒成了蜡烛卸。还是唐和尚知道了，用了上好的至宝丹敷了，才把那个子孙桩留了一寸有余。后来收了功，没头没脑，肉小皮宽，不知像个什么东西，要行房时，料想也不能了。此是奚十一的淫报。","en":"Juhua, seeing his plight, was heartbroken, but did not dare voice her resentments. She could only pray to the gods and make vows, nursing him with the utmost devotion. He changed doctors two or three times, but the afflicted organ merely melted away like a"}],"47":[{"paragraph":4,"mentions":2,"tokens":["菊花"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"又大了好些。但奚十一这个孽障，虽经了这番痛苦，就应该痛改前非，保身节欲。谁知他身体一健，仍旧不安本分。况且内有菊花，外有巴英官，这两重前后门是封锁不来的，未免也要应酬应酬。无奈那厥物甚不妥当，不动作时倒也不觉怎样，此时原只剩了半截，没头没脑，颇不壮观。到动兴时，内中有一条筋胀得生疼，要勉强应酬几下，也是不能的，把个菊花心内急得无法，唯有暗中流泪。奚十一也觉抱愧，","en":"health. Who could have guessed that, once recovered, he would refuse to stay within his bounds? Moreover, with Juhua within the house and Ba Yingguan outside, locking his front and rear gates was impossible, and he could not help but make some effort to accommodate them. But alas, that wretched organ was in a sorry state. At rest it posed no issue, but now only a stunted"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":6,"tokens":["菊花"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"奚十一满心欢喜，便等不及唐和尚请他吃饭，即辞了回去，与菊花说知，菊花更加欢喜，便找了丁香油出来，绝早就吃饭，过了瘾，催奚十一睡了，将药调得浓浓的，敷满了他，将带子捆上。奚十一觉得那物先凉后热，一会儿火烧起来，胀得甚疼，便叫菊花把带子收紧，收紧了觉好些，一连收了三次，方才止痛。奚十一睡着了，菊花醒来，将手摸摸","en":"Overjoyed, Xi Eleven could not even wait for Monk Tang's meal; he took his leave, went home, and told Juhua. She was even more delighted, fetching the clove oil at once. They ate supper very early, smoked their opium, and Juhua hurried Xi Eleven to bed. Mixing a thick paste of the medicine, she coated him completely and bound him with the band. Xi Eleven felt"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":1,"tokens":["菊花"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"吃了早饭，唐和尚同了那人前来，奚十一到书房里陪他们坐了，阳善修问了昨夜的光景。菊花走将出来，从板壁缝里望那个医生，生得颇不顺眼，一个黄肿脸儿，约三十来岁年纪，有几根微须，身材短小，穿一件油晃晃的旧绸袄子，两只袖子破烂不堪。又见唐和尚的头剃得紫光油滑，穿件青绸夹袄，拿着把扇子扇着。听得那人说道：「叫你们管家生个炭炉来。要一大罐子开水","en":"arrived with the doctor. Xi Eleven sat with them in the study, and Yang Shanxiu asked how the night had gone. Juhua crept out and peered through the cracks in the wooden partition. The doctor looked utterly unpresentable—a sallow, puffy face, about thirty years old, with a sparse beard and short stature, wearing a greasy, worn silk jacket with tattered sleeves. Beside"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":5,"tokens":["菊花"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"菊花见那人先调了半盏子药，将奚十一的带子解开，将水洗净，把绸子擦干了。菊花嫌那板缝小，还有些灰土嵌在里面，取下金耳挖来，把板缝里的灰剔得干干净净，眼光才望得到转弯处。见那人将药与他敷上，又拿一个绸套子套上，点了五寸长一枝香。奚十一与和尚躺下吹烟，菊花又见","en":"Juhua saw the man mix half a cup of paste, untie Xi Eleven's band, wash him clean with water, and dry him with the silk. Displeased that the partition crack was too narrow and clogged with dust, she took her gold earpick and scraped the crack completely clean"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":4,"tokens":["菊花"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"那麻药已上了好一会，菊花忍不住又走了出来瞧时，见那人说道：「香已点完了，药性也走到了。」身边又扯了一块青绉纱来，笑对奚十一道：「疼是一点不疼的，但你自己看了，我就下不得手，你须闭了眼。」奚十一听了，把绉纱在脸上捆了两道。叫他坐在炕沿上，把腿分开，搁在两张凳上。那人拿了药线放","en":"The anesthetic had been applied for a good while when Juhua, unable to resist, crept out to look again. She heard the man say: \\"The incense has burned down; the medicine has taken effect.\\" Pulling a strip of black crepe silk from his pocket, he smiled at Xi Eleven: \\"It will not hurt in the slightest, but if you"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":2,"tokens":["菊花"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"过多少了。」阳善修对唐和尚道：「昨日讲的药本先给我，我好去配药。」奚十一即叫春兰去对姨奶奶讲，要一封银子出来。菊花听了，先进去开了箱，取出一封银子，交与春兰送出。阳善修接了，收拾了药包物件，叫春兰、巴英官扶了奚十一进内去躺罢，同了唐和尚出去了。奚十一果然每天服药一次，阳善修每到午正时候便来上药，一连十余日，竟已长好。后来菊花也不回避了，到阳善修来上药时，在旁偷看","en":"Xi Eleven immediately told Chunlan to go to the concubine and fetch a wrapped packet of silver. Hearing this, Juhua hurried inside, opened the chest, took out the silver, and handed it to Chunlan to bring out. Yang accepted it, packed his medicines and tools, and told Chunlan and Ba Yingguan to help Xi Eleven inside to rest, before leaving with Monk Tang. Xi Eleven"}],"50":[{"paragraph":23,"mentions":5,"tokens":["白菊花","菊花"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"白菊花未从良时与玉天仙同在一局，且甚相好，结为异姓姊妹，玉天仙长菊花两岁。菊花与奚十一讲了，要请玉天仙过来饯行，奚十一岂有不肯之理？即请了玉天仙到家。菊花出外迎接。到了里面见了礼，坐下各谈契阔。玉天仙道：「我见四妹从了良，又遇见这位多情的老爷，我便心上羡慕","en":"Before Bai Juhua had left her profession, she and Yutianxian had worked in the same establishment and were exceedingly close, having sworn an oath as adopted sisters; Yutianxian was the elder by two years. Juhua spoke with Xi Eleven, expressing her desire to invite Yutianxian"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":2,"tokens":["菊花"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"玉天仙道：「你见过你姐夫么？」菊花道：「姐夫也常来找我们老爷，所以我也看见过他几次，人才是没有说的。」玉天仙面有喜色，笑道：「只要裙里香，管他十二房。妹妹这么个人，妹夫岂有不一心一意的。你看那杨八妹夫也是个从九，再没有选期，尽仗着看风水，能赚多少人？他家里也利害，如今与六妹妹也远了，","en":"Yutianxian asked eagerly, \\"Have you met your brother-in-law?\\" Juhua replied, \\"He used to visit our master often, so I've seen him several times. There is absolutely nothing to criticize about his looks or demeanor.\\" Yutianxian's face lit up with undisguised joy, and she laughed, \\"As long as there's fragrance beneath"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":2,"tokens":["菊花"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"玉天仙吃了饭，谢了菊花要回，菊花送出来。到了二门，两人还是依依的拉着手，站住说话。姬亮轩在书房里听得清清楚楚，便剜破窗纸，闭着一眼，睁着一眼，从窗隙里望将出去。","en":"After they finished their meal, Yutianxian thanked Juhua and prepared to leave. Juhua escorted her out. When they reached the second gate, the two women lingered, holding hands affectionately, reluctant to part, and stood there talking softly. Ji Liangxuan, who was sitting in the nearby study, heard their"},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":3,"tokens":["菊花"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"不大不小，一个容长脸儿，容光滑洁，体态风骚，裙下金莲约有四寸，甚是伶俏，比菊花身材略高了些。菊花穿件蛋青纱衫，内衬桃红衫，下是月白纱裤，穿着厚底堆绒蝴蝶鞋。两鬓堆鸦，高鬟滴翠，脸上微带几点俏麻，美目含情，春容满面。把姬亮轩看得筋酥骨软，口内流涎。谁料这个窗纸还是旧年糊的，风吹日晒，也脆极了。亮轩只顾偷看，把个额角靠在纸上，拍的","en":"peeked tiny bound feet, barely four inches long, incredibly delicate and lively; she was just slightly taller than Juhua. Juhua was dressed in a pale eggshell-blue gauze robe over a peach-pink lining, paired with moon-white gauze trousers and thick-soled velvet butterfly shoes. Her raven hair was piled high in twin coils, dripping with emerald ornaments. A few charming"}],"58":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["菊花"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"却说奚十一选了广西一个知州，是个极苦的地方，十分不乐，心上想告病不去。又因近着他家乡，且菊花是广西人，借此可以回家看看，因此竭力唆成。奚十一近来得了家信，洋行倒了，盐场又为海水冲了，家事不好。又听得老太翁得了腿疾，也要告病。又想家内兄弟都已回去，也轮不到他作主，不如且到广西走走，看看局面怎样。但此时已经盘费全无，而且又欠了潘三四千银子，急于","en":"he was thoroughly displeased, inclined to plead illness and not go. It lay near his home region, however, and Juhua was a Guangxi native, so he could use the post to visit family. He therefore pushed hard to make it happen. Xi had lately received word from home. The foreign trading house had failed, the salt pans had been washed out by seawater, and family finances"},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":1,"tokens":["菊花"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，不得主意。此时十月天气，日短夜长，日里在外头张罗，夜间开了灯，惟以吃烟为事。吃迷了，睡着不醒。一连几夜，把个菊花熬得清水直流。且自三月内修肾之后，虽然壮观了些，其实不中用。","en":"night, with lamps lit, he did nothing but smoke opium. Lost in the pipe, he slept like the dead. Night after night, Juhua was left with clear fluids running. And since that \\"kidney repair\\" in the third month, though the thing looked more imposing, it was in truth useless."},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":12,"tokens":["菊花"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一来疙疙瘩瘩，皮肉粗了，而且周围不甚平整，兼之头重脚轻，虽见头脑狰狞，其实根株疲软，只好停顿多而纵送少。菊花才二十几岁，火盆似的，如何能常吃那粗粝东西？一日，奚十一带了胡八出门去了，与唐和尚商量。一轮晴日，满照明窗，菊花梳了头，好不纳闷。无意之间到外边来散步，走到跟班房门口，见关着门，里面有笑声。菊花轻轻的在门缝里一张，见春兰弯着腰在炕边，看有四只脚站在一","en":"root-weak. It was fierce-looking at the head but soft at the base, good for long pauses but poor for thrusting. Juhua was only in her twenties, a brazier of appetite. How could she constantly endure that coarse implement? One day Xi Eleven took Hu Eight out on business and went to consult Monk Tang. Under a clear sun filling the bright windows Juhua dressed her hair,"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":15,"tokens":["菊花"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"奚十一忽从怀中摸出个纸包看看，重又揣好了。菊花问是什么东西，奚十一道：「宝贝。」菊花道：「给我瞧瞧。」奚十一道：「停一停，用的时候给你瞧。」菊花笑嘻嘻的一骨碌爬了过来，伏在奚十一身上，在怀里掏了出来，解开一看，是几条白绫带子，便道：「呸，这个宝贝！用也用了几十条了，不见得什么稀奇。现在还有几条存","en":"Xi Eleven suddenly fished a paper packet from his breast, glanced at it, and tucked it away again. Juhua asked what it was. Xi said it was a treasure. \\"Let me see,\\" she demanded. \\"Wait, when it's time to use it, I'll show you,\\" he replied. Juhua giggled, scrambled over, and fished it from his breast. Unwrapped, it was several strips of white silk ribbon."},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":3,"tokens":["菊花"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"奚十一知他难受，便把腰一弓，头到门口，忽然如针刺的一疼，急拔了出来。菊花坐起，披上衣服，道：「这带子怎么这般利害？」奚十一道：「你里头怎样的？」菊花道：「起头甚好，后来便如炭火一样，直烧到心里来。方才你吃的什么药？以后不要吃他了。」奚十一道：「太吃多了。那卖药的说只要用一丸，我倒吃了三丸。但不知什么意思，涨得我那龟头上也","en":"He arched his waist, pointed his head toward the door, then felt a stab like needles and yanked free in haste. Juhua sat up and threw on clothes, \\"How can a ribbon be that vicious?\\" Xi asked how it felt inside. Juhua shuddered, \\"Fine at first, then like live coals straight to the heart. What pills did you take? Never again.\\" Xi admitted, \\"I took too many. The seller"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":1,"tokens":["菊花"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"看洋货，正屋看书画，后楼是看珍玩珠宝。若要看花卉并上等的古玩，请到园里去。」奚十一道：「我都要请教请教。」先将菊花的东西点了出来，果然精致，价也不昂。又要了些零碎东西，共花了十金。便要看看古董、花木，即同亮轩走到中间正屋来。从人揭开帘子，见是两面大玻璃窗，屋中摆设精雅，名人书画挂了好些。两边是画橱、书架，还有些陈设古玩。那个伙计叫了一声：「乌大爷！有客来了。」听","en":"jewels. For flowers and fine antiques, please go to the garden.\\" Xi said, \\"I'll see everything.\\" He first ordered Juhua's goods, which proved exquisite and not dear, added some trifles, spent ten taels in all, and then asked to view antiques and plants. With Liangxuan he went to the central hall. Servants lifted the curtain to reveal two large glass windows, elegant furnishings,"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":5,"tokens":["菊花"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"到了家，进了房，见菊花捆绉纱包头，两太阳帖了两个小红膏药，两眼水汪汪的靠在枕上。奚十一将花袖给他看了，菊花才有笑容，软洋洋的坐不起来。奚十一道：「怎么样？」菊花道：「今日觉得不舒服。」奚十一摸他的手有些发热，便笑道：「昨日弄伤了？」菊花笑道：「或者脱衣时冒了风。你出去后忽","en":"At home he entered the bedroom and found Juhua with a crêpe band wound around her head and a little red plaster on each temple. Her eyes were wet and languid as she leaned against the pillow, too weak to sit upright. Xi showed her the sleeves, and she smiled at last and lay limp, unable to sit. Xi"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":1,"tokens":["菊花"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"个法子要收拾他们，又因有些阔人护着，他自己相与的都是些没有势力的，又因出京已近，闹出事来于功名有碍，只能罢了。菊花一连病了几日，奚十一的春药不能发试，心中便闷。","en":"circle lacked influence. His departure was near, and a scandal might harm his career, so he had to let it drop. Juhua was ill several days running. Xi's spring drugs could not be tested, and he grew restless."},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":1,"tokens":["菊花"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"了几杯，烟又多吹了几口，到二更后才回，醉醺醺的。底下那东西甚是作怪，时刻直竖起来，头上痒飕飕的，好不难受。看看菊花口里哼哼唧唧的，身上火炭一般，嘴唇皮结得很厚，鼻子里热气直冲，心里不忍。但可恨那东西，不知为什么不肯安静，便想着英官多时没有做这件事了，又想道：「这个兔子与别人不同，真是屁中之精，近来嫌我不好，勉勉强强的，今日我要收拾这个兔崽子。」酒醉模模糊糊，吃了","en":"second watch, thoroughly drunk. Below, his member misbehaved, stiffening constantly, the tip itching unbearably. Juhua moaned in bed, her body hot as charcoal, her lips thickly crusted, and breath scorching from her nose, and he pitied her. Yet the thing would not rest. He thought how long it had been since he had done that with Yingguan. He mused, \\"This rabbit isn't"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":8,"tokens":["菊花"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"的阳物血淋淋的只有半截，再看英官的屁股，也是血淋淋的，脏头拖出三四寸。众人个个失色，便大惊小怪乱闹起来，忙报与菊花知道。菊花听了，急得一身透汗，也顾不得病，穿上衣裳，着了裤子，袜子也穿不及，趿上鞋，把衣衿掩好，只扣了外面钮子，直跌直晃的出来。姬亮轩也睡了，听得闹便也赶出来，穿上袜子，披上长衣，竟忘记穿裤子，慌慌张张赶到书房里，正与菊花撞个满怀，也不及回避，乱嘈嘈","en":"bloody three- or four-inch length of flesh protruding. Everyone paled and raised a clamor, and they sent word to Juhua. She broke out in a cold sweat, forgot her sickness, threw on a jacket and trousers, could not wait for socks, slipped into shoes, buttoned her outer coat only, and stumbled out. Ji Liangxuan was asleep but heard the noise, pulled on socks and a long"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":3,"tokens":["菊花"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"也醒转来。亮轩把蜡灯放在旁边，揉了一会，恐怕水溅了袍子，便将前衿提起些。此时心里痛苦，再想不起自己没有穿裤子。菊花坐在炕上，亮轩蹲在地下，却是对面，中间放了一个蜡灯。菊花一手摸着奚十一心坎，回头看他服事英官。只见亮轩两腿中间垂着一根肉柱，头锐根粗，倒有四寸来长，好个怪样。亮轩身子微动，那物也摆来摆去。菊花看了，心中一动，便扭转了头，又不好意思说他。但门外还有些人","en":"candle nearby. Fearing a splash on his robe, he lifted his front hem, too distraught to recall he wore no trousers. Juhua sat on the kang, hand on Xi's chest, and glanced back at Ji tending Yingguan. She saw between Ji's legs a flesh column hanging, the tip sharp and root thick, near four inches, grotesque. When Ji moved, it swayed. Her heart jumped, and she looked away,"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":3,"tokens":["菊花"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"少顷医生来，亮轩又同进来。那医生先将灯照一照，然后诊了脉，菊花远远的坐着。那医生道：「今番难治了，这个除非神仙才能。」菊花求道：「先生，你行个方便，医好了我们老爷，你要多少谢仪，我一毫也不少你的。」那医生道：「奶奶，医生有割股之心，最肯行方便的，倒是奶奶你不肯行方便。他本是个残疾，修治好了，也只可随意用用，那里","en":"Soon the doctor arrived, and Ji came in with him. He held the lamp to look, then felt the pulse while Juhua sat at a distance. The doctor said, \\"This time it's grave. Only a god could cure it.\\" Juhua begged, \\"Sir, please save our master. Whatever fee you ask I will pay.\\" The doctor said, \\"Madam, doctors have hearts to cut their own flesh. We gladly oblige,"},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":3,"tokens":["菊花"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话焉能文气？天天的把那卵放在手里盘弄，觉得这个字顺口得很，没有忌讳了。」便又说道：「杀只鸡来，要一块活鸡皮。」菊花即叫人割了一块活鸡皮来。那阳善修拿些药和鸡皮捣烂了，与他洗净了血，敷上了药。也与从前一样的治法，留了一服药煎了与他吃，明日再来看罢。亮轩又同他去看英官，阳善修也与他几味药吃了，说道：「这个不要紧，明日就缩进去的。」阳善修去了，菊花就在书房中睡，陪了奚","en":"word rolls off the tongue, with no taboo.\\" He added, \\"Kill a chicken, and bring a piece of living chicken skin.\\" Juhua sent for it. Yang Shanxiu mashed medicine with the skin, washed away the blood, and applied the dressing in the same method as before. He left a decoction for him to drink and said he would return tomorrow. Ji went with him to Yingguan, and Yang gave"},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":2,"tokens":["菊花"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"阳善修说道：「从此你要戒淫才好，若再把根子弄散了，那就有性命之忧，不如吃两剂寒凉药，断了性罢。」奚十一无奈，与菊花商量，菊花也只得由他。遂听了阳善修，吃了十剂凉药，从此春蚕如死，再不起性了。又谢了阳善修五十两。","en":"life is at risk. Better to take cooling drafts and kill the urge altogether.\\" Xi had no choice, so he consulted Juhua, who could only agree. He followed Yang's prescription of ten doses of cold medicine, and thereafter his spring silkworm died, with no more rising. He thanked Yang with fifty taels."},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":2,"tokens":["菊花"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"菊花便守了活寡。不知果然是真守，还是假守，这也不能查他。外面确做出那从良极正派的样子来，以博虚名。菊花恨极英官，等他脏头好了，痛打了一顿，撵他出去。姬亮轩馆地要紧，也只可忍心割爱。","en":"Juhua kept a \\"widow's vigil,\\" whether truly or for show could not be checked. Outwardly she played the utmost respectability to win a name. She hated Yingguan bitterly. When his wound healed she beat him soundly and drove him out. Ji Liangxuan needed his tutoring"},{"paragraph":30,"mentions":1,"tokens":["菊花"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"奚十一病好之后，带了菊花赴任，潘三打发伙计同去讨账。唐和尚倒十分惆怅，又请了几天，临行与得月送出城外，倒算个全始全终的交情了。潘三因脸上有病，不好见风，这月内总不出门。","en":"After Xi Eleven recovered, he took Juhua to his post. Pan the Third sent clerks along to collect the debt. Monk Tang was quite melancholy and kept him several extra days. On leaving, he and Deyue escorted Xi beyond the city, cementing a friendship complete in courtesy. Pan the Third, due to"},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":1,"tokens":["白菊花"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"叙起他们一件闲事来。今年六月初六，唐和尚生日，请潘三、奚十一在庙里吃面，又备了两桌送与白菊花、石氏。石氏处是打发得月送去。这石氏见了得月那个模样，中心甚是爱他，给了他许多东西，便要他做干儿子。得月岂有不肯，便拜了干娘，以后常常叫他来走动。得月若来，必陪着石氏吃饭，或时抹牌顽耍。又知道潘三爱男风，必想得月，不许他进来窥探，潘三竟不敢进来，只好","en":"Tang's birthday, he invited Pan the Third and Xi Eleven to the temple for noodles, and sent two tables to Bai Juhua and to Lady Shi. Lady Shi's table went by Deyue. Lady Shi took one look at Deyue and loved him, gave him many gifts, and asked him to be her godson. Deyue agreed at once, kowtowed to his godmother, and afterward was often summoned to visit. When Deyue"}]}`),"char-138":JSON.parse(`{"33":[{"paragraph":24,"mentions":1,"tokens":["得月"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"和尚得意洋洋的道：「小徒叫得月，今年十五岁了，念经唱曲都也将就，就是爱顽皮，我总不许他出门，三老爷不知从何处见他？」富三爷笑得两眼瞇，齐说道：「待我想来。」想了一回，忽然的大笑道：「呸！我记错了，我认是大悲庵的姑子，实在像得很。」说得聘才大笑，小和尚涨红了脸。唐和尚笑道：「三老爷","en":"The monk boasted proudly, \\"My disciple is named Deyue; he is fifteen this year. He's decent at reciting sutras and singing, but he's quite mischievous, so I never allow him out. Master Third, where might you have seen him?\\" Master Fu the Third, eyes crinkling with a smile, said, \\"Let me think.\\" After a"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":4,"tokens":["得月"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"午，才见聘才的人来摆桌子，放杯箸。富三道：「你可不要费事。」聘才道：「没有什么可吃的。」于是分宾主坐了，富三叫得月也坐了。唐和尚命得月同着蓉官斟酒。富三见果碟小吃已摆满了一桌，便道：「作什么，都拿开，留四碟就够了。」便叫留下山鸡丝、火腿、倭瓜子、杏仁。蓉官道：「慢些，慢些！」便抢了一碟橘子，又抓了一把金橘道：「你不爱吃，还有人爱吃呢。」一连上了九样菜，倒也很好滋","en":"Pincai replied, \\"There isn't much to eat.\\" Thus, they took their seats as host and guests, and Fu the Third invited Deyue to sit as well. Monk Tang ordered Deyue and Rongguan to pour the wine. Seeing the table filled with small fruit plates, Fu the Third said, \\"What is all this? Take them away; just keep four plates, that will be enough.\\" He requested to keep the shredded"}],"34":[{"paragraph":21,"mentions":2,"tokens":["得月"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"」子佩道：「是软篷子里小剃头。」聘才笑道：「呸！你怎么说这些人？」子佩道：「你别轻看他，他比相公还红呢！你瞧那得月的脑袋怎样？」聘才道：「好是好的，然而我不爱他，光光的头有甚趣味！」子佩道：「可不！若说天香、翠官，比得月的相貌还要好些。你不信，明日先叫他来，你瞧瞧好就叫他。」聘才道：「也使得。」","en":"people?\\" Zipei said, \\"Don't look down on them—they are even more in vogue than the actors! What do you make of Deyue's head?\\" Pincai said, \\"Fine enough, but I don't fancy him—what charm is there in a shaven pate?\\" Zipei said, \\"Just so! And as for Tianxiang and Cuiguan, their looks are finer than Deyue's. If you don't believe me, call them over tomorrow first; have"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":1,"tokens":["得月"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"梳完了又捶了一会。那一个也与子佩梳了，然后吃过早饭，开了烟灯，大家吃烟。富三爷先来，唐和尚见富三爷来了，就带了得月进来。天香、翠官与富三、和尚都请了安。富三却不认识，问他是谁，在那一班的，聘才就说是全福班的。随后奚十一、潘三同来。奚十一带了巴英官，潘三带了个学徒弟的小伙计，拿他竟当做跟班的。大家一齐相见了。潘三见了天香、翠官，笑道：「你们怎么也跑了来？」奚十一道","en":"lit, and everyone partook. Fu the Third was the first guest to arrive, and upon seeing him, Monk Tang brought Deyue in. Tianxiang and Cuiguan paid their respects to Fu the Third and the monk. Fu the Third, not recognizing them, asked who they were and which troupe they belonged to; Pincai smoothly claimed they were from the Quanfu Troupe. Soon after, Xi Eleven and"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":8,"tokens":["得月"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"众人看了，一齐大笑。奚十一对着得月道：「你师父天天这么着吗？」得月「呸」了一声，涨红了脸，扭转头不看。唐和尚合着掌道：「阿弥陀佛！罪过，罪过！」此时坐的是富三首席，聘才叫翠官陪了他。第二是奚十一，唐和尚知他是个阔手，且知道他爱得月，便叫得月陪了他。杨八坐了第三，聘才叫天香挨着他。潘三","en":"Everyone looked and erupted in laughter. Xi Eleven turned to Deyue and teased, \\"Does your master do this every day?\\" Deyue spat out a \\"Pah!\\", his face flushing crimson, and turned his head away, refusing to look. Monk Tang pressed his palms together and chanted, \\"Amitabha! Sinful, how sinful!\\" By this time, the seating"},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":1,"tokens":["得月"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"了。」便互相与唐和尚豁了几拳。闹了一个多时辰，奚十一瘾来了，便叫巴英官拿出烟具来。灯是开现成的，奚十一躺下，叫得月陪他吹烟，两个剃头的也有烟瘾。都聚拢来。唐和尚见了，即连打了两个呵欠，伸了个懒腰。看得奚十一瘾大，等不及，便到自己房中过瘾去了。","en":"ordered Ba Yingguan to bring out the smoking gear. The lamps were already lit; Xi Eleven lay down and commanded Deyue to join him in smoking. The two barbers, also being addicts, crowded around as well. Seeing this, Monk Tang let out two large yawns and stretched his back. Noting the severity of Xi Eleven's craving, Tang decided he couldn't wait and retreated to his"},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":2,"tokens":["得月"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"便索性扒上富三身上，将头在富三肩上碰了几碰，说道：「我就磕头谢了！好三老爷，好亲爸爸！」富三乐得受不得。潘三见得月躺在奚十一怀里，天香躺在对面，杨八也想吹一口，便坐在炕沿上，歪转身子，压在天香身上。得月上好了一口，杨八接了过来，拨开毛冗冗的胡子，抽了一抽，口涎直流下来，点点滴滴，烟枪上也沾了好些，他就把皮袖子擦擦嘴再抽。枪又堵住了，天香欲替他通通，身子被他压住难","en":"thanks! Good Third Master, good dear father!\\" Fu the Third was overwhelmed with delight. Pan the Third, observing Deyue lounging in Xi Eleven's arms and Tianxiang lying opposite them, decided he wanted a puff of opium as well. He moved to the edge of the kang, twisted his body, and leaned heavily against Tianxiang. Deyue finished preparing a pipe of opium, and Yang Eight"},{"paragraph":30,"mentions":3,"tokens":["得月"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"杨八道：「这个我也是初学。」便勉强吸了一口，烧得很焦枯臭，放下枪。天香道：「你别压住了我，我替你烧。」那边得月枕在奚十一手上，奚十一又摸他的屁股。得月要起来，奚十一将一条腿压住了他，得月无法，只好任其抚摩。奚十一一盒子烟已完了，便叫巴英官拿烟来。英官远远的站在一边，正在那里发气。奚十一叫了两三声，方才答道：「没有了。」奚十一道：「怎么没有？我还有个大盒子在袋","en":"the pipe down in defeat. Tianxiang said, \\"Stop pinning me down like this; I'll prepare it for you.\\" Meanwhile, Deyue was resting his head on Xi Eleven's arm as Xi Eleven continued to grope his backside. Deyue tried to rise, but Xi Eleven pinned him down with one leg; with no other recourse, Deyue had to endure the fondling. Xi Eleven finished an entire box of opium"},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":3,"tokens":["得月"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"得月忙取时，不提防将灯碰翻，「当」的一声，把个玻璃罩子砸破了，还溅了奚十一一脸的油。得月颇不好意思，奚十一道：「不妨。」忙将手巾抹了，坐了过来，要盆水净了脸。一件猞狮裘上也洒了几点，也抹干净了。聘才的人忙换了一盏灯，擦了盘子。得月将盒子揭开看时，果然是空","en":"As Deyue scrambled to retrieve it, he carelessly knocked the lamp over with a loud clatter, shattering the glass chimney and splashing oil all over Xi Eleven's face. Deyue was deeply mortified, but Xi Eleven brushed it off, saying, \\"It's nothing.\\" He quickly"}],"40":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["得月"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，真是可笑，一味的弃旧怜新。从前买了春兰，也待得甚好，不到半年就冷淡了。去年得了巴英官，如获至宝，如今又弄上了得月、卓天香，将英官也疏远起来。","en":"Last year he had acquired Ba Yingguan, whom he treasured like a rare gem; but now he had entangled himself with Deyue and Zhuo Tianxiang, and had already grown cold toward Ba Yingguan."},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":4,"tokens":["得月"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"裤，剃得逼清的光头。奚十一看了动火，脱了外面长衣，倒身躺下，轻轻的解了他的带子，把裤子扯了一半下来，贴身服侍。得月惊醒，扭转头一看，见了奚十一，便说道：「来不得。」奚十一不听，得月又说道：「当真来不得。」奚十一还当是他做作，故意进了一步，只听得得月腹内咕噜咕噜的一响。得月连说「不好」，身子一动，一股热气直冒出来。奚十一觉得底下如热水一泡的光景，急忙退出，「口咨」","en":"quietly untied his sash, and pulled his trousers halfway down, pressing close against him in intimate service. Deyue woke with a start, turned his head, saw Xi Eleven, and said, \\"You mustn't do this.\\" Xi Eleven paid him no heed. Deyue said again, \\"I really mean it — you mustn't do this.\\" Xi Eleven still thought he was playing coy and deliberately pressed a step forward"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":1,"tokens":["得月"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"得月跟着下来，往下就蹲，哗喇喇的一响，已是一大滩，臭不可当。奚十一掩着鼻子瞧那地下，还有些似脓似血的东西。","en":"Deyue scrambled down after him and immediately squatted on the floor; with a great rushing sound he released a massive puddle — the stench was overpowering. Xi Eleven held his nose and peered at the floor; among the filth there seemed to be something resembling"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":2,"tokens":["得月"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"奚十一找了些纸，抹了一会，裤裆上连带子上也沾了好些，一一抹了。得月皱着眉挪了挪，方才撒完了起来。不好叫人收拾，自己到煤炉里撮些灰掩上，扫净了。奚十一道：「我怎样好，快拿盆水来洗洗。」得月道：「我原说来不得，你不听。」便找了小沙盆，舀了些水，将块脚布与他，奚十一将就抹了一把。","en":"the crotch of his trousers and even his sash ties had caught a fair amount, and he wiped them clean one by one. Deyue wrinkled his brow, shifted himself aside, and only then finished and rose. Since they could not call anyone in to clean it up, Deyue himself scooped some ash from the coal brazier to cover it and swept it clean. Xi Eleven said, \\"What am I to do — hurry"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":3,"tokens":["得月"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"得月重又躺下，奚十一好不扫兴。得月道：「我身子不快，且走肚子，懒得说话，你去罢。」奚十一只得出来，却好碰着卓天香进来，撞个满怀。奚十一道：「和尚与魏大爷都不在家，得月病了，懒应酬，不要进去了。」天香道：「我们还到魏老爷那边去坐坐罢，他虽不在家，也可坐得的","en":"Deyue lay back down. Xi Eleven felt his mood thoroughly spoiled. Deyue said, \\"My body is unwell and my stomach is unsettled; I'm too lethargic to speak. You had better go.\\" Xi Eleven had no choice but to emerge, and happened to bump squarely into Zhuo Tianxiang"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":1,"tokens":["得月"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"原来唐和尚这几天见得月气色不正，指甲发青，知他受了毒气，便用了一剂攻毒泻火的泻药，昨日已泻了好几遍，适奚十一来承受了，由肾经直入心经。奚十一身子是空虚的，再与天香闹了一次，而天香又新染了哈小回子的疮毒，也叫奚十一收来。两毒齐发，甚为沉重。少顷，和尚来问其得病之由，奚十一只","en":"Now, the monk Tang had for several days observed that Deyue's complexion was irregular and his fingernails were turning blue; knowing he had absorbed some toxic substance, he had administered a purging decoction to attack the poison and reduce the fever. Yesterday Deyue had purged several times — just as Xi Eleven"}],"47":[{"paragraph":5,"mentions":5,"tokens":["得月"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，封了五十两银子，叫英官拿了。到了寺门口，见间壁开了个饭庄子，挂着招牌，写着安吉堂。奚十一也不理会，到寺中见了得月，有些恨上心来，把他肩上狠狠的拧了一把。得月嚷道：「做什么使劲的拧我？」奚十一笑道：「你害得我好苦，病了一个多月不算，把那子孙桩也锯掉了半截，教我做了个废人，我好不恨你。」得月把眼狠狠的瞅了他一下，冷笑了一声，道：「你不知那里沾了来，倒来冤我！我好好","en":"door, its signboard reading Peaceful Fortune Hall. Paying it no mind, he entered the temple, where the sight of Deyue roused his resentment, and he gave the boy's shoulder a vicious twist. Deyue cried out: \\"Why are you twisting me so hard?\\" Xi Eleven smiled grimly: \\"You made me suffer bitterly. Not only was I bedridden for a month, but you sawed off half my family pillar"}],"58":[{"paragraph":20,"mentions":1,"tokens":["得月"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"了潘三来，潘三打发人来说：「跌坏了鼻子，要避风，不能来。」奚十一、唐和尚都疑潘三怪了，是托辞的。那日奚十一见了得月，想与他叙叙，无奈唐和尚在前，只得忍住，酒也多喝了几杯，烟又多吹了几口，到二更后才回，醉醺醺的。底下那东西甚是作怪，时刻直竖起来，头上痒飕飕的，好不难受。看看菊花口里哼哼唧唧的，身上火炭一般，嘴唇皮结得很厚，鼻子里热气直冲，心里不忍。但可恨那东西，不","en":"the wind, so he could not come. Xi and Monk Tang suspected Pan was sulking and making excuses. That day Xi saw Deyue and wished to renew acquaintance, but with Monk Tang present he held back. He drank extra cups, smoked extra pipes, and only returned past the second watch, thoroughly drunk. Below, his member misbehaved, stiffening constantly, the tip itching unbearably."},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":1,"tokens":["得月"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"慢的走来，道：「看什么？不是又有了翡翠镯子了。」奚十一坐起，拉了过来，抱了他。英官冷笑道：「闹什么鬼？我又不是得月、卓天香，肏了要烂鸡巴的，我们好好的家伙为什么要装这个狗鸡巴？」奚十一道：「好屁话。」便拽起长衣，扯开裤子，那物脱颖而出，见了英官，怒吽吽的跳突起来。英官一呆，一手攥住了，笑道：「怎么今日改了样儿了？想是得了缺了，所以挺胸凸肚，不似候选时那绒头绒脑的","en":"bracelets?\\" Xi sat up, pulled him over, and embraced him. Yingguan sneered, \\"What ghost are you playing? I'm not Deyue or Zhuo Tianxiang, who get fucked till their cocks rot. We have good gear of our own — why fit this dog's cock?\\" Xi dismissed him, \\"Bullshit,\\" and, \\"Fine talk.\\" He hiked his long robe and opened his trousers. The thing sprang free and reared at Yingguan."},{"paragraph":30,"mentions":1,"tokens":["得月"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"奚十一病好之后，带了菊花赴任，潘三打发伙计同去讨账。唐和尚倒十分惆怅，又请了几天，临行与得月送出城外，倒算个全始全终的交情了。潘三因脸上有病，不好见风，这月内总不出门。","en":"along to collect the debt. Monk Tang was quite melancholy and kept him several extra days. On leaving, he and Deyue escorted Xi beyond the city, cementing a friendship complete in courtesy. Pan the Third, due to facial trouble, avoided the wind and did not go out that month."},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":5,"tokens":["得月"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"起他们一件闲事来。今年六月初六，唐和尚生日，请潘三、奚十一在庙里吃面，又备了两桌送与白菊花、石氏。石氏处是打发得月送去。这石氏见了得月那个模样，中心甚是爱他，给了他许多东西，便要他做干儿子。得月岂有不肯，便拜了干娘，以后常常叫他来走动。得月若来，必陪着石氏吃饭，或时抹牌顽耍。又知道潘三爱男风，必想得月，不许他进来窥探，潘三竟不敢进来，只好暗地垂涎。一日活该闹出事","en":"Xi Eleven to the temple for noodles, and sent two tables to Bai Juhua and to Lady Shi. Lady Shi's table went by Deyue. Lady Shi took one look at Deyue and loved him, gave him many gifts, and asked him to be her godson. Deyue agreed at once, kowtowed to his godmother, and afterward was often summoned to visit. When Deyue came he dined with Lady Shi or played cards. Knowing"},{"paragraph":33,"mentions":7,"tokens":["得月"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"得月来看干娘，那日天气很热，见石氏在房中将席子铺在地上，穿件没有领子的白罗布短袖汗衫，却也大镶大滚，只齐到腰间，穿条桃红纱裤，四寸金莲，甚是伶俏，两鬓茉莉花如雪，胸前映出个红纱兜肚，眉目澄清，肌肤白腻，实足动人。叫得月也在席上坐了，又叫小丫鬟拿了水果儿、","en":"Deyue came to see his godmother on a very hot day. Lady Shi had spread a mat on the floor in her room and wore a collarless white ramie short summer shirt, wide-bordered, reaching only her waist, with peach-red gauze trousers and four-inch golden lotuses,"},{"paragraph":34,"mentions":8,"tokens":["得月"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"潘其观驮了个小小石碑，尚不知觉，一心倒想顽那得月。后来也有些疑心，看出石氏待得月的情景。过了两月，心生一计。一日，候着得月进来，半路截留，邀他到一间书房内，开了一个灯，与他吃烟。潘三睡在得月后头，摸摸索索，得月不肯。潘三道：「你若不依我，我便不许你进来。你们娘儿两个做的事，当我不知道么？我不过不肯","en":"Pan Qiguan carried that little stone tablet on his back without noticing, his mind only on sporting with Deyue. Later he grew suspicious and read how Lady Shi treated Deyue. After two months he formed a plan. One day he intercepted Deyue halfway to a visit, pulled him into a study, lit a lamp, and smoked with him. Pan lay behind Deyue, fumbling, but Deyue refused."},{"paragraph":35,"mentions":4,"tokens":["得月"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"石氏那日约定得月早饭后来的，等了好一会，还不见来，心里也恐潘三半路打劫。他悄悄的到书房来，见关上门，更加疑心。听了一听，觉两人切切促促的私语，听不明白，便轻轻的走到窗下来。见又下了卷窗，便将舌尖舔破了纸一望，见潘三抱着得月坐在身上，两脸相偎，索索的动。一看心中大怒，","en":"That day Lady Shi had arranged for Deyue to come after breakfast. She waited long without him and feared Pan would intercept. Quietly she went to the study and found the door shut, raising more suspicion. Listening, she heard whispers she could not make out, and crept to the window. The blind"},{"paragraph":37,"mentions":2,"tokens":["得月"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"？」便使劲一个嘴巴，潘三「啊哟」一声，血流满面，也顾不得胡子，死命的挣脱了，胡子已挦去了半边。石氏怒气未息，把得月光头上凿了几个栗暴，脸上拧了两把。得月战战兢兢，双膝跪下求饶，石氏又可怜他，拧了他的耳朵，同了进去。","en":"could not mind his beard and wrenched free, with half the whiskers torn away. Lady Shi still raged. She rapped Deyue's head, twisted his cheeks. Deyue trembled, knelt, and begged. Pitying him, she dragged him by the ear inside."},{"paragraph":38,"mentions":1,"tokens":["得月"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"巴，这个便害臀风，那个接狗肾，这个便掏粪门，那个断龟头，这个又抓鼻子，你说奇不奇，谁也想不出这个理来。只便宜了得月这个小秃厮，害了两人做了残疾，他倒好端端的又拜了一个好干娘。不知后事如何，且听下回分解。","en":"the other had his gate dug; one lost a glans, one lost a nose. It was odd, and there was no logic to it. Only Deyue, that little bald wretch, profited from the whole calamity: he had left two men maimed and emerged with a powerful and affectionate godmother What followed, hear in the next chapter."}]}`),"char-139":JSON.parse(`{"8":[{"paragraph":6,"mentions":1,"tokens":["天香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"？」仲雨道：「我那里有工夫听戏？清早到锦春园华公府走了一走，出来又到怡园徐二爷处商量件事，遂同起盛银号潘老三在天香楼吃了饭。昨日宏济寺的唐和尚，有件事约我在这里等他。」说罢拿出了玉烟壶，递与聘才，聘才接了过来。元茂此时方想起是初六那一天见过的，重叙了几句寒温。仲雨又将烟壶递与元茂，元茂不知好歹，当着闻痧药的，一闻即连打了七八个嚏喷，眼泪鼻涕一齐出来，惹得仲雨、聘","en":"Garden, then went to Master Xu's place at the Garden of Contentment to discuss a matter. Afterward, I dined at Tianxiang Pavilion with Third Brother Pan of the Qisheng Bank. Yesterday, Monk Tang of the Hongji Monastery arranged to meet me here on business.\\" As he spoke, he produced a jade snuff bottle and handed it to Pincai, who accepted it graciously. Yuanmao suddenly"}],"34":[{"paragraph":21,"mentions":2,"tokens":["卓天香","天香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"很好，叫他也便宜，而且你还可以常使唤他，相貌也与袁宝珠、苏蕙芳相并。」聘才道：「叫什么名字？」子佩道：「一个叫卓天香，一个叫张翠官。」聘才道：「现在那班里？」子佩道：「在整容班。」聘才道：「整容班这班名很生，我竟没有领教过。」子佩道：「是软篷子里小剃头。」聘才笑道：「呸！你怎么说这些人？」子佩道：「你别轻看他，他比相公还红呢！你瞧那得月的脑袋怎样？」聘才道：「好是","en":"comparison with Yuan Baozhu and Su Huifang.\\" Pincai asked, \\"What are their names?\\" Zipei said, \\"One is called Zhuo Tianxiang, the other Zhang Cuiguan.\\" Pincai asked, \\"Which troupe are they in now?\\" Zipei said, \\"The Zhengrong troupe.\\" Pincai said, \\"The Zhengrong troupe—that name is unfamiliar; I have never had the pleasure.\\" Zipei said, \\"They are the little barbers of the soft-awning"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":3,"tokens":["天香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"了两个，贵大爷病了，张仲雨有事不能来。即补了冯子佩、唐和尚，宾主共七位。聘才叫了蓉官来陪富三，着人到篷子里叫了天香、翠官前来。不多一刻，两个剃头的也坐了大骡车，有一个人跟着，走进寺来。冯子佩是认识的，小剃头的先与子佩请了安，然后向聘才请安。聘才仔细看他，果然生得俊俏，眉目清澄，肌肤洁白，打扮的式样也与相公一般。天香的面色虽白，细看皮肤略粗。翠官伶俐可爱，就是面上","en":"seven host and guests. Pincai summoned Rongguan to accompany Fu the Third, and sent someone to the stall to fetch Tianxiang and Cuiguan. Before long, the two barber boys arrived at the temple in a large mule cart, accompanied by a servant. The younger barber, recognizing Zipei, paid his respects to him first before greeting Pincai. Pincai studied him carefully; he was indeed"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":2,"tokens":["天香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"了一会。那一个也与子佩梳了，然后吃过早饭，开了烟灯，大家吃烟。富三爷先来，唐和尚见富三爷来了，就带了得月进来。天香、翠官与富三、和尚都请了安。富三却不认识，问他是谁，在那一班的，聘才就说是全福班的。随后奚十一、潘三同来。奚十一带了巴英官，潘三带了个学徒弟的小伙计，拿他竟当做跟班的。大家一齐相见了。潘三见了天香、翠官，笑道：「你们怎么也跑了来？」奚十一道：「看来，","en":"everyone partook. Fu the Third was the first guest to arrive, and upon seeing him, Monk Tang brought Deyue in. Tianxiang and Cuiguan paid their respects to Fu the Third and the monk. Fu the Third, not recognizing them, asked who they were and which troupe they belonged to; Pincai smoothly claimed they were from the Quanfu Troupe. Soon after, Xi Eleven and Pan the Third"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":1,"tokens":["天香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"人作了个揖，说：「今日有个内城朋友请我去看阳宅，闹了一天，并邀我去给他们看地，也不过是想外放。」聘才因叫翠官、天香过来见了，说：「这就是很会看风水的杨八老爷，你们何不求他去看看你们的棚子，多会儿发财呢？」富三因接向杨八道：「你要留神呀，不要像乌家的事，看完了找到你门上去。」说罢大家大笑。冯子佩忽然皱了眉说声不好，便到院子里吐起来。慌得大家同来看他。吐了一会，就脸","en":"to evaluate some land for them—they're likely hoping for a provincial appointment.\\" Pincai called Cuiguan and Tianxiang over to meet him, introducing him by saying, \\"This is Master Yang Eight, who is highly skilled in reading fengshui. Why don't you beg him to inspect your stall and tell you when you'll strike it rich?\\" Catching the joke, Fu the Third chimed in, \\"You'd"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":4,"tokens":["天香","卓天香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"首席，聘才叫翠官陪了他。第二是奚十一，唐和尚知他是个阔手，且知道他爱得月，便叫得月陪了他。杨八坐了第三，聘才叫天香挨着他。潘三坐了第四，自己与唐和尚坐了主位，只不见蓉官来。饮酒之间，撒村笑骂，嘈杂到个不成样子。还是富三稳重些，不过与翠官说些顽笑话，尚不至十分村俗。奚十一手拿了杯子灌那得月，一手伸在得月屁股后头，闹得得月一个腰扭来扭去，两个肩膀闪得一高一低，水汪汪","en":"had a fondness for Deyue, Monk Tang told Deyue to sit with him. Yang Eight took the third seat, and Pincai had Tianxiang sit next to him. Pan the Third sat in the fourth seat, while Pincai and Monk Tang occupied the host's positions. Only Rongguan was absent. As the wine flowed, the conversation devolved into vulgar shouting and coarse jokes, becoming a chaotic, unsightly"},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":3,"tokens":["天香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"将头在富三肩上碰了几碰，说道：「我就磕头谢了！好三老爷，好亲爸爸！」富三乐得受不得。潘三见得月躺在奚十一怀里，天香躺在对面，杨八也想吹一口，便坐在炕沿上，歪转身子，压在天香身上。得月上好了一口，杨八接了过来，拨开毛冗冗的胡子，抽了一抽，口涎直流下来，点点滴滴，烟枪上也沾了好些，他就把皮袖子擦擦嘴再抽。枪又堵住了，天香欲替他通通，身子被他压住难动。杨八便检了根签子","en":"father!\\" Fu the Third was overwhelmed with delight. Pan the Third, observing Deyue lounging in Xi Eleven's arms and Tianxiang lying opposite them, decided he wanted a puff of opium as well. He moved to the edge of the kang, twisted his body, and leaned heavily against Tianxiang. Deyue finished preparing a pipe of opium, and Yang Eight took it. Parting his thick, unkempt beard,"},{"paragraph":30,"mentions":1,"tokens":["天香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"杨八道：「这个我也是初学。」便勉强吸了一口，烧得很焦枯臭，放下枪。天香道：「你别压住了我，我替你烧。」那边得月枕在奚十一手上，奚十一又摸他的屁股。得月要起来，奚十一将一条腿压住了他，得月无法，只好任其抚摩。奚十一一盒子烟已完了，便叫巴英官拿烟来。英官远远的站在一边，正在那里发气。奚十一叫了两三声，方才答道：「没有了。」","en":"puff, but he burned the opium until it was charred and foul-smelling, finally setting the pipe down in defeat. Tianxiang said, \\"Stop pinning me down like this; I'll prepare it for you.\\" Meanwhile, Deyue was resting his head on Xi Eleven's arm as Xi Eleven continued to grope his backside. Deyue tried to rise, but Xi Eleven pinned him down with one leg; with no other recourse,"}],"35":[{"paragraph":4,"mentions":1,"tokens":["天香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"甩着袖子，急急走进来，见了众人，请了安，见要散的样子。富三道：「好红相公！十四日叫了，要十五日才来。」蓉官见了天香、翠官，便冷笑道：「既然大家要散了，也要回去。我还要叫剃头的剃头呢。」说罢，把腰一弯，竟自去了。两个剃头的甚是局促，众人也没有话说，各人上车而散。两个剃头的重新进来安慰，聘才每人赏了四两银子，欢喜而去。","en":"tease, \\"What a sought-after darling! Invited for the fourteenth, yet you only show up on the fifteenth.\\" Seeing Tianxiang and Cuiguan, Rongguan sneered, \\"Since everyone is about to scatter and go back, I should too. I still need to call the barbers to shave my head.\\" With a slight bow, he turned and left on his own. The two barbers felt extremely awkward, and the others"}],"36":[{"paragraph":14,"mentions":1,"tokens":["天香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一道：「你放心，我断不动粗的。我只要与他坐一坐，怎敢还想别的好处。我还有几样菜着人送来，你快把潘三也叫他出来，天香、翠官也撵开，就摆饭，我去去就来。」说罢，慌慌张张上车去了。","en":"could I dare hope for anything more? I have some dishes being sent over. Get Pan the Third out of there, send Tianxiang and Cuiguan away, and set the table. I'll be right back.\\" With that, he hurriedly got into his carriage and left."},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":1,"tokens":["天香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"聘才进来对潘三道：「和尚请你说话。」潘三不得已，迟延的出去，尚回顾了几次。聘才把天香、翠官也打发走了，便故意的对琴言道：「好了，清净了，我也被他们闹昏了，闹得一屋子俗臭不堪。我们如今清清净净谈谈，吃了早饭再去，自然有一会耽搁。」琴言一想，在聘才处吃饭也不妨。况且这些人都去了，自然没有人来，便问聘才道：「今年见过庾香几次了？」聘才随口","en":"wants to speak with you.\\" Reluctantly, Pan the Third dawdled out, looking back several times. Pincai then sent Tianxiang and Cuiguan away and feigned relief to Qinyan, \\"Ah, finally some peace and quiet. I was getting dizzy with all their noise, filling the room with such vulgar stench. Let's have a nice, quiet chat. We'll go after breakfast; a little delay won't matter.\\""}],"40":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["卓天香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"可笑，一味的弃旧怜新。从前买了春兰，也待得甚好，不到半年就冷淡了。去年得了巴英官，如获至宝，如今又弄上了得月、卓天香，将英官也疏远起来。","en":"he had acquired Ba Yingguan, whom he treasured like a rare gem; but now he had entangled himself with Deyue and Zhuo Tianxiang, and had already grown cold toward Ba Yingguan."},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":9,"tokens":["卓天香","天香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"得月重又躺下，奚十一好不扫兴。得月道：「我身子不快，且走肚子，懒得说话，你去罢。」奚十一只得出来，却好碰着卓天香进来，撞个满怀。奚十一道：「和尚与魏大爷都不在家，得月病了，懒应酬，不要进去了。」天香道：「我们还到魏老爷那边去坐坐罢，他虽不在家，也可坐得的。」奚十一无可无不可，就同了天香进去，叫聘才的家人沏了两碗茶，与天香闲谈。天香道：「今日我找魏老爷，要问他借","en":"lethargic to speak. You had better go.\\" Xi Eleven had no choice but to emerge, and happened to bump squarely into Zhuo Tianxiang coming in. Xi Eleven said, \\"The monk and Master Wei are both out; Deyue is sick and too languid to entertain — don't bother going in.\\" Tianxiang said, \\"Let's go sit over in Master Wei's quarters then — even though he's not home, we can still sit there.\\""},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":1,"tokens":["天香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"赏十五吊钱，了此事罢。」奚十一道：「这有什么要紧，横竖明日才还他。我们坐一坐，到潘三爷铺子里开张票子就是了。」天香道了谢，便与奚十一在一处坐着闲谈。","en":"sit for a while, and then we'll go to Third Master Pan's shop and write a cash draft, and that will be that.\\" Tianxiang thanked him, and the two sat together chatting."},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":5,"tokens":["天香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"原来天香去找哈回回，哈回回有个侄儿与天香有些瓜葛，见他叔叔不在家，便留在铺子里吃了两小碗牛肉，五六个馒头，做了一回没要紧的事，也给了他两吊钱。那晓得那个小回子才生了杨梅毒，尚未发出来，这一回倒过与天香了。天香此时后门口觉得焦辣辣的难受，要想奚十一与他杀杀火。","en":"As it happened, when Tianxiang had gone to find the Muslim butcher, the butcher was not at home; but the butcher's nephew, who had some entanglements with Tianxiang, kept him in the shop to eat two small bowls of beef and five or six steamed buns. They then engaged in a brief affair"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":1,"tokens":["天香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"奚十一本要同他到潘三处取钱，忽然眼中冒火，两太阳疼胀，身子不快起来，便写了一个飞字叫天香自取。奚十一即回家，头晕眼花，扎挣不住。","en":"throbbed and swelled with pain, and a general malaise washed over him. He hastily dashed off a quick note and told Tianxiang to go collect it himself. Xi Eleven returned straight home, his head spinning and vision blurring, barely able to hold himself together."},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":3,"tokens":["天香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"了毒气，便用了一剂攻毒泻火的泻药，昨日已泻了好几遍，适奚十一来承受了，由肾经直入心经。奚十一身子是空虚的，再与天香闹了一次，而天香又新染了哈小回子的疮毒，也叫奚十一收来。两毒齐发，甚为沉重。少顷，和尚来问其得病之由，奚十一只将天香的事说了，诊了脉，也用一剂泻药。谁知毒气甚深，打不下来，一连三日，更加沉重。肿溃处，头已破了，奚十一苦不可言，只得又另请医生，要二百金","en":"into the heart channel. Xi Eleven's constitution was already hollowed out, and then he had gone on to dally with Tianxiang, who had freshly contracted the sore-poison of the young Muslim — which Xi Eleven had also gathered into himself. The simultaneous eruption of these two poisons made his condition exceedingly grave. Shortly after, the monk arrived and asked about the"}],"47":[{"paragraph":22,"mentions":15,"tokens":["卓天香","天香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"又挨了几日，那天多喝了一盅，更痒得利害，偶然想起卓天香也十七八岁了，又是他的老主顾，叫他来商量商量倒可以，即叫人去叫了天香来。天香来了，见了潘三，请了安。潘三甚是欢喜，又同他到小账房里，摆出一盘盒子菜、一碟熏鱼、一碟瓜子、一壶陈木瓜酒，与他谈心。天香见潘三喜眉笑脸，乜斜着眼睛，扭头扭脑，不像往日的样子，","en":"days passed. After drinking an extra cup of wine one day, the itch flared up fiercely. He suddenly remembered Zhuo Tianxiang, who was seventeen or eighteen and an old patron of his. \\"Calling him over to sound him out might work,\\" he thought, and sent someone to fetch Tianxiang. Tianxiang arrived, saw Pan the Third, and paid his respects. Pan the Third was delighted, taking"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":4,"tokens":["天香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"潘三道：「我也不恼你，但我今日不高兴与你做这件事。」天香只得走开坐了，又道：「三爷，要梳发不要？」潘三道：「也好，倒梳梳发罢。」天香与潘三梳起发来。潘三问道：「你们给人顽的时候，内里怎样快活？」天香笑道：「有什么快活，这是伺候人的差使，快活是在人快活呢。」潘三道：「不是这么说。我听说有一种人，小时上了人的","en":"Pan the Third said: \\"I am not angry with you, but I am not in the mood for this today.\\" Tianxiang could only step aside and sit down, asking: \\"Third Master, shall I comb your hair?\\" Pan the Third said: \\"Alright, comb it then.\\" As Tianxiang combed his hair, Pan the Third asked: \\"When you boys serve gentlemen in that way, what pleasure do you get from"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":7,"tokens":["天香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"天香道：「那里有什么方法！」想了一想，忽又说道：「有，有，有！有一个人与我们同行，听他说医好一个人，说是用手挖出来的。」潘三笑道：「这个如何放得进手？」天香道：「手是放不进，指头是伸得进的。」潘三道：「适或长了毛，指头也挖不出来。」天香道：「他有方法。他","en":"Tianxiang said: \\"What method could there be?\\" He paused in thought, then suddenly exclaimed: \\"Yes, yes, yes! There is a man in our trade who said he cured someone once. He said he dug it out by hand.\\" Pan the Third laughed: \\"How could a hand fit inside?\\" Tianxiang"},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":4,"tokens":["天香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"天香再三的替潘三央求。那人道：「既然要我去治好他的病，你去对他说，要送我三百吊钱。他这个毛病还花三百吊买来的，何况要治好？他应该加一倍才是。」天香即将这话去对潘三讲了，潘三道：「不知取得出来取不出来？如果真能取出来，我就给他三百吊。但叮嘱他别告诉人。」天","en":"Tianxiang pleaded on Pan the Third's behalf again and again. The man finally said: \\"If you insist I go cure his illness, tell him he must give me three hundred strings of cash. It cost him three hundred strings to buy this affliction in the first place; to cure"},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":1,"tokens":["天香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"味，先给了一百吊钱，那人把这耳挖果然要了，潘三以为得计。过了十余日，居然好了，竟不发痒，又将那二百吊也给了他。天香借此向潘三借钱，潘三要买他的嘴，也给了几十吊钱。","en":"passed, and miraculously, the itching ceased entirely. Pan the Third then paid the remaining two hundred strings. Tianxiang used this leverage to borrow money from Pan the Third, who, wanting to buy his silence, gave him several dozen strings more."},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":4,"tokens":["天香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"到银匠铺里打两个戒指。银匠说是镀金的，他还不信，及到试金石上刮了出来，果然是银的。便恨潘三赚他，起了狠心，找了天香，要他去对潘三讲，不应欺他，他如今把这耳挖做了凭据，逢人便说是潘三爷要他挖屁股的，叫他一辈子怎样做人？天香果然说了，潘三无奈，只得托天香去说，叫他不要声扬，再给他些钱。后来讲来讲去，那人只是不依，又给了三百吊。以后那人与天香串通，每逢缓急，便找潘三，","en":"proved to be silver underneath. Enraged that Pan the Third had cheated him, malice filled his heart. He sought out Tianxiang and demanded he tell Pan the Third that he should not have deceived him. Now, he would use the earpick as proof and tell everyone he met that Pan the Third had hired him to dig out his ass—how would Pan the Third ever face the world again? Tianxiang"}],"58":[{"paragraph":21,"mentions":1,"tokens":["卓天香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"来，道：「看什么？不是又有了翡翠镯子了。」奚十一坐起，拉了过来，抱了他。英官冷笑道：「闹什么鬼？我又不是得月、卓天香，肏了要烂鸡巴的，我们好好的家伙为什么要装这个狗鸡巴？」奚十一道：「好屁话。」便拽起长衣，扯开裤子，那物脱颖而出，见了英官，怒吽吽的跳突起来。英官一呆，一手攥住了，笑道：「怎么今日改了样儿了？想是得了缺了，所以挺胸凸肚，不似候选时那绒头绒脑的。看将起","en":"Xi sat up, pulled him over, and embraced him. Yingguan sneered, \\"What ghost are you playing? I'm not Deyue or Zhuo Tianxiang, who get fucked till their cocks rot. We have good gear of our own — why fit this dog's cock?\\" Xi dismissed him, \\"Bullshit,\\" and, \\"Fine talk.\\" He hiked his long robe and opened his trousers. The thing sprang free and reared at Yingguan. Yingguan started,"},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":1,"tokens":["卓天香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"英官撵出之后，便到卓天香铺里去做了伙计。人爱他脑袋好，这个卵字号，倒也生意兴隆。虽然英官脏头上去些，但屁股里已经受了伤，竟成了内外痔。后又广与人交，不到一年之功，竟是众毒齐发，把个巴英官活活烂死，岂不是件大奇事！这也是他的恶报了。","en":"After his expulsion, Yingguan went to Zhuo Tianxiang's shop as a clerk. Men prized his \\"head,\\" and the \\"egg\\" trade thrived. Though the hanging tip was shortened, his rear had been injured. Inside and out he developed piles. Later he took many partners, and within a year every poison flared. Ba Yingguan"}]}`),"char-140":{47:[{paragraph:9,mentions:1,tokens:["阳善修"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"肾是要狗连的时候，一刀砍死两个，从母狗阴里取出来的，才有用呢，不是什么海狗肾。而且听得说人是不疼不痒的。这人叫阳善修，现寓在城外，想必你那个也可以接得。但据你说短了，不晓得能接长不能。」奚十一听了，满心欢喜，就立逼着唐和尚去请他来商量。",en:`of any use; it is no fur seal's member. And they say the patient feels no pain or itch at all! The man is named Yang Shanxiu, currently lodging outside the city. I am sure yours can be grafted too. But since you say it is short, I do not know if he can lengthen it." Hearing this, Xi Eleven was filled with joy and immediately pressed Monk Tang to fetch the man for a consultation.`},{paragraph:10,mentions:1,tokens:["阳善修"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"唐和尚已经访明了住处，就叫人去请那阳善修。",en:"Tang had already learned his lodgings and sent someone to invite Yang Shanxiu."},{paragraph:11,mentions:2,tokens:["阳善修"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"那阳善修住得不远，不多一刻来了。唐和尚出来，照应他先在外间坐下。奚十一从里面看他，面貌颇不适观，衣裳蓝缕，有几分瞧不起他，也不出来，叫唐和尚与他说话。和尚将奚十一的毛病讲了。阳善修道：「讲接法也不同，先看各人的本源，再看各人的行货。譬如那老年人筋力衰的，是不",en:"Yang Shanxiu lived nearby and arrived in short order. Monk Tang went out and saw to seating him in the outer room first. From inside, Xi Eleven observed him: his face was rather unseemly, his clothes ragged, and Xi Eleven felt a touch of disdain, remaining inside"},{paragraph:12,mentions:3,tokens:["阳善修"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"唐和尚同了他进去，奚十一勉强把腰松了一松，就坐下了。阳善修见奚十一才三十来岁，身材长大，像个本源未亏的人。但看他那威风凛凛的样子，不敢来问他，局局促促的站着。奚十一把手一招，叫他坐了。方才讲的话，奚十一早已听见，便道：「我这个病就有一样作怪，内中像有条筋扳住，胀起来，他就有些疼。必要先治好了这条筋，才可治别",en:'to pull tight; when it swells, it hurts. This tendon must be straightened before anything else can be treated." Yang Shanxiu said: "Let me first examine it to see what we are dealing with." Feeling somewhat embarrassed, Xi Eleven waited until Monk Tang stepped out, then stood and undid his trousers. The man leaned in for a look, prodded it twice with a small ivory slip, and'},{paragraph:14,mentions:1,tokens:["阳善修"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"吃了早饭，唐和尚同了那人前来，奚十一到书房里陪他们坐了，阳善修问了昨夜的光景。菊花走将出来，从板壁缝里望那个医生，生得颇不顺眼，一个黄肿脸儿，约三十来岁年纪，有几根微须，身材短小，穿一件油晃晃的旧绸袄子，两只袖子破烂不堪。又见唐和尚的头剃得紫光油滑，穿件青绸夹袄，拿着把扇子扇着。听得那人说道：「叫你们管家生个炭",en:"After breakfast, Monk Tang arrived with the doctor. Xi Eleven sat with them in the study, and Yang Shanxiu asked how the night had gone. Juhua crept out and peered through the cracks in the wooden partition. The doctor looked utterly unpresentable—a sallow, puffy face, about thirty years old, with a sparse beard and short stature, wearing a greasy, worn silk"},{paragraph:15,mentions:1,tokens:["阳善修"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"说了一声道：「极短也要五寸。」唐和尚忍不住笑了一声。奚十一听得出口声，便咳嗽了一声。菊花自知失言，便跑了进去。阳善修听得有人说要五寸，抬头一看，见门口有两个孩子站着，便当是他们讲的，也笑了一笑。春兰脸倒红了一红，英官鼻子里哼了一声。",en:"Eleven coughed loudly. Knowing she had misspoken, Juhua fled back inside. Hearing someone demand five inches, Yang Shanxiu looked up and, seeing the two servant boys at the door, assumed they had spoken and smiled as well. Chunlan blushed deeply, while Yingguan gave a haughty snort."},{paragraph:17,mentions:5,tokens:["阳善修"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"唐和尚问道：「怎样？」奚十一道：「倒也不觉怎样，就是下身麻木，此时两腿一动也难动。」阳善修把他腿掇了下来，扶他睡下，说道：「每日吃煎药一服，我留下方子，你们自去抓罢。敷药我每天午正时来替你上，七日内包好。好之后切不可就使唤他，总要两三月之后，方可办事，不然是要受伤的。切记，切记。公鸡、鲤鱼、羊肉，百天之内吃不得的。大好之后，你若能吃狗肉，",en:`Eleven replied: "I don't feel much of anything, just numbness below; it's hard to even move my legs right now." Yang Shanxiu lifted his legs down, helped him lie flat, and said: "Drink one dose of decoction every day. I will leave the prescription; you can fill it yourselves. I will come every day exactly at noon to change the dressing, and within seven days it will heal completely.`}],58:[{paragraph:26,mentions:3,tokens:["阳善修"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"里盘弄，觉得这个字顺口得很，没有忌讳了。」便又说道：「杀只鸡来，要一块活鸡皮。」菊花即叫人割了一块活鸡皮来。那阳善修拿些药和鸡皮捣烂了，与他洗净了血，敷上了药。也与从前一样的治法，留了一服药煎了与他吃，明日再来看罢。亮轩又同他去看英官，阳善修也与他几味药吃了，说道：「这个不要紧，明日就缩进去的。」阳善修去了，菊花就在书房中睡，陪了奚十一。这一唬，倒把个菊花的病唬好",en:'tongue, with no taboo." He added, "Kill a chicken, and bring a piece of living chicken skin." Juhua sent for it. Yang Shanxiu mashed medicine with the skin, washed away the blood, and applied the dressing in the same method as before. He left a decoction for him to drink and said he would return tomorrow. Ji went with him to Yingguan, and Yang gave him medicines too, saying,'},{paragraph:27,mentions:4,tokens:["阳善修"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"奚十一上了药，便止了痛。明日阳善修复来。过了十余日，伤痕平复。阳善修说道：「从此你要戒淫才好，若再把根子弄散了，那就有性命之忧，不如吃两剂寒凉药，断了性罢。」奚十一无奈，与菊花商量，菊花也只得由他。遂听了阳善修，吃了十剂凉药，从此春蚕如死，再不起性了。又谢了阳善修五十两。",en:`With medicine applied, Xi's pain stopped. Yang Shanxiu came the next day, and after ten-odd days the wound closed. Yang said, "From now on abstain. If you damage the root again, life is at risk. Better to take cooling drafts and kill the urge altogether." Xi had no choice, so he consulted Juhua, who could`},{paragraph:38,mentions:2,tokens:["阳善修"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"银指甲打断，既薄且尖，竟将潘三的鼻子尖刮断，故此流得满面的血。潘三痛不可忍，忙忙跑出，就请了与奚十一修肾的那个阳善修医治，也与他配了个假鼻子。潘三因在家不能医治，又怕他女人再打，竟不敢回家，就在城里他的那个靴铺内住着，日日请那阳善修进城与他诊视，服药两月有余，方见大好。从此各处传说，又有人赠他个美名，叫做抓三爷，又叫大眼三儿。奚十一断肾那几天，正是潘三抓鼻那几天，",en:"and snapped, slicing off the tip of his nose, hence the blood. Pan could not bear the pain, fled, and sent for Yang Shanxiu, the same who had repaired Xi Eleven's kidney, to fit a false nose. Pan could not heal at home and feared his wife's fists. He dared not return, lodged at his boot shop in the city, and had Yang come daily for two months before he mended. Tales spread,"}]},"char-141":JSON.parse(`{"7":[{"paragraph":7,"mentions":2,"tokens":["道生","屈本立"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"署款是「道生屈本立书」，书法古拙异常。下面一张大案，案上罗列着许多书籍。旁边摆着十二盆唐花，香气袭人，令人心醉。子玉看了，又想起琴言那日作戏光景，真是宝光夺人，香气沁骨，不觉有些模糊起来。忽听文泽道：「这屋子太敞，我们里面坐罢。」随同到东边，有书童揭起帘子，进去","en":"The inscription read, 'Written by Qu Benli, styled Daosheng,' showcasing calligraphy of exceptional, archaic charm. Below sat a large table laden with numerous books. To the side were twelve pots of forced winter flowers, their fragrance wafting over and intoxicating the senses. Taking it all"}],"9":[{"paragraph":27,"mentions":1,"tokens":["屈本立"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"也过了好几重门户，进了朝东五间三明两暗的西洋房。此中点缀得甚佳，琴床画桌，金鼎铜壶，斑然可爱。正中悬着一额，是屈本立写的「宜春阁」三字，一边是陆素兰写的几幅小楷，一边是袁宝珠画的几幅墨兰，中间地上点着一盏仿古鸡足银灯，有四尺高，上面托着个九瓣莲花灯盏，点着九穗，照得满屋通明。一一坐了，次贤道：「我们何不再饮几杯？」众人道：「我们在亭子上已饮多了，可以不必酒了，倒是","en":"plaque inscribed with three characters, 'Yichun Pavilion' or Lodge of Welcoming Spring, in the calligraphy of Qu Benli. On one side hung several panels of small-script calligraphy by Sulan, and on the other side, several panels of ink-painted orchids by Yuan Baozhu. In the middle of the floor stood a lamp imitating an ancient chicken-foot design in silver, some four"}],"12":[{"paragraph":6,"mentions":1,"tokens":["屈大令"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"苏州，两处的年谊故旧，几个当道显贵，共相帮扶。春航在那两处，勾留了半年，诗文著作传抄殆遍。时下谓其可与侯太史、屈大令争名，因此囊橐充盈，黄白满箧。不消说题花载酒，访翠眠香，几至乐而忘返。及接了他太夫人的手谕，催其速行进京，春航不得已，即择日起身。先寄了千金回家，又收了两个俊仆，裘马辉煌，妓女饯行，狎客祖道。一路上风花诗酒，游目骋怀，好不有兴。","en":"circulated almost everywhere. People of the day said he could rival the Hanlin compiler Hou and the district magistrate Qu in literary fame, and as a result his purse filled up nicely and his luggage box was full of gifts. Needless to say, there was also visiting the pleasure quarters and carousing with wine, calling on singing-girls and sleeping in their fragrant rooms,"}],"37":[{"paragraph":13,"mentions":3,"tokens":["屈道生","道生"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"风生，无人不敬爱他。」子云想了一想，道：「要是姓屈，不是姓瞿。」蕙芳道：「是姓屈，我记错了。」次贤道：「不要是屈道生么？」子云道：「一定是他，我听说他到了。」子玉道：「他名字可叫本立？」子云道：「正是，你认识他么？」子玉道：「我却不认识，我见他几封书札与家严的，有论些史事疑难处，却独出卓见，真是只眼千古。家严将他裱成一个册页，我倒常看的。」次贤道：「这道生先生今年","en":"be over sixty.\\" Ziyun asked his surname. Huifang answered, \\"It is an unusual name. Let me think, something like Qu, I believe. He was wearing sixth-rank official dress, and his conversation was so brilliant and wide-ranging that everyone present held him in admiration.\\" Ziyun thought for a moment and corrected him, \\"It will be Qu written 屈, not Qu written 瞿.\\" Huifang"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":3,"tokens":["道生","道翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"类，还有些集经书诗词的对子，却甚有趣。好像末后还有个对戏目的对子，是两个字的多，可惜没有细看。」子云道：「你看道生的诗文，与侯石翁如何？」次贤道：「据我看，是道翁高于石翁。石翁的才虽大，格却不高，且系驳杂不纯。道翁才也不小，其格纯正，却是可传之作。就是石翁也很佩服他的。」王恂道：「我们江宁的侯石翁么，他却自负天下第一才子。据我看来，也不见得。」子云道：「才是大的","en":"of them two-character titles, but I regret I did not examine it carefully.\\" Ziyun asked, \\"How would you compare Daosheng's poetry and prose with Hou Shiweng's?\\" Cixian said, \\"In my estimation, Daoweng is the superior of the two. Shiweng has great talent, but his writing lacks distinction and is rather mixed and impure. Daoweng, too, is a man of considerable talent, and"},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":1,"tokens":["屈道生"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"兰单请子玉、琴言二人，又叙了一日，这一日清谈小叙，更为有趣。一连叙了三日，子玉也心满意足，人也乏了。徐子云要请屈道生，却好史南湘已到京，作一个诗酒大会。子玉不能推辞，只得赴约。且听下回分解。","en":"feasted, and Ziyu felt perfectly content, though by now he was quite worn out. Xu Ziyun had been planning to invite Qu Daosheng, and just at this point Shi Nanxiang arrived in the capital, providing the occasion for a grand literary gathering of wine and verse. Ziyu could not decline, and had no choice but to attend. As to what happened next, listen to the following chapter for"}],"38":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["屈公"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"且说徐子云请了屈公来，并请南湘、仲清、文泽、春航、王恂、子玉作陪，仍在梅崦中。王恂是日为孙亮功请去有事，因李元茂吉期已定，要招赘过来。亮功因两位贤郎是不懂事的，一切皆托王恂料理，王恂所以不能前来。","en":"To return to our story: Xu Ziyun had invited Master Qu to attend, with Nanxiang, Zhongqing, Wenze, Chunhang, Wang Xun, and Ziyu as companions, again in the Plum Knoll. Wang Xun on this particular day had been called away by Sun Lianggong on an important matter: the wedding date had been fixed for Li Yuanmao,"},{"paragraph":2,"mentions":2,"tokens":["屈道生","屈公"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云因屈道生是个高雅好静的人，名旦中止叫了四个，宝珠、漱芳、蕙芳、素兰。漱芳有恙不能前来，格外又知会了琴言。是日屈公先到，与子云、次贤叙了好些旧话。","en":"Knowing that Qu Daosheng was a man of refined tastes who preferred quieter company, Ziyun had invited only four performers: Baozhu, Shufang, Huifang, and Sulan. Shufang was indisposed and unable to attend; as an added guest, Qinyan was also notified. That day Master Qu arrived"},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":2,"tokens":["屈公"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"且将屈公的出身述其大概。屈公是湖北武昌府人，为三闾大夫之后。学贯天人，神通六艺，但一生运蹇时乖，家道清寒，除了书籍之外，一无所有。","en":"Let us briefly describe Master Qu's background. Master Qu was a native of Wuchang Prefecture in Hubei, a descendant of the Grand Officer of the Three Lü Clans. His learning spanned heaven and earth, and he had mastery of all six classical arts; yet his entire life had been beset by ill"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":4,"tokens":["道生"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"那时道生才得四岁，尚有祖父母在堂，其太夫人苦节多年，教养兼任。道生到了十六岁上入了学，即丁祖父忧。三年服满，将要应举，又丁了祖母忧，又是三年。那年服阕后，太夫人又相继去世。道生一连丁了九年忧，已到二十五岁了。娶妻闵氏，贤慧无双。道生奔走衣食，笔耕餬口，历走燕","en":"At that time Daosheng was only four years old. His paternal grandparents were still alive, and his mother kept her widowhood faithfully for many years, single-handedly both rearing and educating him. Daosheng was admitted to the prefectural school at the age of sixteen, only"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":1,"tokens":["屈公"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"有几个下人，也是外面荐来的。只有一个长随叫刘喜，跟了有五六年，颇有良心，其余是些不关痛痒的。屈公虽则一肩行李，生平所藏金石玩器、名书古画，倒有好几箱。到京来，刘尚书念旧，见其宦囊萧索，赠了他二百金。","en":"him for five or six years and was a man of some conscience; the rest were of no particular consequence. Though Master Qu travelled light in the way of baggage, a lifetime of collecting had filled several trunks with bronze and stone antiques, precious books, and old paintings. When he arrived in the capital, Minister Liu, mindful of their old connection, saw that Qu's"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":1,"tokens":["屈公"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"华公子知道他来，出城拜了他，送了三百金。屈公得了五百金，又到那些古玩铺买了好些书籍、名帖等类。从前相好中有寒士者，也分送了好些，目下所余无几了。","en":"arrival, came out of the city to pay a formal call and gave him three hundred taels. With five hundred taels in hand, Master Qu went round the antique shops and bought a good many books and famous rubbings. He also distributed a fair amount among impoverished friends of former times, so that only a little remained by now."},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":2,"tokens":["道生"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"田春航前日已经会过，唯仲清、子玉初次识荆，见了那仙风道骨的相貌，况且又是父执，自然十分恭敬。道生见仲清骨秀神清，知是不凡。又看子玉温然玉立，皎若珠光，秀外慧中，神怡气肃，又不是那徒有外貌的一派，心中十分大喜，想道：「梅铁庵可为有子矣。」便与子玉说些江西事情，说道：「令尊大人严拒情面，杜绝苞苴，一省人都比他为司马光、文彦博。士子们感戴是不用说了。","en":"and mindful moreover that he was a friend of his father's generation, Ziyu naturally showed the deepest respect. Master Qu saw in Zhongqing a refined and spiritually luminous quality and knew him immediately for a man of exceptional character. Then he looked at Ziyu — warm and composed as a piece of jade, bright as the glow of a pearl, fine without and wise within, serene"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":4,"tokens":["道生"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"只见四旦约齐同来，蕙芳已经认识，四人都上前请安。道生拱了手，命他们坐了，细细看了一番，又问了三人名号，谓子云道：「如今京里的相公，一发比从前好了。」子云道：「今日本不应叫他们来伺候，因他们尚不十分恶劣，还可以捧研拂笺。况他们前日听得先生来了，要瞻仰瞻仰老名士。若得齿颊余芬，褒扬一字，则胜于拳金之赏，想","en":"then the four performers arrived together. Huifang he already knew; all four came forward to pay their respects. Qu clasped his hands in return, bade them be seated, and looked them over carefully, asking the names of three of them. He said to Ziyun, \\"The young performers in the capital today are even finer than in former times.\\" Ziyun said, \\"Strictly speaking I ought"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":2,"tokens":["道生"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，西席三是文泽。子云东席作主，次贤西席作陪。宝珠、琴言在东，蕙芳、素兰在西，一一坐了。主人让酒，客皆饮了几杯。道生道：「我将前日先见的苏媚香谈起。」西席的人个个细听。道生道：「我这看相不论气色，部位是要论的，然尚在其次。我看全身的神骨、举止行动、坐相、立相，并口音言语，分人清浊，观人心地，以定休咎。但头一句就恐有些不对，我看媚香是个好出身，不是平常人家的子弟，你","en":"Sulan on the west. Everyone took their places. The host circulated wine and the guests each drank a few cups. Qu said, \\"I shall begin with Su Meixiang, whom I met the other day.\\" Everyone at the west table listened attentively. Qu said, \\"In my physiognomy I do not rely on complexion or the formal positions of features — those are secondary matters. What I observe"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":3,"tokens":["道生"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"道生道：「这也何必要访？我知道他聪慧异常，肝胆出众，是个敢作敢为的。但虽是个好出身，未免幼年受尽了苦，所谓死里逃生。据我看，他一二年内，必有一番作为，就要改行的。后来收成怎样，此事还远，我也不必说。若说，静宜又要驳我了。」再看素兰、宝珠，大致相仿，与蕙芳","en":"Qu said, \\"There is no need for inquiries. I can see that he is exceptionally perceptive, courageous, and spirited — a person who dares to act. Yet despite his good background, he clearly suffered greatly in his early years; what one might call an escape"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":1,"tokens":["屈道生"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，也可挽回造化。」众人听他说得真切，便知道真能看相，不是瞎话。琴言因这几句话，说到心坎上，便也十分快活。又看那屈道生有飘飘欲仙之概，便也待他亲厚起来。","en":"spoken struck Qinyan to the very core of his being, and he felt a great warmth towards the old man. Seeing too that Master Qu had about him an air of one who might at any moment ascend to the immortal realm, Qinyan felt an intimacy and affection toward him that grew by the moment."},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":3,"tokens":["道生"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"道生与南湘并坐，便问道：「令尊到任可有些施为？请把善政讲讲。」南湘道：「家严初任外官，况且才三个月，尚未办什么事，就访得了一个土豪、两个蠹役，地方上很称快。制台写信来，也说了几句好话，其余也没有什么。」道生道：「我知道你令尊是耿直人，定有作为的。说起土豪","en":"Qu turned to Nanxiang, who was seated beside him, and asked, \\"Has your honoured father made any notable achievements since taking up his post? Tell me of any good governance he has carried out.\\" Nanxiang said, \\"My father has only recently taken a provincial"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":4,"tokens":["道生","道翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云见上菜的家人一件新衣上爬着个虱子，候他上好了菜，叫他拈掉了。道生即问关子玉道：「世兄博览经史，不知方才这个虱子见于何书为古？诗词杂说是不用讲的。」子玉劈头被他一问，呆了一呆，想道：「这个字却也稀少，他说见于何书为古，这些扪虱、贯虱就不必讲了。」婉言答道：「小侄寡闻浅见，读书未多。见于书史者也只有数条，大约要以阮籍","en":"new jacket. He waited until the man had set down the dishes, then called him over and told him to pick it off. Qu immediately turned to Ziyu and asked, \\"Since the young gentleman has read widely in the classics and histories, I wonder — in which text does this creature make its earliest and most venerable appearance? I need not say anything of it in poetry and miscellaneous"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":3,"tokens":["道生"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"道生道：「此板早已劈化了，这是少年时无赖，作这些东西，毫无道理。」子云道：「又闻得有些对戏目的对子。」道生道：「有数十条，也记不得了。」次贤道：「我们前日几个人，也凑了好些。」又指琴言、蕙芳、宝珠三人道：「这三个还有一个王桂保，他们也对了许多，比我们还好","en":"Qu said, \\"The woodblocks for that were long ago split up for firewood. It is a worthless thing I wrote in my youth, without the least sense or reason.\\" Ziyun said, \\"I also heard there was a section of couplets matching opera titles.\\" Qu said, \\"There were"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":1,"tokens":["道生"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"那边仲清问道：「先生所藏金石甚富，且精于考辨。不知篆隶碑板，究以何本为最？」道生道：「古篆近人不甚讲究，如《衡岳碑》，相传七十七字，在衡岳密云峰。至宋嘉定中何致子一游南岳，拓其文刻于岳麓，杨用修又刻于滇南，杨时乔又刻于栖霞，辗转相刻，姑为弗论，余尝译其文曰：","en":"your assessments. Of seal script, clerical script, and carved steles, which examples do you consider the finest?\\" Qu said, \\"Seal script is not much studied in recent times. Take the Mount Heng Stele, traditionally said to contain seventy-seven characters, located on the Miyun Peak of Mount Heng. As late as the Song, in the Jiading reign, a certain He Zhi visited the"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":1,"tokens":["道生"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"春航道：「兰亭聚讼纷纷，即定武本亦有二刻。真伪已分，究何以辨？」道生道：「兰亭刻于唐太宗贞观年，先太宗为秦王时，得于僧辨才处。贞观十年，始命汤普、冯承素、诸葛贞、赵模，各临拓以赐近臣。当时褚遂良、欧阳询各有临本，人并崇尚。所谓定武本者，欧临是也。\\n唐绢本者，褚临是也。彼时欧临石刻在禁中，后石晋之乱，契丹辇石投于杀虎口","en":"two versions. Now that the question of authentic and spurious has been settled, how does one tell them apart?\\" Qu said, \\"The Orchid Pavilion text was engraved in the Zhenguan reign of Tang Taizong. Before Taizong became emperor, while still the Prince of Qin, he obtained it from the monk Biancai. In the tenth year of Zhenguan he commissioned Tang Pu, Feng Chengsu,"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":1,"tokens":["道生"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"春航又道：「人说汉之碑，宋之帖，可以只立千古，淳化、大观、绛帖、潭帖，此四帖可好？」道生道：「以鄙见论，以淳化为第一，次大观，次绛帖，又次潭帖。然宋人常谓潭帖在阁帖之上，又谓淳化创始，兼以王着摹手不高，未及大观之精美。然淳化气运朴厚，大观光彩浮动，比之诗，则盛而渐晚矣。」","en":"supreme for their era. The four great model books — Chunhua, Daguan, Jiang tie, and Tan tie — how do they compare?\\" Qu said, \\"In my view, Chunhua ranks first, Daguan second, Jiang tie third, and Tan tie fourth. Yet Song connoisseurs often held Tan tie to be superior to the palace model books, and also maintained that Chunhua, being the first of its kind, was limited"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":1,"tokens":["道生"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"道生道：「诗以性情所近，近李则好李，近杜则好杜，李、杜兼近则兼好矣。元微之粗率之文，颓唐之句，于李岂能相近？自然尊杜而贬李。王荆公谓李只是一个家法，杜则能包罗众体，殊不知李亦何尝不包罗众体，特以不屑为琐语，人即疑其不能。大抵论太白之诗，皆喜其天才横逸，有","en":"Qu said, \\"Poetry speaks to us through the natural affinity of our own spirits. Those whose hearts resonate with Li Bai will love Li Bai; those who share a kinship with Du Fu will love Du Fu; those fortunate enough to encompass both will naturally admire"},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":1,"tokens":["道生"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"道生道：「韵学之辨，诸家通转各有依据。沈约以越音而定八方之音，岂能尽合？而同一字也，而舌与齿为一音，齿与舌又为一音。即如五方土音，甚难吻合，所以支元之韵最杂，正不知何方人才能念出一韵来。昔分在韵为二百六部，自淳佑中，平水刘渊始并为一百七部。《广韵》计二万","en":"Qu said, \\"In the disputes of rhyme scholarship, each school has its own authorities for the merged and transferred categories. Shen Yue established a standard for the eight regional dialects using the Yue dialect — how could that possibly cover all of them"},{"paragraph":31,"mentions":1,"tokens":["道生"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"道生道：「宋南渡后，有王湜着《太乙肘后备检》三卷，为阴阳二遁，绘图一百四十有四。以太乙考治人君之善恶，其专考阳九百六之数者，以四百五十六年为一阳九，以二百八十八年为一百六。阳九奇数也，阳数之穷；百六偶数也，阴数之穷。王湜之说云：「后羿寒浞之乱，得阳九之数","en":"Qu said, \\"After the Southern Song, a certain Wang Shi composed the *Taiyi Handbook for Ready Reference* in three scrolls, covering the yin and yang excursions and drawing one hundred and forty-four diagrams. The work uses the Taiyi system to illuminate"},{"paragraph":33,"mentions":1,"tokens":["道生"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"道生笑道：「这个理倒有些难讲。然《齐民要术》内说种梨法，一梨十子，唯二子生梨，余皆为杜。段氏曰：鹘生三子，一为鸱。《禽经》曰：鹳生三子，一为鹤。造化权舆，夏雀生鹑，楚鸠生▉，《南海记》曰：鳄生子百数，为鳄者才十二，余为鳖，为鼋，随气而化。且推之，圣不生圣","en":"Qu laughed and said, \\"That is a difficult principle to explain fully. Yet the *Essential Techniques for the Common People* contains the following on the method of growing pear trees: one pear yields ten seeds, but only two of them produce pear trees, while"},{"paragraph":35,"mentions":1,"tokens":["道生"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"道生道：「古人笔墨皆妙，何能枚举。但形容的美人得体，又要人人合眼称妙者，莫如卫庄姜。《硕人》之诗，先曰：「硕人其颀，衣锦褧衣。」这两句，就写得光华射目。「领如蝤蛴」，至「美目盼兮」，便字字形容绝妙，不着一衬帖语，不用一假借语，正所谓咏月咏月满，写花写花开","en":"Qu said, \\"All the writers of antiquity are admirable — how can one single any out? But the piece of writing that depicts a beautiful woman most fittingly, and that every reader would unanimously acclaim as superb, is none other than the description of Lady"},{"paragraph":37,"mentions":2,"tokens":["道生"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"道生道：「此不过略为缠束，不使放散，读「胫跗丰妍，底平指敛」，似又非今日之紧紧缠小，必使尖如莲瓣也。」蕙芳道：「这个尺寸是怎样？身长七尺一寸，肩广一尺六寸，怎样算法？若依今日之尺寸，只怕没有这般长大人。」道生道：「这是汉尺，比起今日工部营造尺来，只得七寸","en":"Qu said, \\"That is merely a loose binding to prevent them from spreading freely. If one reads the words 'calves and instep shapely and fine, the sole flat and the toes neatly gathered,' it seems not at all like the tight and severe binding of today that"},{"paragraph":38,"mentions":7,"tokens":["道翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"道翁又道：「都中现有一个极博雅的人，年纪虽轻，与我是旧交，也是个南京巨族。论起世家来，与子云、星北不相上下，想诸公自必相熟的。」子云道：「是那一位？」道翁道：「此君姓金名粟，号吉甫，可相好么？」众人同道：「久闻其名，恨未一见。」道翁道：「若论考据学问品行","en":"Master Qu then said, \\"There is a supremely cultivated and erudite person currently in the capital — young in years but an old acquaintance of mine, and also from a great Nanjing family. In terms of family standing, his lineage is on a par with Ziyun's and Xingbei's,"},{"paragraph":39,"mentions":5,"tokens":["道翁","屈道翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"宝珠道：「此君疏懒太甚，不好交游的。」道翁道：「想与此数君自必水乳。」这一日，屈道翁足足讲了一日，人也乏了。吃完了饭，散坐了一会，也就二更光景。刘文泽系旧学生，不敢问难。宝珠问子云要柄扇子，求道翁题诗，子云索性叫取四柄扇子出来，给四旦每人一柄。于是宝珠拂几，蕙芳移砚，素兰磨墨，琴言润毫，共求","en":"Baozhu said, \\"This gentleman is rather reclusive and not fond of society.\\" Master Qu said, \\"With these gentlemen I think he would find himself perfectly at ease.\\" That day Master Qu had talked at length from beginning to end — everyone was weary. After finishing the meal they sat about in a relaxed manner for a while; it was already"}],"43":[{"paragraph":5,"mentions":1,"tokens":["屈道翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"了一笑，且不坐下，就看那册页。宝珠先抢了那本画的，那两人也凑着同看，有山水，也有花卉，却画得甚好，原来蕙芳新求屈道翁画的。看到末后一页，是一个美人倚阑惆怅的光景，阑外落花满地，双燕飞来，像是：「落花人独立，微雨燕双飞」的诗意。琴言触动了当年那个灯谜，忽忽如有所感，看题着一首绝句，琴言默念是：","en":"were landscapes and flower studies, all rendered with great skill, as Huifang had newly commissioned them from Master Qu Daoweng. On the last page was a painting of a beauty leaning on a balustrade in a mood of melancholy: fallen petals carpeted the ground below the railing, and a pair of swallows came flying through, as if evoking the lines:\\n\\n\\"Fallen blossoms drift, and"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":1,"tokens":["屈道翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"七十岁时，还是这样不是？」次贤笑道：「春华秋实，各有其时。就是荔枝鲜的时候，配得上杨玉妃。如今干了，也还配得上屈道翁，总还是在枣栗之上。」说得大家笑了。","en":"it conforms to their own mouths, cutting here, adding there, corrupting it past all sense. Unless one could ask Master Qu to advise.\\" \\"He has little interest in musical theory,\\" said Cixian. \\"Beyond playing the qin, nothing else engages him. If you speak to him of it, he simply says that since the Three Dynasties music has perished, and that is why the Liji and Record of"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":1,"tokens":["道翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云道：「这一比虽切，然究竟委屈了道翁。他却不酸，还比为干江瑶罢。」次贤道：「那更委屈了。你是浙人，自然夸赞江瑶。若说那干江瑶，真像那从良老妓，回忆当年，姿态全无，余腥尚在。」宝珠问次贤道：「食品之内，究以何物为第一？」次贤道：「我口不同于人口，不敢定。以我所好，以鱼为第一。」琴言、蕙芳","en":"\\"The comparison is apt, but rather unfair to Daoweng,\\" said Ziyun. \\"He at least is not sour. Let him be compared to dried river scallops instead.\\" \\"That is even more unfair to him,\\" said Cixian. \\"You are a man from Zhejiang, so naturally you sing the praises of river scallops. If you ask me, dried scallops"}],"44":[{"paragraph":18,"mentions":1,"tokens":["屈道生"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这是琴言出师第二日，琴言原要今日进去，适子云于初六日要请客，一来与南湘、春航送场，并请屈道生，约子玉、仲清等相陪。今日已是初四，索性到初七进去，并说写个字贴与华公子，说他过了假期，一因身子不快，二因留他逛几天。所以琴言倒也心安，乐得多顽几日。","en":"but Ziyun was planning a banquet on the sixth day of the month — to send off Nanxiang and Chunhang, and to host Master Qu Daosheng, with Ziyu, Zhongqing, and others invited to keep them company. As today was only the fourth, they resolved to wait until the seventh for Qinyan to go back, and to draft a note to Young Master Hua explaining that after his leave expired, Qinyan"}],"45":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["屈道生"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"昨日子云又请了屈道生、梅子玉、史南湘、颜仲清、田春航、刘文泽、王恂等，并有诸名旦全来，会了一日。因南湘、春航次早要入场，所以散得甚早。","en":"The day before, Ziyun had once again invited Qu Daosheng, Mei Ziyu, Shi Nanxiang, Yan Zhongqing, Tian Chunhang, Liu Wenze, Wang Xun, and others. Together with all the leading actors, they had gathered for an entire day. Since Nanxiang and Chunhang were to enter the examination hall the following morning, the"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":1,"tokens":["屈道生"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"颜夫人是从没有阻过他的。子玉到了辰刻，因是仙坛，衣冠而去。是日一早，屈道生同金吉甫先到，随后颜仲清、刘文泽、王恂一齐都来了，子玉到了，各人与吉甫相见，叙了些彼此仰慕的话。只有史南湘、田春航在场中未来。相公们到的是宝珠、蕙芳、素兰、玉林、漱芳、兰保、桂保、春喜、琪官、连琴言刚是十人。","en":"way. Ziyu arrived at the chen hour. Since it was an immortal altar, he went in full dress. Early that morning, Qu Daosheng and Jin Jifu had already arrived. They were followed by Yan Zhongqing, Liu Wenze, Wang Xun, and finally Ziyu. They exchanged words of long admiration with Jifu. Shi Nanxiang and Tian Chunhang were still at the examination grounds. Among the performers"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":1,"tokens":["屈道生"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"王胡子过来，也与诸人叙礼，他却都是认识的，与屈道生更是多年相好。王胡子道：「今日人多，仙坛要设个宽绰的地方才好。」子云道：「我估量着人多，已经叫人在含万楼上铺设了。」又笑问王胡子道：「你是主坛的法师，请教你，今日是吃斋呢，还是吃荤？」王胡子笑道：「神仙也是吃肉的，只不用葱蒜五荤罢。」子云道：「这很好","en":"Old Wang Beard came forward and greeted everyone. He knew them all and had been acquainted with Qu Daosheng for years. Old Wang said, \\"With such a crowd today, we need a spacious spot for the altar.\\" Ziyun replied, \\"I expected a crowd, so I had the Tower of Myriad Containment prepared.\\" He smiled at Old Wang and added, \\"You are the master of ceremonies. Tell"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":1,"tokens":["屈道生"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"前世之因，今生之果。\\n杜郎且退，屈翁上前。\\n屈道生听了，恭恭敬敬，上前叩拜，站立在旁。乩上又判了一首诗，王胡子录出，众人看是：","en":"\\"The causes of lives past bear fruit today.\\nYoung Du, withdraw. Old Qu, step forward.\\"\\nHearing this, Qu Daosheng bowed respectfully, stepped forward, and stood aside. The planchette wrote another poem. Old Wang copied it out, and everyone leaned in to read. It read:"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":2,"tokens":["道翁","道生"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云看了，不禁笑道：「据上仙所判，玉侬前世，竟是道翁的女公子了。」琴言不觉红晕了两颊，道生也觉奇异，欲要再问时，见乩又动起来，写道：「吾去也，坡仙来。」写罢，寂然不动。","en":"\\"According to the immortal, Yunong was Old Gentleman's daughter in a previous life!\\" Qinyan's cheeks flushed crimson. Daosheng marveled too and would have asked more, but the planchette wrote: \\"I depart; the Immortal of the Slope comes.\\" Then all was still."},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":2,"tokens":["道生"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"道生与琴言拜送了杜兰仙，重新焚香换酒，众名士一齐下拜，换了琪官、春喜上来扶乩。道生道：「今日坡仙必有佳作，我们当盥漱恭读。」只见乩上写道：","en":"Daosheng and Qinyan bowed to see off the Goddess Du Lanxiang. Fresh incense and wine were brought. Every gentleman knelt together, and Qiguan and Chunxi took the planchette. Daosheng said, \\"Today the Immortal of the Slope will surely leave us a masterpiece. We"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":1,"tokens":["道生"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"春山再展云，情如秋浦长流水。\\n众人看了，都欣欣然说道：「坡仙要作长古了。」子云叫人取了一幅白绢笺，研好了墨，请道生另写。只见乩上又写道：","en":"Delighted, they realized Su Shi meant to compose a long ballad. Ziyun ordered a bolt of fine silk and ink ground so Daosheng could copy it separately. The planchette continued:"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":2,"tokens":["道生"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"梅花一枝开春先，瑶琴三尺弹鹍弦。\\n红愁绿怨泪沾袖，明月一年几度圆。\\n道生写了。仲清对金粟道：「这四句像是说庾香与玉侬的。」金粟点头。子玉看了，分明一个梅字，一个琴字，也知道是说他们二人的，心里又想道：「难道坡仙今日要将这十九个人全写入诗内么？」子云与诸人也都看了，蕙芳呆呆的看着乩盘，只见道生又照着乩上写了四句是：","en":"gather all nineteen of them into his poem. Ziyun and the others read on. Huifang stared blankly at the tray as Daosheng copied four more lines from the planchette:"},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":1,"tokens":["道生"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"香浪费金条脱。\\n蕙芳看了两句，喜动颜色，及看到「分香浪费金条脱」，不觉脸上又微泛红潮，怕人题起潘三的故事。止有道生不懂，吟哦了几遍。众人心里想道：「怎么这些事神仙都会知道？这也奇极了！」各各骇异。又见写道：","en":"wasted, golden armlets,\\" his cheeks flushed faintly, as he dreaded any mention of Pan the Third's affair. Only Daosheng did not catch the allusion, and he chanted the lines repeatedly. Everyone thought to themselves, \\"How can the immortal know such secrets? It is marvelous!\\" More lines appeared:"},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":1,"tokens":["道生"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"名园公子人中英，于彼于此俱有情。\\n珠辉宝气联星斗，金光灿烂云霞明。\\n道生写了，对着子云、吉甫道：「这像是说你们二位呢。」子云、吉甫俱说「惭愧！惭愧！」宝珠看了，也知道带着他，且与吉甫相联，心甚喜欢。只见又写道：","en":"bind.\\nPearl gleams and treasure light thread through the Dipper,\\nGolden radiance and rosy clouds shine bright.\\"\\nDaosheng turned to Ziyun and Jifu. \\"This seems to describe you two.\\" Both replied, \\"We are unworthy!\\" Baozhu knew he was included, linked with Jifu, and he was deeply pleased. Next came:"},{"paragraph":30,"mentions":1,"tokens":["道生"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"更有清才萧颖士，漱芳六艺精文史。\\n闲云不肯出山来，赋价曾高洛阳纸。\\n道生道：「这位是静宜了。」漱芳看见第二句，心中暗喜神仙赞静宜，也带着他的名字，可谓附尾了。一面看写的道：","en":"Shufang's six arts shine,\\nIdle clouds refuse the mountains' call,\\nHis fu once priced above Luoyang's fine paper.\\"\\nDaosheng nodded. \\"That must be Jingyi.\\" Shufang thrilled at the second line. The immortal had praised Jingyi and slipped in his own name. They read on:"},{"paragraph":34,"mentions":2,"tokens":["道翁","道生"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"春兰秋桂非凡种，香色由来人所重。\\n尽待神仙闲品题，群花齐向天门拥。\\n子云道：「他们都说完了，就只有道翁先生与胡兄了。」王胡子拈着长须，候着乩上说他。道生道：「我这老朽，恐怕未必能附诸名士名花之后，且如何能邀坡仙齿芬一粲？」只见乩上又写道：","en":"idly taste each name,\\nAll blooms together crowd Heaven's gate the same.\\"\\nZiyun said, \\"That finishes them. Only Old Gentleman Qu and Brother Hu remain.\\" Old Wang stroked his beard, eagerly waiting to be named. Daosheng said, \\"This worn-out frame hardly deserves a place after such masters and flowers. How could I ever win Su's smile?\\" The planchette wrote again:"},{"paragraph":35,"mentions":5,"tokens":["道生","道翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"涛腥。\\n汨罗沉冤感天帝，千百余世扣明磬。\\n知君一生秉正直，风骨棱棱谢雕饰。\\n娇女含愁化玉郎，石头城下伤春色。\\n道生写到此处，不禁伤感起来，众人亦皆叹息。子玉道：「据两仙所云，玉侬前身的真是道翁先生前世之女，今日相见，可谓有缘。」道生听了子玉之言，不觉泪下。原来道生六十无儿，并且丧偶，孤苦一身，是以触动心事，凄然流涕，便呆呆的看着琴言，琴言也呆呆的看着道生，各有感","en":"unadorned,\\nA tender daughter's grief became this jade youth,\\nSpring wounded beneath the stone-walled town.\\"\\nAs Daosheng copied the words, deep sorrow welled up within him, and everyone sighed in sympathy. Ziyu said softly, \\"From both immortals' words, Yunong's former life was truly your daughter, Old Gentleman. Today's meeting was destined by fate.\\" Hearing Ziyu's words,"},{"paragraph":36,"mentions":1,"tokens":["道生"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"难得名花名士兼，长歌一纸示王髯。\\n丙寅三月初八日，请得眉山苏子瞻。\\n道生写完，众人正要观看，忽见乩上又写道：「奉敕赴凌云殿撰文，不能久留，去矣！」书完寂然不动。众人一齐拜送，焚符酾酒，俱欣欣然有喜色。家童收拾了仙坛，大家就在楼中坐下，又将仙诗同读了两遍。","en":"One long song shows Old Wang the sign.\\nThird month, eighth day, year Bingyin,\\nWe summoned Meishan's Su Zizhan.\\"\\nDaosheng had just finished copying when the planchette added, \\"Ordered to the Lingyun Hall to draft documents. Cannot stay. Farewell!\\" Then, there was complete silence. They all bowed to see out the spirit, burned talismans, and poured libations. Their faces"},{"paragraph":37,"mentions":3,"tokens":["道翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"吩咐家人在承荫堂摆了四桌盛席，便对众人道：「今日我有一言，上承仙命，下合人心，成了前因后果。两仙乩上俱判玉侬为道翁前生娇女。现在道翁无子，玉侬无父，我欲成此仙缘，要请道翁收玉侬为义子。玉侬虽失足于前，未尝不可立身于后，想先生决不以世俗之见论人。未识玉侬之意如何？","en":"Ziyun ordered a lavish banquet to be laid in the Hall of Inherited Shade. He stood and addressed the gathering. \\"Today I have a proposal, commanded from above and welcomed below, that completes the circle of cause and effect. Both immortals judged Yunong to be Old Gentleman's daughter in a former life. Now, he has no son, and Yunong has no father. I wish to seal this fairy bond and ask Old Gentleman to adopt Yunong as a son. Although Yunong stumbled in the past, he may yet stand upright. Surely you will not judge him by vulgar eyes. As for Yunong's own inclination, I cannot yet speak to it.\\""},{"paragraph":38,"mentions":6,"tokens":["道生","道翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"而诸公以弟之言为然否？」道生尚未回言，子玉喜动颜色，即道：「玉侬若得道翁先生栽培，真是精金入冶，美玉成器。只求道翁不以寒微为鄙，玉侬岂有不愿之理？」次贤与吉甫等都赞成道：「这是极好的事，大约今日合当父子相逢，不然杜兰仙何以特判出来，又单叫道翁上前，说明前因后果，不是也要撮合这件","en":"He turned to the rest of the group. \\"And you, gentlemen, do you find my proposal sound?\\" Before Daosheng could answer, Ziyu's face lit up with joy. \\"If Yunong gains Old Gentleman's guidance, it will be fine gold in the forge, fair jade carved to ware. Only do not scorn his humble birth. How could Yunong refuse?\\" Cixian and Jifu wholeheartedly approved."},{"paragraph":39,"mentions":3,"tokens":["道翁","道生"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"但终是面嫩，答应不来，红泛桃花，低头不语。子云道：「玉侬，你怎么样？道翁是极愿意的了。况你们前生原系父女，今世自然天性未离，这是光明正大的事情，何妨答应，有什么害羞处说不出来的？」琴言目视子云，将头点了一点。子云哈哈大笑道：「愿意了，愿意了！这也不是轻易遇得着的。」就让众人到承荫堂，铺了红毡，次贤、子云扶道生坐了，文泽、","en":"meetings are rare!\\" He led everyone to the Hall of Inherited Shade and spread a red carpet. Cixian and Ziyun seated Daosheng. Wenze and Zhongqing gently drew Qinyan forward to perform eight deep bows, and Daosheng graciously received them."},{"paragraph":40,"mentions":2,"tokens":["道生"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"众人称贺已毕，道生又谢了子云，便说道：「弟是孤苦一身，并无家小，既承诸公雅爱作成，认为父子。但我比不得那有子嗣的人，单只挂个名儿。我既认了他，自就与亲生的一样，要教训他，并且要随着我去，不知他心上何如？」子云听了，略一踌躇，即问琴言道：「这事要你自己作主意，旁人难以应","en":"When the congratulations were done, Daosheng thanked Ziyun and said, \\"I am all alone, with no family. Since you gentlemen have honored me with this adoption, I am not one to wear an empty name. I will treat him as my own blood kin and instruct him. He must follow me when I go. What is his wish?\\""},{"paragraph":41,"mentions":2,"tokens":["道生"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云便请入席。第一席是道生、子玉、吉甫、王胡子、琴言，二席是仲清、文泽、王恂、子云、次贤，九个名旦分为两桌，各自叙齿坐了三、四两席。琴言坐在下手，拘拘谨谨，也不举箸，甚觉可怜。倒是道生体恤他，道：「凡遇热闹场中，当言的即言，也不必过于拘谨，但存着个后辈的分寸就是了。」","en":"Ziyun invited everyone to the table. The first table sat Daosheng, Ziyu, Jifu, Old Wang Beard, and Qinyan. The second seated Zhongqing, Wenze, Wang Xun, Ziyun, and Cixian. The nine actors split two more tables by age. Qinyan sat quietly at the foot, his chopsticks untouched, looking pitifully constrained. Daosheng"},{"paragraph":42,"mentions":2,"tokens":["道生"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"道生喝了几杯酒，便与子玉、吉甫、王胡子谈些闲话。王胡子道：「屈老先生，晚生这个请仙的本事如何？你说我是赚人么？」道生笑道：「今日之事却真稀奇，若不是我亲眼见的，亲手写的，凭谁告诉我，我也不信。」又道：「胡兄，你往常请仙，也有这么灵异么？」胡子道：「今年过","en":"After a few cups, Daosheng chatted comfortably with Ziyu, Jifu, and Old Wang Beard. Old Wang asked, \\"Old Gentleman Qu, how was my spirit-planchette today? Do you still say I cheat people?\\" Daosheng smiled warmly. \\"Today was a marvel. I would not believe it from hearsay had I not"},{"paragraph":43,"mentions":1,"tokens":["道生"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"道生也笑道：「我也略猜着此，但不知是怎样个始末，何妨与我说明？」子云道：「我要说，又怕有人不依，我不说罢。」玉林对漱芳说道：「起初乩动的时候，我总当着你的手动，我想把我的手不动，教你写不成。后来，不由得我的手也跟着动起来了。」漱芳道：「可不是，我先也打量","en":"Daosheng smiled as well. \\"I guessed something of the sort. What was the story? Will you tell me?\\" Ziyun deflected gracefully. \\"If I speak, someone may object. I will keep silent.\\" Yulin turned to Shufang and whispered, \\"When the planchette first moved, I thought"},{"paragraph":47,"mentions":3,"tokens":["道生","道翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"道生来了一天，便要早回，对琴言道：「明日我着人来接你罢。」子云道：「先生何不搬来，那寓里有甚好处？」道生道：「这个最妙。我心上不好讲，又要搅扰。我还要细细把你的园子逛一逛呢！」诸名士道：「若得道翁先生住在园里，更有趣了。」次贤道：「前年园亭成后，一切布置","en":"Daosheng had been out all day and wished to leave early. He told Qinyan, \\"Tomorrow I will send for you.\\" Ziyun asked, \\"Why not move in here? What good is an inn?\\" Daosheng replied, \\"That sounds ideal. I hardly liked to impose, but I still mean to wander your"},{"paragraph":48,"mentions":3,"tokens":["道翁","道生"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"至今日看去，似觉草草。昨日我与度香商量，尚须添的添，换的换，非道翁及诸兄手笔不可。」仲清道：「我们究竟还没有逛到。须尽一日之兴，游到了，方可拟题。」子云道：「含万楼下，我想刻一篇怡园序，要借重道翁。明日搬来，第一就要请教这篇序。」次贤笑道：「他还没有搬进来，你倒先索房租了。」说得众人大笑。道生约定明日即移过来，与琴","en":"laughed out loud. \\"He has not moved in yet, and you already demand rent!\\" The room filled with general laughter. Daosheng named the morrow for his move, confirming he would lodge with Qinyan."}],"46":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":5,"tokens":["屈道翁","道翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说屈道翁搬过怡园来，与琴仙就在海棠春圃住下。次贤向在梨花院，与海棠圃相近。道翁即有一番教导，琴仙从前念过的书，一面温理，一面与他讲究些诗词文艺，习学楷书。可喜琴仙天姿颖悟，过目成诵，而且锐志攻书，把从前的忧闷倒也撇开。一连几日，道翁见其聪明可学，也甚欢喜。子","en":"When Qu Daoweng moved over to the Garden of Contentment, he and Qinxian took up their lodging at the Crabapple Spring Garden. Cixian had long been in the Pear Blossom Court, which was close by. Daoweng set about teaching him at once: the books Qinxian had read before"},{"paragraph":2,"mentions":2,"tokens":["道翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"次贤看了，请他斟酌。次贤道：「妙极了，就使徐、庾复生，也不能涂改一字。」子云道：「是石刻好呢，还是木刻好呢？」道翁道：「论长久，自然是石刻。前日见金吉甫相熟的那个季十矮子，刻工尚好，不过价值大些，然此是市井的常理。你莫若找吉甫将他荐来一刻，是极妙的。不是说要刻在含万楼屏风上？却也好看。」次贤称善。子云即叫书童找出了八张大宣纸，照着屏风大小裁好了，送到海棠春圃，请","en":"One day, remembering Ziyun's commission for a *Preface to the Garden of Contentment*, Daoweng drafted half a day, revised, and carried the text to Ziyun and Cixian for comment. Cixian said: \\"Perfect—even if Xu Ling and Yu Xin rose from the grave they could not alter a stroke.\\" Ziyun asked: \\"Stone inscription or woodblock?\\" Daoweng said: \\"For"},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":4,"tokens":["道翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"、春航、南湘、仲清、文泽、王恂，共是六位，惟吉甫因感冒未到。园内屈氏父子，与次贤、主人四位，都在含万楼下坐了。道翁道：「这个含万楼是本《易经》「含万物而化光」句摘下，因为园中的主楼，故取此名。但就本意是言干道之大，此名似乎不甚相宜，度香以为何如？我见楼上现供着赐书，何不就改为赐书楼，未知可否？」子云道：「改得甚妙，就是赐书楼。还要求作一副长联。」道翁道：「老夫改","en":"piecemeal: Ziyu, Chunhang, Nanxiang, Zhongqing, Wenze and Wang Xun—six—while Jifu stayed home with a chill. The Qu father and son, Cixian and their host — four in all — sat below the Tower of Myriad Containment. Daoweng explained: \\"This tower borrows from the *Book of Changes*: 'embracing the myriad things, transforming their splendour.' As chief pavilion it suits"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":2,"tokens":["道翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云让大众进了承荫堂，崇墉巍焕，局面堂皇。院子内有座戏台，槐阴布绿，栋宇生辉。道翁与诸名士看了那些匾对，说道：「这堂名很好，不用换。东西楹要添副长联，就请静宜大笔罢。」次贤道：「这些联额，原是弟当日胡乱写成的。这承荫堂与赐书楼，皆是正屋，还求吾兄老手一题才称，恐我们终是柔筋脆骨，撑不住这个大局面。况所添的地方尚多，大约有二十余处，","en":"walls, splendid and imposing, and a stage in the courtyard, with green pagoda-tree shade against the shining eaves. Daoweng and the scholars looked over the plaques and couplets, and he said, \\"The name of this hall is good; there is no need to change it. The east and west pillars want a long couplet added. Let Jingyi take the brush.\\"\\n\\nCixian said, \\"Those boards and couplets"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":1,"tokens":["道翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"若尽要老夫题咏，倒将诸位的锦绣埋没了。」众名士谦道：「此处实不敢妄拟，其余各拟几句呈改。」琴仙又捧了笔砚过来，道翁道：「你学了几天字了，我念你写，不要写别字才好，诸兄看看可长进些么？」遂口占一联，琴仙写了，个个的端楷。","en":"will draft a few lines and submit them for correction.\\"\\n\\nQinxian brought the brush and inkstone over again, and Daoweng said, \\"You have been at your writing some days now. I shall dictate and you shall write — mind you make no wrong characters. Gentlemen, see whether he has come on at all.\\" He composed a couplet aloud, and Qinxian wrote it out, every character in faultless"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":2,"tokens":["道翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"风草月松，缘庭绮合；\\n日华云实，旁沼星罗。\\n诸名士惟有痛赞。再看琴仙的字，已是美女簪花，秀润如水，更为欣喜。道翁道：「对面戏台，虽有联匾，那块「太音之和」可以不换，檐前那块是要换的。柱上的七字联，应改八字的，请庾香世兄一题，老夫借观珠玉。」子玉尚要推逊，众人挤定了，却也不慌不忙，想了半刻工夫，提起笔来写了，说道：「小侄荒疏，未敢妄作，也集个成语，尚求老先生斧正","en":"followed; Qinxian's brush now flowed like hairpins and blossoms—graceful and moist—and hearts warmed further. Daoweng said: \\"The stage opposite keeps its plaques—'Harmony of Great Music' may stay—but the eaves board must change; the seven-character pillars should carry eight—Young Yuxiang shall try—I would trade for a pearl.\\" Ziyu hesitated until the crowd settled him;"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":1,"tokens":["道翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"轻扇初开，长眉始画。\\n鸣瑟向赵，吹箫入秦。\\n道翁赞道：「我说庾香世兄定是不凡的，果然，果然！」子云及众名士也赞了好。","en":"Light fans open; long brows are freshly traced.\\nZithers resound toward Zhao, pipes echo into Qin.\\n\\nDaoweng cried: \\"I knew Yuxiang would excel—indeed!\\" Ziyun and the others praised without stint."},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":1,"tokens":["道翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，小憩了一会。来到正屋，是七间，里面又间着些洞房绮户。再到后一进，长廊缭曲，屈戍横波，却种满芍药花，此时未开。道翁道：「这牡丹香国，繁华已极，可改名为宝香堂，后一进题为护香廊。这宝香堂须添一副对子，请湘帆兄罢。」","en":"about with latticework rippling along it, and the whole of it planted with herbaceous peonies, not yet in flower.\\n\\nDaoweng said, \\"This Kingdom of Peony Fragrance is splendour carried to its limit. It may be renamed the Hall of Treasured Fragrance, and the court behind it inscribed the Fragrance-Guarding Colonnade. The Hall of Treasured Fragrance must have a couplet added."},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":1,"tokens":["道翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"五云书凿金银字，百宝栏开富贵花。\\n道翁看了赞道：「真好富丽，却称这宝香堂。」众人也附和了几声。次贤道：「我们还是从东去呢，还是从西去呢？」子云道：「从西到东路长，还是从东转西，可以坐船，路却顺些。」便领众人出了护香廊后的围墙，只见一带石坡，层层的丛兰翠筱，芳磬袭人。从石磴上行到了山北，也","en":"five hues carve characters in gold and silver; rails of a hundred gems cradle blossoms of wealth and honour.\\"\\n\\nDaoweng praised the grandeur as worthy of the hall; others echoed. Cixian asked: \\"East loop or west?\\" Ziyun said: \\"West to east runs longer—begin east and circle west by boat—the route flows easier.\\" He led them past the colonnade wall onto stone terraces layered"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":2,"tokens":["道翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"低。望东南去的，却是层峦苍翠，山下一带清溪，溪外尽是竹树。依山临水间，有一所院宇，石壁上刻了「兰径」两个大字。道翁与众人进了屋子，见是一间、两间、三间、五间的不一，有好几处。满目尽是碧杜、红兰、翠苔、绿藓，甚为幽雅。道翁道：「此处甚佳，一洗宝香堂繁华之气，不可不题。」因题为风露清吟馆，对仲清道：「剑潭兄试题一联。」仲清不能推辞，此处也合他的雅趣，即题道：","en":"the hill and the water stood a compound, with the two great characters *Orchid Path* cut into the stone face.\\n\\nDaoweng and the others went into the building and found rooms of one bay, of two, of three, of five, in several separate places; and everywhere green cassia and red orchids, emerald moss and green lichen — very quiet and elegant.\\n\\nDaoweng said, \\"This is an excellent"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":2,"tokens":["道翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"二分水蘸三分竹，一面山栽两面花。\\n道翁赞道：「好极了，却移不到别处去。」仲清笑道：「有先生的珠玉在前，我等实难附尾，不过聊以塞责而已。」文泽道：「此处我竟没有来游玩过。」王恂道：「我也没有，到护香廊就住了。」南湘道：「我去年看菊花，是从这里走过，倒游了一游。」子云引道，过了一座木桥，从竹","en":"\\"Two parts water reflect three parts bamboo; a single slope of hill bears two slopes of bloom.\\"\\n\\nDaoweng exclaimed, \\"Excellent — and it could not be moved anywhere else.\\" Zhongqing smiled. \\"With your pearls before us, we can hardly do more than follow at the tail; it is only to fill the gap.\\" Wenze said, \\"I have never once come and looked at this place.\\""},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":1,"tokens":["道翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，如虬龙盘云一般，中间设一张禅床，前面一个丹鼎，署名为松龛。外有一个鹤栏，见有两只白鹤，雪羽皑皑的，甚是可爱。道翁道：「松龛可改名为松鹤丹房，竹君可题一联。」南湘也集了六朝文，念道：","en":"called the Pine Shrine. Outside was a crane-pen with two white cranes in it, their snowy plumage very fine to see.\\n\\nDaoweng said, \\"The Pine Shrine may be renamed the Cinnabar Chamber of Pine and Crane. Zhujun, give us a couplet.\\" Nanxiang made one out of Six Dynasties prose, and recited:"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":3,"tokens":["道翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"逸翮独翔，孤风绝侣；\\n真花暂落，画树长春。\\n道翁赞了「好」。翻山过去，从一条石径走下，望南一百余步，倒是梅崦了。密叶繁阴，子多于豆。同进了屋内，众人已走了许多路，也要歇歇了。子云即吩咐摆饭上来，略喝了几杯酒，便吃了饭，喝了茶。道翁问道：「这个园共有几里？我们今日也走了好半天，还不到三分之一。」子云","en":"aloof, the solitary wind without a mate; true blossoms briefly fall, while painted trees are forever spring.\\"\\n\\nDaoweng pronounced it good. They crossed the hill and went down by a stone path, and a hundred paces and more to the south lay the Plum Knoll, dense-leaved and heavy with shade, and more fruit on it than beans on a bush.\\n\\nThey went in together, for the company"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":5,"tokens":["道翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"道翁道：「已经好极了，设使我起出稿来，还未必能如此。」子云道：「有几处，静宜也改了好几回才成的。」子玉道：「这梅崦两字，只好刻在山上。在房屋里，这崦字似乎要改才好。」道翁道：「就请教换个名字。」子玉道：「还请道翁先生改罢。」仲清道：「你若想着了好的，就说","en":"Daoweng said, \\"It is already excellent. Even had I brought out a draft of my own, it might not have reached this standard.\\" Ziyun explained, \\"There were several places that Jingyi revised again and again before they came right.\\"\\n\\nZiyu said, \\"The two words 'Plum"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":1,"tokens":["道翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"看他竹外枝斜，恰称翠袖生寒，缟衣纯素；伴我夜阑人静，正值瑶琴一曲，玉笛三终。\\n道翁大赞道：「仙骨珊珊，非吃烟火食所能道，拜服，拜服！」子云与众人也都大赞，又赞琴仙的字比先写的更加精美。","en":"deepens into silence—just when the jade zither finishes a tune, and the jade flute plays its third refrain.\\"\\n\\nDaoweng cried: \\"Immortal bones—no kitchen smoke could phrase it—I bow!\\" Ziyun praised again; Qinxian's brush surpassed earlier work."},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":1,"tokens":["道翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"前面两块英州灵石，平屋三进。后有一楼，楼上有一神龛，供设花神牌位。中间一进，署名为红茶仙馆，两边都有厢房。道翁道：「此处既供设花神，索性做个花神庙，改名为蕊珠仙府，湘帆兄可再咏一联。」春航应了，想了一想，写了出来。众人看是：","en":"set up in it. The middle court was inscribed the Red Camellia Immortal's Lodge, with wing-rooms on either side.\\n\\nDaoweng said, \\"Since the Flower Goddess is worshipped here, make it a temple of the Flower Goddess outright and rename it the Immortal Mansion of the Pearl of Stamens. Brother Xiangfan, another couplet from you.\\" Chunhang assented, thought a moment, and wrote"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":1,"tokens":["道翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"花雨散缤纷，娇舞霓裳云贴地；风情吹旖旎，轻摇月佩步凌虚。\\n道翁笑道：「湘帆兄的是妙才，写得如此风流香艳，真把那花情花魂都写出来了。」春航自谦了几句，众人也帮着赞好。","en":"the clouds brush the earth; an amorous breeze blows soft—moon-pendants gently sway, footsteps tread the void.\\"\\n\\nDaoweng laughed that such wit bodied forth flower soul; Chunhang demurred; praise followed."},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":2,"tokens":["道翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"于是出了蕊珠仙府，顺着两行修竹径，一条荔枝街，又过了几处神仙洞，望东走，到了萧次贤的梨院来。道翁道：「可不必进去了，梨院可改为卧云香院，庸庵兄请题一联。」王恂一面想，随着走到了海棠春圃来。子云道：「且请坐坐，喝杯茶，那边又要用船了。」都进了海棠春圃坐下。道翁道：「海棠花为花中艳品，还有那些紫白丁香衬贴他，更觉香色兼备，须好好起他个名字才好。」即","en":"avenue of tall bamboo and Lychee Lane, passed several grottoes, and going east came to Xiao Cixian's Pear Court. Daoweng said, \\"There is no need to go in. The Pear Court may be changed to the Fragrant Court of Reclining Clouds. Brother Yong'an, a couplet, if you please.\\"\\n\\nWang Xun was still thinking as they walked on to the Crabapple Spring Garden, and Ziyun said, \\"Sit"},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":2,"tokens":["道翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"来，答应不出。子云道：「很能，很能。你快想来，如不甚好，也没有人笑你的。」琴仙道：「有倒有一个，只怕不好用。」道翁道：「你且说来。」琴仙道：「春风沉醉轩，不知用得用不得？」子云拍手赞好，子玉等同声说道：「果然真好！这沉醉二字，用得入神入妙。」道翁也点点头，道：「也难为他。」又道：「你还能作一副对子么？」琴仙正要回言，王恂已写了卧云香院的对子出来，看是：","en":"you.\\"\\n\\n\\"I do have one name,\\" Qinxian said at last, \\"but I fear it may not serve.\\"\\n\\n\\"Let us hear it first,\\" said Daoweng.\\n\\n\\"'Pavilion of Spring-Wind Intoxication.' I do not know whether it can be used.\\"\\n\\nZiyun clapped his hands in delight, while Ziyu and the others praised it with one voice: \\"It is truly excellent! Those two words 'lie drunk' catch the very spirit with"},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":2,"tokens":["道翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"梦到香云生屋角，笑看新月上墙腰。\\n道翁与众人也着实赞赏了。琴仙道：「这个春风沉醉轩是昨日偶然想着的。对子只有上联，没有想得出下联。」道翁道：「你且将上联写出来看看，不好就不用他。如可以用得，请一位替你对成了才好。」琴仙就将上联写了出来，众人看是：","en":"reach the fragrant clouds above the roof's corner; with a smile I watch the new moon crest the wall's waist.\\"\\n\\nDaoweng and the rest praised it warmly. Qinxian said, \\"This Pavilion of Spring-Wind Intoxication came into my head only yesterday. I have the upper line of the couplet and could not get the lower.\\" Daoweng said, \\"Write out the upper line and let us see it. If"},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":1,"tokens":["道翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，倒将琴仙赞得不好意思起来。仲清道：「可惜没有下联。」子玉将这句不住的吟哦，次贤道：「这下联非庾香续成不可。」道翁道：「果然，就烦庾香点铁成金罢。」子玉欣然提起笔来，写道：","en":"lower line.\\" Ziyu kept murmuring the words over. Cixian said, \\"Nobody but Yuxiang can complete that lower line.\\" Daoweng said, \\"True enough. Let us trouble Yuxiang to turn iron into gold.\\" Ziyu took up the brush with pleasure and wrote:"},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":1,"tokens":["道翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"千金买良夜，好酬春色正温柔。\\n道翁大赞道：「此与湘帆兄一样手笔，今日看诸兄题的联句，正是一人一样性灵，原不能强合的，就是前舟还没有题过。」","en":"\\"A thousand in gold buys this perfect night—well to repay the spring, tender and warm.\\"\\n\\nDaoweng praised parity with Xiangfan—each man's spirit showed distinct—only Qianzhou had yet to write."},{"paragraph":30,"mentions":1,"tokens":["道翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"。众人绕过了河堤，下了船，荡出了小港，即是个大宽阔处，令人豁目爽心。不多一刻，到了吟秋水榭，子云请众客进了榭。道翁尚未游过，把这三层水榭游了一转，老年人也乏了，就在中间一层坐了。子云道：「少酌几杯，此处已预备了。」于是众家人上来，在各人面前摆了个攒盒，斟了杯酒。","en":"heart. In a little while they reached the Autumn-Chant Waterside Pavilion, and Ziyun invited his guests inside.\\n\\nDaoweng had never been over it, and went round all three storeys of the water-pavilion; but he was an old man and tired, and sat down on the middle floor. Ziyun said, \\"Let us drink a few cups; it is all laid ready here.\\" The servants came up and set a partitioned"},{"paragraph":31,"mentions":1,"tokens":["道翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"道翁饮了数杯，倚阑眺远，见旁有条条小港，迭迭崇山，前有绿柳低垂，红桥斜跨，山上有泉，翻银滚雪，屋边皆树，云护烟笼，赞道：「我看园中以此处为第一，这榭名也好，就每层有一副对子。前舟题第一层，竹君题第二层，剑潭题第三层。必皆有惊人好句，老夫洗耳恭听。」三人不","en":"Daoweng drank several cups and leaned on the rail to look out. There were little channels running off on every side and ranges of hills piled one behind another; in front, green willows hanging low and a red bridge slanting across; a spring on the hill turning"},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":2,"tokens":["道翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"楚江烟水吴江雨；▉字阑杆丁字帘。\\n道翁及众人痛赞了。道翁道：「这第二层最难，上有第三层，下有第一层，这要看竹君的巧思了。」南湘已想了一会，颇难着笔。仲清也在那里凝思，各要争胜。南湘已得了，写了出来，道：「题得不好，将就算他第二层罢。」众人看是：","en":"\\"Mist on the river of Chu, rain on the river of Wu; …-shaped balustrades, T-shaped blinds.\\"\\n\\nDaoweng and the rest praised it warmly. Daoweng said, \\"The middle storey is the hardest — there is a third above it and a first below, and this will take all Zhujun's ingenuity.\\" Nanxiang had been thinking a good while and found it hard to set pen to paper;"},{"paragraph":33,"mentions":1,"tokens":["道翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"秋色扑帘栊，置身已觉超平等；月光穿竹树，放眼请登最上层。\\n道翁赞道：「果然是第二层的联句，移易不动，这是煞费苦心才得出来。剑潭的第三层如何？想另有妙意。」仲清道：「我的不及竹君的切题。」即写了出来，看是：君如趁月来游，云移一鹤；我欲乘风归去，桥卧长虹。","en":"mortal realm; moonlight threads through bamboo and tree—to cast your gaze afar, please ascend the highest tier.\\"\\nDaoweng said: \\"Truly the middle voice—immovable—clearly wrought with pain. Jiantan, the summit?\\" Zhongqing answered: \\"Mine cannot match his fit\\" and wrote: Should you roam by moon, a crane rides shifting cloud; I would ride the wind home—a long bridge sleeps"},{"paragraph":34,"mentions":1,"tokens":["道翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"赞起来，道：「剑潭此联，颇有仙气，这断不像第二层，也不像第一层，实在是第三层最高处，我真服了你这种浑脱句子。」道翁与诸人也齐声痛赞。","en":"admiration: \\"Immortal breath—neither lowest nor middle tone—pure top-storey height—I yield to such unfettered lines!\\" Daoweng and all thundered praise."},{"paragraph":35,"mentions":2,"tokens":["道翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"曲红桥，沿着那竹树蒙茸，到了一处，那是停云叙雨轩。高下两层，一在半山，一在山脚，甚为幽雅，大致与吟秋水榭彷佛。道翁道：「这个名字要改，此处是第二个胜景，着不得陈腐语，改为练秋阁罢。」众人道：「改得很好。」道翁道：「此处须静宜添一副好对子。」次贤道：「恐题得不佳。」也即写了两句，看是：","en":"and one at the foot, and was very quiet and elegant, much of a kind with the Autumn-Chant Waterside Pavilion.\\n\\nDaoweng said, \\"This name must be changed. It is the second of the fine prospects here, and will not bear a stale phrase. Call it the Refining Autumn Loft.\\" They all said, \\"Well changed.\\" Daoweng said, \\"Jingyi must add a good couplet here.\\" Cixian said, \\"I am"},{"paragraph":36,"mentions":1,"tokens":["道翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"清樽满赏《山香曲》，画舫遥听《水调歌》。\\n道翁与众名士赞赏不已。","en":"cups brim as we savour the *Mountain Fragrance*; painted boats drift afar, listening to the *Water-Tune Song*.\\"\\nDaoweng and guests praised unstintingly."},{"paragraph":38,"mentions":3,"tokens":["道翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"处院落，自成一景，亭台楼阁，备极其胜。子云领众都走到了，进了正屋坐下。子云又让客用了些茶、点心。诸人一面游赏，道翁道：「此处是个大坐落，桂岭二字不足以尽之，改为丛桂山房罢。」子云道：「改得妙。」道翁又道：「你自置一联。」子云笑道：「道翁先生既要考我，也应早些命题。到临时才说，教我如何想得出来？」构思了一刻，也集了副成语，写将出来。众人看是：","en":"again pressed tea and delicate refreshments upon his guests.\\n\\nAs they drank, they continued to admire the scene. Daoweng said, \\"This is an extensive establishment; the two words 'Osmanthus Ridge' cannot contain all its character. Let us rename it the Osmanthus Grove Mountain Lodge.\\"\\n\\n\\"An excellent change,\\" said Ziyun.\\n\\n\\"And you must furnish its couplet yourself,\\" Daoweng"},{"paragraph":39,"mentions":1,"tokens":["道翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"大雅扶轮，小山承盖；\\n落花入领，微风动裾。\\n道翁道：「集得甚好。」即起身出了桂岭，望北而来。只见怪石嵯峨，若飞若走，颇为骇目。\\n古藤如臂，香草成茵。上了山径，直盘旋到了山顶，有十丈多高，把园中的景致，望得豁然。看了好一会，才一步步的拾级而下，到一个山凹里亭子边，便是缥渺亭，靠山踞石，两翼外张如飞的","en":"wheels, small hills raise the canopy; fallen blossoms slip within the collar, a gentle breeze stirs the skirt.\\"\\n\\nDaoweng said, \\"Very well pieced together.\\" He rose and left Osmanthus Ridge and came away northward. There were grotesque rocks towering up, some as though flying and some as though running, quite startling to the eye; ancient creepers thick as a man's arm,"},{"paragraph":40,"mentions":2,"tokens":["道翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"亭中可容三席，下面东手就是方才的练秋阁了。道翁道：「怎么又走回来了？」看亭子里有副对子，是他的学生华光宿的，也还用得，便对子云道：「你于此处，何不再集一副成语？」子云道：「我料着道翁还要考我，我已想就了。」即写道：幽岫含云，深溪蓄翠；\\n横藤碍路，弱柳低人。","en":"room for three tables, and below it to the east stood the Refining Autumn Loft they had passed a while before. Daoweng said, \\"How is it that we have come round again?\\" He looked at the couplet hanging there, which was by his pupil Hua Guangsu and would serve well enough, and said to Ziyun, \\"Why not gather another couplet of set phrases for this spot?\\" Ziyun said, \\"I"},{"paragraph":41,"mentions":2,"tokens":["道翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"道翁说：「好。」又步下山来，沿着右边一带山径，足足走了半里多路，过了好些石磴、云屏、小亭、曲榭，到了一带梧桐树边，前面远远望见赐书楼。才从西边一条曲径走去，又穿过了几处神仙洞，便是一道清溪，围着一个院落，门外也有几堆小山，尽是碧桃花树，已盛开了。遂同过了","en":"Daoweng said, \\"Good.\\" They walked down the hill again and along the range of paths on the right, a good half li and more, past a quantity of stone steps and cloud-screens and little kiosks and winding galleries, until they came to a belt of paulownias, and away"},{"paragraph":42,"mentions":1,"tokens":["道翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"此处即仙源，自有问字青鬟，添香红袖；名园为福地，不数踏歌潭水，打桨春潮。\\n道翁大赞，众名士也随声附和。","en":"renowned garden is a blessed land—no need to sing by the Peach Blossom Pool, or strike oars in the spring tide.\\"\\n\\nDaoweng marvelled; others echoed."},{"paragraph":43,"mentions":2,"tokens":["道翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"出了寻源仙墅，又过一座半石半土的小山，接着就是几百株杏林，围着三四层重楼，湘帘晃漾，绮户文窗，令人应接不暇。道翁道：「这个楼名题得才妙，无须更换。东风昨夜楼是那一位题的？」次贤道：「是度香题的，对子是我做的。」道翁道：「好对子。」朗吟了一遍，也叫琴仙写了出来，琴仙记得是：","en":"trees girdling a four-storey tower—its blinds swaying and its latticed windows more than the eye could take in. Daoweng said, \\"This tower is finely named; it needs no changing. Who wrote the East-Wind-Last-Night Tower?\\" Cixian said, \\"Duxiang wrote the name, and I made the couplet.\\" Daoweng said, \\"A good couplet.\\" He chanted it through once and had Qinxian write it out;"},{"paragraph":44,"mentions":1,"tokens":["道翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"园中的景致。又到了一处，尽是些榴花艾叶、萱草紫薇等类，有几架老藤花开满四处，还有些罂粟、虞美人，有五六处坐落。道翁各处看了，知是小赤城，因榴花而设。又看了些对联，自己题了一副，命琴仙写了出来。众人看是：","en":"wistaria in full flower on every side, and poppies too, and a corn-poppy or two, and five or six sets of buildings. Daoweng looked over the whole of it and saw that it was the Little Red Citadel, made for the sake of the pomegranate flower. He looked at the couplets as well, composed one of his own, and told Qinxian to write it out. They read:"},{"paragraph":45,"mentions":4,"tokens":["道翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"、翠竹、芭蕉、棕榈、枇杷柿子，清荫满目，爽逼衣襟。有五六块大盘陀石，顶上盘着凌霄花，正开得茂盛。此处妙不可言，道翁与众名士在石磴上坐了，道翁道：「这里别开生面，宜夏宜秋。」坐了一会，进了屋宇，见有回廊，有抱厦，有平台，有敞厅，游历不厌。正在厅内，见题着积翠轩，有几副对联。道翁道：「积翠轩可改为清凉诗境。」众名士道：「这诗境二字大妙。」道翁道：「庾香再题一联何如？","en":"there with trumpet-creeper coiled over the tops of them and in full flower. The place was beyond describing.\\n\\nDaoweng and the scholars sat down on the stone steps, and Daoweng said, \\"This is something quite new — good for summer and good for autumn.\\" They sat a while and then went into the buildings, and found galleries and a projecting porch and a terrace and an open"},{"paragraph":46,"mentions":1,"tokens":["道翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"零雨送秋，轻寒迎节；\\n狂花满屋，落叶半床。\\n道翁与众人赞毕，过了清凉诗境，便是个水荡，青蒲细柳，绿蘸波光。湖边有两三处茅舍竹篱，是个稻庄，其余隙地尽作平畴，颇有鸡犬桑麻之胜。东边河面窄处，有个石梁，众人走了过去，就是先来的射圃，那边就是菊畦了。到了稻庄，闲步了一会。又到稻庄后面，尚有无数的小房子在","en":"light chill welcomes the turning season; wild blossoms fill the room, fallen leaves cover half the bed.\\"\\n\\nWhen Daoweng and the rest had done praising it, they passed the Cool and Tranquil Poetic Realm and came to a stretch of open water, with green rushes and slender willows dipping their green in the light on the waves. On the bank were two or three thatched cottages"},{"paragraph":48,"mentions":1,"tokens":["道翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"道翁不胜留恋，想起归田之乐来。谓子云道：「将来尊大人回来，这个平泉庄胜于古人多矣。」便数今天添的对子，已有了二十二副，内有最多者是子玉与他自己，其余也有两副的，惟文泽、王恂只有一副，未免不公，于是烦王恂、文泽各撰一副，又改稻庄为红雪西庄。先是文泽念了出来","en":"Daoweng could hardly bear to leave it, and fell to thinking of the pleasures of retirement. He said to Ziyun, \\"When your honoured father comes home, this Pingquan manor of yours will far outdo the ancients'.\\"\\n\\nHe then counted the couplets added that day, and"},{"paragraph":50,"mentions":1,"tokens":["道翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"宰相归来游绿野，将军老去隐青门。\\n道翁道：「这两联都好，不分伯仲。今日这些对联，各有所长，老夫只可拜倒辕门了。」众名士谦让了好些话。","en":"The minister comes home to roam the green wild; the general, grown old, hides at Green Gate.\\nDaoweng said both pairs excelled—no choosing between them—today's lines each had virtue; he could only kneel at the camp gate. Modest protests followed."},{"paragraph":52,"mentions":1,"tokens":["道翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云请众位还到宝香堂，已是夕阳西下，朱霞半天，映着那些牡丹花，更为绚烂。已撤了护花的幛子。子云备了两席，一席是道翁、南湘、子玉、琴仙、次贤，一席是仲清、春航、文泽、王恂、子云。","en":"The sun sank west; red sky half the vault set peonies blazing—protective screens gone. Two tables waited—one for Daoweng, Nanxiang, Ziyu, Qinxian, Cixian; one for Zhongqing, Chunhang, Wenze, Wang Xun, Ziyun."},{"paragraph":53,"mentions":3,"tokens":["道翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"、林春喜同来见了，即分开坐了，谈了些闲话。子云道：「今日这二十四副对子，清芬浓艳，各尽所长。但我看来，始终要推道翁先生的赐书楼、承荫堂冠冕堂皇了。」众名士道：「自然，我们到底觉得力薄，那里能这样大方，这是勉强不来的。」道翁道：「这也不然，一来相体裁衣，二来是各人的性灵。今日高超的是剑潭，沉着的是竹君，细腻风光的是庾香，风华绮丽的是湘帆，秀润工稳的是庸庵、前舟，潇","en":"\\"These twenty-four couplets today are fresh or rich by turns, and every man has done his best. But to my mind Master Qu's, for the Tower of Imperial Bestowals and the Hall of Inherited Shade, must have the crown for stateliness.\\" The scholars said, \\"Naturally. We feel our own strength thin; how are we to be so large and easy? It is not to be forced.\\"\\n\\nDaoweng said, \\"That"},{"paragraph":55,"mentions":1,"tokens":["道翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"道翁自谦一番，又道：「可惜今日吉甫未来，又少了许多名作。明日想他也就大好了，请他来看了，斟酌斟酌再刻。」诸名士皆以为然，直饮到三更，方才尽欢而散。不知后事如何，且听下回分解。","en":"Daoweng demurred, then sighed that Jifu had missed the day—and with him many fine lines—though by tomorrow he would likely mend; they should invite him to read and polish before carving. All agreed and drank till the third watch before parting in high spirits."}],"47":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":2,"tokens":["道翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说诸名士那日在怡园分题了些对子，经道翁一番赏识，俱极欣喜，后又看了那篇序文，真是五体投地，不能不服。就是南湘、春航，是最不轻易服人的，此时也是真心拜倒。明日子云又请金吉甫到园，将那些联额看了，吉甫亦甚佩服。请道翁用真行字，写了十六扇屏风，吉甫荐的季十矮子在园中刻起来。","en":"The day those scholars had matched scrolls at the Garden of Contentment, Qu Daoweng's praise left them glowing with joy; reading his preface afterward moved them to true admiration. Even Nanxiang and Chunhang, usually slow to bow to anyone, yielded in genuine respect. The next day Ziyun invited Jin Jifu to the garden to view the paired"},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":1,"tokens":["道翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，就托蕙芳留心，蕙芳又托人问了几处，皆不合意。一日来到子云处，说及此事，子云道：「何不到我园中来，也热闹些。且道翁已选了南昌府通判，不日就要赴任，玉侬是要同去的了，你们搬进来，不好么？」蕙芳道：「我是不搬进来。」子云道：「你也搬进来。」蕙芳道：「我要搬进来，还要等一两个月，此时还不能呢。」子云道：「桂岭那边丛桂山房就有三十几间屋子，竹君、湘帆二人很够住了。你去对","en":"visited Ziyun and raised the matter. Ziyun said: \\"Why not move into my garden? It would be livelier. Besides, Daoweng has just been appointed as an Assistant Prefect in Nanchang and will soon depart; Yunong must naturally accompany him. Would it not be splendid for you to move in?\\" Huifang replied: \\"I am not moving in.\\" Ziyun countered: \\"You must move in as well.\\" Huifang"}],"48":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["屈道翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说屈道翁选了南昌府通判，领凭之后，就要起身，这几天就有些人与他饯行，常不在园。那些名士、名旦也轮流与琴仙作饯。","en":"Qu Daoweng had been appointed as the Assistant Prefect of Nanchang. After receiving his official papers, he began preparing for his departure. During these days, people constantly hosted farewell feasts for him, so he was frequently away from the garden. The scholars"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":1,"tokens":["屈道翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"湘馆选后，便搬进怡园，在清凉诗境住了。他的脾气又与春航两样，把那些同年同馆朋友不放在眼里，也不出去应酬，天天与屈道翁、萧次贤、徐子云一班人，诗酒陶情。","en":"down upon his cohort friends and avoided social engagements. Day after day, he indulged in wine and poetry with Qu Daoweng, Xiao Cixian, Xu Ziyun, and their refined circle."},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":2,"tokens":["道翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"今日已是五月初四，道翁定于初七日起身，众名士饯行已过。今日道翁一早进城，为华公子请去了。南湘来找次贤、子云，都不在园里，即到春风沉醉轩来，只见琴仙手托香腮，在那里颦眉泪眼，见南湘进来，连忙起身。南湘笑道：「我道你此番自然长了学问，谁知还是那样见识。人生离合悲欢，是一定之理","en":"It was the fourth day of the fifth month, and Daoweng planned to depart on the seventh. The scholars' farewell banquets had already concluded. Early that morning, Daoweng went into the city at Young Master Hua's invitation. Nanxiang came searching for Cixian and Ziyun, but finding neither in the garden,"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":1,"tokens":["道翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"不必了。」子玉写好。这一会凄楚，连南湘、金粟也没有兴致，即上了岸。正逢子云、次贤回来，大家在寻源仙墅坐了一会，道翁也回来了。","en":"Ziyun and Cixian just coming back, and all sat a while at the Seeking-the-Source Immortal Villa, and presently Daoweng returned as well."},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":1,"tokens":["道翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"明日，道翁还有事进城。琪官因与琴仙一同来京，且同一师傅学戏，如今见他跳出樊笼，得以出京，心里甚为感慨，便单请琴仙过来话别。因想请琴仙，必须请子玉，又托琴仙转约子玉于初六日同去。琴仙应了，果然把子玉请了出来。子玉那日先到文辉处拜寿，耽搁了一早晨，吃了面，即便辞回","en":"The following day, Daoweng had affairs to attend to in the city. Qiguan, who had traveled to the capital with Qinxian and trained under the same master, felt a deep wave of emotion seeing his friend escape their constrained life and prepare to leave the capital. He decided to"},{"paragraph":34,"mentions":1,"tokens":["道翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"明日端午，道翁在园，琴仙也要收拾些零碎。那名旦九人，是要到子云处来贺节的，见了一见。子云也无心绪，没有请客，就止与南湘、次贤、屈氏父子，在练秋阁小饮了几杯，看了一看龙舟，应了景儿。","en":"The following day was the Dragon Boat Festival. Daoweng remained in the garden while Qinxian occupied himself with packing his small belongings. The nine renowned performers arrived at Ziyun's residence to offer their festival greetings and paid a brief, polite call. Lacking any mood for festive entertainment,"},{"paragraph":35,"mentions":3,"tokens":["道翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"到了初六日，道翁一早命家人押了行李先走，自己与琴仙到了辰初方才上车。其时送行的不计其数。道翁一班老友，有到园中来的，有在城外等候的。华公子本要出城亲送，道翁再三阻了，没有来，止打发家人代叩送行，预先送了程仪六百金。","en":"On the sixth, Daoweng instructed his servants early in the morning to escort the luggage ahead. He and Qinxian did not finally mount their carriage until the early chen hour. The crowd of people seeing them off was vast and beyond counting. Daoweng's old friends had either"},{"paragraph":36,"mentions":2,"tokens":["道翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云也送了六百，文泽送了二百，道翁的盘费很富足了。子云、次贤各备车马跟着，一直送出城外，直到十里之外皇华亭。只见南湘、仲清、文泽、金粟、王恂、子玉、春航，领着那蕙芳、宝珠、素兰、漱芳、玉林、兰保、桂保、琪官、春喜九个名旦，在皇华亭等候。道翁等连忙下车，极口辞谢。各人皆要把盏。","en":"Ziyun also gifted six hundred pieces of silver, and Wenze gave two hundred, ensuring Daoweng's travel funds were exceedingly abundant. Ziyun and Cixian each prepared their own carriages and followed closely behind, escorting them ten li beyond the city wall to the Imperial Envoys' Pavilion, ten miles away. Waiting there at the pavilion were"},{"paragraph":38,"mentions":5,"tokens":["道翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"急得如痰迷心窍一般，直瞪瞪两眼，一句话说不出，泪落如雨。子云、次贤慌了，救醒了琴仙，便说道：「快扶他上车罢。」道翁交代家人刘喜好好服侍。子云谓道翁道：「令郎与他们几年在一处，一刻要分手，自然是难忍的。道翁先生，我们倒不敢久留了，一路福星，请升舆罢。」道翁见琴仙如此，心内甚慌，与诸人作了一个揖，又握着子云、次贤的手道：「从此别后，只好魂梦相随。感激之私，令人口不能","en":"Cixian were equally alarmed. When Qinxian had been brought round, they said, \\"Get him into the carriage, quickly.\\" Daoweng charged his servant Liu Xi to wait on him carefully.\\n\\nZiyun said to Daoweng, \\"Your son has been among them these several years, and to be parted in a moment is more than they can well bear. Master Qu, we dare not keep you longer. A lucky star go with"}],"49":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["道翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说子玉送了琴仙回来，这一急一痛，便出了神，旧病复发，足足病了一月始愈。后来颜夫人已知琴仙出了京，道翁养为义子，倒也替他欢喜。","en":"passed before he recovered. Later, when Lady Yan learned that Qinxian had left the capital and had been taken by Qu Daoweng as an adopted son, she, too, felt a measure of relief and joy for him."},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":2,"tokens":["屈道翁","道翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子是一时气性，写了那封恶札。过了两日，使有些自悔了。谁知子云只当没有事的一般，又不来招陪他，心内殊觉无趣。后与屈道翁送行，道翁倒把子云的好处说了一番。","en":"or entertain him, leaving Young Master Hua feeling extremely awkward and bored. Later, when bidding farewell to Qu Daoweng, Daoweng had spoken at length about Ziyun's many virtues."},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":1,"tokens":["道翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"又说起扶乩，琴言与他前世原是父女，并将那首诗通身念给他听。华公子听了，心中着实骇然。道翁又赞琴言多少好处，现在认为义子，带他到任。华公子冰消雨霁，倒有几分过意不去。","en":"Daoweng also recounted the spirit-writing session, revealing that Qinyan and he himself had been father and daughter in a former life, and he recited the entire poem to him. Hearing this, Young Master Hua was deeply shaken. Daoweng then went on to praise Qinyan's"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":2,"tokens":["道翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"再将琴言细细一想，真没有甚么不好，倒冤了他，便也赞了几句。道翁去后，次贤又来，才将这事澈底澄清的讲了一番，华公子始悔自己孟浪，又念与子云两代世交，为这点事绝交，是给人要议论的。又因他是个盟兄，只得尽个弟道，下口气先去招陪他。先是道翁、次贤已将华公子懊悔之意与子云讲过。子云是大度包容的，既是他先来，岂尚有芥蒂之意","en":"over Qinyan again, he realized the boy truly had no faults; he had wronged him, and he voiced his praise. After Daoweng left, Cixian arrived and clarified the entire matter thoroughly. Only then did Young Master Hua fully repent his rashness, mindful of the generations of deep friendship between their families. To break ties over such a trivial matter would surely invite"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":2,"tokens":["屈本立","屈道生"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"家及各大员子弟，与四方乡会试诸名宿，门生熟识往来却也不少，但是人云亦云的多。就有一位老前辈，近来又赴任去了，叫屈本立。想现任官，在京也不能考的。」苏侯道：「屈道生么？他是孝廉方正，可惜了，屈在下位。不然倒好保他。还有那南京名宿金粟，也因限于成例不能保举的，真真令人可惜。此外呢？」子云道：「此外尚有几个，都是英才未发的人。翰林院侍读学士梅公之子名子玉，目下少年中有景","en":"However, many merely echo the opinions of others. There is one older senior who recently left for a post, named Qu Benli. I assume that as an active official, he cannot take the exam in the capital.\\" Su the Marquis said, \\"Ah, Qu Daosheng? He was recommended for Filial Piety and Incorruptibility; it is a pity he is relegated to a lower post. Otherwise, it would be good"}],"50":[{"paragraph":8,"mentions":1,"tokens":["道翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"别之间，倒应如此的。就是庾香遮饰不来，直着眼睛，拉他上车，还挣着不动，又有那一哭，到底为着什么事来？幸亏度香催道翁走了，不然，他见了也要猜疑。」文泽道：「可不是？庾香与湘帆比起来，正是苦乐不同。湘帆非但与媚香朝夕相亲，如今又对了阔亲，偏偏又是个姓苏的，而且才貌双全。你道湘帆的运气好不好？我看咱们这一班朋友，就是他一个得意。」仲清道：「自然。」王恂道：「竹君近来倒","en":"carriage, refusing to move, and then that sudden wail... what was that all about? Fortunately, Duxiang hurried Daoweng away; otherwise, seeing that, Daoweng would surely have grown suspicious.\\" Wenze nodded. \\"Is it not so? When you compare Yuxiang with Xiangfan, the contrast in their suffering and joy is stark. Not only does Xiangfan enjoy the constant, intimate company"}],"53":[{"paragraph":7,"mentions":1,"tokens":["屈公"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"实也不甚亲密，就是两心相照，悲多欢少，这是人人解不出来的。一见就哭，大约前世有点因果在里头。那日扶乩说琴言原是屈公前生之女，我想庾香前世，又是琴言什么，也未可知。」华公子道：「这事渺茫，譬如你作了琴言，当怎样待人呢？」这句话，素兰倒有些难答，支支吾吾起来。华公子笑道：「你作了琴言，待庾香怎样，在我这里又当怎样？事齐乎，事楚乎？必有一个主意。」素兰面泛桃花，只是不","en":"there must be some karmic cause from a past life at work. That day, the spirit-writing revealed Qinyan was Lord Qu's daughter in a former life; who knows what relationship Yuxiang might have been to Qinyan in that past life.\\"\\n\\nYoung Master Hua dismissed this: \\"Such things are too nebulous. For instance, if you were in Qinyan's place, how would you treat others?\\""},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":1,"tokens":["屈道翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一日，子云正与静宜、南湘、高品闲话，只见书童拿了一包书信进来。子云一看封面，是屈道翁在南京途中寄来的，心中一喜。拆了总封，里头有十几封信与各相好，却都是琴言笔迹，说自己跌坏了膀子不能写，无非是些道谢等语，内有怀怡园诸同人五古一篇，并沿途七律八首。又见琴言另有一封信，子云拆开，内里是三封，一封是诸名士同启，一封是众弟兄同启，一封庾香才","en":"Nanxiang, and Gao Pin when a pageboy brought in a bundle of letters. Ziyun looked at the cover and saw it was sent by Qu Daoweng en route from Nanjing. His heart leapt with joy.\\n\\nHe broke the main seal and found over ten letters addressed to various friends—all written in Qinyan's hand. Qinyan explained that he had injured his shoulder and could not write himself, so the contents"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":1,"tokens":["道生"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"首词他若见了，必有一番伤心痛哭，那时在这里倒教他难为情。不如送去与他，索性使他哭个尽性罢。」子云即着人将琴言并道生的信，送与子玉。","en":"to him, so he can simply weep to his heart's content.\\"\\n\\nZiyun immediately ordered someone to deliver Qinyan and Daosheng's letters to Ziyu."},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":1,"tokens":["道翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"前到华府去时寄他那块帕子，唯觉血泪斑斑可数。子玉此时心中如万箭攒心，停了一会，问道：「为何你一人在此，你那义父道翁先生呢，那里去了？」琴言道：「你问我那义父么？」叹了一声，又泪如雨下，停了半晌说道：「我也为要见你一面。不然，这个地方就是我葬身之地了。」子玉不解所言，尚要问他，只听得后船舱有人出来，不见犹可，一见吓得魂不附体。原来不是别人，是他父亲梅学士，满面怒容","en":"were piercing his heart. After a pause, he asked, \\"Why are you here alone? Where is your adoptive father, Mr. Daoweng?\\"\\n\\n\\"You ask after my adoptive father?\\" Qinyan sighed, tears falling like rain once more. After a long silence, he said, \\"I too only wanted to see you one last time. Otherwise, this place would have become my burial ground.\\"\\n\\nZiyu did not understand his"}],"55":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":3,"tokens":["道翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"思，涕零不已。十八站旱路到了王家营，渡了黄河，在清江浦南河赁店住了。写了江船，做了旗子，制了衔牌，耽搁了三日。道翁于漕河两院都是相好，一概不惊动了，没有往拜。道翁有个长随叫刘喜，为人老实忠厚，四十多岁，跟随了五六年，跟过江宁侯石翁太史，善于烹调，如今叫他伺侯琴仙。这刘喜正是个老婆子一样，饥则问食，寒则问衣，琴仙甚得其力。开船之后，三天到了扬州。道翁怕那些商人缠扰","en":"There, they hired a riverboat, fashioned their flags and official boards, and paused for three days' rest. Though Qu Daoweng had old acquaintances in both the grain-transport and river-conservancy offices, he chose not to disturb them and paid no visits. Daoweng had a longtime attendant named Liu Xi, an honest and loyal man in his forties who had served him for half a decade."},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":2,"tokens":["道翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"朱楼青琐声歌地，蔓草荒榛瓦砾场。\\n道翁道：「这是小虹园。我当日在此与诸名士虹桥修禊，眼见琳宫梵宇，瑶草琪花，此刻成了这个模样，令人可感。前面还有个大虹园，也差不多，略还好些。」琴仙道：「若论这个园，当年只怕也与怡园彷佛。」道翁道：「那本来不及怡园，若能两园相并，再连到平山堂，就比得上怡园","en":"red towers and carved windows once echoed with song, now brambles and broken tiles spread across the wasteland.\\"\\nDaoweng sighed, \\"This is the Lesser Rainbow Garden. In days past, I gathered here with famous scholars for the spring purification festival at Rainbow Bridge. I saw with my own eyes the magnificent temples, the jade-like grass, and the fairy blossoms, yet now"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":6,"tokens":["道翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"好意思，低了头望着别处。船过去时，琴仙身上忽然打来一样东西，吃了一惊，掉在船板上，看时是一方白绢，包着些果子。道翁一笑，拾起来解开，是些枇杷、杨梅、菱、藕、桃、梨之类。琴仙还不知从何处打来，问道翁这包从那里掉下来的，道翁道：「是那船上抛过来与你的，这倒成了安仁掷果了。」琴仙方明白是两个妇人送给他的，脸便红起来。道翁道：「这也不必管他，他既送来，也是他的好意，扰了","en":"Startled, he watched it fall onto the deck boards and saw it was a square of white silk wrapped around some fruit. Daoweng chuckled, picked it up, and untied it, revealing loquats, bayberries, water chestnuts, lotus roots, peaches, and pears. Still not realizing where it had come from, Qinxian asked Daoweng where the bundle had dropped from. Daoweng replied, \\"It was tossed"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":5,"tokens":["道翁","屈老爷"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"其数。不过也是旧旧的了，还不见得很荒凉。过了御书楼，才穿到平山堂上来，见了欧文忠公的亲笔。见有个和尚出来，见了道翁，忙笑嘻嘻的上前施礼，问道：「屈老爷儿几时到的？僧人眼也望穿了。」道翁一看见那和尚，有五十来岁，白白净净，高颧骨，颐下有三寸长的黑须，记得是个知客，忘了他的名氏，便也拱一拱手，道：「才到。现等过关，今日晚上就要开船。」那和尚道：「那里有这样要紧，自然","en":"into Pingshan Hall, where they saw the authentic calligraphy of Ouyang Xiu. A monk emerged, and upon recognizing Daoweng, he hurried forward with a beaming smile and bowed. \\"When did the honorable Lord Qu arrive? This poor monk has been looking forward to this till his eyes nearly wore out!\\" Seeing the monk—a fair-skinned man in his fifties with high cheekbones and a three-inch"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":3,"tokens":["道翁","屈老爷"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"所以往往取出来不见好，就是没有量准尺寸。」道翁道：「是了，我只晓得金山脚下为第一泉，却不晓得潮长潮落时的尺寸，故取出来仍是江水，倒辜负了这个第一泉了。」和尚道：「容易，明日我们摆过江去取来，吊桶是现成的。」道翁道：「也罢了，这第二泉尝了也不输似第一泉。」那和尚道：「屈老爷，我们想杀你了。你去年说","en":"\\"That is why what people pull up often tastes poor—they simply didn't measure the depth correctly.\\" Daoweng realized, \\"Ah, so that's it. I only knew the First Spring was at the foot of Jinshan, but I never knew the exact measurements for high and low tides. No wonder what we pulled up was still just river water; we completely wasted the First Spring.\\" The"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":5,"tokens":["道翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"道翁笑道：「这些商家就多花几个钱，也不要紧。」和尚对琴仙道：「少爷，那边还有个花园，请去逛逛罢。」琴仙也想逛园，不敢说，看着道翁。道翁道：「也好，索性逛一逛。」和尚叫人开了门，引进了园。可惜是夏天，虽然今日没有太阳，也是热烘烘的，有那树木丛杂，翳障了不透","en":"Daoweng laughed and said, \\"It doesn't matter if those merchants spend a few extra coins.\\" The monk then turned to Qinxian, \\"Young master, there is another garden over there. Please, go and take a stroll.\\" Qinxian wanted to explore the garden but did not dare"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":4,"tokens":["道翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"那和尚尚要挽留，道翁决意要走。琴仙见那开园门的几个人，问他刘喜要钱，刘喜给了一百大钱，尚还嫌少。和尚喝退了，直送出山门。道翁与琴仙下了船，仍坐船而回。只见往来游船甚多，一去一来，也有大半天。回来船已过关，等道翁、琴仙上了大船，即打了三回锣，抽了跳，开起船，趁着微风，到了","en":"The monk still tried to urge them to stay, but Daoweng was resolved to leave. At the garden gate, Qinxian saw the gatekeepers asking Liu Xi for money. Liu Xi gave them one hundred large cash, but they still complained it was too little. The monk shouted them down and escorted the guests straight out of the"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":1,"tokens":["道翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"道翁忆着侯石翁，要在此与他盘桓几日。一早带了琴仙并刘喜，雇了个凉篷子，由护城河摇到了旱西门，进城雇了肩舆，到凤凰山来访侯石翁。这个侯石翁，是个陆地神仙，今年已七十四岁。二十岁点了翰林，到如今已成了二十三科的老前辈，朝内已没有他的同年。此人从三十余岁就致仕","en":"Daoweng thought of Hou Shiweng and decided to linger here for a few days to visit him. Early the next morning, taking Qinxian and Liu Xi along, he hired a shaded skiff. They rowed from the city moat to the Hanxi Gate, entered the city, hired sedan chairs, and"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":8,"tokens":["道翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"道翁与琴仙到了园，叫刘喜先将名帖送进。琴仙见这个园四面尽编槿竹为篱，种些杂树。望着里头，疏疏落落，有几处亭台院宇，甚是清旷，却无围墙。不一会，刘喜同了一人出来，说请就将肩舆抬进。琴仙在轿窗里看时，高高下下，弯弯曲曲，有长松夹道，有修竹成林，有飞瀑如帘，有","en":"Upon arriving at the garden, Daoweng had Liu Xi send in his calling card first. Qinxian noticed that the garden was enclosed entirely by fences of woven hibiscus and bamboo, interspersed with various trees. Looking inside, he saw scattered pavilions and courtyards, exuding a clear and open"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":10,"tokens":["道翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"两人又对驳了一会，各自抚掌大笑。石翁即吩咐家人备出饭来，石翁是不饮酒的，拿出来陪道翁。琴仙不肯喝酒，道翁善饮，便一人自酌。石翁道：「我劝你也不必做官了，虽然得了别驾，究也难展骥足。你的相知也尽多，难道舍了这六品前程，竟没有饭吃么？」道翁叹道：「我并非老马恋栈，但也有个难处。你晓得我数十年来非特依然故我，反成了个孑身，还是立锥无地。我","en":"ordered his servants to prepare a meal. Though Shiweng did not drink wine himself, he brought some out to accompany Daoweng. Qinxian declined the wine, while Daoweng, a fine drinker, poured for himself. Shiweng said, \\"I advise you, there's no need to pursue officialdom any longer. Though you've obtained the post of Vice-Prefect, it is ultimately too small a stage for your"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":6,"tokens":["道翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"道翁又将那篇序文念了，石翁赞了两声，道：「竟是一篇唐文，宋人四六无此谨严。但其中有两句，还要斟酌斟酌。」道翁道：「就请教，那两句呢？」石翁道：「琉璃研匣，翡翠笔床，是用《玉台序》。但他一浓一淡，相间成文，便入古格。他是「琉璃研匣，终日随身；\\n翡翠笔床，无","en":"Daoweng then recited the preface he had written. Shiweng praised it a few times, saying, \\"It is truly a piece of Tang-style prose; the parallel prose of the Song writers lacks such rigor. However, there are two lines within it that require a bit more deliberation.\\""},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":13,"tokens":["道翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"石翁听了，始不为异，忽然悟了，说道：「可恶！可恶！」道翁也笑。石翁道：「你送我副对子，要说得真切，不要那隔靴搔痒的话。」道翁念道：「天下词人皆后辈。」石翁大笑道：「当不起，但马齿加长也还说得去。」道翁笑道：「下联倒难对呢。」又说道：「此地有个卢莫愁，借他对一对罢，「卢家少妇是乡亲。」石翁狂笑起来，道：「这","en":"not find this strange, but suddenly he caught the meaning and cried out, \\"Abominable! Absolutely abominable!\\" Daoweng laughed as well. Shiweng demanded, \\"If you give me a couplet, it must be piercing and true, not some vague scratching-through-the-boot nonsense.\\" Daoweng recited, \\"'All poets under heaven are my juniors.'\\" Shiweng roared with laughter, \\"I can hardly"},{"paragraph":30,"mentions":1,"tokens":["屈道翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"？了不得了，老爷在山上跌了一交，晕了过去，救转来，现在还哼声不止呢。」琴仙听了，唬得一身冷汗，连忙进舱来。不知屈道翁性命如何，且听下回分解。","en":"stopped groaning since!\\" Hearing this, Qinxian broke into a cold sweat and rushed into the cabin. To know whether Qu Daoweng's life was saved, you must listen to the next chapter's explanation."}],"56":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":4,"tokens":["道翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说琴仙上船，闻道翁跌坏，连忙进舱看视，道翁道：「此刻略清爽些，就是半个身子动不来，想也就好的。我已服了好些药，你今日到何处去？」琴仙便说去逛莫愁湖，有个杜仙女墓，与仙乩上说的相对。道翁也觉诧异，道：「果然有这个坟，有碑记没有呢？」琴仙道：「没有碑记。」也将红衣女子的光","en":"When Qinxian came aboard and heard that Daoweng had fallen and injured himself, he hurried into the cabin to check on him. Daoweng murmured: \\"I feel a little clearer now. Though half my body refuses to move, I imagine it will mend in time. I have already taken a good deal of medicine. Where did you"},{"paragraph":2,"mentions":2,"tokens":["道翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴仙又将石翁所赠的诗，与道翁看了。道翁不觉动气，因说道：「此老游戏散漫，习与性成，老来还是这样。我就素鄙其人，不过爱其才耳。将这扇子撕了罢。」琴仙即将扇子撕得粉碎，一夜无话。","en":"Qinxian then showed Daoweng the poem Old Shiweng had gifted him. Daoweng's temper flared as he read it, and he scoffed: \\"That old man treats life as a trifling game and scatters his mind to the wind. His habits have calcified into his very nature, and even in his twilight years,"},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":4,"tokens":["道翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"将要过关，忽然起了大顶风，走了锚，白浪滔天，把船倒打上去，一直打到了燕子矶，方才收住，连忙抛锚打橛，加缆守风。道翁叫过琴仙来，吩咐道：「京中诸好友也应写封信去道谢道谢，我膀子疼，你替我写，我念给你。写行书就是了，不必尽要楷书。」一面靠在靠枕上，一面念给琴仙，大同小异写了十几封，又写了好些诗，足足写了大半天。傍晚风小了些，道翁知他写乏了，便叫刘喜同他上岸去散散。刘","en":"hurried to drop the anchor, drive mooring stakes deep into the bank, and double the cables against the howling wind. Daoweng called Qinxian to his side and instructed: \\"You ought to write letters of thanks to my friends in the capital. My arm aches terribly, so you shall write while I dictate. A flowing running script will suffice; it need not all be perfectly regular.\\" Leaning"},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":5,"tokens":["道翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"道翁一生于笔墨一事，耗费心血，又伤于酒，前日这一跌已中了心，有时清楚，有时昏愦，若痰涌上来，便迷了心，连话也说不出来。兼之老年人了，大小便也不甚便，这些下人如何肯来服事？就只刘喜一人又兼买办，料理饮食，是以琴仙彻夜无眠，在中舱伺侯。偏遇了日日顶风，江中船","en":"Throughout his entire life, Daoweng had poured his heart's blood into brush and ink, while simultaneously destroying his health with heavy wine. This recent, devastating fall had struck at his very core. He drifted in and out of awareness—sometimes lucid, sometimes terribly muddled. Whenever"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":8,"tokens":["道翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"谁知道翁命逢阳九，岁数将终，非特不能好，倒添出别样病来。因他一生心血用枯，素有李长吉呕血之病，近来好了几年，此时重又大发，一日呕吐数次，神昏色丧，卧床不起。过了二十余日，更加沉重。琴仙见此光景，心如油沸，日夜在神前焚香祷告，愿以身代。道翁自知不免，见琴仙如此","en":"But Daoweng's fate had fallen in a Yangjiu, the very cycle of calamity he had expounded, and his allotted span on earth was rapidly drawing to a close. He did not improve; instead, a dark new ailment manifested. A lifetime of expending his heart's blood had finally"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":1,"tokens":["道翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴仙听了，肝肠寸断，双膝跪在床前，泪流满面，惟双手捧着药碗。道翁勉强吃了一口，咳嗽一声，又吐出许多血来。","en":"knees by the bed in a flood of desperate tears, his trembling hands still gripping the porcelain medicine bowl. Daoweng forced down a single mouthful, but immediately broke into a violent cough, bringing up a great deal of dark blood once more."},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":1,"tokens":["道翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，像似棺材暴起来，又像鬼叫了几声，琴仙好不害怕。想到佛前去求告，却又心惊肉跳的不敢前去。要不去，心又不安。重到道翁房里看时，见昏昏沉沉的睡着了，便放大了胆，烧了一炉香，就在院子里跪下，叩头默祷，祷了三刻工夫方才起来，树上落下一个虫，在发顶上蠕蠕的动。琴仙心慌，将袖子拂了下来，拿了香炉，走进了房，方才坐下，心上还突突的跳。忽见自己肩上有三寸来长的一条蝎虎，爬到胸前","en":"violently in his chest that his legs refused to move. Yet, remaining still unsettled him even more. He checked on Daoweng's room and found the old man sleeping fitfully. Finally gathering a sliver of courage, he lit a small censer and knelt out in the desolate courtyard. He kowtowed repeatedly, praying in fervent silence for nearly three quarters of an hour before finally"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":1,"tokens":["道翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「还是这样。」刘喜道：「如果老爷有些长短便怎样呢？」琴仙又哭道：「如果有什么不好，我也是死。」刘喜叹了一声，到道翁房里来看了一看，就到后头去了。","en":"down Doctor Li. He is also famous, but lives very far away—a full twenty li there and back.\\" He then asked how Daoweng was faring. Qinxian shook his head sadly: \\"He is exactly the same.\\" Liu Xi's face fell. \\"If the master should... if the worst happens, what will we do?\\" Qinxian began to weep anew: \\"If anything happens to him, I will surely die as well.\\" Liu Xi let out"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":1,"tokens":["道翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴仙又到道翁的房来，只听得刘喜嚷道：「不好了，这些箱子到那里去了？」琴仙听了，慌忙出来，走到后面厢房里看时，就剩了几个书画箱，其余搬运一空。见张贵、汪升、钱德的李行都没有了，此刻还不回来？这门开着，岂没有人进来的，如何是好呢？况且盘费银子也都在箱内。老爷房内一个","en":"Qinxian went again toward Daoweng's room and heard Liu Xi shout: \\"Disaster—where are those trunks?\\" Qinxian hurried out. In the rear wing only a few chests of paintings and books remained; everything else was gone. Zhang Gui, Wang Sheng, and Qian De's luggage bundles were nowhere to"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":1,"tokens":["道翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴仙与刘喜等到天明，绝无影响，方知三人偷了东西走了。琴仙却不是心疼东西，见道翁如此模样，设有不测，则殡殓之费皆无，如何是好？便哭了半日，只剩下一个刘喜，又不能分身寻觅。","en":"bitter truth: the three men had stolen their goods and fled into the night. Qinxian did not mourn the goods; seeing Daoweng as he was, if the worst came he would have no money for funeral—what then? He wept half the day. Only Liu Xi was left, and he could not split himself to search."},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":8,"tokens":["道翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"忽听得道翁叫人，琴仙急忙过去，见他歪转过身，当他要解手，问了他，摇摇头，心上要坐起来。琴仙叫刘喜来帮着扶起，把两个大靠枕靠了背。道翁道：「你们去找我那些诗文集来。」琴仙忙去开了箱，一部一部的搬过来。道翁问了书名，又过了目，叫留下一本近作诗稿子，一本书画册，其余","en":"Suddenly they heard Daoweng call. Qinxian ran over. The old man had turned on his side—Qinxian thought he needed the pot; asked; he shook his head; he wanted to sit up. Qinxian called Liu Xi to help raise him and propped his back with two large bolsters. Daoweng said: \\"Fetch my"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":3,"tokens":["道翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"道翁执着笔，颤巍巍的，一大一小，写了一篇放下，又喘了一回，眼中掉下泪来，叫一声：「琴儿，我有句话吩咐你。」琴仙含泪听训。道翁道：「你虽幼年失路，但看你立志不凡，我不须多嘱，你回京后自然旧业是不理的了，徐度香处尽可寄身。」琴仙听到此，便哭起来，不能答应。道","en":"Daoweng took the brush, trembling, and wrote large and small characters on a sheet—then stopped and panted. Tears fell from his eyes. He called: \\"Qin'er—I have something to tell you.\\" Qinxian listened through tears. Daoweng said: \\"Though you lost your way while"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":5,"tokens":["屈本立","道翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"慰我于九原也。残魂不馁，当为报德之蛇；稚子有知，亦作感恩之雀。肝胆素照，神魂可通，不尽之言，伏惟矜察。七月七日屈本立绝笔。\\n琴仙看了。不觉恸倒在地，刘喜也哭了，道翁命刘喜扶起琴仙，琴仙独自倚床而哭，道翁道：「不必哭了，我累了你。殡殓之后，即埋我于江岸，也不必等过百日，你速速进京罢。你将我的文凭送到石翁处，托他在制台前缴了，要他与我做篇传。人虽不足传，但我一生之困苦","en":"each other clear; spirits may meet. What words remain—please read with care. Seventh day of the seventh month: Qu Benli's final brush.\\n\\nQinxian read and collapsed to the floor; Liu Xi wept too. Daoweng told Liu Xi to raise Qinxian; Qinxian leaned on the bed and wept. Daoweng said: \\"No more crying—I've burdened you. After the funeral bury me on the riverbank; do not wait"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":2,"tokens":["道翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"南朝感旧游。\\n题罢，掷笔而逝。琴仙一见，又昏晕倒了，慌得刘喜神魂失措，一面哭，一面拍醒琴仙。琴仙跪在床前，抱了道翁双足，哭得昏而醒，醒而昏，足足哭了半天。刘喜连连解劝道：「大爷，事已如此，人死不能复生，料理后事要紧。这么个热天，也不宜耽搁。」琴仙那里肯听，又哭了好一会，直到泪枯声尽，人也起不来了。刘喜扶了他起来，又拿水来与他净了脸，琴仙才敢仰视，只见道翁容颜带笑","en":"weeping openly as he gently slapped Qinxian's face to wake him. Qinxian knelt by the bed, desperately clasping Daoweng's cold feet, and wept until he swooned, woke, and swooned again, trapped in his grief for half the day. Liu Xi urged him again and again: \\"Young master, it is done. The dead do not return to us, and the aftermath must be urgently seen to. In this terrible"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":2,"tokens":["道翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴仙道：「这些事我都不知道，尽要仗你费点心的了。」刘喜道：「这个不消吩咐。」于是先将道翁扶下，易箦之后，点了香烛，焚了纸钱，昨日请的李大夫方来，闻得死了，即忙回转。刘喜出去料理，一个人又没有帮手。棺材买不到，只得向和尚买了那一口停放在后楼的，就去了二十二千大钱。其余做孝衣，叫吹鼓手，请僧念经，雇了一个厨子，忙得不了。琴仙诸事不能，惟在床","en":"I must rely entirely on you.\\" Liu Xi squeezed his shoulder: \\"There is no need to even say it.\\" They first laid Daoweng's body down reverently; after the bedding was changed, they lit tall candles and began to burn paper money. Doctor Li, whom they had fetched yesterday, had only just arrived; upon hearing that Daoweng was already dead, he turned on his heel and hurried"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":1,"tokens":["屈道翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"跪也不跪的，想是个有根气的人，来历不小。」琴仙将要出去，只见一个戴金幞头穿红袍的神人进来，仔细一看，就是他义父屈道翁。琴仙吃了一惊，心上却不当他是死的。因为这个地方，不敢上前相见，仍躲在树后。见他义父上阶，打了一恭。那尊神也不回礼，略把手举了一举，见他义父恭恭敬敬站在一旁。","en":"brilliant red robe entered the hall. Looking closely, Qinxian realized with a shock that it was his foster father, Qu Daoweng. Qinxian started, but curiously did not feel that the man was dead. The overwhelming strangeness of the celestial hall kept him from stepping forward to reveal himself; instead, he remained hidden behind the tree. He watched his foster father mount the"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":5,"tokens":["道翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"却一件也想不起，就记得方才那个童子，问道：「方才有个童子进来，那尊神给他许多笔，始而又骂他，这童子是什么人？」道翁道：「这童子前身却不小，从六朝时转劫到此刻，想还骂他从前的罪孽。后来是个大作家，名传不朽的。三十年后见他一部小小的著作，四十年后还有大著作出来。」琴仙又问道：「这位尊神是何名号？」道翁道：「低声。」便左右顾盼了一会，用指头在琴仙掌中写了两字，琴仙看是","en":"foster father paced alone beneath the steps, gazing up at the great hall. Only then did Qinxian remember that Daoweng had passed away; grief swept over him, and he seized the old man's robe, weeping bitterly. His foster father looked upon him with sorrow and offered comfort: \\"Qin'er, you have suffered, yet this was ordained by your fate. It will be but a hundred days"},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":2,"tokens":["道翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"侯老爷与制台讲明，想人已死了，也没有什么要紧的。」刘喜伺候了饭，脱了孝衫，便到凤凰山侯石翁处来。那侯石翁自从见道翁跌了这一交，甚不放心。隔了一日，来找道翁的船，已不见了，当是开了船，只道他已经到任，再不料他已经身故，心上又想起琴仙：「见了那首诗，不知是喜是恼，想来经我品题，自然欢喜。但看他生得这般妙丽，却冷冰冰的，少些风趣。可惜如此美男，若能收他作个门生，足以娱","en":"After serving the meal, Liu Xi shed his mourning jacket and went to Hou Shiweng at Phoenix Mountain. Ever since Daoweng's fall, Lord Hou had been deeply uneasy. Finding the boat gone the very next day, he had assumed they sailed for the official post, never imagining that Daoweng had perished. His thoughts had lingered on Qinxian and the poem, wondering whether the boy"},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":3,"tokens":["道翁","屈老爷"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"石翁问道：「怎么你又回来了，不曾跟去么？」刘喜将道翁归天之事，细细说了。又将遗言嘱托并张贵等偷去衣箱、银钱等物，并文凭也偷去了，如今少爷在寺里守灵，连衣食将要不给起来。石翁听大惊，道：「有这等事！我道是已经到任去了，那知道这个光景！」便也洒了几点泪。刘喜道：「此时总要求老爷想个法子才好。」石翁道：「屈","en":"Hou asked: \\"Why have you returned? Did you not go with them?\\" Liu Xi recounted the tragedy of Daoweng's passing in agonizing detail: his final wishes, how Zhang Gui and the others had absconded with clothes, silver, and the vital credential, and how the young master now kept a bleak vigil at the temple, nearly destitute of food and clothing. Lord Hou"}],"59":[{"paragraph":3,"mentions":1,"tokens":["屈道翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"起来，我去寄就是了。」琴仙于是哀哀切切，写了几封信与子玉、子云、蕙芳诸人，要他们专人来接他回去，子云信内并封着屈道翁遗言。写了一天，刘喜托便寄了。后来寺中又做起法事来，男女混杂，游人挤满。琴仙屋里常有人来张张望望的，琴仙好不气闷。刘喜见度日艰难，就算京里有人来接他们，也须两月之久，就到年底去了。便想出个法子，卖了两件衣裳，就借寺门口摆了一个小摊，卖些水果、干果之类","en":"others, pleading with them to send someone specifically to take him back. In the letter to Ziyun, he also enclosed Qu Daoweng's dying testament. After a full day of writing, Liu Xi entrusted the letters to a courier. Later on, the temple began hosting Buddhist rituals, drawing large, mixed crowds of men and women that packed the grounds. People frequently peered into Qinxian's"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":2,"tokens":["屈本立"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"制台讲起：「江西有个通判屈本立，可认得么？」梅侍郎答以相好。制台就将屈本立死在南京，其行李盘费为三个长随窃逃，侯石翁代他嗣子报了，行文到江西。昨接江西巡抚移文，内开：","en":"During their conversation, the Governor-General asked, \\"There was an Assistant Prefect in Jiangxi named Qu Benli; were you acquainted with him?\\" Vice Minister Mei replied that they had been close friends. The Governor-General then explained that Qu Benli had passed away in Nanjing, and that his luggage and travel funds had been stolen by three of his senior servants,"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":2,"tokens":["道翁","道生"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"禁江宁县监，还有从犯一名汪升，已经身故了。但不知他嗣子下落，须问石翁便知。\\n梅侍郎听了，心里颇为恺恻，又想：「道翁并无嗣子，想是近来过继的了。」便辞了制台，到凤凰山来拜石翁。石翁连忙接进，先道了喜，叙了契阔，即问宦囊如何。士燮笑道：「晚生靠祖宗的余荫，稍有几亩薄田，尽够饔飧，无须另积囊橐。论江西，虽不算富厚之邦，也算膏腴之地。若不论公明，任行暧昧，此行原也可腰缠","en":"ascertain this.\\"\\nUpon hearing this, Vice Minister Mei felt a profound sense of sorrow. He thought to himself, \\"Daoweng had no heir; this adopted son must be a recent development.\\" He took his leave of the Governor-General and headed to Phoenix Mountain to visit Shiweng. Shiweng hurriedly welcomed him in, first offering his congratulations and reminiscing about their"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":3,"tokens":["道翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"明日，先着人到护国寺问了，说要亲自过来，又遣人送了道翁一封奠仪，自己备了祭桌，到护国寺来。刘喜手忙脚乱，请个小和尚看了摊子，进来伺候。琴仙穿了孝衣，帏间俯伏，知是子玉的父亲，心里虽喜，然倒有些虚心，恐他风闻前事，问起他的根本来，甚是惶恐。只见梅侍郎进来上了香，奠了酒，行了礼，请出琴仙来。琴仙上前叩谢了。","en":"to announce that he would be coming in person. He then dispatched a servant with a monetary condolence gift in Daoweng's name and prepared a sacrificial table before making his way to the temple. Flustered, Liu Xi paid a young monk to watch the stall and hurried inside to serve. Qinxian, dressed in mourning white, knelt behind the curtain. Knowing this was Ziyu's father,"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":3,"tokens":["屈道翁","道翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这两日，梅侍郎托人找买坟地，尚无回信。晚间睡了，梦见屈道翁纱帽红袍，欣然而来。士燮见了大奇，便问他为何这样打扮？道翁也不讲明，执着士燮的手道：「明公不忘故旧，仗义恤孤，泉下人衔环难报，小女现寓莫愁湖畔，乞以骸骨付之，死且不朽。小儿流落无所依栖，想万间广厦，可借一枝，诸祈怜悯。」说罢便拜，慌得士燮也答拜了。道","en":"finding and purchasing a burial plot, but he had yet to receive a reply. That night, as he slept, he dreamed of Qu Daoweng, dressed in a black gauze cap and red robes, approaching him with a joyful expression. Shixie was greatly surprised and asked why he was dressed in such a manner. Daoweng didn't explain, but grasped Shixie's hand and said, \\"Your Honor has not forgotten"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":1,"tokens":["道翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"：「出于淤泥而临清」与「既往不咎」，想他这个义子必是个小旦出身。这也不必论他，只要人好，总是一样。又想：「看这道翁像成了神，莫非莫愁湖畔果有他女儿的坟么？昨琴仙请仙之说，又见什么杜仙女，竟是真的了。」半夜竟不能寐。天一明就起来，着人去请了屈大爷过来，有话商量。","en":"dwelling on; as long as the boy possessed good character, that was all that mattered. He also thought, \\"It seems Daoweng has become a deity. Could it be that his daughter's grave truly is located by Mochou Lake? If so, Qinxian's account of the planchette session and his encounter with Fairy Du must actually be true.\\" He lay awake for the rest of the night. At the crack"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":1,"tokens":["道翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"算清房租，一直搬到梅侍郎的船上，并将领回之银，送与梅侍郎，梅侍郎仍叫他收了。此番琴仙感激，真到二十分。梅侍郎因道翁梦中之语，绝不查问琴仙根底，因刘喜称呼大爷，便命家下人也称呼为屈大爷。梅侍郎要他叔侄称呼，琴仙不敢，仍称大人，自称名字，梅侍郎也只好由他了。","en":"Vice Minister Mei, but Mei insisted he keep it. This time, Qinxian's gratitude was truly boundless. Influenced by Daoweng's words in the dream, Vice Minister Mei firmly refrained from inquiring into Qinxian's background. Noting that Liu Xi addressed him as \\"Young Master,\\" Mei ordered his household servants to respectfully refer to him as \\"Master Qu.\\" Although Vice Minister"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":3,"tokens":["屈公"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"士燮，一到就走，拜也没有拜一拜。后来诸绅士又有高兴的出来倡捐，这个十两，那个二十，集腋成裘，又凑了数千金。把这屈公祠扩充起来，起了好些亭台楼阁。莫愁湖中造了湖心亭、九曲红桥，又造了几个船，以为春夏游湖之乐。屈公墓、杜仙女墓前，都建石牌坊、华表柱、翁仲，余外又围了一个园，种些花木，堆些假山，竟成了一个名胜。这屈公祠竟与孙楚楼、江令宅齐名不朽了。","en":"and even commissioned a few boats for the enjoyment of spring and summer excursions. In front of the tombs of Master Qu and Fairy Du, they erected stone memorial archways, ornamental pillars, and stone guardian statues. Furthermore, they enclosed the area to create a garden, planting various flowers and trees, and piling up artificial rockeries, transforming the site"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":1,"tokens":["道翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"见还有与子云、蕙芳、素兰、琪官的信，且搁过一边。拆开自己的信，见一张白纸写着「哀启者」，大为骇然，想道：「难道道翁有什么缘故了？」遂细细的看下去，不觉泪珠点点的落将下来。","en":"words, \\"A Notice of Bereavement.\\" He was deeply shocked, thinking to himself, \\"Could something have happened to Daoweng?\\" He read on carefully, and before he knew it, teardrops began to fall one by one."},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":4,"tokens":["道翁","屈道翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"又将道翁的遗言拆读，更加泪落如雨。子玉等与众人看了，个个大哭了一场，哭得九香楼下好不热闹。众人哭毕，子云道：「此事在我，明日即着人到江南去接玉侬回来，并办道翁葬事。但今年不能到了。」子云即回，要告诉次贤商量此事。子玉也无心在九香楼，便即回家。高品，史南湘金粟","en":"When they tore open and read Daoweng's dying testament, their tears fell even more heavily, like rain. After Ziyu and the others finished reading, every one of them wept bitterly, their cries making the base of the Nine-Fragrance Tower ring with grief. Once their weeping subsided, Ziyun"},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":1,"tokens":["屈道生"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"士燮道：「这个是我的小儿，那个是我的内侄颜剑潭。」又对子玉、仲清道：「这是屈道生先生的令郎，同我进京的，其中缘故，此是也不及细说。你们见见，将来要在一处的。」子玉始而大骇，继而大乐，竟乐得笑将出来。琴仙见了子玉，笑容满面，也觉喜欢，上前与二人见了礼，彼此面面相觑，心里明白，口里却都无话可讲。士燮当着他们初次见面，自然是生的，没甚","en":"nephew by marriage, Yan Jiantan.\\" He then turned to Ziyu and Zhongqing and said, \\"This is the son of the scholar Qu Daosheng, who traveled with me to the capital. There are reasons behind this that I don't have time to detail right now. You should greet him; you will be spending a lot of time together in the future.\\" Ziyu was initially terrified, but this quickly gave way"},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":1,"tokens":["道翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"而卧，竟把嫌疑也忘了，琴仙便哝哝唧唧说出京时如何想念，在南京如何游玩，到莫愁湖亲见他前生坟墓，杜仙女怎样灵异，道翁临终时怎样伤心，众长随逃窃后怎样受苦，刘喜怎样尽心服侍，侯石翁怎样戏谑，又将梅侍郎来访，他怎样仗义安葬建祠的话，细细述了，说得子玉悲乐相乘。","en":"his former life's grave at Mochou Lake, the miraculous manifestations of Fairy Du, the heartbreaking sorrow of Daoweng's final moments, the suffering he endured after the senior servants stole their belongings and fled, how Liu Xi had served him with utmost devotion, the lecherous harassment of Hou Shiweng, and finally, Vice Minister Mei's visit and how he had righteously"},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":3,"tokens":["道翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"内伤了无数的心，哭了无数的眼泪，才有今日这一叙，倒成了悲欢离合，真也奇极了。」后来，琴仙又讲到他梦见神娥授笔，道翁成神，并舟中彼此照镜正面反面，怎样又化了珠为龙抢去，子玉、仲清连连称异。子玉也将送行后怎样得病，得信后怎样悲伤，众人怎样祭奠道翁，度香已着人下了江南来接你并安葬道翁，直说到今日再想不着你来，二人又复悲喜交集。琴仙又复感激子云与众人，不住在枕上与子玉、","en":"utterly extraordinary.\\" Later, Qinxian spoke of dreaming that the divine maiden had bestowed brushes upon them, how Daoweng had become a deity, how their boats had drawn alongside one another and they had reflected each other's fronts and backs in mirrors, and how the pearl had turned into a dragon and been snatched away. Ziyu and Zhongqing marveled repeatedly at these tales."},{"paragraph":34,"mentions":2,"tokens":["屈道翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"回家，合家迎接。琼华拜见了公公，士燮十分喜欢。颜夫人同着谈了一回，后将琴仙的事委委婉婉说了出来，就说他唱过戏，屈道翁见他人品好，所以收为义子。将子玉害病的话，却隐藏不题。士燮道：「我已猜着了几分。」也将屈道翁梦中之言说了，又道：「前事也不必论他。这个孩子甚好，没有一点优伶习气，不说破真令人看不出来。」颜夫人道：「看这个孩子，将来有些造化也未可定的。」士燮点头，索性","en":"then gently and tactfully recounted Qinxian's entire story, explaining that he had once sung in operas, and that Qu Daoweng, seeing his excellent character, had adopted him as his son. She deliberately hid the details of Ziyu's illness, making no mention of it. Shixie said, \\"I had already guessed as much.\\" He then shared the words Qu Daoweng had spoken to him in his dream,"}],"60":[{"paragraph":4,"mentions":1,"tokens":["屈道翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云问道：「怎样呢？」吉甫道：「花神若定要十二位，也可凑得上，只要把屈道翁做了芙蓉城主，再借重玉侬的前生所说那杜仙女，凑上玉侬，不是十二位了？」春航道：「妙，妙！此像要画得像，不必说真姓真名，缀个别号，每人做一篇赞语，说得似真似幻的，要与人花两合。」子玉道：「这个图怎样的好呢？还是单画人，还是补景呢？」仲清道：「自然单画人","en":"what it was. Jifu explained, \\"If we must have twelve flower deities, we can make up the number. We need only cast Qu Daoweng as the Lord of Furong City, and borrow the Fairy Du from Yunong's past-life vision. Add Yunong himself, and does that not make twelve?\\" Chunhang exclaimed, \\"Brilliant, brilliant! The portraits must capture their likenesses, but we need not use their"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":3,"tokens":["道生","屈道翁","道翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"次贤道：「不必过谦。道生先生故后，笔墨之道，自然要让你，大家公论，何必推辞。我就做云龙那一幅，作好了，你再给我改改。」子云道：「自然是借重你们二位。那十篇如今是这样，各人拈阄，拈到谁是谁。华星北也叫他做一篇在内。」南湘道：「甚好。」于是写起阄来，将屈道翁与杜仙女、屈琴仙分做","en":"Cixian insisted, \\"There is no need for excessive modesty. With Master Daosheng gone, the realm of brush and ink naturally yields to you; this is public consensus, so why decline? I will draft the cloud-dragon panel; once it is done, you can refine it for me.\\" Ziyun said, \\"Naturally, we must rely on you both. As for the other ten"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":1,"tokens":["道翁"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"贤妙腕灵思，画了十天才成。画成又请吉甫一一的改好，画一个，刻一个，倒也甚快。子云因受了感冒甚重，不敢用心，嘱将道翁、琴仙、杜仙女画在一幅，并求子玉作赞。到二十七日，连传赞都也刻起，系是各人书丹。二十八日就搬往九香楼镶嵌，一日完工。","en":"proceeding with remarkable speed. Ziyun, suffering from a severe cold, dared not overexert himself, so he asked that Daoweng, Qinxian, and Fairy Du be combined into a single panel, and requested Ziyu to compose the eulogy. By the twenty-seventh, all the biographies and eulogies had been carved, each inscribed on the stone in the author's own hand. On the twenty-eighth, the"}]}`),"char-142":JSON.parse(`{"5":[{"paragraph":28,"mentions":1,"tokens":["苏兵部"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"赶不上他。只是太爱花钱，其实他倒不骄不傲，人家看着他那样气焰排场，便不敢近他。他家财本没有数儿，那年娶了靖边侯苏兵部的姑娘，这妆奁就有百万。他夫人真生得天仙似的，这相貌只怕要算天下第一了，而且贤淑无双，琴棋书画，件件皆精。还有十个丫头，叫做十珠婢，名字都有个珠字，都也生得如花似玉，通文识字，会唱会弹。这华公子在府里，真是一天乐到晚。这是城里头第一个贵公子，第一个阔","en":"Through the passageway was the main hall, flanked by six wing-rooms on either side. Fu the Third was already standing beneath the eaves of the main house, coming forward to welcome him. Pincai hurried up and clasped his hands in greeting. Fu the Third led him behind the main hall to sit in a pair of small study rooms, exchanging polite inquiries about each other's health. Pincai said: \\"The snow delayed me these past few days, otherwise I would have come to pay my respects the day before yesterday. I felt so restless at home, thinking of you constantly, Third Brother.\\" Fu the Third replied: \\"The feeling is mutual.\\" This place was Fu the Third's study, situated close to the inner chambers, separated only by a courtyard. Pincai briefly took in the room's furnishings: the space was divided by a floor-to-ceiling partition of nanmu wood carved with ice-crackle patterns. In the upper room was a wooden kang, adorned with a set of four small landscape screens, and a striking clock rested on the kang table. Nearby stood a square table with several chairs, and in the center sat a large copper coal-brazier. On the wall hung a silk-scroll couplet, and beside it an intricate Western painting. The kang cushions were of sapphire-blue satin. A servant entered, wearing a plain silk fur-lined jacket and a fur hat pulled down over his eyebrows, revealing half of a large braided queue at the back. Carrying a tea tray, he first handed a cup to Pincai. Pincai said: \\"Please convey my respects to the Madam.\\" Before the servant could reply, Fu the Third said: \\"Your sister-in-law is not home today; she has gone to visit her parents. Stay and have a meal with me today, and we can chat.\\" Pincai readily agreed, then asked: \\"Will Eldest Brother be coming today?\\" Fu the Third replied: \\"I'm not sure. I heard him say yesterday he had business and needed to go to Jinchun Garden to ask Young Master Hua to put in a good word. I imagine he has gone there by now.\\" Hearing of Young Master Hua of Jinchun Garden, Pincai asked: \\"I was just going to ask about that Young Master Hua.\\" He then recounted what he had seen on the road and what the driver had told him. Fu the Third said: \\"What does a driver know! This Young Master Hua's name is Guangsu, style name Xingbei. His father is a hereditary first-class duke, currently serving as Commander-General of the Western Frontier. Because of the great merits of his ancestors, when he was eighteen and entered official service, he was immediately awarded the rank of a second-class idle grand minister. This year he is twenty-one, accomplished in horsemanship and archery, and quite capable in literary affairs as well. His looks go without saying — even those young dan performers cannot match him. The only fault is that he spends too lavishly. But in truth he is not arrogant or haughty at all; people who see his imposing retinue simply do not dare approach him. His family wealth is beyond reckoning. A few years back he married the daughter of Su, Marquis of Jingbian of the Ministry of War, whose dowry alone came to a million taels. His wife is truly beautiful as a heavenly immortal, her looks may be the finest in all the realm. She is supremely virtuous too, accomplished in calligraphy, painting, chess, and music. She also has ten maidservants called the Ten Pearl Maids, all bearing names with the character 'pearl', all as beautiful as flowers and jade, literate, and able to sing and play instruments. In his residence, Young Master Hua truly passes every day in delight. He is the foremost noble young man in the city, the supreme wealthy patron. I have a slight family tie to him myself, through your sister-in-law's maternal uncle."}],"11":[{"paragraph":4,"mentions":1,"tokens":["臣泰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"用些富贵豪华之福。养尊处优，不喜酬应。\\n骑射既精，词赋更妙。也曾千卷罗胸，不难七步随口。这华夫人母家姓苏，父名臣泰，也是功臣之后，世袭列侯，现任兵部尚书。并无嗣子，只生二女：长名浣香，次名浣兰，皆生得华容绝代，每于花下闲行，有百蝶随舞。精于诗词音律，书画琴棋，各臻微妙。外间有两句口号说道：「不愿得龙宫十斛珠，只愿」一见侯门大小苏。」这浣香十八岁上嫁了华光宿，真是","en":"effortlessly compose verse within seven paces. His wife, Lady Hua, was born of the maternal Su lineage. Her father, Su Chentai, descended from the glorious founders of the dynasty, held the hereditary title of marquis, and currently reigned as President of the Board of War. Lacking sons, he cherished his two daughters: the elder, Huanxiang, and the younger, Huanlan. Both were"}],"48":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":4,"tokens":["臣泰","苏侯"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，不得不向正路上走，因此成就了功名学问。今年会试，房官虽荐了他的卷子，大总裁已经驳落。内中有一位总裁，姓苏，名臣泰，现任兵部大堂，翰林出身，后又承袭了侯爵，就是华公子的泰山。看了春航的文字，大加赞赏道：「此人才调不凡，虽掞藻摛华，过于靡丽，倒是个词臣格调，可以黼黻太平。」大总裁犹以为未可。及看他《五经》通明，策对平允，遂中了他三十四名。苏侯到填榜时，拆对墨卷，见","en":"chamber examiner had recommended his paper, the chief examiner had rejected it. However, one of the chief examiners, Su Chentai, the Minister of War, who possessed a Hanlin background and was a hereditary marquis as well as Young Master Hua's father-in-law, greatly admired Chunhang's essay. He praised Chunhang's ornate yet elegant style as perfectly suited for a peaceful reign."},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":1,"tokens":["苏侯"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"苏侯初见了春航这般人物，心上十分中意，意欲附为婚姻，问他已有了妻室，暗暗叹息。","en":"When Marquis Su first met a man of Chunhang's caliber, he was immensely pleased and wished to forge a marriage alliance. Upon discovering that Chunhang already had a wife, he sighed secretly in disappointment."}],"49":[{"paragraph":5,"mentions":2,"tokens":["苏侯"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"却说春航要续弦，选择清门之语，传入苏侯耳内，正合他意。便在武选司郎中杨方猷面前，略露了些口风，似要他去对春航说，托人来求的意思。杨方猷是春航的房师，心中甚喜，即来与春航讲了，叫他请人去求亲。春航倒有些踌躇，因苏家是世禄之家，门庭烜赫，自己虽成了名，依然寒素，因此有些不愿。且未知那位小姐怎","en":"Meanwhile, rumors that Chunhang sought a new match from a pure, respectable family reached the ears of Su the Marquis, fitting his own desires perfectly. He dropped a few subtle hints before Yang Fangyou, Director of the Bureau of Military Appointments, suggesting he convey to Chunhang that he should send an intermediary to propose. Yang Fangyou was Chunhang's examiner-teacher;"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":2,"tokens":["苏侯"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"此时子云在宝香堂，见了春航进来，连忙迎接，彼此谈了些话。春航问他与苏侯是师生，可知他家的细底。子云道：「你问他做甚？」春航将杨方猷的话对子云讲了，子云连忙称贺道：「恭喜，恭喜！这个喜，比你中状元还要大些。」春航笑道：「不过显官罢了，知道成与不成，吾兄倒先贺起来。」子云道：「显官什么要紧，又不要借他声势。但这个苏侯是我的","en":"he hurried to welcome him, and they exchanged pleasantries. Chunhang asked whether Ziyun, being a student of Su the Marquis, knew the intimate details of his household. \\"Why do you ask?\\" Ziyun asked. Chunhang recounted Yang Fangyou's words. Ziyun immediately offered his congratulations. \\"Congratulations, congratulations! This joy is even greater than your taking first place"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":4,"tokens":["苏侯"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云过了两日，回拜华公子，进城顺路到了苏府。正值苏侯下衙门回来，请了进去。子云请了安，又进去见了师母，说他夫人与师母请安，苏夫人也问了好。苏侯让进内书房坐下，谈了一会，子云将春航春间断弦，闻二世妹贤淑之名，奉母命求亲的话说了。苏侯故作沉吟道：「看田修撰文才品貌，是极好的，而且也是个旧家，但不知品行如何","en":"Ziyun returned Young Master Hua's visit, and on his way back through the city, he stopped at the Su residence. Su the Marquis had just returned from his office and invited him in. Ziyun paid his respects and then went inside to greet the Madam, conveying his wife's regards, to which Madam Su warmly replied. Su the Marquis then invited him into the inner study to sit. After"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":10,"tokens":["苏侯"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"苏侯大乐，留子云小饮，问近日见华星北无有。子云答以方才从那里来。苏侯又问：「园中想必收拾得更好了，我竟一二年没有来逛园子。」子云道：「比初成时又更好了些，花木比从前繁盛了，池子也开通了。」苏侯道：「我这几年也实在忙，竟没有一日空闲，倒是你们师母心上想来逛","en":"Greatly pleased, Su the Marquis kept Ziyun for a small drink. He asked if Ziyun had seen Young Master Hua recently, and Ziyun replied that he had just come from there. Su the Marquis then asked, \\"Your garden must be even more beautifully arranged now; I haven't been there for a stroll"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":3,"tokens":["苏侯"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"子云道：「就五十外得子，也不算很迟。德门世冑，无须虑及此的。」苏侯道：「我已不作此想了。尊大人今年是六十几了？」子云道：「家严六十三，家慈六十二。」苏候道：「尊翁是何等福分！那年在京时是五十九了，须发光黑，那里像花甲之人，正是龙马精神，我们是比不上的。而且尊公的福气那是世间全福，就是令泰山也比不上他。」子云道：「总","en":"considered very late. A family of such accumulated virtue and noble lineage has no need to worry about this.\\" Su the Marquis sighed, \\"I no longer entertain such thoughts. Is your father in his sixties this year?\\" Ziyun replied, \\"My father is sixty-three, and my mother is sixty-two.\\" Su the Marquis exclaimed, \\"What tremendous fortune your father has! When he was in the capital"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":4,"tokens":["苏侯"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"门生熟识往来却也不少，但是人云亦云的多。就有一位老前辈，近来又赴任去了，叫屈本立。想现任官，在京也不能考的。」苏侯道：「屈道生么？他是孝廉方正，可惜了，屈在下位。不然倒好保他。还有那南京名宿金粟，也因限于成例不能保举的，真真令人可惜。此外呢？」子云道：「此外尚有几个，都是英才未发的人。翰林院侍读学士梅公之子名子玉，目下少年中有景星凤凰之誉。」苏侯点点头。子云又道","en":"left for a post, named Qu Benli. I assume that as an active official, he cannot take the exam in the capital.\\" Su the Marquis said, \\"Ah, Qu Daosheng? He was recommended for Filial Piety and Incorruptibility; it is a pity he is relegated to a lower post. Otherwise, it would be good to sponsor him. There is also the famous Nanjing scholar Jin Su, who is restricted by established"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":1,"tokens":["苏侯"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"我知道前日失言，仁兄因此怪我。」子云笑道：「岂有此理。我辈肝胆之交，就说错句话，也断无怪理。」却说闲话，不提起苏侯的事来。春航性急，只得问道：「前日吾兄进城会见苏老师么？」子云道：「谈了半日，到赶城出来的。」春航见他神色不像，心中疑虑，只得问道：「所托之事怎样？」子云道：「有几分可望。」春航听了大疑，心中想道：「据杨老师说，是他愿意，怎么如今只有几分可望，此话怎","en":"absolutely no reason to hold a grudge.\\" He then chatted of idle matters, deliberately avoiding the subject of Su the Marquis. Impatient, Chunhang was forced to ask, \\"Did you go into the city to meet Teacher Su the other day?\\" Ziyun said, \\"We talked for half a day, and I had to rush to get out of the city before the gates closed.\\" Seeing Ziyun's unreadable expression, Chunhang"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":1,"tokens":["苏侯"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"只见次贤、南湘进来，大家坐了。子云即将苏侯问南湘的话，与南湘说了。南湘听了，不觉双眉一扬，说道：「没有什么错处，我也照着人一样。况且那一天同着人去的，并不是我一人，怎么就是我错，又单是我狂呢？这就难了，这就难了。」","en":"Just then, Cixian and Nanxiang entered, and everyone took a seat. Ziyun immediately relayed Su the Marquis's remarks about Nanxiang's etiquette. Hearing this, Nanxiang's eyebrows shot up in indignation. \\"What did I do wrong? I follow the same etiquette as everyone else. Besides, that day I went with a group; I was not alone. Why is it suddenly my fault, and"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":2,"tokens":["苏侯"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"我倒请教你，什么叫神色之间有些错呢？」大家也就不言语了。次贤问子云道：「湘帆的事如何？」子云道：「可成。」又将苏侯问他访些真才实学的人，就将对苏侯所举那几个，一一讲来。又对南湘道：「原来你们都是年谊。」南湘道：「原是年伯，但从前却不大往来。」子云道：「闻考宏词定于八月初一日，如今只有两月多了，怎么高卓然还不见来？」春航道：「他连信也没有一封，不知在家做什么，真荒","en":"quiet by asking Ziyun, \\"How did Xiangfan's matter go?\\" Ziyun replied, \\"It can be done.\\" He then recounted how Su the Marquis had asked him to seek out men of true talent and learning, detailing the names he had proposed. Turning to Nanxiang, he added, \\"It turns out you all share examination-year ties.\\" Nanxiang replied, \\"He is indeed an elder of my father's examination year,"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":1,"tokens":["苏侯"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"而且都好。我们有一回在他家唱戏，看见帘子内有一大群，有男装的，有女装的，粉白黛绿，也望不清楚。」春航道：「将来苏侯赠嫁过来，我想必有几个丫鬟，如果有好的在内，我送一个与你。」蕙芳笑道：「多谢，多谢！那时我只好在这里伺候一辈子，算田、苏两姓家奴了。」春航道：「言重！言重！我自有个道理，决不教你受一分委屈。而且也是顽话，知道有好的没有好的？我想世间错配的真有，咱们家","en":"women's, all powdered and painted, though I couldn't see them clearly.\\" Chunhang offered, \\"In the future, when Su the Marquis sends over the dowry maids, there are sure to be several. If there is a good one among them, I will give her to you.\\" Huifang laughed, \\"Many thanks, many thanks! In that case, I will just have to serve here for the rest of my life, counting as a bonded"}],"50":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["苏侯"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说春航已聘了苏侯的小姐，只等七月七日完毕婚姻。五月过了，正是日长炎夏，火伞如焚。","en":"By this time, Chunhang was already formally betrothed to the daughter of Marquis Su, waiting only for the seventh day of the seventh month to complete the marriage rites. The fifth month had slipped away; the days grew long in the blazing height of midsummer, the sun beating down like a fiery parasol."}],"52":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["苏侯"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"且说春航吉期已到，这苏侯是个阔家，大姑娘嫁与华公子，妆奁就值百万。今知春航是个寒士，把京东的田庄批了二百顷，拨了两名庄头，六房家人男妇，十个丫鬟，至珠宝古玩、陈设铺垫，以及衣服被褥、箱盒桌椅器皿之类，送奁那一日，用了二千名人夫，苏夫人犹以为薄，不及大姑娘十分之七，于铺箱时铺","en":"By now, the auspicious day for Chunhang's wedding had arrived. Su the Marquis, commanding immense wealth, had already married his elder daughter to Young Master Hua with a dowry valued at a million taels. Knowing Chunhang was a humble scholar without such means, the Marquis assigned him two hundred qing of estates in the eastern"}],"54":[{"paragraph":4,"mentions":1,"tokens":["苏侯"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"玉见仲清、高品、王恂等落第，心甚不安，并不以此自得，反谦谨了许多。拜了保荐老师刘尚书，是熟极的，及谒阅卷老师，苏侯见了子玉，就想起子云之言，真是吉星鸾凤，喜不可言。王文辉与陆夫人心中半喜半闷，喜的是子玉考中，闷的是王恂、仲清不中，但接着要办女儿的喜事，也就喜多闷少。","en":"On the ninth, examining ministers were assigned: Su the Marquis again chief examiner, Young Master Hua inspection officer, Ziyun receiving officer, Wenze sealing officer, and Zhang Zhongyu patrol officer. On the morning of the tenth they entered the hall. First session had eight questions: *Draft Han Edict*, *Draft"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":1,"tokens":["苏侯"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"两人我七月内都曾会过，有他们的诗么？我前日倒没有细看。」琼华翻了出来，蓉华看了道：「果然。这浣香、浣兰是苏年伯苏侯的女儿，浣香嫁与华家，浣兰就是田春帆新娶的夫人。这两姊妹真是才貌双全，世间少有的。」琼华道：「就是他们么？怪不得母亲回来这么夸奖他们。」佩秋道：「他们姊妹倒像双生似的，一模一样，比二位姑娘生得还要像些。」蓉华道：「我们虽是亲姊妹，其实不很像。你看二姑","en":"Ronghua exclaimed, \\"They are excellent indeed. Huanxiang and Huanlan are the daughters of our old family friend, the Marquis of Su. Huanxiang married into the Hua family; Huanlan is Tian Chunhang's new wife. The sisters possess beauty and talent together—a thing rarely seen in this world.\\" \\"So it is they!\\" said Qionghua. \\"No wonder Mother praised them so upon her return.\\""}]}`),"char-143":JSON.parse(`{"23":[{"paragraph":10,"mentions":1,"tokens":["亮轩"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"且说孙嗣徽今日出门是找他一个亲戚，系姑表妻舅，姓姬叫作亮轩，江苏常州府金匮县人，向办刑钱，屡食重聘，因其品行不端，以致闻风畏惕。且学问平常，专靠巴结，因声名传开了，近省地方竟弄不出个馆地来。只得带了些银钱货物进京，希图结交显宦，弄个大馆出来。于孙亮功谊有葭莩，遂送了一分厚礼，托其吹嘘汲引。已经来了两月，却也","en":"Meanwhile, Sun Sihui had gone out that day to seek a relative, a cousin-in-law named Ji Liangxuan, a native of Jinkui County in Changzhou Prefecture, Jiangsu. Ji had long worked as a legal and financial secretary, earning hefty salaries, but due to his unsavory character, his reputation had grown notorious, making people wary of him. His scholarship"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":2,"tokens":["亮轩","姬亮轩"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"亮轩见其眉目清俊，以青蚨十千买得，改名英官，打扮起来也还好看。日间是主仆称呼，晚间为妻妾侍奉。当下嗣徽见了也觉垂涎。二人点了菜，凤林敬了几杯酒，那巴英官似气忿忿的站在后面。凤林最伶透，便知他是个卯君，忙招呼了他，问了姓，叫了几声巴二爷，方才踱了出去，姬亮","en":"Seeing his delicate features, Liangxuan had purchased him for ten thousand copper cash, renaming him Yingguan. Dressed up, the boy looked quite charming. By day they maintained the guise of master and servant, but by night he served as a concubine. Upon seeing him, Sihui could not help but"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":4,"tokens":["亮轩"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"亮轩笑道：「妹丈取笑了，东家的墙岂可逾得？就太晚了，二更三更，宅门也还叫得开的。」嗣徽道：「三更叫门，大惊小怪的，到底有些不便。你何不开个后门倒便当些，人不能测度的。」亮轩即正正经经的讲道：「妹丈真真是个趣人，取笑得岂有此理。我们作朋友的，第一讲究是品行","en":"Liangxuan laughed, \\"My dear brother-in-law jokes! How could one scale the host's wall? Even if it is quite late, the second or third watch of the night, the mansion gates can still be called open.\\" Sihui replied, \\"Calling at the gates during the third watch causes"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":4,"tokens":["亮轩"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"凤林道：「也拿不定，一年牵算起来，三四千吊钱是长有的。」亮轩吐出舌头道：「有这许多？比我们作刑钱的束修还多呢！我如今倒也懊悔，从前也应该学戏，倒比学幕还快活些。我们收徒弟是赔钱贴饭，学不成的，十年八年，推不出去，即有荐出去的，或到半年三月又回来了。到得徒弟孝敬老师，一世能碰见几个？真不如你们作相公的好了。」说","en":"said, \\"It's hard to say for certain. Averaged over a year, three or four thousand strings of cash is typical.\\" Liangxuan stuck out his tongue in astonishment: \\"That much? That's more than we legal secretaries earn in tuition fees! I truly regret it now; I should have learned to perform theater in the past. It would have been far more joyous than learning the secretarial"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":2,"tokens":["亮轩"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这一句说到亮轩心上来，便笑道：「这小童倒也亏他，驴子、小妾两样，他都作全了。」嗣徽道：「奇哉！什么叫作驴子、小妾？吾愿闻其详。」亮轩道：「我今只用他一个跟班，譬如你住西城，我住南城，若有话商量，我必要从城根下骑了驴子过来。有了他，便写一信，叫他送给官，便代了步，不","en":"This struck a chord in Liangxuan's heart, and he smiled: \\"I must give credit to this little boy. He perfectly fulfills two roles: both donkey and concubine.\\" Sihui exclaimed, \\"How extraordinary! What do you mean by donkey and concubine? I wish to hear the details.\\" Liangxuan explained,"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":1,"tokens":["亮轩"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"他的嘴，凤林跑出屋子，嗣徽赶出去，凤林又进来了，嗣徽便狠起那斑斑驳驳的面皮道：「你若到我手，我决不放你起来。」亮轩替他讨了情，敬了一杯酒，夹了两箸菜，嗣徽方才饶了凤林。","en":"in. Sihui, his mottled face flushed with anger, threatened, \\"If I catch you, I will definitely not let you up!\\" Liangxuan pleaded on his behalf, offering a cup of wine and picking up some food with his chopsticks, and only then did Sihui forgive Fenglin."},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":4,"tokens":["亮轩","姬亮轩"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"凤林又敬了亮轩几杯，那个巴英官红着脸，在廊下走来走去。姬亮轩叫他来装烟，他也不理，又去了。嗣徽见了说道：「大哥，方才小弟要请教你的话，我只知泌水洋洋，可以乐饥。至于蒸豚之味，未曾尝过，不识其中之妙，到底有甚好处，与妻子好合如何？」亮轩笑道：「据我想来，原是各有好处","en":"Fenglin offered several more toasts to Liangxuan. Meanwhile, Ba Yingguan, his face flushed with jealousy, paced back and forth under the veranda. Ji Liangxuan called him in to prepare the tobacco pipe, but he ignored him and walked away again. Seeing this, Sihui said, \\"Elder brother, earlier I wished"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":2,"tokens":["亮轩","姬亮轩"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"哉！竟是闻所未闻。小弟船倒天天坐的，车却总坐不进。到了门口，竟非人力可通，又恐坐着了粪车，则人皆掩鼻而过矣。」亮轩笑道：「也有个法子，就是粪车，也可坐得的。大木耳一个，水泡软了，拿来作你的帽子，又作车里的垫子，那管粪车，也就坐得了。」嗣徽大乐道：「领教，领教。」对着凤林道：「我明日坐一回罢。」凤林啐了一口道：「不要胡讲了。天已晚了，我还有两处地方要去呢。吃饭吧。","en":"strength to pass through; and I fear that if I sit in a dung cart, people will cover their noses as they pass by.\\" Liangxuan laughed: \\"There is a method for that; even a dung cart can be ridden. Take a large piece of wood ear mushroom, soak it in water until soft, use it as your hat, and as the cushion inside the cart—then, no matter the dung cart, it can be ridden.\\" Sihui"}],"27":[{"paragraph":4,"mentions":1,"tokens":["姬亮轩"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"奚十一心上极为畅快。那巴英官伺候过大老爷，在师爷面前，越发骄纵起来。况又得了几件新衣，裱糊好了，觉得更加光彩。姬亮轩每到情急求他，竟是勉强应酬，不是那从前服贴光景。","en":"year. They already lodged together, and the clerk began playing sycophant in advance. Guess who? That same Mr. Ji from the dung-cart. Seeing Xi due for posting—magistrate of an independent department, a fat stint where one or two years could yield a fortune—and knowing Xi was open-handed but a muddle-headed young gentleman, he reckoned the post would in practice"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":1,"tokens":["姬亮轩"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"次。从前还只一个，如今又添了巴英官，更比春兰巴结的好。巴英官肌肤虽黑，却光亮滑泽，得个油字诀，所以爱的人最多，姬亮轩醉后也曾对人讲过。","en":"actors. Zhongyu chased coin, not flesh; in those circles he feigned manners and never indulged truly, while Xi and Ji, without this, had no hobby. Xi Eleven was especially low; even during one meal he had to slip inside twice. Once there was only one boy, but now Ba Yingguan was added, even more devoted than Chunlan. Ba Yingguan's skin, though dark, was sleek and glossy—the"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":3,"tokens":["亮轩"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"是日饮酒之间，奚十一叫春兰进去了一回，出来坐了一坐；又叫巴英官进去了。仲雨不知其故，只道有事，便与亮轩讲些闲话。这两个相公，一个是蓉官，一个是春林，皆是奚十一常叫的。蓉官对着春林做眼色，春林笑了一笑。亮轩也做眉做眼的，仲雨偶然看见，却不晓得什么，也不便问。蓉官忽问仲雨道：「你能有个相好姓魏的，他初到京时，我就认识他，却不见得怎样。前日我在富三爷家见他","en":"Zhongyu wonder what business was being conducted behind the inner door. Zhongyu guessed his errands and chatted with Liangxuan. The two actors, Rongguan and Chunlin, were Xi's usual calls. Rongguan signaled Chunlin, and Chunlin smiled. Liangxuan too rolled his eyes; Zhongyu glimpsed it but didn't grasp it and didn't ask. Rongguan suddenly asked Zhongyu: \\"You know a patron surnamed"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":3,"tokens":["亮轩"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"的议论。若说华府里，田地甚多，我听得有四十几个庄头，一年论租，就抵得一府分的钱漕，自然也算个极豪富的人家了。」亮轩点点头：「我们东家也常提起，说华公子是他的世叔，华公爷是我老东家提台老大人的老师。有这么一个好世交，我们东家竟不拉拢。小弟是常劝他去走走。东家说，这是从前在军营保举的老师，那时华公子还小，说起来也未必知道，所以不肯去。就是现在那位徐中堂，做两广总督的","en":"and a year's rent from them would answer for a whole prefecture's grain tax. They are rich enough, certainly.\\" Liangxuan nodded. \\"My patron often speaks of it — that Young Master Hua is an uncle of his own generation, and that the old Duke Hua was the teacher of my former patron, the Provincial Military Commander. With a family connection as good as that, and yet my patron"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":1,"tokens":["亮轩"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"杯罢。」仲雨道：「喝得多了。」奚十一道：「好话，快再干两杯，我们豁几拳罢。」仲雨道：「也好。」奚十一就与仲雨、亮轩、蓉官、春林豁了十拳，起初还叫得清，后来便叫出怪声。广东人豁拳是最难听的，像叫些杀狗杀鸭的字音。","en":"\\"Good words—two more rounds, and we'll finger-guess.\\" Zhongyu agreed, \\"Fine.\\" Xi guessed ten rounds with Zhongyu, Liangxuan, Rongguan, and Chunlin. At first his calls were distinct and orderly; as the wine mounted, his tongue tangled and the cries became strange animal noises. Cantonese finger-guessing was notorious for sounding ugly, as though men were shouting the words"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":1,"tokens":["亮轩"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，就是你那两位老世叔，是有名的大公子，尚且不能难为他，倒常受他的气。若教你去，准还不能进他的屋，子要想见他。」亮轩道：「那里有这话？我不信。岂有东家这样阔人，还不来巴结，难道他不喜欢银钱的？」仲雨道：「别人你拿钱，可以熏他；这小东西，钱倒熏不动的。」奚十一道：「岂有此理，你不要尽讲海话。你看我去，包管他必出来，还待得我好。」","en":"lords, couldn't bend him and often ate his temper. You'd never cross his threshold, let alone dream of seeing him.\\" Liangxuan put in, \\"How can that be? I do not believe it. Is there a grandee as rich as my patron whom he will not court? Is he not fond of money?\\" Zhongyu said, \\"With anyone else, money will smoke him out. This little creature money will not move.\\" Xi Eleven said,"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":2,"tokens":["姬亮轩","亮轩"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"奚十一过了夜，明日早饭后，想起仲雨所说的琴言这么利害，到底不信，必要去试试。过瘾之后，同了姬亮轩，带了春兰、巴英官，自己换了件新纱衫子，坐了车，叫春兰、巴英官同跨了车沿，亮轩另雇一个车，到秋水堂来。","en":"Qinyan could be so unapproachable, he resolved to test the matter for himself. After taking opium, along with Ji Liangxuan, Chunlan, and Ba Yingguan, he wore a fresh gauze jacket and took a carriage. Chunlan and Ba Yingguan rode on the footboards, while Liangxuan hired another cart, and they set off to Autumn-Water Hall."},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":1,"tokens":["姬亮轩"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这边奚十一已到门，春兰、英官下来，进去问了，回说不在家。奚十一听了，先有一分怒气，自己也就下来，刚刚走进了门，姬亮轩尚在门外，只见一人笑嘻嘻的上前说道：「老爷是找那一个的？若是找相公们的，没有一个在屋里。」说罢，便迎面站住，也不说个请字。奚十一见了就有了三分气。正要开口，倒是春兰先说道：「呀！这是奚大老爷，无论相公在家不在家，总请大老爷进去，怎么门口就挡住了？」","en":"Yingguan descended and asked within. When answered that no one was home, Xi felt anger rising and entered himself. Liangxuan was still outside when a man stepped up grinning: \\"Sir, seeking whom? If actors, none are inside.\\" He blocked the way with no \\"please.\\" Xi was three parts furious and about to bark, but Chunlan spoke first: \\"Ah, this is Great Master Xi! Whether the actors"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":1,"tokens":["亮轩"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"那人才退了两步，说：「请大老爷进屋子里喝茶。」即开了二门，奚十一同亮轩进内，走过了庭心，上了客厅，却是三间：东边隔去了一间，算客房。对面两间，一边是门房，一边空着。","en":"The man stepped back, \\"Please, Master, have tea inside,\\" and opened the inner gate. Xi and Liangxuan crossed the courtyard and entered the salon, which spanned three bays: The east was partitioned as a guest room. Opposite were two bays: one gate room, and one empty."},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":1,"tokens":["亮轩"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"我叫他，他也不好意思不放回的。」说罢，便解开了两个扣子。长庆替他脱了衫子，折好了，交与春兰，即请他到吃烟去处，亮轩也随了进去。","en":"buttons. Changqing peeled off his jacket, folded it, handed it to Chunlan, and ushered him into the smoking room; Liangxuan followed."},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":1,"tokens":["亮轩"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"请过了安，又见亮轩。长庆叫他们来陪着烧烟，自己抽空走了。","en":"After bowing, they greeted Liangxuan. Changqing had them attend the pipe, and then slipped away."},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":5,"tokens":["亮轩","姬亮轩"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"天福就在奚十一对面躺下，天寿坐在炕沿上。亮轩拖张凳子近着炕边，看他们吃烟，春兰、巴英官在房门口帘子边望着。只见天寿爬在奚十一身上，看他手上的翡翠镯子，天福也斜着身子，隔着灯盘拉了奚十一的手，两人同看。亮轩也来炕上躺了，两个相公就在炕沿轮流烧烟。天福挨了奚十一，天寿靠了姬亮轩，两边唧唧哝哝的讲话","en":"Tianfu lay opposite Xi, and Tianshou perched on the edge of the kang. Liangxuan dragged a stool beside the kang, watching them smoke. Chunlan and Ba Yingguan peered from the doorway curtain. Tianshou climbed beside Xi, studying his jade bracelet, while Tianfu leaned across the lamp tray, holding Xi's hand; both admired him. Liangxuan"},{"paragraph":31,"mentions":4,"tokens":["姬亮轩","亮轩"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"了戏饭，也没有见无缘无故的打上门来，我们到街上去讲理。」奚十一也不答话，抓住了长庆，走到外面，把他又摔了一交。姬亮轩忙上前，作好作歹，连忙劝开，长庆家里人也来劝住。奚十一坐了，长庆爬起来，气得目瞪口呆，只是发喘。亮轩见此光景，忙把衫子与奚十一穿上，死命劝了出去。奚十一一面走，一面骂道：「今日被你们躲过了，明日再来搜你这龟窝，叫我搜着了，就打烂你这娘卖□的。你就拿他","en":"such unprovoked beatings; there is street justice!\\" Xi stayed silent, dragged Changqing out, and threw him again. Liangxuan finally intervened and pacified him, as the family pulled them apart. Xi sat while Changqing rose, his eyes wide, only gasping. Liangxuan dressed Xi and dragged him out. As he walked, Xi cursed, \\"Today you slipped away, but tomorrow I will search this"}],"39":[{"paragraph":5,"mentions":1,"tokens":["姬亮轩"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"人也不甚钟爱他，故此一切从简。女客只有陆氏夫人的嫂子，就是陆宗沅的夫人，带了小女儿前来。男家早上道过喜了。倒是姬亮轩在那里假热闹，心上想闹闹新房，自有两位废物招接。","en":"come, bringing her young daughter. The groom's family had offered their congratulations in the morning. It was Ji Liangxuan who was making a show of festivity; he was privately hoping to rowdy up the bridal chamber, and had the two useless brothers to receive him."},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":6,"tokens":["姬亮轩","亮轩"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"姬亮轩与王恂、仲清是见过几回的了，子玉却是初见，心中想道：「这个梅少爷好相貌，比起那孙老徽来，倒似那戏上岑彭、马武了。」聘才问姬亮轩道：「好几天不见你东家出来，在家里作什么？」亮轩道：「这两天敝东有点贵恙，不便行动。」聘才道：「什么贵恙？」亮轩道：「听得腿","en":"Ji Liangxuan had met Wang Xun and Zhongqing on several previous occasions, but this was his first meeting with Ziyu, whom he eyed with private admiration: \\"This young master Mei is a fine-looking man. Set beside that Sun Sihui, who might be Cen Peng or Ma Wu straight"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":4,"tokens":["姬亮轩","亮轩"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"叫嗣元过来，嗣元不肯，拿张凳子在床面前坐着。姬亮轩向子玉笑嘻嘻道：「梅大先生是不常出来，小弟今日还是头一回识荆。如高兴，歇天何不到敝东处来走走，敝东是极好相与的。」子玉不知他的东家是谁，含糊答应。即私问王恂，王恂答以奚十一，子玉便是一腔忿恨，也不理他。亮轩又向元茂道：「舍表妹贤德无双，李大哥真有福气","en":"Siyuan to come over, but he would not leave; he pulled up a stool and planted himself in front of the bed-curtain. Ji Liangxuan turned to Ziyu with a grinning smile and said, \\"Elder Master Mei rarely goes out in company, and today is the first time I have had the honor of your acquaintance. If you're inclined, why not come visit my master one of these days? He is a most agreeable"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":1,"tokens":["亮轩"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"求栽培栽培，携带携带。」说得个恶心。仲清忍不住问道：「姬先生这样叙起来，我们都可以算得亲戚，只要多转两个弯。」亮轩连称「正是」。子玉微笑。元茂道：「我非但算不得清，而且也听不清，真是葫芦牵倒扁豆藤。」聘才笑道：「忙中遇着腿缠筋。」嗣徽道：「亲亲也，凡有血气者莫不尊亲。亲亲人也，仁者人也。」嗣元听了乃兄开口，就要驳起来，道：「这话、话，不、不通，你、你说凡有血、血","en":"mention.\\" This speech fairly turned everyone's stomach. Zhongqing could not contain himself and said, \\"The way Master Ji works out these connections, we all become kinsmen, as it merely requires a few more turns in the pedigree.\\" Liangxuan agreed heartily. Ziyu smiled. Yuanmao said, \\"Not only can I not follow the connections, I couldn't even hear them properly. It's like"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":2,"tokens":["亮轩"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"？」龙王大惊道：「快些放他去罢，不然他要与我攀亲了，不要攀出蛤蟆亲戚来。」说得聘才、王恂、子玉几乎笑倒。嗣徽与亮轩知道是骂他们，因回答不出来，只好忍气。嗣元见骂了他们，倒反笑起来，道：「好、好个王八亲戚，好、好个蛤蟆亲、亲、亲戚。」王恂道：「我也有个笑话。一个妓女是个瞎子，有人去嫖他，他虽看不见，却分得人的等次来。那一天接了三个客，老鸨问他道：「姑娘，你猜今日三","en":"for a toad as a cousin.\\"' At this, Pincai, Wang Xun, and Ziyu nearly fell off their seats laughing. Sihui and Liangxuan, knowing themselves to be the butt of the joke and having no reply, had to swallow their indignation. Siyuan, however, seeing those two mocked, laughed all the louder. \\"A f-f-fine turtle kinsman!\\" he cried. \\"A f-f-fine toad r-r-relation!\\" Wang Xun said,"}],"42":[{"paragraph":14,"mentions":4,"tokens":["姬亮轩","亮轩"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一绺红线纬，虽不像个有钱的，或者倒是个老白相。」问了他们的姓，让他们坐了。你道这两人是谁？一个是乌大傻，一个是姬亮轩，他二人新在戏园里认识。这日都在街上闲走，适相遇了，跟了琴言到门口。亮轩恍惚记得这个门，想了一会想着了，就猜方才见的是琴言。后又想起奚十一的话，说前月在聘才处叫他陪过酒，无疑是他。便与大傻讲了，大傻见亮轩高兴，欲赞成他进去，好吃个镶边酒，便道：「管他","en":"game.\\" Wu Mazi asked their names and offered them seats. And who were these two? One was Wu Dasha, the other was Ji Liangxuan, two men newly acquainted at the theater. That day both had been idling about the streets when they happened upon each other, had followed Qinyan to the gate, and now had come in. Liangxuan had a vague sense that he recognized the gate, and after thinking"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":2,"tokens":["亮轩"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这边伍麻子正在张罗，却好天福、天寿散戏回来。见亮轩像是见过的，又记不清，请了安。那个大傻子，他们却见过他，在园子里听衬戏的，便也请了安。大傻子迷迷盹盹的说道：「今日兰保的《盗令》、《杀舟》，桂保的《相约》、《相骂》，实是个名人家数，他人做不来的。」亮轩道：「你们还认得我么？」天福道：「有些面善，想不","en":"arrangements when, conveniently, Tianfu and Tianshou returned from the day's performance. Tianshou thought he had seen Liangxuan somewhere before, though he could not quite remember where, and greeted him politely. As for Dasha, both boys had definitely seen him before as he was a regular audience member at the garden theater, and they greeted him as well. Dasha, in his vague"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":5,"tokens":["亮轩"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"亮轩道：「你的记性好，天福就不记得了。」天福听了也想起来，道：「哎哟！那一天好怕人。那位吃烟的好不利害，把桌子都打翻了，还直打到里头去。幸亏我躲得快，不然给他一脚，也踢个半死。」亮轩道：「可不是，亏我救了你们，你们感激我不感激呢？」天寿道：「那一位如今那","en":"Liangxuan said, \\"You have a good memory. Tianfu here does not remember at all.\\" Now that Tianfu heard it, he recalled it too. \\"Aiyo! What a frightening day that was. That opium-smoker was fearsome — he turned the table clean over and went on fighting all the way"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":3,"tokens":["亮轩"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"大傻子望着亮轩道：「你们既然是旧交，自然也应叙叙，断无空坐之理。」亮轩支吾道：「我还有点事。」天寿道：「你能没有事，你能不肯赏脸。」亮轩道：「真有事。」伍麻子道：「坐坐罢，就有事也不必忙。如今他的师父不在了，他师娘就靠着这两个孩子呢。」大傻道：「你也难得出来，我也","en":"Dasha looked at Liangxuan. \\"Since the two of you are old acquaintances, you must have a word together. There is no sense sitting here like this.\\" Liangxuan hedged, \\"I have something to see to.\\" Tianshou said, \\"You've nothing to see to. You just won't do us the honour.\\" Liangxuan"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":4,"tokens":["亮轩"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"少顷，亮轩要走，天福拖住了他，大傻却不动身。只见打杂的进来，在桌子上摆了几个碟子，天福道：「姬老爷请坐罢。」亮轩着急，对着大傻挤眉弄眼，要叫他走的意思。大傻装作不见，一手摸着那几根既稀且短的鼠须，拈了几拈。亮轩见他不动，只得独自想跑，说道：「我要小便。」天寿指","en":"Shortly afterward Liangxuan made to leave, but Tianfu held him back. Dasha, however, showed no sign of moving. Just then one of the servants came in and set a few dishes on the table, and Tianfu said, \\"Master Ji, do sit down.\\" Liangxuan was anxious; he made eyes at Dasha and jerked"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":2,"tokens":["亮轩"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"不料天寿在后，扯着他的发辫一迸，将亮轩的帽子落了下来，发根拉得很疼。天寿嘻嘻的笑，亮轩急回转头来，涨红了脸道：「这是什么顽法？」天寿拣了帽子，拍净了灰，与他戴上，拉了他进来。","en":"But he had not reckoned on Tianshou being right behind him. Tianshou gave his pigtail a sharp yank and Liangxuan's hat tumbled to the ground, leaving his scalp stinging from the sudden pull. Tianshou grinned playfully. Liangxuan wheeled around, his face flushed red, and demanded what kind of nonsense that was. Tianshou calmly picked up the hat, dusted it off, placed"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":4,"tokens":["亮轩"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"亮轩道：「我真有事，何苦缠我。」大傻子见了酒，喉咙已经发痒，劝亮轩道：「他们这般至诚留你，你就赏他们点脸罢。既摆了出来，不赏他们的脸，也叫他们下不去。」亮轩无法，又见大傻不肯走，反留住他，想是大傻要做这个东。如果大傻作东，也就放心了，只得勉强坐下。天福、","en":"Liangxuan pleaded that he really did have something to do, asking why they must torture him like this. Dasha, whose throat had been itching at the sight of the wine, urged Liangxuan that they were keeping him with such sincerity he should honor them a little."},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":2,"tokens":["亮轩"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"亮轩心上又想去看看琴言，此时已经点了灯，便对天福道：「你同我到你师兄屋子里去坐坐罢。」天福道：「你定要见他，待我先去讲一声。」天福进去，见琴言在那里看书，便说道：「外面有个姬老爷要见见你，见不见呢？」琴言道：「我见他作什么呢？你见我见过人吗？」天福没趣，","en":"Liangxuan was beginning to want a look at Qinyan. By now lamps had been lit, and he said to Tianfu, \\"Take me into your senior brother's room and let us sit there.\\" Tianfu said, \\"If you must see him, let me go and say a word first.\\"\\n\\nTianfu went in and found Qinyan"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":1,"tokens":["亮轩"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴言满脸怒容，未开言，大傻子深深一揖，亮轩也曲着腰作了半个揖，满面堆下笑来。琴言倒也无法，只得还了一揖，不好就走。他们也不待招呼就坐了。","en":"Qinyan's face was full of anger. He had not yet spoken when Dasha made a deep, sweeping bow, and Liangxuan bent forward in a half-bow, his face wreathed in eager smiles. Qinyan found he had no choice but to return their bow, as he could not very well walk away. Without waiting to be invited, they promptly sat down."},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":2,"tokens":["亮轩"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"亮轩瞇齐了鼠眼，掀唇露齿的要说话。大傻先说道：「怪道多天不见令师，原来归天了，我竟全然不知。非但没有具个薄分，连拜也没有为拜一拜。多年相好，从前承他一番相待，倒也不是寻常的交情。」又摇着头道：「荒唐，荒唐！不知那些联幛的公分，有我的名字没有？」亮轩笑容可","en":"Liangxuan narrowed his ratty eyes and drew back his lip to speak, but Dasha got in first. \\"No wonder I have not seen your honoured master these many days — so he has gone to heaven, and I knew nothing whatever about it. Not only did I send no small contribution,"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":3,"tokens":["亮轩"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"。大傻腹内既属欠通，眼光又系近视，倒最喜念对子看画，充那假斯文。琴言看了暗笑，略略看他们的相貌，已经生厌。又见亮轩嘻着嘴说道：「我那敝东，其实很好交的。你是不知道他的脾气，若混熟了，只怕还离不开呢。」大傻道：「不见那春兰么？」亮轩道：「春兰固然。本来钱也花多了，自应心悦诚服的了。我那英官呢，借去用两天，就用到如今不肯送还。这个小东西也恋着他，将我往日多少恩情付之","en":"man of culture. Qinyan saw the mistake and smiled inwardly; one look at their faces had already disgusted him.\\n\\nLiangxuan said with his simpering grin, \\"That patron of mine is really very easy to get on with. You do not know his temper yet. Once you were used to him, I dare say you would not want to be without him.\\" Dasha said, \\"What became of Chunlan, then?\\" Liangxuan"},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":7,"tokens":["亮轩"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"亮轩就想从此脱身，一径的走，又被福、寿二人拉住。桌上又添了四小碟小菜、两碗稀饭，亮轩心上想道：「这是什么吃局，一样可吃的菜也没有，难道八碟干果、四碟小菜、两碗白粥，就算请客不成？要不然，是傻子与他讲明，是要省钱的缘故。这个东，大约是傻子作定了，索性吃他娘","en":"Liangxuan now resolved to make his escape and headed directly for the door, but was caught again by Tianfu and Tianshou. Four more small side-dishes and two bowls of congee had been added to the table. Liangxuan thought to himself what kind of entertainment this"},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":3,"tokens":["亮轩"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"亮轩与福、寿二人说了一会话，问了些琴言光景。伍麻子来请吃饭，亮轩才找起大傻来，杳无影响，心中着忙，便变了神色，只管要找乌大傻。天寿说道：「他去了。这个人是坐不住的，我见他在戏园里，一天总要走个十几回，想必他就来的。我们先坐，不用等他了。」亮轩只得坐了。看","en":"Liangxuan chatted with the two boys for a while, asking about Qinyan's situation. Wu Mazi came in to announce that dinner was ready. Only then did Liangxuan start looking for Dasha. But Dasha had vanished without a trace, and Liangxuan's expression changed as"},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":7,"tokens":["亮轩"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"家里还是第一回开张留客，叫伍麻子好好照料，不要待慢了老斗，故常在窗前站立。那两个孩子本来不会说话，夹七夹八的。亮轩更坐不住，横竖迟早皆走，吃完了，嗽了口，对天福道：「今日扰了你们，我只好明日补情的了，今日却没有带钱。」天福听了，呆了一呆，不敢答应。还是天寿略灵些，说道：「老爷既没带钱，府上在那里住，叫人送老爷回府，就可以带了来。」亮轩道：「这也不必，我明日送来罢","en":"frequently. The two young boys, for their part, had no knack for conversation, and their talk came out all jumbled. Liangxuan grew more and more unable to sit still. Sooner or later he would have to go in any case, so when he had finished eating and rinsed his mouth he said to Tianfu, \\"I have put you to trouble today. I shall have to make it good tomorrow — I have brought no"},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":3,"tokens":["亮轩"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"你既没有带钱，难道不准你走，留你的东西做抵押不成？自然跟你回去。知道了一个地方，就歇一天给我们，也使得。」亮轩无言可答，再想说两句大话，又说不出来。那样鸡肋身材，木瓜脑袋，就装些威风，也吓不动人，只得说道：「我是省你们跟我走，你当是什么？你既不嫌路远，就跟我去领赏。」伍麻子想那些跟兔不中用，便自己提了灯笼照了。亮轩轻轻的脚步，左绕右绕，还想遁去。无奈伍麻子紧","en":"surety. Naturally we accompany you back. Once we know your address, even waiting a day to collect is acceptable.\\" Liangxuan had nothing to say in reply; he tried to think of another bluster but simply could not manage it. With that scrawny fishbone of a frame and that blockhead of his, whatever air of menace he tried to assume was not enough to frighten anyone. He had no"},{"paragraph":30,"mentions":4,"tokens":["亮轩"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"叫他取钱，也不知取了若干。一字到十字这几个，凭你怎样字写，他都认得。灯下一看见是两吊，便叫道：「姬老爷转来！」亮轩欲待不理他，已跟进了门，只得应道：「还有什么？」伍麻子道：「这两吊钱怎样，是赏我的么？那相公开发，酒席钱呢？」亮轩道：「我不晓得，一总在内。」伍麻子道：「姬爷不要顽笑，既然这么说，请收了。」便将票子递过来。亮轩无奈，只得又添上那一吊，说道：「尽在乎此","en":"however they were written, he knew every one. He held the notes under the lantern: two strings of cash. \\"Master Ji! Come back!\\"\\n\\nLiangxuan would have pretended not to hear, but Wu Mazi had already followed him through the door, and he had to answer. \\"What is it now?\\" Wu Mazi said, \\"What are these two strings? Are they a tip for me? And the young gentleman's fee,"},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":1,"tokens":["亮轩"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"想便宜了，既要乐又舍不得钱。你也算了，折了这一回本钱罢，不要在此啰唣，适或教我们老爷听见了，倒不好。」伍麻子见亮轩已进去了，又不好跟进去，再经那门公劝告他，知道是奚十一的寓处，恐怕闹出事来，只好转回，却也讲了好些淡话，匆匆回家交账。","en":"time, and not make a scene here, as if their master happened to hear, it could get quite awkward. Wu Mazi saw that Liangxuan had already gone inside and he could not very well go in after him. With the gatekeeper's persuasion, and realizing this was Xi Eleven's lodgings and that making trouble there could lead to worse trouble for himself, he had no choice but to turn back,"},{"paragraph":34,"mentions":2,"tokens":["亮轩"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"的，真他妈的可恶！」长庆媳妇叨叨了一回。到明日，伍麻子去照票子，谁知后来添的一吊还是张假的。又到奚十一寓处来找亮轩，倒被奚十一的家人骂了一顿。伍麻子受屈而回，只得自己赔上一吊钱，交清了账，唯有咒骂亮轩而已。","en":"only to discover that the one-string note added later was counterfeit. He went to Xi Eleven's lodgings to find Liangxuan, and was roundly abused by Xi Eleven's servant. Wu Mazi returned with his grievance unredressed, had to make up the difference from his own pocket to square the accounts, and could do nothing but curse Liangxuan."}],"43":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["姬亮轩"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说琴言是晚听姬亮轩、乌大傻说了多少瞎话，更加烦闷，幸他们就出去了。候到二更，不见宝珠、素兰过来，只得睡了。一夜无眠，到了次早，即叫小使去请他二人来。","en":"That evening, Qinyan endured a great deal of empty talk from Ji Liangxuan and Wu Dasha, leaving his spirit ever more clouded. Fortunately they soon took their leave. He waited until the second watch, yet seeing no sign of Baozhu or Sulan, he had little choice but to retire for the night in solitude. He lay restless through"}],"50":[{"paragraph":25,"mentions":1,"tokens":["姬亮轩"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"玉天仙吃了饭，谢了菊花要回，菊花送出来。到了二门，两人还是依依的拉着手，站住说话。姬亮轩在书房里听得清清楚楚，便剜破窗纸，闭着一眼，睁着一眼，从窗隙里望将出去。","en":"gate, the two women lingered, holding hands affectionately, reluctant to part, and stood there talking softly. Ji Liangxuan, who was sitting in the nearby study, heard their voices perfectly clearly. Unable to resist, he carefully pierced a tiny hole in the window paper, squinted one eye shut, opened the other wide, and eagerly peered out through the slit."},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":3,"tokens":["姬亮轩","亮轩"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"衫，内衬桃红衫，下是月白纱裤，穿着厚底堆绒蝴蝶鞋。两鬓堆鸦，高鬟滴翠，脸上微带几点俏麻，美目含情，春容满面。把姬亮轩看得筋酥骨软，口内流涎。谁料这个窗纸还是旧年糊的，风吹日晒，也脆极了。亮轩只顾偷看，把个额角靠在纸上，拍的一响，裂破了一块。玉天仙回头见窗内有人偷看他们，玉天仙也就走了出去。菊花送出二门，看上了车，转身回来，抬头望见亮轩的窗纸破处，他尚在里面偷看。欲","en":"eyes swam with tender feeling, and her face glowed with the radiance of spring. The sight of the two women left Ji Liangxuan utterly mesmerized—his bones turned to jelly, his muscles melted, and drool fairly pooled in his mouth. But alas, the window paper was left over from the previous year; baked by the sun and battered by the wind, it had grown incredibly brittle. So entirely"}],"58":[{"paragraph":7,"mentions":1,"tokens":["姬亮轩"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"到了明日，早饭后，奚十一即拉了姬亮轩，坐了车，巴英官骑了马，到了九香楼。奚十一下了车，见是大门里面竖着一块屏风，两旁放着金字招牌，一块是收买秦汉唐宋古玩书画，一块是发卖苏杭花绣衣料，一切洋货俱全，还有一块是内看金珠宝玉、四时花卉。此时那九个名旦均已出班，内有未满师者，也是宝珠、蕙芳共同","en":"The next morning after breakfast, Xi Eleven pulled Ji Liangxuan into a carriage, while Ba Yingguan rode horseback, and they reached Nine-Fragrance Tower. Xi stepped down to find a screen inside the main gate and gilt-lettered boards on either side. One was for buying Qin, Han, Tang, and Song antiquities, calligraphy,"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":2,"tokens":["姬亮轩","亮轩"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"奚十一、姬亮轩走进了大门，见门房两人站起招呼，一个便引他们进了二门。见上面是五间正屋，两边厢房。到了那东厢，便有个伙计出来招接，衣冠楚楚，相貌文雅，五十余岁年纪，请他们坐了，问了姓名，即有人送上茶来。奚十一四下张望，并不见班里一个，便问那人道：「这班掌柜的都不住在","en":"Xi Eleven and Ji Liangxuan entered the gate. Two gatemen stood to greet them, and one led them through the second gate. Above were five main bays with wings on either side. In the east wing a clerk came out to receive them. His hat and gown were neat, his face refined, and he"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":1,"tokens":["姬亮轩"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"姬亮轩一看是乌大傻子，乌大傻作了揖，请二人坐了。","en":"Ji Liangxuan saw that it was Big Fool Wu. Wu made a bow and asked them to sit."},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":1,"tokens":["姬亮轩"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"奚十一道：「你在这里掌柜么？」大傻笑道：「闲着没有事，他们要我过来帮同照料。」姬亮轩从前打茶围上了大傻的当，后来已经说明，大傻倒说得好，我回去取钱来，你又走了。","en":"Eleven asked, \\"Do you mind the shop here?\\" Big Fool smiled, \\"I have idle hands, so they asked me to help watch.\\" Ji Liangxuan had once been cheated by Big Fool at a tea-house visit. That misunderstanding was cleared up later, and Big Fool had said fairly that he went home for money and Ji had left."},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":2,"tokens":["亮轩","姬亮轩"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"又说他那日晚上，还给了他们十几吊钱，亮轩似信不信的。后来伍麻子即跟了长庆的媳妇回扬州去了，此话绝无对证。三人讲了些闲话，奚十一便问大傻子，那些相公在什么地方。大傻道：「今日就只王兰官、苏蕙芳在家，其余都出门去了。」奚十一道：「我要看看花，你同我们去。」大傻便领了奚、姬二人，从东边进了一重门","en":"He also claimed he had given them over a dozen strings of cash that night, which Ji half believed. Later Wu the Pockmark had followed Changqing's widow back to Yangzhou, so the story could not be checked. The three chatted, and Xi Eleven asked Big Fool where the actors were. Big Fool replied, \\"Today only Wang Lanbao and Su Huifang are"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":3,"tokens":["亮轩"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，我做个小东，请你二人来坐坐。你们也就要出京了，到广西去要见这样脑袋是没有的。那里的班子尽是些湖南、贵州人。」亮轩道：「其实有两个在家，也可叫一个过来陪陪。」大傻不言语。奚十一烟瘾来了，见这楼下头铺设得甚好，想开灯吃烟，就可等他们回来。烟枪是带着的，就少盏灯，问大傻道：「你去点一个灯来，我要吃两口。」大傻想了一想，道：「这件东西只怕没有。」便蹋到扎花匠处，借了一","en":"capital soon, and in Guangxi you'll find no heads like these. The troupes there are all Hunan and Guizhou men.\\" Liangxuan added, \\"If two had been home, we might have called one to drink with us.\\" Big Fool said nothing. Xi's opium craving struck, and since the downstairs was well fitted, he figured he could smoke and wait for their return. He had brought his pipe but lacked"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":1,"tokens":["亮轩"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"」就听得大闹起来，有个小孩子声音乱骂乱嚷的。大傻子走了出去。奚十一懒的起身，但听得像巴英官的声音与人嚷闹，便叫亮轩出去看看。见一丛人围着，走上前，见英官揪住了一个人，那人把马鞭子打了他几下，英官号啕哭骂道：「你骂我兔崽子，你是驴崽子！将老婆的众去讹钱，讹到了手，如今要充二爷了。」","en":"Fool went out to investigate. Xi was too lazy to rise but thought it sounded like Ba Yingguan quarreling and told Liangxuan to look. A crowd had gathered. Yingguan had seized someone who had struck him with a whip. Yingguan howled, \\"You call me rabbit, but you're a donkey colt! You sold your wife's cunt to swindle money, and now you play lord second!\\""},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":2,"tokens":["亮轩","姬亮轩"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"骂得那人气极了，又打了他几下。乌大傻连声劝解，亮轩也上前说道：「他是个孩子，你怎么动手就打？」那人道：「他先来揪住了我，要打我。我们才买了两盆金橘，两盆佛手，要抬回去，被他摘得干干净净，气人不气人？问问他，他开口就骂人。」那边蕙芳、兰保都出来看，却不认得英官，也不认得姬亮轩。","en":"The man, furious, hit him again. Big Fool urged peace, and Liangxuan stepped up, \\"He's a child, why strike him?\\" The man defended himself, \\"He grabbed me first to fight. We just bought two pots of kumquats and two of Buddha's-hand to carry home, and he stripped them bare. Is it maddening or not? Ask him, he cursed first.\\""},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":1,"tokens":["亮轩"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，怎么无缘无故的就打起人来？」蕙芳一看，认的是奚十一，便拉了兰保进去了。奚十一大怒，他也不管有客，便闯过桥去，亮轩跟着。大傻子一想这事情有些不好，便把灯收了，自己躲起来，免得带累他受气。奚十一走到屋子里，见残肴满桌，不见一人，明知他们躲了，心中更怒，拍着桌子嚷道：「走个人出来！」不见答应，奚十一又拍桌子骂道：「好大的相公，见了人都不理么？虽然出了班子，总是小旦。","en":"recognized Xi Eleven, pulled Lanbao, and went inside. Xi raged. Ignoring the guests, he charged across the bridge, with Liangxuan following. Big Fool thought this could turn ugly, so he put the lamp away and hid to avoid blame. Xi entered a room of half-finished dishes and empty seats. He knew they were hiding and raged even more, pounding the table and shouting, \\"Someone come"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":1,"tokens":["亮轩"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"打了他也不要紧。」奚十一大怒，即将桌子一掀，碗盏砸了好些，大骂起来，里头也大骂。奚十一如何能忍，要赶进去打架，亮轩却劝住，只见蕙芳、兰保出来，对奚十一点点头，道：「尊驾为什么发气，到小店来照顾什么？敢是敝伙计们得罪了。」奚十一听了，火上添油，圆睁两眼，大喝道：「你别支起那屁架子，我照顾你？我要带你到安吉堂吃饭，还要留你过夜呢。」","en":"dishes, and cursed. Curses answered from within. He could not endure it and would have rushed in to fight, but Liangxuan restrained him. Huifang and Lanbao emerged, nodded to Xi, and asked, \\"Why the anger, sir? What business brings you to our humble shop? Did our people offend you?\\" Xi felt like oil was poured on fire, his eyes rounded, and he roared, \\"Drop that pose!"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":1,"tokens":["姬亮轩"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"保忍不住笑，叫园丁扶他出去。奚十一想要不依他们，无奈阳物已伤，适或再受了磕碰就不好了，嘴里骂了几句，也就出来。姬亮轩见奚十一不闹，自然更不敢闹，重到了九香楼下，英官收拾了烟枪，奚十一坐了一会，也就不大疼了。心中忿恨，来到外边，乌大傻躲得不见影儿，奚十一只得上车而回。","en":"him out. Xi wanted to make trouble but feared further injury to his member, so he cursed a few lines and left. Ji Liangxuan, seeing Xi quiet, dared not stir either. Back at Nine-Fragrance Tower, Yingguan packed the pipe. Xi sat until the worst pain passed, bitter at heart. Outside, Big Fool had vanished without a trace, leaving Xi no choice but to climb into his carriage"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":2,"tokens":["姬亮轩","亮轩"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"得一身透汗，也顾不得病，穿上衣裳，着了裤子，袜子也穿不及，趿上鞋，把衣衿掩好，只扣了外面钮子，直跌直晃的出来。姬亮轩也睡了，听得闹便也赶出来，穿上袜子，披上长衣，竟忘记穿裤子，慌慌张张赶到书房里，正与菊花撞个满怀，也不及回避，乱嘈嘈的闹在一块。菊花见奚十一如此光景，便哭起来。亮轩心慌，便仔细看了奚十一尚有点气，便说：「不妨，姨奶奶且慢哭，我想老爷这个头原是接上的，","en":"jacket and trousers, could not wait for socks, slipped into shoes, buttoned her outer coat only, and stumbled out. Ji Liangxuan was asleep but heard the noise, pulled on socks and a long robe, forgot his trousers, rushed to the study, and collided with Juhua, too frantic to mind decency. Seeing Xi's state, Juhua wept. Ji panicked, saw Xi still faintly breathing, and said, \\"Wait,"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":6,"tokens":["亮轩"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"那个医生还不见来，这边亮轩看见英官这个模样，也十分心疼，便细细的照料他一会，叫人烧了一盆热水，拿块布泡热了，与他揉，揉了一会，英官也醒转来。亮轩把蜡灯放在旁边，揉了一会，恐怕水溅了袍子，便将前衿提起些。此时心里痛苦，再想不起自己没有穿裤子。菊花坐在炕上，亮轩蹲在地下，却是对面","en":"The doctor did not come. Ji Liangxuan saw Yingguan's state and pitied him too. He tended him, ordered hot water, soaked a cloth, and pressed it until Yingguan woke. Ji set a candle nearby. Fearing a splash on his robe, he lifted his front hem, too distraught to recall he wore no trousers."},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":1,"tokens":["亮轩"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"少顷医生来，亮轩又同进来。那医生先将灯照一照，然后诊了脉，菊花远远的坐着。那医生道：「今番难治了，这个除非神仙才能。」菊花求道：「先生，你行个方便，医好了我们老爷，你要多少谢仪，我一毫也不少你的。」那医生道：「奶奶，医生有割股之心，最肯行方便的，倒是奶奶你不肯行方便","en":"Soon the doctor arrived, and Ji came in with him. He held the lamp to look, then felt the pulse while Juhua sat at a distance. The doctor said, \\"This time it's grave. Only a god could cure it.\\" Juhua begged, \\"Sir, please save our master. Whatever fee you ask I will pay.\\" The doctor"},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":2,"tokens":["亮轩"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"了，说话所以没有留心。如今尽我的心，谢仪不谢仪，我倒也不计论。但要说明，我只能救他这条命，不能再接那条卵子。」亮轩道：「先生说话文气些，奶奶在这里。」那医生道：「我这行业就不文气，说话焉能文气？天天的把那卵放在手里盘弄，觉得这个字顺口得很，没有忌讳了。」便又说道：「杀只鸡来，要一块活鸡皮。」菊花即叫人割了一块活鸡皮来。那阳善修拿些药和鸡皮捣烂了，与他洗净了血，敷","en":"hasty. I'll do my utmost. Fee or no, I don't care, but I must say I can save his life, not reattach that egg.\\" Ji said, \\"Refined speech, sir, madam is present.\\" The doctor defended himself, \\"My trade isn't refined, how should speech be? Daily I handle that part in my hands, so the word rolls off the tongue, with no taboo.\\" He added, \\"Kill a chicken, and bring a"},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":1,"tokens":["姬亮轩"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"守，这也不能查他。外面确做出那从良极正派的样子来，以博虚名。菊花恨极英官，等他脏头好了，痛打了一顿，撵他出去。姬亮轩馆地要紧，也只可忍心割爱。","en":"respectability to win a name. She hated Yingguan bitterly. When his wound healed she beat him soundly and drove him out. Ji Liangxuan needed his tutoring post and could only swallow the loss."}]}`),"char-145":{16:[{paragraph:18,mentions:3,tokens:["张笑梅","笑梅"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"引路小厮交代了园中的人，就不进去了。那边又有人来接引。进了斑竹花篱，是一所厅，两进共有十间，还有些厢房。此中是张笑梅、顾月卿画画之处。顾、张二位出来相见，知道聘才是富三爷新荐来的，便陪着聚谈。聘才见那张笑梅，倒也生得俊俏，是杭州人，年纪二十上下，是画工笔人物的，就是吹竹弹丝也还来得。顾月卿是苏州人，比笑梅略长两岁，亦颇俊秀，是画山水花草的。那边还有个书启先生叫王卿",en:"They were led through a mottled bamboo fence to a hall of ten rooms, flanked by side chambers. This was where Zhang Xiaomei and Gu Yueqing practiced their painting. The two men came out to greet them, knowing Pincai was the new arrival recommended by Third Master Fu, and sat down to converse. Pincai noted Zhang Xiaomei's handsome features; a young man of twenty from Hangzhou,"},{paragraph:19,mentions:1,tokens:["张笑梅"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"们舅太爷，还要面托的。」又对聘才道：「咱们到里头屋子，瞧瞧住那一间？」又同聘才到了里头一进，也是五间，东边两间张笑梅做房，聘才就在西边两间下榻，中间空了一间为会客之地。富三即叫将行李搬进，叫小厮们铺设好了。",en:'inside and see which room you will take." They moved to the inner courtyard, which also consisted of five rooms. Zhang Xiaomei occupied the two eastern rooms, while Pincai was assigned the two on the west, leaving the central room open for receiving guests. Fu the Third immediately ordered the pages to bring in the luggage and arrange the furnishings.'}],18:[{paragraph:6,mentions:1,tokens:["张笑梅"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"酬，就有人说起闲话来。虽止一月之间，府里这些闲杂人，倒也混熟了，也有与聘才合式的，也有不对的。合式的是顾月卿、张笑梅诸人；不对的是阎简安、王卿云诸人。聘才也只好各人安分，合式的便往来密些，不对的便疏远些。惟郁郁不乐者，尚未见过华公子一面。而且一无所事，不过天天与众人厮混，正是「两餐老米饭，一枕黑甜乡」而已。",en:"hangers-on of the household. Some proved congenial, while others did not. The congenial ones included Gu Yueqing, Zhang Xiaomei, and their sort, whereas the uncongenial ones were men like Yan Jian'an and Wang Qingyun. Pincai could only attend to his own station, keeping close to the congenial ones while distancing himself from the uncongenial. But what truly vexed him was that"}],19:[{paragraph:4,mentions:2,tokens:["张笑梅","笑梅"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"一日，打听华公子出门去了，聘才约了张笑梅出城。笑梅要找冯子佩，二人同车即到冯子佩家来。这子佩是与华公子最熟的，已与聘才见过，彼此合式。冯子佩也是个宦家子弟，只因早丧严亲，又积些宦囊，其母钟爱，任凭他游荡歌场，结交豪贵，后来家业渐渐萧条。又亏了几个好友帮扶，所以觉得银钱应手，服御鲜华，其一种",en:"One day, having learned that the young master had gone out, Pincai invited Zhang Xiaomei to come out of the city. Xiaomei wanted to find Feng Zipei, so the two shared a carriage straight to Feng Zipei's house. This Zipei was the most familiar with Young Master Hua; he had already met Pincai, and the two hit it off well. Feng Zipei was also"},{paragraph:5,mentions:5,tokens:["笑梅","张笑梅"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"设倒也华丽，就觉得满桌子东西，残书、笔、砚、玩器等物颠颠倒倒乱杂无章。壁间挂些箫管、琵琶，又有刀箭等物。聘才对笑梅说道：「小冯这么一个样儿，怎么屋子里东西，也不检点检点。」笑梅笑道：「他未必有检点的工夫，世间人最没有他忙的。」说着子佩走将出来，此时四月尽天气，一身罗绮，愈显得袅娜多姿。未出屏门，先就是一个笑声出来，嚷道：「你们来做什么，可是来给二太爷请安的吗？」",en:`Hanging on the walls were flutes, pipes, and pipas, as well as swords, arrows, and similar items. Pincai said to Xiaomei: "Little Feng has such a fine appearance, why doesn't he tidy up the things in his room a bit?" Xiaomei laughed: "He probably doesn't have the time to tidy up; there is no one in the world busier than he is." As they were speaking, Zipei came out. It`},{paragraph:7,mentions:1,tokens:["笑梅"],kind:"named-mention",zh:`的，更为热闹了，大家说些无非是游戏欢乐的话。四人商议道：「难道今日说些闲话，就算了事不成，可不辜负了韶光么？」笑梅道：「我们是打算听戏的。」冯子佩道：「呸！乡里人进城不认得明角灯，当是猪溺泡。
今日是忌辰，还想听戏呢。」杨梅窗道：「今日果然是忌辰，咱们做什么，上馆子去罢。」三人都也高兴，子佩又进去换了衣裳，即同步行出门，到了一个酒楼。`,en:`we can't just sit here chatting today and call it done; wouldn't that be a waste of this beautiful spring day?" Xiaomei said: "We had planned to listen to some opera." Feng Zipei said: "Bah! Country bumpkins coming to the city don't recognize a bright horn lantern, they think it's a pig's bladder. Today is a memorial anniversary, and you still want to listen to opera?"`},{paragraph:8,mentions:2,tokens:["笑梅"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"。」聘才心内想道：「如今我在华府，他们也应该知道了，自然看我不比从前，就去叫他，如若不来，再叫别个。」梅窗又问笑梅道：「叫谁？」笑梅道：",en:`treat me the same as before. I'll call him, and if he doesn't come, I'll call someone else." Meichuang then asked Xiaomei: "Who will you call?" Xiaomei said:`},{paragraph:10,mentions:1,tokens:["笑梅"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"才原料琴官不来的，只好罢了。倒是杨梅窗心上不快，说道：「怎么叫三个人，倒有两个不来？不知是真病呢，还是推托的？笑梅道：「自然是真病，推托什么。」聘才道：「还有个琪官也是很好的，我正月里叫过他几回，倒是全来的。」聘才又写了条子去叫琪官，梅窗另叫了二喜。走堂的道：「琪官打发人去叫了。二喜在那边陪客已经吃过饭，就散了。」",en:'is it that of three people called, two are not coming? I wonder if they are truly ill, or just making excuses?" Xiaomei said: "Naturally they are truly ill; what is there to make excuses about?" Pincai said: "There is also Qiguan, who is very good; I called him a few times in the first month, and he always came." Pincai then wrote a slip to call Qiguan, and Meichuang'},{paragraph:11,mentions:2,tokens:["张笑梅","笑梅"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"了，这些朋友是不大往来的了。」二喜道：「你在城里什么地方？」聘才道：「华公府。」二喜道：「哎呀！华公府。」又问张笑梅住处，笑梅道：「我同他在一个宅子里。」二喜道：「听得华公府里，天天唱戏，他府里有班子？」聘才道：「有几班呢。」二喜就到各人面前劝酒，猜拳吃皮杯的，无所不至。",en:'you?" Pincai said: "The Hua Ducal Mansion." Erxi exclaimed: "Good heavens! The Hua Mansion." He then asked where Zhang Xiaomei lived, and Xiaomei replied: "I live with him in the same residence." Erxi said: "I hear there is opera singing every day in the Hua Mansion; does the mansion have its own troupe?" Pincai said: "Several troupes, in fact." Erxi then went around to each'},{paragraph:12,mentions:2,tokens:["笑梅"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"闹了一阵，只不见蓉官、琪官到来。笑梅道：「奇了，今日是忌辰，倒叫不出相公来。」二喜道：「还有那个？」笑梅道：「你们班里的琪官，还有联珠的蓉官。」二喜道：「蓉官，我出门时见他到三合楼去的，只怕还没有散。」梅窗道：「那玉林是你们同班的，他真有病吗？」二喜道：「玉林阿！不要说起，他同琪官前日",en:`They had been making merry for a while when still neither Rongguan nor Qiguan had arrived. Xiaomei said: "How strange. Today is a memorial anniversary, yet we can't even call out any young protégés." Erxi said: "Who else is there?" Xiaomei said: "Qiguan from your troupe, and Rongguan from Lianzhu." Erxi said: "As for Rongguan, when I left the house`},{paragraph:15,mentions:1,tokens:["笑梅"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"：「你这么恨他，莫非看过他的宝贝桶子么？」子佩把梅窗啐了两口。梅窗道：「他这个桶子，咱们京里不知会做不会做？」笑梅笑道：「你也要学样子么？」梅窗笑了一笑。聘才笑对二喜道：「你讲得这么清楚，这桶子你想必看过的了。」二喜脸上一红，便斜睃了一眼，就要拧聘才的嘴。梅窗道：「他未必要用着桶子。」二喜又将梅窗拧了两把，说道：「咱们作买卖的人，有钱就好，何必那样拿身分呢。可惜",en:`Zipei spat at Meichuang twice. Meichuang said: "Can they make that kind of barrel here in the capital, or not?" Xiaomei laughed: "Are you thinking of copying the design?" Meichuang gave a little laugh. Pincai laughed and said to Erxi: "You've described it so clearly, you must have had a look at the barrel yourself." Erxi's face reddened, and with a sideways glance he`},{paragraph:16,mentions:1,tokens:["笑梅"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"亲现做提督呢。」聘才道：「如今春兰呢？」二喜道：「同出去了。」于是大家又谈谈笑笑，又喝了一回酒。看看天气将晚，笑梅、聘才皆要进城，只得算了账。梅窗又与二喜说定，明日开发。梅窗让聘才等一同进城，他却住在城外，又到子佩处，两个同吃了一回烟，拉了子佩，到胭脂巷玉天仙家去了。",en:'with him." The group then talked and joked some more, drank another round. Seeing that the day was growing late, Xiaomei and Pincai both needed to return to the city and settled the bill. Meichuang arranged with Erxi to settle the payment the next day. Meichuang declined to accompany Pincai and the others into the city; since he lived outside the city, he went back to'}],21:[{paragraph:1,mentions:1,tokens:["张笑梅"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"上下下皆用心周旋的十分很好，又因华公子待他有些颜面，银钱又宽展起来，便有些小人得志，就不肯安分了。内有顾月卿、张笑梅，外有杨梅窗、冯子佩一班人朝欢暮乐，所见所闻，无非势力钻营等事，是以渐渐心肥胆大。从前在梅宅有士燮学士在家，虽不来管教他，自然畏惧的。而且子玉所结交的，都是些公子名士，没有那些游荡之人。譬如马困槽枥之中，虽欲泛驾也就不能。此时是任凭所欲，无所忌惮。",en:"thereupon he began to show the petty man's triumph and would no longer keep his place. Within were Gu Yueqing and Zhang Xiaomei; outside Yang Meichuang, Feng Zipei, and such company — nightly revelry — and whatever he saw and heard ran to schemes of influence and trimming to power; his heart grew fat and his daring swelled. Formerly at the Mei residence Academician Mei had been"}],33:[{paragraph:20,mentions:1,tokens:["张笑梅"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"谁知候了两日，不见一个人来，就是平时常见的顾月卿、张笑梅也不过来。再思量了半夜，才定了主意，次早写了一封谢札，先说些感激的话，后说梅宅有事，现要请其回去照料家务，情面难却，只得暂去，俟开春再来。写完，自己到门房里告诉了门上，将书信给他传进。约有半个时辰，见门上进来道：「方才的字，公子已看，说回梅宅去的很是",en:"However, after waiting two days, no one came, not even the usual acquaintances Gu Yueqing and Zhang Xiaomei. After pondering for half the night, he finally made up his mind. Early the next morning, he wrote a letter of thanks: first expressing his gratitude, then stating that there were matters at the Mei residence requiring him to return and manage the household"}],47:[{paragraph:9,mentions:2,tokens:["笑梅","张笑梅"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"唐和尚拍手笑道：「巧极，巧极！怎么没有？方才一个杨八爷，叫梅窗，一个张师爷，叫笑梅，是魏大爷的相好，常到这里来，我也与他相好。他们二人在间壁吃饭，我送烟过去，与他们讲了半天。那张笑梅有个亲戚是苏州人，专门行这一道，替人配眼珠子，配鼻子，配牙，这却都是假的。惟有接那样东西，说先上了麻药，将他一劈四瓣，把狗肾嵌进，用药敷好，再将药线缠",en:'"Perfect, perfect! Of course there is! Just now a Master Yang the Eighth, named Meichuang, and a Master Zhang, named Xiaomei—an intimate of Master Wei—were eating next door. I often see them here, and we are well acquainted. I took them some opium and we talked a long while. Master Zhang Xiaomei has a relative from Suzhou who specializes in this very art. He fits people with'}],50:[{paragraph:22,mentions:1,tokens:["张笑梅"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"他两个舅子下通州赴考去了，只好认了晦气。到出京那几日，一起一起的饯行，潘其观、奚十一、张仲雨、冯子佩、杨梅窗、张笑梅、顾月卿、唐和尚等轮流作饯，唐和尚的庄子好不热闹，聘才又辞了几天行。",en:"farewell banquets were thrown one after another. Pan Qiguan, Xi Eleven, Zhang Zhongyu, Feng Zipei, Yang Meichuang, Zhang Xiaomei, Gu Yueqing, Monk Tang, and others took turns hosting him. Tang's establishment was exceptionally lively, and Pincai ended up postponing his departure for several more days."}]},"char-146":JSON.parse(`{"16":[{"paragraph":5,"mentions":1,"tokens":["梅窗"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"」贵大爷道：「这位阎简安先生，是华府中的师爷。那一位是精于地理的，又是富三哥的干兄弟，就在东胡衕那大宅子里，号梅窗，行八。」说罢，小厮移了一张凳子，就放在富三上首，大家坐了。富三道：「你好呵！你在城外天天的乐，你也不来瞧瞧哥哥。你知道哥哥惦记你，你就不惦记我。我找你两三回，你躲着不出来，你天天儿瞧戏，好乐阿！」聘才笑道：「那里的话。那一天不想着三爷。因我老伯到江","en":"and Third Brother Fu's sworn brother. He lives in that large residence in Donghu Lane, goes by the literary name Meichuang, and is the eighth in his family.\\" With that, a servant brought over a stool and placed it beside Third Master Fu, allowing everyone to sit. The Third Master said, \\"Look at you! Every day you're out of the city enjoying yourself, yet you never come to"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":3,"tokens":["杨老八","梅窗","杨梅窗"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「怎么不认得？他们茔地的树，还是我种的呢。」贵大爷道：「这杨老八的风水是高明的，我们内城多半是请他瞧的。」聘才便又拉拢起来，只有那个阎简安是冷冰冰的，只与富、贵两人讲话。富三爷道：「歇了罢，这牌打得闷人，就是我输了，算账罢。」阎简安便道：「怎么就歇？方才打了两转。」梅窗道：「算了，不用来了。」于是，大家起身散坐，","en":"\\"How could I not be? I planted the trees on their ancestral burial ground myself.\\" Lord Gui put in, \\"Old Yang the Eighth's geomancy is outstanding; most families in the inner city ask him to assess their properties.\\" Pincai engaged him further, though Yan Jian'an sat coldly aside, speaking only with Fu and Gui. Third Master Fu complained, \\"Let's stop here. This card game"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":2,"tokens":["杨梅窗","杨老八"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这个阎简安，是个半生半熟的老篾片，却与华公有旧，嫌其心窄嘴臭，脾气古怪，所以叫他在府里住着。华公子是更不对的。杨梅窗是个土篾片，但知势利，毫无所能。又是个里八府的人，怯头怯脑。因与富三爷是干兄弟，又拉拢了些半生半熟的阔老，仗着看风水为名，胡吹乱讲的一味贪财，或与地主勾通，或与花儿匠工头连手，赚下人的钱，也捐了个从九候选，至于堪舆之学，实在不懂。是日谈次，倒与聘才合","en":"language, and peculiar temper, allowing him to stay in the household. Young Master Hua found him even more difficult. Yang Meichuang, on the other hand, was a thoroughly unrefined social parasite who recognized only power and profit, possessing no genuine ability. Hailing from the inner provinces, he was timid and apprehensive. Relying on his sworn brotherhood with Fu the Third, he"}],"19":[{"paragraph":7,"mentions":2,"tokens":["杨梅窗"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"道：「没有在家。」聘才听得声音很熟，只见一个直闯进来，道：「好阿！你在洞里头，还答应不在家。」众人一看，原来是杨梅窗，皆是熟识的，更为热闹了，大家说些无非是游戏欢乐的话。四人商议道：「难道今日说些闲话，就算了事不成，可不辜负了韶光么？」笑梅道：「我们是打算听戏的。」冯子佩道：「呸！乡里人进城不认得明角灯，当是猪溺泡。\\n今日是忌辰，还想听戏呢。」杨梅窗道：「今日果然","en":"\\"Well, well! You're hiding in your cave and yet you answer that you're not at home.\\" They all looked and saw it was Yang Meichuang; everyone was well-acquainted, making it even livelier, and their conversation was entirely filled with talk of games and merriment. The four of them discussed matters: \\"Surely we can't just sit here chatting today and call it done; wouldn't that be"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":6,"tokens":["杨八爷","梅窗"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"走堂的见是四个少年，且认得杨、冯二人，便觉高兴，知道今日热闹的。杨八爷道：「吃什么？」冯子佩对着走堂的道：「你报上来。」走堂的一一报了数十样，四人就点了五六样，先吃起来再说。走堂的先烫上四壶黄酒，一桌果碟儿，遂一样一样摆上来。四人饮了一回，又说些笑话，梅窗道：「咱们就这么算了，叫走堂的也瞧不起，叫个人罢。」聘才是最高兴","en":"waiters, seeing four young men and recognizing Yang and Feng, perked up immediately and knew today would be lively. Master Yang the Eighth said: \\"What shall we eat?\\" Feng Zipei turned to the waiter and said: \\"Recite the menu for us.\\" The waiter recited dozens of dishes one by one, and the four of them ordered five or six items, deciding to start eating first and see about the rest later."},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":5,"tokens":["梅窗"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「我叫蓉官罢。」又问子佩，子佩道：「叫了三人，也就热闹。我不叫，我算吃镶边酒罢。」梅窗笑道：「你自己算了相公罢。「子佩听了，含了一口酒，望着梅窗劈面喷来，梅窗一闪，身上却洒了好些。梅窗道：「何必一句话如此着急，必定说着了你的真病。」大家一笑。就将衫子脱下要些烧酒喷了，放在檐下栏杆上晾了，便又笑道：「可惜这口酒糟蹋了，你何不吐在我口里？","en":"already summoned, that's quite lively enough. I won't call anyone; I'll just drink the 'border-trimming wine.'\\" Meichuang laughed: \\"You might as well be the young protégé yourself.\\" Hearing this, Zipei held a mouthful of wine and sprayed it straight at Meichuang's face. Meichuang dodged, but a good deal of it splashed onto his clothes. Meichuang said: \\"Why get so frantic"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":2,"tokens":["杨梅窗","梅窗"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"只见那走堂的进来道：「琴官、玉林都说病着不能来，蓉官就来。」聘才原料琴官不来的，只好罢了。倒是杨梅窗心上不快，说道：「怎么叫三个人，倒有两个不来？不知是真病呢，还是推托的？笑梅道：「自然是真病，推托什么。」聘才道：「还有个琪官也是很好的，我正月里叫过他几回，倒是全来的。」聘才又写了条子去叫琪官，梅窗另叫了二喜。走堂的道：「琪官打发人去叫了。二喜在那","en":"can't come; Rongguan is coming.\\" Pincai had originally expected Qinguan wouldn't come, so he simply let it be. But Yang Meichuang was displeased in his heart and said: \\"How is it that of three people called, two are not coming? I wonder if they are truly ill, or just making excuses?\\" Xiaomei said: \\"Naturally they are truly ill; what is there to make excuses about?\\" Pincai said:"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":2,"tokens":["梅窗"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"走堂的知会了二喜，不多一刻，二喜就过来，对各人请过安，就在梅窗肩下坐了。斟了一巡酒，送了一巡菜，便问道：「今日席间还叫谁？」梅窗道：「叫的都是有病的，不能来。」聘才见了二喜，便不大欢喜，因正月里吃了他多少刻薄话。二喜倒不记在心，且那日开发，聘才明日即已送去，没有漂他的，所以二喜还看得起，遂问聘才道：「从前那一位","en":"The waiter informed Erxi; before long, Erxi came over, greeted everyone in turn, and sat down beside Meichuang. After pouring a round of wine and presenting a round of food, he asked: \\"Who else is called to the table today?\\" Meichuang said: \\"The ones called are all ill and cannot come.\\" Pincai was not very pleased to see Erxi, because in the first month he had"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":2,"tokens":["梅窗"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"那个？」笑梅道：「你们班里的琪官，还有联珠的蓉官。」二喜道：「蓉官，我出门时见他到三合楼去的，只怕还没有散。」梅窗道：「那玉林是你们同班的，他真有病吗？」二喜道：「玉林阿！不要说起，他同琪官前日都闹了一件事，几乎闹出人命来。他们的师傅，此刻还不依，要去告那个人。琪官今日也不能来的。」于是大家问起什么事，二喜道：「说来话长，且喝两钟再说。」众人又干了几杯。聘才听说","en":"Rongguan, when I left the house I saw him going to the Sanhe Restaurant; I expect they haven't broken up yet.\\" Meichuang said: \\"That Yulin is in your troupe too — is he truly ill?\\" Erxi said: \\"Ah, Yulin! Don't even mention it. He and Qiguan both got involved in an incident the day before yesterday, nearly resulting in a loss of life. Their teacher still refuses to let"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":1,"tokens":["杨梅窗"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"去。」说到此，张、魏二人就大乐起来，说：「该！该！这样东西必有天报。酒又换了，我们共贺一杯。」冯子佩也不言语，杨梅窗道：","en":"must have its heaven-sent retribution. More wine; let's all raise a cup to celebrate.\\" Feng Zipei said nothing; Yang Meichuang said:"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":6,"tokens":["梅窗"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"称奇。冯子佩道：「这个狗鸡巴蛋的，实在可恨，他不管什么人，当着年轻貌美的，总可以顽得的，他也不瞧自己的样儿。」梅窗笑道：「你这么恨他，莫非看过他的宝贝桶子么？」子佩把梅窗啐了两口。梅窗道：「他这个桶子，咱们京里不知会做不会做？」笑梅笑道：「你也要学样子么？」梅窗笑了一笑。聘才笑对二喜道：「你讲得这么清楚，这桶子你想必看过的了。」二喜脸上一红，便斜睃了一眼，就要拧","en":"is; if he sees a young good-looking person he thinks they're fair game. And he doesn't even look at himself.\\" Meichuang laughed: \\"You're so indignant. Can it be that you've already had a look at his precious barrel?\\" Zipei spat at Meichuang twice. Meichuang said: \\"Can they make that kind of barrel here in the capital, or not?\\" Xiaomei laughed: \\"Are you thinking of copying"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":2,"tokens":["梅窗"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"兰呢？」二喜道：「同出去了。」于是大家又谈谈笑笑，又喝了一回酒。看看天气将晚，笑梅、聘才皆要进城，只得算了账。梅窗又与二喜说定，明日开发。梅窗让聘才等一同进城，他却住在城外，又到子佩处，两个同吃了一回烟，拉了子佩，到胭脂巷玉天仙家去了。","en":"Seeing that the day was growing late, Xiaomei and Pincai both needed to return to the city and settled the bill. Meichuang arranged with Erxi to settle the payment the next day. Meichuang declined to accompany Pincai and the others into the city; since he lived outside the city, he went back to Zipei's place, and the two of them had a smoke of opium together; then Meichuang"}],"21":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["杨梅窗"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"周旋的十分很好，又因华公子待他有些颜面，银钱又宽展起来，便有些小人得志，就不肯安分了。内有顾月卿、张笑梅，外有杨梅窗、冯子佩一班人朝欢暮乐，所见所闻，无非势力钻营等事，是以渐渐心肥胆大。从前在梅宅有士燮学士在家，虽不来管教他，自然畏惧的。而且子玉所结交的，都是些公子名士，没有那些游荡之人。譬如马困槽枥之中，虽欲泛驾也就不能。此时是任凭所欲，无所忌惮。","en":"the petty man's triumph and would no longer keep his place. Within were Gu Yueqing and Zhang Xiaomei; outside Yang Meichuang, Feng Zipei, and such company — nightly revelry — and whatever he saw and heard ran to schemes of influence and trimming to power; his heart grew fat and his daring swelled. Formerly at the Mei residence Academician Mei had been at home: though he did"}],"34":[{"paragraph":15,"mentions":1,"tokens":["杨梅窗"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"聘才初一日拜年，初二日听戏，初三日寓里大排筵席，请一班浮浪子弟如冯子佩、杨梅窗、乌大傻等，带了一群下作相公，天天的欢呼畅饮，清曲锣鼓，闹得竹嘈丝杂，酒池肉林，一连五日，方才少息，也去了三百吊钱。到初九日，忽然有人高兴要开赌，劝聘才做头家。聘才自思近来财运颇好，或者可以赢些钱，即于初九日晚上开起赌来。或是摇滩，或是掷骰，又把玉天","en":"the third day, he threw a grand banquet at his lodgings, inviting a crowd of idle dandies—such as Feng Zipei, Yang Meichuang, and Wu Dasha—along with a flock of lowly young male companions. Every day was filled with raucous cheers and heavy drinking, accompanied by the clatter of gongs and pure melodies. It was a chaotic din of silk strings and bamboo flutes, a veritable lake"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":1,"tokens":["梅窗"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"赏脸么？」奚、潘二人应了。冯子佩道：「你倒不请我。」聘才道：「你天天在这里，难道还要下请帖么？」子佩道：「我将梅窗也拉来。」聘才道：「很好。」众赌客算了帐，到五更时各散了，又送了玉天仙回去。","en":"invite me.\\" Pincai retorted, \\"You're here every day; must I send you a formal invitation?\\" Zipei said, \\"I'll drag Meichuang along as well.\\" Pincai agreed, \\"Very well.\\" The gamblers settled their accounts and dispersed around the fifth watch, once again sending Yutianxian on her way."},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":1,"tokens":["杨梅窗"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"到了明日，聘才发贴请客，请的是富三爷、贵大爷、奚十一、潘三、张仲雨、杨梅窗。是日辞了两个，贵大爷病了，张仲雨有事不能来。即补了冯子佩、唐和尚，宾主共七位。聘才叫了蓉官来陪富三，着人到篷子里叫了天香、翠官前来。不多一刻，两个剃头的也坐了大骡车，有一个人跟着，走进寺来。冯子佩是认识的，小剃头的先与子佩请了安，然后向聘才请安。聘","en":"gathering. His guests included Master Fu the Third, Gui the Eldest, Xi Eleven, Pan the Third, Zhang Zhongyu, and Yang Meichuang. Two sent their regrets—Gui was ill, and Zhang had other matters to attend to—so Feng Zipei and Monk Tang were brought in to fill their seats, making a total of seven host and guests. Pincai summoned Rongguan to accompany Fu the Third, and sent someone"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":2,"tokens":["杨八"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"去看阳宅，闹了一天，并邀我去给他们看地，也不过是想外放。」聘才因叫翠官、天香过来见了，说：「这就是很会看风水的杨八老爷，你们何不求他去看看你们的棚子，多会儿发财呢？」富三因接向杨八道：「你要留神呀，不要像乌家的事，看完了找到你门上去。」说罢大家大笑。冯子佩忽然皱了眉说声不好，便到院子里吐起来。慌得大家同来看他。吐了一会，就脸红头晕，满身发热。聘才忙叫他到炕上躺了","en":"appointment.\\" Pincai called Cuiguan and Tianxiang over to meet him, introducing him by saying, \\"This is Master Yang Eight, who is highly skilled in reading fengshui. Why don't you beg him to inspect your stall and tell you when you'll strike it rich?\\" Catching the joke, Fu the Third chimed in, \\"You'd better be careful, Yang Eight! Make sure you don't end up like that Wu"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":4,"tokens":["杨八"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"过！」此时坐的是富三首席，聘才叫翠官陪了他。第二是奚十一，唐和尚知他是个阔手，且知道他爱得月，便叫得月陪了他。杨八坐了第三，聘才叫天香挨着他。潘三坐了第四，自己与唐和尚坐了主位，只不见蓉官来。饮酒之间，撒村笑骂，嘈杂到个不成样子。还是富三稳重些，不过与翠官说些顽笑话，尚不至十分村俗。奚十一手拿了杯子灌那得月，一手伸在得月屁股后头，闹得得月一个腰扭来扭去，两个肩膀","en":"second seat; knowing Xi was a generous spender who had a fondness for Deyue, Monk Tang told Deyue to sit with him. Yang Eight took the third seat, and Pincai had Tianxiang sit next to him. Pan the Third sat in the fourth seat, while Pincai and Monk Tang occupied the host's positions. Only Rongguan was absent. As the wine flowed, the conversation devolved into vulgar shouting"},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":2,"tokens":["杨八"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"讲明学徒弟不过三年，如今已满了三年了，要去就去。亲爸爸，你真带我去吗？」富三道：「你若愿意跟我，我就带你去。」杨八听了，因向富三道：「老三，你又胡闹了！你与其带他去的钱，不如帮帮我捐个分发。前日那个告帮的知单上，求你再写一笔。」富三因说道：「我再写三十两就是了，你不必在旁吃醋。」杨八不但不急，并且连连道谢。","en":"truly take me with you?\\" Fu the Third said, \\"If you're willing to follow me, I shall take you.\\" Overhearing this, Yang Eight turned to Fu the Third and said, \\"Old Third, you're fooling around again! Instead of spending money to take him with you, you'd do better to help me purchase a provincial posting. I implore you to add another pledge to that subscription list you saw"},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":1,"tokens":["杨八"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"翠官一笑道：「三爷你能好造化，我才叫你能一个干爹爹，就又给你能招了一个来了。」杨八只作未听见，坐在一旁吃水烟。","en":"called you my dear father, and you've already attracted another dependent for yourself.\\" Pretending not to hear, Yang Eight sat to one side, quietly smoking his water pipe."},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":3,"tokens":["杨八"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"碰了几碰，说道：「我就磕头谢了！好三老爷，好亲爸爸！」富三乐得受不得。潘三见得月躺在奚十一怀里，天香躺在对面，杨八也想吹一口，便坐在炕沿上，歪转身子，压在天香身上。得月上好了一口，杨八接了过来，拨开毛冗冗的胡子，抽了一抽，口涎直流下来，点点滴滴，烟枪上也沾了好些，他就把皮袖子擦擦嘴再抽。枪又堵住了，天香欲替他通通，身子被他压住难动。杨八便检了根签子乱戳，一抬手，","en":"the kang, twisted his body, and leaned heavily against Tianxiang. Deyue finished preparing a pipe of opium, and Yang Eight took it. Parting his thick, unkempt beard, Yang Eight took a drag, his saliva dripping down in little drops, coating the opium pipe. He nonchalantly wiped his mouth with his fur sleeve and took another draw. When the pipe clogged, Tianxiang tried to"},{"paragraph":30,"mentions":1,"tokens":["杨八"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"杨八道：「这个我也是初学。」便勉强吸了一口，烧得很焦枯臭，放下枪。天香道：「你别压住了我，我替你烧。」那边得月枕在奚十一手上，奚十一又摸他的屁股。得月要起来，奚十一将一条腿压住了他，得月无法，只好任其抚摩。奚十一一盒子烟已完了，便叫巴英官拿烟来。英官远远","en":"Yang Eight said, \\"This is my first time trying it as well.\\" He forced himself to take a puff, but he burned the opium until it was charred and foul-smelling, finally setting the pipe down in defeat. Tianxiang said, \\"Stop pinning me down like this; I'll prepare"}],"35":[{"paragraph":3,"mentions":1,"tokens":["杨八"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"即草草的开了一个单子，拿出来给众人瞧。众人见聘才有事，不便再留，况已交卯初，大家都要作别。此时已经开城，富三与杨八也要回去。外面正在套车，只见蓉官坐了车来。","en":"already begun, so they all decided to take their leave. By now the city gates had opened, and Fu the Third and Yang Eight were also preparing to return. While their carriages were being harnessed outside, they saw Rongguan arriving in a cart."}],"36":[{"paragraph":8,"mentions":1,"tokens":["杨八"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"言道：「魏聘才搬了出去了，不知可在庾香处？」蕙芳道：「魏聘才么，如今倒更阔了。就在宏济寺住，同了奚十一、潘三、杨八一班混账人天天的闹，是什么剃头的，又是什么大和尚、小和尚，开赌宿娼，闹得不像。张仲雨也不与他往来了。」 　　 琴言问起子玉来，宝珠道：「前日我们在怡园叙了一日。」便将前日怎样喝酒，怎样行令，次贤新制的酒壶、杯子都说了，琴言着实羡慕。又说那首诗，度香也","en":"lives at Hongji Temple and causes trouble every day with a bunch of scoundrels like Xi Eleven, Pan the Third, and Yang Eight—barbers, monks big and small—gambling and visiting prostitutes. It's a disgrace. Even Zhang Zhongyu no longer associates with him.\\" When Qinyan asked about Ziyu, Baozhu recounted, \\"The day before yesterday, we spent the whole day together at the Garden"}],"42":[{"paragraph":34,"mentions":1,"tokens":["杨八"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"厂，又不是我的儿子，吃了抹抹嘴就走。当家的死后，今日还是头一回开市，就遇着两个混账东西，与前年那个开姜店姓杨的杨八一样，不是玉天仙还叫他姊夫呢。归根儿是他妈的白吃白喝。这些个不要脸的狗鸡巴□的，真他妈的可恶！」长庆媳妇叨叨了一回。到明日，伍麻子去照票子，谁知后来添的一吊还是张假的。又到奚十一寓处来找亮轩，倒被奚十一的家人骂了一顿。伍麻子受屈而回，只得自己赔上一吊","en":"master died this was our first day of business, and we run into two good-for-nothings — the very likeness of that Yang Eight from the ginger shop the year before last, and he only got away with it because Yutianxian still calls him brother-in-law. It comes down to eating and drinking scot-free, damn them. These shameless dog-cock-… things — they are truly, damnably vile!\\""}],"47":[{"paragraph":5,"mentions":1,"tokens":["杨八爷"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"我的师父…」说到此，住了口。奚十一坐了，拉他在身边，问道：「你师父那里去了？」得月道：「在间壁庄子上。方才有个杨八爷请他去说话，就回来的。」奚十一又与得月顽笑一会，再问聘才，也不在家。","en":"down, pulled the boy close, and asked: \\"Where did your master go?\\" Deyue said: \\"To the dining house next door. Master Yang the Eighth called him over to talk; he will be back shortly.\\" Xi Eleven teased Deyue a while longer, then asked for Pincai, who was also out."},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":2,"tokens":["杨八爷","梅窗"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"唐和尚拍手笑道：「巧极，巧极！怎么没有？方才一个杨八爷，叫梅窗，一个张师爷，叫笑梅，是魏大爷的相好，常到这里来，我也与他相好。他们二人在间壁吃饭，我送烟过去，与他们讲了半天。那张笑梅有个亲戚是苏州人，专门行这一道，替人配眼珠子，配鼻子，配牙，这却都是假的。惟有接那样东西，说先上了麻药，将他一劈四瓣，把狗","en":"Monk Tang clapped his hands and laughed: \\"Perfect, perfect! Of course there is! Just now a Master Yang the Eighth, named Meichuang, and a Master Zhang, named Xiaomei—an intimate of Master Wei—were eating next door. I often see them here, and we are well acquainted. I took them some opium and we talked a long while. Master Zhang Xiaomei has a relative from Suzhou"}],"50":[{"paragraph":17,"mentions":1,"tokens":["杨八爷"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"大爷，想少爷们都认识的。」王恂道：「认识之至。」唐和尚道：「这个人真好，真是个满场飞。近来他也要出京了。方才是杨八爷、张、顾二位师老爷在那里，大家高兴，唱了几只曲子。」","en":"is a truly wonderful man, the life of any gathering! He will be leaving the capital soon, too. Just now, it was Eighth Master Yang, along with Master Zhang and Master Gu, all in high spirits, singing a few arias together.\\""},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":1,"tokens":["杨梅窗"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"元茂同了他两个舅子下通州赴考去了，只好认了晦气。到出京那几日，一起一起的饯行，潘其观、奚十一、张仲雨、冯子佩、杨梅窗、张笑梅、顾月卿、唐和尚等轮流作饯，唐和尚的庄子好不热闹，聘才又辞了几天行。","en":"the capital, farewell banquets were thrown one after another. Pan Qiguan, Xi Eleven, Zhang Zhongyu, Feng Zipei, Yang Meichuang, Zhang Xiaomei, Gu Yueqing, Monk Tang, and others took turns hosting him. Tang's establishment was exceptionally lively, and Pincai ended up postponing his departure for several more days."},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":1,"tokens":["杨八"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，人才是没有说的。」玉天仙面有喜色，笑道：「只要裙里香，管他十二房。妹妹这么个人，妹夫岂有不一心一意的。你看那杨八妹夫也是个从九，再没有选期，尽仗着看风水，能赚多少人？他家里也利害，如今与六妹妹也远了，那六妹妹也真教他赚苦了，那个人才没良心呢。听说他上了回江南，也不知是谁赚他，叫他给门户中带了一封信。他到江南就坐着轿子，穿着衣帽，拿着眷晚生的帖去拜。到了门，投了","en":"takes twelve concubines? With a woman like you, my sister, how could your husband not be utterly devoted? Look at Yang Eight, our brother-in-law—he too is only a rank 9b official with no prospect of a real posting, surviving entirely on reading feng shui. How many people can he really swindle? And his household is fiercely strict. Now he's drifted far away from Sixth Sister,"}]}`),"char-147":JSON.parse(`{"40":[{"paragraph":19,"mentions":1,"tokens":["周小三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"上了潘三的当，放了东西，心中甚恨，忍住了仍不理他。潘三自以为得计，必当移舟就岸，那知许老三怀恨在心。他有个姐夫周小三，即与潘三赶车，为人颇有血性，倒是个路见不平拔刀相助的朋友。","en":"toward the bank. Little did he know that Xu Laosan nursed his grievance bitterly. He had a brother-in-law named Zhou Xiaosan, who drove Pan the Third's cart — a man of considerable hot-blooded spirit, the very sort of friend who would draw a sword to aid a stranger facing injustice on the road."},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":2,"tokens":["周小三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"倒不妨，三吊钱一月，别处也弄得出来。这件事既商议定了，倒要趁早，你们去将你妹夫叫来。大家说明，也要他肯。」去叫周小三来家，三姐将方才商量的话说了，周小三无有不依，定于后日晚间行事。","en":"early. Go and fetch your brother-in-law. We must all be clear on the plan, and he must be willing.\\" They sent for Zhou Xiaosan, and the third sister explained the scheme they had just plotted. Zhou Xiaosan agreed to everything without hesitation, and they set the action for the evening of the day after next."},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":9,"tokens":["周小三","小三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"过了一夜，明日老二到潘三处搬老三的铺盖，潘三知事发了，心中有些惧怕，只得将言留他。经周小三力劝，留下铺盖，把老二劝回。潘三感激小三不尽，谢了小三，小三道：「三爷如果真心要提拔我的舅子，明日我去劝他来。这孩子胡涂，我开导他几句，他就明白了。明日倒有件凑巧事，不晓三爷肯赏脸不肯？」潘三道：「什么话！你虽与我赶车，也是伙计一样。你既这么懂交情，","en":"sensing the affair had come to light, was gripped by fear and desperately tried to detain him with words. Through Zhou Xiaosan's forceful persuasion, the bedding was left behind, and the second brother was convinced to return home. Pan the Third was boundlessly grateful to Xiaosan and offered his profuse thanks. Xiaosan said, \\"Third Master, if you truly intend to elevate my"},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":4,"tokens":["小三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，这又娇又嫩的声音，就觉入耳。潘三听得咭咭咯咯的高低响，到了门后，手望门上一扶，露出两个银指甲道：「要什么？」小三道：「三爷初次来，你也该出来见个礼。况且三爷是有年纪的人，父母一样，不要害臊。」三姐笑了一声，道：「我厨房有事，还没有净手。老三嘴馋得很，不能帮我也罢，我装一碟，他到要吃半碟。」又笑了一笑，便进去了。潘三听了，已有些软洋洋的起来，心中想道：「好个声音","en":"the doorway, a hand rested upon the frame, revealing two silver nail guards, and a voice asked: \\"What is it?\\" Xiaosan said, \\"Third Master honors us for the first time; you ought to come out and pay your respects. Furthermore, Third Master is a man of mature years, like a parent to us — there is no need to be bashful.\\" Third Sister gave a little laugh and said, \\"I have"},{"paragraph":30,"mentions":1,"tokens":["小三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"老三不理，又进去了。小三道：「他帮着他姐姐弄菜，少停肯来的。」老三又拿出两碟两碗，一碟是炒猪肝，一碟是炒羊肉，一碗烩银丝，一碗炸紫盖。","en":"Laosan ignored him and went back inside. Xiaosan said, \\"He's helping his sister prepare the dishes; he'll come out in a little while.\\" Laosan then brought out two more plates and two bowls: a plate of stir-fried pig's liver, a plate of stir-fried mutton, a bowl of braised silver-thread noodles, and"},{"paragraph":31,"mentions":2,"tokens":["小三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"两人已吃了一会酒，只听得打门之声，又听得连叫两声「小三！」小三即忙去开门。潘三听得一声「了不得了！」倒吃了一惊，又听说了好些话。","en":"The two had been drinking for a while when a pounding at the door was heard, followed by two urgent shouts of \\"Xiaosan! Xiaosan!\\" Xiaosan hurriedly went to open the door. Pan the Third heard a cry of \\"Disaster!\\" — which gave him quite a start — followed by a flurry of urgent words."},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":1,"tokens":["小三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"小三道：「我就来。」那人道：「同走罢，不要耽搁了。」","en":"Xiaosan said, \\"I'm coming immediately.\\" The man said, \\"Let's walk together—don't dally.\\""},{"paragraph":33,"mentions":6,"tokens":["小三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"小三进来向潘三道：「三爷请坐坐，我叫老三来陪你，我要出去劝解一件事，就回来的。」潘三道：「我也走罢。」小三道：「忙什么，我即刻回来的。」潘三心上为着老三，正好等小三去了，招陪他。口虽说走，身却不动。小三叫老三出来，老三终是不肯。小三骂了一声：「胡涂小子！","en":"Xiaosan came back inside and said to Pan the Third, \\"Third Master, please sit for a moment. I will tell Laosan to come keep you company. I must go out and mediate an affair, but I will be right back.\\" Pan the Third said, \\"I will leave as well.\\" Xiaosan said,"},{"paragraph":34,"mentions":3,"tokens":["小三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"。身材不长不短，不肥不瘦。香喷喷一脸笑容，对了潘三福了一福。潘三见了，色心已动，连忙还礼，请坐下，他却不坐，对小三道：「你快些回来，省得三爷等得不耐烦。」小三应了，到了外边说道：「顶快也要二更天才得回来，去有五六里路呢。」说着忙忙的去了。三姐出去关门，进来坐下，潘三便笑迷迷的道：「奶奶今年贵庚了？」三姐道：「十九岁。」即叫声：「三爷，我们那小三是粗卤人，有伺侯不","en":"his heart ablaze with lust, hurriedly returned the bow and invited her to sit. She declined, and instead said to Xiaosan, \\"Come back quickly, lest you make Third Master wait until he grows impatient.\\" Xiaosan agreed, and from outside he could be heard saying, \\"At the very fastest, it will be the second watch before I return; it's a journey of five or six li.\\" With that,"},{"paragraph":35,"mentions":2,"tokens":["小三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"三姐笑道：「你不来陪你的人，倒要我替你陪，那里有这样倔强的孩子，怪不得人要暗算你。」潘三听了这话有因，即道：「小三在我家，也是亲人一样，奶奶就坐坐，谅也无妨。」三姐道：「我坐在这里，也是一样。」潘三道：「奶奶坐着虽是一样，但到底离远些，不好说话，请过来坐罢。」三姐起一起身，微微的笑着，又坐下了。潘三便起身斟了一杯酒，送到三姐的身边道：「我敬奶奶一杯。」三姐道：「","en":"child! No wonder people plot against you.\\" Pan the Third, catching the hidden barb in her words, immediately said, \\"Xiaosan is like family in my home; Lady, please just sit down — I am sure there is no harm in it.\\" Third Sister said, \\"My sitting here is just the same.\\" Pan the Third said, \\"Though the lady sitting there is the same, it is somewhat distant, making conversation"},{"paragraph":37,"mentions":1,"tokens":["小三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"想道：「他想这个，也顾不得了。」即除下来道：「奶奶，你肯行好事可怜我，我就将镯子送你，以后还要大大的谢你，也加小三的工食钱。」三姐接了镯子，套在自己手上，笑道：「多谢你，我如今依了你，你却不要告诉人。」潘三连声答应，想扯他的裤子，三姐即忙跳下道：「房里来！」说罢先走，潘三随后跟了进去。到了炕边，三姐道：「你把长衣脱了，就在炕沿上顽一顽罢。」","en":"and take pity on me, I shall give you this bracelet. In the future, I will reward you handsomely, and increase Xiaosan's wages as well.\\" Third Sister accepted the bracelet, slipped it onto her own wrist, and laughed: \\"Many thanks to you. Now that I have agreed to this, you must not go telling others.\\" Pan the Third agreed repeatedly and moved to pull at her trousers."},{"paragraph":38,"mentions":8,"tokens":["周小三","小三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"三姐先坐在一边，潘三把长衣解开，扯了裤子，正想挨扰来，忽听得背后脚步响。回头一看，吓了一跳，连忙掖了裤子。只见周小三已到前面，大喝了一声，一把揪住，骂道：「好大胆的忘八蛋，原来你竟不是人！」潘三吓得目瞪口呆。三姐忙说道：「潘三爷方才要小解找溺壶，你当是什么？」小三忙道：「没廉耻的婊子，一见爷们就搭上了，还要在我面前遮饰！溺壶在你身上呢？」三姐嚷道：「你别撒赖讹人。","en":"behind him. Turning his head, he was given a terrible fright, and hastily tried to pull his trousers back up. Zhou Xiaosan had already stormed into the room; he gave a great shout, seized Pan the Third in a tight grip, and cursed, \\"You audacious son of a turtle! So you are no kind of human being at all!\\" Pan the Third was frightened utterly speechless. Third Sister hurriedly"},{"paragraph":39,"mentions":11,"tokens":["小三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"潘三道：「奶奶，你劝劝。」小三道：「你想罢，你愿出一千银子，你就乖乖的答应送来。你不愿，我就捆你起来，送你到官。」潘三道：「我愿，我愿！但如何要得一千银子？我身边有三百吊钱的票子，给你罢。」小三道：「三百吊钱算什么？」三姐道：「你也摸摸良心，三爷待你这样好，今日就算他错了，你也须","en":"Pan the Third cried out, \\"Lady, please speak a word of persuasion!\\" Xiaosan threatened, \\"Think it over! If you are willing to hand over a thousand taels of silver, then agree to it obediently. If you refuse, I will tie you up and deliver you to the magistrate!\\" Pan the Third desperately agreed, \\"I am willing! I am willing! But"},{"paragraph":40,"mentions":1,"tokens":["小三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"吃了早饭，到了小三家，见门不闩，推了进去。见三姐坐在屋里，引着小狗儿顽。潘三咳嗽一声，三姐满面堆下笑来。","en":"After eating breakfast, he arrived at Xiaosan's house. Finding the door unbolted, he pushed it open and entered. He saw Third Sister sitting in the room, teasing a small dog. Pan the Third coughed once, and Third Sister's face immediately bloomed into a radiant smile."},{"paragraph":42,"mentions":2,"tokens":["周小三","小三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"」要来扯他，三姐笑道：「关了房门。」刚转身，只听得外面嚷道：「做的好事！」一阵脚步响。潘三一听，魂不附体。只见周小三领着他两个舅子，拿着雪亮的刀，又有一条粗麻绳，上前将潘三按住，拉下炕来。许老二一连三四拳，骂道：「你这狗鸡巴亏的，肛了我的兄弟，还想血我的妹子。」潘三只得在地下叩头。小三道：「我昨日饶了你的狗命，你今日又来送死。」便把潘三捆了。潘三光着身子，只是哀求","en":"followed by the thunderous clatter of footsteps. Pan the Third, hearing this, felt his soul flee his body. He saw Zhou Xiaosan leading his two brothers-in-law, brandishing gleaming blades and carrying a thick hemp rope. They surged forward, pinned Pan the Third down, and dragged him off the kang. Xu Laoer delivered three or four heavy punches, cursing, \\"You dog-dicked son of"},{"paragraph":43,"mentions":4,"tokens":["小三","周小三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"潘三俯首无词，穿了裤子鞋袜，然后向小三说道：「你既然是为人报仇，就不应要我的钱。」小三道：「要你什么钱？」潘三道：「非但钱，还有八两重的金镯子。」小三道：「你回去与我打官司就是了。」三姐道：「潘三，你要打官司早些说，我好习学口供，省得上堂时说得不好。」潘三一人，如何闹得过他们，只得忍气吞","en":"Pan the Third hung his head, utterly bereft of words. He put on his trousers, shoes, and socks, and then said to Xiaosan, \\"Since you were seeking revenge for another, you should not have taken my money.\\" Xiaosan retorted, \\"What money of yours did I take?\\" Pan the Third said, \\"Not only the money, but also an eight-tael gold bracelet.\\" Xiaosan scoffed, \\"Go back and file"},{"paragraph":45,"mentions":1,"tokens":["小三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"那兄弟两个都说「很是。」小三今早将这票子，已同潘三对了外票，是预先商量停妥的，便拿出来交与三姐。三姐分派定了，又说道：「倒是三兄弟的毛病要紧，与他治好了方好。」","en":"The two brothers both agreed, \\"Very right.\\" Xiaosan had already exchanged the notes for cash with Pan the Third that very morning — a detail prearranged — and he now brought the money out and handed it to Third Sister. Once she had finished distributing it, she added, \\"However, Third Brother's ailment"}],"47":[{"paragraph":3,"mentions":1,"tokens":["周小三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"不好相强。蕙芳也找着一所房子，甚是合式，就在鸣珂坊，与子玉相近。又替春航备了车马，新收了几个管家。那赶车的就是周小三，进来后，又荐他小舅子许老三，改名许贵，做了跟班，局面一变，暂且按下。","en":"to Ziyu. He also arranged a carriage and horses for Chunhang and took on several new servants. The driver was Zhou Xiaosan; once hired, he recommended his young brother-in-law, Xu Laosan, who took the name Xu Gui and became a footman. And so the household took on a new face. We leave this thread for now."},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":1,"tokens":["周小三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"再说潘三自那日受了周小三这番荼毒回去，唬了一场大病，二十几天才起得来。这口气闷在心里，无从发泄，还算小事。","en":"Let us return to Pan the Third. After suffering Zhou Xiaosan's brutal torment that day, he went home and fell gravely ill with a severe fever, unable to rise from his bed for over twenty days. The stifling resentment lodged in his chest with nowhere to vent was still the lesser of his woes."},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":1,"tokens":["周小三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"得叫伙计重兑了。再看屋内墙上挂的一个表，也不见了。潘三恨声不已，因是找他来医病的，不便多说，忍气吞声，惟有暗恨周小三与三姐害他。","en":"the clock hanging on the wall was missing as well. Pan the Third fumed with endless resentment, secretly cursing Zhou Xiaosan and Third Sister for ruining him."}],"49":[{"paragraph":3,"mentions":4,"tokens":["周小三","小三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一日，赶车的周小三与蕙芳说起他的三姐，情愿进来伺候老太太，又夸奖他三姐粗粗细细件件皆能，还会缝衣写算，针线活计是不用说了。蕙芳也闻得三姐之名，收拾过潘三，想是个伶俐人，也想见见他，问他怎样收拾的。便与春航说了，举荐他进来，春航不好推辞，一口应允。这三姐因收拾潘三之后，","en":"One day, the carriage driver Zhou Xiaosan mentioned his Third Sister to Huifang, saying she was willing to come in and serve the old madam. He boasted that she was highly capable in all tasks, both rough and delicate, could sew, read, and calculate—and her needlework was beyond compare. Huifang,"},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":1,"tokens":["小三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"次，没有见着三姐。一日，蕙芳又来，春航未回，在书房闲坐，听得三姐脚步声在他门前过，急出来望时，见三姐到二门口叫小三说话。说了话进来，蕙芳意欲招陪他几句，见他低了头，当不看见。及走过了书房门口，又回转脸来，却正与蕙芳四目相对，三姐低鬟一笑而去。蕙芳自此以后，也看出没有恼他的意思了。","en":"heard Third Sister's footsteps passing his door. He hurried out to look and saw her at the second gate, calling Xiaosan over for a word. After she finished speaking and turned back inside, Huifang intended to greet her and chat a little, but she lowered her head as if she hadn't seen him. Yet, just as she passed the study door, she turned her face back, her eyes meeting"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":1,"tokens":["周小三"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"言重！言重！我自有个道理，决不教你受一分委屈。而且也是顽话，知道有好的没有好的？我想世间错配的真有，咱们家里的周小三，倒有这么个好女人，岂不冤枉了他。」蕙芳道：「你爱他么？」春航笑道：「岂有此理！我不过说说罢了。」","en":"knows if there will be good ones or not? I think there truly are mismatched pairs in this world. Take our own Zhou Xiaosan—to have such a fine woman as his wife, isn't that a terrible waste of her?\\" Huifang asked, \\"Do you like her?\\" Chunhang laughed, \\"Preposterous! I was merely making a casual remark.\\""}]}`),"char-148":{44:[{paragraph:2,mentions:4,tokens:["孟七"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"想道：「原来他倒在外边这样快乐，一定又到那里去陪酒了。」姚贤一面想，一面走，忽前面来了两个熟人，一个二十九岁叫孟七，是徐子云的家人；一个三十九岁叫胡八，是奚十一的家人，都是本京人，那胡八与姚贤是两姨中表，这三个人都是相好的。这日胡八因主人患病无事，出来找了孟七听戏，想到馆子里去吃饭，遇见了姚贤，又是城里出来的，便一把拉住，各人问了好，便邀进了馆子，要了几样菜、两",en:`party." He walked on, still thinking, when ahead of him two acquaintances appeared: one was twenty-nine-year-old Meng Qi, a household man of Xu Ziyun's; the other was thirty-nine-year-old Hu Ba, a household man of Xi Eleven's. Both were natives of the capital. Hu Ba was Yao Xian's first cousin on the maternal side; all three were on friendly terms. That day Hu Ba, whose`},{paragraph:3,mentions:2,tokens:["孟七"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"感恩，辞也不辞，竟同人走了。我想天下竟有这样忘恩负义的人，我回去禀明了公子，定然要拿转来，这就看他的造化罢。」孟七听了，笑道：「那里的话，这是谁哄你的？琴言好好的在这里，何曾同什么江南人出京。这是讹言，听不得的。」姚贤道：「这倒不是讹言，是他家里讲的。」孟七道：「你别信这话，你且喝一钟，我告诉你，这琴言从他师父死了，告假出来，却天天总在我们园里，我们老爷为他请了",en:'young master, he will certainly have Qinyan brought back — it will come down to whether Qinyan is lucky or not." Meng Qi heard all this and laughed. "Where did you hear such a thing? Qinyan is right here, perfectly well — when has he left the capital with any southerner? This is all rumour and not to be believed." "It is not rumour," said Yao Xian. "His own household told'},{paragraph:6,mentions:1,tokens:["孟七"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"姚贤吃了饭，道了谢，就进城来见了珊枝，将琴言近日的事，先照伍麻子，后照孟七、胡八的话，没有少说一句，说得顺口，还添了好些。又说路上见他与一个相公同车，想是陪酒去了。珊枝听了，呆了一会，说道：「这是什么话？是真的，还是假的？我要照你的话回，若有假的在里头，就了不得了。」",en:"the city, where he reported to Shanzhi. He relayed Qinyan's recent doings — first as Mazi had told them, then as Meng Qi and Hu Ba had reported — without leaving out a single word, and with his tongue loosened, he added a good many embellishments of his own. He also said that on the road he had seen Qinyan sharing a carriage with another young performer, apparently going"},{paragraph:7,mentions:1,tokens:["孟七"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"姚贤道：「我怎敢撒谎？这是徐老爷家的孟七爷，并奚家的胡八爷，讲得有凭据，我敢添一句，对出谎来，是好耍的么？」珊枝心里细想道：「琴言何敢如此负恩？非特公子白疼了他，我也白白的照应他一番了。」又转念道：「看他的心总是勉强在此，心上又有什么梅少爷，自然在外面快乐。但到徐老爷处也还罢了。怎么连魏聘",en:`"How would I dare to tell lies?" said Yao Xian. "These are words spoken by Meng Qi of Lord Xu's household and Hu Ba of the Xi family's household — with witnesses to what was said. Would I dare add a word? Is it something to jest about?" Shanzhi turned it over in his mind: "How could Qinyan be so ungrateful? Not only has the young master`}]},"char-149":{44:[{paragraph:1,mentions:1,tokens:["姚贤"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"话说琴言出师之日，就是华公子赏花之日。明日，华公子吩咐珊枝着人去叫琴言回来，珊枝派了一个外跟班姚贤，一早出城。到了长庆寓处，见了伍麻子。说假期已过，叫他进城。",en:"ordered Shanzhi to send someone to summon Qinyan back to the household. Shanzhi dispatched an outer attendant named Yao Xian, who set out early for the city gate. Arriving at the Changqing lodgings, he found Wu Mazi and delivered word that the leave period had expired and Qinyan was to return to the city."},{paragraph:2,mentions:12,tokens:["姚贤"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"伍麻子道：「琴言么，昨日有人替他出师，已经搬了出去，恐怕未必进城来了。」姚贤听了一惊，道：「这话怎么说！我家的人怎样私自放走了，如今他搬在那里？」伍麻子道：「我不知道，听得说替他出师的，是个江南人，想必就在他家了。」姚贤道：「岂有此理！你们就要出师，也回明公子，没有这样的。我们公子知道了，如何肯依，那就了不得了。」伍麻子道：",en:`someone arranged his release from indenture. He has already moved out and is unlikely to return to the city." Yao Xian was startled. "What does that mean? How could someone in our household be simply let go without permission? Where has he moved to?" "I don't know," said Mazi. "I only heard that the one who secured his release was a man from the south of the Yangtze`},{paragraph:3,mentions:1,tokens:["姚贤"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"罢。」孟七听了，笑道：「那里的话，这是谁哄你的？琴言好好的在这里，何曾同什么江南人出京。这是讹言，听不得的。」姚贤道：「这倒不是讹言，是他家里讲的。」孟七道：「你别信这话，你且喝一钟，我告诉你，这琴言从他师父死了，告假出来，却天天总在我们园里，我们老爷为他请了半月多客。至于出师的事，不晓得是琴言求我们老爷的，还是我们老爷愿意与他出师的。昨日，我们管总的叫我去到日",en:`he left the capital with any southerner? This is all rumour and not to be believed." "It is not rumour," said Yao Xian. "His own household told me." "Never mind that," said Meng Qi. "Have a cup of wine, and I'll tell you: ever since Qinyan's shifu died and he came out on leave, he has spent every day at our master's garden. Our master has been hosting banquets for him`},{paragraph:4,mentions:1,tokens:["姚贤"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"玩器，很重的东西都肯送。若要这个人，只消写个贴儿与你们公子，难道公子不肯送他？何必花此二千四百银，真冤不冤？」姚贤道：「原来如此。就是你们老爷要他，也应告诉我们公子一声，现在还没有出府。不是我说，你们老爷也有点冒失。」",en:'given him up? Why spend two thousand four hundred taels? What a needless waste." "So that is the story," said Yao Xian. "Even so, even if your master wanted him, he should have informed our young master first — Qinyan has not yet formally left the household. Not to put too fine a point on it, your master was a little rash."'},{paragraph:6,mentions:1,tokens:["姚贤"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"姚贤吃了饭，道了谢，就进城来见了珊枝，将琴言近日的事，先照伍麻子，后照孟七、胡八的话，没有少说一句，说得顺口，还添了好些。又说路上见他与一个相公同车，想是陪酒去了。珊枝听了，呆了一会，说道：「这是什么话？是真的，还是假的？我要照你的话回，若有假的在里头，",en:"Yao Xian finished his meal, offered his thanks, and returned to the city, where he reported to Shanzhi. He relayed Qinyan's recent doings — first as Mazi had told them, then as Meng Qi and Hu Ba had reported — without leaving out a single word, and with his tongue"},{paragraph:7,mentions:1,tokens:["姚贤"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"姚贤道：「我怎敢撒谎？这是徐老爷家的孟七爷，并奚家的胡八爷，讲得有凭据，我敢添一句，对出谎来，是好耍的么？」珊枝心里细想道：「琴言何敢如此负恩？非特公子白疼了他，我也白白的照应他一番了。」又转念道：「看他的心总是勉强在此，心上又有什么梅少爷，自然在外面快",en:`"How would I dare to tell lies?" said Yao Xian. "These are words spoken by Meng Qi of Lord Xu's household and Hu Ba of the Xi family's household — with witnesses to what was said. Would I dare add a word? Is it something to jest about?" Shanzhi turned it over in his mind: "How could Qinyan be so`},{paragraph:10,mentions:4,tokens:["姚贤"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"道：「奴才方才走来，听得公子正说着话，故在太湖石后瞧一瞧，再上来。」公子道：「有什么话说？」珊枝道：「今早打发姚贤去叫琴言，姚贤回来了。」公子道：「琴言呢？」珊枝道：「琴言没有回来。」公子道：「琴言怎么还不回来？难道还有事呢？」珊枝道：「这琴言恐怕不能来的了。」公子听了，倒吃一惊，道：「怎么说，琴言有病么？」珊枝道：「没有。」公子道：「既没有病，为什么不能来呢？",en:'paused to glance from behind the Taihu rock before coming forward." "What is it?" said the young master. "You sent Yao Xian early this morning to summon Qinyan; Yao Xian has returned," said Shanzhi. "And Qinyan?" "Qinyan did not come back." "Why has Qinyan still not come back? Has something detained him?" "I fear Qinyan will not be able to come." The young master was startled.'},{paragraph:12,mentions:1,tokens:["姚贤"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"，连说：「有这等事！可恨！可恨！琴言丧尽天良，人间少有。而度香笑里藏刀，欺人太甚，难道我就罢了不成！你明日还叫姚贤去，务必把他叫来，我问问他，是何缘故。我也不管什么徐度香，我自然不能依他，与他评个理，天下有这么欺人的事情么？若不相好的人也罢了，既系相好，就不该有心欺人。从前何以不早与他出师！要到我这里来了，才卖弄他的家私，替他出起师来。这琴言实在可恨。那一样待差",en:"blade within — he has gone too far in insulting me. Do you think I will simply let this pass? Go at once and send Yao Xian back — he must bring Qinyan here, no matter what. I must question him face to face and hear his reasons. I care nothing for this Xu Duxiang — I intend to have a reckoning with him and see who is in the right. Is there such an outrage as this in the world?"},{paragraph:22,mentions:1,tokens:["姚贤"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"正月二十七日，小价琴言因其师长庆病故，告假一月，经理丧葬，今已逾假数日。弟于昨日着家人姚贤出城唤彼回来，始知吾兄已为琴言出师，并已收用。今将其箱笼什物一并送上，祈即查收转交，想琴言断无颜面前来自取也。但闻此子下流已甚，曾于各处陪酒，不择所从，惟利是爱，弟闻之发指。本欲拘回重处，犹恐有负尊意。但以后务宜严加管束，勿使仍蹈前愆。兄虽大度优容，",en:"month's leave to manage the funeral arrangements. As this leave has now been exceeded by several days, I sent my man Yao Xian to the city outskirts yesterday to summon him back, and only then learned that my elder brother had arranged Qinyan's release from indenture and has already received him into his household. I therefore send his chests and belongings herewith, requesting"}]},"char-150":{52:[{paragraph:22,mentions:1,tokens:["紫烟"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"。田太夫人请了王文辉的陆氏夫人，带了他大姑奶奶蓉华并媳妇孙少奶奶佩秋，又请刘守正的夫人，没有来，他媳妇吴少奶奶紫烟来了。周锡爵、杨方猷、陆宗沅的夫人都辞了。",en:"Sun Peiqiu. She also invited the wife of Liu Shouzheng, who could not attend, though her daughter-in-law, Madam Wu Ziyan, came in her stead. The wives of Zhou Xijue, Yang Fangyou, and Lu Zongyuan all politely declined."}],54:[{paragraph:38,mentions:1,tokens:["吴紫烟"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"爱果，自然也不像那梦中措大的光景。若像那梦中光景，岂不要将个琼华小姐气死了么？明日也请了袁绮香、苏浣香、浣兰、吴紫烟、王蓉华、孙佩秋来陪新人，群仙高会，又叙了一日。华夫人因是父亲得意门生，又是年伯母来请他，所以欣然而来。至排场热闹，与田家一样，不能细述。以后子玉闺房之乐，真是乐不可言。一个仕女班头，一个才人魁首，或早起看花，或迟眠玩月，或分题拈韵，或论古辨疑，成了",en:"Had that dream become reality, Qionghua would have died of outrage. Next day Yuan Qixiang, Huanxiang, Huanlan, Ziyan, Ronghua, and Peiqiu came to accompany the bride—a gathering of near-immortals that lasted another full day. Lady Hua came gladly because Ziyu was her father's prized disciple and Lady Yan had invited her personally. The scale and excitement matched"}],57:[{paragraph:2,mentions:1,tokens:["吴紫烟"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"娴柔静，贤淑无双，又且绣口锦心，才能咏絮。于十月初十日，请了华公子的夫人苏浣香、田春航的夫人浣兰、刘文泽的夫人吴紫烟、颜仲清的夫人王蓉华、梅子玉的夫人琼华、王恂的夫人孙佩秋。此时园中菊花开满，五色斑烂。是日晴光和蔼，风不扬尘，小毛衣服都用不着，绵的尽够了。袁绮香一早带了十二红婢，还有几个家人媳妇，先到园里候客。那日次贤、高品、南湘皆回避了。那十二红都是十五六岁，有",en:"the tenth month, she invited Hua Gongzi's wife, Su Huanxiang; Tian Chunhang's wife, Huanlan; Liu Wenze's wife, Wu Ziyan; Yan Zhongqing's wife, Wang Ronghua; Mei Ziyu's wife, Qionghua; and Wang Xun's wife, Sun Peiqiu. By this time, the garden's chrysanthemums were in full bloom, a brilliant tapestry of five colors. The day's sunlight was gentle, the wind stirred no dust,"},{paragraph:3,mentions:2,tokens:["吴紫烟","紫烟"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"到巳初一刻，刘文泽的夫人吴紫烟先到，车进了园门，即换肩舆，抬到宝香堂前下轿，珠围翠绕的，带了四个丫鬟。绮香迎接上堂，彼此见了礼。绮香笑道：「今日算你早，我是辰刻过来的。」紫烟道：「我今天卯正就起来，昨日姐姐说要辰正毕集的。已经到巳初了，谁知这些姐姐们还没有一个来。」",en:"At the first quarter of the si hour, Liu Wenze's wife, Wu Ziyan, arrived first. Her carriage entered the garden gate, and she immediately transferred to a shoulder-sedan, which carried her directly to the Hall of Treasured Fragrance. Resplendent in pearls and kingfisher ornaments, she was accompanied by four maids."},{paragraph:5,mentions:1,tokens:["紫烟"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"袁绮香接下台阶，苏氏姊妹笑盈盈的上前见礼，然后与佩秋、紫烟、蓉华、琼华都见了，各人挽着手，喜笑颜开，叙了一番。",en:"stairs. The Su sisters stepped forward with radiant smiles and curtsied, then exchanged greetings with Peiqiu, Ziyan, Ronghua, and Qionghua. Each took another's arm, their faces bright with joy, and they conversed warmly for a while."},{paragraph:6,mentions:3,tokens:["紫烟","吴紫烟"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"「妹子前日就有这心，今日正打算商议这事，不料姐姐先得我心。我们今日序齿之后，以后称呼，就照这里的排行可好么？」紫烟道：「更好了。我与绮香姐姐，都没有亲姊妹，我从前就厌人称我为大姑娘。如今好了，要改排行了。」绮香笑道：「你要改什么行？大姑娘已改了大奶奶，你如今就想改大太太么？」说得众人笑了。序齿袁绮香二十五岁，吴紫烟二十三岁，孙佩秋、王蓉华皆二十二岁，苏浣香二十一",en:`anticipate my mind. After we order ourselves by age today, may we use that ranking for our future forms of address?" Ziyan agreed, "That is even better. Sister Qixiang and I have no blood sisters, and I have always disliked being called 'eldest young lady.' Now it is perfect; I can finally change my rank." Qixiang laughed, "What rank will you change to? 'Eldest young lady'`},{paragraph:8,mentions:1,tokens:["紫烟"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"浣香道：「极高的所在，除非上山不可，但恐难走。」紫烟道：「我听说这园里有个缥缈亭是最高的，我们就到那缥缈亭上去罢。」蓉华道：「据我想，登山不如临水，且闻得路路走得通的。不如坐个船游他一转，望着那些景致，似乎比岸上还好些。」佩秋道：「说得是，又省力。若上山去，只怕也走乏了，还能游么？」绮香道：「既是这样",en:'Huanxiang said, "The highest spots require going uphill, which I am afraid would be too difficult." Ziyan suggested, "I hear there is a Pimiao Pavilion that is the absolute highest point. Let us go there." Ronghua countered, "In my opinion, facing the water is better than climbing a mountain, and I hear that every path connects by boat. It would be better'},{paragraph:9,mentions:1,tokens:["吴紫烟"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"到了吟秋榭，将三层游览过了，在第二层设了筵宴。众佳人酒量虽不算好，却也能饮几杯，最大者为吴紫烟、王蓉华。",en:"ladies' capacity for wine was modest, yet each could manage a few cups. The strongest drinkers among them were Wu Ziyan and Wang Ronghua."},{paragraph:13,mentions:2,tokens:["紫烟"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"个小翠，才十三岁，生得很好，且又灵变。又点了许三姐。琼华的四个丫头，点了一个青琴。蓉华两个丫头，点了一个秋莲。紫烟两个丫头，点了一个侍香。佩秋两个丫头，点了一个金凤。共二十四人。其余都命他们代酒。绮香即命拿过筹来，先是七人掣了，顺着年齿掣去，绮得掣着秦，紫烟掣着楚，佩秋掣着燕，蓉华掣着赵，浣香掣着魏，浣兰掣着齐，琼华掣着韩。浣香道：「姐姐，你今日受了大敌了，我们",en:"with Miss Xu Sanjie. From Qionghua's four maids, Qingqin was chosen. Ronghua picked Qiulian from her two maids. Ziyan selected Shixiang. Peiqiu chose Jinfeng. In total, there were twenty-four capable maids; the rest were ordered to drink on behalf of others when necessary. Qixiang then had the lots brought out. The seven mistresses drew first, in order of age: Qixiang"},{paragraph:14,mentions:2,tokens:["紫烟"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"佩秋道：「我掣荆轲，也不至中铜柱的。」浣兰道：「我把田单的火车驱过来，看你有什么御敌的妙计。」紫烟道：「就是我国没有勇将，若能掣着了项重瞳就好了。」绮香道：「且慢高兴，我秦国是兵强将勇，没有一个弱兵。待我且先派定了人数再说。他们共二十四人，我用六个，你们一家用三个。」即叫浣香的爱珠、花珠过来，道：「你两人到我大国来立些功业，不要在你那个小国埋没。",en:`bronze pillar." Huanlan said, "I will unleash Tian Dan's fire-oxen against you. Let us see how you counter that." Ziyan said, "Even if my state lacks a champion, drawing the double-pupiled Xiang Yu would be more than enough." Qixiang responded, "Do not celebrate just yet. My Qin fields strong generals; there is not a single weak soldier among them. Let me balance the`},{paragraph:15,mentions:2,tokens:["紫烟"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"是韩非子，红玉掣的是吕不韦，红雪掣的是李斯，红霙掣的是赵高。绮香笑道：「如何，你看我们文武皆全。」收过了筒，取紫烟楚国的筹来，侍香掣的是令尹子兰，红薇掣的是高唐神女，赠珠掣的是宋玉。紫烟笑道：「完了，一个佞人，一个梦神，一个风流鬼，这如何打得仗来？」众佳人皆笑，也收过了。再掣佩秋的燕国小筹，金凤掣了荆轲，红莲掣了田光，红娟掣了骏马。佩秋道：「也不好，究竟是个不祥",en:`drew for Chu. Shixiang drew Minister Ling Yin Zilan; Hongwei drew the Gaotang Goddess; and Zengzhu drew Song Yu. Ziyan groaned with a laugh, "We are done for! A flatterer, a dream goddess, and a romantic ghost. How can we possibly fight with them?" The others laughed and set Chu's tube aside. Next came Peiqiu's Yan lots: Jinfeng drew Jing Ke, Honglian drew Tian Guang,`},{paragraph:22,mentions:2,tokens:["紫烟"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"道：「我是甲冑在身，不能还礼。」画珠骂道：「你威风不要使尽了，只怕这回就要对人磕头呢。」于是又击起鼓来，花到了紫烟住了，侍香、红薇、赠珠上来。赠珠把骰子一掷，数到红薇，是高唐神女，众人皆笑。紫烟笑道：「好个红姑娘，高鬟大袖的，真像个神女。」红薇脸已红了。那边爱珠、红玉、红香、红霙、红雪也过来，掷到爱珠，是白起。绮香道：「这叫做无情遇。」看谱：「如神女遇见白起，神",en:'may well be kowtowing in the next round." They beat the drum once more, and this time the flower stopped with Ziyan. Shixiang, Hongwei, and Zengzhu stepped forward. Zengzhu cast the dice, and it pointed to Hongwei, who was playing the Gaotang Goddess. Everyone laughed. Ziyan smiled, "Look at our Miss Hong. With her high chignon and wide, flowing sleeves, she truly'},{paragraph:23,mentions:2,tokens:["紫烟"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"一出《闹庄》，也是净脚戏，生、旦俱不应到，红薇又到了，又罚一杯。红薇不服，说道：「这出戏也要让我们国王点了。」紫烟道：「不错，我们上了他的当了。」紫烟点了一出生旦戏，想罚爱珠一杯。谁知爱珠是个空手，倒将侍香罚了一杯。",en:`nut again, earning her another penalty cup. Hongwei protested, "Our king should be the one to pick the play!" Ziyan agreed, "You are right. We fell right into their trap." Ziyan then quickly named a sheng-dan piece in order to fine Aizhu, but Aizhu's hand was perfectly empty, meaning Shixiang was forced to drink the penalty instead.`},{paragraph:42,mentions:2,tokens:["紫烟"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"容情，他们四个跑得快，不然叫你一窝子六个滚在一堆。」那六个人我一句，你一句，把三姐骂了好一会，众佳人方才笑完，紫烟一人尚有余笑。绮香对浣兰道：「妹妹，你这个三姐真好，我拿个丫鬟与你换了罢。」浣兰道：「姐姐要他作什么，他是只会装狗的。。」紫烟笑道：「姐姐你招集这些亡命作甚，你真作秦始皇么？」大家又笑起来。",en:'would be rolling in one heap." The six berated Sanjie roundly before the beauties finally stopped laughing—though Ziyan still had a few giggles left in her. Qixiang said to Huanlan, "Sister, your Sanjie is wonderful. I would trade you a maid for her." Huanlan replied, "What would you do with her? She only plays the dog." Ziyan laughed, "Sister, why recruit these desperadoes?'},{paragraph:48,mentions:1,tokens:["紫烟"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"「这闷雷、劈雷是可以乱打的，你也不必容情，连他们的国王也可打得的。」佩秋道：「你若像了秋莲的廉颇，就不好了。」紫烟道：「也不要像我们荆轲的匕首。」你一句，我一句的说笑。绮香笑道：「谅此孤军深入重地，焉有生还之理？」便命六人一齐上前，与青琴对敌。",en:`thunder may strike wildly. Do not spare them—not even their king." Peiqiu warned, "Do not be Qiulian's Lian Po." Ziyan chimed in, "Nor our Jing Ke's dagger." Banter flew across the room. Qixiang laughed heartily, "This lone army, deep in enemy land—can it possibly return alive?" She confidently ordered six of her maids forward at once against Qingqin.`},{paragraph:51,mentions:1,tokens:["紫烟"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"众姐妹方携着手，就近到了春风沉醉轩坐下。群婢也都来了，煮茗清谈了一会，已点上灯。紫烟要打马吊，便拉了蓉华、佩秋二人打起马吊来。琼华看见有一匣诗牌，便与绮香、浣兰三人在一桌打了一副，足足打到二更后，琼华方成了一首七律，绮香差了一韵斗不成。浣兰牌起得不好，尚差了十数字，琼华将牌摊出，那边蓉华等也过来看时，只见斗的是：",en:'Drunken Pavilion"—and sat down. The maids followed, brewing tea and talking until the lamps were finally lit. Ziyan wanted to play ma-diao and pulled Ronghua and Peiqiu into a game. Qionghua spotted a box of poetry cards and played a hand with Qixiang and Huanlan until past the second watch. Qionghua completed one beautifully regulated octet; Qixiang missed one rhyme'},{paragraph:52,mentions:1,tokens:["紫烟"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"得很好，我也只见过五六个，到年节下，他们也过来贺节。不是我说，我们今日这一班人，倒有几个像他们。」这句话，就有紫烟想不出是谁，其余皆听得人说过。浣兰、琼华恐绮香说出来，便不约而同的将闲话拦住他。又看将近三更，也要各散。绮香挽留不住，只得同散，便说道：「残月未尽，妹妹们可高兴，能走到园门口不能？」众佳人情愿都走，一对对的手灯相照，众姊妹你携我，我携你，一路说说笑笑",en:'them; at festivals, they come to pay their respects. Not to boast, but several among us today resemble them." Ziyan alone could not guess whom she meant; the others had heard people speak of them. Huanlan and Qionghua, fearing Qixiang would name names, quickly cut in with small talk. Near the third watch, they finally prepared to leave. Qixiang could not keep them'}]},"char-151":{35:[{paragraph:5,mentions:1,tokens:["蔡某"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"情愿来帮同灌园打更。那晚睡后即不见了，委系无同谋窝窃情节。坊里问了几回，总是一样，只得送部。知会九城，严缉贼匪蔡某，且按下不题。",en:"interrogated the gardener and found that he was genuinely unaware of the circumstances. It turned out the helper, surnamed Cai, was a recent hire from late last year whom the gardener had known for some time. Cai had originally done odd jobs at a cheap meat eatery, but when it closed down, he volunteered to help water the garden and keep the night watch. That night, after going"}]},"char-152":JSON.parse(`{"36":[{"paragraph":4,"mentions":1,"tokens":["师娘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"指点了，走过了门房，却喜那些人都知道了，也不来问。一直出了头门，望见照墙边歇着一辆车，即是他向来坐的车。又见他师娘的表弟伍麻子同来，琴言上前见了，两人坐上车，一路的讲出城来。","en":"gate, he saw a carriage waiting by the screen wall—the very carriage he always took. He also saw Wu Mazi, his teacher's wife's cousin, who had come along. Qinyan went up to greet him, and the two boarded the carriage, talking all the way out of the city."},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":8,"tokens":["师娘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"将到了门口，已见一班人在那里搭篷。琴言进了门，一直进内，只见天寿跑出来，见了琴言，重又跑进。听得他师娘在里头，呜呜咽咽哭起来。琴言到了床前，见他师傅已穿好了衣，帕子蒙了面，自然一阵悲酸，跪在床前，痛哭不止。倒是他师娘拉他起来，劝他住了哭。琴言问道：「师傅得了什么病，好端端就死了？」他师娘道：「并没有病，昨夜还是好好的。吹烟吹到三更后，睡了还讲了好些话","en":"canopy. Qinyan entered and went straight in. Tianshou ran out, saw him, and ran back in. Inside, he could hear his teacher's wife weeping bitterly. Approaching the bed, Qinyan saw his teacher already dressed in grave clothes, a cloth covering his face. Overcome with bitter grief, he knelt by the bed and wept profusely. His teacher's wife pulled him up and urged him to stop crying."},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":1,"tokens":["师娘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"没有见着公子，说办完丧事就回去，也没有限定几天。」素兰道：「总得告一个月的假，等出了殡才可进去，不然也对不住你师娘。」琴言道：「可不是。」蕙芳道：「索性告假告个长假，不去也罢了。究竟你也不是卖与他们的。」宝珠道：「在那里好倒算好，就是拘束些。且同事中没有一个知心的人，未免孤另些。」蕙芳道：「当日林珊枝也算不得什么，此刻见了我们，那一种大模大样。他就忘了从前同班子","en":"ask for at least a month's leave and wait until after the burial to return; otherwise, you'll be letting your teacher's wife down.\\" Qinyan agreed. Huifang added, \\"You might as well ask for a long leave and just not go back. After all, you didn't sell yourself to them.\\" Baozhu reasoned, \\"It has its advantages, though it's a bit restrictive. And without any close confidants"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":1,"tokens":["师娘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"空闲无事，不如去看看庾香罢。」因想去年梅夫人待的光景，去谅也无妨。主意定了，换了一身素服，吩咐套了车，一面告诉师娘去谢谢同班的人。到了外间，忽然又转念道：「如今已隔了半年了，况从前是聘才领我去的，不要进门房里回话。如今我独自去，就算太太待我好，叫我进去，那门房里我总要去求他，适或碰起钉子来，他倒不许我进去呢？况且他家的人除了云儿之外，一个都不认识。」思前想后，不","en":"no harm in going. Mind made up, he changed into plain clothes, ordered the carriage to be readied, and told his teacher's wife he was going to thank his fellow actors. When he reached the outer courtyard, however, he hesitated: \\"It's been half a year. Before, Pincai took me, so I didn't have to speak to the gatekeepers. If I go alone now, even if the lady treats me well and"}],"42":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":2,"tokens":["师娘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"。到长庆葬事过了，忙了两三天，琴言辛苦了，身子有些不快起来，意欲安顿几天，再进华府。一日早饭后，卧在房中，见他师娘进来，琴言连忙站起。师娘叫他坐了，说道：「从前你进华府，不知华公子怎样对你师父讲的，师父也没有对我说过。他在时我诸事不管，如今是要我支持门户了。我想我们一年总要三千吊钱才够花消。你看那天福、天寿挣得出来吗？你没有进华府时，一月内极少也挣得二三百吊钱。","en":"more days before returning to the Hua household. One morning after breakfast, he was resting in his room when his master's wife came in. Qinyan quickly rose to his feet. She told him to sit down, and then began to speak. \\"When you first entered the Hua household, I never knew what terms your master had agreed upon with Young Master Hua, nor did your master ever tell me. While"},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":3,"tokens":["师娘","长庆媳妇"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"。如今师父死了，他们只怕未必照旧了。若除了华府，又问谁去要钱？难道还可以问度香商量么？不比在外，常可见面。此刻师娘要我一月定给多少钱，这倒是件难事。况且公子近来待我又不如从前，这话怎好去问他？」想来想去，不得主意，答不出来。他师娘心上疑着华公子待琴言不知怎样好，自然要一千就是一千，要二千就是二千。这几天在琴言身上盘算，把个心想昏了。又恐琴言存着坏心，道是师父死了","en":"for money? It is hardly possible to negotiate with Duxiang. He is not someone one can meet with easily. Now his widow is asking me to fix a monthly sum, which is a difficult thing to do. Furthermore, the young master has not been as warm toward me as he used to be. How could I possibly bring up money with him?\\" He turned the problem over and over in his mind without"},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":3,"tokens":["师娘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"只听说师父每月到府一回，也只在门房里，不知领多少钱。此时我又不出去应酬，一月给师娘多少钱，原是应该的，但我拿不定主意自己有钱无钱，我怎敢随口答应？设或答应了又不见钱呢，怎么对得住师娘？」他师娘口中哼了一声道：「我不信，我也不知细底。你师父是不知自己要死，若知道自己要死，也早对我说了。我听得去年你没有进去时，华公子就打发人出来说要买","en":"\\"I only heard that master came to the household once a month, and that he waited in the gatehouse. I do not know how much he received. As for giving you a monthly sum, that is of course right and proper. However, since I do not know for certain whether I have any money or not, how can I rashly make a promise? And what if I promised and then no money appeared? How could I possibly face you?\\" She made a sharp sound in her throat and retorted: \\"I don't believe it. I don't know the full details either. Your master had no idea he was going to die. If he had known, he would have told me everything long ago. I heard that last year, before you went in, Young Master Hua sent people out to say he wanted to buy out your contract. Is he the sort of man who would be stingy with money? A person should act in good conscience. How is it that the moment your master dies, you change your tune?\\" Qinyan, stung nearly to tears by these words, could only suppress his feelings and say: \\"The only way is to wait until I return and then discuss it. I have not kept a single coin for myself. What I received in gifts last year and at New Year is merely that packet of silver from the other day."},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":2,"tokens":["师娘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"师娘要三百吊钱一月，只怕不能有这许多，总要问明白公子才好定得。但是这句话，师娘代我想想，怎好自己去对公子讲？」","en":"\\"If you want three hundred strings of cash a month, I am afraid that may not be possible. I must first ask the young master clearly before anything can be settled. But think about it for me. How could I possibly raise this matter with the young master myself?\\""},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":3,"tokens":["师娘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"他师娘冷笑道：「人在他家半年多了，还不好讲？交情越重，钱应该越多了。若是不给钱的交情，要他做什么？你不要装胡涂，他又没花过三千五千两替你出师。若出了师，我自然不能对你讲这些话了。还有那一种有良心的，念着师父、师娘，就出了师还常常孝敬，也是有的。不然你就对他","en":"those with a conscience who, even after being redeemed, still regularly show their gratitude to their master and mistress. That kind of person exists too. Otherwise, you could simply tell him to bring three thousand taels of silver to buy out your contract. I could use that to acquire some property, which would be far better than receiving it in dribs and drabs. There are"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":1,"tokens":["师娘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"时候，这些相公如何在家？琴言白白走了一回，路上又遇着这两个厌物，更加纳闷。进了房，长叹了一声，不觉泪下。偏有那师娘的表弟伍麻子，不看风色，走进来坐在炕沿，捏着潮烟袋，找了个纸条子，抽了二三十口，纸煤烟灰吹得一地。","en":"At this hour the afternoon performances were just ending. Where would any of the young entertainers be at home? Qinyan had made two wasted trips and on top of that had run into these two repellent creatures on the road, leaving him feeling even more wretched. Back in his room, he heaved a long sigh, and found tears falling without his willing them. At just this inopportune moment, his master's younger cousin by marriage, Wu Mazi, came wandering in without reading the mood in the room. He sat himself on the edge of the kang, pinched his damp tobacco pipe, fished out a strip of paper for a spill, and puffed away twenty or thirty times, scattering paper-taper ash all over the floor."},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":1,"tokens":["师娘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"：「你能没有事，你能不肯赏脸。」亮轩道：「真有事。」伍麻子道：「坐坐罢，就有事也不必忙。如今他的师父不在了，他师娘就靠着这两个孩子呢。」大傻道：「你也难得出来，我也走乏了，略坐一坐罢。」又问天福道：「你师父几时不在的？」天福道：「前月二十五。」大傻道：「咳，我竟不晓得他死了。你们虽不认得我，你师父倒与我极相好的。」天寿道：「我也常见你在戏园里，你怎么坐不住，总走","en":"really have something.\\"\\n\\nWu Mazi said, \\"Sit a while. Even if you have, there's no hurry. Now their master is gone, his wife depends on these two boys and nothing else.\\" Dasha said, \\"You so seldom get out, and I am tired with walking. Let us sit a little.\\" Then to Tianfu, \\"When did your master die?\\" Tianfu said, \\"The twenty-fifth of last month.\\" Dasha said, \\"Aiya — I never"},{"paragraph":33,"mentions":1,"tokens":["长庆媳妇"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"长庆媳妇一见只有三吊钱，便说道：「那里有这样开发？你也在这里多年了，你见收过三吊钱么？怎么不摔还他，也臊臊他的脸！腥不腥，臭不臭，两个相公留了两个客，烟茶酒饭，闹得乌烟瘴气的，还替人做跟班，提了灯笼送回去，接了三吊钱就夹着屁股回来。一个汉子连个数目字都不认得","en":"Changqing's widow, when she saw only three strings of cash, demanded who was ever paid off with three strings. She asked if he had been in this business long enough, had he ever seen three strings handed over, and why he didn't throw it back in his face and shame him"},{"paragraph":34,"mentions":2,"tokens":["长庆媳妇"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"板凳打得粉碎。倘今日又遇见了他，可不要白挨一顿打，连这三吊钱也没有，我所以只好接了回来。我岂不想他三十吊么？」长庆媳妇道：「都是你们这些瞎眼睛的，也不分个人鬼。分明来打茶围的，苦苦拉住他，将个臭虫当作洋虫。以后如遇这等不要脸的下作东西进来，务必撵他出去。太太这里不是舍粥厂，又不是我的儿子，吃了抹抹嘴就走。当家的死后，今日还是头一回开市，就遇着两个混账东西，与前年那个","en":"even these three strings. That is why I took what I could and left. As if I didn't want thirty strings from him!\\" Changqing's widow burst out, \\"Blind fools, the lot of you — you cannot tell a man from a ghost! Plainly he came in for nothing but a cup of tea, and you clung to him and dragged him back, taking a bedbug for a foreign beetle. In future, whenever a shameless, low creature"},{"paragraph":35,"mentions":1,"tokens":["师娘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴言今日找着了宝珠、素兰、商量师师娘要钱之事。不知宝、素二人有何良策，且听下回分解。","en":"As for Qinyan, that same day he had managed to find both Baozhu and Sulan to discuss the matter of his master's widow's demands for money. As to what Baozhu and Sulan proposed as a plan, listen to the following chapter."}],"43":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":3,"tokens":["师娘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"量，怎么代我想个法儿才好。」宝珠道：「什么难事，你且说来。但你想不到的，只怕我也想不到。」琴言道：「昨日，我那师娘问我进华府时，华公子对你师父是怎样讲的，可曾得过他家的钱。又说家中一年的浇裹，须得两千四百吊钱，要我给他二百吊钱一月，说定了方叫我进城。我想去年原为奚十一的事送我进去，我进去了也没有见着师父，不知其中是怎样的。今师娘忽然问我要二百吊钱一月，叫我怎么打","en":"said Baozhu, \\"though if you cannot think of a solution yourself, I am afraid I may fare no better.\\" \\"Yesterday my master's wife questioned me about the day I entered the Hua household — what Young Master Hua's young lord said to my shifu, and whether my shifu had ever received money from them. She also said that the household costs two thousand four hundred strings a month, and"},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":2,"tokens":["师娘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"然之事，所以没有对人讲起。」宝珠道：「你说佩服的是谁？」素兰道：「那一天我与媚香闲谈，偶然讲起玉侬来，媚香说他师娘…」素兰说到此，便从窗外望了一望，说道：「此处说话，那边听不真么？」琴言道：「听不见的。」素兰道：「媚香说他师娘与他师父一样利害，只怕这一辈子要靠在玉侬身上。玉侬虽不唱戏，究竟没有出师。若论玉侬的钱，也就不少，看来此时未必有存余。若四五千吊钱可以出得","en":"day I was chatting idly with Meixiang,\\" said Sulan, \\"and Yunong's name happened to come up. Meixiang said his master's wife—\\" At this point Sulan glanced out the window and said: \\"Can they hear us from over there?\\" \\"No, they cannot,\\" said Qinyan. Sulan continued: \\"Meixiang said his master's wife is as hard a taskmaster as his shifu was, and fears she will make Yunong support"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":1,"tokens":["师娘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"花么？」素兰道：「事有一件，到怡园再讲罢。」蕙芳道：「何不先讲讲，此刻还早，到度香处尚可略迟。」素兰就将琴言的师娘要他出师的话，略说了几句。蕙芳道：「何如？我前日对你讲，你还说这也未必然之事，谁知竟叫我说着了。但要办这事，其实也不很难，就怕娘儿们的说话不作准，一会儿又不愿了。或是说定了数目，又要增添起来。且谁去与他讲呢？」素兰道：「那倒不要紧，就是我们也可以去讲","en":"\\"It is still early — there is no need to hurry to Duxiang's.\\" Sulan then briefly outlined the matter of Qinyan's master's wife demanding that Qinyan be released from his indenture. \\"Indeed!\\" said Huifang. \\"I told you the other day, and you said it might not come to pass, yet here it is, just as I predicted. The matter is not so very difficult to arrange. The only fear is that"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":1,"tokens":["师娘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"吃过了饭，又下楼逛了一会，过了小山，过了石梁，便是留春坞。就在留春坞内煮茗清谈。宝珠对子云将琴言的师娘要他出师，及蕙芳、素兰的主意说了一遍。子云道：「若果如此，倒也很好。」便问蕙芳道：「你们有这力量作此义举么？」蕙芳道：「若说力量，原也勉强，但集腑成裘，也还容易。我与瑶卿、香畹三人可以凑得六百金，王氏弟兄、佩仙、庾香可以凑得四百金。」次贤道：「我来一","en":"Dell. There, over brewed tea, they fell into easy conversation. Baozhu recounted to Ziyun the matter of Qinyan's master's wife demanding the release of his indenture, together with the plans that Huifang and Sulan had proposed. \\"If that is truly the case,\\" said Ziyun, \\"it would be very good indeed.\\" He turned to Huifang and asked: \\"Do you have the means to carry out this righteous"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":4,"tokens":["长庆媳妇"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"会，春航去了。茂林已在外面候了多时。定更后了，茂林提了灯笼，照着蕙芳，到了长庆家。也不找琴言，找了伍麻子，请了长庆媳妇出来。蕙芳见他扎了白包头，穿了孝衫，下面倒是条长绿绸裤子，白布弓鞋，黄瘦脸儿，长挑身材，三十来岁年纪，像个嘴尖舌利的人。见了蕙芳却不认识，问茂林道：「这位是谁？」茂林道：「这是班里的苏大相公。」蕙芳上前见了礼，叫了婶娘。长庆媳妇还了礼，请他坐下，问叶","en":"and the two arrived at the Changqing household. They did not seek out Qinyan but found Wu Mazi and asked for the widow, the wife of Changqing. Huifang saw a woman emerge who wore a white mourning kerchief and a white hemp jacket, below which she had on a long green silk skirt with white cloth bound shoes. Her face was sallow and thin, her build tall and willowy; she"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":5,"tokens":["长庆媳妇"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"昨日与我们商量，若要花三五千两，是花不起的，三千吊钱还可以打算。」长庆媳妇口里「阿哟」了几声道：「三千吊钱就要出师！你想那琴言去年唱戏时，半年就得了整万吊钱。如今与他出师，这个人就是他的，他倒几个月就捞回本来。啧，啧，啧！有这便宜的事情，我也去干了。」茂林道：「嫂子不是这么说。譬如还唱戏呢，原可以挣得出来。若卖去作儿子，是","en":"three thousand strings might perhaps be possible.\\" \\"Three thousand strings, and you want to release him!\\" The widow exclaimed several times in astonishment. \\"Do you realise that when Qinyan was performing last year, he earned a clear ten thousand strings in half a year alone? This person pays three thousand strings and gets Qinyan for his own, and then in a few months"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":3,"tokens":["长庆媳妇"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"主意已定，口中还说要添，经不得叶茂林这个老头子，倒是一条软麻绳，嫂子长，嫂子短，口甜心苦，把个长庆媳妇，像个躁头骡子似的，倒捆住了，只得应允。蕙芳道：「你倒担承了，不知那边花得起，花不起。若真凑不起来，倒叫婶娘见怪，空费了半天唇舌。」茂林笑道：「你倒胆小，就是他凑不上来，短了一千八百，你这个红人儿替他张罗张罗，值什么事？横竖他也不至负你。」蕙芳道：「","en":"was like a soft hemp rope, offering sweet words of 'sister-in-law' this, and 'sister-in-law' that. He worked the widow like a headstrong mule until she was bound fast and could only consent. \\"You've agreed to this,\\" said Huifang, \\"but we don't know whether they can afford it. If they can't raise the money, auntie will blame us, and all this talk will have been for nothing.\\""},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":6,"tokens":["长庆媳妇","师娘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，格外又一张五十两的，赏与茂林。蕙芳也不耽搁，急忙回去吃了饭，找了茂林，先将五十两送了他，茂林感激不尽，即同到长庆媳妇家来。蕙芳说：「费了多少力，他才凑了一千九百两，我代他借了五百两，一总开了一张票子在此，请收了。」茂林就代写了一张字据，与琴言收执。长庆媳妇见事成了，才备了几个碟子请茂林、蕙芳，叫琴言陪了小酌。蕙芳道：「我吃过饭了，不消费心，叶先生请独用罢。」即对琴","en":"quickly, found Maolin, and sent him the fifty taels first. Maolin was deeply grateful. They then went together to the widow's home. \\"With great effort,\\" said Huifang, \\"I managed to gather one thousand nine hundred taels, and borrowed five hundred on his behalf. The whole has been made into a single draft, so please accept it.\\" Maolin drew up a written receipt for Qinyan to"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":1,"tokens":["长庆媳妇"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"明日，长庆媳妇谢了茂林一百吊钱，茂林倒也不想，已心满意足的了。谁知琴言命中磨蝎颇多，虽出了师，忽又生出气恼来。未知后事如何，且听下回分解。","en":"The following day the widow thanked Maolin with a gift of a hundred strings. Maolin had not been expecting it, and was well satisfied. But Qinyan's natal palace stood under Capricorn, the sign of a life dogged by slander: though he had now been released, a fresh source of trouble"}],"44":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["师娘"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"！你们就要出师，也回明公子，没有这样的。我们公子知道了，如何肯依，那就了不得了。」伍麻子道：「不干我事，这是他师娘作主，谁能拦阻他的！」姚贤道：「如今到底在什么地方？我好去找他问个明白。」伍麻子道：「住处实在不知，只听得说，他还进城呢。况且他还有多少东西在城里，岂肯扔掉了，自然还要进城来的。」伍麻子说得不明不白，急得姚贤什么似的，又问道：「你们奶奶呢？待我当面问","en":"this. If he finds out, there will be serious consequences.\\" \\"It is none of my affair,\\" said Mazi. \\"This was the mistress's decision — who could stop her?\\" \\"Where is he now, exactly?\\" said Yao Xian. \\"I need to find him and get a straight answer.\\" \\"I truly don't know his whereabouts. I only heard it said that he still intends to enter the city — he has things there he can't"}]}`),"char-153":JSON.parse(`{"5":[{"paragraph":28,"mentions":1,"tokens":[],"kind":"identified-reference","zh":"那年娶了靖边侯苏兵部的姑娘，这妆奁就有百万。他夫人真生得天仙似的","en":"Through the passageway was the main hall, flanked by six wing-rooms on either side. Fu the Third was already standing beneath the eaves of the main house, coming forward to welcome him. Pincai hurried up and clasped his hands in greeting. Fu the Third led him behind the main hall to sit in a pair of small study rooms, exchanging polite inquiries about each other's health. Pincai said: \\"The snow delayed me these past few days, otherwise I would have come to pay my respects the day before yesterday. I felt so restless at home, thinking of you constantly, Third Brother.\\" Fu the Third replied: \\"The feeling is mutual.\\" This place was Fu the Third's study, situated close to the inner chambers, separated only by a courtyard. Pincai briefly took in the room's furnishings: the space was divided by a floor-to-ceiling partition of nanmu wood carved with ice-crackle patterns. In the upper room was a wooden kang, adorned with a set of four small landscape screens, and a striking clock rested on the kang table. Nearby stood a square table with several chairs, and in the center sat a large copper coal-brazier. On the wall hung a silk-scroll couplet, and beside it an intricate Western painting. The kang cushions were of sapphire-blue satin. A servant entered, wearing a plain silk fur-lined jacket and a fur hat pulled down over his eyebrows, revealing half of a large braided queue at the back. Carrying a tea tray, he first handed a cup to Pincai. Pincai said: \\"Please convey my respects to the Madam.\\" Before the servant could reply, Fu the Third said: \\"Your sister-in-law is not home today; she has gone to visit her parents. Stay and have a meal with me today, and we can chat.\\" Pincai readily agreed, then asked: \\"Will Eldest Brother be coming today?\\" Fu the Third replied: \\"I'm not sure. I heard him say yesterday he had business and needed to go to Jinchun Garden to ask Young Master Hua to put in a good word. I imagine he has gone there by now.\\" Hearing of Young Master Hua of Jinchun Garden, Pincai asked: \\"I was just going to ask about that Young Master Hua.\\" He then recounted what he had seen on the road and what the driver had told him. Fu the Third said: \\"What does a driver know! This Young Master Hua's name is Guangsu, style name Xingbei. His father is a hereditary first-class duke, currently serving as Commander-General of the Western Frontier. Because of the great merits of his ancestors, when he was eighteen and entered official service, he was immediately awarded the rank of a second-class idle grand minister. This year he is twenty-one, accomplished in horsemanship and archery, and quite capable in literary affairs as well. His looks go without saying — even those young dan performers cannot match him. The only fault is that he spends too lavishly. But in truth he is not arrogant or haughty at all; people who see his imposing retinue simply do not dare approach him. His family wealth is beyond reckoning. A few years back he married the daughter of Su, Marquis of Jingbian of the Ministry of War, whose dowry alone came to a million taels. His wife is truly beautiful as a heavenly immortal, her looks may be the finest in all the realm. She is supremely virtuous too, accomplished in calligraphy, painting, chess, and music. She also has ten maidservants called the Ten Pearl Maids, all bearing names with the character 'pearl', all as beautiful as flowers and jade, literate, and able to sing and play instruments. In his residence, Young Master Hua truly passes every day in delight. He is the foremost noble young man in the city, the supreme wealthy patron. I have a slight family tie to him myself, through your sister-in-law's maternal uncle.","identityNote":{"en":"Hua’s wife is described here; chapter 11 identifies her as Huanxiang.","zh":"此处描述华光宿之妻，第11回明言浣香嫁与华光宿。"}}],"7":[{"paragraph":15,"mentions":1,"tokens":["浣香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"对得很好。」高品道：「他是想天鹅肉吃，不要吓坏了。」南湘道：「搁着你这贫嘴，回来和你算账。」再看王恂的是「华屋浣香融燕乳」。子玉已经连圈了。众人道：「这句融洽得很。」共贺了一杯。文泽道：「我是落第了。」众人看他对的是「歌馆小么含鸟舌」。南湘道：「也讲得下去。」高品道：「歌馆内有小么是极连贯的，就是那小么儿太苦些。」南湘道：「为什么？」高品道：「又是鸟，又是舌头，","en":"later.\\" Next was Wang Xun's: 'The splendid house washing its fragrance—the swallow's milk blends and melts. (华屋浣香融燕乳)' Ziyu had already marked it with double circles. The group praised it, \\"This line is beautifully harmonious,\\" and drank a congratulatory toast. Wenze admitted, \\"I've clearly failed this examination.\\" They read his match: 'The singing-hall's little"}],"11":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"得什么似的，连我都骂起来，这不是可以相信的么？况那几个孩子也不喜人与他戏谑的。」说了一会闲话，袁夫人说起明日是华夫人生日，且系二十岁正寿，是必要去走一走的。子云道：「自然该去，且你去年生日他也过来，还送了好些东西，我们也备几样玩好送他。」一宵无话。","en":"themselves disdain such frivolous teasing.\\" They conversed a while longer until Mrs. Yuan said that the next day was Lady Hua's twentieth birthday, a milestone of great significance, demanding their attendance. \\"Indeed, we must go,\\" Ziyun agreed. \\"She honored your birthday last year with her presence and numerous gifts. We are obliged to prepare a selection of fine treasures"},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":3,"tokens":["华夫人","浣香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"过在那起居服食上，享用些富贵豪华之福。养尊处优，不喜酬应。\\n骑射既精，词赋更妙。也曾千卷罗胸，不难七步随口。这华夫人母家姓苏，父名臣泰，也是功臣之后，世袭列侯，现任兵部尚书。并无嗣子，只生二女：长名浣香，次名浣兰，皆生得华容绝代，每于花下闲行，有百蝶随舞。精于诗词音律，书画琴棋，各臻微妙。外间有两句口号说道：「不愿得龙宫十斛珠，只愿」一见侯门大小苏。」这浣香十八岁","en":"profound. Having devoured a thousand volumes, he could effortlessly compose verse within seven paces. His wife, Lady Hua, was born of the maternal Su lineage. Her father, Su Chentai, descended from the glorious founders of the dynasty, held the hereditary title of marquis, and currently reigned as President of the Board of War. Lacking sons, he cherished his two daughters:"},{"paragraph":5,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这日是华夫人生日，外边恰一概不知。昨日公子与夫人家宴了一日，命八龄班唱了一天戏。这八龄名字都有一个龄字，无非金龄、玉龄、兰龄、桂龄之类。有几个是家童教的，有几个是各班选的。虽不能如《花选》中之名旦，却也胜于寻常戏旦，闲时原叫其伺候书房。","en":"The outside world remained entirely ignorant of Lady Hua's birthday festivities. The day prior, the young master and his wife had shared a private family banquet, entertained from dawn till dusk by the Eight-Ages Troupe. Every boy in the troupe bore the character 'ling' (Age) in his name, known as Golden-Age,"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":5,"tokens":["华夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这日华夫人知其胞妹浣兰小姐要来，复又见徐府中送了十样珍玩，知袁夫人也要来，与华公子清早拜过了家庙，供过了佛。公子本要再与夫人家宴一天，因他姨妹与盟嫂来，只好回避。不一会苏小姐已到，香车到了穿堂，用软肩舆一直抬进了内堂院子里，四个丫鬟扶了小姐下轿，华夫人出接，姐","en":"Knowing her younger sister, Miss Huanlan, would attend, Lady Hua was further delighted by the arrival of the Xu household's ten precious curios, signaling Mrs. Yuan's impending visit. Rising early, she and the young master offered reverent respects at the ancestral shrine and the Buddhist altar. The young master had"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":7,"tokens":["华夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"有些官客们，接接连连闹到十八日，也没有空得一日。又因你们都在城里，只得日间来看，不能晚上赏玩，所以没有来请。」华夫人也甚为羡慕。袁夫人又对苏小姐道：「承年伯母惦记，又赏东西。」苏小姐道：「家母那日因姐姐回去时，说有些不快，心上常惦记着呢。」袁夫人又欠身谢了。十珠婢与苏小姐的丫鬟，都向袁夫人请了安。袁夫人的六红婢，也向华夫人、苏小姐请了安。大家谈了些闲话，叙了些家常","en":"can only call by day, missing the true nocturnal beauty of the lanterns, we refrained from sending invitations.\\" Lady Hua expressed profound admiration at the description. Turning back to Miss Su, Mrs. Yuan added, \\"We are deeply grateful that your honored mother kept us in her thoughts and so kindly sent gifts.\\" \\"When you departed that day,\\" Miss Su replied, \\"mother noted"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"第五句用《毛诗》。这五句须要有韵，念出来才觉得铿锵入调。「苏小姐听了十分高兴，便问他姐姐要骰子出来，试行这令。华夫人道：「好虽好，只是难些，又要自然，又要有韵，你不怕费心么？」便命丫鬟取过骰盆，放了骰子，送与袁夫人道：","en":"Delighted by the challenge, Miss Su urged her sister to summon the dice. \\"It is a clever game, yet quite demanding,\\" Lady Hua said. \\"One must remain perfectly natural while holding to the rhyme. Is it not overly taxing?\\" She signaled a maid to fetch the dice tray, placed the ivory cubes within, and offered it to Mrs. Yuan, saying:"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":2,"tokens":["华夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"华夫人与苏小姐大赞，华夫人道：「这三句实在说得好，三句至五句尤妙。香心旖旎，读之令人心醉。这个恐我不能。」","en":"Lady Hua and Miss Su offered lavish praise. \\"The opening phrases are truly excellent, and the final three are utterly exquisite,\\" Lady Hua marveled. \\"The sentiment breathes such a warm, languorous beauty that it melts the heart to hear it. I fear I could never"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"袁夫人笑道：「你凡事总有一番谦退。及至行出令来，必定又十分用心，不肯让人一毫。」华夫人也笑了，即取过骰子，掷了几掷，掷了个铁索缆孤舟的色样，便想了一想，即念道：","en":"when your turn arrives, you summon immense effort, refusing to let anyone surpass you by even a hair's breadth.\\" Lady Hua smiled, took up the dice, and threw the pattern 'Iron Chains Mooring a Lone Boat.' Pausing briefly in thought, she softly recited:"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"必有警人之句，这五句如一句，比我的好得多了。这句《续西厢》更用得有趣。再要看兰妹的。想必更好，定是后来居上。」华夫人犹谦了几句。","en":"Younger Sister Lan will compose. Surely it will be finer still, proving that the last to speak surpasses the first.\\" Lady Hua merely offered a few graceful, self-effacing disclaimers."},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"道：「我说后来居上是不错的，兰妹这个令真教我五体投地，惟有贺一个满杯罢。」苏小姐颇自得意，喜孜孜的倒谦了一句。华夫人也赞道：「果然好。但也是掷着了那个好色样，成全了他。」也贺了一杯，并命伺候丫鬟们，每人都饮一杯酒，作个大犒三军，公贺将军挂印。十珠、六红等都饮毕，爱珠拉拉红雪的袖子，低低说道：「你们奶奶的五更转，甘与子同梦」，说得有情；我们奶奶的「铁索缆孤舟，搭着夜","en":"in congratulation.\\" Immensely pleased, Miss Su smiled while offering a gentle disclaimer. \\"It is truly fine,\\" Lady Hua agreed, \\"though fortune aided you in throwing so auspicious a pattern for your opening.\\" Offering her own cup of congratulation, Lady Hua commanded the attending maids to drink as well, serving as a grand reward to the three armies in honor of the victorious"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":2,"tokens":["华夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"样，觉得有点粗气。这个我们该贺。」各贺了一杯。袁夫人笑道：「你是李、杜大家，我是温、李靡艳，如何比得上你来？」华夫人笑道：「这首绝妙，与题相称。我想姐姐是骂二哥天天带着相公，在园里喝醉了回来，教姐姐腰围都清减了。」袁夫人颇不好意思，说道：「你来取笑我，你留心了色样，这是有还礼的。」华夫人、苏小姐皆笑，那十珠、六红等听了，也各微微的笑，听他们主人说笑，甚是有味。","en":"Fu, whilst I linger in the delicate, ornate shadows of Wen Tingyun and Li Shangyin. How can they be compared?\\" Lady Hua smiled knowingly. \\"It is absolutely exquisite and perfectly suited to the theme. I suspect Elder Sister is subtly scolding her husband for bringing his young actor companions to the garden each day, returning home so deep in his cups that she pines away,"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"华夫人取过骰子，掷了一个二士入桃源。也构思了一会，想着了几句妙语。但方才取笑了袁夫人，如今说出来，又恐他要报复，不觉迟迟的红泛桃腮。若改换了，便觉可惜，只得念道：","en":"Lady Hua cast the dice, revealing the pattern 'Two Gentlemen Entering the Peach Blossom Spring.' She spent a quiet moment gathering her thoughts, quickly weaving together several exquisite phrases. Yet, having just teased Mrs. Yuan, she feared a swift retaliation"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"苏小姐听了，对着华夫人微笑。袁夫人笑道：「你怎么忽然想起初嫁的时候来？这几句可谓风华旖旎已极。如见熏香对景，画眉人偎倚妆台，喃喃私语。","en":"Hearing this, Miss Su turned a knowing, luminous smile toward Lady Hua. Mrs. Yuan laughed softly: \\"What possessed you to suddenly dream of the days when you were newly wed? These phrases represent the very pinnacle of romantic, entwined devotion. One can almost envision a fragrant-hearted beauty leaning against her dressing"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"索口脂香。我们今日在此，未免不情。」华夫人笑道：","en":"rouge. We sit here today as mere guests, making it rather awkward for you to render us so entirely out of place.\\" Lady Hua laughed in surrender:"},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"华夫人先赞了好。袁夫人道：「你这个可谓温柔香艳之至矣，又恰是闺秀口气。我略比你长了几年，就说不到这样秀韵，这真是勉强不来的。」苏小姐只是含笑，又贺了一杯。那边红香低低对宝珠说道：「你听各人行的令，真像各人的语言情性，连相貌都像，这是什么缘故？若教彼此换一个","en":"Lady Hua was the first to offer her praise. Mrs. Yuan said, \\"Your verse achieves the very ultimate in gentle warmth and fragrant allure, capturing precisely the pure voice of a sheltered maiden from a noble house. Being a few years your senior, I find I can no"},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":3,"tokens":["华夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"华夫人、苏小姐大赞。华夫人道：「姐姐风流倜傥，情见乎词。这几句如见姐姐扶着婢女，一步步的走来，又像姐姐在园里看灯的光景，令人羡慕。」于是各贺了一杯。此时华夫人便叫宝珠等，同着两家的丫鬟到后房去吃饭。","en":"Lady Hua and Miss Su showered the verse with praise. \\"Elder Sister is so carefree and elegant, her true spirit glowing through her words,\\" Lady Hua marveled. \\"These lines conjure the very image of you leaning gracefully upon a maid's arm, stepping slowly through"},{"paragraph":30,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"也在那里当啷当啷的掷骰子，有些嗤嗤的笑，与互相褒贬讥诮之声。苏小姐道：「他们在那里行令呢，不知行出来的怎样？」华夫人笑道：","en":"playing the wine game as well,\\" Miss Su noted. \\"I wonder what manner of verses they are managing to compose?\\" Lady Hua laughed softly:"},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"袁夫人道：「这个也把你的情韵都写出来，我如见你在花阴之下，绿妥红酣，劳情自遣，真是碧桃花下神仙侣。」华夫人道：「觉得我的出语总平些，没有姐姐的灵警。今日终是姐姐考第一，一片的香腻光泽，都在字里头透出来，我只好甘拜下风。」袁夫人道：「那里！清华明艳，都被你们姐妹二人占尽了。","en":"dispelling the quiet longings of your heart. You are truly a companion fit for immortals beneath the jade-peach trees.\\" Lady Hua demurred gently: \\"I feel my lines inevitably fall flat, utterly lacking the electric, dazzling wit of Elder Sister's verse. Today, Elder Sister undeniably stands foremost. A seamless richness of fragrant warmth illuminates your every word, and I can"},{"paragraph":33,"mentions":2,"tokens":["华夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"。我看，如今你们二位共占了六斗，还有一个小才女，来抢了三斗，只剩一斗，天下闺秀分起来，到我分不到一合了。」说得华夫人、苏小姐皆笑。苏小姐道：「姐姐说那个小才女是谁家？」袁夫人道：「这人你们不认得么？是王质夫年伯的第二个女儿，名叫琼华，我们都是世姐妹。」华夫人道：「是通政司卿那位王年伯么？我们倒没有往来过。」苏小姐道：「这王琼华怎样好呢？」袁夫人道：「他今年十七岁，","en":"educated ladies of the world to divide amongst themselves. By the time the cup reaches me, nothing remains.\\" As Lady Hua and Miss Su laughed at her charming exaggeration, Miss Su asked, \\"And who is this 'small talent' you speak of?\\" \\"Do you truly not know her?\\" Mrs. Yuan asked in mild surprise. \\"She is the second daughter of our Senior Kinsman Wang Zhifu, named Wang Qionghua."},{"paragraph":36,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"袁夫人道：「你还说这格子眼无趣，倒成了这个好令，实在自然得很。」这一人三转，也有好一会工夫了。华夫人道：「停一停再行罢，我们且吃些菜，不是这么空费心的。」且搁下外边，说后房那些美婢．也在那里行令。有说得好，有说得不好，也有自己说不出，要找人代说的。虽不敢十分嬉笑，但也交头附耳，摩肩擦鬓的挤在一堆。这徐家的十二红，与华家的十珠，正是年貌相当、才力相敌","en":"rounds, a pleasant stretch of the afternoon had passed. \\"Let us rest and allow the game to pause for a moment,\\" Lady Hua suggested. \\"We should partake of the food rather than exhaust our minds for nothing.\\" We shall leave the ladies in the outer room for now and speak of the beautiful maids gathered in the back chambers, deeply engrossed in their own wine game. While some"},{"paragraph":44,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"上花朵也掉了，头发也弄得蓬蓬的，便把手掠了一会，骂荷珠道：「顽得这般粗卤。说说罢了，就要认真。」这一会闹，闹得华夫人、袁夫人都按捺不住了，便叫家人媳妇进来查问，不许他们顽笑。群婢才息声静气的，赶紧的吃了一碗饭，都出来伺候。夫人们看这一班顽婢，有闹得花朵歪斜的，鬓发蓬松的，还有些背转脸去要笑的，还有些气忿忿以眉眼记恨的，不觉好笑，只得对着爱珠等说道：「你们这么大了，","en":"but you had no right to take it to such violent extremes.\\" The chaotic commotion had now reached a pitch that Lady Hua and Mrs. Yuan could no longer ignore. They dispatched a senior married maidservant to investigate and strictly forbid any further rough play. The cluster of maids fell instantly into a terrified silence, hurriedly composing themselves and finishing their"},{"paragraph":45,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"华夫人笑道：「这些痴丫头，令人可恼又可笑。」苏小姐又问道：「你们若行着好令，不妨说出来，教我们也赏鉴赏鉴。如果真好，我还要赏你们。就是你们的奶奶也决不责备你们的。」","en":"Lady Hua laughed softly: \\"These foolish girls, they are at once maddening and entirely amusing.\\" Miss Su pressed further: \\"If any of your entries were truly clever, you may as well share them with us, for we would love to hear and appreciate them. If they are"},{"paragraph":46,"mentions":3,"tokens":["华夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"爱珠的光景似将要说，红香扯扯他的袖子，叫他不要说。爱珠道：「他们说的也多，也记不清了。」苏小姐急于要听，便对华夫人、袁夫人道：「他们是惧怕主人不敢说，你们叫他说他就说了。」华夫人也知道这些婢女有些小聪明，都也说得几个好的出来，便对袁夫人微笑。袁夫人本是个风流跌宕的人，心上也要显显他的丫鬟的才学，便说道：「你们说的只要通，就说说也不妨。若说出来不通，便各人跪着罚一","en":"\\"There were a great many verses, I cannot recall them all clearly.\\" Eager to hear the tale, Miss Su turned to Lady Hua and Mrs. Yuan: \\"They are terrified of their mistresses and dare not speak. But if you command them to recite, they surely will.\\" Knowing full well her maids possessed razor-sharp wits and had likely composed highly entertaining verses, Lady Hua exchanged"},{"paragraph":47,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"功，抵消这个过罢。」袁夫人道：「二妹说了，我也不敢不依，但也须警戒警戒他们。不然说惯了，一发肆无忌惮的。」便与华夫人评定这六个令，太恶者罚一大觞酒，打手掌三板，以示薄责；其次者罚酒免责。于是红雪、红霙、荷珠、宝珠受了责罚；爱珠、红雯单罚了酒。群婢受罚起来好不羞愧，又喝了这些急酒，觉得有些晃宕起来，勉强扎挣住了，深悔一时高兴。","en":"admonish them; if we do not, they will grow accustomed to such license and become completely unbridled.\\" She and Lady Hua then passed judgment upon the six entries: for the most egregious offenses, the penalty was a massive cup of wine to be drained in a single draft, accompanied by three sharp slaps of the palm as token chastisement. For the lesser offenses, a simple forfeit"},{"paragraph":48,"mentions":2,"tokens":["华夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"袁夫人见天色不早，也要散席，便笑对华夫人道：「你再掷一个色样，好好的说几句收令，也可解秽。」便叫一面拿饭。华夫人见天色也是时候，不好过迟，便命上菜吃饭。即取过骰子，掷了一个金菊对芙蓉，心里暗喜，这个名色甚好，便细细的一想，成了一个，念道：金菊对芙蓉，盘花卷烛红，却教我翠袖殷懃捧玉钟。醉太平","en":"lengthening as the day grew late, Mrs. Yuan realized the banquet must draw to a close. She smiled and turned to Lady Hua: \\"Throw the dice one final time and weave a few well-turned phrases to conclude our game. Let it be something pure and beautiful to cleanse the air after all this foolishness.\\" She softly instructed the maids to serve the rice. Seeing the hour was indeed"},{"paragraph":49,"mentions":2,"tokens":["华夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"袁夫人、苏小姐称赞不已。华夫人又劝他们二人喝了两杯酒，然后吃饭。洗漱已毕，袁夫人见夕阳欲下，不可迟延，便道谢告辞。华夫人、苏小姐带着十珠群婢送上了轿。六红扶着轿子，细行软步，一直到了穿堂外才上了车，流水般的走了。","en":"Mrs. Yuan and Miss Su praised the verse endlessly. Lady Hua warmly urged them both to drink two final cups, after which the rice was served and the magnificent meal gracefully concluded. Following the washing and rinsing of hands, Mrs. Yuan noted the evening sun slipping low on the horizon and knew she could"}],"16":[{"paragraph":10,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"说请你去讲一声，请他来就是了。」即吩咐林珊枝传谕总办，将魏师爷修金钦馔说定，富三连连答应几个「是」！又进去见了华夫人，就辞了，一径出城，通知了魏聘才，请其明日就去。","en":"steward that Master Wei's stipend and board were arranged. Fu the Third agreed repeatedly, paid his respects to Madam Hua, and then hurried out of the city to inform Wei Pincai, urging him to arrive the next day."}],"26":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说华公子进城到得府时，已上灯好一会。到上房坐了一坐，华夫人问了些怡园光景，华公子略说了些，便叫两个小丫鬟提了灯笼，走到星栊卧室来。只见灯光之下，照见那十婢，都着一色的白罗大绸衫子，头上挽了麻姑髻儿，后头仍拖着大辫子，当头插一球素馨花，下截是青罗镶花边裤，微露红莲三寸。见了公子进来，都是笑盈盈的两边站立。华公","en":"Hua returned to his city mansion, the evening lamps had long been lit. He rested briefly in the main hall while Lady Hua asked about the affairs at the Garden of Contentment. After sharing a few details, he summoned two young maids to carry lanterns and guide him to his Star-Lattice bedchamber. Beneath the soft lamplight, he found the ten maids waiting, all clad in identical"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":3,"tokens":["华夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"明早，华公子到底尚为酒困，身子有些疲软，早上就起得迟了。直到巳正方才起身，净了脸，丫鬟替他梳了发，穿好了衣裳。华夫人恐他酒后伤身，便叫小丫鬟送出一盏参汤，公子吃了。只见宝珠进来回道：「珊枝在外面请示爷，昨晚叫他去请魏师爷，今早要请不要请？」华公子略一踌躇道：「叫他去请魏师爷，到留青精舍吃早饭。」宝珠答应去了。华公子到上房，华夫人晓妆已完，丫鬟侍立两旁。公子见夫人淡","en":"until the hour of Si that he finally washed his face, allowed the maids to comb his hair, and dressed for the day. Lady Hua, concerned that the wine might have harmed his constitution, sent a maid with a bowl of medicinal ginseng soup, which he drank. Baozhu then entered to report, \\"Shanzhi is waiting outside to ask for your instructions. Do you still wish to invite Secretary"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":2,"tokens":["华夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"华夫人几次说要把花珠、宝珠收了，公子只是不要，说：「一做了妾，倒无趣了。不如等他们伺候几年，选几个青年美貌的配他，是件极有功德的事。还有一句话，若是夫人生得平常，自然就要到姬妾身上来。如今夫人是这么样的好，姬妾们虽好，也是比不上的。譬如草木杂花，未尝不娇艳","en":"Lady Hua had several times suggested taking Huazhu and Baozhu as concubines, but the Young Master always refused. \\"Once they become concubines, their charm will fade,\\" he would say. \\"It is better to let them serve for a few years and then arrange marriages with"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"进得去还求你？」又迟延了一回，爱珠故意刁难，倒是荷珠做好人进去了。半个时辰始听脚步响，是公子出来。原来华公子与华夫人说得高兴，忽然疲倦，就在他夫人床上躺了一回，却谁敢去惊动他，直到醒时已是未末。","en":"Meanwhile, Lin Shanzhi waited outside the Crimson Wash Pavilion, chatting with the Ten Pearls, unable to ascend and disturb the Master. Zengzhu said, \\"Earlier, I heard the Master dining with Madame upstairs. Their conversation was quite lively, so he is unlikely to emerge anytime soon.\\" Shanzhi sighed, \\"What is to be done? Secretary Wei has been summoned since dawn and has waited over two hours. I am famished myself. Have you all eaten?\\" Mingzhu replied, \\"We finished long ago. There are leftovers, if you don't mind eating them. It's impossible to guess when he will come out.\\" \\"Dear sister, your scraps are far beyond my meager fortune,\\" Shanzhi laughed. \\"I would be honored; how could I possibly disdain them?\\" Aizhu teased, \\"Such a silver tongue! I wager your eyes are hungry too.\\" She led him to a side room where summer dishes requiring no heating—both meat and vegetables—were laid out. Shanzhi ate his fill, wiped his hands, and resumed joking with the maids, but the Young Master still did not appear. As the afternoon wore on, Shanzhi grew anxious. \\"Will he come out or not? Keeping someone waiting like this... Dear Aizhu, please go and tell him that Secretary Wei is still waiting at the Quiet-Green Retreat.\\" \\"I won't carry your messages,\\" Aizhu retorted. \\"Go tell him yourself.\\" \\"Dear sister, if I could step inside, I wouldn't need to beg you.\\" After more delay, with Aizhu deliberately making things difficult, Hezhu finally relented and went inside. After an hour, footsteps sounded, and the Young Master emerged. He and his wife had talked until they were exhausted, and he had lain down for a while on his wife's bed. Naturally, no one dared to wake him, and he only stirred as the afternoon waned."}],"28":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":2,"tokens":["华夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"至明日，长庆即把琴言送到华府，公子又细细的打量了一回，心中甚喜，即拨在留青精舍伺候。又领他到华夫人处叩见，华夫人见他弱质婷婷，毫无优伶习气，也说了个「好」字，华公子是更不必说。琴言心上总是惦记子玉，也只好暗中洒泪，背地长吁。过了几天，见华公子脾气是正正经经的，没有什么歪缠之处，便也略觉放心。惟见了魏聘才，只是息夫人不言的光景，聘才也无可奈何，就要","en":"pleased, and assigned him to attend to them at the Quiet-Green Retreat. Qinyan was also led in to kowtow before Lady Hua. Observing his frail, graceful form and noting the complete absence of any vulgar actor's air, she uttered a single word of approval: \\"Good.\\" As for the Young Master's satisfaction, it goes without saying. Yet Qinyan's heart remained anchored to Ziyu;"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"你道珊枝是什么意思，敢作主意叫他出来？原来琴言刚进来半月光景，连华夫人都疼他，时常赏他东西。又常说：「这孩子老实，不像个唱戏的。」因此珊枝便动了酸意。想道：「我进来了三年多，也算第一分的人，他才进来几天，就这么样。脑袋又好，将来不要把我压下去。」如此一想，便要设法挤他。今日聘才的一番话，正好立主意，因此就应许他，便到了","en":"did Shanzhi dare to orchestrate such a scheme? Qinyan had only been in the mansion for half a month, yet even Lady Hua doted on him, frequently bestowing gifts and praising him: \\"This child is honest; he doesn't act like a theatrical performer at all.\\" This favoritism stoked the fires of Shanzhi's jealousy. He reasoned, \\"I have been here for over three years, holding"}],"41":[{"paragraph":5,"mentions":3,"tokens":["华夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"约有两刻工夫，听得环佩琤琤，华夫人带了明珠、花珠、荷珠、赠珠四个女婢过来，华公子笑面相迎。华夫人道：「这两日天气甚好，我本来也想逛逛。方才香儿说你在这里钓鱼，我从西书房夹道中走来，倒也不远。我又叫老婆子收拾些食品过来。」华公子道：「我本有此意，你倒预先办妥了。」二人凭阑观玩了一会，华","en":"After about half an hour, the sound of tinkling ornaments announced the arrival of Madam Hua, attended by four maidservants—Mingzhu, Huazhu, Hezhu, and Zengzhu. The young master stepped forward with a smile to welcome her. Madam Hua said: \\"The weather has been so fine these past two days—I had been meaning to take a stroll. A moment ago Xiang'er"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"曲榭，迭阁崇台，甚为华丽，红白碧桃已开了好些。公子对夫人道：「赏花不可无酒，方才说老婆子预备，不知可曾停妥？」华夫人命花珠去看来，花珠拉明珠同他弄船过去。明珠道：「你又来混缠，不过爱顽罢了，那里真不认得路径？你从这后头走过古藤书屋，再过了猗香亭，就通方才来的路，要坐什么船？」花珠原是爱顽，并非不认得路径，只得独自出去。将到藤花书屋前，只见林珊枝正走来，口中嚷道：「","en":"without wine. You mentioned just now that the servants had made preparations. I wonder whether they are ready yet?\\" Madam Hua sent Huazhu to go and look, and Huazhu tried to drag Mingzhu along to pole the boat with her. Mingzhu said, \\"There you go again with your nonsense. You simply want an excuse to play on the water. Do you not know the way? Go through the old-wisteria study"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"华夫人道：「我知道你爱这酒，已叫他们带了些来，但是没有什么很好的果品。既是祭花，这些食物，都用不着，你想将什么祭好呢？」公子笑道：「我倒被你问住了。年年祭花，也不过是些蔬果之类。这番是我们虔诚特祭，须得与花相称才好。」","en":"Madam Hua said: \\"I know how much you love that wine—I have already had some brought, though there are no particularly fine fruits to accompany it. If we are to make an offering to the flowers, ordinary food will hardly do. What, then, do you propose to offer?\\""},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":5,"tokens":["华夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"尽是古铜、旧玉等物。又将抽屉一开，见有一个紫檀木匣，开了盖子，看是个手卷，签上写着「花蕊夫人小像，管夫人画」。华夫人笑道：「这个就很好。」公子扯开看时，是个绢本工笔，画得秀艳绝伦。后有赵集贤书的小楷，就写的花蕊夫人《宫词》，真是双绝。公子道：「可惜就这一样，再找些什么配上呢？」华夫人道：「马四娘的兰花，可以不可以？」公子摇头道：「配不上，还是李香君那个桃花扇的册页","en":"lid, he saw it contained a hand scroll, its label inscribed: \\"Portrait of Lady Huarui, painted by Madam Guan.\\" Madam Hua smiled: \\"This is just the thing.\\" The young master unrolled it. It was an exquisite, meticulously detailed painting on silk, of surpassing delicacy and beauty. Appended in small regular script by Zhao Mengfu was Lady Huarui's own Palace Lyrics, forming"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"华夫人叫老婆子再去取一大瓶酒来，不要耽搁。公子道：「要这许多酒做什么？」夫人笑道：「我看这些丫头们见我们浇了花，觉得好馋似的，所以我要些酒来，也叫他们顽顽。」","en":"Madam Hua called one of the older maidservants to go and fetch another large jug of wine, and not to dawdle. The young master asked: \\"What do you need so much wine for?\\" His lady laughed: \\"I noticed that when we poured our offering on the flowers, all the maids"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"公子、夫人看了，好不快乐。华公子叫取两个锦褥来，就铺在花下，与夫人对面坐了。摆了攒盒，把那百花春对饮了几杯。华夫人道：「何不叫他们吹唱一回，以尽雅兴。」公子道：「很好，你就分派他们唱起来。」夫人将十珠分了五对，吩咐道：「你们各拣一枝，总要有句桃花在里头的。我派定了对，不是此唱彼吹，就是彼吹此唱。若唱错了，吹错了，要跪在花下，罚酒一大杯。」爱珠笑道：「奶奶这个令，","en":"lacquered partitioned box was laid out before them, and they drank several cups of the Hundred-Flowers Spring wine. Madam Hua said: \\"Why not have them sing and play a round, to complete our elegant pleasure?\\" The young master replied: \\"Excellent—you may assign their parts.\\" His lady divided the Ten Pearls into five pairs and gave her instructions: \\"Each pair is to select one"},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":3,"tokens":["华夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"夜春情散不收。\\n《尾声》唱完，公子与夫人甚是欢喜，十珠齐齐站起。公子道：「今日倒难为他们，须要赏他们些东西。」华夫人道：「此中要定个等第，才见赏罚分明。」即叫拿笔砚过来。爱珠抢先取了笔砚、花笺，送到公子面前。公子让夫人品定，夫人又推公子，公子道：「这音律中实在我不如你，恐定得不公，还是你定罢。」夫人微笑，把笔先写了十个字，就是珠字上面那个字，对公子道：「据我评来，","en":"said with a conciliatory smile, \\"I would venture to think that my singing was above both Ruizhu's and Zhenzhu's.\\" Madam Hua replied, \\"Just because you are unhappy with the ranking does not mean you know your own weaknesses. You were trying to show off your strengths and outshine the others, which led you to add embellishments not in the original. That is what is meant by"},{"paragraph":30,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"像有些委屈。如今告假一个多月，也不见他进来。其实看他也不像那种下作的，不知为什么心上总不喜欢，我实想不出来。」华夫人道：「我看这孩子，大抵是个高傲性子，像不是肯居人下的光景。但不知自己落到这个地位，也就无法。所谓「做此官，行此礼」，若妄自高傲，也真是胡涂人了。」华公子笑而不语。夫人赏那十珠的，记了一等是钗环，二等是香粉。","en":"seem like the common sort—yet I cannot fathom why he has never seemed content. I simply cannot understand it.\\" Madam Hua said: \\"In my observation, the boy is by nature proud—he does not appear to be the kind of person who willingly takes a place beneath others. But not knowing how he came to be in his present situation, there is nothing to be done. As the saying goes:"},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"黄不值钱，你还同他们一般见识呢？」这边华公子忽然念那《牡丹亭》上的两句道：「良辰美景奈何天，赏心乐事谁家院。」华夫人笑道：「《牡丹亭》的《游园惊梦》，可称旖旎风光，香温玉软。但我读曲时，想那柳梦梅的光景似乎配不上丽娘。」公子道：「我也这么想，觉柳梦梅有些粗气，自然不及丽娘。至于那《元人百种曲》只可唱戏，断不可读。若论文采词华，这些曲本只配一火而焚之。","en":"When Aizhu walked past, this maidservant called out, \\"Miss, what has the mistress been saying to you all? And I see she's written something on a list.\\" Aizhu laughed, \\"She is giving us presents.\\" The old woman said, \\"You young ladies truly have the blessed life, always receiving gifts. Miss, if you get something you do not want, pass it to me, don't let those little girls make waste of it.\\" Aizhu smiled and walked away. The little maidservant Xiang'er laughed and said, \\"They haven't even received their gifts yet, and you're already hoping for hand-me-downs. Tomorrow I'll buy you a clay wine-flask as a present, so you can store your spirits in it and not have to hold that handle-less jug bottom-up to drink from it. As for anything better, do you really think you're worthy?\\" The old woman was teased but dared not scold Xiang'er, so she could only open her eyes wide and stare. The other old maidservant sighed under her breath, \\"Alas, as they say, a pearl grown old and yellowed is worth nothing. Why bother arguing with them?\\" At this point the young master suddenly recited two lines from The Peony Pavilion: \\"A fine day and a beautiful scene, what good are they? Joy in the heart and delight in the eye, whose garden holds them?\\" His lady laughed, \\"The 'A Stroll in the Garden and the Interrupted Dream' scene of The Peony Pavilion is all languorous beauty, warm fragrance, and soft grace. Yet when I read that play, Liu Mengmei always seems somehow unsuited to Du Liniang.\\" The young master agreed, \\"I have always thought so too. There is a certain coarseness about Liu Mengmei that naturally falls short of Liniang's quality. As for *Hundred Yuan Plays*, they can only be performed on stage and are utterly unfit to be read. If one is to speak of literary artistry and lyrical brilliance, those scripts deserve nothing but to be thrown into the fire."},{"paragraph":33,"mentions":2,"tokens":["华夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"偏有那些人赞不绝口，不过听听音节罢了，这个曲文何能赞得一句好的出来？」华夫人道：「我想从前未唱时，或者倒好些。都是唱的人要他合这工尺，所以处处点金成铁。不是我说，那些曲本，不过算个工尺的字谱，文理之顺逆，气韵之雅俗，也全不讲究了。有曲文好些的，偏又没人会唱。从那《九宫谱》一定之后，人人只会改字换音，不会移宫就谱，也是世间一件","en":"but the sound of the music, though for the lyrics themselves, not a single fine sentence could be pointed out.\\" Madam Hua said, \\"I suspect that before they were set to music, the texts may have been somewhat better. It is the singers who must make them conform to the musical notation, and so at every point the gold is turned to iron. I do not mean to be harsh, but those"},{"paragraph":37,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"色一般，分外好看，看看天色也将晚了，便对公子道：「今日也可算尽兴，我有些乏了，进去罢。」便站起来，公子也起身。华夫人带了十珠等，将花蕊夫人的像与《桃花扇》，并他绣的《玉台新咏序》，都带进去，公子也同了夫人缓缓而行。到古藤书屋，又进去略坐了一坐。到了猗香亭，山石路径，险仄难行，群珠扶好了夫人，一步一步的走过。前面是一条青石荔枝街，平正得很的，又过三四处楼台，便进内室","en":"we have had our fill of pleasure. I am growing tired; let us go in.\\" She rose, and the young master also stood. Madam Hua, with her ten maids in attendance, gathered up the portrait of Lady Huarui, The Peach Blossom Fan album leaf, and her embroidered \\"New Songs from the Jade Terrace Preface\\", and they all set off slowly together. Reaching the old-wisteria study, they went"}],"44":[{"paragraph":16,"mentions":3,"tokens":["华夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"公子回房，见了夫人，欲不题起，心上又忍不住，就将子云与琴言出师的事说了。华夫人道：「什么叫作出师？」华公子道：「当年他师父也是花钱买的，所以挣的钱都归他师父。有人替他出了师，那就不算师父的人，由他自己作主了。昨日度香花二千四百两与琴言出师的。」华夫人道：「这么说，琴言就是度香的人了。」公子道：「可不是么！我心上实在有气，度香眼","en":"her of Ziyun's arrangement of Qinyan's release from indenture. \\"What does 'release from indenture' mean?\\" asked Madam Hua. \\"In the old days his shifu paid to have him, so all earnings went to the shifu,\\" the young master explained. \\"With his release, he is no longer considered the shifu's person and may act for himself. Yesterday Duxiang spent two thousand four hundred"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"消了一大半，口内答应了一句：「说得是。」但又舍不得琴言。忽又转念过来，欲行不可，欲罢不能，惟是无情无绪的光景。华夫人又宽解了一回，华公子只得暂为放开。过了一夜，明早忽又恼起来，叫珊枝将琴言的衣箱什物装了车，写了个帖儿，着珊枝亲到怡园，面交度香，看他怎样。珊枝只得遵命而行。","en":"\\"Duxiang's lord and our lord were the closest of friends — why damage a friendship of generations over Qinyan? My advice is that you need not act on this at all. When all is said and done, Qinyan is a performer — if this becomes a quarrel, both families will earn an unpleasant reputation for keeping company with such people.\\" The young master, who had always held his wife in great esteem, heard her speak with calm and reason, and felt more than half his anger dissipate. He murmured: \\"You are right.\\" Yet he could not quite let Qinyan go from his heart. He went back and forth in his mind — unable to act, unable to desist — and drifted through the day in a mood of empty restlessness. The mistress soothed him further. The young master could only try to put the matter aside for the time being. Through the night his grievance lay unresolved, and the next morning it flared up again without warning. He ordered Shanzhi to have Qinyan's clothing-chests and belongings loaded into a cart, wrote a letter, and directed Shanzhi to deliver it in person to the Garden of Contentment and hand it directly to Duxiang, to see what he would make of it. Shanzhi had no choice but to carry out the command."}],"48":[{"paragraph":3,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"年近五旬，夫人之外，尚有四位如君，贵承七叶，位列通侯，但艰于嗣子。正夫人止生了两位千金，长的是华夫人，第二位小姐也十九岁了，要选个才貌双全的女婿，所以还没有字人。","en":"the rank of marquis, lacking only a male heir. His principal wife had borne two daughters. The elder was already Lady Hua, and the younger, at nineteen, was still unbetrothed as they sought a son-in-law of exceptional talent and appearance."}],"49":[{"paragraph":9,"mentions":1,"tokens":["浣香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"么说比中状元还要喜呢？我那两位世妹，真是绝世无双，有名的苏氏二乔。大世妹就是华星北的夫人，今年二十一岁了，名叫浣香。方才说的二世妹，叫浣兰，一母所生的。若结了这个亲，就要叫你喜欢得说不出来，那时你才信我这句话。」春航听他说得这样好，似信不信的，便道：「怎样的好处，你如此称赞？你且把他的大概说说，你见过这人吗？」子云道「怎么没有见过？他姐妹两个跟着师母，常到我家来","en":"world, famous as the Two Qiaos of the Su clan. The elder sister is Young Master Hua's wife, now twenty-one, named Huanxiang. The younger sister you just mentioned is Huanlan, born of the same mother. If you secure this match, you will be so overjoyed you won't be able to speak; only then will you believe my words.\\" Hearing Ziyun praise her so highly, Chunhang half-believed"}],"52":[{"paragraph":22,"mentions":1,"tokens":["浣香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"明日，苏夫人请了他大姑奶奶浣香与徐子云夫人袁绮香去陪新，吃扶头卯酒。田太夫人请了王文辉的陆氏夫人，带了他大姑奶奶蓉华并媳妇孙少奶奶佩秋，又请刘守正的夫人，没有来，他媳妇吴少奶奶紫烟来了。周锡爵、杨方猷、陆宗沅的夫人都辞了。","en":"The next day, Lady Su invited her elder daughter Huanxiang and Xu Ziyun's wife, Yuan Qixiang, to accompany the bride and partake in the morning wine. Old Madam Tian invited Wang Wenhui's wife, Madam Lu, who brought along her elder daughter Ronghua and her daughter-in-law, Madam Sun Peiqiu. She also invited the"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":3,"tokens":["华夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"却说华夫人清早起来梳妆，群珠伺候打扮停妥，华公子进来，在妆台边坐了一会，忽然笑道：「不知二妹心里此时怎样，还是苦，还是乐？」华夫人笑了一笑，道：「亏你作姐夫的讲出这句话来。」群珠也都微笑。华夫人见公子的手内扇子，不是前日写的那一把，要过来看了一看，把这词念了一","en":"That morning, Lady Hua rose early to perform her toilette, attended flawlessly by her Pearl Maids. Young Master Hua entered, sitting by the dressing table for a moment before suddenly smiling, \\"I wonder what Second Sister is feeling in her heart right now—is it bitterness,"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":9,"tokens":["华夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「好词。这扇子那里来的？」公子道：「是陆素兰的。我爱这首词，所以带了他回来。」华夫人道：「这首词甚好，但不像是送朋友的。若送朋友，怎么有这「只道今生常厮守，盼银塘不隔秋河汉」呢？若说夫妇离别之词，又不像，说是赠妓的，也不甚像。然而语至情真，却有可取。」华公子笑道：「你真好眼力，这一评真评得不错。这首词是一个人送琴言的，可不是夫妇不像","en":"this fan come from?\\" Young Master Hua replied, \\"It belongs to Lu Sulan. I loved the lyric, so I brought it back.\\" Lady Hua said thoughtfully, \\"The lyric is excellent, but it does not read like a poem for an ordinary friend. If for a friend, why include lines like, 'I only thought this life we would forever stay together, hoping the silver pond would not be severed by the"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":6,"tokens":["华夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"人定席，徐夫人坐首席，徐夫人道：「老伯母怎么将侄女当作客了。这首席该定新亲，是要华家妹妹坐的。」田老夫人只得让华夫人坐，华夫人道：「这个侄女如何坐得？」即对徐夫人道：「姐姐，我姐妹不知叙过多少次了，怎么今日忽然推起来？」徐夫人道：「往日我就僭你，今日妹妹是新亲，况且你老远的出来，我又近在此，我如何僭得你来？」华夫人道：「今日姐姐是家母请来陪舍妹的，叫妹妹跟着姐姐过","en":"to the new relative; it is Sister Hua who must sit here.\\" Old Madam Tian had no choice but to offer the seat to Lady Hua, who immediately demurred, \\"How could this niece presume to sit here?\\" Turning to Madam Xu, she said, \\"Sister, you and I have socialized countless times; why are we suddenly standing on ceremony today?\\" Madam Xu replied, \\"In the past, I may have taken"},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"设或又派了他作起主考来，那就是坑死人了。太太你将我来比你，若论上半世呢，我也将就，论下半世，只怕就差得远了。」华夫人与刘少奶奶听他这一口清而且脆的话，听得甚有趣。又见他卷起大袖子，手上金钏、金镯碰得叮叮当当，那一种精明爽辣的样儿，倒也可爱。那边徐夫人笑道：「伯母倒也不必自谦，我看你们两位，一位是东华圣母，一位是南岳夫人，正是敌体。」新人坐了一坐，早已告退。这边太太","en":"compare my life to yours, perhaps my early years were passable, but in these later years, I fear I lag far behind.\\" Lady Hua and Liu's daughter-in-law listened with great amusement to her crisp, ringing speech. Seeing her rolled-up sleeves and hearing the clinking of her gold bracelets and bangles, they found her sharp, capable charm quite endearing. From the other table,"},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":2,"tokens":["华夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"正席上听了几出戏，放过了赏，散了席，太太奶奶们都到新房中坐。华夫人与他妹子说了好一会话，然后告辞。徐夫人要留他逛园，华夫人说晚了，改日再来奉拜罢，遂带了群珠登舆而去。徐夫人也即告辞，陆夫人同了女、媳回去，刘少奶奶也回，田老夫人一一相送。不知后事如何，且听下回分解。","en":"distributing the rewards, the feast dispersed, and the madams and young ladies all moved to the bridal chamber to sit. Lady Hua spoke with her sister for a long while before taking her leave. Madam Xu urged her to stay and stroll through the garden, but Lady Hua replied it was getting late, promising to return another day to pay her respects, and departed in her sedan chair with"}],"53":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["华夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说前回书中，华公子将自己扇子与素兰换了，后被华夫人问起来，方知将夫人写画的桃花扇子与了他，甚是懊悔。一日，即命家人去叫素兰，说明叫他带了前日的扇子来。那日素兰正在蕙芳处商议开那古董铺的事情，苏、陆之外，尚有袁宝珠、金漱芳、王兰保、李玉林要来，大家商议那古董书画等物公凑些起来，也就不少。况且怡园花木极","en":"The story continues from the previous chapter. After Young Master Hua had swapped fans with Sulan, Lady Hua had asked about it, and only then did he realize with deep regret that he had given away the peach-blossom fan painted and inscribed by his own wife. One day, he dispatched a servant to summon Sulan, specifically instructing him to bring that fan from"}],"54":[{"paragraph":6,"mentions":1,"tokens":["浣香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"不脱闺门气，无甚体裁。」蓉华道：「你看那些题词呢，要算谁的好？」琼华道：「那瑶因女史十首七绝，就做得好。还有那浣香、浣兰这几首七律，真是绣口锦心，香因慧果，这两人不知是那里人？」","en":"seven-character quatrains by the lady-scholar Yaoyin are excellent. Then there are these several regulated heptasyllabics by Huanxiang and Huanlan: truly embroidered words from brocade hearts, fragrant causes flowering into wisdom. I wonder where those two ladies come from?\\""},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":3,"tokens":["浣香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"蓉华道：「这两人我七月内都曾会过，有他们的诗么？我前日倒没有细看。」琼华翻了出来，蓉华看了道：「果然。这浣香、浣兰是苏年伯苏侯的女儿，浣香嫁与华家，浣兰就是田春帆新娶的夫人。这两姊妹真是才貌双全，世间少有的。」琼华道：「就是他们么？怪不得母亲回来这么夸奖他们。」佩秋道：「他们姊妹倒像双生似的，一模一样，比二位姑娘生得还要像些。」蓉华道：「我们虽是亲姊妹，其","en":"closely the other day.\\" Qionghua turned them up, and after reading Ronghua exclaimed, \\"They are excellent indeed. Huanxiang and Huanlan are the daughters of our old family friend, the Marquis of Su. Huanxiang married into the Hua family; Huanlan is Tian Chunhang's new wife. The sisters possess beauty and talent together—a thing rarely seen in this world.\\" \\"So it is they!\\""},{"paragraph":38,"mentions":2,"tokens":["苏浣香","华夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，遂成就了良缘爱果，自然也不像那梦中措大的光景。若像那梦中光景，岂不要将个琼华小姐气死了么？明日也请了袁绮香、苏浣香、浣兰、吴紫烟、王蓉华、孙佩秋来陪新人，群仙高会，又叙了一日。华夫人因是父亲得意门生，又是年伯母来请他，所以欣然而来。至排场热闹，与田家一样，不能细述。以后子玉闺房之乐，真是乐不可言。一个仕女班头，一个才人魁首，或早起看花，或迟眠玩月，或分题拈韵，或","en":"dream seduction scene. Had that dream become reality, Qionghua would have died of outrage. Next day Yuan Qixiang, Huanxiang, Huanlan, Ziyan, Ronghua, and Peiqiu came to accompany the bride—a gathering of near-immortals that lasted another full day. Lady Hua came gladly because Ziyu was her father's prized disciple and Lady Yan had invited her personally. The scale and excitement"}],"57":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["苏浣香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"且说徐子云的夫人袁绮香，生得婉娴柔静，贤淑无双，又且绣口锦心，才能咏絮。于十月初十日，请了华公子的夫人苏浣香、田春航的夫人浣兰、刘文泽的夫人吴紫烟、颜仲清的夫人王蓉华、梅子玉的夫人琼华、王恂的夫人孙佩秋。此时园中菊花开满，五色斑烂。是日晴光和蔼，风不扬尘，小毛衣服都用不着，绵的尽够了。袁绮香一早带了十二红婢，还有几个家人媳妇，先到园里候客。那日次贤、高品、","en":"Xie Daoyun's famous 'willow-fluff' poetry. On the tenth day of the tenth month, she invited Hua Gongzi's wife, Su Huanxiang; Tian Chunhang's wife, Huanlan; Liu Wenze's wife, Wu Ziyan; Yan Zhongqing's wife, Wang Ronghua; Mei Ziyu's wife, Qionghua; and Wang Xun's wife, Sun Peiqiu. By this time, the garden's chrysanthemums were in full bloom, a brilliant tapestry of five colors."},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":2,"tokens":["浣香","华夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"绮香道：「也差不多了，大约浣香来得迟些，自然先到浣兰处同来的。」家人媳妇报导：「王大姑奶奶与少奶奶、梅家少奶奶齐来了。」说罢，轿子已齐到堂前。姑嫂三位下了轿，一群仆妇、丫鬟随在后头。绮香一一迎接，见琼华打扮，今日分外妖艳，比陪新那一日，更添了几分娇娆姽婳。众姊妹序齿坐下，蓉华道：","en":"Qixiang said, \\"It is nearly time. Huanxiang will likely be the latest; she will naturally have gone to Huanlan's first so they could arrive together.\\" Just then, a serving-woman announced, \\"The elder and younger Wang ladies, along with the Mei family's young mistress, have all arrived.\\" Before"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":4,"tokens":["浣香","苏浣香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"苏氏姊妹见了琼华，分外亲爱，琼华见了浣香、浣兰，也十分亲热。这一班姊妹，大约同是瑶池会上人，都有夙契。绮香道：「今日我们众姊妹都是通家世好。苏家二浣，王氏双华，本是同胞，不用说了。我们一共七人，今日仿他竹林七贤，做个桃园结义，大家团拜一拜，以后遇着，就不许谦让。愚姐痴长，不识众位妹妹意下如","en":"sisters felt a special fondness for Qionghua at first sight, and Qionghua, in turn, was exceptionally warm toward Huanxiang and Huanlan. This circle of sisters might well have all been immortals from the Jade Pool banquet, as each pair seemed linked by deep, preordained karma. Qixiang said, \\"Today, we sisters are all from families with generations of friendship. The two Huans"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":1,"tokens":["浣香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"浣香道：「极高的所在，除非上山不可，但恐难走。」紫烟道：「我听说这园里有个缥缈亭是最高的，我们就到那缥缈亭上去罢。」蓉华道：「据我想，登山不如临水，且闻得路路走得通的。不如坐个船游他一转，望着那些景致，似乎比岸上还好些。」佩秋道：「说得是，又省力。若上山","en":"Huanxiang said, \\"The highest spots require going uphill, which I am afraid would be too difficult.\\" Ziyan suggested, \\"I hear there is a Pimiao Pavilion that is the absolute highest point. Let us go there.\\" Ronghua countered, \\"In my opinion, facing the water is"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":1,"tokens":["浣香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"绮香道：「可惜我们酒量都是有限。我新年无事，与我们老爷编了一个酒令，行起来颇为热闹，不论多少人，都放得进去。」浣香笑道：「这么说来，竟不是个酒令，是个阵图了。」绮香道：「却也有阵图在内。」蓉华道：「你且说这个令是怎样的？若要人多也不难，我们带着这些女兵，都叫过来，也就不少了。」","en":"compiled a drinking game with my husband. It is quite lively when played, and any number of people can join in.\\" Huanxiang laughed, \\"By that description, it's not a wine game at all—it is a battle chart!\\" Qixiang smiled, \\"There is indeed something of a battle chart to it.\\" Ronghua urged, \\"Tell us how this game works. If we need more people, we can easily call up all these"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":3,"tokens":["浣香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"了，倒累主人罚酒。」就先点自己的丫鬟，点了红香、红玉、红雪、红雯、红薇、红莲、红霙、红娟，其余那四个不能饮酒。浣香的十珠都可使唤，全点了。浣兰的四个丫鬟，只点了一个小翠，才十三岁，生得很好，且又灵变。又点了许三姐。琼华的四个丫头，点了一个青琴。蓉华两个丫头，点了一个秋莲。紫烟两个丫头，点了一个侍香。佩秋两个丫头，点了一个金凤。共二十四人。其余都命他们代酒。绮香即","en":"Hongxiang, Hongyu, Hongxue, Hongwen, Hongwei, Honglian, Hongying, and Hongjuan. Her other four maids could not drink. Huanxiang's Ten Pearls were all capable and were chosen in their entirety. Out of Huanlan's four maids, she selected only Xiaocui, a pretty and quick-witted thirteen-year-old, along with Miss Xu Sanjie. From Qionghua's four maids, Qingqin was chosen. Ronghua picked"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":2,"tokens":["浣香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"高兴，我秦国是兵强将勇，没有一个弱兵。待我且先派定了人数再说。他们共二十四人，我用六个，你们一家用三个。」即叫浣香的爱珠、花珠过来，道：「你两人到我大国来立些功业，不要在你那个小国埋没。」爱珠、花珠笑了，站了过来。绮香自己点了爱珠、花珠、红香、红玉、红雪、红霙，浣香自己留了宝珠、明珠、掌珠，浣兰留了许三姐、小翠，要了荷珠，紫烟留了侍香，要了红薇、赠珠，佩秋留了金","en":"numbers first. We have twenty-four servants. I will use six, and each of you will use three.\\" She then called out to Huanxiang's maids, Aizhu and Huazhu, \\"Come to my great kingdom and win true merit. Do not moulder away in your petty state.\\" Aizhu and Huazhu laughed and stepped over to her side. Qixiang chose Aizhu, Huazhu, Hongxiang, Hongyu, Hongxue, and Hongying for her own"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":1,"tokens":["浣香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"蓉华的赵国来，秋莲掣了廉颇，画珠掣了蔺相如，红雯掣了平原君。蓉华道：「我这三根掣得好，大可折秦国的锐气。」再掣浣香的魏国，宝珠掣了信陵君，明珠掣了侯生，掌珠掣了醇酒妇人，大家又笑起来。绮香道：「这倒难，又算酒，又算妇人，横竖一出马，就叫人开心的。」掌珠道：「换一根罢。」红香道：「好便宜事。」忙将筹拿开了。掌珠无奈，也只得捏了那根筹，脸上甚是羞愧。再掣浣兰的齐国，","en":"With the assignments set, Qixiang called for the seven small lot-tubes and drew for Qin first. Aizhu drew Bai Qi; Huazhu drew Lord Shang; Hongxiang drew Han Feizi; Hongyu drew Lü Buwei; Hongxue drew Li Si; and Hongying drew Zhao Gao. Qixiang laughed triumphantly, \\"You see? Both civil and military talents are perfectly complete.\\" They put away Qin's tube and drew for Chu. Shixiang drew Minister Ling Yin Zilan; Hongwei drew the Gaotang Goddess; and Zengzhu drew Song Yu. Ziyan groaned with a laugh, \\"We are done for! A flatterer, a dream goddess, and a romantic ghost. How can we possibly fight with them?\\" The others laughed and set Chu's tube aside. Next came Peiqiu's Yan lots: Jinfeng drew Jing Ke, Honglian drew Tian Guang, and Hongjuan drew a fine horse. Peiqiu sighed, \\"Not good. It feels ominous all the same.\\" Ronghua teased, \\"Before the army even marches, you have already lost two heads!\\" Laughter erupted again, and the tube was put away. For Zhao, Qiulian drew Lian Po, Yazhu drew Lin Xiangru, and Hongwen drew Lord Pingyuan. Ronghua beamed, \\"My three draws are excellent; we can easily blunt Qin's edge.\\" For Wei, Baozhu drew Lord Xinling, Mingzhu drew Hou Sheng; and Zhangzhu drew the Drunken-Woman lot. This sparked even more laughter. Qixiang noted, \\"That is an awkward one; it counts as both wine and a woman. Whichever element rides out first will surely cheer everyone up.\\" Zhangzhu pleaded, \\"Let me swap the lot.\\" Hongxiang quickly interjected, \\"An easy bargain!\\" and snatched the chip away. Zhangzhu had no choice but to keep her lot, her face burning red. Next was Qi's draw. Huanlan murmured, \\"My state will be quite ordinary. We probably have no strong lots inside. Nothing like Ronghua's Lian Po and Lin Xiangru.\\""},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":3,"tokens":["浣香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"又击鼓传花，到了浣香，数宝珠出马。浣香笑道：「这是我们的福将，四公子中的魁首，看你们什么人来抵敌罢。」那边数到了红雪，是李斯。绮香道：「好个对手。」看谱：「信陵君是运筹点将令。」就拿上一筒酒筹来，宝珠掣了一枝看时，是「蜡照半笼金翡翠。」注：「席中戴金条脱、玉钏者饮一杯。","en":"The drum beat and the flower was passed again, stopping this time with Huanxiang. The dice sent Baozhu forth. Huanxiang smiled, \\"Here is our lucky general, the true champion among the Four Lords. Let us see who dares to meet him.\\" On Qin's side, the lot fell to Hongxue, representing Li Si. Qixiang said, \\"A worthy foe indeed.\\" The"},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":2,"tokens":["浣香","华夫人"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"轮到掌珠，是醇酒妇人，令是掷色，若输了，跪请本国王与敌国王出令。掌珠掷了么二三，红雪掷了四五六。掌珠跪在浣香面前求救出令，把个华夫人笑得不止，便道：「出什么令呢？」便对绮香道：「我有一个集词牌成韵的，两句三字，一句七字，要凑拍。」便念道：「宴清都，清平乐，八声甘州金缕曲。姐姐也照样说一个。」绮香道：「这个倒难，词牌我也不甚熟，比不得你是长填词的，这倒被你难","en":"issue a command. Zhangzhu threw a one-two-three; Hongxue threw a four-five-six. Defeated, Zhangzhu knelt before Huanxiang, begging for a command, and Madam Hua could not stop laughing. \\"What command?\\" she asked, turning to Qixiang. \\"I have a rhyme made of lyric titles: two three-character lines and one seven-character line, tightly fitted.\\" She recited, \\"*Feast in the Celestial"},{"paragraph":30,"mentions":4,"tokens":["浣香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"浣香道：「姐姐不要谦，请说来。」绮香想了一想，也念道：「高阳台，尉迟杯，貂裘换酒醉蓬莱。」浣香道：「拜服，拜服，姐姐说得这样凑拍，还说不熟呢！」那五位佳人都赞道：「两人都说得好，我们公贺一杯，为两盟主寿。再请多说几个，大家听听。」浣香道：「就是七个字的难","en":"Huanxiang urged, \\"Sister, do not be modest. Go on.\\" Qixiang thought for a moment and recited, \\"*Gaoyang Terrace*, *Yuchi Cup*, *Sable Coat Exchanged for Wine*, *Drunk in Penglai*.\\" Huanxiang was impressed, \\"I bow to you! I bow! You fitted it so neatly and still"},{"paragraph":33,"mentions":2,"tokens":["浣香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"红娟道：「这个马吊色样我记不清楚，奶奶须与我记着。」浣香应了。红娟出了一个食指，一个小指，红玉偏偏出了一个小指，刚刚凑成一百两极，是个双尾蝎。浣香道：「这个就六十贺。」绮香道：「这倒好，叫通场伺候的都喝一杯。」红玉两手齐出，是一个食指，两个小指，红娟出了一个小指，是一百三极，凑成了玉鲫鱼背，又是一百贺。佩","en":"Hongjuan said, \\"I cannot keep these madiao patterns straight—my lady must remember them for me.\\" Huanxiang agreed. Hongjuan put out a forefinger and a little finger, and Hongyu, as it happened, put out a little finger: together they made exactly 'a hundred with two extremes'—the Double-Tailed Scorpion. Huanxiang said, \\"That is sixty toasts.\\" Qixiang said,"},{"paragraph":34,"mentions":1,"tokens":["浣香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"于是传花又传到浣兰，点将出马是荷珠孟尝君，那边点了红霙的赵高。浣香笑道：「赵高如何是孟尝君的对手？且看谱来。」孟尝君是食客三千，令两人用骰子六颗对掷，如遇红遇么者，出钱投于盆内，六红即投六钱，两红两么即投四钱，无红无么即赢此钱。如孟尝君赢了，问那人：「你有的是什么？没有的是什么？要的是什么？不要的是什么？那人每件说","en":"Huanlan, whose commission sent forth Hezhu as Lord Mengchang, while the other side appointed Hongying as Zhao Gao. Huanxiang laughed, \\"How is Zhao Gao any match for Lord Mengchang? Let us see the rules.\\" Lord Mengchang kept three thousand table-guests, so the two were to cast six dice against each other: whenever reds or aces turned up, coins were thrown into the basin—six"},{"paragraph":35,"mentions":1,"tokens":["浣香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"：红珠斗帐樱桃熟。」荷珠道：「你不要的呢？」红霙道：「我不要的是：春入眉心两点愁。」众佳人都赞道：「说得好。」浣香对绮香道：「姐姐，足见你强将手下无弱兵。你的婢女都是这样绣口锦心，真令人羡慕之至。」绮香道：「他们虽然记得几句诗，然那里及得尊婢们般般皆会。」荷珠听他主人称赞红霙，心中有些不服，便说道：「这四句却说得好，但忘了你是赵高，一个老公，也配用这些东西？」","en":"I do not want is: 'Spring entering the brow with two points of sorrow.'\\" The beauties all cried, \\"Well said!\\" Huanxiang said to Qixiang, \\"Sister, it is plain that under a strong general there are no weak soldiers. That your very maids should have such embroidered mouths and brocade hearts—it makes one envious beyond measure.\\" Qixiang said, \\"They may remember a few lines"},{"paragraph":36,"mentions":1,"tokens":["浣香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"有的是：细草春香小洞幽。你没有的是：娇娆意绪不胜羞。。你要的是：鸳鸯帐下香犹暖。你不要的是：嫁个萧郎爱远游。」浣香听了，笑骂荷珠道：「荷儿怎么这般轻薄？」绮香正笑着，尚未开口，红霙气极要打起荷珠来，荷珠再四的赔礼，群珠又与他央求，红霙方才饶他。众佳人笑道：「荷姑娘这几句太刻薄，幸遇着人多，不然是挨定□姑娘的打。」到了小翠的鸡鸣来了，小翠上来就有些发怯。看谱是接牌","en":"curtains the fragrance still warm.' What you do not want is: 'To marry a young Xiao who loves to roam afar.'\\" At this Huanxiang laughingly scolded Hezhu: \\"He'er, how can you be so saucy?\\" Qixiang was still laughing and had not yet spoken when Hongying, in a fury, made to strike Hezhu; Hezhu apologized over and over, the other maids pleaded for her, and only then did Hongying"},{"paragraph":48,"mentions":1,"tokens":["浣香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"与主人争个脸。」青琴笑道：「我这椎是要椎椎打中的。」浣兰道：「你若赢了他们，非但与你主人争气，且与我等报仇。」浣香道：「这闷雷、劈雷是可以乱打的，你也不必容情，连他们的国王也可打得的。」佩秋道：「你若像了秋莲的廉颇，就不好了。」紫烟道：「也不要像我们荆轲的匕首。」你一句，我一句的说笑。绮香笑道：「谅此孤军深入重地，焉有生还之理？」便命六人一齐上前，与青琴对敌。","en":"smiled confidently, \\"My hammer strikes true with every swing.\\" Huanlan added, \\"Beat them, and you avenge us all.\\" Huanxiang urged, \\"Dull and split thunder may strike wildly. Do not spare them—not even their king.\\" Peiqiu warned, \\"Do not be Qiulian's Lian Po.\\" Ziyan chimed in, \\"Nor our Jing Ke's dagger.\\" Banter flew across the room. Qixiang laughed heartily, \\"This lone army,"},{"paragraph":50,"mentions":3,"tokens":["浣香"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"浣香见天色已晚，便要进城，浣兰要留他，浣香不肯，定要回去。绮香见太阳已落，也不好挽留，只得先送了浣香，便说道：「你们是不要紧，又不赶城，到三更再散不迟。」十珠婢收拾零星，大家都下船渡过了河，直送到山下，上了轿出园。","en":"Huanxiang, seeing the approaching dusk, wished to return to the city. Huanlan urged her to stay, but she gently refused. Qixiang saw that the sun had set and could not insist. She saw Huanxiang off first, then said to the others, \\"The rest of you need not rush"}]}`),"char-154":JSON.parse(`{"11":[{"paragraph":4,"mentions":1,"tokens":["浣兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"七步随口。这华夫人母家姓苏，父名臣泰，也是功臣之后，世袭列侯，现任兵部尚书。并无嗣子，只生二女：长名浣香，次名浣兰，皆生得华容绝代，每于花下闲行，有百蝶随舞。精于诗词音律，书画琴棋，各臻微妙。外间有两句口号说道：「不愿得龙宫十斛珠，只愿」一见侯门大小苏。」这浣香十八岁上嫁了华光宿，真是瑶琴玉瑟，鱼水和谐，说不尽咏月吟风，闺房潇洒。又有十个美婢，名字都有一个珠字，","en":"President of the Board of War. Lacking sons, he cherished his two daughters: the elder, Huanxiang, and the younger, Huanlan. Both were endowed with surpassing, celestial beauty. When they strolled languidly amidst the gardens, a hundred butterflies would flutter and dance in their wake. They were masters of poetry, musical theory, calligraphy, and painting, equally adept"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":3,"tokens":["浣兰","苏小姐"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这日华夫人知其胞妹浣兰小姐要来，复又见徐府中送了十样珍玩，知袁夫人也要来，与华公子清早拜过了家庙，供过了佛。公子本要再与夫人家宴一天，因他姨妹与盟嫂来，只好回避。不一会苏小姐已到，香车到了穿堂，用软肩舆一直抬进了内堂院子里，四个丫鬟扶了小姐下轿，华夫人出接，姐妹二人见了礼","en":"Knowing her younger sister, Miss Huanlan, would attend, Lady Hua was further delighted by the arrival of the Xu household's ten precious curios, signaling Mrs. Yuan's impending visit. Rising early, she and the young master offered reverent respects at the ancestral shrine and the Buddhist altar."},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":1,"tokens":["苏小姐"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"苏小姐道：「十一那一天，家母遣人来问候姐姐。来人回来说：姐姐花园里请些太太们赏灯。他把那些灯，足足就讲了半天，说试一回要用几千人，说得天花乱坠，教我晚间做梦竟到姐姐园里来看灯，又并没有看见。」","en":"Miss Su recounted, \\"On the eleventh, my mother dispatched a servant to inquire after your health. The messenger returned to report that your sister had hosted a gathering of ladies in her garden to admire the lanterns. He spent half the day spinning tales of"},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":4,"tokens":["苏小姐"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"日，也没有空得一日。又因你们都在城里，只得日间来看，不能晚上赏玩，所以没有来请。」华夫人也甚为羡慕。袁夫人又对苏小姐道：「承年伯母惦记，又赏东西。」苏小姐道：「家母那日因姐姐回去时，说有些不快，心上常惦记着呢。」袁夫人又欠身谢了。十珠婢与苏小姐的丫鬟，都向袁夫人请了安。袁夫人的六红婢，也向华夫人、苏小姐请了安。大家谈了些闲话，叙了些家常，华夫人便要唱戏。袁夫人道：","en":"refrained from sending invitations.\\" Lady Hua expressed profound admiration at the description. Turning back to Miss Su, Mrs. Yuan added, \\"We are deeply grateful that your honored mother kept us in her thoughts and so kindly sent gifts.\\" \\"When you departed that day,\\" Miss Su replied, \\"mother noted you seemed somewhat indisposed, and you have lingered in her thoughts ever"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":1,"tokens":["苏小姐"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"句用五言唐诗，第三句用《西厢》曲文，第四句用曲牌名，第五句用《毛诗》。这五句须要有韵，念出来才觉得铿锵入调。「苏小姐听了十分高兴，便问他姐姐要骰子出来，试行这令。华夫人道：「好虽好，只是难些，又要自然，又要有韵，你不怕费心么？」便命丫鬟取过骰盆，放了骰子，送与袁夫人道：","en":"weave into a single rhyme, ringing out with a pleasing, poetic cadence when spoken.\\" Delighted by the challenge, Miss Su urged her sister to summon the dice. \\"It is a clever game, yet quite demanding,\\" Lady Hua said. \\"One must remain perfectly natural while holding to the rhyme. Is it not overly taxing?\\" She signaled a maid to fetch the dice tray, placed the ivory cubes"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":1,"tokens":["苏小姐"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"华夫人与苏小姐大赞，华夫人道：「这三句实在说得好，三句至五句尤妙。香心旖旎，读之令人心醉。这个恐我不能。」","en":"Lady Hua and Miss Su offered lavish praise. \\"The opening phrases are truly excellent, and the final three are utterly exquisite,\\" Lady Hua marveled. \\"The sentiment breathes such a warm, languorous beauty that it melts the heart to hear it. I fear I could never weave anything"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":1,"tokens":["苏小姐"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"苏小姐性急，急于要掷，也无暇谦让，把骰子盆移过来，当当啷掷了好几掷，才掷成了一个将军挂印，好不喜欢。便把秋波凝注，想了一想，凑成了五句，即笑吟吟的念将出来，是：","en":"Impatient and eager, Miss Su abandoned all pretense of modesty, pulling the dice tray eagerly toward herself. With a sharp clatter, she threw the pattern 'A General Hangs His Seal.' Delighted, she narrowed her autumn-water eyes in deep concentration, arranged her thoughts, and recited"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":1,"tokens":["苏小姐"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"袁夫人赞道：「我说后来居上是不错的，兰妹这个令真教我五体投地，惟有贺一个满杯罢。」苏小姐颇自得意，喜孜孜的倒谦了一句。华夫人也赞道：「果然好。但也是掷着了那个好色样，成全了他。」也贺了一杯，并命伺候丫鬟们，每人都饮一杯酒，作个大犒三军，公贺将军挂印。十珠、六红等都饮毕，爱珠拉拉红雪的袖子，低低说道：「你们奶奶的五更转，甘与子同梦」，说得","en":"me in absolute admiration; I can offer nothing less than a brimming cup in congratulation.\\" Immensely pleased, Miss Su smiled while offering a gentle disclaimer. \\"It is truly fine,\\" Lady Hua agreed, \\"though fortune aided you in throwing so auspicious a pattern for your opening.\\" Offering her own cup of congratulation, Lady Hua commanded the attending maids to drink as"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":2,"tokens":["苏小姐"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"苏小姐赞道：「姐姐这个实在好极，怎么能说这般蕴藉风流。为什么我说不到这样，觉得有点粗气。这个我们该贺。」各贺了一杯。袁夫人笑道：「你是李、杜大家，我是温、李靡艳，如何比得上你来？」华夫人笑道：「这首绝妙，与题相称。我想姐姐是骂二哥天天带着相公，在园里喝醉了","en":"Miss Su sighed in admiration: \\"Elder Sister, this is truly magnificent. How do you summon words steeped in such delicate, graceful allusion? My own efforts feel impossibly blunt and coarse by comparison. We must surely congratulate you for this.\\" They each raised"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":1,"tokens":["苏小姐"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"苏小姐听了，对着华夫人微笑。袁夫人笑道：「你怎么忽然想起初嫁的时候来？这几句可谓风华旖旎已极。如见熏香对景，画眉人偎倚妆台，喃喃私语。","en":"Hearing this, Miss Su turned a knowing, luminous smile toward Lady Hua. Mrs. Yuan laughed softly: \\"What possessed you to suddenly dream of the days when you were newly wed? These phrases represent the very pinnacle of romantic, entwined devotion. One can almost envision a"},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":1,"tokens":["苏小姐"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"又到了苏小姐，掷了一个梅梢月上，想了一想念道：梅梢月上，花树香玲珑，人间玉容深锁绣帏中。琐窗寒，零露浓浓。","en":"The turn fell once more to Miss Su, who rolled 'Moonrise Above the Plum Branch.' After a brief contemplation, she recited:\\n\\n\\"Moonrise above the plum branch,\\nFragrant and translucent the flowering tree,\\nThe jade face of the beloved, deep-locked within the embroidered bed-curtains.\\nCold"},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":1,"tokens":["苏小姐"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"袁夫人道：「你这个可谓温柔香艳之至矣，又恰是闺秀口气。我略比你长了几年，就说不到这样秀韵，这真是勉强不来的。」苏小姐只是含笑，又贺了一杯。那边红香低低对宝珠说道：「你听各人行的令，真像各人的语言情性，连相貌都像，这是什么缘故？若教彼此换一个过儿，就便都不像本人了。」宝珠等微笑。袁夫人又取过骰子来，掷了一个观灯十五夜。","en":"I find I can no longer summon such delicate, exquisite innocence. It is a grace that truly cannot be forced.\\" Miss Su responded with a serene smile as another round of wine was shared. Beyond the curtain, Hongxiang leaned close to Baozhu, whispering, \\"Have you noticed? Each lady's verse perfectly mirrors her own voice, her deepest feelings, even her very appearance."},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":1,"tokens":["苏小姐"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"苏小姐道：「这是姐姐的本地风光、可以把那些百鸟百兽，神龙癞象，火树银花，一齐说出来，做个热闹灯节了。」袁夫人笑道：「我也这么想，但我未必有这力量。」想了一会凑不上来，只得重换了，念道：观灯十五夜，未醉岂劳扶，一声声道不如归去。步步娇，谓行多露。","en":"\\"This is Elder Sister's true domain,\\" Miss Su said. \\"Surely you can paint for us the hundreds of birds and beasts, the divine dragons and mottled elephants, the fire-blossomed trees and cascading silver flowers, conjuring the grand, festive spectacle of your lantern festival.\\" Mrs. Yuan laughed:"},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":1,"tokens":["苏小姐"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"华夫人、苏小姐大赞。华夫人道：「姐姐风流倜傥，情见乎词。这几句如见姐姐扶着婢女，一步步的走来，又像姐姐在园里看灯的光景，令人羡慕。」于是各贺了一杯。此时华夫人便叫宝珠等，同着两家的丫鬟到后房去吃饭。","en":"Lady Hua and Miss Su showered the verse with praise. \\"Elder Sister is so carefree and elegant, her true spirit glowing through her words,\\" Lady Hua marveled. \\"These lines conjure the very image of you leaning gracefully upon a maid's arm, stepping slowly through the night,"},{"paragraph":30,"mentions":1,"tokens":["苏小姐"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这边伺候的人，已少了好些。袁夫人听得后房也在那里当啷当啷的掷骰子，有些嗤嗤的笑，与互相褒贬讥诮之声。苏小姐道：「他们在那里行令呢，不知行出来的怎样？」华夫人笑道：","en":"mingled with bursts of laughter and the playful barbs of mutual teasing. \\"They are playing the wine game as well,\\" Miss Su noted. \\"I wonder what manner of verses they are managing to compose?\\" Lady Hua laughed softly:"},{"paragraph":33,"mentions":4,"tokens":["苏小姐"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"如今你们二位共占了六斗，还有一个小才女，来抢了三斗，只剩一斗，天下闺秀分起来，到我分不到一合了。」说得华夫人、苏小姐皆笑。苏小姐道：「姐姐说那个小才女是谁家？」袁夫人道：「这人你们不认得么？是王质夫年伯的第二个女儿，名叫琼华，我们都是世姐妹。」华夫人道：「是通政司卿那位王年伯么？我们倒没有往来过。」苏小姐道：「这王琼华怎样好呢？」袁夫人道：「他今年十七岁，相貌是没","en":"ladies of the world to divide amongst themselves. By the time the cup reaches me, nothing remains.\\" As Lady Hua and Miss Su laughed at her charming exaggeration, Miss Su asked, \\"And who is this 'small talent' you speak of?\\" \\"Do you truly not know her?\\" Mrs. Yuan asked in mild surprise. \\"She is the second daughter of our Senior Kinsman Wang Zhifu, named Wang Qionghua. We are"},{"paragraph":34,"mentions":1,"tokens":["苏小姐"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"改日我抄一篇出来送给你。」于是各人饮了一杯酒，又吃了些菜。听后房那些婢女们好掷得高兴，说笑的说笑，罚酒的罚酒。苏小姐又掷了一个格子眼，笑道：「这个好无趣。」想了一会。","en":"\\"Does Elder Sister happen to remember the verses of this poem?\\" Miss Su asked eagerly. \\"I cannot recall it fully,\\" Mrs. Yuan admitted, \\"but on another day, I shall transcribe it carefully and send it to you.\\" They each drank another cup of wine and ate a little. From the back room, the lively commotion of the maids grew"},{"paragraph":44,"mentions":1,"tokens":["苏小姐"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"大了，怎么还这样顽皮？若不为着有客在此，我今日必要责罚你们。」袁夫人也说了六红婢几句，群婢低首侍立，面有愧色。苏小姐问道：「你们行的什么令？这般好笑。」群婢中又有些抿嘴笑起来，倒惹得两位夫人也要笑了。","en":"the Six Reds. The maids bowed their heads deeply, standing in contrite silence. Unable to contain her curiosity, Miss Su asked, \\"What manner of verses were you playing at in there? What on earth was so terribly funny?\\" At this, several of the maids failed to hold back their smiles, which in turn brought both ladies to the very brink of laughter themselves."},{"paragraph":45,"mentions":1,"tokens":["苏小姐"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"华夫人笑道：「这些痴丫头，令人可恼又可笑。」苏小姐又问道：「你们若行着好令，不妨说出来，教我们也赏鉴赏鉴。如果真好，我还要赏你们。就是你们的奶奶也决不责备你们的。」","en":"Lady Hua laughed softly: \\"These foolish girls, they are at once maddening and entirely amusing.\\" Miss Su pressed further: \\"If any of your entries were truly clever, you may as well share them with us, for we would love to hear and appreciate them. If they are genuinely fine, I shall even bestow a reward upon you. And I promise your mistresses will not scold"},{"paragraph":46,"mentions":2,"tokens":["苏小姐"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"爱珠的光景似将要说，红香扯扯他的袖子，叫他不要说。爱珠道：「他们说的也多，也记不清了。」苏小姐急于要听，便对华夫人、袁夫人道：「他们是惧怕主人不敢说，你们叫他说他就说了。」华夫人也知道这些婢女有些小聪明，都也说得几个好的出来，便对袁夫人微笑。袁夫人本是个风流跌宕的人，心上也要显显他的丫鬟的才学，便说道：「你们说的只要通，就说说也不妨。若说出来","en":"silent. Aizhu demurred, \\"There were a great many verses, I cannot recall them all clearly.\\" Eager to hear the tale, Miss Su turned to Lady Hua and Mrs. Yuan: \\"They are terrified of their mistresses and dare not speak. But if you command them to recite, they surely will.\\" Knowing full well her maids possessed razor-sharp wits and had likely composed highly entertaining verses,"},{"paragraph":47,"mentions":1,"tokens":["苏小姐"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，强住了笑，说道：「你们这般轻薄，还了得？传了出去，叫你们有什么颜面见人，还不跪下！」六婢含羞，只得当筵跪了。苏小姐替他们讨饶道：「二位姐姐，看我面上，恕他们初次。虽是风流口过，也亏他们心灵口敏。将他们这个功，抵消这个过罢。」袁夫人道：「二妹说了，我也不敢不依，但也须警戒警戒他们。不然说惯了，一发肆无忌惮的。」便与华夫人评定这六个令，太恶者罚一大觞酒，打手掌三板，","en":"you!\\" Blushing furiously with deep shame, the six maids had no choice but to kneel before the gathered company. Miss Su quickly interceded on their behalf: \\"Two dear sisters, for my sake, I beg you to forgive them this first offense. Though their words were highly improper and excessively free, we must grant them credit for their lightning-quick wits and nimble tongues."},{"paragraph":49,"mentions":2,"tokens":["苏小姐"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"袁夫人、苏小姐称赞不已。华夫人又劝他们二人喝了两杯酒，然后吃饭。洗漱已毕，袁夫人见夕阳欲下，不可迟延，便道谢告辞。华夫人、苏小姐带着十珠群婢送上了轿。六红扶着轿子，细行软步，一直到了穿堂外才上了车，流水般的走了。","en":"Mrs. Yuan and Miss Su praised the verse endlessly. Lady Hua warmly urged them both to drink two final cups, after which the rice was served and the magnificent meal gracefully concluded. Following the washing and rinsing of hands, Mrs. Yuan noted the evening sun slipping"},{"paragraph":50,"mentions":1,"tokens":["苏小姐"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这边苏小姐直到二更天才回去。不知后事如何，且听下回分解。","en":"As for Miss Su, she did not return to her own estate until the second watch of the deep night. To learn what transpired next, you must hear the tale told in the following chapter."}],"49":[{"paragraph":9,"mentions":1,"tokens":["浣兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"那两位世妹，真是绝世无双，有名的苏氏二乔。大世妹就是华星北的夫人，今年二十一岁了，名叫浣香。方才说的二世妹，叫浣兰，一母所生的。若结了这个亲，就要叫你喜欢得说不出来，那时你才信我这句话。」春航听他说得这样好，似信不信的，便道：「怎样的好处，你如此称赞？你且把他的大概说说，你见过这人吗？」子云道「怎么没有见过？他姐妹两个跟着师母，常到我家来看我们家母，且与我内人是","en":"elder sister is Young Master Hua's wife, now twenty-one, named Huanxiang. The younger sister you just mentioned is Huanlan, born of the same mother. If you secure this match, you will be so overjoyed you won't be able to speak; only then will you believe my words.\\" Hearing Ziyun praise her so highly, Chunhang half-believed him and asked, \\"What is so wonderful about her that"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":1,"tokens":["苏小姐"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"后来定于七月初七日。春航将此事与蕙芳说明，蕙芳也替他欢喜。春航又述子云之言，说这位苏小姐像你竟到九分。蕙芳笑道：「这不是糟蹋人么？一个千金小姐像了我，还说好，我们算什么人呢？」春航道：「只怕未必如你。若果然像你，我就心满意足了，当他菩萨供养，天天拜他。」蕙芳笑道：「你嘴里常说，我就没见你拜过谁。」春航笑道：「你要我拜么，我就拜。」果然先","en":"the matter to Huifang, who also rejoiced for him. Chunhang then recounted Ziyun's words, saying, \\"He says this Miss Su resembles you nine parts out of ten.\\" Huifang laughed, \\"Isn't that just insulting her? For a young lady of a noble house to look like me, and for that to be called good—what sort of people are we supposed to be?\\" Chunhang said, \\"I only fear she might"}],"53":[{"paragraph":13,"mentions":1,"tokens":["苏小姐"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，到开市那几天，搬到那边去罢。」春航知道他们要开铺子，又闻得华公子、徐度香帮了许多物件，也要与蕙芳些东西。但系苏小姐过门未久，虽然鱼水情深，但将蕙芳之事骤然说起，恐他疑心，要吃醋起来，只得托辞要了二百两赤金，送与蕙芳添买货物。","en":"Duxiang had contributed so many items, he also wanted to give Huifang something. However, he had recently married Miss Su, and though their marital affection was deep, he feared that bringing up Huifang so abruptly might arouse her suspicion and jealousy. Forced to find an excuse, he requested two hundred taels of pure gold under a pretext and sent it to Huifang to help"}],"54":[{"paragraph":6,"mentions":1,"tokens":["浣兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"门气，无甚体裁。」蓉华道：「你看那些题词呢，要算谁的好？」琼华道：「那瑶因女史十首七绝，就做得好。还有那浣香、浣兰这几首七律，真是绣口锦心，香因慧果，这两人不知是那里人？」","en":"the lady-scholar Yaoyin are excellent. Then there are these several regulated heptasyllabics by Huanxiang and Huanlan: truly embroidered words from brocade hearts, fragrant causes flowering into wisdom. I wonder where those two ladies come from?\\""},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":3,"tokens":["浣兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"蓉华道：「这两人我七月内都曾会过，有他们的诗么？我前日倒没有细看。」琼华翻了出来，蓉华看了道：「果然。这浣香、浣兰是苏年伯苏侯的女儿，浣香嫁与华家，浣兰就是田春帆新娶的夫人。这两姊妹真是才貌双全，世间少有的。」琼华道：「就是他们么？怪不得母亲回来这么夸奖他们。」佩秋道：「他们姊妹倒像双生似的，一模一样，比二位姑娘生得还要像些。」蓉华道：「我们虽是亲姊妹，其实不很","en":"day.\\" Qionghua turned them up, and after reading Ronghua exclaimed, \\"They are excellent indeed. Huanxiang and Huanlan are the daughters of our old family friend, the Marquis of Su. Huanxiang married into the Hua family; Huanlan is Tian Chunhang's new wife. The sisters possess beauty and talent together—a thing rarely seen in this world.\\" \\"So it is they!\\" said Qionghua."},{"paragraph":38,"mentions":1,"tokens":["浣兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"了良缘爱果，自然也不像那梦中措大的光景。若像那梦中光景，岂不要将个琼华小姐气死了么？明日也请了袁绮香、苏浣香、浣兰、吴紫烟、王蓉华、孙佩秋来陪新人，群仙高会，又叙了一日。华夫人因是父亲得意门生，又是年伯母来请他，所以欣然而来。至排场热闹，与田家一样，不能细述。以后子玉闺房之乐，真是乐不可言。一个仕女班头，一个才人魁首，或早起看花，或迟眠玩月，或分题拈韵，或论古辨","en":"seduction scene. Had that dream become reality, Qionghua would have died of outrage. Next day Yuan Qixiang, Huanxiang, Huanlan, Ziyan, Ronghua, and Peiqiu came to accompany the bride—a gathering of near-immortals that lasted another full day. Lady Hua came gladly because Ziyu was her father's prized disciple and Lady Yan had invited her personally. The scale and excitement matched"}],"57":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["浣兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"夫人袁绮香，生得婉娴柔静，贤淑无双，又且绣口锦心，才能咏絮。于十月初十日，请了华公子的夫人苏浣香、田春航的夫人浣兰、刘文泽的夫人吴紫烟、颜仲清的夫人王蓉华、梅子玉的夫人琼华、王恂的夫人孙佩秋。此时园中菊花开满，五色斑烂。是日晴光和蔼，风不扬尘，小毛衣服都用不着，绵的尽够了。袁绮香一早带了十二红婢，还有几个家人媳妇，先到园里候客。那日次贤、高品、南湘皆回避了。那十","en":"poetry. On the tenth day of the tenth month, she invited Hua Gongzi's wife, Su Huanxiang; Tian Chunhang's wife, Huanlan; Liu Wenze's wife, Wu Ziyan; Yan Zhongqing's wife, Wang Ronghua; Mei Ziyu's wife, Qionghua; and Wang Xun's wife, Sun Peiqiu. By this time, the garden's chrysanthemums were in full bloom, a brilliant tapestry of five colors. The day's sunlight was gentle,"},{"paragraph":4,"mentions":1,"tokens":["浣兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"绮香道：「也差不多了，大约浣香来得迟些，自然先到浣兰处同来的。」家人媳妇报导：「王大姑奶奶与少奶奶、梅家少奶奶齐来了。」说罢，轿子已齐到堂前。姑嫂三位下了轿，一群仆妇、丫鬟随在后头。绮香一一迎接，见琼华打扮，今日分外妖艳，比陪新那一日，更添了几分娇娆姽婳。众姊妹序齿坐下，蓉华道：「我等二妹来，就等了多","en":"Qixiang said, \\"It is nearly time. Huanxiang will likely be the latest; she will naturally have gone to Huanlan's first so they could arrive together.\\" Just then, a serving-woman announced, \\"The elder and younger Wang ladies, along with the Mei family's young mistress, have all arrived.\\" Before she even finished speaking, the sedan chairs had drawn up before the"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":3,"tokens":["浣兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"苏氏姊妹见了琼华，分外亲爱，琼华见了浣香、浣兰，也十分亲热。这一班姊妹，大约同是瑶池会上人，都有夙契。绮香道：「今日我们众姊妹都是通家世好。苏家二浣，王氏双华，本是同胞，不用说了。我们一共七人，今日仿他竹林七贤，做个桃园结义，大家团拜一拜，以后遇着，就不许谦让。愚姐痴长，不识众位妹妹意下如何？」","en":"special fondness for Qionghua at first sight, and Qionghua, in turn, was exceptionally warm toward Huanxiang and Huanlan. This circle of sisters might well have all been immortals from the Jade Pool banquet, as each pair seemed linked by deep, preordained karma. Qixiang said, \\"Today, we sisters are all from families with generations of friendship. The two Huans of the"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":1,"tokens":["浣兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"园之名，约妹妹们叙叙。若真要逛园，这五六里一片大地方，山石荦确，又难行走，况你那金莲三寸还不满，如何走得来？」浣兰道：「据我想，要逛尽这个园，一天也逛不到。不如到一个极高的所在，望一望罢。」","en":"difficult to walk. Besides, your golden lotuses are not even three inches long; how could you possibly manage?\\" Huanlan added, \\"To my mind, even a full day would not be enough to wander the entire place. We would be better off climbing to a very high spot and gazing out over it all.\\""},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":2,"tokens":["浣兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"己的丫鬟，点了红香、红玉、红雪、红雯、红薇、红莲、红霙、红娟，其余那四个不能饮酒。浣香的十珠都可使唤，全点了。浣兰的四个丫鬟，只点了一个小翠，才十三岁，生得很好，且又灵变。又点了许三姐。琼华的四个丫头，点了一个青琴。蓉华两个丫头，点了一个秋莲。紫烟两个丫头，点了一个侍香。佩秋两个丫头，点了一个金凤。共二十四人。其余都命他们代酒。绮香即命拿过筹来，先是七人掣了，顺","en":"four maids could not drink. Huanxiang's Ten Pearls were all capable and were chosen in their entirety. Out of Huanlan's four maids, she selected only Xiaocui, a pretty and quick-witted thirteen-year-old, along with Miss Xu Sanjie. From Qionghua's four maids, Qingqin was chosen. Ronghua picked Qiulian from her two maids. Ziyan selected Shixiang. Peiqiu chose Jinfeng."},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":2,"tokens":["浣兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"佩秋道：「我掣荆轲，也不至中铜柱的。」浣兰道：「我把田单的火车驱过来，看你有什么御敌的妙计。」紫烟道：「就是我国没有勇将，若能掣着了项重瞳就好了。」绮香道：「且慢高兴，我秦国是兵强将勇，没有一个弱兵。待我且先派定了人数再说。他们共二十四人，我用六个，你们一家用三个。」即叫浣香的爱珠、花珠过来","en":"Peiqiu chimed in, \\"If I draw Jing Ke, my dagger will not miss the bronze pillar.\\" Huanlan said, \\"I will unleash Tian Dan's fire-oxen against you. Let us see how you counter that.\\" Ziyan said, \\"Even if my state lacks a champion, drawing the double-pupiled Xiang Yu would be more than enough.\\" Qixiang responded, \\"Do not celebrate just yet. My"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":2,"tokens":["浣兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"的。」掌珠道：「换一根罢。」红香道：「好便宜事。」忙将筹拿开了。掌珠无奈，也只得捏了那根筹，脸上甚是羞愧。再掣浣兰的齐国，浣兰道：「我这国就掣得平常，只怕没有什么好筹在里头，再不能如蓉华姐姐的廉颇、蔺相如的。」","en":"snatched the chip away. Zhangzhu had no choice but to keep her lot, her face burning red. Next was Qi's draw. Huanlan murmured, \\"My state will be quite ordinary. We probably have no strong lots inside. Nothing like Ronghua's Lian Po and Lin Xiangru.\\""},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":2,"tokens":["浣兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"是「蜡照半笼金翡翠。」注：「席中戴金条脱、玉钏者饮一杯。」绮香道：「这一句只怕都要喝一杯。」七位佳人都喝了，独浣兰不喝。绮香问他，浣兰道：「这杯没有我的酒。」绮香不信，拉他手看时，是一对碧霞玺做成的镯子。众佳人道：「这真便宜了他。」那二十四个婢女，不是金的，就是玉的，满堂都喝了一杯。佩秋道：「五妹好个福将，一出来叫满堂喝酒。」红雪掣了一枝是：「玉搔头袅凤双飞。」","en":"gasped, \\"That line might make everyone in the room drink!\\" All seven ladies drank, with the sole exception of Huanlan. Qixiang asked why, and Huanlan replied, \\"This cup is not mine.\\" Qixiang pulled her hand open to reveal bracelets made of tourmaline. The others grumbled, \\"She got off cheap.\\" However, of the twenty-four maids present, all wore either gold or jade, meaning"},{"paragraph":31,"mentions":1,"tokens":["浣兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"于是又击鼓传花，传到佩秋的燕国，数骰子是金凤出马，为荆轲。那边数到了红玉，是吕不韦。荆轲行的是投壶令。浣兰道：「这令大约没有笑话了。」金凤投了一枝苏秦背剑，红玉投了一枝姜公钓鱼，那两枝都没有中，各人饮了两杯。转到红莲的田光出来，是个哑口令。各出一指，如大指为金，食指为木，中指为土，无名指为水，小指为火。譬如一个出大指，一个出食指，便是金克木。大指赢，食指","en":"Jing Ke, while on the other side the count fell to Hongyu, as Lü Buwei. Jing Ke's appointed game was pitch-pot. Huanlan said, \\"This game, at least, should yield no jokes.\\" Jinfeng threw a shaft in the 'Su Qin Shoulders His Sword' style, and Hongyu one in the 'Lord Jiang Angles for Fish' style; neither shaft found the pot, and each drank two cups. Then it passed to Honglian's"},{"paragraph":34,"mentions":1,"tokens":["浣兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"于是传花又传到浣兰，点将出马是荷珠孟尝君，那边点了红霙的赵高。浣香笑道：「赵高如何是孟尝君的对手？且看谱来。」孟尝君是食客三千，令两人用骰子六颗对掷，如遇红遇么者，出钱投于盆内，六红即投六钱，两红两么即投四钱，无红无么即赢此钱。如孟尝君赢了，问那人：「你有的是什么？没","en":"Then the flower passed on to Huanlan, whose commission sent forth Hezhu as Lord Mengchang, while the other side appointed Hongying as Zhao Gao. Huanxiang laughed, \\"How is Zhao Gao any match for Lord Mengchang? Let us see the rules.\\" Lord Mengchang kept three thousand table-guests, so the"},{"paragraph":37,"mentions":3,"tokens":["浣兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"口胡卢。小翠听了这个，倒投其所好，毫不为难，便咮咮□□的学起鸡叫来，学了几声，即从凳下钻了三次，惹得众人大笑。浣兰道：「姐姐你好心，故意点他来作笑话。」绮香笑道：「这是他自己掣着的。你倒别笑他，若不是他，别人也不能钻得这么灵便。」小翠钻完了，头上歪着个偏髻，嘻嘻的对着浣兰笑。浣兰视了他一个白眼，道：「你还乐得很呢。」酒是三姐代喝了。","en":"of a rooster's crowing, and after a few cries crawled under the bench three times, setting everyone laughing. Huanlan said, \\"How kind of you, sister—you appointed her on purpose to make a joke of her.\\" Qixiang laughed, \\"She drew it herself. And you had better not laugh at her: had it been anyone else, they could never have wriggled through so nimbly.\\" When Xiaocui had"},{"paragraph":39,"mentions":2,"tokens":["浣兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"绮香笑对浣兰道：「妹妹你手下那些鸡鸣狗盗怎么好？又要作出好模样来了。」浣兰气忿忿的道：「罢了！罢了！今日教姐姐的威风施尽，我只好慢慢的报仇。将来掣着了西楚霸王，巨鹿一战，才消得这口气呢。」众佳人笑道：「还有一个韩国在那里，兵书尚未出来，只好盼他打胜仗了。」看三姐","en":"Qixiang said to Huanlan with a laugh, \\"Sister, what is to be done with those cock-crowers and dog-thieves of yours? They will be making a fine show of themselves again.\\" Huanlan said indignantly, \\"Enough, enough. Today my elder sister has had her pride out to the full; I shall"},{"paragraph":40,"mentions":1,"tokens":["浣兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"三姐道：「这回姐妹们可饶了我罢。」二珠、四红如何肯依？浣兰笑对绮香道：「你这个无道强秦，到底要怎样？五国已给你吞食尽了，还要纵容这些豺狼虎豹去吃人。」绮香笑得伏桌难应。三姐被他们围住。毫不容情，心生一计，想道：「这些骚货实在可恶，我今也顾不得作笑话，也叫他们作些笑话出来。」","en":"Sanjie pleaded, \\"Sisters, spare me this round.\\" But the two Pearls and four Reds would not yield. Huanlan laughed at Qixiang, \\"Your lawless Qin—what more do you want? You've swallowed five whole states and still set wolves on people.\\" Qixiang laughed so hard she bent over the table, entirely unable to answer. Sanjie, pinned mercilessly, hatched a desperate"},{"paragraph":42,"mentions":2,"tokens":["浣兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"然叫你一窝子六个滚在一堆。」那六个人我一句，你一句，把三姐骂了好一会，众佳人方才笑完，紫烟一人尚有余笑。绮香对浣兰道：「妹妹，你这个三姐真好，我拿个丫鬟与你换了罢。」浣兰道：「姐姐要他作什么，他是只会装狗的。。」紫烟笑道：「姐姐你招集这些亡命作甚，你真作秦始皇么？」大家又笑起来。","en":"before the beauties finally stopped laughing—though Ziyan still had a few giggles left in her. Qixiang said to Huanlan, \\"Sister, your Sanjie is wonderful. I would trade you a maid for her.\\" Huanlan replied, \\"What would you do with her? She only plays the dog.\\" Ziyan laughed, \\"Sister, why recruit these desperadoes? Are you playing the First Emperor of Qin?\\" Laughter erupted"},{"paragraph":48,"mentions":1,"tokens":["浣兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"人马。琼华道：「就要看这一将成功了。」蓉华道：「琴儿，你须与主人争个脸。」青琴笑道：「我这椎是要椎椎打中的。」浣兰道：「你若赢了他们，非但与你主人争气，且与我等报仇。」浣香道：「这闷雷、劈雷是可以乱打的，你也不必容情，连他们的国王也可打得的。」佩秋道：「你若像了秋莲的廉颇，就不好了。」紫烟道：「也不要像我们荆轲的匕首。」你一句，我一句的说笑。绮香笑道：「谅此孤军","en":"\\"Qin'er, win honor for your mistress!\\" Qingqin smiled confidently, \\"My hammer strikes true with every swing.\\" Huanlan added, \\"Beat them, and you avenge us all.\\" Huanxiang urged, \\"Dull and split thunder may strike wildly. Do not spare them—not even their king.\\" Peiqiu warned, \\"Do not be Qiulian's Lian Po.\\" Ziyan chimed in, \\"Nor our Jing Ke's dagger.\\" Banter flew across"},{"paragraph":50,"mentions":1,"tokens":["浣兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"浣香见天色已晚，便要进城，浣兰要留他，浣香不肯，定要回去。绮香见太阳已落，也不好挽留，只得先送了浣香，便说道：「你们是不要紧，又不赶城，到三更再散不迟。」十珠婢收拾零星，大家都下船渡过了河，直送到山下，上了轿出园。","en":"Huanxiang, seeing the approaching dusk, wished to return to the city. Huanlan urged her to stay, but she gently refused. Qixiang saw that the sun had set and could not insist. She saw Huanxiang off first, then said to the others, \\"The rest of you need not rush to the gate. Stay until the third watch if you like.\\" The Ten Pearls"},{"paragraph":51,"mentions":2,"tokens":["浣兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"都来了，煮茗清谈了一会，已点上灯。紫烟要打马吊，便拉了蓉华、佩秋二人打起马吊来。琼华看见有一匣诗牌，便与绮香、浣兰三人在一桌打了一副，足足打到二更后，琼华方成了一首七律，绮香差了一韵斗不成。浣兰牌起得不好，尚差了十数字，琼华将牌摊出，那边蓉华等也过来看时，只见斗的是：","en":"pulled Ronghua and Peiqiu into a game. Qionghua spotted a box of poetry cards and played a hand with Qixiang and Huanlan until past the second watch. Qionghua completed one beautifully regulated octet; Qixiang missed one rhyme and could not finish; Huanlan's draw was poor and was still ten characters short. Qionghua proudly spread her cards on the table, and Ronghua's"},{"paragraph":52,"mentions":1,"tokens":["浣兰"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，他们也过来贺节。不是我说，我们今日这一班人，倒有几个像他们。」这句话，就有紫烟想不出是谁，其余皆听得人说过。浣兰、琼华恐绮香说出来，便不约而同的将闲话拦住他。又看将近三更，也要各散。绮香挽留不住，只得同散，便说道：「残月未尽，妹妹们可高兴，能走到园门口不能？」众佳人情愿都走，一对对的手灯相照，众姊妹你携我，我携你，一路说说笑笑，穿过了好些石门竹径。正是：","en":"us today resemble them.\\" Ziyan alone could not guess whom she meant; the others had heard people speak of them. Huanlan and Qionghua, fearing Qixiang would name names, quickly cut in with small talk. Near the third watch, they finally prepared to leave. Qixiang could not keep them any longer and said, \\"The waning moon still shines. Sisters, are you willing to walk to"}]}`),"char-155":JSON.parse(`{"11":[{"paragraph":3,"mentions":2,"tokens":["红雪"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琼瑶玉连环七宝钗翠羽扇珊瑚搔头镂金博山炉青瑶玉琴珍沉水香瑟柱奇楠香串玛瑙印章」先着人送去。遂于十二红丫鬟中带了红雪，红霙、红香、红玉、红薇、红雯六个，都是盈盈十五，窈窕多姿，识字能书，工诗善绣。伺候夫人晓妆已毕，红雪道：「今日天气寒冷，似有雪意，须多带几件衣服。」便向大毛衣服内，检出一件天蓝缎绣金紫貂鼠披风，红缎绣金天马皮蟒裙，玉佩玎璫，珠璎珞索。格外又带了一个","en":"ahead by a servant. From her retinue of twelve maidservants, each named with the character 'Hong' (Red), she chose Hongxue, Hongying, Hongxiang, Hongyu, Hongwei, and Hongwen. These six, all fifteen years of age and in the very springtime of their youth, were slender and graceful. They were literate, skilled in calligraphy, and deeply accomplished in both poetry and embroidery."},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":2,"tokens":["红雪"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"全了他。」也贺了一杯，并命伺候丫鬟们，每人都饮一杯酒，作个大犒三军，公贺将军挂印。十珠、六红等都饮毕，爱珠拉拉红雪的袖子，低低说道：「你们奶奶的五更转，甘与子同梦」，说得有情；我们奶奶的「铁索缆孤舟，搭着夜行船」，说得有理；二小姐的说得有声有势，三个各有好处。」红雪点点头道：「你说得一点不错。」袁夫人等听了，亦都微笑。","en":"three armies in honor of the victorious general. As the Ten Pearls and Six Reds partook of the wine, Aizhu tugged Hongxue's sleeve, whispering: \\"Your mistress's verse of sharing a dream's content overflows with tender emotion. My mistress's vision of the lone boat adrift is imbued with profound philosophical depth. But the Second Young Lady's verse radiates immense martial"},{"paragraph":39,"mentions":1,"tokens":["红雪"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"蕊珠掷了个鳅入菱窠，嫌这名色不好，要不算。众人不依。蕊珠只得细想，也想不出来，觉句句总连络不上。红雪笑道：","en":"as she might, she could not string the awkward phrases into any connected, poetic sense. Seeing her struggle, Hongxue laughed aloud:"},{"paragraph":40,"mentions":2,"tokens":["红雪"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「我也代你说，你也要谢谢媒。」蕊珠道：「若好的，你就说。若骂人的，就免劳照顾。」红雪道：「不骂你，你还要感激我呢。」众人道：「你且念出来。」红雪笑道：鳅入菱窠，翠羽戏兰苕，侯门不许老僧敲。秃厮儿，与子偕老。","en":"eyed her suspiciously. \\"If the verse is decent, speak it. But if it is merely an insult, spare me the favor.\\" Hongxue smiled mischievously. \\"I would not insult you. In truth, you shall be deeply grateful to me.\\" Urged on by the eager crowd, Hongxue laughed and recited:\\n\\n\\"A loach slipping into a water-chestnut nest,\\nA green-feathered bird sporting on the orchid sedge,"},{"paragraph":41,"mentions":2,"tokens":["红雪"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"蕊珠伸过手来，一把拧住了红雪的嘴。红雪急忙用手解开，大家笑得弯了腰。 　　明珠一笑，袖子带着酒杯，砸了一个。外面夫人们也听得明白，袁夫人笑道：「他们还比我们会乐。」这边红玉掷了一个八不就，便道：「这个名色也难，凑不成的换了罢。」宝珠道：「怎么凑不成，我替你凑，包你一凑就凑上，总","en":"With a shriek, Ruizhu lunged forward and pinched Hongxue's mouth tightly shut. As Hongxue struggled wildly to pry the fingers from her lips, the entire room doubled over in helpless laughter. Mingzhu laughed so violently that her flailing sleeve knocked a wine cup entirely off the table. The raucous merriment"},{"paragraph":44,"mentions":1,"tokens":["红雪"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"红雪、红香过去拉开了，红霙头上花朵也掉了，头发也弄得蓬蓬的，便把手掠了一会，骂荷珠道：「顽得这般粗卤。说说罢了，就要认真。」这一会闹，闹得华夫人、袁夫人都按捺不住了，便叫家人媳妇进来查问，不许他们顽笑。群婢才息声静气的，赶紧的吃了一碗饭，都出来伺候。夫人","en":"Hongxue and Hongxiang finally rushed over, prying the furious Hezhu away. Sitting up, Hongying discovered the delicate flowers had been torn from her hair, her elegant tresses left a disheveled ruin. She spent a long moment smoothing her hair back into place"},{"paragraph":46,"mentions":1,"tokens":["红雪"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"不能受赏，更要受罚。」华夫人笑道：「你们且一一的说来。」于是明珠把爱珠、宝珠、荷珠骂人的三个令全说了、红薇也将红雪、红雯、红霙骂人的三个令也说了，笑得两位夫人头上的珠钿斜颤，欲要装做正色责备他们，也装不过来。苏小姐虽嫌他们过于亵狎，然心里也赞他们敏慧，不便大笑，只好微颔而已。","en":"offensive entries composed by Aizhu, Baozhu, and Hezhu, while Hongwei recited the three scandalous verses authored by Hongxue, Hongwen, and Hongying. The effect was absolute: both ladies laughed so helplessly that the heavy pearl ornaments in their hair quivered and swayed wildly. Though they desperately attempted to compose their features into masks of stern reprimand, they"},{"paragraph":47,"mentions":1,"tokens":["红雪"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"说惯了，一发肆无忌惮的。」便与华夫人评定这六个令，太恶者罚一大觞酒，打手掌三板，以示薄责；其次者罚酒免责。于是红雪、红霙、荷珠、宝珠受了责罚；爱珠、红雯单罚了酒。群婢受罚起来好不羞愧，又喝了这些急酒，觉得有些晃宕起来，勉强扎挣住了，深悔一时高兴。","en":"palm as token chastisement. For the lesser offenses, a simple forfeit cup of wine was deemed sufficient. Thus, Hongxue, Hongying, Hezhu, and Baozhu suffered both the wine and the stinging slaps, while Aizhu and Hongwen escaped with only the wine forfeit. Receiving their punishments in utter humiliation, and having thrown back the harsh wine in such haste, the maids found"}],"52":[{"paragraph":27,"mentions":1,"tokens":["红雪"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"东华圣母，一位是南岳夫人，正是敌体。」新人坐了一坐，早已告退。这边太太们讲得好不投机，底下是许三姐张罗。徐家的红雪、红莲、红香、红玉、红梅、红月、红露、红霙八个，并华家六珠，与那些家人媳妇丫鬟们，整整坐了八桌。这八桌里头，有会说会笑的，有会喝会吃的，有抿着嘴不开口的，有缩着手不动箸的，各人有各人的模样。三姐八面张罗，满场飞舞。","en":"enthusiasm. Below them, Xu Third Sister managed everything flawlessly. The eight 'Hong' maids of the Xu household—Hongxue, Honglian, Hongxiang, Hongyu, Hongmei, Hongyue, Honglu, and Hongying—along with the six Pearl Maids of the Hua household, plus all the servants and maids, filled exactly eight tables. At these tables, some laughed and joked, some ate and drank boldly,"}],"57":[{"paragraph":10,"mentions":1,"tokens":["红雪"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"绮香命红雪、红云、红玉调丝品竹，小拍清歌。绮香道：「可惜我们酒量都是有限。我新年无事，与我们老爷编了一个酒令，行起来颇为热闹，不论多少人，都放得进去。」浣香笑道：「这么说来，竟不是个酒令，是个阵图了。」绮香道：「却也有阵图在内。」蓉华道：「你且说这个令是怎样的","en":"Qixiang ordered Hongxue, Hongyun, and Hongyu to tune the strings and pipes, accompanying light, clear songs with small clappers. Qixiang said, \\"It is a pity our limits with wine are so constrained. During the New Year, having some idle hours, I compiled a drinking game with"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":1,"tokens":["红雪"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"：「我们且先点起将来，设有不合使唤的，便不中用。出去战败了，倒累主人罚酒。」就先点自己的丫鬟，点了红香、红玉、红雪、红雯、红薇、红莲、红霙、红娟，其余那四个不能饮酒。浣香的十珠都可使唤，全点了。浣兰的四个丫鬟，只点了一个小翠，才十三岁，生得很好，且又灵变。又点了许三姐。琼华的四个丫头，点了一个青琴。蓉华两个丫头，点了一个秋莲。紫烟两个丫头，点了一个侍香。佩秋两个","en":"burden your mistress with penalty wine.\\" She began by choosing from her own maids, picking Hongxiang, Hongyu, Hongxue, Hongwen, Hongwei, Honglian, Hongying, and Hongjuan. Her other four maids could not drink. Huanxiang's Ten Pearls were all capable and were chosen in their entirety. Out of Huanlan's four maids, she selected only Xiaocui, a pretty and quick-witted thirteen-year-old,"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":1,"tokens":["红雪"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"两人到我大国来立些功业，不要在你那个小国埋没。」爱珠、花珠笑了，站了过来。绮香自己点了爱珠、花珠、红香、红玉、红雪、红霙，浣香自己留了宝珠、明珠、掌珠，浣兰留了许三姐、小翠，要了荷珠，紫烟留了侍香，要了红薇、赠珠，佩秋留了金凤，要了红莲、红娟，蓉华留了秋莲，要了红雯、画珠，琼华留了青琴，要了珍珠、蕊珠。","en":"state.\\" Aizhu and Huazhu laughed and stepped over to her side. Qixiang chose Aizhu, Huazhu, Hongxiang, Hongyu, Hongxue, and Hongying for her own forces. Huanxiang kept Baozhu, Mingzhu, and Zhangzhu. Huanlan retained Sanjie and Xiaocui, and added Hezhu. Ziyan kept Shixiang, taking Hongwei and Zengzhu to fill her ranks. Peiqiu kept Jinfeng and added Honglian and Hongjuan."},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":1,"tokens":["红雪"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"分派定了，绮香叫拿七个小筹来，先掣秦国的。爱珠掣了是白起，花珠掣的是商君，红香掣的是韩非子，红玉掣的是吕不韦，红雪掣的是李斯，红霙掣的是赵高。绮香笑道：「如何，你看我们文武皆全。」收过了筒，取紫烟楚国的筹来，侍香掣的是令尹子兰，红薇掣的是高唐神女，赠珠掣的是宋玉。紫烟笑道：「完了，一个佞人，一个梦神，一个风流鬼，这如何打得仗来？」众佳人皆笑，也收过了。再掣佩秋的","en":"drew for Qin first. Aizhu drew Bai Qi; Huazhu drew Lord Shang; Hongxiang drew Han Feizi; Hongyu drew Lü Buwei; Hongxue drew Li Si; and Hongying drew Zhao Gao. Qixiang laughed triumphantly, \\"You see? Both civil and military talents are perfectly complete.\\" They put away Qin's tube and drew for Chu. Shixiang drew Minister Ling Yin Zilan; Hongwei drew the Gaotang Goddess;"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":1,"tokens":["红雪"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，红雯三个就上来，旁边又摆了一桌酒肴。秋莲把两个骰子一掷，掷了四点，是自己出马。秦国的爱珠、花珠、红香、红玉、红雪、红霙也过来。爱珠把骰子一掷，掷了二点，是花珠出马。花珠是商君，秋莲是廉颇。绮香翻出谱来，查到廉颇名下，内有一条：「廉颇如遇商君，俱系勇将，皆以豁拳为令。如廉颇败了，必系老年无用，一败带上假白须，再败罚酒一大觞，三败罚饭一碗。」众佳人看了，不禁又笑。","en":"cast the two dice, rolling a four, meaning she would fight first. Qin's forces—Aizhu, Huazhu, Hongxiang, Hongyu, Hongxue, and Hongying—stepped up to meet her. Aizhu cast the dice and rolled a two, signaling that Huazhu would take the field. Huazhu was playing Lord Shang, while Qiulian represented Lian Po. Qixiang opened the rule book to Lian Po's entry and read: \\"If Lian"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":1,"tokens":["红雪"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"了一杯酒，又盛了一碗饭要他吃。秋莲笑道：「你们也有良心，戴上这个东西，怎样吃得饭来？除非要用金钩挂胡子法子。」红雪道：「有钩子，早就预备的。」便在匣子里找出两个金钩来，挂在秋莲耳上，两边分开。佩秋想着他丈夫说的笑话，不留心说了出来道：「倒像人蝇拂子。」蓉华瞅了他一眼，道：「请问，这蝇拂子是谁家的？」一句话说得佩秋两颊微红，幸众人不解，也过去了。秋莲只得央求旁人代","en":"have some heart! But wearing this, how can I possibly eat? Unless we use golden hooks to tie the whiskers back.\\" Hongxue replied, \\"The hooks are already prepared,\\" and from a small box, she produced two gold hooks to hang from Qiulian's ears, parting the whiskers neatly to the sides. Peiqiu, suddenly recalling a joke her husband had told, blurted out, \\"She looks rather"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":1,"tokens":["红雪"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"唐神女，众人皆笑。紫烟笑道：「好个红姑娘，高鬟大袖的，真像个神女。」红薇脸已红了。那边爱珠、红玉、红香、红霙、红雪也过来，掷到爱珠，是白起。绮香道：「这叫做无情遇。」看谱：「如神女遇见白起，神女如何能敌？须起倾国之兵尽出助战。如系文臣者，行藏阄令，手中各藏一物。国君点戏一出，如白起为净，神女为旦，其余助战者各肖其人定色。」再查：「令尹子兰为丑，宋玉为生。」绮香命","en":"she truly resembles a goddess.\\" Hongwei blushed deeply. On Qin's side, Aizhu, Hongyu, Hongxiang, Hongying, and Hongxue stepped forward. The dice landed on Aizhu, representing the fearsome general Bai Qi. Qixiang noted, \\"This match is 'the heartless meets the divine.'\\" The rule book read: \\"If the delicate goddess meets the brutal Bai Qi, how can she possibly fight? She"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":7,"tokens":["红雪"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"击鼓传花，到了浣香，数宝珠出马。浣香笑道：「这是我们的福将，四公子中的魁首，看你们什么人来抵敌罢。」那边数到了红雪，是李斯。绮香道：「好个对手。」看谱：「信陵君是运筹点将令。」就拿上一筒酒筹来，宝珠掣了一枝看时，是「蜡照半笼金翡翠。」注：「席中戴金条脱、玉钏者饮一杯。」绮香道：「这一句只怕都要喝一杯。」七位佳人都喝了，独浣兰不喝。绮香问他，浣兰道：「这杯没有我的","en":"general, the true champion among the Four Lords. Let us see who dares to meet him.\\" On Qin's side, the lot fell to Hongxue, representing Li Si. Qixiang said, \\"A worthy foe indeed.\\" The rule book stated: \\"Lord Xinling utilizes the 'plan and deploy' rule.\\" They brought out a tube filled with poetic wine lines. Baozhu drew a slip: \\"Candlelight half-holds kingfisher gold.\\" The"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":2,"tokens":["红雪"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"绮香道：「宝丫头了不得，真是个勇将。」红雪又掣了一枝是：「暗中惟觉睡鞋香。」说道：「这句倒难。」绮香道：「你一个个闻去，是谁的香，就叫他喝酒。」红雪笑道：「若要闻，那就…」便笑了不说。又说道：「我知道了，我来敬个人。」","en":"Qixiang praised her, \\"Miss Bao is formidable indeed, a true champion.\\" Hongxue then drew a slip: \\"In the dark, only the scent of sleeping shoes.\\" She frowned, \\"This line is too difficult.\\" Qixiang instructed, \\"Sniff each one in turn. Whoever's scent matches must drink.\\" Hongxue laughed mischievously, \\"If we are truly to sniff,"},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":2,"tokens":["红雪"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"便斟了一杯来敬红薇。红薇道：「难道你真闻过我的脚么？这奇不奇，无缘无故的来缠人。」红雪道：「我虽没有闻过你的脚，但常见你用松子粉浆缠足带，不是香的？」红薇被他说着了，两颊通红，只得喝了一杯。宝珠又掣了一枝是：「十指纤纤玉笋红。」看来看去，就是个小翠指甲尚是红的，要他喝了一杯。红雪掣了一枝是：「天赐胭脂一抹腮。」看红雯喝了两杯酒，两颊尚","en":"Hongwei recoiled and said, \\"Have you truly sniffed my feet? How absolutely absurd, to pester me for nothing!\\" Hongxue replied, \\"I have never sniffed your feet, but I often see you powdering your foot-binding bands with pine powder. Are they not fragrant?\\" Hongwei flushed a deep crimson and quickly drank the cup. Baozhu drew another slip: \\"Ten fingers slender, like red"},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":9,"tokens":["红雪"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"红雪道：「交交黄鸟。」明珠道：「鸟鸣嘤嘤。」红雪道：「嘤其鸣矣。」明珠道：「请教这个矣字怎样接，这不是难人？」罚了红雪一杯，喝了说道：「我换一个已字罢。」即道：「已焉哉。」明珠道：「又要罚。」红雪道：「你单念过一部《诗经》，没有念过别的经书，就说没有哉字","en":"Hongxue said, \\"Yellow birds cry jiao-jiao.\\" Mingzhu answered, \\"Birds sing ying-ying.\\" Hongxue countered, \\"Ying—they cry.\\" Mingzhu was stumped, \\"How do I link to yi? Aren't you making it impossible?\\" Hongxue was fined a cup, drank it, and said, \\"I'll switch to"},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":1,"tokens":["红雪"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"轮到掌珠，是醇酒妇人，令是掷色，若输了，跪请本国王与敌国王出令。掌珠掷了么二三，红雪掷了四五六。掌珠跪在浣香面前求救出令，把个华夫人笑得不止，便道：「出什么令呢？」便对绮香道：「我有一个集词牌成韵的，两句三字，一句七字，要凑拍。」便念道：「宴清都，清平乐，八声甘州金缕曲。姐姐也照样说一个。」绮香道：「这个倒难，词牌我也不甚熟，比不得","en":"she must kneel and ask both her own king and the enemy king to issue a command. Zhangzhu threw a one-two-three; Hongxue threw a four-five-six. Defeated, Zhangzhu knelt before Huanxiang, begging for a command, and Madam Hua could not stop laughing. \\"What command?\\" she asked, turning to Qixiang. \\"I have a rhyme made of lyric titles: two three-character lines and one seven-character"},{"paragraph":39,"mentions":1,"tokens":["红雪"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"？我当狗盗是什么东西，原来要装狗的。我不来。」说着就跑，众佳人听了，都笑得了不得。只见花珠、爱珠、红香、红玉、红雪、红霙一齐赶上，围住了三姐，说道：「凭你怎样利害，今天在我们园里，你想走到那里去？好好的叫了饶你，不然我们就按倒了你，剥你的皮。」便七手八脚，你一捏，我一捏，三姐身上最怕捏的，被他们缠住了，便笑作一团，身似紫薇花的乱颤起来，连连求告道：「不要闹，不要","en":"to run for it, at which the beauties all laughed till they could not stand.\\n\\nHuazhu, Aizhu, Hongxiang, Hongyu, Hongxue and Hongying all came up together and hemmed Sanjie in. \\"Formidable as you are, this is our garden today — where do you think you are going? Bark nicely and we will let you off; otherwise we will pin you down and take the skin off you.\\" And with six"},{"paragraph":41,"mentions":6,"tokens":["红雪"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"又想：「顶坏是爱珠、红雪两个，待我顽他们一顽。」便装着笑盈盈的说道：「姐妹们不要这样，你们让开些，我就伏在地上就是了。」诸人还不信，红雪道：「我们就站开些，谅你也不能跑。」三姐故意慢慢的曲着腰，伏将下去，见红雪与爱珠都是三寸金莲，裙边下微露一线的镶边花裤，叫了一声，众人又笑","en":"She thought it out. \\"The worst of them are Aizhu and Hongxue. Let me pay those two back.\\" So she put on a smiling face and said, \\"Sisters, do not go on so. Stand off a little and I will get down on the floor for you.\\" They still did not trust her, and Hongxue said, \\"We will stand clear — but you are not to run.\\""},{"paragraph":42,"mentions":1,"tokens":["红雪"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"红雪道：「不要将来，只怕出门就教狗咬的。」三姐笑道：「谁教你们太作恶了。我还容情，他们四个跑得快，不然叫你一窝子六个滚在一堆。」那六个人我一句，你一句，把三姐骂了好一会，众佳人方才笑完，紫烟一人尚有余笑。绮香对浣兰道：「妹妹，你这个三姐真好，我拿个丫鬟与","en":"Hongxue added, \\"No need to wait for later. She'll be bitten the moment she leaves the gate.\\" Sanjie laughed triumphantly, \\"Who told you to be so wicked? I was actually merciful. The other four ran fast, or else all six of you would be rolling in one heap.\\" The"},{"paragraph":47,"mentions":2,"tokens":["红雪"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"珠见了，说道：「这个断断使不得，怪脏的东西，那是什么样儿！」红香道：「不妨的。」便要来脱他的鞋。珍珠一跑，不防红雪在旁暗中把脚一勾，珍珠跌了一交，被红香上前按住，脱了他一只鞋下来。珍珠急得满脸飞红，一手拉住红香要夺回，不料红雪把鞋接了过去，正要装酒，不防又被花珠一手抢了，扔与珍珠，惹得大家笑个不住。珍珠着了鞋，捆上带子，起来将红香拧了两把。这一关也就算了。","en":"is this?\\" Hongxiang insisted, \\"It is perfectly fine,\\" and reached for Zhenzhu's shoe. Zhenzhu tried to run, but Hongxue tripped her from the side. Zhenzhu fell, and Hongxiang pinned her down, forcefully pulling off one shoe. Zhenzhu's face flamed; she clutched at Hongxiang to get it back, but Hongxue took the shoe to fill it with wine. Huazhu swiftly snatched it away"},{"paragraph":49,"mentions":1,"tokens":["红雪"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"与姐姐周旋。」绮香笑道：「众志成城，坚不可破，我让了你罢。」看青琴这打擂，已赢得不少，爱珠、花珠、红香、红玉、红雪、红霙都喝了许多酒。","en":"unbreakable. I yield.\\" Qingqin's ring match had already won plenty of victories; Aizhu, Huazhu, Hongxiang, Hongyu, Hongxue, and Hongying had all drunk deeply."}]}`),"char-156":{11:[{paragraph:3,mentions:1,tokens:["红香"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"宝钗翠羽扇珊瑚搔头镂金博山炉青瑶玉琴珍沉水香瑟柱奇楠香串玛瑙印章」先着人送去。遂于十二红丫鬟中带了红雪，红霙、红香、红玉、红薇、红雯六个，都是盈盈十五，窈窕多姿，识字能书，工诗善绣。伺候夫人晓妆已毕，红雪道：「今日天气寒冷，似有雪意，须多带几件衣服。」便向大毛衣服内，检出一件天蓝缎绣金紫貂鼠披风，红缎绣金天马皮蟒裙，玉佩玎璫，珠璎珞索。格外又带了一个大红绵包袱，",en:"From her retinue of twelve maidservants, each named with the character 'Hong' (Red), she chose Hongxue, Hongying, Hongxiang, Hongyu, Hongwei, and Hongwen. These six, all fifteen years of age and in the very springtime of their youth, were slender and graceful. They were literate, skilled in calligraphy, and deeply accomplished in both poetry and embroidery. After assisting"},{paragraph:27,mentions:1,tokens:["红香"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"至矣，又恰是闺秀口气。我略比你长了几年，就说不到这样秀韵，这真是勉强不来的。」苏小姐只是含笑，又贺了一杯。那边红香低低对宝珠说道：「你听各人行的令，真像各人的语言情性，连相貌都像，这是什么缘故？若教彼此换一个过儿，就便都不像本人了。」宝珠等微笑。袁夫人又取过骰子来，掷了一个观灯十五夜。",en:`cannot be forced." Miss Su responded with a serene smile as another round of wine was shared. Beyond the curtain, Hongxiang leaned close to Baozhu, whispering, "Have you noticed? Each lady's verse perfectly mirrors her own voice, her deepest feelings, even her very appearance. If you were to exchange the verses among them, the words would utterly fail to suit the speaker."`},{paragraph:43,mentions:3,tokens:["红香"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"红香掷了一个正双飞，偏也凑不上来。想着了几句，又不是一韵，这边荷珠道：「我代你说一个好的，叫你再不恨我。」红香当他是好心，便道：「好姐姐，你代我说了罢。」荷珠笑道：「我虽代你说，这令是原算你的。」便念道：正双飞，有愿几时谐，捱一刻似一夏。并头莲，庶几夙夜",en:`Hongxiang threw the pattern 'A Pair of Matched Butterflies, Precisely,' but found herself utterly incapable of assembling the verse. The few phrases she conjured stubbornly refused to rhyme. Hezhu offered sweetly, "I shall compose a beautiful verse for you, one`},{paragraph:44,mentions:1,tokens:["红香"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"红雪、红香过去拉开了，红霙头上花朵也掉了，头发也弄得蓬蓬的，便把手掠了一会，骂荷珠道：「顽得这般粗卤。说说罢了，就要认真。」这一会闹，闹得华夫人、袁夫人都按捺不住了，便叫家人媳妇进来查问，不许他们顽笑。群婢才息声静气的，赶紧的吃了一碗饭，都出来伺候。夫人们看这",en:"Hongxue and Hongxiang finally rushed over, prying the furious Hezhu away. Sitting up, Hongying discovered the delicate flowers had been torn from her hair, her elegant tresses left a disheveled ruin. She spent a long moment smoothing her hair back into place before fiercely"},{paragraph:46,mentions:1,tokens:["红香"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"爱珠的光景似将要说，红香扯扯他的袖子，叫他不要说。爱珠道：「他们说的也多，也记不清了。」苏小姐急于要听，便对华夫人、袁夫人道：「他们是惧怕主人不敢说，你们叫他说他就说了。」华夫人也知道这些婢女有些小聪明，都也说得几个好的出来，便对袁夫人微笑。袁夫人本是个风流跌宕的人，心上也",en:`Aizhu's bright eyes suggested she was eager to speak, but Hongxiang sharply tugged her sleeve, warning her to remain silent. Aizhu demurred, "There were a great many verses, I cannot recall them all clearly." Eager to hear the tale, Miss Su turned to Lady Hua and Mrs. Yuan: "They are terrified of their mistresses and`}],52:[{paragraph:27,mentions:1,tokens:["红香"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"位是南岳夫人，正是敌体。」新人坐了一坐，早已告退。这边太太们讲得好不投机，底下是许三姐张罗。徐家的红雪、红莲、红香、红玉、红梅、红月、红露、红霙八个，并华家六珠，与那些家人媳妇丫鬟们，整整坐了八桌。这八桌里头，有会说会笑的，有会喝会吃的，有抿着嘴不开口的，有缩着手不动箸的，各人有各人的模样。三姐八面张罗，满场飞舞。",en:"them, Xu Third Sister managed everything flawlessly. The eight 'Hong' maids of the Xu household—Hongxue, Honglian, Hongxiang, Hongyu, Hongmei, Hongyue, Honglu, and Hongying—along with the six Pearl Maids of the Hua household, plus all the servants and maids, filled exactly eight tables. At these tables, some laughed and joked, some ate and drank boldly, some sat with pursed"}],57:[{paragraph:13,mentions:1,tokens:["红香"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"绮香道：「我们且先点起将来，设有不合使唤的，便不中用。出去战败了，倒累主人罚酒。」就先点自己的丫鬟，点了红香、红玉、红雪、红雯、红薇、红莲、红霙、红娟，其余那四个不能饮酒。浣香的十珠都可使唤，全点了。浣兰的四个丫鬟，只点了一个小翠，才十三岁，生得很好，且又灵变。又点了许三姐。琼华的四个丫头，点了一个青琴。蓉华两个丫头，点了一个秋莲。紫烟两个丫头，点了一个侍",en:`battle, you will only burden your mistress with penalty wine." She began by choosing from her own maids, picking Hongxiang, Hongyu, Hongxue, Hongwen, Hongwei, Honglian, Hongying, and Hongjuan. Her other four maids could not drink. Huanxiang's Ten Pearls were all capable and were chosen in their entirety. Out of Huanlan's four maids, she selected only Xiaocui, a pretty and`},{paragraph:14,mentions:1,tokens:["红香"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"来，道：「你两人到我大国来立些功业，不要在你那个小国埋没。」爱珠、花珠笑了，站了过来。绮香自己点了爱珠、花珠、红香、红玉、红雪、红霙，浣香自己留了宝珠、明珠、掌珠，浣兰留了许三姐、小翠，要了荷珠，紫烟留了侍香，要了红薇、赠珠，佩秋留了金凤，要了红莲、红娟，蓉华留了秋莲，要了红雯、画珠，琼华留了青琴，要了珍珠、蕊珠。",en:'away in your petty state." Aizhu and Huazhu laughed and stepped over to her side. Qixiang chose Aizhu, Huazhu, Hongxiang, Hongyu, Hongxue, and Hongying for her own forces. Huanxiang kept Baozhu, Mingzhu, and Zhangzhu. Huanlan retained Sanjie and Xiaocui, and added Hezhu. Ziyan kept Shixiang, taking Hongwei and Zengzhu to fill her ranks. Peiqiu kept Jinfeng and added Honglian'},{paragraph:15,mentions:2,tokens:["红香"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"分派定了，绮香叫拿七个小筹来，先掣秦国的。爱珠掣了是白起，花珠掣的是商君，红香掣的是韩非子，红玉掣的是吕不韦，红雪掣的是李斯，红霙掣的是赵高。绮香笑道：「如何，你看我们文武皆全。」收过了筒，取紫烟楚国的筹来，侍香掣的是令尹子兰，红薇掣的是高唐神女，赠珠掣的是宋玉。紫烟笑道：「完了，一个佞人，一个梦神，一个风流鬼，这如何打得仗来",en:`Qixiang called for the seven small lot-tubes and drew for Qin first. Aizhu drew Bai Qi; Huazhu drew Lord Shang; Hongxiang drew Han Feizi; Hongyu drew Lü Buwei; Hongxue drew Li Si; and Hongying drew Zhao Gao. Qixiang laughed triumphantly, "You see? Both civil and military talents are perfectly complete." They put away Qin's tube and drew for Chu. Shixiang drew Minister Ling`},{paragraph:17,mentions:1,tokens:["红香"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"」秋莲、画珠，红雯三个就上来，旁边又摆了一桌酒肴。秋莲把两个骰子一掷，掷了四点，是自己出马。秦国的爱珠、花珠、红香、红玉、红雪、红霙也过来。爱珠把骰子一掷，掷了二点，是花珠出马。花珠是商君，秋莲是廉颇。绮香翻出谱来，查到廉颇名下，内有一条：「廉颇如遇商君，俱系勇将，皆以豁拳为令。如廉颇败了，必系老年无用，一败带上假白须，再败罚酒一大觞，三败罚饭一碗。」众佳人看了",en:"set aside. Qiulian cast the two dice, rolling a four, meaning she would fight first. Qin's forces—Aizhu, Huazhu, Hongxiang, Hongyu, Hongxue, and Hongying—stepped up to meet her. Aizhu cast the dice and rolled a two, signaling that Huazhu would take the field. Huazhu was playing Lord Shang, while Qiulian represented Lian Po. Qixiang opened the rule book to Lian Po's entry"},{paragraph:22,mentions:1,tokens:["红香"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"到红薇，是高唐神女，众人皆笑。紫烟笑道：「好个红姑娘，高鬟大袖的，真像个神女。」红薇脸已红了。那边爱珠、红玉、红香、红霙、红雪也过来，掷到爱珠，是白起。绮香道：「这叫做无情遇。」看谱：「如神女遇见白起，神女如何能敌？须起倾国之兵尽出助战。如系文臣者，行藏阄令，手中各藏一物。国君点戏一出，如白起为净，神女为旦，其余助战者各肖其人定色。」再查：「令尹子兰为丑，宋玉为",en:`and wide, flowing sleeves, she truly resembles a goddess." Hongwei blushed deeply. On Qin's side, Aizhu, Hongyu, Hongxiang, Hongying, and Hongxue stepped forward. The dice landed on Aizhu, representing the fearsome general Bai Qi. Qixiang noted, "This match is 'the heartless meets the divine.'" The rule book read: "If the delicate goddess meets the brutal Bai Qi, how can`},{paragraph:39,mentions:1,tokens:["红香"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"个令如何来得？我当狗盗是什么东西，原来要装狗的。我不来。」说着就跑，众佳人听了，都笑得了不得。只见花珠、爱珠、红香、红玉、红雪、红霙一齐赶上，围住了三姐，说道：「凭你怎样利害，今天在我们园里，你想走到那里去？好好的叫了饶你，不然我们就按倒了你，剥你的皮。」便七手八脚，你一捏，我一捏，三姐身上最怕捏的，被他们缠住了，便笑作一团，身似紫薇花的乱颤起来，连连求告道：「",en:`it." And she made to run for it, at which the beauties all laughed till they could not stand.

Huazhu, Aizhu, Hongxiang, Hongyu, Hongxue and Hongying all came up together and hemmed Sanjie in. "Formidable as you are, this is our garden today — where do you think you are going? Bark nicely and we will let you off; otherwise we will pin you down and take the skin off you."`},{paragraph:43,mentions:5,tokens:["红香"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"摆，摆出来相同的不论，如摆出来不同，请中人评论优劣，劣者罚酒。蕊珠将三个骰子摆了，将茶杯盖好，又将三个骰子递与红香，道：「你摆「九重春色醉仙桃」这一句。」红香想了一想，摆了一个三，一个六，一个四，说道：「三六是九重，四即算仙桃，不知对不对？」蕊珠揭开杯子，是对的。蕊珠又摆了一句是：「十三筝柱雁行斜。」红香想了一想，摆了两个五，一个三，蕊珠也说对了。又摆了一句，说",en:'judge would pick the better and worse, and the loser would drink. Ruizhu set three dice, covered them, and handed Hongxiang three dice, saying, "Match Ninefold spring hues drunk on fairy peaches." Hongxiang thought for a moment and set a three, a six, and a four. "Three and six make nine. Four stands for peach. Is that right?" Ruizhu lifted the cup—it was correct. She offered'},{paragraph:44,mentions:3,tokens:["红香"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"蕊珠道：「取笔研来涂脸。」红香道：「姐姐，饶了我罢，涂了脸又要擦脸，费事得很，我情愿跪了喝一杯罢。」蕊珠将要容情，倒是珍珠不肯，说道：「我还要与他来呢。一个容了情，个个要容情了。」便把笔在红香脸上画了一个眼镜，惹得满堂又笑起来。红香好不有气，喝了一杯，忙忙的要水洗了脸。",en:'Ruizhu demanded, "Bring the inkstone. We are painting faces." Hongxiang pleaded, "Sister, spare me. Painting means washing, which is a bother. I will kneel and drink instead." Ruizhu was about to relent, but Zhenzhu refused, "I fight her next. Show one mercy, and everyone will want mercy." She took the brush and drew spectacles'},{paragraph:46,mentions:1,tokens:["红香"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"珍珠象棋下得虽好，谱却不熟，偏偏遇着红香是爱打棋谱的。",en:"Zhenzhu played chess quite well but knew the manual poorly; she unfortunately met Hongxiang, who absolutely loved memorizing traps."},{paragraph:47,mentions:7,tokens:["红香"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"珍珠十分用心，无奈未得其妙，几着变化就迷住了，看看要输，宝珠要指点他，红香道：「谁教了，就算谁输，要照样罚酒。」琼华心甚着急，又不好教，看红香把他一个挂角将，就将死了。红香笑道：「今番得了。」查圯上老人的谱，是脱鞋置酒，遍敬席上。珍珠见了，说道：「这个断断使不得，怪脏的东西，那是什么样儿！」红香道：「不妨的。」便要来脱他的",en:`but missed the subtleties. After only a few moves, she was completely lost. Baozhu wanted to offer a hint, but Hongxiang warned, "Whoever teaches, loses. Same penalty." Qionghua burned with worry but dared not speak. Hongxiang hung a corner checkmate—dead. Hongxiang smiled sweetly, "Got you this time." The old man's book dictated: remove a shoe, fill it with wine, and`},{paragraph:49,mentions:1,tokens:["红香"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"可秣马厉兵，与姐姐周旋。」绮香笑道：「众志成城，坚不可破，我让了你罢。」看青琴这打擂，已赢得不少，爱珠、花珠、红香、红玉、红雪、红霙都喝了许多酒。",en:`hearts make a city unbreakable. I yield." Qingqin's ring match had already won plenty of victories; Aizhu, Huazhu, Hongxiang, Hongyu, Hongxue, and Hongying had all drunk deeply.`}]},"char-157":JSON.parse(`{"11":[{"paragraph":4,"mentions":1,"tokens":["花珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"了华光宿，真是瑶琴玉瑟，鱼水和谐，说不尽咏月吟风，闺房潇洒。又有十个美婢，名字都有一个珠字，宝珠、明珠、爱珠、花珠、荷珠、蕊珠、掌珠、珍珠、画珠、赠珠。这十珠都有十分姿色，年皆十五六岁，真像十样鲜花，一群粉蝶，个个慧心香口，莲步柳腰，针黹巧夺天工，词令皆成妙品。比郑康成之诗婢，少道学之风规，较郭令公之家姬，得风流之香主。华公子夫妇二人这样的妙才浓福，也就人间少有","en":"Serving them were ten beautiful maids, each bearing the character 'Zhu' (Pearl) in her name: Baozhu, Mingzhu, Aizhu, Huazhu, Hezhu, Ruizhu, Zhangzhu, Zhenzhu, Yazhu, and Zengzhu. All fifteen or sixteen years of age, they bloomed like ten distinct varieties of fresh spring flowers, fluttering like a cluster of powdered butterflies. Each possessed a nimble mind and a fragrant"}],"26":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":3,"tokens":["花珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一瓶雪水出来，也不到厨房，就在公子卧房前，一个八角琉璃亭的廊檐下，生了一个铜炉的火，用个银吊子，慢慢的熬起来。花珠亦在旁蹲着，拖下一条大红绦子，一半在地，就道：「爷今日像醉了，只管打量我们。一个人无缘无故笑起来。」宝珠道：「我昨日听得奶奶讲，到秋天就要收你了。」花珠啐了一口道：「要收还先收你，你是个脑儿赛，又会巴结差使，只怕还等不到秋天呢！」宝珠用手一推，把花珠","en":"just outside his room, they lit a small copper brazier and began to slowly simmer the porridge in a silver pot. Huazhu squatted nearby, a long crimson sash trailing onto the ground, and said, \\"The Master seems quite drunk today. He keeps staring at us, smiling to himself for no reason.\\" \\"I heard Madame say yesterday that she plans to take you in as a concubine by autumn,\\""},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":1,"tokens":["花珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"华夫人几次说要把花珠、宝珠收了，公子只是不要，说：「一做了妾，倒无趣了。不如等他们伺候几年，选几个青年美貌的配他，是件极有功德的事。还有一句话，若是夫人生得平常，自然就要到姬妾身上来。如今夫人是这么样的好，姬妾们虽好，也是比不上的。譬如草木杂花，未尝不娇艳无比，单看时觉","en":"Lady Hua had several times suggested taking Huazhu and Baozhu as concubines, but the Young Master always refused. \\"Once they become concubines, their charm will fade,\\" he would say. \\"It is better to let them serve for a few years and then arrange marriages with handsome youths—a truly meritorious deed."}],"41":[{"paragraph":5,"mentions":4,"tokens":["花珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"约有两刻工夫，听得环佩琤琤，华夫人带了明珠、花珠、荷珠、赠珠四个女婢过来，华公子笑面相迎。华夫人道：「这两日天气甚好，我本来也想逛逛。方才香儿说你在这里钓鱼，我从西书房夹道中走来，倒也不远。我又叫老婆子收拾些食品过来。」华公子道：「我本有此意，你倒预先办妥了。」二人凭阑观玩了一会，华公子道：「我们","en":"hour, the sound of tinkling ornaments announced the arrival of Madam Hua, attended by four maidservants—Mingzhu, Huazhu, Hezhu, and Zengzhu. The young master stepped forward with a smile to welcome her. Madam Hua said: \\"The weather has been so fine these past two days—I had been meaning to take a stroll. A moment ago Xiang'er told me you were here fishing, and I came"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":2,"tokens":["花珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「怎么样，你们也荡过桨的，今日又不会荡起来。」花珠笑道：「明珠不会荡，我望前，他倒望后。」明珠道：「不说你不会，倒说我不会。荷珠，你荡罢，再用着他，这个船就要翻了。」荷珠替了花珠，果然好了。清风徐来，涟漪深碧，慢慢的穿过小桥。公子与夫人看桥边及山石上缠的古藤，蒙蒙茸茸，垂到水面，底下的水，一派清冷戛","en":"\\"What is this? You have all handled oars before. How is it you have forgotten today?\\" Huazhu laughed, saying, \\"It is Mingzhu who cannot scull. I face forward, but she faces backward.\\" Mingzhu replied, \\"Never mind your own failings. Must you blame it all on me? Hezhu, you take over; let her keep at it and this boat will capsize.\\" Hezhu replaced"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":6,"tokens":["花珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"阁崇台，甚为华丽，红白碧桃已开了好些。公子对夫人道：「赏花不可无酒，方才说老婆子预备，不知可曾停妥？」华夫人命花珠去看来，花珠拉明珠同他弄船过去。明珠道：「你又来混缠，不过爱顽罢了，那里真不认得路径？你从这后头走过古藤书屋，再过了猗香亭，就通方才来的路，要坐什么船？」花珠原是爱顽，并非不认得路径，只得独自出去。将到藤花书屋前，只见林珊枝正走来，口中嚷道：「花姑娘","en":"mentioned just now that the servants had made preparations. I wonder whether they are ready yet?\\" Madam Hua sent Huazhu to go and look, and Huazhu tried to drag Mingzhu along to pole the boat with her. Mingzhu said, \\"There you go again with your nonsense. You simply want an excuse to play on the water. Do you not know the way? Go through the old-wisteria study at the"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":1,"tokens":["花珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"对荷珠低低说道：「要拜我们十个一同拜，不要分先后，省得先拜的叫后拜的笑。」爱珠道：「我们一对一对的拜不好吗？」花珠凑着爱珠的耳说道：「又不是夫妻拜堂，怎么你要一对对的拜呢？」爱珠打他一下。已见老婆子颤巍巍的拎了一大瓶酒来，放在廊下。十珠等各拿了小酒杯斟了酒，分头去觅那开得鲜艳的，你一杯我一杯的乱浇，走来穿去，也像一群穿花蝴蝶一样，果然齐齐的拜了四拜。","en":"first won't be laughed at by those who bow after.\\" Aizhu said: \\"Would it not be better for us to bow in pairs?\\" Huazhu leaned close to Aizhu's ear and whispered: \\"This is not a wedding ceremony—why on earth do you want to bow in pairs?\\" Aizhu gave her a light swat. By this time the older maidservant had come tottering in with a large jug of wine, which she set down at"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":1,"tokens":["花珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"桃红似绣，艳覆文君酒；屏开金孔雀，围春昼。涤了金瓯，点着喷香兽。这当垆红袖，太温柔，应与相如消受。《一枝花》\\n花珠一面打鼓板，一面接唱道：","en":"the wine-counter\\nIs far too tender-hearted;\\nShe ought to let Xiangru enjoy her company. [A Spray of Flowers]\\n\\nHuazhu, keeping the drum and rhythm-boards going, took up the next aria and sang:"},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":3,"tokens":["花珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"第一，唱得风神跌宕，文秀温存，十人中是他压卷了。次则爱珠，情韵皆到，为第二。次赠珠，次掌珠，次蕊珠，次珍珠，次花珠，次荷珠，次画珠，次明珠。不知定得不委屈么？」公子道：「定得极是。」夫人又问十珠婢道：「如有委屈，不妨自说。」花珠赔着笑道：「奴才唱的，似乎在蕊珠、珍珠之上。」华夫人道：「就是你不服，你那里知道自己唱的毛病。你想显己之长，压人之短，添出些腔调来，此所","en":"Second is Aizhu, who conveyed both emotion and charm. Then Zengzhu, then Zhangzhu, then Ruizhu, then Zhenzhu, then Huazhu, then Hezhu, then Yazhu, and then Mingzhu last. I hope this is not unjust?\\" The young master said, \\"The ranking is entirely right.\\" His lady also invited the Ten Pearls: \\"If anyone feels hard done by, please speak freely.\\" Huazhu said with a conciliatory"},{"paragraph":37,"mentions":2,"tokens":["花珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"串出来也像那《赏荷》一样。不过那十珠丫头，倒好扮些净丑出来取笑，然而也觉俗了。」公子笑道：「若要扮丑脚的，只有花珠可以扮得。」花珠听了，红起脸来，扭转头，对着爱珠道：「还有爱珠也可扮得。」爱珠尚未开言，公子道：「爱珠是贴旦，画珠是老旦，宝珠是正旦，蕊珠是小旦。其余扮生、净、外、末，比八龄又强了。」夫人道：「这倒可以，只怕他们害羞，做不出来。」夫人一面说，一面看那","en":"roles, but then again, that would be vulgar.\\" The young master laughed, \\"If anyone is to play the clown, only Huazhu could carry it off.\\" Huazhu, overhearing this, flushed red, turned her head away, and addressed Aizhu, \\"And Aizhu could too.\\" Before Aizhu could reply, the young master said, \\"Aizhu would play the secondary female lead, Yazhu the older-woman role, Baozhu"}],"44":[{"paragraph":7,"mentions":1,"tokens":["花珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"里，还是看桃花去了。奶奶没有去。」珊枝又听里面一人说话：「你听是谁？」那人道：「是林珊枝儿，还有谁！」珊枝知是花珠、荷珠，就急往园中来。只见姹紫嫣红，和风骀荡，一径往留仙院走去。到了园后，听得笑声盈耳，又像念诗的，却是女儿声口。珊枝便轻了脚步，绕到西边，隐身在太湖石后，从石穴中远远望去，只见蕊珠穿了桃红绸袄，绿绸背心，跪在桃花林下，背的是《长恨歌》，背到了：","en":"room: \\"Listen — who is that?\\" The voice replied: \\"Lin Shanzhi, of course — who else?\\" Shanzhi recognized it as Huazhu and Hezhu, and went off quickly toward the garden. He passed through a blaze of crimson and pink, in a languid and gentle breeze, and went straight along to the Liu Xian Courtyard. Reaching the rear of the garden, he could hear laughter everywhere, and"}],"57":[{"paragraph":14,"mentions":3,"tokens":["花珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"是兵强将勇，没有一个弱兵。待我且先派定了人数再说。他们共二十四人，我用六个，你们一家用三个。」即叫浣香的爱珠、花珠过来，道：「你两人到我大国来立些功业，不要在你那个小国埋没。」爱珠、花珠笑了，站了过来。绮香自己点了爱珠、花珠、红香、红玉、红雪、红霙，浣香自己留了宝珠、明珠、掌珠，浣兰留了许三姐、小翠，要了荷珠，紫烟留了侍香，要了红薇、赠珠，佩秋留了金凤，要了红莲","en":"servants. I will use six, and each of you will use three.\\" She then called out to Huanxiang's maids, Aizhu and Huazhu, \\"Come to my great kingdom and win true merit. Do not moulder away in your petty state.\\" Aizhu and Huazhu laughed and stepped over to her side. Qixiang chose Aizhu, Huazhu, Hongxiang, Hongyu, Hongxue, and Hongying for her own forces. Huanxiang kept Baozhu,"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":1,"tokens":["花珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"分派定了，绮香叫拿七个小筹来，先掣秦国的。爱珠掣了是白起，花珠掣的是商君，红香掣的是韩非子，红玉掣的是吕不韦，红雪掣的是李斯，红霙掣的是赵高。绮香笑道：「如何，你看我们文武皆全。」收过了筒，取紫烟楚国的筹来，侍香掣的是令尹子兰，红薇掣的是高唐神女，赠珠掣的是宋玉。紫烟笑道：「完了，一个佞人，一个梦神，一个风流鬼","en":"With the assignments set, Qixiang called for the seven small lot-tubes and drew for Qin first. Aizhu drew Bai Qi; Huazhu drew Lord Shang; Hongxiang drew Han Feizi; Hongyu drew Lü Buwei; Hongxue drew Li Si; and Hongying drew Zhao Gao. Qixiang laughed triumphantly, \\"You see? Both civil and military talents are perfectly complete.\\" They put away Qin's tube and drew for Chu."},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":3,"tokens":["花珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"手段。」秋莲、画珠，红雯三个就上来，旁边又摆了一桌酒肴。秋莲把两个骰子一掷，掷了四点，是自己出马。秦国的爱珠、花珠、红香、红玉、红雪、红霙也过来。爱珠把骰子一掷，掷了二点，是花珠出马。花珠是商君，秋莲是廉颇。绮香翻出谱来，查到廉颇名下，内有一条：「廉颇如遇商君，俱系勇将，皆以豁拳为令。如廉颇败了，必系老年无用，一败带上假白须，再败罚酒一大觞，三败罚饭一碗。」众佳","en":"been set aside. Qiulian cast the two dice, rolling a four, meaning she would fight first. Qin's forces—Aizhu, Huazhu, Hongxiang, Hongyu, Hongxue, and Hongying—stepped up to meet her. Aizhu cast the dice and rolled a two, signaling that Huazhu would take the field. Huazhu was playing Lord Shang, while Qiulian represented Lian Po. Qixiang opened the rule book to Lian"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":1,"tokens":["花珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"开阡陌。如败后，手中藏一物，叫胜家猜。猜不着，平过；猜着了，商君即以本物飞诗一句。不能或不合本题者，罚一杯。」花珠道：「这还好，不甚累赘。」两人对垒起来。秋莲看了谱，心已怯了，输了三次。","en":"a poetic line featuring that object as the theme. If he fails or the line mismatches, he must drink one cup.\\" Huazhu said, \\"That is tolerable enough, not overly fussy.\\" The two generals faced off. Qiulian, having heard her punishing rules, lost her nerve and quickly lost three consecutive rounds."},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":3,"tokens":["花珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"蓉华道：「好个廉颇，头一阵就打了败仗。」秋莲想跑开，被爱珠、花珠赶上，捉了过来，戴上假须，飘飘漾漾的。众婢女把他形容个淋漓尽致，罚了一杯酒，又盛了一碗饭要他吃。秋莲笑道：「你们也有良心，戴上这个东西，怎样吃得饭来？除非要用金钩挂胡子法子。」红雪道：「有钩子，早就预备的。」便在匣子里找出两个金钩来，挂在秋莲耳上，两","en":"Ronghua sighed playfully, \\"Brave Lian Po, the very first battle is lost.\\" Qiulian attempted to flee, but Aizhu and Huazhu swiftly caught her and tied on the false white whiskers, which fluttered comically in the air. The maids vividly painted the scene, fining her one cup of wine and heaping a large bowl of rice before her. Qiulian laughed, \\"You still have some heart! But"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":2,"tokens":["花珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"花珠手中藏了一颗莲子，叫红雯猜。画珠看见了，把脚踢一踢红雯的脚，红雯不解，看着画珠。画珠又指着桌上一盘的莲子，红雯又看到隔壁去了，道是鸭掌，便说道：「鸭掌。」画珠听了，大笑起来。红雯害臊说道：「你故意顽我。」画珠道：「我顽你？」花珠道：「他倒不是顽你，你","en":"Huazhu then hid a lotus seed in her hand for Hongwen to guess. Yazhu saw it and subtly kicked Hongwen's foot to give her a hint. Puzzled, Hongwen looked at Yazhu, who then pointed discreetly at a dish of lotus seeds resting on the table. However, Hongwen's"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":2,"tokens":["花珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"笑道：「这也不难。」便斟了一杯酒，走到绮香面前福了一福，绮香也还了一礼，笑而受之。那画珠、秋莲、红雯，只得也向花珠万福。花珠笑道：「我是甲冑在身，不能还礼。」画珠骂道：「你威风不要使尽了，只怕这回就要对人磕头呢。」于是又击起鼓来，花到了紫烟住了，侍香、红薇、赠珠上来。赠珠把骰子一掷，数到红薇，是高唐神女，众人皆笑。紫烟笑道：「好个红姑娘，高鬟大袖的，真像个神女。","en":"returned the bow and accepted the cup with a warm smile. Yazhu, Qiulian, and Hongwen were then forced to curtsey to Huazhu, who had emerged victorious as Lord Shang. Huazhu laughed, \\"I have my armor on; I cannot return the courtesy.\\" Yazhu retorted, \\"Do not spend all your swagger so quickly. You may well be kowtowing in the next round.\\" They beat the drum once more, and"},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":1,"tokens":["花珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"骰子，数到明珠，是侯生，是个《顶针续麻令》。李斯输了喝酒，侯生输了要喝酱油。明珠道：「这个酱油倒有些难喝呢。」花珠低低说道：「吃杯醋罢，比酱油还好些。」众佳人听了，忍不住笑。明珠也不理他，说道：「十月之交。」","en":"wine; if Hou Sheng lost, the penalty was soy sauce. Mingzhu groaned, \\"Soy sauce is incredibly hard to swallow.\\" Huazhu whispered a helpful hint, \\"Try vinegar instead; it is far better than soy.\\" The beauties stifled their laughter. Mingzhu ignored her and boldly began the verse: \\"'In the tenth month,'\\""},{"paragraph":39,"mentions":1,"tokens":["花珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"道：「呸！这个令如何来得？我当狗盗是什么东西，原来要装狗的。我不来。」说着就跑，众佳人听了，都笑得了不得。只见花珠、爱珠、红香、红玉、红雪、红霙一齐赶上，围住了三姐，说道：「凭你怎样利害，今天在我们园里，你想走到那里去？好好的叫了饶你，不然我们就按倒了你，剥你的皮。」便七手八脚，你一捏，我一捏，三姐身上最怕捏的，被他们缠住了，便笑作一团，身似紫薇花的乱颤起来，连","en":"dog. I will not do it.\\" And she made to run for it, at which the beauties all laughed till they could not stand.\\n\\nHuazhu, Aizhu, Hongxiang, Hongyu, Hongxue and Hongying all came up together and hemmed Sanjie in. \\"Formidable as you are, this is our garden today — where do you think you are going? Bark nicely and we will let you off; otherwise we will pin you down and take"},{"paragraph":47,"mentions":1,"tokens":["花珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"红香上前按住，脱了他一只鞋下来。珍珠急得满脸飞红，一手拉住红香要夺回，不料红雪把鞋接了过去，正要装酒，不防又被花珠一手抢了，扔与珍珠，惹得大家笑个不住。珍珠着了鞋，捆上带子，起来将红香拧了两把。这一关也就算了。","en":"Zhenzhu's face flamed; she clutched at Hongxiang to get it back, but Hongxue took the shoe to fill it with wine. Huazhu swiftly snatched it away and threw it back to Zhenzhu. Laughter filled the air everywhere. Zhenzhu put the shoe back on, tied it, rose indignantly, and pinched Hongxiang twice. And with that, the round closed."},{"paragraph":49,"mentions":1,"tokens":["花珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，也只可秣马厉兵，与姐姐周旋。」绮香笑道：「众志成城，坚不可破，我让了你罢。」看青琴这打擂，已赢得不少，爱珠、花珠、红香、红玉、红雪、红霙都喝了许多酒。","en":"\\"Many hearts make a city unbreakable. I yield.\\" Qingqin's ring match had already won plenty of victories; Aizhu, Huazhu, Hongxiang, Hongyu, Hongxue, and Hongying had all drunk deeply."}]}`),"char-158":{11:[{paragraph:4,mentions:1,tokens:["画珠"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"谐，说不尽咏月吟风，闺房潇洒。又有十个美婢，名字都有一个珠字，宝珠、明珠、爱珠、花珠、荷珠、蕊珠、掌珠、珍珠、画珠、赠珠。这十珠都有十分姿色，年皆十五六岁，真像十样鲜花，一群粉蝶，个个慧心香口，莲步柳腰，针黹巧夺天工，词令皆成妙品。比郑康成之诗婢，少道学之风规，较郭令公之家姬，得风流之香主。华公子夫妇二人这样的妙才浓福，也就人间少有的了；兼之高堂未老，雄镇四夷，",en:"bearing the character 'Zhu' (Pearl) in her name: Baozhu, Mingzhu, Aizhu, Huazhu, Hezhu, Ruizhu, Zhangzhu, Zhenzhu, Yazhu, and Zengzhu. All fifteen or sixteen years of age, they bloomed like ten distinct varieties of fresh spring flowers, fluttering like a cluster of powdered butterflies. Each possessed a nimble mind and a fragrant tongue, walking with dainty lotus-steps"}],26:[{paragraph:1,mentions:1,tokens:["画珠"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"用些，玫瑰露、香稻露、荷花露、桂花露多加些，茯苓粉、莲子粉、琼糜粉、燕窝粉都照单子上分两。」宝珠答应了，便拉了画珠同去，先将那些东西配定了，又取了一碗香稻米，拎了一瓶雪水出来，也不到厨房，就在公子卧房前，一个八角琉璃亭的廊檐下，生了一个铜炉的火，用个银吊子，慢慢的熬起来。花珠亦在旁蹲着，拖下一条大红绦子，一半在地，就道：「爷今日像醉了，只管打量我们。一个人无缘无",en:`out the poria, lotus seed, qiongmi, and swallow's nest powders exactly as prescribed." Baozhu agreed and pulled Yazhu along with her. Having prepared the ingredients and fetched a bowl of sweet rice and a jar of snow water, they avoided the kitchen altogether. Instead, under the eaves of the octagonal glazed pavilion just outside his room, they lit a small copper brazier`}],41:[{paragraph:28,mentions:1,tokens:["画珠"],kind:"named-mention",zh:`昏后。私携手，眉黛愁，香肌瘦。
春宵一刻天长久，人前怎解芙蓉扣。
盼到灯昏玳筵收，宫壶滴尽莲花漏。《节节高》
画珠接唱，明珠合着唱道：`,en:`banquet ends,
Until the palace censer has dripped out its last lotus-flower drop. [Section by Section Higher]

Yazhu took up the next aria, with Mingzhu singing the harmony:`},{paragraph:29,mentions:1,tokens:["画珠"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"宕，文秀温存，十人中是他压卷了。次则爱珠，情韵皆到，为第二。次赠珠，次掌珠，次蕊珠，次珍珠，次花珠，次荷珠，次画珠，次明珠。不知定得不委屈么？」公子道：「定得极是。」夫人又问十珠婢道：「如有委屈，不妨自说。」花珠赔着笑道：「奴才唱的，似乎在蕊珠、珍珠之上。」华夫人道：「就是你不服，你那里知道自己唱的毛病。你想显己之长，压人之短，添出些腔调来，此所谓戏曲，非清曲。",en:'both emotion and charm. Then Zengzhu, then Zhangzhu, then Ruizhu, then Zhenzhu, then Huazhu, then Hezhu, then Yazhu, and then Mingzhu last. I hope this is not unjust?" The young master said, "The ranking is entirely right." His lady also invited the Ten Pearls: "If anyone feels hard done by, please speak freely." Huazhu said with a conciliatory smile, "I would venture'},{paragraph:37,mentions:1,tokens:["画珠"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"可以扮得。」花珠听了，红起脸来，扭转头，对着爱珠道：「还有爱珠也可扮得。」爱珠尚未开言，公子道：「爱珠是贴旦，画珠是老旦，宝珠是正旦，蕊珠是小旦。其余扮生、净、外、末，比八龄又强了。」夫人道：「这倒可以，只怕他们害羞，做不出来。」夫人一面说，一面看那桃花，映着夕阳，红的更如霞如锦，白的成了粉色，又有些如金色一般，分外好看，看看天色也将晚了，便对公子道：「今日也可",en:'Aizhu could too." Before Aizhu could reply, the young master said, "Aizhu would play the secondary female lead, Yazhu the older-woman role, Baozhu the principal female, and Ruizhu the ingenue. The rest could take on the male lead, painted-face, senior, and supporting roles, better than the the Eight Ages troupe." His lady said, "That could indeed work. I only fear they'}],57:[{paragraph:14,mentions:1,tokens:["画珠"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"了许三姐、小翠，要了荷珠，紫烟留了侍香，要了红薇、赠珠，佩秋留了金凤，要了红莲、红娟，蓉华留了秋莲，要了红雯、画珠，琼华留了青琴，要了珍珠、蕊珠。",en:"ranks. Peiqiu kept Jinfeng and added Honglian and Hongjuan. Ronghua retained Qiulian, bringing in Hongwen and Yazhu. Finally, Qionghua kept Qingqin and rounded out her forces with Zhenzhu and Ruizhu."},{paragraph:15,mentions:1,tokens:["画珠"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"是个不祥之兆。」蓉花笑道：「尚未出兵，倒已先砍了两个脑袋。」众人皆笑，又收过了。取蓉华的赵国来，秋莲掣了廉颇，画珠掣了蔺相如，红雯掣了平原君。蓉华道：「我这三根掣得好，大可折秦国的锐气。」再掣浣香的魏国，宝珠掣了信陵君，明珠掣了侯生，掌珠掣了醇酒妇人，大家又笑起来。绮香道：「这倒难，又算酒，又算妇人，横竖一出马，就叫人开心的。」掌珠道：「换一根罢。」红香道：「好",en:`have already lost two heads!" Laughter erupted again, and the tube was put away. For Zhao, Qiulian drew Lian Po, Yazhu drew Lin Xiangru, and Hongwen drew Lord Pingyuan. Ronghua beamed, "My three draws are excellent; we can easily blunt Qin's edge." For Wei, Baozhu drew Lord Xinling, Mingzhu drew Hou Sheng; and Zhangzhu drew the Drunken-Woman lot. This sparked even more`},{paragraph:17,mentions:1,tokens:["画珠"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"于是折了枝菊花来，命小丫鬟点鼓，到了蓉花，鼓已住了。蓉华笑道：「我这三员勇将正好出这个头阵，试试手段。」秋莲、画珠，红雯三个就上来，旁边又摆了一桌酒肴。秋莲把两个骰子一掷，掷了四点，是自己出马。秦国的爱珠、花珠、红香、红玉、红雪、红霙也过来。爱珠把骰子一掷，掷了二点，是花珠出马。花珠是商君，秋莲是廉颇。绮香翻出谱来，查到廉颇名下，内有一条：「廉颇如遇商君，俱系勇",en:`confidently, "My three champions are perfectly fit to lead the vanguard and demonstrate their skill." Qiulian, Yazhu, and Hongwen stepped forward to the staging area, where another table filled with wine and dishes had been set aside. Qiulian cast the two dice, rolling a four, meaning she would fight first. Qin's forces—Aizhu, Huazhu, Hongxiang, Hongyu, Hongxue, and`},{paragraph:19,mentions:5,tokens:["画珠"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"微红，幸众人不解，也过去了。秋莲只得央求旁人代了这碗饭，便除下胡子，指着花珠道：「我看你的笑话。」骰子掷了，是画珠，画珠是蔺相如。蓉花道：「廉颇无用，要看这相如了。」绮香看蔺相如的谱：「如败了，三杯俱系赵王代饮。」蓉华笑道：「画姑娘你须仔细些，不要丧师辱国，反累我喝酒。」画珠道：「奶奶放心，看我赢他。」无奈行的是猜枚令，画珠藏了三个瓜子，三次都被花珠猜着，画珠好",en:`ridiculous beard, and pointed directly at Huazhu, declaring, "Now I will watch you become the joke!" The dice fell to Yazhu, representing Lin Xiangru. Ronghua said, "Lian Po has failed us; now it is time for Xiangru." Qixiang read Lin Xiangru's entry: "If defeated, all three penalty cups must be drunk by the King of Zhao in his stead." Ronghua laughed nervously, "Miss Yazhu,`},{paragraph:21,mentions:7,tokens:["画珠"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"花珠手中藏了一颗莲子，叫红雯猜。画珠看见了，把脚踢一踢红雯的脚，红雯不解，看着画珠。画珠又指着桌上一盘的莲子，红雯又看到隔壁去了，道是鸭掌，便说道：「鸭掌。」画珠听了，大笑起来。红雯害臊说道：「你故意顽我。」画珠道：「我顽你？」花珠道：「他倒不是顽你，你倒是骂我。」便摊开手说道：「露冷",en:"Huazhu then hid a lotus seed in her hand for Hongwen to guess. Yazhu saw it and subtly kicked Hongwen's foot to give her a hint. Puzzled, Hongwen looked at Yazhu, who then pointed discreetly at a dish of lotus seeds resting on the table. However, Hongwen's gaze drifted sideways, and thinking of duck feet, she confidently"},{paragraph:22,mentions:2,tokens:["画珠"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"，也须领队前来纳降。」蓉华笑道：「这也不难。」便斟了一杯酒，走到绮香面前福了一福，绮香也还了一礼，笑而受之。那画珠、秋莲、红雯，只得也向花珠万福。花珠笑道：「我是甲冑在身，不能还礼。」画珠骂道：「你威风不要使尽了，只怕这回就要对人磕头呢。」于是又击起鼓来，花到了紫烟住了，侍香、红薇、赠珠上来。赠珠把骰子一掷，数到红薇，是高唐神女，众人皆笑。紫烟笑道：「好个红姑娘",en:'walked over to Qixiang, and gracefully curtsied. Qixiang returned the bow and accepted the cup with a warm smile. Yazhu, Qiulian, and Hongwen were then forced to curtsey to Huazhu, who had emerged victorious as Lord Shang. Huazhu laughed, "I have my armor on; I cannot return the courtesy." Yazhu retorted, "Do not spend all your swagger so quickly. You may well be kowtowing'}]},"char-159":JSON.parse(`{"11":[{"paragraph":4,"mentions":1,"tokens":["明珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"香十八岁上嫁了华光宿，真是瑶琴玉瑟，鱼水和谐，说不尽咏月吟风，闺房潇洒。又有十个美婢，名字都有一个珠字，宝珠、明珠、爱珠、花珠、荷珠、蕊珠、掌珠、珍珠、画珠、赠珠。这十珠都有十分姿色，年皆十五六岁，真像十样鲜花，一群粉蝶，个个慧心香口，莲步柳腰，针黹巧夺天工，词令皆成妙品。比郑康成之诗婢，少道学之风规，较郭令公之家姬，得风流之香主。华公子夫妇二人这样的妙才浓福，","en":"leisure. Serving them were ten beautiful maids, each bearing the character 'Zhu' (Pearl) in her name: Baozhu, Mingzhu, Aizhu, Huazhu, Hezhu, Ruizhu, Zhangzhu, Zhenzhu, Yazhu, and Zengzhu. All fifteen or sixteen years of age, they bloomed like ten distinct varieties of fresh spring flowers, fluttering like a cluster of powdered butterflies. Each possessed a nimble mind"},{"paragraph":41,"mentions":1,"tokens":["明珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"蕊珠伸过手来，一把拧住了红雪的嘴。红雪急忙用手解开，大家笑得弯了腰。 　　明珠一笑，袖子带着酒杯，砸了一个。外面夫人们也听得明白，袁夫人笑道：「他们还比我们会乐。」这边红玉掷了一个八不就，便道：「这个名色也难，凑不成的换了罢。」宝珠道：「怎么凑不成，我替你凑，包你一凑就凑上，总不教你八不就。」红玉道：「你说顽话呢，还是正经话？","en":"Hongxue struggled wildly to pry the fingers from her lips, the entire room doubled over in helpless laughter. Mingzhu laughed so violently that her flailing sleeve knocked a wine cup entirely off the table. The raucous merriment drifted clearly to the ladies in the outer room, prompting Mrs. Yuan to laugh, \\"They are proving vastly more entertaining than we are.\\" Meanwhile,"},{"paragraph":46,"mentions":2,"tokens":["明珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"上也要显显他的丫鬟的才学，便说道：「你们说的只要通，就说说也不妨。若说出来不通，便各人跪着罚一大杯酒。」红薇与明珠的记性最好，况且没有他们说的在里面，便说道：「通倒也算通，恐怕说了出来，非但不能受赏，更要受罚。」华夫人笑道：「你们且一一的说来。」于是明珠把爱珠、宝珠、荷珠骂人的三个令全说了、红薇也将红雪、红雯、红霙骂人的三个令也说了，笑得两位夫人头上的珠钿斜颤，","en":"cup.\\" Knowing their own memories were flawless and that their personal verses were free of offense, Hongwei and Mingzhu stepped forward. \\"They are coherent enough,\\" they admitted cautiously, \\"but we fear that by speaking them, instead of earning a reward, we shall only invite punishment.\\" Lady Hua laughed, \\"Go on, recite them one by one.\\" Thus, Mingzhu recounted the three"}],"26":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["明珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"家庙观音阁进香，叫奴才们改了装，都跟出去的。」公子进来坐下，那十珠都是十五六岁，倒也生得大致相仿，都不差上下。明珠先送上一盏冰梅汤，掌珠拿了鹅毛扇，轻轻的打着。珍珠便上前与公子脱了靴，换上盘珠登云履。荷珠与公子换了件轻纱衫子，都在两旁站着。宝珠便道：「爷可曾用饭？可要吩咐内厨房预备什么？」华公子道：「今日酒多了，觉得口渴。到定更后，你照着我前日开那防风粥的单子，","en":"Ten Pearls, all fifteen or sixteen years of age, were remarkably similar in beauty, each as lovely as the last. Mingzhu first offered him a bowl of iced plum broth, while Zhangzhu stood by, gently fanning him with a goose-feather fan. Zhenzhu came forward to draw off his boots and changed them for coiled-pearl cloud-climbing slippers, while Hezhu changed him into a light"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":1,"tokens":["明珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"掌珠一面打扇，一面看着公子与珊枝讲话，便心不在扇，一扇子扇脱了手，掉下地来，明珠嗤的一笑，掌珠红了脸，慌忙捡起。华公子倒笑了，道：「你们难道没有听过戏，听说到戏连心都没有了。歇天我就叫那一班人进来唱一天，请奶奶听，你们大家都托托福。」爱珠多嘴说道：「什么好班子？难道比咱们府里的还好吗？」华公子笑道：「你们也是十个，叫你们扮生，他","en":"listening to their conversation. Her mind wandered, and the fan slipped from her grasp, tumbling to the floor. Mingzhu let out a muffled giggle, and Zhangzhu, flushing deeply, hurriedly retrieved it. The Young Master laughed aloud. \\"Have you never heard opera before? Is mere talk of it enough to steal your hearts away? Someday, I will summon the entire troupe to perform"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":1,"tokens":["明珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"。」珊枝道：「这怎么好呢？一早把个魏师爷请在留青精舍里，等到此刻，一个多时辰，我也觉得饿了。你们吃过早饭么？」明珠道：「我们是早吃过了，吃剩的东西倒有，你不嫌脏，就吃了饭去，要等他出来不晓什么时候呢！」珊枝说道：「好说，姐姐吃剩的菜，只怕我还没有这福分呢。肯赏我，还敢嫌脏么。」爱珠道：「会说话，我瞧你眼也饿花了。」就同珊枝到一间屋子来。夏天是不用热的，荤荤素素菜","en":"Secretary Wei has been summoned since dawn and has waited over two hours. I am famished myself. Have you all eaten?\\" Mingzhu replied, \\"We finished long ago. There are leftovers, if you don't mind eating them. It's impossible to guess when he will come out.\\" \\"Dear sister, your scraps are far beyond my meager fortune,\\" Shanzhi laughed. \\"I would be honored; how could I possibly"}],"41":[{"paragraph":5,"mentions":4,"tokens":["明珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"约有两刻工夫，听得环佩琤琤，华夫人带了明珠、花珠、荷珠、赠珠四个女婢过来，华公子笑面相迎。华夫人道：「这两日天气甚好，我本来也想逛逛。方才香儿说你在这里钓鱼，我从西书房夹道中走来，倒也不远。我又叫老婆子收拾些食品过来。」华公子道：「我本有此意，你倒预先办妥了。」二人凭阑观玩了一会，华公子道：","en":"half an hour, the sound of tinkling ornaments announced the arrival of Madam Hua, attended by four maidservants—Mingzhu, Huazhu, Hezhu, and Zengzhu. The young master stepped forward with a smile to welcome her. Madam Hua said: \\"The weather has been so fine these past two days—I had been meaning to take a stroll. A moment ago Xiang'er told me you were here fishing, and"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":2,"tokens":["明珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「怎么样，你们也荡过桨的，今日又不会荡起来。」花珠笑道：「明珠不会荡，我望前，他倒望后。」明珠道：「不说你不会，倒说我不会。荷珠，你荡罢，再用着他，这个船就要翻了。」荷珠替了花珠，果然好了。清风徐来，涟漪深碧，慢慢的穿过小桥。公子与夫人看桥边及山石上缠的古藤，蒙蒙茸茸，垂到水面，底下的水，一派清冷戛玉之声，觉得","en":"is this? You have all handled oars before. How is it you have forgotten today?\\" Huazhu laughed, saying, \\"It is Mingzhu who cannot scull. I face forward, but she faces backward.\\" Mingzhu replied, \\"Never mind your own failings. Must you blame it all on me? Hezhu, you take over; let her keep at it and this boat will capsize.\\" Hezhu replaced Huazhu, and at once all went"},{"paragraph":7,"mentions":2,"tokens":["明珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"红白碧桃已开了好些。公子对夫人道：「赏花不可无酒，方才说老婆子预备，不知可曾停妥？」华夫人命花珠去看来，花珠拉明珠同他弄船过去。明珠道：「你又来混缠，不过爱顽罢了，那里真不认得路径？你从这后头走过古藤书屋，再过了猗香亭，就通方才来的路，要坐什么船？」花珠原是爱顽，并非不认得路径，只得独自出去。将到藤花书屋前，只见林珊枝正走来，口中嚷道：「花姑娘来了，想必在留仙院","en":"preparations. I wonder whether they are ready yet?\\" Madam Hua sent Huazhu to go and look, and Huazhu tried to drag Mingzhu along to pole the boat with her. Mingzhu said, \\"There you go again with your nonsense. You simply want an excuse to play on the water. Do you not know the way? Go through the old-wisteria study at the back, then past the Yixiang Pavilion, and you will"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":1,"tokens":["明珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「这曲文实在好，可以追步《玉茗堂四梦》，真才子之笔。」夫人道：「以后唯《红雪楼九种》可以匹敌，余皆不及。」只听明珠接着唱道：","en":"agreed: \\"After them, only the Nine Works from Red Snow Tower can stand as a rival; all else falls short.\\" Then Mingzhu took up the next aria and sang:"},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":1,"tokens":["明珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"明珠折了两枝红白桃花，拿个汝窑瓶插了，放在公子、夫人面前。又见珍珠唱道：","en":"Mingzhu broke two sprigs of red-and-white peach blossom, arranged them in a Ru-ware vase, and placed it before the young master and his lady. Zhenzhu then sang:"},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":1,"tokens":["明珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"手，眉黛愁，香肌瘦。\\n春宵一刻天长久，人前怎解芙蓉扣。\\n盼到灯昏玳筵收，宫壶滴尽莲花漏。《节节高》\\n画珠接唱，明珠合着唱道：","en":"censer has dripped out its last lotus-flower drop. [Section by Section Higher]\\n\\nYazhu took up the next aria, with Mingzhu singing the harmony:"},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":1,"tokens":["明珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"温存，十人中是他压卷了。次则爱珠，情韵皆到，为第二。次赠珠，次掌珠，次蕊珠，次珍珠，次花珠，次荷珠，次画珠，次明珠。不知定得不委屈么？」公子道：「定得极是。」夫人又问十珠婢道：「如有委屈，不妨自说。」花珠赔着笑道：「奴才唱的，似乎在蕊珠、珍珠之上。」华夫人道：「就是你不服，你那里知道自己唱的毛病。你想显己之长，压人之短，添出些腔调来，此所谓戏曲，非清曲。清曲要唱","en":"and charm. Then Zengzhu, then Zhangzhu, then Ruizhu, then Zhenzhu, then Huazhu, then Hezhu, then Yazhu, and then Mingzhu last. I hope this is not unjust?\\" The young master said, \\"The ranking is entirely right.\\" His lady also invited the Ten Pearls: \\"If anyone feels hard done by, please speak freely.\\" Huazhu said with a conciliatory smile, \\"I would venture to think that"}],"45":[{"paragraph":28,"mentions":1,"tokens":["明珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"。\\n只惜豪华怒碎琴，明珠减价珊瑚贱。\\n仲清道：「这不消说是华公子。」子云道：「竟连前日的事，都说出来了。你知道明珠、珊瑚的故事么？」仲清道：「我不知这句的故事。」文泽道：「明珠是他有十婢，皆以珠字为名，这珊瑚就是林珊枝了。」又看写的是：","en":"\\"Shi Chong and Wang Kai, all envied their wealth,\\nNoble gates by Heaven's favor blessed.\\nPity such splendor vented rage at a qin,\\nBright pearls cheapened, coral branches priced less.\\"\\nZhongqing exclaimed, \\"That can only be Young Master Hua.\\" Ziyun agreed, \\"Even last week's quarrel appears. Do you know the pearl and coral story?\\" Zhongqing shook his head. \\"I don't know that line.\\" Wenze explained, \\"The pearls were his ten maids, all named with 'pearl.' The coral is Lin Shanzhi.\\" The next lines read:"}],"52":[{"paragraph":24,"mentions":1,"tokens":["明珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"只得说道：「我不与人瞧，我恐扇旧了，已收起了。」华夫人也不疑心他给了人。将要出门，带了宝珠、爱珠、蕊珠、珍珠、明珠、掌珠六婢，又带了小香儿与两个仆妇。此时新秋，天气尚热，也不须多带衣服，带了一个小锦箱、一个锦匣，装些花钿脂粉。外面叫一个老年的管家骑了顶马，金龄、玉龄、兰龄、桂龄骑了跟班马。华夫人出房到内花厅，就坐肩舆，出了垂花门，上了车，另有车道。绕过大堂，家人","en":"away.\\" Lady Hua suspected nothing. Preparing to depart, she brought along six maids—Baozhu, Aizhu, Ruizhu, Zhenzhu, Mingzhu, and Zhangzhu—along with little Xiang'er and two older servant women. Since it was early autumn and the weather remained warm, they did not pack many heavy clothes, only bringing a small brocade chest and a casket containing cosmetics and ornaments."}],"57":[{"paragraph":14,"mentions":1,"tokens":["明珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"你那个小国埋没。」爱珠、花珠笑了，站了过来。绮香自己点了爱珠、花珠、红香、红玉、红雪、红霙，浣香自己留了宝珠、明珠、掌珠，浣兰留了许三姐、小翠，要了荷珠，紫烟留了侍香，要了红薇、赠珠，佩秋留了金凤，要了红莲、红娟，蓉华留了秋莲，要了红雯、画珠，琼华留了青琴，要了珍珠、蕊珠。","en":"Qixiang chose Aizhu, Huazhu, Hongxiang, Hongyu, Hongxue, and Hongying for her own forces. Huanxiang kept Baozhu, Mingzhu, and Zhangzhu. Huanlan retained Sanjie and Xiaocui, and added Hezhu. Ziyan kept Shixiang, taking Hongwei and Zengzhu to fill her ranks. Peiqiu kept Jinfeng and added Honglian and Hongjuan. Ronghua retained Qiulian, bringing in Hongwen and Yazhu. Finally,"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":1,"tokens":["明珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"画珠掣了蔺相如，红雯掣了平原君。蓉华道：「我这三根掣得好，大可折秦国的锐气。」再掣浣香的魏国，宝珠掣了信陵君，明珠掣了侯生，掌珠掣了醇酒妇人，大家又笑起来。绮香道：「这倒难，又算酒，又算妇人，横竖一出马，就叫人开心的。」掌珠道：「换一根罢。」红香道：「好便宜事。」忙将筹拿开了。掌珠无奈，也只得捏了那根筹，脸上甚是羞愧。再掣浣兰的齐国，浣兰道：「我这国就掣得平常，","en":"Ronghua beamed, \\"My three draws are excellent; we can easily blunt Qin's edge.\\" For Wei, Baozhu drew Lord Xinling, Mingzhu drew Hou Sheng; and Zhangzhu drew the Drunken-Woman lot. This sparked even more laughter. Qixiang noted, \\"That is an awkward one; it counts as both wine and a woman. Whichever element rides out first will surely cheer everyone up.\\" Zhangzhu pleaded,"},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":3,"tokens":["明珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"重掷骰子，数到明珠，是侯生，是个《顶针续麻令》。李斯输了喝酒，侯生输了要喝酱油。明珠道：「这个酱油倒有些难喝呢。」花珠低低说道：「吃杯醋罢，比酱油还好些。」众佳人听了，忍不住笑。明珠也不理他，说道：「十月之交。」","en":"They cast the dice once more, and Mingzhu was called up as Hou Sheng, playing the \\"Linked-Phrase Drinking Game\\" chain game. The rules stated that if Li Si lost, the penalty was wine; if Hou Sheng lost, the penalty was soy sauce. Mingzhu groaned, \\"Soy sauce is incredibly hard to swallow.\\" Huazhu"},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":7,"tokens":["明珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"红雪道：「交交黄鸟。」明珠道：「鸟鸣嘤嘤。」红雪道：「嘤其鸣矣。」明珠道：「请教这个矣字怎样接，这不是难人？」罚了红雪一杯，喝了说道：「我换一个已字罢。」即道：「已焉哉。」明珠道：「又要罚。」红雪道：「你单念过一部《诗经》，没有念过别的经书，就说没有哉字的起头。」明珠不服，红","en":"Hongxue said, \\"Yellow birds cry jiao-jiao.\\" Mingzhu answered, \\"Birds sing ying-ying.\\" Hongxue countered, \\"Ying—they cry.\\" Mingzhu was stumped, \\"How do I link to yi? Aren't you making it impossible?\\" Hongxue was fined a cup, drank it, and said, \\"I'll switch to yi, meaning 'already': 'Already it is ended.'\\""}]}`),"char-160":JSON.parse(`{"11":[{"paragraph":4,"mentions":1,"tokens":["荷珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"宿，真是瑶琴玉瑟，鱼水和谐，说不尽咏月吟风，闺房潇洒。又有十个美婢，名字都有一个珠字，宝珠、明珠、爱珠、花珠、荷珠、蕊珠、掌珠、珍珠、画珠、赠珠。这十珠都有十分姿色，年皆十五六岁，真像十样鲜花，一群粉蝶，个个慧心香口，莲步柳腰，针黹巧夺天工，词令皆成妙品。比郑康成之诗婢，少道学之风规，较郭令公之家姬，得风流之香主。华公子夫妇二人这样的妙才浓福，也就人间少有的了；","en":"were ten beautiful maids, each bearing the character 'Zhu' (Pearl) in her name: Baozhu, Mingzhu, Aizhu, Huazhu, Hezhu, Ruizhu, Zhangzhu, Zhenzhu, Yazhu, and Zengzhu. All fifteen or sixteen years of age, they bloomed like ten distinct varieties of fresh spring flowers, fluttering like a cluster of powdered butterflies. Each possessed a nimble mind and a fragrant tongue,"},{"paragraph":43,"mentions":6,"tokens":["荷珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"红香掷了一个正双飞，偏也凑不上来。想着了几句，又不是一韵，这边荷珠道：「我代你说一个好的，叫你再不恨我。」红香当他是好心，便道：「好姐姐，你代我说了罢。」荷珠笑道：「我虽代你说，这令是原算你的。」便念道：正双飞，有愿几时谐，捱一刻似一夏。并头莲，庶几夙夜。红香红着脸，要撕荷珠的嘴，经众人劝住。荷珠掷了一个一枝花，正","en":"found herself utterly incapable of assembling the verse. The few phrases she conjured stubbornly refused to rhyme. Hezhu offered sweetly, \\"I shall compose a beautiful verse for you, one that will ensure you never ignore me again.\\" Assuming the offer was born of genuine kindness, Hongxiang replied, \\"Good elder sister, please compose it for me then.\\" Hezhu laughed, \\"Though"},{"paragraph":44,"mentions":1,"tokens":["荷珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"红雪、红香过去拉开了，红霙头上花朵也掉了，头发也弄得蓬蓬的，便把手掠了一会，骂荷珠道：「顽得这般粗卤。说说罢了，就要认真。」这一会闹，闹得华夫人、袁夫人都按捺不住了，便叫家人媳妇进来查问，不许他们顽笑。群婢才息声静气的，赶紧的吃了一碗饭，都出来伺候。夫人们看这一班顽婢，有闹得花朵歪斜的，鬓发蓬松的，还有些背转脸去要笑的，还有些气忿","en":"Hongxue and Hongxiang finally rushed over, prying the furious Hezhu away. Sitting up, Hongying discovered the delicate flowers had been torn from her hair, her elegant tresses left a disheveled ruin. She spent a long moment smoothing her hair back into place before fiercely scolding Hezhu: \\"What brutish, reckless play!"},{"paragraph":46,"mentions":1,"tokens":["荷珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「通倒也算通，恐怕说了出来，非但不能受赏，更要受罚。」华夫人笑道：「你们且一一的说来。」于是明珠把爱珠、宝珠、荷珠骂人的三个令全说了、红薇也将红雪、红雯、红霙骂人的三个令也说了，笑得两位夫人头上的珠钿斜颤，欲要装做正色责备他们，也装不过来。苏小姐虽嫌他们过于亵狎，然心里也赞他们敏慧，不便大笑，只好微颔而已。","en":"on, recite them one by one.\\" Thus, Mingzhu recounted the three offensive entries composed by Aizhu, Baozhu, and Hezhu, while Hongwei recited the three scandalous verses authored by Hongxue, Hongwen, and Hongying. The effect was absolute: both ladies laughed so helplessly that the heavy pearl ornaments in their hair quivered and swayed wildly. Though they desperately"},{"paragraph":47,"mentions":1,"tokens":["荷珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"肆无忌惮的。」便与华夫人评定这六个令，太恶者罚一大觞酒，打手掌三板，以示薄责；其次者罚酒免责。于是红雪、红霙、荷珠、宝珠受了责罚；爱珠、红雯单罚了酒。群婢受罚起来好不羞愧，又喝了这些急酒，觉得有些晃宕起来，勉强扎挣住了，深悔一时高兴。","en":"chastisement. For the lesser offenses, a simple forfeit cup of wine was deemed sufficient. Thus, Hongxue, Hongying, Hezhu, and Baozhu suffered both the wine and the stinging slaps, while Aizhu and Hongwen escaped with only the wine forfeit. Receiving their punishments in utter humiliation, and having thrown back the harsh wine in such haste, the maids found themselves swaying"}],"26":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["荷珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"致相仿，都不差上下。明珠先送上一盏冰梅汤，掌珠拿了鹅毛扇，轻轻的打着。珍珠便上前与公子脱了靴，换上盘珠登云履。荷珠与公子换了件轻纱衫子，都在两旁站着。宝珠便道：「爷可曾用饭？可要吩咐内厨房预备什么？」华公子道：「今日酒多了，觉得口渴。到定更后，你照着我前日开那防风粥的单子，配着那几样花露果粉，用文武火熬，一时二刻不可见着铜器，还是你亲手做去，不要经那老婆子的手，","en":"fan. Zhenzhu came forward to draw off his boots and changed them for coiled-pearl cloud-climbing slippers, while Hezhu changed him into a light gauze robe; then they all stood to either side. Baozhu then asked, \\"Has the Master dined? Shall we order the inner kitchen to prepare anything?\\" \\"I drank too much today and feel parched,\\" the Young Master replied. \\"After the"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":1,"tokens":["荷珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"。」爱珠道：「我不会回，要回你自去回。」珊枝道：「好姐姐，我若进得去还求你？」又迟延了一回，爱珠故意刁难，倒是荷珠做好人进去了。半个时辰始听脚步响，是公子出来。原来华公子与华夫人说得高兴，忽然疲倦，就在他夫人床上躺了一回，却谁敢去惊动他，直到醒时已是未末。","en":"could step inside, I wouldn't need to beg you.\\" After more delay, with Aizhu deliberately making things difficult, Hezhu finally relented and went inside. After an hour, footsteps sounded, and the Young Master emerged. He and his wife had talked until they were exhausted, and he had lain down for a while on his wife's bed. Naturally, no one dared to wake him, and he only"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":1,"tokens":["荷珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"适见荷珠来问，华公子想起早上之约，已经迟了，只好吃晚饭的了，便就从侧边一个角门走出去，却只与留青精舍隔一个院子。 　　珊枝疾忙先去照应了，聘才连忙走出到窗前，华公子已到，聘才便请了一个安。华公子一手拉住说道：「本约足下早上过来谈谈，不料我昨日多吃了酒，今日起","en":"Seeing Hezhu inquire, the Young Master suddenly recalled his morning appointment. Realizing it was already late, and that he could only offer supper now, he slipped through a side gate that opened directly onto the courtyard of the Quiet-Green Retreat, only one courtyard"}],"41":[{"paragraph":5,"mentions":3,"tokens":["荷珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"约有两刻工夫，听得环佩琤琤，华夫人带了明珠、花珠、荷珠、赠珠四个女婢过来，华公子笑面相迎。华夫人道：「这两日天气甚好，我本来也想逛逛。方才香儿说你在这里钓鱼，我从西书房夹道中走来，倒也不远。我又叫老婆子收拾些食品过来。」华公子道：「我本有此意，你倒预先办妥了。」二人凭阑观玩了一会，华公子道：「我们何不下","en":"sound of tinkling ornaments announced the arrival of Madam Hua, attended by four maidservants—Mingzhu, Huazhu, Hezhu, and Zengzhu. The young master stepped forward with a smile to welcome her. Madam Hua said: \\"The weather has been so fine these past two days—I had been meaning to take a stroll. A moment ago Xiang'er told me you were here fishing, and I came by way"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":3,"tokens":["荷珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"也荡过桨的，今日又不会荡起来。」花珠笑道：「明珠不会荡，我望前，他倒望后。」明珠道：「不说你不会，倒说我不会。荷珠，你荡罢，再用着他，这个船就要翻了。」荷珠替了花珠，果然好了。清风徐来，涟漪深碧，慢慢的穿过小桥。公子与夫人看桥边及山石上缠的古藤，蒙蒙茸茸，垂到水面，底下的水，一派清冷戛玉之声，觉得心旷神怡。过了小桥，苏堤上便是些杨柳桃花，红绿相间，春风和煦，众鸟","en":"forward, but she faces backward.\\" Mingzhu replied, \\"Never mind your own failings. Must you blame it all on me? Hezhu, you take over; let her keep at it and this boat will capsize.\\" Hezhu replaced Huazhu, and at once all went smoothly. A light breeze drifted past; the ripples shimmered deep green as the craft glided slowly beneath a small bridge. The young master and"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":1,"tokens":["荷珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"公子笑道：「这叫做与人同乐。但是他们祭花是要拜的，不好同我们一样。」十珠都微微笑起来。掌珠对荷珠低低说道：「要拜我们十个一同拜，不要分先后，省得先拜的叫后拜的笑。」爱珠道：「我们一对一对的拜不好吗？」花珠凑着爱珠的耳说道：「又不是夫妻拜堂，怎么你要一对对的拜呢？」爱珠打他一下。已见老婆子颤巍巍的拎了一大瓶酒来，放在廊下。十珠等各拿了小酒杯斟了酒","en":"cannot do it the same way as we did.\\" All Ten Pearls broke into quiet smiles. Zhangzhu said in a low voice to Hezhu: \\"If we are to bow, let all ten of us bow at the same moment—no one first, no one last, so that those who bow first won't be laughed at by those who bow after.\\" Aizhu said: \\"Would it not be better for us to bow in pairs?\\" Huazhu leaned close to Aizhu's"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":1,"tokens":["荷珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"一声声乱我柔肠。翱翔双凤凰。海南异品风飘荡，要打着美人心上痒。《雁过声》\\n掌珠一面唱，一面将帕子打了一个结，望荷珠脸上打来。","en":"beauty. [Sound of Geese Passing]\\n\\nAll the while she sang, Zhangzhu tied a knot in her handkerchief and flung it at Hezhu's face."},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":2,"tokens":["荷珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"荷珠嗤的一笑，公子喝了一声采，夫人也嫣然微笑。二人各饮了一杯，听荷珠唱道：","en":"Hezhu burst into laughter; the young master called out his approval, and his lady smiled serenely. Both drank a cup each, then listened as Hezhu sang:"},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":1,"tokens":["荷珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"得风神跌宕，文秀温存，十人中是他压卷了。次则爱珠，情韵皆到，为第二。次赠珠，次掌珠，次蕊珠，次珍珠，次花珠，次荷珠，次画珠，次明珠。不知定得不委屈么？」公子道：「定得极是。」夫人又问十珠婢道：「如有委屈，不妨自说。」花珠赔着笑道：「奴才唱的，似乎在蕊珠、珍珠之上。」华夫人道：「就是你不服，你那里知道自己唱的毛病。你想显己之长，压人之短，添出些腔调来，此所谓戏曲，","en":"who conveyed both emotion and charm. Then Zengzhu, then Zhangzhu, then Ruizhu, then Zhenzhu, then Huazhu, then Hezhu, then Yazhu, and then Mingzhu last. I hope this is not unjust?\\" The young master said, \\"The ranking is entirely right.\\" His lady also invited the Ten Pearls: \\"If anyone feels hard done by, please speak freely.\\" Huazhu said with a conciliatory smile,"}],"44":[{"paragraph":7,"mentions":1,"tokens":["荷珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"是看桃花去了。奶奶没有去。」珊枝又听里面一人说话：「你听是谁？」那人道：「是林珊枝儿，还有谁！」珊枝知是花珠、荷珠，就急往园中来。只见姹紫嫣红，和风骀荡，一径往留仙院走去。到了园后，听得笑声盈耳，又像念诗的，却是女儿声口。珊枝便轻了脚步，绕到西边，隐身在太湖石后，从石穴中远远望去，只见蕊珠穿了桃红绸袄，绿绸背心，跪在桃花林下，背的是《长恨歌》，背到了：","en":"\\"Listen — who is that?\\" The voice replied: \\"Lin Shanzhi, of course — who else?\\" Shanzhi recognized it as Huazhu and Hezhu, and went off quickly toward the garden. He passed through a blaze of crimson and pink, in a languid and gentle breeze, and went straight along to the Liu Xian Courtyard. Reaching the rear of the garden, he could hear laughter everywhere, and what sounded"}],"57":[{"paragraph":14,"mentions":1,"tokens":["荷珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"过来。绮香自己点了爱珠、花珠、红香、红玉、红雪、红霙，浣香自己留了宝珠、明珠、掌珠，浣兰留了许三姐、小翠，要了荷珠，紫烟留了侍香，要了红薇、赠珠，佩秋留了金凤，要了红莲、红娟，蓉华留了秋莲，要了红雯、画珠，琼华留了青琴，要了珍珠、蕊珠。","en":"for her own forces. Huanxiang kept Baozhu, Mingzhu, and Zhangzhu. Huanlan retained Sanjie and Xiaocui, and added Hezhu. Ziyan kept Shixiang, taking Hongwei and Zengzhu to fill her ranks. Peiqiu kept Jinfeng and added Honglian and Hongjuan. Ronghua retained Qiulian, bringing in Hongwen and Yazhu. Finally, Qionghua kept Qingqin and rounded out her forces with Zhenzhu and"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":1,"tokens":["荷珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"看小翠掣一根，已经失笑，再看三姐掣出来，大家笑得如花枝乱颤，扎挣不住。原来小翠一根是鸡鸣，三姐一根是狗盗，幸亏荷珠掣了孟尝君，稍可解嘲。再掣琼华的韩国，蕊珠掣了张子房，青琴掣了博浪椎，珍珠掣了圯上老人。琼华笑道：「我早说的，绮香姐姐你仔细博浪椎、荆轲匕首，好不利害。就是高唐神女、醇酒妇人教你受用罢。」红薇道：「奶奶且慢喜欢，只怕奶奶手下也有个笑话出来呢！」绮香道","en":"able to sit upright. Xiaocui had drawn the rooster's crow, while Sanjie had drawn the dog-thief. Fortunately, Hezhu drew Lord Mengchang, which was just enough to laugh off the shame. They then drew for Qionghua's state of Han: Ruizhu drew Zhang Liang, Qingqin drew the Bolang hammer, and Zhenzhu drew the old man at the bridge. Qionghua laughed, \\"I warned you, Sister"},{"paragraph":34,"mentions":1,"tokens":["荷珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"于是传花又传到浣兰，点将出马是荷珠孟尝君，那边点了红霙的赵高。浣香笑道：「赵高如何是孟尝君的对手？且看谱来。」孟尝君是食客三千，令两人用骰子六颗对掷，如遇红遇么者，出钱投于盆内，六红即投六钱，两红两么即投四钱，无红无么即赢此钱。如孟尝君赢了，问那人：「你有的是什么？没有的是什么？要的","en":"Then the flower passed on to Huanlan, whose commission sent forth Hezhu as Lord Mengchang, while the other side appointed Hongying as Zhao Gao. Huanxiang laughed, \\"How is Zhao Gao any match for Lord Mengchang? Let us see the rules.\\" Lord Mengchang kept three thousand table-guests, so the two were to cast six dice against"},{"paragraph":35,"mentions":6,"tokens":["荷珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"红霙与荷珠掷了一会，红霙输了，荷珠问道：「你有的是什么？」红霙道：「我有的是：绣檀回枕玉雕锼。」荷珠又问道：「你没有的是什么？」红霙道：「我没有的是：珍簟新铺翡翠楼。」荷珠又问道：「你要的是什么？」红霙道：「我要的是：红珠斗帐樱桃熟。」荷珠道：「你不要的呢？」","en":"Hongying and Hezhu cast for a while, and Hongying lost. Hezhu asked, \\"What do you have?\\" Hongying said, \\"What I have is: 'An embroidered sandalwood pillow, fretted and carved like jade.'\\" Hezhu asked again, \\"What do you lack?\\" Hongying said, \\"What I lack is: 'A precious"},{"paragraph":36,"mentions":3,"tokens":["荷珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"香小洞幽。你没有的是：娇娆意绪不胜羞。。你要的是：鸳鸯帐下香犹暖。你不要的是：嫁个萧郎爱远游。」浣香听了，笑骂荷珠道：「荷儿怎么这般轻薄？」绮香正笑着，尚未开口，红霙气极要打起荷珠来，荷珠再四的赔礼，群珠又与他央求，红霙方才饶他。众佳人笑道：「荷姑娘这几句太刻薄，幸遇着人多，不然是挨定□姑娘的打。」到了小翠的鸡鸣来了，小翠上来就有些发怯。看谱是接牌令。","en":"What you do not want is: 'To marry a young Xiao who loves to roam afar.'\\" At this Huanxiang laughingly scolded Hezhu: \\"He'er, how can you be so saucy?\\" Qixiang was still laughing and had not yet spoken when Hongying, in a fury, made to strike Hezhu; Hezhu apologized over and over, the other maids pleaded for her, and only then did Hongying let her off. The beauties"}]}`),"char-161":{11:[{paragraph:4,mentions:1,tokens:["蕊珠"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"是瑶琴玉瑟，鱼水和谐，说不尽咏月吟风，闺房潇洒。又有十个美婢，名字都有一个珠字，宝珠、明珠、爱珠、花珠、荷珠、蕊珠、掌珠、珍珠、画珠、赠珠。这十珠都有十分姿色，年皆十五六岁，真像十样鲜花，一群粉蝶，个个慧心香口，莲步柳腰，针黹巧夺天工，词令皆成妙品。比郑康成之诗婢，少道学之风规，较郭令公之家姬，得风流之香主。华公子夫妇二人这样的妙才浓福，也就人间少有的了；兼之高",en:"beautiful maids, each bearing the character 'Zhu' (Pearl) in her name: Baozhu, Mingzhu, Aizhu, Huazhu, Hezhu, Ruizhu, Zhangzhu, Zhenzhu, Yazhu, and Zengzhu. All fifteen or sixteen years of age, they bloomed like ten distinct varieties of fresh spring flowers, fluttering like a cluster of powdered butterflies. Each possessed a nimble mind and a fragrant tongue, walking"},{paragraph:39,mentions:2,tokens:["蕊珠"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"蕊珠掷了个鳅入菱窠，嫌这名色不好，要不算。众人不依。蕊珠只得细想，也想不出来，觉句句总连络不上。红雪笑道：",en:"Ruizhu threw the dice, landing the pattern 'A Loach Slipping into a Water-Chestnut Nest.' Disgusted by the unrefined name, she said it did not count and demanded a redraw, but the others vehemently refused to allow it. Forced to comply, Ruizhu thought desperately,"},{paragraph:40,mentions:1,tokens:["蕊珠"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"「我也代你说，你也要谢谢媒。」蕊珠道：「若好的，你就说。若骂人的，就免劳照顾。」红雪道：「不骂你，你还要感激我呢。」众人道：「你且念出来。」红雪笑道：鳅入菱窠，翠羽戏兰苕，侯门不许老僧敲。秃厮儿，与子偕老。",en:'"I shall compose for you as well, but you too must thank me as the matchmaker." Ruizhu eyed her suspiciously. "If the verse is decent, speak it. But if it is merely an insult, spare me the favor." Hongxue smiled mischievously. "I would not insult you. In truth, you shall be deeply grateful to me." Urged on by the eager crowd, Hongxue laughed'},{paragraph:41,mentions:1,tokens:["蕊珠"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"蕊珠伸过手来，一把拧住了红雪的嘴。红雪急忙用手解开，大家笑得弯了腰。 　　明珠一笑，袖子带着酒杯，砸了一个。外面夫人们也听得明白，袁夫人笑道：「他们还比我们会乐。」这边红玉掷了一个八不就，便道：「这个名色也难，凑不成的换了罢。」宝珠道：「怎么凑不成，我替",en:"With a shriek, Ruizhu lunged forward and pinched Hongxue's mouth tightly shut. As Hongxue struggled wildly to pry the fingers from her lips, the entire room doubled over in helpless laughter. Mingzhu laughed so violently that her flailing sleeve knocked a wine cup entirely"}],41:[{paragraph:27,mentions:1,tokens:["蕊珠"],kind:"named-mention",zh:`腔》
公子道：「这「见惯司空也应羞」之句，岂常人道得出来？」夫人道：「与「今番小杜扬州」句，真是同一妙笔。」见蕊珠唱起，宝珠合着唱道：`,en:`lady said: "Together with 'a little Du Mu visits Yangzhou,' these are truly from the same inspired pen." Then Ruizhu began, with Baozhu joining in harmony:`},{paragraph:29,mentions:2,tokens:["蕊珠"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"我评来，以宝珠为第一，唱得风神跌宕，文秀温存，十人中是他压卷了。次则爱珠，情韵皆到，为第二。次赠珠，次掌珠，次蕊珠，次珍珠，次花珠，次荷珠，次画珠，次明珠。不知定得不委屈么？」公子道：「定得极是。」夫人又问十珠婢道：「如有委屈，不妨自说。」花珠赔着笑道：「奴才唱的，似乎在蕊珠、珍珠之上。」华夫人道：「就是你不服，你那里知道自己唱的毛病。你想显己之长，压人之短，添",en:'the peerless performer. Second is Aizhu, who conveyed both emotion and charm. Then Zengzhu, then Zhangzhu, then Ruizhu, then Zhenzhu, then Huazhu, then Hezhu, then Yazhu, and then Mingzhu last. I hope this is not unjust?" The young master said, "The ranking is entirely right." His lady also invited the Ten Pearls: "If anyone feels hard done by, please speak freely."'},{paragraph:37,mentions:1,tokens:["蕊珠"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"起脸来，扭转头，对着爱珠道：「还有爱珠也可扮得。」爱珠尚未开言，公子道：「爱珠是贴旦，画珠是老旦，宝珠是正旦，蕊珠是小旦。其余扮生、净、外、末，比八龄又强了。」夫人道：「这倒可以，只怕他们害羞，做不出来。」夫人一面说，一面看那桃花，映着夕阳，红的更如霞如锦，白的成了粉色，又有些如金色一般，分外好看，看看天色也将晚了，便对公子道：「今日也可算尽兴，我有些乏了，进去",en:'said, "Aizhu would play the secondary female lead, Yazhu the older-woman role, Baozhu the principal female, and Ruizhu the ingenue. The rest could take on the male lead, painted-face, senior, and supporting roles, better than the the Eight Ages troupe." His lady said, "That could indeed work. I only fear they would be too shy to carry it off convincingly." As she spoke,'}],44:[{paragraph:7,mentions:1,tokens:["蕊珠"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"园后，听得笑声盈耳，又像念诗的，却是女儿声口。珊枝便轻了脚步，绕到西边，隐身在太湖石后，从石穴中远远望去，只见蕊珠穿了桃红绸袄，绿绸背心，跪在桃花林下，背的是《长恨歌》，背到了：",en:'western side, concealing himself behind a Taihu rock, peering through a gap in the stone from a distance. He saw Ruizhu, dressed in a peach-pink silk jacket and green silk vest, kneeling under the peach trees and reciting the "Song of Everlasting Sorrow." She had arrived at the lines:'},{paragraph:8,mentions:2,tokens:["蕊珠"],kind:"named-mention",zh:`春带雨。
到了「梨花一枝春带雨」，便重了两句，背不下去。公子哈哈大笑道：「跪了之后，还背不出来，只好打了。」见蕊珠涨红了脸，越想越想不出来。旁边爱珠在那里笑他，宝珠在公子身后抓着脸羞他，羞得蕊珠要哭出来。这两日公子与夫人把这十珠作个消遣法子，教他们念唐诗，念熟了背，背错了要罚。`,en:`pear blossoms in spring rain, trailing its tears still."

At the line "a spray of pear blossoms in spring rain," Ruizhu stumbled, repeated two lines, and could not go on. The young master burst out laughing. "Still kneeling, and you still can't recite it," he said. "You deserve a smacking." Ruizhu's face had turned deep red. She tried and tried again but could not recall`},{paragraph:9,mentions:1,tokens:["蕊珠"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"多的，跪了还要打几下手板。今日宝珠背了李义山《无题》六首，错了一字，没有记过。爱珠背了《琵琶行》，竟一字不错。蕊珠背《长恨歌》，已经错了许多，故跪在地下，又背不出来，那三珠又一言半语的笑他，他已气得难受，又不敢站起来跑了出去。",en:'one wrong character and no demerit recorded. Aizhu had recited the "Song of the Pipa" without a single error. Ruizhu, reciting the "Song of Everlasting Sorrow," had already accumulated many errors, and so was kneeling on the ground; now she could not recite further, while the other three Pearl-maids chipped in with a word or a phrase to tease her. Half beside herself'},{paragraph:11,mentions:1,tokens:["蕊珠"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"四珠婢听了，也觉诧异。那蕊珠尚跪在地下呆呆的看着珊枝讲话，自己忘其所以，花片落了一头，还拿一片花瓣在嘴里嚼了一会，吐在爱珠手上，爱珠瞅了他一眼。",en:"The four Pearl-maid attendants, hearing all this, were also astonished. And Ruizhu, still kneeling on the ground, had been staring blankly at Shanzhi as he spoke, lost in a dream of her own: a shower of petals had fallen all over her head, and she was idly chewing a petal in her mouth, which she then spat out onto Aizhu's hand. Aizhu"},{paragraph:14,mentions:1,tokens:["蕊珠"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"公子被这两人劝了一番，气虽平了些，究不能尽释，坐着不语。蕊珠跪了这半天，虽有个垫子垫着，膝盖也跪得很疼，又遇着要小便起来，满脸飞红，那要笑要哭的光景，令人可怜。公子生了这一回气，又听珊枝、宝珠说话，就忘了他还跪着。",en:"young master considerably; his anger had partly subsided, but he could not entirely release it. He sat in silence. Ruizhu had been kneeling all this time — though a cushion had been placed beneath her — and her knees had grown quite painful. Nature was also pressing her with some urgency; her face flushed crimson in that expression somewhere between the desire to laugh"},{paragraph:15,mentions:4,tokens:["蕊珠"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"蕊珠急了，只得说道：「跪到明日，也想不出的了，要打倒是打罢。」公子听了，倒笑了一笑，道：「起来罢，我也忘了你还跪着。」蕊珠站起来，曲着腰，将膝盖揉了揉，徜徜徉徉的走开道：「冤不冤，跪了这半天。」找个僻静地方小解去了。华公子起身回夫人房内，宝珠、爱珠随了进",en:'In desperation Ruizhu finally said: "I could kneel until tomorrow and still not remember it. You had better just give me my punishment." The young master laughed in spite of himself. "Get up," he said. "I had forgotten you were still kneeling." Ruizhu stood, bent over, rubbed'}],52:[{paragraph:24,mentions:1,tokens:["蕊珠"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"时没有留心，只得说道：「我不与人瞧，我恐扇旧了，已收起了。」华夫人也不疑心他给了人。将要出门，带了宝珠、爱珠、蕊珠、珍珠、明珠、掌珠六婢，又带了小香儿与两个仆妇。此时新秋，天气尚热，也不须多带衣服，带了一个小锦箱、一个锦匣，装些花钿脂粉。外面叫一个老年的管家骑了顶马，金龄、玉龄、兰龄、桂龄骑了跟班马。华夫人出房到内花厅，就坐肩舆，出了垂花门，上了车，另有车道。绕",en:`already stored it away." Lady Hua suspected nothing. Preparing to depart, she brought along six maids—Baozhu, Aizhu, Ruizhu, Zhenzhu, Mingzhu, and Zhangzhu—along with little Xiang'er and two older servant women. Since it was early autumn and the weather remained warm, they did not pack many heavy clothes, only bringing a small brocade chest and a casket containing cosmetics`}],57:[{paragraph:14,mentions:1,tokens:["蕊珠"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"留了侍香，要了红薇、赠珠，佩秋留了金凤，要了红莲、红娟，蓉华留了秋莲，要了红雯、画珠，琼华留了青琴，要了珍珠、蕊珠。",en:"Qiulian, bringing in Hongwen and Yazhu. Finally, Qionghua kept Qingqin and rounded out her forces with Zhenzhu and Ruizhu."},{paragraph:16,mentions:1,tokens:["蕊珠"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"家笑得如花枝乱颤，扎挣不住。原来小翠一根是鸡鸣，三姐一根是狗盗，幸亏荷珠掣了孟尝君，稍可解嘲。再掣琼华的韩国，蕊珠掣了张子房，青琴掣了博浪椎，珍珠掣了圯上老人。琼华笑道：「我早说的，绮香姐姐你仔细博浪椎、荆轲匕首，好不利害。就是高唐神女、醇酒妇人教你受用罢。」红薇道：「奶奶且慢喜欢，只怕奶奶手下也有个笑话出来呢！」绮香道：「不用讲，拿出谱来。」大家看时，见写道：",en:`drew Lord Mengchang, which was just enough to laugh off the shame. They then drew for Qionghua's state of Han: Ruizhu drew Zhang Liang, Qingqin drew the Bolang hammer, and Zhenzhu drew the old man at the bridge. Qionghua laughed, "I warned you, Sister Qixiang! You had best mind the Bolang hammer and Jing Ke's dagger. Let the Gaotang Goddess and the wine-woman deal with`},{paragraph:43,mentions:6,tokens:["蕊珠"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"琼华道：「我来灭秦了。他们也只有一个韩非子，只懂刑名，不懂兵法的。」数到蕊珠出马，是张良，是金门射策令，自己先出一句成语为题，将三个骰子摆出句中之意，将杯子盖了，叫那人也摆，摆出来相同的不论，如摆出来不同，请中人评论优劣，劣者罚酒。蕊珠将三个骰子摆了，将茶杯盖好，又将三个骰子递与红香，道：「你摆「九重春色醉仙桃」这一句。」红",en:`Qionghua said, "I will destroy Qin. They only have Han Feizi—a man of law and names, not of war." The dice fell to Ruizhu, playing Zhang Liang. Her challenge was the "Golden Gate examination": she must propose an idiom, cover three dice under a cup showing the phrase's meaning, and have the opponent match it with three dice of their own. If different, a judge would pick`},{paragraph:44,mentions:2,tokens:["蕊珠"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"蕊珠道：「取笔研来涂脸。」红香道：「姐姐，饶了我罢，涂了脸又要擦脸，费事得很，我情愿跪了喝一杯罢。」蕊珠将要容情，倒是珍珠不肯，说道：「我还要与他来呢。一个容了情，个个要容情了。」便把笔在红香脸上画了一个眼镜，惹得满堂又笑起来。红香好不有气，喝了一杯，忙",en:'Ruizhu demanded, "Bring the inkstone. We are painting faces." Hongxiang pleaded, "Sister, spare me. Painting means washing, which is a bother. I will kneel and drink instead." Ruizhu was about to relent, but Zhenzhu refused, "I fight her next. Show one mercy,'}]},"char-162":JSON.parse(`{"30":[{"paragraph":23,"mentions":2,"tokens":["乌大傻"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"而散。」说到此，却又懒说下去，华公子道：「为何不欢而散？你且说来。」子佩道：「今日和我妻舅归自荣，同到他的妻舅乌大傻家替他婶娘祝寿。」仲雨听了要笑，子云道：「有了乌大傻，自然就不妥了。」文泽点点头道：「这套话倒必定可听，快说罢。」子佩道：","en":"unhappily? Tell us.\\" Zipei said, \\"Today I went with my brother-in-law Gui Zirong to the house of his brother-in-law Wu Dasha, to celebrate his aunt's birthday.\\" Zhongyu wanted to laugh when he heard this, and Ziyun said, \\"With Wu Dasha there, things naturally wouldn't go well.\\" Wenze nodded, \\"This story is definitely worth hearing; hurry up and tell us.\\" Zipei continued:"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":1,"tokens":["大傻"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「归自荣并约了他小丈人，带了那四个档子。大傻也请了两桌客，并些南边朋友。」有几个会串戏的在内，大家公议：「每人凑钱十吊，共得九十吊，遂叫了全福班演戏。归自荣高兴，与一个姓吕的串了一出《独占》。」文泽道：「归自荣本生得好，就是不该同小老婆另住在城外。听说仍旧窘迫得很。」子佩丢个眼色，文泽不说了，","en":"\\"Gui Zirong also invited his concubine's father and brought along his four musicians. Dasha had invited two tables of guests, including some friends from the south. A few of them were amateur actors. They agreed to contribute ten strings of cash apiece, collected ninety strings in all, and hired the Quanfu Troupe to perform. Gui Zirong was"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":3,"tokens":["大傻子","大傻"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"我。」华公子道：「不错，你的戏是唱得最好的，我看比他们还强些。今日串的是什么呢？」子佩道：「和别人串也好，偏偏大傻子死缠住了，要与他唱《活捉》。本来戏名就不吉利，大傻生得又呆又笨，种种不在行，难以尽述，看的人也不住的笑。正到进场的时候，我将帕子套住了他，忽然走进了一群人来，不论皂白，拿出刑部一张票子，给众人瞧了瞧，就一条链子，把大傻子拉了出去。","en":"them. What did you perform today?\\" Zipei replied, \\"Singing with anyone else would have been fine, but that idiot Dasha pestered me to death and insisted on singing 'Capturing Alive' with me. The name of the play is unlucky to begin with, and Dasha is both dull and clumsy; he was incredibly amateurish. I can't even describe it all, but the audience couldn't stop laughing."},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":6,"tokens":["大傻","乌大傻","乌大傻子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"。众人不晓得是什么缘故，欲待出去劝解，他们已经飞跑去了，没头没脑的叫人怎样，只得一哄而散。自荣是不能走的，还有大傻几个至交在那里，我便一直到这里来。」众人听了也都称奇，仲雨道：「我也猜着八分了。这事还是为着归自荣起的，乌大傻不过听了衬戏，吃了镶边酒，便替归自荣担了个苦海的干系。」冯子佩道：「我倒不知，你知是为着什么？」仲雨道：「我也是猜测。我听得人说：乌大傻子造","en":"already sped off. Not knowing what to do, the guests scattered in an uproar. Zirong couldn't leave, and a few of Dasha's close friends stayed behind, so I came straight here.\\" Everyone was amazed upon hearing this. Zhongyu said, \\"I have a pretty good idea what happened. This matter actually stems from Gui Zirong. Wu Dasha was just an extra, caught in the crossfire, and"},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":1,"tokens":["乌大傻"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"商，幼年夤缘得中举人，加捐了中书，现在本籍安享。自荣在京八年未归，糟蹋了多少钱财。家中现有妻室，谎言断弦，娶了乌大傻之妹。又不甚合意，又娶了叶茂林之女为副室，另居城南。叶女在家时，即不安本分，喜交游，而自荣宠嬖特甚。奁资颇厚，被自荣乱为花费，不到两年化为乌有。","en":"squandering a vast amount of money. He already had a wife at home, but lied that he was a widower and married Wu Dasha's sister. Still unsatisfied, he took Ye Maolin's daughter as a concubine and lived separately in the southern part of the city. When the Ye girl was at home, she was not one to abide by the rules and loved to socialize, but Zirong doted on her obsessively."}],"32":[{"paragraph":11,"mentions":12,"tokens":["乌大傻","大傻","大傻子","乌大傻子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"如今要讲起一件闲事来。那八月十四日晚，乌大傻教刑部里传了去，问了一堂私造假契、抵押钱财事。因归自荣急欲借钱，商于大傻，要借彼房契抵押，许其分用。大傻早将房契押出，只得另造伪契与归自荣，押了六百吊钱，大傻分用了二百吊。谁知这个财东与前次那个财东相好，一日叙谈账目等项，讲起乌大傻的房子来，那个财东","en":"Now we must recount a separate incident. On the night of the fourteenth of the eighth month, Wu Dasha was summoned to the Ministry of Punishments and questioned regarding the forging of a deed to mortgage for money. Gui Zirong, urgently needing to borrow money, had consulted with the Big Fool to use the latter's house deed as collateral, promising to"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":2,"tokens":["乌大傻","乌大傻子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"却说拿乌大傻那一天，有个皂隶叫作陆升，与归自荣住处相近认得，那日见他报了举人，忽然想起八月十四日，明明看见归自荣在乌大傻子寓里吃酒。因想十四日秀才们正在场里，怎么他不进去，又会中呢？\\n想来想去，再不明白。一日遇见一个贴写，叫作葛逢时，排行第六，是个绍兴朋友，极会","en":"However, on the day Wu Dasha was arrested, a runner named Lu Sheng, who lived near Gui Zirong and recognized him, suddenly remembered something. Seeing Gui Zirong reported as a successful candidate, he recalled that on the night of the fourteenth of the eighth month, he had clearly"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":1,"tokens":["乌大傻子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"葛贴写道：「有甚么事难明白？」陆皂隶道：「我们街坊有个姓归的，是个南边人，招赘在乌大傻子家里，常见他出进的。","en":"\\"What is it you don't understand?\\" Runner Lu said, \\"We have a neighbor named Gui, a southerner, who married into Wu Dasha's family and lives there. I often see him coming and going.\\""},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":1,"tokens":["乌大傻子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"原听得人说，不完场是不能中的。我方才讲的那街坊姓归，名字叫自荣，现在高高中了三十四名。我于八月十四日二更天去传乌大傻子，明明看见归自荣在那里。他并且上前来问甚么事，讲了多少话，急得什么似的。","en":"in thirty-fourth place. Yet, on the fourteenth of the eighth month at the second watch, when I went to summon Wu Dasha, I clearly saw Gui Zirong there. He even came forward to ask what was going on, talked at length, and seemed extremely anxious.\\""},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":1,"tokens":["乌大傻"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"全无，前溪边秋砧又捣。既在泥涂以含垢，岂堪月窟以探香。借曰兔本前生，竟忘鳖为同气；一味狐能工媚，亦由虫自可怜。乌大傻破屋无存，尚须还债；马二回大门亦坏，遑问谢仪。效张冠而李戴，回天力于人工。夫枪替虽已鳞潜，而索贿尚多雀噪。皂隶岂知颠倒，乱吵街坊；诸生尽讦阴私，纷呈词牍。是宜先除巾服，消断袖之余妍；重挞鞭挝，起引锥之隐痛。照例充军烟瘴，俟全案之齐拘；大书以示衣冠，泄","en":"the turtle is of the same breath; playing the fox to perfection in flattery, he proves himself a pitiful insect. Wu Dasha's ruined house is gone, yet he must still pay debts; Ma the Muslim's front gate is smashed, no need to ask about the middleman's fee. Placing Zhang's hat on Li's head, he tries to substitute human effort for the power of Heaven. Though the substitute"}],"34":[{"paragraph":15,"mentions":1,"tokens":["乌大傻"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"聘才初一日拜年，初二日听戏，初三日寓里大排筵席，请一班浮浪子弟如冯子佩、杨梅窗、乌大傻等，带了一群下作相公，天天的欢呼畅饮，清曲锣鼓，闹得竹嘈丝杂，酒池肉林，一连五日，方才少息，也去了三百吊钱。到初九日，忽然有人高兴要开赌，劝聘才做头家。聘才自思近来财运颇好，或者可以赢些钱，即于初九日晚上开起赌来。或是摇滩，或是掷骰，又把玉天仙接了来","en":"threw a grand banquet at his lodgings, inviting a crowd of idle dandies—such as Feng Zipei, Yang Meichuang, and Wu Dasha—along with a flock of lowly young male companions. Every day was filled with raucous cheers and heavy drinking, accompanied by the clatter of gongs and pure melodies. It was a chaotic din of silk strings and bamboo flutes, a veritable lake of wine and"}],"42":[{"paragraph":14,"mentions":3,"tokens":["乌大傻","大傻"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"新些，帽上拖着一绺红线纬，虽不像个有钱的，或者倒是个老白相。」问了他们的姓，让他们坐了。你道这两人是谁？一个是乌大傻，一个是姬亮轩，他二人新在戏园里认识。这日都在街上闲走，适相遇了，跟了琴言到门口。亮轩恍惚记得这个门，想了一会想着了，就猜方才见的是琴言。后又想起奚十一的话，说前月在聘才处叫他陪过酒，无疑是他。便与大傻讲了，大傻见亮轩高兴，欲赞成他进去，好吃个镶边酒","en":"be an old hand at this game.\\" Wu Mazi asked their names and offered them seats. And who were these two? One was Wu Dasha, the other was Ji Liangxuan, two men newly acquainted at the theater. That day both had been idling about the streets when they happened upon each other, had followed Qinyan to the gate, and now had come in. Liangxuan had a vague sense that he recognized"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":2,"tokens":["大傻子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这边伍麻子正在张罗，却好天福、天寿散戏回来。见亮轩像是见过的，又记不清，请了安。那个大傻子，他们却见过他，在园子里听衬戏的，便也请了安。大傻子迷迷盹盹的说道：「今日兰保的《盗令》、《杀舟》，桂保的《相约》、《相骂》，实是个名人家数，他人做不来的。」亮轩道：「你们还认得我么？」天福道：「有些面善，想不起来，好像那里见过的。」天寿眼瞪瞪的看了","en":"had seen Liangxuan somewhere before, though he could not quite remember where, and greeted him politely. As for Dasha, both boys had definitely seen him before as he was a regular audience member at the garden theater, and they greeted him as well. Dasha, in his vague and muddled way, said: \\"Today Lanbao's 'Stealing the Token' and 'Killing in the Boat,' and Guibao's"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":2,"tokens":["大傻子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"感激我不感激呢？」天寿道：「那一位如今那里去了？」亮轩道：「现在病着。」天福道：「天报！天报！叫他多病几天。」大傻子道：「方才见个相公进来，叫什么名字？」天福道：「没有阿，我们就是师兄弟两个。」亮轩道：「有一个进来的，比你们高些，有十六七岁了。」天寿道：「没有，没有。我们只有一个琴师兄，从华公府回来，如今他也不算相公，不唱戏了。或者你们看见的就是他。」亮轩道：「不","en":"\\"He is ill at present.\\" Tianfu cried, \\"Heaven's justice! Heaven's justice! Let him be ill a good while longer.\\"\\n\\nDasha put in, \\"A young gentleman came in just now — what is his name?\\" Tianfu said, \\"There is nobody. It is only the two of us, brothers.\\" Liangxuan said, \\"Somebody came in — taller than you, sixteen or seventeen.\\" Tianshou said, \\"No, no. We only have our"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":5,"tokens":["大傻子","大傻"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"大傻子望着亮轩道：「你们既然是旧交，自然也应叙叙，断无空坐之理。」亮轩支吾道：「我还有点事。」天寿道：「你能没有事，你能不肯赏脸。」亮轩道：「真有事。」伍麻子道：「坐坐罢，就有事也不必忙。如今他的师父不在了，他师娘就靠着这两个孩子呢。」大傻道：「你也难得出","en":"Dasha looked at Liangxuan. \\"Since the two of you are old acquaintances, you must have a word together. There is no sense sitting here like this.\\" Liangxuan hedged, \\"I have something to see to.\\" Tianshou said, \\"You've nothing to see to. You just won't do us"},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":3,"tokens":["大傻"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"少顷，亮轩要走，天福拖住了他，大傻却不动身。只见打杂的进来，在桌子上摆了几个碟子，天福道：「姬老爷请坐罢。」亮轩着急，对着大傻挤眉弄眼，要叫他走的意思。大傻装作不见，一手摸着那几根既稀且短的鼠须，拈了几拈。亮轩见他不动，只得独自想跑，说道：「我要小便。」天寿指着院子里道：「那东墙角就","en":"Shortly afterward Liangxuan made to leave, but Tianfu held him back. Dasha, however, showed no sign of moving. Just then one of the servants came in and set a few dishes on the table, and Tianfu said, \\"Master Ji, do sit down.\\" Liangxuan was anxious; he made eyes at Dasha and jerked his head, clearly meaning for him to go. Dasha"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":5,"tokens":["大傻子","大傻"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"亮轩道：「我真有事，何苦缠我。」大傻子见了酒，喉咙已经发痒，劝亮轩道：「他们这般至诚留你，你就赏他们点脸罢。既摆了出来，不赏他们的脸，也叫他们下不去。」亮轩无法，又见大傻不肯走，反留住他，想是大傻要做这个东。如果大傻作东，也就放心了，只得勉强坐下。天福、天寿各斟了酒。亮轩饮了两杯，见大傻","en":"Liangxuan pleaded that he really did have something to do, asking why they must torture him like this. Dasha, whose throat had been itching at the sight of the wine, urged Liangxuan that they were keeping him with such sincerity he should honor them a little. He added that since the dishes were already out, to refuse them would be making things awkward for"},{"paragraph":21,"mentions":1,"tokens":["大傻"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"要见见你，见不见呢？」琴言道：「我见他作什么呢？你见我见过人吗？」天福没趣，将要出来，琴言想要关门，不料亮轩、大傻已走到房门口，就都扁着身子挤进来。","en":"me see anybody?\\"\\n\\nRebuffed, Tianfu was on his way out and Qinyan was about to shut the door when Liangxuan and Dasha, already at the doorway, turned sideways and squeezed their way in."},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":1,"tokens":["大傻子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"琴言满脸怒容，未开言，大傻子深深一揖，亮轩也曲着腰作了半个揖，满面堆下笑来。琴言倒也无法，只得还了一揖，不好就走。他们也不待招呼就坐了。","en":"Qinyan's face was full of anger. He had not yet spoken when Dasha made a deep, sweeping bow, and Liangxuan bent forward in a half-bow, his face wreathed in eager smiles. Qinyan found he had no choice but to return their bow, as he could not very well walk away. Without waiting to be invited, they promptly sat down."},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":1,"tokens":["大傻"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"亮轩瞇齐了鼠眼，掀唇露齿的要说话。大傻先说道：「怪道多天不见令师，原来归天了，我竟全然不知。非但没有具个薄分，连拜也没有为拜一拜。多年相好，从前承他一番相待，倒也不是寻常的交情。」又摇着头道：「荒唐，荒唐！不知那些联幛的公分，有我的名字没有？」亮轩笑容可掬的道：「我去年奉拜过的，偏值尊驾","en":"Liangxuan narrowed his ratty eyes and drew back his lip to speak, but Dasha got in first. \\"No wonder I have not seen your honoured master these many days — so he has gone to heaven, and I knew nothing whatever about it. Not only did I send no small contribution, I never even came to make a bow at the bier. We were on good terms"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":5,"tokens":["大傻"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"大傻一面吃茶，见挂着一副对子，念将出来，错了两字。大傻腹内既属欠通，眼光又系近视，倒最喜念对子看画，充那假斯文。琴言看了暗笑，略略看他们的相貌，已经生厌。又见亮轩嘻着嘴说道：「我那敝东，其实很好交的。你是不知道他的脾气，若混熟了，只怕还离不开呢。」大傻道","en":"Dasha drank his tea, noticed a couplet hanging on the wall, and read it aloud, mispronouncing two characters. Dasha's classical education being decidedly thin, and his eyes nearsighted into the bargain, he was nonetheless especially fond of reading out couplets"},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":4,"tokens":["大傻子","大傻"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"客不成？要不然，是傻子与他讲明，是要省钱的缘故。这个东，大约是傻子作定了，索性吃他娘的。」亮轩也举箸吃了一会。大傻子已喝了两壶酒，将四碟小菜也吃干净了，喝了两碗粥，抹一抹嘴。见亮轩不甚高兴，便对天寿道：「姬老爷是要喝热闹酒的，你叫人去添些菜来，酒烫得热热儿的，与姬老爷豁几拳。今日是我拉他来的，你们巴结得不好，以后他就不肯来了。」亮轩打量是请他，便放了心，忙说道：「","en":"dried fruit, four side-dishes, and two bowls of plain congee could really count as entertaining guests, unless Dasha had told them he was paying, and they were trying to economize. He figured if Dasha was the host, he might as well eat his fill. Liangxuan picked up his chopsticks and ate for a while. Dasha had already drunk two pots of wine and polished off all four"},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":2,"tokens":["大傻","乌大傻"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"亮轩与福、寿二人说了一会话，问了些琴言光景。伍麻子来请吃饭，亮轩才找起大傻来，杳无影响，心中着忙，便变了神色，只管要找乌大傻。天寿说道：「他去了。这个人是坐不住的，我见他在戏园里，一天总要走个十几回，想必他就来的。我们先坐，不用等他了。」亮轩只得坐了。看菜是四碟两碗，两盘饽饽，就吃了些。终是无精打采，心上要想个脱身之计。","en":"Qinyan's situation. Wu Mazi came in to announce that dinner was ready. Only then did Liangxuan start looking for Dasha. But Dasha had vanished without a trace, and Liangxuan's expression changed as he kept urgently trying to find Wu Dasha. Tianshou explained that he left, noting that the man could never stay put. He saw him at the theater and he came and went a dozen"},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":1,"tokens":["大傻子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"那伍麻子在旁，见大傻子先走了，看这位又是心神不定，像有心事，倒也猜不着他要跑。那长庆的媳妇，自从丈夫死后，家里还是第一回开张留客，叫伍麻子好好照料，不要待慢了老斗，故常在窗前站立。那两个孩子本来不会说话，夹七夹八的。亮轩更坐不住，横竖迟早皆走，吃完了，嗽了口，对天福道：「","en":"Wu Mazi stood nearby. Noticing that Dasha had already left and that this remaining guest seemed distracted and uneasy, as though he had something heavy on his mind, he could not quite guess that the man was planning to bolt. Changqing's widow, since her husband's death, was treating this as"},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":1,"tokens":["大傻"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"笼照了。亮轩轻轻的脚步，左绕右绕，还想遁去。无奈伍麻子紧紧的照着，亮轩只得回寓，叫他在门口等了，好不懊悔，上了大傻的恶当，心里骂几声，开了拜匣，捡出几张钱票，看来看去，犹如割他的肉一般，忍着心疼，捡了一张两吊的，又于纸页子内捡了一张一吊的，要找人送出，跟他的人又不在家。只得拈了一个纸条子，蘸上油点子出来，交与伍麻子，转身就走。","en":"lodgings. He asked Wu Mazi to wait at the door, inwardly cursing his luck and kicking himself for being taken in by Dasha's shameless scheming. He unlocked his document-chest and sorted through the banknotes, examining each one as though it were a piece of his own flesh being cut away. Steeling himself against the pain, he selected one note for two strings of cash, then"}],"43":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["乌大傻"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"话说琴言是晚听姬亮轩、乌大傻说了多少瞎话，更加烦闷，幸他们就出去了。候到二更，不见宝珠、素兰过来，只得睡了。一夜无眠，到了次早，即叫小使去请他二人来。","en":"That evening, Qinyan endured a great deal of empty talk from Ji Liangxuan and Wu Dasha, leaving his spirit ever more clouded. Fortunately they soon took their leave. He waited until the second watch, yet seeing no sign of Baozhu or Sulan, he had little choice but to retire for the night in solitude. He lay restless through the long night."}],"58":[{"paragraph":9,"mentions":2,"tokens":["乌大傻子","乌大傻"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"姬亮轩一看是乌大傻子，乌大傻作了揖，请二人坐了。","en":"Ji Liangxuan saw that it was Big Fool Wu. Wu made a bow and asked them to sit."},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":3,"tokens":["大傻"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"奚十一道：「你在这里掌柜么？」大傻笑道：「闲着没有事，他们要我过来帮同照料。」姬亮轩从前打茶围上了大傻的当，后来已经说明，大傻倒说得好，我回去取钱来，你又走了。","en":"Xi Eleven asked, \\"Do you mind the shop here?\\" Big Fool smiled, \\"I have idle hands, so they asked me to help watch.\\" Ji Liangxuan had once been cheated by Big Fool at a tea-house visit. That misunderstanding was cleared up later, and Big Fool had said fairly that he went home for money and Ji had left."},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":4,"tokens":["大傻子","大傻"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"了他们十几吊钱，亮轩似信不信的。后来伍麻子即跟了长庆的媳妇回扬州去了，此话绝无对证。三人讲了些闲话，奚十一便问大傻子，那些相公在什么地方。大傻道：「今日就只王兰官、苏蕙芳在家，其余都出门去了。」奚十一道：「我要看看花，你同我们去。」大傻便领了奚、姬二人，从东边进了一重门，见是一带游廊，假山层迭，花木扶疏，大大小小盆景有几千盆，有楼有阁，有台有池，甚是有趣。来到一所","en":"Changqing's widow back to Yangzhou, so the story could not be checked. The three chatted, and Xi Eleven asked Big Fool where the actors were. Big Fool replied, \\"Today only Wang Lanbao and Su Huifang are home, the rest are out.\\" Xi demanded, \\"I want to see the flowers, so take us.\\" Big Fool led Xi and Ji through an east door into a gallery of layered rockwork, scattered"},{"paragraph":12,"mentions":10,"tokens":["大傻子","大傻"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"见他才二十几岁，好生面善，想了一想，像是从前潘三那个赶车的，如今体面多了。那人一见了奚十一，低着头过去。大傻子道：「你应认得这人。」奚十一道：「好像潘三从前那个赶车的一样。」大傻道：「可不是他？如今他靠着他女人的福，不赶车，做了状元公的家人了。」奚十一逛了一会，重到九香楼下来，园中有许多灌园的浇灌花木，还有几个扎花匠修剪花树，与那小使们川流不息。奚十一道：「","en":"strutting with a dignity far beyond his old station. The man, seeing Xi Eleven, lowered his head and passed by. Big Fool said, \\"You ought to know him.\\" Xi agreed, \\"He looks like Pan's former driver.\\" Big Fool confirmed, \\"Exactly. Now he rides his woman's luck. There is no more driving for him, he's a household man for the zhuangyuan.\\" Xi strolled again to the foot of Nine-Fragrance"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":2,"tokens":["大傻子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"忽听园里有人闹起来，大傻子留神细听，听得骂道：「那里来得这个小杂种兔崽子，将这金橘摘得干干净净！」又有一人骂道：「不是那个小狗肏的？连那佛手也摘了两个。」就听得大闹起来，有个小孩子声音乱骂乱嚷的。大傻子走了出去。奚十一懒的起身，但听得像巴英官的声音与人嚷闹，便叫亮轩出去看看。","en":"Suddenly a row erupted in the garden. Big Fool listened and heard a voice shouting, \\"Where did this brat rabbit come from? He picked the kumquats clean!\\" Another voice chimed in, \\"That little wretch took two Buddha's-hand citrons too!\\" A child's voice cursed and yelled. Big Fool went out to investigate."},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":1,"tokens":["乌大傻"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"骂得那人气极了，又打了他几下。乌大傻连声劝解，亮轩也上前说道：「他是个孩子，你怎么动手就打？」那人道：「他先来揪住了我，要打我。我们才买了两盆金橘，两盆佛手，要抬回去，被他摘得干干净净，气人不气人？问问他，他开口就骂人。」那边蕙芳、兰保都出来看，却不认得英官，也不认得姬亮轩。","en":"The man, furious, hit him again. Big Fool urged peace, and Liangxuan stepped up, \\"He's a child, why strike him?\\" The man defended himself, \\"He grabbed me first to fight. We just bought two pots of kumquats and two of Buddha's-hand to carry home, and he stripped them bare. Is it maddening or"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":1,"tokens":["大傻子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"无故的就打起人来？」蕙芳一看，认的是奚十一，便拉了兰保进去了。奚十一大怒，他也不管有客，便闯过桥去，亮轩跟着。大傻子一想这事情有些不好，便把灯收了，自己躲起来，免得带累他受气。奚十一走到屋子里，见残肴满桌，不见一人，明知他们躲了，心中更怒，拍着桌子嚷道：「走个人出来！」不见答应，奚十一又拍桌子骂道：「好大的相公，见了人都不理么？虽然出了班子，总是小旦。兔子变得成狗","en":"Lanbao, and went inside. Xi raged. Ignoring the guests, he charged across the bridge, with Liangxuan following. Big Fool thought this could turn ugly, so he put the lamp away and hid to avoid blame. Xi entered a room of half-finished dishes and empty seats. He knew they were hiding and raged even more, pounding the table and shouting, \\"Someone come out!\\" Receiving no answer,"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":1,"tokens":["乌大傻"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"见奚十一不闹，自然更不敢闹，重到了九香楼下，英官收拾了烟枪，奚十一坐了一会，也就不大疼了。心中忿恨，来到外边，乌大傻躲得不见影儿，奚十一只得上车而回。","en":"Nine-Fragrance Tower, Yingguan packed the pipe. Xi sat until the worst pain passed, bitter at heart. Outside, Big Fool had vanished without a trace, leaving Xi no choice but to climb into his carriage and return home in humiliation."}]}`),"char-163":{30:[{paragraph:23,mentions:1,tokens:["归自荣"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"「绝好一局，弄得不欢而散。」说到此，却又懒说下去，华公子道：「为何不欢而散？你且说来。」子佩道：「今日和我妻舅归自荣，同到他的妻舅乌大傻家替他婶娘祝寿。」仲雨听了要笑，子云道：「有了乌大傻，自然就不妥了。」文泽点点头道：「这套话倒必定可听，快说罢。」子佩道：",en:`Young Master Hua pressed, "Why did it end unhappily? Tell us." Zipei said, "Today I went with my brother-in-law Gui Zirong to the house of his brother-in-law Wu Dasha, to celebrate his aunt's birthday." Zhongyu wanted to laugh when he heard this, and Ziyun said, "With Wu Dasha there, things naturally wouldn't go well." Wenze nodded, "This story is definitely worth hearing;`},{paragraph:24,mentions:3,tokens:["归自荣"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"「归自荣并约了他小丈人，带了那四个档子。大傻也请了两桌客，并些南边朋友。」有几个会串戏的在内，大家公议：「每人凑钱十吊，共得九十吊，遂叫了全福班演戏。归自荣高兴，与一个姓吕的串了一出《独占》。」文泽道：「归自荣本生得好，就是不该同小老婆另住在城外。听说仍旧窘",en:`"Gui Zirong also invited his concubine's father and brought along his four musicians. Dasha had invited two tables of guests, including some friends from the south. A few of them were amateur actors. They agreed to contribute ten strings of cash apiece, collected`},{paragraph:26,mentions:5,tokens:["自荣","归自荣"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"头奶奶们急得哭号起来。众人不晓得是什么缘故，欲待出去劝解，他们已经飞跑去了，没头没脑的叫人怎样，只得一哄而散。自荣是不能走的，还有大傻几个至交在那里，我便一直到这里来。」众人听了也都称奇，仲雨道：「我也猜着八分了。这事还是为着归自荣起的，乌大傻不过听了衬戏，吃了镶边酒，便替归自荣担了个苦海的干系。」冯子佩道：「我倒不知，你知是为着什么？」仲雨道：「我也是猜测。我",en:`could go out to intervene, they had already sped off. Not knowing what to do, the guests scattered in an uproar. Zirong couldn't leave, and a few of Dasha's close friends stayed behind, so I came straight here." Everyone was amazed upon hearing this. Zhongyu said, "I have a pretty good idea what happened. This matter actually stems from Gui Zirong. Wu Dasha was just an`},{paragraph:28,mentions:1,tokens:["归自荣"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"珠微笑；又见刘文泽与萧次贤站着，在一处彼此俯耳低言，大约是品评他的意思。原来文泽与蕙芳倒不是讲冯子佩，倒讲的是归自荣。",en:"probably discussing him. In fact, Wenze and Huifang were not talking about Feng Zipei at all; they were talking about Gui Zirong."},{paragraph:29,mentions:4,tokens:["归自荣","自荣"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"这归自荣原籍江西，寄籍直隶，也进了一名秀才。少年却很生得标致，今已二十七八岁了。生平闇昧之事甚多。家本豪富，其父曾为大商，幼年夤缘得中举人，加捐了中书，现在本籍安享。自荣在京八年未归，糟蹋了多少钱财。家中现有妻室，谎言断弦，娶了乌大傻之妹。又不甚合意，又娶了",en:"This Gui Zirong was originally from Jiangxi but registered in Zhili, and had earned the title of Xiucai. In his youth, he was quite handsome. He was now twenty-seven or twenty-eight years old, and had a history of many shady dealings. His family had been wealthy. His"},{paragraph:30,mentions:4,tokens:["自荣","归自荣"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"夫妻两个都是不耐贫苦的，未免交谪诮谤。叶女又鼓搔头弄姿，倚门卖俏，那些旧交渐渐走动起来。自荣始虽气忿，后图银钱趁手，便已安之，竟彰明昭著，当起忘八来，并雇了一个伙计在家。士林久已不齿，而自荣犹常常的口称某给事为业师，某孝廉为课友，而一班无耻好色者，亦欲相为征逐。归自荣与叶女住宅，就与蕙芳相近，故蕙芳知之甚详。刘文泽也去吃过酒的。但去吃酒的。",en:"door, flirting and selling her charms, and those old acquaintances gradually started visiting again. At first, Zirong was furious, but later, seeing the money roll in, he accepted it and openly played the role of a pimp, even hiring a helper at home. The scholarly circles had long despised him, yet Zirong often boasted that a certain Supervising Secretary was his teacher"}],32:[{paragraph:8,mentions:2,tokens:["窑子归","归自荣"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"《题名录》来，众人细细看了，果无高品在内。蕙芳笑道：「中的人我也不认得，我就晓得这两个，一个是叶茂林的女婿叫作窑子归，这三十四名归自荣就是。一个是潘三的女婿叫作杠花，他老子叫花三胡子，在杠房抬杠出身，如今大发财，开了几处杠房，这六十三名花中桂就是。」高品再把第一张《题名录》看了一遍，略生喜色，不觉叹口气道：「也罢，名利二字是有一定的。现在你们不比外人，我对你们直讲",en:"passed, but I do know these two: one is Ye Maolin's son-in-law, known as 'Brothel Gui', and this thirty-fourth name, Gui Zirong, is him. The other is Pan the Third's son-in-law, called 'Bier-pole Hua'. His father is Hua the Third, nicknamed 'The Beard', who started out carrying biers in a funeral parlor, then made a fortune and opened several parlors himself. This sixty-third"},{paragraph:11,mentions:4,tokens:["归自荣"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"如今要讲起一件闲事来。那八月十四日晚，乌大傻教刑部里传了去，问了一堂私造假契、抵押钱财事。因归自荣急欲借钱，商于大傻，要借彼房契抵押，许其分用。大傻早将房契押出，只得另造伪契与归自荣，押了六百吊钱，大傻分用了二百吊。谁知这个财东与前次那个财东相好，一日叙谈账目等项，讲起乌大傻的房子来，那个财东问起住址、方向，知道就是押于他那一所，便对那人道：「这",en:"summoned to the Ministry of Punishments and questioned regarding the forging of a deed to mortgage for money. Gui Zirong, urgently needing to borrow money, had consulted with the Big Fool to use the latter's house deed as collateral, promising to share the proceeds. The Big Fool had long since mortgaged the deed, so he had to forge a new one for Gui Zirong. They borrowed"},{paragraph:12,mentions:2,tokens:["归自荣"],kind:"named-mention",zh:`却说拿乌大傻那一天，有个皂隶叫作陆升，与归自荣住处相近认得，那日见他报了举人，忽然想起八月十四日，明明看见归自荣在乌大傻子寓里吃酒。因想十四日秀才们正在场里，怎么他不进去，又会中呢？
想来想去，再不明白。一日遇见一个贴写，叫作葛逢时，排行第六，是个绍兴朋友，极会生事的。`,en:"However, on the day Wu Dasha was arrested, a runner named Lu Sheng, who lived near Gui Zirong and recognized him, suddenly remembered something. Seeing Gui Zirong reported as a successful candidate, he recalled that on the night of the fourteenth of the eighth month, he had clearly seen Gui Zirong drinking at Wu Dasha's residence. He wondered:"},{paragraph:16,mentions:2,tokens:["自荣","归自荣"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"会中？就是大主考的儿子，也不能中的。」陆皂隶道：「我原听得人说，不完场是不能中的。我方才讲的那街坊姓归，名字叫自荣，现在高高中了三十四名。我于八月十四日二更天去传乌大傻子，明明看见归自荣在那里。他并且上前来问甚么事，讲了多少话，急得什么似的。",en:`Runner Lu said, "I had heard that you can't pass without finishing the exams. The neighbor I just mentioned, named Gui Zirong, has now passed highly in thirty-fourth place. Yet, on the fourteenth of the eighth month at the second watch, when I went to summon Wu Dasha, I clearly saw Gui Zirong there. He even came forward to ask what was going on, talked at length, and seemed`},{paragraph:18,mentions:1,tokens:["归自荣"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"歇了几日，陆皂隶访得明明白白。是归自荣撵出一个奶妈子，因偷了一张钱票，两样银首饰，被主人搜着了，撵了出来。",en:"A few days later, Runner Lu investigated the matter thoroughly. Gui Zirong had driven out a wet nurse because she had stolen a banknote and two pieces of silver jewelry; the master had caught her and thrown her out."},{paragraph:19,mentions:1,tokens:["归自荣"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"归自荣那日因城外人眼多，故躲在城里头看戏，请的客都是心腹至交，所以不瞒他们。内中有个马回子，替他经手，请了一个浙江人，丁忧的廪生，许了他一千两银子，先付润笔一百两。",en:`Gui Zirong, wary of the many eyes outside the city, had hidden himself inside the city to watch plays. The guests he invited were all close confidants, so he hadn't kept it from them. Among them was "Ma the Muslim", who acted as his middleman and hired a man from`},{paragraph:20,mentions:1,tokens:["归自荣"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"归自荣没有钱，只付了四十金，至今分文未付。那经手的马回子，又从中赚了十两，那廪生仅得他三十两银子，倒替他中了一个举人。如今天天向马回子吵闹，把马回子的大门也打破了。",en:"Gui Zirong, lacking funds, only paid forty taels, and to this day hasn't paid another cent. The middleman, Ma the Muslim, skimmed ten taels from that, so the stipendiary student only received thirty taels for passing the provincial exam for him. Now he makes a"},{paragraph:21,mentions:5,tokens:["归自荣"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"归自荣躲在家里再不出来，并且闹得外头有些风声了。陆皂隶从奶妈子口中访得清清楚楚，便告诉了。葛贴写便叫陆皂隶去向归自荣借一千银子，被归自荣啐了一脸吐沫，便一五一十嚷将出来。归自荣无法，掩不住口，也只得和他闹了一场。陆皂隶讹诈不动，逢人便说要告他。葛贴写与他作",en:`Gui Zirong hid at home and refused to come out, but rumors had already begun to spread outside. Runner Lu, having learned the whole story clearly from the wet nurse's mouth, went and told Ge. Scrivener Ge told Runner Lu to go to Gui Zirong and "borrow" a thousand`},{paragraph:22,mentions:1,tokens:["归自荣"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"此案一出，闹动了多少不第生监，鸣鼓而攻，并把归自荣在城外那些事情，一总通出，部中看成了一个大笑话。有个老司官游戏三昧的，作了一个勘语，是一篇四六文，满城传遍。",en:"stir among the many failed students and scholars, who beat the drum and attacked him, bringing to light all of Gui Zirong's affairs outside the city as well. The Board treated it as a huge joke. An elderly official, fond of playful writing, composed a judgment in the parallel prose style, which spread throughout the entire city."},{paragraph:23,mentions:3,tokens:["归自荣"],kind:"named-mention",zh:`从此归自荣成了一个衣冠禽兽了。一日，文泽的家人从外面抄了一张来送与文泽看，恰好南湘、仲清都在那里。大家看时，只见写道：勘得归自荣，家本书香，父曾攀桂；心耽铜臭，性爱游花。
浪迹都门，骗人弱息；缩头陋巷，拥彼淫娼。恣挑达于风月场中，攫钱财于鸳鸯被底。臀有肤而尽堪`,en:`From then on, Gui Zirong became known as a "beast in human clothing". One day, Wenze's servant copied down the judgment from outside and brought it to show Wenze, just when Nanxiang and Zhongqing happened to be there. As they read it, it said: "Upon investigation of Gui Zirong:`}]},"char-164":JSON.parse(`{"36":[{"paragraph":4,"mentions":1,"tokens":["伍麻子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"过了门房，却喜那些人都知道了，也不来问。一直出了头门，望见照墙边歇着一辆车，即是他向来坐的车。又见他师娘的表弟伍麻子同来，琴言上前见了，两人坐上车，一路的讲出城来。","en":"Reaching the main gate, he saw a carriage waiting by the screen wall—the very carriage he always took. He also saw Wu Mazi, his teacher's wife's cousin, who had come along. Qinyan went up to greet him, and the two boarded the carriage, talking all the way out of the city."},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":1,"tokens":["伍麻子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"只见众人纷纷的忙乱，伍麻子捧了一包孝衣进来。又见袁宝珠、苏蕙芳、陆素兰来了，琴言即忙招接三人，一同坐下。","en":"Outside, amidst the bustling crowd, Wu Mazi brought in a bundle of mourning clothes. Then Yuan Baozhu, Su Huifang, and Lu Sulan arrived. Qinyan quickly welcomed them, and they sat down together."},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":1,"tokens":["伍麻子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"桂保、李玉林、金漱芳，大家直等了送殓，拜了，然后才散。琴言穿了孝袍，似乎明日不好出门，只得约定三日后再叙。又叫伍麻子到华府求珊枝转为告假一月，俟出殡后方得进城。华公子准了，又拿了一个衣箱回来，琴言方才放心。","en":"mourning robes, it seemed improper to go out the next day, so they agreed to meet again in three days. He also sent Wu Mazi to the Hua estate to ask Shanzhi to request a one-month leave for him, waiting until after the burial to return to the city. Young Master Hua approved and sent back a chest of clothes, which finally put Qinyan's mind at ease."}],"42":[{"paragraph":10,"mentions":1,"tokens":["伍麻子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"相公如何在家？琴言白白走了一回，路上又遇着这两个厌物，更加纳闷。进了房，长叹了一声，不觉泪下。偏有那师娘的表弟伍麻子，不看风色，走进来坐在炕沿，捏着潮烟袋，找了个纸条子，抽了二三十口，纸煤烟灰吹得一地。","en":"tears falling without his willing them. At just this inopportune moment, his master's younger cousin by marriage, Wu Mazi, came wandering in without reading the mood in the room. He sat himself on the edge of the kang, pinched his damp tobacco pipe, fished out a strip of paper for a spill, and puffed away twenty or thirty times, scattering paper-taper ash all over the floor."},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":1,"tokens":["伍麻子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"又盘三问四的寻这样，看那样。琴言好不砂烦，也不理他。伍麻子吃了一会潮烟，问琴言道：「我听说华府里那些大爷们是不用说了，各人家里都是大屋子，有十个八个小老婆陪着睡觉。","en":"that. Qinyan found him unbearably tiresome and simply ignored him. After chewing on his damp tobacco for a while, Wu Mazi turned to Qinyan: \\"I've heard that those senior gentlemen at the Hua household, needless to say about them, each man has a big house to himself, with eight or ten little concubines to share his bed."},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":2,"tokens":["伍麻子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"伍麻子又道：「我听说这还不算什么奇事。他家的银子柜子里装不下，就散堆在墙脚边，到了两三年不用他，受了潮气要霉烂的，便发出晒晾。晒晾了一天，就有人将五两的换他十两的，将二两的换他五两的，他也不点数。偶然看出来，说：「我的银子如何变小了？」那些人说：「晒了一天","en":"Wu Mazi went on, undeterred: \\"I've heard that's not even the remarkable part. That household has so much silver it won't fit in the chests. It's piled loose against the walls. After two or three years without being used it gets damp and starts to mildew, so"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":2,"tokens":["伍麻子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"伍麻子正说得高兴，忽外面有人叫他，就出去了。原来有两个客来打茶围，伍麻子招呼到客厅坐下，打量这二人，见一个衣裳很旧，穿着旧皂靴，头上的小帽子油晃晃的，沾了些灰土。心上想：「他不是个监生老爷，就是个没选期的老爷。那一人衣裳略新些，帽上拖着一绺红线纬，虽不像个","en":"Wu Mazi was just warming to his subject when someone called for him from outside, and he went out. It turned out that two visitors had come to take tea, and Wu Mazi showed them to the reception room. Sizing them up, he saw that one was very shabbily dressed,"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":1,"tokens":["伍麻子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这边伍麻子正在张罗，却好天福、天寿散戏回来。见亮轩像是见过的，又记不清，请了安。那个大傻子，他们却见过他，在园子里听衬戏的，便也请了安。大傻子迷迷盹盹的说道：「今日兰保的《盗令》、《杀舟》，桂保的《相约》、《相骂》，实是个名人家数，他人做不来的。」亮轩道：「你","en":"Inside, Wu Mazi was busying himself with arrangements when, conveniently, Tianfu and Tianshou returned from the day's performance. Tianshou thought he had seen Liangxuan somewhere before, though he could not quite remember where, and greeted him politely. As for Dasha,"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":1,"tokens":["伍麻子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"他家，是不到第二家的。」大傻子道：「他既不肯出来，你领我们到他屋里坐坐是可以的。」天寿摇头道：「他要骂我们。」伍麻子站在廊前道：「我们这个琴官，如今是华公府的二爷，不见人了。二位老爷如高兴，叫天福、天寿伺侯罢。」","en":"will not come out, you can at least take us into his room to sit.\\" Tianshou shook his head. \\"He would scold us.\\"\\n\\nWu Mazi, standing at the veranda, said, \\"This Qinguan of ours is Second Master in the Hua household now; he does not see people. If your honours are in the mood, let Tianfu and Tianshou wait on you.\\""},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":2,"tokens":["伍麻子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"应叙叙，断无空坐之理。」亮轩支吾道：「我还有点事。」天寿道：「你能没有事，你能不肯赏脸。」亮轩道：「真有事。」伍麻子道：「坐坐罢，就有事也不必忙。如今他的师父不在了，他师娘就靠着这两个孩子呢。」大傻道：「你也难得出来，我也走乏了，略坐一坐罢。」又问天福道：「你师父几时不在的？」天福道：「前月二十五。」大傻道：「咳，我竟不晓得他死了。你们虽不认得我，你师父倒与我极相","en":"said, \\"You've nothing to see to. You just won't do us the honour.\\" Liangxuan said, \\"I really have something.\\"\\n\\nWu Mazi said, \\"Sit a while. Even if you have, there's no hurry. Now their master is gone, his wife depends on these two boys and nothing else.\\" Dasha said, \\"You so seldom get out, and I am tired with walking. Let us sit a little.\\" Then to Tianfu, \\"When did your"},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":1,"tokens":["伍麻子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"亮轩与福、寿二人说了一会话，问了些琴言光景。伍麻子来请吃饭，亮轩才找起大傻来，杳无影响，心中着忙，便变了神色，只管要找乌大傻。天寿说道：「他去了。这个人是坐不住的，我见他在戏园里，一天总要走个十几回，想必他就来的。我们先坐，不用等他了。」亮轩只得坐了。看菜是四碟两碗，两盘饽饽，就吃了些。终是无精打采","en":"Liangxuan chatted with the two boys for a while, asking about Qinyan's situation. Wu Mazi came in to announce that dinner was ready. Only then did Liangxuan start looking for Dasha. But Dasha had vanished without a trace, and Liangxuan's expression changed as he kept urgently trying to find Wu Dasha. Tianshou explained that he left, noting"},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":4,"tokens":["伍麻子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"那伍麻子在旁，见大傻子先走了，看这位又是心神不定，像有心事，倒也猜不着他要跑。那长庆的媳妇，自从丈夫死后，家里还是第一回开张留客，叫伍麻子好好照料，不要待慢了老斗，故常在窗前站立。那两个孩子本来不会说话，夹七夹八的。亮轩更坐不住，横竖迟早皆走，吃完了，嗽了口","en":"Wu Mazi stood nearby. Noticing that Dasha had already left and that this remaining guest seemed distracted and uneasy, as though he had something heavy on his mind, he could not quite guess that the man was planning to bolt. Changqing's widow, since her husband's"},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":3,"tokens":["伍麻子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"材，木瓜脑袋，就装些威风，也吓不动人，只得说道：「我是省你们跟我走，你当是什么？你既不嫌路远，就跟我去领赏。」伍麻子想那些跟兔不中用，便自己提了灯笼照了。亮轩轻轻的脚步，左绕右绕，还想遁去。无奈伍麻子紧紧的照着，亮轩只得回寓，叫他在门口等了，好不懊悔，上了大傻的恶当，心里骂几声，开了拜匣，捡出几张钱票，看来看去，犹如割他的肉一般，忍着心疼，捡了一张两吊的，又于纸页","en":"save them the bother of following him, and if they didn't mind the walk, then to come and collect their reward. Wu Mazi thought those boys were useless for the job and decided to go himself, taking a lantern to light the way. Liangxuan made a few tentative zigzags, still hoping to give him the slip, but Wu Mazi kept the lantern trained on him without a single gap. Liangxuan"},{"paragraph":30,"mentions":4,"tokens":["伍麻子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"伍麻子虽不认的字，但长庆生前将票子叫他取钱，也不知取了若干。一字到十字这几个，凭你怎样字写，他都认得。灯下一看见是两吊，便叫道：「姬老爷转来！」亮轩欲待不理他，已跟进了门，只得应道：「还有什么？」伍麻子道：「这两吊钱怎样，是赏我的么？那相公开发，酒席钱呢？","en":"Wu Mazi could not read, but Changqing in his lifetime had sent him to fetch money against notes many times over. The characters from one to ten, however they were written, he knew every one. He held the notes under the lantern: two strings of cash. \\"Master Ji!"},{"paragraph":31,"mentions":1,"tokens":["伍麻子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"伍麻子欲要跟进来，门房里有人听见，出来问是什么事情。","en":"Wu Mazi tried to follow him in, and a gatekeeper who had heard the commotion came out to ask what was the matter."},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":2,"tokens":["伍麻子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"伍麻子将细底说了，那管门的笑道：「我们这师爷也太想便宜了，既要乐又舍不得钱。你也算了，折了这一回本钱罢，不要在此啰唣，适或教我们老爷听见了，倒不好。」伍麻子见亮轩已进去了，又不好跟进去，再经那门公劝告他，知道是奚十一的寓处，恐怕闹出事来，只好转回，却也讲了","en":"Wu Mazi explained everything in detail. The gatekeeper laughed, noting that their master here had really been trying to get something for nothing, wanting all the pleasure while refusing to part with the cash. He suggested Wu Mazi might as well let it go, chalk"},{"paragraph":33,"mentions":1,"tokens":["伍麻子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"替人做跟班，提了灯笼送回去，接了三吊钱就夹着屁股回来。一个汉子连个数目字都不认得，难道你钱票子见得少么？」把个伍麻子骂得火星直冒，嚷道：「我岂不知道，我见千见万，也没见这两个不爱脸的，一个喝了两碗粥先逃走了，这个也是时刻想跑，好容易逼住了他，送他回去。","en":"as a grown man who couldn't even read a number, asking if he had never seen a banknote before. She ranted until Wu Mazi's ears burned, and he shouted back that as if he didn't know, he had seen thousands, tens of thousands, and he had never seen two such shameless creatures. One of them drank two bowls of congee and slipped away first. The other one was also looking to"},{"paragraph":34,"mentions":2,"tokens":["伍麻子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"仙还叫他姊夫呢。归根儿是他妈的白吃白喝。这些个不要脸的狗鸡巴□的，真他妈的可恶！」长庆媳妇叨叨了一回。到明日，伍麻子去照票子，谁知后来添的一吊还是张假的。又到奚十一寓处来找亮轩，倒被奚十一的家人骂了一顿。伍麻子受屈而回，只得自己赔上一吊钱，交清了账，唯有咒骂亮轩而已。","en":"shameless dog-cock-… things — they are truly, damnably vile!\\" Changqing's widow ranted on for some time. The next day Wu Mazi went to exchange the notes for cash, only to discover that the one-string note added later was counterfeit. He went to Xi Eleven's lodgings to find Liangxuan, and was roundly abused by Xi Eleven's servant. Wu Mazi returned with his grievance unredressed,"}],"43":[{"paragraph":21,"mentions":3,"tokens":["伍麻子","麻子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"了饭，谈了一会，春航去了。茂林已在外面候了多时。定更后了，茂林提了灯笼，照着蕙芳，到了长庆家。也不找琴言，找了伍麻子，请了长庆媳妇出来。蕙芳见他扎了白包头，穿了孝衫，下面倒是条长绿绸裤子，白布弓鞋，黄瘦脸儿，长挑身材，三十来岁年纪，像个嘴尖舌利的人。见了蕙芳却不认识，问茂林道：「这位是谁？」茂林道：「这是班里的苏大相公。」蕙芳上前见了礼，叫了婶娘。长庆媳妇还了礼，","en":"lit the way for Huifang, and the two arrived at the Changqing household. They did not seek out Qinyan but found Wu Mazi and asked for the widow, the wife of Changqing. Huifang saw a woman emerge who wore a white mourning kerchief and a white hemp jacket, below which she had on a long green silk skirt with white cloth bound shoes. Her face was sallow and thin, her build"}],"44":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["伍麻子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"就是华公子赏花之日。明日，华公子吩咐珊枝着人去叫琴言回来，珊枝派了一个外跟班姚贤，一早出城。到了长庆寓处，见了伍麻子。说假期已过，叫他进城。","en":"outer attendant named Yao Xian, who set out early for the city gate. Arriving at the Changqing lodgings, he found Wu Mazi and delivered word that the leave period had expired and Qinyan was to return to the city."},{"paragraph":2,"mentions":7,"tokens":["伍麻子","麻子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"伍麻子道：「琴言么，昨日有人替他出师，已经搬了出去，恐怕未必进城来了。」姚贤听了一惊，道：「这话怎么说！我家的人怎样私自放走了，如今他搬在那里？」伍麻子道：「我不知道，听得说替他出师的，是个江南人，想必就在他家了。」姚贤道：「岂有此理！你们就要出师，也回明","en":"\\"Qinyan?\\" said Wu Mazi. \\"Yesterday someone arranged his release from indenture. He has already moved out and is unlikely to return to the city.\\" Yao Xian was startled. \\"What does that mean? How could someone in our household be simply let go without permission? Where has he"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":1,"tokens":["伍麻子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"姚贤吃了饭，道了谢，就进城来见了珊枝，将琴言近日的事，先照伍麻子，后照孟七、胡八的话，没有少说一句，说得顺口，还添了好些。又说路上见他与一个相公同车，想是陪酒去了。珊枝听了，呆了一会，说道：「这是什么话？是真的，还是假的？我要照你的话回，若有假的在里头，就了不得了。」","en":"his thanks, and returned to the city, where he reported to Shanzhi. He relayed Qinyan's recent doings — first as Mazi had told them, then as Meng Qi and Hu Ba had reported — without leaving out a single word, and with his tongue loosened, he added a good many embellishments of his own. He also said that on the road he had seen Qinyan sharing a carriage with another"}],"58":[{"paragraph":11,"mentions":1,"tokens":["伍麻子"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"又说他那日晚上，还给了他们十几吊钱，亮轩似信不信的。后来伍麻子即跟了长庆的媳妇回扬州去了，此话绝无对证。三人讲了些闲话，奚十一便问大傻子，那些相公在什么地方。大傻道：「今日就只王兰官、苏蕙芳在家，其余都出门去了。」奚十一道：「我要看看花，你同我们去。」大傻便领了奚、姬二人，从东边进了一重门，见是一带游廊，假山层","en":"He also claimed he had given them over a dozen strings of cash that night, which Ji half believed. Later Wu the Pockmark had followed Changqing's widow back to Yangzhou, so the story could not be checked. The three chatted, and Xi Eleven asked Big Fool where the actors were. Big Fool replied, \\"Today only Wang Lanbao and Su Huifang are home, the rest are out.\\" Xi demanded,"}]}`),"char-165":{27:[{paragraph:10,mentions:1,tokens:["天福"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"或者出来见一见，就算高情了。要待你好断不能。我见他待人没有好过，就是见那几位大人们，也是冷冷的。倒是他两个师弟天福、天寿会应酬，相貌又不好，人也不喜欢他。他师傅曹长庆，也是个古怪脾气，就是一门只爱钱，钱到了手，又不睬人了。」奚十一听了这些话，心上着实不信，对仲雨道：「你停一停，同我去看看，到底怎样？」仲雨道：「别处都去，他那里我不去，况前日我还骂了他。」众人吃了",en:`but treat you well? Never. I've never seen him warm; even to great officials, he's cold. His junior disciples Tianfu and Tianshou butter people up, but they have ugly faces and folk dislike them. His teacher Cao Changqing has an odd temper, loves only silver, and with silver in hand, ignores people." Xi refused to believe it and said to Zhongyu, "Wait, come with me,`},{paragraph:13,mentions:1,tokens:["天福"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"和你一样，就是其中有好些难处。你如今倒别顾我，只要你自己想，自己定了主意才好，也不必哭了。我是有事要出门，偏偏天福、天寿又进戏园去了。你若气闷，不如去请素兰来与你顽顽，他今日不下园子，你们是讲得来的。」一面说，就走出来了，叫人去请素兰即便过来。",en:'there are a great many difficulties in it. Never mind me — decide for yourself. And do not cry. I must go out; Tianfu and Tianshou are at the theatre. If you are dull, send for Sulan; he is not on the stage today, and the two of you can talk." With that he went out, and sent for Sulan at once.'},{paragraph:16,mentions:1,tokens:["天福"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"想道：「这姓奚的，虽听得他是个冤大头，但是个没味的人，多少相公上了他的当，没处伸冤，琴言是断乎讲不来的。不然叫天福、天寿回来，或者有些甜头，也未可知。一面即打发人到戏园去叫，一面自己穿了衣裳、鞋袜出来，款待奚十一。",en:'and tasteless. Many actors have been ruined with no redress, and Qinyan is hopeless with him. Or I could summon Tianfu and Tianshou; maybe there are sweets to be had." He sent for them from the theater, donned his coat and boots, and went out to receive Xi Eleven.'},{paragraph:25,mentions:2,tokens:["天福"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"，一样一样的拿出来，摆在炕上。长庆陪了，给他烧了几口，心上又起了坏主意，赔着笑道：「小的还有两个徒弟：「一个叫天福，一个叫天寿，今日先叫他们伺候，迟日再叫琴言到府上来，不知大老爷可肯赏脸？」奚十一既吹动了烟，即懒得起来。又想他如此殷懃，便也点点头，说：「叫来看看。」长庆着人叫了天福、天寿回来，走进炕边。奚十一举目看时：一个是圆脸，一个是尖脸，眉目也还清秀洁白。一",en:'burned several bowls. A wicked idea struck him, and he smiled: "This small one has two more disciples, one named Tianfu and one Tianshou. Today let them serve you, and another day I will bring Qinyan to your mansion, if the Great Master would honor us." Xi, smoke-lulled and lazy to rise, seeing such zeal, nodded: "Call them for a look." Changqing sent for Tianfu and Tianshou.'},{paragraph:27,mentions:4,tokens:["天福"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"天福就在奚十一对面躺下，天寿坐在炕沿上。亮轩拖张凳子近着炕边，看他们吃烟，春兰、巴英官在房门口帘子边望着。只见天寿爬在奚十一身上，看他手上的翡翠镯子，天福也斜着身子，隔着灯盘拉了奚十一的手，两人同看。亮轩也来炕上躺了，两个相公就在炕沿轮流烧烟。天福挨了奚",en:"Tianfu lay opposite Xi, and Tianshou perched on the edge of the kang. Liangxuan dragged a stool beside the kang, watching them smoke. Chunlan and Ba Yingguan peered from the doorway curtain. Tianshou climbed beside Xi, studying his jade bracelet, while Tianfu"},{paragraph:29,mentions:2,tokens:["天福"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"素兰。待我们与老爷说了，好不依他。」于是二人又到房门口，见他们还挤在一处，听得奚十一道：「琴言到底几时回来？」天福正要回言，春兰即说道：「他们哄老爷的，琴言现在里头，同着素兰坐在床上说话，还说在城里唱戏呢？」奚十一听了心如火发，便跳起身就走出来，天福、天寿两边拉住，奚十一摔手，两个都跌倒了，问春兰道：「你见琴言在那里？」春兰道：「在后面，有个小门进去。「奚十一十",en:`asked, "Who's there?" The two tittered and bolted. Sulan rose to look, but Qinyan said, "Why look? It is naturally Tianfu and Tianshou making mischief." Sulan was still uneasy, still frightened from before, and ordered the door barred to all visitors. Chunlan told Ba Yingguan, "They told the Master that Qinyan wasn't home, but isn't he sitting right there on the bed?" Ba`},{paragraph:31,mentions:1,tokens:["天福"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"拿他藏在你婆娘海里，我也会掏出来。」亮轩竭力的劝，方把奚十一拉出了门。上了车，还骂了几声，亮轩也上了车随去，那天福、天寿，不知躲到那里去了。",en:`wife's cunt, I can dig him out!" Liangxuan pulled him into the cart, still cursing. Liangxuan boarded as well; Tianfu and Tianshou had vanished.`}],42:[{paragraph:1,mentions:1,tokens:["天福"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"师父讲的，师父也没有对我说过。他在时我诸事不管，如今是要我支持门户了。我想我们一年总要三千吊钱才够花消。你看那天福、天寿挣得出来吗？你没有进华府时，一月内极少也挣得二三百吊钱。如今你又不进班子，这钱自然要出在华府里，想他们也不肯白使唤人。你与我讲定了，一月给我多少钱，其余你自己存下，将来可成家立业，过一辈子的日子。今虽少了你师父一个，其余还是一样，就算省俭些，大",en:"household afloat. As I reckon it, we need at least three thousand strings of cash a month to cover our expenses. Can Tianfu and Tianshou earn that much? Before you entered the Hua household, you used to bring in at least two or three hundred strings of cash a month at your busiest. Now that you are no longer in the troupe, that money must naturally come from the Hua household."},{paragraph:15,mentions:2,tokens:["天福"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"这边伍麻子正在张罗，却好天福、天寿散戏回来。见亮轩像是见过的，又记不清，请了安。那个大傻子，他们却见过他，在园子里听衬戏的，便也请了安。大傻子迷迷盹盹的说道：「今日兰保的《盗令》、《杀舟》，桂保的《相约》、《相骂》，实是个名人家数，他人做不来的。」亮轩道：「你们还认得我么？」天",en:"Inside, Wu Mazi was busying himself with arrangements when, conveniently, Tianfu and Tianshou returned from the day's performance. Tianshou thought he had seen Liangxuan somewhere before, though he could not quite remember where, and greeted him politely. As for Dasha, both boys had definitely seen him before as he was a regular"},{paragraph:16,mentions:6,tokens:["天福"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"亮轩道：「你的记性好，天福就不记得了。」天福听了也想起来，道：「哎哟！那一天好怕人。那位吃烟的好不利害，把桌子都打翻了，还直打到里头去。幸亏我躲得快，不然给他一脚，也踢个半死。」亮轩道：「可不是，亏我救了你们，你们感激我不感激呢？」天寿道：「那一位如今那里去了？」亮轩道：「现",en:'Liangxuan said, "You have a good memory. Tianfu here does not remember at all." Now that Tianfu heard it, he recalled it too. "Aiyo! What a frightening day that was. That opium-smoker was fearsome — he turned the table clean over and went on fighting all the way inside. Lucky for me I got out of the'},{paragraph:17,mentions:3,tokens:["天福"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"不必忙。如今他的师父不在了，他师娘就靠着这两个孩子呢。」大傻道：「你也难得出来，我也走乏了，略坐一坐罢。」又问天福道：「你师父几时不在的？」天福道：「前月二十五。」大傻道：「咳，我竟不晓得他死了。你们虽不认得我，你师父倒与我极相好的。」天寿道：「我也常见你在戏园里，你怎么坐不住，总走的时候多？」大傻子道：「我的朋友多，照应了一个，不照应那个，就招人怪了。」天福道",en:`nothing else." Dasha said, "You so seldom get out, and I am tired with walking. Let us sit a little." Then to Tianfu, "When did your master die?" Tianfu said, "The twenty-fifth of last month." Dasha said, "Aiya — I never knew he was dead. You may not know me, but your master and I were on the best of terms."

Tianshou said, "I see you at the theatre often enough, but`},{paragraph:18,mentions:2,tokens:["天福"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"少顷，亮轩要走，天福拖住了他，大傻却不动身。只见打杂的进来，在桌子上摆了几个碟子，天福道：「姬老爷请坐罢。」亮轩着急，对着大傻挤眉弄眼，要叫他走的意思。大傻装作不见，一手摸着那几根既稀且短的鼠须，拈了几拈。亮轩见他不动，只得独自想跑，说道：「我要小便。」天寿指着院子里道",en:'Shortly afterward Liangxuan made to leave, but Tianfu held him back. Dasha, however, showed no sign of moving. Just then one of the servants came in and set a few dishes on the table, and Tianfu said, "Master Ji, do sit down." Liangxuan was anxious; he made eyes at Dasha and jerked his head, clearly meaning'},{paragraph:20,mentions:1,tokens:["天福"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"他们下不去。」亮轩无法，又见大傻不肯走，反留住他，想是大傻要做这个东。如果大傻作东，也就放心了，只得勉强坐下。天福、天寿各斟了酒。亮轩饮了两杯，见大傻子放心乐意的喝酒，手里抓了一把杏仁，不住的往嘴里去，又见他吃了三个山里红，一个柿饼。",en:"Dasha intended to play the host. If Dasha was paying, then he could relax, and so he reluctantly sat back down. Tianfu and Tianshou each poured a cup. Liangxuan drank two cups and watched Dasha drink with cheerful abandon, grabbing handfuls of apricot kernels and tossing them into his mouth without pause, then working his way rapidly through three hawthorn berries and"},{paragraph:21,mentions:4,tokens:["天福"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"亮轩心上又想去看看琴言，此时已经点了灯，便对天福道：「你同我到你师兄屋子里去坐坐罢。」天福道：「你定要见他，待我先去讲一声。」天福进去，见琴言在那里看书，便说道：「外面有个姬老爷要见见你，见不见呢？」琴言道：「我见他作什么呢？你见我见过人吗？」天福没趣，将要出来，琴言想要关门，不料亮轩、大傻已走到",en:`Liangxuan was beginning to want a look at Qinyan. By now lamps had been lit, and he said to Tianfu, "Take me into your senior brother's room and let us sit there." Tianfu said, "If you must see him, let me go and say a word first."

Tianfu went in and found Qinyan reading. "There is a Master Ji outside who wants to see you. Will you see him or not?"`},{paragraph:25,mentions:3,tokens:["天福"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"谊，不肯僭我，我所以没有去。」大傻道：「可惜，可惜！我吃过他家酒席，只怕京里要算第一家了。」琴言听得坐不住，幸天福、天寿都在这里，便对天福道：「你请二位到外面坐罢，我有事情。」便即走了出来。二人没趣，只得同天福、天寿也出来了。",en:`table, and I should say it is the first house in the capital."

Qinyan could not sit still under this. Luckily Tianfu and Tianshou were both there, so he said to Tianfu, "Take the two gentlemen out and let them sit outside; I have something to do." And he walked out. The pair, put out of countenance, had to come out too with Tianfu and Tianshou.`},{paragraph:26,mentions:3,tokens:["天福"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"。既然姬老爷还没有用饭，另预备饭就是了。」大傻道：「是阿，我也没有吃饭。姬老爷也吹两口的，你何不请他去躺躺。」天福道：「那一天真也见你吃了两口，不过吹不多。」亮轩见大傻这般张罗，像个做东的样子，便有些喜欢。天福同他们到了里面，一面吩咐厨房添菜备饭。亮轩原不会吹烟，不过借此消遣。天福、天寿倒有几口烟瘾，便你争我夺的上烟。大傻乘他们不留心，即走了出来。他也饱了，便蹋",en:"Liangxuan now resolved to make his escape and headed directly for the door, but was caught again by Tianfu and Tianshou. Four more small side-dishes and two bowls of congee had been added to the table. Liangxuan thought to himself what kind of entertainment this was, without a single proper dish in the lot. He wondered if eight plates of dried fruit, four"},{paragraph:28,mentions:3,tokens:["天福"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"待慢了老斗，故常在窗前站立。那两个孩子本来不会说话，夹七夹八的。亮轩更坐不住，横竖迟早皆走，吃完了，嗽了口，对天福道：「今日扰了你们，我只好明日补情的了，今日却没有带钱。」天福听了，呆了一呆，不敢答应。还是天寿略灵些，说道：「老爷既没带钱，府上在那里住，叫人送老爷回府，就可以带了来。」亮轩道：「这也不必，我明日送来罢。」伍麻子听了，想道：「有些不妙，不料这两位是",en:`Sooner or later he would have to go in any case, so when he had finished eating and rinsed his mouth he said to Tianfu, "I have put you to trouble today. I shall have to make it good tomorrow — I have brought no money with me."

Tianfu was struck dumb and did not dare answer. Tianshou, quicker-witted, said, "If your honour has brought no money, where is your residence?`}]},"char-166":JSON.parse(`{"27":[{"paragraph":10,"mentions":1,"tokens":["天寿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"来见一见，就算高情了。要待你好断不能。我见他待人没有好过，就是见那几位大人们，也是冷冷的。倒是他两个师弟天福、天寿会应酬，相貌又不好，人也不喜欢他。他师傅曹长庆，也是个古怪脾气，就是一门只爱钱，钱到了手，又不睬人了。」奚十一听了这些话，心上着实不信，对仲雨道：「你停一停，同我去看看，到底怎样？」仲雨道：「别处都去，他那里我不去，况前日我还骂了他。」众人吃了饭，又","en":"you well? Never. I've never seen him warm; even to great officials, he's cold. His junior disciples Tianfu and Tianshou butter people up, but they have ugly faces and folk dislike them. His teacher Cao Changqing has an odd temper, loves only silver, and with silver in hand, ignores people.\\" Xi refused to believe it and said to Zhongyu, \\"Wait, come with me, and see how"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":1,"tokens":["天寿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"样，就是其中有好些难处。你如今倒别顾我，只要你自己想，自己定了主意才好，也不必哭了。我是有事要出门，偏偏天福、天寿又进戏园去了。你若气闷，不如去请素兰来与你顽顽，他今日不下园子，你们是讲得来的。」一面说，就走出来了，叫人去请素兰即便过来。","en":"great many difficulties in it. Never mind me — decide for yourself. And do not cry. I must go out; Tianfu and Tianshou are at the theatre. If you are dull, send for Sulan; he is not on the stage today, and the two of you can talk.\\" With that he went out, and sent for Sulan at once."},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":1,"tokens":["天寿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"「这姓奚的，虽听得他是个冤大头，但是个没味的人，多少相公上了他的当，没处伸冤，琴言是断乎讲不来的。不然叫天福、天寿回来，或者有些甜头，也未可知。一面即打发人到戏园去叫，一面自己穿了衣裳、鞋袜出来，款待奚十一。","en":"tasteless. Many actors have been ruined with no redress, and Qinyan is hopeless with him. Or I could summon Tianfu and Tianshou; maybe there are sweets to be had.\\" He sent for them from the theater, donned his coat and boots, and went out to receive Xi Eleven."},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":2,"tokens":["天寿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"拿出来，摆在炕上。长庆陪了，给他烧了几口，心上又起了坏主意，赔着笑道：「小的还有两个徒弟：「一个叫天福，一个叫天寿，今日先叫他们伺候，迟日再叫琴言到府上来，不知大老爷可肯赏脸？」奚十一既吹动了烟，即懒得起来。又想他如此殷懃，便也点点头，说：「叫来看看。」长庆着人叫了天福、天寿回来，走进炕边。奚十一举目看时：一个是圆脸，一个是尖脸，眉目也还清秀洁白。一样的湖色罗衫","en":"bowls. A wicked idea struck him, and he smiled: \\"This small one has two more disciples, one named Tianfu and one Tianshou. Today let them serve you, and another day I will bring Qinyan to your mansion, if the Great Master would honor us.\\" Xi, smoke-lulled and lazy to rise, seeing such zeal, nodded: \\"Call them for a look.\\" Changqing sent for Tianfu and Tianshou. They reached"},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":4,"tokens":["天寿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"天福就在奚十一对面躺下，天寿坐在炕沿上。亮轩拖张凳子近着炕边，看他们吃烟，春兰、巴英官在房门口帘子边望着。只见天寿爬在奚十一身上，看他手上的翡翠镯子，天福也斜着身子，隔着灯盘拉了奚十一的手，两人同看。亮轩也来炕上躺了，两个相公就在炕沿轮流烧烟。天福挨了奚十一，天寿靠了姬亮轩，两","en":"Tianfu lay opposite Xi, and Tianshou perched on the edge of the kang. Liangxuan dragged a stool beside the kang, watching them smoke. Chunlan and Ba Yingguan peered from the doorway curtain. Tianshou climbed beside Xi, studying his jade bracelet, while Tianfu leaned across the lamp tray,"},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":1,"tokens":["天寿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"哄老爷的，琴言现在里头，同着素兰坐在床上说话，还说在城里唱戏呢？」奚十一听了心如火发，便跳起身就走出来，天福、天寿两边拉住，奚十一摔手，两个都跌倒了，问春兰道：「你见琴言在那里？」春兰道：「在后面，有个小门进去。「奚十一十分大怒，不管好歹，直闯进去。长庆业已听见，忙忙的从内迎将出来，劈面撞着，即赔笑问道：「大老爷要往那去？里面都是内眷住的。」奚十一嚷道：「我不看","en":"there?\\" The two tittered and bolted. Sulan rose to look, but Qinyan said, \\"Why look? It is naturally Tianfu and Tianshou making mischief.\\" Sulan was still uneasy, still frightened from before, and ordered the door barred to all visitors. Chunlan told Ba Yingguan, \\"They told the Master that Qinyan wasn't home, but isn't he sitting right there on the bed?\\" Ba asked, \\"Who's"},{"paragraph":31,"mentions":1,"tokens":["天寿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"在你婆娘海里，我也会掏出来。」亮轩竭力的劝，方把奚十一拉出了门。上了车，还骂了几声，亮轩也上了车随去，那天福、天寿，不知躲到那里去了。","en":"cunt, I can dig him out!\\" Liangxuan pulled him into the cart, still cursing. Liangxuan boarded as well; Tianfu and Tianshou had vanished."}],"36":[{"paragraph":5,"mentions":1,"tokens":["天寿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"将到了门口，已见一班人在那里搭篷。琴言进了门，一直进内，只见天寿跑出来，见了琴言，重又跑进。听得他师娘在里头，呜呜咽咽哭起来。琴言到了床前，见他师傅已穿好了衣，帕子蒙了面，自然一阵悲酸，跪在床前，痛哭不止。倒是他师娘拉他起来，劝他住了哭。琴言问道：「师傅得了什么病，好端端就死了？」他师娘道：「并没有病，昨夜还是好","en":"neared the door, a group of people was already setting up a mourning canopy. Qinyan entered and went straight in. Tianshou ran out, saw him, and ran back in. Inside, he could hear his teacher's wife weeping bitterly. Approaching the bed, Qinyan saw his teacher already dressed in grave clothes, a cloth covering his face. Overcome with bitter grief, he knelt by the bed and"}],"42":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":1,"tokens":["天寿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"的，师父也没有对我说过。他在时我诸事不管，如今是要我支持门户了。我想我们一年总要三千吊钱才够花消。你看那天福、天寿挣得出来吗？你没有进华府时，一月内极少也挣得二三百吊钱。如今你又不进班子，这钱自然要出在华府里，想他们也不肯白使唤人。你与我讲定了，一月给我多少钱，其余你自己存下，将来可成家立业，过一辈子的日子。今虽少了你师父一个，其余还是一样，就算省俭些，大约二百","en":"As I reckon it, we need at least three thousand strings of cash a month to cover our expenses. Can Tianfu and Tianshou earn that much? Before you entered the Hua household, you used to bring in at least two or three hundred strings of cash a month at your busiest. Now that you are no longer in the troupe, that money must naturally come from the Hua household. I should"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":2,"tokens":["天寿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"这边伍麻子正在张罗，却好天福、天寿散戏回来。见亮轩像是见过的，又记不清，请了安。那个大傻子，他们却见过他，在园子里听衬戏的，便也请了安。大傻子迷迷盹盹的说道：「今日兰保的《盗令》、《杀舟》，桂保的《相约》、《相骂》，实是个名人家数，他人做不来的。」亮轩道：「你们还认得我么？」天福道：","en":"Inside, Wu Mazi was busying himself with arrangements when, conveniently, Tianfu and Tianshou returned from the day's performance. Tianshou thought he had seen Liangxuan somewhere before, though he could not quite remember where, and greeted him politely. As for Dasha, both boys had definitely seen him before as he was a regular audience member"},{"paragraph":16,"mentions":4,"tokens":["天寿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"直打到里头去。幸亏我躲得快，不然给他一脚，也踢个半死。」亮轩道：「可不是，亏我救了你们，你们感激我不感激呢？」天寿道：「那一位如今那里去了？」亮轩道：「现在病着。」天福道：「天报！天报！叫他多病几天。」大傻子道：「方才见个相公进来，叫什么名字？」天福道：「没有阿，我们就是师兄弟两个。」亮轩道：「有一个进来的，比你们高些，有十六七岁了。」天寿道：「没有，没有。我们","en":"and I'd have been half dead.\\" Liangxuan said, \\"Just so. It was I who saved you. Are you grateful to me or not?\\"\\n\\nTianshou said, \\"And where has that gentleman got to now?\\" Liangxuan said, \\"He is ill at present.\\" Tianfu cried, \\"Heaven's justice! Heaven's justice! Let him be ill a good while longer.\\"\\n\\nDasha put in, \\"A young gentleman came in just now — what is his name?\\" Tianfu"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":2,"tokens":["天寿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"大傻子望着亮轩道：「你们既然是旧交，自然也应叙叙，断无空坐之理。」亮轩支吾道：「我还有点事。」天寿道：「你能没有事，你能不肯赏脸。」亮轩道：「真有事。」伍麻子道：「坐坐罢，就有事也不必忙。如今他的师父不在了，他师娘就靠着这两个孩子呢。」大傻道：「你也难得出来，我也走乏了，略坐一坐罢。」又问天福道：「你师父几时不在的？」天福道：「前月二十五。」大傻","en":"have a word together. There is no sense sitting here like this.\\" Liangxuan hedged, \\"I have something to see to.\\" Tianshou said, \\"You've nothing to see to. You just won't do us the honour.\\" Liangxuan said, \\"I really have something.\\"\\n\\nWu Mazi said, \\"Sit a while. Even if you have, there's no hurry. Now their master is gone, his wife depends on these two boys and nothing else.\\""},{"paragraph":18,"mentions":1,"tokens":["天寿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"的意思。大傻装作不见，一手摸着那几根既稀且短的鼠须，拈了几拈。亮轩见他不动，只得独自想跑，说道：「我要小便。」天寿指着院子里道：「那东墙角就可以。」亮轩走出屋子，到院子中间，撒开脚步就走。","en":"moustache. Seeing Dasha would not budge, Liangxuan thought he would slip away on his own. \\"I must make water,\\" he said. Tianshou pointed into the courtyard. \\"The east corner will do.\\" Liangxuan walked out of the room, crossed to the middle of the courtyard, and broke into a sudden run."},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":3,"tokens":["天寿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"不料天寿在后，扯着他的发辫一迸，将亮轩的帽子落了下来，发根拉得很疼。天寿嘻嘻的笑，亮轩急回转头来，涨红了脸道：「这是什么顽法？」天寿拣了帽子，拍净了灰，与他戴上，拉了他进来。","en":"But he had not reckoned on Tianshou being right behind him. Tianshou gave his pigtail a sharp yank and Liangxuan's hat tumbled to the ground, leaving his scalp stinging from the sudden pull. Tianshou grinned playfully. Liangxuan wheeled around, his face flushed red, and demanded what kind"},{"paragraph":20,"mentions":1,"tokens":["天寿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"不去。」亮轩无法，又见大傻不肯走，反留住他，想是大傻要做这个东。如果大傻作东，也就放心了，只得勉强坐下。天福、天寿各斟了酒。亮轩饮了两杯，见大傻子放心乐意的喝酒，手里抓了一把杏仁，不住的往嘴里去，又见他吃了三个山里红，一个柿饼。","en":"intended to play the host. If Dasha was paying, then he could relax, and so he reluctantly sat back down. Tianfu and Tianshou each poured a cup. Liangxuan drank two cups and watched Dasha drink with cheerful abandon, grabbing handfuls of apricot kernels and tossing them into his mouth without pause, then working his way rapidly through three hawthorn berries and a sweet persimmon"},{"paragraph":25,"mentions":2,"tokens":["天寿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"肯僭我，我所以没有去。」大傻道：「可惜，可惜！我吃过他家酒席，只怕京里要算第一家了。」琴言听得坐不住，幸天福、天寿都在这里，便对天福道：「你请二位到外面坐罢，我有事情。」便即走了出来。二人没趣，只得同天福、天寿也出来了。","en":"I should say it is the first house in the capital.\\"\\n\\nQinyan could not sit still under this. Luckily Tianfu and Tianshou were both there, so he said to Tianfu, \\"Take the two gentlemen out and let them sit outside; I have something to do.\\" And he walked out. The pair, put out of countenance, had to come out too with Tianfu and Tianshou."},{"paragraph":26,"mentions":3,"tokens":["天寿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"的。」亮轩也举箸吃了一会。大傻子已喝了两壶酒，将四碟小菜也吃干净了，喝了两碗粥，抹一抹嘴。见亮轩不甚高兴，便对天寿道：「姬老爷是要喝热闹酒的，你叫人去添些菜来，酒烫得热热儿的，与姬老爷豁几拳。今日是我拉他来的，你们巴结得不好，以后他就不肯来了。」亮轩打量是请他，便放了心，忙说道：「怎么是这样的，也算不得吃饭。」天寿道：「这原算不得吃饭，我当你们吃过饭了，随便吃钟","en":"Liangxuan now resolved to make his escape and headed directly for the door, but was caught again by Tianfu and Tianshou. Four more small side-dishes and two bowls of congee had been added to the table. Liangxuan thought to himself what kind of entertainment this was, without a single proper dish in the lot. He wondered if eight plates of dried fruit, four side-dishes,"},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":1,"tokens":["天寿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"说了一会话，问了些琴言光景。伍麻子来请吃饭，亮轩才找起大傻来，杳无影响，心中着忙，便变了神色，只管要找乌大傻。天寿说道：「他去了。这个人是坐不住的，我见他在戏园里，一天总要走个十几回，想必他就来的。我们先坐，不用等他了。」亮轩只得坐了。看菜是四碟两碗，两盘饽饽，就吃了些。终是无精打采，心上要想个脱身之计。","en":"had vanished without a trace, and Liangxuan's expression changed as he kept urgently trying to find Wu Dasha. Tianshou explained that he left, noting that the man could never stay put. He saw him at the theater and he came and went a dozen times a day, figuring he would probably be back soon enough, and suggested they sit down without waiting for him. Liangxuan had no"},{"paragraph":28,"mentions":2,"tokens":["天寿"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"了，嗽了口，对天福道：「今日扰了你们，我只好明日补情的了，今日却没有带钱。」天福听了，呆了一呆，不敢答应。还是天寿略灵些，说道：「老爷既没带钱，府上在那里住，叫人送老爷回府，就可以带了来。」亮轩道：「这也不必，我明日送来罢。」伍麻子听了，想道：「有些不妙，不料这两位是这样的。」便进来在窗户边站着，看看亮轩。亮轩想硬走出来，天寿拉住道：「不用忙，再坐坐。」亮轩不理","en":"to make it good tomorrow — I have brought no money with me.\\"\\n\\nTianfu was struck dumb and did not dare answer. Tianshou, quicker-witted, said, \\"If your honour has brought no money, where is your residence? We will send someone home with you and he can bring it back.\\" Liangxuan said, \\"There is no need for that. I will send it round tomorrow.\\"\\n\\nHearing this, Wu Mazi thought,"}]}`),"char-167":JSON.parse(`{"11":[{"paragraph":4,"mentions":1,"tokens":["爱珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"岁上嫁了华光宿，真是瑶琴玉瑟，鱼水和谐，说不尽咏月吟风，闺房潇洒。又有十个美婢，名字都有一个珠字，宝珠、明珠、爱珠、花珠、荷珠、蕊珠、掌珠、珍珠、画珠、赠珠。这十珠都有十分姿色，年皆十五六岁，真像十样鲜花，一群粉蝶，个个慧心香口，莲步柳腰，针黹巧夺天工，词令皆成妙品。比郑康成之诗婢，少道学之风规，较郭令公之家姬，得风流之香主。华公子夫妇二人这样的妙才浓福，也就人","en":"Serving them were ten beautiful maids, each bearing the character 'Zhu' (Pearl) in her name: Baozhu, Mingzhu, Aizhu, Huazhu, Hezhu, Ruizhu, Zhangzhu, Zhenzhu, Yazhu, and Zengzhu. All fifteen or sixteen years of age, they bloomed like ten distinct varieties of fresh spring flowers, fluttering like a cluster of powdered butterflies. Each possessed a nimble mind and"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":1,"tokens":["爱珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"色样，成全了他。」也贺了一杯，并命伺候丫鬟们，每人都饮一杯酒，作个大犒三军，公贺将军挂印。十珠、六红等都饮毕，爱珠拉拉红雪的袖子，低低说道：「你们奶奶的五更转，甘与子同梦」，说得有情；我们奶奶的「铁索缆孤舟，搭着夜行船」，说得有理；二小姐的说得有声有势，三个各有好处。」红雪点点头道：「你说得一点不错。」袁夫人等听了，亦都微笑。","en":"reward to the three armies in honor of the victorious general. As the Ten Pearls and Six Reds partook of the wine, Aizhu tugged Hongxue's sleeve, whispering: \\"Your mistress's verse of sharing a dream's content overflows with tender emotion. My mistress's vision of the lone boat adrift is imbued with profound philosophical depth. But the Second Young Lady's verse radiates"},{"paragraph":37,"mentions":1,"tokens":["爱珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"红起来。这一回行令，内中有几个说得不好，已受了多少刻薄。红薇这一掷，掷了个醉西施。半天说不出来，急得两颊通红。爱珠想了一个，笑道：「我代你说，你要谢谢媒人才好。」即笑吟吟地对着红薇，还把一个指头指着他，念道：醉西施，酒色上来迟，他昨日风清月朗夜深时。好姐姐，吉士诱之。","en":"blank. For a long, agonizing moment, her cheeks burned a furious crimson with frustration. Suddenly inspired, Aizhu laughed and said, \\"I shall compose a verse for you, but you must thank me properly as your matchmaker!\\" Still smiling her sweet, cutting smile, she pointed a delicate finger at Hongwei and recited:\\n\\n\\"Intoxicated Xi Shi,\\nThe flush of wine and beauty come"},{"paragraph":38,"mentions":1,"tokens":["爱珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"众人赞好。红薇道：「你真是个好姐姐，怪不得有人要诱你。」爱珠道：「我是说你的，你这好模样。还不像个醉西施吗？」众人又笑。","en":"verse. Hongwei retorted, \\"You are indeed a 'good elder sister', small wonder there are those longing to tempt you!\\" Aizhu replied, \\"I was merely describing you and your striking looks. Do you not agree you perfectly resemble an intoxicated Xi Shi?\\" The maids dissolved into laughter once more."},{"paragraph":44,"mentions":1,"tokens":["爱珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"看这一班顽婢，有闹得花朵歪斜的，鬓发蓬松的，还有些背转脸去要笑的，还有些气忿忿以眉眼记恨的，不觉好笑，只得对着爱珠等说道：「你们这么大了，怎么还这样顽皮？若不为着有客在此，我今日必要责罚你们。」袁夫人也说了六红婢几句，群婢低首侍立，面有愧色。苏小姐问道：「你们行的什么令？这般好笑。」群婢中又有些抿嘴笑起来，倒惹得两位夫人也要笑了。","en":"silent, aggrieved reproach. Despite themselves, the ladies found the entire spectacle deeply amusing. Turning to Aizhu and the others, they scolded gently, \\"At your ages, how can you still behave with such unbridled mischief? Were it not for our honored guest being present today, I would certainly see you punished.\\" Mrs. Yuan added her own words of mild censure to the"},{"paragraph":46,"mentions":3,"tokens":["爱珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"爱珠的光景似将要说，红香扯扯他的袖子，叫他不要说。爱珠道：「他们说的也多，也记不清了。」苏小姐急于要听，便对华夫人、袁夫人道：「他们是惧怕主人不敢说，你们叫他说他就说了。」华夫人也知道这些婢女有些小聪明，都也说得几个好的出来，便对袁夫人微笑。袁夫人本是个","en":"Aizhu's bright eyes suggested she was eager to speak, but Hongxiang sharply tugged her sleeve, warning her to remain silent. Aizhu demurred, \\"There were a great many verses, I cannot recall them all clearly.\\" Eager to hear the tale, Miss Su turned to Lady"},{"paragraph":47,"mentions":1,"tokens":["爱珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"夫人评定这六个令，太恶者罚一大觞酒，打手掌三板，以示薄责；其次者罚酒免责。于是红雪、红霙、荷珠、宝珠受了责罚；爱珠、红雯单罚了酒。群婢受罚起来好不羞愧，又喝了这些急酒，觉得有些晃宕起来，勉强扎挣住了，深悔一时高兴。","en":"deemed sufficient. Thus, Hongxue, Hongying, Hezhu, and Baozhu suffered both the wine and the stinging slaps, while Aizhu and Hongwen escaped with only the wine forfeit. Receiving their punishments in utter humiliation, and having thrown back the harsh wine in such haste, the maids found themselves swaying unsteadily on their feet. They fought to hold themselves upright,"}],"26":[{"paragraph":2,"mentions":4,"tokens":["爱珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"又见爱珠提了一盏绛纱灯走出来道：「差不多要定更了，此刻还要传林珊枝进来呢！」宝珠问道：「叫林珊枝做什么？」爱珠道：「我知道什么事？自然是有要紧事了。」爱珠穿了木底小弓鞋，走快了，觉得咭咭咯咯的响。走到角门口，找着了管事的老婆子说了。老婆子又找了内管门，才到外","en":"Presently, Aizhu emerged carrying a crimson gauze lantern and said, \\"It is almost the first watch, yet we are still supposed to summon Lin Shanzhi!\\" \\"Why call for Lin Shanzhi?\\" Baozhu asked. \\"How should I know? It must be something urgent,\\" Aizhu replied. Wearing wooden-soled"},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":3,"tokens":["爱珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"爱珠把绛纱灯提起，在珊枝脸上一照，笑了一笑，道：「你把脸喝得红红儿的，上去准要碰钉子。」珊枝笑道：「我几时喝酒？你那灯笼是红的，映到人家脸上来，倒说我醉了。」爱珠也笑了一笑，就领了珊枝慢慢而行，进了内室，听得公子正在与那些丫鬟说笑。爱珠先进去。说：「珊枝","en":"Aizhu lifted the amber lantern to Shanzhi's face, smiling playfully. \\"Your face is flushed red from drinking; you are sure to meet a rebuff when you go in.\\" Shanzhi chuckled, \\"When did I drink? It's your red lantern reflecting on my face that makes you think"},{"paragraph":6,"mentions":2,"tokens":["爱珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，道：「你们难道没有听过戏，听说到戏连心都没有了。歇天我就叫那一班人进来唱一天，请奶奶听，你们大家都托托福。」爱珠多嘴说道：「什么好班子？难道比咱们府里的还好吗？」华公子笑道：「你们也是十个，叫你们扮生，他们扮旦，合串一出，就知道人家的好处了。」爱珠等听了红了脸，低了头说道：「我们是不会串的，要串戏有八龄班。」华公子笑道：「学就会了，女戏子也是常有的。」珊枝也笑","en":"Someday, I will summon the entire troupe to perform for Madame for a full day, so you may all share in the pleasure.\\" Aizhu chimed in, \\"What outside troupe could possibly compare to our own within the mansion?\\" Smiling, the Young Master replied, \\"There are ten of you as well. If you were to play the male leads and they the female leads in a joint performance, you would soon"},{"paragraph":10,"mentions":3,"tokens":["爱珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"饭去，要等他出来不晓什么时候呢！」珊枝说道：「好说，姐姐吃剩的菜，只怕我还没有这福分呢。肯赏我，还敢嫌脏么。」爱珠道：「会说话，我瞧你眼也饿花了。」就同珊枝到一间屋子来。夏天是不用热的，荤荤素素菜都有，珊枝吃了，擦擦手，仍坐下与那些丫鬟顽笑，只不见华公子出来。看看已到未正，珊枝道：「这怎么好，到底出来不出来？叫人家等着。爱姐姐请你去说一声，说魏师爷还在留青精舍等","en":"scraps are far beyond my meager fortune,\\" Shanzhi laughed. \\"I would be honored; how could I possibly disdain them?\\" Aizhu teased, \\"Such a silver tongue! I wager your eyes are hungry too.\\" She led him to a side room where summer dishes requiring no heating—both meat and vegetables—were laid out. Shanzhi ate his fill, wiped his hands, and resumed joking with the maids, but"}],"41":[{"paragraph":7,"mentions":1,"tokens":["爱珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"：「花姑娘来了，想必在留仙院了。」花珠待要问时，只见藤花架边走出一群人来，是六珠并两个老婆子，还有几个小丫鬟。爱珠对花珠道：「在什么地方，你也不给个信，叫我们满园的瞎找。」花珠道：「我们是坐船过去的，还到不多时，有人在岸上也应瞧得见。此刻原是来找你们的。」那两个婆子抬了食箱，六珠婢也拿了零碎物件，还有二龄及珊枝帮忙。送到留仙院后，一一布置了，群珠上前送了茶，一边","en":"emerged from beside the wisteria trellis. It was the Six Zhus, two older maidservants, and several young girls. Aizhu said to Huazhu, \\"What have you been doing all this time? Not a word to let us know, and here we have been wandering all over the garden searching.\\" Huazhu replied, \\"We came by boat, and we have not been there long. Anyone on the bank should have been"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":3,"tokens":["爱珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"想了一想，叫爱珠去问珊枝找管屋的书童要了钥匙来。不一会，爱珠取了进来，公子叫他开了两个博古橱，携着夫人细细看那橱中，尽是古铜、旧玉等物。又将抽屉一开，见有一个紫檀木匣，开了盖子，看是个手卷，签上写着「花蕊夫人小像，管夫人画」。华夫人笑道：「这个就很好。」公子扯开看时","en":"After a moment's thought, he called Aizhu to go and ask Shanzhi to fetch the key from the study-boy in charge of the storeroom. Presently Aizhu returned with it, and the young master had her unlock two antique cabinets, then led his lady over to examine them at leisure. They were filled with"},{"paragraph":13,"mentions":3,"tokens":["爱珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"同我们一样。」十珠都微微笑起来。掌珠对荷珠低低说道：「要拜我们十个一同拜，不要分先后，省得先拜的叫后拜的笑。」爱珠道：「我们一对一对的拜不好吗？」花珠凑着爱珠的耳说道：「又不是夫妻拜堂，怎么你要一对对的拜呢？」爱珠打他一下。已见老婆子颤巍巍的拎了一大瓶酒来，放在廊下。十珠等各拿了小酒杯斟了酒，分头去觅那开得鲜艳的，你一杯我一杯的乱浇，走来穿去，也像一群穿花蝴蝶一","en":"same moment—no one first, no one last, so that those who bow first won't be laughed at by those who bow after.\\" Aizhu said: \\"Would it not be better for us to bow in pairs?\\" Huazhu leaned close to Aizhu's ear and whispered: \\"This is not a wedding ceremony—why on earth do you want to bow in pairs?\\" Aizhu gave her a light swat. By this time the older maidservant had come"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":1,"tokens":["爱珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"枝，总要有句桃花在里头的。我派定了对，不是此唱彼吹，就是彼吹此唱。若唱错了，吹错了，要跪在花下，罚酒一大杯。」爱珠笑道：「奶奶这个令，未免太苦了。况且我们会唱的也有限，譬如这人会唱这一枝，那人又不会吹那一枝。那人会吹那一枝，这人又不会唱这一枝，如何合得来？今奶奶预先派定了这个吹，那个唱，我们十个人竟齐齐的跪在花下，喝了这半大瓶的冷酒就结了。」说得公子、夫人都笑。","en":"mistake in singing or playing, she is to kneel beneath the flowers and drink a full large cup of wine as a forfeit.\\" Aizhu laughed: \\"Mistress, this game of yours is rather too cruel. We have only a limited repertoire, after all—it may well happen that one person knows how to sing a particular aria but her partner cannot play it, and the partner who can play it has no one"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":1,"tokens":["爱珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，添了些行云想。\\n匆匆忘却仙模样。春宵花月休成谎，良缘到手难推让，准备着身赴高唐。《小桃红》\\n《访翠》唱完了，爱珠接唱《眠香》，唱道：","en":"Make ready to travel up to the high palace of clouds. [Little Peach Red]\\n\\n\\"Visiting Cui\\" being thus concluded, Aizhu took up the next suite, \\"Sleeping amid Fragrance,\\" and sang:"},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":2,"tokens":["爱珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"起。公子道：「今日倒难为他们，须要赏他们些东西。」华夫人道：「此中要定个等第，才见赏罚分明。」即叫拿笔砚过来。爱珠抢先取了笔砚、花笺，送到公子面前。公子让夫人品定，夫人又推公子，公子道：「这音律中实在我不如你，恐定得不公，还是你定罢。」夫人微笑，把笔先写了十个字，就是珠字上面那个字，对公子道：「据我评来，以宝珠为第一，唱得风神跌宕，文秀温存，十人中是他压卷了。次","en":"order of merit, so the rewards and forfeits will be seen to be just.\\" She called for writing brush and ink-stone. Aizhu was the first to seize them and carried the brush, ink, and flower-patterned paper to the young master. He deferred to his lady for the assessment; she in turn deferred to him, until he said, \\"In matters of musical judgment I am truly no match for you,"},{"paragraph":32,"mentions":3,"tokens":["爱珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"见爱珠走来，问道：「姑娘，奶奶与你们讲些什么？又见他写单子。」爱珠笑道：「要赏给我们东西。」那老婆子道：「你们姑娘们实在福分大，常常得赏赐。我们一天劳到黑，也没有格外得过一点好东西。姑娘，如今赏下来，你不要的给我，不要给那些小丫头糟蹋了。」爱珠一笑走开。那","en":"When Aizhu walked past, this maidservant called out, \\"Miss, what has the mistress been saying to you all? And I see she's written something on a list.\\" Aizhu laughed, \\"She is giving us presents.\\" The old woman said, \\"You young ladies truly have the blessed life,"},{"paragraph":35,"mentions":1,"tokens":["爱珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"倒教我不安。」公子道：「只羡鸳鸯不羡仙」虽是成句，但用来比原作还好，也不能教崔鸳鸯、郑鹧鸪得名了。」即叫宝珠、爱珠过来念熟了好唱。","en":"and Zheng Zhegu will not be able to claim sole possession of that sentiment now.\\" He at once called Baozhu and Aizhu to come over and memorize the words so they could sing them."},{"paragraph":36,"mentions":1,"tokens":["爱珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"二珠念了几遍熟了，唱了两句，错起板来。夫人道：「还不熟，你将工尺注在旁边，倒是看着唱罢。」宝珠、爱珠将工尺写了出来，果然一字字唱去，却很对腔，听得夫人、公子快乐非常。公子笑道：「这两枝曲子，倒定了我们的生旦了。你何不唱唱。这里唱，外人断乎听不见的。」夫人笑道：「你见我几时会唱？」公子道：「你真不会唱，何以其中的深微奥妙都知道，且人偶然唱错了一板，你","en":"secure. Write the notation marks in the margins, and you had better read from the score as you sing.\\" Baozhu and Aizhu wrote in the notation and then sang through it again, note by note, and this time fell perfectly into the melodic mode, to the great delight of both the mistress and the young master. The young master laughed: \\"With these two arias, the two of us might"},{"paragraph":37,"mentions":4,"tokens":["爱珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"些净丑出来取笑，然而也觉俗了。」公子笑道：「若要扮丑脚的，只有花珠可以扮得。」花珠听了，红起脸来，扭转头，对着爱珠道：「还有爱珠也可扮得。」爱珠尚未开言，公子道：「爱珠是贴旦，画珠是老旦，宝珠是正旦，蕊珠是小旦。其余扮生、净、外、末，比八龄又强了。」夫人道：「这倒可以，只怕他们害羞，做不出来。」夫人一面说，一面看那桃花，映着夕阳，红的更如霞如锦，白的成了粉色，又","en":"clown, only Huazhu could carry it off.\\" Huazhu, overhearing this, flushed red, turned her head away, and addressed Aizhu, \\"And Aizhu could too.\\" Before Aizhu could reply, the young master said, \\"Aizhu would play the secondary female lead, Yazhu the older-woman role, Baozhu the principal female, and Ruizhu the ingenue. The rest could take on the male lead, painted-face,"}],"44":[{"paragraph":8,"mentions":1,"tokens":["爱珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"便重了两句，背不下去。公子哈哈大笑道：「跪了之后，还背不出来，只好打了。」见蕊珠涨红了脸，越想越想不出来。旁边爱珠在那里笑他，宝珠在公子身后抓着脸羞他，羞得蕊珠要哭出来。这两日公子与夫人把这十珠作个消遣法子，教他们念唐诗，念熟了背，背错了要罚。","en":"smacking.\\" Ruizhu's face had turned deep red. She tried and tried again but could not recall the words. Beside her, Aizhu was laughing at her, while behind the young master, Baozhu was scratching her own cheek in mock shame. The teasing drove Ruizhu nearly to tears. Over these past two days, the young master and the mistress had devised an entertainment for the Ten Pearls,"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":1,"tokens":["爱珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"如错得多的，跪了还要打几下手板。今日宝珠背了李义山《无题》六首，错了一字，没有记过。爱珠背了《琵琶行》，竟一字不错。蕊珠背《长恨歌》，已经错了许多，故跪在地下，又背不出来，那三珠又一言半语的笑他，他已气得难受，又不敢站起来跑了出去。","en":"Baozhu had recited the six \\"Untitled\\" poems of Li Yishan, with only one wrong character and no demerit recorded. Aizhu had recited the \\"Song of the Pipa\\" without a single error. Ruizhu, reciting the \\"Song of Everlasting Sorrow,\\" had already accumulated many errors, and so was kneeling on the ground; now she could not recite further, while the other three Pearl-maids"},{"paragraph":11,"mentions":2,"tokens":["爱珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"了，也觉诧异。那蕊珠尚跪在地下呆呆的看着珊枝讲话，自己忘其所以，花片落了一头，还拿一片花瓣在嘴里嚼了一会，吐在爱珠手上，爱珠瞅了他一眼。","en":"petals had fallen all over her head, and she was idly chewing a petal in her mouth, which she then spat out onto Aizhu's hand. Aizhu gave her a look."},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":1,"tokens":["爱珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"腰，将膝盖揉了揉，徜徜徉徉的走开道：「冤不冤，跪了这半天。」找个僻静地方小解去了。华公子起身回夫人房内，宝珠、爱珠随了进去，珍珠等蕊珠同行。珊枝慢慢的送公子出了园，正要走时，忽然一把花瓣撒了他一头，急回头看时，见蕊珠、珍珠骂道：「人家跪着，你倒在石洞里偷看人，瞎掉你的眼睛。」珊枝道：「明日还要挨打呢。」说着也就走开了。","en":"find a secluded corner to relieve herself. Young Master Hua rose and went to the mistress's quarters; Baozhu and Aizhu followed him in. Zhenzhu waited for Ruizhu, and the two walked together. Shanzhi slowly escorted the young master out of the garden, and was just turning to leave when a handful of petals was thrown over her head. She spun around to see Ruizhu and Zhenzhu"}],"52":[{"paragraph":24,"mentions":1,"tokens":["爱珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"甚悔一时没有留心，只得说道：「我不与人瞧，我恐扇旧了，已收起了。」华夫人也不疑心他给了人。将要出门，带了宝珠、爱珠、蕊珠、珍珠、明珠、掌珠六婢，又带了小香儿与两个仆妇。此时新秋，天气尚热，也不须多带衣服，带了一个小锦箱、一个锦匣，装些花钿脂粉。外面叫一个老年的管家骑了顶马，金龄、玉龄、兰龄、桂龄骑了跟班马。华夫人出房到内花厅，就坐肩舆，出了垂花门，上了车，另有车","en":"already stored it away.\\" Lady Hua suspected nothing. Preparing to depart, she brought along six maids—Baozhu, Aizhu, Ruizhu, Zhenzhu, Mingzhu, and Zhangzhu—along with little Xiang'er and two older servant women. Since it was early autumn and the weather remained warm, they did not pack many heavy clothes, only bringing a small brocade chest and a casket containing"}],"57":[{"paragraph":14,"mentions":3,"tokens":["爱珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"我秦国是兵强将勇，没有一个弱兵。待我且先派定了人数再说。他们共二十四人，我用六个，你们一家用三个。」即叫浣香的爱珠、花珠过来，道：「你两人到我大国来立些功业，不要在你那个小国埋没。」爱珠、花珠笑了，站了过来。绮香自己点了爱珠、花珠、红香、红玉、红雪、红霙，浣香自己留了宝珠、明珠、掌珠，浣兰留了许三姐、小翠，要了荷珠，紫烟留了侍香，要了红薇、赠珠，佩秋留了金凤，要","en":"twenty-four servants. I will use six, and each of you will use three.\\" She then called out to Huanxiang's maids, Aizhu and Huazhu, \\"Come to my great kingdom and win true merit. Do not moulder away in your petty state.\\" Aizhu and Huazhu laughed and stepped over to her side. Qixiang chose Aizhu, Huazhu, Hongxiang, Hongyu, Hongxue, and Hongying for her own forces. Huanxiang"},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":1,"tokens":["爱珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"分派定了，绮香叫拿七个小筹来，先掣秦国的。爱珠掣了是白起，花珠掣的是商君，红香掣的是韩非子，红玉掣的是吕不韦，红雪掣的是李斯，红霙掣的是赵高。绮香笑道：「如何，你看我们文武皆全。」收过了筒，取紫烟楚国的筹来，侍香掣的是令尹子兰，红薇掣的是高唐神女，赠珠掣的是宋玉。紫烟笑道：「完了，一个佞人，一个","en":"With the assignments set, Qixiang called for the seven small lot-tubes and drew for Qin first. Aizhu drew Bai Qi; Huazhu drew Lord Shang; Hongxiang drew Han Feizi; Hongyu drew Lü Buwei; Hongxue drew Li Si; and Hongying drew Zhao Gao. Qixiang laughed triumphantly, \\"You see? Both civil and military talents are perfectly complete.\\" They put away Qin's"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":2,"tokens":["爱珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，试试手段。」秋莲、画珠，红雯三个就上来，旁边又摆了一桌酒肴。秋莲把两个骰子一掷，掷了四点，是自己出马。秦国的爱珠、花珠、红香、红玉、红雪、红霙也过来。爱珠把骰子一掷，掷了二点，是花珠出马。花珠是商君，秋莲是廉颇。绮香翻出谱来，查到廉颇名下，内有一条：「廉颇如遇商君，俱系勇将，皆以豁拳为令。如廉颇败了，必系老年无用，一败带上假白须，再败罚酒一大觞，三败罚饭一碗。","en":"dishes had been set aside. Qiulian cast the two dice, rolling a four, meaning she would fight first. Qin's forces—Aizhu, Huazhu, Hongxiang, Hongyu, Hongxue, and Hongying—stepped up to meet her. Aizhu cast the dice and rolled a two, signaling that Huazhu would take the field. Huazhu was playing Lord Shang, while Qiulian represented Lian Po. Qixiang opened the rule book"},{"paragraph":19,"mentions":1,"tokens":["爱珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"蓉华道：「好个廉颇，头一阵就打了败仗。」秋莲想跑开，被爱珠、花珠赶上，捉了过来，戴上假须，飘飘漾漾的。众婢女把他形容个淋漓尽致，罚了一杯酒，又盛了一碗饭要他吃。秋莲笑道：「你们也有良心，戴上这个东西，怎样吃得饭来？除非要用金钩挂胡子法子。」红雪道：「有钩子，早就预备的。」便在匣子里找出两个金钩来，挂在秋莲耳","en":"Ronghua sighed playfully, \\"Brave Lian Po, the very first battle is lost.\\" Qiulian attempted to flee, but Aizhu and Huazhu swiftly caught her and tied on the false white whiskers, which fluttered comically in the air. The maids vividly painted the scene, fining her one cup of wine and heaping a large bowl of rice before her. Qiulian laughed, \\"You still have some"},{"paragraph":22,"mentions":2,"tokens":["爱珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"骰子一掷，数到红薇，是高唐神女，众人皆笑。紫烟笑道：「好个红姑娘，高鬟大袖的，真像个神女。」红薇脸已红了。那边爱珠、红玉、红香、红霙、红雪也过来，掷到爱珠，是白起。绮香道：「这叫做无情遇。」看谱：「如神女遇见白起，神女如何能敌？须起倾国之兵尽出助战。如系文臣者，行藏阄令，手中各藏一物。国君点戏一出，如白起为净，神女为旦，其余助战者各肖其人定色。」再查：「令尹子兰","en":"high chignon and wide, flowing sleeves, she truly resembles a goddess.\\" Hongwei blushed deeply. On Qin's side, Aizhu, Hongyu, Hongxiang, Hongying, and Hongxue stepped forward. The dice landed on Aizhu, representing the fearsome general Bai Qi. Qixiang noted, \\"This match is 'the heartless meets the divine.'\\" The rule book read: \\"If the delicate goddess meets the brutal"},{"paragraph":23,"mentions":2,"tokens":["爱珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"杯。红薇不服，说道：「这出戏也要让我们国王点了。」紫烟道：「不错，我们上了他的当了。」紫烟点了一出生旦戏，想罚爱珠一杯。谁知爱珠是个空手，倒将侍香罚了一杯。","en":"agreed, \\"You are right. We fell right into their trap.\\" Ziyan then quickly named a sheng-dan piece in order to fine Aizhu, but Aizhu's hand was perfectly empty, meaning Shixiang was forced to drink the penalty instead."},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":8,"tokens":["爱珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"喝酒。」红雪掣了一枝是：「玉搔头袅凤双飞。」注：「插金丝软凤钗者饮一杯。」红雪四下留心，戴此钗的却亦不少，只见爱珠与红雯在那里交线顽耍，爱珠交错了，被红雯打了一下，爱珠格格的笑，把个金丝双凤钗颤得乱飞。红雪斟了一杯酒，上前道：「在这里了。」爱珠道：「怎么你要消酒，消到外国来了？」红雪道：「你不见你头上么？方才这句诗是，戴双凤钗的酒。」爱珠摸一摸钗，又看看众人道：","en":"soft phoenix hairpins must drink.\\" Hongxue looked carefully around the room; many easily qualified. She spotted Aizhu and Hongwen playing cat's-cradle. Aizhu missed a tricky cross, and Hongwen slapped her hand. Aizhu giggled so hard that her golden twin-phoenix pins shook violently. Hongxue poured a cup, stepped right up to her, and said, \\"Here.\\" Aizhu complained, \\"Why"},{"paragraph":39,"mentions":1,"tokens":["爱珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"呸！这个令如何来得？我当狗盗是什么东西，原来要装狗的。我不来。」说着就跑，众佳人听了，都笑得了不得。只见花珠、爱珠、红香、红玉、红雪、红霙一齐赶上，围住了三姐，说道：「凭你怎样利害，今天在我们园里，你想走到那里去？好好的叫了饶你，不然我们就按倒了你，剥你的皮。」便七手八脚，你一捏，我一捏，三姐身上最怕捏的，被他们缠住了，便笑作一团，身似紫薇花的乱颤起来，连连求告","en":"not do it.\\" And she made to run for it, at which the beauties all laughed till they could not stand.\\n\\nHuazhu, Aizhu, Hongxiang, Hongyu, Hongxue and Hongying all came up together and hemmed Sanjie in. \\"Formidable as you are, this is our garden today — where do you think you are going? Bark nicely and we will let you off; otherwise we will pin you down and take the"},{"paragraph":41,"mentions":9,"tokens":["爱珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"又想：「顶坏是爱珠、红雪两个，待我顽他们一顽。」便装着笑盈盈的说道：「姐妹们不要这样，你们让开些，我就伏在地上就是了。」诸人还不信，红雪道：「我们就站开些，谅你也不能跑。」三姐故意慢慢的曲着腰，伏将下去，见红雪与爱珠都是三寸金莲，裙边下微露一线的镶边花裤，叫了一声，众","en":"She thought it out. \\"The worst of them are Aizhu and Hongxue. Let me pay those two back.\\" So she put on a smiling face and said, \\"Sisters, do not go on so. Stand off a little and I will get down on the floor for you.\\" They still did not trust her, and Hongxue said, \\"We will stand clear — but you are"},{"paragraph":49,"mentions":1,"tokens":["爱珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"不获命，也只可秣马厉兵，与姐姐周旋。」绮香笑道：「众志成城，坚不可破，我让了你罢。」看青琴这打擂，已赢得不少，爱珠、花珠、红香、红玉、红雪、红霙都喝了许多酒。","en":"surrender, \\"Many hearts make a city unbreakable. I yield.\\" Qingqin's ring match had already won plenty of victories; Aizhu, Huazhu, Hongxiang, Hongyu, Hongxue, and Hongying had all drunk deeply."}]}`),"char-168":{11:[{paragraph:4,mentions:1,tokens:["掌珠"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"玉瑟，鱼水和谐，说不尽咏月吟风，闺房潇洒。又有十个美婢，名字都有一个珠字，宝珠、明珠、爱珠、花珠、荷珠、蕊珠、掌珠、珍珠、画珠、赠珠。这十珠都有十分姿色，年皆十五六岁，真像十样鲜花，一群粉蝶，个个慧心香口，莲步柳腰，针黹巧夺天工，词令皆成妙品。比郑康成之诗婢，少道学之风规，较郭令公之家姬，得风流之香主。华公子夫妇二人这样的妙才浓福，也就人间少有的了；兼之高堂未老",en:"beautiful maids, each bearing the character 'Zhu' (Pearl) in her name: Baozhu, Mingzhu, Aizhu, Huazhu, Hezhu, Ruizhu, Zhangzhu, Zhenzhu, Yazhu, and Zengzhu. All fifteen or sixteen years of age, they bloomed like ten distinct varieties of fresh spring flowers, fluttering like a cluster of powdered butterflies. Each possessed a nimble mind and a fragrant tongue, walking with dainty"},{paragraph:42,mentions:3,tokens:["掌珠"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"掌珠掷了个踏梯望月，说了一个只是平平，不见出色。红雯道：「这个令题就好得很，你这么说来，就辜负了题目了。我代你说。」即说道：踏梯望月，宋玉在西邻，隔墙儿酬和到天明。花心动，有女怀春。掌珠笑骂红雯道：「好个女孩儿家，踏着梯子去望人，还说自己花心动呢。臊也臊",en:`Zhangzhu rolled the pattern 'Climbing the Ladder to Gaze at the Moon,' offering a verse that was merely passable, devoid of any true brilliance. Hongwen immediately criticized her: "The name of this pattern is exquisitely poetic, yet presenting it so poorly is`}],26:[{paragraph:1,mentions:1,tokens:["掌珠"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"们改了装，都跟出去的。」公子进来坐下，那十珠都是十五六岁，倒也生得大致相仿，都不差上下。明珠先送上一盏冰梅汤，掌珠拿了鹅毛扇，轻轻的打着。珍珠便上前与公子脱了靴，换上盘珠登云履。荷珠与公子换了件轻纱衫子，都在两旁站着。宝珠便道：「爷可曾用饭？可要吩咐内厨房预备什么？」华公子道：「今日酒多了，觉得口渴。到定更后，你照着我前日开那防风粥的单子，配着那几样花露果粉，用",en:"remarkably similar in beauty, each as lovely as the last. Mingzhu first offered him a bowl of iced plum broth, while Zhangzhu stood by, gently fanning him with a goose-feather fan. Zhenzhu came forward to draw off his boots and changed them for coiled-pearl cloud-climbing slippers, while Hezhu changed him into a light gauze robe; then they all stood to either side. Baozhu then"},{paragraph:6,mentions:2,tokens:["掌珠"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"掌珠一面打扇，一面看着公子与珊枝讲话，便心不在扇，一扇子扇脱了手，掉下地来，明珠嗤的一笑，掌珠红了脸，慌忙捡起。华公子倒笑了，道：「你们难道没有听过戏，听说到戏连心都没有了。歇天我就叫那一班人进来唱一天，请奶奶听，你们大家都托托福。」爱珠多嘴说道：「什么",en:"Zhangzhu, meanwhile, had been fanning the Master while listening to their conversation. Her mind wandered, and the fan slipped from her grasp, tumbling to the floor. Mingzhu let out a muffled giggle, and Zhangzhu, flushing deeply, hurriedly retrieved it. The"}],41:[{paragraph:13,mentions:1,tokens:["掌珠"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"公子笑道：「这叫做与人同乐。但是他们祭花是要拜的，不好同我们一样。」十珠都微微笑起来。掌珠对荷珠低低说道：「要拜我们十个一同拜，不要分先后，省得先拜的叫后拜的笑。」爱珠道：「我们一对一对的拜不好吗？」花珠凑着爱珠的耳说道：「又不是夫妻拜堂，怎么你要一对对的拜呢？」爱珠打他一下。已见老婆子颤巍巍的拎了一大瓶酒来，放在廊下。十珠等各拿了小酒杯",en:`when they make their offering—they cannot do it the same way as we did." All Ten Pearls broke into quiet smiles. Zhangzhu said in a low voice to Hezhu: "If we are to bow, let all ten of us bow at the same moment—no one first, no one last, so that those who bow first won't be laughed at by those who bow after." Aizhu said: "Would it not be better for us to bow in pairs?"`},{paragraph:19,mentions:1,tokens:["掌珠"],kind:"named-mention",zh:`、玉液浆。相当，竟飞来捧觞，密约在芙蓉锦帐。《朱奴剔银灯》
公子道：「该打。少唱了「拨琴阮，笙箫嘹亮」一句。」掌珠接唱道：`,en:`master cried: "A penalty! You left out the line: 'The ruan-lute is plucked; flutes and pipes ring out clear.'" Zhangzhu took up the next aria and sang:`},{paragraph:20,mentions:1,tokens:["掌珠"],kind:"named-mention",zh:`睡乡。鸾笙凤管云中响，弦悠扬，玉玎璫一声声乱我柔肠。翱翔双凤凰。海南异品风飘荡，要打着美人心上痒。《雁过声》
掌珠一面唱，一面将帕子打了一个结，望荷珠脸上打来。`,en:`the breeze,
Arching straight to the aching heart of a beauty. [Sound of Geese Passing]

All the while she sang, Zhangzhu tied a knot in her handkerchief and flung it at Hezhu's face.`},{paragraph:29,mentions:1,tokens:["掌珠"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"道：「据我评来，以宝珠为第一，唱得风神跌宕，文秀温存，十人中是他压卷了。次则爱珠，情韵皆到，为第二。次赠珠，次掌珠，次蕊珠，次珍珠，次花珠，次荷珠，次画珠，次明珠。不知定得不委屈么？」公子道：「定得极是。」夫人又问十珠婢道：「如有委屈，不妨自说。」花珠赔着笑道：「奴才唱的，似乎在蕊珠、珍珠之上。」华夫人道：「就是你不服，你那里知道自己唱的毛病。你想显己之长，压人",en:'the ten she was the peerless performer. Second is Aizhu, who conveyed both emotion and charm. Then Zengzhu, then Zhangzhu, then Ruizhu, then Zhenzhu, then Huazhu, then Hezhu, then Yazhu, and then Mingzhu last. I hope this is not unjust?" The young master said, "The ranking is entirely right." His lady also invited the Ten Pearls: "If anyone feels hard done by, please speak'}],52:[{paragraph:24,mentions:1,tokens:["掌珠"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"道：「我不与人瞧，我恐扇旧了，已收起了。」华夫人也不疑心他给了人。将要出门，带了宝珠、爱珠、蕊珠、珍珠、明珠、掌珠六婢，又带了小香儿与两个仆妇。此时新秋，天气尚热，也不须多带衣服，带了一个小锦箱、一个锦匣，装些花钿脂粉。外面叫一个老年的管家骑了顶马，金龄、玉龄、兰龄、桂龄骑了跟班马。华夫人出房到内花厅，就坐肩舆，出了垂花门，上了车，另有车道。绕过大堂，家人方上马",en:"suspected nothing. Preparing to depart, she brought along six maids—Baozhu, Aizhu, Ruizhu, Zhenzhu, Mingzhu, and Zhangzhu—along with little Xiang'er and two older servant women. Since it was early autumn and the weather remained warm, they did not pack many heavy clothes, only bringing a small brocade chest and a casket containing cosmetics and ornaments. Outside, an elderly"}],57:[{paragraph:14,mentions:1,tokens:["掌珠"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"小国埋没。」爱珠、花珠笑了，站了过来。绮香自己点了爱珠、花珠、红香、红玉、红雪、红霙，浣香自己留了宝珠、明珠、掌珠，浣兰留了许三姐、小翠，要了荷珠，紫烟留了侍香，要了红薇、赠珠，佩秋留了金凤，要了红莲、红娟，蓉华留了秋莲，要了红雯、画珠，琼华留了青琴，要了珍珠、蕊珠。",en:"Aizhu, Huazhu, Hongxiang, Hongyu, Hongxue, and Hongying for her own forces. Huanxiang kept Baozhu, Mingzhu, and Zhangzhu. Huanlan retained Sanjie and Xiaocui, and added Hezhu. Ziyan kept Shixiang, taking Hongwei and Zengzhu to fill her ranks. Peiqiu kept Jinfeng and added Honglian and Hongjuan. Ronghua retained Qiulian, bringing in Hongwen and Yazhu. Finally, Qionghua"},{paragraph:15,mentions:3,tokens:["掌珠"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"，红雯掣了平原君。蓉华道：「我这三根掣得好，大可折秦国的锐气。」再掣浣香的魏国，宝珠掣了信陵君，明珠掣了侯生，掌珠掣了醇酒妇人，大家又笑起来。绮香道：「这倒难，又算酒，又算妇人，横竖一出马，就叫人开心的。」掌珠道：「换一根罢。」红香道：「好便宜事。」忙将筹拿开了。掌珠无奈，也只得捏了那根筹，脸上甚是羞愧。再掣浣兰的齐国，浣兰道：「我这国就掣得平常，只怕没有什么好",en:`are excellent; we can easily blunt Qin's edge." For Wei, Baozhu drew Lord Xinling, Mingzhu drew Hou Sheng; and Zhangzhu drew the Drunken-Woman lot. This sparked even more laughter. Qixiang noted, "That is an awkward one; it counts as both wine and a woman. Whichever element rides out first will surely cheer everyone up." Zhangzhu pleaded, "Let me swap the lot." Hongxiang`},{paragraph:29,mentions:3,tokens:["掌珠"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"轮到掌珠，是醇酒妇人，令是掷色，若输了，跪请本国王与敌国王出令。掌珠掷了么二三，红雪掷了四五六。掌珠跪在浣香面前求救出令，把个华夫人笑得不止，便道：「出什么令呢？」便对绮香道：「我有一个集词牌成韵的，两句三字，一句七字，要凑拍。」便念道：「宴清都，清平乐，八",en:"Next was Zhangzhu, drawing the wine-woman lot. She had to cast dice; if she lost, she must kneel and ask both her own king and the enemy king to issue a command. Zhangzhu threw a one-two-three; Hongxue threw a four-five-six. Defeated, Zhangzhu knelt before Huanxiang,"}]},"char-169":{11:[{paragraph:4,mentions:1,tokens:["珍珠"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"鱼水和谐，说不尽咏月吟风，闺房潇洒。又有十个美婢，名字都有一个珠字，宝珠、明珠、爱珠、花珠、荷珠、蕊珠、掌珠、珍珠、画珠、赠珠。这十珠都有十分姿色，年皆十五六岁，真像十样鲜花，一群粉蝶，个个慧心香口，莲步柳腰，针黹巧夺天工，词令皆成妙品。比郑康成之诗婢，少道学之风规，较郭令公之家姬，得风流之香主。华公子夫妇二人这样的妙才浓福，也就人间少有的了；兼之高堂未老，雄镇",en:"each bearing the character 'Zhu' (Pearl) in her name: Baozhu, Mingzhu, Aizhu, Huazhu, Hezhu, Ruizhu, Zhangzhu, Zhenzhu, Yazhu, and Zengzhu. All fifteen or sixteen years of age, they bloomed like ten distinct varieties of fresh spring flowers, fluttering like a cluster of powdered butterflies. Each possessed a nimble mind and a fragrant tongue, walking with dainty lotus-steps"}],26:[{paragraph:1,mentions:1,tokens:["珍珠"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"进来坐下，那十珠都是十五六岁，倒也生得大致相仿，都不差上下。明珠先送上一盏冰梅汤，掌珠拿了鹅毛扇，轻轻的打着。珍珠便上前与公子脱了靴，换上盘珠登云履。荷珠与公子换了件轻纱衫子，都在两旁站着。宝珠便道：「爷可曾用饭？可要吩咐内厨房预备什么？」华公子道：「今日酒多了，觉得口渴。到定更后，你照着我前日开那防风粥的单子，配着那几样花露果粉，用文武火熬，一时二刻不可见着铜",en:'first offered him a bowl of iced plum broth, while Zhangzhu stood by, gently fanning him with a goose-feather fan. Zhenzhu came forward to draw off his boots and changed them for coiled-pearl cloud-climbing slippers, while Hezhu changed him into a light gauze robe; then they all stood to either side. Baozhu then asked, "Has the Master dined? Shall we order the inner kitchen'}],41:[{paragraph:26,mentions:1,tokens:["珍珠"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"明珠折了两枝红白桃花，拿个汝窑瓶插了，放在公子、夫人面前。又见珍珠唱道：",en:"red-and-white peach blossom, arranged them in a Ru-ware vase, and placed it before the young master and his lady. Zhenzhu then sang:"},{paragraph:29,mentions:2,tokens:["珍珠"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"以宝珠为第一，唱得风神跌宕，文秀温存，十人中是他压卷了。次则爱珠，情韵皆到，为第二。次赠珠，次掌珠，次蕊珠，次珍珠，次花珠，次荷珠，次画珠，次明珠。不知定得不委屈么？」公子道：「定得极是。」夫人又问十珠婢道：「如有委屈，不妨自说。」花珠赔着笑道：「奴才唱的，似乎在蕊珠、珍珠之上。」华夫人道：「就是你不服，你那里知道自己唱的毛病。你想显己之长，压人之短，添出些腔调",en:'performer. Second is Aizhu, who conveyed both emotion and charm. Then Zengzhu, then Zhangzhu, then Ruizhu, then Zhenzhu, then Huazhu, then Hezhu, then Yazhu, and then Mingzhu last. I hope this is not unjust?" The young master said, "The ranking is entirely right." His lady also invited the Ten Pearls: "If anyone feels hard done by, please speak freely." Huazhu said with'}],44:[{paragraph:15,mentions:2,tokens:["珍珠"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"揉，徜徜徉徉的走开道：「冤不冤，跪了这半天。」找个僻静地方小解去了。华公子起身回夫人房内，宝珠、爱珠随了进去，珍珠等蕊珠同行。珊枝慢慢的送公子出了园，正要走时，忽然一把花瓣撒了他一头，急回头看时，见蕊珠、珍珠骂道：「人家跪着，你倒在石洞里偷看人，瞎掉你的眼睛。」珊枝道：「明日还要挨打呢。」说着也就走开了。",en:`relieve herself. Young Master Hua rose and went to the mistress's quarters; Baozhu and Aizhu followed him in. Zhenzhu waited for Ruizhu, and the two walked together. Shanzhi slowly escorted the young master out of the garden, and was just turning to leave when a handful of petals was thrown over her head. She spun around to see Ruizhu and Zhenzhu scolding her: "Someone`}],52:[{paragraph:24,mentions:1,tokens:["珍珠"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"留心，只得说道：「我不与人瞧，我恐扇旧了，已收起了。」华夫人也不疑心他给了人。将要出门，带了宝珠、爱珠、蕊珠、珍珠、明珠、掌珠六婢，又带了小香儿与两个仆妇。此时新秋，天气尚热，也不须多带衣服，带了一个小锦箱、一个锦匣，装些花钿脂粉。外面叫一个老年的管家骑了顶马，金龄、玉龄、兰龄、桂龄骑了跟班马。华夫人出房到内花厅，就坐肩舆，出了垂花门，上了车，另有车道。绕过大堂",en:`it away." Lady Hua suspected nothing. Preparing to depart, she brought along six maids—Baozhu, Aizhu, Ruizhu, Zhenzhu, Mingzhu, and Zhangzhu—along with little Xiang'er and two older servant women. Since it was early autumn and the weather remained warm, they did not pack many heavy clothes, only bringing a small brocade chest and a casket containing cosmetics and ornaments.`}],57:[{paragraph:14,mentions:1,tokens:["珍珠"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"，紫烟留了侍香，要了红薇、赠珠，佩秋留了金凤，要了红莲、红娟，蓉华留了秋莲，要了红雯、画珠，琼华留了青琴，要了珍珠、蕊珠。",en:"retained Qiulian, bringing in Hongwen and Yazhu. Finally, Qionghua kept Qingqin and rounded out her forces with Zhenzhu and Ruizhu."},{paragraph:16,mentions:1,tokens:["珍珠"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"小翠一根是鸡鸣，三姐一根是狗盗，幸亏荷珠掣了孟尝君，稍可解嘲。再掣琼华的韩国，蕊珠掣了张子房，青琴掣了博浪椎，珍珠掣了圯上老人。琼华笑道：「我早说的，绮香姐姐你仔细博浪椎、荆轲匕首，好不利害。就是高唐神女、醇酒妇人教你受用罢。」红薇道：「奶奶且慢喜欢，只怕奶奶手下也有个笑话出来呢！」绮香道：「不用讲，拿出谱来。」大家看时，见写道：",en:`shame. They then drew for Qionghua's state of Han: Ruizhu drew Zhang Liang, Qingqin drew the Bolang hammer, and Zhenzhu drew the old man at the bridge. Qionghua laughed, "I warned you, Sister Qixiang! You had best mind the Bolang hammer and Jing Ke's dagger. Let the Gaotang Goddess and the wine-woman deal with you instead." Hongwei cautioned, "Madam, do not rejoice too`},{paragraph:44,mentions:1,tokens:["珍珠"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"「取笔研来涂脸。」红香道：「姐姐，饶了我罢，涂了脸又要擦脸，费事得很，我情愿跪了喝一杯罢。」蕊珠将要容情，倒是珍珠不肯，说道：「我还要与他来呢。一个容了情，个个要容情了。」便把笔在红香脸上画了一个眼镜，惹得满堂又笑起来。红香好不有气，喝了一杯，忙忙的要水洗了脸。",en:`me. Painting means washing, which is a bother. I will kneel and drink instead." Ruizhu was about to relent, but Zhenzhu refused, "I fight her next. Show one mercy, and everyone will want mercy." She took the brush and drew spectacles on Hongxiang's face, causing the hall to roar with laughter again. Hongxiang fumed, drank her penalty, and hurried off to wash.`},{paragraph:45,mentions:2,tokens:["珍珠"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"幸他倒是不擦粉的，不然便将脂粉洗去了。气忿忿的抬着手，向珍珠道：「你先来，你先来！你若输了，求人讨饶便不算人，只算是狗。」珍珠笑道：「我怕你？讨饶也算好汉么？」看谱上，圯上老人的令是盘象棋谱，名为八阵图。圯上老人下红子。",en:`Luckily, she wore no powder, or her makeup would have been ruined. Fuming, she pointed directly at Zhenzhu, "You're next! You're first! If you lose and beg, you are not human—you are a dog!" Zhenzhu laughed confidently, "Afraid of you? Does begging still make one a hero?" The old man at the bridge used a chess-manual game called "Eight Formations"; the old`},{paragraph:46,mentions:1,tokens:["珍珠"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"珍珠象棋下得虽好，谱却不熟，偏偏遇着红香是爱打棋谱的。",en:"Zhenzhu played chess quite well but knew the manual poorly; she unfortunately met Hongxiang, who absolutely loved memorizing traps."},{paragraph:47,mentions:7,tokens:["珍珠"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"珍珠十分用心，无奈未得其妙，几着变化就迷住了，看看要输，宝珠要指点他，红香道：「谁教了，就算谁输，要照样罚酒。」琼华心甚着急，又不好教，看红香把他一个挂角将，就将死了。红香笑道：「今番得了。」查圯上老人的谱，是脱鞋置酒，遍敬席上。珍珠见了，说道：「这个断",en:'Zhenzhu tried hard but missed the subtleties. After only a few moves, she was completely lost. Baozhu wanted to offer a hint, but Hongxiang warned, "Whoever teaches, loses. Same penalty." Qionghua burned with worry but dared not speak. Hongxiang hung a corner'}]},"char-170":{11:[{paragraph:4,mentions:1,tokens:["赠珠"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"不尽咏月吟风，闺房潇洒。又有十个美婢，名字都有一个珠字，宝珠、明珠、爱珠、花珠、荷珠、蕊珠、掌珠、珍珠、画珠、赠珠。这十珠都有十分姿色，年皆十五六岁，真像十样鲜花，一群粉蝶，个个慧心香口，莲步柳腰，针黹巧夺天工，词令皆成妙品。比郑康成之诗婢，少道学之风规，较郭令公之家姬，得风流之香主。华公子夫妇二人这样的妙才浓福，也就人间少有的了；兼之高堂未老，雄镇四夷，思承七",en:"character 'Zhu' (Pearl) in her name: Baozhu, Mingzhu, Aizhu, Huazhu, Hezhu, Ruizhu, Zhangzhu, Zhenzhu, Yazhu, and Zengzhu. All fifteen or sixteen years of age, they bloomed like ten distinct varieties of fresh spring flowers, fluttering like a cluster of powdered butterflies. Each possessed a nimble mind and a fragrant tongue, walking with dainty lotus-steps upon willow"}],26:[{paragraph:10,mentions:1,tokens:["赠珠"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"这边林珊枝在洗红轩外边等候，与那些十珠婢闲谈，又不能上去请他。赠珠道：「我先到上房听得说，爷与奶奶吃饭，两人讲得热闹，只怕不出来了。」珊枝道：「这怎么好呢？一早把个魏师爷请在留青精舍里，等到此刻，一个多时辰，我也觉得饿了。你们吃过早饭么？」明珠道：「我们是早吃过了，吃剩的东西倒有，你不嫌脏，就吃了饭去，要等他出来不",en:'waited outside the Crimson Wash Pavilion, chatting with the Ten Pearls, unable to ascend and disturb the Master. Zengzhu said, "Earlier, I heard the Master dining with Madame upstairs. Their conversation was quite lively, so he is unlikely to emerge anytime soon." Shanzhi sighed, "What is to be done? Secretary Wei has been summoned since dawn and has waited over two hours.'}],41:[{paragraph:5,mentions:3,tokens:["赠珠"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"约有两刻工夫，听得环佩琤琤，华夫人带了明珠、花珠、荷珠、赠珠四个女婢过来，华公子笑面相迎。华夫人道：「这两日天气甚好，我本来也想逛逛。方才香儿说你在这里钓鱼，我从西书房夹道中走来，倒也不远。我又叫老婆子收拾些食品过来。」华公子道：「我本有此意，你倒预先办妥了。」二人凭阑观玩了一会，华公子道：「我们何不下船逛逛",en:`tinkling ornaments announced the arrival of Madam Hua, attended by four maidservants—Mingzhu, Huazhu, Hezhu, and Zengzhu. The young master stepped forward with a smile to welcome her. Madam Hua said: "The weather has been so fine these past two days—I had been meaning to take a stroll. A moment ago Xiang'er told me you were here fishing, and I came by way of the passage`},{paragraph:23,mentions:1,tokens:["赠珠"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"称得这妙句。」夫人笑道：「樊素如何能得？就是他们也还将就，比外头那些班中生旦就强多了。」公子点头道：「是」。见赠珠唱道：",en:'with the sheng and dan of the outside troupes, they are far superior." The young master nodded in agreement. Then Zengzhu sang:'},{paragraph:29,mentions:1,tokens:["赠珠"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"，对公子道：「据我评来，以宝珠为第一，唱得风神跌宕，文秀温存，十人中是他压卷了。次则爱珠，情韵皆到，为第二。次赠珠，次掌珠，次蕊珠，次珍珠，次花珠，次荷珠，次画珠，次明珠。不知定得不委屈么？」公子道：「定得极是。」夫人又问十珠婢道：「如有委屈，不妨自说。」花珠赔着笑道：「奴才唱的，似乎在蕊珠、珍珠之上。」华夫人道：「就是你不服，你那里知道自己唱的毛病。你想显己之",en:'warm; among the ten she was the peerless performer. Second is Aizhu, who conveyed both emotion and charm. Then Zengzhu, then Zhangzhu, then Ruizhu, then Zhenzhu, then Huazhu, then Hezhu, then Yazhu, and then Mingzhu last. I hope this is not unjust?" The young master said, "The ranking is entirely right." His lady also invited the Ten Pearls: "If anyone feels hard done'}],57:[{paragraph:14,mentions:1,tokens:["赠珠"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"红香、红玉、红雪、红霙，浣香自己留了宝珠、明珠、掌珠，浣兰留了许三姐、小翠，要了荷珠，紫烟留了侍香，要了红薇、赠珠，佩秋留了金凤，要了红莲、红娟，蓉华留了秋莲，要了红雯、画珠，琼华留了青琴，要了珍珠、蕊珠。",en:"Mingzhu, and Zhangzhu. Huanlan retained Sanjie and Xiaocui, and added Hezhu. Ziyan kept Shixiang, taking Hongwei and Zengzhu to fill her ranks. Peiqiu kept Jinfeng and added Honglian and Hongjuan. Ronghua retained Qiulian, bringing in Hongwen and Yazhu. Finally, Qionghua kept Qingqin and rounded out her forces with Zhenzhu and Ruizhu."},{paragraph:15,mentions:1,tokens:["赠珠"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"高。绮香笑道：「如何，你看我们文武皆全。」收过了筒，取紫烟楚国的筹来，侍香掣的是令尹子兰，红薇掣的是高唐神女，赠珠掣的是宋玉。紫烟笑道：「完了，一个佞人，一个梦神，一个风流鬼，这如何打得仗来？」众佳人皆笑，也收过了。再掣佩秋的燕国小筹，金凤掣了荆轲，红莲掣了田光，红娟掣了骏马。佩秋道：「也不好，究竟是个不祥之兆。」蓉花笑道：「尚未出兵，倒已先砍了两个脑袋。」众人",en:`away Qin's tube and drew for Chu. Shixiang drew Minister Ling Yin Zilan; Hongwei drew the Gaotang Goddess; and Zengzhu drew Song Yu. Ziyan groaned with a laugh, "We are done for! A flatterer, a dream goddess, and a romantic ghost. How can we possibly fight with them?" The others laughed and set Chu's tube aside. Next came Peiqiu's Yan lots: Jinfeng drew Jing Ke, Honglian`},{paragraph:22,mentions:2,tokens:["赠珠"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"能还礼。」画珠骂道：「你威风不要使尽了，只怕这回就要对人磕头呢。」于是又击起鼓来，花到了紫烟住了，侍香、红薇、赠珠上来。赠珠把骰子一掷，数到红薇，是高唐神女，众人皆笑。紫烟笑道：「好个红姑娘，高鬟大袖的，真像个神女。」红薇脸已红了。那边爱珠、红玉、红香、红霙、红雪也过来，掷到爱珠，是白起。绮香道：「这叫做无情遇。」看谱：「如神女遇见白起，神女如何能敌？须起倾国之",en:'next round." They beat the drum once more, and this time the flower stopped with Ziyan. Shixiang, Hongwei, and Zengzhu stepped forward. Zengzhu cast the dice, and it pointed to Hongwei, who was playing the Gaotang Goddess. Everyone laughed. Ziyan smiled, "Look at our Miss Hong. With her high chignon and wide, flowing sleeves, she truly resembles a goddess." Hongwei blushed'}]},"char-171":{11:[{paragraph:3,mentions:1,tokens:["红薇"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"瑚搔头镂金博山炉青瑶玉琴珍沉水香瑟柱奇楠香串玛瑙印章」先着人送去。遂于十二红丫鬟中带了红雪，红霙、红香、红玉、红薇、红雯六个，都是盈盈十五，窈窕多姿，识字能书，工诗善绣。伺候夫人晓妆已毕，红雪道：「今日天气寒冷，似有雪意，须多带几件衣服。」便向大毛衣服内，检出一件天蓝缎绣金紫貂鼠披风，红缎绣金天马皮蟒裙，玉佩玎璫，珠璎珞索。格外又带了一个大红绵包袱，包了两三件衣",en:"twelve maidservants, each named with the character 'Hong' (Red), she chose Hongxue, Hongying, Hongxiang, Hongyu, Hongwei, and Hongwen. These six, all fifteen years of age and in the very springtime of their youth, were slender and graceful. They were literate, skilled in calligraphy, and deeply accomplished in both poetry and embroidery. After assisting her mistress with"},{paragraph:37,mentions:2,tokens:["红薇"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"，我薄你，彼此都想占点便宜。闹到后来，必至斗嘴斗舌的面红起来。这一回行令，内中有几个说得不好，已受了多少刻薄。红薇这一掷，掷了个醉西施。半天说不出来，急得两颊通红。爱珠想了一个，笑道：「我代你说，你要谢谢媒人才好。」即笑吟吟地对着红薇，还把一个指头指着他，念道：醉西施，酒色上来迟，他昨日风清月朗夜深时。好姐姐，吉士诱之。",en:'round of the wine game, several had already faltered, suffering a relentless barrage of cutting remarks. When Hongwei threw her pattern, her mind went entirely blank. For a long, agonizing moment, her cheeks burned a furious crimson with frustration. Suddenly inspired, Aizhu laughed and said, "I shall compose a verse for you, but you must thank me properly as your matchmaker!"'},{paragraph:38,mentions:1,tokens:["红薇"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"众人赞好。红薇道：「你真是个好姐姐，怪不得有人要诱你。」爱珠道：「我是说你的，你这好模样。还不像个醉西施吗？」众人又笑。",en:`The room erupted in praise for the clever verse. Hongwei retorted, "You are indeed a 'good elder sister', small wonder there are those longing to tempt you!" Aizhu replied, "I was merely describing you and your striking looks. Do you not agree you perfectly resemble an intoxicated Xi Shi?" The maids dissolved`},{paragraph:46,mentions:2,tokens:["红薇"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"人，心上也要显显他的丫鬟的才学，便说道：「你们说的只要通，就说说也不妨。若说出来不通，便各人跪着罚一大杯酒。」红薇与明珠的记性最好，况且没有他们说的在里面，便说道：「通倒也算通，恐怕说了出来，非但不能受赏，更要受罚。」华夫人笑道：「你们且一一的说来。」于是明珠把爱珠、宝珠、荷珠骂人的三个令全说了、红薇也将红雪、红雯、红霙骂人的三个令也说了，笑得两位夫人头上的珠钿",en:'massive penalty cup." Knowing their own memories were flawless and that their personal verses were free of offense, Hongwei and Mingzhu stepped forward. "They are coherent enough," they admitted cautiously, "but we fear that by speaking them, instead of earning a reward, we shall only invite punishment." Lady Hua laughed, "Go on, recite them one by one." Thus, Mingzhu recounted'}],57:[{paragraph:13,mentions:1,tokens:["红薇"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"点起将来，设有不合使唤的，便不中用。出去战败了，倒累主人罚酒。」就先点自己的丫鬟，点了红香、红玉、红雪、红雯、红薇、红莲、红霙、红娟，其余那四个不能饮酒。浣香的十珠都可使唤，全点了。浣兰的四个丫鬟，只点了一个小翠，才十三岁，生得很好，且又灵变。又点了许三姐。琼华的四个丫头，点了一个青琴。蓉华两个丫头，点了一个秋莲。紫烟两个丫头，点了一个侍香。佩秋两个丫头，点了一",en:`mistress with penalty wine." She began by choosing from her own maids, picking Hongxiang, Hongyu, Hongxue, Hongwen, Hongwei, Honglian, Hongying, and Hongjuan. Her other four maids could not drink. Huanxiang's Ten Pearls were all capable and were chosen in their entirety. Out of Huanlan's four maids, she selected only Xiaocui, a pretty and quick-witted thirteen-year-old, along`},{paragraph:14,mentions:1,tokens:["红薇"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"花珠、红香、红玉、红雪、红霙，浣香自己留了宝珠、明珠、掌珠，浣兰留了许三姐、小翠，要了荷珠，紫烟留了侍香，要了红薇、赠珠，佩秋留了金凤，要了红莲、红娟，蓉华留了秋莲，要了红雯、画珠，琼华留了青琴，要了珍珠、蕊珠。",en:"Baozhu, Mingzhu, and Zhangzhu. Huanlan retained Sanjie and Xiaocui, and added Hezhu. Ziyan kept Shixiang, taking Hongwei and Zengzhu to fill her ranks. Peiqiu kept Jinfeng and added Honglian and Hongjuan. Ronghua retained Qiulian, bringing in Hongwen and Yazhu. Finally, Qionghua kept Qingqin and rounded out her forces with Zhenzhu and Ruizhu."},{paragraph:15,mentions:1,tokens:["红薇"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"是李斯，红霙掣的是赵高。绮香笑道：「如何，你看我们文武皆全。」收过了筒，取紫烟楚国的筹来，侍香掣的是令尹子兰，红薇掣的是高唐神女，赠珠掣的是宋玉。紫烟笑道：「完了，一个佞人，一个梦神，一个风流鬼，这如何打得仗来？」众佳人皆笑，也收过了。再掣佩秋的燕国小筹，金凤掣了荆轲，红莲掣了田光，红娟掣了骏马。佩秋道：「也不好，究竟是个不祥之兆。」蓉花笑道：「尚未出兵，倒已先",en:`talents are perfectly complete." They put away Qin's tube and drew for Chu. Shixiang drew Minister Ling Yin Zilan; Hongwei drew the Gaotang Goddess; and Zengzhu drew Song Yu. Ziyan groaned with a laugh, "We are done for! A flatterer, a dream goddess, and a romantic ghost. How can we possibly fight with them?" The others laughed and set Chu's tube aside. Next came Peiqiu's`},{paragraph:16,mentions:1,tokens:["红薇"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"圯上老人。琼华笑道：「我早说的，绮香姐姐你仔细博浪椎、荆轲匕首，好不利害。就是高唐神女、醇酒妇人教你受用罢。」红薇道：「奶奶且慢喜欢，只怕奶奶手下也有个笑话出来呢！」绮香道：「不用讲，拿出谱来。」大家看时，见写道：",en:`mind the Bolang hammer and Jing Ke's dagger. Let the Gaotang Goddess and the wine-woman deal with you instead." Hongwei cautioned, "Madam, do not rejoice too soon. Your own side might have a joke coming as well!" Qixiang said, "There is no need for idle talk. Bring out the rule book." They began to read:`},{paragraph:22,mentions:3,tokens:["红薇"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"身，不能还礼。」画珠骂道：「你威风不要使尽了，只怕这回就要对人磕头呢。」于是又击起鼓来，花到了紫烟住了，侍香、红薇、赠珠上来。赠珠把骰子一掷，数到红薇，是高唐神女，众人皆笑。紫烟笑道：「好个红姑娘，高鬟大袖的，真像个神女。」红薇脸已红了。那边爱珠、红玉、红香、红霙、红雪也过来，掷到爱珠，是白起。绮香道：「这叫做无情遇。」看谱：「如神女遇见白起，神女如何能敌？须起",en:'kowtowing in the next round." They beat the drum once more, and this time the flower stopped with Ziyan. Shixiang, Hongwei, and Zengzhu stepped forward. Zengzhu cast the dice, and it pointed to Hongwei, who was playing the Gaotang Goddess. Everyone laughed. Ziyan smiled, "Look at our Miss Hong. With her high chignon and wide, flowing sleeves, she truly resembles a goddess."'},{paragraph:23,mentions:2,tokens:["红薇"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"看各人手中个个皆有。绮香笑道：「生、旦不应到，各罚一杯。」绮香又点了一出《闹庄》，也是净脚戏，生、旦俱不应到，红薇又到了，又罚一杯。红薇不服，说道：「这出戏也要让我们国王点了。」紫烟道：「不错，我们上了他的当了。」紫烟点了一出生旦戏，想罚爱珠一杯。谁知爱珠是个空手，倒将侍香罚了一杯。",en:`one cup." She then named *Naozhuang*, another painted-face piece where the sheng and dan were not required. Yet Hongwei's hand held a nut again, earning her another penalty cup. Hongwei protested, "Our king should be the one to pick the play!" Ziyan agreed, "You are right. We fell right into their trap." Ziyan then quickly named a sheng-dan piece in order to fine Aizhu,`},{paragraph:26,mentions:3,tokens:["红薇"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"便斟了一杯来敬红薇。红薇道：「难道你真闻过我的脚么？这奇不奇，无缘无故的来缠人。」红雪道：「我虽没有闻过你的脚，但常见你用松子粉浆缠足带，不是香的？」红薇被他说着了，两颊通红，只得喝了一杯。宝珠又掣了一枝是：「十指纤纤玉笋红。」看来看去，就是个小翠指甲尚是红的，要他喝",en:'She poured a cup and purposefully approached Hongwei. Hongwei recoiled and said, "Have you truly sniffed my feet? How absolutely absurd, to pester me for nothing!" Hongxue replied, "I have never sniffed your feet, but I often see you powdering your foot-binding bands with pine powder. Are they not fragrant?"'}]},"char-172":{11:[{paragraph:3,mentions:1,tokens:["红玉"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"羽扇珊瑚搔头镂金博山炉青瑶玉琴珍沉水香瑟柱奇楠香串玛瑙印章」先着人送去。遂于十二红丫鬟中带了红雪，红霙、红香、红玉、红薇、红雯六个，都是盈盈十五，窈窕多姿，识字能书，工诗善绣。伺候夫人晓妆已毕，红雪道：「今日天气寒冷，似有雪意，须多带几件衣服。」便向大毛衣服内，检出一件天蓝缎绣金紫貂鼠披风，红缎绣金天马皮蟒裙，玉佩玎璫，珠璎珞索。格外又带了一个大红绵包袱，包了两",en:"retinue of twelve maidservants, each named with the character 'Hong' (Red), she chose Hongxue, Hongying, Hongxiang, Hongyu, Hongwei, and Hongwen. These six, all fifteen years of age and in the very springtime of their youth, were slender and graceful. They were literate, skilled in calligraphy, and deeply accomplished in both poetry and embroidery. After assisting her mistress"},{paragraph:41,mentions:4,tokens:["红玉"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"得弯了腰。 　　明珠一笑，袖子带着酒杯，砸了一个。外面夫人们也听得明白，袁夫人笑道：「他们还比我们会乐。」这边红玉掷了一个八不就，便道：「这个名色也难，凑不成的换了罢。」宝珠道：「怎么凑不成，我替你凑，包你一凑就凑上，总不教你八不就。」红玉道：「你说顽话呢，还是正经话？你若刻薄我，我就撕你的嘴。」宝珠道：「我是不喜欢刻薄人的。」便指着红玉说道：八不就，惊梦起鸳鸯",en:`outer room, prompting Mrs. Yuan to laugh, "They are proving vastly more entertaining than we are." Meanwhile, Hongyu threw the pattern 'Eight Refusals' and immediately groaned, "This pattern is far too difficult. It cannot be assembled; allow me to throw again." Baozhu interjected, "Of course it can be assembled. I shall weave it for you, and I guarantee it will not`}],52:[{paragraph:27,mentions:1,tokens:["红玉"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"岳夫人，正是敌体。」新人坐了一坐，早已告退。这边太太们讲得好不投机，底下是许三姐张罗。徐家的红雪、红莲、红香、红玉、红梅、红月、红露、红霙八个，并华家六珠，与那些家人媳妇丫鬟们，整整坐了八桌。这八桌里头，有会说会笑的，有会喝会吃的，有抿着嘴不开口的，有缩着手不动箸的，各人有各人的模样。三姐八面张罗，满场飞舞。",en:"Sister managed everything flawlessly. The eight 'Hong' maids of the Xu household—Hongxue, Honglian, Hongxiang, Hongyu, Hongmei, Hongyue, Honglu, and Hongying—along with the six Pearl Maids of the Hua household, plus all the servants and maids, filled exactly eight tables. At these tables, some laughed and joked, some ate and drank boldly, some sat with pursed lips in"}],57:[{paragraph:10,mentions:1,tokens:["红玉"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"绮香命红雪、红云、红玉调丝品竹，小拍清歌。绮香道：「可惜我们酒量都是有限。我新年无事，与我们老爷编了一个酒令，行起来颇为热闹，不论多少人，都放得进去。」浣香笑道：「这么说来，竟不是个酒令，是个阵图了。」绮香道：「却也有阵图在内。」蓉华道：「你且说这个令是怎样的？若要人多也",en:'Qixiang ordered Hongxue, Hongyun, and Hongyu to tune the strings and pipes, accompanying light, clear songs with small clappers. Qixiang said, "It is a pity our limits with wine are so constrained. During the New Year, having some idle hours, I compiled a drinking game with my husband. It is quite'},{paragraph:13,mentions:1,tokens:["红玉"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"绮香道：「我们且先点起将来，设有不合使唤的，便不中用。出去战败了，倒累主人罚酒。」就先点自己的丫鬟，点了红香、红玉、红雪、红雯、红薇、红莲、红霙、红娟，其余那四个不能饮酒。浣香的十珠都可使唤，全点了。浣兰的四个丫鬟，只点了一个小翠，才十三岁，生得很好，且又灵变。又点了许三姐。琼华的四个丫头，点了一个青琴。蓉华两个丫头，点了一个秋莲。紫烟两个丫头，点了一个侍香。佩",en:`will only burden your mistress with penalty wine." She began by choosing from her own maids, picking Hongxiang, Hongyu, Hongxue, Hongwen, Hongwei, Honglian, Hongying, and Hongjuan. Her other four maids could not drink. Huanxiang's Ten Pearls were all capable and were chosen in their entirety. Out of Huanlan's four maids, she selected only Xiaocui, a pretty and quick-witted`},{paragraph:14,mentions:1,tokens:["红玉"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"：「你两人到我大国来立些功业，不要在你那个小国埋没。」爱珠、花珠笑了，站了过来。绮香自己点了爱珠、花珠、红香、红玉、红雪、红霙，浣香自己留了宝珠、明珠、掌珠，浣兰留了许三姐、小翠，要了荷珠，紫烟留了侍香，要了红薇、赠珠，佩秋留了金凤，要了红莲、红娟，蓉华留了秋莲，要了红雯、画珠，琼华留了青琴，要了珍珠、蕊珠。",en:'your petty state." Aizhu and Huazhu laughed and stepped over to her side. Qixiang chose Aizhu, Huazhu, Hongxiang, Hongyu, Hongxue, and Hongying for her own forces. Huanxiang kept Baozhu, Mingzhu, and Zhangzhu. Huanlan retained Sanjie and Xiaocui, and added Hezhu. Ziyan kept Shixiang, taking Hongwei and Zengzhu to fill her ranks. Peiqiu kept Jinfeng and added Honglian and'},{paragraph:15,mentions:1,tokens:["红玉"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"分派定了，绮香叫拿七个小筹来，先掣秦国的。爱珠掣了是白起，花珠掣的是商君，红香掣的是韩非子，红玉掣的是吕不韦，红雪掣的是李斯，红霙掣的是赵高。绮香笑道：「如何，你看我们文武皆全。」收过了筒，取紫烟楚国的筹来，侍香掣的是令尹子兰，红薇掣的是高唐神女，赠珠掣的是宋玉。紫烟笑道：「完了，一个佞人，一个梦神，一个风流鬼，这如何打得仗来？」众佳人皆笑，也",en:`seven small lot-tubes and drew for Qin first. Aizhu drew Bai Qi; Huazhu drew Lord Shang; Hongxiang drew Han Feizi; Hongyu drew Lü Buwei; Hongxue drew Li Si; and Hongying drew Zhao Gao. Qixiang laughed triumphantly, "You see? Both civil and military talents are perfectly complete." They put away Qin's tube and drew for Chu. Shixiang drew Minister Ling Yin Zilan; Hongwei`},{paragraph:17,mentions:1,tokens:["红玉"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"、画珠，红雯三个就上来，旁边又摆了一桌酒肴。秋莲把两个骰子一掷，掷了四点，是自己出马。秦国的爱珠、花珠、红香、红玉、红雪、红霙也过来。爱珠把骰子一掷，掷了二点，是花珠出马。花珠是商君，秋莲是廉颇。绮香翻出谱来，查到廉颇名下，内有一条：「廉颇如遇商君，俱系勇将，皆以豁拳为令。如廉颇败了，必系老年无用，一败带上假白须，再败罚酒一大觞，三败罚饭一碗。」众佳人看了，不禁",en:"Qiulian cast the two dice, rolling a four, meaning she would fight first. Qin's forces—Aizhu, Huazhu, Hongxiang, Hongyu, Hongxue, and Hongying—stepped up to meet her. Aizhu cast the dice and rolled a two, signaling that Huazhu would take the field. Huazhu was playing Lord Shang, while Qiulian represented Lian Po. Qixiang opened the rule book to Lian Po's entry and read:"},{paragraph:22,mentions:1,tokens:["红玉"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"掷，数到红薇，是高唐神女，众人皆笑。紫烟笑道：「好个红姑娘，高鬟大袖的，真像个神女。」红薇脸已红了。那边爱珠、红玉、红香、红霙、红雪也过来，掷到爱珠，是白起。绮香道：「这叫做无情遇。」看谱：「如神女遇见白起，神女如何能敌？须起倾国之兵尽出助战。如系文臣者，行藏阄令，手中各藏一物。国君点戏一出，如白起为净，神女为旦，其余助战者各肖其人定色。」再查：「令尹子兰为丑，",en:`chignon and wide, flowing sleeves, she truly resembles a goddess." Hongwei blushed deeply. On Qin's side, Aizhu, Hongyu, Hongxiang, Hongying, and Hongxue stepped forward. The dice landed on Aizhu, representing the fearsome general Bai Qi. Qixiang noted, "This match is 'the heartless meets the divine.'" The rule book read: "If the delicate goddess meets the brutal Bai`},{paragraph:31,mentions:2,tokens:["红玉"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"于是又击鼓传花，传到佩秋的燕国，数骰子是金凤出马，为荆轲。那边数到了红玉，是吕不韦。荆轲行的是投壶令。浣兰道：「这令大约没有笑话了。」金凤投了一枝苏秦背剑，红玉投了一枝姜公钓鱼，那两枝都没有中，各人饮了两杯。转到红莲的田光出来，是个哑口令。各出一指，如大指为金，食指为木，中指为土，无名指为水，小指为火。譬如一个出大指，一",en:`Peiqiu's kingdom of Yan. The dice count sent Jinfeng forth as Jing Ke, while on the other side the count fell to Hongyu, as Lü Buwei. Jing Ke's appointed game was pitch-pot. Huanlan said, "This game, at least, should yield no jokes." Jinfeng threw a shaft in the 'Su Qin Shoulders His Sword' style, and Hongyu one in the 'Lord Jiang Angles for Fish' style; neither shaft`},{paragraph:33,mentions:4,tokens:["红玉"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"红娟道：「这个马吊色样我记不清楚，奶奶须与我记着。」浣香应了。红娟出了一个食指，一个小指，红玉偏偏出了一个小指，刚刚凑成一百两极，是个双尾蝎。浣香道：「这个就六十贺。」绮香道：「这倒好，叫通场伺候的都喝一杯。」红玉两手齐出，是一个食指，两个小指，红娟出了一个小指，是一百三极，凑成了玉鲫鱼背，又是一百贺。佩秋道：「这酒实在消得多，不论多少总通场",en:`straight—my lady must remember them for me." Huanxiang agreed. Hongjuan put out a forefinger and a little finger, and Hongyu, as it happened, put out a little finger: together they made exactly 'a hundred with two extremes'—the Double-Tailed Scorpion. Huanxiang said, "That is sixty toasts." Qixiang said, "Excellent—let every attendant in the hall drink a cup as well." Hongyu`},{paragraph:39,mentions:1,tokens:["红玉"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"何来得？我当狗盗是什么东西，原来要装狗的。我不来。」说着就跑，众佳人听了，都笑得了不得。只见花珠、爱珠、红香、红玉、红雪、红霙一齐赶上，围住了三姐，说道：「凭你怎样利害，今天在我们园里，你想走到那里去？好好的叫了饶你，不然我们就按倒了你，剥你的皮。」便七手八脚，你一捏，我一捏，三姐身上最怕捏的，被他们缠住了，便笑作一团，身似紫薇花的乱颤起来，连连求告道：「不要闹",en:`she made to run for it, at which the beauties all laughed till they could not stand.

Huazhu, Aizhu, Hongxiang, Hongyu, Hongxue and Hongying all came up together and hemmed Sanjie in. "Formidable as you are, this is our garden today — where do you think you are going? Bark nicely and we will let you off; otherwise we will pin you down and take the skin off you." And`},{paragraph:49,mentions:1,tokens:["红玉"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"厉兵，与姐姐周旋。」绮香笑道：「众志成城，坚不可破，我让了你罢。」看青琴这打擂，已赢得不少，爱珠、花珠、红香、红玉、红雪、红霙都喝了许多酒。",en:`city unbreakable. I yield." Qingqin's ring match had already won plenty of victories; Aizhu, Huazhu, Hongxiang, Hongyu, Hongxue, and Hongying had all drunk deeply.`}]},"char-173":{11:[{paragraph:3,mentions:1,tokens:["红雯"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"镂金博山炉青瑶玉琴珍沉水香瑟柱奇楠香串玛瑙印章」先着人送去。遂于十二红丫鬟中带了红雪，红霙、红香、红玉、红薇、红雯六个，都是盈盈十五，窈窕多姿，识字能书，工诗善绣。伺候夫人晓妆已毕，红雪道：「今日天气寒冷，似有雪意，须多带几件衣服。」便向大毛衣服内，检出一件天蓝缎绣金紫貂鼠披风，红缎绣金天马皮蟒裙，玉佩玎璫，珠璎珞索。格外又带了一个大红绵包袱，包了两三件衣裳。一",en:"maidservants, each named with the character 'Hong' (Red), she chose Hongxue, Hongying, Hongxiang, Hongyu, Hongwei, and Hongwen. These six, all fifteen years of age and in the very springtime of their youth, were slender and graceful. They were literate, skilled in calligraphy, and deeply accomplished in both poetry and embroidery. After assisting her mistress with her morning"},{paragraph:42,mentions:7,tokens:["红雯"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"掌珠掷了个踏梯望月，说了一个只是平平，不见出色。红雯道：「这个令题就好得很，你这么说来，就辜负了题目了。我代你说。」即说道：踏梯望月，宋玉在西邻，隔墙儿酬和到天明。花心动，有女怀春。掌珠笑骂红雯道：「好个女孩儿家，踏着梯子去望人，还说自己花心动呢。臊也臊死了。」红雯笑道：「我是说你的，你闷在心里，不要",en:`'Climbing the Ladder to Gaze at the Moon,' offering a verse that was merely passable, devoid of any true brilliance. Hongwen immediately criticized her: "The name of this pattern is exquisitely poetic, yet presenting it so poorly is a grave injustice to the subject. Let me speak it properly for you." She then recited:

"Climbing the ladder to gaze at the moon,
Song Yu is in`},{paragraph:46,mentions:1,tokens:["红雯"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"赏，更要受罚。」华夫人笑道：「你们且一一的说来。」于是明珠把爱珠、宝珠、荷珠骂人的三个令全说了、红薇也将红雪、红雯、红霙骂人的三个令也说了，笑得两位夫人头上的珠钿斜颤，欲要装做正色责备他们，也装不过来。苏小姐虽嫌他们过于亵狎，然心里也赞他们敏慧，不便大笑，只好微颔而已。",en:"entries composed by Aizhu, Baozhu, and Hezhu, while Hongwei recited the three scandalous verses authored by Hongxue, Hongwen, and Hongying. The effect was absolute: both ladies laughed so helplessly that the heavy pearl ornaments in their hair quivered and swayed wildly. Though they desperately attempted to compose their features into masks of stern reprimand, they completely"},{paragraph:47,mentions:1,tokens:["红雯"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"定这六个令，太恶者罚一大觞酒，打手掌三板，以示薄责；其次者罚酒免责。于是红雪、红霙、荷珠、宝珠受了责罚；爱珠、红雯单罚了酒。群婢受罚起来好不羞愧，又喝了这些急酒，觉得有些晃宕起来，勉强扎挣住了，深悔一时高兴。",en:"sufficient. Thus, Hongxue, Hongying, Hezhu, and Baozhu suffered both the wine and the stinging slaps, while Aizhu and Hongwen escaped with only the wine forfeit. Receiving their punishments in utter humiliation, and having thrown back the harsh wine in such haste, the maids found themselves swaying unsteadily on their feet. They fought to hold themselves upright, privately,"}],57:[{paragraph:13,mentions:1,tokens:["红雯"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"们且先点起将来，设有不合使唤的，便不中用。出去战败了，倒累主人罚酒。」就先点自己的丫鬟，点了红香、红玉、红雪、红雯、红薇、红莲、红霙、红娟，其余那四个不能饮酒。浣香的十珠都可使唤，全点了。浣兰的四个丫鬟，只点了一个小翠，才十三岁，生得很好，且又灵变。又点了许三姐。琼华的四个丫头，点了一个青琴。蓉华两个丫头，点了一个秋莲。紫烟两个丫头，点了一个侍香。佩秋两个丫头，",en:`your mistress with penalty wine." She began by choosing from her own maids, picking Hongxiang, Hongyu, Hongxue, Hongwen, Hongwei, Honglian, Hongying, and Hongjuan. Her other four maids could not drink. Huanxiang's Ten Pearls were all capable and were chosen in their entirety. Out of Huanlan's four maids, she selected only Xiaocui, a pretty and quick-witted thirteen-year-old,`},{paragraph:14,mentions:1,tokens:["红雯"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"浣兰留了许三姐、小翠，要了荷珠，紫烟留了侍香，要了红薇、赠珠，佩秋留了金凤，要了红莲、红娟，蓉华留了秋莲，要了红雯、画珠，琼华留了青琴，要了珍珠、蕊珠。",en:"to fill her ranks. Peiqiu kept Jinfeng and added Honglian and Hongjuan. Ronghua retained Qiulian, bringing in Hongwen and Yazhu. Finally, Qionghua kept Qingqin and rounded out her forces with Zhenzhu and Ruizhu."},{paragraph:15,mentions:1,tokens:["红雯"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"蓉花笑道：「尚未出兵，倒已先砍了两个脑袋。」众人皆笑，又收过了。取蓉华的赵国来，秋莲掣了廉颇，画珠掣了蔺相如，红雯掣了平原君。蓉华道：「我这三根掣得好，大可折秦国的锐气。」再掣浣香的魏国，宝珠掣了信陵君，明珠掣了侯生，掌珠掣了醇酒妇人，大家又笑起来。绮香道：「这倒难，又算酒，又算妇人，横竖一出马，就叫人开心的。」掌珠道：「换一根罢。」红香道：「好便宜事。」忙将筹",en:`Laughter erupted again, and the tube was put away. For Zhao, Qiulian drew Lian Po, Yazhu drew Lin Xiangru, and Hongwen drew Lord Pingyuan. Ronghua beamed, "My three draws are excellent; we can easily blunt Qin's edge." For Wei, Baozhu drew Lord Xinling, Mingzhu drew Hou Sheng; and Zhangzhu drew the Drunken-Woman lot. This sparked even more laughter. Qixiang noted, "That`},{paragraph:17,mentions:1,tokens:["红雯"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"了枝菊花来，命小丫鬟点鼓，到了蓉花，鼓已住了。蓉华笑道：「我这三员勇将正好出这个头阵，试试手段。」秋莲、画珠，红雯三个就上来，旁边又摆了一桌酒肴。秋莲把两个骰子一掷，掷了四点，是自己出马。秦国的爱珠、花珠、红香、红玉、红雪、红霙也过来。爱珠把骰子一掷，掷了二点，是花珠出马。花珠是商君，秋莲是廉颇。绮香翻出谱来，查到廉颇名下，内有一条：「廉颇如遇商君，俱系勇将，皆",en:`confidently, "My three champions are perfectly fit to lead the vanguard and demonstrate their skill." Qiulian, Yazhu, and Hongwen stepped forward to the staging area, where another table filled with wine and dishes had been set aside. Qiulian cast the two dice, rolling a four, meaning she would fight first. Qin's forces—Aizhu, Huazhu, Hongxiang, Hongyu, Hongxue, and Hongying—stepped`},{paragraph:20,mentions:3,tokens:["红雯"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"轮到了红雯，是平原君。谱上：「平原君用丝线。平原作交线之戏，平原输了，叫人打了手，还要喝十大杯，说有酒惟浇赵州土，要他吐了才歇。」这红雯是酒量最小的，又兼胆小，见了这个令，先害怕起来。两手框了一条线，那十个指头就不住的发颤，惹得众佳人又笑，他自己也笑起来，越笑",en:`Next up was Hongwen, playing the role of Lord Pingyuan. The rule book dictated: "Lord Pingyuan uses a silk thread, engaging in a game of cat's-cradle. If Pingyuan loses, his hands are slapped, and he must drink ten large cups of wine, echoing the line, 'Only wine can soak`},{paragraph:21,mentions:6,tokens:["红雯"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"花珠手中藏了一颗莲子，叫红雯猜。画珠看见了，把脚踢一踢红雯的脚，红雯不解，看着画珠。画珠又指着桌上一盘的莲子，红雯又看到隔壁去了，道是鸭掌，便说道：「鸭掌。」画珠听了，大笑起来。红雯害臊说道：「你故意顽我。」画珠道：「我顽你？」花珠道：「他倒不是顽你，你倒是骂我。」便摊开手说道",en:"Huazhu then hid a lotus seed in her hand for Hongwen to guess. Yazhu saw it and subtly kicked Hongwen's foot to give her a hint. Puzzled, Hongwen looked at Yazhu, who then pointed discreetly at a dish of lotus seeds resting on the table. However, Hongwen's gaze drifted sideways, and thinking of duck feet,"},{paragraph:22,mentions:1,tokens:["红雯"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"来纳降。」蓉华笑道：「这也不难。」便斟了一杯酒，走到绮香面前福了一福，绮香也还了一礼，笑而受之。那画珠、秋莲、红雯，只得也向花珠万福。花珠笑道：「我是甲冑在身，不能还礼。」画珠骂道：「你威风不要使尽了，只怕这回就要对人磕头呢。」于是又击起鼓来，花到了紫烟住了，侍香、红薇、赠珠上来。赠珠把骰子一掷，数到红薇，是高唐神女，众人皆笑。紫烟笑道：「好个红姑娘，高鬟大袖的",en:'and gracefully curtsied. Qixiang returned the bow and accepted the cup with a warm smile. Yazhu, Qiulian, and Hongwen were then forced to curtsey to Huazhu, who had emerged victorious as Lord Shang. Huazhu laughed, "I have my armor on; I cannot return the courtesy." Yazhu retorted, "Do not spend all your swagger so quickly. You may well be kowtowing in the next round."'},{paragraph:24,mentions:2,tokens:["红雯"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"」红雪掣了一枝是：「玉搔头袅凤双飞。」注：「插金丝软凤钗者饮一杯。」红雪四下留心，戴此钗的却亦不少，只见爱珠与红雯在那里交线顽耍，爱珠交错了，被红雯打了一下，爱珠格格的笑，把个金丝双凤钗颤得乱飞。红雪斟了一杯酒，上前道：「在这里了。」爱珠道：「怎么你要消酒，消到外国来了？」红雪道：「你不见你头上么？方才这句诗是，戴双凤钗的酒。」爱珠摸一摸钗，又看看众人道：「呸！",en:`phoenix hairpins must drink." Hongxue looked carefully around the room; many easily qualified. She spotted Aizhu and Hongwen playing cat's-cradle. Aizhu missed a tricky cross, and Hongwen slapped her hand. Aizhu giggled so hard that her golden twin-phoenix pins shook violently. Hongxue poured a cup, stepped right up to her, and said, "Here." Aizhu complained, "Why chase your`},{paragraph:26,mentions:1,tokens:["红雯"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"是：「十指纤纤玉笋红。」看来看去，就是个小翠指甲尚是红的，要他喝了一杯。红雪掣了一枝是：「天赐胭脂一抹腮。」看红雯喝了两杯酒，两颊尚是红的，也逼他喝了一杯。",en:'currently painted red, so she made her drink. Hongxue then drew: "Heaven gifts a smear of rouge upon the cheeks." Hongwen had already consumed two cups, and her cheeks were burning bright red. Consequently, she was forced to drink yet another.'}]},"char-174":{52:[{paragraph:27,mentions:1,tokens:["红莲"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"母，一位是南岳夫人，正是敌体。」新人坐了一坐，早已告退。这边太太们讲得好不投机，底下是许三姐张罗。徐家的红雪、红莲、红香、红玉、红梅、红月、红露、红霙八个，并华家六珠，与那些家人媳妇丫鬟们，整整坐了八桌。这八桌里头，有会说会笑的，有会喝会吃的，有抿着嘴不开口的，有缩着手不动箸的，各人有各人的模样。三姐八面张罗，满场飞舞。",en:"Below them, Xu Third Sister managed everything flawlessly. The eight 'Hong' maids of the Xu household—Hongxue, Honglian, Hongxiang, Hongyu, Hongmei, Hongyue, Honglu, and Hongying—along with the six Pearl Maids of the Hua household, plus all the servants and maids, filled exactly eight tables. At these tables, some laughed and joked, some ate and drank boldly, some sat"}],57:[{paragraph:13,mentions:1,tokens:["红莲"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"来，设有不合使唤的，便不中用。出去战败了，倒累主人罚酒。」就先点自己的丫鬟，点了红香、红玉、红雪、红雯、红薇、红莲、红霙、红娟，其余那四个不能饮酒。浣香的十珠都可使唤，全点了。浣兰的四个丫鬟，只点了一个小翠，才十三岁，生得很好，且又灵变。又点了许三姐。琼华的四个丫头，点了一个青琴。蓉华两个丫头，点了一个秋莲。紫烟两个丫头，点了一个侍香。佩秋两个丫头，点了一个金凤",en:`penalty wine." She began by choosing from her own maids, picking Hongxiang, Hongyu, Hongxue, Hongwen, Hongwei, Honglian, Hongying, and Hongjuan. Her other four maids could not drink. Huanxiang's Ten Pearls were all capable and were chosen in their entirety. Out of Huanlan's four maids, she selected only Xiaocui, a pretty and quick-witted thirteen-year-old, along with`},{paragraph:14,mentions:1,tokens:["红莲"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"浣香自己留了宝珠、明珠、掌珠，浣兰留了许三姐、小翠，要了荷珠，紫烟留了侍香，要了红薇、赠珠，佩秋留了金凤，要了红莲、红娟，蓉华留了秋莲，要了红雯、画珠，琼华留了青琴，要了珍珠、蕊珠。",en:"added Hezhu. Ziyan kept Shixiang, taking Hongwei and Zengzhu to fill her ranks. Peiqiu kept Jinfeng and added Honglian and Hongjuan. Ronghua retained Qiulian, bringing in Hongwen and Yazhu. Finally, Qionghua kept Qingqin and rounded out her forces with Zhenzhu and Ruizhu."},{paragraph:15,mentions:1,tokens:["红莲"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"了，一个佞人，一个梦神，一个风流鬼，这如何打得仗来？」众佳人皆笑，也收过了。再掣佩秋的燕国小筹，金凤掣了荆轲，红莲掣了田光，红娟掣了骏马。佩秋道：「也不好，究竟是个不祥之兆。」蓉花笑道：「尚未出兵，倒已先砍了两个脑袋。」众人皆笑，又收过了。取蓉华的赵国来，秋莲掣了廉颇，画珠掣了蔺相如，红雯掣了平原君。蓉华道：「我这三根掣得好，大可折秦国的锐气。」再掣浣香的魏国，",en:`fight with them?" The others laughed and set Chu's tube aside. Next came Peiqiu's Yan lots: Jinfeng drew Jing Ke, Honglian drew Tian Guang, and Hongjuan drew a fine horse. Peiqiu sighed, "Not good. It feels ominous all the same." Ronghua teased, "Before the army even marches, you have already lost two heads!" Laughter erupted again, and the tube was put away. For Zhao, Qiulian`},{paragraph:31,mentions:1,tokens:["红莲"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"浣兰道：「这令大约没有笑话了。」金凤投了一枝苏秦背剑，红玉投了一枝姜公钓鱼，那两枝都没有中，各人饮了两杯。转到红莲的田光出来，是个哑口令。各出一指，如大指为金，食指为木，中指为土，无名指为水，小指为火。譬如一个出大指，一个出食指，便是金克木。大指赢，食指输了。一个出大指，一个出小指，是火克金，小指赢，大指输了。这三婢出得甚快，有输有赢。",en:"the 'Lord Jiang Angles for Fish' style; neither shaft found the pot, and each drank two cups. Then it passed to Honglian's Tian Guang, who came out for the mute game: each player puts forth one finger, the thumb standing for metal, the forefinger for wood, the middle finger for earth, the ring finger for water, and the little finger for fire. If one throws the thumb and"}]},"char-175":{57:[{paragraph:13,mentions:1,tokens:["红娟"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"使唤的，便不中用。出去战败了，倒累主人罚酒。」就先点自己的丫鬟，点了红香、红玉、红雪、红雯、红薇、红莲、红霙、红娟，其余那四个不能饮酒。浣香的十珠都可使唤，全点了。浣兰的四个丫鬟，只点了一个小翠，才十三岁，生得很好，且又灵变。又点了许三姐。琼华的四个丫头，点了一个青琴。蓉华两个丫头，点了一个秋莲。紫烟两个丫头，点了一个侍香。佩秋两个丫头，点了一个金凤。共二十四人",en:"by choosing from her own maids, picking Hongxiang, Hongyu, Hongxue, Hongwen, Hongwei, Honglian, Hongying, and Hongjuan. Her other four maids could not drink. Huanxiang's Ten Pearls were all capable and were chosen in their entirety. Out of Huanlan's four maids, she selected only Xiaocui, a pretty and quick-witted thirteen-year-old, along with Miss Xu Sanjie. From Qionghua's"},{paragraph:14,mentions:1,tokens:["红娟"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"己留了宝珠、明珠、掌珠，浣兰留了许三姐、小翠，要了荷珠，紫烟留了侍香，要了红薇、赠珠，佩秋留了金凤，要了红莲、红娟，蓉华留了秋莲，要了红雯、画珠，琼华留了青琴，要了珍珠、蕊珠。",en:"Ziyan kept Shixiang, taking Hongwei and Zengzhu to fill her ranks. Peiqiu kept Jinfeng and added Honglian and Hongjuan. Ronghua retained Qiulian, bringing in Hongwen and Yazhu. Finally, Qionghua kept Qingqin and rounded out her forces with Zhenzhu and Ruizhu."},{paragraph:15,mentions:1,tokens:["红娟"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"一个梦神，一个风流鬼，这如何打得仗来？」众佳人皆笑，也收过了。再掣佩秋的燕国小筹，金凤掣了荆轲，红莲掣了田光，红娟掣了骏马。佩秋道：「也不好，究竟是个不祥之兆。」蓉花笑道：「尚未出兵，倒已先砍了两个脑袋。」众人皆笑，又收过了。取蓉华的赵国来，秋莲掣了廉颇，画珠掣了蔺相如，红雯掣了平原君。蓉华道：「我这三根掣得好，大可折秦国的锐气。」再掣浣香的魏国，宝珠掣了信陵君",en:`laughed and set Chu's tube aside. Next came Peiqiu's Yan lots: Jinfeng drew Jing Ke, Honglian drew Tian Guang, and Hongjuan drew a fine horse. Peiqiu sighed, "Not good. It feels ominous all the same." Ronghua teased, "Before the army even marches, you have already lost two heads!" Laughter erupted again, and the tube was put away. For Zhao, Qiulian drew Lian Po, Yazhu drew`},{paragraph:32,mentions:1,tokens:["红娟"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"再换红娟的骏马上来，看谱是马吊谱。大指为赏，中指为肩，小指为极，食指为百子，无名指不用。可用两手齐出，如此出二指，彼出一指，成了色样，是归出二指家。出一指者，照贺例贺酒。如彼出两手三指，此出一手二指，成了色样，是归出两手家。总以少数凑成多数，余皆仿此。所贺之",en:"Next Hongjuan's fine steed came forward; the rulebook showed a chart for madiao. The thumb counted as a 'reward,' the middle finger as a 'shoulder,' the little finger as an 'extreme,' and the forefinger as a 'hundred sons'; the ring finger was not used. Both hands"},{paragraph:33,mentions:5,tokens:["红娟"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"红娟道：「这个马吊色样我记不清楚，奶奶须与我记着。」浣香应了。红娟出了一个食指，一个小指，红玉偏偏出了一个小指，刚刚凑成一百两极，是个双尾蝎。浣香道：「这个就六十贺。」绮香道：「这倒好，叫通场伺候的都喝一杯。」红玉两手齐出，是一个食指，两个小指，红娟出了",en:`Hongjuan said, "I cannot keep these madiao patterns straight—my lady must remember them for me." Huanxiang agreed. Hongjuan put out a forefinger and a little finger, and Hongyu, as it happened, put out a little finger: together they made exactly 'a hundred with`}]},"char-176":{57:[{paragraph:13,mentions:1,tokens:["秋莲"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"点了一个小翠，才十三岁，生得很好，且又灵变。又点了许三姐。琼华的四个丫头，点了一个青琴。蓉华两个丫头，点了一个秋莲。紫烟两个丫头，点了一个侍香。佩秋两个丫头，点了一个金凤。共二十四人。其余都命他们代酒。绮香即命拿过筹来，先是七人掣了，顺着年齿掣去，绮得掣着秦，紫烟掣着楚，佩秋掣着燕，蓉华掣着赵，浣香掣着魏，浣兰掣着齐，琼华掣着韩。浣香道：「姐姐，你今日受了大敌了",en:"quick-witted thirteen-year-old, along with Miss Xu Sanjie. From Qionghua's four maids, Qingqin was chosen. Ronghua picked Qiulian from her two maids. Ziyan selected Shixiang. Peiqiu chose Jinfeng. In total, there were twenty-four capable maids; the rest were ordered to drink on behalf of others when necessary. Qixiang then had the lots brought out. The seven mistresses drew first,"},{paragraph:14,mentions:1,tokens:["秋莲"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"珠、掌珠，浣兰留了许三姐、小翠，要了荷珠，紫烟留了侍香，要了红薇、赠珠，佩秋留了金凤，要了红莲、红娟，蓉华留了秋莲，要了红雯、画珠，琼华留了青琴，要了珍珠、蕊珠。",en:"taking Hongwei and Zengzhu to fill her ranks. Peiqiu kept Jinfeng and added Honglian and Hongjuan. Ronghua retained Qiulian, bringing in Hongwen and Yazhu. Finally, Qionghua kept Qingqin and rounded out her forces with Zhenzhu and Ruizhu."},{paragraph:15,mentions:1,tokens:["秋莲"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"「也不好，究竟是个不祥之兆。」蓉花笑道：「尚未出兵，倒已先砍了两个脑袋。」众人皆笑，又收过了。取蓉华的赵国来，秋莲掣了廉颇，画珠掣了蔺相如，红雯掣了平原君。蓉华道：「我这三根掣得好，大可折秦国的锐气。」再掣浣香的魏国，宝珠掣了信陵君，明珠掣了侯生，掌珠掣了醇酒妇人，大家又笑起来。绮香道：「这倒难，又算酒，又算妇人，横竖一出马，就叫人开心的。」掌珠道：「换一根罢。",en:`army even marches, you have already lost two heads!" Laughter erupted again, and the tube was put away. For Zhao, Qiulian drew Lian Po, Yazhu drew Lin Xiangru, and Hongwen drew Lord Pingyuan. Ronghua beamed, "My three draws are excellent; we can easily blunt Qin's edge." For Wei, Baozhu drew Lord Xinling, Mingzhu drew Hou Sheng; and Zhangzhu drew the Drunken-Woman lot.`},{paragraph:17,mentions:4,tokens:["秋莲"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"看。」于是折了枝菊花来，命小丫鬟点鼓，到了蓉花，鼓已住了。蓉华笑道：「我这三员勇将正好出这个头阵，试试手段。」秋莲、画珠，红雯三个就上来，旁边又摆了一桌酒肴。秋莲把两个骰子一掷，掷了四点，是自己出马。秦国的爱珠、花珠、红香、红玉、红雪、红霙也过来。爱珠把骰子一掷，掷了二点，是花珠出马。花珠是商君，秋莲是廉颇。绮香翻出谱来，查到廉颇名下，内有一条：「廉颇如遇商君，",en:`laughed confidently, "My three champions are perfectly fit to lead the vanguard and demonstrate their skill." Qiulian, Yazhu, and Hongwen stepped forward to the staging area, where another table filled with wine and dishes had been set aside. Qiulian cast the two dice, rolling a four, meaning she would fight first. Qin's forces—Aizhu, Huazhu, Hongxiang, Hongyu, Hongxue,`},{paragraph:18,mentions:1,tokens:["秋莲"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"，平过；猜着了，商君即以本物飞诗一句。不能或不合本题者，罚一杯。」花珠道：「这还好，不甚累赘。」两人对垒起来。秋莲看了谱，心已怯了，输了三次。",en:'he must drink one cup." Huazhu said, "That is tolerable enough, not overly fussy." The two generals faced off. Qiulian, having heard her punishing rules, lost her nerve and quickly lost three consecutive rounds.'},{paragraph:19,mentions:4,tokens:["秋莲"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"蓉华道：「好个廉颇，头一阵就打了败仗。」秋莲想跑开，被爱珠、花珠赶上，捉了过来，戴上假须，飘飘漾漾的。众婢女把他形容个淋漓尽致，罚了一杯酒，又盛了一碗饭要他吃。秋莲笑道：「你们也有良心，戴上这个东西，怎样吃得饭来？除非要用金钩挂胡子法子。」红雪道：「有钩子，早就预备的。」便在匣子里找出两个金钩",en:'Ronghua sighed playfully, "Brave Lian Po, the very first battle is lost." Qiulian attempted to flee, but Aizhu and Huazhu swiftly caught her and tied on the false white whiskers, which fluttered comically in the air. The maids vividly painted the scene, fining her one cup of wine and heaping a large bowl of rice before her. Qiulian'},{paragraph:22,mentions:1,tokens:["秋莲"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"领队前来纳降。」蓉华笑道：「这也不难。」便斟了一杯酒，走到绮香面前福了一福，绮香也还了一礼，笑而受之。那画珠、秋莲、红雯，只得也向花珠万福。花珠笑道：「我是甲冑在身，不能还礼。」画珠骂道：「你威风不要使尽了，只怕这回就要对人磕头呢。」于是又击起鼓来，花到了紫烟住了，侍香、红薇、赠珠上来。赠珠把骰子一掷，数到红薇，是高唐神女，众人皆笑。紫烟笑道：「好个红姑娘，高鬟",en:'over to Qixiang, and gracefully curtsied. Qixiang returned the bow and accepted the cup with a warm smile. Yazhu, Qiulian, and Hongwen were then forced to curtsey to Huazhu, who had emerged victorious as Lord Shang. Huazhu laughed, "I have my armor on; I cannot return the courtesy." Yazhu retorted, "Do not spend all your swagger so quickly. You may well be kowtowing in'},{paragraph:48,mentions:1,tokens:["秋莲"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"且与我等报仇。」浣香道：「这闷雷、劈雷是可以乱打的，你也不必容情，连他们的国王也可打得的。」佩秋道：「你若像了秋莲的廉颇，就不好了。」紫烟道：「也不要像我们荆轲的匕首。」你一句，我一句的说笑。绮香笑道：「谅此孤军深入重地，焉有生还之理？」便命六人一齐上前，与青琴对敌。",en:`urged, "Dull and split thunder may strike wildly. Do not spare them—not even their king." Peiqiu warned, "Do not be Qiulian's Lian Po." Ziyan chimed in, "Nor our Jing Ke's dagger." Banter flew across the room. Qixiang laughed heartily, "This lone army, deep in enemy land—can it possibly return alive?" She confidently ordered six of her maids forward at once against Qingqin.`}]},"char-177":{57:[{paragraph:13,mentions:1,tokens:["侍香"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"很好，且又灵变。又点了许三姐。琼华的四个丫头，点了一个青琴。蓉华两个丫头，点了一个秋莲。紫烟两个丫头，点了一个侍香。佩秋两个丫头，点了一个金凤。共二十四人。其余都命他们代酒。绮香即命拿过筹来，先是七人掣了，顺着年齿掣去，绮得掣着秦，紫烟掣着楚，佩秋掣着燕，蓉华掣着赵，浣香掣着魏，浣兰掣着齐，琼华掣着韩。浣香道：「姐姐，你今日受了大敌了，我们六国今番并力，定要杀你",en:"Sanjie. From Qionghua's four maids, Qingqin was chosen. Ronghua picked Qiulian from her two maids. Ziyan selected Shixiang. Peiqiu chose Jinfeng. In total, there were twenty-four capable maids; the rest were ordered to drink on behalf of others when necessary. Qixiang then had the lots brought out. The seven mistresses drew first, in order of age: Qixiang drew Qin, Ziyan"},{paragraph:14,mentions:1,tokens:["侍香"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"点了爱珠、花珠、红香、红玉、红雪、红霙，浣香自己留了宝珠、明珠、掌珠，浣兰留了许三姐、小翠，要了荷珠，紫烟留了侍香，要了红薇、赠珠，佩秋留了金凤，要了红莲、红娟，蓉华留了秋莲，要了红雯、画珠，琼华留了青琴，要了珍珠、蕊珠。",en:"Huanxiang kept Baozhu, Mingzhu, and Zhangzhu. Huanlan retained Sanjie and Xiaocui, and added Hezhu. Ziyan kept Shixiang, taking Hongwei and Zengzhu to fill her ranks. Peiqiu kept Jinfeng and added Honglian and Hongjuan. Ronghua retained Qiulian, bringing in Hongwen and Yazhu. Finally, Qionghua kept Qingqin and rounded out her forces with Zhenzhu and Ruizhu."},{paragraph:15,mentions:1,tokens:["侍香"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"的是吕不韦，红雪掣的是李斯，红霙掣的是赵高。绮香笑道：「如何，你看我们文武皆全。」收过了筒，取紫烟楚国的筹来，侍香掣的是令尹子兰，红薇掣的是高唐神女，赠珠掣的是宋玉。紫烟笑道：「完了，一个佞人，一个梦神，一个风流鬼，这如何打得仗来？」众佳人皆笑，也收过了。再掣佩秋的燕国小筹，金凤掣了荆轲，红莲掣了田光，红娟掣了骏马。佩秋道：「也不好，究竟是个不祥之兆。」蓉花笑道",en:`"You see? Both civil and military talents are perfectly complete." They put away Qin's tube and drew for Chu. Shixiang drew Minister Ling Yin Zilan; Hongwei drew the Gaotang Goddess; and Zengzhu drew Song Yu. Ziyan groaned with a laugh, "We are done for! A flatterer, a dream goddess, and a romantic ghost. How can we possibly fight with them?" The others laughed and set`},{paragraph:22,mentions:1,tokens:["侍香"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"甲冑在身，不能还礼。」画珠骂道：「你威风不要使尽了，只怕这回就要对人磕头呢。」于是又击起鼓来，花到了紫烟住了，侍香、红薇、赠珠上来。赠珠把骰子一掷，数到红薇，是高唐神女，众人皆笑。紫烟笑道：「好个红姑娘，高鬟大袖的，真像个神女。」红薇脸已红了。那边爱珠、红玉、红香、红霙、红雪也过来，掷到爱珠，是白起。绮香道：「这叫做无情遇。」看谱：「如神女遇见白起，神女如何能敌",en:'well be kowtowing in the next round." They beat the drum once more, and this time the flower stopped with Ziyan. Shixiang, Hongwei, and Zengzhu stepped forward. Zengzhu cast the dice, and it pointed to Hongwei, who was playing the Gaotang Goddess. Everyone laughed. Ziyan smiled, "Look at our Miss Hong. With her high chignon and wide, flowing sleeves, she truly resembles'},{paragraph:23,mentions:1,tokens:["侍香"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"让我们国王点了。」紫烟道：「不错，我们上了他的当了。」紫烟点了一出生旦戏，想罚爱珠一杯。谁知爱珠是个空手，倒将侍香罚了一杯。",en:"Ziyan then quickly named a sheng-dan piece in order to fine Aizhu, but Aizhu's hand was perfectly empty, meaning Shixiang was forced to drink the penalty instead."},{paragraph:24,mentions:3,tokens:["侍香"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"「这爱儿真是可儿，不枉这个爱字。」宝珠又掣了一根筹是：「轻敛翠蛾呈皓齿。」宝珠四下一望，道：「有了，我来敬我们侍香妹妹。你看双蛾颦蹙，皓齿微呈，不是西子捧心的模样么？」侍香不肯，被宝珠捏着鼻子一灌，侍香一笑，喷了宝珠一身，众佳人皆笑。",en:'"Softly she knits kingfisher brows, shows bright teeth." She looked about the room and said, "Found her. I toast our Shixiang. With those pinched brows and teeth half shown, is she not the very image of Xishi clutching her heart?" Shixiang flatly refused the drink. Baozhu playfully pinched her nose and poured the wine in; Shixiang laughed and accidentally sprayed the wine all'}]},"char-178":{57:[{paragraph:13,mentions:1,tokens:["金凤"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"。琼华的四个丫头，点了一个青琴。蓉华两个丫头，点了一个秋莲。紫烟两个丫头，点了一个侍香。佩秋两个丫头，点了一个金凤。共二十四人。其余都命他们代酒。绮香即命拿过筹来，先是七人掣了，顺着年齿掣去，绮得掣着秦，紫烟掣着楚，佩秋掣着燕，蓉华掣着赵，浣香掣着魏，浣兰掣着齐，琼华掣着韩。浣香道：「姐姐，你今日受了大敌了，我们六国今番并力，定要杀你个片甲不留。」绮香道：「慢说",en:"four maids, Qingqin was chosen. Ronghua picked Qiulian from her two maids. Ziyan selected Shixiang. Peiqiu chose Jinfeng. In total, there were twenty-four capable maids; the rest were ordered to drink on behalf of others when necessary. Qixiang then had the lots brought out. The seven mistresses drew first, in order of age: Qixiang drew Qin, Ziyan drew Chu, Peiqiu drew"},{paragraph:14,mentions:1,tokens:["金凤"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"雪、红霙，浣香自己留了宝珠、明珠、掌珠，浣兰留了许三姐、小翠，要了荷珠，紫烟留了侍香，要了红薇、赠珠，佩秋留了金凤，要了红莲、红娟，蓉华留了秋莲，要了红雯、画珠，琼华留了青琴，要了珍珠、蕊珠。",en:"Sanjie and Xiaocui, and added Hezhu. Ziyan kept Shixiang, taking Hongwei and Zengzhu to fill her ranks. Peiqiu kept Jinfeng and added Honglian and Hongjuan. Ronghua retained Qiulian, bringing in Hongwen and Yazhu. Finally, Qionghua kept Qingqin and rounded out her forces with Zhenzhu and Ruizhu."},{paragraph:15,mentions:1,tokens:["金凤"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"紫烟笑道：「完了，一个佞人，一个梦神，一个风流鬼，这如何打得仗来？」众佳人皆笑，也收过了。再掣佩秋的燕国小筹，金凤掣了荆轲，红莲掣了田光，红娟掣了骏马。佩秋道：「也不好，究竟是个不祥之兆。」蓉花笑道：「尚未出兵，倒已先砍了两个脑袋。」众人皆笑，又收过了。取蓉华的赵国来，秋莲掣了廉颇，画珠掣了蔺相如，红雯掣了平原君。蓉华道：「我这三根掣得好，大可折秦国的锐气。」再",en:`How can we possibly fight with them?" The others laughed and set Chu's tube aside. Next came Peiqiu's Yan lots: Jinfeng drew Jing Ke, Honglian drew Tian Guang, and Hongjuan drew a fine horse. Peiqiu sighed, "Not good. It feels ominous all the same." Ronghua teased, "Before the army even marches, you have already lost two heads!" Laughter erupted again, and the tube was`},{paragraph:31,mentions:2,tokens:["金凤"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"于是又击鼓传花，传到佩秋的燕国，数骰子是金凤出马，为荆轲。那边数到了红玉，是吕不韦。荆轲行的是投壶令。浣兰道：「这令大约没有笑话了。」金凤投了一枝苏秦背剑，红玉投了一枝姜公钓鱼，那两枝都没有中，各人饮了两杯。转到红莲的田光出来，是个哑口令。各出一指，如大指为金，食指为木，中指为土，无名指为水，",en:`Then the drum beat and the flower passed again, coming round to Peiqiu's kingdom of Yan. The dice count sent Jinfeng forth as Jing Ke, while on the other side the count fell to Hongyu, as Lü Buwei. Jing Ke's appointed game was pitch-pot. Huanlan said, "This game, at least, should yield no jokes." Jinfeng threw a shaft in the 'Su Qin Shoulders His Sword' style, and`}]},"char-179":{57:[{paragraph:13,mentions:1,tokens:["小翠"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"红雪、红雯、红薇、红莲、红霙、红娟，其余那四个不能饮酒。浣香的十珠都可使唤，全点了。浣兰的四个丫鬟，只点了一个小翠，才十三岁，生得很好，且又灵变。又点了许三姐。琼华的四个丫头，点了一个青琴。蓉华两个丫头，点了一个秋莲。紫烟两个丫头，点了一个侍香。佩秋两个丫头，点了一个金凤。共二十四人。其余都命他们代酒。绮香即命拿过筹来，先是七人掣了，顺着年齿掣去，绮得掣着秦，紫",en:"Ten Pearls were all capable and were chosen in their entirety. Out of Huanlan's four maids, she selected only Xiaocui, a pretty and quick-witted thirteen-year-old, along with Miss Xu Sanjie. From Qionghua's four maids, Qingqin was chosen. Ronghua picked Qiulian from her two maids. Ziyan selected Shixiang. Peiqiu chose Jinfeng. In total, there were twenty-four capable"},{paragraph:14,mentions:1,tokens:["小翠"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"笑了，站了过来。绮香自己点了爱珠、花珠、红香、红玉、红雪、红霙，浣香自己留了宝珠、明珠、掌珠，浣兰留了许三姐、小翠，要了荷珠，紫烟留了侍香，要了红薇、赠珠，佩秋留了金凤，要了红莲、红娟，蓉华留了秋莲，要了红雯、画珠，琼华留了青琴，要了珍珠、蕊珠。",en:"Hongxue, and Hongying for her own forces. Huanxiang kept Baozhu, Mingzhu, and Zhangzhu. Huanlan retained Sanjie and Xiaocui, and added Hezhu. Ziyan kept Shixiang, taking Hongwei and Zengzhu to fill her ranks. Peiqiu kept Jinfeng and added Honglian and Hongjuan. Ronghua retained Qiulian, bringing in Hongwen and Yazhu. Finally, Qionghua kept Qingqin and rounded out her forces"},{paragraph:16,mentions:2,tokens:["小翠"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"看小翠掣一根，已经失笑，再看三姐掣出来，大家笑得如花枝乱颤，扎挣不住。原来小翠一根是鸡鸣，三姐一根是狗盗，幸亏荷珠掣了孟尝君，稍可解嘲。再掣琼华的韩国，蕊珠掣了张子房，青琴掣了博浪椎，珍珠掣了圯上老人。琼华笑道：「我早说的，绮香姐姐你仔细博浪椎、荆轲匕首，",en:"When Xiaocui drew her lot, the ladies were already smiling. But when Sanjie's lot was revealed, everyone shook with laughter like trembling flower branches, barely able to sit upright. Xiaocui had drawn the rooster's crow, while Sanjie had drawn the dog-thief. Fortunately,"},{paragraph:26,mentions:1,tokens:["小翠"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"带，不是香的？」红薇被他说着了，两颊通红，只得喝了一杯。宝珠又掣了一枝是：「十指纤纤玉笋红。」看来看去，就是个小翠指甲尚是红的，要他喝了一杯。红雪掣了一枝是：「天赐胭脂一抹腮。」看红雯喝了两杯酒，两颊尚是红的，也逼他喝了一杯。",en:`cup. Baozhu drew another slip: "Ten fingers slender, like red jade shoots." Looking around, she noticed that only Xiaocui's fingernails were currently painted red, so she made her drink. Hongxue then drew: "Heaven gifts a smear of rouge upon the cheeks." Hongwen had already consumed two cups, and her cheeks were burning bright red. Consequently, she was forced to drink`},{paragraph:36,mentions:2,tokens:["小翠"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"赔礼，群珠又与他央求，红霙方才饶他。众佳人笑道：「荷姑娘这几句太刻薄，幸遇着人多，不然是挨定□姑娘的打。」到了小翠的鸡鸣来了，小翠上来就有些发怯。看谱是接牌令。",en:`cutting. Lucky for her there were so many present, or a beating from Miss Hongying was a certainty." Then came Xiaocui's cock-crow, and Xiaocui stepped forward already rather timid. The rulebook showed a tile-joining game.`},{paragraph:37,mentions:4,tokens:["小翠"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"两人将骨牌对接，么头对么，二头接二，接死了罚酒。小翠暗喜。两人就在地下接起来，小翠接死了三次，便发急起来，不知道要怎样奈何他。绮香道：「今番有好令来了。」把谱一翻是：「鸡鸣出关三杯酒，都要装着鸡啼，从板凳下钻过去钻过来三次。」众佳人掩口胡卢。小翠听了这个，倒投其所好，毫不为难，便咮咮□□的学起鸡叫来，",en:'dominoes end to end—an ace head against an ace, a deuce head against a deuce—and whoever was blocked drank a forfeit. Xiaocui secretly rejoiced. The two began joining tiles there on the floor, and Xiaocui was blocked three times running. She began to fret, not knowing what would be done with her. Qixiang said, "Now comes a fine rule," and turned up the book: for the cock-crow'}]},"char-180":{57:[{paragraph:13,mentions:1,tokens:["青琴"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"，全点了。浣兰的四个丫鬟，只点了一个小翠，才十三岁，生得很好，且又灵变。又点了许三姐。琼华的四个丫头，点了一个青琴。蓉华两个丫头，点了一个秋莲。紫烟两个丫头，点了一个侍香。佩秋两个丫头，点了一个金凤。共二十四人。其余都命他们代酒。绮香即命拿过筹来，先是七人掣了，顺着年齿掣去，绮得掣着秦，紫烟掣着楚，佩秋掣着燕，蓉华掣着赵，浣香掣着魏，浣兰掣着齐，琼华掣着韩。浣香",en:"only Xiaocui, a pretty and quick-witted thirteen-year-old, along with Miss Xu Sanjie. From Qionghua's four maids, Qingqin was chosen. Ronghua picked Qiulian from her two maids. Ziyan selected Shixiang. Peiqiu chose Jinfeng. In total, there were twenty-four capable maids; the rest were ordered to drink on behalf of others when necessary. Qixiang then had the lots brought"},{paragraph:14,mentions:1,tokens:["青琴"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"，要了荷珠，紫烟留了侍香，要了红薇、赠珠，佩秋留了金凤，要了红莲、红娟，蓉华留了秋莲，要了红雯、画珠，琼华留了青琴，要了珍珠、蕊珠。",en:"and added Honglian and Hongjuan. Ronghua retained Qiulian, bringing in Hongwen and Yazhu. Finally, Qionghua kept Qingqin and rounded out her forces with Zhenzhu and Ruizhu."},{paragraph:16,mentions:1,tokens:["青琴"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"，扎挣不住。原来小翠一根是鸡鸣，三姐一根是狗盗，幸亏荷珠掣了孟尝君，稍可解嘲。再掣琼华的韩国，蕊珠掣了张子房，青琴掣了博浪椎，珍珠掣了圯上老人。琼华笑道：「我早说的，绮香姐姐你仔细博浪椎、荆轲匕首，好不利害。就是高唐神女、醇酒妇人教你受用罢。」红薇道：「奶奶且慢喜欢，只怕奶奶手下也有个笑话出来呢！」绮香道：「不用讲，拿出谱来。」大家看时，见写道：",en:`which was just enough to laugh off the shame. They then drew for Qionghua's state of Han: Ruizhu drew Zhang Liang, Qingqin drew the Bolang hammer, and Zhenzhu drew the old man at the bridge. Qionghua laughed, "I warned you, Sister Qixiang! You had best mind the Bolang hammer and Jing Ke's dagger. Let the Gaotang Goddess and the wine-woman deal with you instead." Hongwei`},{paragraph:48,mentions:3,tokens:["青琴"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"只剩了一个青琴是博浪椎，谱上是：打擂有闷雷、劈雷，是打秦国通国中人马。琼华道：「就要看这一将成功了。」蓉华道：「琴儿，你须与主人争个脸。」青琴笑道：「我这椎是要椎椎打中的。」浣兰道：「你若赢了他们，非但与你主人争气，且与我等报仇。」浣香道：「这闷雷、劈雷是可以乱打",en:`Only Qingqin remained, playing the Bolang hammer. The rule book stated: "The ring match has 'dull thunder' and 'split thunder'—you may strike anyone in Qin, even the king." Qionghua commanded, "This general must succeed." Ronghua cheered, "Qin'er, win honor for your`},{paragraph:49,mentions:2,tokens:["青琴"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"说也奇怪，被青琴一顿闷雷、劈雷，将二珠、四红打得个个心惊胆怯，琼华好不得意，只管点头微笑，说道：「一将功成万骨枯。」众佳人齐声称贺。绮香笑道：「这还了得？你是个顶小的小妹妹，公然欺侮大姐姐来，这般可恶。你敢与我对敌么？」那五个佳人同声说道：「这有什么不敢？如果七妹胆",en:`Strangely, Qingqin's dull and split thunder-strikes left the two Pearls and four Reds trembling in defeat. Qionghua glowed, nodding and smiling, "One general's merit; ten thousand bones dry." The beauties cheered wildly. Qixiang laughed, "How dare you! The youngest little`}]},"char-181":{18:[{paragraph:22,mentions:2,tokens:["陶妈妈"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"今日来接他的是个开门户的陶家。这陶妈妈家里有三个姑娘，内中一个好的名叫玉天仙，是扬州人，生得风骚娇俏。这两天接着一个大嫖客，就是广东那个奚十一。陶妈妈打听他的家世，知他是海南大家，家有千万之富，兄弟十人，都作道府大员。老太爷是现任提台，家里开着洋行。又访他是个大冤桶，便想发他一票大财。无",en:"The woman who had come to fetch her today was from the Tao household, an establishment keeper. This Madam Tao had three girls in her house; the best of them, known as Jade Celestial Fairy (Yutianxian), was a native of Yangzhou, born vivacious and coquettishly attractive. These past two days she had received a big-spending patron, none other than Xi Eleven from"},{paragraph:23,mentions:1,tokens:["陶妈妈"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"因此，奚十一不大喜欢。陶妈妈知道菊花是广西人，又生得好看，必定勾得住他，所以把他接了过来，认为义女。登时换了崭新的衣服，与诸姊妹相见，菊花与玉天仙尤为相爱。菊花受尽了狼狈，到此已如出了地狱，心里还有甚不足，一心就候那奚十一来。",en:"As a result, Xi Eleven was not greatly pleased. Madam Tao knew that Chrysanthemum hailed from Guangxi and was also very good-looking. Confident that Chrysanthemum could hold his interest, Madam Tao brought her over and formally adopted her as a foster daughter. At once new clothing was found for her, and she"},{paragraph:24,mentions:2,tokens:["陶妈妈"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"填在粪窖里。有人劝他何不娶个妾。他是游荡惯的，见了那良家之女子，甚为厌恶，惟在娼妓队里物色，又没有合意的。一日陶妈妈转来请他，说他家新到了一个广西人。奚十一听见是广西的便满心欢喜，叫个小跟班带了烟具，也不坐车，昂然的步行而去。到了陶家，陶妈妈先出来见了，便极意的胁肩谄笑了一回，然后说道：「你们快请四姑娘出来。」不多一刻，见白菊花袅袅婷婷的，一身香艳，满面春情，上前",en:"families most disagreeable; he hunted for someone among the prostitutes, but found no one to his taste. One day Madam Tao came to invite him, saying she had a new arrival from Guangxi at her establishment. Xi Eleven, hearing she was from Guangxi, was filled with joy; he called a small page boy and had him bring the opium equipment, then, making no use of a carriage, strode"}]},"char-183":{32:[{paragraph:12,mentions:1,tokens:["陆升"],kind:"named-mention",zh:`却说拿乌大傻那一天，有个皂隶叫作陆升，与归自荣住处相近认得，那日见他报了举人，忽然想起八月十四日，明明看见归自荣在乌大傻子寓里吃酒。因想十四日秀才们正在场里，怎么他不进去，又会中呢？
想来想去，再不明白。一日遇见一个贴写，叫作葛逢时，排行第六，是个绍兴朋友，极会生事的。`,en:"However, on the day Wu Dasha was arrested, a runner named Lu Sheng, who lived near Gui Zirong and recognized him, suddenly remembered something. Seeing Gui Zirong reported as a successful candidate, he recalled that on the night of the fourteenth of the eighth month, he had clearly seen Gui Zirong drinking at Wu Dasha's"},{paragraph:13,mentions:5,tokens:["陆皂隶"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"那天是十月初三日，陆皂隶走到衙门前一个小茶馆内，见葛贴写在里面吃茶，一边放着黄布小包。身穿贵州绸绵袍，套着元青大褂，低着头在那里吃火烧。皂隶走近来弯弯腰，叫声：「葛先生，独自一人闲坐吗？」葛逢时见了，也照应了。陆皂隶就对面坐下，走堂即添了一碗茶。葛逢时道：「你今日清闲，想不",en:"That day was the third of the tenth month. Runner Lu walked into a small teahouse in front of the yamen and saw Scrivener Ge drinking tea inside, a small yellow cloth bundle beside him. He was wearing a padded silk robe from Guizhou under a black jacket, head down, eating a baked wheat cake. The runner"},{paragraph:14,mentions:1,tokens:["陆皂隶"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"葛贴写道：「有甚么事难明白？」陆皂隶道：「我们街坊有个姓归的，是个南边人，招赘在乌大傻子家里，常见他出进的。",en:`Scrivener Ge asked, "What is it you don't understand?" Runner Lu said, "We have a neighbor named Gui, a southerner, who married into Wu Dasha's family and lives there. I often see him coming and going."`},{paragraph:15,mentions:2,tokens:["陆皂隶"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"十日出来。十一日再进去，十三日出来。十四日再进去，十六日完场。这是各省一样的。会试是三月初八日起，也是一样。」陆皂隶道：「你说二场是八月十四日进去，是什么时候点名，什么时候封门呢？」葛贴写道：「点名总在一早，到了午未时也就要封门了。」陆皂隶道：「到十四日二更天，还有不进场的人吗？」",en:`every province. The metropolitan examinations start on the eighth of the third month, and it's the same pattern." Runner Lu asked, "You say they go in for the second session on the fourteenth of the eighth month. What time is roll call, and what time are the gates sealed?" Scrivener Ge said, "Roll call is always early morning, and the gates are sealed around noon or early`},{paragraph:16,mentions:3,tokens:["陆皂隶"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"二三场午正时候已经封门了。十四日二更天还在场外，那是头二场犯了贴例贴出的了，所以不用进去。你当他还未进场呢。」陆皂隶点点头道：「原来有这些原故。什么叫作犯了贴例贴出来的？」葛贴写道：「这些事你要问他作甚么？贴例的或是烧了卷子，或是墨水污了，或是不完卷子交了白卷。这些有毛病的卷子，就不发誊录所，就贴了出来，不要他再进去了。」陆皂隶道：「据你说，贴出来的可会一样中么？",en:`had their names posted outside, so they wouldn't be allowed in. You might think they just hadn't gone in yet." Runner Lu nodded, "So that's how it is. What does it mean to 'violate the rules and have your name posted outside'?" Scrivener Ge said, "Why are you asking about all this? Having your name posted means perhaps burning your exam paper, or staining it with ink,`},{paragraph:17,mentions:3,tokens:["陆皂隶"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"场，怎么也会中呢？请教你评出个理来。」葛贴写道：「这却奇了，或者你认错了人，或是记错了日子，不要是十三晚上。」陆皂隶道：「这人虽烧了灰，也认得出来，断不会错的。至于日子，有票字为凭，而且明日就是中秋节，一发不会记错。你想是什么缘故？」葛贴写道：「这真奇了。」细细想了一回，问道：「你可知道他的底子怎样？」陆皂隶道：「这却不知道，他外面是极好看的，说是乌家的女婿。至于",en:`strange. Perhaps you misidentified him, or remembered the date wrong; maybe it was the night of the thirteenth." Runner Lu said, "Even if he were burnt to ashes I'd recognize him, I couldn't be mistaken. As for the date, I have the warrant to prove it, and the next day was the Mid-Autumn Festival, so I definitely wouldn't misremember. What do you think the reason is?" Scrivener`},{paragraph:18,mentions:1,tokens:["陆皂隶"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"歇了几日，陆皂隶访得明明白白。是归自荣撵出一个奶妈子，因偷了一张钱票，两样银首饰，被主人搜着了，撵了出来。",en:"A few days later, Runner Lu investigated the matter thoroughly. Gui Zirong had driven out a wet nurse because she had stolen a banknote and two pieces of silver jewelry; the master had caught her and thrown her out."},{paragraph:21,mentions:3,tokens:["陆皂隶"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"归自荣躲在家里再不出来，并且闹得外头有些风声了。陆皂隶从奶妈子口中访得清清楚楚，便告诉了。葛贴写便叫陆皂隶去向归自荣借一千银子，被归自荣啐了一脸吐沫，便一五一十嚷将出来。归自荣无法，掩不住口，也只得和他闹了一场。陆皂隶讹诈不动，逢人便说要告他。葛贴写与他作了一张呈子，就递在部里。马回子知道了，通知了那个",en:`Gui Zirong hid at home and refused to come out, but rumors had already begun to spread outside. Runner Lu, having learned the whole story clearly from the wet nurse's mouth, went and told Ge. Scrivener Ge told Runner Lu to go to Gui Zirong and "borrow" a thousand taels. Gui Zirong spat in his face, and Lu promptly yelled out the whole story for everyone`}]},"char-184":{32:[{paragraph:12,mentions:1,tokens:["葛逢时"],kind:"named-mention",zh:`大傻子寓里吃酒。因想十四日秀才们正在场里，怎么他不进去，又会中呢？
想来想去，再不明白。一日遇见一个贴写，叫作葛逢时，排行第六，是个绍兴朋友，极会生事的。`,en:`manage to pass?" He thought and thought, but couldn't make sense of it. One day, he ran into a scrivener named Ge Fengshi, the sixth child in his family, a man from Shaoxing who was very good at stirring up trouble.`},{paragraph:13,mentions:5,tokens:["葛贴写","葛逢时"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"那天是十月初三日，陆皂隶走到衙门前一个小茶馆内，见葛贴写在里面吃茶，一边放着黄布小包。身穿贵州绸绵袍，套着元青大褂，低着头在那里吃火烧。皂隶走近来弯弯腰，叫声：「葛先生，独自一人闲坐吗？」葛逢时见了，也照应了。陆皂隶就对面坐下，走堂即添了一碗茶。葛逢时道：「你今日清闲，想不是值堂日子么？」陆皂隶道：「这几",en:'That day was the third of the tenth month. Runner Lu walked into a small teahouse in front of the yamen and saw Scrivener Ge drinking tea inside, a small yellow cloth bundle beside him. He was wearing a padded silk robe from Guizhou under a black jacket, head down, eating a baked wheat cake. The runner approached, bowed, and said, "Mr. Ge, sitting here alone?" Ge Fengshi acknowledged'},{paragraph:14,mentions:1,tokens:["葛贴写"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"葛贴写道：「有甚么事难明白？」陆皂隶道：「我们街坊有个姓归的，是个南边人，招赘在乌大傻子家里，常见他出进的。",en:`Scrivener Ge asked, "What is it you don't understand?" Runner Lu said, "We have a neighbor named Gui, a southerner, who married into Wu Dasha's family and lives there. I often see him coming and going."`},{paragraph:15,mentions:2,tokens:["葛贴写"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"我家与乌家隔不到一箭远，在一条胡衕里，这且慢说。我问你年年下场的日子可是一定的日期，或是可以先后移改的？」葛贴写道：「乡试么，通天下是八月初八日头场，初十日出来。十一日再进去，十三日出来。十四日再进去，十六日完场。这是各省一样的。会试是三月初八日起，也是一样。」陆皂隶道：「你说二场是八月十四日进去，是什么时候点名，什么时候封门呢？」葛贴写道：「点名总在一早，到",en:'that aside for now. Tell me, are the dates for the annual provincial examinations fixed, or can they be changed?" Scrivener Ge replied, "The provincial exams? Across the empire, the first session starts on the eighth of the eighth month and they come out on the tenth. The second session starts on the eleventh and they come out on the thirteenth. They go in again on the fourteenth'},{paragraph:16,mentions:3,tokens:["葛贴写"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"葛贴写道：「怎么能够到二更天？今年点名极快，二三场午正时候已经封门了。十四日二更天还在场外，那是头二场犯了贴例贴出的了，所以不用进去。你当他还未进场呢。」陆皂隶点点头道：「原来有这些原故。什么叫作犯了贴例贴出来的？」葛贴写道：「这些事你要问他作甚么？贴例的",en:'Scrivener Ge said, "How could they wait until the second watch? This year roll call was very fast; for the second and third sessions, the gates were already sealed by noon. Anyone still outside at the second watch on the fourteenth had violated the rules in the first'},{paragraph:17,mentions:4,tokens:["葛贴写"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"那时我去不理会。后来见他报了举人，我又不曾认错人，细细想来，他没有进场，怎么也会中呢？请教你评出个理来。」葛贴写道：「这却奇了，或者你认错了人，或是记错了日子，不要是十三晚上。」陆皂隶道：「这人虽烧了灰，也认得出来，断不会错的。至于日子，有票字为凭，而且明日就是中秋节，一发不会记错。你想是什么缘故？」葛贴写道：「这真奇了。」细细想了一回，问道：「你可知道他的底",en:`carefully: he didn't enter the examination compound, so how could he have passed? Tell me, what do you make of it?" Scrivener Ge said, "That is strange. Perhaps you misidentified him, or remembered the date wrong; maybe it was the night of the thirteenth." Runner Lu said, "Even if he were burnt to ashes I'd recognize him, I couldn't be mistaken. As for the date, I have the warrant`},{paragraph:21,mentions:2,tokens:["葛贴写"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"归自荣躲在家里再不出来，并且闹得外头有些风声了。陆皂隶从奶妈子口中访得清清楚楚，便告诉了。葛贴写便叫陆皂隶去向归自荣借一千银子，被归自荣啐了一脸吐沫，便一五一十嚷将出来。归自荣无法，掩不住口，也只得和他闹了一场。陆皂隶讹诈不动，逢人便说要告他。葛贴写与他作了一张呈子，就递在部里。马回子知道了，通知了那个廪生，两人星夜逃往他方去了。部中审了两次，",en:`spread outside. Runner Lu, having learned the whole story clearly from the wet nurse's mouth, went and told Ge. Scrivener Ge told Runner Lu to go to Gui Zirong and "borrow" a thousand taels. Gui Zirong spat in his face, and Lu promptly yelled out the whole story for everyone to hear. With the secret out, Gui Zirong couldn't silence him and had no choice but to have a huge`}]},"char-185":{40:[{paragraph:42,mentions:4,tokens:["许老二"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"脚步响。潘三一听，魂不附体。只见周小三领着他两个舅子，拿着雪亮的刀，又有一条粗麻绳，上前将潘三按住，拉下炕来。许老二一连三四拳，骂道：「你这狗鸡巴亏的，肛了我的兄弟，还想血我的妹子。」潘三只得在地下叩头。小三道：「我昨日饶了你的狗命，你今日又来送死。」便把潘三捆了。潘三光着身子，只是哀求。许老二道：「你会□人的屁股，老爷子也要个礼你的屁股。」潘三着急，苦苦求饶。那",en:`and carrying a thick hemp rope. They surged forward, pinned Pan the Third down, and dragged him off the kang. Xu Laoer delivered three or four heavy punches, cursing, "You dog-dicked son of a turtle! You violated my brother, and now you dare to violate my sister!" Pan the Third could do nothing but kowtow on the floor. Xiaosan shouted, "I spared your dog's life yesterday,`}],47:[{paragraph:19,mentions:1,tokens:["许老二"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"那许老二抠了他一抠，又放了些东西在内，潘三回来趁早想法还好，偏偏又病了整个月，如今又隔了多时，里头倒像生了虫，痒得难忍。老婆面前也讲不出来，每到痒时只好隔着裤子抠抠擦擦，无奈全不中用。要想找个人替他医医这痒病，自己已是这些年纪，又这般相貌，断难启齿。那一日实",en:"When Xu Laoer had violated him, he had left something behind inside. Had Pan the Third sought a remedy early on, it might have been manageable, but he had languished in sickness for a full month. Now, after so much time had passed, it felt as though worms were crawling"},{paragraph:25,mentions:2,tokens:["许老二"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"那人，告知缘故。那人笑道：「潘三叫你来请我么？这事我早知道。他正月里拿这个法子收拾了许老三，许三姐才设计哄他，许老二就用他的法子收拾他，许老二早告诉了我。许老三吃了多少荞麦面，还吃了泻药，泻不出来。还是我传他的法子。听说三姐将银耳挖替他挖干净的，才不至成了毛病。潘三这个人真不是个东西，极该得这个报应，由他罢了。」",en:"month, Pan the Third used this very trick to ruin Xu Laosan. Xu's Third Sister devised a scheme to trick him, and Xu Laoer used Pan the Third's own method to ruin him in return. Xu Laoer told me all about it. Xu Laosan ate so much buckwheat flour and took purgatives, but couldn't pass it. It was I who taught him the cure. I heard Third Sister used a silver earpick to scrape"}]},"char-186":{40:[{paragraph:17,mentions:3,tokens:["许老三","老三"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"无事不成巧，说起来真可笑。却说潘三店内有个小伙计，叫许老三，只得十六岁，生得颇为标致。潘三久想弄他，哄骗过他几次，竟骗不上手。那孩子有一样毛病，爱喝一钟，多喝了就要睡。正月十五日，众伙计都回家过节，潘三单留住了老三，在小账房同他喝酒。许老三已醉了，在炕上睡着。",en:"the story; and this tale is truly laughable to tell. In Pan the Third's shop there was a young assistant named Xu Laosan; he was only sixteen years of age, and possessed quite a handsome appearance. Pan the Third had long coveted him and had tried to coax and deceive him on several occasions, but had unexpectedly never managed to get him in hand. The boy, however, had"},{paragraph:18,mentions:1,tokens:["许老三"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"找了些剃二回的短发，与刮下来的头发，藏在身边，乘他醉了，便强奸了一回，将头发揌进，以后叫他痒起来，好来就他。那许老三醒来，已被他奸了，要叫喊时，又顾着脸，只得委委屈屈受了。",en:"inside, intending that once the irritation flared up, the boy would be forced to seek him out for relief. When Xu Laosan awoke and realized he had been violated by him, he wanted to cry out, but out of concern for his own face, he had no choice but to swallow the grievance and bear the humiliation."},{paragraph:19,mentions:1,tokens:["许老三"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"谁知从此得了毛病。明知上了潘三的当，放了东西，心中甚恨，忍住了仍不理他。潘三自以为得计，必当移舟就岸，那知许老三怀恨在心。他有个姐夫周小三，即与潘三赶车，为人颇有血性，倒是个路见不平拔刀相助的朋友。",en:"congratulating himself on his success, assumed the boat would naturally drift toward the bank. Little did he know that Xu Laosan nursed his grievance bitterly. He had a brother-in-law named Zhou Xiaosan, who drove Pan the Third's cart — a man of considerable hot-blooded spirit, the very sort of friend who would draw a sword to aid a stranger facing injustice on the road."},{paragraph:20,mentions:2,tokens:["许老三","老三"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"许老三上当之后，即告诉了姐夫，姐夫即要与潘三吵闹，倒是老三止住了，商量个妙计报他。",en:"After falling victim to the plot, Xu Laosan immediately informed his brother-in-law. His brother-in-law was ready to go raise a violent clamor with Pan the Third right then and there, but Laosan held him back, and together they deliberated on a clever stratagem to exact their revenge."},{paragraph:27,mentions:1,tokens:["老三"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"大听了，可以报得仇，还可以讹得钱，便也劝道：「老二这句话，倒也讲得在理，除妹子，却无第二人可做。但是做了之后，老三是不用说了，就是妹夫，这个锅也砸定了。」三姐道：「那倒不妨，三吊钱一月，别处也弄得出来。这件事既商议定了，倒要趁早，你们去将你妹夫叫来。大家说明，也要他肯。」去叫周小三来家，三姐将方才商量的话说了，周小三无有不依，定于后日晚间行事。",en:`aside from you, my sister, there truly is no second person capable of this. However, once it is done, leaving Laosan aside, your husband's rice bowl will certainly be smashed as well." The third sister said, "That is of no consequence — three strings of cash a month can be scrounged up elsewhere. Since we have agreed on this course, it is best to act early. Go and`},{paragraph:29,mentions:6,tokens:["老三"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"来，你也该出来见个礼。况且三爷是有年纪的人，父母一样，不要害臊。」三姐笑了一声，道：「我厨房有事，还没有净手。老三嘴馋得很，不能帮我也罢，我装一碟，他到要吃半碟。」又笑了一笑，便进去了。潘三听了，已有些软洋洋的起来，心中想道：「好个声音，不知相貌怎样，若像他兄弟就好了。」小三拖开桌子，摆了三面。老三先拿酒壶、两个酒杯、两双筷子来，随后又送出四个碟子。潘三见是一碟",en:`bashful." Third Sister gave a little laugh and said, "I have tasks in the kitchen and haven't yet washed my hands. Laosan's mouth is so greedy; not only can he not help me, but if I plate up a dish, he'll eat half of it." She laughed again and retreated inside. Pan the Third, hearing this, felt his limbs go soft and languid; he thought to himself, "What a glorious voice`},{paragraph:33,mentions:5,tokens:["老三"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"小三进来向潘三道：「三爷请坐坐，我叫老三来陪你，我要出去劝解一件事，就回来的。」潘三道：「我也走罢。」小三道：「忙什么，我即刻回来的。」潘三心上为着老三，正好等小三去了，招陪他。口虽说走，身却不动。小三叫老三出来，老三终是不肯。小三骂了一声：「胡涂小子！」只得叫声：「三姐出来。」三姐到门后",en:`Xiaosan came back inside and said to Pan the Third, "Third Master, please sit for a moment. I will tell Laosan to come keep you company. I must go out and mediate an affair, but I will be right back." Pan the Third said, "I will leave as well." Xiaosan said, "What's the rush? I'll be back in an instant." Pan the Third's true motivation for staying was Laosan;`},{paragraph:35,mentions:2,tokens:["老三"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"潘三乐得受不得，便道：「奶奶何不请坐过来。要你这么劳动，心上不安。」三姐笑了一笑，即叫声：「老三，三兄弟，你出来。」老三道：「我不来，你陪他罢。」三姐笑道：「你不来陪你的人，倒要我替你陪，那里有这样倔强的孩子，怪不得人要暗算你。」潘三听了这话有因，即道：「小三在我家，也是亲人一样，奶奶就坐坐，谅也无妨。」三姐道：「我坐在这里，也是一样。」潘三道",en:`not come sit over here? I am truly uneasy making you exert yourself so." Third Sister smiled and called out, "Laosan, Third Brother, come out!" Laosan replied, "I'm not coming; you keep him company." Third Sister laughed and said, "You refuse to come out and entertain your own guest, and instead demand that I keep him company for you — where in the world is there such`},{paragraph:36,mentions:1,tokens:["老三"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"已完了，三姐道：「没有酒有，兄弟你去打半斤好烧酒来。方才这酒淡，你上大街去买，你不要嫌路远，又在小铺里买来。」老三答应，亦不点灯，趁着月色去了。三姐道：「我关了门，他到大街上去，有一会呢。」潘三见他去关门，心中想道：「可以下手了。这婆娘很有勾我的意，我不可辜负他。」三姐进来坐了。潘三此际欲火中烧，脸皮发赤，走过来道：「奶奶再饮这一杯。」便挨近了，在凳边坐下。三姐",en:`too mild. Go to the main street to buy it; don't be lazy about the distance and buy from a small corner stall." Laosan voiced his agreement and, without lighting a lantern, departed by the light of the moon. Third Sister said, "I will close the door; going to the main street will take him some time." Pan the Third, seeing her go to bolt the door, thought to himself:`}],47:[{paragraph:3,mentions:2,tokens:["许老三","许贵"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"，甚是合式，就在鸣珂坊，与子玉相近。又替春航备了车马，新收了几个管家。那赶车的就是周小三，进来后，又荐他小舅子许老三，改名许贵，做了跟班，局面一变，暂且按下。",en:"took on several new servants. The driver was Zhou Xiaosan; once hired, he recommended his young brother-in-law, Xu Laosan, who took the name Xu Gui and became a footman. And so the household took on a new face. We leave this thread for now."},{paragraph:25,mentions:2,tokens:["许老三"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"到明日去找那人，告知缘故。那人笑道：「潘三叫你来请我么？这事我早知道。他正月里拿这个法子收拾了许老三，许三姐才设计哄他，许老二就用他的法子收拾他，许老二早告诉了我。许老三吃了多少荞麦面，还吃了泻药，泻不出来。还是我传他的法子。听说三姐将银耳挖替他挖干净的，才不至成了毛病。潘三这个人真不是个东西，极该得这个报应，由他罢了。」",en:"sent you to fetch me? I knew about this long ago. In the first month, Pan the Third used this very trick to ruin Xu Laosan. Xu's Third Sister devised a scheme to trick him, and Xu Laoer used Pan the Third's own method to ruin him in return. Xu Laoer told me all about it. Xu Laosan ate so much buckwheat flour and took purgatives, but couldn't pass it. It was I who taught"}],48:[{paragraph:6,mentions:1,tokens:["许贵"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"精明周到。蕙芳又是个好胜脾气，就是没有办过的，他先就访问了，想得澈底澄清，一无翳障，不要春航费一点心。就是那个许贵，也十分灵慧，惟有那老田安，只可看门而已。",en:"first make inquiries and think them through until everything was flawlessly clear, sparing Chunhang any worry. Xu Gui was also quite clever, leaving old Tian An suited only for watching the gate."}]},"char-187":{12:[{paragraph:6,mentions:1,tokens:["田安"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"月内，田夫人见其子困守乡园，终非长策；且当年其夫的同榜进士，如今置身青云者也不少，遂令春航游学京师，命一老家人田安随了。半被出门，先到杭州，后到苏州，两处的年谊故旧，几个当道显贵，共相帮扶。春航在那两处，勾留了半年，诗文著作传抄殆遍。时下谓其可与侯太史、屈大令争名，因此囊橐充盈，黄白满箧。不消说题花载酒，访翠眠香，几至乐而忘返。及接了他太夫人的手谕，催其速行进京",en:"prominent positions. So she directed Chunhang to go to the capital to pursue his studies, with the old family servant Tian An accompanying him. Departing from home, he first went to Hangzhou, then to Suzhou, where old friends and current acquaintances, as well as several influential officials, all lent their support. Chunhang lingered in those two places for half a year; his"},{paragraph:9,mentions:1,tokens:["田安"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"田安虽常苦谏，他那里肯听，还是一样的苦中寻乐。他预先存着一个主意，是」财尽而交绝」的一句，若能乐得一天，算一天，实在到水尽山穷时，方肯歇手。此时高品与春航已经认识。",en:'Though Tian An repeatedly remonstrated with him, Chunhang paid no attention and continued finding pleasure in hardship just the same. He had a prior philosophical conviction of his own: "When funds are exhausted, friendships dissolve" — if he could enjoy himself one'},{paragraph:31,mentions:2,tokens:["田安"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"春航拖泥带水的，一步步走回庙中，恰懊悔不曾问得那一班的小旦。进了庙门，就把衣裳脱下，交田安收拾，换去泥靴，身上只穿了一件夹袄，来到高品屋里坐下。高品见他身上不穿袍子，且下雨寒冷，便问他何以不多穿件衣服？春航答以被雨沾湿，叫田安烤去了。高品即于衣包内，取出一件袍子与他穿了。春航即坐下说道：「我今日虽然跌了一交，沾了些泥，但这一交实在跌得有趣",en:"troupe this small-role actor belonged to. Entering the temple gate, he took off his clothes and handed them to Tian An to clean, changed out of his muddy boots, and in only a lined jacket went to sit in Gao Pin's room. Gao Pin, seeing that he wore no outer robe, and that the rain had made the weather cold, asked why he was not wearing more. Chunhang explained that the"},{paragraph:34,mentions:3,tokens:["田安"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"想着田安尚有几件衣服，便走到田安房里，却不见他，也等不及他来，打开了他的衣包，见有件茧绸皮袍，包在里面，便拿了出来，叫那小使张和去当了，倒有六吊钱，心中大喜。饭也不吃，一连看了五天联锦班，才见着那个相公一面。看他唱了一出《独占》，访问他的姓名，却正是苏蕙芳。",en:"He thought of Tian An, who still had a few garments. He went to Tian An's room, but found him absent; unable to wait, he opened Tian An's luggage pack, and there inside, wrapped up, was a fur-lined robe of pongee silk. He took it out, sent the young servant Zhanghe to pawn"},{paragraph:35,mentions:1,tokens:["田安"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"春航只当不听见，在炕上和衣卧了，心里只想着蕙芳。田安出去，嘴里却不住咕咕噜噜的抱怨，春航也有些踌躇。",en:"Chunhang simply let it wash over him; he lay on the heated bed fully clothed, thinking only of Huifang. Tian An went out, muttering and grumbling without pause. Chunhang was also somewhat at a loss."}],13:[{paragraph:33,mentions:3,tokens:["田安"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"高品已经睡了，春航不好去惊动他，一径到自己房内。田安伏在桌上瞌睡，春航剔亮了灯，叫醒了田安，说道：「快去泡茶。」田安擦擦眼睛，见一个美少年，只道是位公子，便急急的泡茶去了。蕙芳坐下，看他行李萧条，心里着实难过。便叫跟班的将衣裳、票子拿上来，道：「这五套衣服都是我平日穿过的，你不嫌旧，使收着。这票子送你",en:`Gao Pin had already gone to bed. Chunhang, not wanting to disturb him, went directly to his own room. Tian An was dozing over the table. Chunhang trimmed the lamp brighter and woke Tian An. "Go and make tea, quickly." Tian An rubbed his eyes, and seeing a beautiful youth took him for a young gentleman and hurried off to get it.

Huifang sat down, and looking`}],48:[{paragraph:6,mentions:1,tokens:["田安"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"气，就是没有办过的，他先就访问了，想得澈底澄清，一无翳障，不要春航费一点心。就是那个许贵，也十分灵慧，惟有那老田安，只可看门而已。",en:"through until everything was flawlessly clear, sparing Chunhang any worry. Xu Gui was also quite clever, leaving old Tian An suited only for watching the gate."}]},"char-188":{48:[{paragraph:7,mentions:1,tokens:["田太夫人"],kind:"named-mention",zh:`津府知府，因与上台不合，告病回家。
家居数年，情况不支。且上司已换，只得起程来京，定于三月十五日挈眷起身，偕了田太夫人来都，数日间就要到了。`,en:"decided to travel to the capital. Setting out on the fifteenth of the third month with his household, he escorted Madam Tian along the journey, and their arrival was imminent."},{paragraph:9,mentions:1,tokens:["田太夫人"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"过了十余日，田太夫人已到，春航接到良乡，母子相见，悲欢各半。太夫人在路已知春航中了状元，因此更念起亡媳来。",en:"Over ten days later, Madam Tian arrived, and Chunhang met her at Liangxiang. Mother and son reunited with a mixture of tears and smiles. Having heard on the road that he had become the Zhuangyuan, she remembered her departed daughter-in-law all the more poignantly."},{paragraph:10,mentions:1,tokens:["田太夫人"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"的好处，也是落难才唱戏的，如今已出了班子，他父亲在云南做过州同，是个书香之后，在京甚为相得，一切都赖藉他。因此田太夫人待蕙芳甚好，蕙芳更加相安了。",en:"In the capital, they suited each other perfectly, and everything relied on Huifang's assistance. Consequently, Madam Tian treated Huifang with great kindness, and Huifang felt completely at ease."}],50:[{paragraph:17,mentions:1,tokens:["田老太太"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"唐和尚道：「我听得说，这位苏相公如今也出了班子，田老太太认他为义子，宅里都称他为二老爷，是真的么？」文泽道：「没有的话。苏相公也没有住在那里，他们下人称呼他为苏大爷是真的。」唐和尚道：「这苏相公本来好，斯斯文文，和和气气，见了我们也是待得一样，必恭必敬，不当我们是个和尚，少了头发看待。不像那个什么琴相公，",en:`Monk Tang continued, "I've heard rumors that this Master Su has also left his troupe. They say Old Madam Tian has recognized him as her adopted son, and everyone in the household now addresses him as 'Second Master'. Is it true?" Wenze dismissed it, "Nonsense. Master Su doesn't even live there. The servants calling him 'Master Su' is true enough, though." Tang`}],52:[{paragraph:22,mentions:1,tokens:["田太夫人"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"明日，苏夫人请了他大姑奶奶浣香与徐子云夫人袁绮香去陪新，吃扶头卯酒。田太夫人请了王文辉的陆氏夫人，带了他大姑奶奶蓉华并媳妇孙少奶奶佩秋，又请刘守正的夫人，没有来，他媳妇吴少奶奶紫烟来了。周锡爵、杨方猷、陆宗沅的夫人都辞了。",en:"daughter Huanxiang and Xu Ziyun's wife, Yuan Qixiang, to accompany the bride and partake in the morning wine. Old Madam Tian invited Wang Wenhui's wife, Madam Lu, who brought along her elder daughter Ronghua and her daughter-in-law, Madam Sun Peiqiu. She also invited the wife of Liu Shouzheng, who could not attend, though her daughter-in-law, Madam Wu Ziyan, came in her stead."},{paragraph:25,mentions:1,tokens:["田老太太"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"田老夫人在东边作陪。陆夫人对田老夫人道：「太太，那边不用你过去张罗了。」便叫蓉姑道：「你在那边代作主人罢，省得田老太太走来走去的费事。」田老夫人满面笑容，站起来说道：「若得姑奶奶张罗，就妙极的了。」说罢便福了两福，蓉华连忙还礼。陆夫人道：「太太实在多礼，小孩子也当得起你这么着？他们姐妹聚会还高兴不过，只怕你老人家过去，倒拘束了他们。」田老夫人见新妇这般天姿国色，不觉",en:'new bride was invited to sit at the center of the main table, flanked by two side tables to the east and west. Old Madam Tian assigned the seats, placing Madam Xu at the head of the east table. However, Madam Xu protested, "Elder Aunt, how can you treat your niece as a guest? This head seat should belong to the new relative; it is Sister Hua who must sit here." Old Madam Tian'}]},"char-189":{51:[{paragraph:8,mentions:3,tokens:["缝穷的","缝穷婆"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"卖小菜、豆腐的，挤来挤去，地下还有些测字摊子。还有那些缝穷婆，面前放下个筐子，坐在小凳上与人缝补。元茂望着一个缝穷的，堆着一头黑发，一个大髻子歪在半边，插一枝纸花。虽然紫糖色脸，望去像二十几岁的人，倒也少艾。两眼只顾瞅着，慢腾腾走近去，不防一条缆子一绊，栽了一交，直跌到那个缝穷婆身上。那个缝穷婆正伸直两条腿，交跷着七寸长的花鞋，鞋口上捆了鲜红的带子。",en:"set before her, sitting on small stools and patching clothes for passersby. Yuanmao's eyes fixed upon one such mender. She sported a thick crown of black hair, gathered into a large bun tilted to one side and adorned with a paper flower. Though her face was the dark hue of burnt sugar, she appeared to be in her twenties and retained a youthful charm. With his eyes locked"},{paragraph:10,mentions:4,tokens:["缝穷婆","缝穷的"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"只见那缝穷婆抖着布衫，连说道：「这是怎么说，走道儿会栽到人身上来！」元茂只得自认不是。那缝穷的尚要发作几句，见元茂一身绸绢，像个旗丁模样，又见他一袜子泥，衫子也扎破了，倒想揽这个买卖，便道：「你的衣裳破了，你脱下来我与你缝缝罢。」元茂见他好言好语，便看自己样子也",en:'The mender stood up, dusting off her cotton blouse, and grumbled repeatedly, "What is the meaning of this? How does a man walk straight into a person?" Yuanmao had no choice but to swallow the blame. The mender was about to unleash a sharper scolding, but seeing'},{paragraph:11,mentions:7,tokens:["缝穷的"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"缝完了，元茂穿上，缝穷的提了篮子，跟了元茂进城。元茂问他的住处，缝穷的道：「我也在城里。」元茂又问他的丈夫，缝穷的道：「我们当家的撑小驳船，如今在杨柳青呢。」元茂说一句，望一望，两人并着走，见他胸前高高的两个乳，元茂鼻子望空嗅嗅，觉有些汗香，心上有几分爱他，却又不敢问他。同进了寓，只见嗣徽的房门也锁着，不见一个人，缝穷",en:`When the mending was finished, Yuanmao donned his gown, and the mender, carrying her basket, followed him into the city. Yuanmao asked where she lived; she replied, "I also live in the city." He then asked about her husband. "Our master poles a small barge; he's currently at Yangliuqing," she answered. With every word he`},{paragraph:12,mentions:1,tokens:["缝穷的"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"元茂道：「我就给你四百钱。」对着他把嘴望炕上一扭，缝穷的道：「待我提了篮子进来。」元茂恐怕人来，关了门闩了，二人就在炕上云雨起来。",en:'Yuanmao agreed, "I will give you four hundred coppers." He pursed his lips and gestured toward the kang. The mender said, "Wait, let me bring my basket inside." Fearing someone might walk in, Yuanmao quickly closed and bolted the door, and the two tumbled onto the kang, losing themselves in the clouds and rain.'},{paragraph:14,mentions:3,tokens:["缝穷婆","缝穷的"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"嗣徽看清，想撞破他，恐元茂脸上下不来。且看缝穷的生得少艾，便想要半路截留，便先到门口等他。那缝穷婆出来，嗣徽拦住了门，问道：「你方才在里头做什么？」那缝穷婆笑嘻嘻的扭着头，看嗣徽穿着芙蓉布汗衫，脚下是皂靴，知道是位老爷，说道：「方才有位爷们，叫我缝补小衣。」孙嗣徽道：「我在窗子外望得清清楚楚，他给了你四百钱。明日我也要缝小衣，你务必来。」那缝穷的",en:'everything clearly, wanted to expose him, but feared causing Yuanmao too much embarrassment. Moreover, seeing that the mender was young and attractive, he decided to intercept her. He waited by the outer gate. When she emerged, Sihui blocked her path and asked, "What were you doing inside just now?" The mender grinned, tilting her head. Seeing Sihui clad in a fine lotus-cloth'},{paragraph:17,mentions:5,tokens:["缝穷婆","缝穷的"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"爷，我没有这价钱。」听得嗣徽说道：「我是照你昨日的价钱，没有少给你。他那里不是四百钱？」元茂听了，方知是昨日的缝穷婆，心里诧异道：「他怎么在他房里？定是来找我的，被这强盗打劫了去，可恨！可恨！」又听得缝穷婆道：「快快的高升，不要耽搁我。」嗣徽道：「这是什么缘故，一样的人，我就要加钱？」缝穷婆道：「一样的人，他是平等人，你是个老爷。况且昨日连衣也没有脱，今日有两三倍",en:"asleep at all. With Sihui in the room directly opposite, how could he fail to hear someone entering? Furthermore, the mender wore wooden-soled shoes today, with raised heels inside; her seven-inch shoes from yesterday had seemingly shrunk to five. Despite her light steps, the clatter was unmistakable. Sihui, convinced Yuanmao was asleep, took no precautions and unleashed his"},{paragraph:18,mentions:4,tokens:["缝穷婆"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"听得嗣徽笑道：「我倒问你，你怎么知道我是个老爷？难道昨日那人不是位老爷么？」缝穷婆道：「他不是老爷。」嗣徽暗喜，想道：「他必看出我龟头上那个黑斑，知是主贵的，待我问他。」又道：「我身有样主贵，你若说出来我才服你，若说不出来，不过想讹我一吊钱。」那缝穷婆道：「呸！你的鸡巴主贵，那满面的糟疙瘩，像粮船上带来的糟枇杷一样。我讹你的钱？把",en:'laugh and ask, "I must ask you, how did you know I was a master? Was the man from yesterday not a master?" The mender replied, "He is no master." Sihui, secretly delighted, thought, "She must have noticed the dark spot on the head of my member and recognized it as a sign of nobility. Let me test her." He said, "I possess a mark of high nobility on my body. If you can'},{paragraph:19,mentions:1,tokens:["缝穷的"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"来，心内惊慌，定一定神，倒生了个急智，随手拉一件衣裳，撕破了一块，叫他拿出针线来缝，便开了门。嗣元进去，见一个缝穷的鬓发蓬松，面有愧色，坐在凳子缝衣。嗣元一见生了气。",en:"to calm down, a desperate plan formed in his mind. He grabbed a piece of clothing, tore a hole in it, ordered the mender to take out a needle and thread and start sewing, and then unbolted the door. Siyuan burst in, only to find a mender with disheveled hair and a guilty flush on her cheeks, sitting on a stool sewing a garment. The sight sent Siyuan into a towering rage."},{paragraph:20,mentions:3,tokens:["缝穷的","缝穷婆"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"那里有这种不要脸的烂、烂、烂货跑进房里来，关了门，做、做、做什么事情，还、还不滚出去！」 　　把他的篮子踢翻。缝穷的虽不敢发作，也有了气，便道：「有人请我来的，我又不是挨上门的。开口就骂人滚，好个不讲理的蛮子。」便理清了零星碎布，提了篮子，到外间来缝。见了元茂，有些不好意思，笑了一笑。元茂仔细看他，比昨日标致了好些，脚也小了，但心里恨他没有情义，还说他不像老爷，又",en:`door to do... do... do what filthy business?! Get... get the hell out of here!" He kicked her basket over. Though the mender dared not explode, her temper flared. She shot back, "Someone invited me in; I didn't barge through your door! Opening your mouth just to curse people and tell them to get out—what an unreasonable barbarian!" She calmly gathered her scattered scraps`},{paragraph:21,mentions:1,tokens:["缝穷的"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"元恨极了，即将席子扯下地来，叫小使进来，把马褥子铺了，便烂脓烂血的大骂。嗣徽自知理短，不敢回言，只作不闻。那个缝穷的实在也听不得了，便道：「太太今儿真丧气，碰着了这些浑虫，没有开过屁眼。」将衣裳一扔，提了篮子，扭着屁股，唠唠叨叨的骂了出去。嗣徽不敢进房，在外间与元茂说那缝穷婆的好处，一个说皮肤很细腻，一个说汗都是香的。一个说他是个镰刀式，愈弄愈紧，一个说像个烂瓤瓜",en:`and rotten blood. Knowing he was entirely in the wrong, Sihui dared not retort, pretending he heard nothing. The mender, finally unable to endure the abuse any longer, snapped, "My luck today is truly foul, running into you disgusting worms! It's like you've never seen a woman before!" She threw down the garment, snatched up her basket, and stormed out, her hips swaying`},{paragraph:24,mentions:2,tokens:["缝穷婆"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"，毛长且茂，闲着把他梳理梳理，孙氏也不阻拦他。元茂自觉得意忘言，忽然说道：「我当是你们这个与我们一样，谁想那个缝穷婆才二十四岁，竟是一大片毛，连小肚子上都是的，倒不好看。」孙氏听了，已有了气，故意问道：「或者他小肚子上有泥，你看不清楚，就当他是毛了。」元茂笑道：「你笑我是近视眼，看不见，我的手难道也是近视，摸不出么？」孙氏气涌心头，把元茂身上一把拧得死紧，元茂道：",en:"She was tall and pleasantly plump, possessing a countenance that promised good fortune. Compared to the lowly mender, she lacked a certain wild coquetry, but she was infinitely cleaner. As they shared their bed that night, having been separated for over twenty days, a fierce mutual desire inevitably blossomed. Furthermore, Yuanmao felt his 'knowledge' of the world"}]},"char-190":{56:[{paragraph:12,mentions:1,tokens:["李大夫"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"只狗了。」琴仙道：「你为何去了这半天才回？」刘喜道：「那王大夫今日到仪征县去了，要耽搁三四天才回。我只得去请了李大夫，也是个名医，住的远，来回有二十里路呢。」又问道：「老爷此刻怎样？」琴仙道：「还是这样。」刘喜道：「如果老爷有些长短便怎样呢？」琴仙又哭道：「如果有什么不好，我也是死。」刘喜叹了一声，到道翁房里来看了一看，就到后头去了。",en:`"Doctor Wang traveled to Yizheng today and will not return for three or four days. I had no choice but to track down Doctor Li. He is also famous, but lives very far away—a full twenty li there and back." He then asked how Daoweng was faring. Qinxian shook his head sadly: "He is exactly the same." Liu Xi's face fell. "If the master should... if the worst happens, what will we`},{paragraph:19,mentions:1,tokens:["李大夫"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"知道，尽要仗你费点心的了。」刘喜道：「这个不消吩咐。」于是先将道翁扶下，易箦之后，点了香烛，焚了纸钱，昨日请的李大夫方来，闻得死了，即忙回转。刘喜出去料理，一个人又没有帮手。棺材买不到，只得向和尚买了那一口停放在后楼的，就去了二十二千大钱。其余做孝衣，叫吹鼓手，请僧念经，雇了一个厨子，忙得不了。琴仙诸事不能，惟在床前守尸痛哭，水浆不入口者两日。刘喜又疼他，也无空劝",en:"Daoweng's body down reverently; after the bedding was changed, they lit tall candles and began to burn paper money. Doctor Li, whom they had fetched yesterday, had only just arrived; upon hearing that Daoweng was already dead, he turned on his heel and hurried away. Liu Xi was forced to go out into the city to manage everything alone, without a single soul to help him. Not"}]},"char-191":{56:[{paragraph:10,mentions:1,tokens:["张贵"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"琴仙穿了个半臂，坐了一会，听得后头有响声，便又叫声张贵，不听得答应。琴仙又不敢去看，刘喜是请大夫没有回来，又问了一声：「是谁？」也没有答应。再听得一声很响，像似棺材暴起来，又像鬼叫了几声，琴仙好不害怕。想到佛前去求告，却又心惊肉跳的不敢前去。要不去，心又不安。重到道翁房里看时，见昏昏沉沉的睡着了，便放大",en:'half-sleeve vest and sat in the gloom for a while. Hearing a strange noise behind him, he called out nervously for Zhang Gui, but received no answer. He dared not go look for the source. Liu Xi was still out fetching the doctor. He asked, "Who is there?" but met only with dead silence. Suddenly, a loud, cracking noise echoed—sounding like a heavy coffin violently bursting'},{paragraph:13,mentions:2,tokens:["张贵"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"道：「不好了，这些箱子到那里去了？」琴仙听了，慌忙出来，走到后面厢房里看时，就剩了几个书画箱，其余搬运一空。见张贵、汪升、钱德的李行都没有了，此刻还不回来？这门开着，岂没有人进来的，如何是好呢？况且盘费银子也都在箱内。老爷房内一个小扁箱，只有几件单纱衣服。大爷你的东西全偷去了，你房里那个小箱子，也是几件纱衣。现在我身边存不到二十两银子，适或有起事来，这怎么样呢？",en:"Qinxian hurried out. In the rear wing only a few chests of paintings and books remained; everything else was gone. Zhang Gui, Wang Sheng, and Qian De's luggage bundles were nowhere to be seen—still not back? The door stood open—anyone could walk in—what were they to do? The travel money had been in those chests too. In the master's room a small flat trunk held only a few gauze"},{paragraph:21,mentions:1,tokens:["张贵"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"「做什么？」琴仙道：「你是什么缘故？睡梦中跑出来，抱住了树。」刘喜方揉揉眼，停了一停，道：「原来是梦。我方才见张贵来扯我的被窝，我正要捉他，问他的箱子，一赶出来抱住他，不想抱着了树，又睡着了。」自己也笑了一笑，琴仙又害怕，又好笑，同了进来，关了窗子，刘喜倒身复睡。",en:'hug a tree?" Liu Xi rubbed his blurry eyes, paused to gather his wits, and laughed. "It was a dream. I dreamt Zhang Gui was pulling at my quilt. I tried to catch the scoundrel and demand to know where our trunks were! I chased him all the way out here and grabbed him... I suppose I ended up hugging the tree and just fell asleep again." He laughed at his own foolishness.'},{paragraph:29,mentions:2,tokens:["张贵"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"石翁问道：「怎么你又回来了，不曾跟去么？」刘喜将道翁归天之事，细细说了。又将遗言嘱托并张贵等偷去衣箱、银钱等物，并文凭也偷去了，如今少爷在寺里守灵，连衣食将要不给起来。石翁听大惊，道：「有这等事！我道是已经到任去了，那知道这个光景！」便也洒了几点泪。刘喜道：「此时总要求老爷想个法子才好。」石翁道：「屈老爷相好呢尽多，但皆不在这里。我只好写",en:`not go with them?" Liu Xi recounted the tragedy of Daoweng's passing in agonizing detail: his final wishes, how Zhang Gui and the others had absconded with clothes, silver, and the vital credential, and how the young master now kept a bleak vigil at the temple, nearly destitute of food and clothing. Lord Hou was visibly shocked: "Such a thing! I assumed he had already taken`}],59:[{paragraph:11,mentions:1,tokens:["张贵"],kind:"named-mention",zh:`吉安府差役拿获窃犯张贵、钱德二名，搜出南昌府通判凭文一角，皮箱两口，内存白银三百十七两零，金镯一个，衣服若干件，一并着役赍解前来，但此衣物等须交还他嗣子收领。那二犯现收禁江宁县监，还有从犯一名汪升，已经身故了。但不知他嗣子下落，须问石翁便知。
梅侍郎听了，心里颇为恺恻，又`,en:`"The constables of Ji'an Prefecture have apprehended the thieves, Zhang Gui and Qian De. A search yielded one fragment of a credential belonging to the Assistant Prefect of Nanchang Prefecture, two leather trunks containing three hundred and seventeen taels of silver, one gold bracelet, and several garments. These have all been`}]},"char-192":{56:[{paragraph:13,mentions:1,tokens:["汪升"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"不好了，这些箱子到那里去了？」琴仙听了，慌忙出来，走到后面厢房里看时，就剩了几个书画箱，其余搬运一空。见张贵、汪升、钱德的李行都没有了，此刻还不回来？这门开着，岂没有人进来的，如何是好呢？况且盘费银子也都在箱内。老爷房内一个小扁箱，只有几件单纱衣服。大爷你的东西全偷去了，你房里那个小箱子，也是几件纱衣。现在我身边存不到二十两银子，适或有起事来，这怎么样呢？琴仙急",en:"out. In the rear wing only a few chests of paintings and books remained; everything else was gone. Zhang Gui, Wang Sheng, and Qian De's luggage bundles were nowhere to be seen—still not back? The door stood open—anyone could walk in—what were they to do? The travel money had been in those chests too. In the master's room a small flat trunk held only a few gauze garments."}],59:[{paragraph:11,mentions:1,tokens:["汪升"],kind:"named-mention",zh:`七两零，金镯一个，衣服若干件，一并着役赍解前来，但此衣物等须交还他嗣子收领。那二犯现收禁江宁县监，还有从犯一名汪升，已经身故了。但不知他嗣子下落，须问石翁便知。
梅侍郎听了，心里颇为恺恻，又想：「道翁并无嗣子，想是近来过继的了。」便辞了制台，到凤凰山来拜石翁。石翁连忙接进，先道了喜，叙了契阔，即问宦囊如何。士燮笑道：「晚生靠祖宗的余荫，稍有几亩薄田，尽够饔飧，无`,en:`to his adopted son for claiming. The two culprits are currently imprisoned in Jiangning County; an accomplice, Wang Sheng, has already died. But as the whereabouts of his adopted son are unknown, we must ask Shiweng to ascertain this."
Upon hearing this, Vice Minister Mei felt a profound sense of sorrow. He thought to himself, "Daoweng had no heir; this adopted son must`}]},"char-193":{56:[{paragraph:13,mentions:1,tokens:["钱德"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"，这些箱子到那里去了？」琴仙听了，慌忙出来，走到后面厢房里看时，就剩了几个书画箱，其余搬运一空。见张贵、汪升、钱德的李行都没有了，此刻还不回来？这门开着，岂没有人进来的，如何是好呢？况且盘费银子也都在箱内。老爷房内一个小扁箱，只有几件单纱衣服。大爷你的东西全偷去了，你房里那个小箱子，也是几件纱衣。现在我身边存不到二十两银子，适或有起事来，这怎么样呢？琴仙急得没有",en:`rear wing only a few chests of paintings and books remained; everything else was gone. Zhang Gui, Wang Sheng, and Qian De's luggage bundles were nowhere to be seen—still not back? The door stood open—anyone could walk in—what were they to do? The travel money had been in those chests too. In the master's room a small flat trunk held only a few gauze garments. "Young master,`}],59:[{paragraph:11,mentions:1,tokens:["钱德"],kind:"named-mention",zh:`吉安府差役拿获窃犯张贵、钱德二名，搜出南昌府通判凭文一角，皮箱两口，内存白银三百十七两零，金镯一个，衣服若干件，一并着役赍解前来，但此衣物等须交还他嗣子收领。那二犯现收禁江宁县监，还有从犯一名汪升，已经身故了。但不知他嗣子下落，须问石翁便知。
梅侍郎听了，心里颇为恺恻，又想：「`,en:`"The constables of Ji'an Prefecture have apprehended the thieves, Zhang Gui and Qian De. A search yielded one fragment of a credential belonging to the Assistant Prefect of Nanchang Prefecture, two leather trunks containing three hundred and seventeen taels of silver, one gold bracelet, and several garments. These have all been forwarded`}]},"char-194":{8:[{paragraph:12,mentions:1,tokens:["掌柜"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"出了戏园，两个跟兔的跟着。聘才问仲雨道：「那个馆子好？」仲雨道：「前面的春阳馆就很好。」不多几步，走进了馆子，掌柜的都站了起来，叫声」张老爷，新年好！升官发财。」又作了个揖，仲雨也应酬了几句。拣了个雅座，仲雨首坐，元茂第二，聘才第三，二喜、保珠一凳坐了。走堂的送了茶，便请点菜。仲雨让元茂、聘才，二人又推仲雨先点，仲雨要的是瓦块鱼，烩鸭腰，聘才要的是炸肫、火腿。保",en:'replied, "The Chunyang Restaurant just ahead is quite excellent." A few short steps brought them inside, where the manager immediately rose to his feet. "Master Zhang, a happy New Year to you! May you rise in rank and prosper!" he called out, bowing deeply. Zhongyu offered a few polite pleasantries in return. They selected an elegant private room, with Zhongyu taking the'},{paragraph:29,mentions:1,tokens:["掌柜"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"？」走堂的道：「不敢多开。」聘才对元茂道：「你醉了不要多话，咱们到柜上去写罢。」遂到柜上，走堂的又交代了一遍，掌柜的把算盘拨了一回，看着聘才、元茂道：「你们二位是同着张二老爷来的，怎么张二老爷又先走了。你们二位同他是同乡还是什么？」聘才道：「我们是亲戚，他有事先走了。」掌柜的又问道：「你们二位贵姓？寓在什么地方？到京来有什么贵干？」聘才答了几句，问他要帐条子，掌",en:'settle the bill at the counter." They approached the front desk, where the waiter recited the total once more. The manager clicked his abacus beads, then looked sharply at Pincai and Yuanmao. "You two arrived with Master Zhang, yet he has already departed. Are you his fellow provincials, or something else?" Pincai replied smoothly, "We are relatives. He had pressing business'}],21:[{paragraph:13,mentions:1,tokens:["掌柜"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"「细听起来，这魏聘才真是个小人，你问他怎的，不如不提他为妙。」素兰道：「不为别的，我昨日在春阳楼吃饭，听得说，掌柜的闹了一件事，得罪了华公府一个师爷，便送到兵马司，打了二十个嘴巴，还出脱了几十吊钱，又是两桌酒席。",en:`all."

Sulan said, "It is nothing in particular. Yesterday I was eating at the Spring Sun Tower and heard that the proprietor had got into trouble — he had offended one of the secretaries from the Hua mansion, and was taken off to the gendarmerie and given twenty slaps, and had to part with several tens of strings of cash besides, and stand two tables of wine.`},{paragraph:14,mentions:1,tokens:["掌柜"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"里。」素兰道：「我听走堂的说起来，却说得原原委委。新年上，这姓魏的同了几个人，带着保珠、二喜，吃了五十几吊钱，掌柜的因不认识，写账的时候，想必说了什么话。",en:`told the tale end to end. New Year's week this Wei and others brought Baozhu and Erxi — fifty-odd strings — the boss did not know him and must have spoken out of turn when tallying credit."`},{paragraph:15,mentions:1,tokens:["掌柜"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"还钱又零零碎碎的，此刻还没有清楚。前日听说同了两个人，倒带了五个相公，从已初进馆，到申正才散，算账有七十余吊。掌柜的不晓得他是华公府出来的，便支支吾吾的不肯写，又说前账未清的话。那姓魏的酒也醉了，就把笔摔了，又把大砚台一推，推下柜去，可可里头放着一桌家伙，砸得粉碎。掌柜的不依，喧嚷起来，经众人劝散了。只得仍就写了票子，票子上写的是华公府师老爷。掌柜的就着了忙，一",en:"did not break up until the middle of the shen hour; the reckoning came to more than seventy strings of cash. The proprietor did not know he belonged to the Hua ducal mansion, so he hesitated over writing the charge ticket and muttered something about the old account remaining unpaid. Wei was drunk. He flung down the brush, then gave the great inkstone such a shove that it"}],24:[{paragraph:1,mentions:1,tokens:["掌柜"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"泰水听见了，是要气坏的。」仲清道：「我还听得说，那魏聘才进了华公府，就变了相，在外边很不安分：闹了春阳馆，送了掌柜的，打了二十还不要紧。又听得陆素兰对人说，魏聘才买出华公府一个车夫，一个三小子，去糟蹋琴言，直骂了半天。琴言的人磕头请安赔了不是，又送了他几吊钱才走。「王恂道：「奇了，这几天就有这许多事。我们从前看了这两个人都是斯斯文文的，再不料如今作出这些事来，真",en:"changed his tune. He behaves with utter insolence outside. He caused a massive uproar at the Chunyang Restaurant—the proprietor was beaten twenty strokes, and that wasn't even the worst of it. Lu Sulan says Pincai hired a groom and a page boy from the Hua household to ruthlessly bully Qinyan. They hurled abuse for half the day, until Qinyan's people were forced to kowtow, apologize,"}],47:[{paragraph:7,mentions:1,tokens:["黄掌柜"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"子是我寺里的，前年师兄租与一家住了，吊死了两个人，那家就搬了出去。以后常常的闹鬼，所以闲空了一年。前月春阳馆的黄掌柜的来，看这屋子好开庄子，与我搭伙计，我出了四千吊钱，才开了三天。有个厨子会做几样菜，一样烧鸭子，已是压倒通京城的了，还有一样生炒翅子，是人家做不来的。靠你能的福，这几天倒也拥挤不开，城里头有几位相好也赶出来。却还有一样比别处好，后头一重门开通，就是魏",en:"themselves, and the family moved out. Afterward, it was often haunted, so it sat empty for a year. Last month Manager Huang of the Spring Sun Pavilion came looking; seeing the place well-suited for a dining house, he partnered with me. I put up four thousand strings of cash, and we opened just three days ago. We have a chef who makes a few fine dishes—his roast duck is already"}],50:[{paragraph:6,mentions:1,tokens:["掌柜"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"了花卉，大天篷凉爽得很。倒是那里好。」即催了春喜，换了衣裳，都上车，到了安吉堂对门车厂里，卸了车。文泽等走进，掌柜的忙出柜迎接，即引到后面一个密室，却是三间，隔去一间，并预备了床帐枕席。外面摆了两个座儿，一圆一方，都是金漆的的桌凳。上面铺炕，挂了四幅屏画，是画些螃蟹，倒还画得象样。上头挂一块桃红绸子的贺额，写着「九重春色」四字，上款是「归云禅师长兄、瑞林亲台长兄",en:"arriving at the carriage-yard across from Anji Hall, where they dismounted. As Wenze and the others entered, the manager rushed out from the counter to welcome them, guiding them to a secluded suite in the back. It consisted of three rooms, one partitioned off, complete with a prepared bed, curtains, pillows, and mats. In the outer room sat two sets of tables and stools—one"}]},"char-195":{34:[{paragraph:9,mentions:1,tokens:["掌柜的"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"你的车，到那里去办得齐全，你就带了票子出去。如一家办不齐，再找别家。」于是二人上车，不到半里路，到了一个银号，掌柜的招呼到里面。送过了茶，富三道：「我有一件事特来商量，替我出一张二千四百两的银票，到三十日早上来取。」",en:'two men boarded the carriage and, after traveling less than half a li, arrived at an exchange house, where the manager ushered them inside. After serving tea, Fu the Third said, "I have a specific matter to discuss. I need you to issue me a bank draft for two thousand four hundred taels of silver, to be withdrawn on the morning of the thirtieth."'},{paragraph:10,mentions:3,tokens:["掌柜的"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"掌柜的道：「若早两天也不难，但今天已是二十六了，这两天也忙得很，恐怕凑不上来。」富三道：「你家凑不上来，还有谁家凑得上来？」掌柜的道：「三爷，你难道不知道近来银号的银子家家都窄，而且也真少，外面的帐又归还不进来。看这两天能收下来，如能足数固好，不然有多少兑",en:`The manager replied, "If it had been two days earlier, it wouldn't have been difficult. But today is already the twenty-sixth, and these next couple of days are extremely busy; I'm afraid we won't be able to scrape it all together." Fu the Third retorted, "If your`},{paragraph:11,mentions:2,tokens:["掌柜的"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"掌柜的只得应了，出了一千四百两。聘才对富三说：「叫他分开了写，两张五百，一张四百，适或人家今年使不了这许多，留两张明年来取呢。」富三道：「有理。」就照数开了三张。富三收了票子，别了掌柜的，上了车，再找两个银号，都说不能。富三没法，别家都是生的，没有往来，只",en:'Having no other choice, the manager agreed and issued a draft for one thousand four hundred taels. Pincai advised Fu the Third, "Tell him to write it out in separate drafts: two for five hundred and one for four hundred. Just in case the recipient cannot use so much this year, they can'}]},"char-196":{56:[{paragraph:22,mentions:1,tokens:["老年掌柜"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"琴仙也只得睡下，恍恍惚惚的，一会觉自己走出寺来，见对面有个书铺，招牌写着华正昌三字，有个老年掌柜的照应了他。琴仙即进铺内，忽听锣声锽锽，又接着作乐之声。回头看时，见一对对的旌旗幡盖，仪从纷纭，还有那金盔金甲，执刀列道，香烟成字，宝盖蟠云，玉女金童，华妆妙像，过了有半个时辰。末后见一座七香宝辇，坐着一位女神，正大华容，珠璎蔽面。看这些仪仗并那尊神",en:'out of the temple and saw a bookshop situated directly opposite; the wooden sign read "Hua Zhengchang," and an elderly shopkeeper warmly greeted him. Qinxian entered the shop, but suddenly, loud gongs rang out, followed closely by majestic music. Looking back outside, he saw pairs of vibrant banners and silken canopies, accompanied by a bustling, magnificent retinue. Figures clad'}]},"char-197":{46:[{paragraph:2,mentions:1,tokens:["季十矮子"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"，也不能涂改一字。」子云道：「是石刻好呢，还是木刻好呢？」道翁道：「论长久，自然是石刻。前日见金吉甫相熟的那个季十矮子，刻工尚好，不过价值大些，然此是市井的常理。你莫若找吉甫将他荐来一刻，是极妙的。不是说要刻在含万楼屏风上？却也好看。」次贤称善。子云即叫书童找出了八张大宣纸，照着屏风大小裁好了，送到海棠春圃，请道翁亲笔自书。此时春航、南湘场事已毕，子云定了二十八日，",en:'alter a stroke." Ziyun asked: "Stone inscription or woodblock?" Daoweng said: "For longevity, stone. That carver Ji the Tenth who knows Jin Jifu does honest work—dearer than common, but markets are markets. Ask Jifu to recommend him for the cutting. Was it meant for the Tower of Myriad Containment screen? Splendid display." Cixian approved. Ziyun had pages fetch eight sheets'}],47:[{paragraph:1,mentions:1,tokens:["季十矮子"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"时也是真心拜倒。明日子云又请金吉甫到园，将那些联额看了，吉甫亦甚佩服。请道翁用真行字，写了十六扇屏风，吉甫荐的季十矮子在园中刻起来。",en:"voiced high praise. Daoweng was invited to brush the characters in flowing cursive for a sixteen-panel screen, and Ji the Tenth Dwarf, whom Jifu recommended, set to carving them within the garden."}],60:[{paragraph:5,mentions:1,tokens:["季十矮子"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"「做传容易，画画难，还要刻石，更须时日，不知几天可以告成？」吉甫道：「不消多日，碑是磨现成的，一面画，一面就叫季十矮子找人刻，大约十几天是必要的，嵌好这些碑，也要几天。我们这一叙，总在九香园了，索性多歇几天，我好加意画画，到二月初一日，在九香园聚会罢。」大家都说有理，于是各散。",en:'replied, "It will not take many. The steles are already polished. We can paint and carve simultaneously by having Ji the Tenth Dwarf find artisans. It should take about a dozen days, plus a few more to inset the stones. Since our gathering is here at Nine-Fragrance Garden anyway, let us stay a few more days so I can devote myself to the painting. We shall reconvene here on the first'}]},"char-198":{10:[{paragraph:42,mentions:2,tokens:["玉龄"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"宝珠笑道：「这个要问你的玉侬。」子云笑着唤道：「玉龄！你再来给梅少爷瞧瞧。」只见里面套间内走出一个人来，却是头里那个假琴言，垂手正色，侍立在子云身旁。这假琴言是华公子家八龄班内的一个，名字叫玉龄，本是子云家人，送给华公子。因其面貌有些相像，所以叫回应用。这就是子云移花接木之计。",en:'Baozhu laughed brightly: "That is something you must ask your own Yunong." Ziyun, still laughing, called out: "Yuling! Come and show yourself again for Master Mei." From the inner suite there emerged a person. It was the false Qinyan from before, standing with arms at his sides, composed and upright, attending quietly beside Ziyun. This false Qinyan was a member of'},{paragraph:43,mentions:4,tokens:["玉龄"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"言，实在是假的，疑团尽释。子云道：「我是要试试庾香的眼力，所以刻画无盐，唐突西子。今果被识透，足见高明。」就令玉龄取了两个大玉杯来道：「你代我敬梅少爷一杯。」玉龄斟了，送与子玉。子玉接着道：「酒已多了，天也不早了，我们用饭罢。」子云道：「吾兄若不饮这杯酒，是真怪小弟了。玉龄你替我喝一杯，代我赔罪。」玉龄果将那一杯也斟了，大大的饮了一口。宝珠给他几片春橘过酒，又饮",en:'upon a true beauty. That you saw right through it proves your keen, exceptional perception." He then directed Yuling to bring two large jade cups and ordered: "Present a cup to Master Mei on my behalf." Yuling poured and brought the cup to Ziyu. Ziyu received it and said: "The wine has already been far too much, and the evening grows late, so let us have our rice."'}],11:[{paragraph:2,mentions:1,tokens:["玉龄"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"「就算你如此，难道你那些朋友也是这样么？」子云道：「他们若不是这样，就与我冰炭不入了。方才我不是说那梅庾香，教玉龄略说了两句戏话，他就气得什么似的，连我都骂起来，这不是可以相信的么？况那几个孩子也不喜人与他戏谑的。」说了一会闲话，袁夫人说起明日是华夫人生日，且系二十岁正寿，是必要去走一走的。子云道：「自然该去，且你去年生日他也过来，还送了好些东西，我们也备几样玩",en:`and ice. Did I not just tell you how Mei Yuxiang erupted in fury, even turning his wrath upon me, merely because Yuling uttered a few flirtatious jests? Does that not prove their honor? Moreover, the boys themselves disdain such frivolous teasing." They conversed a while longer until Mrs. Yuan said that the next day was Lady Hua's twentieth birthday, a milestone of great`},{paragraph:5,mentions:1,tokens:["玉龄"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"是华夫人生日，外边恰一概不知。昨日公子与夫人家宴了一日，命八龄班唱了一天戏。这八龄名字都有一个龄字，无非金龄、玉龄、兰龄、桂龄之类。有几个是家童教的，有几个是各班选的。虽不能如《花选》中之名旦，却也胜于寻常戏旦，闲时原叫其伺候书房。",en:"the Eight-Ages Troupe. Every boy in the troupe bore the character 'ling' (Age) in his name, known as Golden-Age, Jade-Age, Orchid-Age, Cassia-Age, and the like. Some were cultivated by the household's private tutors, while others had been handpicked from renowned traveling companies. Though they could not rival the legendary female-role performers celebrated in the *Selection"}],19:[{paragraph:2,mentions:1,tokens:["玉龄"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"一日，林珊枝教玉龄唱曲，适值聘才闲闯进来，珊枝就请他坐了，一面教着。刚刚这曲子是聘才最得意的，便在旁帮起腔来，五音不乱，唇齿分明，竟唱得出神入妙，把个林珊枝倒惊倒了。即由此相好，就在华公子面前，朝朝暮暮，称赞聘才。",en:"One day, Lin Shanzhi was teaching Yuling to sing an aria when Pincai happened to wander in. Shanzhi invited him to sit while he continued the lesson. As it happened, this aria was one of Pincai's favorites, so he began to sing along from the sidelines; his pitch was flawless and his articulation"}],21:[{paragraph:7,mentions:1,tokens:["玉龄"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"才故意冷笑一声，不言语。琴言心上更动了疑：「难道庾香近来真不记得我了，难道他与别人又相好么？」因又想道：「那日玉龄这么引他，他却如此发气，断无与别人相好之理。聘才的话支支吾吾，半吞半吐，似乎又有些隐情在内。他说进城住了，是已不在庾香处，怎么又晓得庾香的事呢，若庾香竟没一毫的事，他又何必来诳我呢。」便怔怔的低了头想，又想道：「这聘才也不是什么好人，他向来的话，是信",en:`Qinyan's heart. "Can Yuxiang truly have forgotten me? Has he formed an attachment elsewhere?" Then he remembered how Yuling had tried to entice Yuxiang that day, and how angry Yuxiang had become: surely a man who reacted so could not have taken another favorite. Yet Pincai kept halting and swallowing half his words, as though some secret lay behind them. He claimed to be`}],41:[{paragraph:3,mentions:1,tokens:["玉龄"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"华公子急把钓竿一拽，丝纶已断，那鱼连钓吞下半截，断丝尚浮在水面。公子看了，一时高兴，便叫金龄、玉龄去将小船撑过来。",en:"broken end of the line floated on the water. Delighted by the spectacle, the young master called out to Jinling and Yuling to bring the little boat around."},{paragraph:4,mentions:2,tokens:["玉龄"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"跑的去了。过了桥，到了潭水房山对岸。金龄走忙了，不防脚碰着个老树根，栽了一交，跌得膝盖甚疼，蹲在地下站不起来。玉龄将他扶起，揉了几揉，同下了船，解了缆。这小船也三丈余长，油漆光亮，两边栏杆，船头有个亭子，中舱摆个小花梨圆桌。船篷上是绿油布顶，垂下白绫飞沿。金龄、玉龄在两头荡桨，荡了过来。华公子见此春光明媚，桃李齐芳，即叫小丫鬟去请夫人出来逛园。",en:"tripped over it, and tumbled down, badly scraping his knee, and for a moment could not get up from the ground. Yuling helped him to his feet and rubbed the knee until the pain eased, then together they climbed into the little craft, cast off the mooring lines, and sculled it across. The boat was over thirty feet long, its paintwork gleaming bright; railings ran along"},{paragraph:37,mentions:1,tokens:["玉龄"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"。园里这两个老婆子收拾东西，虽有两个小丫头帮着他，一次也还拿不完。来时有六珠帮他拿些，如今只得央求珊枝、金龄、玉龄帮他拿了几样。",en:"the way in, the Six Zhus had helped carry some items; now they had no recourse but to beg Shanzhi, Jinling, and Yuling to carry several loads for them."}],52:[{paragraph:24,mentions:1,tokens:["玉龄"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"时新秋，天气尚热，也不须多带衣服，带了一个小锦箱、一个锦匣，装些花钿脂粉。外面叫一个老年的管家骑了顶马，金龄、玉龄、兰龄、桂龄骑了跟班马。华夫人出房到内花厅，就坐肩舆，出了垂花门，上了车，另有车道。绕过大堂，家人方上马，随后八辆大鞍车，坐了群婢。雕轮绣幰，流水一般的出城。来到了田宅，众夫人已到。田老夫人迎下阶来，群珠扶拥着夫人进来。田老夫人一见，真是仙娥下降，玉",en:"and a casket containing cosmetics and ornaments. Outside, an elderly steward rode the lead horse, while Jinling, Yuling, Lanling, and Guiling rode escort. Leaving her chambers, Lady Hua took a shoulder sedan from the inner flower hall, passed through the hanging-flower gate, and boarded her carriage via a separate lane. Bypassing the main hall, her retinue mounted their"}]},"char-199":{11:[{paragraph:5,mentions:1,tokens:["金龄"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"这日是华夫人生日，外边恰一概不知。昨日公子与夫人家宴了一日，命八龄班唱了一天戏。这八龄名字都有一个龄字，无非金龄、玉龄、兰龄、桂龄之类。有几个是家童教的，有几个是各班选的。虽不能如《花选》中之名旦，却也胜于寻常戏旦，闲时原叫其伺候书房。",en:"till dusk by the Eight-Ages Troupe. Every boy in the troupe bore the character 'ling' (Age) in his name, known as Golden-Age, Jade-Age, Orchid-Age, Cassia-Age, and the like. Some were cultivated by the household's private tutors, while others had been handpicked from renowned traveling companies. Though they could not rival the legendary female-role performers celebrated in"}],41:[{paragraph:2,mentions:1,tokens:["金龄"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"一日在园中归鸿小渚倚阑垂钓，珊枝与金、玉二龄，还有一个小丫鬟香儿，在傍伺候。金龄找了一个大瓷瓯，走下池边贮了水。华公子钓了一回，得了三寸长的一个小鱼，已觉满心欢喜。见那池水清冷，每于潆流洄互处，把些铜皮嵌在石脚，那流水过来便有琤琮之声，如琴筑一般。又见水面上飞了无数的花瓣，一个红鲤鱼游来游去，吃那飞花，见了钓丝上的饵，便来吞了。",en:"railing at Returning Geese Islet in the garden, rod in hand, fishing at the water's edge. Shanzhi and the two pages Jinling and Yuling attended him, along with a little maidservant named Xiang'er. Jinling had fetched a large porcelain basin and filled it with water at the pond's edge to hold any catch. The young master had been fishing for a while and caught a small fish"},{paragraph:3,mentions:1,tokens:["金龄"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"华公子急把钓竿一拽，丝纶已断，那鱼连钓吞下半截，断丝尚浮在水面。公子看了，一时高兴，便叫金龄、玉龄去将小船撑过来。",en:"and the broken end of the line floated on the water. Delighted by the spectacle, the young master called out to Jinling and Yuling to bring the little boat around."},{paragraph:4,mentions:2,tokens:["金龄"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"那二龄听不得一声，走下台基，便飞跑的去了。过了桥，到了潭水房山对岸。金龄走忙了，不防脚碰着个老树根，栽了一交，跌得膝盖甚疼，蹲在地下站不起来。玉龄将他扶起，揉了几揉，同下了船，解了缆。这小船也三丈余长，油漆光亮，两边栏杆，船头有个亭子，中舱摆个小花梨圆桌。船篷上是绿油布顶，垂下白绫飞沿。金龄、玉龄在两头荡桨，荡了过来。华",en:"Crossing the bridge, they reached the far shore where the hillside of the Tanshui Pavilion stood. In his haste, Jinling failed to notice an old tree root underfoot, tripped over it, and tumbled down, badly scraping his knee, and for a moment could not get up from the ground. Yuling helped him to his feet and rubbed the knee until the pain eased, then together they climbed"},{paragraph:37,mentions:1,tokens:["金龄"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"进内室。园里这两个老婆子收拾东西，虽有两个小丫头帮着他，一次也还拿不完。来时有六珠帮他拿些，如今只得央求珊枝、金龄、玉龄帮他拿了几样。",en:"single trip. On the way in, the Six Zhus had helped carry some items; now they had no recourse but to beg Shanzhi, Jinling, and Yuling to carry several loads for them."}],52:[{paragraph:24,mentions:1,tokens:["金龄"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"妇。此时新秋，天气尚热，也不须多带衣服，带了一个小锦箱、一个锦匣，装些花钿脂粉。外面叫一个老年的管家骑了顶马，金龄、玉龄、兰龄、桂龄骑了跟班马。华夫人出房到内花厅，就坐肩舆，出了垂花门，上了车，另有车道。绕过大堂，家人方上马，随后八辆大鞍车，坐了群婢。雕轮绣幰，流水一般的出城。来到了田宅，众夫人已到。田老夫人迎下阶来，群珠扶拥着夫人进来。田老夫人一见，真是仙娥下",en:"chest and a casket containing cosmetics and ornaments. Outside, an elderly steward rode the lead horse, while Jinling, Yuling, Lanling, and Guiling rode escort. Leaving her chambers, Lady Hua took a shoulder sedan from the inner flower hall, passed through the hanging-flower gate, and boarded her carriage via a separate lane. Bypassing the main hall, her retinue mounted"}]},"char-200":{11:[{paragraph:5,mentions:1,tokens:["兰龄"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"人生日，外边恰一概不知。昨日公子与夫人家宴了一日，命八龄班唱了一天戏。这八龄名字都有一个龄字，无非金龄、玉龄、兰龄、桂龄之类。有几个是家童教的，有几个是各班选的。虽不能如《花选》中之名旦，却也胜于寻常戏旦，闲时原叫其伺候书房。",en:"Eight-Ages Troupe. Every boy in the troupe bore the character 'ling' (Age) in his name, known as Golden-Age, Jade-Age, Orchid-Age, Cassia-Age, and the like. Some were cultivated by the household's private tutors, while others had been handpicked from renowned traveling companies. Though they could not rival the legendary female-role performers celebrated in the *Selection of Flowers*,"}],52:[{paragraph:24,mentions:1,tokens:["兰龄"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"，天气尚热，也不须多带衣服，带了一个小锦箱、一个锦匣，装些花钿脂粉。外面叫一个老年的管家骑了顶马，金龄、玉龄、兰龄、桂龄骑了跟班马。华夫人出房到内花厅，就坐肩舆，出了垂花门，上了车，另有车道。绕过大堂，家人方上马，随后八辆大鞍车，坐了群婢。雕轮绣幰，流水一般的出城。来到了田宅，众夫人已到。田老夫人迎下阶来，群珠扶拥着夫人进来。田老夫人一见，真是仙娥下降，玉女临凡",en:"casket containing cosmetics and ornaments. Outside, an elderly steward rode the lead horse, while Jinling, Yuling, Lanling, and Guiling rode escort. Leaving her chambers, Lady Hua took a shoulder sedan from the inner flower hall, passed through the hanging-flower gate, and boarded her carriage via a separate lane. Bypassing the main hall, her retinue mounted their horses,"}]},"char-201":{11:[{paragraph:5,mentions:1,tokens:["桂龄"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"，外边恰一概不知。昨日公子与夫人家宴了一日，命八龄班唱了一天戏。这八龄名字都有一个龄字，无非金龄、玉龄、兰龄、桂龄之类。有几个是家童教的，有几个是各班选的。虽不能如《花选》中之名旦，却也胜于寻常戏旦，闲时原叫其伺候书房。",en:"Every boy in the troupe bore the character 'ling' (Age) in his name, known as Golden-Age, Jade-Age, Orchid-Age, Cassia-Age, and the like. Some were cultivated by the household's private tutors, while others had been handpicked from renowned traveling companies. Though they could not rival the legendary female-role performers celebrated in the *Selection of Flowers*, their"}],52:[{paragraph:24,mentions:1,tokens:["桂龄"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"尚热，也不须多带衣服，带了一个小锦箱、一个锦匣，装些花钿脂粉。外面叫一个老年的管家骑了顶马，金龄、玉龄、兰龄、桂龄骑了跟班马。华夫人出房到内花厅，就坐肩舆，出了垂花门，上了车，另有车道。绕过大堂，家人方上马，随后八辆大鞍车，坐了群婢。雕轮绣幰，流水一般的出城。来到了田宅，众夫人已到。田老夫人迎下阶来，群珠扶拥着夫人进来。田老夫人一见，真是仙娥下降，玉女临凡。走上",en:"cosmetics and ornaments. Outside, an elderly steward rode the lead horse, while Jinling, Yuling, Lanling, and Guiling rode escort. Leaving her chambers, Lady Hua took a shoulder sedan from the inner flower hall, passed through the hanging-flower gate, and boarded her carriage via a separate lane. Bypassing the main hall, her retinue mounted their horses, followed by"}]},"char-202":{22:[{paragraph:4,mentions:1,tokens:["凤林"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"篷，便道：「不是我性子不好，实在情理不堪，就是六十二斤半，我也见过，倒没有见过这样大相公。你们打听打听，春林、凤林这么红的人，你三太爷点一点头，马上就跟了来，从没有上门不见人，叫人挡住，又撒谎说病着呢。猴儿崽子，躲著作什么，又不是少只眼睛，短条腿儿，见不得人。」那青衣的站起来说道：「老三算了，咱们也要吃饭去了。」那人道：「到那里去吃饭？就叫他们预备饭，咱们吃了再",en:"I've seen sixty-two catties and a half in my day, but never so grand a xianggong as this. Go ask about: Chunlin, Fenglin — boys as red as they are come running the moment your Third Grandpa nods his head. Never once have I stood at a door and been denied, blocked by servants and fobbed off with lies about sickness. The monkey's cub! What is he skulking for? He's not missing"},{paragraph:32,mentions:1,tokens:["凤林"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"「我竟一个都不相识，不知是那一班的？素兰道：「我都认识。坐在怀里的，是登春班的玉美，那弹弦子的叫春林，唱的是叫凤林，皆是凤台班的。」子玉道：「看他们如此作乐，其实有何乐处？他若见了我们这番光景，自然倒说寂寥无味了。」",en:'one held in his arms is Yumei of the Dengchun troupe; the one at the strings is called Chunlin, and the singer Fenglin — both of the Fengtai troupe." Ziyu said: "Look at them at their pleasures — what pleasure is really in it? And were they to see this scene of ours, no doubt they would call it dreary and flavorless."'}],23:[{paragraph:13,mentions:1,tokens:["凤林"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"这日孙嗣徽请他吃饭听戏，先听了凤台班的戏，带了凤林，拣了个馆子，进雅座坐了。这姬先生倒有一个俊俏的跟班，年纪约十五六岁，是徽州人，在剃头铺里学徒弟的，叫作巴老英。",en:"and listen to an opera. First, they enjoyed a performance by the Fengtai Troupe, then brought along the actor Fenglin, chose a restaurant, and settled into a private elegant room. This Mr. Ji was accompanied by a rather handsome young attendant of about fifteen or sixteen, a native of Huizhou who had been an apprentice in a barber shop, named Ba Laoying."},{paragraph:14,mentions:2,tokens:["凤林"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"以青蚨十千买得，改名英官，打扮起来也还好看。日间是主仆称呼，晚间为妻妾侍奉。当下嗣徽见了也觉垂涎。二人点了菜，凤林敬了几杯酒，那巴英官似气忿忿的站在后面。凤林最伶透，便知他是个卯君，忙招呼了他，问了姓，叫了几声巴二爷，方才踱了出去，姬亮轩才放了心。如今见了京中小旦，觉比外省的好了几倍：第一是款式好，第二是衣服好，第三是应酬好，说话好，因对嗣徽道：「外省小旦相貌却",en:"served as a concubine. Upon seeing him, Sihui could not help but drool with desire. The two ordered dishes, and Fenglin offered a few toasts of wine. Ba Yingguan stood behind them, seemingly brimming with resentful anger. Fenglin, being exceptionally perceptive, realized the boy was a fellow practitioner of the trade. He hastily greeted him, asked his surname, and called"},{paragraph:16,mentions:2,tokens:["凤林"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"徽尚是不懂，连问何故？一个是信口胡柴，一个是胸无墨水，弄得彼此所问非所答，直闹得一团糟了，亮轩便不与他说。因问凤林道：「你们作相公，一年算起来可弄得多少钱？」凤林道：「钱多钱少是师傅的，我们尽取老爷们赏几件衣裳穿着，及到出了师，方算自己的。」亮轩道：「此时一年，师傅挣得钱多少呢？」",en:'sequiturs, spiraling into total confusion, until Liangxuan gave up trying to converse with him. Instead, he turned to Fenglin and asked, "You young gentlemen, how much money can you make in a year?" Fenglin replied, "The bulk of the money goes to the master. We only keep whatever garments the gentlemen bestow upon us. Only after our apprenticeship is complete does the money'},{paragraph:17,mentions:3,tokens:["凤林"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"凤林道：「也拿不定，一年牵算起来，三四千吊钱是长有的。」亮轩吐出舌头道：「有这许多？比我们作刑钱的束修还多呢！我如今倒也懊悔，从前也应该学戏，倒比学幕还快活些。我们收徒弟是赔钱贴饭，学不成的，十年八年，推不出去，即有荐出去的，或到半年三月又回来了。到得徒",en:`Fenglin said, "It's hard to say for certain. Averaged over a year, three or four thousand strings of cash is typical." Liangxuan stuck out his tongue in astonishment: "That much? That's more than we legal secretaries earn in tuition fees! I truly regret it now;`},{paragraph:19,mentions:4,tokens:["凤林"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"。绥之斯来，盎于背，将入门，则茅塞之矣，如之何则可。而国人皆曰：若大路然。吾斯之未能信，明以教我，请尝试之。」凤林不晓得他说些什么，便送了一杯酒，又暗数他脸上的疙瘩，及鼻子上的红糟点儿，共有三十余处，问道：「你到底说话叫人明白才好。我实在不懂得你这脸上会好不会好。我有个方子给你用香糟十斤，猪油三斤，羊胰一斤，皂荚四两，银硝四两，铺在蒸笼内，蒸得熟了。你把脸贴在上",en:'countrymen say: it is like a great road. I cannot yet believe this; enlighten me clearly, let me attempt it." Fenglin had no idea what nonsense he was spouting, so he offered him a cup of wine and secretly counted the pockmarks and red rosacea spots on his nose—totaling more than thirty. He asked, "It would be best if you spoke clearly so people can understand. I truly'},{paragraph:20,mentions:4,tokens:["凤林"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"凤林把嗣徽脸上，轻轻的打了一掌，两个眼瞪瞪儿的说道：「人家嫌你这红鼻子，我倒爱他。」索性把嗣徽的脸捧了乱擦，跳下来笑道：「也算打了个手铳罢。嗣徽赶过来，要拧他的嘴，凤林跑出屋子，嗣徽赶出去，凤林又进来了，嗣徽便狠起那斑斑驳驳的面皮道：「你若到我手，我决不",en:`Fenglin lightly slapped Sihui's face, glaring at him with wide eyes, "Others may despise this red nose of yours, but I quite love it." He then boldly grabbed Sihui's face and rubbed it vigorously, jumped down, and laughed, "Consider that a hand-job!" Sihui chased`},{paragraph:21,mentions:1,tokens:["凤林"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"凤林又敬了亮轩几杯，那个巴英官红着脸，在廊下走来走去。姬亮轩叫他来装烟，他也不理，又去了。嗣徽见了说道：「大哥，方才小弟要请教你的话，我只知泌水洋洋，可以乐饥。至于蒸豚之味，未曾尝过，不识其中之妙，到底有甚好处，与妻子好合如何？」亮轩笑道：「据我想来，原",en:"Fenglin offered several more toasts to Liangxuan. Meanwhile, Ba Yingguan, his face flushed with jealousy, paced back and forth under the veranda. Ji Liangxuan called him in to prepare the tobacco pipe, but he ignored him and walked away again. Seeing this, Sihui"},{paragraph:22,mentions:4,tokens:["凤林"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"尚未说完，凤林便红脸道：「你这个赶车的，实在讲得透彻。你那辆车是什么车？像是辆河南篷子车。罚你三杯酒，不准说了，说得人这么寒嘇。」嗣徽道：「快哉，快哉！竟是闻所未闻。小弟船倒天天坐的，车却总坐不进。到了门口，竟非人力可通，又恐坐着了粪车，则人皆掩鼻而过矣。」亮轩笑",en:'Before he could finish, Fenglin flushed and interrupted: "You cart driver, you certainly explain things thoroughly! What kind of cart is yours? Sounds like a covered Henan wagon. I fine you three cups of wine—you are forbidden from speaking further! You speak with such vulgarity."'}],24:[{paragraph:8,mentions:1,tokens:["凤林"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"当不起这考语。」王恂道：「还有几个人索性请你批评批评。」桂保笑道：「是谁？」王恂道：「蓉官、二喜、玉美、春林、凤林，这些人又是怎样？」桂保笑道：「这又是一路，不与我们往来的。我们是玉虚门下弟子，是兴周伐纣的，他们是通天教主门人，是助纣为虐的。这些人是龟灵圣母、申公豹等类，却也有些旁门左道的神通，倒也利害。我们那一日运气不好？与他们同席，便小小心心的待他，断不敢取",en:'the day." Yulin modestly demurred. Wang Xun then asked for their judgment on Rongguan, Erxi, Yumei, Chunlin, and Fenglin—the outsiders. Guibao laughed, "They belong to an entirely different school! We are the disciples of the Yuqing gate, crusading for the Zhou; they are of the Tongtian sect, aiding the tyrants—they are like the tortoise-spirit and Shen Gongbao. They possess'}]},"char-203":{22:[{paragraph:4,mentions:1,tokens:["春林"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"只好收篷，便道：「不是我性子不好，实在情理不堪，就是六十二斤半，我也见过，倒没有见过这样大相公。你们打听打听，春林、凤林这么红的人，你三太爷点一点头，马上就跟了来，从没有上门不见人，叫人挡住，又撒谎说病着呢。猴儿崽子，躲著作什么，又不是少只眼睛，短条腿儿，见不得人。」那青衣的站起来说道：「老三算了，咱们也要吃饭去了。」那人道：「到那里去吃饭？就叫他们预备饭，咱们",en:"bearing. I've seen sixty-two catties and a half in my day, but never so grand a xianggong as this. Go ask about: Chunlin, Fenglin — boys as red as they are come running the moment your Third Grandpa nods his head. Never once have I stood at a door and been denied, blocked by servants and fobbed off with lies about sickness. The monkey's cub! What is he skulking for? He's"},{paragraph:32,mentions:1,tokens:["春林"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"么？」琴言道：「我竟一个都不相识，不知是那一班的？素兰道：「我都认识。坐在怀里的，是登春班的玉美，那弹弦子的叫春林，唱的是叫凤林，皆是凤台班的。」子玉道：「看他们如此作乐，其实有何乐处？他若见了我们这番光景，自然倒说寂寥无味了。」",en:'said: "I know them all. The one held in his arms is Yumei of the Dengchun troupe; the one at the strings is called Chunlin, and the singer Fenglin — both of the Fengtai troupe." Ziyu said: "Look at them at their pleasures — what pleasure is really in it? And were they to see this scene of ours, no doubt they would call it dreary and flavorless."'}],24:[{paragraph:8,mentions:1,tokens:["春林"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"「我却当不起这考语。」王恂道：「还有几个人索性请你批评批评。」桂保笑道：「是谁？」王恂道：「蓉官、二喜、玉美、春林、凤林，这些人又是怎样？」桂保笑道：「这又是一路，不与我们往来的。我们是玉虚门下弟子，是兴周伐纣的，他们是通天教主门人，是助纣为虐的。这些人是龟灵圣母、申公豹等类，却也有些旁门左道的神通，倒也利害。我们那一日运气不好？与他们同席，便小小心心的待他，断",en:'insight grows by the day." Yulin modestly demurred. Wang Xun then asked for their judgment on Rongguan, Erxi, Yumei, Chunlin, and Fenglin—the outsiders. Guibao laughed, "They belong to an entirely different school! We are the disciples of the Yuqing gate, crusading for the Zhou; they are of the Tongtian sect, aiding the tyrants—they are like the tortoise-spirit and Shen Gongbao.'}],27:[{paragraph:6,mentions:3,tokens:["春林"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"一回，出来坐了一坐；又叫巴英官进去了。仲雨不知其故，只道有事，便与亮轩讲些闲话。这两个相公，一个是蓉官，一个是春林，皆是奚十一常叫的。蓉官对着春林做眼色，春林笑了一笑。亮轩也做眉做眼的，仲雨偶然看见，却不晓得什么，也不便问。蓉官忽问仲雨道：「你能有个相好姓魏的，他初到京时，我就认识他，却不见得怎样。前日我在富三爷家见他，体面得了不得，大鞍子热车，跟班亦骑上马。他",en:`conducted behind the inner door. Zhongyu guessed his errands and chatted with Liangxuan. The two actors, Rongguan and Chunlin, were Xi's usual calls. Rongguan signaled Chunlin, and Chunlin smiled. Liangxuan too rolled his eyes; Zhongyu glimpsed it but didn't grasp it and didn't ask. Rongguan suddenly asked Zhongyu: "You know a patron surnamed Wei. I met him first when he came`},{paragraph:8,mentions:1,tokens:["春林"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"道：「喝得多了。」奚十一道：「好话，快再干两杯，我们豁几拳罢。」仲雨道：「也好。」奚十一就与仲雨、亮轩、蓉官、春林豁了十拳，起初还叫得清，后来便叫出怪声。广东人豁拳是最难听的，像叫些杀狗杀鸭的字音。",en:`and we'll finger-guess." Zhongyu agreed, "Fine." Xi guessed ten rounds with Zhongyu, Liangxuan, Rongguan, and Chunlin. At first his calls were distinct and orderly; as the wine mounted, his tongue tangled and the cries became strange animal noises. Cantonese finger-guessing was notorious for sounding ugly, as though men were shouting the words used to slaughter dogs`},{paragraph:9,mentions:1,tokens:["春林"],kind:"named-mention",zh:`，是好的。」仲雨正要说时，蓉官道：「好什么？只得两三出戏。你叫他陪酒，终席不说话。
要他斟钟酒，是没有的事。」春林道：「好沉架子，到他家去看他，倒是从不会客的。就是从前的王吉庆、李春芳，如今红字号的袁宝珠、苏蕙芳，也没有这么大架子。要他中意的，才陪着坐一坐；不中意的，简直的不理，赏他东西谢也不谢一声，也没有见他给人请安。」奚十一道：「这么样的相公，没有遇见我。若`,en:'he will not open his mouth the whole feast; and as for his pouring you a cup, the thing has never been known." Chunlin added, "And such airs with it! Go to his house and he never receives anybody. Wang Jiqing and Li Chunfang in their day, or Yuan Baozhu and Su Huifang who are the great names now — none of them ever gave themselves such airs. He will sit down with the'}]},"char-204":{34:[{paragraph:21,mentions:2,tokens:["张翠官","翠官"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"宜，而且你还可以常使唤他，相貌也与袁宝珠、苏蕙芳相并。」聘才道：「叫什么名字？」子佩道：「一个叫卓天香，一个叫张翠官。」聘才道：「现在那班里？」子佩道：「在整容班。」聘才道：「整容班这班名很生，我竟没有领教过。」子佩道：「是软篷子里小剃头。」聘才笑道：「呸！你怎么说这些人？」子佩道：「你别轻看他，他比相公还红呢！你瞧那得月的脑袋怎样？」聘才道：「好是好的，然而我不",en:'Baozhu and Su Huifang." Pincai asked, "What are their names?" Zipei said, "One is called Zhuo Tianxiang, the other Zhang Cuiguan." Pincai asked, "Which troupe are they in now?" Zipei said, "The Zhengrong troupe." Pincai said, "The Zhengrong troupe—that name is unfamiliar; I have never had the pleasure." Zipei said, "They are the little barbers of the soft-awning stalls." Pincai'},{paragraph:22,mentions:3,tokens:["翠官"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"，贵大爷病了，张仲雨有事不能来。即补了冯子佩、唐和尚，宾主共七位。聘才叫了蓉官来陪富三，着人到篷子里叫了天香、翠官前来。不多一刻，两个剃头的也坐了大骡车，有一个人跟着，走进寺来。冯子佩是认识的，小剃头的先与子佩请了安，然后向聘才请安。聘才仔细看他，果然生得俊俏，眉目清澄，肌肤洁白，打扮的式样也与相公一般。天香的面色虽白，细看皮肤略粗。翠官伶俐可爱，就是面上有几点",en:"guests. Pincai summoned Rongguan to accompany Fu the Third, and sent someone to the stall to fetch Tianxiang and Cuiguan. Before long, the two barber boys arrived at the temple in a large mule cart, accompanied by a servant. The younger barber, recognizing Zipei, paid his respects to him first before greeting Pincai. Pincai studied him carefully; he was indeed handsome,"},{paragraph:23,mentions:2,tokens:["翠官"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"。那一个也与子佩梳了，然后吃过早饭，开了烟灯，大家吃烟。富三爷先来，唐和尚见富三爷来了，就带了得月进来。天香、翠官与富三、和尚都请了安。富三却不认识，问他是谁，在那一班的，聘才就说是全福班的。随后奚十一、潘三同来。奚十一带了巴英官，潘三带了个学徒弟的小伙计，拿他竟当做跟班的。大家一齐相见了。潘三见了天香、翠官，笑道：「你们怎么也跑了来？」奚十一道：「看来，魏大爷",en:"partook. Fu the Third was the first guest to arrive, and upon seeing him, Monk Tang brought Deyue in. Tianxiang and Cuiguan paid their respects to Fu the Third and the monk. Fu the Third, not recognizing them, asked who they were and which troupe they belonged to; Pincai smoothly claimed they were from the Quanfu Troupe. Soon after, Xi Eleven and Pan the Third arrived together."},{paragraph:24,mentions:1,tokens:["翠官"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"门向各人作了个揖，说：「今日有个内城朋友请我去看阳宅，闹了一天，并邀我去给他们看地，也不过是想外放。」聘才因叫翠官、天香过来见了，说：「这就是很会看风水的杨八老爷，你们何不求他去看看你们的棚子，多会儿发财呢？」富三因接向杨八道：「你要留神呀，不要像乌家的事，看完了找到你门上去。」说罢大家大笑。冯子佩忽然皱了眉说声不好，便到院子里吐起来。慌得大家同来看他。吐了一会",en:`also asked me to evaluate some land for them—they're likely hoping for a provincial appointment." Pincai called Cuiguan and Tianxiang over to meet him, introducing him by saying, "This is Master Yang Eight, who is highly skilled in reading fengshui. Why don't you beg him to inspect your stall and tell you when you'll strike it rich?" Catching the joke, Fu the Third chimed`},{paragraph:25,mentions:2,tokens:["翠官"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"」得月「呸」了一声，涨红了脸，扭转头不看。唐和尚合着掌道：「阿弥陀佛！罪过，罪过！」此时坐的是富三首席，聘才叫翠官陪了他。第二是奚十一，唐和尚知他是个阔手，且知道他爱得月，便叫得月陪了他。杨八坐了第三，聘才叫天香挨着他。潘三坐了第四，自己与唐和尚坐了主位，只不见蓉官来。饮酒之间，撒村笑骂，嘈杂到个不成样子。还是富三稳重些，不过与翠官说些顽笑话，尚不至十分村俗。奚",en:'how sinful!" By this time, the seating was arranged. Fu the Third took the seat of honor, with Pincai assigning Cuiguan to accompany him. Xi Eleven took the second seat; knowing Xi was a generous spender who had a fondness for Deyue, Monk Tang told Deyue to sit with him. Yang Eight took the third seat, and Pincai had Tianxiang sit next to him. Pan the Third sat in the'},{paragraph:27,mentions:2,tokens:["翠官"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"富三歪转身子，拉过翠官问道：「你在铺子里做这买卖，究竟也无甚好处，不如跟我到湖北去罢，可愿不愿呢？」翠官听了道：「你肯带我去吗，你就是我的亲爸爸了。」说罢，便靠在富三怀里，把脸挨近富三嘴边，又说道：「我是不比相公，要花钱出师。当年讲明学徒弟不过三年，如今已满了三年了，要去",en:`Fu the Third twisted his body around, pulled Cuiguan close, and asked, "Plying your trade in that shop doesn't seem to offer much of a future. Why don't you come with me to Hubei instead? Are you willing?" Upon hearing this, Cuiguan replied, "If you're willing to take me, you'll be my very own dear father!"`},{paragraph:28,mentions:1,tokens:["翠官"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"翠官一笑道：「三爷你能好造化，我才叫你能一个干爹爹，就又给你能招了一个来了。」杨八只作未听见，坐在一旁吃水烟。",en:`Cuiguan gave a smile and said, "Third Master, you certainly have good fortune! I had just called you my dear father, and you've already attracted another dependent for yourself." Pretending not to hear, Yang Eight sat to one side, quietly smoking his water pipe.`},{paragraph:29,mentions:2,tokens:["翠官"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"聘才道：「你跟三爷去很好，还有什么不愿的吗。虽然比不得相公出师，也要赏你师父几吊钱。」富三道：「这个自然。」翠官道：「当真的了？」富三道：「当真的了。」翠官便索性扒上富三身上，将头在富三肩上碰了几碰，说道：「我就磕头谢了！好三老爷，好亲爸爸！」富三乐得受不得。潘三见得月躺在奚十一怀里，天香躺在对面，杨八也想吹一口，便坐在炕沿上，歪转身子，压在天香身上。得月上好",en:`formal release fee, we should still tip your master a few strings of cash." Fu the Third agreed, "Naturally." Cuiguan asked, "Is it truly settled?" Fu the Third replied, "It is settled." Cuiguan practically climbed onto Fu the Third, rubbing his head affectionately against Fu the Third's shoulder and saying, "Then I shall kowtow in thanks! Good Third Master, good dear`}],35:[{paragraph:4,mentions:1,tokens:["翠官"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"子，急急走进来，见了众人，请了安，见要散的样子。富三道：「好红相公！十四日叫了，要十五日才来。」蓉官见了天香、翠官，便冷笑道：「既然大家要散了，也要回去。我还要叫剃头的剃头呢。」说罢，把腰一弯，竟自去了。两个剃头的甚是局促，众人也没有话说，各人上车而散。两个剃头的重新进来安慰，聘才每人赏了四两银子，欢喜而去。",en:'sought-after darling! Invited for the fourteenth, yet you only show up on the fifteenth." Seeing Tianxiang and Cuiguan, Rongguan sneered, "Since everyone is about to scatter and go back, I should too. I still need to call the barbers to shave my head." With a slight bow, he turned and left on his own. The two barbers felt extremely awkward, and the others had nothing'}],36:[{paragraph:14,mentions:1,tokens:["翠官"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"「你放心，我断不动粗的。我只要与他坐一坐，怎敢还想别的好处。我还有几样菜着人送来，你快把潘三也叫他出来，天香、翠官也撵开，就摆饭，我去去就来。」说罢，慌慌张张上车去了。",en:`hope for anything more? I have some dishes being sent over. Get Pan the Third out of there, send Tianxiang and Cuiguan away, and set the table. I'll be right back." With that, he hurriedly got into his carriage and left.`},{paragraph:15,mentions:1,tokens:["翠官"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"聘才进来对潘三道：「和尚请你说话。」潘三不得已，迟延的出去，尚回顾了几次。聘才把天香、翠官也打发走了，便故意的对琴言道：「好了，清净了，我也被他们闹昏了，闹得一屋子俗臭不堪。我们如今清清净净谈谈，吃了早饭再去，自然有一会耽搁。」琴言一想，在聘才处吃饭也不妨。况且这些人都去了，自然没有人来，便问聘才道：「今年见过庾香几次了？」聘才随口说道：",en:`with you." Reluctantly, Pan the Third dawdled out, looking back several times. Pincai then sent Tianxiang and Cuiguan away and feigned relief to Qinyan, "Ah, finally some peace and quiet. I was getting dizzy with all their noise, filling the room with such vulgar stench. Let's have a nice, quiet chat. We'll go after breakfast; a little delay won't matter." Qinyan thought`}],40:[{paragraph:9,mentions:2,tokens:["翠官"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"一道：「你要多少钱使？」天香道：「还短十五吊钱，一时竟凑不起来。」奚十一道：「什么事这样紧要？」天香道：「昨日翠官被人讹了八十吊钱，写了欠票与他，今日来取，约明日还他的。」奚十一道：「翠官被什么人讹的？」天香道：「除了草字头，还有谁？昨日叫他们去伺候一天，倒把他捆了起来，说他偷了烟壶，要送北衙门。跟去的人再三央求，他们的人做好做歹，赔他八十吊钱，写了借条，才放出",en:`and I simply can't scrape it together." Xi Eleven said, "What matter is so urgent?" Tianxiang said, "Yesterday Cuiguan was swindled out of eighty strings by some people and signed a promissory note for it; they're coming to collect today, and we promised to pay them back by tomorrow." Xi Eleven said, "Who was it that swindled Cuiguan?" Tianxiang said, "Who else but the`}]},"char-205":JSON.parse(`{"11":[{"paragraph":4,"mentions":1,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"」这浣香十八岁上嫁了华光宿，真是瑶琴玉瑟，鱼水和谐，说不尽咏月吟风，闺房潇洒。又有十个美婢，名字都有一个珠字，宝珠、明珠、爱珠、花珠、荷珠、蕊珠、掌珠、珍珠、画珠、赠珠。这十珠都有十分姿色，年皆十五六岁，真像十样鲜花，一群粉蝶，个个慧心香口，莲步柳腰，针黹巧夺天工，词令皆成妙品。比郑康成之诗婢，少道学之风规，较郭令公之家姬，得风流之香主。华公子夫妇二人这样的妙才","en":"unutterable leisure. Serving them were ten beautiful maids, each bearing the character 'Zhu' (Pearl) in her name: Baozhu, Mingzhu, Aizhu, Huazhu, Hezhu, Ruizhu, Zhangzhu, Zhenzhu, Yazhu, and Zengzhu. All fifteen or sixteen years of age, they bloomed like ten distinct varieties of fresh spring flowers, fluttering like a cluster of powdered butterflies. Each possessed a"},{"paragraph":41,"mentions":4,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"也听得明白，袁夫人笑道：「他们还比我们会乐。」这边红玉掷了一个八不就，便道：「这个名色也难，凑不成的换了罢。」宝珠道：「怎么凑不成，我替你凑，包你一凑就凑上，总不教你八不就。」红玉道：「你说顽话呢，还是正经话？你若刻薄我，我就撕你的嘴。」宝珠道：「我是不喜欢刻薄人的。」便指着红玉说道：八不就，惊梦起鸳鸯，着甚支吾此夜长。脱布衫，中心养养。」这个养字要作痒字解。」","en":"and immediately groaned, \\"This pattern is far too difficult. It cannot be assembled; allow me to throw again.\\" Baozhu interjected, \\"Of course it can be assembled. I shall weave it for you, and I guarantee it will not leave you suffering 'eight refusals.'\\" Hongyu warned her, \\"Are you speaking in jest or earnestness? If you intend to be cruel, I swear I shall tear your"},{"paragraph":46,"mentions":1,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"说道：「通倒也算通，恐怕说了出来，非但不能受赏，更要受罚。」华夫人笑道：「你们且一一的说来。」于是明珠把爱珠、宝珠、荷珠骂人的三个令全说了、红薇也将红雪、红雯、红霙骂人的三个令也说了，笑得两位夫人头上的珠钿斜颤，欲要装做正色责备他们，也装不过来。苏小姐虽嫌他们过于亵狎，然心里也赞他们敏慧，不便大笑，只好微颔而已。","en":"laughed, \\"Go on, recite them one by one.\\" Thus, Mingzhu recounted the three offensive entries composed by Aizhu, Baozhu, and Hezhu, while Hongwei recited the three scandalous verses authored by Hongxue, Hongwen, and Hongying. The effect was absolute: both ladies laughed so helplessly that the heavy pearl ornaments in their hair quivered and swayed wildly. Though they"},{"paragraph":47,"mentions":1,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"惮的。」便与华夫人评定这六个令，太恶者罚一大觞酒，打手掌三板，以示薄责；其次者罚酒免责。于是红雪、红霙、荷珠、宝珠受了责罚；爱珠、红雯单罚了酒。群婢受罚起来好不羞愧，又喝了这些急酒，觉得有些晃宕起来，勉强扎挣住了，深悔一时高兴。","en":"For the lesser offenses, a simple forfeit cup of wine was deemed sufficient. Thus, Hongxue, Hongying, Hezhu, and Baozhu suffered both the wine and the stinging slaps, while Aizhu and Hongwen escaped with only the wine forfeit. Receiving their punishments in utter humiliation, and having thrown back the harsh wine in such haste, the maids found themselves swaying unsteadily"}],"26":[{"paragraph":1,"mentions":5,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，掌珠拿了鹅毛扇，轻轻的打着。珍珠便上前与公子脱了靴，换上盘珠登云履。荷珠与公子换了件轻纱衫子，都在两旁站着。宝珠便道：「爷可曾用饭？可要吩咐内厨房预备什么？」华公子道：「今日酒多了，觉得口渴。到定更后，你照着我前日开那防风粥的单子，配着那几样花露果粉，用文武火熬，一时二刻不可见着铜器，还是你亲手做去，不要经那老婆子的手，龌龌龊龊的。此刻盛暑的天气，本来是发散时","en":"cloud-climbing slippers, while Hezhu changed him into a light gauze robe; then they all stood to either side. Baozhu then asked, \\"Has the Master dined? Shall we order the inner kitchen to prepare anything?\\" \\"I drank too much today and feel parched,\\" the Young Master replied. \\"After the first watch of the night, follow the recipe I gave you the other day for the ledebouriella"},{"paragraph":2,"mentions":1,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"又见爱珠提了一盏绛纱灯走出来道：「差不多要定更了，此刻还要传林珊枝进来呢！」宝珠问道：「叫林珊枝做什么？」爱珠道：「我知道什么事？自然是有要紧事了。」爱珠穿了木底小弓鞋，走快了，觉得咭咭咯咯的响。走到角门口，找着了管事的老婆子说了。老婆子又找了内管门，才到外间跟班房来，找着了林珊枝，便说：「爷叫你呢。」林珊枝正在院子乘凉，旁边也","en":"said, \\"It is almost the first watch, yet we are still supposed to summon Lin Shanzhi!\\" \\"Why call for Lin Shanzhi?\\" Baozhu asked. \\"How should I know? It must be something urgent,\\" Aizhu replied. Wearing wooden-soled bow shoes, her rapid steps clattered sharply against the floor. Reaching the side gate, she relayed the message to the senior maid on duty, who passed it to"},{"paragraph":3,"mentions":1,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"华公子想了一想，果然没有什么要紧，也只得依了，便道：「既锁了门，到明日也还不迟。」停了一停，又对珊枝道：「那个宝珠的戏，我倒是初见，倒不料他如此之妙，怎么他们总不进府来？」","en":"\\"Since the gates are locked, tomorrow will not be too late.\\" After a pause, he added, \\"It was my first time seeing Baozhu perform, and I never expected him to be so fine. Why does their troupe never enter the mansion?\\""},{"paragraph":8,"mentions":1,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"华夫人几次说要把花珠、宝珠收了，公子只是不要，说：「一做了妾，倒无趣了。不如等他们伺候几年，选几个青年美貌的配他，是件极有功德的事。还有一句话，若是夫人生得平常，自然就要到姬妾身上来。如今夫人是这么样的好，姬妾们虽好，也是比不上的。譬如草木杂花，未尝不娇艳无比，单看时觉得很好","en":"Lady Hua had several times suggested taking Huazhu and Baozhu as concubines, but the Young Master always refused. \\"Once they become concubines, their charm will fade,\\" he would say. \\"It is better to let them serve for a few years and then arrange marriages with handsome youths—a truly meritorious deed. Furthermore,"}],"41":[{"paragraph":11,"mentions":1,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"笑道：「怎么配上这个？如何称得过那两种？」公子道：「这是各人的好处。况且你那刺绣工夫，也算绝顶了。」华夫人就命宝珠、爱珠取这两样来。二珠去了，也有好一会才来，又找了个汉玉觞，贮了一觞酒，将桌子抬到廊前，摆了这三样宝贝，再将博山炉焚了百合香。华夫人道：「怎样，要拜不要拜呢？」华公子道：「不用拜罢。我们去拣顶好的花，将这酒去浇在他根上罢。」二人就走到林下，公子拣了一","en":"particular excellence. And besides, your needlework is itself a supreme achievement.\\" Madam Hua thereupon sent Baozhu and Aizhu to fetch these two items. The two maids were gone for quite a while before they returned. A Han-dynasty jade wine-cup was also found, and it was filled with wine. They moved a table out to the covered veranda and arranged all three treasures"},{"paragraph":17,"mentions":2,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"十珠也甚高兴，即拿了弦笛、鼓板，我推你，你推我，推了一会，推定了是宝珠先唱。宝珠唱道：","en":"and rhythm boards, each one pushing the other to go first. After much good-natured wrangling, they settled on Baozhu to lead. Baozhu sang:"},{"paragraph":27,"mentions":1,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"道：「这「见惯司空也应羞」之句，岂常人道得出来？」夫人道：「与「今番小杜扬州」句，真是同一妙笔。」见蕊珠唱起，宝珠合着唱道：","en":"\\"Together with 'a little Du Mu visits Yangzhou,' these are truly from the same inspired pen.\\" Then Ruizhu began, with Baozhu joining in harmony:"},{"paragraph":29,"mentions":1,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"在我不如你，恐定得不公，还是你定罢。」夫人微笑，把笔先写了十个字，就是珠字上面那个字，对公子道：「据我评来，以宝珠为第一，唱得风神跌宕，文秀温存，十人中是他压卷了。次则爱珠，情韵皆到，为第二。次赠珠，次掌珠，次蕊珠，次珍珠，次花珠，次荷珠，次画珠，次明珠。不知定得不委屈么？」公子道：「定得极是。」夫人又问十珠婢道：「如有委屈，不妨自说。」花珠赔着笑道：「奴才唱的","en":"by the character before the Zhu of her name. Then she turned to the young master and said, \\"By my assessment, Baozhu stands first. Her singing had a spirit that was free and flowing, yet refined and warm; among the ten she was the peerless performer. Second is Aizhu, who conveyed both emotion and charm. Then Zengzhu, then Zhangzhu, then Ruizhu, then Zhenzhu, then Huazhu,"},{"paragraph":35,"mentions":1,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"赞赏，倒教我不安。」公子道：「只羡鸳鸯不羡仙」虽是成句，但用来比原作还好，也不能教崔鸳鸯、郑鹧鸪得名了。」即叫宝珠、爱珠过来念熟了好唱。","en":"Cui Yuanyang and Zheng Zhegu will not be able to claim sole possession of that sentiment now.\\" He at once called Baozhu and Aizhu to come over and memorize the words so they could sing them."},{"paragraph":36,"mentions":1,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"二珠念了几遍熟了，唱了两句，错起板来。夫人道：「还不熟，你将工尺注在旁边，倒是看着唱罢。」宝珠、爱珠将工尺写了出来，果然一字字唱去，却很对腔，听得夫人、公子快乐非常。公子笑道：「这两枝曲子，倒定了我们的生旦了。你何不唱唱。这里唱，外人断乎听不见的。」夫人笑道：「你见我几时会唱？」公子道：「你真不会唱，何以其中的深微奥妙都知道，且人偶然唱错了一","en":"not yet secure. Write the notation marks in the margins, and you had better read from the score as you sing.\\" Baozhu and Aizhu wrote in the notation and then sang through it again, note by note, and this time fell perfectly into the melodic mode, to the great delight of both the mistress and the young master. The young master laughed: \\"With these two arias, the two"},{"paragraph":37,"mentions":2,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"夫人道：「你何不唱唱？」公子道：「我一人唱也无趣。」夫人道：「叫宝珠和你唱。况「休负了金樽浅」这句是要合唱的。」公子道：「不唱罢，明日我们多填几阕，成了一套《赏花》。叫他们扮作你我，串他一出，叫做《祭花》何如？」夫人道：「这倒没趣味，串出来也像那《赏荷》一样。不过那十珠丫头，倒好扮些净丑出来取笑，然而也觉俗了。」公子","en":"\\"Why do you not sing?\\" The young master replied, \\"Singing alone has no pleasure in it.\\" His lady suggested, \\"Have Baozhu sing with you. After all, the line 'do not let the gold in our cups lie shallow' is meant to be sung in chorus.\\" The young master demurred, \\"Let us not sing today; tomorrow I shall compose a few more stanzas and we can make a complete suite called 'Viewing"}],"44":[{"paragraph":8,"mentions":1,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"下去。公子哈哈大笑道：「跪了之后，还背不出来，只好打了。」见蕊珠涨红了脸，越想越想不出来。旁边爱珠在那里笑他，宝珠在公子身后抓着脸羞他，羞得蕊珠要哭出来。这两日公子与夫人把这十珠作个消遣法子，教他们念唐诗，念熟了背，背错了要罚。","en":"tried again but could not recall the words. Beside her, Aizhu was laughing at her, while behind the young master, Baozhu was scratching her own cheek in mock shame. The teasing drove Ruizhu nearly to tears. Over these past two days, the young master and the mistress had devised an entertainment for the Ten Pearls, teaching them Tang poems and having them recite from memory,"},{"paragraph":9,"mentions":1,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"如错得多的，跪了还要打几下手板。今日宝珠背了李义山《无题》六首，错了一字，没有记过。爱珠背了《琵琶行》，竟一字不错。蕊珠背《长恨歌》，已经错了许多，故跪在地下，又背不出来，那三珠又一言半语的笑他，他已气得难受，又不敢站起来跑了出去。","en":"For many mistakes, a kneeling penalty could be followed by a rapping of the palms. Today Baozhu had recited the six \\"Untitled\\" poems of Li Yishan, with only one wrong character and no demerit recorded. Aizhu had recited the \\"Song of the Pipa\\" without a single error. Ruizhu, reciting the \\"Song of Everlasting Sorrow,\\" had already accumulated many"},{"paragraph":14,"mentions":1,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"垫子垫着，膝盖也跪得很疼，又遇着要小便起来，满脸飞红，那要笑要哭的光景，令人可怜。公子生了这一回气，又听珊枝、宝珠说话，就忘了他还跪着。","en":"was rather pitiable. The young master had worked himself up into a rage and then been calmed by Shanzhi's and Baozhu's words, and had quite forgotten that Ruizhu was still kneeling."},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":1,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，曲着腰，将膝盖揉了揉，徜徜徉徉的走开道：「冤不冤，跪了这半天。」找个僻静地方小解去了。华公子起身回夫人房内，宝珠、爱珠随了进去，珍珠等蕊珠同行。珊枝慢慢的送公子出了园，正要走时，忽然一把花瓣撒了他一头，急回头看时，见蕊珠、珍珠骂道：「人家跪着，你倒在石洞里偷看人，瞎掉你的眼睛。」珊枝道：「明日还要挨打呢。」说着也就走开了。","en":"went off to find a secluded corner to relieve herself. Young Master Hua rose and went to the mistress's quarters; Baozhu and Aizhu followed him in. Zhenzhu waited for Ruizhu, and the two walked together. Shanzhi slowly escorted the young master out of the garden, and was just turning to leave when a handful of petals was thrown over her head. She spun around to see Ruizhu"}],"52":[{"paragraph":24,"mentions":1,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，心中甚悔一时没有留心，只得说道：「我不与人瞧，我恐扇旧了，已收起了。」华夫人也不疑心他给了人。将要出门，带了宝珠、爱珠、蕊珠、珍珠、明珠、掌珠六婢，又带了小香儿与两个仆妇。此时新秋，天气尚热，也不须多带衣服，带了一个小锦箱、一个锦匣，装些花钿脂粉。外面叫一个老年的管家骑了顶马，金龄、玉龄、兰龄、桂龄骑了跟班马。华夫人出房到内花厅，就坐肩舆，出了垂花门，上了车，","en":"out, I have already stored it away.\\" Lady Hua suspected nothing. Preparing to depart, she brought along six maids—Baozhu, Aizhu, Ruizhu, Zhenzhu, Mingzhu, and Zhangzhu—along with little Xiang'er and two older servant women. Since it was early autumn and the weather remained warm, they did not pack many heavy clothes, only bringing a small brocade chest and a casket containing"}],"53":[{"paragraph":10,"mentions":2,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，各色铺垫料，并零件荷囊、扇袋的花片子，共装了两大箱，算起价来，也值数千金，叫人抬出去，放在珊枝屋里。公子又问宝珠要出那文房什物以及玩器、书画闲放着不用的那本帐来。宝珠找了出来，公子看了，把笔点出了几十样是：「新坑大端砚四方、中端砚六方、歙石砚十方、假铜雀砚二方，徽墨二十匣、印色一斤，田黄石图章两匣、青田石图章两匣、寿山石图章十匣、昌化石图章十匣，嘉兴刻花竹笔筒","en":"thousands of taels of silver. Young Master Hua ordered them carried out and placed in Shanzhi's room.\\n\\nHe then asked Baozhu to bring the inventory ledger for the unused study items, curios, and calligraphy and paintings. Once Baozhu found it, Young Master Hua reviewed it and marked off dozens of items with his brush: \\"Four new-pit large Duan inkstones, six medium Duan inkstones,"}],"57":[{"paragraph":14,"mentions":1,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"不要在你那个小国埋没。」爱珠、花珠笑了，站了过来。绮香自己点了爱珠、花珠、红香、红玉、红雪、红霙，浣香自己留了宝珠、明珠、掌珠，浣兰留了许三姐、小翠，要了荷珠，紫烟留了侍香，要了红薇、赠珠，佩秋留了金凤，要了红莲、红娟，蓉华留了秋莲，要了红雯、画珠，琼华留了青琴，要了珍珠、蕊珠。","en":"side. Qixiang chose Aizhu, Huazhu, Hongxiang, Hongyu, Hongxue, and Hongying for her own forces. Huanxiang kept Baozhu, Mingzhu, and Zhangzhu. Huanlan retained Sanjie and Xiaocui, and added Hezhu. Ziyan kept Shixiang, taking Hongwei and Zengzhu to fill her ranks. Peiqiu kept Jinfeng and added Honglian and Hongjuan. Ronghua retained Qiulian, bringing in Hongwen and Yazhu."},{"paragraph":15,"mentions":1,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"，秋莲掣了廉颇，画珠掣了蔺相如，红雯掣了平原君。蓉华道：「我这三根掣得好，大可折秦国的锐气。」再掣浣香的魏国，宝珠掣了信陵君，明珠掣了侯生，掌珠掣了醇酒妇人，大家又笑起来。绮香道：「这倒难，又算酒，又算妇人，横竖一出马，就叫人开心的。」掌珠道：「换一根罢。」红香道：「好便宜事。」忙将筹拿开了。掌珠无奈，也只得捏了那根筹，脸上甚是羞愧。再掣浣兰的齐国，浣兰道：「我","en":"Hongwen drew Lord Pingyuan. Ronghua beamed, \\"My three draws are excellent; we can easily blunt Qin's edge.\\" For Wei, Baozhu drew Lord Xinling, Mingzhu drew Hou Sheng; and Zhangzhu drew the Drunken-Woman lot. This sparked even more laughter. Qixiang noted, \\"That is an awkward one; it counts as both wine and a woman. Whichever element rides out first will surely cheer everyone"},{"paragraph":24,"mentions":6,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"又击鼓传花，到了浣香，数宝珠出马。浣香笑道：「这是我们的福将，四公子中的魁首，看你们什么人来抵敌罢。」那边数到了红雪，是李斯。绮香道：「好个对手。」看谱：「信陵君是运筹点将令。」就拿上一筒酒筹来，宝珠掣了一枝看时，是「蜡照半笼金翡翠。」注：「席中戴金条脱、玉钏者饮一杯。」绮香道","en":"The drum beat and the flower was passed again, stopping this time with Huanxiang. The dice sent Baozhu forth. Huanxiang smiled, \\"Here is our lucky general, the true champion among the Four Lords. Let us see who dares to meet him.\\" On Qin's side, the lot fell to Hongxue, representing Li Si. Qixiang said, \\"A worthy foe indeed.\\" The rule book stated: \\"Lord"},{"paragraph":47,"mentions":1,"tokens":["宝珠"],"kind":"named-mention","zh":"珍珠十分用心，无奈未得其妙，几着变化就迷住了，看看要输，宝珠要指点他，红香道：「谁教了，就算谁输，要照样罚酒。」琼华心甚着急，又不好教，看红香把他一个挂角将，就将死了。红香笑道：「今番得了。」查圯上老人的谱，是脱鞋置酒，遍敬席上。珍珠见了，说道：「这个断断使不得，怪脏的东西，那是什么样儿！」红香道：「不妨的。","en":"Zhenzhu tried hard but missed the subtleties. After only a few moves, she was completely lost. Baozhu wanted to offer a hint, but Hongxiang warned, \\"Whoever teaches, loses. Same penalty.\\" Qionghua burned with worry but dared not speak. Hongxiang hung a corner checkmate—dead. Hongxiang smiled sweetly, \\"Got you this time.\\" The old man's book dictated:"}]}`),"char-206":{11:[{paragraph:3,mentions:1,tokens:["红霙"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"连环七宝钗翠羽扇珊瑚搔头镂金博山炉青瑶玉琴珍沉水香瑟柱奇楠香串玛瑙印章」先着人送去。遂于十二红丫鬟中带了红雪，红霙、红香、红玉、红薇、红雯六个，都是盈盈十五，窈窕多姿，识字能书，工诗善绣。伺候夫人晓妆已毕，红雪道：「今日天气寒冷，似有雪意，须多带几件衣服。」便向大毛衣服内，检出一件天蓝缎绣金紫貂鼠披风，红缎绣金天马皮蟒裙，玉佩玎璫，珠璎珞索。格外又带了一个大红绵",en:"servant. From her retinue of twelve maidservants, each named with the character 'Hong' (Red), she chose Hongxue, Hongying, Hongxiang, Hongyu, Hongwei, and Hongwen. These six, all fifteen years of age and in the very springtime of their youth, were slender and graceful. They were literate, skilled in calligraphy, and deeply accomplished in both poetry and embroidery. After"},{paragraph:43,mentions:5,tokens:["红霙"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"一刻似一夏。并头莲，庶几夙夜。红香红着脸，要撕荷珠的嘴，经众人劝住。荷珠掷了一个一枝花，正要想几句好句子，忽见红霙对着他笑盈盈的说道：「我代你说。」荷珠料他没有好话，便摇着头道：「不稀罕。」红霙道：「你虽不稀罕，我倒偏要说。」众人要听笑话，都要他说。红霙念道：一枝花，还怜合抱时，这叫做才子佳人信有之。一点红，薄污我私。众人忍不住皆笑。荷珠气极，走过来把红霙拦腰抱",en:`then Hezhu's turn; she threw the pattern 'A Single Flower.' As she began to quietly arrange her poetic phrases, Hongying turned toward her with a brilliant, predatory smile. "Let me compose for you." Suspecting nothing but malice, Hezhu shook her head fiercely. "No, thank you." "Even if you do not want it, I am going to say it regardless," Hongying insisted. Hungry for`},{paragraph:44,mentions:1,tokens:["红霙"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"红雪、红香过去拉开了，红霙头上花朵也掉了，头发也弄得蓬蓬的，便把手掠了一会，骂荷珠道：「顽得这般粗卤。说说罢了，就要认真。」这一会闹，闹得华夫人、袁夫人都按捺不住了，便叫家人媳妇进来查问，不许他们顽笑。群婢才息声静气的，赶紧的吃了一碗饭，都出来伺候。夫人们看这一班顽婢，有闹得",en:'Hongxue and Hongxiang finally rushed over, prying the furious Hezhu away. Sitting up, Hongying discovered the delicate flowers had been torn from her hair, her elegant tresses left a disheveled ruin. She spent a long moment smoothing her hair back into place before fiercely scolding Hezhu: "What brutish, reckless play! Speaking a jest is one thing,'},{paragraph:46,mentions:1,tokens:["红霙"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"要受罚。」华夫人笑道：「你们且一一的说来。」于是明珠把爱珠、宝珠、荷珠骂人的三个令全说了、红薇也将红雪、红雯、红霙骂人的三个令也说了，笑得两位夫人头上的珠钿斜颤，欲要装做正色责备他们，也装不过来。苏小姐虽嫌他们过于亵狎，然心里也赞他们敏慧，不便大笑，只好微颔而已。",en:"Aizhu, Baozhu, and Hezhu, while Hongwei recited the three scandalous verses authored by Hongxue, Hongwen, and Hongying. The effect was absolute: both ladies laughed so helplessly that the heavy pearl ornaments in their hair quivered and swayed wildly. Though they desperately attempted to compose their features into masks of stern reprimand, they completely failed. While"},{paragraph:47,mentions:1,tokens:["红霙"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"，一发肆无忌惮的。」便与华夫人评定这六个令，太恶者罚一大觞酒，打手掌三板，以示薄责；其次者罚酒免责。于是红雪、红霙、荷珠、宝珠受了责罚；爱珠、红雯单罚了酒。群婢受罚起来好不羞愧，又喝了这些急酒，觉得有些晃宕起来，勉强扎挣住了，深悔一时高兴。",en:"token chastisement. For the lesser offenses, a simple forfeit cup of wine was deemed sufficient. Thus, Hongxue, Hongying, Hezhu, and Baozhu suffered both the wine and the stinging slaps, while Aizhu and Hongwen escaped with only the wine forfeit. Receiving their punishments in utter humiliation, and having thrown back the harsh wine in such haste, the maids found themselves"}],52:[{paragraph:27,mentions:1,tokens:["红霙"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"坐了一坐，早已告退。这边太太们讲得好不投机，底下是许三姐张罗。徐家的红雪、红莲、红香、红玉、红梅、红月、红露、红霙八个，并华家六珠，与那些家人媳妇丫鬟们，整整坐了八桌。这八桌里头，有会说会笑的，有会喝会吃的，有抿着嘴不开口的，有缩着手不动箸的，各人有各人的模样。三姐八面张罗，满场飞舞。",en:"The eight 'Hong' maids of the Xu household—Hongxue, Honglian, Hongxiang, Hongyu, Hongmei, Hongyue, Honglu, and Hongying—along with the six Pearl Maids of the Hua household, plus all the servants and maids, filled exactly eight tables. At these tables, some laughed and joked, some ate and drank boldly, some sat with pursed lips in silence, and some held their chopsticks"}],57:[{paragraph:13,mentions:1,tokens:["红霙"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"有不合使唤的，便不中用。出去战败了，倒累主人罚酒。」就先点自己的丫鬟，点了红香、红玉、红雪、红雯、红薇、红莲、红霙、红娟，其余那四个不能饮酒。浣香的十珠都可使唤，全点了。浣兰的四个丫鬟，只点了一个小翠，才十三岁，生得很好，且又灵变。又点了许三姐。琼华的四个丫头，点了一个青琴。蓉华两个丫头，点了一个秋莲。紫烟两个丫头，点了一个侍香。佩秋两个丫头，点了一个金凤。共二",en:`wine." She began by choosing from her own maids, picking Hongxiang, Hongyu, Hongxue, Hongwen, Hongwei, Honglian, Hongying, and Hongjuan. Her other four maids could not drink. Huanxiang's Ten Pearls were all capable and were chosen in their entirety. Out of Huanlan's four maids, she selected only Xiaocui, a pretty and quick-witted thirteen-year-old, along with Miss Xu Sanjie.`},{paragraph:14,mentions:1,tokens:["红霙"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"我大国来立些功业，不要在你那个小国埋没。」爱珠、花珠笑了，站了过来。绮香自己点了爱珠、花珠、红香、红玉、红雪、红霙，浣香自己留了宝珠、明珠、掌珠，浣兰留了许三姐、小翠，要了荷珠，紫烟留了侍香，要了红薇、赠珠，佩秋留了金凤，要了红莲、红娟，蓉华留了秋莲，要了红雯、画珠，琼华留了青琴，要了珍珠、蕊珠。",en:"and Huazhu laughed and stepped over to her side. Qixiang chose Aizhu, Huazhu, Hongxiang, Hongyu, Hongxue, and Hongying for her own forces. Huanxiang kept Baozhu, Mingzhu, and Zhangzhu. Huanlan retained Sanjie and Xiaocui, and added Hezhu. Ziyan kept Shixiang, taking Hongwei and Zengzhu to fill her ranks. Peiqiu kept Jinfeng and added Honglian and Hongjuan. Ronghua retained"},{paragraph:15,mentions:1,tokens:["红霙"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"拿七个小筹来，先掣秦国的。爱珠掣了是白起，花珠掣的是商君，红香掣的是韩非子，红玉掣的是吕不韦，红雪掣的是李斯，红霙掣的是赵高。绮香笑道：「如何，你看我们文武皆全。」收过了筒，取紫烟楚国的筹来，侍香掣的是令尹子兰，红薇掣的是高唐神女，赠珠掣的是宋玉。紫烟笑道：「完了，一个佞人，一个梦神，一个风流鬼，这如何打得仗来？」众佳人皆笑，也收过了。再掣佩秋的燕国小筹，金凤掣",en:`Aizhu drew Bai Qi; Huazhu drew Lord Shang; Hongxiang drew Han Feizi; Hongyu drew Lü Buwei; Hongxue drew Li Si; and Hongying drew Zhao Gao. Qixiang laughed triumphantly, "You see? Both civil and military talents are perfectly complete." They put away Qin's tube and drew for Chu. Shixiang drew Minister Ling Yin Zilan; Hongwei drew the Gaotang Goddess; and Zengzhu drew Song`},{paragraph:17,mentions:1,tokens:["红霙"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"三个就上来，旁边又摆了一桌酒肴。秋莲把两个骰子一掷，掷了四点，是自己出马。秦国的爱珠、花珠、红香、红玉、红雪、红霙也过来。爱珠把骰子一掷，掷了二点，是花珠出马。花珠是商君，秋莲是廉颇。绮香翻出谱来，查到廉颇名下，内有一条：「廉颇如遇商君，俱系勇将，皆以豁拳为令。如廉颇败了，必系老年无用，一败带上假白须，再败罚酒一大觞，三败罚饭一碗。」众佳人看了，不禁又笑。秋莲道",en:`dice, rolling a four, meaning she would fight first. Qin's forces—Aizhu, Huazhu, Hongxiang, Hongyu, Hongxue, and Hongying—stepped up to meet her. Aizhu cast the dice and rolled a two, signaling that Huazhu would take the field. Huazhu was playing Lord Shang, while Qiulian represented Lian Po. Qixiang opened the rule book to Lian Po's entry and read: "If Lian Po meets Lord`},{paragraph:22,mentions:1,tokens:["红霙"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"，是高唐神女，众人皆笑。紫烟笑道：「好个红姑娘，高鬟大袖的，真像个神女。」红薇脸已红了。那边爱珠、红玉、红香、红霙、红雪也过来，掷到爱珠，是白起。绮香道：「这叫做无情遇。」看谱：「如神女遇见白起，神女如何能敌？须起倾国之兵尽出助战。如系文臣者，行藏阄令，手中各藏一物。国君点戏一出，如白起为净，神女为旦，其余助战者各肖其人定色。」再查：「令尹子兰为丑，宋玉为生。」",en:`flowing sleeves, she truly resembles a goddess." Hongwei blushed deeply. On Qin's side, Aizhu, Hongyu, Hongxiang, Hongying, and Hongxue stepped forward. The dice landed on Aizhu, representing the fearsome general Bai Qi. Qixiang noted, "This match is 'the heartless meets the divine.'" The rule book read: "If the delicate goddess meets the brutal Bai Qi, how can she possibly`},{paragraph:34,mentions:1,tokens:["红霙"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"于是传花又传到浣兰，点将出马是荷珠孟尝君，那边点了红霙的赵高。浣香笑道：「赵高如何是孟尝君的对手？且看谱来。」孟尝君是食客三千，令两人用骰子六颗对掷，如遇红遇么者，出钱投于盆内，六红即投六钱，两红两么即投四钱，无红无么即赢此钱。如孟尝君赢了，问那人：「你有的是什么？没有的是什么？要的是什么？不要的是什么",en:'flower passed on to Huanlan, whose commission sent forth Hezhu as Lord Mengchang, while the other side appointed Hongying as Zhao Gao. Huanxiang laughed, "How is Zhao Gao any match for Lord Mengchang? Let us see the rules." Lord Mengchang kept three thousand table-guests, so the two were to cast six dice against each other: whenever reds or aces turned up, coins were thrown'},{paragraph:35,mentions:7,tokens:["红霙"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"红霙与荷珠掷了一会，红霙输了，荷珠问道：「你有的是什么？」红霙道：「我有的是：绣檀回枕玉雕锼。」荷珠又问道：「你没有的是什么？」红霙道：「我没有的是：珍簟新铺翡翠楼。」荷珠又问道：「你要的是什么？」红霙道：「我要的是：红珠斗帐樱桃熟。」荷珠道：「你不要的",en:`Hongying and Hezhu cast for a while, and Hongying lost. Hezhu asked, "What do you have?" Hongying said, "What I have is: 'An embroidered sandalwood pillow, fretted and carved like jade.'" Hezhu asked again, "What do you lack?" Hongying said, "What I lack is:`},{paragraph:36,mentions:2,tokens:["红霙"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"鸯帐下香犹暖。你不要的是：嫁个萧郎爱远游。」浣香听了，笑骂荷珠道：「荷儿怎么这般轻薄？」绮香正笑着，尚未开口，红霙气极要打起荷珠来，荷珠再四的赔礼，群珠又与他央求，红霙方才饶他。众佳人笑道：「荷姑娘这几句太刻薄，幸遇着人多，不然是挨定□姑娘的打。」到了小翠的鸡鸣来了，小翠上来就有些发怯。看谱是接牌令。",en:`laughingly scolded Hezhu: "He'er, how can you be so saucy?" Qixiang was still laughing and had not yet spoken when Hongying, in a fury, made to strike Hezhu; Hezhu apologized over and over, the other maids pleaded for her, and only then did Hongying let her off. The beauties laughed, "Miss Hezhu's lines were far too cutting. Lucky for her there were so many present, or a`},{paragraph:38,mentions:3,tokens:["红霙"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"到了三姐上前，红霙口里作呼狗声。三姐道：「你运气好，别要赢我，你若赢了我，我真咬你一口。」翻出谱来，是五毒令。大指为虾蟆，食指为蛇，中指为蜈蚣，无名指为蝎虎，小指为蜘蛛。分胜负是蜘蛛吃蝎虎，蝎虎吃蜈蚣，蜈蚣吃蛇，蛇吃虾蟆，虾蟆吃蜘蛛。两人就猜起来。三姐想道：「他若料我",en:`When Sanjie came forward, Hongying set up a dog-calling noise with her mouth. Sanjie said, "You are in luck—don't you beat me. If you beat me, I will truly give you a bite." The book, turned up, showed the Five Venoms game: the thumb was the toad, the forefinger the snake, the middle`},{paragraph:39,mentions:2,tokens:["红霙"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"狗盗是什么东西，原来要装狗的。我不来。」说着就跑，众佳人听了，都笑得了不得。只见花珠、爱珠、红香、红玉、红雪、红霙一齐赶上，围住了三姐，说道：「凭你怎样利害，今天在我们园里，你想走到那里去？好好的叫了饶你，不然我们就按倒了你，剥你的皮。」便七手八脚，你一捏，我一捏，三姐身上最怕捏的，被他们缠住了，便笑作一团，身似紫薇花的乱颤起来，连连求告道：「不要闹，不要闹，我",en:`it, at which the beauties all laughed till they could not stand.

Huazhu, Aizhu, Hongxiang, Hongyu, Hongxue and Hongying all came up together and hemmed Sanjie in. "Formidable as you are, this is our garden today — where do you think you are going? Bark nicely and we will let you off; otherwise we will pin you down and take the skin off you." And with six or seven pairs`},{paragraph:49,mentions:1,tokens:["红霙"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"周旋。」绮香笑道：「众志成城，坚不可破，我让了你罢。」看青琴这打擂，已赢得不少，爱珠、花珠、红香、红玉、红雪、红霙都喝了许多酒。",en:`yield." Qingqin's ring match had already won plenty of victories; Aizhu, Huazhu, Hongxiang, Hongyu, Hongxue, and Hongying had all drunk deeply.`}]},"char-207":{52:[{paragraph:27,mentions:1,tokens:["红梅"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"，正是敌体。」新人坐了一坐，早已告退。这边太太们讲得好不投机，底下是许三姐张罗。徐家的红雪、红莲、红香、红玉、红梅、红月、红露、红霙八个，并华家六珠，与那些家人媳妇丫鬟们，整整坐了八桌。这八桌里头，有会说会笑的，有会喝会吃的，有抿着嘴不开口的，有缩着手不动箸的，各人有各人的模样。三姐八面张罗，满场飞舞。",en:"managed everything flawlessly. The eight 'Hong' maids of the Xu household—Hongxue, Honglian, Hongxiang, Hongyu, Hongmei, Hongyue, Honglu, and Hongying—along with the six Pearl Maids of the Hua household, plus all the servants and maids, filled exactly eight tables. At these tables, some laughed and joked, some ate and drank boldly, some sat with pursed lips in silence,"}]},"char-208":{52:[{paragraph:27,mentions:1,tokens:["红月"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"敌体。」新人坐了一坐，早已告退。这边太太们讲得好不投机，底下是许三姐张罗。徐家的红雪、红莲、红香、红玉、红梅、红月、红露、红霙八个，并华家六珠，与那些家人媳妇丫鬟们，整整坐了八桌。这八桌里头，有会说会笑的，有会喝会吃的，有抿着嘴不开口的，有缩着手不动箸的，各人有各人的模样。三姐八面张罗，满场飞舞。",en:"everything flawlessly. The eight 'Hong' maids of the Xu household—Hongxue, Honglian, Hongxiang, Hongyu, Hongmei, Hongyue, Honglu, and Hongying—along with the six Pearl Maids of the Hua household, plus all the servants and maids, filled exactly eight tables. At these tables, some laughed and joked, some ate and drank boldly, some sat with pursed lips in silence, and some"}]},"char-209":{52:[{paragraph:27,mentions:1,tokens:["红露"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"」新人坐了一坐，早已告退。这边太太们讲得好不投机，底下是许三姐张罗。徐家的红雪、红莲、红香、红玉、红梅、红月、红露、红霙八个，并华家六珠，与那些家人媳妇丫鬟们，整整坐了八桌。这八桌里头，有会说会笑的，有会喝会吃的，有抿着嘴不开口的，有缩着手不动箸的，各人有各人的模样。三姐八面张罗，满场飞舞。",en:"flawlessly. The eight 'Hong' maids of the Xu household—Hongxue, Honglian, Hongxiang, Hongyu, Hongmei, Hongyue, Honglu, and Hongying—along with the six Pearl Maids of the Hua household, plus all the servants and maids, filled exactly eight tables. At these tables, some laughed and joked, some ate and drank boldly, some sat with pursed lips in silence, and some held their"}]},"char-210":{45:[{paragraph:5,mentions:2,tokens:["王胡子"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"，那人便鞠躬如也的直迎上来，深深作一个揖，子玉也还了礼。见那人有五十余岁，相貌虽俗，倒生得一部好须，直垂至腹。王胡子见子玉清华潇洒，知是个贵公子，头一句便问家世，第二句就问科第。子玉倒有些不好意思，次贤代他答了，王胡子道：「在下作个斯文买卖，二十年来，走了十四省，就是关东、甘肃、广西没有到过，其余各省都已走过几回。去年八月在江西吉安府，遇见尊大人，正在开考。候考完",en:`he sported a handsome beard that swept down to his belly. Observing Ziyu's clear refinement and graceful ease, Old Wang Beard correctly judged him to be the son of a noble house. His first question was about Ziyu's family background; his second was about examination honors. Ziyu felt somewhat awkward, so Cixian answered on his behalf. Old Wang Beard said, "My trade passes for`},{paragraph:6,mentions:2,tokens:["王胡子"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"那王胡子好不话多，子玉有些发烦。无奈王胡子要候子云回来，消些东西。还有一部《图书集成》，这部书是个难消的，心上要想求子云买这部书，情愿减价，只要三千银子，今日看来也要在园中下榻的了。",en:"Old Wang Beard talked without end, and Ziyu grew rather tired of his chatter. Unfortunately, Old Wang insisted on waiting for Ziyun's return to unload his goods. He also carried a complete set of the *Complete Collection of Illustrations and Writings from Antiquity"},{paragraph:8,mentions:1,tokens:["王胡子"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"连忙答应。琴言接二人进来，一同归坐。子云道：「今日二位，真可谓畅谈衷曲了。」次贤道：「今日园中苦乐不均，我被那王胡子缠得发昏，要消这样，要消那样，据他的想头，差不多把他带来的东西都消在这里才好。」子云道：「老王的胡子越发长了。其实这个人，倒也不讨人嫌，就是利心过于重些。《古今图书集成》我虽有一部，这个也只好我们留下罢。这部书也不过如聋子的耳朵，摆设而已。留他住两天",en:`you two have truly poured out your hearts." Cixian sighed, "Joy and pain in the garden ran unevenly today. That Old Wang Beard tangled me in knots, demanding this be sold and that be sold. By his own lights, he would unload his entire pack right here." Ziyun laughed. "Old Wang's beard grows longer every year. The man himself is not so trying, only his greed runs high. I own`},{paragraph:13,mentions:4,tokens:["王胡子"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"王胡子过来，也与诸人叙礼，他却都是认识的，与屈道生更是多年相好。王胡子道：「今日人多，仙坛要设个宽绰的地方才好。」子云道：「我估量着人多，已经叫人在含万楼上铺设了。」又笑问王胡子道：「你是主坛的法师，请教你，今日是吃斋呢，还是吃荤？」王胡子笑道：「神仙也是",en:'Old Wang Beard came forward and greeted everyone. He knew them all and had been acquainted with Qu Daosheng for years. Old Wang said, "With such a crowd today, we need a spacious spot for the altar." Ziyun replied, "I expected a crowd, so I had the Tower of Myriad'},{paragraph:14,mentions:2,tokens:["王胡子"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"王胡子看那楼中，好不精致，是五大间，却分作五处，两面开窗，中设了仙坛。看不尽玉壶宝鼎，古画奇书，王胡子自忖一生贩买古董，从未见过这些好的。凭栏眺望，犹如身在蓬莱。想扬州盐商家那些花园，也算精工的了，如何比得上这里？再如平山堂、虹园也不能彷佛。至于侯石翁的起",en:"Old Wang surveyed the pavilion. It consisted of five bays divided into five chambers, with windows on both sides. The immortal altar stood at the center, surrounded by tripods of jade and bronze, antiquities beyond price, and paintings and books both uncanny"},{paragraph:15,mentions:2,tokens:["王胡子"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"王胡子上前虔诚默祷，一连叩了九个头。先焚了一通风符，次云符，又鹤符。候了约有半刻时候，要请两位仙童扶乩，便点了玉林、漱芳，二人扶上。又有半刻工夫，不见运动，王胡子又磕了头，再焚个催符。玉林、漱芳呆呆的扶着，见那乩像有些动，玉林把手一拨，便旋转起来，满盘走了",en:'Old Wang stepped forward in silent devotion and knocked his head nine times. He burned wind, cloud, and crane talismans. After about a quarter-hour, he needed two "immortal youths" to hold the planchette, so he named Yulin and Shufang. Another quarter-hour passed,'},{paragraph:16,mentions:1,tokens:["王胡子"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"王胡子将笔写了，子云等就在两边看时，分明是「珠珍」两字。",en:"Old Wang transcribed the characters while Ziyun and the others watched intently from the sides. They were clearly the words Pearl and Jewel."},{paragraph:17,mentions:1,tokens:["王胡子"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"。再看又写了七个王，胡子一一记了，已得两句七言诗。众人点头，暗暗称奇。又见运动得更快了。斜斜的两行，写得甚草。王胡子却认得，写了出来是：",en:'completing the line: "Pearl and gem make the carriage, jade makes the wheels." Then seven more characters were written. Old Wang recorded them one by one, and there were now two lines of seven-syllable verse. The motion grew faster, tracing two slanting lines in wild cursive. Old Wang could read them and carefully copied them out:'},{paragraph:18,mentions:4,tokens:["王髯","王胡子"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"诗。众人知是女仙，越加敬谨。复又写出数语道：「吾仙杜兰香奉金母命，至东海蓬莱仙阙，邀请碧霞仙府神君，便道来游。王髯有何疑问？」王胡子连忙下了拜，来问道：「那位要问，就请祷告，好待上仙判断。」众人心上都没有事，不过来看热闹的。及王胡子问时，你推我，我推你，没有一个肯上前。子云忍不住笑道：「既诸位没有问的事，我要问一个人。」就叫：「玉侬，你来跪下。默祷默祷，请上仙判",en:`the West to the Penglai palace of the Eastern Sea to invite the Lord of Azure Dawn. I am passing by to visit. Bearded Wang, what is your question?" Old Wang bowed low at once and said, "Whoever wishes to inquire, pray step forward with your petition for the immortal's judgment." No one had any real business; they had merely come for the spectacle. When Old Wang asked, each`},{paragraph:19,mentions:1,tokens:["王胡子"],kind:"named-mention",zh:`。
再生不记前生事，父子相逢各惘然。
众人看了，不解其意，有的还在细细推求。但第四句总解不出来，琴言只是发怔。王胡子道：「你再祷告祷告，求个注解。」琴言又祷告了，乩上又判了四句是：`,en:`each lost in mist."
No one grasped the meaning fully, though some pondered the fourth line. Qinyan stood stunned. Old Wang instructed, "Pray again. Ask for a commentary." Qinyan prayed once more, and four more lines appeared:`},{paragraph:20,mentions:1,tokens:["王胡子"],kind:"named-mention",zh:`前世之因，今生之果。
杜郎且退，屈翁上前。
屈道生听了，恭恭敬敬，上前叩拜，站立在旁。乩上又判了一首诗，王胡子录出，众人看是：`,en:"Hearing this, Qu Daosheng bowed respectfully, stepped forward, and stood aside. The planchette wrote another poem. Old Wang copied it out, and everyone leaned in to read. It read:"},{paragraph:34,mentions:1,tokens:["王胡子"],kind:"named-mention",zh:`非凡种，香色由来人所重。
尽待神仙闲品题，群花齐向天门拥。
子云道：「他们都说完了，就只有道翁先生与胡兄了。」王胡子拈着长须，候着乩上说他。道生道：「我这老朽，恐怕未必能附诸名士名花之后，且如何能邀坡仙齿芬一粲？」只见乩上又写道：`,en:`crowd Heaven's gate the same."
Ziyun said, "That finishes them. Only Old Gentleman Qu and Brother Hu remain." Old Wang stroked his beard, eagerly waiting to be named. Daosheng said, "This worn-out frame hardly deserves a place after such masters and flowers. How could I ever win Su's smile?" The planchette wrote again:`},{paragraph:36,mentions:1,tokens:["王髯"],kind:"named-mention",zh:`难得名花名士兼，长歌一纸示王髯。
丙寅三月初八日，请得眉山苏子瞻。
道生写完，众人正要观看，忽见乩上又写道：「奉敕赴凌云殿撰文，不能久留，去矣！」书完寂然不动。众人一齐拜送，焚符酾酒，俱欣欣然有喜色。家童收拾了仙坛，大家就在楼中坐下，又将仙诗同读了两遍。`,en:`"Rare to join fair flower and gentleman fine,
One long song shows Old Wang the sign.
Third month, eighth day, year Bingyin,
We summoned Meishan's Su Zizhan."
Daosheng had just finished copying when the planchette added, "Ordered to the Lingyun Hall to draft documents. Cannot stay. Farewell!" Then, there was complete silence.`},{paragraph:41,mentions:1,tokens:["王胡子"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"子云便请入席。第一席是道生、子玉、吉甫、王胡子、琴言，二席是仲清、文泽、王恂、子云、次贤，九个名旦分为两桌，各自叙齿坐了三、四两席。琴言坐在下手，拘拘谨谨，也不举箸，甚觉可怜。倒是道生体恤他，道：「凡遇热闹场中，当言的即言，也不必过于拘谨，但存着个后辈的分寸就是了。」",en:'Ziyun invited everyone to the table. The first table sat Daosheng, Ziyu, Jifu, Old Wang Beard, and Qinyan. The second seated Zhongqing, Wenze, Wang Xun, Ziyun, and Cixian. The nine actors split two more tables by age. Qinyan sat quietly at the foot, his chopsticks untouched, looking pitifully constrained. Daosheng comforted him gently. "In lively'},{paragraph:42,mentions:2,tokens:["王胡子"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"道生喝了几杯酒，便与子玉、吉甫、王胡子谈些闲话。王胡子道：「屈老先生，晚生这个请仙的本事如何？你说我是赚人么？」道生笑道：「今日之事却真稀奇，若不是我亲眼见的，亲手写的，凭谁告诉我，我也不信。」又道：「胡兄，你往常请仙，也有这么灵异么？」胡子道：「今年过扬州时，在一个盐商家扶乩，请的什么",en:'After a few cups, Daosheng chatted comfortably with Ziyu, Jifu, and Old Wang Beard. Old Wang asked, "Old Gentleman Qu, how was my spirit-planchette today? Do you still say I cheat people?" Daosheng smiled warmly. "Today was a marvel. I would not believe it from hearsay had I not seen and copied it with my own eyes." He then asked,'}],46:[{paragraph:2,mentions:1,tokens:["王胡子"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"园，以辰初毕集。是日不设筵宴，恐误了游兴，止于几处备了小酌茶点。凡近水者坐船，离水远者步行，须以一日之内游尽。王胡子住了两日回寓，将《图书集成》装了五大车，送进怡园，子云只得收了，就放在含万楼上，也就摆满了五间大楼。",en:"banquet—only light wine and tea en route; near water they boated, far from water they walked—to finish in one day. Old Wang Beard returned to his lodging two days later and carted the *Complete Collection of Illustrations and Writings from Antiquity to the Present* to the Garden of Contentment in five wagon-loads; Ziyun accepted them and stacked the Tower of Myriad Containment"}]},"char-211":{16:[{paragraph:5,mentions:1,tokens:["阎简安"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"姓。」那上首的即答道：「姓杨，我是这里的街坊。」又问那位年老的，老年的慢慢的答道：「我姓阎。」贵大爷道：「这位阎简安先生，是华府中的师爷。那一位是精于地理的，又是富三哥的干兄弟，就在东胡衕那大宅子里，号梅窗，行八。」说罢，小厮移了一张凳子，就放在富三上首，大家坐了。富三道：「你好呵！你在城外天天的乐，你也不来瞧瞧哥哥。你知道哥哥惦记你，你就不惦记我。我找你两三回，",en:`When asked for his name, the older man answered slowly, "My name is Yan." Lord Gui explained, "This is Master Yan Jian'an, a private secretary in the Hua household. That gentleman is a specialist in geomancy and Third Brother Fu's sworn brother. He lives in that large residence in Donghu Lane, goes by the literary name Meichuang, and is the eighth in his family." With that,`},{paragraph:6,mentions:4,tokens:["阎简安"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"的树，还是我种的呢。」贵大爷道：「这杨老八的风水是高明的，我们内城多半是请他瞧的。」聘才便又拉拢起来，只有那个阎简安是冷冰冰的，只与富、贵两人讲话。富三爷道：「歇了罢，这牌打得闷人，就是我输了，算账罢。」阎简安便道：「怎么就歇？方才打了两转。」梅窗道：「算了，不用来了。」于是，大家起身散坐，点筹马，是阎、富两人输了。聘才道：「倒是我吵散了。」富三一手捶着腰道：「我",en:`outstanding; most families in the inner city ask him to assess their properties." Pincai engaged him further, though Yan Jian'an sat coldly aside, speaking only with Fu and Gui. Third Master Fu complained, "Let's stop here. This card game is insufferably dull, and I've been losing. Let's settle our accounts." Yan Jian'an countered, "Why stop so soon? We've only played two rounds."`},{paragraph:7,mentions:5,tokens:["阎简安","老阎","简安"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"席中聘才对那阎简安问起华府的光景，那老阎就觉得有些高兴，便道：「敝东公子，是人间少有的。府里的阔大；是说不尽的。」聘才又问同事几位？简安道：「在府里住的有十几位，在老爷子任上的有十几位，其余来来去去走动的，不计其数。我是老爷子三十年的交情，同着出过兵，与那些个朋友是两",en:`During the meal, Pincai asked Yan Jian'an about the situation in the Hua household. Old Yan's spirits lifted as he boasted, "My employer's young master is a rare individual in this world, and the grandeur of the mansion is beyond description." When Pincai asked about the number of colleagues`},{paragraph:8,mentions:1,tokens:["老阎"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"便把心事讲起。富三爷道：「既然如此，何不就挪到舍下来，盘桓几时。」重又说道：「我们舅太爷府中朋友最多。今日听得老阎说，辞了那位出去，如今正少人呢。」聘才道：「舅太爷是那一位？」富三道：「你不记得去年在城外，瞧见那十几辆车，车内那个貂裘绣蟒的，叫做华公子就是。」聘才心中十分欢喜，想道：这华公子势焰熏天，若得合了式，弄个小小的出身，也还容易。",en:`for a while?" He added, "In our uncle-by-marriage's household, friends are incredibly numerous. Today I heard Old Yan mention that someone recently left, so there is currently a vacancy." Pincai asked, "Who is this uncle-by-marriage?" Fu the Third replied, "Don't you remember the procession of carriages outside the city last year, with that man in a sable coat and embroidered`},{paragraph:9,mentions:1,tokens:["老阎"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"黄辫子荷包一对，四喜搬指儿一个呢。你要去，我明日就荐你，包管可成。」聘才听得喜动颜色，忙作揖谢了。因又想着这个老阎有些碍眼。忽又想道：「各人办各人的事，不与他往来便了。」再坐了一回，辞了富三回寓。",en:`tomorrow. I guarantee it will work out." Pincai's face lit up with pleasure, and he bowed in gratitude. He considered Old Yan an obstacle but reasoned, "Everyone minds their own affairs; if I simply avoid him, there will be no issue." After sitting a while longer, he took his leave of Fu the Third and returned to his lodgings.`},{paragraph:18,mentions:2,tokens:["阎简安"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"是苏州人，比笑梅略长两岁，亦颇俊秀，是画山水花草的。那边还有个书启先生叫王卿云，是老公爷的旧友，有五十余岁了。阎简安是办笔墨杂务，他二人又在一个院落，当下都请来见了。阎简安道：「不料前日一见，今日就进我们府中来，有这等奇事。」聘才道：「小弟多蒙华公子谬爱，招之门下。无奈铅刀袜线，一无所能，诸事全仗老先生们教训。」",en:`floral painting. Also present was Wang Qingyun, a drafting secretary in his fifties and an old friend of the Duke. Yan Jian'an, who handled miscellaneous writing tasks, resided in another courtyard but was invited over for introductions. Yan Jian'an said, "Who would have thought that after meeting just the other day, you would join our household today? What a curious turn of`}],18:[{paragraph:6,mentions:1,tokens:["阎简安"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"。虽止一月之间，府里这些闲杂人，倒也混熟了，也有与聘才合式的，也有不对的。合式的是顾月卿、张笑梅诸人；不对的是阎简安、王卿云诸人。聘才也只好各人安分，合式的便往来密些，不对的便疏远些。惟郁郁不乐者，尚未见过华公子一面。而且一无所事，不过天天与众人厮混，正是「两餐老米饭，一枕黑甜乡」而已。",en:"congenial ones included Gu Yueqing, Zhang Xiaomei, and their sort, whereas the uncongenial ones were men like Yan Jian'an and Wang Qingyun. Pincai could only attend to his own station, keeping close to the congenial ones while distancing himself from the uncongenial. But what truly vexed him was that he had still not had a proper meeting with the young master, despite having"},{paragraph:13,mentions:1,tokens:["阎简安"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"是赚他。他上了赚，就凭我怎么样了，这叫做钓金蝉。至于为人虽要和气，也不可一味的脓包，于那些没相干，不中用的人如阎简安、王卿云等辈，倒不要去睬他，浑去应酬他也无用。大门子里，有那一种在里头一句话都不能讲的，他却会懵人。你自己要看得清：可应酬则应酬，不必应酬就不应酬；你应酬那不中用的人，被那要紧人就看轻了。」聘才听了大笑道：「吾兄真是当今第一个大才，陈平之智，诸葛之谋",en:"amiable, one also cannot be spineless through and through. Those who have no relevance and serve no purpose, such as Yan Jian'an and Wang Qingyun, don't bother with them; mingling indiscriminately with them serves no purpose at all. Among the household retinue, there are those who cannot say a single useful word inside, yet are masters at bamboozling outsiders. You must see clearly"}]},"char-212":{16:[{paragraph:18,mentions:1,tokens:["王卿云"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"笔人物的，就是吹竹弹丝也还来得。顾月卿是苏州人，比笑梅略长两岁，亦颇俊秀，是画山水花草的。那边还有个书启先生叫王卿云，是老公爷的旧友，有五十余岁了。阎简安是办笔墨杂务，他二人又在一个院落，当下都请来见了。阎简安道：「不料前日一见，今日就进我们府中来，有这等奇事。」聘才道：「小弟多蒙华公子谬爱，招之门下。无奈铅刀袜线，一无所能，诸事全仗老先生们教训。」",en:`slightly older than Xiaomei, was equally refined and focused on landscape and floral painting. Also present was Wang Qingyun, a drafting secretary in his fifties and an old friend of the Duke. Yan Jian'an, who handled miscellaneous writing tasks, resided in another courtyard but was invited over for introductions. Yan Jian'an said, "Who would have thought that after meeting`}],18:[{paragraph:6,mentions:1,tokens:["王卿云"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"月之间，府里这些闲杂人，倒也混熟了，也有与聘才合式的，也有不对的。合式的是顾月卿、张笑梅诸人；不对的是阎简安、王卿云诸人。聘才也只好各人安分，合式的便往来密些，不对的便疏远些。惟郁郁不乐者，尚未见过华公子一面。而且一无所事，不过天天与众人厮混，正是「两餐老米饭，一枕黑甜乡」而已。",en:"included Gu Yueqing, Zhang Xiaomei, and their sort, whereas the uncongenial ones were men like Yan Jian'an and Wang Qingyun. Pincai could only attend to his own station, keeping close to the congenial ones while distancing himself from the uncongenial. But what truly vexed him was that he had still not had a proper meeting with the young master, despite having been there"},{paragraph:13,mentions:1,tokens:["王卿云"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"他上了赚，就凭我怎么样了，这叫做钓金蝉。至于为人虽要和气，也不可一味的脓包，于那些没相干，不中用的人如阎简安、王卿云等辈，倒不要去睬他，浑去应酬他也无用。大门子里，有那一种在里头一句话都不能讲的，他却会懵人。你自己要看得清：可应酬则应酬，不必应酬就不应酬；你应酬那不中用的人，被那要紧人就看轻了。」聘才听了大笑道：「吾兄真是当今第一个大才，陈平之智，诸葛之谋，也不过",en:"cannot be spineless through and through. Those who have no relevance and serve no purpose, such as Yan Jian'an and Wang Qingyun, don't bother with them; mingling indiscriminately with them serves no purpose at all. Among the household retinue, there are those who cannot say a single useful word inside, yet are masters at bamboozling outsiders. You must see clearly for yourself:"}]},"char-213":{16:[{paragraph:18,mentions:2,tokens:["顾月卿"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"交代了园中的人，就不进去了。那边又有人来接引。进了斑竹花篱，是一所厅，两进共有十间，还有些厢房。此中是张笑梅、顾月卿画画之处。顾、张二位出来相见，知道聘才是富三爷新荐来的，便陪着聚谈。聘才见那张笑梅，倒也生得俊俏，是杭州人，年纪二十上下，是画工笔人物的，就是吹竹弹丝也还来得。顾月卿是苏州人，比笑梅略长两岁，亦颇俊秀，是画山水花草的。那边还有个书启先生叫王卿云，是老",en:"through a mottled bamboo fence to a hall of ten rooms, flanked by side chambers. This was where Zhang Xiaomei and Gu Yueqing practiced their painting. The two men came out to greet them, knowing Pincai was the new arrival recommended by Third Master Fu, and sat down to converse. Pincai noted Zhang Xiaomei's handsome features; a young man of twenty from Hangzhou, he specialized"}],18:[{paragraph:6,mentions:1,tokens:["顾月卿"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"，一不应酬，就有人说起闲话来。虽止一月之间，府里这些闲杂人，倒也混熟了，也有与聘才合式的，也有不对的。合式的是顾月卿、张笑梅诸人；不对的是阎简安、王卿云诸人。聘才也只好各人安分，合式的便往来密些，不对的便疏远些。惟郁郁不乐者，尚未见过华公子一面。而且一无所事，不过天天与众人厮混，正是「两餐老米饭，一枕黑甜乡」而已。",en:"the idle hangers-on of the household. Some proved congenial, while others did not. The congenial ones included Gu Yueqing, Zhang Xiaomei, and their sort, whereas the uncongenial ones were men like Yan Jian'an and Wang Qingyun. Pincai could only attend to his own station, keeping close to the congenial ones while distancing himself from the uncongenial. But what truly vexed"}],21:[{paragraph:1,mentions:1,tokens:["顾月卿"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"有余，上上下下皆用心周旋的十分很好，又因华公子待他有些颜面，银钱又宽展起来，便有些小人得志，就不肯安分了。内有顾月卿、张笑梅，外有杨梅窗、冯子佩一班人朝欢暮乐，所见所闻，无非势力钻营等事，是以渐渐心肥胆大。从前在梅宅有士燮学士在家，虽不来管教他，自然畏惧的。而且子玉所结交的，都是些公子名士，没有那些游荡之人。譬如马困槽枥之中，虽欲泛驾也就不能。此时是任凭所欲，无所",en:"grew easier; thereupon he began to show the petty man's triumph and would no longer keep his place. Within were Gu Yueqing and Zhang Xiaomei; outside Yang Meichuang, Feng Zipei, and such company — nightly revelry — and whatever he saw and heard ran to schemes of influence and trimming to power; his heart grew fat and his daring swelled. Formerly at the Mei residence Academician"}],33:[{paragraph:20,mentions:1,tokens:["顾月卿"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"谁知候了两日，不见一个人来，就是平时常见的顾月卿、张笑梅也不过来。再思量了半夜，才定了主意，次早写了一封谢札，先说些感激的话，后说梅宅有事，现要请其回去照料家务，情面难却，只得暂去，俟开春再来。写完，自己到门房里告诉了门上，将书信给他传进。约有半个时辰，见门上进来道：「方才的字，公子已看，说回梅宅",en:"However, after waiting two days, no one came, not even the usual acquaintances Gu Yueqing and Zhang Xiaomei. After pondering for half the night, he finally made up his mind. Early the next morning, he wrote a letter of thanks: first expressing his gratitude, then stating that there were matters at the Mei residence requiring him to return"}],50:[{paragraph:22,mentions:1,tokens:["顾月卿"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"子下通州赴考去了，只好认了晦气。到出京那几日，一起一起的饯行，潘其观、奚十一、张仲雨、冯子佩、杨梅窗、张笑梅、顾月卿、唐和尚等轮流作饯，唐和尚的庄子好不热闹，聘才又辞了几天行。",en:"were thrown one after another. Pan Qiguan, Xi Eleven, Zhang Zhongyu, Feng Zipei, Yang Meichuang, Zhang Xiaomei, Gu Yueqing, Monk Tang, and others took turns hosting him. Tang's establishment was exceptionally lively, and Pincai ended up postponing his departure for several more days."}]},"char-214":{44:[{paragraph:2,mentions:3,tokens:["胡八"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"又到那里去陪酒了。」姚贤一面想，一面走，忽前面来了两个熟人，一个二十九岁叫孟七，是徐子云的家人；一个三十九岁叫胡八，是奚十一的家人，都是本京人，那胡八与姚贤是两姨中表，这三个人都是相好的。这日胡八因主人患病无事，出来找了孟七听戏，想到馆子里去吃饭，遇见了姚贤，又是城里出来的，便一把拉住，各人问了好，便邀进了馆子，要了几样菜、两壶酒，细酌闲谈。孟七问起姚贤，倒有空",en:"appeared: one was twenty-nine-year-old Meng Qi, a household man of Xu Ziyun's; the other was thirty-nine-year-old Hu Ba, a household man of Xi Eleven's. Both were natives of the capital. Hu Ba was Yao Xian's first cousin on the maternal side; all three were on friendly terms. That day Hu Ba, whose master was ill and had no errands, had come out to find Meng Qi to watch"},{paragraph:5,mentions:1,tokens:["胡八"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"那胡八道：「这琴言我没见过，不知怎样生得好呢。就是我们老爷，前月在宏济寺魏大爷处，叫他陪了一天酒。将我们姨奶奶的一对翡翠镯子赏了他。这镯子在广东买，还值一千四百块钱，在京里更贵了。如今我们老爷病到了，也没见他来看过一回，这人大概是没有良心的。既跟了你们公子",en:`Hu Ba then put in: "I have never seen this Qinyan — I don't know what he looks like. As for our master, last month at the Hongjisi Temple, at the gathering hosted by Master Wei, Qinyan attended our master for a whole day, and our master gave him a pair of`},{paragraph:6,mentions:1,tokens:["胡八"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"姚贤吃了饭，道了谢，就进城来见了珊枝，将琴言近日的事，先照伍麻子，后照孟七、胡八的话，没有少说一句，说得顺口，还添了好些。又说路上见他与一个相公同车，想是陪酒去了。珊枝听了，呆了一会，说道：「这是什么话？是真的，还是假的？我要照你的话回，若有假的在里头，就了不得了。」",en:"where he reported to Shanzhi. He relayed Qinyan's recent doings — first as Mazi had told them, then as Meng Qi and Hu Ba had reported — without leaving out a single word, and with his tongue loosened, he added a good many embellishments of his own. He also said that on the road he had seen Qinyan sharing a carriage with another young performer, apparently going off to"},{paragraph:7,mentions:1,tokens:["胡八爷"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"姚贤道：「我怎敢撒谎？这是徐老爷家的孟七爷，并奚家的胡八爷，讲得有凭据，我敢添一句，对出谎来，是好耍的么？」珊枝心里细想道：「琴言何敢如此负恩？非特公子白疼了他，我也白白的照应他一番了。」又转念道：「看他的心总是勉强在此，心上又有什么梅少爷，自然在外面快乐。但到徐老爷处也还罢了。怎么连魏聘才、奚十一都陪酒来",en:`"How would I dare to tell lies?" said Yao Xian. "These are words spoken by Meng Qi of Lord Xu's household and Hu Ba of the Xi family's household — with witnesses to what was said. Would I dare add a word? Is it something to jest about?" Shanzhi turned it over in his mind: "How could Qinyan be so ungrateful? Not only has the young master loved him for nothing — I have`}],58:[{paragraph:4,mentions:1,tokens:["胡八"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"见头脑狰狞，其实根株疲软，只好停顿多而纵送少。菊花才二十几岁，火盆似的，如何能常吃那粗粝东西？一日，奚十一带了胡八出门去了，与唐和尚商量。一轮晴日，满照明窗，菊花梳了头，好不纳闷。无意之间到外边来散步，走到跟班房门口，见关着门，里面有笑声。菊花轻轻的在门缝里一张，见春兰弯着腰在炕边，看有四只脚站在一处。菊花一见，即把袖子掩了口，听巴英官说道：「你倒会长，怎么他不",en:`For one thing it was lumpy and rough, with coarse skin and an uneven outline. For another it was top-heavy and root-weak. It was fierce-looking at the head but soft at the base, good for long pauses but poor for thrusting. Juhua was only in her twenties, a brazier of appetite. How could she constantly endure that coarse implement? One day Xi Eleven took Hu Eight out on business and went to consult Monk Tang. Under a clear sun filling the bright windows Juhua dressed her hair, thoroughly bored. Idly she strolled outside and came to the attendants' quarters. The door was shut, but laughter came from within. Juhua peeped through the crack. Chunlan was bent over the kang, and four feet stood together on it. At once she clapped her sleeve to her mouth. She heard Ba Yingguan say, "You're the one who grows, so how come he doesn't? He is always the same." Chunlan replied, "He's grown a bit, just not as fast as yours. You're short in the body, but he's long. It's almost like the master's now." Yingguan said, "The master's doesn't match mine nowadays." As they spoke their feet turned about. Whoever had been in front was now behind. Juhua went limp watching, and her teeth grated. She could not bear it, yet she could not bring herself to curse them, and she went back to her room thinking, "Who'd have thought those two pups could carry on like that. People mock me for saying rabbits lack vigor. Little they know it's a whole oven of good sesame cakes in one bed. If they can do this, they can surely do that too." Her face burned. An old woman brought food. Juhua ate and lit the lamp. Suddenly she examined that "musket" a while, circled it with two fingers, finding it a full handspan thick, and laid it between her thighs. She scooped a box of opium, trimmed the wick, and blew puff after puff, her eyes half closed as if sleep were coming. She felt someone lean over her and kiss her mouth. Slowly she opened her eyes to find it was Xi Eleven returned. Juhua smiled. Xi wore a smile too and went to lie down and smoke on the other side. Juhua asked, "Why are you home so early today?" Xi sighed, "How fickle men are! Had I known, I'd have saved. I'd owe nothing and still have a surplus. Why must I swallow such insults! Today, if Monk Tang and Zhang Zhongyu hadn't stood surety, Pan the Third would never have lent a copper and would have pressed the debt. Pan borrowed from me once. Did I ever charge interest? Now he lends to me at compound rates. Think how touching that friendship is. In bits and pieces I used three thousand of his silver. With interest he calls it four. He lends two thousand more for travel but makes me sign a ten-thousand-tael promissory note, with five thousand repaid at the Jiangnan father's post, and five thousand in Guangdong. He is also sending two clerks along. I had no choice but to agree. Once we're south of the river it may be well. If I can pay all at once, it would be better still, and I could spare feeding them the whole way. Bringing two creditors home would look ugly." Juhua said, "That Pan the Third was never decent. No wonder people want to gouge his backside. I can't stand that face of his." Xi Eleven giggled. Juhua asked, "The silver, did you bring it?" Xi confirmed he did. Juhua continued, "I hear there's a Nine-Fragrance Tower the actors newly opened, selling embroidery and such. Buy me something. I want two pairs of figured sleeves, one pair kesi-woven, one drawn-thread." Xi said, "We'll pass Suzhou on the way, so we can buy there. Goods here come from Suzhou too." Juhua insisted, "I want theirs. Nine-Fragrance has palace-made stock, gifts from princely houses, and Suzhou can't match it. It wouldn't cost much." Xi knew the shop was run by Yuan Baozhu, Su Huifang, and the others. Lately he had been in no mood to browse, but now he had travel money and could go tomorrow, so he agreed.`}]},"char-215":{40:[{paragraph:42,mentions:1,tokens:["许老大"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"头发，揌了两三回。潘三口内呻吟，双脚乱挣。幸亏他的肛门老苍，没有抠出血来。许老二揌完，放了潘三。潘三只是发抖。许老大道：「潘三，你知罪么？我好好一个兄弟，被你强奸了，就天理难容。你还放了些东西，叫他一世成了病，做不得好人。所以我们今日也还个礼，叫你也做个脏头风，你说该不该？」",en:`gouging. Once Xu Laoer finished stuffing, he released Pan the Third. Pan the Third was left trembling uncontrollably. Xu Laoda said, "Pan the Third, do you know your crime? My perfectly good brother was forcibly violated by you — a deed heaven's laws cannot tolerate! Furthermore, you planted things inside him, condemning him to a lifetime of illness, unable to be a proper man.`},{paragraph:46,mentions:1,tokens:["许老大"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"许老大道：「这个有什么方法？」三姐道：「我闻得吃荞麦面，便可除肚里吃下的猪毛羊毛。你把这荞麦面做了汤元，包些糖，不要煮熟，带生的与他吃，吃两天试试。或者可以撒得出来。」那二人道：「这个最容易，我们回去就做些与他吃。」又坐了一坐，弟兄二人拿了钱也自回去。不知",en:'Xu Laoda asked, "What method is there for this?" Third Sister explained, "I have heard that eating buckwheat noodles can expel pig or sheep hair swallowed into the stomach. Take this buckwheat flour, make it into dumplings filled with sugar, but do not boil them'}]},"char-216":{45:[{paragraph:21,mentions:1,tokens:[],kind:"identified-reference",zh:"汝前生为江宁府推官，杜郎为汝娇女，十五夭亡，汝伤悼成疾而殁。",en:`"How pitiful, a death for love of a tender daughter;
Three perfect arts once praised Zheng Guangwen.
Another day seek Lake Mochou's shore,
Lotus fragrance drifting round a maiden's tomb."
More judgment followed: "You were, in a former life, an assistant magistrate of Jiangning Prefecture. Young Du was your beloved daughter. She died at fifteen, and you wasted away with grief and followed her. This was seventy-seven years ago. Causes stand clear, and effects are yet to ripen."`,identityNote:{en:"The planchette describes Qinyan’s former incarnation as the judge’s daughter; chapter 55 identifies her grave as Fairy Du’s. This is a supernatural disclosure within the story.",zh:"乩判说琴言前生为推官之女，第55回明言其墓为杜仙女墓；这是小说中的神异叙述。"}}],55:[{paragraph:23,mentions:2,tokens:["杜仙女"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"声都飞向北去了，刘喜还拍一拍手赶他。刘喜问那女郎道：「湖那边有什么顽的地方没有？」女郎道：「那边是城墙，只有个杜仙女墓，看兰苕花、翡翠雀最好顽的。方才那一群翠雀就是杜仙女墓上的，他懒得飞，搭我的船过来。」",en:`girl, "Are there any fun places across the lake?" She replied, "Over there is just the city wall and the tomb of Du the Fairy—it's the best place to see orchids and kingfishers. That flock of kingfishers just now came from her tomb; they were too lazy to fly, so they hitched a ride on my boat."`},{paragraph:24,mentions:2,tokens:["杜仙女"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"琴仙听了有个杜仙女墓，触动了心事，即问道：「这个杜仙女是几时人？」那女郎道：「我却不知，只听说有七八十年，也是个官家的女儿，死了葬在这里的。」琴仙问道：「何以要称他仙女呢？」那女郎道：「他看这个地方也数得清的人家，如何有那样华妍妙丽的女郎？见他常常的荡个小船，在莲花丛",en:`Hearing of Du the Fairy's tomb, Qinxian's heart was deeply stirred, and he immediately asked, "From what era was this Du the Fairy?" The girl answered, "That I don't know. I've only heard she lived seventy or eighty years ago. She was the daughter of an official family and`}],56:[{paragraph:1,mentions:1,tokens:["杜仙女"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"道：「此刻略清爽些，就是半个身子动不来，想也就好的。我已服了好些药，你今日到何处去？」琴仙便说去逛莫愁湖，有个杜仙女墓，与仙乩上说的相对。道翁也觉诧异，道：「果然有这个坟，有碑记没有呢？」琴仙道：「没有碑记。」也将红衣女子的光景述了一遍。道翁猜是莲花神指点，父子两个说了一会话。",en:`medicine. Where did you wander today?" Qinxian explained that he had strolled along Mochou Lake, discovering a Du Fairy's tomb just as the spirit-planchette had foretold. Daoweng, taken aback, asked: "So there truly is such a grave. Does it bear an inscription?" Qinxian replied that there was none, and he went on to describe the ethereal vision of the girl in red. Daoweng`}],59:[{paragraph:12,mentions:1,tokens:["杜仙女"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"」又道：「尊公葬事一切在我，我回去就着人去找地，先安葬了，再说别事。」琴仙想道：「与其葬在别处，不如葬在莫愁湖杜仙女坟上，原是父女。」又恐梅侍郎不信，委委曲曲的讲了那底里。",en:`later." Qinxian thought to himself, "Rather than burying him elsewhere, it would be better to bury him beside Fairy Du's tomb by Mochou Lake; after all, they were father and daughter." Fearing Vice Minister Mei might not believe him, he meticulously recounted the entire intricate story.`},{paragraph:16,mentions:1,tokens:["杜仙女"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"不必论他，只要人好，总是一样。又想：「看这道翁像成了神，莫非莫愁湖畔果有他女儿的坟么？昨琴仙请仙之说，又见什么杜仙女，竟是真的了。」半夜竟不能寐。天一明就起来，着人去请了屈大爷过来，有话商量。",en:`grave truly is located by Mochou Lake? If so, Qinxian's account of the planchette session and his encounter with Fairy Du must actually be true." He lay awake for the rest of the night. At the crack of dawn, he rose and sent someone to invite Master Qu over, indicating he had matters to discuss.`},{paragraph:17,mentions:1,tokens:["杜仙女"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"时就开了许多花出来。倒将个梅侍郎看得心惊，唯有肃然起敬。琴仙见墓门间多了四棵小树，已有三四尺高，仔细看时，就是杜仙女种的苹、梨、桃、李，每棵树上开了一朵花，芳艳无比，心中甚骇：「怎么已经开花了？」梅侍郎看了，连连称异，叹为真神仙福地，便问家人道：「此处大约是官地，没有地主的？」家人道：「凡靠城一带，俱系官地。」梅侍郎才定了主意，在左右徘徊了一会，见苕花丛中飞出许多",en:'already three or four feet tall. Looking closely, he recognized them as the apple, pear, peach, and plum trees that Fairy Du had planted. Each tree bore a single, incomparably vibrant blossom, leaving him utterly astonished. "How can they have blossomed already?" he wondered. Vice Minister Mei, witnessing this, repeatedly expressed his amazement, praising it as a truly blessed'},{paragraph:18,mentions:1,tokens:["杜仙女"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"、二门、正上厅三楹，两厢房后楼三楹，余平厦六间。规模粗定，士燮不能等待，发了二千金与家中老总管梅成督造，又画了杜仙女像，命塑泥身彩画。一一分拨定了，那日就请琴仙过来商量，要带他进京。琴仙喜出望外，又复谢了，即算清房租，一直搬到梅侍郎的船上，并将领回之银，送与梅侍郎，梅侍郎仍叫他收了。此番琴仙感激，真到二十分。梅侍郎因道翁梦中之语，绝不查问琴仙根底，因刘喜称呼大爷，",en:"to his seasoned chief steward, Mei Cheng, to oversee the remaining construction. He also sketched a portrait of Fairy Du, ordering a painted clay statue to be modeled after it. Once every task was meticulously assigned, he invited Qinxian over that very day to discuss taking him along to the capital. Overjoyed, Qinxian offered his profound thanks once more. He immediately"},{paragraph:19,mentions:1,tokens:["杜仙女"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"。把这屈公祠扩充起来，起了好些亭台楼阁。莫愁湖中造了湖心亭、九曲红桥，又造了几个船，以为春夏游湖之乐。屈公墓、杜仙女墓前，都建石牌坊、华表柱、翁仲，余外又围了一个园，种些花木，堆些假山，竟成了一个名胜。这屈公祠竟与孙楚楼、江令宅齐名不朽了。",en:"commissioned a few boats for the enjoyment of spring and summer excursions. In front of the tombs of Master Qu and Fairy Du, they erected stone memorial archways, ornamental pillars, and stone guardian statues. Furthermore, they enclosed the area to create a garden, planting various flowers and trees, and piling up artificial rockeries, transforming the site into a renowned"},{paragraph:28,mentions:1,tokens:["杜仙女"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"仙在一个枕上和衣而卧，竟把嫌疑也忘了，琴仙便哝哝唧唧说出京时如何想念，在南京如何游玩，到莫愁湖亲见他前生坟墓，杜仙女怎样灵异，道翁临终时怎样伤心，众长随逃窃后怎样受苦，刘喜怎样尽心服侍，侯石翁怎样戏谑，又将梅侍郎来访，他怎样仗义安葬建祠的话，细细述了，说得子玉悲乐相乘。",en:"Nanjing, how he had personally visited his former life's grave at Mochou Lake, the miraculous manifestations of Fairy Du, the heartbreaking sorrow of Daoweng's final moments, the suffering he endured after the senior servants stole their belongings and fled, how Liu Xi had served him with utmost devotion, the lecherous harassment of Hou Shiweng, and finally, Vice Minister"}],60:[{paragraph:4,mentions:2,tokens:["杜仙女"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"子云问道：「怎样呢？」吉甫道：「花神若定要十二位，也可凑得上，只要把屈道翁做了芙蓉城主，再借重玉侬的前生所说那杜仙女，凑上玉侬，不是十二位了？」春航道：「妙，妙！此像要画得像，不必说真姓真名，缀个别号，每人做一篇赞语，说得似真似幻的，要与人花两合。」子玉道：「这个图怎样的好呢？还是单画人，还是补景呢？」仲清道：「自然单画人，一并的画去，后就缀小传一篇。刻石之后，可",en:`flower deities, we can make up the number. We need only cast Qu Daoweng as the Lord of Furong City, and borrow the Fairy Du from Yunong's past-life vision. Add Yunong himself, and does that not make twelve?" Chunhang exclaimed, "Brilliant, brilliant! The portraits must capture their likenesses, but we need not use their true names—we can append style names instead. Each will`},{paragraph:5,mentions:2,tokens:["杜仙女"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"。那十篇如今是这样，各人拈阄，拈到谁是谁。华星北也叫他做一篇在内。」南湘道：「甚好。」于是写起阄来，将屈道翁与杜仙女、屈琴仙分做二阄，其余九人分作九阄。说也奇怪，想必文字有灵，前生缘法，子云拈了道翁，子玉拈了杜仙女、琴仙，金粟拈了宝珠，春航拈了蕙芳，仲清拈了琪官，文泽拈了春喜，南湘拈了兰保，王恂拈了桂保，高品拈了玉林，次贤拈了漱芳，单拈不着素兰，只好送与华公子去作",en:'to write one as well." Nanxiang agreed it was a fine idea. And so they prepared the lots, grouping Qu Daoweng, Fairy Du, and Qu Qinxian into two draws, and the remaining nine into nine draws. Curiously enough, as if the written word possessed a spirit and past-life affinities were at play, Ziyun drew Daoweng; Ziyu drew Fairy Du and Qinxian; Jin Su drew Baozhu; Chunhang'},{paragraph:6,mentions:1,tokens:["杜仙女"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"画了十天才成。画成又请吉甫一一的改好，画一个，刻一个，倒也甚快。子云因受了感冒甚重，不敢用心，嘱将道翁、琴仙、杜仙女画在一幅，并求子玉作赞。到二十七日，连传赞都也刻起，系是各人书丹。二十八日就搬往九香楼镶嵌，一日完工。",en:"speed. Ziyun, suffering from a severe cold, dared not overexert himself, so he asked that Daoweng, Qinxian, and Fairy Du be combined into a single panel, and requested Ziyu to compose the eulogy. By the twenty-seventh, all the biographies and eulogies had been carved, each inscribed on the stone in the author's own hand. On the twenty-eighth, the stones were moved to Nine-Fragrance"}]},"char-217":{12:[{paragraph:4,mentions:1,tokens:["张桐孙"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"通经史。二十五岁上生了春航，二十八岁上，春航之父田浩中了进士，即殁于京师。这田夫人苦节抚孤，教养兼任，幸藉其兄张桐孙太守不时周济。这春航的学问，多半得于母教。幼有凤毛之誉，长夸骏骨之奇。十三岁进了学，十八岁中了副举。",en:"capital. Lady Tian kept her chaste widowhood and raised her son alone, with the support of her elder brother, Prefect Zhang Tongsun, who helped them from time to time. Chunhang's learning owed much of its foundation to his mother's teaching. As a child he had a reputation for extraordinary gifts; as he grew, people marveled at his exceptional qualities. At thirteen he entered the"}],48:[{paragraph:7,mentions:1,tokens:["张桐孙"],kind:"named-mention",zh:`的夫人，于二月内暴病而亡。太夫人伤心万状，家中止有一老仆，并一仆妇，诸事草草，甚望春航会试回来。适值春航之母舅张桐孙，前任直隶天津府知府，因与上台不合，告病回家。
家居数年，情况不支。且上司已换，只得起程来京，定于三月十五日挈眷起身，偕了田太夫人来都，数日间就要到了。`,en:"handled hastily in the hope that Chunhang would return from the examinations. Meanwhile, Chunhang's maternal uncle, Zhang Tongsun, the former prefect of Tianjin, had resigned due to illness after a conflict with his superior and found himself struggling financially at home. With his superior now replaced, he decided to travel to the capital. Setting out on the fifteenth of the"}],52:[{paragraph:3,mentions:2,tokens:["张桐孙"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"仲雨这些事是最在行的，诸事调度得很有章程。新房内自有苏府的人来铺设。春航的母舅张桐孙已带了家眷往直省候补去了，今奉差来京，也帮着春航张罗。初六那一日有两处戏酒，一处在聚星堂，请的是乡试座师礼部尚书刘守正、座师内阁学士王文辉、会试房师兵部郎中杨方猷，鸿胪寺卿周锡爵、光禄少卿陆宗沅，这两位是同乡前辈兼有年谊。张桐孙陪了这几位在聚星堂观戏",en:"Within the bridal chamber, the Su household's own people handled the elaborate preparations. Chunhang's uncle, Zhang Tongsun, who had previously taken his family to await an official appointment in a provincial post, now returned to the capital on a formal assignment and also helped coordinate the festivities. On the sixth day, there were two distinct banquet sites. One was"},{paragraph:17,mentions:1,tokens:["张桐孙"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"得出来歇歇，便到文辉席上来，就在文辉旁边坐了。此处是两席，那席是刘守正、周锡爵、杨方猷，这席是王文辉、陆宗沅、张桐孙。文辉道：「这几天我知道你也累极了，所以叫你出来歇歇，此刻也应没有什么事了。」蕙芳道：「也没有什么忙，借此倒可跟着张二爷学学。那张二爷实在可以，大大小小，没有一点遗漏。」陆宗沅道：「这是张老二的专门本事。大概遇着这些事情，这账房非他不可。」文辉问蕙芳",en:'tables: one seated Liu Shouzheng, Zhou Xijue, and Yang Fangyou; the other seated Wang Wenhui, Lu Zongyuan, and Zhang Tongsun. Wenhui said kindly, "I know you have been worked to the bone these past days, so I called you out to rest. By now, the heavy work should be finished." Huifang replied, "It is not too busy now. It is a good chance to learn from Second Master Zhang. He'},{paragraph:18,mentions:1,tokens:["张桐孙"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"蕙芳笑道：「难带的东西想是粗笨的，你不要拿些木器家伙，什么铁炉子、铁火盒，寄放在我处，我是不领情的。」陆宗沅、张桐孙笑起来，王文辉也笑，把扇子打了蕙芳一下：「你薄我，这还了得。」蕙芳也笑。文辉手弄长髯，蕙芳道：「你那胡子怎么倒黑起来了？想是遵姨太太命染黑的。」文辉笑道：「这更胡说了。」便自己看看胡须道：「老了，你们这些少年人，虽然与我们讲些顽笑话，心上是很嫌我们的",en:'try to dump wooden furniture, iron stoves, or heavy braziers on me—I will not thank you for it." Lu Zongyuan and Zhang Tongsun chuckled, and Wang Wenhui laughed too, tapping Huifang lightly with his fan. "You mock me? This is too much!" Huifang smiled as well. As Wenhui stroked his long beard, Huifang said, "How has your beard grown so black? I suppose you dyed it at the command'},{paragraph:19,mentions:1,tokens:["张桐孙"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"陆宗沅笑道：「你不要带着人说，我们的胡子不是染的。」那边席上的刘尚书、周锡爵、杨方猷都笑起来，惟有张桐孙是个道学人，不会顽笑。周锡爵道：「质夫，你那乌须药的方子，可是你孙亲家传你的？」文辉道：「他那几根胡子，要用什么乌须药？」既而一想，便大笑起来。陆宗沅也明白，也笑了。",en:'beards are not dyed." At the other table, Minister Liu, Zhou Xijue, and Yang Fangyou all burst into laughter. Only Zhang Tongsun, a rigid neo-Confucian scholar, remained unamused. Zhou Xijue called out, "Zhifu, did that black-beard prescription of yours come from your Sun-family in-laws?" Wenhui replied dismissively, "With those few sparse hairs of his, what use would he have'},{paragraph:20,mentions:1,tokens:["张桐孙"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"刘守正与杨方猷不解其故，连声的问，文辉就将亮功女儿漆头发的一事讲出来，听得众人皆笑，连张桐孙也笑起来。周锡爵道：「既是这么着，质夫，你何不到班里借个假胡子带着，省得这乌黑的东西，沾染了你们如夫人的脸。」刘守正道：「这一染，就直染到胸前呢。」文辉道：「嚼你的舌头。」陆宗沅道：「怎么你把这尺寸都量得清清楚楚的？」蕙芳道：「带着假胡子好。你索性把",en:`recounted the old story of Lianggong's daughter dyeing her hair, which sent everyone into fits of laughter—even Zhang Tongsun chuckled. Zhou Xijue suggested, "If that is the case, Zhifu, why not borrow a fake beard from the theater troupe? It would save that black dye from rubbing off onto your ladies' faces." Liu Shouzheng added, "Once it rubs off, it stains right down to`}],55:[{paragraph:13,mentions:1,tokens:["张桐孙"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"」道翁把那几个名士一一说了，石翁道：「今年点状元的那个田君，他的父亲也算我的门生，中了进士，就不在了。他的母舅张桐孙也与我相好。这徐公子自然不用讲了，晓山相公可为善人裕后。」道翁将怡园诸人分题的对子念与，石翁也赞了几联，说道：「倒不料一班小孩子居然能这样，真是英雄出少年，我辈老头儿，倒要退避三舍了。」",en:`top honors this year—his father could be considered my disciple. He became a Jinshi but is now gone. His uncle Zhang Tongsun is also a good friend of mine. Young Master Xu goes without saying; Minister Xiaoshan's goodness naturally blesses his descendants." Daoweng then recited the matched couplets composed by the various scholars at the Garden of Contentment. Shiweng praised`}]},"char-218":{12:[{paragraph:4,mentions:1,tokens:["田浩"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"十三岁。也是金陵人，却寄居扬州。自幼失怙。母张氏，名门世族，淹通经史。二十五岁上生了春航，二十八岁上，春航之父田浩中了进士，即殁于京师。这田夫人苦节抚孤，教养兼任，幸藉其兄张桐孙太守不时周济。这春航的学问，多半得于母教。幼有凤毛之誉，长夸骏骨之奇。十三岁进了学，十八岁中了副举。",en:"classics and histories. She bore Chunhang at the age of twenty-five; when Chunhang was three years old, his father Tian Hao passed the jinshi examination and promptly died in the capital. Lady Tian kept her chaste widowhood and raised her son alone, with the support of her elder brother, Prefect Zhang Tongsun, who helped them from time to time. Chunhang's learning owed much"}]},"char-219":{30:[{paragraph:5,mentions:2,tokens:["谢笠山","笠山"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"埒。不过地址窄小，只得怡园三分之一。园中有十二楼，从前聘才所到之西花厅，尚是进园第一处。从前华公爷一个好友叫作谢笠山，是个画画好手，与他布置了十二年，却是浓淡相宜，疏密得体。到华公子长成，心爱繁华，又把笠山手笔改了许多。如今是一味雕琢绚烂，竟不留一点朴素处。",en:"Hall where Pincai had previously been was just the first entry point. A close friend of the late Duke Hua named Xie Lishan, an excellent painter, had spent twelve years designing it, achieving a perfect balance of light and shade, density and sparseness. As Young Master Hua grew up with a love for extravagance, he altered much of Lishan's original work. Now, it was entirely"}]},"char-220":{5:[{paragraph:28,mentions:1,tokens:[],kind:"identified-reference",zh:"他的老爷子是世袭一等公，现做镇西将军。",en:`Through the passageway was the main hall, flanked by six wing-rooms on either side. Fu the Third was already standing beneath the eaves of the main house, coming forward to welcome him. Pincai hurried up and clasped his hands in greeting. Fu the Third led him behind the main hall to sit in a pair of small study rooms, exchanging polite inquiries about each other's health. Pincai said: "The snow delayed me these past few days, otherwise I would have come to pay my respects the day before yesterday. I felt so restless at home, thinking of you constantly, Third Brother." Fu the Third replied: "The feeling is mutual." This place was Fu the Third's study, situated close to the inner chambers, separated only by a courtyard. Pincai briefly took in the room's furnishings: the space was divided by a floor-to-ceiling partition of nanmu wood carved with ice-crackle patterns. In the upper room was a wooden kang, adorned with a set of four small landscape screens, and a striking clock rested on the kang table. Nearby stood a square table with several chairs, and in the center sat a large copper coal-brazier. On the wall hung a silk-scroll couplet, and beside it an intricate Western painting. The kang cushions were of sapphire-blue satin. A servant entered, wearing a plain silk fur-lined jacket and a fur hat pulled down over his eyebrows, revealing half of a large braided queue at the back. Carrying a tea tray, he first handed a cup to Pincai. Pincai said: "Please convey my respects to the Madam." Before the servant could reply, Fu the Third said: "Your sister-in-law is not home today; she has gone to visit her parents. Stay and have a meal with me today, and we can chat." Pincai readily agreed, then asked: "Will Eldest Brother be coming today?" Fu the Third replied: "I'm not sure. I heard him say yesterday he had business and needed to go to Jinchun Garden to ask Young Master Hua to put in a good word. I imagine he has gone there by now." Hearing of Young Master Hua of Jinchun Garden, Pincai asked: "I was just going to ask about that Young Master Hua." He then recounted what he had seen on the road and what the driver had told him. Fu the Third said: "What does a driver know! This Young Master Hua's name is Guangsu, style name Xingbei. His father is a hereditary first-class duke, currently serving as Commander-General of the Western Frontier. Because of the great merits of his ancestors, when he was eighteen and entered official service, he was immediately awarded the rank of a second-class idle grand minister. This year he is twenty-one, accomplished in horsemanship and archery, and quite capable in literary affairs as well. His looks go without saying — even those young dan performers cannot match him. The only fault is that he spends too lavishly. But in truth he is not arrogant or haughty at all; people who see his imposing retinue simply do not dare approach him. His family wealth is beyond reckoning. A few years back he married the daughter of Su, Marquis of Jingbian of the Ministry of War, whose dowry alone came to a million taels. His wife is truly beautiful as a heavenly immortal, her looks may be the finest in all the realm. She is supremely virtuous too, accomplished in calligraphy, painting, chess, and music. She also has ten maidservants called the Ten Pearl Maids, all bearing names with the character 'pearl', all as beautiful as flowers and jade, literate, and able to sing and play instruments. In his residence, Young Master Hua truly passes every day in delight. He is the foremost noble young man in the city, the supreme wealthy patron. I have a slight family tie to him myself, through your sister-in-law's maternal uncle.`,identityNote:{en:"The old Duke Hua is referred to as Hua Guangsu’s father; this is a report, not his entrance into the scene.",zh:"此处说华光宿之父的爵位与官职，并非华老公爷亲自登场。"}}],16:[{paragraph:18,mentions:1,tokens:["老公爷"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"就是吹竹弹丝也还来得。顾月卿是苏州人，比笑梅略长两岁，亦颇俊秀，是画山水花草的。那边还有个书启先生叫王卿云，是老公爷的旧友，有五十余岁了。阎简安是办笔墨杂务，他二人又在一个院落，当下都请来见了。阎简安道：「不料前日一见，今日就进我们府中来，有这等奇事。」聘才道：「小弟多蒙华公子谬爱，招之门下。无奈铅刀袜线，一无所能，诸事全仗老先生们教训。」",en:`landscape and floral painting. Also present was Wang Qingyun, a drafting secretary in his fifties and an old friend of the Duke. Yan Jian'an, who handled miscellaneous writing tasks, resided in another courtyard but was invited over for introductions. Yan Jian'an said, "Who would have thought that after meeting just the other day, you would join our household today? What a curious`}],24:[{paragraph:5,mentions:2,tokens:["华公爷"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"了军功。他父亲荫袭云骑尉，由守备起来，在军营出力，今作了提台。度香说与他有世谊，因鄙其为人，是以不与往来。从前华公爷作大经略，平倭寇，徐中堂是副经略，同在军营。那时老奚才作四川游击，是华公爷、徐中堂保举起来，即得了副将，旋升总兵，前年又升了江南提督。籍系广东嘉应州，家道甚丰，足有正千万的事业，又在省城当了个洋行总商。他共有兄弟十二人，有作官的，有当商的。他本要捐个",en:"the families are old connections, but he despises the man and will have nothing to do with him. Years ago, when Duke Hua was Grand Commandant and put down the Japanese pirates, Grand Secretary Xu served as his deputy, and both were with the army. Old Xi was then only a brigade sub-commander in Sichuan; it was Duke Hua and Grand Secretary Xu who recommended him. He was"}],25:[{paragraph:10,mentions:1,tokens:["华公爷"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"原来华公爷与徐相国，已是二十年至好，又同在军营两年，有苔岑之谊，金石之交。徐子云与华公子，他们又订金兰，重修世好。子云比华公子长了五岁，华公子以长兄相待，甚是恭敬。当时子云即让华公子坐了，家人献过了茶，华公子道：「早几日就要过来请安，因连日有随驾差使，而且天气",en:"It emerged that Duke Hua and Duke Xu had been deepest friends twenty years and served two campaigns together — friendship moss-thick as hill herbs, oath-bound as metal and stone. Xu Ziyun and Young Master Hua had sworn brotherhood and revived the tie between houses. Ziyun was"}],27:[{paragraph:7,mentions:1,tokens:["华公爷"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"一年论租，就抵得一府分的钱漕，自然也算个极豪富的人家了。」亮轩点点头：「我们东家也常提起，说华公子是他的世叔，华公爷是我老东家提台老大人的老师。有这么一个好世交，我们东家竟不拉拢。小弟是常劝他去走走。东家说，这是从前在军营保举的老师，那时华公子还小，说起来也未必知道，所以不肯去。就是现在那位徐中堂，做两广总督的，也是老师在军营同拜的，如今只有二少爷在京里。我前日在",en:'Liangxuan nodded. "My patron often speaks of it — that Young Master Hua is an uncle of his own generation, and that the old Duke Hua was the teacher of my former patron, the Provincial Military Commander. With a family connection as good as that, and yet my patron will not cultivate it. I am forever urging him to call. He says the tie came of a recommendation in camp, that Young Master'}],30:[{paragraph:5,mentions:1,tokens:["华公爷"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"而精工华丽，却亦相埒。不过地址窄小，只得怡园三分之一。园中有十二楼，从前聘才所到之西花厅，尚是进园第一处。从前华公爷一个好友叫作谢笠山，是个画画好手，与他布置了十二年，却是浓淡相宜，疏密得体。到华公子长成，心爱繁华，又把笠山手笔改了许多。如今是一味雕琢绚烂，竟不留一点朴素处。",en:"The West Flower Hall where Pincai had previously been was just the first entry point. A close friend of the late Duke Hua named Xie Lishan, an excellent painter, had spent twelve years designing it, achieving a perfect balance of light and shade, density and sparseness. As Young Master Hua grew up with a love for extravagance, he altered much of Lishan's original work."}]},"char-221":{32:[{paragraph:8,mentions:4,tokens:["杠花","花中桂"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"：「中的人我也不认得，我就晓得这两个，一个是叶茂林的女婿叫作窑子归，这三十四名归自荣就是。一个是潘三的女婿叫作杠花，他老子叫花三胡子，在杠房抬杠出身，如今大发财，开了几处杠房，这六十三名花中桂就是。」高品再把第一张《题名录》看了一遍，略生喜色，不觉叹口气道：「也罢，名利二字是有一定的。现在你们不比外人，我对你们直讲罢，一千六百两银子卖掉了一个举人，这个杠花就是我",en:`carrying biers in a funeral parlor, then made a fortune and opened several parlors himself. This sixty-third name Hua Zhonggui is him." Gao Pin read through the first sheet of the list again, a slight look of pleasure crossing his face, and then he couldn't help sighing: "Ah well, fame and fortune are predestined. Since we are all friends here, I will speak plainly. I sold a`}]},"char-222":{32:[{paragraph:8,mentions:1,tokens:["花三胡子"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"不认得，我就晓得这两个，一个是叶茂林的女婿叫作窑子归，这三十四名归自荣就是。一个是潘三的女婿叫作杠花，他老子叫花三胡子，在杠房抬杠出身，如今大发财，开了几处杠房，这六十三名花中桂就是。」高品再把第一张《题名录》看了一遍，略生喜色，不觉叹口气道：「也罢，名利二字是有一定的。现在你们不比外人，我对你们直讲罢，一千六百两银子卖掉了一个举人，这个杠花就是我中的，是张仲雨的过",en:`thirty-fourth name, Gui Zirong, is him. The other is Pan the Third's son-in-law, called 'Bier-pole Hua'. His father is Hua the Third, nicknamed 'The Beard', who started out carrying biers in a funeral parlor, then made a fortune and opened several parlors himself. This sixty-third name Hua Zhonggui is him." Gao Pin read through the first sheet of the list again, a slight look of pleasure`}]},"char-223":{41:[{paragraph:2,mentions:1,tokens:["香儿"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"一日在园中归鸿小渚倚阑垂钓，珊枝与金、玉二龄，还有一个小丫鬟香儿，在傍伺候。金龄找了一个大瓷瓯，走下池边贮了水。华公子钓了一回，得了三寸长的一个小鱼，已觉满心欢喜。见那池水清冷，每于潆流洄互处，把些铜皮嵌在石脚，那流水过来便有琤琮之声，如琴筑一般。又见水面上飞了无数的花瓣，一个红鲤鱼游来游去，吃那飞花，见了钓丝上",en:"water's edge. Shanzhi and the two pages Jinling and Yuling attended him, along with a little maidservant named Xiang'er. Jinling had fetched a large porcelain basin and filled it with water at the pond's edge to hold any catch. The young master had been fishing for a while and caught a small fish barely three inches long, yet felt quite pleased with himself. He observed"},{paragraph:5,mentions:1,tokens:["香儿"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"华夫人带了明珠、花珠、荷珠、赠珠四个女婢过来，华公子笑面相迎。华夫人道：「这两日天气甚好，我本来也想逛逛。方才香儿说你在这里钓鱼，我从西书房夹道中走来，倒也不远。我又叫老婆子收拾些食品过来。」华公子道：「我本有此意，你倒预先办妥了。」二人凭阑观玩了一会，华公子道：「我们何不下船逛逛池子？」四珠即扶了夫人慢慢的走下台阶，明珠，赠珠先上了船头，挽住华夫人上了船。公子",en:`Hua said: "The weather has been so fine these past two days—I had been meaning to take a stroll. A moment ago Xiang'er told me you were here fishing, and I came by way of the passage alongside the west study; it was not far at all. I have also had the servants prepare some refreshments to bring along." The young master replied: "That was precisely what I had in mind,`},{paragraph:32,mentions:2,tokens:["香儿"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"也没有格外得过一点好东西。姑娘，如今赏下来，你不要的给我，不要给那些小丫头糟蹋了。」爱珠一笑走开。那个小丫头叫香儿的笑道：「他们还没有到手，你倒想他转赏了你。我明日买个沙吊子送你，好装烧酒，省得你那个没有把子，要倒拿着嘴使。你要想别的东西，你也配？」那老婆子被香儿取笑了，又不敢骂他，只得鼓起了眼睛，瞅了他一眼。那一个老婆子低低叹口气道：「咳，从来说人老珠黄不值钱",en:`it to me, don't let those little girls make waste of it." Aizhu smiled and walked away. The little maidservant Xiang'er laughed and said, "They haven't even received their gifts yet, and you're already hoping for hand-me-downs. Tomorrow I'll buy you a clay wine-flask as a present, so you can store your spirits in it and not have to hold that handle-less jug bottom-up`}],44:[{paragraph:7,mentions:5,tokens:["小香儿","香儿"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"点下作脾气。如今好罢，倒是那有些下作脾气的，不敢告假，闹出笑话来。」主意定了便走到内书房，在粉墙外低低的喊叫那小香儿。听得香儿在里头咯吱吱的笑，喊了几声才出来。香儿问：「是什么事？」珊枝说：「要回话。」香儿道：「公子到园里去了…」珊枝道：「公子一人去的，还是同奶奶去的？」香儿道：「公子在这里带了宝姐姐、珍姐姐、蕊姐姐到园里，还是看桃花去了。奶奶没有去。」珊枝又听里",en:`one makes a spectacle of himself." His mind made up, he walked to the inner study and called softly to little Xiang'er through the whitewashed wall. He heard Xiang'er's silvery laughter from within, and only after several calls did the girl emerge. "What is it?" Xiang'er asked. "I need to report something." "The young master has gone to the garden," said Xiang'er. "Did`}],52:[{paragraph:24,mentions:1,tokens:["小香儿"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"，我恐扇旧了，已收起了。」华夫人也不疑心他给了人。将要出门，带了宝珠、爱珠、蕊珠、珍珠、明珠、掌珠六婢，又带了小香儿与两个仆妇。此时新秋，天气尚热，也不须多带衣服，带了一个小锦箱、一个锦匣，装些花钿脂粉。外面叫一个老年的管家骑了顶马，金龄、玉龄、兰龄、桂龄骑了跟班马。华夫人出房到内花厅，就坐肩舆，出了垂花门，上了车，另有车道。绕过大堂，家人方上马，随后八辆大鞍车，",en:"to depart, she brought along six maids—Baozhu, Aizhu, Ruizhu, Zhenzhu, Mingzhu, and Zhangzhu—along with little Xiang'er and two older servant women. Since it was early autumn and the weather remained warm, they did not pack many heavy clothes, only bringing a small brocade chest and a casket containing cosmetics and ornaments. Outside, an elderly steward rode the lead"}],53:[{paragraph:5,mentions:1,tokens:["香儿"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"拘泥了。你这样灵慧人，怕不是绣口锦心，作出来还要比人好。不要谦，今日在这里逛半天。既要制曲，自然不可无酒。」叫香儿到小厨房要几样果品，并要那莲心酒来。公子道：「你们这班人，为什么从前定要学戏？既学了戏，倒又不专于戏，学成了多少本事。我想从前戏旦中，也没有你们这一派。就有几个小聪明的，也拿不出手，况且他们的品行，我就不好说了。」素兰道：「我们这样本事算得什么？因是",en:`half the day wandering here. Since we are to compose lyrics, naturally we cannot do without wine." He ordered Xiang'er to fetch several kinds of fruit and lotus-heart wine from the small kitchen.

Young Master Hua continued, "Why did your lot insist on learning opera in the past? Since you learned it, you haven't devoted yourselves entirely to it, yet you have mastered`},{paragraph:6,mentions:1,tokens:["香儿"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"铺子。至于古董书画也有，要好的不能，不过中等的。」素兰请安谢了，道：「府上中等的，就是外头上等的了。」正说间，香儿领着两个书童，拿了酒盒来。珊枝见素兰喝酒，想没有什么差使，便走开了。华公子道：「喝一杯润润诗肠，好得佳句。」素兰道：「今日真要出丑，恐石子里榨不出油来。」公子道：「不用谦，况且是曲，一发熟极生巧。」素兰接过酒壶，与公子斟了，自己也斟了一杯，心中好不思",en:`gratitude. "What your noble house considers middling is equivalent to the very best outside."

As they were speaking, Xiang'er led two pageboys in, carrying a wine box. Seeing Sulan drinking and figuring he had no errands to run, Shanzhi slipped away.

Young Master Hua said, "Drink a cup to moisten your poetic spirit and draw out fine lines."

Sulan replied, "I fear I will truly`}]},"char-224":{6:[{paragraph:26,mentions:1,tokens:["保环"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"！那个那里是袁宝珠，那是顶黑的黑相公，偏偏他的名字也叫保珠，庾香一听就当是你定的第一名。我也想着要分辨，就被那保环缠住，没有这个空儿。「南湘大笑，子玉才知道另是个保珠，不是《花选》上的宝珠。",en:`Baozhu. Yuxiang heard the name and immediately assumed him to be your top choice. I was about to explain, but Baohuan had me so entangled that I never had the chance." Nanxiang burst into hearty laughter, and Ziyu finally realized it had been a completely different 'Baozhu' than the one in the Selection of Flowers.`}]},"char-225":{27:[{paragraph:9,mentions:1,tokens:["王吉庆"],kind:"named-mention",zh:`叫他陪酒，终席不说话。
要他斟钟酒，是没有的事。」春林道：「好沉架子，到他家去看他，倒是从不会客的。就是从前的王吉庆、李春芳，如今红字号的袁宝珠、苏蕙芳，也没有这么大架子。要他中意的，才陪着坐一坐；不中意的，简直的不理，赏他东西谢也不谢一声，也没有见他给人请安。」奚十一道：「这么样的相公，没有遇见我。若遇见我时，他要这样起来，我就骂这婊子养的，他能咬掉我的卵子？」`,en:'thing has never been known." Chunlin added, "And such airs with it! Go to his house and he never receives anybody. Wang Jiqing and Li Chunfang in their day, or Yuan Baozhu and Su Huifang who are the great names now — none of them ever gave themselves such airs. He will sit down with the ones he takes to; the ones he does not take to he simply ignores. Make him a present and'}]},"char-226":{27:[{paragraph:9,mentions:1,tokens:["李春芳"],kind:"named-mention",zh:`，终席不说话。
要他斟钟酒，是没有的事。」春林道：「好沉架子，到他家去看他，倒是从不会客的。就是从前的王吉庆、李春芳，如今红字号的袁宝珠、苏蕙芳，也没有这么大架子。要他中意的，才陪着坐一坐；不中意的，简直的不理，赏他东西谢也不谢一声，也没有见他给人请安。」奚十一道：「这么样的相公，没有遇见我。若遇见我时，他要这样起来，我就骂这婊子养的，他能咬掉我的卵子？」仲雨冷笑`,en:'known." Chunlin added, "And such airs with it! Go to his house and he never receives anybody. Wang Jiqing and Li Chunfang in their day, or Yuan Baozhu and Su Huifang who are the great names now — none of them ever gave themselves such airs. He will sit down with the ones he takes to; the ones he does not take to he simply ignores. Make him a present and he does not thank'}]},"char-227":{40:[{paragraph:22,mentions:1,tokens:["李三叔"],kind:"named-mention",zh:"大哥拉住了，道：「不是打架的事，且商量。去邀了李三叔来，是他荐去的，我们讲理去，看他怎样？」三姐说道：「打架固不好，讲理也不好。这又没有伤痕，难道好到刑部里去相验么？依我想个法子，也叫他受用一回，叫他吃个闷亏，讲不出来。」",en:`pulled him back, saying, "This is not a matter to be settled with fists; let us discuss it first. Go and invite Uncle Li San — he's the one who recommended Laosan for the post. We shall go and reason with him, and see what he has to say." The third sister said, "Fighting certainly won't do, but trying to reason with him is no good either. There are no physical wounds to show;`}]}},h=o;function s(n,a){var e;return((e=h[n])==null?void 0:e[a])??[]}function r(n){return Array.from({length:60},(a,e)=>({ch:e+1,count:s(n,e+1).reduce((t,i)=>t+i.mentions,0)}))}export{s as a,h as c,r as g};
